Simon Garzella,/users/64c550b07dada800129720e5,US,3.0,2024-09-08 15:18:27+00:00,1.0,Racist behavior,"""I have a foreign name, and yes, I am foreign. But that does not excuse the abysmal behavior of Amazon's customer representative. After being connected to an Amazon agent, she asked for my name. Once I said it, she immediately transferred me, without asking, to a Spanish-speaking representative — and I do not speak Spanish.Was she instructed to assume that all foreigners are Latinos, or that none of them speak English? Or were those her own biases? Either way, this episode reflects terribly on Amazon",2024-09-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,9.0,8.0,505,85,15,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,foreign name yes foreign excuse abysmal behavior amazon customer representative connected amazon agent asked name said immediately transferred without asking spanishspeaking representative — speak spanishwas instructed assume foreigner latino none speak english bias either way episode reflects terribly amazon,0.06814665771560649,0.9318533422843935,0.04767246214245653,0.2,0.7754611635706882,77.54611635706881,High Trust
