Farida Jamali,/users/66dc94df193b7224743fa57e,AE,1.0,2024-09-07 20:01:34+00:00,1.0,Amazon have zero control over 3rd party…,"Amazon have zero control over 3rd party sellers. They take no responsibility for orders. Despite being charged for shipping I had to pay additional to the courier company to receive the order, as 3rd party seller chose a shipping option that didn't cover delivery door to door. I then received an open box product which was not mentioned and again amazon did nothing. To send the order back I need to pay again for the shipping, again amazon did nothing. Absolutely disgraceful.",2024-08-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,9.0,7.0,478,82,40,7,37.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon zero control rd party seller take responsibility order despite charged shipping pay additional courier company receive order rd party seller chose shipping option didnt cover delivery door door received open box product mentioned amazon nothing send order back need pay shipping amazon nothing absolutely disgraceful,0.015980283842976468,0.9840197161570235,0.045989904655075714,0.2,0.8012078390095269,80.12078390095269,High Trust
Attic Crawl,/users/6464ef3cad9a2300128bc090,US,3.0,2024-09-16 19:13:57+00:00,1.0,Unreliable Service and Pricing Discrepancy,"I typically don't take the time to share reviews, but my recent experience with Amazon has been deeply frustrating and deserves to be addressed.As an HVAC business, I rely heavily on timely and reliable deliveries. I placed an order for a 16"" duct, which was crucial for one of our ongoing projects. The order came with a guaranteed delivery date that Amazon failed to meet. After several unsuccessful attempts to reach Amazon (with no accessible customer service contact numbers or direct support options), I was forced to contact the third-party seller directly. The seller assured me that the product had been dispatched on time and advised me to resolve the issue with Amazon. Despite being provided with a phone number that I could not find anywhere on Amazon’s platform, I eventually managed to speak with an Amazon representative. I was informed that the product had been lost, and while a refund was issued, the real issue remains unresolved.I need the material, not just a refund. When I attempted to reorder the product, I discovered that the price had increased by $150 — an unjustifiable increase given the circumstances. I explained the situation to the representative, emphasizing that I had already quoted my customer the original price and could not go back to them with an unexplained price hike. In summary, my experience with Amazon has been one of misleading pricing, unreliable delivery, and a lack of customer support. This has caused significant delays for my business and damaged my relationship with my customer.I expect Amazon to resolve this by honoring the original price and ensuring the prompt delivery of the product.Sincerely,  Alex Garcia  Attic Crawl Inc.",2024-09-16 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,9.0,16.0,1689,276,42,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,typically dont take time share review recent experience amazon deeply frustrating deserves addressedas hvac business rely heavily timely reliable delivery placed order duct crucial one ongoing project order came guaranteed delivery date amazon failed meet several unsuccessful attempt reach amazon accessible customer service contact number direct support option forced contact thirdparty seller directly seller assured product dispatched time advised resolve issue amazon despite provided phone number could find anywhere amazon’s platform eventually managed speak amazon representative informed product lost refund issued real issue remains unresolvedi need material refund attempted reorder product discovered price increased — unjustifiable increase given circumstance explained situation representative emphasizing already quoted customer original price could go back unexplained price hike summary experience amazon one misleading pricing unreliable delivery lack customer support caused significant delay business damaged relationship customeri expect amazon resolve honoring original price ensuring prompt delivery productsincerely alex garcia attic crawl inc,0.003897168796740138,0.9961028312032598,0.15479528883903534,0.2,0.8290104733694369,82.90104733694369,High Trust
NathanOr BenZvi,/users/55ef384a0000ff0001da4863,IL,9.0,2024-09-09 09:53:01+00:00,5.0,Excellent Shopping Experience on Amazon,"I’ve been using Amazon for several years, and it consistently delivers a great shopping experience. The website is user-friendly, making it easy to find what I need quickly. From books to electronics, the variety of products is impressive. The customer reviews are helpful in making informed decisions, and I’ve found the delivery to be fast and reliable. In the rare instance I’ve needed to return an item, the process was smooth and hassle-free. Overall, Amazon provides convenience and value, and I highly recommend it to others.",2024-09-09 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,9.0,9.0,532,86,39,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’ve using amazon several year consistently delivers great shopping experience website userfriendly making easy find need quickly book electronics variety product impressive customer review helpful making informed decision i’ve found delivery fast reliable rare instance i’ve needed return item process smooth hasslefree overall amazon provides convenience value highly recommend others,0.05229401897689095,0.9477059810231091,0.04823331463825014,1.0,1.9834996534392044,198.34996534392045,High Trust
