MacEanruig,/users/4d5c1a270000640001069a90,GB,27.0,2024-09-09 13:00:41+00:00,1.0,Fraudulent Behaviour - fake reviews,"I appreciate how pointless it may be to review a behemoth company like Amazon but it appears that consumers are powerless to prevent companies like this defrauding them.  Unless of course you refuse to use them.  I have read about fake Amazon reviews in the press, but today has been the first time I've experienced it.  An item I found via Google search was listed on Amazon. On further inspection it became clear that all of the reviews are fake.  It also became clear that every other item sold by this Amazon merchant were also fake.  To make matters worse, all items are being supplied directly by Amazon making them wholly complicit in this fraud.  Complaining directly to Amazon is impossible as there appears to be no way to do so and their AI chat bots only provide very specific topics to contact them about, fraud not being one of them.  If you are using Amazon, please be aware of this.  Check out MISOSU Direct Shop for example fake reviews, they all start with some made up problem that the item has been given 5 stars for resolving.",2024-09-09 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,9.0,9.0,1047,188,35,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,appreciate pointless may review behemoth company like amazon appears consumer powerless prevent company like defrauding unless course refuse use read fake amazon review press today first time ive experienced item found via google search listed amazon inspection became clear review fake also became clear every item sold amazon merchant also fake make matter worse item supplied directly amazon making wholly complicit fraud complaining directly amazon impossible appears way ai chat bot provide specific topic contact fraud one using amazon please aware check misosu direct shop example fake review start made problem item given star resolving,0.02756878059313387,0.9724312194068662,0.10544026920919798,0.2,0.8073036635452727,80.73036635452728,High Trust
