Ted Bowen,/users/662038596c01e50012f7392e,US,2.0,2024-09-05 19:31:23+00:00,1.0,I used to like Amazon a lot... not anymore,"I used to like Amazon a lot, in their early years they couldn't be beat because of their quality of service, but things have really changed in my opinion, and they keep getting worse.For the 3rd time this year I've had an order get delayed.  I understand that that's part of mail-ordering... but there's always somethings that are ""hinky"" about the delays. For instance, I received a confirmation 20 hours ago that the items had just shipped and that I could expect them today. Just now, I received a delay notice that it ""should"" arrive in 5 days. (How did it get delayed overnight?) And the other delays were similarly nonsensical.I've worked in shipping & receiving positions a lot, in my career days, so I get that odd things can happen, in fact odd can be rather normal in the ""business"". So, I'm unconvinced that the reasons behind any of my recent delayed shipments were the ""normal sort of odd"".The thing with Amazon and their sellers is that there's a rather long waiting period when an item gets delayed before they'll consider it lost and grant a refund or whatever. Also, they don't take the loss/delay seriously like they used to do back in the day. And to add to that, there's really no place on the Amazon site to comment about their site (as if they care about the customer) ... I've always hated looking at the reviews about an item, only to read about shipping issues... now I understand why.So, a month or so ago, I quit Amazon Prime because paying for better shipping privileges when the shipping services were cruddy didn't make sense. But what am I to do when I want to quit this corporate juggernaut that we've built... they pretty much own the market.",2024-09-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,9.0,5.0,1675,299,42,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used like amazon lot early year couldnt beat quality service thing really changed opinion keep getting worsefor rd time year ive order get delayed understand thats part mailordering there always somethings hinky delay instance received confirmation hour ago item shipped could expect today received delay notice arrive day get delayed overnight delay similarly nonsensicalive worked shipping receiving position lot career day get odd thing happen fact odd rather normal business im unconvinced reason behind recent delayed shipment normal sort oddthe thing amazon seller there rather long waiting period item get delayed theyll consider lost grant refund whatever also dont take lossdelay seriously like used back day add there really place amazon site comment site care customer ive always hated looking review item read shipping issue understand whyso month ago quit amazon prime paying better shipping privilege shipping service cruddy didnt make sense want quit corporate juggernaut weve built pretty much market,0.003955766467376302,0.9960442335326237,0.16769489624228828,0.2,0.8315610960147695,83.15610960147694,High Trust
