madtaz,/users/52835210000064000154d8f7,GB,165.0,2024-09-14 16:36:31+00:00,1.0,Not sure what’s worse delivery drivers not wanting to deliver or you can’t get a refund from Amazon if you try,"Terrible delivery placed an order two weeks ago was supposed to come on Thursday waited up until 10 o’clock at night. It still didn’t arrive. Had to contact Amazon to be told there was a problem with my order and they would reschedule it till Saturday. Well what a surprise they have sent me another message saying it’s been rescheduled till Monday, so I rang up and told them to cancel it now they’re saying I’ve got wait nearly a week to get my refund. It’s ridiculous. Why would you place any more orders with a company? If they’re not going to deliver it? I don’t think they understand the concept.. sadly their customer services got worse that I didn’t think it could get. I had to repeat myself to the person nine times and he still didn’t seem to understand that I had a pending payment which means I sadly could not access my money and was told by the bank that I needed a code from him so it could be cancelled or they could cancel it for me either way he refused to do it. He said I just had to ring my bank like I haven’t done that numerous times before now. I have money that I can’t even get to sat there pending. I hate Amazon and I will never use them again they are disgusting. I even asked him if I could put a complaint in because I don’t think he understood when I said I needed the payment pending cancelled. I want to close the account and I cannot do that until this is done. I would never order from this company ever again because now they’re holding my money and I can’t even get to it my bank said without an authorisation code they could not close it themselves so I had to ring Amazon and get them to do it directly which they are refusing to do so my money is just sat there in limbo sadly unimpressed quite wound up and my birthday is tomorrow. I’m so I’m not in the best of moods.. if you ever deal with Amazon Amazon and it goes wrong, you cannot get any help from anybody",2024-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,9.0,14.0,1904,372,110,21,10.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,terrible delivery placed order two week ago supposed come thursday waited o’clock night still didn’t arrive contact amazon told problem order would reschedule till saturday well surprise sent another message saying it’s rescheduled till monday rang told cancel they’re saying i’ve got wait nearly week get refund it’s ridiculous would place order company they’re going deliver don’t think understand concept sadly customer service got worse didn’t think could get repeat person nine time still didn’t seem understand pending payment mean sadly could access money told bank needed code could cancelled could cancel either way refused said ring bank like haven’t done numerous time money can’t even get sat pending hate amazon never use disgusting even asked could put complaint don’t think understood said needed payment pending cancelled want close account cannot done would never order company ever they’re holding money can’t even get bank said without authorisation code could close ring amazon get directly refusing money sat limbo sadly unimpressed quite wound birthday tomorrow i’m i’m best mood ever deal amazon amazon go wrong cannot get help anybody,0.35571424440389976,0.6442857555961002,0.20863712843522153,0.2,0.6638703034850945,66.38703034850944,Medium Trust
