JohnW,/users/610be0a4da326a00121147f5,GB,17.0,2024-08-25 14:42:07+00:00,1.0,Amazon Free Prime Offer Fix,"Amazon Free Prime Offer a Fix, orders cancelled. The family have several Amazon accounts. I have one rarely used so decided to create a fresh one with my new email address. I entered all the details correctly then I was offered a Free Prime membership for a month, great who would refuse?I ordered a few items straight away then to be advised that they had cancelled my order due to security as it appears that there was suspicious activity on the account. Bear in mind the two cards I registered had already been validated with them and the bank.I tried it again with different suppliers and the same happened.I tried ordering the same with my old account and exactly the same card, so this was without the Prime deal and SURPRISE SURPRISE the order went through and was delivered.So there is no “security” or “suspicious activity”, basically Amazon are using this as an excuse so they don’t want to give me the free Prime offer. What a fix. They need to be taxed in the UK same as all other companies, no sympathy for them at all!",2024-08-24 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,8.0,25.0,1032,187,27,5,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon free prime offer fix order cancelled family several amazon account one rarely used decided create fresh one new email address entered detail correctly offered free prime membership month great would refusei ordered item straight away advised cancelled order due security appears suspicious activity account bear mind two card registered already validated banki tried different supplier happenedi tried ordering old account exactly card without prime deal surprise surprise order went deliveredso “security” “suspicious activity” basically amazon using excuse don’t want give free prime offer fix need taxed uk company sympathy,0.07485483154445345,0.9251451684555465,0.10487941671340438,0.2,0.7835484675704542,78.35484675704542,High Trust
Letty N.,/users/58c956280000ff000a81df99,GB,5.0,2024-08-25 14:14:08+00:00,1.0,Ordered desk (HOMCOM Computer Desk with…,"Ordered desk (HOMCOM Computer Desk with Drawers and Bookshelf, Writing Desk for Home Office with Storage Shelves, Study Workstation, Oak) on the 6th of August, supposed to arrive on 10, arrived on the 23rd of August. Tried to cancel several times before being dispatched, request refused because the item was supposedly shipped, it wasn’t until a week later. Advised to reject upon delivery or send it back.  Mind you that Is a 40kg parcel. Decided to keep the item, noticed some holes were missing, and it has a gap in the back after putting the pieces together. Tried to leave a review which was refused because it is against their policy. It seems that reviews about delivery issues or about the seller are not allowed. Tried to leave a seller feedback, but being sold by Amazon itself, I can’t leave a seller feedback. I am a prime member for almost 10 years, but lately I have seen too much false advertising, late deliveries and no transparency. ",2024-08-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,8.0,25.0,952,166,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered desk homcom computer desk drawer bookshelf writing desk home office storage shelf study workstation oak th august supposed arrive arrived rd august tried cancel several time dispatched request refused item supposedly shipped wasn’t week later advised reject upon delivery send back mind kg parcel decided keep item noticed hole missing gap back putting piece together tried leave review refused policy seems review delivery issue seller allowed tried leave seller feedback sold amazon can’t leave seller feedback prime member almost year lately seen much false advertising late delivery transparency,0.011651541667715221,0.9883484583322848,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.8127945320264902,81.27945320264902,High Trust
