ambleside62,/users/5bdd7fd84de5666d34ef2f8c,GB,31.0,2024-08-23 10:11:05+00:00,1.0,failed delivery window 1 day is now 1 week,"Purchased item (mortar). Delivery was stated as next day. Amazon stated using Hermes. Hermes has been Evri for several years. Amazon are unaware. Tracking via Evri said that there has been a problem that was resolved. Delivery never occurred. Note on tracking that instead of 24 hours it would be 168 hours (one week) !!!!. Mortar is easily available - for example in Homebase 25 minutes away. So not a discontinuation or rarity item. I used the Amazon 24 hour for my convenience of weather to do some mortar repair - not wait 1 week. Now I wished I had gone elsewhere, but some people cannot do so and rely upon courier delivery. To compound the matter speaking to a call centre person at Amazon who was very helpful actually, I could not have a refund as the purchase was “on the way” as in it takes a week to be under way? I could refuse the delivery and get a refund that way, except that a) I would have to be totally present in the 12 hour delivery window - no toilet, being in garden, asleep and b) the delivery drivers just sling the item into one’s “safe place”. You know of the delivery by the e-mail saying its delivered. Hence inability to stop delivery at end point. Along with other purchases I now find it easier and cheaper to go the original seller and purchase there. Small is good, corporate fails despite the empty platitudes and promises.",2024-08-20 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,8.0,23.0,1359,249,42,9,3.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,purchased item mortar delivery stated next day amazon stated using hermes hermes evri several year amazon unaware tracking via evri said problem resolved delivery never occurred note tracking instead hour would hour one week mortar easily available example homebase minute away discontinuation rarity item used amazon hour convenience weather mortar repair wait week wished gone elsewhere people cannot rely upon courier delivery compound matter speaking call centre person amazon helpful actually could refund purchase “on way” take week way could refuse delivery get refund way except would totally present hour delivery window toilet garden asleep b delivery driver sling item one’s “safe place” know delivery email saying delivered hence inability stop delivery end point along purchase find easier cheaper go original seller purchase small good corporate fails despite empty platitude promise,0.8004211981377636,0.19957880186223642,0.13965227145260797,0.2,0.4277198552216398,42.77198552216398,Low Trust
