J L,/users/66c6977edd4792ed5204931f,US,1.0,2024-08-22 03:42:43+00:00,1.0,Beware - Third Party Sellers and Guarantee,"I order many items for personal and business from Amazon.  Generally, the items from Amazon direct are delivered on time and work well.  However, in my recent experiences with refurbished computers and electronics I received several defective products from Amazon third party sellers.  The third party sellers did not respond for refunds or returns.  Amazon did NOT stand behind their A to Z Guarantee.  After several emails and phone calls to their customer service, it was a miserable experience. They misrepresented their return to me and never provided a refund.  I don't think the A to Z guarantee is real???   I learned my lesson, NOT to buy from anymore third party sellers, as Amazon won't warranty their products.",2024-08-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,8.0,22.0,722,118,42,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,order many item personal business amazon generally item amazon direct delivered time work well however recent experience refurbished computer electronics received several defective product amazon third party seller third party seller respond refund return amazon stand behind z guarantee several email phone call customer service miserable experience misrepresented return never provided refund dont think z guarantee real learned lesson buy anymore third party seller amazon wont warranty product,0.007796466091919808,0.9922035339080801,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.8093378858547691,80.9337885854769,High Trust
