Peter,/users/54c6304b0000ff0001a6a7e2,DE,19.0,2024-08-20 12:15:56+00:00,1.0,In the past years I had some ads on…,"In the past years I had some ads on Amazon in addition to my own webshop. Sales were relatively small. However, the support level has sunken to an absolute minimum. The support teams (chat/email/phone) are completely unaware of their own systems and procedures let alone to advice you. It takes ages to convince them to escalate this.After I found myself once more in a position where Amazon negatively affected my business I have stopped selling on Amazon. Just some examples, some happened more than once: - A perfectly valid creditcard which suddenly is considered invalid. After 25 successive support cases I decided to leave the money in the Spanish account. - A customer complaining on a product label that did not completely match those on the picture. (Really?). Surprisingly Amazon granted the claim and refunded the customer. I have no way of getting the products back. Amazon does not support, cannot even explain why I am not eligible to open a Safe-T claim... (Really?)- Suddenly blocked account + balance for under the context of mismatch in address (untrue- nothing changed) - only by contacting an old contact in the Amazon organisation it was released again (this doesn't work anymore). I am completely fed-up with this organisation and utterly lack of support. It has been an intensive ride but it came to a definite stop. Won't miss Santhosh or any of the 150 colleagues I have communicated with.  ",2024-08-20 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,8.0,20.0,1417,237,36,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,past year ad amazon addition webshop sale relatively small however support level sunken absolute minimum support team chatemailphone completely unaware system procedure let alone advice take age convince escalate thisafter found position amazon negatively affected business stopped selling amazon example happened perfectly valid creditcard suddenly considered invalid successive support case decided leave money spanish account customer complaining product label completely match picture really surprisingly amazon granted claim refunded customer way getting product back amazon support cannot even explain eligible open safet claim really suddenly blocked account balance context mismatch address untrue nothing changed contacting old contact amazon organisation released doesnt work anymore completely fedup organisation utterly lack support intensive ride came definite stop wont miss santhosh colleague communicated,0.011415087974223347,0.9885849120257767,0.13292204150308468,0.2,0.8208768643135053,82.08768643135052,High Trust
