ng cancelled order already charged card first order didn’t process refund customer service claimed refund would processed immediately never processed wait business day starve get money back,0.902071072214069,0.09792892778593099,0.12282669657879977,0.2,0.3735298032087254,37.35298032087254,Low Trust
