customer,/users/5d6d758aa9494a73c52ed70d,US,2.0,2024-08-14 17:25:46+00:00,1.0,If you have any alternatives to Amazon,"If you have any alternatives to Amazon, use it. The shipping has become completely unreliable (they'll outsource to your local postal service most of the time gig drivers who may steal your package) and the outsourced customer service oftentimes results in being transferred multiple times or hung up on when seeking a resolution. As an Amazon Influencer, I find this company to be the worst one I've ever worked with. There needs to be major changes all around for this company. ",2024-08-12 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,8.0,14.0,480,81,38,7,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,alternative amazon use shipping become completely unreliable theyll outsource local postal service time gig driver may steal package outsourced customer service oftentimes result transferred multiple time hung seeking resolution amazon influencer find company worst one ive ever worked need major change around company,0.012568158384509193,0.9874318416154908,0.045429052159282106,0.2,0.8028017312396017,80.28017312396017,High Trust
