Bo B,/users/63c41dcd0965aa0012e9332c,US,3.0,2024-08-01 16:19:56+00:00,1.0,Amazon keeps charging more $ but you…,"Amazon keeps charging more $ but you get less customer service, especially shipping time. When I signed up there was guaranteed two day shipping. Now I'm lucky to get one out of ten orders in two days. Sometimes it's weeks. They are convenient but There other choices that give the same shipping time without the $130 yearly fee. And their prices aren't better either. ",2024-08-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,8.0,1.0,369,64,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon keep charging get less customer service especially shipping time signed guaranteed two day shipping im lucky get one ten order two day sometimes week convenient choice give shipping time without yearly fee price arent better either,0.016761682841407846,0.9832383171585921,0.0358945597307908,0.2,0.7987980705254542,79.87980705254542,High Trust
