Rosalind,/users/6671dbfa290ae6616211d99d,GB,1.0,2024-07-31 10:24:48+00:00,1.0,Beware you could have unexplained money…,Beware you could have unexplained money taken from your bankHad a unexplained subscription from Amazon Prime each month on my  credit card. Rang amazon on several occasions with promise answer within 48hrs. Nothing happened so blocked charge through bank. Following month they took it out of my current account. Again rang same answer as before. Beware this company has the worse customer service. You will get no satisfaction. Surely this company needs to be regulated for the protection of their customers.,2024-07-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,31.0,508,81,40,6,6.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,beware could unexplained money taken bankhad unexplained subscription amazon prime month credit card rang amazon several occasion promise answer within hr nothing happened blocked charge bank following month took current account rang answer beware company worse customer service get satisfaction surely company need regulated protection customer,0.011353250447307632,0.9886467495526924,0.045429052159282106,0.2,0.8034091852082026,80.34091852082025,High Trust
Bill Herzog,/users/66a9ea2776ae2b3fcbb57d3f,US,1.0,2024-07-31 09:39:39+00:00,1.0,Boycot do Not Order from Amazon any more…,"I have determined that amazon customer service and shipping department are the worst I have seen in my 56 years on this earth!  Items rarely arrive on time or when promised even if you pay extra for expedited shipping.  I asked numerous times for a corporate officer's name and phone number to contact and was told by customer service that they don't have access to that.  I call BS I did a google search and found the corporate office phone numbers in less than a minute.  If I can do it, why don't they!  Customer service is absolutely worthless and does not resolve problems.  They constantly pass you off to different people without warning, 4-5 different Customer Service reps per chat, or just flat cut you off turning off the chat without warning.  Then they claim it closed automatically due to inactivity. Only to have to resay everything you already said or make you log back in to try again. I am stern and direct but never curse or ask for inappropriate resolutions.  In fact, all I have ever asked for is my product to be delivered and give me a real date that I can expect delivery when promised. They will then tell you they are issuing a refund because the system gives them no other option and when the item arrives you can keep it.  All the while insisting it will be delivered. But then they go in and cancel the order ensuring you never receive it.  Not that it matters because even items I clearly told them I didn't want a refund never arrive and then I have to have another terrible interaction to get the refund because it never shows up. This defeats the purpose we order thing because we want or need them and do not want them cancelled, we want them delivered when promised. I have a business and personal prime account with Amazon But will be cancelling and never ordering again from them from either account.  I pray people read this review and do the same thing to ensure you do not have these problems. I know I am a small fish in all of their profits, but I do spend between my business and personal use $50K per year plus or minus a few thousand.  But even if I only spent $200 a year, I would expect better shipping and better customer service.  I am the CEO of a 10 million dollar a year customer service-based company and would fire everyone involved with my interactions if I was made aware of such terrible customer service and shipping mistakes!",2024-07-30 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,31.0,2384,436,41,8,1.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,determined amazon customer service shipping department worst seen year earth item rarely arrive time promised even pay extra expedited shipping asked numerous time corporate officer name phone number contact told customer service dont access call b google search found corporate office phone number less minute dont customer service absolutely worthless resolve problem constantly pas different people without warning different customer service rep per chat flat cut turning chat without warning claim closed automatically due inactivity resay everything already said make log back try stern direct never curse ask inappropriate resolution fact ever asked product delivered give real date expect delivery promised tell issuing refund system give option item arrives keep insisting delivered go cancel order ensuring never receive matter even item clearly told didnt want refund never arrive another terrible interaction get refund never show defeat purpose order thing want need want cancelled want delivered promised business personal prime account amazon cancelling never ordering either account pray people read review thing ensure problem know small fish profit spend business personal use k per year plus minus thousand even spent year would expect better shipping better customer service ceo million dollar year customer servicebased company would fire everyone involved interaction made aware terrible cu