SU,/users/66a712970e5575f097420ace,JM,1.0,2024-07-29 05:55:24+00:00,1.0,I am warning everyone about Amazon and…,"I am warning everyone about Amazon and their Amazon Prime membership tomfoolery.  On the 17th of July 2024, I saw ""prime day deals"" on two items. One was a ring doorbell for $99.99 and the other was for a spotlight camera for $109.99. I signed up for a Prime Membership on that same day in order to get the Prime Day deal for these two items. I received an email on the 22nd of July 2024 from them that I needed to update my payment method and one of the items needed to be paid for. I thought that was strange since I had the exact amount of money listed on the 17th of July 2024 on my card. I contacted customer service and they told me to pay full price for the two items temporarily, then when they were delivered I could go back to customer service and receive a refund for the difference. I decided to contact customer service tonight for a refund of the difference but to no avail. Customer service was poor, and they had me going around in circles for 4 hours as I explained to about 6 different people what was happening. Finally, I was told I could return the items for a full refund. This was trickery and fraud on the part of Amazon.",2024-07-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,29.0,1145,221,39,7,8.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,warning everyone amazon amazon prime membership tomfoolery th july saw prime day deal two item one ring doorbell spotlight camera signed prime membership day order get prime day deal two item received email nd july needed update payment method one item needed paid thought strange since exact amount money listed th july card contacted customer service told pay full price two item temporarily delivered could go back customer service receive refund difference decided contact customer service tonight refund difference avail customer service poor going around circle hour explained different people happening finally told could return item full refund trickery fraud part amazon,0.013906120558681598,0.9860938794413184,0.12394840157038699,0.2,0.8178366200347366,81.78366200347365,High Trust
