Anone,/users/5fa82ef83eeffe0019cf2f1e,GB,4.0,2024-07-29 13:53:38+00:00,2.0,"Mr Bezo, the billionaire.","Mr Bezo's, the billionaire, greediness is limitless. Less than six months ago, he raised the minimum purchase for Free Delivery from £20 to £25. A months ago, it was raised again to £35. And, even if your purchase totals £35 he still tries to trick you into paying another £4.99 by setting the site in the way that the £4.99 box is ticked by default,  instead of the Free Delivery box.  You have to be really vigilant with this greedy guy. Make sure, you scroll down to the delivery options and tick the Free Delivery box before hitting the BUY button.",2024-07-11 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,29.0,552,101,25,4,18.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,mr bezos billionaire greediness limitless less six month ago raised minimum purchase free delivery £ £ month ago raised £ even purchase total £ still try trick paying another £ setting site way £ box ticked default instead free delivery box really vigilant greedy guy make sure scroll delivery option tick free delivery box hitting buy button,0.012147842175690196,0.9878521578243098,0.056646102075154234,0.4,1.1052552993271856,110.52552993271856,High Trust
