Randi,/users/66a520b9e96304cae6e252ad,US,1.0,2024-07-27 18:30:58+00:00,1.0,Order Undeliverable?,"Had to cancel an order for my grandson's birthday because delivery:Day 1: Package held by carrier as the delivery address is incomplete. Please contact the carrier to update your address information. This is a lie: not only was the address complete, I provided street by street directions to get there. It is also a lie because they had delivered there before!!Day 2: A carrier delay has occurred. Really?Day 3: Address is outside their service area. Also a lie; see comments from Day 1.I contacted Customer Service each time a problem was noted, asking them to escalate and showing them that I included directions. They were more than accommodating but lied about everything, assuring me up and down and promising the package would be delivered next day. Delivery is unreliable, customer service reps are liars and I am extremely disappointed that I couldn't get the gift to my grandson when I had already, previously been able to send him gifts at the same address.",2024-07-26 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,27.0,967,163,20,2,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,cancel order grandson birthday deliveryday package held carrier delivery address incomplete please contact carrier update address information lie address complete provided street street direction get also lie delivered beforeday carrier delay occurred reallyday address outside service area also lie see comment day contacted customer service time problem noted asking escalate showing included direction accommodating lied everything assuring promising package would delivered next day delivery unreliable customer service rep liar extremely disappointed couldnt get gift grandson already previously able send gift address,0.24589309243747062,0.7541069075625294,0.09141895681435783,0.2,0.6953372451441363,69.53372451441363,Medium Trust
