Karissa Pomerleau,/users/611f5a427f665300120c6acf,CA,2.0,2024-07-25 19:19:49+00:00,1.0,I am Boycotting Amazon,"I am Boycotting Amazon. I will take my business to Walmart.  Here's why, I purchased blink Cameras on Prime day. The original cost was $519.95, due to the Prime discount last week the cost I paid was $190.27. The Products did not get delivered,  they were returned to Amazon marked as ""damaged"", so totally not my fault.  I contacted Amazon to Not refund me, to just resend the items.  But No, they said they had to refund me and I had to place a New order at the original price of $519.95 and then once it's delivered I can call to get the promotional difference refunded.  So I did...I paid $519 for $190 worth of items and called for my refund... and of course...I go through 5 ppl who end with telling me despite the fact that I was told and sent an email stating I would get the promotional price... that I actually would Not be gettingany refund And they're was nothing more they could do for me and would be disconnecting the call...Horrible customer service, especially considering I order probably an avg of $500 a week on amazon.... so I requested ups to pick the items up for return.  And I will take my money to Walmart since they are Amazon's #1 Competitor.  ",2024-07-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,25.0,1172,215,22,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,boycotting amazon take business walmart here purchased blink camera prime day original cost due prime discount last week cost paid product get delivered returned amazon marked damaged totally fault contacted amazon refund resend item said refund place new order original price delivered call get promotional difference refunded didi paid worth item called refund coursei go ppl end telling despite fact told sent email stating would get promotional price actually would gettingany refund theyre nothing could would disconnecting callhorrible customer service especially considering order probably avg week amazon requested ups pick item 