KC,/users/669ed1ad9a84bbfed2502f85,US,2.0,2024-07-23 13:30:25+00:00,1.0,Extremely Disappointed in Amazon,"Amazon has been heading downhill lately.  With their missed delivery dates, broken promises, and damaged product - I'm about to cancel my Prime membership.  Today's debacle - I bought a bathroom vanity with cabinet and top and the top is chipped along with a crack starting at the chip.  I submitted refund paperwork, they offered an additional $208 discount (on $902 vanity) but it's in an obvious location and this just doesn't work for me.  So I scheduled pickup, I had to buy a banding kit so I could package it properly (another $80), and took the day off from work.  The pickup time was scheduled for 12:00 - 8:00.  At 3:30(ish) a rented truck pulled up in front of my house and I thought - they're here!  I waited for them to come to the door as I was on the computer - but much to my surprise they put the truck in reverse and drove off.  Amazon then informed me that the company rejected the delivery because they couldn't contact me.  Complete and utter BS.  I was sitting in the house with an open window and could see the driver.  Nobody called, nobody came to the door, and the ""Pickup failed: Carrier rejected your return"" just illustrates how crappy Amazon service is becoming.  Seriously - they must think people are stupid and have unlimited time on their hands.  Now they want to reschedule (another day off work - another lost PTO day (± $550) and for what?  Drivers that are too damned lazy to do their job??  UPDATE - after three calls to Amazon (Philippines) and 90 minutes this morning they rescheduled the pickup to Wednesday - another day of PTO, another $550.  We'll see what happens.",2024-07-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,23.0,1610,289,32,4,2.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,amazon heading downhill lately missed delivery date broken promise damaged product im cancel prime membership today debacle bought bathroom vanity cabinet top top chipped along crack starting chip submitted refund paperwork offered additional discount vanity obvious location doesnt work scheduled pickup buy banding kit could package properly another took day work pickup time scheduled ish rented truck pulled front house thought theyre waited come door computer much surprise put truck reverse drove amazon informed company rejected delivery couldnt contact complete utter b sitting house open window could see driver nobody called nobody came door pickup failed carrier rejected return illustrates crappy amazon service becoming seriously must think people stupid unlimited time hand want reschedule another day work another lost pto day ± driver damned lazy job update three call amazon philippine minute morning rescheduled pickup wednesday another day pto another well see happens,0.08283181236442837,0.9171681876355716,0.16208637128435222,0.2,0.7910013680746563,79.10013680746563,High Trust
