Di77,/users/5e029d326af502d12a2b5beb,GB,7.0,2024-07-22 23:19:09+00:00,1.0,Amazon Block Genuine Negative Feedback ,"I purchased a £25 BENEFIT makeup product from Amazon but received a different Benefit product Amazon were selling for £9.99.I attempted to start a return and was promptly told due to the product being a makeup item a return was not possible.I contacted Amazon customers and raised a complaint. This was the only way I could get past the “return not eligible for makeup products” generic response.Amazon customer services did eventually refund the full amount I’d paid, and told me to keep the incorrect product I’d been sent.A couple of days after this I received an email asking me to review the original product I’d purchased but not received. When I tried to leave this feedback, Amazon refused to publish it. Like many folk I’ve always wondered how trustworthy Amazon reviews actually are. I now know, honest negative feedback is not tolerated, after they can’t have folk knowing about this little scam. Amazon have also removed this order from my account history, however I have the screenshots and my bank records too.Be wary of Amazon reviews. If you are sent a different makeup product to what you ordered and paid for, don’t take their generic no return allowed reply - raise a complaint. ",2024-07-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,22.0,1198,203,39,5,19.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,purchased £ benefit makeup product amazon received different benefit product amazon selling £i attempted start return promptly told due product makeup item return possiblei contacted amazon customer raised complaint way could get past “return eligible makeup products” generic responseamazon customer service eventually refund full amount i’d paid told keep incorrect product i’d senta couple day received email asking review original product i’d purchased received tried leave feedback amazon refused publish like many folk i’ve always wondered trustworthy amazon review actually know honest negative feedback tolerated can’t folk knowing little scam amazon also removed order account history however screenshots bank record toobe wary amazon review sent different makeup product ordered paid don’t take generic return allowed reply raise complaint,0.013358909329125953,0.986641090670874,0.11385305664610207,0.2,0.8160911566646575,81.60911566646575,High Trust
