ation”obviously refund explanation given problem next action write amazon although anticipate response kind prime membership due renew august finished amazon thanks thanks,0.05498185709771405,0.9450181429022859,0.11217049915872125,0.4,1.0949431712828872,109.49431712828871,High Trust
