Sherlock Holmes,/users/5ddba7b6fc4e5bc5b41f20b6,GB,10.0,2024-07-19 09:24:36+00:00,1.0,Difficult to get refunds,"The website is difficult to negotiate if you want to do anything other than buy! They give their sellers too much leeway when dealing with things. I returned a package, tracked, delivery was attempted seller won't collect and just keeps saying they will refund when they get the package! Amazon say nothing to do with them until it's delivered. Shambles. Avoid.",2024-07-18 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,19.0,361,61,24,4,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,website difficult negotiate want anything buy give seller much leeway dealing thing returned package tracked delivery attempted seller wont collect keep saying refund get package amazon say nothing delivered shamble avoid,0.2787425362360167,0.7212574637639833,0.034212002243409985,0.2,0.6674711323306737,66.74711323306737,Medium Trust
