Renn,/users/6696ac47e7ebac50e9d9d0ca,US,3.0,2024-07-16 19:22:25+00:00,1.0,Beware of keeping your card info on file. ,"Everyone knows amazon but your not allowed to review them , only the product. I've had several issues with Amazon with the last time now being the last I will use Amazon. I just happened to look at my bank account and saw a $30 blink charge,  haven't used my blink cameras since 2022. I called Blink they tell me to call Amazon , this went back and forth 4 times until I called my bank. The info on the charge had Amazon contact so it was definitely them, ended up canceling all my cards and got new ones. Called Amazon back again with info saying it was Amazon, they tell after 6 phone calls that they see the charge this time. They say either friends or family have my card info witch is impossible,  they only place that had my card I fo was Amazon. They would not tell me who or what account used my card. That's when I decided to erase all my info on Amazon and never use them again. ",2024-07-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,16.0,889,174,42,8,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,everyone know amazon allowed review product ive several issue amazon last time last use amazon happened look bank account saw blink charge havent used blink camera since called blink tell call amazon went back forth time called bank info charge amazon contact definitely ended canceling card got new one called amazon back info saying amazon tell phone call see charge time say either friend family card info witch impossible place card fo amazon would tell account used card thats decided erase info amazon never use,0.012140476351271488,0.9878595236487285,0.0975883342680875,0.2,0.8134474286779818,81.34474286779817,High Trust
