Lifter,/users/5c79b184899439793a4d4827,AU,16.0,2024-07-16 04:34:57+00:00,1.0,After reading 5 star reviews I bought…,"After reading 5 star reviews I bought an XXXL varsity jacket. When it, finally, arrived it clearly stated L on the bag. Immediately I knew the seller was dodgy. I tried to send it back, but he requested I PAY and he'd refund me!!!Obviously I don't trust him, so I tried to get a resolution through Amazon. What an ordeal that's been! Multiple calls, one saying it had been granted. Another; ""be patient"". My next port of call is Consumer Affairs.I stopped using eBay due to all the scammers, now they seem to be on Amazon. What peace of mind is there if Amazon allow them to carry out their ploys? When I FINALLY get my refund my time with Amazon is over.",2024-07-11 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,16.0,655,123,38,7,5.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,reading star review bought xxxl varsity jacket finally arrived clearly stated l bag immediately knew seller dodgy tried send back requested pay hed refund meobviously dont trust tried get resolution amazon ordeal thats multiple call one saying granted another patient next port call consumer affairsi stopped using ebay due scammer seem amazon peace mind amazon allow carry ploy finally get refund time amazon,0.9092897746283379,0.09071022537166207,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.3591520840823537,35.91520840823537,Low Trust
