Judie B,/users/6695888d5ca9a61eea868920,US,1.0,2024-07-15 22:37:48+00:00,1.0,"Late order was at a carrier facility a couple miles away, then shipped across the country???","I placed an order and paid for shipping because if I place a large enough order for free shipping, it'll take a month or more. Expected delivery was July 8th. I was tracking the package, and on July 7th, it was at a carrier facility only a few miles away, on July 8th, it was at a carrier facility a couple miles away. On July 12th, however, it was suddenly at a carrier facility across the country!! Every time I tried to reach someone in customer service, I received a ""we are having technical difficulties"" message. I tried reaching out to the shipper and only got an error message. My order is now a week overdue, and I STILL haven't received it or been able to reach anyone at Amazon or their shipper. This company is getting worse and worse and worse.",2024-07-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,15.0,757,142,92,16,7.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,placed order paid shipping place large enough order free shipping itll take month expected delivery july th tracking package july th carrier facility mile away july th carrier facility couple mile away july th however suddenly carrier facility across country every time tried reach someone customer service received technical difficulty message tried reaching shipper got error message order week overdue still havent received able reach anyone amazon shipper company getting worse worse worse,0.18172881795368792,0.8182711820463121,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.7250638019036945,72.50638019036944,Medium Trust
