Deejaie,/users/661ae910d0cd7a0012aee82a,US,2.0,2024-07-13 21:15:06+00:00,1.0,Terrible,"Spent over $600.00 for items for a small business. They sent only a partial package. Someone at the warehouse read the order wrong. Made several phone calls to C/S only to be told they cant help and cannot send entire order or cannot give me a refund, or would just hang up on me only for  having to call back again and talk to someone else and  explain the partial order again.  They claim it was stolen upon delivery. The package was directly handed to me so it wasnt stolen. Amazon wanted me to file a police report?? Someone packing at the warehouse messed up. They want me to return the partial package, Im still waiting for their return label. Almost 2 weeks. I filed a dispute with my credit card company, still waiting for results of my dispute. My next move will be to news channels,  BBB, the State attorney generals office, and anyone else out there that can either get me the rest of my order or get me a refund, or else I will be out over $600's. Ive shopped at Amazon alot over the years, well, never again and although Amazon is a huge company and maybe $600 isnt alot of money to them but its alot for me to lose. Sad, that, for a company like Amazon that they will not help with customer issues, but sure didnt hesitate to take my money. So, from now on I will do my shopping elsewhere.",2024-06-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,13.0,1303,248,8,1,16.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,spent item small business sent partial package someone warehouse read order wrong made several phone call c told cant help cannot send entire order cannot give refund would hang call back talk someone else explain partial order claim stolen upon delivery package directly handed wasnt stolen amazon wanted file police report someone packing warehouse messed want return partial package im still waiting return label almost week filed dispute credit card company still waiting result dispute next move news channel bbb state attorney general office anyone else either get rest order get refund else ive shopped amazon alot year well never although amazon huge company maybe isnt alot money alot lose sad company like amazon help customer issue sure didnt hesitate take money shopping elsewhere,0.009488846793755138,0.9905111532062448,0.13909141895681434,0.2,0.8230738603944853,82.30738603944853,High Trust
