Darlene Van Dieman,/users/661a2a6e427b7a0011a6ad27,ZA,3.0,2024-07-11 17:11:09+00:00,1.0,Smelling a rat with this service a d it stinks!,"If i could rate this ZERO, I would. I purchased a ring on 24 May. The product has not been delivered at 10 July. The seller is completely unhelpful despite requests for tracking which says ""collected by carrier"". No details of where the package is, if it's in the country (South Africa), and if it is, where exactly. I dont know who the courier is and if they are delivering, nor a single WhatsApp or sms to confirm what they are doing or where they are. After lodging a complaint I suddenly received an update that my ring would arrive before 8pm on 10 July. And a total no show. Today I received an update saying it will be delivered 16 July. Further and further out of reach. Shocking service from such a large company. I hope takealot, shein and temu push them right out of business. Buyer beware. ",2024-07-10 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,11.0,802,149,47,10,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,could rate zero would purchased ring may product delivered july seller completely unhelpful despite request tracking say collected carrier detail package country south africa exactly dont know courier delivering single whatsapp sm confirm lodging complaint suddenly received update ring would arrive pm july total show today received update saying delivered july reach shocking service large company hope takealot shein temu push right business buyer beware,0.02338095805733734,0.9766190419426627,0.08356702187324734,0.2,0.8050229253459809,80.50229253459808,High Trust
