Glynno Carter,/users/4f8f2717000064000117ddae,GB,87.0,2024-07-10 14:00:16+00:00,5.0,I cant understand why so many low stars,"I cant understand why there are so many low scores for Amazon. Where else can you go and get same day delivery, on Prime and the items and packaging come in perfect condition. Such a range and always giving price comparisons. I know I can rely on them to deliver on time with no hastle. I can return items with no questions if I or they got it wrong. Its easier and cheaper than going to town for sure with more variety. I'm very pleased. this is not a one off experience, i have been shopping with them for years with many purchases.",2024-07-10 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,10.0,534,103,39,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,cant understand many low score amazon else go get day delivery prime item packaging come perfect condition range always giving price comparison know rely deliver time hastle return item question got wrong easier cheaper going town sure variety im pleased one experience shopping year many purchase,0.2850274973071502,0.7149725026928497,0.05776780706674145,1.0,1.8690398127597732,186.90398127597732,High Trust
