Nicola Emery,/users/668be07d03e960cba1199a45,GB,1.0,2024-07-08 14:50:10+00:00,1.0,Delivery drivers are so bad ,"I like Amazon items as there's a lot of choice and I like that they do a lot of next day delivery. What I don't like is that Amazon delivery drivers don't seem to be physically able to knock on doors anymore? They park up.. run to the door.. quick scan of the item.. then leave it right outside the front door for the world to see. No knocking, no doorbell ring. What's the point in having a ring doorbell... they never press it. There's no point writing delivery instructions.. they're ignored. Surely the delivery drivers must be told to deliver this way, because they ALL do it. It's so annoying. Can you literally just knock on the door and wait for 10 seconds please?! ",2024-07-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,8.0,674,125,28,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,like amazon item there lot choice like lot next day delivery dont like amazon delivery driver dont seem physically able knock door anymore park run door quick scan item leave right outside front door world see knocking doorbell ring whats point ring doorbell never press there point writing delivery instruction theyre ignored surely delivery driver must told deliver way annoying literally knock door wait second please,0.05291361282769821,0.9470863871723018,0.07010656197420079,0.2,0.787564505980991,78.75645059809911,High Trust
