Family&Friends,/users/6686c26a523fa61ebddbd57f,VG,2.0,2024-07-04 20:34:29+00:00,3.0,Treat Your Members Better,"I've been a Prime member for many years. It's not perfect but I find Customer service is quick to resolve missed deadlines and defective goods. My only complaint is a lot of sellers are selling expired goods. So my advice is to check the dates on everything and contact customer service if you've received old products. It's true some reps are difficult to deal with but just keep escalating until you get results.Prime Video is another issue altogether. I refuse to pay extra fees for ""no commercials""This is a ridiculous money grab since a lot of content you can get for free on other non subscription channels.The above reasons are why I'm giving Amazon a 3 star rating. IMO they can do better!",2024-07-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,4.0,697,123,25,4,2.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ive prime member many year perfect find customer service quick resolve missed deadline defective good complaint lot seller selling expired good advice check date everything contact customer service youve received old product true rep difficult deal keep escalating get resultsprime video another issue altogether refuse pay extra fee commercialsthis ridiculous money grab since lot content get free non subscription channelsthe reason im giving amazon star rating imo better,0.08929737350126674,0.9107026264987332,0.06898485698261357,0.6,1.3691482846458893,136.91482846458894,High Trust
