Ian,/users/56489da60000ff0001eaed0f,GB,21.0,2024-07-02 21:54:18+00:00,1.0,Amazon A-Z guarantee proving worthless,"Amazon have served me well for some time while everything seemed to function well. Then, I hit a problem with a company who chose a courier that did not deliver but claimed they did. Despite CCTV evidence on offer for non delivery on 4 occasions the seller would not help or offer a refund.  Despite all evidence offered to Amazon's protection policy (A-Z) Amazon have put obstacles in the way and time consuming procedures, then eventually we're not supportive. For an item that is weeks overdue I have received no apology from seller or Amazon and no refund. This looks certain to go to court.",2024-06-30 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,2.0,595,105,38,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon served well time everything seemed function well hit problem company chose courier deliver claimed despite cctv evidence offer non delivery occasion seller would help offer refund despite evidence offered amazon protection policy az amazon put obstacle way time consuming procedure eventually supportive item week overdue received apology seller amazon refund look certain go court,0.013595171251800504,0.9864048287481995,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.8049803167857654,80.49803167857654,High Trust
