CK Sanders,/users/60b62c979110c3001a8d5c62,GB,4.0,2024-07-02 15:49:10+00:00,1.0,!!AVOID!!,"POOR customer service & logistics management.NO procedures or processes. NO resolution.I ordered a MacBook Pro on Thursday, June 26th, stating it would be delivered on Saturday.On Saturday, no delivery arrived and was marked as 'Delivery attempted.' However, no attempt was made to deliver. On Sunday, no delivery arrived and was marked as a 'Delivery attempted.' Again, no attempt was made to deliver. On Monday, a delivery did arrive, and I accessed it using the pin provided against this MacBook Pro order. However, the box was very light, so I opened it in front of the driver, and rather than a laptop, there were two cheap random items. I refused to take the package and gave it back to the driver.On Monday, I used the Amazon App to report the issue, as found that the item was marked as delivered. The entire weekend was spent in anticipation of the MacBook Pro's arrival, but it never came. This not only disrupted my plans but also left me without the product I had eagerly awaited, which has impacted my business. Despite the issue, I have not received any communication regarding the process or procedures for resolving the issue, which further highlights the poor customer service. Despite the significant inconvenience, no refund has been offered, nor has anyone suggested rescheduling the delivery, which is a clear failure to address the problem.Thankfully, I have Amex to rely on to help resolve this issue, as the company has failed to provide a satisfactory solution.",2024-07-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,2.0,1486,248,9,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,poor customer service logistics managementno procedure process resolutioni ordered macbook pro thursday june th stating would delivered saturdayon saturday delivery arrived marked delivery attempted however attempt made deliver sunday delivery arrived marked delivery attempted attempt made deliver monday delivery arrive accessed using pin provided macbook pro order however box light opened front driver rather laptop two cheap random item refused take package gave back driveron monday used amazon app report issue found item marked delivered entire weekend spent anticipation macbook pro arrival never came disrupted plan also left without product eagerly awaited impacted business despite issue received communication regarding process procedure resolving issue highlight poor customer service despite significant inconvenience refund offered anyone suggested rescheduling delivery clear failure address problemthankfully amex rely help resolve issue company failed provide satisfactory solution,0.00929317710634734,0.9907068228936526,0.13909141895681434,0.2,0.8231716952381892,82.31716952381892,High Trust
