Sanjeev Banerjee,/users/6682f2f0d9904e7de9d9dca7,IN,1.0,2024-07-01 20:18:48+00:00,1.0,"Dear Amazon,","Dear Amazon,I am writing to express my disappointment with the recent cancellation of my orders on June 29th and 30th. Despite being a loyal Prime member and a long-time customer, I have experienced a series of cancellations without any prior communication from your delivery agents.The lack of notification or attempts to resolve the issue before canceling the orders is unacceptable. As a customer who relies on timely deliveries, this negligence has greatly inconvenienced me.I urge you to improve your communication and customer service processes to prevent such incidents from happening in the future. I value the convenience and reliability that Amazon has provided me over the years, and I hope to see a positive change in the handling of orders going forward.Sincerely,Sanjeev Banerjee ",2024-07-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,7.0,1.0,794,123,12,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dear amazoni writing express disappointment recent cancellation order june th th despite loyal prime member longtime customer experienced series cancellation without prior communication delivery agentsthe lack notification attempt resolve issue canceling order unacceptable customer relies timely delivery negligence greatly inconvenienced mei urge improve communication customer service process prevent incident happening future value convenience reliability amazon provided year hope see positive change handling order going forwardsincerelysanjeev banerjee,0.018404560182959134,0.9815954398170409,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.8045946913050431,80.45946913050432,High Trust
