caleb stanley,/users/66812f690b81d7e788e1f29f,US,1.0,2024-06-30 12:12:02+00:00,1.0,Ever wonder what kind of a company this is?,So I was a customer at Amazon for years and ordered from them often. I had prime and multiple Amazon devices in my home. So I had used an hsa card to make a purchase on the Amazon store and apparently my card got saved to my account. Well someone proceeded to hack my account and drain my hsa account by purchasing gift cards. I contacted Amazon about the issue and was told that they couldn’t do anything about it I had to get ahold of the credit card company. So I did and about 2-3 months later I finally had the money returned to my account. As soon as the money returned to my account Amazon proceeded to terminate my account due to fraudulent activity. So I made a new account which was also terminated a day later. So if you ever wonder what kind of company Amazon is here is your answer.,2023-06-30 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,30.0,795,154,43,9,366.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,customer amazon year ordered often prime multiple amazon device home used hsa card make purchase amazon store apparently card got saved account well someone proceeded hack account drain hsa account purchasing gift card contacted amazon issue told couldn’t anything get ahold credit card company month later finally money returned account soon money returned account amazon proceeded terminate account due fraudulent activity made new account also terminated day later ever wonder kind company amazon answer,4.357365868164901e-05,0.9999564263413183,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.8172524700411022,81.72524700411023,High Trust
