Latasha W,/users/62b33f7aed83df0012c121e1,US,2.0,2024-06-29 19:22:05+00:00,1.0,Amazon don't care about fraudulent accounts using others people's cards ,"Well in June 14 2024 at 10:04pm an Ebike and lock for it where purchased on a fraudulent Amazon account WITHOUT MY PERMISSION. Now unfortunately the account was made by a family member and they used my address for the order. When the items where delivered I returned it ASAP. NOW AMAZON DID send the refund for $418.74 back to my card however do to all the fraudulent activities going on in the world today I keep my card locked.  So I Did Not get my refund. Now I call Amazon and let them know what happened they are holding on to my refund now. All because the fraudulent account have more rights then using my card. I Gave Amazon ALL of the INFORMATION they asked for about the fraudulent account. Amazon keep emailing the fraudulent account like I have access to it. I don't I need that $418.74 more Jeff Bezos does. We live in a sick sick world. Amazon should verify with person that's name on the card is making the order before the order goes through. There should be a way to do that. I have had Amazon for years before this. I should have been asked by Amazon am I creating an new account and verify with me. All of that money they could make it safer if they cared to. Also, FIY the person who made the fraudulent account does not want me to get my $ 418.74 back. Is making codes for ordering on Amazon accounts and cards that hard to do? I would give 0 star if I could. ",2024-06-12 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,29.0,1381,266,72,10,17.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,well june pm ebike lock purchased fraudulent amazon account without permission unfortunately account made family member used address order item delivered returned asap amazon send refund back card however fraudulent activity going world today keep card locked get refund call amazon let know happened holding refund fraudulent account right using card gave amazon information asked fraudulent account amazon keep emailing fraudulent account like access dont need jeff bezos live sick sick world amazon verify person thats name card making order order go way amazon year asked amazon creating new account verify money could make safer cared also fiy person made fraudulent account want get back making code ordering amazon account card hard would give star could,0.005750507278733221,0.9942494927212667,0.14918676388109928,0.2,0.8269620991368533,82.69620991368532,High Trust
Sherry Smead,/users/6612123687fcdb00112cd92d,US,2.0,2024-06-29 19:09:13+00:00,1.0,My heart is broken,"My heart is broken. There are so many third-party sellers on Amazon now I think I'm on Temu. I'm talking primarily about women's clothing. There is false advertising, tricks, made up AI reviews and just downright lying. Also you have to go right to the seller to seek a refund and they make you go through the process of being offered 10% of your refund and keeping the item 20% of the refund and keeping your item so and so forth. They do this because they know their products aren't worth anything and they think if they tell you you have to wait two weeks for a refund you'll just go ahead and take the 10%. What breaks my heart however, is that Amazon will not take responsibility for advertising and selling cheap products. This is a way to get around their claim to take care of their customers. I don't know why Amazon is going downhill so rapidly, doesn't bezos have enough money?",2024-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,29.0,888,164,18,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,heart broken many thirdparty seller amazon think im temu im talking primarily womens clothing false advertising trick made ai review downright lying also go right seller seek refund make go process offered refund keeping item refund keeping item forth know product arent worth anything think tell wait two week refund youll go ahead take break heart however amazon take responsibility advertising selling cheap product way get around claim take care customer dont know amazon going downhill rapidly doesnt bezos enough money,0.027620674987527554,0.9723793250124725,0.09197980931015143,0.2,0.8045856243682665,80.45856243682665,High Trust
