lee clark,/users/6582da06ea18f80012add489,GB,4.0,2024-06-28 14:10:32+00:00,1.0,Terrible service ,"Firstly one star implies 20% whereas my experience is 0%. I was refused to leave a review on amazon website for all to see. They ban any negative reviews apparently, they only want info on product not service. The delivery and customer review are all sent and delt with internally and therefore they just disappear and no one does anything.This represents my typical experience of amazon over the last three years at least.Below is the review I tried to post on amazon. I didn't receive order. I live in a 3 storey apartment. Every delivery is just dumped on ground floor, i live on third floor. Sometimes just left outside the building. On occasion I have had items stolen. I have order instructions to bring to my front door as I'm partially disabled, but the delivery personnel ignore this. I believe this is prejudice and discrimination, they wanted me to fill in online forms. There advice was very unclear, confusing and contradictory. I have been robbed basically and amazon do not care. I won't get anything back. I'm going to get legal advice. This is disgusting service.  The delivery and customer service is abysmal. Boycott, go else where or as a society let's go back to buying things from actual shops ",2024-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,28.0,1216,211,17,2,8.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,firstly one star implies whereas experience refused leave review amazon website see ban negative review apparently want info product service delivery customer review sent delt internally therefore disappear one anythingthis represents typical experience amazon last three year leastbelow review tried post amazon didnt receive order live storey apartment every delivery dumped ground floor live third floor sometimes left outside building occasion item stolen order instruction bring front door im partially disabled delivery personnel ignore believe prejudice discrimination wanted fill online form advice unclear confusing contradictory robbed basically amazon care wont get anything back im going get legal advice disgusting service delivery customer service abysmal boycott go else society let go back buying thing actual shop,0.010022517241764796,0.9899774827582352,0.11833987661245092,0.2,0.8186567167016078,81.86567167016078,High Trust
