Jessica,/users/667c9b943a6fe0283628a675,US,1.0,2024-06-27 00:54:16+00:00,1.0,Allegedly uses 'dark patterns' to sign…,"Allegedly uses 'dark patterns' to sign people up for a prime membership that I have repeatedly canceled. Was told(and emailed) that I would receive a full refund of a confirmed amount for the several months that they have been fraudulently taking my money and I only received a deposit for 1 month in charges. Called back today and they tried to give me the run around and tried to take back their previous promised owe amount.  I have documents, screen shots, emails and recordings as evidence. Todays agent pretended to put a supervisor on the phone. Then it gets really weird; the voice recorded conversations I took as a precaution, no longer have audio. Poof gone. Both recordings have been stripped of the audio(Alleged to be Amazon accessing my personal device for their own protection). I'm completely disgusted with Amazon and will never use their services again. Keep your banking information far away from this company. If you are having similar issues, contact the FTC and/or The BBB. I will be getting with the bank to get records from previous years, as I think this has been happening to me for longer than I have realized due to a federal lawsuit filed against Amazon for using 'Dark Patterns'. Chuck your Amazon account in the trash and just support local businesses. For legal purposes, all the above information is allegedly true to the best of my knowledge.",2024-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,27.0,1377,236,39,6,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,allegedly us dark pattern sign people prime membership repeatedly canceled toldand emailed would receive full refund confirmed amount several month fraudulently taking money received deposit month charge called back today tried give run around tried take back previous promised owe amount document screen shot email recording evidence today agent pretended put supervisor phone get really weird voice recorded conversation took precaution longer audio poof gone recording stripped audioalleged amazon accessing personal device protection im completely disgusted amazon never use service keep banking information far away company similar issue contact ftc andor bbb getting bank get record previous year think happening longer realized due federal lawsuit filed amazon using dark pattern chuck amazon account trash support local business legal purpose information allegedly true best knowledge,0.01575159144165952,0.9842484085583405,0.13236118900729107,0.2,0.8185964420806285,81.85964420806286,High Trust
