David Robinson,/users/647e6d5b125a740011343bef,GB,7.0,2024-06-26 01:06:56+00:00,1.0,Be careful writing reviews for Amazon,"Be careful writing reviews for Amazon. They are paranoid about incentivised reviews. So much so, if you are pleased with your products and dare to write constructive 4/5 star reviews you risk either further reviews being blocked, case by case, or being banned from the reviewer community with a warning. Make sure you give a 1 star review from time to time to prove you are human. If you receive a nice letter/email from the company you bought from, don’t leave a review because Amazon will think you have been incentivised! I find this infuriating and feel uncomfortable about leaving honest well deserved reviews. I have been threatened by Amazon and I have responded with potential litigation and even the police. The irony is, because I am human, I am prepared to write a 1 star review and here it is🖕😎 I have not been incentivised to write this review…",2024-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,26.0,857,150,37,6,29.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,careful writing review amazon paranoid incentivised review much pleased product dare write constructive star review risk either review blocked case case banned reviewer community warning make sure give star review time time prove human receive nice letteremail company bought don’t leave review amazon think incentivised find infuriating feel uncomfortable leaving honest well deserved review threatened amazon responded potential litigation even police irony human prepared write star review is🖕😎 incentivised write review…,0.08772872306672781,0.9122712769332721,0.08412787436904094,0.2,0.7729612133404442,77.29612133404441,High Trust
