Brigid Lynch,/users/624ed7ab1cd3bb0012845db1,DE,3.0,2024-06-25 20:04:58+00:00,1.0,"Expensive items not delievered, missing","I have never encountered such terrible, rude and inefficient service.I have ordered a fridge freezer that obviously is desperately needed to store food in summer heat.Order cancelled with no explaination.Then take day off work to wait for delivery which never shows.Cancel doctors appointment and wait for another delivery that never shows. No info offered.Call customer service over and over to he accused of lying, told contracdicting info (""itll be there by 11pm"" then in next call ""it never shipped"") Promised supervisor calls that never happened. Told Id be called back with shipping info and then called back by a a guy who merrily told me he was refunding me for the ""fridge I didnt want""!!Got put on hold and cut off twice, once after an hour wait.When I asked was I to wait in constantly while waiting for info on missed delievery  never got I was told a neighbour could take the fridge freezer and I could collect it..... In an apartment block and Id ordered the old broken one to be collected. Beyond idiotic.As far as I see its a team of barely interested staff, who make no notes on files, do not follow up and dont even scroll back a sentence or 2 in a chat to read info that was repeatedly given. No supervisor has contacted me and ive bern told they dont make calls despite being promised a call.No solutions have been offered. Having worked in call centres in customer care I am shocked how any of this has happened or how these people are employed. I ",2024-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,25.0,1469,261,39,5,5.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,never encountered terrible rude inefficient servicei ordered fridge freezer obviously desperately needed store food summer heatorder cancelled explainationthen take day work wait delivery never showscancel doctor appointment wait another delivery never show info offeredcall customer service accused lying told contracdicting info itll pm next call never shipped promised supervisor call never happened told id called back shipping info called back guy merrily told refunding fridge didnt wantgot put hold cut twice hour waitwhen asked wait constantly waiting info missed delievery never got told neighbour could take fridge freezer could collect apartment block id ordered old broken one collected beyond idioticas far see team barely interested staff make note file follow dont even scroll back sentence chat read info repeatedly given supervisor contacted ive bern told dont make call despite promised callno solution offered worked call centre customer care shocked happened people employed,0.18984774041354954,0.8101522595864504,0.14638250140213124,0.2,0.7343526300736515,73.43526300736515,Medium Trust
Elizabeth Monroy,/users/595d6ba00000ff000aabf48e,US,9.0,2024-06-25 11:13:20+00:00,1.0, Amazon's Decline ,I  have used Amazon for just about everything. From pet treats to my clothing. The products have been good the prices competitive. But as many large companies once they secure their customers their policies change. Now their return polices have deteriorated. I can no longer have the item picked up by the amazon courier but must find a drop off center or post office and pay the postage many times to China to return the item. IT is a huge hazzel and I DO NOT RECOMMEND USING AMAZON ANY MORE. IT is not the same company. As a writer I have also found the KDP department is very unsupportive to authors and their pay out methods are nothing like they used to be.  ,2024-06-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,25.0,664,123,18,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used amazon everything pet treat clothing product good price competitive many large company secure customer policy change return police deteriorated longer item picked amazon courier must find drop center post office pay postage many time china return item huge hazzel recommend using amazon company writer also found kdp department unsupportive author pay method nothing like used,0.012220882194578831,0.9877791178054212,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.8076865302992333,80.76865302992333,High Trust
