Paul,/users/54e7c35e0000ff0001ac82f4,GB,23.0,2024-06-25 09:52:09+00:00,1.0,I’m frightened of buying from Amazon!,"I’m now on my third parcel that has not been delivered over the last twelve months, I get the same emails saying it’s on its way, then I get the same emails saying it’s been delivered, all lies, I get pictures that are clearly not my back garden where the parcel has supposedly been left (I’ve got proof). I put all this to Amazon and then I get an email basically accusing me of having received them, with the number of other complaints on here this problem is on the scale of the recent Post Office scandal, I have written to the newspapers to try and get this published, I will update if I succeed. Sadly I really do want to use Amazon but as a pensioner I’m frightened of the outcome of purchasing from them.PS - On this occasion after all the stress I actually got a full refund.",2024-06-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,25.0,784,150,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’m third parcel delivered last twelve month get email saying it’s way get email saying it’s delivered lie get picture clearly back garden parcel supposedly left i’ve got proof put amazon get email basically accusing received number complaint problem scale recent post office scandal written newspaper try get published update succeed sadly really want use amazon pensioner i’m frightened outcome purchasing themps occasion stress actually got full refund,0.03176345914105574,0.9682365408589443,0.08412787436904094,0.2,0.8009438453032803,80.09438453032803,High Trust
