SG,/users/5f1cb866c251f3c7c27d2b6a,GB,21.0,2024-06-23 16:38:30+00:00,1.0,Disgraceful Treatment ,"I bought a fire guard which arrived on time but it was damaged and not fit for purpose. I contacted Amazon immediately and offered to send photos but they said they didn't need photos and would arrange for a refund. I explained that I don't have a printer but they said don't worry we will send you a returns label. The next thing I hear, is the seller instructing me to send it back but told me that I was liable for the postage. I refused to pay the postage when it's damaged and Amazon had already told me I would get a free label. I contacted Amazon again on Friday and was transferred to a so called manager who was extremely patronising and told me to look at my messages on the 15th June and I would see the label. I explained that it was there but it instructs me to print it but he assured me this would be ok and I stupidly took his word for it, as I got sick of him saying 'as I have already told you' and as he then cut me of and didn't have the decency to call me back, so I took this fairly heavy parcel, on foot to the nearest Hermes shop and they wouldn't accept it because it was a print only label and they didn't have a printer, so by this time, I was in tears at the thought of walking home with it, having wasted 1.5hrs. Including another call to Amazon.This has now been going on for 10 days and I hope once I get my refund, I hope I won't have to ever deal with this disgusting company, who just pass the buck to the seller, who they gave the wrong information to in the first place. They told them that the parcel arrived late and I didn't want it, which was total rubbish, as I told them the reason I wanted to return it. (Damaged and unusable) and it did not arrive late",2024-06-14 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,23.0,1696,339,22,2,9.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,bought fire guard arrived time damaged fit purpose contacted amazon immediately offered send photo said didnt need photo would arrange refund explained dont printer said dont worry send return label next thing hear seller instructing send back told liable postage refused pay postage damaged amazon already told would get free label contacted amazon friday transferred called manager extremely patronising told look message th june would see label explained instructs print assured would ok stupidly took word got sick saying already told cut didnt decency call back took fairly heavy parcel foot nearest hermes shop wouldnt accept print label didnt printer time tear thought walking home wasted hr including another call amazonthis going day hope get refund hope wont ever deal disgusting company pas buck seller gave wrong information first place told parcel arrived late didnt want total rubbish told reason wanted return damaged unusable arrive late,0.010055912058482957,0.989944087941517,0.19012899607403252,0.2,0.832997843185565,83.2997843185565,High Trust
