Hugh,/users/631877f5a09d850012fe2d41,HK,9.0,2024-06-23 11:10:51+00:00,1.0,Attempted delivery,"I do wish Amazon would stop lying. They constantly say they have attempted delivery of orders to my address, yet I have CCTV and no attempts are made. I pay for PRIME service and receive poor service. Yesterday it was ""couldn't gain access to the property"". We were in the garden in full view of the entrance! Again, CCTV shows no attempt at delivery.",2024-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,23.0,351,64,18,2,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,wish amazon would stop lying constantly say attempted delivery order address yet cctv attempt made pay prime service receive poor service yesterday couldnt gain access property garden full view entrance cctv show attempt delivery,0.11806584144167445,0.8819341585583256,0.0358945597307908,0.2,0.7481459912253209,74.81459912253209,Medium Trust
Samantha,/users/662ad7c5aa5b2f0012f13f27,US,4.0,2024-06-23 09:17:00+00:00,1.0,If I could give zero stars,"If I could give zero stars, I would. Amazon has dipped so far below satisfaction in their customer service department. No one seems to speak or understand English and it is so frustrating. It has caused me so much stress. It recently took me chatting with 8 different reps including 3 ""Supervisors"" ..all foreigners to finally get my very simple issue resolved. 4 of those reps straight up lied to me. The whole area of customer service hell is owned by Amazon. And even though this issue has been brought up by thousands, if not millions of their dedicated customers, they still refuse to change anything. It is sheer hell ever trying to contact anyone here who knows what they're doing. Hire people from the US who speak AND understand English, Amazon...or I will take my business elsewhere !!",2024-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,23.0,795,139,26,6,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,could give zero star would amazon dipped far satisfaction customer service department one seems speak understand english frustrating caused much stress recently took chatting different rep including supervisor foreigner finally get simple issue resolved rep straight lied whole area customer service hell owned amazon even though issue brought thousand million dedicated customer still refuse change anything sheer hell ever trying contact anyone know theyre hire people u speak understand english amazonor take business elsewhere,0.15391808599512002,0.84608191400488,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.7386326563855022,73.86326563855022,Medium Trust
Orangish,/users/6107fbe6df9f4000129812e6,US,7.0,2024-06-23 01:51:58+00:00,1.0,Amazon Is a Monster - Stealing Our Money!,"Will someone please do something about Amazon.com? What they are doing is not right and I don't see how it can even be legal. But everyone seems to be scared of the monster.They have stolen several thousand dollars from us. They say we were involved in illegal activity so they're keeping thousands that we legitimately earned selling legitimate products, and they know it. But they claim that we were selling drugs. They have zero proof, and indeed can't have any proof because the accusation is completely false. Any reasonable intelligent person who spent two minutes researching the product Amazon says is a drug would conclude beyond a doubt that it is not a drug.Please do something to help me get my money. Losing Amazon sales was 75% of my income, then them stealing thousands on top of that is salt in the wound for sure. This is an extreme hardship on my family, especially since the allegations are false and are apparently based on guesses on Amazon's part. Amazon has enough money, they really don't need to steal more!I am far from the only one. I see hundreds of stories like this, involving millions of dollars and merchandise (they also steal anything you have stored there if you're unlucky enough to have trusted them with your livelihood).I realize that everyone is either scared of Amazon or has been bought by Amazon (like the senator who squashed the bill trying to reign Amazon in a little). But someday someone needs to step up and start the fight against this supremely arrogant monster. I, for one, and not going to rest until justice is done and Amazon is forced to pay out all the money they are stealing on a daily basis.BOYCOTT AMAZON!1) Disburse our money immediately with a 100% penalty for their false accusations.2) Disburse to everyone from which they've stolen money and/or merchandise those funds and/or product with a 100% penalty for their false accusations.3) Disburse to me $800,000 for the next five years of lost revenue. They really should disburse twice this amount as well.",2024-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,23.0,2020,346,41,8,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,someone please something amazoncom right dont see even legal everyone seems scared monsterthey stolen several thousand dollar u say involved illegal activity theyre keeping thousand legitimately earned selling legitimate product know claim selling drug zero proof indeed cant proof accusation completely false reasonable intelligent person spent two minute researching product amazon say drug would conclude beyond doubt drugplease something help get money losing amazon sale income stealing thousand top salt wound sure extreme hardship family especially since allegation false apparently based guess amazon part amazon enough money really dont need steal morei far one see hundred story like involving million dollar merchandise also steal anything stored youre unlucky enough trusted livelihoodi realize everyone either scared amazon bought amazon like senator squashed bill trying reign amazon little someday someone need step start fight supremely arrogant monster one going rest justice done amazon forced pay money stealing daily basisboycott amazon disburse money immediately penalty false accusation disburse everyone theyve stolen money andor merchandise fund andor product penalty false accusation disburse next five year lost revenue really disburse twice amount well,0.13694178151050312,0.8630582184894968,0.19405496354458776,0.2,0.770340101953666,77.03401019536659,High Trust
J Lindsay,/users/5333d9c200006400016b02cb,GB,36.0,2024-06-23 00:20:51+00:00,1.0,Terrible company to work with! ,"Been a seller on Amazon for 2 years. What people don’t know is that when they pay for prime and they get free delivery.Amazon don’t pay for it. In fact Amazon don’t pay for anything stock delivery nothing, when a person sends something back to Amazon they don’t know Amazon charges the seller for the postage and re stocking fees and the seller looses a lot more money than people think.So while Amazon profits allThe time no matter what the seller pays for everything and lots are loosing everything.I have recently spent £35,000 to start an Amazon account that was with Smart FBA (fulfilled by Amazon) and in that two years all I have to show for it is less than £3,000 back. I spent £25,000 to get my account set up and have spent £10,000 in the products/clothes and shoes etc, all that for less than £3,000 back in total.It’s all grossly unfair. I have written to Andy Jassy and Jeff Bezos 9 times in 12 months and not once I have had a reply, that to me says it all, Shocking to say the least. My advice is shop elsewhere………spare the sellers because eventually no body will be able to afford to sell on there, Amazons greed will put an end to that!!!!",2024-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,23.0,1156,215,31,5,1.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,seller amazon year people don’t know pay prime get free deliveryamazon don’t pay fact amazon don’t pay anything stock delivery nothing person sends something back amazon don’t know amazon charge seller postage stocking fee seller loos lot money people thinkso amazon profit allthe time matter seller pay everything lot loosing everythingi recently spent £ start amazon account smart fba fulfilled amazon two year show less £ back spent £ get account set spent £ productsclothes shoe etc less £ back totalit’s grossly unfair written andy jassy jeff bezos time month reply say shocking say least advice shop elsewhere………spare seller eventually body able afford sell amazon greed put end,0.9305089290028528,0.06949107099714724,0.12058328659562535,0.2,0.3588621928176987,35.88621928176987,Low Trust
