laura hall,/users/637596545d8b960012944ec8,US,1.0,2024-06-19 23:37:41+00:00,1.0,I bought a Visa Gift Card from Amazon…,"I bought a Visa Gift Card from Amazon and when I went to use it two charges had already been made. I called Amazon two times and asked for the customer service phone number in the U.S. after spending over 1.5 hours on the phone. After speaking with customer service in the U.S. I was told that the credit card I used to make the purshase with would be refunded. Three days went by with no refund. I called again and asked for the customer service phone number in the U.S. and was told there was none. Ruan D. was so rude talking over me and hanging up on me twice. After the second time when I asked for his name, I got an email from Amazon with a list of phone numbers with one for Canada and the U.S. I had already called the U.S. number which went to the Ruan D. I am thinking Amazon cuts off customers from speaking with anyone from the U.S. when they no longer want to deal with the issue. This company is not ethical, and due to its size, there are no regulatory agencies to hold them accountable. Moving forward I will not be giving my business to Amazon. Unfortinately, I am one of the many who is guility of not buying local!",2024-06-16 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,19.0,1134,221,38,8,3.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,bought visa gift card amazon went use two charge already made called amazon two time asked customer service phone number u spending hour phone speaking customer service u told credit card used make purshase would refunded three day went refund called asked customer service phone number u told none ruan rude talking hanging twice second time asked name got email amazon list phone number one canada u already called u number went ruan thinking amazon cut customer speaking anyone u longer want deal issue company ethical due size regulatory agency hold accountable moving forward giving business amazon unfortinately one many guility buying local,0.03223438456862023,