Elle Lee,/users/5da7b84d9315cce7622441ab,GB,6.0,2024-06-20 13:38:29+00:00,1.0,Amazon don't have a Complaint team and if they do nobody knows where ,"There is so much wrong with the way Amazon deals with their customers and my experience with the company in the last 10 months, that it is pretty impossible to sum it up in a review. However given the awful experience and their ongoing failure to resolve the issues I feel others who may not have used this platform often or recently should know exactly what they might face if anything goes wrong. My account suddenly appeared to be frozen with the only option to make digital orders -very clever as I subscribe to Kindle- this issue first happened in May 24 which was frustrating as my daughter did not to receive her birthday present which I ordered in plenty of time. Eventually I was told the possible reasons and was passed on to FOUR different people over the space of three hours. I'll refrain from going through all the incompetence I experienced but I'll sum it up by saying it's now 7.15 and today at 3pm I was assured my order had been processed and would be delivered tomorrow, after speaking to 3 people and a manager I'm none the wiser and once again the items I urgently need won't be here! But of course payment has been taken and nobody has advised me not to place a new order, on the contrary I am told I'm a valued loyal customer and there's no reason for me to cancel an Amazon account that I can't access!!! Oh and apparently Complaints and Escalations team doesn't exist despite the email I've received from them and although I am visually impaired the only way to communicate is by email!!! It's so ridiculous I'd laugh if I had the energy after wasting so much time today Added 20/6/24 I've now read multiple reviews of this company and many people seem to have had the same experience as myself. Interesting Amazon don't even bother responding. ",2024-06-19 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,20.0,1771,321,69,13,1.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,much wrong way amazon deal customer experience company last month pretty impossible sum review however given awful experience ongoing failure resolve issue feel others may used platform often recently know exactly might face anything go wrong account suddenly appeared frozen option make digital order clever subscribe kindle issue first happened may frustrating daughter receive birthday present ordered plenty time eventually told possible reason passed four different people space three hour ill refrain going incompetence experienced ill sum saying today pm assured order processed would delivered tomorrow speaking people manager im none wiser item urgently need wont course payment taken nobody advised place new order contrary told im valued loyal customer there reason cancel amazon account cant access oh apparently complaint escalation team doesnt exist despite email ive received although visually impaired way communicate email ridiculous id laugh energy wasting much time today added ive read multiple review company many people seem experience interesting amazon dont even bother responding,0.9938278121824491,0.0061721878175509115,0.18003365114974762,0.2,0.339092824138725,33.909282413872496,Low Trust
