Ben,/users/56d4ae140000ff000a0a8e62,GB,25.0,2024-06-18 23:00:38+00:00,1.0,Amazon have really gone downhill.,"Amazon used to be a really reliable company, but recently they have really gone downhill. Whilst the cost of Amazon Prime is going up, the quality of service we are receiving is gong down. I ordered an item on Saturday afternoon specifically because it stated the item would arrive the next day on Sunday. The item did arrive the next day, albeit a little late. But the main problem was the item I had ordered did not work. I set up a return and Royal Mail collected the damaged item to be returned. Whilst I waited for the refund, I reordered another item, the same as what I had ordered on the Saturday, but a different brand. This was due to be delivered on Tuesday. The item I had ordered required very specific batteries to operate, so I added those to the same order to ensure I'd be able to use my item when it finally arrives on Tuesday. The item did arrive, albeit a little late again, on Tuesday as stated. However, for some reason the batteries are coming separate. Amazon did say these batteries would arrive on the same day, Tuesday, by 10pm. However, it's past 10pm and there is no sign of them. Item still waiting to be dispatched according to the app, but still on track to arrive today by 10pm? It's Tuesday night and I'm still without the item I originally ordered to get on Sunday. I've spent thousands with Amazon. But that is about to stop at their customer service has become terrible. They get more of my orders wrong than they do right.",2024-06-18 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,18.0,1460,270,33,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon used really reliable company recently really gone downhill whilst cost amazon prime going quality service receiving gong ordered item saturday afternoon specifically stated item would arrive next day sunday item arrive next day albeit little late main problem item ordered work set return royal mail collected damaged item returned whilst waited refund reordered another item ordered saturday different brand due delivered tuesday item ordered required specific battery operate added order ensure id able use item finally arrives tuesday item arrive albeit little late tuesday stated however reason battery coming separate amazon say battery would arrive day tuesday pm however past pm sign item still waiting dispatched according app still track arrive today pm tuesday night im still without item originally ordered get sunday ive spent thousand amazon stop customer service become terrible get order wrong right,0.020343572045097322,0.9796564279549027,0.1514301738642737,0.2,0.820114248750306,82.0114248750306,High Trust
