Damien,/users/5e9872230ebc96ce7c050f3f,GB,5.0,2024-06-17 19:48:21+00:00,1.0,"Amazon lose the parcel, then repeatedly lie about refunding","Amazon first claimed the parcel had been shipped, when it fact, they lost it, and the courier never picked it up.Then they claimed it was only delayed.Then they on 3 occassions claimed they would issue a refund - despite their own site showing ""this may be lost"" and the DPD tracker showing the item was never picked up.Weeks later, 3 lies about refunding in 7 days, and the most blunt customer disservice.Still over two-and-a-half-grand out of pocket because they lost a high value item.",2024-05-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,17.0,488,84,59,9,21.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon first claimed parcel shipped fact lost courier never picked upthen claimed delayedthen occassions claimed would issue refund despite site showing may lost dpd tracker showing item never picked upweeks later lie refunding day blunt customer disservicestill twoandahalfgrand pocket lost high value item,0.011004749322858373,0.9889952506771417,0.04711160964666293,0.2,0.8039199472679034,80.39199472679034,High Trust
