myview,/users/5c16e0681f403db4ac9a261f,IE,47.0,2024-06-17 18:13:16+00:00,1.0,Braking EU consumer law and getting away with it,"026-3373215-4636309I purchased a phone from you four months ago, and it has since broken. Since you do not have a contact form and have refused to accept my return, and also manufacturer for repair, I am writing to inform you that I am filing a claim through the European Consumer Centre Ireland. Please contact me as soon as possible. have bought a phone 4 months ago, that broked. Since you don't have a contact form and you refused to accept my return item for repair. I am writing here, as im placing a claim through European consumer centre Ireland. Please get in contact asap.",2024-06-14 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,17.0,582,104,48,9,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,purchased phone four month ago since broken since contact form refused accept return also manufacturer repair writing inform filing claim european consumer centre ireland please contact soon possible bought phone month ago broked since dont contact form refused accept return item repair writing im placing claim european consumer centre ireland please get contact asap,0.07057042519186417,0.9294295748081358,0.05832865956253505,0.2,0.7763805193165748,77.63805193165749,High Trust
DanielB,/users/47f0d12400006400010018c7,DK,53.0,2024-06-17 14:10:36+00:00,5.0,Hands down THE best customer service…,"Hands down THE best customer service I've experienced online. I'm in Denmark and have been buying goods from the German Amazon for about a decade now.I've just been given my latest refund, which was for an awful Logitech MX Keys keyboard which luckily had one of its keys fall off after about 18 months, meaning I was still under warranty. I hoped to then be able to sell the brand-new replacement for a decent amount and buy a better keyboard, but Amazon just offered a full refund, which I happily accepted.I've had returns on close to ten orders, some of which have been swiftly closed with ""refund issued, no need to return the item,"" the others returned with a prepaid parcel slip that just needs to be printed and stuck on the box, and once they've received the item back, a refund has been issued.Once I bought twelve bottles of baby oil (enough to get free shipping), and it was delivered damaged with three bottles having escaped through a hole. I called the local carrier and was put in queue as number 90-something. While waiting I checked the Amazon website and discovered the option to have Amazon call you up. I activated it and was immediately called on my phone by an employee who promptly refunded me money for the three missing bottles, no questions asked. The local carrier called me back two hours later.This last refund was set in motion by the friendliest German supporter who laughed with me at my broken German and did his best to follow my better English.If there's one negative, it's that the search function on their own website is basically useless, so I have to use Google with ""site:amazon.de"" added to the query instead.I see many negative reviews based on having been fooled by refund scammers, fake websites, or forgetting your password and blaming Amazon, hating on Bezos (which I agree with), or some other random own-fault issue.I've spent at least 10k € over a decade and NEVER had a bad experience with them.People, if someone randomly calls you up and say they're from Amazon (or any other business), hang up the phone and block that number. ",2024-06-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,17.0,2081,364,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,hand best customer service ive experienced online im denmark buying good german amazon decade nowive given latest refund awful logitech mx key keyboard luckily one key fall month meaning still warranty hoped able sell brandnew replacement decent amount buy better keyboard amazon offered full refund happily acceptedive return close ten order swiftly closed refund issued need return item others returned prepaid parcel slip need printed stuck box theyve received item back refund issuedonce bought twelve bottle baby oil enough get free shipping delivered damaged three bottle escaped hole called local carrier put queue number something waiting checked amazon website discovered option amazon call activated immediately called phone employee promptly refunded money three missing bottle question asked local carrier called back two hour laterthis last refund set motion friendliest german supporter laughed broken german best follow better englishif there one negative search function website basically useless use google siteamazonde added query insteadi see many negative review based fooled refund scammer fake website forgetting password blaming amazon hating bezos agree random ownfault issueive spent least k € decade never bad experience thempeople someone randomly call say theyre amazon business hang phone block number,0.07926516909219701,0.920734830907803,0.2041503084688727,1.0,2.001197477147676,200.11974771476758,High Trust
MISS HANNAH BIRD,/users/5fb3b649b97938001a18571a,GB,3.0,2024-06-17 14:03:35+00:00,1.0,Awful awful company,"Awful awful company, have a see Amazon for years and needed a new bed ordered but not arrived, told me I would get a refund and then they blocked my account and every time I use the web chat they tell me that I’ve yet again been refunded and I haven’t l! I have screen shots of these conversations and still nothing is done so no bed and no refund of nearly £400! ",2024-06-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,17.0,364,73,19,3,14.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,awful awful company see amazon year needed new bed ordered arrived told would get refund blocked account every time use web chat tell i’ve yet refunded haven’t l screen shot conversation still nothing done bed refund nearly £,0.3639852487795528,0.6360147512204473,0.04094223219293326,0.2,0.6261958220488102,62.61958220488102,Medium Trust
Thea,/users/5ca0e37ea24eec1920a2b5d5,US,2.0,2024-06-17 05:15:49+00:00,1.0,VISA Gift Card Issue - Horrible Amazon CS,"I'm writing what I have tried to write twice, as a review for a product experience on Amazon. My review has been denied with an email from Amazon telling me that my review could not focus on seller, delivery, packaging, pricing, or availability. Wait, what? Isn't it one of these items that we are typically reviewing when we provide a review?I ordered 2 $100 VISA cards, requested next day delivery. Included in the same order were three other items. I was excited when I received a delivery notice for the next day AM. At my doorstep was a typical sealed box and a sealed envelope. The three items were in the box. The sealed enveloped, when opened, contained nothing. Most importantly, it did not contain the two cards. I immediately called Amazon customer service (now clearly offshored - if you've experienced Amazon customer service you will understand) and was told that because it was within 24 hours of the order, I would have to call back the next day. I requested an email, which I received. I called back the next day after spending over 2 hours on the phone, I was finally escalated to a Manager. I was told that cards had already been used, that my situation would be escalated to ""card services"" and I would get a call back within 24-48 hours. I requested an email, which I received. Otherwise, crickets, I never received a call from Amazon ""card services.""I then called the distributor of the card (Sunrise Banks), who advised me that no only had the cards been registered to someone NOT in my name, also that they had been used for an online purchase. They took down my information, sent me an email, asked for proof of purchase of the cards, which I sent to them. And, in that same email advised me that I would hear back from them within 24 hours. Again, crickets. I decided my only course of action was to file a dispute with the credit card company I used for this purchase. They have reached out to Amazon, and in reply I received a completely nonsensical, I kid you not, email from Amazon telling me that I should have called their customer service. The email went on to ask me for a credit card number against which they can charge the costs of my original purchase. It made zero sense.Where in the world did customer service go for Amazon? Horrible, horrible, horrible customer service. I've been an Amazon Prime member for over a decade, longer. This is the first situation I've run into like this with Amazon. I remain out $211.90 for these cards with no resolution in sight. I DO NOT recommend using Amazon for any gift card purchases of any kind. Now the bigger decision, do I leave Amazon as a Prime member after over a decade of membership?",2024-06-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,17.0,2671,481,41,8,9.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,im writing tried write twice review product experience amazon review denied email amazon telling review could focus seller delivery packaging pricing availability wait isnt one item typically reviewing provide reviewi ordered visa card requested next day delivery included order three item excited received delivery notice next day doorstep typical sealed box sealed envelope three item box sealed enveloped opened contained nothing importantly contain two card immediately called amazon customer service clearly offshored youve experienced amazon customer service understand told within hour order would call back next day requested email received called back next day spending hour phone finally escalated manager told card already used situation would escalated card service would get call back within hour requested email received otherwise cricket never received call amazon card servicesi called distributor card sunrise bank advised card registered someone name also used online purchase took information sent email asked proof purchase card sent email advised would hear back within hour cricket decided course action file dispute credit card company used purchase reached amazon reply received completely nonsensical kid email amazon telling called customer service email went ask credit card number charge cost original purchase made zero sensewhere world customer service go amazon horrible horrible horrible customer service ive amazon prime member decade longer first situation ive run like amazon remain card resolution sight recommend using amazon gift card purchase kind bigger decision leave amazon prime member decade membership,0.0028865680074838486,0.9971134319925161,0.26977005047672464,0.2,0.852510726091603,85.2510726091603,High Trust
