Shaq Bar,/users/5e00a89cb14ccf17faf41843,GB,20.0,2024-06-15 23:13:49+00:00,1.0,“Same Day Delivery” Scam,"I ordered a gift via Amazon as it was the last place that had the specific item in stock. I am not the least bit impressed that it is now due to arrive on the 18th. Similarly, an item I ordered almost a week ago, supposedly next day delivery, is now arriving on July 22nd. Amazon has seriously declined in standards. Constant delays with packages yet you charge people an extortionate amount for the below subpar service that is Prime. I was sure to double-check before I ordered and made both purchases way ahead of time. You should do more than offer a measly automated apology - I was not even emailed about the delay. Incredibly pathetic. ",2024-06-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,15.0,643,117,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered gift via amazon last place specific item stock least bit impressed due arrive th similarly item ordered almost week ago supposedly next day delivery arriving july nd amazon seriously declined standard constant delay package yet charge people extortionate amount subpar service prime sure doublecheck ordered made purchase way ahead time offer measly automated apology even emailed delay incredibly pathetic,0.015116914641140186,0.9848830853588598,0.06561974200785194,0.2,0.8055654910810003,80.55654910810003,High Trust
