Palmira Quiñones,/users/5f71b880a3275c686eab0943,IE,2.0,2024-06-14 12:59:17+00:00,1.0,Unfortunately,"Unfortunately, my experience with purchasing pants on Amazon.com left much to be desired. First of all, the shipping time was significantly longer than expected. I anticipated the package to arrive within a few days, but I ended up waiting almost two weeks, which was very frustrating.When the pants finally arrived, I was met with yet another disappointment. The pants were torn in several places. I was shocked because I expected a product in perfect condition, especially for the price I paid. This situation was very unpleasant for me as I needed the pants for an important event that took place a few days later.I immediately contacted customer service, hoping for a quick resolution. Unfortunately, my expectations were once again disappointed. The claim was rejected, and I was left without any help or compensation. They argued that the damage could have been caused by me, which was completely untrue.I am very disappointed with both the product and the customer service on Amazon.com. I expected such a large and reputable company to handle the issue professionally and responsibly, but unfortunately, that was not the case. This experience has discouraged me from making further purchases on this platform. I hope other customers have better luck, but I certainly will not return.",2024-05-30 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,14.0,1291,208,13,1,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,unfortunately experience purchasing pant amazoncom left much desired first shipping time significantly longer expected anticipated package arrive within day ended waiting almost two week frustratingwhen pant finally arrived met yet another disappointment pant torn several place shocked expected product perfect condition especially price paid situation unpleasant needed pant important event took place day lateri immediately contacted customer service hoping quick resolution unfortunately expectation disappointed claim rejected left without help compensation argued damage could caused completely untruei disappointed product customer service amazoncom expected large reputable company handle issue professionally responsibly unfortunately case experience discouraged making purchase platform hope customer better luck certainly return,0.007344312538444894,0.9926556874615551,0.1166573191250701,0.2,0.8196593075557915,81.96593075557915,High Trust
