Paula Jeffs,/users/5bf810305483f4b8a9aaa0a7,GB,7.0,2024-06-13 22:20:02+00:00,1.0,Never received my order,"Received my first package ok, but sent back due to wrong size, the second one of a different size never arrived. The tracking said it was delayed then it gave a specific day to be delivered and we waited in all day till 9pm and it never came. Then it said it was arriving on a different date and then when that date passed the tracking changed to saying it had been delivered two weeks previously. Total lies, they obviously lost or stole it ( Evri) and tried to say they delivered it. Why would I have tracking after this date saying its delayed etc? Anyway I complained to the seller, but as I am new to Amazon I didn’t know I had to contact customer service so I tried to ask for a refund from the seller directly. I went away for a week working then tried again with the seller. It was confusing. When I eventually reached out to customer service ( an AI Bot) they said I was over the deadline for a refund. So basically £28.99 down the drain. Very angry. Never again will I order from Amazon, it’s totally put me off. This online stuff is not as good as they make out, the couriers are often rubbish too. ",2024-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,13.0,1110,214,23,4,29.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,received first package ok sent back due wrong size second one different size never arrived tracking said delayed gave specific day delivered waited day till pm never came said arriving different date date passed tracking changed saying delivered two week previously total lie obviously lost stole evri tried say delivered would tracking date saying delayed etc anyway complained seller new amazon didn’t know contact customer service tried ask refund seller directly went away week working tried seller confusing eventually reached customer service ai bot said deadline refund basically £ drain angry never order amazon it’s totally put online stuff good make courier often rubbish,0.011974532004272691,0.