PJ,/users/5f88897ea251c7001a495189,US,26.0,2024-06-12 05:05:13+00:00,1.0,Repeated misdeliveries,"Amazon keeps delivering my packages to the wrong address!  The drivers are incredibly stupid. They go by GPS, which takes them to wrong address. My packages keep getting delivered to an address around the corner from me. So, it’s a completely different street, and a completely different house number than what is on the package! It’s painfully obvious that the drivers are too lazy to actually look at the address on the package. The first time this happened, I spoke with Amazon, they added more details to the delivery instructions. They still get it wrong!  When I tell them that they delivered to the wrong address yet again, they do NOTHING to rectify the situation. I am done with Amazon!",2024-06-11 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,12.0,695,120,22,2,1.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,amazon keep delivering package wrong address driver incredibly stupid go gps take wrong address package keep getting delivered address around corner it’s completely different street completely different house number package it’s painfully obvious driver lazy actually look address package first time happened spoke amazon added detail delivery instruction still get wrong tell delivered wrong address yet nothing rectify situation done amazon,0.9760872213272181,0.023912778672781854,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.32541684923543746,32.54168492354375,Low Trust
