Hamid  Mansouri,/users/5968dc750000ff000aaf5ca7,SE,9.0,2024-06-22 17:20:52+00:00,1.0,Be extra cautious when ordering from Amazon…,"I made two separate orders on May 21st within few hours. Each order contained 2 items. I receiced 2 different e-mails with 2 different order numbers shortly after. On June 7th I received a package containg two items. I continued tracking the 2nd package and it was claimed that it would be delivered on June 11th. As I didn't receive the 2nd package today, I tracked it  and, to my astonishment, it was claimed that it was also delivered on June 7th which is a big lie!Order number1:  112-4824835-3849806 (Delivered)Order number 2. 112-1613888.8337816 (undelivered)Value of undelivered package: 18+22= 40 USDWhat is interesting is that I have received many similar messages from very many countries( including Indonesia and Ethiopia) claiming that they  have wrongly received my packet and they all sent me a similar link asking me about my address and credit card specification for shipment cost to my address!!",2024-06-11 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,22.0,912,149,44,7,11.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,made two separate order may st within hour order contained item receiced different email different order number shortly june th received package containg two item continued tracking nd package claimed would delivered june th didnt receive nd package today tracked astonishment claimed also delivered june th big lieorder number deliveredorder number undeliveredvalue undelivered package usdwhat interesting received many similar message many country including indonesia ethiopia claiming wrongly received packet sent similar link asking address credit card specification shipment cost address,0.6856610640289692,0.3143389359710308,0.08356702187324734,0.2,0.47388287236016485,47.38828723601649,Low Trust
Aleks,/users/66688b36397733923c1d34ab,RU,1.0,2024-06-11 19:38:44+00:00,1.0,Suspicious and dangerous online store,"Suspicious and dangerous online store.  I registered, entered my personal data, bank card details, selected the product, indicated the delivery address in Germany, the product was paid from my bank card, the order was confirmed to my email.  After this, Amazon blocked my account and for several days demanded from me various additional information about my bank and account.  I have sent all the requested data.  However, Amazon responded that I could not verify my information and blocked my access to my account.  As a result, the money was debited, the goods were not delivered, and I can’t even log into my account to delete my personal data.  I would like to know what this organization does, collecting customer data or working with sales?  If they do the same with millions of subscribers, just use their money without paying any interest, then this is another kind of business.  Be careful.  My issue is still not resolved.  I feel in danger due to the fact that my personal data on the Amazon app and I cannot delete it now.",2024-06-10 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,11.0,1034,178,37,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,suspicious dangerous online store registered entered personal data bank card detail selected product indicated delivery address germany product paid bank card order confirmed email amazon blocked account several day demanded various additional information bank account sent requested data however amazon responded could verify information blocked access account result money debited good delivered can’t even log account delete personal data would like know organization collecting customer data working sale million subscriber use money without paying interest another kind business careful issue still resolved feel danger due fact personal data amazon app cannot delete,0.025668613882430708,0.9743313861175693,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.8071320419090371,80.71320419090371,