Saharat Anuwatmatee,/users/5331e87800006400016ac01e,GB,8.0,2024-06-10 11:00:56+00:00,1.0,Just one missing item and they want me to report to the police???!!!,"I have ordered multiple items from them, however, a piece of the order was missing so I filed a complaint.After a month, I received no response, so I chased this up. Initially, they claimed they could no longer claim and I quote ""Unfortunately, due to the age of this order, reliable tracking information is no longer available. Because of this, we won't be able to provide a replacement or refund for this order at this time."".Obviously, I wasn't happy with this irresponsible response in which they ended up chasing up for me and asking for more information AGAIN despite having provided the information a month ago.After a while they replied me with this: ""Based on our investigation and your statements, it seems that the item has been stolen by a third party and we urge you to contact your local police department to report the theft of the parcel. To assist in obtaining a Police Report , we recommend that you provide a copy of the email that we will send to you to the police to help explain what has happened. We'll happily cooperate with the police as part of any investigation.If the issue isn't resolved after contacting local law enforcement and the carrier, please contact us back during the business hours of the related police department with a link to access your Police Report , or a PDF/Image file of the Police Report. There are multiple ways to file a Police Report. Check with your local authorities for ways to file a report. Note that we will not be able to offer support on this delivery after 1-July-2024. Please ensure to get a Police Report and contact back before this time.""The item missing is about 100 USD and anyone would know how useless it is to contact police without any solid evidence provided such as a packing video from Amazon part to show they have actually packed the correct number or items. Let alone wasting 5-6 hours (ie. 1 working) day just to chase up something worth 100 USD, I might as well work a minimum wage for that.Anyway, this is very irresponsible from Amazon part and let me leave this message here for good.Do not order too many pieces with Amazon or else you might ended up wasting hundreds of dollars for nothing.For Amazon: If you're reading this, my order number is 111-7515587-0251454",2024-06-10 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,10.0,2250,396,68,13,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered multiple item however piece order missing filed complaintafter month received response chased initially claimed could longer claim quote unfortunately due age order reliable tracking information longer available wont able provide replacement refund order timeobviously wasnt happy irresponsible response ended chasing asking information despite provided information month agoafter replied based investigation statement seems item stolen third party urge contact local police department report theft parcel assist obtaining police report recommend provide copy email send police help explain happened well happily cooperate police part investigationif issue isnt resolved contacting local law enforcement carrier please contact u back business hour related police department link access police report pdfimage file police report multiple way file police report check local authority way file report note able offer support delivery july please ensure get police report contact back timethe item missing usd anyone would know useless contact police without solid evidence provided packing video amazon part show actually packed correct number item let alone wasting hour ie working day chase something worth usd might well work minimum wage thatanyway irresponsible amazon part let leave message gooddo order many piece amazon else might ended wasting hundred dollar nothingfor amazon youre reading order number,0.007165924608882397,0.9928340753911176,0.2220975883342681,0.2,0.8408365553624124,84.08365