M. E.,/users/626c07f18385d5001288c6d6,US,3.0,2024-06-08 19:38:07+00:00,1.0,A 5 year old could do better,"The delivery drivers are the most inconsiderate and disrespectful people on the face of the planet....I guess that is why they work for Amazon, no other company in their right mind would hire them. After many times of telling Amazon that my driveway is NOT to be used to turn their trucks around, I had to install a chain to keep out of my driveway, it didn't stop them from trying, I watched one of their drivers back into the chain and cause damage to the post. I added additional posts and signs, one sign even says to ""do not block"" yet Amazon drivers either can't read, don't know what a driveway is or just think they are above all others since they still block the driveway. It would be one thing if they were blocking my driveway to deliver to MY  house but, they block my driveway to deliver to 3 other houses when there are plenty of places to park without blocking a driveway. I don't shop with Amazon and won't shop with them ever so there is NEVER a reason for them to block my driveway.",2024-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,8.0,1000,189,28,7,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,delivery driver inconsiderate disrespectful people face planeti guess work amazon company right mind would hire many time telling amazon driveway used turn truck around install chain keep driveway didnt stop trying watched one driver back chain cause damage post added additional post sign one sign even say block yet amazon driver either cant read dont know driveway think others since still block driveway would one thing blocking driveway deliver house block driveway deliver house plenty place park without blocking driveway dont shop amazon wont shop ever never reason block driveway,0.025945478963010384,0.9740545210369896,0.10600112170499158,0.2,0.8082274848594931,80.82274848594932,High Trust
