Lloyd M,/users/58331a0c0000ff000a597a2a,GB,12.0,2024-06-08 12:02:38+00:00,1.0,Incompetent Liars,"It's 2 weeks after my item should have been delivered and I am now talking to Amazon delivery team as to where my item is. One agent (Gotham) told me that my item was stolen in transit but assured me that another one would be sent out to me and it will arrive tomorrow evening and that he would personally call me tomorrow at  5pm to confirm this. He never called, and the item never arrived. Today I spoke with another agent (Josh) in the delivery team who said he will do his best to rectify things.. he placed me on hold.. and after 10min of waiting the phone was shut off! I called again and another agent (I did not get his name) said he would assist me and placed me on hold.. for 25min. At this point now I just wanted a refund. Eventually someone (a female) answered and said they would have to contact the delivery team to check the status of my order. I was placed on hold again. (All these people spoke with an Indian accent -I was now beginning to think that all this was a vicious scam.) After a further 10min she came back and said a refund would be authorised within 5-7 working days. I will wait to see if this happens and if it does I will be closing down my Prime account with Amazon. If this is how they treat Prime members, wow, I would hate to see how they treat non-Prime members. ",2024-06-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,8.0,1303,253,17,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,week item delivered talking amazon delivery team item one agent gotham told item stolen transit assured another one would sent arrive tomorrow evening would personally call tomorrow pm confirm never called item never arrived today spoke another agent josh delivery team said best rectify thing placed hold min waiting phone shut called another agent get name said would assist placed hold min point wanted refund eventually someone female answered said would contact delivery team check status order placed hold people spoke indian accent beginning think vicious scam min came back said refund would authorised within working day wait see happens closing prime account amazon treat prime member wow would hate see treat nonprime member,0.21030242657453993,0.7896975734254601,0.14189568143578238,0.2,0.7232279229998865,72.32279229998865,Medium Trust
