Eva Marie Jenkins,/users/66635bddb579e16dbbb5e824,US,1.0,2024-06-07 21:13:41+00:00,1.0,Never received item and refused refund,"I ordered an item in January and never received it. There was no way to get a refund since it was officially ""lost in delivery"" and the self service options just gave a runaround. Only option for refund was a return, but I didn't have the item. Called Amazon customer service and was told to call my credit card company. The company won't do anything because I waited too long, apparently, to complain. Amazon basically stole my money....",2024-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,7.0,438,78,38,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item january never received way get refund since officially lost delivery self service option gave runaround option refund return didnt item called amazon customer service told call credit card company company wont anything waited long apparently complain amazon basically stole money,0.014930296237459359,0.9850697037625407,0.04374649467190129,0.2,0.8012841508156505,80.12841508156505,High Trust
Mema,/users/5fd3aeab92146d0019bfbc18,US,6.0,2024-06-07 21:05:47+00:00,1.0,Late shipments and Delivery Issues are becoming the norm,"I’ve noticed in the last few months, deliveries have been delayed or lost.  It seems that a lot of these issues may be attributed to the USPS which has been used more in recent months.  My most recent order was initially delayed for 2 days and now Amazon says there is a problem and if I don’t get it in another 2 days, I can cancel the order.  I don’t want to cancel the order, I wanted it shipped and delivered in accordance with the promised delivery date.  I will be canceling my subscription if these delivery issues persist! ",2024-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,7.0,531,99,56,9,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,i’ve noticed last month delivery delayed lost seems lot issue may attributed usps used recent month recent order initially delayed day amazon say problem don’t get another day cancel order don’t want cancel order wanted shipped delivered accordance promised delivery date canceling subscription delivery issue persist,0.050885751151240596,0.9491142488487594,0.055524397083567024,0.2,0.7856620038410931,78.56620038410931,High Trust
Ross O,/users/62b8d8f198ab1b00123d0162,US,15.0,2024-06-07 19:53:23+00:00,5.0,Can I give more than 5 stars?,"A review on here states, ""I can't understand why people give Amazon so many bad reviews"". I'm with that person. I have bought loads of goods in both the U.K. and U.S. website and rarely have I had a problem. Things are delivered quickly (sometimes same day). I can easily get through to customer service. The goods are competively priced and returns are simple. Given the enormous complexity of the service I am surprised at how good they are.",2024-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,7.0,443,79,29,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,review state cant understand people give amazon many bad review im person bought load good uk u website rarely problem thing delivered quickly sometimes day easily get customer service good competively priced return simple given enormous complexity service surprised good,0.054596241535039954,0.94540375846496,0.0443073471676949,1.0,1.981563348666019,198.1563348666019,High Trust
Brian Csejtey,/users/66633e18b579e1870cb5cfe3,US,1.0,2024-06-07 19:06:40+00:00,2.0,Consistently late,"Consistently late. A guarantee means something will be given if they lie. They lie, we try and call and get nowhere, we text and get nowhere, they deliver a week or two later than PROMISED (they don't say the product ""MAY"" be delivered by this time, it says ""WILL"" be...but don't count on it), and we get no refund unless we deal with the hassle of returning the item if/when it arrives. Seriously?? How is it possible a company can constantly misrepresent their product timelines, give the customer nothing in return, and continue doing it? Don't trust me, look it up for yourself.",2024-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,7.0,582,103,17,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,consistently late guarantee mean something given lie lie try call get nowhere text get nowhere deliver week two later promised dont say product may delivered time say bebut dont count get refund unless deal hassle returning item ifwhen arrives seriously possible company constantly misrepresent product timeline give customer nothing return continue dont trust look,0.018041739837064006,0.981958260162936,0.05776780706674145,0.4,1.1025326914948161,110.25326914948161,High Trust
