J.,/users/64b7043406754a001236199f,NL,4.0,2024-06-07 12:42:03+00:00,1.0,Issue with the seller on the Amazon…,"Issue with the seller on the Amazon platform without getting any help at all.the seller sold a bad quality dry cabinet to me and insisted if I want a full refund I need to return it. fine, of course I'm willing to return and get my money back. however the seller rejected to provide a PAID postage label to me and keep offering me like 20-50 Euro compensation asking me to shut my mouth.Reported this to Amazon and confirmed that the seller needs to provide a PAID postage label to me. then I kept going back and forth to try to get the seller to understand what I'm requesting.of course they didn't get what I meant.and at the end they said if I send the post and fill out the form for the custom. I need to write the value of the item for less than $49 USD. I brought that item for 288 Euro.Im pissed by both seller and Amazon. Amazon as a platform they allowed such a bad quality seller to sell there and now trying to get me to do some illegal stuff just because they don't want to pay the custom?I'm very tired of this and this has been ongoing for 3 months. ",2024-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,7.0,1064,207,36,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,issue seller amazon platform without getting help allthe seller sold bad quality dry cabinet insisted want full refund need return fine course im willing return get money back however seller rejected provide paid postage label keep offering like euro compensation asking shut mouthreported amazon confirmed seller need provide paid postage label kept going back forth try get seller understand im requestingof course didnt get meantand end said send post fill form custom need write value item less usd brought item euroim pissed seller amazon amazon platform allowed bad quality seller sell trying get illegal stuff dont want pay customim tired ongoing month,0.012629431943772466,0.9873705680562276,0.1160964666292765,0.2,0.816904577353969,81.6904577353969,High Trust
Zena Briggs,/users/6662daef7959c9c1e1a956fc,US,1.0,2024-06-07 21:47:01+00:00,1.0,Here's a review of a product that I…,"Here's a review of a product that I wrote on Amazon, but for some reason it keeps being unsubmitted. So, I came here. ""This product arrived on time and was wonderful the first time that we ordered it. We decided to purchase another. The problem is that the zipper is broken and the fabric is torn. It makes the seat look used instead of brand new.UPDATE:Someone came over to pick up the item before I had a chance to check my email and/or the message left on Amazon website.  I have to work. The guy came to the door, said he could not wait, as his supervisor was with him. He was impatient, maybe stressed because of the supervisor and not exactly polite. (I'm glad he has a job and want him to continue to work, but customer service is a positive thing.)Baseline: He could not take the package as it was not ready. He left a slip and said he'd be back tomorrow. It has to be in the box that it came in.I am 67 years old. I remember when we could return items whether we had the box that we bought them in or not. We were still able to get our money back. I paid for it. It is damaged. I want my money. I don't care. They should be able to take it whether or not it is in the same package.Also, if does not fit. Ironically, because of the damage, ie the zipper does not work, I am able to fit small pieces into the opening left when it is unzipped. I was not able to fix the section with the wheels in the pox though. I had no one to help me at the time and had to pull the wheels off to be more versatile. It took almost tow hours. I could not wait for help, as I have to have it ready. I'm not sure when he will come. I was almost able to fit everything in properly, but the top is unable to close, as some parts stick out.I was finally able to read the massage on Amazon. I can drop it off if it is not picked up. I don't drive. That's one reason why I order online. I have to wait for someone to pick it up for me and I have a deadline to get it back.First, they received their money with no problem. I fulfilled my end of the bargain ASAP. Yet,  I had to wait for them to ship it at their convivence. Now, that i need my money back, through no fault of my own, I can't have it back ASAP, I again have to wait and follow their guidelines to have a refund. Needless guidelines, as returns were previously made whether they fit in the original box or not. I understand that I have to wait for shipments and my refund, but it has to fit in the box? For real? Provide bigger boxes.And, what if I had thrown the box away? I don't have space to keep original boxes.Secondly, I was unable to work during the time that I tried to package it. If we go to court, I want to be reimbursed for the time that I lost. My money was not damaged. Their product was.Thirdly, I have a deadline, I have to get it back ASAP. I will either have to carry this item via bus. It's heavy. or, take an Uber, which is expensive and I want to be reimbursed either way for cost of transportation and my time. I may be able to have one of my sons transport me on their day off and/or after work. It was convenient to have it picked up. I deserve it. They got my undamaged money on time.I wanted to have them replace the seat, which would have been easy for me. The guy could have brought one. It was their decision to return the whole chair. They should make sure that they get it and I get either my money or a exchange.UPDATE:I went back to read instructions on Amazon again. It did not specify that it needed the original box, but did say that it had to be securely packaged. It is, as far as I am concerned. It fits in the box, although it is not sealed and items stick out of it. He can take it to UPS, they will package it and send it back. They did it when I returned an item for Spectrum. Why does it have to be me? He's picking it up anyway. They will do it no matter who brings it. Why me and not him? ",2024-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,7.0,3885,785,36,8,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,here review product wrote amazon reason keep unsubmitted came product arrived time wonderful first time ordered decided purchase another problem zipper broken fabric torn make seat look used instead brand newupdatesomeone came pick item chance check email andor message left amazon website work guy came door said could wait supervisor impatient maybe stressed supervisor exactly polite im glad job want continue work customer service positive thingbaseline could take package ready left slip said hed back tomorrow box came ini year old remember could return item whether box bought still able get money back paid damaged want money dont care able take whether packagealso fit ironically damage ie zipper work able fit small piece opening left unzipped able fix section wheel pox though one help time pull wheel versatile took almost tow hour could wait help ready im sure come almost able fit everything properly top unable close part stick outi finally able read massage amazon drop picked dont drive thats one reason order online wait someone pick deadline get backfirst received money problem fulfilled end bargain asap yet wait ship convivence need money back fault cant back asap wait follow guideline refund needless guideline return previously made whether fit original box understand wait shipment refund fit box real provide bigger boxesand thrown box away dont space keep original boxessecondly unable work time tried package go court want reimbursed time lost money damaged product wasthirdly deadline get back asap either carry item via bus heavy take uber expensive want reimbursed either way cost transportation time may able one son transport day andor work convenient picked deserve got undamaged money timei wanted replace seat would easy guy could brought one decision return whole chair make sure get get either money exchangeupdatei went back read instruction amazon specify needed original box say securely packaged far concerned fit box although sealed item stick take ups package send back returned item spectrum he picking anyway matter brings,0.004156046650343177,0.9958439533496568,0.4402692091979809,0.2,0.8859758185144246,88.59758185144247,High Trust
