taniag,/users/639d326497ce850014854d49,US,4.0,2024-06-07 03:51:50+00:00,1.0,Lies,"An Amazon employee told me that she would (and did) refund my damaged item and put the credit on my current card. She said it was processed and confirmed. When I called back a couple days later, they said they would not honor what she told me. A company as large as Amazon should honor what an employee says. They don't care and refuse to make this right. Very, very wrong of them. ",2024-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,7.0,382,73,4,1,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon employee told would refund damaged item put credit current card said processed confirmed called back couple day later said would honor told company large amazon honor employee say dont care refuse make right wrong,0.024898854028498212,0.9751011459715018,0.04094223219293326,0.2,0.7957390194243374,79.57390194243375,High Trust
