LEONORA MARSLAND,/users/5e7cb6d9955aee113c8f7ce6,US,3.0,2024-06-06 01:43:31+00:00,1.0,Poor customer service experience.,"I spent a hour this evening trying to speak with a customer service representative.  I sent back damaged items for refund, the tracking number showed they were received and I received an email stating as they had not been received I was going to be charged for them.  Everything I have ordered recently has either showed up late, not at all, or damaged. I tried to cancel my membership, but cannot do that until my renewal date in 2025.  That is I could cancel it now but would not receive any sort of refund. Their online assistant and their telephone voice assistant were complete useless. There service used to be great, I guess they feel they are big enough now that they do not have to care.",2024-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,6.0,696,127,33,4,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,spent hour evening trying speak customer service representative sent back damaged item refund tracking number showed received received email stating received going charged everything ordered recently either showed late damaged tried cancel membership cannot renewal date could cancel would receive sort refund online assistant telephone voice assistant complete useless service used great guess feel big enough care,0.029087416993916596,0.9709125830060834,0.071228266965788,0.2,0.7997019448961993,79.97019448961993,High Trust
