Chris Louck,/users/505da03900006400012235d6,US,2.0,2024-06-05 20:38:48+00:00,1.0,I have come to realize a pattern,"I have come to realize a pattern with amazon lately. Twice I have placed an order for an item at a discount price, a couple days later the price goes back up and suddenly my package is either lost or damaged in shipment and they only offer a refund, not to re-send the item. This tells me that they are canceling the deliveries so that they can reship for the new price.Amazon has become a fraud and you can get any item on their site at the manufacturers websites. and usually cheaper even with a shipping cost.",2024-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,5.0,512,97,32,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,come realize pattern amazon lately twice placed order item discount price couple day later price go back suddenly package either lost damaged shipment offer refund resend item tell canceling delivery reship new priceamazon become fraud get item site manufacturer website usually cheaper even shipping cost,0.008641584250663433,0.9913584157493366,0.05440269209197981,0.2,0.8065597462930643,80.65597462930643,High Trust
Greg Wilkinson,/users/5426d3fc00006400018ce004,US,28.0,2024-08-08 22:06:20+00:00,1.0,Is Amazon's Reputation Starting to Crumble? ,"I've been purchasing on Amazon for years (like many others do).Several years ago, my account was hacked and purchases were made on my account. Uncertain how that occurred as Amazon never caught it.I was told by an Amazon rep to close my account and I advised I had recently purchased a 75""TV and was concerned about having proof of purchase should I need it. I was told, it would still be available to me however, I was never able to access the information anywhere.I was then prohibited from posting reviews on my purchases. Amazon claimed due to previous reviews, I was banned from ever submitting reviews again.I don't recall ever posting reviews that would warrant being banned. I made multiple requests for them to tell me what was submitted that caused me to be banned however, Amazon never responded.Now, I'm noticing, each time, I place an order, the delivery time takes longer and longer.I don't think it has anything to do with the above mentioned matters. I think it's Amazon's attempt to get me to join Amazon Prime. I never took issue with the amount of time it took to receive items however, now the wait time is 2+ weeks to receive deliveries. I placed an order the third week of July and the deluvery window for seven items is listed between Sept 7-12. Six weeks for delivery? Uncertain if Amazon is tightening their belts and making non-Prime members pay the price or the quality of Amazon's business practices are is diminishing which eventually happens to many organizations.I began searching other online business to see if I can find better prices etc....I never used to question Amazon's integrity however, there seems to be a bit of a snowball effect which is causing me to question things and stray..... I purchase a ton of stuff from Amazon yet, they ban me from leaving reviews and take literally several weeks to deliver items? Then they aren't even capable of protecting my account from being hacked, items I never purchased but, they chose to disregard the issue?",2024-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,8.0,8.0,1992,344,44,6,65.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ive purchasing amazon year like many others doseveral year ago account hacked purchase made account uncertain occurred amazon never caught iti told amazon rep close account advised recently purchased tv concerned proof purchase need told would still available however never able access information anywherei prohibited posting review purchase amazon claimed due previous review banned ever submitting review againi dont recall ever posting review would warrant banned made multiple request tell submitted caused banned however amazon never respondednow im noticing time place order delivery time take longer longeri dont think anything mentioned matter think amazon attempt get join amazon prime never took issue amount time took receive item however wait time week receive delivery placed order third week july deluvery window seven item listed sept six week delivery uncertain amazon tightening belt making nonprime member pay price quality amazon business practice diminishing eventually happens many organizationsi began searching online business see find better price etci never used question amazon integrity however seems bit snowball effect causing question thing stray purchase ton stuff amazon yet ban leaving review take literally several week deliver item arent even capable protecting account hacked item never purchased chose disregard issue,0.0017137593786707127,0.9982862406213293,0.19293325855300056,0.2,0.8377297720212649,83.77297720212648,High Trust
