Randi McKie,/users/665c92bf9e5419392f7bbb5e,US,1.0,2024-06-02 17:50:15+00:00,1.0,"Amazon's Phone Customer Service Forgot The ""Service""","Amazon's customer service via the phone is awful. First there's the AI Voice asking questions, then the wait for a human being to take your call, and finally the human being intentionally hangs up although I'm certain Raja will claim an accidental disconnect. Customer service representatives are supposed to help customers, not create more issues. I wouldn't have called and wasted my time if I didn't need help, but the person who is to supposed to help me (Raja) decides it's better to end the call. I still have an issue and Raja gets paid to treat Amazon's customers like dog dirt. This is a big reason I shop very sparingly with Amazon. The bigger a company gets the worse the service gets.",2024-06-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,2.0,696,123,52,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service via phone awful first there ai voice asking question wait human take call finally human intentionally hang although im certain raja claim accidental disconnect customer service representative supposed help customer create issue wouldnt called wasted time didnt need help person supposed help raja decides better end call still issue raja get paid treat amazon customer like dog dirt big reason shop sparingly amazon bigger company get worse service get,0.008816313306698043,0.9911836866933019,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.8093888147431736,80.93888147431736,High Trust
Carl Van Gorkom,/users/665c8aa2a755ef0b0a258f43,US,1.0,2024-06-02 17:20:38+00:00,1.0,Bait and Switch,"Tried to buy item advertised at $499 for 4 days. I tried to purchased on second day and the price in cart changed to $799. Called CS and told too bad it’s not on sale even though I am looking at the ad as we spoke. Customer service then accused me of lying. After 5 emails, they will no longer respond.  Classic case of bait and switch!!!After 15 years and thousands of dollars I will be switching to Walmart. They have same products and faster shipping. Needs to be a class action on pricing, not the first time this has happened. ",2024-05-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,2.0,532,101,15,3,16.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,tried buy item advertised day tried purchased second day price cart changed called c told bad it’s sale even though looking ad spoke customer service accused lying email longer respond classic case bait switchafter year thousand dollar switching walmart product faster shipping need class action pricing first time happened,0.5401858051374034,0.45981419486259656,0.056646102075154234,0.2,0.5412363178463291,54.123631784632906,Medium Trust
