Dead Days,/users/57334b6f0000ff000a1f323c,GB,10.0,2024-06-02 10:52:04+00:00,1.0,Fake or wrong item! Amazon service has gone to sh!t,Amazon customer service / care has really gone down hill! I understand that there are people that take advantage of Amazon but the rest of us suffer. I bought a 1TB Amazon basic micro SD card. Now the new thing is that the send you a code that you must give the driver. I am more than happy with this as it will stop scammers but I was out and had to rush home and then sit and wait for the driver. (NO WHERE WHEN PLACING THE ORDER DO THEY STATE THIS). I  received the card however it was the wrong size (256GB) NOT a 1TB. Now I understand that mistakes happen and that Amazon have to follow protocol they asked me to send some photos of it.   (I sent photos as they request name and date)I did this and explained to them how urgently I need a card (they ensured me I could use the one received) and that there would be a case to see what’s happened. I then spoke to the person and said I am happy to keep the card but please just charge me the correct amount and refund the rest or replace item.  All was ok and yes sure from agent side only to wake up today and they state that only once item is returned a full refund will be issued? (Again I am happy to do this but I explained to the agent I’ll still be on holiday) come to think of it the last few deliveries I have had from Amazon have been terrible from NOT following instructions to just being charged for apps that Amazon think I would like (if I didn’t question it I would of not been refunded) prime has adverts too?? Had anyone else had a bad experience? I been a loyal customer for years yet no compensation or keep the item and here is a voucher or refund. I really need to think about staying with Amazon.  They so quick to take your money yet if it’s a refund can take up to two weeks? My advice is Amazon need to check there items before sending out. The drivers need to follow instructions.,2024-06-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,6.0,2.0,1859,367,51,10,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service care really gone hill understand people take advantage amazon rest u suffer bought tb amazon basic micro sd card new thing send code must give driver happy stop scammer rush home sit wait driver placing order state received card however wrong size gb tb understand mistake happen amazon follow protocol asked send photo sent photo request name datei explained urgently need card ensured could use one received would case see what’s happened spoke person said happy keep card please charge correct amount refund rest replace item ok yes sure agent side wake today state item returned full refund issued happy explained agent i’ll still holiday come think last delivery amazon terrible following instruction charged apps amazon think would like didn’t question would refunded prime advert anyone else bad experience loyal customer year yet compensation keep item voucher refund really need think staying amazon quick take money yet it’s refund take two week advice amazon need check item sending driver need follow instruction,0.04191700126957845,0.9580829987304216,0.2058328659562535,0.2,0.8202080725564616,82.02080725564616,High Trust
