Natalya Abarbanel,/users/6658c40013022d2f75f5d207,US,1.0,2024-05-30 20:23:08+00:00,1.0,There is no low enough rating I can give to Amazon,"There is no low enough rating I can give to Amazon. When delivery goes smoothly people don’t notice it. However, if an order has not been delivered on time, this company takes absolutely no responsibility and has no control over the situation. Amazon took 90% of a global market and they just no longer care about customer’s satisfaction. Their off-shore customer service is something else completely. If you are trying to get any information about your order that has been  delayed , forget about it. They have no access , no rights, no work ethics They would feed you with lies or they just hang up. I’ve been waiting for a milestone birthday present to be delivered to my co-worker. Her Birthday was May 28. Everyday Amazon CS has been telling me that it would be delivered next day. Just now their delivery logistics supervisor, located in different country, of cause, has told me that they have absolutely no control over their delivery stations and that I should wait another 24-48 house and if it is still not delivered, I should cancel. Lessons learned, if there is any way not to buy on Amazon , don’t buy from them. Or at least NEVER buy anything that is time sensitive. It is time for Sherman Act to kick in. Amazon is out of hands . ",2024-05-29 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,30.0,1245,224,50,11,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,low enough rating give amazon delivery go smoothly people don’t notice however order delivered time company take absolutely responsibility control situation amazon took global market longer care customer’s satisfaction offshore customer service something else completely trying get information order delayed forget access right work ethic would feed lie hang i’ve waiting milestone birthday present delivered coworker birthday may everyday amazon c telling would delivered next day delivery logistics supervisor located different country cause told absolutely control delivery station wait another house still delivered cancel lesson learned way buy amazon don’t buy least never buy anything time sensitive time sherman act kick amazon hand,0.005504824284917612,0.9944951757150824,0.1256309590577678,0.2,0.8223737796690946,82.23737796690946,High Trust
