donna mills,/users/65d1392b29af5e001239ed7d,GB,3.0,2024-05-28 00:07:13+00:00,1.0,Feeling annoyed and frustrated ,"It is impossible to obtain a truthful response from the Amazon customer service team, and there is no avenue to escalate the issue and file an official complaint. I am frustrated with the constant lies I am told whenever an item goes missing or is delivered late. Yesterday, I ordered scattering urns for my parents' ashes, with an expected delivery time between 1.30 and 3.30 pm today.  When I checked the tracking information, it showed the driver parked near my house without any movement for hours. Upon contacting customer service through live chat, I was assured that the items were still out for delivery, despite evidence to the contrary. After speaking with multiple representatives, I was given conflicting information about the delivery attempt. Ultimately, I was informed that the item would still be delivered, but it was already late in the evening and unlikely to arrive today. To my dismay, the delivery date was suddenly changed to the 29th of May. This is not the first time such issues have occurred, and despite promises of refunds for the inconvenience, I have never received them. It seems that Amazon's customer service team protects each other, as there is no effective way to lodge a complaint against them. Unfortunately, it appears that sharing my negative experiences on review platforms like Trustpilot will not result in any action being taken. So I’m probably wasting my time writing this review as nothing will happen as usual ",2024-05-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,28.0,1459,242,31,4,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,impossible obtain truthful response amazon customer service team avenue escalate issue file official complaint frustrated constant lie told whenever item go missing delivered late yesterday ordered scattering urn parent ash expected delivery time pm today checked tracking information showed driver parked near house without movement hour upon contacting customer service live chat assured item still delivery despite evidence contrary speaking multiple representative given conflicting information delivery attempt ultimately informed item would still delivered already late evening unlikely arrive today dismay delivery date suddenly changed th may first time issue occurred despite promise refund inconvenience never received seems amazon customer service team protects effective way lodge complaint unfortunately appears sharing negative experience review platform like trustpilot result action taken i’m probably wasting time writing review nothing happen usual,0.008728667333109051,0.9912713326668909,0.1357263039820527,0.2,0.822780927129856,82.2780927129856,High Trust
Stephen Starling,/users/6654fee5f50d234e518f2911,US,1.0,2024-05-27 23:45:15+00:00,1.0,The last person i spoke with was very…,"The last person i spoke with was very rude, and was basically telling me that it's my fault that my order was delivered messed up. I ordered the shorts needing them for an event tomorrow, but they were delivered today ripped. So, now not only do i have to go out spend more money to buy more, and even told her i didn't want or need the refund that i still want the shorts only to be told that a replacement was unavailable and that i need to send in the shorts and wait for them to be received processed before i can be refunded, so i simply asked are you kidding me then she wants to get an attitude saying no she isn't kidding and that it can take 30 days or more to get them processed for a refund i still even asked if there was any way possible for me to get my refund into my Ammazon gift card balance so that i could order another pair to which she was again rude as hell saying no i had to not only wait the 30 plus days for the refund to be issued but i have to wait another 10 days for it to go back to my card. So, satisfied sadly after this refund is processed i will no longer bee ordering anything from Amazon again, and i took screen shots of the conversation and how rude this person was and i will be on every platform i can find leaving reviews about this. So, not only did Amazon lose me as a customer today but they also lost everyone of my family members and friends that use Amazon. We will be ordering from TikTok shop and ebay from now on. TikTok shop usually has better prices and neither one of them have ever been rude like this to me before and never have i ever had something delivered to me ripped up and i get blamed basically for it and get told I'm basically screwed on getting my money back for a month and a half. I have only had one package come messed up from another place and i contacted customer support and they gave me a choice of getting refunded or i could have the same thing i ordered mailed out that day, to wait on my money for a month and a half is absolutely ridiculous and unacceptable especially when it's either Amazon's fault or the delivery company THEY USED to have my order delivered. I guess you guys at Amazon forget that us customers are the ones that keep you employed and for you to treat your customers that spend alot of money with you the way you treated me is beyond crazy. But hey losing around 10-15 prime customers in one day is no sweat for y'all even though one single person is the one that made these 10-15 prime customers leave. So, congrats Amazon keep it up and I'm sure you'll be losing alot more. Hope you enjoy this terrible review on every platform i find showing everyone how you treat people.",2024-05-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,27.0,2675,523,38,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,last person spoke rude basically telling fault order delivered messed ordered short needing event tomorrow delivered today ripped go spend money buy even told didnt want need refund still want short told replacement unavailable need send short wait received processed refunded simply asked kidding want get attitude saying isnt kidding take day get processed refund still even asked way possible get refund ammazon gift card balance could order another pair rude hell saying wait plus day refund issued wait another day go back card satisfied sadly refund processed longer bee ordering anything amazon took screen shot conversation rude person every platform find leaving review amazon lose customer today also lost everyone family member friend use amazon ordering tiktok shop ebay tiktok shop usually better price neither one ever rude like never ever something delivered ripped get blamed basically get told im basically screwed getting money back month half one package come messed another place contacted customer support gave choice getting refunded could thing ordered mailed day wait money month half absolutely r