T. V.,/users/5ea1327184263142ec1bdf0d,CA,7.0,2024-05-27 19:54:20+00:00,1.0,ZERO CUSTOMER SERVICE! ZERO RESPECT & APPRECIATION FROM AMAZON!!  ,"I decided to share my experience in dealing with Amazon, especially it’s negative flows. 1. There is no transparency from some vendors, especially from China, about return policy and shipping. I had to deal a few times with situations when the company claims their merchandise is refundable, but in fact they want you to pay for the return out of your own pocket! This is SCAM!! 2. Encountered problems with ordering dog’s treats and supplements. Dog treats were extremely dry and old! The supplements came EXPIRED and total ignore from the company to my complains and no refund!! 😡😡 “No refund on pets supplements “ message was only was provided when I tried to return it. THIS IS ALSO SCAM!!! 😡😡3. Like probably for many other people, I find that some prices are much higher than in stores for identical products! 4. I’m sick and tired to see unreasonably high “delivery” fees added to the price tag! This is again especially true for the Chinese vendors. 5. I find it that delivery home, here in Toronto, is disgusting!! Our camera captured a few time like delivery men toss the packages to the ground instead of carefully placing it. Noteworthy to mention how they take the pictures when they leave the package near your door. Once they sent my son a picture of a completely wrong package with a computer keyboard. The picture captured square type of box, where the keyboard no way could have even fit it. The actual package has NEVER arrived!! Once in Toronto a delivery man text me that he couldn’t find my address (😱🙄) and gave me only 5 min to respond back. They obviously don’t think and don’t care, that a person may not see a text within 5 min or be unavailable. I got a feeling he even didn’t try to delivered as it was a day after some minor snowfall! For delivery they ask for any “special instructions”; mine was “please ALWAYS ring the bell!” No, they don’t bother and don’t care that thefts are not only possible, but are very common now! 6. The worse thing of all, that if you encounter any problem, there is no one to contact to resolve an issue immediately or even EVER!! This company obviously DOES NOT CARE about customers satisfaction!!! They are blinded by all the money they get from us, yet treat people without any due respect!! 7. Amazon encounters very serious PROBLEMS SECURING CUSTOMERS’ PERSONAL INFORMATION and this is a NO-NO!! 😡😡🙏I AM EXTREMELY DISAPPOINTED with many business and customer service aspects of this company and will STOP or drastically REDUCE my dealing to the necessary minimum! I will support a small, hard-working guy, who appreciates my business!! ",2024-05-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,27.0,2602,455,66,9,26.0,0,30,1,0,Genuine,decided share experience dealing amazon especially it’s negative flow transparency vendor especially china return policy shipping deal time situation company claim merchandise refundable fact want pay return pocket scam encountered problem ordering dog’s treat supplement dog treat extremely dry old supplement came expired total ignore company complains refund 😡😡 “no refund pet supplement “ message provided tried return also scam 😡😡 like probably many people find price much higher store identical product i’m sick tired see unreasonably high “delivery” fee added price tag especially true chinese vendor find delivery home toronto disgusting camera captured time like delivery men toss package ground instead carefully placing noteworthy mention take picture leave package near door sent son picture completely wrong package computer keyboard picture captured square type box keyboard way could even fit actual package never arrived toronto delivery man text couldn’t find address 😱🙄 gave min respond back obviously don’t think don’t care person may see text within min unavailable got feeling even didn’t try delivered day minor snowfall delivery ask “special instructions” mine “please always ring bell” don’t bother don’t care theft possible common worse thing encounter problem one contact resolve issue immediately even ever company obviously care customer satisfaction blinded money get u yet treat people without due respect amazon encounter serious problem securing customers’ personal information nono 😡😡🙏i extremely disappointed many business customer service aspect company stop drastically reduce dealing necessary minimum support small hardworking guy appreciates business,1.0,0.0,0.25518788558609085,0.2,0.35103757711721817,35.10375771172182,Low Trust
