Pamela Duncan,/users/5d7f5ef8ab5050fb6763e50f,GB,8.0,2024-05-25 18:55:36+00:00,1.0,My parcel was left outside the main…,"My parcel was left outside the main multi occupancy building again because they couldn't be bothered to bring it to my own personal front door. I have ostio arthritis in both knees and hips. I live at the end of a corridor. It is quicker for a fit person to delivery to my door than for me to go all the way along a corridor and down into the lift to the ground floor and having to bend to retrieve my parcel from outside the main door where anyone can take it. We have a small carpark outside and although private we do have people who are not a resident come and use it. The parcel could be taken by anyone.I have paid for delivery to my door. It has not been. They either don't know how to use the panel to gain access or they can't be bothered. Therefore I should not be charged delivery. I am thinking to cancel my account because of this. All I ask is that if I am paying for delivery, please deliver to my own personal door and not outside a multi occupancy building.",2024-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,25.0,974,191,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,parcel left outside main multi occupancy building couldnt bothered bring personal front door ostio arthritis knee hip live end corridor quicker fit person delivery door go way along corridor lift ground floor bend retrieve parcel outside main door anyone take small carpark outside although private people resident come use parcel could taken anyonei paid delivery door either dont know use panel gain access cant bothered therefore charged delivery thinking cancel account ask paying delivery please deliver personal door outside multi occupancy building,0.026977278297839264,0.9730227217021608,0.1071228266965788,0.2,0.8079359261903961,80.79359261903961,High Trust
