D Haddow,/users/6650c57fe16bb9906c4e8888,US,1.0,2024-05-24 18:51:31+00:00,1.0,Amazon shipped order by UPSPOST and the…,"Amazon shipped order by UPSPOST and the emailed me to say delivery failed. Why did it fail. Because this delivery method has UPS leave the package at the Post Office after the mail carrier has already left. Amazon “customer service” says they did this because the system said to. This order is a recurring order and Amazon has not used this shipping method in the past. Interestingly enough, the UPS truck drove by my house twice after the delivery “failed.” Amazon has grown far too big - the customer is no longer first.",2024-05-24 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,24.0,522,93,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon shipped order upspost emailed say delivery failed fail delivery method ups leave package post office mail carrier already left amazon “customer service” say system said order recurring order amazon used shipping method past interestingly enough ups truck drove house twice delivery “failed” amazon grown far big customer longer first,0.010542150466608703,0.9894578495333913,0.05215928210880538,0.2,0.8051607811884567,80.51607811884567,High Trust
