SUSAN DAVIS,/users/5b2306014de5666d34a547e2,US,3.0,2024-05-24 04:46:52+00:00,1.0,Dishonest company,"Dishonest company.  I have made several attempts to get help with my problem but no customer support people have been able to resolve it.  I have tried numerous times.  The last customer rep I talked with was Dewong today between 5 and 6 MST. Below is my issue:Amazon has been double charging or in some cases charging up to four times the amount of my EBT orders. I found this out when I was on vacation two weeks ago. I have checked all my expenditures in my food stamp account for at least a year. This has happened probably 30 to 50 times charging me anywhere from 2-4 times the same amount in my EBT account, usually on the same day but at different times. I have tried to resolve these overcharges with customer service but to no avail. There may be a government website that I can contact because of fraudulent charges on my EBT card. I have proof of all these transactions.  Amazon does not let you file an online review of their company on their website.  They will take reviews of any of the products you purchased, but nowhere does it let you make any comments about their company.Amazon truly doesn't seem to care about its customers.  It is ridiculous they are trying to rob the EBT customers, EBT customers are the ones who are already in dire straights financially.I will be glad to update this issue if it gets resolved.  Perhaps it is a glitch in their system, but this should not be happening and needs to be addressed.  I would love to hear from other customers who have had this problem.  Still looking for a resolution.I just reviewed many of the other complaints of other users, I understand their complaints, I have had many of the same issues that they are talking about, like customer reps lying to them, it not being easy to contact them, I am not their customer, delivering to the incorrect address, etc., I have heard it all from their customer service if you can get hold of them.",2024-05-23 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,24.0,1909,348,17,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dishonest company made several attempt get help problem customer support people able resolve tried numerous time last customer rep talked dewong today mst issueamazon double charging case charging four time amount ebt order found vacation two week ago checked expenditure food stamp account least year happened probably time charging anywhere time amount ebt account usually day different time tried resolve overcharge customer service avail may government website contact fraudulent charge ebt card proof transaction amazon let file online review company website take review product purchased nowhere let make comment companyamazon truly doesnt seem care customer ridiculous trying rob ebt customer ebt customer one already dire straight financiallyi glad update issue get resolved perhaps glitch system happening need addressed would love hear customer problem still looking resolutioni reviewed many complaint user understand complaint many issue talking like customer rep lying easy contact customer delivering incorrect address etc heard customer service get hold,0.0044934488519103675,0.9955065511480896,0.195176668536175,0.2,0.8367886092812798,83.67886092812799,High Trust
