Gail Peacock,/users/59463e400000ff000aa50788,GB,9.0,2024-05-23 16:05:26+00:00,1.0,Delivery Problems - Apparently Unresolvable,"I recently ordered several items from Amazon, to be delivered by Evri.  The items were due to be delivered a few days ago, then I got a message from Evri saying that they tried to deliver but couldn't because access to our house was blocked.  This was untrue.  I was at home all day and no delivery van appeared, and the access to our house is always clear.  I looked on my Amazon order page, and it advised me to contact Evri.  I really tried to do this.  There is no option on Evri's site to speak to a human being, so I left a message on their chatbot explaining the problem.  They didn't reply, but instead left me a message saying they had tried to deliver again and still couldn't.  This is nonsense.  Whoever they are trying to deliver to, it's not to our address.  On my Amazon account it now says that Evri have paused the delivery until I contact them with more information.  What information?! And how am I supposed to do this, when they won't talk to me?!!Instead I contacted Amazon customer service and asked for a refund for the items.  The agent told me that they couldn't request a refund until the following day, so he would phone me back today.  Today he sent me an email saying he can't get through on my number, I don't know why, and that I need to call Amazon back.  I did this, and the line was so bad I could barely hear the lady I was trying to explain the problem to.  She said she would process a refund.  Later I looked at my Amazon account to check the status of the items, and there was no change, so I phoned back to check that the refund had been requested.  I was told that it hadn't, and that it will be done now and will be in my bank account next week. After all the problems, I have little faith that it will happen.  I have wasted hours trying to resolve this and I am at my wit's end.  It is absurd and not good enough.  I buy a lot from Amazon, but this has put me off and from now on I will shop locally whenever possible.",2024-05-23 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,23.0,1962,381,43,5,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,recently ordered several item amazon delivered evri item due delivered day ago got message evri saying tried deliver couldnt access house blocked untrue home day delivery van appeared access house always clear looked amazon order page advised contact evri really tried option evris site speak human left message chatbot explaining problem didnt reply instead left message saying tried deliver still couldnt nonsense whoever trying deliver address amazon account say evri paused delivery contact information information supposed wont talk meinstead contacted amazon customer service asked refund item agent told couldnt request refund following day would phone back today today sent email saying cant get number dont know need call amazon back line bad could barely hear lady trying explain problem said would process refund later looked amazon account check status item change phoned back check refund requested told hadnt done bank account next week problem little faith happen wasted hour trying resolve wit end absurd good enough buy lot amazon put shop locally whenever possible,0.6498451959460153,0.3501548040539847,0.213684800897364,0.2,0.5178143622064652,51.78143622064651,Medium Trust
