terry ann berger,/users/662b56318288950011e03fbc,US,3.0,2024-05-21 16:31:02+00:00,1.0,"Safety issues with supplements that were tampered with, and Amazon does not care!","On 5/17/24, I picked up my order for Prevagen brain supplement. The product was packaged inside a sturdy cardboard box that had the safety seal broken. There was a red sticked on the box that stated, ""The box clearly states that ""This is a set. DO NOT SEPARATE"". Obviously, the box has been tampered with, and 2 bottles of the product have been removed. The bottle had no safety seal at all, and there is no way that I am using this product. I looked online, and there are many more reviews that state the same thing. Amazon customer service gave me a refund, but I wanted to post the review to warn other customers of the tampering issue. Guess what? My review doesn't meet community standards! Amazon doesn't want any reviews to pertain to the seller, which is ridiculous, since the package was tampered with, the safety seal on the outside of the box had been slit open, the package had originally contained 3 bottles, not just one, and the worst, the bottle itself had no safety seal, and someone had access to the supplements before shipping. Great idea, Amazon. Don't have any reviews that warn a customer of potential safety issues on a product. Better that you make additional sales, which may cover your legal issues if the product is not Prevagen!",2024-05-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,21.0,1257,224,81,13,4.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,picked order prevagen brain supplement product packaged inside sturdy cardboard box safety seal broken red sticked box stated box clearly state set separate obviously box tampered bottle product removed bottle safety seal way using product looked online many review state thing amazon customer service gave refund wanted post review warn customer tampering issue guess review doesnt meet community standard amazon doesnt want review pertain seller ridiculous since package tampered safety seal outside box slit open package originally contained bottle one worst bottle safety seal someone access supplement shipping great idea amazon dont review warn customer potential safety issue product better make additional sale may cover legal issue product prevagen,0.2719702651415736,0.7280297348584264,0.1256309590577678,0.2,0.6891410592407667,68.91410592407668,Medium Trust
Luca,/users/664ca3f62c441a40be6e023c,DE,2.0,2024-05-21 16:10:42+00:00,1.0,New acc. got blocked over nothing,"My account has been temporarily blocked. I had created it so that I no longer had to order via my mother's account (I'm 18), so it was a brand new account.An order on invoice was canceled directly by amazon (I can still understand because of the creditworthiness of new customers) and my account was then blocked. I sent amazon the necessary data to get access to my account again. Since it didn't work out with an invoice purchase, I decided to buy with a gift card. And guess what... my account was blocked again. This time I also sent Amazon my receipt from the supermarket where I bought the gift card, only to receive an e-mail informing me that my account would still be blocked. I don't understand how Amazon determines what is suspicious and what is not. The fact is that my 80 euros are now waiting at amazon and I can't use them...Watch out! Because the service doesn't seem to care whether their work has done any good or not! And yes, contacting a customer via no-reply mail also shows a lot of understanding and problem-solving skills. I am totally amazed! Amazon's competence is even worse than I have ever experienced!",2024-05-20 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,21.0,1133,203,33,6,1.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,account temporarily blocked created longer order via mother account im brand new accountan order invoice canceled directly amazon still understand creditworthiness new customer account blocked sent amazon necessary data get access account since didnt work invoice purchase decided buy gift card guess account blocked time also sent amazon receipt supermarket bought gift card receive email informing account would still blocked dont understand amazon determines suspicious fact euro waiting amazon cant use themwatch service doesnt seem care whether work done good yes contacting customer via noreply mail also show lot understanding problemsolving skill totally amazed amazon competence even worse ever experienced,0.8794393431120887,0.12056065688791129,0.11385305664610207,0.2,0.38305093977317606,38.305093977317604,Low Trust
