A.R. LaBaere,/users/629c3d79d8e8f100115b0133,SE,17.0,2024-05-21 08:41:35+00:00,1.0,Amazon Kindle Direct Publishing Account Termination,"Amazon Kindle Direct Publishing Account Termination May Twentieth, Twenty Twenty-FourFull Publication TitleCase #27232847We wish to complain regarding the following reason:Our Kindle Direct Publishing Titles, If on a winter's night a traveler, … —have been censored as being titled identically to titles which are published via third-party portfolios.However, these works are published within Amazon’s systems beneath an abbreviated title. The full title of these works contains too many characters with which to be placed into Amazon’s publication bracket.Amazon Kindle Direct Publishing’s services may view this full title within the work’s tome cover design, which we will include herein.The following works, which are published beneath the following title,If on a winter's night a traveler, … —are actually entitled as follows:If on a winter's night a traveler, Outside the town of Malbork, Leaning from the steep slope Without fear of wind or vertigo, Looks down in the gathering shadow In a network of lines that enlace, In a network of lines that intersect, On the carpet of leaves illuminated by the moon Around an empty grave — What story down there awaits its end? — He asks, anxious to hear the story.This complaint applies to the following works:If on a winter's night a traveler, … — Volume Seventy—Four (The Abyss Laughs Book One)LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR)ID : 55470981If on a winter's night a traveler, … — Volume Seventy—Seven (The Abyss Laughs Book One)LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR)ID : 55480606If on a winter's night a traveler, … — Volume Seventy—Six (The Abyss Laughs Book One)LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR)ID : 55480451If on a winter's night a traveler, … — Volume Seventy—Five (The Abyss Laughs Book One)LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR)ID : 55474942If on a winter’s night a traveler, … — Volume Forty—Two (The Abyss Laughs Book One) by LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR) (ID: 49488429)If on a winter’s night a traveler, … — Volume Eighty—Eight (The Abyss Laughs Book One) by LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR) (ID: 55506585)If on a winter’s night a traveler, … — Volume Ninety—Three (The Abyss Laughs Book One) by LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR) (ID: 55507299)If on a winter’s night a traveler, … — Volume Ninety (The Abyss Laughs Book One) by LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR) (ID: 55506784)If on a winter’s night a traveler, … — Volume Ninety—One (The Abyss Laughs Book One) by LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR) (ID: 55506926)If on a winter’s night a traveler, … — Volume Seventy—Four (The Abyss Laughs Book One) by LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR) (ID: 55470981)If on a winter’s night a traveler, … — Volume Seventy—Five (The Abyss Laughs Book One) by LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR) (ID: 55474942)If on a winter’s night a traveler, … — Volume Seventy—Six (The Abyss Laughs Book One) by LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR) (ID: 55480451)If on a winter’s night a traveler, … — Volume Seventy—Seven (The Abyss Laughs Book One) by LaBaere, A.R. (AUTHOR) (ID: 55480606)",2024-05-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,21.0,2874,460,51,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon kindle direct publishing account termination may twentieth twenty twentyfourfull publication titlecase wish complain regarding following reasonour kindle direct publishing title winter night traveler … —have censored titled identically title published via thirdparty portfolioshowever work published within amazon’s system beneath abbreviated title full title work contains many character placed amazon’s publication bracketamazon kindle direct publishing’s service may view full title within work’s tome cover design include hereinthe following work published beneath following titleif winter night traveler … —are actually entitled followsif winter night traveler outside town malbork leaning steep slope without fear wind vertigo look gathering shadow network line enlace network line intersect carpet leaf illuminated moon around empty grave — story awaits end — asks anxious hear storythis complaint applies following worksif winter night traveler … — volume seventy—four abyss laugh book onelabaere ar authorid winter night traveler … — volume seventy—seven abyss laugh book onelabaere ar authorid winter night traveler … — volume seventy—six abyss laugh book onelabaere ar authorid winter night traveler … — volume seventy—five abyss laugh book onelabaere ar authorid winter’s night traveler … — volume forty—two abyss laugh book one labaere ar author id winter’s night traveler … — volume eighty—eight abyss laugh book one labaere ar author id winter’s night traveler … — volume ninety—three abyss laugh book one labaere ar author id winter’s night traveler … — volume ninety abyss laugh book one labaere ar author id winter’s night traveler … — volume ninety—one abyss laugh book one labaere ar author id winter’s night traveler … — volume seventy—four abyss laugh book one labaere ar author id winter’s night traveler … — volume seventy—five abyss laugh book one labaere ar author id winter’s night traveler … — volume seventy—six abyss laugh book one labaere ar author id winter’s night traveler … — volume seventy—seven abyss laugh book one labaere ar author id,0.0353776947764362,0.9646223052235638,0.2579921480650589,0.2,0.8339095822247936,83.39095822247936,High Trust
Lee,/users/5dc4845b4ae89b1c82529a2c,US,4.0,2024-05-21 02:35:12+00:00,1.0,Keeping my return money,"I returned a tackle box to Amazon on the 17th. Been looking at my credit card for the balance. Called Amazon and asked where is my return. They said it was applied to my last purchase. They didn’t tell me my refund was being held hostage on a gift card.  Or didn’t tell me my last order was discounted with a gift card. After doing the math. Amazon kept $5.17 cents. After on the phone for 45 minutes, I told them, they was never to put my refund on a gift card. It is suppose to go back to my credit card. Amazon was told another thieving incident like this and I will file with the attorney generals office. Be aware of amazons scams. Make sure your refunds go back to your card.",2024-05-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,21.0,681,133,23,4,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,returned tackle box amazon th looking credit card balance called amazon asked return said applied last purchase didn’t tell refund held hostage gift card didn’t tell last order discounted gift card math amazon kept cent phone minute told never put refund gift card suppose go back credit card amazon told another thieving incident like file attorney general office aware amazon scam make sure refund go back card,0.027728997441424135,0.9722710025585759,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.8010541776673978,80.10541776673978,High Trust
