Clare Weaver,/users/5f652f99000e296051df1336,GB,5.0,2024-05-19 12:52:18+00:00,1.0,Shocking and lies ,"Never had the best experience with their delivery because unlike other companies they seem to struggle locating our front door. We have parcels chucked over the fence, or left by a back gate exposed and in the rain.Today one better, we attempted to call but no one in. Well sorry Amazon we have a ring door bell and if you come to the door which is on our instructions you would be seen trying to deliver. Also someone was in the house and we know that no delivery van came into the close. Can't be bothered sounds right. Advised delivery next day now have to wait up to 72 hours. There is absolutely zero customer service from anyone at Amazon. You cannot get to speak to someone and when you go on chat it just loops you round and round. We've started buying goods elsewhere because there are other more reliable and honest companies out there and quite often you can find it cheaper.Come on Amazon pull your socks up. Maybe paying better you will get a better calibre of staff but I don't expect you big wigs care as long as your pockets are lined. Just one thing about customer service don't lie, honesty is the best policy.",2024-05-19 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,19.0,1128,209,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,never best experience delivery unlike company seem struggle locating front door parcel chucked fence left back gate exposed raintoday one better attempted call one well sorry amazon ring door bell come door instruction would seen trying deliver also someone house know delivery van came close cant bothered sound right advised delivery next day wait hour absolutely zero customer service anyone amazon cannot get speak someone go chat loop round round weve started buying good elsewhere reliable honest company quite often find cheapercome amazon pull sock maybe paying better get better calibre staff dont expect big wig care long pocket lined one thing customer service dont lie honesty best policy,0.01938069379909388,0.9806193062009061,0.11721817162086372,0.2,0.8137532874246257,81.37532874246257,High Trust
