AM H,/users/664918a6f9916e311fe9565f,US,1.0,2024-05-18 23:56:15+00:00,1.0,Death of an Empire,"I have been an Amazon Prime member for well over a decade and a Music + Member for several years. In my opinion, they were once a good company (I remember when they were a book seller!). Over the past few years, their service has detiorated drastically, in every way possible. I firmly believe that Walmart, Target or Home Depot are better options, depending on your needs. For your pet supplies, Chewy also offers 5% off on Subscribe & Save and they are a MUCH more personable company.  Streaming music is available from so many different companies and several are compatible with Amazon Echo devices, so there's no problem there. It seems as though Bezos got the money he needed and is now resting on his laurels. I could could go into the vast number of problems that now exist with the company, but it would take days and most people are probably already aware. I'm starting to feel like I am always on the phone with a representative who ""can't help"", but will escalate my case, which of course, means you will never hear from them again. They believe if they offer you a $5 credit for your ""inconvenience"", everything will be fine. It's demeaning, condescending and insulting. I'm all for capitalism, but, in my opinion, supporting Amazon's continuously and drastically worsening business practices, is an enormous mistake.",2024-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,18.0,1329,229,18,4,10.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,amazon prime member well decade music member several year opinion good company remember book seller past year service detiorated drastically every way possible firmly believe walmart target home depot better option depending need pet supply chewy also offer subscribe save much personable company streaming music available many different company several compatible amazon echo device there problem seems though bezos got money needed resting laurel could could go vast number problem exist company would take day people probably already aware im starting feel like always phone representative cant help escalate case course mean never hear believe offer credit inconvenience everything fine demeaning condescending insulting im capitalism opinion supporting amazon continuously drastically worsening business practice enormous mistake,0.02404835036577242,0.9759516496342275,0.12843522153673584,0.2,0.813662869124461,81.3662869124461,High Trust
