Joe Todaro,/users/5829d34d0000ff000a571f6e,US,28.0,2024-05-18 19:40:40+00:00,1.0,*Disappointing Amazon Purchase…,"*Disappointing Amazon Purchase Experience*I recently had a frustrating experience with an item I purchased from Amazon, sold by a third-party vendor called LAFIYA US. While the outer bubble packaging appeared undamaged upon delivery, the product itself inside was in an unacceptable condition. It was torn apart and crudely held together with masking tape.This shoddy state of the item has severely diminished my view of Amazon as a reputable retailer. And just two years ago, I had spent nearly $10,000 on computer parts (to build for Custom Fully Water-cooled PC) through their platform without any issues. However, this recent incident has made me reconsider being an Amazon customer going forward.What I find most disheartening is that Amazon would allow questionable vendors likeLAFIYA US to operate on their marketplace while selling non-returnable items in such poor condition. Despite being just a $20 purchase, the fact that Amazon would permit this kind of subpar seller experience after my substantial patronage over the years is truly disappointing and discouraging.",2024-05-18 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,18.0,1078,165,31,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,disappointing amazon purchase experiencei recently frustrating experience item purchased amazon sold thirdparty vendor called lafiya u outer bubble packaging appeared undamaged upon delivery product inside unacceptable condition torn apart crudely held together masking tapethis shoddy state item severely diminished view amazon reputable retailer two year ago spent nearly computer part build custom fully watercooled pc platform without issue however recent incident made reconsider amazon customer going forwardwhat find disheartening amazon would allow questionable vendor likelafiya u operate marketplace selling nonreturnable item poor condition despite purchase fact amazon would permit kind subpar seller experience substa