Sandy Smith,/users/6488d45d745d740012688112,US,3.0,2024-05-16 14:29:08+00:00,1.0,Can’t even place an Amazon order now…,"Can’t even place an Amazon order now unless you’re prime member. I know they are under fire for this, when they ask if you want to join prime, if you say no, a little round circle spins, for hours. You can forget ordering at this point. I’m moving on. I found other good places, don’t need Amazon anymore. ",2024-05-14 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,16.0,306,58,37,7,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,can’t even place amazon order unless you’re prime member know fire ask want join prime say little round circle spin hour forget ordering point i’m moving found good place don’t need amazon anymore,0.014202715671906927,0.9857972843280931,0.03252944475602917,0.2,0.7994045311152523,79.94045311152523,High Trust
Thomas Utt,/users/62ba2b547a1f150012189cd2,US,4.0,2024-05-16 20:22:56+00:00,1.0,Amazon keeps charging me for refunded…,"Amazon keeps charging me for refunded items that were already returned or resolved. Despite resolving these matters with them and receiving a refund, they repeated the same issue months later.I received an email from Amazon months later stating they didn't receive the item that I returned and that they would charge my payment method if they didn't hear from me. Concerning this specific item, my payment method was charged $57.15. An Amazon supervisor informed me that they did receive the item and would refund the charge to my original payment method. This has occurred repeatedly, with supervisors and representatives stating that I shouldn't have received the emails.I have filed complaints with my bank. They informed me that this is a common practice with Amazon, affecting several other customers as well. This situation needs to be addressed immediately and stopped.",2024-05-12 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,16.0,876,139,38,6,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon keep charging refunded item already returned resolved despite resolving matter receiving refund repeated issue month lateri received email amazon month later stating didnt receive item returned would charge payment method didnt hear concerning specific item payment method charged amazon supervisor informed receive item would refund charge original payment method occurred repeatedly supervisor representative stating shouldnt received emailsi filed complaint bank informed common practice amazon affecting several customer well situation need addressed immediately stopped,0.011725483736487755,0.9882745162635123,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.8097289575148183,80.97289575148183,High Trust
