Duke Morgan,/users/5bdc86034de5666d343f926a,US,6.0,2024-05-15 19:30:46+00:00,1.0,Amazon no interest credit a crock,"So, I decided to purchase an AIR PURIFIER, which works fine. Amazon offered 12 monthly payments with no interest, which sounded good, so I accepted that. I get my credit card bill, and... the total amount is stated.What added to my confusion was the fact that the section where it should have specified the special terms on the credit card statement showed ZERO, as in no special was applied, leaving me unsure about the details of my payment plan. ONE HOUR ON THE PHONE with Amazon and then the Credit Card Company, and what a JOKE!  I decided to pay the whole thing off and get rid of this nonsense; Amazon stock is going up, but I can't figure out why because when you have a problem, good luck with rectifying it.  OH MAN!  It's an AMAZON of Confusion!",2024-05-09 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,15.0,756,139,33,6,6.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,decided purchase air purifier work fine amazon offered monthly payment interest sounded good accepted get credit card bill total amount statedwhat added confusion fact section specified special term credit card statement showed zero special applied leaving unsure detail payment plan one hour phone amazon credit card company joke decided pay whole thing get rid nonsense amazon stock going cant figure problem good luck rectifying oh man amazon confusion,0.6450690296503939,0.3549309703496061,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.4930571845578653,49.30571845578653,Low Trust
Susan Sheppard,/users/505dca0f0000640001223843,GB,38.0,2024-05-15 18:44:42+00:00,1.0,Given up on Amazon,"Awful customer service.  I ordered an item which I received with a vital part missing. No surprises there, as this happens a lot. I contacted CS and was told the only option for return was Evri colle tion, which they booked for yesterday. No show from EVRI, but they often turn up a day late, so waited again today, again no show. I spent an.hour on chat, being passed around departments being told only option was to re-arrange EVRI collection. Having wasted 2 days already and not being able to stay in for another 2 days, this was not suitable. I was then told I could arrange and pay for return, but its a large item that I can't weigh for booking other courier. Five CS agebts in total told me onlyOption was EVRI collection. All LIED! the EVRI label could also be used for drop off at EVRI collection point. I could have dropped off 2 days ago, and not wasted 2 days waiting for EVRI to not show up.",2024-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,15.0,905,171,18,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,awful customer service ordered item received vital part missing surprise happens lot contacted c told option return evri colle tion booked yesterday show evri often turn day late waited today show spent anhour chat passed around department told option rearrange evri collection wasted day already able stay another day suitable told could arrange pay return large item cant weigh booking courier five c agebts total told onlyoption evri collection lied evri label could also used drop evri collection point could dropped day ago wasted day waiting evri show,0.33095290352094414,0.6690470964790558,0.09590577678070668,0.2,0.6537047035956692,65.37047035956692,Medium Trust
