Kelly,/users/6644d1e8cdaacc1c960f7719,US,1.0,2024-05-15 17:20:10+00:00,1.0,Awful customer services,"I ordered a few things at the same time and returned what I didn't want to keep. The return was processed, I got my refund.  I got an email a month later stating that if I didn't return one of the items I had already returned, they would charge my card again. I contact the customer service phone that I found thru the app. I was assured multiple times this email was sent in error and that I will not be charged. Ok! This email kept coming to me, and I would call each time. I finally got charged for the item again. I contacted them again and got nowhere. Amazon could not manage their own affairs', so I disputed this charge with the credit card company.  Amazon then starting to send me harassing emails asking me to cancel the dispute... they contacted my card company and tried arguing it.  They got nowhere. The account is now closed, I will not shop with Amazon again.",2024-03-31 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,15.0,876,165,23,3,45.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered thing time returned didnt want keep return processed got refund got email month later stating didnt return one item already returned would charge card contact customer service phone found thru app assured multiple time email sent error charged ok email kept coming would call time finally got charged item contacted got nowhere amazon could manage affair disputed charge credit card company amazon starting send harassing email asking cancel dispute contacted card company tried arguing got nowhere account closed shop amazon,0.028069050417146565,0.9719309495828534,0.09254066180594504,0.2,0.8044736071526156,80.44736071526157,High Trust
cham eleon,/users/6644cffd5e09ff7646267547,US,1.0,2024-05-15 17:08:53+00:00,1.0,Amazon is an absolute joke at this…,"Amazon is an absolute joke at this point. Between the shoddy delivery drivers, Indian customer service and plethora of Chinese sellers (shipping from China even). It’s just a complete soup sandwich at this point. I had a mother day gift that was supposed to arrive within time, it didn’t, and I even paid for over night shipping just to make sure. Well I tried to get a refund on shipping and they could only offer 5$ Amazon credit instead of just refunding my card. I don’t want your slap in the face 2$ and I don’t want my funds locked in your store. Shop elsewhere, Amazon is dying/dead.",2024-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,15.0,590,108,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon absolute joke point shoddy delivery driver indian customer service plethora chinese seller shipping china even it’s complete soup sandwich point mother day gift supposed arrive within time didn’t even paid night shipping make sure well tried get refund shipping could offer amazon credit instead refunding card don’t want slap face don’t want fund locked store shop elsewhere amazon dyingdead,0.010942179212853058,0.989057820787147,0.06057206954570948,0.2,0.8066433243027155,80.66433243027154,High Trust
M Hasrouny,/users/6644bb8477806e9bbc4060ca,US,1.0,2024-05-15 15:41:35+00:00,1.0,Amazon is not what it used to be,"Amazon is not what it used to be. Customer service is terrible. There is no proper communication between the warehouse and customer service. I returned 2 rugs in one box but got a refund for 1 only. The shipping label calls for both and I did what I am supposed to do, put them together. They are hiring incompetent people to answer phones, work at the warehouse and deliver. I will dispute that charge with my credit card bank because I have all my documentation intact. It’s Time for Amazon to have some competition in order for them to straighten their act. ",2024-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,15.0,561,102,32,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon used customer service terrible proper communication warehouse customer service returned rug one box got refund shipping label call supposed put together hiring incompetent people answer phone work warehouse deliver dispute charge credit card bank documentation intact it’s time amazon competition order straighten act,0.007203636178535933,0.9927963638214641,0.05720695457094784,0.2,0.8078395728249216,80.78395728249215,High Trust
help me amazon,/users/65bb67488442ee00128b17ff,TR,3.0,2024-05-15 12:51:20+00:00,1.0,SUSPEND,"Hello,I have an Amazon account associated with the email address kerimeklemee@ gmail.com. However, my account has been suspended due to intellectual property issues related to items I haven't sold. I have all the necessary authorization information and a strong defense. I have complied with all policies, and it should be accepted. They have been giving me a hard time for months, and my only wish is to recover the money inside the account since I won't be selling anymore. If you can't do that, I will complain everywhere.",2024-04-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,15.0,525,88,7,1,30.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,helloi amazon account associated email address kerimeklemee gmailcom however account suspended due intellectual property issue related item havent sold necessary authorization information strong defense complied policy accepted giving hard time month wish recover money inside account since wont selling anymore cant complain everywhere,0.01999264162386811,0.9800073583761318,0.049355019629837356,0.2,0.7998746831140334,79.98746831140335,High Trust
