pridehappy,/users/637296c4830a930012b11bd2,GB,92.0,2024-05-08 19:40:05+00:00,1.0,Toxic Company,"I've had an issue with Amazon double charging previously, and their response was far from swift. I ended up relying on my bank to refund me the amount due to Amazon failing to accept responsibility, and putting the phone down on me after hours of phone calls trying to beg for them to refund me.I now attempted to verify myself for Student Prime, however, my email was not accepted by Amazon's automated system. I sent manual verification, to be told my card wasn't saved to my account (it was). Afterwards, I was asked to resend my details which went back and forward around 3 times until I had to call them to chase it up as I needed a product urgently for an exam on Friday. Unfortunately, nobody was able to assist and my details were passed around everywhere. I've only since started receiving scam emails claiming to be from 'Apple ID' and 'Amazon Pride' which have been sent to the hide my email for Amazon. After reporting this data breach, they have done nothing about it, refused to accept responsibility and again put the phone down, while my order is still half processed. I also received an email saying someone had unauthorised access to my account and to call Customer Service, who can't do anything.I'd never trust Amazon with my details and will close my account as soon as I've received my order. Disgusting treatment of customers and don't deserve a single penny!",2024-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,8.0,1382,244,13,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ive issue amazon double charging previously response far swift ended relying bank refund amount due amazon failing accept responsibility putting phone hour phone call trying beg refund mei attempted verify student prime however email accepted amazon automated system sent manual verification told card wasnt saved account afterwards asked resend detail went back forward around time call chase needed product urgently exam friday unfortunately nobody able assist detail passed around everywhere ive since started receiving scam email claiming apple id amazon pride sent hide email amazon reporting data breach done nothing refused accept responsibility put phone order still half processed also received email saying someone unauthorised access account call customer service cant anythingid never trust amazon detail close account soon ive received order disgusting treatment customer dont deserve single penny,0.4238055890266633,0.5761944109733367,0.13684800897363994,0.2,0.6154668072813964,61.546680728139634,Medium Trust
Heather Booth,/users/663ba7f9c225536310f19511,GB,1.0,2024-05-08 18:27:44+00:00,1.0, Lego R2D2,My son ordered the Lego R2D2. It arrived today and on inspection 3 of the packs had been opened and resealed. Ironically the packs which had been opened contained the parts which make up the mini figures. Both of which are 2 of the ones which are highly collectible. All Amazon say when contacted they said to refer to Lego. This has never happened with items bought from Lego. Someone is making a bit on the side opening these packages!!!,2024-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,8.0,439,80,10,2,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,son ordered lego rd arrived today inspection pack opened resealed ironically pack opened contained part make mini figure one highly collectible amazon say contacted said refer lego never happened item bought lego someone making bit side opening package,0.7776487375833833,0.22235126241661674,0.044868199663488505,0.2,0.42014927114100603,42.0149271141006,Low Trust
Will Blanchard,/users/5ea2be550b753b649df7ac95,GB,3.0,2024-05-08 17:11:49+00:00,5.0,Amazon is my favourite shopping experience.,"Amazon probably provide my favourite shopping experience. Everything you want to know about your product is available to you from reviews, to dimensions, to Q&A, to comparisons with other products. Price is clear and normally very competitive and you can choose on delivery options to suit your price requirements, or subscribe to Prime and get things delivered scarily fast. They've been pretty good when I've had problems with things. I guess this exposes a flaw in Trustpilot as a platform. Amazon have so many customers and there is no motivation for customers to leave a positive review on the website, even though I'm sure the majority of customers would, however when you're angry you'll post a 1 star review everywhere you can. As a result the company with the best shopping experience has a sub 2-star review.",2024-04-29 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,8.0,818,137,43,6,9.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon probably provide favourite shopping experience everything want know product available review dimension qa comparison product price clear normally competitive choose delivery option suit price requirement subscribe prime get thing delivered scarily fast theyve pretty good ive problem thing guess expose flaw trustpilot platform amazon many customer motivation customer leave positive review website even though im sure majority customer would however youre angry youll post star review everywhere result company best shopping experience sub star review,0.025830342414759327,0.9741696575852407,0.07683679192372406,1.0,2.002452187177365,200.24521871773652,High Trust
