Peonce' Santa,/users/663b66fc0ba916fdb202577b,US,1.0,2024-05-08 13:50:59+00:00,1.0, Paid extra for next day delivery USPS still waiting,"Ordered shoes from highly rated seller. Paid extra for next day shipping and now 3 days past delivery date. Seller is not the problem here it's USPS and their atrocious performance. Amazon was super quick to take my money but I am still waiting to receive my order. Sad because Amazon USED to be reliable. From now on I will be shopping elsewhere, if I'm paying extra it might as well be from a store that will actually provide the merchandise I paid for.",2024-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,8.0,455,84,52,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered shoe highly rated seller paid extra next day shipping day past delivery date seller problem usps atrocious performance amazon super quick take money still waiting receive order sad amazon used reliable shopping elsewhere im paying extra might well store actually provide merchandise paid,0.02160115617985525,0.9783988438201447,0.04711160964666293,0.2,0.798621743839405,79.8621743839405,High Trust
L.O.,/users/663b5347e8722768b99f3fb5,DE,1.0,2024-05-08 12:26:27+00:00,2.0,pre-orders canceled by amazon to save money,"I've been using Amazon for years. Recently, pre-orders of books with the pre-order price guaranty have been canceled by Amazon twice with the justification given that 'the books are not available at this time'. When I checked Amazon both times I found that they were in fact available immediately, if I was willing to reorder them... for roughly 4-5 Euros more than the original pre-order. A customer service representative told me, he couldn't actually help me when I called about this problem. ",2024-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,8.0,496,82,43,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive using amazon year recently preorders book preorder price guaranty canceled amazon twice justification given book available time checked amazon time found fact available immediately willing reorder roughly euro original preorder customer service representative told couldnt actually help called problem,0.010095886259822657,0.9899041137401774,0.045989904655075714,0.4,1.104150037801104,110.4150037801104,High Trust
