Ja N,/users/6639eee6ec9f7500129197b6,CZ,1.0,2024-05-07 11:05:53+00:00,1.0,I've ordered some kitchen equipment in…,"I've ordered some kitchen equipment in December for Christmas. Due to the customs issues I didn't receive it and it was sent back to the Amazon. Since then I have contacted Amazon customer service at least 7 times and was repeatedly promissed to get my money back within 3-5 business days but it never happened. After the last contact I was told from Amazon that it is already too long since the order was made and they will not give me anything, although I was asking for the refund a whole half year. So with my first order via Amazon all I experienced was unprofessionality, ignorance and lies. I precieve the whole purschase as a scam ay I paid 500 USD and got nothing. I will definitely not buy anything via Amazon again and I definitely do not recommend it to you, unless you want to be scammed. ",2024-05-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,7.0,802,148,39,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive ordered kitchen equipment december christmas due custom issue didnt receive sent back amazon since contacted amazon customer service least time repeatedly promissed get money back within business day never happened last contact told amazon already long since order made give anything although asking refund whole half year first order via amazon experienced unprofessionality ignorance lie precieve whole purschase scam ay paid usd got nothing definitely buy anything via amazon definitely recommend unless want scammed,0.0061377146483378225,0.9938622853516622,0.08300616937745373,0.2,0.8135323765513218,81.35323765513218,High Trust
