Alberto Cornel  Popescu Cabo,/users/5ea9e32f99486b2c16e7bbb6,NL,7.0,2024-05-06 17:52:35+00:00,1.0,My nightmare with amazon customer…,"My nightmare with amazon customer service started off a few days before Christmas when I ordered a gift for my parents. A few days after placing the order, I checked my letterbox on my way back from work to find that my package from Amazon had been delivered to my neighbours, however, it was not specified which neighbours the package was delivered to. Bear in mind, I live in an apartment block with over 100 residents. So I put up a sign on the entrance asking if anyone has received my package to please contact me. I also contacted amazon asking them where my package is exactly. Consequently, Amazon launched an investigation with the courier and found that there is no further information as to where the package was delivered and as a result starts a refund process. So far so good. However, after waiting for more than a full week, I still did not receive my refund and there are no further updates from Amazon. Therefore, I called customer service, spelled out my unbelievably long university email about 3 times before they got it right for them to check what the refund status was. They then assured me that all is in order and that I will receive my money soon. Nevertheless, days passed and I still did not receive a refund. So I decided to call again. After giving the customer service worker all my details they told me that my account had been blocked due to an outstanding payment on Amazon.es, although I live in Germany and order from Amazon.de. Therefore, the refund has also been blocked. As a result, they escalated the issue and promised me that I would receive my money as this outstanding order nonsense made no sense. Nevertheless, a week went by and my bank account was still 160 euros short. Consequently, I called a third time to ask what the situation was. Bear in mind, each time I call I have to explain my situation from the beginning and carry out the verification procedure of repeating my long and complex email address and home address. After explaining my situation, customer service once again told me that they have made a mistake and that my refund will be issued. Nevertheless, the EXACT same thing happened as last time. I didn't hear back from them for days and my refund never arrived. At this point I am 3 calls and several emails in with absolutely no progress.Subsequently, I called a fourth time to figure out what the hell was going on. This time I was forwarded to someone higher up in the customer service rankings. After almost one hour on the phone, the lady assured me that she would tend to the issue herself. Once this has been done, she would call me back with the final outcome. It was already 630 pm after work when the call was coming to an end. Nevertheless, she told me that she was working until midnight and would call me back before then. So I literally stayed awake until midnight waiting for a call which never arrived. At this point I really wanted to give up but it is a lot of money for me so I checked my emails 2 days later only to see that my account has been unblocked but there is no sign of a refund. As a result, I called a 5th time now. This time I insisted on a solution on the spot. After almost an hour on the call and the customer service employee talking to his superiors while I was on hold, I was told that the final decision is that no refund will be issued. Well, let me explain their logic. Apparently, a one time pickup code was issued to me and given to the courier. Long story short, I got screwed over almost 200 euros for no reason, be careful with Amazon.",2023-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,6.0,3551,655,34,5,131.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,nightmare amazon customer service started day christmas ordered gift parent day placing order checked letterbox way back work find package amazon delivered neighbour however specified neighbour package delivered bear mind live apartment block resident put sign entrance asking anyone received package please contact also contacted amazon asking package exactly consequently amazon launched investigation courier found information package delivered result start refund process far good however waiting full week still receive refund update amazon therefore called customer service spelled unbelievably long university email time got right check refund status assured order receive money soon nevertheless day passed still receive refund decided call giving customer service worker detail told account blocked due outstanding payment amazones although live germany order amazonde therefore refund also blocked result escalated issue promised would receive money outstanding order nonsense made sense nevertheless week went bank account still euro short consequently called third time ask situation bear mind time call explain situation beginning carry verification procedure repeating long complex email address home address explaining situation customer service told made mistake refund issued nevertheless exact thing happened last time didnt hear back day refund never arrived point call several email absolutely progresssubsequently called fourth time figure hell going time forwarded someone higher customer service ranking almost one hour phone lady assured would tend issue done would call back final outcome already pm work call coming end nevertheless told working midnight would call back literally stayed awake midnight waiting call never arrived point really wanted give lot money checked email day later see account unblocked sign refund result called th time time insisted solution spot almost hour call customer service employee talking superior hold told final decision refund issued well let explain logic apparently one time pickup code issued given courier long story short got screwed almost euro reason careful amazon,0.000956441862377848,0.9990435581376221,0.36735838474481214,0.2,0.8729934560177735,87.29934560177735,High Trust
