Willie,/users/6638ae57595dcc00125c6da3,NL,1.0,2024-05-06 12:31:03+00:00,1.0,Amazon let's you pay for their own mistakes. ,"Amazon charged me for an item I returned months ago. Apparently if they haven't scanned the item 120 days after the refund they still charge you even if they lost the item. Amazon admitted their mistake before, said the item was misplaced and they won't charge. Not once, but twice, after to much time calling the CS, they guaranteed me the issue was resolved and i don't have to pay for a mistake they made.  Yesterday, day 120, they still charged me, and basically said that it's not their problem anymore and they cannot help me and just hung up on me. ",2024-05-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,6.0,556,102,45,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon charged item returned month ago apparently havent scanned item day refund still charge even lost item amazon admitted mistake said item misplaced wont charge twice much time calling c guaranteed issue resolved dont pay mistake made yesterday day still charged basically said problem anymore cannot help hung,0.010936835264594285,0.9890631647354057,0.05720695457094784,0.2,0.8059729732818924,80.59729732818924,High Trust
