anna,/users/5aa277c24de5666d34bb62d0,CA,8.0,2024-05-04 16:46:50+00:00,1.0,Avoid,"My recent experience with Amazon's customer service was frustrating and disappointing. Their answering machine is faulty, leading to long wait times to speak with unhelpful agents. As well, the new package return policy heavily favors the company over customers. It's a far cry from Amazon's reputation for excellent service, now feeling like we're just treated poorly on their platform.",2024-05-04 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,4.0,387,59,5,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recent experience amazon customer service frustrating disappointing answering machine faulty leading long wait time speak unhelpful agent well new package return policy heavily favor company customer far cry amazon reputation excellent service feeling like treated poorly platform,0.022170625401698618,0.9778293745983013,0.03309029725182277,0.2,0.7955327467495151,79.55327467495151,High Trust
Kristen K Castrataro,/users/663637ae4cd8ba00114fa5da,US,1.0,2024-05-04 15:27:20+00:00,1.0,Amazon enables cyber-stalking,"Over the past week, I have received two unwanted packages from a cyber-stalker. I could not find a phone number on the website; I had to Google it. There was no chat option on the website. Once on the phone, I had to fight with an automated system that wanted to return products I had purchased and had no option to talk to a human. When I finally reached humans, one said they would process the return and refund the sender but didn't. I then had to call the next day. The first woman said she couldn't return the item and refund the sender. Because I had already had the experience, I knew that wasn't true and asked for a supervisor. FINALLY, Trace got on the line and beautifully escalated the complaint and processed the refund and return. (Thank you Trace!) Amazon, however, needs to get its act together on the customer service end. I couldn't even lodge a complaint on their service online. Not good, Amazon. Not good. ",2024-05-04 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,4.0,927,169,29,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,past week received two unwanted package cyberstalker could find phone number website google chat option website phone fight automated system wanted return product purchased option talk human finally reached human one said would process return refund sender didnt call next day first woman said couldnt return item refund sender already experience knew wasnt true asked supervisor finally trace got line beautifully escalated complaint processed refund return thank trace amazon however need get act together customer service end couldnt even lodge complaint service online good amazon good,0.05299882522394158,0.9470011747760584,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.7924574017458531,79.24574017458531,High Trust
Charles Edward York,/users/6055c2f536087e001b49a9a8,US,22.0,2024-05-05 01:11:25+00:00,1.0,Amazon Not A Good Place To Shop,"I’m writing this review to tell the truth about amazon.com. I have been a member for several years and even though I have bought many items of good quality, some of the items sold were in poor state. I am warning customers to do your homework and research the individual sellers. Some of them are not honest and some either were damaged, defective or otherwise false goods. Furthermore, Amazon disallows bad reviews regarding late or in accurate deliveries that failed to arrive on time. This is a concern to me because it appears Amazon is only interested in profits and not customer satisfaction. They need to do better with the respective delivery companies charged with making sure things are delivered on time and to the correct address. It’s inconceivable and inexcusable for Amazon not to properly vet their sellers and deliver to the correct address on time.",2024-05-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,5.0,866,147,31,7,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,i’m writing review tell truth amazoncom member several year even though bought many item good quality item sold poor state warning customer homework research individual seller honest either damaged defective otherwise false good furthermore amazon disallows bad review regarding late accurate delivery failed arrive time concern appears amazon interested profit customer satisfaction need better respective delivery company charged making sure thing delivered time correct address it’s inconceivable inexcusable amazon properly vet seller deliver correct address time,0.028459401980037484,0.9715405980199625,0.08244531688166012,0.2,0.8022593623863133,80.22593623863133,High Trust
