Clarissa,/users/663568cc4cd8ba00114f4714,US,6.0,2024-05-08 00:19:34+00:00,3.0,Quantity over Quality ,"Been a customer for few years and as time goes on I'm reminded why I was hesitant to create an account.  Don't get me wrong they have loads of brands, variety, and prices many times are better than the seller's own website's but all good things on the surface have hidden costs. More than half the time delivery days change often without any explanations. Once I received a completely different product than I ordered and couldn't get the proper product from that seller so had to go through similar items to find a more pricey deal anyways. They did gift card the price but many times I've received items that barely resemble the ad and certainly weren't the quality the reviews said so it makes you wonder how do they stay on top? IMO humans are lazy, we don't want to have to go to five stores to get five types of things combined with free shipping that only seems free. I would also guess Amazon knows what other mega stores online or not do:you don't need the best quality if you have enough items just a bit cheaper than the competition and become a one stop shop. Ultimately my choice to go with Amazon for products, or not, isn't likely to change their business model as look at their profits year over year. But that's just one opinion among hundreds of millions and I've experienced some sellers that have quality products and they probably want a piece of the $$$ that comes with being connected to the fifth largest company worldwide, I can understand that. Good luck, read reviews and log every order. ",2024-04-30 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,8.0,1516,274,22,3,8.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,customer year time go im reminded hesitant create account dont get wrong load brand variety price many time better seller website good thing surface hidden cost half time delivery day change often without explanation received completely different product ordered couldnt get proper product seller go similar item find pricey deal anyways gift card price many time ive received item barely resemble ad certainly werent quality review said make wonder stay top imo human lazy dont want go five store get five type thing combined free shipping seems free would also guess amazon know mega store online doyou dont need best quality enough item bit cheaper competition become one stop shop ultimately choice go amazon product isnt likely change business model look profit year year thats one opinion among hundred million ive experienced seller quality product probably want piece come connected fifth largest company worldwide understand good luck read review log every order,0.004308360387941745,0.9956916396120583,0.15367358384744811,0.6,1.4285805365755186,142.85805365755186,High Trust
S.Khan,/users/6184196b9f59af001540317e,GB,5.0,2024-05-04 01:30:14+00:00,1.0,scam,"With the intension to start selling on Amazon as an individual seller I created my seller account.I picked the option of Individual Seller which they say is free of charge.As they ask you to verify your card by paying them £1 ,I did it.Instead they charged me 3 times £1..The story was not yet finished,they charged me another £30 and I received an email from these scammers that they would charge me even more as this time per my card limit my bank didn’t allow more.This all happened to me within 15 minutes of my account activation when no item was yet placed for sale by me and I had picked the Individual Seller option.So my advice to all is to be careful as they rob you.I had no option but to delete my account immediately before getting robbed any more.",2024-05-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,4.0,761,141,4,1,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,intension start selling amazon individual seller created seller accounti picked option individual seller say free chargeas ask verify card paying £ itinstead charged time £the story yet finishedthey charged another £ received email scammer would charge even time per card limit bank didn’t allow morethis happened within minute account activation item yet placed sale picked individual seller optionso advice careful rob youi option delete account immediately getting robbed,0.0307782349410254,0.9692217650589746,0.07908020190689849,0.2,0.800426922910867,80.04269229108671,High Trust
