Sheryl Read,/users/5485e9e900006400019bf7cc,GB,54.0,2024-05-02 17:49:26+00:00,1.0,I am so very disappointed with the…,I am so very disappointed with the reoccurring failure of delivery to my address leaving me to go hunting around the building to look for the item delivered which is usually left in a very public place. Today took the biscuit. I received an email saying my item had been delivered and handed to me in person. Which is utter nonsense my door bell wasn't even ring let alone me take delivery. I went to the communal area and did find what could be loosely called the delivery. Bassoon as I looked at the package I knew it was incorrect as soon as I looked at it  as I had ordered a 100 Vit D tablets and the packaging was a standard A4 Amazon envelope. You could never get a tub of 100 vitamin tablets in that. What's more there was absolutely nothing in the envelope not even a sheet of paper.  Customer services are worse than useless. Now you know be warned. The delivery people don't always deliver and will tell untruths claiming tgey have and customer services are useless. ,2024-05-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,2.0,978,181,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,disappointed reoccurring failure delivery address leaving go hunting around building look item delivered usually left public place today took biscuit received email saying item delivered handed person utter nonsense door bell wasnt even ring let alone take delivery went communal area find could loosely called delivery bassoon looked package knew incorrect soon looked ordered vit tablet packaging standard amazon envelope could never get tub vitamin tablet whats absolutely nothing envelope even sheet paper customer service worse useless know warned delivery people dont always deliver tell untruth claiming tgey customer service useless,0.06961888720821856,0.9303811127917815,0.10151430173864273,0.2,0.7854934167436193,78.54934167436193,High Trust
