Oskar Posda,/users/6633aa0181620200121081ed,US,1.0,2024-05-02 16:59:08+00:00,1.0,My item could not be delivered on time,"My item could not be delivered on time. Then two people from Amazon staff: ANKIT and KANISHKA promised me a refund. But they didn't give it to me. I contacted them again and they told me the same thing. they just fooled meThis is what they said:Oscar, As I have checked the details, As I have checked the details, Your package Is with the carrier, As they are facing some technical Issues In delivery, so the package got delayed,But please be assured, we have raised the ticket to the carrier, to make this deliver within few hours.And the carrier will take care of this,And as a token of apology, We will help you with the full refund of this Item,So you can keep the Item and the refund too.Once the Item delivered to you, Please contact us back we will Issue a full refund of this Item.I will add the notes In your account for the same.So you do not have to explain everything again.Next agent will simply help you with the refund.I hope this helps to you?",2024-05-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,2.0,959,178,38,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,item could delivered time two people amazon staff ankit kanishka promised refund didnt give contacted told thing fooled methis saidoscar checked detail checked detail package carrier facing technical issue delivery package got delayedbut please assured raised ticket carrier make deliver within hoursand carrier take care thisand token apology help full refund itemso keep item refund tooonce item delivered please contact u back issue full refund itemi add note account sameso explain everything againnext agent simply help refundi hope help,0.005599110307262076,0.9944008896927379,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.8171667936966214,81.71667936966213,High Trust
NORTHCUTT WEST,/users/600243f0e21093001a8f6ea1,US,4.0,2024-05-02 15:57:16+00:00,1.0,Amazon is the issue,"Amazon is the issue, not the drivers. Drivers do not appear in a vacuum, they are hired by Amazon. For what they pay, I am surprised they are not worst - well, not yet at least. In the last 6 months I had lost in transit packages ( handled via Amazon itself ), destroyed packages in transit, bad drivers. Most interesting is when a package is ordered, on the web site it shows next day delivery or even overnight, and then it transforms into a 3 day delivery AFTER the checkout, or never delivery....in some cases I think this is a tactic to skim money from millions of customers, who pay prime, and deliver whenever they like. Basically a free pool of floating money for Amazon at your expense. I do not want to name other sellers out there, but if all the products come from China, why pay the middle man for crappy service when I can get them less expensive directly from Chinese sellers. No, I am not advertising for any one here, but I am done with Amazon and fed up with them. Already canceled most of services I had through Amazon, and will close them all. Not worth it anymore.",2024-04-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,2.0,1085,204,19,4,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon issue driver driver appear vacuum hired amazon pay surprised worst well yet least last month lost transit package handled via amazon destroyed package transit bad driver interesting package ordered web site show next day delivery even overnight transforms day delivery checkout never deliveryin case think tactic skim money million customer pay prime deliver whenever like basically free pool floating money amazon expense want name seller product come china pay middle man crappy service get less expensive directly chinese seller advertising one done amazon fed already canceled service amazon close worth anymore,0.015283648946975356,0.9847163510530247,0.11441390914189568,0.2,0.8152409573548914,81.52409573548914,High Trust
Rod Philpott,/users/58d110310000ff000a83da57,GB,62.0,2024-05-02 13:50:55+00:00,5.0, Amazon Echo Dot.,"My daughter bought me an Amazon Echo Dot (Alexa) as a Christmas present. It works fine and came with one months free subscription to Amazon Music Unlimited.  Thereon I tried to subscribe to Amazon Music Unlimited and have been totally frustrated with emails from Amazon advising me that there was a problem with my payment.  My bank has confirmed that the bank details I gave Amazon are totally correct and I confirmed that the transaction with Amazon  was approved, but still the saga goes on. It's not a serious issue as can use the Echo Dot without the subscription, but I do get stressed with the adverts that keep interrupting the music. They suggested an alternative method of payment, but there is no alternative unless I post £5.99 in cash every month. I suggest that anyone thinking of obtaining an Echo Dot (Alexa) find an alternative supplier. Having used Amazon previously, I checked the reviews and can assure them that I never will again.",2024-05-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,2.0,952,164,17,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,daughter bought amazon echo dot alexa christmas present work fine came one month free subscription amazon music unlimited thereon tried subscribe amazon music unlimited totally frustrated email amazon advising problem payment bank confirmed bank detail gave amazon totally correct confirmed transaction amazon approved still saga go serious issue use echo dot without subscription get stressed advert keep interrupting music suggested alternative method payment alternative unless post £ cash every month suggest anyone thinking obtaining echo dot alexa find alternative supplier used amazon previously checked review assure never,0.22252622926524426,0.7774737707347558,0.09197980931015143,1.0,1.907132847229408,190.7132847229408,High Trust
