Micaela Feiteira-Vitoria,/users/5efad8a9ddda415279dcc759,GB,10.0,2024-04-29 13:05:45+00:00,1.0,Unacceptable Product Recall,"Unacceptable Product Recall - Natures Aid DHA Drops (Amazon)I am writing this review to express my outrage at a recent product recall from Amazon. In July of last year, I purchased Natures Aid DHA Omega-3 Mini Drops for Infants and Children. Just this week, I received an email stating the product has been recalled due to containing hazardous chemicals!Here's the most disturbing part - my son, who was 19 months old at the time, consumed these drops! Amazon offered a simple refund as compensation. This is absolutely absurd! A refund does not come close to addressing the potential health risks my child may have faced.I am utterly disgusted that Amazon considers a measly £5 sufficient compensation for potentially exposing my child to harmful chemicals. Their response is shockingly dismissive of a very serious situation.This experience raises serious concerns about the safety of products sold on Amazon and their handling of product recalls. Parents trust them with the well-being of their children, and this kind of nonchalant response is completely unacceptable.Other parents, please be aware! Check your cupboards for these recalled drops and take immediate action to protect your child's health. Furthermore, I urge Amazon to take product safety and recalls much more seriously. A simple refund is not enough when a child's health is potentially at risk.",2024-04-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,29.0,1366,217,27,3,2.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,unacceptable product recall nature aid dha drop amazoni writing review express outrage recent product recall amazon july last year purchased nature aid dha omega mini drop infant child week received email stating product recalled due containing hazardous chemicalsheres disturbing part son month old time consumed drop amazon offered simple refund compensation absolutely absurd refund come close addressing potential health risk child may facedi utterly disgusted amazon considers measly £ sufficient compensation potentially exposing child harmful chemical response shockingly dismissive serious situationthis experience raise serious concern safety product sold amazon handling product recall parent trust wellbeing child kind nonchalant response completely unacceptableother parent please aware check cupboard recalled drop take immediate action protect child health furthermore urge amazon take product safety recall much seriously simple refund enough child health potentially risk,0.9380880925621645,0.06191190743783548,0.12170499158721257,0.2,0.35529695203636025,35.529695203636024,Low Trust
