Brenda McGehee,/users/5f79e75b2af0b792a49eab58,US,14.0,2024-04-26 16:47:08+00:00,1.0,AMAZON DONT ASK ME TO WRITE REVIEWS ,"I have been a PRIME member for 10 years. My COMPLAINT is about my reviews being rejected!! ""MY TIME ""is valuable and 95% of my reviews are positive. I never bash the sellers. During COVID I ,and others needed ROYAL CANIN5 oz can cat food. It's a specialty for sick cats. It's the ONLY food my cat can eat. He almost died that year. You couldn't get it anywhere. A case of 24 ,5 oz cans sold for $90. HOWEVER, a very ""empathetic "" seller (sarcasm  here) took advantage of having a few cases on hand to sell for a mere $250 a case!!!!! So along with other customer's reviews about the disgusting PRICE GOUGING, I added my review. This was 2020. Mine was REJECTED. And from then on no matter how wonderful a review I wrote they found some reason to say it didn't follow ""AMAZON GUIDELINES""!! WELL here is my LAST AMAZON REVIEW ever and AMAZON can't touch it!! What you are doing is a disservice to your customers!!!! You aren't hurting me. I will add this,"" I spend a LOT LESS$$$$ on AMAZON"" I use to spend around $500- $1,000 a month or more. Now, maybe $100.Love the products ,not the lack of appreciation of me and my loyalty as a customer. So go ahead and support the PRICE GOUGERS, the corrupt. I screen shot those comments YOU DIDNT REJECT!! There are lots of different sites that offer great items but with better Customer Service!! ",2024-04-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,26.0,1337,248,36,7,1.0,0,19,2,1,Suspicious,prime member year complaint review rejected time valuable review positive never bash seller covid others needed royal canin oz cat food specialty sick cat food cat eat almost died year couldnt get anywhere case oz can sold however empathetic seller sarcasm took advantage case hand sell mere case along customer review disgusting price gouging added review mine rejected matter wonderful review wrote found reason say didnt follow amazon guideline well last amazon review ever amazon cant touch disservice customer arent hurting add spend lot less amazon use spend around month maybe love product lack appreciation loyalty customer go ahead support price gouger corrupt screen shot comment didnt reject lot different site offer great item better customer service,0.9999999999850051,1.499489421519229e-11,0.13909141895681434,0.2,0.3278182837988603,32.78182837988603,Low Trust
DebraAnna Shanghai,/users/63edd8db4a27a00011158d07,AU,2.0,2024-04-26 13:45:11+00:00,1.0,Signing back into Australian Amazon,"Signing back into Australian Amazon - Global Company but keeping the rest of us in the stone age.I travel between the UK and Australia and have not been back to Australia for a year.  Despite having the same email as verification - I needed to enter my new Australian phone number. What a nightmare!!  I am so disgusted with both the service and attitude - as the ""customer service"" person kept saying the credit card entered on the site had expired. He couldn't get past this!!  Implying that I didn't qualify for the site - I kept saying if I can enter the site I will update my payment details.  I do this regularly in the UK.I have never been able to access the Kindle site because my Kindle was brought in Australia and I lived abroad.  However, when I was back in Australia I was told to buy a new Kindle, as too much time had elapsed to link it. ",2024-04-26 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,26.0,853,161,35,5,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,signing back australian amazon global company keeping rest u stone agei travel uk australia back australia year despite email verification needed enter new australian phone number nightmare disgusted service attitude customer service person kept saying credit card entered site expired couldnt get past implying didnt qualify site kept saying enter site update payment detail regularly uki never able access kindle site kindle brought australia lived abroad however back australia told buy new kindle much time elapsed link,0.946688462712516,0.053311537287483945,0.09029725182277061,0.2,0.3447152190082961,34.47152190082961,Low Trust
