K.C Morcom,/users/662b450d47e43d0012d33c99,AU,2.0,2024-04-26 08:13:30+00:00,1.0,Horrid site with a lack of transparency and lack of easy access,"I have two email addresses linked to amazon site for Australia and USA. One business and one personal,  and I'm unable to log in with either of the emails on the Amazon.au. Therefore have attempted to change password but the process has been ridiculous because of it continuously being repetitive with puzzle solving and input matching. I've used the visual and audio etc, and it never stops and never completes the process even though I've continuously input correctly. I've tried to contact customer service and yet that continuously goes around in circles too, leading me back to the repetitive process that never ends.I have products on amazon.au and tried to contact them to find out why they have deliberately increased the pricing to 3 times the amount than I nominated. For example, a book in paperback is higher than the hardcover of the same title. Why would they do that to a producer of a product and certainly discourage a sale for the most popular customer preference. The fact I cannot get past log in process and they blatantly make it impossible to question why they have nominated to make a producers product pricing questionable does really spell a lack of transparency for the company. When it comes down to me being a customer, the site is certainly losing sales from me and for the sellers because they don't make it easy to log in to an account to make a purchase. Poor form and very unprofessional.P.S, It does make me question their selling tactics. Do they have staff on retainers or commission who also sell their own products on the site? Therefore, pushing their own products to make sales above all other sellers and do their staff have a place in listing other sellers product pricing, only to cause a dire affect to deter customers from purchasing thus the other sellers products which would only give advantage to the staff products being reasonably priced to influence sales for themselves.I know of another site that I have become very familiar with over the past 5 years who are doing the same thing and it became obvious by their marketing emails with the same old artists products being in the emails, high up in search on the site, and always in the artists spotlight. Very biased, indeed.",2024-04-26 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,26.0,2228,386,63,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,two email address linked amazon site australia usa one business one personal im unable log either email amazonau therefore attempted change password process ridiculous continuously repetitive puzzle solving input matching ive used visual audio etc never stop never completes process even though ive continuously input correctly ive tried contact customer service yet continuously go around circle leading back repetitive process never endsi product amazonau tried contact find deliberately increased pricing time amount nominated example book paperback higher hardcover title would producer product certainly discourage sale popular customer preference fact cannot get past log process blatantly make impossible question nominated make producer product pricing questionable really spell lack transparency company come customer site certainly losing sale seller dont make easy log account make purchase poor form unprofessionalps make question selling tactic staff retainer commission also sell product site therefore pushing product make sale seller staff place listing seller product pricing cause dire affect deter customer purchasing thus seller product would give advantage staff product reasonably priced influence sale themselvesi know another site become familiar past year thing became obvious marketing email old artist product email high search site always artist spotlight biased indeed,0.004808563814131811,0.9951914361858681,0.21648906337633203,0.2,0.8408935307682005,84.08935307682005,High Trust
