Erik H,/users/662a7c13aa5b2f0012f10bac,US,1.0,2024-04-25 17:53:09+00:00,1.0,"Worth customer service on the planet, what happened?","Amazon customer service is the worst I’ve ever experienced, or, I should say, has become that. This year marks the worst so far, and it’s only April. Nobody trains the agents what to do except lie, or they do not understand what you say to them. You can even water it down so anyone could understand it but they're always lost. At the beginning of the year, I had to update my phone number. It took a month of working with the BBB to even attempt that. A billion agents each telling something asinine, thinking I’d believe it being they made constant assurances that never go anywhere. They are surely trained in that.I had to give them my blacked-out ID to merely update a bloody phone number that was easier with my bank, pharmacy and post office. After all, this whole country is based on phone numbers and codes when not involving targeted ads. The former is what finally after almost a month got my number updated after all their insanely ridiculous replies to the BBB case, which shows how dense and clueless they are. It sadly gets worse.That same month, I received two items damaged beyond repair. An agent two months ago said there was no need to return the item. I have screenshots. If you mention this, they seemingly panic and lie some more. Weirdly, there are screenshots, but the mere mention of such things sends them into a frenzy. The agents in turn assure more things which they never bothered to do, like a refund for one. Two months later, I received  an email to return the item I was told to never send back. Screenshots tell the truth. They naturally took the money out after saying that if you’re charged, meaning you will be, we will reimburse you. They took it out twice.  Another agent said he fixed it and issued it, but there was no confirmation email. More screenshots. Always take them, or they’ll just lie some more. Of course, in essence it’s all they do when not assuring it is fixed and leads to more issues. I thought to check if the refund even went through two days later, but I never received a confirmation email, so I merely engaged to check. An hour later, I was promised four months of free Prime because the other agent lied about issuing a refund just two days earlier. I found out from the third agent during one chat alone (many get lost and transfer to another sometimes even more lost) for a simple issue (checking the status of non-existent and promised refunds). Amazon also conveniently and quite stupidly have no reference or ticket numbers for any chat so future agents won’t be as lost as they always are. Lovely. This agent was as nice as most are, but clearly in over his head. I took billions of screenshots, but I am fearful all the promises will lead to more chats from hell. I know nobody wants to work there since Rocket Boy is so cheap; there’s nothing worse than the people working there. 2024 has already been an absolute nightmare.  Always use chat so you can get screenshots of these fake promises. The emails have no reference numbers, as is now policy so ask for chat transcripts. Good luck in getting concrete answers for anything, as it’s all assurances to seem nice while they mislead you, or outright lie until you get the next lying agent. Fix this now, Rocket Boy.",2024-04-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,25.0,3239,585,52,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service worst i’ve ever experienced say become year mark worst far it’s april nobody train agent except lie understand say even water anyone could understand theyre always lost beginning year update phone number took month working bbb even attempt billion agent telling something asinine thinking i’d believe made constant assurance never go anywhere surely trained thati give blackedout id merely update bloody phone number easier bank pharmacy post office whole country based phone number code involving targeted ad former finally almost month got number updated insanely ridiculous reply bbb case show dense clueless sadly get worsethat month received two item damaged beyond repair agent two month ago said need return item screenshots mention seemingly panic lie weirdly screenshots mere mention thing sends frenzy agent turn assure thing never bothered like refund one two month later received email return item told never send back screenshots tell truth naturally took money saying you’re charged meaning reimburse took twice another agent said fixed issued confirmation email screenshots always take they’ll lie course essence it’s assuring fixed lead issue thought check refund even went two day later never received confirmation email merely engaged check hour later promised four month free prime agent lied issuing refund two day earlier found third agent one chat alone many get lost transfer another sometimes even lost simple issue checking status nonexistent promised refund amazon also conveniently quite stupidly reference ticket number chat future agent won’t lost always lovely agent nice clearly head took billion screenshots fearful promise lead chat hell know nobody want work since rocket boy cheap there’s nothing worse people working already absolute nightmare always use chat get screenshots fake promise email reference number policy ask chat transcript good luck getting concrete answer anything it’s assurance seem nice mislead outright lie get next lying agent fix rocket boy,0.005123057389805973,0.994876942610194,0.32809871003925967,0.2,0.863058213312949,86.3058213312949,High Trust
Rosa,/users/5bb1e7ab4de5666d34a2c582,GB,36.0,2024-04-25 15:14:17+00:00,1.0,Digital Tyranny ,"Passwords, codes, verification, authentication, error codes, reset passwords, more verification codes, etc..Just the thought of logging into my Amazon account is enough to raise my stress levels. For this reason I avoid using Amazon. I recently bought a smartphone from Amazon but I'll buy the accessories that I need from another retailer that allows guest purchases. No account necessary. No passwords. A simple life. ",2024-04-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,25.0,420,64,16,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,password code verification authentication error code reset password verification code etcjust thought logging amazon account enough raise stress level reason avoid using amazon recently bought smartphone amazon ill buy accessory need another retailer allows guest purchase account necessary password simple life,0.06475063989895974,0.9352493601010403,0.0358945597307908,0.2,0.7748035919966784,77.48035919966783,High Trust
