Dennis Bell,/users/6629bd43b70e680012df8b0c,US,1.0,2024-04-25 04:17:52+00:00,4.0,"""Reputable and customer-centric"" becomming a ""used to be"" reality!","I have mostly had good luck with Amazon over the years, but it's my most recent experiences that have me not ""smiling"".I recently ordered a new set of Sony surround speakers that were part of a renovation of what we call our ""sunroom"". When the ""new"" speakers arrived, one of the main tower speakers and the set of two Atmos ceiling-directed speakers were obvious returns. The tower speaker was without the soft foam ""sock"" that keeps it from being scratched and the Atmos speakers were carelessly wrapped in the soft foam (hanging half off) plus there were the remains of speaker wires being previously attached. I sent the tower speaker back to get another one and Amazon would only do a credit to the account and not a refund. I kept the Atmos speakers as they seem to work ok, but I felt cheated. These items should have been sold as ""warehouse"" items at a reduced price. New is new and not kind-of new and we pay a premium price for that privilege. The most recent problem was with a lightening arrester that I needed. I bought an item that would work with standard coax used by satellite and cable companies but received an item that was for larger coax. I sent it back for another one only to get the same wrong item. I'm now dealing directly with the producer of the item who is correcting the situation.After having the problem myself, I have since read where others have experienced the same problems. To add to the problem, Amazon has made it impossible to find and actual contact phone number where you can talk to a human to right things. If not for being able (at this point) to Google the number, I could not have talked to someone.These are some of the signs of a non customer-centric company.",2024-04-12 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,25.0,1709,310,66,9,13.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,mostly good luck amazon year recent experience smilingi recently ordered new set sony surround speaker part renovation call sunroom new speaker arrived one main tower speaker set two atmos ceilingdirected speaker obvious return tower speaker without soft foam sock keep scratched atmos speaker carelessly wrapped soft foam hanging half plus remains speaker wire previously attached sent tower speaker back get another one amazon would credit account refund kept atmos speaker seem work ok felt cheated item sold warehouse item reduced price new new kindof new pay premium price privilege recent problem lightening arrester needed bought item would work standard coax used satellite cable company received item larger coax sent back another one get wrong item im dealing directly producer item correcting situationafter problem since read others experienced problem add problem amazon made impossible find actual contact phone number talk human right thing able point google number could talked someonethese sign non customercentric company,0.01705985240842641,0.9829401475915736,0.17386427369601795,0.8,1.7262429285349903,172.624292853499,High Trust
Jim Hoover,/users/60c7da0a99e71c001a8079df,US,2.0,2024-04-24 23:42:43+00:00,1.0,Customer service cant find numbers to Amazon carriers,"3 Days ago I ordered  a package that I was told would be next day delivery, and it did not show up, I did get an email saying the delivery person ""tried to deliver but couldn't enter the building""The building is my home, not a business, the delivery instructions said ""deliver to the front door"", even if it were a business it was at 5:08 in the morning.I know they never even tried to deliver the package, my home has a vestibule, and a sign saying to leave packages inside the door. The door was unlocked, I was home, and up at 5:08 AM. The package as per delivery instructions could have been left at the front door!This is one of many times Amazon said they tried to deliver, but never even got out of their truck to try.The note from the Tracking told me to contact the carrier for information on the delivery. No Number, No address, just told me to contact the carrier. Who is the carrier? Who do I contact?I called customer service, I thought they could help. They simply said SORRY, we will try again tomorrow. (It was supposed to be delivered yesterday, What happened to today?)I asked the customer service rep to give me the number to the carrier. He said Amazon is the carrier but he didn't have the contact information, and could not get it. AMAZON CUSTOMER SERVICE CAN'T GET THE CONTACT INFORMATION TO THEIR OWN CARRIERS???I was extremely frustrated, told them they need to fire the driver that didn't do his job, (I may have cussed a little, LOL) and hung up",2024-04-24 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,24.0,1472,270,53,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,day ago ordered package told would next day delivery show get email saying delivery person tried deliver couldnt enter buildingthe building home business delivery instruction said deliver front door even business morningi know never even tried deliver package home vestibule sign saying leave package inside doo