Teresa Zermeno,/users/62ec30238ee6840012d2eccd,US,3.0,2024-04-24 18:36:12+00:00,1.0,If I Could rate this company less than…,"If I Could rate this company less than zero I would this is what happened to me.Unfortunately, there’s always a problem with Amazon delivery can never get what you want when you order it even being a prime member. It really sucks because your service is really bad. I never got any of my products that I ordered so I canceled everything. The GPS came up as the delivery guy going into the circle in front of my house and then saying oh I have a few more deliveries then when I go to him and ask him where my delivery is, he said I don’t even have it on my truck, you have to order something in order for us to deliver really Every time I order something I never get it delivered right they either leave it in the damn driveway or they just don’t deliver it at all and they don’t even put it on a truck but then say it was on a truck and ready for delivery, but it never comes. Everyone around me gets their damn package except for me. They always skip my house for some reason or another. The service from Amazon is the worst that you can ever get I will not be ordering again from Amazon and I order a lot. You’ve lost me as a customer. And it’s really sad because the people that sell with you they’re out money too just because you can’t get it together. An unsatisfied customer and the supervisor last last night Megan she was very rude. Told me that she couldn’t get a hold of me, but her call never went through and she’s not the one that was supposed to call me. It was another supervisor that told me he would call me at 9:00 PM last night never called. I don’t know why your service and customer service is really bad. Maybe you guys need to be trained a little bit better in your manners and the way you guys do business because you don’t know how. I will keep my prime Tv, but other than that I will never shop again with Amazon. I’ll find it elsewhere",2024-04-23