Lynette Phillips,/users/5485a87e00006400019be2f9,GB,41.0,2024-04-24 12:38:20+00:00,1.0,Had so many problems with Amazon that I…,"Had so many problems with Amazon that I will no longer use them, even though I have outstanding items to be delivered. I purchased an Apollo biscuit tin and returned it, due to its cheapness, with another item - both items in the same box. Unfortunately, I did not complete the paperwork - address label, instructions etc., due to a lapse in forgetfulness (age related). Therefore used the label from the Flexzion Teapot that went on the box for the both items not realising this was for two different addresses one for Amazon and the other a third party seller. As far as I am concerned if it's on the Amazon website then regardless of third party or not it's going back to Amazon. This problem has been bouncing around since the end of March 2024. Just spoken to someone in Customer Services (another person appearing to be helpful but not) and that is the main problem 2 different addresses. Apparently unless Amazon or the seller send this item back to me (very doubtful because of the label situation ) I can then send to the correct party I won't get my refund of £15.95! This may seem a very small amount but I am in my seventies with serious illnesses and on a fixed budget. Amazon have created so many problems for me over the last couple of years that most of the time I never return items just either chuck them or place in charity. This is definitely the parting of the waves with Amazon I really cannot stand all these problems is stressful and worring.",2024-04-24 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,24.0,1466,268,40,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,many problem amazon longer use even though outstanding item delivered purchased apollo biscuit tin returned due cheapness another item item box unfortunately complete paperwork address label instruction etc due lapse forgetfulness age related therefore used label flexzion teapot went box item realising two different address one amazon third party seller far concerned amazon website regardless third party going back amazon problem bouncing around since end march spoken someone customer service another person appearing helpful main problem different address apparently unless amazon seller send item back doubtful label situation send correct party wont get refund £ may seem small amount seventy serious illness fixed budget amazon created many problem last couple year time never return item either chuck place charity definitely parting wave amazon really cannot stand problem stressful worring,0.08147178330200483,0.9185282166979951,0.15030846887268648,0.2,0.7893258021235348,78.93258021235347,High Trust
