Carly Pippin,/users/66284fc829bec100125960ba,US,1.0,2024-05-08 02:26:42+00:00,1.0,Pathetic customer service,"Pathetic customer service. For a well known brand you would think they would be professional, but they are not. They don't keep any record of customers previous interactions. Instead they make you explain your situation ALL OVER again from the very start and ask you questions, had they taken notes or recorded previous interactions like professional companies do, they would not have to ask you to explain what is going on from the beginning all over again and repeat this every time you come back to check on the status of the issue. (Hence another problem: they are VERY slow to solve your issues.) This is common sense in a retail/customer service business. Must have dummies managing this company. This same things happens every time I have an issue with a new order/return. No one has answers for the issue. On chat, they keep transferring you to another agent. McDonalds, Dollar tree, and Walmart amongst a billion others have better customer service. A 5 year old could do a better job than these sorry excuse for employees do because their trainer or manager is simply lazy.",2024-04-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,8.0,1083,186,25,3,17.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,pathetic customer service well known brand would think would professional dont keep record customer previous interaction instead make explain situation start ask question taken note recorded previous interaction like professional company would ask explain going beginning repeat every time come back check status issue hence another problem slow solve issue common sense retailcustomer service business must dummy managing company thing happens every time issue new orderreturn one answer issue chat keep transferring another agent mcdonalds dollar tree walmart amongst billion others better customer service year old could better job sorry excuse employee trainer manager simply lazy,0.011837488407731198,0.9881625115922688,0.10431856421761077,0.2,0.8149449686396565,81.49449686396565,High Trust
