R. Riggs,/users/5ab07ad84de5666d34b98030,US,2.0,2024-04-24 17:03:11+00:00,1.0,Amazon screwed up my bank account and won't correct their mistake,"I made a purchase from Amazon on 4/22/2024.  Amazon did the preauth and settlement on the 4/22/2024, but it put the settlement date as 4/25/2024.  So the settlement was done on the 22nd, but the preauth won't be released until the 25th.  Leaving my account overdrawn.  The bank said it would release the hold now if Amazon would fax the a letter asking them to do it.AMAZON REFUSED TO DO IT, EVEN THOUGH THIS SITUATION WAS CAUSED BY *THEIR* ERROR.UPDATE:  An idiot on Amazon responded to my complaint at the Better Business Bureau by saying, ""we didn't charge you twice.""  I never said they charged me twice, I said the preauth was held after the settlement, instead of the settlement being taken out of the preauth, because the screwed up and put the settlement date as 4/25, but settled it on 4/22.  That explanation CAME STRAIGHT FROM MY BANK, and these incompetent people didn't even listen to what I told them.",2024-04-22 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,24.0,915,161,65,11,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,made purchase amazon amazon preauth settlement put settlement date settlement done nd preauth wont released th leaving account overdrawn bank said would release hold amazon would fax letter asking itamazon refused even though situation caused errorupdate idiot amazon responded complaint better business bureau saying didnt charge twice never said charged twice said preauth held settlement instead settlement taken preauth screwed put settlement date settled explanation came straight bank incompetent people didnt even listen told,0.015306845923545528,0.9846931540764545,0.09029725182277061,0.2,0.8104060274027813,81.04060274027813,High Trust
