Jeremie Lopez,/users/5edb95cacc207f53b2b1b1d1,US,2.0,2024-04-21 15:26:38+00:00,1.0,Amazon has gone downhill,"Amazon has gone downhill, I have bough from Amazon for many years and always have had great experiences until 2023. Now it’s a roll of the dice if I get my packages on time or if at all. The drivers don’t care about taking pride in their work. They lose, steal or damage items. This has happened to me many times this past year, Then we have to wait for Amazon to keep moving delivery date and time further and further out before we can request a refund. If it’s not delivered by the first estimated date and time a refund should be available immediately. Starting to wonder if there is anyone in charge at Amazon ",2024-04-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,21.0,614,116,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon gone downhill bough amazon many year always great experience it’s roll dice get package time driver don’t care taking pride work lose steal damage item happened many time past year wait amazon keep moving delivery date time request refund it’s delivered first estimated date time refund available immediately starting wonder anyone charge amazon,0.013755818860648004,0.986244181139352,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.8061338684720877,80.61338684720877,High Trust
