C Boyce,/users/6621c62a7f1db60012de0aac,US,1.0,2024-04-19 03:17:40+00:00,1.0,Amazon is fraudulent ,"I had been a loyal customer of Amazon for over 7 years until they increased their membership fees for Prime. I cancelled my account.I have put up with Amazon delivery drivers throwing expensive items over the locked gate to my complex or leaving my gaming computer outside the complex gate. All the drivers had to do was call my cell phone. I guess that this was too much trouble I recently ordered a VPN router on Amazon for paid delivery. They charged my card $193 after verifying my identity and card then put a hold on my delivery due to ""fraudulent activity"" concerns. I called Amazon customer service this morning and was assured that my item would be shipped. Since it never arrived I called customer service again and surprise surprise they had no documentation in the system that I had called earlier.The same Amazon that allowed someone to charge movies among other items to my card 4 years ago and did nothing to protect my account until my bank got involved at the time.This is retaliation at its worst.Never again Amazon. Jeffy Bezos can beso me ***",2024-04-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,19.0,1062,188,21,3,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,loyal customer amazon year increased membership fee prime cancelled accounti put amazon delivery driver throwing expensive item locked gate complex leaving gaming computer outside complex gate driver call cell phone guess much trouble recently ordered vpn router amazon paid delivery charged card verifying identity card put hold delivery due fraudulent activity concern called amazon customer service morning assured item would shipped since never arrived called customer service surprise surprise documentation system called earlierthe amazon allowed someone charge movie among item card year ago nothing protect account bank got involved timethis retaliation worstnever amazon jeffy bezos beso,0.01393523688666475,0.9860647631133352,0.10544026920919798,0.