Anonymity,/users/5b1e770f4de5666d3458419a,GB,42.0,2024-04-18 20:34:48+00:00,1.0,Amazon now uses RM to deliver…,"0I ordered an item from a seller via Amazon UK. The seller used RM as a courier and, of course, they failed to deliver. So, I got refund for that and ordered a similar item which was to be dispatched by Amazon themselves to avoid RM. However, Amazon sent the item by RM instead of using their own driver. I was horrified to see the notification from RM on this delivery as I wanted to avoid them like a plague. I called Amazon to complain; however, the agent who answered the phone told me that they were too busy and had to leave the delivery to RM even after what I experienced. He said that he valued customers. His joke was not funny.",2024-04-18 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,18.0,638,123,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item seller via amazon uk seller used rm courier course failed deliver got refund ordered similar item dispatched amazon avoid rm however amazon sent item rm instead using driver horrified see notification rm delivery wanted avoid like plague called amazon complain however agent answered phone told busy leave delivery rm even experienced said valued customer joke funny,0.04376694905756556,0.9562330509424344,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.7919134968677399,79.19134968677399,High Trust
