optional optional,/users/66208e33434f990012baddb3,US,1.0,2024-04-18 05:06:37+00:00,1.0,WORST CUSTOMER SERVICE IVE EVER RECEIVED ,"So my order got canceled even though everything was saying it was a successful order. I contacted support chat and was with them for two hours being transferred 18 times and 4 of them I asked to be transferred to a manager and instead they transferred me to another rep. I got the same people multiple times and each time they told me the same thing that they need to transfer me to the right department. After the 18th time of having hope that I’d be transferred to the right department I ended chat. Then I tried doing the request a call. Three of the times it didn’t go through the call just went to my voicemail like that’s where they directed the call. Then I got an actual call, except the app automatically ended the call. Then I got to a woman she was nice and was able to help me and told me she needed to transfer me to the grocery department. I get to the grocery department and the representative has attitude with me. Now I understand what customer service reps I work for customer service in a banks fraud department trust me I understand. But if I’m telling you what’s showing up on my end that everything was successful and that I didn’t receive a failed payment method until an hour later stop telling me it sent a minute later I even have evidence of it as well as the alerts through the app being sent through an hour later. My problem didn’t get resolved but I asked if I’d still get my free delivery for being a first time customer, as it says on the main page as a headline, first time customers with orders over $50 gets free delivery. I asked if I would still get it and she said no you can’t get free delivery unless it’s over $100. I said it’s right here on the main change and she keeps arguing with me and then I told her go to the Amazon app for Amazon fresh and it says it as a headline and she said okay I’ll escalate it to my manager to let them know about this issue, then waited 7 minutes in silence when I finally decided to end the call. THIS IS BY FAR THE worst customer service I’ve ever received. Like I said I understand what you guys go through as CS reps but please Amazon EDUCATE YOUR REPS WITH ALL INFORMATION. No one knew anything ",2024-04-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,18.0,2176,419,41,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,order got canceled even though everything saying successful order contacted support chat two hour transferred time asked transferred manager instead transferred another rep got people multiple time time told thing need transfer right department th time hope i’d transferred right department ended chat tried request call three time didn’t go call went voicemail like that’s directed call got actual call except app automatically ended call got woman nice able help told needed transfer grocery department get grocery department representative attitude understand customer service rep work customer service bank fraud department trust understand i’m telling what’s showing end everything successful didn’t receive failed payment method hour later stop telling sent minute later even evidence well alert app sent hour later problem didn’t get resolved asked i’d still get free delivery first time customer say main page headline first time customer order get free delivery asked would still get said can’t get free delivery unless it’s said it’s right main change keep arguing told go amazon app amazon fresh say headline said okay i’ll escalate manager let know issue waited minute silence finally decided end call far worst customer service i’ve ever received like said understand guy go c rep please amazon educate rep information one knew anything,0.0038263922407278136,0.9961736077592722,0.23499719573752104,0.2,0.8450862430271402,84.50862430271403,High Trust
