Simone  Ferguson,/users/5f2ea6bea9d3b21f365309ab,IE,3.0,2024-04-15 16:39:47+00:00,1.0,Amazon is a disgrace,"Amazon is a disgrace, they cancelled the smart ball 1001 that I have been waiting for now since the 15 December 2023. My son had this on his santa list. When it didn't arrive at Christmas we wrote a note from santa that so many boys wanted these the elves just could not make enough in time but would send one as soon as he can after Christmas. Amazon kept emailing me telling me that I would get a delivery date once in stock. After 2 months I realised the smart ball was back in stock on amazon. I rang amazon and asked why I had not received the ball as it is in back in stock. On 3 ocasions they apologised and said I would receive the item in the next few days. Today 5 months later they cancelled my order and offered me £20 compensation. £20 constipation was an insult from a multi million pound company. I don't want £20 I wanted the item I promised my child he would receive as a late gift from santa for Christmas. I am so annoyed, how do I explain to my son santa can't send it anymore. I going to speak to consumer rights on this issue and try take further action as I am fuming.",2024-04-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,15.0,1091,216,20,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon disgrace cancelled smart ball waiting since december son santa list didnt arrive christmas wrote note santa many boy wanted elf could make enough time would send one soon christmas amazon kept emailing telling would get delivery date stock month realised smart ball back stock amazon rang amazon asked received ball back stock ocasions apologised said would receive item next day today month later cancelled order offered £ compensation £ constipation insult multi million pound company dont want £ wanted item promised child would receive late gift santa christmas annoyed explain son santa cant send anymore going speak consumer right issue try take action fuming,0.01583885423410991,0.9841611457658901,0.12114413909141895,0.2,0.8163094007012288,81.63094007012288,High Trust
