C Ambrose,/users/55afc2680000ff0001ce817d,GB,42.0,2024-04-12 23:50:11+00:00,1.0,Cancelled my Prime membership,"Cancelled my Prime membership. Same day deliveries are rare. Amazon have this new idea where they encourage you to spend over £20 you will receive same day delivery, not true. The tv package is very average. I use to shop exclusively at Amazon but no more. Won’t miss the inflated prices or the mediocre tv and music package. Amazon do not do what they say they will do and that is deliver on time. Judging by the ratings, I clearly am not the only one who is disappointed with this service. ",2024-04-12 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,12.0,492,91,29,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,cancelled prime membership day delivery rare amazon new idea encourage spend £ receive day delivery true tv package average use shop exclusively amazon won’t miss inflated price mediocre tv music package amazon say deliver time judging rating clearly one disappointed service,0.0533589952009933,0.9466410047990067,0.05103757711721817,0.2,0.783528017822947,78.3528017822947,High Trust
Ash F,/users/6619a6c2427b7a0011a67fa4,GB,1.0,2024-04-12 23:25:29+00:00,2.0,Had enough!,"Was a Prime member for years until recently because I'm fed up mainly with customer service and the constant lying/false information.Returning an item is completely inconsistent where sometimes it will be less than a week and some times over a month with constant back and forth between customer service web chat and phone calls.... Currently waiting on a £232 refund for an item that has been sat at their returns center for 3 days now with no update. I was relying on this refund to pay bills, get food, electricity etc but nope... Holding my refund until they see fit regardless of them confirming they've received the item.  Take my money instantly but make me wait a month for it back. It's not even like I have a history of scamming with Amazon, every single on of my returns have been sound and refunded but whenever it's anything over £100 it takes this long. Once and IF I eventually get my refund, I'm not buying anything from Amazon again and I'm leaving out Prime. I'm done with the rude customer service who constantly lie and close the webchat before I even get a chance to respond. Being told one thing by one rep then told something completely different by another and that the last person was wrong and shouldn't have said that. ",2024-04-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,12.0,1246,222,11,2,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,prime member year recently im fed mainly customer service constant lyingfalse informationreturning item completely inconsistent sometimes less week time month constant back forth customer service web chat phone call currently waiting £ refund item sat return center day update relying refund pay bill get food electricity etc nope holding refund see fit regardless confirming theyve received item take money instantly make wait month back even like history scamming amazon every single return sound refunded whenever anything £ take long eventually get refund im buying anything amazon im leaving prime im done rude customer service constantly lie close webchat even get chance respond told one thing one rep told something completely different another last person wrong shouldnt said,0.015540729596032947,0.9844592704039671,0.12450925406618059,0.4,1.1171314860152197,111.71314860152197,High Trust
