Topsi,/users/65feb6b45c72ec0012eb0018,US,5.0,2024-04-12 07:03:52+00:00,1.0,Amazon customer service lies to you and even admits it. Plain fraudd an order on Amazon,"I placed an order on Amazon, choosing carefully items that fall under the category ""free shipping over USD 49"". When checking out free shipping option is not applied.So items are advertised and marked as free shipping over USD 49, but actually there are not.ORDER # 111-832****-594****Fine. Misleading.After contacting amazon customer service, I was told to go ahead and place the order. After arrival of the items, the shipping charges that were over USD 40 will be refunded. Just to contact customer service.Customer service even sent an email. Written proof about this agreement:AmazonYour AccountAmazon.comMessage From Customer ServiceHello,This email is regarding the shipping charges which you have to pay.Once the item will be delivered to you contact us back we will refund you the USD 41.52For the items listed here:- Speedo Unisex-Adult Water Shoe Tidal Cruiser Mens Black/Gull, 12 Women's Water Shoes Adult Beach Pool Swim Shoes Men White Barefoot Aqua Shoes Non Slip Yoga Shoes for Women Summer Shoes Sandals Rubber Size IceUnicorn Water Shoes Quick Dry Swim Aqua Barefoot Socks for Women Men(Black Size 9) Philips Beauty Series 5000 Electric Shaver and Personal Groomer for Women, Cordless & Compact, Hypollergenic Head, Gentle & Quick Hair Removal Easy Finishing TouchThanksBest regards,Amazon.com When I then requested my refund, a customer service agent told me that I can forget about it.That the email is meaningless and that the other agent simply lied about it.To all Amazon shoppers: DO NOT TRUST AMAZON CUSTOMER SERVICE! Unprofessional underpaid workers who handle issues according how they feel on that day or towards you.I will never order from Amazon again!",2024-03-31 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,12.0,1682,262,87,16,12.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,placed order amazon choosing carefully item fall category free shipping 