Angelika,/users/6150fa8eee3eec0012f017fb,DK,4.0,2024-04-12 05:56:16+00:00,5.0,I need Amazon help,"Hello, I'm writing a message to Amazon here because I can't contact them in any way and I need their help and I don't know who to contact with my problem.I am a customer on amzon.com and I need their help in setting up my account.  I cannot find an option to change the address, city, state of the Amazon warehouse from which orders are sent to me. I have two cities set from which my shipments are sent to me, New Jersey and California, and I would like to change my settings so that shipments only come from New Jersey,but I can't find these options myself.Could someone from Amazon help me find these options?  they are hidden somewhere deep in the options but I don't know where.Can anyone tell me how I can change the address, city, state of the Amazon warehouse where I shop?Can someone show me what options I should go to on the Amazon website to change the state and city in which I shop, step by step. For answer I  , thank you in advance.",2024-03-29 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,12.0,948,180,18,4,14.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,hello im writing message amazon cant contact way need help dont know contact problemi customer amzoncom need help setting account cannot find option change address city state amazon warehouse order sent two city set shipment sent new jersey california would like change setting shipment come new jerseybut cant find option myselfcould someone amazon help find option hidden somewhere deep option dont know wherecan anyone tell change address city state amazon warehouse shopcan someone show option go amazon website change state city shop step step answer thank advance,0.02664576832650957,0.9733542316734904,0.10095344924284913,1.0,2.006867805685315,200.6867805685315,High Trust
Chris C.,/users/642b60c42746220012c3cd83,US,2.0,2024-04-12 00:12:13+00:00,1.0,This again!?!?!,"Promise dates changed three times... Again. Ordered Tuesday April 9th (Monday). Estimated delivery Friday April 12th. Changed to Friday April 11th, ok. Today, April 11th at 5:10PM when I checked, now arriving by Sunday April 14th. Glad my mower works so I can mow my already one week overdue lawn..... Oh, wait, I can't huh? Pathetic! There is a better way but you just wouldn't listen because you, Amazon, have forgotten your beginnings. Dissatisfied and will be writing a review of this type EVERY time this occurs. Thank you",2024-04-10 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,12.0,527,89,15,2,2.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,promise date changed three time ordered tuesday april th monday estimated delivery friday april th changed friday april th ok today april th pm checked arriving sunday april th glad mower work mow already one week overdue lawn oh wait cant huh pathetic better way wouldnt listen amazon forgotten beginning dissatisfied writing review type every time occurs thank,0.20948553324301042,0.7905144667569896,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.705240407803621,70.5240407803621,Medium Trust
