J.T,/users/52d5e8f100006400015e85be,GB,44.0,2024-04-10 23:44:07+00:00,1.0,Non existent customer service / nightmare delivery drivers,"I have been a member of Amazon for over 20 years, I love Amazon, most of the sellers are great, you can get absolutely anything at great value, but the past 1-3 years the outsourced 'lack of' Customer Service and the Delivery Drivers have driven me insane.What the feck has happened?!There is no longer a customer service, the online support has been ceased, you are passed from team to team and person to person, they tell you what you want to hear and all band together and nothing gets resolved.Jeff Bezos please sort this cr*p out.We pay for the products and the delivery service - we leave instructions for our safe place etc, and yet this is ignored over and over again. The drivers are literally leaving parcels in the rain, in grass and mud, while my dry safe place is two feet to the right staring them in the face. They even have the audacity to update the job stating the parcel has been handed to the customer - I'm not even home. An advisor has also changed my delivery instructions.This week I got really p*ssed off with it and was online with advisors and a so called manager during the early hours of the morning - what a total waste of my time. He just kept telling me how to add this info to my account. I was sent an email after asking me if I was happy with the service, yes or no, and to click on the relevant link, but the links don't open, so you can't provide feedback. I've emailed twice since with photos and no replies.The service and deliveries have become an absolute joke. After being such a long term loyal customer this has seriously made me think of leaving Amazon.So Amazon, what are you going to do about this? Am sure 1000s feel the same.",2024-04-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,10.0,1674,312,58,8,2.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,member amazon year love amazon seller great get absolutely anything great value past year outsourced lack customer service delivery driver driven insanewhat feck happenedthere longer customer service online support ceased passed team team person person tell want hear band together nothing get resolvedjeff bezos please sort crp outwe pay product delivery service leave instruction safe place etc yet ignored driver literally leaving parcel rain grass mud dry safe place two foot right staring face even audacity update job stating parcel handed customer im even home advisor also changed delivery instructionsthis week got really pssed online advisor called manager early hour morning total waste time kept telling add info account sent email asking happy service yes click relevant link link dont open cant provide feedback ive emailed twice since photo repliesthe service delivery become absolute joke long term loyal customer seriously made think leaving amazonso amazon going sure feel,0.09665970698112045,0.9033402930188795,0.17498597868760515,0.2,0.7866673422469608,78.66673422469607,High Trust
Mar,/users/5901f8370000ff000a91cc8f,GB,2.0,2024-04-10 23:02:22+00:00,1.0,They don’t own up to their mistake ,"They send me the wrong item, I have therefore returned it and selected “wrong item received” as a reason and reordered the item again.They now won’t own up to their mistake and are not refunding me “because I send them the wrong item”. Are they for real ? I have send them proof and keep on receiving automatic reply.You can try and call their customer service, however they are completely useless and have no authority whatsoever. Their only solution is to keep on emailing the “specialist team” which respond in automatic email. I am now short of £228 and nothing they can do for me",2024-04-09 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,10.0,584,105,35,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,send wrong item therefore returned selected “wrong item received” reason reordered item againthey won’t mistake refunding “because send wrong item” real send proof keep receiving automatic replyyou try call customer service however completely useless authority whatsoever solution keep emailing “specialist team” respond automatic email short £ nothing,0.021313528184353715,0.9786864718156463,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.801121138319489,80.11211383194889,High Trust
Zahrah Kabir,/users/6616f5734cf6c500124fe3de,CA,1.0,2024-04-10 22:31:08+00:00,5.0,Amazon is an exceptional company that…,"Amazon is an exceptional company that provides a wide range of products at competitive prices. Their efficient delivery service ensures that items are received promptly, often earlier than expected. The user-friendly website makes it easy to navigate and find exactly what you're looking for, with detailed product descriptions and reviews to help make informed decisions. Customer service is top-notch, always ready to assist with any inquiries or issues, making the overall shopping experience with Amazon a pleasant one.",2024-03-29 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,10.0,523,78,38,6,12.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon exceptional company provides wide range product competitive price efficient delivery service ensures item received promptly often earlier expected userfriendly website make easy navigate find exactly youre looking detailed product description review help make informed decision customer service topnotch always ready assist inquiry issue making overall shopping experience amazon pleasant one,0.009306983463214855,0.9906930165367851,0.04374649467190129,1.0,2.004095807202773,200.4095807202773,High Trust
