derek woodward,/users/598c9a970000ff000aba11d1,GB,41.0,2024-04-10 17:53:10+00:00,1.0,Placed an order on the 2nd of April…,"Placed an order on the 2nd of April 2024. On the 3rd of April I got a notification to say my items had been delivered, they had not, I went outside to look for the driver, I checked the usual places drivers sometimes leave good and I spoke to neighbours, my goods were nowhere to be seen. I phoned amazon, spoke to a lady who could barely speak English, she put me on hold and said she whould be 3 or 4 minutes, I waited half an hour so I hung up and instantly got an email with details of what to do if you don't get your goods, she had no intention of speaking to me again and I was very polite. One week later and still no sign of my goods, no follow up from amazon so this is the last time I'm wasting money with this company. No more amazon for me. ",2024-04-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,10.0,754,155,36,8,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,placed order nd april rd april got notification say item delivered went outside look driver checked usual place driver sometimes leave good spoke neighbour good nowhere seen phoned amazon spoke lady could barely speak english put hold said whould minute waited half hour hung instantly got email detail dont get good intention speaking polite one week later still sign good follow amazon last time im wasting money company amazon,0.06467869435380252,0.9353213056461975,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.7850470801927005,78.50470801927005,High Trust
