Helen Thompson,/users/66166eb874c7bb0012376030,PL,2.0,2024-04-10 12:52:35+00:00,1.0,Not recieving a refund for item I returned ,"On January 29, 2024, I made a purchase of an Apple 2022 iPad Pro 12.9"" Wifi + Celular, 512 GB from Amazon.it. Shortly after making the purchase, I came across another website where the same product was offered at a better price. I therefore decided to return it to Amazon.it and purchase it again from another seller.The return process was carried out through the DHL courier company, which delivered the package to Amazon.it. Confirmation of Amazon.it's receipt of the package was documented by the DHL courier, and I also have a letter from the courier company in which Amazon.it signed for the package upon receipt, at VIA PELLONI 5 41057 SPILAMBERTO MODENA, Italy.The shipment was posted on February 13, 2024 and delivered on February 16, 2024 at 10:51 a.m. The weight of the package was 1,795 kg. Despite having documentation confirming the delivery to Amazon.it, the company claims it never received the package.",2024-01-29 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,10.0,918,153,43,8,72.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,january made purchase apple ipad pro wifi celular gb amazonit shortly making purchase came across another website product offered better price therefore decided return amazonit purchase another sellerthe return process carried dhl courier company delivered package amazonit confirmation amazonits receipt package documented dhl courier also letter courier company amazonit signed package upon receipt via pelloni spilamberto modena italythe shipment posted february delivered february weight package kg despite documentation confirming delivery amazonit company claim never received package,0.007614069892816273,0.9923859301071837,0.08581043185642176,0.2,0.8133550514248762,81.33550514248762,High Trust
