Pravish Shetty,/users/6613d0c7172e8100120dfe8a,IN,1.0,2024-04-08 13:12:04+00:00,1.0,A seller outside amazon sent me a…,"A seller outside amazon sent me a parcel on 29th of march via Amazon Shipping. It was supposed to be delivered on 3rd April. It has been 5 days since then and I still havent received my parcel yet. Neither the tracking status has been updated. Called the customer service 5 times and every time I heard ""Sir it will be delivered by tomorrow surely"" and that 'tomorrow' never came. Their service is literally pathetic. Neither are they ready to give me the address of the hub it has reached or any other leads. All they are saying that they have escalated a complain and just fooling me on every single call. Never opt for amazon shipping for courier, its the most pathetic delivery service I have ever experienced. Dear Jeff, if you ever look at this grief, please think upon your decision of starting this courier service. The employees you have hired are probably not good or qualified enough niether do they care about customer.",2024-04-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,8.0,931,166,34,7,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,seller outside amazon sent parcel th march via amazon shipping supposed delivered rd april day since still havent received parcel yet neither tracking status updated called customer service time every time heard sir delivered tomorrow surely tomorrow never came service literally pathetic neither ready give address hub reached lead saying escalated complain fooling every single call never opt amazon shipping courier pathetic delivery service ever experienced dear jeff ever look grief please think upon decision starting courier service employee hired probably good qualified enough niether care customer,0.02343072016927445,0.9765692798307255,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.8069049427757105,80.69049427757105,High Trust
Henry,/users/59573a1b0000ff000aaa38b1,GB,45.0,2024-04-08 08:53:07+00:00,2.0,They can mistreat their couriers,"They can put unfair pressure on their couriers which can adversely impact their mental health. That can then lead the couriers to be super aggressive when delivering parcels. For example, a courier knocked on our door so aggressively to the extent that any person with heart problems could have been in very deep water! So, Amazon, if you are reading this, please start giving your couriers better working conditions and more respect as human beings. Doing so will likely improve their wellbeing as well as the customer experience due to a reduction in aggressive behaviour when delivering parcels.",2024-04-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,8.0,598,98,32,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,put unfair pressure courier adversely impact mental health lead courier super aggressive delivering parcel example courier knocked door aggressively extent person heart problem could deep water amazon reading please start giving courier better working condition respect human being likely improve wellbeing well customer experience due reduction aggressive behaviour delivering parcel,0.37675263601477627,0.6232473639852237,0.054963544587773416,0.4,0.9226163909101665,92.26163909101665,High Trust
