Star,/users/660af073d554230013cd3ed4,GB,2.0,2024-04-01 23:33:09+00:00,1.0,Delivery driver said he handed me parcel but I wasn't in. No refund or replacement from amazon. Amazon Awful. ,"I am so distressed and upset at the way I have been dealt with by Amazon today. I used to think they were a good company. Not now. My deliveries used to arrive. Not now. So basically I ordered a couple of small items that would have fitted in the mailbox today. I got an email they would be delivered by 9pm. I was out of my apartment for about an hour. When I came back I checked my amazon account and it said my item had been delivered and handed to resident. Which it hadn't. This really annoyed me as it had not been delivered I was not in and it had not been handed to me. I really hate it when a delivery driver says they have handed something to you when they have not as its a complete lie. I live in an apt on the first floor and all I want is for someone to ring my bell and hand me my delivery. This rarely happens. I have written clear delivery instructions which are never read and I've complained before. If I'm not in go to my apt on first floor and leave outside my door. I don't want it thrown outside and I don't want it thrown downstairs in a communal area. I don't what it handed to people that live in other apts that I don't even know. So it takes me ages to find amazon's customer service number. As they keep changing it. Then I've to listen to lots of recorded stuff. The call gets cut off and I phone back. Then I have to go through a painstakingly long process to give my number and my email several times repeating every letter. Then they say there's no account with my email and my number despite me using amazing for years. Then finally then I've to go into my email. I can't understand the person I'm talking to they can't understand me. Why can't amazon employ people in local areas to deal with local issues. It's insanely hard dealing with amazon. I wasted hours today and it's after midnight and I'm still upset. I'm told sorry to hear you didn't receive your item I will help you. Then I'm transferred to some other team logistics or something and I got the rudest woman I've ever encountered on a phone call jia or something I honestly didn't get her name. I really wanted to report her for being absolutely horrific and completely upsetting me. She had zero empathy. I told her I just wanted what I had ordered as I had paid amazon and it was meant to be here. I said just send it next day delivery or give me a refund. She said no they were launching an investigation whatever the hell that means. And you have to wait 3 days! Hold on I've already waited 3 days for delivery and now I've to wait another 3 days. Before I can even get a refund or replacement. Are these jokers for real? With a guy that has lied about giving my parcel to me as I was not physically there. Where the hell do these parcels go? I have a severe back injury and one of the items was to help that and I was going into hospital in a few days I said look please just send out what I ordered. She had zero empathy and just kept taking over me saying only when the investigation has concluded. I said I will be in hospital then. She couldn't care less. I also said well the delivery driver has obviously lied that he handed me the parcel and I can prove I wasn't in. She then kept talking over me very negatively zero empathy and finally hung up! I've actually been in tears over her attitude and it's ruined my day. I phoned back again to complain about her but of course I couldn't as you get through to a call centre that couldn't care less. There's no official customer service team. I go through the whole drawn out process again with a nicer girl this time but still saying no refund no replacement. How is this even legal? Amazon failed to deliver what I paid for and already waited 3 days for. And now I've to wait another 3 days.  I asked to speak to a manager and then it was, the same robotic response our policy is bla bla bla. No human empathy. This is not on. Amazon need to get delivery drivers that deliver and stop telling lies that they have handed you a parcel. I feel like cancelling amazon account and I wish there was a better place I could order from. Thus whole experience has ruined my day. And I've been in tears and stressed out. Now I've to wait for the outcome of an investigation with a delivery driver who has already lied as he didn't hand me the parcel. Amazon sucks and I really dislike this company now and want nothing to do with them. I need the items that I ordered and they told me to order again but there's no guarantee I will get them and I have to wait 3 days if I even get a refund. I don't think this is legal. And Amazon are horrific now. I will be looking into ordering elsewhere. Amazon make out that you're almost not telling the truth or something. It's absolutely horrific customer service and if you've an injury or disability amazon couldn't care less. Inhuman and awful company now. Used to be brilliant. Very annoyed and disappointed. Amazon get delivery drivers that tell the truth. ",2024-04-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,1.0,4950,952,110,19,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,distressed upset way dealt amazon today used think good company delivery used arrive basically ordered couple small item would fitted mailbox today got email would delivered pm apartment hour came back checked amazon account said item delivered handed resident hadnt really annoyed delivered handed really hate delivery driver say handed something complete lie live apt first floor want someone ring bell hand delivery rarely happens written clear delivery instruction never read ive complained im go apt first floor leave outside door dont want thrown outside dont want thrown downstairs communal area dont handed people live apts dont even know take age find amazon customer service number keep changing ive listen lot recorded stuff call get cut phone back go painstakingly long process give number email several time repeating every letter say there account email number despite using amazing year finally ive go email cant understand person im talking cant understand cant amazon employ people local area deal local issue insanely hard dealing amazon wasted hour today midnight im still upset im told sorry hear didnt receive item help im transferred team logistics something got rudest woman ive ever encountered phone call jia something honestly didnt get name really wanted report absolutely horrific completely upsetting zero empathy told wanted ordered paid amazon meant said send next day delivery give refund said launching investigation whatever hell mean wait day hold ive already waited day delivery ive wait another day even get refund replacement joker real guy lied giving parcel physically hell parcel go severe back injury one item help going hospital day said look please send ordered zero empathy kept taking saying investigation concluded said hospital couldnt care less also said well delivery driver obviously lied handed parcel prove wasnt kept talking negatively zero empathy finally hung ive actually tear attitude ruined day phoned back complain course couldnt get call centre couldnt care less there official customer service team go whole drawn process nicer girl time still saying refund replacement even legal amazon failed deliver paid already waited day ive wait another day asked speak manager robotic response policy bla bla bla human empathy amazon need get delivery driver deliver stop telling lie handed parcel feel like cancelling amazon account wish better place could order thus whole experience ruined day ive tear stressed ive wait outcome investigation delivery driver already lied didnt hand parcel amazon suck really dislike company want nothing need item ordered told order there guarantee get wait day even get refund dont think legal amazon horrific looking ordering elsewhere amazon make youre almost telling truth something absolutely horrific customer service youve injury disability amazon couldnt care less inhuman awful company used brilliant annoyed disappointed amazon get delivery driver tell truth,0.02748264982268111,0.9725173501773189,0.5339315759955132,0.2,0.8930449902877621,89.3044990287762,High Trust
