Tea,/users/60892b1f1c32b1001a86017e,SE,6.0,2024-03-31 21:46:45+00:00,1.0,A big joke company!,"A big joke company!By mistake I bought a quite expensive Tom Gord sunglasses from the american Amazon site not from the Swedish site where I’m based.When the product arrived to Sweden they did not look as on the pictures on the amazon page. Therefor I sent in an return request for the product.I then only for the adress label to the seller not a prepaid return label.I contacted Amazon again and asked for it, but they couldn’t send me one that I could use here in Sweden. I had to pay for one myself and then be refunded afterwards. Ok for me so far BUT!….I then simply asked for 4 simple informations needed to create a return label in Sweden:AdressName on the person that will receive itPhone numberEmail I now have spent 10!!!! Hours to try to get that information! Yes 10 hours!I have been calling Amazon in both Sweden and in the Us. I have been sending emails without replies, I have been trying to contact Amazon through chat but they cancel the chat as soon as I demand them to send me the details.Without it I can’t make the return since the law in Sweden requires that information.And of course you must have a phone number and email so the postoffice could sent notifications to the seller about the package for it to be delivered!Amazon refuses to help me. They refuse to help me get in contact with the seller, they refuses to send the info thats neccessary to solve this issue. They refuses to make a refund on the product.Status Que!!!It should not take 10hours to provided the customer a solution or these simple details!I guess I have to leave this matter to court to be solved! I will never buy on Amazon again!They should be ashamed of how they treat their customers!",2024-03-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,31.0,1688,306,19,4,23.0,0,16,1,0,Genuine,big joke companyby mistake bought quite expensive tom gord sunglass american amazon site swedish site i’m basedwhen product arrived sweden look picture amazon page therefor sent return request producti adress label seller prepaid return labeli contacted amazon asked couldn’t send one could use sweden pay one refunded afterwards ok far but…i simply asked simple information needed create return label swedenadressname person receive itphone numberemail spent hour try get information yes hoursi calling amazon sweden u sending email without reply trying contact amazon chat cancel chat soon demand send detailswithout can’t make return since law sweden requires informationand course must phone number email postoffice could sent notification seller package deliveredamazon refuse help refuse help get contact seller refuse send info thats neccessary solve issue refuse make refund productstatus queit take hour provided customer solution simple detailsi guess leave matter court solved never buy amazon againthey ashamed treat customer,0.9999999969841249,3.015875105205623e-09,0.17162086371284352,0.2,0.33432417425050626,33.43241742505062,Low Trust
P,/users/575b03a30000ff000a28113b,GB,14.0,2024-03-31 20:05:42+00:00,1.0,Amazon no more,"After years of using Amazon and being a prime member I have cancelled all subscriptions and will never use them again.I own firesticks, echo shows, fire tvs, have multiple fire tablets and have supported them for years. After having numerous missed deliveries, the last straw was when an order was placed for a birthday gift. After waiting in all day and following the tracking I was surprised to see that delivery had been attempted. I looked at my video door bell footage and no such delivery was attempted. I immediately phoned to cancel my subscription and they refused to give me a refund of my recently renewed yearly subscription.... Which was only 5 days old.I own stocks in amazon and they will be sold and I will never use them again. Liars... And yes I have video evidence and they clearly do not know about distance selling regulations.Avoid this company and support others that offer far better customer service. ",2024-03-31 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,31.0,926,159,14,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,year using amazon prime member cancelled subscription never use againi firesticks echo show fire tv multiple fire tablet supported year numerous missed delivery last straw order placed birthday gift waiting day following tracking surprised see delivery attempted looked video door bell footage delivery attempted immediately phoned cancel subscription refused give refund recently renewed yearly subscription day oldi stock amazon sold never use liar yes video evidence clearly know distance selling regulationsavoid company support others offer far better customer service,0.017846698594018728,0.9821533014059812,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.8089117600692273,80.89117600692273,High Trust
