Liz R,/users/5c0188575483f4b8a90fc389,US,3.0,2024-03-28 23:23:38+00:00,1.0,Once the best and most reliable website…,"Once the best and most reliable website to shop, now a bait and switch scam when it comes to delivery dates.   Not sure what has happened to Amazon when it comes to deliveries but they are no longer reliable.  Deliveries are constantly late.  They intentionally mark a order shipped so that customers can't cancel the order even though it won't arrive on the date that was promised.  For example, I placed an order that was to be delivered the next day.  The next day, the order wasn't even shipped and I was told by customer service they were out of stock on the item I ordered, yet, not me or customer service could cancel this order.  How ridiculous is this?   Prime membership is a joke at this point.  With the price of this membership going up every year and deliveries failing more than ever, who needs it.  Walmart is much more reliable when it comes to delivery dates.",2024-03-28 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,28.0,877,158,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,best reliable website shop bait switch scam come delivery date sure happened amazon come delivery longer reliable delivery constantly late intentionally mark order shipped customer cant cancel order even though wont arrive date promised example placed order delivered next day next day order wasnt even shipped told customer service stock item ordered yet customer service could cancel order ridiculous prime membership joke point price membership going every year delivery failing ever need walmart much reliable come delivery date,0.017105976254151826,0.9828940237458482,0.0886146943353898,0.2,0.8091699507400021,80.91699507400021,High Trust
