Asaf,/users/5a9e69e74de5666d34b5a254,IL,2.0,2024-03-28 15:07:19+00:00,1.0,Bad service - misleading false info,"the issue i encountered is quite simple - Amazon is collecting Import fees on products below the tax Threshold. they claim the product gets free shipping but then they collect a tax, that is not going to be collected by customs, which is higher than the original shipping fee.once being called upon with the customer service - started a chain of two weeks moving me from one rep to the other which none could help. until today. 43 min on a call and the supervisor couldn't help and transferred me to wait for an answer from the same department that didn't help twice before.my guess is that they don't want to help/solve this problem, because it makes a nice free profit. ",2024-03-28 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,28.0,672,121,35,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,issue encountered quite simple amazon collecting import fee product tax threshold claim product get free shipping collect tax going collected custom higher original shipping feeonce called upon customer service started chain two week moving one rep none could help today min call supervisor couldnt help transferred wait answer department didnt help twice beforemy guess dont want helpsolve problem make nice free profit,0.02168583941022396,0.978314160589776,0.06786315199102635,0.2,0.8027297106930932,80.27297106930932,High Trust
