First. Place,/users/5f5f98c314844e65dfa04d8e,GB,9.0,2024-03-27 23:30:42+00:00,1.0,I'm trying to close a family member's…,"I'm trying to close a family member's account due to their sad & sudden death. Amazon have asked for a copy of the will, Grant of Probate and various other documents.I'm closing an account - not going into business with them!!!  It's a difficult enough time for us.  I still have a parcel to return. I've repeatedly told them I have no access to the account. I'm giving up now, it's so frustrating. How hard can it be for them to understand. And I'm quite sure you don't need a copy of the Will, Grant of Probate or anything else to close an Amazon account.One phone call to another company, it was all sorted. I've contacted Temu nine times so far & I'm still getting nowhere.",2024-03-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,27.0,677,126,38,7,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,im trying close family member account due sad sudden death amazon asked copy grant probate various documentsim closing account going business difficult enough time u still parcel return ive repeatedly told access account im giving frustrating hard understand im quite sure dont need copy grant probate anything else close amazon accountone phone call another company sorted ive contacted temu nine time far im still getting nowhere,0.6809156092664148,0.3190843907335852,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.4736756782607915,47.367567826079146,Low Trust
