Claire Logan,/users/62c3cf5f3367760012304717,GB,2.0,2024-03-27 22:00:04+00:00,1.0,Horrendous customer service.,"Horrendous customer service.. My call got disconnected because I asked the lady to speak slower. I could not understand what she was saying..I asked to speak to a manager, I was told NO ... I was not shouting swearing or been aggressive. I wanted to know why I had been delivered (outside my door) a faulty mattress.  £459 ~ approx 20 calls later they delivered me another mattress and it was not what I ordered. ... Then I'm expected to pay for them both.. Unbelievable. I just want both removed and nearly £1000 they've taken from my bank back... AVOID THIS COMPANY. THEY ARE INCOMPETENT AT BEST. Exploitation of miners..  slave trade.. Disgusting... I bet they won't post my review...",2024-03-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,27.0,687,120,28,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,horrendous customer service call got disconnected asked lady speak slower could understand sayingi asked speak manager told shouting swearing aggressive wanted know delivered outside door faulty mattress £ approx call later delivered another mattress ordered im expected pay unbelievable want removed nearly £ theyve taken bank back avoid company incompetent best exploitation miner slave trade disgusting bet wont post review,0.032444498829767826,0.9675555011702321,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.7972382104841625,79.72382104841626,High Trust
