PBO,/users/5ff11389b339a9001b7ee738,GB,6.0,2024-03-25 19:37:35+00:00,1.0,Told my son to order a pack of water…,Told my son to order a pack of water bottles on prime which I paid for. The bottles were for my youngest son who was too ill to go out and buy for himself. He never got them. Amazon claims they have proof of delivery but have not sent it to us. The seller is blaming Amazon to whom they entrust delivery. Amazon doesn’t care - I’m ten pounds down and my dehydrated son never got his water. The seller only cares about getting a bad review. We order a lot from Amazon and have never complained even when our goods were delivered to nearby streets etc. this time I am appalled by their refusal to furnish proof they claim they have or offer a refund. I spent money and got no goods.Not acceptable.,2024-03-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,25.0,695,134,37,9,8.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,told son order pack water bottle prime paid bottle youngest son ill go buy never got amazon claim proof delivery sent u seller blaming amazon entrust delivery amazon doesn’t care i’m ten pound dehydrated son never got water seller care getting bad review order lot amazon never complained even good delivered nearby street etc time appalled refusal furnish proof claim offer refund spent money got goodsnot acceptable,0.010585273522334685,0.9894147264776653,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.8097382101261013,80.97382101261013,High Trust
Svend Elk,/users/4cc89571000064000104d293,DK,15.0,2024-03-25 13:52:31+00:00,1.0,Amazon can't give me access to my…,"Amazon can't give me access to my account. I have got a new phone number and I cannot access the account to change my phone number, as the two-factor security requires me to type in a code which Amazon sends to my old phone number. According to Amazon customer service, the only solution is to close down the account and start a new once the account has been out of use for 1-2 weeks. However, Amazon requires me to log in to my account to accept that the account is closed :-(",2024-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,25.0,477,92,34,7,39.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon cant give access account got new phone number cannot access account change phone number twofactor security requires type code amazon sends old phone number according amazon customer service solution close account start new account use week however amazon requires log account accept account closed,0.012054550427144954,0.987945449572855,0.051598429613011774,0.2,0.8042924107090298,80.42924107090298,High Trust
