Disappointed Customer,/users/65fe8fb4830fec001287e5e2,GB,1.0,2024-03-23 10:16:45+00:00,1.0,"Empty promises, poor service and disappointment","It is worth pointing out that this happened with the US Amazon.com who decided to suspend my newly created account due to what they called “suspicious activity”(clearly a machine error). While I appreciate how this can help protect me, this turned into a nightmare experience.I placed an order to send to a friend as a surprise, when the account was suspended, my order containing various individual message was also canceled. I contacted customer service 4 times over the course of 1 week. Continually all agents kept on promising and reassuring me that my account will be reinstated in 24-48 hours as well as my order with each individual message and I was promised a $15 gift card for the trouble. I followed up on my account status 48 hrs after the initial contact and I was told my account is still suspended but it’s not their responsibility to reinstate it instead it was Accounts team. After failing to put me in contact with this team I was asked to grab a pen and paper to call this department myself. I requested a call back instead. The call was promised the same day. 3 days later no contact so I reached out to customer service again to be told again how they can’t do anything about it and should speak to another team. Having spoken to 6 agents over the phone and about 12 in chats I can’t begin to describe my frustration, disappointment and whirlpool of emotions. This last agent told me that there is no way my order can be recovered and that there is no such $15 credit in my account. Confused and upset I’m just speechless about this whole experience. I would recommend against Amazon.com at all cost. If you can order with another provider who values their promises and delivers quality , trust me it’s worth the extra dollar. Avoid dealing with their empty promises and poor quality (both services and goods).PS: there is still no resolution to my problem or any reasonable contact/communication with Amazon.comThe whole thing has literally turned from a computer/model error into a human led poor customer service. ",2024-03-19 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,23.0,2039,356,47,6,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,worth pointing happened u amazoncom decided suspend newly created account due called “suspicious activity”clearly machine error appreciate help protect turned nightmare experiencei placed order send friend surprise account suspended order containing various individual message also canceled contacted customer service time course week continually agent kept promising reassuring account reinstated hour well order individual message promised gift card trouble followed account status hr initial contact told account still suspended it’s responsibility reinstate instead account team failing put contact team asked grab pen paper call department requested call back instead call promised day day later contact reached customer service told can’t anything speak another team spoken agent phone chat can’t begin describe frustration disappointment whirlpool emotion last agent told way order recovered credit account confused upset i’m speechless whole experience would recommend amazoncom cost order another provider value promise delivers quality trust it’s worth extra dollar avoid dealing empty promise poor quality service goodsps still resolution problem reasonable contactcommunication amazoncomthe whole thing literally turned computermodel error human led poor customer service,0.0062748728546699805,0.99372512714533,0.19966348850252383,0.2,0.8367952612731697,83.67952612731698,High Trust
T Pin,/users/65fe8365830fec001287e0ee,NZ,2.0,2024-03-23 10:01:44+00:00,1.0,Jeff Bezos has the unique privilege on…,"Jeff Bezos has the unique privilege on being classified as a rilobber baron alongside many early 20th century figures. Amazon Export Services (AES) employs the cheapest 1* rated companies for international deliveries. It makes it imposdible to record a complaint. It tells a lot of lies on its invoice about how it will handle import processes. In New Zealabd, if your package is worth more than 1000 nzd, for which you have already paid import fees, your package sits in limbo forever. Aramex NZ, which Anazon employs, is a frachisee provider. There is one customs broker who tells a lot of lies about how the the package is due soon, when it has been held by customs for 17days. Mr Azmir Siddiqui (AamirS- his domain name is aramex.com in case you need to put his contact details together) is not inclined to respond to emails. The contact centre is in the phillipines and likely to hang up on you. Aamir is a bottleneck and nothing happens. He probably has too much paperwork in between delivery of 1* rated uber eats. Mr Danny Murphy, supposedluly the Canterbury General Manager of Aramex NZ (1.3* rating only because you cannot rate zero) is uncontactable. This is Amazon for you. The customer can only rate the seller who is not to blame. Customer cannot rate AES. Cunning.",2024-03-23 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,23.0,1279,223,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,jeff bezos unique privilege classified rilobber baron alongside many early th century figure amazon export service aes employ cheapest rated company international delivery make imposdible record complaint tell lot lie invoice handle import process new zealabd package worth nzd already paid import fee package sits limbo forever aramex nz anazon employ frachisee provider one custom broker tell lot lie package due soon held custom day mr azmir siddiqui aamirs domain name aramexcom case need put contact detail together inclined respond email contact centre phillipines likely hang aamir bottleneck nothing happens probably much paperwork delivery rated uber eats mr danny murphy supposedluly canterbury general manager aramex nz rating cannot rate zero uncontactable amazon customer rate seller blame customer cannot rate aes cunning,0.021731052236698512,0.9782689477633015,0.1250701065619742,0.2,0.8141484951940456,81.41484951940457,High Trust
