B Ma,/users/632331cc177977001320d28a,US,2.0,2024-03-22 22:10:53+00:00,1.0,"Nowadays, Amazon is a mess","Nowadays, Amazon is a mess; for its customer service, everybody tells a story on his own and every story is different from another. I returned a item on March 5, and they received it on March 7, but so far I still can't get my refund. Can you believe it takes Amazon a whole month to process a simple return?The worse is that the more I complaint about it, the longer they delay the refund. Originally, by them, the refund would be issued by March 23, but after I complained about it, today they changed refund to be by March 26. What kind of customer service is this? They don't resolve the issue but make it worse.",2024-03-22 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,22.0,616,117,26,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,nowadays amazon mess customer service everybody tell story every story different another returned item march received march far still cant get refund believe take amazon whole month process simple returnthe worse complaint longer delay refund originally refund would issued march complained today changed refund march kind customer service dont resolve issue make worse,0.02452621179891593,0.9754737882010841,0.06561974200785194,0.2,0.8008608425021124,80.08608425021124,High Trust
