ELLIE SMITH,/users/65fcb6b8006eb30012226aa5,US,1.0,2024-03-22 00:38:00+00:00,1.0,Amazon has zero customer service,"If I could leave zero stars I would. Amazon has now entered into the new world of zero customer service sadly. They removed the option of print your own label. So now you are using your own time and gas to drive to one of the Amazon return sites which are 25+ mins one way from me. $7.99 to have UPS box it up and ship the return back --that is 30 mins 1 way. Basically, Amazon is driving customer into Kohls, Staples, Whole Foods and UPS the stores THEY choose to business with!! Then they present it as trying to keep trucks off the road. Who cares if its a truck or my car. The truth is they are saving a TON of money by inconveniencing their customers!!! A return took me 1 min, put it back in the box or bag it came in, print a label, slap it on and drop it in a UPS drop box --any time of the day or night--even midnight if needed. The box is 1 min drive. Now I have to chat with an Amazon representative they email me a label it takes about 20 mins of my time. So RIDICULOUS and beyond maddening!! So happy Amazon is using their customers to save money. Is Amazon going to pay for gas and time for their customer returns to the stores they do business with?????? I do not choose to drive to any of those stores. I was a HUGE amazon customer HUGE-- I am done now--I can not take it anymore! ",2024-03-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,22.0,1297,260,32,5,1.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,could leave zero star would amazon entered new world zero customer service sadly removed option print label using time gas drive one amazon return site min one way ups box ship return back min way basically amazon driving customer kohl staple whole food ups store choose business present trying keep truck road care truck car truth saving ton money inconveniencing customer return took min put back box bag came print label slap drop ups drop box time day nighteven midnight needed box min drive chat amazon representative email label take min time ridiculous beyond maddening happy amazon using customer save money amazon going pay gas time customer return store business choose drive store huge amazon customer huge done nowi take anymore,0.9996766563453282,0.0003233436546717927,0.14582164890633764,0.2,0.3293260016086034,32.93260016086034,Low Trust
