Christoffer Aasted,/users/58762b8d0000ff000a6b1e90,DK,52.0,2024-03-21 16:54:16+00:00,1.0,Unsuccesful in disabling 2FA for 5+ years,"I have contacted and paid international phone-fees several times (5+) to get access to my amazon.com account with digital purchases at least 5+ times over the last 5+ years.Each time the same thing happens.. After I finally get to a representative who can disable the 2FA from the old phone number it works for 2 weeks to 1 month and then the old phone number is re-enabled as 2FA on the account - completely without any action from my part.Amazon doesn't prioritize Account Recovery, otherwise there would be steps for customers to follow to disable 2FA indefinetily and regain access to the account.This is clearly not a priority however, they must assume everyone is creating new accounts - or simpy don't care.It is extremely illogical that current account login information is overwritten with old information (incl. 2FA phone number) but this is what happens.I can't access any of my digital purchases because amazon keeps locking me out of my account. This has never been an issue from my part. This is an amazon IT department technical issue relating to the account logins.I can't be the only person in the world this happens to, but I can only imagine that they are losing business cuz I have avoided amazon in every of my purchases if available elsewhere anytime, I'd even pay more to avoid amazon because this site is simply broken.What I think happens as a qualified software developer is that I think amazon has some legacy software between its site networks that might restore or synchronize an old backup incl. 2FA between accounts.There is no other logical explanation.But what is logical and completely reasonable to understand is that I will avoid amazon at all costs for all purchases.Horrible company, horrible services, horrible customer support. Avoid this trap.",2024-03-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,21.0,1784,297,41,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,contacted paid international phonefees several time get access amazoncom account digital purchase least time last yearseach time thing happens finally get representative disable fa old phone number work week month old phone number reenabled fa account completely without action partamazon doesnt prioritize account recovery otherwise would step customer follow disable fa indefinetily regain access accountthis clearly priority however must assume everyone creating new account simpy dont careit extremely illogical current account login information overwritten old information incl fa phone number happensi cant access digital purchase amazon keep locking account never issue part amazon department technical issue relating account loginsi cant person world happens imagine losing business cuz avoided amazon every purchase available elsewhere anytime id even pay avoid amazon site simply brokenwhat think happens qualified software developer think amazon legacy software site network might restore synchronize old backup incl fa accountsthere logical explanationbut logical completely reasonable understand avoid amazon cost purchaseshorrible company horrible service horrible customer support avoid trap,0.02768902327912827,0.9723109767208717,0.16657319125070105,0.2,0.819470126610576,81.9470126610576,High Trust
RU,/users/65fc36d2006eb3001222173a,DK,1.0,2024-03-21 15:33:20+00:00,1.0,rating,"Rating: zero StarsI recently experienced unacceptable service from Amazon. After purchasing several items and seeing the payment taken from my account, my order was inexplicably paused, and I was accused of being a ""fake profile."" This baseless accusation and the immediate halting of my order without any prior communication is deeply frustrating.Despite my attempts to resolve this issue, Amazon's customer service has been unhelpful, leaving me without my products and out of pocket. The lack of clear communication and effort to address this misunderstanding shows a significant flaw in Amazon's customer verification and support process.This incident has drastically diminished my trust in Amazon, and I caution others about using their services until they improve their approach to customer care and respect.",2024-03-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,21.0,814,121,6,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,rating zero starsi recently experienced unacceptable service amazon purchasing several item seeing payment taken account order inexplicably paused accused fake profile baseless accusation immediate halting order without prior communication deeply frustratingdespite attempt resolve issue amazon customer service unhelpful leaving without product pocket lack clear communication effort address misunderstanding show significant flaw amazon customer verification support processthis incident drastically diminished trust amazon caution others using service improve approach customer care respect,0.00834413227569203,0.9916558677243079,0.06786315199102635,0.2,0.8094005642603591,80.94005642603591,High Trust
