Jodi Walker,/users/5b33bd224de5666d34debca9,US,9.0,2024-03-21 07:34:43+00:00,1.0,Sc-Amazon,"Sc-Amazon.  I ordered cameras, and they sent used ones.  I returned them.  I ordered a 2nd set, and again received used ones.  So I returned them too.  Both sets were received back.  I was owed 2 credits of $431.99.  I wasn't receiving either credit so I disputed these charges with my credit card company.  Then Amazon issued 1 credit for $431.99.  They still owed me the other credit.  Amazon lied to me multiple times, and broke many promises to issue the credit they owed me.  Then Amazon lied to my credit card company and claimed they issued both credits.  My credit card company believed them.  I have proved to the credit card company that Amazon lied to them, and to me.  They are trying to get this resolved.  I am sure I am not the only one to be ripped off by Sc-Amazon.  I am pretty disgusted.",2024-03-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,21.0,806,147,9,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,scamazon ordered camera sent used one returned ordered nd set received used one returned set received back owed credit wasnt receiving either credit disputed charge credit card company amazon issued credit still owed credit amazon lied multiple time broke many promise issue credit owed amazon lied credit card company claimed issued credit credit card company believed proved credit card company amazon lied trying get resolved sure one ripped scamazon pretty disgusted,0.03763313379717639,0.9623668662028236,0.08244531688166012,0.2,0.7976724964777439,79.76724964777439,High Trust
