Kernow13,/users/577fbcc10000ff000a301398,GB,7.0,2024-03-20 21:36:19+00:00,1.0,The Earth's most customer centric company? Don't make us Laugh!,"WARNING - Do not use Amazon as a platform to keep your book reviews. I was stupid enough to do so for several years. A process I enjoyed and one that caused no issues. In April 2023, I submitted a review which was rejected because they said 'it breached the guidelines' Examining the guidelines it was not obvious how, but I re-wrote it, resubmitted it and heard no more. The same happened in November 2024 and then in December and completely out-of-the-blue I got an email saying 'I'd breached guidelines and my review rights had been withdrawn'. What they did not say was all my review were removed. Gone - years of input, a real treasure trove of memories of my reading hobby. From that time I tried hard to communicate with Amazon to ask that they be restored, but they were rude, hostile, they continually obfuscated, were totally unclear, seemed unable to grasp basic concepts and their responses were frequently unintelligible and on several occasions they lied. They denied repetitively they have a complaints department and they showed a general lack of any personal care or concern. This is a company that strives (so says its mission) to be the earth's most customer centric company. This is an insult to it's customers - they might delivery parcels ok, but when things go wrong they it is clear that they have the  'Earth's most incompetent customer service department' ",2024-03-20 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,20.0,1382,238,63,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,warning use amazon platform keep book review stupid enough several year process enjoyed one caused issue april submitted review rejected said breached guideline examining guideline obvious rewrote resubmitted heard happened november december completely outoftheblue got email saying id breached guideline review right withdrawn say review removed gone year input real treasure trove memory reading hobby time tried hard communicate amazon ask restored rude hostile continually obfuscated totally unclear seemed unable grasp basic concept response frequently unintelligible several occasion lied denied repetitively complaint department showed general lack personal care concern company strives say mission earth customer centric company insult customer might delivery parcel ok thing go wrong clear earth incompetent customer service department,0.014825566012058177,0.9851744339879418,0.1334828939988783,0.2,0.8192837957937467,81.92837957937466,High Trust
