urn prime previously could pay monthly leaving company want close amazon prime account cannot get money back lost order membership respect company trust went beyond humiliation client shame amazon prime unworthy customer,0.9999980157534822,1.984246517761079e-06,0.12226584408300617,0.2,0.3244541609398601,32.44541609398601,Low Trust
