V and $280.00 for the nsf fees caused so far then you can close my Amazon account,2024-03-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,16.0,1963,396,35,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,trust company employee amazon thought trustworthy place bought fire tv paid tv showed missing part asked get refund z guarantee refund policy toldi couldnt get refund could get replacement said okit took almost week replacement come left original tv missing part door step got home original gone replacement also missing part laying ground bottom stair noticed new charge bank called amazon told refund mailed day waited check came called told record telling refund coming exsisted support staff told check processed expect week made sense onsidering get lb item place overnight case bur envelope weighs less lb need week deliverso called hack replacement tv missing part malfunctioning finally got agree pick refund picked dec havent seen penny back top tried charge time time ive nsf fee charged accountamazon refund tv send fee caused attempting charge tv bought already returned theyvtold system collect another account keep charging trying charge amount suggestion put another account let take instantly refund thanks want tv nsf fee caused far close amazon account,0.008066537334562503,0.9919334626654375,0.2220975883342681,0.2,0.8403862489995724,84.03862489995724,High Trust
