Sarah Pezaro,/users/5da56a5b2393e1946fa089c2,NZ,13.0,2024-03-14 10:02:50+00:00,1.0,Honestly I could not make this up.,"Honestly I could not make this up.I landed back in the UK a month ago and ordered a new sim/mobile number on contract.  Updated my Amazon account using my mobile.  Went to my account a few days later to order something but kept getting a wrong password message.  I reset my password and placed an order using my new debit card.  Changed the address to my new address.Problem was it wasn’t my account.  Someone had my mobile number before me and I had inadvertently hacked their account.  There address, their card details, their order history, all there for me to read.I contact Amazon and we go through the process of sorting out the mess.  They cancel my order for me and I was promised that no payment would be taken from my card.I re-order on my own account.After checking my bank account I find I’ve been billed twice.  I don’t get the order twice, just the money removed from my account.I have called several times to sort this mess only to be told by various agents that they can help me as the transaction I am disputing is……..on someone else’s account!!!I now appreciate why Jeff is doing so well.As of today the 14th of March I am still waiting for my money back.",2024-03-06 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,14.0,1173,213,34,7,8.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,honestly could make upi landed back uk month ago ordered new simmobile number contract updated amazon account using mobile went account day later order something kept getting wrong password message reset password placed order using new debit card changed address new addressproblem wasn’t account someone mobile number inadvertently hacked account address card detail order history readi contact amazon go process sorting mess cancel order promised payment would taken cardi reorder accountafter checking bank account find i’ve billed twice don’t get order twice money removed accounti called several time sort mess told various agent help transaction disputing is……on someone else’s accounti appreciate jeff wellas today th march still waiting money back,0.4442676072102168,0.5557323927897833,0.11946158160403814,0.2,0.6017585127156992,60.175851271569925,Medium Trust
Matt,/users/63b97265a1ea78001287281e,GB,6.0,2024-03-13 23:23:53+00:00,5.0,Excelling in Variety and Choice ,"- A customer of 8 YearsAs a company in terms of offering customers value it  undeniably does so. I dont use their software services much as I already had spotify/ youtube but have still got value from prime delivery through their food and items as well as occasional prime video and audible. There's more they can be doing environmentally to offset such a large footprint but due to how logistically efficient they are it brings down the CO2 emissions per parcel compared to driving to collect the same item yourself! They can also invest in electric or alterenative fuel methods for their vehicles.Paper and cardboard packaging on all orders is recyclable/reusable and I've been able to support small online/sustainable businesses through the marketplace The shopping experience is excellent and the delivery very professional.The value offered is great, and with such a large selection of products and reviews its not difficult to find what you're after. The tracking and history of orders is exceptional, as well as the ability to create multiple lists (wish lists) that could be shared.Used items can also be found on the platform too, which is a better choice for the environment than brand new, I've recently found a growing offering of recycled plastic items which is even better as it creates a demand to get the products out of our environment.I barely touched on the software/ streaming applications and services offered which is a large part of the subscription and could be worth the monthly fee in it's own right.I'd be quite surprised if you had anything but a positive experience. I can't comment from an empoyee/ seller side of the company but as a customer I keep coming back and will continue to aslong as I receive great service. As buyers we need to continue to carefully consider the demand our purchases place on the environment but it's good to know that Amazon can align with this goal shoud we choose to.I look forward to seeing more sustainably powered vans adopted and encouragement for smaller local and quality goods sellers promoted on the home page.",2024-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,13.0,2080,350,32,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,customer yearsas company term offering customer value undeniably dont use software service much already spotify youtube still got value prime delivery food item well occasional prime video audible there environmentally offset large footprint due logistically efficient brings co emission per parcel compared driving collect item also invest electric alterenative fuel method vehiclespaper cardboard packaging order recyclablereusable ive able support small onlinesustainable business marketplace shopping experience excellent delivery professionalthe value offered great large selection product review difficult find youre tracking history order exceptional well ability create multiple list wish list could sharedused item also found platform better choice environment brand new ive recently found growing offering recycled plastic item even better creates demand get product environmenti barely touched software streaming application service offered large part subscription could worth monthly fee rightid quite surprised anything positive experience cant comment empoyee seller side company customer keep coming back continue aslong receive great service buyer need continue carefully consider demand purchase place environment good know amazon align goal shoud choose toi look forward seeing sustainably powered van adopted encouragement smaller local quality good seller promoted home page,0.037499528954156994,0.962500471045843,0.1962983735277622,1.0,2.020509910228474,202.0509910228474,High Trust
Татьяна Зуева,/users/60465a138a767c00198a9530,IT,2.0,2024-03-13 23:09:15+00:00,1.0,Amazon closed my account without an explanation ,"A couple of weeks ago, Amazon abruptly canceled my account. I was attempting to access my account to make a purchase, and upon reaching the login page and entering my credentials, the following message appeared: ‘Your account has been terminated for improper use of Amazon services. We have sent you an email with more information.’ (It was written in Italian, I translated it with Google translate). However, no email arrived in my inbox despite repeated attempts. I began searching online to see if anyone else had encountered the same issue. I found an email address where I could file a complaint. They responded stating: ‘as already communicated to you, we have closed this account. From our records, we have previously terminated your account for violating the terms of our user agreement. Following termination of your account due to breach of contract, you are not permitted to open a new account or use another account to place orders on our site. Following a thorough evaluation, we have decided not to restore your full access to this account. It will therefore not be possible for you to place orders on our site. Any digital content purchased with this account is still available to you. To access the content, click the Manage content and devices link in the My Orders menu on Amazon.it.’ Despite my attempts to seek clarification, they provided the same generic responses, failing to explain the exact reason for the account termination and how I violated the terms of the agreement. Furthermore, they mentioned that I could still access digital content purchased with the account, which was untrue since my account was closed, leaving me without access to anything.Adding insult to injury, I own a Kindle that was linked to my account. A few days later, I attempted to read a book on my Kindle. As I am Russian and my Amazon account is Italian (and all the books in the Amazon store are either in Italian or English), I purchase eBooks from Russian websites and download them via USB from my PC to my Kindle. However, that night when I opened my Kindle, it was EMPTY!!! All my books were gone! And on the screen was the login page to the Amazon account, which I no longer had access to. Here arises an interesting question: how did they learn that my account was closed if my device was not connected to Wi-Fi? This implies that Amazon has another means of controlling my data and my device. All the books I downloaded, all the notes I made in the books, all the progress I made (I usually read several books at the same time) - everything was gone! An empty Kindle!!!I am deeply disappointed and angry with the situation and feel utterly helpless in resolving this problem. My account was canceled without explanation, I cannot ask questions through the app's customer service as my account is closed, Amazon support has ceased responding to my emails, my Kindle books have been deleted, and there is no one who seems to care or can offer assistance in any way to address this issue.",2024-02-28 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,13.0,3000,521,48,7,14.0,0,8,1,0,Genuine,couple week ago amazon abruptly canceled account attempting access account make purchase upon reaching login page entering credential following message appeared ‘your account terminated improper use amazon service sent email information’ written italian translated google translate however email arrived inbox despite repeated attempt began searching online see anyone else encountered issue found email address could file complaint responded stating ‘as already communicated closed account record previously terminated account violating term user agreement following termination account due breach contract permitted open new account use another account place order site following thorough evaluation decided restore full access account therefore possible place order site digital content purchased account still available access content click manage content device link order menu amazonit’ despite attempt seek clarification provided generic response failing explain exact reason account termination violated term agreement furthermore mentioned could still access digital content purchased account untrue since account closed leaving without access anythingadding insult injury kindle linked account day later attempted read book kindle russian amazon account italian book amazon store either italian english purchase ebooks russian website download via usb pc kindle however night opened kindle empty book gone screen login page amazon account longer access arises interesting question learn account closed device connected wifi implies amazon another mean controlling data device book downloaded note made book progress made usually read several book time everything gone empty kindlei deeply disappointed angry situation feel utterly helpless resolving problem account canceled without explanation cannot ask question apps customer service account closed amazon support ceased responding email kindle book deleted one seems care offer assistance way address issue,0.9980604415862016,0.0019395584137984478,0.29220415030846886,0.2,0.359410609268593,35.9410609268593,Low Trust
