Taslima,/users/5bfaa69e5483f4b8a94cc5a6,GB,12.0,2024-03-13 11:59:46+00:00,1.0,Shalu's incompetent customer service,"Shalu displayed rather incompetent customer service today by constantly saying ""sorry for the inconvenience"" rather than trying to sort the issue. On top of that, they asked me what the issue was despite having already explained it to them which makes me think they didn't actually bother reading my message. The issue wasn't even a complicated one, simply just that I needed a code to pick up my parcel from the shop like you do with any Amazon order that goes to a pick-up point, just that I hadn't been provided one this time. And then on top of all of the above, they've just decided to stop responding to my messages - how professional.",2024-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,13.0,641,115,36,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,shalu displayed rather incompetent customer service today constantly saying sorry inconvenience rather trying sort issue top asked issue despite already explained make think didnt actually bother reading message issue wasnt even complicated one simply needed code pick parcel shop like amazon order go pickup point hadnt provided one time top theyve decided stop responding message professional,0.028777670983357314,0.9712223290166427,0.06449803701626472,0.2,0.7985107719115743,79.85107719115743,High Trust
