Siobhan,/users/5b6d70144de5666d340fae1b,GB,18.0,2024-03-11 21:07:09+00:00,1.0,Another terrible Amazon.co.uk service,"Another terrible Amazon.co.uk experience. The item that I ordered and PAID for to be delivered to my home never arrived and according to their website when I tracked the package ""was delivered to a resident"" which is so vague and unhelpful as it did not arrive at my home or to ME. There is no way I can contact the seller via the website and when I tried to ask for a refund online there is no option to say that the item never arrived, as if the folks in Amazon are so arrogant and stupid give the service they provide, that this isn't an option. I've wasted several days trying to contact the right person to let them know my item hasn't arrived and to arrange a refund and still no such luck. This is what happens when you automate a whole delivery process and no human being actually gives a shoite or is easily available to speak to. Get rid of your stupid AI and your delivery companies and look after your PAYING customers!! I will be going elsewhere for my products from now on.",2024-03-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,11.0,987,187,37,4,3.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,another terrible amazoncouk experience item ordered paid delivered home never arrived according website tracked package delivered resident vague unhelpful arrive home way contact seller via website tried ask refund online option say item never arrived folk amazon arrogant stupid give service provide isnt option ive wasted several day trying contact right person let know item hasnt arrived arrange refund still luck happens automate whole delivery process human actually give shoite easily available speak get rid stupid ai delivery company look paying customer going elsewhere product,0.26970705496161124,0.7302929450383888,0.10487941671340438,0.2,0.6861223558618753,68.61223558618754,Medium Trust
