Mr. saha,/users/56fdca4c0000ff000a13725c,GB,30.0,2024-03-11 13:50:01+00:00,1.0,Recent amazon experience - Awful,"I have always rated Amazon highly, but my recent experience has been awful. I was sent a replacement product and was advised there was no need to send the faulty product back. But after the return window was over, Amazon charged my credit card. I tried to explain to many people why the item was not sent and the date discussion happened, but no one would listen or check the previous correspondence; they simply terminated the chat. This is how customers are treated at Amazon. Such a nice company, but earning a bad reputation due to a few bad people who don't deserve to be in customer service.",2024-03-09 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,11.0,597,108,32,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,always rated amazon highly recent experience awful sent replacement product advised need send faulty product back return window amazon charged credit card tried explain many people item sent date discussion happened one would listen check previous correspondence simply terminated chat customer treated amazon nice company earning bad reputation due bad people dont deserve customer service,0.05630605669522313,0.9436939433047768,0.06057206954570948,0.2,0.7839613855615303,78.39613855615303,High Trust
