customer,/users/63954414eb4fc90012baea61,US,2.0,2024-03-10 03:40:27+00:00,1.0,Bought a tv from Amazon,"Bought a tv from Amazon. Should and fulfilled by amazon. For large heavy items you set up a day and can do room delivery. I set up the delivery for Saturday and hired a professional installed for Sunday. Saturday is here and even though tracking showed delays it made it out for delivery. They give you a large window which is fine you know what to expect. The driver calls me to confirm the delivery it is my turn and says he is 15 minutes out. The installer called me earlier and said he would be able to do the install today. When the driver called and said he was 15 minutes out I let the installer know. An hour goes by and the driver never shows up the installer does. I spent the next hour calling customer service trying to track everything down. Finally I hear back that the driver will be there 30 mons to an hour. Finally almost 3 hours later the driver shows up. He shows up with my sticker on a treadmill which is barely stuck to the package at this point. I had to pay the installer to Come out and not install the TV which I have already been charged for and didn't receive. I am out almost 3k. My next few hours trying to contact customer service were the most frustrating I ever had. I actually was hung up on stating this is a ""professional"" conversation. I am out 3k and they think that is ""professional"". I should mention to that the TV is now out of stock as well. They are saying they can have another week but I'm not optimistic. I'm still out 300$ for the Install that I will never get back. I don't even know of it is worth seeking counsel on this or not. As it stands I am out of alot of money with nothing to show for it.",2024-03-09 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,10.0,1648,323,23,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought tv amazon fulfilled amazon large heavy item set day room delivery set delivery saturday hired professional installed sunday saturday even though tracking showed delay made delivery give large window fine know expect driver call confirm delivery turn say minute installer called earlier said would able install today driver called said minute let installer know hour go driver never show installer spent next hour calling customer service trying track everything finally hear back driver mon hour finally almost hour later driver show show sticker treadmill barely stuck package point pay installer come install tv already charged didnt receive almost k next hour trying contact customer service frustrating ever actually hung stating professional conversation k think professional mention tv stock well saying another week im optimistic im still install never get back dont even know worth seeking counsel stand alot money nothing show,0.02502045134127689,0.9749795486587232,0.18115535614133482,0.2,0.8237208455576286,82.37208455576285,High Trust
Srephen,/users/65ed09b1c64a540012536fd7,US,2.0,2024-03-10 03:15:50+00:00,5.0,Five stars all the way,"Five stars all the way! I couldn't be happier with my purchase from Amazon. The product arrived promptly, well-packaged, and exactly as described. I highly recommend shopping on Amazon for all your needs!",2024-03-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,10.0,204,33,22,5,5.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,five star way couldnt happier purchase amazon product arrived promptly wellpackaged exactly described highly recommend shopping amazon need,0.6157593837285917,0.38424061627140826,0.018508132361189006,1.0,1.695821934607942,169.5821934607942,High Trust
