Sarah Mulder,/users/65d8106e59b83b0012d2cc2d,US,2.0,2024-03-09 13:43:06+00:00,1.0,I have had to make a new accoount 4…,"I have had to make a new accoount 4 different accounts with Amazon.com. When I pull up my account every few weeks, it will be locked. I get a message to call customer service. So i call. I am on hold for 30 mins or longer and then they verify that it is me. When I ask why my account is locked they tell me they can not tell me that information. Well why not? it is my account and you just verified my identity. Then i get sent to the special department in which i have no idea what the title is. They wont tell me what is going on either. So I ask.... Is there anyone that can tell me why they continue to lock my account up?",2024-03-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,9.0,626,130,36,9,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,make new accoount different account amazoncom pull account every week locked get message call customer service call hold min longer verify ask account locked tell tell information well account verified identity get sent special department idea title wont tell going either ask anyone tell continue lock account,0.027301995827355815,0.9726980041726442,0.07291082445316882,0.2,0.8009311669769559,80.09311669769559,High Trust
