Aymincendiary One,/users/5e3ef7f512b06c0537ee9d96,US,13.0,2024-03-09 03:01:19+00:00,1.0,NEVER use a product box as a shipping box...!,"On February 28th I returned a sump pump and check valve. I wanted to send them in one box so I used an empty Remington Solar fan box I bought from them in November. The return was delivered on March 1st and I was told by Amazon CS it would be 15-20 days before being issued a refund.Today I got an email reading I was refunded for the Remington Solar Fan I bought three months ago and $311.99 was sent back to Affirm. I had to contact CS over the phone and tell them there was no fan in the box, I used it as a shipping box for the pump and valve. Payments go instantly, refunds take 3-5 days to process and I won't see the $311.99 back in my checking account until Tuesday or Wednesday. Then I have to call Amazon CS and reimburse them for the refund sent in error. Then I still have to wait until the 20th to be refunded for the pump and valve, if at all, and if not may have to have Affirm dispute the account which can take 60 days or more. Amazing they just blindly issue a refund for a product I didn't request a return for and is wildly past the return window. This one will be a REAL cliffhanger. I already contacted the seller that I didn't request to return the fan in case Amazon sends it to them.",2024-03-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,9.0,1208,241,45,9,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,february th returned sump pump check valve wanted send one box used empty remington solar fan box bought november return delivered march st told amazon c would day issued refundtoday got email reading refunded remington solar fan bought three month ago sent back affirm contact c phone tell fan box used shipping box pump valve payment go instantly refund take day process wont see back checking account tuesday wednesday call amazon c reimburse refund sent error still wait th refunded pump valve may affirm dispute account take day amazing blindly issue refund product didnt request return wildly past return window one real cliffhanger already contacted seller didnt request return fan case amazon sends,0.013552836393694657,0.9864471636063054,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.8202566721004045,82.02566721004045,High Trust
