Laura,/users/65ea377917c1410012b17dae,US,1.0,2024-03-07 23:54:20+00:00,1.0,Awful Customer Call Center ,"After being scammed on Craigslist, I needed to change my email and phone number on my Amazon account. The customer call center staff did not listen to what I needed and gave me incorrect instructions - at least 5 times. I had to ask call center staff person to stop interrupting me so I could explain the issue. Just fyi - if you need to change your email/phone and you have 2 step verification, good luck. I finally called their corporate HQ (who then transferred my call to another call center of course) and asked them to delete my account. Beyond frustrating. ",2024-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,7.0,564,102,27,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,scammed craigslist needed change email phone number amazon account customer call center staff listen needed gave incorrect instruction least time ask call center staff person stop interrupting could explain issue fyi need change emailphone step verification good luck finally called corporate hq transferred call another call center course asked delete account beyond frustrating,0.028343989967779,0.971656010032221,0.05720695457094784,0.2,0.7972693959303001,79.72693959303001,High Trust
