Andrew T. Llewellyn,/users/5558adf30000ff0001bf92f0,GB,15.0,2024-03-07 20:17:49+00:00,1.0,Stop using Amazon.,"My last order, I paid for next day delivery - it never came. Promised it wouldn't happen again and I'd get a rebate. Never got the rebate, and guess what... IT'S HAPPENED AGAIN!!!! Bloody useless. Just spent an hour dealing with it, both online and over the phone. Told by the phone agent that the driver cancelled after I redirected to a collection point, when I redirected 5mins after I had the email saying delivery today was cancelled (which really got me pi**ed off), and then got told by the online agent that they have no way of contacting the driver, and that the item hadn't even got to the local courier (despite the promise of it being delivered by 10pm tonight). So, I've now been lied to TWICE. Three times if you count the £10 added to my account, which hasn't been added. FOUR TIMES if you add on my request for a formal complaints form that was promised to be emailed to me by the phone agent, which also hasn't been received. Get f**ked, Amazon! You've ripped me off twice now.",2024-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,7.0,994,183,18,3,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,last order paid next day delivery never came promised wouldnt happen id get rebate never got rebate guess happened bloody useless spent hour dealing online phone told phone agent driver cancelled redirected collection point redirected min email saying delivery today cancelled really got pied got told online agent way contacting driver item hadnt even got local courier despite promise delivered pm tonight ive lied twice three time count £ added account hasnt added four time add request formal complaint form promised emailed phone agent also hasnt received get fked amazon youve ripped twice,0.9722490652310838,0.027750934768916213,0.10263600673022995,0.2,0.33440266873050406,33.440266873050405,Low Trust
