Dominic,/users/5b719e8f4de5666d34e7f3c4,GB,26.0,2024-03-07 17:14:07+00:00,1.0,amazon can ship you an empty box and you can do nothing about it!,"What went wrong this time?  Simply put, amazon delivered an empty package in place of an Intel CPU.  But it gets worse.  The seal on manufacturer's package had clearly been broken BEFORE it was shipped from the amazon distribution centre, as the amazon shipping box had not been tampered with.  Would amazon provide a replacement or refund?  Nope!Instead, amazon insist that I report the matter to the local police to get a Crime reference and a crime report.The police provide the Crime reference but will only give the crime report to amazon but amazon insist that I need to get the report to them.So now I am playing-piggy-in-the-middle, with the police saying they will only talk to amazon and amazon wanting me to get the crime report to them and refusing to talk to the police.Meanwhile, I am £550 out of pocket!  And amazon call themselves the most Customer centric business on the planet!UPDATE:After wasting half a day with email exchanges between myself and amazon or myself and the police, every email to amazon gets the same response: We couldn't verify the details of the Crime Reference you provided.So the Crime ref provided by the police is not good enough for amazon and ""Therefore, we're unable to assist you any further in this matter. We would ask you to resolve the issues and reshare the Crime Reference with us"".So the police have issued the Crime reference but amazon do not like it so the process stops and there is nothing I can do.I have had 7 phone conversations with amazon and it is like talking to a wall. They want me to provide the crime report, which is impossible as the police will only give that to amazon.",2024-03-06 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,7.0,1643,288,65,14,1.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,went wrong time simply put amazon delivered empty package place intel cpu get worse seal manufacturer package clearly broken shipped amazon distribution centre amazon shipping box tampered would amazon provide replacement refund nopeinstead amazon insist report matter local police get crime reference crime reportthe police provide crime reference give crime report amazon amazon insist need get report themso playingpiggyinthemiddle police saying talk amazon amazon wanting get crime report refusing talk policemeanwhile £ pocket amazon call customer centric business planetupdateafter wasting half day email exchange amazon police every email amazon get response couldnt verify detail crime reference providedso crime ref provided police good enough amazon therefore unable assist matter would ask resolve issue reshare crime reference usso police issued crime reference amazon like process stop nothing doi phone conversation amazon like talking wall want provide crime report impossible police give amazon,0.7681966074348876,0.2318033925651124,0.16152551878855861,0.2,0.4482068000402679,44.82068000402679,Low Trust
Ken Bell,/users/65e9b15a0ea5390011f84620,US,1.0,2024-03-07 14:22:02+00:00,1.0,Amazon getting greedy.,"I used to buy quite a bit from Amazon. This time When I went to pay for my order I noticed they were going to sign me up for a free trial of Prime. I don't want prime, but could find no way to order without being forced to get a Prime trial. Until this is rectified I will no longer buy from Amazon.I tried talking to customer service online and on the phone and was told there was nothing they could do.",2024-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,7.0,404,83,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used buy quite bit amazon time went pay order noticed going sign free trial prime dont want prime could find way order without forced get prime trial rectified longer buy amazoni tried talking customer service online phone told nothing could,0.020999150263632426,0.9790008497363676,0.04655075715086932,0.2,0.7988105762983577,79.88105762983577,High Trust
Cecilie Kalkar,/users/65e99d4e5d3483001138b426,DK,2.0,2024-03-07 12:56:25+00:00,1.0,They have my account on hold because of…,"They have my account on hold because of ""suspisious acitivity"" and ask me to confirm the card from my last order - BUT ID DID NOT ORDER ANYTHING so i cannot confirm something i didn't do. I have done EVERYTHING they asked, uploaded pictures of my credit cards, passport, utility bills everything about 4 times now, but they keep saying it is not enough. i guess its a BOT that scans and because my passport and credit cards are not American, the BOT cannot read my cards. Well... I do not have any BECAUSE I LIVE I DENMARK (duh) - . there is no way to contact them, because to contact them you have to login, but I CANT LOGIN BECAUSE YOU HAVE ME ON HOLD. I just wanted to use the kindle app - but I GUESS YOU DO NOT WANT MY MONEY - I was going to buy a kindle e-reader, but if I cant use kindle app, why would i buy a 200 dollar e-reader from them? I cant even aske them to just delete my accout, because there is no way to contact them. THEY ARE THE SACMMERS. DO NOT SUPPORT THIS BOGUS COMAPNY!!!",2024-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,7.0,997,198,40,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,account hold suspisious acitivity ask confirm card last order id order anything cannot confirm something didnt done everything asked uploaded picture credit card passport utility bill everything time keep saying enough guess bot scan passport credit card american bot cannot read card well live denmark duh way contact contact login cant login hold wanted use kindle app guess want money going buy kindle ereader cant use kindle app would buy dollar ereader cant even aske delete accout way contact sacmmers support bogus comapny,0.6521635946652384,0.34783640533476157,0.11104879416713405,0.2,0.49612796150080757,49.612796150080754,Low Trust
