Peter Hogg,/users/5b4f52ec4de5666d343657a0,US,57.0,2024-03-27 18:26:53+00:00,1.0,Finally delivered broken,"We've had a lot of theft in our neighborhood of packages left outside of homes. We've requested on Amazon that all deliveries be left at our front door not the entry gate, a 20 step walk to the front door. Also, on the gate is a sign with Amazon on it stating deliveries made to front door. Lately that's totally ignored by the drivers and tonight the driver left 4 big boxes outside the gate and my wife was able to catch him getting into his truck and he just ignored her and ran away. We order lots from Amazon and don't want it stolen and also I'm 80 years old and home today from another medical procedure so would be nice to have our delivery request honored and not ignored by these lazy drivers. The following are the order numbers which were left at the gate with the explicit sign to deliver everything to the front door.111-4651581-4353842, 111-4651581-4353842,113-7714709-5873865, 111-4651581-4353842Because of our age we rely on these deliveries so don't want them stolen!Finally we did get the dresser delivered with one of the drawers broken. Drivers who were from Wayfair as they wore Wayfair shirts and drove a Wayfair truck we noted to them the broken drawer and did not sign for the delivery. The driver stated he would notify Wayfair and that they'd send someone to fix the drawer or replace the dresser. Next we find out the driver most likely told Wayfair nothing and we were billed full tilt for the dresser. So the battle now going on 3 months goes on and what more can I say but I would never buy from Wayfair again and hope others that might, would read this saga and do the same not ordering from them.",2024-03-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,27.0,1629,295,24,3,22.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,weve lot theft neighborhood package left outside home weve requested amazon delivery left front door entry gate step walk front door also gate sign amazon stating delivery made front door lately thats totally ignored driver tonight driver left big box outside gate wife able catch getting truck ignored ran away order lot amazon dont want stolen also im year old home today another medical procedure would nice delivery request honored ignored lazy driver following order number left gate explicit sign deliver everything front door age rely delivery dont want stolenfinally get dresser delivered one drawer broken driver wayfair wore wayfair shirt drove wayfair truck noted broken drawer sign delivery driver stated would notify wayfair theyd send someone fix drawer replace dresser next find driver likely told wayfair nothing billed full tilt dresser battle going month go say would never buy wayfair hope others might would read saga ordering,0.19796993760696638,0.8020300623930336,0.16545148625911385,0.2,0.7341053284483396,73.41053284483397,Medium Trust
