Mike,/users/5581830b0000ff0001c69d82,GB,23.0,2024-03-04 08:41:52+00:00,1.0,Have Amazon become  ScAmazon,"I strongly caution anyone who buys from Amazon to LOOK FOR ALTERNATIVE VENDORS as I ordered and paid £483.00 + £4.99 for 24 hour premium delivery for a brand new Gigaset GX6 smartphone from Amazon on 15/09/2023 and was fraudulently sent an unsealed / opened used £282.00 phone in a tatty water-soiled box. Even though I rang and reported the problem within an hour of opening the box and provided pictures I was not provided with a replacement which I requested on at least a dozen occasions when communicating with 18 different employees and was instead just repeatedly advised about returns and had to wait 28 days to get my money back. As an Amazon customer of over 12 years I am disgusted with their response especially as they make the most OUTRAGEOUS CLAIM of aiming to be the ""MOST CUSTOMER-CENTRIC COMPANY ON EARTH"". The companies who I have ordered from in the Asian continent may take longer for their items to arrive if I am prepared to wait but at least they are HONEST IN THEIR INTENTIONS and if there is an issue, they genuinely attempt to make amends. 	It appears that while Amazon get orders and their balance sheet is ticking over then nothing else matters, the customers are an afterthought, and their staff seem primed to stick to a rigid script designed to repel customers seeking to get redress for any wrongs that they have experienced.Amazon need taking down a peg or 2 as they have become incredibly arrogant as their financial clout has gone to their heads and THEY NOW HAVE A CONTEMPT FOR THEIR CUSTOMERS which they try to camouflage with the absurd claim of being the ""MOST CUSTOMER-CENTRIC COMPANY ON EARTH""Have you ever heard such garbage???Please pen your reviews as these are the only real safeguards we have against the injustices that us as consumers experience when dealing with these commercial titans because when they are in the wrong they just say sorry and there is no empathy shown just cold hard invoicing.Remember it is your choice where you decide to spend your money and companies only listen when their profits start decreasing.",2023-09-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,4.0,2073,359,28,4,171.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,strongly caution anyone buy amazon look alternative vendor ordered paid £ £ hour premium delivery brand new gigaset gx smartphone amazon fraudulently sent unsealed opened used £ phone tatty watersoiled box even though rang reported problem within hour opening box provided picture provided replacement requested least dozen occasion communicating different employee instead repeatedly advised return wait day get money back amazon customer year disgusted response especially make outrageous claim aiming customercentric company earth company ordered asian continent may take longer item arrive prepared wait least honest intention issue genuinely attempt make amends appears amazon get order balance sheet ticking nothing else matter customer afterthought staff seem primed stick rigid script designed repel customer seeking get redress wrong experiencedamazon need taking peg become incredibly arrogant financial clout gone head contempt customer try camouflage absurd claim customercentric company earthhave ever heard garbageplease pen review real safeguard injustice u consumer experience dealing commercial titan wrong say sorry empathy shown cold hard invoicingremember choice decide spend money company listen profit start decreasing,0.0006047313516650773,0.999395268648335,0.20134604598990466,0.2,0.8399668435221485,83.99668435221484,High Trust
