Michael,/users/5989b4a60000ff000ab8df03,GB,22.0,2024-02-29 19:14:24+00:00,1.0,Third time for a collection…,I ordered an item that cost less than £15 but was wrongly described on the site - the size was different so had to be returned.  Royal Mail was due to collect it on Monday between 07.42 and 11.42 but didn't.  I chatted with an Amazon person who gave me a £5 credit and guaranteed it would be collected today at my preferred time of 14.00 - 16.00.  It wasn't.  I asked for a call from Amazon and the guy was completely unsympathetic and repeated either I could drop it to a collection point or he could arrange another Royal mail collection tomorrow.  I have no confidence in Amazon's ability to handle this or Royal Mail,2024-02-29 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,29.0,620,116,28,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item cost less £ wrongly described site size different returned royal mail due collect monday didnt chatted amazon person gave £ credit guaranteed would collected today preferred time wasnt asked call amazon guy completely unsympathetic repeated either could drop collection point could arrange another royal mail collection tomorrow confidence amazon ability handle royal mail,0.0658968421820105,0.9341031578179895,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.7800633568114064,78.00633568114064,High Trust
Customer,/users/5ad821f64de5666d34613b3e,GB,9.0,2024-02-29 18:35:03+00:00,1.0,"Package tracking stated ""delivered"", but it wasn't.","Package tracking stated ""delivered"", but it wasn't. The ordering was straightforward and the delivery to a business address was clear. The tracking status was changed to ""delivered"" - allegedly personally to the recipient - but nothing had been delivered. Following Amazon's guidance, we waited 48 hours before trying to contact them - which they don't make easy. Speaking to the customer service advisor they offered a replacement or refund. We chose replacement as we wanted the items. As potential future customers we wanted to know whether Amazon would be safe and reliable by asking what had caused the delivery failure and to receive an email or phone call describing how the problem had been resolved. Either the driver accidentally scanned the item and then binned, stole, or lost it; or the driver delivered it to the wrong address; or the driver left it outside the building and lied about handing it to the recipient. None of these are acceptable. The first customer service advisor told us the vehicle was moving and that the package would probably be delivered late. They then gauranteed that it would be delivered within 48 hours (it wasn't). The second customer service advisor offered the replacement or refund and refused to offer any communication about what went wrong and what they were doing about it. Amazon, you have multiple systemic failures in your system and your refusal to engage with curious and unsatisfied customers does not fill us with confidence regarding your services.",2024-02-29 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,29.0,1505,247,51,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,package tracking stated delivered wasnt ordering straightforward delivery business address clear tracking status changed delivered allegedly personally recipient nothing delivered following amazon guidance waited hour trying contact dont make easy speaking customer service advisor offered replacement refund chose replacement wanted item potential future customer wanted know whether amazon would safe reliable asking caused delivery failure receive email phone call describing problem resolved either driver accidentally scanned item binned stole lost driver delivered wrong address driver left outside building lied handing recipient none acceptable first customer service advisor told u vehicle moving package would probably delivered late gauranteed would delivered within hour wasnt second customer service advisor offered replacement refund refused offer communication went wrong amazon multiple systemic failure system refusal engage curious unsatisfied customer fill u confidence regarding service,0.01708724072788176,0.9829127592721183,0.13853056646102074,0.2,0.8191624929282634,81.91624929282634,High Trust
