David Morgan,/users/526a288f00006400015209cb,GB,39.0,2024-02-29 15:40:14+00:00,1.0,Non delivery to Northern Ireland ,If you live in Northern Ireland don't try to order insulation boards from Amazon. You will pay for them and then get a text/email saying that they have been dispatched and a tracking number given. You keep checking the tracking details and it keeps saying dispatched nothing else. As Royal Mail tracking number check with Royal Mail and they will not have received the item/ items. Why don't the sellers on Amazon state that they won't post to Northern Ireland instead of taking the money and doing nothing. Amazon needs to check into this and get it sorted. ,2024-02-14 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,29.0,559,98,33,5,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,live northern ireland dont try order insulation board amazon pay get textemail saying dispatched tracking number given keep checking tracking detail keep saying dispatched nothing else royal mail tracking number check royal mail received item item dont seller amazon state wont post northern ireland instead taking money nothing amazon need check get sorted,0.07637172082126191,0.9236282791787381,0.054963544587773416,0.2,0.7728068485069237,77.28068485069237,High Trust
