Melanie Charlaine,/users/65df6a68de5baf00127fdfc5,NL,1.0,2024-02-28 19:26:46+00:00,1.0,Horrible delivery and customer service,"Horrible delivery and customer service. I ordered two books from Amazon.com, I myself live in the Netherlands. Both books arrived damaged because they were thrown into a box and shipped to the other side of the world. The box was ripped open and both books were damaged. I contacted Amazon about this and at first the customer service took full responsibility, promising me a refund and I got to keep the books. When I emailed them later that week to ask where the refund was (it took quite long) they told me I wasn't getting a refund because my return window had closed, and that they were véry sorry (bet they were) and that there was absolutely nothing they could do for me. I'm absolutely flabbergasted. Never again. ",2024-02-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,28.0,722,128,38,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,horrible delivery customer service ordered two book amazoncom live netherlands book arrived damaged thrown box shipped side world box ripped open book damaged contacted amazon first customer service took full responsibility promising refund got keep book emailed later week ask refund took quite long told wasnt getting refund return window closed véry sorry bet absolutely nothing could im absolutely flabbergasted never,0.005422927081111359,0.9945770729188886,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.8116463603517606,81.16463603517606,High Trust
