Mike from Brentwood,/users/526e4c1f0000640001526d7f,GB,13.0,2024-02-28 16:15:53+00:00,1.0,Amazon’s customer service plummets,"I’ve been an Amazon customer for the best part of 20 years, and I’ve always felt comfortable purchasing from them because I knew that I could return an item with a very simple process. Over the last 12 months, it would appear that something has changed to the extent that too many poor quality retailers are being allowed to join the Amazon platform. With these poor quality retailers, comes a problem when trying to return items and, if you get a problem trying to return an item Amazon don’t want to know because you purchased it from a third-party. Shame on you Amazon, you are betraying your loyal customer.",2024-02-28 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,28.0,611,109,34,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’ve amazon customer best part year i’ve always felt comfortable purchasing knew could return item simple process last month would appear something changed extent many poor quality retailer allowed join amazon platform poor quality retailer come problem trying return item get problem trying return item amazon don’t want know purchased thirdparty shame amazon betraying loyal customer,0.030676561877313983,0.9693234381226861,0.061132922041503085,0.2,0.7968883034696436,79.68883034696435,High Trust
