Lynn,/users/657a435b729ecd00115923e7,US,2.0,2024-02-28 11:23:03+00:00,1.0,Conflicting customer services,"What happened to Amazon???Been a customer for over 20 years and I had so much trust with Amazon until what happened today...For reference:2/19I placed a high value item order (a smartphone) with my Prime account. 2/20 Amazon first updated item to be delivered by 2/23.2/23 Item not arrived and pushed to the next day.2/26 Still no delivery and no more tracking update. Upon contacting Chatbot, delivery date pushed to 2/27.2/28 Live online chat agent report item is lost by carrier and I need to fill out an incident report. Requested phone call from Amazon that I wanted to cancel my order and get refund ASAP.Phone assistant claims the item was never lost and should deliver on 2/28 but due to my cancelation request, item will go back to Amazon and refund can take up to a month. I asked what happened if the item is indeed lost per the other agent's claim and never returned to Amazon? Agent has no knowledge of the consequences that may affect my refund process. Now I'm left feeling extremely concerned without my highly anticipated new phone and no refund in time to repurchase it before I travel abroad.The huge disconnect between the Chat and the Phone customer services providing inconsistent information/solutions has made me lost my trust with Amazon. On top of that, major problems with the security of high value item shipment.I am ok with longer delivery time if it's stated in advance. However, I don't feel safe as a customer when items were advertised with Prime shipping that came without proper updates resulting lost or never delivered package.Amazon was known for their quality and fast services, but sadly, I would need to find alternatives from now on.",2024-02-28 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,28.0,1676,285,29,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,happened amazonbeen customer year much trust amazon happened todayfor referencei placed high value item order smartphone prime account amazon