Linda M,/users/654c3c6552f176001298818b,US,5.0,2024-02-28 07:46:43+00:00,1.0,BEWARE OF AMAZON,"BEWARE OF AMAZON!  I paid for some recent orders for a birthday party with gift cards, specifically because I don't want Amazon to have my bank info.  (In America, we are free to shop anonymously, but Amazon seems determined to stop that.) When I placed another order to use up the balance on my gift card, I got the message below.  I've wasted hours trying to either get my merchandise or my money back for the gift card. Presently, I have neither.🤬""Your Amazon account is temporarily on hold.""Hello,""We have detected unusual payment activity on your Amazon account [An Amazon gift card is unusual?!]. For your protection, we have temporarily placed your account on hold and placed any pending orders [that I already paid for!] or subscriptions on hold as well.""If we are unable to confirm your payment information within 72 hours, your pending orders will be canceled. Your account will remain on hold until we are able to confirm that you are the authorized owner of the payment method used in the recent transaction [How can I prove I own a gift card??!!!!].""To restore access to your account, sign in and follow the on-screen instructions. You will have the option to upload a document [A billing or banking statement!!🤬] with the required information to verify your account. Once you have provided this document, we will review it and respond within 24 hours. [So if I don't, they keep the money I paid for the gift card?!!]""When uploading a document to verify the ownership of a payment method [I have to do all this to buy something with a gift card at Amazon?!😳], be sure that the name, address, payment type, and relevant transaction information are clearly visible. For your security, only display the last 4 digits of the payment method number...""HOW AND WHY WOULD I PROVIDE THIS INFO IF I PAID WITH A GIFT CARD?!  Their whole retail operation is clearly a ruse to get your sensitive information into their database.  You can't buy anonymously from them.  BOYCOTT AMAZON to do at least a little something to fend off the Chinese-style fascist state they want!   They chose their name appropriately from the outset:  AMAZON - to dwarf all us little people and force us to submit to their will.  Americans BEWARE!",2024-02-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,28.0,2223,381,16,3,1.0,0,15,2,1,Suspicious,beware amazon paid recent order birthday party gift card specifically dont want amazon bank info america free shop anonymously amazon seems determined stop placed another order use balance gift card got message ive wasted hour trying either get merchandise money back gift card presently neither🤬your amazon account temporarily holdhellowe detected unusual payment activity amazon account amazon gift card unusual protection temporarily placed account hold placed pending order already paid subscription hold wellif unable confirm payment information within hour pending order canceled account remain hold able confirm authorized owner payment method used recent transaction prove gift cardto restore access account sign follow onscreen instruction option upload document billing banking statement🤬 required information verify account provided document review respond within hour dont keep money paid gift cardwhen uploading document verify ownership payment method buy something gift card amazon😳 sure name address payment type relevant transaction information clearly visible security display last digit payment method numberhow would provide info paid gift card whole retail operation clearly ruse get sensitive information database cant buy anonymously boycott amazon least little something fend chinesestyle fascist state want chose name appropriately outset amazon dwarf u little people force u submit american beware,0.9999999961145376,3.88546239626919e-09,0.213684800897364,0.2,0.342736962122204,34.2736962122204,Low Trust
Pam,/users/567929e10000ff0001f5e2fb,GB,16.0,2024-02-28 10:20:49+00:00,1.0,A signed for delivery that wasn’t delivered!,Apparently an item I ordered was delivered to reception and signed for today.   The delivery address has no reception and nothing was delivered.   Took a long time to actually speak to a person in Amazon who apologised but could only offer a refund which will take a few days.  The driver failed to deliver the item.  Where is it?  I hate lies.  Poor delivery service again.  Not good enough Amazon.Update.  Parcel was handed to a person yesterday and has now been received in the right place.  Amazon actioned a refund so I contacted them as I didn’t want a refund I wasn’t due to have.  Told me to keep the refund as a gesture of goodwill.  Hope it doesn’t happen again.  ,2024-02-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,28.0,674,121,44,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,apparently item ordered delivered reception signed today delivery address reception nothing delivered took long time actually speak person amazon apologised could offer refund take day driver failed deliver item hate lie poor delivery service good enough amazonupdate parcel handed person yesterday received right place amazon actioned refund contacted didn’t want refund wasn’t due told keep refund gesture goodwill hope doesn’t happen,0.018083814851902087,0.9819161851480979,0.06786315199102635,0.2,0.8045307229722541,80.45307229722542,High Trust
Kevin van den Heuvel,/users/5d333144a3e23865ee2a8673,NL,9.0,2024-02-27 22:37:31+00:00,1.0,I ordered a playstation 5,"I ordered a playstation 5, and the package was never delivered for €560! DHL said it was delivered but it’s not. Contacted the seller and Amazon. They did nothing. They just believed DHL that the delivery was succeeded. Never ordering at Amazon again. Now my money is gone and I can’t do anything about it. I’m staying with local services.",2024-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,27.0,339,60,25,5,26.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered playstation package never delivered € dhl said delivered it’s contacted seller amazon nothing believed dhl delivery succeeded never ordering amazon money gone can’t anything i’m staying local service,0.07562286557834715,0.9243771344216528,0.03365114974761638,0.2,0.7689187971603497,76.89187971603498,High Trust
KC,/users/65de3c1cdc69da0012052146,US,1.0,2024-02-27 23:11:13+00:00,1.0,Terrible Seller and Customer Service Experience ,"I have been an Amazon customer for 15 years but unfortunately I will not be renewing my Prime membership or ordering from Amazon anymore. I had ordered a computer and was sent the wrong computer. I sent it back and did get my refund right  away. I ordered another computer from a different seller and was sent the wrong computer once again. I received an approval from the seller immediatly to return it, so I returned it immediately. This particular seller decided to not issue a refund. I reached out to him and he was telling me how he is ""investigating"" it, even though he sent the wrong computer.  However, he used the ""investigation"" as an excuse to hold my money hostage for weeks. I really needed my money back as computers cost alot of money and I needed to buy another one since I had dropped and broken mine. I reached out to Amazon customer service and the customer service rep profusely apologized and said they would submit the prime A-Z guarantee ticket and also give me a $10 gift certificate credit to my Amazon account for my troubles. I was pleased about this and was immediately sent a survey in which I gave raving reviews of the customer service I had just received. However, as time passed,  I hadn't heard a word nor did I receive any confirmation email and also didn't see any $10 gift card credit. I had to take time out to reach customer service again and the new agent said, I'm so sorry the agent before me never submitted the ticket for refund request and did not give you the $10 credit. I couldn't believe it and wondered what kind of customer service is this? So this new rep and me went back and forward with a bunch of bs they were telling me that this computer  isn't covered with A-Z guarantee and there is nothing they can do. I reminded the agent it WAS listed as Prime and they are incorrect and then I started asking what is wrong with Amazon sellers and customer service at Amazon? I told this agent I have witnessed some of the sellers and customer service going downhill fast. I asked them if Amazon is supporting their sellers stealing from their customers  even when they order a Prime listed product. All of a sudden it was a miracle as the rep decided to issue my return. I asked him, how about issuing me the $10 credit also. This rep said, oh yes, of course, but it will take at least a couple hours to register in your account. At this point, it was no surprise that I never have received the $10 gift card credit nor any notice about it even being initiated. Needless to say, I am bewildered. I decided to get a Costco membership the next day and have already found replacements for many things I've ordered over the years with Amazon and set up to have my account not renew my Prime membership in April. Something is seriously wrong at Amazon now and they lost me as a customer.  I have ordered thousands of dollars each year for many years. Here is a statement from Jeff Bezos I found on the Internet. “We have always wanted to be Earth’s Most Customer-Centric Company.  We won’t change that. It’s what got us here.  But I am committing us to an addition.  We are going to be Earth’s Best Employer and Earth’s Safest Place to Work.”  My question to Jeff is....what kind of ""addition""  have you established in the workplace that allows shady sellers and awful customer service? I looked online and found a bunch of complaints about the seller who people are saying is an outright thief. It took me two minutes to run the company name and find this information. It took me to long to figure out how to see the actual Amazon seller reviews on which seems like it is hidden it's so hard to find now. I wrote a review stating what happened,  but to date I can't see it on his Amazon seller account and he's still on Amazon selling his computers! This is not acceptable. ",2024-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,27.0,3819,704,48,6,12.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,amazon customer year unfortunately renewing prime membership ordering amazon anymore ordered computer sent wrong computer sent back get refund right away ordered another computer different seller sent wrong computer received approval seller immediatly return returned immediately particular seller decided issue refund reached telling investigating even though sent wrong computer however used investigation excuse hold money hostage week really needed money back computer cost alot money needed buy another one since dropped broken mine reached amazon customer service customer service rep profusely apologized said would submit prime az guarantee ticket also give gift certificate credit amazon account trouble pleased immediately sent survey gave raving review customer service received however time passed hadnt heard word receive confirmation email also didnt see gift card credit take time reach customer service new agent said im sorry agent never submitted ticket refund request give credit couldnt believe wondered kind customer service new rep went back forward bunch b telling computer isnt covered az guarantee nothing reminded agent listed prime incorrect started asking wrong amazon seller customer service amazon told agent witnessed seller customer service going downhill fast asked amazon supporting seller stealing customer even order prime listed product sudden miracle rep decided issue return asked issuing credit also rep said oh yes course take least couple hour register account point surprise never received gift card credit notice even initiated needless say bewildered decided get costco membership next day already found replacement many thing ive ordered year amazon set account renew prime membership april something seriously wrong amazon lost customer ordered thousand dollar year many year statement jeff bezos found internet “we always wanted earth’s customercentric company won’t change it’s got u committing u addition going earth’s best employer earth’s safest place work” question jeff iswhat kind addition established workplace allows shady seller awful customer service looked online found bunch complaint seller people saying outright thief took two minute run company name find information took long figure see actual amazon seller review seems like hidden hard find wrote review stating happened date cant see amazon seller account he still amazon selling computer acceptable,0.022114758270041824,0.9778852417299582,0.39484015703869885,0.2,0.8679106522727188,86.79106522727189,High Trust
