John Hade,/users/514b7f530000640001350e18,GB,4.0,2024-02-26 20:49:08+00:00,1.0,Amazon . . . be more available.,"I am a massive fan of Amazon and think their percepton of what a customer wants is precisely right. However, when things go wrong they can be masters of customer frustration.I have had three deliveries over the past three days, all to a mystery place that is not my house or near my house. Each of the pics shows the parcels piling up. Efforts to reach an Amazon human proved fruitless because the callbacks gave me three numbers they subsequently declared to be wrong or not receiving calls. So today I had to go to a SHOP (gasp) to buy a crucial item for my work. I could claim refunds but Amazon's suspicions of my honesty might be raised. My faith in Amazon has been seriously undermined and I went to eBay for today's purchase. AMAZON , , , be more available.",2024-02-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,26.0,764,142,31,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,massive fan amazon think percepton customer want precisely right however thing go wrong master customer frustrationi three delivery past three day mystery place house near house pic show parcel piling effort reach amazon human proved fruitless callback gave three number subsequently declared wrong receiving call today go shop gasp buy crucial item work could claim refund amazon suspicion honesty might raised faith amazon seriously undermined went ebay today purchase amazon available,0.00853410483863642,0.9914658951613636,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.8116611584612202,81.16611584612203,High Trust
