Coral Barton,/users/54aa9c8a0000ff0001a20dc9,GB,4.0,2024-02-26 19:16:42+00:00,1.0,I purchased a mobile phone in November…,"I purchased a mobile phone in November 2023 for a Christmas present.  This was used from the 26th December to the 23rd January and then completely stopped working.  The seller refused a refund stating it was out of the guarantee.  I spoke to Amazon Customer Services on the 26th January, I was apparently passed to a supervisor who apologised for the problem.  I advised that this had a years Amazon Guarantee and it wasn't that i didn't like it it was because it was completely broken.  The CS person advised that I return this to their returns warehouse in Dumfremline Fife.  He advised to send a copy of the returns receipt to the CS email address.  I returned this by Royal Mail on the 26th January by Special delivery.  I sent confirmation of this to there CS email with a copy of the receipt showing the tracking ref number.  This was received by them on the 27th January at 10.18am.  I have contacted them multiply times, every time they ask me to send the return receipt to them again as they haven't received it but I have the email response from the CS email on the same day to say they have it.  I have sent 2 complaint emails to their customer complaints department and not had a response.  I spoke to the specialist team on  the 12th February, they asked that I send the information again which I did and I got a email response stating I would hear in 3 days. I didn't so I wrote to them they said I had to wait until the 26th February.  Today I chased them as I hadn't heard only to be told nothing they can do I need to go back to the seller but they had my phone. I emailed no reply and so I called, CS would not put me through to the specialist team nor a supervisor.  She told me I had returned the phone to the vendor which wasn't the case.  She said they didn't have the returns receipt and was not listening to me say that they have my phone.  I have sent them 2 emails asking for the phone to be sent back and they are ignoring this. So they now have my money and my phone and I have paid for return postage that I have not been reimbursed and I can no longer take this up with the seller as I don't have the phone.  Absolutely so angry.  My prime membership is being cancelled as this company has absolutely no contactable customer service not chain of correspondence with regards to a complaint.  ",2024-01-26 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,26.0,2321,440,39,7,31.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,purchased mobile phone november christmas present used th december rd january completely stopped working seller refused refund stating guarantee spoke amazon customer service th january apparently passed supervisor apologised problem advised year amazon guarantee wasnt didnt like completely broken c person advised return return warehouse dumfremline fife advised send copy return receipt c email address returned royal mail th january special delivery sent confirmation c email copy receipt showing tracking ref number received th january contacted multiply time every time ask send return receipt havent received email response c email day say sent complaint email customer complaint department response spoke specialist team th february asked send information got email response stating would hear day didnt wrote said wait th february today chased hadnt heard told nothing need go back seller phone emailed reply called c would put specialist team supervisor told returned phone vendor wasnt case said didnt return receipt listening say phone sent email asking phone sent back ignoring money phone paid return postage reimbursed longer take seller dont phone absolutely angry prime membership cancelled company absolutely contactable customer service chain correspondence regard complaint,0.010635142979650316,0.9893648570203497,0.24677509814918677,0.2,0.8440374481400121,84.40374481400121,High Trust
