BJCass,/users/5f32dcd4a3633082f037c86a,US,7.0,2024-02-24 18:53:50+00:00,1.0,Amazon “same-day delivery” is bogus,Amazon “same-day delivery” is bogus. Individual products will be marked as same-day delivery and you will be required to have a minimum order of $35 of ONLY same-day delivery products. The problem is that it is only after you have submitted the order that you will find out that most of the order will not be delivered on the same day. It will take between one and four days for these items to be delivered. Customer Service will give you all kinds of excuses about availability as if they do not have computerized inventories or any way of tracking whether or not they actually have the item in stock… Apparently they want you to believe that it is only after the order is placed and some time has passed that they can actually tell you that they have something to ship. ,2024-02-23 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,24.0,772,141,35,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon “sameday delivery” bogus individual product marked sameday delivery required minimum order sameday delivery product problem submitted order find order delivered day take one four day item delivered customer service give kind excuse availability computerized inventory way tracking whether actually item stock… apparently want believe order placed time passed actually tell something ship,0.01906772763670771,0.9809322723632923,0.07908020190689849,0.2,0.8062821765630258,80.62821765630258,High Trust
