David Gray,/users/62aca14bf456b40013865e37,GB,6.0,2024-02-21 22:20:24+00:00,2.0,Going downhill fast.,"Going downhill fast.When it comes to searching for items, Ebay has always been superior. Search for a frying pan on ebay, you'll get frying pans in whatever order you choose, on Amazon you will get frying pans but many other items, plus a different search may find other prices. Delivery charges are not always available until you start the order whilst ebay shows p&p or is often included. On Ebay a lot of items from China can be found in my country and that is reflected in the few days to delivery. I don't mind waiting a few weeks for an item but today it said ""Delivery by 8pm today"" but after I had waited in all day at 8.03pm it said, ""Delivery now in 5 days time"".I have no problem waiting but if communication regarding delivery is not forthcoming until AFTER the promised delivery date, that is unacceptable, if they told me yesterday, no problem but after wasting a day, that's not good customer service.",2024-02-21 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,21.0,916,166,20,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,going downhill fastwhen come searching item ebay always superior search frying pan ebay youll get frying pan whatever order choose amazon get frying pan many item plus different search may find price delivery charge always available start order whilst ebay show pp often included ebay lot item china found country reflected day delivery dont mind waiting week item today said delivery pm today waited day pm said delivery day timei problem waiting communication regarding delivery forthcoming promised delivery date unacceptable told yesterday problem wasting day thats good customer service,0.007882340183566058,0.992117659816434,0.09310151430173864,0.4,1.1146791327685648,111.46791327685648,High Trust
