Susana Delta,/users/65d4d36c52f1640012155798,GB,1.0,2024-02-20 18:29:37+00:00,1.0,Very bad customer services,"Title: Terrible Experience - Item Not Received, No Support from Seller or AmazonI am extremely disappointed with my recent experience on Amazon. I ordered an item weeks ago and it still hasn't arrived. Despite reaching out to both the seller and Amazon multiple times, I have received no assistance whatsoever. The seller has been unresponsive, and Amazon's customer service has been abysmal. To make matters worse, when I tried to escalate the issue by emailing the Amazon department, they have the audacity to claim that I didn't even write to them. This level of incompetence and lack of accountability is unacceptable. I will definitely be taking my business elsewhere in the future. Avoid this seller and Amazon at all costs unless you enjoy wasting your time and money with no resolution in sight.",2024-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,20.0,803,133,26,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,title terrible experience item received support seller amazoni extremely disappointed recent experience amazon ordered item week ago still hasnt arrived despite reaching seller amazon multiple time received assistance whatsoever seller unresponsive amazon customer service abysmal make matter worse tried escalate issue emailing amazon department audacity claim didnt even write level incompetence lack accountability unacceptable definitely taking business elsewhere future avoid seller amazon cost unless enjoy wasting time money resolution sight,0.006337150390861425,0.9936628496091385,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.8117501011926792,81.17501011926792,High Trust
