Ashleigh Jeffries,/users/65d4b45aa23caa0012077d49,GB,1.0,2024-02-20 16:17:12+00:00,1.0,Do not use Amazon!,"I ordered several items on my Amazon account in January, which came to a substantial amount of money, some of my items were delivered, when I tried to go onto my account to check when the rest of my items were due to be delivered, Amazon had closed my account. I have tried to contact them to find out why, and to try and get the money back for the items I have not received, and I get passed around to different departments, no one can help me, no one can tell me why my account was closed, no one can tell me where my items are. One of the items that did come I need to return as it is faulty and because I cannot get in to my account I can’t return it or get the order number! Customer service are useless, often have been very rude.",2024-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,20.0,736,149,18,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered several item amazon account january came substantial amount money item delivered tried go onto account check rest item due delivered amazon closed account tried contact find try get money back item received get passed around different department one help one tell account closed one tell item one item come need return faulty cannot get account can’t return get order number customer service useless often rude,0.038707987612318015,0.961292012387682,0.08356702187324734,0.2,0.7973594105684905,79.73594105684904,High Trust
