Javagymnut,/users/62b5f9ab7932390012677a44,US,2.0,2024-02-20 09:36:51+00:00,1.0,Amazon has become such a greedy…,"Amazon has become such a greedy corporation using bait and switch delivery times so you order and then they change the delivery. I ordered something on prime which said next day delivery and it wasn't even shipped next day and took 5 days to receive.Jeff Bezos and Amazon are unethical and have no loyalty except to money & greed. Amazon platform was designed as a, ""online retail outlet"" for businesses and people to sell on.It wasn't enough to put many mom & pop stores out of business, their greed took over and they turned their backs on the very same people that built their business, the sellers.Once Amazon analyzed sales reports and repeat sales they decided to screw the seller and began to sell their own branded products like batteries etc.They used the US Postal Service, FEDEX and UPS until they decided to operate delivery services.They place their ""ads"" prominently when you search for a product, giving them a greedy, unfair advantage.If that wasn't enough their Prime Services have gotten more expensive and they pushed back their delivery guarantees.Prime has increased, Amazon Music has increased, Audible has increased and NOW, after paying for an inferior ""Prime"" product that continues to decline, they decided to put ads on Prime Video and if you want ""ad free"" it is an additional $2.99 per month.Amazon Prime is inferior to Netflix as I have no issues streaming on Netflix or other Apps on tv, but Amazon constantly has lag issues and connection issues and doesn't respond.I have already been trimming my Amazon reliance, left Amazon Music, left Audible, using Amazon much less and can't wait to pull the plug on Amazon completely.I heard FEDEX is now going to compete with Amazon and in Fall of 2024 they are supposed to be launching their own online selling platform!! I can't wait!!",2024-02-11 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,20.0,1810,306,32,6,9.0,0,4,1,