Laura L.,/users/629a0f5a84677800134f2167,GB,19.0,2024-02-16 00:06:11+00:00,1.0,Cheated and robbed by Amazon,"My son was scammed and ripped off by Amazon!!! In general, I love Amazon and their products and services. But recently my son who is 18 opened an Amazon account and I wanted to teach him how to use and order from Amazon. Of course, we ordered goods like ""warm socks"". A few days later the courier delivered to the wrong address well, according to the photo of the 'proof of delivery' we were able to prove that it was not our address and house and of course it was refund done. A few weeks later we tried to order again exactly the same and guess what, the same again! This time he got a ""suspicious activity warning"" warning on my son's account and I tried to speak to customer service to confirm it wasn't his fault! A few months later he ordered 'headphones' which cost around £100 so guess what, same thing happened again!!! We were at home and no delivery only an email that you received the parcel...?! I called again and told the situation that we did not receive the shipment, I have security camera footage and can send proof that the courier was not at my place at the time. He said wait a few days and maybe the courier will deliver because sometimes the system mistakenly says delivered but they are still on their way. So we waited and called again after a few days. They advised to check the neighbors and come back in 48 hours. After a few days we called again... they said that will investigate and report back. After that call... a few days later my son's account was suspended due to an investigation. Tried to contact again and called like 10 more times trying to figure out what's going on here....asked for a photo of ""Proof of Delivery""....but (still haven't received it yet) ...so they shut down completely account and did not refund because their courier said the package was delivered safely to the location. today I spoke to an amazon ""manager"" who did not help me at all...couldn't give a ''Proof Of Delivery''...and no one can help because the courier said the item was delivered to the address and she can't change anything. The advice was from her... to contact the police...... So my son was left without money and without headphones. Therefore, dear future customers of Amazon....be careful...because if the courier steals from you...amazon will do nothing and you will be left without money and goods...and nothing to prove that it is not your fault. I am very disappointed with amazon!!! It's very scary that in the UK there are no laws that would protect the common citizens and such companies can steal from simple people's... it's very disappointing....",2024-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,16.0,2590,461,28,5,1.0,0,12,2,1,Suspicious,son scammed ripped amazon general love amazon product service recently son opened amazon account wanted teach use order amazon course ordered good like warm sock day later courier delivered wrong address well according photo proof delivery able prove address house course refund done week later tried order exactly guess time got suspicious activity warning warning son account tried speak customer service confirm wasnt fault month later ordered headphone cost around £ guess thing happened home delivery email received parcel called told situation receive shipment security camera footage send proof courier place time said wait day maybe courier deliver sometimes system mistakenly say delivered still way waited called day advised check neighbor come back hour day called said investigate report back call day later son account suspended due investigation tried contact called like time trying figure whats going hereasked photo proof deliverybut still havent received yet shut completely account refund courier said package delivered safely location today spoke amazon manager help allcouldnt give proof deliveryand one help courier said item delivered address cant change anything advice contact police son left without money without headphone therefore dear future customer amazonbe carefulbecause courier steal youamazon nothing left without money goodsand nothing prove fault disappointed amazon scary uk law would protect common citizen company steal simple people disappointing,0.9999992488899163,7.511100836854467e-07,0.2585530005608525,0.2,0.3517109756672123,35.17109756672123,Low Trust
