Iserhierhien,/users/5dc15a6de8f0e0e06dc7d2ad,GB,2.0,2024-02-15 20:54:19+00:00,1.0,I recently had a baffling and…,"I recently had a baffling and frustrating experience with Amazon UK. On February 15, 2024, I was shocked to discover a random debit of £53.97 on my credit card by Amazon. Puzzled, I immediately contacted their customer service, hoping for a swift resolution. Little did I know, this would be the beginning of a two-hour odyssey through the depths of Amazon's incompetence.After enduring an endless cycle of chat and call sessions with their customer service representatives, I was left more bewildered than when I started. None of them could provide a coherent explanation for why I was charged for a product I had already purchased days earlier with a different card. As a loyal Amazon customer of over 5 years, I expected better treatment than being left in the dark and wasting precious hours of my day.Not only was I inconvenienced and frustrated, but I was also left feeling vulnerable and paranoid, fearing that my card had been hacked and wrongfully used. To my dismay, it was Amazon itself behind the unauthorized charge. This level of carelessness and disregard for customer trust is simply unacceptable.I demand that Amazon rectify this situation immediately, compensate me for the time wasted, and reassure me that my financial information is secure. It's high time for Amazon to step up their game and provide the reliable and trustworthy service that customers deserve.",2024-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,15.0,1382,227,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently baffling frustrating experience amazon uk february shocked discover random debit £ credit card amazon puzzled immediately contacted customer service hoping swift resolution little know would beginning twohour odyssey depth amazon incompetenceafter enduring endless cycle chat call session customer service representative left bewildered started none could provide coherent explanation charged product already purchased day earlier different card loyal amazon customer year expected better treatment left dark wasting precious hour daynot inconvenienced frustrated also left feeling vulnerable paranoid fearing card hacked wrongfully used dismay amazon behind unauthorized charge level carelessness disregard customer trust simply unacceptablei demand amazon rectify situation immediately compensate time wasted reassure financial information secure high time amazon step game provide reliable trustworthy service customer deserve,0.008276397048221239,0.9917236029517787,0.12731351654514864,0.2,0.8213245047849191,82.13245047849192,High Trust
