John,/users/627c01f0622cd9001272c7dd,US,7.0,2024-02-15 19:52:02+00:00,1.0,Amazon review,"Normally, I love Amazon and their products and their service. However, recently I ordered something that was from a third-party seller through Amazon. Returning it was a nightmare and I called Amazon at least four times and each time was told that someone would call me back and that this would be solved. I ended up solving the problem directly with the third-party seller and not Amazon, but I was very disappointed in Amazon and their customer service",2024-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,15.0,454,78,13,2,14.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,normally love amazon product service however recently ordered something thirdparty seller amazon returning nightmare called amazon least four time time told someone would call back would solved ended solving problem directly thirdparty seller amazon disappointed amazon customer service,0.018803882250663588,0.9811961177493365,0.04374649467190129,0.2,0.7993473578090484,79.93473578090484,High Trust
Colin Southwell,/users/64fb0bd26e71e100123ad652,GB,9.0,2024-02-15 19:48:44+00:00,1.0,Drivers lying about deliveriesAmazon email notified 'item posted…,"Amazon email notified 'item posted through letterbox' - the item has probably been stolen from the doorstep - 2nd time this has happened in 2 weeks because the driver did not follow the delivery instructions. My main complaint is that the whole Amazon system is run by some kind of AI where, if your complaint doesn't fit their 10 item criteria it is not possible to post the complaint and the customer simply goes round in circles. The 'chat with assistant' and 'request a telephone call' options are just as bad - there is no option in the list to report that although the tracking email states ' posted through letterbox' in some cases this is a downright lie! Have spent thousands of pound a year with them for 6 years or so but if the delivery situation doesn't improve fast I'll switch to other suppliers. Here's an idea Amazon - employ some human beings to deal with complaints!",2024-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,15.0,885,159,65,8,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon email notified item posted letterbox item probably stolen doorstep nd time happened week driver follow delivery instruction main complaint whole amazon system run kind ai complaint doesnt fit item criterion possible post complaint customer simply go round circle chat assistant request telephone call option bad option list report although tracking email state posted letterbox case downright lie spent thousand pound year year delivery situation doesnt improve fast ill switch supplier here idea amazon employ human being deal complaint,0.3856661168365177,0.6143338831634824,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.6250020509479778,62.50020509479778,Medium Trust
