Soon-to- be-ex-customer,/users/63242d0f15b0d10012555cc4,US,2.0,2024-02-14 15:56:42+00:00,1.0,Customer service is really not for customers,"Customer service representatives are poor at all levels...including supervisors. Some employees will break their backs to do their job effectively and professionally...sadly, most for amazon will not. They intentionally disconnect the calls or put you on hold with the hopes that you will get tired of waiting and force you to hang up. They don't call the customer back it the phone call ""mysteriously"" disconnects even though you're still trying to get a situation resolved. If you ask to speak to a supervisor, the employee tries to tell you what the supervisor ""will say to you"". Even though they are not a supervisor, many employees will say they are a supervisor, but you won't get an email of your conversation satisfaction survey. They are really disappointing people and the company doesn't seem to care how the customers are treated.",2024-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,14.0,842,139,44,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer service representative poor levelsincluding supervisor employee break back job effectively professionallysadly amazon intentionally disconnect call put hold hope get tired waiting force hang dont call customer back phone call mysteriously disconnect even though youre still trying get situation resolved ask speak supervisor employee try tell supervisor say even though supervisor many employee say supervisor wont get email conversation satisfaction survey really disappointing people company doesnt seem care customer treated,0.0318329105414505,0.9681670894585495,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.7996752441123369,79.9675244112337,High Trust
