Sakara Campbell,/users/64a304a09937830012109b57,GB,1.0,2024-02-14 15:08:22+00:00,1.0,Zero for customer service,"Zero for customer service. Zero for delivery. Manager Erica very very rude. I am so upset, my sister has been murdered. I used amazon to buy the stuff I needed for my sisters funeral (big mistake). While going through the hardest time of my life and being a prime member I didnt expect the treatment I received from amazon. Every item I bought was jus left outside in the block of flats, where anybody walking by could take up. So many of my items was being stolen, I called customer service so many times to ask them to talk to delivery person to stop this happening. I made a purchase for 48.99 which was meant to be delivered 1st Feb it was n stolen because it was delivered outside the block of flats, I was told to wait till the 3rd of Feb for my refund which I did, I called up and was told on the phone and in writing that my refund was being processed I should wait 5 to 7 business days for it to be in my account. So I'm here waiting and waiting with the expenses rising for the funeral but yet no money back from amazon. I called back on the 14th Feb only to be told that I have to wait till 17th February for my refund that should have come bk to me fr the 3rd Feb. Tell me how this is right, how can you write a email stating one thing and then do the complete opposite. This is wrong beyond any measure. I am grieving a loss in the most horrible way ever. My big sister was murdered and amazon has made the journey of saying good bye to her even worst. I would never ever use them for important things because right now I am short of money and the products I bought from amazon when I have an email from 3rd of February telling me my money was being processed back into my account. I'm sooo hurt and disappointed because I would never have expected this. I cnt do nothing until 17th of February wen they process my refund and then I will still have to wait. Its so wrong n so disheartening",2024-02-14 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,14.0,1902,375,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,zero customer service zero delivery manager erica rude upset sister murdered used amazon buy stuff needed sister funeral big mistake going hardest time life prime member didnt expect treatment received amazon every item bought jus left outside block flat anybody walking could take many item stolen called customer service many time ask talk delivery person stop happening made purchase meant delivered st feb n stolen delivered outside block flat told wait till rd feb refund called told phone writing refund processed wait business day account im waiting waiting expense rising funeral yet money back amazon called back th feb told wait till th february refund come bk fr rd feb tell right write email stating one thing complete opposite wrong beyond measure grieving loss horrible way ever big sister murdered amazon made journey saying good bye even worst would never ever use important thing right short money product bought amazon email rd february telling money processed back account im sooo hurt disappointed would never expected cnt nothing th february wen process refund still wait wrong n disheartening,0.02308309630982537,0.9769169036901746,0.21031968592260236,0.2,0.8305223890296077,83.05223890296077,High Trust
