JSsanantonio,/users/5ea5a7ff842631b8311e5b9f,US,2.0,2024-02-13 17:50:25+00:00,1.0,Amazon reviews block due to important community health issue.,"I have sent email complaints to two different Amazon customer service email addresses and have spoken to one of their reps. that asked me to send an email to an Amazon address that does not accept emails! I would like to know exactly how my reviews violated their very general guidelines.  For example, Kindle includes hundreds of gay mm romance books that contain many long, graphic, explicit anal sex scenes, yet no mention is made of the need to douche beforehand, both for hygiene and health reasons.  That makes Amazon complicit in the continuing STD problems in the gay community.  They can't have it both ways. Amazon needs to filter and censure the authors whose books contain these scenes, which is probably all the books in this category, OR allow important, constructive reviews like mine.  This is a very important community health issue. In my emails to Amazon, I asked them to please reply with specifics on how I violated their guidelines.  They can't just send me a link to very general review guidelines that looks for certain words in the reviews without considering the context.  I have already canceled my Kindle Unlimited subscription.",2024-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,13.0,1156,194,61,9,25.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,sent email complaint two different amazon customer service email address spoken one rep asked send email amazon address accept email would like know exactly review violated general guideline example kindle includes hundred gay mm romance book contain many long graphic explicit anal sex scene yet mention made need douche beforehand hygiene health reason make amazon complicit continuing std problem gay community cant way amazon need filter censure author whose book contain scene probably book category allow important constructive review like mine important community health issue email amazon asked please reply specific violated guideline cant send link general review guideline look certain word review without considering context already canceled kindle unlimited subscription,0.022399448130680493,0.9776005518693195,0.10880538418395962,0.2,0.8105613527714517,81.05613527714517,High Trust
