Fool,/users/54250d7c00006400018ca350,HR,5.0,2024-03-24 09:28:30+00:00,1.0,"Ordered ""in stock"" VR Meta Quest 2 on…","Ordered ""in stock"" VR Meta Quest 2 on 1st of January 2024., should be delivered in a month from Deutschland to Croatia! No change in order status for 2 weeks, I contact support, they say ""it will be dispatched on 2nd of February""... I say OK.4th of February, still nothing. Contact support, they say to cancel it and order again with EXPEDIENT DELIVERY, and I'll receive full shipping refund when item arrives - in the MIDDLE OF MARCH!THIS IS 5H1T, so they have my 360€ for item which STILL didn't change status (11th of Feb) and I'll expect to receive it 2 and a half months after it's order.Crap company, crap leadership, 5h1tty BEZOS or JASSY, they get the money and ride the wave of established and fine company while having it's service dumped to that of A DEAD CORPSE.Unfortunately, their wealth can't diminish no matter what happens with service, and no one cares about your experience as a customer.UPDATE 2024-03-16:On 12th of March I was assured by customer service that delivery is on 13th of March. Today it's 16th and they send me the same thing as always ""delay in delivery, expected date is 23rd of APRIL"". Another month?What to say? If it was local shop with such service, it would be closed.UPDATE 2024-03-24:Talked with a customer service on 16th, the guy assured me that it will come asap (not on 23rd of April) and not to cancel the order. To check it in a week and if it doesn't change, then to cancel.SO, THREE FULL MONTHS I'm patient only to be screwed again and again with promises.Silly me, cancelling it now, avoiding Amazon for good, ordering item locally for 3% higher price which will be delivered in under a week.Thanks, bye",2024-02-11 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,24.0,1654,293,38,8,42.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,ordered stock vr meta quest st january delivered month deutschland croatia change order status week contact support say dispatched nd february say okth february still nothing contact support say cancel order expedient delivery ill receive full shipping refund item arrives middle marchthis ht € item still didnt change status th feb ill expect receive half month ordercrap company crap leadership htty bezos jassy get money ride wave established fine company service dumped dead corpseunfortunately wealth cant diminish matter happens service one care experience customerupdate th march assured customer service delivery th march today th send thing always delay delivery expected date rd april another monthwhat say local shop service would closedupdate talked customer service th guy assured come asap rd april cancel order check week doesnt change cancelso three full month im patient screwed promisessilly cancelling avoiding amazon good ordering item locally higher price delivered weekthanks bye,0.16041728816394982,0.8395827118360502,0.16432978126752665,0.2,0.7526573121715304,75.26573121715305,High Trust
