Joe Bird,/users/5b8818b44de5666d3418c30f,GB,34.0,2024-02-09 00:11:42+00:00,1.0,Selling returned goods as new,I have been using Amazon for a number of years and rarely had a problem and when I did its normally solved in a timely manner. But this one takes the biscuit I orderd a new angle grinder and a new circular saw dewalt sold by amazon sarl normally if its sold by amazon its next day but as I Hit the button I noticed it was a 3 day delivery arriving today Feb 8th again no bigie as I don't need the tools till the 9th so carried on and true to there word they both arrived one by DPD and the other royal mail which made me think 🤔 so I looked at the postage label my address then the senders address.Well low and behold senders' address was amazon returns wharehouse Fife well the cheekie devil's (not the words I want to use) are selling returned goods as new went back to the adverts it dont say nothing about these power tools being sold as returned or second hand which is what they are in law the tools do look OK but why should I pay top dollar for a tool that as been handled possibly used then cleaned so complained to customer service who said don't worry send them back we will refund you all well and good but what about tomorrow's job and more to the point why are amazon passing returned goods as new naughty naughty phone went dead tried to ring back and evertime I did they just rejected the call. Time to involve trading standards lots of screen shots of the adverts taken and I think I will also contact the BBC rip of Britain 🇬🇧 they like stuff like this Amazon never will I buy from you again  as you are deceitful and fundamentally dishonest,2024-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,9.0,1559,303,29,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,using amazon number year rarely problem normally solved timely manner one take biscuit orderd new angle grinder new circular saw dewalt sold amazon sarl normally sold amazon next day hit button noticed day delivery arriving today feb th bigie dont need tool till th carried true word arrived one dpd royal mail made think 🤔 looked postage label address sender addresswell low behold sender address amazon return wharehouse fife well cheekie devil word want use selling returned good new went back advert dont say nothing power tool sold returned second hand law tool look ok pay top dollar tool handled possibly used cleaned complained customer service said dont worry send back refund well good tomorrow job point amazon passing returned good new naughty naughty phone went dead tried ring back evertime rejected call time involve trading standard lot screen shot advert taken think also contact bbc rip britain 🇬🇧 like stuff like amazon never buy deceitful fundamentally dishonest,0.0306796625975872,0.9693203374024129,0.16993830622546272,0.2,0.818647829946299,81.8647829946299,High Trust
Jabar Barzanji,/users/65c5446111555a0012e148c7,GB,2.0,2024-02-08 23:15:26+00:00,1.0,I have been scammed on Amazon,"I have been scammed on Amazon. I bought a scooter paid £499 and featured a seat. I bought the scooter for the sake of the seat and the scooter hasn’t come with a seat. The seller has scammed me by definition, if it wasn’t for the seat I wouldn’t have bought the scooter. Despite evident proof and all the messages exchanged between I and the seller, Amazon denies refunding me.",2023-12-28 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,8.0,377,70,29,6,42.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,scammed amazon bought scooter paid £ featured seat bought scooter sake seat scooter hasn’t come seat seller scammed definition wasn’t seat wouldn’t bought scooter despite evident proof message exchanged seller amazon denies refunding,0.015131871582807486,0.9848681284171925,0.03925967470555244,0.2,0.8002859991497068,80.02859991497068,High Trust
