Dick monger,/users/5f708e22971efa225eb0c9f4,US,2.0,2024-02-08 07:07:51+00:00,1.0,In the last 30 days i have ordered 15…,"In the last 30 days i have ordered 15 items from amazon. 1 arrived on time. We pay for prime. Everything i order is sold and shipped by amazon, i dont deal with secondary sellers. So when theu tell me...3-8hr delivery, next day, 2 day, etc...i expect that they should meet that deadline. I am in a huge city and we have 3 amazon warehouses near me. When they advertise a time for something to be delivered youd expect that its for items in their local reach. We have multiple drivers (many) go through our neighborhood all day long. Amazon lies. Charge me 150 for prime and for what? Im done with them. At least Walmart gets me my items in 2 days and i dont have to pay for a membership. Amazon has become a joke.",2024-02-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,8.0,713,137,38,9,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,last day ordered item amazon arrived time pay prime everything order sold shipped amazon dont deal secondary seller theu tell mehr delivery next day day etci expect meet deadline huge city amazon warehouse near advertise time something delivered youd expect item local reach multiple driver many go neighborhood day long amazon lie charge prime im done least walmart get item day dont pay membership amazon become joke,0.005359529944998663,0.9946404700550013,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.8126875934122454,81.26875934122454,High Trust
