Maria Matarazzo,/users/63995f50b9b21d001256fe32,US,2.0,2024-02-07 22:34:35+00:00,1.0,DISAPPOINTED IN AMAZON,"As so many other people purchasing from amazon...it has been very convenient to say the least, never had an issue and if there was, it has always been resolved until now... I am SO DISAPPOINTED...my son purchased an apple watch for me for Christmas received it...it looked tampered with so he returned it. It was a returnable item as stated on Amazon site when purchased, it was returned in the timeframe allowed, he has proof that it was returned has everything needed for a simple return AND Amazon now will NOT give a refund. Why ????? I don't understand and feel they are taking advantage of my son. Amazon may not care if I never purchase from them again .....but if they don't make this right ... they leave me no other choice . AMAZON shame on you !",2023-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,7.0,756,139,22,3,58.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,many people purchasing amazonit convenient say least never issue always resolved disappointedmy son purchased apple watch christmas received itit looked tampered returned returnable item stated amazon site purchased returned timeframe allowed proof returned everything needed simple return amazon give refund dont understand feel taking advantage son amazon may care never purchase dont make right leave choice amazon shame,0.022649989005167886,0.9773500109948321,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.8042667048804784,80.42667048804783,High Trust
Vicky Carney,/users/633add30345fab0014c61e61,GB,7.0,2024-02-07 22:21:59+00:00,1.0,Amazon left a cripple stranded with no…,"Amazon left a cripple stranded with no food and no money and nobody to assist!!!I placed an order through Amazon with Morrisons. My husband went away on business, so I am on crutches alone. Naturally I thought it would be more reliable to order through Amazon but I was wrong!!!I waited close to the door without the tv on so I could hear a knock. Then I received a message saying that my order couldn’t be delivered due to access! Which absolute nonsense! Amazon deliver all the time! There was no knock and nobody phoned me. I tried to call the driver but it wouldn’t go through! I then called your call centre and was left in a queue for 40 minutes. I then explained the issue in a chat and was passed three times and left stranded with nobody to help me!!!I applied for a refund but it’s going to take 3 days!!! So in summary Amazon didn’t help me!! They with Morrisons left me without food and money because I can’t get my refund straight away!!! They also didn’t bother to help sort it out!!Absolutely unacceptable!!!!",2024-02-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,7.0,1024,188,39,7,0.0,0,27,2,1,Suspicious,amazon left cripple stranded food money nobody assisti placed order amazon morrison husband went away business crutch alone naturally thought would reliable order amazon wrongi waited close door without tv could hear knock received message saying order couldn’t delivered due access absolute nonsense amazon deliver time knock nobody phoned tried call driver wouldn’t go called call centre left queue minute explained issue chat passed three time left stranded nobody help mei applied refund it’s going take day summary amazon didn’t help morrison left without food money can’t get refund straight away also didn’t bother help sort outabsolutely unacceptable,1.0,0.0,0.10544026920919798,0.2,0.3210880538418396,32.10880538418396,Low Trust
Guest,/users/5ae5d91c4de5666d34a9f578,GB,5.0,2024-02-07 21:45:08+00:00,1.0,Item delivered but left on doorstep,"Item delivered to my addresd but left on the doorstep for all to see and to take away. When I tried to leave a complaint on line the item was “marked delivered through your letterbox”, ( this was untrue), therefore you cannot leave any further feedback! When you try to contact Amazon complaints department and type in complaints in their search bar you just get a long list of books to buy on how to make complaints, but no customer service, phone number or e mail address. It seems they don’t want anyone to make a complaint. ☹️ poor way to run a business!",2024-02-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,7.0,558,104,35,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,item delivered addresd left doorstep see take away tried leave complaint line item “marked delivered letterbox” untrue therefore cannot leave feedback try contact amazon complaint department type complaint search bar get long list book buy make complaint customer service phone number e mail address seems don’t want anyone make complaint ☹️ poor way run business,0.26930084171713037,0.7306991582828697,0.05832865956253505,0.2,0.6770153110539417,67.70153110539418,Medium Trust
