Interesting stuff,/users/65c30e043d9bf40012ca1ff0,CA,1.0,2024-02-07 06:58:56+00:00,1.0,Rude and Denial behavior from customer service,"I recently bought a language translator from Amazon. And after couple of uses realized that it is not useful for me and requested to return. I got an email from Amazon to deliver it to Canada post with out any packing or anything. They also attached a QR code. There was no label or anything. As per the  instruction everything would be taken care of by the Canada post. When I went to Canada post which was quite far from my place, they told that they dont have the QR setup yet and cannot accept the return.I called Amazon and after spending long time explaining the incident the agent transferred the line to supervisor and the supervisor came on line and she was very rude and said Amazon will never ask to return using QR code. Always there will be a label. I said I have the proof in the email. She denied and said that it is not true and said if you want we can send you label to return it to another location which they did. But I am very upset about the lie and rude response from the supervisor. Never had something like this happened before from amazon. Seems like their customer service standards are getting worse. I will think twice next time before I order anything from Amazon due to this incident.",2024-02-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,7.0,1214,227,46,7,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,recently bought language translator amazon couple us realized useful requested return got email amazon deliver canada post packing anything also attached qr code label anything per instruction everything would taken care canada post went canada post quite far place told dont qr setup yet cannot accept returni called amazon spending long time explaining incident agent transferred line supervisor supervisor came line rude said amazon never ask return using qr code always label said proof email denied said true said want send label return another location upset lie rude response supervisor never something like happened amazon seems like customer service standard getting worse think twice next time order anything amazon due incident,0.007330263811236114,0.9926697361887639,0.12731351654514864,0.2,0.8217975714034117,82.17975714034117,High Trust
