Troy Underwood,/users/5506e2240000ff0001b1c2c4,US,2.0,2024-02-06 19:21:24+00:00,1.0,Inaccurate Product Descriptions and NO SUPPORT from Amazon!,"I ordered some Contact brand shelf liner.  The product is advertised as, ""Con-Tact Brand Creative Covering Shelf Liner, 18"" x 50', Black, 6 Count"".  It clearly states ""6 count"", which to me means six rolls.  I ordered two ""6 counts"" (12 rolls), but only received 2 rolls.  I tried to contact Amazon about this but good luck with that.  They have an automated chat bot, which doesn't answer your question.  You can request a phone call, but that's automated as well, so I could not talk with anyone about this issue.  If you ever have an issue and need to actually speak with someone at Amazon, it's not going to happen.  Beware of inaccurate product descriptions.",2024-02-06 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,6.0,663,116,59,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered contact brand shelf liner product advertised contact brand creative covering shelf liner x black count clearly state count mean six roll ordered two count roll received roll tried contact amazon good luck automated chat bot doesnt answer question request phone call thats automated well could talk anyone issue ever issue need actually speak someone amazon going happen beware inaccurate product description,0.018810641813377823,0.9811893581866222,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.8036064569957229,80.36064569957229,High Trust
