Josh,/users/65afa0c225ce3b0012fad72a,GB,2.0,2024-02-06 13:31:54+00:00,1.0,Christmas Disaster,"Absolutely seething. I bought a few christmas presents from the website for dear family members. You wouldn't believe it when I tell you that they arrived just today (06/02/2024). I asked for a refund and got told over the phone to physically ""do one"" and ""jog on"". Until it got to far and one of them told me my mum wears ear plugs in the bath. Never ordering from Amazon again.",2024-02-06 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,6.0,379,71,18,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolutely seething bought christmas present website dear family member wouldnt believe tell arrived today asked refund got told phone physically one jog got far one told mum wear ear plug bath never ordering amazon,0.0282254622670645,0.9717745377329355,0.039820527201346045,0.2,0.793851374306737,79.38513743067371,High Trust
EisaP,/users/634d1fd6eab0fa0013a328c6,GB,4.0,2024-02-06 12:17:28+00:00,1.0,Awful experience with AMAZON,"Although I have been using AMAZON for over 10 years, I noticed lately that their delivery service has detreated beyond imagination. Not only the drivers will drop the parcel at the door without even considering ringing the door-bell (if the parcel is to large to go through the letter-box) regardless to the weather condition. They use to be careful about delivering the parcels but no anymore!! It could be a result of work pressure and delivery quota per driver. Our house is located on the corner of two roads with a front garden leading to the front door via our drive. Last Friday 02nd Feb we were expecting a delivery of a new air-fryer as notified by AMAZON. We were sitting watching TV at lounge which by the front door at around four o'clock in the afternoon when I received an e-mail  from AMAZON stating the the package was delivered and left by the front door (with a photo showing that), so immediately we open the door but found nothing!!!! We looked everywhere around the house in case the driver decided to hide the package but there was nothing!! It is unusal for our neighbours to pick anything from the front of our door unless we were on a holiday and have requested them to do so! Our neighbourhood where we live, is very safe and never encountered nor heard of any theft! Furthermore, It needed someone there and ready for the delivery to be dropped so that he/she swiftly grab  it and run with it which is remotely to happen. Unless, the driver took the photo and picked it up again and took it. No one would've  suspected that action as it would look as if he was returning the item back to the van!! Even if we caught him doing it, he could easily say I didn't want to leave it at the door!!  Both our cars where there on the drive and our door-bell is working!!!!!!! So, we called AMAZON who initially integrated us asking if we are sure is not there, or with neighbours ..etc before telling us that we need to wait 72 hours before we can report it undelivered. So, we waited until Monday 05th and we requested a call-back where we discussed the issue!! Regrettably, the customer-service agent who was based in Ireland could not get through to the correct department who could resolve the issue and told us that she will leave a message on the system for them to call us back and assured us that the case will be resolved. No call was received so today (Tue 06th) once again requested a call back and we spoken to another agent based in Ireland who passed us to another colleague (sounded as if based in India) and who also passed us to another of his colleagues there who told us that they 72 hours  to investigate the matter and we have to wait!! Besides being frustrated with this matter, we feel as if we were accused of false claim!!!   Shameful that AMAZON treats customers like this!!!   .",2024-02-06 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,6.0,2822,516,28,4,0.0,0,31,2,1,Suspicious,although using amazon year noticed lately delivery service detreated beyond imagination driver drop parcel door without even considering ringing doorbell parcel large go letterbox regardless weather condition use careful delivering parcel anymore could result work pressure delivery quota per driver house located corner two road front garden leading front door via drive last friday nd feb expecting delivery new airfryer notified amazon sitting watching tv lounge front door around four oclock afternoon received email amazon stating package delivered left front door photo showing immediately open door found nothing looked everywhere around house case driver decided hide package nothing unusal neighbour pick anything front door unless holiday requested neighbourhood live safe never encountered heard theft furthermore needed someone ready delivery dropped heshe swiftly grab run remotely happen unless driver took photo picked took one wouldve suspected action would look returning item back van even caught could easily say didnt want leave door car drive doorbell working called amazon initially integrated u asking sure neighbour etc telling u need wait hour report undelivered waited monday th requested callback discussed issue regrettably customerservice agent based ireland could get correct department could resolve issue told u leave message system call u back assured u case resolved call received today tue th requested call back spoken another agent based ireland passed u another colleague sounded based india also passed u another colleague told u hour investigate matter wait besides frustrated matter feel accused false claim shameful amazon treat customer like,1.0,0.0,0.2893998878295008,0.2,0.3578799775659002,35.787997756590016,Low Trust
hiep pham,/users/60e55f09d9ad6d0011be745f,VN,1.0,2024-02-06 09:31:52+00:00,1.0,"Amazon has held my money 20 days after item returned to their carrier, without estimated date of refund","I purchased an item over $1000, but it was stopped at the custom of my country due to lacking permission from the laws, and I had to return the item. The carrier received my request to return the item on 14 Jan 2024. The item had been kept by the carrier at all time. Since then I contacted with Amazon representative several times to ask about my refund. Some even promised I would receive after 2 days because I was a loyal customer, but they are just liars. Even one of their colleagues told me they were wrong, when I quoted the promises. Today, I talked with one supervisor, and the only thing she provided is that I would receive my refund once they receive the item because the item has high value.  I think at some point I will receive my money, but I don't think my case is acceptable to every customer. I don't even have a chance to see the item, so if it was damaged it is not my fault. What is the reason to hold my money for so long? If their employees could consider my case with common sense, they could do more than just generic, useless instruction, as a machine. Either Amazon tries to exploit me or their system is at fault. Either case, I would have to pay interest for the credit I used to buy such item if Amazon does not refund me on time.",2024-01-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,6.0,1262,244,103,18,22.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,purchased item stopped custom country due lacking permission law return item carrier received request return item jan item kept carrier time since contacted amazon representative several time ask refund even promised would receive day loyal customer liar even one colleague told wrong quoted promise today talked one supervisor thing provided would receive refund receive item item high value think point receive money dont think case acceptable every customer dont even chance see item damaged fault reason hold money long employee could consider case common sense could generic useless instruction machine either amazon try exploit system fault either case would pay interest credit used buy item amazon refund time,0.0028180730555265134,0.9971819269444735,0.13684800897363994,0.2,0.8259605652669648,82.59605652669649,High Trust
