Debbi Murray,/users/64fb20fe83d84b00129e15cf,GB,2.0,2024-02-05 20:30:02+00:00,1.0,Rip off Amazon,"What on earth has happened to Amazon?! The overseas customer service is dire! Prime has now become a rip off £1.99 for next day delivery, Amazon has become the worst platform to purchase from! Ordered a Worx grass strimmer for £108 my status was updated to ‘delivered to neighbour’ NOT TRUE we live in a gated complex with CCTV plus we haven’t been out today, no way any of our 4 neighbours was handed my parcel!! CCTV checked no deliveries today! Rang Amazon they said call back in 48 hours…didn’t take them 48 hours to take my money! I had to ask the agent to slow down as I couldn’t understand a word he was saying. Get a grip Geoff, I am cancelling my Prime subscription definitely NOT a platform I am prepared to pay for…remember if your purchase is over £100 you can always do a charge back via your credit card company in the UK! Amazon seem to be reluctant to admit they ARE responsible for your refund regardless of them saying it’s the sellers responsibility! UK law is probably different to USA law but we also have a 14 day cooling off period in the UK regardless of what the so call customer service advisor says!",2024-02-05 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,5.0,1126,209,14,3,0.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,earth happened amazon overseas customer service dire prime become rip £ next day delivery amazon become worst platform purchase ordered worx grass strimmer £ status updated ‘delivered neighbour’ true live gated complex cctv plus haven’t today way neighbour handed parcel cctv checked delivery today rang amazon said call back hours…didn’t take hour take money ask agent slow couldn’t understand word saying get grip geoff cancelling prime subscription definitely platform prepared pay for…remember purchase £ always charge back via credit card company uk amazon seem reluctant admit responsible refund regardless saying it’s seller responsibility uk law probably different usa law also day cooling period uk regardless call customer service advisor say,0.9999789541482469,2.10458517531098e-05,0.11721817162086372,0.2,0.3234541572500493,32.345415725004926,Low Trust
