R Fitzgerald,/users/5d16772797935f2624d65de5,US,72.0,2024-02-04 23:48:50+00:00,1.0,I may have spoken to soon when I…,"I may have spoken to soon when I previously Star 5'd Amazon for their change in business behavior. Today I experienced their new over seas customer service. It is brutal. Horrible English. Horrible skills. Internet telephone lines that chop and hack every other word. They have now gotten so big that they cannot talk to customers. They do not want any phone calls or emails from customers. Use their digital feature or chat feature. If it does not address your issue, too bad.",2024-02-04 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,4.0,477,83,33,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,may spoken soon previously star amazon change business behavior today experienced new sea customer service brutal horrible english horrible skill internet telephone line chop hack every word gotten big cannot talk customer want phone call email customer use digital feature chat feature address issue bad,0.2023954226784028,0.7976045773215972,0.04655075715086932,0.2,0.7081124400909724,70.81124400909724,Medium Trust
