Ron,/users/65bf041a5b51c20012d410fe,US,2.0,2024-02-04 05:30:00+00:00,1.0,There are many Alternatives,"Amazon's A to Z guarantee is worthless. It only reassures customers until you actually need it. Then you wake up very unpleasantly.I had always thought that Amazon was on my side in the fight against unfair sellers, but far from it: they take their side and leave me out in the rain.There are now many alternatives to Amazon, I'm just discovering them online and I'm using them more and more.",2024-02-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,4.0,392,70,27,4,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon z guarantee worthless reassures customer actually need wake unpleasantlyi always thought amazon side fight unfair seller far take side leave rainthere many alternative amazon im discovering online im using,0.023543921038618333,0.9764560789613816,0.03925967470555244,0.2,0.7960799744218013,79.60799744218014,High Trust
Chris Santucci,/users/564e62bc0000ff0001ec3b41,US,12.0,2024-02-04 22:46:28+00:00,1.0,Too Big To Care,"Here's the thing about mega huge companies that service consumers: They don't need to care about you. If a company has many millions of customers, and 90% of those customers escape doing business with amazon without issues, then the company has little to worry about.If amazon is making enough to send rockets into space, build their own warehouses, and buy their own delivery vehicles, they just don't need to care.I've been using amazon for decades and I suspect my recent issues have to do with policies enacted specifically to increase revenues.A few years ago I got locked out of my amazon account and customer service was no help. I pleaded with them to allow me SOME way to prove my identity beyond their asinine ""tell us the last 3 things you ordered."" At that point, I hadn't used my account in 3 months so I just did not remember the last 3 things I ordered, AND, amazon had at that point stopped showing orders on order confirmation emails. Instead, confirmation emails were only giving a link back to your amazon order page. Useless if you're locked out of your account. I did ultimately realize a way to get back into the account on my own.Most recently, while traveling, I ordered some items from different sellers, but items fulfilled by amazon to be delivered to an amazon locker. I waited, and then checked the amazon order page which showed that ALL the items were cancelled. I called amazon customer service but they knew absolutely nothing, so I reordered those items and waited again. A week later, I checked the amazon order page and yet again, all items were cancelled. This time, I insisted on talking to someone above the first person I spoke to. Then, they ended up handing me off to an actual American who worked specifically with the lockers, but that person just listened to my complaint and then said they'd tell someone else, blah, blah, blah. For some reason the UPS driver was cancelling my orders and nobody would tell me why. When I went to make the order a third time, I saw on the order page, for the first time, in red text, that the locker I had chosen was full. Mystery solved, no thanks to amazon, because they obviously have a low cost deal with UPS to deliver packages to their amazon lockers and the deal does not include bringing undeliverable items to a UPS facility so a customer can pick stuff up there. Instead, the driver just cancels the order and everything gets returned to amazon fulfillment centers with zero notification to the customer. My other major issue with amazon is that they did away with commenting on reviews for products. This was a super valuable method of sharing information with other consumers who took the time to write reviews. I suspect they stopped allowing this because people occasionally were recommending different products and that was obviously not good for them. Amazon has gotten progressively more and more antagonistic towards consumers but they know they can because there just is no alternative for us.",2024-02-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,4.0,2991,520,15,4,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,here thing mega huge company service consumer dont need care company many million customer customer escape business amazon without issue company little worry aboutif amazon making enough send rocket space build warehouse buy delivery vehicle dont need careive using amazon decade suspect recent issue policy enacted specifically increase revenuesa year ago got locked amazon account customer service help pleaded allow way prove identity beyond asinine tell u last thing ordered point hadnt used account month remember last thing ordered amazon point stopped showing order order confirmation email instead confirmation email giving link back amazon order page useless youre locked account ultimately realize way get back account ownmost recently traveling ordered item different seller item fulfilled amazon delivered amazon locker waited checked amazon order page showed item cancelled called amazon customer service knew absolutely nothing reordered item waited week later checked amazon order page yet item cancelled time insisted talking someone first person spoke ended handing actual american worked specifically locker person listened complaint said theyd tell someone else blah blah blah reason ups driver cancelling order nobody would tell went make order third time saw order page first time red text locker chosen full mystery solved thanks amazon obviously low cost deal ups deliver package amazon locker deal include bringing undeliverable item ups facility customer pick stuff instead driver cancel order everything get returned amazon fulfillment center zero notification customer major issue amazon away commenting review product super valuable method sharing information consumer took time write review suspect stopped allowing people occasionally recommending different product obviously good amazon gotten progressively antagonistic towards consumer know alternative u,0.008495880455086988,0.991504119544913,0.2916432978126753,0.2,0.8540807193349916,85.40807193349916,High Trust
Kaz,/users/569f65f40000ff0001fe1475,GB,63.0,2024-02-03 22:20:36+00:00,1.0,I can't rely on Amazon anymore.,"What is going on with this company?!It used to be trustworthy and reliable.Lately, I've had parcels not arrive even though it said handed to resident! Yesterday, I ordered a phone charger to arrive the next day because the one I'm using isn't fully connecting. I should have gone and found one in a shop instead of relying on this dreadful company!Here I am still sitting waiting for it at 8.15pm, knowing full well that it won't arrive tonight.I'm now wasting my 7% charge on writing an angry review!From now on, I will go into the city and find things myself. If I can't rely on Amazon, then there's no hope for online shopping anymore.",2024-02-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,3.0,638,114,31,6,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,going companyit used trustworthy reliablelately ive parcel arrive even though said handed resident yesterday ordered phone charger arrive next day one im using isnt fully connecting gone found one shop instead relying dreadful companyhere still sitting waiting pm knowing full well wont arrive tonightim wasting charge writing angry reviewfrom go city find thing cant rely amazon there hope online shopping anymore,0.975437499678856,0.024562500321144043,0.06393718452047112,0.2,0.32506868706466624,32.506868706466626,Low Trust
Kathleen Manning,/users/5dcd58f017e36ee6522b1e5a,US,9.0,2024-02-03 20:36:22+00:00,1.0,DO NOT use Visa debit gift cards - AMAZON's system steals your money!,"Amazon received two $100 Visa debit gift cards from me - these were referral rewards from my health sharing program. The first I loaded per online instructions as a debit card, and it looked fine, for a day. I then loaded the second Visa debit gift card, but it loaded as $89.12 instead of $100. Got on chat and went through 3 people until one of them said something like ""Okay, I'm adding $11, plus a $10 courtesy for your trouble."" It was apparently a glitch in the system. The Visa debit was showing as $100.12 on the order. I then ordered a vacuum cleaner, putting the balance on my CC. TODAY my account now says ""We couldn't charge your selected payment method, so we charged your backup payment method."" They charged my CC $100. This is not cool. I am doubly paying the $100 for the vacuum. Back to the first Visa debit card, which I loaded and had appeared as a gift card with $100 in the system. I received an email on 01/31/2024 that said I had successfully loaded it, and they gave an $8 bonus for the load. Great! Problem is, it was zeroed out quickly, and when I went through the chat, one guy told me the amount would be reloaded within 24-48 hours. I then got an email saying that the payment failed. Of course it failed! They already got it from the card balance!Back to chat the morning of 02/02. They sent me to a phone person immediately, a lady named T. She was SO rude, as we had a lag, and she insisted on schooling me about how there was now no lag and so forth. T. was completely condescending. Needs education about tech and how to treat customers with respect. She  finally told me that the first thing people usually do is call the issuing bank. I am not in the habit of using Visa debit gift cards, and did not know that. She treated me like a child. I called the bank and they were completely helpful, giving me two transaction numbers when Amazon transferred funds into their system. But this is for Visa Debit GC #1. Who knows if it will work? I still have to try to claw $ back from them for the vacuum cleaner purchase with Visa debit #2. This has already cost me 2 hours of work. SO frustrated.The upshot - DON'T trust Amazon to deal with these debit gift cards. Their system will steal your money. Their Customer Service is quite ineffective and apparently doesn't work for this issue. They should be set up to not receive them at all, since it's so screwed up.I will edit this post after my next contact with Amazon Customer Service.",2024-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,3.0,2468,463,69,13,3.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,amazon received two visa debit gift card referral reward health sharing program first loaded per online instruction debit card looked fine day loaded second visa debit gift card loaded instead got chat went people one said something like okay im adding plus courtesy trouble apparently glitch system visa debit showing order ordered vacuum cleaner putting balance cc today account say couldnt charge selected payment method charged backup payment method charged cc cool doubly paying vacuum back first visa debit card loaded appeared gift card system received email said successfully loaded gave bonus load great problem zeroed quickly went chat one guy told amount would reloaded within hour got email saying payment failed course failed already got card balanceback chat morning sent phone person immediately lady named rude lag insisted schooling lag forth completely condescending need education tech treat customer respect finally told first thing people usually call issuing bank habit using visa debit gift card know treated like child called bank completely helpful giving two transaction number amazon transferred fund system visa debit gc know work still try claw back vacuum cleaner purchase visa debit already cost hour work frustratedthe upshot dont trust amazon deal debit gift card system steal money customer service quite ineffective apparently doesnt work issue set receive since screwed upi edit post next contact amazon customer service,0.5203629402885751,0.4796370597114249,0.2596747055524397,0.2,0.5917534709662003,59.17534709662004,Medium Trust
