Morten,/users/5498439600006400019f7203,DK,73.0,2024-02-02 18:19:50+00:00,1.0,"DONT subscribe for a ""free"" membership of Prime Video !!!","Oh, I see that Amazon has the world record in low trust already, so they probably dont care about one more bad comment.Well: I subscribed for a 7 days long free subscription to Prime Video - wich I got, and what I could watch was few and lousy movies and a loooot of crappy series. All the good stuf was ""temporarely not avaiable in your area""...It gets worse:I tried to end the subscription 2 days before it ran out. No way !Clicking on ""end membership"" had no effect at all - NOTHING happened - not even an error message came up...BUT there was a link to Help, so I clicked that, and got an error message - the page was not existing...After an hour or so, I gave up, and guessed that Amazon/Prime Video had a problem with their site.NEXT DAY: I tried again - guess what happened...You got it - NOTHING !!!!!! Same crap as yesterday.Today I see that Prime Video has drawn the subscription fee for a month.AndToday I have ended my subscription - nooo problem.What is going on here - are Amazon/Prime Video so low, that they pull a scam on their potential customers ???I can assure that it has ONE effect on me:""NEVER AGAIN PRIME VIDEO OR AMAZON !!!""Also I will sell all my Amazon Stocks - because I cannot believe that Amazon is a good business that will grow, when this is how it works.Addition on feb.02-24:Getting Worse: They took payment for my unwanted subscription and i put it to an end, so they will not grab more of my money, and what I see now is, that I can't see much <1% of contents, and mainly bad series, and the rest is only possibly to watch if I buy or rent or is not avaiable at all, so I payed for 1 month, and I got 1 day.So I have payed for a subscription in one month, and I get basicly nothing.That is called theft !F. Amazon !",2024-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,2.0,1751,334,57,10,2.0,0,12,1,0,Genuine,oh see amazon world record low trust already probably dont care one bad commentwell subscribed day long free subscription prime video wich got could watch lousy movie loooot crappy series good stuf temporarely avaiable areait get worsei tried end subscription day ran way clicking end membership effect nothing happened even error message came upbut link help clicked got error message page existingafter hour gave guessed amazonprime video problem sitenext day tried guess happenedyou got nothing crap yesterdaytoday see prime video drawn subscription fee monthandtoday ended subscription nooo problemwhat going amazonprime video low pull scam potential customer assure one effect menever prime video amazon also sell amazon stock cannot believe amazon good business grow worksaddition febgetting worse took payment unwanted subscription put end grab money see cant see much content mainly bad series rest possibly watch buy rent avaiable payed month got dayso payed subscription one month get basicly nothingthat called theft f amazon,0.9999998691504484,1.3084955163833456e-07,0.1873247335950645,0.2,0.3374650121437887,33.746501214378874,Low Trust
DoggoMom,/users/65bb9b80e26307001253e7db,US,1.0,2024-02-01 15:24:46+00:00,1.0,Used to be an ok company,"Used to be an ok company that sold decent products but for the last 5 or 6 years it is a crap shot as to whether you are getting a quality product or not.  They will not tell you in the description if something is being made in China or not and they allow bogus reviews to get the rating of a product up because they know most people look for things with as close to a five star review as possible.  They also allow false advertisement on their site.  Numerous products have pictures to show you what it is they are selling but once you receive the item it’s nothing like what was pictured.  That is another thing actually receiving your purchase.  I’m so tired of it a logistics issue.  I can receive items from other companies with no issues but Amazon can’t seem to find my house.  If I do get what I ordered it is almost always after the promised delivery date.  They advertise two day delivery for prime and I do good to get within 5 days, if I get it at all.  I actually quit buying clothes off of Amazon because 99% of all clothes on Amazon are made in China and sizes in China are totally different than they are in the US.  That or they deliberately make them smaller so you waste your money buying them.",2024-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,1.0,1213,233,24,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used ok company sold decent product last year crap shot whether getting quality product tell description something made china allow bogus review get rating product know people look thing close five star review possible also allow false advertisement site numerous product picture show selling receive item it’s nothing like pictured another thing actually receiving purchase i’m tired logistics issue receive item company issue amazon can’t seem find house get ordered almost always promised delivery date advertise two day delivery prime good get within day get actually quit buying clothes amazon clothes amazon made china size china totally different u deliberately make smaller waste money buying,0.005469683020073987,0.994530316979926,0.13067863151991027,0.2,0.8234008847939451,82.34008847939451,High Trust
Tati Khuzwayo,/users/65bb81eee26307001253d523,ZA,1.0,2024-02-01 13:35:36+00:00,1.0,Literally the worst shopping experience…,"Literally the worst shopping experience I've had online. Account was closed for suspicious activity. Customer service is a joke, you'll get 15 different answers no one knows what's going on. You need to talk to an unreachable account specialist to get your account reinstated. Do not shop here. I lost two weeks of my life I'll never get back. Nevermind the $50 balance on my account that I'll apparently forfeit. I genuinely hope you all die a slow and painful death",2024-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,1.0,467,81,40,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,literally worst shopping experience ive online account closed suspicious activity customer service joke youll get different answer one know whats going need talk unreachable account specialist get account reinstated shop lost two week life ill never get back nevermind balance account ill apparently forfeit genuinely hope die slow painful death,0.018750757236246477,0.9812492427637535,0.045429052159282106,0.2,0.7997104318137331,79.97104318137332,High Trust
Trae Browne,/users/546d1a9b000064000197bf4b,GB,53.0,2024-02-01 11:32:23+00:00,1.0,Expensive item avoid Amazon unless you're rich.,"Faulty slow running laptop bought as a Christmas present for my daughter and her studies, so I returned the thing on Boxing Day and was given a timetable of when the refund would be issued when you click on track return.So I check this morning and they have now added a further 2 days to the timeline to issue the refund, so I phoned them and have now been told It can take up to 30 days, 14 working days, wait until the 7TH Feb, so I've just phoned my bank up and done a chargeback which will payout by tomorrow morning. My advice if you're rich then keep the return receipt and Amazon will eventually pay you your refund, but if you can only afford one laptop at a time then either use a different company or do a chargeback asap.",2024-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,2.0,1.0,732,142,47,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,faulty slow running laptop bought christmas present daughter study returned thing boxing day given timetable refund would issued click track returnso check morning added day timeline issue refund phoned told take day working day wait th feb ive phoned bank done chargeback payout tomorrow morning advice youre rich keep return receipt amazon eventually pay refund afford one laptop time either use different company chargeback asap,0.04065745164272651,0.9593425483572735,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.7955994850591751,79.5599485059175,High Trust
