Anna Li,/users/65b8f16e35038e001240d08d,GB,1.0,2024-01-30 14:54:18+00:00,1.0,Wrong delivery address item needs Police Repot to get refund,"I have ordered one Laptop around £400 from Amazon App. Amazon gave wrong address to DPD. On DPD tracking system I can see it has been delivered to wrong address successful. So I contacted DPD, they said that’s the address came from Amazon order. I need to contact Amazon. So I talked to Amazon customer service. They consistently say it’s a third party theft, I need to report to police and get a criminal report then they can start an investigation. On the Amazon customer service email said, it’s okay for a criminal reference number from Police. But now they asked for the pdf criminal report. I have requested to police. They asked Amazon to contact them due to the report will be delivered to me within 3 months. That will miss Amazon case closing deadline. I have emailed to Amazon. It’s still no response yet. Amazon’s services usually were the best of the best. Just don’t understand what’s happened now. They created so complicated procedures to ask customer to take responsibility for their own mistake. I really suggest people don’t buy expensive stuffs in Amazon in the future. Just buy cheaper stuff on Amazon. If lost, just lost. You don’t need spend so much time to cover their mistakes. Really unbelievable!",2024-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,30.0,1223,212,60,10,11.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered one laptop around £ amazon app amazon gave wrong address dpd dpd tracking system see delivered wrong address successful contacted dpd said that’s address came amazon order need contact amazon talked amazon customer service consistently say it’s third party theft need report police get criminal report start investigation amazon customer service email said it’s okay criminal reference number police asked pdf criminal report requested police asked amazon contact due report delivered within month miss amazon case closing deadline emailed amazon it’s still response yet amazon’s service usually best best don’t understand what’s happened created complicated procedure ask customer take responsibility mistake really suggest people don’t buy expensive stuff amazon future buy cheaper stuff amazon lost lost don’t need spend much time cover mistake really unbelievable,0.016862052942427708,0.9831379470575723,0.11890072910824454,0.2,0.815349119350435,81.5349119350435,High Trust
