Elise,/users/65b256aac435e20012bcd3e4,US,4.0,2024-01-29 16:59:43+00:00,5.0,Amazon has been consistently great throughout the years.,"After creating an account at trustpilot to save others from dealing with my total disappointment with Bizay / 360online Print / 360 Print / Bizay.com, and never having my problem resolved although they claimed it was, nor receiving satisfaction from Bizay.com and being exhausted by dealing with them, I was not looking forward to dealing with Amazon on an item I received that was damaged. I braced myself for my call with Amazon, and was relieved and surprised at how easy it was to deal with Amazon, this huge company. I was so shocked, that I became curious to see how Amazon was rated as compared to my horrendous Bizay.com experience. I decided that since I already have this account to do reviews, I would review my great experience with Amazon. But this was not the only great experience I've had with Amazon. They have been extremely easy to work with throughout the years, and they deserve to be positively reviewed for their continued good service that I have received throughout the years.",2024-01-29 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,29.0,1001,173,56,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,creating account trustpilot save others dealing total disappointment bizay online print print bizaycom never problem resolved although claimed receiving satisfaction bizaycom exhausted dealing looking forward dealing amazon item received damaged braced call amazon relieved surprised easy deal amazon huge company shocked became curious see amazon rated compared horrendous bizaycom experience decided since already account review would review great experience amazon great experience ive amazon extremely easy work throughout year deserve positively reviewed continued good service received throughout year,0.019849279248478045,0.980150720751522,0.09702748177229388,1.0,2.00948085673022,200.948085673022,High Trust
Stephen rekab,/users/53d7c74400006400018194e2,IE,19.0,2024-01-30 15:56:03+00:00,1.0,I was offered a FREE 7day No Obligation Amazon Prime shipping...However...,"I was offered a FREE 7 day, NO OBLIGATION trial of Amazon PRIME as I landed at the check out webpage. I opted in: ""sure why not says I""However after a day or so, I had buyer's remorse and choose to cancel my Amazon Prime membership. What happened next was disappointing:My item went missing for 10 days without a notification from the seller - who had shipped it - or Amazon PRIME - who had lost it! Reaching out to Amazon online, I asked what had happened to my purchase. Having been compelled to call Amazon, after a long wait, I opted for a call back. A very nice lady offered me a full refund. FYI, this option was not displayed to me online. ""Great ! thanks, yes please. Let's do that"". Guess what happened next? She sends the money back into my credit card account  and withing a couple of hours of it happily resting in my account - don't I get an email next day saying the product was being delivered!  It arrives; I print the RETURNS LABELS and stick them to the unopened box. Then I noticed that the Package required a STAMP, which turned out to be €9.00 So I found myself being put in a position of PAYING for accepting a NO OBLIGATION FREE TRAIL OF AMAZON PRIME 24-48 HOUR SHIPPING - should I RETURN a refunded order. Mmmm!?!OR alternately I am tacitly being invited to injure my personal integrity if I don't post the (now) unwanted item back to the shop who in fact had sold and shipped it in good faith. It seems to me that it ought to be the manager responsible for the online Free AMAZON PRIME trail promotion- who should be the individual sanctioned for making an offer s/he never intended to honor in word as well as spirit.  Shame on you Sir or Madam, no doubt on a lower wrung of the Regional management ladder, on your shifting your lack of integrity from yourself and onto the shop or the guileless customer you have out witted today. Are you proud of your interpretation of fair procedure of a dispute between a shop, a customer and Amazon Prime?",2024-01-10 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,30.0,1970,368,74,11,20.0,0,5,1,0,Genuine,offered free day obligation trial amazon prime landed check webpage opted sure say ihowever day buyer remorse choose cancel amazon prime membership happened next disappointingmy item went missing day without notification seller shipped amazon prime lost reaching amazon online asked happened purchase compelled call amazon long wait opted call back nice lady offered full refund fyi option displayed online great thanks yes please let guess happened next sends money back credit card account withing couple hour happily resting account dont get email next day saying product delivered arrives print return label stick unopened box noticed package required stamp turned € found put position paying accepting obligation free trail amazon prime hour shipping return refunded order mmmmor alternately tacitly invited injure personal integrity dont post unwanted item back shop fact sold shipped good faith seems ought manager responsible online free amazon prime trail promotion individual sanctioned making offer never intended honor word well spirit shame sir madam doubt lower wrung regional management ladder shifting lack integrity onto shop guileless customer witted today proud interpretation fair procedure dispute shop customer amazon prime,0.9350574105980889,0.06494258940191111,0.2063937184520471,0.2,0.37375003839136495,37.3750038391365,Low Trust
