Emma Carter,/users/5e5587081a955c11252b98bd,GB,3.0,2024-01-26 10:16:21+00:00,1.0,Alexa devices at Amazon !,"Alexa devices at Amazon !Used to love Amazon , myself and my nan have an account and we’re always ordering. I’m very upset with recent contact with Amazon , i bought an AmazonTower a few years ago but I now can’t use this because it’s Obsolete. I asked if there was anything they can do and all I got was that the product is obsolete so it won’t work anymore ! But yet I bought it to Last ? So Why is it fair to keep buying new Amazon music devices because people need to upgrade ? I thinkIt’s disgusting the tower cost me £90 and it should last for years to come ! I have a radio from Argos for £10 that’s last me 10 years ! Yet they thinkIt’s acceptable to sell all these music devices but they DoNot last ! So seriously ,do not buy Amazon music devices ! Go to Argos and get one that will last !!",2024-01-26 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,26.0,799,162,25,5,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,alexa device amazon used love amazon nan account we’re always ordering i’m upset recent contact amazon bought amazontower year ago can’t use it’s obsolete asked anything got product obsolete won’t work anymore yet bought last fair keep buying new amazon music device people need upgrade thinkit’s disgusting tower cost £ last year come radio argo £ that’s last year yet thinkit’s acceptable sell music device donot last seriously buy amazon music device go argo get one last,0.9998180394691952,0.00018196053080477004,0.09085810431856421,0.2,0.3182626011291152,31.82626011291152,Low Trust
Jacqueline Gibney,/users/5fa821fb342334001a063068,CA,2.0,2024-01-26 06:46:22+00:00,1.0,Amazon used to be amazing,"Amazon used to be amazing. Prime actually ment 1 day shipping on items that said one day shipping and 2 day on items that were 2 days. Several orders had arrived late and this has been all the way back to summer of this year. I don’t care about the music I use YouTube, I don’t watch a lot of shows so the free shows on prime are not why i have it. I got it for fast delivery. The thing is that now apparently they are raising there prices of prime. I don’t order enough for that even to be worth it as I have found other means of getting stuff through Instacart which arrives extremely fast. And Amazon doesn’t have the cheap deals anymore. Everything has gone up in price and if I can order Kirkland brand olive oil from Costco cheaper through Instacart I’m going to do that. As for clothes the prices are through the roof and with Temu it’s literally free delivery and half the price and same quality material. Guess what I ordered a dress from Amazon they took 3 months to get. I order 1 from Temu and it’s cheaper and took 14 days actually 12 it was early.  Also you can’t use Amazon gift cards anymore to purchase digital stuff. That’s my main source for games and sometimes the game has a booster pack that is a digital code. Some games also come only in digital. If they were fast at delivery like they used to be I of course would be fine with a physical game. But no I literally never got my game and had to cancel it. I got a refund yes but if I could buy the digital code I’d be playing it sooner. Shame on you Amazon.",2024-01-24 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,26.0,1530,300,25,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon used amazing prime actually ment day shipping item said one day shipping day item day several order arrived late way back summer year don’t care music use youtube don’t watch lot show free show prime got fast delivery thing apparently raising price prime don’t order enough even worth found mean getting stuff instacart arrives extremely fast amazon doesn’t cheap deal anymore everything gone price order kirkland brand olive oil costco cheaper instacart i’m going clothes price roof temu it’s literally free delivery half price quality material guess ordered dress amazon took month get order temu it’s cheaper took day actually early also can’t use amazon gift card anymore purchase digital stuff that’s main source game sometimes game booster pack digital code game also come digital fast delivery like used course would fine physical game literally never got game cancel got refund yes could buy digital code i’d playing sooner shame amazon,0.005675266443144804,0.9943247335568552,0.16825574873808188,0.2,0.830813516526044,83.0813516526044,High Trust
Theresa Swaby,/users/596392580000ff000aad92ef,GB,32.0,2024-01-26 01:38:54+00:00,1.0,VERY DISAPPOINTED,"This is So Disappointing for such a very Large Company as Amazon, order items on the 15th January, the order was cancelled, but still arrived for delivery, the delivery Guy couldn’t understand a word of English, I couldn’t understand him an he couldn’t understand me….!!!! He had a phone that was translating what I was trying to say into English,,, l finally he understood, I waited 7 days for a response No response of able to return funds back to account, I have Now been waiting 11DAYS ONLY TO BE TOLD THAT THE REFUND WAS STUCK…. Why ? Admin could not give me a reason why this happened, Now Having to WAIT ANOTHER 5-7 days……. Amazon you used to be an excellent company and service WHAT HAPPENED..!!! Have you made so much money that now you treat your customers without any respect…. Once this is resolved it Ever am Done been a long loyalty-customer, I will take my money somewhere else further",2024-01-25 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,26.0,900,162,17,2,1.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,disappointing large company amazon order item th january order cancelled still arrived delivery delivery guy couldn’t understand word english couldn’t understand couldn’t understand me… phone translating trying say english l finally understood waited day response response able return fund back account waiting day told refund stuck… admin could give reason happened wait another days…… amazon used excellent company service happened made much money treat customer without respect… resolved ever done long loyaltycustomer take money somewhere else,0.9996032615825855,0.00039673841741449944,0.09085810431856421,0.2,0.31836999007242006,31.836999007242007,Low Trust
