Plamen Simeonov,/users/640b13ec974b9c0012e33f4b,GB,2.0,2024-01-23 17:26:23+00:00,1.0,Shipment lost or stolen by supplier...,"Greetings. We put our trust in Amazon, but they let us down a lot. We had ordered a laptop and it did not arrive. They sent us a message that we received it, but we didn't. I was at home waiting for him all day and even a few days after that. They didn't send us a security code either. We did our best to talk to them, but we didn't have any understanding or cooperation from them. They said the problem could not be resolved and repeatedly rejected our attempts to talk to them... The purchase was quite expensive and we lost it. I recommend not to trust this company....We were very disappointed and lost a lot....",2024-01-23 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,23.0,617,118,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,greeting put trust amazon let u lot ordered laptop arrive sent u message received didnt home waiting day even day didnt send u security code either best talk didnt understanding cooperation said problem could resolved repeatedly rejected attempt talk purchase quite expensive lost recommend trust companywe disappointed lost lot,0.013079354245412799,0.9869206457545872,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.8066964417780227,80.66964417780227,High Trust
