Martin Hind,/users/65aa64b8fcd2f40012d9d856,GB,1.0,2024-01-19 14:02:08+00:00,1.0,What is going on!?,"what on God’s (or any other etherial being’s) green earth is going on!Since the 21st of December I have not had a single delivery on time.I hold a business account and have spent in excess of £25,000 with you in the past 36 months.I have spent numerous hours of my time on your live chat, over an hour on the phone last night with the “management team” who, quite frankly it would appear cannot manage to put their underwear on the correct way round!I was assured by a representative last night that the order that was due for delivery on Tuesday would be delivered without fail today.But the order has been marked as “delayed in transit” and has been like that since 6am.Some of the items ordered are crucial for the running of my business, you are costing me money every time you mess up.For a logistics company you really have let yourself down over the past 4 weeks.I also requested a copy of the telephone call, of which I am within my legal rights to do. And the representative just repeated that the order would be delivered today.I have now been given a date of Monday 22nd. 1 week after ordering with your “guaranteed next day delivery”.I have actually worked out that I could walk to your head office in Manchester and back again in the time it’s taken you to NOT deliver the item from 5 miles away.Absolute shambles, total disgrace.The only reason I have ever used the Amazon for online shopping is the guaranteeed delivery time. What’s the point?Any Local business want my money?Will need to provide office supplies, hand tools, computer equipment and the odd car part that is backorder from our usual suppliers.",2024-01-16 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,19.0,1624,288,18,4,3.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,god’s etherial being’s green earth going onsince st december single delivery timei hold business account spent excess £ past monthsi spent numerous hour time live chat hour phone last night “management team” quite frankly would appear cannot manage put underwear correct way roundi assured representative last night order due delivery tuesday would delivered without fail todaybut order marked “delayed transit” like since amsome item ordered crucial running business costing money every time mess upfor logistics company really let past weeksi also requested copy telephone call within legal right representative repeated order would delivered todayi given date monday nd week ordering “guaranteed next day delivery”i actually worked could walk head office manchester back time it’s taken deliver item mile awayabsolute shamble total disgracethe reason ever used amazon online shopping guaranteeed delivery time what’s pointany local business want moneywill need provide office supply hand tool computer equipment odd car part backorder usual supplier,0.09302404441497844,0.9069759555850215,0.16152551878855861,0.2,0.7857930815502224,78.57930815502225,High Trust
