Stephen Griffin Griff,/users/607f081b473f8d0019f2d1cb,IE,4.0,2024-01-17 22:27:20+00:00,1.0,Absolute ridiculous and shouldn't be legal,"What an absolute sham of a company when it comes to customer service! I added a new card to my account then bought a gift card to send to a friend, said order successful and I received the confirmation email. Immediately got locked out of my account due to suspicious activity on my account. There is absolutely no way to contact customer service, it just redirects you to the login page over and over. No options whatsoever of any phone numbers to call customer service. I even tried downloading the app, tried signing in but couldn't, was asked by the app to call customer service  number which was an invalid number. Going round and round in circles and getting nowhere. How is this even legal? They let you add your credit/debit card which you then confirm your card with your bank and then amazon block your account once you try to use your own already verified card? W.T.F! And seriously, trustpilot? How the hell is W.T.F without the dots inappropriate language?",2024-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,17.0,969,171,42,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,absolute sham company come customer service added new card account bought gift card send friend said order successful received confirmation email immediately got locked account due suspicious activity account absolutely way contact customer service redirects login page option whatsoever phone number call customer service even tried downloading app tried signing couldnt asked app call customer service number invalid number going round round circle getting nowhere even legal let add creditdebit card confirm card bank amazon block account try use already verified card wtf seriously trustpilot hell wtf without dot inappropriate language,0.20409470397668492,0.7959052960233151,0.09590577678070668,0.2,0.7171338033677989,71.71338033677989,Medium Trust
Steven McCullough,/users/5538b54a0000ff0001ba3e12,GB,16.0,2024-01-17 17:44:10+00:00,1.0,We couldn't give an Air Fryer,"In this day and age is it really that difficult to deliver a product when you say you will? No worries I'll make it easier for you and you can deliver it to my home address, Wait for it! Here comes that classic hit from the customer service team ""All the things we can't do"" To the ""customer service director"" can I suggest a new direction of travel or change your title to the ""No Can't Director"" as this seems to be the strategy you team are striving to achieve.",2024-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,17.0,464,90,29,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,day age really difficult deliver product say worry ill make easier deliver home address wait come classic hit customer service team thing cant customer service director suggest new direction travel change title cant director seems strategy team striving achieve,0.06984574101912534,0.9301542589808747,0.050476724621424565,0.2,0.7751724744147221,77.51724744147222,High Trust
piroskaraczgypsy,/users/596f81330000ff000ab1313e,US,19.0,2024-03-11 10:35:17+00:00,2.0,I've used Amazon since 2016,I've used Amazon since 2016. Through the years the merchandise and service was excellent. But recently Sellers have been dishonest regarding conditions of merchandise offered. Most recently a seller described an out of print Spanish textbook as LIKE NEW condition with no writing on pages. Upon receipt I went through entire book finding ten pages filled with penciled in answers on top and margins. Even some in pen. I immediately took photos of everything and returned for refund. Most recently since last week I bought a Book and six cassette Greek course...described as having just a few loose pages. Upon unwrapping the book an entire section in one piece of 65 PAGES fell out of the book onto my lap. Now both the seller and Amazon are refusing a partial refund (for book) cassettes are good. I was left with no recourse but to register complaint with the credit card itself.... hopefully with positive outcome for me. And I agree with other commenters regarding customer service phone calls.....they're based out of the USA with accents I can barely understand their English. WTH. Shame on Amazon AND their SellersUPDATE: The situation with seller sending me damaged overpriced goods. My creditor awarded full reimbursement. ,2024-01-16 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,11.0,1232,202,27,5,55.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ive used amazon since year merchandise service excellent recently seller dishonest regarding condition merchandise offered recently seller described print spanish textbook like new condition writing page upon receipt went entire book finding ten page filled penciled answer top margin even pen immediately took photo everything returned refund recently since last week bought book six cassette greek coursedescribed loose page upon unwrapping book entire section one piece page fell book onto lap seller amazon refusing partial refund book cassette good left recourse register complaint credit card hopefully positive outcome agree commenters regarding customer service phone callstheyre based usa accent barely understand english wth shame amazon sellersupdate situation seller sending damaged overpriced good creditor awarded full reimbursement,0.008166987490562043,0.991833012509438,0.11329220415030847,0.4,1.1185749470847806,111.85749470847806,High Trust
Marco Ilario,/users/61ffe9165cd84a0012db3b6e,IT,9.0,2024-01-17 14:48:34+00:00,1.0,"I bought a used screen labeled ""Like…","I bought a used screen labeled ""Like New,"" and it arrived without a power adapter and broken.I arranged for a return, and the courier NEVER came by. We scheduled it three times, I stayed at home for six full days, and they never showed up.The chat operators barely speak Italian, and the ones on the phone hung up on me twice.I don't know what to do.I will never buy from Amazon.it again",2024-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,17.0,387,72,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought used screen labeled like new arrived without power adapter brokeni arranged return courier never came scheduled three time stayed home six full day never showed upthe chat operator barely speak italian one phone hung twicei dont know doi never buy amazonit,0.019445976355612824,0.9805540236443872,0.040381379697139654,0.2,0.7983532877616215,79.83532877616216,High Trust
Adrian,/users/6102823692c194001343788c,NL,4.0,2024-01-17 14:09:57+00:00,1.0,Absolutely worthless customer 'service',"Absolutely worthless customer 'service'.I carefully checked online before registering, and was told I could pay by bank transfer. Once registering, it proved impossible to pay with anything but a credit card. I wrote them, explaining very well the problem. I then received a standard reply asking me to elaborate. There being nothing to add, I replied to the mail, and then received one saying I was not able to respond to the one I had received.I thought Amazon might be a good way to boost my sales, but it already being a nightmare before even getting started, I will not use Amazon at all, and, not that they will lose any sleep over it, they have now also lost me as a customer.",2024-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,17.0,683,123,39,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolutely worthless customer servicei carefully checked online registering told could pay bank transfer registering proved impossible pay anything credit card wrote explaining well problem received standard reply asking elaborate nothing add replied mail received one saying able respond one receivedi thought amazon might good way boost sale already nightmare even getting started use amazon lose sleep also lost customer,0.03113189052329523,0.9688681094767048,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.7982310261348751,79.8231026134875,High Trust
