Customer Tony Betts,/users/4dd268190000640001087bc0,GB,78.0,2024-01-15 10:39:58+00:00,1.0,Be very careful and read the small print before signing up!,"You need to be very careful, and certainly read all the very small print. I’m a pensioner and full time carer for my very frail wife who is currently in hospital. I’m not therefore necessarily what you might say on the ball, or a bit vulnerable!When receiving an Amazon email saying that I had unused facilities on my Amazon Alexa which was FREE, I thought I would take aloo. It turns out that it was music and that I could download the app. On doing so it turns out that it is in fact only FREE for the first 30 day. After that you will get charged circa £11.00 unless you cancel it! With everything I’m trying to currently juggle in my life and that of my dear wife, I really don’t need this type of money grabbing nonsense.",2024-01-15 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,15.0,726,139,59,11,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,need careful certainly read small print i’m pensioner full time carer frail wife currently hospital i’m therefore necessarily might say ball bit vulnerablewhen receiving amazon email saying unused facility amazon alexa free thought would take aloo turn music could download app turn fact free first day get charged circa £ unless cancel everything i’m trying currently juggle life dear wife really don’t need type money grabbing nonsense,0.6657479948064478,0.33425200519355225,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.4827177019798384,48.27177019798384,Low Trust
Dean,/users/622b72d41fa4c80012a57735,GB,5.0,2024-01-15 08:56:07+00:00,1.0,0 % customer service,"Amazon used to be so good customer service when they first started, to convince the world they was the way forward,.Now i cancelled an order straight away...so was surprised  to see when i checked status it was out for delivery 2 days layer ..the person i spoke to told me it was a computer error,  she could see it on the internet tracking on there end..however as its out for delivery we can do nothing ...wait for it send it back minus the postage and packiging,  first week after christmas and my £70  sitting there account for 2 weeks, then would of been £55 by the time i got it back ..for a mistake there end.Bring back the shops !!",2024-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,15.0,639,120,20,4,11.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,amazon used good customer service first started convince world way forwardnow cancelled order straight awayso surprised see checked status delivery day layer person spoke told computer error could see internet tracking endhowever delivery nothing wait send back minus postage packiging first week christmas £ sitting account week would £ time got back mistake endbring back shop,0.15116040426949423,0.8488395957305057,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.7378802577642994,73.78802577642995,Medium Trust
Lisa Rhoades,/users/5adf8c344de5666d344abc91,US,31.0,2024-01-15 04:18:27+00:00,1.0,Again updating a request to Bezos and…,"Again updating a request to Bezos and Amazon prime.Why isn't there a discount for people receiving SSDI or SSI seniors?We are NOT on Snap or do not get food stamps.But we are barely getting by.What that isn't poor enough for you.  We could qualify for benefits but will not until needed.  Not everyone can afford mansions.Most of us are living month to month.We have gotten 2 COLA raises that were way over due.  And what happens?  Everyone jacks up prices yet again.  Our trash company went from $84 to $136 every 3 months.  We in my town can not pick a different company since the City decided one company for us.  So the have free  will on what we pay.  The cost of living is $2300 a person I get $800 plus on SSDI.  My husband $1200 plus $2000 for retirement.  Our house payment went from $850 to almost $2000 a month. He spends out of pocket $400 on PT 8 times a month. Insurance doesn't cover Holistic treatments.Our CCs are still maxed since attorney in his car accident didn't apply all medical cost to settlement.OOPS too late now.  And took almost half of his settlement for payments. But yet he has life long medical issues.  Couldn't sue a 22 yr old that has nothing or his friend who owned the truck that hit my husband,  Had what is required for insurance in my state.  Which is basic coverage.  We can't downsize since rent is more than we're paying for house payment.We can't borrow against house since we did that to take care of MIL for 15 yrs. So we are looking to move out of state.  We have no equity anymore in house.  And will be lucky to get $50,000.But we can't get a discount on Amazon for seniors or disabled????  Come on Bezo's your yacht is bigger than our house and lot.  And your online CS is all people outside the USA so they have NO clue about disability.We also have to pay for extra insurance because government insurance is rotten.  We pay almost $400 between us for government required insurance and almost $1500 more out of pocket.  We're both ill and disabled. My husband is diabetic and has traumatic brain injury and back and neck, leg foot and more injuries. I have life threatening allergies to  almost all antibiotics and foods and environmental , fibromyalgia, chronic fatigue asthma, knee, neck and back injuries from work injury. And also 3 brain injuries as a child.  I think we deserve a discount more than most getting free rides of the government.I get Amazon several times a month.  Since Walmart is out of stock and getting too costly.HELP us all on SSDI or seniors who are drowning.",2024-01-14 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,15.0,2537,457,38,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,updating request bezos amazon primewhy isnt discount people receiving ssdi ssi seniorswe snap get food stampsbut barely getting bywhat isnt poor enough could qualify benefit needed everyone afford mansionsmost u living month monthwe gotten cola raise way due happens everyone jack price yet trash company went every month town pick different company since city decided one company u free pay cost living person get plus ssdi husband plus retirement house payment went almost month spends pocket pt time month insurance doesnt cover holistic treatmentsour cc still maxed since attorney car accident didnt apply medical cost settlementoops late took almost half settlement payment yet life long medical issue couldnt sue yr old nothing friend owned truck hit husband required insurance state basic coverage cant downsize since rent paying house paymentwe cant borrow house since take care mil yr looking move state equity anymore house lucky get cant get discount amazon senior disabled come bezos yacht bigger house lot online c people outside usa clue disabilitywe also pay extra insurance government insurance rotten pay almost u government required insurance almost pocket ill disabled husband diabetic traumatic brain injury back neck leg foot injury life thr