Christian,/users/53df7e56000064000182984e,GB,21.0,2024-01-12 13:06:37+00:00,1.0,Awful company. Do better,"Awful company. Ordered an iPad through Amazon prime which was due to arrive on the 22nd December in time for Christmas. On the day of delivery the parcels were out for delivery and then suddenly marked as being unable to deliver. After ordering thousands of pounds worth of stuff from Amazon in the past, they have never once had an issue finding the address. This started raising concern. The item then returned to the depot around 2330 that evening and was marked to be out for delivery the following day. The following day the supposed item was delivered and one time passcode given but instead of a package containing an iPad, it was a children’s book. The iPad had clearly been stolen and the label showed obvious signs of being swapped. Pictures were taken of the driver handing the parcel over along with evidence that the label was tampered with and the incorrect item was received. A complaint was officially logged with Amazon who said they’ll look into it. Pictures were sent to give the required evidence they asked for the same day (23rd December) but nothing was done about it still and they keep saying to “contact them again in a few days” every time we try to contact their customer services. I had to go out on the 23rd December to try and buy the gifted iPad elsewhere (from Currys, an actual store) and told Amazon this which is further proof we didn’t receive the iPad from them but they still delay and don’t offer any solution.",2023-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,12.0,1450,259,24,4,21.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,awful company ordered ipad amazon prime due arrive nd december time christmas day delivery parcel delivery suddenly marked unable deliver ordering thousand pound worth stuff amazon past never issue finding address started raising concern item returned depot around evening marked delivery following day following day supposed item delivered one time passcode given instead package containing ipad children’s book ipad clearly stolen label showed obvious sign swapped picture taken driver handing parcel along evidence label tampered incorrect item received complaint officially logged amazon said they’ll look picture sent give required evidence asked day rd december nothing done still keep saying “contact days” every time try contact customer service go rd december try buy gifted ipad elsewhere curry actual store told amazon proof didn’t receive ipad still delay don’t offer solution,0.009959269943784148,0.9900407300562158,0.14526079641054404,0.2,0.8240725243102167,82.40725243102167,High Trust
Michael Ackers,/users/5ea843d084263117be1fd270,GB,16.0,2024-01-12 12:40:18+00:00,1.0,If I could give them 0 stars I would,"If I could give them 0 stars I would. Why is 1 the minimum?I ordered an item on 21 Dec, 2023, for delivery on 27 Dec. I stayed in all day even though DPD gave me an hour window. I eventually got a message to say they had tried to deliver but I wasn't home. When I complained to DPD they said they had a picture and couldn't talk to me because their delivery contract was with Amazon and not me. Amazon told me to talk to DPD. Cancelled the order. on 27 December, which was accepted and they've now delivered it on 12 Jan, 2024! What's more, the item I ordered was not what was delivered.So I can't send it back for a refund, because what was delivered never came from Amazon, but some company in London. So Amazon will not see it as what they apparently sent out.Took me half an hour to get to speak to someone, their AI Bot system just wound me up even more, eventually got through and they were as much use as a chocolate teapot.Upshot is I have something I didn't order and am out of pocket.",2024-01-12 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,12.0,994,195,36,9,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,could give star would minimumi ordered item dec delivery dec stayed day even though dpd gave hour window eventually got message say tried deliver wasnt home complained dpd said picture couldnt talk delivery contract amazon amazon told talk dpd cancelled order december accepted theyve delivered jan whats item ordered deliveredso cant send back refund delivered never came amazon company london amazon see apparently sent outtook half hour get speak someone ai bot system wound even eventually got much use chocolate teapotupshot something didnt order pocket,0.04230738852451744,0.9576926114754826,0.10936623667975323,0.2,0.8007195530736919,80.0719553073692,High Trust
