Janet Erlam,/users/65731a47087b6700125c1303,GB,17.0,2024-01-08 14:46:44+00:00,1.0,Delivery Driver Dumping deliveries anywhere,". I ordered the above and on the delivery date I checked outside my house and delivery boxes there was no delivery.I went to my email  it claimed that the delivery had been made and left at reception. As I have no reception I live in a house. I presumed the delivery must have been delivered somewhere wrongly. I once again contacted you because this kind of delivery is ongoing. Parcels are left anywhere despite clear instructions to use the delivery box right by the door,Deliveries have been left in bins, some on bin collection days. Some on the step some behind things in the garden. If you buy from Amazon you are tied into a game of hide and seek and if this is the case there should be a price reduction. If I want to play games I can play with my Grandson. Ex[pensive or electrical items have been left outside to the elements. I have reported it and reported it so many times and still this driver is doing the same things. All my deliveries are at risk of theft or damage.This morning I went to look if the parcel had been dumped. I found the receptionist a Scarecrow at the end of the garden, The driver had dumped the package right at the far end of the garden with my Grandsons Scarecow, It had been out there in the wet. That is something else he does leaves stuff in the rain. This person is delusional if he calls a scarecrow a receptionist. This is Amazon Prime too. I have photographs of all this",2024-01-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,8.0,1416,267,43,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered delivery date checked outside house delivery box deliveryi went email claimed delivery made left reception reception live house presumed delivery must delivered somewhere wrongly contacted kind delivery ongoing parcel left anywhere despite clear instruction use delivery box right doordeliveries left bin bin collection day step behind thing garden buy amazon tied game hi