Leo Varghese,/users/659bc20b4d2598001201654f,NL,1.0,2024-01-08 11:36:21+00:00,1.0,Do not buy phones from Amazon,"I ordered an IPhone 15 pro from Amazon Netherlands (sold by Amazon NL) several days ago but still haven’t received my phone despite paying the full price for the phone. I pay for Amazon “Prime membership” and expect the products to be delivered quicker. Unfortunately, I have still not received my phone after so many days and the Orders page shows status my order as “Undeliverable”. The phone is shown as “in stock” on the Amazon website so I am not sure why it can’t be sent to me. I don’t want a refund. I just want the phone to be sent to me since I paid for it, and it is said to be “in stock” at Amazon. I contacted Amazon helpdesk last week, but I still have no clear indication if I will get the phone. I am very disappointed and find Amazon a very unreliable site for ordering expensive products like iPhone. I recommend using a more reliable shop and save yourself a lot of trouble. Also the “Prime membership” is a bit of a farce in reality.",2024-01-08 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,8.0,953,181,29,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered iphone pro amazon netherlands sold amazon nl several day ago still haven’t received phone despite paying full price phone pay amazon “prime membership” expect product delivered quicker unfortunately still received phone many day order page show status order “undeliverable” phone shown “in stock” amazon website sure can’t sent don’t want refund want phone sent since paid said “in stock” amazon contacted amazon helpdesk last week still clear indication get phone disappointed find amazon unreliable site ordering expensive product like iphone recommend using reliable shop save lot trouble also “prime membership” bit farce reality,0.011120236897753216,0.9888797631022468,0.10151430173864273,0.2,0.8147427418988519,81.4742741898852,High Trust
Unhappy W. Amazon,/users/659b41ce4d25980012012a25,US,1.0,2024-01-08 02:29:20+00:00,1.0,Amazon Anything-but-Prime,"Once again, the prime delivery day changed between selecting my products and paying for them, and once again they FAILED to honor the later delivery date. “PRIME” should be called “MEDIOCRE” (at best) and if everyone did like I have done and continually reduce the amount purchased on Amazon, maybe they would care enough to make it better. Instead of “continuous process improvement” they appear to employ “continuous process destruction” and their customer service has become a joke.",2024-01-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,8.0,485,78,25,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime delivery day changed selecting product paying failed honor later delivery date “prime” called “mediocre” best everyone like done continually reduce amount purchased amazon maybe would care enough make better instead “continuous process improvement” appear employ “continuous process destruction” customer service become joke,0.026290963965664715,0.9737090360343352,0.04374649467190129,0.2,0.7956038169515478,79.56038169515477,High Trust
Gary,/users/625ce46057bf130012467ec6,US,4.0,2024-01-08 01:40:36+00:00,1.0,Use a reliable company.,"A Pakistani coat company uses them for shipping. The tracking is always incomplete. The latest tracking info said the package went to Dallas where there was no notification for a week. Then suddenly there was a notification,  (not to me, I had to look up their site and put in the shipment number provided by the seller) it said the package was lost while returning it to the seller. Why were they returning my package to Pakistan??? Why didn't they deliver it to me. Did one of their employees steal it or deliver it to the wrong address or load it into the wrong truck? How do they ""lose"" a package and not have it turn up somewhere? This sounds like the worst shipping company in the world.",2023-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,8.0,693,128,23,4,12.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,pakistani coat company us shipping tracking always incomplete latest tracking info said package went dallas notification week suddenly notification look site put shipment number provided seller said package lost returning seller returning package pakistan didnt deliver one employee steal deliver wrong address load wrong truck lose package turn somewhere sound like worst shipping company world,0.026805666327952463,0.9731943336720476,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.8009549907283401,80.095499072834,High Trust
Nadav Cohen,/users/5e93615e708bf815cbf1dc71,IL,12.0,2024-01-07 23:32:01+00:00,1.0,Poor customer support,"I recently experienced an issue with Amazon.es customer service that I feel compelled to share. I had requested a phone call for assistance while logged into my Amazon account. During this call, the representative, Jasper (07 Jan 2024, 22:31 Madrid time), attempted to verify my identity. Despite providing my order number, name, email, and even the billing address of my last delivery, they were unable to confirm my identity. This was perplexing, especially since the call was made to the phone number registered with my Amazon account.Furthermore, Jasper's attitude throughout the interaction was notably unprofessional. He demonstrated a lack of patience and courtesy, which only added to the frustration of the situation. I am disappointed with the level of service provided and hope that this feedback can lead to improvements in the future. Customer service is a vital aspect of any business, and in this instance, it was unsatisfactory.",2024-01-07 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,7.0,944,149,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently experienced issue amazones customer service feel compelled share requested phone call assistance logged amazon account call representative jasper jan madrid time attempted verify identity despite providing order number name email even billing address last delivery unable confirm identity perplexing especially since call made phone number registered amazon accountfurthermore jasper attitude throughout interaction notably unprofessional demonstrated lack patience courtesy added frustration situation disappointed level service provided hope feedback lead improvement future customer service vital aspect business instance unsatisfactory,0.020531987196418775,0.9794680128035812,0.08356702187324734,0.2,0.8064474107764401,80.64474107764401,High Trust
