Mark Dunsford,/users/635397a7284a1600129e9f9b,GB,2.0,2024-01-06 18:45:12+00:00,1.0,They're so bad it's hard to know where to start,"It's hard to know where to start because there is now so much wrong with this company's services.Having been an Amazon Prime customer for well over a decade I have seen a lot of changes but recently the service has gone downhill to the point that I will not be renewing my subscription when it next expires.Particular issues that I've experiences are:1. Fake products - There are now a large number of cheap/dangerous knockoff products on amazon and it is impossible to tell from the listings which are genuine and which are the fakes.2. Reviews - The review system is broken and now so full of fake and even fraudulent reviews it has lost all meaning. Basic tricks like aggregating reviews for several products or even switching reviews over to a completely different product are common and no attempt seems to be made to stop this practice.3. Prime Delivery - This increased significantly in price and whereas once next day delivery was the norm, the minimum I am now quoted is 3 to 5 days with most items not even despatching for a couple of days after the order - as bad as the free delivery for non-prime members. It is not unusual for items to take two to three weeks to arrive despite paying the Prime premium.I am also seeing a lot of instances where the item goes to ""collected by courier"" status very quickly preventing order cancellation but no further movement or valid training information appears for several days suggesting that the item has probably not actually been despatched and that status change was just to stop me cancelling when I discover the delay.4. Prime Video - This was always a bit of a rip-off with most items incurring an extra charge on top of prime membership but the latest change forces you to pay an extra subscription on top of the already expensive Prime membership to get the add free viewing I got for free up until now.5. Prime music - this is another service that has been deliberately made almost unusable unless you want to pay yet another addition subscription on top.6. Customer services - All contact is via chat or phone, not email, so hard to make formal complaints or keep a paper trail. Although occasionally helpful, most of the time they merely read information to you that you can already see on the website and promises of action are rarely followed through.I have, at one point or another raised all of these issues with Amazon customer services only to be met with responses that ranged from complete indifference to promises to pass on my concerns which clearly went no further because nothing changed.In short, other than the convenience of having so many items in one place there is little to commend this company any more. Amazon Prime in particular is most definitely no longer worth the money.",2024-01-06 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,6.0,2759,483,47,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,hard know start much wrong company serviceshaving amazon prime customer well decade seen lot change recently service gone downhill point renewing subscription next expiresparticular issue ive experience fake product large number cheapdangerous knockoff product amazon impossible tell listing genuine fake review review system broken full fake even fraudulent review lost meaning basic trick like aggregating review several product even switching review completely different product common attempt seems made stop practice prime delivery increased significantly price whereas next day delivery norm minimum quoted day item even despatching couple day order bad free delivery nonprime member unusual item take two three week arrive despite paying prime premiumi also seeing lot instance item go collected courier status quickly preventing order cancellation movement valid training information appears several day suggesting item probably actually despatched status change stop cancelling discover delay prime video always bit ripoff item incurring extra charge top prime membership latest change force pay extra subscription top already expensive prime membership get add free viewing got free prime music another service deliberately made almost unusable unless want pay yet another addition subscription top customer service contact via chat phone email hard make formal complaint keep paper trail although occasionally helpful time merely read information already see website promise action rarely followed throughi one point another raised issue amazon customer service met response ranged complete indifference promise pas concern clearly went nothing changedin short convenience many item one place little commend company amazon prime particular definitely longer worth money,0.0022098671293965966,0.9977901328706034,0.27089175546831185,0.2,0.853073417528964,85.3073417528964,High Trust
