Joey Misquita,/users/61d7567e03f66e0012590bf4,GB,6.0,2024-01-06 16:14:22+00:00,1.0,"THE TIN OF PAINT ARRIVED BADLY DENTED ON BOTH SIDES, INCLUDING THE LID!","I have never used the company, Lightning and Mobile Accessories UK, before and will never ever use this company again. This order was through Amazon! The can of paint arrived badly dented on both sides, including the lid which was dented and covered untidily in cellotape. It is totally unacceptable for this Amazon order to have arrived in such a bad state and, even though I eventually received a refund, I am totally unhappy with the whole experience as I intended to paint a freestanding bathroom shelving unit, which I made myself from scratch, and give it as a Christmas present to a family member. Unfortunately, the badly damaged tin of paint only arrived on 23rd December! I am never using this company again. I naively did not look at the company that was providing the paint and with a name like Lightning and Mobile Accessories UK, I am not surprised. Companies like these should not deal in products outside their range and, in addition to including all the above, I stressed this point to Amazon in my review feedback to them. However, Amazon wrote back to me saying that they could not post my review, which now needs to be edited, because it focuses on one or more of these topics and not the product:SellersDeliveryPackagingPricingAvailabilityMake of this what you will. I give up!",2023-12-23 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,6.0,1298,224,71,13,14.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,never used company lightning mobile accessory uk never ever use company order amazon paint arrived badly dented side including lid dented covered untidily cellotape totally unacceptable amazon order arrived bad state even though eventually received refund totally unhappy whole experience intended paint freestanding bathroom shelving unit made scratch give christmas present family member unfortunately badly damaged tin paint arrived rd december never using compa