Ashish Thapa,/users/61ee6d0b32091a00126dfb1f,AU,3.0,2024-01-06 12:12:02+00:00,1.0,As a prime member,"As a prime member, I have been using Amazon services in India and overseas for a long time. But the recent incident made me rethink regarding availing the services again. Recently, during my vacation in Noida India, I requested a refund for my order. Consequently, there was a pick up of the delivered product, but the pick man was very rude and acted like a local goon. He came 2 times for pickup. On the first visit, he misguided me and told me that the product he had come to pick up was of a different color by showing one of the different color product pictures. The second time, when I asked him why he misguided me, he became quite rude and started abusing me in front of my house and was not ready to leave the property despite repeated instructions by me to leave the property. I have CCTV footage regarding the incident. I hope Amazon will take steps accordingly as the only automated reply I got from their customer service and the head team is that 'you are our precious customer and they will take strong action against the pickup agent', but until now there has been no action and when I asked them about the status they told me that it is an internal matter which shows how serious they are regarding the incident and don't care about the customer. I am planning to go legal and also posting the CCTV footage on the internet to aware the other customers regarding this rowdy pick up agent.",2023-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,6.0,1404,259,17,4,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,prime member using amazon service india overseas long time recent incident made rethink regarding availing service recently vacation noida india requested refund order consequently pick delivered product pick man rude acted like local goon came time pickup first visit misguided told product come pick different color showing one different color product picture second time asked misguided became quite rude started abusing front house ready leave property despite repeated instruction leave property cctv footage regarding incident hope amazon take step accordingly automated reply got customer service head team precious customer take strong action pickup agent action asked status told internal matter show serious regarding incident dont care customer planning go legal also posting cctv footage internet aware customer regarding rowdy pick agent,0.009487296054727581,0.9905127039452725,0.14526079641054404,0.2,0.824308511254745,82.4308511254745,High Trust
