Amy Collins,/users/6362560576888300121c473a,US,3.0,2024-01-05 14:13:48+00:00,1.0,We ordered an Amazon Fire 10 Kids…,"We ordered an Amazon Fire 10 Kids tablet on November 18 for a Christmas gift for our grandson.  We had the item shipped directly to them.  When they opened on Christmas Day and charged it, a red line was across the screen.  We contacted Amazon to get a replacement but we were told we could only return it and reorder.  The price had jumped up over $60 dollars from what we paid.  I asked to speak with a manager and the best he could do is to have us return the tablet and get a refund plus $30 gift card.  This tablet was purchased new, not third party and while the Amazon website says 2 year hassle free warranty, this was all but hassle free!The manager explained that he could not exchange the damaged product because it’s very popular-I am furious and will think twice about purchasing anything through Amazon.",2023-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,5.0,817,150,34,7,9.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered amazon fire kid tablet november christmas gift grandson item shipped directly opened christmas day charged red line across screen contacted amazon get replacement told could return reorder price jumped dollar paid asked speak manager best could u return tablet get refund plus gift card tablet purchased new third party amazon website say year hassle free warranty hassle freethe manager explained could exchange damaged product it’s populari furious think twice purchasing anything amazon,0.054717336905263925,0.9452826630947361,0.08412787436904094,0.2,0.7894669064211762,78.94669064211762,High Trust
