Nurul Afsar,/users/62ccfc8d09d9d60012da7fc2,GB,7.0,2024-01-05 05:51:39+00:00,1.0,Record your transaction with delivery driver,"I cannot believe this actually happened and I do not believe it was done by mistake. Instead of the meta quest 3 we received 2 boxes of cat food. I was given pass code to driver which kind of gives it away that it's an expensive product, so I don't know if the driver is the culprit. Straight away tried to contact amazon through the app which was not easy, after explaining the situation to a representative on the chat he said this time ups will collect the return and I will be refunded within 14 days. Not sure what to make of that! I had to reorder as its a birthday gift for my son. Again I received email that a pass code is required. I am now very worried same thing may happen. I will be recording once I hear a knock on the door and make the driver witness what's in the parcel this time. Wonder if anyone else has experienced anything like this",2024-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,5.0,855,167,44,6,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,cannot believe actually happened believe done mistake instead meta quest received box cat food given pas code driver kind give away expensive product dont know driver culprit straight away tried contact amazon app easy explaining situation representative chat said time ups collect return refunded within day sure make reorder birthday gift son received email pas code required worried thing may happen recording hear knock door make driver witness whats parcel time wonder anyone else experienced anything like,0.07968879002426307,0.9203112099757369,0.09366236679753225,0.2,0.7788880783473748,77.88880783473748,High Trust
Patricia Perkins,/users/65976f0bfab0030012fe62c9,US,1.0,2024-01-06 15:21:46+00:00,2.0,Let this be a lesson,Let this be a lesson. Amazon allowed a customer to put Two Bank of America Visa Debit cards on my account. 18 orders were placed and sent to my address. Not one customer service would listen to me and I tried to refuse the shipment. The next day it landed on my deck. BOA doesn't have me in the system but they say my name is on the BOA Debit card and I owe the money. These were not on my orders but transactions. Make sure you look at what cards they are putting in your account. They can add and take them out.,2024-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,6.0,513,104,20,5,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,let lesson amazon allowed customer put two bank america visa debit card account order placed sent address one customer service would listen tried refuse shipment next day landed deck boa doesnt system say name boa debit card owe money order transaction make sure look card putting account add take,0.01638971816667814,0.9836102818333219,0.05832865956253505,0.4,1.103470872829168,110.3470872829168,High Trust
LaMar Macklin II,/users/659763128d1a620011cbb993,US,1.0,2024-01-05 04:02:08+00:00,1.0,BUYER BEWARE AMAZON & Temu are one in the same,"I ordered Hoverboards for my grandchildren, the items were delivered and by all accounts had already been shipped out and recalled for safety reasons. I have exhausted all remedies thru Amazon, contact the vendor, which is not in business anymore and impossible to reach. I will be taking Amazon to small claims court? Please if you can avoid Amazon please do! It was formerly an honest business that really helped, but not anymore they are out for your money and could care less about you and I! Please be advised Amazon will sell you whatever and take NO RESPONSIBILITY even for safety recalls that were sent apparently but I saw the recall first yesterday. Shame on this billionaire corporation that cares nothing about our children safety or their customers in general! BUYER BEWARE! Go to Temu it’s cheaper than Amazon and you can trust them just as much, really cheap but really poor quality stuff but not always? Kind of like Amazon is now so why not?",2024-01-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,5.0,958,167,46,10,3.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,ordered hoverboards grandchild item delivered account already shipped recalled safety reason exhausted remedy thru amazon contact vendor business anymore impossible reach taking amazon small claim court please avoid amazon please formerly honest business really helped anymore money could care less please advised amazon sell whatever take responsibility even safety recall sent apparently saw recall first yesterday shame billionaire corporation care nothing child safety customer general buyer beware go temu it’s cheaper amazon trust much really cheap really poor quality stuff always kind like amazon,0.5989603534274757,0.40103964657252433,0.09366236679753225,0.2,0.5192522966457687,51.92522966457687,Medium Trust
