George Donald,/users/594517ec0000ff000aa4d10c,GB,171.0,2024-01-03 19:34:29+00:00,1.0,"HAD ENOUGH OF BEING ROBBED,","Feels pointless writing this as Amazon don't care!  Now they are trying to sneak in a rise of £2.99 on Prime Video which is a disgrace after the massive rise in price a couple if years ago.  Why if you care  don't you offer different levels e.g. people who don't need Prime Video but only want Prime for deliveries could pay less but no the only way is upwards, well I for one have had enough!!!",2024-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,3.0,395,76,27,5,0.0,0,4,3,1,Suspicious,feel pointless writing amazon dont care trying sneak rise £ prime video disgrace massive rise price couple year ago care dont offer different level eg people dont need prime video want prime delivery could pay less way upwards well one enough,0.9995682825340186,0.00043171746598136274,0.04262478968031408,0.2,0.3087408166690535,30.87408166690535,Low Trust
