Agent K,/users/58330d590000ff000a597463,GB,7.0,2024-01-03 18:19:27+00:00,1.0,Went downhill,"Since last years there were 3 price rises. Now u can't get anything same day if cost less than £20, you have to pay an extra £1.99. Then shortly the monthly price went up £1 and now they asking an extra £2.99 to watch anything ad free. I though customer service were fine until a recent experience when i've had to return a faulty product (faulty out of box) to a 3rd party seller. Regardless i was following the seller request how to return the product they were wasting my time close to 1 month to issue a refund. They were ending the chat without resolving the matter so we have gotten to the point when i told them i'll take them to court. Delivery drivers mostly leaving the parcels outside regardless we were home 90%. U still can buy good products but it is full of cheap chinese crap making it hard to get through the list of items. I genuinely thinking about cancelling my prime and rather waiting to submit all of my orders at once when it is above £20 altogether to get a free delivery, i am not interested to pay £6 more to get the same service like a year ago.",2024-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,3.0,1073,206,13,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,since last year price rise u cant get anything day cost less £ pay extra £ shortly monthly price went £ asking extra £ watch anything ad free though customer service fine recent experience ive return faulty product faulty box rd party seller regardless following seller request return product wasting time close month issue refund ending chat without resolving matter gotten point told ill take court delivery driver mostly leaving parcel outside regardless home u still buy good product full cheap chinese crap making hard get list item genuinely thinking cancelling prime rather waiting submit order £ altogether get free delivery interested pay £ get service like year ago,0.009994465230898935,0.990005534769101,0.1155356141334829,0.2,0.8181098902112471,81.81098902112471,High Trust
