Susan Frost,/users/5ded86bdae7758096eb9d068,GB,21.0,2024-01-03 18:13:25+00:00,1.0,A Cautionary Tale: Intellectual Property Theft on Amazon - Buyer Beware!,"Beware of sellers on Amazon, particularly those seemingly based in China, who have illicitly used my Registered Designs and images. Despite reporting this intellectual property theft to Amazon and providing them with all relevant registration numbers, the listings have not been removed. I had expected Amazon to promptly address instances of IP theft.Prior to making a purchase on Amazon, I strongly recommend conducting a reverse image search to verify the ownership of the images associated with the seller. No one wants to risk receiving a low-quality imitation from China. Exercise caution and ensure the authenticity of the products before proceeding with any transactions.Thank you for your attention and vigilance",2024-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,3.0,721,109,72,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,beware seller amazon particularly seemingly based china illicitly used registered design image despite reporting intellectual property theft amazon providing relevant registration number listing removed expected amazon promptly address instance ip theftprior making purchase amazon strongly recommend conducting reverse image search verify ownership image associated seller one want risk receiving lowquality imitation china exercise caution ensure authenticity product proceeding transactionsthank attention vigilance,0.02123729753350366,0.9787627024664963,0.061132922041503085,0.2,0.8016079356415488,80.16079356415487,High Trust
