TrueBlue,/users/5dea77feae7758a841b89a4e,US,8.0,2024-01-01 22:51:11+00:00,1.0,Buyer beware of digital gift cards,"You will be locked out of your Amazon account for supposed fraud by simply attempting to order any of their digital gift cards. Amazon is incapable of fulfilling these orders due to their failed “verification system” and helpless customer service agents. Even at the supervisor level there’s no human being who can override the system upon confirming with you on the phone that you’re in fact placing the order rather than a scammer. Amazon gives the appearance of great customer service by allowing you to speak with agents directly—agents who are trained to be pleasant and patient but given no access to fix any real issues. The software truly runs the company. I spent more than 3 hours speaking with 3 different departments trying to get back into my account and re-placing my order over and over. After two days of this, my order was canceled by their system repeatedly, my account is still frozen for any kind of digital order, and a family member also got locked out immediately for the same purchase. By comparison, we were able to purchase the gift cards (barely in time for Christmas) at a physical retailer quickly and with zero aggravation. Amazon lost $300+ of sales to a brick-and-mortar because their software is abysmal and their customer service impotent. Considering the constantly rising cost of the Prime subscription and the record profits Amazon reported during lockdowns this is all a cruel joke. We need to support what few local businesses are left before they too are eliminated by Amazon and their AI decides what gifts we’re allowed to buy.",2023-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,1.0,1569,266,34,6,10.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,locked amazon account supposed fraud simply attempting order digital gift card amazon incapable fulfilling order due failed “verification system” helpless customer service agent even supervisor level there’s human override system upon confirming phone you’re fact placing order rather scammer amazon give appearance great customer service allowing speak agent directly—agents trained pleasant patient given access fix real issue software truly run company spent hour speaking different department trying get back account replacing order two day order canceled system repeatedly account still frozen kind digital order family member also got locked immediately purchase comparison able purchase gift card barely time christmas physical retailer quickly zero aggravation amazon lost sale brickandmortar software abysmal customer service impotent considering constantly rising cost prime subscription record profit amazon reported lockdown cruel joke need support local business left eliminated amazon ai decides gift we’re allowed buy,0.0094324842536594,0.9905675157463406,0.14918676388109928,0.2,0.8251211106493902,82.51211106493902,High Trust
