SAM,/users/5c39f6951b96571d9875c0d3,GB,33.0,2024-01-01 11:37:12+00:00,1.0,Appalling customer service.,Appalling customer service.I have purchased from Amazon many many times and never had an issue. This said however on 12 December I ordered a large item (a chair/bed) which is something I have not done before. I needed the chair/bed for a guest visit and ordered it on 10 December. I was initially happy with the fast delivery date which was due to be 14 December. However despite the fact that Amazon claim to have attempted delivery in 14 December this attempt definitely didn’t not happen (I have an advanced security system which I had reviewed) when the chair eventually arrived with no notice in 18 December on a dark wet and windy evening it was left by my gate in the rain until I could get help to lift the very heavy boxes inside. Once inside it took hours to put the chair together with the poor and hard to follow instructions. Once installed it was apparent that the chair was of very poor quality and defective. I immediately reported the matter to amazon who quite frankly have been totally unhelpful. They have basically explained the item is from a ‘third party seller’ which apparently means they don’t really care!! I have always believed that items bought on the Amazon platform gave me some kind of protection but this is definitely not the case. I am now still arguing with the ‘third party seller’ with no help from Amazon. I have been informed that the seller sees no problem with the chair which quite frankly is alarming in itself. I have been told I need to return the chair in the original packaging (which I don’t Have as it arrived wet and damaged) and pay for a courier to collect it !! I have since discovered that previous reviews of the same chair are much of the same . Please read reviews before making any purchase these are often informative and an insight into the kind of company you are dealing with .,2023-12-10 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,1.0,1841,334,27,3,2