Lisa Marie,/users/625b14510d81f1001349cfab,US,2.0,2024-01-01 01:19:51+00:00,1.0,Amazon is a joke!,"Amazon is a joke!! Walmart beats you out ever since Bezos stepped down as CEO...this company is horrible now! I was prime member for years snd spent alot. Finally dropped my membership and only used membership for one month Christmas this year and only because Amazon has False advertising regarding shipping fees being free if order is over $35 like Walmart does. Amazon only has select items that qualify for their free shipping when not a prime member. Also, they used to care about customer and refunds on items of poor quality or broken but they don't care now especially if it is third party seller on their site! So...think I'll stick with Wal-Mart I get good customer service and they ship faster than Amazon...believe me I know even on common items I get in a day from Walmart but I was prime member four years and rarely got items same day ever. And usually Amazon takes 2 to three days on delivery. No excuse! And if you want right away as a member you pay a 2.99 fee when you are a member!",2023-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,1.0,1.0,1001,184,17,4,2.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,amazon joke walmart beat ever since bezos stepped ceothis company horrible prime member year snd spent alot finally dropped membership used membership one month christmas year amazon false advertising regarding shipping fee free order like walmart amazon select item qualify free shipping prime member also used care customer refund item poor quality broken dont care especially third party seller site sothink ill stick walmart get good customer service ship faster amazonbelieve know even common item get day walmart prime member four year rarely got item day ever usually amazon take three day delivery excuse want right away member pay fee member,0.9908990102727051,0.009100989727294895,0.10319685922602355,0.2,0.32518986670885214,32.51898667088521,Low Trust
