Gary,/users/658ef858f49a3a0012cb949e,US,2.0,2023-12-31 17:49:29+00:00,1.0,Amazon Customer Ambush,"The company representatives cannot identify me. A U.S. based company representative is no longer available. They will send me a confirmation email that I never receive, but I get others from them. They will send me a text message that I get but they don't receive the response, so now they will provide no service. I get charged twice for the same item which shows up as pending deducted from my account. I received an item that was a cheap representation of the brand product I ordered that came from Beijing with NO return or refund policy. I cannot close my account because I don't receive their confirmation email. There is no way to fix the new mess that they have recently created. Do yourself a favor and go back to ebay.",2023-11-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,31.0,728,132,22,3,46.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,company representative cannot identify u based company representative longer available send confirmation email never receive get others send text message get dont receive response provide service get charged twice item show pending deducted account received item cheap representation brand product ordered came beijing return refund policy cannot close account dont receive confirmation email way fix new mess recently created favor go back ebay,0.014243699478775379,0.9857563005212246,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.8076846561495635,80.76846561495636,High Trust
Robert Drake,/users/57f58a400000ff000a4adf4e,US,5.0,2023-12-31 03:53:40+00:00,1.0,The return process is a rip-off,"The return process is a rip-off! I bought something and it was much larger than expected.  I wanted to return it.  During the process, I had a couple of options, first print my own return label in which the charge was over 13 Dollars!  Expletive (I can't use bad language)! 13 Dollars to print your own return label!!! The second was just to drop it off for free at the UPS store.  I had used the latter method before and it took well over two months to get a partial refund.  I never got a full refund.  Calling the service center took such a long time on the phone with someone who barely spoke English. On my current return, they said it would take over a month to ""process"" the return!  Expelitive! In years past, I would get a refund once the item was scanned in at the UPS center.  Why are they holding my money for so long?!  I have been an Amazon shopper for years.  I think that in the future I  will be looking to other online retailers.",2023-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,31.0,947,181,31,6,6.0,0,9,1,0,Genuine,return process ripoff bought something much larger expected wanted return process couple option first print return label charge dollar expletive cant use bad language dollar print return label second drop free ups store used latter method took well two month get partial refund never got full refund calling service center took long time phone someone barely spoke english current return said would take month process return expelitive year past would get refund item scanned ups center holding money long amazon shopper year think future looking online retailer,0.9998009561502523,0.00019904384974767098,0.10151430173864273,0.2,0.32040238227260237,32.04023822726024,Low Trust
