Steven Drysdale,/users/658fc804162e7d00121d4c17,CA,1.0,2023-12-30 09:34:39+00:00,1.0,Unresolved Theft Incident - Disappointing Customer Service,"I am compelled to share my disappointing experience with Amazon, specifically regarding an incident that occurred in August, which has left me frustrated and dissatisfied with their customer service.I made a substantial purchase exceeding $500, only to have the package left unattended on my front porch and subsequently stolen. Despite reporting the theft promptly, my attempts to seek assistance have been met with ongoing delays and unfulfilled promises from Amazon's customer support.This situation is deeply troubling, and as a valued customer, I expected a more proactive and helpful response. Unfortunately, despite providing all necessary details, including the order number and relevant documentation, the matter remains unresolved.The lack of responsibility and follow-up in the face of a significant financial loss is concerning. I believe that a reputable company like Amazon should take swift action and provide adequate support to customers who experience theft or loss.My hope is that by sharing my experience, it serves as a cautionary tale for others and prompts Amazon to reassess their commitment to customer satisfaction, especially in situations involving security issues with their deliveries.",2023-08-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,30.0,1215,178,58,7,133.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,compelled share disappointing experience amazon specifically regarding incident occurred august left frustrated dissatisfied customer servicei made substantial purchase exceeding package left unattended front porch subsequently stolen despite reporting theft promptly attempt seek assistance met ongoing delay unfulfilled promise amazon customer supportthis situation deeply troubling valued customer expected proactive helpful response unfortunately despite providing necessary detail including order number relevant documentation matter remains unresolvedthe lack responsibility followup face significant financial loss concerning believe reputable company like amazon take swift action provide adequate support customer experience theft lossmy hope sharing experience serf cautionary tale others prompt amazon reassess commitment customer satisfaction especially situation involving security issue delivery,0.0016286287857874475,0.9983713712142126,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.8191520344573586,81.91520344573587,High Trust
James Edwards,/users/50b80e1c00006400012889cd,GB,16.0,2023-12-30 02:20:03+00:00,1.0,Terrible customer service and lying delivery drivers,"This Christmas has been horrible with Amazon.  So much so have started using other suppliers like Argos and Currys.  I have had too many deliveries registered as 'handed to resident' but the parcels have not been left.  No photos.  And when challenged via customer services you get 'the status must have been changed prematurely' and please check with neighbours or wait a few days.  Customer service and deliveries used to be the best bit about Amazon.  I've been a prime member for almost a decade but won't be renewing.  If I can't depend on deliveries, and I can't talk to someone to correct until almost another week has gone they don't deserve my custom.  Absolutely terrible.",2023-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,30.0,682,116,52,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,christmas horrible amazon much started using supplier like argo curry many delivery registered handed resident parcel left photo challenged via customer service get status must changed prematurely please check neighbour wait day customer service delivery used best bit amazon ive prime member almost decade wont renewing cant depend delivery cant talk someone correct almost another week gone dont deserve custom absolutely terrible,0.021656219363639408,0.9783437806363606,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.8021836682205921,80.21836682205921,High Trust
