ny as I again say don’t bother buying from them there a absolute joke .",2023-12-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,29.0,1820,345,156,29,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,brought camera amazon took money disabled terminal brain tumour defrauded £ purchase thing absolute disaster company would fool purchase one customer agent doesn’t know hell clue circumstance wait manager neither know hell either i’m taking matter defrauding money given christmas present nice one amazon might well put money shredder none want take responsibility problem arise purchasing company ever also i’ve i’ve also cancelled account payment amazon disgrace want wast money product fool responsibility liability taken action i’ve recorded every conversation i’ve evidence taking matter good luck amazon company go administration nasty lot multi million pound company someone like disabled permanently electric wheelchair terminal brain tumour horrible amazon purchase please wasting time make cheaper lol 😂 erm get delivery’s subscription next day delivery door hasn’t herd chuck parcel doorstep others steal got argument hand un received item joke company say don’t bother buying absolute joke,0.6061033505112269,0.3938966494887731,0.19349411104879416,0.2,0.5356471469541454,53.56471469541454,Medium Trust
