Demus,/users/5cc9f6823e992b05fc37bdd6,GB,20.0,2023-12-29 17:51:45+00:00,4.0,Amazon is a good place to shop if you…,"Amazon is a good place to shop if you have prime. Fast delivery sometimes. Amazon offer next day delivery, Some by 1pm however by the time you get to checkout it's 10pm estimated delivery and I assure you it's 10pm beforeyou get your order. Always search for better prices, like I've said it's not always the cheapest. You will get better deals elsewhere. A dewalt laser level almost 500£ On Amazon, on eBay the same thing 300£ to 395£ screwfix 350£. Also be careful of fake items, not as bad as Ebay.",2023-12-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,29.0,501,92,38,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon good place shop prime fast delivery sometimes amazon offer next day delivery pm however time get checkout pm estimated delivery assure pm beforeyou get order always search better price like ive said always cheapest get better deal elsewhere dewalt laser level almost £ amazon ebay thing £ £ screwfix £ also careful fake item bad ebay,0.018145961087369118,0.9818540389126309,0.051598429613011774,0.8,1.701246705378918,170.1246705378918,High Trust
