olga chavez,/users/5c49165998cdb494dd8dbcd3,US,4.0,2023-12-29 16:24:10+00:00,2.0,Don't depend on the delivery date,"Amazon promise delivery dates they can't keep. They go as far as saying out for delivery then at 7pm they say it's going to late. The next day it say it's going to be a week late, but finally the kicker is "" I'm sorry your package was lost and we are going to give you a refund 🤔 so you can order again"". I understand things happen,but this is to often. It seems they get their money out of me on time but don't send your stuff on time. They got to get better.",2023-12-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,29.0,460,95,33,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon promise delivery date cant keep go far saying delivery pm say going late next day say going week late finally kicker im sorry package lost going give refund 🤔 order understand thing happenbut often seems get money time dont send stuff time got get better,0.011382894411784913,0.9886171055882151,0.0532809871003926,0.4,1.1049647502141862,110.49647502141862,High Trust
