Florian Weinhold,/users/5d6592aa48da2afd48fa1d03,GB,7.0,2023-12-29 15:26:06+00:00,1.0,Customer service??? Refunds???,"I used to be a prime member for years. Then, their delivery and customer services went right down through the trapdoor. I stooped being a prime member. Then, I made the mistake to buy through Amazon, again, for the last time.Delivery ""to a neighbour""? That's what I found out when I looked on the website, wonduring where my laptop was.  Nothing posted that indicated where it had been left. And I never gave my permission to leave MY stuff with strangers. Previously, other delivery boys had just dropped my orders outside my door, on the pavement! Luckily, I noticed; otherwise, some passer-by could/would have picked it up for their own use. Amazon sucks! And their ""customer services""? ""Service""? Amazon needs to look up the word in the dictionary. Big Joke. They give you empty phrases, refuse to investigate, refer you to the police, they wash their hands, say they will not refund you, give you a deadline, until when you, the customer, have to comply with their orders.Whatever that bloke's name who owns amazon, he has fully joined the parasitic elites, as far as I can see. Not coming back because you do NOT value your customers. Amazon has become another moloch. Shame on you!And you customer ""service"" robots, do not respond to this zero star review. It'd be just another show of uncaring hypocrisy.",2023-12-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,29.0,1312,225,30,3,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,used prime member year delivery customer service went right trapdoor stooped prime member made mistake buy amazon last timedelivery neighbour thats found looked website wonduring laptop nothing posted indicated left never gave permission leave stuff stranger previously delivery boy dropped order outside door pavement luckily noticed otherwise passerby couldwould picked use amazon suck customer service service amazon need look word dictionary big joke give empty phrase refuse investigate refer police wash hand say refund give deadline customer comply orderswhatever bloke name owns amazon fully joined parasitic elite far see coming back value customer amazon become another moloch shame youand customer service robot respond zero star review itd another show uncaring hypocrisy,0.6860964491746362,0.3139035508253638,0.1261918115535614,0.2,0.4821901377233942,48.21901377233942,Low Trust
