Jack the Sailor,/users/5eceeeeada677a7525d2e1a0,US,13.0,2023-12-28 00:55:23+00:00,1.0,Will Amazon ever deliver my order?,"I ordered a product first week of November. When it did not arrive as scheduled, I contacted ""Customer Service"", a mostly polite but completely ill-prepared group whose main purpose is to read to customers the information about their order that is available on the Amazon web site.Customer Service declared that there was no inventory to fulfill my order; however, on the Amazon web site for the item, it explicitly stated that there were several in stock. I have contacted Customer Service several times with the same result. They have no authority to resolve the issue by expediting an order that is now almost two months old (as many other online retailers would do), and the item continues to appear available (I have time-stamped screenshots). The price has increased since I first placed my order, so I cannot help but wonder if Amazon is trying to outwait me and planning to send an email telling me how sorry they are that the product is no longer available (when they could have sent it at any time in the past two months).",2023-12-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,28.0,1032,180,34,6,8.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered product first week november arrive scheduled contacted customer service mostly polite completely illprepared group whose main purpose read customer information order available amazon web sitecustomer service declared inventory fulfill order however amazon web site item explicitly stated several stock contacted customer service several time result authority resolve issue expediting order almost two month old many online retailer would item continues appear available timestamped screenshots price increased since first placed order cannot help wonder amazon trying outwait planning send email telling sorry product longer available could sent time past two month,0.015438187804645074,0.9845618121953549,0.10095344924284913,0.2,0.8124715959462473,81.24715959462473,High Trust
Ashley F.,/users/5de27520ebb74628ef003ad3,US,2.0,2023-12-28 00:27:45+00:00,3.0,Amazon customer service,"I unfortunately don’t have the representatives names, but I had an item never show up. I contacted the customer support for a replacement. The lady who I first talked to LIED saying she could expedite the replacement and get it to me in 2 days. After 4 days, it still never showed up and the statement on my order said Jan. 8. The lady whom I talked to after the 2nd order was placed, said they could not expedite any replacement item and was quite surprised another representative would tell me that. I am EXTREMELY disappointed in Amazon who has an experienced representative LIE TO A CUSTOMER. However, the Second Lady who Told me they could not expedite my order was nothing but absolutely wonderful.",2023-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,28.0,704,125,23,3,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,unfortunately don’t representative name item never show contacted customer support replacement lady first talked lied saying could expedite replacement get day day still never showed statement order said jan lady talked nd order placed said could expedite replacement item quite surprised another representative would tell extremely disappointed amazon experienced representative lie customer however second lady told could expedite order nothing absolutely wonderful,0.03141224090138458,0.9685877590986154,0.07010656197420079,0.6,1.3983151919441477,139.83151919441477,High Trust
