nancy smith,/users/5f424a977a05b0d403ecfa7e,US,3.0,2023-12-27 23:21:13+00:00,1.0,NO SERVICE AMAZON,"Amazon’s delivery leaves a lot to be desired.  I was told that there were problems with my address; there were no problems.  I had to explain this 4 different times to cancel my order.  Could not cancel the last item because the customer service rep said this has to have been cancelled w/in 30 minutes if placing the order.  I am filing a dispute with American Express.  Won’t order anything from these charlatans again. Sick of their cheap fake merchandise and belligerent customer service.  I spent almost an hour on the phone dealing with this ridiculous problem, and the last rude idiot “Regional Customer” Service person, if you can call him customer service.",2023-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,27.0,665,113,17,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon’s delivery leaf lot desired told problem address problem explain different time cancel order could cancel last item customer service rep said cancelled win minute placing order filing dispute american express won’t order anything charlatan sick cheap fake merchandise belligerent customer service spent almost hour phone dealing ridiculous problem last rude idiot “regional customer” service person call customer service,0.034503308327315775,0.9654966916726843,0.0633763320246775,0.2,0.7954236122412777,79.54236122412777,High Trust
