Jackson Vose,/users/641dde4cf460440012672242,US,7.0,2023-12-27 21:59:08+00:00,1.0,They will steal your money and time,"I wanted to return an item. I contacted Amazon and they scheduled a pickup for my item. Nobody showed up. Now they are saying I can't return this item, and they are saying that it was clear nobody could have shown up for the pickup. Well, why didn't anybody tell me? Now I am out $700 and I wasted eight hours of my life for your ridiculous pickup window. Avoid Amazon at all costs, they are the worst.",2023-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,27.0,402,78,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wanted return item contacted amazon scheduled pickup item nobody showed saying cant return item saying clear nobody could shown pickup well didnt anybody tell wasted eight hour life ridiculous pickup window avoid amazon cost worst,0.020776088564216626,0.9792239114357834,0.04374649467190129,0.2,0.7983612546522719,79.8361254652272,High Trust
