Bartek Szot,/users/5b0e414f4de5666d3425103b,GB,18.0,2023-12-27 13:47:15+00:00,1.0,I was scammed by this company,"I was scammed by this company. I ordered wireless headphones for £150. The headphones were the wrong color, so I decided to return them. The instructions were for me to take the item to an Amazon location. So I did. The postal worker scanned the product. He put it in the box and did everything for me as per the instructions. He even let me take a photo confirming that the product had been returned. I received a return parcel code. The problems started when on the same day I saw that the product did not have an updated status as ""dropped off"". I called Amazon and an Indian guy told me on the phone that everything was fine and that they were having problems updating the system and everything would be fine tomorrow. Nothing like that happened. 3 weeks have passed and they told me in Amazon chat that I would not receive my refund. Because they didn't receive my drop off. I was shocked and gave them the tracking number. They said that it was an invalid number and that we were ending the discussions and turned off the chat. I was in total shock. Be careful with this company, I lost my Christmas present and £150. Don't buy anything on Amazon! there is no money back guarantee like on ebay. People, buy only on eBay, there you have a money back guarantee and no one will cheat you.",2023-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,27.0,1291,241,29,6,14.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,scammed company ordered wireless headphone £ headphone wrong color decided return instruction take item amazon location postal worker scanned product put box everything per instruction even let take photo confirming product returned received return parcel code problem started day saw product updated status dropped called amazon indian guy told phone everything fine problem updating system everything would fine tomorrow nothing like happened week passed told amazon chat would receive refund didnt receive drop shocked gave tracking number said invalid number ending discussion turned chat total shock careful company lost christmas present £ dont buy anything amazon money back guarantee like ebay people buy ebay money back guarantee one cheat,0.06346671060104582,0.9365332893989542,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.7952997349967289,79.52997349967289,High Trust
