Christi White,/users/658ba5acec129f001294d1f6,US,1.0,2023-12-27 06:19:29+00:00,1.0,Amazon stealing from customers,"What the hell has happened to Amazon?! They used to have the best customer service, now it’s gone to hell. I recently purchased an expensive watch from Amazon and they sent me an EMPTY WATCH BOX. I called to report the issue, thinking that just maybe they would be able to check their cameras and do their own due diligence since clearly someone in their facility had stolen the watch but instead, they tell me I’m the one that needs to file the police report and once I send them a copy of it, they will decide whether or not a refund will be granted! Yes, you read that correctly. I paid for an empty box and then they will decide if they want to give me a refund! I know this sounds crazy because it is!!! Nonetheless, I filed the police report and submitted it and to my surprise, I still got kickback telling me that my police report is invalid. It’s a legal document from a police department. How much more valid does it need to be?!! Unfortunately, I’ve spent almost a week of my time trying to provide them with everything Amazon needed in order to receive my money back and it’s still not enough so it looks as though I’ll just have to refuse the charge since they did not send me what I paid for. In sum, I did not receive what I paid for and in theory, I should be filing the police report on Amazon. They stole my watch and/or they are stealing my money…however you want to put it. It’s disgraceful and they should be making every bit of effort on their end to get to the bottom of this because clearly they have a thief in house.",2023-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,27.0,1542,296,30,4,3.0,0,8,1,0,Genuine,hell happened amazon used best customer service it’s gone hell recently purchased expensive watch amazon sent empty watch box called report issue thinking maybe would able check camera due diligence since clearly someone facility stolen watch instead tell i’m one need file police report send copy decide whether refund granted yes read correctly paid empty box decide want give refund know sound crazy nonetheless filed police report submitted surprise still got kickback telling police report invalid it’s legal document police department much valid need unfortunately i’ve spent almost week time trying provide everything amazon needed order receive money back it’s still enough look though i’ll refuse charge since send paid sum receive paid theory filing police report amazon stole watch andor stealing money…however want put it’s disgraceful making every bit effort end get bottom clearly thief house,0.9996775515061083,0.000322448493891736,0.16601233875490745,0.2,0.33336369199792737,33.336369199792735,Low Trust
