Chris Purcell,/users/54f086cb0000ff0001adf27b,GB,9.0,2023-12-25 18:06:33+00:00,1.0,"Defective products, no refund, no help.","I bought a load of ecomics on Xmas eve, only two of them worked (lots of blank pages). I tried deleting the comics and redownloading, I tried deleting and reinstalling the kindle app and then redownloading the books, still broken. So, then I started requesting refunds on their site. For some of them that was fine, but for the majority they wouldn't accept it saying I'd had too many refunds and some of the books had been read, I had skipped through to the end of some of the books to see if all the pages were blank. I hadn't asked for too many refunds, Amazon had sold too many broken books! I'm now stuck with a load of broken books as a Christmas present. Audible cancelled, never will Amazon have another penny from me or another opportunity to rip me off. It's impossible to get hold of anyone without their app, which I do not think I, as a FORMER customer, should have to download.",2023-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,25.0,891,166,39,6,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,bought load ecomics xmas eve two worked lot blank page tried deleting comic redownloading tried deleting reinstalling kindle app redownloading book still broken started requesting refund site fine majority wouldnt accept saying id many refund book read skipped end book see page blank hadnt asked many refund amazon sold many broken book im stuck load broken book christmas present audible cancelled never amazon another penny another opportunity rip impossible get hold anyone without app think former customer download,0.06213278222452385,0.9378672177754761,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.7875539117480859,78.75539117480858,High Trust
