Alison,/users/57c009ba0000ff000a3e4aa5,GB,28.0,2023-12-23 19:27:44+00:00,1.0,failed delivery of xmas gift no one cares,"I had tracking of a parcel yesterday stayed in all day.  At gone 5pm tracking showed delivery was attempted but could not find the front door!!! ridiculous.  I have spent all day trying to contact amazon for an update and confirmation i will get this xmas gift today, no one will answer my simple questions will it be delivered today.  getting absolutely nowhere and no update on the tracking next year I may have to consider boycotting this is disgraceful delivery service and useless customer service deepartment.",2023-12-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,23.0,515,87,41,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,tracking parcel yesterday stayed day gone pm tracking showed delivery attempted could find front door ridiculous spent day trying contact amazon update confirmation get xmas gift today one answer simple question delivered today getting absolutely nowhere update tracking next year may consider boycotting disgraceful delivery service useless customer service deepartment,0.9016549901482505,0.09834500985174954,0.04879416713404375,0.2,0.35893133835268354,35.89313383526835,Low Trust
Charlotte,/users/584fc4610000ff000a611a1b,GB,7.0,2023-12-23 17:32:17+00:00,5.0,Amazon delivery driver is a legend!,"My Amazon delivery driver today is an absolute legend! I really wish I knew his name but I'll leave feedback on the app also in the hope he gets recognised. He was holding a parcel behind his back and he asked me if the parcel was for me as it had my name on it. I explained my partner ordered it on the account. He asked if it was a Christmas present for me, to which I said yes. He said it wasn't in additional packaging, so I would see what it is, so he asked how I wanted to receive the package. He very kindly came into my porch to hide the package so my surprise wouldn't be ruined! How thoughtful!! I've never had a delivery driver so thoughtful and kind - how amazing! it must be such a busy/stressful time on 23rd dec and yet he still took the time to help (and waited at the door a long time as it took me ages to find my key). I always get deliveries quickly and efficiently but this was exceptional!! Thank you!!",2023-12-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,23.0,924,184,35,6,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,amazon delivery driver today absolute legend really wish knew name ill leave feedback app also hope get recognised holding parcel behind back asked parcel name explained partner ordered account asked christmas present said yes said wasnt additional packaging would see asked wanted receive package kindly came porch hide package surprise wouldnt ruined thoughtful ive never delivery driver thoughtful kind amazing must busystressful time rd dec yet still took time help waited door long time took age find key always get delivery quickly efficiently exceptional thank,0.9999331023551294,6.689764487055605e-05,0.10319685922602355,1.0,1.52067282066764,152.06728206676402,High Trust
