Tamara Boney,/users/658651a6b9668a001103163c,US,1.0,2023-12-23 05:19:20+00:00,1.0,I am so upset with amazon,"I am so upset with amazon. They have ruined a 13 year old girls Christmas.  I have been begging all day to get replacement products and it has been a no go. I don't have alot of money . I struggle but I always make sure to have enough when it comes to the children in my family. My niece made a wishlist so I tried to at least get her several things on there that I could afford. She is 13 and her hair is her everything her. so she wanted a product call Not Your Mother beach babe for curls and she also wanted brittany spears fantasy bodyspray, she loves brittany spears and is a huge fan. To many that's not costly but to me it is because I have numerous children to buy for that's in my family and it adds up. But anways I ordered these products the not your mother comes in, when I opened it the I noticed the plastic looked wet so I open the plastic and this oily stuff was coming out so I cleaned it up off my carpet and when I really looked  the bottles were empty and the lids were barly on. Ok the brittany spears body spray comes in, the lid was busted off and the spray thing did not work. So I call amazon I swallowed my pride and begged and begged for them to replace the products. I explained to them over and over it they were Christmas gufts for my niece. Basically I was told no because I didn't take a picture of the bottles leaking. Who in their right mind thinks of a camera when greasy product is leaking all over their carpet. Ok at that time I didn't know I had to take a picture, who would have known that. I have talked to numerous people on amazon everyone has something different to tell me. I'm very upset because I told them I don't want the money back I just want the products so she has a gift from me. They didn't even care. I cried I was so hurt because I have been a very loyal costumer, I have 4 services with them for the last 2 years. I don't have the words it's Christmas damnit!! I don't have no more to give. A multi billion dollar company couldn't replace 20 dollars worth of products whats wrong with that? It dont even sound normal. Shame on you people at amazon how do u sleep at night knowing you knew the products were damaged when u put them in the boxes.  The only one that will suffer in this is my niece, i guess she supose to open the lid on the body spray and dump it on herself. It's like she is to blame, I guess she is the one who put the damaged products in the boxes knowly they were damaged and gifts at that. I did it for my niece she don't have rich parents they struggle as well. What seems cheap to some may be expensive to another.  I'm sorry for the long review I just want people to know how a multibillion dollar company will take my money quick but at the Sametime won't make it right for the costumer when it was their own company that damaged the products. You should be ashamed of yourselves knowing you don't give a rats ass and that's what really upsets me. Also I want to add they said if they were to decide to give me my money it would be 30 days. Christmas is long gone after 30 days. I just wanted the products they can keep the money that how much this girl means to me. My heart is broke",2023-12-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,23.0,3167,632,25,6,3.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,upset amazon ruined year old girl christmas begging day get replacement product go dont alot money struggle always make sure enough come child family niece made wishlist tried least get several thing could afford hair everything wanted product call mother beach babe curl also wanted brittany spear fantasy bodyspray love brittany spear huge fan many thats costly numerous child buy thats family add anways ordered product mother come opened noticed plastic looked wet open plastic oily stuff coming cleaned carpet really looked bottle empty lid barly ok brittany spear body spray come lid busted spray thing work call amazon swallowed pride begged begged replace product explained christmas gufts niece basically told didnt take picture bottle leaking right mind think camera greasy product leaking carpet ok time didnt know take picture would known talked numerous people amazon everyone something different tell im upset told dont want money back want product gift didnt even care cried hurt loyal costumer service last year dont word christmas damnit dont give multi billion dollar company couldnt replace dollar worth product whats wrong dont even sound normal shame people amazon u sleep night knowing knew product damaged u put box one suffer niece guess supose open lid body spray dump like blame guess one put damaged product box knowly damaged gift niece dont rich parent struggle well seems cheap may expensive another im sorry long review want people know multibillion dollar company take money quick sametime wont make right costumer company damaged product ashamed knowing dont give rat as thats really upset also want add said decide give money would day christmas long gone day wanted product keep money much girl mean heart broke,0.19148390590516695,0.808516094094833,0.3544587773415592,0.2,0.7751498025157283,77.51498025157282,High Trust
