CDenby,/users/61bcd130369fb900128b64df,GB,3.0,2023-12-22 22:34:00+00:00,1.0,Christmas Disappointment,"Christmas Disappointment – Missing DJI Camera BundleI recently received my parcel, or so I thought. The delivery man left it on the floor and requested I enter a code on his phone. Suspicion arose when the weight felt off, and upon opening it, I discovered baby items instead of the expensive DJI camera bundle set I ordered. The disappointment prompted an immediate call to Amazon customer service, as evident in the attached photo.Despite the tracking indicating a delivery on my street for five hours on 21.12.23, the package mysteriously arrived on 22.12.23. During the redelivery, the delivery person, with limited English proficiency, placed the parcel on the floor and asked me to enter a code on his phone—raising further concerns about the legitimacy of the process.The evident scan became apparent when I noticed the packaging opened too easily, contrary to Amazon's usual tamper-proof measures. This ordeal is especially disheartening as I cannot have children, and the unexpected delivery of baby items shattered my Christmas spirit. The mix-up not only ruined the holiday but also raised questions about the security of Amazon's delivery system. I hope for a swift resolution to rectify this unfortunate situation.",2023-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,22.0,1227,194,24,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,christmas disappointment – missing dji camera bundlei recently received parcel thought delivery man left floor requested enter code phone suspicion arose weight felt upon opening discovered baby item instead expensive dji camera bundle set ordered disappointment prompted immediate call amazon customer service evident attached photodespite tracking indicating delivery street five hour package mysteriously arrived redelivery delivery person limited english proficiency placed parcel floor asked enter code phone—raising concern legitimacy processthe evident scan became apparent noticed packaging opened easily contrary amazon usual tamperproof measure ordeal especially disheartening cannot child unexpected delivery baby item shattered christmas spirit mixup ruined holiday also raised question security amazon delivery system hope swift resolution rectify unfortunate situation,0.020729924199144264,0.9792700758008558,0.10880538418395962,0.2,0.8113961147372198,81.13961147372198,High Trust
