Joel Smith,/users/5ecfead8e8866c2e88531702,US,4.0,2023-12-22 18:06:43+00:00,1.0,Amazon FAILS in delivering any viable customer service.,"I called customer service because I was having a payment method issue. After explaining my issue, the person says well there's nothing we can do you need to do it. I am like wait I am adding a new payment method, I did that online and it won't let me utilize the payment method. I was again told I need to do it, after 3 back and Forths, I asked for a manager, the manager gets on the phone and verifies my info but called me by my name initially. I explained the problem again. She said we cannot help you. I asked why she said we don't know how we have never been trained. I said you have not been trained on how to set up a new default payment method. She said no Amazon has a history of failing in the training. I said who can i speak to, I do not know was her reply. So we have a either she was straight up lying to a customer or Amazon fails in training either way to say things like this to a customer whose company spent 236k in the last 3 years with them is extremely poor customer service. I will take my business elsewhere.",2023-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,22.0,1034,208,55,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,called customer service payment method issue explaining issue person say well there nothing need like wait adding new payment method online wont let utilize payment method told need back forth asked manager manager get phone verifies info called name initially explained problem said cannot help asked said dont know never trained said trained set new default payment method said amazon history failing training said speak know reply either straight lying customer amazon fails training either way say thing like customer whose company spent k last year extremely poor customer service take business elsewhere,0.018672779456287533,0.9813272205437125,0.1166573191250701,0.2,0.8139950740968703,81.39950740968703,High Trust
