Jac,/users/6571ff64932a920012597f3f,GB,6.0,2023-12-22 14:11:59+00:00,1.0,Amazon 'customer service' is abysmal.,"There is absolutely no reasonable way to contact Amazon to make a complaint about a blatant lie by one of their delivery drivers. So I'm putting the details here which is the only website that seems to allow me to do so. A note on my Amazon account, presumably from the Amazon delivery driver, says: ""Your package was delivered to a neighbour James at door H Signed by: James.""This is a blatant lie. This is a small block of 8 flats, and there is only one James in the block, and that would be me. The delivery driver is a liar. This is what actually happened.The package was left outside the main security doors where anyone passing by or visiting another tenant could easily have stolen it. Fortunately, it was noticed by a neighbour who brought it to my door. Whilst I had asked for the package to be delivered to my neighbour, I was at home all day. A simple push of either MY bell or my neighbour's, would have got an answer. Instead, the package was left outside the security doors at the front of the building and the driver who delivered it lied about it. As an aside, I ordered something else at the same time as the item above and it was supposed to arrive yesterday. I still haven't got it at the time of writing this review. I will never buy from Amazon again. IMO, the customer service is abysmal. The chatbox 'assistant' (I use the word advisedly) is ludicrous. You simply go round and round in circles and never get to make the comment/s you want to make in the first place. There is simply no way to write a complaint to Amazon itself - except in spaces like this. So thank you Amazon for nothing and for wasting my time.",2023-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,22.0,1637,307,37,5,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,absolutely reasonable way contact amazon make complaint blatant lie one delivery driver im putting detail website seems allow note amazon account presumably amazon delivery driver say package delivered neighbour james door h signed jamesthis blatant lie small block flat one james block would delivery driver liar actually happenedthe package left outside main security door anyone passing visiting another tenant could easily stolen fortunately noticed neighbour brought door whilst asked package delivered neighbour home day simple push either bell neighbour would got answer instead package left outside security door front building driver delivered lied aside ordered something else time item supposed arrive yesterday still havent got time writing review never buy amazon imo customer service abysmal chatbox assistant use word advisedly ludicrous simply go round round circle never get make comment want make first place simply way write complaint amazon except space like thank amazon nothing wasting time,0.0072404880414589775,0.9927595119585411,0.17218171620863712,0.2,0.8308160992209979,83.08160992209979,High Trust
