Matthieu,/users/611e06744a5e660012ac804a,BE,5.0,2023-12-22 00:16:22+00:00,5.0,Very happy frequent user,"I have been using amazon on a weekly basis for years with great satisfaction. I use them for almost everything because I don't enjoy physical shopping and that they offer a wider virety of choices.Located in Belgium, I use both amazon.fr and .de comparing prices and paying a lot of attention to customer feedback.Because I buy after analysis and consideration, I very rarely return articles. But when I do it is easy and free. Today I exceptionally returned an article and my credit card was refunded the same day!!! This is more than impressive!They are actually getting even better :-)I always buy with great trust on Amazon!",2023-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,22.0,628,107,24,4,1.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,using amazon weekly basis year great satisfaction use almost everything dont enjoy physical shopping offer wider virety choiceslocated belgium use amazonfr de comparing price paying lot attention customer feedbackbecause buy analysis consideration rarely return article easy free today exceptionally returned article credit card refunded day impressivethey actually getting even better always buy great trust amazon,0.9794393493671665,0.02056065063283352,0.06001121704991587,1.0,1.5222825687263999,152.22825687263997,High Trust
