CathB,/users/5a7dbf3bf675864e56fff616,IE,24.0,2023-12-19 01:06:49+00:00,1.0,Literally zero customer service,"If I could leave a zero I would. I have used Amazon for years, shopping, prime, kindle and audible and one of the things I ordered this year was an iPhone 14 for my daughter’s Christmas present.  When I opened the box there was a box of biscuits inside. I got onto Amazon straight away on the chat and the guy told me not to worry that it would be sorted immediately. I took photos and made a police report but Amazon wouldn’t contact the police about the report so I had to post back the box of biscuits 😡 I am still waiting for my refund even though the biscuits have been received by them by now and they keep saying it takes up to 30 days to process the return and refund. It is Christmas week and I am supposed to have a phone for my daughter for Christmas, it’s the only thing she asked for but I won’t receive the refund in time. Amazon do not care about their customers, it’s just money, money, money with them. Well I may well be only one person but as soon as I receive my refund I will never use Amazon again and will delete my account",2023-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,19.0,1046,207,31,4,10.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,could leave zero would used amazon year shopping prime kindle audible one thing ordered year iphone daughter’s christmas present opened box box biscuit inside got onto amazon straight away chat guy told worry would sorted immediately took photo made police report amazon wouldn’t contact police report post back box biscuit 😡 still waiting refund even though biscuit received keep saying take day process return refund christmas week supposed phone daughter christmas it’s thing asked won’t receive refund time amazon care customer it’s money money money well may well one person soon receive refund never use amazon delete account,0.011254681321551292,0.9887453186784487,0.1160964666292765,0.2,0.8175919526650797,81.75919526650797,High Trust
