Susie Melo,/users/638faf2940b1550012d83203,US,4.0,2023-12-18 18:41:37+00:00,1.0,Amazon customer service has plummeted…,"Amazon customer service has plummeted over the past year or so.  Now they are making returns harder and charging if you use UPS.  They are also requiring a copy of your ID which is unacceptable!! They claim they need to identify us but they don't seem to need that to take our money!!  That is invasive and opens us up to identity theft in the event they get hacked like everyone else.  I will never give them this!!!  To make matters worse any phone call to customer service takes far too long.  Now, after you've spent 10-15 minutes with a customer service rep they often say they need to transfer the call and you sit in yet another long queue waiting for that person to help and they are less inclined to resolve problem easily putting the burden on the customer.I recently ordered 2 gallons of fuel stabilizer.  After multiple emails that it had been delayed, I called to cancel the order because I was leaving town.  They said they couldn't, but as soon as they could locate te product they would refund my money.  Then, I got emails saying the product ""was likely delivered on December 2nd"", when it wasn't.  They still would not refund my money.  They said I had to wait until after December 12th - almost 2 weeks and I would have to call back and go thru the process all over again.  Finally, after 4 phone calls and over 2 hours of wasted  time, they refunded my money for ""their"" mistake.  Yesterday, I received a $16 item that was not as described online and they wanted a copy of my drivers license or ID.  Well I told them to take a hike.  Instead of placing my next order on Amazon I bought several hundred dollars worth of goods between Walmart and Home Depot and even saved money!!  I will be cancelling Prime and using Amazon as little as possible in the future.",2023-12-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,18.0,1780,327,38,5,1.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,amazon customer service plummeted past year making return harder charging use ups also requiring copy id unacceptable claim need identify u dont seem need take money invasive open u identity theft event get hacked like everyone else never give make matter worse phone call customer service take far long youve spent minute customer service rep often say need transfer call sit yet another long queue waiting person help less inclined resolve problem easily putting burden customeri recently ordered gallon fuel stabilizer multiple email delayed called cancel order leaving town said couldnt soon could locate te product would refund money got email saying product likely delivered december nd wasnt still would refund money said wait december th almost week would call back go thru process finally phone call hour wasted time refunded money mistake yesterday received item described online wanted copy driver license id well told take hike instead placing next order amazon bought several hundred dollar worth good walmart home depot even saved money cancelling prime using amazon little possible future,0.9997829632495016,0.00021703675049844495,0.18339876612450925,0.2,0.33678827160015107,33.6788271600151,Low Trust
