Meg Ryan,/users/657ced582446c000116a6bc9,CA,1.0,2023-12-16 02:20:52+00:00,1.0,Buyer beware,"Buyer bewareDO NOT BUY FROM AMAZON,  I purchased a bunch of items from Amazon and  when I went to open the undamaged , not tampered box, which looked exactly like the picture taken by the delivery personnel and what was attached on my Amazon order saying delivered . I was missing one item. The one item missing that I ordered was an easy bake oven .I originally wanted to order from Walmart as it was cheaper ($59.97) but it was sold out everywhere but on Amazon it was $185.xx approx with some extra items food items for the easy bake oven but it was in stock.Other items in that box that I received,costed more than the easy bake oven.When I called Amazon to let them know that one item was not in the box but everything else was , they told me I had to file a police report.Which they believe it was stolen and I had to file a report .I don’t believe it was stolen , it was just not sent by Amazon . So I filed a Police report anyways cause Amazon won’t give me my money back to get a new one until I file a police report and to boot it’s now a week away from Christmas .I sent the incident number by email which I filed with the police department before 10am on Friday dec 15th,2023 and I also told the Amazon customer service rep that I would be calling back after work as I would like an update . When I called back after work the lovely lady listened to my story and tried to call the police department at that time but because it was after 6pm the police department was no longer open . They had since 10 am in the morning to call but no Amazon customer service rep called and now I have to wait over the weekend . Now, I have to  call back on Monday and go through the same process for a missing easy bake oven that I believe they never had or sent. Plus, I have to go and try and find another one somewhere over the weekend .Amazon packaging tape is so unbelievably hard to get off on any package , the package I received was in perfect condition and the whole box was on my porch. There was no question in my mind that the package was open or tampered with. Now, I have to go through all the extra work and stress for something that was never put in the package in the first place . If someone was going to steal anything would they not just take the entire box or pick the more expensive items in the box and wouldn’t the box be damaged ?????All good questions that three + managers at Amazon cannot answer or help with. They don’t have a picture of the package inside before it left Amazon but a picture of the package/box on my porch from the delivery personel , which looks exactly how it was when I received it .I will not be purchasing anymore from Amazon … I received all my products that were suppose to be in my package except for one item and I am the one that has to do all the work and file a police report for something I believe was not stolen . I believe Amazon didn’t sent it . Which is more suspicious is that Walmart was sold out everywhere in the GTA. Which makes me think… did they even have any easy bake ovens and what’s the chances that the one thing I am missing is what was sold out from Walmart .. hmmmmm makes you think 🤔????Recommend not to buy from Amazon",2023-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,16.0,3196,628,12,2,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,buyer bewaredo buy amazon purchased bunch item amazon went open undamaged tampered box looked exactly like picture taken delivery personnel attached amazon order saying delivered missing one item one item missing ordered easy bake oven originally wanted order walmart cheaper sold everywhere amazon xx approx extra item food item easy bake oven stockother item box receivedcosted easy bake ovenwhen called amazon let know one item box everything else told file police reportwhich believe stolen file report don’t believe stolen sent amazon filed police report anyways cause amazon won’t give money back get new one file police report boot it’s week away christmas sent incident number email filed police department friday dec th also told amazon customer service rep would calling back work would like update called back work lovely lady listened story tried call police department time pm police department longer open since morning call amazon customer service rep called wait weekend call back monday go process missing easy bake oven believe never sent plus go try find another one somewhere weekend amazon packaging tape unbelievably hard get package package received perfect condition whole box porch question mind package open tampered go extra work stress something never put package first place someone going steal anything would take entire box pick expensive item box wouldn’t box damaged good question three manager amazon cannot answer help don’t picture package inside left amazon picture packagebox porch delivery personel look exactly received purchasing anymore amazon … received product suppose package except one item one work file police report something believe stolen believe amazon didn’t sent suspicious walmart sold everywhere gta make think… even easy bake oven what’s chance one thing missing sold walmart hmmmmm make think 🤔recommend buy amazon,0.01133694493552237,0.9886630550644776,0.35221536735838477,0.2,0.8647746010039158,86.47746010039158,High Trust
