Vladyslav G.,/users/5e7ccd4c955aee56eb8f9095,UA,3.0,2023-12-15 18:08:08+00:00,1.0,Took my 1900 euros and ignored me,"Took my 1900 euros and ignored me. I've purchased 2 gift cards each for 950 euros and used both of them to place orders. All the orders were canceled, then they suspended my gift cards and I received the email regarding it. I replied to the email with 2 invoices confirming the purchase of those gift cards. Then, I was contacting support agents almost every day to hear a single word saying ""Wait a little bit more"", ""Your case is under review"", etc. Moreover, they voided 1 of my gift cards for 950 euros. It has been 12 days since the problem occurred and no clear answers or responses.",2023-12-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,15.0,589,109,33,7,12.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,took euro ignored ive purchased gift card euro used place order order canceled suspended gift card received email regarding replied email invoice confirming purchase gift card contacting support agent almost every day hear single word saying wait little bit case review etc moreover voided gift card euro day since problem occurred clear answer response,0.01368616441212829,0.9863138355878717,0.061132922041503085,0.2,0.8053835022022364,80.53835022022365,High Trust
Lionel,/users/65129a501d40ec001175754c,US,2.0,2024-03-04 22:00:49+00:00,1.0,Feel scammed by Amazon,"Disappointed with Amazon  - we bought a JOOLA table tennis table during Black Friday at a steeply discounted price. It was supposed to be delivered on December 7th, but never arrived. I eventually was told that it was damaged in transit and would not be delivered, and that my only option is a refund as no replacements were availably since the item was out of stock. We have since ordered another JOOLA table on Amazon, but at a much higher price. Feels like we have been scammed by Amazon. Not what I would expect from Amazon. Disappointed with this poor service. All we wanted was a replacement at the same price we paid during Black Friday. JOOLA on the other hand provided us with amazing service. Post my initial negative review they contacted us, apologized for the inconvenience and graciously sent us a variety of JOOLA products to make up for the mishap. What great customer service! I have been converted to a lifelong supporter and client.",2023-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,3.0,4.0,951,167,22,4,83.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,disappointed amazon bought joola table tennis table black friday steeply discounted price supposed delivered december th never arrived eventually told damaged transit would delivered option refund replacement availably since item stock since ordered another joola table amazon much higher price feel like scammed amazon would expect amazon disappointed poor service wanted replacement price paid black friday joola hand provided u amazing service post initial negative review contacted u apologized inconvenience graciously sent u variety joola product make mishap great customer service converted lifelong supporter client,0.02054037814903278,0.9794596218509672,0.09366236679753225,0.2,0.80846228428499,80.846228428499,High Trust
