Anthony Perrelli,/users/657c21c42446c0001169d056,US,1.0,2023-12-15 11:55:10+00:00,1.0,To all my fellow shoppers,"To all my fellow shoppers , I would like to start a boycott of the purchase of any Amazon products , I have just recently found out a week ago that I need open-heart surgery and my life has been thrown for a loop as you all can imagine , I have been a member of Amazon for over 10 years , I never missed a payment until last month , I had $400 credit in my Amazon which I was going to utilize for Christmas, I made my purchases and woke up the next day to find they have all been canceled , I called to see what the issue was and they shut off the remainder of my credit and reversed my purchases , I am in a bad spot due to the medical issue that has arose but to be treated like this on Christmas is absolutely disgusting and when one of you are down and out like me that’s when Amazon will turn its back on you too, I do not think a company like this deserves our time money or respect as Americans and I think the boycott should start today on the purchase of Amazon for any items ,everyone have a great Christmas, I will try to make more with less like I always have but this really hurts at a time when there’s enough pain in my plate allready , Merry Christimas",2023-12-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,15.0,1168,239,25,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,fellow shopper would like start boycott purchase amazon product recently found week ago need openheart surgery life thrown loop imagine member amazon year never missed payment last month credit amazon going utilize christmas made purchase woke next day find canceled called see issue shut remainder credit reversed purchase bad spot due medical issue arose treated like christmas absolutely disgusting one like that’s amazon turn back think company like deserves time money respect american think boycott start today purchase amazon item everyone great christmas try make less like always really hurt time there’s enough pain plate allready