andy wroblewski,/users/5581b9840000ff0001c6ac55,GB,51.0,2023-12-14 14:21:56+00:00,4.0,"All the bad reviews, and yet Amazon work so hard and have never let me down.","I am glad that I am able to write a review for Amazon, the hardest part is finding the correct Amazon (with me living in the UK), and a search for Amazon revealed pages and pages of Amazons', all linked, with different country extensions etc.Anyway, despite the negative feedback, and there seems to be an awful lot here, PLUS, despite the feedback about what goes on in the background, I have to say I am delighted with Amazon. Truly, they have never let me down, deliver ALWAYS on time, keep me updated all the way too, and so easy if a return is needed.I see our Amazon drivers every day struggling in this constant traffic, literally stood still at times on motorways and peak time, and yet they still raise a smile, and deliver all the goods to the correct place even following any instructions for safe places.This Christmas 2023, (at the time of the review), they will be busier than ever, and yet they still deliver, even up to 10pm at night.  Hats off to Amazon, and I just hope the odd good review now and then will help others think, again, how hard this company are working to get this right, and on time.",2023-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,14.0,1117,206,76,16,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,glad able write review amazon hardest part finding correct amazon living uk search amazon revealed page page amazon linked different country extension etcanyway despite negative feedback seems awful lot plus despite feedback go background say delighted amazon truly never let deliver always time keep updated way easy return neededi see amazon driver every day struggling constant traffic literally stood still time motorway peak time yet still raise smile deliver good correct place even following instruction safe placesthis christmas time review busier ever yet still deliver even pm night hat amazon hope odd good review help others think hard company working get right time,0.03407875178965241,0.9659212482103476,0.1155356141334829,0.8,1.7060677469318704,170.60677469318705,High Trust
Kei,/users/5331b6db00006400016ab02a,GB,12.0,2023-12-14 13:25:05+00:00,1.0,"""Arrive tonight by 10pm＂is a myth","""Arrive tonight by 10pm＂is a myth. No matter what the website says or the countdown timer says - just forget about receiving it the same day. I have yet to ever receive an order the same day after selecting that option umpteen times. Amazon may as well remove this option since it's an out and out lie.When I rang up to find out more, I was told ""well, you ordered it this morning so it's going to be next-day delivery.' Tried to convince me that I didn't see the words 'ARRIVE TONIGHT BY 10PM' as I hit order. I didn't select next day delivery as I knew I wouldn't be available.Frustrating experience - don't get your hopes up with that is all I can say on that.The couriers are hopeless. They rarely knock and will happily leave your parcel out on the street. When they do knock, they expect you to instantly teleport to the door, seeing as they give you a nanosecond to open the door after ringing your doorbell. If you take any longer than that, they'll drop your parcel on the floor and take off down the street.",2023-12-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,14.0,1017,191,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,arrive tonight pm＂is myth matter website say countdown timer say forget receiving day yet ever receive order day selecting option umpteen time amazon may well remove option since liewhen rang find told well ordered morning going nextday delivery tried convince didnt see word arrive tonight pm hit order didnt select next day delivery knew wouldnt availablefrustrating experience dont get hope say thatthe courier hopeless rarely knock happily leave parcel street knock expect instantly teleport door seeing give nanosecond open door ringing doorbell take longer theyll drop parcel floor take street,0.010890302115030623,0.9891096978849694,0.1071228266965788,0.2,0.8159794142818005,81.59794142818005,High Trust
CLLO,/users/537cbed5000064000174ce05,GB,20.0,2023-12-14 13:14:54+00:00,1.0,NEW SCAM - DO NOT ORDER iPHONE or anything expensive - Warehouse or delivery THEFT!,"To all,We have been Amazon clients for a very long time.We have just ordered an iPhone XV for our daughter...when we received the package, we gave the Amazon code to the delivery guy. The package was sealed with tape. When we opened it their was a Dove lotion bottle - clearly the same weight and size of the iPhone.We called right away the customer service but Amazon said that the package was delivered. They were not nice at all and after 5' of conversation did not seem to care. We had to send photos and we are awaiting their answer within 3 days. This is theft. It can only have taken place in their warehouse or while it was delivered but...someone somewhere must have known what was in the package - which means access to Personal Data! DO NOT ORDER ANYTHING EXPENSIVE.NEW SCAM - DO NOT ORDER iPHONE or anything expensive - Warehouse or delivery THEFT!",2023-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,14.0,860,156,83,15,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,allwe amazon client long timewe ordered iphone xv daughterwhen received package gave amazon code delivery guy package sealed tape opened dove lotion bottle clearly weight size iphonewe called right away customer service amazon said package delivered nice conversation seem care send photo awaiting answer within day theft taken place warehouse delivered butsomeone somewhere must known package mean access personal data order anything expensivenew scam order iphone anything expensive warehouse delivery theft,0.26440981421076265,0.7355901857892373,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.6852936907633791,68.52936907633791,Medium Trust
Clive Baxter,/users/657ad930a9248200126ebf8a,DK,1.0,2023-12-14 12:30:15+00:00,1.0,Deplorable company with even more…,"Deplorable company with even more demented customer service. Was redirected to a different Amazon site when attempting to buy gift card for Australia. Finding out I had purchased to the German site. Of course, one might assume gift cards could be redeemed wherever, but no. It has to be with the place of purchase, and they have also blocked ability to purchase gift card with other gift cards and you guessed it - no refunds. So, money is now locked and completely unusable to my friend just relocating to Australia. I cannot over-stress the utter dissatisfaction experienced when your frankly laughable self-help/ chat bot customer service is not even able to provide the simplest of answers. And even more so when it is absolutely impossible to reach an actual human being. Will look forward to keep following the shockingly poor reviews you get and root for more people to avoid Amazon and your arrogant business practices.",2023-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,14.0,927,156,34,5,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,deplorable company even demented customer service redirected different amazon site attempting buy gift card australia finding purchased german site course one might assume gift card could redeemed wherever place purchase also blocked ability purchase gift card gift card guessed refund money locked completely unusable friend relocating australia cannot overstress utter dissatisfaction experienced frankly laughable selfhelp chat bot customer service even able provide simplest answer even absolutely impossible reach actual human look forward keep following shockingly poor review get root people avoid amazon arrogant business practice,0.017872409724542213,0.9821275902754578,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.8085623930064894,80.85623930064894,High Trust
Andrew  Widdall,/users/5e7e128487efac7c90cf4bf7,GB,8.0,2023-12-14 00:46:17+00:00,1.0,Incredibly stupid system at Amazon,"Incredibly stupid system at Amazon! The driver turned up at my house with a chainsaw and then drove away.I caught up with him at the bottom of our lane and he had the box with my name & address on it but wouldn't give it me because his tracking system wouldn't go green. I had photo ID, a car with my initials on the reg plate and he agreed the name and address on the parcel matched the address he'd just visited.Total madness he drove away with it.Amazon also have sold me 2 HP printers with a three year warranty but when you go to the HP site they're not on the list for the extended warranty.Can't get any sense out of HP or Amazon, in the end Amazon just cut you off on the call. IT's a shambles and a con!",2023-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,14.0,712,142,34,5,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,incredibly stupid system amazon driver turned house chainsaw drove awayi caught bottom lane box name address wouldnt give tracking system wouldnt go green photo id car initial reg plate agreed name address parcel matched address hed visitedtotal madness drove away itamazon also sold hp printer three year warranty go hp site theyre list extended warrantycant get sense hp amazon end amazon cut call shamble con,0.55544880410342,0.44455119589658,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.5382038088288285,53.820380882882844,Medium Trust
Pacic Customer,/users/656f926b58ab9c0012140fa2,US,3.0,2023-12-14 00:15:39+00:00,1.0,"Amazon is really going down hill, their AI customer service tanks, no ""Free Returns"" honored without some real hassles and time wasters","Recently ordered a new ($750) item on Amazon (they were the seller/vendor and the shipper) and it said ""Free Returns."" Decided against the item and when I went to return online via the AMZ app, Amazon provided a generic mailing label but no postage and no accommodation to return or drop off at UPS store or even Unholyfood$.Have been ordering from then for over a decade and spent thousands a year on their site.Buyer beware. As long as you don't return anything you might be okay, but my experience has been sad and a time waster lately when trying to chat with their AI customer service",2023-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,14.0,589,106,135,22,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,recently ordered new item amazon sellervendor shipper said free return decided item went return online via amz app amazon provided generic mailing label postage accommodation return drop ups store even unholyfoodhave ordering decade spent thousand year sitebuyer beware long dont return anything might okay experience sad time waster lately trying chat ai customer service,0.0028492572838578643,0.9971507427161421,0.05945036455412227,0.2,0.8104654442688954,81.04654442688954,High Trust
James,/users/63d4045e4a5c9100125a5f44,GB,2.0,2023-12-13 23:45:47+00:00,1.0,I ordered a 4K Blu-ray Disc,"I ordered a 4K Blu-ray Disc. It was coming from the states. Fine. Said DPD would be delivering it.. okay. Would prefer Amazon but okay. Then I start getting emails from Evri… Evri decided that they weren’t even going to attempt delivery, marked my item as damaged return to seller. Whats the point in ordering from Amazon if they’re going to use Evri?! Your just giving Amazon your money for a couple of weeks while they screw you around and Evri never deliver. 17  year prime member here. Cancelled..",2023-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,13.0,501,89,27,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered k bluray disc coming state fine said dpd would delivering okay would prefer amazon okay start getting email evri… evri decided weren’t even going attempt delivery marked item damaged return seller whats point ordering amazon they’re going use evri giving amazon money couple week screw around evri never deliver year prime member cancelled,0.10330772116589855,0.8966922788341014,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.7583293138421769,75.83293138421769,High Trust
lucas savill,/users/6579b7e50cd51300120d06c5,GB,8.0,2023-12-13 23:18:20+00:00,3.0,Good marketplace,"Decent company has a wide variety of products as you would expect from Amazon. The customer service is slowly becoming better and better. I like shopping with Amazon as it is quick and reliable and I can always get a refund if needed. However I think there are some areas that could be improved, for example, the way they treat their staff and handle goods",2023-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,13.0,356,65,16,2,6.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,decent company wide variety product would expect amazon customer service slowly becoming better better like shopping amazon quick reliable always get refund needed however think area could improved example way treat staff handle good,0.09401281473254398,0.905987185267456,0.03645541222658441,0.6,1.360284675079045,136.02846750790448,High Trust
RealNorthBen,/users/5f4785024630aa70fc0407f2,GB,7.0,2023-12-13 22:04:50+00:00,3.0,Good and bads,"Overall not too bad, amazing prices and basically everything you need. Smooth process of buying and returning of items, never had any issues in that area, my only pretty big minus is there courier drivers, 90% of the time they either knock and leave in full view of people walking past and are back in there van and driven off before you even open the door, or most the time they don't even knock on the door and leave it in full view of people, if I didn't follow the tracking as closely as I do I wouldn't be surprised if half my parcels get stolen. Overall amazing shopping experience but extremely lacking in courier drivers.",2023-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,13.0,629,116,13,3,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,overall bad amazing price basically everything need smooth process buying returning item never issue area pretty big minus courier driver time either knock leave full view people walking past back van driven even open door time dont even knock door leave full view people didnt follow tracking closely wouldnt surprised half parcel get stolen overall amazing shopping experience extremely lacking courier driver,0.03686978967000486,0.9631302103299951,0.06505888951205833,0.6,1.3945768830674092,139.45768830674092,High Trust
David Miodrag,/users/6579db520cd51300120d24e9,GB,2.0,2023-12-14 07:53:23+00:00,1.0,"A CAUTIONARY TALE: ABANDON ALL HOPE, YE WHO ORDER FROM HERE","I ordered an IPad Air from Amazon (the company itself rather than a Marketplace seller) on 24th November. It was meant to be my daughter’s Christmas present and it cost several hundred pounds. It should have been delivered to me on 26th November, though instead I was delivered a box of opened dry cat food. I presume that an Amazon employee somewhere along the chain took the IPad and replaced it with the cat food that they emptied to an equivalent weight.I phoned Amazon Customer Services on 26th November and explained what had happened. I asked I be sent an actual IPad Air, though was told I could only be refunded the money, and only once Amazon had “received my return” (the cat food). UPS collected the cat food from me on 27th and delivered it to Amazon on 28th November.Two and a half weeks and several phone calls to Amazon down the line I was told today that “hopefully” I should be refunded my money on 3rd January 2024 (38 days after I’d initially explained to Amazon what had happened and “returned” the item).Each Amazon Customer Services person over the past couple of weeks has treated me indifferently, as if I’m a customer who has returned an unwanted book rather than someone who has essentially been defrauded by an Amazon employee. In actual fact I’ve been treated worse than someone returning an unwanted book, as if it had been a low cost item that was being refunded I would have been reimbursed within 14 days, rather than it taking more than a month because of the financial cost involved. I have kept on being told to “be patient” and that I’ll be refunded in 5 to 10 days, though the date keeps being put back for no reason that anyone has explained, and now for some reason I won’t be refunded until 2024. It means my daughter will be without a Christmas present this year. No one at Amazon seems particularly bothered or sympathetic.I might continue to buy inexpensive items from Amazon that I can’t easily get elsewhere, though I certainly won’t be buying anything expensive from them again. Though buying from Amazon is often convenient, it is much safer to shop with a retailer with decent, accessible and relatively transparent Customer Services.",2023-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,14.0,2183,384,59,11,20.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered ipad air amazon company rather marketplace seller th november meant daughter’s christmas present cost several hundred pound delivered th november though instead delivered box opened dry cat food presume amazon employee somewhere along chain took ipad replaced cat food emptied equivalent weighti phoned amazon customer service th november explained happened asked sent actual ipad air though told could refunded money amazon “received return” cat food ups collected cat food th delivered amazon th novembertwo half week several phone call amazon line told today “hopefully” refunded money rd january day i’d initially explained amazon happened “returned” itemeach amazon customer service person past couple week treated indifferently i’m customer returned unwanted book rather someone essentially defrauded amazon employee actual fact i’ve treated worse someone returning unwanted book low cost item refunded would reimbursed within day rather taking month financial cost involved kept told “be patient” i’ll refunded day though date keep put back reason anyone explained reason won’t refunded mean daughter without christmas present year one amazon seems particularly bothered sympathetici might continue buy inexpensive item amazon can’t easily get elsewhere though certainly won’t buying anything expensive though buying amazon often convenient much safer shop retailer decent accessible relatively transparent customer service,0.0026253205613943702,0.9973746794386056,0.2153673583847448,0.2,0.8417608113962518,84.17608113962518,High Trust
Malcolm McSkimming,/users/5d19f9e73fc1c8c65b37f917,FR,5.0,2023-12-13 16:20:18+00:00,1.0,AMAZON E-GIFT CARD NIGHTMARE,"On 14/05/2023 I ordered an e-gift card for US$100 to be sent to an email address of a family member in the USA. The corresponding 95 euros was debited to my Amazon.fr account. No problem. The e-gift card was not delivered but after extensive tracing I established that the amount of 95euros was in actual fact deposited into the recipients Amazon.com account. Euros cannot be used for purchases on Amazon in the USA. It has been impossible to obtain a refund or to open the account section containing the 95 euros. Amazon have referred me to Amazon.fr, Amazon.uk, Amazon.es. All not interested. The 95 euros is now frozen in an Amazon.com account and nobody at Amazon is interested in assisting me to resolve the problem. I have to warn prospective users of e-gift cards to be aware of the difficulties and waste of time I am encountering.",2023-05-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,13.0,839,147,28,4,217.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered egift card u sent email address family member usa corresponding euro debited amazonfr account problem egift card delivered extensive tracing established amount euro actual fact deposited recipient amazoncom account euro cannot used purchase amazon usa impossible obtain refund open account section containing euro amazon referred amazonfr amazonuk amazones interested euro frozen amazoncom account nobody amazon interested assisting resolve problem warn prospective user egift card aware difficulty waste time encountering,0.0016071966435830898,0.9983928033564169,0.08244531688166012,0.2,0.8156854650545405,81.56854650545405,High Trust
Leia Wedholm,/users/6568a69ecdc57e0013689980,SE,4.0,2023-12-13 16:15:32+00:00,1.0,So..,"So... I tested Amazon prime for 30 days on my Google TV. Ten tried to login. Seems to be the right email and password but ""for my own protection"" they wanted to verify and sent a code to my old mobile number. I can't access that number anymore so I went forward to verify in some other way. There was no other way and their on website it said that I should contact Amazons international number. I did, and that number was out of service. So I guess I'll have to pay this forever and will never be able to access my account because I can't find any mail to them eather..",2023-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,13.0,569,112,4,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tested amazon prime day google tv ten tried login seems right email password protection wanted verify sent code old mobile number cant access number anymore went forward verify way way website said contact amazon international number number service guess ill pay forever never able access account cant find mail eather,0.02706951276545888,0.9729304872345411,0.0628154795288839,0.2,0.7990283395230473,79.90283395230473,High Trust
Stephen Pearson,/users/57236c910000ff000a1bc357,GB,107.0,2023-12-18 20:29:27+00:00,2.0,I ordered a paperback on the 26th of…,"I ordered a paperback on the 26th of October, the release date for that item was the first week in November. After the official release date had passed I was told the new date was now  the 5th of December. When I visited the Amazon web site today 13th of December and sign in a message comes up that I will be e-mailed when the paperback is sent out and can track my order.The book is now advertised on Amazon order it now 13th of December and get it by Saturday the 16th of December. I did phone amazon and spoke to a very helpful young lady but unfortunately, I still have no idea when my order will be sent out. Not very good.It is now the 18th of December still waiting for my order, phoned several times promised item would be delivered today by 08-00pm, it is now 08-16pm no sign of book. Been told it got lost in transportation, what a bunch of liars.",2023-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,18.0,858,166,37,8,5.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered paperback th october release date item first week november official release date passed told new date th december visited amazon web site today th december sign message come emailed paperback sent track orderthe book advertised amazon order th december get saturday th december phone amazon spoke helpful young lady unfortunately still idea order sent goodit th december still waiting order phoned several time promised item would delivered today pm pm sign book told got lost transportation bunch liar,0.3215766838810583,0.6784233161189417,0.09310151430173864,0.4,0.9578319609198186,95.78319609198186,High Trust
