Anthony Calleja,/users/5df34225214ad8390071e8fd,US,62.0,2023-12-13 03:21:25+00:00,1.0,I am sending you a 1-star review on…,"I am sending Amazon a 1-star review on Trust Pilot.You say there is suspicious activity on my account but refuse to explain.You have verified my phone number.You have my email and have been corresponding back and forth.I submitted my return request with the assistance of one of your employees.My order was incomplete, and some of the items were defective.I called in after doing the phone verification, and the call dropped. Your employee did not call me back.I called back and did not use the automatic verification; I was verified over the phone.I called in today because you sent me an email that said I had until the 21st of December to return the SD Cards, but I have yet to receive them in the first place.I ordered six; you sent me four and charged me for six.You are holding me accountable for your employees' incompetence.I submitted my ID, and you said you needed it because my account was compromised.Your system accepted my ID, and then you said it was blurry, but everything was clear and sharp.This is another excuse.Your system and the way you deal with returns are unfair.",2023-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,13.0,1089,189,36,8,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,sending amazon star review trust pilotyou say suspicious activity account refuse explainyou verified phone numberyou email corresponding back forthi submitted return request assistance one employeesmy order incomplete item defectivei called phone verification call dropped employee call backi called back use automatic verification verified phonei called today sent email said st december return sd card yet receive first placei ordered six sent four charged sixyou holding accountable employee incompetencei submitted id said needed account compromisedyour system accepted id said blurry everything clear sharpthis another excuseyour system way deal return unfair,0.12538990804428304,0.8746100919557169,0.10