Stacy Miller,/users/6578dcd80cd51300120c8e8a,US,2.0,2023-12-13 03:25:44+00:00,1.0,Amazon jerking me around,"Four months ago I bought 2 bike tires from Amazon.  I returned both tires in the same box because they were the wrong size for my bike.  A month after they received the tires, Amazon sent me an email saying they were going to charge my account for 1 of the tires because they didn't receive it, even though it was together in the box with the other one that they received.  I called customer service and they assured me that it was an error and they have both tires so they will not charge my account.  Then 4 months later I get another email from them saying that they again do not have the tires, and that they will be changing my account.  So I called them twice, and they assured me that this was sent out in error and they will not charge my account.  A week later they ended up charging my credit card.  I called them again, and now waiting for a refund.  I also called my credit card, and they said that if I don't get a refund with 5 business days, they will dispute the charges, and refund my account, and will cancel my credit card, and give me a new one so that Amazon can't keep doing this to me.  After this poor experience, I am going to stop shopping at Amazon because this is a waste of my time to deal with this crap from them just because they want to make a profit.",2023-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,13.0,1284,252,24,4,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,four month ago bought bike tire amazon returned tire box wrong size bike month received tire amazon sent email saying going charge account tire didnt receive even though together box one received called customer service assured error tire charge account month later get another email saying tire changing account called twice assured sent error charge account week later ended charging credit card called waiting refund also called credit card said dont get refund business day dispute charge refund account cancel credit card give new one amazon cant keep poor experience going stop shopping amazon waste time deal crap want make profit,0.027523663689589604,0.9724763363104104,0.14133482893998878,0.2,0.814505133943203,81.4505133943203,High Trust
