J Tweedie,/users/54d0fb900000ff0001a88338,GB,44.0,2023-12-09 17:17:43+00:00,1.0,Amazon failing to package items properly yet again!,"Two packages arrived from Amazon today - one looks like a return that had been re-sent out to me and the other was a dvd box set that had been sent in a bag! and as a result all the corners were damaged. Cheap prices are no good if your purchases arrive in such a state. Most my big purchases this year have been with other companies, all of whom package their goods properly. I will now try and buy my dvd’s elsewhere where possible - I already buy most my books from other sellers for that reason, which is rather ironic as that is how Amazon started. So until they start to pack things properly I will try to only buy things off them where condition isn’t so important! GET YOUR ACT TOGETHER AMAZON!",2023-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,9.0,702,135,51,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,two package arrived amazon today one look like return resent dvd box set sent bag result corner damaged cheap price good purchase arrive state big purchase year company package good properly try buy dvd’s elsewhere possible already buy book seller reason rather ironic amazon started start pack thing properly try buy thing condition isn’t important get act together amazon,0.8193748753875721,0.18062512461242786,0.07571508693213685,0.2,0.4054555796926413,40.54555796926413,Low Trust
