Lindsay Lee,/users/643fd554612df50012c46623,CA,6.0,2023-12-09 11:24:17+00:00,1.0,4 of my orders not being shipped!!,"4 of my orders not being shipped!!. I paid for them 9 days ago! Can’t cancel them because they say “shipping now” for like 2 days!!!!!!! Keep calling to see what’s happened and the staff keep telling me stuff that pops into their head, one was “item is delayed in transit to facility” another one was “your payment was cancelled” another one was “delayed because one item was slow” what’s next? A dinosaur ate my packages????!!!  I purchased them 9 days ago!! They all say “shipping now”lol, this is insane!! One of them was supposed to be delivered yesterday and it wasn’t and I can’t cancel the order because it says “shipping now” what a load of BS! NONE OF MY ORDERS THAT I PAID FOR 9 DAYS AGO ARE BEING SHIPPED!!  UPDATE***** orders are suppose to arrive today (Dec 9th) , and it still has NOT been shipped out!!!! This is crazy!! I can’t even cancel them!!!!!! Amazon figured out a loophole how to keep your money and not ship the orders!! They mark them as “shipping now” so you can’t cancel them and they don’t have to ship them out and your stuck in a loop with no product and they have your money!!",2023-12-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,9.0,1108,206,34,7,8.0,0,36,1,0,Genuine,order shipped paid day ago can’t cancel say “shipping now” like day keep calling see what’s happened staff keep telling stuff pop head one “item delayed transit facility” another one “your payment cancelled” another one “delayed one item slow” what’s next dinosaur ate package purchased day ago say “shipping now”lol insane one supposed delivered yesterday wasn’t can’t cancel order say “shipping now” load b none order paid day ago shipped update order suppose arrive today dec th still shipped crazy can’t even cancel amazon figured loophole keep money ship order mark “shipping now” can’t cancel don’t ship stuck loop product money,1.0,0.0,0.1155356141334829,0.2,0.32310712282669657,32.310712282669655,Low Trust
