Ingelina,/users/6015ba9ac04443001b62214d,NZ,2.0,2023-12-08 05:31:15+00:00,1.0,Robbers!!!!,"I bought a gift card for my sister and send it to her email address. She tried to use gift card, it was declined.then she received an email from Amazon that her account will be blocked.I and my sister contacted them via chat 4 times, they promised to fixI spoked twice on the phone, they promised to fix.They were never able to provide a case number. In my case speaking to their customer services is like speaking to a wall. Below is an exact copy of my conversation with Ridhi Jain on the 7/12/2024I: please advise amazon ombudsman email so that I can contact in case I cannot resolve this issue again.R: Yes sure. Is there anything else I can help you with?I: please advise amazon ombudsman emailR: as we dont have amazon ombudsman email.however request you to check your email and follow the steps to unblock the accountI: how do I escalate my issue further?R: Please allow me a momentI: what email I can use? can I use this?complaints at amazon.co.uk""Ridhi Jain just hung up on me as I started asking about emails I can send my concerns to.They did request latest bank statement from my sister. She supplied to them (I advised her to keep minimum amount of money on it in case they steal those too), but Amazon advised they are not satisfied with the statement and blocked her account.We cannot use gift card as Amazon blocked account of the recipient of the gift card. They will not reimburse money paid for gift card, they will not release gift card from blocked account. I sent emails to complaints at amazon.com managingdirector at amazon.co.uk; jeff at amazon.com  managingdirector at amazon.com; primary at amazon.com; resolution at amazon.com orders at amazon.com; charge-inquiries at amazon.com and NO ACTION !!!It's the worst customer services I have ever received in my life and not only this, but it's the only multinational company that stole money from me.at least with robbers you know they will be robbing you. with a big company you do not expect them to steal your money.",2023-12-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,8.0,1993,347,11,1,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,bought gift card sister send email address tried use gift card declinedthen received email amazon account blockedi sister contacted via chat time promised fixi spoked twice phone promised fixthey never able provide case number case speaking customer service like speaking wall exact copy conversation ridhi jain please advise amazon ombudsman email contact case cannot resolve issue againr yes sure anything else help withi please advise amazon ombudsman emailr dont amazon ombudsman emailhowever request check email follow step unblock accounti escalate issue furtherr please allow momenti email use use thiscomplaints amazoncoukridhi jain hung started asking email send concern tothey request latest bank statement sister supplied advised keep minimum amount money case steal amazon advised satisfied statement blocked accountwe cannot use gift card amazon blocked account recipient gift card reimburse money paid gift card release gift card blocked account sent email complaint amazoncom managingdirector amazoncouk jeff amazoncom managingdirector amazoncom primary amazoncom resolution amazoncom order amazoncom chargeinquiries amazoncom action worst customer service ever received life multinational company stole money meat least robber know robbing big company expect steal money,0.6383506637106107,0.36164933628938933,0.1946158160403814,0.2,0.5197478313527709,51.97478313527709,Medium Trust
Major Shopper,/users/586a8b5c0000ff000a67c219,US,18.0,2023-12-08 04:42:04+00:00,1.0,WORST CUSTOMER SERVICE IN HISTORY!,"I ordered $2,800 in gift cards to PRINT that were to be sent via email so that I could include them in Christmas cards to my employees. On the PREVIEW for the gift cards, it included the redeem code. When they arrived in my email (28 emails, one for each gift card) NO REDEEM CODES WERE THERE! It merely read to click the button to add to my Amazon account balance. NO! This is NOT what I ordered. So (after hunting forever for the chat option) I chatted for THIRTY MINUTES and at the end, they said they would have to transfer me to a ""gift card specialist."" After speaking with the specialist, they then said they had to call me so I gave them my number. After ANOTHER THIRTY MINUTES, the ""gift card specialist"" said she can't process that many codes for gift cards so she has to transfer me to a ""gift card specialist."" Uuummmmm aren't YOU a gift card specialist????? WHAT IS GOING ON WITH AMAZON! This is the worst experience I've ever had! I will NOT be buying gift cards for Amazon next year that's for sure! YOU JUST LOST OVER $3,000 IN ONE TRANSACTION PEOPLE!",2023-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,8.0,1067,200,34,5,1.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,ordered gift card print sent via email could include christmas card employee preview gift card included redeem code arrived email email one gift card redeem code merely read click button add amazon account balance ordered hunting forever chat option chatted thirty minute end said would transfer gift card specialist speaking specialist said call gave number another thirty minute gift card specialist said cant process many code gift card transfer gift card specialist uuummmmm arent gift card specialist going amazon worst experience ive ever buying gift card amazon next year thats sure lost one transaction people,0.996734942693296,0.003265057306704011,0.11217049915872125,0.2,0.32406662848509626,32.406662848509626,Low Trust
RICHARD GRAHAM,/users/656fc734c0833600123a891a,JM,4.0,2023-12-08 03:32:59+00:00,1.0,Seller Maltreatment,"I sold for Amazon for quite some time, until I was told I sold counterfeit merchandise. I sought to ask Amazon for verification which never came, no client ever complained as my suppliers were all certified. Amazon refused to send me a copy of the complaint from the company that I was a reseller associate of. Turns out the complaint was lodged by another associate but didn't matter to Amazon. They just wanted independent suppliers out. Then worst of it was they held on to $2800 of my money. Pity no negative stars can be given, they certainly deserve it. Customers don't know how badly the sellers are treated, this is just the tip of the many icebergs.",2023-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,8.0,658,118,19,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sold amazon quite time told sold counterfeit merchandise sought ask amazon verification never came client ever complained supplier certified amazon refused send copy complaint company reseller associate turn complaint lodged another associate didnt matter amazon wanted independent supplier worst held money pity negative star given certainly deserve customer dont know badly seller treated tip many iceberg,0.028643015284842553,0.9713569847151574,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.7989146112583078,79.89146112583077,High Trust
Adrian Juarez,/users/65726645a581380012de9528,PA,1.0,2023-12-08 03:14:13+00:00,1.0,Three orders with different issues,"I had been ordering on Amazon for a long time, and I have had inconveniences with them, but always revolved around reaching common ground, however, this time placed three different orders. One was retained in transit and it says it is impossible to deliver, that one will be refunded, but the other two... This is where the real issue is, I received one package empty and another one says delivered, but I never received it and they say there is nothing they can do! If you want to keep your money safe, do not buy at Amazon. One single bad experience did it all, taking my business elsewhere, for sure!",2023-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,8.0,603,110,34,5,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,ordering amazon long time inconvenience always revolved around reaching common ground however time placed three different order one retained transit say impossible deliver one refunded two real issue received one package empty another one say delivered never received say nothing want keep money safe buy amazon one single bad experience taking business elsewhere sure,0.24495017458134488,0.7550498254186551,0.06169377453729669,0.2,0.6898636676167869,68.98636676167868,Medium Trust
