Albert,/users/648907791c8a2e0012359841,US,3.0,2023-12-07 21:01:01+00:00,1.0,Long But Important On How Amazon Customer Service FAILS,"I placed an order on September 20th on amazon for two chairs one of the chairs showed up on September 23rd with holes in the fabric so i wanted to return it.  I've had issues in the past with replacements and the whole back and forth so I decided I'd just order a different chair thinking I'll just pay myself back once my refund is processed. I reach out to Amazon ""customer service"" and this is what they say: Customer contact date : 2023-09-24 01:16:54 PM PDT01:18 PM PDT Albert: Hello these chairs showed up with holes and rips and the seller wants me to pay to return this and I’m not really thinking that’s fair if I send you a product that’s damaged and you want to return them to me do you feel like you should pay to do so? 01:19 PM PDT Amal: Hi, Albert. Amal here to assist you today01:19 PM PDT Albert: Thank you hi Amal01:19 PM PDT Amal: I'm sorry to know that your order arrived damaged.Let me check and assist you with it.01:20 PM PDT Albert: Ok thank you01:21 PM PDT Amal: Thanks for waiting.01:22 PM PDT Amal: For seller items,if you try to create the return through the order, return label won't be prepaid.That's what happened.I'll contact the seller and inform them to provide prepaid return label for return01:23 PM PDT Albert: Ok i apologize i did click something that say no thanks ill do it for free and thought I was all set but i appreciate you for clearing it up for me and helping me out thank you01:24 PM PDT Amal: Please note that when you order an item from seller and if you need return label, we need to contact the seller.Don't request the return through your order01:25 PM PDT Amal: I've informed them to provide the prepaid label for return01:25 PM PDT Albert: ok thank you01:25 PM PDT Amal: You'll be receiving the label via email. You're most welcome! I hope I was able to assist you with this. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? 01:26 PM PDT Albert: That was it Thank you01:26 PM PDT Amal: It was a pleasure assisting you today!I think great! alright so my problem is taken care of right? I'll get the return label and send them back now.WRONG. Lilypelle reaches out to me amazon says this is the seller? anyway they say they'll send me a replacement cushion instead of my refund. I say no thanks as I already ordered my new chair.  Lilypelle stops replying to me at this point. So message amazon on again! I know this because I wait till the  27th of September and speak to Nashreen  She says: ""09:48 AM PDT Nashreen: No worries AlbertThe seller will contact you within 24-48 hrs and arrange the free pick up for you.In case, they not process the return within 48 hrs, we will file a-z claim for full refund without returning the item."" She also tells me to wait till Sept 29th and reach back out to Amazon for the claim to start. Customer contact date : 2023-09-29 05:38:22 PM PDT05:40 PM PDT Albert: Hi John I haven’t heard back from the seller regarding a pick up or a return label to ship back for free05:45 PM PDT John Zodin: Thank you for patiently waiting. I can see here that the seller responded to your Email and they are willing to give you the refund without returning the item, you can keep, dispose or donate the item, I can message the seller for you now, are you willing to accept their offer?05:45 PM PDT Albert: yes I’m happy to receive my refund that’s all I want05:46 PM PDT John Zodin: Alright, let me message the seller for you and to let them know that you are fine with their offer, it will only take a moment.05:46 PM PDT Albert: Thank youThe seller refunds me exactly half of my money back $106.70 i'll make this quick to catch you up from this point since you have the important stuff now.Going forward they are insistent I send back the Chairs now to get the rest of my money back. A-Z claim denied 11/13 because seller told them I shipped back an item that wasn't the correct item. I HADN'T SENT THEM ANYTHING YET, (yes, lilypelle lied and a-z asked no questions or for no proof from them or me) until i finally agree to because a manager tells me they would refund me the shipping cost once it's sent. Low and behold they are now refusing to refund me the shipping cost which amounted to $175.35 as it exceeds their max amount which if you read back NO ONE MENTIONED ANYTHING ABOUT A MAX AMOUNT ON THE SHIPPING. When they offered me to ship it back and pay me the shipping costs once it's received by the seller I took them at their word. Now not only am I out the other half of my refund as the seller still won't respond to me i'm also out the shipping costs because Amazon customer service can't do their most basic tasks properly. i'm now out a total of $282.05 and my lawyer says we start with a demand letter as I downloaded my data which included phone calls and messages back and forth So SEE YOU SOON AMAZON. also i recommend if they don't refund you to just dispute the charge @ bank",2023-09-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,7.0,4879,916,55,9,78.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,placed order september th amazon two chair one chair showed september rd hole fabric wanted return ive issue past replacement whole back forth decided id order different chair thinking ill pay back refund processed reach amazon customer service say customer contact date pm pdt pm pdt albert hello chair showed hole rip seller want pay return i’m really thinking that’s fair send product that’s damaged want return feel like pay pm pdt amal hi albert amal assist today pm pdt albert thank hi amal pm pdt amal im sorry know order arrived damagedlet check assist pm pdt albert ok thank pm pdt amal thanks waiting pm pdt amal seller itemsif try create return order return label wont prepaidthats happenedill contact seller inform provide prepaid return label return pm pdt albert ok apologize click something say thanks ill free thought set appreciate clearing helping thank pm pdt amal please note order item seller need return label need contact sellerdont request return order pm pdt amal ive informed provide prepaid label return pm pdt albert ok thank pm pdt amal youll receiving label via email youre welcome hope able assist anything else assist today pm pdt albert thank pm pdt amal pleasure assisting todayi think great alright problem taken care right ill get return label send back nowwrong lilypelle reach amazon say seller anyway say theyll send replacement cushion instead refund say thanks already ordered new chair lilypelle stop replying point message amazon know wait till th september speak nashreen say pdt nashreen worry albertthe seller contact within hr arrange free pick youin case process return within hr file az claim full refund without returning item also tell wait till sept th reach back amazon claim start customer contact date pm pdt pm pdt albert hi john haven’t heard back seller regarding pick return label ship back free pm pdt john zodin thank patiently waiting see seller responded email willing give refund without returning item keep dispose donate item message seller willing accept offer pm pdt albert yes i’m happy receive refund that’s want pm pdt john zodin alright let message seller let know fine offer take moment pm pdt albert thank youthe seller refund exactly half money back ill make quick catch point since important stuff nowgoing forward insistent send back chair get rest money back az claim denied seller told shipped back item wasnt correct item hadnt sent anything yet yes lilypelle lied az asked question proof finally agree manager tell would refund shipping cost sent low behold refusing refund shipping cost amounted exceeds max amount read back one mentioned anything max amount shipping offered ship back pay shipping cost received seller took word half refund seller still wont respond im also shipping cost amazon customer service cant basic task properly im total lawyer say start demand letter downloaded data included phone call message back forth see soon amazon also recommend dont refund dispute charge bank,0.5581349380949328,0.44186506190506725,0.5137408861469434,0.2,0.6236807081819223,62.36807081819224,Medium Trust
Ken Bradley,/users/5d7113f248d1f07619eb09b9,GB,4.0,2023-12-07 20:49:37+00:00,1.0,"Liars, time wasters","Free delivery for a piano book for my daughter (or so it says).So I sign up, proceed to checkout and then it tells me that I have to pay £3.99 for delivery.Thanks for wasting my precious time Amazon, well done!",2023-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,7.0,210,40,19,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,free delivery piano book daughter saysso sign proceed checkout tell pay £ deliverythanks wasting precious time amazon well done,0.09821099709391226,0.9017890029060878,0.022434099831744252,0.2,0.7553813214193927,75.53813214193927,High Trust
Ben Armstrong,/users/51cf8197000064000141e50d,GB,16.0,2023-12-07 20:48:01+00:00,1.0,A terrible outlet/online store.,"What a terrible outlet/online store.I have purchased a great deal for convenience,  however I'm going to be terminating for many reasons. One reason:The amount of terrible quality chinese crap that doesn't last long.Second reason:They class ""seller stores"" as being a separate entity and it's not made obvious you're buying from one of these stores until you hit a problem. Third reason:There's no quality control or testing on any products sold. I have purchased electrical items (240v) which are unsafe, to the point they'll kill someone who's not vigilant or knowledgeable.  Example? One of many, I purchased some ceiling spots. The wiring inside was needle thin, definitely not capable of 240v at the usual 13A. This is a fire hazard.  Furthermore,  its a metal chassis and there was no grounding of the chassis! A literal death trap.Fourth reason:The returns and refund processes. They completely ignore uk consumer law and I've reported them to trading standards numerous times. They're always Claiming that because it's a seller's shop they don't refund! News Flash, my contract is with amazon who take my money and who appear on my back statements.  Amazon have a separate contract with their seller stores. What SHOULD  happen is that ANY refund should be made by amazon and if its from a seller's shop, amazon claim that back from them.Fifth reason:Customer service.  Well lack of. Trying to contact them is a mission.  They're making it harder and harder to reach an actual human! Then when you do get through,  clearly indian call centre agents with fake names follow a standard,  generic script which in no way is relevant to a customer's specific issue.Sixth Reason:No refund without a return.  Example? I ordered a box of paper clips. It was poorly packaged and had split during transit.  There was a trail from my drive to the front door.  It was a wet day, so even when i cleaned them up, they couldn't be used.  I contacted customer service to explain and they said ""without a return we cannot refund "". What absolute nonsense. Seventh reason:Delivery and drivers.  I'm easy to find but i leave good instructions.  They always deliver to the wrongbplace. On the of chance they get it right, they leave gates open, don't knock on the door and they always lie saying ""handed to customer "" when you're lucky if you even see the van arrive or leave. Eighth reason:Amazon Prime TV. There's nothing worth watching anymore.  If you find one or 2 things they've started making additional charges and the amount of ads is beyond ridiculous and Furthermore they have no 4k or uhd content. *please note, the date stat3d is just one example of many*",2023-04-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,7.0,2655,447,31,4,236.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,terrible outletonline storei purchased great deal convenience however im going terminating many reason one reasonthe amount terrible quality chinese crap doesnt last longsecond reasonthey class seller store separate entity made obvious youre buying one store hit problem third reasontheres quality control testing product sold purchased electrical item v unsafe point theyll kill someone who vigilant knowledgeable example one many purchased ceiling spot wiring inside needle thin definitely capable v usual fire hazard furthermore metal chassis grounding chassis literal death trapfourth reasonthe return refund process completely ignore uk consumer law ive reported trading standard numerous time theyre always claiming seller shop dont refund news flash contract amazon take money appear back statement amazon separate contract seller store happen refund made amazon seller shop amazon claim back themfifth reasoncustomer service well lack trying contact mission theyre making harder harder reach actual human get clearly indian call centre agent fake name follow standard generic script way relevant customer specific issuesixth reasonno 