Kayleigh Breslin,/users/656f07257088530012238bc7,GB,1.0,2023-12-05 13:19:11+00:00,1.0,Poor,"I have shopped with amazon for years and haven't ever had problems up until recently. I ordered some presents expecting them to be delivered as normal, I had a notification to tell me they had been delivered and handed to the resident. This is completely false, no one in my household or neighbours had received my parcel. I contacted amazon and was told to wait 3 days to see if it was marked incorrectly and would be delivered slightly later. This didn't happen so I contacted amazon who agreed to give me a refund and told me to wait upto 7 days. After the 7 days had passed and I still hadn't received my refund I contacted them again to be told the refund hadn't even been issued and I would now need to wait another 7 days to receive my money back. Stupidly, I placed another order from amazon a couple of weeks later and am now having the exact same issue as previously described and the customer service I am receiving is absolutely disgusting. There is no clear pathway to make a complaint and none of the customer service advisers seem to be able to help me. I cannot make a complaint myself and cannot check the status of the complaint through the advisers. What kind or customer service is this?! So disappointed and I will not be ordering with them again once I receive my money back. Very frustrating.",2023-12-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,5.0,1315,242,4,1,3.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,shopped amazon year havent ever problem recently ordered present expecting delivered normal notification tell delivered handed resident completely false one household neighbour received parcel contacted amazon told wait day see marked incorrectly would delivered slightly later didnt happen contacted amazon agreed give refund told wait upto day day passed still hadnt received refund contacted told refund hadnt even issued would need wait another day receive money back stupidly placed another order amazon couple 