C.Lee,/users/656e7af4ff4b9d00121e19d4,US,2.0,2023-12-05 03:43:07+00:00,1.0,Allows Fraudulent Listings That Deceives Consumers,"I ordered several shirts from Veetrends on Amazon based on the listing saying free returns as I wasn't sure if the shirts would fit. They turned out to be too long, but when I tried to return the shirts, Veetrends lied and said Amazon would provide a pre-paid return label. I contacted Amazon and they said they do not provide pre-paid return labels for 3rd party sellers and I would have to pay to return the items. I asked Amazon how they are allowed to fraudulently list the items as free returns if that is not the case. They basically said they didn't know and it was my problem. Don't purchase anything from Veetrends. They are blatantly lying to people with their free returns listings, and Amazon sucks for not doing anything about it.",2023-12-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,5.0,743,134,50,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered several shirt veetrends amazon based listing saying free return wasnt sure shirt would fit turned long tried return shirt veetrends lied said amazon would provide prepaid return label contacted amazon said provide prepaid return label rd party seller would pay return item asked amazon allowed fraudulently list item free return case basically said didnt know problem dont purchase anything veetrends blatantly lying people free return listing amazon suck anything,0.009097069053520347,0.9909029309464796,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.8104823123605085,81.04823123605085,High Trust
