imatrustpilotreviewer,/users/656e4d643328540012a353b4,US,1.0,2023-12-05 00:06:38+00:00,5.0,"Amongst online retailers, it's great","I'm surprised at how many bad reviews are up here. While Amazon has probably gotten too big, and customer service has waned since the early days, it still is the most customer friendly online retailer I've ever used. Given the amount of individual shipping they do, it's amazing how quickly things get here, how often they're in great shape, and how easy it is to return things or get refunds when things go badly.",2023-08-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,5.0,414,74,36,5,123.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,im surprised many bad review amazon probably gotten big customer service waned since early day still customer friendly online retailer ive ever used given amount individual shipping amazing quickly thing get often theyre great shape easy return thing get refund thing go badly,0.0065723408272215095,0.9934276591727785,0.04150308468872686,1.0,2.0050144465241346,200.50144465241345,High Trust
