John G Amero,/users/623dcae647517c0013cb8570,US,6.0,2023-12-04 15:09:19+00:00,1.0,Amazon Refund = Amazon Hush Money,"On October 10, 2023 I purchased a nine pack of refurbished Nanoleaf octagon panels from Amazon.The final payment amount was $74.19.The item queued up in the Amazon app and Amazon website as being in process for delivery. Both the app and website told me my item was in the Amazon Georgia facility. ￼As the Delivery days would come and go I would then reach out to Customer Support at Amazon. Customer Support would say to me here’s a new delivery date and if it doesn’t come by this date we can offer you a refund. I would tell them each time I don’t want a refund, I want my product.￼I believe I called at least three times because the date slipped three times. By the third time I was pretty miffed and I asked it to be escalated to the management in customer service that I did not want a refund I want in my product the product that was basically still being offered as in stock even but all they kept saying was, we can give you a refund.So I get escalated to the manager and the manager says we can offer you a refund and nothing else. I said I’d like this escalated out of their customer service then and I was told no.￼I was told I could be issued a refund and re-order the item which is now more expensive or hang up that was it no other solution it was not gonna get escalated out of the customer service area for items are being offered as for sale items are purchasable items are getting stuck at Amazon and then Amazon is not making good with the process of delivery To make matters worse, is paying hush money to every customer that goes through this in the form of the refund. Amazon does not escalate any issues in his own company or if items are getting stolen having those escalated either they just pay off the customers with refunds ￼I didn’t ask for a refund I didn’t want a refund. I wanted the item that they had put on the website as for sale and that I purchased. Customer Support Management gave me the take it or leave it option and refused to escalate the fraud or inside the company, theft of the item.I would bet that Amazon uses this refund workflow to as I said silence the customer with hush money, but also not really reporting it appropriately potentially on the books because if they have excellent amount of sales, I can guarantee daily they have X amount of refunds that are you know just going and no one’s doing anything about it so they’re just Sending in the outdoor and out the indoor.Customer should not be getting refunds from Amazon. Amazon should be delivering the items that they had for sale.",2023-12-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,4.0,2541,476,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,october purchased nine pack refurbished nanoleaf octagon panel amazonthe final payment amount item queued amazon app amazon website process delivery app website told item amazon georgia facility ￼as delivery day would come go would reach customer support amazon customer support would say here’s new delivery date doesn’t come date offer refund would tell time don’t want refund want product￼i believe called least three time date slipped three time third time pretty miffed asked escalated management customer service want refund want product product basically still offered stock even kept saying give refundso get escalated manager manager say offer refund nothing else said i’d like escalated customer service told no￼i told could issued refund reorder item expensive hang solution gonna get escalated customer service area item offered sale item purchasable item getting stuck amazon amazon making good process delivery make matter worse paying hush money every customer go form refund amazon escalate issue company item getting stolen escalated either pay customer refund ￼i didn’t ask refund didn’t want refund wanted item put website sale purchased customer support management gave take leave option refused escalate fraud inside company theft itemi would bet amazon us refund workflow said silence customer hush money also really reporting appropriately potentially book excellent amount sale guarantee daily x amount refund know going one’s anything they’re sending outdoor indoorcustomer getting refund amazon amazon delivering item sale,0.004272465396263815,0.9957275346037362,0.2669657879977566,0.2,0.8512569249014194,85.12569249014193,High Trust
Steve Tessier,/users/577da11f0000ff000a2f9654,CA,19.0,2023-12-04 14:55:35+00:00,1.0,Amazon is a stupid company,"Amazon is a stupid company. The first thing is the prices. If you see an item when you Google it on Amazon don’t buy it right away. Search the same item on Amazon. Amazon is like eBay so there are many prices from the different sellers. The second problem is China sellers claiming the part you want fits your item. Often it doesn’t. Lastly, they leave a package at you door when you are home? They do this all the time because they take a picture. There is no Customer Service. They are responsible if it is stolen period. Check the law. The problems are all because Jeff Bezos, his is an idiot like all Billionaires.",2023-12-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,4.0,618,116,26,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon stupid company first thing price see item google amazon don’t buy right away search item amazon amazon like ebay many price different seller second problem china seller claiming part want fit item often doesn’t lastly leave package door home time take picture customer service responsible stolen period check law problem jeff bezos idiot like billionaire,0.01149065095632854,0.9885093490436715,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.8072664524242474,80.72664524242474,High Trust
