SmellyAlley,/users/5497e69400006400019f59c0,GB,22.0,2023-12-04 13:22:52+00:00,1.0,Sly re-charge of returns,"Returning more than one item in one parcel - you will not be refunded for all of them. In June I orderd 10 boxes of gloves. I opened one box and realised that they were of poor quality and sent the whole lot back in the same box in which they were delivered. I was immediately refunded for all 10 boxes, but as the months went by I saw in my bank account that I was re-charged for individual items that they claim did not arrive. Only because I do my own bookkeeping did I realise what had happened. This has happened many times with other orders and I have decided to close my Amazon account because the returns process is unreliable and untrustworthy.",2023-12-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,4.0,653,124,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,returning one item one parcel refunded june orderd box glove opened one box realised poor quality sent whole lot back box delivered immediately refunded box month went saw bank account recharged individual item claim arrive bookkeeping realise happened happened many time order decided close amazon account return process unreliable untrustworthy,0.03073044459752851,0.9692695554024715,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.7985439195969172,79.85439195969171,High Trust
