Dennis Hinrichsen,/users/656d33ef3eae850012f6d3ab,GB,1.0,2023-12-04 04:05:50+00:00,1.0,Ship USPS General Delivery,"How do you get packages when you are on an extended trip? You can’t trust AMAZON to ship UPS to a UPS depot or store. AMAZON is shipping everything through USPS initially. USPS staff is pissed off and resistant. It took me a week to get one package that supposedly was delivered on 11 27,23. Again I’m enduring the same hostile environment with an item I ordered on November 26…maybe arriving December 10…it’s coming from AMAZON Maryland.",2023-11-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,4.0,438,77,26,4,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,get package extended trip can’t trust amazon ship ups ups depot store amazon shipping everything usps initially usps staff pissed resistant took week get one package supposedly delivered i’m enduring hostile environment item ordered november …maybe arriving december …it’s coming amazon maryland,0.01580774751568895,0.9841922524843111,0.04318564217610768,0.2,0.8007332546773771,80.0733254677377,High Trust
Casey,/users/6005c20e101b8b001a1fbf62,CA,9.0,2023-12-04 01:19:09+00:00,1.0,Disregards Customer Privacy and Protection,"I have prime membership but for many purchases they no longer give the option to have purchases disguised in an unmarked Amazon box, that my goods are vulnerable to porch pirates.  The vacuum I ordered I had requested it be in an Amazon box , but they neglected to do so and slapped the label on the vacuum box and left it against my front door without even ringing my bell.  It could have been stolen.  Those scum knuckleheads.",2023-12-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,4.0,428,79,42,5,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,prime membership many purchase longer give option purchase disguised unmarked amazon box good vulnerable porch pirate vacuum ordered requested amazon box neglected slapped label vacuum box left front door without even ringing bell could stolen scum knucklehead,0.03858812164806996,0.9614118783519301,0.0443073471676949,0.2,0.7895674086095039,78.95674086095039,High Trust
Susan Davies,/users/5c42df70703a7630518ed1cb,GB,15.0,2023-12-03 23:08:10+00:00,1.0,Misleading delivery message,Received a message that my parcel had been left with a neighbour. I asked my husband to check and when he opened the door the parcel fell in. It was not wrapped. It was electrical equipment and it was raining heavily. The contents of the box were obvious and could easily have been stolen. We live close to a busy main road.,2023-12-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,3.0,324,62,27,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,received message parcel left neighbour asked husband check opened door parcel fell wrapped electrical equipment raining heavily content box obvious could easily stolen live close busy main road,0.09853440102345032,0.9014655989765497,0.034772854739203586,0.2,0.7576873704361156,75.76873704361155,High Trust
customer,/users/5cd8176d083ba95047b49d28,GB,15.0,2023-12-03 20:59:53+00:00,1.0,Fed up with Amazon delivery risk,"I’m fed up with seeing Amazon deliveries left by our front door; the packages are visible from the road (security risk) and exposed to the weather. Nothing untoward has happened up until today - the package was wet, having been covered in snow for two days. Why not walk to the back of the house and overcome both issues?!",2023-12-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,3.0,322,59,32,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,i’m fed seeing amazon delivery left front door package visible road security risk exposed weather nothing untoward happened today package wet covered snow two day walk back house overcome issue,0.16646469543585984,0.8335353045641402,0.03309029725182277,0.2,0.7233857117324346,72.33857117324347,Medium Trust
