Morman Dragos-Cristian,/users/606c1ff926bd26001b439ce2,GB,5.0,2023-12-03 19:25:50+00:00,1.0,Today,"Today, I checked my orders and it was showing two stops to my delivery, as was Sunday, I had some plans and I was happy when I notice that in a short time I'm going to receive my parcels.  So I confirm my plans to my family.  About 1 hour after that, when I check again, the system was showing that the driver has few more deliveries to do until he is going to arrive with my parcels.  This few more deliveries took him from 1pm to 5pm .Between this hours I call customer service asking why is change because I made some plans and now I need to change everything? They couldn't say why because that information is confidential, and I've got a prime membership. In conclusion, Amazon manage to distribute my Sunday, and is not the drivers fault.",2023-12-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,3.0,744,140,5,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,today checked order showing two stop delivery sunday plan happy notice short time im going receive parcel confirm plan family hour check system showing driver delivery going arrive parcel delivery took pm pm hour call customer service asking change made plan need change everything couldnt say information confidential ive got prime membership conclusion amazon manage distribute sunday driver fault,0.027204529994940833,0.9727954700050592,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.8021016048847505,80.21016048847504,High Trust
Dottie,/users/5bb528b34de5666d34de825c,PA,49.0,2023-12-03 17:53:08+00:00,1.0,Shame on me!,"On September 4, 2023 I gave Amazon a 1-star review (since a ZERO was not an option) and stated I would never order from Amazon again. Well, I goofed--and placed another order on November 28, 2023. At the time I had almost $7.00 remaining on my account. I canceled the order within minutes. When I checked my account, my credit had disappeared! Silly me, I called Amazon. Going through two different people, giving the same information twice, verifying via email my name twice, I was finally directed to a ""specialist."" She asked question after question, had an accent I could barely understand, and it sounded like 50 people were chattering in a foreign language in the same room. Perversely, I didn't hang up--I wanted to see how long the ""process"" took. I carried my phone with me while I worked on other tasks in my home. Well, 40 minutes later, she told me I'd get a credit on my credit card ""within 3-5 days"" later.Shame on me for daring to do business with Amazon again. And sadly, Bezos doesn't give a s**t and never responds to any of the negative reviews.",2023-12-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,3.0,1064,191,12,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,september gave amazon star review since zero option stated would never order amazon well goofedand placed another order november time almost remaining account canceled order within minute checked account credit disappeared silly called amazon going two different people giving information twice verifying via email name twice finally directed specialist asked question question accent could barely understand sounded like people chattering foreign language room perversely didnt hang upi wanted see long process took carried phone worked task home well minute later told id get credit credit card within day latershame daring business amazon sadly bezos doesnt give st never responds negative review,0.21589689281404745,0.7841031071859526,0.1071228266965788,0.2,0.7134761189322921,71.34761189322921,Medium Trust
Yi Yin,/users/6104c9c900d7530012290229,US,4.0,2023-12-03 17:40:56+00:00,1.0,"Amazon customer service manipulating, gaslighting, double speaking, terrible was not enough to describe","I am writing this review to share a recent experience with Amazon that has left me deeply disappointed and concerned. After purchasing a Panasonic camera, I discovered that it was missing an essential component - the battery charger. This led me to contact Amazon's customer service, where I expected a simple and straightforward resolution. However, what transpired was far from satisfactory.My interaction with a customer service manager named Cris, based in the Philippines, was not only unhelpful but also deeply troubling. Cris's approach to handling my concern was evasive and unprofessional. The situation escalated to a point where, following my expressed dissatisfaction, I received a notification about ""abnormal activity"" on my account, which I believe was a retaliatory action.This experience has raised serious concerns about the misuse of power within Amazon's customer service. The treatment I received was not just poor service; it bordered on tactics I would associate with organized crime - using intimidation and authority to suppress and control. As a customer of over 18 years, I am shocked and appalled.I believe such behavior within Amazon's ranks is unacceptable and poses a significant risk to customer trust and loyalty. I urge Amazon to address this issue seriously and take necessary steps to ensure that no other customer experiences such treatment. Until then, my confidence in Amazon and my decision to continue as a customer remains uncertain.",2023-11-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,3.0,1475,228,103,13,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,writing review share recent experience amazon left deeply disappointed concerned purchasing panasonic camera discovered missing essential component battery charger led contact amazon customer service expected simple straightforward resolution however transpired far satisfactorymy interaction customer service manager named cris based philippine unhelpful also deeply troubling criss approach handling concern evasive unprofessional situation escalated point following expressed dissatisfaction received notification abnormal activity account believe retaliatory actionthis experience raised serious concern misuse power within amazon customer service treatment received poor service bordered tactic would associate organized crime using intimidation authority suppress control customer year shocked appalledi believe behavior within amazon rank unacceptable pose significant risk customer trust loyalty urge amazon address issue seriously take necessary step ensure customer experience treatment confidence amazon decision continue customer remains uncertain,0.00766907133522351,0.9923309286647765,0.12787436904094224,0.2,0.8217403381405767,82.17403381405767,High Trust
