Customer,/users/5b7fd89c4de5666d346ec347,GB,20.0,2023-12-04 08:24:54+00:00,1.0,Very poor customer care from Amazon Avoid!,"Ordered two pulse / oximeter - one was faulty the other poorly constructed and non functioning. The latter sent broken with loose parts. Stated can't return as medical device but they accepted the first one, another pulse / oxyimeter. So their statement that no medical devices are returnable is false. Breaking UK law re. 14 day distant selling regulation is not prudent. The non return was never made clear on website prior to ordering. Phoned in two occasions the Amazon put the phone down. Really poor service as needed to turn item and get a replacement. Contacted manufacturer Nonin who do not respond. Again poor advice from Amazon to contact them. Avoid Nonin and be really careful about returns back to Amazon. This is not the 'worlds most customer centric company'.",2023-11-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,4.0,775,131,42,7,17.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered two pulse oximeter one faulty poorly constructed non functioning latter sent broken loose part stated cant return medical device accepted first one another pulse oxyimeter statement medical device returnable false breaking uk law day distant selling regulation prudent non return never made clear website prior ordering phoned two occasion amazon put phone really poor service needed turn item get replacement contacted manufacturer nonin respond poor advice amazon contact avoid nonin really careful return back amazon world customer centric company,0.011990358325123367,0.9880096416748766,0.07347167694896242,0.2,0.8086991562272308,80.86991562272307,High Trust
