Lunch Box,/users/6559c5f917ba6500120c8024,CA,1.0,2023-12-02 02:36:50+00:00,1.0,"Garbage, INCOMPETENT Customer Service","Canceled an order, the replaced the order and Amazon suspended my account under ""suspicion of fraud.""Called customer service- several times, and not only could I not understand the 8 different Indian call reps, but they couldn't understand me, and I repeated my e-mail alone no less than 37 times! After asking to be put through to ""someone who speaks English as a first f**king language"", they hung up on me, and when I called back, they had completely locked my account for fraud!My account is in my name. My credit card linked to my account is in my name. My address correlates to the address on my card. The order was to be shipped to my address... Can't think of how this makes ANY sense! HOW IS IT FRAUD?!!2 days later, I get an e-mail saying the order has been shipped... yet I'm still locked out of my account!So, if there is fraud on your account, they still ship it out but lock you out of your account so you can't dispute anything!Also missing a promotion for a game key which was supposed to be e-mailed to me, which I haven't received.I will update this in the future.I am filing a lawsuit in small claims court!",2023-11-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,2.0,1126,206,37,4,3.0,0,8,1,0,Genuine,canceled order replaced order amazon suspended account suspicion fraudcalled customer service several time could understand different indian call rep couldnt understand repeated email alone less time asking put someone speaks english first fking language hung called back completely locked account fraudmy account name credit card linked account name address correlate address card order shipped address cant think make sense fraud day later get email saying order shipped yet im still locked accountso fraud account still ship lock account cant dispute anythingalso missing promotion game key supposed emailed havent receivedi update futurei filing lawsuit small claim court,0.9993882262210783,0.0006117737789217426,0.1155356141334829,0.2,0.32341300971615744,32.341300971615745,Low Trust
