David Stone,/users/57330d6d0000ff000a1f1d32,GB,138.0,2023-11-29 11:44:32+00:00,1.0,The worst ever contact with Customer Service,"I have just experienced the worst ever LiveChat with any Customer Service. At least FOUR times I explained what I needed and each time the response was irrelevant and unhelpful.In the past, if you needed to view someone's Wish List all you needed to do was search for their name. I already knew the person's name and email address and the only suggestions were to email her, create a list and even send her my list!I don't expect a lost sale will bother Amazon.",2023-11-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,29.0,461,84,44,7,0.0,0,1,2,1,Suspicious,experienced worst ever livechat customer service least four time explained needed time response irrelevant unhelpfulin past needed view someone wish list needed search name already knew person name email address suggestion email create list even send listi dont expect lost sale bother amazon,0.8957952793362948,0.10420472066370523,0.04711160964666293,0.2,0.36152468226118517,36.152468226118515,Low Trust
