Silki TheCraftyDiva,/users/5a79d8e564c8174c8cf37d2a,US,6.0,2023-11-29 00:12:37+00:00,2.0,Going Downhill,"Amazon use to be an amazing company but lately over the last couple of years the services have gone down tremendously, when ordering items; a lot of the time the date they promise is not met, I have been getting a message every four orders or,"" your item has been delayed"". Sometimes they send used products when you pay for new products, sometimes the products are not authentic. When you leave a bad review for a prodcut that you ordered off their site they ban you from leaving anymore comments. And now they are charging a small fee for returns, when it use to be free.",2023-11-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,29.0,573,106,14,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon use amazing company lately last couple year service gone tremendously ordering item lot time date promise met getting message every four order item delayed sometimes send used product pay new product sometimes product authentic leave bad review prodcut ordered site ban leaving anymore comment charging small fee return use free,0.023793879410508752,0.9762061205894913,0.05945036455412227,0.4,1.0999931332055701,109.99931332055701,High Trust
This Girl,/users/65665e18eaaf540012eadc3e,US,1.0,2023-11-28 23:51:11+00:00,1.0,Amazon is NOT what they used to be,"The ease of ordering, simplicity of returning, competitive pricing, quick deliveries, great customer service are ALL things of the past. I’ve been a Prime customer for over 10 years. These clowns not delivering items by the delivery date has gone too far this time. My husband ordered a portable SSD. Delivery date stated November 27th. On the 27th I saw an update that said it would be delivered between 1:35pm to 3:35pm. Then later another update said it would arrive “before 10pm”. Then at 8:30pm, I looked up the status again and it said, “your new delivery date is December 21” WTH?!?! When I called, the representative read off the new delivery parameters on the item…which WERE NOT the same as when my husband placed the order. So annoyed.",2023-11-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,28.0,746,129,34,8,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,ease ordering simplicity returning competitive pricing quick delivery great customer service thing past i’ve prime customer year clown delivering item delivery date gone far time husband ordered portable ssd delivery date stated november th th saw update said would delivered pm pm later another update said would arrive “before pm” pm looked status said “your new delivery date december ” wth called representative read new delivery parameter item…which husband placed order annoyed,0.22818539616883546,0.7718146038311645,0.0723499719573752,0.2,0.7003772963070573,70.03772963070573,Medium Trust
Thomas,/users/6566387e575ddb0011978a8d,US,2.0,2023-11-28 21:27:54+00:00,1.0,Amazon scammed me and illegally charged my card and refused refund,"I've been a customer for over 10 years and all was good until the last year. I noticed my orders take longer and longer to arrive and some of the items were damaged, Amazon refused to give me refunds. My last order from 2 weeks ago they illegally charged my debit card $20 more and refused to refund the money. That was my gas money to go to work and now I'm screwed. Their customer service chat agents on their website are a complete joke, they are from India and are completely disrespectful and dishonest. I will never order anything from this company EVER AGAIN. I contacted my bank and they reversed the charge so at least I got my money back. Amazon is completely ridiculous and I hope to see the day they go BANKRUPT.",2023-11-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,28.0,724,136,66,11,10.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ive customer year good last year noticed order take longer longer arrive item damaged amazon refused give refund last order week ago illegally charged debit card refused refund money gas money go work im screwed customer service chat agent website complete joke india completely disrespectful dishonest never order anything company ever contacted bank reversed charge least got money back amazon completely ridiculous hope see day go bankrupt,0.008074393873435264,0.9919256061265648,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.8112179909488685,81.12179909488685,High Trust
