Michael Hardy,/users/53bba8d800006400017db3e7,GB,2.0,2023-11-28 18:33:17+00:00,1.0,I phone delivered to wrong address,"I phone delivered to wrong address.  they asked me to get a crime report number from police ..done...they then said once the case is closed they will do a 3 way call to confirm and issue a refund...when the case was closed they refused to do the 3 way call and said my police report was invalid, which the email they sent me said nothing of the sort and twice two customer care agents hung up on me, and refused to send me evidence of any email ever saying the report was invalid..The police have evidence the phone went to the wrong address as the person admited it and said they left it back on their porch and it must have been stolen from there...(whatever)....they have basically just stolen my money and are refusing to hear police evidence to issue a refund in a 3 way call......avoid at all costs buying anything of any value from this company .....we are now without a phone and had to re buy from elsewhere.",2023-11-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,28.0,917,171,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,phone delivered wrong address asked get crime report number police donethey said case closed way call confirm issue refundwhen case closed refused way call said police report invalid email sent said nothing sort twice two customer care agent hung refused send evidence email ever saying report invalidthe police evidence phone went wrong address person admited said left back porch must stolen therewhateverthey basically stolen money refusing hear police evidence issue refund way callavoid cost buying anything value company without phone buy elsewhere,0.02564081915208782,0.9743591808479122,0.09590577678070668,0.2,0.8063607457800973,80.63607457800973,High Trust
