Ruth Chapman,/users/61e53b9c866c2b0012ef41b0,GB,9.0,2023-11-27 10:50:48+00:00,1.0,I’ve been a prime customer for years,"I’ve been a prime customer for years. After last week I have cancelled prime membership and will no longer use Amazon to purchase. The chat agents have lied to me on a number of occasions. Promising me the order is on its way, when knowing full well it isn’t. Also saying the package has been marked delivered so cannot refund until I fill in an investigation form. When I asked for proof of delivery than said they didn’t have the exact details. So once again lied and made me to lots of work to hope that I give up.",2023-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,27.0,517,99,36,7,11.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,i’ve prime customer year last week cancelled prime membership longer use amazon purchase chat agent lied number occasion promising order way knowing full well isn’t also saying package marked delivered cannot refund fill investigation form asked proof delivery said didn’t exact detail lied made lot work hope give,0.013425348244888776,0.9865746517551113,0.055524397083567024,0.2,0.8043922052942691,80.43922052942692,High Trust
