Jonesy Jones,/users/5ff887e2928b2a00194c0da8,GB,13.0,2023-11-27 03:42:10+00:00,1.0,Where to start,"Where to start? A week of poor Amazon service. The main issues were as a prime member I ordered three items for next day delivery. I waited all day as were vehicle parts and tools. When they arrived one of the parts was missing, A rear brake master cylinder. After over an hour of trying to contact them I got through to a chat with a human person.  They refunded the money for the part but this was not the point. The person on chat did not understand why I was not happy for a refund. I needed the part, it was that simple. They then promised if I reordered the part it would arrive early the next day. I explained I had no faith in this but after half an hour of chatting on their app and them continually making the same promise I relented and repurchased the item than them was to arrive next day...today. that did not happen,I got a new email promising it tomorrow,  Monday. That is not in time, I missed a weekend of working on my vehicle and limited remaining time this year to use it. Amazon has no understanding of customer service and think the promise of a £5 gift card as compensation resolves every issue. Really not good enough. I pay for Prime, it is n9t free and does not often provide the service quality promised. From now on will be looking to shop in my own locality where I get to see the goods as I buy them. Really disappointed",2023-11-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,27.0,1351,259,14,3,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,start week poor amazon service main issue prime member ordered three item next day delivery waited day vehicle part tool arrived one part missing rear brake master cylinder hour trying contact got chat human person refunded money part point person chat understand happy refund needed part simple promised reordered part would arrive early next day explained faith half hour chatting app continually making promise relented repurchased item arrive next daytoday happeni got new email promising tomorrow monday time missed weekend working vehicle limited remaining time year use amazon understanding customer service think promise £ gift card compensation resolve every issue really good enough pay prime nt free often provide service quality promised looking shop locality get see good buy really disappointed,0.008828458006670009,0.99117154199333,0.14526079641054404,0.2,0.8246379302787737,82.46379302787737,High Trust
glenn green,/users/62cde04c14d6ed001277df73,CA,6.0,2023-12-09 15:50:25+00:00,2.0,There’s nothing Amazing about Amazon,"The main problem with Amazon is their system of delivery. It’s extremely convenient and easy to order items on the app, but receiving the items when you’ve paid extra money to have items delivered the next day, is a different story. Add to that their customer service reps who most of the time seem clueless as to how to do their jobs. Inquiring about merchandise you’ve purchased has never been so difficult. Their service is extremely inconsistent to the point of incompetency. I will not be using their service for any future purchases. And to add to this review, my last two purchases were terrible. A shirt was ordered over three weeks ago, and I was just notified last week regarding this item.The reply was  that the item could not be delivered due to a non-legit seller. My last order of a toaster was it for me. You are better off going to a store to purchase items, where at least you don’t go through any hassles.",2023-11-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,9.0,924,167,36,5,13.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,main problem amazon system delivery it’s extremely convenient easy order item app receiving item you’ve paid extra money item delivered next day different story add customer service rep time seem clueless job inquiring merchandise you’ve purchased never difficult service extremely inconsistent point incompetency using service future purchase add review last two purchase terrible shirt ordered three week ago notified last week regarding itemthe reply item could delivered due nonlegit seller last order toaster better going store purchase item least don’t go hassle,0.00830645598831532,0.9916935440116846,0.09366236679753225,0.4,1.1145792453653487,111.45792453653488,High Trust
