Jim Goodwin,/users/562692a30000ff0001e47741,GB,9.0,2023-11-25 19:33:40+00:00,1.0,Amazon stole my item,"Bought a new laptop for my son from Amazon.They said they tried to deliver yesterday but they never attempted as there was someone at home waiting......The box arrived the very next day - today - completely empty.Amazon are now demanding we prove that so are filing a complain with the police (who couldn't really care less either).Report it to your card company - done that - same response.For the love of god, check your item in front  of the driver as they will deny any responsibility if you don't.While I still have a pulse I'll never buy from these thieves again...",2023-11-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,25.0,571,101,20,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought new laptop son amazonthey said tried deliver yesterday never attempted someone home waitingthe box arrived next day today completely emptyamazon demanding prove filing complain police couldnt really care less eitherreport card company done responsefor love god check item front driver deny responsibility dontwhile still pulse ill never buy thief,0.018226913832869878,0.9817730861671301,0.056646102075154234,0.2,0.8022157634985958,80.22157634985957,High Trust
S N,/users/6562286a48a8b500122cec35,US,1.0,2023-11-25 19:01:38+00:00,1.0,There have been many recent issues with…,"There have been many recent issues with Amazon customer service associates AND supervisors being incompetent, impatient and just generally unwilling to help because they honestly don't care. They recently lost a package of mine that happened to beat gift for someone else. Embarrassing already since I ordered it in advance to avoid any issues only to have to go through at least 20 different people telling me there's nothing they can do. The tracking information through UPS shows nothing, not even an acceptance scan and despite sending Amazon screen shots, I keep getting the same scripted, generic apology email telling me to wait another week. Except in every email, the date changes so no one knows what they're talking about. On my end, it shows the order was canceled and returned. They're not allowing me to get a refund and keep brushing me off. I already reordered another item myself and it was delivered to my family member no problem but now Amazon tells me if the other item gets delivered, they're supposed to refuse it? What if they're not home? Why is it now their problem because Amazon screwed up? I've talked to supervisors and ""specialists"" who are all just unwilling to help and actually hang up on me when I ask what I'm supposed to do. Original delivery date was 11/22, a day before their birthday. I reordered another item and it was delivered just fine on 11/23. The lost package, I'm being told to wait until 11/28 before Amazon will even think about doing anything.",2023-11-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,25.0,1495,258,40,7,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,many recent issue amazon customer service associate supervisor incompetent impatient generally unwilling help honestly dont care recently lost package mine happened beat gift someone else embarrassing already since ordered advance avoid issue go least different people telling there nothing tracking information ups show nothing even acceptance scan despite sending amazon screen shot keep getting scripted generic apology email telling wait another week except every email date change one know theyre talking end show order canceled returned theyre allowing get refund keep brushing already reordered another item delivered family member problem amazon tell item get delivered theyre supposed refuse theyre home problem amazon screwed ive talked supervisor specialist unwilling help actually hang ask im supposed original delivery date day birthday reordered another item delivered fine lost package im told wait amazon even think anything,0.005171225009847154,0.9948287749901529,0.1446999439147504,0.2,0.8263543762780265,82.63543762780266,High Trust
Dan,/users/65621c0735d22b0012f3f906,GB,2.0,2023-11-25 18:10:37+00:00,1.0,Delivery,"Delivery - handed to resident, but not!Amazon UK's Logistics delivery is useless. Some people may find getting a delivery at 8.30pm convenient, I do not. Why do they leave it so late to start their deliveries?I have had several deliveries where in my orders it states ""parcel handed to resident"" but in all cases it was just left unattended at the front of my property. I assume management are instructing the drivers to leave the parcel no matter what.My tip - do not give Amazon permission to leave the parcel unattended in your amazon settings and/or delivery addresses. If the driver/Amazon choose to leave the parcel unattended then they are liable for the loss. If they do not give you a refund or send the item again you can do a chargeback against them via your card. If your order says ""parcel handed to resident"" and it wasn't ask them for picture proof of the parcel being handed to the resident.It is a shame I now have to do this with Amazon UK. Like someone else below has stated you can't either email/call to complain or leave feedback as they have removed the options from their site. I assume because they were getting to many complaints. Even my Evri deliveries are now better then Amazon UK!Just a thought for Amazon UK, why not give the customer the option of using a different courier at the checkout?",2023-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,25.0,1323,236,8,1,9.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,delivery handed resident notamazon uk logistics delivery useless people may find getting delivery pm convenient leave late start deliveriesi several delivery order state parcel handed resident case left unattended front property assume management instructing driver leave parcel matter whatmy tip give amazon permission leave parcel unattended amazon setting andor delivery address driveramazon choose leave parcel unattended liable loss give refund send item chargeback via card order say parcel handed resident wasnt ask picture proof parcel handed residentit shame amazon uk like someone else stated cant either emailcall complain leave feedback removed option site assume getting many complaint even evri delivery better amazon ukjust thought amazon uk give customer option using different courier checkout,0.3848903158518413,0.6151096841481587,0.13236118900729107,0.2,0.6340270798755375,63.402707987553754,Medium Trust
Cristian Matabanchoy,/users/6562108a48a8b500122cdabe,CO,3.0,2023-11-25 17:19:47+00:00,1.0,I was banned for no reason,"I was banned for no reason, they just wrote me because they linked my account to another account, I have only used one account to shop with amazon.",2023-11-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,25.0,147,28,26,6,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,banned reason wrote linked account another account used one account shop amazon,0.022799105961464575,0.9772008940385354,0.015703869882220976,0.2,0.7917412209957119,79.17412209957119,High Trust
Colette,/users/5b579aaf4de5666d3479141c,US,24.0,2023-11-25 14:14:45+00:00,1.0,Horrible Customer Service & Won't Refund Me For A 3 Month Old Return,"Sure, Amazon is convenient, typically. But over the past couple of years the customer service has gotten so bad. I returned an item three months ago and got my advance refund, as normal. I get an email a month ago stating I was going to be charged for this item. So I reached out and was told to disregard this email that they had this item and I won't be charged. Which, this has happened to me in the past. And typically it always gets taken care of. Last week I get another email stating I have been charged. So I reach out again to get refunded for it. Well they tell me they need me to submit some kind of form of ID because they have detected abnormal activity on my account before they can process my refund. Not sure how processing a refund back to my credit card that I have used for years has anything to do with this so called abnormal activity. Yet I have made several purchases and returns since this order from three months ago and have no issues. So I have spent days calling and chatting trying to get my refund issued back and was told a couple different times it was, only to find out it wasn't. Filed a complaint against them with the BBB because this is crazy thay they charged me for an item I returned three months ago. I was able to obtain the tracking number from one of the reps I had spoke with, since so much time had passes the return label wasn't available on my end. Of course after 120 days UPS tracking numbers are no longer valid. So I had to reach out to UPS, and they emailed the proof of delivery. Which Amazon received the return within two days of me shipping it back. So, I've been emailing back and forth with different reps making the same bs excuses and won't even tell me why this order is any different from my other orders that they feel the need to have my ID uploaded. They keep saying it is to protect my account. If protecting my account was the case and there was abnormal activity, why let me continue to place orders?! I could understand if this was for an item over $300, but it was for a $22 sports bra! Not sure hoe not refunding me my money is protecting me. I'm not uploading any personal information through an email and I should not have to. I never should have been charged in the first place. I think someone at Amazon simply misplaced the item and don't want to own up to their mistake and they are trying to keep money. I did end up disputing the charge with my credit card company and provided more than enough documentation showing they have my return and correspondence showing they received it and a refund has been issued, even though they didn't issue it. This whole experience has ruined shopping at Amazon for me. I had a ton of subscription orders and canceled all of those and will not be renewing my Prime either. I am all done shopping with them.",2023-11-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,25.0,2821,536,68,13,8.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,sure amazon convenient typically past couple year customer service gotten bad returned item three month ago got advance refund normal get email month ago stating going charged item reached told disregard email item wont charged happened past typically always get taken care last week get another email stating charged reach get refunded well tell need submit kind form id detected abnormal activity account process refund sure processing refund back credit card used year anything called abnormal activity yet made several purchase return since order three month ago issue spent day calling chatting trying get refund issued back told couple different time find wasnt filed complaint bbb crazy thay charged item returned three month ago able obtain tracking number one rep spoke since much time pass return label wasnt available end course day ups tracking number longer valid reach ups emailed proof delivery amazon received return within two day shipping back ive emailing back forth different rep making b excuse wont even tell order different order feel need id uploaded keep saying protect account protecting account case abnormal activity let continue place order could understand item sport bra sure hoe refunding money protecting im uploading personal information email never charged first place think someone amazon simply misplaced item dont want mistake trying keep money end disputing charge credit card company provided enough documentation showing return correspondence showing received refund issued even though didnt issue whole experience ruined shopping amazon ton subscription order canceled renewing prime either done shopping,0.09633747523965096,0.903662524760349,0.30061693774537296,0.2,0.8119546499292492,81.19546499292491,High Trust
Adrian,/users/566bd9100000ff0001f2b775,GB,15.0,2023-11-25 13:32:44+00:00,1.0,Don’t buy high value items from Amazon!,"I purchased a monitor from Amazon which never arrived but they say was handed to me, even though it wasn’t in - the driver needs the one time passcode OR your phone number, which is on the delivery instructions!!!!  So no security at all. They didn’t even have to take a photo as they usually do.",2023-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,25.0,296,56,39,7,1.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,purchased monitor amazon never arrived say handed even though wasn’t driver need one time passcode phone number delivery instruction security didn’t even take photo usually,0.9294351653291826,0.07056483467081742,0.03140773976444195,0.2,0.3415639652882971,34.15639652882971,Low Trust
Fishing for Zoras,/users/62dab4de1acc9400128dcbac,US,19.0,2023-11-25 11:43:18+00:00,1.0,"Stole my money, then locked my account, because they're monsters.","I bought an ebook with a Visa gift card. Amazon charged me, sent me a receipt, and then locked my account for suspicious activity. They then demanded I prove the card was mine by sending in a bank statement with my name, address, billing history, and bank account information to unlock my account. If this sounds like a scam site it should, because Amazon is just another ******** third-world mobster. Such insane amounts of incompetence. Every interaction with them is always beyond idiotic. They stole my money and demanded unobtainable proof to give me access to what I've already bought. Literal thieves. If the account was so suspicious, then DON'T CHARGE THE CARD, morons! I hate Amazon with a fire that will never extinguish. I hope someone at the company reads this, and then their eyes fall out.",2023-11-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,25.0,804,138,65,10,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,bought ebook visa gift card amazon charged sent receipt locked account suspicious activity demanded prove card mine sending bank statement name address billing history bank account information unlock account sound like scam site amazon another thirdworld mobster insane amount incompetence every interaction always beyond idiotic stole money demanded unobtainable proof give access ive already bought literal thief account suspicious dont charge card moron hate amazon fire never extinguish hope someone company read eye fall,0.1259149713881175,0.8740850286118825,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.7525220431898448,75.25220431898448,High Trust
Angela,/users/6232053d6f15960012d356bf,US,4.0,2023-11-25 05:03:37+00:00,2.0,I had been a customer of Amazon for…,"I had been a customer of Amazon for sometime..I purchased a lot of stuff like house hold items to shampoo/conditioner..I even purchased stuff for our new addition  like pictures  hand towel holder and clocks..Well, I ended up changing my mind and I return a few items..When returning these items I had no idea that crap was about to hit..My account had been hacked, and I notified Amazon about my account I've been hacked so they go in and they lock my accounts and I think nothing of it a few days passes and still my account is locked and I'm not able to reorder or you know do anything so I call customer service they said they would relate it and take care of it and I would receive a phone call, few days later my account was still locked. I called and I found out that they supposedly had sent me an email from Amazon telling me that they had close my account permanently and that I can no longer be a customer .because The email stated I had requested too many refunds, and  the second email stated that I had returned too many items due to their policy requirement that your limit on how many stuff you're allowed to return..I never once received any letter  through the mail letting me know what was going on my with my ordering history, instead amazon took it upon herself to go ahead and permanently close my account...I was Informed by an email and never at one time had I received a phone call from freaky amazon regarding my account...In my email I was informed that since they looked at my ordering history and my account had been closed, I was never allowed to open another account with Amazon and neither was my family members that I lived with..I can't understand how Amazon can close my account because I RETURNED TOO MANY ITEMS, AND REQUESTED TO MANY REFUNDS!!!! Walmart allows you to buy and return without totally banning you from there stores...So. as warnings do not be a customer of freaking Amazon",2023-11-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,25.0,1923,350,36,8,7.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,customer amazon sometimei purchased lot stuff like house hold item shampooconditioneri even purchased stuff new addition like picture hand towel holder clockswell ended changing mind return itemswhen returning item idea crap hitmy account hacked notified amazon account ive hacked go lock account think nothing day pass still account locked im able reorder know anything call customer service said would relate take care would receive phone call day later account still locked called found supposedly sent email amazon telling close account permanently longer customer email stated requested many refund second email stated returned many item due policy requirement limit many stuff youre allowed returni never received letter mail letting know going ordering history instead amazon took upon go ahead permanently close accounti informed email never one time received phone call freaky amazon regarding accountin email informed since looked ordering history account closed never allowed open another account amazon neither family member lived withi cant understand amazon close account returned many item requested many refund walmart allows buy return without totally banning storesso warning customer freaking amazon,0.7752832336981925,0.22471676630180748,0.1962983735277622,0.4,0.7516180578564562,75.16180578564561,High Trust
RFguy,/users/65615f6c8555180013875af7,US,1.0,2023-11-25 04:44:29+00:00,1.0,Don't rely on Amazon CS to solve a problem,"Tried to purchase an inverter which is the same model as one I bought last year from Amazon shipped to the same address.  This time Amazon website would not accept the address.  I tried different addresses of friend same result.  I contacted Amazon CS twice to get problem resolved.  Today (after going through all their hoops like deleting my address and re-entering it which I had already tried) I got on with the ""top tier"" supervisor who finally said there was nothing wrong with my address but the item is restricted to certain addressed due to regulations.  My B.S. sensor went off scale so I asked him what restrictions?  He could not answer because he had better things to do other that actually fix a difficult problem.  During the entire call I remained respectful even though I was being treated as if my business was of no value to them.  I explained to this guy that I could purchase the identical unit (electronically) but was in a larger housing due to it being a marine version of the same inverter and there was no restrictions related to that unit.  He did not care to explain why because it would have actually meant he had to think about something outside his window of knowledge.  To be sure after the call I went back to their website put the ""restricted"" item in my cart and used the address autofill function of their website to arbitrarily find addressed in other states and I could not find an address that was not restricted.  So Amazon has an issue with this particular item and they will not do anything to correct it because they simply do no care about any one customer.  It does not matter if you spend thousands on their website, it does not matter how long you have been a customer, it does not matter how great a customer you have been YOU DO NOT MATTER TO AMAZON!  As Lily Tomilin used to say when she played a phone company operator on Laugh In ""We dont care because we don't have to""  Thankfully there are still retailers that value their customers like Costco.",2023-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,25.0,1999,361,42,9,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,tried purchase inverter model one bought last year amazon shipped address time amazon website would accept address tried different address friend result contacted amazon c twice get problem resolved today going hoop like deleting address reentering already tried got top tier supervisor finally said nothing wrong address item restricted certain addressed due regulation b sensor went scale asked restriction could answer better thing actually fix difficult problem entire call remained respectful even though treated business value explained guy could purchase identical unit electronically larger housing due marine version inverter restriction related unit care explain would actually meant think something outside window knowledge sure call went back website put restricted item cart used address autofill function website arbitrarily find addressed state could find address restricted amazon issue particular item anything correct simply care one customer matter spend thousand website matter long customer matter great customer matter amazon lily tomilin used say played phone company operator laugh dont care dont thankfully still retailer value customer like costco,0.021560989199764995,0.978439010800235,0.20246775098149186,0.2,0.8297130555964158,82.97130555964158,High Trust
