Rahmathullah Rasheed,/users/62519966c6086000129a2480,GB,3.0,2023-11-24 16:42:13+00:00,1.0,The Customer service was horrifying,"The Customer service was horrifying. I was on the call for over a hour  and spent 10 minutes trying to dictate my email address. The people there can't even understand English. They brought me over to the manager whose name Waseem and he was not even helpful. I am very disappointed with this cheating business. Even being a prime member is no use. They don't even deliver on time.I absolutely don't recommend this business, to either buy anything from Amazon or ask anything.",2023-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,24.0,476,83,35,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer service horrifying call hour spent minute trying dictate email address people cant even understand english brought manager whose name waseem even helpful disappointed cheating business even prime member use dont even deliver timei absolutely dont recommend business either buy anything amazon ask anything,0.02328621530554683,0.9767137846944531,0.04655075715086932,0.2,0.7976670437774005,79.76670437774006,High Trust
Emre Öztürk,/users/60df0aaa85b2b10012fab9bc,TR,2.0,2023-11-24 16:16:53+00:00,1.0,Amazon has cancelled the order for no reason after 1 month,"I bought an espresso machine on 21.10.2023. Today I received an e-mail regarding the order cancellation. I have been waiting for more than 1 month. In this time period I tried to get support from the customer services several time but unfortunately they did not do anything to support me on this issue. It is not fair to cancel the order after 1 month waiting. Frustrating, waste of time and money. By the way they gave me 0.66$ for this inconvenience situation. Should I feel happy for that ?",2023-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,24.0,493,89,58,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought espresso machine today received email regarding order cancellation waiting month time period tried get support customer service several time unfortunately anything support issue fair cancel order month waiting frustrating waste time money way gave inconvenience situation feel happy,0.009929627905383775,0.9900703720946162,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.8050183604724344,80.50183604724343,High Trust
Christopher Vradis,/users/60525ec18c176a001a47802e,GR,4.0,2023-11-24 14:35:46+00:00,1.0,Horrible - Amazon.nl,"Horrible. 3 times ordered, 1 time was fine, second time they delivered it to a neighbor while i was in house and they never mentioned which neighbor i had to knock the door but eventually never found them so they refunded, third time they said i got it delivered and I never did (which is actually illegal) so yeah, eventually i found the items after knocking to all the doors in the neighborhood. Amazon prime cancelled. Just buy from individual stores that use DHL or UPS. You can get the same prices and much safer delivery. And proper delivery guys instead of the HORRIBLE Amazon Delivery. Thanks ! by the way this is for Amazon Netherlands.",2023-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,24.0,645,116,20,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,horrible time ordered time fine second time delivered neighbor house never mentioned neighbor knock door eventually never found refunded third time said got delivered never actually illegal yeah eventually found item knocking door neighborhood amazon prime cancelled buy individual store use dhl ups get price much safer delivery proper delivery guy instead horrible amazon delivery thanks way amazon netherlands,0.09114826592674541,0.9088517340732546,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.767437644939039,76.7437644939039,High Trust
CollectPlus Customer,/users/5daab42d0c83e1cca9e647c3,GB,39.0,2023-11-24 12:33:22+00:00,1.0,Warning to all Amazon buyers!! Never ask for a refund to the Gift Card!,"Warning to all Amazon buyers!!! Never agree to your money being refunded to the Gift Card in your Amazon account!  From my experience  once it is there you will never get it back to your bank account, and you will never know where it really is. Amazon has a very confusing and strange way of dividing the refunds so once you agree to your money to be refunded to the gift Card rather than to your bank account - even for one item,  then it is impossible to find out how much money was really refunded and where. The original payment method does not mean your bank account. As soon as you agree to it then for ever can  be the Gift Card and you will never be in control of your refund again.",2023-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,24.0,690,134,71,14,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,warning amazon buyer never agree money refunded gift card amazon account experience never get back bank account never know really amazon confusing strange way dividing refund agree money refunded gift card rather bank account even one item impossible find much money really refunded original payment method mean bank account soon agree ever gift card never control refund,0.9570180221317741,0.042981977868225885,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.33652183582138157,33.65218358213816,Low Trust
