Jamie Busher,/users/63a2ca0e181db900121aa383,IE,3.0,2023-11-24 08:04:29+00:00,1.0,Amazon are thieves,Amazon are thieves. Recently I was charged monthly for 4 months for prime services on a US account that I've never used or setup. I have UK based acccount. After hours/days going back and forth between amazon and my bank amazon admitted the mistake. Said they would refund monies. As of today refunds still pending and this is after hour upon hour chatting with extremely poor customer service reps. Myself and family will never use Amazon again and closed my account.,2023-11-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,24.0,468,81,18,3,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon thief recently charged monthly month prime service u account ive never used setup uk based acccount hoursdays going back forth amazon bank amazon admitted mistake said would refund monies today refund still pending hour upon hour chatting extremely poor customer service rep family never use amazon closed account,0.017023448669996458,0.9829765513300035,0.045429052159282106,0.2,0.8005740860968581,80.05740860968581,High Trust
Merry Ann,/users/655fefc6ba827c0012a42a7c,US,2.0,2023-11-24 02:38:15+00:00,1.0,Amazon's customer service is terrible,"Amazon's customer service is terrible. There isn't good contact info, getting out of the automated system is hard, and what I find on my account on the computer isn't the same as what the reps see. My default address has changed twice when I had items shipped to other addresses while I did not change it. Orders are late, and reps are not helpful. I was hung up on twice and put on hold for an inordinate amount of time. Finding out any info about a time sensitive order is a nightmare. I've had several orders shipped by USPS that said there was an inadequate address while the address on the site is correct with detailed added info. The system needs improving badly.",2023-11-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,24.0,670,123,37,5,16.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon customer service terrible isnt good contact info getting automated system hard find account computer isnt rep see default address changed twice item shipped address change order late rep helpful hung twice put hold inordinate amount time finding info time sensitive order nightmare ive several order shipped usps said inadequate address address site correct detailed added info system need improving badly,0.020677800910624492,0.9793221990893755,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.8034580709412105,80.34580709412104,High Trust
