Alex Walton,/users/655f4d1ef1ee8600129c9619,GB,1.0,2023-11-23 15:01:24+00:00,1.0,My Amazon delivery driver stole my new phone,"My Amazon delivery driver stole my new phone. After providing my phone number at his request, he exploited it to bypass the necessary passcode for delivery. Despite receiving only the phone case, he left without giving me the phone. When questioned, he ignored me, and later, I received a false delivery notification. Despite multiple attempts, Amazon refuses to refund or replace the item, share the courier's details, or investigate the matter. They suggested filing a police report for suspected theft, leaving me without a resolution and out of pocket for a new Samsung phone.",2023-11-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,23.0,580,94,44,8,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon delivery driver stole new phone providing phone number request exploited bypass necessary passcode delivery despite receiving phone case left without giving phone questioned ignored later received false delivery notification despite multiple attempt amazon refuse refund replace item share courier detail investigate matter suggested filing police report suspected theft leaving without resolution pocket new samsung phone,0.008746493444862462,0.9912535065551376,0.05272013460459899,0.2,0.8061707801984885,80.61707801984885,High Trust
