GEORGE BLACKWELL,/users/5f6ddb956747aa3bd45f6ce9,GB,13.0,2023-11-22 23:34:14+00:00,1.0,BAD BAD AMAZON,"For the second time in this month Amazon have take my money. But can deliver the item I ordered. They can't contact the company that is selling through them. Or the shipping for the. So after a week they have to refund my payment. But all the time there website is saying that my item is in transit, but is running late. An hour or two is running late, days is not running late it's lost in a black hole. Or you get a part order, that is delivered by the post office. And the rest again can't be found, and don't know if they had the stock when they took my money. And yet again they can cancel the order right away. But can't do a refund for a week or more.So taking money for a service or a item that they don't have, and can't supply. Does this classed as a type of fraud or something like it. After all they must have the best computer stock control in the world, Or not. So why complete the sale if you can't send your complete order.Find another company, you should get a better service.",2023-11-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,22.0,993,195,14,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,second time month amazon take money deliver item ordered cant contact company selling shipping week refund payment time website saying item transit running late hour two running late day running late lost black hole get part order delivered post office rest cant found dont know stock took money yet cancel order right away cant refund week moreso taking money service item dont cant supply classed type fraud something like must best computer stock control world complete sale cant send complete orderfind another company get better service,0.026718470884760592,0.9732815291152395,0.10936623667975323,0.2,0.8085140118935703,80.85140118935703,High Trust
