Honestyisthebestpolicy,/users/655e27b3db8b11001362f084,GB,1.0,2023-11-22 18:09:46+00:00,1.0,Amazon Brand - Presto! Multipurpose Kitchen Rolls,"I'm not typically one to voice complaints or write reviews, but I felt compelled to do so in this instance. This marks the second time I've ordered these rolls at £16.15 per pack of six, and regrettably, both times they arrived in a damaged condition. Given that these were intended for food-related use, I had to discard the initial batch as they were fused to the plastic packaging, which I suspect was due to moisture.Hoping for a resolution, I decided to give Amazon another chance and reordered the rolls, but my optimism was misplaced. They arrived once again in a damaged state, with the same issue and an additional rip in the plastic packaging.However, the most disheartening part of this experience was the interaction with the customer service agent. Their demeanor was exceptionally rude, condescending, and arrogant. They didn't allow me the opportunity to explain what had occurred, instead choosing to rant and abruptly ending the call. It was truly an abysmal encounter.Today's service did not reflect anything remotely ""Prime,"" so I have decided to cancel my Prime membership and will not be shopping in-store either.I've wasted two days waiting for deliveries and more time on the process of returning the item. My suggestion would be to save your time and consider purchasing your kitchen rolls from a different source.My review was deleted twice, and despite assurances of a manager's contact weeks ago, there's been no call or message. They denied any issue exists, which seems untrue.I've noticed they persistently ask for reviews but delete them if they're negative, especially for their own brand products. Recently, I tried Marks and Spencer's and Waitrose's own brand rolls, and they're far superior. Not only is the product better, but the service also matches the quality.Amazon, you can do better.",2023-09-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,22.0,1826,297,49,7,72.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,im typically one voice complaint write review felt compelled instance mark second time ive ordered roll £ per pack six regrettably time arrived damaged condition given intended foodrelated use discard initial batch fused plastic packaging suspect due moisturehoping resolution decided give amazon another chance reordered roll optimism misplaced arrived damaged state issue additional rip plastic packaginghowever disheartening part experience interaction customer service agent demeanor exceptionally rude condescending arrogant didnt allow opportunity explain occurred instead choosing rant abruptly ending call truly abysmal encountertodays service reflect anything remotely prime decided cancel prime membership shopping instore eitherive wasted two day waiting delivery time process returning item suggestion would save time consider purchasing kitchen roll different sourcemy review deleted twice despite assurance manager contact week ago there call message denied issue exists seems untrueive noticed persistently ask review delete theyre negative especially brand product recently tried mark spencer waitroses brand roll theyre far superior product better service also match qualityamazon better,0.0027204110292102517,0.9972795889707897,0.16657319125070105,0.2,0.8319544327355352,83.19544327355352,High Trust
JoJo,/users/59dbb2100000ff000ad2d84c,GB,18.0,2023-11-22 16:40:50+00:00,1.0,Seriously need to retrain your drivers…,"Seriously need to retrain your drivers and keep track of what they are doing. I ordered a signed for package, unfortunately I was on the school run yesterday when he arrived, however I asked for it to be left with my neighbour. I watched on my doorbell and he did not attempt to deliver to my neighbour, he just walked off. The next day, no driver came, no van came, but it was put as another attempted delivery, even though he had been nowhere near my house. Do you not want the sale Amazon? You will just end up refunding a very unhappy customer. Absolute joke and liars.",2023-11-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,22.0,573,108,39,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,seriously need retrain driver keep track ordered signed package unfortunately school run yesterday arrived however asked left neighbour watched doorbell attempt deliver neighbour walked next day driver came van came put another attempted delivery even though nowhere near house want sale amazon end refunding unhappy customer absolute joke liar,0.02282588492171752,0.9771741150782824,0.06057206954570948,0.2,0.8007014714482831,80.07014714482831,High Trust
Ryan Matthews,/users/65243193dded22001218ab73,GB,12.0,2023-11-22 15:59:13+00:00,1.0,Damage to propery,"I am compelled to write this review to share my deeply disappointing experience with Amazon regarding a recent purchase (Order #203-5391742-2345144). My ordeal began with the delivery of a pack of 10, M8 x 1m (1000mm) Zinc Plated Threaded Rod/Bar, which was irresponsibly posted through my letterbox by Royal Mail, resulting in significant damage to my vinyl flooring.However, the core of my frustration lies in Amazon's response to this incident. Despite the severity of the damage and the clear evidence provided, including photographs and a video from my Ring Doorbell, Amazon has completely denied any responsibility for the mishap. Their justification is that the item was sold by a third-party seller and delivered by Royal Mail, thereby absolving themselves of any accountability.This lack of ownership and customer care is appalling. As a customer, I purchased this product through the Amazon platform, trusting in their promise of quality service and reliable delivery. The fact that Amazon refuses to acknowledge their role in this chain of responsibility, or to offer any form of assistance or compensation, is unacceptable.The damage to my property is not just a minor inconvenience; it is a significant financial and emotional burden. The flooring that was damaged was costly, and the idea that neither Amazon nor their delivery partners are willing to address this issue is deeply troubling.This experience has severely eroded my trust in Amazon. It's clear that their customer service and support systems are severely lacking when it comes to handling issues with third-party sellers and delivery partners. I am left feeling frustrated and disregarded as a customer.To anyone considering making a purchase through Amazon, especially for items involving third-party sellers or heavy goods, I urge caution. Based on my experience, if anything goes wrong, you may find yourself in a similar situation, with little to no support from Amazon.In conclusion, I am extremely dissatisfied with how Amazon has handled this situation. Their refusal to take any responsibility or offer a resolution is not only disappointing but also reflects poorly on their commitment to customer satisfaction and service.",2023-11-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,22.0,2210,342,17,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,compelled write review share deeply disappointing experience amazon regarding recent purchase order ordeal began delivery pack x mm zinc plated threaded rodbar irresponsibly posted letterbox royal mail resulting significant damage vinyl flooringhowever core frustration lie amazon response incident despite severity damage clear evidence provided including photograph video ring doorbell amazon completely denied responsibility mishap justification item sold thirdparty seller delivered royal mail thereby absolving accountabilitythis lack ownership customer care appalling customer purchased product amazon platform trusting promise quality service reliable delivery fact amazon refuse acknowledge role chain responsibility offer form assistance compensation unacceptablethe damage property minor inconvenience significant financial emotional burden flooring damaged costly idea neither amazon delivery partner willing address issue deeply troublingthis experience severely eroded trust amazon clear customer service support system severely lacking come handling issue thirdparty seller delivery partner left feeling frustrated disregarded customerto anyone considering making purchase amazon especially item involving thirdparty seller heavy good urge caution based experience anything go wrong may find similar situation little support amazonin conclusion extremely dissatisfied amazon handled situation refusal take responsibility offer resolution disappointing also reflects poorly commitment customer satisfaction service,0.008376229900489692,0.9916237700995103,0.19181155356141336,0.2,0.8341741957620378,83.41741957620378,High Trust
Steve,/users/655de93235db6800124da737,AM,11.0,2023-11-22 13:48:53+00:00,1.0,False marketing & lies,"I ordered a Pixel 8 Pro deal from Amazon with the Pixel Watch 2. Delivery was given for the following week. Then a delay was introduced (silently) for 7 more days. When I reached out, they promised me repeatedly that there was no issue and I would receive my Pixel 8 Pro and Watch. Then another delay happened (silently). If I didn't keep checking my orders, I wouldn't know because they don't send any email notifications when the delays are on their end. So I reach out again, and again they say that my item is ready to be shipped. Finally, my order is cancelled (again, silently), because they've run out. If they'd run out, why did they let me place my order? If they'd run out, why did they string me along for 3 WEEKS?!I could easily have grabbed the deal from another more reliable store. But they lied and lied until it was too late and that promotion had ended.",2023-10-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,22.0,871,162,22,4,50.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered pixel pro deal amazon pixel watch delivery given following week delay introduced silently day reached promised repeatedly issue would receive pixel pro watch another delay happened silently didnt keep checking order wouldnt know dont send email notification delay end reach say item ready shipped finally order cancelled silently theyve run theyd run let place order theyd run string along weeksi could easily grabbed deal another reliable store lied lied late promotion ended,0.060210170795067804,0.9397898292049321,0.09085810431856421,0.2,0.7880665354661789,78.8066535466179,High Trust
