Paul,/users/524c37d300006400014ec276,GB,4.0,2023-11-22 01:00:56+00:00,1.0,Stay away. Not what it used to be,"Lately I have been receiving deliveries with missing items. Sold by and fulfilled by Amazon.Trying to get help from support is worse and worse as day goes by. From my last order I was missing an iPad and a magic keyboard.Every time I contacted support they would say a different thing. One person said I can get replacement or refund. One said I can get a refund only. One said I reported wrong items not missing items. When I asked if there is any chance that the items might show up one said Yes, they are still being delivered(order history said delivered). A different person said they won’t be delivered as they were part of the order that has been delivered. I asked if they can check with the driver and they said they don’t have his information like name phone number etc(the carrier is Amazon) . I was left speechless. Not to mention that I have received emails from Amazon saying that I have a high number of refunds for missing items and that they will stop refunding or something similar. They are incapable of hiring competent people that can safely deliver the items instead of stealing them. I have filed a police report as they said and will probably get a refund, but this experience made me cancel prime and as soon as this case is over I will cancel my account. I have been a customer for over 5 years and I can see how this company is starting to fail. This company has become anti customer. I can’t recommend them anymore.",2023-11-21 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,22.0,1443,265,33,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,lately receiving delivery missing item sold fulfilled amazontrying get help support worse worse day go last order missing ipad magic keyboardevery time contacted support would say different thing one person said get replacement refund one said get refund one said reported wrong item missing item asked chance item might show one said yes still deliveredorder history said delivered different person said won’t delivered part order delivered asked check driver said don’t information like name phone number etcthe carrier amazon left speechless mention received email amazon saying high number refund missing item stop refunding something similar incapable hiring competent people safely deliver item instead stealing filed police report said probably get refund experience made cancel prime soon case cancel account customer year see company starting fail company become anti customer can’t recommend anymore,0.004965504382263746,0.9950344956177363,0.14862591138530568,0.2,0.8272424300859292,82.72424300859292,High Trust
