sheila ryan,/users/5d304a6648140585da53c355,GB,45.0,2023-11-21 11:22:41+00:00,1.0,TERRIBLE DELIVERY SERVICE.,"What is going on with Amazon.  I have been promised deliveries for the early afternoon only to find that it then states a delivery time in the evening because (the courier has picked up more orders on the way to my address).  This is totally unacceptable,  people do not want to stay in waiting for a parcel only to find they have wasted a full day waiting for their order to be delivered. Deliveries at 9 and 10 in the evening are unacceptable especially when they were originally promised for lunchtime.  The other problem is that Amazon keep losing my parcels. Items are promised for next day delivery and then I find the parcel has gone missing and I have to wait a few days to see if it turns up and if it doesn't I have to contact Amazon and then wait another few days for a refund.  Because the parcel does not turn up we don't know for sure if it has been lost and have no idea if it will be delivered at all so we decide to go out and when we get back home, lo and behold the parcel is sitting on the door step facing the road.  I know they say it is free next day delivery but it really isn't because when you check the price of the item you want to order, it is   often cheaper elsewhere, even with the postage and packing some companies charge us for delivery. Come on Amazon, sort yourselves out.  It states in the box below to give a date when this happened, I cannot give a date as it is happening all the time now.",2023-11-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,21.0,1430,279,26,3,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,going amazon promised delivery early afternoon find state delivery time evening courier picked order way address totally unacceptable people want stay waiting parcel find wasted full day waiting order delivered delivery evening unacceptable especially originally promised lunchtime problem amazon keep losing parcel item promised next day delivery find parcel gone missing wait day see turn doesnt contact amazon wait another day refund parcel turn dont know sure lost idea delivered decide go get back home lo behold parcel sitting door step facing road know say free next day delivery really isnt check price item want order often cheaper elsewhere even postage packing company charge u delivery come amazon sort state box give date happened cannot give date happening time,0.015029934885697524,0.9849700651143025,0.15647784632641615,0.2,0.8237806018224345,82.37806018224344,High Trust
deja vu,/users/64c6d270d4f64b001203f3ae,GB,4.0,2023-11-21 10:58:29+00:00,1.0,Amazon’s persistent push for Prime,"Amazon’s persistent push for Prime, even with free postage from the seller, adds an extra layer of scrutiny to the checkout process. To enhance my review, Amazon could improve by toning down the relentless Prime prompts.  As for the included movies included with prime, these are usually low budget productions not even worth watching.",2023-11-21 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,21.0,335,54,34,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon’s persistent push prime even free postage seller add extra layer scrutiny checkout process enhance review amazon could improve toning relentless prime prompt included movie included prime usually low budget production even worth watching,0.04525937159640885,0.9547406284035912,0.03028603477285474,0.2,0.7834275211563665,78.34275211563664,High Trust
