Elvia Duenas,/users/6559864025a5fd0011670bc1,MX,2.0,2023-11-19 06:00:51+00:00,1.0,I need someone to get in touch with me…,"I need someone to get in touch with me as soon as possible. This is unbelievable , I am very FRUSTRATED AND DISAPPOINTED with the company! I made a purchase of $3,523.12 pesos with monthly payments of $391.52 for 9 months “no interest”. They are not respecting the agreement I made with my monthly payments. I checked my credit card account and have 6 separate payments pending!!! One on the amount of $1,445.08 , the other of $599.99, another of $584.10, and 3 separate payments of $20 pesos !! Wt the heck is going on I need an explanation and have that money refunded with my monthly payments of 391.52 for 9 months to be respected or I will file a BBB complaint and never order from Amazon again!! Get in touch with me asap! !(33)2660-2868 Elvia Duenas!Necesito que alguien se ponga en contacto conmigo lo antes posible. ¡Esto es increíble, estoy muy FRUSTRADA Y DECEPCIONADA con la empresa! Hice una compra de $3,523.12 pesos con pagos mensuales de $391.52 por 9 meses “sin intereses”. No están respetando el acuerdo que hice con mis pagos mensuales. ¡Revisé mi cuenta de tarjeta de crédito y tengo 6 pagos separados pendientes! Uno por la cantidad de $1,445.08, el otro de $599.99, otro de $584.10, y 3 pagos separados de $20 pesos!! ¿Qué diablos está pasando? Necesito una explicación y que me reembolsen ese dinero con mis pagos mensuales de 391,52 durante 9 meses para que se respeten o presentaré una queja de BBB y nunca volveré a realizar pedidos en Amazon. ¡Ponte en contacto conmigo lo antes posible! !(33)2660-2868 Elvia Dueñas! Guadalajar Jalisco.",2023-11-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,19.0,1563,271,39,9,1.0,0,18,2,1,Suspicious,need someone get touch soon possible unbelievable frustrated disappointed company made purchase peso monthly payment month “no interest” respecting agreement made monthly payment checked credit card account separate payment pending