Gerald,/users/655962ece560ae001255de36,US,1.0,2023-11-19 03:20:53+00:00,1.0,Disappointed with Amazon’s Declining Delivery Service,"I’ve been an Amazon customer for years, and I have to say, I’m quite disappointed with the current state of their delivery service. Once hailed as the epitome of convenience with their same day, next day, and two-day deliveries, it has become a hit or miss experience.I remember when I could rely on Amazon to deliver my most important items promptly, without fail. However, in recent times, I’ve had multiple instances where these deliveries were either delayed or, worse, lost altogether. Needless to say, this has left me feeling frustrated and dissatisfied.It is absolutely unacceptable for a service that prides itself on efficiency and reliability to provide such unreliable service. Customers rely on Amazon to deliver their goods on time, especially when they’re crucial and time-sensitive items. Countless times I’ve found myself waiting anxiously, only to be disappointed when the delivery is delayed or simply never arrives.It’s disheartening to see a company that was once the gold standard for fast and reliable deliveries struggle to maintain that standard. If Amazon wishes to retain its loyal customers and attract new ones, they need to address these shortcomings immediately. Not only should they improve their communication regarding delayed deliveries, but they should also take concrete steps to prevent these delays and losses from happening in the first place.I hope Amazon realizes the impact these delivery issues have on their customers. For now, I can only express my disappointment and hope for a significant improvement in their delivery service.",2023-11-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,19.0,1575,246,53,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’ve amazon customer year say i’m quite disappointed current state delivery service hailed epitome convenience day next day twoday delivery become hit miss experiencei remember could rely amazon deliver important item promptly without fail however recent time i’ve multiple instance delivery either delayed worse lost altogether needless say left feeling frustrated dissatisfiedit absolutely unacceptable service pride efficiency reliability provide unreliable service customer rely amazon deliver good time especially they’re crucial timesensitive item countless time i’ve found waiting anxiously disappointed delivery delayed simply never arrivesit’s disheartening see company gold standard fast reliable delivery struggle maintain standard amazon wish retain loyal customer attract new one need address shortcoming immediately improve communication regarding delayed delivery also take concrete step prevent delay loss happening first placei hope amazon realizes impact delivery issue customer express disappointment hope significant improvement delivery service,0.005978076132040461,0.9940219238679595,0.13796971396522714,0.2,0.8246049047270252,82.46049047270252,High Trust
Claire,/users/60696995a97e40001b8c4804,NZ,19.0,2023-11-19 02:06:58+00:00,1.0,I've spent four hours over several…,"I've spent four hours over several weeks being bounced around various people and hung up on at customer service. Finally one person gave me useful information that my account has been closed because my last purchase was a year ago. So then, all my kindle books that I have spent hundreds and hundreds of dollars on are now gone. Amazon you suck big time , taking people's books. Horrid .",2023-11-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,19.0,387,70,35,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive spent four hour several week bounced around various people hung customer service finally one person gave useful information account closed last purchase year ago kindle book spent hundred hundred dollar gone amazon suck big time taking people book horrid,0.008318627749098606,0.9916813722509014,0.03925967470555244,0.2,0.8036926210665611,80.36926210665611,High Trust
