Robert USA,/users/5ff89404928b2a00194c141b,US,10.0,2023-11-18 19:44:33+00:00,1.0,The scam called third party selling on AMAZON...,"Third party sellers on AMAZON.com do not have to disclose their true, actual identities. They come up with a pseudy-name, a fake name. A third party seller only needs a pseudy-name, a working email address and a bank account. That's it! AMAZON has no idea who these people are in reality. Nor do they care either! Its a scam! And there are millions of them on-line, doing business under the AMAZON domain name. Its an unfair market  advantage since American businesses need to incorporate (usually this is a good idea for legal reasons), pay taxes and fees, file tax returns, file for business licenses, etc. AMAZON and the millions of third party sellers who transact business under the AMAZON domain are scamming the US economy and the American consumer! If these AMAZON third party sellers get into trouble with AMAZON, they only have to change their fake business name and get a new email address! AMAZON knows this too! It is a cycle of perpetual chaos and insanity!  The largest population of third party AMAZON sellers are in CHINA and AMAZON protects these sellers at the expense of the American consumer - crazy! :(",2023-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,18.0,1124,194,48,8,2.0,0,8,1,0,Genuine,third party seller amazoncom disclose true actual identity come pseudyname fake name third party seller need pseudyname working email address bank account thats amazon idea people reality care either scam million online business amazon domain name unfair market advantage since american business need incorporate usually good idea legal reason pay tax fee file tax return file business license etc amazon million third party seller transact business amazon domain scamming u economy american consumer amazon third party seller get trouble amazon change fake business name get new email address amazon know cycle perpetual chaos insanity largest population third party amazon seller china amazon protects seller expense american consumer crazy,0.9995380124295633,0.0004619875704366949,0.10880538418395962,0.2,0.32199207062201024,32.199207062201026,Low Trust
