Michelle Gussow,/users/6558056f192b8f0012ae2c71,US,1.0,2023-11-18 02:39:30+00:00,1.0,Service has reached a new low,"For years Amazon had the most amazing customer service.  Unfortunately, it has been going downhill over time and seems to be reaching a new. low.  I ordered a case of Volvic water that was out for delivery all day. I finally get the email saying it had been delivered but there was no package.  I called and got told that the driver might have accidentally marked it delivered but I have to wait until Monday before they will consider it ""not delivered.""  The promised delivery date when I ordered was today and they want me to wait three more days!  This is just the most recent run-in  The service reps also eager to just get you off the phone too.  Guess I'm glad it's not just me noticing this.",2023-11-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,18.0,698,129,29,6,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,year amazon amazing customer service unfortunately going downhill time seems reaching new low ordered case volvic water delivery day finally get email saying delivered package called got told driver might accidentally marked delivered wait monday consider delivered promised delivery date ordered today want wait three day recent runin service rep also eager get phone guess im glad noticing,0.04355348782028644,0.9564465121797135,0.0723499719573752,0.2,0.7926932504813318,79.26932504813318,High Trust
Sachin,/users/6557f35c292ae70012233e4c,GB,1.0,2023-11-18 01:12:44+00:00,1.0,Gift Card Balance,"Redeemed a gift card in my account under Amazon.com (the default redeem link they send lands on this page)  and when trying to use the gift card balance on Amazon.co.uk, it isn't available. When getting in contact with Amazon about this, they claim its because they are two different sites. When the same login details are used to login to both sites, and things like the payment card info is shared between both sites (.com and .co.uk) why is the gift card balance not available on both sites? Absolutely ridiculous.",2023-11-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,18.0,517,90,17,3,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,redeemed gift card account amazoncom default redeem link send land page trying use gift card balance amazoncouk isnt available getting contact amazon claim two different site login detail used login site thing like payment card info shared site com couk gift card balance available site absolutely ridiculous,0.07154543033805195,0.9284545696619481,0.050476724621424565,0.2,0.7743226297552589,77.43226297552589,High Trust
