Terry,/users/5c7c5d98558b28169253a621,US,3.0,2023-11-18 13:28:27+00:00,1.0,My daughter passed away a week ago and…,My daughter passed away a week ago and I ordered a urn from Amazon they lost my order and can't find it now I am unable to get it to the funeral home in time and Amazon customer service is nearly impossible to get a hold of and even less help if you can. Nothing but transfer to another department and then back again until you get tired of it and you never get anything done. Alot of empty apologies and smoke up your buns. I just got a email from Amazon saying they refused my review of this product so confirming the rumors I had heard that they censor their reviews don't trust amazon they lie and manipulate everything to favor their company,2023-11-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,18.0,646,124,39,8,6.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,daughter passed away week ago ordered urn amazon lost order cant find unable get funeral home time amazon customer service nearly impossible get hold even less help nothing transfer another department back get tired never get anything done alot empty apology smoke bun got email amazon saying refused review product confirming rumor heard censor review dont trust amazon lie manipulate everything favor company,0.006492560478324484,0.9935074395216755,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.8106628616565192,81.06628616565192,High Trust
Bruce,/users/54bfd0dc0000ff0001a5a93e,US,10.0,2023-11-17 19:33:25+00:00,1.0,Timing may not be everything but -- it is important!,"At 11 AM delivery was to be today at 12:05 it is now 2 days or so later. I had ordered a desk for a new computer (which also came from Amazon). Since I am older I ask a friend for help to assemble it. He is taking off work and driving 45 miles to help me. I called him at 11 AM and said the desk would be here. He left work. At 12 05 PM got an e-mail that the delivery will probably now be on the 19th. I ordered a matching table and that will be here today, but I really don't need help putting that together. Have to go he is at the door. Timing is everything - even the timing of missed delivery notifications!",2023-11-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,17.0,613,129,52,10,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,delivery today day later ordered desk new computer also came amazon since older ask friend help assemble taking work driving mile help called said desk would left work pm got email delivery probably th ordered matching table today really dont need help putting together go door timing everything even timing missed delivery notification,0.046913898352614086,0.9530861016473859,0.0723499719573752,0.2,0.791013045215168,79.1013045215168,High Trust
John Correa,/users/63ceb1ee3b87700012aee4db,US,1.0,2023-11-17 17:41:07+00:00,1.0,Package came,"Package came, heavy box opened missing item. Received a credit for 50 dollars over the phone.  Next morning I use the credit.  Account closed for fraudulent gift card! WHAT???? Fraudulent gift card. I thought it was a joke.  So all day I contact them over 100 times hung up on about 10     Never resolved. I had 3 orders totaling 500 dollars they said we’re canceled but never heard anything about refunds.  So now I feel like they stole 500 dollars from me.   Will never use Amazon again after this.",2023-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,17.0,500,89,12,2,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,package came heavy box opened missing item received credit dollar phone next morning use credit account closed fraudulent gift card fraudulent gift card thought joke day contact time hung never resolved order totaling dollar said we’re canceled never heard anything refund feel like stole dollar never use amazon,0.052559468511893116,0.9474405314881069,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.7837034401691796,78.37034401691795,High Trust
marcus,/users/550ab6ab0000ff0001b2825c,GB,32.0,2024-05-06 10:24:38+00:00,1.0,What an Absolute joke,"What an Absolute joke. For many years the pay in 5 months instalments via Amazon themselves has been active on my account, I've used it loads of times in the past without missing a payment as well as I've literally just finished paying off my last item a few days ago with no issues whatsoever. So after doing some research and asking others in shops at the check out they have all said the same that theirs has just vanished. However I've checked on my mother in law's Amazon account and her's is still active. Like huh how is her's still active and mines gone? My Amazon account is squeaky clean and I've easily spent 20k+ over the years. So until Amazon decide to put this back I will never use them again and the 1 star will remain.Update 06/05/2024: amazon has finally put the pay monthly option back on to my account, however I have noticed now that they request the full amount of the item first through your bank but they don't take any money, then once that's confirmed they will only charge the monthly amount, so if you have less money in your account than the item you want to purchase, they will not allow you to pay in 5 or 12 monthly instalments when they used to only requested the monthly amount. Now what is the point of this monthly payment if you have to have the same amount of money or more in your account than the item?? if you have the full amount in your account then you don't need to pay in instalments. So what an absolute joke and complete shambles. Worst part of it is, when I spoke to amazon the person said they have not changed how it works and it's been like that for years then left the chat then another advisor came on. But I can 100% guarantee you they have changed how it works. So it looks like I know more than the fully trained amazon advisor. So the 1 star remains until they take the request of the full amount off and put it back to what it was before.",2023-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,5.0,6.0,1898,363,21,4,186.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,absolute joke many year pay month instalment via amazon active account ive used load time past without missing payment well ive literally finished paying last item day ago issue whatsoever research asking others shop check said vanished however ive checked mother law amazon account still active like huh still active mine gone amazon account squeaky clean ive easily spent k year amazon decide put back never use star remainupdate amazon finally put pay monthly option back account however noticed request full amount item first bank dont take money thats confirmed charge monthly amount less money account item want purchase allow pay monthly instalment used requested monthly amount point monthly payment amount money account item full amount account dont need pay instalment absolute joke complete shamble worst part spoke amazon person said changed work like year left chat another advisor came guarantee changed work look like know fully trained amazon advisor star remains take request full amount put back,0.002534340879816952,0.997465659120183,0.2035894559730791,0.2,0.8394507207547073,83.94507207547073,High Trust
