Fly fly,/users/61c212f798779d00121e670f,GI,4.0,2023-11-17 13:46:08+00:00,1.0,Amazon Retain your Import tax fee deposit for 180 days,"Very bad experience when buying products from Amazon.com for export.I bought a laptop in July 2023 and received it on 4th August 2023 they charged me a import fee deposit of $97.59, When the item came to my country it was import tax exempt, I have sent amazon many emails and called them many times just to receive the same answer that i need to wait 180 days for my import tax refund even though i have sent them many emails attaching the customs cash payment receipt which clearly states 0% Tax was applied upon arrival. They just retain your money for no reason at all!",2023-08-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,17.0,572,106,54,10,105.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,bad experience buying product amazoncom exporti bought laptop july received th august charged import fee deposit item came country import tax exempt sent amazon many email called many time receive answer need wait day import tax refund even though sent many email attaching custom cash payment receipt clearly state tax applied upon arrival retain money reason,0.017799975081693186,0.9822000249183068,0.05945036455412227,0.2,0.8029900853699778,80.29900853699779,High Trust
Robert Cantellow,/users/6556279cdcee1d00120c85b4,CA,1.0,2023-11-16 16:31:01+00:00,5.0,Had to contact customer service today…,Had to contact customer service today about an incorrect charge to my credit card. I have never had to jump through so many hoops to contact someone. First I tried online chat and was told I would have to phone Amazon but couldn't supply a phone number. Attempts to find phone number on their website just looped me back to online so I ended up googling the number. After several conversations with the computerized I was finally connected to a real person who informed me that no charges had been applied to my account yet the info on the bank charge was the same as previous charges from before I cancelled my account. When I further pressed I was told that the charges could be connected  to a previous account that I had years ago. She said that she could see I had this account but she could not access it. When I asked to be put through to someone who could help she said the there was nobody and I should just dispute the charge with my bank which I have done but I can see this becoming a recurring problem that Amazon should be able to rectify.,2023-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,16.0,1053,199,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,contact customer service today incorrect charge credit card never jump many hoop contact someone first tried online chat told would phone amazon couldnt supply phone number attempt find phone number website looped back online ended googling number several conversation computerized finally connected real person informed charge applied account yet info bank charge previous charge cancelled account pressed told charge could connected previous account year ago said could see account could access asked put someone could help said nobody dispute charge bank done see becoming recurring problem amazon able rectify,0.024389749264374032,0.975610250735626,0.11160964666292765,1.0,2.0101270547003987,201.01270547003986,High Trust
