Peter Brown,/users/5e7b279c8cd2bc0caf081144,GB,14.0,2023-11-16 15:15:13+00:00,1.0,Why didn't you listen,After years of brilliant service Amazon you have let me down. Instead of leaving a 5 star I've had to leave a true negative review and sadly will close my account.I purchased a fire kindle for my 6 yrs old daughter of which a free subscription for 12 months and after expiry chargeable. Knowing this I took the time to contact Amazon and was told don't worry Mr Brown you have no subscription and no up and coming subscriptions I explained what the subscription was for and when expired. I was not aware that my 6 year old had her own Amazon account when I registered the device and had to put my credit card details on being an over 18. Amazon started taking money out of my account in August and I only noticed this November.I made contact and explained I was told I would be credited back the 4 months then I was cut off when I wanted to complain about the fact that it had been debited after I had taken the time to stop the subscription. It then turned in to hours of my time wasted with Amazon customer service to have the money given back.Because its not my Amazon account and belongs to my 7 year old daughter they could not deal with me. I had to contact again through my daughters account even though it could be anyone on there they even asked to speak to her. Its pathetic I am the father owner of the credit card and due to data protection use this as an excuse. They tell you when have contact via phone call you are taped by chat you have the transcript which I will add was wiped on my account on my device .however I did after being told find it on another device when I added my details so I have taken snap shots. I like this as the customer and the seller can see and listen to exactly what has been said.Amazon will not acknowledge that I made contact with them to cancel the subscription.I've asked for an apology and only had a verbal one and now as its not my Amazon account they will only speak with the account holder my 7yr old even though its my credit card Pathetic Amazon.What happened to the customer service integrity common sense ?Thank you for my time you wasted and as soon as the credit hits my account I will be closing my Amazon account a drop in the ocean.Customers beware of this Peter B,2023-11-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,16.0,2227,426,21,4,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,year brilliant service amazon let instead leaving star ive leave true negative review sadly close accounti purchased fire kindle yr old daughter free subscription month expiry chargeable knowing took time contact amazon told dont worry mr brown subscription coming subscription explained subscription expired aware year old amazon account registered device put credit card detail amazon started taking money account august noticed novemberi made contact explained told would credited back month cut wanted complain fact debited taken time stop subscription turned hour time wasted amazon customer service money given backbecause amazon account belongs year old daughter could deal contact daughter account even though could anyone even asked speak pathetic father owner credit card due data protection use excuse tell contact via phone call taped chat transcript add wiped account device however told find another device added detail taken snap shot like customer seller see listen exactly saidamazon acknowledge made contact cancel subscriptionive asked apology verbal one amazon account speak account holder yr old even though credit card pathetic amazonwhat happened customer service integrity common sense thank time wasted soon credit hit account closing amazon account drop oceancustomers beware peter b,0.01297636040571163,0.9870236395942884,0.23892316320807627,0.2,0.8412964524387595,84.12964524387596,High Trust
