Andrew G,/users/62af973b2bd0db0012a83bf8,US,7.0,2023-11-15 20:00:41+00:00,1.0,Customer service went from A to F,"Amazon has been slowly going downhill, but in the past year the customer service has become horrific. It is no longer worth shopping on Amazon, ever. You run a high risk of having a horrible experience if something goes wrong.Amazon has had issues with shipping speed, fake reviews, empty boxes, used products sold as new, and bad packaging for a long time. But the saving grace was their customer service would fix your issues. That is NO longer the case. Customer service will instead try to do anything they can to not refund you for a package lost in shipping (even with tracking!) or a return. Every time you talk to a representative you will hear something completely different. They have no clue what they are doing, they just want you off the phone/chat ASAP.I will never use Amazon again, after 18 years and $15,000+ PER year spent, they will never get another cent from me. Ordering anything from them is now stressful because you anticipate something will go wrong. Try literally ANY other site. Want electronics? B&H. Want regular goods? Target or Walmart. Trading cards or art? eBay or Etsy. Literally anything but Amazon. I never thought I would dump Amazon, but it is now far more trouble than it’s worth. If it continues on this track, Prime will be removed as a service in the next few years.",2023-11-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,15.0,1309,230,33,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon slowly going downhill past year customer service become horrific longer worth shopping amazon ever run high risk horrible experience something go wrongamazon issue shipping speed fake review empty box used product sold new bad packaging long time saving grace customer service would fix issue longer case customer service instead try anything refund package lost shipping even tracking return every time talk representative hear something completely different clue want phonechat asapi never use amazon year per year spent never get another cent ordering anything stressful anticipate something go wrong try literally site want electronics bh want regular good target walmart trading card art ebay etsy literally anything amazon never thought would dump amazon far trouble it’s worth continues track prime removed service next year,0.04301354607565081,0.9569864539243492,0.12899607403252944,0.2,0.8042924417686805,80.42924417686805,High Trust
