00 back because I charge it on my credit card and the rest in cash purchase gift card I lost.",2023-06-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,15.0,1964,385,39,8,160.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon good honest website online shopping hack shopping website computer froze call number computer screen male voice thick accent instructed give access computer don’t know remove add appts ever since incident percent believe amazon access computer log online shopping another time november expecting delivery package got text message amazon driver go update address deliver package foreign amazon site told charge cent redeliver package put credit info got suspicious reported amazon customer service issue amazon june scam buying online amazon website don’t remember detail much online call credit card bank believe call make bank interfere scammer requested call back another number security reason call number area code don’t remember rest pretending bank informed charge charge online porn site i’ve paid get money back got access bank online check much money since little ask cash access much settle gift card walmart shopping center near card value eachhe ask give gift card serial number call bank check charge told charge amount please aware decent honest consumer shop online specially amazon still receipt scam gift card manage get back charge credit card rest cash purchase gift card lost,0.0008304542532964659,0.9991695457467036,0.21592821088053843,0.2,0.8427704150494595,84.27704150494594,High Trust
