Shelley Parr,/users/587102a20000ff000a69c3d1,GB,36.0,2023-11-13 19:02:36+00:00,1.0,Refusing to refund my money to the…,"Refusing to refund my money to the original payment and forcing me to take a gift balance. Manager was rude constantly interrupting me and talked me over me the whole time. So I kept trying to repeat what I was saying until she stopped and showed she was listening, but guess what she didn’t she took this as a competition or a mission accepted to talk over me asking the question repeatedly. She said that it could only be refunded as gift balance as half was gift balance and half was debit card but as I tried to explain to her that all or it was originally debit card and the only reason why some of the payment shows as gift balance is because I had returned an outdoor sensor light and re ordering a different one and the quickest way to do that was to put it on to my Amazon account. So my question was but taking away the gift balance I still paid and extra £10 odd on debit to top up the difference in cost of the new light and an additional purchase of some blue plasters I needed for work, (I had received skin coloured plasters which I can’t use in my job) so I tried to say you could still refund to my debit card because £10 odd the transaction was debit card (even though all of it was originally debit card) and this would more than cover the cost of the plaster, she just kept telling no you can’t it have it back on your debit card because you paid gift balance and I said no there was a debit payment on it she was having none of it and wouldn’t let me even say all the above without her continuously talking over me telling me no no no u can’t no your wrong it a gift balance. I don’t know what trustpilot doesn’t give me option for 0 I came of that call stressed and annoyed. And tbh I don’t think Amazon will care that I or many others have come here and wrote reviews about their experiences",2023-11-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,13.0,1814,356,35,7,0.0,0,0