Donna,/users/6550d8d94fb56b0011912958,GB,1.0,2023-11-12 16:05:55+00:00,1.0,"""Collect from Office Unknown ""?????","2 separate orders within a week not delivered. Tracking said they tried to deliver the first package but our driveway/front door was inaccessible.  This was untrue. I was there all day and no attempt was made to deliver. They said they would try to deliver again the next day but they didn't.  Not only that,  it then went on to say my package was at an office unknown.  What is that supposed to mean!! I complained snd got a refund. The next day a second package I was waiting for again failed to arrive. The tracking has told me if it hasn't arrived by 14th to call the next day for a refund.  To me that sounds like it's not going to arrive anyway.  I would normally do all my Christmas Shopping on Amazon but this year I'm not going to risk it and would rather go to my local supermarkets and department stores.  Amazon is not the company it used to be and I no longer trust it.",2023-11-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,12.0,882,169,35,5,2.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,separate order within week delivered tracking said tried deliver first package drivewayfront door inaccessible untrue day attempt made deliver said would try deliver next day didnt went say package office unknown supposed mean complained snd got refund next day second package waiting failed arrive tracking told hasnt arrived th call next day refund sound like going arrive anyway would normally christmas shopping amazon year im going risk would rather go local supermarket department store amazon company used longer trust,0.11378924515100328,0.8862107548489967,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.7620621917823223,76.20621917823223,High Trust
