FLeitch,/users/654fe3a9f9ac270011cc9e44,GB,2.0,2023-11-12 09:53:26+00:00,1.0,An hour of my life I will never get back!,"Just spent an hour on the phone trying to sort out an issue with a delivery I have not received.  The delivery email stated it had been delivered through the letter box.  It definitely was not received.  Customer services was absolutely shocking this evening! I have had a few deliveries that have not been received, as they have been left on the door mat outside, even though my instructions clearly state do not leave parcels outside front door and to knock and hand the parcel directly to me…it’s an endless battle. I keep getting promised it won’t happen again *sigh* that’s 3 deliveries not received in just over a week.  You can’t even speak to a human being… everything is so automated! Anyone reading this review… stop supporting amazon and maybe they will actually listen and start to realise that it’s only through our continued patronage that they have a business. #shockingcustomerservice #boycotamazon",2023-11-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,12.0,914,153,41,10,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,spent hour phone trying sort issue delivery received delivery email stated delivered letter box definitely received customer service absolutely shocking evening delivery received left door mat outside even though instruction clearly state leave parcel outside front door knock hand parcel directly me…it’s endless battle keep getting promised won’t happen sigh that’s delivery received week can’t even speak human being… everything automated anyone reading review… stop supporting amazon maybe actually listen start realise it’s continued patronage business shockingcustomerservice boycotamazon,0.1557892396245912,0.8442107603754088,0.08581043185642176,0.2,0.7392674665589888,73.92674665589888,Medium Trust
