Teenamarie,/users/4e7e52dd00006400010c6e58,GB,28.0,2023-11-11 20:16:43+00:00,1.0,Bad service,"If I could give 0 stars, I would! Twice this week our delivery has been left on the front doorstep, in full view of anyone walking/driving by. Instructions are to be left in the greenhouse if no answers but our driver either can not read, doesn’t understand English or just can’t be arsed! Even leaving a polite note on the front door stating to NOT LEAVE PARCELS ON THE DOORSTEP had no effect and came home to parcels left on doorstep once again! Getting as bad as EVRI!",2023-11-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,11.0,471,88,11,2,1.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,could give star would twice week delivery left front doorstep full view anyone walkingdriving instruction left greenhouse answer driver either read doesn’t understand english can’t arsed even leaving polite note front door stating leave parcel doorstep effect came home parcel left doorstep getting bad evri,0.9797786583637488,0.020221341636251222,0.049355019629837356,0.2,0.31998167474409306,31.998167474409307,Low Trust
william,/users/557b233e0000ff0001c59490,GB,35.0,2023-11-11 19:46:57+00:00,1.0,Amazon deliveries have become a…,Amazon deliveries have become a shambles. 3 occassions in the last couple of weeks i had one stolen cardboard envelope which could very fit through letter box but for some strange reason the driver didnt and it got stolen. Then a week between 2 separate orders i dont receive them. Drivers dont even chap your door. I have a dog who sits at the window all day and as soon as my door is chapped or the bell goes he starts barking. I seriously think thieving is going on with these sub contractors. I now get a password from amazon to pass on to driver on receipt of delivery. I think this is a great idea.,2023-11-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,11.0,604,116,32,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon delivery become shamble occassions last couple week one stolen cardboard envelope could fit letter box strange reason driver didnt got stolen week separate order dont receive driver dont even chap door dog sits window day soon door chapped bell go start barking seriously think thieving going sub contractor get password amazon pas driver receipt delivery think great idea,0.03443904423691267,0.9655609557630873,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.7957922557839554,79.57922557839554,High Trust
Dee,/users/654fb460f9ac270011cc8ff3,US,1.0,2023-11-11 19:23:45+00:00,1.0,Amazon Flex - Driver Support is Equivalent to Poo Poo,"Amazon Flex - Side GigThe quality of Driver Support is severely lacking; it appears to be more of a facade than genuine concern. Support is often incapable of providing meaningful assistance to drivers and tends to offer recommendations that harm their standings. Despite my brief tenure of less than 15 days and only 5 attempted/completed deliveries, I've filed numerous reports without satisfactory resolutions. No one responds to your support emails and direct contact with Support is useless. They're dismissive and just want to end the call so they can carry on with their laziness.There is a noticeable lack of care from just about everyone, exemplified by unanswered emails, unhelpful support responses, and the logistical failure of multiple drivers delivering to the same location simultaneously. My account seems to be shadow banned without any fault on my part, a consequence of ill-advised recommendations from support representatives. Once shadow banned, available offers are scarce and undesirable, often requiring the completion of more deliveries than you can actually handle and in an unreasonably short time frame, particularly to challenging locations. (apartments, building complex's, gates, codes, with poorly written instructions)It's perplexing that, despite only three deliveries, I've garnered a multitude of compliments from customers, yet support continues to recommend actions detrimental to drivers' scores. With one incident again, recommended by a support rep, I am now seeing 0 offers and the offers that I do see are so bad that you're almost always going to be late. A company of such stature, built on innovative minds, should prioritize refining its Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) and Standard Work Instructions (SWIs). The current lack of coherence in support recommendations suggests a need for substantial improvement.The repercussions are evident when company leadership prioritizes personal gain over reinvesting in the company. Profiting extensively from AliExpress products, they display negligence towards their flawed mobile applications, lackluster pay, subpar support team, and logistical shortcomings. It serves as a prime illustration of poorly developed AI and algorithms.",2023-11-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,11.0,2228,326,53,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon flex side gigthe quality driver support severely lacking appears facade genuine concern support often incapable providing meaningful assistance driver tends offer recommendation harm standing despite brief tenure less day attemptedcompleted delivery ive filed numerous report without satisfactory resolution one responds support email direct contact support useless theyre dismissive want end call carry lazinessthere noticeable lack care everyone exemplified unanswered email unhelpful support response logistical failure multiple driver delivering location simultaneously account seems shadow banned without fault part consequence illadvised recommendation support representative shadow banned available offer scarce undesirable often requiring completion delivery actually handle unreasonably short time frame particularly challenging location apartment building complex gate code poorly written instructionsits perplexing despite three delivery ive garnered multitude compliment customer yet support continues recommend action detrimental driver score one incident recommended support rep seeing offer offer see bad youre almost always going late company stature built innovative mind prioritize refining standard operating procedure sop standard work instruction swis current lack coherence support recommendation suggests need substantial improvementthe repercussion evident company leadership prioritizes personal gain reinvesting company profiting extensively aliexpress product display negligence towards flawed mobile application lackluster pay subpar support team logistical shortcoming serf prime illustration poorly developed ai algorithm,0.0026663747470492905,0.9973336252529507,0.18283791362871565,0.2,0.8352343953522184,83.52343953522184,High Trust
