Hy Spec,/users/5f843f565f99e6001ae668b8,GB,7.0,2023-11-09 17:57:50+00:00,5.0,Amazon overtaken ebay,"I've routinely used Amazon for little over a couple of years now & ebay for over 17 years.Amazon customer service is better than what ebay used to provide it's premium members (but no longer provide).I cannot believe it, but I have been able to speak with Customer services (real person) all hours - even at 4am & for then to holistically evaluate & provide swift resolution on the phone.Another advantage is that Amazon have oversight & control of delivery of the item, they are accountable and reliable unlike ebay where sellers may use some crap delivery service like Evri/Hermes, which often deliver to the wrong address & having to wait weeks for a replacement/refund. Amazon prime's delivery service is often free, but crucially fast - very fast! Often next day, regardless whether it's a weekday or weekend - simply unparalleled.Amazon are definitely going to (and in fact are) overtaking ebay.Gia Hy",2023-11-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,9.0,907,151,21,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ive routinely used amazon little couple year ebay yearsamazon customer service better ebay used provide premium member longer providei cannot believe able speak customer service real person hour even holistically evaluate provide swift resolution phoneanother advantage amazon oversight control delivery item accountable reliable unlike ebay seller may use crap delivery service like evrihermes often deliver wrong address wait week replacementrefund amazon prime delivery service often free crucially fast fast often next day regardless whether weekday weekend simply unparalleledamazon definitely going fact overtaking ebaygia hy,0.15515712910624016,0.8448428708937599,0.08468872686483454,1.0,1.9393591808198467,193.93591808198468,High Trust
