Brittany,/users/61f31e3e54c40b001276ac35,US,53.0,2023-11-09 04:22:17+00:00,1.0,Haven't been happy with Amazon the past…,"Haven't been happy with Amazon the past few months. Everytime I reach out about a complaint towards a driver and hoping I don't have to deal with anymore ignorant ones not following delivery instructions, I deal with another one. Dealt with one today. I reached out and complained about them, agent apologized twice and said they'd take care of it and also escalated the situation so it won't happen again. Was it really escalated and taken care of though? I've dealt with it before and complained and I was told the same thing. I can't stand when anyone but myself and my boyfriend walk or try to walk between my vehicles. That's ignorant. There is no reason for it especially where my front door is they can just walk through grass. I'm tired of reaching out about this. Always seems to be random drivers that haven't been here before too. But I have it listed on my account for drivers not to walk between my vehicles at all. Wish people would have commen sense and respect but clearly lots of people out there lack both. I will stop ordering from Amazon for as long as I live here if I'm going to continue to get ignorant drivers. Also every driver reported no matter what company they work for, should be punished in some way and not be able to deliver at the house that complained about them anymore. I also have had issues with rude/unhelpful agents many times.I also don't like how you have to have a credit card to do try before you buy. A debit card should be just fine! I also like the Amazon payment plans, I've used it for 3 or 4 items, but now I no longer see payments available when I browse and don't understand why. If they were available to me before, they should always be available to me. I paid off everything on time to.",2023-11-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,9.0,1742,323,40,7,2.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,havent happy amazon past month everytime reach complaint to