francesca marie,/users/5c081aaf0717ee0c17d97d86,US,12.0,2023-11-16 19:45:33+00:00,1.0,Placed an order for next day delivery…,"Placed an order for next day delivery that was a gift.  Received an email saying my package was, not only delivered, but handed to me and signed for by me.  Neither of which is true.  Package was never delivered and customer service was a joke. This is not the first time this has happened.  I have read a lot about drivers stealing packages.  Amazon prime is a great online shopping option but when delivery is this bad it's not worth it.Update on 11/16/23  Regarding the above order. Finally received the order in 3 separate shipments.  I needed to return 3 items via UPS store.  One item was refunded the following day the other 2 have been received by the shipping facility but the refund is being held until December .  I wrote the following to Amazon when they asked to rate my experience when speaking with their customer rep today:""Where is my damn refund?  And, when did Amazon change the policy on refunds without informing their client base.  I returned 3 items to ups. Received a refund for 1 item the following day.  The other 2 show my items were accepted by the facility in Indianapolis and I can expect a refund around December. 1st...what in the hell?  I need the refund NOW .  Maybe your customers should start charging Amazon interest on our refunds they are stalling. This in no way reflects on the customer service I received from Nana.  Although prior to speaking with her I spoke with another who referred me to the chat bot because the verification codes he kept sending , to which I responded, were not received on his end.  Get it together Amazon before your customer service rating falls below those for Temu.""",2023-11-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,16.0,1637,290,38,7,10.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,placed order next day delivery gift received email saying package delivered handed signed neither true package never delivered customer service joke first 