Jay in NC,/users/5f7d1590b0a0db0012239704,US,3.0,2023-11-08 02:37:45+00:00,4.0,Amazon has pros and cons - Good overall!,"Amazon has it's pros and cons, but one thing they usually have going for them is good return policies!I know that not all Amazon sellers are required to adhere to the standard return policy, but that is shown on the item page where the item is sold.  If you check that, and order only RETURNABLE items, and check the specific return policy for certain items - should be a good experience.I've placed literally hundreds of orders through Amazon, and 98% of the time, I've been satisfied either with the product I received, or a full refund.The only reason I'm not giving Amazon 5 stars is because they definitely have room for improvement, and I don't like how they've impacted the business of so many local brick-and-mortar stores.",2023-11-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,8.0,731,127,40,8,2.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,amazon pro con one thing usually going good return policiesi know amazon seller required adhere standard return policy shown item page item sold check order returnable item check specific return policy certain item good experienceive placed literally hundred order amazon time ive satisfied either product received full refundthe reason im giving amazon star definitely room improvement dont like theyve impacted business many local brickandmortar store,0.045579279139598534,0.9544207208604014,0.071228266965788,0.8,1.6914560138233583,169.14560138233583,High Trust
