Dexter,/users/6548da6fb0bede0011ecce43,HK,2.0,2023-11-06 14:22:52+00:00,1.0,Unfriendly policies for damaged items,"I recently ordered a book from Amazon, and when I received it the cover page was torn. I was told that I needed to send the item back for a refund within 31 days, but unfortunately had a trip planned that would take me out of the country for quite a while.No workarounds give, no extensions given...nothing. I asked if that means ""I have to accept damaged goods because of Amazon's fault, and that I'm a sucker for having a trip scheduled for more than 31 days"". The customer service rep actually told me ""yes"". Pretty amazing, will not use again. Plenty of other ecommerce options to choose from...",2023-11-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,6.0,599,109,37,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently ordered book amazon received cover page torn told needed send item back refund within day unfortunately trip planned would take country quite whileno workarounds give extension givennothing asked mean accept damaged good amazon fault im sucker trip scheduled day customer service rep actually told yes pretty amazing use plenty ecommerce option choose,0.01214700996714004,0.98785299003286,0.061132922041503085,0.2,0.8061530794247306,80.61530794247305,High Trust
