David Abbott,/users/6534cbde6cdad40012c8c671,GB,2.0,2023-11-05 17:36:43+00:00,1.0,Delivery nonsense and unhelpful customer service,"I ordered an Air Fryer and paid the delivery charge, on the day of delivery all was well, and I watched as I moved up the queue, then when i was next, all of sudden my order was placed on hold with a message saying extra information required, I had provided a full address, my contact number and email address.I rang customer service and the first lady I spoke to couldn’t have been less helpful at one point she actually suggested that not only might I not get my product but that I wouldn’t get my money back, I requested she get her manager.  Once I was on with the manager all she could say was more information was required for the delivery, when I asked what more than my full address, phone number and email could I provide, she checked and confirmed that I had provided all of that at the time of order but responded that she did not know but that there was nothing she could do about it and that I would have to wait till 8pm for the end of the delivery day before I could make any kind of complaint or request it be redelivered.I WILL NEVER BUY FROM AMAZON AGAIN!",2023-11-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,5.0,1073,207,48,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered air fryer paid delivery charge day delivery well watched moved queue next sudden order placed hold message saying extra information required provided full address contact number email addressi rang customer service first lady spoke couldn’t less helpful one point actually suggested might get product wouldn’t get money back requested get manager manager could say information required delivery asked full address phone number email could provide checked confirmed provided time order responded know nothing could would wait till pm end delivery day could make kind complaint request redeliveredi never buy amazon,0.0504822811187271,0.9495177188812729,0.1160964666292765,0.2,0.7979781527664918,79.797815276649