Lisa Barrett (lisebrrtt),/users/5773a01f0000ff000a2d4ee8,GB,65.0,2023-11-05 17:50:58+00:00,1.0,Amazon customer service - None existent,"Ordered a lens on Friday for my husband it was £669 very good value and was supposedly on sale with Amazon.  It was due to arrive on Sunday.  Sunday morning I received an email informing me that the lens had to be cancelled due to unavailability and that it would take 1 - 2 business days before the money would go back on my account!! I went into Amazon where the lens was showing as still having 6 available. I finally contacted Amazon by phone, asking to speak to a Manager, there was a definitely a language barrier, I found it extremely difficult understanding what they were saying, with at least 2 customer service reps speaking very bad English, and did not understand what I wanted and basically just put the phone down on me.I could not get in touch with a manager at all, despite trying for over an hour, finally I used the chat option. I was put through to someone who said he was a member of the leadership team, who told me the 6 that were showing available, were already pre-ordered, (which is surly rubbish, as if pre-ordered surely they shouldn't show as being available).  I said that I had ordered these on Friday and if they weren't available, why had they taken the money for these out of my account?  He was not able/refused to answer that question.Earlier this week I had a generated email from Amazon, telling me I was cancelling items and if this continued they would not refund me.  When I got in touch with them about this, they said it was automatically generated email.  I pointed out that what they were saying about refunding was illegal and that, in my case, it was they who were cancelling items not I.  This is all very strange isn't it?  I have attached a picture of the lens, this I uploaded at 11.36 on Sunday 5th November, so you can see for yourselves it is still stating 6 available (NOT 6 PRE-ORDERED).  Again the 6 lens are still showing as available at 17.26pm and again at 17.50pm on Sunday 5th November.  I have taken a snap shot and can share if required.  This is very frustratingSeriously considering closing all my accounts with Amazon, having been with them for many years the level of customer service, is now non existent!!!!!",2023-11-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,5.0,2178,395,39,6,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,ordered lens friday husband £ good value supposedly sale amazon due arrive sunday sunday morning received email informing lens cancelled due unavailability would take business day money would go back account went amazon lens showing still available finally contacted amazon phone asking speak manager definitely language barrier found extremely difficult understanding saying least customer service rep speaking bad english understand wanted basically put phone mei could get touch manager despite trying hour finally used chat option put someone said member leadership team told showing available already preordered surly rubbish preordered surely shouldnt show available said ordered friday werent available taken money account ablerefused answer questionearlier week generated email amazon telling cancelling item continued would refund got touch said automatically generated email pointed saying refunding illegal case cancelling item strange isnt attached picture lens uploaded sunday th november see still stating available preordered lens still showing available pm pm sunday th november taken snap shot share required frustratingseriously considering closing account amazon many year level customer service non existent,0.9996701009091722,0.0003298990908278121,0.22153673583847447,0.2,0.3444722967131088,34.44722967131088,Low Trust
