Arnold Saenz,/users/64cd677ade21ff00111d9ac8,US,3.0,2023-11-04 17:21:45+00:00,2.0,Review of Amazon Locker service,"Review of a specific aspect of Amazon, and that is delivery to a nearby locker for pickup.  They state 3 days to pickup, but in reality it is more like 2, where I live.  You are given notice it has arrived towards the end of the first day, instead of towards the beginning, and that counts as 1 day, and so you have 2 days to pick up the package, otherwise, it will be returned.  So 3 days is false, and you have to arrange your schedule to get your package within 2 days or it will be returned.",2023-11-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,4.0,495,99,31,5,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,review specific aspect amazon delivery nearby locker pickup state day pickup reality like live given notice arrived towards end first day instead towards beginning count day day pick package otherwise returned day false arrange schedule get package within day returned,0.010731624485903282,0.9892683755140967,0.055524397083567024,0.4,1.1057390671737617,110.57390671737618,High Trust
