customer,/users/5f3fcacd3e39bef5835f4559,GB,9.0,2023-11-04 14:40:00+00:00,1.0,I ordered a mixer shower,"I ordered a mixer shower, and never received it, I contacted DPD and Amazon customer service, I tried contacting the seller but was unable to. The Amazon customer service team asked me to fill out a form which I did, then sent another one saying they sent the wrong one, I reported to the police like they asked me to and got a crime number like they asked me to, I even added the police badge number and the area of the police and this was still not enough for Amazon they are now telling me they cannot help meI will not stop until this have been sorted This is theft, bad customer service and. Fraud Times are hard people are trying to survive and you are doing this to us",2023-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,4.0,675,131,24,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered mixer shower never received contacted dpd amazon customer service tried contacting seller unable amazon customer service team asked fill form sent another one saying sent wrong one reported police like asked got crime number like asked even added police badge number area police still enough amazon telling cannot help mei stop sorted theft bad customer service fraud time hard people trying survive u,0.00793339083649628,0.9920666091635038,0.07347167694896242,0.2,0.8107276399715443,81.07276399715442,High Trust
