Sam Heseltine,/users/648acaa00fb7ec001200f790,GB,1.0,2023-11-04 09:49:26+00:00,1.0,Absolutely horrendous company,"Absolutely horrendous company ! Stay well clear ! I had 2 of their men pick up a pop up gazebo from me , they was over 3 hours late , then I asked them if they had a returns label to put on it ? They replied yes at the unit not with us , iv been waiting since the 28th of September for my £200 refund from amazon and arrow xl are saying the parcel was never scanned into returns and they can't help me , spoke to a few different people on the phone and they all said the same , we can't help you ? Worst company I have ever dealt with and would definitely not recommend to anyone to use. (STAY CLEAR) how un professional!!!! The carrier said take a photo if you don't believe me of the gazebo, iv sent them and amazon this and they still won't give me my money back both company's are absolutely cowboys amazon are saying they can't help me as I have no proof of return receipt or letter off carrier driver I have a email from amazon telling me to not put a label on the gazebo the driver will do it all and just give them the gazebo back iv done everything I was told to do and correctly yet amazon and arrowxl are both keep saying they can't help me ? So iv now lost £200 how does that work ? So I have now taken legal action against them.",2023-09-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,4.0,1241,254,29,3,37.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,absolutely horrendous company stay well clear men pick pop gazebo hour late asked return label put replied yes unit u iv waiting since th september £ refund amazon arrow xl saying parcel never scanned return cant help spoke different people phone said cant help worst company ever dealt would definitely recommend anyone use stay clear un professional carrier said take photo dont believe gazebo iv sent amazon still wont give money back company absolutely cowboy amazon saying cant help proof return receipt letter carrier driver email amazon telling put label gazebo driver give gazebo back iv done everything told correctly yet amazon arrowxl keep saying cant help iv lost £ work taken legal action,0.9948271448006946,0.005172855199305437,0.142456533931576,0.2,0.3310777343859679,33.10777343859679,Low Trust
