Karen,/users/5df7be1297520bf3f9c31408,US,16.0,2023-11-04 02:33:46+00:00,1.0,Dont Trust the Amazon 2 Day or Next Day Shipping,"Thoroughly Frustrated. With a company of this magnitude, I don't understand the reason why you can't get true Customer Service or there is nothing in place to resolve issues. I ordered a computer for my sister's birthday on 10/28/23 with promised 2-day shipping. I paid more to get it on Amazon because I wanted the 2-day shipping. Was supposed to be here on the 30th, then 31, then they changed to the 1st, then today the 3rd. Still has not arrived and tomorrow will be a week. I called them several times only to get ""I'm sorry for the inconvenience"" with no resolve. When you contact them online the chat gives you general answers that don't allow you to move forward. I can't even estimate how much money I have spent at Amazon. I've dealt with the late shipping multiple times but this is ridiculous. I am so disappointed with them. Not professional at all.",2023-10-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,4.0,862,155,48,10,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,thoroughly frustrated company magnitude dont understand reason cant get true customer service nothing place resolve issue ordered computer sister birthday promised day shipping paid get amazon wanted day shipping supposed th changed st today rd still arrived tomorrow week called several time get im sorry inconvenience resolve contact online chat give general answer dont allow move forward cant even estimate much money spent amazon ive dealt late shipping multiple time ridiculous disappointed professional,0.010270928524048803,0.9897290714759512,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.8122509631075774,81.22509631075773,High Trust
Антон Щербань,/users/654584c8df1ff4001195f7dc,US,1.0,2023-11-04 01:40:09+00:00,1.0,"Stolen iPad by Amazon-NO REFUND, BLOCKED account","I have been a loyal Amazon customer since 2016, consistently engaging in numerous transactions with a clear and honest track record. It is with great regret and frustration that I find myself compelled to leave a 1-star review after a recent experience that has left me questioning Amazon’s commitment to customer service and fair play.I recently purchased a 10th generation 256 GB iPad (Order No. 113-7489110-7733059), but upon delivery, I was shocked to discover a metal plate instead of the iPad I had ordered. Acting promptly, I reported the incident to Amazon within 30 minutes of delivery, providing all necessary documentation, including a detailed police report (Report No. 01-23-094996). Despite initially assuring me that a refund was in process, Amazon later retracted this and, without any valid justification, suspended my account, tainting my reputation by labeling me as a 'serial offender'.The handling of my case was not only unjust but it also highlighted a severe lack of evidence on Amazon’s part to substantiate their claims. Despite my efforts to resolve the issue amicably, including providing photographic evidence and engaging in extensive communication, Amazon has remained uncooperative. The discrepancy in package weight and the condition of the packaging upon receipt were clear indicators of tampering, yet my concerns were dismissed.My intent behind this review is not only to express my dissatisfaction but also to alert others to the potential pitfalls of dealing with Amazon’s customer service. It’s disheartening to have one's integrity doubted and to be denied a basic consumer right — the right to receive the purchased product or a refund.As I continue to seek a resolution through the Delaware Department of Justice Consumer Protection Unit, I am left with a tarnished view of a company I once held in high esteem. I can only hope that this review serves as a call for Amazon to improve their support processes and to treat their customers with the respect and honesty they deserve.Buyer beware – your loyalty may not shield you from a similar ordeal.",2023-10-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,4.0,2090,334,48,7,31.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,loyal amazon customer since consistently engaging numerous transaction clear honest track record great regret frustration find compelled leave star review recent experience left questioning amazon’s commitment customer service fair playi recently purchased th generation gb ipad order upon delivery shocked discover metal plate instead ipad ordered acting promptly reported incident amazon within minute delivery providing necessary documentation including detailed police report report despite initially assuring refund process amazon later retracted without valid justification suspended account tainting reputation labeling serial offenderthe handling case unjust also highlighted severe lack evidence amazon’s part substantiate claim despite effort resolve issue amicably including providing photographic evidence engaging extensive communication amazon remained uncooperative discrepancy package weight condition packaging upon receipt clear indicator tampering yet concern dismissedmy intent behind review express dissatisfaction also alert others potential pitfall dealing amazon’s customer service it’s disheartening one integrity doubted denied basic consumer right — right receive purchased product refundas continue seek resolution delaware department justice consumer protection unit left tarnished view company held high esteem hope review serf call amazon improve support process treat customer respect honesty deservebuyer beware – loyalty may shield similar ordeal,0.004879003886852122,0.9951209961131479,0.1873247335950645,0.2,0.8350254447755868,83.50254447755869,High Trust
