Ester Buenno,/users/6544bb32fad17400128847c7,GE,1.0,2023-11-03 11:23:58+00:00,1.0,Disappointing Customer Service and Product Quality from Amazon,"I recently had an incredibly disappointing experience with Amazon, and I feel compelled to share my dissatisfaction with the community. My purchase of a rice cooker from Amazon turned into a frustrating ordeal that highlighted their poor customer service and lack of empathy towards international customers.I purchased a rice cooker from Amazon, hoping to have a reliable kitchen appliance. However, the product arrived broken, rendering it completely unusable. As I was overseas at the time, I utilized a freight forwarder to have the product shipped to my location. Unfortunately, due to logistical constraints and the time taken for the shipment, I couldn't initiate the return process within the ten-day window provided by Amazon.Upon contacting their customer support, I was met with a series of canned responses that lacked any form of empathy or understanding of my situation. It seemed as though I was conversing with automated robots rather than individuals capable of critical thinking and problem-solving. Their refusal to provide a replacement or a refund left me feeling utterly disregarded and disrespected as a customer.It is deeply disheartening to encounter such a lack of consideration for the challenges faced by international customers. The rigid adherence to a ten-day return window, coupled with the robotic and unhelpful nature of their customer support, has significantly tarnished my perception of Amazon's commitment to customer satisfaction.As a loyal customer who has relied on Amazon for various purchases over the years, this experience has left me disillusioned and hesitant to continue using their services. I urge Amazon to reevaluate their customer service protocols and extend greater support and understanding to customers facing genuine difficulties, especially those outside the United States. It is crucial for them to remember that behind every transaction is a real person with genuine concerns and expectations.",2023-10-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,3.0,1953,295,62,8,24.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,recently incredibly disappointing experience amazon feel compelled share dissatisfaction community purchase rice cooker amazon turned frustrating ordeal highlighted poor customer service lack empathy towards international customersi purchased rice cooker amazon hoping reliable kitchen appliance however product arrived broken rendering completely unusable overseas time utilized freight forwarder product shipped location unfortunately due logistical constraint time taken shipment couldnt initiate return process within tenday window provided amazonupon contacting customer support met series canned response lacked form empathy understanding situation seemed though conversing automated robot rather individual capable critical thinking problemsolving refusal provide replacement refund left feeling utterly disregarded disrespected customerit deeply disheartening encounter lack consideration challenge faced international customer rigid adherence tenday return window coupled robotic unhelpful nature customer support significantly tarnished perception amazon commitment customer satisfactionas loyal customer relied amazon various purchase year experience left disillusioned hesitant continue using service urge amazon reevaluate customer service protocol extend greater support understanding customer facing genuine difficulty especially outside united state crucial remember behind every transaction real person genuine concern expectation,0.003238082230987405,0.9967619177690126,0.16545148625911385,0.2,0.8314712561363291,83.14712561363291,High Trust
Me,/users/619faa1e3602df001265964e,GB,3.0,2023-11-03 11:18:55+00:00,1.0,As with many other reviews Amazon very…,"As with many other reviews Amazon very rarely meet their delivery deadlines, I say very rarely as they have done so on a couple of occasions. Amazon always blame everyone other than take responsibility for these failures, if you can’t meet the target that they set, then don’t advertise that you can. We are now going to cancel our prime membership and close our account, dreadful company to try and deal with, and don’t expect to speak with a human anytime soon.",2023-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,3.0,463,82,39,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,many review amazon rarely meet delivery deadline say rarely done couple occasion amazon always blame everyone take responsibility failure can’t meet target set don’t advertise going cancel prime membership close account dreadful company try deal don’t expect speak human anytime soon,0.030432126353929383,0.9695678736460707,0.045989904655075714,0.2,0.7939819177540505,79.39819177540505,High Trust
Anne Baker,/users/56fbbd570000ff000a12ed04,GB,17.0,2023-11-03 11:18:52+00:00,5.0,Very surprised !,"Really surprised at the low ratings for Amazon. I've been using them for over 20 years , and have rarely had any problems at all with them. Prime is a great service, deliveries have been 97% on time over that 20 year period. Customer service is very good -Prompt refunds, good communication. Perhaps I've just been lucky?!",2023-11-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,3.0,322,57,16,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,really surprised low rating amazon ive using year rarely problem prime great service delivery time year period customer service good prompt refund good communication perhaps ive lucky,0.1572181773267878,0.8427818226732122,0.03196859226023556,1.0,1.9277846297886532,192.77846297886532,High Trust
