Agne Metcalfe,/users/6540471a628d850012ee2d5c,GB,1.0,2023-10-31 02:16:16+00:00,1.0,They are tragic,"Bought Elemis cream for £150, arrived damaged, asked to return for a replacement. They refused, when asked for a return address customer service closed the chat. Spent a lot on amazon and will never give them £1 again. Posted a review about damaged parcel and they took it down saying “we could not post your review because it focuses on one or more of these topics:Sellers, Delivery, Packaging, Pricing, Availability”. So if you get a damaged parcel, don’t expect returns or being able to post any feedback.",2023-10-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,31.0,508,87,15,3,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,bought elemi cream £ arrived damaged asked return replacement refused asked return address customer service closed chat spent lot amazon never give £ posted review damaged parcel took saying “we could post review focus one topicssellers delivery packaging pricing availability” get damaged parcel don’t expect return able post feedback,0.021771592487712453,0.9782284075122876,0.04879416713404375,0.2,0.7988730371829526,79.88730371829526,High Trust
