Rahul Mandal,/users/654007d0eb9f660011d2747b,IN,1.0,2023-10-30 21:45:29+00:00,1.0,Order not received neither refunded,The delivery guy didn't deliver the order and marked deliver. I called the Amazon on same day & they said you will get your order till 9 PM. After 2 days I called Amazon again & they said we will refund after investigation within 4 days. I called Zomato 10 days later & they said we cannot refund. I mailed them also & they replied the same. I want to know one thing only that what customer can do if they didn't get their order and money got deducted. Please uninstall Amazon soon. Next could be u,2023-10-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,30.0,498,97,35,5,17.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,delivery guy didnt deliver order marked deliver called amazon day said get order till pm day called amazon said refund investigation within day called zomato day later said cannot refund mailed also replied want know one thing customer didnt get order money got deducted please uninstall amazon soon next could u,0.005237952940536515,0.9947620470594635,0.05440269209197981,0.2,0.8082615619481277,80.82615619481277,High Trust
DM,/users/653fe5d0eb9f660011d26201,NL,1.0,2023-10-30 19:20:49+00:00,1.0,Got my money back through my legal insurance,"I have ordered stuff online for two decades, sometimes from sketchy shops with little hope for customer protection, yet I never got scammed. Until I ordered from Amazon.On April 2023 I placed a fairly expensive order (403-1085610-9838734) worth almost 600 euro, to only receive the wrong goods in a damaged and incomplete fashion. Although I immediately contacted Amazon I ended up in a nightmare for five long frustrating months without any reasonable compensation. I finally threatened to sue Amazon and got my money back through my legal insurance!Their nerve to claim ""Amazon strives to be Earth’s most customer-centric company"" is utterly appalling. Never in my life have I been treated so horribly. Amazon is by far the very worst online shopping experience I can imagine. Their level of incompetence is simply criminal.The whole thing went wrong when an Amazon helpdesk employee filed a ATOZ claim prematurely that had me waiting for one month, voiding my right to get reimbursed. It was their mistake for which I received multiple apologies from Amazon but which in the course of another four months couldn't be fixed. All this time I remained patient, polite and confident that Amazon would make right. Only, despite promises, they never did. After finally threatening Amazon with a lawsuit Amazon's Executive Customer Relations stepped in, making me a truly despicable offer: to put my money on a voucher ""with something extra for the inconvenience"". How on earth is that reasonable? The item I ordered was no longer available through Amazon, so I kindly declined the extra's and just demanded my money back. Their response: ""We apologize we could not find a solution to the problem. Unfortunately we are unable to offer any new information. We will no longer respond to anything related to this order."" Not find a solution? How about just giving people back their money when you screw up so miserably, causing five months of frustration?Although my case was solid and well documented my legal insurance advised against litigation because a lawsuit could take another five months to win. My patience had run out and I ended agreeing to be paid out my incurred losses by the insurance. Amazon went scot-free and probably continues to scam more honest customers out of their money. Utterly disgusting. Naturally I terminated anything related to Amazon. This will remain the first and last time I was robbed of my money by a billion dollar company... I'll stick with the smaller ""sketchy"" businesses that have remained decent and reliable.",2023-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,30.0,2546,417,44,8,56.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered stuff online two decade sometimes sketchy shop little hope customer protection yet never got scammed ordered amazonon april placed fairly expensive order worth almost euro receive wrong good damaged incomplete fashion although immediately contacted amazon ended nightmare five long frustrating month without reasonable compensation finally threatened sue amazon got money back legal insurancetheir nerve claim amazon strives earth’s customercentric company utterly appalling never life treated horribly amazon far worst online shopping experience imagine level incompetence simply criminalthe whole thing went wrong amazon helpdesk employee filed atoz claim prematurely waiting one month voiding right get reimbursed mistake received multiple apology amazon course another four month couldnt fixed time remained patient polite confident amazon would make right despite promise never finally threatening amazon lawsuit amazon executive customer relation stepped making truly despicable offer put money voucher something extra inconvenience earth reasonable item ordered longer available amazon kindly declined extra demanded money back response apologize could find solution problem unfortunately unable offer new information longer respond anything related order find solution giving people back money screw miserably causing five month frustrationalthough case solid well documented legal insurance advised litigation lawsuit could take another five month win patience run ended agreeing paid incurred loss insurance amazon went scotfree probably continues scam honest customer money utterly disgusting naturally terminated anything related amazon remain first last time robbed money billion dollar company ill stick smaller sketchy business remained decent reliable,0.006338405631519394,0.9936615943684806,0.2338754907459338,0.2,0.8436058953334271,84.3605895333427,High Trust
