Nigel Lane,/users/653fc6c6d33f280012190706,CZ,1.0,2023-10-30 17:11:55+00:00,1.0,Amazon bad service,"Subject: Complaint regarding refund issues and poor customer serviceDear Amazon Customer Service,I am writing to you with great dissatisfaction and frustration regarding my recent experience with Amazon. As a loyal customer, I expect a certain level of service, which unfortunately has been severely lacking in my recent interactions with your company. I made a purchase on Amazon, using my own funds, for an item. To my disappointment, the wrong size was sent to me not once, but three times. In order to expedite the process, I used the return refunds provided to me in gift card form and immediately repurchased the item. However, due to the repeated errors made by Amazon, I finally requested a refund for the item to be returned to my original account.To my dismay, it took four weeks and multiple attempts to contact customer service to receive a response. Eventually, the refund was processed, but contrary to what I was informed, it was credited back to the gift card instead of my original account. I subsequently reached out to seniormanagers and was assured on four separate occasions that the refund would be transferred to my account within seven days.However, it has now been an unreasonable amount of time, and I still have not received the refund in my original account. Furthermore, when I contacted Amazon again to rectify the situation, I was informed that they could not refund the money from the gift card, which was originally my own money.I am deeply disappointed and frustrated by this level of service. It is unacceptable for Amazon to provide false information and promises regarding refunds, causing undue inconvenience and financial loss on my part.I kindly request a thorough investigation into this matter and a prompt resolution. I expect the refund to be immediately credited back to my original account without any further delays. Additionally, I would appreciate appropriate compensation for the time, effort, and frustration I have experienced as a result of Amazon's errors and poor customer service.I value my long-standing relationship with Amazon and hope that this complaint prompts a change in the way you handle such situations. I trust that you will take immediate action to rectify these issues and restore my faith in the company.I look forward to your prompt response resolving this matter.Thank you for your attention to this urgent issue.Yours sincerely,Nigel Lane",2023-10-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,30.0,2412,389,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,subject complaint regarding refund issue poor customer servicedear amazon customer servicei writing great dissatisfaction frustration regarding recent experience amazon loyal customer expect certain level service unfortunately severely lacking recent interaction company made purchase amazon using fund item disappointment wrong size sent three time order expedite process used return refund provided gift card form immediately repurchased item however due repeated error made amazon finally requested refund item returned original accountto dismay took four week multiple attempt contact customer service receive response eventually refund processed contrary informed credited back gift card instead original account subsequently reached seniormanagers assured four separate occasion refund would transferred account within seven dayshowever unreasonable amount time still received refund original account furthermore contacted amazon rectify situation informed could refund money gift card originally moneyi deeply disappointed frustrated level service unacceptable amazon provide false information promise regarding refund causing undue inconvenience financial loss parti kindly request thorough investigation matter prompt resolution expect refund immediately credited back original account without delay additionally would appreciate appropriate compensation time effort frustration experienced result amazon error poor customer servicei value longstanding relationship amazon hope complaint prompt change way handle situation trust take immediate action rectify issue restore faith companyi look forward prompt response resolving matterthank attention urgent issueyours sincerelynigel lane,0.0061692992818499865,0.99383070071815,0.21817162086371283,0.2,0.8405496745318176,84.05496745318176,High Trust
Tammy,/users/64f27674ee59660013fdc2c8,US,11.0,2023-10-30 14:21:54+00:00,2.0,No Bathroom Breaks?,"I am a blogger who writes about company reviews on any company I come across to. I am sure some of you will agree with me on this. I know someone who is a driver, and they better be treated respectfully.It is important to look around at other stores. I look at prices too. Online is a bigger issue with dealing with scams. Be careful where you shop online. Amazon is one of them.I was ranting while I was walking back from a store. I saw an Amazon truck. There seems to be a lot more nowadays. But this specific truck looked old, not the ones I usually see. I was curious of where this truck came from. Do drivers have to clean the truck themselves?. I feel bad for those drivers. I was really annoyed, no bathroom breaks?!. The warehouse employees are fired at the year 3 of how long they have been working. The company has stated that after three years, the employees are 'lazy'. They pay you to leave. Instead of fixing the speed of shipping, why not fix the employee situation?. These are human beings. Even the ones with color do not get treated fairly. Even though Amazon has a 'black lives matter' thing on their website or advertisements, it is lie.I say to myself, it is not just with the people you see at a store, to me, it is about the whole company, is the CEO willing to change something’s about their company. I hope the employees are striking for more respect, who does the harder work?, the employees. I still have not used the app. I am glad. I feel for those employees with the holiday season coming up.",2023-09-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,30.0,1522,286,19,3,35.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,blogger writes company review company come across sure agree know someone driver better treated respectfullyit important look around store look price online bigger issue dealing scam careful shop online amazon one themi ranting walking back store saw amazon truck seems lot nowadays specific truck looked old one usually see curious truck came driver clean truck feel bad driver really annoyed bathroom break warehouse employee fired year long working company stated three year employee lazy pay leave instead fixing speed shipping fix employee situation human being even one color get treated fairly even though amazon black life matter thing website advertisement liei say people see store whole company ceo willing change something’s company hope employee striking respect harder work employee still used app glad feel employee holiday season coming,0.06608957675402702,0.933910423245973,0.16040381379697138,0.4,1.0990359743823805,109.90359743823805,High Trust
