Jakub Ward,/users/653eddccc334c700127a65ce,GB,2.0,2023-10-30 02:03:03+00:00,1.0,They stole me and closed my account,"I had a horrible exprience with Amazon. They have scammed me for only 20$. It started when I purschased a gift card via Dundel using my skrill account, everything was okay. I used it in Amazon and they gave me 20$. after that I went to buy an item from them and when I checked out and paid with my 20$ they closed my account and asked me for a proof. I sent the purschasing bill of Dundel but they did not respond I have tried to email them many times but they reply with the same thing over and over. They stole me and I am surprised of the many bad reviews they getting here",2023-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,30.0,576,116,35,7,56.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,horrible exprience amazon scammed started purschased gift card via dundel using skrill account everything okay used amazon gave went buy item checked paid closed account asked proof sent purschasing bill dundel respond tried email many time reply thing stole surprised many bad review getting,0.006545387506188107,0.9934546124938118,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.8097390841493176,80.97390841493176,High Trust
tanya Holloway,/users/5cdd981dd7bca40813771496,GB,5.0,2023-10-31 23:06:48+00:00,1.0,I am disgusted with Amazon,"I am disgusted with Amazon. They stole my money without my permission. I signed up to a monthly thing and paid my first month upfront then they have now taken a year of £95. Who the hell do you think you are stealing my money without my permission. I will be contacting my bank and reporting this. This is theft. There is no number or email to contact you to sort it out so I’ll submit a fraud claim. 90% of all films you have to buy now or rent, what are we actually getting for Amazon prime anymore? I also found out I’ve been paying Amazon music that I didn’t sign up for which was meant to be included in prime. I will never use Amazon prime again. I’ll stick to eBay or other selling sites.",2023-10-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,31.0,695,137,26,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,disgusted amazon stole money without permission signed monthly thing paid first month upfront taken year £ hell think stealing money without permission contacting bank reporting theft number email contact sort i’ll submit fraud claim film buy rent actually getting amazon prime anymore also found i’ve paying amazon music didn’t sign meant included prime never use amazon prime i’ll stick ebay selling site,0.024654269933341858,0.9753457300666581,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.8030402234180739,80.3040223418074,High Trust
