Tonya Bailey,/users/649b6b6b469a430012ea1e4b,US,2.0,2023-10-28 20:38:26+00:00,2.0,Getting tired of foreign products…,"Getting tired of foreign products getting shown first. They are usually very cheaply made and not worth the money. I also would expect to see items that I searched for, not a lot of stuff I didn’t. It’s frustrating to weed through stuff I didn’t request. Lastly, when I see next day delivery or delivery by 3, I expect it to be there by then. Especially when I filter the search for that. Many times I don’t get it by their initial delivery day. Sometimes I need something by a certain time and when it’s late, it’s useless.",2023-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,28.0,524,98,34,5,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,getting tired foreign product getting shown first usually cheaply made worth money also would expect see item searched lot stuff didn’t it’s frustrating weed stuff didn’t request lastly see next day delivery delivery expect especially filter search many time don’t get initial delivery day sometimes need something certain time it’s late it’s useless,0.00953406147906994,0.99046593852093,0.054963544587773416,0.4,1.1062256781780198,110.62256781780198,High Trust
