Paul Cormier,/users/653d162073570c0012d32169,CA,1.0,2023-11-30 14:11:53+00:00,1.0,Beware when item comes in multiple pieces,"I recently order a tonneau cover for my truck. The item ships in 2 pieces: the cover and the rails. Amazon only shipped the cover and did not ship the rails. I called their customer support and was told there was no way for them to ship me the missing box... instead, I would have to return the product and re-order.I returned the one box I had received and waited for Amazon to receive the returned item. After 2 weeks, I still had not received a refund, so I called customer service once again. Apparently, something was missed so they hadn't issued a refund. 5 days later, my credit card was refunded.As requested, I re-ordered the product. Once again, I received only the cover and not the rails. When I called Amazon, I was told I couldn't return it because it hadn't been delivered even though it was clearly sitting in my garage (apparently it did not show up as delivered in their system). I waited until it showed as delivered online and called customer service again (4th time if you're keeping count). Same story... they cannot send me the missing box so I will have to return the cover and re-order.This has been going on for almost 2 months now.The saga continues... Given this is an oversized item, it must be picked up by a local carrier. After 10 days, 3 calls to customer service, and 4 emails to customer service, I finally received the email I needed that needed to be forwarded to the local carrier. 2 weeks after initial delivery, the box was picked up and is on route to Amazon.Not over yet! The one box was picked up from my home on November 10th. It took until November 21st to get to Amazon in Toronto. Amazon now claims they need up to 14 days to process the return and issue my refund. As of November 30th, Amazon's systems have yet to be updated... and of course, no refund.",2023-10-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,11.0,30.0,1802,332,41,7,37.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,recently order tonneau cover truck item ship piece cover rail amazon shipped cover ship rail called customer support told way ship missing box instead would return product reorderi returned one box received waited amazon receive returned item week still received refund called customer service apparently something missed hadnt issued refund day later credit card refundedas requested reordered product received cover rail called amazon told couldnt return hadnt delivered even though clearly sitting garage apparently show delivered system waited showed delivered online called customer service th time youre keeping count story cannot send missing box return cover reorderthis going almost month nowthe saga continues given oversized item must picked local carrier day call customer service email customer service finally received email needed needed forwarded local carrier week initial delivery box picked route amazonnot yet one box picked home november th took november st get amazon toronto amazon claim need day process return issue refund november th amazon system yet updated course refund,0.030199409303027943,0.9698005906969721,0.1862030286034773,0.2,0.8221409010691815,82.21409010691815,High Trust
