Sally,/users/5d78ce8cfde9e27d56f9a695,GB,15.0,2023-10-28 13:54:03+00:00,1.0,left on my doorstep…,"My items have been left on my doorstep when it clearly says leave in the parcel box in the garden on the order AND on the doorbell in a clear sign .  The courier will throw the item to the ground, ring the doorbell and walk off!! Then click to say handed to the resident when I'm at work.... So angry.  I then spent an hour trying to email or call or comment to customer service and constantly going around their site getting nowhere!! Eventually I was able to speak via chat by pure luck and told the courier will be reprimanded and told I won't know the out come or updates for the issue but we are sorry!!!I won't be buying anything else as I can't trust your couriers to READ where to leave my item and they are left on the front door of a home which is on the main road. Good job I had the door camera to see how it was delivered.  I'm beyond shocked for the lack of care or consideration from someone delivering my paid for items!! Sort it out Amazon",2023-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,28.0,956,188,20,4,1.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,item left doorstep clearly say leave parcel box garden order doorbell clear sign courier throw item ground ring doorbell walk click say handed resident im work angry spent hour trying email call comment customer service constantly going around site getting nowhere eventually able speak via chat pure luck told courier reprimanded told wont know come update issue sorryi wont buying anything else cant trust courier read leave item left front door home main road good job door camera see delivered im beyond shocked lack care consideration someone delivering paid item sort amazon,0.9999830894773054,1.6910522694590924e-05,0.10544026920919798,0.2,0.3210965091031869,32.109650910318685,Low Trust
Mr Terry Moore,/users/53a833cd00006400017af020,GB,20.0,2023-10-28 11:37:29+00:00,1.0,I’ve bought 4 items from Amazon in the…,"I’ve bought 4 items from Amazon in the past few weeks. Firstly, a book, which though not damaged in transit had a damaged corner and a torn dust cover when I opened the package. Clearly it was picked and packed in that state.Secondly, another book, which was delivered while I was home and I saw the Amazon van arrive outside and waited by my front door to take the delivery. Except he didn’t come up to my front door. Out of my line of sight, he left the package in my half full garden waste bin, taken a snap of his fine work, and driven away! Staggering stupidity.The next item was delivered on time, no problemThe latest purchase was due for delivery yesterday by 8pm. It never arrived. The so-called trace leads to the Royal Mail website and when to try to track the parcel it sternly tells you that tracking can only be done when they’ve attempted delivery! I guess it’s the Royal Mail at fault, but in agreement with many other reviewers I find it astonishingly difficult to actually speak with an Amazon employee who are after all the supplier and whose responsibility it is to ensure the goods arrive with the purchaser when they should and in a good condition.I’ve made a mental note to use Amazon only as a last resort. It’s funny how many big business operations performance only ever gets worse the bigger they become. See IBM.",2023-10-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,28.0,1340,243,39,8,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,i’ve bought item amazon past week firstly book though damaged transit damaged corner torn dust cover opened package clearly picked packed statesecondly another book delivered home saw amazon van arrive outside waited front door take delivery except didn’t come front door line sight left package half full garden waste bin taken snap fine work driven away staggering stupiditythe next item delivered time problemthe latest purchase due delivery yesterday pm never arrived socalled trace lead royal mail website try track parcel sternly tell tracking done they’ve attempted delivery guess it’s royal mail fault agreement many reviewer find astonishingly difficult actually speak amazon employee supplier whose responsibility ensure good arrive purchaser good conditioni’ve made mental note use amazon last resort it’s funny many big business operation performance ever get worse bigger become see ibm,0.14137613945735142,0.8586238605426486,0.13628715647784634,0.2,0.7565693615668935,75.65693615668934,High Trust
Lourdes Iglesias,/users/64f13f09471b150011724980,US,1.0,2023-10-28 03:07:33+00:00,1.0,Bad customer service and hidden fees,Today I had an experience with Amazon that I have never had before. We returned an item that the original box did not have a seal and came open  when we tried the product it didn't work correctly we returned it and put it in for return on the very same day. We specified the problem on the return  and they only gave us partial refund because they said that we had to pay a restocking fee.  I spoke to four different representatives and I emailed pictures and photos and everything and at the end I spoke to the most difficult the most unprofessional Spanish speaking person that said she was a supervisor no one was bigger than her she was rude and she was undescribably a  bad customer service Individual.  Apparently Amazon now has a new restocking fee policy and it does not state it on the product that you are purchasing so even if you return an item unused or that came damaged you will be charged a restocking fee according to three different people this is the new format and the new policy just beware. I will start thinking twice before purchasing from them again when it comes to high end priced products.,2023-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,28.0,1117,206,36,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,today experience amazon never returned item original box seal came open tried product didnt work correctly returned put return day specified problem return gave u partial refund said pay restocking fee spoke four different representative emailed picture photo everything end spoke difficult unprofessional spanish speaking person said supervisor one bigger rude undescribably bad customer service individual apparently amazon new restocking fee policy state product purchasing even return item unused came damaged charged restocking fee according three different people new format new policy beware start thinking twice purchasing come high end priced product,0.009547460319877394,0.9904525396801226,0.1155356141334829,0.2,0.8183333926667579,81.8333392666758,High Trust
