Pa,/users/638696262c2e5f0013ecc830,GB,5.0,2023-10-27 08:50:38+00:00,1.0,Terrible company,"Ordered a brand new 2tb computer memory drive (£138), only to receive an empty box inside the package. The drive had been stolen at Amazon’s end. I immediately reported this to Amazon and was assured that I would get a refund. However, after lots of emails and telephone conversations, Amazon have refused to give me my money back. They even accused me of claiming for stolen goods multiple times, even though this is the first time it has ever happened to me, with any company! Their true colours have been shown, beware.",2023-10-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,27.0,522,92,16,2,4.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered brand new tb computer memory drive £ receive empty box inside package drive stolen amazon’s end immediately reported amazon assured would get refund however lot email telephone conversation amazon refused give money back even accused claiming stolen good multiple time even though first time ever happened company true colour shown beware,0.11962652899976008,0.8803734710002399,0.051598429613011774,0.2,0.7505064214227223,75.05064214227222,High Trust
