John Ritter,/users/653a0aa11e43980012dbf4db,US,2.0,2023-10-26 08:47:54+00:00,1.0,I would give minus 5 if I could!,"I would give minus 5 if I could!Trust me do not order ANYTHING from Amazon!I just went through 2 days of absolute HELL with these A$$HOLES!They actually made me call my local police and file a police report for something they 100% screwed up on!They delivered my order to an entity that don’t even exist and refused to refund the order.Amazon said “Delivered October 24 Your package was left in the mail room. Signed by: Mail Room”, their exact words, copied and pasted right from the message they sent me.Here’s the big problem, THERE IS NO “MAIL ROOM” anywhere within the 22 units of the condo complex I live in, there is no “mail room” attendant to sign for ANYTHING!Where this package actually went is a big mystery because no driver ever came to my door!I sat right by where my doorbell is all day, my doorbell is in 100% working condition, also I posted 2 signs on my door one saying ring doorbell multiple times and the other saying if no answer call number, I put my number on the sign.As I said no one came to my door, no one rang my doorbell, no one called my phone and the kicker is, THERE IS NO “MAIL ROOM”!So after going through hell talking to multiple people, explaining the exact same thing to each and every one of them over and over again for 2 days and eventually at the end of the next day being on the phone with these a$$holes for another hour they tell me I have to wait until after 5PM before I can request to cancel and get a refund or re-delivery, not very happy, I’m like whatever.So I call back after 5PM, I’m now on the phone again getting jerked around as usual once again for like God only knows how long.They then tell me that I have to call my local police and file a police report, I had to ask them to repeat this a few times because I thought I heard them say I had to file a police report and to my complete and utter surprise that was exactly what they were telling me.I ask them why do I have to file a police report over something that was your fault, you delivered my items to the wrong place, you delivered my items to a place that don’t even exist, you delivered my items to somewhere other than the address I gave you without my consent, your delivery driver never once ever came to my door or even attempted to ever contact me and you are making me file a police report.This so called customer service representative would not even listen to anything I was saying and all she kept saying talking over me is, “is there anything else I can help you with sir”, that was all she keep saying to me, in other words go screw yourself, I am done with you sir and there is nothing you can do about it.So I hung up called my local police and ask him if he’s ever heard of anything like this, he said “Amazon” I thought they just cancel the order and re-ship you another item, I said that’s what ebay does I know this for sure but  not Amazon they make me file a police report for something they screwed up, he was as surprised as I was.So he directed me where to go to file a police report.I then spent more of my time filling out a police report over something that was 100% Amazons fault and I made this very clear on the police report.I tried to copy and paste it here but it’s a PDF file so it’s not possible.Amazon is nothing but big greedy corporate a$$holes who could care less about consumers who make them filthy rich, they hire foreigners in a foreign country paying them absolutely nothing likely with zero benefits and undermining American workers all to fill their greedy pockets.Amazon is way too big and way to greedy and their customer service is beyond horrifying, it’s beyond belief and no one should buy anything from these greedy corporate a$$holes.I have been buying online with eBay well over 20 years with PayPal and yes, they are big corporate, but the truth is in over 20 years I have never, EVER ran into anything remotely close to what I just ran into with Amazon.This was my first order with my new account, and this is how I was treated, unreal and just flat out wrong and no way to treat any customer bring business to your company.Any problems I have ran into buying on eBay the issue was resolved immediately either by Ebay or PayPal and was always handled by them I never had to file some police report.I’ve had items missing on several occasions with eBay and they never questioned me, they just simply sent me another item with absolutely no issues unlike these a$$wipes at Amazon, should be Ama-a$$holes!Fair warning to everyone, never order from Amazon, you just may regret it, I sure as hell do!I will NEVER EVER order anything from these evil, greedy corporate pigs and I will spend the rest of my life as long as Amazon still exist warning everyone to never buy from this place!",2023-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,26.0,4753,888,32,8,1.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,would give minus couldtrust order anything amazoni went day absolute hell aholesthey actually made call local police file police report something screwed onthey delivered order entity don’t even exist refused refund orderamazon said “delivered october package left mail room signed mail room” exact word copied pasted right message sent mehere’s big problem “mail room” anywhere within unit condo complex live “mail room” attendant sign anythingwhere package actually went big mystery driver ever came doori sat right doorbell day doorbell working condition also posted sign door one saying ring doorbell multiple time saying answer call number put number signas said one came door one rang doorbell one called phone kicker “mail room”so going hell talking multiple people explaining exact thing every one day eventually end next day phone aholes another hour tell wait pm request cancel get refund redelivery happy i’m like whateverso call back pm i’m phone getting jerked around usual like god know longthey tell call local police file police report ask repeat time thought heard say file police report complete utter surprise exactly telling mei ask file police report something fault delivered item wrong place delivered item place don’t even exist delivered item somewhere address gave without consent delivery driver never ever came door even attempted ever contact making file police reportthis called customer service representative would even listen anything saying kept saying talking “is anything else help sir” keep saying word go screw done sir nothing itso hung called local police ask he’s ever heard anything like said “amazon” thought cancel order reship another item said that’s ebay know sure amazon make file police report something screwed surprised wasso directed go file police reporti spent time filling police report something amazon fault made clear police reporti tried copy paste it’s pdf file it’s possibleamazon nothing big greedy corporate aholes could care less consumer make filthy rich hire foreigner foreign country paying absolutely nothing likely zero benefit undermining american worker fill greedy pocketsamazon way big way greedy customer service beyond horrifying it’s beyond belief one buy anything greedy corporate aholesi buying online ebay well year paypal yes big corporate truth year never ever ran anything remotely close ran amazonthis first order new account treated unreal flat wrong way treat customer bring business companyany problem ran buying ebay issue resolved immediately either ebay paypal always handled never file police reporti’ve item missing several occasion ebay never questioned simply sent another item absolutely issue unlike awipes amazon amaaholesfair warning everyone never order amazon may regret sure hell doi never ever order anything evil greedy corporate pig spend rest life long amazon still exist warning everyone never buy place,0.9999753522665688,2.464773343124893e-05,0.49803701626472235,0.2,0.3996197271196601,39.96197271196601,Low Trust
