Sophie rahl,/users/6515fedf9f16d400114bdaa2,GB,2.0,2023-10-25 19:01:54+00:00,1.0,ILLEGAL move by Amazon AVOID!,"ABSOLUTELY DISGUSTED by this company!!! I have just come out of hospital and am housebound. I have a family/children to feed and had NOTHING in my house to eat. So I ordered a small food shop so we had food for the next few days, which left me with £2 in my bank. Order was due at 4pm. I waited and waited, and was getting really hungry and needed to eat as I have diabetes. At 5.20pm!!!!!!! I received a email to say my order has been CANCELLED & I won’t receive a refund for 3-5 working days!!! Amazon said Morrisons cancelled it, and Morrisons says Amazon cancelle it!!! So I called up and said what do I do about food? Me and my children will now be without ANY food & I can’t order from anywhere else as I used ALL my money on the food order!!! I was offered a pathetic £20 credit which is absolutely useless as all the delivery slots had gone and there wasn’t anymore until tomorrow. So me and my family will be left hungry now for 3-5 days until my refund. Which also , they are WORKING days so could even be next week now. I have an incurable illness and am a vunerable person & have a special needs child too. I rely on Amazon everyday to deliver essentials and never experienced this level of disgraceful treatment in my life. It’sactu illegal to leave a vulnerable person without food for 24hours and the company is supposed to HELP make alternative arrangements.",2023-10-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,25.0,1374,259,29,5,8.0,0,19,1,0,Genuine,absolutely disgusted company come hospital housebound familychildren feed nothing house eat ordered small food shop food next day left £ bank order due pm waited waited getting really hungry needed eat diabetes pm received email say order cancelled won’t receive refund working day amazon said morrison cancelled morrison say amazon cancelle called said food child without food can’t order anywhere else used money food order offered pathetic £ credit absolutely useless delivery slot gone wasn’t anymore tomorrow family left hungry day refund also working day could even next week incurable illness vunerable person special need child rely amazon everyday deliver essential never experienced level disgraceful treatment life it’sactu illegal leave vulnerable person without food hour company supposed help make alternative arrangement,0.9999999999719105,2.808953070143616e-11,0.14526079641054404,0.2,0.32905215929615356,32.90521592961536,Low Trust
Mila,/users/6539460f1e43980012db9a45,GB,2.0,2023-10-25 18:45:23+00:00,1.0,Customer service humiliating to the point that I ended up in tears,"Ordered an item over Amazon and returned it as was not fitting the purpose. QR code provided to myself supposed to be for Evri, however in the post office when they scan it, it showed that is unvalid for Evri, as it is QR code for Amazon Hub Returns. The guy scanned it, showed on device items being returned and that return is accepted by Amazon. As item was bought over Amazon I did not find it weird at the moment. So return is completed and I supposed to get confirmation of the return on my email, what never happened. Two weeks after, I contacted customer service and seller to follow-up return status and refund. Customer service was the worst, misleading me in the process, providing fake informations, being extremely rude, as mocking me. I ended up wasting hours in chasing the return, as being humiliated by their staff to the point that I ended up in tears. I tried to clarify an obvious error with that QR code that was not mine mistake and to locate my return. The last person that I spoke with said that is not their problem, they will not take part of responsibility for providing unvalid code and for wrong return service, as they refuse to assist me in locating parcel or compensate financial loss.",2023-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,25.0,1216,221,66,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item amazon returned fitting purpose qr code provided supposed evri however post office scan showed unvalid evri qr code amazon hub return guy scanned showed device item returned return accepted amazon item bought amazon find weird moment return completed supposed get confirmation return email never happened two week contacted customer service seller followup return status refund customer service worst misleading process providing fake information extremely rude mocking ended wasting hour chasing return humiliated staff point ended tear tried clarify obvious error qr code mine mistake locate return last person spoke said problem take part responsibility providing unvalid code wrong return service refuse assist locating parcel compensate financial loss,0.008536653343890598,0.9914633466561094,0.12394840157038699,0.2,0.820521353642132,82.0521353642132,High Trust
Pieter van der Werf,/users/5f6a00a1933e1805a512d48c,NL,25.0,2023-10-25 17:41:55+00:00,3.0,Normally I’m happy with Amazon,Normally I’m happy with Amazon. They deliver fast and have a wide variety of choice. Prices are not always very competitive though. What really sucks is the customer services. Everything is standardized. No room for a personal touch. Today I received a toaster but It’s been used but the only thing I can do is send it back.  I would never buy something electronically. I guess you can’t trust their suppliers,2023-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,25.0,409,71,30,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,normally i’m happy amazon deliver fast wide variety choice price always competitive though really suck customer service everything standardized room personal touch today received toaster it’s used thing send back would never buy something electronically guess can’t trust supplier,0.04636342388933362,0.9536365761106664,0.039820527201346045,0.6,1.3847823934956023,138.47823934956023,High Trust
SHANE,/users/50d7852d00006400012b4e36,GB,4.0,2023-10-25 16:09:49+00:00,1.0,Ordered 4 chairs,"Ordered 4 chairs, only 2 arrived in one box, my wife was there to receive that one box, so I got in touch with Amazon customer service and was told that a couple of minutes later that they had carried out an investigation and the other box had been stolen, stolen from where? they could not give me any answers to my questions and told me to contact the police, hung up on that person and was told by the next person exactly the same, clearly they were reading the same pathetic direction! Phoned the delivery service was told that one parcel had been dropped off and another was due the next day! Amazon your call centre abroad is a load of rubbish and should be shut down immediately! Really bad service.",2023-10-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,25.0,706,132,16,3,1.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,ordered chair arrived one box wife receive one box got touch amazon customer service told couple minute later carried investigation box stolen stolen could give answer question told contact police hung person told next person exactly clearly reading pathetic direction phoned delivery service told one parcel dropped another due next day amazon call centre abroad load rubbish shut immediately really bad service,0.739513164714255,0.260486835285745,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.4450499235318237,44.504992353182374,Low Trust
