Mike Gosling,/users/644e367027368300128405f1,GB,2.0,2023-10-25 14:27:56+00:00,1.0,Terrible customer service advisors,Terrible customer service advisors  I ordered an item on Amazon Marketplace on 17/10/23 from Wallpaper Empire.  A day later 18/10/23 I received an email from Amazon  stating my payment had been declined. I then reordered the item on 19/10/23 from a different supplier thinking my original order had been cancelled. However both items arrived on the same day 20/10/23?Yesterday I spoke to Reem a customer service advisor (who cant speak English) and tried explained my problem requesting I free post return for Wallpaper Empire. Although she agreed to my request I read today on my conversation page the seller was informed a made a double order - incorrect they replied “hi we dont have a double order we only received 1 order for 1 tin 204-9872367-7841128 returns as mentioned in return policy are not prepaid”   So Reem did not understand my problem and I still don’t have a freepost return slip for the item. To add insult to injury I have tried to complain today and followed the online resolution page on Amazons  website (what a joke). When I clicked on the link it took me to a page with a picture of a French pug dog?? saying Amazon cant find the page your trying to view. What a absolutely terrible service. M Gosling,2023-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,25.0,1226,214,34,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,terrible customer service advisor ordered item amazon marketplace wallpaper empire day later received email amazon stating payment declined reordered item different supplier thinking original order cancelled however item arrived day yesterday spoke reem customer service advisor cant speak english tried explained problem requesting free post return wallpaper empire although agreed request read today conversation page seller informed made double order incorrect replied “hi dont double order received order tin return mentioned return policy prepaid” reem understand problem still don’t freepost return slip item add insult injury tried complain today followed online resolution page amazon website joke clicked link took page picture french pug dog saying amazon cant find page trying view absolutely terrible service gosling,0.009613581867368066,0.990386418132632,0.12002243409983174,0.2,0.8191976958862823,81.91976958862823,High Trust
