Jude Croos,/users/5dc3bf0e401a48ae99db4c7d,GB,7.0,2023-10-24 18:50:48+00:00,1.0,Poor quality of customer support,"Title: Extremely Disappointed with Amazon Prime PurchaseRating: ★☆☆☆☆ (1 star)I recently made a purchase on Amazon Prime, and I couldn't be more disappointed with the entire experience. On the 10th of October 2023, I ordered a Samsung Galaxy Z Flip phone and a Galaxy Watch, both totaling over £1000 as part of a Prime deal. However, what I received was two packs of 85p price-marked wet wipes, which is not even close to what I ordered.My frustration didn't end there. I've since sent numerous emails and made several phone calls to Amazon UK, but it seems they lack effective customer support. There's no clear way to address my issue, as they don't even have a complaints department. I went as far as sending a personal email to the managing director of Amazon UK, but I'm still struggling to get a resolution.This experience has been incredibly frustrating, and I expect better from a company as large as Amazon. I'm still waiting for a refund, and I hope Amazon can take immediate action to resolve this situation and improve their customer service.",2023-10-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,24.0,1054,180,32,5,14.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,title extremely disappointed amazon prime purchaserating ★☆☆☆☆ stari recently made purchase amazon prime couldnt disappointed entire experience th october ordered samsung galaxy z flip phone galaxy watch totaling £ part prime deal however received two pack p pricemarked wet wipe even close orderedmy frustration didnt end ive since sent numerous email made several phone call amazon uk seems lack effective customer support there clear way address issue dont even complaint department went far sending personal email managing director amazon uk im still struggling get resolutionthis experience incredibly frustrating expect better company large amazon im still waiting refund hope amazon take immediate action resolve situation improve customer service,0.009212731021485256,0.9907872689785148,0.10095344924284913,0.2,0.8155843243378272,81.55843243378273,High Trust
