Sean,/users/54c966700000ff0001a74c40,GB,16.0,2023-10-24 13:29:40+00:00,1.0,Amazon is getting worse and worse,"Amazon is getting worse and worse. The delivery driver used to deliver the parcel to my door. Now they don’t even bother to knock my door and throw the items on the ground floor. We don’t have any reception desk and anyone can get in easily. It’s been happening a few times I saw my parcel lying on the ground. Last Friday, I missed one big parcel and Amazon’s tracking info shows it’s accepted by a receptionist from downstairs but we don’t have a reception desk. The drive is a 100% lazy liar. I called Amazon and asked to order the replacement but they refuse to do that for me. They only offer me refund but the thing is I bought the item at a sale. Now the price is going up. Why I have to pay for the mistake made by Amazon driver?",2023-10-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,24.0,737,144,33,6,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon getting worse worse delivery driver used deliver parcel door don’t even bother knock door throw item ground floor don’t reception desk anyone get easily it’s happening time saw parcel lying ground last friday missed one big parcel amazon’s tracking info show it’s accepted receptionist downstairs don’t reception desk drive lazy liar called amazon asked order replacement refuse offer refund thing bought item sale price going pay mistake made amazon driver,0.015456969698870974,0.984543030301129,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.8084240670294204,80.84240670294204,High Trust
