Marc Taylor,/users/5fa9522eff12ae001a17e3e5,GB,26.0,2023-10-22 19:36:39+00:00,2.0,RIP Customer Service. Died 22/10/23,"While they obviously have questionable business behaviour, & in a lot of cases actually cruel working conditions, I've understood (like many of us) that convenience is king & I have chosen this over paying more for items, waiting longer for & paying extra for deliveries elsewhere. I had hoped that some that corporate body would keep them in check. Futile hope I guess but it's not the consumer's responsibility to organise & sacrifice themselves & their accounts for this. But I draw the line at such insanely poor customer service. I'm not sure when it died but the customer service in this place has been murdered. I've spoken to 5 different agents today on their live chat - over a span of 12 hours - to figure out & sort a seemingly innocuous issue; they create random accounts for each of your devices. I've been promised that a specialist would call me back 4 times & each time, I've been left waiting with no such call coming my way. At a certain point, being 'happy to help' is the most faceless thing you can say to someone who's tired of the constant BS & lies. I'm still waiting on that call but in the mean time, I've deleted my account.",2023-10-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,22.0,1151,210,35,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,obviously questionable business behaviour lot case actually cruel working condition ive understood like many u convenience king chosen paying item waiting longer paying extra delivery elsewhere hoped corporate body would keep check futile hope guess consumer responsibility organise sacrifice account draw line insanely poor customer service im sure died customer service place murdered ive spoken different agent today live chat span hour figure sort seemingly innocuous issue create random account device ive promised specialist would call back time time ive left waiting call coming way certain point happy help faceless thing say someone who tired constant b lie im still waiting call mean time ive deleted account,0.020917070494805866,0.9790829295051942,0.11777902411665732,0.4,1.1130972695759285,111.30972695759284,High Trust
Brandon Smith,/users/6534efbbe7550d00122ab27b,US,1.0,2023-10-22 12:51:29+00:00,1.0,"Master Bait n Switchers, Hate Crime Commissioners, Two-Faced Frauds","For years have I tolerated this cesspit trifecta of fraud and corruption absolute. Between frequently defective streaming service, 3rd party commerce fraud, and illegal in-house withholding and contractual lies, this steaming pile of whistled Dixie knows not when to quit, even allows its own staff to violate their own forums with self immolating hate crime to torture their less happy customers--who retrospectively vilifies every psychotic ""genius"" he can of whom thinks that they can grift our unsuspecting OP for whatever it's worth--by pathologically lying in many forum accepted comments that hate breeds hate, neither supported nor condoned, not surprisingly expected and noted, neither surprisingly similar to the compulsive bull, forum violations, and finite fraud of both Amazon staff and whoever reported it the 1st place. (I wouldn't be surprised if it has nothing to do with that either, I have so many enemies, each only suffering a bed of their own making.)Anyway, whether removing content(s) from merchandise post-purchase, regardless of warning of change of terms in any way; outright fraud in description of content, services, or policy, even as blindly illogical so as to contradict itself in the same paragraph or sentence and then denying either, all the while denying refund (last time this happened was only a few months ago); or simply good, old fashioned BS (my review: ""said new, sent used. liar. thief.""), this place is the pit of iniquity. Finally saying it because I've gotten sick of being kicked off streaming several times in two hours. Between episodes is bad enough, still unacceptable, not user related. It's all Amazon nonsense, and I'm dead sick of the theft. Pay for episodes? Withdrawn. Buy another set. Pay for new? Used. Watch a new channel enough to make it worth the while? Hell, no. Kicked, over and over.It isn't bad enough I'm disabled and watch a fair bit, I have to put up with this absolute, actual theft from Amazon, the empire of organized crime itself. Enough. I'm spreading the truth and getting what I deserve back. It's not about the money though. If your liable pathological embellishment fraudulently takes me down in flames, I'm using every legal means to take you with me. You psychotic, compulsive liars deserve every bad review you've seen for stealing and defaming mine. Like I've already informed you, I'm going legal and this is justice. You can't hide the truth.",2023-10-21 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,22.0,2428,396,67,9,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,year tolerated cesspit trifecta fraud corruption absolute frequently defective streaming service rd party commerce fraud illegal inhouse withholding contractual lie steaming pile whistled dixie know quit even allows staff violate forum self immolating hate crime torture less happy customerswho retrospectively vilifies every psychotic genius think grift unsuspecting op whatever worthby pathologically lying many forum accepted comment hate breed hate neither supported condoned surprisingly expected noted neither surprisingly similar compulsive bull forum violation finite fraud amazon staff whoever reported st place wouldnt surprised nothing either many enemy suffering bed makinganyway whether removing content merchandise postpurchase regardless warning change term way outright fraud description content service policy even blindly illogical contradict paragraph sentence denying either denying refund last time happened month ago simply good old fashioned b review said new sent used liar thief place pit iniquity finally saying ive gotten sick kicked streaming several time two hour episode bad enough still unacceptable user related amazon nonsense im dead sick theft pay episode withdrawn buy another set pay new used watch new channel enough make worth hell kicked overit isnt bad enough im disabled watch fair bit put abs