GMR,/users/5b51b0594de5666d3403a50c,GB,26.0,2023-10-21 18:47:38+00:00,1.0,Literally thieves,"I recently purchased a video game from Amazon, and I couldn't have had a worse experience. The game arrived without the disc, and to make matters worse, the case wasn't wrapped in cellophane, and the disc slot was empty. It's painfully clear that someone at their warehouse pilfered the disc itself. This situation was extremely frustrating and infuriating.When I contacted Amazon's customer service, it took a mind-numbing 30 minutes to explain what had happened because, frankly, it seemed like they were completely clueless. It's as if they were living in a different world, disconnected from the problem I was facing.After I explained the situation, I was told I needed to wait for a ""72-hour investigation."" The entire time, I had to be the one reaching out to them for updates because they never took the initiative to keep me informed. Their customer service representatives were unbelievably rude, and they would abruptly end chats without my consent, as if they didn't want to deal with me anymore.After nearly a week of back-and-forth, I finally received a refund. However, this refund didn't include the £5 voucher I had used for the purchase, which effectively left me out of pocket. I repeatedly asked how to make a formal complaint about the whole ordeal, and it seemed like they were actively avoiding my question and cutting me off. The lack of transparency and accountability was appalling.In conclusion, this experience with Amazon was a nightmare. The missing disc, the inept customer service, and the loss of the voucher all added up to a terrible shopping experience. I would strongly advise potential buyers to exercise caution and be prepared for a potential lack of assistance should anything go wrong with their purchase. It's incredibly disappointing to see a company of Amazon's stature failing so spectacularly in providing basic customer service and support.",2023-10-21 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,21.0,1887,306,17,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently purchased video game amazon couldnt worse experience game arrived without disc make matter worse case wasnt wrapped cellophane disc slot empty painfully clear someone warehouse pilfered disc situation extremely frustrating infuriatingwhen contacted amazon customer service took mindnumbing minute explain happened frankly seemed like completely clueless living different world disconnected problem facingafter explained situation told needed wait hour investigation entire time one reaching update never took initiative keep informed customer service representative unbelievably rude would abruptly end chat without consent didnt want deal anymoreafter nearly week backandforth finally received refund however refund didnt include £ voucher used purchase effectively left pocket repeatedly asked make formal complaint whole ordeal seemed like actively avoiding question cutting lack transparency accountability appallingin conclusion experience amazon nightmare missing disc inept customer service loss voucher added terrible shopping experience would strongly advise potential buyer exercise caution prepared potential lack assistance anything go wrong purchase incredibly disappointing see company amazon stature failing spectacularly providing basic customer service support,0.018966430776819674,0.9810335692231803,0.17162086371284352,0.2,0.8248409573541589,82.48409573541589,High Trust
