Larry Lowe,/users/5bfee10a5483f4b8a9e0be44,GB,6.0,2023-10-21 00:33:01+00:00,1.0,I am absolutely disgusted with Amazon’s…,"I am absolutely disgusted with Amazon’s customer service at this moment in time.  As a result, I plan to quit Amazon Prime, as the service has become unrecognisable and unreliable. Your telephone assistance today was probably one of the worst experiences of my life, where I was advised to transfer all of my money to a new bank account, because he was having difficulty with his system! This was advice given by someone who barely spoke English! Shameful. Get your act together. I simply tried to buy a TV and you have managed to turn it into a crisis.  I have since bought the same productfrom Argos, for the same price. NO CRISIS NECESSARY.  Apparently my debit card is ok for use in Argos!Amazon, you should be ashamed.Thank you again - for nothing!!!!Larry",2023-10-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,21.0,761,133,40,6,1.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,absolutely disgusted amazon’s customer service moment time result plan quit amazon prime service become unrecognisable unreliable telephone assistance today probably one worst experience life advised transfer money new bank account difficulty system advice given someone barely spoke english shameful get act together simply tried buy tv managed turn crisis since bought productfrom argo price crisis necessary apparently debit card ok use argosamazon ashamedthank nothinglarry,0.9992231592268804,0.0007768407731195692,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.3153070967746697,31.530709677466973,Low Trust
