Lady Unknown,/users/6531d896c741280012499f16,US,1.0,2023-10-20 03:33:36+00:00,1.0,Delivers to wrong address - wants me to file a police report,"Amazon delivers items to the wrong address, delays delivery, damages items during shipping, and loses deliveries.There are two distinct patterns related to Amazon deliveries:1. Most are delivered to the right address with random deliveries to the wrong address.2. Clusters of multiple deliveries to the incorrect address over the course of 2-6 weeks.When there are repeated errors with deliveries, Amazon blames the consumer, asks them to update their delivery information (even though it's correct), denies refunds, and tells consumers they must file police reports, and provide that information, to be considered for a refund. It is my understanding, they will still deny a refund, which seems wrong.Amazon has asked me to return items for a refund on items I never received.Today I was told I had to file a police report about stolen packages, however, I have proof these packages were delivered to the wrong location, which is not the same as having them stolen. Filing a false report of theft is a Class A misdemeanor and I'm not willing to commit a crime because Amazon delivered several packages to the wrong address.They say based on 'their investigation' and my response, the items were stolen, unless they see my ring camera, which shows no packages, it seems their investigation is incomplete.",2023-10-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,20.0,1304,210,60,12,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon delivers item wrong address delay delivery damage item shipping loses deliveriesthere two distinct pattern related amazon delivery delivered right address random delivery wrong address cluster multiple delivery incorrect address course weekswhen repeated error delivery amazon blame consumer asks update delivery information even though correct denies refund tell consumer must file police report provide information considered refund understanding still deny refund seems wrongamazon asked return item refund item never receivedtoday told file police report stolen package however proof package delivered wrong location stolen filing false report theft class misdemeanor im willing commit crime amazon delivered several package wrong addressthey say based investigation response item stolen unless see ring camera show package seems investigation incomplete,0.00874614113423284,0.9912538588657671,0.11777902411665732,0.2,0.8191827342562149,81.91827342562149,High Trust
