Mr Ian Loring,/users/64354d04ab6c6b0013f34f6f,GB,2.0,2023-10-20 00:29:07+00:00,1.0,There is something wrong at Amazon,"There is something wrong at Amazon, I hardly ever get an order completed with out something, fake goods, missing goods, wrong color, wrong flavor, wrong size, delivery lost, delivery a week late, delivery missed. It’s not every time but it feels like it, there is no longer trust in Amazon it must be costing them a fortune!",2023-10-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,20.0,324,57,34,6,11.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,something wrong amazon hardly ever get order completed something fake good missing good wrong color wrong flavor wrong size delivery lost delivery week late delivery missed it’s every time feel like longer trust amazon must costing fortune,0.07825815359513262,0.9217418464048673,0.03196859226023556,0.2,0.7672646416544807,76.72646416544808,High Trust
Mark S,/users/581f871c0000ff000a54aae7,GB,2.0,2023-10-19 22:20:46+00:00,1.0,Thick delivery drivers,"I frequently buy from Amazon, but I'm so fed up that not even one of their delivery drivers is blessed with half a brain. I have a lock box, ironically bought from Amazon that is mounted on the wall of my house. Not one of them can use it correctly, which is simply to twist the lock to lock it after placing the parcel in. And some even just dump the parcel by the front door without even ringing the bell. Surely they can't be that thick. I actually think that they mess things up on purpose so that people will instead have their items delivered to the local shop, that way they have less drops.",2023-10-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,19.0,598,116,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,frequently buy amazon im fed even one delivery driver blessed half brain lock box ironically bought amazon mounted wall house one use correctly simply twist lock lock placing parcel even dump parcel front door without even ringing bell surely cant thick actually think mess thing purpose people instead item delivered local shop way less drop,0.03994335360801781,0.9600566463919822,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.7930401010984027,79.30401010984028,High Trust
