xJFMDx,/users/65316d6b3650170012efb87d,GB,1.0,2023-10-19 19:55:00+00:00,1.0,Stolen Package from amazon warehouse,"I ordered a few parts to build my new gaming pc. Amongst the parts I ordered was a Ryzen 7700X CPU. When my package arrived it was in the amazon delivery box but the actual product itself was not inside its retail packaging. Infact you could clearly see that someone had cut the seal on the internal box and took thr product from it. I contacted amazon and have to get a police report but in the UK you can only get a crime Reference Number so I can't even get a refund or return. I'm now in the process of talking to a solicitor in order for me to be able to get a copy of the police report in order to send it to amazon. Absolutely no help on the phone as they can just about speak English and had to call them at least 5 times in order to get through to someone that could actually understand me. At this time I have still not been helped, this will be the last time I order anything through Amazon and I hope others stay away as well.",2023-10-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,19.0,938,189,36,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered part build new gaming pc amongst part ordered ryzen x cpu package arrived amazon delivery box actual product inside retail packaging infact could clearly see someone cut seal internal box took thr product contacted amazon get police report uk get crime reference number cant even get refund return im process talking solicitor order able get copy police report order send amazon absolutely help phone speak english call least time order get someone could actually understand time still helped last time order anything amazon hope others stay away well,0.009725474353175704,0.9902745256468243,0.10600112170499158,0.2,0.8163374871644105,81.63374871644105,High Trust
