LINDA P,/users/51d9c687000064000142ded7,GB,74.0,2023-10-19 16:02:42+00:00,1.0,BEWARE of error messages - payment still taken!,"Usually great.  Today not so.  I tried to order 10 Covid test kits. Got an error message ""We're sorryThere was an internal error in our system. We logged the problem and will investigate it later. Our apologies for the inconvenience."" and a button to ""Continue Shopping"".   OK - so waited and tried again - same message.  Nothing to state payment would be taken.  So I went to another retailer site and ordered from them.  Then later I checked my credit card only to find TWO identical payments taken from Amazon without any notification to me!!  So I tried to cancel the order but system said it could not as dispatched.  So today, 20 Covid test kits arrived that I do not need. I tried to initiate a return, but system said these items cannot be returned or refunded. So I did an online chat with customer services to explain the issue, the system error message etc., but they simply refused to take any action or take the goods back.  So I am £22 out of pocket with 20 Covid test kits I will not use, (the expiry date of each is just 11 months hence.) So peeps...BEWARE - if ever you get a system error message as you order - that order WILL BE PROCESSED without your knowledge!!",2023-10-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,19.0,1182,218,47,8,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,usually great today tried order covid test kit got error message sorrythere internal error system logged problem investigate later apology inconvenience button continue shopping ok waited tried message nothing state payment would taken went another retailer site ordered later checked credit card find two identical payment taken amazon without notification tried cancel order system said could dispatched today covid test kit arrived need tried initiate return system said item cannot returned refunded online chat customer service explain issue system error message etc simply refused take action take good back £ pocket covid test kit use expiry date month hence peepsbeware ever get system error message order order processed without knowledge,0.9883012572109414,0.01169874278905858,0.12226584408300617,0.2,0.33030254021113054,33.03025402111305,Low Trust
