Lance Hunt,/users/5dadbc0be518995a1387492b,GB,29.0,2023-10-18 10:56:07+00:00,1.0,DPD issues,"I called BT on Monday and order a new set top box and an EE mobile phone. My box, delivered by Royal mail Tuesday. My phone, was due to deliver with DPD yesterday. The driver pulled up outside, on double yellow lines, took a picture, and drove away. I jumped on chat with DPD twice, and was sent an email, I was told they tried to contact the depot, to rearrange delivery for yesterday, but they could not. I was told it would definitely deliver today. This morning, same thing, only this time, they took a picture of a random house down the road. The exact same thing happened last week, with a delivery from Amazon with DPD. They again took 3 attempts to deliver with a package from Amazon.It seems like the drivers get paid for delivery attempts, as it always seems to take 3 attempts for deliveries, the maximum it takes, before it has to be returned to the supplier.Customer services continually unhelpful. I have lost 6 days, waiting for 2 parcels.",2023-10-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,18.0,954,174,10,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,called bt monday order new set top box ee mobile phone box delivered royal mail tuesday phone due deliver dpd yesterday driver pulled outside double yellow line took picture drove away jumped chat dpd twice sent email told tried contact depot rearrange delivery yesterday could told would definitely deliver today morning thing time took picture random house road exact thing happened last week delivery amazon dpd took attempt deliver package amazonit seems like driver get paid delivery attempt always seems take attempt delivery maximum take returned suppliercustomer service continually unhelpful lost day waiting parcel,0.03151030309450885,0.9684896969054911,0.0975883342680875,0.2,0.803762515306363,80.3762515306363,High Trust
CW,/users/62acc1aa0a6f7400134ee522,GB,2.0,2023-10-18 08:39:59+00:00,1.0,Amazon UK - nightmare customer service,"I ordered 2 items with next day delivery (this was an urgent order) but 2 days later there was still no delivery but instead of it daily updates that my delivery will arrive TODAY. Called Amazon customer service on various occasions and dialled the 3 numbers as indicated, and got cut off each time! Ended up with the Indian customer service but found that when they didn’t know what to suggest or simply didn’t want to chat, they suffered “technical issues” and passed me on to the next colleague. Within 10mins I was passed on 6x!! I had to organise wfh to be there for the delayed delivery that never came…I managed to get my money refunded after my order did not arrive 5 days later. I was told that the issue is with a carrier. I’m a premium customer and with Amazon since 13 years but this will be my last year. I’m waiting for another previous order and will cancel my membership afterwards. Worst customer service ever!",2023-10-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,18.0,927,169,38,6,3.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,ordered item next day delivery urgent order day later still delivery instead daily update delivery arrive today called amazon customer service various occasion dialled number indicated got cut time ended indian customer service found didn’t know suggest simply didn’t want chat suffered “technical issues” passed next colleague within min passed x organise wfh delayed delivery never came…i managed get money refunded order arrive day later told issue carrier i’m premium customer amazon since year last year i’m waiting another previous order cancel membership afterwards worst customer service ever,0.6385436083449223,0.3614563916550777,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.4996850101853627,49.96850101853627,Low Trust
