Melissa C,/users/5e7c1c32062aadecd2cd5a29,US,2.0,2023-10-18 04:26:02+00:00,1.0,"It took me putting a ""man's"" name in…","It took me putting a ""man's"" name in the chat in order for anyone overseas to take me seriously.  They took out payments that weren't authorized, claimed they have no record of it, and wouldn't file a dispute even after they said they would need my bank statement, which I was willing to give.  They do not take women seriously at all.  I was on the phone/chat almost all day just trying to get this problem solved.  Once I used my maiden name as a first name, the problem was solved in a matter of minutes.  I am seriously extremely close to closing my account with them.",2023-10-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,18.0,572,107,37,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,took putting man name chat order anyone overseas take seriously took payment werent authorized claimed record wouldnt file dispute even said would need bank statement willing give take woman seriously phonechat almost day trying get problem solved used maiden name first name problem solved matter minute seriously extremely close closing account,0.010674720823521786,0.9893252791764782,0.06001121704991587,0.2,0.8066648829982221,80.66648829982222,High Trust
