iuliatrusmeiyahoo.com,/users/652ee606c7f90400121b6709,GB,1.0,2023-10-17 21:52:53+00:00,1.0,Amazon product,"Amazon product. Philips shower filter. Box not sealed, acces to the actual product, used product instead of new, inside packaging completely wet, no seal on the product. Very disappointed. Product was on sale initially, right after my purchase the product was at full price. After receiving the product I searched for a replacement one, still at full price. Once returned and back with Amazon and after receiving a refund, the same product was back on sale again. My question is: will I receive the same used product if I try to purchase a new one again?",2023-10-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,17.0,554,96,14,2,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon product philip shower filter box sealed acces actual product used product instead new inside packaging completely wet seal product disappointed product sale initially right purchase product full price receiving product searched replacement one still full price returned back amazon receiving refund product back sale question receive used product try purchase new one,0.03049431096860843,0.9695056890313916,0.0538418395961862,0.2,0.7955212124349329,79.55212124349329,High Trust
Andreas,/users/63ce662ac0f8490014874214,NL,5.0,2023-10-17 19:44:03+00:00,5.0,I am a big fan of Amazon,"I am a big fan of Amazon. They once saved my ass when someone frauded me, they are reliable and trustworthy. I am saying this, considering the extent to which any logistics and distribution company is reliable and trustworthy. Most aren't and none is perfect. The best among them for me, Amazon. I almost forgot, I also published my first book using KDP. Was also not 100% perfect but if such a service is 96% good and saves you that much work, that is a lot.",2023-10-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,17.0,459,86,24,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,big fan amazon saved as someone frauded reliable trustworthy saying considering extent logistics distribution company reliable trustworthy arent none perfect best among amazon almost forgot also published first book using kdp also perfect service good save much work lot,0.09312325151695497,0.906876748483045,0.04823331463825014,1.0,1.9630850371691724,196.30850371691724,High Trust
