Richard,/users/652da5d2102d5800113f14de,US,1.0,2023-10-16 23:06:51+00:00,1.0,Following is a review I sent to Amazon…,"Following is a review I sent to Amazon after a recent order for three bags different loose leaf tea from Tealyra. All three were ordered on the same day, one arrived, and the other two were identified as ""undeliverable.""Atrocious customer service. No delivery of products. I was notified of the ""problem with delivery"" which in itself was a puzzle, as I ordered three items from the same company - 1 was delivered but the other 2 had a problem? I gave time for a refund to be made (products were purchased on 10/2), and finally I called today (10/16) and was then informed that it would take 5-7 days for the refund to be carried out - unless I decided to agree to an Amazon Card in which case it could be immediate. In other words - if I agree to another Amazon product then I can get a refund immediately, otherwise you will have held on to my money for a total of 19-21 days. You are always ready to take my money the moment I order something, but to refund takes days if not weeks. Additionally, if I had not taken the time to call about this issue, I would never have received a refund - I wonder how much money you take from this kind of poor customer service? This really is verging on scam territory!To say your customer service is disappointing is an understatement.",2023-10-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,16.0,1275,238,39,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,following review sent amazon recent order three bag different loose leaf tea tealyra three ordered day one arrived two identified undeliverableatrocious customer service delivery product notified problem delivery puzzle ordered three item company delivered problem gave time refund made product purchased finally called today informed would take day refund carried unless decided agree amazon card case could immediate word agree another amazon product get refund immediately otherwise held money total day always ready take money moment order something refund take day week additionally taken time call issue would never received refund wonder much money take kind poor customer service really verging scam territoryto say customer service disappointing understatement,0.019274426459850013,0.98072557354015,0.1334828939988783,0.2,0.8170593655698506,81.70593655698507,High Trust
Lee,/users/5fdb3f6dc839220019ebef7d,GB,28.0,2023-10-16 20:13:26+00:00,1.0,"Awful, awful, awful...","Duplicated from Amazon.co.ukWe returned an item, only to have issues from the get-go. Amazon used UPS to collect this product. UPS decided to hang on to it for longer than was necessary. After some pushing, UPS delivered and now Amazon is delaying refunding the original cost. 3-5 days became 14 days, which then became 14-30 days.Talk about moving the goalposts.Amazon has had our return for >10 days. I know this because the UPS tracking site shows this. Amazon has not synced its systems to correspond, and so we are now - out rather we were - running round in circles, speaking to people who seemed wholly incapable of independent thought.Talk about sacrificing something of yourself to perform as a robot in a consumer supply chain.Not one of the people we have been in contact with at Amazon have been able to do anything but regurgitate the company line.We are now told that customer complaints are dealt with internally - which is standard - which is where the results remain - which is not - with Amazon. Outcomes are not usually shared with the complainant.We asked what the point of complaining was if no feedback was released, to which there was no discernible reply. Seems there is no reply. Not a lawful one in any event.Amazon seems to have made its refund policy increasingly difficult to navigate. We strongly suggest that customers end all contact with this greedy industry. Take, take, take. That's the long and the short of it.We saw this coming when Amazon began to whittle down the benefits of being a Prime customer. Where once there was a ""Free to Me"" selection of movies, you now have an ads-free option, which isn't quite the same thing, with paid-for opting heavily outnumbering any kickbacks.Why bother?Also, Amazon Music makes it difficult to listen to your favourite tunes. Ever since the option to play your favourite album has been interfered with and the songs mixed up, any point of paying for Prime has gone out the window.Everything is engineered to illicit more and more cash from the customer. I get how difficult it can be to move on, but sometimes we just have to cut our losses and look for better deals elsewhere.There are other options. There are alternatives. Amazon does not have to be - indeed it is not - the only vehicle through which to interact with the worldoutside your window.Greed has finally got the better of this company. Do yourself a favour, and look someplace else ✊",2023-10-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,16.0,2426,419,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,duplicated amazoncoukwe returned item issue getgo amazon used ups collect product ups decided hang longer necessary pushing ups delivered amazon delaying refunding original cost day became day became daystalk moving goalpostsamazon return day know ups tracking site show amazon synced system correspond rather running round circle speaking people seemed wholly incapable independent thoughttalk sacrificing something perform robot consumer supply chainnot one people contact amazon able anything regurgitate company linewe told customer complaint dealt internally standard result remain amazon outcome usually shared complainantwe asked point complaining feedback released discernible reply seems reply lawful one eventamazon seems made refund policy increasingly difficult navigate strongly suggest customer end contact greedy industry take take take thats long short itwe saw coming amazon began whittle benefit prime customer free selection movie adsfree option isnt quite thing paidfor opting heavily outnumbering kickbackswhy botheralso amazon music make difficult listen favourite tune ever since option play favourite album interfered song mixed point paying prime gone windoweverything engineered illicit cash customer get difficult move sometimes cut loss look better deal elsewherethere option alternative amazon indeed vehicle interact worldoutside windowgreed finally got better company favour look someplace else ✊,0.017671382334352215,0.9823286176656478,0.23499719573752104,0.2,0.8381637479803281,83.81637479803281,High Trust
