Kelly,/users/5efdfbcf87982a96b440cd05,GB,8.0,2023-10-16 19:26:16+00:00,1.0,Placed an order over £700,"Placed an order over £700, driver turned up Thursday asked for a one time code, was given it then he checked the van no package. They said come back tomorrow, they didn't. After speaking to several staff at amazon all saying you have the code so your not having an exchange or refund. I have now informed my bank, the police and a solicitor and now the money is back in my account. I'm still following up as I don't want this to happen to others but please don't hand over the code until the products in your view. They even said we've checked your account you've had loads of refunds so i checked my account I've had 1 refund in 4 years. I asked for a copy of the details of the driver for the police, proof of a photo or video of delivery, along with a copy of the voice calls as 1 of the staff said its the drivers fault as he's supposed to have the package in hand and you exchange code and parcel. The driver was asked to sign some paper to say he'd not delivered it which he did. Amazon kept saying they'll email me the correct links but they did not. I had to keep requesting a call back. I was told I'd get a call Sunday they didn't call I had to contact them. No wonder they've got a poor rating. I've cancelled my prime and once this is resolved I'm cancelling my account and so have my friends and family.",2023-10-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,16.0,1316,259,25,5,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,placed order £ driver turned thursday asked one time code given checked van package said come back tomorrow didnt speaking several staff amazon saying code exchange refund informed bank police solicitor money back account im still following dont want happen others please dont hand code product view even said weve checked account youve load refund checked account ive refund year asked copy detail driver police proof photo video delivery along copy voice call staff said driver fault he supposed package hand exchange code parcel driver asked sign paper say hed delivered amazon kept saying theyll email correct link keep requesting call back told id get call sunday didnt call contact wonder theyve got poor rating ive cancelled prime resolved im cancelling account friend family,0.012344108888273444,0.9876558911117266,0.14526079641054404,0.2,0.822880104837972,82.28801048379721,High Trust
