Anonym kunde,/users/6402e12770da560013d424fd,NO,11.0,2023-10-16 10:41:23+00:00,1.0,Customer service is very hard to get in…,"Customer service is very hard to get in touch with and very unhelpful once you do.I suspect that there is one or two people who ruin the experience, that should really be fired. I remember the voice. Since changing my phone number it has been completely impossible for me to access my account. I have tried to talk to amazon customer service about this five times already and they have neither gotten me access to the account again, nor deleted the account as I requested.After I gave them an honest feedback on the customer service a specific person provided, where I also stated my concern about someone else possibly getting access to my account if they obtain my old phone number and using it to order things, I recieve a no reply email stating that Amazon has detected suspicious activity on my account where someone tried to order things.It seems highly suspicious that this happened exactly after I wrote to customer service about my concern of exactly this happening, when it hasn't never happened to me even once during the 4-5 years I've had that Amazon account.It seems possible that this was done by the customer service person who got upset with the review I gave.I recommend looking into the cause of why this email was sent and firing the person who sent it, if it was sent without legitimate cause.",2023-10-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,16.0,1314,231,40,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer service hard get touch unhelpful doi suspect one two people ruin experience really fired remember voice since changing phone number completely impossible access account tried talk amazon customer service five time already neither gotten access account deleted account requestedafter gave honest feedback customer service specific person provided also stated concern someone else possibly getting access account obtain old phone number using order thing recieve reply email stating amazon detected suspicious activity account someone tried order thingsit seems highly suspicious happened exactly wrote customer service concern exactly happening hasnt never happened even year ive amazon accountit seems possible done customer service person got upset review gavei recommend looking cause email sent firing person sent sent without legitimate cause,0.009133818020689332,0.9908661819793106,0.12955692652832304,0.2,0.8213444762953199,82.13444762953199,High Trust
