J,/users/5d3a26296eaec20565e86c0f,GB,12.0,2023-10-14 18:42:16+00:00,1.0,Unable to get next day delivery,"I've been unable to get next day delivery for nearly two months now. I've lost count of how many times I've called and how many hours (it's double digits) I've lost answering the same questions.- Each time I am told that it's because not all items can be delivered next day, or because I am not selecting the right options, however after lengthy conversations it's agreed that there is an issue with the account. I've been a prime customer for years so I am very familiar with how next day delivery works.- On three occasions the agent has checked and verified that items that should be available next day for my delivery address are in fact not showing as such when I try to place the order.- On three occasions I have tried to order the same item sitting alongside my wife or a neighbour only to see that they have the next day option and I do not for the same item at the same time. - I have been told to delete and reinstall the app. It didn't work.- The last 36 or soitems I have ordered all the same - almost never available next day.- I have had to go through this same cycle so many times it is now an absolute joke. Each time I am told that they will need to raise a the issue with their technical team. If they have done this then it has not worked. Today I called again - put through to a manager and the line drops. I call back again, now explaining it for the fourth time in one day to a gentleman called Uday. The line drops. Thankfully he called back. He is telling me that it is still being looked into. 4 weeks at least. I think it's clear that it is not going to be fixed.It cost £95 for prime, Uday is offering me a £50 refund and suggesting I cancel my account. So I will be £28 ( I already had a £17 refund) out of pocket and have no Prime. One of the reasons he will not refund me the full £95 is that he says I have used prime music - I did not ask for prime music, they sent me an email to say ""you have prime music for a month"". Another reason he gave me was that I have had 45 items deliveres express. On checking he reduced that to 6. Then it was 4. Better than I thought but still 4 out of 36. He then said ""I don't see what the problem is"". To be honest I think that is quite offensive.I don't know what changed at Amazon this year but it is now very frustrating, poor customer service and not at all convenient.",2023-09-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,14.0,2341,466,31,6,30.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ive unable get next day delivery nearly two month ive lost count many time ive called many hour double digit ive lost answering question time told item delivered next day selecting right option however lengthy conversation agreed issue account ive prime customer year familiar next day delivery work three occasion agent checked verified item available next day delivery address fact showing try place order three occasion tried order item sitting alongside wife neighbour see next day option item time told delete reinstall app didnt work last soitems ordered almost never available next day go cycle many time absolute joke time told need raise issue technical team done worked today called put manager line drop call back explaining fourth time one day gentleman called uday line drop thankfully called back telling still looked week least think clear going fixedit cost £ prime uday offering £ refund suggesting cancel account £ already £ refund pocket prime one reason refund full £ say used prime music ask prime music sent email say prime music month another reason gave item deliveres express checking reduced better thought still said dont see problem honest think quite offensivei dont know changed amazon year frustrating poor customer service convenient,0.001713639024588879,0.9982863609754111,0.26135726303982054,0.2,0.8514146330956697,85.14146330956697,High Trust
Shaun Roberts,/users/5a115cdb0000ff000ae487ca,GB,13.0,2023-10-14 17:58:35+00:00,1.0,Scamazon Prime has ruined my weekend,"Scamazon Prime has ruined my weekend plans.Almost 100quid a year for a very shoddy mediocre service? I only signed up for a free trial but I certainly won't be giving this company any money for this horrible service. Ever.I ordered 2 items this month using Prime Next Day delivery. One item took them took 4 days to finally reach me and other one is currently 2 days late, ruining my weekend.Customer service are a bunch of robot parrots that will just repeat apologies at you, but will not actually do anything helpful.I'll stick to reliable retailors in future.",2023-10-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,14.0,563,98,36,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,scamazon prime ruined weekend plansalmost quid year shoddy mediocre service signed free trial certainly wont giving company money horrible service everi ordered item month using prime next day delivery one item took took day finally reach one currently day late ruining weekendcustomer service bunch robot parrot repeat apology actually anything helpfulill stick reliable retailors future,0.02213024427617259,0.9778697557238274,0.054963544587773416,0.2,0.7999275867794683,79.99275867794682,High Trust
