JL,/users/61ed25c6a8ad5b0012467e6b,IE,6.0,2023-10-14 10:58:40+00:00,1.0,You have to pay for refund even if item is damaged,"See here the reason why I don't buy in Amazon. Last time I bought an item it was sold as new item but they sent me a used item with the package opened and missing parts. I called them (25min call) and they finally told me that they don't provide missing parts and they don't fully cover the refund, and they don't send someone to collect the wrong item, so I had to pay lot of extra money because I had to return the item to a different country (the one they sent the item from), also I wasted much time printing out their f... Labels, buying a new box for delivery and bringing the parcel to a post office... If you don't have printer at home it is a pain in the as! Think very well before buying anything here, even if it cost a bit more it really worth it buying in local stores.",2023-10-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,14.0,782,156,50,11,3.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,see reason dont buy amazon last time bought item sold new item sent used item package opened missing part called min call finally told dont provide missing part dont fully cover refund dont send someone collect wrong item pay lot extra money return item different country one sent item also wasted much time printing f label buying new box delivery bringing parcel post office dont printer home pain think well buying anything even cost bit really worth buying local store,0.04293424481614737,0.9570657551838526,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.7960314754606868,79.60314754606867,High Trust
