Caroline Thomas,/users/638b8044a1a9be001246f4a2,GB,3.0,2023-10-13 20:47:57+00:00,1.0,The Amazon delivery drivers took…,"The Amazon delivery drivers took advantage of my 13 year old son and took the one time passcode required for delivery and only gave him 2 out of the 3 packages, conveniently not delivering the TV I had ordered.  When I spoke to Amazon when I got home an hour after the delivery and could see no TV had been delivered I called them.  They asked me to wait two days and if no delivery was made I told could request a refund or replacement.  Today as no delivery has been made I contacted Amazon who have now said that they cannot do anything and won’t even investigate.  I was a loyal Amazon Prime member, with audible, music, TV however it stands for nothing - as they write to me their apologies that they can’t don’t anything even though their delivery drivers are thieves, they sign off their emails as the Earth's Most Customer-Centric Company - what a joke!!!!!!",2023-10-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,13.0,866,159,33,5,2.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,amazon delivery driver took advantage year old son took one time passcode required delivery gave package conveniently delivering tv ordered spoke amazon got home hour delivery could see tv delivered called asked wait two day delivery made told could request refund replacement today delivery made contacted amazon said cannot anything won’t even investigate loyal amazon prime member audible music tv however stand nothing write apology can’t don’t anything even though delivery driver thief sign email earth customercentric company joke,0.9831390622401658,0.016860937759834216,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.32626557824615376,32.626557824615375,Low Trust
