Jon,/users/5ab2916d4de5666d3466ab9a,GB,7.0,2023-10-11 21:44:08+00:00,5.0,"Anytime, Variety, Value & Convenience","Amazon UK receives a great deal of negative press most of which in my humble opinion is totally unjustified. In my experience of being an Amazon user stretching back for many years now, I’ve never really encountered or experienced anything other than the most excellent and reliable customer service, great choice & value, and excellent delivery turn arounds. I did once have a blip, something went very wrong (obviously these things will happen), however after contacting Amazon, straightaway the issue got satisfactorily resolved and I was even provided with a complete refund and agreeable compensation. I was so highly impressed with the professional manner in which that particular issue was dealt with. I find more and more these days so many high street brand stores often only provide top selling products with limited to zero choices being readily made available to the consumer and that includes their internet shopping sites. Time after time I’ve visited many of these companies and then swiftly moved across to Amazon. Being with Amazon the opposite is true, so many wide ranging products, such huge variety, so many obscure products, and the opportunity to shop at my convenience at anytime day or night so for these reasons thats why Amazon always tends getting my money and vote. The only negatives for me are:- I consider it’s important that people understand that some employees both in-house and self employed aren’t always being treated lawfully in so far as the meaning contained within the UK Employment Act and this is an extremely important issue that I consider should have a much higher priority within their internal HR department. And finally, the often totally ridiculous amount of packaging involved and I’ve never fully understood why this issue isn’t being more swiftly addressed.",2023-10-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,11.0,1811,294,37,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon uk receives great deal negative press humble opinion totally unjustified experience amazon user stretching back many year i’ve never really encountered experienced anything excellent reliable customer service great choice value excellent delivery turn arounds blip something went wrong obviously thing happen however contacting amazon straightaway issue got satisfactorily resolved even provided complete refund agreeable compensation highly impressed professional manner particular issue dealt find day many high street brand store often provide top selling product limited zero choice readily made available consumer includes internet shopping site time time i’ve visited many company swiftly moved across amazon amazon opposite true many wide ranging product huge variety many obscure product opportunity shop convenience anytime day night reason thats amazon always tends getting money vote negative consider it’s important people understand employee inhouse self employed aren’t always treated lawfully far meaning contained within uk employment act extremely important issue consider much higher priority within internal hr department finally often totally ridiculous amount packaging involved i’ve never fully understood issue isn’t swiftly addressed,0.01791499341040563,0.9820850065895944,0.16489063376332025,1.0,2.024020630047461,202.4020630047461,High Trust
Michelle Dewey,/users/6526efc75fe1f6001192b9d8,GB,1.0,2023-10-11 20:56:22+00:00,1.0,"Half of my goods were missing, Amazon refusing to acknowledge this","Half of my goods were missing, value of order £450, £160 of the goods were missing, gave the security code issued by Amazon to the driver to accept my package, what an absolute joke, the driver left, when I opened it there should have been 4 items but only 2 in the box, I contacted Amazon immediately, did everything they asked of me, report the theft and got a crime number, I sent them every bit of information they asked for even video footage of the delivery but they are refusing to re send me the items I have paid for or refund me, just continually fobbing me off, absolutely utterly and totally disgusting, this company are not fit to trade",2023-09-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,11.0,649,121,66,11,11.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,half good missing value order £ £ good missing gave security code issued amazon driver accept package absolute joke driver left opened item box contacted amazon immediately everything asked report theft got crime number sent every bit information asked even video footage delivery refusing send item paid refund continually fobbing absolutely utterly totally disgusting company fit trade,0.006680040468557586,0.9933199595314424,0.06786315199102635,0.2,0.8102326101639264,81.02326101639264,High Trust
Ryan Hennessy-Saunders,/users/5ca6099d9b19aa60b47311df,GB,7.0,2023-10-11 20:20:52+00:00,1.0,Amazon…do one,"Amazon…well where the hell do I start? To say that Amazon are a shocking shower of s**t, would be such a huge understatement. I used to have so much confidence and faith in Amazon, but only until recently, they’ve gone down hill dramatically, and is just a disappointing company. I have had NUMEROUS packages ‘get lost’ and when I’ve contacted their customer support, well they were as much use as a knitted condom and no explanations as to how or why this happened! Their overall business ethics are just horrifically diabolical and their customer service is just absolutely appalling to say the least! They’re quick enough to take OUR hard-earned money, but when it comes to refunding, well it’s like trying to pry a mouse from the jaws of a venomous viper! I am ABSOLUTELY DISGUSTED with Amazon and their customer service and I DO NOT recommend anybody to use them. AVOID them like you would a pit full of hungry rats!!",2023-10-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,11.0,922,162,13,2,1.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,amazon…well hell start say amazon shocking shower st would huge understatement used much confidence faith amazon recently they’ve gone hill dramatically disappointing company numerous package ‘get lost’ i’ve contacted customer support well much use knitted condom explanation happened overall business ethic horrifically diabolical customer service absolutely appalling say least they’re quick enough take hardearned money come refunding well it’s like trying pry mouse jaw venomous viper absolutely disgusted amazon customer service recommend anybody use avoid like would pit full hungry rat,0.9758127627726474,0.02418723722735261,0.09085810431856421,0.2,0.3302652394773891,33.02652394773891,Low Trust
