Illuminated Journey Tarot,/users/6526a9ca9b8e460012e3f7fc,US,1.0,2023-10-11 15:57:40+00:00,1.0,Poor business model,"I don't know what happened to their business model in the last year, but I won't be using this app again. Items not delivered and not refunded, completely wrong items sent in place of ordered items, agents who do not listen to the problem and refuse to fix it, hours of my time spent making sure I'm compensated for my unfulfilled orders... who is paying me back for the time I spent doing this?! Probably the same people who expect me to check out my own items at Walmart.",2023-10-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,11.0,473,89,19,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,dont know happened business model last year wont using app item delivered refunded completely wrong item sent place ordered item agent listen problem refuse fix hour time spent making sure im compensated unfulfilled order paying back time spent probably people expect check item walmart,0.03842888889744983,0.9615711111025502,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.7907687299764012,79.07687299764012,High Trust
