chris petro,/users/6060a6acd0a67f00197865bc,US,6.0,2023-10-11 05:04:25+00:00,1.0,Had it with Amazon,"I've been an Amazon Prime member forever and have never had such a nightmare experience with an order.The kettle arrived in fine condition, but instead of the white handled kettle I ordered, and was listed on my invoice, I received a black handled kettle. The sticker on the top of the box said ""white"", but later when I packed it up to return it, I noticed the sticker on the bottom stated ""black"". So,I called and asked to exchange it for the color that I ordered.That's when the problems began.I spoke w/4 supervisors in the hopes that one of them would be helpful in resolving the issue, but to varying degrees,I was met with disrespect, suspicion,condescending attitude, and downright talking over me.Quite honestly, I've never experienced this from Amazon,... ever...until now.Something has changed, and not for the better.To complicate matters, mine was sold through their warehouse as "" like new"" and they didn't want to help me get the color I ordered...even though it was their error.I guess they fail to check to be sure these boxes contain the item as described, although their descriptions online would lead you to believe they do. I was told I would be refunded only if I followed their online instructions to a T and if I wanted the white one I could go back and purchase it at the current price which is now higher. No apologies, no ""let's see if we can correct this error"", no... actually, one supervisor questioned whether I did receive the wrong color, Ugh...  (that theory was debunked once she saw the photo and the invoice).Because the correct color was now going to cost more as it's price moved up and down like the stock market while I waited for my package to arrive, I decided to just cut my loses of time and energy and get my money back.Amazon, it appears does not value their customers.Because of the horrible treatment, waste of hours on the phone,the stress I endured, and the lack of respect and value for a long standing Prime member, I decided I had enough, and plan to cancel my membership and stop ordering from Amazon altogether.",2023-10-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,11.0,2067,362,18,4,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive amazon prime member forever never nightmare experience orderthe kettle arrived fine condition instead white handled kettle ordered listed invoice received black handled kettle sticker top box said white later packed return noticed sticker bottom stated black soi called asked exchange color orderedthats problem begani spoke w supervisor hope one would helpful resolving issue varying degreesi met disrespect suspicioncondescending attitude downright talking mequite honestly ive never experienced amazon everuntil nowsomething changed betterto complicate matter mine sold warehouse like new didnt want help get color orderedeven though errori guess fail check sure box contain item described although description online would lead believe told would refunded followed online instruction wanted white one could go back purchase current price higher apology let see correct error actually one supervisor questioned whether receive wrong color ugh theory debunked saw photo invoicebecause correct color going cost price moved like stock market waited package arrive decided cut loses time energy get money backamazon appears value customersbecause horrible treatment waste hour phonethe stress endured lack respect value long standing prime member decided enough plan cancel membership stop ordering amazon altogether,0.005079858475801255,0.9949201415241987,0.20302860347728546,0.2,0.8380657914575564,83.80657914575565,High Trust
Asum,/users/539edd600000640001799c93,GB,4.0,2023-10-25 08:39:48+00:00,1.0,Amazon refusing to exchange airpods…,Amazon refused to exchange airpods that had been declared by Apple as defective and told that Amazon must replace them under the Apple program.I went to Apple they wrote a full report on x2 Apple Airpods purchased in 2020 and declared these were sold with a defect and in the report under consumer law amazon must replace these.Amazon has point blank refused and asked me to go back to Apple to play ping pong.I spoke to Katelyn June - who just wouldn't help and kept on telling me to go back to Apple and not listen to anything `i was telling her. so i have no choice but to go back to store and waste another day working this out25/10 - I have been advised by Apple to go back to Amazon an apply the consumer right 2015 which i have and contacted the MD office and will let you know how i got on,2023-10-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,25.0,797,155,36,5,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon refused exchange airpods declared apple defective told amazon must replace apple programi went apple wrote full report x apple airpods purchased declared sold defect report consumer law amazon must replace theseamazon point blank refused asked go back apple play ping pongi spoke katelyn june wouldnt help kept telling go back apple listen anything telling choice go back store waste another day working advised apple go back amazon apply consumer right contacted md office let know got,0.025390682137219362,0.9746093178627806,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.8046910863009922,80.46910863009921,High Trust
