JDW,/users/6525c06731c75e0011534cc6,US,1.0,2023-10-10 23:22:23+00:00,1.0,If there was a zero stars or negative…,"I've been a long-time Prime customer and an even longer Amazon customer.  But, because of the way I'm being treated now by customer service, I won't be for long.If there was a zero star or negative star, that's what I would give them.  I have an ongoing issue with Amazon's shipping (I believe it's Amazon Logistics) not being able to deliver packages to my address.  No other shippers seem to have a problem finding it, but Amazon, not so much.I understand that things happen and there are glitches, mistakes, I get it.  However, this started over 3 months ago ... and they can't seem to solve it.   The worst part is the customer service itself.  They appear to be completely incompetent at every level - at best.  At worst, they just don't care about me as a customer (I am leaning towards the at worst).  They make it impossible to directly contact anyone who might actually be competent enough to fix the problem.  Took forever for them to even ""escalate"" the issue to the ""appropriate team"" for ""investigations"".  Once they finally did, nothing has happened.  All I get are lame, canned responses that all say the same things regardless of my correspondence to them.  No one has directly replied to what I've actually written to them - via emails and postal mail.  Just canned ""Thank you for your patience"", etc.Absolutely terrible customer ""service""!",2023-10-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,10.0,1357,233,38,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ive longtime prime customer even longer amazon customer way im treated customer service wont longif zero star negative star thats would give ongoing issue amazon shipping believe amazon logistics able deliver package address shipper seem problem finding amazon muchi understand thing happen glitch mistake get however started month ago cant seem solve worst part customer service appear completely incompetent every level best worst dont care customer leaning towards worst make impossible directly contact anyone might actually competent enough fix problem took forever even escalate issue appropriate team investigation finally nothing happened get lame canned response say thing regardless correspondence one directly replied ive actually written via email postal mail canned thank patience etcabsolutely terrible customer service,0.05199062778899903,0.948009372211001,0.13067863151991027,0.2,0.8001404124094826,80.01404124094826,High Trust
Shaq,/users/5b9386bb4de5666d344b4320,FI,2.0,2023-10-10 22:31:03+00:00,1.0,Customer service is the worst,"Amazon customer service is just one big joke, got account locked and I can change password for it, but they cant get it open, because they need more information, too bad that no-one tells me what they need. searched from the internet some emails to contant, couldnt find one from their sites, only phonenumbers, but they didnt work from finland...  never again amazon, never again...",2023-10-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,10.0,383,65,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service one big joke got account locked change password cant get open need information bad noone tell need searched internet email contant couldnt find one site phonenumbers didnt work finland never amazon never,0.014212902142743986,0.985787097857256,0.03645541222658441,0.2,0.8001846313739448,80.01846313739448,High Trust
Pamela Philips,/users/64ef89187d26f40011b41dfa,US,2.0,2023-10-10 20:51:06+00:00,1.0,"Amazon marks wrong, cheaper item as being returned and won't fix their records so I get full refund","I requested a return of a Wera 05008735001 Kraftform Plus 350 PH Phillips Screwdriver, Lasertip, PH 3 Head, 6"" Blade Length and was given a temporary $19.02 refund on October 4th. I went to a UPS store and physically returned THAT item in person. The problem is: my records are now showing that amazon has NOT received this item, but erroneously shows that I instead returned a cheaper ($11.93) Wera 05008720001 Kraftform Plus 350 PH Phillips Screwdriver, Lasertip, PH 2 Head, 4"" Blade Length ... the latter item still being in my possession in my toolbox!All I want is for my amazon records to reflect that the $19.02 screwdriver was indeed returned and that said return is complete. Live chat was useless in this regard because they just said the problem is fixed and i ""won't be charged"" nor will i ""receive any more emails"" regarding this, totally neglecting the real issue because amazon is NOT showing the actual return of the $19.02 item (thus, the return is incomplete) and incorrectly showing a return of the $11.93 item (showing it is complete). I know it is only a $7 and change difference, but this is fraudulent and I am being cheated out of the full amount of the screwdriver that was returned to amazon in good faith!!",2023-10-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,10.0,1233,217,99,18,6.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,requested return wera kraftform plus ph phillips screwdriver lasertip ph head blade length given temporary refund october th went ups store physically returned item person problem record showing amazon received item erroneously show instead returned cheaper wera kraftform plus ph phillips screwdriver lasertip ph head blade length latter item still possession toolboxall want amazon record reflect screwdriver indeed returned said return complete live chat useless regard said problem fixed wont charged receive email regarding totally neglecting real issue amazon showing actual return item thus return incomplete incorrectly showing return item showing complete know change difference fraudulent cheated full amount screwdriver returned amazon good faith,0.4113037412840215,0.5886962587159785,0.12170499158721257,0.2,0.6186891276754318,61.86891276754318,Medium Trust
