Toyota McNeill,/users/5d3389e9a0b0aa314f639cdf,US,4.0,2023-10-08 23:32:54+00:00,1.0,Same day Delivery took 4 days,"I have been Waiting for an IPad with Cover for 4 days, it was suppose to be a Same day delivery!! The driver said at 5 am the next day, that he was at my door and could not deliver my order becuz I didn’t answer and said it was a business and he couldn’t get in!! I told a live customer service agent that was BS becuz if he had been at my door knocking I would have heard it as my screen door is metal!! 2 days later still No IPad!! I finally Cancelled my order and waiting for my Refund. This was a delivery from the Burlington NJ Warehouse!!",2023-10-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,8.0,544,112,29,6,3.0,0,10,1,0,Genuine,waiting ipad cover day suppose day delivery driver said next day door could deliver order becuz didn’t answer said business couldn’t get told live customer service agent b becuz door knocking would heard screen door metal day later still ipad finally cancelled order waiting refund delivery burlington nj warehouse,0.9999648674562344,3.51325437656369e-05,0.0628154795288839,0.2,0.31258066217765956,31.258066217765958,Low Trust
Furgy,/users/5fd64c243a64c6001a4b599c,US,34.0,2023-10-08 21:21:23+00:00,2.0,AMAZON - NOT DELIVERING OR SHIPPING AS PROMISED!,"I have 4 different orders placed on Amazon Prime as a 8 year Prime member. Three items were promised on 10/5 and at this time they all 3 show NOT YET SHIPPED? All 3 showed 2 day delivery but are not even shipped 3 days after the delivery promise date - NONE OF THEM! The fourth order was to be here Friday 10/6 and it has set in 2 area locations in DFW both of which are less than 20 miles away. It currently sits in Lewisville TX ONLY 5 MILES away with no delivery date showing???ALL common excuses on line don’t fit. They have been delivering to my same home for 8 years with no delivery issues until the last 3 months???In the last 3 months at least a quarter of my orders are delayed 1-3 days past the promise dates?? I complain but it still happens. I can see why a package can be 1-2 days late occasionally because they OVERSTATE their capabilities!! However, it gets worse every week. I get angry when this many orders go past the PROMISED date, only to find out they haven’t even been shipped. Then, OR EVEN 2 or 3 DAYS LATER, they all say NOT YET SHIPPED. How is this not violation of Federal Law as far as Internet sales?? They have a monopoly and need to be held accountable! Calling my Texas Attorney General Consumer Fraud Division tomorrow!!",2023-10-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,8.0,1255,238,48,8,3.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,different order placed amazon prime year prime member three item promised time show yet shipped showed day delivery even shipped day delivery promise date none fourth order friday set area location dfw less mile away currently sits lewisville tx mile away delivery date showingall common excuse line don’t fit delivering home year delivery issue last monthsin last month least quarter order delayed day past promise date complain still happens see package day late occasionally overstate capability however get worse every week get angry many order go past promised date find haven’t even shipped even day later say yet shipped violation federal law far internet sale monopoly need held accountable calling texas attorney general consumer fraud division tomorrow,0.9898898096978721,0.010110190302127897,0.1334828939988783,0.4,0.6317516739508395,63.17516739508395,Medium Trust
Andra Iliescu,/users/6522f1aaa0bc7d00119e3d34,CZ,1.0,2023-10-08 20:15:15+00:00,1.0,Worst experience with Amazon since Fan Courier took over logistics,Worst experience with Amazon since Fan Courier took over the logistics company in Europe. 2 years later and they are still not on top of things. Not possible to manage delivery through various companies. They set a default in the Czech Republic on the company Zasilkovna and that company delivers only up to 15kg. Thus no one in the Czech Republic can order anything heavier than 15kg from Amazon anymore. Fan Courier is a catastrophic company.,2023-10-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,8.0,444,76,66,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,worst experience amazon since fan courier took logistics company europe year later still top thing possible manage delivery various company set default czech republic company zasilkovna company delivers kg thus one czech republic order anything heavier kg amazon anymore fan courier catastrophic company,0.011667159193238009,0.988332840806762,0.04262478968031408,0.2,0.8026913783394437,80.26913783394437,High Trust
Judith Castle,/users/650b5367af3ea600128dfabd,GB,2.0,2023-10-08 14:03:56+00:00,2.0,Delivery Box ignored,"Several years ago we made a large wooden box with a key code especially for deliveries. It sits on our small porch  by the front door and is usually unlocked until items have been delivered. The box has been admired by delivery personnel and visitors alike. My instructions always include the key code.  The problem is three-fold 1. Amazon does not provide an option to leave items in a secure box in the delivery section when we order so I have to adapt how I give the instructions - but they’re there. 2. Drivers don’t read the instructions. 3. Despite the box being clearly labelled with ‘Amazon Deliveries etc’  many delivery drivers leave parcels on top of the box, at the side of the box or even elsewhere and photograph it. Some items are quite valuable. Not all drivers do this so it is annoying when it happens. It has also gone on for too long and is NOT acceptable. We’ve done our best to help delivery drivers do their job so they should do the same for us.",2023-10-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,8.0,969,179,20,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,several year ago made large wooden box key code especially delivery sits small porch front door usually unlocked item delivered box admired delivery personnel visitor alike instruction always include key code problem threefold amazon provide option leave item secure box delivery section order adapt give instruction they’re driver don’t read instruction despite box clearly labelled ‘amazon delivery etc’ many delivery driver leave parcel top box side box even elsewhere photograph item quite valuable driver annoying happens also gone long acceptable we’ve done best help delivery driver job u,0.00947622860220528,0.9905237713977947,0.10039259674705553,0.4,1.1153404050483084,111.53404050483084,High Trust
Simon Atkinson,/users/604915e92022320019b491aa,GB,12.0,2023-10-08 11:57:35+00:00,5.0,Consistently Good Service,"I am a Prime user, have been for several years and buy a lot from Amazon. I have always found them to be reliable and when things have gone wrong they have been great at sorting things out. I can see why many people don't like the company which might might explain the poor score but for me their performance would not be a reason.I use Amazon for both personal and business related purchases, I probably have two or three deliveries a week and rarely does anything fail to arrive on time.Prices are variable and not always the best but on the whole I would say they are good and sometimes very good. Also there are app's to price watch so if you are after a particular item and not in a hurry you can often grab a bargain.Obviously things do go wrong but I've found Amazon are always quick to respond and I can't say I have ever felt they have not resolved things to my satisfaction.Examples are: Expensive headphones broke after one and a half years - Amazon gave me a full refund. Extract fans delivered were not the model I ordered but I only noticed after the return period - Full refund.Diamond drill, should have been 5, only one in pack - Full refund, kept the one drillI would generally prefer to buy things on Amazon, especially electronics that can go wrong as I know I will get a refund with little fuss.So in my experience I really can't fault Amazon",2023-10-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,8.0,1363,254,25,3,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,prime user several year buy lot amazon always found reliable thing gone wrong great sorting thing see many people dont like company might might explain poor score performance would reasoni use amazon personal business related purchase probably two three delivery week rarely anything fail arrive timeprices variable always best whole would say good sometimes good also apps price watch particular item hurry often grab bargainobviously thing go wrong ive found amazon always quick respond cant say ever felt resolved thing satisfactionexamples expensive headphone broke one half year amazon gave full refund extract fan delivered model ordered noticed return period full refunddiamond drill one pack full refund kept one drilli would generally prefer buy thing amazon especially electronics go wrong know get refund little fussso experience really cant fault amazon,0.01718647148307788,0.9828135285169222,0.142456533931576,1.0,2.0198980710447763,201.98980710447762,High Trust
