Richard Doherty,/users/652054313ebb7a0012316c60,GB,4.0,2023-10-06 20:39:51+00:00,1.0,UNAPOLOGETICALLY and REPEATEDLY lied to by Amazon.,"I ordered a mobile phone to replace one that had broken. Therefore it needed to arrive promptly. Naively as an Amazon Prime customer I thought I could rely on Amazon. Instead Amazon repeatedly lied to me and caused me a great deal of inconvenience, aggravation, frustration and added expense.LIE 1 : Day 01 - ‘The Item is in Stock’. Clearly it wasn’t  / couldn’t be dispatched.LIE 2 : Day 11 - ‘Your item has been dispatched’.  Untrue. No tracking information was forthcoming. The courier states Amazon did nothing other than ‘Prepare a label’.LIE 3 : Day 23 - ‘Your item will arrive by day 24’.  With great difficulty I got the attention a ‘customer service’ representative. I was told by this individual that the item would definitely arrive on day 24.  'I could trust him on that'. LIE 4 : Day 24 - ‘Sorry we a re running late. Your item will arrive by day 27’. Final lie. Day 27 the item never arrived.Exacerbating the WOEFUL service is the fact that when there is a problem there is no meaningful or practical mechanism to remedy the situation. When the system works it works. When it doesn’t there is no plan ‘B’. Amazon provides no access to anyone who is empowered to either investigate or remediate. Further they filter out and censor all criticism.",2023-10-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,6.0,1258,223,50,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered mobile phone replace one broken therefore needed arrive promptly naively amazon prime customer thought could rely amazon instead amazon repeatedly lied caused great deal inconvenience aggravation frustration added expenselie day ‘the item stock’ clearly wasn’t couldn’t dispatchedlie day ‘your item dispatched’ untrue tracking information forthcoming courier state amazon nothing ‘prepare label’lie day ‘your item arrive day ’ great difficulty got attention ‘customer service’ representative told individual item would definitely arrive day could trust lie day ‘sorry running late item arrive day ’ final lie day item never arrivedexacerbating woeful service fact problem meaningful practical mechanism remedy situation system work work doesn’t plan ‘b’ amazon provides access anyone empowered either investigate remediate filter censor criticism,0.009514496312338885,0.9904855036876611,0.1250701065619742,0.2,0.8202567731562254,82.02567731562253,High Trust
