Anna,/users/651f9658b151090011f33bc4,US,4.0,2023-10-06 08:19:25+00:00,1.0,Damaged “brand new books” sold and shipped directly by Amazon.com,"I order quite a lot from Amazon because they have everything available and the prices are pretty good as well. I’m an avid reader so I order a lot of books. Textbooks, spiritual books, baby books, you name it. I always buy brand new & directly from Amazon. I never buy anything from third party sellers because I had multiple bad experiences with those before (mainly false advertisement regarding the book’s condition). Anyway, I noticed that half the time the brand new books that get sold & shipped by Amazon itself, come damaged, beat up or worn. There was several times when I wanted to gift a book to someone and I couldn’t because they looked used. Amazon, store and take care of your books and package them carefully! If I pay $40 for a brand new copy then I EXPECT it to look brand new. If I wanted a beat up one, I would have gone to a thrift store.",2023-10-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,6.0,859,161,65,10,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,order quite lot amazon everything available price pretty good well i’m avid reader order lot book textbook spiritual book baby book name always buy brand new directly amazon never buy anything third party seller multiple bad experience mainly false advertisement regarding book’s condition anyway noticed half time brand new book get sold shipped amazon come damaged beat worn several time wanted gift book someone couldn’t looked used amazon store take care book package carefully pay brand new copy expect look brand new wanted beat one would gone thrift store,0.011989330690908536,0.9880106693090914,0.09029725182277061,0.2,0.8120647850190998,81.20647850190998,High Trust
