wolfestein,/users/5c2ff75915c98550c7760069,GB,6.0,2023-10-04 23:00:09+00:00,1.0,Orders delayed for couple of days,"I have prime membership with Amazon and I spend like £1000 on order and I had 3 items that they came late like 3 days after the day I order. One item has been late and then delivered to a random neighbour, I never found the item obviously, I'm still chasing Amazon about my item. First, I would like to say that I never been so disappointed like now, how bad they organise all the orders and the amount delay time. Secondly, if they know that it will take more time to deliver the items, they should put the time (days) for how long it will take the order instead of lying about the next day delivery of the items. Basically I'm paying PRIME for no reason as I could just order straight without membership. I will try not to order from here again because of the lack of time, is horrible as I really needed the item next day delivered to me. Don't put the trust in them anymore as the organisation is so bad right now in their company.",2023-10-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,4.0,935,181,33,6,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,prime membership amazon spend like £ order item came late like day day order one item late delivered random neighbour never found item obviously im still chasing amazon item first would like say never disappointed like bad organise order amount delay time secondly know take time deliver item put time day long take order instead lying next day delivery item basically im paying prime reason could order straight without membership try order lack time horrible really needed item next day delivered dont put trust anymore organisation bad right company,0.004774601755095977,0.995225398244904,0.10151430173864273,0.2,0.8179155594701805,81.79155594701804,High Trust
