Alucard,/users/5f0080d958d8a758398299c2,GB,26.0,2023-10-04 11:27:47+00:00,1.0,"The only review you need, games and koei tecmo.","First who am I? A no nonesense reviewer 100% honesty from birth to death.This is regarding a pre-order game off Amazon.com Fate Samurai Remnant, So I pre-ordered it, it's supposed to come with bonus in game content, I've gotten games off Amazon for more than 2 decades with no problem, until today, basically Amazon said this to me----------------------Hello,Greetings from Amazon Team.We're really sorry for the inconvenience caused for accessing your game code.As much as I want unfortunately,  as the item is ordered out side of the USA you are not eligible for the Game code.It is our privilege to have you as our valued customer & we want to make sure you are always taken care of.On a personal level, I highly appreciate your patience, cooperation and understanding in this matter.|You contact our Customer Service Team at your earliest convenience.You can reach us by chat or phone at the link below:or call us at 888-280-4331.We'd appreciate your feedback. Please use the buttons below to vote about your experience today.Best regards,ReikaAmazon.com----------------------So I can'tget it because I'm not in USA right now? Lesson learned never buy games off Amazon.com they will lie to you as other representitives said that I would get it.I even contacted Koei Tecmo, the developer of the game, and they said this to me, ---------------Dear Customer, Thank you for your inquiry. We are afraid that the preorder bonus Phantasmal Dress ""Miyamoto Musashi"" distributed by Amazon is a store bonus, and Amazon is in charge of handling this.We are sorry to trouble you, but please contact Amazon for your inquiry about this matter. Even if you have already contacted Amazon and been directed to us, please kindly contact Amazon again for the above mentioned reason. We would much appreciate your understanding. Sincerely, Koei Tecmo Customer Support------------------