Graham Broxham,/users/5cd1470eb2a742559e9890f6,GB,11.0,2023-10-03 19:57:41+00:00,1.0,Amazon the high Street killer is…,"Amazon the high Street killer is without a doubt very convenient when they get it right and you are happy with your purchase.  The down side if you ever have the misfortune to have to deal with the obligatory Idian customer service then you have arrived in shopping hell, some idiot reading from an idiot board telling you how sorry they are for any inconvenience or you return something for a refund. In the later expect to gave your money in Amazons bank for at least 21 days if your lucky, this is 14 days after they received your item back which in my case showed by the tracking as two days but for Amazon eleven days they told me, two weeks to process and then ten days for the money to hot my account.  So in summary 35 days for a refund and only then after a huge argument with several Idian call centre experts.   Really people stop shopping with these clowns and close them down.",2023-09-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,3.0,889,167,33,6,18.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon high street killer without doubt convenient get right happy purchase side ever misfortune deal obligatory idian customer service arrived shopping hell idiot reading idiot board telling sorry inconvenience return something refund later expect gave money amazon bank least day lucky day received item back case showed tracking two day amazon eleven day told two week process ten day money hot account summary day refund huge argument several idian call centre expert really people stop shopping clown close,0.008406722108054697,0.9915932778919453,0.09366236679753225,0.2,0.8145291123054791,81.45291123054791,High Trust
