PJ Shannon,/users/61196e612045750012e411cc,US,11.0,2023-10-03 00:13:13+00:00,1.0,Unacceptable Customer Service- AMAZON,"So I placed two orders this afternoon with Amazon - about 30 minutes apart.  Then I start getting emails that my prime card has been declined - wth?  I pay this account on time in full every single month - there’s no issue with my card.  Then I get a scam email pretending to be Amazon also saying my card has been declined - so weird!  So I go online to Amazon for help for which their chat bot is of no help -shocker!  Can’t even enter that their supplied menu does not fit why I need help -such a waste of time.  So I request a call back - I get one man, who speaks very poor English but I can make out that he doesn’t see an issue but that he has to transfer me to customer service “just to be sure”. So I’ve now been on hold for over 30 minutes with a lady whom I have already told that I am sorry but I simply cannot understand her.  I finally ascertain that she is telling me “I” need to call Synchrony Bank since the purchase has been declined.  I said absolutely not as there is not an issue with my card and I request an English-speaking manager.  She proceeds to tell me, of course, that there is not one, so I tell her she can cancel my prime account and I will leave a negative review here - hence the reason I am now on hold.  She asked to put me on hold for “2 minutes” -it has now been over 30, which is what prompted this review.  To me, this is “their” issue between them and synchrony bank (the 3rd party payment processor who handles so many accounts it will make your head spin). I am cancelling this order and will simply go elsewhere.  Amazon has simply become too damn big and they outsource their customer service, like so many other companies, which helps to keep the costs down I’m sure.  From now on, if I can find an Amazon alternative, I will use it - despite being a stockholder -in fact, I will probably just sell my stock now - they certainly don’t deserve my business.  I shouldn’t even be having to waste my time messing with any of this.  The death of customer service - truer words were never spoken!",2023-10-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,3.0,2037,397,37,4,2.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,placed two order afternoon amazon minute apart start getting email prime card declined wth pay account time full every single month there’s issue card get scam email pretending amazon also saying card declined weird go online amazon help chat bot help shocker can’t even enter supplied menu fit need help waste time request call back get one man speaks poor english make doesn’t see issue transfer customer service “just sure” i’ve hold minute lady already told sorry simply cannot understand finally ascertain telling “i” need call synchrony bank since purchase declined said absolutely issue card request englishspeaking manager proceeds tell course one tell cancel prime account leave negative review hence reason hold asked put hold “ minutes” prompted review “their” issue synchrony bank rd party payment processor handle many account make head spin cancelling order simply go elsewhere amazon simply become damn big outsource customer service like many company help keep cost i’m sure find amazon alternative use despite stockholder fact probably sell stock certainly don’t deserve business shouldn’t even waste time messing death customer service truer word never spoken,0.5656071458923962,0.43439285410760375,0.2226584408300617,0.2,0.5617281152198143,56.17281152198142,Medium Trust
