Brent,/users/639859c2d924a40012066672,US,18.0,2023-10-01 05:04:36+00:00,1.0,I made a purchase last Monday on Amazon…,"I made a purchase last Monday on Amazon for a glass-top desk and a leather desk chair. I canceled the purchase no more than 20-30 seconds due to them being the wrong items. I intended to go forward with the same purchase but different items but the policy states 3 -5 business days before the money is returned to my debit card. On the 3rd day I contacted Amazon asking where the refund is because the items I canceled weren't even in my list of purchases. Amazon kept asking me for the order number and they weren't listed to get the item number! So they asked for the card number I used to make the purchase. Some magical reason, neither Amazon nor Chime bank can tell me where or how or what about that purchase. It's non-existent to them. But clear on my bank statement. It's been a week and still no sign of my refund. I've called Amazon countless times. Chime too. Today Chime had to start a claim to investigate where the money is and to give it back. How sad is it that they large corporate businesses can't handle their own customers money. They don't really care either because it's not them at loss!! Now I have to wait who knows WEEKS to get my damn money back from these 2 idiotic and ridiculous companies and I needed those items to start school tomorrow!! Never again Amazon, and Chime can definitely kiss my ass!",2023-09-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,1.0,1328,247,40,8,13.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,made purchase last monday amazon glasstop desk leather desk chair canceled purchase second due wrong item intended go forward purchase different item policy state business day money returned debit card rd day contacted amazon asking refund item canceled werent even list purchase amazon kept asking order number werent listed get item number asked card number used make purchase magical reason neither amazon chime bank tell purchase nonexistent clear bank statement week still sign refund ive called amazon countless time chime today chime start claim investigate money give back sad large corporate business cant handle customer money dont really care either loss wait know week get damn money back idiotic ridiculous company needed item start school tomorrow never amazon chime definitely kiss as,0.985319143750017,0.014680856249983054,0.13853056646102074,0.2,0.33504654141719564,33.50465414171956,Low Trust
