Timamu Hakim,/users/59723fc00000ff000ab21f3d,US,6.0,2023-09-29 16:36:23+00:00,1.0,A charge for item returned,"What I like about Amazon is the ability to order an item and receive it either the next day or the same day if available. I prefer to keep what I order, but at times, they don't fit or are described inaccurately, and appreciate the ability to return or replace them; however, lately, I've noticed a tactic that I hope is just the left hand not knowing what the right is doing and not a more grim plan to deceive their customers. I purchased an item for close to $300 and realized it did not work for what I needed it to. I printed out the return label and returned it to Kohl's. My funds were refunded and I purchased a unit that was close to $500 that served my purpose. Shortly thereafter, I started receiving emails from Amazon saying I needed to return the item and that they already refunded my money. They also stated that my card would be charged the full amount if not returned by a certain day. I may be incorrect, but Amazon has never refunded me for an item that was not returned. I was able to chat with an Amazon representative, they researched and found that the merchandise was returned and I was good to go. A month later, yesterday, my Prime card was charged the full amount for the item I charged. I'm disputing the charges and waiting to see how Amazon responds to my dispute, that will decide my business further with them.",2023-09-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,29.0,1343,252,26,5,16.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,like amazon ability order item receive either next day day available prefer keep order time dont fit described inaccurately appreciate ability return replace however lately ive noticed tactic hope left hand knowing right grim plan deceive customer purchased item close realized work needed printed return label returned kohl fund refunded purchased unit close served purpose shortly thereafter started receiving email amazon saying needed return item already refunded money also stated card would charged full amount returned certain day may incorrect amazon never refunded item returned able chat amazon representative researched found merchandise returned good go month later yesterday prime card charged full amount item charged im disputing charge waiting see amazon responds dispute decide business,0.006690668732756467,0.9933093312672435,0.14133482893998878,0.2,0.8249216314216195,82.49216314216194,High Trust
Maureen Booth,/users/5b5ef4ca4de5666d34f0c209,GB,31.0,2023-09-29 16:12:08+00:00,1.0,I purchased a blood pressure monitor…,"I purchased a blood pressure monitor dispatched by Amazon. Cazon Store, from WANGQIAN Ltd. This Cazon item is unreliable. Given the readings I should be dead!! My Dr. was mortified that this monitor is allowed on the market. It’s dangerous!! After repeated attempts of raising my concerns I was blocked. Amazon acknowledged but took no further action. People’s lives are at stake here? CE approved apparently? What’s that?",2023-09-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,29.0,422,68,37,6,7.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,purchased blood pressure monitor dispatched amazon cazon store wangqian ltd cazon item unreliable given reading dead dr mortified monitor allowed market it’s dangerous repeated attempt raising concern blocked amazon acknowledged took action people’s life stake ce approved apparently what’s,0.9772145307793764,0.022785469220623633,0.03813796971396523,0.2,0.31902032855310486,31.902032855310487,Low Trust
