Charles W,/users/57673fb00000ff000a2ab17e,US,4.0,2023-09-29 17:42:20+00:00,1.0,Amazon product reviews are not trustworthy,"I buy a lot of items from Amazon and am a Prime member. I usually like the products, but not always. I have written a lot of product reviews on Amazon about various products sold by Amazon.Amazon only publishes my positive reviews of products. Amazon refuses to publish any of my negative reviews of products. This indicates that Amazon and its product reviews are NOT trustworthy because Amazon only publishes positive reviews and refuses to publish negative reviews.All negative product reviews that I wrote were not published because (Amazon said) those reviews violated Amazon policy. All positive reviews that I wrote were published by Amazon.I do not trust Amazon to be honest and I no longer trust Amazon product reviews or star ratings.Also, Amazon does not allow reviews of Amazon itself or of delivery reliability. Why? Probably because they don't expect positive reviews.",2023-09-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,29.0,882,143,42,6,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,buy lot item amazon prime member usually like product always written lot product review amazon various product sold amazonamazon publishes positive review product amazon refuse publish negative review product indicates amazon product review trustworthy amazon publishes positive review refuse publish negative reviewsall negative product review wrote published amazon said review violated amazon policy positive review wrote published amazoni trust amazon honest longer trust amazon product review star ratingsalso amazon allow review amazon delivery reliability probably dont expect positive review,0.013606205283829382,0.9863937947161706,0.08020190689848569,0.2,0.8092372787377824,80.92372787377823,High Trust
