Andy Morfrett,/users/604a032392fd610019ad6f7f,GB,5.0,2023-09-28 16:50:12+00:00,1.0,Customer Service? They Have NO Idea What it Means!,"I have bought treats and dog-related items off Amazon many times. Sadly, my dog died four weeks ago so having those constant reminders of him every time I use Amazon is painful and upsetting. The issue is the 'buy again' display on the 'Your Orders' page.Today, I spoke to TWO so-called customer service agents who, between them, I would trust to open a door! For a start neither actually LISTENED to me (the first guy incurred my anger when he asked me what order I was referring to!) even when I explained very carefully what I wanted done: removal of all my dog-related purchases from my 'Your Orders' page.The second agent, a woman who preferred the sound of her own voice to mine, assured me that it would be done. I was not in the least surprised to learn, when I checked, that it was yet another false promise.So, thanks to the inherent idiocy of Amazon's set-up and the incompetence of their undertrained staff I am forced to be reminded of a most painful and upsetting experience that is still very raw. Thank you SO much Amazon.  Customer-centric company? Don't make me laugh! You don't stand a chance!!",2023-09-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,28.0,1113,198,50,9,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,bought treat dogrelated item amazon many time sadly dog died four week ago constant reminder every time use amazon painful upsetting issue buy display order pagetoday spoke two socalled customer service agent would trust open door start neither actually listened first guy incurred anger asked order referring even explained carefully wanted done removal dogrelated purchase order pagethe second agent woman preferred sound voice mine assured would done least surprised learn checked yet another false promiseso thanks inherent idiocy amazon setup incompetence undertrained staff forced reminded painful upsetting experience still raw thank much amazon customercentric company dont make laugh dont stand chance,0.9566223502031833,0.043377649796816686,0.11104879416713405,0.2,0.34389858373183513,34.389858373183515,Low Trust
