Alan,/users/538d6fc400006400017714aa,GB,27.0,2023-09-28 12:30:19+00:00,1.0,Amazon - Mehh,"Did you know that Amazon no longer accept PayPal?? I didn't.I recently wanted to buy an item, the price with postage was £112. I went through to the purchasing area for delivery address and method of payment and looked for PayPal. Obviously I couldn't find it. I backtracked through the ordering procedure and again I couldn't find a PayPal button. It was then that my phone pinged and I was told that the cash had been taken from my account by Amazons BuyNow procedure. I had not agreed to pay and I had not finalised payment, but Amazon had taken the money (illegally??) - without my consent to a contract.The item is still in the 'my basket' area.I asked for a call back and after 20 minutes waiting for a call went back on line and found how to cancel and cancelled the order.This morning I have been on a chat line for about an hour to find out that Mr. Bezos will not be returning my money (which was taken within seconds) for at least seven working days. Obviously the multi billionaire wants to hang on to the cash so he can make an extra penny or two in interest.Moral of this post - make sure that every detail of your purchase from Amazon is 100% correct before you enter the final page or you MAY be charged whether you consent or not, or even if you decide against the purchase.",2023-09-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,28.0,1291,242,13,3,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,know amazon longer accept paypal didnti recently wanted buy item price postage £ went purchasing area delivery address method payment looked paypal obviously couldnt find backtracked ordering procedure couldnt find paypal button phone pinged told cash taken account amazon buynow procedure agreed pay finalised payment amazon taken money illegally without consent contractthe item still basket areai asked call back minute waiting call went back line found cancel cancelled orderthis morning chat line hour find mr bezos returning money taken within second least seven working day obviously multi billionaire want hang cash make extra penny two interestmoral post make sure every detail purchase amazon correct enter final page may charged whether consent even decide purchase,0.02699836511055236,0.9730016348894477,0.1357263039820527,0.2,0.8136460782411344,81.36460782411345,High Trust
