Lesley Dawes,/users/5da21c5c7c1d9c830d1a3c16,GB,11.0,2023-09-27 20:48:42+00:00,1.0,LYING DELIVERY MAN,"Went to answer door to accept package, however found I had locked it, said I will back in a minute. By the time I got back driver was in van and driving off he saw me as I came out onto the path. However he just drove off. Now in the time it took for me to open the door about 10 seconds he had apparently got the receptionist of my house a 3 bedroom terrace to take and sign for the package. I would be very pleased 😀 if he would introduce me to this invisible person. As far as I know since the houses were built in the 1900’s no one has ever had a receptionist and I am not sure where they would put one. Perhaps under the garden bench no not there. So I have no parcel and a STUPID AMAZON system that says I can’t report it missing for 24 hours,  as it may be with a neighbour or in my very small front garden, or I might find the invisible receptionist who will give me my parcel 📦. BEWARE all you who deal with Amazon they look as though they are now employing self help drivers, to help themselves to YOUR parcel that you have PAID for.",2023-09-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,27.0,1043,213,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,went answer door accept package however found locked said back minute time got back driver van driving saw came onto path however drove time took open door second apparently got receptionist house bedroom terrace take sign package would pleased 😀 would introduce invisible person far know since house built ’s one ever receptionist sure would put one perhaps garden bench parcel stupid amazon system say can’t report missing hour may neighbour small front garden might find invisible receptionist give parcel 📦 beware deal amazon look though employing self help driver help parcel paid,0.029257540326330277,0.9707424596736697,0.11946158160403814,0.2,0.8092635461576425,80.92635461576425,High Trust
Tobias,/users/601b125ced25de001a108101,GB,18.0,2023-09-27 20:45:29+00:00,1.0,Zero stars if I could,"Zero stars if I could - Amazon want to be the most customer centric company ... just a joke! Nowadays it's all based on cheap offshoring with untrained people not knowing what they're doing. It's becoming more and more frustrating to talk/chat with someone - as a customer you're being ignored, agents lie & close tickets so that their KPIs look good. What world do we live in ... money over anything else!",2023-09-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,27.0,406,73,21,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,zero star could amazon want customer centric company joke nowadays based cheap offshoring untrained people knowing theyre becoming frustrating talkchat someone customer youre ignored agent lie close ticket kpis look good world live money anything else,0.5514056981462941,0.44859430185370586,0.04094223219293326,0.2,0.5324855973654395,53.24855973654395,Medium Trust
Jade Hale,/users/65144fc45a66810011724d90,US,1.0,2023-09-27 17:52:47+00:00,1.0,BAD CUSTOMER SERVICE,"I had an order going to the wrong address which was my fault of course and I tried correcting it with both Amazon and USPS which I couldn't because it couldn't be rerouted. However, USPS already confirmed it was going to an address that didn't exist and it would just get returned to sender anyway. Originally I was told by Amazon when the status updates (it was in transit) to let them know and they would explore our options from there.Chatted them the next day and was told nothing they could do but I knew it would get returned to sender. Once it was confirmed it was returned to sender on USPS I immediately contact Amazon and was told they were going to reattempt delivery and to wait until the next business day. I did that knowing it was a lie since it updated returned to sender. Next day it shows it arrived back to the sender and even updated on Amazon that it was returned to sender. I contacted Amazon once more and was transferred twice just to be told to fill out an incident report to ""Prove"" it didn't arrive. Like how the hell can you not see it was returned to sender?! what is there to prove? It shows it was returned to sender on the tracking. I filled out the incident report and was told I'd have to wait until after 09/26 and if I didn't get it by that evening to reach them for a refund. I called and was told I had to wait 14 days to get a refund! Escalated and was told to fill out another incident report which I did then prompted to fill out ANOTHER incident report. So I called back Amazon and escalated and was told due to the system I had to wait until after 09/26 and if it doesn't arrive, call them back 09/27 and they can refund. I did this and you know what I was told? We got only one of your incident reports and it was done on 09/25 so you'll have to fill out another one for your refund. I disputed this with my bank. I will NEVER use Amazon again. Their customer service is trash. They don't listen to you, they don't care, and if you are owed a refund GOOD LUCK getting it.",2023-09-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,27.0,2015,392,20,3,4.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,order going wrong address fault course tried correcting amazon usps couldnt couldnt rerouted however usps already confirmed going address didnt exist would get returned sender anyway originally told amazon status update transit let know would explore option therechatted next day told nothing could knew would get returned sender confirmed returned sender usps immediately contact amazon told going reattempt delivery wait next business day knowing lie since updated returned sender next day show arrived back sender even updated amazon returned sender contacted amazon transferred twice told fill incident report prove didnt arrive like hell see returned sender prove show returned sender tracking filled incident report told id wait didnt get evening reach refund called told wait day get refund escalated told fill another incident report prompted fill another incident report called back amazon escalated told due system wait doesnt arrive call back refund know told got one incident report done youll fill another one refund disputed bank never use amazon customer service trash dont listen dont care owed refund good luck getting,0.3308576945744864,0.6691423054255137,0.21985417835109367,0.2,0.6785419883829756,67.85419883829756,Medium Trust
