Trevor Paradise,/users/5c0967ca686c0946946823a2,GB,13.0,2023-09-27 16:10:40+00:00,1.0,"Ordered mobile phone(£350),got…","Ordered mobile phone(£350),got something else (£10  item),couldn't speak to any one kept being cut off.returned wrong item sent and waited for refund,and waited and waited.contacted customer services(ha.rude ) was told refund would be instigated.waited another week.had to contact credit card to raise dispute(they credited my account).Another week later still no refund.once again contacted customer services(this now being 5weeks),again told would instigate refund.5weeks and 4days.got refund.Their refund policy states 14 days to refund not 31 days.Then they had the Gaul to email me ,asking why I'd raised a dispute with my credit card provider.5 1/2 weeks to get a refund.Absolutely appalling service.Thankfully I didn't have to pay any interest(thanks credit card provider).how much did Amazon make in interest in not refunding me,and many,many others.Shocking service,will not be using again.",2023-09-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,27.0,899,128,31,3,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered mobile phone£got something else £ itemcouldnt speak one kept cut offreturned wrong item sent waited refundand waited waitedcontacted customer servicesharude told refund would instigatedwaited another weekhad contact credit card raise disputethey credited accountanother week later still refundonce contacted customer servicesthis weeksagain told would instigate refundweeks daysgot refundtheir refund policy state day refund daysthen gaul email asking id raised dispute credit card provider week get refundabsolutely appalling servicethankfully didnt pay interestthanks credit card providerhow much amazon make interest refunding meand manymany othersshocking servicewill using,0.012497191602751128,0.9875028083972489,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.8081092280909408,80.81092280909408,High Trust
Tommy Andersen,/users/533dba8300006400016c6426,DK,20.0,2023-09-27 16:05:07+00:00,1.0,They took my money and closed my account,"I have used Amazon from time to time for delivery of books and other minor stuff, as well as access to their Prime Video.September 8 I all of a sudden got an email from them stating that they ""after a review of your details"" had decided to close my account. They also wrote that I could not reply to the email, and that they might not reply to further email about this.I received no information about this, the full text is the following:""Hello,After a review of your details, we have determined it is necessary to close your Amazon.de account. Any pending orders have been canceled.We may not reply to further emails about this issue.""That made me worried that somehow someone had gained unauthorized access to my account and perhaps even my payment information, but the email contained no information. I could not reach support since you have to be logged in to be able to do that.After much search I found their Twitter support, wrote them, and they showed me a way to find a telephone number by stating that the password did not work on the website. I called, but the person on the other end could not help, but she took my details and my number, passed the information to account handling department and promised me that they would call me back within 24 hours. They never did. I never heard from them again.About a week before they closed my account, they charged me for a month's Amazon Prime. So I have paid for the better part of a month that I cannot use because they have closed my account without giving me a reason. I still do not know why, and my credentials could still be vulnerable without them telling me.I cannot believe that they can legally charge me for a service just to close my account for no apparent reason, and not at the minimum provide a refund.",2023-09-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,27.0,1775,322,40,8,19.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,used amazon time time delivery book minor stuff well access prime videoseptember sudden got email stating review detail decided close account also wrote could reply email might reply email thisi received information full text followinghelloafter review detail determined necessary close amazonde account pending order canceledwe may reply email issuethat made worried somehow someone gained unauthorized access account perhaps even payment information email contained information could reach support since logged able thatafter much search found twitter support wrote showed way find telephone number stating password work website called person end could help took detail number passed information account handling department promised would call back within hour never never heard againabout week closed account charged month amazon prime paid better part month cannot use closed account without giving reason still know credential could still vulnerable without telling mei cannot believe legally charge service close account apparent reason minimum provide refund,0.005852661075600221,0.9941473389243998,0.18059450364554122,0.2,0.8331925701913081,83.31925701913082,High Trust
Arthur Petrillo Aguiar,/users/6006e4cc6d0d00001a6e906d,GB,11.0,2023-09-27 12:14:55+00:00,1.0,Don't trust Amazon Customer Service. I Didn't receive my refund.,"I bought a Dell monitor with an extended warranty, and the USBC wasn't working. I did the troubleshooting and realized it was defective. I then contacted Amazon, who said they would refund me if I sent the item back. I sent the item back on July 25 and emailed them. Since I bought with an Amazon Credit Card at that time, and the Amazon Credit Card ceased to exist in the UK later, I no longer could dispute the charge with my credit card. The refund would only be available as a gift card, which is not ideal, but I accepted since I wanted to spend less time fixing this issue. I got in touch one week later since my refund didn't happen. They then said I should wait one month, which I did. I got in touch one month later, and they asked me to wait longer. It has been two months, and I still need to be refunded.",2023-09-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,27.0,816,160,64,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought dell monitor extended warranty usbc wasnt working troubleshooting realized defective contacted amazon said would refund sent item back sent item back july emailed since bought amazon credit card time amazon credit card ceased exist uk later longer could dispute charge credit card refund would available gift card ideal accepted since wanted spend less time fixing issue got touch one week later since refund didnt happen said wait one month got touch one month later asked wait longer two month still need refunded,0.012495159218462634,0.9875048407815373,0.08973639932697701,0.2,0.811699700256164,81.1699700256164,High Trust
