Sam,/users/58459de40000ff000a5e4b3f,GB,13.0,2023-09-26 14:03:11+00:00,1.0,Amazon & Trespass: Ethical Concerns,"Amazon's marketplace has become increasingly unsafe due to the presence of companies like Trespass. Trespass has repeatedly engaged in deceptive practices, such as deliberately mispricing items to manipulate rankings, followed by order cancellations under false pretenses. This isn't the first time they've employed such tactics, and Amazon needs to take stronger action to protect its customers from such unethical behavior.",2023-09-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,26.0,425,60,35,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon marketplace become increasingly unsafe due presence company like trespass trespass repeatedly engaged deceptive practice deliberately mispricing item manipulate ranking followed order cancellation false pretense isnt first time theyve employed tactic amazon need take stronger action protect customer unethical behavior,0.0420038331025516,0.9579961668974484,0.03365114974761638,0.2,0.7857283133982476,78.57283133982476,High Trust
