T johnson,/users/651237c8548d230012438417,US,1.0,2023-09-26 03:46:27+00:00,1.0,Delivery drivers from one Amazon warehouse...,"Delivery drivers from one Amazon warehouse near me are awful. Luckily only 10%of what I order comes from this warehouse. Was supposed to be delivered between 5-10pm. Saw on the Amazon app that he was four stops away...Then he stopped for about half an hour... Headed half an hour south away from me, when he was previously only 5 minutes away!The map then showed he had ""other stops"" to make before my house... He headed further away to the next state. I called Amazon customer service. They reached out to the delivery people who contacted the driver and he said he would have it at my house in half an hour. I could see on the map that he continued to drive back to his warehouse and ignored whoever contacted him, Amazon and me. Didn't get my delivery. Second time it has happened from this warehouse. The first time it happened he came back in the morning and threw it in my yard in the grass. Nice job Amazon.",2023-09-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,26.0,914,169,45,6,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,delivery driver one amazon warehouse near awful luckily order come warehouse supposed delivered pm saw amazon app four stop awaythen stopped half hour headed half hour south away previously minute awaythe map showed stop make house headed away next state called amazon customer service reached delivery people contacted driver said would house half hour could see map continued drive back warehouse ignored whoever contacted amazon didnt get delivery second time happened warehouse first time happened came back morning threw yard grass nice job amazon,0.037759934496283926,0.9622400655037161,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.800076847109682,80.00768471096819,High Trust
