Lesley Collings,/users/5def9804741d5fa1de3787b7,GB,9.0,2023-09-25 18:10:38+00:00,1.0,Amazon is a mess,"I have been an Amazon customer for a long time, but I am seriously considering turning my back on them, Everything is good and dandy until you have a problem with an order and then the experience goes down hill fast You can’t speak to a real person, and they don’t really have proper live chat either, it’s automated and isn’t fit for purpose, you can’t get any answers If you are buying from an Amazon seller they can take the whole 48 hours to reply or not reply, and if you are buying from Amazon directly it gets worse than thatIt will take forever to get a refund, amazing really as they seem to be able to take your money to pay for items instantly so why they can’t return it in the same time is beyond comprehension For some reason unknown to me Amazon have gone down hill fast, used to be good but not as good now",2023-09-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,25.0,822,160,16,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer long time seriously considering turning back everything good dandy problem order experience go hill fast can’t speak real person don’t really proper live chat either it’s automated isn’t fit purpose can’t get answer buying amazon seller take whole hour reply reply buying amazon directly get worse thatit take forever get refund amazing really seem able take money pay item instantly can’t return time beyond comprehension reason unknown amazon gone hill fast used good good,0.013452792295066024,0.986547207704934,0.08973639932697701,0.2,0.8112208837178624,81.12208837178623,High Trust
Paul,/users/5e3c70a712b06cb98aed72cc,GB,8.0,2023-09-25 16:48:39+00:00,1.0,Photo of delivery is not our house,"Just been sent a photo of our printer being delivered to number 1.  This is not our house. I’ve driven round our estate and it is not at any number1.  Also our neighbours have been sent a photo of their delivery and it’s not their house either. Either lazy driver, can’t read street signs or fancied a couple of parcels to take home so photographed wrong house as proof of delivery then took them.Can’t report it until Wednesday.Tracked parcel down to 1 Birch Grove. Lady refuses to hand parcel over, will only give it to Amazon when they call to collect it, even though I had id.  She says it’s happening too often.",2023-09-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,25.0,616,113,34,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sent photo printer delivered number house i’ve driven round estate number also neighbour sent photo delivery it’s house either either lazy driver can’t read street sign fancied couple parcel take home photographed wrong house proof delivery took themcan’t report wednesdaytracked parcel birch grove lady refuse hand parcel give amazon call collect even though id say it’s happening often,0.025191737486521048,0.974808262513479,0.0633763320246775,0.2,0.800079397661675,80.0079397661675,High Trust
B H,/users/64dcc71c30dbe100123a4cb2,US,1.0,2023-09-25 15:29:07+00:00,1.0,I ordered  an item from Amazon they intentionally delivered it days later than my order date.,"I ordered  an item from Amazon.I was paying a monthly fee as a prime member.When it came to checkout and delivery options, there was a highlighted ""AMAZON DAY"" listed among other dates i could have it delivered by.Rather than picking the AMAZON DAY delivery date (which was a Friday, I chose Thursday simply because I wanted the item as soon as possible. Right? RIGHT!So, because I didn't choose Friday Amazon Day delivery, Someone within Amazon ordering on my account apparantly was upset that I wasn't interested in SAVING THE EARTH. So I was punished and didn't receive my order until TUESDAY the following week!Because of Amazon's decision I immediately CANCELED MY PRIME  ACCT. and stopped using Amazon all together. I truly don't miss any of it and don't have to make them rich with the monthly prime fee auto pay charge.I have found it much easier to just go buy what we need when we need it.Most of the stuff I ordered from Amazon was cheaply manufactured Chinese merchandise that you dont find out about until you open the huge cardboard box or package.Large boxes were not good for us because we burn all paper/cardboard trash so a lot less being burned in our burn pit now.Felt profiled as well depending on what we bought.Good riddance!",2023-01-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,25.0,1248,216,93,16,257.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,ordered item amazoni paying monthly fee prime memberwhen came checkout delivery option highlighted amazon day listed among date could delivered byrather picking amazon day delivery date friday chose thursday simply wanted item soon possible right rightso didnt choose friday amazon day delivery someone within amazon ordering account apparantly upset wasnt interested saving earth punished didnt receive order tuesday following weekbecause amazon decision immediately canceled prime acct stopped using