BOB HOLLYWOOD,/users/61a89b7d34258d001259a505,US,18.0,2023-09-23 02:05:14+00:00,1.0,AMAZON HAS HORRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE,"AMAZON HAS HORRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE. I BOUGHT AN AMAZON GIFT CARD THAT WOULD NOT PERFORM A TRANSACTION ON THE AMAZON WEBSITE. I CALLED  CUSTOMER  SERVICE MANY TIMES & THE CUSTOMER  SERVICE  REPRESENTATIVES TOLD ME TO GIVE THEM A CLAIM NUMBER BUT NONE OF THE SERVICE  REPS. TOLD ME THAT THE CLAIM NUMBER IS ACTUALLY ALL THE WAY ON TOP OF THE AMAZON GIFT CARD & YOU HAVE TO PULL OUT THE WHOLE ENTIRE CARD FROM THE BIG PIECE OF CARDBOARD. THE LADY AT THE PHARMACY WHO SELLS MANY GIFT CARDS DID NOT EVEN KNOW THIS. LUCKILY AN EVEN YOUNGER LADY AT THE GIFT CARD COUNTER IN THE PHARMACY KNEW ENOUGH TO PULL OUT THE ENTIRE CARD. AMAZON CUSTOMER SERVICE DID NOT TELL ME TO PERFORM THE ""PULLOUT PROCEDURE"" OF THE WHOLE ENTIRE CARD. WHAT I ALSO DON'T LIKE ABOUT  AMAZON IS THAT MOST LIKELY YOU HAVE TO GO TO THE ""REDEEM  YOUR GIFT CARD"" SECTION  OF THE WEBSITE JUST TO BUY SOMETHING. THIS ACTION  IS MORE COMPLICATED & MORE TIME CONSUMING. EBAY GIFT CARDS ARE MUCH MORE SIMPLER  TO ACCESS THE ACTIVATION CODE OR REDEMPTION CODE. SOME EBAY GIFT CARDS HAVE A REDEMPTION CODE. I AM ALMOST POSITIVE ON THE EBAY WEBSITE YOU ONLY HAVE TO PUT IN THE GIFT CARD NUMBER IN DURING THE TRANSACTION. AMAZON IS VERY EXPENSIVE & WANTED ONLY $30 LESS FOR A USED VERSION OF AN ELECTRONIC DEVICE THAT IS VERY POPULAR THAT I WANTED TO BUY. EBAY HAD THE SAME ELECTRONIC ITEM FOR $80 LESS THAT WAS AN UNOPENED SEALED NEW VERSION OF THE DEVICE. I AM NOT BUYING THAT MANY ITEMS ON AMAZON ANYMORE. THE LESS YOU DEAL WITH AMAZON THE BETTER OFF YOU ARE. DO YOURSELF A FAVOR, SHOP ELSEWHERE.",2023-09-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,23.0,1555,288,36,5,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon horrible customer service bought amazon gift card would perform transaction amazon website called customer service many time customer service representative told give claim number none service rep told claim number actually way top am