Marc benko,/users/63b1ccac1caa130012d566fa,CA,2.0,2023-09-22 03:06:11+00:00,1.0,Stay away from 3rd party sellers,"I bought something, the item that was sent me did not match the description and so I opened an AZ claim. The customer service rep on the phone told me that I would get a refund and not have to send the item, she said wait for a week and the a-z would investigate the seller. I got an email back after hanging up the phone with her saying that the seller didn’t do anything wrong and I had to ship the item back and pay restocking fees. This was a third-party seller and after talking with Customer Service for two days, then talking with the supervisor, I have to give the seller a 5 star review on both their item and profile. DONT BUY FROM A 3rd PARTY SELLER, they will rip you off and Amazon won’t help you at all!!!",2023-09-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,22.0,719,142,32,6,2.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,bought something item sent match description opened az claim customer service rep phone told would get refund send item said wait week az would investigate seller got email back hanging phone saying seller didn’t anything wrong ship item back pay restocking fee thirdparty seller talking customer service two day talking supervisor give seller star review item profile dont buy rd party seller rip amazon won’t help,0.645325106683781,0.35467489331621904,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.49326565753864793,49.32656575386479,Low Trust
