Lada Poláčková,/users/6295c3ed98141c0011f25fbd,CZ,4.0,2023-09-20 16:50:22+00:00,1.0,Horrible customer service phone line!,"I have had issue twice with two orders in last two weeks. The second issue I am still having is not resolved in the right way. Today I called the customer service at 8:00 and I was busy untill 9:24 to get answer.I called 4 or 5 times to be able to get to customer care in English. The dutch team was not able to help me, they were lying to me, I heard always different stories from all three employees. One told me that she has to verify me before she can put me through English department (she was not able for 10 minutes to pick up my email address after several times being spelled to her - even in dutch and she told me because she cannot pick up my email, she cannot help me). After she finally got my email sheput me through, the line told me that they are too busy and they have to hang up my phone which they did themselves.Second employee she did not suddenly need to verify me before she put me through the English department and she transffered me right away without verification. I was waiting 15 minutes on the line to be picked up by the english team - no success.Thrid call and third employee of the dutch team was telling me that she cannot verify me on the phone and I have to click on link in email to be verified while on the phone - how strange that the first employee could verify me on the phone, the second did not verify me at all and the third needed me to click on link in my email (while calling the data is not working so I had no internet connection to click on the link - I explained her about the process with two other employees but she did not care). She put me through english department again and I had to wait 13 minutes with no success being transffered. I called for the 4th time and after again waiting around 10 minutes I got connected with en english department - finally!!! I got finally normal employee but the resolution was not satisfying at all. I wanted replacement but they could not do that, only refund. I did not agree with this but I had no choice. Then I wanted to raise a complaint and have compensation for this awful customer experience being busy on the phone one and half hour, having employees coming with always different procedures how to verify me. It is disgusting! Teribble service! Of course they told me there is no compensation possible, unbelievable!",2023-09-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,20.0,2318,440,37,5,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,issue twice two order last two week second issue still resolved right way today called customer service busy untill get answeri called time able get customer care english dutch team able help lying heard always different story three employee one told verify put english department able minute pick email address several time spelled even dutch told cannot pick email cannot help finally got email sheput line told busy hang phone themselvessecond employee suddenly need verify put english department transffered right away without verification waiting minute line picked english team successthrid call third employee dutch team telling cannot verify phone click link email verified phone strange first employee could verify phone second verify third needed click link email calling data working internet connection click link explained process two employee care put english department wait minute success transffered called th time waiting around minute got connected en english department finally got finally normal employee resolution satisfying wanted replacement could refund agree choice wanted raise complaint compensation awful customer experience busy phone one half hour employee coming always different procedure verify disgusting teribble service course told compensation possible unbelievable,0.9958071710491304,0.004192828950869587,0.24677509814918677,0.2,0.35145143410527213,35.14514341052721,Low Trust
