Carola Erlandsen,/users/6500e66e44c7ac0012bd1116,US,1.0,2023-09-17 18:42:03+00:00,1.0,Amazon is failing to issue refund on mistake made by them!,"Unfortunately I currently can’t trust Amazon on anything beyond $500. My husband bought a drone for his job and ended up receiving a package containing gifts for a 3-year old. He immediately contacted them and sent that package back to the warehouse; Amazon confirmed receipt and said that given the amount it would take about 30 days for the refund. He called them 4 times asking for the status of the refund and after 45 days he opted to dispute the charge via the credit card. After 30 days of the dispute, Amazon told the bank it didn’t accept it and was reversed by the bank. A second dispute was opened and the bank requested all the evidence from my husband, which he provided (photos, emails from Amazon, order number, etc).He still hasn’t heard back as it is within the 30-day dispute cycle at this point. Mind you, the original order from Amazon was in mid-May 2023 and we’re now in mid-September and no refund!",2023-09-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,17.0,921,165,58,11,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,unfortunately currently can’t trust amazon anything beyond husband bought drone job ended receiving package containing gift year old immediately contacted sent package back warehouse amazon confirmed receipt said given amount would take day refund called time asking status refund day opted dispute charge via credit card day dispute amazon told bank didn’t accept reversed bank second dispute opened bank requested evidence husband provided photo email amazon order number etche still hasn’t heard back within day dispute cycle point mind original order amazon midmay we’re midseptember refund,0.023069874408190326,0.9769301255918097,0.09254066180594504,0.2,0.8069731951570939,80.69731951570938,High Trust
