Jordan,/users/60a3b80491916f001903e00b,GB,4.0,2023-09-18 06:56:13+00:00,1.0,"No refund and no one to contact,","I am beyond stressed and angry, this experience really has put me off amazon. I'm AUDHD and really don't need this. I returned an expensive item on saturday 2nd September. It says i have till 18th September to return,  hence my panic. I haven't received any type of contact. The QR code was scanned by royal mail, you'd like to think there's some sort of recognition so they can tell you have returned. Today I'm trying to contact a human, so I can ask what's happening, but for 20mins so far, it's taken me from page to page and not giving me any type of contact details. You'd think clicking on customer services would be a shoe in, but no, it just takes you through everything you don't want. Then using the search function to ask directly what I want ""contact human"" or ""customer support"" does it provide contact details for customer service???? No, how to contact alexa emergency services!!! Not even close. I cannot figure out this maze to speak to a human, just getting more pissed off. I sent back a projector costing just under £2k, there should be a dedicated contact person. What am I suppose to do. I feel constant anxiety, this was a lot of money to me, this was my birthday gift. It shouldn't be this difficult and stressful.",2023-09-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,18.0,1239,225,32,7,1.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,beyond stressed angry experience really put amazon im audhd really dont need returned expensive item saturday nd september say till th september return hence panic havent received type contact qr code scanned royal mail youd like think there sort recognition tell returned today im trying contact human ask whats happening min far taken page page giving type contact detail youd think clicking customer service would shoe take everything dont want using search function ask directly want contact human customer support provide contact detail customer service contact alexa emergency service even close cannot figure maze speak human getting pissed sent back projector costing £k dedicated contact person suppose feel constant anxiety lot money birthday gift shouldnt difficult stressful,0.6960771877082839,0.30392281229171614,0.1261918115535614,0.2,0.47719976845657036,47.71997684565704,Low Trust
