Andrew Stewart,/users/5b587fdb4de5666d342c4dda,GB,4.0,2023-09-14 21:17:42+00:00,1.0,"Awful experience, gone down hill","Long term customer, years, prime customer, hundreds of purchases every year. This year had nothing but problems/issues, raised a complaint over the phone & the manager literally said to me - ""we can't do anymore, get over it Andrew & hang up"" (I hope they record calls) she clearly didn't like that I requested to talk to a manager. I wanted to forward proof of discussions with Amazon associates to prove the fault was their end, but she refused to listen, refused to escalate the complaint and said it won't go any higher than her! Very, very worrying that Amazon have 'management' talking to customers this way. Surely the managers have managers? I don't know. I'll start shopping with high street shops for everything again though, forget Amazon.",2023-09-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,14.0,750,128,32,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,long term customer year prime customer hundred purchase every year year nothing problemsissues raised complaint phone manager literally said cant anymore get andrew hang hope record call clearly didnt like requested talk manager wanted forward proof discussion amazon associate prove fault end refused listen refused escalate complaint said wont go higher worrying amazon management talking customer way surely manager manager dont know ill start shopping high street shop everything though forget amazon,0.07664304662440852,0.9233569533755914,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.7760363005801121,77.6036300580112,High Trust
Maria K. Faria,/users/5cded5ad00f3b53f80d656c1,US,4.0,2023-09-14 21:03:44+00:00,1.0,Amazon can't deliver and doesn't honor timelines,"Amazon does not support its overnight delivery promises. Amazon could not locate my package, which shows as delivered (and which I don't have). Amazon driver consistently misdelivers to just any address in my neighborhood. Amazon driver did not provide photo of delivery, so it is undocumented. Amazon places burden of proof of its misdelivery on me. Thinking it is time to leave Prime, which is getting sloppy and nonresponsive. There are now more competitive options available than there were 10 years ago when I joined.",2023-09-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,14.0,522,85,48,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon support overnight delivery promise amazon could locate package show delivered dont amazon driver consistently misdelivers address neighborhood amazon driver provide photo delivery undocumented amazon place burden proof misdelivery thinking time leave prime getting sloppy nonresponsive competitive option available year ago joined,0.007862249007214554,0.9921377509927854,0.04767246214245653,0.2,0.8056033679248841,80.56033679248841,High Trust
