McFrizzle,/users/62bf193e96481900130c8158,GB,8.0,2023-09-14 16:58:02+00:00,1.0,Hopeless,"Have had the same address and delivery instructions for over 20 years! In the last year I have contacted Amazon no less than 100 times about the same issue… Drivers either leaving packages on the pavement in plain view or not bothering to turn up at all and saying they attempted delivery. Instructions are always to leave in designated “safe place” so there is never a reason for a failed delivery. Sick of hearing pat customer service responses from people that are not equipped to actually deal with the issue or capable of deviating from pre-scripted procedures. Told every time they “understand” and “this is not the level of service we expect Amazon customers to receive” and “I will definitely ensure this never happens again.”…. A year! Over 100 phone calls, innumerable online chats and still…. The issue of ridiculously bad delivery, missing packages, dishonest drivers and poor customer services continues.",2023-09-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,14.0,917,151,8,1,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,address delivery instruction year last year contacted amazon less time issue… driver either leaving package pavement plain view bothering turn saying attempted delivery instruction always leave designated “safe place” never reason failed delivery sick hearing pat customer service response people equipped actually deal issue capable deviating prescripted procedure told every time “understand” “this level service expect amazon customer receive” “i definitely ensure never happens again”… year phone call innumerable online chat still… issue ridiculously bad delivery missing package dishonest driver poor customer service continues,0.13459506288899697,0.8654049371110031,0.08468872686483454,0.2,0.7496402139284684,74.96402139284683,Medium Trust
