Pauline.,/users/5f870c020695cb001a39fa50,GB,24.0,2023-09-13 15:20:43+00:00,1.0,WARNING if you decide to cancel your subscription,"I decided to not renew my Amazon prime subscription it's too expensive now and the service is appalling.Be warned before you cancel read all the small print. I have four Amazon devices and a fire stick. If I cancel I will lose all my files, photos, the movies I purchased from Amazon, I'm sure that counts as stealing in England! My money paid for the films, my money paid the subscription but everything I have on my devices They Will Erase!!! That's stealing at the very least. Maybe they don't have that law in America maybe the bald dumb ass who owns Amazon does it all the time. Reading the reviews on here I'm not the only customer being ripped off and lied to in a right royal way...forgot they don't have a royal family across the pond just a bunch of lying cheating thieves!Shame on you Amazon!!!!!",2023-09-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,13.0,807,148,49,8,0.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,decided renew amazon prime subscription expensive service appallingbe warned cancel read small print four amazon device fire stick cancel lose file photo movie purchased amazon im sure count stealing england money paid film money paid subscription everything device erase thats stealing least maybe dont law america maybe bald dumb as owns amazon time reading review im customer ripped lied right royal wayforgot dont royal family across pond bunch lying cheating thievesshame amazon,0.9999966306700296,3.369329970359658e-06,0.08300616937745373,0.2,0.3166029185404759,31.66029185404759,Low Trust
