Deborah Schimek,/users/650142c94dca280012182294,US,1.0,2023-09-13 07:04:22+00:00,1.0,DON’T OPEN YOUR AMAZON BOXES IN THE…,"DON’T OPEN YOUR AMAZON BOXES IN THE HOUSELiving in the mountains I order multiple items from Amazon as it is cheaper than driving to Gainesville.  Plus, with Amazon prime I get free delivery, movie channels and music.  Order multiple flavors of Atkins Plus Protein Shakes (30 grams).  All drinks were arrived with the exception of the Strawberry.  Each flavor was in an amazon box, amazon prime tape with brown paper rolled to prevent the inner Atkins box from moving during shipment.  Previously, I was a victim of product tampering so I always check the box for any visual evidence of tampering.  All flavors with the exception of the Strawberry were in an inner Akins box that was glued and contained 3 4 packs of the shake.  The Amazon Prime outer box for the Strawberry was securely taped with no gaps.  It did not have any of the brown paper to prevent movement during shipment.  The inner Atkins box was taped versus side flaps glued.  Immediately noticed a lot of black spots on the Atkins box.  Opened the inner Atkins box and found more tiny black spots. The drinks were not in the 3 4packs but were in the box individually.  Tried to figure out what the heck and as soon as I started removing the shakes cockroaches ran out of the box disappearing in my Kitchen.  The black spots are cockroach poop.  The amount of poop in the box, the fact that the outer box was securely taped and the time from shipment to delivery they were not picked up in transit.  Amazon sent me the Atkins shake knowing it was opened and visually had a lot of cockroach poop on it.  Amazon customer service (CSR) keep repeating the same script in broken English taking a breath at the same time while reading the script.  They would refund the money.  Repeatedly I asked them to send me something to get rid of the cockroaches, pay for an exterminator or I would post on every website I could find that Amazon knowingly ships items with cockroaches and cockroach poop.  The CSR stated I couldn’t do it.  Call was ended with me saying watch me.  I have an AKC Cavalier King Spaniel who has an unplanned pregnancy thanks to my male AKC king Charles.  Spraying to not an option and I don’t want to endanger Princess or her babies.  Several exterminators were called and I was quoted a figure up to $200 to get rid of the cockroaches but declined treatment when I advised them of the pregnancy.  Liability issues as 1 pup could be valued at $4k One finally told me an alternative way to get rid of the cockroaches as they have not had time to lays eggs which I have started.",2023-09-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,13.0,2556,462,36,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,don’t open amazon box houseliving mountain order multiple item amazon cheaper driving gainesville plus amazon prime get free delivery movie channel music order multiple flavor atkins plus protein shake gram drink arrived exception strawberry flavor amazon box amazon prime tape brown paper rolled prevent inner atkins box moving shipment previously victim product tampering always check box visual evidence tampering flavor exception strawberry inner akins box glued contained pack shake amazon prime outer box strawberry securely taped gap brown paper prevent movement shipment inner atkins box taped versus side flap glued immediately noticed lot black spot atkins box opened inner atkins box found tiny black spot drink pack box individually tried figure heck soon started removing shake cockroach ran box disappearing kitchen black spot cockroach poop amount poop box fact outer box securely taped time shipment delivery picked transit amazon sent atkins shake knowing opened visually lot cockroach poop amazon customer service csr keep repeating script broken english taking breath time reading script would refund money repeatedly asked send something get rid cockroach pay exterminator would post every website could find amazon knowingly ship item cockroach cockroach poop csr stated couldn’t call ended saying watch akc cavalier king spaniel unplanned pregnancy thanks male akc king charles spraying option don’t want endanger princess baby several exterminator called quoted figure get rid cockroach declined treatment advised pregnancy liability issue pup could valued k one finally told alternative way get rid cockroach time lay egg started,0.00419998302385761,0.9958000169761424,0.2591138530566461,0.2,0.8497227790994004,84.97227790994005,High Trust
