Lili Doly,/users/6500bd64df8e9800121a6f3b,CA,1.0,2023-09-12 21:35:55+00:00,1.0,I was ordering sunglasses from Amazon…,"I was ordering sunglasses from Amazon but unfortunately it didn’t fit my face. I decided to return the item back with all original package and label to Canada Post. I was wait thing to get my money back in 14 days after they receive an item. 14 days past and I still didn’t get money back. No item no money 😂 funny joke. I start to chat with customers service and they told me wait another 30 days for return. Is it kind a joke nowadays? Why should I have to wait 44 days to get my money back if in your policy it’s 14 days after receiving the item. It was horrible experience for the first time in my life! I was so mad and disappointed with customer service and support. I have no many and I don’t know if I will have them back. I will wait 30 more days and write additional reviews how they gonna solve this problem. It’s ridiculous way how you treat customers this way!!! Shame on you Amazon. From personal experience I recommend everyone go to the store and buy directly!!! Instead of arguing with customers service that DON’T Care at All about you or your situation. All they care to get money from you , but not responsibility.",2023-09-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,12.0,1134,216,38,6,11.0,0,7,1,0,Genuine,ordering sunglass amazon unfortunately didn’t fit face decided return item back original package label canada post wait thing get money back day receive item day past still didn’t get money back item money 😂 funny joke start chat customer service told wait another day return kind joke nowadays wait day get money back policy it’s day receiving item horrible experience first time life mad disappointed customer service support many don’t know back wait day write additional review gonna solve problem it’s ridiculous way treat customer way shame amazon personal experience recommend everyone go store buy directly instead arguing customer service don’t care situation