Byron Jackson,/users/583b47700000ff000a5b829b,US,22.0,2023-09-12 20:51:04+00:00,1.0,liars,"I ordered a baritone ukulele from Amazon on September 3 2023 for my birthday, they said it shipped using UPS but they couldn't give me a tracking number. I have a good friend that drives for UPS and he said all UPS packages have a tracking number but Amazon insists there was no tracking number. I cancelled my order but they have a different idea about that and don't want to cancel it. These folks at Amazon are liars and they will do anything to keep you buying from them. I left eBay because of the same thing now I will have to find another place to buy from. 👹 order number 111_9623886_772452 kmise baritone ukulele. My birthday ukulele won't happen this time. Thank you Amazon.",2023-09-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,12.0,684,126,5,1,9.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered baritone ukulele amazon september birthday said shipped using ups couldnt give tracking number good friend drive ups said ups package tracking number amazon insists tracking number cancelled order different idea dont want cancel folk amazon liar anything keep buying left ebay thing find another place buy 👹 order number kmise baritone ukulele birthday ukulele wont happen time thank amazon,0.050527636124154084,0.9494723638758459,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.7888696648319218,78.88696648319218,High Trust
