Sophia NRW,/users/6284e75b4a9f5900124d6a76,DE,27.0,2023-09-23 07:09:34+00:00,1.0,unbelievably miserable service:,"unbelievably miserable service:I order an item on invoice, everything is perfect, amazon confirms, dhl announces the shipment shortly after.After days I receive an email from Amazon that the payment method was rejected. As I said, after days. I call them and they explain that it does not go on invoice. Then I take my Visa credit card and pay with it. Again, everything is perfect. Again, an e-mail that the payment was rejected by my bank. Again with the Visacard, everything again perfect. Again the e-mail from amason, again that my bank rejects the payment.I call the bank, everything okay, it was not even a request for any payment. I call Amazon again and explain that my bank has received no request for payment at all. „Well, that does not work either“, I hear from the hotline-being, „ you must first buy a gift card with us, and then you can pay with it and then you can switch back to credit card ...“Sorry amason, but something got completely out of hand, it's a children's circus, guys.… days later, I bought the giftcard, credited it to my account and wanted to pay. You know what they say …when paying …“The gift card balance cannot be used for this order.”😂😂😂😂😂😂",2023-09-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,23.0,1179,209,31,3,11.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,unbelievably miserable servicei order item invoice everything perfect amazon confirms dhl announces shipment shortly afterafter day receive email amazon payment method rejected said day call explain go invoice take visa credit card pay everything perfect email payment rejected bank visacard everything perfect email amason bank reject paymenti call bank everything okay even request payment call amazon explain bank received request payment „well work either“ hear hotlinebeing „ must first buy gift card u pay switch back credit card “sorry amason something got completely hand childrens circus guys… day later bought giftcard