Kysha Woods,/users/65008847ab5a98001199d6be,US,1.0,2023-09-12 17:51:37+00:00,1.0,Dissatisfied with Amazon's Recent…,"Dissatisfied with Amazon's Recent Policies and ServiceI have been a loyal Amazon customer for many years, but recent experiences have left me deeply dissatisfied with the company's policies and service. I want to emphasize that my dissatisfaction is not directed at any specific representative but is primarily related to systemic issues stemming from Amazon's new policies.​ Incorrect Items Received: On multiple occasions, I have received the wrong items in my orders. These mistakes not only caused inconvenience but also resulted in wasted time and resources as I had to arrange returns and replacements.​ Items Not Received and Police Report: One incident stands out where a package mysteriously disappeared. I had to file a police report due to the significant value of the missing items. This was an extremely distressing experience and raises concerns about Amazon's delivery and security measures.​ Items Delivered to the Wrong Address: I have also faced situations where items were marked as ""delivered"" but were, in reality, delivered to the wrong address. This forced me to engage in a time-consuming process to track down and retrieve my packages.​ Refund Delays: The most frustrating aspect of my recent interactions with Amazon has been the extensive delays in processing refunds. Waiting for 30 to 60 days for a refund is not just an inconvenience but also feels like a tactic akin to withholding customer funds.​ This pattern of behavior resembles actions taken by financial institutions to retain customers' money rather than providing satisfactory customer service. It is disheartening to witness Amazon, a company I once held in high regard, resorting to such practices.​ As a result of these recurring issues and my growing frustration, I have made the difficult decision to discontinue my patronage of Amazon. While I have enjoyed the convenience and variety of products offered in the past, the recent decline in service quality and the apparent disregard for customer satisfaction have left me with no choice.​ I hope that by sharing my experiences, Amazon will take the necessary steps to address these issues and improve its customer service. It is my belief that companies should prioritize customer satisfaction over all else, as loyal customers are the lifeblood of any business.​ In conclusion, I can no longer place my trust in Amazon as a reliable online shopping platform, and I will be seeking alternatives for my future purchases.",2023-09-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,12.0,2465,391,34,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dissatisfied amazon recent policy servicei loyal amazon customer many year recent experience left deeply dissatisfied company policy service want emphasize dissatisfaction directed specific representative primarily related systemic issue stemming amazon new policies​ incorrect item received multiple occasion received wrong item order mistake caused inconvenience also resulted wasted time resource arrange return replacements​ item received police report one incident stand package mysteriously disappeared file police report due significant value missing item extremely distressing experience raise concern amazon delivery security measures​ item delivered wrong address also faced situation item marked delivered reality delivered wrong address forced engage timeconsuming process track retrieve packages​ refund delay frustrating aspect recent interaction amazon extensive delay processing refund waiting day refund inconvenience also feel like tactic akin withholding customer funds​ pattern behavior resembles action taken financial institution retain customer money rather providing satisfactory customer service disheartening witness amazon company held high regard resorting practices​ result recurring issue growing frustration made difficult decision discontinue patronage amazon enjoyed convenience variety product offered past recent decline service quality apparent disregard customer satisfaction left choice​ hope sharing experience amazon take necessary step address issue improve customer service belief company prioritize customer satisfaction else loyal customer lifeblood business​ conclusion longer place trust amazon reliable online shopping platform seeking alternative future purchase,0.004549681909364301,0.9954503180906357,0.21929332585530006,0.2,0.8415838242163778,84.15838242163778,High Trust
