Harlan W,/users/5d12bb3abe59e8177add1bb0,US,12.0,2023-09-12 14:49:28+00:00,2.0,Amazon's Poor Customer Service,"I had thought that in the beginning Amazon was destined to be a great customer service experience. Nothing could be further from the truth. Late packages, items packaged poorly and unprotected, some wrong items sent and many package delivery drivers that won't follow placement instructions. Add to all of this, there have been many product's pricing that is an utter rip off. 100's % higher and Amazon does NOTHING about it like their policies say that they will. I have had inferior products advertising original brands which I had to return or fight with the manufacturing company after the Amazon 30 days return window closed on me. No one seems either to care much or want to do a better job these days. Sad but true. I know many will dispute me here, but that's been my honest experiences.",2023-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,12.0,795,139,30,4,8.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,thought beginning amazon destined great customer service experience nothing could truth late package item packaged poorly unprotected wrong item sent many package delivery driver wont follow placement instruction add many product pricing utter rip higher amazon nothing like policy say inferior product advertising original brand return fight manufacturing company amazon day return window closed one seems either care much want better job day sad true know many dispute thats honest experience,0.01826537064859857,0.9817346293514014,0.07795849691531127,0.4,1.106459014058763,110.64590140587629,High Trust
