JANE JUNIS,/users/5fc41edd246e5d001af95e29,US,4.0,2023-09-12 10:22:30+00:00,1.0,Once again total Failure,"Once again, Amazon has proven what a HORRENDOUS AND USELESS company it is.  On 9-11-23, at around 4:00 a.m., I ordered 2 bags of dog chews.  As a Prime member, I was told I would receive them the same day, between 7-11:00 a.m.  I get a notice around 11:10 a.m., that things are running late.  I tracked my package and was told it was out for delivery at 12:30 p.m..  Then, I get another notice telling me it won't be delivered until 9-12-23, sometime before 6:00 p.m.  I had recently gone through this same scenario with them, and called Customer Service to see what was going on.  They assured me I would get my package on 9-11-23.  I got ONE package - I had ordered TWO.   I had to call Customer Service again, only to find out Amazon had split my order, and two separate drivers would be delivering it. The tracking on the 2nd package originally indicated that it was out for delivery at 11:05 a.m. Then, I get a notice that it would not be coming until sometime before 6:00 p.m. on 9-12-23.  When I spoke to Customer Service, they they again assured me I would get the 2nd package on 9-11-23 but when I asked for a timeframe, I was told sometime on the 11th,  but no later than 6:00 p.m. on the 12th. What kind of an answer is that!!!!  It is 2:45 a.m. on 9-12-23 and NO PACKAGE!!  It is unbelievable that I have to be this frustrated over dog chews!!!!! I am going to be cancelling my Prime membership today, as I am paying for nothing.",2023-09-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,12.0,1441,272,24,4,1.0,0,11,2,1,Suspicious,amazon proven horrendous useless company around ordered bag dog chew prime member told would receive day get notice around thing running late tracked package told delivery pm get another notice telling wont delivered sometime pm recently gone scenario called customer service see going assured would get package got one package ordered two call customer service find amazon split order two separate driver would delivering tracking nd package originally indicated delivery get notice would coming sometime pm spoke customer service assured would get nd package asked timeframe told sometime th later pm th kind answer package unbelievable frustrated dog chew going cancelling prime membership today paying nothing,0.9999982250888995,1.77491110053829e-06,0.1525518788558609,0.2,0.3305112632267224,33.05112632267224,Low Trust
