Sam,/users/644f26c7192d6f00137b1e02,GB,2.0,2023-09-12 08:25:53+00:00,1.0,Really gone off Amazon,"Really gone off Amazon. It used to sell great quality products at reasonable prices but now it seems they've succumbed to allowing China to a foot in the door and there is just so much tat on the site I lose interest trying to find anything that doesn't resemble a cheap knock off of something. I also signed up for Amazon Prime because of benefits like next day delivery, access to music and videos but I cannot remember the last time something took less than several days to a month to arrive and you can forget listening to decent music or watching anything good that you don't have to sign up to an additional subscription for. HUGE FAIL!! I'm cancelling the membership as there isn't any benefit to having the membership. Also, they're allowing too much tat from China. I dislike all the low quality products flooding Amazon and always skip when the seller or product origin is China.Temu is another Professional tat site to avoid!!",2023-09-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,12.0,937,166,22,4,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,really gone amazon used sell great quality product reasonable price seems theyve succumbed allowing china foot door much tat site lose interest trying find anything doesnt resemble cheap knock something also signed amazon prime benefit like next day delivery access music video cannot remember last time something took less several day month arrive forget listening decent music watching anything good dont sign additional subscription huge fail im cancelling membership isnt benefit membership also theyre allowing much tat china dislike low quality product flooding amazon always skip seller product origin chinatemu another professional tat site avoid,0.8545539995022806,0.14544600049771939,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.3913433031092074,39.13433031092074,Low Trust
