Megan Swanson,/users/6259f93457bf13001245348e,US,3.0,2023-09-11 17:49:15+00:00,1.0,Amazon disgusts me,"Amazon disgusts me, truly. I have shopped with Amazon for so long now and their customer service has gone entirely away. No one is helpful anymore whatsoever, you wait forever to talk with someone, when you finally get someone on the phone you cannot understand them and they cannot understand you. It’s a perfect way for Amazon to disregard their customers; let’s hire people that entirely don’t speak English so that when you do try and call to get help, well, you just can’t and you’ll end up getting so upset trying, you give up. OR, you decide to sue or rant about them on every single possible platform available and call their headquarters to regularly complain. That’s the route I’m taking. Horrific experience this last time that’s two months past and still not resolved. I hope Amazon goes under.",2023-09-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,11.0,806,140,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon disgust truly shopped amazon long customer service gone entirely away one helpful anymore whatsoever wait forever talk someone finally get someone phone cannot understand cannot understand it’s perfect way amazon disregard customer let’s hire people entirely don’t speak english try call get help well can’t you’ll end getting upset trying give decide sue rant every single possible platform available call headquarters regularly complain that’s route i’m taking horrific experience last time that’s two month past still resolved hope amazon go,0.024039905054554684,0.9759600949454453,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.8036839173549436,80.36839173549436,High Trust
