RV,/users/64fa130baa73f90012afd989,US,1.0,2023-09-07 20:15:04+00:00,1.0,Trust/Untrust Amazon,"Woke up a bright summer morning with all happiness which did not last long as soon as I saw the weird message from Amazon - ""Your order is still running late..!""Placed an order on May 19 2023 with an expected date in next few weeks. The order was shipped as per Amazon and amount has been deducted. Weeks and months by passed, with each day me starring at every Amazon van that stops at my community to see the strong racquets that I ordered as since the order status always said ""Out for Delivery"".Finally after 75 Days I contacted Amazon only to know that the I need to cancel the order and request for refund. I argued with the Amazon customer service that I have been waiting for more than 75 days after paying in full and now can not simply cancel the order as since the price of the product as gone up very much. The Amazon customer service agent has then informed me to place a new order again and once it is delivered I could reach the customer service and get the refund for the price difference amount.[ Amazon CS promised that the new price - old price will be the amount I would get refund] for which I agreed. Based on the above discuss I went ahead and cancelled the existing order and also placed a new order which arrived in next few days.All seem to be going well until when I contacted Amazon Customer service again and heard that Amazon does not have any such policy for refund. This news made me go into shock and think  ""how a company such as Amazon either does not know what promise it is making or is Amazon fooling on people by keeping their money for months and simply not delivering the orders"". I asked the customer service rep to send me an email in writing about how first customer service rep told me they would refund while the later one is saying there is no such policy.I am trying to warn fellow customers to be aware of Amazon and always have everything in writings with the  customer service.",2023-08-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,7.0,1928,361,20,2,20.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,woke bright summer morning happiness last long soon saw weird message amazon order still running lateplaced order may expected date next week order shipped per amazon amount deducted week month passed day starring every amazon van stop community see strong racquet ordered since order status always said deliveryfinally day contacted amazon know need cancel order request refund argued amazon customer service waiting day paying full simply cancel order since price product gone much amazon customer service agent informed place new order delivered could reach customer service get refund price difference amount amazon c promised new price old price amount would get refund agreed based discus went ahead cancelled existing order also placed new order arrived next daysall seem going well contacted amazon customer service heard amazon policy refund news made go shock think company amazon either know promise making amazon fooling people keeping money month simply delivering order asked customer service rep send email writing first customer service rep told would refund later one saying policyi trying warn fellow customer aware amazon always everything writing customer service,0.010554090481700563,0.9894459095182995,0.20246775098149186,0.2,0.8352165049554481,83.5216504955448,High Trust
