Tina Nilsson,/users/587635710000ff000a6b22aa,NO,4.0,2023-09-05 12:01:23+00:00,1.0,Account linked to old phone number and got no help,"I tried to reset my password for my amazon account, got the email with OTP (one time password) and then it shows something like: ""for security reasons we sendt an OTP to number: ******34"", -> my old phone number. Then it shows some phone numbers to amazon customerservice, which I called. First USA, and they wanted me to call UK customer service. Called them and they says I need to make a new account because the one I had is old and probably taked down. I told them I can see my account is linked to my old phone number when I try to reset it. Customer lady: ""NO"". And then told me to make a new account. I so said that I hope I will be able to use my email adress, and she just repeated I had to make a new account on amazon. Whej I tried to make a new account it shows I already has an account. AND THERE IS NO OTHER WAY FOR CONTACTING THEM THAN CALLING THE F**KING CUSTOMER SERVICE. How is it possible amazon, one of the worlds largest online shopping website, has so terrible customer service????",2023-09-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,5.0,1003,194,50,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tried reset password amazon account got email otp one time password show something like security reason sendt otp number old phone number show phone number amazon customerservice called first usa wanted call uk customer service called say need make new account one old probably taked told see account linked old phone number try reset customer lady told make new account said hope able use email adress repeated make new account amazon whej tried make new account show already account way contacting calling fking customer service possible amazon one world largest online shopping website terrible customer service,0.006296990211492048,0.993703009788508,0.10880538418395962,0.2,0.8186125817310459,81.86125817310459,High Trust
