Kevin John,/users/5b3f9de84de5666d348a05b9,GB,29.0,2023-09-04 22:06:24+00:00,1.0,Extreme Difficulty Getting a Refund for 3rd Party Suppliers for Items that turn up Broken.,"Sold a Gardenesque Ancient Collection, Frostproof Outdoor Garden Pot with Drainage.  (From a the 3rd Party Gardenesque Store)Amazon have so far failed to provide a refund for this item that turned up cracked. Trying to use the return process on-line Amazon was impossible, it kept taking us in loops. Eventually managed to phone Amazon using customer service ‭0800 279 7234‬, who at first told us to send photo's, and we did but then put us on hold and came back to us by sending us a QR code for Evri to print and return the package. Found an Evri shop and we did this, have a reference and still nothing over a week later. It seems like if you order anything from a 3rd party supplier via Amazon, you can expect a nightmare if you have to return it.",2023-08-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,9.0,4.0,751,139,90,15,11.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,sold gardenesque ancient collection frostproof outdoor garden pot drainage rd party gardenesque storeamazon far failed provide refund item turned cracked trying use return process online amazon impossible kept taking u loop eventually managed phone amazon using customer service ‭ ‬ first told u send photo put u hold came back u sending u qr code evri print return package found evri shop reference still nothing week later seems like order anything rd party supplier via amazon expect nightmare return,0.013943564566683383,0.9860564354333167,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.8086199170997206,80.86199170997206,High Trust
