Jayden hunt,/users/64ef36cba0e14f0011b20bcc,GB,2.0,2023-08-30 17:40:26+00:00,1.0,30-08-2023 13:13,"30-Aug-2023 13:13Hello I did not receive the item as it said its been delivered i have ask my Neighbors if they got it they said they don't I would like a refund please30-Aug-2023 16:34On 25 of August I placed an order on Amazon for Ferrero rocher chocolate bars. The estimated delivery date was yesterday. I tracked the package on the Amazon website and saw that it was delivered to my address on 30 of August However, when I went to check my mailbox, there was no parcel waiting for me.I waited for several days, thinking that maybe the delivery person just forgot to leave the package in my mailbox. But after a week had passed and there was still no sign of the package, I decided to contact Amazon customer service.I called Amazon's customer service number and spoke to a representative. They told me that they could not locate any record of my order or delivery. I provided them with my order number and all the details of my purchase, but they still couldn't find any information about it.The representative suggested that I check with my neighbors to see if they had received the package by mistake. I did so, but none of my neighbors had received anything either.I then asked the representative to investigate further and provide me with more information about what might have happened to my package. They told me that they would look into it and get back to me within 24-48 hours.It has now been over 48 hours since I first contacted Amazon, and I have still not heard back from them. I am very frustrated and disappointed with the lack of communication and resolution to this issue.Therefore, I am requesting a full refund for my order, as well as a resend of the item if it is still available. I would appreciate it if you could look into this matter urgently and provide me with a resolution as soon as possible.Thank you for your time and attention to this matter. Please let me know if there is any further information or documentation that you need from me.Sincerely,Jayden hunt",2023-08-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,30.0,1994,354,16,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,aug hello receive item said delivered ask neighbor got said dont would like refund pleaseaug august placed order amazon ferrero rocher chocolate bar estimated delivery date yesterday tracked package amazon website saw delivered address august however went check mailbox parcel waiting mei waited several day thinking maybe delivery person forgot leave package mailbox week passed still sign package decided contact amazon customer servicei called amazon customer service number spoke representative told could locate record order delivery provided order number detail purchase still couldnt find information itthe representative suggested check neighbor see received package mistake none neighbor received anything eitheri asked representative investigate provide information might happened package told would look get back within hoursit hour since first contacted amazon still heard back frustrated disappointed lack communication resolution issuetherefore requesting full refund order well resend item still available would appreciate could look matter urgently provide resolution soon possiblethank time attention matter please let know information documentation need mesincerelyjayden hunt,0.0031294139654676127,0.9968705860345324,0.19854178351093663,0.2,0.8381436497194535,83.81436497194535,High Trust
