Julie Paine,/users/5ff473bfe17491001abe5d9f,GB,14.0,2023-08-29 18:41:06+00:00,1.0,Amazon Alexa secret Charges Warning,"It seems, when I have asked Alexa to play a track, I was automatically subscribed to Amazon Music- despite me answering NO, when she said this is part of Amazon Music do you wish to subscribe, and, I did not even listen to the track I'd requested. Shocking!When I talked to an operative this evening, it turns out that you have to Turn Off, Voice Purchase, found in Settings on your Alexa App.I pointed out that this should be made clear to people using the Alexa service. At the point when you say NO, you do not want to subscribe, that should be your word, NO! Just because they have your bank details, does not give them any more rights to take your money, to which they are not entitled. This is an unlawful practice, one which would not stand up in court. Assumed Consent???? I'm sorry Amazon, now I distrust you. This is very poor business practice. My trust in Amazon has plummeted.",2023-08-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,29.0,889,164,35,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,seems asked alexa play track automatically subscribed amazon music despite answering said part amazon music wish subscribe even listen track id requested shockingwhen talked operative evening turn turn voice purchase found setting alexa appi pointed made clear people using alexa service point say want subscribe word bank detail give right take money entitled unlawful practice one would stand court assumed consent im sorry amazon distrust poor business practice trust amazon plummeted,0.28097990483686697,0.719020095163133,0.09197980931015143,0.2,0.6779060094435968,67.79060094435968,Medium Trust
