Apple Pantry,/users/64ecf697c235c30012caf0ca,US,4.0,2023-08-28 21:40:32+00:00,1.0,Since people told me that the beauty…,"Since people told me that the beauty products they ordered seemed to be inferior to products bought directly from the manufacturer, I never wanted to order products from Amazon. Why my family member decided to give me an Amazon gift card for my birthday is beyond me. At first, I wasn't going to use it. It turned out, I needed a clothing item. I ordered the clothing with the gift card, and was hoping the articles of clothing would be delivered to the Amazon Mail Box. It never did. I received an email they couldn't deliver the item, and I would receive a refund. This was December of 2022, and now it is August 2023, I never received the refund. I find Amazon to be a very corrupt, unethical company.",2023-08-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,28.0,704,130,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,since people told beauty product ordered seemed inferior product bought directly manufacturer never wanted order product amazon family member decided give amazon gift card birthday beyond first wasnt going use turned needed clothing item ordered clothing gift card hoping article clothing would delivered amazon mail box never received email couldnt deliver item would receive refund december august never received refund find amazon corrupt unethical company,0.012900416506669746,0.9870995834933303,0.07291082445316882,0.2,0.808131956637299,80.8131956637299,High Trust
