Baza,/users/64eb594bc235c30012c9e9f5,GB,5.0,2023-08-27 16:10:30+00:00,1.0,The Poorest Service I Have Ever Had,"I have been asked to be constructive when writing this review about Amazon but I will find that very difficult.I am in my late 70s and have most of my requirement delivered by various companies as I live in a second floor flat and find carrying things upstairs quite difficultand have been using Amazon for many years. Recently I have noticed that most of the deliveries from Amazon come in unmarked white vans or even cars and not in Amazon vans.I am afraid most of the drivers of these vans and cars are rude, disinterested in their job and really don't care. I have recently had one driver who having been extremenly rude to my wife left some very heavy parcels blocking a fire door instead of walking another three yards to leave them by my front door. When confronted by my wife his response was ""if you don't like where I've left them I'll come and take them away - I don't care"". My wife thinls he made a very rude gesture as he drove away but cann't be sure.Today I was expecting another heavy delivery. When it arrive in a plain blue van a young woman who, when she rang the bell to the main door of the flats, told me she would leave the parcels just insi8de the main door. When I told her that was not any good to me. she just got back in her van and drove of with my delivery. Within a couple of minutes I received a pre recorde phone message from Amazon Logistic saying they had been unable to make the delivery.Every day now the main entrance to our flats is littered with Amazon parcel that are just thrown in by the drivers who then just drive off without making any effort to deliver properly.Wake up Amazon and get your house into order. You are no longer providing a service and your drivers are getting away with murder probably because they are the cheapest you can find.",2023-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,27.0,1792,336,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,asked constructive writing review amazon find difficulti late requirement delivered various company live second floor flat find carrying thing upstairs quite difficultand using amazon many year recently noticed delivery amazon come unmarked white van even car amazon vansi afraid driver van car rude disinterested job really dont care recently one driver extremenly rude wife left heavy parcel blocking fire door instead walking another three yard leave front door confronted wife response dont like ive left ill come take away dont care wife thinls made rude gesture drove away cannt suretoday expecting another heavy delivery arrive plain blue van young woman rang bell main door flat told would leave parcel inside main door told good got back van drove delivery within couple minute received pre recorde phone message amazon logistic saying unable make deliveryevery day main entrance flat littered amazon parcel thrown driver drive without making effort deliver properlywake amazon get house order longer providing service driver getting away murder probably cheapest find,0.013427235267841153,0.9865727647321588,0.18844643858665172,0.2,0.8309756700834098,83.09756700834097,High Trust
