Deedra Ankrom,/users/63697ce9e01f360013b1d731,US,9.0,2023-08-26 00:38:38+00:00,1.0,I'm disappointed with Amazon.com for various reasons…,"I'm seriously disappointed with Amazon, a company I used to view as the best.Those days are over. Customer Service has been farmed out overseas. So reps are hard to understand and sometimes don't know how to help customers. Delivery service sucks. You're told when your delivery will arrive, and then you're notified it won't be there AFTER you've wasted an entire day waiting for it. Packages are left out in the rain, with no attempt to shield them to keep them dry. Nor do they knock on the door to give you the package, so it won't get wet. All this, and they've increased our membership fees. What are we getting for paying more--aside from shoddy service? Definitely time for me to carefully consider whether to renew my Prime Membership.",2023-08-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,26.0,744,130,53,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,im seriously disappointed amazon company used view bestthose day customer service farmed overseas rep hard understand sometimes dont know help customer delivery service suck youre told delivery arrive youre notified wont youve wasted entire day waiting package left rain attempt shield keep dry knock door give package wont get wet theyve increased membership fee getting paying moreaside shoddy service definitely time carefully consider whether renew prime membership,0.02750612482587398,0.972493875174126,0.07291082445316882,0.2,0.8008291024776968,80.08291024776968,High Trust
