Piotr,/users/50f9ddb300006400012deac0,GB,11.0,2023-08-25 22:58:12+00:00,1.0,Don't buy electronics!,"I bought an Iphone 14 Pro max worth over 1k on Amazon and it was meant to be delivered within 2 days. On delivery day message appeared on my account stating ""Problem occurred and item won't be delivered"". I spoke to countless Amazon associates via chat and phone and no one could tell me what happened. They told me to wait 14 days for the refund. After 2 weeks money was still not in my account and again after several phone calls they told me to raise an incident report which I did as per instructions and within another week got the money back. I smashed my current phone prior to ordering from Amazon and for nearly 3 weeks I was left with no phone and no money to buy new device. I could not raise complaint and as there is no such department in Amazon as I was told. Company that delivers in one day was unable to send me the replacement item, nor to give me the money back quickly enough. The service I had received was absolutely disgraceful and I won't be using them ever again.",2023-07-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,25.0,988,189,22,3,27.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,bought iphone pro max worth k amazon meant delivered within day delivery day message appeared account stating problem occurred item wont delivered spoke countless amazon associate via chat phone one could tell happened told wait day refund week money still account several phone call told raise incident report per instruction within another week got money back smashed current phone prior ordering amazon nearly week left phone money buy new device could raise complaint department amazon told company delivers one day unable send replacement item give money back quickly enough service received absolutely disgraceful wont using ever,0.014005381285074309,0.9859946187149257,0.10600112170499158,0.2,0.8141975336984612,81.41975336984612,High Trust
