ced specialist still saying insufficient earthnow week hard try account dead might call bank try roll back im going small claim court amazon believed transaction suspicious would take money away processing suspicious transaction case amazon took money blocked accessing possible shipped item suspending account scam done amazon,0.13848941014631388,0.8615105898536861,0.11946158160403814,0.2,0.7546476112476506,75.46476112476506,High Trust
