Maya Kim,/users/64e3e7e856ea1c0012c844b0,CR,1.0,2023-08-22 00:41:16+00:00,1.0,they just buy time until the customer give up,"I placed an order from Amazon.com on 17, July. (I was traveling around Guatemala, and amazon shipped to Guatemala, I picked up the package at DHL office on 25, July. I opened the box in front of some friends (took an unboxing video) but we got to know there was no item in it. I reached Customer service and I was told to file a police report, and I did it.(I went to local police station and Municipal department to get appropriate police report ) I sent them to Amazon CS team the next day. and I was told that I should verify this issue via call, and I did it. the agent who got the call always changed, so I had to explain my issue over and over again. they told me that I would get answer from ""escalation team"" within 1-2 business day, which I didn't. After I sent them several email, I got an email saying that they cannot address my issue. the detailed as below: based on the lack of information we have about the shipment, we won’t be able to provide a replacement or refund for this order at this time. For more information on our shipping policy you can review our Terms and Conditions of Use under Risk of Loss here:  They made me file a police report and make numerous call but in the end, they just sent this message without a detailed explanation. I made several calls and asked for detailed explanation about reject reason, but they never send me back. (though all agents said to me that I should wait for 1-2business day) or they(the escalartion team) just hung up on me. I doubt if amazon really had an any intention of resolving this issue in the first place. I was under the impression amazon just wanted to buy some time waiting until I gave up on this issue. There was no willing to address this issue. or it can be racism because I'm not a US customer.",2023-07-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,22.0,1775,337,45,9,24.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,placed order amazoncom july traveling around guatemala amazon shipped guatemala picked package dhl office july opened box front friend took unboxing video got know item reached customer service told file police report iti went local police station municipal department get appropriate police report sent amazon c team next day told verify issue via call agent got call always changed explain issue told would get answer escalation team within business day didnt sent several email got email saying cannot address issue detailed based lack information shipment won’t able provide replacement refund order time information shipping policy review term condition use risk loss made file police report make numerous call end sent message without detailed explanation made several call asked detailed explanation reject reason never send back though agent said wait business day theythe escalartion team hung doubt amazon really intention resolving issue first place impression amazon wanted buy time waiting gave issue willing address issue racism im u customer,0.002613533922589255,0.9973864660774108,0.18900729108244532,0.2,0.8364946912551944,83.64946912551943,High Trust
Steve K Wise,/users/64e3dfd70324ac0013f18e53,GB,2.0,2023-08-22 00:06:22+00:00,1.0,"Amazon, too big for their boots?","If there was a zero, I would give zero. I bought a TV. I put it in my basket in the morning but didn't buy it until the evening. In this time the price had increased by £50. I contacted an agent to see if they would do anything about the price. After speaking to his manager he came back and said they would refund the £50 but first of all I would need to order the TV and have it delivered. Then I would need to contact them for the refund. I received the TV and contacted Amazon to arrange my refund. They refused! They said that I had been misinformed. I advised that I had a screenshot of the conversation and that I had it in writing that a refund would be given. They still refused. They offered to put a credit on my account for £30 but I refused this. I escalated to a manager who offered me £20 credit on my account. I was given an email address to complain to, which I have sent numourous emails but never had a reply. I have spent thousands with Amazon over the years and find how this has been handled really disgraceful. Poor show Amazon, you should be ashamed.",2023-07-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,22.0,1074,211,32,6,24.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,zero would give zero bought tv put basket morning didnt buy evening time price increased £ contacted agent see would anything price speaking manager came back said would refund £ first would need order tv delivered would need contact refund received tv contacted amazon arrange refund refused said misinformed advised screenshot conversation writing refund would given still refused offered put credit account £ refused escalated manager offered £ credit account given email address complain sent numourous email never reply spent thousand amazon year find handled really disgraceful poor show amazon ashamed,0.040042490503588796,0.9599575094964112,0.11833987661245092,0.2,0.8036467300706958,80.36467300706957,High Trust
