Ketol,/users/64e368c12acd740012be96f8,US,1.0,2023-08-21 15:38:46+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime-less,"I've been an Amazon member/shopper for over 20 years.  The Prime service used to be good - Now its the worst 'service' out there.  Long before Covid, Prime would get your stuff delivered in 1-3 days. Now? A week or MORE. It's insane. Walmart + is a MUCH better option with similar benefits.  Prime is expensive.  And you get Prime video? Whoopeee. There are many places to get good streaming from, free or much cheaper than a prime subscription.  Get a good IPTV service and you'll have everything you need.  Also, Amazon is worth billions -  I think they can probably stop with Prime at this point as it doesn't really offer anything anymore that makes it anywhere worth the price they want to scam us for.I almost never use Amazon anymore - they care very little about customers at all.  I want my packages in a timely fashion, which they are no longer able to do. The service and value and quality has gone way down over the past 5 years or so, so much so it's HIGHLY noticeable. They take in zillions in Prime fees and the service is nearly rock bottom now. There are never any deals on prime for customer loyalty or longevity. No 'grandfathered' in when they raise prices and lower service. Amazon is on the downhill swing and I'm here for it. I'm tired of companies taking such advantage of customers who made them what they are.",2023-08-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,21.0,1335,243,17,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive amazon membershopper year prime service used good worst service long covid prime would get stuff delivered day week insane walmart much better option similar benefit prime expensive get prime video whoopeee many place get good streaming free much cheaper prime subscription get good iptv service youll everything need also amazon worth billion think probably stop prime point doesnt really offer anything anymore make anywhere worth price want scam u fori almost never use amazon anymore c