Puja,/users/64cf81f6a08744001251e54b,IN,3.0,2023-08-21 15:26:29+00:00,1.0,Daylight robbery by Amazon delivery:pick up agent,"I have ordered One Grey color clogs(Rs 858.00) from Kazarmax on amazon for my son and however, due to some fitting issue, I have asked for the return of the same. On 19.08.2023 at 1630 Hours, amazon pick up guy reached my place for return pick up. However, instead of asking clogs he asked for the shoes. My house-help unknowingly handed him my Hoka Shoes women shoes (Purchased from Tata Cliq for 7799.00). That guy even checked the returned product for 5 minutes at my door and even outside the house(Screenshots attached), but he did not inform my househelp for wrong product and took away that costly product with him. When I came to know, I immediately called the Amazon customer service and informed them about the same. I was told by Mr  Mohit, customer service executive that the issue will be resolved, he will personally follow up and I will receive my product back. I called again on 20.08.2023 to your customer service and these guys were not able to inform about the status of my complaint and no resolution was provided. Instead they told me that I will not get my product return back and they don’t have any contact details of the pick up guy. My wife requested them to share the contact details of the delivery guy or their warehouse address but they simply refused to provide any information. This is ridiculous, how can a company like amazon could not keep the track of the delivery/pick up guys, if this guy commits some serious crimes, then also amazon will say that they don’t have any contact details of their delivery/pick up guys. I am seriously shocked by the behaviour/attitude and customer service of Amazon. The copy of e-mail is also marked to the seller of the product M/s Kazarmax as the wrong product(Hoka Women shoes instead of Clogs) should reach back to seller(M/s Karamax) and they should be kind enough to return back my product. If that 