Paris,/users/6070a34637c70e001959336c,GB,3.0,2023-08-18 23:07:12+00:00,1.0,Amazon’s error - refund for returns postage refused,"I purchased a pair of AirPods on Prime Day for £149, but upon completing the order, I was charged £163.90. I reached out to Amazon to inquire about the price change and why I was charged more. They apologised, acknowledging their mistake, and advised me to return the items since they couldn't cancel the order. They recommended tracked returns, which cost me around £8. I contacted customer service three times to request a refund for the return postage. Although they refunded the item cost, they haven't addressed the return postage refund, despite it being their error. They explained that they couldn't refund it due to my selection of 'no longer needed' instead of 'default'. Despite their mistake, they've refused to refund the return postage and even disconnected our conversation abruptly. The customer service experience has been extremely disappointing.",2023-07-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,18.0,864,138,51,8,38.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,purchased pair airpods prime day £ upon completing order charged £ reached amazon inquire price change charged apologised acknowledging mistake advised return item since couldnt cancel order recommended tracked return cost around £ contacted customer service three time request refund return postage although refunded item cost havent addressed return postage refund despite error explained couldnt refund due selection longer needed instead default despite mistake theyve refused refund return postage even disconnected conversation abruptly customer service experience extremely disappointing,0.005631377742447054,0.994368622257553,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.81266384001268,81.266384001268,High Trust
