Aaron Frasher,/users/64de781894e2ab00124624b7,GB,1.0,2023-08-17 21:42:26+00:00,1.0,I received an email that Amazon had…,"I received an email that Amazon had recalled the under cabinet lights I had already paid to have installed because of a risk of being a fire hazard. I contacted customer service to ask what could be done about the item. Customer service offered me a 5 gpb credit for Amazon and a refund upon returning the item. I said no and that it wasn't an acceptable answer and that the lights were already very installed into my cabinets (holes had been drilled for the wires) She finally got to the point where she stated we will give you a full refund and you can keep the item, then asked if I would be satisfied. I again said ""no"" because all they have done is allowed me to throw the item away instead of taking it to the post office. I asked to speak with her manager and after a long winded attempt, I finally spoke with a manager named ""Oliver."" He was less then helpful and stated that they could give me nothing further. When disagreeing with his answer, he asked if there was anything else they could do to assist and then basically left the chat and failed to resolve the issue. Can't believe he was a ""manager"" of anything. Really disappointed with Amazon and think they really dropped the ball for an item they sold. Do better Amazon.",2023-08-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,17.0,1237,231,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,received email amazon recalled cabinet light already paid installed risk fire hazard contacted customer service ask could done item customer service offered gpb credit amazon refund upon returning item said wasnt acceptable answer light already installed cabinet hole drilled wire finally got point stated give full refund keep item asked would satisfied said done allowed throw item away instead taking post office asked speak manager long winded attempt finally spoke manager named oliver less helpful stated could give nothing disagreeing answer asked anything else could assist basically left chat failed resolve issue cant believe manager anything really disappointed amazon think really dropped ball item sold better amazon,0.021923055257345593,0.9780769447426544,0.12955692652832304,0.2,0.8149498576769918,81.49498576769918,High Trust
julie,/users/5ae8e1844de5666d340e5326,US,13.0,2023-08-17 21:17:48+00:00,5.0,I knew it!!!,"I knew it!!!! Everyone has completely lost their minds!!! Amazon Prime ROCKS!!! Mother Earth!!! Amazon has brought all of us a little piece of heaven to us earthlings. Amazon has given me a higher quality of life, and if there's ever a problem or issue with an order or return, basically anything that comes up, the customer service agents are always there to help resolve those problems. I love Amazon for the gift of better living, and unlimited supply of products brought to my doorstep. They do this all day/everyday!! They are very generous with their return policies and more. I had never seen such negative reviews before. I will say this to all of the anti-Amazon customer service feed backers, you wouldn't realize their sweet, helpful acts of customer service kindness, if it was wrapped in hundred dollar bills. Put a little love and appreciation for Amazon in your heart, and be a lover not an ass with them and hopefully you'll come to the light that shines so bright in my life because of Amazon Prime and every soul that works hard everyday to make our lives better and easier. I love you Amazon for bringing this experience to me in this world. Hugs!!!!",2023-08-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,17.0,1169,206,12,3,0.0,0,19,2,1,Suspicious,knew everyone completely lost mind amazon prime rock mother earth amazon brought u little piece heaven u earthling amazon given higher quality life there ever problem issue order return basically anything come customer service agent always help resolve problem love amazon gift better living unlimited supply product brought doorstep dayeveryday generous return policy never seen negative review say antiamazon customer service feed backer wouldnt realize sweet helpful act customer service kindness wrapped hundred dollar bill put little love appreciation amazon heart lover as hopefully youll come light shine bright life amazon prime every soul work hard everyday make life better easier love amazon bringing experience world hug,0.99999999999336,6.640021865678136e-12,0.1155356141334829,1.0,1.5231071228300166,152.31071228300166,High Trust
