Jay Cee,/users/62e540055c89010013652edd,US,2.0,2023-08-16 15:47:11+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime Is No Longer Prime!,"I've been an Amazon customer for years. I started out selling books on their site in the 1990's. I became a Prime member later and enjoyed the 1-2 day free shipping and returns. My more recent orders now take weeks to arrive. Quality of products have gone way down and they don't care. I can shop the dollar stores for junk.  Returns are a horrific experience. While I used to get immediate refunds when returning through UPS to an Amazon gift card, I was told by customer service that I will have to wait 2-3 weeks for a refund. So, why exactly am I paying for Amazon Prime? It's worthless and I'm cancelling. It seems like Mr Jessy had ditched the old Amazon model and now it's about profits over customer service. Time to move on.",2023-08-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,16.0,733,136,32,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive amazon customer year started selling book site became prime member later enjoyed day free shipping return recent order take week arrive quality product gone way dont care shop dollar store junk return horrific experience used get immediate refund returning ups amazon gift card told customer service wait week refund exactly paying amazon prime worthless im cancelling seems like mr jessy ditched old amazon model profit customer service time move,0.005817556920818583,0.9941824430791815,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.8123464094251768,81.23464094251767,High Trust
