Trevor Lawrance,/users/59eb3e470000ff000ad7ca86,GB,14.0,2023-08-16 11:56:17+00:00,1.0,Amazon's rubbish customer service,"I have been using Amazon.com and Amazon.co.uk for some years to buy books with no problem, but like all big companies when something does go wrong they have no customer service and are hard to contact. I ordered one book in March this year which never arrived and have lost over €40 as Amazon refuse to reinburse me as they said it was a supplier using their site and not direct from them even though my bank statement says the money went to Amazon. The book store --- calls himself glenthebookstore had stolen my money and not supplied the book. I recently ordered another book from Amazon who said it had been delivered on 8th August, which was a lie by them. I will not be using Amazon again as I have lost over €50 on that book also.",2023-08-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,16.0,737,139,33,4,8.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,using amazoncom amazoncouk year buy book problem like big company something go wrong customer service hard contact ordered one book march year never arrived lost € amazon refuse reinburse said supplier using site direct even though bank statement say money went amazon book store call glenthebookstore stolen money supplied book recently ordered another book amazon said delivered th august lie using amazon lost € book also,0.007404338160122403,0.9925956618398776,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.811889530303001,81.1889530303001,High Trust
Tama Gildes,/users/64dc68f7a228250012520037,US,1.0,2023-08-16 08:13:23+00:00,1.0,Amazon-Professional Scam Artists,"Don't shop with these people. It's a scam, and they readily price gauge on every item they can get away with. But we love them for the fast shipping so we turn our eyes away from the fact that they scam all day everyday. Fast shipping-Scamming even faster. They are not the same Amazon they once were, and will lie to you and take their time refunding your items if at all. The management has gone downhill and they no longer care about their dedicated customers, or customers at all. Do not trust these people they will take your money fast and send you a defective item and make you wait until whenever to receive a refund. I'm sorry I ever shopped here and am happy to take their app out of my phone for good.",2023-08-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,16.0,712,136,32,3,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dont shop people scam readily price gauge every item get away love fast shipping turn eye away fact scam day everyday fast shippingscamming even faster amazon lie take time refunding item management gone downhill longer care dedicated customer customer trust people take money fast send defective item make wait whenever receive refund im sorry ever shopped happy take app phone good,0.028795843156300113,0.9712041568436999,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.800857266307436,80.08572663074361,High Trust
