Aleksandra Nezhmedinova,/users/64dbe16ab14faa00123ce8d4,UA,1.0,2023-08-15 22:45:10+00:00,1.0,I ordered LP from Amazon,"I ordered LP from Amazon. As I’m living in Ukraine I used the forwarding company to deliver my parcel to Ukraine. When I received my parcel it was sealed by Amazon. I opened it and found out that they sent me a wrong LP, not even the band I ordered. After that I spent much time and a lot of nerve cells trying to solve this problem but at first they changed managers 20 times until they found that one who can help. He promised to make a replacement. Several days ago I contacted them once more and they said that they will help me to make a replacement. In a week when I still didn’t have any information about what’s going on they told me that it’s not their fault and the delivery company should solve this problem. They didn’t give me any answers about how they imagine that delivery company is guilty? And why should I pay for their mistakes? So - much time, no results. I paid money for LP, I didn’t get it, Amazon doesn’t want to do anything to solve the problem. Amazon has the worst customer service I have ever met! It was my last purchase from them and I don’t recommend this shop to anyone!",2023-08-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,15.0,1103,212,24,5,4.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,ordered lp amazon i’m living ukraine used forwarding company deliver parcel ukraine received parcel sealed amazon opened found sent wrong lp even band ordered spent much time lot nerve cell trying solve problem first changed manager time found one help promised make replacement several day ago contacted said help make replacement week still didn’t information what’s going told it’s fault delivery company solve problem didn’t give answer imagine delivery company guilty pay mistake much time result paid money lp didn’t get amazon doesn’t want anything solve problem amazon worst customer service ever met last purchase don’t recommend shop anyone,0.14925561571638277,0.8507443842836172,0.11890072910824454,0.2,0.7491523379634575,74.91523379634575,Medium Trust
ML,/users/5da62a8d3a42566bae3f1fce,GB,18.0,2023-08-15 22:11:14+00:00,1.0,Absolutely Terrible!!!!,"Absolutely Terrible!!!!!  Seems Amazon staff no longer have to be polite as Amazon don’t care anymore about their customers and clearly think they are too big to treat people with dignity and respect! I ordered some suitcases for my sons holiday. Said they were ‘delivered’ left on porch….clearly they were not! Or due to it being an insecure area, they were stolen! Called called customer services who said they would NOT give me a refund until I reported the “crime” to the police!!!! What the hell!!!! What crime!!! Who even knows if the delivery company delivered when they said they did! I have had to call on numerous times. Every advisor I spoke to was RUDE!!! I then had to take time out of my day and waste police time to report that a delivery company did not deliver my parcel properly!! This is an absolute JOKE! Like the police don’t have more important things to deal with that a delivery company not doing their job! Amazon should be ashamed of themselves, and the police need to put a stop to this kind of nonsense, unless Amazon are going to donate some of their billion dollar revenue to the UK police force 🤬. I will be taking my business elsewhere they clearly don’t care as long as they get your money!",2023-08-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,15.0,1223,221,23,2,4.0,0,28,1,0,Genuine,absolutely terrible seems amazon staff longer polite amazon don’t care anymore customer clearly think big treat people dignity respect ordered suitcase son holiday said ‘delivered’ left porch…clearly due insecure area stolen called called customer service said would give refund reported “crime” police hell crime even know delivery company delivered said call numerous time every advisor spoke rude take time day waste police time report delivery company deliver parcel properly absolute joke like police don’t important thing deal delivery company job amazon ashamed police need put stop kind nonsense unless amazon going donate billion dollar revenue uk police force 🤬 taking business elsewhere clearly don’t care long get money,1.0,0.0,0.12394840157038699,0.2,0.3247896803140774,32.47896803140774,Low Trust
