Jim,/users/5533a2ce0000ff0001b954fe,GB,9.0,2023-08-15 12:28:19+00:00,1.0,Poor knock off and cheap products have…,Poor knock off and cheap products have been flooded into amazon over the last few years so you really have to mind what you buy. I dislike the direction the business is headed. Reviews for many products are sometimes generated by sellers giving away their products for free or by sellers sending out to customers who never ordered. Shocking service recently. Subscribe and save product got duplicated and charged twice. I was told I really need to tell them within 30 days after the last time the item didn't arrive. I set up automatic delivery so I don't have to worry about it. Took me 1 hour on chat to get that sorted. No longer an amazon customer.,2023-08-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,15.0,652,118,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,poor knock cheap product flooded amazon last year really mind buy dislike direction business headed review many product sometimes generated seller giving away product free seller sending customer never ordered shocking service recently subscribe save product got duplicated charged twice told really need tell within day last time item didnt arrive set automatic delivery dont worry took hour chat get sorted longer amazon customer,0.009823443817515425,0.9901765561824846,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.8083243969919713,80.83243969919714,High Trust
Hrvoje,/users/5df151ed520b42ee30ffb93e,HR,5.0,2023-08-15 08:40:27+00:00,1.0,"Amazon took my money,never received mobile phone","Ordered phone and charger for approx. 750eur but only charger was in the box I received and Amazon did not help me, washing their hands.I lost my money on Amazon Italy!! Very rude customer service,bad customer service,repetitive emails,only writing on Italian, do not read what you are telling them, do not want to introduce case to higher authority,do not understand English well,you cannot contact them via phone nor chat if you are not Italian,totally disappointed with Amazon Italy.I am buying a lot on Amazon with really good track record and 0 returning (mainly Germany and UK and no problem with them at all,with fully positive experience) but after this I will think twice for buying on Amazon,especially Italy.Since 2nd June I am trying to solve this,lot of time wasted and I am giving up and giving Amazon my money because they deserved it and obviously need it more then their customers...Recap:- On June 2nd received package from UPS, opened and only charger was in the box,no phone- Immediately contacted Amazon asking for help. I tried to solve case directly with Amazon but since very beginning they started repeating same message in different variants again and again to go to Police and report case...I didn't see any reason for that because it wasn't my fault but ok eventually I decided to go to police and waited for hours there ofc.- So I went to Police and provided Report to Amazon in official Croatian Police Report that can be only on Croatian because Croatian is only official language in Public institutions. I provided it to Amazon but Amazon ignored me and said it is not on English or Italian and their desired form, ignoring me further and said that they will not help me any more.- I reported also this missing phone to UPS and they finally UPS confirmed after investigation that there was not phone in the package and they said they will contact Amazon and pay insurance amount directly to Amazon (since Amazon hired them for transport and they can not refund me,they said they will to Amazon and Amazon should refund me...but no!). But guess what, no!! I contacted Amazon with this information with hope that this will be finally solved and that I will be refunded but Amazon told again about this police report not on Italian or English and totally ignored my refering to UPS solved case and they agqin finished correspondence with...you are guessing... will not assist any more because Police report was not in Amazon requested form and language and will not refund me!!So Amazon will at the end earn money on this lost package from UPS insurance! And for me nothing!Be aware!My only option is now to give up or to introduce this to lawyer and start fighting with big ones... overall bad taste and never expected this from Amazon.",2023-06-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,15.0,2766,476,48,7,74.0,0,10,1,0,Genuine,ordered phone charger approx eur charger box received amazon help washing handsi lost money amazon italy rude customer servicebad customer servicerepetitive emailsonly writing italian read telling want introduce case higher authoritydo understand english wellyou cannot contact via phone chat italiantotally disappointed amazon italyi buying lot amazon really good track record returning mainly germany uk problem allwith fully positive experience think twice buying amazonespecially italysince nd june trying solve thislot time wasted giving giving amazon money deserved obviously need customersrecap june nd received package ups opened charger boxno phone immediately contacted amazon asking help tried solve case directly amazon since beginning started repeating message different variant go police report casei didnt see reason wasnt fault ok eventually decided go police waited hour ofc went police provided report amazon official croatian police report croatian croatian official language public institution provided amazon amazon ignored said english italian desired form ignoring said help reported also missing phone ups finally ups confirmed investigation phone package said contact amazon pay insurance amount directly amazon since amazon hired transport refund methey said amazon amazon refund mebut guess contacted amazon information hope finally solved refunded amazon told police report italian english totally ignored refering ups solved case agqin finished correspondence withyou guessing assist police report amazon requested form language refund meso amazon end earn money lost package ups insurance nothingbe awaremy option give introduce lawyer start fighting big one overall bad taste never expected amazon,0.9999380754409143,6.192455908571315e-05,0.2669657879977566,0.2,0.35342411987909417,35.342411987909415,Low Trust
