Nova Moore,/users/64d94cb2358c59001226a6c2,US,1.0,2023-08-13 23:36:24+00:00,1.0,Terrible. Just TERRIBLE!,"First of all being that I don't have a credit card I opened an account using a visa gift card. Well the gift card worked for one of the seven items in my cart. I tried buying clothes and a bunk bed for my daughters. The others were denied. Fine I went to Walgreens to load my digital Amazon gift card. No problem. The money was loaded I reordered my items for them to get cancelled again. This time Amazon put a hold on my account. I could not login or anything. I contacted customer service to which I was told there was questionable activity. There customer service reps don't have no clue what e was going on. There is another department that has no phones. I spoken with several reps and managers that kept taking my information and sending it to the other department. I was told that there was a problem with the load at Walgreens. I went to Walgreens knowing that the problem was on Amazon part. As I knew, Walgreens said the money was loaded. There was nothing they can do. I went back to Amazon with this they asked me to send pictures of the receipt and I even added the screenshot of the virtual wallet to ensure it was no miscommunication. Six months down the line I have no product but the one, I have lost almost $400 and then they also deleted my account so I no longer have access to my portal. I absolutely hate I even tried. My daughters had to sleep in sleeping bags on the floor of my new apartment for a month until I could recount the mistake we made, buying from Amazon.",2022-08-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,13.0,1492,285,24,3,355.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,first dont credit card opened account using visa gift card well gift card worked one seven item cart tried buying clothes bunk bed daughter others denied fine went walgreens load digital amazon gift card problem money loaded reordered item get cancelled time amazon put hold account could login anything contacted customer service told questionable activity customer service rep dont clue e going another department phone spoken several rep manager kept taking information sending department told problem load walgreens went walgreens knowing problem amazon part knew walgreens said money loaded nothing went back amazon asked send picture receipt even added screenshot virtual wallet ensure miscommunication six month line product one lost almost also deleted account longer access portal absolutely hate even tried daughter sleep sleeping bag floor new apartment month could recount mistake made buying amazon,0.00014116857468411906,0.9998588314253158,0.15984296130117778,0.2,0.8318980079728935,83.18980079728935,High Trust
