Michael Leister,/users/5fe570559cfabb001b5295a8,US,2.0,2023-08-11 17:28:57+00:00,1.0,What has happened to Amazon Prime?,"What has happened to Amazon Prime? This colossus company has gotten so huge it's done what most huge companies all do eventually. FORGOTTEN WHO PAYS THE BILLS! In the past 6 to 8 months Amazon Prime has completely collapsed. Before that it was a great thing. Now, it's wrong items shipped, items never show up, and poor custoer service that tells you how much they care and want to help, but in the end give you a huge run around. The final straw for me was I ordered new tires.  Received totally wrong size. Was hassled to no end by CS to get return labels. Now they have had the tires back for nearly a week and have only managed to refund my money ON ONE. Have spoken to customer service and they say it takes 2 weeks to process returns. Really? Never took that long before. Tracking shows all 4 tires were received at the same time, but only one refunded. They can't explain why that is. CS claims they are too busy processing refunds. I wonder if they would be so busy if they did it correctly the first time. They're holding up over $500 that I need to buy tires elsewhere, and couldn't care less. I'm done with Amazon PERIOD! Just another compny getting too big and too fast and screwing the customers. I'm canceling Prime as soon as the current subscription expires.  I'll go back to supporting my local merchants. At least then I know what I'm getting and will see it BEFORE I pay for it",2023-08-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,11.0,1396,261,34,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,happened amazon prime colossus company gotten huge done huge company eventually forgotten pay bill past month amazon prime completely collapsed great thing wrong item shipped item never show poor custoer service tell much care want help end give huge run around final straw ordered new tire received totally wrong size hassled end c get return label tire back nearly week managed refund money one spoken customer service say take week process return really never took long tracking show tire received time one refunded cant explain c claim busy processing refund wonder would busy correctly first time theyre holding need buy tire elsewhere couldnt care less im done amazon period another compny getting big fast screwing customer im canceling prime soon current subscription expires ill go back supporting local merchant least know im getting see pay,0.24547424963820483,0.7545257503617951,0.14638250140213124,0.2,0.7065393754613238,70.65393754613238,Medium Trust
