Norman Maclean,/users/5a6c66df0000ff000b076ff6,GB,8.0,2023-08-10 10:43:00+00:00,1.0,Awful customer service,"Awful customer service. Purchased a Helly Hansen fleece which had been discounted. I also used £15 credit on my account to purchase it. When I checked the delivery status a few days later, it said 16 Feb 2024 (OVER 6 MONTHS) - even although I could purchase again online with Amazon with a 2 week delivery date. Phoned customer service, very difficult to understand, could not explain the reason. I had no alternative but to cancel the order, not happy. I was then told my £15 was non refundable, company policy. I asked for my Prime membership to be cancelled which she did and asked to speak to her supervisor. The supervisor didn't appear interested in my complaint but did agree to credit my amazon account with the £15. Customer service on this occasion very poor. They also make it difficult to contact them and resolve issues or complain. When you phone them they also suggest going online and book a call back, there is nowhere online you can book a call back. Poor, poor poor. I prefer Ebay anyway.",2023-08-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,10.0,1007,180,22,3,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,awful customer service purchased helly hansen fleece discounted also used £ credit account purchase checked delivery status day later said feb month even although could purchase online amazon week delivery date phoned customer service difficult understand could explain reason alternative cancel order happy told £ non refundable company policy asked prime membership cancelled asked speak supervisor supervisor didnt appear interested complaint agree credit amazon account £ customer service occasion poor also make difficult contact resolve issue complain phone also suggest going online book call back nowhere online book call back poor poor poor prefer ebay anyway,0.006233319327793013,0.993766680672207,0.10095344924284913,0.2,0.8170740301846734,81.70740301846735,High Trust
