Sharon Ogbueze,/users/600881ea43e54000190bf09e,US,10.0,2023-08-10 08:56:08+00:00,1.0,Don't buy Amazon Renewed Products,"I purchased a renewed Dell Latitude 5490, a 14-inch Full HD business laptop featuring an Intel 8th Gen i5-8350U Quad Core processor, 16GB DDR4 RAM, 256GB SSD, and Windows 10 Pro. My experience with it was devastating, the laptop turned out to be of poor quality and a total ripoff. I advise against making a computer purchase from the Amazon Renewed Store based on my negative encounter. I purchased the laptop on March 13, 2023, and unfortunately, my option to return the product lapsed on June 13, 2023, and to make matters worse, the laptop stopped functioning entirely on June 30, 2023. The Laptop only lasted a few weeks after 90 days.",2023-06-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,10.0,640,112,33,5,58.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,purchased renewed dell latitude inch full hd business laptop featuring intel th gen iu quad core processor gb ddr ram gb ssd window pro experience devastating laptop turned poor quality total ripoff advise making computer purchase amazon renewed store based negative encounter purchased laptop march unfortunately option return product lapsed june make matter worse laptop stopped functioning entirely june laptop lasted week day,0.021437375434356358,0.9785626245656437,0.0628154795288839,0.2,0.8018444081885986,80.18444081885985,High Trust
