MLS,/users/649ffe11f7459f0011e4d3ef,IE,2.0,2023-08-09 19:54:04+00:00,1.0,I cannot emphasise enough how deeply…,"I cannot emphasise enough how deeply disappointed and frustrated I am with Amazon Ireland. For small purchases? They might be adequate. But for anything above 100EUR? Forget it.Firstly, they couldn't even get a simple invoice right, despite multiple confirmations and assurances. And when they make a mistake? They leave you to deal with the aftermath. No refund was issued, their drivers obstinately refused to take back the item, and now I'm left with the headache of sending it back myself.Moreover, the lack of an import fee or a detailed invoice breakdown isn't just an oversight, it's potentially illegal. It's clear that they're cutting corners at the expense of their customers.And the customer service? A complete travesty. I'm not sure what kind of training, if any, their team and management receive, but it's clearly inadequate. Rude, unhelpful, and utterly incompetent would be an understatement.Given this experience, I'm not only cancelling all my Amazon services, including my Prime membership, but I'm also urging everyone across the UK and Ireland to seriously reconsider using Amazon. There are plenty of other providers who value their customers and offer transparent, reliable services.For your own peace of mind, steer clear.Order Number: 202-5433225-0173931.",2023-08-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,9.0,1281,196,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,cannot emphasise enough deeply disappointed frustrated amazon ireland small purchase might adequate anything eur forget itfirstly couldnt even get simple invoice right despite multiple confirmation assurance make mistake leave deal aftermath refund issued driver obstinately refused take back item im left headache sending back myselfmoreover lack import fee detailed invoice breakdown isnt oversight potentially illegal clear theyre cutting corner expense customersand customer service complete travesty im sure kind training team management receive clearly inadequate rude unhelpful utterly incompetent would understatementgiven experience im cancelling amazon service including prime membership im also urging everyone across uk ireland seriously reconsider using amazon plenty provider value customer offer transparent reliable servicesfor peace mind steer clearorder number,0.009341759545719587,0.9906582404542804,0.10992708917554683,0.2,0.8173145380622495,81.73145380622495,High Trust
