Iryna,/users/64cff2c0aa15ce0012495dd5,UA,1.0,2023-08-06 21:21:51+00:00,1.0,The Shocking Experience,"In recent times, there have been numerous instances of account closures by e-commerce giant Amazon without any explanation or proper communication to the affected customers. These abrupt closures have left customers frustrated, confused, and feeling violated. A negative trend of unexplained account closures is observed, highlighting the negative impact on customers and questioning the ethical practices of a company that prides itself on customer-centricity. Many customers, like myself, have fallen victim to Amazon's sudden account closures. Without warning or prior notice, access to accounts that have been faithfully used for years is abruptly terminated. When attempting to log in, a message appears stating that the account has been closed, with an email notification supposedly sent. However, in numerous cases, customers claim to have never received any such email or any details on how to resolve the situation.Adding to the frustration, attempts to seek clarification from Amazon's customer support often go unanswered. It is only when customers create new accounts and reach out to support that they receive a response, albeit in a rude form. The response typically states that the account was closed for violating the terms of the Conditions of Use agreement. However, customers vehemently deny any wrongdoing and are left perplexed by the lack of specific reasons for their account closures.Account closures without proper explanation or justification raise severe concerns about customer rights. As loyal patrons who have spent years and significant amounts of money on the platform, customers have the right to transparency and fair treatment. The sudden termination of access to accounts, which may contain valuable digital assets such as e-books and audio files, feels like a betrayal of trust. The alarming trend of unexplained account closures by Amazon raises serious questions about the company's commitment to customer satisfaction and respect for customer rights.",2023-05-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,6.0,1990,298,23,3,78.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,recent time numerous instance account closure ecommerce giant amazon without explanation proper communication affected customer abrupt closure left customer frustrated confused feeling violated negative trend unexplained account closure observed highlighting negative impact customer questioning ethical practice company pride customercentricity many customer like fallen victim amazon sudden account closure without warning prior notice access account faithfully used year abruptly terminated attempting log message appears stating account closed email notification supposedly sent however numerous case customer claim never received email detail resolve situationadding frustration attempt seek clarification amazon customer support often go unanswered customer create new account reach support receive response albeit rude form response typically state account closed violating term condition use agreement however customer vehemently deny wrongdoing left perplexed lack specific reason account closuresaccount closure without proper explanation justification raise severe concern customer right loyal patron spent year significant amount money platform customer right transparency fair treatment sudden termination access account may contain valuable digital asset ebooks audio file feel like betrayal trust alarming trend unexplained account closure amazon raise serious question company commitment customer satisfaction respect customer right,0.003426604786305334,0.9965733952136947,0.16713404374649468,0.2,0.8317135063561463,83.17135063561463,High Trust
Arvin,/users/5dd3c5abeafba9d48dd8cac2,SR,2.0,2023-08-06 20:36:37+00:00,2.0,Prices getting marked up and then giving discount,"Items usually are good but prices get marked up alot. During the last Prime day they had a Lavazza LB400 machine with 40% off for $139.99Today I see the exact same item with just 20% off for the same $139.99 and on top of that an extra 20% coupon, bringing the item price down to $111.99Why the hell do I pay for Prime AND get a prime day deal if the item is now being sold way cheaper??? The markup price of the item during Prime day was $349.99 and now it's marked as $175. That's just bull****.",2023-07-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,6.0,497,98,49,8,27.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,item usually good price get marked alot last prime day lavazza lb machine today see exact item top extra coupon bringing item price hell pay prime get prime day deal item sold way cheaper markup price item prime day marked thats bull,0.020494573685497137,0.9795054263145029,0.054963544587773416,0.4,1.100745422074806,110.0745422074806,High Trust
AJ,/users/64cfd314aa15ce0012494c18,GB,2.0,2023-08-06 19:07:08+00:00,1.0,Would give 0 stars,"Would give 0 stars, the drivers are the worst, they don't handle packages with care, leave packages wherever they like and even cancel packages they can't be bothered to deliver (because they need a code). Do not order from them unless is it a small ticket item and you know 100% you need it and won't be returning as the returns process is just as bad as delivery. Awful Customer service, promise you the world and don't deliver. I ordered a bunch of things during prime day, the driver upon delivery threw my package consisting of electronics on the ground and walked away, we asked him to not do this and he was very rude and unprofessional, he then decided to cancel our second package stating we had refused this, we contacted customer service they claimed they would resend the undelivered package but this didn't happen, we were charged incorrectly and no resolutions, they just don't listen and go round and round, completely frustrating as they just ignore you and lie. Will not be buying anything from them again, save yourself the hassle, spend a little bit more and purchase directly from stores.",2023-07-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,6.0,1108,193,18,4,23.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,would give star driver worst dont handle package care leave package wherever like even cancel package cant bothered deliver need code order unless small ticket item know need wont returning return process bad delivery awful customer service promise world dont deliver ordered bunch thing prime day driver upon delivery threw package consisting electronics ground walked away asked rude unprofessional decided cancel second package stating refused contacted customer service claimed would resend undelivered package didnt happen charged incorrectly resolution dont listen go round round completely frustrating ignore lie buying anything save hassle spend little bit purchase directly store,0.005332590260127827,0.9946674097398722,0.10824453168816602,0.2,0.8189826112075692,81.89826112075693,High Trust
Hugh Weaver,/users/593d7e3b0000ff000aa26837,GB,78.0,2023-08-06 14:10:18+00:00,1.0,Every time my wife has a weekend…,"Every time my wife has a weekend delivery from Amazon , the delivery person simply throws it over the gate without even coming through  it and either posting it through our letterbox or ringing our door bell or leaving it in a safe place or on the doorstep  !!!!!! Today the delivery notification says it was put through  our letterbox !!!!!! It was actually thrown over the gate on to our garden path  !!!!!!!!There is nothing on the delivery  notification to let Amazon know about this inefficiency and unprofessional habit . This only happens with weekend deliveries . So Amazon - Have a word with your weekend delivery person !!!!!!",2023-08-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,6.0,636,110,33,7,0.0,0,26,2,1,Suspicious,every time wife weekend delivery amazon delivery person simply throw gate without even coming either posting letterbox ringing door bell leaving safe place doorstep today delivery notification say put letterbox actually thrown gate garden path nothing delivery notification let amazon know inefficiency unprofessional habit happens weekend delivery amazon word weekend delivery person,1.0,0.0,0.06169377453729669,0.2,0.3123387549074593,31.233875490745934,Low Trust
