William Resler,/users/64cee77a86803c0011019dde,US,1.0,2023-08-06 02:21:27+00:00,1.0,A-Z means nothing,"I ordered a electric wheelchair in Nov 22. i am a disabled vet and need one to get around. Two weeks after we had the chair, sparks flew out of the control box when we connected the charger. We called the company that sold it, and they said they would send a new box. Weeks turned to months that we waited for this box. We were being told there was a holiday in China and as soon as it was over, they would send the part. After about 7 months of calls and complaints, they talked us into buying another chair of higher quality for half price. $500. We ordered it and it was junk. It needed to be charged 3 times the first day and was so slow it was useless. We asked to return the items, and they would not send us return labels. We wanted our money back so we could buy a quality chair. After arguing for a while, we asked Amazon to step in. Speaking with these people we got a lot of wrong information. Every time I said something to them, I had to wait either 72hrs or a week for the seller to answer. They sent it to an A-Z department to settle this while I was told a number of times, I would get my money back. This department refused to do anything saying I did not return the item in the allowed 30 days. They refused to recognize that the seller kept promising a replacement part.      I will continue to tell others about my experience as a warning to them about the dishonest customer service I received. It is a shame because they seem so proud of themselves backing the customer and making sure the customer is satisfied. I found out the hard way, and it cost me $1500 that AMAZON LIKE SO MANY OTHERS IS JUST A BUNCH OF TALK!",2022-11-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,6.0,1638,320,17,3,259.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered electric wheelchair nov disabled vet need one get around two week chair spark flew control box connected charger called company sold said would send new box week turned month waited box told holiday china soon would send part month call complaint talked u buying another chair higher quality half price ordered junk needed charged time first day slow useless asked return item would send u return label wanted money back could buy quality chair arguing asked amazon step speaking people got lot wrong information every time said something wait either hr week seller answer sent az department settle told number time would get money back department refused anything saying return item allowed day refused recognize seller kept promising replacement part continue tell others experience warning dishonest customer service received shame seem proud backing customer making sure customer satisfied found hard way cost amazon like many others bunch talk,0.0005498914185903508,0.9994501085814097,0.17947279865395402,0.2,0.8356196140214956,83.56196140214956,High Trust
Michelle Koklas,/users/5a01df7e0000ff000adf2077,GB,35.0,2023-08-06 01:47:54+00:00,3.0,I absolutely love Amazon and have been…,"I absolutely love Amazon and have been shopping with them for years, but I couldn't believe it when a Botabay Dog Stroller was bought as a gift for my ageing dog from my sister and the description states that it has a rear storage pocket, it doesn't!!! That was one of the main reasons it was purchased. My ageing dog loves it, but we are so disappointed. My sister spent over £205.00 on it.......how disappointing!!!",2023-07-31 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,6.0,417,75,39,7,6.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,absolutely love amazon shopping year couldnt believe botabay dog stroller bought gift ageing dog sister description state rear storage pocket doesnt one main reason purchased ageing dog love disappointed sister spent £ ithow disappointing,0.9994601458752413,0.0005398541247586541,0.04206393718452047,0.6,0.9086827144992834,90.86827144992834,High Trust
