Rachel Cole,/users/64cebeaaa087440012519a8c,US,1.0,2023-08-05 23:28:10+00:00,1.0,Save yourself,"Working at Amazon looks like:  You do get great insurance and benefits packages and flexibility. There's an amazing Fake open door policy. If you love getting be treated and talked down to, hated for no reason, bias shown towards you, discriminated against, targeted and potentially fired for breathing, this job is for you.  If you are into stabbed in the back out of fear from others for getting fired because everyday is a competition to keep your job, then look no further. If you are a number and not a person, this place is for you. Working here is stressful and draining, and everyday your soul dies a little more. People will tell you lies in hopes that you will fall for them and mess up and get fired instead of them.  It takes a regular employee YEARS to advance IF they aren't fired after their 2 year mark. After 1 year working here, true colors start to show, and what once looked like a promising inclusive atmosphere is now a dark desolate wasteland where people come at the end of their lives to be forgotten. Criminals are employed here, as they hire anyone. You're a number, and not a person. I was told specifically by management that I was 1 head count (a number).  You better learn to projectile pee and poop because if you go over 5 minutes, you're in trouble.  They fire people faster than they hire, and because of that high turn o er rate Amazon will run out of hirable employees from firing good hard workers for breathing wrong.  Apathy and management tooting their own horns for destroying your self-worth live here.  https: // youtube.com/watch?v=Lyqo2uJvNO4&feature=share",2022-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,5.0,1602,280,13,2,218.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,working amazon look like get great insurance benefit package flexibility there amazing fake open door policy love getting treated talked hated reason bias shown towards discriminated targeted potentially fired breathing job stabbed back fear others getting fired everyday competition keep job look number person place working stressful draining everyday soul dy little people tell lie hope fall mess get fired instead take regular employee year advance arent fired year mark year working true color start show looked like promising inclusive atmosphere dark desolate wasteland people come end life forgotten criminal employed hire anyone youre number person told specifically management head count number better learn projectile pee poop go minute youre trouble fire people faster hire high turn er rate amazon run hirable employee firing good hard worker breathing wrong apathy management tooting horn destroying selfworth live youtubecomwatchvlyqoujvnofeatureshare,0.0014328300375288888,0.9985671699624711,0.15703869882220975,0.2,0.8306913247456775,83.06913247456775,High Trust
