G.,/users/64ce2a86aa15ce0012486df7,NL,1.0,2023-08-05 12:55:49+00:00,1.0,Amazon.es customer service is a disgrace,Amazon.es customer service is a disgrace. I've placed an order at Amazon.es a month ago which needed to be shipped to the Netherlands. The order never arrived. After contacting Amazon.es they claim the order has been picked up at a pickup point. I never picked up anything or signed for receiving this order.Their response is to file a police report on postal fraud. Which I can't because in the Netherlands the seller is responsible for any shipment untill it's delivered correctly to the buyer. I can file a report on identity fraud though but I need signed proof of delivery for that. Amazon.es doesn't seem to understand my request or is deliberately frustrating my request because they know they can't provide signed proof of delivery.I'm running in circles for over a month now and I'm out of hundreds of Euro's which I likely won't get refunded because of Amazon.es' extremely poor customer service department.,2023-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,5.0,917,154,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazones customer service disgrace ive placed order amazones month ago needed shipped netherlands order never arrived contacting amazones claim order picked pickup point never picked anything signed receiving ordertheir response file police report postal fraud cant netherlands seller responsible shipment untill delivered correctly buyer file report identity fraud though need signed proof delivery amazones doesnt seem understand request deliberately frustrating request know cant provide signed proof deliveryim running circle month im hundred euro likely wont get refunded amazones extremely poor customer service department,0.016061691170133292,0.9839383088298667,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.8092434112853764,80.92434112853763,High Trust
