Jamie Sanderson,/users/64cbff087285bd0012fc4827,US,1.0,2023-08-03 21:25:09+00:00,1.0,Order a toy for my son,"I ordered a toy for my son, who is autistic. This is relevant as he expected it to come overnight and was very excited. It didn't come. I figured out how to contact customer service, which is a pain in and of itself. I complained that it didn't come, but they say they ""escalated"" it and it will arrive tomorrow by 8:00AM. All day my son is upset. I wake up this morning and look outside. It is not there. I call again. I ask them to be honest and tell me if they lost it. We could have cancelled and gone to the store or I could have even re-ordered as it was supposed to be available same day. The guy says it is on a truck and will be there by 8:00AM. He said the truck had mechanical issues yesterday. 8:00AM comes around. It is not there. My husband calls. Turns out they lost it yesterday. So they lied to me. I called them up to complain because my husband was over it by the time he was through talking to the person. The lady asks if I asked my neighbors where it is? No. You guys told me it was on  a truck and then said you lost it. For all I know, your third party delivery person stole it. No real solution offered. In the past, this would have been resolved yesterday. I buy a lot from Amazon. Like a lot. I am greatly going to reduce how much I buy in the future. We cancelled all our subscribe and save items. I will do in person shopping. I am not going to spend $10,000 plus a year with a company that doesn't value their customers at all.",2023-08-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,3.0,1457,292,22,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered toy son autistic relevant expected come overnight excited didnt come figured contact customer service pain complained didnt come say escalated arrive tomorrow day son upset wake morning look outside call ask honest tell lost could cancelled gone store could even reordered supposed available day guy say truck said truck mechanical issue yesterday come around husband call turn lost yesterday lied called complain husband time talking person lady asks asked neighbor guy told truck said lost know third party delivery person stole real solution offered past would resolved yesterday buy lot amazon like lot greatly going reduce much buy future cancelled subscribe save item person shopping going spend plus year company doesnt value customer,0.005786028885867477,0.9942139711141326,0.16376892877173305,0.2,0.8298607713114129,82.98607713114129,High Trust
