Max Morais,/users/64cad9454da489001294ce8a,CA,1.0,2023-08-03 00:31:46+00:00,1.0,You don't need to care once you've conquered the world,"The delivery contractor they're using in my area (Intelcom) is horrendous. They don't have a pickup location so if you're not home when they show up, they keep the package and come back another day. You never know for sure when it will be, so you have to play cat and mouse with them, sometimes for days. They seem to think that everyone is unemployed and sitting home all day. They call when they get to your place, and if you're not there, sometimes the drivers get upset. I once had one threatening to return the package after three attempts, but he always came while I was at work. If they could at least give a clear idea of when to expect them, that would help. ""Between 8am and 10pm"" is not exactly what I would call clear. It's infuriating. That contractor can only afford to be that bad because their main client has obliterated the competition and doesn't need to care about the quality of the service anymore. I don't think my bad review will shake them out of their mediocrity, but it feels good to vent and I hope it will provide some relief to the readers who have had a similar experience.",2023-08-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,3.0,1104,205,54,10,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,delivery contractor theyre using area intelcom horrendous dont pickup location youre home show keep package come back another day never know sure play cat mouse sometimes day seem think everyone unemployed sitting home day call get place youre sometimes driver get upset one threatening return package three attempt always came work could least give clear idea expect would help pm exactly would call clear infuriating contractor afford bad main client obliterated competition doesnt need care quality service anymore dont think bad review shake mediocrity feel good vent hope provide relief reader similar experience,0.007142390961040136,0.9928576090389598,0.11497476163768929,0.2,0.8194237568470177,81.94237568470177,High Trust
Kim,/users/5ca5387766da2cbff348e182,US,8.0,2023-08-02 23:34:57+00:00,1.0,The absolute worst customer service…,The absolute worst customer service experience of my life!I purchased a treadmill on 7/13 and after it was delivered I tried it and for the money it wasn’t worth it.Set up a return delivery for 8/2.Company showed up with no label and extremely rude people.I requested a UPS label from Amazon to drop it off myself to ensure that my account was credited and spent two hours and multiple agents only to be told they can’t send me a label and that the company doesn’t provide labels for pickup.How would I prove the treadmill was actually shipped back then? Nightmare customer service waste of $700 and two hours of my life I’ll never get back.Run don’t walk from Amazon I’ve been a loyal customer for years but never again.,2023-08-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,2.0,721,129,36,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,absolute worst customer service experience lifei purchased treadmill delivered tried money wasn’t worth itset return delivery company showed label extremely rude peoplei requested ups label amazon drop ensure account credited spent two hour multiple agent told can’t send label company doesn’t provide label pickuphow would prove treadmill actually shipped back nightmare customer service waste two hour life i’ll never get backrun don’t walk amazon i’ve loyal customer year never,0.08185726285429665,0.9181427371457034,0.0723499719573752,0.2,0.7735413629643266,77.35413629643266,High Trust
Reg Cardin,/users/64cac6e4b14e590011960823,US,1.0,2023-08-02 23:13:34+00:00,1.0,I called to report a technical issue…,"I called to report a technical issue with the Amazon website.  Links to answered questions from any product no longer worked.  Customer service (888.280.4331) first had difficulty understanding the issue, then referred me to a supervisor. He said that they had no way of transferring me or referring the problem to Amazon's technical support.  I should wait 24 hours to see if the problem went away. If it did not I should call customer service back. Pathetic!  Jeff, put a few dollars into at least adequate customer service.  Really.",2023-08-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,2.0,535,89,37,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,called report technical issue amazon website link answered question product longer worked customer service first difficulty understanding issue referred supervisor said way transferring referring problem amazon technical support wait hour see problem went away call customer service back pathetic jeff put dollar least adequate customer service really,0.06531998748972026,0.9346800125102798,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.7773231806802661,77.7323180680266,High Trust
