Daniel Ghirbomean,/users/5d5557776a6b175e3c1f1da4,GB,36.0,2023-08-02 18:15:46+00:00,1.0,Cancelled my prime after this experience,"Been an amazon prime customer for over 7 years now and I've made a lot of orders.I had an issue with returning a bundled ring + chime. The items are split into separate products and you need to request authorization for each and send them separately.It wasn't clear on the mobile app that this order was split into 2 and I only requested a return for the Ring and proceeded to return the bundle. They refunded me only for the Ring, while they said I should have returned the chime separately. So they have the entire ring+chime bundle, but won't refund me for the chime.My recommendation is to not split the order into 2 as this is confusing and be a bit more helpful since I've been a customer for a long time. Time to cancel prime and stop shopping here.",2023-08-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,8.0,2.0,756,141,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime customer year ive made lot ordersi issue returning bundled ring chime item split separate product need request authorization send separatelyit wasnt clear mobile app order split requested return ring proceeded return bundle refunded ring said returned chime separately entire ringchime bundle wont refund chimemy recommendation split order confusing bit helpful since ive customer long time time cancel prime stop shopping,0.029264043353284353,0.9707359566467156,0.07908020190689849,0.2,0.8011840187047375,80.11840187047376,High Trust
