Bob,/users/6053cb9311ff020019a7b5ba,US,4.0,2023-07-31 04:37:10+00:00,1.0,I thought it was bad two years ago,"I thought it was bad two years ago, though it's continuously worsened since.  They had the audacity to send me a USED AND DAMAGED tool bag that actually contained somebody else's old junk and had a 3"" tear in it.  I had to demand to speak to a supervisor after wasting my time with the first tier rep for some 20 minutes just to get my money back.  I but a lot of things from them.  Some 1/4 of what I buy is either the wrong product, damaged or somebody else's old junk. Huge language barrier with all of these overseas ""reps"" only worsens things.  Two day shipping has almost become a thing of the past, even for ""Prime"" members such as myself and despite membership fees literally tripling in a relatively short period of time.",2023-07-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,31.0,730,136,34,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,thought bad two year ago though continuously worsened since audacity send used damaged tool bag actually contained somebody elses old junk tear demand speak supervisor wasting time first tier rep minute get money back lot thing buy either wrong product damaged somebody elses old junk huge language barrier overseas rep worsens thing two day shipping almost become thing past even prime member despite membership fee literally tripling relatively short period time,0.019070506900961365,0.9809294930990387,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.8057199344351055,80.57199344351055,High Trust
Mary,/users/647575b0ca525f0012aed5d6,US,3.0,2023-07-30 20:45:30+00:00,5.0,Unmatched Customer Service,"Amazon is the mother of all online marketplaces ... and for some very solid reasons.1. 100% customer-centered. From the first page loading on their site to the shipping confirmation, Amazon treats every customer like a VIP. Awesome!2. Adapts and evolves with customers' needs. Unafraid to charter new territory, Amazon evolves with the ever-changing needs of its customers.3. Delivers your package on-time OR early. This is such a game-changer that Amazon has seriously disrupted the US Postal Service due to their unmatched delivery system. I could easily write 10 more pages about why Amazon is #1, but it really boils down to this: customer service. In a time where true customer service has become a rarity, Amazon is the undisputed leader.",2023-07-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,30.0,744,120,26,3,15.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,amazon mother online marketplace solid reason customercentered first page loading site shipping confirmation amazon treat every customer like vip awesome adapts evolves customer need unafraid charter new territory amazon evolves everchanging need customer delivers package ontime early gamechanger amazon seriously disrupted u postal service due unmatched delivery system could easily write page amazon really boil customer service time true customer service become rarity amazon undisputed leader,0.12957374373321598,0.870426256266784,0.06730229949523275,1.0,1.9486735880324386,194.86735880324386,High Trust
