Emily Lynch,/users/5d9bc6a8f37572279b57b7b7,US,2.0,2023-07-30 15:33:17+00:00,1.0,Bad customer service and company policies,"I tried to order for a charity. Bec my phone number changed I was told to contact an 800 #. I haven't ordered since 2021 I was told I have to open a new account amd Bec my phone number changed. I asked about my $43.10 credit. The man tells me it will be put back on my cc. I tell him I no longer have that card. So I lose my credit and can't use my account all bec my phone number changed. Changing a phone number is not uncommon. I knew my email address, password, user name, everything he asked. This is rediculous and I don't make a lot of money so I'm out my credit and the dog rescue I wanted to buy something for loses as well. This is rediculous bec there are other ways to verify it was me.",2023-07-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,30.0,698,144,41,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tried order charity bec phone number changed told contact havent ordered since told open new account amd bec phone number changed asked credit man tell put back cc tell longer card lose credit cant use account bec phone number changed changing phone number uncommon knew email address password user name everything asked rediculous dont make lot money im credit dog rescue wanted buy something loses well rediculous bec way verify,0.015981872520435966,0.9840181274795641,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.808161615618638,80.8161615618638,High Trust
