John MC,/users/64c376b4f2829700114a299d,QA,1.0,2023-07-28 10:08:31+00:00,1.0,Amazon currency conversion semi-scam,"Beware of the almost immoral currency conversion practices by Amazon!When you use an international card be very careful when you choose your currency at checkout.I use a Revolut card when paying on Amazon - this is basically a multi-currency prepaid card and I always use to covert between currencies using Revolut rates as they are almost interbank rates.For whatever reason Amazon always selects as default currency my home country currency thus I always have to change it to USD. For my last order, tho I switched to USD Amazon unilaterally decided to charge my Revolut card in my local currency and not USD.Long story short Amazon immorally (and in the EU also illegally) pocketed 10 USD (2% from the order value) - now imagine how many billions they make from this practice that borders basically a scam.Also they're customer support is even worse than their stupid exchange rate scam - the callback doesn't do anything whilst on the chat you end up discussing with people with very limited use and understanding of the English language, that are rude and completely useless.As a conclusion I am very disappointed in Amazon's practices.",2023-07-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,28.0,1141,190,36,4,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,beware almost immoral currency conversion practice amazonwhen use international card careful choose currency checkouti use revolut card paying amazon basically multicurrency prepaid card always use covert currency using revolut rate almost interbank ratesfor whatever reason amazon always selects default currency home country currency thus always change usd last order tho switched usd amazon unilaterally decided charge revolut card local currency usdlong story short amazon immorally eu also illegally pocketed usd order value imagine many billion make practice border basically scamalso theyre customer support even worse stupid exchange rate scam callback doesnt anything whilst chat end discussing people limited use understanding english language rude completely uselessas conclusion disappointed amazon practice,0.05216606675084372,0.9478339332491563,0.1065619742007852,0.2,0.7952293614647352,79.52293614647353,High Trust
