Vicki,/users/61887eb9afe9fd00120cb1dc,US,3.0,2023-07-26 18:20:35+00:00,1.0,Amazon Customer Service Dept. is worse than ever anymore...…,"Most of these people here are complaining about Amazon Customer Service Dept., and they are absolutely right about that.  The Amazon Customer Service is getting worse than ever anymore.  Since you don't get to talk to anyone in the states, and the overseas people are not too familiar with the states' law, or even if they do know, they are trying to play games and stall time, so that they don't have to refund your money as long as they can.  If your package is missing and you have never received it.  They will make you fill out a stupid and ignorant questionnaire, for questions that they already have the answers just to stall time.  For such a big company like Amazon, how can they do something like that.  They don't used to be like that.  Amazon is not the same anymore, being a customer for the past 10 years, I am truly disappointed.",2023-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,26.0,844,154,60,9,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,people complaining amazon customer service dept absolutely right amazon customer service getting worse ever anymore since dont get talk anyone state overseas people familiar state law even know trying play game stall time dont refund money long package missing never received make fill stupid ignorant questionnaire question already answer stall time big company like amazon something like dont used like amazon anymore customer past year truly disappointed,0.016594753439691984,0.983405246560308,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.8089768801505971,80.89768801505971,High Trust
Anthony Bristow,/users/64c133f179f4110012302d6b,GB,1.0,2023-07-26 16:56:02+00:00,3.0,Amazon Prime are liars far too often,"Amazon Prime. It's fine when they have the item in stock and you are prepared to wait until the end of the day.Recent orders - My keyboard broke, so when asked if I wanted delivery morning I said yes please. Got a message late morning saying couldn't deliver, nobody at home. This is code for ""you live off my route, and I have too many parcels to deliver, so I will pretend you weren't in"". Liars. So instead I received it at the end of the following day.Next one - I ordered an item that said it would be delivered next day from their website. An hour later I get a message saying that the item would be delivered in 11 days time. So I cancelled the order, and my money will be returned in about a week and a half. Amazon must have known that they had no stock, their stock must be computerised for the robots to be able to fetch it off the shelves. SO liars again. When you are paying an extra £90 a year for next day delivery, this kind of behaviour sours the relationship.Next problem - you cannot complain by chat about an order you have cancelled. So I asked for a call and was called by a young woman the other side of the world, for whom English was guesswork. But then I don't speak Phillippino either. Waste of my time again.",2023-07-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,26.0,1236,239,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime fine item stock prepared wait end dayrecent order keyboard broke asked wanted delivery morning said yes please got message late morning saying couldnt deliver nobody home code live route many parcel deliver pretend werent liar instead received end following daynext one ordered item said would delivered next day website hour later get message saying item would delivered day time cancelled order money returned week half amazon must known stock stock must computerised robot able fetch shelf liar paying extra £ year next day delivery kind behaviour sour relationshipnext problem cannot complain chat order cancelled asked call called young woman side world english guesswork dont speak phillippino either waste time,0.0059041809610873375,0.9940958190389126,0.1340437464946719,0.6,1.4238566588183907,142.3856658818391,High Trust
