James Brown,/users/5f44dd116e807350528006bb,GB,16.0,2023-07-26 12:51:09+00:00,1.0,What are Amazon playing at,"What are Amazon playing at, I ordered an item.. tried to get it delivered to an Amazon hub near my address, they said there was a problem with getting it delivered to any of the two hubs near me, so I spend the money to get it posted to my address, Amazon then delivered my item to the hub, and did not refund my postage. They are penny pinching from valued customers and conning us so be very aware. I've started shopping with Temu and it's fantastic, a lot cheaper and less hassle. Shame on you Amazon. Your going to lose a lot of valued customers.",2023-07-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,26.0,550,106,26,5,14.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon playing ordered item tried get delivered amazon hub near address said problem getting delivered two hub near spend money get posted address amazon delivered item hub refund postage penny pinching valued customer conning u aware ive started shopping temu fantastic lot cheaper less hassle shame amazon going lose lot valued customer,0.027196521592523008,0.9728034784074769,0.05945036455412227,0.2,0.7982918121145629,79.82918121145629,High Trust
