Frank Morley,/users/5c7940462f6f41e7a70667d9,IE,13.0,2023-07-25 18:56:09+00:00,1.0,False advertising?,"Ordered a Karcher Pressure Washer from Amazon on April 12th, still not received (July 25th), though it is in stock and available on their site. Expect they don't want to ship it as I bought it at a special price during a deal period. However, if they advertise and then fail/refuse to ship, is this not equivalent to false advertising??Side note: Based on the pretty brutal Trustpilot reviews of Amazon, it is clear how VERY LITTLE they care about their (long standing) customers.",2023-07-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,25.0,480,83,18,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered karcher pressure washer amazon april th still received july th though stock available site expect dont want ship bought special price deal period however advertise failrefuse ship equivalent false advertisingside note based pretty brutal trustpilot review amazon clear little care long standing customer,0.04220849764895203,0.9577915023510479,0.04655075715086932,0.2,0.7882059026056978,78.82059026056977,High Trust
