Maria Fernanda Arismendi,/users/64be7951cd0e1e00127a96a1,US,2.0,2023-07-24 15:19:42+00:00,1.0,My recent delivery experience with…,"My recent delivery experience with Amazon was a complete disaster. I placed an order with guaranteed two-day shipping for a time-sensitive item, and I ended up waiting for more than a week for it to arrive. The delivery was delayed multiple times, and there was no clear communication from Amazon about the reasons for the delay.To make matters worse, the package finally arrived in terrible condition. It was crushed and looked like it had been mishandled during transit. The product inside was damaged, rendering it unusable. I contacted Amazon's customer support, but their response was slow and unapologetic.I expected better from a company as renowned as Amazon, but this experience has left me frustrated and disappointed. The lack of accountability and poor handling of my order has made me reconsider using Amazon for future purchases. They need to improve their delivery services and customer support if they want to maintain their reputation as a reliable online retailer.",2023-07-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,24.0,982,157,35,5,20.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,recent delivery experience amazon complete disaster placed order guaranteed twoday shipping timesensitive item ended waiting week arrive delivery delayed multiple time clear communication amazon reason delayto make matter worse package finally arrived terrible condition crushed looked like mishandled transit product inside damaged rendering unusable contacted amazon customer support response slow unapologetici expected better company renowned amazon experience left frustrated disappointed lack accountability poor handling order made reconsider using amazon future purchase need improve delivery service customer support want maintain reputation reliable online retailer,0.0038648857680967084,0.9961351142319033,0.08805384183959619,0.2,0.8156783254838709,81.56783254838709,High Trust
Sam,/users/60994e6ba9b34b001a65f226,GB,5.0,2023-07-24 14:27:51+00:00,1.0,What a joke,"What a joke, clowns. I ordered a tablet to watch my daughter’s university graduation as am very ill and housebound. Paid extra for it to turn up by 1:00pm. So far the driver has gone past my house 3 times and has also been stationary twice round the corner from my house. The first time for 40 minutes and this second time for over an hour. Terrible service, now I’m going to miss the graduation and want a refund on my delivery. I know someone who delivers for WH Smith’s and they do Amazon deliveries. He snorts Cocaine in the back of the van off the top of the parcels and masterbates in the back of the van. He works for the Croydon branch. They really need to sort their drivers out. Absolutely disgusting service.",2023-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,24.0,719,135,11,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,joke clown ordered tablet watch daughter’s university graduation ill housebound paid extra turn pm far driver gone past house time also stationary twice round corner house first time minute second time hour terrible service i’m going miss graduation want refund delivery know someone delivers wh smith’s amazon delivery snort cocaine back van top parcel masterbates back van work croydon branch really need sort driver absolutely disgusting service,0.017680917357840293,0.9823190826421597,0.07571508693213685,0.2,0.8063025587075072,80.63025587075072,High Trust
Tandy,/users/573a04260000ff000a20947b,SI,29.0,2023-07-24 13:27:05+00:00,1.0,I ordered a mobile phone and was told…,I ordered a mobile phone and was told it would be delivered next day on prime. I was then told they had attempted delivery. Checked cctv cameras that are right around the house and front door camera plus an extra hidden one at the front door. No one had been to our front door. Rang so called customer services explained problem the woman explained I was next for delivery because when he scanned my parcel he was 9 miles away from my address. It didn’t come she even said she would watch my delivery and send me a personal email still waiting. Uday  supposedly in charge of deliveries rang and said he would send it back out and I would have it before 10 that night. Tracking said sorry they had missed original time slot but it was on its way and would arrive by 10 that night. I am disabled and don’t normally stay up that late but did it never arrived. My husband has just had a big operation and should be resting but had to keep a watch for the incompetent delivery drivers they employ. They asked for my phone number and then said she would give it to the driver. I told her she could not give my number to the driver. When I went on the tracking she had put my number on the delivery instructions. They just don’t care and tell lies all the time and don’t give a dam about their customers. This isn’t the first time they have said they had attempted a delivery but nobody showed on the cameras so unless they employ invisible drivers now it’s just more lies. Don’t order this is the worst company I have ever dealt with. Still no phone and nobody willing to speak to me.,2023-07-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,24.0,1578,301,38,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered mobile phone told would delivered next day prime told attempted delivery checked cctv camera right around house front door camera plus extra hidden one front door one front door rang called customer service explained probl