Tracy Byrd,/users/60dcfb1f47e6f30012747d8e,US,4.0,2023-07-24 11:57:32+00:00,1.0,I no longer trust Amazon,"I no longer trust Amazon. I have used them for years but really started depending on them when Covid started. A few problems here and there but was always treated fairly and things were made right. NOT THIS TIME! Be very cautious when returning an item. Amazon is not at all helpful if you return an item and it isn't scanned properly by UPS or Fedex. I returned 4 packages all to Amazon using their label. I handed them right to the UPS driver. That night 3 packages had been scanned and I was refunded. The 4th package did not show being scanned. It was A BIG box too! UPS said call Amazon, they had a contract and Amazon had to take care. Amazon told me to wait 14 business days then they would help refund me if package didn't show up. Today I received an email stating that Amazon would not be refunding me since its been too long and they have no proof that I sent the package! Was on hold for almost 2 hours, going from supervisor to supervisor..in the end I am left holding  the bag. They won't file a missing package report, UPS won't take responsibility for the item not scanned and lost. Amazon has insurance! WHY won't they file a missing package! I am out $$ and NOT happy about it. Filed a report with the BBB. Cancelled my membership and account with Amazon. A simple enough situation to fix but they won't even try. RIP OFF!!",2023-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,24.0,1341,253,24,5,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,longer trust amazon used year really started depending covid started problem always treated fairly thing made right time cautious returning item amazon helpful return item isnt scanned properly ups fedex returned package amazon using label handed right ups driver night package scanned refunded th package show scanned big box ups said call amazon contract amazon take care amazon told wait business day would help refund package didnt show today received email stating amazon would refunding since long proof sent package hold almost hour going supervisor supervisorin end left holding bag wont file missing package report ups wont take responsibility item scanned lost amazon insurance wont file missing package happy filed report bbb cancelled membership account amazon simple enough situation fix wont even try rip,0.9978124715299541,0.0021875284700458852,0.14189568143578238,0.2,0.3294729005221794,32.947290052217944,Low Trust
