ronnie granek,/users/64ba991cc7ef880011e6a9ea,GB,2.0,2023-07-21 16:50:18+00:00,1.0,"i was a seller on amazon they owe my company 130,000 pounds","i was a seller on Amazon, we were closed down the account due to failing a standard KYC investigation, we never found out exactly why. Amazon never gave us any reasonAmazon kept £61,300 of our cash in October 2021.We took Amazon to court, and won the case. Amazon never came to defend themselves, nor did they appeal the decision.The judgement also included fines if Amazon delayed repayment.Today Amazon owe my company £130,000 plus legal costs of Euro 3,000.I personally have been suffering from acute mental anxiety directly due to this situation.In 20 months, of chasing this money, not once has the Amazon legal department engaged in any form of communication with us.They have lost a case, and have a court order to pay these costs.amazon thinks it is above the law..... I am going to cause them hell now..... as they have stolen my money, ruined my business, and effected my health tremendously.this is what amazon really is.....",2022-09-21 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,21.0,936,158,59,12,303.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,seller amazon closed account due failing standard kyc investigation never found exactly amazon never gave u reasonamazon kept £ cash october took amazon court case amazon never came defend appeal decisionthe judgement also included fine amazon delayed repaymenttoday amazon owe company £ plus legal cost euro personally suffering acute mental anxiety directly due situationin month chasing money amazon legal department engaged form communication usthey lost case court order pay costsamazon think law going cause hell stolen money ruined business effected health tremendouslythis amazon really,0.0001475269725448763,0.9998524730274552,0.0886146943353898,0.2,0.8176491753808056,81.76491753808057,High Trust
