Princess,/users/64a603f9bbdc81001246a7db,US,2.0,2023-07-20 13:55:54+00:00,2.0,Amazon has extended it's refund time…,"Amazon has extended it's refund time because they fired so many workers. They now say it takes 60 days to process a return even though the site says up to 30 days. No business has longer than a 30 day return/refund policy. They will tell you to wait 60 days but then once it has been 60 days they will say it has been to long and they cannot process a refund. This way they can keep your money, the product, and it will be too late to dispute the purchase with your bank. Dispute your purchase with your bank 2 weeks after you return an item. That way you have time to dispute your purchase before Amazon can steal your money. They will also go as far as to block you from the cHat or call feature or close your account. If they close your account you can definitely open a dispute with your bank. The refund window used to be 14 days now it is 60 days which unreasonable long since they have no problem taking your money.",2023-07-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,20.0,922,180,37,6,16.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon extended refund time fired many worker say take day process return even though site say day business longer day returnrefund policy tell wait day day say long cannot process refund way keep money product late dispute purchase bank dispute purchase bank week return item way time dispute purchase amazon steal money also go far block chat call feature close account close account definitely open dispute bank refund window used day day unreasonable long since problem taking money,0.00613222434017146,0.9938677756598285,0.10095344924284913,0.4,1.117124577678484,111.71245776784839,High Trust
