KENDRA C.,/users/62cdd60949a8fe0011514e4b,CA,19.0,2023-07-18 15:28:47+00:00,1.0,Incompetent fulfillment team.,"I’ve placed an order for multiple items at once on July 5th, all (2 of them have been returned) but one still has yet to be delivered to me, and I placed the order like 2 weeks ago. It’s a simple 1oz lip scrub so you’d think they wouldn’t take eons to ship it out after the third-party seller shipped it to them, but they did. Kept calling Amazon.ca about this and they keep parroting the estimated delivery date of July 18th (which is today) and kept telling me to wait. My card was charged last night and they fulfilled this last item in my order, but now the estimated delivery date is Thursday, the 20th and will be coming from Richmond, BC instead of a nearby Ontario one like the first one I ordered. I’m floored and told them as much this morning and they refused to even compensate me with a $10 credit (should be more at this point given I’ve been calling them for the past week about this small item…) me as an apology. Kept repeating that delivery dates are just a guess and not guaranteed, yet they couldn’t explain why I have to wait 2 more days for a freaking lip scrub. Unbelievable.It always take forever for these people to fulfill my orders…like about a week each time. I’m currently living an hour and a half away from a fulfillment center in a bigger city so there’s no excuse. They need to get it together or I’m going back to eBay…the item + shipping prices might be really crazy now but at least people on there don’t take forever to ship out your order. Etsy is also great. I’m done with Amazon. Customer service and fast shipping are such foreign terms to them at this point.",2023-07-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,18.0,1600,301,29,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’ve placed order multiple item july th returned one still yet delivered placed order like week ago it’s simple oz lip scrub you’d think wouldn’t take eon ship thirdparty seller shipped kept calling amazonca keep parroting estimated delivery date july th today kept telling wait card charged last night fulfilled last item order estimated delivery date thursday th coming richmond bc instead nearby ontario one like first one ordered i’m floored told much morning refused even compensate credit point given i’ve calling past week small item… apology kept repeating delivery date guess guaranteed yet couldn’t explain wait day freaking lip scrub unbelievableit always take forever people fulfill orders…like week time i’m currently living hour half away fulfillment center bigger city there’s excuse need get together i’m going back ebay…the item shipping price might really crazy least people don’t take forever ship order etsy also great i’m done amazon customer service fast shipping foreign term point,0.025103631996832566,0.9748963680031675,0.16881660123387549,0.2,0.8212115042483588,82.12115042483588,High Trust
