Ivan Chu,/users/64b6463bec3482001382ff83,US,2.0,2023-07-18 09:59:02+00:00,1.0,Have to write this after a very poor experience.,"Have to write this review after very poor experience with their delivery. Ordered the item on July 11th. The product was supposed to arrive on the 13th and it didn't. It said there's issue during delivery so the item will be delayed.I waited 2 more days to contact Amazon through Chat. They told me the product is still in process of shipping. But I've had similar experience before and believe the product had been lost. But they tried to reassure me that it's not lost. And I cannot cancel and get a refund until the 18th.Today is the 18th, the product is indeed lost. I am frustrated that they made me wait so many days until I can cancel and re-order again. If they just told me sooner that the product is lost, then this wouldn't have happened.If the item is something not urgent, I wouldn't be so pissed. But it's a health product for my dog. I waited 5 extra days when they could have told me the item is lost. Anyway, I am pissed at how bad their delivery system is. The 3 people I chatted with all said they cannot find out the information. Just kept saying it's stuck in processing.If they have a better system, they would have been able to tell me the product is lost or it's no longer in process or being shipped. Very poor experience. Poor system and poor customer service as well.",2023-07-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,18.0,1294,241,48,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,write review poor experience delivery ordered item july th product supposed arrive th didnt said there issue delivery item delayedi waited day contact amazon chat told product still process shipping ive similar experience believe product lost tried reassure lost cannot cancel get refund thtoday th product indeed lost frustrated made wait many day cancel reorder told sooner product lost wouldnt happenedif item something urgent wouldnt pissed health product dog waited extra day could told item lost anyway pissed bad delivery system people chatted said cannot find information kept saying stuck processingif better system would able tell product lost longer process shipped poor experience poor system poor customer service well,0.019496540763543388,0.9805034592364567,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.8172848199154802,81.72848199154802,High Trust
