P B,/users/564472800000ff0001ea2b62,GB,16.0,2023-07-13 12:33:53+00:00,1.0,Don't buy Dyson on Amazon - THEY SELL FAKES,"Fake goods alert Bought a Dyson hairdryer on Amazon.It broke down so posted it back to Dyson for a repair under the warranty.Dyson have kept it and refused to send it back as it's counterfeit.Now Amazon want nothing to do with it because they claim it is now outside of the warranty period.  It might be now (because it's taken so long to get a sensible response), but when I sent it to Dyson it was within the warranty time period.Also - they say the order was fulfilled by a third party and so they can't help.  They don't seem to care that (1) Counterfeit Dyson goods can be dangerous (2) Many other Amazon customers will have been sold the same fake goods - they could find out who, and contact them, but would rather not bother (3) They don't seem to care that this is ongoing.  There is a ""Buy again"" option under what I bought from them first time.  Why on earth would I want to buy another fake counterfeit item.So beware of buying Dyson goods on Amazon.If they're fake, Amazon can't be bothered to help sort it out.  I've lost the money and don't have the goods any more either.  Amazon website sells counterfeit, fake Dyson goods.  And they don't care.",2023-07-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,13.0,1162,214,43,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,fake good alert bought dyson hairdryer amazonit broke posted back dyson repair warrantydyson kept refused send back counterfeitnow amazon want nothing claim outside warranty period might taken long get sensible response sent dyson within warranty time periodalso say order fulfilled third party cant help dont seem care counterfeit dyson good dangerous many amazon customer sold fake good could find contact would rather bother dont seem care ongoing buy option bought first time earth would want buy another fake counterfeit itemso beware buying dyson good amazonif theyre fake amazon cant bothered help sort ive lost money dont good either amazon website sell counterfeit fake dyson good dont care,0.011528037840020421,0.9884719621599796,0.12002243409983174,0.2,0.8182404678999561,81.8240467899956,High Trust
