Melissa Beible,/users/64af4c7347f0aa0012afe91d,US,2.0,2023-07-13 03:00:45+00:00,1.0,I received notification that my…,"Whats Happening with Amazon?!?!I received notification that my purchase had arrived along with a picture of the box outside my door. When I got home I noticed that the package was not mine. It belonged to my neighbor down the street. I called Amazon to report the issue but they seemed like they didn't believe me. They told me my package was still in transit but when I looked up the tracking number it no longer existed. After being a member for so long I was disappointed in the runaround that I received. I had an issue a week prior where my delivery was completely empty. No product in it. So maybe they think I'm trying to scam them due to back to back issues??After 2 phone calls, I gave up. It's only $10 after all, not going to make or break me. God knows they don't need my money to stay in business. I gave up and reordered the item. If these mistakes continue with others it will start to take a toll. Unfortunately when they have all my money and so many others, it's hard to make an impression when they mess up once, twice, three or four times.",2023-07-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,13.0,1059,201,32,5,2.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,whats happening amazoni received notification purchase arrived along picture box outside door got home noticed package mine belonged neighbor street called amazon report issue seemed like didnt believe told package still transit looked tracking number longer existed member long disappointed runaround received issue week prior delivery completely empty product maybe think im trying scam due back back issuesafter phone call gave going make break god know dont need money stay business gave reordered item mistake continue others start take toll unfortunately money many others hard make impression mess twice three four time,0.19701258276512215,0.8029874172348779,0.11273135165451487,0.2,0.7240399789483418,72.40399789483418,Medium Trust
