jenni Rose,/users/5ed4f06a387d4223bb01fcb6,GB,3.0,2023-07-11 16:51:44+00:00,1.0,When trying to use my debit card it…,"When trying to use my debit card it keeps being declined saying there is insufficient funds. this was not the case. I contacted Amazon customer services and they say there are no issues and that it is the bank that is at fault. I called my bank and they have said they get lots of these calls and that in my case (as in many) there have been no requests from Amazon for payment. I know who I believe! Amazon don't seem to give a fig, I believe it may be something to do with the new on line 2 step authentication that has come in to force, Amazon transactions don't seem to do this. I have a feeling that Amazon will care when this starts happening with a lot more of their customers and they wonder where their sales have gone!",2023-07-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,11.0,728,142,36,8,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,trying use debit card keep declined saying insufficient fund case contacted amazon customer service say issue bank fault called bank said get lot call case many request amazon payment know believe amazon dont seem give fig believe may something new line step authentication come force amazon transaction dont seem feeling amazon care start happening lot customer wonder sale gone,0.1711476757541984,0.8288523242458016,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.7303543730034392,73.03543730034392,Medium Trust
