Terry L.,/users/64ab77a6d0640400127cef73,US,1.0,2023-07-10 05:21:42+00:00,4.0,Amazon.com is great for researching…,"Amazon.com is great for researching products, and selections of products. I really like checking other customers reviews about quality, and fitting by brands, and items. So you know if you need to order a bigger size, or smaller size. The customers service Representatives are always a big help, with refunds, getting damaged packages, missing orders help. The delivery people are sometimes, great, and sometimes bad. Mostly great, a few bad.",2023-06-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,10.0,442,70,36,5,12.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazoncom great researching product selection product really like checking customer review quality fitting brand item know need order bigger size smaller size customer service representative always big help refund getting damaged package missing order help delivery people sometimes great sometimes bad mostly great bad,0.0207688562082523,0.9792311437917477,0.03925967470555244,0.8,1.6974675068369844,169.74675068369845,High Trust
