Roger,/users/64ab1dc92188510012f75394,US,1.0,2023-07-09 22:51:47+00:00,1.0,Amazon does not do the right thing!!!,"Defective John Deere Kids, riding tractor from Peg prego. Amazon did nothing to solve my problem and made my life much harder!!!They don’t care they sell defective items or care about us as people!!!The defective construction in the drive shaft makes the chain come off when the kid is sitting on it. The chain is too short to reach the next access point.At the same time, there is too much slack in the chain so when the kid sits on the defective john deere tractor. The chain slips off!The part Peg Pegro provided does not fix the problem! The issue is where the pedals are where the crankshaft goes in and where the softer metal and the plastic hold onto the frame. The metal is too soft where it is attached to the plastic. It is low quality and cheaply made.We have driven it to Cahaba Cycles 3 different times. Paid them for their service.The positive is after 5 months of paying to get it fixed the local bike shop. Calling Amazon and the manufacture. Peg Prego did the right thing and refund our money!!!We gave this present to my son for his third birthday party. My mother was in the hospital and passed away two weeks after my child’s birthday. I after burying my mother and getting back on my feet. I reached out to Amazon to help us with the issue.  They told us sorry it’s been 30 days nothing we can do!They basically said pound sand!I asked for a supervisor, and they wouldn’t give me one and said that the supervisor will tell you the same thing!!!!Amazon doesn’t care about us, the customer! They only care about profits!!!!I never will buy anything from Amazon again, even if it saves me money or I have to do without!!!!I try every week to get my wife to quit spending money on Amazon and will never stop!!!!!",2023-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,9.0,1729,317,37,7,30.0,0,31,1,0,Genuine,defective john deere kid riding tractor peg prego amazon nothing solve problem made life much harderthey don’t care sell defective item care u peoplethe defective construction drive shaft make chain come kid sitting chain short reach next access pointat time much slack chain kid sits defective john deere tractor chain slip offthe part peg pegro provided fix problem issue pedal crankshaft go softer metal plastic hold onto frame metal soft attached plastic low quality cheaply madewe driven cahaba cycle different time paid servicethe positive month paying get fixed local bike shop calling amazon manufacture peg prego right thing refund moneywe gave present son third birthday party mother hospital passed away two week child’s birthday burying mother getting back foot reached amazon help u issue told u sorry it’s day nothing dothey basically said pound sandi asked supervisor wouldn’t give one said supervisor tell thingamazon doesn’t care u customer care profitsi never buy anything amazon even save money withouti try every week get wife quit spending money amazon never stop,1.0,0.0,0.1777902411665732,0.2,0.33555804823331464,33.555804823331464,Low Trust
