Christine Taraschuk,/users/64aa3f613bb77800124198e9,CA,1.0,2023-07-09 07:02:33+00:00,1.0,I order so much on Amazon for years and…,I order so much on Amazon for years and I have deliveries almost everyday of the week.   Lately in past three months deliveries are not coming when they say they are supposed to be there. They say running late and give me a new date for them to arrive and they often don’t come on that date. They are often a week late. When I call Amazon and I call often they say carrier picked up order two days ago so it should be there today but it usually isn’t. It’s usually 4 or five days the carrier has it. I think because I am so far out they wait till they have a lot of deliveries for me or wait till they have more deliveries in area. I have a business and buy many things by bulk witch I find good deals on Amazon. If they don’t come on time then my orders can’t be met and I often loose orders. It doesn’t matter how much I call they just don’t seem to fix it. It’s just getting worse that I am looking at other companies. It’s really to bad they don’t care to make me happy because I buy so much.,2023-04-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,9.0,996,203,40,9,96.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,order much amazon year delivery almost everyday week lately past three month delivery coming say supposed say running late give new date arrive often don’t come date often week late call amazon call often say carrier picked order two day ago today usually isn’t it’s usually five day carrier think far wait till lot delivery wait till delivery area business buy many thing bulk witch find good deal amazon don’t come time order can’t met often loose order doesn’t matter much call don’t seem fix it’s getting worse looking company it’s really bad don’t care make happy buy much,0.001007917664049816,0.9989920823359502,0.11385305664610207,0.2,0.8222666524971954,82.22666524971955,High Trust
