Pasquale,/users/5e0681376af50259d02cec76,DE,60.0,2023-07-08 08:36:33+00:00,1.0,0/0 this is the stars.,"0/0 this is the stars.So, as in the attached pic of July 3rd, the order had been dispatched and the tracking showed the delivery between July 24th and 31st. Today July 8th are you writing to me that the order has been canceled because the goods are out of stock? In summary, on 30 June I complete the order and pay, on 3 July it confirms and dispatched and on 8 July you write me an e mail “greetings we confirm begin processing the refund because out of stock”.. not even feeling sorry. The product is out of stock product 8 days after I paid and was already dispatched? What kind of job you all do? Catching butterflies? Are you serious? You are a bunch of incompetents. Refund immediately, I don't care if your supplier has to refund the money. You are responsible as I bought through you and 10 days is too much. You illegally hold my money already for 8 days. Never againI checked now on your web page and there are still 2 items in stock???!!!",2023-07-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,8.0,949,179,22,5,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,starsso attached pic july rd order dispatched tracking showed delivery july th st today july th writing order canceled good stock summary june complete order pay july confirms dispatched july write e mail “greetings confirm begin processing refund stock” even feeling sorry product stock product day paid already dispatched kind job catching butterfly serious bunch incompetent refund immediately dont care supplier refund money responsible bought day much illegally hold money already day never againi checked web page still item stock,0.9607287877926123,0.03927121220738772,0.10039259674705553,0.2,0.339714125453105,33.9714125453105,Low Trust
