jo,/users/603d74c5c3941b001b82914a,US,2.0,2023-07-07 21:29:54+00:00,1.0,They are no longer reliable.,"I have either been on chat or on the phone with Amazon customer service at least 7 times in the last week for the same missing order.  They said their tracking proves it was delivered. So, they told me to get a police report.  I spent two hours at the police station getting that.  I submitted it.  They then have given me the run around on every single interaction and moved the goal post in an effort to not do what they say they will do and reimburse me for the package I never received.  They have sent me an email telling me to write them again on July 19th (12 days from now).  They have Amazon used to take a picture of a delivered package, and they wont even provide me with that.  This is far different than their customer service was just two years ago.  Now, you are rolling the dice with them.",2023-07-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,7.0,805,155,28,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,either chat phone amazon customer service least time last week missing order said tracking prof delivered told get police report spent two hour police station getting submitted given run around every single interaction moved goal post effort say reimburse package never received sent email telling write july th day amazon used take picture delivered package wont even provide far different customer service two year ago rolling dice,0.014427456207675193,0.9855725437923248,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.8101726992657643,81.01726992657643,High Trust
