nandi gumede,/users/5f8df45725f09e001ab54757,ZA,1.0,2023-07-07 19:19:59+00:00,1.0,I placed an order for two phones using…,"I placed an order for two phones using a UK address and phone number as I just relocated. Paid using my Revolut account. The items were meant to be shipped next day when one phone was delivered the delivery needed an OTP code which I didn't have on checking I found that my account has been closed for ' misuse' therefore couldn't log in to retrieve any messages on the account. On third delivery attempt the delivery man suggested that he would return the item under ' customer no longer needs the item'. Second phone was delivered but in very bad condition not worth the amount I paid at all had scratches all over. I have tried contacting Amazon for the past week with proof of payment and asking them to just return the one phone and process a refund on both phones. On all occasions have had to call and only thing I get is 'sorry we will escalate and you'll get a response in 24hours"" not once have I received any response from them only to get an email from Amazon to tell me that after much consideration the account will remain closed and they won't be responding to my emails. This is so unfair as I used money to purchase which they received surely am entitled to my refund if they will not be dealing with my account anymore. Such a dissapointing experience with Amazon. Customer service is worse as I was told on one occasion they don't care if escalate.",2023-07-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,7.0,1367,254,39,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order two phone using uk address phone number relocated paid using revolut account item meant shipped next day one phone delivered delivery needed otp code didnt checking found account closed misuse therefore couldnt log retrieve message account third delivery attempt delivery man suggested would return item customer longer need item second phone delivered bad condition worth amount paid scratch tried contacting amazon pa