sam g,/users/5df119cc520b4213c8ff8c49,US,2.0,2023-07-11 04:16:44+00:00,1.0,I have been a customer with Amazon…,"I have been a customer with Amazon since 2000. With inflation so high, haven't purchased from them for a few months.I got a new phone and went to log in.But I'm not allowed to log in because I now have a security alert just because it has been about 4 or 5 months since I last purchased from them.Still same email, same address.I was required to call them.They said I had to answer some security questions. Confirming my email and address not enough. Nor would they send a confirmation code to my email. Had to be security questions and get them all correct to be allowed to get back into my account.In 23 years never had to do this before.I said okay. Then after being put on hold, person came back that i haven't ordered enough stuff from Amazon lately, so she couldn't get enough security questions. 23 years of purchases and she can't get enough purchases questions!What's the point of security questions based on recent purchases when the reason for the security questions is because I haven't purchased lately. Absurd!So I'm not allowed back into my account.They want me to lose all my history of 23 years of purchases, shopping cart, wish lists. And start all over.They don't care.I haven't used Walmart in about the same amount of time but no problem getting into my account on my new phone.Bye bye foolish Amazon.Better to buy locally anyway.",2023-07-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,11.0,1351,238,35,7,4.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,customer amazon since inflation high havent purchased monthsi got new phone went log inbut im allowed log security alert month since last purchased themstill email addressi required call themthey said answer security question confirming email address enough would send confirmation code email security question get correct allowed get back accountin year never beforei said okay put hold person came back havent ordered enough stuff amazon lately couldnt get enough security question year purchase cant get enough purchase questionswhats point security question based recent purchase reason security question havent purchased lately absurdso im allowed back accountthey want lose history year purchase shopping cart wish list start overthey dont carei havent used walmart amount time problem getting account new phonebye bye foolish amazonbetter buy locally anyway,0.1825719196836058,0.8174280803163942,0.1334828939988783,0.2,0.7354106189579728,73.54106189579727,Medium Trust
