Alan,/users/64a6c2398c152400120726e1,GB,1.0,2023-07-06 15:31:50+00:00,1.0,THE WORST Customer Service Of All Time,"The company I work for sell on Amazon as well as other platforms. The Amazon platform itself is incredibly faulted. As a buyer it all looks good and fine, easy to use. But when you run a company on there you realise just how awful it is. But that's just the Amazon functionality. Regarding the customer service itself? I'll give an example. We had a piece of negative feedback, it was meant for another seller as it was regarding an item we did not sell, I thought that's okay, these things happen, easy fix for Amazon just 2 seconds to click and remove it. Wrong. Weeks of back and forth via email and chat saying ""go through feedback manager"", which I did originally, it was declined, I reopened the case, and it was closed permanently saying they won't remove it. After weeks I finally spoke to someone on the phone who told me that no-one at all has the power to remove the feedback and I need to leave a public reply! (Which I already did might I add. You get robotic responses, no way humans are looking at these and responding, otherwise they have 1 brain cell between them. This is just one example, there are many where you get moronic, repeated responses that are sometimes nothing to do with what you have reported.Avoid them at all costs, serious sham of a company and appalling customer service and seller support.",2023-07-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,6.0,1327,241,38,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,company work sell amazon well platform amazon platform incredibly faulted buyer look good fine easy use run company realise awful thats amazon functionality regarding customer service ill give example piece negative feedback meant another seller regarding item sell thought thats okay thing happen easy fix amazon second click remove wrong week back forth via email chat saying go feedback manager originally declined reopened case closed permanently saying wont remove week finally spoke someone phone told noone power remove feedback need leave public reply already might add get robotic response way human looking responding otherwise brain cell one example many get moronic repeated response sometimes nothing reportedavoid cost serious sham company appalling customer service seller support,0.07061577146032028,0.9293842285396797,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.7917252045670917,79.17252045670918,High Trust
Stacey,/users/57a6e8910000ff000a387ff4,GB,15.0,2023-07-06 12:41:16+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service I've ever received,"The products and delivery service is usually pretty good, but the customer service via chat is absolutely shocking. I received the worst customer service I have ever received on Friday, but I have absolutely no way to feed this back or even complain about it unless I go through the same service where I received the service. I just want an email address or a form to complete so I can submit a complaint, every company, especially one as large as Amazon should have a dedicated complaints procedure.",2023-06-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,6.0,500,88,41,6,6.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,product delivery service usually pretty good customer service via chat absolutely shocking received worst customer service ever received friday absolutely way feed back even complain unless go service received service want email address form complete submit complaint every company especially one large amazon dedicated complaint procedure,0.04826108156582932,0.9517389184341707,0.049355019629837356,0.2,0.7857404631430529,78.57404631430529,High Trust
