Nicole,/users/64a44468c57f3d0012dd39f6,US,2.0,2023-07-04 18:10:25+00:00,1.0,Amazon is no longer a good retailer,"Amazon sends all things out as new now instead of new but opened or used. You get items and can tell someone else has had it. They also are review Nazis. They pick and choose which reviews they want posted. They hide behind community rules for reviews. Even if your reviews follow all their rules they will still send you nasty email saying you have been warned. Yet they never explain which review or what is wrong with the review. They just say it doesn't comply. Well, let's be honest if you write a review that is positive and is only about product there is no reason to reject it. I even read it to a few representatives and they didn't see an issue with it either. They have an AI controlling which reviews are allowed. They program it. No person actually decides. Since Bezzo left Amazon has gone to pot!!!",2023-07-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,4.0,813,151,35,7,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,amazon sends thing new instead new opened used get item tell someone else also review nazi pick choose review want posted hide behind community rule review even review follow rule still send nasty email saying warned yet never explain review wrong review say doesnt comply well let honest write review positive product reason reject even read representative didnt see issue either ai controlling review allowed program person actually decides since bezzo left amazon gone pot,0.740564408342403,0.259435591657597,0.08468872686483454,0.2,0.44665554120176537,44.66555412017654,Low Trust
