Colin lyth,/users/5a54e5e60000ff000afd6ffc,GB,22.0,2023-07-03 18:06:21+00:00,1.0,THE WORSE COMPANY EVER,"I wasn't going to make a complaint on here about Amazon because talking to them it's like hitting my head against the brick wall. Long story short, I live in a flat which is seven floors up, and for the last year or so the delivery drivers are continually leaving my packages downstairs just dumped on the floor outside the main door. Because of where I live, this place is full of thieving little folk who like to steal people's packages, I've have had about 25 packages go missing which Amazon have automatically refunded me for but it's the fact that I have put on my delivery information, don't leave downstairs, and yet the delivery people totally ignore me and leave my packages downstairs to be thieved by sticky fingered little peeps around here. I had two packages due today and because it was absolutely chucking it down with rain the delivery person wouldn't even get out of his van and want it me to go outside with covid to collect the parcels from him I told him where to go and he did and now I don't have them parcels. I wasn't gonna put anything about this on here bought this has gone far enough I'm also cancelling my subscription to Amazon as soon as I get all my videos and pictures backed up elsewhere... Very poor company and they do NOTHING to help ( exept refund) but it's the principal.. I've had it with them...",2023-07-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,3.0,1338,247,22,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wasnt going make complaint amazon talking like hitting head brick wall long story short live flat seven floor last year delivery driver continually leaving package downstairs dumped floor outside main door live place full thieving little folk like steal people package ive package go missing amazon automatically refunded fact put delivery information dont leave downstairs yet delivery people totally ignore leave package downstairs thieved sticky fingered little peep around two package due today absolutely chucking rain delivery person wouldnt even get van want go outside covid collect parcel told go dont parcel wasnt gonna put anything bought gone far enough im also cancelling subscription amazon soon get video picture backed elsewhere poor company nothing help exept refund principal ive,0.01572627845169192,0.9842737215483081,0.13853056646102074,0.2,0.8198429740663582,81.98429740663582,High Trust
