Raby Martin,/users/608b41282087f7001a924877,CA,7.0,2023-07-03 16:47:58+00:00,1.0,"Dear Amazon,sale used items for new items","Dear Amazon,I am writing to you today to express my concern about the recent trend of selling products as new on Amazon when they are actually used and open. I have personally experienced this issue on several occasions, and I am sure that many other customers have as well.In my most recent experience,I returns multiple items from Amazon. When I received my order package, were clearly used or open or broken. The packaging was open, and the product themselves were dirty and had scratches and broken on them. I was very disappointed, as I had expected to receive a brand new product if any other business would do that would be held responsible but amazon is above the lawThey are aloud to do falls advertisements I contacted Amazon customer service about this issue, and they were very helpful. They issued me a refund for the headphones, and they also told me that they would investigate the seller. However, I am concerned that this issue is not being taken seriously enough.I believe that it is unfair to sell products as new when they are actually used. This is especially true when the products are sold at a premium price. Customers who purchase these products are expecting to receive a brand new product, and they should not be misled.I urge Amazon to take this issue seriously and to take steps to prevent it from happening in the future. I believe that Amazon should require sellers to provide clear and accurate information about the condition of their products. Additionally, Amazon should have a system in place to investigate complaints about sellers who are selling used products as new.I appreciate your time and consideration. I hope that you will take my concerns seriously and that you will take steps to address this issue.Sincerely,Martin raby",2023-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,3.0,1768,300,41,7,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,dear amazoni writing today express concern recent trend selling product new amazon actually used open personally experienced issue several occasion sure many customer wellin recent experiencei return multiple item amazon received order package clearly used open broken packaging open product dirty scratch broken disappointed expected receive brand new product business would would held responsible amazon lawthey aloud fall advertisement contacted amazon customer service issue helpful issued refund headphone also told would investigate seller however concerned issue taken seriously enoughi believe unfair sell product new actually used especially true product sold premium price customer purchase product expecting receive brand new product misledi urge amazon take issue seriously take step prevent happening future believe amazon require seller provide clear accurate information condition product additionally amazon system place investigate complaint seller selling used product newi appreciate time consideration hope take concern seriously take step address issuesincerelymartin raby,0.006509731013923611,0.9934902689860764,0.16825574873808188,0.2,0.8303962842406546,83.03962842406546,High Trust
