Kelby,/users/6354bcde3b101900137e0b07,US,4.0,2023-07-02 17:03:58+00:00,2.0,What Happened to Amazon?,"I’ve always enjoyed using Amazon. I would get my packages on time and when there was an issue, customer service was always helpful. But recently, Amazon’s service has gone downhill, especially with shipping delays. I’ve notice more and more that my items have been delayed by 3-4 days (even longer) or I never get them at all. Or the item is marked as shipped, which pays the vendor and then it never moves. You track shipping and all it says is shipped or a label was made. In my opinion, Amazon is to blame even if it’s a third-party seller. Having them sell under Amazon means they represent Amazon and when it’s poor, Amazon is poor. I’ve been seeing A LOT complaints about shipping lately. Maybe Amazon needs to start listening and start fixing the issue.",2023-07-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,2.0,760,136,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’ve always enjoyed using amazon would get package time issue customer service always helpful recently amazon’s service gone downhill especially shipping delay i’ve notice item delayed day even longer never get item marked shipped pay vendor never move track shipping say shipped label made opinion amazon blame even it’s thirdparty seller sell amazon mean represent amazon it’s poor amazon poor i’ve seeing lot complaint shipping lately maybe amazon need start listening start fixing issue,0.011012847585247777,0.9889871524147522,0.07627593942793046,0.4,1.109748764092962,110.9748764092962,High Trust
