Mark,/users/649d9c70a6d20100132a8cc4,NL,1.0,2023-06-29 17:00:10+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service I've ever had.,"Worst customer service I've ever had.I've send in an item for repair which has some defects. 4 weeks further and I still hadn't received any mail concerning the return, so I contacted them. In the next 10 hours they send me 2 replies I would receive a refund in the next two weeks for the item returned for repair and they would pay it to the original payment method. Fast forward 2 weeks further and I still hadn't received my refund so I contact them again. Apparently they couldn't identify a payment method, I added a new payment method to my Amazon account and they told me they would be paying it back there in the next 7 days. 1,5 week later I still didn't receive a refund, so I contacted them again. They still weren't able to identify a payment method which I find odd because I also had an amazon prime subscription on the same account. I removed it and added it again. 7 days later still no refund nor any reply once again. So I contacted them again they now said my products warranty was expired (it did expire in that week). The only reason my warranty was expired was because of their slow and lacking customer service and they told me they won't be able to pay it back. I've send an email again afterwards and they told me they didn't notice there was a case concerning the return. Apparantly the employees closed the case.A few weeks later and I still haven't received a refund nor I received the item I've send in for return. Truly the worst customer service I've ever had.",2023-04-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,29.0,1491,277,37,6,82.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,worst customer service ive ever hadive send item repair defect week still hadnt received mail concerning return contacted next hour send reply would receive refund next two week item returned repair would pay original payment method fast forward week still hadnt received refund contact apparently couldnt identify payment method added new payment method amazon account told would paying back next day week later still didnt receive refund contacted still werent able identify payment method find odd also amazon prime subscription account removed added day later still refund reply contacted said product warranty expired expire week reason warranty expired slow lacking customer service told wont able pay back ive send email afterwards told didnt notice case concerning return apparantly employee closed casea week later still havent received refund received item ive send return truly worst customer service ive ever,0.0017933374261516763,0.9982066625738483,0.15535614133482895,0.2,0.8301745595538899,83.01745595538898,High Trust
Lisette Barroso,/users/5cdc730594dddbe5418b9f8d,US,5.0,2023-06-29 16:21:58+00:00,1.0,Amazon does not have your back,"I ordered an item that I did a return on before it arrived.  The 3rd party seller refused to give me my refund saying when they received the item back it was so damaged it had to be thrown out.  They never received the item.  It arrived at my house shortly after in perfect condition.  I've been fighting with Amazon over my refund.  I keep hearing ""We've got your back"" and ""You're going to get your refund in 24-48 hours"".  It's been over a month and I'm still fighting with them to get my refund.  What do they say?  ""We've got your back""  Bullsh*t",2023-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,29.0,551,104,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item return arrived rd party seller refused give refund saying received item back damaged thrown never received item arrived house shortly perfect condition ive fighting amazon refund keep hearing weve got back youre going get refund hour month im still fighting get refund say weve got back bullsht,0.019526022573994516,0.9804739774260055,0.05832865956253505,0.2,0.8019027206255097,80.19027206255097,High Trust
R Gurung,/users/649d6437e4b8c60012c99be0,HK,1.0,2023-06-29 13:00:16+00:00,1.0,"Normally great, now completely awful","DIFFERENT AMAZON CUSTOMER SERVICE GUYS, COMPLETELY DIFFERENT SETS OF INSTRUCTION!!!Normally, Amazon is alright for me. I don’t have to pay for shipping when I want to return any products I buy from there. Also, returning is normally quite easy and only takes at the very least 15-20 mins. I end up getting a full refund a few days after sending the products.However, when I recently tried to return a defective product, I was told that I HAD to pay for SHIPPING to return. Fortunately, they said I would get a refund for that as well. I went to the nearest local mail service point. They told me they could not accept it as it contained batteries.I contacted Amazon and a representative told me that I had to return it by UPS and that I couldn’t do so by any other way, even though I had used only the local mail service and DHL to return Amazon products in the past. Like I had mentioned earlier, I had to pay for shipping. I had no idea how much shipping would be but I didn’t really care. The closest UPS store is pretty far from where I live unlike the local mail courier and DHL so imagine my disappointment when I’m told that I needed a tracking number. I already had the other papers like the shipping labels which I had always used to return Amazon products and nothing else. In addition, that Amazon representative told me that all that I had was all I needed..I contact Amazon again and it takes 20-30 mins this time to get a response. Again, another Amazon representative told me that I COULD return by DHL. So I went to a DHL store.The guy at the DHL store told me I needed a label if I wanted to ship for free(I always received that whenever I wanted to return an Amazon product and I could return for free) but that was the one thing I did not get from Amazon for the first time. An Amazon sales rep did say that I would have to pay for shipping but I wasn’t told how much it would be. The DHL guy told me it would cost TWICE as much as the cost I had paid for the product. That would mean that I would have to pay for absolutely nothing but stress and travelling and some transport costs..I contacted Amazon for the last time. A different sales rep told me that she felt sorry for all the trouble I had gone through just for this and told me that I no longer had to return the product and I would still get a refund.Will see if I actually get a refund like last time or not..If I do, I’ll change this to 2 stars instead.",2023-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,29.0,2435,468,36,5,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,different amazon customer service guy completely different set instructionnormally amazon alright don’t pay shipping want return product buy also returning normally quite easy take least min end getting full refund day sending productshowever recently tried return defective product told pay shipping return fortunately said would get refund well went nearest local mail service point told could accept contained batteriesi contacted amazon representative told return ups couldn’t way even though used local mail service dhl return amazon product past like mentioned earlier pay shipping idea much shipping would didn’t really care closest ups store pretty far live unlike local mail courier dhl imagine disappointment i’m told needed tracking number already paper like shipping label always used return amazon product nothing else addition amazon representative told neededi contact amazon take min time get response another amazon representative told could return dhl went dhl storethe guy dhl store told needed label wanted ship freei always received whenever wanted return amazon product could return free one thing get amazon first time amazon sale rep say would pay shipping wasn’t told much would dhl guy told would cost twice much cost paid product would mean would pay absolutely nothing stress travelling transport costsi contacted amazon last time differe