Ron Wischer,/users/6498bd249d2e98001139f49c,US,1.0,2023-06-26 00:18:24+00:00,1.0,The lack of US customer service ...,"The lack of US customer service is a bad thing. When spending US dollars to purchase an item, I want a US rep to take care of my problem. Until now, I've been quite satisfied with all my many purchases. Now I received an order that was shorted merchandise. Had to try to understand an out of country service rep which was near to impossible. I gave up, and figured I'd do an email. No Way !!Tried every email address I could find on the net ( of course there's no Amazon email address to be found on their site ) and every one I sent came back ""You have contacted an non response email address"".So after I find Amazon has NO direct email address and NO direct US customer service phone number, I decided to check out other resources.RTW",2023-06-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,26.0,736,140,35,7,2.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,lack u customer service bad thing spending u dollar purchase item want u rep take care problem ive quite satisfied many purchase received order shorted merchandise try understand country service rep near impossible gave figured id email way tried every email address could find net course there amazon email address found site every one sent came back contacted non response email addressso find amazon direct email address direct u customer service phone number decided check resourcesrtw,0.1690317847822536,0.8309682152177464,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.7311879774910941,73.1187977491094,Medium Trust
