Alex T.,/users/5cbdaaed94fc46b458bcf2e0,IT,14.0,2023-06-25 10:43:55+00:00,1.0,Intimidating message from Amazon with no reason,"I have been a customer of Amazon for at least five years if not more. I bought dozens of items from these gentlemen for a few thousand euros in value. On March 3, 2023, I bought an inexpensive screwdriver drill (Amazon order number # 402-7269180-7579518) worth 54.99 euros (cheap). After a few days of use, one of the two rechargeable batteries stopped working. After having obtained the guarantee in chat from an Amazon operator that I could return an already used item, I requested and obtained the return, sending the item on June 6, 2023, even if the item only reached Amazon on June 19. On June 23 I receive the following email from Amazon:""Good morning,We are contacting you to inform you that we have processed your recent return of the article TEENO Cordless Screwdriver 21V, 2 Speed ​​Cordless Drill, 2 Lithium Batteries 1.5Ah, Fast Charge in 1 Hour, 20 Accessories Included (Drill an in the order n. 402-7269180-7579518.The item was returned in a condition that does not comply with our return policies. On this occasion, we have processed a refund for the order. However, if your returns continue to violate our policies, we may not issue further refunds or we may apply returns condition fees.To review our return policies, please see the About Our Returns Policy page:We will inform you if similar cases occur in the future.Account SpecialistAmazon. it""Aside from the semi-intimidating tone of the email, the email came to me with no reason why my returned item violated Amazon policies. The signature of whoever wrote the message is also missing and it doesn't seem correct to me. Perhaps it would be too much to ask for two specific words in the message?! And maybe even accompanying photos?! Why Amazon allows certain tones with its customers?! And why doesn't he document his motivations?Years and years of even very expensive purchases and now they send me threatening messages! What a disappointment...",2023-06-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,25.0,1921,321,47,7,2.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,customer amazon least five year bought dozen item gentleman thousand euro value march bought inexpensive screwdriver drill amazon order number worth euro cheap day use one two rechargeable battery stopped working obtained guarantee chat amazon operator could return already used item requested obtained return sending item june even item reached amazon june june receive following email amazongood morningwe contacting inform processed recent return article teeno cordless screwdriver v speed ​​cordless drill lithium battery ah fast charge hour accessory included drill order n item returned condition comply return policy occasion processed refund order however return continue violate policy may issue refund may apply return condition feesto review return policy please see return policy pagewe inform similar case occur futureaccount specialistamazon itaside semiintimidating tone email email came reason returned item violated amazon policy signature whoever wrote message also missing doesnt seem correct perhaps would much ask two specific word message maybe even accompanying photo amazon allows certain tone customer doesnt document motivationsyears year even expensive purchase send threatening message disappointment,0.7888660919875579,0.21113390801244214,0.18003365114974762,0.2,0.4415736842361706,44.15736842361706,Low Trust
