Myola Z,/users/647635b2ba66350012867292,GB,3.0,2023-06-24 20:34:34+00:00,3.0,Parcel never arrived. Although full refund given when requested.,"I ordered an Amazon Fire stick. It was supposed to be delivered on 6th June 2023.I received an delivery confirmation on email. It stated the parcel had been delivered at reception. This is somewhat suspect because there is no reception area or anywhere safe to leave it, except with a neighbour. It wasn’t left with one of them. I enquired about this on Amazon chat. To be told the delivery status was updated too early. Strange… Apologies were given and the new delivery date was 8th of June 2023.Surprise, surprise…the parcel still didn’t arrive on 8th June. I called Amazon customer service and informed them about this. The customer advisor stated they need to speak to their manager. I explained they are in breach of contract the goods never arrived and funds have been taken. I asked for a full refund.To be fair, after the advisor had spoke to their boss. They stated I would have a refund in up to 5 working days. They also told me I could keep the items if they arrived. Of course, the items never arrived.I received a confirmation email of my refund being processed. Thankfully, I received a full refund including the postage and packaging I paid for too. Despite the initial frustration to start with, I’m happy I got a hassle free refund experience. Although, I am somewhat reluctant to order from Amazon incase a parcel doesn’t arrive again.",2023-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,24.0,1355,237,64,9,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered amazon fire stick supposed delivered th june received delivery confirmation email stated parcel delivered reception somewhat suspect reception area anywhere safe leave except neighbour wasn’t left one enquired amazon chat told delivery status updated early strange… apology given new delivery date th june surprise surprise…the parcel still didn’t arrive th june called amazon customer service informed customer advisor stated need speak manager explained breach contract good never arrived fund taken asked full refundto fair advisor spoke bos stated would refund working day also told could keep item arrived course item never arrivedi received confirmation email refund processed thankfully received full refund including postage packaging paid despite initial frustration start i’m happy got hassle free refund experience although somewhat reluctant order amazon incase parcel doesn’t arrive,0.020117484259101745,0.9798825157408982,0.13292204150308468,0.6,1.4165256661710661,141.6525666171066,High Trust
