Stephen,/users/649520c5d23a1b0012fe52c8,US,1.0,2023-06-23 06:42:53+00:00,1.0,Amazon has REPEATEDLY FAILED to rectify…,"Amazon has REPEATEDLY FAILED to rectify the problem of failed deliveries for several weeks now. Mind you, even the photos that the drivers take showing misdeliveries don't seem to move Amazon in the right direction. In one situation, one misdelivered *private* order had been mysteriously removed from the box, and the item appeared by itself (no box in sight) for the whole neighborhood to see. Another disconcerting things is that Amazon is now asking the customers to go outside and look for the misdelivered package themselves. Can Amazon guarantee that their customers are going to be safe by doing this? Especially in today's world where most people don't know the character of most of their neighbors? We've been customers of Amazon's for years, and up until recently, we've never had this issue.",2023-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,23.0,803,132,40,6,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon repeatedly failed rectify problem failed delivery several week mind even photo driver take showing misdeliveries dont seem move amazon right direction one situation one misdelivered private order mysteriously removed box item appeared box sight whole neighborhood see another disconcerting thing amazon asking customer go outside look misdelivered package amazon guarantee customer going safe especially today world people dont know character neighbor weve customer amazon year recently weve never issue,0.010165014556435254,0.9898349854435647,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.8097239986107335,80.97239986107336,High Trust
