H R,/users/6493676521fbb80012cdb27e,US,1.0,2023-06-21 23:12:10+00:00,1.0,I've just come to hate the Amazon…,"I've just come to hate the Amazon Business model. I ordered a tablet on June 13 and still haven't received it! If you aren't on Amazon Prime and you choose the free shipping, then JUST FORGET IT! Amazon makes no effort to get your order to you in a timely manner! Since I ordered my tablet, an Amazon truck has been down my street at least 15 times and could have easily brought my order! Instead, they chose to send it USPS. Such lamebrains! USPS shows they never received it, and I believe it. You check the routing number:9361289670021256517671Is there anyone to call in customer service? NO. Does the chatbot help? NO, they just repeat what is already stated on the website. My recourse? I can get my money back tomorrow. I don't want my money back, I want the tablet I ordered!If they sent it USPS, then it's their problem that my tablet didn't get here. Well, no, actually it is mine. Amazon will take no further action on their own. They don't care if I received my item or not. I'm the one who has to take action, not Amazon.The credit card should be billed after the product is received. Then they would pay better attention and make sure the product is shipped in a way that gets it to the customer.Jeff, you need to come back down of your spaceship and do something about this Jassy guy before he destroys the company you created...",2023-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,21.0,1343,247,34,7,1.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,ive come hate amazon business model ordered tablet june still havent received arent amazon prime choose free shipping forget amazon make effort get order timely manner since ordered tablet amazon truck street least time could easily brought order instead chose send usps lamebrains usps show never received believe check routing numberis anyone call customer service chatbot help repeat already stated website recourse get money back tomorrow dont want money back want tablet orderedif sent usps problem tablet didnt get well actually mine amazon take action dont care received item im one take action amazonthe credit card billed product received would pay better attention make sure product shipped way get customerjeff need come back spaceship something jassy guy destroys company created,0.9882794531193073,0.011720546880692684,0.13853056646102074,0.2,0.33356638673255046,33.35663867325505,Low Trust
Erica,/users/6470d17779c0be0012a90721,BR,2.0,2023-06-21 22:13:06+00:00,1.0,AMAZON MADE ME PURCHASE A PRODUCT SAYIN ID HAVE THE REFUND AND IS NOW REFUSING TO DO SO,"AMAZON UK I bought an Alexa and asked for it to be delivered to my place. If I wasnt at home it should be delivered to my next-door neighbour. However, the product was delivered to my door and got lost. I informed Amazon and they locked the device. Several months later, another neighbor from down the road told me he had my parcel. Immediately I contacted Amazon as I now had a device without any purpose as it was locked. Amazon couldnt activate the device anymore. But the attendant instructed me to purchase another one (Full price - and I'd purchased it for half price) and I'd get the full refund on it as soon as it was delivered. I got an email informing me that this would be the procedure. Therefore I purchased it and got it delivered to my friend's house as I am not even living in the UK anymore - he'd give it to me when we meet again. As soon as it was delivered I contacted Amazon asking for the refund. For SEVERAL times amazon said that it was being processed, and then asked me to now contact my bank to understand what was the issue. When contacting my bank, they told me they couldnt see any refund being processed and asked for the track number of the refund. I went back to amazon chat and asked for it. It took days to get back to me - as they said they had to ask for the specialized team. Then they sent me an email simply saying that the refund wasnt authorised. When I contacted Amazon about it they ratified the last message, saying that I wouldnt receive any refund, EVEN THOUGH their attendant INSTRUCTED me to purchase this product. Now I only have 6 days to return it, and my friend is not even in London to return this product. And I was short in almost 70 pounds for a month waiting on the refund of a product I would never pay the full price.It honestly seems that amazon made a fool out of me to increase their sales.shame on amazon. I want my refund as promised.",2023-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,21.0,1900,363,87,18,24.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon uk bought alexa asked delivered place wasnt home delivered nextdoor neighbour however product delivered door got lost informed amazon locked device several month later another neighbor road told parcel immediately contacted amazon device without purpose locked amazon couldnt activate device anymore attendant instructed purchase another one full price id purchased half price id get full refund soon delivered got email informing would procedure therefore purchased got delivered friend house even living uk anymore hed give meet soon delivered contacted amazon asking refund several time amazon said processed asked contact bank understand issue contacting bank told couldnt see refund processed asked track number refund went back amazon chat asked took day get back said ask specialized team sent email simply saying refund wasnt authorised contacted amazon ratified last message saying wouldnt receive refund even though attendant instructed purchase product day return friend even london return product short almost pound month waiting refund product would never pay full priceit honestly seems amazon made fool increase salesshame amazon want refund promised,0.002479417934604383,0.9975205820653956,0.2035894559730791,0.2,0.8394781822273136,83.94781822273136,High Trust
