Customer L,/users/5d66242448da2a2c31fa3f62,GB,41.0,2023-06-21 11:10:50+00:00,1.0,Amazon.....my god can you not get…,"Amazon.....my god can you not get anything right!?! I've spent so much money with them over the years and customer services have deteriorated as well as the telecoms system and site issues it is almost unusable!! I've got some terrible products to return, they are just not fit for purpose which had great reviews but just don't perform, I think this is probably because they pay people or give people incentives for reviews, so please look into products first before buying them. I didn't used to worry to much as when you got a bad product from Amazon you could return it which is why I've spent a fortune with them but just recently you can't get through to anybody or return anything. In fact for the last three weeks I've wasted days on the phone just to get cut off or more frustratingly the code errors, people reusing to help of transfer you to someone who might understand English and been in a job for more than a week. When your request callback it doesn't happen, then when you do get through to somebody they don't know what they're talking about because I've only been there for few days and every time they try and transfer to a manager they refuse 99% of the time, hang up or if they do pass you on to somebody you just get cut off. Even if you tell them that you've had hours of wasted time and spent half a day on the phone and been cut off umpteen times so please take my phone number down so you can call me back I get cut off but it doesn't happen. I've been waiting for a return to be picked up and it hasn't happened, this is now taken well over a week and there doesn't seem to be any progress with it. If that they can't even arrange for the return, they just say they've arrange for a callback and again that never happens... I've had so much time wasted hopeless products and terrible terrible customer service and terrible comms. They really do need to get their act together! Even if you click Amazon assistant from the Amazon site, you get a picture of a bloody dog which is no help at all so that link doesn't work. As well as the telephone line is not working with the codes that you have to put in getting refused and then customer services not know what to do. It's a complete joke and gone to the dogs. I've had days wasted and it's very stressful. I will try and shop anywhere else now apart from Amazon and I spent a lot of money with Amazon but I'm not going to have my stress levels are through the roof and my time wasted any further. Amazon get your act together your not performing at all, the only thing I now expect from you is bad products, a terrible website, customers services and coms that are the worst I've ever came across!! HOPELESS!!!!",2023-06-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,21.0,2689,509,34,6,2.0,0,11,1,0,Genuine,amazonmy god get anything right ive spent much money year customer service deteriorated well telecom system site issue almost unusable ive got terrible product return fit purpose great review dont perform think probably pay people give people incentive review please look product first buying didnt used worry much got bad product amazon could return ive spent fortune recently cant get anybody return anything fact last three week ive wasted day phone get cut frustratingly code error people reusing help transfer someone might understand english job week request callback doesnt happen get somebody dont know theyre talking ive day every time try transfer manager refuse time hang pas somebody get cut even tell youve hour wasted time spent half day phone cut umpteen time please take phone number call back get cut doesnt happen ive waiting return picked hasnt happened taken well week doesnt seem progress cant even arrange return say theyve arrange callback never happens ive much time wasted hopeless product terrible terrible customer service terrible comms really need get act together even click amazon assistant amazon site get picture bloody dog help link doesnt work well telephone line working code put getting refused customer service know complete joke gone dog ive day wasted stressful try shop anywhere else apart amazon spent lot money amazon im going stress level roof time wasted amazon get act together performing thing expect bad product terrible website customer service coms worst ive ever came across hopeless,0.9999948049863486,5.195013651371205e-06,0.2854739203589456,0.2,0.3570973815786148,35.70973815786148,Low Trust
