Michelle Martin,/users/634c2fd653fce90012895bd0,US,2.0,2023-06-20 21:34:23+00:00,1.0,Will soon delete my account,"I will be deleting my account with Amazon as soon as my extended warranty expires on a purchase I made. I purchased a loveseat cover for my mother. She lives 5 hours away. She was not able to come in on Mother’s Day, so I waited until we were able to go to her, which was not until June 8th due to a medical emergency. The cover didn’t stay in place as the description indicates. I packed it up neatly in the original packaging. When I returned home on June 10th I attempted to return it and it would not allow me to. I tried to get with customer service but it said to try later. It said try later for at least 3 days. Today I finally found the phone number and spoke to an agent. It took 22 minutes and two agents to tell me it was past the June 8th deadline and they couldn’t do anything for me. The agents were very nice. However offered no recourse. I would understand if I made a lot of returns in the past but I haven’t.",2023-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,20.0,927,186,27,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,deleting account amazon soon extended warranty expires purchase made purchased loveseat cover mother life hour away able come mother’s day waited able go june th due medical emergency cover didn’t stay place description indicates packed neatly original packaging returned home june th attempted return would allow tried get customer service said try later said try later least day today finally found phone number spoke agent took minute two agent tell past june th deadline couldn’t anything agent nice however offered recourse would understand made lot return past haven’t,0.02357469581013831,0.9764253041898617,0.10431856421761077,0.2,0.809076364938453,80.9076364938453,High Trust
Matt,/users/6491fee5d23a1b0012fc9b34,US,1.0,2023-06-20 21:33:24+00:00,1.0,I can no longer trust Amazon,"I can no longer trust Amazon - or maybe they've just hired a really useless driver.  For the second time, they have delivered what I ordered to the wrong address.  Another order that I placed, I was tracking.  The map showed that I was next in the queue.  Then, a further look showed the truck further away, and then gone.  This happened twice, did not recieve my package.  It happened again, with a different order, but the next day I received the package.  And of course, customer service is completely useless. I guess I'm going back to eBay for product purchases.  Still OK with Prime Video, though.",2023-06-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,20.0,603,107,28,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,longer trust amazon maybe theyve hired really useless driver second time delivered ordered wrong address another order placed tracking map showed next queue look showed truck away gone happened twice recieve package happened different order next day received package course customer service completely useless guess im going back ebay product purchase still ok prime video though,0.01884794291891912,0.9811520570810809,0.06001121704991587,0.2,0.8025782719505236,80.25782719505236,High Trust
