Johnnie Bostick,/users/63d1bdd97d10e200128f5ead,US,3.0,2023-06-19 00:22:21+00:00,1.0,On 4-01-23 my husband order a louver…,"On 4-01-23 my husband order a louver rear shade for my 2019 Chevrolet Camaro RS. Recently, at a reputable auto repair shop I went to have it installed. Ultimately, to my surprise it was the wrong one . The louver sent to me was for a Mustang. We contacted Amazon and the third party to get a return label and have been unsuccessful. Today, and on Thursday we spoke to a representative and supervisor. Both responses were they would send a email to the company. Well on Friday the representative sent the email and my husband responded. There shouldn’t be any other conversations between the customer and vendor. However, we should have had the return label and sent the product back and received a credit or refund. This is not customer service satisfaction at all. I am really disappointed in the lack of service. As a result, I shouldn’t been told to wait 48hrs either. I don’t have to wait for nothing when you have my money. Bad timing and terrible customer service I received today on Father’s Day!  Process our label and give us our money , that’s all we want . Learn how to respond and respect your paying customers!!!",2023-04-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,19.0,1125,202,37,7,79.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,husband order louver rear shade chevrolet camaro r recently reputable auto repair shop went installed ultimately surprise wrong one louver sent mustang contacted amazon third party get return label unsuccessful today thursday spoke representative supervisor response would send email company well friday representative sent email husband responded shouldn’t conversation customer vendor however return label sent product back received credit refund customer service satisfaction really disappointed lack service result shouldn’t told wait hr either don’t wait nothing money bad timing terrible customer service received today father’s day process label give u money that’s want learn respond respect paying customer,0.6472780500708953,0.35272194992910466,0.11329220415030847,0.2,0.499019415794614,49.9019415794614,Low Trust
Kamil,/users/5aca76ce4de5666d34d9baea,GB,8.0,2023-06-18 21:30:18+00:00,1.0,Just cancelled prime after 8 years,"Just cancelled prime after 8 yearsJust cancelled prime after 8 years. Bought mini pc, delivery date i see on ap you are next delivery i got windows from i can see road and doors. Van park driver on phone and after few secs he leaves and i see msg delivery attempted (message customer service). 2 days after (Sunday) i suppose to have different item delivered... same story delivery ''attempted'', i need to provide code for item won't be home next day (so i need to cancel). Massage to customer service again. Cs assistant ask me, do i have proof or witness that delivery was not attempted .. For real?? I said, I'm chatting with him 5 min after supposed to be delivery and my whole family is at home, wasn't sure he wants their testimony or what? Then he started mumbling that i should leave instructions for delivery, so i ask what instructions i was at home? Press doorbell? Then he answered that Amazon drivers can't press doorbells or knock on doors, as it would disturb privacy of customers, and that's why i can track delivery progress (so what i should wait in front door?). I lost it there guy from cs obviously have fun at my cost. Just cancelled prime, i think when they earn billions during covid, they simply stop caring. That whole thing was simply surreal.didn't even get email confirmation after that ''conversation.",2023-06-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,18.0,1332,236,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,cancelled prime yearsjust cancelled prime year bought mini pc delivery date see ap next delivery got window see road door van park driver phone sec leaf see msg delivery attempted message customer service day sunday suppose different item delivered story delivery attempted need provide code item wont home next day need cancel massage customer service c assistant ask proof witness delivery attempted real said im chatting min supposed delivery whole family home wasnt sure want