RE,/users/63f8d9f67a60510015d5681e,US,2.0,2023-06-18 15:40:27+00:00,1.0,I had been a long time customer of…,"I had been a long time customer of Amazon Prime.  I discontinued my membership about 4 months ago because very inconsistent shipping and policies to rectify the situation.  I was given a 30 fay free trial to try it once again, which I did.  I gave them a chance and ordered dog food for my puppy.  It said it would be delivered by Friday/Saturday, as I ordered it on Tuesday.  They charged my card which I only use a pre-paid card with them and only add enough to pay for the order in the event that what happened happens.  They charged the card successfully on the date the order was placed, but it did not ship.  They then attempted to make 3 more attempts at taking the same charged amount again all three times where of course, it was not available.  When I contacted customer service, they could only say they had not charged my card where I was looking at the charge which was today on 6.18.2023 still pending and will not be removed until they finalize a charge they claim they never made.  And the CS rep, had the audacity to tell me ""don't worry, we are not trying to keep your money.""  I will not be using them at all. They have become CONSISTENTLY INCONSISTENT and it is unacceptable.  Very few packages actually come overnight anymore, which was the main attraction for Prime in the beginning.  All you get is a message stating your delivery is going to be delayed, if they even plan to send it.",2023-06-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,18.0,1407,260,35,8,6.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,long time customer amazon prime discontinued membership month ago inconsistent shipping policy rectify situation given fay free trial try gave chance ordered dog food puppy said would delivered fridaysaturday ordered tuesday charged card use prepaid card add enough pay order event happened happens charged card successfully date order placed ship attempted make attempt taking charged amount three time course available contacted customer service could say charged card looking charge today still pending removed finalize charge claim never made c rep audacity tell dont worry trying keep money using become consistently inconsistent unacceptable package actually come overnight anymore main attraction prime beginning get message stating delivery going delayed even plan send,0.006868074615515234,0.9931319253844848,0.14582164890633764,0.2,0.8257302924735098,82.57302924735099,High Trust
Alex P,/users/611fa50dc3f11a0012c3ff3c,GB,2.0,2023-06-18 14:06:05+00:00,1.0,An insult to customer service everywhere,"I ordered an electrical item (for over £300). When the courier arrived it was a completely different item (garden shed). Amazon wouldn’t sort the error just told me to cancel and reorder. Went to reorder and the price had gone up £20 (scam much?!) Amazon offered to compensate, but the compensation wasn’t eligible for use on the item ordered! I reordered as requested and the courier has now failed to deliver two days in a row citing “technical errors”. I tried speaking to them on live chat and each time their staff say they can’t help and tell you to contact the courier, then they close the chat without warning. Now I am over £300 out of pocket, haven’t received the item and they are refusing to cancel or refund. Thank God I bought on credit card and can cancel the payment with my bank! Avoid Amazon at all costs.",2023-06-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,18.0,823,150,40,6,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,ordered electrical item £ courier arrived completely different item garden shed amazon wouldn’t sort error told cancel reorder went reorder price gone £ scam much amazon offered compensate compensation wasn’t eligible use item ordered reordered requested courier failed deliver two day row citing “technical errors” tried speaking live chat time staff say can’t help tell contact courier close chat without warning £ pocket haven’t received item refusing cancel refund thank god bought credit card cancel payment bank avoid amazon cost,0.7290886502206386,0.2709113497793614,0.08412787436904094,0.2,0.4522812497634889,45.22812497634889,Low Trust
