Michelle Buchan,/users/530c87c8000064000165dd63,GB,17.0,2023-06-16 19:37:57+00:00,1.0,Was delivered an item that was damaged…,"Was delivered an item that was damaged and defective.  I am disabled and recovering from major surgery.  Unless I can print off a returns label I cannot return it for a refund.  Not everyone possesses a printer, I don't even possess a computer but amazon are happy to leave a disabled customer with a defective item which they shouldn't be selling in the first place. They take your money quick enough but don't want to help you with a refund.",2023-06-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,16.0,443,80,39,7,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,delivered item damaged defective disabled recovering major surgery unless print return label cannot return refund everyone possesses printer dont even possess computer amazon happy leave disabled customer defective item shouldnt selling first place take money quick enough dont want help refund,0.019464927088600172,0.9805350729113999,0.044868199663488505,0.2,0.7992411763883976,79.92411763883976,High Trust
Cassie Winfield,/users/648c965338faa50012e0f99d,GB,4.0,2023-06-16 19:11:49+00:00,1.0,A company that only cares about the £,"Had a mixed bag of experiences until this year and now nothing goes right. An item you select for that day or next day delivery doesn't turn up or does but it's damaged or missing a whole load of stuff. Amazon, a company that is supposed to make your life that bit easier, has caused me nothing but stress and amped up my anxiety on the past 3 deliveries especially, even missing most of the first day of my first holiday in 8 years. The mental health and mobility awareness is nonexistent. Never using again.",2023-06-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,16.0,509,95,37,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,mixed bag experience year nothing go right item select day next day delivery doesnt turn damaged missing whole load stuff amazon company supposed make life bit easier caused nothing stress amped anxiety past delivery especially even missing first day first holiday year mental health mobility awareness nonexistent never using,0.00428317525846428,0.9957168247415357,0.0532809871003926,0.2,0.8085146097908463,80.85146097908464,High Trust
