terry newhart,/users/610ace784e30320012dea400,US,1.0,2023-06-15 06:21:46+00:00,1.0,Shady delivery practice,"14 june, Ordered a product this morning because it said it would be delivered this evening, went to Amazon to check on delivery, got the""oops your delivery is going to be late at 830 pm, and immediately got another message saying  ""carrier picked up package"" the carrier message was dated 15 June, (tomorrow)  The point of this is the receipt of the second message does not give you the opportunity to cancel of the pkg if you absolutely need it today. which I do., Not sure if it's Amazon or a contracted Carrier pulling this little scam , but putting both messages in at the same time is basically a shady way to not let you cancel an order, even though it says you can right in the oops it's going to be late message. Bottom line is the carrier picked up the  package and said oops, we can't deliver until tomorrow. So the Carrier gets paid and the consumer has to jump through hoops with amazon to try to get it staightened out. of course Amazon's answer is ""sorry it's already shipped nothing we can do"" but you can call us back tomorrow, after it has been delivered, after I am out of town.",2023-06-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,15.0,1096,205,23,3,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,june ordered product morning said would delivered evening went amazon check delivery got theoops delivery going late pm immediately got another message saying carrier picked package carrier message dated june tomorrow point receipt second message give opportunity cancel pkg absolutely need today sure amazon contracted carrier pulling little scam putting message time basically shady way let cancel order even though say right oops going late message bottom line carrier picked package said oops cant deliver tomorrow carrier get paid consumer jump hoop amazon try get staightened course amazon answer sorry already shipped nothing call u back tomorrow delivered town,0.04158336402502304,0.958416635974977,0.11497476163768929,0.2,0.8022032703150264,80.22032703150263,High Trust
