Ramos Family,/users/648a41c31c8a2e001236605c,US,1.0,2023-06-15 00:40:12+00:00,1.0,First of please understand one thing,"First of please understand one thing, I am not looking for someone to reach out and feed my continued lies such as what I am experiencing during Amazon Chat or phone calls.  I am hoping this will explain to Amazon that the only reason why they are as big as they are is their customer base. And we deserve better!I have been an Amazon Prime member for very many years. For most of that time, I have been very happy which is why I kept the membership. However, as of recent every purchase/order I place, especially those of the next day/one day variety, have not made it within the time frame posted on their product page. Only options for me are to wait and deal with it or request a refund. Which then requires me to take it to a facility to execute the return before I receive my credit or refund.During a recent interaction, I was told by the rep to visit my neighbors to see if the package was delivered to their home in error. Did I mention it was 9 PM?Part of the benefit of having the Prime account is provides members expedited shipping. If this has changed, why aren’t we being told and why do they continue to post on their website, next day or 1 day shipping?If they can’t hold up their end of the bargain, why should I?  At this point with everyone starting to set up online direct to consumer options, is Amazon the only place to shop?  Should I terminate my relationship with and cancel my Prime?",2023-06-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,15.0,1410,265,36,6,2.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,first please understand one thing looking someone reach feed continued lie experiencing amazon chat phone call hoping explain amazon reason big customer base deserve betteri amazon prime member many year time happy kept membership however recent every purchaseorder place especially next dayone day variety made within time frame posted product page option wait deal request refund requires take facility execute return receive credit refundduring recent interaction told rep visit neighbor see package delivered home error mention pmpart benefit prime account provides member expedited shipping changed aren’t told continue post website next day day shippingif can’t hold end bargain point everyone starting set online direct consumer option amazon place shop terminate relationship cancel prime,0.025477818557519617,0.9745221814424804,0.14862591138530568,0.2,0.8169862729983013,81.69862729983012,High Trust
