Tommy Anderson,/users/648761bfb441930011482289,US,2.0,2023-06-12 20:19:54+00:00,1.0,Amazon wasted a lot of my time,"Amazon wasted a lot of my time.  First of all, Amazon.com kept telling me that my password was wrong and it was right.  I have 2FA so I'm pretty safe, but Amazon made me change my password and THEN didn't recognize it for multiple tries.  Once I got on the site, I tried to use filters to find a monitor that was a specific size, had speakers, etc., and I got so many irrelevant choices that I wound up ordering a monitor I didn't want and had to return it.  About the only thing good was Amazon seemed to make it easy to return the monitor I didn't want, but I spent a whole work day trying to find it and then it's still not returned because UPS hasn't picked it up yet.  But they will, I suppose.",2023-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,12.0,699,138,30,7,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon wasted lot time first amazoncom kept telling password wrong right fa im pretty safe amazon made change password didnt recognize multiple try got site tried use filter find monitor specific size speaker etc got many irrelevant choice wound ordering monitor didnt want return thing good amazon seemed make easy return monitor didnt want spent whole work day trying find still returned ups hasnt picked yet suppose,0.009126869675067718,0.9908731303249323,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.8109160940463698,81.09160940463698,High Trust
