Tom Gair,/users/5dca7b53982b899c1a9020e1,GB,26.0,2023-06-12 16:54:40+00:00,1.0,If I could give less than a 1 star,"If I could give less than a 1 star, I would. Can't fault the drivers as they are courteous and only doing as they are told. This has been the worst delivery experience I've ever had. I chose to get my printer on Amazon because I thought that DPD would be delivering it. They are superb at giving a window time for deliveries and especially as I run a business, this is a great user experience. This time though, no DPD and no communication. Nobody told us when they would be coming on Friday and we assumed DPD would be delivering so when we got home and no parcel was there, we were surprised. Waited in two days and nobody came as promised. Asked this morning for an approximate time and was cut off the chat. This company is only interested in one thing- profits. Customer service isn't important. I'm voting with my pocket and saying to Amazon, get stuffed, never again will I use your garbage services",2023-06-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,12.0,906,168,34,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,could give less star would cant fault driver courteous told worst delivery experience ive ever chose get printer amazon thought dpd would delivering superb giving window time delivery especially run business great user experience time though dpd communication nobody told u would coming friday assumed dpd would delivering got home parcel surprised waited two day nobody came promised asked morning approximate time cut chat company interested one thing profit customer service isnt important im voting pocket saying amazon get stuffed never use garbage service,0.008060381798467776,0.9919396182015322,0.09422321929332586,0.2,0.8148144529594312,81.48144529594312,High Trust
Chelsea Kong,/users/64872853b44193001147fb32,CA,3.0,2023-06-12 16:31:42+00:00,2.0,Amazon is not helpful when it comes to…,"Amazon is not helpful when it comes to answering your questions. As author, they can be the worst to deal with. You ask them the same question three or more times and they copy and paste the answer before giving you more information. They give you 5 days to prove you own copyright over your own books especially those published on another website or you use public domain content. When using public domain, they will request you for a signed document to prove you have exclusive rights to use the materials freely. It took a whole day to change one book's content because of this requirement from them. Everything I gave them was not accepted as proof. The issue is there is no way to prove a public domain content version of the World English Bible to them. All the sites that I found says it is public domain. If there was a better place to publish with all their benefits, I would choose that one over them. I just like that I can still get royalties when people read my ebooks and they have ads to advertise your books. I can distribute globally and people buy my books there more than other platforms. Otherwise, I don't like them. They are troublesome to work with. I heard others complain about their author experience with them. They won't pay you for royalties you should have gained if the book page reads doesn't count them. You lose those royalties. They don't know how to do their job well or to be more considerate for the author's needs.",2023-06-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,12.0,1453,265,39,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon helpful come answering question author worst deal ask question three time copy paste answer giving information give day prove copyright book especially published another website use public domain content using public domain request signed document prove exclusive right use material freely took whole day change one book content requirement everything gave accepted proof issue way prove public domain content version world english bible site found say public domain better place publish benefit would choose one like still get royalty people read ebooks ad advertise book distribute globally people buy book platform otherwise dont like troublesome work heard others complain author experience wont pay royalty gained book page read doesnt count lose royalty dont know job well considerate author need,0.005906195663344844,0.9940938043366552,0.14862591138530568,0.4,1.1267720844453888,112.67720844453888,High Trust
Foster,/users/60d3357e45d061001a07e124,FR,5.0,2023-06-12 15:35:15+00:00,1.0,Amazon has the worst financial scam…,"Amazon has the worst financial scam practises , I ordered a UFC venum Hoodie it cost €200 they charged me €45 euro to deliver it within 2 to 8 days the purchase was made on 3 June today we are the 12th of June and I still haven't received my merchandise . This is the money scamming by these big corporate companies that they think we don't take into account, €45 down the toilet just so that Amazon CEO's can get richer, it is appalling .",2023-06-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,12.0,439,86,36,6,9.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon worst financial scam practises ordered ufc venum hoodie cost € charged € euro deliver within day purchase made june today th june still havent received merchandise money scamming big corporate company think dont take account € toilet amazon ceo get richer appalling,0.02851619070891268,0.9714838092910874,0.04823331463825014,0.2,0.7953885675731936,79.53885675731937,High Trust
Ruth B,/users/5cdd56e294dddb45e48c4482,GB,51.0,2023-06-12 12:13:07+00:00,1.0,If you want items quickly - shop elsewhere!,"For the second time in as many weeks, I have cancelled an order after having issues with ""Amazon Logistics"", Amazon's in-house 'courier' who were supposed to be delivering both the items in question. They don't give you a delivery window until you've already wasted half a day sitting indoors waiting for your item, and then they announce that they'll be delivering at a time when you're out of the house for something you can't cancel. I have my preferences set to ask that items be left with two specific neighbours if I am not at home, but the Amazon driver is always too lazy to do this, preferring instead to claim that they had difficulty delivering my item and that they will try again ""probably the next working day"". Sorry, but ""probably"" doesn't cut it when I need supplies for my craft business!",2023-06-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,12.0,806,143,43,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,second time many week cancelled order issue amazon logistics amazon inhouse courier supposed delivering item question dont give delivery window youve already wasted half day sitting indoors waiting item announce theyll delivering time youre house something cant cancel preference set ask item left two specific neighbour home amazon driver always lazy preferring instead claim difficulty delivering item try probably next working day sorry probably doesnt cut need supply craft business,0.13949781999902974,0.8605021800009702,0.08020190689848569,0.2,0.7462914713801821,74.62914713801821,Medium Trust
Dave,/users/5bf4fb95b340fe41de699b31,GB,4.0,2023-06-12 09:05:36+00:00,1.0,One time pass code is a failure delivery system,"I ordered 6 items to be delivered with my prime membership on the next day delivery. I was sent 3 separate emails with one time pass codes on for my items, i didn't realise the one time pass code would be the same for ALL the items. The driver arrived and gave me Amazon boxes and asked for my one time pass code, which i gave to him. When i opened them i realised there was one item missing. Within 4 minutes of the driver delivering my goods I requested a call back from Amazon customer support stating the driver didn't deliver one of my items. The lady told me it was on a different courier and it would arrive later so not to worry. I waited an hour and looked on the app, noticing it said delivered with said item. At this point i realised that all the goods had the same one time pass code, even though there was 5 different parcels total. I called Amazon again and was asked to wait 3 days as the driver might bring it back, so I did. When i called after 3 days explaining everything I was told ""sorry, it's saying delivered. You can't have a refund."" The item in question was £190 which I have lost. The customer service is shocking from a huge company like Amazon. I have been a long time prime member and have cancelled my account due to this. I will not be giving them another penny of my money after this shocking service. I would advise to look elsewhere for goods as at least you will receive them.",2023-06-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,12.0,1413,273,47,9,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered item delivered prime membership next day delivery sent separate email one time pas code item didnt realise one time pas code would item driver arrived gave amazon box asked one time pas code gave opened realised one item missing within minute driver delivering good requested call back amazon customer support stating driver didnt deliver one item lady told different courier would arrive later worry waited hour looked app noticing said delivered said item point realised good one time pas code even though different parcel total called amazon asked wait day driver might bring back called day explaining everything told sorry saying delivered cant refund item question £ lost customer service shocking huge company like amazon long time prime member cancelled account due giving another penny money shocking service would advise look elsewhere good least receive,0.007461215205351561,0.9925387847946484,0.1531127313516545,0.2,0.8268919386676551,82.6891938667655,High Trust
