Helene,/users/564d7b8f0000ff0001ebfb2a,ZA,9.0,2023-06-11 06:15:41+00:00,1.0,Amazon advertises items for sale at a…,"Amazon advertises items for sale at a good price. When you want to check out before submitting, suddenly additional charges are added: tax, shipping and handling plus delivery charges, although they advertise free delivery. In addition to this my account is under an incorrect name and it is extremely difficult to change that. Fortunately due to that error on their system my purchase was rejected. I’m relieved to notice that because I had good experience in the past. I regard myself as an ex Amazon client because I refuse to be ripped off.",2023-06-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,11.0,544,93,38,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon advertises item sale good price want check submitting suddenly additional charge added tax shipping handling plus delivery charge although advertise free delivery addition account incorrect name extremely difficult change fortunately due error system purchase rejected i’m relieved notice good experience past regard ex amazon client refuse ripped,0.016636676823435843,0.9833633231765642,0.05215928210880538,0.2,0.802113518010043,80.2113518010043,High Trust
