N Jones,/users/584c32e00000ff000a603b64,GB,19.0,2023-06-10 16:41:50+00:00,1.0,Frustrating returns policy; delivery fail,"Frustrating returns policy - made worse by repeatedly sending the wrong item. So bad you just want to scream.Keep getting the wrong item from Amazon (Schwarzkopf Vitamin B5 Hairspray instead of the Volume Lift, as listed). Clearly an inventory or listing issue.Amazon's arcane returns policy means it cannot be returned, even if it's wrong. Also, the byzantine customer service contact process means it takes forever to get in contact with Amazon. At the moment, because of a high volume of queries, I'm being directed back into the order returns process which only tells me, at the end, that this product is excluded from the policy!Maddening and at complete odds with Amazon's professed intent of making things easy for customers.Also, on the hottest day is the year so far, the delivery driver left it out in the baking sun, outside on the road where we're couldn't see it. They cannot have known what was in the package, but every other delivery driver manages to bring our packages to the door! Not impressed!",2023-06-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,10.0,1014,171,41,5,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,frustrating return policy made worse repeatedly sending wrong item bad want screamkeep getting wrong item amazon schwarzkopf vitamin b hairspray instead volume lift listed clearly inventory listing issueamazons arcane return policy mean cannot returned even wrong also byzantine customer service contact process mean take forever get contact amazon moment high volume query im directed back order return process tell end product excluded policymaddening complete odds amazon professed intent making thing easy customersalso hottest day year far delivery driver left baking sun outside road couldnt see cannot known package every delivery driver manages bring package door impressed,0.6867813428849759,0.31321865711502406,0.09590577678070668,0.2,0.47579048391365336,47.57904839136533,Low Trust
