MR Shaw,/users/59285b4a0000ff000a9cb73b,US,4.0,2023-06-09 07:45:05+00:00,1.0,Amazon is selling fake and counterfeit beauty products,"Amazon is selling fake and counterfeit products on its website and will not take responsibility for it. I bought a Jan Marini Research cleanser on Amazon. When I opened it, the seal was broken. The cleanser was watering and ineffective. There was no expiration date on the bottle. I immediately bought a bottle of the same cleanser from Jan Marini Research directly and the difference was unbelievable. The fake Amazon cleanser was almost colorless and watery, while the authentic cleanser was green and thick. The authentic cleanser also had a seal and an expiration date. When I contacted Amazon, they would take no responsibility and they recommended I contacted the fake manufacturer/distributor. Are they serious? How is this legal? Aren't there laws that prevent this from happening? Why is Amazon allowed to violate laws that would have other retailer fined or in jail?",2023-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,9.0,876,143,54,8,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon selling fake counterfeit product website take responsibility bought jan marini research cleanser amazon opened seal broken cleanser watering ineffective expiration date bottle immediately bought bottle cleanser jan marini research directly difference unbelievable fake amazon cleanser almost colorless watery authentic cleanser green thick authentic cleanser also seal expiration date contacted amazon would take responsibility recommended contacted fake manufacturerdistributor serious legal arent law prevent happening amazon allowed violate law would retailer fined jail,0.01632832856120643,0.9836716714387935,0.08020190689848569,0.2,0.8078762170990939,80.78762170990939,High Trust
oscarkarem,/users/643ff14f33691000148daf01,US,5.0,2023-06-09 07:29:14+00:00,1.0,New Amazon Forestick not better,"New Amazon Forestick not betterThe new model has preloaded Amazon apps.They eat up a lot of the memory. When I called Amazon to have them uninstall. They said preloads are not removal and just like Google and Samsung they chose to preload their software and thats that. The problem is that because they consume a lot of memory they prevent other apps from updating.  When you try to update Netflix or Max,. It tells you you need to manage your apps because you're out of space. I sometimes use a VPN to watch netlix content from Other countries, no longer on the new firestick. My VPN freezes and because i cant update , no VPN. There was almost 250mgs freed just with clearing the cache on the Amazon apps, but still not enough to update apps.  Amazon's solution is buy the expansion for memory.  So essentially they created a problem that requires you to buy, yet another product to fix the problem. But there is no way to keep the preload Amazon apps from also consuming the additional memory.  A little shady, but what you gonna do I guess.  Hppefully a comperitor will emerge that can capitalize on this crappy business practice. Kind of like Sony loosing their foothold on portable music devaces that allowed Apple to come in and dominate that field.  I definitely regret trading in my old firestick for $7.  Amazon, if you are going to flood the limited memory capacity for your apps, then increase the capacity front 5 gig to accommodate your desire to put apps on there that people don't want.  Other than That it's good?",2023-06-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,9.0,1530,272,31,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,new amazon forestick betterthe new model preloaded amazon appsthey eat lot memory called amazon uninstall said preloads removal like google samsung chose preload software thats problem consume lot memory prevent apps updating try update netflix max tell need manage apps youre space sometimes use vpn watch netlix content country longer new firestick vpn freeze cant update vpn almost mg freed clearing cache amazon apps still enough update apps amazon solution buy expansion memory essentially created problem requires buy yet another product fix problem way keep preload amazon apps also consuming additional memory little shady gonna guess hppefully comperitor emerge capitalize crappy business practice kind like sony loosing foothold portable music devaces allowed apple come dominate field definitely regret trading old firestick amazon going flood limited memory capacity apps increase capacity front gig accommodate desire put apps people dont want good,0.025222027266331635,0.9747779727336684,0.1525518788558609,0.2,0.8178993621380064,81.78993621380064,High Trust
