Monica Hanna,/users/6480b2605a123400122a660e,CA,1.0,2023-06-07 18:38:00+00:00,1.0,Disgusting service,"I had to speak with customer support to change the email address and phone number on my account as it was set up with his information and he is now deceased. Not a single representative could help me, I just kept getting put on hold and transferred to another agent. Each time I was transferred they would greet me by my deceased husband's name and I would have to explain the situation  all over again. Twice my phone call was disconnected. I phoned in 4 separate times to get assistance. I thought I was getting the issue resolved after the first phone call but after waiting a few days and no changes/updates, I tried phoning in to follow up to find out that nothing was started. This is not the first time I have had issues with customer support but it was the final straw for me. I will 100% be reporting my issues in more detail to the BBB. This is simply unacceptable.",2023-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,7.0,875,164,18,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,speak customer support change email address phone number account set information deceased single representative could help kept getting put hold transferred another agent time transferred would greet deceased husband name would explain situation twice phone call disconnected phoned separate time get assistance thought getting issue resolved first phone call waiting day changesupdates tried phoning follow find nothing started first time issue customer support final straw reporting issue detail bbb simply unacceptable,0.015585337855915945,0.984414662144084,0.09197980931015143,0.2,0.8106032929340723,81.06032929340724,High Trust
