Malcolm Agdoma,/users/5dd439c1ca95ac193d41b530,GB,7.0,2023-06-07 13:27:25+00:00,1.0,Amazon Services,"I have been with Amazon over 20 years and the service was good but is now almost non existent. As a prime member I have tolerated parcel left on my step although I am home and the door bell works, to items dropped between the hedge and the bins although I am home. I ordered an expensive item with next day prime delivery which didn't arrive and strangely the tracking on the item disappeared on the same day. Contacted customer service who were not that helpful as I wanted to know what went wrong as is my right to. I just got walls and obstacles with no straight answers. I found an email address to register my complaint and the fact that this cost me paying for the item a second time as well as having to book the carpenter for an extra day at a cost of £200.00. their response was to say that I should have waited for the item to arrive before using the carpenter's services and offering me a five pound voucher. As a provider of a service which is paid for monthly by me that delivery date is in effect a contract to deliver and therefore their responsibility. I am appalled by their blatant contempt of their customers but not actually surprised. I did however highlight to them that as crap as AliExpress is they now offer a better customer service. Seriously rethinking of using their service going forward. There is only so far you can push people",2023-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,7.0,1359,253,15,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon year service good almost non existent prime member tolerated parcel left step although home door bell work item dropped hedge bin although home ordered expensive item next day prime delivery didnt arrive strangely tracking item disappeared day contacted customer service helpful wanted know went wrong right got wall obstacle straight answer found email address register complaint fact cost paying item second time well book carpenter extra day cost £ response say waited item arrive using carpenter service offering five pound voucher provider service paid monthly delivery date effect contract deliver therefore responsibility appalled blatant contempt customer actually surprised however highlight crap aliexpress offer better customer service seriously rethinking using service going forward far push people,0.010587547983374142,0.9894124520166259,0.14189568143578238,0.2,0.8230853622954694,82.30853622954693,High Trust
