emma ryan,/users/60e73fb034ec50001294a1f8,US,32.0,2023-06-06 23:00:36+00:00,1.0,They do nothing to prevent scams,"They have no concern for customers being scammed.  I've been let down repeatedly by their customer service in the past, but today takes the cake.  I reported a clear scam and they literally did not care, the first seller gave me completely irrelevant information and marked my issue as resolved and the second had no concern for taking the listing down, she just claimed that the seller ""probably hadn't updated it"".  If you think this company cares about you at all, they do not.  And for the love of god do not order from Werycos, they will send a tracking number, never ship the package, claim it got lost, tell you the item is out of stock, meanwhile they still have it listed online.",2023-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,6.0,688,124,32,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,concern customer scammed ive let repeatedly customer service past today take cake reported clear scam literally care first seller gave completely irrelevant information marked issue resolved second concern taking listing claimed seller probably hadnt updated think company care love god order werycos send tracking number never ship package claim got lost tell item stock meanwhile still listed online,0.024423123154317338,0.9755768768456826,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.8016975803185228,80.16975803185228,High Trust
