Kevin Navarro,/users/644b106c192d6f001378dd22,US,3.0,2023-06-06 09:08:11+00:00,1.0,BOYCOTT and Cancel Amazon Prime Memberships,"The worst customer service in the industry. Steven, Franz, and LeiLei provided a poor customer experience with a lack of resolution skills. Specifically, Steven, the SUPERVISOR, provided even worse customer service than the agent's and HUNG UP the phone call on me. Overall, Amazon supplies  heavily overpriced items, poor customer service, and the delivery execution is inconsistent. At this point, having Amazon Prime causes more headaches and is virtually useless as their is essentially no benefits to being a member in shopping and customer experience.",2023-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,6.0,557,85,43,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,worst customer service industry steven franz leilei provided poor customer experience lack resolution skill specifically steven supervisor provided even worse customer service agent hung phone call overall amazon supply heavily overpriced item poor customer service delivery execution inconsistent point amazon prime cause headache virtually useless essentially benefit member shopping customer experience,0.024052161396640192,0.9759478386033598,0.04767246214245653,0.2,0.7975084117301713,79.75084117301712,High Trust
Cathy Eldridge,/users/60649eeb631c39001a045920,US,13.0,2023-06-05 22:44:17+00:00,1.0,Boycott Amazon,"Amazon does not stand behind their warranty products... i.e. garden power tools.  I purchased (3) different garden tools over a period of time and all (3) are junk!!  Amazon is fine for an ink cartridge or bottle of supplements but don't rely on them for major purchases.  I have boycotted Amazon for the past 2 months (after spending $2,000 in the first quarter) and I don't miss them.  I prefer Walmart for online shopping and I buy as much as I can in stores where I can actually see what I am buying.",2023-06-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,5.0,504,93,14,2,4.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,amazon stand behind warranty product ie garden power tool purchased different garden tool period time junk amazon fine ink cartridge bottle supplement dont rely major purchase boycotted amazon past month spending first quarter dont miss prefer walmart online shopping buy much store actually see buying,0.3077732526497104,0.6922267473502897,0.05215928210880538,0.2,0.6565452300969058,65.65452300969058,Medium Trust
customer,/users/62c036adeca83c00147a0728,US,4.0,2023-06-05 22:41:16+00:00,1.0,Worst company ever,"Worst company ever, said delivered a package was empty nothing in it. Second time this has happened. Refuse to refund my money. Will never ever use Amazon again. They are Horrible!! Treat your customers better, or soon you wont have any!!",2023-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,5.0,238,41,18,3,8.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,worst company ever said delivered package empty nothing second time happened refuse refund money never ever use amazon horrible treat customer better soon wont,0.9526976559967255,0.04730234400327449,0.022994952327537857,0.2,0.3282501624671448,32.825016246714476,Low Trust
Denice Richards,/users/647e0f48b9257a001223da26,US,6.0,2023-06-05 21:20:18+00:00,1.0,Amazon is NOT giving refunds,"Amazon is a sneaky cheat!  I have been returning some items and Amazon states I get a refund BUT that is not what is happening, it is going to CREDIT towards future purchases.  This IS NOT a refund.  So, I am forced to still pay the credit card PLUS interest and the return is credited to future purchases.  This is false advertising and blatant misrepresentation.  Credit is NOT a refund.  If you read the return options, Amazon states three return options:  1. Replace with the exact same item 2) Refund to your Amazon account balance and 3) in a lighter color so you think it is a link - is Refund to your AmazonPLCC ending in XXXX.  You have to choose option 3 or it will not go back as a refund.  Option 2) will give you credits for future purchases, even though it states 'refund' you do NOT get a refund!!! If you used your Amazon/Synchrony credit card, you do NOT have an Amazon Account Balance!!!!  You have a Credit Card Balance!  AND!!! If you choose a drop off at Kohl's to 'keep more trucks off the road' it automatically gives you a credit and NOT a refund (per customer service)!!  You have to choose UPS even though that is not as convenient! Misdirection, misrepresentation and total lies.  No one in their right mind would buy items they can't get a refund for!!  Everyone should be aware of this sneaky scam by Amazon!",2023-05-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,5.0,1337,244,28,5,23.0,0,18,1,0,Genuine,amazon sneaky cheat returning item amazon state get refund happening going credit towards future purchase refund forced still pay credit card plus interest return credited future purchase false advertising blatant misrepresentation credit refund read return option amazon state three return option replace exact item refund amazon account balance lighter color think link refund amazonplcc ending xxxx choose option go back refund option give credit future purchase even though state refund get refund used amazonsynchrony credit card amazon account balance credit card balance choose drop kohl keep truck road automatically give credit refund per customer service choose ups even though convenient misdirection misrepresentation total lie one right mind would buy item cant get refund everyone aware sneaky scam amazon,0.9999999998587474,1.4125256520003404e-10,0.13684800897363994,0.2,0.32736960186535424,32.73696018653543,Low Trust
