Boating in WI,/users/647e0125b9257a001223d117,US,1.0,2023-06-05 17:37:49+00:00,1.0,Amazon Warehouse does not check the returned items they sell  you,"During the winter I planned to redo my boat's sound system.  Saw Amazon had some Used but Like New speakers for $50.00 less than brand new ones.  Ordered them, they arrived.  I opened the box and saw the speaker grills and some speakers inside. Figured I was good.  Recently went to install them only to find no directions, no mounting hardware, no wires, missing one set of the speaker grills AND the speakers were some old used ones, not the even the model I ordered.  And one of those is broken.  I really thought Amazon was supposed to check these over before listing them as Used but Like New.  Talked to Customer Service and was basically told to take it up with the Seller as it was there problem.  I told her if she checks the order, Amazon was the seller.  She responded ""then there is nothing I can do for you.""  End of discussion.",2023-05-31 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,5.0,841,155,65,11,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,winter planned redo boat sound system saw amazon used like new speaker less brand new one ordered arrived opened box saw speaker grill speaker inside figured good recently went install find direction mounting hardware wire missing one set speaker grill speaker old used one even model ordered one broken really thought amazon supposed check listing used like new talked customer service basically told take seller problem told check order amazon seller responded nothing end discussion,0.010108963149077487,0.9898910368509225,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.8123319457950631,81.2331945795063,High Trust
