Zahra Smit,/users/5f1698a862caa74b2f94b9b9,NL,2.0,2023-06-05 13:15:33+00:00,1.0,Price difference not refunded,"I placed an order for a dress. Upon receiving it,  I discovered I received a completely different item than what I ordered. I then spoke to an associate who said it could not be exchanged but I could place a new order with express shipping. Then the price difference of express shipping and sale (the item was on sale when I bought it) would also be refunded. Logical since this was not my fault nor responsibility. I made a copy of the chat where they promised this. After multiple weeks and I think 7 times contacting them about this whole order, I still haven’t received the price difference back!! Multiple things went wrong with the order and I contacted them three times about not receiving the price difference back. Two of the three times the associate again promised the refund was being processed and I should receive it within 3-5 days. Now today another associate (Asad) said they can only offer store credit!!!! So first of all: three associates promised a refund in money of the price difference. Where the first even emphasized to use express shipping since the whole thing was not my fault. 2. The mistake of receiving a completely different item should not affect the customer anymore than it already has 3. The amazon associates are completely incompetent since they cannot even read the chats properly and you have to explain the situation again and again4. I expect my money back and not some store credit which I dont use, especially not now. It’s common sense that when a store (independent sellers or not) makes a mistake, they fix it and the customer should not have to suffer or pay extra for it. Moreover, the response of the last associate was absolutely ridiculous.Be warned if you order at Amazon!",2023-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,5.0,1726,302,29,4,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,placed order dress upon receiving discovered received completely different item ordered spoke associate said could exchanged could place new order express shipping price difference express shipping sale item sale bought would also refunded logical since fault responsibility made copy chat promised multiple week think time contacting whole order still haven’t received price difference back multiple thing went wrong order contacted three time receiving price difference back two three time associate promised refund processed receive within day today another associate asad said offer store credit first three associate promised refund money price difference first even emphasized use express shipping since whole thing fault mistake receiving completely different item affect customer anymore already amazon associate completely incompetent since cannot even read chat properly explain situation expect money back store credit dont use especially it’s common sense store independent seller make mistake fix customer suffer pay extra moreover response last associate absolutely ridiculousbe warned order amazon,0.9987297258765933,0.001270274123406745,0.1693774537296691,0.2,0.3345106278076372,33.45106278076372,Low Trust
Ian Styles,/users/5491afc800006400019e4ea4,GB,39.0,2023-06-05 12:56:03+00:00,1.0,Shockingly poor,"Can’t give 0 stars. So my partner had a delivery not fulfilled last week for no reason at all. I had a delivery due yesterday and the driver marked it down as delivered when it wasn’t. Complained and had a phone call from Rahul from the executives dept who assured me if I reordered I would get it today. I reordered, along with 2 more items and get an email today saying the driver couldn’t find my address although they have been delivering to me for over 2.5 years. Went on chat and although they gave been delivering ok for 2.5 years they wanted me to give them google maps coordinates. Complained again and had a phone call from Ben at the local logistics hub who was polite and stated redelivery today. Then had a phone call from an Indian woman in another logistics  hub who seemed to find my annoyance amusing and stated delivery today or tomorrow I assume Amazon is using a new delivery company and their driver can’t use Sat nav, Google maps or whatever they use.Have lodged further complaints about their service and this womanAmazon, sort your deliveries and customer service out. I’ve been a prime member for years",2023-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,5.0,1127,203,15,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,can’t give star partner delivery fulfilled last week reason delivery due yesterday driver marked delivered wasn’t complained phone call rahul executive dept assured reordered would get today reordered along item get email today saying driver couldn’t find address although delivering year went chat although gave delivering ok year wanted give google map coordinate complained phone call ben local logistics hub polite stated redelivery today phone call indian woman another logistics hub seemed find annoyance amusing stated delivery today tomorrow assume amazon using new delivery company driver can’t use sat nav google map whatever usehave lodged complaint service womanamazon sort delivery cus