Chris Bashford,/users/5e4ab9b9878fee0435c27e26,GB,3.0,2023-06-05 10:04:53+00:00,1.0,"One day delivery, not always happening","I pay an Amazon prime subscription of £8.99 each month,which entitles me to receive one day delivery on purchase of most products,but a few times now,I have received tracking for an item for that day,then later through the day get an update to say it will be delivered one or two days later,so if I need the item on that day promised,there is no option to cancel the order,I have to wait for it to turn up late and mess about returning the item and wait for Amazon to refund my payment,so if I'm paying for one day delivery on items,I think there should be some kind of compensation if the order is not fulfilled on the day promised.",2023-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,5.0,633,119,38,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,pay amazon prime subscription £ monthwhich entitles receive one day delivery purchase productsbut time nowi received tracking item daythen later day get update say delivered one two day laterso need item day promisedthere option cancel orderi wait turn late mess returning item wait amazon refund paymentso im paying one day delivery itemsi think kind compensation order fulfilled day promised,0.0052070412220581765,0.9947929587779418,0.06674144699943915,0.2,0.8107447687888588,81.07447687888587,High Trust
