Richard Jarnagin,/users/647d25ab028eb00012fc496d,US,1.0,2023-06-05 02:00:56+00:00,1.0,Amazon Now Stinks on Returns…,"I've been dropping off returns at the UPS Store with no hassle but now Amazon was going to charge $1.99 to drop off my return at the UPS Store so I chose the free Kohl option instead.  What a pain in the rear.  Had to park out in a big parking lot and walk to the back of this big department store just to drop off the Amazon return.  On top of that, cell service is practically non-existant inside the store, but I was finally able to get logged into Kohl's wifi and pull up the QR codes for the returns.  Amazon used to be great on returns but now they stink.",2023-06-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,5.0,561,112,29,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ive dropping return ups store hassle amazon going charge drop return ups store chose free kohl option instead pain rear park big parking lot walk back big department store drop amazon return top cell service practically nonexistant inside store finally able get logged kohl wifi pull qr code return amazon used great return stink,0.06172926600735932,0.9382707339926407,0.0628154795288839,0.2,0.7816984629020971,78.1698462902097,High Trust
