ly we’ve package delivered house home time “attempt” made people can’t even call freaking leave could find address several time don’t even sit try tell can’t find important item get together amazon,0.179719203237205,0.820280796762795,0.12731351654514864,0.2,0.7356031016904272,73.56031016904272,Medium Trust
Anne Upshall,/users/5921f1350000ff000a9ad373,GB,3.0,2023-06-04 22:35:40+00:00,1.0,Would have selected no stars but …,Would have selected no stars but it wouldn’t let me. Terrible terrible service. I’m a prime customer and frequent buyer. Usually have deliveries to my home but needed something urgently for my dog and wanted to make sure I didn’t miss the delivery. Selected the closest Amazon locker to my home address. Received notifications it was delivered while I was out and felt thankful as would have missed it. Drove to locker location as soon as I could but there was no lockers. Just a big space and marks on the floor/wall as evidence that lockers were there once but not anymore. Security staff at the location confirmed that it didn’t exist anymore.  Trouble is tracking said it was delivered and I had been sent a barcode and draw number for it!!! Customer services couldn’t have been worse. Arguing with me that the item was there for collection and that I needed to collect it. I was passed through 6 agents. All bots I’m assuming as not answering my questions and repeating. Worst experience ever. Eventually spoke to a human who confirmed the lockers didn’t exist as were permanently closed but couldn’t explain why it was and still is an option for delivery on their site. The human told me I would have to wait a further 4 days for a refund and that was it. Cold hearted response. Could not give a toss that I needed the item today and I was so disappointed or that I had been around the houses trying to get one of the bots to help. Horrendous,2023-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,4.0,1448,263,34,7,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,would selected star wouldn’t let terrible terrible service i’m prime customer frequent buyer usually delivery home needed something urgently dog wanted make sure didn’t miss delivery selected closest amazon locker home address received notification delivered felt thankful would missed drove locker location soon could locker big space mark floorwall evidence locker anymore security staff location confirmed didn’t exist anymore trouble tracking said delivered sent barcode draw number customer service couldn’t worse arguing item collection needed collect passed agent bot i’m assuming answering question repeating worst experience ever eventually spoke human confirmed locker didn’t exist permanently closed couldn’t explain still option delivery site human told would wait day refund cold hearted response could give toss needed item today disappointed around house trying get one bot help horrendous,0.8116505559516879,0.1883494440483121,0.14750420639371845,0.2,0.42367556330289974,42.36755633028997,Low Trust
Kiki,/users/62814347e2b5870012d4b6c3,US,4.0,2023-06-04 21:45:42+00:00,1.0,The Outsourcing of customer reps that do not comprehend English MUST STOP!!,"Re ORDER # 112-9238189-0286645While I must say that I misread the label and thought I received the same incorrect size again and that was my fault.  The suit (see/check delivery photo wasn't even delivered in a bag but just the ziplock back with an address label attached.)  This Supervisor was HORRENDOUS!!! : After reviewing both suits again I do see that I did receive the size 18 however, I wanted to respond to this email in the hopes that someone higher up will see my review of your unprofessional and disgusting incompetent service.I will also be responding the below answer in the hopes that I can report you.You are incapable of handling customer’s in a human way and you do not comprehend the English language thoroughly which makes it literally impossible for you to assist a customer properly.Amazon needs to discontinue outsourcing to outside countries where 90 percent of the reps can not serve the customer because of their ability to respond with immediacy and correctly comprehend the inherit problem.  This is evident and something that customers in the US consumer market have to deal with.  There is not an issue for someone having English as a second language working in customer service; there is an issue with reps who clearly do not thoroughly comprehend English and while it could be a combination of this Supervisor just not giving a s*** about the customer in conjunction with the language barrier, either way this supervisor is ill-equipped and incapable of handling customer’s issues and flat out lied telling me there were no size 18s left when clearly the 18 was open on the website.  The reason I can confirm this is that then she changed her story and said oh yes there is one.This person has no business in customer service let alone as a leader for other reps.  She also is incapable of listening and not speaking over the customer.  I had to ask her several times to let me finish my thought and this is another issue that is very common when I speak with customer reps that are outsources they speak over the customer.  I also believe that is due to their lack of understanding when one sentence is ending and another is beginning due to the language barrier.HURRENDOUS SERVICE FROM THEA M.",2023-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,4.0,2228,385,75,12,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,order must say misread label thought received incorrect size fault suit seecheck delivery photo wasnt even delivered bag ziplock back address label attached supervisor horrendous reviewing suit see receive size however wanted respond email hope someone higher see review unprofessional disgusting incompetent servicei also responding answer hope report youyou incapable handling customer’s human way comprehend english language thoroughly make literally impossible assist customer properlyamazon need discontinue outsourcing outside country percent rep serve customer ability respond immediacy correctly comprehend inherit problem evident something customer u consumer market deal issue someone english second language working customer service issue rep clearly thoroughly comprehend english could combination supervisor giving customer conjunction language barrier either way supervisor illequipped incapable handling customer’s issue flat lied telling size left clearly open website reason confirm changed story said oh yes onethis person business customer service let alone leader rep also incapable listening speaking customer ask several time let finish thought another issue common speak customer rep outsources speak customer also believe due lack understanding one sentence ending another beginning due language barrierhurrendous service thea,0.543615939357487,0.456384060642513,0.21592821088053843,0.2,0.5713776724973642,57.13776724973641,Medium Trust
