evu lix,/users/647ca696bd88e50011a9229e,DE,4.0,2023-06-04 17:29:01+00:00,1.0,"Stollen money, no order","DONT buy gift cards, they steal your money!!! Contacting their service doesn't help at all!!!I'm disappointed in Amazon. I have never experienced such a bad experience with any company in my life! I wanted to make a gif for my boyfriend who lives in another country. His birthday was coming soon and I wanted to surprise him. Because I was saving up money and they weren't in my bank account I decided to just buy a gift card. I made my order for a gaming monitor selected as a gift.Everything was going well till I got an email saying that my account is on hold. I tried to call the service multiple times in German( because I bought it in Germany) and English. I have over 30 calls with Amazon service. The situation didn't get any better, I also didn't get any emails. The ones I sent get deleted or I get a response from their system, not a human! When I log into my account I get a message to check my email and I can't do anything else except log out. I have checked in other categories such as spam or archive... The only way to contact them is to call them.Throughout the call, I got different answers every time. After every call, I have to wait more than 72 hours and contact them back, wait again, the same thing over and over again. I even got asked multiple times for proof of the bought gif card with photos showing the receipt and the spend amount. Others said that I have done something against their terms of policy, although I have read them and explained that I haven't.Overall I wasted a big amount of money, didn't get any support, wasted hours trying to explain my situation to people who don't know what they are doing, destroyed my moods multiple times, and didn't surprise a special someone.",2023-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,4.0,1716,318,23,4,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,dont buy gift card steal money contacting service doesnt help allim disappointed amazon never experienced bad experience company life wanted make gif boyfriend life another country birthday coming soon wanted surprise saving money werent bank account decided buy gift card made order gaming monitor selected gifteverything going well till got email saying account hold tried call service multiple time german bought germany english call amazon service situation didnt get better also didnt get email one sent get deleted get response system human log account get message check email cant anything else except log checked category spam archive way contact call themthroughout call got different answer every time every call wait hour contact back wait thing even got asked multiple time proof bought gif card photo showing receipt spend amount others said done something term policy although read explained haventoverall wasted big amount money didnt get support wasted hour trying explain situation people dont know destroyed mood multiple time didnt surprise special someone,0.9996963781950743,0.00030362180492571333,0.1783510936623668,0.2,0.3358220296349362,33.58220296349362,Low Trust
Philip Messenger,/users/647c7a82b9257a001222e9f2,GB,3.0,2023-06-04 14:22:04+00:00,1.0,Absolutely appalling service,"Absolutely appalling service - bought a pair of trainers on Amazon - told they would be delivered Friday or Saturday- they were delivered on the Thursday without telling me or giving an estimation of time and were then left in a public place outside my front door where they have been stolen . Amazon now saying it’s not them it’s in the market place when I very clearly clicked on an amazon advert to buy them . What makes me even more angry is one I paid for the delivery and 2 the company when check views on Amazon are experiencing the same problems over and over again of packages going missing but continuing to use the same company - Amazon customer services is completely missing , I have now wasted 4 or 5 hours trying to get this sorted and am no nearer - there whole system is obstructive and makes complainting or trying to pursue an issue near on impossible- I am unable to view messages from the seller and Amazon customer services seem unable to sort this issue out , spent 20 mins on phone yesterday to what sounded like a call centre in India with a man saying he completely understands the problem, when he very clearly did not and did absolutely nothing to help get the situation resolved - my advice do NOT USE AMAZON , not only do they duck there taxes and played a big part in shutting down our high streets but now have a monopoly there service has become completely unacceptable, up there with one of the very worst experiences in my nearly 54 years - shocking",2023-06-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,4.0,1484,276,28,3,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,absolutely appalling service bought pair trainer amazon told would delivered friday saturday delivered thursday without telling giving estimation time left public place outside front door stolen amazon saying it’s it’s market place clearly clicked amazon advert buy make even angry one paid delivery company check view amaz