Truth Teller,/users/63bea6f129f88f0013bb5844,US,7.0,2023-06-03 23:12:21+00:00,1.0,CRIMINALS WITH NO CONSCIENCE,"I ordered medicine for my cat and needed it that day.  According to the site, it would be delivered the same day I ordered and I paid an additional $10 for this delivery date.  I received an email from Amazon stating that it would NOT be delivered for three days.  When I contacted Amazon (don't bother - no one speaks English nor do they understand the language), I was informed pretty much too sad, too bad.  I told him I wanted the order cancelled and I wanted a refund.  He stated I would NOT be receiving a refund.  I will NEVER order from these criminals again.",2023-06-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,3.0,567,106,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered medicine cat needed day according site would delivered day ordered paid additional delivery date received email amazon stating would delivered three day contacted amazon dont bother one speaks english understand language informed pretty much sad bad told wanted order cancelled wanted refund stated would receiving refund never order criminal,0.019203531988162336,0.9807964680118376,0.05945036455412227,0.2,0.8022883069167432,80.22883069167432,High Trust
