Micaiah McIntire,/users/647b7705bd88e50011a8a212,US,1.0,2023-06-03 19:23:27+00:00,1.0,Amazon customer service has tanked,"For the last six months we have had over 10 orders not show up or show up very late. Almost everything I order now is “delayed” and just never comes. Now Amazon is trying to re-charge us for items they refunded for us because they came super late (1 month+) without our concent.Furthermore, Amazon customer service has taken a huge nose dive. They do not take care of their customers any more. They refuse to let you report a package until after 5 days past expected delivery, they won’t work with people, they do not let you speak with a manager or honor Amazon prime promises  like 2 day shipping. I have had multiple customer service reps just disappear from our chats etc. It’s a shame. I’ve been a loyal Amazon customer for over 13 years…they used to care and go above and beyond. Now you just get penalized and never even receive your products.",2023-06-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,3.0,850,155,34,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,last six month order show show late almost everything order “delayed” never come amazon trying recharge u item refunded u came super late month without concentfurthermore amazon customer service taken huge nose dive take care customer refuse let report package day past expected delivery won’t work people let speak manager honor amazon prime promise like day shipping multiple customer service rep disappear chat etc it’s shame i’ve loyal amazon customer years…they used care go beyond get penalized never even receive product,0.006257999777157949,0.9937420002228421,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.8142574274810228,81.42574274810228,High Trust
Paul,/users/62801d4af32f8e0013d8548f,GB,2.0,2023-06-03 16:09:06+00:00,1.0,Amazon Guarantee worthless.,"We bought a thermostat from Amazon and paid extra for the Amazon promoted fitting service, as it was covered by their “Happiness Guarantee”. The work caused damage to the wall so I contacted Amazon who said it was covered by the guarantee. I sent them an estimate for the work which they agreed to refund. Work was carried out over a year ago and still no refund! I have called multiple time, but each time get different information from “you will be paid” to “we are looking into it” to “you are not entitled to a refund”. It takes ages to even get through to someone who can access the correct information. We are out of pocket and still waiting. Terrible service.",2022-06-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,3.0,666,122,27,3,338.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,bought thermostat amazon paid extra amazon promoted fitting service covered “happiness guarantee” work caused damage wall contacted amazon said covered guarantee sent estimate work agreed refund work carried year ago still refund called multiple time time get different information “you paid” “we looking it” “you entitled refund” take age even get someone access correct information pocket still waiting terrible service,0.0017825848377260255,0.998217415162274,0.06842400448681997,0.2,0.812793508478501,81.2793508478501,High Trust
