Bart,/users/5d6707d1c227770faf8f995f,GB,72.0,2023-06-02 20:28:55+00:00,1.0,Disappointing,"Had a parcel coming today with two toys that I promised to my nephews. So I stayed home to make sure I didn’t miss the delivery, but I guess the driver was too tired to even attempt delivery. At 5:37 pm today I received a notification from the app that delivery was unsuccessful as no one was home - even though I stayed home all day long to not miss it. Lady on the chat was nice and understood my frustration yet she had no way of contacting the driver to see exactly what happened. So the delivery will be attempted again tomorrow but from my experience I know it’s gonna be past 4 pm again when I won’t be home. The amazon drivers are a joke. They don’t listen to the delivery instructions, often mark orders as delivered and handed over to resident while they didn’t even get to the address yet. Someone seriously need to look into this mess with their drivers as it’s really frustrating to pay for a next day delivery and stay home all day long to make sure someone could open the door to receive the delivery just to be ignored because the driver couldn’t have been bothered to even attempt delivery. I won’t be home tomorrow so I’ll miss tomorrow’s delivery so my nephews will never see those toys. It’s so annoying.",2023-06-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,2.0,1224,229,13,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,parcel coming today two toy promised nephew stayed home make sure didn’t miss delivery guess driver tired even attempt delivery pm today received notification app delivery unsuccessful one home even though stayed home day long miss lady chat nice understood frustration yet way contacting driver see exactly happened delivery attempted tomorrow experience know it’s gonna past pm won’t home amazon driver joke don’t listen delivery instruction often mark order delivered handed resident didn’t even get address yet someone seriously need look mess driver it’s really frustrating pay next day delivery stay home day long make sure someone could open door receive delivery ignored driver couldn’t bothered even attempt delivery won’t home tomorrow i’ll miss tomorrow’s delivery nephew never see toy it’s annoying,0.14220737851149268,0.8577926214885073,0.12843522153673584,0.2,0.7545833550516008,75.45833550516008,High Trust
Kari Olson,/users/5bc128774de5666d34c07169,US,3.0,2023-06-02 19:18:17+00:00,1.0,Amazon is no longer the company that it used to be,"Amazon used to be my favorite place to shop. I used to brag about their wonderful customer service.  Items arrived on time, if not early, and they were what I had ordered. They were quality items and I could trust the reviews. Apparently, those days are over.  For the past six to eight months I've had one problem after another.  They advertise items as coming on a certain day, even the next morning, but they don't come. Packages get lost or they are delivered to someone else and almost never come on time. The products aren't as good as they used to be and it isn't surprising to get something other than what you order. The reviews are completely untrustworthy and I have to look at the bad reviews to even get an idea of whether the product is any good or not.  I do usually have good luck with returns and customer service; however, I am sick of having to go to UPS for returns or just keeping the garbage because I don't want to hassle with it. I am sick of expecting a product to come on a certain day and then having it come two days later or even get lost. I'm going to try some alternatives and hopefully will find better service elsewhere.  The most current problem I had was yesterday but this is not a one time problem.",2023-06-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,2.0,1235,233,50,11,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon used favorite place shop used brag wonderful customer service item arrived time early ordered quality item could trust review apparently day past six eight month ive one problem another advertise item coming certain day even next morning dont come package get lost delivered someone else almost never come time product arent good used isnt surprising get something order review completely untrustworthy look bad review even get idea whether product good usually good luck return customer service however sick go ups return keeping garbage dont want hassle sick expecting product come certain day come two day later even get lost im going try alternative hopefully find better service elsewhere current problem yesterday one time problem,0.0022284797894651554,0.9977715202105348,0.13067863151991027,0.2,0.8250214864092495,82.50214864092496,High Trust
Jade,/users/620a780fa4299c0012bafa4d,GB,4.0,2023-06-02 18:19:01+00:00,1.0,Amazon prime is a con nowadays!,Amazon prime is just becoming a joke. They make you wait home all day and continuously tell you it will be delivered by 10pm and then all of a sudden it’s got an unexpected delay and will be with you in a few days. It’s not the service you pay for and the customer service reps just say don’t worry you will get it in a few days. It’s not exactly the service I’m paying for when it’s meant to be next day or the day I’m choosing. More than 50% of my deliveries run into unexpected delays. They just make too much profit to care about losing customers nowadays.,2023-06-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,2.0,560,110,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime becoming joke make wait home day continuously tell delivered pm sudden it’s got unexpected delay day it’s service pay customer service rep say don’t worry get day it’s exactly service i’m paying it’s meant next day day i’m choosing delivery run unexpected delay make much profit care losing customer nowadays,0.009573959523765916,0.9904260404762341,0.06169377453729669,0.2,0.8075517751455764,80.75517751455764,High Trust
