Amuni,/users/647979d0b9257a00122142a2,CN,1.0,2023-06-02 07:27:04+00:00,3.0,The shopping experience on Amazon has…,"The shopping experience on Amazon has been mostly positive, with a wide selection of products and convenient services.  However, improvements are needed in packaging to prevent damage during transit.  Occasional delivery delays and inconsistencies in product information should also be addressed.  Despite these areas for improvement, I appreciate the convenience and variety offered by Amazon.",2023-05-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,2.0,394,55,38,6,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,shopping experience amazon mostly positive wide selection product convenient service however improvement needed packaging prevent damage transit occasional delivery delay inconsistency product information also addressed despite area improvement appreciate convenience variety offered amazon,0.014650791555349733,0.9853492084446502,0.030846887268648347,0.6,1.3988439816760547,139.88439816760547,High Trust
Edward,/users/64794ab850c37c00143e4b5f,US,2.0,2023-06-02 03:58:27+00:00,1.0,"Bad, Bad, Bad","Not surprisingly, this will be another low star review for Bezoville. Far too many of the sellers are not reputable, and far too much of the experience is low quality. The high rating reviews are all very clearly shills and the fact that delivery drivers do things like dump your packages on the literal street or drive away with your package while claiming to have left it are, essentially, criminal. I've gone out of my way to avoid using Bezolandia but recently someone gave me a $50 gift card and when I logged in, I discovered I had an additional $10 GC I had redeemed and forgotten to use (very little worthwhile is $10 on this crappy site), plus a small amount (about $6-7) left from a secret santa thing I participated in some three or four years ago. THAT's how little I waste time on this site, and it's sad that people give them business despite how awful it is, when it's not like Time Warner or Spectrum and customers are paying to use a lousy company because there's no alternative. People SPEND YOUR MONEY ELSEWHERE. You have choices!",2023-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,2.0,1049,190,13,3,18.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,surprisingly another low star review bezoville far many seller reputable far much experience low quality high rating review clearly shill fact delivery driver thing like dump package literal street drive away package claiming left essentially criminal ive gone way avoid using bezolandia recently someone gave gift card logged discovered additional gc redeemed forgotten use little worthwhile crappy site plus small amount left secret santa thing participated three four year ago thats little waste time site sad people give business despite awful like time warner spectrum customer paying use lousy company there alternative people spend money elsewhere choice,0.030361161749470778,0.9696388382505292,0.1065619742007852,0.2,0.8061318139654217,80.61318139654216,High Trust
