Ali44,/users/5ee2d33eda7651a02fb30a6d,GB,27.0,2023-05-31 16:19:09+00:00,1.0,Trying to get a camping fridge…,"Trying to get a camping fridge delivered to the boatyard where I have my boat - the manager won't take deliveries, and my boat is one of several. Amazon have decided that I need to be present upon delivery, to give a code to the driver - it's not like I don't work full time, or anything. So I wasn't here today, and the delivery failed. I can be here tomorrow, but I'm not going to stand out in the car park for hours, waiting for the delivery to turn up. Have just spoken to Amazon - was sent an email where I could apparently 'put more instructions' (ie, a phone number)for the driver. Well, I've just checked my emails - one was assuring me that the 'jacket you ordered will be delivered to the Amazon locker' - (who was that email intended for, I ordered a camping fridge, not a jacket, and it's coming to my address, not an amazon locker), an email asking me if 'I solved your problem', containing a broken link, so I can't even click No, and an email saying I can 'edit delivery instructions', which only gives the option to remove old delivery addresses I no longer use. What a monumental waste of time. Still, I guess Bezos is a little distracted with his new fiancee. Meanwhile, Amazon just gets worse and worse... UPDATE: Never again will I attempt to order anything that can't be posted trough a letterbox, or delivered to an amazon locker again. Amazon - who clearly consider themselves too big to fail - are beginning to fail. It could all be resolved very simply, if they would just allow customers to send messages to delivery drivers. My circumstances don't fit into their tight little list of 'instructions for delivery' and it's beginning to look like they are simply unable to...deliver an item to a boatyard. Farcical. And a wasted day. Plus, as expected, and contrary to what it says on my order page, there has been no attempt to try again today. Liars.",2023-05-31 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,31.0,1876,343,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,trying get camping fridge delivered boatyard boat manager wont take delivery boat one several amazon decided need present upon delivery give code driver like dont work full time anything wasnt today delivery failed tomorrow im going stand car park hour waiting delivery turn spoken amazon sent email could apparently put instruction ie phone numberfor driver well ive checked email one assuring jacket ordered delivered amazon locker email intended ordered camping fridge jacket coming address amazon locker email asking solved problem containing broken link cant even click email saying edit delivery instruction give option remove old delivery address longer use monumental waste time still guess bezos little distracted new fiancee meanwhile amazon get worse worse update never attempt order anything cant posted trough letterbox delivered amazon locker amazon clearly consider big fail beginning fail could resolved simply would allow customer send message delivery driver circumstance dont fit tight little list instruction delivery beginning look like simply unable todeliver item boatyard farcical wasted day plus expected contrary say order page attempt try today liar,0.014434911695994939,0.985565088304005,0.19237240605720696,0.2,0.8312570253634438,83.12570253634438,High Trust
