Bruna Lobo,/users/63f4f721e2892900122ac257,IE,2.0,2023-05-30 19:40:51+00:00,1.0,Amazon Dublin: bad delivery drivers and even worse customer service,"Amazon in Dublin has to be the worst online shopping experience. The first time I ordered, i did not receive my package even though it said it was delivered. I let them know and they reimbursed and asked me to order again. It was fine this time, i got my order. The second time, order showed delivered. Didn't get it. I let them know and they made it look like I was keeping the packages and trying to get a refund. Third time, same situation. I did not get any reimbursements. Customer service is absolutely incompetent. They don't even read what you are saying and give you copy-paste responses. I have wasted one hour talking to them each time with ZERO solutions. They don't even listen or try to help, the worst customer care i have seen. Then a few days later, a kind old lady from a building 10 minutes away came to tell me that she saw some packages for me there. If she hadn't told me, i wouldn't have known. I ordered again and gave clear delivery instructions and they again delivered to the other building. When I tried letting Amazon know about this, they kept saying ""have you checked your neighbors building?"" I just told them it was delivered to another building but they don't even read what you say. Ridiculous and such a waste of time.  This experience has been so irritating that i am going to delete my Amazon account that i have been shopping (a LOT) on for the last 4 years. No more Amazon. Jeff Bezos has too much money to be providing such a low level of service. I am disgusted.",2023-05-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,30.0,1504,280,67,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon dublin worst online shopping experience first time ordered receive package even though said delivered let know reimbursed asked order fine time got order second time order showed delivered didnt get let know made look like keeping package trying get refund third time situation get reimbursement customer service absolutely incompetent dont even read saying give copypaste response wasted one hour talking time zero solution dont even listen try help worst customer care seen day later kind old lady building minute away came tell saw package hadnt told wouldnt known ordered gave clear delivery instruction delivered building tried letting amazon know kept saying checked neighbor building told delivered another building dont even read say ridiculous waste time experience irritating going delete amazon account shopping lot last year amazon jeff bezos much money providing low level service disgusted,0.006039525691030431,0.9939604743089696,0.15703869882220975,0.2,0.8283879769189267,82.83879769189268,High Trust
customer,/users/5d38de8390717e19b7211aed,US,5.0,2023-05-30 18:43:28+00:00,1.0,Used computer sold as new,"Sent me a used computer that was sold as ""new"". The manufacturer warranty had already been activated months before I even bought the PC. They refuse to do literally anything about it. Won't offer discount, won't let me return. And have just been absolutely awful.",2023-05-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,30.0,263,45,25,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sent used computer sold new manufacturer warranty already activated month even bought pc refuse literally anything wont offer discount wont let return absolutely awful,0.0315816621308636,0.9684183378691364,0.025238362310712283,0.2,0.7892568413967107,78.92568413967108,High Trust
T. LaM,/users/64761382157a940013c30f64,US,2.0,2023-05-30 17:17:38+00:00,1.0,Amazon,"Amazon. Should truly be ashamed of themselves. I purchased several items adding up to $933 worth of stuff on Amazon. I received everything except for one item. When I phoned Amazon to report the missing item, I was told that as far as they were concerned, I received it along with the other items in the delivery . Amazon told me they would not refund me the $30 for the missing item and more or less it was too bad. I can’t believe that this is the risk your  run if you order multiple items at once and you don’t receive one in the bunch. Amazon made note that they have  to protect their revenue. I am disgusted that Amazon would completely absolve themselves of any wrongdoing. They would never stop to say well maybe it wasn’t packed in the order and checked off accidentally as delivered. Not only am I out $30 for the item I did not receive, but now I have to spend another $30 to re-purchase what I was waiting for $60 in the hole! so much for the little people  .",2023-05-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,30.0,972,186,6,1,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon truly ashamed purchased several item adding worth stuff amazon received everything except one item phoned amazon report missing item told far concerned received along item delivery amazon told would refund missing item less bad can’t believe risk run order multiple item don’t receive one bunch amazon made note protect revenue disgusted amazon would completely absolve wrongdoing would never stop say well maybe wasn’t packed order checked accidentally delivered item receive spend another repurchase waiting hole much little people,0.053803208288994944,0.946196791711005,0.10431856421761077,0.2,0.7939621086990246,79.39621086990246,High Trust
