Carmel Foster,/users/60b96d922930150019252373,US,2.0,2023-05-27 03:55:59+00:00,1.0,Amazon delivery is getting really…,"I am writing this review to express my deep disappointment with Amazon's delivery service, which has proven to be increasingly terrible and far from cost-effective. It is truly baffling how one can place an order for a product, only to have it delivered at the very last minute. As a Prime subscriber, I had high expectations when I placed an order for a printer in the afternoon of the day before, expecting a smooth and timely delivery process. However, my experience quickly turned into a frustrating ordeal.The delivery time for my order was changed multiple times, causing significant inconvenience. It went from an initial estimated time of noon to an ever-shifting schedule that ultimately settled on 7.15 PM the next day. Throughout the entire process, I had to wait anxiously, as the delivery time continued to be revised. It is truly disheartening to witness such a lackluster level of service from a company that prides itself on efficiency. The entire day was put on hold as I eagerly awaited the arrival of my order.What makes matters worse is the fact that the delivery time extended all the way until 10 PM, and yet, I am still here waiting. This constant rescheduling and prolonged waiting period have only added to my frustration and dissatisfaction. It has become evident that the convenience I expected from Amazon's Prime service is simply not worth the trouble.I can't help but compare this experience to that of a third-world service, as the level of inefficiency and unreliability is truly reminiscent of subpar delivery systems. It is worth mentioning that since Amazon's unionization, the quality of service seems to have taken a noticeable downturn. While I understand that various factors can contribute to delivery delays, the continuous changes and lack of punctuality are simply unacceptable.I hope this review sheds light on my disappointing experience and highlights the urgent need for improvement in Amazon's delivery service. I trust that Amazon will take these concerns seriously and strive to regain the trust of its customers by delivering on its promises of timely and efficient service.",2023-05-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,27.0,2126,346,34,5,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,writing review express deep disappointment amazon delivery service proven increasingly terrible far costeffective truly baffling one place order product delivered last minute prime subscriber high expectation placed order printer afternoon day expecting smooth timely delivery process however experience quickly turned frustrating ordealthe delivery time order changed multiple time causing significant inconvenience went initial estimated time noon evershifting schedule ultimately settled pm next day throughout entire process wait anxiously delivery time continued revised truly disheartening witness lackluster level service company pride efficiency entire day put hold eagerly awaited arrival orderwhat make matter worse fact delivery time extended way pm yet still waiting constant rescheduling prolonged waiting period added frustration dissatisfaction become evident convenience expected amazon prime service simply worth troublei cant help compare experience thirdworld service level inefficiency unreliability truly reminiscent subpar delivery system worth mentioning since amazon unionization quality service seems taken noticeable downturn understand various factor contribute delivery delay continuous change lack punctuality simply unacceptablei hope review shed light disappointing experience highlight urgent need improvement amazon delivery service trust amazon take concern seriously strive regain trust customer delivering promise timely efficient service,0.006418372199581512,0.9935816278004185,0.19405496354458776,0.2,0.8356018066091268,83.56018066091268,High Trust
TM,/users/645b272b7f308500138bdf93,US,6.0,2023-05-27 00:33:34+00:00,4.0,Amazon delivers what I want consistently well,"Hello. My bride and I order from amazon on a regular basis. Searching for what I want is easy, and the reviews are helpful when deciding on whether to purchase or not and I’m on the fence regarding a product. Returns are easy when dropping off an item at a return center. Just do the return request online, they send you a bar code and you just drop off the item and they scan your phone. Done. Thirty seconds. Don’t even need a box or anything. Prime membership is worth it to me when it comes to the shipping, and prime also comes with the amazon prime tv and I’m certain there are more perks that other people use that I don’t even use that are included with the prime membership. There have been times when something didn’t arrive on time as planned, and the story I’m telling myself is that even the best systems and processes will not be executed perfectly every time. So it is what it is. And I choose to appreciate that the majority of the time, I get what I want and it’s delivered properly as it should be. Well done amazon drivers. Well done amazon customer service. Well done Jeff Bezos. Well done amazon sellers.There are times when I think, I need to go out and go shopping. There are times when I think, I can so order that amazon and get on with my day and focus on other stuff. I like that I can purchase gifts, have them  wrapped, shipped, etc. and bada bing bada bang. Done with a few taps on my phone.Many small business owners and local mom and pop shops may get jacked and may not be able to compete. That’s a challenge everyone needs to overcome. For avoidance of doubt, I do shop at local owned stores and give them my business. I also shop at amazon and give those Amazon sellers my business. I see a bunch of negative reviews here and they are recent reviews. We receive amazon orders a few times each week, so speaking from my experience which is overall positive, I give 4 stars.",2023-05-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,27.0,1907,361,45,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,hello bride order amazon regular basis searching want easy review helpful deciding whether purchase i’m fence regarding product return easy dropping item return center return request online send bar code drop item scan phone done thirty second don’t even need box anything prime membership worth come shipping prime also come amazon prime tv i’m certain perk people use don’t even use included prime membership time something didn’t arrive time planned story i’m telling even best system process executed perfectly every time choose appreciate majority time get want it’s delivered properly well done amazon driver well done amazon customer service well done jeff bezos well done amazon sellersthere time think need go go shopping time think order amazon get day focus stuff like purchase gift wrapped shipped etc bada bing bada bang done tap phonemany small business owner local mom pop shop may get jacked may able compete that’s challenge everyone need overcome avoidance doubt shop local owned store give business also shop amazon give amazon seller business see bunch negative review recent review receive amazon order time week speaking experience overall positive give star,0.010201954759381788,0.9897980452406182,0.20246775098149186,0.8,1.7353925728166075,173.53925728166075,High Trust
SJPLAF,/users/5b86cbda4de5666d34a07a61,GB,6.0,2023-05-26 16:45:22+00:00,1.0,Amazon driver entered our home without…,"Amazon driver entered our home without permission to leave the package inside our house, when my daughter and I were home, they didn't first ring the door bell first they just entered.  Raised this issue to Amazon and provided them security camera footage. 11 days later after 4 telephone calls and 5 emails to them, I've been offered a £5 gift card as a good will gesture and no explanation as to how it happened and or any corrective action being taken with the driver, shocking response.",2023-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,26.0,490,87,39,6,11.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon driver entered home without permission leave package inside house daughter home didnt first ring door bell first entered raised issue amazon provided security camera footage day later telephone call email ive offered £ gift card good gesture explanation happened corrective action taken driver shocking response,0.016130448163986417,0.9838695518360135,0.04879416713404375,0.2,0.8016936093448155,80.16936093448155,High Trust
