Ray Nock,/users/50fec33200006400012e51d9,GB,31.0,2023-05-26 15:29:24+00:00,1.0,Wife's birthday present saga.,"Ordered my wife's birthday present from an on line company to be delivered on her birthday. Their chosen courier was Amazon. Total shambles. The present left the supplying company the day before her birthday, which was fine, and that was the last we heard of it. If you have occasion to come in contact with Amazon Shipping avoid like the plague. Totally ruined my wife's birthday and I will be out of the dog house sometime in August.Edit!!!!!I thought I was the only one moaning about Amazon until I just read all the other 1* reviews. What is the point of reviews if no-one takes any notice. These people would never make another sale if reviews were taken notice of. The thing is Amazon do not give a s--t as long as they continue to make billions each year.My advice is deal with a reputable company, that's if you can find one that is.",2023-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,26.0,841,154,29,4,1.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,ordered wife birthday present line company delivered birthday chosen courier amazon total shamble present left supplying company day birthday fine last heard occasion come contact amazon shipping avoid like plague totally ruined wife birthday dog house sometime augustediti thought one moaning amazon read review point review noone take notice people would never make another sale review taken notice thing amazon give st long continue make billion yearmy advice deal reputable company thats find one,0.99293281626769,0.007067183732309967,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.32080784873659807,32.08078487365981,Low Trust
Emelie Boman,/users/6470660c99b32d001386f42b,SE,1.0,2023-05-26 09:56:07+00:00,1.0,Worst customer support I've ever seen.,"I am new to Amazon and made an order on a tent for about 1500 dollars to be apart of a dance performance in Sweden. Then my account was locked from nowhere. To get in contact with customer support you need to be signed in on your account. Without acces to your account it's quite impossible to get in touch with them. Wich makes it very difficult in the situation where my account is locked. I found an email on a google search and then got the answer to go to the helpsite on their website. I found a nother email on a google search, since it nowhere to be found on their website, and I got the answer to call a account expert. But no information on where to call. I've spent several hours on this. There is still no contact to email, phonenumber och chat to be seen. It's impossible to get in touch with an actual person. Once I think that I'm about to get an answer I'm only looped back to the start. This is the worst, nonexistens cusomer support that I have ever seen.",2023-05-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,26.0,973,189,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,new amazon made order tent dollar apart dance performance sweden account locked nowhere get contact customer support need signed account without acces account quite impossible get touch wich make difficult situation account locked found email google search got answer go helpsite website found nother email google search since nowhere found website got answer call account expert information call ive spent several hour still contact email phonenumber och chat seen impossible get touch actual person think im get answer im looped back start worst nonexistens cusomer support ever seen,0.009599161287227001,0.990400838712773,0.10600112170499158,0.2,0.8164006436973847,81.64006436973847,High Trust
