Brands Distributor,/users/646f8d5179c0be0012a83cda,US,1.0,2023-05-25 18:42:43+00:00,1.0,"The customer service I received was direspectful ,poor and unprofessional …","The customer service I received was unprofessional. They kept transferring me and asking the same questions. When they finally understood that I returned the item a week ago and cofirm they recived on the 18th, they said that I would get the refund in up to 15 business days, which I have never seen before when they already have the item back. A few days ago i contact them, they said it would take 3 to 5 business days, but today I checked the return status and it said they received the item today 25th. Now I need to wait 5 more business days to get my $800 refund, which I need to buy the item I need. Honestly, I do not trust Amazon anymore, and they will lose my business. I prefer to wait a few more days for delivery and deal with honest local business",2023-05-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,25.0,761,147,75,11,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,customer service received unprofessional kept transferring asking question finally understood returned item week ago cofirm recived th said would get refund business day never seen already item back day ago contact said would take business day today checked return status said received item today th need wait business day get refund need buy item need honestly trust amazon anymore lose business prefer wait day delivery deal honest local business,0.007021032320573773,0.9929789676794262,0.08244531688166012,0.2,0.8129785472160451,81.29785472160451,High Trust
