Michelle,/users/5773b4c50000ff000a2d5580,US,44.0,2023-05-25 15:14:31+00:00,1.0,Amazon is a stress inducing nightmare,"Normally I would never buy from Amazon because they are an evil corp, but due to budget constraints and being outside the US, I have no choice but to order from the to get reasonable shipping that actually arrives to where I am. Their customer service used to be great UNTIL the war started in March 2020 which they are a part of because they made billions while the evils forced everyone else to close. If the stores remained open, you know who's tied to the evils.Anyway, last year they told me I could NO LONGER be transferred to an American and I was FURIOUS. That's the first thing I do when I call Amazon so I can have a relatively smooth experience.This is the evils' agenda (most companies who had any Americans left working for them now have NONE) to prop up 3rd world countries and bring down first world countries so the world collapses. Now every time I call, I'm forced to deal with incompetency, and where it takes them 5 minutes just to give me a yes or no response. You should have heard their explanation for why I was charged something I should have been charged for. CLUELESS.I got one American last week and it was a wonderful experience. Every other time they don't know what they are doing and they stress me out to no end. Even their supervisors are CLUELESS and they won't let me speak to anyone higher up. I called 5 times the other day trying to get an American and couldn't.Before if they caused me a lot of time and stress they would give me a promotional credit. Today on live chat he said he can't do that. He wasn't even aware it could be done.Also, almost every item I have purchased and there's been a lot, has been defective. Chips in glass, scratches on pans and now spoon rests, broken plastic, hard pillows, and the list goes on.Even some of the sellers aren't responding to my messages anymore.And their listing says no import fees, and YET I'm charged import fees. Lastly, once AGAIN I go to a page to look at the reviews (most are fake if you didn't know) and I see reviews for a totally different product. This is the 3rd or 4th time I've encountered this in the last 2 years. It stresses me out because I have no idea which review is for what, or how many there are in total. The site is completely screwed up in more ways than one.I never loved Amazon, but now I hate them.Note: that everything about the economy worldwide is imploding. Almost every company I used to deal with has taken a dive since the scamdemic started.Again, this is no coincidence.",2023-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,25.0,2496,462,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,normally would never buy amazon evil corp due budget constraint outside u choice order get reasonable shipping actually arrives customer service used great war started march part made billion evil forced everyone else close store remained open know who tied evilsanyway last year told could longer transferred american furious thats first thing call amazon relatively smooth experiencethis evil agenda company american left working none prop rd world country bring first world country world collapse every time call im forced deal incompetency take minute give yes response heard explanation charged something charged cluelessi got one american last week wonderful experience every time dont know stress end even supervisor clueless wont let speak anyone higher called time day trying get american couldntbefore caused lot time stress would give promotional credit today live chat said cant wasnt even aware could donealso almost every item purchased there lot defective chip glass scratch pan spoon rest broken plastic hard pillow list go oneven seller arent responding message anymoreand listing say import fee yet im charged import fee lastly go page look review fake didnt know see review totally different product rd th time ive encountered last year stress idea review many total site completely screwed way onei never loved amazon hate themnote everything economy worldwide imploding almost every company used deal taken dive since scamdemic startedagain coincidence,0.030766769418450038,0.96923323058155,0.2591138530566461,0.2,0.8364393859021042,83.64393859021042,High Trust
