Desiree,/users/6244e26d1a19690012c4dc5d,US,3.0,2023-05-20 18:04:37+00:00,1.0,"Horrible, horrible customer service","My husband requested a phone call from Amazon this morning to address the latest delivery issue we're having with them.  It was a computer call, but relatively easily he got to an actual person.  Unfortunately, the first woman he talked to said she was putting him on hold then transferred him to someone else without telling him.  Then the second woman did nothing but tell him what the shipping status was, which he already knew from looking at the website.  He told her that he already knew what the status was because he was looking at it online.  The shipping status, for an overnight order, was updated yesterday (the day it was supposed to be delivered) and still hasn't been updated again.  We live in DFW, and the package was one suburb away when the update to ""delayed in transit"" was put up on the Amazon website.  The status is still delayed in transit, dated yesterday.  He was trying to find out when we will actually receive the package.  The second representative, although if I was Amazon I would use that term lightly about her, told him that customer service is unable to contact the fulfillment center to find out where our order is.  I honestly don't believe that for a second.....Amazon personnel have the ability to contact Amazon personnel at other facilities, I've had them do it for me before without any issues.  The only thing she offered to do is to put a request in the system that our order be delivered tomorrow, 2 days late.  And it would just be a request, not a guarantee that the package will actually be delivered.  My husband asked why it couldn't be delivered today, even though it would still be late, which is when she said they can't contact the facility we know the package is at.  My husband told her that there is no feasible reason that customer service can't contact any of their fulfillment centers directly and talk to someone.  At this point we were both highly frustrated by the run around from them.  She told him she was going to put the request for delivery tomorrow in and that's all she was doing.  She was being completely unhelpful and he finally told her so.  She started raising her voice and said ""Oh, so I'm not being helpful huh?  Well then bye,"" and hung up on him.  I listened to the whole thing because he had speaker phone on.  Refusing to do anything to help the situation, the complete inability to deal with a customer, and then actually hanging up on said customer after yelling at them.  This sort of behavior is completely unacceptable.  Now we don't even know if she actually put in the delivery request, the shipping status remains unchanged, and we don't have any idea where to go with our original issue, the shipping status, or who to talk to to report her incredibly unprofessional behavior.  I'd give Amazon customer service a zero star rating if I could.  We're in exactly the same boat we were in when he called, except now he's been yelled at and hung up on.  I'm seriously considering closing our Amazon prime account.  If we're going to have to wait to get our deliveries anyway, I'd rather spend my money elsewhere.",2023-05-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,20.0,3101,551,35,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,husband requested phone call amazon morning address latest delivery issue computer call relatively easily got actual person unfortunately first woman talked said putting hold transferred someone else without telling second woman nothing tell shipping status already knew looking website told already knew status looking online shipping status overnight order updated yesterday day supposed delivered still hasnt updated live dfw package one suburb away update delayed transit put amazon website status still delayed transit dated yesterday trying find actually receive package second representative although amazon would use term lightly told customer service unable contact fulfillment center find order honestly dont believe secondamazon personnel ability contact amazon personnel facility ive without issue thing offered put request system order delivered tomorrow day late would request guarantee package actually delivered husband asked couldnt delivered today even though would still late said cant contact facility know package husband told feasible reason customer service cant contact fulfillment center directly talk someone point highly frustrated run around told going put request delivery tomorrow thats completely unhelpful finally told started raising voice said oh im helpful huh well bye hung listened whole thing speaker phone refusing anything help situation complete inability deal customer actually hanging said customer yelling sort behavior completely unacceptable dont even know actually put delivery request shipping status remains unchanged dont idea go original issue shipping status talk report incredibly unprofessional behavior id give amazon customer service zero star rating could exactly boat called except he yelled hung im seriously considering closing amazon prime account going wait get delivery anyway id rather spend money elsewhere,0.00794212136293522,0.9920578786370647,0.30902972518227706,0.2,0.8578348843549878,85.78348843549878,High Trust
