Lance Douglas,/users/5f6facbdd04310c7aec406d1,US,5.0,2023-05-20 12:59:59+00:00,1.0,Stay away from Amazon Prime!,"Ordered a product from Amazon and received an empty Amazon envelope. The Post Office told me that was how they received it. Tried to do a refund on Amazon and they wanted the product returned, I drove to the next town where there was a UPS drop off point. The clerk was unable to do a return label. After ten minutes, I finally drove back home. I then contacted customer service by phone. I have spoken to several people and have been on the phone for around 25 minutes now. I get the impression that no one knows how to handle the situation. I feel like they are just waiting for me to hang up.Meanwhile, I have cancelled my prime membership that I have have for over five years. And they now charge $139. per year. Not me, not ever again. Wow, about 25 minutes and they said I will get a refund in 3-5 days.",2023-05-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,20.0,809,156,28,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered product amazon received empty amazon envelope post office told received tried refund amazon wanted product returned drove next town ups drop point clerk unable return label ten minute finally drove back home contacted customer service phone spoken several people phone around minute get impression one know handle situation feel like waiting hang upmeanwhile cancelled prime membership five year charge per year ever wow minute said get refund day,0.015594828222342452,0.9844051717776575,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.8097011837575893,80.97011837575893,High Trust
Gary,/users/5eddfaa8a64dab0b2164533e,GB,5.0,2023-05-19 23:53:44+00:00,1.0,Customer service trashed my trust,"Amazon used to be my personal beacon of light for how good an online store can be. But they're customer service just trashed my trust.Short story: I ordered an ""as new"" Amazon Renewed phone but it arrived damaged. The seller refused to refund and Amazons customer service were rude, unhelpful and dishonest. How could you fall so far, so fast Amazon?Longer Story: I ordered a Samsung Fold 3 through an Amazon Renewed approved reseller. The page was full of reassuring info about a 1 year guarantee and special Amazon Renewed customer service staff (later to be confirmed by Amazon that no such team exists).The phone arrived with obvious signs of use which I flagged with photos in a review and then started to crack along the fold. After a long argument with the seller got me nowhere I turn to Amazon for help.Online chat just took me in circles. Pretty sure it was either AI bots or scripted replies.Emails to Customer Services got some bizarre replies. I gave up when I got an email saying I couldn't return the phone for ""health and safety reasons""... It's a phone for goodness sake!Finally tried calling and got bounced around the world. The advisors all backed the seller and refused to listen to me or look at my evidence. I actually filmed the unboxing of my YouTube channel un aware I'd be filming unboxing a damaged product.So if you made it this far my advice is this. Don't buy anything from Amazon unless you really have to.",2023-05-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,19.0,1438,254,33,5,7.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,amazon used personal beacon light good online store theyre customer service trashed trustshort story ordered new amazon renewed phone arrived damaged seller refused refund amazon customer service rude unhelpful dishonest could fall far fast amazonlonger story ordered samsung fold amazon renewed approved reseller page full reassuring info year guarantee special amazon renewed customer service staff later confirmed amazon team existsthe phone arrived obvious sign use flagged photo review started crack along fold long argument seller got nowhere turn amazon helponline chat took circle pretty sure either ai bot scripted repliesemails customer service got bizarre reply gave got email saying couldnt return phone health safety reason phone goodness sakefinally tried calling got bounced around world advisor backed seller refused listen look evidence actually filmed unboxing youtube channel un aware id filming unboxing damaged productso made far advice dont buy anything amazon unless really,0.02236049819112931,0.9776395018088707,0.142456533931576,0.2,0.8173110576907505,81.73110576907506,High Trust
Shahnawaz,/users/639a3afa7b31860013ca7a06,IN,11.0,2023-05-19 12:32:23+00:00,4.0,An Honest Review of Amazon,"An Honest Review of Amazon I have been an Amazon customer for several years now, and I believe it's time to share an honest review of my experiences with the e-commerce giant. While Amazon offers numerous advantages and convenience, it also has its fair share of drawbacks that need to be acknowledged. Here's my breakdown of the pros and cons:Pros:1. Vast Product Selection: One of Amazon's biggest strengths is its unparalleled product range. From electronics to clothing, home goods to books, you can find almost anything you need on their platform.2. Competitive Prices: Amazon's marketplace fosters competition among sellers, often resulting in competitive prices. You can often find great deals and discounts on various products.3. Convenience and Speed: Amazon's Prime membership offers fast and free shipping on eligible items, making it incredibly convenient for time-sensitive purchases. Additionally, their user-friendly interface and seamless checkout process enhance the overall shopping experience.4. Customer Reviews: The abundance of customer reviews provides valuable insights and helps make informed purchasing decisions. It's beneficial to hear others' experiences before making a purchase.Cons:1. Counterfeit Products: Due to the sheer number of sellers on Amazon, there is a risk of encountering counterfeit or low-quality items. While Amazon takes measures to combat this issue, it remains a concern for some buyers.2. Third-Party Seller Discrepancies: As Amazon allows third-party sellers, inconsistencies in product quality, customer service, and shipping practices can occur. It's essential to research sellers and read reviews before making a purchase.3. Environmental Impact: The rapid growth of Amazon's operations has raised concerns about its environmental impact, such as packaging waste and carbon emissions from delivery vehicles. They have made some efforts to address these concerns, but there is still room for improvement.4. Worker Conditions: Over the years, there have been reports and controversies regarding the working conditions at Amazon's fulfillment centers. These issues highlight the need for better worker treatment and labor practices.Overall, Amazon remains a convenient and popular platform for online shopping, but it's important to approach it with awareness of its limitations. Being an informed shopper and understanding the potential drawbacks can help mitigate any negative experiences. Amazon's continuous improvements and addressing of these concerns would undoubtedly contribute to a better customer experience and make it an even more reliable platform in the future.",2022-08-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,19.0,2629,377,26,5,282.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,honest review amazon amazon customer several year believe time share honest review experience ecommerce giant amazon offer numerous advantage convenience also fair share drawback need acknowledged here breakdown pro conspros vast product selection one amazon biggest strength unparalleled product range electronics clothing home good book find almost anything need platform competitive price amazon marketplace foster competition among seller often resulting competitive price often find great deal discount various product convenience speed amazon prime membership offer fast free shipping eligible item making incredibly convenient timesensitive purchase additionally userfriendly interface seamless checkout process enhance overall shopping experience customer review abundance customer review provides valuable insight help make informed purchasing decision beneficial hear others experience making purchasecons counterfeit product due sheer number seller amazon risk encountering counterfeit lowquality item amazon take measure combat issue remains concern buyer thirdparty seller discrepancy amazon allows thirdparty seller inconsistency product quality customer service shipping practice occur essential research seller read review making purchase environmental impact rapid growth amazon operation raised concern environmental impact packaging waste carbon emission delivery vehicle made effort address concern still room improvement worker condition year report controversy regarding working condition amazon fulfillment center issue highlight need better worker treatment labor practicesoverall amazon remains convenient popular platform online shopping important approach awareness limitation informed shopper understanding potential drawback help mitigate negative experience amazon continuous improvement addressing concern would undoubtedly contribute better customer experience make even reliable platform future,0.00015640374977636242,0.9998435962502237,0.21144139091418956,0.8,1.7422100763079498,174.221007630795,High Trust
