Walter,/users/62db18642b64650012407303,MX,1.0,2023-06-02 07:39:28+00:00,1.0,Not much to say about Amazon,"Not much to say about Amazon. Im a new customer. I placed a order then my account is locked. I contacted customer service, they took information and said that new account will email me in 24 hours. Still waiting over a week now. No email address for company. Corp office fax not working. Found the CEO email address and email him, waiting for a reply only been a few hours since I email him.update,I send a email and my account was open within 3 hours.My name is Savvy with Amazon Business Escalations. Jeff Bezos received your recent email and I am responding on his behalf.I understand you are contacting as your account was placed on hold since we could not verify your payment information. I am very sorry for the inconvenience this has caused. I can confirm that the account is open.",2023-05-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,6.0,2.0,788,142,28,6,26.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,much say amazon im new customer placed order account locked contacted customer service took information said new account email hour still waiting week email address company corp office fax working found ceo email address email waiting reply hour since email himupdatei send email account open within hoursmy name savvy amazon business escalation jeff bezos received recent email responding behalfi understand contacting account placed hold since could verify payment information sorry inconvenience caused confirm account open,0.014065410066739432,0.9859345899332606,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.8088955058471686,80.88955058471686,High Trust
