Cathy D.,/users/64666273498f6800126fe047,US,1.0,2023-05-18 19:38:25+00:00,1.0,This os a review regarding LARGE HEAVY…,"This os a review regarding LARGE HEAVY purchases through Amazon that require delivery schedules and phone calls to make sure the buyer is home and available to have the purchase brought inside the home.I ordered two heavy items back to back. One was a large piece of furniture and the second was exercise equipment.The furniture came completely smashed. It is still not resolved despite sending the seller pictures 2x. The exercise machine- we could see before it entered our home, that it was going to be damaged because the box was falling apart.Again, we took pictures and called Amazon immediately.Here’s the issue (besides spending a lot of money to be delivered damaged products) YOU GET STUCK WITH LAGER HEAVY ITEMS cluttering your home until/if Amazon graces you with a pickup.We still don’t have a pickup date for the broken furniture and the Amazon customer service rep had the nerve to say to me, “Be careful who you order from” meaning it’s a third party seller… But it’s through Amazon! So shouldn’t the company be keeping tabs and quality control of the sellers?We were basically blamed for buying through Amazon BY Amazon customer support!Now we have large heavy garbage in our house that we’re stuck with until Amazon comes to remove it AND we don’t get a refund until the broken item has been returned to where it came from.So if you like spending a lot of money to be greatly inconvenienced and you love having your home filled with clutter- you’ll enjoy ordering large items from Amazon.Also- the customer service rep didn’t even seem interested in filling a complaint with whoever Amazon is hiring to deliver heavy items in our area, so they’re just going to allow more products to get smashed and more customers to have to endure the inconvenience.",2023-05-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,18.0,1769,301,39,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,o review regarding large heavy purchase amazon require delivery schedule phone call make sure buyer home available purchase brought inside homei ordered two heavy item back back one large piece furniture second exercise equipmentthe furniture came completely smashed still resolved despite sending seller picture x exercise machine could see entered home going damaged box falling apartagain took picture called amazon immediatelyhere’s issue besides spending lot money delivered damaged product get stuck lager heavy item cluttering home untilif amazon grace pickupwe still don’t pickup date broken furniture amazon customer service rep nerve say “be careful order from” meaning it’s third party seller… it’s amazon shouldn’t company keeping tab quality control sellerswe basically blamed buying amazon amazon customer supportnow large heavy garbage house we’re stuck amazon come remove don’t get refund broken item returned came fromso like spending lot money greatly inconvenienced love home filled clutter you’ll enjoy ordering large item amazonalso customer service rep didn’t even seem interested filling complaint whoever amazon hiring deliver heavy item area they’re going allow product get smashed customer endure inconvenience,0.10808711007534576,0.8919128899246542,0.16881660123387549,0.2,0.7797197652091021,77.97197652091022,High Trust
