Osman Mukhudadaev,/users/6465d376ef90f4001239c378,NL,1.0,2023-05-18 09:37:51+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service of all time.,"I created an Amazon account for the first time to buy a colleague from another country a gift card. After Amazon took my money, I received an email saying that they ""have detected unusual activity on your Amazon account"", and that's why my account is closed, and orders are on hold. Why the hell my activity was unusual if it's the only activity I did perform so far? So at the moment I can't log into my account, money is gone, and the gift card is I don't know where.I tried to reach out thought the ""Help"" page, but it is impossible with your account blocked! And now I'm texting to cs-reply email address, but all they do is promising to answer within 6 hours, what seems to be a lie.",2023-05-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,18.0,688,131,35,6,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,created amazon account first time buy colleague another country gift card amazon took money received email saying detected unusual activity amazon account thats account closed order hold hell activity unusual activity perform far moment cant log account money gone gift card dont know wherei tried reach thought help page impossible account blocked im texting csreply email address promising answer within hour seems lie,0.09452706570237618,0.9054729342976238,0.07347167694896242,0.2,0.7674308025386044,76.74308025386044,High Trust
