Mr John Monaghan,/users/61800cc54da93100121450d8,GB,33.0,2023-05-18 07:23:36+00:00,1.0,Amazon takes no responsibility for sales on their site,"Amazon takes no responsibility for the quality of the items they sell. They refer you to item 11 of their terms and conditions which stated that the agreement is between the purchaser and the seller. This is not the case, Amazon is responsible for what they sell and cannot renege on their obligations. Because of their attitude, I have cancelled all of my subscriptions and Prime. and will go elsewhere",2023-05-17 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,18.0,403,70,54,9,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon take responsibility quality item sell refer item term condition stated agreement purchaser seller case amazon responsible sell cannot renege obligation attitude cancelled subscription prime go elsewhere,0.0269605335977503,0.9730394664022497,0.03925967470555244,0.2,0.7943716681422354,79.43716681422353,High Trust
