jeremy schepp,/users/6463a3b320ef29001328dcad,US,1.0,2023-05-16 17:39:42+00:00,1.0,"Spies, lies & scams","Buy something name brand on Amazon and you're likely to get something bogus and don't expect to get your item when it was initially listed to arrive especially if you needed to show up then. Lots of fake reviews. Being a prime member doesn't actually save you money it tells you get free shipping but the truth is you're paying for it either way. Non-prime members and prime members pay the same for the same products ! I think AMAZON is quickly becoming shadier then other shady shopping sites . The Alexa  spies on people in their home and ease drops on conversations they shouldn't be able to for the sole focus of Amazon gathering information on you illegally and then selling it to other shady company's ! It why they sell them so much cheaper than their competitors versions. I really loved Amazon in the beginning but their business ethics, products, and affiliates have caused the continued loss of my respect for Amazon Co. If their quality continues to dip I may feel forced to boycott them all together.!",2023-05-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,16.0,1015,180,19,4,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,buy something name brand amazon youre likely get something bogus dont expect get item initially listed arrive especially needed show lot fake review prime member doesnt actually save money tell get free shipping truth youre paying either way nonprime member prime member pay product think amazon quickly becoming shadier shady shopping site alexa spy people home ease drop conversation shouldnt able sole focus amazon gathering information illegally selling shady company sell much cheaper competitor version really loved amazon beginning business ethic product affiliate caused continued loss respect amazon co quality continues dip may feel forced boycott together,0.7125327697310777,0.2874672302689223,0.10095344924284913,0.2,0.46392430498303094,46.39243049830309,Low Trust
Angela Melucci,/users/64639a7153203000143d9413,US,1.0,2023-05-16 17:00:13+00:00,1.0,Worst Refund Processing,"First, I ordered a Dymo Label printer and received some ridiculous hand held embossed sticker maker. I returned the item, never got the refund. Tried calling several times to track refund, they first said they didnt get the return, then finally acknowledged the return, but said because it was over 100 I have to wait 10 days for them to process the refund, a month later, they said to call my bank because they sent the refund, the next time I called they said oops they put my refund on a gift card. They did not. Now, I called for a fifth time, they're processing refund to the card I used to purchase the item but to wait 7 days. This is SO unprofessional and irresponsible.  I am canceling my membership and never shopping with them again. BYE!",2023-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,16.0,749,138,23,3,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,first ordered dymo label printer received ridiculous hand held embossed sticker maker returned item never got refund tried calling several time track refund first said didnt get return finally acknowledged return said wait day process refund month later said call bank sent refund next time called said oops put refund gift card called fifth time theyre processing refund card used purchase item wait day unprofessional irresponsible canceling membership never shopping bye,0.0329851718844622,0.9670148281155379,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.7989869429416725,79.89869429416726,High Trust
