 public with this story i have records of every phone call an email i don't want to do this but if you will keep on abusing me i'll have no other options,",2023-03-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,15.0,2050,405,15,2,52.0,0,13,1,0,Genuine,agreement fraudit begin one night saw good deal amazon deal great laptop great price drop excited purchase laptop full trust value item last time trusting next day delivery guy showed handed package ask code required laptop opened package realized trade different item ive tried contact customer service five time course one talk putting fake smile saying im sorry cant help option put bad review seller help seller contact writes understands pain willing take responsibility help thought trust amazon really realized there action taken option dispute charge credit card provider received email amazon customer service ask reason charge disputed told whole story came agreement well let charge dispute get back money felt secure sure trust amazon end past friday may th received letter credit card provider charge authorized remove amount account felt angry amazon arent holding agreement betraying third time customer service fraud lying lost trust policy agreementsi want take fully responsibility action fraud take action go public story record every phone call email dont want keep abusing ill option,0.9999993980892851,6.019107149368708e-07,0.22714526079641054,0.2,0.34542935311463957,34.54293531146396,Low Trust
