Antonio Alonzo,/users/6460ed1fd2cfce0011cebe53,VE,2.0,2023-05-14 16:25:00+00:00,1.0,Account Hacked and Amazon did Absolutely NOTHING!!,"In recent days, I received a message from my bank, informing me that they had debited the amount of 426 dollars for an alleged purchase made by me, someone entered my account, changed the shipping address and made a purchase, the scam was detected by me almost immediately, I immediately contacted Amazon to cancel that order, that was not possible, I tried to cancel the purchase almost immediately but Amazon did not allow it, despite calling and notifying that I was being scammed by a hacker Online Amazon did Absolutely nothing !! The order was delivered the next day and they even sent me photos of the delivery. I think that if the order goes out through Amazon Logistics, they must have control to stop any irregularities. Now my account is blocked for ""SECURITY"" and the bank also charged me. the cost of the product! A security and communication failure within the Amazon departments! I clarify that this happened to me in Amazon United States !!",2023-04-21 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,14.0,956,166,50,7,23.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,recent day received message bank informing debited amount dollar alleged purchase made someone entered account changed shipping address made purchase scam detected almost immediately immediately contacted amazon cancel order possible tried cancel purchase almost immediately amazon allow despite calling notifying scammed hacker online amazon absolutely nothing order delivered next day even sent photo delivery think order go amazon logistics must control stop irregularity account blocked security bank also charged cost product security communication failure within amazon department clarify happened amazon united state,0.9867288150146066,0.01327118498539337,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.3252558953530444,32.52558953530444,Low Trust
