Julio,/users/62ec079409be18001230c10c,GB,2.0,2023-05-14 11:19:46+00:00,1.0,Bad delivery service from Amazon drivers,"This unfortunately it is not the first occurrence. I have addressed this issue with Amazon several times, Amazon drivers leave the orders at the front entrance at my block of flats, there's a note asking not to leave parcels unattended, instead they must be delivered directly to the flats, unfortunately as it happened before, my 4 parcels were left at the entrance and where I live there is no mailroom, said parcels were stolen, same has happened with my neighbours. On April 12th 2023 by coincidence I checked outside the window and noticed an Amazon van leaving. Out of curiosity went to the entrance and orders were left there again. This is unacceptable, if Amazon drivers are not supposed to deliver directly to the flats, Amazon should have had the decency of notifying their clients about this operational procedure. Unfortunately I have stopped buying from AmazonUK due to this situation.",2023-04-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,14.0,899,150,40,6,32.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,unfortunately first occurrence addressed issue amazon several time amazon driver leave order front entrance block flat there note asking leave parcel unattended instead must delivered directly flat unfortunately happened parcel left entrance live mailroom said parcel stolen happened neighbour april th coincidence checked outside window noticed amazon van leaving curiosity went entrance order left unacceptable amazon driver supposed deliver directly flat amazon decency notifying client operational procedure unfortunately stopped buying amazonuk due situation,0.014396108277565555,0.9856038917224345,0.08412787436904094,0.2,0.8096275207350254,80.96275207350254,High Trust
Ne Ro,/users/6457164d1e57ba0014bb6011,CA,2.0,2023-05-14 14:58:14+00:00,1.0,I have called Amazon on Apr 24th to…,"I have called Amazon on Apr 24th to help me restore access to my account, but nobody followed up with me. So, I called again on May 3rd to request a refund for an item that broke down (which they have fulfilled), and asked again for help retrieving access to my account. They said that the account management team would follow up with me via email, but 10 days passed and got no emails. I called them again last night, and they said my account doesn't exist anymore, and there's no way for them to retrieve it. I did some research on Google, and found out that they actually delete accounts without any consent if they go over a certain limit for refund requests. They are also immune from any lawsuits against them based on their terms.I hope they will go out of business and all of their members would cancel their Prime membership.",2023-05-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,14.0,834,154,36,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,called amazon apr th help restore access account nobody followed called may rd request refund item broke fulfilled asked help retrieving access account said account management team would follow via email day passed got email called last night said account doesnt exist anymore there way retrieve research google found actually delete account without consent go certain limit refund request also immune lawsuit based termsi hope go business member would cancel prime membership,0.023823063609463988,0.976176936390536,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.805362725065711,80.53627250657111,High Trust
