Karen Cherry,/users/645e64b0d698590012822672,US,2.0,2023-05-12 20:33:33+00:00,1.0,Amazon needs to get their Logistics issues fixed or use FedEx/UPS exclusively!,"I have been an Amazon Prime customer for as long as I can remember. Their customer service is getting exponentially worse, and their Logistics department is THE WORST! When we moved in early March, any packages sent to our address were being delivered to an unknown other address. CS directed me to provide delivery instructions. No change. Took several weeks and dozens of e-mails, chats, and phone calls to get that situation resolved. Now that they've finally found my house, we're having horrible trouble with deliveries. Amazon needs to stop with the “Uber Eats” model of delivery. I can wait a couple days for my packages! And, at the very least, stop sending drivers out at 4:30 in the morning! Seriously. Stop that: Nobody needs their package at that time of day!! Choosing ""Amazon Day"" isn't always an option - which is super annoying - AND, even when I DO chose that as the delivery option, items are delivered willy nilly anyway. So, really, what's the point? Almost every time we have an issue with a driver, it’s a contractor in a private car. We’ve had drivers racing down our gravel road, we had an underage deliverer driven by his mom deliver a package, had items not arrive at all, items misdelivered, items in the same order arriving in multiple shipments IN THE SAME DAY, and had an uninsured driver with expired tags get stuck on our road while trying to deliver at an unnecessary time of day using ridiculous GPS instructions that he shouldn't have followed in the first place. This is all in the last 2 weeks!! Amazon's vetting process for these drivers seems sketchy at best, and I'm not even sure anything is validated! Safety is Amazon's priority? Nope! I don't feel particularly safe having these contractors on my property. Most customer centric company in the world? No. Get your act together, Amazon! OR, let me pick who delivers my packages.",2023-05-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,12.0,1871,324,78,12,1.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,amazon prime customer long remember customer service getting exponentially worse logistics department worst moved early march package sent address delivered unknown address c directed provide delivery instruction change took several week dozen email chat phone call get situation resolved theyve finally found house horrible trouble delivery amazon need stop “uber eats” model delivery wait couple day package least stop sending driver morning seriously stop nobody need package time day choosing amazon day isnt always option super annoying even chose delivery option item delivered willy nilly anyway really whats point almost every time issue driver it’s contractor private car we’ve driver racing gravel road underage deliverer driven mom deliver package item arrive item misdelivered item order arriving multiple shipment day uninsured driver expired tag get stuck road trying deliver unnecessary time day using ridiculous gps instruction shouldnt followed first place last week amazon vetting process driver seems sketchy best im even sure anything validated safety amazon priority nope dont feel particularly safe contractor property customer centric company world get act together amazon let pick delivers package,0.999938026308878,6.197369112204143e-05,0.18171620863712842,0.2,0.3363742285729867,33.637422857298674,Low Trust
DJB,/users/643247e2f214a50012d725df,GB,11.0,2023-05-12 20:19:44+00:00,1.0,One Time Passcode,"I ordered an apple ultra watch last year, it came with a ""one time passcode"" for security to ensure I actually receive it. I gave the delivery driver the code, when I open the box it was vitamins! Amazon have refused to believe me and rejected my claim, this took 5 months, I was fortunate enough to have paid for this with their partner finance and under section 75 of the credit consumer act the finance company allowed me to make a claim to have my money returned. Amazon state the passcode makes it safe but it actually put me at risk because I could not evidence my Apple watch ultra was stolen. Please be mindful and look out for one time passcodes because if the order is wrong or missing and you given the code to the delivery person Amazon will not except responsibility. I have now started taking my business to more local retailers.",2023-01-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,12.0,843,156,17,3,120.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered apple ultra watch last year came one time passcode security ensure actually receive gave delivery driver code open box vitamin amazon refused believe rejected claim took month fortunate enough paid partner finance section credit consumer act finance company allowed make claim money returned amazon state passcode make safe actually put risk could evidence apple watch ultra stolen please mindful look one time passcodes order wrong missing given code delivery person amazon except responsibility started taking business local retailer,0.012403504075631074,0.9875964959243689,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.811296845830945,81.1296845830945,High Trust
