James Bowen,/users/645d6248c6cc6b001235eb00,US,2.0,2023-05-11 23:48:11+00:00,1.0,Amazon closed my account with over 400 dollars in it,"I won over 400 dollars and redeemed through Amazon. It was successfully deposited, then I tried to make a purchase for a gift card. I didn't know that violated amazons terms and conditions. Amazon locked my account and stole my money saying it was fradulent. I asked taofortune several times to provide me receipts showing that the gift cards were mine. They said they would but they didn't...not until amazon closed my account. Now that I have the receipts amazons no longer responding to me.. I asked taofortune are they a legitimate casino and yes was the answer.. after explaining to them what happen they basically said screw you we didn't close your account Amazon did...I spent my money their with no bonus over a hundred dollars. I asked if they would reach out to Amazon and they wouldn't. So basically amazon robbed me and tao fortune let them. Worst redemption I've ever experienced.... I asked Micheal since this happened could they possibly give me some curious Freeplay since Amazon was the one who closed my account....answer was no...they are partners and I feel like I did nothing wrong. It's really frustrating because I promised my kid that money for his bday and I wasn't able to give it to him...now I suck as a father for lying to my kid. I'm glad he understands that this isn't my fault... Unbelievable.",2023-05-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,11.0,1326,231,52,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dollar redeemed amazon successfully deposited tried make purchase gift card didnt know violated amazon term condition amazon locked account stole money saying fradulent asked taofortune several time provide receipt showing gift card mine said would didntnot amazon closed account receipt amazon longer responding asked taofortune legitimate casino yes answer explaining happen basically said screw didnt close account amazon didi spent money bonus hundred dollar asked would reach amazon wouldnt basically amazon robbed tao fortune let worst redemption ive ever experienced asked micheal since happened could possibly give curious freeplay since amazon one closed accountanswer nothey partner feel like nothing wrong really frustrating promised kid money bday wasnt able give himnow suck father lying kid im glad understands isnt fault unbelievable,0.007296477737596318,0.9927035222624037,0.12955692652832304,0.2,0.8222631464368665,82.22631464368665,High Trust
