Ysen Warsayrodano,/users/63637d5e7f7b560013cbaa1b,DE,5.0,2023-05-10 18:36:20+00:00,3.0,"Decent Quality, but Watch Out for Extra Costs","As a longtime customer of Amazon.com, I have mixed feelings about my recent experiences with the company. While I can't deny the consistently good quality of their products and services, I can't overlook the growing trend of additional charges for certain features. It has left me feeling moderately satisfied with my overall experience.One aspect that has always stood out for me is the impressive range of products available on Amazon. Whether I'm looking for electronics, home goods, or even niche items, I can usually find what I need. The quality of the products I've purchased has generally been reliable, and I appreciate the convenience of having everything delivered right to my doorstep.However, my contentment has been somewhat dampened by the increasing number of features that come at an extra cost. Previously, I enjoyed the simplicity of a Prime membership, which included fast shipping and access to a decent selection of movies, TV shows, and books. Unfortunately, it seems like more and more perks are being pulled behind additional paywalls, which can be frustrating.For instance, the introduction of Amazon Prime Video Channels, which require separate subscriptions for certain content providers, has made the streaming experience less appealing. It feels like I'm being nickel-and-dimed for every additional service, making it harder to justify the extra expenses.",2023-05-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,10.0,1385,214,45,8,9.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,longtime customer amazoncom mixed feeling recent experience company cant deny consistently good quality product service cant overlook growing trend additional charge certain feature left feeling moderately satisfied overall experienceone aspect always stood impressive range product available amazon whether im looking electronics home good even niche item usually find need quality product ive purchased generally reliable appreciate convenience everything delivered right doorstephowever contentment somewhat dampened increasing number feature come extra cost previously enjoyed simplicity prime membership included fast shipping access decent selection movie tv show book unfortunately seems like perk pulled behind additional paywalls frustratingfor instance introduction amazon prime video channel require separate subscription certain content provider made streaming experience less appealing feel like im nickelanddimed every additional service making harder justify extra expense,0.010408379267358053,0.989591620732642,0.12002243409983174,0.6,1.4188002971862872,141.88002971862872,High Trust
