Duncan,/users/5894e5140000ff000a73a354,GB,40.0,2023-05-09 15:44:46+00:00,1.0,Amazon couldn't care less.,"Bought a well advertised small room heater which was meant to heat a room cheaply and help out with the energy crisis over winter. Apparently there is a ""danger of electric shock' with this product and Amazon are advising customers not to use. However as Amazon no longer do business with this supplier there is no refund available, good to see Amazon a helping out during the current cost of living crisis - NOT.NO DOUBT BURIED SOMEWHERE IN THEIR SMALL PRINT THERE WILL BE SOMETHING THAT SAYS THIS IS LEGAL.",2023-05-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,9.0,508,90,26,4,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,bought well advertised small room heater meant heat room cheaply help energy crisis winter apparently danger electric shock product amazon advising customer use however amazon longer business supplier refund available good see amazon helping current cost living crisis notno doubt buried somewhere small print something say legal,0.07462760961178617,0.9253723903882138,0.050476724621424565,0.2,0.7727815401183917,77.27815401183918,High Trust
Steve,/users/588654030000ff000a6f8a54,US,5.0,2023-05-09 12:06:27+00:00,1.0,Was charged then credited then charged again,"Was charged, credited and then recharged again as of May 9, 2023 for Amazon groceries never received. They also removed from my account this grocery order which I find strange. Almost to erase their wrong doing. It seems like I’m being accused of submitting false information to what was received from their delivery personnel . Would you eat a product that was cut open where the seal was.? Or cherry tomatoes or their chicken breasts where the product wrapping was opened and the bag it came in plus the product wrapping had juices leaking all over my steps and floors in my home.? I was notified three hours later from the time the delivery was supposed to have arrived that my items will not be delivered. No explanation why. I have been a customer of Amazon for years and have purchased over $100,000 in products. Other problems I have encountered (as stated above) recently is opened packaging, crushed packaging all containing food products like potato chips, their coconut cream pie, cherry tomatoes, etc. I asked for a credit on my balance and I received it but I feel they are now retaliating against me because of the no show of my order and giving me a credit then charging me again for the same amount of the credit which is now harassment and I’m thinking of suing them over 65.00 in grocery products for their actions. It’s not the money but the principle. My lawsuit will be  10 million including punitive damages. It seems like they don’t believe my claims of how their products arrived. Their service used to be good but not anymore. I think the founder needs to be back at the helm instead of his new mega yacht. These problems all started when he left his position. I saw the change. I’m a CEO of a few companies that I started. I know business.",2023-05-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,9.0,1765,317,44,7,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,charged credited recharged may amazon grocery never received also removed account grocery order find strange almost erase wrong seems like i’m accused submitting false information received delivery personnel would eat product cut open seal cherry tomato chicken breast product wrapping opened bag came plus product wrapping juice leaking step floor home notified three hour later time delivery supposed arrived item delivered explanation customer amazon year purchased product problem encountered stated recently opened packaging crushed packaging containing food product like potato chip coconut cream pie cherry tomato etc asked credit balance received feel retaliating show order giving credit charging amount credit harassment i’m thinking suing grocery product action it’s money principle lawsuit million including punitive damage seems like don’t believe claim product arrived service used good anymore think founder need back helm instead new mega yacht problem started left position saw change i’m ceo company started know business,0.005221352397083892,0.9947786476029161,0.1777902411665732,0.2,0.8329473720347726,83.29473720347727,High Trust
