Jaroslav Politov,/users/645674964cca0b001375ca10,ES,2.0,2023-05-06 17:39:08+00:00,1.0,I strongly do not recommend Amazon,"I strongly do not recommend Amazon. Terrible service. As soon as I set up my account, I started having issues right away. I signed up for a trial Prime subscription and decided to buy some items for my home since I had just moved in. My first purchase wasn't very large, at 800 euros, but then I decided to buy everything I needed all at once, so I wouldn't have to split my delivery into parts. That's why I chose to pay several times more but get everything I needed immediately. My bank declined the transaction because they requested confirmation that it was me making the payment in order to approve such a large amount for spending. While I was dealing with the bank, Amazon blocked me because they considered it suspicious activity.Perhaps I wouldn't have written a review just because of this, but it was only the beginning. Because as soon as I wanted to confirm my identity with Amazon so they could understand it was me, Amazon did absolutely nothing. After blocking my account, they wouldn't let me contact customer support through the account because the account was suspended, even for communication with customer support. They asked me for documents from my bank and information that I had provided in my account. I did that, and they replied that it was not enough information and requested the same thing again. This has been happening in an endless loop. I have provided exactly what they asked for, sometimes even trying to provide more detailed information, but they still continue to ask me for the same information every day. Moreover, when I call customer support, they say they are not competent in matters of account suspension and that the department responsible for unlocking accounts is not directly accessible through a call, only through the bank information they request from me.It turns out they constantly ask for the same thing and then respond that there's not enough information. And no one can tell me what the hell they are missing. As a result, my purchases are paid for, time is passing, and I have been sitting in an empty house for several days now, waiting for them to resolve their issues. It's a waste of time, and I won't be shopping in this store anymore if I need something urgently in the coming days.",2023-05-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,6.0,2250,393,34,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,strongly recommend amazon terrible service soon set account started issue right away signed trial prime subscription decided buy item home since moved first purchase wasnt large euro decided buy everything needed wouldnt split delivery part thats chose pay several time get everything needed immediately bank declined transaction requested confirmation making payment order approve large amount spending dealing bank amazon blocked considered suspicious activityperhaps wouldnt written review beginning soon wanted confirm identity amazon could understand amazon absolutely nothing blocking account wouldnt let contact customer support account account suspended even communication customer support asked document bank information provided account replied enough information requested thing happening endless loop provided exactly asked sometimes even trying provide detailed information still continue ask information every day moreover call customer support say competent matter account suspension department responsible unlocking account directly accessible call bank information request meit turn constantly ask thing respond there enough information one tell hell missing result purchase paid time passing sitting empty house several day waiting resolve issue waste time wont shopping store anymore need something urgently coming day,0.002029594215042679,0.9979704057849573,0.22041503084688727,0.2,0.8430682090618561,84.3068209061856,High Trust
