Jay,/users/6452a685caa57c00155450f4,US,1.0,2023-05-03 20:23:19+00:00,1.0,Looking at a Prime Membership? ..... DON'T!!,"I have a Prime Membership and have had that membership for close to 10 years. If you're thinking about getting a membership... DON'T!! They use to have Free 2-Day Shipping but now everything takes a week + to arrive. When I express me displeasure with Customer Service, they give me the run-around and end up solving nothing. I will not be renewing my membership once it expires. I can't express in words how dissatisfied I am with my overall experience over the last year or more. I use to rave about Amazon and the great things they do. Now, I tell everyone I can to steer clear of this company and look for alternatives. In this day and age, it shouldn't take 10 days for a tube of tooth paste to arrive. I'd give them zero stars, if I could.",2023-05-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,3.0,745,140,44,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,prime membership membership close year youre thinking getting membership dont use free day shipping everything take week arrive express displeasure customer service give runaround end solving nothing renewing membership expires cant express word dissatisfied overall experience last year use rave amazon great thing tell everyone steer clear company look alternative day age shouldnt take day tube tooth paste arrive id give zero star could,0.4237792721219362,0.5762207278780638,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.6038142338212529,60.38142338212529,Medium Trust
