L Gotay,/users/644deb3a90bfde001272d03e,US,1.0,2023-04-30 06:15:04+00:00,1.0,It's time to leave Amazon and back to the stores,"Well, Amazon is getting worse.  Now I am told that when I return an item I will have to wait up to 14 days to get my refund!  This is a company that has not kept good with its own contract with its customers.  The 2-Day delivery is a farce.  You don't get your orders delivered as stated.  They are becoming more often late than on time (or the item is not received at all), yet, they make you wait before you cancel the non-delivered item.  It's an absolute disappointment.  I've had my share of disappointments with this company that I'm going outside of my comfort zone and back to the stores.  It's not worth the lies to keep the business going with them. I've been a long-time customer and patient.  You don't take advantage of my money.  You got paid, and the item requested to return is the item returned.  Here's the thing when I drop off my items I am told no boxes or packaging is required so the shipping company is aware of what is being sent back.  It matches the QR code, so I don't understand the delay in reimbursing me for my refund.  I want my refund.",2023-04-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,30.0,1069,202,48,10,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,well amazon getting worse told return item wait day get refund company kept good contract customer day delivery farce dont get order delivered stated becoming often late time item received yet make wait cancel nondelivered item absolute disappointment ive share disappointment company im going outside comfort zone back store worth lie keep business going ive longtime customer patient dont take advantage money got paid item requested return item returned here thing drop item told box packaging required shipping company aware sent back match qr code dont understand delay reimbursing refund want refund,0.036004071033513066,0.9639959289664869,0.11329220415030847,0.2,0.8046564053133052,80.46564053133052,High Trust
