Honest reviews,/users/5ed7cd6153e6308257da95cb,US,12.0,2023-04-29 22:03:22+00:00,1.0,Buyers be ware,"Buyers be ware! I have been a customer of Amazon for years, and never thought I’d be a victim of their scam. I have returned a few items using QR codes, and have a receipt. UPS has matched all QR codes to the receipt, but Amazon says they have not received the products. $383.02 worth of my hard earned money. UPS advises to reach out to Amazon, Amazon claims to have not receive the items. My credit card company won’t refund the money, because Amazon claims they have not received the items. How were the items not scanned, but I have a receipt?   Is this how you’re making your money? Shame on you!!! You can close my account. I’ll take my poor coins elsewhere. Order#111-9096721-7785817",2023-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,29.0,690,125,14,3,1.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,buyer ware customer amazon year never thought i’d victim scam returned item using qr code receipt ups matched qr code receipt amazon say received product worth hard earned money ups advises reach amazon amazon claim receive item credit card company won’t refund money amazon claim received item item scanned receipt you’re making money shame close account i’ll take poor coin elsewhere order,0.9625845871903472,0.03741541280965277,0.07010656197420079,0.2,0.33272901879966654,33.27290187996665,Low Trust
