David Wayne,/users/644c789e192d6f001379c235,US,1.0,2023-04-29 03:53:50+00:00,1.0,Usually Late with no explanation.,"I pay for Amazon Prime, but you'd never know it.  75% of my purchases are delivered late, with no explanation given.  I don't mean 20 minutes late; I mean a week or two late.  And that date and time is also usually passed on to some other date.  I'll be looking for another method of shipment.",2023-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,29.0,293,56,33,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,pay amazon prime youd never know purchase delivered late explanation given dont mean minute late mean week two late date time also usually passed date ill looking another method shipment,0.025663583454373345,0.9743364165456266,0.03140773976444195,0.2,0.7934497562257017,79.34497562257017,High Trust
Peter Miller,/users/644c473790bfde00127201b6,US,1.0,2023-04-29 00:26:49+00:00,1.0,Poor package placement,"The delivering of packages was place directly in front of our storm door, making access to the package impossible.  Your Drivers need to either knock on the door first, or to place packages away from the door,  This is inexcusable behavior and makes your company look foolish.  If you would like me to teach all your drivers and package delivers I will be glad to do so at a modest salary.  I would expect much better from the supposed leader of the industry",2023-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,29.0,458,83,22,3,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,delivering package place directly front storm door making access package impossible driver need either knock door first place package away door inexcusable behavior make company look foolish would like teach driver package delivers glad modest salary would expect much better supposed leader industry,0.012767684505151726,0.9872323154948482,0.04655075715086932,0.2,0.802926309177598,80.2926309177598,High Trust
paulwills,/users/55a654650000ff0001cce132,GB,72.0,2023-04-28 22:31:01+00:00,1.0,This Company is a total joke,"This Company is a total joke.  I have received an order today where the driver just left the item on the door mat in full view of passers by on the public footpath some 3ft from our front door.  This is not the first time but it will be the last as my purchasing will not be done through Amazon again.  I attempted to contact support and eventually spoke to someone in an overseas (cheap labour) centre.  After explaining my concerns the agent then said they would transfer me to someone else.... but that was the end of any interaction, I waited for 11 minutes but the conversation stopped.  Amazon are a huge retailer but do not back up their operation with any type of Customer Service or care and simply send the complaints to all these overseas centres who simply fob you off.  Its appalling service which is only apparent once they have got your money.  The staff don't give a damn, the online chat agents are insincere and the delivery drivers well say no more !!!!!!!!!",2023-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,28.0,977,178,28,6,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,company total joke received order today driver left item door mat full view passer public footpath ft front door first time last purchasing done amazon attempted contact support eventually spoke someone overseas cheap labour centre explaining concern agent said would transfer someone else end interaction waited minute conversation stopped amazon huge retailer back operation type customer service care simply send complaint overseas centre simply fob appalling service apparent got money staff dont give damn online chat agent insincere delivery driver well say,0.999995828860841,4.171139158959392e-06,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.31996843441983186,31.996843441983184,Low Trust
