Lisa Curry,/users/60bb3731f66049001b2d76c4,GB,8.0,2023-04-28 14:29:10+00:00,1.0,Amazon Fresh Failure and BAD Customer Services,"My Amazon Fresh order was due to be delivered between 12 and 2 pm on the day of delivery.When the order didn't arrive by 2pm I contacted customer services. The first representative told me that they couldn't get in contact with the driver and asked me to try - I couldn't contact the driver either. They then said they were going to refund the order. I agreed. Later they said that the driver was ""in my area"" and would be no later than 4pm ""Max"".Due to the cost of living I didn't have the budget to go and buy more food so I only had the option to take more time out to wait in for the delivery.It didn't arrive by 4pm.I then contacted customer services again who told me that a FREE replacement would be sent out by midnight the same day. After a very long wasted day, time taken off work and an autistic son waiting to be fed, the replacement order arrived by 11:30pm.Today Amazon has taken the payment of £40 despite promising a full refund of the order.I contacted customer services again today and that representative told me that I would be charged the £40 and there was nothing that could be done about it.This has caused stress for both me and my son. I have written to customer services on the email address they provided but that was a few days ago, and they haven't even acknowledged receipt of my email. Needless to say I won't be ordering food from them again and will likely cancel my Prime membership also. Don't bother buying a Prime membership. Doesn't make a shred of difference tbh. And get your food elsewhere.",2023-04-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,28.0,1532,283,46,7,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon fresh order due delivered pm day deliverywhen order didnt arrive pm contacted customer service first representative told couldnt get contact driver asked try couldnt contact driver either said going refund order agreed later said driver area would later pm maxdue cost living didnt budget go buy food option take time wait deliveryit didnt arrive pmi contacted customer service told free replacement would sent midnight day long wasted day time taken work autistic son waiting fed replacement order arrived pmtoday amazon taken payment £ despite promising full refund orderi contacted customer service today representative told would charged £ nothing could done itthis caused stress son written customer service email address provided day ago havent even acknowledged receipt email needless say wont ordering food likely cancel prime membership also dont bother buying prime membership doesnt make shred difference tbh get food elsewhere,0.00882533276114836,0.9911746672388516,0.15872125630959058,0.2,0.827331584881344,82.73315848813439,High Trust
Ivan Boragine,/users/5b4e326d4de5666d34550658,PT,148.0,2023-04-28 14:13:08+00:00,5.0,"Amazon is awesome, in my personal experience","I honestly don't understand the overall rating 1.7 star. My experience with Amazon is just great. Today, I wanted to express my gratitude after ordering melatonin yesterday. My order was delivered in a single day from another county. Free delivery as a premium subscriber which costs me nothing.Prime costs 5 euros which my mobile provider Vodafone pays me back. So my deliveries are free 100%Every issue I ever had before, was solved with truly effective customer support. There was just one highly technical issue with Prime Video which agents failed to understand but I resolved it on my own as a geek.So again and again, thanks, Amazon! I don't share your political and social policies, but you do an amazing job.",2023-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,28.0,717,121,44,7,0.0,0,1,2,1,Suspicious,honestly dont understand overall rating star experience amazon great today wanted express gratitude ordering melatonin yesterday order delivered single day another county free delivery premium subscriber cost nothingprime cost euro mobile provider vodafone pay back delivery free every issue ever solved truly effective customer support one highly technical issue prime video agent failed understand resolved geekso thanks amazon dont share political social policy amazing job,0.9170228897716671,0.08297711022833287,0.06786315199102635,1.0,1.5550611855123717,155.50611855123717,High Trust
