Fra VEFG,/users/64498c8c2783cd0012b21712,BE,2.0,2023-04-27 09:30:49+00:00,4.0,Usually a good experience,"Usually a good experience. Delivery really depends on who you buy your stuff from though, since you have to remember the person you buy your package from has to send it to an amazon warehouse and only THEN amazon can start delivering it to you. Personally, I think I only had one bad experience where my package was 3 weeks late so I decided to contact support, they replied almost immediately since I contacted them through an app kind of like whatsapp, and they were very helpful and gave me a full refund for my item in the form of a 25$ gift card. I think I used the card to buy a 12 inch rainbow dildo and then I sent it to my friend, idk though it was a while ago.",2023-04-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,27.0,670,132,25,4,26.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,usually good experience delivery really depends buy stuff though since remember person buy package send amazon warehouse amazon start delivering personally think one bad experience package week late decided contact support replied almost immediately since contacted app kind like whatsapp helpful gave full refund item form gift card think used card buy inch rainbow dildo sent friend idk though ago,0.017001565665289993,0.98299843433471,0.07403252944475602,0.8,1.7063057230563063,170.63057230563064,High Trust
