Becky Plater,/users/6449a813676e6200131db39f,US,2.0,2023-04-27 00:41:16+00:00,1.0,I got hacked and Amazon won't help.,"I got hacked, person or persons do this changed my email address and password. Charged almost $400.00 dollars to my credit card. I am no longer able to watch prime videos. I spent 53 minutes on the phone with them. After arguing with the rep. I asked to speak with her supervisor. Who told me it was impossible for someone to do that, and I had another email address I just couldn't remember. I then asked him to connect me with security or their fraud department. To which he told me we don't have that. I replied a big company like Amazon doesn't have a fraud department? He said that's right. I told him he was full of poop. End of conversation. Found a number for there security department and get a message saying please hang up and try your call later. Called customer service again woman to me she would report it to their fraud department and they would call me back in about an hour. 4 hours later still no call.",2023-04-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,27.0,921,173,35,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,got hacked person person changed email address password charged almost dollar credit card longer able watch prime video spent minute phone arguing rep asked speak supervisor told impossible someone another email address couldnt remember asked connect security fraud department told dont replied big company like amazon doesnt fraud department said thats right told full poop end conversation found number security department get message saying please hang try call later called customer service woman would report fraud department would call back hour hour later still call,0.016225503806518063,0.9837744961934819,0.09702748177229388,0.2,0.8112927444511997,81.12927444511998,High Trust
