Mark Johnson,/users/60318009d37e8b001a2c4f8a,GB,5.0,2023-04-26 13:28:26+00:00,1.0,Poor customer service from Amazon.,"Terrible customer service from Amazon. I bought a Nadalan Freesat box on Amazon.  It will only pick up a few channels and not  most of the major channels.  I have a different make of Freesat box working in a different room but from the same dish and that works fine so I know the Nadalan box is the issue.  As the item did not work and is functionally virtually useless, I sought to return it.  Every time I attempt to print a return label via the Amazon website, I get an error message and that they were attempting to sort this out.  I called Amazon and they said they would sort this out.  5 days later and the issue persists.  I was told they would e-mail a return label and Amazon have failed to do so.  I received an e-mail saying they would phone back the following day and they did not do so. I can only conclude that they have lost interest and by adopting such a poor and unhelpful stance they hope they will not have to deal with the issue.",2023-04-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,26.0,951,183,34,5,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,terrible customer service amazon bought nadalan freesat box amazon pick channel major channel different make freesat box working different room dish work fine know nadalan box issue item work functionally virtually useless sought return every time attempt print return label via amazon website get error message attempting sort called amazon said would sort day later issue persists told would email return label amazon failed received email saying would phone back following day conclude lost interest adopting poor unhelpful stance hope deal issue,0.006273826624367459,0.9937261733756325,0.10263600673022995,0.2,0.8173902880338623,81.73902880338623,High Trust
Meneleus Tory,/users/64489b79c4e6650012f253f3,US,1.0,2023-04-26 05:34:47+00:00,1.0,False Advertising,"With the end of the COVID-19 pandemic, Amazon has been on the news because Amazon has been losing customers and CUTTING JOBS to save money. Is Amazon in the throes of going out of business? On Sunday afternoon, I ordered a live ""absinthe"" plant from Amazon. Approximately 10 minutes later, I remembered to scroll to the bottom of the page, where Amazon hides the details. The plant that I had ordered was NOT an Artemisia absinthium plant, the absinthe plant. I and most people would call that FALSE ADVERTISING. I tried (Sunday)  to cancel the order, but Amazon would not cancel the order. Several times on Monday, I tried to cancel the order but Amazon would not cancel the order. Today, Tuesday, I tried to cancel the order, but Amazon would not cancel the order. This afternoon, the plant was shipped and cannot be returned. What is wrong with Amazon? I think that I will be switching to Etsy or another service. Buyer beware of Amazon's bad tactics!",2023-04-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,26.0,954,168,17,2,3.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,end covid pandemic amazon news amazon losing customer cutting job save money amazon throe going business sunday afternoon ordered live absinthe plant amazon approximately minute later remembered scroll bottom page amazon hide detail plant ordered artemisia absinthium plant absinthe plant people would call false advertising tried sunday cancel order amazon would cancel order several time monday tried cancel order amazon would cancel order today tuesday tried cancel order amazon would cancel order afternoon plant shipped cannot returned wrong amazon think switching etsy another service buyer beware amazon bad tactic,0.1682603801912705,0.8317396198087295,0.09422321929332586,0.2,0.7347144537630299,73.471445376303,Medium Trust
