Joyce Looney,/users/5fac77bdc1d98c001a04a162,US,2.0,2023-04-25 22:25:09+00:00,1.0,Amazon returns cost more than original shipping.,"I ordered a few things from Amazon that seemed necessary.  All the items were shipped separately, as expected.  They all arrived in a very short amount of time and am pleased with their shipping.  What really ticked me off was the attempt to return something.  One of the items I ordered came in a box from the original manufacturer and was shipped to me via USPS.  When I asked for a return, I was given a Q code for my nearby UPS store...not a USPS label or Q code.  I took the original, unopened package to the UPS store and was told I had to ""PAY"" for another shipping box because the original box was not ""STURDY"" enough.  Funny...the USPS thought it was sturdy enough when they originally picked it up, shipped it and delivered it to me.  With a cost of almost half the estimated refund I would get from Amazon in return shipping fees for re-packing and re-boxing the item, I canceled my return.  With the money for gas and the money I must spend to get the item returned to Amazon, it isn't worth my time or effort.  BEWARE what you purchase with Amazon.  I will go back to ordering from Walmart, as they allow returns to their stores.",2023-04-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,25.0,1142,212,48,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered thing amazon seemed necessary item shipped separately expected arrived short amount time pleased shipping really ticked attempt return something one item ordered came box original manufacturer shipped via usps asked return given q code nearby ups storenot usps label q code took original unopened package ups store told pay another shipping box original box sturdy enough funnythe usps thought sturdy enough originally picked shipped delivered cost almost half estimated refund would get amazon return shipping fee repacking reboxing item canceled return money gas money must spend get item returned amazon isnt worth time effort beware purchase amazon go back ordering walmart allow return store,0.008813667422374464,0.9911863325776256,0.11890072910824454,0.2,0.8193733121104616,81.93733121104616,High Trust
Sue Mills,/users/64481c406ce5cc001295cfb0,US,2.0,2023-04-25 20:56:08+00:00,3.0,I like shopping through Amazon but this…,"I like shopping through Amazon but this last experience might make different choices. Nothing wrong with the purchase process but the delivery really infuriated me. I have 3 doors, front, side and back. Only 2 are used and you can tell side door is never used because sidewalk then street. They had to walk(or drive) by front of house to get house #. Instead of putting it on front porch they placed it on the ground in front of side door, where anyone walking by or driving by would see. Tried to complain at Amazon but there is no where to do it. Amazon needs to hire companies who have better standards for delivery people. Oh the only way that I knew the package was there, delivery person took photo and sent to Amazon, who then emailed me. Package still sat there in plain view for about half an hour. Maybe I should put sign on door - no deliveries at this door please!",2023-04-21 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,25.0,876,164,40,7,4.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,like shopping amazon last experience might make different choice nothing wrong purchase process delivery really infuriated door front side back used tell side door never used sidewalk street walkor drive front house get house instead putting front porch placed ground front side door anyone walking driving would see tried complain amazon amazon need hire company better standard delivery people oh way knew package delivery person took photo sent amazon emailed package still sat plain view half hour maybe put sign door delivery door please,0.10225580578630578,0.8977441942136942,0.09197980931015143,0.6,1.3672680589688773,136.72680589688773,High Trust
