Lorena Nastase,/users/5ee36eaa80fcc43a027d0934,GB,15.0,2023-04-20 10:19:40+00:00,1.0,The driver delivered me a box full of paper rolls!!!,"On 15th of April i was delivered by an allocated Amazon driver two packages. One labelled with the proper ordered item from their website , and another one unlabelled  which supposed to have an Ecovacs cleaning robot . Now , to my horrid stupefaction, when taken inside , and start unpacking, instead of a robot cleaner, on that unlabelled box, i found a pack full of paper rolls!!!!!!  The reason why I am writing this experience everywhere  I can is to rise awareness on the level of theft that happens in 2023!!!! I doubt that package left the Amazon warehouse unlabelled and if so, how did the driver know where to delivery it ???? The facts are very simple, and the driver knew what he was doing not caring a damn in the world that he is seen, nobody will do anything, and the “ item” now in someone’s house will be marked as “ lost” . Such a shame I can’t post the pictures too in here …. What Amazon does? Apologies and a refund is issued, the review i wrote on their website it’s not made visible. So, how can you trust buying electronics or more expensive items from Amazon when the people who work with them steal customers goods????? And it’s happening all over Uk, mostly London not only with Amazon and why companies like these and other delivery companies don’t do anything?????? How many times they didn’t delivered the goods, or to the wrong address , or lying you were not yo be found although you were at home and so on???? And now you come to my door and disrespect me to such a horrid level to deliver me a pack full of paper rolls instead of a robot cleaner  ???  How bad is that in 2023???? Horrible , Horrible experience….. I am beyond disappointed…… this needs to change !!",2023-04-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,20.0,1697,315,52,10,5.0,0,12,1,0,Genuine,th april delivered allocated amazon driver two package one labelled proper ordered i