RLESpeedy2,/users/5c764bf06ba58f664c26de5a,GB,7.0,2023-04-19 01:03:54+00:00,1.0,Words can’t adequately describe how disgraceful their customer service is,"Customer service is utterly appalling. Great if everything goes fine but the moment you have the slightest problem or concern it goes to hell. It’s an utter disgrace. They will NEVER call or email you back but will readily promise to do so. The reps ability to understand a problem or even follow written or verbal English is insufficient for problem-solving that you constantly have to repeat yourself. You have to repeat yourself to a new person every time, they don’t bother to look at chat records (if there even are any). There is no ownership of issues. They don’t make any kind of notes against your account, nothing. They don’t understand their own processes, at least in terms of the information customers receive. They allow people who don’t have the skills or knowledge to deal with serious matters around contractual obligations and your own account security and cyber threats. There is no meaningful complaints process even for the most serious issues and it’s all done outside of the UK with apparently no ability to escalate beyond the customer reps own manager. They can’t handle anything remotely outside the scripts they’re given. Some of the worst customer service I’ve ever experienced",2023-04-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,19.0,1205,201,73,10,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer service utterly appalling great everything go fine moment slightest problem concern go hell it’s utter disgrace never call email back readily promise rep ability understand problem even follow written verbal english insufficient problemsolving constantly repeat repeat new person every time don’t bother look chat record even ownership issue don’t make kind note account nothing don’t understand process least term information customer receive allow people don’t skill knowledge deal serious matter around contractual obligation account security cyber 