Joe Crawford,/users/643b30fe8c95330017eabcb9,US,1.0,2023-04-16 14:21:01+00:00,1.0,Login two step authorization fails,"I tried to logon to my Amazon account and the two step authentication failed since they had my old cell phone number.  There is currently no way to solve the problem on-line.  Their website always takes you to logon with two step authorization, even when you specifically select two step failed.   So, I called customer service for help.  Before she could help me she had to ask several questions to verify my identity.  That failed since I could not list the last three orders I had placed with them without access my account.  I finally got fed up and asked her to close the account.  I then got a email stating: ""If you are experiencing issues with logging into the account you wish to close, visit the Help page below..."" and they give you a web address.That address winds up taking you to the login page that requires two step authorization, which of course fails because of the wrong telephone number.  Every attempt at using their website to correct the problem or cancel the account winds up taking you back to the login page that requires two step authentication.",2023-04-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,16.0,1072,189,34,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,tried logon amazon account two step authentication failed since old cell phone number currently way solve problem online website always take logon two step authorization even specifically select two step failed called customer service help could help ask several question verify identity failed since could list last three order placed without access account finally got fed asked close account got email stating experiencing issue logging account wish close visit help page give web addressthat address wind taking login page requires two step authorization course fails wrong telephone number every attempt using website correct problem cancel account wind taking back login page requires two step authentication,0.024727514471577252,0.9752724855284227,0.10600112170499158,0.2,0.8088364671052097,80.88364671052098,High Trust
