Scott Drumm,/users/632739e498068b00148b6297,US,4.0,2023-04-15 16:40:29+00:00,1.0,Fighting for Amazon with a refund …,"I have been with Amazon for several years. I’ve never had a problem getting a refund either from Amazon directly or for my second or third-party seller. Recently I placed an order and canceled in the same day. Amazon refunded the money that they had charged me from their fulfillment center, but I actually had to call and find out why the second party seller had not refunded the money. Amazon sent an email to the seller after 72 hours. There was no response. Amazon‘s policy is to refund the money. I called Amazon and filed a complaint. They gave me the card member service center. The agent told me and I quote we never charged you for that money. Yes that’s what I said they told me they never charged me for either of the charges . I told him that’s funny because I’m looking at my bank account and I can see both charges the one for $39 the other one for $25. I also can see a week later that you guys refunded the $39 but I filed a complaint with you guys and you had to file an email with the second party seller to get that money. He insisted that they never charged me the money. Then he said they refunded the money  so I said so how was it? You’re telling me one minute ago that you guys never charged me for either of the products and now you’re telling me that you refunded them both? I said I think that you’re lying to me trying to cover your ass. So I had to go to my bank my bank put a hold on it and the money has already cleared now I have to wait and fight for $25.17 from Amazon  highly disappointed but not that a billion dollar  company gives a crap about one persons $25 that they “never took, and then “refunded it, but they never took it  . I can’t make this up. 🤮",2023-03-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,15.0,1693,334,35,7,24.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon several year i’ve never problem getting refund either amazon directly second thirdparty seller recently placed order canceled day amazon refunded money charged fulfillment center actually call find second party seller refunded money amazon sent email seller hour response amazon‘s policy refund money called amazon filed complaint gave card member service center agent told quote never charged money yes that’s said told never charged either charge told that’s funny i’m looking bank account see charge one one also see week later guy refunded filed complaint guy file email second party seller get money insisted never charged money said refunded money said you’re telling one minute ago guy never charged either product you’re telling refunded said think you’re lying trying cover as go bank bank put hold money already cleared wait fight amazon highly disappointed billion dollar company give crap one person “never took “refunded never took can’t make 🤮,0.009242105512170952,0.990757894487829,0.1873247335950645,0.2,0.8328438939629275,83.28438939629275,High Trust
Cockney Londoner,/users/5a4dfa980000ff000afa86cb,GB,21.0,2023-04-15 13:01:22+00:00,3.0,Enfield Depot needs to get its act together,"My moan is about the delivery service provided by their Enfield (North London) Delivery Depot.Amazon Tracking states that packages leave their depot around NOON, yes noon.Most of my orders are delivered to my local 'locker' which happens to be within a Post Office which, on a Saturday, closes at 3 pm!!!!! Should I have a delivery to home the drivers have a tendency to tap on the glass in and surrounding the front door (which rarely I can hear), why I have no idea because there are TWO working doorbells which would be impossible to miss.",2023-04-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,15.0,542,96,43,8,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,moan delivery service provided enfield north london delivery depotamazon tracking state package leave depot around noon yes noonmost order delivered local locker happens within post office saturday close pm delivery home driver tendency tap glass surrounding front door rarely hear idea two working doorbell would impossible miss,0.9936246045985425,0.006375395401457484,0.0538418395961862,0.6,0.9139560656199659,91.39560656199659,High Trust
