Philip Foster,/users/62acbf0af456b40013867379,US,2.0,2023-04-15 03:50:26+00:00,1.0,Amazon’s Customer service,"E-gift cards Amazon is getting pretty famous for selling e-gift cards with no money on them and when you call their customer service you get a person you can’t understand at all because they can’t speak English. When you talk to one of these people they tell you they can’t issue you a refund nor can they send you a card that is good, they want to tell you a line of crap and tell you they reported it to someone else who will get in touch with you in 24 to 48 hours. Well you never hear from anyone so you call back never getting the person you originally spoke to the first time it is always someone different, then you have to go through the same bull crap all over again and never get a new good gift card nor a refund of your money, they just want to play kick the can down the road just to get you off the phone. Well until you make one mad then they send you a email saying everything but coming right out and saying that you took the money from the card and told them it was no good.   Well I am here to say Amazon has done me this way several times and I have reported it without any results but never have they deliberately accused me of being the thief without deliberately saying it. So now I’ll come on the reviews to let other people know that Amazon does this fluently and they are not for one second going to make good on a gift card or anything else you may have a problem with.",2023-04-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,15.0,1396,278,25,3,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,egift card amazon getting pretty famous selling egift card money call customer service get person can’t understand can’t speak english talk one people tell can’t issue refund send card good want tell line crap tell reported someone else get touch hour well never hear anyone call back never getting person originally spoke first time always someone different go bull crap never get new good gift card refund money want play kick road get phone well make one mad send email saying everything coming right saying took money card told good well say amazon done way several time reported without result never deliberately accused thief without deliberately saying i’ll come review let people know amazon fluently one second going make good gift card anything else may problem,0.010247728352678554,0.9897522716473215,0.15591699383062255,0.2,0.8260595345897852,82.60595345897852,High Trust
