Tom,/users/5c68026265f080266cc70874,US,25.0,2023-04-13 13:18:41+00:00,1.0,Amazon has so many problems,"Amazon used to be a great company to do business with. I have been purchasing from them since they first started selling items besides books. Now prices are high, deliveries are late or left in public areas outside of the apartment building instead of safe inside in front of my door and my account is blocked from asking questions or leaving reviews because they say I violated something that no Amazon employee can tell me what it is. I think they did this to me on purpose for complaining about the late deliveries that I paid extra for or the deliveries that never arrived that I contacted them about. Amazon has so many problems and I guess they don't like me contacting them about it so they block me. I can't even contact a seller about an issue with the product received. I've had enough and cancelled my Prime membership and won't buy from again unless absolutely necessary. Walmart online is good so I'll increase my purchases from them instead.",2023-03-30 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,13.0,955,170,27,5,14.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon used great company business purchasing since first started selling item besides book price high delivery late left public area outside apartment building instead safe inside front door account blocked asking question leaving review say violated something amazon employee tell think purpose complaining late delivery paid extra delivery never arrived contacted amazon many problem guess dont like contacting block cant even contact seller issue product received ive enough cancelled prime membership wont buy unless absolutely necessary walmart online good ill increase purchase instead,0.026097421684549395,0.9739025783154506,0.09534492428491306,0.2,0.8060202740147079,80.60202740147079,High Trust
