KB,/users/5dec0c30ebb74602ea0527d2,GB,6.0,2023-04-13 00:26:42+00:00,1.0,Horrible customer service,"I ordered an item for the same day delivery. It wasn’t delivered today and tracking service said that the delivery rescheduled tomorrow by 8. I couldn’t accept because I pay extra money to have prime service. I called customer service. The guy had a strong accent and it was really difficult to understand but I didn’t want to be rude so I kept saying that please repeat because English is not my first language. He put me on hold for a very, very long time and just read out the information from my Amazon account which I’ve already knew about. I wasn’t happy about his “careless” attitude so I complained that I am not happy. He then said to me as if I was the dumb customer, “ I WILL EXPLAIN YOU VERY SLOWLY IF YOU DO NOT UNDERSTAND PLEASE LET ME KNOW” They charge extra money to be prime member but they can’t deliver the item on the day I preferred and this was not the first time. Then he said that he would cancel my prime account then hang up on me. What’s the point having customer service if they just read out what it’s said on my account",2023-04-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,13.0,1049,201,25,3,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item day delivery wasn’t delivered today tracking service said delivery rescheduled tomorrow couldn’t accept pay extra money prime service called customer service guy strong accent really difficult understand didn’t want rude kept saying please repeat english first language put hold long time read information amazon account i’ve already knew wasn’t happy “careless” attitude complained happy said dumb customer “ explain slowly understand please let know” charge extra money prime member can’t deliver item day preferred first time said would cancel prime account hang what’s point customer service read it’s said account,0.025833114483386526,0.9741668855166135,0.11273135165451487,0.2,0.8096297130892096,80.96297130892096,High Trust
Patricia Garcia Sayan,/users/5e043c8c6af5026bc32bd2d7,PE,3.0,2023-04-13 00:23:14+00:00,1.0,Beware when you buy a USD 300 + item,"After being a Prime member for years and always receiving a daily good service, the day arrived when I was not only let down but mistreated by a Amazon Customer Service representative.Sadly I placed an order on March 23rd for a watch that cost USD 450 aprox. I kept receiving messages the delivery was running late until I received a message I should ask for a refund. Why didn’t the refund it automatically I never understood but now I do.To ask for a refund you have to return your item. How can I return something I never received ? The only option is cancelling the delivery (even if it’s days late) and it can be cancelled by the seller (Amazon) or the client, since I was not the seller I had to do it as the client. After that I could only ask for a refund. I called before and I was told that was the method.  By chat the representative told me the item was going to be “delivered tonight” and I asked “you mean in the next 4 hours because it’s already 8pm” and the answer was yes.The following day after not receiving the item I did what I was told. I couldn’t wait longer because I was visiting the US and was flying back to my country. The strange thing is that they told me it was “undeliverable” which is impossible because I was staying in a 5star hotel with 24/7 service and front desk receiving packages. Amazon sent me a code to be given when delivered and I gave it to the hotel. They never arrived to deliver anything nor requested a code. I confirmed that with the hotel. But it’s funny because in 6 days I received at least 10 other orders from Amazon, never missed or lost 1 single order. So “undeliverable” was not accurate.It’s April 12th and still haven’t received anything, the watch or the refund. They told me it was undeliverable and then they told me it was damaged but “since you cancelled the delivery” now I have to wait 30 days for it to be returned to Amazon for my refund.It was never in my hands and I cancelled because they told me to do it but now it’s their excuse for having me wait until they decide.Meanwhile I have had to pay the bank for the USD 450 charged to my credit card.I have chatted 4 times and talked over the phone 1 time with Customer Service Representatives, this lady whose name is Cha. She was rude, arrogant and 0 willingness to help.. just told me I have to wait 30 days and that’s it. I asked if I can talked to somebody else and she told me she was going to hang the phone… 2 times.What can I do ? It’s impossible to get to Amazon, nobody understands the issue.I am responsible for whatever Amazon sold, they decided which carrier to use, they didn’t deliver the order, haven’t sent it back yet BUT everything is about me. They have already charged me but won’t give the money back.A disaster. They work well with sells under USD 300 but more than USD 300 just beware.I have the terrible feeling I won’t see my USD 450 back. Very bad Amazon !!",2023-03-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,13.0,2906,550,36,9,21.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,prime member year always receiving daily good service day arrived let mistreated amazon customer service representativesadly placed order march rd watch cost usd aprox kept receiving message delivery running late received message ask refund didn’t refund automatically never understood doto ask refund return item return something never received option cancelling delivery even it’s day late cancelled seller amazon client since seller client could ask refund called told method chat representative told item going “delivered tonight” asked “you mean next hour it’s already pm” answer yesthe following day receiving item told couldn’t wait longer visiting u flying back country strange thing told “undeliverable” impossible staying star hotel service front desk receiving package amazon sent code given delivered gave hotel never arrived deliver anything requested code confirmed hotel it’s funny day received least order amazon never missed lost single order “undeliverable” accurateit’s april th still haven’t received anything watch refund told undeliverable told damaged “since cancelled delivery” wait day returned amazon refundit never hand cancelled told it’s excuse wait decidemeanwhile pay bank usd charged credit cardi chatted time talked phone time customer service representative lady whose name cha rude arrogant willingness help told wait day that’s asked talked somebody else told going hang phone… timeswhat it’s impossible get amazon nobody understands issuei responsible whatever amazon sold decided carrier use didn’t deliver order haven’t sent back yet everything already charged won’t give money backa disaster work well sell usd usd bewarei terrible feeling won’t see usd back bad amazon,0.07717234328596187,0.9228276567140381,0.30846887268648343,0.2,0.8231076028943158,82.31076028943158,High Trust
Helen  Gatenby,/users/606ca120a49b6900193587d5,GB,3.0,2023-04-12 21:39:38+00:00,1.0,I purchased a tooth whitening kit from…,I purchased a tooth whitening kit from Amazon only to discover (after having inserted the mouth-guards into my mouth that it had previously been used!) Now suffering internal and external mouth sores. Seen GP twice and Dentist once. Have had blood tests and mouth swab. Anxious about the long-term effects and all Amazon can offer is £60 compensation!  This should be a non returnable product and customers should not be exposed to this lack of customer care.,2023-03-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,12.0,459,77,39,7,31.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,purchased tooth whitening kit amazon discover inserted mouthguards mouth previously used suffering internal external mouth sore seen gp twice dentist blood test mouth swab anxious longterm effect amazon offer £ compensation non returnable product customer exposed lack customer care,0.2345854824679846,0.7654145175320154,0.04318564217610768,0.2,0.6913443872012293,69.13443872012293,Medium Trust
