Дід Панас,/users/643665482fd48000129d38b5,BE,1.0,2023-04-12 10:01:26+00:00,1.0,Amazon is not what it used to be...,"Recently I had a terrible experience with the Amazon refund process. I bought the product and returned it the next day, but even after receiving the package three days later, the status still indicated that the product should be received. It's been two weeks now and I still haven't received my refund. I understand that there may be some delays, but Amazon's claim of a 5-7 day return policy is a complete lie. frustrated with the lack of transparency and honesty at Amazon. I will think twice before shopping on Amazon in the future and I will definitely not be recommending them to anyone else.",2023-04-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,12.0,597,105,35,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently terrible experience amazon refund process bought product returned next day even receiving package three day later status still indicated product received two week still havent received refund understand may delay amazon claim day return policy complete lie frustrated lack transparency honesty amazon think twice shopping amazon future definitely recommending anyone else,0.006403478744608922,0.9935965212553911,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.8085761630393613,80.85761630393613,High Trust
