Dwight,/users/5fb5e7d7fe49f3001ac2475e,US,2.0,2023-04-12 03:52:07+00:00,1.0,Amazon Don't Always Refund Money Timely,"I don't want to be negative about a company I could trust. But this is about valuing your customer when a mistake has occurred. I ordered a Cell Phone in December from Amazon it arrived on the 11th of December. I returned the phone on December 16th according to the return rules. I called after about 14 days. Then they told me I had to wait up to 30 days to expect my refund back to the debit card. Which I think is excessive waiting time. at the end of the 30 days, I was on hold for at least 10 minutes and because of work, I was forced to hang up. The next day I traveled to work, for seven days. when I returned I tried to follow up again they ask me for information that I didn't have at the time. So another thirty days go by.  I called today and a  very nice lady help resolve the issue but told me that would have to wait an additional 14 to 30  days for a refund although it had a process. I found that behavior unacceptable. That means they had my money from December 11th until late April. Let's say roughly 12 weeks, at 5% interest for $879.00 equals $43.95 times 3 equals $131.85. When I mentioned this to the nice lady her tone changed and then said there is nothing they can give me except they are sorry for the delay in payment. Well, in my business if I feel like a customer is not happy with my service I make a reasonable offer such as a discount or a refund because if you are a good customer; who can afford to lose good customers? Amazon can! well, like a said I don't want to put down a vendor just because they made one mistake. But they would still have my money if I didn't call today. No go checks and balance systems. I am quite sure this is not the first or last time. But check your Amazon account for your refunds. As a punishment to Amazon for the next 90 days I will not make a purchase with them. That is the only power I have. They offer me a 10-day gift certificate and because I protested they gave me 20 dollars. It is from thank you but no interest to, a 10-day gift certificate to 20 dollars. Plus they lose my money for the next 90 days",2023-04-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,12.0,2079,413,39,6,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,dont want negative company could trust valuing customer mistake occurred ordered cell phone december amazon arrived th december returned phone december th according return rule called day told wait day expect refund back debit card think excessive waiting time end day hold least minute work forced hang next day traveled work seven day returned tried follow ask information didnt time another thirty day go called today nice lady help resolve issue told would wait additional day refund although process found behavior unacceptable mean money december th late april let say roughly week interest equal time equal mentioned nice lady tone changed said nothing give except sorry delay payment well business feel like customer happy service make reasonable offer discount refund good customer afford lose good customer amazon well like said dont want put vendor made one mistake would still money didnt call today go check balance system quite sure first last time check amazon account refund punishment amazon next day make purchase power offer day gift certificate protested gave dollar thank interest day gift certificate dollar plus lose money next day,0.018042081348092272,0.9819579186519077,0.2316320807627594,0.2,0.8373053754785057,83.73053754785057,High Trust
Maxim Lindemann,/users/6435e7c92fd48000129d006e,US,1.0,2023-04-12 01:07:01+00:00,1.0,“I’m so sorry I can’t help you”,I ordered something. It was not delivered on time. I reached out to support team and they suggested that we just cancel the delivery so that I get a refund and order a new one. I asked for a gift-card refund so that I don’t wait for money for 3-5 more days. They said no problem. Next day I find out that I need to wait 15-30 DAYS till they receive the package back and then 3-5 BDAYS to issue the refund and then 3-5 BDAYS to get my refund. So I have to wait for a month to get my goddamn money back because of them not doing their job. And the only thing that could say is “I’m sorry”. Hate Amazon. So sad they have no competition.,2023-04-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,12.0,633,129,31,7,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered something delivered time reached support team suggested cancel delivery get refund order new one asked giftcard refund don’t wait money day said problem next day find need wait day till receive package back bdays issue refund bdays get refund wait month get goddamn money back job thing could say “i’m sorry” hate amazon sad competition,0.007555331525641482,0.9924446684743585,0.0723499719573752,0.2,0.8106923286286543,81.06923286286542,High Trust
gone surfing,/users/63339150c6dc24001425a46f,CR,9.0,2023-04-12 00:40:20+00:00,1.0,JEFF BEZOS of Amazon Fame is B S,"I have $600.00 + left on my Amazon account from a gift card and would rather have the money in my bank! I have used Amazon from day one when all Bezos sold was books, Used to be so easy to leave a good review (even had free surf board fins sent to me as a 'good review' thank you from a new Amazon upstart. Bought some total defective auto brake parts, king size sheets (that were queen size) a terrible highly flammable bath robe and other terrible items, attempted to log on to my review account and got this message ""SORRY BUT YOU DO NOT YET MEET OUR MINIMUM REQUIREMENT TO POST REVIEWS"" WHAT!, I was able to post a review on my very first order ever back in the day. As years went by I noticed my POLITE but negative reviews were gone, never to be seen by anyone. I bought cowboy boots and shipped them here to Costa Rica at a very healthy shipping fee, left boot was 1/2 size to small, not worth sending back, was once again NOT QUALIFIED to post a review. I have since put two and two together and can prove that Amazon will block/remove any negative reviews concerning their precious CHINES and MEXICAN stores to protect said stores from any monetary loss due to any negative reviews posted about these types of 'Amazon Stores' and to be sure you don't post any reviews good or bad they simply block you from posting. So, all you have to do is use their ROBO Contact Us Feature to voice your concern, sooner or later you will be contacted by some kid somewhere on planet Earth that will not be able to assist so ""YOU WILL BE CONTACTED BY OUR SUPERVISOR TEAM BY EMAIL"" YEAH.  RIGHT have gone that route TWICE and never heard from any one!! Amazon is total Bull Sheet  now adays, worse than ebay and that is pretty bad! BOYCOT JEFF BEZOS and his unprofessional money grab company, and I hear that Amazon workers are treated like worthless slaves and forced to work 90 MPH on 