Jim Larkin,/users/643598aeedbb900014379219,US,1.0,2023-04-11 19:29:15+00:00,1.0,I went to place an order on 14 items,"I went to place an order on a tablet (I usually use a computer). Even though I signed in, Amazon did not recognize the device and sent a suspicious activity notice. They then sent me a special password to use to my email account on file. Not only didn't it work, they suspended my account for suspicious activity. They sent a special phone number to call. When I did, they asked me security question as to what I purchased since January. I gave them 4 items. That was not good enough and they cancelled my account. They said I had to reapply for a new account. After verifying all the information I already had, I told them I was not going to re-apply for a new account.  I had this problem years ago and dumped them. Wish I had never come back. Now they lost my family's business (who used Amazon exclusively), relatives and several business accounts, not to mention mine. Good luck people.",2023-04-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,11.0,891,164,36,9,8.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,went place order tablet usually use computer even though signed amazon recognize device sent suspicious activity notice sent special password use email account file didnt work suspended account suspicious activity sent special phone number call asked security question purchased since january gave item good enough cancelled account said reapply new account verifying information already told going reapply new account problem year ago dumped wish never come back lost family business used amazon exclusively relative several business account mention mine good luck people,0.009086974345520218,0.9909130256544798,0.09197980931015143,0.2,0.8138524746892702,81.38524746892702,High Trust
Dana Walker,/users/6308b787b2fce80012ac4c2d,US,1.0,2023-04-11 18:22:19+00:00,2.0,Amazon has got WAY downhill.....,"1. I researched online, and Amazon has upwards of 60 to 70% Asian sellers now (USA site): It's ridiculous - their clothing size measurements are often WAY off (a small in a shirt was 53"" in the bust! I wear an XL and have a 45"" bust); they often don't list the fiber content at all (one item was listed as 100% cotton AND 35% polyester); If you don't read carefully, your item(s) could take a month+ to get because they're shipped from China!; The BROKEN ENGLISH in MOST of product descriptions is absolutely ridiculous, plus wrong color names, duplicate listings of the exact same product, wrong items sent, cm measurements instead of inches, long driveling descriptions like ""You look pretty, sexy for you, so sensual, best dress make you feel luxurious, husband like you better, wear to party, office, vacation, pool, shopping, best dress for your wear...."" . Oh, it gets so freakin' old. For once I'd like to see a whole bunch of LITERATE listings for products.2. Searching for products on Amazon is an absolute joke: You cannot pick your own price-range (it has to be 25$+); when you do a manual search for a specific brand, the results still show off-brands and often will be loosely related to the search you entered; The Asian sellers have illiterate store names: ""Floerns"", Cufech"", ""Linkiom"", ""BTFBM"", ""Dokootoo"", ""Romwe"" ""Micticsi"", and they're everywhere on the site.3. I'm convinced Amazon purposefully rearranges customer product reviews, since the review dates are often out of date order (not sequential); There's absolutely no way 10's of thousands of products all have 5-star reviews before you would see any negative reviews for those thousands of products! At the top of a product review page you can see the percentage of 1-5 star reviews, yet I have had to go in as far as 18-20 pages of product reviews to find ANY ratings under 5 stars. Absolutely ridiculous.4. Amazon Prime isn't worth $140 a year (it went up from $120 in 2022): Prime Video is supposedly free, but most of the videos COST money to watch. I don't use digital books, so that's not a perk for me; I can still get products delivered within 3 days or so, sometimes earlier, and I can find things for a good, low price WITHOUT PRIME! AMAZON, YOU NEED TO GET YOUR ACT TOGETHER.",2023-04-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,11.0,2263,394,32,5,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,researched online amazon upwards asian seller usa site ridiculous clothing size measurement often way small shirt bust wear xl bust often dont list fiber content one item listed cotton polyester dont read carefully item could take month get theyre shipped china broken english product description absolutely ridiculous plus wrong color name duplicate listing exact product wrong item sent cm measurement instead inch long driveling description like look pretty sexy sensual best dress make feel luxurious husband like better wear party office vacation pool shopping best dress wear oh get freakin old id like see whole bunch literate listing product searching product amazon absolute joke cannot pick pricerange manual search specific brand result still show offbrands often loosely related search entered asian seller illiterate store name floerns cufech linkiom btfbm dokootoo romwe micticsi theyre everywhere site im convinced amazon purposefully rearranges customer product review since review date often date order sequential there absolutely way thousand product star review would see negative review thousand product top product review page see percentage star review yet go far page product review find rating star absolutely ridiculous amazon prime isnt worth year went prime video supposedly free video cost money watch dont use digital book thats perk still get product delivered within day sometimes earlier find thing good low price without prime amazon need get act together,0.8884984189156171,0.1115015810843829,0.22097588334268087,0.4,0.6999459672107275,69.99459672107275,Medium Trust
