Tina Alongi Lewis,/users/62b22939fdc1f10012cdcdc7,US,2.0,2023-04-10 22:39:18+00:00,1.0,Awful experience with Amazon credit card and furniture delivery,"I have had an awful experience with an Amazon purchase.  First, the representative suggested I apply for Amazon Prime credit card because they offer 10 months interest free and my purchase was over $1700.00.  I applied with him but my purchase did not get put under the interest free option so I owe full amount.  I only applied for the credit card for the interest free option.  WHAT A SCAM.Secondly, I picked a delivery date for my item and it is for next month on a Saturday.  I triple checked that I could pick such a date and was assured yes only to find out no.  The delivery company tried to deliver a month ahead of time.  When I called Amazon they lied to me about what had transpired and blamed delivery company.Next, the delivery company contacted me again and this time it is 2 weeks before delivery to tell me they DO NOT DELIVER on Saturday's even though the Amazon Representative said I could pick any date available on the calendar.Lastly, spent over 3 hours talking to Amazon Customer Amazon Service Representatives trying to get all matters resolved and to date, nothing has been resolved to my satisfaction.My advice, DO NOT PURCHASE LARGE FURNITURE ON AMAZON AND DO NOT APPLY FOR THEIR BOGUS CREDIT CARD OFFERS.Completely disappointed with Amazon and the lack of customer service.",2023-04-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,10.0,1300,226,63,9,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,awful experience amazon purchase first representative suggested apply amazon prime credit card offer month interest free purchase applied purchase get put interest free option owe full amount applied credit card interest free option scamsecondly picked delivery date item next month saturday triple checked could pick date assured yes find delivery company tried deliver month ahead time called amazon lied transpired blamed delivery companynext delivery company contacted time week delivery tell deliver saturday even though amazon representative said could pick date available calendarlastly spent hour talking amazon customer amazon service representative trying get matter resolved date nothing resolved satisfactionmy advice purchase large furniture amazon apply bogus credit card offerscompletely disappointed amazon lack customer service,0.004490648561507335,0.9955093514384926,0.126752664049355,0.2,0.8231052085291173,82.31052085291172,High Trust
Richie Ryan,/users/5f0371f89a18713dcc500fc1,IE,11.0,2023-04-10 19:41:50+00:00,1.0,Ordered a bag and paid for priority,"Ordered a bag and paid for priority. Bag didn't arrive at this time. Contacted the company. They assured it would arrive the following day. Did not. Contacted again. Was promised bag would arrive the following day as well as compensation. following day, ordered cancelled. They claimed I cancelled it but my chat history proves otherwise. Not bag and awful experience. Said all alone all I wanted was the bag. Was promised it would be solved. Customer service promised a resolution and delivered... NOTHING! Even after talking with customer service for 30 minutes.Benji- did absolutely nothing and said not their problem. Was the one who said that customers with negative experience are entitled to nothing Steffi- lied about delivery and promised resolution Bernice- disconnected when I complained after she said it was my fault. Accused me of cancelling it Abdul-said it was damaged and that was the reason for return(lie)I have no bag and no time to order one. Amazon hate customers",2023-04-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,10.0,985,161,35,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered bag paid priority bag didnt arrive time contacted company assured would arrive following day contacted promised bag would arrive following day well compensation following day ordered cancelled claimed cancelled chat history prof otherwise bag awful experience said alone wanted bag promised would solved customer service promised resolution delivered nothing even talking customer service minutesbenji absolutely nothing said problem one said customer negative experience entitled nothing steffi lied delivery promised resolution bernice disconnected complained said fault accused cancelling abdulsaid damaged reason returnliei bag time order one amazon hate customer,0.049868555035993675,0.9501314449640064,0.09029725182277061,0.2,0.7931251728465574,79.31251728465574,High Trust
Kazzie,/users/60e164665f486a0011706265,GB,7.0,2023-04-10 18:13:37+00:00,1.0,Poor Customer Service,"I ordered a Jump Lead starter pack, the item was ordered to an Amazon locker hub. It never arrived, apparently delivery failed, I did not receive a code to any locker.  Amazon assured me my item would arrive next day, it didn’t.  I called Amazon who said I would be issued a refund to the original payment method, only to find out they refunded money to a gift card. When I called again today to query the advisor called me a liar and said I requested refund to a gift card!  Now I have £50.99 sitting on a gift card and not in my account.When I tried to explain I was told the refund would go back to my original payment method she hung up on me.Amazon have lost my trust and custom.",2023-04-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,10.0,684,133,21,3,5.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,ordered jump lead starter pack item ordered amazon locker hub never arrived apparently delivery failed receive code locker amazon assured item would arrive next day didn’t called amazon said would issued refund original payment method find refunded money gift card called today query advisor called liar said requested refund gift card £ sitting gift card accountwhen tried explain told refund would go back original payment method hung meamazon lost trust custom,0.0883808852005953,0.9116191147994047,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.7707282337878123,77.07282337878124,High Trust
