T scok,/users/64329b942271270013ce77e7,SE,2.0,2023-04-09 13:04:28+00:00,1.0,Amazon.de and story about gift cards,"Amazon.de and story about gift cards. I wanted to buy a gift card, after filling in all the details, after entering the visa card, my purchase was not finalized. Okay it happens. I contacted customer service, everything was OK, an amazon employee canceled my purchase. BUT a few minutes later, I got a message that my password request was accepted and I have to click on the link. (of course I didn't order any password changes) I deleted the message. a minute later my phone ring and I heard that amazon was calling me and she  would help me with buy a gift card. I hung up. but I got suspicious that an amazon employee shared my number with someone from a scam center. I deleted my Amazon account. Amazon needs to rethink how it selects its employees.",2023-04-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,9.0,753,138,36,6,6.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazonde story gift card wanted buy gift card filling detail entering visa card purchase finalized okay happens contacted customer service everything ok amazon employee canceled purchase minute later got message password request accepted click link course didnt order password change deleted message minute later phone ring heard amazon calling would help buy gift card hung got suspicious amazon employee shared number someone scam center deleted amazon account amazon need rethink selects employee,0.020461377966713802,0.9795386220332862,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.8052488399005466,80.52488399005466,High Trust
