matthew weatherer,/users/5ee09b1e2bbe54b597e1c7c5,GB,4.0,2023-04-08 19:49:32+00:00,1.0,Beware of delivery chain fraud,"Beware of delivery chain fraudI purchased a £550 i9 processor, opened the package infront of the delivery driver as I've had previous bad experiences with amazon. The processor had been removed from the package and there was only an empty box remaining. The driver took the package back and said he would mark it as undeliverable. Only after sending Amazon video proof of this did they concede that the package had not been delivered and then they tell me once the return is processed it can take 30 days for a refund. Why, oh why do they make the packaging so easy to be tampered with?",2023-04-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,8.0,586,106,30,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,beware delivery chain fraudi purchased £ processor opened package infront delivery driver ive previous bad experience amazon processor removed package empty box remaining driver took package back said would mark undeliverable sending amazon video proof concede package delivered tell return processed take day refund oh make packaging easy tampered,0.014351742487034452,0.9856482575129656,0.05945036455412227,0.2,0.8047142016673072,80.47142016673072,High Trust
A.X.,/users/6431a496dcea3200132ab2f3,CA,1.0,2023-04-08 19:50:23+00:00,1.0,Amazon push for sale aggressively,"I shopped on Canada Amazon for years and found out that they push for sale incredibly aggressively now! You can’t write a negative review for the product. Therefore, customers are misleading by good reviews only. Return policy is a harassment and some items literally can’t return at all! Amazon doesn’t let you easily see the item is not returnable when you place the order. Instead, they encourage you place order quick by the quick shipping timer and misleading you free return policy within 30days. I stoped shopping from Canada Amazon for a while until I purchased a Supmix 60cc chainsaw last week and got a very frustrated experience from Canada Amazon service. The seller messaged me to retune the item. However, I couldn’t apply a return label. The Amazon supervisor hang up on me without any effort. When I attempted to call back, they transferred to a person who told me he is DELIVERING specialist and he told me the item is non returnable. What’s wrong with Amazon?",2023-04-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,8.0,977,168,33,5,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,shopped canada amazon year found push sale incredibly aggressively can’t write negative review product therefore customer misleading good review return policy harassment item literally can’t return amazon doesn’t let easily see item returnable place order instead encourage place order quick quick shipping timer misleading free return policy within day stoped shopping canada amazon purchased supmix cc chainsaw last week got frustrated experience canada amazon service seller messaged retune item however couldn’t apply return label amazon supervisor hang without effort attempted call back transferred person told delivering specialist told item non returnable what’s wrong amazon,0.12418456658585153,0.8758154334141485,0.09422321929332586,0.2,0.7567523605657394,75.67523605657394,High Trust
BC,/users/60d2544459ee77001a699b3f,US,3.0,2023-04-08 14:44:57+00:00,1.0,Amazon support is AWFUL,I guess Amazon will continue to support merchants who keep sending the wrong merchandise.  I asked for the wrong item to be replaced with what had actually ordered. The merchant sent the same wrong item to replace their mistake. I pointed it out to Amazon and they refused to post my review. I am yet to receive my refund.They clearly missed the point. The company advertised one thing and sent the wrong item TWICE. I guess I need to think twice about buying anything on Amazon,2023-04-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,8.0,478,86,23,4,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,guess amazon continue support merchant keep sending wrong merchandise asked wrong item replaced actually ordered merchant sent wrong item replace mistake pointed amazon refused post review yet receive refundthey clearly missed point company advertised one thing sent wrong item twice guess need think twice buying anything amazon,0.023312026958922743,0.9766879730410772,0.04823331463825014,0.2,0.7979906494481886,79.79906494481887,High Trust
