Mr Holistic,/users/5ede8393b70b9f431805d637,US,8.0,2023-04-08 03:32:42+00:00,1.0,Amazon - Arrogant organization and people who believe they are the only place to shop.,"Going, going gone. Customer service and their loyalty to the customer are a thing of the past.  Their people are spoiled little know-it-alls who are arrogant and actually know very little. Many Amazon representatives have very heavy accents, are difficult to understand, in many cases speaking broken English, lacking basic writing skills. This translates into people who cannot understand what you are calling about or how to help you. Amazon yet again ticked me off with more aggravating issues.  First was a problem with my Amazon 55"" Omni TV which recently started having additional software issues, this time with the picture setting Vivid. I called Amazon and explained the TV would not stay on the Vivid setting and kept going to Natural instead. This was never an issue in the past. Per their request I rebooted the TV, after, I unplugged the TV which still did not work. They then wanted me to reset the TV back to factory settings which I said I would not do as it would not fix the issue, the problem was on their end and that they needed to submit a ticket. The Amazon support person said they cannot until I reset the TV as requested. After over an hour, I advised I would just wait until someone else calls, then takes the hours to reset the TV for them to find out I was right. It only took two days for me to be proven right and the issue to be fixed. Next I wrote a product review for a shampoo and conditioner as follows, which was rejected by morons several times.Review: Title: Excellent product - highly recommend.Text: I developed a very itchy scalp from environmental allergies which was greatly exacerbated by another high end conditioner. Even when I stopped using it, the itch would not go away, even after several months. I read many reviews, found this conditioner along with the shampoo which was in a two pack. Love it. Stopped the itch completely, and it keeps it under control. Both the Shampoo and Conditioner smell great. I did receive a card in the mail from the manufacturer stating I would receive a small gift for leaving a honest review which I would have done without it, so it was just an additional benefit. Tip: In my opinion the conditioner goes faster, so we buy at least a couple of the combination pack, and then an extra one or two of the conditioner.Amazons reply: Hello, Specifically, I would like to draw your attention to the following guideline: -We don't allow content that advocates or threatens physical or financial harm to yourself or others. ------ review you posted (as listed above) the line we rejected for is ""Stopped the itch completely, and it keeps it under control."" Why we rejected ---1. Product work differently for every individual not same working for everyone.2. If you said it worked perfectly and we approved and if some another customer uses it and have harsh reactions , then that person will be in serious trouble.Note, my review is like millions of others giving their opinion. Amazon has dug in their heels. Their CEO and Executives are cowards who cannot and will not take the time to respond to the little people, instead their underpaid, low intelligence employees handle it. From this point on, purchasing from Amazon is only, and I mean only in on an emergency basis, such as for health issues where I cannot get the product anywhere else. From what I read I believe they already laid off around 10,000 employees, and I look forward to many more to come.  Amazon is very slowly becoming a thing of the past. A relative has Walmart+ and they are making inroads, getting better and better by the day. I will make sure to post my opinion on every website possible along with sending copies of the Amazon email to family and friends for a good laugh!",2023-04-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,8.0,3730,659,86,15,4.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,going going gone customer service loyalty customer thing past people spoiled little knowitalls arrogant actually know little many amazon representative heavy accent difficult understand many case speaking broken english lacking basic writing skill translates people cannot understand calling help amazon yet ticked aggravating issue first problem amazon omni tv recently started additional software issue time picture setting vivid called amazon explained tv would stay vivid setting kept going natural instead never issue past per request rebooted tv unplugged tv still work wanted reset tv back factory setting said would would fix issue problem end needed submit ticket amazon support person said cannot reset tv requested hour advised would wait someone else call take hour reset tv find right took two day proven right issue fixed next wrote product review shampoo conditioner follows rejected moron several timesreview title excellent product highly recommendtext developed itchy scalp environmental allergy greatly exacerbated another high end conditioner even stopped using itch would go away even several month read many review found conditioner along shampoo two pack love stopped itch completely keep control shampoo conditioner smell great receive card mail manufacturer stating would receive small gift leaving honest review would done without additional benefit tip opinion conditioner go faster buy least couple combination pack extra one two conditioneramazons reply hello specifically would like draw attention following guideline dont allow content advocate threatens physical financial harm others review posted listed line rejected stopped itch completely keep control rejected product work differently every individual working everyone said worked perfectly approved another customer us harsh reaction person serious troublenote review like million others giving opinion amazon dug heel ceo executive coward cannot take time respond little people instead underpaid low intelligence employee handle point purchasing amazon mean emergency basis health issue cannot get product anywhere else read believe already laid around employee look forward many come amazon slowly becoming thing past relative walmart making inroad getting better better day make sure post opinion every website possible along sending copy amazon email family friend good laugh,0.014400726684935125,0.9855992733150649,0.36960179472798654,0.2,0.8667199956031298,86.67199956031298,High Trust
