Vic Godding,/users/570e7ab90000ff000a1717dd,GB,96.0,2023-04-06 14:49:27+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime are as bad as the other shoddy traders,"On the 28/03/23 my Amazon account was hacked, 3 lots of £28.25 total of £84.75 was taken by ordering 3 items at £3.25 and 3 Gift Cards of £25 each. Amazon admitted that it was fraud and that the money taken would be credited, I have now chased through Amazon several times as no credits shown. Amazon have today told me that I should contact my Bank telling them what has gone on. My Bank is NatWest a Bank that never give customers support ( They pretend they do, but we just queue jump online and live) the Security breach is clearly at Amazon as the fraudsters ordered products I ordered months ago along with gift cards ( Amazon must know where the cards were sent, but have done nothing) I am a long term Amazon customer paying prime membership for years. I am disgusted that Amazon are now washing there hands of this issue....the have since the 28th March told me my credit is on its way....today I find out that that’s a lie!",2023-03-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,6.0,933,175,51,10,9.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,amazon account hacked lot £ total £ taken ordering item £ gift card £ amazon admitted fraud money taken would credited chased amazon several time credit shown amazon today told contact bank telling gone bank natwest bank never give customer support pretend queue jump online live security breach clearly amazon fraudsters ordered product ordered month ago along gift card amazon must know card sent done nothing long term amazon customer paying prime membership year disgusted amazon washing hand issuethe since th march told credit waytoday find that’s lie,0.39640051787152186,0.6035994821284781,0.0981491867638811,0.2,0.6214295784170153,62.14295784170153,Medium Trust
G Susie,/users/642e7787f214a50012d4e7b7,JP,2.0,2023-04-06 09:41:35+00:00,5.0,Outstanding Online Retailer,"Amazon is a truly outstanding online retailer that offers an extensive range of products to customers around the world. As a frequent shopper on Amazon, I have always been impressed by the quality of the products and the excellent level of customer service provided by the company. I have found that Amazon's products are consistently of high quality and are always delivered promptly and efficiently.In addition to its wide selection of products, Amazon also provides exceptional customer service. The company is committed to providing a seamless shopping experience, and I have always found its customer service representatives to be friendly, helpful, and knowledgeable. Whether I have a question about a product or need assistance with an order, Amazon's customer service team is always ready and willing to assist me in a timely and professional manner.Overall, I highly recommend Amazon to anyone looking for a reliable and trustworthy online retailer. With its vast selection of products, exceptional customer service, and commitment to quality, Amazon truly stands out as one of the best e-commerce platforms in the world.",2023-04-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,6.0,1130,176,27,3,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon truly outstanding online retailer offer extensive range product customer around world frequent shopper amazon always impressed quality product excellent level customer service provided company found amazon product consistently high quality always delivered promptly efficientlyin addition wide selection product amazon also provides exceptional customer service company committed providing seamless shopping experience always found customer service representative friendly helpful knowledgeable whether question product need assistance order amazon customer service team always ready willing assist timely professional manneroverall highly recommend amazon anyone looking reliable trustworthy online retailer vast selection product exceptional customer service commitment quality amazon truly stand one best ecommerce platform world,0.02755714654970777,0.9724428534502922,0.09871003925967471,1.0,2.005963434577081,200.5963434577081,High Trust
