colin southwell,/users/5af417574de5666d348c5896,GB,35.0,2023-04-05 12:20:37+00:00,1.0,Third party suppliers on Amazon tricking long term customers,"Have been a long term customer spending thousands of pounds a year. Have a Canon copier and always use Canon cartridges bought on Amazon. Recently looked at website and ordered cartridges that were packaged and imaged to fool the buyer that they were genuine. What turned up were Chinese copies that do not work in a Canon machine - £30 wasted.  My issue with Amazon is that there are a dozen reviews, going back some time, saying the same thing, that the cartridges are useless, but Amazon simply print the review but take no further action. Resulting in more of their customers, who trust the Amazon brand, to be tricked. They need to be more proactive and censure companies who are selling goods not fit for purpose on their site.",2023-04-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,5.0,733,130,60,9,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,long term customer spending thousand pound year canon copier always use canon cartridge bought amazon recently looked website ordered cartridge packaged imaged fool buyer genuine turned chinese copy work canon machine £ wasted issue amazon dozen review going back time saying thing cartridge useless amazon simply print review take action resulting customer trust amazon brand tricked need proactive censure company selling good fit purpose site,0.033902398145345326,0.9660976018546547,0.07291082445316882,0.2,0.7976309658179611,79.7630965817961,High Trust
