Taylor H,/users/642c39b847664d00124126b5,US,1.0,2023-04-04 16:52:57+00:00,1.0,I am very disappointed with the way things are going at Amazon,"I am very disappointed with the purchase of a item. I ordered a Murphy bed in white on 3/23/23. This past weekend it was delivered to me and I attempted to put it together. After opening the boxes, I noticed that I received BLACK colored drawers. I contacted Amazon's Customer Service hotline and they at first asked me to disassemble the ENTIRE bed, repackage the items, and return it to the postal service. I explained that I do not need the entire bed replaced, I just need WHITE colored drawers. In addition, it would cost me more money to purchase new boxes to place the pieces that are over 200 pounds, in ten different boxes, into my economy car (that does not fit). They then suggested they would send ""Pilot"" to package and pick up the items because their policy is to return the entire item for a refund, and I would have to order it again instead of just sending me replacement drawers. ...The bed is now $500 more than what I paid originally. Amazon was not accommodating for their error. The bed was over $2,000 and you would think they would help resolve this issue. I am very disappointed with how Amazon is operating lately and will not be purchasing anything from them again until they get things right.",2023-04-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,4.0,1220,221,62,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,disappointed purchase item ordered murphy bed white past weekend delivered attempted put together opening box noticed received black colored drawer contacted amazon customer service hotline first asked disassemble entire bed repackage item return postal service explained need entire bed replaced need white colored drawer addition would cost money purchase new box place piece pound ten different box economy car fit suggested would send pilot package pick item policy return entire item refund would order instead sending replacement drawer bed paid originally amazon accommodating error bed would think would help resolve issue disappointed amazon operating lately purchasing anything get thing right,0.005396708693499454,0.9946032913065005,0.12394840157038699,0.2,0.8220913259673276,82.20913259673276,High Trust
Scott O'Dell,/users/642c1b7b4793ef0014c348d7,US,2.0,2023-04-18 20:11:15+00:00,1.0,Amazon is Operated Like an All-Powerful Kingdom,"Great selection, fast shipping. BUT, Amazon did not get big by being nice or fair. My seller account was suspended for no given reason. It took a year and letters to Bezos to get it back.  By the way, when you post content, Amazon owns it forever. Then they locked my consumer buyer account - again for reasons unknown. Amazon insisted that my account was new (WRONG - had it for years) and finally suggested that I just open a new account (what, and lose years of purchase history?). This is the short version of things. I will NEVER use Amazon again.",2022-12-31 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,18.0,552,102,47,7,108.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,great selection fast shipping amazon get big nice fair seller account suspended given reason took year letter bezos get back way post content amazon owns forever locked consumer buyer account reason unknown amazon insisted account new wrong year finally suggested open new account lose year purchase history short version thing never use amazon,0.006401684394660359,0.9935983156053396,0.05720695457094784,0.2,0.8082405487168595,80.82405487168595,High Trust
Miss,/users/61dc30e99f4bfe0012ea3b32,GB,4.0,2023-04-04 14:17:14+00:00,1.0,-25 star and i will be using ebay,"#amazonfraud -25 star and i will be using ebay I created an amazon account long time ago. I got a new number in 2021 and i realised i wont be able to access my account because i need my mobile number verification,. I called amazon and the customer service told me there is nothing he can do and I will have to create a new account using the same email and the old account will be deleted. I have been logging in and out of the new account with no problem. I had a £25 gift voucher on the new account. logged in with my new account password as it was already saved on my laptop. To my surprise, it logged me back to my old account. I cant log in to my new account with my £25 gift voucher. I called customer service again, and got the same programmed answer to create a new account and there is nothing they can do. SO my new account with £25 just poofed into thin air because of amazon customer service incompetency. Never ever would buy anything from this incompetent waste of time website with absolute NPC customer service",2023-04-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,4.0,1025,197,33,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazonfraud star using ebay created amazon account long time ago got new number realised wont able access account need mobile number verification called amazon customer service told nothing create new account using email old account deleted logging new account problem £ gift voucher new account logged new account password already saved laptop surprise logged back old account cant log new account £ gift voucher called customer service got programmed answer create new account nothing new account £ poofed thin air amazon customer service incompetency never ever would buy anything incompetent waste time website absolute npc customer service,0.010195524646347934,0.989804475353652,0.11048794167134043,0.2,0.8169998260110941,81.69998260110941,High Trust
