Yasmin McEwen,/users/6151de8aebccb0001232db14,US,13.0,2023-04-04 19:46:31+00:00,1.0,Amazon still STALKING ME ON MY PHONE.,"Today being stalked by Amazon. Sending me MENS VANS SKATEBOARDING SHOES ONTO MY PHONE. I am sick to death of Amazon stalking me on my phone 😭😭😭😭😭 I continue having complications with both talking to any English speaking CSR and getting rudely spoken to by foreign people overseas who clearly Do Not Care:( That I am a Prime Member means nothing to Amazon. I have been trying to buy a dog stroller on a payment plan. They approve the payment plan and then proceed to charge my Card for the over $320.00 full price of the dog stroller. The payment plan is to pay for this item month to month. Not all at once. I have bought 2 other items using their month to month plan with no problems. Yet the minute I try to buy this very important item they charge the full price even though I checked Month to month and the agreement shows I will only be charged a fraction of the full price. Zero help from Amazon about this. I contacted Petique the dog stroller makers and all they said was 'Sorry about Amazon,"" So Zero help. Many of my packages get stolen or delivered to completely different cities and I get cruel emails telling me my order has been delivered to me-when in fact it has not. I feel like there is a criminal element to my account because people email me telling me I need to change me mailing delivery instructions just seconds after I place my Amazon order. Also telling me to ""Update your Billing Address"". I have called and emailed Amazon about all of these issues and its always the same 2 voices of 2 men; they are very rude, sarcastic and sounds like a former landlord who did very bad things to me. It has gotten scary ordering anything from Amazon anymore. Amazon also continues sending me Suggestions to buy: MENs Watches. MENs Clothing. MENs Shoes. ALL MENs items. I am a Disabled Woman with Cancer. I have NEVER bought ANY Mens items and have asked them t