ce put manager also tell delivery monitor saying come resolve situation ever amazon customer service clearly forgotten job role act buffer company upset customer customer service team like wont keep customer long clearly staff working lost spark company hence keep striking think amazon need sit review self maybe restructure old way running arent scratch large company,0.012002684795046818,0.9879973152049532,0.14582164890633764,0.2,0.823162987383744,82.3162987383744,High Trust
