meme,/users/5659a4070000ff0001ee5d64,GB,56.0,2023-04-02 13:36:49+00:00,1.0,I do not trust AMAZON company anymore,"I do not trust AMAZON company anymore! they are holding my personal data after locking me out of my account for months. i asked them to remove my back card when i suspected suspicious activity and they put it back onto my account! when you phone up they know your phone number so this is then diverted to india and you have no hope of speaking with the relevant comlaints team. Anyone could be using your name and details to make fake purchases! if you have closed my account why is my personal information still remaining on your data and being used! this only happened because i called them out of what looked like fraudulent activity by sellers or whomever they are, I ordered and was sent items that would break or no longer work within a couple of weeks. when speaking to customers service they were asking for access to my computer!  when trying to get hold of the seller after purchasing an item, the shop would have been closed,  so you cannot contact them for refund or using a new name. as most sellers have two or three different shop names. I complained about this also complaint about the warranty which has been manipulated on most purchases example: upon purchasing an item when you read the description, i would always only purchase from amazon and fulfilled by amazon! and there would be a year or three year warranty, then upon returning to the site that would of been changed to one month or less than that! and a different seller name, not amazon! never purchase from third parties! or tried not too, when the item broke, I would then go back to the site only to find the listing that I bought, changed to some other shop which is now closed! so, you cannot contact anyone to get a refund! so the third party is changing the script to make it look like i am purchasing from amazon when in fact it is not! I called amazon out regarding this and they obviously are not happy! or the third parties that are mad because there scams have been exposed, then my email was harvested for a data breach , my mobile number was used in the usa and so on and so on, you cannot trust these people with your banking as someone from amazon went to collect monies from my bank account! and you cannot trust them with your personal data! their staff are untrustworthy! use with great caution! infact do not use try and find someone else to buy from! support your local businesses. I have now contacted amazon as to what they as a company is still using my personal data for, and what the information is they are holding of me to track my online presents. One is my mobile phone number, as they flagged the call and new it was me! unless this is a bunch of scammers in India !This needs to be removed! ASAP!",2023-04-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,2.0,2708,503,37,7,0.0,0,22,2,1,Suspicious,trust amazon company anymore holding personal data locking account month asked remove back card suspected suspicious activity put back onto account phone know phone number diverted india hope speaking relevant comlaints team anyone could using name detail make fake purchase closed account personal information still remaining data used happened called looked like fraudulent activity seller whomever ordered sent item would break longer work within couple week speaking customer service asking access computer trying get hold seller purchasing item shop would closed cannot contact refund using new name seller two three different shop name complained also complaint warranty manipulated purchase example upon purchasing item read description would always purchase amazon fulfilled amazon would year three year warranty upon returning site would changed one month less different seller name amazon never purchase third party tried item broke would go back site find listing bought changed shop closed cannot contact anyone get refund third party changing script make look like purchasing amazon fact called amazon regarding obviously happy third party mad scam exposed email harvested data breach mobile number used usa cannot trust people banking someone amazon went collect monies bank account cannot trust personal data staff untrustworthy use great caution infact use try find someone else buy support local business contacted amazon company still using personal data information holding track online present one mobile phone number flagged call new unless bunch scammer india need removed asap,0.9999999999999005,9.947598300641403e-14,0.282108805384184,0.2,0.3564217610768865,35.64217610768865,Low Trust
