Amanda Gu,/users/6428741395d55f0014adfbda,US,1.0,2023-04-01 20:13:03+00:00,1.0,"Two months after return, still no refund!!!","We purchased an iPhone (renewed premium) on Feb. 17, 2023, totally about $600. We returned it on Feb. 27 with free return service. More than two months have passed, but we still haven't received a refund from Amazon. We called multiple times to Amazon service and was informed each time that they have received the return and would refund us soon. About two weeks ago, their service manager Mr. Dulfo apologized to us and promised to refund us in 3-5 days with an additional compensation of $90 for the inconveniences that Amazon caused to us. He also sent us confirmation emails regarding the refund and the compensation. However, nothing has happened!!! We still have not received anything!!! What we should do to get our money back?!!!",2023-04-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,4.0,1.0,738,126,43,7,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,purchased iphone renewed premium feb totally returned feb free return service two month passed still havent received refund amazon called multiple time amazon service informed time received return would refund u soon two week ago service manager mr dulfo apologized u promised refund u day additional compensation inconvenience amazon caused u also sent u confirmation email regarding refund compensation however nothing happened still received anything get money back,0.999892452631292,0.0001075473687079942,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.3141872565783529,31.41872565783529,Low Trust
