James Padgett,/users/60fdadb97642840015578dc5,US,2.0,2023-03-30 05:05:23+00:00,1.0,How businesses go down hill.,"I have had an account with Amazon for quite a few years now, what was good has fallen into discussed. I was Prime for about 3 years but now dropped that and now dealing with their bull threats over not paying for Prime anymore. I never really ever got 2nd day delivery as promised and always bought stuff with free shipping. The only reason I kept Prime was for the movies and they are no better now than Netflix.  Also have been waiting on my  gallon jug of weed killer that was supposed to be to me in less than 2 weeks,  Is now scheduled to be delivered over a month since I bought it. Could have gotten it cheaper and sooner from anyone. C.C.P. special.",2023-03-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,30.0,657,126,28,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,account amazon quite year good fallen discussed prime year dropped dealing bull threat paying prime anymore never really ever got nd day delivery promised always bought stuff free shipping reason kept prime movie better netflix also waiting gallon jug weed killer supposed less week scheduled delivered month since bought could gotten cheaper sooner anyone ccp special,0.023127790925378755,0.9768722090746212,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.8025695874313095,80.25695874313095,High Trust
