Nina D,/users/642457d601554f0016d49790,CA,1.0,2023-03-29 17:23:11+00:00,1.0,Delivery nightmare,"The logistics manager was helpful, but my package was not delivered. The delivery driver faked the delivery as they didn't even show up, but noted that they attempted to deliver my package which is a lie as I was at the delivery point waiting for the package.The driver called once I picked up on the second ring and they hung up. I'm very disappointed in Amazon logistics and have requested for them to be removed as a delivery option for future orders because I don't trust their delivery drivers. I'll take my chances with Canada Post.Update- I was told yesterday that my package would be delivered this morning and still no package. When I call the other logistics team member who answered told me that the manager from yesterday misinformed me and that they can't deliver packages within a specific timeframe, I asked if that was the case then the site wouldn't give expected delivery times.This whole process has been stupid and stressful. I have been very inconvenienced and Amazon didn't try to help instead they are only giving me the run around all on a package that was supposed to be delivered yesterday. Very poor service.If they don't rectify this they will lose me as a customer. This is how Amazon treats their prime members",2023-03-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,29.0,1240,216,18,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,logistics manager helpful package delivered delivery driver faked delivery didnt even show noted attempted deliver package lie delivery point waiting packagethe driver called picked second ring hung im disappointed amazon logistics requested removed delivery option future order dont trust delivery driver ill take chance canada postupdate told yesterday package would delivered morning still package call logistics team member answered told manager yesterday misinformed cant deliver package within specific timeframe asked case site wouldnt give expected delivery timesthis whole process stupid stressful inconvenienced amazon didnt try help instead giving run around package supposed delivered yesterday poor serviceif dont rectify lose customer amazon treat prime member,0.024322998494398233,0.9756770015056018,0.12114413909141895,0.2,0.8120673285710847,81.20673285710846,High Trust
