Sarah Ruhstorfer,/users/5e29fbac61678135f9873dc9,US,1.0,2023-03-29 02:51:09+00:00,1.0,GARBAGE Customer Service.,"Customer service is absolutely ridiculous. It's very clear that none of their representatives are in the U.S. They barely speak English and can't help with any real, actual issues. I ordered an ""open box, very good"" $700 stroller, only to receive it dirty, frayed, and the frame completely broken.... and it wasn't even the right model! $700! Customer service was useless. Transferred 3 times and ALL of them just repeated platitudes in broken English. Just ridiculous.",2023-03-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,29.0,469,76,25,3,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,customer service absolutely ridiculous clear none representative u barely speak english cant help real actual issue ordered open box good stroller receive dirty frayed frame completely broken wasnt even right model customer service useless transferred time repeated platitude broken english ridiculous,0.5076901460178582,0.4923098539821418,0.04262478968031408,0.2,0.5546798849271336,55.46798849271336,Medium Trust
E Zupan,/users/6423893d9fdbd20013a3a64e,US,1.0,2023-03-29 02:41:43+00:00,1.0,I recently ordered electric mountain bike,I recently ordered electric mountain bike from Amazon for $379. Two days later my wife decided she wanted the same one as well. So I looked up the same bike and the price was now advertised for a lesser price of $353. I immediately added it to my cart. I had not yet received my bike yet at this point. I got back to my house 2 hours later and went to purchase my wife her bike but when I went to purchase the bike in the cart the price jumped back up to $379 even though it still showed $353 in the cart. I then contacted customer service to see why this was happening. They were very rude from the start of our conversation. They continued to gaslight every question I was asking. They then requested I send them screenshots of what I was trying to explain…. So I did. I was then put on hold for 15 minutes. When she came back “CS” she stated that in that two hour period the price had changed and had gone up. Never explaining why it still said the lower price in my cart. I then went back to my cart after getting nowhere with customer service. I then saw that they had adjusted the price in my cart on the same bike to $455 after our conversation. This company is corrupt from the top down to the bottom. Great way to appreciate a member of your store. Sorry for the long story. But if you can find what you are looking for at an alternative site such as ebay I suggest you do. I have never had an issue like this with eBay… EVER.,2023-03-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,29.0,1435,284,41,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently ordered electric mountain bike amazon two day later wife decided wanted one well looked bike price advertised lesser price immediately added cart yet received bike yet point got back house hour later went purchase wife bike went purchase bike cart price jumped back even though still showed cart contacted customer service see happening rude start conversation continued gaslight every question asking requested send screenshots trying explain… put hold minute came back “cs” stated two hour period price changed gone never explaining still said lower price cart went back cart getting nowhere customer service saw adjusted price cart bike conversation company corrupt top bottom great way appreciate member store sorry long story find looking alternative site ebay suggest never issue like ebay… ever,0.021580659546272196,0.9784193404537278,0.15928210880538418,0.2,0.8210660919879407,82.10660919879406,High Trust
