Michael Davies,/users/4e65101700006400010bbaa2,GB,123.0,2023-03-29 07:16:02+00:00,1.0,Downhill at an increasing speed,"Like other reviewers I have also been a Prime customer since its introduction, and noticed how the standard of service has seriously deterioated, particularly in the past 12 months.Recent Prime order ""Tracking"" info: (Read from bottom upwards):Monday, 27 March5:00 PMPackage delayed in transit4:53 AMProblem resolved and parcel is in transitBournemouth, GB4:53 AMParcel received by carrierBournemouth, GB4:53 AMCarrier corrected delivery address issue for your package.GB4:53 AMPossible delay in delivery.GB4:06 AMPossible delay in delivery.Huntingdon, GBCarrier picked up the package.I write this email at 2108 on March 28th and there has been no further update. On calling Amazon support I was told they ""cannot find a driver"". The package has been in Bournemouth (12 miles from where I live) for the past 36 hours and I have now been told By Amazon it should arrive ""no later than THURSDAY"".In the past I was always impressed by the company which is why I have used them for over 20 years. I was tempted to ask the agent to find a bible and state ""I promise to tell the truth, the whole truth and nothing but the truth"".Like other reviewers I am also considering parting ways with this company after 20 years, a decision I would not make lightly.Have just cancelled Amazon order and placed a new order on Ebay.",2023-03-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,29.0,1313,215,31,5,1.0,0,0,2,1,Suspicious,like reviewer also prime customer since introduction noticed standard service seriously deterioated particularly past monthsrecent prime order tracking info read bottom upwardsmonday march pmpackage delayed transit amproblem resolved parcel transitbournemouth gb amparcel received carrierbournemouth gb amcarrier corrected delivery address issue packagegb ampossible delay deliverygb ampossible delay deliveryhuntingdon gbcarrier picked packagei write email march th update calling amazon support told cannot find driver package bournemouth mile live past hour told amazon arrive later thursdayin past always impressed company used year tempted ask agent find bible state promise tell truth whole truth nothing truthlike reviewer also considering parting way company year decision would make lightlyhave cancelled amazon order placed new order ebay,0.5194224740679013,0.4805775259320987,0.12058328659562535,0.2,0.5644054202851744,56.440542028517434,Medium Trust
Tracey B.,/users/62212da01552c50012b8659d,US,6.0,2023-03-28 19:24:01+00:00,1.0,Everything about Amazon has went…,"Everything about Amazon has went downhill. Packaging is crap, especially for books! Everything arrives damaged. Shipping is horribly slow and Walmart has most items cheaper. Monthly charges for Prime are ridiculous when shipping is so late every time and Prime channel, music and so on has garbage for a selection. Netflix has better movies and tv selections. Amazon sold out and has went in the toilet as their stock declines show.",2023-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,28.0,432,71,33,5,48.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,everything amazon went downhill packaging crap especially book everything arrives damaged shipping horribly slow walmart item cheaper monthly charge prime ridiculous shipping late every time prime channel music garbage selection netflix better movie tv selection amazon sold went toilet stock decline show,0.04297739564720875,0.9570226043527913,0.039820527201346045,0.2,0.7864754076166649,78.64754076166649,High Trust
