Renee,/users/642315a29fdbd20013a36989,US,1.0,2023-03-28 18:28:38+00:00,1.0,Amazon will steal your money and keep package,My delivery was supposed to arrive on 3/19. The Amazon driver did not ring my doorbell but left the package outside. When I went to collect the package (saw on my ring camera) I realized the package that was delivered was actually for my neighbor across the street. I gave my neighbor my package and assumed my package was on another truck. I then realize that my delivery status was updated to delivered with a picture of my neighbors package. I contacted Amazon about this and they stated they weren’t responsible after delivery. The only problem was my package was never delivered so they should be responsible. I was then berated by one of the “supervisors” and told I was lying and couldn’t speak to anyone else. I was then bombarded with different emails from different representatives saying they weren’t responsible or I would need to show a picture of the incorrect package (I let them know that it was given to the right address so I wouldn’t be able to take a picture). After 3 days the last email I received stated that too much time had gone by and there was nothing else they could do. I’ve been using Amazon for many years and I have never had a problem with them until now. I’m disgusted with how they treated the situation and I am now out of over $100 because they do not want to take responsibility for their drivers negligence.,2023-03-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,28.0,1347,244,45,8,9.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,delivery supposed arrive amazon driver ring doorbell left package outside went collect package saw ring camera realized package delivered actually neighbor across street gave neighbor package assumed package another truck realize delivery status updated delivered picture neighbor package contacted amazon stated weren’t responsible delivery problem package never delivered responsible berated one “supervisors” told lying couldn’t speak anyone else bomba