PMB,/users/51b74d2600006400013f5225,GB,8.0,2023-03-29 10:41:18+00:00,1.0,Absolutely APPALLING customer service,"Absolutely appalling customer service. Been an Amazon Customer for over 18 years, mostly without incident although there have been some hiccups along the way.  In mid Feb I ordered a Punkcase for iphone but got a case for Galaxy S9 instead. Initiated the returns process and sent that one back and got my refund and then ordered a new one. New one came OK ... but now have recieved email saying they want to ""Recharge"" me £29.99 because   ""I didnt return the iphone case but returned a Galaxy S9 case instead""  !!   Have spent the last 26 days going back and forward via email and phone calls and no-one seems to be able to sort this out. Last straw was today when I got talking to a ""Customer Agent"" who basically said that a ""Specialist Team"" will contact me within 72 hours via email and I will have to regurgitate the whole story all over again to them for the 4th time. Apparantly then are not allowed to contact the customer via phone.  What a terrible terrible way to treat your customers in 2023.  I am on the cusp of shutting down my Amazon Prime account, scrapping my Amazon Firesticks and dumping my Kindles in the bin if they cannot sort this out.  Will update in due course.UPDATE:  So ... basically they did respond to my issue .... email stating that they have reviewed the situation .... and understand my concerns ... but thier decision is final and they would ""likely not respond to further emails about this issue""  !!!    How absolutely shabby is that for customer service !!    And they had the cheek to add that I can ""continue to shop as usual on Amazon"" !   I DONT THINK SO !!       I have now closed my Prime account, scrapped a couple of Firesticks and given away my Echo dots to family. I will Never shop at Amazon again.",2023-03-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,29.0,1748,319,37,4,1.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,absolutely appalling customer service amazon customer year mostly without incident although hiccup along way mid feb ordered punkcase iphone got case galaxy instead initiated return process sent one back got refund ordered new one new one came ok recieved email saying want recharge £ didnt return iphone case returned galaxy case instead spent last day going back forward via email phone call noone seems able sort last straw today got talking customer agent basically said specialist team contact within hour via email regurgitate whole story th time apparantly allowed contact customer via phone terrible terrible way treat customer cusp shutting amazon prime account scrapping amazon firesticks dumping kindles bin cannot sort update due courseupdate basically respond issue email stating reviewed situation understand concern thier decision final would likely respond email issue absolutely shabby customer service cheek add continue shop usual amazon dont think closed prime account scrapped couple firesticks given away echo dot family never shop amazon,0.9999820735262122,1.7926473787843733e-05,0.17891194615816042,0.2,0.335791352468526,33.5791352468526,Low Trust
