JustAnswer Customer,/users/5d83e9d86816103526b550af,US,2.0,2023-03-28 04:03:18+00:00,1.0,Amazon’s Customer Service is unable or…,"Amazon’s Customer Service is unable or unwilling to handle anything but very basic questions. Don’t fall for the “Unhelpful” Library, robo-chat etc for anything more. You’ll just descend further into dead-end madness. I’ve had return, refund, delivery, billing issues accrue for months while I bear losses.Some respectful suggestions: email the Executive Customer Relations Dept at (Trustpilot won’t allow addresses). Try Jeff at Amazon.My concerns were still blown off, but I got some insight. Delivery: ~38 carriers. If you have any issue, it’s YOUR onus as Customer to figure out which one supposedly delivered (Amazon Reps refused me that info), contact them, resolve it. With no recourse if you’re told, for example, their driver “proved” a missing ~$450 delivery by their private Log stating they got a Required Signature. From an office Receptionist (my address is a private home.Refunds: be aware that if you select applying any back to your original Credit Card, Amazon can and will apply it to an Amazon Gift Card. That they opened for you/you may not know about, because Reps won’t readily tell you. I’ve been chasing missing refunds for years; a Rep only very recently disclosed this.These 2 issues alone (there’s far more) lead to my “best” suggestion: shop online elsewhere. At least don’t pay for Prime membership, don’t apply for a Synchrony Prime card. (Their  CS is just as sketchy.) Good luck.",2023-03-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,28.0,1412,228,39,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon’s customer service unable unwilling handle anything basic question don’t fall “unhelpful” library robochat etc anything you’ll descend deadend madness i’ve return refund delivery billing issue accrue month bear lossessome respectful suggestion email executive customer relation dept trustpilot won’t allow address try jeff amazonmy concern still blown got insight delivery carrier issue it’s onus customer figure one supposedly delivered amazon rep refused info contact resolve recourse you’re told example driver “proved” missing delivery private log stating got required signature office receptionist address private homerefunds aware select applying back original credit card amazon apply amazon gift card opened youyou may know rep won’t readily tell i’ve chasing missing refund year rep recently disclosed thisthese issue alone there’s far lead “best” suggestion shop online elsewhere least don’t pay prime membership don’t apply synchrony prime card c sketchy good luck,0.005449425175395021,0.994550574824605,0.12787436904094224,0.2,0.8228501612204909,82.28501612204909,High Trust
