Maria Paola Clarizia,/users/5b4888e64de5666d3413e868,GB,70.0,2023-03-27 19:32:04+00:00,4.0,Great Service,"I have always honestly had a good experience with Amazon. Sometimes things might not have the quality that you expect but for me it's part of the game (if I don't want to bother going to shops and I choose the comfort of buying online I take the risk that what I see on a picture might not be exactly what I expect). It's also not cheap but those very few times that the package is lost or undelivered they refund you immediately through their very efficient customer service. I truly appreciate their service, especially because when you start dealing with other companies (which sometimes are cheaper) you run into all sort of problems concerning wrong deliveries, missing information on where the package is, delayed refunds...I personally stick to Amazon whenever I can.",2023-03-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,27.0,774,133,13,2,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,always honestly good experience amazon sometimes thing might quality expect part game dont want bother going shop choose comfort buying online take risk see picture might exactly expect also cheap time package lost undelivered refund immediately efficient customer service truly appreciate service especially start dealing company sometimes cheaper run sort problem concerning wrong delivery missing information package delayed refundsi personally stick amazon whenever,0.11084508469251178,0.8891549153074882,0.07459338194054964,0.8,1.6594961340418541,165.9496134041854,High Trust
