BigBenF,/users/63dd56c7e7ad780013bdc7cb,US,88.0,2023-07-12 18:24:59+00:00,1.0,Amazon Warranty Difficulties.,"Update - 7/12/23 - Amazon POOR Delivery.Amazon Driver launches a package on to my porch that is clearly marked as “Extremely Fragile” on ALL SIDES.Now my electronic device does not work right out of the package.This is what you will get for being a Amazon Prime Member.Amazon needs to get their act together.This company makes obtaining warranty requests from Amazon Seller’s extremely difficult after 30 days.If you send a Seller a request for a warranty claim or product issue, Amazon insists that you do not send personal information to the Seller such as email addresses, physical addresses & phone numbers.Amazon fulfills over 90% of orders so Seller’s don’t have your contact information. Only your money.Here is what you will get when sending a Amazon Seller a message:Please limit your text to less than 4000 characters. For your security, do not include any personal information including email addresses, physical addresses, phone numbers or credit card numbers in your message.So here is my question ???If I can’t give the Seller any of my personal information….how am I supposed to get warranty coverage for an item purchased on Amazon ??(Don’t bother contacting Amazon after 30 days for help either. They will simply tell you that the return window has closed and that there is nothing else that they can do.)You have to play a game with Amazon and send messages to Seller’s in a way that Amazon won’t intercept the message and it is undeliverable.I usually type everything out on paper and take a picture of it and use that to send a message to the Seller via Amazon messaging.Lastly, if you leave a Seller a honest and fair review and Amazon doesn’t like your honesty…..you will get a nasty red message and they also DO NOT reply for a explanation either. If you are in the mood for a extremely hard time, difficulties & terrible, bad customer service after 30 days of purchase….contact Amazon via chat or a phone call. You will get EXACTLY what you are looking for. A heart attack. I promise !!!What a waste of time ! 😠",2023-03-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,7.0,12.0,2035,349,29,3,108.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,update amazon poor deliveryamazon driver launch package porch clearly marked “extremely fragile” sidesnow electronic device work right packagethis get amazon prime memberamazon need get act togetherthis company make obtaining warranty request amazon seller’s extremely difficult daysif send seller request warranty claim product issue amazon insists send personal information seller email address physical address phone numbersamazon fulfills order seller’s don’t contact information moneyhere get sending amazon seller messageplease limit text less character security include personal information including email address physical address phone number credit card number messageso question can’t give seller personal information…how supposed get warranty coverage item purchased amazon don’t bother contacting amazon day help either simply tell return window closed nothing else doyou play game amazon send message seller’s way amazon won’t intercept message undeliverablei usually type everything paper take picture use send message seller via amazon messaginglastly leave seller honest fair review amazon doesn’t like honesty…you get nasty red message also reply explanation either mood extremely hard time difficulty terrible bad customer service day purchase…contact amazon via chat phone call get exactly looking heart attack promise waste time 😠,0.906869785136977,0.09313021486302298,0.1957375210319686,0.2,0.3857126116379052,38.571261163790524,Low Trust
