Barry Allan,/users/577b96220000ff000a2efdb6,GB,91.0,2023-05-05 10:54:39+00:00,1.0,"Amazon, lies, lies and more lies.","Early February I emailed an add for purchase of a Amazon “pallet.” This was supposed to be a chance to purchase a pallet of all manner of items that are made up of excessive stock, returned items etc selling very cheap. I paid approx £55.00 but after six weeks nothing arrived and then started the tales. Mainly that the goods had been delivered and left in my porch. Funny that as I do not have a porch!! However, after sending Amazon a photo to demonstrate that I do not have a porch, Amazon then said they will send me a replacement. Alas, a further 5 weeks on and guess what? No deliver once again and now Amazon seem to have run out of steam as I cannot get information from them about this matter. I no longer trust this outfit. Total scam and disgrace!! How about a FULL REFUND and a bit of compensation for the use of my money over the last 10 weeks?05.05.2023. Nine weeks later and still no order delivered and no refund. Just promises and promises but nothing. Now out of pocket to the tune of nearly £55.00. Thank you Amazon. Scammed by Amazon!!",2023-03-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,5.0,5.0,1056,198,33,6,40.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,early february emailed add purchase amazon “pallet” supposed chance purchase pallet manner item made excessive stock returned item etc selling cheap paid approx £ six week nothing arrived started tale mainly good delivered left porch funny porch however sending amazon photo demonstrate porch amazon said send replacement ala week guess deliver amazon seem run steam cannot get information matter longer trust outfit total scam disgrace full refund bit compensation use money last week nine week later still order delivered refund promise promise nothing pocket tune nearly £ thank amazon scammed amazon,0.9987483629628472,0.0012516370371528085,0.11104879416713405,0.2,0.3228355773520032,32.28355773520032,Low Trust
