Savannah Adams,/users/5ecd3ca5e24cfd5739c25fbb,US,13.0,2023-03-25 15:43:53+00:00,1.0,Amazon is the worst!,"I ordered a scrub top. They sent me the wrong color and size. I live nowhere near a UPS drop off that allows QR codes and don’t own a printer. Therefore, I don’t buy things I plan on returning.  Had this been the type I ordered I would not have returned. Amazon wants me to drive an hour and a half out of my way to return an item I didn’t order. Oh, but he gets better. Are used in the AI system for Amazon and it said it could arrange free UPS pick up. And exchange the item.  I agreed to this, but did not want the item to be exchanged. I just wanted to return, so I talk to customer service following this. Explain to me that there has been a return with a print off the label need in my name.  There is no sign on my account of UPS pick up or exchanging the item. And they follow up with please just return the item. And if I want to pay, they can set up UPS pick up. This is all going on for an hour and a half a royal pain in the ass and in the end they want me to drive an hour and a half to return my product that I did not order in order to get my money back for a $35 top……. After all this then they wanted to call me and I refused because I’m already an hour and a half late because of them.  Bottom line, screw Amazon and their customer service and do not use the AI because it is completely wrong. Let’s not forget the fake commercials about how all their employees benefits. 90% of their employees are employed their outside companies. Therefore they do provide benefits for 10%. Majority have nothing horrible, horrible, horrible company.",2023-03-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,25.0,1554,311,20,4,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered scrub top sent wrong color size live nowhere near ups drop allows qr code don’t printer therefore don’t buy thing plan returning type ordered would returned amazon want drive hour half way return item didn’t order oh get better used ai system amazon sai