Carl Bigham Jr,/users/641e5895917d6700121e8c3f,US,4.0,2023-03-25 04:12:51+00:00,1.0,AMAZON LACK OF CUSTOMER CARE,"AMAZON, VERY POSSIBLY THE WORST BIG COMPANY ON THE PLANET WHEN IT COMES TO CUSTOMER CARE,,, IT SHOULD BE, ""CUSTOMER (WE DO NOT) CARE""!Now, I have no problem with saying that parts of the issues stem from my somewhat limited computer skills and my eventual loss of patience. The loss of patience however, was exacerbated by the Amazon System and the people I had eventually encountered.The System: I believe Amazon is one of the biggest companies on the planet and deals with such large volume of commerce giving them EXTREME POWER OVER SOCIETY AS A WHOLE,,, CONTROL OVER SELECT GROUPS,,, AND AS FAR AS THE INDIVIDUAL GOES... GREASE FOR THE GEARS! Amazon (and other huge companies highly advanced in technology) want to eliminate the ""Human Factor"" from their companies. They want ALL COMMUNICATIONS to be done with bots/A.I. on their end of the transactions... keep taking money from people to continue their automation and computerization. THEN, AS WAS WITH ME, the System failed. A $30 golf club arrives in bent box, broken in half. Needed to ask a question, (may have been somewhat or partially answered in their jumble of ""prepared answers"" if not in the first 50 or so maybe in the second group of 50 or so or 3rd group,,,). I struggled a bit but found a link to live chat. WHERE IT SEEMS MOST SITES YOU GO TO, YOU GET BOMBARDED WITH POP UP ADS,,, AND MOST JUMP RIGHT OUT WITH A, ""LET'S CHAT NOW, WHAT CAN I HELP YOU WITH TODAY"", I had to search around and when I got to the page, I started with a question, it said somethinglike,  ""chat has been started , you are #1 in queue"". About 20 minutes later, I did what they wanted, I ENDED THE CHAT, WITHOUT EVER GETTING ANY REPLY. So next is the attempt to call. Forget it. Not after West Coast work hours, unless you do not mind talking with some whoever, from wherever on the other side of the planet. I mind. Conversation with foreign dialect/accents is tough enough then add the stress brought about by personal and financial information in a world loaded with scammers and con artists. After running into a couple of walls with offshore AND NONE OF THEM ARE INTERESTED IN GETTING YOU ANY HELP WITH CONTACTING A U.S. REPRESENTATIVE FOR THE COMPANY. EVEN GETTING TO SPEAK WITH A SUPERVISOR IS A BATTLE WITH SOME.SO,,, I call the U.S. Corporate phone #. WORTHLESS! IF AMAZON IS LOOKING WHERE TO SAVE SOME WASTED MONEY,,, ELIMINATE THE ""CUSTOMER SUPPORT CALL CENTER"", ABSOLUTELY WORTHLESS. HEARTLESS. SOULLESS, UNCOMPASSIONATE GROUP THAT DO VERY LITTLE TOWARD HELPING (ME ANYWAY),,, AND THEY LIE! CHECK Y'ALLS RECORDINGS! The U.S. CUSTOMER SUPPORT PHONE #, basically 5 prompts. 1- customer service- gives recorded instructions to GO ONLINE. 2- instructions. 3- instructions. 4- instructions. Prompt #5- THE LIVE PEOPLE THAT DIRECT YOU TO CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE,,, THEY ARE JUST THE CALL CENTER,,, CUSTOMER SERVICE IS THE NUMBER I CALLED THAT EVENTUALLY RETURNS TO THEM!WHEN YOU START GETTING LOUD BECAUSE THEY ARE NOT LISTENING WHEN YOU TELL THEM THAT DOING WHAT THEY TOLD ME TO DO DIDN'T WORK AND ASK ""NOW WHAT?"",,, THEY THEN HANG UP ON YOU. AFTER TRYING TO EXPLAIN THAT THEY EITHER AREN'T LISTENING OR DON'T UNDERSTAND, THEY HANG UP ON YOU. BETWEEN THE SYSTEM ITSELF AND THE LIVE AGENTS IN THE CALL CENTER IN SEATTLE WASHINGTON, I CONTINUED TO CALL JUST TO GET A SCRIPT READ TO ME SAYING THEY HAVE GIVEN ME ALL THE HELP AND GUIDEANCE AVAILABLE AT THEIR LEVEL AND THEN HANG UP ON ME... WOULD NOT TELL ME WHAT TO DO WHEN WHAT THEY HAVE TOLD ME TO DO DOESN'T WORK.It concludes with a final attempt at 1 of many AMAZON CUSTOMER SERVICE #s. A guy in India that said he was a supervisor with the ""escalation team"", highest level you can get by phone he said, but I had spent literally HOURS dealing with the Devil, and it boils down to AMAZON UPPER LEVEL COULD CARE LESS WHAT HAPPENS UNDER THEIR FEET AS LONG AS THEY ARE CONTINUALLY BLINDED BY THE MONEY.",2023-03-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,25.0,3904,689,28,5,1.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,amazon possibly worst big company planet come customer care customer carenow problem saying part issue stem somewhat limited computer skill eventual loss patience loss patience however exacerbated amazon system people eventually encounteredthe system believe amazon one biggest company planet deal large volume commerce giving extreme power society whole control select group far individual go grease gear amazon huge company highly advanced technology want eliminate human factor company want communication done botsai end transaction keep taking money people continue automation computerization system failed golf club arrives bent box broken half needed ask question may somewhat partially answered jumble prepared answer first maybe second group rd group struggled bit found link live chat seems site go get bombarded pop ad jump right let chat help today search around got page started question said somethinglike chat started queue minute later wanted ended chat without ever getting reply next attempt call forget west coast work hour unless mind talking whoever wherever side planet mind conversation foreign dialectaccents tough enough add stress brought personal financial information world loaded scammer con artist running couple wall offshore none interested getting help contacting u representative company even getting speak supervisor battle someso call u corporate phone worthless amazon looking save wasted money eliminate customer support call center absolutely worthless heartless soulless uncompassionate group little toward helping anyway lie check yalls recording u customer support phone basically prompt customer service give recorded instruction go online instruction instruction instruction prompt live people direct contact customer service call center customer service number called eventually return themwhen start getting loud listening tell told didnt w