Miss Darlene,/users/6345ac29d10fdd001286a5d3,CA,2.0,2023-03-22 22:24:56+00:00,1.0,Outsourcing to India a HUGE mistake! Poor Customer Service,"I've been with Amazon for years, and with PRIME.  They've always been very professional until today.  I'm a senior with disabilities and do all my shopping with Amazon because I can't/don't go out.  I had 2 items to return & had to speak to 4 agents & 1 supervisor with the same results in the end.  Disappointing service.  Amazon's delivery & pick up were very helpful to me but now they expect me to return by going to post office which I can't or to UPS & pay for return which I can't/won't pay for.  Today was horrible, I believe every single person I spoke to was East Indian & very rude!  Totally unacceptable.  I spend $150-$200 monthly plus subscriptions which I've cancelled all items & returning all the newest items, if I have to pay for a taxi to go to a post office I might as well return all their less than quality items.  I'm so disappointed, they were once an A+ service, now they're outsourced to India and very poor quality service with people you can't understand!  Once I've received my refunds, I'll be closing the account so no more stress ... reading their reviews has made me terrified! If you take the time to watch Jeff Bezos on youtube, he trained his staff to have the best customer service with the goal that the customer is always right...that is no longer the case and I bet he has no idea what's going on now, I'd be ashamed to be the owner or work for this place.",2023-03-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,22.0,1397,260,58,9,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,ive amazon year prime theyve always professional today im senior disability shopping amazon cantdont go item return speak agent supervisor result end disappointing service amazon delivery pick helpful expect return going post office cant ups pay return cantwont pay today horrible believe every single person spoke east indian rude totally unacceptable spend monthly plus subscription ive cancelled item returning newest item pay taxi go post office might well return less quality item im disappointed service theyre outsourced india poor quality service people cant understand ive received refund ill closing account stress reading review made terrified take time watch jeff bezos youtube trained staff best customer service goal customer always rightthat longer case bet idea whats going id ashamed owner work place,0.5691457662614798,0.43085423373852016,0.14582164890633764,0.2,0.5445914466505276,54.45914466505276,Medium Trust
