P.B.,/users/60908f02bcb4b000195cf778,GB,5.0,2023-03-22 11:33:34+00:00,1.0,Amazon tried to charge my inactive account without my consent or knowledge,"I have used Amazon a handful of times over the last decade and have not used it in over 2 years at this point.Out of the blue they tried to charge me with a prime subscription without my consent, permission or even knowledge. My account was inactive for over 2 years, I had changed card since then and they still managed to charge me 8.99.When I asked customer service they told me because I was on some kind of linked account I was being charged. My partner has Amazon prime however she pays for it herself and has done since before we met, we have NEVER linked accounts and again, for emphasis, Amazon tried to charge me without my consent or permission for a product I never signed up for. The only reason I noticed is due to my banking app.Amazon is devolving into a purely criminal enterprise, literally just reaching into people's pockets to see if they can stealth charge them without their knowledge.I am appalled that this practice is even legal let alone adopted by Amazon. What a terrible company. I have cancelled my account, all of the cards on it and will be disputing the charge.How can you charge people for a service with no consent taken or even a notification.Disgusting.",2023-03-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,22.0,1190,214,74,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used amazon handful time last decade used year pointout blue tried charge prime subscription without consent permission even knowledge account inactive year changed card since still managed charge asked customer service told kind linked account charged partner amazon prime however pay done since met never linked account emphasis amazon tried charge without consent permission product never signed reason noticed due banking appamazon devolving purely criminal enterprise literally reaching people pocket see stealth charge without knowledgei appalled practice even legal let alone adopted amazon terrible company cancelled account card disputing chargehow charge people service consent taken even notificationdisgusting,0.009947911673897254,0.9900520883261027,0.12002243409983174,0.2,0.8190305309830177,81.90305309830177,High Trust
