Dest,/users/61390ede364bc500129b7f5e,US,1.0,2023-03-20 23:00:08+00:00,1.0,Shipping issues and fraudulent activity seems to be the new normal,"Used to be great. The company is completely going down the drain service wise. First off, I’ve never had so many issues with shipping until recently. They now use USPS for shipping and they are the worst! They literally lie about attempting to deliver and get away with it with no solutions offered after the fact. I’ve had this happen 3 times now and I work from home. They’ll say an item is being delivered then all of a sudden the status changes to attempted delivery when no one ever came to my door. Never used to happen when they solely used their own drivers. Getting in contact with them is also a nightmare trying to get it reshipped. If that’s not bad, reaching out to the customer service line is a complete joke now and operations seem sketchy. We used Amazon for our baby registry recently and received some gift cards we put on our account to be used later. Fast forward to the next day I get an email about 100 dollars of the gift cards being used for a PlayStation gift card. A) we don’t have any gaming systems. B) I didn’t even receive an email to approve or deny an unknown login like I always do when I sign in. I called customer service twice about this and get the same answer that someone will call me back in 2 days and no one ever does. The only thing I get is a bogus email stating they believe someone accessed my account and they have taken steps to ensure my account is safe and that the gift card funds will be reimbursed in 2-3 days. It’s been over a week now and no call back and the gift card isn’t reimbursed. Wouldn’t be surprised if this was some shady internal thing going on at the rate this company is going. We just want our money back. It used to be so easy calling in and getting a resolution in one phone call, now it just a joke and complete waste of time and no one actually cares about your issues.",2023-03-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,20.0,1844,354,66,11,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,used great company completely going drain service wise first i’ve never many issue shipping recently use usps shipping worst literally lie attempting deliver get away solution offered fact i’ve happen time work home they’ll say item delivered sudden status change attempted delivery one ever came door never used happen solely used driver getting contact also nightmare trying get reshipped that’s bad reaching customer service line complete joke operation seem sketchy used amazon baby registry recently received gift card put account used later fast forward next day get email dollar gift card used playstation gift card don’t gaming system b didn’t even receive email approve deny unknown login like always sign called customer service twice get answer someone call back day one ever thing get bogus email stating believe someone accessed account taken step ensure account safe gift card fund reimbursed day it’s week call back gift card isn’t reimbursed wouldn’t surprised shady internal thing going rate company going want money back used easy calling getting resolution one phone call joke complete waste time one actually care issue,0.035955981850926653,0.9640440181490734,0.19854178351093663,0.2,0.821730365776724,82.17303657767239,High Trust
