PCJ,/users/63b1d3a7cde9420012f8e13d,US,1.0,2023-03-18 19:34:56+00:00,2.0,Amazon Prime is 1 week not 2 days,"I used to be a huge Amazon promoter. Their prices might have been slightly higher but reasonable when factoring in the whole experience including shipping times, customer service, ease returns etc. They will tell you that their shipping times remain unchanged, based on the fact that it's 2 days from the actual shipping of the item. The reality is I used to receive things in 2 or three days depending on the time of day I ordered it. Most days they'd ship it out the same day. Now they have a built in 5 day delay to ship resulting in 1 week delivery. Walmart plus still has true 2 day shipping. I'm cancelling my Prime subscription.",2023-03-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,18.0,635,116,33,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used huge amazon promoter price might slightly higher reasonable factoring whole experience including shipping time customer service ease return etc tell shipping time remain unchanged based fact day actual shipping item reality used receive thing three day depending time day ordered day theyd ship day built day delay ship resulting week delivery walmart plus still true day shipping im cancelling prime subscription,0.014029593298288043,0.985970406701712,0.06505888951205833,0.4,1.1059969812532677,110.59969812532677,High Trust
