markus bredberg,/users/5fc8c36d4584e600197ef99d,SE,3.0,2023-03-18 10:02:24+00:00,1.0,Impossible to log in with new number,"The reason for this 1-star review is just one crucially important bug: it is impossible to log in if you've changed your phone number. Here is how I try to do it:1. I press log in.2. I enter my email address (or old phone number)3. I enter my password4. Sometimes (at least on the computer page) I have to re-enter the password and then the interpret characters from a photo for ""extra safety.""5. I page shows up where Amazon says they've sent an OTP to my old phone number.6. I press resend after 60 seconds to see if they can send it to another phone number or email address instead, but that isn't possible.7. I press the ""I need help""/""contact customer support"" button below.8. I have to select one of four problems: forgot my password, password not working, no account but still need help, cannot create an account.9. I try anyone of the top two, but they still require me to confirm my phone number.10. I try any on of the bottom two, or just contacting customer support directly, but you have to log in to do that (and thus confirm your phone number).11. I consider calling, but I live in Europe and don't want to spend insane amounts of money on a phone call I don't even believe will help.12. I write this review in hope that Amazon will respond here. Can they really have let such an obvious error slip past? I googled of course and couldn't find any solution to it.",2023-03-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,18.0,1376,254,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,reason star review one crucially important bug impossible log youve changed phone number try press log enter email address old phone number enter password sometimes least computer page reenter password interpret character photo extra safety page show amazon say theyve sent otp old phone number press resend second see send another phone number email address instead isnt possible press need helpcontact customer support button select one four problem forgot password password working account still need help cannot create account try anyone top two still require confirm phone number try bottom two contacting customer support directly log thus confirm phone number consider calling live europe dont want spend insane amount money phone call dont even believe help write review hope amazon respond really let obvious error slip past googled course couldnt find solution,0.0158908722126159,0.9841091277873841,0.142456533931576,0.2,0.8205458706800072,82.05458706800071,High Trust
