Mark LaMont,/users/6413c8f7e249630012bdc3f6,US,1.0,2023-03-17 03:57:24+00:00,1.0,Don't count on getting your delivery on time.,"We pay for prime shipping and choose Amazon over other providers to get timely deliveries. However, lately we have been experiencing excessive delays. The packages are stuck somewhere. The tracking never changes, and Amazon blames the shipper, when the shipper has not received the package yet. ""Wait another day or so, and then you can ask for a refund"". On multiple occasions, we have had to wait to ask for a refund and then repurchase, only to find a higher price on the same item. The customer service is a joke, there is no real concern for the consumer. The live agents are simply reciting from a textbook, and offering a meager credit to use on a future order. ""Just throw money at the problem and it will go away"", no real attempt to fix the problem.",2023-03-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,17.0,759,137,45,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,pay prime shipping choose amazon provider get timely delivery however lately experiencing excessive delay package stuck somewhere tracking never change amazon blame shipper shipper received package yet wait another day ask refund multiple occasion wait ask refund repurchase find higher price item customer service joke real concern consumer live agent simply reciting textbook offering meager credit use future order throw money problem go away real attempt fix problem,0.020122901418577196,0.9798770985814228,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.8053059076754562,80.53059076754562,High Trust
