Sandra Outhwaite,/users/564d9ac50000ff0001ec0234,GB,10.0,2023-03-14 22:19:54+00:00,1.0,Mother day flowers delivered squashed and dieing,"My son ordered flowers for mother's day from Amazon. They had been delivered to the wrong address,even though my name and address was on the box.It was a a tall long box at the bottom of the box lay a mess of squashed, broken stems tulips,although the card inside said the flowers are in water ,including plant food.no water, the flowers looked as though they had been packed a few days, not packed well and cared for.Worse of all,I send my son photos of the flowers, he was really upset. I tried to contact amazon  but it was very difficult to contact someone.I have had nice flowers before from via amazon.",2023-03-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,14.0,608,111,48,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,son ordered flower mother day amazon delivered wrong addresseven though name address boxit tall long box bottom box lay mess squashed broken stem tulipsalthough card inside said flower water including plant foodno water flower looked though packed day packed well cared forworse alli send son photo flower really upset tried contact amazon difficult contact someonei nice flower via amazon,0.02869757253149068,0.9713024274685094,0.062254627033090294,0.2,0.7981021391408727,79.81021391408727,High Trust
