lohycore,/users/5b8dbd274de5666d34ebfa2e,US,6.0,2023-03-14 14:39:48+00:00,1.0,"Does not reliably deliver on delivery promises, questionable products from big name brands","This review is based upon a continued worsening of service from Amazon. We have been doing business with Amazon since late 2016, and had mostly satisfactory service from them until the pandemic happened. Our biggest problem is a failure to deliver products on time, if at all. For example. I was just informed for the 4th time in a single week that an order was going to be late, or as with the one I was just informed of, completely undeliverable. This used to happen on occasion, but now happens regularly. Dealing with customer service is just some customer service rep repeating a sentence, phrase or paragraph from the ""how to get rid of (choose your own descriptor) customer as quickly as possible with as little help/work as possible"" book they must all be handed the second they are hired. The second problem we regularly deal with, from day one, is receiving faulty, fake, knock-off, etc. products from ""big brand"" names, such as Energizer (entire 12-pack of CR2450 batteries that were bad), Wrangler (jeans that look like factory rejects, buttons sewed in wrong spot, horrible dye jobs), so on and so forth. That problem was easily solved, only order the cheap knock-off items from Amazon, that way you know what to expect. We order the name brand stuff from Walmart, and those orders rarely arrive late and/or in bad condition.We have tried to be understanding of the problems going on in the world, but we pay for the prime membership mainly for the free two-day shipping promises, and Amazon just cannot deliver on that any longer. Also, if they are able to pull my money immeditately upon ""placing order"", then I shouldn't have to wait 5 business days for a return of my $71 for an order that became ""undeliverable"" on the day it was supposed to be delivered. We cancelled the membership today, and decided to leave a review here, not necessarily to try to hurt Amazon, but to make future customers aware of problems they will likely run into.",2023-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,14.0,1957,341,90,13,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,review based upon continued worsening service amazon business amazon since late mostly satisfactory service pandemic happened biggest problem failure deliver product time example informed th time single week order going late one informed completely undeliverable used happen occasion happens regularly dealing customer service customer service rep repeating sentence phrase paragraph get rid choose descriptor customer quickly possible little helpwork possible book must handed second hired second problem regularly deal day one receiving faulty fake knockoff etc product big brand name energizer entire pack cr battery bad wrangler jean look like factory reject button sewed wrong spot horrible dye job forth problem easily solved order cheap knockoff item amazon way know expect order name brand stuff walmart order rarely arrive late andor bad conditionwe tried understanding problem going world pay prime membership mainly free twoday shipping promise amazon cannot deliver longer also able pull money immeditately upon placing order shouldnt wait business day return order became undeliverable day supposed delivered cancelled membership today decided leave review necessarily try hurt amazon make future customer aware problem likely run,0.0021156423014914725,0.9978843576985085,0.19125070106561975,0.2,0.8371923190623782,83.71923190623782,High Trust
Mark Hodge,/users/64105214c04eab00176532a8,US,2.0,2023-03-14 13:02:02+00:00,1.0,Liars,"Liars. I can buy what I need from numerous other sources, but I chose Amazon because I was promised next day delivery. The only difference was the delivery time. 3 days later, my order isn't here- and I needed it yesterday. If Amazon can't keep their word, they are no good. I'm done considering them as an option. Fast shipping is no advantage, if they just lie and make excuses.",2023-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,14.0,380,70,5,1,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,liar buy need numerous source chose amazon promised next day delivery difference delivery time day later order isnt needed yesterday amazon cant keep word good im done considering option fast shipping advantage lie make excuse,0.01880377412837675,0.9811962258716233,0.03925967470555244,0.2,0.7984500478769221,79.8450047876922,High Trust
