Kim Frutiger,/users/640fb5cae142160013999b87,US,1.0,2023-03-14 01:46:28+00:00,1.0,Accused of misconduct and denied appeal.,"My set of Evo headphones came in an open box with one earpiece torn off. It did not look like the set I ordered but rather looked like it had been a returned item and did not look like the item I ordered. I examined it and tried to get the earpiece on. But it wouldn't stay on and was slightly ripped at a seam.I sent it back and asked for a refund but received an email  message that I returned the wrong item and to return the correct item. I sent back the very item I received and they say I sent back the wrong item and am still going to be charged for the item I ordered even though they are two different things ( confirmed by the email). They followed to say I may be banned from ordering from Amazon if I do not return the correct item. What the actual.......?Buyer beware.And don't assume your$120 Amazon Prime account gives you the protection that they claim.I have, of course,  appealed the decision. Immediately I was sent an email stating there would be no appeal process, the decision was final. I was denied an appeal and accused of the misconduct of sending back an item other than what was sent to me. I am being charged for the item ordered but not received. This isn't the first time I have received damaged items or even the wrong item from Amazon. The customer service is getting worse. The membership is going up. Now they have the item they sent me and are still going to charge me. Isn't that theft?",2023-03-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,14.0,1423,270,40,6,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,set evo headphone came open box one earpiece torn look like set ordered rather looked like returned item look like item ordered examined tried get earpiece wouldnt stay slightly ripped seami sent back asked refund received email message returned wrong item return correct item sent back item received say sent back wrong item still going charged item ordered even though two different thing confirmed email followed say may banned ordering amazon return correct item actualbuyer bewareand dont assume amazon prime account give protection claimi course appealed decision immediately sent email stating would appeal process decision final denied appeal accused misconduct sending back item sent charged item ordered received isnt first time received damaged item even wrong item amazon customer service getting worse membership going item sent still going charge isnt theft,0.012236076645333606,0.9877639233546663,0.1514301738642737,0.2,0.8241679964501879,82.41679964501878,High Trust
STEVEN TILLMAN,/users/5f617354ebfe6e8e5e1fe1cf,US,7.0,2023-03-14 00:37:19+00:00,1.0,Possible BREACH at Amazon?,"I just have a regular account at Amazon.  Each time I order stuff I pay for it with gift cards, and my Debit card.  The last four times my bank has called me about fraudulent charges or some clown from India or Pakistan called saying I made a purchase on my Prime Account, which I don't have for $1900. or some like amount.  First, how did they get my phone number, secondly they have my name and address because I didn't give it to them.  The thing that pisses me off is each time they do this the bank kills my debit card and issues a new 1 which can take up to 10 days unless you opt to pay $25 for express delivery cause the nearest branch is 200 miles away.  When I called Customer Service to ask about the possibility of a data breach the nutjob had no IDEA of what I was talking about.  So I asked if there was a security person or someone with a little more knowledge he said there was no one around so I asked for a supervisor but he couldn't find one of them either. If this happened just once, no big deal. But 4 times and for them to act as if it isn't anything, give me a break!  I can't be the only one! I had been using a reloadable Debit card but this time I was purchasing A Laser which cost $467 I used my regular card and today about a week after I received it I get a call from 530 562-9742 saying they show I purchased some apple crap for $1900 which I would never do cause I hate apple and all of their overpriced products.  The nutjob I spoked to at Amazon was Ben, totally useless.  How do they get the info if someone is not feeding it to them?  I guess Amazon doesn't want people to know their info is at risk?  So they act as if it not a big deal and tell you to contact your bank to report fraud only after your bank has contacted you because the shipping address or not all the info is correct.  I wish they would let me use PayPal cause I would feel a lot more secure.  Guess I just will stop doing business with Amazon, can't take these breaches!",2023-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,14.0,1977,395,26,4,1.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,regular account amazon time order stuff pay gift card debit card last four time bank called fraudulent charge clown india pakistan called saying made purchase prime account dont like amount first get phone number secondly name address didnt give thing piss time bank kill debit card issue new take day unless opt pay express delivery cause nearest branch mile away called customer service ask possibility data breach nutjob idea talking asked security person someone little knowledge said one around asked supervisor couldnt find one either happened big deal time act isnt anything give break cant one using reloadable debit card time purchasing laser cost used regular card today week received get call saying show purchased apple crap would never cause hate apple overpriced product nutjob spoked amazon ben totally useless get info someone feeding guess amazon doesnt want people know info risk act big deal tell contact bank report fraud bank contacted shipping address info correct wish would let use paypal cause would feel lot secure guess stop business amazon cant take breach,0.46974994129929404,0.530250058700706,0.22153673583847447,0.2,0.6094323765180478,60.94323765180478,Medium Trust
Rina Bileski,/users/640f8a9050d2840012a74451,US,1.0,2023-03-13 23:09:09+00:00,2.0,Inaccurate shipping and billing,"I ordered 2 items: A printer cleaning kit, and a bag of sugarless gummy bears. I received a box that included:2 bags of gummy bears, and 1 cleaning kit.I was billed for 2 cleaning kits, and 2 bags of sugarless gummy bears.customers service said they couldn't refund me, and I don't think they believed me.The candy is not returnable.I experienced similar issues in January; I ordered 2 items and received 6, so I know that orders are mishandled. Why should I pay for items that I didn't receive or ordered?",2023-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,13.0,506,90,31,4,6.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered item printer cleaning kit bag sugarless gummy bear received box included bag gummy bear cleaning kiti billed cleaning kit bag sugarless gummy bearscustomers service said couldnt refund dont think believed methe candy returnablei experienced similar issue january ordered item received know order mishandled pay item didnt receive ordered,0.028554579889467132,0.9714454201105329,0.050476724621424565,0.4,1.0958180549795513,109.58180549795513,High Trust
HB,/users/640f8d5ce8b14f00138cae78,GB,1.0,2023-03-13 22:53:56+00:00,1.0,Will never trust Amazon again,"I purchased so much over the years from Amazon. Never had a real problem apart from at times they said something had been delivered when it hadn’t but very soon refunded  the product no problem at all.  But recently I bought an item. It wasn’t any good so I sent it back the next day. Refund given. Then a month later, Amazon said the product returned didn’t match the description of the one sent which is utter rubbish and impossible unless another package was mixed up. I’ve tried to reason with Amazon but they are having none of it. Have virtually accused me of sending back another item and will re charge my card again!!! I’m so upset mostly about it being their fault and I can’t prove it. I will never purchase anything from Amazon again but the monster company they are, I somehow don’t think they will care.",2023-01-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,13.0,817,150,29,5,45.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,purchased much year amazon never real problem apart time said something delivered hadn’t soon refunded product problem recently bought item wasn’t good sent back next day refund given month later amazon said product returned didn’t match description one sent utter rubbish impossible unless another package mixed i’ve tried reason amazon none virtually accused sending back another item charge card i’m upset mostly fault can’t prove never purchase anything amazon monster company somehow don’t think care,0.2950908707668408,0.7049091292331592,0.08412787436904094,0.2,0.6692801394903878,66.92801394903879,Medium Trust
