Karine Shaw,/users/6009c715e7977c001a949233,US,6.0,2023-03-13 15:42:38+00:00,1.0,I wish I could give a big ZERO to the…,I wish I could give a big ZERO to the customer service. This morning I spent over 40 minutes of my work day time being transferred from one person to another and from one country to another and my issue did not get resolved. I have an item that I want to return but I was told that it was sold by a third party and I can’t reach the seller and therefore can’t send the item for a credit. I called Amazon three times about this issue and the only thing I get from them is that I have to wait for the seller to contact me and I should keep sending him emails. Really? Then I get someone from the leader team who could barely speak English and kept reading the same paragraph to me 8 times. What is this? Why can’t we get customer service staff in USA that can actually help customers. I am so tired and mad about their lack of service and their rudeness.,2023-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,13.0,852,170,38,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wish could give big zero customer service morning spent minute work day time transferred one person another one country another issue get resolved item want return told sold third party can’t reach seller therefore can’t send item credit called amazon three time issue thing get wait seller contact keep sending email really get someone leader team could barely speak english kept reading paragraph time can’t get customer service staff usa actually help customer tired mad lack service rudeness,0.006023373390795791,0.9939766266092042,0.09534492428491306,0.2,0.8160572981615847,81.60572981615847,High Trust
