Stray,/users/63e8c8e59683a100139280a6,CA,2.0,2023-03-13 08:45:05+00:00,1.0,Locked out of my account,"This story started in February, I just placed an order and Amazon flagged my account putting it on hold. At first, I did not want to provide my billing details but by selecting that option my request seem to get auto rejected, as the response email was within 5 seconds of me pressing the send button.So this time I included the billing detail, the “account specialist” rejected it saying it was not the card used for purchasing the item. I had multiple card on the account but that was the one I used for that purchase. But I decided Im willing to send them the billing detail for the other one too, this time they came back saying its the wrong card again, funnily enough they are asking for some thing I already sent them the first time. For the third time I decided to just send both cards billing detail. Once again, rejected, however this time they don’t even ask me for by billing detail anymore, they want me to straight up provide my utility bill, how ridiculous. I did try to reach out to their customer service by reaching out to them on a different amazon account that I created just for that purpose, the agent was beyond useless they said they could not do anything about my situation except forward the same exact info I already gave them through the on hold screen.",2023-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,13.0,1281,236,24,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,story started february placed order amazon flagged account putting hold first want provide billing detail selecting option request seem get auto rejected response email within second pressing send buttonso time included billing detail “account specialist” rejected saying card used purchasing item multiple card account one used purchase decided im willing send billing detail one time came back saying wrong card funnily enough asking thing already sent first time third time decided send card billing detail rejected however time don’t even ask billing detail anymore want straight provide utility bill ridiculous try reach customer service reaching different amazon account created purpose agent beyond useless said could anything situation except forward exact info already gave hold screen,0.01203200931683787,0.9879679906831621,0.13236118900729107,0.2,0.8204562331430393,82.04562331430392,High Trust
