David B,/users/640e12146397fe00133e5677,US,15.0,2023-03-13 10:57:38+00:00,4.0,I love amazon but wish they would…,"I love amazon but wish they would respond to the following question which I have asked more than once.Please improve the history of purchases to include dates, amounts, seller, description, and ship date.Keep this by individual and confidential. Include this on statements. I use a credit card for purchases and need more info on CC statement so later I know what this charge was for. Currently most purchases show on credit card invoice as ""amazon bookstore"". Make it possible for the buyer to know seller and have a brief description of item(s) purchased.",2023-03-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,13.0,557,93,34,7,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,love amazon wish would respond following question asked onceplease improve history purchase include date amount seller description ship datekeep individual confidential include statement use credit card purchase need info cc statement later know charge currently purchase show credit card invoice amazon bookstore make possible buyer know seller brief description item purchased,0.019904002830351063,0.9800959971696489,0.05215928210880538,0.8,1.7004798550065856,170.04798550065857,High Trust
MATHEW LUCKEY,/users/618af242175ab400159171fd,US,14.0,2023-03-12 23:18:35+00:00,3.0,I've been a monthly customer of Amazon…,"I've been a monthly customer of Amazon for years and have 2 primary complaints about the online shopping service. 1)I gave fare/honest reviews of merch I purchased - mostly an adequate rating, a few bad and a few excellent reviews - but Amazon removed my ability to review for a couple years now without adequate explanation. I feel duty bound to warn other customers about items I've purchased that are advertized fraudulently or defective, which Amazon does not allow me to do. I expect Amazon as a middleman service suffers from conflict of interest when it comes to the various companies for which they brokers, so it censors reviews for the businesses it's too close to, in order to protect its sells. This is siding with these companies that sell substandard merchandise against Amazon members, and should immediately stop. Ever paying Amazon shopper should have an unhindered right to review the items they paid for.2) Amazon listings needs to clarify differences in sizing scale when merch is manufactured in different countries, which it most often fails to do. For example, I cannot tell you number of times I purchased items manufactured in China, according to Chinese sizing scale - which is about 2-sizes smaller than US sizing - without being warned by Amazon. The result being, merchandise That doesn't fit - clothes, backpack, laptop case - I either haveto go through headache of returning, just givaway, or trash.",2023-03-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,12.0,1430,238,39,7,6.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ive monthly customer amazon year primary complaint online shopping service gave farehonest review merch purchased mostly adequate rating bad excellent review amazon removed ability review couple year without adequate explanation feel duty bound warn customer item ive purchased advertized fraudulently defective amazon allow expect amazon middleman service suffers conflict interest come various company broker censor review business close order protect sell siding company sell substandard merchandise amazon member immediately stop ever paying amazon shopper unhindered right review item paid amazon listing need clarify difference sizing scale merch manufactured different country often fails example cannot tell number time purchased item manufactured china according chinese sizing scale size smaller u sizing without warned amazon result merchandise doesnt fit clothes backpack laptop case either haveto go headache returning givaway trash,0.01291845678263176,0.9870815432173683,0.1334828939988783,0.6,1.4202373504084598,142.02373504084596,High Trust
