KEITH,/users/5231ca9100006400014bf321,GB,28.0,2023-03-12 14:15:28+00:00,1.0,Amazon doesn't care,"Further to my recent review of Amazon's handling of my complaint regarding a door curtain bought online, I have to say that their policy which states that they will be responsible for any company that does not refund a customer when the customer correctly complains, is absolutely untrue. They took the stance that I should have done more, after I sent the goods back and provided the proof of this about 6 or 7 times to the supplier. The supplier denied all knowledge of receipt of either the good s or the copy of the despatch receipt, and then came up with a different address, which had not been mentioned before, and was not on any of the paperwork, and stated that they did not have any record of it. All lies. Amazon cares only about the money and NOT about the customer's problems.",2022-03-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,12.0,789,144,19,3,365.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,recent review amazon handling complaint regarding door curtain bought online say policy state responsible company refund customer customer correctly complains absolutely untrue took stance done sent good back provided proof time supplier supplier denied knowledge receipt either good copy despatch receipt came different address mentioned paperwork stated record lie amazon care money customer problem,0.0007600667271486376,0.9992399332728513,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.8157725185152815,81.57725185152816,High Trust
