customer,/users/6243eba165f16a0012090f7d,GB,2.0,2023-03-11 20:37:29+00:00,1.0,"Cancelled order, stolen packages, poor quality service","I returned items worth £600 with tracking number confirming delivery to amazon return facility. Amazon kept saying to wait another week, end of the month, end of this or that, until it was months and the courier archived the tracking number and then amazon said that they couldn't refund my £600 worth of items as the tracking number was not active. It is a shame what a fraudulent company they have become.On the fraudulent note, their drivers steal my packages, never deliver them, I then alert amazon and they tell me 'our system says it was delivered, call the police and ask them to investigate'. It is appalling what amazon has become. Its worse than the Evri delivery service, funny enough, amazon is one of the only companies still using evri as courier delivery service, it speaks volumes, the company with such low standards uses the delivery service that everyone knows is the worst in the world. Amazon used to be a good quality service, it is now appalling, you need to hope your item arrives, as you pay for it regardless of it arriving or if the delivery driver steals it.",2023-03-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,11.0,1087,192,54,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,returned item worth £ tracking number confirming delivery amazon return facility amazon kept saying wait another week end month end month courier archived tracking number amazon said couldnt refund £ worth item tracking number active shame fraudulent company becomeon fraudulent note driver steal package never deliver alert amazon tell system say delivered call police ask investigate appalling amazon become worse evri delivery service funny enough amazon one company still using evri courier delivery service speaks volume company low standard us delivery service everyone know worst world amazon used good quality service appalling need hope item arrives pay regardless arriving delivery driver 