Richard W,/users/55313bfe0000ff0001b90897,GB,8.0,2023-03-10 22:21:11+00:00,1.0,Over promises. Under delivers.,"Regularly promises delivery by a specific date (often days in the future) and then fails to deliver by that date. For example, I ordered a shower fitting on Monday with a promised delivery between Wednesday and 8pm Friday. At 8.01pm I received an email informing me that the delivery is now due by Wednesday next week. Regularly a really poor service. I'm switching to smaller suppliers.",2023-03-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,10.0,387,66,30,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,regularly promise delivery specific date often day future fails deliver date example ordered shower fitting monday promised delivery wednesday pm friday pm received email informing delivery due wednesday next week regularly really poor service im switching smaller supplier,0.017543679817388837,0.9824563201826112,0.03701626472237801,0.2,0.7986314130357812,79.86314130357812,High Trust
