John Harvey,/users/627e654be2b5870012d337c9,GB,3.0,2023-03-11 18:59:47+00:00,1.0,The worst customer service on Earth,"I returned an order on 31st December 2022, it was actually collected by Royal Mail. Through tracking information I established that it was delivered back to Amazon  on 7th January 2023.Amazon sent me an email later that month to advise me that I would get a retrocharge if I didn't return it.  I spent hours over several phone calls trying to resolve the matter, yet believing it was sorted out I still got a retrocharge of £60 on 6th February.  I made more calls, twice having the phone put down on me.In the end, they advised me that I would have to answer 6 questions to get my money back.  I did so, but they later claimed they hadn't received the email, so I sent the six questions again.  I still had to call another two times and I finally got my £60 back on 7th March. So after nearly 17 years of being a customer, I will now learn to do without this unbelievably incompetent company.",2022-12-31 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,11.0,892,167,35,6,70.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,returned order st december actually collected royal mail tracking information established delivered back amazon th january amazon sent email later month advise would get retrocharge didnt return spent hour several phone call trying resolve matter yet believing sorted still got retrocharge £ th february made call twice phone put mein end advised would answer question get money back later claimed hadnt received email sent six question still call another two time finally got £ back th march nearly year customer learn without unbelievably incompetent company,0.00492396872883721,0.9950760312711628,0.09366236679753225,0.2,0.8162704889950878,81.62704889950878,High Trust
Ronald,/users/5df927257293b163bff6825b,US,36.0,2023-03-10 17:01:10+00:00,4.0,What would life be like without Amazon?,"I have found Amazon to be an excellent company. I buy what I want, and return it if I am not happy with the purchase. They make everything smooth. They are big company, and it is easy to complain about them, but what would your life be without them?",2023-02-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,10.0,249,49,39,7,11.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,found amazon excellent company buy want return happy purchase make everything smooth big company easy complain would life without,0.163847305616065,0.836152694383935,0.027481772293886708,0.8,1.6235727016507449,162.35727016507448,High Trust
