Tomas,/users/640af1e7f7bdb600128f9808,IE,2.0,2023-03-10 11:27:25+00:00,1.0,No more shopping on Amazon,"They were delivering 2 items this year 1st in January, 2nd now on March. They were never delivered but in my account shows as delivered. By the 1st item I’ve never received the call. I requested refund. When it happens second times I did it same, refund. Cause it’s annoying, just wanna get my package. Today I’ve got an email from account associates that is against their terms and policy and they should close my account or in future to reject the refund and they said I requested refund because the items were missing in the packages. But I’ve never say that. I told them many times I’ve never received this two packages. I’m not looking for some extra refund or something for free. I just wanted to get items what I ordered but never were delivered to me and they threat their customers like this? I’m closing my account as I’m no more interested to shop on Amazon, because it was the worst experience ever.",2023-03-10 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,10.0,911,166,26,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,delivering item year st january nd march never delivered account show delivered st item i’ve never received call requested refund happens second time refund cause it’s annoying wanna get package today i’ve got email account associate term policy close account future reject refund said requested refund item missing package i’ve never say told many time i’ve never received two package i’m looking extra refund something free wanted get item ordered never delivered threat customer like i’m closing account i’m interested shop amazon worst experience ever,0.010466683410532106,0.9895333165894679,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.8133869611550817,81.33869611550817,High Trust
Will Rucker,/users/640ad0d6f7bdb600128f8576,US,1.0,2023-03-10 08:40:40+00:00,2.0,"We ordered a ""brand name vacuum."" It…","We ordered a ""brand name vacuum."" It arrived with no brand name on the box, on the vacuum, or on the instruction booklet. We then noticed that the vacuum we ordered was reduced in price the following week by almost $90. We called customer service to ask that they give us the difference, because it makes no sense for us to send it back, just to purchase the item again at a lower price. They refused. We sent the item back, and will no longer be purchasing items through Amazon. Bad business practice.",2023-02-27 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,10.0,502,93,37,7,11.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered brand name vacuum arrived brand name box vacuum instruction booklet noticed vacuum ordered reduced price following week almost called customer service ask give u difference make sense u send back purchase item lower price refused sent item back longer purchasing item amazon bad business practice,0.021598897934756136,0.9784011020652439,0.05215928210880538,0.4,1.099632407454383,109.96324074543831,High Trust
Paul Lie,/users/640ac84c974b9c0012e30be4,CA,1.0,2023-03-10 08:04:08+00:00,1.0,Missing Item,"I recently received a package of 4 items in one Amazon box. One of the items was just a box with no product inside. The Amazon representative stated that since the weight of the box was correct when shipped, the problem is with the shipper or receiver.  I explained that when I picked up the Amazon package the box was intact and the Amazon seal unbroken.I find it frustrating that Amazon cannot accept that their scaling system may have made an error. The only other possibility is that I am lying in an attempt to receive free product, which is extremely insulting. I have been a loyal Amazon customer for years.Paul",2023-03-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,10.0,618,111,12,2,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently received package item one amazon box one item box product inside amazon representative stated since weight box correct shipped problem shipper receiver explained picked amazon package box intact amazon seal unbrokeni find frustrating amazon cannot accept scaling system may made error possibility lying attempt receive free product extremely insulting loyal amazon customer yearspaul,0.03063427192048297,0.969365728079517,0.062254627033090294,0.2,0.7971337894463766,79.71337894463765,High Trust
Kassia M,/users/63f5d4b7d8d65d00124c6554,US,2.0,2023-03-10 06:37:09+00:00,1.0,They delivered my package to a random…,"They delivered my package to a random house in my neighborhood. It was marked as delivered to the correct address so they will not issue a refund. Immediately after I received the notification that my package was delivered, I messaged customer service and let them know the package was not delivered. I asked if they could retrieve the package. They told me that I would be contacted within 24 hours. They never did. I asked why and they told me that my email address needs to be updated. After all of this, they finally tell me that they will not refund me for their mistake and they would not attempt to retrieve the package. So basically they just stole my money. Even though I was literally standing on my front porch waiting for my package, I have security cameras with a dvr, I had a package delivered a few days earlier and the delivery photo is obviously of 2 different places, they refuse to take accountability for their mistake. Amazon does not care that people don't get their items as long as they get paid. Also, they throw (not toss, not slide, not stack) your packages around while they load them. They will literally stack a wall of packages and then will throw other packages over the wall of boxes they stack. Doesn't matter if it's breakable. They don't care. I worked there. I witnessed this first hand. It's a common practice for loading their trucks",2023-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,10.0,1372,246,38,7,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,delivered package random house neighborhood marked delivered correct address issue refund immediately received notification package delivered messaged customer service let know package delivered asked could retrieve package told would contacted within hour never asked told email address need updated finally tell refund mistake would attempt retrieve package basically stole money even though literally standing front porch waiting package security camera dvr package delivered day earlier delivery photo obviously different place refuse take accountability mistake amazon care people dont get item long get paid also throw toss slide stack package around load literally stack wall package throw package wall box stack doesnt matter breakable dont care worked witnessed first hand common practice loading truck,0.012904385619685389,0.9870956143803146,0.13796971396522714,0.2,0.8211417499832027,82.11417499832027,High Trust
