John Jones,/users/5fd7c4bdc4a9b8001960ffaa,US,6.0,2023-03-08 22:45:40+00:00,1.0,Amazon closed my Account on my Birthday,"I have been an Amazon customer since May 19, 2007 - Dec. 3, 2022. From 2019 - 2022 my Amazon delivery have been in constant! Amazon delivery drivers would keep leaving my packages at wrong address randomly! I have two videos of Amazon delivery drivers placing my packages at the wrong address. I have made several phone calls to Amazon customer service and logistics about this issue and Amazon delivery would get my address right and the very next order delivery my order to the wrong address! I was a loyal Prime Amazon customer from May 19, 2007 - Dec. 3, 202! I would loved Amazon customer services and delivery but from 2019 - 2022 Amazon delivery would not deliver my orders to my address constantly! I have made several phone calls to Amazon about their delivery employees not be able to deliver to my address constantly. Amazon customer service would refer me to this website: no links allowed  On this page there is a line item detailing this:RISK OF LOSS All purchases of physical items from Amazon are made pursuant to a shipment contract. This means that the risk of loss and title for such items pass to you upon our delivery to the carrier.  This rule would apply if Amazon was not the shipper but when Amazon is suppose to deliver my package, Amazon takes on the risk of loss because amazon is the carrier.   On Nov 29, 2022, I ordered:  ORICO Hard Drive Case 3.5inch 20-Bay HDD/SSD Multi-Protection Storage Suitcase with Foam Hard Case Shockproof Anti-Static MoistureProof Carrying Case -PSC L20 but it does not hold 20 hard disk drives because I cannot close the lid with 8 hard disk drives in it!  Transformers: A Visual History (Limited Edition) Hardcover is item should up in January 2023 but amazon state dit was delivered on Dec. 21, 2023  On November 24, 2022: Seagate IronWolf Pro 16TB NAS Internal Hard Drive HDD – CMR 3.5 Inch SATA 6GB/S 7200 RPM 256MB Cache for Raid Network Attached Storage, Data Recovery Rescue Service and Amazon stated it was delivered on Dec. 4, 2022 and Amazon delivery stated they gave it to someone but I live alone! Amazon also had me wait for a order because I had to sign for it and they just left it at the wrong address!  On November 13, 202 2 Bayonetta 2 - (Nintendo Switch) but it was not a copy for my country! I could not access the DLC!    I can go on and on but Amazon has decided to first close my account because abuse and then backtrack when I filed credit card disputes for fraud! NowI can only purchase digital goods and nothing physical! I have been with Amazon for over decade and now they want to pull this nonsense! Amazon cannot expect customers to pay for lost and malfuntioning products and claim I am abusing Amazon's policy! Amazon needs better employees and better vetting what is on their website! I want my account back!Date of experience: December 24, 2022",2022-12-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,8.0,2837,507,39,7,75.0,0,16,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer since may dec amazon delivery constant amazon delivery driver would keep leaving package wrong address randomly two video amazon delivery driver placing package wrong address made several phone call amazon customer service logistics issue amazon delivery would get address right next order delivery order wrong address loyal prime amazon customer may dec would loved amazon customer service delivery amazon delivery would deliver order address constantly made several phone call amazon delivery employee able deliver address constantly amazon customer service would refer website link allowed page line item detailing thisrisk loss purchase physical item amazon made pursuant shipment contract mean risk loss title item pas upon delivery carrier rule would apply amazon shipper amazon suppose deliver package amazon take risk loss amazon carrier nov ordered orico hard drive case inch bay hddssd multiprotection storage suitcase foam hard case shockproof antistatic moistureproof carrying case psc l hold hard disk drive cannot close lid hard disk drive transformer visual history limited edition hardcover item january amazon state dit delivered dec november seagate ironwolf pro tb na internal hard drive hdd – cmr inch sata gb rpm mb cache raid network attached storage data recovery rescue service amazon stated delivered dec amazon delivery stated gave someone live alone amazon also wait order sign left wrong address november bayonetta nintendo switch copy country could access dlc go amazon decided first close account abuse backtrack filed credit card dispute fraud nowi purchase digital good nothing physical amazon decade want pull nonsense amazon cannot expect customer pay lost malfuntioning product claim abusing amazon policy amazon need better employee better vetting website want account backdate experience december,0.9999999849906689,1.5009331111315305e-08,0.2843522153673584,0.2,0.3568704505781372,35.68704505781372,Low Trust
Jim Woessner,/users/6408ddd690bd1a001230bcec,US,1.0,2023-03-08 21:11:38+00:00,1.0,Amazon's sells products just can't deliver them,"It has become very apparent that Amazon is allowing more and more vendors that are scam artists list on their sites. And I get why they do it as there is millions of dollars that they get to hold on to of people's money while you wait to process an order that's never going to ship and then go through the process in order to get a refund from Amazon. They obviously know about it and are continuing that process. So in the end you may or may not get any product you order from them and if you don't get the product they will certainly put you through all the steps in order to get your refund while they're hanging on to your money. This is become an ongoing issue with them ordering product, being told it's been delayed, waiting, waiting, waiting and then being told it's not going to arrive at all. I'm sure they're making millions of dollars a month off of consumers who don't track their orders or at the very least being able to hold on to consumers money for quite some time while they continue to delay and order that's never going to actually come. It's obviously their choice what vendors they allow to list on their site and in the end they're making their problem our problem and trying to speak to somebody from Amazon about it is absolutely impossible. So buyer beware Amazon is becoming the new Facebook marketplace.",2023-03-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,8.0,1332,247,47,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,become apparent amazon allowing vendor scam artist list site get million dollar get hold people money wait process order thats never going ship go process order get refund amazon obviously know continuing process end may may get product order dont get product certainly put step order get refund theyre hanging money become ongoing issue ordering product told delayed waiting waiting waiting told going arrive im sure theyre making million dollar month consumer dont track order least able hold consumer money quite time continue delay order thats never going actually come obviously choice vendor allow list site end theyre making problem problem trying speak somebody amazon absolutely impossible buyer beware amazon becoming new facebook marketplace,0.013366007610987017,0.986633992389013,0.13853056646102074,0.2,0.8210231094867106,82.10231094867106,High Trust
