pbson,/users/5d9489ccf45c380872cd9d0b,GB,36.0,2023-03-07 14:13:09+00:00,1.0,I am still Amazons biggest fan…,"I am still Amazons biggest fan…Their speed and accuracy of delivery and customer service used to be exceptional. We have c 180 deliveries a year and had probably two issues in the last 15 years or soHowever. We have just cancelled our prime membership and will not be using them in futureThe reason for this is that their courier is letting them down. Items are being delivered to random local houses. Perhaps the courier can’t read. Perhaps they are too overworked to do a good job. Amazons response seems to be that our neighbours will deliver our parcels eventually. Their chat system just keeps transferring us. Twice we have been cut off after c 90 minutes. Photos of deliveries clearly show different houses. Items we were told were delivered to a person were not…I can’t believe that Amazon would be happy if they thought about what was going on. Our one neighbour is so distressed about this and told us her thoughts that from now on we will have to use eBay. I am not happy…I suspect they are using a courier with such a bad reputation they had to change their name. A rebranding , however , does alter the fact that they are incompetent!",2023-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,7.0,1147,206,31,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,still amazon biggest fan…their speed accuracy delivery customer service used exceptional c delivery year probably two issue last year sohowever cancelled prime membership using futurethe reason courier letting item delivered random local house perhaps courier can’t read perhaps overworked good job amazon response seems neighbour deliver parcel eventually chat system keep transferring u twice cut c minute photo delivery clearly show different house item told delivered person not…i can’t believe amazon would happy thought going one neighbour distressed told u thought use ebay happy…i suspect using courier bad reputation change name rebranding however alter fact incompetent,0.1655224448658758,0.8344775551341241,0.1155356141334829,0.2,0.7403459003937587,74.03459003937587,Medium Trust
