Suzanne,/users/618e65e36fb93e001228e3a4,US,10.0,2023-03-06 17:27:34+00:00,1.0,Originally I gave Amazon a 5 star,"Originally I gave Amazon a 5 star - what a mistake! Over a mth ago ordered a crank, solar powered radio (sounded great) Received it within a couple days (prime). Wasn’t happy with it, so wanted to return it the next day. Unable to print label off phone, so requested they mail me a return label. I’ve called 4 times as nothing came - all in a span of almost a mth. Last rep I spoke with said - ‘no worries’ - I’m covered by the A-Z guarantee. I’ll be refunded and do whatever I wish with the item. I was pleased and relieved, BUT the next day received email from Amazon re the A-Z guarantee, saying it was under consideration and needed more info; like the tracking # that was on the package being sent back!? Seriously,,, THAT WAS THE PROBLEM! I’d never received a return label, so needless to say (email this morning) they are not honoring the A-Z guarantee in my case!!  THIS, imho IS A SCAM; so be sure you understand everything about this supposed safety guarantee.  Infuriating!  Spent a lot at Amazon, now rethinking everything.",2023-03-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,6.0,1035,190,33,7,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,originally gave amazon star mistake mth ago ordered crank solar powered radio sounded great received within couple day prime wasn’t happy wanted return next day unable print label phone requested mail return label i’ve called time nothing came span almost mth last rep spoke said ‘no worries’ i’m covered az guarantee i’ll refunded whatever wish item pleased relieved next day received email amazon az guarantee saying consideration needed info like tracking package sent back seriously problem i’d never received return label needless say email morning honoring az guarantee case imho scam sure understand everything supposed safety guarantee infuriating spent lot amazon rethinking everything,0.9936826612813849,0.006317338718615062,0.1065619742007852,0.2,0.3244710641994646,32.44710641994646,Low Trust
