ement, they must refer to the private dispute resolution council and they do not have the right to complain in court in case of damage or accident because of running on the ice. All packages are registered with photos in the Amazon system.  Therefore, if your package is delivered to your door and a passer-by steals it, or the package is lost, or it gets wet and damaged due to wind and rain, you should contact the amazon , in some cases, amazon is refunding but it depends on the situation. in conclusion, amazon is caring about the costumers rather than their employees. so, they are loosing their employees every day because of hard pressure on them.",2023-03-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,4.0,2536,430,32,7,3.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,amazon fast company it’s delivery quality low hard fast work delivery increase number package driver delivering every day subcontractor amazon gifting subcontractor company speed amazon paying money quality delivery subcontractor delivery driver amazon’s subcontractor try increase stop stop month employing delivery driver try deliver package stop hour city delivery driver adding package amazon’s subcontractor make driver move extraordinary speed dangerous illegal driver run stair knee take ignition unbelievable customer expect company deliver package better condition driver deliver every package costumer’s hand delay driver controlled powerful amazon application subcontractor’s company manager always calling talking increasing speed distinguishing delivery driver’s location calling permanently driver call costumer loose time return package driver loose job tricky way therefore best service amaron currently offer subcontractor delivery company thats feel amazon’s subcontractor boss greedy problem delivery driver work amaron month understand company work speed workload worker border physical injury according company wide long contract worker cannot even complain economic promise court according agreement must refer private dispute resolution council 