Andrew Gibson,/users/51cffa9a000064000141eae0,GB,9.0,2023-03-03 18:38:36+00:00,1.0,Parcel never arrived - Amazon refuse to help or refund,"Parcel never arrived, Amazon states it did, won't issue a refund and told to file a police report.  Done the latter and police request evidence in form of a POD or photo, requested from Amazon and they cannot give it me or provide me any contact details for shipping company even though I have requested it.  As such they are refusing to help, can't give me evidence of delivery or any contact for the courier used to try and get it myself.  Also informed them I have CCTV with no one attempting to come on the property the day the delivery supposedly happened.I've wasted so much of my time and am over £300 out of pocket. Amazon are just so unhelpful, literally terrible customer service.",2023-03-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,3.0,690,125,54,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,parcel never arrived amazon state wont issue refund told file police report done latter police request evidence form pod photo requested amazon cannot give provide contact detail shipping company even though requested refusing help cant give evidence delivery contact courier used try get also informed cctv one attempting come property day delivery supposedly happenedive wasted much time £ pocket amazon unhelpful literally terrible customer service,0.01426008938774943,0.9857399106122505,0.07010656197420079,0.2,0.8068912677009654,80.68912677009654,High Trust
William Dickens,/users/5de68d43741d5f4cdc32df04,US,3.0,2023-03-03 17:04:14+00:00,1.0,Be leery if you order from amazon for your company,"I order a product from Amazon for the company I work for and when I went back to print the invoice I noticed that that product was not listed in the order tab. I contacted amazon customer service and was told I had bought the item thru a vendor that's why it was not posted in my order tab. I was told it's no longer a amazon issue but the vendor that I would have to contact for a invoice even though amazon was the one that accepted the payment. So I have contacted that vendor multiple times thru their website, on the phone and thru email for days and have yet to hear back. I was under the impression that if you sold a product on your website then it would make sense that they would be responsible for the invoice especially since the whole purchase process went thru amazon website and not the vendors. I have canceled my account and will no longer be using amazon my few thousands of dollars spent last year will be going to another company that is less shady.",2023-03-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,3.0,969,186,50,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,order product amazon company work went back print invoice noticed product listed order tab contacted amazon customer service told bought item thru vendor thats posted order tab told longer amazon issue vendor would contact invoice even though amazon one accepted payment contacted vendor multiple time thru website phone thru email day yet hear back impression sold product website would make sense would responsible invoice especially since whole purchase process went thru amazon website vendor canceled account longer using amazon thousand dollar spent last year going another company less shady,0.012078904248609046,0.987921095751391,0.10431856421761077,0.2,0.8148242607192177,81.48242607192176,High Trust
Beth,/users/63621ac53d398200130c5d13,GB,4.0,2023-03-03 14:44:47+00:00,1.0,HORRIBLE COMPANY,"HORRIBLE COMPANYIt treats its sellers like rubbish with absolutely zero respect for human existence whatsoever.This company has no corporate social responsibility and neither does it have any mental health consideration at all. Very fraudulent in its dealings with sellers. They take high commission from all sales. On 1st December, with no prior warning, they closed my seller account, absolutely no reason given, just generic reasons and they still withhold my funds till this day. Initially, I was told funds will be released in 90 days and now it's over 90 days, their reimbursement team ignored all my messages requesting for money and only responded, today advising me of their intention to keep my money. This has plunged me in total darkness with mental and financial struggle. All my money goneJust how do you make someone jobless and penniless in one day.This company needs to be regulated because I still can't believe these fraudstar of a company is allowed to treat people in such ridiculous manner",2022-12-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,3.0,1011,165,16,2,92.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,horrible companyit treat seller like rubbish absolutely zero respect human existence whatsoeverthis company corporate social responsibility neither mental health consideration fraudulent dealing seller take high commission sale st december prior warning closed seller account absolutely reason given generic reason still withhold fund till day initially told fund released day day reimbursement team ignored message requesting money responded today advising intention keep money plunged total darkness mental financial struggle money gonejust make someone jobless penniless one daythis company need regulated still cant believe fraudstar company allowed treat people ridiculous manner,0.007793910703481828,0.9922060892965182,0.09254066180594504,0.2,0.8146111770094481,81.46111770094481,High Trust
