Sonia Miranda Oliva,/users/6269552627e64c0012e4342c,US,3.0,2023-03-03 02:22:37+00:00,1.0,Product ordered 3 months ago,"Ordered a humidifier that was on stock (last December). After all this time they keep saying the item is not on stock and i have to wait more until they get it in stock but cant provide an estimate time. Because I ordered this in sales period now I cant find anything similar for similar price. Funny that they are telling me to order through the item seller in amazon and the same product cost about 70£ more. Absolute joke. They failed to tell me on time that this was out of stock so I could have ordered something different on sale and they are failing to send a similar item or the same one through ""the seller"".",2023-03-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,3.0,617,118,28,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered humidifier stock last december time keep saying item stock wait get stock cant provide estimate time ordered sale period cant find anything similar similar price funny telling order item seller amazon product cost £ absolute joke failed tell time stock could ordered something different sale failing send similar item one seller,0.015611737104874008,0.984388262895126,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.8054302503482921,80.54302503482921,High Trust
