Ash,/users/5ea81f55b61f5a4032e16bfc,US,11.0,2023-03-02 19:42:43+00:00,5.0,"Screw Walmart, I will always shop Amazon","We literally could not live without them, they have turned shopping from a chore into a fun experience and let us do it all from home. Almost every product on prime arrives exactly when it’s supposed to and any that do not are not the fault of Amazon. Selection is amazing, I think a more identified mark should be listed for 3rd party sellers like the mark for prime, most third party stores are top notch but I’ve seen some scams out there and when I tried to report them it fail’s sometimes. If you stick with Amazon stuff and not blame them for the delivery company issues you will have no problems ever. I cannot for the life of me understand why the overall rating isn’t close to 5 stars",2023-03-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,2.0,693,131,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,literally could live without turned shopping chore fun experience let u home almost every product prime arrives exactly it’s supposed fault amazon selection amazing think identified mark listed rd party seller like mark prime third party store top notch i’ve seen scam tried report fail’s sometimes stick amazon stuff blame delivery company issue problem ever cannot life understand overall rating isn’t close star,0.029295250571464388,0.9707047494285356,0.07347167694896242,1.0,2.00004671010406,200.004671010406,High Trust
Mrs Lewis,/users/590424690000ff000a926d4b,GB,35.0,2023-03-02 19:38:12+00:00,1.0,Surprisingly bad customer service,I have always bad great faith in amazon but this time I'm disgusted by their treatment.  I've actually stopped ordering stuff from them.  I bought some bench seat covers back in August last year.  Unfortunately one of the backs did not fit so I requested a replacement.   At first all went well.  I got a refund for the wrong cushion and ordered another.  It did not arrive.  I got another refund and ordered another.  This did not arrive either.  The company supplying stopped answering mine and amazon's emails.  They issued a refund for the missing cushion but as I had 5 cushions in purple and none in the gap I asked for help.  They refused my requesting and then denied my appeal.  I am left with 5 purple cushions which cost 142.00 and a gap.  No other company seems to have that colour and I object to paying 142.00 for odd covers.  I have put in another appeal but don't expect much satisfaction.  I would be happy with a partial refund and at least I could get all the backs in a different colour. It might mot look too bad.....,2022-08-11 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,2.0,1038,190,33,4,203.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,always bad great faith amazon time im disgusted treatment ive actually stopped ordering stuff bought bench seat cover back august last year unfortunately one back fit requested replacement first went well got refund wrong cushion ordered another arrive got another refund ordered another arrive either company supplying stopped answering mine amazon email issued refund missing cushion cushion purple none gap asked help refused requesting denied appeal left purple cushion cost gap company seems colour object paying odd cover put another appeal dont expect much satisfaction would happy partial refund least could get back different colour might mot look bad,0.0029781908983271188,0.9970218091016729,0.1065619742007852,0.2,0.8198232993909935,81.98232993909936,High Trust
