Dave B,/users/5deaa2dd1ef7dc659cda5fe9,US,3.0,2023-03-02 08:24:27+00:00,1.0,"Be Very Careful about what you buy at amazon. If you have to return it for some reason, they will now most likely, Keep Half","I ordered a shower curtain, from amazon. It was about $25.00 or so, I wasn't happy with the curtain, so I set up a return with amazon, they picked it up a few days later, got an email from amazon, they got the package, and where refunding $15.00 to my account. With no heads up, where keeping half your money. So that will be the LAST item I buy from amazon. I wouldn't have given them a 1 star rating.",2023-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,3.0,2.0,402,80,124,25,10.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered shower curtain amazon wasnt happy curtain set return amazon picked day later got email amazon got package refunding account head keeping half money last item buy amazon wouldnt given star rating,0.0035301178960947584,0.9964698821039052,0.044868199663488505,0.2,0.8072085809846503,80.72085809846503,High Trust
