Karla Logston,/users/63fb788ed5c27e0012dfe566,US,2.0,2023-02-26 17:19:50+00:00,1.0,Worst CS ever experienced from retailer,"Returned an item that was a gift that arrived broken. Have email  from Amazon approving return showing picture of item and printing label. Have UPS confirmation #  it was delivered to Amazon. No credit in our account, and now saying we need to call the sender and ask them for their email address to confirm. Not a large amount of money, but thanked the sender when received as it was a gift and don't want to go back to them telling them that it was broken. Horrible customer service for a $20 item. This is why I refuse to become an Amazon Prime member and only use them when I can't find something absolutely anywhere else. For this large of a company and this small of an amount, it's the worst customer service I've ever experienced.",2023-01-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,26.0,738,136,39,6,29.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,returned item gift arrived broken email amazon approving return showing picture item printing label ups confirmation delivered amazon credit account saying need call sender ask email address confirm large amount money thanked sender received gift dont want go back telling broken horrible customer service item refuse become amazon prime member use cant find something absolutely anywhere else large company small amount worst customer service ive ever experienced,0.00725916143908457,0.9927408385609154,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.8116256071660438,81.16256071660437,High Trust
