Colette Murphy,/users/5a9723404de5666d34c7d291,GB,27.0,2023-02-26 15:20:38+00:00,1.0,So annoyed with amazon,"So annoyed with amazon. Certainly won’t be using again. Been a prime member for years but not again.Arranged a return pick up for my one day off this week. Sat in the whole day and they didn’t turn up.Amazon arranged DPD to pick up next morning. They did, and then Evri turned up later to also pick up.The next day DPD try to drop the parcel back at mine, no reason just it’s down as a delivery to me. Listening inside the box can also tell the item now damaged, loose parts Refused delivery.Trying to get my money back from Amazon a nightmare.Decided to go back to shopping on the high street, refusing to do online.",2023-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,26.0,617,116,22,4,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,annoyed amazon certainly won’t using prime member year againarranged return pick one day week sat whole day didn’t turn upamazon arranged dpd pick next morning evri turned later also pick upthe next day dpd try drop parcel back mine reason it’s delivery listening inside box also tell item damaged loose part refused deliverytrying get money back amazon nightmaredecided go back shopping high street refusing online,0.01857070152972114,0.9814292984702788,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.803726427137551,80.3726427137551,High Trust
Kerry Isaacs,/users/5e2589f9ddcefafb715acb31,GB,9.0,2023-02-26 15:00:20+00:00,1.0,Absolutely shocking,"Absolutely shocking, pay for prime every month which has recently increased yet again, I ordered an item for my son which was supposed to come next day (yesterday) didn't come, when he waited eagerly all day, just to be told it wasn't coming!!! Now just says it is expected today with no tracking or any other information, this is not good enough!!my son is eagerly waiting again as he can't wait for this item, he's probably just going to be let down again by amazon and I feel very let let down by them, will be cancelling my prime. They seem to have no regards to how they're treating their loyal customers at the moment as my husband has been treated shockingly too against his account regarding returns, when he's done everything by the book!! Also they make it extremely difficult to complain or sort the issue out,  it's all automated and set up just how they want it to go not what's easiest for the customer, which is why I'm writing this review",2023-02-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,26.0,954,174,19,2,1.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,absolutely shocking pay prime every month recently increased yet ordered item son supposed come next day yesterday didnt come waited eagerly day told wasnt coming say expected today tracking information good enoughmy son eagerly waiting cant wait item he probably going let amazon feel let let cancelling prime seem regard theyre treating loyal customer moment husband treated shockingly account regarding return he done everything book also make extremely difficult complain sort issue automated set want go whats easiest customer im writing review,0.9978898263131075,0.0021101736868924803,0.0975883342680875,0.2,0.32057275369706373,32.057275369706375,Low Trust
Lorelei La,/users/58c3f7810000ff000a807a15,GB,14.0,2023-02-26 12:43:06+00:00,1.0,Dishonest and manipulative,"Despite the questionable ways they treat their staff Amazon used to be a good bet for buyers. What they promised tended to happen. Items would arrive more or less on time. They've clearly changed their policies. They offer quick delivery that is clearly never going to happen, then you wait ages while your item travels around the country (most recently one was within about 10 miles of me then went about 150 miles away, this on premium delivery). They hand far more over to unreliable delivery companies.They also seem to have started trying to trick you into paying for delivery. Items which are theoretically included in the free over £20 delivery suddenly have a charge attached. I do understand that free delivery is a bonus not a right, but they need to be more transparent and honest. Tricking customers into paying more for items (it's amazing how prices can shift) or paying for postage they were promised would be free is certainly making me start to look more elsewhere.",2023-02-21 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,26.0,982,169,26,3,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,despite questionable way treat staff amazon used good bet buyer promised tended happen item would arrive less time theyve clearly changed policy offer quick delivery clearly never going happen wait age item travel around country recently one within mile went mile away premium delivery hand far unreliable delivery companiesthey also seem started trying trick paying delivery item theoretically included free £ delivery suddenly charge attached understand free delivery bonus right need transparent honest tricking customer paying item amazing price shift paying postage promised would free certainly making start look elsewhere,0.009101728851357445,0.9908982711486426,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.8144059499321452,81.44059499321452,High Trust
