Dawn White,/users/5ae0bfa54de5666d342e9c5c,GB,12.0,2023-02-26 04:05:40+00:00,2.0,Extremely disappointed with Amazon😡…,"Ive always found Amazon delivery drivers to be very good at their job.This time however I’m not only annoyed about the delivery service but Amazon customer services itself.I ordered some new garden furniture, the lorry pulled up as I was taking my dog for a walk around the block.I let my partner know they were here and I set off, but as I turned the corner to come home the delivery driver was reversing his truck leaving my Partner to take this extremely large extremely heavy parcel which the driver dumped on the pavement leaving it  for my partner who is classed as disabled to struggle moving it up the pathway 😡.I was fuming, I reported it to Amazon who on the phone apologised and told me they would look into it, all of this is recorded on my door cam but do you think I have heard a word back 🧐 not a bloody word.Oh and if you think that was bad the next day I was expecting a delivery where the delivery woman opens my front door and throws the parcel in shuts the door then runs off up the road once again caught on camera, once again I was put on hold waiting to speak to another person to then have the call cut off from their end. I’m actually looking to seek legal advise as my partner has injured his shoulder.Extremely annoyed with Amazon😡😡",2023-02-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,26.0,1259,238,36,4,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ive always found amazon delivery driver good jobthis time however i’m annoyed delivery service amazon customer service itselfi ordered new garden furniture lorry pulled taking dog walk around blocki let partner know set turned corner come home delivery driver reversing truck leaving partner take extremely large extremely heavy parcel driver dumped pavement leaving partner classed disabled struggle moving pathway 😡i fuming reported amazon phone apologised told would look recorded door cam think heard word back 🧐 bloody wordoh think bad next day expecting delivery delivery woman open front door throw parcel shuts door run road caught camera put hold waiting speak another person call cut end i’m actually looking seek legal advise partner injured shoulderextremely annoyed amazon😡😡,0.02598385382938333,0.9740161461706167,0.1334828939988783,0.4,1.1137046518850842,111.37046518850842,High Trust
Paul Powers,/users/605cdbcb780813001453d77c,GB,35.0,2023-02-26 00:14:42+00:00,5.0,As a subscriber to Amazon Prime Video…,"As a subscriber to Amazon Prime Video for over a decade, I have to say that I am thoroughly impressed with the service. The streaming platform has an extensive library of movies and TV shows, including a wide range of genres and languages, so there is always something new and interesting to watch. The user interface is intuitive and easy to navigate, and the video and sound quality is top-notch. I also appreciate the fact that Amazon Prime Video produces its own original content, which is often of very high quality and offers something new and different from the usual programming. Over the years, the service has added more and more benefits, including free and fast shipping, access to music, and other exclusive offers. The best part is that Amazon Prime Video allows multiple users to stream at the same time, so my family and I can watch different shows on different devices without any issues. Overall, I highly recommend Amazon Prime Video to anyone looking for a quality streaming service with a great selection of content, additional benefits, and a long-standing reputation for excellence.",2023-02-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,26.0,1105,185,38,7,22.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,subscriber amazon prime video decade say thoroughly impressed service streaming platform extensive library movie tv show including wide range genre language always something new interesting watch user interface intuitive easy navigate video sound quality topnotch also appreciate fact amazon prime video produce original content often high quality offer something new different usual programming year service added benefit including free fast shipping access music exclusive offer best part amazon prime video allows multiple user stream time family watch different show different device without issue overall highly recommend amazon prime video anyone looking quality streaming service great selection content additional benefit longstanding reputation excellence,0.05516569113297663,0.9448343088670234,0.10375771172181716,1.0,1.993168696777875,199.3168696777875,High Trust
