KM,/users/6377c5e34e77420014434b61,US,4.0,2023-02-25 20:37:12+00:00,1.0,AMAZON NEEDS A COMPLETE OVERHAUL!,"Amazon really scrapes the bottom of the barrel, when hiring.  One of their drivers, who delivers packages to post offices, begs each postal employee for money and cigarettes.  He either attempts to scam them, or just asks outright.  “Nicholas” does this at every stop on his route, and will even sit around in the parking lot, hitting them up as they show for work.  Even if he was just there a couple of days earlier, he repeats the scamming and begging, all over again.  He claims to be a supervisor, but I think it’s just more of his lies.  How low of a person do you have to be, to think it’s okay to scam federal employees, or anyone, for that matter?!  Since Amazon does not care about anyone who comes into contact with their workers, it is not very surprising that this type of bad behavior is allowed.  Their customer service needs major help, as well.  Recently, I phoned and was connected to Singapore.  Amazon workers hung up on me, lied to me, told me to call back, etc.  Due to all of these issues, I ended up having to speak with four different employees, that day.  Five days later, the bank notified me of a fraudulent charge of $700, made in Singapore.  Clearly, Amazon keeps allowing their employees to treat customers with zero respect.  There are SO MANY problems, within all aspects of Amazon…they need a COMPLETE overhaul!",2023-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,25.0,1345,240,33,5,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon really scrape bottom barrel hiring one driver delivers package post office begs postal employee money cigarette either attempt scam asks outright “nicholas” every stop route even sit around parking lot hitting show work even couple day earlier repeat scamming begging claim supervisor think it’s lie low person think it’s okay scam federal employee anyone matter since amazon care anyone come contact worker surprising type bad behavior allowed customer service need major help well recently phoned connected singapore amazon worker hung lied told call back etc due issue ended speak four different employee day five day later bank notified fraudulent charge made singapore clearly amazon keep allowing employee treat customer zero respect many problem within aspect amazon…they need complete overhaul,0.14662707049966806,0.853372929500332,0.1346045989904655,0.2,0.753607384548259,75.3607384548259,High Trust
Julia Sosolid,/users/63fa51ccd5c27e0012df6578,US,4.0,2023-02-25 20:22:23+00:00,1.0,I call to customer service,"I call to customer service, to remove my old phone number. And after I said to the guy I had done everything he told me 2 times, he started telling on me and dropped the call. Maybe it wasn't his day, but then he shouldn't work today.",2023-02-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,25.0,234,47,26,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,call customer service remove old phone number said guy done everything told time started telling dropped call maybe wasnt day shouldnt work today,0.019599535870938874,0.9804004641290611,0.026360067302299495,0.2,0.7954722455249904,79.54722455249905,High Trust
gps-gb on ebay,/users/63584d3772aa870012913737,GB,7.0,2023-02-25 16:31:52+00:00,1.0,Do not trust Amazon,"I am a seller on Amazon uk. Re a loss over £300. Beware of delays when selling to customers abroad. Your goods can be delayed by customs. If it takes longer than 20 days and the customer complains to Amazon they will get their money back, later the package will be delivered. The customer will not return it nor answer any messages. Amazon will not reimburse you for the loss, in fact, they will ignore any correspondence. Not only that Amazon's selling fees are horrendous, approximately 20%. This is how Bezos finances his space flights and all the rest of his money wasting projects.",2023-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,25.0,586,104,19,4,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,seller amazon uk loss £ beware delay selling customer abroad good delayed custom take longer day customer complains amazon get money back later package delivered customer return answer message amazon reimburse loss fact ignore correspondence amazon selling fee horrendous approximately bezos finance space flight rest money wasting project,0.022114496302151204,0.9778855036978488,0.05832865956253505,0.2,0.8006084837614313,80.06084837614313,High Trust
