Glen,/users/50a0ed23000064000126b192,US,10.0,2023-02-24 13:04:24+00:00,1.0,I avoid using amazon more and more…,"I avoid using amazon more and more these days. Not just because I can usually find things cheaper else where but because of what has to be the worst search engine of any large online retailer. Not only is it impossible to narrow your search to get to what you are looking for, the pages are littered with ""sponsored"" items that get repeated on every page. To make things even worse, now, you only get 7 pages of items so if you sort by price you only see the cheapest 7 pages (and sponsored items) of the item you are searching for. For the biggest retails in the world it just shows they are only interested in profit and not in their customer. Taking my business else where, where I can find what I actually want.",2023-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,24.0,715,136,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,avoid using amazon day usually find thing cheaper else worst search engine large online retailer impossible narrow search get looking page littered sponsored item get repeated every page make thing even worse get page item sort price see cheapest page sponsored item item searching biggest retail world show interested profit customer taking business else find actually want,0.01105022671177507,0.988949773288225,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.8097300745296986,80.97300745296985,High Trust
