Nayna Santana,/users/63f3803ab76e310012ab339f,GB,1.0,2023-02-20 16:14:41+00:00,1.0,DO NOT buy from Amazon,"Wow Amazon are really unfair and try to really prolong the refund process of expensive items. I bought a dynamic microphone from Amazon which took one day to arrive but then arrived faulty, so I requested a refund which took one day to collect from my home. Then it took three weeks for Amazon to receive my item back from the courier and now they are saying it will take another two weeks to process the refund. The original email had advised me that it will take maximum 7-14 days to process a refund. I have been backwards and forwards with customer services at amazon who promised me the refund straight away, only for me to call back and find out that the refund was not processed at all and that I need to wait another 14 days max. I cannot believe this type of services is real, after breaking down and crying on the phone because I needed my money back, they then processed the refund. I will NEVER buy from amazon again. I no longer trust their process. They are manipulative and want to keep your money for as long as possible when processing refunds, that should be a criminal offence. Specially when you're a single mum and rely on refunds coming back promptly.",2023-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,20.0,1173,216,22,5,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,wow amazon really unfair try really prolong refund process expensive item bought dynamic microphone amazon took one day arrive arrived faulty requested refund took one day collect home took three week amazon receive item back courier saying take another two week process refund original email advised take maximum day process refund backwards forward customer service amazon promised refund straight away call back find refund processed need wait another day max cannot believe type service real breaking cry phone needed money back processed refund never buy amazon longer trust process manipulative want keep money long possible processing refund criminal offence specially youre single mum rely refund coming back promptly,0.0072657415104940655,0.9927342584895059,0.12114413909141895,0.2,0.8205959570630368,82.05959570630368,High Trust
