Tina G,/users/6203b0b93f1e03001223bec2,ES,3.0,2023-02-20 11:10:21+00:00,1.0,Stole my money,"I bought a phone as a gift and without ever turning it on, we decided to returne it and get another one. A month and a half later, no word from amazon, no refund. I called and they said I returned a wrong product. Which is a lie. I returned the exact, unused, wrapped product. They refuse to refund and even refuse to give proof of the mistake, or return the inexisting product they claim I returned. I am deleting the account and all of my family is, they will steal from you if possible. Also suing them. Not because of the money, but because they did this to too many people already.",2023-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,20.0,586,113,14,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought phone gift without ever turning decided returne get another one month half later word amazon refund called said returned wrong product lie returned exact unused wrapped product refuse refund even refuse give proof mistake return inexisting product claim returned deleting account family steal possible also suing money many people already,0.019469672341275952,0.980530327658724,0.0633763320246775,0.2,0.8029404302342976,80.29404302342977,High Trust
Police report,/users/63f30eaec6f55700136155a8,US,1.0,2023-02-20 08:10:24+00:00,1.0,Today was the first time I spoke with…,"Today was the first time I spoke with Amazon customer service representative. I didn’t know that such a mega company is trying so hard to save on customer service. The person was not helpful at all. Amazon apparently doesn’t care about customers whatsoever. If you order item and the item is lost - it’s customer’s fault. You will need to prove to Amazon that you didn’t steel it before they even attempt to provide you with picture of delivery (which they didn’t provide). Lesson for the future - don’t ever order any expensive items from Amazon. If the item is lost or stolen during delivery - well, it’s totally your fault and you are pretty much on your own. I will have to keep that in mind and will discourage all my friends, family and business partners not to purchase any valuable or expensive items in the future. I was a happy customer of that company for many years. I guess not any more.",2023-02-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,20.0,900,164,38,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,today first time spoke amazon customer service representative didn’t know mega company trying hard save customer service person helpful amazon apparently doesn’t care customer whatsoever order item item lost it’s customer’s fault need prove amazon didn’t steel even attempt provide picture delivery didn’t provide lesson future don’t ever order expensive item amazon item lost stolen delivery well it’s totally fault pretty much keep mind discourage friend family business partner purchase valuable expensive item future happy customer company many year guess,0.007349919235864925,0.9926500807641351,0.09197980931015143,0.2,0.8147210022440978,81.47210022440979,High Trust
