alked away sitting looking straight said cant put porch floor take pic instead expecting little lad job furious ive amazon prime customerfor year honest never want order supercilious moron look face walked away leaving bairn hand im absolutely disgusted,0.9999999992584558,7.415441594105232e-10,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.3270330906680239,32.70330906680239,Low Trust
