Carl Hodson,/users/5e8dda8a149f486d9eab4f59,GB,14.0,2023-02-19 08:49:18+00:00,1.0,Don't trust Amazon,"It is impossible to post a negative review directly on the Amazon site. I have attempted to post several reviews for several different products and on each occasion Amazon state the content does bot adhere to their guidelines. Below is my review and Amazon's response. My review: ""Amazon's Slipping StandardsI'm becoming tired and frustrated by Amazon, their standards are clearly slipping. I received this item in a damaged state, the damage having clearly occurred prior to shipping.""Amazon's Response:""Thank you for submitting a customer review on Amazon. After carefully reviewing your submission, your review could not be posted to the website. It appears your content did not comply with our guidelines. While we appreciate your time and comments, reviews must adhere to the following guidelinesAmazon Community Guidelines.""There is nothing untoward in my review. It is truthful and shows Amazon in a negative light, nothing more. Don't trust Amazon.",2023-02-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,19.0,956,147,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,impossible post negative review directly amazon site attempted post several review several different product occasion amazon state content bot adhere guideline review amazon response review amazon slipping standardsim becoming tired frustrated amazon standard clearly slipping received item damaged state damage clearly occurred prior shippingamazons responsethank submitting customer review amazon carefully reviewing submission review could posted website appears content comply guideline appreciate time comment review must adhere following guidelinesamazon community guidelinesthere nothing untoward review truthful show amazon negative light nothing dont trust amazon,0.049776873829759365,0.9502231261702406,0.08244531688166012,0.2,0.7916006264614524,79.16006264614524,High Trust
