michelle wolder,/users/63ed7a2de651c20013e2040c,US,1.0,2023-02-16 02:35:08+00:00,2.0,I have been an  Amazon prime member for…,"I have been an  Amazon prime member for years.  They used to be great.  Not so much any more.   Their delivery and customer service is terrible.  I ordered 3 Items at the same time.  One item that was delivered was not what I ordered.  Had to return.  One Item was left at the wrong address.  Thankfully I have trustworthy neighbors that brought package to me.  The third Item, I have yet to receive.  It was a $70,00 item that was on 1 day sale for $37.00.  If I take refund I can no longer get sale price.  Tracking stated it was assigned to driver for delivery, then my package just disappeared.  Couldn't be found.  Customer svc stated they would upload a $5.00 gift card to my account for the inconvenience, which I never got.  Don't know if I will ever receive my package.  The above is just the most recent issue I had with Amazon Prime.  It seems like I'm paying a monthly fee to be jerked around.",2023-02-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,16.0,905,168,40,8,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon prime member year used great much delivery customer service terrible ordered item time one item delivered ordered return one item left wrong address thankfully trustworthy neighbor brought package third item yet receive item day sale take refund longer get sale price tracking stated assigned driver delivery package disappeared couldnt found customer svc stated would upload gift card account inconvenience never got dont know ever receive package recent issue amazon prime seems like im paying monthly fee jerked around,0.006994666489629728,0.9930053335103702,0.09422321929332586,0.4,1.1153473106138503,111.53473106138503,High Trust
