srdmagic,/users/5f1d994f71f4cbec7bc0e72c,GB,3.0,2023-02-15 18:25:56+00:00,1.0,About to buy firestick which was on…,"About to buy firestick which was on offer. Amazon offered me a bigger discount by trading in my old firestick, which I did. The whole trade in took 4 days. Received email from Amazon stating credits put into my account. Went to purchase item and Amazon put up price of item to more than all my discounts. Tried to sort out via text chat at Amazon was told ""nothing can be done but credits last 3 months so keep checking back see if item goes on offer again""Tried to escalate complaint was then given run around from person to person. Asked for manager was told already talking to manager who offered me a solution: buy item at now price then contact Amazon when it arrives then manager will credit my account with £10. I asked why not put £10 credit on account now so I'm not having to ask for £10. Told can't ""sorry"".Gave up with text chat phoned up Amazon spoke with a human and got it sorted within half hour. Don't waste your time with text chat go straight to phone or better still shop elsewhere!",2023-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,15.0,1002,188,36,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,buy firestick offer amazon offered bigger discount trading old firestick whole trade took day received email amazon stating credit put account went purchase item amazon put price item discount tried sort via text chat amazon told nothing done credit last month keep checking back see item go offer againtried escalate complaint given run around person person asked manager told already talking manager offered solution buy item price contact amazon arrives manager credit account £ asked put £ credit account im ask £ told cant sorrygave text chat phoned amazon spoke human got sorted within half hour dont waste time text chat go straight phone better still shop elsewhere,0.04744302003519997,0.9525569799648,0.10544026920919798,0.2,0.7973665438242397,79.73665438242396,High Trust
