Debbie Johnston,/users/63ecd6a1eaecf70012c997e5,US,1.0,2023-02-15 14:57:34+00:00,1.0,Unethical Company,Very disappointed in this and will be canceling my Prime membership.   I ordered a gift for my friends birthday and paid when I ordered.   I chose her address to be shipped to.   They sent email Monday that it was being shipped to me.   I called and spoke to Shahbaz so l who promised and I confirmed 3 times that it was going to be corrected and sent to her house.  Nope it came to me... its not like I can pop over to her house and give it to her as I'm in Florida and she's in Arkansas. 800 miles away.   So i called and spoke to Dave who said no problem we will correct and send it out to her address...he just needs to send me to another department but it will be made right.   I now have Pablo on the phone so days Nope they will not make it right at all!!!  So now I had to go to the UPS store and spend another $30 to send to correct address that I was told on Monday it would be corrected.   Is this really how your treat your customers?,2023-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,15.0,946,191,17,2,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,disappointed canceling prime membership ordered gift friend birthday paid ordered chose address shipped sent email monday shipped called spoke shahbaz l promised confirmed time going corrected sent house nope came like pop house give im florida shes arkansas mile away called spoke dave said problem correct send addresshe need send another department made right pablo phone day nope make right go ups store spend another send correct address told monday would corrected really treat customer,0.8737908907980432,0.12620910920195683,0.1071228266965788,0.2,0.38452911994029415,38.452911994029414,Low Trust
