Martha,/users/54f8bb520000ff0001af5789,US,2.0,2023-02-15 00:38:02+00:00,3.0,CHANGING YOUR DEFAULT CREDIT CARD,"I was trying to change my default credit card from Amazon Visa to another credit cared. The site would absolutely not do it. I called customer service and spent one-plus hours on the phone with an impatient, intolerant rep. going over and over the sites and selections I had already tried. It just would not let me enter an alternative credit card. Tonight, I found an agent who stayed with me and found a circuitous way for me to enter my new credit card. She was an angel; the rest of Amazon is an overbearing monopoly which I suspect just did not want me to use a credit card other than its.",2023-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,15.0,594,112,33,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,trying change default credit card amazon visa another credit cared site would absolutely called customer service spent oneplus hour phone impatient intolerant rep going site selection already tried would let enter alternative credit card tonight found agent stayed found circuitous way enter new credit card angel rest amazon overbearing monopoly suspect want use credit card,0.06205597741155001,0.93794402258845,0.0628154795288839,0.6,1.3815351072000017,138.15351072000018,High Trust
Juura Ahiaq,/users/63ec0645a1eac50013d8063d,CA,1.0,2023-02-15 00:09:04+00:00,1.0,Why can't driver's read??,"I can't believe how many times I've complained to Amazon customer support, Amazon delivery, and a few Amazon delivery supervisors. How GOD. DAMN. HARD. IS IT TO READ AND FOLLOW BASIC INSTRUCTIONS?? I've had 10 packages in a row not here at all or get here late because people cant follow basic instructions. The best part about the current situation I'm having is that the item I'm waiting on was a replacement for one that was screwed up on Saturday LOL (they delivered 2 packages, to TWO SEPARATE DOORS, on TWO SEPARATE FLOORS in the wrong building?? Why?? If you're gonna mess up, AT LEAST mess up at ONE. DOOR.) I bought this new item with the refunded Amazon card money and I STILL DIDNT GET IT. I live in an apartment complex so in my delivery instructions I have -- I live in the small building, not the big one. Please deliver package to the small building. Please call ((my phone number)) when arrived. If I do not answer, it means I am at work and you can leave the package on the porch as a camera records 24/7 The Amazon support people also put down instructions -- Customer lives in the small building in the back parking lot. Please call ((my phone number)) upon arrival. If customer does not answer, it means she is at work and you can leave the package on the porch. There is a camera that is always recording. Please do not attempt delivery before 5pm, as the customer works until that time Monday-froday Oh and guess what?? The delivery customer service people ALSO left basic instructions -- Customer lives in the small building, not the big one. Please call ((my phone number)). If customer does not answer, it means she is at work and you can leave the package on the porch. Please do not deliver until after 5pm on monday-friday I don't understand how anyone could possibly simplify it more. Why can't people read?? This never used to be a problem. They used to always deliver it. Sometimes it would even be in front of my apartment door! Educate your god damn driver's Amazon. Make it a requirement for them to be AT LEAST at an intermediate reading/comprehension level. My 4 year old nephew is better at following instructions than these people are.",2023-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,15.0,2173,391,25,4,2.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,cant believe many time ive complained amazon customer support amazon delivery amazon delivery supervisor god damn hard read follow basic instruction ive package row get late people cant follow basic instruction best part current situation im item im waiting replacement one screwed saturday lol delivered package two separate door two separate floor wrong building youre gonna mess least mess one door bought new item refunded amazon card money still didnt get live apartment complex delivery instruction live small building big one please deliver package small building please call phone number arrived answer mean work leave package porch camera record amazon support people also put instruction customer life small building back parking lot please call phone number upon arrival customer answer mean work leave package porch camera always recording please attempt delivery pm customer work time mondayfroday oh guess delivery customer service people also left basic instruction customer life small building big one please call phone number customer answer mean work leave package porch please deliver pm mondayfriday dont understand anyone could possibly simplify cant people read never used problem used always deliver sometimes would even front apartment door educate god damn driver amazon make requirement least intermediate readingcomprehension level year old nephew better following instruction people,0.022022497314474695,0.9779775026855253,0.21929332585530006,0.2,0.8328474165138227,83.28474165138226,High Trust
