Harold Clark,/users/63ebf85c27b2c40016aa5a18,US,1.0,2023-02-14 23:09:18+00:00,1.0,I ordered a transmission control module…,"I ordered a transmission control module for a 2011GMC 3500hd on December 19, 2022. This is now February 14, 2023. Have not received this item yet and according to the manufacturer’s own site “this item is on back order and we don’t know if or when it will be available.” This part is on back order from GMC, has been for over 9 months and is unavailable in the United States, Canada, and Mexico. I have tried 5 times to cancel this order, Amazon will not stating “this order is in the shipping stage and cannot be cancelled.” They have extended the shipping date 3 times and then place a hold on my debit card for the amount ($315) tying up my money until it finally drops off two weeks later. I am on a fixed income and have had to transfer $ from savings and had money transferred from my credit card to cover bills while my funds were tied up. Trying to reason with customer service is a waste of time, all they do is read off of a script, if they can be understood. Solution-“when the part arrives, refuse it and we will process a refund in 4-6 weeks “ I asked for a supervisor and was informed that non are available. No further options available and no one will read this and that might have a lick of common sense, that might be able to see that “ this part is unavailable”. I have since traded this truck in on a new one so I have no need for this part. They might think that was a legitimate reason for canceling the order but not so. I have no idea what to do next.",2022-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,14.0,1475,288,40,6,57.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered transmission control module gmc hd december february received item yet according manufacturer’s site “this item back order don’t know available” part back order gmc month unavailable united state canada mexico tried time cancel order amazon stating “this order shipping stage cannot cancelled” extended shipping date time place hold debit card amount tying money finally drop two week later fixed income transfer saving money transferred credit card cover bill fund tied trying reason customer service waste time read script understood solution“when part arrives refuse process refund week “ asked supervisor informed non available option available one read might lick common sense might able see “ part unavailable” since traded truck new one need part might think legitimate reason canceling order idea next,0.003918757145401252,0.9960812428545988,0.16152551878855861,0.2,0.830345725185011,83.03457251850111,High Trust
