Louis Frusciante,/users/61fc0ff0e2c7c200126856a9,GB,2.0,2023-02-28 18:12:08+00:00,1.0,When contacting amazon or having…,"When contacting amazon or having problems connecting a firestic that is governed by them so they can track your every move. They still manage to be.. can't say, but they have put the phone down on me many times. This is not acceptable but they get away with it...",2023-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,28.0,263,49,33,5,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,contacting amazon problem connecting firestic governed track every move still manage cant say put phone many time acceptable get away,0.02185710807665217,0.9781428919233478,0.027481772293886708,0.2,0.7945678004204513,79.45678004204512,High Trust
Angela Barajas,/users/63476563d118c800125c8a79,US,9.0,2023-02-13 19:51:35+00:00,1.0,Exceedingly Poor Service,"Shopping on Amazon is among the worst online shopping experiences I have ever had. I've admittedly used this service for years in buying generic goods that are difficult to find in-person. It seems to me that, particularly lately, Amazon is flooded with very poor-quality knock-off products, and there is very little oversight as to whether the consumer receives a quality version of the product or a very poor reproduction. I've received books that are only a scanned image of the cover, used kitchen wares, completely different products than ordered, and other bizarre issues. I do appreciate that the return policy is generous; however, Amazon frequently replaces the product with the same erroneous product. To further this experience, when I try to pursue some sort of real solution, I am faced with an automated labyrinth of chat bots and short, unhelpful articles meant to pacify any complaints rather than fix them. I no longer trust Amazon to deliver the products I purchase. I will scour the internet trying to find items to buy from anywhere but Amazon.",2023-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,13.0,1064,176,24,3,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,shopping amazon among worst online shopping experience ever ive admittedly used service year buying generic good difficult find inperson seems particularly lately amazon flooded poorquality knockoff product little oversight whether consumer receives quality version product poor reproduction ive received book scanned image cover used kitchen ware completely different product ordered bizarre issue appreciate return policy generous however amazon frequently replaces product erroneous product experience try pursue sort real solution faced automated labyrinth chat bot short unhelpful article meant pacify complaint rather fix longer trust amazon deliver product purchase scour internet trying find item buy anywhere amazon,0.008114809170978432,0.9918851908290216,0.09871003925967471,0.2,0.8156846032664457,81.56846032664457,High Trust
