June downum,/users/63e6c33c98650000122b87d9,US,2.0,2023-02-11 00:21:19+00:00,1.0,Do not shop for Christmas item from amazon,"I received a Christmas present from a family member. She had bought it in October and when I got it December 25 I could not return it because the return policy was 30 days. I called five times and they always said that the seller would contact me. The seller never contacted me and Amazon customer service did not correct the return policy because of being a Christmas item. Be aware, do not buy early Christmas gifts.  Order 15 days before Christmas and pray it gets here.",2022-12-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,11.0,473,87,42,8,47.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,received christmas present family member bought october got december could return return policy day called five time always said seller would contact seller never contacted amazon customer service correct return policy christmas item aware buy early christmas gift order day christmas pray get,0.003827973108743006,0.996172026891257,0.04879416713404375,0.2,0.8078448468724372,80.78448468724372,High Trust
