Gma Girl,/users/62ad4dcc3204320015439179,US,7.0,2023-02-09 23:59:50+00:00,1.0,My daughter has a Amazon account and…,"My daughter has a Amazon account and she’s living in Bothell, Washington. I live in Chisholm, Mn. She ordered gifts for my granddaughter from me and I had her use my debit card to purchase them. Amazon charged my account a membership fee! I am unable to use that membership, because I don’t have an account! WOW. I have called several times trying to get a refund and they keep telling me I have an account, but I had canceled my membership last summer because they kept double charging my account. After I canceled, they continued charging the membership fees. I finally had to have my bank block them completely. They have totally gone down the tubes! Also, when I canceled I forgot I had a 20 dollar credit in the account. I called last night to try to have them credit it back to my bank and the customer service said they could credit my card and asked if they should proceed. I wasn’t even allowed time to respond when I got a message they had gone ahead!! The card on file wasn’t accurate anymore. He then passed me off to another rep and that one passed me off to another rep! The final rep was a phone call and I kept getting a fax number sort of sound every couple of words. Now when I think about it, I feel like it may have been some sort of scam call? I really used to love Amazon, now I absolutely despise that place. What a shame.",2023-02-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,9.0,1345,257,37,7,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,daughter amazon account she’s living bothell washington live chisholm mn ordered gift granddaughter use debit card purchase amazon charged account membership fee unable use membership don’t account wow called several time trying get refund keep telling account canceled membership last summer kept double charging account canceled continued charging membership fee finally bank block completely totally gone tube also canceled forgot dollar credit account called last night try credit back bank customer service said could credit card asked proceed wasn’t even allowed time respond got message gone ahead card file wasn’t accurate anymore passed another rep one passed another rep final rep phone call kept getting fax number sort sound every couple word think feel like may sort scam call really used love amazon absolutely despise place shame,0.9951282370097086,0.004871762990291351,0.1441390914189568,0.2,0.33126369977893705,33.1263699778937,Low Trust
