Maxime,/users/62879d5d5f2ee70012ce4743,CA,5.0,2023-02-03 23:13:12+00:00,1.0,"Amazon, and All Its Stands for, Lacks Integrity","I'm surprised reviews for Amazon are this low. But I now understand why after my latest experience today, and I have been a frequent customer. Amazon reps and supervisors lie about Amazon not proactively giving discounts, and about a few dollars, and this is all captured in the recorded chats/calls. Additionally, the company rarely has promo codes. What stinginess for a billion - or trillion - dollar company! All the supervisors disconnect the call, instead of addressing issues, and instead of having integrity and being honorable. These supervisors seemed to be mostly of Asian origin. Maybe they were offshore Customer Service.",2023-02-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,3.0,634,101,47,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,im surprised review amazon low understand latest experience today frequent customer amazon rep supervisor lie amazon proactively giving discount dollar captured recorded chatscalls additionally company rarely promo code stinginess billion trillion dollar company supervisor disconnect call instead addressing issue instead integrity honorable supervisor seemed mostly asian origin maybe offshore customer service,0.14910477167753416,0.8508952283224658,0.056646102075154234,0.2,0.7367768345762638,73.67768345762637,Medium Trust
