Colin Fone,/users/63c1e3b802d9a70013253b6f,GB,7.0,2023-02-03 22:19:13+00:00,1.0,"Amazon are a bunch of amateurs with no customer experiance, should avoid this company at all cost.","I ordered over £800 worth of items from amazon 30 + items on 18th January 2023 next day delivery, 4 items failed to turn up. Stayed in all day as did 4 of my house mates, no knock at door, had email confirmation to say items handed to resident !! Which was total lies by the driver.!!Amazon calling card stuck in between the 2 letter box flaps found the next morning. On the card there was no reference, no name, no item or order number, no driver details, no date,no time.. all it said was 'bin'. I went out side looked around bins and in bins and found no parcels !! Called Amazon customer services 30 + times now and 15 + emails for a refund of the items i paid for and not recieved, was told to report to my local police and get a crime reference number which i did, police were very helpful. Amazon say they tried calling the police but are put on hold and cannot contact police to verify the crime of supposedly stolen items( or failed delivery ) Amazon have told me to call the police to verify the crime reference, but the police won't reveal it to me over the phone as data protection and i am the victim, so god knows how amazon think how they will get my data !! So basically going round in circles day after day calling and emailing them like am at a circus talking to clowns at customer service. I called them this morning and chatted twice to customer service and they must have a note on my file to hang up as all 3 times i was cut off lol i wasn't rude in any way either!! I replied to some emails from last week which are just generic emails to explain again whats just happened and no response whats so ever... ( to be expected i guess ).Amazon biggest retailer in the world how professional of them!! I've twice sent emails to mangement and complaints processing which are advertised on amazon websites only to find my emails bounce back to me as emails don't exist lol its the same great help you get on the drop down menus on your account!!! Waste of time !!! So now am looking at financial ombudsman to complain to and then small claims court. When this is eventually resolved from these day light legal robbers i will close my account and use 'very company' and my old faithful 'Ebay' I'd advise everyone to boycott this uncaring , unprofessional company, bad customer service who use lying delivery drivers and on top of all that it would be nice when you call customer service and spoken to that they would be able to understand you and you could understand them !!!! Does anyone else have that problem of poor communication ? stick to honest reliable company's that you know. I rest my case. Good luck all and good to read all of your reviews, wish I'd read them before signing up to Amazon the clown outfit from rip off England.!!",2023-02-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,3.0,2757,520,98,17,0.0,0,24,2,1,Suspicious,ordered £ worth item amazon item th january next day delivery item failed turn stayed day house mate knock door email confirmation say item handed resident total lie driveramazon calling card stuck letter box flap found next morning card reference name item order number driver detail dateno time said bin went side looked around bin bin found parcel called amazon customer service time email refund item paid recieved told report local police get crime reference number police helpful amazon say tried calling police put hold cannot contact police verify crime supposedly stolen item failed delivery amazon told call police verify crime reference police wont reveal phone data protection victim god know amazon think get data basically going round circle day day calling emailing like circus talking clown customer service called morning chatted twice customer service must note file hang time cut lol wasnt rude way either replied email last week generic email explain whats happened response whats ever expected guess amazon biggest retailer world professional ive twice sent email mangement complaint processing advertised amazon website find email bounce back email dont exist lol great help get drop menu account waste time looking financial ombudsman complain small claim court eventually resolved day light legal robber close account use company old faithful ebay id advise everyone boycott uncaring unprofessional company bad customer service use lying delivery driver top would nice call customer service spoken would able understand could understand anyone else problem poor communication stick honest reliable company know rest case good luck good read review wish id read signing amazon clown outfit rip england,0.9999999999999747,2.531308496145357e-14,0.2916432978126753,0.2,0.3583286595625477,35.83286595625477,Low Trust
