Sharon,/users/589dce2a0000ff000a76074b,GB,10.0,2023-02-03 11:11:30+00:00,1.0,Rubbish customer service- avoid!,"A monitor and hand console requiring a pin no due to be delivered to the house.The pin no given but only the was delivered,Amazon refuse to accept that the monitor was not delivered despite clear evidence from the ring doorbell, the person who took delivery and the marked weight on the box that it should have weighed 2.7 kg- the parcel delivered was much smaller.They refuse to accept there must have been a mistake their end and after considerable back and forth in webchst and their customer service adviser hanging up, the supervisor was requestedHe insisted we report this to the police for a crime reference no, a police report and then they would investigate with the police and maybe issue a refund.When told the police are unlikely to investigate a £140 monitor not delivered as they had other priorities and when asked for a copy of their policy which justifies this approach, we kept being parroted the same line over snd over and over without any escalation available to the next level.So we have duly filled out a theft report for what is most likely an error with their systems.For anything electrical or requiring a pin no, avoid Amazon and go to your local retailer.",2023-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,3.0,1183,206,32,4,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,monitor hand console requiring pin due delivered housethe pin given deliveredamazon refuse accept monitor delivered despite clear evidence ring doorbell person took delivery marked weight box weighed kg parcel delivered much smallerthey refuse accept must mistake end considerable back forth webchst customer service adviser hanging supervisor requestedhe insisted report police crime reference police report would investigate police maybe issue refundwhen told police unlikely investigate £ monitor delivered priority asked copy policy justifies approach kept parroted line snd without escalation available next levelso duly filled theft report likely error systemsfor anything electrical requiring pin avoid amazon go local retailer,0.03025619494716729,0.9697438050528328,0.1155356141334829,0.2,0.807979025353113,80.7979025353113,High Trust
