Mala Naidoo,/users/513958c30000640001335ec8,GB,22.0,2023-02-02 12:19:55+00:00,1.0,Don’t Buy from this Company,"Returned an item in December as they sent the wrong item, not what I ordered. Received an e-mail to say they received it and would be issuing me with a refund for £14.27. Now 6 weeks later they said they were taking back the refund which they did before advising me that they were taking it. I explained that I returned the item that was sent to me but they would not listen. Basically they stole my money and will not return the item which they initially sent which was wrong. I don’t know what else to do.",2023-01-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,2.0,507,98,27,5,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,returned item december sent wrong item ordered received email say received would issuing refund £ week later said taking back refund advising taking explained returned item sent would listen basically stole money return item initially sent wrong don’t know else,0.02585639277383803,0.974143607226162,0.054963544587773416,0.2,0.7980645125306357,79.80645125306357,High Trust
Mary Grace Parde,/users/607d46ee5a88d20019cebe99,US,3.0,2023-02-02 06:01:41+00:00,1.0,My Android Phone Broke,"My android phone broke, had to get new phone with new number. Got locked out of my Amazon account. Their customer service was terrible! They wouldn't help me regain access and I was a huge user of their products with numerous subscriptions. They treated me like a criminal, wouldn't help me regain access and said I failed their security tests when they asked me questions about my last orders and I couldn't remember exact details, but had already confirmed charged amounts, account information, credit card numbers, etc. It was the most ridiculous experience!! I could hear them taking pleasure in telling me, ""Sorry, you failed to answer the questions to our satisfaction...."" I wanted to reach through my phone to ring their necks! I already spoke to one, gathered needed info, called back and they threw another ridiculous question at me!! Closing account and credit card. They suck!! 😞",2023-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,2.0,891,149,22,4,1.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,android phone broke get new phone new number got locked amazon account customer service terrible wouldnt help regain access huge user product numerous subscription treated like criminal wouldnt help regain access said failed security test asked question last order couldnt remember exact detail already confirmed charged amount account information credit card number etc ridiculous experience could hear taking pleasure telling sorry failed answer question satisfaction wanted reach phone ring neck already spoke one gathered needed info called back threw another ridiculous question closing account credit card suck 😞,0.9998045152388285,0.00019548476117148272,0.08356702187324734,0.2,0.3168111467552352,31.68111467552352,Low Trust
