Candace Marra,/users/63dada74ea5e620012f780dd,US,2.0,2023-02-01 23:32:46+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime has become a ripoff!,"Amazon Prime has gone downhill. I initially signed up for Amazon Prime several years ago when it was $99 per year because Amazon guaranteed I would have my items within 2 days of placing my order. I could rely on this, and if I ever failed to get my item on time, I could call and complain, and they would give me a month of free Prime. Today, it takes exactly one week to get my Prime items because Amazon waits five days to ship them. I called and complained, and they claim that I cannot have a refund for my Prime membership because I received expedited shipping on my orders. I can order from Walmart.com or anywhere else with paying a $140 premium and get my items in 2-3 days. My son who does not have Amazon Prime gets his items in the same amount of time. I was also a Prime seller on Amazon for a couple of years. Amazon made more money from my product than I did, and in many cases, Amazon took so much that I owed money. I have also read horror stories about how they treat their workers in shipping and receiving. I will be cutting ties with Amazon. I can't stand anything about this company.",2023-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,1.0,1105,213,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime gone downhill initially signed amazon prime several year ago per year amazon guaranteed would item within day placing order could rely ever failed get item time could call complain would give month free prime today take exactly one week get prime item amazon wait five day ship called complained claim cannot refund prime membership received expedited shipping order order walmartcom anywhere else paying premium get item day son amazon prime get item amount time also prime seller amazon couple year amazon made money product many case amazon took much owed money also read horror story treat worker shipping receiving cutting tie amazon cant stand anything company,0.004200825791543064,0.995799174208457,0.11946158160403814,0.2,0.821791903425036,82.1791903425036,High Trust
Ty Bolt,/users/5187dc2700006400013a92c7,GB,33.0,2023-02-01 21:51:32+00:00,1.0,Literally the biggest shambles of lies…,"Literally the biggest shambles of lies and rubbish, waited a full month for a refund, now fighting over a refund for postage even though the item sent was wrong, been promised a refund twice this week and now being told I have to contact the seller who’s ignored me for a full month. Advisors lie and fob you off, none of them have a clue. I’m sure Amazon won’t miss my business and likewise I won’t miss their incompetence, lies and total grief that this shower manage to give out. Good riddence!",2023-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,1.0,497,92,39,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,literally biggest shamble lie rubbish waited full month refund fighting refund postage even though item sent wrong promised refund twice week told contact seller who’s ignored full month advisor lie fob none clue i’m sure amazon won’t miss business likewise won’t miss incompetence lie total grief shower manage give good riddence,0.21150720797826655,0.7884927920217335,0.051598429613011774,0.2,0.704566081933469,70.45660819334691,Medium Trust
