Sherm Benson,/users/63da973d02a3e10011dcb2ab,US,1.0,2023-02-01 18:46:04+00:00,5.0,My favorite retailer!!,"I have had a Prime account with Amazon for years and expect to have one for many years to come.  Even though they are not always the low-price retailer for an item, I still start by searching Amazon whenever I shop and will frequently buy a slightly more expensive item from them instead of buying from a lesser-known source.  Amazon's on-time delivery and excellent return policy can't be beaten.",2023-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,1.0,397,69,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime account amazon year expect one many year come even though always lowprice retailer item still start searching amazon whenever shop frequently buy slightly expensive item instead buying lesserknown source amazon ontime delivery excellent return policy cant beaten,0.047203000944048466,0.9527969990559515,0.038698822209758836,1.0,1.9841382639699274,198.41382639699273,High Trust
