Donna Carlson,/users/5f7b843408f4f69a38ec8ba5,US,3.0,2023-02-01 16:34:59+00:00,1.0,I purchased an Exterior Heavy Duty…,"I purchased an Exterior Heavy Duty greenhouse in September.  It took until the 1st of November to completely get built and setup.  The temperatures were averaging mid 30s at nite and 50 to 60 degrees daytime.  After a few short weeks, I discovered all my plants were dead and we hadn't even reached freezing yet.  I immediately contacted Amazon.  To date we are at 2 plus months of trying to get a refund.  Each time I have had to call and spend hours trying to get resolution.  Their A to Z Team was to contact me each time and never did in anyway. 5 different calls from me at least.  The 2nd last Supervisor I spoke with approx 9 plus days ago told me that a claim had never been filed with their A to Z Team and this was why I never got a response.  She also told me not to deal with their supplier, that a claim would be issued in full within 7 days.  She also proceeded to give me 100 00 gift card for my frustration and trouble.  I never asked for this.  Please understand I lost several 1000 of dollars in plants.  I also spent 350.00 in labor to setup.  Along with  Clear silicone for sealing, heavy duty base tarp and pebbles, metal tables and I even placed an approved Green house clear tarp over the green house purchasing all but pebbles from Amazon.  It still failed.  When I first contacted I was within the 30 days from setup by the way. How can we know somethings no good until it's tried. My 1st call to them requested a full refund on greenhouse, the tarp, tables and labor as I was devastated.   The women told me no problem on recieving any of this...The last call was made yesterday to a supervisor/gentleman in their A to Z department. This man was not only rude and condescending he was threatening as well.  He made me feel like a crook for the monies given to me by Amazon for the horrible way they had handled things to date (gift cards when nothing happened on my claim)He would not acknowledge anything stated and promised to me prior.  I have been an excellent customer of Amazon's forgoing true stores for ease of access.  Never ever again.  The frustrations, lies ect are so not worth it if you have an issue.  This gentlemen stated that no refund would be issued as I only had 30 days to return and I would have to deal with their supplier.  Understand, that these items were purchased in good faith through Amazon.  I do not know their suppliers nor did I sign up to deal with them at this level.  Amazon needs to stand behind anything they promote and obviously this is not the case. So very sad and wrong Amazon.  Never ever again.",2023-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,2.0,1.0,2567,479,35,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased exterior heavy duty greenhouse september took st november completely get built setup temperature averaging mid nite degree daytime short week discovered plant dead hadnt even reached freezing yet immediately contacted amazon date plus month trying get refund time call spend hour trying get resolution z team contact time never anyway different call least nd last supervisor spoke approx plus day ago told claim never filed z team never got response also told deal supplier claim would issued full within day also proceeded give gift card frustration trouble never asked please understand lost several dollar plant also spent labor setup along clear silicone sealing heavy duty base tarp pebble metal table even placed approved green house clear tarp green house purchasing pebble amazon still failed first contacted within day setup way know somethings good tried st call requested full refund greenhouse tarp table labor devastated woman told problem recieving thisthe last call made yesterday supervisorgentleman z department man rude condescending threatening well made feel like crook monies given amazon horrible way handled thing date gift card nothing happened claimhe would acknowledge anything stated promised prior excellent customer amazon forgoing true store ease access never ever frustration lie ect worth issue gentleman stated refund would issued day return would deal supplier understand item purchased good faith amazon know supplier sign deal level amazon need stand behind anything promote obviously case sad wrong amazon never ever,0.005963154058476751,0.9940368459415232,0.2686483454851374,0.2,0.850748092067789,85.0748092067789,High Trust
