D M,/users/63c9a3f1c9a77600134f9584,US,3.0,2023-01-31 21:52:44+00:00,1.0,Rude customer service who shouted and hung up on me,"I am writing to express my dissatisfaction with the recent customer service experience I had with Amazon related to the AirPods Pro I purchased. The product exhibited defective sealing and was still within the return window. Despite this, the customer service representative I spoke with refused to offer any support and kept insisting that the return window had passed. This was clearly not true as I am still able to request a return label. I was hoping for a replacement for the product instead of a refund, which I thought Amazon would prefer.Further, the person I spoke with on the phone continuously talked over me, refusing to offer any explanation and hung up on me before I could seek any clarification. She clearly wanted to argue and sound forceful and controlling rather than supportive.This type of customer service is unacceptable and I demand that Amazon take appropriate action to address this issue. I expect a full refund for the product and a sincere apology for the experience I had to endure.I also expect Amazon to take appropriate corrective action to ensure this type of customer service is not repeated. This could include improved training for customer service representatives, better customer service policies, and better dispute resolution procedures.I look forward to hearing from Amazon about this matter as soon as possible.",2023-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,31.0,1355,220,51,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,writing express dissatisfaction recent customer service experience amazon related airpods pro purchased product exhibited defective sealing still within return window despite customer service representative spoke refused offer support kept insisting return window passed clearly true still able request return label hoping replacement product instead refund thought amazon would preferfurther person spoke phone continuously talked refusing offer explanation hung could seek clarification clearly wanted argue sound forceful controlling rather supportivethis type customer service unacceptable demand amazon take appropriate action address issue expect full refund product sincere apology experience endurei also expect amazon take appropriate corrective action ensure type customer service repeated could include improved training customer service representative better customer service policy better dispute resolution proceduresi look forward hearing amazon matter soon possible,0.006001963530992899,0.9939980364690071,0.12338754907459339,0.2,0.8216765280494222,82.16765280494222,High Trust
