John Hailes,/users/53fdeb2200006400018705fd,GB,2.0,2023-01-31 02:58:43+00:00,1.0,Item wasn't delivered or left outside plus terrible customer service,"My item was delivered to another house and  still don't know where it went, i spent half an hour in the cold trying to find the item in the garden. They often don't deliver right, leave it outside in a paper or cardboard envelope where it gets wet. On the times where u are in and they do knock, they run off leaving it outside, before you can receive the parcel and whether you are in or out it's just left, when u are out they send you an email to say it was handed to resident when it wasn't. The customer service is abysmal! It's impossible to get anyone on the phone and it took me over an hour and a half to get anyone one on the chat bots. Eventually a human in the internet chat offered me a voucher for my terrible experience to which a manager took over and reversed it and said it was tough but they couldn't give me anything. I made a complaint about their customer service and the reply to which I copy below. I since haven't received any refund for the item that wasn't delivered despite as advised requesting. Use this company at your peril. Yes it's slightly cheaper when you don't have any problems but once you take into the delivery costs there's not that much in it. Instead of a corporate entity that doesn't care about its customers Im now going to use independent reliable companies with a good reputation and I  don't mind paying a tiny bit more for.  U can get similar prices for books with forbidden planet where you can get someone on the phone if any problems and you can also shop around with Blackwell's, bookshop org, foyles, hive, Waterstones, wordery, whsmiths and world of books to name a few to try instead....Here's the reply to my complaint quoted from Amazon....HelloI'm Greeshma from Management team.I'm sorry to hear that you had an unsatisfactory experience when you contacted us previously and for any misunderstanding that may have occurred. We appreciate that you took the time to share your concerns about our customer service. I have passed your feedback along to the appropriate people in our company.I'm sorry to hear that you still haven't received your order #202-4980457-7937901, even though the tracking says it's been delivered.I can see that my colleague has issued a replacement for the item to the same address but it has been cancelled.If you'd like to receive a refund instead, please feel free to write us back.After reviewing our previous correspondence with you, please accept my apologies for any misunderstanding caused due to incorrect promise on goodwill gesture.This situation was the result of a human error, and I'm sorry for any inconvenience caused.We hope you'll understand that we can't offer you any concession in relation to this matter.Rest assured that we're striving to correct any inconsistencies in our processes and those of our carriers, and that your feedback is invaluable to us.I hope that you will allow us another opportunity to prove the quality of our service to you in the future.Warmest regards,Greeshma",2023-01-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,31.0,2993,520,68,10,9.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,item delivered another house still dont know went spent half hour cold trying find item garden often dont deliver right leave outside paper cardboard envelope get wet time u knock run leaving outside receive parcel whether left u send email say handed resident wasnt customer service abysmal impossible get anyone phone took hour half get anyone one chat bot eventually human internet chat offered voucher terrible experience manager took reversed said tough couldnt give anything made complaint customer service reply copy since havent received refund item wasnt delivered despite advised requesting use company peril yes slightly cheaper dont problem take delivery cost there much instead corporate entity doesnt care customer im going use independent reliable company good reputation dont mind paying tiny bit u get similar price book forbidden planet get someone phone problem also shop around blackwells bookshop org foyles hive waterstones wordery whsmiths world book name try insteadheres reply complaint quoted amazonhelloim greeshma management teamim sorry hear unsatisfactory experience contacted u previously misunderstanding may occurred appreciate took time share concern customer service passed feedback along appropriate people companyim sorry hear still havent received order even though tracking say deliveredi see colleague issued replacement item address cancelledif youd like receive refund instead please feel free write u backafter reviewing previous correspondence please accept apology misunderstanding caused due incorrect promise goodwill gesturethis situation result human error im sorry inconvenience causedwe hope youll understand cant offer concession relation matterrest assured striving correct inconsistency process carrier feedback invaluable usi hope allow u another opportunity prove quality service futurewarmest regardsgreeshma,0.01168301167637215,0.9883169883236278,0.2916432978126753,0.2,0.8524871537243489,85.24871537243489,High Trust
