RD,/users/638b53aaa1a9be001246d5a7,US,1.0,2023-01-29 17:31:29+00:00,1.0,Absolutely horrible onboarding process as a potential seller!,"Amazon's onboarding process as a potential seller is horrible! For a couple months I have been trying to list items. Amazon has sent me emails numerous times that my account is verified and I am ready to list.However, when I try to list (via adding a product not sold on Amazon) I get this, ""Problem with your Seller AccountYou’re currently unable to add or edit listings because either the credit card on file is invalid or the credit card is in the process of validating, which could take up to 24 hours. Please ensure that you have a valid credit card uploaded in Account Settings.""I have quadruple checked my credit card info matches my legal identity. That everything matches up 100%. Not only that I use this card on a daily basis. I also use it with my Amazon prime account (under the same account) often! But, am considering dropping my prime account based on this experience.I keep getting canned responses that don't help and have requested phone calls more than once and not received one.Absolutely horrible!",2023-01-29 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,29.0,1019,177,61,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,amazon onboarding process potential seller horrible couple month trying list item amazon sent email numerous time account verified ready listhowever try list via adding product sold amazon get problem seller accountyou’re currently unable add edit listing either credit card file invalid credit card process validating could take hour please ensure valid credit card uploaded account settingsi quadruple checked credit card info match legal identity everything match use card daily basis also use amazon prime account account often considering dropping prime account based experiencei keep getting canned response dont help requested phone call received oneabsolutely horrible,0.6702342718347245,0.3297657281652755,0.09927089175546831,0.2,0.4847370424337314,48.47