Yevgeniy,/users/63d29e77f5e52300125b64d8,US,1.0,2023-01-26 17:38:40+00:00,1.0,Amazon was good before,"Amazon was good before, but now it's complete disappointment. For two times in a row Amazon driver either deliver my package to a different address or just leaves package in the hallway. I'm not going to do business with them again!!",2023-01-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,26.0,233,41,22,4,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon good complete disappointment two time row amazon driver either deliver package different address leaf package hallway im going business,0.534472979373784,0.465527020626216,0.022994952327537857,0.2,0.5373625007786156,53.736250077861555,Medium Trust
Jennifer Thiery,/users/63d28f9d8bf16a0013fcc992,US,1.0,2023-01-26 16:35:20+00:00,1.0,I use my EBT card to purchase seeds and…,"I use my EBT card to purchase seeds and other EBT eligible items as listed as such on their website. I have tried to order some tomato seeds and micro greens that are listed on their website as EBT eligible and they aren't working. I called customer service to try and get help, was transferred several times, the first 4 people were very nice and tried to be helpful but the last person I was transferred to was not helpful at all, told me the items are not EBT eligible when it shows up eligible on my end. I asked to speak with whoever was in charge and she first told me they were just going to tell me the same thing she was and then I persisted to speak to whoever was in charge on this shift and she was very hateful, told me they aren't taking phone calls. I said that's fine transfer me to their voicemail and I'll leave them a message. She then hangs up on me. Freaking joke. I don't have time to keep calling back only to get hung up on as I have small children.",2023-01-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,26.0,973,192,40,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,use ebt card purchase seed ebt eligible item listed website tried order tomato seed micro green listed website ebt eligible arent working called customer service try get help transferred several time first people nice tried helpful last person transferred helpful told item ebt eligible show eligible end asked speak whoever charge first told going tell thing persisted speak whoever charge shift hateful told arent taking phone call said thats fine transfer voicemail ill leave message hang freaking joke dont time keep calling back get hung small child,0.01579892368792923,0.9842010763120708,0.1076836791923724,0.2,0.8136372739945098,81.36372739945098,High Trust
sai,/users/63ce7c98adcd18001337e891,IN,1.0,2023-01-26 14:47:16+00:00,4.0,The amazon is a good app to buy the…,"The amazon is a good app to buy the products through on-line. I recently buy a mobile charger (oppo) and I got the delivery after the 5 days. it's quite ok. And the main surprise for me is i got the Samsung charger. i put it on replacement the amazon was taken more then two weeks to change my charger. it is the main problem faced by me, not only me there are many people who are facing with different issues like wrong delivers, address, product etc.",2023-01-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,26.0,452,87,36,9,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon good app buy product online recently buy mobile charger oppo got delivery day quite ok main surprise got samsung charger put replacement amazon taken two week change charger main problem faced many people facing different issue like wrong delivers address product etc,0.012262701650947862,0.9877372983490521,0.04879416713404375,0.8,1.703627482601335,170.3627482601335,High Trust
MS DEBBIE SNELL,/users/56ac7cc50000ff000a014240,GB,7.0,2023-01-26 12:33:09+00:00,1.0,Absolutely terrible customer service,"Absolutely terrible customer service.  I ordered an iPhone before Christmas and when it arrived in the box was a mug and a packet of shavers, I called  customer service 14 times on that day and no one helped me, the same happened the next day, eventually I got through to a helpful customer service person,  he was in the Caribbean omg but he was very helpful and understanding,  however he ordered me a replacement mobile and when it arrived it was tiny, which I didn't realise just how tiny it would be, so I arranged to  return it. Three times I called customer service to arrange collection and 3 times UPs did not collect. So I contacted amazon customer service again and several calls later they arranged for Arrow XL to collect and they did collect on the date arranged by amazon. But it didn't get returned to amazon so I contacted Arrow XL who were very helpful and  looked into the matter straight away and the following day called me to confirm that they had lost the package  OMG  but they had contacted amazon to  tell them of the lost package.  So today I called amazon customer service and what a waste of my time they still won't help me they still won't give me my money back,  I have to wait for 30 days for them to receive the parcel OMG  thee one that I twice this morning explained that Arrow XL had called to say it was lost. AMAZON CUSTOMER SERVICE IS A JOKE",2023-01-26 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,26.0,1381,257,36,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolutely terrible customer service ordered iphone christmas arrived box mug packet shaver called customer service time day one helped happened next day eventually got helpful customer service person caribbean omg helpful understanding however ordered replacement mobile arrived tiny didnt realise tiny would arranged return three time called customer service arrange collection time ups collect contacted amazon customer service several call later arranged arrow xl collect collect date arranged amazon didnt get returned amazon contacted arrow xl helpful looked matter straight away following day called confirm lost package omg contacted amazon tell lost package today called amazon customer service waste time still wont help still wont give money back wait day receive parcel omg thee one twice morning explained arrow xl called say lost amazon customer service joke,0.010058084277546266,0.9899419157224537,0.1441390914189568,0.2,0.8237987761450182,82.37987761450182,High Trust
