Greg,/users/63d1f0cb7d10e200128f71d1,US,1.0,2023-01-26 05:18:37+00:00,2.0,There’s a reason why there are two…,"There’s a reason why there are two extremes of reviews for Amazon. As a long time Amazon customer, spending almost $10,000 a year, I have plenty of experience.Purchases sold by Amazon direct are well supported, very easy to deal with and more than fair refund policies for returns. Five stars any day. The problem is with Amazon resellers. Amazon does not manage their resellers well. And the resellers will do everything they can to hide the fact that they are resellers. Exorbitant restocking fees are never mentioned, even though the product description says it is qualified for returns. Amazon should be mandating that resellers clearly state any limitations on the return of their products so that buyers can make an informed decision. Until that time, my future usage of Amazon is going to be greatly diminished.",2023-01-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,26.0,818,136,35,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,there’s reason two extreme review amazon long time amazon customer spending almost year plenty experiencepurchases sold amazon direct well supported easy deal fair refund policy return five star day problem amazon resellers amazon manage resellers well resellers everything hide fact resellers exorbitant restocking fee never mentioned even though product description say qualified return amazon mandating resellers clearly state limitation return product buyer make informed decision time future usage amazon going greatly diminished,0.0050096893152624155,0.9949903106847375,0.07627593942793046,0.4,1.1127503432279546,111.27503432279546,High Trust
PB,/users/5c2599950214997456d82e3b,CA,18.0,2023-01-26 05:15:37+00:00,1.0,Prime is not worth it,"I recently was prompted to sign up for Prime for 30 days free & then I placed my order which was going to take 3 days to get to me which is unacceptable.I called them the next day and the agent tells me that I will now get it in 2 days.So on the the next day I check the tracker and my parcel is still in transit, so basically I have been lied to by Amazon.I get my parcel from Amazon after 72 hours so I call them to comp the order. The agent says that she can comp half the cost and I tell her that I want it comped for 100% of the cost.So I ask for a supervisor and he won't do anything about it. He tells me that I have been given a $5.00 credit (whoopee) and that is it.I will never sign up for Prime as the delivery times are garbage and it is not worth $10 per month.Amazon has gotten so cheap and if they give you a $5 credit they think that they are doing you a big favour.Boycott Amazon! They are garbage!Amazon has degraded itself to the bottomfeeder category where Walmart already is. Sad to say but Amazon has gone from good to really bad for both customer service and delivery times!",2023-01-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,26.0,1097,221,21,5,4.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,recently prompted sign prime day free placed order going take day get unacceptablei called next day agent tell get daysso next day check tracker parcel still transit basically lied amazoni get parcel amazon hour call comp order agent say comp half cost tell want comped costso ask supervisor wont anything tell given credit whoopee iti never sign prime delivery time garbage worth per monthamazon gotten cheap give credit think big favourboycott amazon garbageamazon degraded bottomfeeder category walmart already sad say amazon gone good really bad customer service delivery time,0.5502112035432563,0.44978879645674374,0.12394840157038699,0.2,0.5496840785424492,54.968407854244916,Medium Trust
Cristina Cain,/users/63585c510b73ab00135ad465,US,2.0,2023-01-26 03:59:18+00:00,1.0,Amazon I haven't received my refund,"I haven't received my refund from Amazon for the thongs I returned that were too long to fit me as they are only designed for women with flat long bottoms which aren't thoughtful of those with fuller plump bottoms like mine. I gave it to the Amazon driver and took pics of his taking it to return I still haven't received my refund. The driver said he had no idea how to scan my package...I was concerned so I took his name (Hercules) he gave me his number so I could scan email that was sent to me before his drop off and pickup. He never alerted his Arrival by ringing the bell as my instructions indicated. I had to track him down 1/2 a block down the street in adverse snowy weather without a jacket.Refund my money asap thank you!I spoke with customer service agent Best regards,Chithra MHello Cristina,We've accepted your return request. Once we receive the item below, we'll issue your refund.Return CodeView instructionsCheck return & refund statusSend by:Mon, Feb 20	Return ship method:PackageLess_UPSDropOff	FINETOO 10 Pack G-String Thongs...Estimated refund: $16.99*We'll issue refund to your Master Card after we receive the item. Once we issue your refund, it takes up to 7 days for your financial institution to make funds available in your account.",2023-01-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,26.0,1263,216,35,6,3.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,havent received refund amazon thong returned long fit designed woman flat long bottom arent thoughtful fuller plump bottom like mine gave amazon driver took pic taking return still havent received refund driver said idea scan packagei concerned took name hercules gave number could scan email sent drop pickup never alerted arrival ringing bell instruction indicated track block street adverse snowy weather without jacketrefund money asap thank youi spoke customer service agent best regardschithra mhello cristinaweve accepted return request receive item well issue refundreturn codeview instructionscheck return refund statussend bymon feb return ship methodpackagelessupsdropoff finetoo pack gstring thongsestimated refund well issue refund master card receive item issue refund take day financial institution make fund available account,0.03658732545043125,0.9634126745495688,0.12114413909141895,0.2,0.8059351650930682,80.59351650930682,High Trust
