SASSY B,/users/638a2d15eabfdd00120dae6c,US,4.0,2023-01-25 22:54:23+00:00,1.0,If I could give zero stars I would,"If I could give zero stars I would. Ordered an item, was told item was delivered. I never received the item even after waiting a few days. Called them to let them know, I was transferred 5 times (without asking) no one spoke clear English. What they took from it is I was looking for a refund, however, my item was ""try before you buy"" why on earth would I be looking for a refund. They reported me as being a risk and I keep getting all of these emails from Amazon telling everything from getting a lockbox to you've called in multiple item missing and we've refunded you for them. Funny because this is my first time. I swear I will NEVER order ANYTHING from Amazon again.",2023-01-25 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,25.0,674,128,34,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,could give zero star would ordered item told item delivered never received item even waiting day called let know transferred time without asking one spoke clear english took looking refund however item try buy earth would looking refund reported risk keep getting email amazon telling everything getting lockbox youve called multiple item missing weve refunded funny first time swear never order anything amazon,0.011523830444250349,0.9884761695557497,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.8085959086701912,80.85959086701912,High Trust
