Mary Baxter,/users/63d08d596b1d570012012d90,US,1.0,2023-01-25 04:01:07+00:00,3.0,Before you hit the purchase button,"You look at an item, states overnight delivery.  You go ahead and purchase it then you see delivery not overnight!!! I noticed Amazon now has delivery options and it defaults to “your delivery day” Personally I don’t care about fewer boxes when I expect to get it the next day.  Beware of this!!  Make sure you check the delivery date before you hit that purchase button.  This practice is deceptive.  Is I want the delivery day for fewer boxes I should make that choice.  There has been a few times it hasn’t defaulted to “my delivery day” and there is an option for digital credits but not that often.  So before you hit that purchase button…….Personally I won’t remember to check every time and that’s deception!!!",2023-01-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,25.0,717,126,34,6,2.0,0,8,1,0,Genuine,look item state overnight delivery go ahead purchase see delivery overnight noticed amazon delivery option default “your delivery day” personally don’t care fewer box expect get next day beware make sure check delivery date hit purchase button practice deceptive want delivery day fewer box make choice time hasn’t defaulted “my delivery day” option digital credit often hit purchase button……personally won’t remember check every time that’s deception,0.9992245232867929,0.0007754767132071017,0.07066741446999439,0.6,0.9145212212506023,91.45212212506023,High Trust
