Ginger Smith,/users/63cfd35488dc52001488c805,US,1.0,2023-01-24 14:47:31+00:00,1.0,Policies are built for entrapment,"Policies are built for entrapment. After fraudulent activity occurred right before Christmas whoever got in my account changed my password. It became a password war of sorts with the scammer. Got TOTALLY locked out of my account. I called customer service multiple times for help & was given the runaround. I once was told I could answer some security questions over the phone but if I got even 1 answer wrong would have to start all over with a different customer service person. These questions were not typical security questions. They asked stuff like when did I join Amazon (have had the account for years so I couldn't answer correctly), they asked for expiration dates & last 4 digits of 2 credit cards I had stored as payment methods, and what was the last thing ordered, etc. Stuff of that nature. Wasted time on that since they don't tell you until the end of the questions whether or not you missed any or not. Nobody could help me get back into my account. The last call I tried to just cancel my account & was told they couldn't do it over the phone & that I could login to my account & do it. They wanted me to log in to an account that they couldn't help me get back into & offered no additional help.Now they're sending emails telling me that my ""last order has been cancelled and I need to login to get my account straight"". I haven't ordered anything & I think have had all the cards that were on there cancelled. Seems to be set up to try to keep me paying for a service I can't even use bc if their inability or desire to actually help. Still stuck. I do not recommend to anybody. Not even my worse enemy. When they ""removed"" the fraudulent transactions from my account, my bank told me it was never reversed on their end & that I needed to call Amazon again. So I ended up having to eat the fraudulent charges. I'm still trying to recover. In the end, I'm confident they'll learn about karma & they will get theirs. I know I can't be the only one they've done like this.",2022-12-23 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,24.0,1991,374,33,5,32.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,policy built entrapment fraudulent activity occurred right christmas whoever got account changed password became password war sort scammer got totally locked account called customer service multiple time help given runaround told could answer security question phone got even answer wrong would start different customer service person question typical security question asked stuff like join amazon account year couldnt answer correctly asked expiration date last digit credit card stored payment method last thing ordered etc stuff nature wasted time since dont tell end question whether missed nobody could help get back account last call tried cancel account told couldnt phone could login account wanted log account couldnt help get back offered additional helpnow theyre sending email telling last order cancelled need login get account straight havent ordered anything think card cancelled seems set try keep paying service cant even use bc inability desire actually help still stuck recommend anybody even worse enemy removed fraudulent transaction account bank told never reversed end needed call amazon ended eat fraudulent charge im still trying recover end im confident theyll learn karma get know cant one theyve done like,0.006658381320652087,0.9933416186793479,0.20975883342680876,0.2,0.8386225760250356,83.86225760250356,High Trust
Matt England,/users/63bc5b5b29f88f0013b9fb9d,GB,2.0,2023-01-24 14:02:24+00:00,1.0,Going to cancel,I am sadly going to cancel being an amazon prime member this year as you have seriously ruined the prime experience. Number 1:deliveries are no longer a day delivery instead it is a week or two just like normal Number 2: Amazon prime video I no longer use as there are now so many other video apps with better content. Number 3: prime music was fantastic but they have destroyed the prime music experience as you can now no longer listen to your favourite playlist music even though asking Alexa who now recommends and plays completely different music. Seriously Amazon you need to return this app to its original way to get your loved customers back even if you need to increase the price from £75 to £85 a year. Number 4: time and time again I’m greeted by what looks to be overworked staff drivers who sometimes just leave your package on the door or are to lazy to even ring the doorbell and will just shove it through the letterbox. Lastly your company has become the Mr Krabs within the delivery world. To get customers to stay with you. You need to learn and listen to your customers on what they loved about you and what they hated. Find ways of getting more money for example you could add a reward system so every 5th purchase on an item could get a customer a free extra benefit this will make customers want to buy more items which in turn will get you more customers. But seriously please return Amazon Music to what it was before this terrible update where I can now no longer listen to my chosen music.,2023-01-24 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,24.0,1517,281,15,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sadly going cancel amazon prime member year seriously ruined prime experience number delivery longer day delivery instead week two like normal number amazon prime video longer use many video apps better content number prime music fantastic destroyed prime music experience longer listen favourite playlist mu