Dee Matis,/users/63cda1ddc0f849001486e66d,US,1.0,2023-01-22 22:52:48+00:00,1.0,AMAZON HAS TURNED ROTTEN,"I ordered food for my family with my food stamps. Last amount I had to keep us ok until the 1`st. I live in an apartment complex where the buildings are all designed the same, same color and same numbers on apartments. Its very important to get the right building. I don't have a vehicle, so I have to rely on delivery services. I put detailed instructions in my Amazon app for delivery and my number to call if a question. I did not receive my order. Went to neighbors, no luck. I contacted amazon and they actually said the weight of packages when it left the building was the same as the weight wen it was delivered so they cannot help me!!!!!! Here is my response.... And Mr. Bezos, I truly hope you get some pleasure out of ripping off single mothers and taking government food stamp food from the mouths of my children. Somehow, I dont see Elon Musk doing this to a family, but hey....enjoy your time in hell in the afterlife.This is absolutely unlike Amazon customer service. I have never had issues with other services like I have had with you and I will not be recommending this to anyone, in fact I will be posting your response on trustpilot and my social media platforms. My buildings in my apartment complex all look the same and each building has a 207. The delivery driver did not even take a pic of the number on apt. Isnt that against your delivery policies? I do not contest the weight was the same, i am stating the darn thing was delivered to another building. I am a single mother on food stamps. That was my last amount I used and we do not get more until the 1st. But yeah, you make sure Bezos gets that 40.00, because he obviously needs it much more than my kids and I do. You all got too big for your good and its time you got cut down to size!!!!",2023-01-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,22.0,1772,338,24,4,0.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,ordered food family food stamp last amount keep u ok st live apartment complex building designed color number apartment important get right building dont vehicle rely delivery service put detailed instruction amazon app delivery number call question receive order went neighbor luck contacted amazon actually said weight package left building weight wen delivered cannot help response mr bezos truly hope get pleasure ripping single mother taking government food stamp food mouth child somehow dont see elon musk family heyenjoy time hell afterlifethis absolutely unlike amazon customer service never issue service like recommending anyone fact posting response trustpilot social medium platform building apartment complex look building delivery driver even take pic number apt isnt delivery policy contest weight stating darn thing delivered another building single mother food stamp last amount used get st yeah make sure bezos get obviously need much kid got big good time got cut size,0.9999834007819638,1.659921803620623e-05,0.18956814357823892,0.2,0.3379219283246659,33.79219283246659,Low Trust
Autumn,/users/63cd9f515901bb00124b9626,US,1.0,2023-01-22 22:41:08+00:00,1.0,Inconvenient Return Locations,"We have recently been assigned a UPS Store, Wholefoods, Amazon Store and several other pay-to-return locations to return any Amazon item. We do not live near any of these locations except the UPS store that is in a congested area with no parking and shirt business hours. We were once permitted to return to Kohl’s—super convenient as I work in the area and much easier to access and drive to than any other option. I have requested twice for Amazon to permit returns to Kohl’s as in the previous years but to no avail. I have now limited purchases from Amazon (especially clothing) and am now saving my money and my time. Amazon failed a good customer with this decision.",2023-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,22.0,672,120,29,3,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,recently assigned ups store wholefoods amazon store several paytoreturn location return amazon item live near location except ups store congested area parking shirt business hour permitted return kohl’s—super convenient work area much easier access drive option requested twice amazon permit return kohl’s previous year avail limited purchase amazon especially clothing saving money time amazon failed good customer decision,0.013876932131297284,0.9861230678687027,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.806521993833398,80.65219938333979,High Trust
