JT,/users/5a23fca70000ff000aeb5074,GB,35.0,2023-01-22 20:39:33+00:00,1.0,I have had 2 credit cards declined as…,I have had 2 credit cards declined as “invalid” over the last week. Neither one is anywhere near its credit limit so I double-checked all the required account details AND phoned the banks in question who reassured me that all was well. What Amazon do not seem to be doing - unlike other retailers - is asking you to validate your payment method within the bank’s payment app. I’ve had no option than to cancel my Prime membership and my account could well be following.,2023-01-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,22.0,469,85,38,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,credit card declined “invalid” last week neither one anywhere near credit limit doublechecked required account detail phoned bank question reassured well amazon seem unlike retailer asking validate payment method within bank’s payment app i’ve option cancel prime membership account could well following,0.04658000620694827,0.9534199937930518,0.04767246214245653,0.2,0.7862444893250172,78.62444893250172,High Trust
Russell,/users/57ebb48d0000ff000a48833c,US,9.0,2023-01-22 18:43:03+00:00,1.0,Amazon has gone downhill lately when…,"Amazon has gone downhill lately when promising 2-day delivery, but also even next day 4-7am, or 7-11am delivery and they never can do it.  We pay a substantial amount, and it has gotten much worse over the last year that it is making me question the worth of paying them any longer vs using Walmart.Today I was expecting some medical bandages that we needed for a burn, and nope, now they said we will have it to you this evening.  Thanks for wasting my time and I could have left last night or this morning to get them myself.",2023-01-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,22.0,527,99,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon gone downhill lately promising day delivery also even next day delivery never pay substantial amount gotten much worse last year making question worth paying longer v using walmarttoday expecting medical bandage needed burn nope said evening thanks wasting time could left last night morning get,0.020905114590466786,0.9790948854095333,0.055524397083567024,0.2,0.8006523221214801,80.065232212148,High Trust
Callum Lightbody,/users/5ce2e352a5274ee42023678b,GB,8.0,2023-01-22 17:52:18+00:00,1.0,Amazon finance with Barclays,"Went to order a product through Amazon and as it was a large purchase finance through Barclays was offered. I went through the credit check on the Amazon page and then an error occurred with the Amazon side of the transaction. I received confirmation from Barclays that my application was accepted and they would start charging me. However my Amazon account did not reflect this. I contacted customer service and after going round the houses finally got someone to talk to. They informed me that they couldn’t see an order, they weren’t much interested in my email from Barclays and really couldn’t have been more unhelpful. They advised that as the finance is with me that it’s my issue. Why they are unable to speak with Barclays in the background is beyond me. Needless to say I am incredibly disappointed about this and think Amazon is not what it used to be.Not sure if I will continue to use them in the future.",2023-01-22 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,22.0,917,163,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,went order product amazon large purchase finance barclays offered went credit check amazon page error occurred amazon side transaction received confirmation barclays application accepted would start charging however amazon account reflect contacted customer service going round house finally got someone talk informed couldn’t see order weren’t much interested email barclays really couldn’t unhelpful advised finance it’s issue unable speak barclays background beyond needless say incredibly disappointed think amazon used benot sure continue use future,0.011251618797560195,0.9887483812024398,0.09141895681435783,0.2,0.8126579819640914,81.26579819640915,High Trust
