Pamela,/users/63ccf7d8c0f84900148679f2,US,1.0,2023-01-22 10:46:42+00:00,2.0,Important Update for AMAZON USERS,"Important Update for AMAZON USERS....Report toAmazon Support 1-858 (666)-(0943),Phone number for Accounts and Billings office is open Mon-Fri at Salinas CA.For the most part, amazon customer service is made up of representatives who are inept or incompetent. Why? They do not go in-depth when investigating a case of nonreceipt of merchandise. Case in point.... I ordered many zippo and scripto vu cigarette lighters on Amazon during the Christmas season, and two of those lighters were either lost or stolen by inept and incompetent USPS postal carriers. If a tracking number shows as the item being delivered by the post office, then eBay STOPS the investigation, and reports CASE CLOSED. Amazon has to realize that mail sometimes gets stolen or misrouted to other people's addresses.",2023-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,22.0,786,124,33,5,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,important update amazon usersreport toamazon support phone number account billing office open monfri salina cafor part amazon customer service made representative inept incompetent go indepth investigating case nonreceipt merchandise case point ordered many zippo scripto vu cigarette lighter amazon christmas season two lighter either lost stolen inept incompetent usps postal carrier tracking number show item delivered post office ebay stop investigation report case closed amazon realize mail sometimes get stolen misrouted people address,0.010560505483576415,0.9894394945164235,0.06954570947840717,0.4,1.1086288891538931,110.8628889153893,High Trust
