Wayne B.,/users/61146a3bcb639c0012f99cca,US,4.0,2023-01-21 15:40:36+00:00,1.0,My account was hacked so Amazon shut it…,"My account was hacked so Amazon shut it down and now I do not have access. They cannot find any information on me to reinstate it?????I have been a Prime member for years with hundreds of purchases (250-275 a year) and I have a gift card balance and reward points, Amazon tells me if I open a new account I will lose my Prime, my gift balance and my rewards points. They are working on getting my account back and I would be contacted, well no one has contacted me. What kind of business model is this? Amazon has gone to the dogs and now outsource all calls to other Countries... I'm looking elsewhere...",2023-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,21.0,605,114,40,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,account hacked amazon shut access cannot find information reinstate iti prime member year hundred purchase year gift card balance reward point amazon tell open new account lose prime gift balance reward point working getting account back would contacted well one contacted kind business model amazon gone dog outsource call country im looking elsewhere,0.016635648754287753,0.9833643512457122,0.06393718452047112,0.2,0.8044696125269503,80.44696125269503,High Trust
Floyd “Shane” Crosby,/users/63b4a799880d200012c00df2,US,5.0,2023-01-21 08:38:41+00:00,1.0,Ridiculous,"I've rarely had issues with Amazon prior to this, but I have cancelled my prime membership and closing out my Amazon credit card account and I will NEVER use Amazon again. After realizing I needed a cable to connect to a conference at 10am the next morning, I purchased this item specifically because it had next morning delivery, even adding two other items I did not need to be above the $25 threshold for the 4am-8am delivery. I woke up at 6 because I didn't want the package sitting out front after sunrise only to find the item hadn't shipped yet. After waiting until 9am, only because the order had changed to 'preparing to ship' before I raced to Walmart and purchased the item. Later, the order delivery time changed to between 5pm & 10pm, so I used the Amazon assistant to cancel the order, but received a message saying that it might be too late to cancel. Shortly after I got an email saying it was too late to cancel. I then used the messaging system and after initially being told the same thing by 2 employees, I was put in touch with a supervisor who told me he contacted the warehouse to cancel order. A short time later I saw that the item now showed 'shipped' but still had delivery window of 5p to 10pm. This time I requested a call back, and after wasting approximately 45 minutes trying to explain that because it had not arrived in the promised timeframe, I was forced to purchase it already and since I had only purchased it because of early morning delivery, even adding items I did not need to be eligible, asking for order to be cancelled was not an unreasonable request. The two employees and 'supervisor' I spoke with were not helpful and even rude, telling me the item had shipped (but wouldn't arrive for another 5-9 hours), they could not cancel order. I know for a fact that they can contact drivers because of a previous missed delivery where they contacted driver to complete delivery the same night. But all attempts to cancel this order were denied, telling me I would either have to track the order and be out front when truck arrived to refuse delivery or waste my time to return item. The order was delivered at 7pm, I tried tracking, checking about every 5 minutes, but somehow after seeing 6 deliveries before mine, when I next checked back it showed delivered. I was not asking for anything outrageous, they failed to meet the promised delivery window, which is THE ONLY REASON I MADE PURCHASE, even adding two items for my dog in order to get order above $25, this shouldn't have been an issue. I'm finished with Amazon, if they fail to respect or appreciate their customers, I will take my business elsewhere.",2023-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,21.0,2653,479,10,1,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive rarely issue amazon prior cancelled prime membership closing amazon credit card account never use amazon realizing needed cable connect conference next morning purchased item specifically next morning delivery even adding two item need threshold amam delivery woke didnt want package sitting front sunrise find item hadnt shipped yet waiting order changed preparing ship raced walmart purchased item later order delivery time changed pm pm used amazon assistant cancel order received message saying might late cancel shortly got email saying late cancel used messaging system initially told thing employee put touch supervisor told contacted warehouse cancel order short time later saw item showed shipped still delivery window p pm time requested call back wasting approximately minute trying explain arrived promised timeframe forced purchase already since purchased early morning delivery even adding item need eligible asking order cancelled unreasonable request two employee supervisor spoke helpful even rude telling item shipped wouldnt arrive another hour could cancel order know fact contact driver previous missed delivery contacted driver complete delivery night attempt cancel order denied telling would either track order front truck arrived refuse delivery waste time return item order delivered pm tried tracking checking every minute somehow seeing delivery mine next checked back showed delivered asking anything outrageous failed meet promised delivery window reason made purchase even adding two item dog order get order shouldnt issue im finished amazon fail respect appreciate customer take business elsewhere,0.004839244836224964,0.995160755163775,0.2686483454851374,0.2,0.851310046678915,85.1310046678915,High Trust
