Anastasia Franco,/users/62e43b2a0b24b600121f48ba,US,9.0,2023-01-20 18:45:07+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime failed in delivering my…,"Amazon Prime failed in delivering my package, lied about attempting a delivery, never rung the doorbell, which they had to because they said they needed an one time password (OTP) for the computer deliver. Customer service told me the flex driver would be back twice, they never came, and when I was directed to call logistics. That department claimed they couldn't find me by name, address, tracking number or order number. I still don't have my computer even though I was charged. To top it off I offered to come pick it up, and they said no they have to deliver it. But they won't deliver it!!!",2023-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,20.0,597,107,37,6,1.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,amazon prime failed delivering package lied attempting delivery never rung doorbell said needed one time password otp computer deliver customer service told flex driver would back twice never came directed call logistics department claimed couldnt find name address tracking number order number still dont computer even though charged top offered come pick said deliver wont deliver,0.7149399620124933,0.2850600379875067,0.06001121704991587,0.2,0.4545322624037365,45.45322624037365,Low Trust
