Laura,/users/63ca659290137b0011f20aa5,GB,3.0,2023-01-20 12:03:56+00:00,1.0,"Parcel turned up across the other side of town to a stranger, one week after being ‘delivered to a neighbour’","Ordered two items online from Zara- split into two shipments (both due the same day but by different couriers) totally unnecessary.Zara decided to trust Amazon Shipping to deliver one half of my shipment.First shipment arrived via Royal mail. Later that day I received an email the second shipment had been delivered to a neighbour even though I had not left the house all day. The second shipment was ‘delivered’ by Amazon Shipping. Delivered to a neighbour with no proof of delivery or address to collect from. Today, one week after ‘delivery’ I have been informed by a kind hearted stranger by parcel was delivered to them two days ago, at the other side of the town I live in.I now have to collect my parcel, from the other side of town. Isn’t this the job of a courier?Amazon Shipping are the worst courier, if they don’t leave your parcels out in the rain they falsely inform you of a delivery then a week later deliver it to the completely wrong address. Every time I order from Amazon, my parcel is undeliverable. Zara made a huge mistake trusting Amazon Shipping to fulfil their shipments as now I have no trust in Zara and feel even stronger about my dislike of Amazon Shipping!",2023-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,20.0,1188,211,109,20,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered two item online zara split two shipment due day different courier totally unnecessaryzara decided trust amazon shipping deliver one half shipmentfirst shipment arrived via royal mail later day received email second shipment delivered neighbour even though left house day second shipment ‘delivered’ amazon shipping delivered neighbour proof delivery address collect today one week ‘delivery’ informed kind hearted stranger parcel delivered two day ago side town live ini collect parcel side town isn’t job courieramazon shipping worst courier don’t leave parcel rain falsely inform delivery week later deliver completely wrong address every time order amazon parcel undeliverable zara made huge mistake trusting amazon shipping fulfil shipment trust zara feel even stronger dislike amazon shipping,0.02019063110653476,0.9798093688934653,0.11833987661245092,0.2,0.8135726597692228,81.35726597692228,High Trust
Zouzou Elhage,/users/5a81e2bff675864e56012c3e,US,1.0,2023-01-20 06:08:48+00:00,1.0,Amazon Customer service which I got was horrible and not trustworthy,"Amazon customer service has been going into decline. I ordered a product which I did not receive. I called and reported a missing package, and I requested a refund because it was a gift and I will not receive another package on time as needed. They told me they will refund $175.59 to my Amazon gift card. Days past by and I thought they have already refunded me, just to find out that they said they would, but they did not. I called again the second time and they promised again the refund. Few hours later I still do not see any credit on my Amazon account, even though they told me that the refund will appear within few minutes. I will give them the benefit of the doubt and wait another 24 hours. If I do not see the refund, now I will simply go and dispute the credit card transaction, Their customer service used to be much better and much more professional, now it seems like they are going down into the ditch.",2023-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,20.0,920,175,68,11,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service going decline ordered product receive called reported missing package requested refund gift receive another package time needed told refund amazon gift card day past thought already refunded find said would called second time promised refund hour later still see credit amazon account even though told refund appear within minute give benefit doubt wait another hour see refund simply go dispute credit card transaction customer service used much better much professional seems like going ditch,0.004345897040948567,0.9956541029590514,0.0981491867638811,0.2,0.8174568888323019,81.7456888832302,High Trust
