NB,/users/6092e9b6ef8c68001a6bf006,GB,7.0,2023-01-20 04:36:34+00:00,1.0,You Have Been Warned!,"I'm a watch collector and spotted a particular piece that I wanted from Amazon and stocks were low.I ended up having to buy 5 of the same model, as the first four were faulty (3 missing the same hand (QC issue!) and 1 not working!).I was going to keep the fifth watch, but now have chosen to return it due to an email indirectly accusing me of underhandedness.This accusation levelled by Amazon was due to the fact that I had to send 4 faulty watches back.I have been informed that if this continues then they may close my account and will not refund anymore of the watches.So three watches which had the hands  completely missing (not even within the watch face enclosure) was my fault apparently and the fourth wasn't working... probably due to a dead battery.Next problem is all 5 watches came from Europe, so I had to pay somewhere in the region of £200 for customs charges for all 5 watches over a few weeks and could only retrieve the charge back, as each arrived back at the Amazon warehouse in Germany. However I contacted Amazon about the first watch refunded without the custom charges being repaid. This was quickly sorted and a refund issued. After enquiring about the next watch, I've now been told that the remaining custom charges of approximately £160 wil take up to 180 days for each customs charge to be refunded... WHY?So be careful what and how you buy from Amazon. Before this invalid accusation, I would have rated this site much higher. But now, if I could give 0 stars I would!NB",2023-01-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,20.0,1503,270,21,4,4.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,im watch collector spotted particular piece wanted amazon stock lowi ended buy model first four faulty missing hand qc issue workingi going keep fifth watch chosen return due email indirectly accusing underhandednessthis accusation levelled amazon due fact send faulty watch backi informed continues may close account refund anymore watchesso three watch hand completely missing even within watch face enclosure fault apparently fourth wasnt working probably due dead batterynext problem watch came europe pay somewhere region £ custom charge watch week could retrieve charge back arrived back amazon warehouse germany however contacted amazon first watch refunded without custom charge repaid quickly sorted refund issued enquiring next watch ive told remaining custom charge approximately £ wil take day custom charge refunded whyso careful buy amazon invalid accusation would rated site much higher could give star wouldnb,0.4954321837320755,0.5045678162679246,0.1514301738642737,0.2,0.5825699429068171,58.25699429068171,Medium Trust
