Lisa Synnestvedt,/users/63c981c4ebbc790013b232c9,US,1.0,2023-01-19 19:45:50+00:00,1.0,Amazon not reimbursing for fraudulent charges,"There were seven $100 gift cards purchases on my business account which I did not authorize. Trying to get to a human for reimbursement is virtually impossible. Once I reached someone (offshore) three separate times over a two week period, they told me it had been escalated and would be reimbursed within 2-3 business days. The third time I called, they said there was nothing else they could do because it was in a different department that didn't have a phone number! Only email and snail mail. So it's been 2.5 weeks, three of the same promises and apologies, no resolution and no phonecall as promised within 24 hours of each call. Shame on you Amazon for your poor customer service and while we know $700 is nothing to Bezos, to us middle class people, it's a lot.",2023-01-05 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,19.0,770,138,45,6,14.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,seven gift card purchase business account authorize trying get human reimbursement virtually impossible reached someone offshore three separate time two week period told escalated would reimbursed within business day third time called said nothing else could different department didnt phone number email snail mail week three promise apology resolution phonecall promised within hour call shame amazon poor customer service know nothing bezos u middle class people lot,0.02487864901298246,0.9751213509870176,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.8030402043774123,80.30402043774123,High Trust
Bailee Aletha,/users/63c97551ebbc790013b228d4,US,1.0,2023-01-19 18:52:40+00:00,1.0,Delivery Support Needed,"I live in a rural area. I understand deliveries may take a couple extra days however weeks shouldnt go by without a delivery. Amazon is burning bridges with delivery companies. On recent orders I see UPS SurePost, which means UPS is transferring packages to USPS to deliver. I heard UPS is cutting ties with Amazon at the end of January 2023. My prime benefits of reasonable delivery is gone. I would buy some of this stuff locally if it was available instead of dealing with this. Amazon do better.",2023-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,19.0,499,89,23,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,live rural area understand delivery may take couple extra day however week shouldnt go without delivery amazon burning bridge delivery company recent order see ups surepost mean ups transferring package usps deliver heard ups cutting tie amazon end january prime benefit reasonable delivery gone would buy stuff locally available instead dealing amazon better,0.014676278084499438,0.9853237219155005,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.8026450353828765,80.26450353828764,High Trust
Winston,/users/5c4f2328e18375f1f4653649,US,6.0,2023-01-19 17:24:48+00:00,1.0,HORRIBEL and BAD SERVICE!!Amazon has…,"HORRIBEL and BAD SERVICE!!Amazon has become just AWFUL!! I am constantly receiving broken and destroyed items,Amazons customer service is by far hands down the WORST in all of customer service from any company! The customer service people are snarky,rude and shameless,they act entitled as if I am bothering them, they go out of their way to be difficult.I feel these customer service agents are going unchecked and are being allowed to get away with this behavior.Trying to deal with some sellers directly has also proven difficult as there is zero pride for their business and customers anymore.I am beyond fed up.I used to buy a ton of items per month and practically daily and now I am done,I am tired of the poor quality control and atrocious customer service.I only hope there are other companies out there that I can spend my money with that are honest and would appreciate my business,oh...wait!! THERE ARE!!Also,any time you try and leave an honest negative product review Amazon will not post it,that also goes with the sellers reviews,they allow ot,but cross out the review and adds a comment that Amazon takes responsibility (they do NOT)so then that review does not get counted.The whole system is rigged and people WILL start to catch on and get sick of it.",2023-01-18 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,19.0,1271,215,37,5,1.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,horribel bad serviceamazon become awful constantly receiving broken destroyed itemsamazons customer service far hand worst customer service company customer service people snarkyrude shamelessthey act entitled bothering go way difficulti feel customer service agent going unchecked allowed get away behaviortrying deal seller directly also proven difficult zero pride business customer anymorei beyond fed upi used buy ton item per month practically daily donei tired poor quality control atrocious customer servicei hope company sp