RT,/users/62b3808133529000128258e6,US,20.0,2023-01-18 22:32:52+00:00,5.0,Turnaround,"When Amazon was experiencing rapid growth, the company's management focused on growing market share and managing company growth. This is why Amazon is notorious for selling counterfeit products. But, with the global economy contracting and Amazon's sales with it, the company's management has shifted its focus to prioritize its customers. For example, Amazon has implemented many reforms designed to eliminate counterfeit products from its website. In addition, customer reviews on the Amazon site for food products provide many examples of the company selling outdated and stale products. Amazon is also addressing this issue, with a new focus on delivering food products in an acceptable condition. In fact, I order canned foods by the case from Amazon because they arrive in pristine condition. In stark contrast, their largest competitor refuses to sell canned foods by the case and instead ships severely damaged cans to its customers. I congratulate Amazon on its new customer focus and the improved experience it has produced.",2023-01-16 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,18.0,1034,160,10,1,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon experiencing rapid growth company management focused growing market share managing company growth amazon notorious selling counterfeit product global economy contracting amazon sale company management shifted focus prioritize customer example amazon implemented many reform designed eliminate counterfeit product website addition customer review amazon site food product provide many example company selling outdated stale product amazon also addressing issue new focus delivering food product acceptable condition fact order canned food case amazon arrive pristine condition stark contrast largest competitor refuse sell canned food case instead ship severely damaged can customer congratulate amazon new customer focus improved experience produced,0.06305608105777627,0.9369439189422237,0.08973639932697701,1.0,1.9864192393365074,198.64192393365073,High Trust
Jason,/users/63c83e9d12393a00126a3c29,US,1.0,2023-01-18 20:47:17+00:00,1.0,take them to small court if you had to,"As a law abiding citizen and seller, they accused me of ""engaging in deceptive, fraudulent, or illegal activity"" without any evidence. We confirmed deliveries and addressed claims for seller fulfilled orders but all we get is nothing but bureaucracy, back and forth for almost 6 months. Think twice if you want to sell on Amazon.",2022-09-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,18.0,329,55,38,9,139.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,law abiding citizen seller accused engaging deceptive fraudulent illegal activity without evidence confirmed delivery addressed claim seller fulfilled order get nothing bureaucracy back forth almost month think twice want sell amazon,0.0048718420016936725,0.9951281579983063,0.030846887268648347,0.2,0.8037334564528829,80.37334564528828,High Trust
