GDC,/users/57ef6b340000ff000a496a30,BE,36.0,2023-01-16 19:47:13+00:00,1.0,A true story about Stephane and Menzzo,"A true story about Stephane and Menzzo, a company  supported by Amazon. Ripping of people can have heartbreaking consequencesSummer 2020, after 15 years of marriage, my friend Stephane and his wife are separating. Life stops for Stéphane for a moment, he rents a small apartment in Brussels, except for a chair and a table, there is nothing there, the once so lively creative man was onlya shadow of himself. He misses his two daughters very much during the week. After a hopeless year, of intense sadness, in 2021, Stéphane decides to put his life back on track, he works very hard, as a freelance cameraman, also for our company, and takes care of his 2 children with great pleasure and dedication during the weekend. He saves as much money as possible, lives like a hermit and is convinced to lead a respectable life again in no time. After a few months of saving, Stéphane decides to place an order at a French low budget, online furniture store, to finally furnish his apartment, fully motivated he really wanted to make a new start. Unfortunately something goes wrong with the delivery. (what we don't know and is also irrelevant) The goods go back to the supplier and Stéphane waits months to see his money back. Unfortunately after dozens of apologies, the money is not coming back. He no longer has any savings and at his small apartment in Brussels, the social inspector comes by one day after a complaint from his ex-wife, where according to her the children did not have the necessary accommodation to stay with daddy. After this visit we never heard from our friend again, he used his only furniture, his table and chair to do the most unthinkable and took his own life. Months after his death we found printed advertising in his drawer, from a few furniture companies, also Menzzo, we read some reviews and together with the editors decided to place an order at both companies, we ordered a table at one company, with a value of 700 €, this was returned and within a week we had all our money back. On the same day, we ordered 12 chairs from Menzzo, for a value of € 1250, until the end of last week, we did everything we could to get our money back , hoping that our suspicion would not be correct, but unfortunately we also keep getting to hear another excuse and another and another ....so we realize our money will never be paid back again. Our intention is certainly not to shame a company, we ourselves realize how difficult doing business is and that comments are always relative. That is why we decided to do the test ourselves, despite the many negative reviews already suggesting that the same pattern could be observed here as told by our good friend at the time. It is therefore only a suspicion that our friend ordered from them, yet they use the same method to rob people in this way and we found the printed adds remember. The customers who order furniture from Menzzo and other rogue companies are usually guided (misled) by cheap prices and are therefore happy that they can also afford a new table, chair or sofa, often they have to make a huge financial shortfall for this and use their last pennies to realize a small dream to have a dignified life again. Often it turns out that this trust is only a one-way street, deceit, abuse of trust and the umpteenth blow, which can lead to even the most ultimate act for people like Stéphane. Fortunately, there are still many companies that mean well. We can only hope that with the introduction of our website, good people like Stéphane will be warned about companies such as Menzzo. and their collaborators, because one day on Judgment Day, whatever your faith is, you will be welcomed by someone like Stéphane, or maybe by your own grandmother, grandfather, mother, father.... deeply disappointed in the choices you've made, ripping of other people, by the sad disillusioned look in their eyes, you can see, you did the wrong thing, no matter how hard you are trying to ignore it , carma can never be avoided. Not here, not now, not later.Please make sure that kind people like Stéphane, can't be the victim anymore of lawless CEO's like D.M. and all of his co-workers. Everyone of them is guilty, because they just have other choices. Don't buy from them, they are not worth it, inform Amazon of their practices, Facebook and other social media, the only way you can hurt them, is to hurt them in their wallet, because a heart they don't have.",2023-01-15 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,16.0,4424,786,38,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,true story stephane menzzo company supported amazon ripping people heartbreaking consequencessummer year marriage friend stephane wife separating life stop stéphane moment rent small apartment brussels except chair table nothing lively creative man onlya shadow miss two daughter much week hopeless year intense sadness stéphane decides put life back track work hard freelance cameraman also company take care child great pleasure dedication weekend save much money possible life like hermit convinced lead respectable life time month saving stéphane decides place order french low budget online furniture store finally furnish apartment fully motivated really wanted make new start unfortunately something go wrong delivery dont know also irrelevant good go back supplier stéphane wait month see money back unfortunately dozen apology money coming back longer saving small apartment brussels social inspector come one day complaint exwife according child necessary accommodation stay daddy visit never heard friend used furniture table chair unthinkable took life month death found printed advertising drawer furniture company also menzzo read review together editor decided place order company ordered table one company value € returned within week money back day ordered chair menzzo value € end last week everything could get money back hoping suspicion would correct unfortunately also keep getting hear another excuse another another realize money never paid back intention certainly shame company realize difficult business comment always relative decided test despite many negative review already suggesting pattern could observed told good friend time therefore suspicion friend ordered yet use method rob people way found printed add remember customer order furniture menzzo rogue company usually guided misled cheap price therefore happy also afford new table chair sofa often make huge financial shortfall use last penny realize small dream dignified life often turn trust oneway street deceit abuse trust umpteenth blow lead even ultimate act people like stéphane fortunately still many company mean well hope introduction website good people like stéphane warned company menzzo collaborator one day judgment day whatever faith welcomed someone like stéphane maybe grandmother grandfather mother father deeply disappointed choice youve made ripping people sad disillusioned look eye see wrong thing matter hard trying ignore carma never avoided laterplease make sure kind people like stéphane cant victim anymore lawless ceo like dm coworkers everyone guilty choice dont buy worth inform amazon practice facebook social medium way hurt hurt wallet heart dont,0.009026275480627151,0.9909737245193728,0.44083006169377453,0.2,0.8836528745984413,88.36528745984413,High Trust
