Kateryna Selezska,/users/63a582b3657871001366f6c8,NO,3.0,2023-01-15 11:44:27+00:00,1.0,Order # 114-5600391-9453824 AND Order #…,"Order # 114-5600391-9453824 AND Order # 112-0729319-4742609On the 21 of November I placed an order.Never received it and they issued me a refund, saying that if I still want a product, I should order it again with the fastest delivery possible and they will issue me a refund for the delivery once the product is delivered.Also, price of a product has changed since my original order and I asked if they will refund me a price difference. After receiving positive answer, I placed an order. Second order for the same item from the same seller has been placed on 17th of December and delivered to me 22nd of December.On the 23rd of December I placed a refund request, as agreed with them earlier, for the fast delivery and price difference. However, I received no answer.Contacting them by chat, I have been told that they do not do refunds. Although I submitted all the screenshots proofs of them PROMISING ME REFUND. I wrote to the customer support by email again, explaining all that and submitting proofs again. Never received an answer or promised refund, which is 37,32$.SCAM. DO NOT BELIEVE A SINGLE THING CUSTOMER SUPPORT TELLS OR WRITES TO YOU.",2022-12-31 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,15.0,1152,199,40,6,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,order order november placed ordernever received issued refund saying still want product order fastest delivery possible issue refund delivery product deliveredalso price product changed since original order asked refund price difference receiving positive answer placed order second order item seller placed th december delivered nd decemberon rd december placed refund request agreed earlier fast delivery price difference however received answercontacting chat told refund although submitted screenshots proof promising refund wrote customer support email explaining submitting proof never received answer promised refund scam believe single thing customer support tell writes,0.007949960117544888,0.9920500398824551,0.11160964666292765,0.2,0.8183469492738131,81.8346949273813,High Trust
