LadyLoki,/users/5cdcace0d7bca4e2d7763b48,US,13.0,2023-01-15 06:44:21+00:00,1.0,Amazon has lost ALL customer respect.,"I usually swear by Amazon, they were a company who could do no wrong as far as I was concerned.  But, their standards have fallen so far, I cannot support them anymore.  The final straw was just this last week when I bought a pair of JBL Gumy earbuds.  I bought them “Used: Like New” and was really excited when they arrived.  Then I opened them.  The earbuds were covered in earwax and it was disgusting!!  I didn’t bother doing a damn thing else, I boxed them back up and started the return.  Usually the returns are ridiculously easy, you take a QR code to any UPS Store and just drop off the return, the UPS Store does everything else.  This time, I’ve got to print out the label and box everything up all nicely myself.  Then, what really ticked me off, is they refused to post my review warning everyone else about these diseased earbuds.  I wrote a review (just like what I’m doing here) detailing exactly what happened and posting photos of the nasty earbuds.  I get an email saying they “could not post the review” mainly because it had “seller feedback.”  Since they’re the seller, I feel they’re just trying to cover their own asses by hiding things from unsuspecting buyers.  I’ll say the same thing here that I said in that review: NEVER waste your money buying used on these types of products.  Clearly, Amazon has ZERO return quality control protocols and they will resell any disgusting, worthless product as long as it gets them a few bucks.  From now on, if it doesn’t come new, in a SEALED box, I won’t even look at it.",2023-01-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,15.0,1538,280,37,6,3.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,usually swear amazon company could wrong far concerned standard fallen far cannot support anymore final straw last week bought pair jbl gumy earbuds bought “used like new” really excited arrived opened earbuds covered earwax disgusting didn’t bother damn thing else boxed back started return usually return ridiculously easy take qr code ups store drop return ups store everything else time i’ve got print label box everything nicely really ticked refused post review warning everyone else diseased earbuds wrote review like i’m detailing exactly happened posting photo nasty earbuds get email saying “could post review” mainly “seller feedback” since they’re seller feel they’re trying cover ass hiding thing unsuspecting buyer i’ll say thing said review never waste money buying used type product clearly amazon zero return quality control protocol resell disgusting worthless product long get buck doesn’t come new sealed box won’t even look,0.11380414666265873,0.8861958533373413,0.15703869882220975,0.2,0.7745056664331126,77.45056664331126,High Trust
Fred Carl,/users/62c1bc2f5eb62f001219a595,US,3.0,2023-01-15 01:15:14+00:00,2.0,Amazon's cutting services,"Amazon started to cheat it's loyal customers back in November 2022.  1st, I have an Amazon security  product, The Amazon Cloud Cam that included free cloud storage.  Support was cancelled and we were given a much cheaper Blink Mini with a limited cloud storage plan.  Wasn't happy, but...things happen?THEN a weeks later they altered my Amazon Music, a free included part of my Prime Membership.  The programming change has made it unusable.Be careful with Amazon they broke my trust.",2022-11-03 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,15.0,484,79,25,3,73.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon started cheat loyal customer back november st amazon security product amazon cloud cam included free cloud storage support cancelled given much cheaper blink mini limited cloud storage plan wasnt happy butthings happenthen week later altered amazon music free included part prime membership programming change made unusablebe careful amazon broke trust,0.012446265317423547,0.9875537346825765,0.0443073471676949,0.4,1.1026383367748271,110.26383367748271,High Trust
