Seán GW,/users/5ac7f3374de5666d34382323,GB,46.0,2023-01-14 21:49:55+00:00,2.0,Amazon customer service used to be…,"Amazon customer service used to be amazing, on average I would receive 2 parcels a day over the year. However I’ve noticed in the last 3 to 4 months a decline in the quality of their chat customer service agents as-well as being hit and miss on getting refunds for returns on occasions. I’ve had agents being quite slow at replying and sometimes quite blunt to me. They seem to have lost their politeness and willingness to help. I was recharged today for an order I returned about 5 months ago. The agent gave me two totally different reasons for this recharge and then cut me off the chat…. I’ve never seen their customer service like this and it appears to be a continuous trend. I hope their delivery drivers are not affected as they are very good.",2023-01-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,14.0,752,138,35,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service used amazing average would receive parcel day year however i’ve noticed last month decline quality chat customer service agent aswell hit miss getting refund return occasion i’ve agent quite slow replying sometimes quite blunt seem lost politeness willingness help recharged today order returned month ago agent gave two totally different reason recharge cut chat… i’ve never seen customer service like appears continuous trend hope delivery driver affected good,0.06274653825556312,0.9372534617444369,0.07739764441951767,0.4,1.084106259756122,108.41062597561219,High Trust
