Lisa,/users/63c2d28aff751c001470ce46,US,1.0,2023-01-14 18:41:59+00:00,1.0,What happened to quality customer service?,"I ordered several items on Jan 2, this review in reference to the return I started on Jan 4 to exchange a couple of those items (a lunch bag and purse).  First, let me say AMAZON IS NOT what it used to be.  I tried to contact customer service and the ""request a call"" is NOT readily available.  I have to type call AMAZON in the search field.  I followed their instructions on the app and the computer and ""request a call"" does not pop up like they say it should.  But the real issue is this - upon requesting the return of these two items that came shipped together in the same box, yet evidently AMAZON uses two different return codes.  You can't know this because the code is non-discernable.  I dropped the items off to UPS and only scanned one item.  That is the only item showing up as refunded on my account.  Now we talking UPS not USPS, but evidently AMAZON STILL hasn't received the return so the refund is not processed on the second item and it's still showing ""refund started"".  (Oh and lets not forget the 30 day return policy, but your shipping sucks)Clearly AMAZON has outgrown its capabilities.  This is now the third issue I've had with them in recent months.  So to recap:a) calling customer service is not as easy as it used to beb) a simple note when returning multiple items that they will each receive different codes and each item needs to be scanned at drop off seems easy enoughc) shipping is a joke. Its slow in both directions, so why am I paying to be a PRIME MEMBERd) who doesn't offer exchanges (same item diff color/sz) without the whole return and reorder?  Thats just dumb!That CHAT is a joke!  That is automated as well.There is a such thing as TOO BIG! I've said it before and I will say it again AMAZON is slippin.  They are losing their touch.  They have hands in so many pies, they are losing sight of the little details that will cost them customers in the long run.I have already in the last year slowed my ordering from them.  I foresee ordering becoming all but non existent in the future.",2023-01-14 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,14.0,2032,375,42,6,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,ordered several item jan review reference return started jan exchange couple item lunch bag purse first let say amazon used tried contact customer service request call readily available type call amazon search field followed instruction app computer request call pop like say real issue upon requesting return two item came shipped together box yet evidently amazon us two different return code cant know code nondiscernable dropped item ups scanned one item item showing refunded account talking ups usps evidently amazon still hasnt received return refund processed second item still showing refund started oh let forget day return policy shipping sucksclearly amazon outgrown capability third issue ive recent month recapa calling customer service easy used beb simple note returning multiple item receive different code item need scanned drop seems easy enoughc shipping joke slow direction paying prime memberd doesnt offer exchange item diff colorsz without whole return reorder thats dumbthat chat joke automated wellthere thing big ive said say amazon slippin losing touch hand many pie losing sight little detail cost customer long runi already last year slowed ordering foresee ordering becoming non existent future,0.2368984140239662,0.7631015859760338,0.21031968592260236,0.2,0.7236147301725374,72.36147301725374,Medium Trust
