Hunter Lollar,/users/62f5534fa6cbdd00128a7cbf,US,2.0,2023-01-12 22:53:50+00:00,1.0,Amazon does not hold up their end of…,"Amazon does not hold up their end of the deal. I pay $139 yearly to get Prime 2-day shipping, but now it's normally 4-6 days on ANYTHING ordered from Amazon.   There's a huge Amazon Distribution Center located just 56 miles from my house, but they still can't deliver anything now in less than 4-6 days.  I won't be renewing Prime membership in 2023, when I can order the same items from other retailers for the same price if not cheaper with the same delivery time that Amazon is providing now.  Unfortunately, Amazon has done away with what got them to the top of the food chain...but giants fall too.",2023-01-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,12.0,603,109,37,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon hold end deal pay yearly get prime day shipping normally day anything ordered amazon there huge amazon distribution center located mile house still cant deliver anything less day wont renewing prime membership order item retailer price cheaper delivery time amazon providing unfortunately amazon done away got top food chainbut giant fall,0.009319521904076119,0.9906804780959239,0.061132922041503085,0.2,0.8075668234562625,80.75668234562625,High Trust
