Annie,/users/548a635100006400019ce8c0,GB,9.0,2023-01-12 17:48:54+00:00,1.0,Does the richest man in the world really need my £79?,"Does one of  the richest men in the world really need my £79? I purchased a stereo from Amazon which on their website stated had a 36 month warranty. The manfacturer on their website state that I must contact the retailer i.e. Amazon in relation to any claim under a warranty. And when I contacted Amazon today, although  my claim is still  within the warranty period, their customer service operative told me that I should forget about the one month remaining of the warranty because I have had 35 months of use! That is the type of ""Customer service"" that Amazon provides... Nice company to do business with..",2023-01-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,12.0,611,108,53,11,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,one richest men world really need £ purchased stereo amazon website stated month warranty manfacturer website state must contact retailer ie amazon relation claim warranty contacted amazon today although claim still within warranty period customer service operative told forget one month remaining warranty month use type customer service amazon provides nice company business,0.05211970634447498,0.9478802936555251,0.06057206954570948,0.2,0.7860545607369044,78.60545607369043,High Trust
