Martha,/users/5e219b754c2453072602293b,GB,13.0,2023-01-12 15:24:19+00:00,4.0,Thanks Amazon,"I am writing this review not in reference to any of the supplied goods from Amazon, which I have mostly always been happy with. Some supplied directly by Amazon, some by suppliers. But just as Amazon as a company.Your delivery drivers always come on the day they say they will. I appreciate that alot. I also appreciate the fact that when one of your drivers cannot find my house that they contact me and make sure they do. Sometimes your drivers leave a parcel on my doorstep when I'm not in and there are lots of hiding places here. So it would be better if they hid it and sent a picture like DPD. Sometimes they do move them out of view. But compared to Evri - you are winning. Your drivers deliver and I appreciate that now. In fact I'd say I took delivery drivers delivering for granted. Not anymore.Also- the couple of times I have had big problems, your employees have sorted it.1. Being charged tax on an expensive item that did not advertise there would be tax on the listing coming from abroad (they said all tax was included). You fixed it and the bill was sorted.2. My child spent over £1000 on game tokens when he got hold of my device and your refunded me. It took a while and a couple of attempts to sort out, but you did it.3. I had signed up accidentally to a prime feature without realising. You saw I hadn't used it and refunded me in whole. No problem.I appreciate the fact that when things went wrong that weren't even your fault, that you fixed them for me. Thanks.",2023-01-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,12.0,1488,279,13,2,11.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,writing review reference supplied good amazon mostly always happy supplied directly amazon supplier amazon companyyour delivery driver always come day say appreciate alot also appreciate fact one driver cannot find house contact make sure sometimes driver leave parcel doorstep im lot hiding place would better hid sent picture like dpd sometimes move view compared evri winning driver deliver appreciate fact id say took delivery driver delivering granted anymorealso couple time big problem employee sorted charged tax expensive item advertise would tax listing coming abroad said tax included fixed bill sorted child spent £ game token got hold device refunded took couple attempt sort signed accidentally prime feature without realising saw hadnt used refunded whole problemi appreciate fact thing went wrong werent even fault fixed thanks,0.02572653079469657,0.9742734692053034,0.15647784632641615,0.8,1.718432303867935,171.8432303867935,High Trust
Ms Rita Pendlebury,/users/5249cddb00006400014e815a,GB,44.0,2023-01-12 13:47:46+00:00,5.0,Top company,"All the problems with this company in the media is very confusing. Amazon always delivers on the day stated, usually next day, their drivers are competent and rarely cock up, if they do i have ALWAYS been instantly refunded so i can reorder. I can always speak to a personable and competent advisor and the prices on the site are usually cheaper than anywhere else. The £80 approx yearly charge for Prime is worth its weight in gold as it includes top Films and programmes online, free postage however big the delivery. This is a top company and should be given the credit they deserve, as for them paying more Taxes, why should they, the Gov only give it away to other countrys and they get 80% of everyones income anyway!",2023-01-12 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,12.0,723,131,11,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,problem company medium confusing amazon always delivers day stated usually next day driver competent rarely cock always instantly refunded reorder always speak personable competent advisor price site usually cheaper anywhere else £ approx yearly charge prime worth weight gold includes top film programme online free postage however big delivery top company given credit deserve paying tax gov give away country get everyones income anyway,0.3675200444779888,0.6324799555220112,0.07347167694896242,1.0,1.8309343131507982,183.0934313150798,High Trust
Neo,/users/63bfec5d02d9a7001323e8c2,US,1.0,2023-01-12 13:21:57+00:00,3.0,Important update on Amazon help desk,"Important update on Amazon help desk. Amazon Support 1-858 (666)-(0943),Phone number for Accounts and Billings office is open Mon-Fri at Salinas CA.I have been with Amazon for approximately 4 years. I purchased products as I usually do and all of a sudden my account were on a ""security hold."" This had not happened since I set up the account, which makes sense. Unfortunately for me, customer support would not explain why there was a ""security hold"" on my account when nothing had changed. They just told me I had to wait 8 days to recover my account. Excellent customer support and accountability for what they do with your account.",2023-01-09 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,12.0,635,109,36,6,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,important update amazon help desk amazon support phone number account billing office open monfri salina cai amazon approximately year purchased product usually sudden account security hold happened since set account make sense unfortunately customer support would explain security hold account nothing changed told wait day recover account excellent customer support accountability account,0.02297352972657115,0.9770264702734288,0.061132922041503085,0.6,1.400739819545015,140.0739819545015,High Trust
