Alan,/users/5d9a09f355e248713be98d53,GB,11.0,2023-01-17 09:18:03+00:00,5.0,Ordered a workout bench via the app on…,"Ordered a workout bench via the app on 23 December 2022 and was supposed to be delivered 31/12-4/1, unfortunately the supplier has not delivered although it had been cancelled on the Amazon website. The refund has not been received and trying to contact Amazon is a waste of time so will enter claim through my credit card company. Be careful. Company that was supposed to delivery is MHSTAR, be careful.Further to this review I had a email from MHSTAR who were very regrettable for my treatment from Amazon but pleased to say that MHSTAR have sorted the problem out and refunded my payment. They also offered to send product but I had sourced product locally",2023-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,17.0,659,115,39,8,13.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,ordered workout bench via app december supposed delivered unfortunately supplier delivered although cancelled amazon website refund received trying contact amazon waste time enter claim credit card company careful company supposed delivery mhstar carefulfurther review email mhstar regrettable treatment amazon pleased say mhstar sorted problem refunded payment also offered send product sourced product locally,0.018761252151598337,0.9812387478484017,0.06449803701626472,1.0,2.0035189813274537,200.35189813274536,High Trust
