Michael Lawrence,/users/57d7cf920000ff000a43e872,GB,174.0,2024-08-07 16:47:21+00:00,5.0,Best online direct store,"I love Amazon. Customer support is ace and top notch, packaging and delivery or collection options set this company apart. I just wish more lockers available as sometimes collection is not an option for some products, Amazon has a buyer protection which is amazing and one of the best returns processes sometimes free, I would check as some market place platforms have free collections by Royal Mail from home. I honestly do not know what all the complaints are about because Amazon is the best thing and ebay since sliced bread for me. When you can not source stuff locally or even find better stuff cheaper online with logistics to die for lives me baffled how people are not able to engage with something so simple. Never been ripped off from Amazon, it is basically like a world wide market place, with buyer seller protection and some of the nest logistics option often for free with things like Amazon prime if you shop regularly. Thise reviews must be from people who do not know how to use a computer or a market place. I recall ordering from Amazon some Bruce Lee books when Amazon was the best place or a place to get books if you do not want to troll the internet or shop for locally with the convenience of best delivery options money can buy; I especially love the lockers and collection point options. Please please keep Amazon free of scammers and dodge people because that is what the internet is turning into with the online market place and electronic scammer scum bags out there and a den of bell ends. Literally if you have a product and would like to want to reach more markets or as it were all the markets Amazon is the place to sell as you can get stuff on here you simply could not else where from across the world with dirt cheap delivery always properly packed! I often feel like an inventor when searching for stuff as my mind will think of something I might need that will not probably be in the shops 60% of the time and you will 90% find what weird and wonderful wacky things you need on there whatever it is like everything for bicycles Amazon has it all, apart from maybe fast food delivery platforms haha they will probably end up doing that soon. ",2022-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,8.0,7.0,2182,399,24,4,594.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,love amazon customer support ace top notch packaging delivery collection option set company apart wish locker available sometimes collection option product amazon buyer protection amazing one best return process sometimes free would check market place platform free collection royal mail home honestly know complaint amazon best thing ebay since sliced bread source stuff locally even find better stuff cheaper online logistics die life baffled people able engage something simple never ripped amazon basically like world wide market place buyer seller protection nest logistics option often free thing like amazon prime shop regularly thise review must people know use computer market place recall ordering amazon bruce lee book amazon best place place get book want troll internet shop locally convenience best delivery option money buy especially love locker collection point option please please keep amazon free scammer dodge people internet turning online market place electronic scammer scum bag den bell end literally product would like want reach market market amazon place sell get stuff simply could else across world dirt cheap delivery always properly packed often feel like inventor searching stuff mind think something might need probably shop time find weird wonderful wacky thing need whatever like everything bicycle amazon apart maybe fast food delivery platform haha probably end soon,0.0035836837292263597,0.9964163162707736,0.2237801458216489,1.0,2.0429641872997166,204.29641872997166,High Trust
