James Ogden,/users/5c49de9e4ae5f21e3d72bf62,US,2.0,2023-01-09 09:29:48+00:00,1.0,WISH is Faster!!,"Prime Membership includes faster shipping, holiday season and my location (Hawaii) has been taken into consideration. I have ordered 2 9f the same items from Amazon, one to be shipped to my address and one to be shipped to my folks place in East Texas. My Folks will then mail it to me from East Texas. BTW, They live in a small country town. The package they mail me is sent regular mail or regular UPS, same as what Amazon uses and the package from my folks gets to me first everytime!! In fact in most cases my folks get the item before the item to be sent to my address even ships!! 3 to 5 weeks on average is how long it takes Amazon to get a package to Pahoa Hawaii.",2023-01-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,9.0,672,132,16,3,3.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,prime membership includes faster shipping holiday season location hawaii taken consideration ordered f item amazon one shipped address one shipped folk place east texas folk mail east texas btw live small country town package mail sent regular mail regular ups amazon us package folk get first everytime fact case folk get item item sent address even ship week average long take amazon get package pahoa hawaii,0.9247072172684249,0.07529278273157514,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.3524528972547388,35.245289725473874,Low Trust
