Scott Suber,/users/63b899cebcc52000128bbd6e,US,1.0,2023-01-07 00:00:00+00:00,1.0,Customer service lies.,"They blocked my account because I left to many reviews at one time. I didn't know leaving 5-10 reviews was an issue. They locked out my ability to leave reviews and deleted all the ones I had left over the years. I've called 3 times and every time they say it will be fixed within a few hours. This has been going on for months. Apparently, they lie to you to get you off the phone. That's not to mention raising prices and doing away with 2-day prime shipping. Less service for more money. Typical these days.",2023-01-01 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,7.0,510,97,22,3,6.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,blocked account left many review one time didnt know leaving review issue locked ability leave review deleted one left year ive called time every time say fixed within hour going month apparently lie get phone thats mention raising price away day prime shipping less service money typical day,0.019595028663692737,0.9804049713363072,0.05440269209197981,0.2,0.8010830240865495,80.10830240865495,High Trust
Francis Thompson,/users/5b5f3d9a4de5666d3437fe6c,GB,24.0,2023-01-06 19:15:55+00:00,2.0,Delivered orders not arriving,"For the third order consecutively, the item has been marked as ""parcel handed to resident"".....and yet no-one has been to the house. This clearly indicates that Amazon delivery drivers have some kind of scam going and someone is stealing orders and reselling them. Once, I can accept but 3 times? And I note that I am not the only customer encountering this problem. I contacted customer service and after being cut off once, I was eventually allowed to reorder both items. I had the distinct impression however, that the agent was not that bothered and I am sure that no effort will be made to find out what is going on. After all its not the agents money is it?",2023-01-06 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,1.0,6.0,663,120,29,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,third order consecutively item marked parcel handed residentand yet noone house clearly indicates amazon delivery driver kind scam going someone stealing order reselling accept time note customer encountering problem contacted customer service cut eventually allowed reorder item distinct impression however agent bothered sure effort made find going agent money,0.05229169875650192,0.947708301243498,0.06730229949523275,0.4,1.0873146105207956,108.73146105207955,High Trust
