Magic Mendez,/users/63b03cc92952e70012702ea0,US,1.0,2022-12-31 15:44:58+00:00,1.0,"Amazon USED to have integrity.., but NOW...","Amazon USED to have integrity. They used to listen to their customers about where to leave a package. But, that's no longer true. Now drivers just throw your package anywhere that works for THEM!!! I have been asking them for, at LEAST 2 years, to PLEASE PUT MY PACKAGES AT THE FRONT DOOR. I have called them directly as well as put my request on the Amazon site. Of course that doesn't matter to them, and 8 out of 10 times, my packages are THROWN on the ground in my driveway.., which is NOT my front door. I ALSO requested that they ring my bell, but again, that doesn't matter to them. I realize that it's not necessarily ""Amazon"" mishandling my packages, it's their delivery drivers. However, Amazon is at fault for doing a poor job at vetting their drivers. If they are NOT going to deliver the packages where we request them to be delivered.., i.e the FRONT DOOR, then why give us the option at ALL???!!! This is getting way beyond ridiculous now!!!",2022-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,31.0,956,175,43,7,1.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,amazon used integrity used listen customer leave package thats longer true driver throw package anywhere work asking least year please put package front door called directly well put request amazon site course doesnt matter time package thrown ground driveway front door also requested ring bell doesnt matter realize necessarily amazon mishandling package delivery driver however amazon fault poor job vetting driver going deliver package request delivered ie front door give u option getting way beyond ridiculous,0.9999476226250704,5.237737492957972e-05,0.0981491867638811,0.2,0.319656026040241,31.965602604024102,Low Trust
