Karen Van Walbeek,/users/5b1fdd244de5666d345ecbb0,US,8.0,2022-12-28 20:35:37+00:00,1.0,TERRIBLE Deliver AND Customer Service,"Before Amazon employed their drives and relied on UPS an FedEx I had no issues.  Now that they have drives I'm lucky if I get what I ordered much less when delivery date states.  I've contacted Amazon about this and they just don't care.  Spent OVER 2 hours with 5 different calls and finally a chat just because I wanted WRITTEN DOCUMENTATION.  Then they called and I immediately got the ""hold music"".  BS!  They had so many delivery dates, even Christmas Day which I KNEW wouldn't happen.  Finally THEY sent my items back to the seller but told the seller I SENT THEM BACK.  They won't even own up to their driver not delivering packages.  I have a business and if/when I get the last of my deliveries I'm cancelling it and just using prime and cross my fingers.  They offer a refund, but they didn't fulfil their part of the contract (I order pay you deliver) so it's MY MONEY and OWED to me.  If I lied to my customers and sellers I would be out of business.  Evidently this is the new Amazon business plan.  LIE LIE LIE LIE",2022-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,28.0,1028,191,37,5,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon employed drive relied ups fedex issue drive im lucky get ordered much less delivery date state ive contacted amazon dont care spent hour different call finally chat wanted written documentation called immediately got hold music b many delivery date even christmas day knew wouldnt happen finally sent item back seller told seller sent back wont even driver delivering package business ifwhen get last delivery im cancelling using prime cross finger offer refund didnt fulfil part contract order pay deliver money owed lied customer seller would business evidently new amazon business plan lie lie lie lie,0.04362442047551908,0.9563755795244809,0.1071228266965788,0.2,0.7996123551015563,79.96123551015563,High Trust
