Nw,/users/5d823720f04d2b6cf69cf4e8,GB,9.0,2022-12-25 01:05:30+00:00,1.0,Non existent customer service,"This is a pretty long story but TLDR; returned faulty iMac to Amazon using my own chosen courier after they refused to arrange a collection - now have both my item and funds and are refusing to refund me.A while back I purchased an iMac however as it was faulty, I requested a return. Amazon refused to pick up the package and would only help me out if I used my own courier. I arranged a UPS collection from my house and Amazon then refunded me for my shipping after providing them with my shipping invoice which also included tracking number. The item was returned to Amazon a day after it was collected from my address so after chasing up multiple times (one day I was literally transferred to 7 agents and then eventually a ‘manager’ who was unable to provide me with a resolution as I didn’t have a collection receipt - I was never told I needed to provide this and UPS never handed a collection receipt over to me upon pickup, as the tracking was provided I didn’t understand why this was needed also. After even more back and forth I was told to wait 14 days and that I wouldn’t need to wait any longer… 14 days passed no refund no update but received multiple emails saying my refund was processed and then other emails saying it would be processed etc etc… After even more correspondence I have been told to wait up to 30 days which is almost up as of next week and still no sign of a refund. The situation has made me feel physically Ill as I doubt I will be getting me refund and nobody is willing to help me. I’m out of 1,200 as well as an iMac.Worst experience ever - not sure if these reviews are anonymous but any advice on how I can get my refund or take legal action would be appreciated. Disgusting service.",2022-11-26 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,25.0,1725,327,29,4,29.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,pretty long story tldr returned faulty imac amazon using chosen courier refused arrange collection item fund refusing refund mea back purchased imac however faulty requested return amazon refused pick package would help used courier arranged ups collection house amazon refunded shipping providing shipping invoice also included tracking number item returned amazon day collected address chasing multiple time one day literally transferred agent eventually ‘manager’ unable provide resolution didn’t collection receipt never told needed provide ups never handed collection receipt upon pickup tracking provided didn’t understand needed also even back forth told wait day wouldn’t need wait longer… day passed refund update received multiple email saying refund processed email saying would processed etc etc… even correspondence told wait day almost next week still sign refund situation made feel physically ill doubt getting refund nobody willing help i’m well imacworst experience ever sure review anonymous advice get refund take legal action would appreciated disgusting service,0.007726566830795045,0.9922734331692049,0.18339876612450925,0.2,0.8328164698095043,83.28164698095043,High Trust
