Jena Palmer,/users/60e5dddfb2cb710012c5e9dc,US,4.0,2022-12-23 10:28:26+00:00,1.0,My account was  literally suspended for…,"My account was  literally suspended for no reason on December 22,2022. I contacted the Amazon customer  chat representative about my account being suspended. The Amazon customer chat representative had no idea why my account was suspended and apologized. The Amazon customer chat representative claimed that my account would be unsuspended within 24 hours. Five minutes later my reviews, feedbacks, and Amazon account was deleted. It is suspicious that many people that have high viewers and points on their Amazon account is getting automatically suspended now . Is there a problem and a target against people that have many viewers, points, and reviews on Amazon ? Amazon Corporate Headquarter Office is 440 Terry Ave N, Seattle, Washington 98109.",2022-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,23.0,749,117,40,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,account literally suspended reason december contacted amazon customer chat representative account suspended amazon customer chat representative idea account suspended apologized amazon customer chat representative claimed account would unsuspended within hour five minute later review feedback amazon account deleted suspicious many people high viewer point amazon account getting automatically suspended problem target people many viewer point review amazon amazon corporate headquarter office terry ave n seattle washington,0.03533873161105109,0.964661268388949,0.06561974200785194,0.2,0.7954545825960448,79.54545825960449,High Trust
