A Reviewer,/users/63a4d232f510a20012c15608,US,2.0,2022-12-23 00:11:03+00:00,1.0,Try Before You Buy-ers Beware.,"Try Before You Buy-ers Beware.I tried this service. I ordered 3 pair of shoes that were shipped in separate packages.I immediately went to my account to mark I was returning 2 of the 3 pairs as they were too large. These 2 pairs were returned on the SAME day received.My plan was to “try” the third pair. I was, however, immediately charged for that pair. I did not authorize that charge…the “system” assumes.It was then MY responsibility to take a “code” to UPS so the shoes I had been inadvertently charged for could be returned for a refund.The returned shoes arrived at AMAZON per UPS verification on 12/21 at 10:00 am.My account NEVER indicated the shoes were received; no refund was processed.The “try before you buy” customer service department never assisted me for the refund after being transferred to them at least 3 times and speaking with 3 different agents.I finally pressed and the last agent said, “yes…Amazon received the shoes you returned.”BUT- the refund will take 14 business days. What!!?? She also said in a subsequent email that “if your refund is not received by Jan 6 (2023), to write them.”My trust for Amazon is fading. As a prime member I NEVER questioned their professionalism or ethics. This is a most disturbing interaction for me.They inadvertently charged me before I had a chance to try the shoes. They get the return and REFUSE to issue an immediate refund!",2022-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,23.0,1393,239,30,5,2.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,try buyer bewarei tried service ordered pair shoe shipped separate packagesi immediately went account mark returning pair large pair returned day receivedmy plan “try” third pair however immediately charged pair authorize charge…the “system” assumesit responsibility take “code” ups shoe inadvertently charged could returned refundthe returned shoe arrived amazon per ups verification ammy account never indicated shoe received refund processedthe “try buy” customer service department never assisted refund transferred least time speaking different agentsi finally pressed last agent said “yes…amazon received shoe returned”but refund take business day also said subsequent email “if refund received jan write them”my trust amazon fading prime member never questioned professionalism ethic disturbing interaction methey inadvertently charged chance try shoe get return refuse issue immediate refund,0.5095927808370135,0.49040721916298646,0.1340437464946719,0.2,0.5720123588804276,57.20123588804276,Medium Trust
