Mike,/users/55edcf590000ff0001d9f548,US,4.0,2022-12-22 22:06:40+00:00,4.0,Solid Company with some hiccups now and then,"I have been an Amazon customer for years. Over the years I have had a couple of issues with Amazon including at one point being locked out of my account for suspected fraud. (I was buying a bunch of gift cards for family and friends, and it triggered on their end) However, with a little effort, we were able to get everything straightened out. However, Amazon is overall very consistent and has a very easy return/refund policy. Overall, I do recommend friends and family to use amazon.com.",2022-12-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,22.0,491,87,44,8,14.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon customer year year couple issue amazon including one point locked account suspected fraud buying bunch gift card family friend triggered end however little effort able get everything straightened however amazon overall consistent easy returnrefund policy overall recommend friend family use amazoncom,0.02044115987545243,0.9795588401245475,0.04879416713404375,0.8,1.6995382534890826,169.95382534890825,High Trust
