ROD SANDOVAL,/users/63a49c1278061700142eb1f3,US,1.0,2022-12-22 20:04:22+00:00,2.0,Permanent order history,"I have been an Amazon customer for several years and since I live in a rural area, I value the convenience of ordering online.  However, I am now having to delete my entire account and all my connected accounts (Amazon Music Unlimited) simply to delete my archived order history.  This is a major shortcoming of Amazon services and a double standard compared to the ability to delete browsing history.  This is more than an inconvenience as I will now have to re-create my entire account along with my Prime Video and Amazon Music playlists (hundreds of songs).  This will take considerable time and effort and is a major inconvenience to accomplish what should be a simple option available to account holders.  It also is a deterrent to customers when ordering certain items if they will become a permanent record on their account without the option to delete if desired.  This is a simple software fix and I am very disappointed that Amazon does not make this available to its customers.",2022-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,22.0,989,170,23,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer several year since live rural area value convenience ordering online however delete entire account connected account amazon music unlimited simply delete archived order history major shortcoming amazon service double standard compared ability delete browsing history inconvenience recreate entire account along prime video amazon music playlist hundred song take considerable time effort major inconvenience accomplish simple option available account holder also deterrent customer ordering certain item become permanent record account without option delete desired simple software fix disappointed amazon make available customer,0.01845436562065819,0.9815456343793418,0.09534492428491306,0.4,1.1098418020466536,110.98418020466536,High Trust
