Ineffable Perception,/users/63a470686578710013665f0e,US,1.0,2022-12-22 16:57:52+00:00,1.0,No Item Arrived. Company Lied About Refund Processing.,"I have been an Amazon customer for the better part of two decades, most of that time being a subscriber to their Prime service. Up until now I have always had satisfactory service when and if having to deal with customer care. I ordered an upholstered queen size headboard on December 10th, 2022, which was supposed to arrive by UPS on December 19th. On the 19th I was given notice that an item had arrived at my residence. When I arrived home, there was no such item. I contacted customer care a total of four times that evening and was told numerous things. First, I was told that “carriers will mark an item down as delivered even if the item has not arrived yet.” I found that to be a very misleading statement to make, and one that does not fall under the realm of professional business practice. If an item has not yet arrived, why on earth would it be marked down as delivered? I was then asked to wait 24 hours until the following day, Tuesday December 20th 7pm EST specifically, because sometimes items arrive late. I was told that if it hadn’t arrived by that time, that a refund would be issued to me. On Tuesday December 20th I re-contacted customer care three more times in an attempt to let them know that I STILL had not received my paid for item. I was not given a refund as had been stated to me the previous day, instead I was told simply to “file a police report”. In addition to filing that report, I also filed a report with the Better Business Bureau for the completely shady way that this situation was handled, and the run-around that I was given. It is now Thursday, December 22nd and I am still without the item that I had paid for, as well as out of the money used to purchase the item. I have discontinued my Amazon Prime membership and will not be shopping through this company any longer.",2022-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,22.0,1818,340,54,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer better part two decade time subscriber prime service always satisfactory service deal customer care ordered upholstered queen size headboard december th supposed arrive ups december th th given notice item arrived residence arrived home item contacted customer care total four time evening told numerous thing first told “carriers mark item delivered even item arrived yet” found misleading statement make one fall realm professional business practice item yet arrived earth would marked delivered asked wait hour following day tuesday december th pm est specifically sometimes item arrive late told hadn’t arrived time refund would issued tuesday december th recontacted customer care three time attempt let know still received paid item given refund stated previous day instead told simply “file police report” addition filing report also filed report better business bureau completely shady way situation handled runaround given thursday december nd still without item paid well money used purchase item discontinued amazon prime membership shopping company longer,0.006738262359773945,0.9932617376402261,0.19068984856982613,0.2,0.8347688385340782,83.47688385340783,High Trust
