June B,/users/63a38132eb2f090012586fbb,US,1.0,2022-12-21 23:57:24+00:00,1.0,Amazon is horrible and the delivery…,"Amazon is horrible and the delivery service has deteriorated over the last few years. Gone are the days when Amazon's owner Jeff Bezos cared about customers and went out of his way to improve service and delivery. Now that Amazon has Andrew Jassy as its CEO the delivery service has gotten worse. The company has now been relying on the USPS to delivery package and as a result packages are not being delivered on time or not at all. I have decided to stop shopping at Amazon as it is just too stressful when it comes to the delivery. I ordered an item that was supposed to arrived and the package did not show up until 7 days later. I eventually cancelled the item and returned the package. Please, if you continue to shop with Amazon, you do so at your peril!",2022-11-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,21.0,761,142,36,6,31.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,amazon horrible delivery service deteriorated last year gone day amazon owner jeff bezos cared customer went way improve service delivery amazon andrew jassy ceo delivery service gotten worse company relying usps delivery package result package delivered time decided stop shopping amazon stressful come delivery ordered item supposed arrived package show day later eventually cancelled item returned package please continue shop amazon peril,0.014034360572710397,0.9859656394272897,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.8089110305941832,80.89110305941833,High Trust
