s a lot of money that I have spent on the item,2022-12-18 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,18.0,1783,377,182,38,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon delivery driver came house today posted deliver new pc come van spoke telephone driver seat never even attempted get outside house good minute went see ok say forgot load product van drove without even saying anything minute later came knocking door till deliver lead computer computer code number give given item delivered main item cost £ pound say would come back deliver later forgotten time went amazon website said attempted deliver parcel nobody take funny thing could delivered lead computer time computer nobody take main item computer e first time even attempt look back van driver rude polite couldnt care damn said back go back pick never come back main website say nobody take order delivery made nobody answer door funny give two item second time came minute later couldnt given computer back van time wonder stolen happened expensive item good amazon making think never buying amazon lot money spent item,0.002019061647705833,0.9979809383522942,0.21144139091418956,0.2,0.841278747358985,84.1278747358985,High Trust
