Katie,/users/6296142375d4cc0012576f85,GB,4.0,2022-12-16 09:41:21+00:00,1.0,"Awful service, awful delivery people","Two deliveries I’ve had from Amazon and both times the driver has just left the delivery on the step and walked away, not bothering to check if anyone is in or not. The second delivery was quite heavy, I’m currently pregnant so really struggled to lift it into the house myself. Shocking attitude. I get it’s a busy time of the year but can the drivers actually make sure that there is someone in before leaving a parcel outside the door.",2022-12-15 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,16.0,438,81,36,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,two delivery i’ve amazon time driver left delivery step walked away bothering check anyone second delivery quite heavy i’m currently pregnant really struggled lift house shocking attitude get it’s busy time year driver actually make sure someone leaving parcel outside door,0.014667175368477954,0.985332824631522,0.045429052159282106,0.2,0.8017522227476174,80.17522227476174,High Trust
