Q. R-W,/users/63997e839f66f100151c976f,US,1.0,2022-12-14 09:44:08+00:00,1.0,Amazon Driver mistakes/ Lying CSRs,"An Amazon Driver delivered my package to the wrong house. I was sent an email, with a photo of the delivery attached, and it was clear the house/porch was not mine. This happened on 12/12/2022, and I immediately called Amazon. The 1st Rep told me my package was marked as delivered, by mistake, and delivery is scheduled for 12/13/22 by 7pm. The scheduled delivery time came and went, still no package. I called Amazon again, and another Rep told me my package had been delivered 12/12/22, and I had received proof of delivery. I asked the Rep if she could not see the notes from the previous day, and the information confirming I never received my package. After a long hold, Rep came back and stated ""Your package was delivered 12/12/2022, and You should check with your neighbors to see if they have it."" Before I could respond, I was hung up on. I called Amazon again, spoke with a Supervisor, told the see information again, and got the same response. The Supervisor also told me I could not be given a refund, because the package was delivered successfully on 12/12/22. I told the Supervisor, the same thing happened to me in September, and I was given a full refund via gift card. The Supervisor then told me this was not an option, and I should re-order the items, and have them delivered to a different address or a Hub, then I was hung up on again. Amazon had the nerve to send a survey, after this horrible experience. I've canceled my Amazon Prime Membership, and will never order from them again. The Customer Service is horrible, and I.am being held responsible for their Driver's mistake/lies.",2022-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,14.0,1608,286,34,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon driver delivered package wrong house sent email photo delivery attached clear houseporch mine happened immediately called amazon st rep told package marked delivered mistake delivery scheduled pm scheduled delivery time came went still package called amazon another rep told package delivered received proof delivery asked rep could see note previous day information confirming never received package long hold rep came back stated package delivered check neighbor see could respond hung called amazon spoke supervisor told see information got response supervisor also told could given refund package delivered successfully told supervisor thing happened september given full refund via gift card supervisor told option reorder item delivered different address hub hung amazon nerve send survey horrible experience ive canceled amazon prime membership never order customer service horrible iam held responsible driver mistakelies,0.01373318661480674,0.9862668133851933,0.16040381379697138,0.2,0.8252141694519909,82.52141694519909,High Trust
