Daniel M,/users/5b6d48ad4de5666d34e971ba,GB,31.0,2022-12-10 11:59:28+00:00,1.0,Delivery and customer support shambles…,"We all know Amazon delivered are very hit and miss but when they mess up, Amazon and it’s customer service are a completed joke in helping. The only the thing they have to say is “package is showing as delivered”.Recently had an item I was relying on, received a message to say it was delivered through the letter box which I was instantly concerned about as I’m home and nothing had come through my letterbox. So now the question… where did the Amazon driver leave, throw it, hide it or just couldn’t be bothered to post it??!Item was missing, checked hiding places and neighbours and nothing.Customer service made me wait 3 days to even speak to anyone about it. When I did wait 3 days they said I will need to complete an incident form which is an email with questions about the order which all information is already on my account and they had so it’s further delay and waste of time.No response since, no update and still no replacement or refund for my lost item.Last resort next of issue a chargeback through my bank.",2022-12-02 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,10.0,1024,186,39,5,8.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,know amazon delivered hit miss mess amazon it’s customer service completed joke helping thing say “package showing delivered”recently item relying received message say delivered letter box instantly concerned i’m home nothing come letterbox question… amazon driver leave throw hide couldn’t bothered post ititem missing checked hiding place neighbour nothingcustomer service made wait day even speak anyone wait day said need complete incident form email question order information already account it’s delay waste timeno response since update still replacement refund lost itemlast resort next issue chargeback bank,0.06305297859105226,0.9369470214089477,0.10431856421761077,0.2,0.789337223547996,78.9337223547996,High Trust
Karen Tadros,/users/6065e0cfde27580019c6e072,US,2.0,2022-12-10 07:44:43+00:00,1.0,50% of the items that I purchased from…,50% of the items that I purchased from Amazon do not come on their promised delivery date. I ordered two dresses on the seventh that were to be delivered on the ninth. Neither of them are going to be delivered on the ninth. I even paid extra money for expedited shipping. Amazon then tries to say that they’re just a Marketplace and it was a third party sellers drop to deliver them on time. I’m canceling my prime membership. It’s become a joke.,2022-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,10.0,446,83,39,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,item purchased amazon come promised delivery date ordered two dress seventh delivered ninth neither going delivered ninth even paid extra money expedited shipping amazon try say they’re marketplace third party seller drop deliver time i’m canceling prime membership it’s become joke,0.02751557980574794,0.9724844201942521,0.04655075715086932,0.2,0.7955523615272999,79.55523615272999,High Trust
Nikki,/users/5f3e38dbd023cf260b7796ae,US,3.0,2022-12-10 02:15:28+00:00,2.0,What is Going on at Amazon?,"Amazon gets more ridiculous every time I place an order. I ordered an item on December 7th and the delivery date it gave me was December 12th and that was fine. I go on the app today and looked to see why I hadn’t received an order confirmation email it shows the order was placed and is being prepared, I guess we have to confirm orders ourselves now by looking online. Now the delivery date has changed to December 16th, so they have added 4 days to the delivery date. Out of curiosity I clicked on the item as if I were going to order it and if I order within the next 7 hours and 36 minutes I will have it by December 13th (also that is only 1 day later than the original order delivery date I was given 2 days ago) So I order it 2 days after original order was placed and get it 3 days quicker. I’m tempted to cancel the first order and reorder to have it delivered sooner. My Prime membership is up at the end of this month and I am parting ways with them. I hope by some miracle that enough people will get fed up with with the way they do things lately.",2022-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,10.0,1061,213,27,6,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon get ridiculous every time place order ordered item december th delivery date gave december th fine go app today looked see hadn’t received order confirmation email show order placed prepared guess confirm order looking online delivery date changed december th added day delivery date curiosity clicked item going order order within next hour minute december th also day later original order delivery date given day ago order day original order placed get day quicker i’m tempted cancel first order reorder delivered sooner prime membership end month parting way hope miracle enough people get fed way thing lately,0.009340096047373946,0.990659903952626,0.11946158160403814,0.4,1.1192222682971205,111.92222682971205,High Trust
Brandi Porter,/users/6393cbce13b6fb00124908ae,US,1.0,2022-12-10 01:59:21+00:00,1.0,Courtesy credit is a scam!,"Amazon gave me a courtesy credit of $100 after charging my credit card DAILY, for over 2 weeks on something that was returned. I bought a pair of shoes (that didn't fit) with the credit, returned those. I've called twice in the month since Amazon received them and been told TWICE that the refund was being issued.NOW they want to say a courtesy credit is nonrefundable?!Had I known that:A) I wouldn't have bought the shoesB) if they said nonrefundable before returning, I would have kept them!This place is a not doing good business...",2022-11-06 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,10.0,536,93,26,5,34.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,amazon gave courtesy credit charging credit card daily week something returned bought pair shoe didnt fit credit returned ive called twice month since amazon received told twice refund issuednow want say courtesy credit nonrefundablehad known thata wouldnt bought shoesb said nonrefundable returning would kept themthis place good business,0.19452211080081044,0.8054778891991896,0.05215928210880538,0.2,0.7131708010213559,71.31708010213559,Medium Trust
Wha Ahw,/users/619ab141501166001211453f,US,5.0,2022-12-10 01:25:55+00:00,1.0,Unbelievable,On updating my financial accounts I see a charge for 14.99 USD that I have no record of.    As I check it out  further I see I have the same charge a month earlier to the exact day.    It becomes apparent that I am being charged a monthly fee for Amazon Prime.     I discontinued Prime in July 2022 when my annual fee came up as I could no longer justify the fee which seemd to keep going up on a regular basis.    I had to try  twice to escape Prime.    The first time I was under the impression that Prine was cancelled only to see a few day later that I man still under Prime.   The second time I managedd to make it stick which is a challenge in its own right.    October I am again under Prime and I had not knowingly subscribed.    I contacted support.   Amazon used to have great support but no longer.   It was down to a chat which i personally dislike.   It took 4 different individuals over nearly 1.5 hours to finally get confirmation that Prine was canelled and that the fees taken without my consent would be reversed.    I asked for  an email confirmation of the process as I was not keen on repeating it.   I was assured that an email would be forthcoming.    NO EMAIL CONFIRMATION OF THE CANCELLATION AND REVERSAL OF FEES.  Three days later I checked my account to see that I am still  a proud Amazon Pirme subscriber.   5 days later I check my bank account and there is no reversal of fees.    So it would appear that the support individual lied.   What other conclusion can be drawn.,2022-12-05 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,10.0,1501,278,12,1,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,updating financial account see charge usd record check see charge month earlier exact day becomes apparent charged monthly fee amazon prime discontinued prime july annual fee came could longer justify fee seemd keep going regular basis try twice escape prime first time impression prine cancelled see day later man still prime second time managedd make stick challenge right october prime knowingly subscribed contacted support amazon used great support longer chat personally dislike took different individual nearly hour finally get confirmation prine canelled fee taken without consent would reversed asked email confirmation process keen repeating assured email would forthcoming email confirmation cancellation reversal fee three day later checked account see still proud amazon pirme subscriber day later check bank account reversal fee would appear support individual lied conclusion drawn,0.00685103836553014,0.9931489616344699,0.15591699383062255,0.2,0.8277578795833594,82.77578795833594,High Trust
Julia Drury,/users/592043070000ff000a9a7ccc,GB,20.0,2022-12-09 22:11:44+00:00,1.0,"When it goes wrong, customer service is terrible!","When it works well, it's great but when it goes wrong it can be a disaster.Ordered a parcel yesterday for next day prime delivery. I was the next delivery for 20 minutes and then the parcel was handed to resident only it wasn't. Contacted customer services as I wanted to request a refund as I needed to deliver the item tomorrow. Apparently I have to wait until Tuesday before they can either issue a refund or arrange a replacement. They have absolutely no idea where it is as their system is saying that I have it (even though I don't and have offered to send them CCTV coverage of my front door to prove this). Unbelievable that a company of this size has such an ineffective system for tracking parcels and providing replacements for unhappy customers. Interestingly there is now a 3-4 week lead time should I need a replacement but the customer service representative said that my parcel will arrive. Not holding out much hope and shocked at the appalling level of customer care and lack of understanding.",2022-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,9.0,1011,179,49,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,work well great go wrong disasterordered parcel yesterday next day prime delivery next delivery minute parcel handed resident wasnt contacted customer service wanted request refund needed deliver item tomorrow apparently wait tuesday either issue refund arrange replacement absolutely idea system saying even though dont offered send cctv coverage front door prove unbelievable company size ineffective system tracking parcel providing replacement unhappy customer interestingly week lead time need replacement customer service representative said parcel arrive holding much hope shocked appalling level customer care lack understanding,0.029402318028879965,0.9705976819711201,0.10039259674705553,0.2,0.8053773603349711,80.53773603349711,High Trust
