Osagioduwa,/users/61b8a69734262f00122759a9,GB,4.0,2022-12-08 14:34:01+00:00,1.0,Useless and incompetent customer representatives,"Amazon’s greatest undoing is the crop of customer service representatives they employ, perhaps for cheap labour. Or they don’t train them. This crop of people can only run the company downhill if not completely aground. Albie could not even process simple information. She kept asking me to repeat each information up to three times or more, and I’m not exaggerating. She would then place me on hold after every minute. She was unable to answer any of my questions, not even one. She sounded so distressed. After 51 minutes of wasting my invaluable time by the figurative merry-go-round, she told me that I was in the wrong department and that she could not help me. She said she would immediately send me an email by-which I could contact the right department. At the time of your reading, I’m still expecting the ghost email. Other representatives were also useless all-along, but this exceptional experience was my worst while dealing with an Amazon KDP issue I had struggled with for 3 years!",2022-12-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,12.0,8.0,996,170,48,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon’s greatest undoing crop customer service representative employ perhaps cheap labour don’t train crop people run company downhill completely aground albie could even process simple information kept asking repeat information three time i’m exaggerating would place hold every minute unable answer question even one sounded distressed minute wasting invaluable time figurative merrygoround told wrong department could help said would immediately send email bywhich could contact right department time reading i’m still expecting ghost email representative also useless allalong exceptional experience worst dealing amazon kdp issue struggled year,0.0657723658202522,0.9342276341797477,0.09534492428491306,0.2,0.7861828019468565,78.61828019468565,High Trust
