SCM,/users/60ef48adf597570011f8901d,US,2.0,2022-11-24 20:36:28+00:00,1.0,Not what it used to be,"I used to be team Amazon as I used to order everything I could from them. Over the past year, the deliveries are either late or not delivered at all, with the delivery drivers saying that cannot find my apartment. I don't know how this is as I just got something from them yesterday. This is probably due to them being under tremendous pressure to meet their delivery quota. I tried to post this same review on Amazon to give them feedback, and unsurprisingly, they said that they could not post it. I guess they only let you post positive feedback.Oh well.",2022-11-21 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,24.0,557,102,22,6,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,used team amazon used order everything could past year delivery either late delivered delivery driver saying cannot find apartment dont know got something yesterday probably due tremendous pressure meet delivery quota tried post review amazon give feedback unsurprisingly said could post guess let post positive feedbackoh well,0.006137860291578272,0.9938621397084217,0.05720695457094784,0.2,0.8083724607684005,80.83724607684005,High Trust
