Theo,/users/636131c53d398200130be9ba,GB,3.0,2022-11-16 08:51:53+00:00,1.0,Amazon is insecure...,"I received a notification of order confirmation one day when I had not placed an order. I shortly after received notification of suspicious activity on my account, and that changes and orders had been canceled. I logged in and changed the password and ensured two-step verification was ""still"" enabled. I removed my card details and canceled Amazon Prime. Two-step verification should have made it impossible for someone else to sign in. The ordered items were not on my ""ordered items"" list. The next day I received the items I had not ordered. I notified them that day and they said they would look into it and I would receive a confirmation by email. The value of two items I had not ordered was booked from my bank account. I waited the allotted 48 hours and then contacted them again. I was told to wait another 24 hours. I gave them another 72 hours, then contacted them again. They said to wait another 24 hours. I gave them seven days and the money had not been returned. I joined Amazon when they were just selling books. Not anymore. Cut out the middle man. Order directly from the supplier.",2022-10-18 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,16.0,1101,197,21,3,29.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,received notification order confirmation one day placed order shortly received notification suspicious activity account change order canceled logged changed password ensured twostep verification still enabled removed card detail canceled amazon prime twostep verification made impossible someone else sign ordered item ordered item list next day received item ordered notified day said would look would receive confirmation email value two item ordered booked bank account waited allotted hour contacted told wait another hour gave another hour contacted said wait another hour gave seven day money returned joined amazon selling book anymore cut middle man order directly supplier,0.00609344328445223,0.9939065567155477,0.11048794167134043,0.2,0.819050866692042,81.9050866692042,High Trust
