S E A Cound,/users/5c38b315f396c249dbfc9a7d,GB,18.0,2022-11-14 17:46:18+00:00,1.0,Breaking Consumer Law again...,"Appalling.  Appalling,  AppallingI pre-ordered a book two weeks in advance.  The day of release arrived and Amazon stated they were ""out of stock"".  I waited a couple of days, then rang (well, received a call back at their convenience) and spoke to a person who achieved nothing but was concerned that I would rate her highly on a survey, even though she was next to useless. The result is that I have had to cancel this ""not yet despatched"" book and will have to go elsewhere.  I will not be back Amazon, I can assure you.This book was a birthday present for my niece and they have completely ruined it.",2022-11-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,14.0,604,110,30,4,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,appalling appalling appallingi preordered book two week advance day release arrived amazon stated stock waited couple day rang well received call back convenience spoke person achieved nothing concerned would rate highly survey even though next useless result cancel yet despatched book go elsewhere back amazon assure youthis book birthday present niece completely ruined,0.05955163629811909,0.9404483637018809,0.06169377453729669,0.2,0.7825629367583998,78.25629367583998,High Trust
