Aaron Ellerbrock,/users/5d6f030121dfcb4b8ed6fc9a,US,2.0,2022-11-12 00:30:00+00:00,1.0,Why no Customer Service??,"While Amazon is convenient, they are useless when there is an issue. Somehow, someone got the number for my business debit card and racked up charges on Amazon. The card was not a card in my account nor did they use my account to make purchases, just my card. I of course called the bank and put stop payments on these purchases and they suggested I reach out to Amazon. Well, Amazon sure doesn't want to hear from you!!! They limit you to 200 characters to explain the issue. I tried three time to tell them the problem and they continued to send me an automated email that says ""we looked at your account and have determined there has been no suspicious activity"" and then they would close my case. HEY...AMAZON...I said it three times...it is not on my account. Someone used my card to purchase on their own account!! No matter how hard I tried, I got the same response every time. From their response, it is apparent they did not even read the 200 character messages I sent. Hey Jeff Bezos...we are not all billionaires and can't afford when there is fraud on a card. Do better Amazon. With all the money you have you should have a dedicated department to assist. Truly frustrating, disappointing, and sad that you care so little for the customers that made you what you are.",2022-10-26 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,12.0,1279,233,25,4,17.0,0,5,1,0,Genuine,amazon convenient useless issue somehow someone got number business debit card racked charge amazon card card account use account make purchase card course called bank put stop payment purchase suggested reach amazon well amazon sure doesnt want hear limit character explain issue tried three time tell problem continued send automated email say looked account determined suspicious activity would close case heyamazoni said three timesit account someone used card purchase account matter hard tried got response every time response apparent even read character message sent hey jeff bezoswe billionaire cant afford fraud card better amazon money dedicated department assist truly frustrating disappointing sad care little customer made,0.9309759508774957,0.06902404912250426,0.13067863151991027,0.2,0.36064775086523415,36.06477508652341,Low Trust
Cate,/users/5e36fe34ddcefa67e563e686,GB,18.0,2022-11-11 23:24:37+00:00,1.0,Don’t we deserve a customer service phone number?????,"In the past have used Amazon for everything, multiple times a week. I moved home at the end of September albeit only 15 minutes away! I started noticing that despite having Prime there was no weekend deliveries in my area of literally everything. Basically if I chose something on a Friday I would have to wait until Monday to receive it! I spoke to the delivery driver who said someone works in this area 7 days a week so that shouldn’t be the case. As there is no phone number or email address I had to make do with the robotic online customer service! What an absolute shambles. The first person I was connected to didn’t have a clue! I told him about my problem and he said “well we only deliver on business days” which is complete untrue. The next one I spoke to said yes we deliver 7 days a week but only orders over a certain amount, again absolute cr@p! I well and truly give up!!!",2022-11-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,11.0,889,169,53,8,7.0,0,8,1,0,Genuine,past used amazon everything multiple time week moved home end september albeit minute away started noticing despite prime weekend delivery area literally everything basically chose something friday would wait monday receive spoke delivery driver said someone work area day week shouldn’t case phone number email address make robotic online customer service absolute shamble first person connected didn’t clue told problem said “well deliver business days” complete untrue next one spoke said yes deliver day week order certain amount absolute crp well truly give,0.9994284742456206,0.0005715257543793539,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.31924257723501354,31.924257723501352,Low Trust
