Duc Minh Phung,/users/57fd60920000ff000a4cae89,DK,34.0,2022-11-10 20:41:11+00:00,1.0,I dont know where to begin,"I dont know where to begin. Short version. Talked with them 5 times in regards to a return. Every time they asked me to explain the issue, gave me different information and advised me to do different things. First they promised 3 times that I would get a prepaid return label. Then they advised me to keep the item and full refund would be issued within 7 days. Then they told me to return it anyways. I am not paying 110eur for shipping when I paid 205eur for the item and also had to pay for delivery shipping. It's ridiculous how the support is so incompetent and there are no repercussion.",2022-11-10 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,10.0,593,111,26,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dont know begin short version talked time regard return every time asked explain issue gave different information advised different thing first promised time would get prepaid return label advised keep item full refund would issued within day told return anyways paying eur shipping paid eur item also pay delivery shipping ridiculous support incompetent repercussion,0.015826242968189318,0.9841737570318106,0.062254627033090294,0.2,0.8045378039225234,80.45378039225234,High Trust
