Astrid Hiles,/users/5f1828ad598963ecacd52e79,GB,4.0,2022-11-09 10:48:39+00:00,1.0,Customer service has gone downhill,"I will be cancelling Amazon fresh, prime, audible as Amazon no longer has the great customer service it was always known for. I’m all for convenience, hi tech progressive thinking, but it needs to be backed up with great customer care, people will go back to the old ways of doing things if not.Amazon fresh delivery was cancelled by text despite me waiting in that day, cited access issues, strange as my flatmate had another Amazon parcel delivery at the same time all ok. And we have a temp car park right next to the building. Customer service was automated, even the phone call in person repeated the same thing, you can re-order. No Amazon I will not be re-ordering.",2022-11-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,9.0,672,120,34,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,cancelling amazon fresh prime audible amazon longer great customer service always known i’m convenience hi tech progressive thinking need backed great customer care people go back old way thing notamazon fresh delivery cancelled text despite waiting day cited access issue strange flatmate another amazon parcel delivery time ok temp car park right next building customer service automated even phone call person repeated thing reorder amazon reordering,0.01909950663413686,0.9809004933658632,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.803910706581978,80.3910706581978,High Trust
