Keri,/users/5d2dbfaf48140517ce528b83,US,2.0,2022-11-08 16:44:47+00:00,1.0,Tread carefully,"I have been a prime member for years 2 weeks ago there was a hacking attempt and my account was never retrieved, I have relied on Amazon since being diagnosed with cancer to get the things I need. Today I wake up to a pre charge of 83.51 which was my transportation money to go to chemo. I called I emailed and no help or response. I’ve now had to request a new Bank card for the second time in a week and to retrieve my transportation money I have to file a dispute with my bank for money I needed today. Amazon at one point had exceptional customer service not anymore!! It was so much more convenient to order everything from food to supplies to pay for one membership due to my limited funds but it’s not worth what I’ve gone through the last few weeks and now this today",2022-11-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,8.0,775,151,15,2,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,prime member year week ago hacking attempt account never retrieved relied amazon since diagnosed cancer get thing need today wake pre charge transportation money go chemo called emailed help response i’ve request new bank card second time week retrieve transportation money file dispute bank money needed today amazon one point exceptional customer service anymore much convenient order everything food supply pay one membership due limited fund it’s worth i’ve gone last week today,0.2763702884141185,0.7236297115858815,0.08468872686483454,0.2,0.6787526011659076,67.87526011659077,Medium Trust
