Mark Colbourne,/users/633b25e3a5bcfb00153dc342,CA,3.0,2022-11-04 21:01:12+00:00,1.0,Declining Service and Quality Standards,"At one time, Amazon was an efficient, reliable and customer-focused organization. That being said, over the past 24 months, they have become one of the most unreliable and inefficient logistical/retail services I have ever dealt with. Products take longer to arrive when compared to other retailers who don't charge an annual fee and delivery windows are often missed. Customer service agents are based outside of North American and for the most part, are difficult to deal with and generally require further explanation and reiteration to resolve the most basic issues. We have also noticed a steep decline in Amazon's streaming services including the quality and reliability of the content. Lastly, we have found Amazon's customer experience extremely poor. Streaming subscriptions that provided specific movies, that we have maintained for several years are no longer available and can only be ""purchased or rented"". This is extremely poor practice and given that it appears to be (primarily) the movies we have watched, I am inclined to believe that this is an intentional act to force us to buy these movies despite already paying for the subscription. We will be canceling our Prime membership, along with all subscriptions in November when they raise the price.",2022-11-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,4.0,1268,202,39,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,one time amazon efficient reliable customerfocused organization said past month become one unreliable inefficient logisticalretail service ever dealt product take longer arrive compared retailer dont charge annual fee delivery window often missed customer service agent based outside north american part difficult deal generally require explanation reiteration resolve basic issue also noticed steep decline amazon streaming service including quality reliability content lastly found amazon customer experience extremely poor streaming subscription provided specific movie maintained several year longer available purchased rented extremely poor practice given appears primarily movie watched inclined believe intentional act force u buy movie despite already paying subscription canceling prime membership along subscription november raise price,0.01235032317920256,0.9876496768207974,0.11329220415030847,0.2,0.8164832792404605,81.64832792404604,High Trust
Syd,/users/5f6f7b62f299440a3cfc510e,US,15.0,2022-11-04 20:50:13+00:00,1.0,TERRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE,"TERRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE! I initiated a return for refund. The next day UPS picked the item up and delivered it to Amazon the following day! I go into check the status on Amazons website and it just states that a return was requested. Now 2 weeks later their website has the same status! I’ve contacted customer service 4 times and get nowhere with them! I should be seeing and updated status, per their policy, and received an email, per their policy, by now, stating the refund process has begun, but I have received nothing but lip service and no refund! Now they are forcing me to file a complaint through Visa to get my refund! TERRIBLE way to treat a good customer!",2022-11-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,4.0,672,122,25,3,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,terrible customer service initiated return refund next day ups picked item delivered amazon following day go check status amazon website state return requested week later website status i’ve contacted customer service time get nowhere seeing updated status per policy received email per policy stating refund process begun received nothing lip service refund forcing file complaint visa get refund terrible way treat good customer,0.9991235789828626,0.0008764210171373632,0.06842400448681997,0.2,0.3141230114059327,31.412301140593268,Low Trust
