Dr. Gaurav Gupta,/users/6363783bdabc070012c6f1e3,IN,1.0,2022-11-03 10:14:09+00:00,1.0,Extremely Poor Customer Support in India,"Fellow Indians using Amazon for years may too have realized that its customer support has been rapidly down spiralling in India. Amazon India’s Customer support is becoming more and more agonizing. A company which claims to be Earth’s most customer centric company, now just places the customer in centre and harass and abuse them from all directions ! So much so for being Customer Centric now !From Oct-22 they have disabled replacement/return option as well. You can click on it, go through ususal fill-in of boxes and tick-marks and after submit you shall realize that replacement/return no longer works. Now, its just a corrupt company with no customer support. They just appreciate ur patience & ask u to have some more indefinitely. For last defective product they delivered, 8 picks were scheduled by them via Delhivery, 4 times they promised refund if next pick up fails, talked to 12 of their executives, interacted with 17, twice filed complaint with National Consumer Helpline, and then in Consumer Commission. Amazon India brazenly violate Consumer Protection Act 2019 & Consumer Protection (E-commerce) Rules 2020 now. Note that 2020 rules make it mandatory for e-marketplace operator to provide for return and refunds.",2022-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,11.0,3.0,1233,198,40,6,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,fellow indian using amazon year may realized customer support rapidly spiralling india amazon india’s customer support becoming agonizing company claim earth’s customer centric company place customer centre harass abuse direction much customer centric oct disabled replacementreturn option well click go ususal fillin box tickmarks submit shall realize replacementreturn longer work corrupt company customer support appreciate ur patience ask u indefinitely last defective product delivered pick scheduled via delhivery time promised refund next pick fails talked executive interacted twice filed complaint national consumer helpline consumer commission amazon india brazenly violate consumer protection act consumer protection ecommerce rule note rule make mandatory emarketplace operator provide return refund,0.18488751831261752,0.8151124816873825,0.11104879416713405,0.2,0.7297659996771181,72.9765999677118,Medium Trust
