Graham Bisset,/users/621571c88b487a0013963608,GB,2.0,2022-10-28 01:13:22+00:00,1.0,iPhone Lost in Transit,"Ordered Apple iPhone 13 mini from Amazon (Thursday, Oct 20, 20.14 UK time). Received order confirmation email from Amazon at 20.17, advising that delivery would be arriving Saturday, Oct 22 using Amazon Prime service. Received email on Friday Oct 21 at 17.48 advising item had dispatched, and that on day of delivery, a one-time password would be emailed to me, which would need to be shown to the driver. I waited in all day Saturday Oct 22, which turned out to be a wasted day. Track package showed “item had been received at Milton Keynes Amazon UK facility at 21.51 on Oct 21”. Track package next showed “Package delayed in Transit” at 17.00 on Oct 21. Track package on Oct 22 advised “Package on the way, but it’s running late”. On Sunday Oct 23 Track package advised “Now expected today” and “We’re very sorry your delivery is late. If you have not received your package by today, you can come back here the next day for a refund”. Stayed in for the delivery, but nothing arrived! On Monday Oct 24 Track package said “Your package may be lost” and “We’re very sorry your delivery is so late. Although it may still arrive, you can request a refund now” and a button “Contact Us”. Contacted Amazon Customer Service by phone at 14.32 on Monday Oct 24, and agreed with the service agent A that I would like the same item to be re-ordered at no cost. The agent promised 1-day delivery, i.e. delivery on Tuesday October 25th. At 20.40 on Monday Oct 24th, I contacted Amazon Customer Service again, because I had not received a delivery confirmation as promised. Service agent B advised that she could find no trace of the documentation for the re-order of my iPhone, and offered me the choice of re-ordering again or cancelling and requesting a refund. I requested the refund, as I was so annoyed at the way Amazon had dealt with the situation! A very poor experience all round! I cannot in all honesty recommend buying high-value items from Amazon.",2022-10-24 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,28.0,1949,346,22,4,4.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,ordered apple iphone mini amazon thursday oct uk time received order confirmation email amazon advising delivery would arriving saturday oct using amazon prime service received email friday oct advising item dispatched day delivery onetime password would emailed would need shown driver waited day saturday oct turned wasted day track package showed “item received milton keynes amazon uk facility oct ” track package next showed “package delayed transit” oct track package oct advised “package way it’s running late” sunday oct track package advised “now expected today” “we’re sorry delivery late received package today come back next day refund” stayed delivery nothing arrived monday oct track package said “your package may lost” “we’re sorry delivery late although may still arrive request refund now” button “contact us” contacted amazon customer service phone monday oct agreed service agent would like item reordered cost agent promised day delivery ie delivery tuesday october th monday oct th contacted amazon customer service received delivery confirmation promised service agent b advised could find trace documentation reorder iphone offered choice reordering cancelling requesting refund requested refund annoyed way amazon dealt situation poor experience round cannot honesty recommend buying highvalue item amazon,0.469761241220667,0.530238758779333,0.19405496354458776,0.2,0.603930372098584,60.393037209858406,Medium Trust
Gary Harber,/users/5a37daac0000ff000af2c722,GB,148.0,2022-10-28 00:14:42+00:00,1.0,Yet ANOTHER 1* run-in with Amazon CS…,"Yet ANOTHER 1* run-in with Amazon CS via both phone and online chat.My purchase was made on October 4th, with an ETA of today, the 27th. The tracker said (last night) ""Arriving by 8pm"" BUT at a few minutes to 4pm, and an email said it's now OOS, and my NEW delivery date is between NOVEMBER 9th & 16th.Funny thing is IF I wanted, I could purchase the same packs via AMAZON FRESH (fer a lot more than I paid btw)SO Amazon CAN deliver them, but ONLY as part of an Amazon Fresh order, even though they come from fulfilment centres either way",2022-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,28.0,538,103,37,7,1.0,0,0,2,1,Suspicious,yet another runin amazon c via phone online chatmy purchase made october th eta today th tracker said last night arriving pm minute pm email said oos new delivery date november th thfunny thing wanted could purchase pack via amazon fresh fer lot paid btwso amazon deliver part amazon fresh order even though come fulfilment centre either way,0.7802262292080694,0.2197737707919306,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.4214404468093136,42.14404468093136,Low Trust
