Jessica Pagram,/users/5dfa902f7293b14c5ef7604f,GB,8.0,2022-10-27 21:22:28+00:00,1.0,The delivery is a bloody joke,"The delivery is a bloody joke. If you are elderly or aren't able to bend down to pick up a parcel your unfortunately screwed, no matter how many times I say to put the parcel in the side cupboard which is opened by a hatch, they'll place it on the floor. They'll also take the picture to show its been delivered but wont stick around to see if your in. If there gonna take  picture it should be of the front door open to show proof that it was actually delivered, anyone can just walk pat your house and nick your parcel. They also rarely knock on the door. It's only 18:30 and i received my parcel, no email, no doorbell or knock, I'm extremely lucky that i checked the amazon app to see where it was. Would have definitely been stolen or ruined from the rain we've had every day for the past week",2022-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,27.0,798,155,29,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,delivery bloody joke elderly arent able bend pick parcel unfortunately screwed matter many time say put parcel side cupboard opened hatch theyll place floor theyll also take picture show delivered wont stick around see gonna take picture front door open show proof actually delivered anyone walk pat house nick parcel also rarely knock door received parcel email doorbell knock im extremely lucky checked amazon app see would definitely stolen ruined rain weve every day past week,0.015265223051366633,0.9847347769486333,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.8097538158439185,80.97538158439185,High Trust
