Phil,/users/5df5f55fc490efd35f9b2ba6,GB,6.0,2022-10-22 10:00:18+00:00,1.0,Amazon are rubbish!!!,"Honestly I never used to have a problem with amazon. Now the company has gone to the dogs. I no longer get refunds within a few hrs but am literally made to wait the full 14 days. Items over a certain value are always defective when I receive them and returns go missing.And on top of this stellar service they want to increase prime membership.Well not on my watch amazon, I've cancelled my subscription and when I finally get to spend my remaining vouchers that is it, I'm done.Boycott Amazon!!!",2022-10-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,22.0,497,90,21,3,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,honestly never used problem amazon company gone dog longer get refund within hr literally made wait full day item certain value always defective receive return go missingand top stellar service want increase prime membershipwell watch amazon ive cancelled subscription finally get spend remaining voucher im doneboycott amazon,0.5605092705299946,0.43949072947000545,0.050476724621424565,0.2,0.5298407096592876,52.984070965928765,Medium Trust
Neil Pascalll,/users/5d3c2b386eaec2223de928fe,GB,31.0,2022-10-22 06:27:04+00:00,1.0,Amazon took my money without permission.,"Amazon decided to start billing me £8.99 a month for Prime. A service I never signed up for. They didn't send me an email saying they were going to start billing me. A simple security precaution they decided not to take. If I hadn't checked my bank account, I would never have know they were taking my money without my permission. I wonder how many other people have had their money taken without knowing. Their behaviour shows they don't care about anything, other than getting their customers money. Truly disgusting behaviour.",2022-10-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,22.0,529,91,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon decided start billing £ month prime service never signed didnt send email saying going start billing simple security precaution decided take hadnt checked bank account would never know taking money without permission wonder many people money taken without knowing behaviour show dont care anything getting customer money truly disgusting behaviour,0.05577230193002556,0.9442276980699744,0.05103757711721817,0.2,0.7823213644584309,78.2321364458431,High Trust
Boris Dantès,/users/5fcfacd3ce11b00019dc1f31,PL,11.0,2022-10-22 03:04:54+00:00,1.0,Terrible business practices,"I fell for the free 1-month trial offer of Amazon's subsidiary company, IMDB. I really wanted to use their services so I didn't cancel the subscription, up until the moment I realized that their customer service and website were plain awful. I tried to get in contact with them and then with Amazon, in order to have the subscription cancelled and receive my refund. Eventually Amazon did the trick, but little did I know that at a distance of one year the subscription would turn out to be still active. In fact, I got another charge of 184.49 dollars on my bank account. An unauthorized charge which I disputed with my bank immediately. I wrote to the customer support from IMDB and Amazon again and they guaranteed that it was all a mistake, that the subscription would now be cancelled for real and a refund had just been issued. At a distance of 2 months and after several intense exchanges of e-mails, I still haven't received the money back on my account, nor any official pdf confirmation of the refund. Amazon, who owns IMDB, couldn't care less about the issue: all they did was try to pass the ball to IMDB, whose customer support is non-existent, or try to convince me that the refund had been done correctly and there was nothing more they could do. I even showed them the emails from my bank where it's clearly stated that no refund ever came through and that a pdf confirmation of the transaction is required in order to be credible, but - no matter how many times I tried to call them or contact them through the support chat - Amazon refused to acknowledge the problem or do anything to solve it. A problem which was caused by their utmost negligence towards the customer, in the first place. I have now proceeded to report both companies to the Federal Trade Commission, for fraud.",2022-08-17 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,22.0,1798,323,27,3,66.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,fell free month trial offer amazon subsidiary company imdb really wanted use service didnt cancel subscription moment realized customer service website plain awful tried get contact amazon order subscription cancelled receive refund eventually amazon trick little know distance one year subscription would turn still active fact got another charge dollar bank account unauthorized charge disputed bank immediately wrote customer support imdb amazon guaranteed mistake subscription would cancelled real refund issued distance month several intense exchange email still havent received money back account official pdf confirmation refund amazon owns imdb couldnt care less issue try pas ball imdb whose customer support nonexistent try convince refund done correctly nothing could even showed email bank clearly stated refund ever came pdf confirmation transaction required order credible matter many time tried call contact support chat amazon refused acknowledge problem anything solve problem caused utmost negligence towards customer first place proceeded report company federal trade commission fraud,0.0019426957684448047,0.9980573042315551,0.18115535614133482,0.2,0.8352597233440445,83.52597233440446,High Trust
