Rado,/users/620ae713bb9103001245805a,NL,19.0,2022-10-20 13:05:03+00:00,1.0,The best customer service turned the worst,"For over a decade a praised Amazon for amazing customer service. I am a specialist in that field, I always admired the amazing job Amazon did. Well, not anymore: these fvcking cvnts just decided they don't want to have any customer service anymore. Do you have a problem, customer? F*U, Amazon doesn't care anymore. Chat is off, and only a phone call is available (only for a few regions, too). Are you deaf or have hearing problems? F*U, Amazon most certainly will not treat your impairment with any respect or sensitivity. In that case: F*U, Amazon!",2022-10-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,20.0,551,96,42,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,decade praised amazon amazing customer service specialist field always admired amazing job amazon well anymore fvcking cvnts decided dont want customer service anymore problem customer fu amazon doesnt care anymore chat phone call available region deaf hearing problem fu amazon certainly treat impairment respect sensitivity case fu amazon,0.11949719880207922,0.8805028011979208,0.0538418395961862,0.2,0.7510197685181976,75.10197685181976,High Trust
