MUHAMMAD FARHAN,/users/5f12f42dcd230d8512ab35a6,GB,40.0,2022-10-18 23:07:42+00:00,1.0,Had a worst experience scammers,"Had a worst experience. On Amazon prime day in October, i noted a phone was at a discount of 50%, so i placed order for that phone. When i got the package, i noted it has speaker not the phone. While raising to Amazon, they totally disowned this. There are huge scammers in this business, lesson learnt to check before accepting delivery... can't trust this big name 'amazon'",2022-10-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,18.0,375,68,31,5,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,worst experience amazon prime day october noted phone discount placed order phone got package noted speaker phone raising amazon totally disowned huge scammer business lesson learnt check accepting delivery cant trust big name amazon,0.0582215944829548,0.9417784055170452,0.03813796971396523,0.2,0.7785167967013156,77.85167967013156,High Trust
Jaglenn,/users/634ef932f92b450013ade52d,CA,1.0,2022-10-18 21:07:33+00:00,5.0,All my experience with Amazon is good,"All my experience with Amazon is good. It used to be I couldn’t find what I needed unless I went the city and searched all day. Now I just look for it on Amazon.  My goodness, I never knew I could get such a variety of things.  And the delivery service….BEST EVER bar none.  I don’t know how they do it.  If shop owners listened to their customers and actually catered to their needs, ( which is why you would open a store?!) they wouldn’t need Amazon. The only thing wrong Is Amazons online video listing.  You look for something to watch, you open one to read, you go back to look for something else….and you are back at the beginning?!  You have to scroll down the list to where you were and continue….no no no. I just gave up. I don’t need to watch tv anyways. But good supply management guys…keep it up. 5 star service for me!",2022-10-18 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,18.0,831,159,37,7,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,experience amazon good used couldn’t find needed unless went city searched day look amazon goodness never knew could get variety thing delivery service…best ever bar none don’t know shop owner listened customer actually catered need would open store wouldn’t need amazon thing wrong amazon online video listing look something watch open one read go back look something else…and back beginning scroll list continue…no gave don’t need watch tv anyways good supply management guys…keep star service,0.8305261518007018,0.16947384819929823,0.0891755468311834,1.0,1.602572033465886,160.2572033465886,High Trust
Neeraj Nath,/users/634eec48b1a8a800134eab4c,US,1.0,2022-10-18 20:11:30+00:00,1.0,Terrible customer service.,"Terrible customer service.Need a Customer Service Associate9:58 AMMessaging Assistant | Customer ServiceOk, you can chat with an associate now or request a call back.You can also go to your Customer Service hub to fix most things or to search help pages. What do you prefer?9:58 AMChat with an associate now9:58 AMMessaging Assistant | Customer ServiceIf you have details you think would help the associate, type them here.An associate will join the chat.9:58 AMNNics has joined & will be ready to chat in just a minute.Nics | Customer ServiceHi, this is Nics! How are you today? I hope you're doing fine. How can I help you, Neeraj? N9:59 AMhi checking on orderit was supposed to be delivered today9:59 AMNics | Customer ServiceI'm sorry that you haven't received your order yet. As per checking here, the item is not available on the nearest fulfillment center. As you may know, we have several fulfillment centers across the country, and the items in your order may sometimes be in stock at different locations. Therefore, we need to obtain the item from another fulfillment center and it takes additional time to ship your package. Would you mind to wait until it ships out or shall I cancel the order, Neeraj? N9:59 AMwhy is there a delay of 10 days?10:00 AMNics | Customer ServiceIt is because the item is not available in the nearest fulfillment center.N10:00 AMthen why was the Date provided?10:00 AMNics | Customer ServiceI already explained it to you that we have several fulfillment centers across the country, and the items in your order may sometimes be in stock at different locations.If you cannot extend your patience, we can cancel this order and re order it with a different seller.N10:01 AMso get it shipped from a different centerI need the order and am not looking to cancel10:01 AMNics | Customer ServiceThat is what we are doing and this is the main reason why delivery date is extended. I already explained it you just have to understand it.I offered cancellation because you cannot understand and wait for the item to be shipped out.N10:02 AMreally? get me another agent. you are not fit for customer serviceI can not understand.???10:03 AMNics | Customer ServiceYes, you cannot understand. Do I have to explain it one more time, Neeraj?N10:03 AMyesI am reporting youbad experience10:03 AMNics | Customer ServiceWhy would you report me if I only explained it to you at the first place? N10:04 AMcopying this chat",2022-10-18 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,18.0,2437,408,26,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,terrible customer serviceneed customer service associate ammessaging assistant customer serviceok chat associate request call backyou also go customer service hub fix thing search help page prefer amchat associate ammessaging assistant customer serviceif detail think would help associate type herean associate join chat amnnics joined ready chat minutenics customer servicehi nics today hope youre fine help neeraj n amhi checking orderit supposed delivered today amnics customer serviceim sorry havent received order yet per checking item available nearest fulfillment center may know several fulfillment center across country item order may sometimes stock different location therefore need obtain item another fulfillment center take additional time ship package would mind wait ship shall cancel order neeraj n amwhy delay day amnics customer serviceit item available nearest fulfillment centern amthen date provided amnics customer servicei already explained several fulfillment center across country item order may sometimes stock different locationsif cannot extend patience cancel order order different sellern amso get shipped different centeri need order looking cancel amnics customer servicethat main reason delivery date extended already explained understand iti offered cancellation cannot understand wait item shipped outn amreally get another agent fit customer servicei understand amnics customer serviceyes cannot understand explain one time neerajn amyesi reporting youbad experience amnics customer servicewhy would report explained first place n amcopying chat,0.06060152314625871,0.9393984768537413,0.22882781828379137,0.2,0.8154648020836289,81.5464802083629,High Trust
