Eileen Foley,/users/634d71df5639860012543197,US,1.0,2022-10-17 17:17:04+00:00,1.0,Amazon is very quickly going down the…,"Amazon is very quickly going down the toilet!  Forget the 1-day Prime delivery promise...that's LONG gone. Now, you're lucky to even get your orders at all.  This is the 3rd time my order, via USPS, has failed to deliver and needs to be sent back to be relabled and issued a new tracking #.  If USPS is the problem, why keep using them???   Also, why is it SO difficult to reach a PERSON in the US customer service.  We need an easily located customer service PHONE NUMBER, not sent on a wild goose chase thru various, useless online ""help"" nonsense that only frustrates, never helps!   Then, if someone DOES return calls, why is it always a too  difficult to understand Phillipino or East Indian?   Don't you hire Americans any more Bezo?  As I said, quickly going down the toilet.  Too much aggrevation trying to buy your cheap made-in-China crap. We still have real stores to shop in, thankfully. Toodle-lo.",2022-10-16 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,17.0,910,159,38,7,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon quickly going toilet forget day prime delivery promisethats long gone youre lucky even get order rd time order via usps failed deliver need sent back relabled issued new tracking usps problem keep using also difficult reach person u customer service need easily located customer service phone number sent wild goose chase thru various useless online help nonsense frustrates never help someone return call always difficult understand phillipino east indian dont hire american bezo said quickly going toilet much aggrevation trying buy cheap madeinchina crap still real store shop thankfully toodlelo,0.08976014355354253,0.9102398564464574,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.7729550375894654,77.29550375894654,High Trust
