Sarah Body,/users/613d1e03c9ed4b0012854236,GB,34.0,2022-10-15 01:17:04+00:00,3.0,I decided i will start having my…,"I decided i will start having my parcels delivered to my fiancee's address because when I'm not there I have been receiving emails from Amazon saying they have left my parcels with a neighbour who has opened a parcel in the past who I said on the delivery instructions not to leave my parcels with and i told them to give it to s different neighbour if I wasn't in,my other neighbour gets the parcel off her but in future my parcels will be going to my fiancee's address, I can't deal with it anymore this person getting their hands on my parcels, apart from that they are a good company.",2022-10-14 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,15.0,588,111,33,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,decided start parcel delivered fiancee address im receiving email amazon saying left parcel neighbour opened parcel past said delivery instruction leave parcel told give different neighbour wasnt inmy neighbour get parcel future parcel going fiancee address cant deal anymore person getting hand parcel apart good company,0.20728184580024556,0.7927181541997544,0.062254627033090294,0.6,1.3088100025064953,130.88100025064952,High Trust
Gary Quilter,/users/5d53b0b1d9b2cf12016e0f08,GB,14.0,2022-10-15 00:42:34+00:00,1.0,I bought a gift card of £50 from Amazon…,I bought a gift card of £50 from Amazon to send to my girlfriend I have done this regularly for the past six months tonight I sent my girlfriend £50 when she went to the store to pay for a shopping it says wrong pin and there’s no money on the cardI double checked the email address and the email address was correct some beef at Amazon and send it to Abdul Mateen my girlfriend received a copy of a blank gift card so be very very careful people don’t use Amazon gift cards because there is a fee I’ll give Amazon 24 hours to respondGive me my money back and compensation because this is the third time this has happened can you get some gibbering Indian you cannot speak English trying to tell me she doesn’t understand very poor,2022-10-14 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,15.0,731,140,40,9,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought gift card £ amazon send girlfriend done regularly past six month tonight sent girlfriend £ went store pay shopping say wrong pin there’s money cardi double checked email address email address correct beef amazon send abdul mateen girlfriend received copy blank gift card careful people don’t use amazon gift card fee i’ll give amazon hour respondgive money back compensation third time happened get gibbering indian cannot speak english trying tell doesn’t understand poor,0.03129336104992986,0.9687066389500701,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.800057189357256,80.0057189357256,High Trust
