Melanie C,/users/63497db3d118c800125dd9d2,CA,1.0,2022-10-14 17:18:27+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service experience,"Worst customer service experience! I placed an order on September 25th 2022 and one of the items was set to arrive only on October 11th. That day I looked up my order to obtain tracking information and noticed my order was cancelled, claiming that I refused delivery. I live by myself, work from home and there was no attempted delivery. I called Amazon and spoke to an agent who said she would follow up with me the next day. The one time I stepped away from my phone is when she called and missed the call. I called them back and spoke to another agent who said they are trained to return the call 30 minutes later, so instead of explaining my story again, I said I would just wait for her to call back. She never called back. I called Amazon again and spoke to a 3rd agent who put me on hold for 25 minutes and then the line dropped. She also never called back. I waited a couple days and still nothing. So this morning I told my story to a 4th agent and she tells me she is going to escalate this to management and couldn’t tell me much of anything. I told her my only request is that I do not want the same delivery company to be used for any future deliveries going forward and I will not be making any Amazon purchases going forward until that is confirmed. She then tells me the delivery company has to mess up at least 3 times for them to consider this. By this point I’m irate and I’m not interested in possibly going through this experience again a 2nd or 3rd time and request to escalate the call. This is where my experience gets even worse. The manager was completely uncaring, no empathy, unfriendly and expressed very little concern when I said that I would cancel my prime membership and close my account if my request wasn’t granted after all the hoops I had to jump with them. It was so triggering to me and I asked to speak with someone higher than him and he flat out said no. Did I curse and express how I felt about his “help”, yes. Should I have stayed calm? Yes but honestly I was just disappointed and upset by his lack of care and I disconnected the call. I immediately went on the chat customer service to report my experience and the agent right away was empathetic and kind and helpful and filled out a carrier deprioritization form. Why could a manager from the leadership team give me that same treatment?! And the kicker is that I received an email from that manager threatening to cancel my account because of MY Behaviour. UNREAL!",2022-10-14 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,14.0,2465,465,33,4,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,worst customer service experience placed order september th one item set arrive october th day looked order obtain tracking information noticed order cancelled claiming refused delivery live work home attempted delivery called amazon spoke agent said would follow next day one time stepped away phone called missed call called back spoke another agent said trained return call minute later instead explaining story said would wait call back never called back called amazon spoke rd agent put hold minute line dropped also never called back waited couple day still nothing morning told story th agent tell going escalate management couldn’t tell much anything told request want delivery company used future delivery going forward making amazon purchase going forward confirmed tell delivery company mess least time consider point i’m irate i’m interested possibly going experience nd rd time request escalate call experience get even worse manager completely uncaring empathy unfriendly expressed little concern said would cancel prime membership close account request wasn’t granted hoop jump triggering asked speak someone higher flat said curse express felt “help” yes stayed calm yes honestly disappointed upset lack care disconnected call immediately went chat customer service report experience agent right away empathetic kind helpful filled carrier deprioritization form could manager leadership team give treatment kicker received email manager threatening cancel account behaviour unreal,0.7444306153546332,0.2555693846453668,0.2607964105440269,0.2,0.4799439744314888,47.99439744314888,Low Trust
Mario,/users/5bf57f4c5483f4b8a98475a5,ES,2.0,2022-10-14 09:42:41+00:00,2.0,"They sell refurbished items as ""New""","First, the phone arrived late. Then the seal of the package was broken, missing a phone case and grassy fingers everywhere. Obviously the item is a refurbished phone or exposition, but the seller specified as New... this is technically a scam. Amazon.it didn't want to publish my review warning about this, please think seriously about this italian amazon shops, I know more stories from people like this, so there are lot of risks buying there. You cannot trust them",2022-09-29 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,14.0,467,79,36,6,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,first phone arrived late seal package broken missing phone case grassy finger everywhere obviously item refurbished phone exposition seller specified new technically scam amazonit didnt want publish review warning please think seriously italian amazon shop know story people like lot risk buying cannot trust,0.01463443523689825,0.9853655647631018,0.0443073471676949,0.4,1.1015442518150897,110.15442518150897,High Trust
Debbie Katz,/users/6348d4c0d118c800125d66f5,US,1.0,2022-10-14 05:17:29+00:00,1.0,i've noticed their customer service has…,"i've noticed their customer service has really gone downhill in the last few months.  everytime i call there, the rep is from a country around the world...india, jamaica, phillipines, etc etc.  if you can understand them you're lucky.  also, they are totally incompetent and don't resolve anything.i am going to start looking for alternatives to amazon as they simply no longer care about customer service which should be a top priority for any excellent company.",2022-10-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,14.0,463,75,40,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive noticed customer service really gone downhill last month everytime call rep country around worldindia jamaica phillipines etc etc understand youre lucky also totally incompetent dont resolve anythingi going start looking alternative amazon simply longer care customer service top priority excellent company,0.020151655934042,0.979848344065958,0.04206393718452047,0.2,0.7983369594698831,79.83369594698831,High Trust
