Cheyenne Gill,/users/5f19e0327252dc0638acad9b,US,3.0,2022-10-11 21:12:03+00:00,1.0,They will lock you out for no reason,"I usually love Amazon, which I still do, but I have to give a 1 star for the fact that they locked me out of my account for no reason. Not only is my order not coming, I also have to wait days before they will supposedly be calling me back to unlock my account. Its ridiculous that this happened in the first place only because I added a new payment card.. like what?? Am I not allowed to use my debit card now? Geez. Get a better security system and maybe do what the banks do and send a security message asking if it was authorized instead of just locking people out for nothing.",2022-10-11 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,11.0,581,115,36,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,usually love amazon still give star fact locked account reason order coming also wait day supposedly calling back unlock account ridiculous happened first place added new payment card like allowed use debit card geez get better security system maybe bank send security message asking authorized instead locking people nothing,0.014925044666739102,0.985074955333261,0.06449803701626472,0.2,0.8054370850698834,80.54370850698834,High Trust
