Mohamad Alasadi,/users/5f650a34e9e5134703e3e188,GB,6.0,2022-10-02 18:26:48+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime failing,"On Saturday 01/10/2022 My first delivery was marked delivered although it wasn’t delivered! I contacted customer service via chat, and they told me that they can either refund my order or wait until Tuesday 04/10/2022 to receive my delivery although it is a next day delivery. I insisted that they contact the driver to try and deliver on the same day he/she marked the delivery as delivered. The customer service agent said they can’t do that because I reached out via chat and mentioned that if they put me through to phone support then they can contact the driver. When I spoke to phone support, they said that what I have been told by the chat customer agent is wrong, they can’t contact the driver. The phone support agent said that they will do a replacement order for the item for next day delivery, instead they changed the original delivery date to next day as if I the customer asked for that, although I didn’t, I asked for a replacement order. Today 02/10/2022 when the replacement order should be delivered, I get a notification from Amazon’s app that the rescheduled delivery will not be made today and it will be made on Monday 03/10/2022. Amazon driver makes a mistake and marks item delivered although it is still with them, and the customer service deceived me by telling me that will do a replacement order and instead they just rescheduled the original order as if I requested that. No compensation for any of my inconvenience was offered, just empty promises of next day delivery and apologies.",2022-10-02 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,2.0,1515,265,20,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,saturday first delivery marked delivered although wasn’t delivered contacted customer service via chat told either refund order wait tuesday receive delivery although next day delivery insisted contact driver try deliver day heshe marked delivery delivered customer service agent said can’t reached via chat mentioned put phone support contact driver spoke phone support said told chat customer agent wrong can’t contact driver phone support agent said replacement order item next day delivery instead changed original delivery date next day customer asked although didn’t asked replacement order today replacement order delivered get notification amazon’s app rescheduled delivery made today made monday amazon driver make mistake mark item delivered although still customer service deceived telling replacement order instead rescheduled original order requested compensation inconvenience offered empty promise next day delivery apology,0.03057205469459116,0.9694279453054089,0.14862591138530568,0.2,0.8144391549297655,81.44391549297654,High Trust
Steven,/users/56bfd0ec0000ff000a05dc1f,GB,27.0,2022-10-02 16:37:42+00:00,1.0,The lies continue to come out of Amazon…,"The lies continue to come out of Amazon uk from a team of unprofessional and rude customer service agents, it is so hard to contact an agent that understands  your query, I have still not received my refund from Amazon , the following  statementis part of my chat conversation with Amazon on the 27th Sept.(Romark | Customer Serviceyes you will be refunded on your gift card once the refund process is doneI can confirm that your item was received by our returns center, however due to the number of returns we are processing, your item was not processed yet. We are giving our returns specialist enough time to process all returns that is why we are requesting you to give us 14 days to complete the process. If you still didn't get your refund on 12/10/2022 , please let us know so we can review what happen and assist you further.is there anything else that i can help you with aside dis matter?R15:48No that's all I needed to know because of the timescale of returns I will look else where now for the item and cancel prime Thank you15:50Romark | Customer Servicethank you for contacting Amazon have a great day.R15:51Romark has left. Thank you for contacting Amazon.Messaging Assistant | Customer ServiceHello! It's Amazon's Chat Assistant again.In the chat transcript he stated the item had been returned and couldn't help me any further, What a way to treat customers Amazon, this is getting serious now as today I 2nd October I've been waiting for a telephone call since yesterday and (surprise surprise ) I recieved another email instead which is more lies which reads , (Hello,Once the carrier has received your return package, it can take a while to arrive at our returns center. We ask that you wait 14 days from sending to allow for any delay in delivery or processing. We'll request a refund to your payment method and send you an e-mail confirmation as soon as we process the return.If you don't hear from our returns center by DATE: 14 DAYS FROM RETURN DATE, please write back so we can find out what happened.Thank you for your patience.) Clearly going by the chat transcript they have the item back and I do not see any reason for a gift card refund to be held back any longer.My next plan of action is to contact the media and trading standards as I don't believe any customer should be treat like dirt and lied, feel free to add me and hopefully we can build a case for the media and give Amazon the publicity it deserves as this seems like an ongoing issue where genuine customers are badly being let down",2022-10-02 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,10.0,2.0,2526,451,40,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,lie continue come amazon uk team unprofessional rude customer service agent hard contact agent understands query still received refund amazon following statementis part chat conversation amazon th septromark customer serviceyes refunded gift card refund process donei confirm item received return center however due number return processing item processed yet giving return specialist enough time process return requesting give u day complete process still didnt get refund please let u know review happen assist furtheris anything else help aside dis matterrno thats needed know timescale return look else item cancel prime thank youromark customer servicethank contacting amazon great dayrromark left thank contacting amazonmessaging assistant customer servicehello amazon chat assistant againin chat transcript stated item returned couldnt help way treat customer amazon getting serious today nd october ive waiting telephone call since yesterday surprise surprise recieved another email instead lie read helloonce carrier received return package take arrive return center ask wait day sending allow delay delivery processing well request refund payment method send email confirmation soon process returnif dont hear return center date day return date please write back find happenedthank patience clearly going chat transcript item back see reason gift card refund held back longermy next plan action contact medium trading standard dont believe customer treat like dirt lied feel free add hopefully build case medium give amazon publicity deserves seems like ongoing issue genuine customer badly let,0.05020751365688613,0.9497924863431139,0.25294447560291644,0.2,0.8254851382921402,82.54851382921402,High Trust
