Foss,/users/5e220114ddcefacf4b5980be,GB,9.0,2022-09-22 13:49:44+00:00,1.0,We bought a CAMERA but we got COFFE,"we bought a camera (DJI Pocket 2 Creator Combo) along with a sd card (SanDisk Extreme Pro 256gb)and a case( Maxcam dji pocket 2 creator combo carrying case) the case and sd card arrived ok BUT when the camera arrived WE GOT A PACKET OF COFFE, This was MAJORLY INFURIATING, So we contacted amazon and they picked it up the next day and they said they would give the refund money back to us in 2-5 working days, we waited 5 days and we DIDN'T GET THE MONEY BACK, Then 2 days later they said they would get the money back to us in 6 MORE DAYS, so we waited for the 2nd time now and... WE STILL DIDN'T GET THE MONEY, then they said we will get the money back to you in 2 days and ... WE STILL DIDNT GET THE MONEY!!!!!!!, THEN they said wE wIlL gET The MOnEY bAck ThE NeXt dAy, and to this day (22/09/22) WE STILL DONT HAVE THE MONEY, SO please be careful where you buy from.",2022-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,22.0,870,175,35,8,18.0,0,7,1,0,Genuine,bought camera dji pocket creator combo along sd card sandisk extreme pro gband case maxcam dji pocket creator combo carrying case case sd card arrived ok camera arrived got packet coffe majorly infuriating contacted amazon picked next day said would give refund money back u working day waited day didnt get money back day later said would get money back u day waited nd time still didnt get money said get money back day still didnt get money said get money back next day day still dont money please careful buy,0.998558773636809,0.001441226363190995,0.0981491867638811,0.2,0.3203504505343717,32.03504505343717,Low Trust
Vishakha Gupta,/users/632c36e7e7e91400123d80cf,IN,1.0,2022-09-22 12:28:11+00:00,1.0,Amazon you dont even deserve this one…,"Amazon you dont even deserve this one star review. I had really bad experience with Amazon.in On 19th September 2022 I ordered a study table for myself from Amazon and paid them via Google Pay.Today. When I checked my order status it shows that the product has been delivered to me but I haven't got my order yet. Still it shows delivered in status section. I talked with their customer service but they are not giving me proper answer and not sending me a mail that they will resolve this issue ASAP. I'm quite disappointed with Amazon.Please don't buy anything from this site and even if you have to buy just never choose the prepaid option, always choose COD option.",2022-09-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,22.0,669,120,38,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon dont even deserve one star review really bad experience amazonin th september ordered study table amazon paid via google paytoday checked order status show product delivered havent got order yet still show delivered status section talked customer service giving proper answer sending mail resolve issue asap im quite disappointed amazonplease dont buy anything site even buy never choose prepaid option always choose cod option,0.01099676887925202,0.989003231120748,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.8079620754594204,80.79620754594204,High Trust
Jacky Lee,/users/632c16e13f13130013df8d04,CA,1.0,2022-09-22 10:03:52+00:00,1.0,Login Customer Support,"I got locked out of my account for ""suspicious activity"". They said it was because I tried using the OTP system too many times - I entered it and they said to contact customer service in the prompt. They do not have an email or online chat option, instead forcing you to call them at international rates to login. Even then, the customer support representatives can vary. The first person I got lectured me on the difference between amazon.ca and amazon.com accounts for the first half of our call, then asked for details like the titles of my most recent purchases and the authors. I only had the order numbers because those are the only things they write in the email they send for purchases. So they asked me about my payment details. After I gave them my credit card number and expiry date details, they asked me for an ""alphanumeric"" code from my credit card statement. After spending time pulling it up, they suddenly said that I was out of time. In addition, while they were giving their whole apology spiel, I had gotten the details and asked if I could give them now. But they still said it was unacceptable. In addition, they had the audacity to ask ""any more questions""? On the second customer representative I got, I literally just gave them my email address and they unlocked it with no checks. Forcing me to pay international rates and ~30 minutes of my time for their account issues.",2022-09-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,22.0,1398,251,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,got locked account suspicious activity said tried using otp system many time entered said contact customer service prompt email online chat option instead forcing call international rate login even customer support representative vary first person got lectured difference amazonca amazoncom account first half call asked detail like title recent purchase author order number thing write email send purchase asked payment detail gave credit card number expiry date detail asked alphanumeric code credit card statement spending time pulling suddenly said time addition giving whole apology spiel gotten detail asked could give still said unacceptable addition audacity ask question second customer representative got literally gave email address unlocked check forcing pay international rate minute time account issue,0.008154354741691003,0.991845645258309,0.14077397644419518,0.2,0.8240776179179935,82.40776179179935,High Trust
Sarah Peardon,/users/615f8b57f628a50012c782f3,US,2.0,2022-09-22 02:41:58+00:00,3.0,Amazon has stopped trying,"Amazon uses third party sellers which may or may not honor refund request. Recently, I cancelled an expensive lighting fixture order, but the company sent it (after Amazon sent me a message saying the order was cancelled). I have been trying for almost two months to get a return label for a $500 item. Additionally, today, I received a NextBase 422GW car dash cam instead of a 622GW from a third party seller. This was a birthday gift for 9/22. My son helped me drive his birthday gift to an Amazon locker for return. The seller sent an old version at the new version price. And, last week, Amazon Warehouse delivered a microwave upside down with broken foam that was hugely dented inside and out for a small markdown. It looks like trash and cost $300 with tax. Now, I have to repackage this heavy item and bring it to UPS and go without a microwave, or reorder through Amazon (rewarding incompetence). Amazon has good infrastructure (fast delivery, return lockers at third parity locations). It undoubtedly has greased some palms. Amazon has cut out its competitors, who now sell as third party vendors. Amazon is now careless. Yesterday, packages were thrown across my driveway to run over.",2022-09-19 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,22.0,1194,207,25,4,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon us third party seller may may honor refund request recently cancelled expensive lighting fixture order company sent amazon sent message saying order cancelled trying almost two month get return label item additionally today received nextbase gw car dash cam instead gw third party seller birthday gift son helped drive birthday gift amazon locker return seller sent old version new version price last week amazon warehouse delivered microwave upside broken foam hugely dented inside small markdown look like trash cost tax repackage heavy item bring ups go without microwave reorder amazon rewarding incompetence amazon good infrastructure fast delivery return locker third parity location undoubtedly greased palm amazon cut competitor sell third party vendor amazon careless yesterday package thrown across driveway run,0.016308094659864252,0.9836919053401357,0.1160964666292765,0.6,1.415065245995923,141.5065245995923,High Trust
Layla,/users/6322295943ffa10016b63498,US,2.0,2022-09-21 21:21:16+00:00,1.0,Your customer service is incompetent,"Your customer service is incompetent. They can’t read, comprehend, and respond correctly. You have Ramya, Supervisor Terra, Then Lhes K in executive office. Mind boggling how inadequate Amazon customer service is. The customer service fails on so many levels. To have someone in executive office who can’t understand and respond correctly and wastes so much of someone’s time is disgusting. Worst customer service ever!!!",2022-09-01 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,21.0,421,64,36,5,20.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,customer service incompetent can’t read comprehend respond correctly ramya supervisor terra lhes k executive office mind boggling inadequate amazon customer service customer service fails many level someone executive office can’t understand respond correctly waste much someone’s time disgusting worst customer service ever,0.6022959913023243,0.39770400869767575,0.0358945597307908,0.2,0.506030916294996,50.603091629499595,Medium Trust
