Michael Morgan,/users/5e628d421c7f4ffb9c49a85f,US,8.0,2022-09-14 02:57:42+00:00,1.0,"I will leave Amazon, they profile customers.","I will leave Amazon.  They have a curated profile of who they want as customers and the tiers are quite obvious.  Their shipping system is dismal and random.   For so many people, Amazon simply cannot be bothered. The region they live in is not desirable to Amazon's accountants.  Profit is the ONLY motivation of Amazon. They shift all responsibility to the shipper, whose name they pull out of a hat.  Countless people that do not live in or near urban regions cannot reliably use Amazon.  I get endless refunds because my items never arrive.  Looking to join the obviously required class-action.",2022-09-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,14.0,598,101,44,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,leave amazon curated profile want customer tier quite obvious shipping system dismal random many people amazon simply cannot bothered region live desirable amazon accountant profit motivation amazon shift responsibility shipper whose name pull hat countless people live near urban region cannot reliably use amazon get endless refund item never arrive looking join obviously required classaction,0.023080431028278798,0.9769195689717212,0.056646102075154234,0.2,0.7997890049008913,79.97890049008913,High Trust
