Keith Hall,/users/5d0dffea79ad36ebdae9d908,US,4.0,2022-09-13 20:14:30+00:00,1.0,Amazon Returns are NOT refunded to your Credit Card,"I purchased (2) 4W 5V Solar Panel Compatible with Eufycam, Includes Secure Wall Mount, IP65 Weatherproof,13.1ft Power Cable（3Pack ) but they do not provide a weather tight connection to the Euftcams so I returned them. ""A refund will appear on your bank account or credit card statement within the next 7 days."" According to Amazon again, the refund was posted on September 6th. The refund never showed up on the credit card it was charged too. The first time I called Amazon's cs rep, the person couldn't understand English and when I asked to speak to a supervisor, she hung upon me. When I called back, this cs rep check to see what happened, come to find out, instead of Amazon crediting my credit card, instead they issued a gift card. So now, I have to pay the credit card for the defective equipment that was returned and a gift card that can only be used at Amazon, maybe whole foods.",2022-08-29 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,13.0,892,161,51,9,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,purchased w v solar panel compatible eufycam includes secure wall mount ip weatherproofft power cable（pack provide weather tight connection euftcams returned refund appear bank account credit card statement within next day according amazon refund posted september th refund never showed credit card charged first time called amazon c rep person couldnt understand english asked speak supervisor hung upon called back c rep check see happened come find instead amazon crediting credit card instead issued gift card pay credit card defective equipment returned gift card used amazon maybe whole food,0.010613701898860404,0.9893862981011396,0.09029725182277061,0.2,0.8127525994151239,81.27525994151239,High Trust
Dave Worrall,/users/5aeb497a4de5666d34c18b73,GB,8.0,2022-09-13 16:31:28+00:00,5.0,Easy refund,"I'm quite picky when it comes to companies I deal with, and tend to leave reviews usually based on bad service. But this time I've something positive to raise. I was considering cancelling my prime membership and decided to do just that, but then forgot it for a week. Today the payment got taken (year subscription) and though well, that's 80 quid gone, but thought also that I'd log in and check if it's possible to cancel after a payment has been taken. Turns out it is and they'll pay you back for unused time, no fuss, no having to call them. Simple.",2022-09-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,13.0,555,103,11,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,im quite picky come company deal tend leave review usually based bad service time ive something positive raise considering cancelling prime membership decided forgot week today payment got taken year subscription though well thats quid gone thought also id log check possible cancel payment taken turn theyll pay back unused time fuss call simple,0.025834454998498128,0.9741655450015019,0.05776780706674145,1.0,1.9986363339140993,199.86363339140993,High Trust
