NV- Slim,/users/5e0cc70b361d6160b20b0009,US,3.0,2022-09-13 05:20:49+00:00,1.0,Poor customer service,"Poor customer service.  I think it comes from India or Pakistan.  When you ask to speak to someone in the USA, they tell you they are in the USA.  Lies!Spent over an hour on the phone trying to get info on changing my garage access code with Amazon.  No luck, constantly put on hold, and when stumped, they hang up on you!  So you have to start the process all over again. If you ask to speak to someone on the next level up their customer service food chain, they blow you off!Overall I couldn’t get any answers.  Have no idea where to go next other than closing my account.",2022-09-11 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,13.0,575,110,21,3,2.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,poor customer service think come india pakistan ask speak someone usa tell usa liesspent hour phone trying get info changing garage access code amazon luck constantly put hold stumped hang start process ask speak someone next level customer service food chain blow offoverall couldn’t get answer idea go next closing account,0.7605959095587997,0.23940409044120026,0.06169377453729669,0.2,0.43204080012805945,43.204080012805946,Low Trust
