Nichola Green,/users/602aa13ce62fd2001933b4a7,CA,6.0,2022-09-11 20:35:23+00:00,1.0,Account Specialist need to be train,"I have been using Amazon service for sometime now and I had few bad experiences, however, today was the one that break the camel.For the past two weeks my foot has been broken, so it’s difficult for me to move around with crutches.I have purchased several items exceeding $1000.00 on Amazon since August to now.  Yesterday, I got a picture message that the item has been delivered. I went at the door and there was no item.  Last night about 10:28pm, a friend called me to dropped off food, when they arrived, I asked him to check for a package downstairs.  He sent me a picture stating that there wasn’t any package.  I reach out to Amazon, I was transferred to logistics. Whilst talking to the guy the call got disconnected.  I called back and was transferred to someone else who sent me a form to filled.  I filled the form, and based on her suggestion, I call back to have the rep replace the order.  The rep cancel the order stating she couldn’t replace the item, so I had to re-order the item.I was here listening to the News when I received a very rude email threatening me that they will close my Amazon account due to a number of replacement and refund.  I find this email very disturbing, seeing that it’s an online platform and majority of the items on their website is misleading advertisement, poor quality products, false reviews and missing parts. In addition, the first time I did not receive a package was over a year ago when the driver never came to my place of residence. The second time which was yesterday, the package was left outside the building where anyone could have taken the the item.It’s very disheartening to see a company responded to customer in this manner.  No customer service whatever from the account specialist.  I wonder If that person who sent me the email knows that if customers choose not to purchase anything from Amazon she will be out of a job. With that being said, I have decided to deal with Home Depot and Lowe moving forward.",2022-09-09 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,11.0,1978,356,35,6,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,using amazon service sometime bad experience however today one break camelfor past two week foot broken it’s difficult move around crutchesi purchased several item exceeding amazon since august yesterday got picture message item delivered went door item last night pm friend called dropped food arrived asked check package downstairs sent picture stating wasn’t package reach amazon transferred logistics whilst talking guy call got disconnected called back transferred someone else sent form filled filled form based suggestion call back rep replace order rep cancel order stating couldn’t replace item reorder itemi listening news received rude email threatening close amazon account due number replacement refund find email disturbing seeing it’s online platform majority item website misleading advertisement poor quality product false review missing part addition first time receive package year ago driver never came place residence second time yesterday package left outside building anyone could taken itemit’s disheartening see company responded customer manner customer service whatever account specialist wonder person sent email know customer choose purchase anything amazon job said decided deal home depot lowe moving forward,0.0031922523457626373,0.9968077476542374,0.19966348850252383,0.2,0.8383365715276234,83.83365715276234,High Trust
