utter shock and extremely disappointed about all this and quite frankly thinking about going globally with this. As this might be the only way to get their attention. I am a recently single mother just trying to make ends meat and cope with the fact daddy had just recently passed away and struggling so hard just keeping a float. I am not even asking for much. All I want is to be reimbursed or to have my daughters order sent to me which was a deal made and never fulfilled. How is this too much to ask?",2022-08-24 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,10.0,2396,456,28,6,17.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,review nothing nice ive tried calling amazon hung every time im let know putting hold time ive patched thru lied saying id get call back followed department get back ever occure bought item first order got mail second order paid told sent never even reimburse dollar purchase daughter new room supposed surprise never came calling never worked started calling different number wasnt hung right second order account closed cannot gain access anymore ive sent proper document requested said team looking itthey mentioned document werent approved even though sent picture account card used purchase item address sent confirmation item bank statement even text message got sitting couch mentioning order delivered nothing door knock door right thing delivered called nonstop week day inbetween required wait time contacted back never happend week ive emailed situation let know treated broke detail picture sent purchase screen shot etc still answer reply phone call even attempt make right paying something ive never recieved let alone able get thru account closed due suspicion activity always card address name always usedi utter shock extremely disappointed quite frankly thinking going globally might way get attention recently single mother trying make end meat cope fact daddy recently passed away struggling hard keeping float even asking much want reimbursed daughter order sent deal made never fulfilled much a