Victor Akinola,/users/6313a09083466e001268b5c6,NG,1.0,2022-09-03 20:46:41+00:00,5.0,This installment of Total Gut Makeover,"This installment of Total Gut Makeover, featuring IBS is an essential guide for those suffering from IBS. For years I have battled with symptoms and flare-ups that I was unsure how to handle and left with some misguided medical information. Although I am still learning, the recipes included within this book have improved my day-to-day life significantly by making only minor changes. What I was looking for the most with this recipe book were some simple meal ideas that I could prepare ahead of time and easily take to work for lunch. Meal planning can be overwhelming, but this guide has a 21-day meal plan that is easily repetitive and enjoyable, while also including some meals that are easy to prepare in advance. I'm already seeing an improvement in my levels of fatigue from only a week of implementing these new meals into my routine. For now, I'm not strictly going by the guide, but more so interjecting these meals into my otherwise normal routine. The summer tomatoes and gluten free berry muffins are top favorites for me!",2022-09-03 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,9.0,3.0,1037,178,38,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,installment total gut makeover featuring ibs essential guide suffering ibs year battled symptom flareups unsure handle left misguided medical information although still learning recipe included within book improved daytoday life significantly making minor change looking recipe book simple meal idea could prepare ahead time easily take work lunch meal planning overwhelming guide day meal plan easily repetitive enjoyable also including meal easy prepare advance im already seeing improvement level fatigue week implementing new meal routine im strictly going guide interjecting meal otherwise normal routine summer tomato gluten free berry muffin top favorite,0.05078878306322218,0.9492112169367778,0.09983174425126191,1.0,1.9945719573186413,199.45719573186415,High Trust
