JAMES BOUCHARD,/users/60fb02dcc47898001256fd04,US,6.0,2022-08-26 01:08:23+00:00,5.0,"Of Course Amazon.com is a trustworthy website (yet, not a perfect business)","I saw the ""untrustworthy"" reviews for Amazon on Trustpilot and thought ""seriously""?Just because a business has an imperfect record does not mean that they are untrustworthy.  Is a Walmart untrustworthy if it won't accept a return without a receipt even though someone really, really bought the item from that same Walmart?No.  There are legitimate complaints, but Amazon is about the most trustworthy online site that I interact with - considering its depth, scope, and exposure.I don't know how Trustpilot can protect from such nonsense, but I come here to get a view of how trustworthy an online site is (eg, is it operating as a shell, is it placing harmful code on users devices, etc).Maybe I'm wrong and this is just a rant site.  Well, I'm ranting against the utility of that - so there.But, Amazon is a legit online business that is imperfect but trustworthy as ... an online business.",2022-08-25 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,8.0,26.0,892,151,75,12,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,saw untrustworthy review amazon trustpilot thought seriouslyjust business imperfect record mean untrustworthy walmart untrustworthy wont accept return without receipt even though someone really really bought item walmartno legitimate complaint amazon trustworthy online site interact considering depth scope exposurei dont know trustpilot protect nonsense come get view trustworthy online site eg operating shell placing harmful code user device etcmaybe im wrong rant site well im ranting utility therebut amazon legit online business imperfect trustworthy online business,0.04036898502282774,0.9596310149771723,0.08468872686483454,1.0,1.996753252861553,199.6753252861553,High Trust
Richard Gaskell,/users/5a0dbc470000ff000ae36265,GB,10.0,2022-08-25 13:20:36+00:00,1.0,The Worst Customer Service. Ever.,"Amazon used to have the best customer service around, a company that other online stores would look to emulate on their own website. But now, its like trying to pull teeth trying to get answers or help in anyway. The staff are rude, abrupt and are not willing to go the mile, never mind the extra mile. They try to get rid of you with a discount on a product you are querying, but you are not getting any answers to your questions. Please Amazon, spend some time training your staff to get the level or service back to where it once was. So frustrating!!",2022-08-18 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,8.0,25.0,554,105,33,5,7.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,amazon used best customer service around company online store would look emulate website like trying pull teeth trying get answer help anyway staff rude abrupt willing go mile never mind extra mile try get rid discount product querying getting answer question please amazon spend time training staff get level service back frustrating,0.4823667208946768,0.5176332791053232,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.5705945419643274,57.05945419643273,Medium Trust
