Meredith Rutherford,/users/5f9dc6f2a9efb5001c0ca15d,US,4.0,2022-08-21 07:14:42+00:00,1.0,Refusal to refund $300,"We bought a $311 wireless invisible cat fence for our yard from AMAZON. The kind where the cat wears a collar and if he goes out of boundary, the collar buzzes. We got it on August 10th 2022, opened it at 3:30 pm, immediately realized the collar was much too big for a cat, sealed the box shut, submitted the return to AMAZON and it was at the UPS Store by 5:30 pm the same day. It is important to note the only item removed from the box was the collar. Which was promptly placed back in the box.Fast-forward....we get an email two days later from AMAZON that we didn't send the fence back, they threw away whatever we supposedly did send them and they aren't going to refund us the $311. They said if we did want a refund, to return the fence. AMAZON said if we wanted to appeal to reply to the email and they would respond within 72 hours. I responded and included all delivery receipts and the UPS Store receipt, etc. Invited them to come search my house for this supposed missing fence. SIX DAYS LATER, I send a nudge email. They finally reply saying that they did in fact get the fence but it was now ""used"" and ""in poor condition"" and they weren't going to refund the $311. OH and they had to throw it away to protect the safety of their employees. They disregarded all further communication. What do we as consumers do? We'd spend more than $300 getting a lawyer. How are we supposed to get proof the item was ""used"" when they THREW IT AWAY? Why does AMAZON not have any burden to provide proof as to the supposed poor condition of the returned item? Are consumers just to trust the honesty of a multi billion company which has already been slapped on the wrists for deceitful practices and abhorrent treatment of their employees.We are very angry and want our refund.",2022-08-21 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,8.0,21.0,1775,331,22,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought wireless invisible cat fence yard amazon kind cat wear collar go boundary collar buzz got august th opened pm immediately realized collar much big cat sealed box shut submitted return amazon ups store pm day important note item removed box collar promptly placed back boxfastforwardwe get email two day later amazon didnt send fence back threw away whatever supposedly send arent going refund u said want refund return fence amazon said wanted appeal reply email would respond within hour responded included delivery receipt ups store receipt etc invited come search house supposed missing fence six day later send nudge email finally reply saying fact get fence used poor condition werent going refund oh throw away protect safety employee disregarded communication consumer wed spend getting lawyer supposed get proof item used threw away amazon burden provide proof supposed poor condition returned item consumer trust honesty multi billion company already slapped wrist deceitful practice abhorrent treatment employeeswe angry want refund,0.007869923713838463,0.9921300762861616,0.1856421761076837,0.2,0.8331934733646175,83.31934733646175,High Trust
Sherri Root,/users/5f6f4b0ff29944480bfc37df,US,3.0,2022-08-21 01:24:54+00:00,1.0,Zero Star for Delivery!,"If I could give you a stars I would. I am not sure how Amazon delivery services cannot read an address. I'm going to assume that they use GPS location when they're delivering products. So how do items get delivered to a completely wrong address not even the correct street. I have no idea where my items went. But I have a picture and according to Amazon I can ""check to see if someone else has it""... Well I shouldn't have to. That's why I pay for Amazon prime! Worst part is, the items today are things I really needed this evening!! Ugh!!",2022-08-21 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,8.0,21.0,541,103,23,4,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,could give star would sure amazon delivery service cannot read address im going assume use gps location theyre delivering product item get delivered completely wrong address even correct street idea item went picture according amazon check see someone else well shouldnt thats pay amazon prime worst part item today thing really needed evening ugh,0.9846937950462187,0.015306204953781322,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.31920666389023894,31.920666389023893,Low Trust
