Bob.,/users/57065d4f0000ff000a15481d,GB,27.0,2022-08-20 10:52:53+00:00,3.0,"Prime, only any good for deliveries. Delivered from the Amazon warehouse","I find Amazon generally supplies good customer service, good prices and deliveries. However, the continual tricks used to trip people up when placing orders, making other methods of delivery (such as choosing prime) so bold and prevalent and presenting things in a confusing manner very frustrating.Prime, is only any good for deliveries coming from Amazon itself. Music, TV and other services are only given to tempt you to pay more to see the rest of the TV series or the music track you really want to hear. Take music for example. Amazon music is free with advertising, to a degree. Then you have music prime with no add’s. But to get the full Amazon music, you have to pay again. No thanks Amazon.",2022-08-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,8.0,20.0,702,123,72,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,find amazon generally supply good customer service good price delivery however continual trick used trip people placing order making method delivery choosing prime bold prevalent presenting thing confusing manner frustratingprime good delivery coming amazon music tv service given tempt pay see rest tv series music track really want hear take music example amazon music free advertising degree music prime add’s get full amazon music pay thanks amazon,0.025877314359970233,0.9741226856400298,0.06898485698261357,0.6,1.4008583142165374,140.08583142165375,High Trust
