Melton Balls,/users/62fc943fee8f770012b11394,US,1.0,2022-08-17 09:13:54+00:00,1.0,Recently On Amazon,"Recently, Amazon insists to use my phone as a way to verify my account with only text message - which is not safe - And they will not let me use my email account for verification. Now, I would find this acceptable if I could use my VPN service - but, Amazon has decided to not allow this. They also want my cellphone's microphone permissions in order to have a friendly ""chat"" through a type of web browser interface - rather than the traditional phone calls. Maybe it's just me, but I don't think it's safe to do business with them through my cell phone.",2022-08-17 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,8.0,17.0,555,105,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently amazon insists use phone way verify account text message safe let use email account verification would find acceptable could use vpn service amazon decided allow also want cellphone microphone permission order friendly chat type web browser interface rather traditional phone call maybe dont think safe business cell phone,0.04038236024543147,0.9596176397545685,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.79158672228895,79.158672228895,High Trust
Dennis Morrison,/users/62570ac81023750012dafcb8,US,7.0,2022-08-16 21:26:57+00:00,1.0,Done with Amazon,"I have been using amazon for years, but my last purchase was really my last purchase. I ordered a salt generator for my swimming pool. When it came in, we were on vacation and upon our return I didn't get in a hurry to change it out. Bottom line I installed it after the 30 day replacement period and that was entirely my fault. What is not my fault is a piece of junk part they sold me for over $500 bucks that does not work. Amazon says sorry but no recourse. I'm done with a large company that don't care after the sale. I will try to use local folks in my area in the future.",2022-08-16 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,8.0,16.0,579,117,16,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,using amazon year last purchase really last purchase ordered salt generator swimming pool came vacation upon return didnt get hurry change bottom line installed day replacement period entirely fault fault piece junk part sold buck work amazon say sorry recourse im done large company dont care sale try use local folk area future,0.017837584978807882,0.9821624150211922,0.06561974200785194,0.2,0.8042051559121665,80.42051559121664,High Trust
Lee Wilson,/users/590bbade0000ff000a94a0ab,GB,67.0,2022-08-16 20:11:22+00:00,1.0,"Amazon, awful service.","I live on the 2nd floor of a 3 floor block . . . big problem for Amazon, the drivers are too lazy to deliver to my actual address, so just dump my parcels in reception, I'm disabled and can't get down to reception . . . and items left lying around there as stolen on a daily basis . . . . so on Amazon I clearly mark my Additional Delivery Instructions as 'DO NOT LEAVE IN RECEPTION' . . I then use the Security Code field to add . . 'DO NOT LEAVE IN RECEPTION' . . and in the 'Call Box' field I add the helpful suggestion 'DO NOT LEAVE IN RECEPTION' . . . and when I get an email from DPD/Amazon saying your parcel is on the way I add in the options 'DO NOT LEAVE IN RECEPTION', they then send a reply email confirming my choice, with a great big 'DO NOT LEAVE IN RECEPTION' in bold letters.So then the parcel actually arrives, the driver doesn't ring the bell or knock on my door, he just dumps the parcel in reception and leaves.This would be frustrating if it happened once, but it happens all the time, the only thing I can do is to pay a local cab company to come to my flats, I let them in via the intercom and they look for the parcel, and if they find it before the local kids nick it, he brings it up to my flat . . .Anyhow, cancelling Prime today as it - quite literally - is pointless, and then closing down my Amazon account, back to eBay for me, eBay deliveries are not perfect, but orders of magnitude better than Amazon's indifferent, lazy, disinterested approach.",2022-08-16 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,8.0,16.0,1480,293,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,live nd floor floor block big problem amazon driver lazy deliver actual address dump parcel reception im disabled cant get reception item left lying around stolen daily basis amazon clearly mark additional delivery instruction leave reception use security code field add leave reception call box field add helpful suggestion leave reception get email dpdamazon saying parcel way add option leave reception send reply email confirming choice great big leave reception bold lettersso parcel actually arrives driver doesnt ring bell knock door dump parcel reception leavesthis would frustrating happened happens time thing pay local cab company come flat let via intercom look parcel find local kid nick brings flat anyhow cancelling prime today quite literally pointless closing amazon account back ebay ebay delivery perfect order magnitude better amazon indifferent lazy disinterested approach,0.18290980052349362,0.8170901994765064,0.16432978126752665,0.2,0.7414110559917585,74.14110559917584,Medium Trust
