goku,/users/5c600246d2a869588cd20139,GB,3.0,2022-07-28 11:17:31+00:00,1.0,Prime membership traps…,"They create prime membership traps on the website. You can become a member with one misclick but reimbursement is very difficult. It will take days, and if you do any shopping in the meantime the reimbursement is not possible anymore. So you either do not complete your shopping or pay the unwanted membership fee. Shady!",2022-07-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,7.0,28.0,321,55,23,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,create prime membership trap website become member one misclick reimbursement difficult take day shopping meantime reimbursement possible anymore either complete shopping pay unwanted membership fee shady,0.09779598005475201,0.902204019945248,0.030846887268648347,0.2,0.7572713874263537,75.72713874263538,High Trust
AC,/users/62e1fa1dd1516f0013bac735,US,1.0,2022-07-28 05:02:03+00:00,1.0,Amazon has gone to sh**,"Amazon customer service has gone to complete s***. The representatives I’ve dealt with are a new definition of unhelpful and incompetent. They hire these people and don’t give them power to do ANYTHING, or so they claim. These days, you get transferred 5 times just to speak to an even more incompetent and terribly rude manager/“leadership” rep. I don’t know where Amazon is finding these people that they’re hiring but we all know it’s likely due to the pandemic and being desperate to fill positions. They clearly don’t oversee or train these employees well, because they never know how to handle a problem, yet they act so sympathetic at first, “Oh I’m so sorry to hear that”, only to tell you they can’t do anything for you after putting you on hold for 10+ minutes (speaking from personal experience), what a f****** joke of a company Amazon and it’s employees have become. I’ve called recently in the last couple months regarding damaged items received that were non returnable. I sent picture proof of the damage as requested, and didn’t get a response for over ONE week. So I called and waited on hold for FORTY minutes, just to be told, “your images were received but they’re still being reviewed”. WHAT?! ONE WEEK to review images? How stupid are these people? And why on earth can’t these representatives have the capability to process a refund or replacement if they’re able to see the pictures I sent? That makes no sense. I absolutely hate how Amazon has created this script for their reps to use with customers. The reps tell you they can’t help you, when some of them probably wish they could, but leadership isn’t allowing it.Amazon leadership thinks they’re establishing superiority over other companies by being greedy and corrupt towards their customers, when its clearly having the opposite effect. Amazon is going to lose a massive customer base if they haven’t started to already. Their “empire” is about to collapse. I’ll end this with saying they’ll reap what they sow, which is exploitation.",2022-07-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,7.0,28.0,2018,343,23,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service gone complete representative i’ve dealt new definition unhelpful incompetent hire people don’t give power anything claim day get transferred time speak even incompetent terribly rude manager“leadership” rep don’t know amazon finding people they’re hiring know it’s likely due pandemic desperate fill position clearly don’t oversee train employee well never know handle problem yet act sympathetic first “oh i’m sorry hear that” tell can’t anything putting hold minute speaking personal experience f joke company amazon it’s employee become i’ve called recently last couple month regarding damaged item received non returnable sent picture proof damage requested didn’t get response one week called waited hold forty minute told “your image received they’re still reviewed” one week review image stupid people earth can’t representative capability process refund replacement they’re able see picture sent make sense absolutely hate amazon created script rep use customer rep tell can’t help probably wish could leadership isn’t allowing itamazon leadership think they’re establishing superiority company greedy corrupt towards customer clearly opposite effect amazon going lose massive customer base haven’t started already “empire” collapse i’ll end saying they’ll reap sow exploitation,0.05924915213263094,0.9407508478673691,0.19237240605720696,0.2,0.8088499051451259,80.8849905145126,High Trust
