Melissa,/users/62d371f7de5efa001206c732,CA,1.0,2022-07-17 04:21:33+00:00,1.0,Terrible Customer service!!,"This is the worst customer service I have ever experienced!! I recieved a pair of shoes that didn't fit, so I ordered a bigger size, and asked them to return the small ones. I received an email that they would be here between 11 and 2, and nobody showed up. I called customer service, they said the delivery company said they were here (they weren't) and the girl on the phone basically said I was wrong and there's nothing she can do. And I said then you can cancel my membership and I will never order another thing from Amazon. She replied, sure mam, I'll take care of that for you now...all done, have a nice evening. I guess they make enough money that one person's business doesn't mean anything to them. Worst service on the planet!!!",2022-07-17 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,7.0,17.0,741,137,27,3,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,worst customer service ever experienced recieved pair shoe didnt fit ordered bigger size asked return small one received email would nobody showed called customer service said delivery company said werent girl phone basically said wrong there nothing said cancel membership never order another thing amazon replied sure mam ill take care nowall done nice evening guess make enough money one person business doesnt mean anything worst service planet,0.9868156233352117,0.013184376664788333,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.32195954671713894,32.19595467171389,Low Trust
