Tashina Wolford,/users/62c8f3cc29eead0012562e7b,US,5.0,2022-07-09 05:19:52+00:00,1.0,Search is a joke,"Used to, I could enter what I needed in the search bar and get a list of choices of what I was looking for. Now when I search it shows me everything but what I'm looking for. So It takes me 30 minutes to an hour or more to find what I'm looking for and when I do, it doesn't even show you all search results even with filters. I'm sorry, but there are more than 10 sellers of a product on amazon and this company is deliberately filtering out most of them for their own gains. Not only are they taking advantage of customers, they are also hurting seller profits, sellers that are paying them a fee to sell through them. This has gotten so ridiculous that I've decided to close my account and starting to use ebay and Walmart from now on.",2022-07-09 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,7.0,9.0,738,144,16,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used could enter needed search bar get list choice looking search show everything im looking take minute hour find im looking doesnt even show search result even filter im sorry seller product amazon company deliberately filtering gain taking advantage customer also hurting seller profit seller paying fee sell gotten ridiculous ive decided close account starting use ebay walmart,0.014230028372439378,0.9857699716275606,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.8090375376926362,80.90375376926362,High Trust
Tamara ****,/users/5caf8ef01cbaac8e98072ff0,CA,6.0,2022-07-10 04:22:20+00:00,1.0,Do not order any international order…,"Do not order any international orders through Amazon they go from Landmark to Apple Express and they can't be counted on for a delivery. This is second time I have not received my package. Amazon extends the date for deliveries past the promised time so you basically have paid for an item that does not arrive. It is BS that the delivery dates are extended. I am really angry so let this be a warning for others to be careful when placing an international order unless you don't mind the hassle with the delivery issues.  Finally a good customer service representative with Amazon, Paolo issued  refund. I learned not to order items that are not fulfilled by Amazon.",2022-07-09 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,7.0,10.0,667,118,37,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,order international order amazon go landmark apple express cant counted delivery second time received package amazon extends date delivery past promised time basically paid item arrive b delivery date extended really angry let warning others careful placing international order unless dont mind hassle delivery issue finally good customer service representative amazon paolo issued refund learned order item fulfilled amazon,0.008192327991620162,0.9918076720083798,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.809139954904919,80.9139954904919,High Trust
