Richard Caldeira,/users/5c473f3ad201f7d3082076b8,GB,42.0,2022-07-08 21:04:04+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime an utter rip off,"Amazon Prime an utter rip off, you pay for a service which promises next day delivery but in fact takes over a week. Goods are not even dispatched for two or three days after they take the money from your card.Customer services are another joke, half of them don’t understand English and it’s a nightmare trying to communicate with them. I only use Amazon for things which I’m in no hurry for or things that I can’t find locally.I can see Amazon winding down very soon if this is how they treat customers.",2022-07-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,7.0,8.0,505,93,29,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime utter rip pay service promise next day delivery fact take week good even dispatched two three day take money cardcustomer service another joke half don’t understand english it’s nightmare trying communicate use amazon thing i’m hurry thing can’t find locallyi see amazon winding soon treat customer,0.025312049486000087,0.9746879505139999,0.05215928210880538,0.2,0.797775831678761,79.7775831678761,High Trust
