Mr Jim Porter,/users/52cae01f00006400015d2480,GB,49.0,2022-07-06 20:36:20+00:00,1.0,Don't Trust Amazon Reviews or Feedback,I made a purchase on Amazon for a 5ltr Roundup Weedkiller refill. It never arrived. As per Amazon's procedures I contacted the seller and he claimed delivery problems and cancelled my order and refunded my money. When I looked for an alternative supplier on Amazon I saw that the original supplier was still advertising the same Roundup Weedkiller but the price had gone up by £2. Thinking that the price hike was probably the true reason for non delivery I re-ordered with the same supplier at the new price. It never arrived again. I contacted the seller and again he cancelled the order and I am waiting to get my money back. I left negative feedback on this seller on the Amazon site. When I checked to see it published Amazon had cancelled my feedback as the seller had complained and asked for it to be removed. This was done in spite of there being at least twenty recent feedback complaints about this seller not delivering goods that had been paid for. What is the point of leaving feedback? Don't waste your time relying on seller feedback and reviews on Amazon as they don't want to discourage their sellers even if they are operating some kind of scam.,2022-07-06 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,7.0,6.0,1164,208,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,made purchase amazon ltr roundup weedkiller refill never arrived per amazon procedure contacted seller claimed delivery problem cancelled order refunded money looked alternative supplier amazon saw original supplier still advertising roundup weedkiller price gone £ thinking price hike probably true reason non delivery reordered supplier new price never arrived contacted seller cancelled order waiting get money back left negative feedback seller amazon site checked see published amazon cancelled feedback seller complained asked removed done spite least twenty recent feedback complaint seller delivering good paid point leaving feedback dont waste time relying seller feedback review amazon dont want discourage seller even operating kind scam,0.036893949332941454,0.9631060506670586,0.1166573191250701,0.2,0.8048844891585433,80.48844891585432,High Trust
