Daily Shopper,/users/62bcb1faebda300013111a76,US,1.0,2022-06-29 22:14:08+00:00,5.0,Today I received a package from Amazon…,"Today I received a package from Amazon that had several heavier items placed in the same box, like soda, pantry food items, etc.. One item was a package of ""three flat pizza crusts"" that arrived crushed and broken by the heavier items. I went to Amazon online. I was patient, followed the prompts and I was taken to a page that gave me a choice for either a direct call, chat or email. I chose ""call me"" and my phone rang instantly. The customer service agent took note of what I said, asked me if this has happened before and then immediately issued me another order free of charge with an apology.For me, Amazon customer service has always been exceptional. Professional, prompt and courteous. Because of this level of service, I'll be a lifelong customer.",2022-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,29.0,758,135,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,today received package amazon several heavier item placed box like soda pantry food item etc one item package three flat pizza crust arrived crushed broken heavier item went amazon online patient followed prompt taken page gave choice either direct call chat email chose call phone rang instantly customer service agent took note said asked happened immediately issued another order free charge apologyfor amazon customer service always exceptional professional prompt courteous level service ill lifelong customer,0.045981479793462766,0.9540185202065372,0.07571508693213685,1.0,1.9921522774896958,199.21522774896957,High Trust
