Malcolm Campbell,/users/62b497c1e881b30013a441be,GB,3.0,2022-06-23 18:41:50+00:00,1.0,The delivery is abysmal,"The delivery is abysmal. I live in sheltered housing and I'm housebound, so I ask for delivery to my flat on the first floor.  But constantly they leave my parcels in the lobby with 50 odd other flats , staff , visitors and tradesmen going in and out. Anyone could take them .    But this time it wasn't even inside. It was outside on a busy main road. The driver didn't even text or phone me , or use my intercom . He just dumped it outside on the street in full view.  If it hadn't been for a neighbour coming in picking it up and delivering it to me it would at best still be out there , and at worst stolen.   ABSOLUTELY DISGRACEFUL DELIVERY AMAZON !!!",2022-06-23 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,23.0,656,128,23,4,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,delivery abysmal live sheltered housing im housebound ask delivery flat first floor constantly leave parcel lobby odd flat staff visitor tradesman going anyone could take time wasnt even inside outside busy main road driver didnt even text phone use intercom dumped outside street full view hadnt neighbour coming picking delivering would best still worst stolen absolutely disgraceful delivery amazon,0.8427862369331762,0.15721376306682378,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.3929647054257282,39.29647054257282,Low Trust
