Rebecca Harter,/users/62b37768ab7a6a0012bc4311,US,1.0,2022-06-22 22:11:32+00:00,1.0,I received an empty package,"I received an empty package. And was told to call the post office and find my Contents. The post office had placed a sticker on the package that said... received open and no contents. No refund. I thought ok I'll eat that cost. Shame on me... yesterday I received a box completely undamaged, all but one thing was fine. The one broken part was damaged the plastic packaging in came in was opened and broken. It was shipped broken nothing else not even the box was damaged. I contacted customer service. They wanted me to drive to the post office, granted my car is broken hints why I ordered from amazon in the first place, to return a cheap plastic part that probably costed pennies to make.  So the post office could inturn ship it back to them. I told them I would try and fix the part myself. But my complaint is their ""climate friendly"" isn't very environmentally friendly if it requires cheap plastic parts to be shipped 100's of miles to replace a broken part shipped out by their fulfillment center.",2022-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,22.0,1007,183,27,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,received empty package told call post office find content post office placed sticker package said received open content refund thought ok ill eat cost shame yesterday received box completely undamaged one thing fine one broken part damaged plastic packaging came opened broken shipped broken nothing else even box damaged contacted customer service wanted drive post office granted car broken hint ordered amazon first place return cheap plastic part probably costed penny make post office could inturn ship back told would try fix part complaint climate friendly isnt environmentally friendly requires cheap plastic part shipped mile replace broken part shipped fulfillment center,0.02406478209273517,0.9759352179072648,0.10263600673022995,0.2,0.8084948102996784,80.84948102996783,High Trust
Mary Mitzi Prefontaine,/users/56c7c4f70000ff000a07d0d7,US,6.0,2022-06-22 19:46:03+00:00,2.0,My issue is tech support on items I buy…,"My issue is tech support on items I buy from them. It is very sporadic on occasion you get a tech that actually knows what he/she is doing. When trying to work with my Alexa purchase many years ago. I recently been having problems with my alexa constantly unable to discover or function with my smart home devices. After about a six calls, 8-10 hours of trying and 2 days later, i finally got a tech who was able to help me fix the issue within moments!but all the other techs, kept having me reboot my system or delete everything and start over. Many of them ask please bear with me and give me a chance to correct this( which I did many times) Only to realize they did absolutely nothing to help me I continued to have issues. I would prefer to go directly to the companies that make those Alexa products, because Amazon tech support is basically useless! If youre gonna buy something technological from Amazon always request the main number to contact the company before you purchase it! Do not let them tell you “oh we have tech-support here. That is my advice as I am now going to start all over once again. I have spent a lot of money on Amazon and all I request is to give me the proper phone number so I can call and make sure I won’t get proper tech-support on the product!",2022-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,22.0,1282,243,40,9,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,issue tech support item buy sporadic occasion get tech actually know heshe trying work alexa purchase many year ago recently problem alexa constantly unable discover function smart home device six call hour trying day later finally got tech able help fix issue within momentsbut tech kept reboot system delete everything start many ask please bear give chance correct many time realize absolutely nothing help continued issue would prefer go directly company make alexa product amazon tech support basically useless youre gonna buy something technological amazon always request main number contact company purchase let tell “oh techsupport advice going start spent lot money amazon request give proper phone number call make sure won’t get proper techsupport product,0.8562739119317369,0.14372608806826315,0.13628715647784634,0.4,0.6991204753297008,69.91204753297008,Medium Trust
Emily Lane,/users/62b3414cc7ff9c0013865a65,US,1.0,2022-06-22 18:20:43+00:00,1.0,Amazon delivery is non-functional,"It’s pretty ironic that a company that got its start delivering books can no longer seem to accomplish this simple task.  I receive my mail and packages at a mailbox store, which has normal business hours.  I have noted this in the delivery instructions on my Amazon profile, and even entered their hours of operation.  Yet Amazon delivery people keep trying to deliver packages after hours, and the mailbox store employees routinely find Amazon packages that have been dumped at their front and back entrances.  Despite the fact that they have posted large signs telling Amazon drivers not to do this, that all deliveries must be brought inside during normal business hours.  Lately I’ve had experiences where whatever I order, if it’s being sent by Amazon delivery it shows,”Will be delivered by 10pm today”.  And then the item never shows up.  Seriously? First of all, who wants a delivery person banging on their door at 10 pm, and secondly, it seems that Amazon doesn’t actually take into account their customer’s delivery instructions.  There are other online retailers who don’t seem to have a problem with simple things like delivering an item that I’ve ordered, so I will be canceling my “Prime” membership and shopping elsewhere.",2022-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,22.0,1239,205,33,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,it’s pretty ironic company got start delivering book longer seem accomplish simple task receive mail package mailbox store normal business hour noted delivery instruction amazon profile even entered hour operation yet amazon delivery people keep trying deliver package hour mailbox store employee routinely find amazon package dumped front back entrance despite fact posted large sign telling amazon driver delivery must brought inside normal business hour lately i’ve experience whatever order it’s sent amazon delivery shows”will delivered pm today” item never show seriously first want delivery person banging door pm secondly seems amazon doesn’t actually take account customer’s delivery instruction online retailer don’t seem problem simple thing like delivering item i’ve ordered canceling “prime” membership shopping elsewhere,0.005926240920282174,0.9940737590797178,0.11497476163768929,0.2,0.8200318318673968,82.00318318673968,High Trust
Suzi Zhao,/users/6284a4864a9f5900124d27cd,NL,7.0,2022-06-22 12:02:06+00:00,1.0,I felt threatened by the support team...,"Terrible support service. I had a technical issue as a seller and reached their support team for help. The response was within hours which is good, and they do provide a solution to it. However, after trying to solve it, the problem came back again. Therefore I reopened the case and explained more in detail the situation. Finally the next day I received another reply and which is:"" We have reviewed your case and have provided you with all the information we can provide. We understand that you may be disappointed with the outcome of your case. However, our records indicate that this decision is FINAL. If we’ve informed you that no further action will be taken on an issue, don’t seek to obtain a different outcome by reopening the case or raising it again in other cases. Amazon may close cases or limit support if you don’t follow these guidelines.""I am still in shock as I have never felt threatened by any customer service in my life and they are not even trying to help me solve the problem. No wonder the business is falling.",2022-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,22.0,1037,186,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,terrible support service technical issue seller reached support team help response within hour good provide solution however trying solve problem came back therefore reopened case explained detail situation finally next day received another reply reviewed case provided information provide understand may disappointed outcome case however record indicate decision final we’ve informed action taken issue don’t seek obtain different outcome reopening case raising case amazon may close case limit support don’t follow guidelinesi still shock never felt threatened customer service life even trying help solve problem wonder business falling,0.006128266435744267,0.9938717335642557,0.10431856421761077,0.2,0.81779957962565,81.77995796256499,High Trust
Jason willington,/users/5405ca3000006400018821ca,GB,29.0,2022-06-22 07:49:13+00:00,1.0,Shocking customer service,Under no circumstances shop or buy from in-store or online via Amazon from SLK MOBILITY. We have bought replacement batteries for our mothers mobility scooter which only lasted for four months. All they did was just keep going round and round in circles to avoid giving any replacement or refund. They have non existent warranty and no customer service whatsoever. The worst UK company we have ever come across.One minute Amazon are nearly offering us a refund and next minute they're not. This is how the disabled and the elderly are treated in the UK. Please share this.....,2022-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,22.0,576,98,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,circumstance shop buy instore online via amazon slk mobility bought replacement battery mother mobility scooter lasted four month keep going round round circle avoid giving replacement refund non existent warranty customer service whatsoever worst uk company ever come acrossone minute amazon nearly offering u refund next minute theyre disabled elderly treated uk please share,0.03227202964013829,0.9677279703598617,0.054963544587773416,0.2,0.7948566940974855,79.48566940974855,High Trust
