G&D Maxwell,/users/62b0e81db5e4a90013ff73e6,US,1.0,2022-06-20 23:35:44+00:00,1.0,Customers taken for Granted ? Makes you wonder.,"On June 5, 2022, I placed an order #113-7833-464-7799409; for a set of paper plates for $22.30, a total of 176 plates. Then it was noted as having been delivered on June 9, 2022.Problem is the delivery person put package on incorrect steps, so I did not receive the paper platesI asked Amazon and the Seller, B-N Mart for a refund; did not ask for replacement for fear that the same mis-delivery would happen.Neither Amazon nor B-N Mart offer any refund. Amazon claims that B-N Mart is not included in the 'A-Z Guarantee List of Sellers. My contention why then didn't Amazon have a notice posted on the B-N Mart website, and/or B-N Mart disclose these restrictions ? Also why is this lack of information not seen as Poor Customer Service ? Or is it that neither Amazon and/or B-N Mart really cares about disclosure concerning returns and/or replacements once your payment is processed. Why does Amazon advise after the fact, with a link explaining the ""A-Z Guarantee./All of these unaswered questions is lack of consideration for customers' money, in particular being elderly and on a fixed income is very discouraging and makes me hesitant to shop on Amazon, especially without any notice on the Sellers' webpages without refunds, and replacements. Sign Daaiyah Shabazz, thank you for listening",2022-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,20.0,1295,218,47,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,june placed order set paper plate total plate noted delivered june problem delivery person put package incorrect step receive paper platesi asked amazon seller bn mart refund ask replacement fear misdelivery would happenneither amazon bn mart offer refund amazon claim bn mart included az guarantee list seller contention didnt amazon notice posted bn mart website andor bn mart disclose restriction also lack information seen poor customer service neither amazon andor bn mart really care disclosure concerning return andor replacement payment processed amazon advise fact link explaining az guaranteeall unaswered question lack consideration customer money particular elderly fixed income discouraging make hesitant shop amazon especially without notice seller webpage without refund replacement sign daaiyah shabazz thank listening,0.010173534575944812,0.9898264654240552,0.12226584408300617,0.2,0.8193664015286288,81.93664015286288,High Trust
