Vitalie,/users/5e0f20fe361d61433f0c1b33,GB,4.0,2022-06-20 15:10:11+00:00,1.0,Samsung S20 Plus 5G,"Samsung S20 Plus 5GORDER # 204-2172993-2603509The seller PixelDirect is a LIAR and clearly breaking the law by misrepresenting!If you don’t want to waste your precious time – AVOID !!!On the 9th of June 2022, I bought a renewed smartphone - Samsung S20 Plus 5G, on amazon.co.uk which was sold by PixelDirect.Important to mention that this is a used phone, as you could easily notice the dirt which accumulates with time into the small holes of the phone.Under the section ‘’What’s in the box?’’, was listed a list of accessories which were missing when I received the product (the delivery was late as well).I contact the seller, he replied to me that renewed products are not coming with accessories.I sent him the screenshots when I placed the order and where it clearly said what was supposed to be in the box and that ‘’All Amazon renewed purchases will come with accessories that may not be original but will be compatible and fully functional’’ and asked him to explain that.His answer was that this applies to new items, and that renewed items are not supplied with the accessories. Also, he asked me to return the product for a refund. Their address is Pixel Direct (Amazon Return), 353 Hoe St, London, E17 9AP.That is a clear misrepresentation which is against the law!He wants me to send the product back, but what about the inconvenience and all my time wasted for moving the information and all the apps from the old phone to the new one and that I have to repeat the entire process again to be able to send the phone back?Who’s compensating for all the distress?!At this point, I called Amazon Customer Service. The assistant had a look at it and confirmed that the product must have the accessories listed on the web page.Her answer was that as the product was sold by a 3rd party seller, there is nothing she can do.The BIG question is Why then do you allow such sellers to be on your platform? Are you not responsible for the misrepresentation on your platform?I asked the assistant to connect me to her line manager/supervisor and she said that she cannot connect me with one, but that they will contact me in 48 hours. That didn’t happen.Shame on you amazon.co.uk, your customer service is becoming worse and worse. Such experiences are showing you the real face of the AMAZON.That proves that your platform is the perfect place for dodgy sellers and scammers!AVOID !",2022-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,20.0,2385,415,19,4,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,samsung plus gorder seller pixeldirect liar clearly breaking law misrepresentingif don’t want waste precious time – avoid th june bought renewed smartphone samsung plus g amazoncouk sold pixeldirectimportant mention used phone could easily notice dirt accumulates time small hole phoneunder section ‘’what’s box’’ listed list accessory missing received product delivery late welli contact seller replied renewed product coming accessoriesi sent screenshots placed order clearly said supposed box ‘’all amazon renewed purchase come accessory may original compatible fully functional’’ asked explain thathis answer applies new item renewed item supplied accessory also asked return product refund address pixel direct amazon return hoe st london e apthat clear misrepresentation lawhe want send product back inconvenience time wasted moving information apps old phone new one repeat entire process able send phone backwho’s compensating distressat point called amazon customer service assistant look confirmed product must accessory listed web pageher answer product sold rd party seller nothing dothe big question allow seller platform responsible misrepresentation platformi asked assistant connect line managersupervisor said cannot connect one contact hour didn’t happenshame amazoncouk customer service becoming worse worse experience showing real face amazonthat prof platform perfect place dodgy seller scammersavoid,0.9996180352285952,0.0003819647714048413,0.2327537857543466,0.2,0.3467417395365717,34.674173953657174,Low Trust
Graham MOORE,/users/4f27f4640000640001131190,GB,27.0,2022-06-20 13:37:13+00:00,1.0,Uncaring and incompetent,"Impossible to deal with customer service. I purchased an echo show as a gift for an elderly, blind lady.After a power cut the machine would not reconnect.I tried to help but Amazon blocked her account.Numerous attempts to reset,many attempts to deal with Amazon service -all fobbed off to various other departments.A blind elderly lady has been ignored and no help given.Shame on Amazon",2022-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,20.0,386,63,24,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,impossible deal customer service purchased echo show gift elderly blind ladyafter power cut machine would reconnecti tried help amazon blocked accountnumerous attempt resetmany attempt deal amazon service fobbed various departmentsa blind elderly lady ignored help givenshame amazon,0.08464440411294946,0.9153555958870505,0.035333707234997194,0.2,0.7647445393905247,76.47445393905247,High Trust
popadog,/users/5c609642dd5dea2482651cfb,GB,5.0,2022-06-20 12:58:58+00:00,2.0,Amazon maybe the quickest way to get…,"Amazon maybe the quickest way to get what you want but it isn’t always the best option; customer service is frankly overall poor; frequent contact after purchase is necessary to report poor construction, inferior materials and specification in the face of Amazon’s massive under-cutting of UK manufacturers; undermining the value of the UK highstreet just to get back your hard-earner cash. Agents are sometime helpful but often slow to act when challenged over repeated account violations by Sellers who try to interfere with the returns process or who object to some reviews; Amazon and it’s Sellers are overly sensitive to criticism; I’ve finally pulled the plug on online purchases from the big A, cancelled my Prime package and frozen my Amazon New Day linked credit card account after repeated attempts to take money not authorised by me. Had to invoke fraud investigation to stop this worrying account activity and force an investigation. Outcome unsatisfactory!!",2022-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,20.0,970,154,37,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon maybe quickest way get want isn’t always best option customer service frankly overall poor frequent contact purchase necessary report poor construction inferior material specification face amazon’s massive undercutting uk manufacturer undermining value uk highstreet get back hardearner cash agent sometime helpful often slow act challenged repeated account violation seller try interfere return process object review amazon it’s seller overly sensitive criticism i’ve finally pulled plug online purchase big cancelled prime package frozen amazon new day linked credit card account repeated attempt take money authorised invoke fraud investigation stop worrying account activity force investigation outcome unsatisfactory,0.12459110683844812,0.8754088931615519,0.08637128435221536,0.4,1.054978703451219,105.4978703451219,High Trust
Andrew Torok,/users/590dfe010000ff000a95346e,US,11.0,2022-06-20 04:24:03+00:00,1.0,Not fair!,"In genera! I am an Amazon junkie. I love tthose packages coming in day after day. I think they have one of the best delivery systems in the business. So why a one star? When they protect sellers so customers can't post an honest review I think that is a dis-service. I recently received a gift which  would have benefited from an honest review but Amazon blocked it by saying there was an unusual level of activity so only reviews by senders could be written. Duh, how could they know? Not fair. I was blocked from writing a review, being the recipient of the gift.",2022-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,20.0,565,105,9,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,genus amazon junkie love tthose package coming day day think one best delivery system business one star protect seller customer cant post honest review think disservice recently received gift would benefited honest review amazon blocked saying unusual level activity review sender could written duh could know fair blocked writing review recipient gift,0.19645239732888073,0.8035476026711192,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.7135517037472254,71.35517037472255,Medium Trust
Jerry Jocoy,/users/5e6a5f9cbaa518afab1541d6,US,32.0,2022-06-20 03:10:37+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime is crap,"Amazon Prime is crap first of all I order an Al Mar knife for $140 and then what I get is a counterfeit $30 knife I send it back and they tell me I may have to wait 30 days to get my money back! Second thing I order 4 air filters for my RV A/C and I get the package and there's two filters in there they want me to take my filter out put my dirty one back in my air conditioner and send it back to them for them to do anything about it. I'm tired of their incompetence, and they're Crooks!",2022-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,20.0,489,105,20,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime crap first order al mar knife get counterfeit knife send back tell may wait day get money back second thing order air filter rv ac get package there two filter want take filter put dirty one back air conditioner send back anything im tired incompetence theyre crook,0.5678201043654916,0.4321798956345084,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.52786785022892,52.786785022892005,Medium Trust
EricRay,/users/5db91f257354d7448a8158cb,US,4.0,2022-06-19 20:00:55+00:00,2.0,Same day bait & switch - delivery,"Nothing more frustrating than ordering particular items (and dollar value) to get same day shipping - and then NOT get same day shipping. Worse, is watching the delivery tracker - seeing the truck 2 stops away - and then - BOOM - tracker stops, and package not delivered. Driver simply stopped delivering - yet still 2 hours left in the delivery window. Same day instantly becomes next day - and not like next day morning - next day - who knows...???This is equivalent of bait and switch. I chose certain items because of the same day shipping. If it wasn't going to be same day, I would've selected other items at lesser cost.Delivery seems to be the weak link in the chain. Amazon should better audit delivery personnel and activity (especially on weekends when it seems drivers will take the liberty to knock off early...)",2022-06-19 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,19.0,825,145,33,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,nothing frustrating ordering particular item dollar value get day shipping get day shipping worse watching delivery tracker seeing truck stop away boom tracker stop package delivered driver simply stopped delivering yet still hour left delivery window day instantly becomes next day like next day morning next day knowsthis equivalent bait switch chose certain item day shipping wasnt going day wouldve selected item lesser costdelivery seems weak link chain amazon better audit delivery personnel activity especially weekend seems driver take liberty knock early,0.008711723890001096,0.9912882761099989,0.08132361189007291,0.4,1.111908860433014,111.1908860433014,High Trust
Francesca,/users/62af55ff3204320015449534,ES,1.0,2022-06-19 18:59:54+00:00,1.0,Don’t ever use Amazon.es,"Don’t ever use Amazon.es! Faulty items that Amazon does not want to take responsibility for even though it was Amazon that sold and delivered it. I bought some baby items well in time for the baby’s arrival. I had a quick look to see if everything was there and it looked fine but obviously didn’t put it up including a travel cot/changer as I wasn’t due any time at that point, I got it early just in case as you never know when the baby decides to come. When I did get to put it all up, there was a clip missing to hold the changer up safely onto the cot, this is something I would t know was missing without the whole thing up and reading instructions etc. I contacted Amazon and they shrugged it off saying the policy is complain within 30 days. This isn’t realistic for this sinario but they didn’t want to know. I only wanted the missing item! I didn’t want a refund or a return, I just wanted the clip which I am unable to buy separately. They didn’t care and didn’t want to know!! It’s so black and white with Amazon and will use anything to avoid responsibility and to compensate a faulty item! I might as well paid a lot less for the same item as I am unable to use the other aspects. It’s now just a travel cot. I paid €110 for a travel cot!!! Don’t bother! Go to a shop or use a different online sight!",2022-06-19 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,19.0,1314,257,24,4,0.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,don’t ever use amazones faulty item amazon want take responsibility even though amazon sold delivered bought baby item well time baby’s arrival quick look see everything looked fine obviously didn’t put including travel cotchanger wasn’t due time point got early case never know baby decides come get put clip missing hold changer safely onto cot something would know missing without whole thing reading instruction etc contacted amazon shrugged saying policy complain within day isn’t realistic sinario didn’t want know wanted missing item didn’t want refund return wanted clip unable buy separately didn’t care didn’t want know it’s black white amazon use anything avoid responsibility compensate faulty item might well paid lot less item unable use aspect it’s travel cot paid € travel cot don’t bother go shop use different online sight,0.9999816151691142,1.8384830885787018e-05,0.1441390914189568,0.2,0.32883701069923427,32.883701069923426,Low Trust
