mark,/users/57e51a4b0000ff000a471551,GB,24.0,2022-06-17 10:44:32+00:00,1.0,No Wonder Bezos is so rich,"No Wonder Bezos is so rich, they couldn't process my order for a kitchen knife set and despite a couple of hours in live chat they just gave in telling me they didn't know why the order wouldn't verify and they would get back to me which they never did. They did offer a £5 voucher though but then failed to add it to my account. Then the order never came on the day of delivery,  waited for 6 hours and tracked the driver to the next village and I was the next drop, but he decided to go home and they call that 'attempting to deliver' So after the failed attempt they tell me its coming the next day. The next day (2 days of work costing me £260 as I am self employed and you have to present if they are delivering knives) they tell me my knives are missing, but not lost. So they might come they might not. I question the £5 voucher I didn't receive previously and they give me the £5 voucher I am already owed but offer not one penny for the two days I have lost or time or frustration, and the reason why? Because they can only offer £5 a day!  The worst service I have had from anyone in any industry for a very long time.",2022-06-17 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,17.0,1128,226,26,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,wonder bezos rich couldnt process order kitchen knife set despite couple hour live chat gave telling didnt know order wouldnt verify would get back never offer £ voucher though failed add account order never came day delivery waited hour tracked driver next village next drop decided go home call attempting deliver failed attempt tell coming next day next day day work costing £ self employed present delivering knife tell knife missing lost might come might question £ voucher didnt receive previously give £ voucher already owed offer one penny two day lost time frustration reason offer £ day worst service anyone industry long time,0.046833821954407835,0.9531661780455921,0.126752664049