hats happens pay cheap staff every department used customer service issue trying reach someone kdp upload book since april resolve issue error issue dont say error keep getting cut chat cant help situation incompetent sometimes return call request call back spoke someone day promised email upload file see wont upload end email received,0.012504124769897767,0.9874958752301022,0.1435782389231632,0.2,0.8224635853996838,82.24635853996838,High Trust
