Baz,/users/5fa52a8dfb869e001acc4515,GB,19.0,2022-06-11 19:42:28+00:00,1.0,Suspicious activity,"So I received an unsolicited parcel to my address with a name on it not associated with my address or my account but with my correct address, hence it came to me. Try and get that over to their customers service reps.. The first rep seemed quite competent and said it would be investigated internally and to dispose or keep the items.I then get a generic email from customer services basically saying it was a gift and they would let the sender know my appreciation.WHAT!!! So I get back to online chat again trying to explain it was not a gift but probably a scam sometimes known as 'Brushing' from a fake account. I do not want it, nerver ordered it and certainly do not want you to give them my appreciation.  I then get given  a page to report an unwanted parcel with options to tick but as usual the option I want is not there. So I've now deleted my account as I cannot trust Amazon's security or being able to report suspicious activity.",2022-06-11 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,11.0,944,176,19,2,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,received unsolicited parcel address name associated address account correct address hence came try get customer service rep first rep seemed quite competent said would investigated internally dispose keep itemsi get generic email customer service basically saying gift would let sender know appreciationwhat get back online chat trying explain gift probably scam sometimes known brushing fake account want nerver ordered certainly want give appreciation get given page report unwanted parcel option tick usual option want ive deleted account cannot trust amazon security able report suspicious activity,0.7980144483046661,0.20198555169533394,0.09871003925967471,0.2,0.42073478369960193,42.07347836996019,Low Trust
