Stephen DeMay,/users/5ca638cd2fe348ec5713c0c4,US,5.0,2022-06-16 18:54:22+00:00,1.0,A mess,"Dumb crs and managers A to Z protection will not cover cost of pick up. A pig's breakfast in trying to resolve problems.update : Trying to get a US based manager takes a long time. Then the managers are completely ignorant of company A to Z operation. Amazon does not require sellers to provide pre paid return labels even if item is wrong item or broken.Almost all managers are schmos and contradictory information is the norm. Still great for inexpensive items but buying expensive items is a risk. CR people are polite but dunb asses. Ebay policies are clear and well enforced. Never thought I'd see the day when ebay , even with direct telephone contact no longer available, is better for buyers than Amazon Stephen Stephen",2022-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,16.0,727,127,6,2,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,dumb cr manager z protection cover cost pick pig breakfast trying resolve problemsupdate trying get u based manager take long time manager completely ignorant company z operation amazon require seller provide pre paid return label even item wrong item brokenalmost manager schmo contradictory information norm still great inexpensive item buying expensive item risk cr people polite dunb ass ebay policy clear well enforced never thought id see day ebay even direct telephone contact longer available better buyer amazon stephen stephen,0.02211749846894303,0.9778825015310569,0.071228266965788,0.2,0.8031869041586861,80.31869041586862,High Trust
