Betsy,/users/590e1eb30000ff000a953d06,GB,16.0,2022-06-08 18:37:23+00:00,1.0,Would get -1 if I could!,Purchased some AirPods which I waited in for all day and noted the driver was ‘3 stops away’. 1hr later and tracking said they’d been delivered even though my Ring doorbell says otherwise… spoke with Amazon and they said to go and check all my neighbours to which I said no as 1. Didn’t ask for the parcel to be delivered to a neighbour 2. Wasn’t wasting my time going door to door when they couldn’t provide a supposed address the package was delivered to - basically they had no idea where it was! They agreed to send out a replacement and was happy to see this was delivered on the day stated. When I got home I went straight out to get the parcel and noticed it was extremely light and it turns out the Amazon parcel was completely empty 🙃 nothing in there at all but no tampering with the packaging… had the packager or delivery driver stolen them?? Another phone call to Amazon and they couldn’t really have been less bothered that 2 x £100 items have vanished off the face of the Earth and left me wondering where my order was. Issued a refund but offered no explanation as to what may have happened and left me feeling hesitant to ever use them again (also cancelled my Prime account),2022-06-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,8.0,1192,223,24,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,purchased airpods waited day noted driver ‘ stop away’ hr later tracking said they’d delivered even though ring doorbell say otherwise… spoke amazon said go check neighbour said didn’t ask parcel delivered neighbour wasn’t wasting time going door door couldn’t provide supposed address package delivered basically idea agreed send replacement happy see delivered day stated got home went straight get parcel noticed extremely light turn amazon parcel completely empty 🙃 nothing tampering packaging… packager delivery driver stolen another phone call amazon couldn’t really less bothered x £ item vanished face earth left wondering 