Marge Daws,/users/5fc8ca5847a9d7001c92171c,GB,24.0,2022-06-08 13:52:15+00:00,1.0,Bought a 32” JVC tv which stopped…,"Bought a 32” JVC tv which stopped working after 4 years. The tv had hardly been used having been a tv in the spare room for guests. After contacting Amazon I was advised that as the 2 year warrant has expired there is nothing that can be done. I was told to contact Kaza UK, the third party seller selling through Amazon. Again, I was told warranty is 2 years and has expired. I stated the Consumer Rights Act for electrical goods which says if an item is faulty within 6 years it must be replaced or refunded in full. None of this has been complied with by either Amazon or Kaza UK which is extremely disappointing. Therefore I have no choice but to purchase a replacement at a cost of over £200 which is very unfair as a consumer not being treated fairly or in accordance with the current legislation. I was told to get an expert report to prove the tv is faulty which would cost more than the resale value. Therefore, my only option was to purchase another tv. I bought from Richer Sounds who have 6 year warranty with all their tv’s, excellent reviews and amazing customer service. DO NOT BUY A TV FROM AMAZON OR KAZA UK IS MY ADVICE.",2022-06-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,8.0,1138,215,34,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought ” jvc tv stopped working year tv hardly used tv spare room guest contacting amazon advised year warrant expired nothing done told contact kaza uk third party seller selling amazon told warranty year expired stated consumer right act electrical good say item faulty within year must replaced refunded full none complied either amazon kaza uk extremely disappointing therefore choice purchase replacement cost £ unfair consumer treated fairly accordance current legislation told get expert report prove tv faulty would cost resale value therefore option purchase another tv bought richer sound year warranty tv’s excellent review amazing customer service buy tv amazon kaza uk advice,0.020616402715800966,0.979383597284199,0.12058328659562535,0.2,0.8138084559612245,81.38084559612246,High Trust
