Chuck O'Brien,/users/629fa44bdbc4a10012518538,US,1.0,2022-06-07 21:17:42+00:00,1.0,We ordered an item that had free…,"We ordered an item that had free returns.  All this documented.  When we went to return it it was denied.  We called Amazon and they said they'd take care of it.  We did this at least 6 times and each time Amazon told us we would get our money back.  Then, they denied it.They lied, they falsely advertised.  They used to be good, now they're so big they feel they have control over their customers.  I'm actively looking for a replacement for Amazon.",2022-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,7.0,451,83,33,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item free return documented went return denied called amazon said theyd take care least time time amazon told u would get money back denied itthey lied falsely advertised used good theyre big feel control customer im actively looking replacement amazon,0.007385239097120455,0.9926147609028796,0.04655075715086932,0.2,0.8056175318816137,80.56175318816136,High Trust
