Deanna Falcon,/users/5e3da856bef4a476996a5e7d,US,6.0,2022-06-07 10:57:46+00:00,1.0,BEWARE Before ordering anything Big!!! That requires a pick up!!!!,"I ordered a smart Tv and it came defective so I contacted Amazon and got a replacement. And it worked  great…  I filled out the information needed for someone to come pic up the defective tv. They sent me an email from pilot that said someone will  be at my house THURSDAY MAY 26,2022 between 3-6 pm And said an adult needed to be present, so I left work early to make sure I Would be home, no one showed up or called, I thought maybe they were running late so I waited till 9 pm After 9:00 pm I chatted with Amazon and he said he had to transfer the chat to the concern department, I waited in the chat room for 50 mins no one ever came on. I  decided to call while I still had the chat open and that was faster. I explained what was going on to the lady and she did a 3 way call and got in touch with someone from pilot and they said they see the appointment that was scheduled and they didn’t know why no one showed up. so she  gave me the tracking number and the phone number and told me to call on Friday morning May 27th she said they open at 8:00 am.FRIDAY MAY 27th I  called at 8:00 am and at  8:40  Still No one answered the phone. I stayed on 40 minutes waiting for someone to answer. I had to leave for work but I seen they had an email address so I emailed them explain everything and they never got back with me. SATURDAY MAY 28th I contacted Amazon again he transfer me to bulky items, A lady came on and  I explained everything again, well she fell asleep on me. I said can you hear me??? She came to and started talking but then fell asleep again.. I could hear her snoring then she hung up or the phone was  Disconnected, so I called back AGAIN!!!! this time I got through to someone that got me back in touch with pilot. I explained everything, she said she also seen that they were supposed to pick it up and that she would have someone contact me on Tuesday May 31st because Monday was a holiday.. well I made sure to answer every call on Tuesday TUESDAY MAY 31st NO ONE has contacted me. This is crazy…  I  have made countless calls, I’ve chatted, I have emailed, I left work early, I have waisted so many Hours And I have still not gotten through to anyone so I contacted Amazon again Tuesday night I did the chat I explained everything just like I did here and she transferred to someone else. He said In this case I will escalate the issue to the concern department and ask them to disarm the return label created for this orderSo that I won’t  get charged again And I can keep o donate the item. WEDNESDAY JUNE 1, 2022I got an email that says contact Amazon Again to give more details… i emailed back to see what details they need. Then I got another Email that said they scheduled someone to pick up again. But did not give me a date or a time but that someone over 18 needs to be present. But I have no date or time set to make sure someone is here..!!!FRIDAY JUNE 3rdI finally called corporate (206) 266-1000to see if I can get to the bottom of this well they contacted pilot and told me pilot would call me that day to set up a pick up.. I told the lady ok I already know that they are not gonna call I have been dealing with this the past week so what do I do if that don’t call and told me she would call me on Sunday to see if they called.  I was glad to hear that because I done had to explain this situation to so many people already.SUNDAY JUNE 5thIt is 9:45 Pm and….NO ONE CALLED FROM AMAZON OR PILOT! I emailed this to  jeff@amazon begging and pleading for someone To call me to explain what the hell is going on?????? The T.v has been sitting on my living room floor for 2 weeks now. I am so upset.THIS IS ABSOLUTELY RIDICULOUS.. MONDAY JUNE 6th Contacted Amazon chat  told them send me to the highest person they can get me to. He got back and said he sent info to someone and they gonna contact me in 48 hours and ended chat…….  I just got a email for me to contact the company again that dIdn’t show up, answer my calls, emails or call me when they supposed to!!! Still currently emailing back and forth now they saying I need to contact UPS to come get it!! THIS IS INSANE This is seriously consuming my life. I keep my phone by me at all times answering  spam call after spam call…. Hoping it’s Amazon or pilot!!!!!!  And guess what I AM STILL DEALING WITH THIS!!!!!!!   😡VERY PISSED OFF CUSTOMER😡AND THIS ISSUE IS STILL NOT RESOLVED!!!",2022-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,7.0,4379,856,66,10,0.0,0,29,2,1,Suspicious,ordered smart tv came defective contacted amazon got replacement worked great… filled information needed someone come pic defective tv sent email pilot said someone house thursday may pm said adult needed present left work early make sure would home one showed called thought maybe running late waited till pm pm chatted amazon said transfer chat concern department waited chat room min one ever came decided call still chat open faster explained going lady way call got touch someone pilot said see appointment scheduled didn’t know one showed gave tracking number phone number told call friday morning may th said open amfriday may th called still one answered phone stayed minute waiting someone answer leave work seen email address emailed explain everything never got back saturday may th contacted amazon transfer bulky item lady came explained everything well fell asleep said hear came started talking fell asleep could hear snoring hung phone disconnected called back time got someone got back touch pilot explained everything said also seen supposed pick would someone contact tuesday may st monday holiday well made sure answer every call tuesday tuesday may st one contacted crazy… made countless call i’ve chatted emailed left work early waisted many hour still gotten anyone contacted amazon tuesday night chat explained everything like transferred someone else said case escalate issue concern department ask disarm return label created orderso won’t get charged keep donate item wednesday june got email say contact amazon give details… emailed back see detail need got another email said scheduled someone pick give date time someone need present date time set make sure someone herefriday june rdi finally called corporate see get bottom well contacted pilot told pilot would call day set pick told lady ok already know gonna call dealing past week don’t call told would call sunday see called glad hear done explain situation many people alreadysunday june thit pm and…no one called amazon pilot emailed jeffamazon begging pleading someone call explain hell going tv sitting living room floor week upsetthis absolutely ridiculous monday june th contacted amazon chat told send highest person get got back said sent info someone gonna contact hour ended chat…… got email contact company didn’t show answer call email call supposed still currently emailing back forth saying need contact ups come get insane seriously consuming life keep phone time answering spam call spam call… hoping it’s amazon pilot guess still dealing 😡very pissed customer😡and issue still resolved,1.0,0.0,0.48008973639932695,0.2,0.3960179472798654,39.60179472798654,Low Trust
