Ian Jex,/users/5ad674024de5666d34337af0,US,3.0,2022-06-07 01:36:37+00:00,1.0,Two years of delivery issues never resolved no response from Amazon!,"For two years now I’ve been calling, writing, chatting, emailing Amazon about constant delivery issues. Not late delivery but actual driver misconduct/poor performance issues! For two years I’m promised they’ll address it, have a supervisor call me back, speak to the delivery center, and every other excuse you can think of to simply get me to go away and then surprise surprise no call, no response to complaints, still having the issues for two years!This horrible service all started when Amazon let go hundreds of USA based employees and started relying almost entirely on outsourced call centers /service centers in India! I’ve been lied too and even had a employee disable my account after I gave them a negative survey!Amazon has decided they’re too big to fail now and so they don’t care one bit about their customers anymore!I’m canceling my prime membership and blocking Amazon in our home as well as canceling the gift card order my company was going to place with Amazon for gifts for our staff! If they treat me this way after two years of complaints I won’t risk exposing my employees to this horrible service anymore",2022-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,7.0,1132,192,68,11,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,two year i’ve calling writing chatting emailing amazon constant delivery issue late delivery actual driver misconductpoor performance issue two year i’m promised they’ll address supervisor call back speak delivery center every excuse think simply get go away surprise surprise call response complaint still issue two yearsthis horrible service started amazon let go hundred usa based employee started relying almost entirely outsourced call center service center india i’ve lied even employee disable account gave negative surveyamazon decided they’re big fail don’t care one bit customer anymorei’m canceling prime membership blocking amaz