LS,/users/584e38720000ff000a6099da,GB,10.0,2022-06-06 19:25:51+00:00,1.0,I haven’t had any problems with Amazon…,"I haven’t had any problems with Amazon UK. The customer care staff on Twitter has done their best to help me out.I ordered something on the 30th May. I’m a prime member and it was a days delivery.I got a notification on the 31st that my parcel was with the courier. Then I got a notification that there was a delay in getting my parcel to me. So I rescheduled this for 1st June. Notification said on the 1st: should be delivered today. That never happened, I waited until 10pm.It has now been rescheduled for today, and still nothing has happened. It’s not in transit, …I can’t get a refund as I need to send it back, something I cannot do, as I’ve not received it. I am a little reluctant to order it again as I need one for home (to save me bringing the one from work to home every night).Please help me, I get that as soon as items leave the depot, that they are out of your hands.",2022-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,6.0,884,172,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,haven’t problem amazon uk customer care staff twitter done best help outi ordered something th may i’m prime member day deliveryi got notification st parcel courier got notification delay getting parcel rescheduled st june notification said st delivered today never happened waited pmit rescheduled today still nothing happened it’s transit …i can’t get refund need send back something cannot i’ve received little reluctant order need one home save bringing one work home every nightplease help get soon item leave depot hand,0.014358862889705247,0.9856411371102948,0.09646662927650028,0.2,0.8121138944104475,81.21138944104474,High Trust
