Dee,/users/629dd8ed30e24a001248e87b,IN,1.0,2022-06-06 12:37:42+00:00,1.0,"""Horrible experience with Amazon""","""Horrible experience with Amazon - wouldn't recommend my worst of enemies to get associated with them""Amazon delivered Bosch Front Load Washing Machine. On open box inspection, I found the front panel out of its slot. Being new to front load, I wasn’t sure about how it should be. Still, I refused to accept the order as it appeared damaged to me. The delivery men insisted to share the code as they said the panel is just out of socket and not damaged. I didn’t believe them and called Amazon Customer Service. I described what I saw and asked for suggestion. The representative suggested that I can give the code and when Bosch Installation guy (during installation process) confirms it as damage, I can contact amazon to get one. So, I did. When the time came to claim the replacement, the team refused saying that I gave order delivery code and hence, they cannot issue a replacement. I was obviously shocked. On insisting they registered my complain, which was regarding them not taking responsibility of what their agent suggested. After relentless complains, follow-ups, and getting tormented through their lies; finally, one agent – Abhijeet agreed to get the call recording heard and arrange help. Alas! He came back with a different narrative, selectively picked words from the call, and claimed that no such words “damaged” were said and hence, refused the replacement. Not only, it was misrepresentation of facts, it was a poor show of what service from a giant like Amazon is. Now left with no alternative, a common man such me, for whom Rupees 35000 is a huge sum, I am reaching out to consumers like me to help raise a voice against such misconduct and fraud. Please join my voice, otherwise these companies will cheat us all. Today it’s me, tomorrow it can be others.",2022-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,6.0,1783,307,33,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,horrible experience amazon wouldnt recommend worst enemy get associated themamazon delivered bosch front load washing machine open box inspection found front panel slot new front load wasn’t sure still refused accept order appeared damaged delivery men insisted share code said panel socket damaged didn’t believe called amazon customer service described saw asked suggestion representative suggested give code bosch installation guy installation process confirms damage contact amazon get one time came claim replacement team refused saying gave order delivery code hence cannot issue replacement obviously shocked insisting registered complain regarding taking responsibility agent suggested relentless complains followup getting tormented lie finally one agent – abhijeet agreed get call recording heard arrange help ala came back different narrative selectively picked word call claimed word “damaged” said hence refused replacement misrepresentation fact poor show service giant like amazon left alternative common man rupee huge sum reaching consumer like help raise voice misconduct fraud please join voice otherwise company cheat u today it’s tomorrow others,0.062462362790135645,0.9375376372098644,0.17218171620863712,0.2,0.8032051618466596,80.32051618466596,High Trust
Shane Chatterton,/users/629dd0551f28f40011b1f66c,US,1.0,2022-06-06 12:01:06+00:00,1.0,Amazon is incapable of honoring their…,"Amazon is incapable of honoring their own terms. Two-day prime shipping means nothing anymore, deliveries are late more than 80% of the time. Many of the items I order are for business purposes and I can no longer continue to support Amazon as they fail me daily and I MUST TAKE CARE OF MY CUSTOMERS. Prime is no longer a good value, and their customer service places the blame on everyone but themselve, which is in extremely bad taste. Prime was never about a thousand ad on services, it was about two-day shipping. Done with Amazon.",2022-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,6.0,535,96,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon incapable honoring term twoday prime shipping mean nothing anymore delivery late time many item order business purpose longer continue support amazon fail daily must take care customer prime longer good value customer service place blame everyone themselve extremely bad taste prime never thousand ad service twoday shipping done amazon,0.019075060563476704,0.9809249394365233,0.0538418395961862,0.2,0.8012308376374988,80.12308376374988,High Trust
