Dana,/users/5a655f1d0000ff000b04026e,US,5.0,2022-06-05 14:05:18+00:00,5.0,I am an Amazon junkie,"I am an Amazon junkie! I love Amazon! The customer service is great, return policy is great, and you can’t beat the deliver! I barely shop anywhere else! What I would like to see Amazon do is to open their own “Home depot” physical store. I flip homes so I spend thousands per year at the big box, but their delivery is the worst I’ve ever experienced. I get materials from China faster than HD can deliver. I know If Besos was running the show I would have my materials on time! Think about it Jeff! Cha Ching$$$$",2022-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,5.0,514,98,21,5,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,amazon junkie love amazon customer service great return policy great can’t beat deliver barely shop anywhere else would like see amazon open “home depot” physical store flip home spend thousand per year big box delivery worst i’ve ever experienced get material china faster hd deliver know besos running show would material time think jeff cha ching,0.9942058042371873,0.005794195762812704,0.054963544587773416,1.0,1.5138898067989612,151.38898067989612,High Trust
