Frustrated amazon customer,/users/629ac3f730e24a0012476688,IN,1.0,2022-06-04 04:32:32+00:00,1.0,Delivery agents ask for OTP without delivering,"There is loop hole that delivery agents exploit and when this is raised to amazon's customer care they simply accept that it cannot be resolved (to the highest escalation). Delivery agents blackmail you to come pick the order when they are supposed to do doorstep delivery. When denied, they simply mark the product as damaged and return the product. So, the product travels hundreds of km only to be returned because delivery agents employed by amazon are lazy(or under-paid which is not my problem). This time they crossed the line, A amazon's delivery agent named 'Ganesh Khude' calls me from his personal phone number and ask me OTP before the order is delivered. And when I denied, like as usual he threatened to returned the product by marking it as damaged. And he did do that after two days. When I raised this amazon customer service I was redirected multiple to utmost senior named Monali and she simply accepted that it can't be reolved even after being aware of the loop hole that delivery agent exploit. She being 'the senior', her carelessness and recklessness suprised me.After seeing Amazon's PlayStore reviews, I take solace in the fact that  I am not alone and many people are facing the same issue.",2022-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,4.0,1217,209,46,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,loop hole delivery agent exploit raised amazon customer care simply accept cannot resolved highest escalation delivery agent blackmail come pick order supposed doorstep delivery denied simply mark product damaged return product product travel hundred km returned delivery agent employed amazon lazyor underpaid problem time crossed line amazon delivery agent named ganesh khude call personal phone number ask otp order delivered denied like usual threatened returned product marking damaged two day raised amazon customer service redirected multiple utmost senior named monali simply accepted cant reolved even aware loop hole delivery agent exploit senior carelessness recklessness suprised meafter seeing amazon playstore review take solace fact alone many people facing issue,0.008611558030897408,0.9913884419691026,0.11721817162086372,0.2,0.819137855308724,81.9137855308724,High Trust
Cameron Chase,/users/629aaf8484677800134f8a61,US,1.0,2022-06-04 03:04:13+00:00,1.0,They have the worst customer service…,They have the worst customer service ever. Order a pc case on the 28th says over night shipping gets delayed a day. Then I get it and it's broken and they refused to refund it after about 10 people they finally decided since the panels are glass and were broken but the frame is still okay I could get a return. I set it to have it go to my Amazon account so I could repurchase a different case. I got a email saying the item was picked up.  But no money went into my account.  I called them and they said it was going back on my debit card and now couldn't change it since it was already being done with.  I said how Is it my fault you guys put the return wrong after them literally repeating it would go into my Amazon balance but then them not doing.  The lady then proceeded to say it's not our fault you messed up.  I explained why I wanted it on my account and proceeded to make excuses on why they messed up and put it on my card. Then said It would take 14 days to swap the return label so it could go on my account I said never mind DONT change anything I will deal with the 3 days to my card instead.  Then I got a email 5 minutes after the like 15th call that they were going to start the label swap process which would take 14 to 30 days.  I called them back got a lady name Dany who was no help at all and did not listen or understand what I was saying. Then I got a guy who was super good and said the person who sent that email must've been trying to get under my skin. Cause he saw the email saying the relabeling process would start and would be changed to go onto my amazon balance after me telling them never mind leave it. And he said I see that message but it was never changed so whoever sent the email was trying to upset you.  Worst customer service ever now I will not be able to order my new pc case for 3 to 5 more days. 10 days after it being ordered.  They would my offer any compensation for the troubles they caused because my situation did not qualify. Like how does it not quality! They made it nothing but a problem with this whole order.  If I could leave negative stars I would I should have to speak to almost 20 people to get anything done,2022-06-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,4.0,2177,439,37,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,worst customer service ever order pc case th say night shipping get delayed day get broken refused refund people finally decided since panel glass broken frame still okay could get return set go amazon account could repurchase different case got email saying item picked money went account called said going back debit card couldnt change since already done said fault guy put return wrong literally repeating would go amazon balance lady proceeded say fault messed explained wanted account proceeded make excuse messed put card said would take day swap return label could go account said never mind dont change anything deal day card instead got email minute like th call going start label swap process would take day called back got lady name dany help listen understand saying got guy super good said person sent email mustve trying get skin cause saw email saying relabeling process would start would changed go onto amazon balance telling never mind leave said see message never changed whoever sent email trying upset worst customer service ever able order new pc case day day ordered would offer compensation trouble caused situation qualify like quality made nothing problem whole order could leave negative star would speak almost people get anything done,0.02095743882969559,0.9790425611703044,0.24621424565339317,0.2,0.8387641297158308,83.87641297158308,High Trust
