Mark,/users/55c0c4b20000ff0001d1911d,US,15.0,2022-06-03 05:05:50+00:00,1.0,Customer Service Does Not Exist,"I have been a Prime member for years. My non-profit regularly purchases gifts for sick kids over the last five years from Amazon and has spent nearly $20k with them. I purchased (for myself) a telescope. When received, it had a card from the seller stating if I was to leave a ""5-star review"" I would receive an Amazon credit. So I did. A simple review, 5-stars. Amazon flagged the review as ""against their community standards"" and have banned my account from submitting any further reviews, while deleting all previous reviews. For six days, I have emailed (8 times) ""community-help (at) amazon.com"" asking why I'm banned with ZERO responses. I have chatted with support who will not deal with the issue, but have ""escalated"" the request. I have spoken on the phone twice with support who will not deal with the issue, but have ""escalated"" the request. Support on Twitter and Facebook have all told me I need to email support for adjudication . . . but no one will respond to emails. It's a horrible way to treat a customer . . . a non profit who has done nothing wrong . . . and seemingly don't care if they lose a customer. Amazon is so large now, they care NOTHING about their customers.",2022-06-03 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,3.0,1191,215,31,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime member year nonprofit regularly purchase gift sick kid last five year amazon spent nearly k purchased telescope received card seller stating leave star review would receive amazon credit simple review star amazon flagged review community standard banned account submitting review deleting previous review six day emailed time communityhelp amazoncom asking im banned zero response chatted support deal issue escalated request spoken phone twice support deal issue escalated request support twitter facebook told need email support adjudication one respond email horrible way treat customer non profit done nothing wrong seemingly dont care lose customer amazon large care nothing customer,0.018198446684309495,0.9818015533156905,0.12058328659562535,0.2,0.8150174339769704,81.50174339769704,High Trust
