Jill Tait,/users/560847af0000ff0001dee109,GB,5.0,2022-06-01 11:44:09+00:00,1.0,Beware of Amazon,"If I could have given zero stars I would have...My mother-in-law gave me her credit card as she was buying bedroom items for my little boys birthday. We used my account and then when it asked ""Do you want this card to be remembered"" I put NEVER and showed my Mother-in-law  I was doing this. Amazon decided they not only would remember but proceeded to take out over £60 of charges for subscriptions from her card. When we realised this was happening I deleted the card from my payment methods shocked it was there and asked Amazon to refund her the money and was basically told NO after being put through numerous different departments ....outrageous they can do that...held no accountability for it at all!! Just wanted to write this review to warn everybody to please beware of Amazon and there shady practices...check your account for saved cards that u didn't authorise!!!!!",2022-06-01 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,1.0,879,152,16,3,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,could given zero star would havemy motherinlaw gave credit card buying bedroom item little boy birthday used account asked want card remembered put never showed motherinlaw amazon decided would remember proceeded take £ charge subscription card realised happening deleted card payment method shocked asked amazon refund money basically told put numerous different department outrageous thatheld accountability wanted write review warn everybody please beware amazon shady practicescheck account saved card u didnt authorise,0.9990294130789948,0.0009705869210051565,0.08524957936062816,0.2,0.3175352093326282,31.75352093326282,Low Trust
