ReNae Monette,/users/5e124d6431bb5a0f1c95e947,US,9.0,2022-06-01 02:46:56+00:00,1.0,This the first time I have ever left a…,"This the first time I have ever left a negative review.  I bought a pair of yoga tights labeled true to size.  5'2"" and 110lbs.  I wear a small and sometimes a medium in tights.  These medium tights are so tight I have attempted for 4 days to return them.  Each day Amazon swears they will be picked up for sure, without any possibility of fail the next day.  They have been on my porch for 4 days without being picked up.  I am going to donate them and then I suppose Amazon will refuse to return the money spent.  I have now bought the same pair in large and they are still very snug. The medium is in fact an extra, extra, small.  Never before have I worn a large.  If they had been picked up as promised I would not be writing this but I've spent hours and hours on the phone trying to send them back.  If they don't care why should I?",2022-06-01 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,1.0,839,166,39,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,first time ever left negative review bought pair yoga tights labeled true size lb wear small sometimes medium tights medium tights tight attempted day return day amazon swears picked sure without possibility fail next day porch day without picked going donate suppose amazon refuse return money spent bought pair large still snug medium fact extra extra small never worn large picked promised would writing ive spent hour hour phone trying send back dont care,0.015510300266427008,0.984489699733573,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.8108651527271342,81.08651527271343,High Trust
