T. B,/users/629647bc75d4cc001257a23d,US,7.0,2022-05-31 18:52:27+00:00,1.0,Avoid buying from amazon if they are the ones delivering the product,"Ever since Amazon took over delivering the majority of packages ordered through their site, it's been horrible.  You get an alert timeframe when the package is to be delivered and a lot of times you will get a map where and how close the driver is to your location.  Unfortunately it's a bunch of BS most of the time.  I watched the drivers location and stops slowly go down from 5, 4, 3, 2,1, Your the Next Stop.  So I wait paitently for the driver to show up seeing they were shown right down the road.  After waiting for over 10 minutes, the map disappears and no updates.  Then an hour passes and they update the delivery time frame again to extend it another 30 minutes.  I decided to just cancel and not deal with their BS.  I will not order anything from Amazon again that is fulfilled and delivered by them.",2022-05-31 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,31.0,815,152,68,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ever since amazon took delivering majority package ordered site horrible get alert timeframe package delivered lot time get map close driver location unfortunately bunch b time watched driver location stop slowly go next stop wait paitently driver show seeing shown right road waiting minute map disappears update hour pass update delivery time frame extend another minute decided cancel deal b order anything amazon fulfilled delivered,0.014440675382431772,0.9855593246175682,0.08524957936062816,0.2,0.8098295781809098,80.98295781809098,High Trust
Trijnie Wanders,/users/578a50270000ff000a325e96,NL,15.0,2022-05-31 15:00:21+00:00,1.0,Return item no payback,"I have returned 2 items in the same package. The return code I received also clearly stated that it was for both items. I have only received my money back for 1 item. They stole 30 Euro's.I never had any problems with them before. However, this experience made me decide that I will never use Amazon again.",2022-05-31 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,31.0,306,57,22,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,returned item package return code received also clearly stated item received money back item stole eurosi never problem however experience made decide never use amazon,0.02248937626717716,0.9775106237328228,0.03196859226023556,0.2,0.7951490303184585,79.51490303184585,High Trust
