Brandon Prime,/users/607603b36f8487001ae5e0d6,US,3.0,2022-05-30 19:28:02+00:00,1.0,Bad agent,"Aside from the simple fact that Amazon's customer service has been terrible. Preethi had been an absolute nightmare. From telling me that it's not their problem and to contact someone else to ignoring my request to speak to a manager for 30 minutes before having ""technical issues"" that pushed me to another agent (still not a supervisor). If you get Preethi I am sorry that you will be speaking to a brick wall that will hinder and inhibit support that provide it.",2022-05-30 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,30.0,465,82,9,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,aside simple fact amazon customer service terrible preethi absolute nightmare telling problem contact someone else ignoring request speak manager minute technical issue pushed another agent still supervisor get preethi sorry speaking brick wall hinder inhibit support provide,0.05419346393146536,0.9458065360685346,0.045989904655075714,0.2,0.7821012489652824,78.21012489652824,High Trust
Isabel Kennedy-Rye,/users/5e85d31262514554c8e952ec,DK,2.0,2022-05-30 16:40:22+00:00,1.0,Denied access to purchased books,"Amazon just denied me access to my library after my account was locked. I have a Kindle Paperwhite that I had to reset because it didn’t work properly. When I tried to access my account it got locked. I then called customer service and was told that they cannot give unlock my account and therefore can’t get to my cloud and download the books to my kindle again. They tried to belittle the problem by saying I only purchased a couple of books which of is first of all untrue. Secondly it shouldn’t matter. I had complete author collections on my kindle that I payed good money for, which is now lost. My only option now is to repurchase… but since I could be denied access to them if my kindle doesn’t work, I’m not very inclined to do so. I think it’s time for ebook reader that is not connected to Amazon. I will not recommend Amazon to anyone from now on and I am really beginning to appreciate the fact that Amazon is unwanted in Denmark. It feels like I have been robbed.",2022-05-30 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,30.0,977,185,32,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon denied access library account locked kindle paperwhite reset didn’t work properly tried access account got locked called customer service told cannot give unlock account therefore can’t get cloud download book kindle tried belittle problem saying purchased couple book first untrue secondly shouldn’t matter complete author collection kindle payed good money lost option repurchase… since could denied access kindle doesn’t work i’m inclined think it’s time ebook reader connected amazon recommend amazon anyone really beginning appreciate fact amazon unwanted denmark feel like robbed,0.008645283221703838,0.9913547167782961,0.10375771172181716,0.2,0.8164289007335115,81.64289007335115,High Trust
Deborah Serio,/users/6294793a8d90690011805965,US,1.0,2022-05-30 10:01:39+00:00,2.0,TERRIBLE COSTUMER SERVICE,"I AM REALLY TIRED OF CALLING FROM AMERICA AND NOT BEING ABLE TO GET AN AGENT FROM THE USA. I DO NOT UNDERSTAND THE PEOPLE FROM THE PHILIPPINES OR INDIA AND THEY TALK SOOOO FAST. NO MATTER HOW MANY TIMES YOU ASK THEM TO SLOW DOWN. ALSO THEY DO NOT KNOW WHAT THEY ARE DOING OFTEN TIMES. I SPOKE TO 6 OR SEVEN PEOPLE THIS MORNING AND HAD TO GO OVER MY ACCOUNT EVERY TIME. TWO OF THEM HUNG UP ON ME AND ONE DID NOT KNOW WHAT HE WAS DOING AND WAS VERY RUDE. ALSO A WOMAN HUNG UP ON ME BECAUSE THE REP BEFORE HER WAS SUPPOSE TO VALIDATE MY ACCOUNT SO I DID NOT HAVE TO DO IT FOR THE 7TH TIME. I AM CALLING FROM THE USA, WHY CAN'T I GET A REP.  FROM THE USA?! THEY TELL ME THEY ARE THERE 24 HOURS , BUT WHEN YOU ASK FOR THEM YOU ARE TOLD,"" THEY  ARE NOT AVAILABLE.""2 HOURS I AM TRYING TO GET SOMETHING FIXED AND 3 TIMES I WAS TOLD TO CALL BACK IN 10 MINUTES. TWICE HUNG UP ON. TWICE PUT ON SILENT HOLD. MOST OF THE TIME THE RECEPTION AND ACCENTS WERE SO POOR I COULD NOT UNDERSTAND THEM. THEY REALLY NEED TO HAVE USA REPS THERE FOR THE PEOPLE IN THE USA. THIS IS TERRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE AND SUCH A WASTE OF TIME.",2022-05-30 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,30.0,1107,232,25,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,really tired calling america able get agent usa understand people philippine india talk soooo fast matter many time ask slow also know often time spoke seven people morning go account every time two hung one know rude also woman hung rep suppose validate account th time calling usa cant get rep usa tell hour ask told available hour trying get something fixed time told call back minute twice hung twice put silent hold time reception accent poor could understand really need usa rep people usa terrible customer service waste time,0.08043763680856156,0.9195623631914385,0.13011777902411667,0.4,1.0858047374005426,108.58047374005426,High Trust
Paul Rooke,/users/629454d18d906900118041a7,GB,2.0,2022-05-30 07:29:11+00:00,1.0,Poor Amazon AtoZ Guarantee,"Purchased a new Samsung mobile phone from Amazon Marketplace and it was faulty. I had to pay for my own return postage and the carrier Evri/Hermes lost the package. Total nightmare trying to obtain a refund. The AtoZ Guarantee Team sent me the same copy/paste email 12 times. After spending much time speaking with four managers and countless associates around the world, a refund was made.",2022-05-30 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,30.0,390,66,26,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased new samsung mobile phone amazon marketplace faulty pay return postage carrier evrihermes lost package total nightmare trying obtain refund atoz guarantee team sent copypaste email time spending much time speaking four manager countless associate around world refund made,0.019432320328054403,0.9805676796719456,0.03701626472237801,0.2,0.7976870927804485,79.76870927804485,High Trust
Joan R,/users/6293ed5a0afa9d0012205ab8,US,2.0,2022-05-30 00:02:14+00:00,1.0,Amazon shipping is sketchy beware,"I ordered a cricut joy from Amazon and I picked the time they offered for delivery. When it didn’t show up at the time they promised, I discovered it was in Texas still. I live in Florida. I then found out it was being sold for $20. Cheaper. Because it was so late they gave me a discount and promised they would get it to me the next day. I saw it eventually made it to the Lakeland Amazon distribution center in Fl. 2am. In the morning. When I woke up, it was still there, but my other package that was there shipped and was out for delivery. At 3pm I called them and before they picked up my phone call a notice came across my phone saying it was being delayed. Ok, still waiting for them to pick up my call. Some guy finally answered, and said it got damaged and my only option was put my money back on Amazon credit or back to my account. After waiting three days extra and they did nothing to fulfill my order. I tried to write my review, but they wouldn’t publish my review because it wasn’t about the product. I could not find a place on Amazon to complain about there shipping, and there should be a place. I got my cricut joy and also bought a hammock elsewhere. They lost about $400. From me over shipping. I wish I could just not buy from them anymore, but from now on they are my last choice to do my business with.  Also the money they promised to give me on my account for the late shipment disappeared, so they just took back the machine and canceled my reimbursement. Shame on you Amazon.",2022-05-30 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,30.0,1505,292,33,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered cricut joy amazon picked time offered delivery didn’t show time promised discovered texas still live florida found sold cheaper late gave discount promised would get next day saw eventually made lakeland amazon distribution center fl morning woke still package shipped delivery pm called picked phone call notice came across phone saying delayed ok still waiting pick call guy finally answered said got damaged option put money back amazon credit back account waiting three day extra nothing fulfill order tried write review wouldn’t publish review wasn’t product could find place amazon complain shipping place got cricut joy also bought hammock elsewhere lost shipping wish could buy anymore last choice business also money promised give account late shipment disappeared took back machine canceled reimbursement shame amazon,0.006116412142859889,0.9938835878571401,0.16376892877173305,0.2,0.8296955796829167,82.96955796829167,High Trust
