Bet,/users/62936fab75d4cc001255afdd,IT,12.0,2022-05-29 18:50:44+00:00,5.0,"Love Jeff Bezos, but not as I do with Elon Musk","I always use it. Prices are high, but it's easy to manage your orders, easy (and more important, free) to get a refund. I wonder why wish has 4.3 stars review and Amazon has 2. I don't recommend it for DIY electronics, the prices are really bad, better use Aliexpress, keeping in mind to pay with Paypal 'cause many sellers there are scammers.",2022-05-29 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,29.0,343,63,47,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,always use price high easy manage order easy important free get refund wonder wish star review amazon dont recommend diy electronics price really bad better use aliexpress keeping mind pay paypal cause many seller scammer,0.03822063896385659,0.9617793610361434,0.035333707234997194,1.0,1.987956421965071,198.7956421965071,High Trust
Jason Cotterill Clark,/users/5a2d0c140000ff000aeee5df,GB,13.0,2022-05-29 15:24:12+00:00,2.0,Delivery drivers,"Why is it that 90% of Amazon delivery drivers can't follow simple delivery instructions? I'll tell you why , because they can't be bloody arsed ! Sick to death of them just chucking the parcel at the front door and walking away and not using the safe place to leave parcels that's noted on my account ! Amazon you're customer service is appalling! No way of making a complaint,  you should be ashamed of yourselves a company of your size !",2022-05-29 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,29.0,439,81,16,2,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,amazon delivery driver cant follow simple delivery instruction ill tell cant bloody arsed sick death chucking parcel front door walking away using safe place leave parcel thats noted account amazon youre customer service appalling way making complaint ashamed company size,0.9799304957937339,0.020069504206266076,0.045429052159282106,0.4,0.6191205625349895,61.912056253498946,Medium Trust
Peter Wraae Marino,/users/565d91b60000ff0001ef2042,DK,128.0,2022-05-29 10:46:23+00:00,1.0,do not expect much from support,"do not expect much from support, if your package doesn't get delivered you are pretty much just going to loose all the money you paid for it. Finding contacts for chat or telephone number for amazon is nearly impossible, you need to go through at least 20 different webpages before you can get an option to chat with them. this experience is a nightmare, one I wish I never was in.",2022-05-29 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,29.0,381,71,31,6,0.0,0,0,2,1,Suspicious,expect much support package doesnt get delivered pretty much going loose money paid finding contact chat telephone number amazon nearly impossible need go least different webpage get option chat experience nightmare one wish never,0.4016339033243585,0.5983660966756414,0.039820527201346045,0.2,0.6071471537780899,60.71471537780899,Medium Trust
Max Max,/users/5ad9de384de5666d34b51ed9,GB,1.0,2022-05-29 08:21:44+00:00,1.0,Bought a 55 inch flat screen TV,"Bought a 55 inch flat screen TV. The price was the same price as Curry’s so no savings on price. It arrived within four days of purchase but unfortunately damaged. The box was not in great overall condition with a gash on the front screen side. Obviously, it had to be returned. I went to my orders and asked for it to be return due to damage and all I got was to print off the returns label and post it back to Amazon in their returns department. I felt this was unacceptable that I had to return a box I couldn’t physically lift and at a cost to me, which would have been expensive. I tried for hours to get a telephone number to their custom service here in the UK. I wanted to speak to a human as I had tried their online chat (it’s a bot). I also tried their callback that said it was connected but I could hear nothing.I decided to make a complaint via their complaints email but then an email came back saying they’re no longer responding to these emails and sent me links to go back to all the methods I had previously tried via call back and chat which is a bot. I gave up trying to get through to Amazon and actually contacted the company that sold the TV via Amazon by finding their number on Google. I didn’t know if this was correct way but I was at a loss of what to do. I told them the problems I was having with Amazon, they said forget Amazon and told me to contact their customer services, gave me an email to take pictures of the damage and a telephone number to call. The seller had eased my stress about the return but still I wanted to speak to a human at Amazon so I continued for hours looking for a number. Then I found this number 0800 496 1081, which I found on gethuman.com, apparently you can speak to a human and yes you can. It wasn’t easy finding the number. My search for a human to speak to at Amazon seemed like mission impossible, which I think is actually what Amazon want. They don’t have it on their website and during my search for a number I found lots of people asking the same question. There must be a reason it’s hard to find and I can only think that’s what Amazon wants. Human’s cost money so it’s their way of making more profit but at the frustration and stress to the customer - hence the one star. I did speak to a human who was lovely but they sent me an email with a different 0800 contact number should I need to contact them regarding problems returning the TV via the seller. It’s a number I tried before getting the other 0800 number and you don’t get to speak to a human  you get a text that directs you to their website just to go around in circles. That 0800 number is useless, been there done that. So, everyone use the 0800 496 1081 to speak to an actual human. Once I find out how to make a complaint I shall post it on here because if we don’t tell Amazon our experiences how can they provide good customer service. This is their quote from an email sent from the human I spoke to ‘ Your feedback is helping us build Earth's Most Customer-Centric Company’. But I just don’t believe they actually really care about doing this!I mean how do you even make a complaint if they aren’t  responding to their complaints emails?",2022-05-29 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,29.0,3183,616,31,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,bought inch flat screen tv price price curry’s saving price arrived within four day purchase unfortunately damaged box great overall condition gash front screen side obviously returned went order asked return due damage got print return label post back amazon return department felt unacceptable return box couldn’t physically lift cost would expensive tried hour get telephone number custom service uk wanted speak human tried online chat it’s bot also tried callback said connected could hear nothingi decided make complaint via complaint email email came back saying they’re longer responding email sent link go back method previously tried via call back chat bot gave trying get amazon actually contacted company sold tv via amazon finding number google didn’t know correct way loss told problem amazon said forget amazon told contact customer service gave email take picture damage telephone number call seller eased stress return still wanted speak human amazon continued hour looking number found number found gethumancom apparently speak human yes wasn’t easy finding number search human speak amazon seemed like mission impossible think actually amazon want don’t website search number found lot people asking question must reason it’s hard find think that’s amazon want human’s cost money it’s way making profit frustration stress customer hence one star speak human lovely sent email different contact number need contact regarding problem returning tv via seller it’s number tried getting number don’t get speak human get text directs website go around circle number useless done everyone use speak actual human find make complaint shall post don’t tell amazon experience provide good customer service quote email sent human spoke ‘ feedback helping u build earth customercentric company’ don’t believe actually really care thisi mean even make complaint aren’t responding complaint email,0.024268868532243786,0.9757311314677563,0.34548513740886144,0.2,0.8569625932156504,85.69625932156504,High Trust
