Fionnbharr John Oakmur,/users/62928ffb0d273c001102101f,GB,3.0,2022-05-28 23:11:31+00:00,1.0,The fact I only get the option to go no…,"The fact I only get the option to go no lower than 1 star disappoints me.I keep either not getting my deliveries or they are outside in a Bush. The area I live in is surrounded by blocks of flats which are trustworthy. The area is rough and not worth risking a parcel outside the front of a block of flats. I've discussed this with amazon and they are unwilling to help. I run a small buisness which I run from home which needs the materials for deadlines which is why I have the prime for a reason. But what's the point of prime if nothing actually goes to plan. I have now been talking to amazon support team for the last 4 hours where mysteriously their communications keep dropping. By one support I was offered compensation and which would be with me by the end of the day with a refund as well, which still isnt ideal but fair enough I'm getting compensation. Only to be told I'm now not getting it. Amazon sort your s*** out!",2022-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,28.0,932,178,40,10,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,fact get option go lower star disappoints mei keep either getting delivery outside bush area live surrounded block flat trustworthy area rough worth risking parcel outside front block flat ive discussed amazon unwilling help run small buisness run home need material deadline prime reason whats point prime nothing actually go plan talking amazon support team last hour mysteriously communication keep dropping one support offered compensation would end day refund well still isnt ideal fair enough im getting compensation told im getting amazon sort,0.04748664556055748,0.9525133544394425,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.7962230260699736,79.62230260699737,High Trust
Tee,/users/6292645675d4cc00125540d7,US,1.0,2022-06-12 04:07:59+00:00,1.0,REFUNDED to the gift-card not purchase visa SMH,My money was never REFUNDED to the visa I used to make a purchase. Instead it was sent to a gift-card I never used on my account and was not on my account before the refund. They allow the CSR to refund to a giftcard and would not give me my money back on the debit I used. They will take down your reviews when you try to warn others of what horrible things is going on. Not worth having Prime or using the Amazon site. I returned a volte flip phone because t-mobile no longer services that phone and it cant be used. It is not right to continue to sell a item that is outdated. I deleted that account Amazon can't be trusted. Their Customer Service is sketchy.,2022-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,6.0,12.0,662,130,47,8,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,money never refunded visa used make purchase instead sent giftcard never used account account refund allow csr refund giftcard would give money back debit used take review try warn others horrible thing going worth prime using amazon site returned volta flip phone tmobile longer service phone cant used right continue sell item outdated deleted account amazon cant trusted customer service sketchy,0.014074029917564667,0.9859259700824353,0.07291082445316882,0.2,0.8075451499318514,80.75451499318514,High Trust
Martin Roberts,/users/62924d570d273c001101e4f1,GB,1.0,2022-05-28 18:31:01+00:00,1.0,Phantom Delivery,"Items showing as delivered when no sign of them.  Customer Service Chat just says ""They may have been put as delivered in advance. Give us 3 days to sort this out"". No other way of contacting them. Why am I paying for Amazon Prime? Joke. If they promise next day, I expect it next day - Not 3 days later. Awful.",2022-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,28.0,311,61,16,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,item showing delivered sign customer service chat say may put delivered advance give u day sort way contacting paying amazon prime joke promise next day expect next day day later awful,0.010081187690330017,0.9899188123096699,0.034212002243409985,0.2,0.801801806603517,80.1801806603517,High Trust
Matthew Miller,/users/5c5d7e55d2a8691334d01e22,GB,52.0,2022-05-28 10:43:33+00:00,1.0,"No customer services, no goods, no Amazon profit","Until recently we’ve enjoyed a good service … but the there was a change in courier and things went wrong. Items are now delivered to random addresses in the area, I’ve spent literally 6 hours on the customer service “chat” and have gone round in circles. Apparently they can’t call this courier because it’s not in their “procedures”. In the meantime to courier simply ignores the missing item forms sent to them by Amazon. So stuff continues to disappears and they have to send it again. They are supplying twice the amount of goods for half the price but still aren’t willing to resolve this issue, seemingly as they aren’t allowed to use the telephone. No customer service, no goods, no profit for Amazon. We all loose. However made up their “procedures” needs a lesson in critical thinking.",2022-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,28.0,795,138,48,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently we’ve enjoyed good service … change courier thing went wrong item delivered random address area i’ve spent literally hour customer service “chat” gone round circle apparently can’t call courier it’s “procedures” meantime courier simply ignores missing item form sent amazon stuff continues disappears send supplying twice amount good half price still aren’t willing resolve issue seemingly aren’t allowed use telephone customer service good profit amazon loose however made “procedures” need lesson critical thinking,0.03855719806103907,0.9614428019389609,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.7962009298533841,79.6200929853384,High Trust
