Aimee,/users/61be1dd40560660013c24915,US,2.0,2022-05-28 03:35:34+00:00,1.0,"Cheap products, poor delivery, horrible customer service.","Twice now Amazon has tried to deliver a package I ordered to a city in which I do not live. Same distribution center. The customer service rep does not understand the words I am using to describe the problem. It’s been 20 mins and they still don’t get it. My package that was to be delivered today is out for delivery in a city in which I do not live in, therefore it is lost. The same thing happened two weeks ago Why is this so difficult to understand? He keeps saying it’s out for delivery and I keep telling him in the wrong city just like the one from two weeks ago. That original order from two weeks ago never arrived. Only the replacement one did. This time, before replacing the lost item, they wanted me to wait until May 31st in case this one actually makes it there. It was treatment for my excruciatingly painful herniated discs. No, I will now be shopping elsewhere for that product. Further more, the reason I had to order another similar product as the one from two weeks ago was because that one broke.  Cheap products, incompetent distribution centers, and customer service reps and supervisors who cannot comprehend even basic language skills, like differentiating between red and blue and May 16th and May 26th. 45 minutes and I am more angry and dissatisfied than when I started. Then I posted on social media and they showed they still didn’t understand what I was saying.  I’m am done. I will not renew my prime and I will shop elsewhere. Amazon is a shadow of the company it used to be.",2022-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,28.0,1510,277,57,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,twice amazon tried deliver package ordered city live distribution center customer service rep understand word using describe problem it’s min still don’t get package delivered today delivery city live therefore lost thing happened two week ago difficult understand keep saying it’s delivery keep telling wrong city like one two week ago original order two week ago never arrived replacement one time replacing lost item wanted wait may st case one actually make treatment excruciatingly painful herniated disc shopping elsewhere product reason order another similar product one two week ago one broke cheap product incompetent distribution center customer service rep supervisor cannot comprehend even basic language skill like differentiating red blue may th may th minute angry dissatisfied started posted social medium showed still didn’t understand saying i’m done renew prime shop elsewhere amazon shadow company used,0.013694410179388737,0.9863055898206112,0.15535614133482895,0.2,0.8242240231772715,82.42240231772715,High Trust
