Patrick Harvey,/users/628e9b1d43341000137b3f3f,US,1.0,2022-05-25 23:10:03+00:00,1.0,Continue to have multiple issues with…,"Continue to have multiple issues with Amazon proper and Amazon customer charges.  All I can say if you can find it anywhere but Amazon, buy it there even if you pay a little more!  Incorrect charges, duplicate charges.  Up to point we had to cancel our credit cards because of Amazon hitting our credit card account.  Our bank called and stated Amazon had attempted to hit or credit card 30 times in one day for one order!  When i contacted Amazon assured me problem would be resolved in 24 hours.  No answer no communication, except from my bank on potential fraudulent charges from Amazon! When I looked at my Amazon account my order was now repeated 14 time on my account!  What a mess!",2022-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,25.0,689,124,38,6,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,continue multiple issue amazon proper amazon customer charge say find anywhere amazon buy even pay little incorrect charge duplicate charge point cancel credit card amazon hitting credit card account bank called stated amazon attempted hit credit card time one day one order contacted amazon assured problem would resolved hour answer communication except bank potential fraudulent charge amazon looked amazon account order repeated time account mess,0.952967393812487,0.04703260618751304,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.33742544498943794,33.74254449894379,Low Trust
Philip Petre,/users/60157c4bb7944b0019d08ec6,GB,9.0,2022-05-25 21:53:43+00:00,1.0,"Utterly dire and useless customer service, in fact I doubt they recognise the word 'customer'!","Trying to watch a movie, constant glitches! Tried to contact through on line app contact, useless!!! Just says call connected? Connected to who????? Then call the main number, after failing to get any sort of message that actually gets me to speak to anyone!! Then bounced about and have to re explain the issue???? Thats an hour I will never get back!!! Then the line goes dead??? Amazon may want to consider its customers are its business!!! Absolutely useless service by totally inept, so called customer services!!!! How about the business and Mr Bezos, use some of their profits to actually deliver what they say they deliver!!!! Half wits at the very best!!! If amazin wasn't the size it is, then as a start up, they would disappear very quickly!!! Deliver amazon and invest in adequate resources to provide the service, we, the customer, pay for!!!!!",2022-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,25.0,857,146,94,15,0.0,0,31,2,1,Suspicious,trying watch movie constant glitch tried contact line app contact useless say call connected connected call main number failing get sort message actually get speak anyone bounced explain issue thats hour never get back line go dead amazon may want consider customer business absolutely useless service totally inept called customer service business mr bezos use profit actually deliver say deliver half wit best amazin wasnt size start would disappear quickly deliver amazon invest adequate resource provide service customer pay,1.0,0.0,0.08188446438586652,0.2,0.3163768928771733,31.63768928771733,Low Trust
Larry Rosen,/users/5f0a0376df4f24d6d18c5e7d,US,20.0,2022-05-25 17:47:30+00:00,1.0,A once great company has turned into a monster,"I've shopped with Amazon for over twenty years, but their ability to deliver on their promises has declined in the past year, and I will be limiting my purchases with them significantly going forward. I'm not surprised that they are a two-star company on trust pilot and expect that number will continue to decline. While I was treated well by the American who helped me (I had to ask to be transferred to someone in America), she was unable to provide me with service. Only excuses. I ordered an item over a week ago, and it was supposed to be here last Sunday. At this point, they do not have any idea when the order will ship, although their website is still listing the item as available to ship.  Unfortunately, Amazon has so devastated the marketplace and their competition that it is still necessary to shop with them on occasion. But if you can, stay away.",2022-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,25.0,864,156,46,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive shopped amazon twenty year ability deliver promise declined past year limiting purchase significantly going forward im surprised twostar company trust pilot expect number continue decline treated well american helped ask transferred someone america unable provide service excuse ordered item week ago supposed last sunday point idea order ship although website still listing item available ship unfortunately amazon devastated marketplace competition still necessary shop occasion stay away,0.01200350265856001,0.98799649734144,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.8114968465394805,81.14968465394806,High Trust
Frank Rietz,/users/4ea6de9700006400010d9e29,GB,96.0,2022-05-25 14:43:16+00:00,1.0,Amazon leaves you on your own with manufacturer's guarantee,"Just had a failed Seasonic computer power supply  that came with a 12 year warranty, bought in 2018 from Amazon for £175. If bought from retail store I would expect to take it back and get an exchange. With Amazon they are now denying any responsibilty after 2 years. So I now have to go through an RMA process with a company with no UK presence. Any return is at my cost. Very poor service from Amazon who you expect to have exchange arrangements in place with their suppliers or manufacturers.",2022-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,25.0,495,91,59,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,failed seasonic computer power supply came year warranty bought amazon £ bought retail store would expect take back get exchange amazon denying responsibilty year go rma process company uk presence return cost poor service amazon expect exchange arrangement place supplier manufacturer,0.26933704136123715,0.7306629586387628,0.05103757711721817,0.2,0.6755389947428251,67.5538994742825,Medium Trust
