Terry NGuessan,/users/6128dfadfebf850012046cfd,US,2.0,2022-05-25 05:51:51+00:00,1.0,Amazon.com delivery is one of the worst…,"Amazon.com delivery is one of the worst delivery services I have ever experienced. Amazon.com offers customers to provide delivery instructions. I provided clear and simple to follow delivery instructions. They are so easy that a caveman can understand it. Unfortunately, Amazon.com delivery drivers deliver my orders wherever they feel fit without adverse consequences. I have been calling Amazon.com since 2019 to report the issue so that they can correct that matter. To this day, the problem remains. On 05/23/2022, the drive delivered my order somewhere. I contacted Amazon.com to let them know that I did not receive my package. Here’s their response: “Amazon.com is not able to resolve shipping problems after delivery, as outlined on our website in our Conditions of Use, noted under 'Risk of Loss' which states: ""All items purchased from Amazon.com are made pursuant to a shipment contract. This means that the risk of loss and title for such items pass to you upon our delivery to the carrier.""”This is the worse statement ever. I am highly disappointed how Amazon.com treats its Prime members. I will not recommend Amazon Prime to anyone.",2022-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,25.0,1149,185,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazoncom delivery one worst delivery service ever experienced amazoncom offer customer provide delivery instruction provided clear simple follow delivery instruction easy caveman understand unfortunately amazoncom delivery driver deliver order wherever feel fit without adverse consequence calling amazoncom since report issue correct matter day problem remains drive delivered order somewhere contacted amazoncom let know receive package here’s response “amazoncom able resolve shipping problem delivery outlined website condition use noted risk loss state item purchased amazoncom made pursuant shipment contract mean risk loss title item pas upon delivery carrier”this worse statement ever highly disappointed amazoncom treat prime member recommend amazon prime anyone,0.0030530635177724997,0.9969469364822275,0.10375771172181716,0.2,0.8192250105854771,81.92250105854771,High Trust
