"M&M Chassis Shop, LLC",/users/628828c6cfecdd0012e194a4,US,1.0,2022-05-21 01:50:14+00:00,1.0,"Negligent Amazon driver damages property, will not pay claim to repair.","On May 7, 2022, an Amazon driver delivered a package to my home. The driver drove ACROSS my front lawn causing damage to the property. I submitted a claim to Amazons claim processor, ARC claims. They started out with an offer of $400 to fix the damage, then offered $466 after I declined the first offer. I have 2 estimates to fix the damage, one is $1926 and the other is $2180. I filed a complaint with the BBB and was contacted by Robert M Milane, general council with ARC claims. He said that I would have to file a lawsuit because “Amazon does not pay for sod”. I did nothing wrong and all that I've asked for is for someone to pay the claim that was caused by the driver's negligence. By refusing to handle this claim properly, I'm being penalized for something I had NO control over. You can search “ARC claims complaints” and read 100’s of claims similar to mine.",2022-05-21 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,21.0,871,163,71,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,may amazon driver delivered package home driver drove across front lawn causing damage property submitted claim amazon claim processor arc claim started offer fix damage offered declined first offer estimate fix damage one filed complaint bbb contacted robert milane general council arc claim said would file lawsuit “amazon pay sod” nothing wrong ive asked someone pay claim caused driver negligence refusing handle claim properly im penalized something control search “arc claim complaints” read ’s claim similar mine,0.013279037434930772,0.9867209625650692,0.09141895681435783,0.2,0.8116442726454062,81.16442726454062,High Trust
