QNY QNY,/users/61c2552b86a3180012e988d4,GB,3.0,2022-05-18 18:38:14+00:00,1.0,Not interested or dumb!!!,"So we have a business account at work, and about 2 years ago someone made the mistake to send the money owned to Amazon in a big payment instead small payments for each invoice. Since then we had the account blocked with the note to pay what is owed. Our CFO still fighting them as they won't send us back the money we've paid so we can send them as they want, but they won't put that bulk payment to what is owned either. They said that they can see the money in the account but they can't be allocated to any invoice as we don't have an invoice that matches that amount. And although they have over £2k from us, they still think we owe them money....it's like you are talking a different language all together.",2022-05-18 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,18.0,712,137,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,business account work year ago someone made mistake send money owned amazon big payment instead small payment invoice since account blocked note pay owed cfo still fighting wont send u back money weve paid send want wont put bulk payment owned either said see money account cant allocated invoice dont invoice match amount although £k u still think owe moneyits like talking different language together,0.03484666100749394,0.9651533389925061,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.7979440278809978,79.79440278809979,High Trust
