Parker,/users/62806c30f32f8e0013d86bda,US,1.0,2022-05-15 04:58:12+00:00,1.0,AMAZON CANT HELP WILL BAD MOTHERBOARDS,"Ordered a motherboard from Amazon, got the rest of the parts later, and find out that I was given a DUD motherboard, NONE of the USB or HDMI ports work, I've taken it to a specialist and paid my own money trying to fix this issue, for them to tell me it's just a bad motherboard. Have contacted support several times just trying to get a replacement, and they proceed to transfer me through various support members for them all to waste my time reading my messages for 30+ minutes to tell me they can't help and transfer me. Been dealing with this issue for over a month now and still no resolution, they proceed to stall and just not reply, limiting their reply to 15-30 mins, in my guess hoping ill just leave. Incredibly frustrating that the support team can't even help, and advises you to contact the manufaire? Money-back guarantee? more like give you a headache and steal your money. Probably just donated money for his next space trip. The support team also has some attitudes towards their customers. Overall just very unprofessional and it's crazy that this is the type of support Amazon has. I would say 0 out of 10 but that's impossible so I have to give this support team a 1 out of 10. If you order something from amazon, Pray you don't have to deal with support. They will be zero help at the end of the day.",2022-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,15.0,1323,245,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered motherboard amazon got rest part later find given dud motherboard none usb hdmi port work ive taken specialist paid money trying fix issue tell bad motherboard contacted support several time trying get replacement proceed transfer various support member waste time reading message minute tell cant help transfer dealing issue month still resolution proceed stall reply limiting reply min guess hoping ill leave incredibly frustrating support team cant even help advises conta