Star Dazer,/users/593c2e020000ff000aa228cf,US,10.0,2022-05-13 00:20:07+00:00,1.0,Amazon is the WORST,"Placed an order, items being sent in 2 shipments both from Amazon delivery drivers. First shipment marked delivered to mailroom, no picture. Should’ve been to front door. I run down to see it’s not in there. See Amazon driver and he tells me he didn’t have a delivery for me. Call customer service and they say it was marked delivered by mistake and I’ll get it with 2nd shipment. 2nd shipment marked delivered but doesn’t say where and no picture. It’s not outside. I call Amazon and receive terrible customer service so fuming mad I drive down to the Amazon HUB customer counter. Spoke to 2 supervisors who looked into it and found that one shipment was delivered a mile away, completely different apartment complex. The other, they say they have no idea what the driver did but delivery wasn’t actually attempted. They could see this by looking up the GPS history. I now drive to the “wrong” address where they told me it was and spoke with leasing staff. My packages were not found but they did find several packages that belonged to people at MY complex, a mile away. I called Amazon customer service and explained all of this for the 10th time. Amazon then emails me a questionnaire to file a report for them to look into it, I gave them everything they asked for. They respond with, NO refund NO replacement, basically you’re SOL! So, I’ve spent hours of my time and not even to mention aggravation dealing with them over this. I had to file a dispute with my CC company. To add insult to injury I get a WARNING email from Amazon due to “too many” packages reported missing. They are threatening to close my account. Wow!!! They think they are so big and successful that they can now treat their customers like dirt. I’m deleting their app, deleting my handmade seller’s account, F them, horrible company!!!!",2022-05-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,13.0,1815,323,19,4,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,placed order item sent shipment amazon delivery driver first shipment marked delivered mailroom picture should’ve front door run see it’s see amazon driver tell didn’t delivery call customer service say marked delivered mistake i’ll get nd shipment nd shipment marked delivered doesn’t say picture it’s outside call amazon receive terrible customer service fuming mad drive amazon hub customer counter spoke supervisor looked found one shipment delivered mile away completely different apartment complex say idea driver delivery wasn’t actually attempted could see looking gps history drive “wrong” address told spoke leasing staff package found find several package belonged people complex mile away called amazon customer service explained th time amazon email questionnaire file report look gave everything asked respond refund replacement basically you’re sol i’ve spent hour time even mention aggravation dealing file dispute cc company add insult injury get warning email amazon due “too many” package reported missing threatening close account wow think big successful treat customer like dirt i’m deleting app deleting handmade seller’s account f horrible company,0.9996524014238617,0.00034759857613830825,0.18115535614133482,0.2,0.3364048705163361,33.64048705163361,Low Trust
