Nat mardoyan,/users/627af27897907800110e3987,US,1.0,2022-05-11 01:17:21+00:00,1.0,If I could give zero stars I would,"If I could give zero stars. I would. I placed an order at 10pm with guarenteed delivery for 0700-1000am the next day and it didn't arrive yet. (It's now 5pm).I checked on Amazon and it now stated that the order will be delivered the following day. Called Amazon customer service telling them it was guarenteed this morning and they said they couldnt do anything for me. All they could do was give me 50% of my prime membership. No thanks. If this is customer service, I don't want it. Cancel the order and cancel my membership. They suck with customer service lately. They do nothing for the customer other than get them mad. I have been an Amazon member since 2007 and it has never been this bad. Customer service does not care at all about the customer, it's sad. You get off the phone more upset and irritated rather than feeling you have been helped. If the site state a guarenteed delivery time, it should be delivered at that time. If not, the company should issue a credit or refund, not make the customer feel like garbage. Why am I paying for a membership where no customer service rep does anything for the customer?A few weeks ago, I ordered champagne glasses. Opened the box and didn't realize one glass was broken and it cut my hand. I threw out the class and called amazon for a refund. They told me I had to send a picture of the broken glass. I told them i threw the glass out and it was in the trash buried under a ton of food that I threw out the day prior. They told me they couldn't exchange or refund it because they needed a photo of the damage. I told them I could send a picture of the cut on my finger and they said that wasn't enough. I told them I wasn't digging through trash and asked for a supervisor. That person gave me the refund and apologized. Amazon sucks now.",2022-05-11 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,11.0,1796,339,34,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,could give zero star would placed order pm guarenteed delivery next day didnt arrive yet pmi checked amazon stated order delivered following day called amazon customer service telling guarenteed morning said couldnt anything could give prime membership thanks customer service dont want cancel order cancel membership suck customer service lately nothing customer get mad amazon member since never bad customer service care customer sad get phone upset irritated rather feeling helped site state guarenteed delivery time delivered time company issue credit refund make customer feel like garbage paying membership customer service rep anything customera week ago ordered champagne glass opened box didnt realize one glass broken cut hand threw class called amazon refund told send picture broken glass told threw glass trash buried ton food threw day prior told couldnt exchange refund needed photo damage told could send picture cut finger said wasnt enough told wasnt digging trash asked supervisor person gave refund apologized amazon suck,0.008034223698955378,0.9919657763010447,0.19012899607403252,0.2,0.8340086873653288,83.40086873653289,High Trust
