Alex Zhukovsky,/users/5fbf5b3f06deb5001b6e45ae,US,4.0,2022-05-08 19:26:33+00:00,1.0,Amazon Censoring and Threatening Customers For Placing Negative Reviews!,"I recently placed honest and truthful negative review about my personal Amazon experience where I felt that Amazon become one of the worst online retailers due to following reasons: 1. Amazon has been caught using third party companies to place fake product reviews that completely crashed consumer trust in Amazon products. 2. Amazon product quality drastically degraded over time resulting in crazy amount of product returns where I personally out of 10 purchased products would return at least 5 due to either bad quality of the product or receiving used products when order was place for a new product. 3. Amazon Music service is probably one of the worst on the market especially for the Prime member users where you get very limited music selection with poor audio quality. They are forcing you to sign up for the Unlimited service that still have poor audio quality and if you want HD audio quality Amazon forcing you to pay extra on top of Prime and Unlimited memberships. 4. Prime Movies service have very limited collection of good movies, where you forced to rent or buy decent movies making you spend an insane amount of money on top of Prime membership. 5. Amazon Store Card mobile app is very buggy where it takes literally up to 5 business days to show transaction and payments. Amazon also make false advertisement about every day 5% cash back rewards that I've never received because their cash back rewards only come at the end of each billing cycle. They also using Synchrony Bank that would engage in ruining your credit score by reporting it to all main credit score companies if you close Amazon Store Card due to poorly designed mobile app. 6. When you call and complain to their Customer Service that is being outsourced to India and other countries you receive very poor service where customer service agents don't really care about your Amazon experience and would not ask you how we can make your experience better, instead they will intimidate you via email with threats of banning your account (see email example below). I am done with Amazon as it become one of the worst online retailers with shady practices! Hello, One or more of your posts were found to be outside our guidelines. In order to help our customers make informed choices, we encourage them to review the product and contribute information about it. However, Community content that violate our guidelines or Conditions of Use will be removed. Please consider this a first warning. Before submitting your next post, please refer to our Customer GuidelinesFailure to comply with our policies may result in your account being banned from taking part in Community features. Thanks for your understanding in",2022-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,8.0,2698,456,72,9,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,recently placed honest truthful negative review personal amazon experience felt amazon become one worst online retailer due following reason amazon caught using third party company place fake product review completely crashed consumer trust amazon product amazon product quality drastically degraded time resulting crazy amount product return personally purchased product would return least due either bad quality product receiving used product order place new product amazon music service probably one worst market especially prime member user get limited music selection poor audio quality forcing sign unlimited service still poor audio quality want hd audio quality amazon forcing pay extra top prime unlimited membership prime movie service limited collection good movie forced rent buy decent movie making spend insane amount money top prime membership amazon store card mobile app buggy take literally business day show transaction payment amazon also make false advertisement every day cash back reward ive never received cash back reward come end billing cyc