Jacky,/users/5af04afd4de5666d34b04a14,GB,27.0,2022-05-08 14:34:45+00:00,1.0,I’m a Prime member,"I’m a Prime member. For the second time in a few weeks a delivery has been cancelled by Amazon because of a delivery problem. 2 Items due for delivery yesterday and the fact they had been cancelled I only discovered when I checked order status. So why do I have to wait up to 2 weeks for refund to be processed. Amazon’s problem but my money not immediately refunded. I’ve Re-ordered items, if they do not come tomorrow I am cancelling my Prime membership. Service is going rapidly downhill.",2022-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,8.0,491,89,18,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’m prime member second time week delivery cancelled amazon delivery problem item due delivery yesterday fact cancelled discovered checked order status wait week refund processed amazon’s problem money immediately refunded i’ve reordered item come tomorrow cancelling prime membership service going rapidly downhill,0.019373427900027447,0.9806265720999725,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.8002964604751124,80.02964604751124,High Trust
