Aloha Mark,/users/5f149e5f85359c210af470bf,US,4.0,2022-05-08 07:14:34+00:00,4.0,"Mostly Good, A Few Bad Experiences","The Covid-19 pandemic was difficult for most internet merchants. In looking back at the hundreds of orders that I placed, I have to give Amazon credit for the getting most of the merchandise safely to our 50th state, Hawaii. The N95 and KN95 masks were critical to the health of my family. Numerous tools were also delivered in a functional state, which was a big plus since most of us were fixing up our homes during the crisis. Although not a tool warehouse, like Home Depot, Amazon does carry high quality tools from Japan, Taiwan and Europe. Most are not even sold by Home Depot or Lowes. The reviews on Amazon are more extensive than elsewhere. This helps buyers narrow down which items to order. Only around 1% of all orders turn out to be turkeys. The defects on a set of NAS drives were not due to the manufacturer. They were caused by bad packaging. Nothing but a cheap paper envelope was used, with no padding material. I should have looked more carefully at the history of the affiliate merchant in NYC, who fulfilled the order. Resolving this problem with a service associate took time, and tied up money for nearly 3 weeks.",2022-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,8.0,1136,204,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,covid pandemic difficult internet merchant looking back hundred order placed give amazon credit getting merchandise safely th state hawaii n kn mask critical health family numerous tool also delivered functional state big plus since u fixing home crisis although tool warehouse like home depot amazon carry high quality tool japan taiwan europe even sold home depot lowes review amazon extensive elsewhere help buyer narrow item order around order turn turkey defect set na drive due manufacturer caused bad packaging nothing cheap paper envelope used padding material looked carefully history affiliate merchant nyc fulfilled order resolving problem service associate took time tied money nearly week,0.01638429132966084,0.9836157086703392,0.11441390914189568,0.8,1.7146906361635488,171.46906361635487,High Trust
Toxic free customer,/users/6145876687ac9300126e2f89,US,8.0,2022-05-08 00:58:41+00:00,1.0,Why are Amazon drivers not accountable…,"Why are Amazon drivers not accountable for delivering and properly losing packages are just generally lying about how they deliver items. There is a video camera in the mail room where I live and the community calls constantly when I don’t lock them up and then other residents steal them and Amazon used to reprimand the driver. They are not reprimanding the drivers anymore.They have third-party delivery companies and you don’t have the correct tracking information and they’re not insured.In the last year I’ve talked to Logistics probably over 20 times. The last time I had a logistics problem the agent told me he would get it to the relevant department, i.e. do nothing. Here is the logistic part departments direct number, the office shared it with me (888) 280-4331 logistics.I found a way to get your money back quicker it might take anywhere from 3 to 5 days to then if you ask them and it doesn’t happen another for 3 to 5 days and then if you have to go to your institution that 7 to 10 business days so it can take a long time to get your money back but it’s good having the bank on your side or credit card company. However if there are smaller items I just have them return it to a gift card balance because then I get my money anywhere from 2 to 4 hours back on my gift card.How is this a customer eccentric service?Amazon does not care a third-party vendors are gouging, so I check on other sites. If Amazon made a mistake and you have to return the item because they won’t replace it they used to give you the amount of what the item is currently selling at because it was their mistake and now they don’t.Again, why is Amazon advertising there a customer eccentric service.Best I can tell is their loyalty is to their shareholders NOT customers",2022-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,8.0,1764,322,39,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon driver accountable delivering properly losing package generally lying deliver item video camera mail room live community call constantly don’t lock resident steal amazon used reprimand driver reprimanding driver anymorethey thirdparty delivery company don’t correct tracking information they’re insuredin last year i’ve talked logistics probably time last time logistics problem agent told would get relevant department ie nothing logistic part department direct number office shared logisticsi found way get money back quicker might take anywhere day ask doesn’t happen another day go institution business day take long time get money back it’s good bank side credit card company however smaller item return gift card balance get money anywhere hour back gift cardhow customer eccentric serviceamazon care thirdparty vendor gouging check site amazon made mistake return item won’t replace used give amount item currently selling mistake don’tagain amazon advertising customer eccentric servicebest tell loyalty shareholder customer,0.0074912507339179035,0.9925087492660821,0.18059450364554122,0.2,0.8323732753621493,83.23732753621493,High Trust
David C,/users/57babffa0000ff000a3cf710,IT,3.0,2022-05-22 07:39:29+00:00,1.0,Very upset and disappointed,"Very upset and disappointed with Amazon.  I have been a customer for over 10 years.  Ordered a laptop.  Had email on delivery day saying there was a problem with delivery and package has been returned to depot.  This despite someone being at home all day.  Thought this was odd but didn't think too much of it.  The box turned up next day - gave code to driver as per the process.  Something didn't seem correct - package was a bit scruffy - I stopped the driver and asked him to wait while we opened the box.  It had 2 bottles of water in it.  Clearly the laptop had been stolen.  I have had very little support from Amazon other than effectively being told it was my fault, that they would not give me a refund and i should contact the police.  I have the transcript from this on-line chat.  The item shows up as being delivered - I have pictures of the box, code and water.  The driver took it back.  Amazon also dispute this.  All I want from Amazon is a replacement item - not a refund.  I am not confident this will happen based on communication with them to date.  Eventually have a refund from Amazon but way I was treated by customer service was poor.",2022-05-07 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,22.0,1160,218,27,4,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,upset disappointed amazon customer year ordered laptop email delivery day saying problem delivery package returned depot despite someone home day thought odd didnt think much box turned next day gave code driver per process something didnt seem correct package bit scruffy stopped driver asked wait opened box bottle water clearly laptop stolen little support amazon effectively told fault would give refund contact police transcript online chat item show delivered picture box code water driver took back amazon also dispute want amazon replacement item refund confident happen based communication date eventually refund amazon way treated customer service poor,0.0032353681148407946,0.9967646318851592,0.12226584408300617,0.2,0.8228354847591808,82.28354847591808,High Trust
