GCO- O,/users/6272e58bba60fe0012c5d0b7,CA,6.0,2022-05-04 22:44:04+00:00,2.0,I am really disappointed with Amazon,"I am really disappointed with Amazon.  I have been a loyal customer for the last 6 years.  Have made several orders.  Once I ordered a laptop and the screen was broken.  I had no way of getting a refund.  They over charged me for orders for Sales tax and delivery during the pandemic, and now I'm locked out of my account. I tried calling customer service but they couldn't solve me issue. They never appreciated me as a loyal customer after all these years.  I think I'm done with them.  I have never felt so disappointed and abandoned.",2022-05-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,4.0,537,98,36,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,really disappointed amazon loyal customer last year made several order ordered laptop screen broken way getting refund charged order sale tax delivery pandemic im locked account tried calling customer service couldnt solve issue never appreciated loyal customer year think im done never felt disappointed abandoned,0.01641203315976419,0.9835879668402359,0.054963544587773416,0.4,1.1027866923376726,110.27866923376726,High Trust
Queenofcomplaints,/users/5c38823d1b96575fda7493c4,GB,89.0,2022-05-04 17:37:49+00:00,1.0,The incompetent a$$hole that delivers…,"The incompetent a$$hole that delivers from redruth depot delivered my parcels unsafe, did not ring my intercom 🤬🤬🤬 AMAZON HAVE HAD A MILLION COMPLAINTS FROM ME YET CONTINUE CAUSING ME STRESS BY LEAVING MY PARCELS UNSAFE. The !d!ot didnt even ring my intercom and left them where my junk!ie neighbour who has criminal records of theft could get it! Sort your redruth depot workers out",2022-05-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,4.0,383,65,38,5,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,incompetent ahole delivers redruth depot delivered parcel unsafe ring intercom 🤬🤬🤬 amazon million complaint yet continue causing stress leaving parcel unsafe dot didnt even ring intercom left junkie neighbour criminal record theft could get sort redruth depot worker,0.9961775683190301,0.003822431680969851,0.03645541222658441,0.2,0.3092022982858018,30.920229828580183,Low Trust
barry rowswell,/users/619ff86126bb980012d6e7d9,GB,4.0,2022-05-04 17:31:03+00:00,1.0,Amazon are actually mis selling Prime,"We pay annually for Prime, but whenever we order anything from Amazon there is always a problem / delay with delivery. The last 2 things we purchased were more trouble getting than if we were to have gone to the City store for them. They continually promise next day delivery, then when it is held up, they then tell you may be up to another 4 days. Disgusting customer service and a complete waste of time!",2022-05-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,4.0,407,76,37,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,pay annually prime whenever order anything amazon always problem delay delivery last thing purchased trouble getting gone city store continually promise next day delivery held tell may another day disgusting customer service complete waste time,0.03711001686899749,0.9628899831310025,0.04262478968031408,0.2,0.7899699495015641,78.9969949501564,High Trust
Kevin Grames,/users/5ea964c799486b2ea0e74f3a,US,8.0,2022-05-04 16:13:40+00:00,2.0,"Great pricing, lack of transparency and accountability","While Amazon's prices are normally way better than other companies selling the same thing their delivery system is flawed endlessly. They promise 1-day or 2-day deliveries and 7 out of 10 times they are never delivered in the promised time frame. What they do not tell you is that they have a clause that is not clearly posted anywhere for you to easily say. It says that the delivery time begins when the item is actually shipped. So, if you order an item on a Saturday and it says it will be delivered on Monday by 10 p.m. this estimate will only be accurate if the item was picked up by the carrier on Saturday. Now shipping delays happen and often they do happen as a result of the carrier so that is completely out of Amazon's hands but change the system to more accurately reflect these delays.Quit making promises that you knowingly cannot keep. Additionally, if an item is not able to be delivered because it is damaged in the transit process then include that reason in the email when you cancel the order. This actually just happened to me. In fact, it is the second time in a month that I ordered an item that I never got.Previously I ordered an item that the third-party vendor said was in stock but were unable to fulfill the order because they banked on the parts being in stock when they were going to be shipped. This didn't happen and they simply refunded my money with no explanation as to why.In both cases I had to call the vendor and Amazon to get details on why. Amazon needs to hold themselves and their vendors accountable for the accuracy of their descriptions. From shipping lead times to availability of items.While ordering online is convenient and often times less expensive it is beginning to show the weaknesses that are apparent. At least when you go to a brick-and-mortar store you know whether they have the item and if not, you move on to find it elsewhere.  There is no expectation that you are being told it is in stock when it really isn't. Their inventory is what it is. We are using online services such as Amazon with the expectation that they are going to be upfront with regards to inventory levels and shipping estimates. Not to be told that there are 15 items in stock, or it is a 2-day delivery and then not be able to fulfill these promises more often than not. Quit trying to look spectacular only to look lackluster most of the time. Prices are not everything when you cannot get the items anyways. I gave Amazon 2 stars only because of pricing. However, if the issues continue my 15-year history with them is gone. I will gladly pay more and be part of their solution to the problem by seeing them go the way of K-Mart and Sears.",2022-05-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,4.0,2679,491,54,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon price normally way better company selling thing delivery system flawed endlessly promise day day delivery time never delivered promised time frame tell clause clearly posted anywhere easily say say delivery time begin item actually shipped order item saturday say delivered monday pm estimate accurate item picked carrier saturday shipping delay happen often happen result carrier completely amazon hand change system accurately reflect delaysquit making promise knowingly cannot keep additionally item able delivered damaged transit process include reason email cancel order actually happened fact second time month ordered item never gotpreviously ordered item thirdparty vendor said stock unable fulfill order banked part stock going shipped didnt happen simply refunded money explanation whyin case call vendor amazon get detail amazon need hold vendor accountable accuracy description shipping lead time availability itemswhile ordering online convenient often time less expensive beginning show weakness apparent least go brickandmortar store know whether item move find elsewhere expectation told stock really isnt inventory using online service amazon expectation going upfront regard inventory level shipping estimate told item stock day delivery able fulfill promise often quit trying look spectacular look lackluster time price everything cannot get item anyways gave amazon star pricing however issue continue year history gone gladly pay part solution problem seeing go way kmart sears,0.007067526053486628,0.9929324739465134,0.2753785754346607,0.4,1.1515419520601888,115.15419520601888,High Trust
