r help. Amazon refuses to offer any support whatsoever!,2022-05-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,9.0,1953,370,25,5,5.0,0,17,1,0,Genuine,bunch scammer never use ridiculous pathetic uncle bought gift card tried buying razer gold gift card balance redeemed gift card block account cost call suffer get hold support lady tell ok sorry allowed buy gift card redeemed gift card like wth u cle bought using money like gave gift say allowed buy stupid extensive argument decide ok leave refund ill sell amazon card since useless said ok balance cant refunded card account way use buy something amazon wtmf dont want buy anything amazon thing wanted buy refusing said sorry thats refunded account may continue shop use balance moment disconnect support block account requires kind nonsense proof payment method used upload uncle billing address number call confirm heart desire also uploaded pic physical receipt bestbuy physical card next day call guy tell hold opening account minute later said ok forward relevant department mu account unblocked day later unblocking feedback suck donkey literally scammed uploaded detail document morning case try lame excuse receiving requested document still suckjust update week later amazon still unlocked account scamming gift card ask uncle take back bestbuy ask help amazon refuse offer support whatsoever,0.9999999996534539,3.46546125129521e-10,0.20751542344363433,0.2,0.34150308486199993,34.15030848619999,Low Trust
