Introverted Cindy,/users/62720e162793eb0013d54fe8,TT,1.0,2022-05-04 07:27:44+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service,"Been a prime member. Never saw the point of it beyond watching the few alright Amazon exclusive shows. Ordered a chromebook recently. Received an older, cheaper version (about $50-$70 difference). Reached out to customer service. Was told I had to return it for a refund because their system is showing the correct item was sent. No option to get a replacement. I sent in picture proof that the Amazon label and manufacturer label on the product box showed two different product versions. Customer service kept insisting they can't do anything unless I return the product. Return is costing me $150, more than half the cost of the product because I'm international, and customer service told me I'll only be compensated up to $20 in return costs. Says nothing else can be done, which I know was a lie. Basically I lost less money by keeping the item. Everyone I spoke to was very condescending, making it seem like I was lying. Tried to leave a review to warn people to check that they received the version they paid for and my review kept getting rejected. Very unethical practices. For a company of this calibre, the customer service truly is appalling.",2022-05-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,5.0,4.0,1155,200,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime member never saw point beyond watching alright amazon exclusive show ordered chromebook recently received older cheaper version difference reached customer service told return refund system showing correct item sent option get replacement sent picture proof amazon label manufacturer label product box showed two different product version customer service kept insisting cant anything unless return product return costing half cost product im international customer service told ill compensated return cost say nothing else done know lie basically lost less money keeping item everyone spoke condescending making seem like lying tried leave review warn people check received version paid review kept getting rejected unethical practice company calibre customer service truly appalling,0.01049057110780252,0.9895094288921975,0.11217049915872125,0.2,0.817188814277843,81.7188814277843,High Trust
