Joe Trueblood,/users/626b0edbfa908b001349eae9,US,1.0,2022-04-29 00:02:13.731000+00:00,1.0,Horrible Customer Service at Amazon,"I have been trying to get Amazon to resolve an issue since December 2021 - allow me to pay with points. Up until December 2021 I could pay with points. Every time I have interacted with Amazon customer service they first try to blame me or my credit card company - then, they try to find other excuses. Bottom line is nothing has been resolved. Amazon is either one of or all of the following - arrogant, lazy or incompetent.",2022-04-29 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,4.0,29.0,425,80,35,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,trying get amazon resolve issue since december allow pay point december could pay point every time interacted amazon customer service first try blame credit card company try find excuse bottom line nothing resolved amazon either one following arrogant lazy incompetent,0.016084167479413967,0.983915832520586,0.044868199663488505,0.2,0.8009315561929907,80.09315561929907,High Trust
