Becky,/users/5c46639b8ad916265a6dc284,US,3.0,2022-04-28 16:00:38.018000+00:00,1.0,Amazon Subscribe and Save Scam,"A few months ago, I signed up for a bunch of products on Amazon Subscribe and Save.  Big mistake.  They give you a price when you first sign up, but that is NOT the price they charge you.  I noticed this week they were and had been charging me several dollars extra per item, and it wasn’t for tax.  They were just charging me more.  I went and looked at the products to see if the price had gone up, and they had not.  In fact, I could hit Buy Now and buy these products much cheaper than what the Subscribe and Save charged me.  There was no warning that they were charging me extra for these products.  If I hadn’t been paying attention they would have stolen hundreds of dollars from me before I noticed.  I tried to leave a review on Amazon about what happened, and they refuse to post it.  They don’t want me to be able to warn others about this scam.",2022-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,4.0,28.0,857,166,30,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,month ago signed bunch product amazon subscribe save big mistake give price first sign price charge noticed week charging several dollar extra per item wasn’t tax charging went looked product see price gone fact could hit buy buy product much cheaper subscribe save charged warning charging extra product hadn’t paying attention would stolen hundred dollar noticed tried leave review amazon happened refuse post don’t want able warn others scam,0.01693288043292828,0.9830671195670717,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.8101538626438836,81.01538626438835,High Trust
Lori Pomranka,/users/6269be1a1105560012f9fe8f,US,1.0,2022-04-28 00:05:25.144000+00:00,1.0,I like most others would leave less…,"I like most others would leave less than zero stars if possible.  Over a month ago Amazon decided that someone was ordering items they shouldn't be - and shut my account down.  All items were me - they were gift cards to Amazon for a program we are doing.  They canceled all.  I was in Mexico at the time - not sure if it was the location that freaked them out.  I have explained over and over and over and over that it is me.  They refuse to turn my account back on.  Every time I call, I'm told that there is no email or phone number they can give out to ""said department"" - CS has to generate an email with them.  CS doesn't even have a phone number to them.  Right.  They've emailed a couple of times with a format email telling me I have to get a new account, because they deemed someone hacked into mine and placed an order.  IT WAS ME!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!  They finally send an email saying if I really want to get back in, what I have to do - starting with resetting my password.  I've explained over and over that I get a notice every time I try to do this - saying they've closed my account and they won't allow the password to reset.  Not only did my Prime renew days before this happened (NO ONE has offered to refund this, so I would have to pay for it again - even though I've asked).  I have numerous items I have to return and now can't because I can't start the return process.  To say their CS is beyond the lowest most pathetic thing I've ever experienced is putting it mildly.",2022-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,4.0,28.0,1494,289,36,7,0.0,0,19,2,1,Suspicious,like others would leave less zero star possible month ago amazon decided someone ordering item shouldnt shut account item gift card amazon program canceled mexico time sure location freaked explained refuse turn account back every time call im told email phone number give said department c generate email c doesnt even phone number right theyve emailed couple time format email telling get new account deemed someone hacked mine placed order finally send email saying really want get back starting resetting password ive explained get notice every time try saying theyve closed account wont allow password reset prime renew day happened one offered refund would pay even though ive asked numerous item return cant cant start return process say c beyond lowest pathetic thing ive ever experienced putting mildly,0.9999999999632876,3.6712410889094826e-11,0.16208637128435222,0.2,0.33241727427522666,33.24172742752267,Low Trust
Snakebite,/users/541c321700006400018b6949,GB,54.0,2022-04-27 13:39:06.773000+00:00,1.0,3rd Party seller mis-represented the goods Amazon yet to refund under A to Z,"I wanted to leave a review for amazon in the UK but laughably the review site is closed as they have closed the website what a joke. Anyway, the story.1 I place an order for a 120Hz hdmi 2.1 4 port TCL TV 2. It arrives, its not 120Hz its 60 it has Hdmi 2.0 and 3 hdmi ports.4. I arrange return, Hermes refuse collection as to heavy.5. One week later Im still waiitng.6 Amazon eventually proved a heavy and large collection ont he 18th May.7. No refund, no refund.So basically Amazon are not that interested as a third party seller, what happened to policing the adverts, when anyone can say anything that's deceit. Under the A to Z buyer protection, Amazon should have simply refunded the goods as both Amazon and the seller have not complied with the sales of goods act let alone there policy.I cannot therefor recommend Amazon for large price purchases as the return system is like trying to farm in a desert, almost pointless. So Reliant Direct and Amazon you should both be ashamed of yourselves. Amazon order details on request, although so far your staff have done nothing constructive and missed the point that the goods were mis-sold.  Credit card company on the 3rd May then county court if not resolved.",2022-04-27 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,4.0,27.0,1213,217,76,14,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wanted leave review amazon uk laughably review site closed closed website joke anyway story place order hz hdmi port tcl tv arrives hz hdmi hdmi port arrange return hermes refuse collection heavy one week later im still waiitng amazon eventually proved heavy large collection ont th may refund refundso basically amazon interested third party seller happened policing advert anyone say anything thats deceit z buyer protection amazon simply refunded good amazon seller complied sale good act let alone policyi cannot therefor recommend amazon large price purchase return system like trying farm desert almost pointless reliant direct amazon ashamed amazon order detail request although far staff done nothing constructive missed point good missold credit card company rd may county court resolved,0.0366774394832673,0.9633225605167327,0.12170499158721257,0.2,0.8060022785758089,80.60022785758089,High Trust
