Former Amazon Patron,/users/62634391932a9c001222e676,US,1.0,2022-04-23 02:11:12.946000+00:00,1.0,Seriously thinking about canceling my…,"Seriously thinking about canceling my Amazon Prime Membership.I will never buy anything of value on Amazon again after Amazon’s latest screw up.I had saved up for close a year for a new IPad.My present one is cracked and hardly works.I ordered the new iPad through my Prime Membership. At 1st, Amazon claimed that it would arrive the very next day.That changed to two days, which I was fine with. I paid a friend to hang out and get the iPad from the Amazon driver. I did this because this was an expensive item and I didn’t want anything to happen to it. The tracking information said the iPad would arrive between 11:45am and 2:45 pm. Only 6 stops away. Later, I saw that the iPad had been delivered!Great, I thought!I got home around 5:30pm and asked my friend where’s the iPad?He told me that No Amazon Track or Driver dropped off anything at the front door?What, I exclaimed!I immediately tried to contact Amazon Customer Service, which is a total nightmare and not much help, other than asking if I had checked my front porch?No, it’s not on the front porch!Customerservice told me that the iPad was delivered because it says so?OMG, what’s wrong with these people.Usually Amazon takes a photo of where the driver left the item.In my case, there was No Photo!So, an hour later I was speaking with an Amazon supervisor.I explained everything for the 20th time.Only to be told, please wait another day?I asked if I could get another tracking number for a time of arrival? No Can Do!If the iPad hasn’t arrived by the end of the 3rd day, please call back and file a claim.Well that day came and went, No IPad.I’m presently taking Amazon to Small Claims Court to get my money back.So, the moral of the story is,Think Twice Before You Order Anything Of Value From Amazon!Because if anything goes wrong, You Are On Your Own!Amazon=Buyer Beware!",2022-04-23 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,4.0,23.0,1843,324,38,5,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,seriously thinking canceling amazon prime membershipi never buy anything value amazon amazon’s latest screw upi saved close year new ipadmy present one cracked hardly worksi ordered new ipad prime membership st amazon claimed would arrive next daythat changed two day fine paid friend hang get ipad amazon driver expensive item didn’t want anything happen tracking information said ipad would arrive pm stop away later saw ipad deliveredgreat thoughti got home around pm asked friend where’s ipadhe told amazon track driver dropped anything front doorwhat exclaimedi immediately tried contact amazon customer service total nightmare much help asking checked front porchno it’s front porchcustomerservice told ipad delivered say soomg what’s wrong peopleusually amazon take photo driver left itemin case photoso hour later speaking amazon supervisori explained everything th timeonly told please wait another dayi asked could get another tracking number time arrival doif ipad hasn’t arrived end rd day please call back file claimwell day came went ipadi’m presently taking amazon small claim court get money backso moral story isthink twice order anything value amazonbecause anything go wrong ownamazonbuyer beware,0.9998408881221419,0.0001591118778581091,0.18171620863712842,0.2,0.33642279766635474,33.642279766635475,Low Trust
