Don,/users/58caf9e00000ff000a826cac,US,7.0,2022-04-05 01:04:18+00:00,1.0,BOYCOTT AMAZON AND KINDLE ! ! !,"All of the growing negative reviews on here are accurate. For some reason, Amazon's customer service is shutting customer's account for no reason, other than perhaps customers are complaining about their now horrible customer service.Many book authors who sell books on Kindle are getting their accounts closed for no reason, and Amazon steals their hard earned royalties, and can never publish on Kindle again. This happened to me when I've sold many books for many years without a problem, the same is said from many authors who are getting their accounts closed, sometimes losing thousands of dollars.For your own sake, please avoid Amazon like the plague until investigators or attorneys can get to the bottom of this. It is like Putin took over Amazon and Kindle, and is doing their best to ripoff customers and authors.",2022-04-05 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,4.0,5.0,825,136,31,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,growing negative review accurate reason amazon customer service shutting customer account reason perhaps customer complaining horrible customer servicemany book author sell book kindle getting account closed reason amazon steal hard earned royalty never publish kindle happened ive sold many book many year without problem said many author getting account closed sometimes losing thousand dollarsfor sake please avoid amazon like plague investigator attorney get bottom like putin took amazon kindle best ripoff customer author,0.00649780909632283,0.9935021909036772,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.8120062833374248,81.20062833374247,High Trust
juhcru,/users/58ed14050000ff000a8c1ac9,BE,9.0,2022-04-04 22:35:15+00:00,1.0,"Used to be great, now it's issue after issue","Used to never have an issue with Amazon and even get great customer service the few times I needed it over a total of 600+ orders. During the first 500 order, I've returned something 3 times.However, lately it has been issue after issue.- For the first after hundreds of orders I've received the wrong item ... and haven't seen my refund after more than 3 months while the status is ""Return received, We will process your refund in 2-3 days..."".- Received a ""new"" pair of underwear that was completely stained ...- Bought a computer mouse that already failed after using it for 9 months (normal usage). So I submitted a negative review ... that didn't get published despite not having broken any review rules. It was a product with a very high sales volume thus it appears like Amazon was trying to fend out negative reviews for its cash cow, despite the issue with the mouse apparently having been a common issue... This caused me to not try to get a refund because I felt like Amazon was brushing it off and thought they'd likely try to get out of a refund if they already react to reviews like that...- Bought a 50€ Amazon gift card ... Amazon cancelled it and kept the money ?!?!? Claiming a violation of their ""terms of usage"", while the rule they claim was broken isn't in accordance with EU law and has also had precedent in court as being an illegal rule.- And a few more things...In total, everything combined I've lost roughly € 100 and having the associated annoyances and time waste. I used to be a very happy customer, now I avoid Amazon as much as possible - only purchasing through Amazon when what I want is a lot cheaper on Amazon.",2022-04-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,4.0,4.0,1648,300,44,9,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,used never issue amazon even get great customer service time needed total order first order ive returned something timeshowever lately issue issue first hundred order ive received wrong item havent seen refund month status return received process refund day received new pair underwear completely stained bought computer mouse already failed using month normal usage submitted negative review didnt get published despite broken review rule product high sale volume thus appears like amazon trying fend negative review cash cow despite issue mouse apparently common issue caused try get refund felt like amazon brushing thought theyd likely try get refund already react review like bought € amazon gift card amazon cancelled kept money claiming violation term usage rule claim broken isnt accordance eu law also precedent court illegal rule thingsin total everything combined ive lost roughly € associated annoyance time waste used happy customer avoid amazon much possible purchasing amazon want lot cheaper amazon,0.057760204482845426,0.9422397955171545,0.16825574873808188,0.2,0.8047710475061937,80.47710475061936,High Trust
