Mrs Susan Wilson,/users/5cacc8079f582b20dba6dde6,GB,31.0,2022-04-01 10:10:38+00:00,1.0,Very poor customer service,"I ordered some diamante embellished flip flops from an Amazon company.  They arrived with many of the stones missing making them defective for use as you could clearly see the missing stones in the decorative bow on the top.  I decided to return the item, that is when the problems began.  Amazon and the company make it almost impossible to return items without a lengthy process.  Very unhappy decided to just bin the item.  Will never purchase items from Amazon again as this is not the first time I have encountered issues when items arrive and are faulty.",2022-04-01 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,4.0,1.0,560,98,26,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered diamante embellished flip flop amazon company arrived many stone missing making defective use could clearly see missing stone decorative bow top decided return item problem began amazon company make almost impossible return item without lengthy process unhappy decided bin item never purchase item amazon first time encountered issue item arrive faulty,0.019922621931895187,0.9800773780681048,0.054963544587773416,0.2,0.801031397951607,80.1031397951607,High Trust
