A.W,/users/5fedba91fadb09001979c548,GB,7.0,2022-03-10 19:47:15+00:00,1.0,Don't buy from Amazon Warehouse,"Don't buy from Amazon Warehouse. I bought a food processor from them, it was advertised as 'Good' (so, under their conditions it should have arrived in the manufacturer's box and would probably have been returned as an inwanted item). It arrived in a random box and had vital parts of the machine missing! I returned it via the Post Office with the details Amazon sent to me. They could see that it had been recieved. This was on Saturday - I'm STILL Waiting for a refund from them, it's Thursday. I;ve contacted their 'customer services' who basically said 'computer says no'. So I'm out of pocket because THEY failed to deliver on their description of the goods and sent something totally unuseable. They used to be SO much better than this. A massive decline in service standards.",2022-03-10 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,3.0,10.0,783,137,31,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,dont buy amazon warehouse bought food processor advertised good condition arrived manufacturer box would probably returned inwanted item arrived random box vital part machine missing returned via post office detail amazon sent could see recieved saturday im still waiting refund thursday ive contacted customer service basically said computer say im pocket failed deliver description good sent something totally unuseable used much better massive decline service standard,0.08032101029268374,0.9196789897073163,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.775206853238403,77.5206853238403,High Trust
