John David,/users/62281257ebe80c0012a7bc7f,US,2.0,2022-03-09 02:35:14+00:00,1.0,I ordered a computer graphics card that…,"I ordered a computer graphics card that was wrongfully described as “low profile”. I returned it in as new condition with all items and didn’t even put it in my computer because it was obvious it wouldn’t fit.  The seller was a 3rd party prime seller that I shipped it back to.  They charged a 20% restocking fee which I called Amazon to find out why.  After asking the first Person from Amazon told me they couldn’t do anything, so I asked to talk to a supervisor who was extremely, extremely rude and he said tough and hung up without me able to explain anything.  I called Amazon back and got a different rep who told me if I would send stuff back claiming it’s damaged rather than incorrect description then I would have gotten all my money back.  So the moral of the story is lie to get all your money back.  I immediately dropped my prime membership, there are plenty of other companies to do business with that don’t charge $120.00 per year to be rude to you.",2022-03-09 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,3.0,9.0,966,180,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered computer graphic card wrongfully described “low profile” returned new condition item didn’t even put computer obvious wouldn’t fit seller rd party prime seller shipped back charged restocking fee called amazon find asking first person amazon told couldn’t anything asked talk supervisor extremely extremely rude said tough hung without able explain anything called amazon back got different rep told would send stuff back claiming it’s damaged rather incorrect description would gotten money back moral story lie get money back immediately dropped prime membership plenty company business don’t charge per year rude,0.015298283716339607,0.9847017162836604,0.10095344924284913,0.2,0.8125415479904,81.25415479904,High Trust
Tracy Beauregard,/users/5f8f5b2c17dfec001a3e69f0,US,5.0,2022-03-09 00:23:56+00:00,1.0,Amazon customer service doesn’t care about you,"I ordered 12 mason jars on February 14, 2022. It was supposed to be delivered March 4, ok, I can wait. Then it was delayed, no problem. Then on March 8th, I look at the tracking and it says it was delivered at the side door on March 7. Well, I’m home all day and they didn’t come, AND I don’t have a side door. I contacted Fed Ex, and they asked for the tracking number, my name and address. I give them all the information and they tell me that the package doesn’t have my name or address. Ok, so now I know it was delivered to someone else. I contact the seller, Romero Co, and I get a generic email saying that I should look all around my house and sometimes it switches carriers, so just wait. WHAT? Seriously, it went to another address and I still have to wait?So I contact AMAZON. The girl who called me had me on hold for about 10-15 minutes, came back, said “I’m sorry about….” Then she’s gone. I start a chat with Amazon, told them the same thing, went to a different address, first thing “June” said to me was to look all around my house. WHAT?????After a back and forth, she says I have to wait 24-48 hours cause that’s the sellers policy. Meanwhile, I’m out $56 and no product, waited almost a month after ordering and now, Just keep waiting. So I look online to see where I can leave a review for Amazon itself, I find all these complaints that Amazon is deleting reviews. WHAT?????  I used to buy something every week from Amazon, no more. The customer service is terrible. June wasn’t pleasant. She kept asking me the same question over and over. IT’S IN CHAT. You can relook at it. What the heck with their customer service. No more. I’m done with this company.",2022-03-09 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,3.0,9.0,1678,319,46,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered mason jar february supposed delivered march ok wait delayed problem march th look tracking say delivered side door march well i’m home day didn’t come don’t side door contacted fed ex asked tracking number name address give information tell package doesn’t name address ok know delivered someone else contact seller romero co get generic email saying look around house sometimes switch carrier wait seriously went another address still waitso contact amazon girl called hold minute came back said “i’m sorry about…” she’s gone start chat amazon told thing went different address first thing “june” said look around house whatafter back forth say wait hour cause that’s seller policy meanwhile i’m product waited almost month ordering keep waiting look online see leave review amazon find complaint amazon deleting review used buy something every week amazon customer service terrible june wasn’t pleasant kept asking question it’s chat relook heck customer service i’m done company,0.029667818158748648,0.9703321818412514,0.17891194615816042,0.2,0.8209484801522579,82.09484801522578,High Trust
