customer,/users/5f243892c2b593babc048397,GB,7.0,2022-03-08 02:17:58+00:00,1.0,Amazon and ABSU SUPPLIES missing parts,"I recently bought a sealey fps5 paddock stand from ABSU SUPPLIES who sell on Amazon, this paddock stand is a headstock stand that can also be adapted to be used as a rear stand with two pins that are supplied with it ,When it arrived,the two pins that allow it to be used as a rear stand were missing,I contacted Amazon and supplied the order number and tracking number they had given to me , and to my surprise they said it wasn’t one of theirs, So I then contacted ABSU SUPPLIES who’s name was on the invoice and had taken the money from my account, and they too denied any involvement in the the sale,The whole reason I bought this was for it’s adaptability to be used as a front and rear stand , and both AMAZON and ABSU SUPPLIES are not willing to do anything about it ,These two pins that are missing are clearly included in the description on the Amazon website and should have been included,So please if anybody who is thinking about buying the sealey fps5 headstock and rear paddock stand from AMAZON and ABSU SUPPLIES , think again,They should both be ashamed of themselves.UPDATE Amazon have now denied me the right to leave any feedback at all on their site, About themselves and the sellers who advertised this product wrongly,CLASSY.",2022-03-06 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,3.0,8.0,1247,226,38,6,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,recently bought sealey fps paddock stand absu supply sell amazon paddock stand headstock stand also adapted used rear stand two pin supplied arrivedthe two pin allow used rear stand missingi contacted amazon supplied order number tracking number given surprise said wasn’t one contacted absu supply who’s name invoice taken money account denied involvement salethe whole reason bought it’s adaptability used front rear stand amazon absu supply willing anything two pin missing clearly included description amazon website includedso please anybody thinking buying sealey fps headstock rear paddock stand amazon absu supply think againthey ashamed themselvesupdate amazon denied right leave feedback site seller advertised product wronglyclassy,0.027062182459647297,0.9729378175403527,0.126752664049355,0.2,0.8118194415800474,81.18194415800474,High Trust
J.R.,/users/621ce5630dcf740012696c1d,US,5.0,2022-03-06 01:42:11+00:00,1.0,SERVICE MEMBER TREATED BADLY!!,"So there is a reason I pay for Amazon Prime. Mainly for the next day and two day delivery speeds. As a US Service Member with a service dog yesterday March 4th I ordered Purina One dog food because my dog was out of her food. I do not drive or own a car for that matter. I ordered and paid for next day delivery. Low and behold my order was not delivered and I received an email stating my order was delayed. I contacted customer service and first was told "" I can give you a $5 dollar credit, and have your pets food to you by March 8th"". First off $5 dollar credit is laughable since this has actually happend to me multiple times recently. Secondly as I already stated above my dog was out of her food that's why I had next day delivery.  What's my dog supposed to do until March 8th starve to death?So I asked to speak with her supervisor which his name was Sayajit or something to that nature and was pretty much told there is nothing I can do for you! This guy didn't even offer me the laughable $5 dollar credit the first lady offered me. I ASK IS THIS REALLY HOW YOU WANT TO BE KNOWN TO TREAT US SERVICE MEMBERS WHO HQVE FAUGHT FOR YOUR FREEDOMS? I have ordered stuff from Amazon before and had it delivered the same day. I truly believe that even though I was told it was with the carrier and there is nothing I can do, I should have gotten the $24 dollars I paid for the food as a credit and the dog food for free. Now mind you I live in Burlington Kentucky which is 10 mins down the road from many Amazon Warehouses aswell as The CVG Airport Amazon HUB!! I have already contacted all the local news stations here in Cincinnati Ohio. Letting them know how I was treated as a Service Member with a PTSD Service Dog. Why pay all this money yearly for a service that you Amazon can not honor. You need to consider changing your policy and taking the next day delivery off your site especially if your not going to honor it!!!I have spent probably close to 500-600 dollars roughly in the last 2 weeks with amazon and again to be treated like I was today is sad and hurtful and ridiculous. I'm curious how someone at Corporate thinks about this issue!! And how Jeff Bazos the freaking billionaire would think about US Service members being treated this way.So in a nutshell my dog has to go hungry for the next couple days until this order is delivered and your company didn't even offer me anything as a credit or nothing. Was told to wait for the order and if it doesn't come we can give you a refund or you can send it back for a refund. That my friends is totally assanine in my opinion.  My suggestion is to watch your delivery speeds cause Amazon doesn't always honor that!!!!Sincerely,STAFF SERGEANT JAMES ROSSMY SERVICE DOG 🐕‍🦺  SHAY",2022-03-06 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,3.0,6.0,2746,523,30,4,0.0,0,12,2,1,Suspicious,reason pay amazon prime mainly next day two day delivery speed u service member service dog yesterday march th ordered purina one dog food dog food drive car matter ordered paid next day delivery low behold order delivered received email stating order delayed contacted customer service first told give dollar credit pet food march th first dollar credit laughable since actually happend multiple time recently secondly already stated dog food thats next day delivery whats dog supposed march th starve deathso asked speak supervisor name sayajit something nature pretty much told nothing guy didnt even offer laughable dollar credit first lady offered ask really want known treat u service member hqve faught freedom ordered stuff amazon delivered day truly believe even though told carrier nothing gotten dollar paid food credit dog food free mind live burlington kentucky min road many amazon warehouse aswell cvg airport amazon hub already contacted local news station cincinnati ohio letting know treated service member ptsd service dog pay money yearly servic