Kerry,/users/58e093ec0000ff000a889eb3,GB,65.0,2022-03-05 04:58:49+00:00,1.0,prices have went through the roof!!!,"prices have went through the roof!!!I used to order from amazon all the time but now find ebay much better. Amazon want me to pay £5 delivery because I'm 1p short of their free delivery option?! don't bloody think so. I can't afford prime and I can't justify paying it every month anyway when I use ebay more. I may have to wait an extra few days for delivery but I'd sooner that than pay extra to amazon. Think its poor. Their drivers NEVER attempt a second delivery, instead opting to leave my packages in my stairwell where they have been stolen...who the hell is the driver to decide what's a safe place?! Customer service is a joke and have to fight to get a refund where as ebay just refund you straight away when you don't receive your stuff, hardly rocket science...Ebay is far superior for customer care. and can someone please explain why amazon think its ok to add an extra £15 to a £29 kallax ikea unit?? daylight robbery",2022-03-05 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,3.0,5.0,933,172,36,6,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,price went roofi used order amazon time find ebay much better amazon want pay £ delivery im p short free delivery option dont bloody think cant afford prime cant justify paying every month anyway use ebay may wait extra day delivery id sooner pay extra amazon think poor driver never attempt second delivery instead opting leave package stairwell stolenwho hell driver decide whats safe place customer service joke fight get refund ebay refund straight away dont receive stuff hardly rocket scienceebay far superior customer care someone please explain amazon think ok add extra £ £ kallax ikea unit daylight robbery,0.9905453410831161,0.009454658916883907,0.09646662927650028,0.2,0.324020655313742,32.402065531374205,Low Trust
Veronica  Thompson,/users/51d135fa0000640001420300,GB,67.0,2022-03-04 17:00:30+00:00,1.0,Be careful when ordering food products if they arrive damaged,"I have always rated Amazon  highly and in all the years I have been a Prime client have never had cause to complain. That was until I ordered some bread flour which arrived in a box buttered and bruised, with one of the five bags damaged.Thought all it would take would be to ask for a replacement and have searched high and low for how to contact them. The suggest they have a chat function but every avenue leads back to the order page which when you click on the only link ie  returns says food products cannot be returned. Understandable, but I don’t want to return a bag of leaking artisan flour - I simply want a refund, or better still replacement. I tried to indicate this through the only channels open,  customer feedback and then customer reviews but total silence, and the poor review has not been posted. Will be reluctant to buy food products again if they cannot deal with a complaint quickly and reasonably. Or even just provide a loyal customer the courtesy of a response.",2022-03-04 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,3.0,4.0,989,180,61,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,always rated amazon highly year prime client never cause complain ordered bread flour arrived box buttered bruised one five bag damagedthought would take would ask replacement searched high low contact suggest chat function every avenue lead back order page click link ie return say food product cannot returned understandable don’t want return bag leaking artisan flour simply want refund better still replacement tried indicate channel open customer feedback customer review total silence poor review posted reluctant buy food product cannot deal complaint quickly reasonably even provide loyal customer courtesy response,0.07309877308405553,0.9269012269159445,0.10095344924284913,0.2,0.783641303306542,78.3641303306542,High Trust
