Dorota Bigus,/users/5730703a0000ff000a1e64f4,GB,9.0,2022-03-01 19:36:04+00:00,1.0,Thief and liar !!!!!,"Stay away from those Antichrist chiefs that is how Bezos get rich by stealing money from others. I ordered a few items, my card was charged while I did the order, and they supposed to deliver next day. Did not happen. I cancel orders, right away the item vanished. I thought I will get refund. I wait a few days no refund. I called customer service and the person told me to wait . I called again after few days and the person told me that never items were charged. Amazon steal money for 5 items. If you work find other place to work. Antichrist globalist piece of crap. That is how Bezos get money by taking advantage from other people and stealing money from others . I was given free trial of prime. I cancelled immediately. Never again and I will pray that people find better job than this Bezos stealing machine .",2022-03-01 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,3.0,1.0,819,154,20,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,stay away antichrist chief bezos get rich stealing money others ordered item card charged order supposed deliver next day happen cancel order right away item vanished thought get refund wait day refund called customer service person told wait called day person told never item charged amazon steal money item work find place work antichrist globalist piece crap bezos get money taking advantage people stealing money others given free trial prime cancelled immediately never pray people find better job bezos stealing machine,0.0213006955694914,0.9786993044305086,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.8066239090856974,80.66239090856973,High Trust
David Perkins,/users/621db7691addbc0013a4d721,US,2.0,2022-03-01 06:04:49+00:00,1.0,Amazon banned our community organization!,"We are a community organization in Chicago that feeds the homeless and does STEM activities to help disadvantaged youth to inspire them to into STEM fields. As the children are, our future. Well, we use Amazon Pay to process payments on our website, and out the blue one day they just banned our account. Well we ended up messaging them several times and they never can give an answer to what we violated or the reason for our banning. They just kept stating we 'may' have violated. Which in the English language can mean you may have.. but also you may not have.  And of course they don't have a phone number for that 'special' department to discuss this issue.Well after getting nowhere for over a month we contacted the BBB. They were very helpful, but as documented Amazon again did the roundabout, saying, ""You 'may' have done something."" And when pressed that the media will be contacted they came back saying 'occult' violates AUP. What does that even mean? Occult just means hidden.  And in searching amazon for 'occult' hundreds of items come up like crystals, tarot cards etc.  So what are they talking about?So they're literally making up stuff and this is coming from a multi-billion dollar organization. So they have left us no choice but to let the world know what they're doing behind the scenes. Targeting community organizations which is the lowest of low. We have proof of everything stated here and all is 100% factual and are willing to join in on a class action law suit submitting our proof as evidence if need be.Beware.",2022-03-01 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,3.0,1.0,1543,270,41,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,community organization chicago feed homeless stem activity help disadvantaged youth inspire stem field child future well use amazon pay process payment website blue one day banned account well ended messaging several time never give answer violated reason banning kept stating may violated english language mean may also may course dont phone number special department discus issuewell getting nowhere month contacted bbb helpful documented amazon roundabout saying may done something pressed medium contacted came back saying occult violates aup even mean occult mean hidden searching amazon occult hundred item come like crystal tarot card etc talking aboutso theyre literally making stuff coming multibillion dollar organization left u choice let world know theyre behind scene targeting community organization lowest low proof everything stated factual willing join class action law suit submitting proof evidence need bebeware,0.007412258963727553,0.9925877410362725,0.1514301738642737,0.2,0.8265799052909909,82.6579905290991,High Trust
