Joe Maneca,/users/5cdff9b234e829649e84c4d9,US,2.0,2022-02-27 19:58:55+00:00,1.0,Amazon gift card scam,"be careful with amazon returns they pulled a fast one on me. I ordered 4 pairs of snowboard pants the same on the same order. they were all around 200 when I received all of them, I found that they were too small 1 then returned all 4 on the same day and re-ordered 1 pair of the 1 i liked best. I then waited for the near $800 credit when i did not see all of it on my amazon card i found that they placed some of it on a gift card and once any of it is used, they will not put it back to the card it was ordered on. this forces you to pay the card bill in full and your money is stuck in amazon whether you want to buy anything or not. funny that only 1 pair was not credited I think they do this on purpose as it forces anyone not paying attention to buy more from amazon. this is a scam. I found out what was purchase using this gift card and returned it all and the went to Walmart and bought the same things that I returned just so I could get my money back from amazon",2022-02-27 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,27.0,975,207,21,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,careful amazon return pulled fast one ordered pair snowboard pant order around received found small returned day reordered pair liked best waited near credit see amazon card found placed gift card used put back card ordered force pay card bill full money stuck amazon whether want buy anything funny pair credited think purpose force anyone paying attention buy amazon scam found purchase using gift card returned went walmart bought thing returned could get money back amazon,0.02241119551934678,0.9775888044806532,0.1160964666292765,0.2,0.8120136955661819,81.20136955661819,High Trust
