C.L. CURRIE,/users/62189578e4f1540013c1af44,US,2.0,2022-02-26 20:15:16+00:00,5.0,Best Online Shopping,"I guess only the upset people have posted here or maybe things are different outside of the U.S. My experience has been awesome. Yes, recently some deliveries have been a day later than first stated. But where else can you get one to two day delivery free? I don’t buy from 3rd party sellers. If it isn't prime or Amazon recommended, I don’t buy it. The on-site shopping is super easy, and the prices are the lowest or comparable. The online streaming is a bonus. Customer Service has always been helpful to me. There was a glitch recently that was quickly handled where the wrong address was on my subscribe and save. I think it's important to keep your manners when talking to customer support of any legit company.",2022-02-26 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,26.0,717,129,20,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,guess upset people posted maybe thing different outside u experience awesome yes recently delivery day later first stated else get one two day delivery free don’t buy rd party seller isnt prime amazon recommended don’t buy onsite shopping super easy price lowest comparable online streaming bonus customer service always helpful glitch recently quickly handled wrong address subscribe save think important keep manner talking customer support legit company,0.012595626297679309,0.9874043737023207,0.0723499719573752,1.0,2.0081721812426356,200.81721812426358,High Trust
J Curiel,/users/5f33282cef67ace2280ef7fa,NL,3.0,2022-02-26 10:18:07+00:00,1.0,STAY AWAY FROM AMAZON. MY FAMILY GOT THREATED BY THEM. AMAZON DOES NOT RESPECT YOUR PRIVACY,"I got in a dispute with an seller because he was demanding me a reason why I am returning its product. In my opinion and according with the law I do not have to provide you with a reason why I am returning a product within the legal terms. I decided to ask Amazon to intermediate. I got approach by Budify who claimed to represent Amazon. He looked in the file and told me that he will refund me immediately and in addition I will receive a 30 euro voucher from Amazon. But he wanted me to retrieve my negative feedback from Amazon platform in order for me to get refunded and receive my voucher. I decided to retrieve my negative feedback. I got refunded but never received my voucher. After contacting Budify for my voucher I got an reply: I should be happy I got you refunded. I have complained to Budify and his answer was that they know where I life and who my kids are as they have looked it up in the Amazon systems. I could not believe what Budify was telling me so I decided to recontact Amazon with a complain. Amazon simply gave me a standard reply as they do not really care about they customers. I have looked up who is this Budify and I found this person: Adrián Aparicio VeraCL Poeta Manuel Benitez Carrasco 32, 3 ASEVILLA ESPAÑA41013 ESmobile:+34-644692955chamber of commerce #: 30240618BAfter knowing this I have asked Amazon about my privacy as I have never agree or consent for Amazon to provide this person/organization with my personal information. Until today Amazon is not providing me with an answer. So now I am dealing with a complete stranger who has all my private information without my consent (which is against European privacy law). Shame on Amazon, bad company, bad organization. DO NOT WASTE YOUR TIME BUYING FROM AMAZON. I HAVE A FAMILY AND BEING TREATED BY A STRANGER WHO HAS ALL YOUR PRIVATE INFORMATION (PROVIDED BY AMAZON) IS A NIGHTMARE. AFTER REVIEWING THIS WHO SITUATION I GOT BLACKMAILED BY BUDIFY WHO REPRESENT AMAZON IN ORDER FOR ME TO RETRIEVE MY NEGATIVE FEEDBACK FROM THEIR WEBSITE. AMAZON DOES NOT RESPECT YOUR PRIVACY OR PRIVATE INFORMATION.",2022-02-26 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,26.0,2091,372,91,16,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,got dispute seller demanding reason returning product opinion according law provide reason returning product within legal term decided ask amazon intermediate got approach budify claimed represent amazon looked file told refund immediately addition receive euro voucher amazon wanted retrieve negative feedback amazon platform order get refunded receive voucher decided retrieve negative feedback got refunded never received voucher contacting budify voucher got reply happy got refunded complained budify answer know life kid looked amazon system could believe budify telling decided recontact amazon complain amazon simply gave standard reply really care customer looked budify found person adrián aparicio veracl poeta manuel benitez carrasco asevilla españa esmobilechamber commerce bafter knowing asked amazon privacy never agree consent amazon provide personorganization personal information today amazon providing answer dealing complete stranger private information without consent european privacy law shame amazon bad company bad organization waste time buying amazon family treated stranger private information provided amazon nightmare reviewing situation got blackmailed budify represent amazon order retrieve negative feedback website amazon respect privacy private information,0.0077933657787068586,0.9922066342212932,0.20863712843522153,0.2,0.837830742797691,83.7830742797691,High Trust
Jacob Schildt,/users/6219ecce981dc70012343321,US,1.0,2022-02-26 09:03:48+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service out there,"Bought a sink that came with a free faucet and guess what. I only got the faucet. I needed the sink for countertop measurements, and I stressed this to amazons “customer support” and their only solution was to return it and order again. Are you freaking joking me? Why should I have to spend my time returning and ordering again when it was them that screwed up? And especially because I had to go buy a new sink that was $200 more because they told me it’d be here on a date that would’ve worked with my measurement date? I’m going to do everything in my power to not order anything from Amazon. If I can find it somewhere else to buy what I want (which 99% of the time you can) I’m gonna do it. Screw their support team.",2022-02-26 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,26.0,722,140,32,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought sink came free faucet guess got faucet needed sink countertop measurement stressed amazon “customer support” solution return order freaking joking spend time returning ordering screwed especially go buy new sink told it’d date would’ve worked measurement date i’m going everything power order anything amazon find somewhere else buy want time i’m gonna screw support team,0.00623824838401277,0.9937617516159872,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.8125847456902145,81.25847456902146,High Trust
