Kelley,/users/61fc0ea8c8b5f400121caef4,US,5.0,2022-02-26 02:40:15+00:00,1.0,Horrible customer service,"Amazon used to have wonderful customer service. They used to go above and beyond to make sure that they were hitting the mark every time in customer satisfaction. They’ve gone from that to dropping the ball every single time. Over the past several months every single package that I have ordered has arrived late. Not only that, they wait until they’re back to the distribution center, which you can clearly see by tracking them on the app, and send a message stating that they attempted delivery. Like saying at that very moment they had attempted delivery even though they are nowhere near the area. I have called customer service about this several times and all I get is apologies or else they hang up on me. When they apologized they promised that they’re going to escalate it and follow up and yet nothing changes and no one contacts me about how to fix the problem and I’m just so disgusted and fed up that I don’t think I’m even going to order anything from Amazon anymore. I may just cancel my membership entirely because I don’t even watch prime that much anymore. I really thought that Amazon was a different kind of company, and they did used to be. Now they’re just like every other crappy company that doesn’t care anything about their customers because they have so many of them they figure they can lose them and it won’t even make an impact. It’s very sad to see a good company adopt that kind of attitude. Shame on you Mr. Bezos for allowing your company to turn into just another greedy corporation that doesn’t care anything about the customer.",2022-02-26 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,26.0,1564,280,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon used wonderful customer service used go beyond make sure hitting mark every time customer satisfaction they’ve gone dropping ball every single time past several month every single package ordered arrived late wait they’re back distribution center clearly see tracking app send message stating attempted delivery like saying moment attempted delivery even though nowhere near area called customer service several time get apology else hang apologized promised they’re going escalate follow yet nothing change one contact fix problem i’m disgusted fed don’t think i’m even going order anything amazon anymore may cancel membership entirely don’t even watch prime much anymore really thought amazon different kind company used they’re like every crappy company doesn’t care anything customer many figure lose won’t even make impact it’s sad see good company adopt kind attitude shame mr bezos allowing company turn another greedy corporation doesn’t care anything customer,0.023163854287489072,0.976836145712511,0.15703869882220975,0.2,0.8198258126206975,81.98258126206976,High Trust
