Kis Ágnes,/users/61c763968f45ce001278dd9a,DK,2.0,2022-02-24 15:50:31+00:00,1.0,"Scary technical issues, terrible customer service,","First they messed up my gift card (simply disappeared from my account) - customer service unimaginably bad. They didn't even understand the problem, when they realise they can't help a new person tries to assist me and I have to explain everything again and again and again without anything going forward. Finally, when someone saw that I didn't spend but received the amount, and admits that it disappeared, compensation is still not an option :D. They don't have the authority I suppose.Then few weeks later I can't even log in :D. I don't get the security notification to my phone, whereas my number is correct (confirmed with customer service). Customer service then tries to authenticate me on phone, which is unsuccessful, because I don't remember the last 3 books I bought (I don't even remember buying anything from amazon, I have this account for ~10 years and I barely use it for shopping).So now I can't log in to audible either, which I have a subscription for. And this was again many hours of my life instead of them just implementing other ways to authenticate (email, secondary phone number, push notification, I don't know man, something, it is the 21st century!)Overall, I am shocked that customer complaints worth nothing for them, there is no interface to escalate problems and that they have been able to build a disfunctioning bureaucracy in capitalism and they are not yet falling apart.",2022-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,24.0,1410,238,50,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,first messed gift card simply disappeared account customer service unimaginably bad didnt even understand problem realise cant help new person try assist explain everything without anything going forward finally someone saw didnt spend received amount admits disappeared compensation still option dont authority supposethen week later cant even log dont get security notification phone whereas number correct confirmed customer service customer service try authenticate phone unsuccessful dont remember last book bought dont even remember buying anything amazon account year barely use shoppingso cant log audible either subscription many hour life instead implementing way authenticate email secondary phone number push notification dont know man something st centuryoverall shocked customer complaint worth nothing interface escalate problem able build disfunctioning bureaucracy capitalism yet falling apart,0.056173888377137,0.943826111622863,0.1334828939988783,0.2,0.7986096346112073,79.86096346112073,High Trust
Anon,/users/6217a43ccc077d0012afc630,GB,2.0,2022-02-24 15:38:20+00:00,5.0,Best online shop by far,Don't know what all the bad reviews are about. It seems like mainly angry people venting. Amazon has the same products as supermarkets for much cheaper prices. And unlike royal mail or hermes in the uk their delivery is 95% of the time on or before the delivery date. Packages are very rarely lost and customer service are always very helpful and will give you coupons if they can't fix your issue. They're the only online business that are actually trustworthy and won't try to screw you. Only very minor issue i have with them is when a delivery date changes and they don't notify you or ask if you'd like to cancel/ refund. They don't even tell you it changed if you check which can make you doubt yourself. Again this is very rare to happen and they are generally excellent.,2022-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,24.0,778,142,23,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dont know bad review seems like mainly angry people venting amazon product supermarket much cheaper price unlike royal mail hermes uk delivery time delivery date package rarely lost customer service always helpful give coupon cant fix issue theyre online business actually trustworthy wont try screw minor issue delivery date change dont notify ask youd like cancel refund dont even tell changed check make doubt rare happen generally excellent,0.02371201448523416,0.9762879855147658,0.07964105440269209,1.0,2.0040722036379215,200.40722036379213,High Trust
