Lauren C,/users/5e5627a21a955c2e0e2bcb20,GB,6.0,2022-02-24 10:48:19+00:00,1.0,Recalled food item,Placed an order in December for a food item. Yesterday (23/2/22) the item was recalled. The food had obviously already been consumed and to which I had food poisoning that week and when recalled there was a risk of “microbiology contamination”. When speaking to Amazon about this and explaining how I was not happy especially since I had to go see a doctor and have time off work. The response I got was “I’m sorry your order hasn’t arrived yet”. No help at all to settle my issue.,2022-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,24.0,481,88,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order december food item yesterday item recalled food obviously already consumed food poisoning week recalled risk “microbiology contamination” speaking amazon explaining happy especially since go see doctor time work response got “i’m sorry order hasn’t arrived yet” help settle issue,0.012212736104579671,0.9877872638954204,0.049355019629837356,0.2,0.8037646358736776,80.37646358736777,High Trust
Paradox_cat,/users/621732e14ab60d0012074771,GB,2.0,2022-02-24 07:25:29+00:00,1.0,Unscrupulous as best,"So I bought a £50 psn voucher. The order went through, money left my bank and my statement confirmed this. Amazon then tried to say the payment didn't go through when it blatantly did. After 3 or 4 days of getting no where I decided to contact consumer direct. They have no taken on my case an dive asked for my £50 psn and £250 Compensation for my time which they said there is a high chance I'll get that as amazon acted illegally. They have all the proof, original order, transaction proof, my bank statement for the transaction as well as transaction number as well as the whole conversation of them seeing I paid then going back on wheat they said. Do not trust, the customer service are useless and lack the education or mental capability to do the job they are tasked with.",2022-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,24.0,780,145,20,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought £ psn voucher order went money left bank statement confirmed amazon tried say payment didnt go blatantly day getting decided contact consumer direct taken case dive asked £ psn £ compensation time said high chance ill get amazon acted illegally proof original order transaction proof bank statement transaction well transaction number well whole conversation seeing paid going back wheat said trust customer service useless lack education mental capability job tasked,0.01842494380937099,0.981575056190629,0.08132361189007291,0.2,0.8070522504733291,80.7052250473329,High Trust
Manuel Maestrini,/users/5f758b062480d04364c92500,DK,5.0,2022-02-23 20:59:04+00:00,1.0,Amazon breach of contract,"I returned an item that was sold as new although it was used and amazon told me to return it and buy a new one. The only other such item was a lot more expensive, so they wrote me an email promising to cover price difference and import duties.Once I received the new item and contacted them for refund, they went back on what i have in writing and now refuse to uphold their end of the bargain. Desplicable behavior from a company that used to pride itself of their customer service.I spent almost an hour on the phone and nothing. Will not buy again.",2022-02-23 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,23.0,551,105,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,returned item sold new although used amazon told return buy new one item lot expensive wrote email promising cover price difference import dutiesonce received new item contacted refund went back writing refuse uphold end bargain desplicable behavior company used pride customer servicei spent almost hour phone nothing buy,0.021785604335666096,0.9782143956643339,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.8008851002438326,80.08851002438327,High Trust
