StrangeAsAngels,/users/5ec020e3ee8f29394ad2b834,US,25.0,2022-02-21 19:04:21+00:00,1.0,Worse customer service,"Once upon a time Amazon was a great company.  Those days are long gone.  Greed has transformed this company and not for the better.  If you have any sort of issue with an order, you will get someone in a third world country with a script and a lack of basic comprehension skills.  That's their idea of ""support"". I tried to return something and only had the option of having UPS pick it up.  Waited all day for UPS and they never came.  I contacted Amazon yet again.... explained that UPS never showed up and my preference was to drop it off at UPS store.  I was told by the customer service idiot that I could simply drop it off to the UPS store.  WRONG.  I drove to the UPS store and was told that they could not accept my package because I had the wrong barcode and the one I gave them was for UPS pickup.   I stepped outside, contacted Amazon, got another moron w/ a script in a third world call center who couldn't help me.  I was told that they could not provide a QR code and I needed to find a printer.   So I had to drive home from the UPS store to print the barcode.  Now I get to find the time to drive yet again to the UPS store to drop the return off.How is this convenient and why should I keep paying for Prime?  Seems like Prime keeps going up and service keeps getting worse.Done with Amazon.",2022-02-21 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,21.0,1309,254,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,upon time amazon great company day long gone greed transformed company better sort issue order get someone third world country script lack basic comprehension skill thats idea support tried return something option ups pick waited day ups never came contacted amazon yet explained ups never showed preference drop ups store told customer service idiot could simply drop ups store wrong drove ups store told could accept package wrong barcode one gave ups pickup stepped outside contacted amazon got another moron w script third world call center couldnt help told could provide qr code needed find printer drive home ups store print barcode get find time drive yet ups store drop return offhow convenient keep paying prime seems like prime keep going service keep getting worsedone amazon,0.03383392027774622,0.9661660797222538,0.142456533931576,0.2,0.811574346647442,81.1574346647442,High Trust
