Trevor,/users/62119cb53af8150012b742b8,US,1.0,2022-02-20 01:46:01+00:00,1.0,Someone please provide an alternative!,"1 star.. great sevice that blew up and grew a God-complex. Amazon needs to step back about 5-7 years when 2-day prime items we RECEIVED in 2 days. Nearly all estimated delivery dates are DEAD WRONG! Prices keep going up, and service keeps getting worse, sure they have more crap to sell you now, but it’s no longer the go to when you need something just a little cheaper than full retail. And it’s not the go to if you need something fast since prime shipping is the only option for prime items, if I want a prime item shipped next day air then why the hell can’t I order it that way? 5-10 years ago they were everyones saving grace, now they’re everyones $18.99/month sack of empty promises and “sorry *it* hasn’t come in yet”. Even more aggravating is there’s no alternative, btw, if anyone with a big enough swinging 🍆 at amazon actually sees this, STOP SHIPPING ANY ITEMS WHATSOEVER THROUGH UPS MAIL INNOVATIONS!!! The only thing they’ve innovated is a better way for the damn US postal service to lose more of our $h*t than before.. P.S. you’re richer than God, figure out how to get me my $h*t on time, or I’ll find someone else to buy from, and let them sell all my info to advertisers…",2022-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,20.0,1193,221,38,5,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,star great sevice blew grew godcomplex amazon need step back year day prime item received day nearly estimated delivery date dead wrong price keep going service keep getting worse sure crap sell it’s longer go need something little cheaper full retail it’s go need something fast since prime shipping option prime item want prime item shipped next day air hell can’t order way year ago everyones saving grace they’re everyones month sack empty promise “sorry hasn’t come yet” even aggravating there’s alternative btw anyone big enough swinging 🍆 amazon actually see stop shipping item whatsoever ups mail innovation thing they’ve innovated better way damn u postal service lose ht p you’re richer god figure get ht time i’ll find someone else buy let sell info advertisers…,0.8474262465976458,0.15257375340235424,0.12394840157038699,0.2,0.4010765570152545,40.10765570152545,Low Trust
Ollie Robinson,/users/60c51f18c262a5001a5941f3,GB,5.0,2022-02-19 23:19:43+00:00,1.0,Lost my parcel twice,"Lost my parcel twice. First time delivered to an address that doesn't exist and second time states ""handed to resident"".  Queried this with their customer services as i wasn't home and was told that a resident can be ""anyone from the same area"". There may have been a bus passing at the time so it could be anywhere now...",2022-02-19 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,19.0,322,59,20,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,lost parcel twice first time delivered address doesnt exist second time state handed resident queried customer service wasnt home told resident anyone area may bus passing time could anywhere,0.03170756273940191,0.9682924372605981,0.03309029725182277,0.2,0.7907642780806635,79.07642780806636,High Trust
HASANC,/users/5c4d96d011eeb4fdbcbb2d76,GB,11.0,2022-02-19 16:18:01+00:00,1.0,I trusted Amazon Pay A-to-z Guarantee. I lost thousands of ££££££.,"September the 3rd 2021. The Crypto prices was all time low and It was excellent time to buy a graphics card. I wanted the buy the best graphics card which was a RTX 3090. The going rate for a brand new one was around £1750. Searching on Amazon I saw the Star Harbor Shapers GeForce RTX 3090 GameRock 24GB GDDR6X Graphics Card for £1,151.98. It was from China. It was all over the Amazon search including as an ad. It was basically too good to be true. BUT this is Amazon and delivers what they say right? and Amazon does have Amazon Pay A-to-z Guarantee??? Anyway, I got in touch with Amazon customer and asked about the product and the seller. I said it this is too good to be true. I asked for an assurance that the product is real and I would receive the item. The customer advised me and assured me I would receive my graphics card. While the agent was online I bought the RTX 3090. I was advised the delivery time and how I will receive the item. That is how Amazon took part in the scam. All because I trusted Amazon and Amazon Pay A-to-z Guarantee.It was a dragging and soul destroying delivery process which is ended in another address in somewhere in London. I could see the item left China on online tracking. There were no updates until the last delivery date. When that day came, it showed up on my account as ""Delivered 4 Oct 2021. The package was handed directly to the customer"". I HAD NO ITEM. And this note is still there now. I chased it up on post office. I was not given details but I was told it was delivered elsewhere. Now, all I could do is apply for the Amazon Pay A-to-z Guarantee. :( I had to go through it's acceptance and they eventually they payed the money back???You may think this is one off incident. But it was not. I saw a product review, exactly same as my incident including customer adviser part. This was not an one off. I felt let down and I asked the note (The package was handed directly to the customer) in my account to be removed. They refused. They said they knew it and that is all that what was important.This is where I want to talk about how I ended up losing money. Trusting Amazon Pay A-to-z Guarantee and their customer service STOPPED me buying a genuine item from a genuine store. I ended up waiting a month for the delivery and the price of Graphics cards rocketed. It has actually gone up to 4 times my original buying price. All I could do is now feel sorry for myself and put up with that message in my account which winds me up every time I see it. That is why I am writing this review now.",2022-02-19 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,19.0,2551,488,66,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,september rd crypto price time low excellent time buy graphic card wanted buy best graphic card rtx going rate brand new one around £ searching amazon saw star harbor shaper geforce rtx gamerock gb gddrx graphic card £ china amazon search including ad basically good true amazon delivers say right amazon amazon pay atoz guarantee anyway got touch amazon customer asked product seller said good true asked assurance product real would receive item customer advised assured would receive graphic card agent online bought rtx advised delivery time receive item amazon took part scam trusted amazon amazon pay atoz guaranteeit dragging soul destroying delivery process ended another address somewhere london could see item left china online tracking update last delivery date day came showed account delivered oct package handed directly customer item note still chased post office given detail told delivered elsewhere could apply amazon pay atoz guarantee go acceptance eventually payed money backyou may think one incident saw product review exactly incident including customer adviser part one felt let asked note package handed directly customer account removed refused said knew importantthis want talk ended losing money trusting amazon pay atoz guarantee customer service stopped buying genuine item genuine store ended waiting month delivery price graphic card rocketed actually gone time original buying price could feel sorry put message account wind every time see writing review,0.010313126409613927,0.9896868735903861,0.2736960179472799,0.2,0.849582640384649,84.9582640384649,High Trust
