Geraldine H.,/users/59e281960000ff000ad5120d,CA,6.0,2022-02-16 06:56:29+00:00,1.0,I thought it was just their delivery…,"I thought it was just their delivery service that was VERY bad, so SLOW even with Prime and unwilling to follow even the simplest delivery requests. Now, Amazon has decided to put long-time customers like me ""through the wringer"" when it comes to returns and damaged items. I got so mad about the runaround I was getting with their reps in the past two days, I finally gave up. Now I'm stuck with three separated jars of mayo and a hairdryer I don't want. Buyer beware. It used to be ok ordering from them but now the hassle has gone too far. I'll be shopping locally from now on or elsewhere. Tough during Covid but this is just too tiring for me. This is based on shopping mainly at the Canadian site.",2022-02-16 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,16.0,703,132,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,thought delivery service bad slow even prime unwilling follow even simplest delivery request amazon decided put longtime customer like wringer come return damaged item got mad runaround getting rep past two day finally gave im stuck three separated jar mayo hairdryer dont want buyer beware used ok ordering hassle gone far ill shopping locally elsewhere tough covid tiring based shopping mainly canadian site,0.015194480252069275,0.9848055197479307,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.8072092657629165,80.72092657629165,High Trust
