Janet Blair,/users/5ed7d2b5c9645354839882cf,GB,22.0,2022-02-11 18:22:12+00:00,1.0,Hunting the Heater,"Seemingly long ago, on 03/01/22, I ordered an electric LEOP500W heater @ £23.00. Vendors: Yiwushilinguandianzis. Yu Express carriers picked it up on 05/01. It was due to arrive between the 20/01 - 26/01. My inquiries have only gained, from Amazon, that, ""your package may be lost"". It is now 8/02/22 and I cannot ascertain from one of the world's greatest mail order operators just where my package actually is. Has there been a delay in shipping? Maybe, these notes will help them and warn others of my experience. Amazon are welcome to respond to my inquiry. Amazon have acted and I have a full refund, but this was not an easy fix. Amazon have created an on line Maze, guarded by Robozon..a talking computer, that is adept at sending homosapiens into ever decreasing circles.  Fortunately, I have a kind neighbor just as adept at robocombat, finding a telephone line to Johannesburg, South Africa, where a delightful lady sorted everything out with ease. It would have been so much better to have spoken to her earlier. But, there it is, but, heaven knows where on the Planet my heater is .. Malcolm Dyer.",2022-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,11.0,1108,192,18,3,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,seemingly long ago ordered electric leopw heater £ vendor yiwushilinguandianzis yu express carrier picked due arrive inquiry gained amazon package may lost cannot ascertain one world greatest mail order operator package actually delay shipping maybe note help warn others experience amazon welcome respond inquiry amazon acted full refund easy fix amazon created line maze guarded robozona talking computer adept sending homosapiens ever decreasing circle fortunately kind neighbor adept robocombat finding telephone line johannesburg south africa delightful lady sorted everything ease would much better spoken earlier heaven know planet heater malcolm dyer,0.04027441220812399,0.959725587791876,0.1076836791923724,0.2,0.8013995297344124,80.13995297344124,High Trust
