Verna,/users/599c27dd0000ff000abed6c6,GB,16.0,2022-02-08 15:06:56+00:00,1.0,Shocking customer service,I purchased a xoot scooter in November for my Grandson for xmas.  I then closed my Amazon account in December due to the fact they were not going to accept visa.  3 weeks after xmas the handle bars snapped and my Grandson went over the top and knocked his tooth out.  I contacted Amazon who were extremely unhelpful and the robotic answer is we cannot locate the order.  well obviously they can't locate it because as I explained to them I closed my account in December.  I sent them a copy of the original order from the account I closed and I asked for a full refund as I do not want a replacement as i feel these scooters are unsafe.  Because Amazon are so incompetent in locating an order from a closed account i have now reported this matter to the Financial Ombudsman  and Amazon head office.  Surely these people are trained enough to be able to locate a closed account and locate the order so they can issue a refund????,2022-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,8.0,928,172,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased xoot scooter november grandson xmas closed amazon account december due fact going accept visa week xmas handle bar snapped grandson went top knocked tooth contacted amazon extremely unhelpful robotic answer cannot locate order well obviously cant locate explained closed account december sent copy original order account closed asked full refund want replacement feel scooter unsafe amazon incompetent locating order closed account reported matter financial ombudsman amazon head office surely people trained enough able locate closed account locate order issue refund,0.03805629855017545,0.9619437014498246,0.09646662927650028,0.2,0.8002651765802123,80.02651765802123,High Trust
