Jamie Rèes Morris,/users/5a8d6672f675864e56053644,GB,4.0,2022-02-03 21:54:17+00:00,1.0,Absolutely pathetic courier service,"Basically, the Amazon Prime site has been disbanded, so as an alternative I'm forced to write my review here.Looking forward to a response.On the 19th of January I placed an order with Amazon. When I checked the tracker it showed that it was going to be delivered by 8pm on the 31st January. No 2 hour window, so basically stayed in all day for nothing. No one showed up.Just after 8pm on the 31st January, the tracker was updated and showed that it was going to be delivered between 1st to 3rd February. No specific date or time given.Later again that night, yet another update on the tracker to say it HAD been delivered on the 28th January. Absolute lies as I hadn't moved from the house. So contradictory updates here, unless the driver's name is Marty Mcfly and drives a DeLorean. Whichever courier service you use, should be reprimanded, and possibly consider tendering out for another delivery firm once their contract is up for renewal.This service is absolutely abysmal. I'm absolutely livid, and seems to be happening frequently now. My neighbours have experienced the same, shoddy customer service as myself.I've received a full refund from the merchant, who are blameless, and asked them if they could contact an Amazon rep with my grievance, because trying to get in touch with an Amazon human is frankly impossible. There are probably customers out there blaming merchants for something that they didn't do, and basically I have better things to do than stay in the house waiting for something that's not going to turn up.And finally. . How can you call your customer service line ""Amazon Live chat"" when clearly it's automated, as I found out to my chagrin.The number on the chat line for you to speak to an adviser cuts off after a couple of rings. Pathetic. And for the millions of lower paid Amazon workers out there, this is not at you. This grievance is for HIGHER MANAGEMENT who just can't be bothered. GET YOUR ACT TOGETHER PEOPLE AND SORT YOURSELVES OUT! 😡😡",2022-02-03 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,3.0,1980,344,35,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,basically amazon prime site disbanded alternative im forced write review herelooking forward responseon th january placed order amazon checked tracker showed going delivered pm st january hour window basically stayed day nothing one showed upjust pm st january tracker updated showed going delivered st rd february specific date time givenlater night yet another update tracker say delivered th january absolute lie hadnt moved house contradictory update unless driver name marty mcfly drive delorean whichever courier service use reprimanded possibly consider tendering another delivery firm contract renewalthis service absolutely abysmal im absolutely livid seems happening frequently neighbour experienced shoddy customer service myselfive received full refund merchant blameless asked could contact amazon rep grievance trying get touch amazon human frankly impossible probably customer blaming merchant something didnt basically better thing stay house waiting something thats going turn upand finally call customer service line amazon live chat clearly automated found chagrinthe number chat line speak adviser cut couple ring pathetic million lower paid amazon worker grievance higher management cant bothered get act together people sort 😡😡,0.1001066664756271,0.8998933335243728,0.19293325855300056,0.2,0.7885333184727865,78.85333184727865,High Trust
