mark,/users/61f4e733554f830013e9310a,CA,1.0,2022-01-29 07:06:03+00:00,1.0,So I had a scammer trick me into…,"So I had a scammer trick me into getting a gift card. long story short. I realized this really quick. before they redeemed them. so i contacted amazon customer service in a panic and i was relieved when they say ""Dont worry, we will freeze the cards and red flag the codes you gave us and we will get your money back"". Fast forward 8 months and 13 calls later and they still refuse to give me money back or any sort. now look, I could understand if they never promised me to take care of everything. then i could have just redeemed the cards myself. But they never did. they said they would take care of everything and now they are pulling a 180 and wasting TONS of my time and they keep giving me the run around.",2022-01-29 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,29.0,713,139,33,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,scammer trick getting gift card long story short realized really quick redeemed contacted amazon customer service panic relieved say dont worry freeze card red flag code gave u get money back fast forward month call later still refuse give money back sort look could understand never promised take care everything could redeemed card never said would take care everything pulling wasting ton time keep giving run around,0.01381419243445114,0.9861858075655489,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.8086846031658367,80.86846031658366,High Trust
