Kim Robinson,/users/61f4275ef6b4b800128665a3,GB,2.0,2022-01-28 17:40:39+00:00,1.0,Shocking customer service,"I sent a laptop back to Amazon (laptop was shocking quality) via DHL express 24 hour delivery for a refund and it has been sitting at DHL's depo for an entire week as Amazon have not scheduled it for return yet.  DHL advised that it was schedule for delivery today, but now DHL tell me they are still waiting for a date that they can deliver it to Amazon who then take up to 14 days to process it.  This is absolutely ridiculous.  Have never experience such bad customer service.  A global, world renowned company such as Amazon are taking up to 2 months (as confirmed by another courier company) to give the courier companies a scheduled delivery date.  When you speak to someone at Amazon all they do is read a script of standard responses, might as well be voice automated as their customer service agents are no help at all.  Amazon if you want to profess world class service and delivery, then have a world class refund/return system as well, all part of the overall customer experience.",2022-01-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,28.0,992,179,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sent laptop back amazon laptop shocking quality via dhl express hour delivery refund sitting dhls depo entire week amazon scheduled return yet dhl advised schedule delivery today dhl tell still waiting date deliver amazon take day process absolutely ridiculous never experience bad customer service global world renowned company amazon taking month confirmed another courier company give courier company scheduled delivery date speak someone amazon read script standard response might well voice automated customer service agent help amazon want profess world class service delivery world class refundreturn system well part overall customer experience,0.023089024019482755,0.9769109759805172,0.10039259674705553,0.2,0.8085340073396696,80.85340073396696,High Trust
