Mark Kirkpatrick,/users/601acc49ea5829001af6c1bd,GB,31.0,2022-01-28 09:52:53+00:00,1.0,Their Returns policy has changed.,"I have been an Amazon customer for many years and also as a Prime customer. The main reason is because of their normally excellent returns policy. I've just started a return for an item within the returns timeline only to have to jump through hoops and several arguments to get them to accept the return.Now the main reason for me to buy from Amazon has been destroyed. Someone needs to change this policy of belligerence. However it won't be me, I'm going to buy from elsewhere. The replacement for this product, is twice the price of the return, but I've placed an order with another retailer now.",2022-01-28 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,28.0,599,107,33,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer many year also prime customer main reason normally excellent return policy ive started return item within return timeline jump hoop several argument get accept returnnow main reason buy amazon destroyed someone need change policy belligerence however wont im going buy elsewhere replacement product twice price return ive placed order another retailer,0.03616823825616645,0.9638317617438336,0.06001121704991587,0.2,0.7939181242818999,79.39181242819,High Trust
