E Smith,/users/5aaf6c004de5666d34a498d2,GB,12.0,2022-01-27 20:06:41+00:00,1.0,Offers guaranteed delivery dates and…,"Offers guaranteed delivery dates and then changes them after you’ve paid! Ordered something to be delivered to an address I was visiting (elderly relative that needed help setting it up), made sure for it to be delivered the day I was there. I didn’t turn up, checked my orders and the delivery date had been changed to the following day. I called to complain, after 20 odd minutes on the phone, multiple holds and finally being put through a manager he concluded that it wasn’t going to arrive but it would arrive the next day! No explanation, no consideration, no empathy, no attempt at resolution",2022-01-27 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,27.0,599,105,37,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,offer guaranteed delivery date change you’ve paid ordered something delivered address visiting elderly relative needed help setting made sure delivered day didn’t turn checked order delivery date changed following day called complain odd minute phone multiple hold finally put manager concluded wasn’t going arrive would arrive next day explanation consideration empathy attempt resolution,0.3421381744343928,0.6578618255656072,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.6407088151944693,64.07088151944693,Medium Trust
Donna Gale,/users/61f2d79682180400124b65c5,US,1.0,2022-01-27 17:34:23+00:00,1.0,Shame on you AMAZON,"Amazon Delivery Truck Driver Rams into Garage and now I'm stuck paying for it, SHAME ON AMAZON!If you're living in the state of Rhode Island, BEWARE of Amazon delivery drivers! My husband and I recently had our garage rammed into. When we filed a police report with the pictures of the driver and truck and submitted a claim to amazon they simply responded with no witnesses, no video. Hope you understand! Now I'm working with our Homeowners insurance, but please invest in camera security, apparently this is a new occurrence happening in multiple homes in Rhode Island. They will not do anything unless you have video. SHAME ON YOU AMAZON, taking advantage of your loyal customers. Not anymore, buyers beware of amazon!",2022-01-27 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,27.0,722,122,19,4,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,amazon delivery truck driver ram garage im stuck paying shame amazonif youre living state rhode island beware amazon delivery driver husband recently garage rammed filed police report picture driver truck submitted claim amazon simply responded witness video hope understand im working homeowner insurance please invest camera security apparently new occurrence happening multiple home rhode island anything unless video shame amazon taking advantage loyal customer anymore buyer beware amazon,0.9414358564705264,0.05856414352947359,0.06842400448681997,0.2,0.3429668726621008,34.29668726621008,Low Trust
