customer,/users/58f32e1b0000ff000a8d9f93,GB,61.0,2022-01-25 13:19:24+00:00,1.0,Complete lack of common sense or I…,"Complete lack of common sense or Interest to resolve problems. When I asked to make a complaint about a supervisor, who was worse than the agent about whom I was complaining, I was told this was not possible and I had to call again,  where I had to start explaining the issues yet again. The supervisor who then promised me a callback from a manager,  acknowledged there were others with the name Manas, but refused to give any unique identification.The original 2 people I had spoken to steadfastly refused to acknowledge their flawed system or offer to raise issues to the product management or Web team to make improvements.  They have zero goal to make improvements and simply want to get you off the phone and let the same problems happen again and again.  With their weight they should stamp out ridiculous situations where couriers say an item is delivered, but is not and at the very least have the tracking reset so that the real delivery can still be tracked. How can this company be so successful yet so apathetic?",2022-01-25 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,25.0,1025,181,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,complete lack common sense interest resolve problem asked make complaint supervisor worse agent complaining told possible call start explaining issue yet supervisor promised callback manager acknowledged others name manas refused give unique identificationthe original people spoken steadfastly refused acknowledge flawed system offer raise issue product management web team make improvement zero goal make improvement simply want get phone let problem happen weight stamp ridiculous situation courier say item delivered least tracking reset real delivery still tracked company successful yet apathetic,0.06562647419268419,0.9343735258073158,0.10151430173864273,0.2,0.7874896232513865,78.74896232513865,High Trust
H Parkes,/users/61eff33f963b0300124f9283,GB,3.0,2022-01-25 12:56:08+00:00,1.0,I have been trying to return a large…,"I have been trying to return a large item for two weeks and have been let down by the couriers on five occasions.  I have spent two weeks asking Amazon to help as I cannot get my refund until it is returned, the collection has always been arranged by them.Having spoke to to four call operators and two managers I have been let down again ….. but Amazon don’t care as they have my money!!!  I am sick of having policies quoted at me and being told they will resolve the Matter by booking yet another courier service, Just give me my money back and then facilitate the item return …… they are holding me to hostage over a situation I cannot control ……they do not care ….they are making me ill!  SHAME ON YOU!Please consider using smaller local companies that have a face and where you matter as a customer.DISGRACEFUL COMPANY.",2022-01-25 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,25.0,825,152,37,8,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,trying return large item two week let courier five occasion spent two week asking amazon help cannot get refund returned collection always arranged themhaving spoke four call operator two manager let … amazon don’t care money sick policy quoted told resolve matter booking yet another courier service give money back facilitate item return …… holding hostage situation cannot control ……they care …they making ill shame youplease consider using smaller local company face matter customerdisgraceful company,0.9792860613750174,0.02071393862498261,0.08524957936062816,0.2,0.3274068851846169,32.74068851846169,Low Trust
