Xuan,/users/61ef01254251070013672b6b,CA,3.0,2022-01-24 19:46:17+00:00,1.0,Amazon is a joke....,"Amazon is a joke....I placed my order on January 9, 2022. On January 19 I received a message saying that "" Arriving today. Package is out for delivery"". By the end of the day the delivery not arrived. I got a message saying ""We're sorry your package is late. Please contact Amazon for next steps."" The next day I call Amazon customer service for the refund but denied the refund. The agent transferring the calls to the Supervisor,long story short. He told me if I don't received the table by today call in at 9:30pm to get my refund. Nothing come... I call in talk with 2 different agents, one of the agents put me on hold for about 1.5 hours. After 1.5 hours he's back and said you can't have your refund then hang up on me. I call back the next day talk to the agent then transferring the call to the Supervisor same story then hang up on me. I call back, this time the agent said a refund will appear on your original payment method in 3-5 business days. I am still waiting... I hope this is not another joke.",2022-01-24 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,24.0,1013,194,20,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon jokei placed order january january received message saying arriving today package delivery end day delivery arrived got message saying sorry package late please contact amazon next step next day call amazon customer service refund denied refund agent transferring call supervisorlong story short told dont received table today call pm get refund nothing come call talk different agent one agent put hold hour hour he back said cant refund hang call back next day talk agent transferring call supervisor story hang call back time agent said refund appear original payment method business day still waiting hope another joke,0.018231722951464774,0.9817682770485352,0.10880538418395962,0.2,0.8126452153610595,81.26452153610595,High Trust
Eileen Smith,/users/60e2078ee7bdfd0011eb6c47,US,16.0,2022-01-24 19:31:45+00:00,1.0,"Removed my ability to leave reviews, still think they’ll get my business","So I received several emails from Amazon sellers asking me to leave five star reviews in exchange for free stuff. I declined and forwarded the emails to Amazon. I'm so tired of buying stuff with five stars only to realize that the reviews are fake. As a result of trying to be honest Amazon removed my ability to leave any reviews. They're more than happy to take my money, however. I've canceled all of my subscriptions and pending orders and everything I have on the way will be returned. Do NOT believe any five star reviews because they are easily faked and Amazon seems to encourage and reward this behavior. I've given them thousands of dollars over the years. They will not get another dime from me.",2022-01-24 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,24.0,706,127,72,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,received several email amazon seller asking leave five star review exchange free stuff declined forwarded email amazon im tired buying stuff five star realize review fake result trying honest amazon removed ability leave review theyre happy take money however ive canceled subscription pending order everything way returned believe five star review easily faked amazon seems encourage reward behavior ive given thousand dollar year get another dime,0.011297289752273669,0.9887027102477264,0.071228266965788,0.2,0.8085970085170209,80.85970085170209,High Trust
