Tirath Dhariwal,/users/591af19a0000ff000a98d1fb,GB,2.0,2022-01-20 23:08:16+00:00,1.0,Had an issue with a seller on amazon,"Had an issue with a seller. I wanted to return an order as it arrived 5 days later than expected. I needed it for a wedding. So I asked for a refund, but the seller only offered me half of the cost of delivery, which I had paid £15 extra for express delivery,after which the seller had contacted me via watsap, which from my understanding, amazon did not allow. So I contacted amazon to inform them. The seller was then contacted by amazon to let the seller know that they were not allowed to contact me directly. After this I received no less than 30 odd phone calls, and messages from the seller, basically asking why I had contacted amazon. The seller tried contacting me by ringing me and messaging me all hours of the day. I informed amazon each time the seller tried to contact me and was assured by amazon that the matter would be dealt with. Then I received a message from amazon asking me to return my order, which meant I would have to again spend more money on posting. After numerous phone calls from seller to me and from me to amazon, I finally asked to speak to a manger, who finally after about 4 months gave me a refund and an apology. When I wrote a review for the seller warning other customers not to buy from the seller and letting others know about my experience, amazon refused to put it up, as well as letting the seller continue to use amazon to sell on!!! So I asked amazon why and got no reply. So be warned. If an order goes wrong and the seller acts against the rules, amazon will not back the customer up!!!",2022-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,20.0,1537,292,36,8,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,issue seller wanted return order arrived day later expected needed wedding asked refund seller offered half cost delivery paid £ extra express deliveryafter seller contacted via watsap understanding amazon allow contacted amazon inform seller contacted amazon let seller know allowed contact directly received less odd phone call message seller basically asking contacted amazon seller tried contacting ringing messaging hour day informed amazon time seller tried contact assured amazon matter would dealt received message amazon asking return order meant would spend money posting numerous phone call seller amazon finally asked speak manger finally month gave refund apology wrote review seller warning customer buy seller letting others know experience amazon refused put well letting seller continue use amazon sell asked amazon got reply warned order go wrong seller act rule amazon back customer,0.9834205937778353,0.016579406222164694,0.16376892877173305,0.2,0.34104348886542896,34.104348886542894,Low Trust
