Ravi Dalal,/users/5983784f0000ff000ab73396,GB,7.0,2022-01-20 06:51:52+00:00,1.0,Utterly Awful Service!,"I am a Prime member, I ordered an item and selected a delivery date of Monday as I knew I was going to be home however Amazon obviously know my schedule better than I do as they decided to deliver on Sunday, I received a SMS from Amazon, I messaged back saying I was not at home but they could leave it with my neighbour, about 10 minutes later I got a message saying delivered. When I got home I attempted to pick up my parcel to be told that he had not been home either. I contacted Amazon, they would like me to waste Police time by reporting the item as stolen before they would refund or replace the product. I explained that the only thing that had been stolen was my money by Amazon.",2022-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,20.0,690,136,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime member ordered item selected delivery date monday knew going home however amazon obviously know schedule better decided deliver sunday received sm amazon messaged back saying home could leave neighbour minute later got message saying delivered got home attempted pick parcel told home either contacted amazon would like waste police time reporting item stolen would refund replace product explained thing stolen money amazon,0.025430461837691674,0.9745695381623083,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.8025399569667403,80.25399569667402,High Trust
