doctorsnaketown,/users/5ad4029e4de5666d345d2aa3,US,2.0,2022-01-19 03:12:54+00:00,1.0,"Delivery delays, crummy service","I had amazon prime, which costs quite a bit for 2 day delivery. There are some other features, but I do not consume any brainwashing garbage like their shows or songs. Out of my 6 orders, two were delivered later than 2 days. I was under the impression that since I paid for the service, that they would deliver on their part of the agreement. In one case, I was leaving the country and the delivery said it would come before I left, but it didn't come. They say 2 day on a ton of items, but apparently it means nothing to them. All I would want is for them to be honest and accountable, but they don't care if they lie to their customers or don't deliver on their agreements. Even after a delivery is late, there is nowhere to submit a complaint, they just have a FAQ that says that packages might be late.",2022-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,19.0,807,156,31,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime cost quite bit day delivery feature consume brainwashing garbage like show song order two delivered later day impression since paid service would deliver part agreement one case leaving country delivery said would come left didnt come say day ton item apparently mean nothing would want honest accountable dont care lie customer dont deliver agreement even delivery late nowhere submit complaint faq say package might late,0.01486796470897233,0.9851320352910277,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.8100646155142743,81.00646155142744,High Trust
Cinnamon T Thompson,/users/5d2fbbca481405f34b5390ad,US,25.0,2022-01-19 02:43:41+00:00,1.0,A terrible company,"A terrible company that consistently tries to rob you. They refuse to respond to support emails, Rope you into subscribe and 'save' then raise the price to an alarming rate without the decency to tell you. They will not let me ask questions about products nor write a review and have deleted all my past reviews without explanation. They are irresponsible and selfish. Boxes often come smashed and late, they have even canceled (by force) orders. If you can go somewhere else, go somewhere else!",2022-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,19.0,495,85,18,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,terrible company consistently try rob refuse respond support email rope subscribe save raise price alarming rate without decency tell let ask question product write review deleted past review without explanation irresponsible selfish box often come smashed late even canceled force order go somewhere else go somewhere else,0.20950694413960647,0.7904930558603935,0.04767246214245653,0.2,0.7047810203586881,70.4781020358688,Medium Trust
CGAS,/users/61a0eea549b471001206c962,GB,4.0,2022-01-19 02:18:05+00:00,1.0,Absolutely disgusting customer service,"I placed an order on 06,01. I got an email on 13/01 telling me about the delay for my order. which stated : *If the order won't arrive by the time you need it, you can cancel the order or an individual item from your order by visiting Your Account, and viewing the order details. As long as the item hasn't entered the dispatch process,you'll be able to cancel it.*However, this was not true and it actually was impossible to cancel the order, either on my account or by contacting the supplier ( as per automated message on my account) who said that only Amazon could cancel it and also said that my payment was still pending , which is also untrue.I am now told by their advisors that it is not possible for them to cancel the order until it has been dispatched!!!!! I think I am just being fobbed off with random  excuses/explanations. This is ridiculous, makes no sense whatsoever and istotally unacceptable.This email also says: *We're sorry about the delay in getting your order to you, but I'm pleased to tell you that we're preparing it for dispatch now.**Within the next business day you should receive an e-mail from us confirming that the following items have been dispatched:*This ,too, is untrue as apparently they are still trying to locate the item and it has not been dispatched yet. But I do not want it  sent to me, I want it cancelled, as I have been saying since 13/01, and  my money refunded but according to their advisors this cannot be done until it has been dispatched.And apparently there is no way of getting this complaint escalated to a non existent complaint department as I a told the customer service is  also the complaint department . Resolver is not an option either as Amazon UK has decided not to accept complaints raised via Resolver.Absolutely disgusting customer serviceNEVER AGAIN",2022-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,19.0,1821,320,38,4,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,placed order got email telling delay order stated order wont arrive time need cancel order individual item order visiting account viewing order detail long item hasnt entered dispatch processyoull able cancel ithowever true actually impossible cancel order either account contacting supplier per automated message account said amazon could cancel also said payment still pending also untruei told advisor possible cancel order dispatched think fobbed random excusesexplanations ridiculous make sense whatsoever istotally unacceptablethis email also say sorry delay getting order im pleased tell preparing dispatch nowwithin next business day receive email u confirming following item dispatchedthis untrue apparently still trying locate item dispatched yet want sent want cancelled saying since money refunded according advisor cannot done dispatchedand apparently way getting complaint escalated non existent complaint department told customer service also complaint department resolver option either amazon uk decided accept complaint raised via resolverabsolutely disgusting customer servicenever,0.9750107562515725,0.02498924374842748,0.17947279865395402,0.2,0.34838918160500454,34.838918160500455,Low Trust
Esfahan,/users/61e72d4b7d4f1000127e2888,US,1.0,2022-01-18 21:13:49+00:00,1.0,"Amazon is disgusting. Sorry, beyond disgusting.","Amazon is disgusting. Full of liars and cheaters. They will waste hours and hours of your time and then ask you pointless questions like where is your order, which order, whats the number. This is after I have been speaking to 5 different representatives for hours and hours about my order and am told I would finally get a solution only to have Amazon get back to me with more time wasting questions and circles. Amazon is brittled with liars and cheaters and that's the truth.Amazon is definitely not the most consumer based company and is actually now one of the least. They don't deserve the internet traffic they get and they will start to lose a big stronghold on online shopping. Kudos to companies that actually care for their consumers and let Amazon burn by their own ugly fire.",2022-01-18 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,18.0,788,140,47,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon disgusting full liar cheater waste hour hour time ask pointless question like order order whats number speaking different representative hour hour order told would finally get solution amazon get back time wasting question circle amazon brittled liar cheater thats truthamazon definitely consumer based company actually one least dont deserve internet traffic get start lose big stronghold online shopping kudos company actually care consumer let amazon burn ugly fire,0.006883324190927636,0.9931166758090724,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.8122622077867572,81.22622077867572,High Trust
