Elgarnan po,/users/61e6085c4eeecd0012a6e8f0,US,1.0,2022-02-13 03:53:02+00:00,2.0,Amazon is really an outstanding website…,"Amazon is an outstanding website to purchase a few things online. However, I have issues with delivery. My experience with the delivery is bad. I noticed that I am not the only one who has issues with delivery in my apartment. Some of the residents in the apartment have experienced the same issue. When Item is delivered, they update amazon where the package is left. Therefore, it is delivered with misinformation about the exact location of the package because the package actually was placed outside of the apartment where an individual somehow stole my package. I could not confirm whether it is a false delivery or the package is actually stolen... I had to report it and I requested a refund. Amazon is very hesitant about refunding or replacement. Nowadays, I can not trust amazon with delivery. I start to feel anxious that they will misinform me about where my package was actually placed.",2022-01-18 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,2.0,13.0,899,154,40,6,26.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon outstanding website purchase thing online however issue delivery experience delivery bad noticed one issue delivery apartment resident apartment experienced issue item delivered update amazon package left therefore delivered misinformation exact location package package actually placed outside apartment individual somehow stole package could confirm whether false delivery package actually stolen report requested refund amazon hesitant refunding replacement nowadays trust amazon delivery start feel anxious misinform package actually placed,0.009915425472328121,0.9900845745276718,0.08637128435221536,0.4,1.112316544134279,111.2316544134279,High Trust
Laura Niskanen,/users/607f1b97e1fc4000198bc694,US,2.0,2022-01-17 23:24:51+00:00,1.0,I filed a complaint about logistic (…,"I filed a complaint about logistic ( shipping and delivery department) almost 3 weeks ago on the 6th of January for my purchased items being pushed back hours after it was suppose to be delivered ( shipping facility was 20-30 minutes from my home). The tracking info said that the Amazon delivery carrier pick up the item at 7am and would be dropped of at my home between 11am-2pm. At 2pm I got a notification saying that my item was delayed and would be dropped off until 8pm. 8pm came and went and nothing was dropped off. The support person on the live internet chat page told me that the complaint was sent over and that I would her back from logistics department within 24hrs via email. The weekend came and went but no email from logistics came in. When I went back to customer service to check on the complaint it was like pulling teeth trying to get any information from the customer service representative ( the person replied with "" You have to understand we as customer support representatives have uncontrolled limitations and we are sorry for the inconvenience and take a $ 15 promo code as a token of apology). After giving the promo code they just disconnect and still leaving you with questions. To make a long story short today January 17th I have filed two complaints about the same issue and ""NO"" response; back from the person in charge of the logistics department.",2022-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,17.0,1385,248,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,filed complaint logistic shipping delivery department almost week ago th january purchased item pushed back hour suppose delivered shipping facility minute home tracking info said amazon delivery carrier pick item would dropped home ampm pm got notification saying item delayed would dropped pm pm came went nothing dropped support person live internet chat page told complaint sent would back logistics department within hr via email weekend came went email logistics came went back customer service check complaint like pulling teeth trying get information customer service representative person replied understand customer support representative uncontrolled limitation sorry inconvenience take promo code token apology giving promo code disconnect still leaving question make long story short today january th filed two complaint issue response back person charge logistics department,0.018054584519082026,0.981945415480918,0.13909141895681434,0.2,0.8187909915318218,81.87909915318218,High Trust
