Shannon,/users/61e0e7e75ec2f4001714a9a9,US,1.0,2022-01-14 03:03:16+00:00,1.0,The only reason I gave a one star,"The only reason I gave a one star rating is because how terrible the customer service is.  I was wrongly charged another annual prime membership and I was promised a refund for that foolish mistake on their end. It’s been 2 weeks and no refund has been issued. The problem is it’s not even me that was charged, it was my mom that was charged, she had nothing to do with this and they deducted her acct the $126. I’m pissed off on her behalf. In the meantime in these chats I have with customer service, they transfer you a bunch of times to different people that just don’t seem concerned with helping me. And then one of them basically said what I was saying was false. And after I told them I had pictures as proof that’s when they straightened their attitude. Truly the worst customer service in the game. Hopefully I’ll get the refund for my mom this time around. I don’t have high hopes though",2022-01-14 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,14.0,898,168,33,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,reason gave one star rating terrible customer service wrongly charged another annual prime membership promised refund foolish mistake end it’s week refund issued problem it’s even charged mom charged nothing deducted acct i’m pissed behalf meantime chat customer service transfer bunch time different people don’t seem concerned helping one basically said saying false told picture proof that’s straightened attitude truly worst customer service game hopefully i’ll get refund mom time around don’t high hope though,0.020425444201014727,0.9795745557989852,0.09422321929332586,0.2,0.8086319217581577,80.86319217581577,High Trust
Jon Higbie,/users/61e0ab862b562f001220dca9,US,3.0,2022-01-13 22:46:04+00:00,1.0,Delivery drivers and personnel are the…,"Delivery drivers and personnel are the worst!  They mark things delivered when they are not.  Then help tells you oh it will show up in a couple of days.  But it doesn't.  Any you have to deal with a bot, or a chat session with someone who is juggling it seems 10 other chats at the same time, or go through phone tree hell to get to a person.  Then they balk at giving you a refund.  I am buying more stuff from a store - at least as much as I can.  Truly hating Amazon right now.Also their drivers and vehicles should be a disgrace to the company.  Dirty, banged up, reckless.  Applies to vehicles and drivers",2022-01-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,13.0,611,118,39,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,delivery driver personnel worst mark thing delivered help tell oh show couple day doesnt deal bot chat session someone juggling seems chat time go phone tree hell get person balk giving refund buying stuff store least much truly hating amazon right nowalso driver vehicle disgrace company dirty banged reckless applies vehicle driver,0.13392241038864675,0.8660775896113533,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.7462749137064058,74.62749137064057,Medium Trust
Alchemistress,/users/61e0a191165e0500126f0827,NL,1.0,2022-01-13 22:03:10+00:00,1.0,Thinking of Signing Up As An Amazon Seller? Read This First!,"I signed up as an amazon seller, intending to sell white label goods. The sign up fee was just shy of 40 euros -under the sign up button, it states 39 euro per month, excluding seller fees. So signed up expecting that.I get into the account and start to list an item, but I'm notified that I need to have a UPC for each of my products. I don't have a UPC, because I never needed one before and my goods are white labelled and drop-shipped. I was already pretty miffed that I had to find this out after Amazon took the first payment.Long story short, I contact support and ask for a refund and account closure. I was told that I was not able to claim a refund as I had not supplied my tax information. I do not believe I was asked for my tax information until this point, had i been, I would have supplied it. Especially, if the tax information is mandatory. At this point the experience already put me off selling via Amazon. I have gone into the account tonight to provide my tax information and close the account - at which point I see a balance of -137euros. I immediately contact support to ask what this -137euros is supposed to be for. The agent avoids referring to it as a balance and instead pretends that I want to know the status of the payment -rather than explaining the payment. I sent her screen shots twice because she also pretended not to see the first screen shot. That's when this second charge /payment was deducted from my account.I am posting the entire thread in another review. -137 stars is the score that I rate them._______________________________________________",2022-01-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,13.0,1590,290,60,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,signed amazon seller intending sell white label good sign fee shy euro sign button state euro per month excluding seller fee signed expecting thati get account start list item im notified need upc product dont upc never needed one good white labelled dropshipped already pretty miffed find amazon took first paymentlong story short contact support ask refund account closure told able claim refund supplied tax information believe asked tax information point would supplied especially tax information mandatory point experience already put selling via amazon gone account tonight provide tax information close account point see balance euro immediately contact support ask euro supposed agent avoids referring balance instead pretend want know status payment rather explaining payment sent screen shot twice also pretended see first screen shot thats second charge payment deducted accounti posting entire thread another review star score rate,0.00999215984950614,0.9900078401504938,0.16264722378014582,0.2,0.827533364831276,82.7533364831276,High Trust
