Eugene,/users/5d29ca46a4257aaba49b1f0a,CA,15.0,2022-01-13 14:53:36+00:00,1.0,Amazon does not care about security at all,"This company pays zero attention to security. They hacked my account recently and tried to steal some $3000 by buying phones, but 2 phone calls and 8 hours later I only received an e-mail saying ""We did not find any unautorised acitivity on your account""!!!??? And this is given that the perpetrator indicated their address for shipping!Another frustrating thing is that they made it impossible to disable the 1-click payment.Yes Amazon, why would you care about security - the lack of it only increases your sales!",2022-01-13 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,13.0,515,86,42,8,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,company pay zero attention security hacked account recently tried steal buying phone phone call hour later received email saying find unautorised acitivity account given perpetrator indicated address shippinganother frustrating thing made impossible disable click paymentyes amazon would care security lack increase sale,0.98179427999553,0.01820572000446996,0.04823331463825014,0.2,0.318749522929885,31.8749522929885,Low Trust
