Queufreecel Freeman,/users/61da487665c2820013a875d5,US,2.0,2022-01-09 02:29:32+00:00,1.0,Amazon.com Delivery Service is Unreliable and Dishonest,"I can no longer trust and rely on Amazon.com.  Item I ordered 6 days ago arrived at an Amazon Facility IN MY CITY at 1 AM, at 2 PM it got listed as ""Delayed in Transit"", and now the delivery status is listed as 1 to 4 days late.  Destination is an Amazon locker that closes at 11 PM.  My package has been in my city since 1 AM on the promised delivery date and it cannot be inside the Amazon locker by 11 PM??? Very suspicious!!!  I Spoke with 5 different agents and not one of them could get a hold of Amazon logistics to find out what really happened.  Amazon customer service does not have a way of contacting their logistics/drivers other than ONLY BY EMAIL.  All that customer service can do is say ""I'm sorry."" Meanwhile, if their driver decided to go to the beach rather than delivering, I'm the one who had to pay for it, and the driver got away with not doing his job.",2022-01-09 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,9.0,877,170,55,7,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,longer trust rely amazoncom item ordered day ago arrived amazon facility city pm got listed delayed transit delivery status listed day late destination amazon locker close pm package city since promised delivery date cannot inside amazon locker pm suspicious spoke different agent one could get hold amazon logistics find really happened amazon customer service way contacting logisticsdrivers email customer service say im sorry meanwhile driver decided go beach rather delivering im one pay driver got away job,0.6907160005635639,0.30928399943643614,0.09534492428491306,0.2,0.47371098457520067,47.37109845752007,Low Trust
