Mary OLoughlin,/users/5ed1c10313f40a6ffd37fc93,US,8.0,2022-01-07 21:17:26+00:00,3.0,Love/Hate Amazon Relationship,"I have a love/hate relationship with Amazon. I order from them all the time, especially the last few years because it is easier than having to go out and search our local stores for particular items, that often times are not in stock or simply not available where I live. I have also often searched for other online stores to purchase items from but rarely do I find one where I can get free shipping and a lower price. So, though it pains me to do so, if I need to place an order for certain items, I shop on Amazon. That being said, the customer service I personally have received has been pretty awesome, the majority of the time. The key is NOT to buy from a third party seller, as that is a huge headache, in my own experience. Also, you cannot write a review that directly complains about Amazon because they will not ""approve"" it. Which is ridiculous because we all know that Amazon has gone way downhill since the early days. However, that being said, it is possible to get a refund, make a return, and get your money back if you NEVER receive your package. It is a bit of a pain in the a** but it can be done be done. What it takes is patience, persistence, and knowing how to navigate the system. I recently was given a large gift card credit to spend simply because I had such an issue with shipping and it was days past the time my package should have arrived with an item that was an 1/8 of the price of the credit I was given. I used a gift card to purchase it, so I was happy with that. I am the person who manages to get my refunds AND I often get my items for free because I do NOT take NO for an answer. I am polite (for the most part), kind, calm and I do NOT give up. I have experienced many problems with shipping, missing items, items delivered to the wrong apartment, poorly made items, poorly packaged items, products not arriving on time,etc.etc. And each time, customer service has taken care of me. Sometimes it takes more than one phone call and asking for a supervisor, explaining the situation over and over again, but in the end the result is in my favor. I actually fill out the survey the customer service agents email me after the phone call. I am honest and thorough when I fill them out and I praise those exceptional agents who go the extra mile for me, as I appreciate excellent service, as I have been in there shoes in the past. However, if I can find an alternative to shopping at Amazon that also offers free shipping and lower prices, I take it. I would love nothing more than to not have to order another item from them. Obviously, the company treats their employees like crap, the quality of many of their products is merde, they often price gouge, many of their reviews are bogus, the packages are usually not packaged properly or poorly packaged, returns have become a huge pain, many third party sellers rip people off, it can take longer to receive refunds and reviews have to be approved(utter.bullsh**.) Jeff Bezos is making money hand over first, while not paying the amount of taxes or any at all on the billions of dollars he has made and not caring one iota about his employees or his customers. This is what happens when we end up with monopolies and extremely few options available to us. My goal this year is to buy less, continue to search for other online businesses to shop from (especially local ones) and continue to vote, sign petitions and work towards changing the current status quo.",2022-01-07 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,7.0,3450,644,29,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,lovehate relationship amazon order time especially last year easier go search local store particular item often time stock simply available live also often searched online store purchase item rarely find one get free shipping lower price though pain need place order certain item shop amazon said customer service personally received pretty awesome majority time key buy third party seller huge headache experience also cannot write review directly complains amazon approve ridiculous know amazon gone way downhill since early day however said possible get refund make return get money back never receive package bit pain done done take patience persistence knowing navigate system recently given large gift card credit spend simply issue shipping day past time package arrived item price credit given used gift card purchase happy person manages get refund often get item free take answer polite part kind calm give experienced many problem shipping missing item item delivered wrong apartment poorly made item poorly packaged item product arriving timeetcetc time customer service taken care sometimes take one phone call asking supervisor explaining situation end result favor actually fill survey customer service agent email phone call honest thorough fill praise exceptional agent go extra mile appreciate excellent service shoe past however find alternative shopping amazon also offer free shipping lower price take would love nothing order another item obviously company treat employee like crap quality many product merde often price gouge many review bogus package usually packaged properly poorly packaged return become huge pain many third party seller rip people take longer receive refund review approvedutterbullsh jeff bezos making money hand first paying amount tax billion dollar made caring one iota employee customer happens end monopoly extremely option available u goal year buy less continue search online business shop especially local one continue vote sign petition work towards changing current status quo,0.004053373049572769,0.9959466269504272,0.36118900729108244,0.6,1.47021111493343,147.021111493343,High Trust
Lorelei Walden,/users/61d8a0de03f66e001259d288,FR,2.0,2022-01-07 20:22:00+00:00,1.0,Worse than Indian Microsoft scam calls,"Do not, I repeat do not order here.This company is one of the if not the worst.I've been a customer for 10 years. Never had any issue.Until I had an issue. Just before Christmas. Amazon's solution to ANY problem? We ""will,"" (they wont) call you back tomorrow. This can go on for weeks depending if you get someone on the phone who cares about their 10 cent a hour job ( outsourced callcenter)  Then if you finally get your order , IT WONT EVEN BE YOUR ORDER, And guess what return process takes atleast 2 weeks.And I am not even speaking of the endless documentation requested to prove account ownership when you buy something expensive. As of this day amazon is still holding over a 1000 euro hostage in refund and will call me any day now ( yeah no) Tldr (to long didn't read)You are safer replying to Nigerian scam mails than by shopping with Amazon.",2022-01-07 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,7.0,853,157,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,repeat order herethis company one worstive customer year never issueuntil issue christmas amazon solution problem wont call back tomorrow go week depending get someone phone care cent hour job outsourced callcenter finally get order wont even order guess return process take atleast weeksand even speaking endless documentation requested prove account ownership buy something expensive day amazon still holding euro hostage refund call day yeah tldr long didnt readyou safer replying nigerian scam mail shopping amazon,0.007885722318946485,0.9921142776810535,0.08805384183959619,0.2,0.813667907208446,81.36679072084459,High Trust
