shaunofthedead,/users/61d1d1e3149fa50012fca7dd,US,1.0,2022-01-02 16:25:31+00:00,1.0,Pi$$ poor,"I ordered something from Amazon with 1 day delivery. Got an email saying it would be delayed. 3 days later still waiting with no movement on the delivery. Contacted customer service and they want me to call carriers to chase down my package. I paid for a service and I expect them to do their job and deliver my order. Why must I, the customer go chase down my package.",2022-01-02 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,2.0,369,70,9,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered something amazon day delivery got email saying would delayed day later still waiting movement delivery contacted customer service want call carrier chase package paid service expect job deliver order must customer go chase package,0.010889562004320069,0.9891104379956799,0.03925967470555244,0.2,0.8024071539389505,80.24071539389504,High Trust
Haydn Keeton,/users/5ae752454de5666d34cdfb40,GB,5.0,2022-01-02 10:58:34+00:00,1.0,I upgraded my broadband to a faster…,"I upgraded my broadband to a faster speed and was promised a free gift, I chose Alexia, which I could redeem 3 months into my new contract,  April 2021 at Talktalk. They sent me the code which I passed on to Amazon,I contacted Amazon and asked where my order was after an hour they said they could not find the code so I asked talktalk for another code which they sent to me. I sent it to Amazon and they said it would take 28 days to process and deliver which was August by this time.I contact them again in November and asked again where's my order they replied by saying they have lost the code and will not send my order out until I get a new code. I again asked talktalk for another code which they replied, that promotion on that gift has expired. What's the the point in them sending me another code anyway Amazon will only lose it, after all my time on the phone back and forward I have lost  the will to live, Amazon's customer service is a disgrace, they could not run a tap between them,I will try in the future to avoid Amazon and go elsewhere",2022-01-02 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,2.0,1055,204,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,upgraded broadband faster speed promised free gift chose alexia could redeem month new contract april talktalk sent code passed amazoni contacted amazon asked order hour said could find code asked talktalk another code sent sent amazon said would take day process deliver august timei contact november asked wheres order replied saying lost code send order get new code asked talktalk another code replied promotion gift expired whats point sending another code anyway amazon lose time phone back forward lost live amazon customer service disgrace could run tap themi try future avoid amazon go elsewhere,0.02132676383747603,0.978673236162524,0.11441390914189568,0.2,0.8122193999096411,81.2219399909641,High Trust
