Laxman,/users/5c76c5e01652bba435a3cce6,US,7.0,2022-01-02 01:16:18+00:00,1.0,Financial loss. Neither they returned my item nor a refund of amount,"I bought Samsung Galaxy wireless earbuds from amazon and after using it for 1 week I felt it caused pain in my ears and also it was falling off quite often. Hence I returned the galaxy buds as it is neatly packed. However despite this I did not get a refund even after a month and I got an email that the item I had returned is not the same and they are ignoring it. They also said I need to send the correct item to get my money back. I followed up and appealed to amazon multiple times that I returned the exact same item that I bought and in any case I deserve a refund or my item back to me. They said they cannot do both and they have now caused me a financial loss of $85.52. The type of amazon customer service and their responses are deeply deplorable and they do not care for a customer financial loss at all . I have been a prime member for 4 years and after the above disgusting experience with them I have decided to cancel my prime membership. Worst customer experience ever and they made me lose my hard earned $85.52 for no fault of mine.  I am not able to escalate this issue as well to any one in Amazon. They also responded to me today that any further emails from me will not be responded by them and will be ignored. Seriously? Is this the customer service you expect from Amazon? Yes, this is the truth at the end of the day. They will keep ignoring your appeals and emails and you lose financially.  They do not care about customer when makes genuine case. They do not investigate the pattern of customer's purchases at all  to make sure they do justice to the customer.",2022-01-02 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,2.0,1592,308,68,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought samsung galaxy wireless earbuds amazon using week felt caused pain ear also falling quite often hence returned galaxy bud neatly packed however despite get refund even month got email item returned ignoring also said need send correct item get money back followed appealed amazon multiple time returned exact item bought case deserve refund item back said cannot caused financial loss type amazon customer service response deeply deplorable care customer financial loss prime member year disgusting experience decided cancel prime membership worst customer experience ever made lose hard earned fault mine able escalate issue well one amazon also responded today email responded ignored seriously customer service expect amazon yes truth end day keep ignoring appeal email lose financially care customer make genuine case investigate pattern customer purchase make sure justice customer,0.005273826744347779,0.9947261732556523,0.17274256870443072,0.2,0.8319116003687123,83.19116003687122,High Trust
