Chris Cwikla,/users/61d0661dd2cf0d0012875489,US,1.0,2022-01-01 14:33:49+00:00,1.0,They just want your money,"I recently purchased a stick up ring camera. I put it on a payment plan (4 charges of $26.62), to have 8 separate charges pulled out of my account at once. Not only is that twice what the camera cost, but it overdrafted my account, as I was not expecting 8 charges to come out, but then I was also charged the max overdraft fees allowed by my bank. And all they did was say the charges were already reversed. Does not matter that now I have to wait at least 5 days for that money back. No attempt to fix anything. I have been a prime member for a decade. I have an amazon TV. I am done with this pos company. This is just the last straw in many straws.",2022-01-01 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,1.0,652,132,25,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently purchased stick ring camera put payment plan charge separate charge pulled account twice camera cost overdrafted account expecting charge come also charged max overdraft fee allowed bank say charge already reversed matter wait least day money back attempt fix anything prime member decade amazon tv done po company last straw many straw,0.028680342008395254,0.9713196579916048,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.8004663348847535,80.04663348847535,High Trust
Ian Brown,/users/582f29e40000ff000a58b116,GB,36.0,2022-01-01 11:59:05+00:00,1.0,Customer service Hung up on me!,"Won't bore you with the detail. I bought a new camera lens, the item arrived but it was a used damged one. I complained and they said send it back. It took 3 weeks to refund, in the meantime I had to pay for it on my credit card and now I have a credit of £445.Less than ideal. The worst part was when I went on chat to ask when the refund would be done (in a nice polite way) the customer service agent refunded and then just hung up on the chat. I have bought hundreds of items on amazon, buy hey I am just one in millions.",2022-01-01 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,1.0,525,110,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wont bore detail bought new camera lens item arrived used damged one complained said send back took week refund meantime pay credit card credit £less ideal worst part went chat ask refund would done nice polite way customer service agent refunded hung chat bought hundred item amazon buy hey one million,0.10456182591240035,0.8954381740875996,0.06169377453729669,0.2,0.7600578419512591,76.00578419512591,High Trust
