Ibrahim Imran,/users/60c873a27f58c6001a1c27b4,AE,20.0,2021-12-31 15:04:02+00:00,1.0,"Banned my account for no reason,,","I had around 3-25$ Amazon credit and as a joke I went and bought a iPhone 12 using a fake card I got off Google, I didn't expect it to go through but it said ""Order placed"", ASAP i cancelled the order yet 30 minutes later my account was locked and I can't unlock it to this day as they're asking for proof of me owning the card and OBVIOUSLY I didn't.",2021-12-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,31.0,351,72,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,around amazon credit joke went bought iphone using fake card got google didnt expect go said order placed asap cancelled order yet minute later account locked cant unlock day theyre asking proof owning card obviously didnt,0.014666238314681997,0.985333761685318,0.040381379697139654,0.2,0.800743156782087,80.07431567820869,High Trust
Mk,/users/61cedb2dff52fc0012fd707c,US,1.0,2021-12-31 10:28:22+00:00,2.0,Santa didn’t show up,"Santa didn’t show up. I ordered a skee ball machine for grandkids. I just had to move away due to health. They were so excited to come to new house for Christmas. Order was made end of November. Delivery was to be Dec 21. That was changed to Dec 23 8 pm. Never showed up. Item was picked up by Ceva on Dec 8th. So I guess there is an employee somewhere enjoying a skee ball. I had my son here planned to put together. No skee ball, no Santa, Christmas is over.  The item I ordered is now 2 1/2 times more expensive now. Wouldn’t do me any good to get it now because I don’t have anyone to put it together. The customer service person in S Africa was very nice. So they get stars for that. This happened on a freezer I purchased also. Don’t order big items from Amazon. I will save up and get Skee ball brand direct. I have been a big customer of Amazon. Very sad...",2021-12-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,31.0,865,173,20,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,santa didn’t show ordered skee ball machine grandkids move away due health excited come new house christmas order made end november delivery dec changed dec pm never showed item picked ceva dec th guess employee somewhere enjoying skee ball son planned put together skee ball santa christmas item ordered time expensive wouldn’t good get don’t anyone put together customer service person africa nice get star happened freezer purchased also don’t order big item amazon save get skee ball brand direct big customer amazon sad,0.026572757138357665,0.9734272428616423,0.09702748177229388,0.4,1.1061191177852798,110.61191177852798,High Trust
Edwin,/users/5dafc404f4314e131e190f5f,US,2.0,2021-12-31 07:59:34+00:00,1.0,Worst company,"I would never trust amazon again. Many incompetent delivery personnel and when you didn’t receive your package, they will blame the customers. They ended up closing my account just because I complained that I didn’t receive the package that I ordered. I even asked for a replacement but they assumed that I was asking for a refund. I informed them that I can get a footage to verify that they didn’t deliver it yet they didn’t ask for it. Terrible customer service and worst hiring process. They never filter their delivery personnel.",2021-12-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,31.0,534,92,13,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,would never trust amazon many incompetent delivery personnel didn’t receive package blame customer ended closing account complained didn’t receive package ordered even asked replacement assumed asking refund informed get footage verify didn’t deliver yet didn’t ask terrible customer service worst hiring process never filter delivery personnel,0.047718150753338434,0.9522818492466616,0.051598429613011774,0.2,0.7864606105459332,78.64606105459332,High Trust
Landon,/users/61ce86fbd4f88000120d338a,US,2.0,2021-12-31 04:28:53+00:00,1.0,Absolute worst company ever,"Absolute worst company ever. Their customer service is terrible. I don’t know how they can possibly stay in business if this continues. In the past month, I’ve ordered 20 items. 5 of them have been late, 2 have been the wrong thing, and 2 never arrived. Of these 20 items, I’ve returned a total of 4 items. 2 because they were the wrong thing and 2 because they just were not what I was expecting.Of the two that never arrived, Amazon was so reluctant to refund me, they kept telling me to wait it out. The most frustrating thing was my orders showed if the item didn’t arrived by “__”date, then I should return and I would be refunded. When I did this, they asked me to wait longer. After reattempting this 3 times over the course of 6 days, each time they did the same thing. Finally, I was refunded. 2 other items I’ve chatted about and the reps have told me on separate occasions that I don’t need to return the item and I would be refunded. I then donated the items because they were what I needed, and a week later, I have no refunds. I chatted with their CS and they said I needed to return the items in order to be refunded. I told the reps that I didn’t have them anymore because I donated them since the last reps told me I didn’t need to return the items. You can guess how this ended… no refund. I told Amazon that I would send them a screenshot from the previous reps. They still would not refund me, they said that the other reps made a mistake and that I still would need to return the items. I am absolutely dumbfounded. These people just don’t get it. I’ve never seen a company contradict themselves more than Amazon. It is beyond frustrating. Their CRM system or whatever they use is horrendous. How terrible customer service that you don’t keep previous customer correspondence or stick to your word. It’s complete bogus. This company used to be pretty good, but now it’s the most frustrating company to purchase from. So sickening.",2021-12-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,31.0,1951,362,27,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolute worst company ever customer service terrible don’t know possibly stay business continues past month i’ve ordered item late wrong thing never arrived item i’ve returned total item wrong thing expectingof two never arrived amazon reluctant refund kept telling wait frustrating thing order showed item didn’t arrived “”date return would refunded asked wait longer reattempting time course day time thing finally refunded item i’ve chatted rep told separate occasion don’t need return item would refunded donated item needed week later refund chatted c said needed return item order refunded told rep didn’t anymore donated since last rep told didn’t need return item guess ended… refund told amazon would send screenshot previous rep still would refund said rep made mistake still would need return item absolutely dumbfounded people don’t get i’ve never seen company contradict amazon beyond frustrating crm system whatever use horrendous terrible customer service don’t keep previous customer correspondence stick word it’s complete bogus company used pretty good it’s frustrating company purchase sickening,0.013653898507036251,0.9863461014929638,0.20302860347728546,0.2,0.8337787714419389,83.37787714419389,High Trust
Richardo Missouri,/users/6130f937fb543b0012dab710,US,4.0,2021-12-30 23:57:22+00:00,1.0,Amazon is terrible now,Amazon is terrible now. They’re selling used products as new. I bought a $300 F-GT Lite racing cockpit from them that was obviously used. It had what looked like screwdriver scratches all over the base where you mount the wheel and a few scratches on the metal poles. I had already mounted the wheel and pedals to it and it would have been too much of a hassle to send something that big and heavy back so I just kept it. It works like it’s suppose to but it was obviously returned by someone and sold as new. My Mom also just bought a microwave from Amazon in June that already stopped working right before I wrote this review. That’s like 4 months. I told her it was probably used and they sold it as new anyway. Amazon is not the same company anymore and I definitely won’t be doing business with them in the future. I won’t even be using Prime Video anymore. There’s nothing worth watching on there anyway and Prime shipping is a waist of money when it takes them 4 days to ship something. Amazon Fresh items are overpriced like everything else on Amazon. I compared Amazon Fresh to Walmart prices and Walmart was always about $1 or more cheaper. And Amazon Fresh never has what you really want in stock. I’ve spent thousands of dollars with Amazon over the years and the way they treat their customers now is really sad. I wish I could return everything I bought from them over the years and get all my money back. I already deleted all my payment methods from their site and will probably just close my Amazon account. I go out of my way to tell people how awful Amazon is now so they don’t get screwed like a lot of other people have. I’ll be shopping with Walmart from now on and will be using every streaming service except for Prime Video. Amazon is an awful company to do business with now.,2021-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,30.0,1801,338,22,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon terrible they’re selling used product new bought fgt lite racing cockpit obviously used looked like screwdriver scratch base mount wheel scratch metal pole already mounted wheel pedal would much hassle send something big heavy back kept work like it’s suppose obviously returned someone sold new mom also bought microwave amazon june already stopped working right wrote review that’s like month told probably used sold new anyway amazon company anymore definitely won’t business future won’t even using prime video anymore there’s nothing worth watching anyway prime shipping waist money take day ship something amazon fresh item overpriced like everything else amazon compared amazon fresh walmart price walmart always cheaper amazon fresh never really want stock i’ve spent thousand dollar amazon year way treat customer really sad wish could return everything bought year get money back already deleted payment method site probably close amazon account go way tell people awful amazon don’t get screwed like lot people i’ll shopping walmart using every streaming service except prime video amazon awful company business,0.015593318238721893,0.9844066817612781,0.18956814357823892,0.2,0.8301169695962868,83.01169695962868,High Trust
JP van der Merwe,/users/60ca5fd064813d001a5d7eb9,Unknown,9.0,2021-12-30 21:22:01+00:00,5.0,Pleasantly Surprised,"Have purchased three separate items and had them shipped internationally, and it worked really well. The shipping was expensive in all three cases (which is fair considering I’m shipping products from the USA to Africa) and the delivery times were a bit off (out of their control, as the delay was caused by border control). Also, the product import fee estimations are super, super convenient. Product tracking is very useful and the experience was rather smooth! 🎉",2021-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,30.0,466,77,20,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,purchased three separate item shipped internationally worked really well shipping expensive three case fair considering i’m shipping product usa africa delivery time bit control delay caused border control also product import fee estimation super super convenient product tracking useful experience rather smooth 🎉,0.35219776000083813,0.6478022399991619,0.04318564217610768,1.0,1.8325382484348025,183.25382484348026,High Trust
Christin Swaringen,/users/61ce0969d6e4ec0012dbb9fc,US,1.0,2021-12-30 19:33:20+00:00,1.0,Negative 10 out of 10,"Negative 10 out of 10. The lady just hung up one me. Somehow my money got refunded to a gift card instead of my debit card. She said I chose this option, NO I DIDNT. Why would my money not go back to the original form of payment. So dumb. Just another way for Amazon to stay big. Refund money to a gift card so you have to put it back in Jeff Bezos pocket.",2021-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,30.0,356,75,21,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,negative lady hung one somehow money got refunded gift card instead debit card said chose option didnt would money go back original form payment dumb another way amazon stay big refund money gift card put back jeff bezos pocket,0.03391879330911075,0.9660812066908893,0.04206393718452047,0.2,0.7914533907823488,79.14533907823488,High Trust
Nox,/users/61cdd8fcfc2cc600125f3842,US,1.0,2021-12-30 16:06:59+00:00,1.0,Inane solutions to a simple fix,"I ordered a new tv to match my current one, two wall mounts, and an install to have both TVs installed on the wall.  The installer showed up with instructions to only install one of the tvs - when I called Amazon customer services about it they stated that they cannot override the install of the second tv in my request and they would have to do a second appointment for the second tv, even though the installer is already here installing the first tv.  They confirmed it was not a 3rd party installer, it was one from Amazon.  They only way for them to complete my original order was to have the installer leave and come back another time.",2021-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,30.0,641,120,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered new tv match current one two wall mount install tv installed wall installer showed instruction install one tv called amazon customer service stated cannot override install second tv request would second appointment second tv even though installer already installing first tv confirmed rd party installer one amazon way complete original order installer leave come back another time,0.026497226037440702,0.9735027739625592,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.8002118468803262,80.02118468803262,High Trust
