Leonardo Escoto,/users/5e6ccdca1c7f4f26d74e5597,GB,9.0,2021-12-27 00:01:17+00:00,1.0,SCAMMERS !!!,"SCAMMERS !!!Amazon let your order go through without fixing the item price after changing the delivery address during checkout... let me explain.If an item is at $45 only in the U.S. and your default delivery is outside the US, the price increases example $65...I noticed that so I tried, before and AFTER, if you change the delivery to the US before placing the item in the cart, the price updates, and drops to $45. However, if you do it during checkout, the price remains at $65 even after you placed the shipping address within the U.S.So what do Amazon do with that extra $20, well it pays the Gas for another Moon ride...SCAMMERS",2021-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,27.0,635,113,12,2,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,scammer amazon let order go without fixing item price changing delivery address checkout let explainif item u default delivery outside u price increase example noticed tried change delivery u placing item cart price update drop however checkout price remains even placed shipping address within usso amazon extra well pay gas another moon ridescammers,0.8159411813536318,0.1840588186463682,0.0633763320246775,0.2,0.4047046757281196,40.470467572811955,Low Trust
