Luke Carlmain,/users/58343ed10000ff000a59cce6,GB,23.0,2021-12-26 12:54:54+00:00,1.0,Amazon thinks it doesn’t have to answer to its customers,"If I’m brutally honest, I don’t even think they deserve one star, the most herrific customer service I’ve ever come across. I used my compensation money to get a bed that I’ve wanted for years, my dream bed and then realised after three months for the bed to be delivered, I could get it cheaper, so I asked them to refund it as a gift card balance. I told them they were not in any way, shape, or form to refund it to the previous card I purchased because it was £3000 overdrawn. They ignored me. They refunded it to the account expressly told them not to they’ve given me the two-finger salute and treated me like I do not deserve the right to request that they do not refund to something that I expressly told them if they were going to repay it to they were not to refund the bed they ignored me I lost £2014. I don’t have a bed. I’m stuck with the TV that we’re supposed to go in the bed, and I’m stuck with a king super king mattress in a box in my living room for the last year. Amazon is so rude. They don’t give you the right to appeal. They don’t give you the freedom to complain, and if you do complain, they turn round to you and say they don’t have to provide you with any feedback on that complaint. I’ve had about six customer service agents cut me off because they feel that they don’t have to speak to me or they don’t have to explain to me why they did something I repeatedly asked them notto do. I’ll be very wary at giving your money to a company who thinks customer service doesn’t have to be provided because they’re so big!!!!",2021-12-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,26.0,1549,303,56,10,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,i’m brutally honest don’t even think deserve one star herrific customer service i’ve ever come across used compensation money get bed i’ve wanted year dream bed realised three month bed delivered could get cheaper asked refund gift card balance told way shape form refund previous card purchased £ overdrawn ignored refunded account expressly told they’ve given twofinger salute treated like deserve right request refund something expressly told going repay refund bed ignored lost £ don’t bed i’m stuck tv we’re supposed go bed i’m stuck king super king mattress box living room last year amazon rude don’t give right appeal don’t give freedom complain complain turn round say don’t provide feedback complaint i’ve six customer service agent cut feel don’t speak don’t explain something repeatedly asked notto i’ll wary giving money company think customer service doesn’t provided they’re big,0.9316888714577377,0.06831112854226229,0.16993830622546272,0.2,0.3681432255162237,36.81432255162237,Low Trust
