Kristin Stahr,/users/61c75abd8f45ce001278da00,US,1.0,2021-12-25 17:56:04+00:00,1.0,"Dear Amazon,","Dear Amazon,I want to tell you about my experience this Christmas. No, this is not a complaint about a late delivery, delay or broken merchandise. ‘‘Twas the night before Christmas and I was on my way to my first Christmas out since my spouse died in 2019. I was on the 60 freeway in California between 6 and 6:30 when one of your delivery drivers cut me off due to being on their phone. This is where the fun begins….Of course I swerved out of the way and subsequently my belongings and my two dogs went flying. Pulling over and trying to assist them, my 3year old was so spooked that she barreled out of the car and on to the freeway. So, there I was, on the side of the road, in dress attire, searching for my dog under the pitch black sky, walking up and down the embankment all while it begins to rain. Mud and unknown debris dot the highway as cars go screaming by. Calling out to Sierra and the only illumination is my cell phone light I hobble up and down on a blind curve looking for my puppy. Then there, in the distance, something black and white, on the ground about 100 yards from where I pulled over, my dog, on the ground, bleeding and convulsing. My worst fear had come true…..Trying hard not to loose my schit, I pick her up and run with a 50 pound dog, 100 yards to my car. My poor puppy was limp and bleeding from her rectum. ……locating a 24 hour vet…..while in shock…on Christmas Eve….ok….that’s funny….Screaming down the freeway and trying to avoid a ticket, we arrive to Indio Emergency VCA. The staff there was impeccable and came to assist immediately. They whisked my puppy back to the exam room while I, covered in blood and mud, try to gather myself and console my other senior dog. As I am gathering my belongings, the doctor comes out to speak to me at my car……Broken back, pelvis and a completely torn rectal cavity. I couldn’t make this Schit up even if I tried. The only thing I could logically do is to spare my puppy from pain. She was euthanized on Christmas Eve, the first Christmas for me since the passing of my spouse. I have no words and for me, that is a rarity!Dear Amazon, I am a Prime Member, a loyal customer who still has lists and items in their cart. If you do anything….please put the safety of others before your profits….educate your drivers of road safety and doing the right thing when running someone off the road….you ruined my Christmas in ways beyond words. My Christmas….true facts. Sincerely,KS",2021-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,25.0,2453,455,12,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,dear amazoni want tell experience christmas complaint late delivery delay broken merchandise ‘‘twas night christmas way first christmas since spouse died freeway california one delivery driver cut due phone fun begins…of course swerved way subsequently belonging two dog went flying pulling trying assist year old spooked barreled car freeway side road dress attire searching dog pitch black sky walking embankment begin rain mud unknown debris dot highway car go screaming calling sierra illumination cell phone light hobble blind curve looking puppy distance something black white ground yard pulled dog ground bleeding convulsing worst fear come true…trying hard loose schit pick run pound dog yard car poor puppy limp bleeding rectum ……locating hour vet…while shock…on christmas eve…ok…that’s funny…screaming freeway trying avoid ticket arrive indio emergency vca staff impeccable came assist immediately whisked puppy back exam room covered blood mud try gather console senior dog gathering belonging doctor come speak car……broken back pelvis completely torn rectal cavity couldn’t make schit even tried thing could logically spare puppy pain euthanized christmas eve first christmas since passing spouse word raritydear amazon prime member loyal customer still list item cart anything…please put safety others profits…educate driver road safety right thing running someone road…you ruined christmas way beyond word christmas…true fact sincerelyks,0.09991804307853629,0.9000819569214638,0.25518788558609085,0.2,0.8010785555779499,80.10785555779499,High Trust
