S Reed,/users/61c64eb44808380012b63df9,US,1.0,2021-12-24 22:50:41+00:00,1.0,Purchased a present for Christmas for…,"Purchased a present for Christmas for our son who came home from college. Ordered it through Amazon, and when purchasing it they said it would be delivered 12/24 Xmas eve. Now we check and it says 12/29, but didn't give us an email or communication that the date had slipped. Amazon prides themselves in Customer Obsession as their #1 leadership principle! If this is true, would they have stood by their word, and if it couldn't happen on time there would be an email or something that would let us know? This present was the biggest one he was getting, and now we will have to show him a delivery date, and tell him what it is; which isn't the same at all as it is opening the gift. Amazon thinks that they follow their 14 leadership principles, but they don't at all. Not the first issue I've had, and definately not the 1st I've heard about.",2021-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,24.0,845,157,38,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,purchased present christmas son came home college ordered amazon purchasing said would delivered xmas eve check say didnt give u email communication date slipped amazon pride customer obsession leadership principle true would stood word couldnt happen time would email something would let u know present biggest one getting show delivery date tell isnt opening gift amazon think follow leadership principle dont first issue ive definately st ive heard,0.045197694939851776,0.9548023050601482,0.08805384183959619,0.2,0.7950119208979933,79.50119208979933,High Trust
Shirl Breyfogle,/users/61c5ef10e693330012cfbac9,US,2.0,2021-12-24 16:03:07+00:00,1.0,Frustrated,"I like Amazon and have prime, shop often, love the shows and my kindle. Their customer service is horrendous. Some work from so and you hear children in the background and trying to interrupt, some barely speak English and some are just dumber than rocks. It generally takes several phone calls to get someone who can actually help. If I didn't like everything else about them, I would have ceased doing business with them years ago. I am so angry and frustrated with them right now I could scream. I have talked to 2 people, been on the phone a half hour and finally just hung up. I will have to try again when I get home from work. Maybe then I will get someone who speaks and understands English. I had to repeat everything over and over and over and they still couldn't get it. Incompetent!!!!!!!!!!!",2021-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,24.0,804,147,10,1,0.0,0,11,2,1,Suspicious,like amazon prime shop often love show kindle customer service horrendous work hear child background trying interrupt barely speak english dumber rock generally take several phone call get someone actually help didnt like everything else would ceased business year ago angry frustrated right could scream talked people phone half hour finally hung try get home work maybe get someone speaks understands english repeat everything still couldnt get incompetent,0.9999968019210984,3.1980789015895184e-06,0.08244531688166012,0.2,0.31649066241578283,31.649066241578282,Low Trust
