Miracle,/users/61c5e19390f93d00124afeb6,US,1.0,2021-12-24 15:05:47+00:00,1.0,I am giving a 1 star because of the new…,"I am giving a 1 star because of the new policy Amazon will be doing. I recently had an order that was totaled to $230.17. The following day I was charged again for $230.01 from Amazon. So I called customer service and I was told that it is just for authorization and will get taken off in 7-10 business days. So my complaint is, everytime I order from amazon they will “charge” me twice and I will not have access to my money for a couple days? It’s the principle of not being able to take cash out the atm because Amazon all of a sudden (after years of me being a memeber) wants to charge twice. Ridiculous, I will definitely be spreading the news.",2021-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,24.0,649,125,40,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,giving star new policy amazon recently order totaled following day charged amazon called customer service told authorization get taken business day complaint everytime order amazon “charge” twice access money couple day it’s principle able take cash atm amazon sudden year memeber want charge twice ridiculous definitely spreading news,0.010057555741856359,0.9899424442581436,0.07010656197420079,0.2,0.808992534523912,80.89925345239119,High Trust
