Ben Hicks,/users/5fc360d144c93b001a5493c7,GB,3.0,2021-12-23 16:05:28+00:00,1.0,I purchased an expensive item which was…,"I purchased an expensive item which was a Christmas present (£250+) and it was meant to arrive on Tuesday 21st December. I wait in for it and it doesn’t arrive. I talk to the live chat, and someone tells me it’ll definitey be here the next day. The same happens for the next 2 days.Thursday 23rd at 4pm I ring Amazon. The item was lost in transit on the Tuesday. They say they’re going to refund me my money. This leaves me Christmas Eve to go and buy the item from an Apple store over 50 miles away (if it’s in stock). Okay, it happens sometimes I get that, I’ll settle down and sort it. That’s when they tell me my refund won’t be with me for 5-7 working days!!! I request to speak to a manager. Natalia comes onto the phone. I’ve never spoken to a more condensing robotic person in my life. I will never use Amazon ever again. No item, and no refund in time to purchase the item before Christmas. Disgraceful. Merry Christmas",2021-12-23 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,23.0,928,177,40,7,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,purchased expensive item christmas present £ meant arrive tuesday st december wait doesn’t arrive talk live chat someone tell it’ll definitey next day happens next daysthursday rd pm ring amazon item lost transit tuesday say they’re going refund money leaf christmas eve go buy item apple store mile away it’s stock okay happens sometimes get i’ll settle sort that’s tell refund won’t working day request speak manager natalia come onto phone i’ve never spoken condensing robotic person life never use amazon ever item refund time purchase item christmas disgraceful merry christmas,0.7809612282382713,0.2190387717617287,0.09927089175546831,0.2,0.429373564231958,42.9373564231958,Low Trust
