BARBARA SHERWIN,/users/61c3a3ca3474800012da86b5,GB,2.0,2021-12-22 22:26:02+00:00,1.0,"Deliveries unacceptable, non existent customer service","I’ve been an Amazon customer for years. It’s an easy way to buy online. However I can no longer rely on them for deliveries. They registered my complaint after yet another delivery where I was at home, the driver did not ring my entry phone, did not attempt to make delivery to me at my front door and did not leave the package in my safe space. I emailed details of the complaint and heard nothing. Emailed again a few days later and heard nothing. Emailed again after a further week. My complaint is being ignored. I don’t want compensation. I don’t want a discount. I just want to rely on my purchases being delivered safely. Unfortunately Amazon obviously couldn’t care less so I have sadly had to stop being a customer.",2021-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,22.0,724,132,54,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’ve amazon customer year it’s easy way buy online however longer rely delivery registered complaint yet another delivery home driver ring entry phone attempt make delivery front door leave package safe space emailed detail complaint heard nothing emailed day later heard nothing emailed week complaint ignored don’t want compensation don’t want discount want rely purchase delivered safely unfortunately amazon obviously couldn’t care less sadly stop customer,0.007182998891876308,0.9928170011081237,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.8112150064430129,81.12150064430129,High Trust
