Mr edward bird,/users/5616705e0000ff0001e1891a,GB,152.0,2021-12-27 10:03:49+00:00,1.0,Amazon likes to lie and jerk customers around,"Recently I had the ""pleasure ""of being given the total run around by Amazon I am at present an Amazon prime member have been for several years as I result of the lies and runaround I have recently experienced from Amazon I am closely reviewing the situation ,firstly I recently ordered two bottles of alcohol for delivery they were due for delivery via prime on December 15th 2021 which is exceptable I received as normal SMS text confirming delivery initially between 14.00 and 17.00 of that day then a little later I received later another message delivery 15.30 to 18.00,then 16.50 a message was received that my delivery was 2 stops away ,items did not arrive after contacting customer services was supplied with tracking link which stated delivery would be by 19.00 when item did not turn up checked link now said 20.00 hrs then 21.00 hrs then 22.00 hrs items did not turn up I rang Amazon customer services during this time and they were apologetic but still assured me my items would arrive and as a form of apology they sent me via my account a goodwill gesture of a ten pound voucher to use on qualifying Amazon purchase which I checked and was available I did not use straight away (I should of done) anyway back to the B/S from Amazon after my item did not turn up after 22.00 hrs I decided obviously it was taken back to the depot for next day delivery but as I was due to away that weekend I thought as I new where the Amazon depot was in my town I popped to the depot to try and collect my items easy or so I thought got to depot a supervisor initially said it was still out with driver this was 22.30 that night while waiting for them to check a very young lady appeared claiming? To be depot manager ,she went off to find the supervisor I initially asked for help ,she then came back and apologized and said my items were undeliverable and I would have to wait for replacements to be reordered and would be delivered in the next two days which was fine accidents do happen so I delayed going away for again until items would be delivered,I was willing to except this then after getting home the next morning I checked to confirm when my items would be delivered but to my surprise and disappointment Amazon had cancelled the accidentally damaged goods completely and told me I would now have to wait 5 to 7 days for a refund .now I rung up their customer services to yes complain as the problem was not my fault they then reordered the items and I got them on the 18th December 2021 now that is fine except the so called good will gesture a 10 pound on my account has gone and been removed from my account kind of pees you off that they give with one hand then take back where's the good will gone lol.just spent another hour on phone trying to sort out I now realise it's not worth it Amazon goodwill does not exist",2021-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,27.0,2832,531,45,8,5.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently pleasure given total run around amazon present amazon prime member several year result lie runaround recently experienced amazon closely reviewing situation firstly recently ordered two bottle alcohol delivery due delivery via prime december th exceptable received normal sm text confirming delivery initially day little later received later another message delivery message received delivery stop away item arrive contacting customer service supplied tracking link stated delivery would item turn checked link said hr hr hr item turn rang amazon customer service time apologetic still assured item would arrive form apology sent via account goodwill gesture ten pound voucher use qualifying amazon purchase checked available use straight away done anyway back b amazon item turn hr decided obviously taken back depot next day delivery due away weekend thought new amazon depot town popped depot try collect item easy thought got depot supervisor initially said still driver night waiting check young lady appeared claiming depot manager went find supervisor initially asked help came back apologized said item undeliverable would wait replacement reordered would delivered next two day fine accident happen delayed going away item would deliveredi willing except getting home next morning checked confirm item would delivered surprise disappointment amazon cancelled accidentally damaged good completely told would wait day refund rung customer service yes complain problem fault reordered item got th december fine except called good gesture pound account gone removed account kind pee give one hand take back wheres good gone loljust spent another hour phone trying sort realise worth amazon goodwill exist,0.2450733224587697,0.7549266775412303,0.2978126752664049,0.2,0.7370258738238962,73.70258738238962,Medium Trust
Ale West Q,/users/580db4820000ff000a505e4c,GB,6.0,2021-12-22 11:09:32+00:00,1.0,Bought a product which stopped working…,"Bought a product which stopped working after a couple-three months. Usually Amazon is pretty nice and helps you to replace it or return it, however this time went so sideways.Customer service for the first time in 10 years was offensive an aggressive. When complained about that they would close the chat or not pass me to any supervisor.Overall 0 customer service ( WOW, didn't expect this from Amazon sincerely)",2021-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,22.0,413,69,39,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought product stopped working couplethree month usually amazon pretty nice help replace return however time went sidewayscustomer service first time year offensive aggressive complained would close chat pas supervisoroverall customer service wow didnt expect amazon sincerely,0.028276391168848943,0.971723608831151,0.038698822209758836,0.2,0.7936015688575273,79.36015688575273,High Trust
Helen,/users/5957ac970000ff000aaa55df,GB,6.0,2021-12-21 22:00:44+00:00,5.0,Amazing customer care,"Had a delivery that couldn't be left when I was out as needed an I.d. check for, contacted amazon via online chat and said I would not be there because of work, after exploring few options they agreed to deliver after 6pmWithin an hour a customer service lady for amazon locally rang me, explained been hitch and what she was trying to sort and would call back. She called back and said had organised delivery later that eve. Not only did I get another call to let me know driver wouldn't be long, any probs she would check in morning. Amanda was the lovely lady who couldn't have done more if she tried,so grateful as it was a xmas present and only couple days before xmas. Absolutely amazing customer care and fab driver to come out, huge thank you",2021-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,21.0,750,139,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,delivery couldnt left needed id check contacted amazon via online chat said would work exploring option agreed deliver pmwithin hour customer service lady amazon locally rang explained hitch trying sort would call back called back said organised delivery later eve get another call let know driver wouldnt long probs would check morning amanda lovely lady couldnt done triedso grateful xmas present couple day xmas absolutely amazing customer care fab driver come huge thank,0.037748291867186444,0.9622517081328136,0.07795849691531127,1.0,1.996717553449469,199.6717553449469,High Trust
