Tom C,/users/5a9fa57c4de5666d34a19876,GB,17.0,2021-12-21 20:42:20+00:00,1.0,Dangerous Amazon Driver,"I and my 17 year old Son were driving to Wales earlier today. (21st Dec 2021) My Son has only just passed his test and this was his first time on the motorway and the longest journey he has ever undertaken.We were travelling on the M$ and approx. 5 miles from the Bath/Stroud turn off, an Amazon Prime van pulled up very close behind us and the driver was flashing his lights. My Son got quite anxious and pulled over to the slow lane, from his position in the centre lane, as he had just over taken a lorry.The van driver then pulled very sharply in front of us and started to slow down. So my Son pulled out and went to pass him as he did not know what the issue was. With that, the van driver also pulled out, without indicating and forced my Son to return to the middle lane.The van driver then slowed down in the fast lane, so he was alongside us and started making hand gestures. He then pulled ahead again and cut my Son up, causing him to brake and pull back.The incident did nothing for my sons confidence and the driver continued to taunt and make threatening gestures until he finally pulled off and headed for Bath/Stroud.Sadly, when something like this happens, it is not the driver, but the Van that is remembered. Both my Wife and I have been loyal customers with Amazon and this incident was totally unjust and uncalled for.Had the Police been near, there is no doubt the van driver would have been pulled over and warned about his erratic, dangerous driving.As I was a passenger, I was able to take a photo of the number plate. The incident occurred at approx. 09.25. The registration was LC21 XHP. I am sure your records will clearly be able to identify the guilty party. This rude, incompetent, dangerous driver, has only harmed Amazons reputation.",2021-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,21.0,1767,324,23,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,year old son driving wale earlier today st dec son passed test first time motorway longest journey ever undertakenwe travelling approx mile bathstroud turn amazon prime van pulled close behind u driver flashing light son got quite anxious pulled slow lane position centre lane taken lorrythe van driver pulled sharply front u started slow son pulled went pas know issue van driver also pulled without indicating forced son return middle lanethe van driver slowed fast lane alongside u started making hand gesture pulled ahead cut son causing brake pull backthe incident nothing son confidence driver continued taunt make threatening gesture finally pulled headed bathstroudsadly something like happens driver van remembered wife loyal customer amazon incident totally unjust uncalled forhad police near doubt van driver would pulled warned erratic dangerous drivingas passenger able take photo number plate incident occurred approx registration lc xhp sure record clearly able identify guilty party rude incompetent dangerous driver harmed amazon reputation,0.043697123261996956,0.9563028767380031,0.18171620863712842,0.2,0.8144946800964272,81.44946800964273,High Trust
mbrakes23,/users/5daba85b98b060255b0f680a,US,29.0,2021-12-21 18:40:38+00:00,1.0,login nightmare,"Tried to buy new alarm clock. Had to enter e-mail and password. Entered password. Then it asked for password and captcha. Sent e-mail I had to confirm all just to log in. Finally logged in. Tried to check out. Wanted password. Entered password. Then it asked for password and captcha again, even though I had already gone through that just to log in. Would not let me check out. Called customer service. First person transferred me to second person. Had to give all the information again. He transferred me to a third person. ""Your account has been locked out because it has been so long. We'll have to connect you to our security..."" That's when I hung up. NOT WORTH IT!!! I'll never use Amazon again!",2021-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,21.0,702,126,15,2,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,tried buy new alarm clock enter email password entered password asked password captcha sent email confirm log finally logged tried check wanted password entered password asked password captcha even though already gone log would let check called customer service first person transferred second person give information transferred third person account locked long well connect security thats hung worth ill never use amazon,0.976006620701944,0.023993379298056006,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.3261301725430269,32.61301725430269,Low Trust
