Jancie Johnson,/users/5a2bc9740000ff000aee9824,GB,15.0,2021-12-21 18:26:19+00:00,1.0,Amazon ...........Disgraceful,"Monday 20th December I ordered £525 worth of Amazon Vouchers as a thank you to our volunteers with varying amounts. I received a confirmation email at 12:40pm. At 14:36 I received an email from an Amazon email address I did not recognise and it did not address me by name but said ""Hello"". It also asked me to change my password. I thought this might be a phishing email so I called Amazon to check. They confirmed that this was a genuine email and Amazon had deemed my order as fraudulent.I changed my password only to find that my order had been deleted and along with my card details.I have called Amazon at least 8 times and each time they have read from a script apologising and saying this will be escalated.I purchased from Love2Shop with no problems. I have been an Amazon customer for ages, with Amazon Prime as well.The reason I chose e-vouchers was for the very reason they could be sent electronically!For a huge company like Amazon they could have put a hold on the purchase until they investigated and then removed the hold. As of this moment although they have cancelled my order they have a hold on the monies which shows pending in my account.What would I suggest avoid Amazon e-vouchers if you are purchasing more than one.Customer Service is non existent. Poor, poor service.",2021-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,21.0,1294,230,29,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,monday th december ordered £ worth amazon voucher thank volunteer varying amount received confirmation email pm received email amazon email address recognise address name said hello also asked change password thought might phishing email called amazon check confirmed genuine email amazon deemed order fraudulenti changed password find order deleted along card detailsi called amazon least time time read script apologising saying escalatedi purchased loveshop problem amazon customer age amazon prime wellthe reason chose evouchers reason could sent electronicallyfor huge company like amazon could put hold purchase investigated removed hold moment although cancelled order hold monies show pending accountwhat would suggest avoid amazon evouchers purchasing onecustomer service non existent poor poor service,0.10090599346590907,0.8990940065340909,0.12899607403252944,0.2,0.7753462180735514,77.53462180735514,High Trust
Mimi,/users/5b91f5ed4de5666d341d4749,US,15.0,2021-12-21 16:15:53+00:00,1.0,Amazon is full of thieves,"Amazon is horrible. Lost count of how many times a package says it’s been delivered when it’s nowhere to be found in my mailroom. Instead of helping you, Amazon customer services forces you to wait 2 more days before they consider refunding you or sending another product. It’s super infuriating. Clearly the delivery people for Amazon do this to make it seem like they’re on time.",2021-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,21.0,381,66,25,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon horrible lost count many time package say it’s delivered it’s nowhere found mailroom instead helping amazon customer service force wait day consider refunding sending another product it’s super infuriating clearly delivery people amazon make seem like they’re time,0.02739565844733347,0.9726043415526665,0.03701626472237801,0.2,0.7937054237208089,79.37054237208089,High Trust
