Miss Sade Marshall,/users/5b6ad6f94de5666d34011eb1,GB,38.0,2021-12-20 14:39:29+00:00,1.0,So frustrated for a complete stranger,So frustrated for a complete stranger. I work for my local council and upon patrolling the high street I found 6 parcels belonging to a lady that lived close to the area all opened and obviously stolen. I bought the empty envelopes and boxes to her and she informed me nobody had delivered them or rung her bell. She also let me know that the same thing happened to her last week. I also have an item that seems to have gone missing.There is a serious issue with whoever is delivering items to the ealing area. It's just not on and completely disgusting that they may have staff that are stealing.,2021-12-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,20.0,597,111,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,frustrated complete stranger work local council upon patrolling high street found parcel belonging lady lived close area opened obviously stolen bought empty envelope box informed nobody delivered rung bell also let know thing happened last week also item seems gone missingthere serious issue whoever delivering item ealing area completely disgusting may staff stealing,0.050177424452194475,0.9498225755478056,0.062254627033090294,0.2,0.7873622131805209,78.73622131805209,High Trust
