Sarah Griffiths,/users/61bb6dc7906cb70013bf1d91,GB,1.0,2021-12-16 16:48:17+00:00,1.0,Terrible customer service.,"One star is too much in my opinion. Appalling customer service. Delivery guy turned up at my address with my parcel and just keeps repeating the word 'code' at me. I manage to figure out that because i'd purchased an expensive item that he needed a code to prove who I was. No code sent via text or email so he starts trying to explain how to find it on the Amazon app. I'm showing him multiple screen and invoices from the app which prove I made the purchase and also shows there is no code. He gets frustrated and leaves with my parcel. Called the customer service line for help and the call connects but theres no one there. Typical large call centre behaviour, probably got me on mute while they talk about their plans for the weekend! If someone from Amazon could reply to this as I'd like to make a complaint.",2021-12-16 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,16.0,815,154,26,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,one star much opinion appalling customer service delivery guy turned address parcel keep repeating word code manage figure id purchased expensive item needed code prove code sent via text email start trying explain find amazon app im showing multiple screen invoice app prove made purchase also show code get frustrated leaf parcel called customer service line help call connects there one typical large call centre behaviour probably got mute talk plan weekend someone amazon could reply id like make complaint,0.09727340231580449,0.9027265976841955,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.7686375557125408,76.86375557125407,High Trust
