Carl Dent,/users/61bb15a9f3e60f0012cf1381,GB,2.0,2021-12-16 10:32:53+00:00,1.0,One star is to much in my opinion,"One star is to much in my opinion. Brought a packet of ecig coils from a so called 3rd party seller called fortune hero. On using first one it exploded my tank and regulated box mod shattering glass and hot eliquid all over my face. Contacted Amazon via phone and explained exactly what had happened, I was advised to email customer services with as much details has possible which I did, I also included photos of burns to my face, after being passed around their for 3 days, I must have had at least 20 people asking the same questions, one finally said it's not their fault and I should contact the seller Fortune Hero, so here we go again, Contacted seller again explained everything to them and sent images to them, again after 3 days they said it was Eleaf's fault and I should of contacted them. By this point I'd totally lost the will to live. I'm now seeking legal advice and pursuing through the legal system.Please stay away from Amazon, don't be like me and get injured through buying counterfeit goods through Amazon. Their not bothered about you, their just bothered about get the money out your bank account. Support your local shops, you'll find the same items there which you can get the same day and more than likely cheaper, who do you think pays all them wages and advertising for them, you do. So get off your sofa, drive or walk to the locals shops buy what you need and you don't have to sit in and wait for the delivery driver to finally turn up. Plus you'll be helping our local shops and businesses to top it off. How much do you really think that bargain is actually worth from Amazon once you've taken into account the wages, the buildings, the vans, and what ever else you can think of including Amazon profits so that £10 bargain now is worth just £1. Stop funding greedy fatcats who don't give a dame on what they sell or if it causes injury.",2021-12-16 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,16.0,1873,346,33,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,one star much opinion brought packet ecig coil called rd party seller called fortune hero using first one exploded tank regulated box mod shattering glass hot eliquid face contacted amazon via phone explained exactly happened advised email customer service much detail possible also included photo burn face passed around day must least people asking question one finally said fault contact seller fortune hero go contacted seller explained everything sent image day said eleafs fault contacted point id totally lost live im seeking legal advice pursuing legal systemplease stay away amazon dont like get injured buying counterfeit good amazon bothered bothered get money bank account support local shop youll find item get day likely cheaper think pay wage advertising get sofa drive walk local shop buy need dont sit wait delivery driver finally turn plus youll helping local shop business top much really think bargain actually worth amazon youve taken account wage building van ever else think including amazon profit £ bargain worth £ stop funding greedy fatcats dont give dame sell cause injury,0.004751885644583619,0.9952481143554164,0.19405496354458776,0.2,0.8364350498866258,83.64350498866257,High Trust
