Susan Stephan,/users/60c11c6e384d84001a41d748,US,2.0,2021-12-15 20:17:30+00:00,1.0,Received an Empty Package,"I ordered a toy for my grandchild for Christmas.  I was home when the box was delivered. When I picked it up I thought it felt much too light and immediately open it up. The box was empty! Trying to get a replacement without being charged for not returning a non existent toy was a nightmare. First, I tried getting it replaced through the Amazon app through the missing item option - there is no option for receiving an empty box. After selecting the Replace Item option, it showed that I must return the item I didn't actually receive within 30 days or be charged for the replacement. Then I tried the Item Not Delivered but Shows Deliverd selection and it stipulated I had to wait a few days to give it time to show up. Christmas is in 10 days; I don't have time to wait. And this toy was to replace ANOTHER toy order that never showed up.  Now, I'm just really getting peeved because Amazon's customer service used to be top notch.  I tried calling their customer service number with no better service than the app had to offer. It's just automated with no live person option - even when dialing O. There are just automated replace/return/refund options with no option for receiving an empty box, but being responsible for returning an item with missing parts. I went through several options on the automated call hoping  eventually I would be transferred to an actual person. No such luck. Next, I went to Live Chat. Again, the same automated options - no fill in text box. Now, I'm furious! At this point I decided to ask for a replacement for the missing item and let my credit card company deal with them when they charge my credit card for not returning a non existent toy. After selecting the Replace Item the live chat responded this time with ""if item shows up please return."" We'll see what happens. Now that so many things can only be purchased through online sites it seems Amazon customer service has plummeted.",2021-12-15 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,15.0,1927,348,25,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,ordered toy grandchild christmas home box delivered picked thought felt much light immediately open box empty trying get replacement without charged returning non existent toy nightmare first tried getting replaced amazon app missing item option option receiving empty box selecting replace item option showed must return item didnt actually receive within day charged replacement tried item delivered show deliverd selection stipulated wait day give time show christmas day dont time wait toy replace another toy order never showed im really getting peeved amazon customer service used top notch tried calling customer service number better service app offer automated live person option even dialing automated replacereturnrefund option option receiving empty box responsible returning item missing part went several option automated call hoping eventually would transferred actual person luck next went live chat automated option fill text box im furious point decided ask replacement missing item let credit card company deal charge credit card returning non existent toy selecting replace item live chat responded time item show please return well see happens many thing purchased online site seems amazon customer service plummeted,0.0942223744154942,0.9057776255845058,0.195176668536175,0.2,0.7919241464994878,79.19241464994879,High Trust
