Max Galer,/users/5dbf6dcfe6bff784b72685cf,US,10.0,2021-12-10 22:29:58+00:00,1.0,Oh how the mighty have fallen,"I don’t feel like writing an essay. I could. But I don’t wish to waste time as they have. They don’t care anymore, legit we are nothing to them Any concerns with their websites, bad interactions at Whole Foods store/drivers, Anything will absolutely not be solved. All I get now is..sorry this happened and I’ll report it and make sure it doesn’t happen again. Huh?  You’re not here, you don’t work at fulfillment. Promising next day and then delayed two. Again don’t offer a service if you can’t make it happen. Returns and refunds are smooth. I’ll give them that much. But they sell so many sketchy products and we don’t know what’s legit.  I will say for sure that you should do research outside the site as they don’t have customer comments anymore. They use to offer five/ten dollar credits for grievances. They don’t do that anymore. See again, I don’t expect it. But don’t spoil us then take it away. Slap on a wrist. They can’t handle the traffic anymore. All forms of service are impacted and once covid took over, it’s just destroyed any semblance of proper customer service. Sad..so sad. Oh and don’t buy movies. You’ll get them smashed or scratched.  Limited editions will sell out way before you can order them. SighSupport local folks. I beg you",2021-12-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,10.0,1259,222,29,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,don’t feel like writing essay could don’t wish waste time don’t care anymore legit nothing concern website bad interaction whole food storedrivers anything absolutely solved get issorry happened i’ll report make sure doesn’t happen huh you’re don’t work fulfillment promising next day delayed two don’t offer service can’t make happen return refund smooth i’ll give much sell many sketchy product don’t know what’s legit say sure research outside site don’t customer comment anymore use offer fiveten dollar credit grievance don’t anymore see don’t expect don’t spoil u take away slap wrist can’t handle traffic anymore form service impacted covid took it’s destroyed semblance proper customer service sadso sad oh don’t buy movie you’ll get smashed scratched limited edition sell way order sighsupport local folk beg,0.015071564814996786,0.9849284351850032,0.12450925406618059,0.2,0.8173660684057378,81.73660684057378,High Trust
Kathryn ENDTHOFF,/users/5a78c0dd0000ff000b0dc34b,US,2.0,2021-12-10 20:57:36+00:00,5.0,I absolutely love Amazon,"I absolutely love Amazon.  I have bought many things from them over the years and have rarely been disappointed.  My orders come really fast and many times sooner than expected. I've been a Prime member for many years and love that benefit. When I did have an issue with any company on Amazon, the follow-up from Amazon itself was great. My biggest issue is that it's a little too easy to order all my needs from them as well as the things I don't need.",2021-12-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,10.0,453,85,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolutely love amazon bought many thing year rarely disappointed order come really fast many time sooner expected ive prime member many year love benefit issue company amazon followup amazon great biggest issue little easy order need well thing dont need,0.01695012759005373,0.9830498724099462,0.04767246214245653,1.0,2.0010594286334644,200.10594286334646,High Trust
