Disapointed Amazon Customer,/users/61b3b69ddf96ce0012697e0d,US,1.0,2021-12-10 20:25:32+00:00,1.0,Amazon has Fallen,"Not sure what changes have occurred at Amazon but after nearly a decade as a Prime member at almost 2 as a customer I have called it quits with Amazon. Even when packages do show up Prime 2-day shipping does not seem to exist anymore but more often than not, I receive a ""lost in transit"" notification and then must wait weeks for Amazon to issue a refund for their errors. Billing issues are increasing and the customer service (can we even call it that anymore?) team is possibly worse than useless, I am not sure if they do not understand, are not listening or just do not care but no matter what I tried they just were not listening to my concern. It is just too many headaches to deal with and it's time I go back to buying local and attempt to undo the damage I have partaken in by supporting Amazon so long.Edit: Updated for spelling",2021-12-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,10.0,840,159,17,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sure change occurred amazon nearly decade prime member almost customer called quits amazon even package show prime day shipping seem exist anymore often receive lost transit notification must wait week amazon issue refund error billing issue increasing customer service even call anymore team possibly worse useless sure understand listening care matter tried listening concern many headache deal time go back buying local attempt undo damage partaken supporting amazon longedit updated spelling,0.014270940433801407,0.9857290595661986,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.810699639149336,81.0699639149336,High Trust
Socaldesertbro,/users/61b3b61bb05cc70013a9d595,US,2.0,2022-01-03 19:13:24+00:00,1.0,My recent order of a Lucid mattress…,"My recent order of a Lucid mattress reveals that Amazon permits unauthorized sellers to openly permit fraud. Yes, fraud. The seller, Alphaben, is not an authorized reseller of Lucid mattress. Worse, Lucid mattress will not honor its 10 year warranty. This warranty is openly showed on the sellers page for the Lucid mattress. In CA, this is illegal. Amazon was reached and notified. Welp, that was useless. So, my resolution is filing fraud charges through the CA Attorney General for fraud. Amazon is not trust worthy. I wonder how many other sellers sell boasting warranties that will not be honored because of not being authorized resellers? Heck, Amazon rejected my review with screenshot response from Lucid mattress stating fact. Be careful folks because you could be buying nothingness.",2021-12-10 00:00:00+00:00,2022.0,1.0,3.0,793,128,36,7,24.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,recent order lucid mattress reveals amazon permit unauthorized seller openly permit fraud yes fraud seller alphaben authorized reseller lucid mattress worse lucid mattress honor year warranty warranty openly showed seller page lucid mattress ca illegal amazon reached notified welp useless resolution filing fraud charge ca attorney general fraud amazon trust worthy wonder many seller sell boasting warranty honored authorized resellers heck amazon rejected review screenshot response lucid mattress stating fact careful folk could buying nothingness,0.012747837360313045,0.987252162639687,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.8079839052121598,80.79839052121598,High Trust
Kamryn,/users/61b39c5691317e0012e69a0d,CA,3.0,2021-12-10 18:48:00+00:00,1.0,"Horrible, They Obstructed Me And Avoided Any Evidence On A Claim","I bought a mobile phone, the merchant sent the wrong one. I couldn't get in touch with the merchant (their site is also extremely unuser friendly), they E-mailed and asked for photos, but they didn't come with any instructions, so I assumed to just reply to the E-mail and send the photos. They said, if I have a receipt to basically update the claim and upload a picture on there, but there is no option to upload a photo.They also put the wrong link to the case in the E-mails. Everyday, I would get the same E-mail. I went on Facebook, which worked for a little while, they asked me to fill out a form. Some idiot by the name of Jessica, says, we're sorry you did not like our instructions. Does she write it in a better or helpful way? No, she paste the exact same thing in the E-mails I've been getting.They never follow up with anything. My case was denied, because of reasons, to the surprise of no one. After what was happening, in the days leading up, I predicted they would. I plan to sue, and I urge other people who have been a victim to also sue.Screenshot everything and make notes. There's a lot of people who are having a lot of issues and Amazon is still responding to someone, but they are hiding/removing comments. They don't care.",2021-12-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,10.0,1250,233,64,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought mobile phone merchant sent wrong one couldnt get touch merchant site also extremely unuser friendly emailed asked photo didnt come instruction assumed reply email send photo said receipt basically update claim upload picture option upload photothey also put wrong link case email everyday would get email went facebook worked little asked fill form idiot name jessica say sorry like instruction write better helpful way paste exact thing email ive gettingthey never follow anything case denied reason surprise one happening day leading predicted would plan sue urge people victim also suescreenshot everything make note there lot people lot issue amazon still responding someone hidingremoving comment dont care,0.005195943407832924,0.9948040565921671,0.13067863151991027,0.2,0.8235377546000656,82.35377546000656,High Trust
