C. Cole,/users/613a4f3d9150260012a29aa0,US,3.0,2021-12-09 13:05:07+00:00,1.0,New delivery service is worse than unreliable.,"Amazons new delivery service has been so frustrating that I quit prime and will no longer shop at Amazon. I ordered an important medical device which tracked as delivered, complete with a photo of some other address I didn’t recognize. When I spoke with customer service they agreed to send a replacement which has also gone missing. In my area, the drivers consistently deliver packages to the wrong address, not caring to look carefully at the address label. The last customer service representative suggested I wait a few days and maybe a neighbor will bring it by. That left me speechless and prompted me to request a refund for my Amazon prime membership fee and the items that have gone missing.I am done with Amazon. What a pitiful disappointment.",2021-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,9.0,754,129,46,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon new delivery service frustrating quit prime longer shop amazon ordered important medical device tracked delivered complete photo address didn’t recognize spoke customer service agreed send replacement also gone missing area driver consistently deliver package wrong address caring look carefully address label last customer service representative suggested wait day maybe neighbor bring left speechless prompted request refund amazon prime membership fee item gone missingi done amazon pitiful disappointment,0.019291490422759454,0.9807085095772405,0.0723499719573752,0.2,0.8048242491800952,80.48242491800951,High Trust
Bryony Coram,/users/5ef1e947e2470787b02fc96d,GB,26.0,2021-12-09 11:11:26+00:00,1.0,"learnt my lesson, buy local not companies like Amazon.","If it was possible  it would be a 0. waited in all day for a delivery of a mattress before moving due to the difficulty of purchasing goods where we are moving to. Received a PIN for the driver and was due to be delivered yesterday, waited in all day. It did not arrive so looked on tracking and it stated that  they had made 2 attempts to deliver it, which is entirely untrue and invited their customer service to look at our CCTV. This morning the tracking stated it has been delayed guessing they must have lost it after they tried to deliver it hmmmm? Rang customer services and they could not find out if or when it was coming and could only suggest cancelling it, which mean no mattress and no way of easily getting one. Couldn't comprehend nor care, thanks a lot Amazon. Taught me a lesson - buy from local companies who are more reliable and caring. So  now I need to wait in 2 more days before we move in the HOPE that we can get a mattress and not work or do all the other things needed. I'm sure the £25 gesture will really cover that.",2021-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,9.0,1046,202,54,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,possible would waited day delivery mattress moving due difficulty purchasing good moving received pin driver due delivered yesterday waited day arrive looked tracking stated made attempt deliver entirely untrue invited customer service look cctv morning tracking stated delayed guessing must lost tried deliver hmmmm rang customer service could find coming could suggest cancelling mean mattress way easily getting one couldnt comprehend care thanks lot amazon taught lesson buy local company reliable caring need wait day move hope get mattress work thing needed im sure £ gesture really cover,0.03492296057705144,0.9650770394229485,0.11329220415030847,0.2,0.805196960541536,80.5196960541536,High Trust
