Busby,/users/5c4d831611eeb409d5bb1839,GB,33.0,2021-12-07 23:01:23+00:00,1.0,Insulting drivers mashing the door to panic you to answer quickly,Drivers ring the door bell not once but 5 or 6 times then repeatedly knock on the door so hard it frightens the living daylights out of you. The driver can’t wait 15 seconds for you to answer. Standard operation is to mash down the door then immediately leave the item on the door step and if your lucky a designated safe place. If you catch the driver they laugh at you with contempt or react as if they are angels doing you a favour. I have complained to Amazon 3 or 4 times but they are the ones triggering the behaviours of the drivers due to overload or insufficient time. I have stopped using Amazon for this reason and prefer to pay for delivery rather than pay to be treated with contempt!,2021-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,7.0,697,133,65,11,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,driver ring door bell time repeatedly knock door hard frightens living daylight driver can’t wait second answer standard operation mash door immediately leave item door step lucky designated safe place catch driver laugh contempt react angel favour complained amazon time one triggering behaviour driver due overload insufficient time stopped using amazon reason prefer pay delivery rather pay treated contempt,0.09337807970788066,0.9066219202921193,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.7682296365341696,76.82296365341696,High Trust
Stephanie,/users/5fa7d828e312d2001ae010c2,AU,11.0,2021-12-07 17:22:02+00:00,1.0,"Buyers beware! Absolutely terrible ""security"" process, cancels your order then charges your without your permission, cannot contact customer service","Absolutely terrible ""security"" process. Perhaps leaving a bad review might get some action from them.I bought an item on Amazon.de with my Australian bank card. At first it looked fine, it seemed my order went through. Then less than 24 hours later I got an email saying there was suspicious activity on my account (ie using my non-German card to buy from their German branch) and they cancelled order and asked me to verify my account by submitting proof of order or payment. I sent them a PDF of my order confirmation email but it was rejected. Then about 2 days after my original order, I got an email saying my order was approved and it's on it's way. Now first of all I do not appreciate the hassle it took to place a order. My friend tried to buy something on Amazon.de with a Chinese bank card and the same thing happened. This never happened on the Australian site.Second of all, it is really bad practise for Amazon to automatically deduct the cost from my bank card after initially cancelling my order. If you then decide to approve the order, you should have told me so, not take money from my account and tell me afterwards, that my order is on the way. What happens if I bought the same expensive item in the meantime from elsewhere?! This is very very bad practise! Buyers beware!!Secondly, I have since forgotten my password and cannot log in. When I try to log in, it keeps saying my password is incorrect (even though I think it is correct, if the machine thinks it is wrong, then perhaps it is wrong) and when I try to reset it, 1 of 2 things happen: Last week, it would repeatedly tell me to enter my email address, sends me an OTP One time password to that address, make me enter it, then when I do that, tells me to enter a capcha code and my email address again, then sends me a OTP to that address. Rinse and Repeat.Today, what is happening is, no matter whether I use the Australian or German site, the password recovery process ends in a dead end where it says:""Looking for Something? We're sorry. The Web address you entered is not a functioning page on our site. Go to Amazon.com.au's Home Page""From the home page you can try to log in again or reset your password using the method above.When I contacted customer service using the only other digital method I can, via twitter, they told me to make a call to their German branch, something I cannot do at the moment.I've been unable to log in for over a week and thus unable to change my delivery instructions or use or cancel any subscriptions I have.When I tried to contact them for help, their help site tells you to call them (which I can't do) or send a secure email message to them by, get this... logging in to your account.Absolutely terrible, will never use again, especially considering the winners here are the Amazon team, they also rip off sellers by charging a $1 fee just to list their item apart from other transaction/sales fees.Buy elsewhere, don't support the ripping off of sellers and their crappy system.",2021-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,7.0,3003,548,148,19,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,absolutely terrible security process perhaps leaving bad review might get action themi bought item amazonde australian bank card first looked fine seemed order went less hour later got email saying suspicious activity account ie using nongerman card buy german branch cancelled order asked verify account submitting proof order payment sent pdf order confirmation email rejected day original order got email saying order approved way first appreciate hassle took place order friend tried buy something amazonde chinese bank card thing happened never happened australian sitesecond really bad practise amazon automatically deduct cost bank card initially cancelling order decide approve order told take money account tell afterwards order way happens bought expensive item meantime elsewhere bad practise buyer bewaresecondly since forgotten password cannot log try log keep saying password incorrect even though think correct machine think wrong perhaps wrong try reset thing happen last week would repeatedly tell enter email address sends otp one time password address make enter tell enter capcha code email address sends otp address rinse repeattoday happening matter whether use australian german site password recovery process end dead end sayslooking something sorry web address entered functioning page site go amazoncomaus home pagefrom home page try log reset password using method abovewhen contacted customer service using digital method via twitter told make call german branch something cannot momentive unable log week thus unable change delivery instruction use cancel subscription havewhen tried contact help help site tell call cant send secure email message get logging accountabsolutely terrible never use especially considering winner amazon team also rip seller charging fee list item apart transactionsales feesbuy elsewhere dont support ripping seller crappy system,0.8125739260205203,0.18742607397947975,0.30734716769489623,0.2,0.45518247052871913,45.518247052871914,Low Trust
Brett Gaddis,/users/61af8d8cd70d470012611ff2,US,1.0,2021-12-07 16:36:39+00:00,1.0,Amazon is not trustworthy,"Amazon is not trustworthy.  Have order that was over charged $10.00. It was a math issue not showing up on the invoice. Just over by 10.00. Customer service chat, phone or other is ineffective. No help. Just take it. Going through other orders and bank charges as I am sure amazon is cheating people. I am canceling prime and shopping local. If they don't have it I don't need it. Almost got suckered in. Bad by Amazon.",2021-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,7.0,419,77,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon trustworthy order charged math issue showing invoice customer service chat phone ineffective help take going order bank charge sure amazon cheating people canceling prime shopping local dont dont need almost got suckered bad amazon,0.017123192233918564,0.9828768077660814,0.04318564217610768,0.2,0.8000755323182622,80.00755323182622,High Trust
