Alex Matthews,/users/56e156c70000ff000a0d7e8f,GB,34.0,2021-12-11 08:44:43+00:00,5.0,Absolute fast changed to mastcard as…,"Absolute fast changed to mastcard as Amazon requehsted. But they won't give the £20 promotion. Don't trust what you read.Update after 41 minutes on web chat getting nowhere. I called the help line instead, sorted in under 60 seconds. £20 credit applied, and spent. Thank you Amazon Lady on direct calling. Great customer service. Changed from 1 star to 5 stars. But still -10 stars for web chat",2021-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,11.0,394,68,37,6,4.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,absolute fast changed mastcard amazon requehsted wont give £ promotion dont trust readupdate minute web chat getting nowhere called help line instead sorted second £ credit applied spent thank amazon lady direct calling great customer service changed star star still star web chat,0.18945879758496662,0.8105412024150334,0.03813796971396523,1.0,1.9128981951503097,191.28981951503096,High Trust
