LarkB,/users/572fbe970000ff000a1e4748,US,7.0,2021-12-07 11:42:08+00:00,1.0,Absolutely awful customer service,"Absolutely awful customer service.  Item shows as delivered that I doubt ever shipped.  Only recourse is to wait 5 days for card refund, Amazon gift card (price for item had increased $30 in the interim so can’t replace with that) or wait a full month for a replacement on an in stock prime delivery item.  What happened to the days when Amazon would overnight out a replacement instead of acting like someone out of Goodfellas trying to squeeze more money out of their customers?  Cancelled prime first, totally cancelling my account second.  Never again with these clowns.",2021-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,7.0,574,97,33,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolutely awful customer service item show delivered doubt ever shipped recourse wait day card refund amazon gift card price item increased interim can’t replace wait full month replacement stock prime delivery item happened day amazon would overnight replacement instead acting like someone goodfellas trying squeeze money customer cancelled prime first totally cancelling account second never clown,0.018676677884410773,0.9813233221155893,0.05440269209197981,0.2,0.8015421994761905,80.15421994761905,High Trust
