bg,/users/61ae809e22b197001231150b,US,2.0,2021-12-06 21:32:03+00:00,1.0,Amazon lost my trust,"I received package. Inside & outside wasn't packing slip or invoice.Even Co. name wasn't listed there.I spent half a day. Call different companies, credit cards & etc. to get answerwho's sent that package to me.I even contact with Tryrelaxium because inside was their supplement.After very long hold, conversation with clerk, then with supervisor thatcompany I was told that package didn't came from them.Finally I call to Amazon, but they also can't answer for my question.However after long time I was told that package was send from Amazon,but they didn't know why??They offer me shipping label, but I was told them it wasn't my order and I'm not going travel to UPS . I told that UPS can pickup from me.They told me that I must be home next 3 days??. My response was that is not acceptable.I can't understand why it's happening , who was negligent?That matter cause lot of frustration, stress and aggravation.I'm stock holder, but I not working for your Co.Who will compensate me for my time and all above?My email to CEO get by ""team"" who failed resolve issue with my satisfaction.",2021-12-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,6.0,1086,185,20,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,received package inside outside wasnt packing slip invoiceeven co name wasnt listed therei spent half day call different company credit card etc get answerwhos sent package mei even contact tryrelaxium inside supplementafter long hold conversation clerk supervisor thatcompany told package didnt came themfinally call amazon also cant answer questionhowever long time told package send amazonbut didnt know whythey offer shipping label told wasnt order im going travel ups told ups pickup methey told must home next day response acceptablei cant understand happening negligentthat matter cause lot frustration stress aggravationim stock holder working cowho compensate time abovemy email ceo get team failed resolve issue satisfaction,0.010