Julie A,/users/618d7882681c8900128eecee,US,4.0,2021-12-06 20:37:57+00:00,3.0,Why Amazon,"For the most part, I love Amazon. They are good at contacting you on FaceBook because they have blocked my reviews and wanted to know how I can fix that. They were very nice and quickly respond to me on Facebook but they told me to try and fix it with customer service. You try to go to the contact us page and you just get sorry something went wrong on our end. No popup chat no phone number. Verry disappointed 😥",2021-12-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,6.0,414,82,10,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,part love amazon good contacting facebook blocked review wanted know fix nice quickly respond facebook told try fix customer service try go contact u page get sorry something went wrong end popup chat phone number verry disappointed 😥,0.15532433204859197,0.844675667951408,0.045989904655075714,0.6,1.3315358149067191,133.1535814906719,High Trust
Sandy Amedick,/users/5a35a99c0000ff000af22300,US,4.0,2021-12-06 18:23:11+00:00,1.0,So sick of this company,"So sick of this company. #1 I pay a huge amount for prime and they never ship , 2 day anymore. #2 used the wrong credit card and within seconds if placing the order on 11/29 I hit cancel order to redo it. Wouldn't let me so I called. Woman said too late order was in shipping already. Lie #1!! On 12/6 I got an email that credit card was denied I needed to update credit card. Clicked link several times wouldn't let me update the card. Live chat guys says order shipped can't change payment method would recv on the 8th. Lie #2 Umm no not right. Puts me on hold comes back says credit card declined need to update card. AGAIN  it won't let me!! He's useless and says someone will call me. Finally ab English speaking rep!! But sge can't help me had to transfer me to a different Dept that can. This rep lie #3 orders already shipped can't change credit card. Are ya kidding me?? I'm about to lose it now. Finally she says oh your bank declined the card you have to call them. Ummm no I know it declined the cards no good as I already told her!! After going around and around for 20 minutes I tell her just cancel the order. She says fine it's cancelled. That was hours ago order still isn't cancelled!! So sick of reps that cannot understand English!!",2021-12-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,6.0,1252,241,23,5,0.0,0,12,2,1,Suspicious,sick company pay huge amount prime never ship day anymore used wrong credit card within second placing order hit cancel order redo wouldnt let called woman said late order shipping already lie got email credit card denied needed update credit card clicked link several time wouldnt let update card live chat guy say order shipped cant change payment method would recv th lie umm right put hold come back say credit card declined need update card wont let he useless say someone call finally ab english speaking rep sge cant help transfer different dept rep lie order already shipped cant change credit card ya kidding im lose finally say oh bank declined card call ummm know declined card good already told going around around minute tell cancel order say fine cancelled hour ago order still isnt cancelled sick rep cannot understand english,0.9999994230151591,5.769848409054035e-07,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.32703337878967226,32.703337878967226,Low Trust
Paul Naley,/users/5f3d76b4df4cc6278ab25d45,US,5.0,2021-12-06 17:03:25+00:00,1.0,Placed an order on November 29,"Placed an order on November 29, 2021 for a GPS for our son. I was expecting the order to ship quickly since I am a Prime Member which is suppose to get free 2 day shipping on all items which are ""Sold / Shipped"" by Amazon. The GPS was displayed as being in stock and Sold / Shipped by Amazon. Shortly after placing our order I received an email which indicated that our order would be delivered on December 13th. This would be over a 2 week shipping instead of the 2 day shipping that my Prime Membership should have provided. I called Amazon Customer Service twice and each time spoke with a Agent outside of the USA. I asked to speak with a USA Corporate Customer Service Manager, but that was denied. I even submitted a BBB complaint, but Amazon just responded with their standard canned response. Amazon Customer Service is now extremely poor and is no better than Comcast. I highly recommend purchasing from another one other than Amazon.",2021-12-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,6.0,943,171,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order november gps son expecting order ship quickly since prime member suppose get free day shipping item sold shipped amazon gps displayed stock sold shipped amazon shortly placing order received email indicated order would delivered december th would week shipping instead day shipping prime membership provided called amazon customer service twice time spoke agent outside usa asked speak usa corporate customer service manager denied even submitted bbb complaint amazon responded standard canned response amazon customer service extremely poor better comcast highly recommend purchasing another one amazon,0.028501156406739666,0.9714988435932603,0.09590577678070668,0.2,0.8049305771527714,80.49305771527713,High Trust
CaptainNick,/users/5721c6c00000ff000a1b5a91,GB,16.0,2021-12-06 16:47:08+00:00,1.0,What's happened to Amazon ?,"What's happened to Amazon ?My daughter bought me a food mixer from Amazon, box arrived friday night, lid open and flapping in the wind and instructions blew out but I caught those, once inside I see the box has been bashed around and postage sticker slapped on side, on checking contents there is no guarantee, the plug has no protective cover over the 3 prongs and there is a lid missing off the mixer - since when did Amazon send items out without any packing be it a box or a plastic bag - this was a supposed to be a present but has arrived looking like something from a car boot and just like something from a car boot has bits missing !",2021-12-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,6.0,642,124,27,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,whats happened amazon daughter bought food mixer amazon box arrived friday night lid open flapping wind instruction blew caught inside see box bashed around postage sticker slapped side checking content guarantee plug protective cover prong lid missing mixer since amazon send item without packing box plastic bag supposed present arrived looking like something car boot like something car boot bit missing,0.1132271938930679,0.8867728061069321,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.7572955449491475,75.72955449491475,High Trust
