Elvet Evans,/users/61ace755480e540012a97cf6,GB,1.0,2021-12-05 16:22:58+00:00,1.0,"Unbelievable MORRISONS with Amazon food delivery,,,,","We are Prime members and have received good service from Amazon over many years,,,,,,Until we decided to use their Morrisons food delivery. We placed order with Amazon on sat 4th Dec 2021 and we were informed of the same day delivery which we did not need so said that Sunday the 5th would be acceptable.We were allocated 2.00pm to 4.00pm delivery slot.We were informed it was out for delivery at 2.10pm.We were then informed at 4.00pm that the order was cancelled.We would have accepted a late delivery as we had waited in already.I am suspicious that if someone had picked it in the store and loaded it on a vehicle, why not deliver it a bit late. Did they actually pick it !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!I am sorry to say that we will never shop in Morrisons again as we have sometimes in the past and it does put Amazon in a bad light.I think Amazon needs to move away from Morrisons....That food was for our evening meal which created a problem,,,,,",2021-12-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,5.0,940,169,52,6,0.0,0,17,2,1,Suspicious,prime member received good service amazon many yearsuntil decided use morrison food delivery placed order amazon sat th dec informed day delivery need said sunday th would acceptablewe allocated pm pm delivery slotwe informed delivery pmwe informed pm order cancelledwe would accepted late delivery waited alreadyi suspicious someone picked store loaded vehicle deliver bit late actually pick sorry say never shop morrison sometimes past put amazon bad lighti think amazon need move away morrisonsthat food evening meal created problem,0.9999999996031992,3.9680081442838855e-10,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.31895681455622427,31.895681455622427,Low Trust
