Kordon,/users/61ab7ceff91d720012693058,PT,23.0,2021-12-04 16:03:12+00:00,1.0,Fraudulent Shopping Designation Leaving Buyers to Fend for Themselves,"Sadly, Amazon has oligarchically monopolized the internet while promoting con artistry. Which leaves a working class buyer fending for themself if their product never gets shipped and delivered properly. Unfortunately, delivery drivers are treated like wage slaves without much restroom breaks because of how shipping companies are controlled by cut-throat business owners that won't improve working conditions for low-paid employees. Hence, you get these poorly treated delivery drivers who are barely getting by while dropping off deliveries to customers. It doesn't surprise me when some of them don't drop deliveries off to the right destinations sometimes when they don't have nurturing working conditions that keep them psychologically stable with healthy bodies. Also, Amazon has products sold by scammers who lie about their product descriptions. Buyers purchase these scammers' products and become frustrated when wasting money on lies. Amazon authorities do not ban these scammers' accounts whatsoever. So, these scams continue to happen on Amazon. The buyers who dealt with scams have dealt with food poisoning as a result. The customer ""support"" team on Amazon are condescending jerks or unhelpful bots that barely solve problems, too. I can tell this Amazon corporation is a joke.",2021-12-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,4.0,1293,194,69,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sadly amazon oligarchically monopolized internet promoting con artistry leaf working class buyer fending themself product never get shipped delivered properly unfortunately delivery driver treated like wage slave without much restroom break shipping company controlled cutthroat business owner wont improve working condition lowpaid employee hence get poorly treated delivery driver barely getting dropping delivery customer doesnt surprise dont drop delivery right destination s