CSchmidt,/users/5e0655c3361d610fc1088d66,US,18.0,2021-12-03 16:45:00+00:00,1.0,Buyer beware,"Buyer beware. False and deceptive advertising by these crooks has no bounds. Now when you pay for delivery, that DOES NOT mean delivery to your home. In collaboration with the crooks at the US Postal service, they now deliver to a holding station for the USPS and they tell you when to come and get your stuff. I refused both orders since I refuse to spend all day waiting for a government employee to tell me they cant help me. This is not what I paid for but they couldn't care less because they are the great and mighty Amazon. They censor any feedback or reviews that are not 100% positive so there is absolutely no way to work through any issues.",2021-12-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,3.0,651,122,12,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,buyer beware false deceptive advertising crook bound pay delivery mean delivery home collaboration crook u postal service deliver holding station usps tell come get stuff refused order since refuse spend day waiting government employee tell cant help paid couldnt care less great mighty amazon censor feedback review positive absolutely way work issue,0.05009911328768006,0.94990088671232,0.06842400448681997,0.2,0.788635244253524,78.86352442535241,High Trust
Awning Handyman,/users/50c0f2ae0000640001293c43,GB,32.0,2021-12-03 11:06:19+00:00,1.0,"Laptops, Electronics & More beware!","My daughter ordered me a laptop from LAPTOPS, ELECTRONICS & More on her Prime account thinking it was a UK company selling the Acer Aspire 5 A515-43-R19L. However, when my wife’s birthday present arrived, the keyboard was a USA model and not a UK model. If you select United Kingdom mode at set-up, the keys will not produce the letters, numbers or symbols you press.Why have Amazon or L. E. & M. who are actually EW ELECTRONICS, USA. informed potential customers about this in their ‘Specifications’ instead of customers having the disappointment and inconvenience of having to return the item, then wait for a full refund before having to purchase a U.K. model?",2021-12-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,3.0,663,113,35,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,daughter ordered laptop laptop electronics prime account thinking uk company selling acer aspire arl however wife’s birthday present arrived keyboard usa model uk model select united kingdom mode setup key produce letter number symbol presswhy amazon l e actually ew electronics usa informed potential customer ‘specifications’ instead customer disappointment inconvenience return item wait full refund purchase uk model,0.034517502463548726,0.9654824975364513,0.0633763320246775,0.2,0.7954165151731613,79.54165151731613,High Trust
