Wilson,/users/60a689c255c412001a194a81,US,2.0,2021-12-02 03:44:38+00:00,1.0,Their return experience is a rip-off,"So I have bought this item for a friend of mine as a birthday present for his dad. But coincidentally his dad bought the same thing as we did. So we returned this item to Amazon, but never got any response until we called them and they said the serial numbers were not a match so they could not issue any refund. For one there's no clear indication for the serial number that we bought from Amazon to compare with. Two they said they confirmed the wrong item is in their warehouse and refuse to return the wrong item back to us for us to compare and mail out so they called ""correct items"". They promised to send an email to me for a follow-up or report but all they did is just a plain email that says that we cannot do anything with it. Amir D. and Mae C. are simply impatient and hang up my call, you guys suck and I will definitely consider not renew of the Amazon Prime subscription in the future. PERIOD",2021-12-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,2.0,909,177,36,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought item friend mine birthday present dad coincidentally dad bought thing returned item amazon never got response called said serial number match could issue refund one there clear indication serial number bought amazon compare two said confirmed wrong item warehouse refuse return wrong item back u u compare mail called correct item promised send email followup report plain email say cannot anything amir mae c simply impatient hang call guy suck definitely consider renew amazon prime subscription future period,0.010830947896784042,0.9891690521032159,0.09927089175546831,0.2,0.8144387044027017,81.44387044027017,High Trust
