Vida Azteca,/users/60fab5c5602c5f0011a47369,GB,2.0,2021-12-01 17:44:07+00:00,1.0,AWFUL… AVOID LIKE THE PLAGUE!!,"If I could give no stars at all I would. For months now I have not received any parcels I have ordered. This is due to new houses being built in another part of town which have been given the same street name as my address. Now all my parcels get delivered to the new build that has the same number and street name as my address instead of coming to my house despite it being a different postcode! I have made several phone calls to complain and each time been told a note will be put on the file for the driver to read the full address instead of just the first line and STILL they keep sending my parcels to the wrong address!! Today another parcel bought from wowcher was delivered by Amazon and no surprise it went to the wrong address again. On calling Amazon they have basically said they can do nothing and one woman I spoke to was even rude enough to be having a conversation with her colleague as I was trying to explain the issue. I told her I would wait for her to finish having her chat, to which she tried to assure me she was listening. At this point I asked to speak to a manager and was told the manager had left, after I continued with my complaint they suddenly “found” a manager for me to speak to, although I suspect the person I spoke to wasn’t a manager at all. I was told there was nothing they could do and would put a note on the file. When I explained that I get told the same thing every time I phone yet the parcel still goes elsewhere I was simply told “sorry”. There must be a million and one notes on my account by now the amount of times I’ve had to complain about the same thing. They’ve probably worn through their keyboard with all the typing! Seems no one can read!!!I then called to ask for a subject access request to request a copy of all the notes on my account, to be told by the person I spoke to that they couldn’t do this. I assured them that under GDPR it is my right to see any data held about myself and therefore it was a LEGALITY for them to supply this. The guy basically didn’t know what the hell I was going on about and tried to put me through to a manager, this took forever so I asked if a manager could call me back and he took 4 attempts to get my email right and 3 attempts to get my phone number right. I really don’t see how hard it is for them to deliver to the right address given the postcodes are completely different! Complete incompetency!!! Yet in the meantime I’m losing money cause Amazon are refusing to refund me cause the product wasn’t bought from them only delivered by them! I normally get any Amazon parcels delivered to my work place instead so I know I will receive them, unfortunately I didn’t realise Wowcher used Amazon for delivery or else I would have picked an alternative delivery address. As for in future I won’t be bothering to order anything from them again and I’ll be steering clear of anyone who I know uses them as their delivery provider. Absolute bunch of cowboys that obviously haven’t even been trained on simple things such as GDPR!!!!!",2021-12-01 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,1.0,3034,582,30,5,0.0,0,17,2,1,Suspicious,could give star would month received parcel ordered due new house built another part town given street name address parcel get delivered new build number street name address instead coming house despite different postcode made several phone call complain time told note put file driver read full address instead first line still keep sending parcel wrong address today another parcel bought wowcher delivered amazon surprise went wrong address calling amazon basically said nothing one woman spoke even rude enough conversation colleague trying explain issue told would wait finish chat tried assure listening point asked speak manager told manager left continued complaint suddenly “found” manager speak although suspect person spoke wasn’t manager told nothing could wo