Lorraine Maiden,/users/525951fa0000640001501dc5,GB,15.0,2021-11-30 10:32:02+00:00,1.0,Appalling customer service,My son ordered a gaming monitor £169 and instead received a watch £30. He had signed for it because you need a code now for anything over £100. We returned the watch and have now had a gaming monitor delivered 5times! They won’t leave it because we have no code which was supposed to be sent but never received for the replacement. Customer service appalling! Now waiting for a refund 🤞🏻all because someone can’t be bothered to send a simple replacement code.,2021-11-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,30.0,459,82,26,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,son ordered gaming monitor £ instead received watch £ signed need code anything £ returned watch gaming monitor delivered time won’t leave code supposed sent never received replacement customer service appalling waiting refund 🤞🏻all someone can’t bothered send simple replacement code,0.5486375321361893,0.45136246786381073,0.045989904655075714,0.2,0.5348792148629204,53.487921486292045,Medium Trust
kathleen brien,/users/59fcb1360000ff000addb9cb,GB,9.0,2021-11-30 09:12:51+00:00,1.0,Item not arrived from Amazon …,"I've been ordering off Amazon for a few years now and never had a problem with delivery until Saturday 27th November 2021. One order arrived in the morning and I was told the 2nd item would also arrive later that day. At 9pm I checked my emails to see the item had been given to a member of my household 4-5 hours before. I was home all day and no second item arrived. I have contacted Amazon and not got a reply,only for me to give my view on this item. I would love to write a view of this item when it finally arrives. Can someone please get in touch to let me know when this will be. Thank you.",2021-11-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,30.0,598,121,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive ordering amazon year never problem delivery saturday th november one order arrived morning told nd item would also arrive later day pm checked email see item given member household hour home day second item arrived contacted amazon got replyonly give view item would love write view item finally arrives someone please get touch let know thank,0.007254338320752616,0.9927456616792474,0.06786315199102635,0.2,0.8099454612378288,80.99454612378288,High Trust
Cheryl  Lum,/users/5cc2fd85df389e200e221e61,GB,19.0,2021-11-30 01:35:04+00:00,2.0,The Amazon driver dropped off my…,"The Amazon driver dropped off my package at a neighbor's house instead of mine.  Yet the delivery information stated that the package was delivered!  Yes.  But at the wrong address.  There's no help from Amazon.com if one's package is missing although status claims it was delivered.  I had to do an online automated chat via Amazon.com to help resolve the issue.  However, all this chat does is give a few choices as to what one's issue is.  In my case, I chose 'missing package', the online chat said to wait as delivery status could be updated incorrectly and package may be delivered in 24 hours. Later on the same evening, I received an an auto email message from Amazon.com stating that the item would be delivered by 10pm that evening. Well, the package was delivered but at 6pm that night by my neighbor.  Our security camera confirmed that fact.  Thankfully our neighbor was kind enough to walk the package to our house.  If they were not honest and decided to either keep or dump my package I'd be the loser.  No more Amazon email updates or anything else to resolve the issue either so what they claimed (i.e. that the delivery might happen in 24 hours time) was all a lie.Therefore, one is out of luck if the driver carelessly delivers one's package to a different address!  Drivers need to be very careful, but apparently could care less where they drop customers' packages.  I will be very wary of ordering from Amazon.com in future.",2021-11-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,30.0,1447,254,33,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon driver dropped package neighbor house instead mine yet delivery information stated package delivered yes wrong address there help amazoncom one package missing although status claim delivered online automated chat via amazoncom help resolve issue however chat give choice one issue case chose missing package online chat said wait delivery status could updated incorrectly package may delivered hour later evening received auto email message amazoncom stating item would delivered pm evening well package delivered pm night neighbor security camera confirmed fact thankfully neighbor kind enough walk package house honest decided either keep dump package id loser amazon email update anything else resolve issue either claimed ie delivery might happen hour time lietherefore one luck driver carelessly delivers one package different address driver need careful apparently could care less drop customer package wary ordering amazoncom future,0.25552748344182263,0.7444725165581774,0.142456533931576,0.4,1.000727565065404,100.0727565065404,High Trust
