Natalya Ya,/users/61a4a3e8cd3a6200132ece4a,KZ,1.0,2021-11-29 09:57:32+00:00,1.0,"No money, no graphics card","I have ordered new graphics card on Amazon. The package I received contained a completely different graphics card, on top of that it had signs of usage with dust on the fans and scratches on the frame. The mailing box was sealed without any signs of being opened, however the box of the graphics card itself came without any safety wrap or seals. After that I have left a review of the product on Amazon and attached photos of the used graphics card. Then I contacted customer service and followed their instructions. They told me to send the graphics card back to Amazon. Upon receiving the graphics card I was told that I won’t get the money back because it was a different card. However, I don’t have another card, I returned the only card sent to me by Amazon. I was refused a refund and the card I’ve returned was disposed.Our family are regular customers at Amazon. Out of all the purchases we haven’t returned anything except this graphics card.",2021-11-29 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,29.0,952,171,26,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered new graphic card amazon package received contained completely different graphic card top sign usage dust fan scratch frame mailing box sealed without sign opened however box graphic card came without safety wrap seal left review product amazon attached photo used graphic card contacted customer service followed instruction told send graphic card back amazon upon receiving graphic card told won’t get money back different card however don’t another card returned card sent amazon refused refund card i’ve returned disposedour family regular customer amazon purchase haven’t returned anything except graphic card,0.012946471317499576,0.9870535286825004,0.09590577678070668,0.2,0.8127079196973915,81.27079196973915,High Trust
