Stephen,/users/5b367a424de5666d345187c4,GB,9.0,2021-11-28 19:51:51+00:00,1.0,Loved Amazon and always shopped there…,"Loved Amazon and always shopped there until my last order. No facility to complain. Woeful customer service , poor delivery setup for high value items. Code dosnt arrive until after the driver has left. New code wont work and customer service will not register a complaint. Canceled order which i have to send back but i havnt recieved it yet !!! Status says its delivered but it isnt. Had the delivery guy at my door 4 times now and after 4 calls i have given up. I will not contact them again and will put a claim through my credit card company for not recieving items ! Shambles",2021-11-28 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,28.0,581,108,38,6,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,loved amazon always shopped last order facility complain woeful customer service poor delivery setup high value item code dosnt arrive driver left new code wont work customer service register complaint canceled order send back havnt recieved yet status say delivered isnt delivery guy door time call given contact put claim credit card company recieving item shamble,0.8988886500544646,0.10111134994553539,0.06057206954570948,0.2,0.3626700888819096,36.26700888819096,Low Trust
