Andy Lambert,/users/5f6d24a94b28adf1daa9194d,US,8.0,2021-12-25 11:04:05+00:00,1.0,I ordered a bottle of dandruff shampoo,"I ordered a bottle of dandruff shampoo. Around $8.00. and paid with my Mastercard. It came in on time. However, 2 weeks later I received an email from Amazon saying ""your package is on its way"" huh? Could return it but it was made too complicated the way they wanted me to return it. A square postage paid label was issued and the instructions said to return it by putting the square label on a round bottle.They had sent me a second bottle. I put it away to keep and they just had to bill my card on file.They didn't do that. Instead I got an email from Amazon saying "" if you don't pay for the second bottle by (such a date) they would charge me a late fee of $94.00!!!!I didn't want that hanging over my head so I paid for the bottle I never ordered. Around $8.00. No big deal. I received an email from the bank they use to charge credit cards and they confirmed they received my check. I wrote them a check instead of them taking the funds from my credit card.I decided to cancel my credit card but Amazon wouldn't let me. A pop-up came up and said that Amazon requires a credit card so to cancel the card I had to cancel my account.I let it sit as I figured I might buy something later.A couple of weeks after that I received an Amazon credit store card. Only good with Amazon purchases. It was for $600.00! I never asked for this card and if and when I decide to buy something. I didn't know wich card they would bill.When you buy something on credit. You are asked at checkout which card you want them to use.I picked my Mastercard on file. At the same time I deleted the $600.00 card. I did this because Amazon has a reputation of double billing. (Read the reviews). So I immediately locked my Mastercard and had my bank issue a new card with a different number.This at least invalidated my Mastercard and would be denied if someone tried to use it for nefarious reasons.After a few months went by I decided to cancel Amazon completely. Wouldn't you know it had been so long that I had forgotten my password.So I used my email address and pushed the ""forgot my password"" button. That resulted in my receiving an OTP number.I typed in the OTP number and it took me to a site that had further requirements to make sure it was me. ""Okay"" I said and I've used 3 different phones over the years.I had to check off my current phone number and nothing happened.My second option was to click on myLG G6 phone. Click? Nothing. I hadn't had the LG 6 for years so that did nothing.My next thing they wanted me to click on my Samsung SE. I haven't had that phone in a long time. I had sold it.That didn't work.The only phone I have now is an iPhone.Wich wasn't listed. So I'm stuck. There's no number to call Amazon to talk to. Even if there was they would not give me my password back. If they even knew what it was.It was a vicious cycle I couldn't break.I tried all the passwords I could think of.Nothing.I was determined and finally I got a page that had the option to ""cancel your Amazon account"". I had found my old password.I scrolled down to ""cancel your account"" I clicked on the bar and it asked me why was I canceling my account. I just typed into the ""I no longer want an Amazon account""Another page popped up with the option to change my mind or ""confirm cancellation""I hit ""confirm cancellation"". Done!Another page pops up and asked for my username and password. I just closed out of the page.This morning, while checking my email I seen a ""you haven't finished closing your account"" message from Amazon.I clicked on it and it started the whole process again. I just deleted the email. It didn't really matter because I had changed the card anyway rendering the Mastercard invalid. I counted six Amazon emails. I blocked them out. So for those who are crying that Amazon closed your account. Count your blessings. They did you a favor. But they still keep your credit card. Don't forget to delete it in the app website if you want nothing more to do with Amazon. Too bad, I had a good relationship with them innitialy. Just wanted to say that you can't ask Amazon to close your account in anger because you feel stiffed by them as they will not close it. Some people here are saying ""close my account"". That means nothing to them. They've been known to charge over and over and renewal accounts will still be charged even know you tell them to stop. You have to do it on your Amazon website. Just follow the complex account closure instructions.I eventually locked my credit card immediately and ask for a new card with a different number. That will render your card invalid and any charges will be denied. Good Luck as they make you jump through hoops to cancel.UPDATE: 12/25/2021 have not been contacted by Amazon for over a year now.",2021-11-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,12.0,25.0,4746,882,38,7,28.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,ordered bottle dandruff shampoo around paid mastercard came time however week later received email amazon saying package way huh could return made complicated way wanted return square postage paid label issued instruction said return putting square label round bottlethey sent second bottle put away keep bill card filethey didnt instead got email amazon saying dont pay second bottle date would charge late fee didnt want hanging head paid bottle never ordered around big deal received email bank use charge credit card confirmed received check wrote check instead taking fund credit cardi decided cancel credit card amazon wouldnt let popup came said amazon requires credit card cancel card cancel accounti let sit figured might buy something latera couple week received amazon credit store card good amazon purchase never asked card decide buy something didnt know wich card would billwhen buy something credit asked checkout card want usei picked mastercard file time deleted card amazon reputation double billing read review immediately locked mastercard bank issue new card different numberthis least invalidated mastercard would denied someone tried use nefarious reasonsafter month went decided cancel amazon completely wouldnt know long forgotten passwordso used email address pushed forgot password button resulted receiving otp numberi typed otp number took site requirement make sure okay said ive used different phone yearsi check current phone number nothing happenedmy second option click mylg g phone click nothing hadnt lg year nothingmy next thing wanted click samsung se havent phone long time sold itthat didnt workthe phone iphonewich wasnt listed im stuck there number call amazon talk even would give password back even knew wasit vicious cycle couldnt breaki tried password could think ofnothingi determined finally got page option cancel amazon account found old passwordi scrolled cancel account clicked bar asked canceling account typed longer want amazon accountanother page popped option change mind confirm cancellationi hit confirm cancellation doneanother page pop asked username password closed pagethis morning checking email seen havent finished closing account message amazoni clicked started whole process deleted email didnt really matter changed card anyway rendering mastercard invalid counted six amazon email blocked cry amazon closed account count blessing favor still keep credit card dont forget delete app website want nothing amazon bad good relationship innitialy wanted say cant ask amazon close account anger feel stiffed close people saying close account mean nothing theyve known charge renewal account still charged even know tell stop amazon website follow complex account closure instructionsi eventually locked credit card immediately ask new card different number render card invalid charge denied good luck make jump hoop cancelupdate contacted amazon year,0.9781636033719766,0.02183639662802339,0.49467190128996075,0.2,0.40985257857200386,40.98525785720039,Low Trust
Macca Ronney,/users/60778ffe4cc0da001a4d9003,GB,4.0,2021-11-27 18:29:04+00:00,1.0,I have had my prime acc and buying acc…,I have had my prime acc and buying acc closed after having 2 deliveries stolen from my doorstep. Driver didn't follow my safe place instructions so nothing I could have done and totally not my fault. Got a police report as requested but made no difference. Had no refund for stolen items. Total of nearly £200 lost and treated like a criminal. Amazon even deleted an email telling me I'd be notified when the refund has been prossesed. Can't believe a company their size is treating honest and loyal customers like this. I've had no notification email or explanation at all. Just told I've misused the service when I try to log in. I am disgusted and left with no way of getting my money back or even get an reason for all this. I have never even returned a single item after years of buying. Someone stole my deliveries because they were not delivered correctly and that's enough to be blacklisted. Really Amazon. Totally ridiculous. Shame on you.,2021-11-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,27.0,948,169,39,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime acc buying acc closed delivery stolen doorstep driver didnt follow safe place instruction nothing could done totally fault got police report requested made difference refund stolen item total nearly £ lost treated like criminal amazon even deleted email telling id notified refund prossesed cant believe company size treating honest loyal customer like ive notification email explanation told ive misused service try log disgusted left way getting money back even get reason never even returned single item year buying someone stole delivery delivered correctly thats enough blacklisted really amazon totally ridiculous shame,0.014127042910896637,0.9858729570891034,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.8118932929023756,81.18932929023755,High Trust
Steven,/users/515ab87500006400013657ca,GB,7.0,2021-11-27 18:01:57+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service ever !!!,"Worst customer service ever !!!! I order some protein and when it arrived, it was not the one I ordered. I contacted Amazon who told me to send it back and they will send out a replacement and refund. Was told it would be delivered on Sat 27 Nov, said online I had been dispatched. So then got a email saying delivery delayed and will be delivered as soon a possible ?? Contacted customer service and they just fobbed me off with excuses and told me I just have to wait !  They couldn’t close down the chat quick enough. Absolute disgusting customer service.  Not the first time this has happened to me.",2021-11-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,27.0,603,113,31,5,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,worst customer service ever order protein arrived one ordered contacted amazon told send back send replacement refund told would delivered sat nov said online dispatched got email saying delivery delayed delivered soon possible contacted customer service fobbed excuse told wait couldn’t close chat quick enough absolute disgusting customer service first time happened,0.964939832049249,0.03506016795075095,0.0633763320246775,0.2,0.33020535038031096,33.0205350380311,Low Trust
