OnLineBuyer,/users/59e00e500000ff000ad468c7,GB,64.0,2021-11-27 08:19:21+00:00,1.0,BOYCOTT AMAZON,"BOYCOTT AMAZONI have used Amazon for twenty years or more, and buy hundreds of items from them every year. Last week I had an insolent message from a so-called Account Specialist who claimed: ""We noticed that you have requested multiple returns in the last few months, and some of the items that you have returned were damaged, used, or not in their original condition."" That was a pack of lies. I wrote back, pointing out that I have never returned anything unless there was something wrong with it, and that nothing had ever been damaged or been used. This waste-of-space (who has never signed his name) then copied his first message without answering my email. I then complained first to the Manager, then to HIS boss, and I sent copies to Jeff Bezos which always did the trick. The waste-of-space pulled the same stunt four times - never replied, and simply copied his first message again and again. I have now demanded that my complaint be escalated and until it is resolved, I will not buy anything through these misfits.",2021-11-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,27.0,1027,180,14,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,boycott amazoni used amazon twenty year buy hundred item every year last week insolent message socalled account specialist claimed noticed requested multiple return last month item returned damaged used original condition pack lie wrote back pointing never returned anything unless something wrong nothing ever damaged used wasteofspace never signed name copied first message without answering email complained first manager bos sent copy jeff bezos always trick wasteofspace pulled stunt four time never replied simply copied first message demanded complaint escalated resolved buy anything misfit,0.0941235206562917,0.9058764793437083,0.10095344924284913,0.2,0.773128929520424,77.3128929520424,High Trust
