Jessica,/users/5f464091bc400d687e242722,GB,30.0,2021-11-24 23:17:21+00:00,1.0,Do not use! Avoid at all costs!!,"I have bought quite a few things off amazon and they are very hit and miss. Both with quality, Customer service and not to mention their couriers. I have either had my items delivered and them not turn up, turn up damaged or thrown over my hack gate or left outside for people to steal and when this has happened I have been in, I am in majority of the time since I work from home but yet nobody has knocked! Then I get an email saying its been delivered! Half the time it hasn't or for all I know its been robbed. I am dealing with a situation atm where I bought a motherboard and kitten biscuits, They didnt turn up but again saying they have but the woman cant find anything saying that its been delivered even though it says it has. Again not got the product. No refund or replacement given or help even! I was just told to wait 24 hours which I did and now they are saying wait 3 days to investigate. Ive paid for these with my laybuy account and this is going to put my account in default and add a late charge! So not only are they messing me about but they are causing me unnecessary trouble!! Im also still waiting for my £120 refund for my pure white large rug that turned up open, ripped and beyond usable. It was rotten! Again no refund given and its been over a year for this one!! Company was contacted, no resolve, Promised by amazon if I don't get a refund from the company they will issue it automatically and take it off the company themselves, This was not done! Going to take this and my current case to ombudsman. amazon a billion dollar company are stingy b*stards and wont give you your money back!!",2021-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,24.0,1622,312,32,7,0.0,0,12,2,1,Suspicious,bought quite thing amazon hit miss quality customer service mention courier either item delivered turn turn damaged thrown hack gate left outside people steal happened majority time since work home yet nobody knocked get email saying delivered half time hasnt know robbed dealing situation atm bought motherboard kitten biscuit didnt turn saying woman cant find anything saying delivered even though say got product refund replacement given help even told wait hour saying wait day investigate ive paid laybuy account going put account default add late charge messing causing unnecessary trouble im also still waiting £ refund pure white large rug turned open ripped beyond usable rotten refund given year one company contacted resolve promised amazon dont get refund company issue automatically take company done going take current case ombudsman amazon billion dollar company stingy bstards wont give money back,0.9999990063579912,9.936420087841569e-07,0.17498597868760515,0.2,0.3349976925585254,33.49976925585254,Low Trust
Nina,/users/619ebd80516fc90012484a7b,DK,1.0,2021-11-24 22:32:48+00:00,1.0,This website is a scam!!!,"This website is a scam!!!After placing the order, they have put my Amazon account and order on a hold, because they want to verify that it was my cresit card, but they took my money! After providing all requested information, they did not unfreeze my account. They say i need to provide additional documents without saying which documents.Customer service is useful.They cant provide me a refund until my account is on a hold. So, after 25 days, 5 calls and 3 emails, my account is on a hold, order is on a hold and money is out of my account!",2021-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,24.0,543,100,25,5,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,website scamafter placing order put amazon account order hold want verify cresit card took money providing requested information unfreeze account say need provide additional document without saying documentscustomer service usefulthey cant provide refund account hold day call email account hold order hold money account,0.9832505730273117,0.01674942697268833,0.056085249579360626,0.2,0.3195917634022163,31.959176340221628,Low Trust
Lisa darlington,/users/570162ef0000ff000a14119a,GB,8.0,2021-11-24 20:42:38+00:00,1.0,Would leave zero stars if I could,"Would leave zero stars if I could. Can't check out... Been trying for 2 days now...why let you put items in your cart if it doesn't actually let you buy them? Why?? Just keeps looping back to the beginning, not letting me continue to the payment page. Customer service less than useless...no help at all, I'd go so far as to say they're Dangerous to your mental health.Have given up now, and gone with a more deserving company to send my gifts through. I'd encourage anyone else to do the same!!",2021-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,24.0,495,91,33,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,would leave zero star could cant check trying day nowwhy let put item cart doesnt actually let buy keep looping back beginning letting continue payment page customer service less uselessno help id go far say theyre dangerous mental healthhave given gone deserving company send gift id encourage anyone else,0.33110583926530746,0.6688941607346925,0.05103757711721817,0.2,0.64465459579079,64.465459579079,Medium Trust
Kilroy,/users/57df1afb0000ff000a458f7c,US,40.0,2021-11-24 20:31:35+00:00,4.0,You want honesty and REAL facts? Read this. This is almost a decade of facts.,"Anyone who says, ""Amazon just screwed me and that's it"" is just, in fact, a LIAR. Things you do NOT need to approach Amazon with to get good results: Laziness, Attitude, Ignorance and a LOT of people do just that. All this name-calling and venom is just written in ignorance.If you have had a horrible experience, with Amazon, 95% of the time YOU are to blame for most of the problem. It comes down to a few factors on how you rate Amazon and a lot of people will rank Amazon in the heat of anger or without all the facts. I don't do that because i've used Amazon long enough to know they are a ""middle"" man and they are far better than most about ""trying"" to make things right. Amazon is dependant (often) on 3rd party sellers and at the mercy of USPS, UPS, and FedEx and SO many people do not take this into account when ranking them.Now, this is not to say that Amazon hasn't ""slowed"" on how they do things. Yes, ""some"" of their Amazon bases don't know what ""efficient"" means when it comes to processing and shipping because they don't have the staff to support the demand (read that again because that fact is KEY) and their 3-5 day guarantee goes out the door REALLY quick. In point of fact, that little idealism just needs to be removed because it makes them look worse than bad.Has Amazon ever ""screwed"" me on and order. NO and they never will. Why? A lot of people don't handle their situation with research and evidence, I make it a point to do that. I check tracking, i talk to my UPS and USPS mail people, i contact possibly 3rd party sellers to find out what's going on before i even ""think"" of contacting Amazon.Once you have all the possible facts and (again this is KEY so re-read it) you have a ""solid"" history with them, they will ALWAYS go out of their way to take care of you IF you get a good associate to talk to.Lately, i've been ""flushed"" by some online chat associates so CALL rather than chat because it's harder for them to make up some excuse about ""disconnections"" when SOME of these associates (3rd party and out-sourced, you KNOW when you get a good associate vs a out-sourced one) just don't want to handle you.If you come to Amazon ""calm"" and in possession with as many facts (out of your own investigation) as possible they will work with you and, often, they will drop you some credit to your account for your inconvenience.Now this is not saying that there are no bad associates. Yes, there are so i could do without myself by they are FEW and far between unless you get some of these outside of your own country trying to work situations inside your own country.IF YOU GET A BAD ASSOCIATE then TRY AGAIN and call or chat to get a better one. Don't be LAZY about it, try harder. Take a breath and get your anger out of your system.If you try you WILL get satisfaction with Amazon if you have a ""solid"" history with them. However, if you are known to have called in several issues without the facts, they won't try so hard because they just know you're a pain and don't want to deal with you.Now, let me clarify this: I have returned hundreds of items but i've been with them since the beginning and they know me and there are ""notes"" on me that says, ""He investigates, don't try and BS him"" because i've talked voice with a few and they've told me there are notes on me. They know i go the distance when it comes to facts so they know THEY have to go the distance as well.If you are expecting to call in and get butt kissers then you are the problem. They are not there to apologize and beg for forgiveness. They are there to follow facts/data and try to fix the issue to the best of their somewhat limited power (it goes in levels and the end-level phone associate might not have the ability to get what you need) so DONT GET HOSTILE for no reason.",2021-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,24.0,3784,714,77,15,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,anyone say amazon screwed thats fact liar thing need approach amazon get good result laziness attitude ignorance lot people namecalling venom written ignoranceif horrible experience amazon time blame problem come factor rate amazon lot people rank amazon heat anger without fact dont ive used amazon long enough know middle man far better trying make thing right amazon dependant often rd party seller mercy usps ups fedex many people take account ranking themnow say amazon hasnt slowed thing yes amazon base dont know efficient mean come processing shipping dont staff support demand read fact key day guarantee go door really quick point fact little idealism need removed make look worse badhas amazon ever screwed order never lot people dont handle situation research evidence make point check tracking talk ups usps mail people contact possibly rd party seller find whats going even think contacting amazononce possible fact key reread solid history always go way take care get good associate talk tolately ive flushed online chat associate call rather chat harder make excuse disconnection associate rd party outsourced know get good associate v outsourced one dont want handle youif come amazon calm possession many fact investigation possible work often drop credit account inconveniencenow saying bad associate yes could without far unless get outside country trying work situation inside countryif get bad associate try call chat get better one dont lazy try harder take breath get anger systemif try get satisfaction amazon solid history however known called several issue without fact wont try hard know youre pain dont want deal younow let clarify returned hundred item ive since beginning know note say investigates dont try b ive talked voice theyve told note know go distance come fact know go distance wellif expecting call get butt kisser problem apologize beg forgiveness follow factsdata try fix issue best somewhat limited power go level endlevel phone associate might ability get need dont get hostile reason,0.020627651801624784,0.9793723481983753,0.40044868199663486,0.8,1.7697759104985145,176.97759104985144,High Trust
Donna,/users/56253b0e0000ff0001e42c8c,GB,26.0,2021-11-24 09:47:30+00:00,1.0,Avoid Amazon credit card,"Avoid Amazon credit card, I paid over £1300 and received an email stating the payment was unsuccessful and no money was taken however it was taken and received by New Day.  I raised the issue with them on 19th Nov and 5 days later I'm still waiting.  I phoned and asked to speak to a manager on 22nd and I was told no manager was available, I asked could a manager phone me back, I was told they would, two days later I've still not received a call back.  This morning, 24th November I phoned again and asked to speak to a manager.  I was told they would get one however I am still on hold 30 minutes later.  Customer service is appalling, they don't care that they have lost £1300 of my money.",2021-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,24.0,694,134,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,avoid amazon credit card paid £ received email stating payment unsuccessful money taken however taken received new day raised issue th nov day later im still waiting phoned asked speak manager nd told manager available asked could manager phone back told would two day later ive still received call back morning th november phoned asked speak manager told would get one however still hold minute later customer service appalling dont care lost £ money,0.05443682984974253,0.9455631701502575,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.7878124319623974,78.78124319623974,High Trust
