Dan,/users/5a2a1c930000ff000aee06d8,US,2.0,2021-11-20 07:19:19+00:00,1.0,Watch out for the scammer bc Amazon…,"Watch out for the scammer bc Amazon website security is pretty much non existent. I will never have another Amazon account again and anyone reading this...run far away from Amazon. Ever since Jeff bezos left the company it has gone downhill. Look out for the prime video scam with registering your account. If an email or tv code tells you to call a number, don't, it's a scam to get access to your account and to make you pay extra to register more than one device in your home. Once they access your account to steal your identity Amazon dies little to protect you and tells you their security department will look over it in 24hrs. That's great so the hacker has 24hrs to go through my account and get as much info about me as possible. Great security Amazon. You just lost a customer and possibly gained a lawsuit. You would think a multi-billion dollar company could afford amazing internet security to protect their customers, but don't. See how important you are to them? Fuk Amazon. Fuk them up their stupid A$$e$.",2021-11-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,20.0,1022,183,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,watch scammer bc amazon website security pretty much non existent never another amazon account anyone reading thisrun far away amazon ever since jeff bezos left company gone downhill look prime video scam registering account email tv code tell call number dont scam get access account make pay extra register one device home access account steal identity amazon dy little protect tell security department look hr thats great hacker hr go account get much info possible great security amazon lost customer possibly gained lawsuit would think multibillion dollar company could afford amazing internet security protect customer dont see important fuk amazon fuk stupid ae,0.015673167395634124,0.9843268326043659,0.10263600673022995,0.2,0.8126906176482289,81.2690617648229,High Trust
