Tina,/users/5e8a4361ebf8a9eb621dbd86,GB,13.0,2021-11-20 03:44:48+00:00,1.0,Terrible customer service,This has been a very stressful experience for my wife and her father.We ordered an adjustable bed for my father in law who was being discharged from hospital he is 73 and in ill health so he has come to live with us he can’t get in and out of a normal bed so we ordered this one from Amazon as it would be delivered earlier than others we looked at with other companies as until than his sleeping on a sofa so we really need one asap.First the bed was to be delivered between the 18th-19th Nov than it was confirmed it would be delivered on 19th that was fine I took a day off work and lost a days pay but it had to be done the bed never arrived and no word to say what was happening than that night it was updated to say it’l now be delivered between 20th-25th so I messaged customer service who apologised and said they would refund me £7.99! Personally I find that an insult after waiting in all day and as I say losing a days pay.I was very surprised by Amazon as I’ve usually found the customer service is very helpful and knowledgeable.I asked to cancel the order but apparently that’s not possible and informed I would now have to refuse delivery at the door.I couldn’t get anywhere with customer service at all so I’m now closing my Amazon account and all connected accounts and will never use them again I just feel like they couldn’t be bothered to find a solution so I will never spend my money with them again.I now need to start looking elsewhere for a bed.My father in laws physio only agreed to discharging him when she knew the adjustable bed would be here asap if she had known it wasn’t being delivered his discharge from hospital would of been delayed until it did arrive.,2021-11-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,20.0,1691,321,25,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,stressful experience wife fatherwe ordered adjustable bed father law discharged hospital ill health come live u can’t get normal bed ordered one amazon would delivered earlier others looked company sleeping sofa really need one asapfirst bed delivered thth nov confirmed would delivered th fine took day work lost day pay done bed never arrived word say happening night updated say it’l delivered thth messaged customer service apologised said would refund £ personally find insult waiting day say losing day payi surprised amazon i’ve usually found customer service helpful knowledgeablei asked cancel order apparently that’s possible informed would refuse delivery doori couldn’t get anywhere customer service i’m closing amazon account connected account never use feel like couldn’t bothered find solution never spend money againi need start looking elsewhere bedmy father law physio agreed discharging knew adjustable bed would asap known wasn’t delivered discharge hospital would delayed arrive,0.049101073360073993,0.950898926639926,0.18003365114974762,0.2,0.8114561935499125,81.14561935499125,High Trust
