Amanda Kelly,/users/5f6011684c38613f30af122f,US,3.0,2021-11-19 17:58:55+00:00,1.0,HORRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE,"I have had an account with Amazon for 5 years now. I updated the payment information for Prime and changed the password on the account.  Now it says ""We have detected unusual activity on your account. Please contact customer service.""  I called customer service on Friday, November 12, and was told that the Account Specialist department would contact me in 24 hours about my account.  No one ever contacted me by phone or email.  I called customer service again on Monday, November 15, again I was told that the Account Specialist department would contact me in 24 hours about my account.  Crickets.  Nothing. No one contacted me by phone or email.  I contacted customer service again on Friday, November 19, and they tried to start with the Account Specialist routine again.  I said no do not even start with that.  I asked the representative to contact Account Specialist department, if they exist, and get immediate assistant.  The representative refused.  I asked to speak with a supervisor.  She said she was the supervisor.  Oh so when did the CEO of Amazon become an Indian woman in a call center?  I guess Jeff Bezos has a new trick up his sleeve!!!  She said she could not help me and hung up the phone.  THE WORST CUSTOMER SERVICE EVER!!!  I filed a complaint with the Better Business Bureau.  Someone out there has to be able to help me with my account.  The moral of this story is:  1) Do not change your payment method for Prime 2) Do not change your password.",2021-11-19 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,19.0,1474,259,25,3,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,account amazon year updated payment information prime changed password account say detected unusual activity account please contact customer service called customer service friday november told account specialist department would contact hour account one ever contacted phone email called customer service monday november told account specialist department would contact hour account cricket nothing one contacted phone email contacted customer service friday november tried start account specialist routine said even start asked representative contact account specialist department exist get immediate assistant representative refused asked speak supervisor said supervisor oh ceo amazon become indian woman call center guess jeff bezos new trick sleeve said could help hung phone worst customer service ever filed complaint better business bureau someone able help account moral story change payment method prime change password,0.9952067380406115,0.004793261959388451,0.14526079641054404,0.2,0.331448790261803,33.1448790261803,Low Trust
Tonya Bishop,/users/6197d6d7f98a9600139a5cff,CA,1.0,2021-11-19 17:01:11+00:00,1.0,Agents who argue with the costumer and who are lazy at their jobs,"I have been a customer for three years now, I purchase everything through amazon from groceries to school supplies, clothing, furniture....in fact i spend my monthly finances using only this site. I drop alot of money each month...but due to recent experiences with costumer service agents and how unprofessional they are i will from now on spend all my money with the competitors. Such as wal mart ebay home depot , where ever isnt amazon. I have several times now agents who transfer chat calls just because they dont want to deal with it, ive had them transfer me over and over and over, when all i was trying to do was receive instructions on how to purchase a couch with the discount that was been offered, i told them it was time sensitive, and they assured me that the time would have no effect when it comes to me making my purchase, and i would be co9ntacted with in 48 hrs. when the time passed, i recieved no email , and then was told that the issue was not handled and taht it was to late for me to recieve the discount becuiae it was past the time. so basically they played me, becuase they were unable to do the job they were hired for. another account happened the other day. i asked to be refunded on an item that failed to be delivered,and the agent named Ravi told me that i would have to contact the third part myself ( even tho i had specifically told him i was with out a phone as it was stolen, and was waiting for it to arrive in the mail that i ordered through amazon. ) the agent began to argue with me, and then gaslighted the conversation stating if thats how you feel .... i have had many items refunded i know how it works, i know there is a 3 day time period, i was asking the agent to do there job the same as the many other agents that were able to do the same thing through out the years of me ordering items...non the less...i have worked customer service for decades....and to argue with a customer is a sure sign this company no longer hires trained professionals . or have failed to remind them that the customer is always right. And your trained to help them not tell them to do the job you were hired to do.",2021-11-19 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,19.0,2146,411,65,13,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer three year purchase everything amazon grocery school supply clothing furniturein fact spend monthly finance using site drop alot money monthbut due recent experience costumer service agent unprofessional spend money competitor wal mart ebay home depot ever isnt amazon several time agent transfer chat call dont want deal ive transfer trying receive instruction purchase couch discount offered told time sensitive assured time would effect come making purchase would contacted hr time passed recieved email told issue handled taht late recieve discount becuiae past time basically played becuase unable job hired another account happened day asked refunded item failed deliveredand agent named ravi told would contact third part even tho specifically told phone stolen waiting arrive mail ordered amazon agent began argue gaslighted conversation stating thats feel many item refunded know work know day time period asking agent job many agent able thing year ordering itemsnon lessi worked customer service decadesand argue customer sure sign company longer hire trained professional failed remind customer always right trained help tell job hired,0.003510403314700955,0.996489596685299,0.23051037577117217,0.2,0.844346873496884,84.4346873496884,High Trust
Ciomara Campos,/users/61972e39f73c86001264cea5,US,3.0,2021-11-19 04:55:36+00:00,1.0,Amazon ... giving me alibabab wish vibes.,"I have been over amazon since 2018. When they started allowing Chinese whole sellers to sell on the platform. At first... they promised prime shipping.  They provide products and make shipments to consumer deliveries within 3 days. Since at the time , the sellers from China hadn't shipped the items to the US yet to be fulfilled by Amazon. The prime deliveries really suffered. Many times I had to wait weeks. Finally the factories in China sent over the items to Amazon's warehouse. Now Amazon is filled with cheap products over priced. Basically I feel like I am shopping at alibaba these days. Last 2 orders I have yet to recieve from usps.  The ones I did get they were hideously cheap and the quality was garbage. Will be returning asap.",2021-11-19 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,19.0,743,131,41,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon since started allowing chinese whole seller sell platform first promised prime shipping provide product make shipment consumer delivery within day since time seller china hadnt shipped item u yet fulfilled amazon prime delivery really suffered many time wait week finally factory china sent item amazon warehouse amazon filled cheap product priced basically feel like shopping alibaba day last order yet recieve usps one get hideously cheap quality garbage returning asap,0.005137113973281701,0.9948628860267184,0.07347167694896242,0.2,0.8121257784031516,81.21257784031516,High Trust
