Larry Brown,/users/6193583c2030d30012062300,US,1.0,2021-11-16 07:17:15+00:00,1.0,Lately I've been pretty consistently…,"Lately I've been pretty consistently getting bad product if I get anything at all. They are running at about 50%. They took away my ability to rate because I complained about someone who didn't offer a password to their video editor and then never followed up on customer service and the next day I was banned from rating. If you take the ability of free speech away from a veteran, then you should realize their message boards where else veterans can talk, along with those people and their families, we should be able to take this garbage company down. With a seriously deficient success rate in quality product and In a timely manner, you might want to look at how Montgomery Ward failed. It was customer service and a company that was around for over a century to go down the toilet was strange. However, somebody that likes to fly around in space while they don't vet their Sellers and don't do follow-ups, or have some sort of quality control, that says a lot. I don't like taking time out of my life to earn cash, spend it somewhere because of how many hours I work and have that time out of my life flushed down the toilet is in no way justifiable. You have lost me as a customer and I was there since the beginning. I have no use for people who no longer about the people that are paying their bills.  You should think about that Jeff, instead of suing other people that are trying to make the world a better place.",2021-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,16.0,1424,265,37,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,lately ive pretty consistently getting bad product get anything running took away ability rate complained someone didnt offer password video editor never followed customer service next day banned rating take ability free speech away veteran realize message board else veteran talk along people family able take garbage company seriously deficient success rate quality product t