Damon Peterson,/users/61932d69d2f5a70012deedc1,US,1.0,2021-11-16 04:02:56+00:00,1.0,During an item return,"During an item return, we sent back the item as per the directions given to us by Amazon.  Upon arrival at the return facility, the item was erroneously deemed the wrong item.  They told us they would not refund the item.  In addition, they said they ""destroyed the item"".  After hours with customer service they refused to honor their obligation and we wound up out $120.  Obviously we have canceled our membership and will never use these people again. Beware of returns with Amazon.  These folk just might steal from you too!",2021-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,16.0,528,92,21,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,item return sent back item per direction given u amazon upon arrival return facility item erroneously deemed wrong item told u would refund item addition said destroyed item hour customer service refused honor obligation wound obviously canceled membership never use people beware return amazon folk might steal,0.11569516087637227,0.8843048391236277,0.051598429613011774,0.2,0.7524721054844162,75.24721054844163,High Trust
