Catalin,/users/5ff612423b9226001b945573,GB,6.0,2021-11-05 17:12:46+00:00,1.0,I have returned a pair of Sony…,"I have returned a pair of Sony earphones valued at £240 on the 9th of October 2021 using one of the option given to me by Amazon to return an item, which was to drop the package at an Amazon locker, which I did. 2 days later I received an email saying that the item is in transit back to Amazon and it can take up to 2 weeks to be refunded. I've waited until this week and nothing, no contact, no refund received. So I've got in touch with Amazon customer service via chat and I was told that the box received was empty, an investigation will be made which will take up to 3 days and if I don't get any emails I should get back in touch with customers service today. I haven't received any emails so I requested for them to call me just. The agent said that my case will be escalated and if no one reaches me in 24h I should get back in touch with them. Looks like no one has done anything since last time I spoke with them. This is just poor customer service. I'm an Amazon prime member, I shop every week from Amazon for years now, I have returned valuable items in the past with no issues, and now they are accusing me of having returned an empty box. What idiot would return an empty box?!? It's just shocking how a customer can be treated like this. They haven't said a thing until I contacted them. I am so curious to see what they will say by tomorrow, but I'm disgusted with the whole experience.",2021-11-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,5.0,1404,276,31,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,returned pair sony earphone valued £ th october using one option given amazon return item drop package amazon locker day later received email saying item transit back amazon take week refunded ive waited week nothing contact refund received ive got touch amazon customer service via chat told box received empty investigation made take day dont get email get back touch customer service today havent received email requested call agent said case escalated one reach h get back touch look like one done anything since last time spoke poor customer service im amazon prime member shop every week amazon year returned valuable item past issue accusing returned empty box idiot would return empty box shocking customer treated like havent said thing contacted curious see say tomorrow im disgusted whole experience,0.023554883460110285,0.9764451165398897,0.15479528883903534,0.2,0.819181616037752,81.9181616037752,High Trust
