DJ Savage,/users/61853380e4352c0012d2eab1,US,1.0,2021-11-05 13:37:21+00:00,1.0,Amazon is a crooked company,"Amazon is a crooked company.  Once upon a time, it was amazing for people in rural areas like me.  We used to get things quick, and usually in the 2 day shipping time.  However, that number has grown from 2 days to at least 10 days, and now cost more to have the Prime membership.  I needed something quick, and realized how slow they were now, and received something from Walmart in 2 days, and do not even have an account with them.  Amazon is too big now, and needs to realize that they have hurt the rural areas, even though they do not care.  I finally cancelled my Prime account, and realized that I did not benefit from it.  I still have money in my account for returns, and they will not refund it.  They tell me that I can use it towards another order from them, but refuse to use them for business.  They steal money, and will not return it!!!  No wonder Jeff Bezos is rich.... he is a thief!!!",2021-11-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,5.0,904,173,27,5,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,amazon crooked company upon time amazing people rural area like used get thing quick usually day shipping time however number grown day least day cost prime membership needed something quick realized slow received something walmart day even account amazon big need realize hurt rural area even though care finally cancelled prime account realized benefit still money account return refund tell use towards another order refuse use business steal money return wonder jeff bezos rich thief,0.9856216810377734,0.014378318962226633,0.09702748177229388,0.2,0.32659465583557207,32.65946558355721,Low Trust
