Thomas Walsh,/users/6184659d4a974d0012c1937b,CA,1.0,2021-11-04 22:58:44+00:00,1.0,Quite honestly some of the worst…,"Quite honestly some of the worst costumer service there could be.  For such a dominate force in the industry you would think they would actually take customer service even remotely serious.  I spent over 5 hours being hung up on, being asked the same questions repeatedly, reps would disconnect mid conversation causing me to repeat the entire process again.  Doesn't post contact numbers and when they do it doesn't even ring before sending you to a full mail box.  Terrible company, quick to take your money especially in a time where its almost the only option and gives you almost no way to actually communicate with someone that is actually able to help you.  I do not regret cancelling my subscription when I was finally able to go back to small businesses. P.S. Your rocket looked like a johnson, you dr. evil wanna be.",2021-11-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,4.0,826,144,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,quite honestly worst costumer service could dominate force industry would think would actually take customer service even remotely serious spent hour hung asked question repeatedly rep would disconnect mid conversation causing repeat entire process doesnt post contact number doesnt even ring sending full mail box terrible company quick take money especially time almost option give almost way actually communicate someone actually able help regret cancelling subscription finally able go back small business p rocket looked like johnson dr evil wanna,0.021259807549951163,0.9787401924500488,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.8055226481038803,80.55226481038802,High Trust
Diane Sala,/users/61843facf320e00016de9938,US,1.0,2021-11-04 20:17:33+00:00,1.0,Beware of Trade-ins to Amazon,"I had a Kindle fire that was never used.  No book was ever downloaded on it.  I bought it for my 88 year old dad at the time.  Deceased so I got it back recently. Maybe 9 years old. Still in the box it came in.  I got in touch with Amazon to see if I can use it (since mine died.)  Nope! No way even though I was able to give them all the information they required for ownership except an email address that my dad used 8 years ago and has not had an address for probably 6 years.  Send it in for a gift card of $5 and when they review the item, they will let you know about another gift card.  NOPE!  All I got was $5 and a 20% coupon.  I was lied to.  I asked for the unit back and was told - can't do it!  I am so angry that I was lied to and let Customer Service know it.  I was then credited for an different item I purchased last month and still have in my possession of $14.95!  Still angry!",2021-11-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,4.0,898,189,29,5,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,kindle fire never used book ever downloaded bought year old dad time deceased got back recently maybe year old still box came got touch amazon see use since mine died nope way even though able give information required ownership except email address dad used year ago address probably year send gift card review item let know another gift card nope got coupon lied asked unit back told cant angry lied let customer service know credited different item purchased last month still possession still angry,0.9544431988881895,0.045556801111810485,0.10600112170499158,0.2,0.34397862489690356,34.397862489690354,Low Trust
