Mr. H,/users/5f6bb6f796d0a3d03d6229af,US,3.0,2021-11-03 20:13:34+00:00,1.0,Prime shipping now takes over a week…,"Prime shipping now takes over a week despite it being initially advertised as ""2-day"". You can't trust the products anymore because there is little to no regulation and the marketplace has more fakes and cheap knockoffs than anything else. Product reviews are often fake or non-existent. Amazon tries to trick you into subscribing to ongoing item shipments and into purchasing their own low-quality brand over others. Price-gouging is rampant and the same products, or higher-quality products, can be found elsewhere for cheaper prices and faster shipping.",2021-11-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,3.0,556,86,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime shipping take week despite initially advertised day cant trust product anymore little regulation marketplace fake cheap knockoff anything else product review often fake nonexistent amazon try trick subscribing ongoing item shipment purchasing lowquality brand others pricegouging rampant product higherquality product found elsewhere cheaper price faster shipping,0.019429194248994096,0.9805708057510059,0.04823331463825014,0.2,0.7999320658031529,79.99320658031529,High Trust
Annette B.,/users/6182e006aeb80c0012123f2f,US,2.0,2021-11-03 19:22:20+00:00,3.0,"5-Star Convenience, 1-Star Wokeness","Honestly, I love Amazon in that it's convenient, and shipping is amazing. Pricing is often not particularly competitive; but it's just so easy. On the downside, I don't like supporting a company that routinely decides to censor books that don't conform to their Woke guidelines. I know it's perfectly legal because they're a private company, I just don't want to pay for it. So, I'm averaging out to 3-stars.",2021-11-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,3.0,408,69,35,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,honestly love amazon convenient shipping amazing pricing often particularly competitive easy downside dont like supporting company routinely decides censor book dont conform woke guideline know perfectly legal theyre private company dont want pay im averaging star,0.06067867942439033,0.9393213205756097,0.038698822209758836,0.6,1.3774004247297564,137.74004247297563,High Trust
