Shere,/users/5d69978a2eb4d860a7aa9bc9,US,3.0,2021-10-31 08:30:09+00:00,1.0,Amazon Logistics Delivery Drivers Falsely Stating They Delivered My Package!,"On Thursday October 27th 2021 I purchased a $100.00 gift card from Amazon.com that was supposed to be delivered on the same day along with other items. Everything else came except for that. On Friday 10-29-2021 I checked the tracking on Amazon, they said that they ''attempted delivery at 06:28 a.m.'' that is false because I was awake. No one rang the doorbell or knocked on the door. I've contacted customer service and I've been given the run around saying that it will be delivered on Saturday, no one delivered anything. They delivered another order that I purchased but not the gift card. It is important that I receive it because it's for someone else as a gift. Customer Service relayed to me each time I chatted with them via Amazon Chat that ""they would arrange a report to delivery management to review the conversation and this issue for each report they receive will be investigated and the appropriate action will be taken."" There has been no follow up or when to ''truly"" expect my order. They have delivery drivers that falsely state they've attempted delivery when they have not, and what I don't understand is why they won't just leave the gift card package on the porch like they've done the other times? Even the other gift card I purchased on Thursday they left it on the porch along with the other orders as they always do. I pay for an Amazon Prime Subscription that does not deliver, they claim that I would have my card on two specific days and it has not been delivered. I feel that they're giving me the run around and playing games with me. All I ask is to receive what I've purchased and if unable to deliver on those promises then they should clearly state that. They have taken $100.00 from me which is for a gift card and will not delivered my item and something should be done about it. Amazon makes fraudulent promises when it comes to receiving your packages but does not deliver. The Delivery Driver lied and stated that they attempted to deliver my package when no one showed up because I was wide awake. Amazon will not give me the status on when my package is supposed to arrive, so I've decided I will no longer invest my money into their Prime Membership. I'm cancelling my Prime Membership and I'm taking my hard earned cash elsewhere. Because they do not deliver on the promises they make and employ those with unethical business practices who lie about delivering items to paying customers.",2021-10-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,31.0,2434,434,76,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,thursday october th purchased gift card amazoncom supposed delivered day along item everything else came except friday checked tracking amazon said attempted delivery false awake one rang doorbell knocked door ive contacted customer service ive given run around saying delivered saturday one delivered anything delivered another order purchased gift card important receive someone else gift customer service relayed time chatted via amazon chat would arrange report delivery management review conversation issue report receive investigated appropriate action taken follow truly expect order delivery driver falsely state theyve attempted delivery dont understand wont leave gift card package porch like theyve done time even gift card purchased thursday left porch along order always pay amazon prime subscription deliver claim would card two specific day delivered feel theyre giving run around playing game ask receive ive purchased unable deliver promise clearly state taken gift card delivered item something done amazon make fraudulent promise come receiving package deliver delivery driver lied stated attempted deliver package one showed wide awake amazon give status package supposed arrive ive decided longer invest money prime membership im cancelling prime membership im taking hard earned cash elsewhere deliver promise make employ unethical business practice lie delivering item paying customer,0.0032894580859943894,0.9967105419140057,0.24340998317442514,0.2,0.8470372675918878,84.70372675918878,High Trust
