Marisa Dinzeo,/users/6179e585b833460013990175,US,1.0,2021-10-27 23:49:36+00:00,1.0,Beware of Scammers,So I recently just got a fire tv from best buy today I am setting it up so I had to call Amazon prime customer service to continue with the setting up I was speaking to a gentleman with a foreign accent and he was helping me verify my Amazon account by asking me to put in my debit card information which by the way was correct and I should hear from them in 24 hours but he did something else that was a red flag asked me to put in 100 dollars to my gift card balance and that wasn't suppose to happen then said open zelle on the bank app my bank app and send money to a strange person so I was furious and without me using bad language I said you are not helping me at all I am done with this conversation have a great day and hung up on him caution for scammers people but I ended up calling customer service and spoke to someone else who was able to help me about getting a refund and my money back to where it belongs,2021-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,27.0,922,190,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently got fire tv best buy today setting call amazon prime customer service continue setting speaking gentleman foreign accent helping verify amazon account asking put debit card information way correct hear hour something else red flag asked put dollar gift card balance wasnt suppose happen said open zelle bank app bank app send money strange person furious without using bad language said helping done conversation great day hung caution scammer people ended calling customer service spoke someone else able help getting refund money back belongs,0.04043105179418573,0.9595689482058143,0.1065619742007852,0.2,0.8010968689430642,80.10968689430642,High Trust
