Amanda Mitchell,/users/61792edd30fc180012b6a410,US,1.0,2021-10-27 10:50:12+00:00,1.0,2 Thumbs Down,"I ordered two items on Oct 20th with a delivery date of Oct 25th. On the 22nd I got an email stating that my items would be arriving earlier on the  24th. On the 24th I receive an email stating that my items will be late and I should receive them on the 25 or 26th. And if I hadn't received the items after yesterday that I could request a refund. Yet this morning when I go to cancel the order and request a refund the site tells me that  I can't update my delivery options yet. I clicked on cancel and refund, not delivery options.My items arrived in Hebron KY at 3 something in the morning on Saturday. Left Hebron at 2 something in the morning on Sunday. At 4p and 7p on Sunday both updates say delayed in transit and that is that of my tracking details. Way to go Amazon!!!!!!!",2021-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,27.0,782,153,13,3,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,ordered two item oct th delivery date oct th nd got email stating item would arriving earlier th th receive email stating item late receive th hadnt received item yesterday could request refund yet morning go cancel order request refund site tell cant update delivery option yet clicked cancel refund delivery optionsmy item arrived hebron ky something morning saturday left hebron something morning sunday p p sunday update say delayed transit tracking detail way go amazon,0.9995587453063483,0.0004412546936517492,0.08581043185642176,0.2,0.3173827137181102,31.738271371811024,Low Trust
