Thomas Peng,/users/5eeb31bcac639e10189acbe6,GB,12.0,2021-10-26 22:18:30+00:00,1.0,Amazon account specialist,"On a Saturday morning received an email telling my account is closed due to misuse - 'include placing orders for your own products or purchasing products in order to receive compensation directly from the Sellers', yet I never did that! They did not give a specific reason for that, and I never received a warning before (I don't even know what caused the misunderstanding). They didn't give me a chance to explain but only 'After a thorough review of your details, we have decided to close your Amazon account' and 'We may not respond to further emails about this issue'. The customer service is good but the account specialists hardly meet the 'customer-centred service' and how can they close accounts so easily without a specific reason?",2021-10-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,26.0,741,126,25,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,saturday morning received email telling account closed due misuse include placing order product purchasing product order receive compensation directly seller yet never give specific reason never received warning dont even know caused misunderstanding didnt give chance explain thorough review detail decided close amazon account may respond email issue customer service good account specialist hardly meet customercentred service close account easily without specific reason,0.11573641079223652,0.8842635892077635,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.7562652774978805,75.62652774978805,High Trust
