Beth Ford,/users/60219eabfe424b001a6b4ac8,US,3.0,2021-10-26 14:06:10+00:00,1.0,That standardized letter you send to…,"That standardized letter you send to people is full of incomplete accusations that do not apply to me and I'm sure lots of other people who received it. The only reason I had so many returns was a one-time issue that included bad luck and several other factors. The 2 boxed sets of children's books my child wanted were out of stock so I was forced to buy each one separately. They were just cheap little paperbacks and not worth the 6-12 bucks I spent on each of them. When I received them I noticed a lot of murder and torture in them. If you send my kid torture, it's going back. It was a one time issue that is never likely to happen again. But that letter you send out and the subsequent lying, avoidance, failure of reps to answer my questions, hateful supervisors, repeated emails full of vague language that didn't mean anything. I wasted two days of my life trying to figure out why you thought I had done something fraudulent and you weren't even talking to me. You just put inflammatory accusations in every letter. Amazon is mismanaged. Good customer service and support were all Amazon had and now it's gone. This is a sinking ship and I'm not going down with you. You can sell your souls for this garbage they call a ""marketplace"" Marketplaces get busted by the cops when they sell fake products. And they do not send hateful letters to good citizens.",2021-10-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,26.0,1365,250,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,standardized letter send people full incomplete accusation apply im sure lot people received reason many return onetime issue included bad luck several factor boxed set childrens book child wanted stock forced buy one separately cheap little paperback worth buck spent received noticed lot murder torture send kid torture going back one time issue never likely happen letter send subsequent lying avoidance failure rep answer question hateful supervisor repeated email full vague language didnt mean anything wasted two day life trying figure thought done something fraudulent werent even talking put inflammatory accusation every letter amazon mismanaged good customer service support amazon gone sinking ship im going sell soul garbage call marketplace marketplace get busted cop sell fake product send hateful letter good citizen,0.012520247239078894,0.9874797527609211,0.14021312394840157,0.2,0.821782501170141,82.1782501170141,High Trust
