Jo,/users/616ecfe6272e970013c90494,GB,11.0,2021-10-26 09:40:46+00:00,1.0,Amazon sent a faulty monitor,"Amazon sent a faulty monitor, then a replacement. The replacement isn't even a year old and it's broken the same way as the first. I tried contacting them but they told me to contact the maker, I did and they said it was Amazon's responsibility. Went back to Amazon who basically told me to take it up with their legal team. I feel like this big company is just bullying people out of their money. I've already lost work and money as a self employed person, working from home. I cannot afford a new monitor and Amazon are just throwing their weight around with rude replies, and generic 'thanks for your patience'",2021-10-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,26.0,613,112,28,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon sent faulty monitor replacement replacement isnt even year old broken way first tried contacting told contact maker said amazon responsibility went back amazon basically told take legal team feel like big company bullying people money ive already lost work money self employed person working home cannot afford new monitor amazon throwing weight around rude reply generic thanks patience,0.034148678588517445,0.9658513214114826,0.0628154795288839,0.2,0.7954887566115181,79.54887566115181,High Trust
Jennifer,/users/617721097b7eff0013ecccd3,US,1.0,2021-10-25 21:27:07+00:00,1.0,I can't get into my Amazon account even…,I can't get into my Amazon account even though I put in the correct username and password due to the fact I broke my previous phone and don't have text message access so I can't get the code that they text me. When calling customer service they have to read a disclaimer to you that States they're going to ask you a few will to a few which is 2 questions regarding your account. They say the questions are different every time you call in but that's not the case. The 3 questions they ask you to verify you are you are  About the last 4 digits of your credit or debit card number along with the expiration date and What the last 3 items you purchased from Amazon are lasagna and what 3 items do you currently have in your safe for later cart. I am not a regular Amazon user The last time I made a purchase was at least 6 months ago and and like I said not regular user so I have no idea what's in my saved for later cart.. I've called about 5 times have times gotten hung up on and they have been unable to help.,2021-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,25.0,1013,203,40,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,cant get amazon account even though put correct username password due fact broke previous phone dont text message access cant get code text calling customer service read disclaimer state theyre going ask question regarding account say question different every time call thats case question ask verify last digit credit debit card number along expiration date last item purchased amazon lasagna item currently safe later cart regular amazon user last time made purchase least month ago like said regular user idea whats saved later cart ive called time time gotten hung unable help,0.010913699892489139,0.9890863001075109,0.11385305664610207,0.2,0.8173137613829758,81.73137613829759,High Trust
