Estela Jennings,/users/61760063d5f6610012c8fb7a,US,1.0,2021-10-25 00:55:27+00:00,1.0,"Hey Amazon, Hire New Delivery Drivers","Hey Amazon, Hire New Delivery Drivers No point in paying for Prime if they can't even deliver your packages on time, or deliver them at all. I have had several instances of this. Amazon said ""package will be delivered today"" meanwhile it was sitting in a processing center in India. Amazon is terrible at making estimates apparently.  Most recently, the delivery driver just gave up on finding my address and took it back to the processing center. They provided a ""nonexistent"" tracking number as well.  I live next to a college campus and it is very easy to find where I live. And finally, when packages ARE delivered, they don't bother to double check WHICH APARTMENT to deliver it to, so they send it to either apartment either directly on the left or directly on the right. I don't want to be that person digging through the neighbor's mail to find my stuff!!! It is NOT HARD to double check where a package is supposed to be going, you'd think that would be the most basic job requirement is to know how to read.",2021-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,25.0,1017,184,37,6,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,hey amazon hire new delivery driver point paying prime cant even deliver package time deliver several instance amazon said package delivered today meanwhile sitting processing center india amazon terrible making estimate apparently recently delivery driver gave finding address took back processing center provided nonexistent tracking number well live next college campus easy find live finally package delivered dont bother double check apartment deliver send either apartment either directly left directly right dont want person digging neighbor mail find stuff hard double check package supposed going youd think would basic job requirement know read,0.7074627892443923,0.2925372107556077,0.10319685922602355,0.2,0.46690797722300853,46.69079772230085,Low Trust
