Kevin Desbrow,/users/6172a7f413672c001222ec19,ES,2.0,2021-10-22 12:08:01+00:00,1.0,Potentially dangerous product,"The product i purchased via Amazon.es is the chemical bromine spa tablets. It arrived with the product box open and some broken bromine tablets spilling into the outer packaging which was a poor fit, with small holes in the corners which leaked chemical dust. When i opened the outer packaging i inhaled bromine dust particals which irritated my nasal passages and throat. This product was ordered through Amazon Spain. I decided to call Amazon uk as this issue was potentially dangerous and i wanted to speak in english. Assuming any of Amazons employees would take this safety issue seriously. I explained that i did not want a refund or replacement and that i was informing them of a potentially dangerous situation for other customers and anyone opening the outer packaging and inhaling bromine dust could have serious consequences, especially if they have respiratory problems. The Amazon uk help desk response was dreadful. I was told that i could not be helped as i had purchased via Amazon es and i would be sent an email with details of how to contact Amazon es. I had made this clear that this was a safety issue and assumed that any Amazon helpdesk employee would take this seriously regardless of location as this product is sold in multiple locations. As i stated, this was not a replacement or refund issue but SAFETY as the chemical bromine can potentially be very dangerous. All i wanted was for someone to take responsibility for the safety of Amazon customers. Amazon totally failed to achieve this.",2021-10-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,22.0,1517,259,29,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,product purchased via amazones chemical bromine spa tablet arrived product box open broken bromine tablet spilling outer packaging poor fit small hole corner leaked chemical dust opened outer packaging inhaled bromine dust particals irritated nasal passage throat product ordered amazon spa