James Cannom,/users/55952eab0000ff0001c9e9b5,GB,19.0,2021-10-20 07:36:55+00:00,1.0,A special kind of stupid,"You place an order through Amazon Business because you run a business - that is common sense. So Amazon decide your parcel is going to be delivered next day (order placed at the very start of the day so following day is not a huge demand) but wait for it - outside of business hours.Then you get a message ""your parcel has been left at reception"". I do not have a reception and outside of business hours on an industrial estate there are very few people about. The delivery driver therefore leaves it outside....in the rain. It has rained all night. The package is water sensitive and you know there is going to be a problem when you pick it up and it takes over a minute for the water to run out of the plastic bag the driver left it in.Can you contact Amazon - No!Chatbot is the best you can do.You have to be a special kind of stupid to leave a parcel out in the rain - 12 hours worth of rain at that.Ruined parcel and whilst a refund has been authorised by the chatbot it takes 5 to 7 days for the money to reach my account - quick enought to take it but hang on to it as long as they can. Aside from that, we actually needed the goods - it's why we have Business Prime - for NEXT DAY DELIVERY",2021-10-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,20.0,1197,237,24,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,place order amazon business run business common sense amazon decide parcel going delivered next day order placed start day following day huge demand wait outside business hoursthen get message parcel left reception reception outside business hour industrial estate people delivery driver therefore leaf outsidein rain rained night package water sensitive know going problem pick take minute water run plastic bag driver left incan contact amazon nochatbot best doyou special kind stupid leave parcel rain hour worth rain thatruined parcel whilst refund authorised chatbot take day money reach account quick enought take hang long aside actually needed good business prime next day delivery,0.06898901054012996,0.93101098945987,0.13292204150308468,0.2,0.7920899030305519,79.20899030305519,High Trust
