Braced Satsuma,/users/6050d98fb86eba001a746e74,GB,6.0,2021-10-17 16:55:16+00:00,4.0,it’s amazon.,"Well… it’s amazon? It’s the place to go to buy anything and everything. Good, quick delivery times (mostly), good deals and prices and clear delivery information. The only problem about amazon is not themselves, but the other companies and traders who use the platform to sell their products, some are extremely overpriced, fake and scams. Amazon themselves and verified amazon products are fine, but sometimes you need to watch out for the third party sellers, because their prices are sometimes inflated and the actual product is faulty.",2021-10-17 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,17.0,539,87,12,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,well… it’s amazon it’s place go buy anything everything good quick delivery time mostly good deal price clear delivery information problem amazon company trader use platform sell product extremely overpriced fake scam amazon verified amazon product fine sometimes need watch third party seller price sometimes inflated actual product faulty,0.015228399164737746,0.9847716008352623,0.04879416713404375,0.8,1.70214463384444,170.214463384444,High Trust
Jackie Dunnagan,/users/616c2b1c0c5bca0012f435b6,US,1.0,2021-10-17 13:54:43+00:00,1.0,Don't buy!!!,"Don't buy!!!! I'm 99.9% sure that this third party private seller is having these rebuilt or buying them with the forknowledge of and with non Microsoft certified hardware,which is not at all difficult to do. They will of course deny this.I am very familiar with hardware and the Xbox console. Even the interface is different and it lags doing the most simple of menu tasks .Not to mention the loading icons and colors are all slightly different to the trained eye.Know that they are all made in China now as well as assembled. This is what happens sadly.Put in a lesser quality processor or hardware and sell these things and they make lots of $$$$$$$$ because most people are unaware in this respect. For most I'm sure it will work just good enough and they won't catch it.Lucky for me I had issues out the box and it was clear to me without taking it apart what the issue is.I mean the games won't even play.I know all too well...cheap Chinese rebuilds with uncertified parts...Shame on me for thinking Amazon would be any better then Alibaba.It's the American equivalent.",2021-10-17 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,17.0,1075,189,12,2,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,dont buy im sure third party private seller rebuilt buying forknowledge non microsoft certified hardwarewhich difficult course deny thisi familiar hardware xbox console even interface different lag simple menu task mention loading icon color slightly different trained eyeknow made china well assembled happens sadlyput lesser quality processor hardware sell thing make lot people unaware respect im sure work good enough wont catch itlucky issue box clear without taking apart issue isi mean game wont even playi know wellcheap chinese rebuilds uncertified partsshame thinking amazon would better alibabaits american equivalent,0.9173854523644613,0.08261454763553866,0.10600112170499158,0.2,0.36250749815876765,36.250749815876766,Low Trust
