GN,/users/5d173f46be59e885c9dee05b,GB,13.0,2021-10-07 19:45:18+00:00,5.0,Good service needs to be flagged too,"I think there is a tendency only to provide experiences when you are frustrated and angry. So I thought for a few seconds about who had impressed me most. And I would say these guys. I am talking about the ease of buying products which I started to do at the start of the pandemic. Everything about this platform is fantastic. I can spend 30 min wandering around hardware stores to find some obscure screw, and probably fail, but I can identify it on Amazon and it'll be here next day most of the time.I've never had cause to complain and cannot judge customer service too well as a result, but I'm around 100 orders now and no issues, so what can you do other than give 5 stars?",2021-10-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,7.0,679,129,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,think tendency provide experience frustrated angry thought second impressed would say guy talking ease buying product started start pandemic everything platform fantastic spend min wandering around hardware store find obscure screw probably fail identify amazon itll next day timeive never cause complain cannot judge customer service well result im around order issue give star,0.044846073940134595,0.9551539260598654,0.0723499719573752,1.0,1.9920469574214077,199.20469574214076,High Trust
Aubree Hill,/users/615f2558f628a50012c75888,US,1.0,2021-11-06 21:11:39+00:00,1.0,Horrible customer service and shady…,"UPDATE 11/6/21: It's November and still no PC or refund! After calling them out on twitter a few days ago, they sent me an email to pretty much let me know that they're not going to do anything because it has passed the 90 limit for a claim. Meanwhile, the rep made sure to for some reason, send me a link to the sellers feedback page which ironically, has several reviews of people complaining about getting denied refunds or also missing items after returning them. I showed them this in another email and of course, they just glossed over it and pretty much said ""whoops lol sorry."" A different rep decided to reply to the email and showed me proof of the email that the previous one had sent to the seller Well low and behold, there's also proof of the last email that the last rep also sent to the seller which of course went unanswered, along with the 3 other messages I had sent to the seller too dating back to July of this year! I swear these ""people"" don't read anything! And probably on purpose.Oh, and that refund that was sent as ""compensation"", yeah, now they're threatening to charge me because the associate that did it, sneakily processed it as a regular return request. If anyone happens to come across a 3rd party seller named premier660 on Amazon or any other platform for that matter, DO NOT BUY FROM THEM. They will sell you damaged products hoping that you don't know enough about them to realize that they're broken, and then when they do break after 30 days, they'll ignore you continuously. Amazon will of course, play into this and will run you in circles telling you to wait 3-5 business days while they email the seller for a response in hopes that they can run the time out that you have to file a claim.Horrible customer service and shady third party sellers! I have spent months trying to resolve an issue with a damaged PC I ordered earlier this year. I contacted a rep after not hearing from the seller or manufacturer and they approved me for a partial refund and sent me the label. Seller tells me not to send it back or else they’d just deny the request (even though it had already been approved) and would return it back to me. Since this was the first time I’ve ever had to return something, I didn’t return it. My mom then goes and returns it (before the seller denied, i was at work when I received the label and didn’t want to use the company computer to print it so I sent it to her and asked her to print it out at home. I told her to discard it after I was messaged by the seller so that’s why she had access to the label and was able to ship it without me knowing.) it has nearly been an entire month and I have not seen the PC or the partial refund that the first associate said I’d get. The no refund, I can accept as I figured that wouldn’t be happening. But if you’re going to take both my money AND the product back, THEN I’d either like said money refunded or said product returned to me like the seller said. I contacted another rep a week or two ago and they tell me that if I didn’t get a response within two to three Business days, that I was ok to contact another associate and file a claim to process a partial refund. They then refunded me for another purchase as compensation, which I didn’t ask for.So I wait, then try contacting a rep again as they said, and get told that I can’t file a claim because it’s past 90 days. When I told them that the last rep told me that I could (and I have screenshot evidence of this), they glossed over it and told me that I shouldn’t have tried to return the product. I told her that it was done without my knowledge and asked what could be done to which she replied with “I can email the seller and ask them to return the PC or refund you” which is what I’ve already been doing for months now, and told me that if they don’t respond, I have no other options but to accept the loss. Huh? So you’re fine with allowing the seller to keep both the item and my money? Nah, I don’t think so.The whole experience has been such a huge nightmare that I almost want to do just that. All I’ve been told is “sure! Just Wait x amount of days” or “message the seller” I’m tired of messaging and waiting! It has already proven to not work! The seller has sneakily removed the product to hide the bad reviews on the product as well as my review with the original screenshots, so it’s obvious that they know what they’re doing! Teach your reps how to actually help people instead of reading scripts and giving false answers to get the customer to shut up! After this, I honestly don’t know if I want to order from Amazon anymore knowing that if I have an issue with a product, THIS is the type of service I’ll be receiving!",2021-10-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,11.0,6.0,4704,896,36,5,30.0,0,10,1,0,Genuine,update november still pc refund calling twitter day ago sent email pretty much let know theyre going anything passed limit claim meanwhile rep made sure reason send link seller feedback page ironically several review people complaining getting denied refund also missing item returning showed another email course glossed pretty much said whoop lol sorry different rep decided reply email showed proof email previous one sent seller well low behold there also proof last email last rep also sent seller course went unanswered along message sent seller dating back july year swear people dont read anything probably purposeoh refund sent compensation yeah theyre threatening charge associate sneakily processed regular return request anyone happens come across rd party seller named premier amazon platform matter buy sell damaged product hoping dont know enough realize theyre broken break day theyll ignore continuously amazon course play run circle telling wait business day email seller response hope run time file claimhorrible customer service shady third party seller spent month trying resolve issue damaged pc ordered earlier year contacted rep hearing seller manufacturer approved partial refund sent label seller tell send back else they’d deny request even though already approved would return back since first time i’ve ever return something didn’t return mom go return seller denied work received label didn’t want use company computer print sent asked print home told discard messaged seller that’s access label able ship without knowing nearly entire month seen pc partial refund first associate said i’d get refund accept figured wouldn’t happening you’re going take money product back i’d either like said money refunded said product returned like seller said contacted another rep week two ago tell didn’t get response within two three business day ok contact another associate file claim process partial refund refunded another purchase compensation didn’t ask forso wait try contacting rep said get told can’t file claim it’s past day told last rep told could screenshot evidence glossed told shouldn’t tried return product told done without knowledge asked could done replied “i email seller ask return pc refund you” i’ve already month told don’t respond option accept loss huh you’re fine allowing seller keep item money nah don’t think sothe whole experience huge nightmare almost want i’ve told “sure wait x amount days” “message seller” i’m tired messaging waiting already proven work seller sneakily removed product hide bad review product well review original screenshots it’s obvious know they’re teach rep actually help people instead reading script giving false answer get customer shut honestly don’t know want order amazon anymore knowing issue product type service i’ll receiving,0.9999142631050237,8.573689497626269e-05,0.5025238362310712,0.2,0.4005476356937024,40.05476356937024,Low Trust
Andrew Richardson,/users/615f1c79fc7024001380bb92,GB,11.0,2021-10-07 16:20:39+00:00,1.0,Bought an air fryer they never…,"Bought an air fryer they never delivered it the asked me for info, I’ve sent an email every day since July no responses.",2021-10-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,7.0,120,23,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought air fryer never delivered asked info i’ve sent email every day since july response,0.0389323970391164,0.9610676029608836,0.012899607403252944,0.2,0.7831137229610923,78.31137229610923,High Trust
Tracey,/users/5a5e42600000ff000b01c728,GB,30.0,2021-10-07 16:05:57+00:00,1.0,Possible fake digestive supplements,"I bought a digestive supplement that I have been taking from Amazon today for the first time, I usually use the health food shop. I had an immediate bad reaction and my throat was burning, shaking, tingling lips and nausea. I then read that Amazon can supply fake supplements so I panicked and called Amazon. To my amazement they do not have a telephone number for the supplier and told me I have to wait up to 48 hours for an email response. There isnt a telephone number listed for this company on Google. I told the Manager that I am going to the hospital and I need to know if these are fake pills. He couldnt help me at all. I asked what the emergency procedure is for one of their suppliers and he told me they didnt have one. Just use the contact button and wait he told me. I needed to inform the Dr if the product was indeed fake as this would have been the difference between a fast diagnosis and lots of tests etc. I ended up calling Optibac who told me they probably genuine as the seller is a customer of theirs which put my mind to rest but why do Amazon not have a procedure for emergencies and why did I have to do all of the leg work when it is a supplier using their platform. Because I now know it is probably genuine I will wait it out to see if it just goes away by itself as I probably haven't taken anything dangerous, just a bad batch. Amazon, get your act together and put a process in place for instances like this!",2021-10-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,7.0,1441,282,35,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,bought digestive supplement taking amazon today first time usually use health food shop immediate bad reaction throat burning shaking tingling lip nausea read amazon supply fake supplement panicked called amazon amazement telephone number supplier told wait hour email response isnt telephone number listed company google told manager going hospital need know fake pill couldnt help asked emergency procedure one supplier told didnt one use contact button wait told needed inform dr product indeed fake would difference fast diagnosis lot test etc ended calling optibac told probably genuine seller customer put mind rest amazon procedure emergency leg work supplier using platform know probably genuine wait see go away probably havent taken anything dangerous bad batch amazon get act together put process place instance like,0.10879946327582483,0.8912005367241752,0.15816040381379698,0.2,0.777232349124847,77.7232349124847,High Trust
Ian Mcconnell,/users/5af7f50b4de5666d342d27e9,GB,7.0,2021-10-07 13:34:06+00:00,1.0,I tried to speak to them on chat and…,"I tried to speak to them on chat and eventually asked them to call me.  My mobile rang i answered and pressed 5 as requested it then cut off.  No one has answered my questions/concerns in messaging.my issues are:1. 4 items showing as delivered yesterday but never arrived and no notes through door?  have tried to tell amazon online but only mechanism for this is to start a return but no items to return?  2. cable delivered today br driver.  Driver did not ring bell but instead walked in our front door and left the very broken package on the floor.  My wife was at home on her own and was scared out of her skin at a big bloke walking into our house.  This is the 2nd time he has done this, last time i managed to run outside and told him never to do it again.  I also complained to Amazon about it.  I assume it was a different person, who knows???i am really annoyed at the driver for doing this to my wife & annoyed at Amazon who dont seem interested in talking to you to resolve issues.   I hope my items have not gone walkies?",2021-10-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,7.0,1035,199,37,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tried speak chat eventually asked call mobile rang answered pressed requested cut one answered questionsconcerns messagingmy issue item showing delivered yesterday never arrived note door tried tell amazon online mechanism start return item return cable delivered today br driver driver ring bell instead walked front door left broken package floor wife home scared skin big bloke walking house nd time done last time managed run outside told never also complained amazon assume different person knowsi really annoyed driver wife annoyed amazon dont seem interested talking resolve issue hope item gone walkies,0.012742495158979931,0.98725750484102,0.11160964666292765,0.2,0.8159506817530955,81.59506817530955,High Trust
