Jordan Shackleton,/users/5ee13b26da921fe8869b02fb,GB,9.0,2021-10-02 11:20:06+00:00,1.0,3rd Party Sellers are a major issue.,"I ordered a large item from a 3rd party seller. The item was required ASAP but hermes as usual lost the parcel, I couldn't cancel as it was in transit. It arrived 10 days later but was no longer needed. Opened a return request, hermes failed to pick up twice and then claimed it was too large, contacted the 3rd party who got DHL to pick up, 3rd party received the item and said they've issued a refund, amazon claimed they have not received the refund and won't issue it to me. I'm now without the item and £70 down, I've essentially been scammed and Amazon don't want to know. They used to care about customer service but those days have long gone.",2021-10-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,2.0,650,123,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered large item rd party seller item required asap hermes usual lost parcel couldnt cancel transit arrived day later longer needed opened return request hermes failed pick twice claimed large contacted rd party got dhl pick rd party received item said theyve issued refund amazon claimed received refund wont issue im without item £ ive essentially scammed amazon dont want know used care customer service day long gone,0.012752062443538567,0.9872479375564615,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.8074209401747534,80.74209401747534,High Trust
