David O'Connell,/users/6157baa046bc2a001212a88e,US,1.0,2021-10-02 01:49:38+00:00,1.0,I was given a 500 gift card for amazon…,"I was given a 500 gift card for amazon even though I stopped using amazon because of their horrible service. I tried using 200 of the card and my account was placed on a freeze for unusual activity thought when I spent the same on my personal cc they never cared. I called customer service once and argued with a manager till he hung up. I called back and spoke with another knowing I would get nowhere but I live in upstate NY with nothing to do so I read her bad customer, employees and lawsuit reviews for two hours till I got an email saying my account was unfroze but my cart was emptied. I tried making the same exact purchase only to be froze again for the same activity. If they cared this much about my cc purchase I wouldn't mind so much but they have no questions about my cc only when it comes to spending money already paid to them. I would rather not have the gift card instead of another piece of useless plastic w a receipt. EBAY or an actual store is the way to go. Also I canceled prior to this because they said if I paid for prime it was Guaranteed for two days but came after four days. A billion dollar sham to pay for a cheating mans space adventure nothing more",2021-10-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,2.0,1185,231,39,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,given gift card amazon even though stopped using amazon horrible service tried using card account placed freeze unusual activity thought spent personal cc never cared called customer service argued manager till hung called back spoke another knowing would get nowhere live upstate ny nothing read bad customer employee lawsuit review two hour till got email saying account unfroze cart emptied tried making exact purchase froze activity cared much cc purchase wouldnt mind much question cc come spending money already paid would rather gift card instead another piece useless plastic w receipt ebay actual store