N.G.,/users/6157104d60cd210012f15971,US,1.0,2021-10-01 13:43:05+00:00,1.0,From exceptional to mediocre,"Amazon's new approach of handling customer relations is mediocre at best.  Calls are always forwarded to a country where it's hard to communicate due to language barrier, as well as the new attitude from these representatives.  Amazon used to have exceptional customer service based in the USA, that used to look at case by case situations, now all we get is some mediocre person reading off a script and making sure he doesn't step outside the box that his/her Supervisor drew around his/her feet.  I've been an Amazon consumer for over 20 years, but after recent encounters with mediocre service - NO MORE!  For that, I'd go to Walmart.",2021-10-01 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,1.0,638,109,28,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon new approach handling customer relation mediocre best call always forwarded country hard communicate due language barrier well new attitude representative amazon used exceptional customer service based usa used look case case situation get mediocre person reading script making sure doesnt step outside box hisher supervisor drew around hisher foot ive amazon consumer year recent encounter mediocre service id go walmart,0.0824379706161019,0.9175620293838981,0.061132922041503085,0.2,0.7710075991002496,77.10075991002496,High Trust
customer,/users/5f68c427e28d636bb9cdfda5,GB,13.0,2021-10-01 13:39:10+00:00,1.0,Amazon have become a joke,"Amazon have become awful, their deliveries are a joke. I've just had a driver drive pass my home without bothering to get out and deliver my prime parcel, I was then notified that they attempted to deliver my parcel without success....I literally watched them stop outside my home and then drive off. I regularly have problems with my deliveries, it is now becoming a joke. I pay £7.99 a month for this shocking service....Amazon need to get a grip before myself and many others shop elsewhere",2021-10-01 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,1.0,493,86,25,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon become awful delivery joke ive driver drive pas home without bothering get deliver prime parcel notified attempted deliver parcel without successi literally watched stop outside home drive regularly problem delivery becoming joke pay £ month shocking serviceamazon need get grip many others shop elsewhere,0.017863417792414252,0.9821365822075857,0.04823331463825014,0.2,0.8007149540314429,80.07149540314428,High Trust
Bruce Richardson,/users/5f22a98c28bf3baf7f11498a,US,3.0,2021-10-01 09:59:12+00:00,1.0,Poor packaging turned the health bars ordered into dog food,"The following was sent to Amazon on September 29, 2021Poor packaging turned the health bars ordered into dog food.The bars were ordered and I received an email with a tracking number that they would be received the next day. Next day I received an email stating out for delivery. That was a week ago. When the package never showed up, I followed up and was told the tracking number did not exist.  A week later a nondescript van pulls up and drops this Amazon envelope on my step.  Inside is the box of bars completely crushed and broken open from the weight of packages piled onto it throughout it's shipping trip.  I have pics of all.  Amazon's service or rather lack of service has grown tiresome.  The sad part is that I pay extra for it with my Prime membership which constantly increases in price as the actual service standards decrease.  Does Jeff Bezos want to receive his food in this condition?  I submitted this review to Amazon and was told that it violated policy and could not be accepted, inviting me to rewrite it and resubmit.  No comment, concern or interest in even looking into their breach of basic delivery expectations.  This shipping experience was completely normal.  This is how little they care about how they fulfil their commitment to their customers.  They can run all the commercials they want touting their caring nature and civic responsibility but facts are stubborn things...they don't change.  The reality is they do not care about others, particularly their customers that they support and the customer service response I received back from them after sharing my poor experience proves that.",2021-10-01 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,10.0,1.0,1629,277,59,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,following sent amazon september poor packaging turned health bar ordered dog foodthe bar ordered received email tracking number would received next day next day received email stating delivery week ago package never showed followed told tracking number exist week later nondescript van pull drop amazon envelope step inside box bar completely crushed broken open weight package piled onto throughout shipping trip pic amazon service rather lack service grown tiresome sad part pay extra prime membership constantly increase price actual service standard decrease jeff bezos want receive food condition submitted review amazon told violated policy could accepted inviting rewrite resubmit comment concern interest even looking breach basic delivery expectation shipping experience completely normal little care fulfil commitment customer run commercial want touting caring nature civic responsibility fact stubborn thingsthey dont change reality care others particularly customer support customer service response received back sharing poor experience prof,0.00546050235197037,0.9945394976480296,0.15535614133482895,0.2,0.8283409770909806,82.83409770909806,High Trust
