Marcus Jenson,/users/5e4d2c0f85f62f15b6e19a62,GB,6.0,2021-09-30 16:21:48+00:00,1.0,Amazon has gone totally downhill & like…,"Amazon has gone totally downhill & like so many other companies simply doesn't care about customer experience any longer.Next day delivery gauranteed, now means -maybe next day delivery & if not we won't bother to let you know until it's dispatched 2 days later or compensate you for not having the product when we said you would.Another problem is the use of non-native English speakers for customer service in native English speaking countries. They just do not understand the communication a lot of the time.And we pay higher prices for our goods all the same in the west, so we should receive customer service that is commensurate.The only way to stop this behaviour is to vote with your wallet & hope that others do too.The stock value is the only thing they care about.",2021-09-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,30.0,775,134,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon gone totally downhill like many company simply doesnt care customer experience longernext day delivery gauranteed mean maybe next day delivery wont bother let know dispatched day later compensate product said wouldanother problem use nonnative english speaker customer service native english speaking country understand communication lot timeand pay higher price good west receive customer service commensuratethe way stop behaviour vote wallet hope others toothe stock value thing care,0.009287364516322075,0.9907126354836779,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.8103871646291076,81.03871646291077,High Trust
