customer,/users/5b153ba94de5666d34c06bcd,GB,5.0,2021-09-30 10:27:56+00:00,1.0,Amazon behave as a tricky small Asian…,"Amazon behave as a tricky small Asian shop – when you buy a small number of items and easy can control it, everything will be ok BUT if you order a significant amount of goods at different times, days they make a mess in your account. The transactions are not matched your bank transactions and order. If you calculate all the prices manually, you will find out they cheat you and you paid more than it was announced. It wouldn’t be possible to refund your money and proof the incorrect purchase. They are tricky and thief despite on how big of this company and customers expect them to be responsible and keep their reputation.",2021-09-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,30.0,628,114,38,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon behave tricky small asian shop – buy small number item easy control everything ok order significant amount good different time day make mess account transaction matched bank transaction order calculate price manually find cheat paid announced wouldn’t possible refund money proof incorrect purchase tricky thief despite big company customer expect responsible keep reputation,0.005839989733098687,0.9941600102669013,0.06393718452047112,0.2,0.8098674420375448,80.98674420375448,High Trust
