Jaime Aguirre,/users/5bdb4b4e43d2652e751c05bd,US,8.0,2021-09-29 01:27:15+00:00,1.0,"Amazon lied about their A-Z refund, unprofessional !","In August 2021 purchased an item from a vendor on Amazon.  The item never arrived.  Contacted the seller to no avail notwithstanding my CC was charged ASAP. Contacted Amazon and they promised their ""A-Z refund"" after 48 hours, Carlos, from Amazon called me on a Tuesday(next day after I reported incident), then in Wednesday again.  Then he told me the A-Z refund was established. Within the 48 hours the seller did not reply to Amazon. I was told my refund would take 3 days, that I need not contact seller ever again.  After about 10 days of nothing happening contacted Amazon again, and I was met by a rude and insolent phone operator that told me no refund was ordered in my name. I pleaded with him to bring in a manager, thinking maybe this phone attendant did not know what happened 10 days prior, to no avail.  The operator put me off.  Amazon never refunded anything. Never contacted me. No other way to reach them.  Extremely disappointed. Contacted my bank, Chase, and disputed the charges. Amazon did not do its job, aided and abetted a bad seller and treated me with disdain. Terrible !",2021-09-29 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,29.0,1099,195,52,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,august purchased item vendor amazon item never arrived contacted seller avail notwithstanding cc charged asap contacted amazon promised az refund hour carlos amazon called tuesdaynext day reported incident wednesday told az refund established within hour seller reply amazon told refund would take day need contact seller ever day nothing happening contacted amazon met rude insolent phone operator told refund ordered name pleaded bring manager thinking maybe phone attendant know happened day prior avail operator put amazon never refunded anything never contacted way reach extremely disappointed contacted bank chase disputed charge amazon job aided abetted bad seller treated d