Marie Grimes,/users/5e2605f3ddcefa90c15b3359,US,4.0,2021-09-25 17:00:41+00:00,1.0,Can't think outside of a few selected issue,"I had a technical issue with my order. I requested a call to help resolve the issue. The first representative could not understand what I was explaining, which was basic and simple and kept repeating the issue back to me incorrectly. So I just asked her to cancel the order. She canceled part of the order then had to transfer me to another agent because she was having technical difficulties canceling all the items.  When I explain to the second agent that I really didn't want to cancel the order but the previous agent could not help me, she offered no help to resolve the original problem. They are like robots that need keywords to initiate a response. If the problem is not in their tiny little box of keywords, the deer in the headlight happens. That call was painful.",2021-09-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,25.0,776,140,43,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,technical issue order requested call help resolve issue first representative could understand explaining basic simple kept repeating issue back incorrectly asked cancel order canceled part order transfer another agent technical difficulty canceling item explain second agent really didnt want cancel order previous agent could help offered help resolve original problem like robot need keywords initiate response problem tiny little box keywords deer headlight happens call painful,0.016964442715947006,0.983035557284053,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.8072216485242474,80.72216485242474,High Trust
Jayde Bell,/users/5e0cb9ef6af50238f62f4355,GB,2.0,2021-09-25 13:54:22+00:00,1.0,Let down,"On Wednesday, I was over the moon as I had been successful in purchasing a PS5 for my son for Christmas. I had been following stock releases for days. I received my tracking information which stated it would be delivered on 23/09/2021. The 23rd arrived and I eagerly waited for my delivery, regularly checking the tracking updates. I noticed my delivery timeframe kept changing, it then said it would arrive by 10 pm. 9:3pm came and no delivery, I contacted customer services who informed me the carrier is delayed and reassured me my parcel would be delivered the following day (24/09/2021). On the 24th I again kept checking the tracking information which hadn't been updated since the day before. Concerned I contacted customer services again who reassured me my parcel would be delivered by 9 pm. 8 pm arrives and still not the arrival of my parcel. I made contact with customer services again who were then stating there was an issue with the carrier and my parcel would be delivered the following. When I asked exacting where my parcel was as the tracking information had not been updated since the 23rd this question was avoided and further excuses were made. I requested to speak with a manager who was then honest and stated the tracking information had not been updated since the 23rd and the parcel had not been scanned or checked back into the depo at any point. The manager made the comment he did not know where my parcel was. After reading all the horror stories online of other customers whose PS5’s never arrived due to them going missing or being stolen I realised I was now in the same situation. I made my concerns clear to the manager that I suspected my parcel has been stolen. I have continued to be told I news to wait until the 26th to see if my parcel arrives, then I can request a refund. The fact that this is even happening is disgusting I should be able to trust the items I purchase online will be delivered. Throughout this whole process, I have been lied to, given different information and no one has told the truth.  Oh and a customer service advisor has also hung up on me today. The reality is my parcel is “missing” and I will have to request a full refund as a replacement is unable to be carried out due to go stock. I will again have to track stock and hope I manage to get another PS5 via a different retailer who hopefully actually manage to deliver it. Amazon needs to full investigate this and take action. I am sad, angry and disappointed by the lack of support and honesty from Amazon.",2021-09-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,25.0,2532,459,8,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wednesday moon successful purchasing p son christmas following stock release day received tracking information stated would delivered rd arrived eagerly waited delivery regularly checking tracking update noticed delivery timeframe kept changing said would arrive pm pm came delivery contacted customer service informed carrier delayed reassured parcel would delivered following day th kept checking tracking information hadnt updated since day concerned contacted customer service reassured parcel would delivered pm pm arrives still arrival parcel made contact customer service stating issue carrier parcel would delivered following asked exacting parcel tracking information updated since rd question avoided excuse made requested speak manager honest stated tracking information updated since rd parcel scanned checked back depo point manager made comment know parcel reading horror story online customer whose ps’s never arrived due going missing stolen realised situation made concern clear manager suspected parcel stolen continued told news wait th see parcel arrives request refund fact even happening disgusting able trust item purchase online delivered throughout whole process lied given different information one told truth oh customer service advisor also hung today reality parcel “missing” request full refund replacement unable carried due go stock track stock hope manage get another p via different retailer hopefully actually manage deliver amazon need full investigate take action sad angry disappointed lack support honesty amazon,0.01697611129541616,0.9830238887045838,0.2574312955692653,0.2,0.842998203466145,84.2998203466145,High Trust
