Gustavo,/users/614079be046bb800125977de,BR,1.0,2021-09-14 10:30:39+00:00,1.0,Punched holes and leaked contents,"I purchased a kit of Meguiars Leather cleaning from the seller Aseson (shipping and handling by Amazon) and all 4 units arrived leaking and with a small hole punched through the seal. It clearly looked like it was done on purpose, like a set up. This convinced me the product package could be easily sabotaged. Some containers felt empty, with all the content leaked or removed… easily accomplished trickery, possibly by an Amazon Employee who knew his craft. Now the carrier does not want to accept shipping the return package with the contents to Amazon because the product is leaking. And even thought amazon knows this kind of shipping is irregular and they saw many pictures I have sent they, they keep coming up with excuses and demanding pictures of the original package seal, more pictures of the box (I have sent a bunch), more pictures of the original shipping box label…. And simply refuse to provide a pre-paid return label that will work to get the spoiled product back to them. They also refuse to give my money back.",2021-09-14 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,14.0,1031,180,33,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased kit meguiars leather cleaning seller aseson shipping handling amazon unit arrived leaking small hole punched seal clearly looked like done purpose like set convinced product package could easily sabotaged container felt empty content leaked removed… easily accomplished trickery possibly amazon employee knew craft carrier want accept shipping return package content amazon product leaking even thought amazon know kind shipping irregular saw many picture sent keep coming excuse demanding picture original package seal picture box sent bunch picture original shipping box label… simply refuse provide prepaid return label work get spoiled product back also refuse give money back,0.016825130027493137,0.9831748699725069,0.10095344924284913,0.2,0.8117781248348234,81.17