R A,/users/6133659322f357001212fb6c,US,5.0,2021-09-04 12:24:58+00:00,1.0,They falsifying Prime orders,"They falsifying Prime orders! Prime means in an Amazon warehouse waiting to ship. You are not allowed to have prime items at a third party warehouse, that means not prime. They are marking everything now prime, and most of it you won't get because third party is fake, or they ship FedEx and they loose everything. Not sure why FedEx doesn't get the whole tracking thing, I get USPS and no employees, but FedEx. Therefore, Amazon Prime is fraud, stay away, unless you like to buy things you'll never get.",2021-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,4.0,504,90,28,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,falsifying prime order prime mean amazon warehouse waiting ship allowed prime item third party warehouse mean prime marking everything prime wont get third party fake ship fedex loose everything sure fedex doesnt get whole tracking thing get usps employee fedex therefore amazon prime fraud stay away unless like buy thing youll never get,0.11073851293967668,0.8892614870603233,0.050476724621424565,0.2,0.7547260884544464,75.47260884544464,High Trust
