Mia,/users/57adf1180000ff000a3a45ba,GB,22.0,2021-09-04 08:16:41+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service ever!!!,"Amazon customer service is Appalling!  I needed to return two damaged items and went through the returns process online.  The courier arrived on 3 occasions to collect them.  Each time with a car when, as items are heavy and bulky, a van is needed.  After each failed attempt I have contacted customer service by live chat and telephone.  Further collections were supposedly arranged with Hermes who didn’t turn up even after I waited in on days for them.  At this point I had contacted them at least 8 times.  The whole experience was utterly frustrating.  On 2 occasions the call was disconnected.  Eventually Amazon customer service told me I have to arrange my own courier and they will refund.  However, I tried again and, after explaining all the details again, this assistant said she went through to the large items department and had arranged the collection for the following Tuesday.  Again a courier didn’t turn up.  I tried to contact Hermes direct.  They only provide digital chat.  I inputted the parcels tracking number and waited about a week for a digital response which said they couldn’t locate the parcel.  I then went online to arrange my own courier.  The cheapest courier costs £126 yet the item cost £90.  I contacted Amazon again to check they would refund this large amount.  He said yes.  But as so many CS advisers have told me different things I don’t trust anything they say.  I am now left with two large and heavy items unlike want or can afford to fork out £126 for their return.  It definitely is the worst customer service I’ve ever experienced and I will not buy anything through them again.",2021-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,4.0,1627,281,30,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service appalling needed return two damaged item went return process online courier arrived occasion collect time car item heavy bulky van needed failed attempt contacted customer service live chat telephone collection supposedly arranged hermes didn’t turn even waited day point contacted least time whole experience utterly frustrating occasion call disconnected eventually amazon customer service told arrange courier refund however tried explaining detail assistant said went large item department arranged collection following tuesday courier didn’t turn tried contact hermes direct provide digital chat inputted parcel tracking number waited week digital response said couldn’t locate parcel went online arrange courier cheapest courier cost £ yet item cost £ contacted amazon check would refund large amount said yes many c adviser told different thing don’t trust anything say left two large heavy item unlike want afford fork £ return definitely worst customer service i’ve ever experienced buy anything,0.09752688438514621,0.9024731156148538,0.15759955131800338,0.2,0.7827564680710276,78.27564680710276,High Trust
Roy Galloway,/users/5bce41f24de5666d34d2b758,AU,6.0,2021-09-04 06:27:24+00:00,1.0,Amazon lacks customer servive.  MINUS 5 STARS,"I give one star only because I cannot give zero or minus stars.Customer service at amazon.com is non existent. It is impossible to email or contact a live person at amazon. If you do happen to come across a real person they will just tell you to go to the customer service page.   This will send you around in circles without resolving your issueMy issue relates to a missing dvd set.  Two months later   the amazon site tells me....it is running late but I can apply for a refund.   Yeah right how do I do that.Despite numerous attempts I could not get amazon.com to contact me.    A couple of times I filled out various complaint boxes explaining my problem...but rather than forward my complaaint to a person to help me I was just told to contact  customer service.The only way I could gain their attention was to get my bank to reverse the transaction taking the money back from amazon and putting it into my account, then closing that account and putting my money in another bank.    Amazon contacted me within 12 hours, but they still refuse to fix my problem ...they are only annoyed that  the money was taken back from them.I have dealt with amazon.com for over 15 years and never had a problem with them.     Has the company been sold.....do they have a new CEO....I dont know but   I am not happy with their current level of service.   I believe there is room for a new competitor in this field.",2021-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,4.0,1405,253,45,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,give one star cannot give zero minus starscustomer service amazoncom non existent impossible email contact live person amazon happen come across real person tell go customer service page send around circle without resolving issuemy issue relates missing dvd set two month later amazon site tell meit running late apply refund yeah right thatdespite numerous attempt could get amazoncom contact couple time filled various complaint box explaining problembut rather forward complaaint person help told contact customer servicethe way could gain attention get bank reverse transaction taking money back amazon putting account closing account putting money another bank amazon contacted within hour still refuse fix problem annoyed money taken back themi dealt amazoncom year never problem company solddo new ceoi dont know happy current level service believe room new competitor field,0.007789206243831156,0.9922107937561688,0.14189568143578238,0.2,0.824484533165241,82.4484533165241,High Trust
Sungmi Kim,/users/6132dfdd5d0622001360476e,CA,2.0,2021-09-04 03:12:12+00:00,1.0,Stop using Purolator for delivering…,"Stop using Purolator for delivering package for your clients. If you really care about your customer satisfaction, you should be careful who you are associated with in your business. Just go check Purolator's review. I ordered a mattress from you guys, and Purolator gave it to some random person. I was home!!! Only solution I get from Amazon, is I need to wait another 5 days so they can figure it out... Are you kidding me???? You should send me a package with different carrier!!!!!!! Don't make customer deal with bs. IT is your responsibility as You promised to deliver it on short time!!!!!!! If I knew you can't keep the promise, I would have bought from a local mattress shop from the get-go!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",2021-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,4.0,720,124,36,5,0.0,0,37,2,1,Suspicious,stop using purolator delivering package client really care customer satisfaction careful associated business go check purolators review ordered mattress guy purolator gave random person home solution get amazon need wait another day figure kidding send package different carrier dont make customer deal b responsibility promised deliver short time knew cant keep promise would bought local mattress shop getgo,1.0,0.0,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.3139091418956814,31.390914189568143,Low Trust
