Sherry Byers,/users/613226bb22f35700121284b3,US,3.0,2021-09-03 13:44:44+00:00,1.0,HACKED WHEN ATTEMPTED TO LOG IN TO PRIME VIDEO ON MY FIRESTICK!!!,"I bought a fire stick.  I tried to log in to prime video for the first time last night.  I was given a code and asked to enter it.  I got a message asking to call a number because it was my first attempt to log in?  I called the number.  I was sent an OTP and asked for the OTP.  I then was I feel ""harassed"" to pay UP FRONT for a 1 year ($129) 3 year ($219, I think) or 5 year ($299) plan to ""SAVE"" money?  If I did not, then I would have to pay a one time $69 dollar fee to access the prime video????  I have been ""CHATTING"" with amazon for an hour.  I repeatedly asked about the ""deals"" and ""pricing"" and got switched around to three different people.  At the end I told him that I had all the answers to my questions ""EXCEPT' the guy trying to sell me the plans.  I was trying to see if I had been hacked.  He tried to blame it on xfinity????  I was speaking to amazon when it happened? I gave them the code and the OTP?  I don't know how it happened but I was HACKED through either my fire stick or the number that came throught the internet that I was to call?  AMAZON, PLEASE INVESTIGATE THIS!!!!  BUYERS BEWARE!!!Sincerely,Sherry ByersBuena Vista, VA.",2021-09-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,3.0,1159,229,65,12,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,bought fire stick tried log prime video first time last night given code asked enter got message asking call number first attempt log called number sent otp asked otp feel harassed pay front year year think year plan save money would pay one time dollar fee access prime video chatting amazon hour repeatedly asked deal pricing got switched around three different people end told answer question except guy trying sell plan trying see hacked tried blame xfinity speaking amazon happened gave code otp dont know happened hacked either fire stick number came throught internet call amazon please investigate buyer bewaresincerelysherry byersbuena vista va,0.9983029045169981,0.001697095483001898,0.12843522153673584,0.2,0.3265355920488481,32.65355920488481,Low Trust
