Anonymous from West Sussex,/users/5e5e8bcc1a9169d747a75fb2,GB,6.0,2021-09-02 18:48:18+00:00,2.0,Amazon Prime Video false content,"I think Amazon Prime Video is going downhill. It links to netflix but I've been finding more and more cases of recommended watches show up but when you click on 'watch on Netflix' the programme either doesn't exist on Netflix, or it takes you to a film/programme with exactly the same name on Netflix (but not the one advertised). If it doesn't exist then don't promote it... It makes it look like there is more good stuff to watch than there really is. Not very ethical and clearly not being properly monitored by Amazon.",2021-09-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,2.0,522,94,32,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,think amazon prime video going downhill link netflix ive finding case recommended watch show click watch netflix programme either doesnt exist netflix take filmprogramme exactly name netflix one advertised doesnt exist dont promote make look like good stuff watch really ethical clearly properly monitored amazon,0.047346154286382794,0.9526538457136172,0.05272013460459899,0.4,1.0868709497777285,108.68709497777284,High Trust
Lubaina Ali,/users/60d1f66729910d001a54c9a6,SE,5.0,2021-09-02 18:46:57+00:00,1.0,'Buy again' option is a trap!,"'Buy again' option is a trapI bought a book from Amazon.com and due to some security features, the first attempt on my Mastercard did not allow the payment. I got a 'rejected payment' notification from Amazon when I logged in the following day. I used a different card and clicked on 'buy again' as there was no other option. I was then charged for 2 books of the same title. When I eventually realised this, I tried cancelling one of them, but the time was apparently 'too close to it being delivered' for cancellation. Moments later, it was being shipped .I have received one copy of the book and not the other. I therefore cannot return the book as it is not in my possession in addition to needing some refund slip from Amazon. I cannot get a hold of any person or chat that enables me to explain this and get a refund into my account. Totally frustrating. This is the first and final time I will attempt to shop on Amazon. What a disappointment!",2021-09-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,2.0,950,176,29,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,buy option trapi bought book amazoncom due security feature first attempt mastercard allow payment got rejected payment notification amazon logged following day used different card clicked buy option charged book title eventually realised tried cancelling one time apparently close delivered cancellation moment later shipped received one copy book therefore cannot return book possession addition needing refund slip amazon cannot get hold person chat enables explain get refund account totally frustrating first final time attempt shop amazon disappointment,0.025521930674173784,0.9744780693258263,0.09871003925967471,0.2,0.806981042514848,80.6981042514848,High Trust
DSC,/users/5e612c93d24398943cedd2af,US,2.0,2021-09-02 14:43:35+00:00,1.0,Amazon customer service is the worst I’ve ever dealt with.,"Why does Amazon allow their delivery services to flat out lie to their “Prime” customers. For my birthday i ordered several items for myself. One package was marked as delivered at 1015am on delivery day. I checked at 9pm and still hadn’t received the items. “Tricia” at Amazon proceeded to tell me that they allow carriers to mark packages as delivered even though they haven’t been, I suppose in an attempt to cover their @&&. She mentioned a “grace period” that they allow the carrier and that the package wouldn’t be considered late for an additional 24 hours. So even though as a prime member, delivery was GUARANTEED, I was just out of luck. What is this nonsense?!?  Worst customer service ever. Wouldn’t even entertain the idea of a refund until 24 hours later.  What a bunch of 🐂 💩",2021-09-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,2.0,790,140,58,10,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon allow delivery service flat lie “prime” customer birthday ordered several item one package marked delivered delivery day checked pm still hadn’t received item “tricia” amazon proceeded tell allow carrier mark package delivered even though haven’t suppose attempt cover mentioned “grace period” allow carrier package wouldn’t considered late additional hour even though prime member delivery guaranteed luck nonsense worst customer service ever wouldn’t even entertain idea refund hour later bunch 🐂 💩,0.07007054488411735,0.9299294551158827,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.7806685974401623,78.06685974401623,High Trust
