Tyrone,/users/5c1010288d4dd134061426f2,GB,9.0,2021-09-02 10:21:49+00:00,1.0,Amazon UK - one star ratingI…,"If I could give a minus star rating I would. I have been a Prime member since 2014, place over 900 orders. I placed an order, Amazon uses Hermes in the UK for delivery here is the funny part Hermes issues  a tracking number, guess what they cannot  track where my parcel is. Despite several conversations I have had several excuses, Hermes could not find my address, one Customer service agent told me it would  be delivered on the bank holiday, when. I challenged him this was not possible because it was a Bank Holiday in the UK, he then told me Tuesday, never arrived. Escalated to a manage Stuart, from Amazon management team (the highest level of escalation in Amazon), in the UK Scotland, assured me he would call back guess what still waiting for the call back? I think we should start  a movement to boycott Amazon.  Appalling customer service, appalling service",2021-09-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,2.0,870,154,29,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,could give minus star rating would prime member since place order placed order amazon us hermes uk delivery funny part hermes issue tracking number guess cannot track parcel despite several conversation several excuse hermes could find address one customer service agent told would delivered bank holiday challenged possible bank holiday uk told tuesday never arrived escalated manage stuart amazon management team highest level escalation amazon uk scotland assured would call back guess still waiting call back think start movement boycott amazon appalling customer service appalling service,0.054183547652808826,0.9458164523471911,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.7901824830440386,79.01824830440385,High Trust
