James Dalrymple,/users/61309bf7e5619300129d2a9b,GB,2.0,2021-09-02 09:41:27+00:00,1.0,PLEASE CAN SOMEONE FROM AMAZON SELLER…,"PLEASE CAN SOMEONE FROM AMAZON SELLER CENTRAL CONTACT ME!? (Extons Roofing Supplies)We stopped selling on amazon UK in February 2021. Amazon have held our reserve for 8 months now a total of £1,071.52.we need this back we are only a small business.Every month amazon moves the payment date. the laterst says Transfer of £1,071.52 scheduled to initiate on 13/09/2021*When we get to this date it will move on another month.PLEASE AMAZON CAN YOU HELP!? We are a small business and can not afford to let £1071.52 go.",2021-09-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,9.0,2.0,512,87,38,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,please someone amazon seller central contact extons roofing supplieswe stopped selling amazon uk february amazon held reserve month total £we need back small businessevery month amazon move payment date laterst say transfer £ scheduled initiate get date move another monthplease amazon help small business afford let £ go,0.2650248113243808,0.7349751886756192,0.04879416713404375,0.2,0.6772464277646183,67.72464277646183,Medium Trust
