Mimi,/users/611b486f05fd280012a36415,US,3.0,2021-08-30 00:01:24+00:00,1.0,WHAT A NIGHTMARE!,"What a nightmare! Amazon keeps delivering my items to other addresses. Their customer service keeps making beautiful promises they do not keep. A neighbor had their package misdelivered to my address, and they got verbally aggressive with me. I am a law abiding citizen and polite person, and did not appreciate the confrontation.  I also have to struggle  to get refunds for items that even their tracking system shows was never delivered to us --- even after 5 days! One item was NEVER delivered, and they claimed they would send me a replacement, and I NEVER got it nor did I ever get a refund. The replacement simply disappeared from my account, so there is no record of it ever having been shipped, and it appears as if the original item had been delivered when it had not been delivered. I am wondering how many more customers have been ripped off this way?  I am now shopping on other sites, as Amazon is no longer trustworthy. It is being run by people who appear to be shysters.  The new CEO needs to lose his job. He's running the company into the ground.",2021-08-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,30.0,1065,192,17,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,nightmare amazon keep delivering item address customer service keep making beautiful promise keep neighbor package misdelivered address got verbally aggressive law abiding citizen polite person appreciate confrontation also struggle get refund item even tracking system show never delivered u even day one item never delivered claimed would send replacement never got ever get refund replacement simply disappeared account record ever shipped appears original item delivered delivered wondering many customer ripped way shopping site amazon longer trustworthy run people appear shyster new ceo need lose job he running company ground,0.3152613396049343,0.6847386603950657,0.1076836791923724,0.2,0.6639060660360073,66.39060660360073,Medium Trust
Cris L,/users/612c1ef45602a60012770447,US,1.0,2021-08-29 23:57:58+00:00,1.0,There's been a lot of wrong items sent…,"There's been a lot of wrong items sent to me lately. I've shopped at Amazon for years and recently there's more errors with the orders. I notice this is more common with high priced items being 'mistaken' for much cheaper ones. My last order was supposedly delivered to me, which was supposed to be a $60 drink mix pack, and instead I had received someone's clearly worn and returned sports bra. What's so hard about installing a camera system to have full view of all employees as they work?! I had to spend 2 hours of my Sunday trying to print a return label and drive around to the nearest actual UPS drop off location for their mistake. Now I have to wait even longer and hope they can get it right this time. Makes me feel as though I now have to video-record picking up my package at the locker in its entirety, which is ridiculous. I was reading somewhere that Amazon is instilling a lot of fear in employees and publicly shaming those who are caught stealing but I feel that simply installing more cameras and looking into discrepancies as they happen would prove more effective in getting rid of dishonest workers.",2021-08-29 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,29.0,1123,204,39,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,there lot wrong item sent lately ive shopped amazon year recently there error order notice common high priced item mistaken much cheaper one last order supposedly delivered supposed drink mix pack instead received someone clearly worn returned sport bra whats hard installing camera system full view employee work spend hour sunday trying print return label drive around nearest actual ups drop location mistake wait even longer hope get right time make feel though videorecord picking package locker entirety ridiculous reading somewhere amazon instilling lot fear employee publicly shaming caught stealing feel simply installing camera looking discrepancy happen would prove effective getting rid dishonest worker,0.029641138511263796,0.9703588614887362,0.11441390914189568,0.2,0.8080622125727471,80.80622125727471,High Trust
