Moria,/users/61016cb792c194001342e3b1,US,2.0,2021-08-28 03:56:26+00:00,2.0,Amazon Customer service was helping my…,"Amazon Customer service was helping my sort out a subscription issue.  They mirrored my fire 7 screen to help navigate the issue.  The problem I have with that was that the customer service representative insisted that I log in to the subscription's website, use my amazon uid/pwd to log in to the subcription's app.  Ok - But... the screen mirroring was on and she wanted me to  check the box to show the password!  TO MY AMAZON ACCOUNT!  I just kept messing up my password until she got impatient & got off the phone call and mirror of my fire 7 tablet.  Then I went out and fixed the issue myself.  Poor practice on Amazon Customer Service's part by wanting a person to put in their password WHILE MIRRORING IS ON.  And insisting that I check the box to show my password.  Suspicious...",2021-08-28 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,28.0,789,143,39,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service helping sort subscription issue mirrored fire screen help navigate issue problem customer service representative insisted log subscription website use amazon uidpwd log subcriptions app ok screen mirroring wanted check box show password amazon account kept messing password got impatient got phone call mirror fire tablet went fixed issue poor practice amazon customer service part wanting person put password mirroring insisting check box show password suspicious,0.22536908636740094,0.7746309136325991,0.08020190689848569,0.4,1.0033558381959966,100.33558381959966,High Trust
Michael Davidson,/users/6129a6ce24140e00125fc0ad,US,1.0,2021-08-28 03:00:41+00:00,1.0,Unacceptable. Hit my limit…,I ordered an action camera from Amazon on Wednesday. It said One day delivery. I needed in one day or at worst two days as I purchased it to take on my honeymoon to Hawaii. It made it from TN to my state of NC overnight and showed out for delivery the next morning. I then get a message that my delivery is delayed and it will be Friday or Saturday before my package arrives. I leave Saturday morning at 7am for my honeymoon. As it stands it’s Friday night and it hasn’t showed up. I am now forced to cancel my order. I called customer support and filed a complaint. I cancelled my Prime membership (as it is obviously useless) and I will be closing my Amazon Prime Visa. For a company as big as Amazon this is unacceptable.,2021-08-28 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,28.0,724,140,27,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered action camera amazon wednesday said one day delivery needed one day worst two day purchased take honeymoon hawaii made tn state nc overnight showed delivery next morning get message delivery delayed friday saturday package arrives leave saturday morning honeymoon stand it’s friday night hasn’t showed forced cancel order called customer support filed complaint cancelled prime membership obviously useless closing amazon prime visa company big amazon unacceptable,0.013311172843395289,0.9866888271566047,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.8090482834605233,80.90482834605233,High Trust
Carmen LeBlanc,/users/6129746a24140e00125fb5c4,US,1.0,2021-08-27 23:25:40+00:00,1.0,"Pollutes Without Conscience, Unaccountable to Customers","In a single order, all at the same time with one payment, we ordered 12 horse lunge whips (we use them as dog toys). They were shipped to us ONE to a BOX, 12 very large, long boxes. Since whips are slender as a pencil, 12 whips would easily have fit in one box. We talked to Amazon ""support,"" and their answer was to shrug and blame it on ""the system."" So Amazon's system apparently lacks common sense or any environmental policy regarding the waste of resources on packing and shipping these completely unnecessary 12 boxes. They also said there's no option for me to reorder in the future and ensure the items are sent in one box. Can you imagine ordering 12 lemons online through Safeway, and Safeway bags them for you one lemon to a bag?? Amazon is irresponsible, pollutes our Earth without conscience, and is completely unaccountable to customers.",2021-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,27.0,852,152,55,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,single order time one payment ordered horse lunge whip use dog toy shipped u one box large long box since whip slender pencil whip would easily fit one box talked amazon support answer shrug blame system amazon system apparently lack common sense environmental policy regarding waste resource packing shipping completely unnecessary box also said there option reorder future ensure item sent one box imagine ordering lemon online safeway safeway bag one lemon bag amazon irresponsible pollutes earth without conscience completely unaccountable customer,0.009268140932851495,0.9907318590671486,0.08524957936062816,0.2,0.8124158454056999,81.24158454056999,High Trust
RAS,/users/61294fa2520e7e00129f2185,US,1.0,2021-08-27 20:48:40+00:00,2.0,I loved amazon in the recent years as…,"I loved amazon in the recent years as it seemed to just get better, however today I noticed changes to prime only offering free shipping over $25.I was quite frustrated by the end of my shopping which ended up taking 2 hrs for 1 item since the sellers were falsely describing the item (custom name necklace) searching for gold plated 925 sterling ad I cannot wear metals.Many put 925 in description yet when you read details it states ""stainless steel"" it was very annoying.Shipping rates were not included & prime was only over $25.Disappointed in the lack of simplicity I have always liked amazon for, might as well go to ebay or alibaba and get lower prices.",2021-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,27.0,661,117,38,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,loved amazon recent year seemed get better however today noticed change prime offering free shipping quite frustrated end shopping ended taking hr item since seller falsely describing item custom name necklace searching gold plated sterling ad cannot wear metalsmany put description yet read detail state stainless steel annoyingshipping rate included prime disappointed lack simplicity always liked amazon might well go ebay alibaba get lower price,0.021165806703837168,0.9788341932961628,0.06561974200785194,0.4,1.1025410450496518,110.25410450496518,High Trust
