Calvin Pederson,/users/61293479520e7e00129f158e,US,1.0,2021-08-27 18:52:47+00:00,1.0,Honestly if I had the option to choose…,"Honestly if I had the option to choose no stars I would. The past 3 packages have arrived completely broken, at the time I had Amazon prime and tried to get a refund or at least a replacement for the orders and no luck. All the customer service agents have terrible trouble shooting skills and overall bad English. I understand that almost all of them are located in third world countries such as India. But I get a little frustrated when I spend over 1,000 dollars on a laptop that arrived totally broken that I can't even get a refund for..",2021-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,27.0,542,101,39,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,honestly option choose star would past package arrived completely broken time amazon prime tried get refund least replacement order luck customer service agent terrible trouble shooting skill overall bad english understand almost located third world country india get little frustrated spend dollar laptop arrived totally broken cant even get refund,0.009847626463244077,0.9901523735367559,0.056646102075154234,0.2,0.8064054071834088,80.64054071834089,High Trust
