Aaron,/users/5a4d1fbf0000ff000afa40a3,GB,60.0,2021-08-27 16:57:15+00:00,1.0,"Parcel delivered with no item, refuse to refund","Parcel delivered with no itemTold to return it for a refund, which makes no sense as there was no itemThen told a refund can’t be issued as no item was returned.I have then had to contact Amazon 20 times who keep putting me through to a ‘special team’ only which they can resolve, and every time they email me back saying that the return was received with no item, and as such they can’t refund me.I have written and called to head office, but no one cares.4 months of chasing and still £185 out of pocket.",2021-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,27.0,506,96,47,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,parcel delivered itemtold return refund make sense itemthen told refund can’t issued item returnedi contact amazon time keep putting ‘special team’ resolve every time email back saying return received item can’t refund mei written called head office one care month chasing still £ pocket,0.08473618314507118,0.9152638168549289,0.0538418395961862,0.2,0.7684002763467016,76.84002763467016,High Trust
customer Nick,/users/5e6ce0f4dffcf7514e8ad4de,GB,13.0,2021-08-27 12:36:55+00:00,2.0,UNRELIABLE AMAZON DON’T CARE,"I have been an amazon customer for many years and a prime subscriber for nearly as long. Recently, i have notices a sharp decline in the service provided by Amazon, most notably, their inability to deliver items on time or even on the same day. I order a pair of headphones for next day delivery which were dispatched that day, then shipped in the early hours, the item was sent out for delivery and a slot for delivery was sent. This time came and went and a corporate apology e mail sent. Having waiting in all day, I had to go out and at 9pm, I received a call, stating a delivery was attempted but i was not in. Driver said he would deliver following day. Today, i have been informed that the item has been sent back to the local sorting office and a delay has been experienced in delivery and no one knows (or cares, as they have my money) why or when i will receive the item and this is on the Prime service.This is FAR FROM A PRIME SERVICE and is happening more often than not now. Not only to you pay your annual subscription, you also pay a PREMIUM PRICE for PREMIUM DELIVERY which doesn’t occur. I have attempted to speak with customer service who just read out and repeat the scant information from the tracking info. In reality, the delivery companies take on work beyond their abilities in their greedy pursuit of wealth and when things go wrong, they just brush the problem aside and carry on as if nothing has happened, they have no real strategy for dealing with balls ups. THIS IS UNACCEPTABLE and I shan’t be using Amazon anymore, there are better and more reliable options out there. This seems to be my only option now and i advise others to do the same and save their money! NOT RECOMMENDED!",2021-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,27.0,1712,319,28,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer many year prime subscriber nearly long recently notice sharp decline service provided amazon notably inability deliver item time even day order pair headphone next day delivery dispatched day shipped early hour item sent delivery slot delivery sent time came went corporate apology e mail sent waiting day go pm received call stating delivery attempted driver said would deliver following day today informed item sent back local sorting office delay experienced delivery one know care money receive item prime servicethis far prime service happening often pay annual subscription also pay premium price premium delivery doesn’t occur attempted speak customer service read repeat scant information tracking info reality delivery company take work beyond ability greedy pursuit wealth thing go wrong brush problem aside carry nothing happened real strategy dealing ball ups unacceptable shan’t using amazon anymore better reliable option seems option advise others save money recommended,0.18619763033880957,0.8138023696611905,0.17891194615816042,0.4,1.0426835740622273,104.26835740622273,High Trust
