J T,/users/60241e98b2252d001ad59726,DK,4.0,2021-08-23 23:46:39+00:00,1.0,Ignored - Children's Safety Issues,"Again, This is another follow up to my previous review. Where Amazon BROKE THE LAW by delivering a 18+ ID Verification required VAPE Kit to my 13 year old son, with no questions asked. Their Customer Services manager emailed me saying they took this very seriously and would make an investigation I have now asked their customer service department constantly for 6 months for an report on the investigation. But they ignore me.Today I told them I needed it urgently to give to the police to show that they had done an actual investigation into why this happened.They have not replied and yet again ignored me.Their customer services is appalling. They obviously dont care about children's safety. Which as a parent i take a top priority. They should not have a licence to sell goods. I for one will never use their services again.",2021-08-23 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,23.0,830,144,34,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,another follow previous review amazon broke law delivering id verification required vape kit year old son question asked customer service manager emailed saying took seriously would make investigation asked customer service department constantly month report investigation ignore metoday told needed urgently give police show done actual investigation happenedthey replied yet ignored metheir customer service appalling obviously dont care childrens safety parent take top priority licence sell good one never use service,0.03259180275767108,0.967408197242329,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.7998566505000204,79.98566505000204,High Trust
