Ana Filipa Pereira,/users/53a79cae00006400017ad690,PT,4.0,2021-08-23 17:05:09+00:00,1.0,"I was robbed by Amazon, as a seller.","I opened an account in order to sell on Amazon Handmade. I was told I needed to open a business account, pay the subscription fee and wait for it to be approved. Then I could ask for the individual account and ask for a refund. I waited for months but Amazon did not accept any of my documents, I sent a bunch of them, all good I can assure you. Months went by and I started to ask for a refund. I received automatic emails saying they couldn’t help me. this went for months!! I decided to ask for my account to be closed and a refund for my subscription. They did close the account, but never refund me. All I wanted since the beginning was to sell on Amazon Handmade. I started selling on Etsy instead, of course. In one hour I was up and good to go on Etsy! But I was robbed by Amazon. If a person wants to sell as an individual is forced to pay a subscription with the promise that the amount will be refunded, but is not and you cant do anything about it.Amazon never replied to any of my emails and requests. I was robbed. This is incredible for a huge company to treat sellers like this. Only big companies can do this and get away with it as nothing happened. Shame on Amazon.",2021-08-23 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,23.0,1184,232,36,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,opened account order sell amazon handmade told needed open business account pay subscription fee wait approved could ask individual account ask refund waited month amazon accept document sent bunch good assure month went started ask refund received automatic email saying couldn’t help went month decided ask account closed refund subscription close account never refund wanted since beginning sell amazon handmade started selling etsy instead course one hour good go etsy robbed amazon person want sell individual forced pay subscription promise amount refunded cant anything itamazon never replied email request robbed incredible huge company treat seller like big company get away nothing happened shame amazon,0.625926128318616,0.37407387168138395,0.13011777902411667,0.2,0.5130604916455153,51.306049164551524,Medium Trust
