Andrew,/users/5405b7810000640001881db9,US,2.0,2021-08-23 14:54:02+00:00,1.0,Amazon is HORRIBLE,"Amazon is HORRIBLE. They used to be a good source to purchase and I have been a prime member for years. Lately the products are not as good, the return process has gotten to be so complicated. The one thing that we used to pay for was ""2 DAY SHIPPING"" that was free with your prime membership. Now it is 50/50 at best with items that are promised at check-out to be delivered in two days to actually get there. My inbox is FULL of ""Your package is on the way but running late. We’re sorry for the delay."" They can't be trusted to fulfill which brings me back to buying local and most retailers now are making a huge effort to price match. To all prospective new amazon shoppers. Think twice before shelling out your hard earned money for a service that is meh at best and a customer service that leaves a lot to be desired.",2021-08-23 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,23.0,823,158,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon horrible used good source purchase prime member year lately product good return process gotten complicated one thing used pay day shipping free prime membership best item promised checkout delivered two day actually get inbox full package way running late we’re sorry delay cant trusted fulfill brings back buying local retailer making huge effort price match prospective new amazon shopper think twice shelling hard earned money service meh best customer service leaf lot desired,0.04398196050004643,0.9560180394999536,0.0886146943353898,0.2,0.7957319586170547,79.57319586170547,High Trust
TLS TN,/users/6123009150eb5100126a0f55,US,1.0,2021-08-23 01:57:47+00:00,1.0,I would give ZERO stars if possible,"I would give ZERO stars if possible. Horrible service and total lack of responsiveness to calls.  The Amazon driver hit the post for the control pad for my automatic gate. I reported it within an hour of when it occurred and completed all of the online forms required for my claim which included uploading photos. A couple of days later I received an email from the adjuster stating that I had no proof that the Amazon was responsible. (I suppose we are all supposed to have video surveillance of every corner of our property running 24/7- huge eye roll). I requested to speak to a supervisor numerous times via email and never received a response.  I also made numerous calls but the only option is to leave a message; you can speak to anyone-ever.Now, several months later and after speaking to the associates at Amazon logistics several times,  I'm  taking the only course of action I have left... a public bashing.  ARC adjudicates that I am a liar without even the courtesy of hearing my account of what transpired.  I'll guess I'll have to eat the $150 to fix my gate control but I'll also be absolutely sure to tell my story to anyone and everyone who will listen.",2021-08-23 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,23.0,1171,209,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,would give zero star possible horrible service total lack responsiveness call amazon driver hit post control pad automatic gate reported within hour occurred completed online form required claim included uploading photo couple day later received email adjuster stating proof amazon responsible suppose supposed video surveillance every corner property running huge eye roll requested speak supervisor numerous time via email never received response also made numerous call option leave message speak anyoneevernow several month later speaking associate amazon logistics several time im taking course action left public bashing arc adjudicates liar without even courtesy hearing account transpired ill guess ill eat fix gate control ill also absolutely sure tell story anyone everyone listen,0.009951309404370133,0.9900486905956298,0.11721817162086372,0.2,0.8184679796219877,81.84679796219876,High Trust
symmetry,/users/6122bee950eb51001269fc8f,US,2.0,2021-08-22 21:17:41+00:00,1.0,More incompetent at delivery than usual?,"Due to a kidney transplant my vaccine probably doesn't protect me very well, and live alone, so at the moment (Aug 2021) I'm very dependent on delivery services.Amazon used to be fairly dependable.  Currently, they are anything but.  Over half of my recent deliveries have been delayed by 1-5 business days, with the occasional package simply being lost.  Whatever it is that's leading to the recent increase in incompetence, STOP LYING ABOUT THE DELIVERY DATE and provide a more accurate estimate that I can use for planning purposes.Also, the frequency with which packages are delivered to the wrong address is infuriating/appalling; on my account I provide detailed, clear directions on how to get to my door, yet about half of my deliveries are dropped off at the wrong building or doorstep in my apartment complex, and as someone who uses a cane to walk, I cannot go from door, up and down many flights of stairs, searching for my package, physically speaking.  Even more appallingly, on a few occasions, a driver has dropped all packages for the entire 6-building apartment complex outside in the open/rain in a big pile.  I've been on the phone a few dozen times with Amazon's customer shipping department over the past year about this exact same issue -- they look at my directions and remark on how clear and detailed they are, apologize, assure me that this will not happen again, but... it still does.  Might the issue be not to give each driver so many deliveries that they end up cutting corners and not bothering to look at the directions?It's a huge relief when I find out a package I ordered from Amazon is coming via UPS or FedEx because then I usually get it on time AND at the right location... and only needed to call each of those companies' customer service numbers once to fix the any misdelivery issues.",2021-08-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,22.0,1827,317,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,due kidney transplant vaccine probably doesnt protect well live alone moment aug im dependent delivery servicesamazon used fairly dependable currently anything half recent delivery delayed business day occasional package simply lost whatever thats leading recent increase incompetence stop lying delivery date provide accurate estimate use planning purposesalso frequency package delivered wrong address infuriatingappalling account provide detailed clear direction get door yet half delivery dropped wrong building doorstep apartment complex someone us cane walk cannot go door many flight stair searching package physically speaking even appallingly occasion driver dropped package entire building apartment complex outside openrain big pile ive phone dozen time amazon customer shipping department past year exact issue look direction remark clear detailed apologize assure happen still might issue give driver many delivery end cutting corner bothering look directionsits huge relief find package ordered amazon coming via ups fedex usually get time right location needed call company customer service number fix misdelivery issue,0.006453675942524398,0.9935463240574756,0.1777902411665732,0.2,0.8323312102620524,83.23312102620524,High Trust
