Katharine Ford,/users/5694ebe30000ff0001fb8285,GB,53.0,2021-08-20 10:20:36+00:00,1.0,Customer Service 'Chat' is a waste of your time it resolves nothing,I have just had a frustrating (entirely unproductive) hour and a half trying to resolve a simple issue with Amazon Prime. The people on the chat kept dropping out of the conversation and changing - and they clearly had not read the entire conversation prior to engaging with me. This meant that I needed to repeat the issue over and over again to people who were not fully engaged in their job. The whole exercise was a waste of an hour and a half of my time sitting at the computer responding to people who were either not there or just didn't bother to process the details of the conversation as I was passed from on person to another. No-one apologized or seemed to care much about my problem and no-one was able to resolve it.  I am now contacting my bank to stop amazon Prime payments and will stop ordering from them - and return to dealing directly with sellers. Amazon's disregard for the time of their customers is breath taking.,2021-08-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,20.0,938,172,67,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,frustrating entirely unproductive hour half trying resolve simple issue amazon prime people chat kept dropping conversation changing clearly read entire conversation prior engaging meant needed repeat issue people fully engaged job whole exercise waste hour half time sitting computer responding people either didnt bother process detail conversation passed person another noone apologized seemed care much problem noone able resolve contacting bank stop amazon prime payment stop ordering return dealing directly seller amazon disregard time customer breath taking,0.051109295174231774,0.9488907048257682,0.09646662927650028,0.2,0.7937386782681841,79.37386782681841,High Trust
