Misaki,/users/61149a855b450000128c6d13,US,3.0,2021-08-12 04:09:12+00:00,1.0,Dosen't deserve it's reputation!,"I used to use Amazon a lot because it was the only online store that I thought was safe. Now that I have looked at (and switched to) other online stores, I'm never going back to amazon.The only, ONLY benefit of using Amazon is that delivery is (usually) quick compared to other online stores. However Amazon is shown to be more expensive than other online stores as well, which basically means that it forces you to pay for a quicker delivery! And even with this being the only good thing about it it still fails sometimes! I used it for about 4 months before finding out that other websites were better, and in that time I have had 2 items that never got delievered, yet I still got charged for with no refund! Try comparing this to other websites with a reputation for being unsafe like Aliexpress, which I have used for 2 years with zero isssues, and take a look at how ""safe"" Amazon is now. On top of everything else, Amazon (in my experience) has a very small variety of items compared to other online stores).In summary, it is- expensive, unsafe, has poor customer service, limited in items, and just dosen't deserve its good reputation in general. If you use Amazon a lot then switch to other websites- you wont regret it!",2021-08-12 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,12.0,1229,224,32,4,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,used use amazon lot online store thought safe looked switched online store im never going back amazonthe benefit using amazon delivery usually quick compared online store however amazon shown expensive online store well basically mean force pay quicker delivery even good thing still fails sometimes used month finding website better time item never got delievered yet still got charged refund try comparing website reputation unsafe like aliexpress used year zero isssues take look safe amazon top everything else amazon experience small variety item compared online storesin s