Helen,/users/5bcda0034de5666d342b6002,GB,16.0,2021-08-11 17:27:00+00:00,2.0,Downhill all the way,"Prime is no longer worth it. Items that say in the listings are next day for members delivery turn out not to be. Items are also not always delivered on time. Waited in on Saturday for an item; three times the time slot changed, and when it had not turned up at 10pm I investigated further only to find a message saying that it should turn up within 2 days! On Sunday evening it did show but not with the item that was due on that day! I would rather shop elsewhere even if I have to pay postage and packing. As for Prime Video, well, what can I say? It is just not worth paying for the very few films and programmes that are of any quality. You have lost my membership, and by the looks of it the good ship Amazon is sinking fast.",2021-08-11 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,11.0,731,146,20,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,prime longer worth item say listing next day member delivery turn item also always delivered time waited saturday item three time time slot changed turned pm investigated find message saying turn within day sunday evening show item due day would rather shop elsewhere even pay postage packing prime video well say worth paying film programme quality lost membership look good ship amazon sinking fast,0.3251945875417556,0.6748054124582443,0.08188446438586652,0.4,0.9537795991062954,95.37795991062954,High Trust
