Judgement Day,/users/5350325d00006400016ece1d,GB,82.0,2021-08-09 12:07:51+00:00,1.0,I'm a prime member and I'm discusted…,"I'm a prime member and I'm discusted with their service, out of 75 parcels delivered this year so far, 16 have gone missing, 36 have been damaged, Smashed, dropped in water, thrown over garden fence and randomly put in safe places that do not even exist! 12 boxes have actually arrived with NOTHING IN THE BOXES! No damage to the outside of these boxes either so amazon have fraudulently taken money and not sent items.And to make matters worse amazon refuses to let you leave negative feedback. So both amazon and seller are free to do what they want. When you leave a factual negative review you always get a email saying ""after careful reviewing of your feedback, your review could not be posted""Every single negative review gets this reply from amazon.Plus prime TV is utter pants, nothing worth even 1 cents on this poor poor TV show platform.I'm going back to Netflix and ebay again now, much better shows and delivery of items.DO NOT TRUST AMAZON",2021-08-09 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,9.0,953,167,37,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,im prime member im discusted service parcel delivered year far gone missing damaged smashed dropped water thrown garden fence randomly put safe place even exist box actually arrived nothing box damage outside box either amazon fraudulently taken money sent itemsand make matter worse amazon refuse let leave negative feedback amazon seller free want leave factual negative review always get email saying careful reviewing feedback review could postedevery single negative review get reply amazonplus prime tv utter pant nothing worth even cent poor poor tv show platformim going back netflix ebay much better show delivery itemsdo trust amazon,0.6458911171544736,0.35410888284552644,0.09366236679753225,0.2,0.49578691478226966,49.578691478226965,Low Trust
Christopher Fitzgerald,/users/611089c7bf368400125db81f,US,1.0,2021-08-09 01:51:43+00:00,1.0,So I Bought a grill off Amazon  through…,"So I Bought a grill off Amazon  through  a 3rd party  Grill came in damaged  we refused  it when UPS tried delivering it  because  of the damage  I emailed  Amazon  explained  what happened  and also the seller  I asked them to just send me a new grill  because  I needed  for my outdoor  kitchen  weeks went by no updates so I decided  to reach  out to the seller  they basically stop responding  so therefore  I went to Amazon  and told them the situation  I emailed  them the pictures , I even sent  them the slip were UPS sent it back to them  and still Amazon  is saying  it's not enough  to get me a refund  so basically  a month and a half  later I have no grill and they are  refusing  to give me my money back !!! So Amazon  said since it's a 3rd party that they have exhausted  all of there options and there is nothing  they can do for me sooo I'm basically  out of almost  $1500 !! So I have reached out to my credit  card company  to dispute  the transaction  !! Which  honestly  I should  have never had to do at this point   so with that please  note even though  you purchase  the product on  Amazon  if it's a 3rd party  Amazon  does not stand  behind  that company  if they decide  not to give you your money  back !!Company  Name by the way is Deal supply  very unprofessional  and do not respond  to problems   would never do business  with them !!",2021-08-09 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,9.0,1368,256,40,8,0.0,0,11,2,1,Suspicious,bought grill amazon rd party grill came damaged refused ups tried delivering damage emailed amazon explained happened also seller asked send new grill needed outdoor kitchen week went update decided reach seller basically stop responding therefore went amazon told situation emailed picture even sent slip ups sent back still amazon saying enough get refund basically month half later grill refusing give money back a