Kyle Ellis,/users/610ffe3e5e1e9a0012796ca4,US,1.0,2021-08-08 15:54:45+00:00,1.0,I want to tell my story about Amazon.....,"I want to tell my story and leave a review about Amazon.Earlier this year (Spring of 2021), I was barred from leaving customer reviews and asking/answering customer product inquiries on Amazon.com with NO EXPLANATION as to what specifically I did wrong to justify this. I was sent a vague, generic email stating I had ""violated Community Guidelines"" and that I had previously been given a warning about this (warning was one, similar type email both vague and generic, and gave NO SPECIFIC allegation of my supposed ""violation of Community Guidelines"". I have repeatedly emailed AND called AND online ""chat"" trying to get to the bottom of this, and Amazon outright REFUSES to respond. I've been trying and trying to resolve this with Amazon. If I knew what guideline I violated, it wouldnt happen again. But like they say: ""How can you fix what you dont know is broken???""The way I go about leaving customer reviews is: if you sell me a great product, I will sing the praises of that product and you'll get most likely 5 Stars from me. If you sell me something damaged/defective, poor quality, used, etc I will slam and destroy you in a review. But Im always honest, and do not lie and make up falsehoods, exaggerate, for the good or the bad, I simply: TELL IT LIKE IT IS.The last review on Amazon I left was a particularly BAD review about a drone I purchased that had MULTIPLE shortcomings: It was damaged AND defective. It not only didnt work at all, it also had a front light missing  as well. A loose wire protruding out the bottom of the drone. I could also tell this drone had been used/previously sold to someone else, they returned it, and it was packaged back up, and sent to me, and a few other things wrong too. I left a scathing, but honest review (nothing any worse than other reviews I've seen out there) complete with photos to prove my allegations. I suspect that the Seller of this hunk of garbage drone sold to me just couldnt handle the fact that they GOT CAUGHT this time and/or someone (me) actually had the audacity to call them out on their unethical, seedy business practices, and they probably went and complained and managed to get me kicked off of making customer product reviews and so forth. This is just a guess, who knows.....?? Regardless, this IS a form of depriving me of my 1st Amendment Rights to Freedom of Speech. As I said to them in emails I've sent them on this matter: It would be one thing IF they could demonstrate to me WHAT I am alleged to have said or did wrong - then no problem - it wont happen again. But they refuse to answer their phones, respond to chats, email inquiries - and therefore cannot give me a legitimate reason for doing this to me. This should serve to prove to everyone out there just how authoritarian Amazon actually is in silencing good customers who do nothing more than leave honest assessments about the products they sell on their website.",2021-08-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,8.0,2914,524,41,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,want tell story leave review amazonearlier year spring barred leaving customer review askinganswering customer product inquiry amazoncom explanation specifically wrong justify sent vague generic email stating violated community guideline previously given warning warning one similar type email vague generic gave specific allegation supposed violation community guideline repeatedly emailed called online chat trying get bottom amazon outright refuse respond ive trying trying resolve amazon knew guideline violated wouldnt happen like say fix dont know brokenthe way go leaving customer review sell great product sing praise product youll get likely star sell something damageddefective poor quality used etc slam destroy review im always honest lie make falsehood exaggerate good bad simply tell like isthe last review amazon left particularly bad review drone purchased multiple shortcoming damaged defective didnt work also front light missing well loose wire protruding bottom drone could also tell drone usedpreviously sold someone else returned packaged back sent thing wrong left scathing honest review nothing worse review ive seen complete photo prove allegation suspect seller hunk garbage drone sold couldnt handle fact got caught time andor someone actually audacity call unethical seedy business practice probably went complained managed get kicked making customer product review forth guess know regardless form depriving st amendment right freedom speech said email ive sent matter would one thing could demonstrate alleged said wrong problem wont happen refuse answer phone respond chat email inquiry therefore cannot give legitimate reason serve prove everyone authoritarian amazon actually silencing good customer nothing leave honest assessment product sell website,0.007004590683826069,0.9929954093161739,0.2938867077958497,0.2,0.8552750462172569,85.5275046217257,High Trust
Gloria,/users/610f52b68a6f4700126d4838,GB,2.0,2021-08-08 13:50:44+00:00,5.0,Customor for ages and will stay,Customor for ages . I find everything I need at one click with prime . Never miss a delivery. Custmor service is what I like most . Refunds are very prompt . They say 5-7 days but I always get within 1-2 days in my account and within hours in my prime account. I buy everything off Amazon.I save a lot in monthly subscription . Get my grocery within hours . Any bogus item I ever had get refunded . Biggest thing is no waiting time getting to reach customer services . They keep record of everything and any item which becomes faulty or I don’t like can be refunded even after 28 days through  customer services. With Amazon I feel my money is safe . I buy everything from Amazon now . If there is any issues with a delivery within time scale and I inquire about it I get my refunds within days . Amazon is one company that played a fantastic role in pandemic snd has given and created jobs for thousands of people.,2021-08-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,8.0,915,177,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customor age find everything need one click prime never miss delivery custmor service like refund prompt say day always get within day account within hour prime account buy everything amazoni save lot monthly subscription get grocery within hour bogus item ever get refunded biggest thing waiting time getting reach customer service keep record everything item becomes faulty don’t like refunded even day customer service amazon feel money safe buy everything amazon issue delivery within time scale inquire get refund within day amazon one company played fantastic role pandemic snd given created job thousand people,0.0040190912386627,0.9959809087613373,0.09927089175546831,1.0,2.0178446327317623,201.78446327317624,High Trust
