Владислав Левшинский,/users/60c728063c94130019b53006,FR,2.0,2021-08-07 10:27:03+00:00,1.0,Horrible customer service,"I've ordered an item. It was lost during the transition and Amazon initiated the refund. I've got less money due to conversion rates.Why should I pay for Amazon faults? So I asked for compensation.I had contacted support centre via chat three times. At the first time someone named Mohammed said that I will get difference in 3 days. I trusted them and waited. In one week I got nothing so I contacted centre one more time.During the second time I started to talk with Kai and later was switched to their supervisor: Sweety. They didn't help me. They confirmed that Mohammed was lying and didn't help me. After short conversation Sweety just started to ignore my questions, refused to let me contact their manager and later just left the chat. I felt really bad. During the third time I had a talk with Banupriya, later they called a supervisor - Kuldeep and payment specialist - Revathy. I didn't get any information nor help. Later the chat window just dissapeared during conversation.My customer experience:1. Spent time waiting for order.2. Got it cancelled because Amazon lost it during transition.3. Got less money back - lost around $5.4. Spent time trying to solve the issue via support centre. Felt bad after. I recommend to avoid Amazon, because its customer service is horrible. All they need is your money.",2021-08-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,7.0,1318,225,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive ordered item lost transition amazon initiated refund ive got less money due conversion rateswhy pay amazon fault asked compensationi contacted support centre via chat three time first time someone named mohammed said get difference day trusted waited one week got nothing contacted centre one timeduring second time started talk kai later switched supervisor sweety didnt help confirmed mohammed lying didnt help short conversation sweety started ignore question refused let contact m