SM,/users/6045b4ad8a767c00198a2f7e,US,2.0,2021-08-05 23:55:14+00:00,1.0,Amazon offers horrific customer…,"Amazon offers horrific customer service! It's delivery service has repeatedly left my parcels in an unmanned lobby - contrary to my delivery instructions. On multiple occasions, the packages have been stolen. What did Amazon do? Refuse to issue me a refund until I threatened to complain my attorney general and credit card company. The company makes mistakes and in spite of the billions it is sitting on - tells the customer it's their problem. When I asked for a courtesy coupon to match the coupon that I had used several days prior - the supervisor named Allison, bluntly told me no and stated she was disconnecting the call. She was rude, unprofessional and made no attempt to please me as a customer. Amazon needs competition.",2021-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,5.0,733,125,32,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon offer horrific customer service delivery service repeatedly left parcel unmanned lobby contrary delivery instruction multiple occasion package stolen amazon refuse issue refund threatened complain attorney general credit card company company make mistake spite billion sitting tell customer problem asked courtesy coupon match coupon used several day prior supervisor named allison bluntly told stated disconnecting call rude unprofessional made attempt please customer amazon need competition,0.05976922773259363,0.9402307722674064,0.07010656197420079,0.2,0.7841366985285433,78.41366985285433,High Trust
