Emma,/users/5964ba8a0000ff000aadf18e,GB,16.0,2021-08-05 19:11:13+00:00,1.0,Wish I could give no stars,"Ordered 2 mattresses on Saturday 31st July for our girls through prime one came Sunday no issue but the other was meant to be delivered Tuesday 3rd August. As we were redoing the girls bedroom I messaged them in the morning to confirm it would be delivered which they confirmed would be by 9pm so we put the old mattress outside in preparation and as per normal English weather it was rained on but when it got to 7pm and the order stated it wasn’t out for delivery yet I questioned it again only to be told they had changed the date to Friday without any communication with myself and the app still advising it would be delivered by 10pm. So we then had to drag the smaller damp old mattress back in and deal with the heat whilst having to dry this mattress before my 9 year olds bedtime we then had to use teddy bears to stop her rolling off the smaller cabin mattress onto the metal base of the new single bed. On Tuesday evening after going through several useless advisors I asked to speak to a supervisor who advised she would reorder for delivery the next day (Wednesday 4th) but at 11pm on the Tuesday after several attempts to get this sorted I got the redelivery information stating delivery would now be Thursday the 5th instead so contacted them again and explained the situation over and over again until I was too tired and stressed to argue anymore at 11.45pm and picked it up the next day. After again going through several advisors all day I finally got through to a manager who said because of the issues I had suffered he would guarantee delivery for Thursday 5th and refund the order.  I have been messaging every hour from 10am this morning until I was blocked by them via chat and when I requested a call back instead I got a message stating I had also been blocked on this also so rang the main number from my work phone to be fobbed off again stating I hadn’t been blocked and me advising I have a screen shot proving I had been as well as chasing an update again as still stated it wasn’t out for delivery. Once they’d unblocked me I have now been told this will not be delivered today either and to wait until Sunday so will be raising a formal complaint now. If they’d have just been honest and admitted nothing has actually been done we would have, had a refund and gone elsewhere but instead they chose to lie and then block me because I wanted an update because I knew there would be an issue again today. So not only has my one daughter not got a suitable mattress they have had to stay in the house during the 6 weeks holiday because of having to wait for a mattress that may never be delivered!",2021-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,5.0,2627,495,26,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered mattress saturday st july girl prime one came sunday issue meant delivered tuesday rd august redoing girl bedroom messaged morning confirm would delivered confirmed would pm put old mattress outside preparation per normal english weather rained got pm order stated wasn’t delivery yet questioned told changed date friday without communication app still advising would delivered pm drag smaller damp old mattress back deal heat whilst dry mattress year old bedtime use teddy bear stop rolling smaller cabin mattress onto metal base new single bed tuesday evening going several useless advisor asked speak supervisor advised would reorder delivery next day wednesday th pm tuesday several attempt get sorted got redelivery information stating delivery would thursday th instead contacted explained situation tired stressed argue anymore pm picked next day going several advisor day finally got manager said issue suffered would guarantee delivery thursday th refund order messaging every hour morning blocked via chat requested call back instead got message stating also blocked also rang main number work phone fobbed stating hadn’t blocked advising screen shot proving well chasing update still stated wasn’t delivery they’d unblocked told delivered today either wait sunday raising formal complaint they’d honest admitted nothing actually done would refund gone elsewhere instead chose lie block wanted update knew would issue today one daughter got suitable mattress stay house week holiday wait mattress may never delivered,0.08329368689564727,0.9167063131043527,0.2776219854178351,0.2,0.8138775536357434,81.38775536357434,High Trust
Jesse,/users/5db9d39e4e6816890e530aca,US,9.0,2021-08-05 18:48:36+00:00,1.0,I am a prime member and are suposed to…,"I am a prime member and are suposed to get certain privileges but I have found out the 2 day shipping dose not matter and amazon sells produces foe third party that do have to back iy up. (SCAM YOU) Amazon only believe the seller so you are out. They will tell you it has shipped, but shipped not to your address. it all a SCAM.",2021-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,5.0,328,66,39,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime member suposed get certain privilege found day shipping dose matter amazon sell produce foe third party back iy scam amazon believe seller tell shipped shipped address scam,0.03986731844857278,0.9601326815514272,0.03701626472237801,0.2,0.7874695937201892,78.74695937201892,High Trust
Axa Troncoso-Urrutia,/users/610c2ccbda326a0012117fdc,US,1.0,2021-08-05 18:25:04+00:00,1.0,It’s impossible to get a hold of a human being,"My international package got held at customs. Amazon didn’t take responsibility and deferred me to DHL. DHL experience was another challenge. Trying to figure out why my package didn’t arrive, I was transferred 3 times—I’m not kidding, from one DHL to the other(every time I gave them my tracking number). Finally I got to their “investigation/research team. This gentleman named Mark put me through the ringer. Concisely put, he said they didn’t get a hold of my sister (recipient) and he wonders whether to hold OR destroy the package.Then he sends an email saying that Customs is requesting a Public Health Certificate—w..the hell?..I think. So I’m like I have no idea what a PHC is. So, my sister there thinks this is going to be a lot of trouble, so I emailed Mark saying, “just send it back” (I was feeling defeated and like it was going to be a waste of time) So, he next sends me an email requesting the following:“I am following up with you regarding your request to return your shipment to the Origin. In order to make this change, DHL USA requires an authorization letter from the account holder.The letter should be written using your company’s Letterhead and requires: · Your name · Your title · Your signature · The return address · Your DHL import express account number (beginning with the numbers 95 or 96).· Clarification of your need for return to the Origin.If you do not have a 95/96 DHL import account number, please provide your export account number instead.Once completed please send your attached PDF/Word document via email to uscsdocuments or directly send it back to us here and be sure to ‘Reply All.’ I set a follow up for tomorrow no later than 5PM your local time. If you have any questions or concerns, please call us at 877-297-6031Thank you for choosing DHL”Again I’m like WTH? What’s a 96/97 DHL import number? EtcSo I sent him an email saying “Listen, I’m just an Amazon.com customer. I shopped, paid extra for international, expecting my 82 y/o mom would get the Leg Brace to help with her sciatic pain. Why are you talking to me like I’m a corporation. That’s Amazon. I told him I needed to hear by the end of the day. He did not reached out. I tried to talk to Amazon and it was IMPOSSIBLE. When I finally outsmarted them and they were going to give me a call back if I left my number, mysteriously, they said that specific feature wasn’t working. In small tiny letters, a number for internationals having trouble with their packages to USA. So, being the ONLY number, I called it. I kid you not, I was on hold for about 11 minutes. First, it was music for about 9mins. Then, it got creepy; music was gone and there was only silence. I tried to talk to someone and nobody answered just silence and then “call dropped”.I might be upset but above all, I want you to know that unfortunately, we are giving Amazon.com too much power.",2021-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,5.0,2870,513,46,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,international package got held custom amazon didn’t take responsibility deferred dhl dhl experience another challenge trying figure package didn’t arrive transferred times—i’m kidding one dhl otherevery time gave tracking number finally got “investigationresearch team gentleman named mark put ringer concisely put said didn’t get hold sister recipient wonder whether hold destroy packagethen sends email saying custom requesting public health certificate—wthe helli think i’m like idea phc sister think going lot trouble emailed mark saying “just send back” feeling defeated like going waste time next sends email requesting following“i following regarding request return shipment origin order make change dhl usa requires authorization letter account holderthe letter written using company’s letterhead requires · name · title · signature · return address · dhl import express account number beginning number · c