Rory Holliday,/users/5be33bf9f13428102c7853a2,GB,6.0,2021-08-02 17:46:31+00:00,1.0,Amazon's Preston warehouse has thieves…,"Amazon's Preston warehouse has thieves working out of it. Some of you might be aware of the recent incidents of people buying PS5's from Amazon and upon delivery the console box had been opened and the console taken out the box and then delivered to customers. Well this also happens when you buy a mobile phone. Ordered a OnePlus 9 model (most recent model) and upon delivery took the phone box out of the outer packing and immediately noticed the seals had been cut and upon opening the phone box found the phone had been removed. I spent over 2 hours trying to get in touch with someone at Amazon who understood the situation but was bounced around the Philippines, Columbia and the Caribbean before getting through to someone in the UK who understood the situation. I was offered £5 as a good will gesture which you'll agree was insulting so did not accept it and was assured a member of management would contact me to discuss further and have not received a call, no surprise there being it's Amazon. The agents I spoke to we're more interested in trying to cover up and ignore the fact they have thieves working in their Preston warehouse, basically trying their best to brush it under the carpet. Next step is the police and the press to report the theft and I hope anyone who reads this will think twice before purchasing a high priced or sought after item from Amazon...I assure you you'll have issues and then more issues trying to resolve it with their utterly useless customer services. It shows how little Amazon thinks of its customers as they don't even monitor their own trust pilot and respond to reviews, they're so big now they simply don't care about criminality within their own company. You've been warned, purchase from Amazon at your own risk.",2021-08-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,2.0,1767,313,39,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon preston warehouse thief working might aware recent incident people buying ps amazon upon delivery console box opened console taken box delivered customer well also happens buy mobile phone ordered oneplus model recent model upon delivery took phone box outer packing immediately noticed seal cut upon opening phone box found phone removed spent hour trying get touch someone amazon understood situation bounced around philippine columbia caribbean getting someone uk understood situation offered £ good gesture youll agree insulting accept assured member management would contact discus received call surprise amazon agent spoke interested trying cover ignore fact thief working preston warehouse basically trying best brush carpet next step police press report theft hope anyone read think twice purchasing high priced sought item amazoni assure youll issue issue trying resolve utterly useless customer service show little amazon think customer dont even monitor trust pilot respond review theyre big simply dont care criminality within company youve warned purchase amazon risk,0.012594654872856067,0.987405345127144,0.17554683118339875,0.2,0.8288120388002517,82.88120388002517,High Trust
Alan Studd,/users/5c65adecec5cc1ef45f4f33f,GB,4.0,2021-08-02 14:22:37+00:00,5.0,Customer Service - 5 Star,"Problems with my Amazon Prime Account - I contacted Amazon Prime via their app - they then rang me. The Customer Service advisor ‘Jamie’ was able to look into my account, spotted anomalies (caused by my incompetence) and refund me - he was very patient and treated me with dignity and respect despite the mistakes being my own. Reading the reviews shown here I was prepared for poor quality but what I got was quite the opposite. Excellent service - a great employee - maybe I got lucky? Top notch Jamie - thank you! 👍🏻",2021-08-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,2.0,519,95,25,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,problem amazon prime account contacted amazon prime via app rang customer service advisor ‘jamie’ able look account spotted anomaly caused incompetence refund patient treated dignity respect despite mistake reading review shown prepared poor quality got quite opposite excellent service great employee maybe got lucky top notch jamie thank 👍🏻,0.1416394855765788,0.8583605144234212,0.0532809871003926,1.0,1.9398364546317892,193.98364546317893,High Trust
