Sandy Covington,/users/6106540732cb4c0013441f8e,US,1.0,2021-08-01 07:58:08+00:00,1.0,Lousy Customer Service,"Amazon is an awful company and their customer service is even worst. I was browsing for things on my phone, which I am always logged into my work email all of sudden everything was purchased including the prime add on. I already have prime on main email account. So I went in the chat to cancel everything and the guy said he would cancel it all and refund it. Never got refund and they started sending out the packages. Then when I checked my bank account and didn't see a refund I talked to again and they said they couldn't fix it, because it wasn't cancelled. Even though the previous person said it was and I got an email saying it was. I two more representatives who brushed me off saying they couldn't fix it when it fault on Amazon's end. I definitely done with Amazon after this.",2021-08-01 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,8.0,1.0,788,148,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon awful company customer service even worst browsing thing phone always logged work email sudden everything purchased including prime add already prime main email account went chat cancel everything guy said would cancel refund never got refund started sending package checked bank account didnt see refund talked said couldnt fix wasnt cancelled even though previous person said got email saying two representative brushed saying couldnt fix fault amazon end definitely done amazon,0.02406548679466024,0.9759345132053397,0.08300616937745373,0.2,0.8045684904781606,80.45684904781606,High Trust
