Julene,/users/5f0643c209a036734d2d625c,US,4.0,2021-07-31 15:12:16+00:00,1.0,Billionaire crooks stealing from the people who made them rich.,"I have used Amazon for a long time, but I won't anymore.  I just moved and made a big order to them to get things for my house.  I always work out my finances to the penny.  After I put in the order to Amazon, I watched my bank account all weekend. Every time I checked it, it was either a positive, or a large negative balance. They took money out for the item, then put the money back in, then took it out when  they shipped it.  I had no idea what I had in the bank. Long story short, I ended up with a negative balance.  Once more I ordered some things from them, and also ended up with a large negative balance. This extremely rich billionaire company was stealing money from me, a disabled person with multiple sclerosis who has very little money.  Not only that, they don't even pay taxes.  I've always had to pay taxes. They also used to return your money promptly when you did a return.  No more, they hold onto your money for several days.  When you call them about it,  you get someone named Mohammad or Rashnesh who doesn't understand anything you say and they insist Amazon has never returned your money right away, like I can't remember 3 months ago when they did.  I've cancelled Prime, Kindle.  I exclusively order from Walmart.com now, and guess what, my bank balance is exactly what it's supposed to be.  No more dealing with these crooks.  They should be ashamed stealing money from poor people.",2021-07-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,31.0,1414,261,63,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used amazon long time wont anymore moved made big order get thing house always work finance penny put order amazon watched bank account weekend every time checked either positive large negative balance took money item put money back took shipped idea bank long story short ended negative balance ordered thing also ended large negative balance extremely rich billionaire company stealing money disabled person multiple sclerosis little money dont even pay tax ive always pay tax also used return money promptly return hold onto money several day call get someone named mohammad rashnesh doesnt understand anything say insist amazon never returned money right away like cant remember month ago ive cancelled prime kindle exclusively order walmartcom guess bank balance exactly supposed dealing crook ashamed stealing money poor people,0.005389248761820148,0.9946107512381799,0.14638250140213124,0.2,0.8265818758995163,82.65818758995162,High Trust
