Billie Orr,/users/60fe8294ccc0fe0012d22aa7,US,3.0,2021-07-26 10:26:18+00:00,1.0,Dumpster fire of a company!!!!!! Epic FAIL!,"Amazon used to be a wonderful service. The last 6 months have been like dealing with untrained monkeys. 7/10 deliveries are either a week late, damaged, lost, wrong shipments, or delivered to one of my neighbors. I spoke to 3 agents yesterday who all PROMISED my order (that was now 4 days late and still hadn't shipped) was still being delivered by 10pm....even at 9:26pm they still insisted. At 10pm I cancelled my order. The MOMENT I cancelled it, they marked as shipped and basically told me I was SOL. I told them I was going to dispute the charge with my bank and was told ""yeah? go ahead and try it"". As a disabled person, I depend on service like Amazon. It's how I do ally shopping. It's a damn shame they have lost so much respect for their customers. It's all about the sales and not about service. They don't want to do anything to help the customer anymore. They take ur money and run without any repercussions because someone will always be stupid enough to purchase from them. I've heard of a new Amazon-like company I'll try out. Anything better than this dumpster fire of a company",2021-07-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,26.0,1098,200,43,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon used wonderful service last month like dealing untrained monkey delivery either week late damaged lost wrong shipment delivered one neighbor spoke agent yesterday promised order day late still hadnt shipped still delivered pmeven pm still insisted pm cancelled order moment cancelled marked shipped basically told sol told going dispute charge bank told yeah go ahead try disabled person depend service like amazon ally shopping damn shame lost much respect customer sale service dont want anything help customer anymore take ur money run without repercussion someone always stupid enough purchase ive heard new amazonlike company ill try anything better dumpster fire company,0.00708699711