alan haskell,/users/559195db0000ff0001c946e0,GB,9.0,2021-07-23 15:20:41+00:00,1.0,Frightening delivery  courier,"Whilst at work, I had a phone call from my wife literally in tears and sounded incredibly  upset, very concerned  I asked her what was wrong, she told me that whilst upstairs there had been rapid loud banging on both our front door knocker and also the sound of a hand banging against the door, it was so loud and rapid she thought it was the police who was about to knock the  door down. She stayed upstairs whilst this continuous banging carried on, after about 5 minutes  it stopped but I had decided  to leave work early  to see what had been going on. When I arrived  at my house I opened our exterior letterbox which had a card from Amazon informing  us we had a parcel which had now been delivered  to a neighbour. Not only had this upset my wife who is still only in her 50s and caused me to loose money coming  home early as I'm  self employed  but it is nearly  impossible  to speak or email someone to lodge a complaint hence my review  on here.",2021-07-23 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,23.0,956,182,29,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,whilst work phone call wife literally tear sounded incredibly upset concerned asked wrong told whilst upstairs rapid loud banging front door knocker also sound hand banging door loud rapid thought police knock door stayed upstairs whilst continuous banging carried minute stopped decided leave work early see going arrived house opened exterior letterbox card amazon informing u parcel delivered neighbour upset wife still caused loose money coming home early im self employed nearly impossible speak email someone lodge complaint hence review,0.033817140102781446,0.9661828598972185,0.10207515423443635,0.2,0.8035064607954965,80.35064607954965,High Trust
