Rich Ball,/users/60fab8f2cc82900012743e73,US,1.0,2021-07-23 12:44:27+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime - not two day shipping,"The marketing promise for Amazon Prime is receive your item in two days from ship.  Every time my order goes through their Brownstown, MI facility I have to end up calling to cancel it.  That is also not a process they ever intend for you to do.  In order to speak to someone about it you have to Google the Amazon contact phone number.  I guess their hope is you get so frustrated trying to find a way to talk to a person that you will just drop it and they get to keep your money.",2021-07-23 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,23.0,482,96,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,marketing promise amazon prime receive item two day ship every time order go brownstown mi facility end calling cancel also process ever intend order speak someone google amazon contact phone number guess hope get frustrated trying find way talk person drop get keep money,0.021669546700759608,0.9783304532992404,0.0538418395961862,0.2,0.7999335945688574,79.99335945688574,High Trust
