Kristin Bucek,/users/60fa05eda7052d001277a614,US,1.0,2021-07-22 23:59:06+00:00,1.0,Driver who slapped me in the face.,"I’ve had many interactions with the Amazon drivers not delivering my purchases to the designated area. I have a box before you go past my gate that clearly states all packages go here. Also I have a no trespassing sign next to it. I have a very territorial dog and he will bite when a stranger comes up to the house. I’ve told many drivers to put items in the box, but they don’t seem to listen. I also warn them that my dog will bite. I had a recent altercation with a female driver. She pulled up to my house and my dog was outside. I asked her what she doesn’t understand about putting the boxes in the box.  She mocked me like I was crying and moved her hands as if saying blah blah blah. I took the box and asked her what does with the packages when she comes to the house. She states she throws them out the window. I again warned her about the dog. She put her hand in my face and of course my reaction was to put her hand down. She then slapped me and said she’s going to run over my dog! She still works there. I was assured that Amazon would not tolerate this behavior but I guess they do! They deserve no stars for customer service. Then Amazon put a hold on my account and to promise them I was not going to be verbally or physically abusive to their drivers. Ummm…. She hit me on my property. They definitely need a new HR director. Where’s Jeff Bezos?? Oh yeah he’s in space! These employees need more education in customer service and also anger management classes. I did press charges against her. I asked the lady from the “executive complaint department” why the drivers  don’t read the directions of where I want my packages on the delivery caption when I order something. She stated the drivers don’t see that caption until after the delivery!! Unreal!!",2021-07-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,22.0,1773,336,34,7,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,i’ve many interaction amazon driver delivering purchase designated area box go past gate clearly state package go also trespassing sign next territorial dog bite stranger come house i’ve told many driver put item box don’t seem listen also warn dog bite recent altercation female driver pulled house dog outside asked doesn’t understand putting box box mocked like cry moved hand saying blah blah blah took box asked package come house state throw window warned dog put hand face course reaction put hand slapped said she’s going run dog still work assured amazon would tolerate behavior guess deserve star customer service amazon put hold account promise going verbally physically abusive driver ummm… hit property definitely need new hr director where’s jeff bezos oh yeah he’s space employee need education customer service also anger management class press charge asked lady “executive complaint department” driver don’t read direction want package delivery caption order something stated driver don’t see caption delivery unreal,0.9968780145135093,0.003121985486490675,0.18844643858665172,0.2,0.3392502804605757,33.92502804605757,Low Trust
