LEE BATTY,/users/57de5b7e0000ff000a45699b,GB,8.0,2021-07-15 15:38:17+00:00,1.0,I'm absolutely disgusted in the lack of…,"I'm absolutely disgusted in the lack of service Amazon provided me when I tried to return a faulty item. I purchased an inflatable bed for my disabled daughter earlier this year, and last week the bed started to blow up in the centre like a balloon. The bed comes with a 2 year Amazon warranty, so didn't expect any issues. I called them over the weekend, and was instructed to email them a picture, to which they didn't even reply. I then decided to call them again today, following on from my email. I explained the situation, going into more details, about how we were involved in a house fire, and was extremely lucky to still be alive, and that the inflatable bed, was a temporary bed for my disabled daughter, due to the house fire, and the main house and contents being destroyed. The annex is only a one bedroom, with one double bed, and the inflatable bed that my daughter uses. I explained that the fault was affecting my daughters sleep, who has already been through so much in the last year, and I would therefore need an urgent replacement. I was then informed, that the bed I purchased wasn't their own stock and therefore, the bed would need to be returned to the supplier, for them to send out a replacement bed. In the meantime, my disabled daughter, will have to sleep on the floor; ""I'm sorry there is nothing our billion pound company can do about this""... To add to my frustration, to replace the bed, it is now 2x the cost of when I purchased the bed in March. How very convenient... There is no wonder this man can afford to travel to space, in his own space rocket, treating loyal customers, like their own life's mean nothing. Bad move Mr Bezos All future business cancelled, and my monthly subscription to Amazon prime. Account closed.  Deal direct from here forth...",2021-07-15 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,15.0,1793,325,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,im absolutely disgusted lack service amazon provided tried return faulty item purchased inflatable bed disabled daughter earlier year last week bed started blow centre like balloon bed come year amazon warranty didnt expect issue called weekend instructed email picture didnt even reply decided call today following email explained situation going detail involved house fire extremely lucky still alive inflatable bed temporary bed disabled daughter due house fire main house content destroyed annex one bedroom one double bed inflatable bed daughter us explained fault affecting daughter sleep already much last year would therefore need urgent replacement informed bed purchased wasnt stock therefore bed would need returned supplier send replacement bed meantime disabled daughter sleep floor im sorry nothing billion pound company add frustration replace bed x cost purchased bed march convenient wonder man afford travel space space rocket treating loyal customer like life mean nothing bad move mr bezos future business cancelled monthly subscription amazon prime account closed deal direct forth,0.025806674424497758,0.9741933255755022,0.18227706113292205,0.2,0.8235520750143356,82.35520750143355,High Trust
