Rick Kling,/users/60eeb88ac07ca900112ef6eb,US,2.0,2021-07-14 10:12:44+00:00,2.0,Shop elsewhere first,"Recently ordered a computer and a piece of dining furniture. The furniture never showed when it was supposed to and I paid extra to have it delivered to my apartment. Finally received a text 4 hours after the delivery deadline saying it would be delivered 2 days later. The computer was ordered 6/29 and had an ETA of 7-1 to 7-13. As of the 13th it still hadn’t shipped. The “virtual assistant” informed me it was shipping that day, but it never came. When I called Amazon they told me there was no ETA available and that they must have sold out of that model??? Funny because it was still saying that there were 3 left in stock weeks after my original order!This was a Birthday presentation and I’m extremely disappointed to say the least.",2021-07-14 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,14.0,740,135,20,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,recently ordered computer piece dining furniture furniture never showed supposed paid extra delivered apartment finally received text hour delivery deadline saying would delivered day later computer ordered eta th still hadn’t shipped “virtual assistant” informed shipping day never came called amazon told eta available must sold model funny still saying left stock week original orderthis birthday presentation i’m extremely disappointed say least,0.1253926440287708,0.8746073559712292,0.07571508693213685,0.4,1.052446695372042,105.24466953720419,High Trust
