Tyson Burrell,/users/60ecdb3f6222490011bc4238,US,1.0,2021-07-13 00:16:10+00:00,1.0,Amazon is taking advantage of its…,"Amazon is taking advantage of its customers. They are never less expensive, prone to knock-offs, and poor shipping services. They spent years over delivering to get people hooked, assuming people are to dumb to realize service gradually tappers off the longer you're enrolled. Try canceling your service and then re-joining. You'll notice service improves temporarily. I cancelled my subscription and started buying from reputable businesses, that deliver real products, and allow for reliable shipping options.",2021-07-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,13.0,511,75,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon taking advantage customer never less expensive prone knockoff poor shipping service spent year delivering get people hooked assuming people dumb realize service gradually tapper longer youre enrolled try canceling service rejoining youll notice service improves temporarily cancelled subscription started buying reputable business deliver real product allow reliable shipping option,0.030863985924628416,0.9691360140753715,0.04206393718452047,0.2,0.7929807944745898,79.29807944745897,High Trust
Jo Trastuzumab,/users/60ecd0a73e67cd0011ff8c99,US,1.0,2021-07-12 23:30:54+00:00,1.0,customer service is rude and unprofessional,"I can't believe this multi-billion dollar company has disgusting customer service! Fresh grocery order was supposed to arrive on Saturday afternoon. On whatever reason i don't know, they said the delivery had a problem and suggested me to wait for the status to change. I had to stayed home the whole day, then i contacted an agent to complaint. Noticing how annoyed and upset i was, he suddenly hung up on me. Another agent did the same, no one listened or finally gave resolution. Over the conversation, those associate agents promised me both my gift card amount and courtesy credit used to purchase would be returned back (OF COURSE I WANT MY SINGLE MONEY BACK, THE CANCELATION / TROUBLED DELIVERY WAS NOT FROM MY END, I FURIOUSLY HAD TO WASTE MY ENERGY AND TIME). 2 days passed and nothing changed, no refund, no delivery, no nothing. I spent my time reaching to customer service again, this time i made a call. This lady promised my gift card amount along with courtesy credit to be refunded back. After hours i got my gift card amount back but i didn't get my credit back! It was half of the total payment. I don't want to lose money for something that i didn't spend on! Chatted and called again everyone gave 360 different answers. Called like for 30 mins just to hear the customer service went against me and assumed me lying. Dude i say just listen to the call recording at the time when i was promised with my credit back, or my chat histories! But no, i only receive arrogance. Oh then if you don't wanna return my money then send me the items i spent those money on. They couldn't even do replacement saying that i already asked for a refund (YES BUT I WAS REQUESTING FULL AMOUNT OF REFUND IN ALL FORMS AND YOUR AGENT PROMISED IT). Well dude just so you know those are the attitude of most agents i received. I didn't receive my credit back + being treated rudely. They are nice in the beginning yet shows their unprofessionalism when i start complaining for my right. It's not just the matter of the policy, it's the attitude that i receive that i'll never forget. Funny how customer service from a big company shows their true self.",2021-07-12 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,12.0,2148,390,43,6,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,cant believe multibillion dollar company disgusting customer service fresh grocery order supposed arrive saturday afternoon whatever reason dont know said delivery problem suggested wait status change stayed home whole day contacted agent complaint noticing annoyed upset suddenly hung another agent one listened finally gave resolution conversation associate agent promised gift card amount courtesy credit used purchase would returned back course want single money back cancelation troubled delivery end furiously waste energy time day passed nothing changed refund delivery nothing spent time reaching customer service time made call lady promised gift card amount along courtesy credit refunded back hour got gift card amount back didnt get credit back half total payment dont want lose money something didnt spend chatted called everyone gave different answer called like min hear customer service went assumed lying dude say listen call recording time promised credit back chat history receive arrogance oh dont wanna return money send item spent money couldnt even replacement saying already asked refund yes requesting full amount refund form agent promised well dude know attitude agent received didnt receive credit back treated rudely nice beginning yet show unprofessionalism start complaining right matter policy attitude receive ill never forget funny customer service big company show true self,0.8248005783094469,0.17519942169055314,0.21873247335950646,0.2,0.43134620551717784,43.13462055171778,Low Trust
