Latesha Jones,/users/5f96fd548950b90019d271c5,US,3.0,2021-07-12 20:10:19+00:00,1.0,Amazon is horrible,"Amazon is awful now! Last week I received some candy that was opened and it looked as if someone had eaten out of it. This week I ordered products for my baby shower that was set for next day delivery but instead it was set to be shipped 3 days later. I worked from home instead of going into office so that it would not be rained on. I called and had to go through the horrible automated response first which is annoying AF... then I spoke with someone from a different country who didn't speak English well. After 20 minutes getting nowhere with him I was transferred to a ""supervisor"" who had a very thick accent and she was even worse than the first person. She placed me on hold and randomly transferred me somewhere else. Then she called me immediately after transferred me and said the call was disconnected. I told her that it was not disconnected and that she transferred me someone else. SHE ASKED ME IF THEY WERE ABLE TO HELP ME.... I was beyond frustrated at this point. I asked to speak to a supervisor in America and she transferred me to someone that spoke English but they disconnected after answering and putting me on hold. I called back and reached someone else with a thick accent so I asked to speak to a supervisor in America. They transferred me to someone who spoke english but was not supervisor, was no help, and knew nothing about my package. She said to give it 48 hours and if it still hadn't arrived they would issue a REFUND. I NEED THESE ITEMS FOR MY BABY SHOWER!!!! I am livid at this point and ended up screaming.... The way they Amazon treats their customers is disgusting and it doesn't seem like they care.",2021-07-12 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,12.0,1643,305,18,3,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,amazon awful last week received candy opened looked someone eaten week ordered product baby shower set next day delivery instead set shipped day later worked home instead 