Simon Griffin,/users/566fedb70000ff0001f3abec,GB,43.0,2021-07-12 00:58:55+00:00,1.0,There’s clearly a reason most reviews are ‘bad!’ What’s most shocking is that Amazon clearly doesn’t care about this!?,"Joined Amazon Prime mostly for the ‘free One Day Delivery!’ Proposition! However, it turns out that this is just a gimmick (lie!) & the reality is actually the total opposite! Having ordered an item on Saturday, this was due for delivery on the Sunday, so I waited in… around 15:00 I was checking my social media & emails & noticed an email from Amazon stating that my order had been delivered over an hour earlier! In fact, it stated that it ‘had been handed to resident!’ At which point I’m a little confused as to how exactly I didn’t remember this ‘significant event!?’ But for good measure, I checked outside my front door (which opens out onto the sidewalk) & behold, no parcel… so I’m forced contact Amazon for clarification & am told I have to wait until the following Wednesday before they will ‘assist me’!?? Hence, Amazon Prime promptly cancelled 😡 what an utter waste of space & definitely one to avoid!",2021-07-12 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,12.0,915,163,118,19,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,joined amazon prime mostly ‘free one day delivery’ proposition however turn gimmick lie reality actually total opposite ordered item saturday due delivery sunday waited in… around checking social medium email noticed email amazon stating order delivered hour earlier fact stated ‘had handed resident’ point i’m little confused exactly didn’t remember ‘significant event’ good measure checked outside front door open onto sidewalk behold parcel… i’m forced contact amazon clarification told wait following wednesday ‘assist me’ hence amazon prime promptly cancelled 😡 utter waste space definitely one avoid,0.9999379131660442,6.208683395581005e-05,0.09141895681435783,0.2,0.31831483477984945,31.831483477984946,Low Trust
