SP,/users/5cb34f9f92c79901781fedff,US,4.0,2021-07-05 12:25:51+00:00,1.0,Amazon prime member,"I’ve been an Amazon prime member for years until recently. The customer service is horrible and deliveries are ALWAYS late, if they arrive at all. A lot of the merchandise at Amazon is poor, cheap quality and very often the sizes are way off. I placed an order for shorts and shirts to take on a trip. The shorts were cancelled without notice for a “delivery problem. When  I called to find out why, I was told that they were damaged. I advised I still needed the shorts and wanted to know if there was any way they could refund me the money back to an Amazon gift card so that I can go ahead an reorder them. This seemed to be an out of the world request for their customer service team. To make a long story short it took 3 phone calls to get this done and during the 3 third phone call, I find out that the refund never came through because it was requested on the wrong item which was the shirt I ordered and that my shirt order has been cancelled too. I am now on with them again to try to get the refund for the shirt on a gift card because they should not have cancelled it. After this, I’m done with Amazon. I’ve cancelled my prime subscription.",2021-07-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,5.0,1153,225,19,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’ve amazon prime member year recently customer service horrible delivery always late arrive lot merchandise amazon poor cheap quality often size way placed order short shirt take trip short cancelled without notice “delivery problem called find told damaged advised still needed short wanted know way could refund money back amazon gift card go ahead reorder seemed world request customer service team make long story short took phone call get done third phone call find refund never came requested wrong item shirt ordered shirt order cancelled try get refund shirt gift card cancelled i’m done amazon i’ve cancelled prime subscription,0.013752118614824293,0.9862478813851757,0.1261918115535614,0.2,0.8183623030033002,81.83623030033002,High Trust
Fiona Murphy,/users/4f116b5c000064000111eb95,GB,40.0,2021-07-05 14:42:24+00:00,3.0,Amazon Review Procedure not up to scratch,"Update, after a day of back and forth plus a trustpilot review I finally got a comprehensive answer and I am now have all the info and reasons why I cannot post my product review.  Maybe an explanation in the first place would have helped.                                                    I have written a review for an item I purchased. I was sent an email to say it was rejected. Fair enough. Why it was rejected is not noted so I looked at the guidelines and popped back on to right a review within these guidelines. Not allowed. Barred for writing a review because I really like something? Emailed the address given by Amazon for any questions regarding this. Reply states they cant find the review. Yes that would be correct Amazon- as you rejected it, the review wont be there. I replied and got another email stating I had emailed the wrong place and was given guidelines on how to report dodgy reviews. I have emailed again asking for someone to actually read my first email and let me review the item I purchased. Round and round we go, Will update if I ever get and answer to my initial request.......",2021-07-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,5.0,1113,197,41,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,update day back forth plus trustpilot review finally got comprehensive answer info reason cannot post product review maybe explanation first place would helped written review item purchased sent email say rejected fair enough rejected noted looked guideline popped back right review within guideline allowed barred writing review really like something emailed address given amazon question regarding reply state cant find review yes would correct amazon rejected review wont replied got another email stating emailed wrong place given guideline report dodgy review emailed asking someone actually read first email let review item purchased round round go update ever get answer initial request,0.0788112060473748,0.9211887939526252,0.11048794167134043,0.6,1.3826919853105806,138.26919853105807,High Trust
Christine,/users/52fe794b0000640001640637,GB,27.0,2021-07-05 09:32:38+00:00,1.0,Fraud lies and rudeness,"If i could post zero stars i would. Ordered some headphones - which were dreadful. £69.00. Returned via the correct recorded channels. I then receive a very rude - all block capitals email, stating i have returned the package - with a wheel caster inside - that they want the refund back!! I have phoned them twice- through to india...so rude saying I was a thief! I have made a formal complaint, they have ignored it. I have written to Amazon head office london - ignored. Truly dreadful. I am 60 years old, living a quiet life- i dont,steal headphones. They are not even stating they will investigate at their warehouse. How do i get help, this is causing me great distress",2021-07-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,5.0,675,122,23,4,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,could post zero star would ordered headphone dreadful £ returned via correct recorded channel receive rude block capital email stating returned package wheel caster inside want refund back phoned twice indiaso rude saying thief made formal complaint ignored written amazon head office london ignored truly dreadful year old living quiet life dontsteal headphone even stating investigate warehouse get help causing great distress,0.9189577367945834,0.08104226320541663,0.06842400448681997,0.2,0.3542059325000723,35.42059325000723,Low Trust
Johnny MUFC,/users/5c7ef2f04fe0fb1c9ea7f414,GB,4.0,2021-07-05 07:39:52+00:00,5.0,Simply Brilliant!,"I’ve been using Amazon for over 15 years and now I’ll give my opinion for the first time, for something so wide in variety and complex this has been incredible, yes or has its faults but reading some people’s bad reviews I just don’t understand is anybody ever happy with anything these days what do people expect for example if a product I purchase is not what I expected I just repackage and send back and get my money back it’s simple and I’d say over the 15 years I’ve maybe returned 5% of my purchases and those returns have mainly been down to clothing sizes so based on how often I’ve used Amazon I’d consider it the best shopping internet site ever, it’s where I always go to first to search for a product and 9/10 I get it at a good deal on Amazon and as a prime customer I get next day delivery etc - which again once in a while the next day delivery promise doesn’t come maybe due to eg. Ordering at Xmas time at peak time you might not get it next day which is understandable. Also as for deliveries I’ve nothing but praise for those people who run about like blue arsed flies and yet for amount of orders I’ve made never once have they failed to deliver my items, yes maybe once or twice over 15 years it been slightly late but that’s always been down to the time of year example week leading up to Xmas where it’s just chaos. Anyway as a whole I’ll judge Amazon based on 15 years I’ve been using it and all I’ll say is big thumbs up from me, it’s saved my butt many a time at Xmas buying present for family and friends, the quality of the items have been top notch very rarely have I had any problems, delivery has always been top - in fact writing this I’d say the only thing that does get me down little is there’s an old man (maybe early 70’s) who appears to be driving about in his own car (maybe he’s 3rd party delivery don’t know) and he’s been doing the deliveries around our area for couple of years now would be nice to see him get his own van rather using his own small car to do the deliveries. Overall Amazon o thank you for everything it been a pleasure to shop with you and I’ll certainly be using this for the foreseeable future so all in all brilliant company to shop with and fantastic 5 stars from me!",2021-07-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,5.0,2233,435,17,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,i’ve using amazon year i’ll give opinion first time something wide variety complex incredible yes fault reading people’s bad review don’t understand anybody ever happy anything day people expect example product purchase expected repackage send back get money back it’s simple i’d say year i’ve maybe returned purchase return mainly clothing size based often i’ve used amazon i’d consider best shopping internet site ever it’s always go first search product get good deal amazon prime customer get next day delivery etc next day delivery promise doesn’t come maybe due eg ordering xmas time peak time might get next day understandable also delivery i’ve nothing praise people run like blue arsed fly yet amount order i’ve made never failed deliver item yes maybe twice year slightly late that’s always time year example week leading xmas it’s chaos anyway whole i’ll judge amazon based year i’ve using i’ll say big thumb it’s saved butt many time xmas buying present family friend quality item top notch rarely problem delivery always top fact writing i’d say thing get little there’s old man maybe early ’s appears driving car maybe he’s rd party delivery don’t know he’s delivery around area couple year would nice see get van rather using small car delivery overall amazon thank everything pleasure shop i’ll certainly using foreseeable future brilliant company shop fantastic star,0.028066391262196465,0.9719336087378035,0.24397083567021874,1.0,2.0347609715029455,203.47609715029455,High Trust
