Richard William Felker,/users/60e17ee25f486a0011707045,CA,1.0,2021-07-18 10:54:10+00:00,1.0,Amazon. You suck!! Again,"Was good for a year till an item never showed. Amazon credited an account that didn't exist anymore. I told them not too. But they did anyway. No item no refund. No help from Amazon. Was a great customer for a year. Spent lots, Was a prime member. When they wouldn't help. I said ok close my account. The idiot on chat side someone would follow up. Nope just closed my account an nothing. Absolutely disgusting.  I was stolen from and tossed aside. Guess I now know why Jeff Bezozs is so rich. Taking from the little guy.  If he goes up, we shouldn't allow him re-entry. He can become the first Martian of our time... 😁. Good job Amazon! You suck. 100 percent do not recommend. Unless you like giving your money away, to a ruthless, heartless corporation with no morals or accountabilty.* Update.* I needed(wanted😔) 2 items quickly. I went back to Amazon. Foolishly. First one was supposed to be here on Monday. Nope lost it. Still waiting to see that refund, but I'm not holding my breath 🤣. 2nd showed up on Monday. 2 days late. Everything seemed fine.. go to install.. damaged. Likely due to the way it was packaged. Seller still hasn't replied. First customer service idiot just pissed me off. Second one said they would takecare of it. Also offered me another option. 2 days later still no answer.. so I tried a third moron. He wouldnt honor last reps offer.. ???  Said only option. I have to send back pay the return shipping and wait a couple weeks for a refund, because ""we can't order those items anymore""🤔🤥🤥 yeah so I now own a expensive piece of garbage. And a item I never got..  the account stays closed this time!!!",2021-07-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,18.0,1629,297,24,4,14.0,0,4,1,0,Genuine,good year till item never showed amazon credited account didnt exist anymore told anyway item refund help amazon great customer year spent lot prime member wouldnt help sai