Georgia Hayes,/users/60e0dc1331d6dd0013479c14,US,6.0,2021-07-03 21:52:26+00:00,1.0,Order wasn’t delivered and CS lied,"I ordered a pkg and was sent an email saying it had been delivered. I called cs and was routed to three different ppl none of whom spoke english. Unbelievable…. Needless to say I never got an answer as to where the pkg is. This isn’t the first time that this has happened. I will never order anything else from them, they are completely irresponsible",2021-07-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,3.0,350,65,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered pkg sent email saying delivered called c routed three different ppl none spoke english unbelievable… needless say never got answer pkg isn’t first time happened never order anything else completely irresponsible,0.03374967728347651,0.9662503227165234,0.03645541222658441,0.2,0.7904162438035786,79.04162438035786,High Trust
Terry Gill,/users/4d2c76a2000064000105e7b6,GB,12.0,2021-07-03 21:51:02+00:00,1.0,Amazon sellers should collect wrong items.,"I ordered two of an item which was in stock at the time of ordering. I received two of a similar item but not what I wanted or ordered. I claimed a refund or the correct items. Amazon refused unless I returned the items. I would have to carry the items to a Royal Mail Depot and follow a certain procedure to return them. The Depot is about a mile away at the top of a very steep hill. I am eighty eight years of age  and due to medical reasons do not have a car. My wife is similar and is 75 % blind and both of us  very deaf. We cannot use telephones to help with this problem.I feel that when an Amazon seller sends an incorrect item ,then they should collect and replace with correct item or give an immediate refund. I shall be loathe to order any further items from Amazon Sellers.",2021-07-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,3.0,787,156,42,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered two item stock time ordering received two similar item wanted ordered claimed refund correct item amazon refused unless returned item would carry item royal mail depot follow certain procedure return depot mile away top steep hill eighty eight year age due medical reason car wife similar blind u deaf cannot use telephone help problemi feel amazon seller sends incorrect item collect replace correct item give immediate refund shall loathe order item amazon seller,0.01902350932403536,0.9809764906759646,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.8079868432067427,80.79868432067427,High Trust
