r lg,/users/60db850547e6f3001273bc59,DE,1.0,2021-06-29 20:39:38+00:00,1.0,"Amazon no longer fulfills orders as promised, no more guarantees of shipping or availability","It used to be that Amazon would say, available to ship in 1 day fulfilled by Amazon est. shipping 2-3 days , was correct but recently they have changed their system. No longer when you order something even if 100 items are in stock will you get it as it suggests or promises even if you pay extra for shipping.  Amazon changed its algorithms to get more business, the Joe who is up late and is ordering.  Unfortunately that Joe expects his products in a timely fashion, not a week, two weeks, one month, two months or a year later.  He could get it locally or with another online vendor with less the hassle.  But now this is the experience of Amazon This product seems maybe good but I have been waiting on a new tire for over a month now. But it to be used with the tire replacement I ordered over a month ago.The first tire fulfilled by Amazon said available to ship in 1-2 days, 25 were available at the time, I took a screenshot, it also said shipping by the end of the week, I ordered on a Monday morning. Wednesday nothing had changed, not even dispatched, so I called customer service, was told it would be shipping in a couple days not to worry, at that time 20 were still available. Although Wednesday I still could re-order and get by the weekend. But Amazon assured me it would come. Friday still not dispatched and a call revealed that they did not know what the problem was, 8 were still available and it although now it was Friday, it would still be here Monday if ordered again, Amazon sent request to fulfillment (since it is fulfilled by Amazon)  Sunday nothing changed, this customer service call revealed it was out of stock and not know when it would be back in stock I could wait or order another tire.Monday I got an email late that said it would not be in stock until the end of July, it was the first week of June now.  So I called and asked whyWhy, when I order something does not the computer reserved the 1 of the 25 available to me ? and then show 24 available to the next customer, after all I wrote software for Best Buy and other online sites, that how it works, I also trained Amazon Customer service, Walmart, Starbucks etc.  The only way possible was that Amazon has changed their system, not to take away from the available for the order I paid for and placed.  So they can get more orders, maybe it works for them, but in Germany thousands of people are leaving Amazon for these reasons.Now I decided Monday to order a replacement, and with this replacement the same issue, still it is not shipped out or even dispatched even when I call everyday they say it is going out today, it was delayed 2 weeks because out of the 15 available at time of order, no customer is a priority anymore.After a week I noticed the status of the first tire I ordered was changed to in stock available to ship 1-2 days, fulfilled by Amazon est. shipping in 2-3 days arriving.  I could cancel this tire and reorder the original that was cancelled or wait because I think if I did that I would be waiting this game even longerAnd for this order I also had similar problems, although fulfillment was not so long, the only way to review Amazon is this way.  I talked with my colleagues the university here there are 40,000 of them at this online event we were discussing marketing and I brought up amazon, out of the 10,000 attending, they all had similar problems are are also stopping orders with Amazon.Sure I wait a few more days, but I already found it less expensive online at another vendor and can have it by the weekend, will decide what to do in the next days cancel this and go with another vendor, but I know I will not order anything with Amazon for a while, maybe never again, and I spend thousands every year with them.  I think it's time everyone reconsider where they purchase from. I will post this all over social media also, but I think Amazon will not change they want more orders even if they lose customers, they are too big and they don't care about customers, just like all those influencers that used to be amazon associates and gave them almost free marketing, they screwed them first, now they screw the customers.",2021-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,29.0,4155,772,92,14,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used amazon would say available ship day fulfilled amazon est shipping day correct recently changed system longer order something even item stock get suggests promise even pay extra shipping amazon changed algorithm get business joe late ordering unfortunately joe expects product timely fashion week two week one month two month year later could get locally another online vendor less hassle experience amazon product seems maybe good waiting new tire month used tire replacement ordered month agothe first tire fulfilled amazon said available ship day available time took screenshot also said shipping end week ordered monday morning wednesday nothing changed even dispatched called customer service told would shipping couple day worry time still available although wednesday still could reorder get weekend amazon assured would come friday still dispatched call revealed know problem still available although friday would still monday ordered amazon sent request fulfillment since fulfilled amazon sunday nothing changed customer service call revealed stock know would back stock could wait order another tiremonday got email late said would stock end july first week june called asked whywhy order something computer reserved available show available next customer wrote software best buy online site work also trained amazon customer service walmart starbucks etc way possible amazon changed system take away available order paid placed get order maybe work germany thousand people leaving amazon reasonsnow decided monday order replacement replacement issue still shipped even dispatched even call everyday say going today delayed week available time order customer priority anymoreafter week noticed status first tire ordered changed stock available ship day fulfilled amazon est shipping day arriving could cancel tire reorder original cancelled wait think would waiting game even longerand order also similar problem although fulfillment long way review amazon way talked colleague university online event discussing marketing brought amazon attending similar problem also stopping order amazonsure wait day already found less expensive online another vendor weekend decide next day cancel go another vendor know order anything amazon maybe never spend thousand every year think time everyone reconsider purchase post social medium also think amazon change want order even lose customer big dont care customer like influencers used amazon associate gave almost free marketing screwed first screw customer,0.0015437706159272327,0.9984562293840727,0.43297812675266406,0.2,0.8858237400425691,88.58237400425692,High Trust
