Cliff,/users/60d88817791d6900124c9e16,US,2.0,2021-06-27 14:18:54+00:00,1.0,Ivy | Customer Service,"Ivy | Customer ServiceHi Cliff. This is Ivy. Nice to meet you! What can I help with your Automatic Gate Opener?Please confirm the issue so I can help you?I9:50 AMMy ranch in northern Michigan was robbed by destroyinh the gate and opener. I replaced it with this opener.It worked one week,then there was a problem with the control board failing. I sent two unanswered emails to the seller...they were NOT answered.I then threated to leave negative feedback on a blog with thousands od readers and they replied that they did not carry or sell this product.So,the opener is useless and I have not place to go?Cliff9:50 AMIvy | Customer ServiceI am sorry to hear that your house got robbed and the seller is not responsive. No worries, I am here to help you.Did you get hurt in any way, Mr. Cliff?I9:52 AMonly financially....i was at my florida home when it happened9:53 AMIvy | Customer ServiceI sincerely apologize for what happened. I know this is hard for you and for your family but please always remember that bad things happen because you are being prepared for the best one. :)That's good to hear. I hope no one is home when the robbery happened.Can you please send me at least one email transcript of your conversation with the manufacturer?This is for documentation purposes only.I9:54 AMyes,habg on9:55 AMIvy | Customer ServiceSure! I am just here to help you.Is there any update with the transcript?I9:58 AMFrom: Gorilla Grip (Shopify) >Sent: Monday, June 14, 2021 11:23 AMTo: Gorilla Grip >Subject: New customer message on June 14, 2021 at 11:23 amYou received a new message from your online store's contact form.Section:ContactName:Cliff HBody:This is the third email over 30 days.I i do not hear from you in 48hours I'll be posting on my blog to over 1000 sites the review you deserve.I bought a mighty mule that worked 1 weekCliff Houser9:58 AMIvy | Customer ServiceThank you for that information. Upon checking here I do have an option to process you a refund but this is an exception only for you since the return window is already closed.I10:00 AMbecause there was no answer over 8 weeks10:00 AMIvy | Customer ServiceI want you to know that there will be a $69.74 deduction for the restocking fee, shall I proceed?I10:00 AMwhat is required on my end10:00 AMIvy | Customer ServiceThe frustration is understandable, Mr. Cliff, I would do the same if I am on your situation.You need return the item back to us.I10:01 AMi paid 600 to install it on the gate. the problem is the circuit board not the opener10:01 AMIvy | Customer ServiceOh, the thing is you need to return the item so you can get the refund. It has to be accepted by out fulfillment center.I10:03 AMbetter for me to find a source for the board and post negative feedback on them and Amazon.I'll post this thread to over a thousand sites and then the reviews of their non response will hopefully be seen by thousandsYou represented a company that did not return any emails regarding defective equipment...then offered in their benefit another penalty to me for doing business with you both. Rather than have them them replace the defective control board you want me to sustain the labor expense of removing the entire mechanism and sending it back to dishonorable people. So much for Amazon and your vendor\10:09 AMIvy | Customer ServiceI do understand that it’s been very inconvenient in your situation right now that you paid a lot of money for the gate and now the item is defective. If I’m in your situation, I would feel the same way, too.However as our policy we need to scan the item first before the item to be refunded. I10:11 AMI'll copy and post this response to over a thousand blogs on the Internet. Hopefully,both of your business will suffer greatly. Have a good day.10:12 AM",2021-06-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,27.0,3765,649,22,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,ivy customer servicehi cliff ivy nice meet help automatic 