tomer servicei understand it’s inconvenient situation right paid lot money gate item defective i’m situation would feel way toohowever policy need scan item first item refunded amill copy post response thousand blog internet hopefullyboth business suffer greatly good day,0.20343804212599662,0.7965619578740034,0.3639932697700505,0.2,0.7710796328910118,77.10796328910118,High Trust
Sonya,/users/60d86544420fe100134d863d,US,1.0,2021-07-12 00:06:45+00:00,2.0,Delivery drivers can't read.,"I use Amazon quite frequently to the point where amazon delivers to my home every other day. I am writing this review to complain about Amazon because complaints are ignored on their site. You can complain if the package was damaged or if the company you bought from messed up but in every case where I'm unhappy, it's Amazon's fault. My delivery instructions are very clear and there is even a garage code for them to use, however, they continue to drop the packages at the front, take a picture and take off. I live in an area where packages are stolen as soon as the package is left so it is extremely important for the delivery personnel to follow instructions. I have started ordering directly from companies instead of going through Amazon because apparently, amazon drivers can't follow basic instructions.",2021-06-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,7.0,12.0,813,141,28,4,15.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,use amazon quite frequently point amazon delivers home every day writing review complain amazon complaint ignored site complain package damaged company bought messed every case im unhappy amazon fault delivery instruction clear even garage code use however continue drop package front take picture take live area package stolen soon package left extremely important delivery personnel follow instruction started ordering directly company instead going amazon apparently amazon driver cant follow basic instruction,0.017314137323153744,0.9826858626768462,0.07908020190689849,0.4,1.1071589717198027,110.71589717198027,High Trust
