rainbowhermit,/users/5ccac8dee003232aaf8011b3,NZ,2.0,2021-06-27 09:37:59+00:00,1.0,"Ordered a book and a movie (DVD), 40 days later, still nothing. Useless service. Don't bother.","Ordered a book and a movie (DVD) - from different individual sellers on Amazon, on May 18, 2021. Both individual sellers shipped the items quickly. It's now June 27, 2021 (40 days later), and I still haven't received any of these items shipped from Amazon's facility (not the individual seller's fault - only Amazon). I decided that after Amazon's appalling service so far with delivery times, to cancel an order I had made in the meantime, some digital calipers (for measuring fruit size), as well as a brix meter device (for measuring sugar content/sweetness in fruit) because they hadn't even shipped the items after 7 days of utter incompetence. When you try to get information as to where the hell your items are, you're greeted by a useless AI message bot that basically tells you information you already know - like that your order is running late - which is such *helpful* information (please note my sarcasm). Clearly they don't have humans working at Amazon anymore. I honestly don't know how on earth Amazon is still a company - after such bad service, and review after review of bad service (clearly I'm not the only one) and apparently many ex-workers of Amazon too (you only need to do a quick YouTube search). Clearly a bad company, with even worse service. Take your money elsewhere, folks - support your local business, rather than this company that is so utterly incompetent. I will NEVER use Amazon again. Monkeys could run a company better. Honestly.",2021-06-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,27.0,1470,252,94,16,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered book movie dvd different individual seller amazon may individual seller shipped item quickly june day later still havent received item shipped amazon facility individual seller fault amazon decided amazon appalling service far delivery time cancel order made meantime digital caliper measuring fruit size well brix meter device measuring sugar contentsweetness fruit hadnt even shipped item day utter incompetence try get information hell item youre greeted useless ai message bot basically tell information already know like order running late helpful information please note sarcasm clearly dont human working amazon anymore honestly dont know earth amazon still company bad service review review bad service clearly im one apparently many exworkers amazon need quick youtube search clearly bad company even worse service take money elsewhere folk support local business rather company utterly incompetent never use amazon monkey could run company better honestly,0.0025582098171937104,0.9974417901828063,0.14133482893998878,0.2,0.8269878608794008,82.69878608794008,High Trust
