Todd,/users/60cb966a71f6130019cc806b,US,1.0,2021-06-18 09:33:11+00:00,3.0,"2 1/2 stars, not 3.","I am giving the third star reluctantly; I would rather only give 2 1/2 out of 5 stars, as my feelings about the company are 50/50.  As far as prompt delivery and fair pricing goes, Amazon is second to none.  Unfortunately, it is obvious that several of the reviews on the site are bogus, and until recently they would even allow trolls to write ""counter reviews"" to legitimate criticisms.  Where they really falter is in customer service.  I was locked out of my account for unknown reasons and I had to go through a whole rigmarole trying -- unsuccessfully -- to get back into it.  The belligerent, unapologetic operator I spoke to was acting as if I had put HIM out.  I couldn't take it anymore and disconnected the call.  Later, I was inexplicably able to access my account but it was no thanks to them.  They really need to clean up their act.  Goodness knows they can afford to.",2021-06-17 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,18.0,883,160,19,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,giving third star reluctantly would rather give star feeling company far prompt delivery fair pricing go amazon second none unfortunately obvious several review site bogus recently would even allow troll write counter review legitimate criticism really falter customer service locked account unknown reason go whole rigmarole trying unsuccessfully get back belligerent unapologetic operator spoke acting put couldnt take anymore disconnected call later inexplicably able access account thanks really need clean act goodness know afford,0.03305466606551657,0.9669453339344835,0.08973639932697701,0.6,1.4014199468326372,140.1419946832637,High Trust
