Turtle,/users/5ca5f45480e6579a6b9ccffb,US,31.0,2021-06-17 13:20:31+00:00,5.0,"Supremely convenient, great customer service (a customer for 21 years)","Selection, customer service and fast shipping. It's just plain convenient. We place several hundred orders per year. Nearly all our food comes via Amazon. No more trips to Target or Walmart for toiletries or clothes. Trailer hitch receivers, movies, sheds - you name it!Refunds are a piece of cake (in particular for Prime items, which we mostly stick to). Our car is going to last ""forever"" because we do nearly all of our shopping online via Amazon.Prices are usually competitive, the Prime membership saves a ton on shipping, and we get 5% back on all purchases with their rewards card (which is actually a Chase card). That's more than a thousand back per year in our case.Remember when Amazon was just books? Let me predict they'll, at some point future, start selling new cars online. I called it.",2021-06-17 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,17.0,803,138,70,10,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,selection customer service fast shipping plain convenient place several hundred order per year nearly food come via amazon trip target walmart toiletry clothes trailer hitch receiver movie shed name itrefunds piece cake particular prime item mostly stick car going last forever nearly shopping online via amazonprices usually competitive prime membership save ton shipping get back purchase reward card actually chase card thats thousand back per year caseremember amazon book let predict theyll point future start selling new car online called,0.12583670599047977,0.8741632940095202,0.07739764441951767,1.0,1.9525611758886636,195.25611758886637,High Trust
Lisa Raper,/users/60cb26ffc3a27e001ab5caba,US,1.0,2021-06-17 10:42:22+00:00,1.0,Here it goes… a review of their…,"Here it goes… a review of their thievery - back in April I ordered a memory foam mattress from Amazon.  The first one received never fully inflated.  I called after a week and they replaced the item.  In that call I was told to donate or trash the mattress I was initially sent as they could not take them in retun and there was no way I could repack the mattress.  I do not have a commercial vacuum machine it would take to flatten and roll up the memory foam.  Of note - the first mattress had been vacuum packed for almost 2 years.  The replacement only 8 months.  The replacement was fine so one would be led to believe the length of time vacuum packed is the issue with these items not returning to normal and fully inflating.Fast forward a month and I started receiving reminders to return the mattress or be charged again.  I called, I emailed and was again told this was a mistake and I did not have to return the defective mattress and I would not be charged.Last night I saw a charge for a large sum of money appear in my bank app.  I checked and it was the same amount originally spent on the mattress.  I immediately called.  I was told there was nothing that could be done, even if it wiped out my account I use for bills and online/travel purchases. The first agent was great but I wanted to speak to a supervisor just due to the severity of THEIR mistake as Amazon.  The supervisor was rude, condescending and threatens to hang up.  Then is when I did get nasty with him and hung up. Called back - got another nice agent that was able to get the charge reversed.  But - as Amazon.com can take money they are not due in a flash- and admit it was because someone back in April did not do their job- they can take their time RETURNING that money and there is NOTHING the customer can do to fix the problem.  I am sure they will blame the bank but the bank has made it clear it cannot speed up the refund.  So here I sit waiting 3- 5 days for MY money, incorrectly taken from me, to be returned to me.  I can wait for further bills scheduled to be paid automatically to bounce and incur those fees, or incur a fee to transfer money to cover AMAZON’s mistake. Either way, because of their ERROR, I lose and have to pay for their shifty behaviour.",2021-06-17 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,17.0,2256,432,32,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,goes… review thievery back april ordered memory foam mattress amazon first one received never fully inflated called week replaced item call told donate trash mattress initially sent could take retun way could repack mattress commercial vacuum machine would take flatten roll memory foam note first mattress vacuum packed almost year replacement month replacement fine one would led believe length time vacuum packed issue item returning normal fully inflatingfast forward month started receiving reminder return mattress charged called emailed told mistake return defective mattress would chargedlast night saw charge large sum money appear bank app checked amount originally spent mattress immediately called told nothing could done even wiped account use bill onlinetravel purchase first agent great wanted speak supervisor due severity mistake amazon supervisor rude condescending threatens hang get nasty hung called back got another nice agent able get charge reversed amazoncom take money due flash admit someone back april job take time returning money nothing customer fix problem sure blame bank bank made clear cannot speed refund sit waiting day money incorrectly taken returned wait bill scheduled paid automatically bounce incur fee incur fee transfer money cover amazon’s mistake either way error lose pay shifty behaviour,0.013160465111938715,0.9868395348880613,0.2422882781828379,0.2,0.8418774230805982,84.18774230805982,High Trust
