Carol Brady,/users/60746147359d57001a8daae2,US,2.0,2021-06-15 21:37:47+00:00,1.0,Poor care when delivering and horrible seller support.,"The Amazon delivery seems to have a problem with reading the sign on the front door that says in big bold red lamination ""PLEASE DELIVER PACKAGES TO THE BACK DOOR"".  Today they just dumped my packages in the driveway.  Unfortunately you can find everything on Amazon.  So hard to find stuff I do buy still.  As the owner of a company that also sells on Amazon, the seller support is virtually non existent.   Yes you can go to the knowledge base or community forum and read the useless answers that don't cover your specific issue.  You're only other option is to email support.  NO phone calls allowed period. So I have sent many many emails trying to resolve issues.  You may as well email your local politician.  You will receive a reply that vaguely touches on the topic in question or maybe doesn't address your question at all.  The only way you will ever get anything resolved is to badger them with email after email on the same topic.  Reopen cases after they have been closed (by Amazon) and resubmit your question.  I had some listings that were out of Amazon policy and were removed by Amazon until I ""corrected"" them.  This only happened because Amazon changed the requirements.  So I corrected all of my listings and still nothing.  I emailed them to let them know I had corrected the issue.  They emailed me back letting me know that I needed to make the corrections I had already made. Frustrating?  It took all summer to resolve the issue.  I mean it took me one day and all summer to get Amazon to realize that I had indeed done all they required.",2021-06-15 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,15.0,1565,281,54,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon delivery seems problem reading sign front door say big bold red lamination please deliver package back door today dumped package driveway unfortunately find everything amazon hard find stuff buy still owner company also sell amazon seller support virtually non existent yes go knowledge base community forum read useless answer dont cover specific issue youre option email support phone call allowed period sent many many email trying resolve issue may well email local politician receive reply vaguely touch topic question maybe doesnt address question way ever get anything resolved badger email email topic reopen case closed amazon resubmit question listing amazon policy removed amazon corrected happened amazon changed requirement corrected listing still nothing emailed let know corrected issue emailed back letting know needed make correction already made frustrating took summer resolve issue mean took one day summer get amazon realize indeed done required,0.005365852175277125,0.9946341478247229,0.15759955131800338,0.2,0.8288369841759621,82.88369841759621,High Trust
