Aleana B,/users/60c7911599e71c001a8057dc,PR,3.0,2021-06-15 14:38:19+00:00,1.0,Amazon sold me a counterfeit product and then deleted my review.,"1) Amazon had a listing of what seemed like a counterfeit product (<$500 price tag for what should have been a $2k item.)2) Amazon representative told me that they personally vetted the product and that it's authenticated. I have screenshots of this conversation.3) I ended up buying the product. When I received it, it was obviously fake. Still, I paid a professional authenticator and they confirmed that it's counterfeit.4) I reported this to Amazon, they apologized, but they did not allow me to post my review on the seller's product page!In short, Amazon sold me counterfeit AND is covering up for a seller who should not only be banned, but reported to authorities.Forgot to mention, I'm a ""prime"" customer, who had easily spent multiple 5 digits with this garbage business, not out of love, but out of necessity. This is what you get when you allow psychopaths to have monopoly over the market, and then you push small businesses to shut down during a pandemic.EDIT:Remember the fake bag I bought, which the seller only had ONE of? Well, the merchant, now has a mysterious 5 star review that says ""Love it!""Except this review was posted while I was in possession of the one bag. Sooo either they're lying about stock levels to create false scarcity, or they're creating fake reviews. Take your pick.",2021-06-14 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,15.0,1307,223,64,11,1.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon listing seemed like counterfeit product price tag k item amazon representative told personally vetted product authenticated screenshots conversation ended buying product received obviously fake still paid professional authenticator confirmed counterfeit reported amazon apologized allow post review seller product pagein short amazon sold counterfeit covering seller banned reported authoritiesforgot mention im prime customer easily spent multiple digit garbage business love necessity get allow psychopath monopoly market push small business shut pandemiceditremember fake bag bought seller one well merchant mysterious star review say love itexcept review posted possession one bag sooo either theyre lying stock level create false scarcity theyre creating fake review take pick,0.2714674492701589,0.728532550729841,0.1250701065619742,0.2,0.6892802966773153,68.92802966773152,Medium Trust
