"Unhappy PAYING, customer 😤",/users/60c4c8955e8b8c0019ac6487,GB,3.0,2021-06-12 14:46:07+00:00,1.0,Absolutely disgusting delivery…,"Absolutely disgusting delivery service!! I was due to have a parcel delivered from them today. The driver presses my number in the intercom system(I live in a flat) I saw it was a man with a box in his hand so I buzzed him into the building. I wait and wait and wait at my front door, standing there, door wide open.......no one arrives. I check my amazon account,looked at my orders for it to tell me the parcel had been delivered and handed to resident!!!! No such exchange happened at all. I even went downstairs to check to see if it was left down there and nothing. Not the first time this has happened. I saw him, from my window, get back in his van and drive away?! I'm absolutely fuming. When I call to explain, I get a load of ridiculous excuses as to what happened and get asked to wait 24 hours as it may still turn up!! I said not a chance I am waiting any longer. I already waited 3 days for this parcel despite the fact I pay for this service every month and I refuse to wait any longer. She kept telling me she couldn't refund me or reorder for another 24 hours and I repeatedly kept telling her no. Then all of a sudden she was able to offer a refund?! So now I have to wait yet again, for my money to come back to me. 5-7 days to refund!! Takes 5 minutes for them to take the money when I order something though or the stroke of midnight when taking the membership money. Given they are such a big company and the fact I pay for it, they really need to sort themselves out as their service is appalling. This has happened so many times now. Membership is definitely being cancelled just as soon as I get my money. I refuse to pay them another penny as you don't even get the kind of service they say you do with a membership. NEVER AGAIN!!!!",2021-06-12 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,12.0,1758,344,31,3,0.0,0,16,2,1,Suspicious,absolutely disgusting deliver