Geoffrey Devred,/users/60bcec509110c3001a916379,GB,2.0,2021-06-06 15:42:01+00:00,1.0,Terrible incompetent customer service.,"I tried to collect my package from one of their pickup points yesterday. I was unable to do it after many attempts (I scanned the bar code and typed the code many times but nothing was working). The error message that was displayed on the screen was saying that the code was incorrect. I contacted their customer service via text message and he told me I would get a new code within 24 hours. After 24 hours, still no email with my code from Amazon.Today I contacted them again and a guy told me that the locker could have been opened manually in the first place. Problem: I am not in front of it any more of course. As an Amazon Prime customer, I can't express how disappointed I am!Disgraceful!",2021-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,6.0,696,130,38,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,tried collect package one pickup point yesterday unable many attempt scanned bar code typed code many time nothing working error message displayed screen saying code incorrect contacted customer service via text message told would get new code within hour hour still email code amazontoday contacted guy told locker could opened manually first place problem front course amazon prime customer cant express disappointed amdisgraceful,0.38163019217924715,0.6183698078207529,0.07291082445316882,0.2,0.6237670688010103,62.37670688010103,Medium Trust
Martin Brenner,/users/600b0e259f7d2d001ad53589,US,8.0,2021-06-06 15:04:39+00:00,1.0,Our new Samsung TV has never worked…,"Our new Samsung TV has never worked properly. Samsung has looked at it and even sent it and the soundbar  to be looked at this causing Amazon to decline refunding it because Samsung held it past my 30 days!. 12, 12 customer support calls and one home service and it still sits there. Samsungs repair tech stated it looked like I was sold a refurbished TV. Amazon not Samsung continually avoids this. 63 years old and this is the most bizzare situation. Working for one of the three major news networks I will remove both off our vendors list and we will no longer buy from them in my specific area. BUYER BEWARE! This is the second defective tv sent back to Amazon. They are confused about the billing and have let me sit here with a useless TV and out $1399.00. They claim they refunded me and they did. I then bought the same garbage from them it needs to be refunded. Refurbished or used, It's Fraud.Avoid these companies for your sanity. These once great companies turned into a flea market",2021-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,6.0,994,182,36,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,new samsung tv never worked properly samsung looked even sent soundbar looked causing amazon decline refunding samsung held past day customer support call one home service still sits samsungs repair tech stated looked like sold refurbished tv amazon samsung continually avoids year old bizzare situation working one three major news network remove vendor list longer buy specific area buyer beware second defective tv sent back amazon confused billing let sit useless tv claim refunded bought garbage need refunded refurbished used fraudavoid company sanity great company turned flea market,0.3396420958295369,0.660357904170463,0.10207515423443635,0.2,0.6505939829321187,65.05939829321187,Medium Trust
Sonia Rashid,/users/5fca6ed20f30bd00198c7856,GB,4.0,2021-06-06 12:24:01+00:00,1.0,Delivery drama! Terrible customer service,"My delivery was delivered by an amazon delivery driver this morning. He left the parcel unattended, got back in us car and left! Nobody answered the door! The instruction he left on the app 'handed to resodent' was extremely false! I have the ring doorbell and have video evidence of this. I wasn't able to check notification for this untill midday. Of which I saw this recording and another one in which a women is walking away from my door. After checking the doorstep I have seen there is no parcel. Speaking to customer services has been absolutely shocking! The first gentleman attempted to fob me of by saying it was falsely marked as delivered and I have to wait a couple of day. When I explained I had a video showing the delivery his tune changed. He said he has refunded me the moneys for the items. However I needed the items today so this is not helpful to me right now! He then said he has raised a complaint and I should hear back within 48 hours. He had transferred me to the delivery department, and I spoke with Darel. Darel was not helpful. And was extremely rude. Would always speak over me. I explained the situation again. And he said that as the package was delivered amazon fulfilled its service. I highlighted the fact the the package was left unattended. In full view of passersby. Darel then went on to blame me for not leaving delivery instructions. Stating that it is the perogative of amazon delivery driver to leave parcels on the doorstep unattended. I tried to explain to him that common sense dictates that if someone doesn't answer their door. They may not be in. So like every other delivery service and in a few cases prior, amazon themselves, they should leave a calling card and take the parcel with them! Darel said this is not what they do. I am furious by the blatent wantonness by amazon delivery drivers and customer service representatives. Absolutely ridiculous",2021-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,6.0,1906,340,41,5,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,delivery delivered amazon delivery driver morning left parcel unattended got back u car left nobody answered door instruction left app handed resodent extremely false ring doorbell video evidence wasnt able check notification untill midday saw recording another one woman walking away door checking doorstep seen parcel speaking customer service absolutely shocking first gentleman attempted fob saying falsely marked delivered wait couple day explained video showing delivery tune changed said refunded money item however needed item today helpful right said raised complaint hear back within hour transferred delivery department spoke darel darel helpful extremely rude would always speak explained situation said package delivered amazon fulfilled service highlighted fact package left unattended full view passersby darel went blame leaving delivery instruction stating perogative amazon delivery driver leave parcel doorstep unattended tried explain common sense dictate someone doesnt answer door may like every delivery service case prior amazon leave calling card take parcel darel said furious blatent wantonness amazon delivery driver customer service representative absolutely ridiculous,0.9948169949642831,0.005183005035716892,0.19068984856982613,0.2,0.34072947223182365,34.07294722318237,Low Trust
t haddad,/users/60bc4bc69110c3001a911c4a,US,1.0,2021-06-06 04:15:38+00:00,1.0,Extremely disappointing,"Extremely disappointing. I paid extra for next day shipping. Still no product 3 days later. Tracking for product was not updated. No offer to replace my order. Customer service personnel unable to locate my product or tell me if it was still out for delivery. I was only offered a refund. While I was on hold, I was able to locate what I needed from another company.",2021-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,6.0,366,67,23,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,extremely disappointing paid extra next day shipping still product day later tracking product updated offer replace order customer service personnel unable locate product tell still delivery offered refund hold able locate needed another company,0.027099302684309462,0.9729006973156905,0.03757711721817162,0.2,0.7939657721014796,79.39657721014795,High Trust
Julie-Anne Smith,/users/5b11a73f4de5666d34503973,GB,9.0,2021-06-05 19:19:13+00:00,1.0,Absolutely shocking experience,"Absolutely shocking experienceI stopped in all day for a delivery, followed the tracker and was told driver 1 stop away and location less than 100 yards or so away on the next road.....no delivery so  checked tracker again....it then says driver has a few more deliveries to do....still no delivery....tracker then updates to say delivery attempted. NO IT WAS NOT!.I then went through to Amazon customer services and was fobbed off with obvious scripted apology and advised driver would be instructed to re deliver today.I followed the tracker again to see delivery attempted again at 7.11, NO IT WAS NOT!!.Second contact in customer services advises that the re delivery was attempted 54km away from my address!The driver is obviously incapable of doing his job and telling the truth.The operative has now cancelled the order and refunded me.I worry for anyone ordering on their prime promotion day.My order was in reaction to one of the daily offer texts I get from Amazon....obviously too good to be true and they are incapable of fulfilling them",2021-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,5.0,1049,173,30,3,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,absolutely shocking experiencei stopped day delivery followed tracker told driver stop away location less yard away next roadno delivery checked tracker againit say driver delivery dostill deliverytracker update say delivery attempted noti went amazon customer service fobbed obvious scripted apology advised driver would instructed deliver todayi followed tracker see delivery attempted notsecond contact customer service advises delivery attempted km away addressthe driver obviously incapable job telling truththe operative cancelled order refunded mei worry anyone ordering prime promotion daymy order reaction one daily offer text get amazonobviously good true incapable fulfilling,0.9351074052703137,0.06489259472968634,0.09702748177229388,0.2,0.3