S. Langan,/users/604faf592798f800190dad41,US,4.0,2021-05-28 11:37:19+00:00,5.0,NO RETAILER DOES IT BETTER,"I absolutely love Amazon because they’ve made life so much easier, as well as countless others.  There have been a couple of unpleasant experiences but it’s to be expected when most of all my gazillion purchases are Amazon.  In rural areas, Amazon does there best to get packages to customers but expecting 2 day deliveries is unrealistic, 4 days has been the maximum time I’ve waited.  To lift the burden off Amazon, if I didn’t need the item, I’d click on standard shipping but the packages came quicker than if I didn’t have prime.  My hope is that Mr. Bezos opens an Amazon distribution center in Niagara Falls and a kiosk retail store would bring lots of people from the entire WNY area and Canada.  Niagara Falls is ripe for a business like Amazon because there’s a lot of open space and from an economical standpoint, a steal.  My daughter in NYC said Amazon Fresh is “lovely”, a word she has never used to describe a retail food delivery service.  Thank you for reading my review.",2021-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,28.0,988,176,26,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolutely love amazon they’ve made life much easier well countless others couple unpleasant experience it’s expected gazillion purchase amazon rural area amazon best get package customer expecting day delivery unrealistic day maximum time i’ve waited lift burden amazon didn’t need item i’d click standard shipping package came quicker didn’t prime hope mr bezos open amazon distribution center niagara fall kiosk retail store would bring lot people entire wny area canada niagara fall ripe business like amazon there’s lot open space economical standpoint steal daughter nyc said amazon fresh “lovely” word never used describe retail food delivery service thank reading review,0.02293585765658637,0.9770641423434137,0.09871003925967471,1.0,2.008274079023642,200.8274079023642,High Trust
