LadyBug,/users/60af9c1232d2990019becadd,US,1.0,2021-05-27 13:18:40+00:00,1.0,Not so great service,"I pay for the extra service of Amazon Prime which usually includes free two day shipping.  However, I am finding that within the past year or two my packages are usually a day late.  I could understand if this happened around holidays; however this is also happening during other times of the year.  Lately it has felt that Amazon has become more and more less reliable.  I don’t even see the point of paying $13/ month to receive the substandard service I have been receiving.",2021-05-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,27.0,477,85,20,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,pay extra service amazon prime usually includes free two day shipping however finding within past year two package usually day late could understand happened around holiday however also happening time year lately felt amazon become less reliable don’t even see point paying month receive substandard service receiving,0.02075738173895456,0.9792426182610454,0.04767246214245653,0.2,0.799155801559014,79.9155801559014,High Trust
michelle davis,/users/60af78c75e4038001ae50330,US,6.0,2021-05-27 10:47:41+00:00,1.0,Such bad service from Amazon and the…,"Such bad service from Amazon and the vendor! No communication what so ever from either side. I ordered 2 items, my card was charged and on the day the items were supposed to arrive they canceled my order. After waiting several days my order was returned back! They marked undeliverable on the status with no proof delivery. I check the tracking info and my purchase never left Los Angeles, CA I live in Miami, FL?? Screen shot attached. I'm canceling my account with Amazon and I make frequent purchases very dishonest now I have to wait 3-5 days for my refund as if it's my fault they decided to return my items without my knowledge or consent. Really Amazon is that how you guys are doing business now?",2021-05-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,27.0,704,128,37,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,bad service amazon vendor communication ever either side ordered item card charged day item supposed arrive canceled order waiting several day order returned back marked undeliverable status proof delivery check tracking info purchase never left los angeles ca live miami fl screen shot attached im canceling account amazon make frequent purchase dishonest wait day refund fault decided return item without knowledge consent really amazon guy business,0.1644911983084613,0.8355088016915387,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.7321122247380857,73.21122247380856,Medium Trust
Joyous Marie,/users/60aef34d28d2da0019b0e624,US,1.0,2021-05-27 01:18:16+00:00,3.0,Prime,"Overall, I do enjoy Amazon. I'm not much of a fan of their Prime Membership, simply because everything I would buy never does fall under their Membership. So it's always an added and unnecessary expense.When that happens you still pay for for the shipping, and then wait for the item to arrive, whenever it gets there, rather than enjoying the 2 day, free shipping that you're paying for with prime. It just seems more like a waste of money to me.But I've never had an issue with Amazon itself.",2021-05-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,27.0,494,89,5,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,overall enjoy amazon im much fan prime membership simply everything would buy never fall membership always added unnecessary expensewhen happens still pay shipping wait item arrive whenever get rather enjoying day free shipping youre paying prime seems like waste money mebut ive never issue amazon,0.036781400167204666,0.9632185998327953,0.04991587212563096,0.6,1.3915924743415238,139.15924743415238,High Trust
