Tyler Aronne,/users/5cfa69ea400f6f12fb2bf4c0,US,15.0,2021-05-26 12:43:26+00:00,1.0,I remember shopping on Amazon when it…,"I remember shopping on Amazon when it was good many years ago. My last customer service interactions with them, probably the last five or so for varying reasons, have been negative. When Amazon gets it right, fast shipping and a good price, they are the best, but when they get it wrong, they are the worst. It's hard to give them anything other than a one because they are basically an artificial intelligence, so the robot gets high scores but the people behind the curtains get the one star.",2021-05-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,26.0,494,89,38,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,remember shopping amazon good many year ago last customer service interaction probably last five varying reason negative amazon get right fast shipping good price best get wrong worst hard give anything one basically artificial intelligence robot get high score people behind curtain get one star,0.035699801185110236,0.9643001988148898,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.792133273832571,79.21332738325711,High Trust
