Carol,/users/5dc0aaaafcab4fdc2dade6fd,US,4.0,2021-05-26 03:10:18+00:00,1.0,Amazon is horrible,"Amazon has gotten really bad with deliveries not being delivered, not being delivered on time and being delivered damaged. Also,if you have a subscribe and save they wait until the day before item is due to be sent to tell you the item is not available. In the past two months I have had to contact an Amazon supervisor and a person in logistics to get my orders resolved. And customer service is horrible. They can't seem to find your account information even when you give them your name, address, phone number, order number or tracking number. They need your email to locate you. Amazon was great when it first offered their service but it is horrible now. And products are getting more expensive but are cheaply made. So disappointing and frustrating considering they have raised the yearly membership amount but lowered their standards for providing decent service to their customers. Jeff needs to put more time and effort back into his business and less time into politics and outside events.",2021-05-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,26.0,999,171,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon gotten really bad delivery delivered delivered time delivered damaged alsoif subscribe save wait day item due sent tell item available past two month contact amazon supervisor person logistics get order resolved customer service horrible cant seem find account information even give name address phone number order number tracking number need email locate amazon great first offered service horrible product getting expensive cheaply made disappointing frustrating considering raised yearly membership amount lowered standard providing decent service customer jeff need put time effort back business less time politics outside event,0.004957065846737375,0.9950429341532626,0.09590577678070668,0.2,0.8167026224327726,81.67026224327726,High Trust
JD,/users/60ad9e764d27a40019566b6a,US,1.0,2021-05-26 01:04:15+00:00,2.0,Tired of Amazon,"Honestly, I love Amazon but ever since they switched from using UPS and went to using Amazon drivers for delivery (about a year or so ago) about 75% of the time there is some kind of issue with their drivers not being able to find my house. I have something delivered to my house almost weekly, UPS and FedEx never has an issue. I don’t know if it’s the GPS app that Amazon drivers are using but it is TERRIBLE! I am constantly calling them with complaints and every time they ask if I want to update my delivery info. Like HELLO!!!! I don’t have any update, it’s my dang address I can’t change it because the drivers are incapable of finding it even though no one else has an issue.I have literally put on my account a step by step direction breakdown from both ways you can access my address and it is extremely detailed. Their excuse this time was the driver did try calling, well I’m sorry I live in TX and when I see WA number I am not going to answer. I mean a reasonable thing to do would send a text message or call and then leave a message saying I will try to call you back one more time in five minutes. But no, let’s call once and then do some message on your Amazon account (which is a new feature) and try to start a chat that way... 1. Didn’t even know that was a thing 2. I don’t have Amazon notifications “enabled” on my phone, so that is useless. What makes matters worse is when I call and ask them to track the package to the driver hauling it, they can’t retrieve that info and couldn’t transfer me to someone who could. Ummm, I’m sorry. I work for an acetylene gas company and I can track down the driver, truck number and trailer number with whatever customer product we are shipping out. If I can do that then they can track down the driver. They have done it before, and he did confirm it was an amazon driver not a third party. But that is horribly inefficient on Amazon if you can’t track packages down to that extent. Sorry for the rant. But I am incredibly tired of Amazon and the incompetent drivers that they have employed. Switch GPS apps or go back to using UPS. Canceling my meme er ship looks better and better every day, only reason why I haven’t yet is because I’m holding out hope. But I’m almost out of hope.",2021-05-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,26.0,2247,433,15,3,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,honestly love amazon ever since switched using ups went using amazon driver delivery year ago time kind issue driver able find house something delivered house almost weekly ups fedex never issue don’t know it’s gps app amazon driver using terrible constantly calling complaint every time ask want update delivery info like hello don’t update it’s dang address can’t change driver incapable finding even though one else issuei literally put account step step direction breakdown way access address extremely detailed excuse time driver try calling well i’m sorry live tx see wa number going answer mean reasonable thing would send text message call leave message saying try call back one time five minute let’s call message amazon account new feature try start chat way didn’t even know thing don’t amazon notification “enabled” phone useless make matter worse call ask track package driver hauling can’t retrieve info couldn’t transfer someone could ummm i’m sorry work acetylene gas company track driver truck number trailer number whatever customer product shipping track driver done confirm amazon driver third party horribly inefficient amazon can’t track package extent sorry rant incredibly tired amazon incompetent driver employed switch gps apps go back using ups canceling meme er ship look better better every day reason haven’t yet i’m holding hope i’m almost hope,0.9635320687714917,0.03646793122850833,0.2428491306786315,0.4,0.6668037917499805,66.68037917499805,Medium Trust
