Suzanne Davis,/users/5258db9f00006400015015d9,GB,42.0,2021-05-25 15:37:37+00:00,1.0,Amazon a company that deserves zero if…,"Amazon a company that deserves zero if not minus stars, but I can't do that to leave a review.Once again they send an email to say 'Your item has been dispatched'Followed by track your item.Your parcel is out for delivery.Your item will be delivered by 1PMYour parcel will be delivered between 2PM and 5PM.Your item will be delivered by 8PMYour item will definately be with you by 10PM.Only to then get an email.Hi ...Your parcel is still on the way but running late. Now expected tomorrow or the day after-but most parcels arrive within a day.We are sorry it won't arrive today but we will let you know when your parcel is out for delivery.You can always track your parcel for the latest updates.PLease note this email was sent from an email address that can't recieve emails. Please don't reply to this email.What utter rubbish do they expect us to believe?It has either been sent or it hasn't.I cvan still order the self same item for guarenteed delivery tomorrow, not on prime but if I pay extra.This will definately be the very last thing I ever purchase via Amazon.Amazon a company that hides behind the fact you can not contact them.A company that will not allow you to leave a bad review on it's own site.A company that you pay for a service and don't recieve the one promised.Oh and a very important bit they included.If your parcel does not arrive by X you can claim a free refund.What the heck is a free refund?I paid for the item, how can a refund be free?I can't be charged for a broken contract.",2021-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,25.0,1509,272,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon company deserves zero minus star cant leave reviewonce send email say item dispatchedfollowed track itemyour parcel deliveryyour item delivered pmyour parcel delivered pm pmyour item delivered pmyour item definately pmonly get emailhi parcel still way running late expected tomorrow day afterbut parcel arrive within daywe sorry wont arrive today let know parcel deliveryyou always track parcel latest updatesplease note email sent email address cant recieve email please dont reply emailwhat utter rubbish expect u believeit either sent hasnti cvan still order self item guarenteed delivery tomorrow prime pay extrathis definately last thing ever purchase via amazonamazon company hide behind fact contact thema company allow leave bad review sitea company pay service dont recieve one promisedoh important bit includedif parcel arrive x claim free refundwhat heck free refundi paid item refund freei cant charged broken contract,0.047472770497232884,0.9525272295027671,0.1525518788558609,0.2,0.8067739905225557,80.67739905225557,High Trust
JH,/users/602f37874d2c59001b353739,GB,10.0,2021-05-25 05:16:14+00:00,2.0,Yikes!,"Amazon Prime subscriber here; very hit and miss with Amazon deliveries!I barely get my packages on the 'next day' I'm paying for, a package was once thrown on the kerb outside someone's house a few streets away (person in the house saw it happened and kindly retrieved it and brought it to my address), packages are more often than not, left at the communal door on the street (I live in apartment complex) or just inside with no notice (never buzzes my intercom!) save for a photo email at least an hour late showing my package in a 'safe place' (one other time it was 'handed to resident' err, no it wasn't!) only for it to be stolen once I got down 2 flights of stairs to pick it up....really, these delivery guys are too lazy to actually bring it to my door.The postman delivers to my door, all other delivery companies do, even supermarket food deliveries are hoiked up the stairs to me....so WHY Amazon, do you refuse to?Customer service online chats are always helpful and accommodating and I got an immediate refund for the stolen package, but I suspect they read off a script tick box fashion so actually getting my issue across in a timely manner is a long drawn out affair.Seriously, I think I have to cancel my subscription for good if this continues to be the 'norm'...for Amazon!I'm expecting another delivery later today (which should have been yesterday) so feeling anxious now....fingers crossed, hey?",2021-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,25.0,1418,249,6,1,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,amazon prime subscriber hit miss amazon deliveriesi barely get package next day im paying package thrown kerb outside someone house street away person house saw happened kindly retrieved brought address package often left communal door street live apartment complex inside notice never buzz intercom save photo email least hour late showing package safe place one time handed resident err wasnt stolen got flight stair pick upreally delivery guy lazy actually bring doorthe postman delivers door delivery company even supermarket food delivery hoiked stair meso amazon refuse tocustomer service online chat always helpful accommodating got immediate refund stolen package suspect read script tick box fashion actually getting issue across timely manner long drawn affairseriously think cancel subscription good continues normfor amazonim expecting another delivery later today yesterday feeling anxious nowfingers crossed hey,0.9235585864139301,0.07644141358606993,0.13965227145260797,0.4,0.6661511610835565,66.61511610835565,Medium Trust
