Angie Lanovaz,/users/5b76b8684de5666d34d6af6c,CA,6.0,2021-05-24 14:15:35+00:00,2.0,Ive been an amzon customer since 2015…,"Ive been an amzon.ca customer since 2015 when they were new and just finding a place on the map.  Back then they really cared about their customers and stepped up their customer service and care to a whole new level.Much like most companies they forget about who made them big (the consumers) and their service fell by the waste side.Its now a company thats gotten to big for its britches and cares very little if your happy with their service or not.I pay prime fees and my parcels are well past their delivery time at the best of times.My son tried amazon, he said never again!..reason my mothers day order was placed well in advance, the day it was suppose to arrive it was canceled as product was damaged (4 items) his money was refunded but that provided him little comfort as mothers day was in two days in a lock down.  They blamed it on the seller and offered NOTHING for his inconvenience not even to expedite the same things.They are never accountable for things that go wrong and never try to rectify it anymore...this leaves a bad taste in my mouth! I use to rave about them...not so much anymore.  I myself keep looking for the next amazing company that cares for its consumers ...mean while i have started shopping more locally and doing curb side to try and eliminate my frustration with amazon.",2021-05-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,24.0,1310,236,38,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,ive amzonca customer since new finding place map back really cared customer stepped customer service care whole new levelmuch like company forget made big consumer service fell waste sideits company thats gotten big britches care little happy service noti pay prime fee parcel well past delivery time best timesmy son tried amazon said never againreason mother day order placed well advance day suppose arrive canceled product damaged item money refunded provided little comfort mother day two day lock blamed seller offered nothing inconvenience even expedite thingsthey never accountable thing go wrong never try rectify anymorethis leaf bad taste mouth use rave themnot much anymore keep looking next amazing company care consumer mean started shopping locally curb side try eliminate frustration amazon,0.10963423000564546,0.8903657699943546,0.13236118900729107,0.4,1.0716551227986355,107.16551227986355,High Trust
Lauren,/users/60aba4d29706a4001a0d8d11,US,2.0,2021-05-24 13:07:20+00:00,1.0,What’s the point of being a Prime Member?????,"As person who had been on the side of a Amazon Customer Service Representative and a actual loyal customer. The company is trash. The Prime Membership is a joke and they do not honor their own terms. The 2 day shipping turns into a week and ends up in the hands of other carriers instead of Amazon themselves. They make you wait a extra day after your delivery has been missed just to get a refund or replacement.  Prime Video is the worst streaming service,they just play recycled movies which you can see for free on Tubi or Pluto TV. You might as well just order straight from the manufacturer and eliminate Amazon had the middle man.",2021-05-24 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,24.0,637,117,45,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,person side amazon customer service representative actual loyal customer company trash prime membership joke honor term day shipping turn week end hand carrier instead amazon make wait extra day delivery missed get refund replacement prime video worst streaming servicethey play recycled movie see free tubi pluto tv might well order straight manufacturer eliminate amazon middle man,0.008062263993050637,0.9919377360069493,0.06561974200785194,0.2,0.809092816405045,80.9092816405045,High Trust
