Dean,/users/60aa7ac20e0f7000198e1d40,US,1.0,2021-05-23 15:57:02+00:00,1.0,You dont need to be rude to drivers,"You dont need to be rude to drivers, in Portland Oregon the people here are just so rude! We are doing you a favor with our own vehicles, after wear and tear and gas we really dont make that much money, so when your package is late often times it is the traffic, warehouse, or the glitchy app that navigates us to your destination. Dont be mad at us. Thank us for doing this stressful job, it isnt a dream job and we arent making enough to pay Bills. This is an added income for people just trying to make it in an overpriced economy.",2021-05-23 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,23.0,534,105,35,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,dont need rude driver portland oregon people rude favor vehicle wear tear gas really dont make much money package late often time traffic warehouse glitchy app navigates u destination dont mad u thank u stressful job isnt dream job arent making enough pay bill added income people trying make overpriced economy,0.08814588857721549,0.9118541114227845,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.767704958123058,76.7704958123058,High Trust
