Jack Evans,/users/60a8fdf9e47d8f001af093d5,US,1.0,2021-05-22 12:50:20+00:00,2.0,love Amazon Hate Amazon,"I love Amazon, they have pretty good tech support.But……..Seems half the time the item never shows up. They send you a email that says “oops, sorry looks like your item has been lost in the system” Or oops, sorry your item did not show up on expected date, please allow another 7 days. Then another and never shows.At this point they do offer your money to be credited back.The last couple packages have shown up with the box ripped to pieces, crushed and looks like it was hit by a bus. Fortunately the item seemed to survive with only a couple scratches.I pay for the premium service but feel I get the poorest service possible.Maybe they just got to big for their britches.My membership is being canceled at the of this review. Enough is enough,",2021-05-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,22.0,747,135,23,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,love amazon pretty good tech supportbut……seems half time item never show send email say “oops sorry look like item lost system” oops sorry item show expected date please allow another day another never showsat point offer money credited backthe last couple package shown box ripped piece crushed look like hit bus fortunately item seemed survive couple scratchesi pay premium service feel get poorest service possiblemaybe got big britchesmy membership canceled review enough enough,0.02343390562950833,0.9765660943704917,0.07571508693213685,0.4,1.1034260645716731,110.3426064571673,High Trust
