G L,/users/609570433beaf40019c38f78,NL,19.0,2021-06-03 14:02:39+00:00,1.0,beware US to NL misleading gift card scam,"So you have different amazon sites not to confuse with the dutch amazon website.US website is the one with dot com.now when you compare the dutch amazon and the American amazon then they sell different products, yet the American amazon tells it can sent products to the Netherlands.after I signed up, I had no pay options like paypal or IDEAL, so I bought 60$ in gift card from a dutch reseller a third party.So I go to the product which I want to buy, and guess what?, the button is disabled.after speaking with the support and having alot of issues with my email addresses since I used a disposable email address for data protection (my fault, although also from amazon because they misleaded me).the consumer support told me that I cannot use the gift card because I have to reside in the US even though they state it can be shipped to the Netherlands.This is very misleading, and they have locked my funds in their US amazon, refunding doesn't work the support just removes your gift balance and tries to sent it to the resellers bank rather than me.So a big big warning about buying US gift cards from third partys and locking them in amazon.you won't get your funds back be aware of this scam and neither you can buy products./edit it seemed I figured a loophole to still be able to buy products but after that my account got suspended because I had to verify my giftcard. /End editI found it very disciminating how the amazon US acts upon european citizens and I might even consider for not buying a product on any amazon this includes also the dutch one.and note I'm not attacking amazons support here they did a great job but where limited.I will not support a company like this mather, its amazons its own responsibility for allowing grey markets and locking funds.",2021-05-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,6.0,3.0,1775,317,41,8,12.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,different amazon site confuse 