Yervand Abrahamian,/users/60a3af864b39a7001bb50179,AM,1.0,2021-05-18 12:15:03+00:00,1.0,I was charged but didn’t get the package,"I was charged but didn’t get the package. Tried to solve the problem with the customer service but they claim that the package has been delivered to my Freight Forwarder company but my Freight Forwarder approves that they didn’t get that package, after a several days of investigation my FF company provided a document that confirms they have not got any package from Amazon. I have sent that document to Amazon and that's all, I have been waiting more than 15 days for their side investigation, I have contacted customer support more than 10 times, and every time they just say that the package was delivered. I have requested them to provide me a “proof of delivery” and the answer every time was “tracking status is only the proof of delivery” and they refuse to provide any type of document that confirms that delivery .I do not want to deceive anyone, I am making this review because it seems that this is the only way to make my voice and my complaint heard.I was charged 200$ for just nothing. This is the worst experience ever!!!",2021-05-18 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,18.0,1037,185,40,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,charged didn’t get package tried solve problem customer service claim package delivered freight forwarder company freight forwarder approves didn’t get package several day investigation ff company provided document confirms got package amazon sent document amazon thats waiting day side investigation contacted customer support time every time say package delivered requested provide “proof delivery” answer every time “tracking status proof delivery” refuse provide type document confirms delivery want deceive anyone making review seems way make voice complaint heardi charged nothing worst experience ever,0.4152944546252108,0.5847055453747891,0.10375771172181716,0.2,0.6131043150317579,61.31043150317579,Medium Trust
