SmokeyJoe,/users/609d9cbb85dde600191f9053,US,1.0,2021-05-13 21:46:28+00:00,1.0,Amazon purposely delays shipping if you don't pay $120. No other retailer does this.,"They were great as long as I paid an extra $120 a year for Prime. Now that I no long pay for Prime they purposely hold my shipment for two days before shipping it. I don't believe that they have to take care of the prime customers first. They are Amazon they can do it. Hire more people if they truly can't. They are practically a monopoly support all the people who lost jobs over the years as their companies went out of business.No other retailer delays shipping by two days except Amazon. They try to manipulate you into paying for Prime, period.",2021-05-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,13.0,550,103,84,14,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,great long paid extra year prime long pay prime purposely hold shipment two day shipping dont believe take care prime customer first amazon hire people truly cant practically monopoly support people lost job year company went businessno retailer delay shipping two day except amazon try manipulate paying prime period,0.011013829306025668,0.9889861706939743,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.8060466467603354,80.60466467603355,High Trust
Callum Johnson,/users/609ac9b116cabc001b2bd26c,GB,5.0,2021-05-13 21:13:50+00:00,5.0,Been paying for Amazon Prime since 2017…,"Been paying for Amazon Prime since 2017 and is honestly the best subscription service out their in terms of getting quick delivery for essential and non essential items. The more products offered on prime video and the free subscription on twitch just top of the service for me. The only problem I would have is the highly publicised treatment of factory workers in the UK which are underpaid and overworked during the Christmas period, if they fix that then it would be better.",2021-05-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,13.0,478,83,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,paying amazon prime since honestly best subscription service term getting quick delivery essential non essential item product offered prime video free subscription twitch top service problem would highly publicised treatment factory worker uk underpaid overworked christmas period fix would better,0.05604586648721781,0.9439541335127822,0.04655075715086932,1.0,1.981287218186565,198.12872181865652,High Trust
Chris,/users/59b977c00000ff000ac8cdde,GB,5.0,2021-05-13 19:06:43+00:00,1.0,"Orders stuck, no contact, no info, no refund :/","I never thought I will be writing a negative review for Amazon 0.o but here goes. Things have clearly changed with Amazon deliveries. I’ve got another (second already) order stuck on “there was a problem with delivery” status. You can’t reschedule, you can’t cancel, you’re advised to contact Amazon but I’ve spent 20 min looking around for a way to contact them and no luck. It’s truly ridiculous and Amazon just went from providing one of the best e-commerce experiences around to a shockingly bad one! I mean what the actual ... ! Can’t even get a bloody refund!",2021-05-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,13.0,565,99,47,9,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,never thought writing negative review amazon go thing clearly changed amazon delivery i’ve got another second already order stuck “there problem delivery” status can’t reschedule can’t cancel you’re advised contact amazon i’ve spent min looking around way contact luck it’s truly ridiculous amazon went providing one best ecommerce experience around shockingly bad one mean actual can’t even get bloody refund,0.6148820520616018,0.38511794793839815,0.055524397083567024,0.2,0.5036638533859125,50.36638533859124,Medium Trust
Debra Lawson Pascua,/users/5f46e1b75f80d71d9e26bccf,US,2.0,2021-05-13 18:58:31+00:00,1.0,Unhelpful and waste of my time,"Unhelpful or useful packaging, shipping and customer service.  I don't know what happened to Amazon and UPS as far as giving a crap about their customer service but it seems to have disappeared.  My last three orders in the last month: First one - the item just thrown in a box too big no packing materials to cushion it.  Second one:  I did not receive half the order, because apparently damage.  No information from Amazon, no information from ups, no way to find out the status, no effort to resend.  Only a note that part of the package will be late with out any ETA, and the rest just not coming, they will give a refund in a week.  Third time;  I received one item out of 10 items.  The rest is apparently in Salt Lake.  No information in UPS or now I guess they must of repackaged, because now USPS number.  No tracking info other than it was suppose to arrive yesterday.  Amazon gives no information.  Just that if I don't get it in a few days - they will refund.  I don't order items so I can waste a week or two as a prime member and have no where to turn to for answers.  Just guess.  No.  I am done.  I resisted Amazon for a long time.  Because, although EBAY often has lousy products, at least I get it in a week without having to pay a yearly fee, and if something goes wrong I can contact the seller.  I only had one issue, in ten years with ebay.  With Amazon, every order nowadays.  I used to love UPS for their customer service.  Now they have none.  Two companies that have gotten so big they don't care.  They think a refund will make up for the time and effort you spend on shopping from them.  I am glad I was only trying out the prime membership, because at least I could cancel it.    It will be much better to order directly from the retailers/sellers from now on.  I am not going to waste my time with Amazon.  And I plan to start doing my shipping with USPS (my only other option) because lousy customer service with UPS and FEDEX.",2021-05-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,13.0,1958,372,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,unhelpful useful packaging shipping customer service dont know happened amazon ups far giving crap customer service seems disappeared last three order last month first one item thrown box big packing material cushion second one receive half order apparently damage information amazon information ups way find status effort resend note part package late eta rest coming give refund week third time received one item item rest apparently salt lake information ups guess must repackaged usps number tracking info suppose arrive yesterday amazon give information dont get day refund dont order item waste week two prime member turn answer guess done resisted amazon long time although ebay often lousy product least get week without pay yearly fee something go wrong contact seller one issue ten year ebay amazon every order nowadays used love ups customer service none two company gotten big dont care think refund make time effort spend shopping glad trying prime membership least could cancel much better order directly retailerssellers going waste time amazon plan start shipping usps option lousy customer service ups fedex,0.0033144256365455157,0.9966855743634545,0.20863712843522153,0.2,0.8400702128687716,84.00702128687716,High Trust
