Tom Moran,/users/609afcb6910779001a957e47,US,5.0,2021-05-12 22:03:42+00:00,1.0,Samsung is not a company you want to buy from,"This is not a review about Amazon but on Samsung which Amazon sells many of their products.  You can not trust what the Samsung company tells you!     Here's my story;In December of 2020, I contacted Samsung customer service directly because I wanted to purchase a television that was compatible with the MLB Channel.  The Samsung customer service person recommended a television and assured me that it was compatible with the MLB Channel. (I have a copy of the e-mail stating this)The baseball season did not start until April so I could not test it out ahead of time. Now it's over the return period.  I contacted Samsung and was told there's nothing they can do.  Which tells me that they do not stand behind their product and do not value me as a customer. So don't trust Samsung to do the right thing! I will no longer be a Samsung customer.",2021-05-12 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,12.0,846,151,45,10,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,review amazon samsung amazon sell many product trust samsung company tell here storyin december contacted samsung customer service directly wanted purchase television compatible mlb channel samsung customer service person recommended television assured compatible mlb channel copy email stating thisthe baseball season start april could test ahead time return period contacted samsung told there nothing tell stand behind product value customer dont trust samsung right thing longer samsung customer,0.25458561314986866,0.7454143868501313,0.08468872686483454,0.2,0.6896449387980326,68.96449387980326,Medium Trust
