Ben Blair,/users/518ac64800006400013ae9b4,US,3.0,2021-05-06 16:18:38+00:00,1.0,"Once great, destroyed by dishonesty and incompetence","Once great, this online marketplace has been destroyed by inaccurate listings, reviews for the wrong products which grossly skew overall product ratings, and most importantly - search algorithms that push products that often have absolutely NOTHING to do with what is entered in the search bar. In fact, in many cases it is possible to type EXACTLY WHAT YOU ARE LOOKING FOR BY BRAND AND MODEL NAME and get results that are often completely different and unrelated products or at the very least poor quality imitations of what you asked for with hundreds or even thousands of incorrect and misleading reviews for other products. Shame on them. Seems nobody is monitoring or moderating reviews, listings, or descriptions any more. Too bad. Time to move onto different retailers at this point.",2021-05-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,6.0,790,130,52,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,great online marketplace destroyed inaccurate listing review wrong product grossly skew overall product rating importantly search algorithm push product often absolutely nothing entered search bar fact many case possible type exactly looking brand model name get result often completely different unrelated product least poor quality imitation asked hundred even thousand incorrect misleading review product shame seems nobody monitoring moderating review listing description bad time move onto different retailer point,0.02447200179433515,0.9755279982056648,0.07291082445316882,0.2,0.8023461639934663,80.23461639934662,High Trust
