Jc Wolf,/users/608d6218e31684001c9bae8f,GB,3.0,2021-05-01 14:13:52+00:00,1.0,Where do I start,"Where do I start, sadly amazon have let me down again. Its not enough that my kids Xmas present got lost🎅 delivered to the wrong address but now I have been mistreated badly by amazon. Ordered a rattan patio set a week back, one box arrived with half of it and then 3 days later my order has been cancelled and I've had a refund. No email no explanation nothing. So I'm not out of pocket but I've got a box of bits I can't use and everybody is sold out of patio sets.Thank amazon. Next time don't take my money if you can't fulfill the order and secondly dont just delete the order from my app and pretend it didn't happen.",2021-05-01 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,1.0,623,122,16,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,start sadly amazon let enough kid xmas present got lost🎅 delivered wrong address mistreated badly amazon ordered rattan patio set week back one box arrived half day later order cancelled ive refund email explanation nothing im pocket ive got box bit cant use everybody sold patio setsthank amazon next time dont take money cant fulfill order secondly dont delete order app pretend didnt happen,0.005225897700984257,0.9947741022990158,0.06842400448681997,0.2,0.8110718520468718,81.10718520468718,High Trust
