Steve Stefania Galasso,/users/608b5545186f7a001a301b50,US,1.0,2021-04-30 00:54:37+00:00,5.0,"Nancy, the Best Customer Service Rep at Amazon.","I do not write many reviews but this one needs to be written. I had the pleasure of having Nancy help resolve an issue I had with an order that never showed up. The package was to arrive on Sunday from some odd company (dynamex) but it stated delayed. That is fine by me but this happened Monday and Tuesday also. On Wednesday it said it was delivered on the order but it never was. I reached out and Nancy was a huge help. She thought seeing it delayed for 3 days and instead of giving me the number to the delivery carrier she called with me on the phone. The carrier oddly said that the items were being returned because of issues for drop off. You only need to take 20 steps and you are at my front door so I did not understand that. Nancy went through the steps and refunded my money for me and while I was on the phone we started speaking. Such a wonderful person, upbeat, cheery, and above all helpful. At times, customer service reps may not be in the happiest mood but try to think who they may have dealt with earlier because their those that do a wonderful job and need to be thanked. I wished I had a direct line to her because of her service. Amazon please appreciate the hard work the unseen workers do to keep your company running.",2021-04-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,30.0,1246,241,47,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,write many review one need written pleasure nancy help resolve issue order never showed package arrive sunday odd company dynamex stated delayed fine happened monday tuesday also wednesday said delivered order never reached nancy huge help thought seeing delayed day instead giving number delivery carrier called phone carrier oddly said item returned issue drop need take step front door understand nancy went step refunded money phone started speaking wonderful person upbeat cheery helpful time customer service rep may happiest mood try think may dealt earlier wonderful job need thanked wished direct line service amazon please appreciate hard work unseen worker keep company running,0.011084751616433521,0.9889152483835665,0.1351654514862591,1.0,2.021490714489035,202.1490714489035,High Trust
Keena Neal,/users/608af084de14fb0019f3cf4f,US,1.0,2021-04-29 17:44:43+00:00,1.0,Do not recommend,"I have used Amazon to order things more than any other app. I am very disappointed on how when I order multiple things or even just one it does not make it to my door. The deliverers will mark my items as delivered but I won’t have them. Then, I do not ask for a refund I only ask that the item is replaced because if I order something I want it obviously but that’s all they do is refund you, as a company I would worry about where my products are ending up if it is not with the customer. If it was so important for us to pay for these items why can they just disappear without a trace if that is the case the items should be free. One order I had to wait 3 months and did not receive it after the long wait. This has happened to me multiple times where I have not received my packages, I think when this happens more than twice that customers should be more compensated because the inconvenience is not our fault. To top it off, the customer service representative lie to you, they do not help you at all they say anything to end the chat. Very unprofessional!",2021-04-29 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,29.0,1063,210,16,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,used amazon order thing app disappointed order multiple thing even one make door deliverer mark item delivered won’t ask refund ask item replaced order something want obviously that’s refund company would worry product ending customer important u pay item disappear without trace case item free one order wait month receive long wait happened multiple time received package think happens twice customer compensated inconvenience fault top customer service representative lie help say anything end chat unprofessional,0.039657193774565766,0.9603428062254342,0.11777902411665732,0.2,0.8037272079360486,80.37272079360486,High Trust
