Adreanna James,/users/60885ae8811d7a001be1ec62,CA,1.0,2021-04-27 18:41:50+00:00,1.0,I had to make a post on my social media…,"I had to make a post on my social media platforms today because my messages are continuously never answered.Well I'm super curious to know if anyone has had problems with #Amazon #amazonprime  in the last year... as in money being taken from account with out notice, or maybe items being purchased,  then receiving an email 1-2 weeks later stating the seller DID NOT recieve a payment and then they delete your order which leaves you no evidence of purchase on the site except for your bank statements clearing showing the order number and amount taken from the account.This isn't the first time I've had an issue, and I thought quite highly of Amazon for quite sometime until I realize their platform is basically turning into the exact same platform as wish. They aren't motoring their sellers and pretty much anyone can sell items or products on their site whether it's a business or an individual. I'm all for supporting small businesses and anyone just trying to make a living BUT ONLY IF ITS AN HONEST WAY. Amazon has become super difficult to just be able to contact a customer service representative and I'm not sure why. A lot of times when this has happend I've tried to contact the seller to discuss the situation but my message is either disregarded and I get no response or the seller deletes my order and I'm unable to contact them regarding that SPECIFIC order. I messaged Amazon personally a while ago with NO response. Well I sent out another message today just to try and reach out to someone from Amazons team today because I had another issue with a seller. The whole point of this post is not for opinions on HOW YOU FEEL ABOUT AMAZON. IM PURELY TRYING TO SEE IF ANYONE HAS HAD SIMILAR ISSUES.  I've tagged them in Instagram posts and facebook posts, I also have screen shots of other customer complaints. Something needs to be done or Amazon should just call it quits 😡",2021-04-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,27.0,1891,336,40,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,make post social medium platform today message continuously never answeredwell im super curious know anyone problem amazon amazonprime last year money taken account notice maybe item purchased receiving email week later stating seller recieve payment delete order leaf evidence purchase site except bank statement clearing showing order number amount taken accountthis isnt first time ive issue thought quite highly amazon quite sometime realize platform basically turning exact platform wish arent motoring seller pretty much anyone sell item product site whether business individual im supporting small business anyone trying make living honest way amazon become super difficult able contact customer service representative im sure lot time happend ive tried contact seller discus situation message either disregarded get response seller deletes order im unable contact regarding specific order messaged amazon personally ago response well sent another message today try reach someone amazon team today another issue seller whole point post opinion feel amazon im purely trying see anyone similar issue ive tagged instagram post facebook post also screen shot customer complaint something need done amazon call quits 😡,0.003528115213987405,0.9964718847860126,0.18844643858665172,0.2,0.8359252301103367,83.59252301103368,High Trust
Megan Fitzwater,/users/60884d96f61c990013e6ef73,US,1.0,2021-04-27 17:47:18+00:00,2.0,Delivery Notifications,"How about we stop seriously misleading our customers when it comes to delivery?  I used to love Amazon, now all I want to do is avoid it.  The last few items I ordered all sent me notifications about my item being delivered earlier than expected, it's usually only a day or so.  And yes, it is Amazon that is sending me these notifications.  All of those items either arrived on the original estimated delivery date or later.  Why continuously feed your customers false information?  How about you update your tracking systems or at least get them in working order?  It's disappointing when you're notified about literally every item you order being delivered earlier than expected, waiting all day for said item, waiting almost another 24 hours for tracking information to update again, then getting the item later than the original delivery date anyway.  It's ridiculous, and it's actually forcing me to have to use other sites because if I order anything off of Amazon it's become a 50/50 chance whether or not I get my package on time or at this point, at all.  I understand that there are delays because of COVID or whatever the excuse is these days.  But just stop sending false notifications about things being delivered early then.  I'm sorry, but if I order an item that's coming from China, I should not be getting a notification the same day that it's going to be delivered literally the next day.  It not.  Items coming from 1 state away from me don't even come the next day.  I've never done overnight or next-day, and probably never will because cost is outrageous.  You know damn well it's not going to be delivered the next day, yet I get 3 different notifications about it being delivered early (all of them said they were going to arrive the day after I ordered them).",2021-04-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,27.0,1786,313,22,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,stop seriously misleading customer come delivery used love amazon want avoid last item ordered sent notification item delivered earlier expected usually day yes amazon sending notification item either arrived original estimated delivery date later continuously feed customer false information update tracking system least get working order disappointing youre notified literally every item order delivered earlier expected waiting day said item waiting almost another hour tracking information update getting item later original delivery date anyway ridiculous actually forcing use site order anything amazon become chance whether get package time point understand delay covid whatever excuse day stop sending false notification thing delivered early im sorry order item thats coming china getting notification day going delivered literally next day item coming state away dont even come next day ive never done overnight nextday probably never cost outrageous know damn well going delivered next day yet get different notification delivered early said going arrive day ordered,0.009258593651651359,0.9907414063483486,0.17554683118339875,0.4,1.130480069410854,113.0480069410854,High Trust
