Yancey Miles,/users/5d644e7eae480f4f4d62dde5,US,1.0,2021-04-22 22:21:32+00:00,1.0,Amazon rips ppl off.,"Amazon used to be an amazing company. It has went downhill fast. Over the past couple years its only gotten worst and worse. I had a credit line with this for 1500 bucks no interest if paid in 12 months. I paid 130.00 a month on time every time, my balance never went down. I got to checking come to find out they had been charging my amazon store card, and my personal debit card I used to pay for all my prime video and channel subscriptions. They have charged me over 1000 dollars over the course of the 12 months, they were taking my prime video money from my debit card and charging my amazon store card. I tried getting in touch with them many times. I was told it was when my debit card decline a charge. I know all of this is lies because my debit card always has my bill money on it. It is useless to try and contact the BBB about it. Amazon has their own BBB represenatives. I have been arguing with them for over a year. Essentially nothing can be done about it except close the account and owe money for something you already paid for. So if you are debating on a credit line with them make sure it is the only card on the account. That is how they became one of the highest-earning companies. They have a customer base in the hundreds of millions if not a billion. If they rip off a couple of million ppl a few dollars at a time every month it adds up quick. It is sad to see such a good company turn greedy corpo. They even have the BBB in their pocket.",2021-04-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,22.0,1467,290,20,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon used amazing company went downhill fast past couple year gotten worst worse credit line buck interest paid month paid month time every time balance never went got checking come find charging amazon store card personal debit card used pay prime video channel subscription charged dollar course month taking prime video money debit card charging 