jane hunter,/users/60807ded8dd361001c825ea6,US,1.0,2021-04-21 19:33:51+00:00,1.0,Amazon has no customer service,"Amazon has no customer service and no security. My account was compromised with what is called ""Amazon Brushing"". I called immediately and talked to a Juan who thought had it all under control and my account would be placed on temporary hold. I was told to hold on to the packages and they would be needed for evidence because of the tracking nbr on them. I waited two weeks then talked to a Joseph and a Ann from security. I again was told they were working on it. Well now 6 weeks later, I just called Amazon Customer Service again and was told all they could do was put the account on hold and I would need to open a new account.  That means I have no order history.  Really this is suppose to be a high tech company and the best they can do for fraud activity is put your account on hold/freeze for forever. Doesn't sound like a big company to me.  Sounds like a start up company.  Too bad Amazon has the multiply for on line ordering.  Since they are about the only way to order on line and hold all the ""marbles"" I guess they don't have to really  worry about dissatisfied customers.  So order at your own risk!!!!",2021-04-21 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,21.0,1120,213,30,5,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,amazon customer service security account compromised called amazon brushing called immediately talked juan thought control account would placed temporary hold told hold package would needed evidence tracking nbr waited two week talked joseph ann security told working well week later called amazon customer service told could put account hold would need open new account mean order history really suppose high tech company best fraud activity put account holdfreeze forever doesnt sound like big company sound like start company bad amazon multiply line ordering since way order line hold marble guess dont really worry dissatisfied customer order risk,0.9192051964190632,0.08079480358093682,0.11946158160403814,0.2,0.36428971811127603,36.4289718111276,Low Trust
