Alan Jenner,/users/5eae75cc67277239caddab6e,GB,4.0,2021-04-26 09:52:07+00:00,1.0,Order never arrived,"Made an order beginning of March, delivery date 25th march. Email then stated ""we will contact you when the item is available for dispatch"" I thought this was odd but, ok.It is now 20th April, no further communication at all from amazon, I check my order status & apparently my order doesn't exist. Now i've got to chase them to see whats going on & make sure i get my money back.What a great way to treat yoir customers.Update 26th April,I finally managed to get hold of customer service, very nice lady that unfortunately hardly spoke any english... she didn't have a clue what was going on, just kept repeating whatever i said to her. COMPLETELY USELESS! I evemtually told her to close mY account.Today i received an email asking if i am interested in EXACTLY the same item at TWICE THE ORIGINAL PRICE!!!!WHAT AN ABSOLUTE RIPOFF,DO NOT USE AMAZON UNLESS YOU WANT TO BE SCAMMED.",2021-04-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,26.0,880,156,19,3,6.0,0,5,1,0,Genuine,made order beginning march delivery date th march email stated contact item available dispatch thought odd okit th april communication amazon check order status apparently order doesnt exist ive got chase see whats going make sure get money backwhat great way treat yoir customersupdate th aprili finally managed get hold customer service nice lady unfortunately hardly spoke english didnt clue going kept repeating whatever said completely useless evemtually told close accounttoday received email asking interested exactly item twice original pricewhat absolute ripoffdo use amazon unless want scammed,0.9840711432364377,0.01592885676356226,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.32546302625054163,32.54630262505416,Low Trust
Vladimir,/users/607ed679c35082001ac92e51,CY,1.0,2021-04-20 13:36:10+00:00,1.0,Not dispatched 3 weeks after order,"I made an order on 2 of April (Amazon UK)I chose Expedited Delivery (3-5 days).But ~2 weeks later item still was not dispatched.(Item fulfilled by amazon)I contacted support and first, they said some weird thing, that item was not delivered because of price change.I asked another manager and this manager stated that he will do all that he can.But almost one week late (20 of April) it still was not even dispatched.I canceled the order and write this review.Disappointed with support and delivery service.Did not receive any notifications or information regarding when the order can be dispatched.",2021-04-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,20.0,599,97,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,made order april amazon uki chose expedited delivery daysbut week later item still dispatcheditem fulfilled amazoni contacted support first said weird thing item delivered price changei asked another manager manager stated canbut almost one week late april still even dispatchedi canceled order write reviewdisappointed support delivery servicedid receive notification information regarding order dispatched,0.019054312548050678,0.9809456874519493,0.05440269209197981,0.2,0.8013533821443707,80.13533821443707,High Trust
