Chris,/users/5c6ae15b93b9c55e0393d239,GB,31.0,2021-04-18 10:48:57+00:00,1.0,Stressful shopping these days,"Stressful shopping these days, have to carefully check reviews to see if they are genuine (many not I've just reported 6 sellers that I reported two weeks ago!), check delivery time to see if its poor quality made in China stuff (not everything is poor but another thing to be wary of) Seems to be the place dodgy traders go.  Didn't used to be as bad. As long as you are careful and check with other platforms you may get a good deal - or not, but you have to put the effort in.  Once you find a product I have found the delivery and return ok, when a product failed there was no quibble refund.",2021-04-18 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,18.0,596,116,29,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,stressful shopping day carefully check review see genuine many ive reported seller reported two week ago check delivery time see poor quality made china stuff everything poor another thing wary seems place dodgy trader go didnt used bad long careful check platform may get good deal put effort find product found delivery return ok product failed quibble refund,0.06851459759514403,0.931485402404856,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.7787544791048397,77.87544791048397,High Trust
Mr Alistair Davidson,/users/5f0c7edf4b841d266c1c8f46,GB,15.0,2021-04-18 08:28:44+00:00,1.0,This company refused to cancel my order…,"This company refused to cancel my order when it didn’t arrive on the delivery date. I did give them an extra 3 days in case it was a logistical problem. After 2 weeks I asked for a refund. They refused this saying I would need to wait another week, as the item was in transit. A week later I call to say I hadn’t received the goods. They sanctioned a refund which would take 7 business days to go into my account. An absolute disgrace and disregard to customer service. Will be cancelling my Prime account.",2021-04-18 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,18.0,506,96,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,company refused cancel order didn’t arrive delivery date give extra day case logistical problem week asked refund refused saying would need wait another week item transit week later call say hadn’t received good sanctioned refund would take business day go account absolute disgrace disregard customer service cancelling prime account,0.021968315703475058,0.978031684296525,0.0538418395961862,0.2,0.7997842100674997,79.97842100674997,High Trust
Mr Pearson,/users/55524fb70000ff0001be90c5,GB,28.0,2021-04-18 04:23:31+00:00,1.0,Watch Out,I have spent literally £thousands at Amazon each year for around 10 years now.  Originally online selling was something customers were inherently wary of doing as we were so used to high street shops.  Amazon knew this and their customer service was excellent.  In the last few years this has not been the case.  I bought a computer chair for my son and even though it is obviously defective I cannot get a refund.   They want me to pay £66 to return the item even though I have photos showing it is clearly defective.  Neither the seller or Amazon's A to Z guarantee can be trusted.  Their A to Z cover is more like a very limited promise that they may cover you if they feel like it.  I would like to say I will never use them again but I probably will have to but I will try and use other sellers if I can find them and just try and reduce my spend with Amazon.  To compound this my son has a serious medical condition and this incident has not helped at all.,2021-04-18 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,18.0,962,185,9,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,spent literally £thousands amazon year around year originally online selling something customer inherently wary used high street shop amazon knew customer service excellent last year case bought computer chair son even though obviously defective cannot get refund want pay £ return item even though photo showing clearly defective neither seller amazon z guarantee trusted z cover like limited promise may cover feel like would like say never use probably try use seller find try reduce spend amazon compound son serious medical condition incident helped,0.022678819629361857,0.9773211803706381,0.10375771172181716,0.2,0.8094121325296824,80.94121325296824,High Trust
