Lesha,/users/607b46cfd3ebb9001a1b4fe8,CA,1.0,2021-04-17 20:36:49+00:00,1.0,One headache that cost me!,"I paid for prime to have my product shipped quickly. They had no problem charging me for shipping immediately... however it did not say “pay from prime” it said “free shipping”As the arrival date was inching closer the product still has not shipped, I reached out and the response was they have express delivery, it would be there in 24hrs. But I was welcome to cancel my order and buy locally.I receive Amazon gift cards as a form of payment at times and was using one. I asked for further instructions in doing so with no response, in fact I have emailed 3 times since then with no response. It showed that delivery could be as late as 10pm! I’m usually up early for work I had said anything after 6pm is inappropriate as I would be in bed. No response. No product came Monday either! Which is exactly what I was stressing for as this was for work! No product or response all week as I reached out wondering where it was and why they had gone through with the payment rather than reach out about how to buy this locally with my Amazon card (yea I realize this is impossible but it was their suggestion)I received my package at the end of the work week, Friday night and after 6pm no less. They showed me that my money and my business is of no concern to them. They may see gift cards as money already in the pocket but it is up to me to accept those gift cards or not. Which I will no longer be doing. This is the last disappointment I will be going through due to shopping with Amazon... oh yea, they have a warehouse one town over.. so it should have been smooth sailing. BYE AMAZON",2021-04-17 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,17.0,1586,303,26,5,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,paid prime product shipped quickly problem charging shipping immediately however say “pay prime” said “free shipping”as arrival date inching closer product still shipped reached response express delivery would hr welcome cancel or