Linda M,/users/5e8d1236ebf8a911d41f53a0,US,2.0,2021-04-15 21:58:51+00:00,1.0,Amazon has no Honor,"This was the final straw.  Nevermind, the late deliveries, forgive the items that don't show at all and omitting the three(3) out of five items that were damaged upon arrival; it was this last transaction that caused me to say enough. I'm finished Amazon!To 2K Furniture and Amazon,My name is Linda M, I am a customer. A customer! I'm contacting you yet again in reference to a Kitchen Buffet that I purchased in March. I have made at least five attempts to get this item back to 2K and have been requesting a refund for a month. I have believed that this should be a very simple process. To explain, a customer purchased an item, they're unsatisfied with the item, they make arrangements to return the item, the company which is reputable and has integrity will assist the purchaser in the return of the item via a return label or transport. The company provides the customer with a full refund of the purchase price. Contract done. I've never experienced a purchase, especially from Amazon, which I was required to pay for the shipping and handling 2 return item that does not satisfy the customer. These are the basics of customer service. Now allow me to further illustrate how easy this process can be resolved. I am requesting that 2K Furniture send me a return label and I am requesting that 2K make arrangements for the pick up by UPS, FedEx, US Postal Service, a truck of a friend that you know, to pick up this item. I do not think it acceptable that I incur any additional cost for your delivering a damaged product. To deliver an item in such terrible condition is unacceptable. Shame on you! Shame on you again! Is this really how you want to represent yourself. Do you really think that this is necessary for $260. Are you willing to sacrifice your reputation for $260. I want my money back. I believe I have been patient enough. I want a refund and a refund shouldn't cost me any more money or distress. If you do not respond to my satisfaction, I will have no other recourse but 2 investigate legal alternatives. I await your response. Thanking you for your cooperation in advance. Your loyal customer Linda M.",2021-04-15 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,15.0,2126,381,19,4,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,final straw nevermind late delivery forgive item dont show omitting three five item damaged upon arrival last transaction caused say enough im finished amazonto k furniture amazonmy name linda customer customer im contacting yet reference kitchen buffet purchased march made least five attempt get item back k requesting refund month believed simple process explain customer purchased item theyre unsatisfied item make arrangement return item company reputable integrity assist purchaser return item via return label transport company provides customer full refund purchase price contract done ive never experienced purchase especially amazon required pay shipping handling return item satisfy customer basic customer service allow illustrate easy process resolved requesting k furniture send return label requesting k make arrangement pick ups fedex u postal service truck friend know pick item think acceptable incur additional cost delivering damaged product deliver item terrible condition unacceptable shame shame really want represent really think necessary willing sacrifice reputation want money back believe patient enough want refund refund shouldnt cost money distress respond satisfaction recourse investigate legal alternative await response thanking cooperation advance loyal customer linda,0.8216648119060871,0.1783351880939129,0.213684800897364,0.2,0.43190455422642926,43.19045542264293,Low Trust
