Chastity Gaze,/users/6076307d359d57001a8ea2d0,US,1.0,2021-04-14 00:00:05+00:00,1.0,Bait and Switch,"Amazon advertises $100 off your purchase if you apply for their credit card. Then after application, a response of ""we need more time to process the application appears"" thus avoiding having to provide the $100 credit. Low and behold 7 days later I receive the credit card in the mail. Not only that, but I've never been denied a credit card in my life and have excellent credit. I have always been immediately approved - except this time. This is a complete bait and switch tactic and I hope a class action lawsuit arises for shady and deceptive business practices.",2021-04-14 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,14.0,566,100,15,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon advertises purchase apply credit card application response need time process application appears thus avoiding provide credit low behold day later receive credit card mail ive never denied credit card life excellent credit always immediately approved except time complete bait switch tactic hope class action lawsuit arises shady deceptive business practice,0.02764703206106047,0.9723529679389395,0.056085249579360626,0.2,0.797393533885342,79.7393533885342,High Trust
