Mr Paine,/users/53fe0bea0000640001870d8d,GB,18.0,2021-04-13 14:33:06+00:00,1.0,Their customer service have NO IDEA…,"Their customer service have NO IDEA what they are doing!I reported a major issue with my account whereby I could not view any items on my wish list or old orders, also could not open any item to see the full details or add to a cart.I spent 3 hours being passed from one operator to another and at the end I was told other customers was having the same issues and should be resolved shortly.I left it 3 days and tried again, same issue!  Again I contact customer support, been pushed from one person to another and keep asking for same original info (glad I made a list I could copy and paste)!I have had no issues in the past and only 2 days before this started I had viewed and added items to my wish list!  This is a problem their end, I can use Amazon.co.uk without any issues.All they say is please stay connected I am working on it and then push it to someone else!TOTAL WASTE OF TIME!",2021-04-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,13.0,891,172,36,6,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,customer service idea doingi reported major issue account whereby could view item wish list old order also could open item see full detail add carti spent hour passed one operator another end told customer issue resolved shortlyi left day tried issue contact customer support pushed one person another keep asking original info glad made list could copy pastei issue past day started viewed added item wish list problem end use amazoncouk without issuesall say please stay connected working push someone elsetotal waste time,0.9890373543315563,0.010962645668443738,0.09646662927650028,0.2,0.32477464868952194,32.4774648689522,Low Trust
DESIREE ATTARD,/users/5c1435d60b36f4f13b0b7867,GB,5.0,2021-04-13 14:00:05+00:00,1.0,Worst experience with an amazon…,"Worst experience with an amazon delivery driver. Driver came up to my door and request a one time password.  I checked my inbox, spam, junk and amazon app and could not find this one time password. I asked the driver to help me locate it or help me get in contact with customer service. Amazon s customer service contact procedure is quite automated and was taking me around in circles. I tried to express this to the driver and proved to him that I was the legitimate recipient of the package, showing him the order details, confirmation tracking number, receipt, I even offered to show him my passport to prove my identity...which ALL matched to the label on the parcel. I asked the driver to call his boss to see if in this situation where amazon did not give me a one time password they would accept LEGITIMATE evidence that I was the recipient.  Clearly he had no intention or knowledge on helping resolve the issue and instead of calling for assistance he just walked away.  After he left, I managed to get in contact with amazon customer service, who managed to give me the password on the spot. I ran towards the driver who was just delivering other parcels up the road, I told him that i had the password and instead of giving me the parcel, he asked me to go away and not follow him, got into his van and drove a few more meters up the road.  I was shocked!  He was clearly getting paid by the number of parcels delivered or attempted and not by the quality of service he offers.  And we still have not had our parcel delivered yet despite being promised it would be redelivered on the same day.  Utterly the worst experience, it left me shook up.",2021-04-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,13.0,1657,306,32,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,worst experience amazon delivery driver driver came door request one time password checked inbox spam junk amazon app could find one time password 