Googoodoll,/users/6067334add534e0019b4b9ce,SG,6.0,2021-04-11 09:33:36+00:00,1.0,DISHONEST and has poor customer service,"I ordered an item on 28 March. I checked on the status a few days later and saw that delivery might be delayed but it would still reach me on the latest stated date. I would check on the status every other day, and still get the same update. On the stated date , I called up Amazon and was told the item would not reach me that day and delivery was delayed. So i waited, and i still got an update online that delivery was delayed but would reach me between 9 to 12 April. I called up Amazon again (11 Apr) and this time, was told that my item had actually gone missing since 2 April. Why didn't anyone tell me? WHy was I told again and again that delivery was late but my item would still arrive soon.I wasted nine days waiting for something that has gone missing.Actually Amazon seems to be losing or damaging their customers' stuff quite a lot lately. Another order i placed also went missing but the person  I spoke to was honest with me (tho the first person i spoke with was unhelpful) . It took two phone calls (and a bloody lot of my time). The second person told me the items were damaged during transit, and advised me to cancel for refund and place a new order. He agreed to waive off the priority international shipping charges for me ( since i have wasted about 3-4 day waiting). All i had to do was give him the order number when i placed an order and he would make sure i didn't get charged for shipping. Amazon refused to do the same this time even tho i had wasted nine days in between and had given them countles opportunities to come clean with me. They also were not honest about the status on line.So what am i going to do? I have decided I have enough of AMazon's shoddy service and dishonesty. I am not going to put up with bad service anymore. I will never shop at amazon again. The aggro and time wasting is just not worth it.I hope you will think twice about shopping at Amazon too. Their service is getting worse. And they show an amazing lack of integrity..DO NOT STAND FOR BAD SERVICE. BOYCOTT AMAZON",2021-04-11 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,11.0,2028,389,39,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item march checked status day later saw delivery might delayed would still reach latest stated date would check status every day still get update stated date called amazon told item would reach day delivery delayed waited still got update online delivery delayed would reach april called amazon apr time told item actually gone missing since april didnt anyone tell told delivery late item would still arrive sooni wasted nine day waiting something gone missingactually amazon seems losing damaging customer stuff quite lot lately another order placed also went missing person spoke honest tho first person spoke unhelpful took two phone call bloody lot time second person told item damaged transit advised cancel refund place new order agreed waive priority international shipping charge since wasted day waiting give order number placed order would make sure didnt get charged shipping amazon refused time even tho wasted nine day given countles opportunity come clean also honest status lineso going decided enough amazon shoddy service dishonesty going put bad service anymore never shop amazon aggro time wasting worth iti hope think twice shopping amazon service getting worse show amazing lack integritydo stand bad service boycott amazon,0.004805110119041243,0.9951948898809587,0.21817162086371283,0.2,0.841231769113222,84.12317691132219,High Trust
