TSOR MMH,/users/606e3f1e47417900190a9a66,US,23.0,2021-04-08 01:29:10+00:00,1.0,Increased Pricing & Delayed Shipping,"I have been a long time customer of Amazon but have had several delays in shipments. It seems like every order I make shows that it is available and will be delivered in 2 days but gets delayed over and over again. I also ordered a metal detector that was priced ridiculously low. Come to find out that the company made a mistake in the pricing. My order was canceled. Nice to know that my order can be canceled if the company providing the item changes their mind or makes a mistake. Another big problem I have seen on Amazon lately, and probably the most concerning, is that their prices have gone WAY up. It is no longer worth it to purchase from them but to go to the actual stores website and pay for shipping. Example of price gouging occuring at Amazon: At this moment Amazon has Natrol Melatonin 10mg gummies 90 count listed for $29.93. Target has the same ones for $9.88.",2021-04-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,8.0,880,164,36,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,long time customer amazon several delay shipment seems like every order make show available delivered day get delayed also ordered metal detector priced ridiculously low come find company made mistake pricing order canceled nice know order canceled company providing item change mind make mistake another big problem seen amazon lately probably concerning price gone way longer worth purchase go actual store website pay shipping example price gouging occuring amazon moment amazon natrol melatonin mg gummies count listed target one,0.025148112640203203,0.9748518873597968,0.09197980931015143,0.2,0.8058219055419287,80.58219055419286,High Trust
