Ron Bissing,/users/606a1cfcebf30500197f0c03,US,5.0,2021-04-04 20:09:41+00:00,1.0,Many lost orders,Three of the last four items that I have ordered from amazon.com have been lost and were never delivered. The customer service representative in each case tells me the items I ordered were at a procurement Center and to be picked up from there delivered to my home. The procurement Center is only an hour from where I live yet I never seen the packages. Amazon claims they have no explanation for the missing packages simply that they have disappeared. By far they are the worst to order from from any company I have tried. They grew too fast with all the vehicles and the quick hiring and there doesn't appear to be any accountability. Such a huge disappointment,2021-04-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,4.0,663,119,16,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,three last four item ordered amazoncom lost never delivered customer service representative case tell item ordered procurement center picked delivered home procurement center hour live yet never seen package amazon claim explanation missing package simply disappeared far worst order company tried grew fast vehicle quick hiring doesnt appear accountability huge disappointment,0.035634293233544494,0.9643657067664555,0.06674144699943915,0.2,0.7955311427831157,79.55311427831157,High Trust
