essurized leaktested ensure leakfree design restore vehicle cooling system performance optimum operating condition aluminum treated coating radiator crossflow style applied prevent corrosion ensure product longevityi received email amazon stating thank submitting customer review amazon carefully reviewing submission review could posted website appreciate time comment review must adhere following guideline,0.020493941094030733,0.9795060589059693,0.11160964666292765,0.2,0.8120749587855702,81.20749587855703,High Trust
