DW,/users/6027fd4ee62fd20019327321,GB,10.0,2021-04-02 23:03:48+00:00,2.0,Yankee plug in refills...or are they???,"Recently I ran out of yankee plug in refills so decided to purchase from Amazon as cannot purchase from shops at present.Ordered on line for the same price as in store. They arrived appearing to be the same as my normal purchase from the store.On replacing the plug in into the unit the liquid inside seemed to appear a lot thinner than usual as it was sloshing around, for want of a better word, then as I tilted the plug in back into the socket the solution then poured out onto my oak flooring!! This HAS never happened previously with any in store purchases. So highly suspicious of this products pedigree.I contacted the seller to query if these were genuine Yankee. They responded with yes they were and they would refund a pound. Bit random and slightly suspicious, so I did not respond. They then offered a full refund if I removed my less than positive feedback...I replied they could keep the cash and I will keep my feedback, thanks.",2021-04-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,2.0,944,170,39,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,recently ran yankee plug refill decided purchase amazon cannot purchase shop presentordered line price store arrived appearing normal purchase storeon replacing plug unit liquid inside seemed appear lot thinner usual sloshing around want better word tilted plug back socket solution poured onto oak flooring never happened previously store purchase highly suspicious product pedigreei contacted seller query genuine yankee responded yes would refund pound bit random slightly suspicious respond offered full refund removed less positive feedbacki replied could keep cash keep feedback thanks,0.4571834657644544,0.5428165342355455,0.09534492428491306,0.4,0.8904772519747554,89.04772519747553,High Trust
Debbie Bennett,/users/5f10963bbe9adac41a0b712b,CA,2.0,2021-04-02 20:45:21+00:00,1.0,If I could give a 0,"If I could give a 0, I would.  I tried to hook up my Prime tv, called Customer Service and she said that my Amazon account was cut off.  I asked her why as I have never missed a payment and she said an email was sent out to everyone saying that everyone had to pay up front for a 1 year, 5 year or lifetime service.  It's not month to month any more.  I told her I never got that email and it was bad business.  Called my son, he never got it either.  Phone Amazon CS back, they rep never gave me his name, just like the last person.  When I explained what the last girl said, he was very snotty and said it wasn't true.  Then put me on hold, got back on the phone and told me that the Amazon Prime tv was not working because of maintenance, but I could still order.  I told him he was working with someone that was trying to scam people for more money.  He did not care.  Would not let me speak to a supervisor.  This is the worst customer service I have ever endured.",2021-04-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,2.0,969,196,19,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,could give would tried hook prime tv called customer service said amazon account cut asked never missed payment said email sent everyone saying everyone pay front year year lifetime service month month told never got email bad business called son never got either phone amazon c back rep never gave name like last person explained last girl said snotty said wasnt true put hold got back phone told amazon prime tv working maintenance could still order told working someone trying scam people money care would let speak supervisor worst customer service ever endured,0.0214133209611003,0.9785866790388997,0.10992708917554683,0.2,0.8112787573545592,81.12787573545592,High Trust
Marden customer,/users/603f98eb028d9000194e5a98,GB,15.0,2021-04-02 18:49:33+00:00,1.0,Do not waste your money,"Will never use Amazon again, ordered a book called ""I Should Know This"", it had so many inaccurate facts i gave up counting, apparrently Captain Bligh was the master on the Marie Celeste & not the Bounty, who knew! Also ordered a toilet seat,thus proving the old adage buy cheap buy twice. All the screws etc included, unfortunately no holes provided enabling you to fix to said toilet. No delivery note or invoice included for me to return. Also couriers no longer make any attempt to let you know goods have been delivered. Watched on 3 seperate occassions goods dumped on doorstep with no attempt to ring bell or rattle knocker.",2021-04-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,2.0,631,111,23,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,never use amazon ordered book called know many inaccurate fact gave counting apparrently captain bligh master marie celeste bounty knew also ordered toilet seatthus proving old adage buy cheap buy twice screw etc included unfortunately hole provided enabling fix said toilet delivery note invoice included return also courier longer make attempt let know good delivered watched seperate occassions good dumped doorstep attempt ring bell rattle knocker,0.13195109157514148,0.8680489084248585,0.062254627033090294,0.2,0.7464753796190473,74.64753796190473,Medium Trust
