Eliza Rose,/users/5f80ab7e9bbc0d001a9f963a,US,3.0,2023-12-02 03:42:23+00:00,1.0,Amazon has really gone down the drain,"I used to think Amazon and their CS was awesome (at least it was years ago). Amazon claimed to deliver a package to me a day earlier than planned. I was working so I could not check for it until and hour after but there was no delivery. Looked and waited for 2 days per their recommendation. After that, I asked for the photo proof of delivery... they said they didn’t have one. So I went back and forth with them for days about what to do and talking to their logistics teams they asked me to file a police report in order to further assist. So I did. The report was completed. I called the police to confirm, they did. Amazon claims they cannot contact the police, and that they want a URL to the police report, which doesn’t exist since the city police department does not offer this.The CS team would copy and paste the same information again and again to me, it was ridiculous and made me feel like every single one of their agents was incompetent. I had offered copies, photos and contact info for the police report filed but still this was not enough, or well they couldn’t do anything with this information. I’m like why TF do you make me do all this for you and you don’t even make an effort?! I have so many regrets, I should have just gone to the store to purchase this somewhat expensive item. Now I’m at a loss here, no help, no refund. Amazon has really gone down the drain these past few years. I’m done with being a prime member.",2021-04-02 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,12.0,2.0,1445,275,37,7,974.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,used think amazon c awesome least year ago amazon claimed deliver package day earlier planned working could check hour delivery looked waited day per recommendation asked photo proof delivery said didn’t one went back forth day talking logistics team asked file police report order assist report completed called police confirm amazon claim cannot contact 