Diana Owens,/users/60669349377f4a0019813431,US,1.0,2021-04-02 03:48:30+00:00,1.0,Third party sellers.,"Third party sellers.Yes  Im the past 30 days i have ordered 40 plus items from Amazon. In the last 2 weeks i have had to contact Amazon's Customer Service/Support  . All of these issues were for products that were 3rd party sellers which in Amazon Customer support speak translates to yiu are on your own and get to do all the work to straighten this out with the Seller . I will only step in and contact the seller on our behalf is when the item is not received by the estimated delivery date.Order # i ordered  a platform bed with a headboard.when i received the package the headboard was missing. Come to find out that version of the bed was out of stock.. so the 3rd party seller sent me the version without the headboard and charged me for the more expensive model but sent me the cheaper model without any word nothing*(*  (this is the one abd only instance where the issue was resolved to my satisfaction Order #2. I searched Amazon for hours to find the exact sofa I wanted.  Only to have the order canceled.3 days prior to the expected delivery date. Amazon's website showed the item was canceled by the customer ,(ME) per the email I received as well. It was not me.  I contacted Amazon and spoke to a live agent after several useless chats.  To find out that it was canceled by the seller because the item was out of stock.  (NOW MIND THE AMAZON SITE LISTED EXACTLY HOW MANY WERE IN STOCK AT THE I PLACED MY ORDER (4) . AND AMAZINGLY ENOUGH AFTER I CONTACTED AMAZON CUSTOMER SERVICE AND I WAS TOLD TOO BAD SO SAD YOU WILL JUST HAVE TO LOOK FOR A DIFFERENT ONE AND ORDER IT.  I WENT BACK INTO THE AMAZON SITE AND SURPRISE/SURPRISE/SURPRISE THERE WAS MY EXACT COUCH I HAS ORDERED BUT CANCELED BECAUSE IT WAS SUPPOSEDLY (OUT OF STOCK) STILL SHOWING AS AVAILABLE FROM THE SAME 3RD PARTY SELLER. IF AMAZON AND THE 3RD PARTY SELLER ARE GOING TO TELL LIES TO THE CUSTOMER THEY NEED TO GET THEIR STORY STRAIGHT . Order #3 EXPECTED DELIVERY DATES EXAMPLE MARCH 29TH -APRIL 2ND. I ORDERED A RUG TO Be DELIVERED BY APRIL 1ST ACCORDING TO AMAZONS SITE  .AS OF 3/31/2021 it still was not showing as shipped.  I chatted with Amazon Customers support which said my package was being prepared to ship with a delivery date of 4/1. Then today 4/1 I get an email regarding a delivery date update. I will now have to wait until April 13th for this if it ever shows up at all.   I was very unhappy and told the live agent I spoke to how really felt about Amazon's shorty support/service. I also told the liive chat agent to stop using the ""scripting ""i apologize for the inconvenience over and over again because that solves ""Nothing "" except to irritate customer' and to start acting human and put themselves in the customer's shoe. ***Order ,#4 Set of lamp with delivery date estimate of 4/2-4/6. This issue is due to the multiple emails and text messages from Amazon and the National Carrier stating my package would be delivered today 4/1. All.day today a little Amazon delivery truck kept popping up on my phone telling me my order would be delivered today 4,% as did the carrier site as well only to be changed back to the original delivery date of 4/2 without any explanation. I just wish they would get their facts straight and quit changing the delivery date back and forth.  After i get the last 4 items I have ordered I am done with Amazon and the 3rd party sellers they use. Diana O. Illinois",2021-04-02 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,2.0,3394,626,20,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,third party sellersyes im past day ordered plus item amazon last week contact amazon customer servicesupport issue product rd party seller amazon customer support speak translates yiu get work straighten seller step contact seller behalf item received estimated delivery dateorder ordered platform bed headboardwhen received package headboard missing come find version bed stock rd party seller sent version without headbo