Pamela Joy Anderson,/users/5fd660b2f967dc001ba06ce5,US,5.0,2021-03-31 17:34:31+00:00,1.0,Cancellations,"I have been a customer of Amazon for many years, and I have tried to cancel several items over the years, all for different reasons. But, I’m just realizing it is impossible to cancel any order placed, even if you just placed it 2 seconds ago. I’ve heard over and over, once it goes into shipping process, you can’t cancel, I’ve heard every line they have, many times. Any order should be able to be canceled as long as it hasn’t left the shipping yard. That would make sense, and a whole lot easier, But, no! They want that product to get to the customer in hopes they change their mind and keep it, thinking the customer doesn’t want to go through the hassle of sending it back and waiting on a refund! Well that theory has been working for many years now, they need to fix this problem, me personally, I’m fed up with it. If I change my mind on a product for any reason, I want to be able to cancel without it being delivered. And if that is done before it is actually shipped out, it should not be a problem, and it won’t be if if the programming is done correctly. And I’m speaking about Amazon, not 3rd party sellers. Fix it! Pam",2021-03-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,31.0,1135,218,13,1,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,customer amazon many year tried cancel several item year different reason i’m realizing impossible cancel order placed even placed second ago i’ve heard go shipping process can’t cancel i’ve heard every line many time order able canceled long hasn’t left shipping yard would make sense whole lot easier want product get customer hope change mind keep thinking customer doesn’t want go hassle sending back waiting refund well theory working many year need fix problem personally i’m fed change mind product reason want able cancel without delivered done actually shipped problem won’t programming done correctly i’m speaking amazon rd party seller fix pam,0.7726022783538448,0.22739772164615524,0.12226584408300617,0.2,0.43815202963967886,43.815202963967884,Low Trust
