Daniel Kennett,/users/572496e00000ff000a1bfb84,GB,2.0,2021-03-31 14:41:37+00:00,1.0,Amazon account hack but not dealt with,"Just over 2 weeks ago my Amazon account got hacked and I reported this to Amazon. The hacker took £119.98 from me. Amazon still haven’t given me my money back and are trying to tell me that it’s the bank that has to provide me with forms to dispute the charge, credit my account and then file it as a chargeback. The bank are saying they can’t do that as those forms don’t exist anymore and that Amazon have their own fraud team but don’t seem to be treating it as fraud. There is no way of contacting the fraud team, they just keep ignoring my emails and when I ring up Amazon customer service they can’t help and just keep passing my fraudulent complaint through to the fraud team but don’t let me speak to them. Today my Amazon account got hacked again!! This has been an absolute joke and I am 100% deleting my Amazon account and not using them again as I can’t trust that I won’t get hacked again and that if I do, I won’t ever get my money back. I would not recommend using Amazon, awful service!!!",2021-03-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,31.0,1004,193,38,7,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,week ago amazon account got hacked reported amazon hacker took £ amazon still haven’t given money back trying tell it’s bank provide form dispute charge credit account file chargeback bank saying can’t form don’t exist anymore amazon fraud team don’t seem treating fraud way contacting fraud team keep ignoring email ring amazon customer service can’t help keep passing fraudulent complaint fraud team don’t let speak today amazon account got hacked absolute joke deleting amazon account using can’t trust won’t get hacked won’t ever get money back would recommend using amazon awful service,0.9693222877842674,0.030677712215732567,0.10824453168816602,0.2,0.3369877624454995,33.69877624454995,Low Trust
