Elle,/users/5a29831d0000ff000aedd169,GB,8.0,2021-03-29 10:02:36+00:00,1.0,Bad Delivery Drivers,"Despite the convenience of having goods delivered on a next day basis (and not including complaints regarding their general working practice, at least in this review), Amazon uses delivery drivers who are not directly employed by Amazon Logistics. The majority of the time these drivers mishandle parcels and sometimes just don't deliver them. We recently had an issue where one such driver arrived and ""delivered"" our items by simply placing them outside of the door and walking off. The items would have been stolen if a neighbour hadn't picked them up and contacted us about them. Sadly this is not an uncommon occurrence.",2021-03-29 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,29.0,625,103,20,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,despite convenience good delivered next day basis including complaint regarding general working practice least review amazon us delivery driver directly employed amazon logistics majority time driver mishandle parcel sometimes dont deliver recently issue one driver arrived delivered item simply placing outside door walking item would stolen neighbour hadnt picked contacted u sadly uncommon occurrence,0.019691581017993565,0.9803084189820064,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.8017077709043515,80.17077709043515,High Trust
