Adam,/users/5d012098252a76e98426563c,CA,5.0,2021-03-28 07:07:24+00:00,1.0,Shame on Amazon's Customer Support,"I have been purchasing from Amazon.ca for few years and it’s been good for the most part, but for a while now, the shopping experience has changed to much more regrettable, not so pleasant.  For one... a lot of the merchandise is shipped in a boxes that aren’t filled with protective bubble wrap and whether that causes some of the items to bounce inside during shipping and get damaged internally or the manufacturers QC is just not there I can’t tell, but more often when you receive products, they are either visibly damaged, even thou the box it’s not, or the components are DOA e.g. Mechanical Drives, External Hard Drive Enclosures and ext. Amazon will cover the cost for you to ship the defective items back to them, but if you think that this is as easy as it sounds…wrong, there is a catch.  If you buying 1-2 items here and there, you might not come across to many defective products, but if you happen to make either bigger purchase or do more frequent purchases you could end up getting more defective defects, which seem to be happening more often and if you make too many returns, you will hear from Amazon, so my advice is, keep the defective item(s) and pretend everything is good (I’m been totally sarcastic) but that’s what seem Amazon want you to do.With Prime membership on two different occasions, my packages came 2 days later, even thou everything was in stock I didn’t make it big deal, but when few items arrived DOA and call them the same and asked them “what should I do, I don’t want to look bad in any possible way” I was assured that DOA purchases aren’t my fault so I should ship them back, so I did.The next thing I have been red flagged and told that I have return to many items within 12 months, which there were 4 items that cost maybe $200-$300 (HDMI cables and such) out of at least 30 items worth close to 10K… ridicules.OK! After spending some time on the phone with Amazon supervisor that got sort out. Here is unpleasant part when comes to Customer Support, especially Chat. I ordered few items on different day “sold and shipped by Amazon” all in stock, prime 2-day shipping, my items didn’t get shipped till 4 days after I placed the order, again I wouldn’t care if there was good explanation, but also If the customer support was courteous. My conversation with 2 different Chat support was one of the most excruciating experiences I have encounter in a long time.I asked about my order, right from the start, attitude! “We’ve had COVID19 Outbreak so we are short” I said I understand, I’m just asking when I can expect my parcel, again, rude answer. At that point I have cancelled my order and closed my Amazon account. This is not what I have envision with Amazon, they used to be pretty good, but even before the pandemic, the customer support it’s not that courteous any more, even rude at times and that will not fly with me. I'm done with Amazon. Amazon needs to hire people with better communication skills, not someone who comes and goes and don't give a wrath about how they interact with some of the most loyal customers who wont put up with disrespect I definitely wont.Good by Amazon.",2021-03-28 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,28.0,3140,567,34,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,purchasing amazonca year it’s good part shopping experience changed much regrettable pleasant one lot merchandise shipped box aren’t filled protective bubble wrap whether cause item bounce inside shipping get damaged internally manufacturer qc can’t tell often receive product either visibly damaged even thou box it’s component doa eg mechanical drive external hard drive enclosure ext amazon cover cost ship defective item back think easy sounds…wrong catch buying item might come across many defective product happen make either bigger purchase frequent purchase could end getting defective defect seem happening often make many return hear amazon advice keep defective item pretend everything good i’m totally sarcastic that’s seem amazon want dowith prime membership two different occasion package came day later even thou everything stock didn’t make big deal item arrived doa call asked “what don’t want look bad possible way” assured doa purchase aren’t fault ship back didthe next thing red flagged told return many item within month item cost maybe hdmi cable least item worth close k… ridiculesok spending time phone amazon supervisor got sort unpleasant part come customer support especially chat ordered item different day “sold shipped amazon” stock prime day shipping item didn’t get shipped till day placed order wouldn’t care good explanation also customer support courteous conversation different chat support one excruciating experience encounter long timei asked order right start attitude “we’ve covid outbreak short” said understand i’m asking expect parcel rude answer point cancelled order closed amazon account envision amazon used pretty good even pandemic customer support it’s courteous even rude time fly im done amazon amazon need hire people better communication skill someone come go dont give wrath interact loyal customer wont put disrespect definitely wontgood amazon,0.0709740584133211,0.9290259415866788,0.31800336511497473,0.2,0.8281136438163343,82.81136438163344,High Trust
FAD Park,/users/605fb5072d361e0019c68a60,US,1.0,2021-03-27 22:43:27+00:00,1.0,Amazon 3rd Party Scammers.,"Amazon was my go to, for anything I needed.  I have never really had an issue with them until I ordered some tires for my travel trailer. I was told I would have them in 4 days. However, what they did not tell me was the 3rd party seller, was in China, and that the dates promised on the product page were never possible. I ordered on the 3/23/2021, and on 3/24/2021 I was told they shipped. 6 hours later I was sent an email from the 3rd party seller, informing me that because of Covid 19 Disease FedEx does not have manpower to come get the items. Until 5 to 8 business days, and that it will most likely take an additional 5 to 15 days to.get it to me once FedEx has possession of the items. Amazon refuses to admit that thus shipper is running scam, even after 12 reviews indicate the same thing has happened to them. In order to get a refund of my money which has already hard posted to my account. I have to wait until the expiration of the promised delivery dates, which keep changing. Thus seller is very good. He cover his bases, he allowed for 23 possible delivery days. What a scam.  I just asked fir all items I have ordered in the past 6 months be returned, and all money's refunded. But to add insult to injury, Amazon customer service refuses to help. I spend 5 hours of my time on the phone, only to be hung up on 3 times and told there is no way to get in touch with anyone but customer service, the executive branch of Amazon hides behind a rude customer service department that has little respect for the customers who ultimately buy the products that pay their salaries.",2021-03-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,27.0,1591,304,26,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon go anything needed never really issue ordered tire travel trailer told would day however tell rd party seller china date promised product page never possible ordered told shipped hour later sent email rd party seller informing covid disease fedex manpower come get item business day likely take additional day toget fedex possession item amazon refuse admit thus shipper running scam even review indicate thing happened order get refund money already hard posted account wait expiration promised delivery date keep changing thus seller good cover base allowed possible delivery day scam asked fir item ordered past month returned money refunded add insult injury amazon customer service refuse help spend hour time phone hung time told way get touch anyone customer service executive branch amazon hide behind rude customer service department little respect customer ultimately buy product pay salary,0.004728195972736049,0.9952718040272639,0.17049915872125632,0.2,0.8317357337578831,83.17357337578831,High Trust
