Kieron Murphy,/users/605ee6152989d9001a6298d5,GB,1.0,2021-03-27 08:00:26+00:00,1.0,One star is pushing it in all honesty,"One star is pushing it in all honesty, I've had two days of unauthorized purchases being sent to every corner of the country, and in spite of changing passwords, email addresses, cancelling my card and deleting all payment details from my account it's still happening and everytime I've brought it up with Amazon it'll be reviewed by 24 hours from customer service reading from a script, I've been using Amazon for over ten years now, never had an issue but now it seems they couldn't careless. Im cancelling my account in its entirety but i still think it's going to continue. Awful company to deal with and from all accounts a worse company to work for. Absolutely shameful.",2021-03-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,27.0,676,118,37,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,one star pushing honesty ive two day unauthorized purchase sent every corner country spite changing password email address cancelling card deleting payment detail account still happening everytime ive brought amazon itll reviewed hour customer service reading script ive using amazon ten year never issue seems couldnt careless im cancelling account entirety still think going continue awful company deal account worse company work absolutely shameful,0.004247658900796356,0.9957523410992036,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.8111122894503309,81.11122894503309,High Trust
Meg,/users/605e9fb82f9b2c00197daa7c,US,2.0,2021-03-27 03:01:28+00:00,1.0,Amazon has stolen so much of my time,"Amazon has stolen so much of my time, money, and energy from me and if I can do business with anyone else, I will. First, my account was deleted with no notice, along with all my wish lists that I spent hours organizing and adding to, all my account credits, all my order history, and all my gift cards, all my kindle books, and my 5 months of kindle unlimited free Bc I had just bought a kindle and signed up for unlimited. All gone. $500 and countless hours, all gone. I’ve spent HOURS on the phone with “customer service” and they simply can’t do sh** except offer me $5 which they still haven’t done. They can’t even do that! Ha! What a joke of a business. I had an account in Spain when I lived there and that’s the account I wanted to cancel. Not my US one. And the only reason I went to cancel it was Bc I got an email from Amazon music saying I had 3 months free based off a recent order I placed in AMERICA and when I went to use it, it said I couldn’t Bc There’s no amazon music in SPAIN. So obviously things were getting tangled and I wanted to get rid of Spain account so I could use amazon music on American account. I called amazon “customer service” before doing so trying to find out why that happened and if I cancelled nothing would happen to American account. They assured me accounts were not linked at all. So I cancelled. And 2 weeks later I get an email saying EVERYTHING is gone. And now it’s all apparently in cyber space and they can’t get it back. No emails, nothing in those 2 weeks verifying if I want to cancel my account. NOTHING. It’s just gone one day. Oh well. Nothing they can do. Amazon I hope you get lost in cyber space you piece of sh**. And then when I go to create a new account, it’s recommending me products based off recently sold items from my old account!! So how is it that they can’t recover my account but Amazon knows what I last bought in my old account?? WT*?! AND SO NOW, today, 3 months after this sh** went down, I received an Amazon gift card and went to add it to my account and get back on my kindle that I haven’t been able to read on much yet Bc amazon is a piece of sh**, and I immediately get locked out of my account. And to get back in, I need to send in a copy of my gift card reciept. I don’t have my gift card receipt Bc I didn’t buy my gift card bc it was a gift!!!!! AHHHHHH! And so I called “customer service” and they said it could be up to Tuesday until my account isn’t on hold anymore. Today is Friday. All I wanted to do was read a f****** book. F you amazon. F you. You owe me. I hope you get a million competitors and go out of biz. You don’t deserve to be in biz you piece of sh**.",2021-03-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,27.0,2659,532,36,8,0.0,0,11,2,1,Suspicious,amazon stolen much time money energy business anyone else first account deleted notice along wish list spent hour organizing adding account credit order history gift card kindle book month kindle unlimited free bc bought kindle signed unlimited gone countless hour gone i’ve spent hour phone “customer service” simply can’t sh except offer still haven’t done can’t even ha joke business account spain lived that’s account wanted cancel u one reason went cancel bc got email amazon music saying month free based recent order placed america went use said couldn’t bc there’s amazon music spain obviously thing getting tangled wanted get rid spain account could use amazon music american account called amazon “customer service” trying find happened cancelled nothing would happen american account assured account linked cancelled week later get email saying everything gone it’s apparently cyber space can’t get back email nothing week verifying want cancel account nothing it’s gone one day oh well nothing amazon hope get lost cyber space piece sh go create new account it’s recommending product based recently sold item old account can’t recover account amazon know last bought old account wt today month sh went received amazon gift card went add account get back kindle haven’t able read much yet bc amazon piece sh immediately get locked account get back need send copy gift card reciept don’t gift card receipt bc didn’t buy gift card bc gift ahhhhhh called “customer service” said could tuesday account isn’t hold anymore today friday wanted read f book f amazon f owe hope get million competitor go biz don’t deserve biz piece sh,0.9999945960599396,5.403940060433321e-06,0.29837352776219855,0.2,0.3596774075224699,35.96774075224699,Low Trust
K Cooper,/users/605e92909645d10019795938,US,1.0,2021-03-27 02:04:06+00:00,1.0,Terrible customer service!!!,"I ordered an item for my granddaughter to use for prom and the reason that I ordered it from Amazon was because I could get it on Wednesday before we needed it on Saturday.  Well as of 6:00 on Friday, it still had not been delivered.  I called customer service and she checked with logistics and they said it was probably lost.  She said that she would refund my money and I told her that was fine as long as she did not cancel the order as there was a slim chance that we might receive the item.  She assured me it would not be cancelled.  Well, the order was cancelled.  I was livid!  Customer service is terrible and apparently cannot speak English good enough to understand what the customer is saying when they say DO NOT cancel the order.  Amazon used to be great but their shipping sucks now!!  Will never order anything important from them again.",2021-03-27 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,27.0,854,158,28,3,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,ordered item granddaughter use prom reason ordered amazon could get wednesday needed saturday well friday still delivered called customer service checked logistics said probably lost said would refund money told fine long cancel order slim chance might receive item assured would cancelled well order cancelled livid customer service terrible apparently cannot speak english good enough understand customer saying say cancel order amazon used great shipping suck never order anything important,0.661266063655072,0.338733936344928,0.0886146943353898,0.2,0.4870899070395419,48.70899070395419,Low Trust
