Allan Gilmour,/users/50f7142900006400012da5c8,GB,45.0,2021-03-26 21:46:15+00:00,1.0,Awful customer service,"I have been an Amazon customer for about 13 years.  I have experienced highs and lows over the years with their service, but have rarely had a bad experience with customer service when needing to complain.  However, over the past 2 or 3 years it has been getting worse.  This week has been the straw that has finally broken the camels back.  2 attempts to order a specific model of sat nav and both times they sent the wrong one.  Now I have hundreds of pounds tied up and they don’t take the complaints seriously.  I was asked to hold whilst they transferred me to escalations only for no response 40 minutes later.  Well Amazon, my response to that is that you can do one, I’ll be buying elsewhere from now on!",2021-03-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,26.0,712,132,22,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer year experienced high low year service rarely bad experience customer service needing complain however past year getting worse week straw finally broken camel back attempt order specific model sat nav time sent wrong one hundred pound tied don’t take complaint seriously asked hold whilst transferred escalation response minute later well amazon response one i’ll buying elsewhere,0.22333133747498593,0.7766686625250141,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.7031408371514581,70.31408371514581,Medium Trust
