Dave,/users/5ec16d55ee8f295e27d33fc3,US,8.0,2021-03-22 18:34:56+00:00,5.0,"Great experience, but a few tips can help","I love Amazon! Great products, quick delivery, excellent customer service, but... Double check prices with other sellers, Amazon isn't always cheap. Often it's not even Amazon, but a 3rd party seller on the Amazon platform. Track your delivery with shop.com to make sure you really get it. With doorstep thieves running around, have them drop off the package at a pick-up location if nobody is home, or it may be gone before you get to it. Great return policy, no questions asked.",2021-03-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,22.0,480,82,41,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,love amazon great product quick delivery excellent customer service double check price seller amazon isnt always cheap often even amazon rd party seller amazon platform track delivery shopcom make sure really get doorstep thief running around drop package pickup location nobody home may gone get great return policy question asked,0.13604996321111704,0.8639500367888829,0.045989904655075714,1.0,1.9411729993254567,194.11729993254568,High Trust
