Fritobambeano Binder,/users/60574e0628feec00190e5f70,US,1.0,2021-03-21 13:45:56+00:00,1.0,Seller 1 star But amazon answered a prayer,Ok so the one star is for the seller the product is ASR outdoor sluice Box gold prospecting Kit I set the box up and got it in the water and once in the water the current pulled it and the edge hadn't been deburred so it was razor sharp and part of my thumb floated down the creek now this is where Amazon forever earned my respect and love the 3rd party seller said only thing they would do was replace or refund if I sent the product back as for my injuries too bad so sad so I called Amazon customer service they are having management get ahold of me to remove the seller and apologized all she could do at the moment is add to my account was the amount of my medical bill..... Im tearing up writing this I'm a single father of 2 and I work with my hand I got this box for the kids and I we love the outdoors but I don't make much and they have different mothers who neither see nor help support them... So these little things are big deals to them and maybe just me but seems like everyone is just says f the little guy ya don't have money and any company walks all over ya they know ya can't take time off to fight them or even afford a lawyer... Ok sorry I'm getting preachy just really means a lot when that prayer is heard,2021-03-21 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,21.0,1230,249,42,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ok one star seller product asr outdoor sluice box gold prospecting kit set box got water water current pulled edge hadnt deburred razor sharp part thumb floated creek amazon forever earned respect love rd party seller said thing would replace refund sent product back injury bad sad called amazon customer service management get ahold remove seller apologized could moment add account amount medical bill im tearing writing im single father work hand got box kid love outdoors dont make much different mother neither see help support little thing big deal maybe seems like everyone say f little guy ya dont money company walk ya know ya cant take time fight even afford lawyer ok sorry im getting preachy really mean lot prayer heard,0.007913799323034574,0.9920862006769654,0.13965227145260797,0.2,0.8239735546290042,82.39735546290042,High Trust
