Gil,/users/5e9a68015efa59626d586a4c,US,12.0,2021-03-13 19:43:19+00:00,1.0,Amazon protection? Think again..,"You think you are covered when shopping at Amazon? Think again.I purchased a $2150 Citizen watch and found out the seller promisses warranty that is not actually in place because he is not an authorised dealer which he claimed to be. I immediately checked with Citizen and cancelled tje teansaction. Amazon approved it. The seller shipped the item regardless of the cancellation so Amazon instructed me to ship it back and supplied a return shipping labal. I shipped ot and item was deliverd and returned to seller.I recieved no refund. I tried to have Amazon refund me and they said they are issuing the refund and sending confirmation email. They did not. I called 3 times and same results.Now I am without the watch and without my $2150.Be aware of this situation as things have changed dramatically at Amazon, it wasn't like that in the past. I had their CS lie to me by representatives that hardly speak english. Tried to escalate... Didn't help.Bottom line is that you should be aware of the risk of having no actual protection.Now I need to hire an attorney and go legal... Just horrible experience.",2021-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,13.0,1106,191,32,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,think covered shopping amazon think againi purchased citizen watch found seller promisses warranty actually place authorised dealer claimed immediately checked citizen cancelled tje teansaction amazon approved seller shipped item regardless cancellation amazon instructed ship back supplied return shipping labal shipped ot item deliverd returned selleri recieved refund tried amazon refund said issuing refund sending confirmation email called time resultsnow without watch without aware situation thing changed dramatically amazon wasnt like past c lie representative hardly speak english tried escalate didnt helpbottom line aware risk actual protectionnow need hire attorney go legal horrible experience,