PJ,/users/5e80d3de87efacb464d059fd,US,5.0,2021-03-10 13:21:50+00:00,1.0,Shipping is hit and miss,Shipping is hit and miss. Mostly miss. They don't post real reviews. If you have anything negative to say about anything they usually don't post it. Most items now are shipped from china in my experience. They charge your credit/debit card before they ship 99 percent of the time. They have horrible customer service. What use to take 2 or 3 days is now 2 or 3 weeks. They don't tag out of country sales and usually the sellers doesn't mention where the item ships from or made. Amazon is just another big corporation that cares only about themselves and how much money they rake in. No more Amazon for me period. Support your local community by buying local.,2021-03-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,10.0,659,119,24,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,shipping hit miss mostly miss dont post real review anything negative say anything usually dont post item shipped china experience charge creditdebit card ship percent time horrible customer service use take day week dont tag country sale usually seller doesnt mention item ship made amazon another big corporation care much money rake amazon period support local community buying local,0.014985031848380934,0.985014968151619,0.06674144699943915,0.2,0.8058557734756974,80.58557734756974,High Trust
