Bex,/users/60481de92022320019b3f72b,US,1.0,2021-03-10 01:17:12+00:00,1.0,Proof Amazon don't care about customer…,"Proof Amazon don't care about customer only our money. I thought my order was canceled because I never got this is response from Amazon.Hello,I've reviewed your comments  and I understand your concern regarding refund. Let me assist you on this regard right away.Upon checking with the details, I see that this order was placed on  January 23, 2021  and order shows delivered.Based on the age of the order, reliable tracking information is no longer available through the carrier. Because of this, we won’t be able to provide a replacement/refund for this order at this time.​I'd love to help you with the refund. However, as the item was ordered on  January 23, 2021  where  the delivery or refund date had been passed and in this situation I'm unable to process a refund. I hope you understand.In this case, I'd request you to please contact the carrier for further information.In addition to our large selection, one of the benefits we try very hard to offer our customers is convenience. I'm very sorry for the inconvenience you experienced in this case.Thank you for understanding and cooperating with us. We look forward to seeing you soon.​​​Best regards,NurAmazon.com",2021-03-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,10.0,1175,193,39,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,proof amazon dont care customer money thought order canceled never got response amazonhelloive reviewed comment understand concern regarding refund let assist regard right awayupon checking detail see order placed january order show deliveredbased age order reliable tracking information longer available carrier won’t able provide replacementrefund order time​id love help refund however item ordered january delivery refund date passed situation im unable process refund hope understandin case id request please contact carrier informationin addition large selection one benefit try hard offer customer convenience im sorry inconvenience experienced casethank understanding cooperating u look forward seeing soon​​​best regardsnuramazoncom,0.008029479616869265,0.9919705203831307,0.10824453168816602,0.2,0.8176341665291985,81.76341665291986,High Trust
