Raphael de la Ghetto,/users/60476848e8accf001a5d88e2,ES,2.0,2021-03-09 12:21:38+00:00,1.0,Terrible review process,"I had struggled in the past trying to identify what reviews were accurate about the products present in their website, and which ones were inaccurate or simply fake.In an attempt to contribute to the improvement of the content, after acquiring a product from this website, and after having used it for a few days, I decided to write a review with information that I wished I had had before I bought it, because I thought that would be beneficial to others. I spent some time writing that review, but after 5 days, I receive a completely generic mail stating that my review cannot be published... and none of the generic requirements seems to be in contradiction with the contents of my review.How is it possible that a genuine review onto which I put some effort gets rejected, while inaccurate or fake reviews appear so frequently in this website?I was happy with them in the past, but I cannot trust them anymore.",2021-03-09 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,9.0,915,161,23,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,struggled past trying identify review accurate product present website one inaccurate simply fakein attempt contribute improvement content acquiring product website used day decided write review information wished bought thought would beneficial others spent time writing review day receive completely generic mail stating review cannot published none generic requirement seems contradiction content reviewhow possible genuine review onto put effort get rejected inaccurate fake review appear frequently websitei happy past cannot trust anymore,0.019601172489761214,0.9803988275102388,0.09029725182277061,0.2,0.8082588641196735,80.82588641196735,High Trust
