Julie Ann,/users/563f4ba20000ff0001e90d98,US,2.0,2021-03-08 21:36:34+00:00,1.0,Amazon is the worst,"Amazon is the worst! They offer you a 7 day trial for free of their product and then use the credit card you have on file with your regular amazon account and they continue billing you not knowing. I signed up for 7 days FREE and found out 1 year later I was charged $140 in reoccurring charges!! So shady!! I called and since I had already cancelled but did not notice the charges, Amazon did not reimburse me for a penny! They discreetly make for free just to give out the bait so you can start being billed using your information. I gave these people so much of my money, had Amazon Prime membership, ordered many products and groceries and they can’t reimburse me for an App I didn’t even use?! Ridiculous. When I called Kindle to complain and asked for a manager, the manager was yelling at me that I should’ve noticed!! I’m completely boycotting Amazon for good. Their prime membership is horrible with customer service too. They give free shipping but the reason they have so many of their customers getting their packages stolen is because Amazon doesn’t even make their delivery people ring the doorbell! So many times they drop packages and don’t even knock or ring and leave the packages right on a busy street for someone to take. I’m so dissatisfied with Amazon’s customer service, product, and company as a whole. They lost all my respect and I know I’m not the only one.",2021-03-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,8.0,1385,250,19,4,0.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,amazon worst offer day trial free product use credit card file regular amazon account continue billing knowing signed day free found year later charged reoccurring charge shady called since already cancelled notice charge amazon reimburse penny discreetly make free give bait start billed using information gave people much money amazon prime membership ordered many product grocery can’t reimburse app didn’t even use ridiculous called kindle complain asked manager manager yelling should’ve noticed i’m completely boycotting amazon good prime membership horrible customer service give free shipping reason many customer getting package stolen amazon doesn’t even make delivery people ring doorbell many time drop package don’t even knock ring leave package right busy street someone take i’m dissatisfied amazon’s customer service product company whole lost respect know i’m one,0.9999865162276036,1.3483772396405413e-05,0.14021312394840157,0.2,0.32804936667587853,32.80493666758785,Low Trust
