Me,/users/6011e63f1a3577001a26e598,US,4.0,2021-03-08 15:41:42+00:00,1.0,SCAM- 2% GC PROMO,"Amazon's GC PROMO: 2% WHEN LOADED FROM DEBIT CARD (Since I can't attach any file here, to view the promo, go to Reload GC, then it will promt you to view the promo.) So I availed the above promo, reloaded GC from debit card on 2/25 with a small trial amount -before I put in more $.  But the 2% NEVER came which counters their claim/advertisement. On the same date 2/25 I used GC to purchase an item.  So there should have been some leftover, only to find out several days after- that the remaining money that was still there 2/25 after I bought the item suddenly disappeared! With an agent saying that it  went to a much earlier order made 2/22- which should NEVER have had happened coz at the time of that order, on 2/22, the items were FULLY paid on that same order day 2/22, so there shouldn't be ANY FLOATING UNPAID amount at all which would be charged days after on 2/25. Amazon CAN'T have any price change after I ordered & fully paid the purchase already on 2/22. So there are 2 ISSUES HERE: 1) MISSING 2% on the $ I put into the GC from my debit card as advertised. 2) MISSING money deducted WITHOUT my knowledge days after I ordered items.  BOTH of which should be put & returned to my GC, NOT in the form of promo credits. I REFUSE that Amazon will again FORCE me to just accept the missing 2% in the form of promo credits. No, I do not need those promo credits where I could only access & make use of by buying only certain Amazon items I'm NOT interested in buying at all! This is like conning me of my own money. Who gave Amazon the right to decide how it will be returned to me when my debit card's worth + the amount deducted from me are both good as cash, NOT good as promo credits being forced on me.  And it's a TOTAL FRAUD if Amazon's gonna force promo credits on me to pay me of the missing 2% because this CONTRADICTS their promo clearly saying that it should appear as 2% right there & then! All of Amazon's agents/managers are pathetically clueless of this promo & this is a VIOLATION of our trust when they post promos NONE of agents are able to help customers with coz they have ZERO product knowledge of it. Worse, I requested to be escalated to the correct dept, twice promised, made to wait for days, but none! A little bit of RESPECT of my time when I already wasted almost 4 hours now being passed on to around 10 agents and different departments & now reporting to this to Trustpilot to warn others of this 2% because all avenues failed in Amazon. This is so unfair & unacceptable.",2021-03-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,8.0,2513,480,17,4,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,amazon gc promo loaded debit card since cant attach file view promo go reload gc promt view promo availed promo reloaded gc debit card small trial amount put never came counter claimadvertisement date used gc purchase item leftover find several day remaining money still bought item suddenly disappeared agent saying went much earlier order made never happened coz time order item fully paid order day shouldnt floating unpaid amount would charged day amazon cant price change ordered fully paid purchase already issue missing put gc debit card advertised missing money deducted without knowledge day ordered item put returned gc form promo credit refuse amazon force accept missing form promo credit need promo credit could access make use buying certain amazon item im interested buying like conning money gave amazon right decide returned debit card worth amount deducted good cash good promo credit forced total fraud amazon gonna force promo credit pay missing contradicts promo clearly saying appear right amazon agentsmanagers pathetically clueless promo violation trust post promos none agent able help customer coz zero product knowledge worse requested escalated correct dept twice promised made wait day none little bit respect time already wasted almost hour passed around agent different department reporting trustpilot warn others avenue failed amazon unfair unacceptable,0.9162589957499991,0.08374100425000086,0.269209197980931,0.2,0.39571234172118663,39.571234172118665,Low Trust
Mary Jane,/users/5e320fa9ddcefa77126193ff,US,10.0,2021-03-08 08:51:05+00:00,1.0,F u c k Amazon,"They surely pick and choose what reviews they want on their site. TrustPilot really annoys me, but at least they let people post their reviews without having to be “approved” first. You can try to share your experience with a product and Amazon can and will deny it. I’ve seen some nasty reviews on there but my reviews get denied.They need to pick better shipping companies, too! USPS is trash but most of the items I order are shipped with them. It’s not like people can pick and choose who to use for shipping and delivery. You only know once your item’s shipped. After reading reviews on here about USPS, I just don’t understand why Amazon would continually use them.I’ve also seen racist/anti-common sense masks when looking some up. To be “pro-BLM” and “pro-safety” they sure don’t give a crap who sells what. Whatever though. F u c k this site, and f u c k anyone who has a problem with this review.",2021-03-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,8.0,906,164,14,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,surely pick choose review want site trustpilot really annoys least let people post review without “approved” first try share experience product amazon deny i’ve seen nasty review review get deniedthey need pick better shipping company usps trash item order shipped it’s like people pick choose use shipping delivery know item’s shipped reading review usps don’t understand amazon would continually use themi’ve also seen racistanticommon sense mask looking “problm” “prosafety” sure don’t give crap sell whatever though f u c k site f u c k anyone problem review,0.05467950010055181,0.9453204998994482,0.09197980931015143,0.2,0.7910562118117545,79.10562118117545,High Trust
Fatma Efe,/users/6045431fe664b70019e59fa1,US,1.0,2021-03-07 21:18:34+00:00,1.0,I have been using Amazon over 7 years,"I have been using Amazon over 7 years. It was great at the beginning. Last 2 years, everything changed. They are providing costumer service like developing countries especially last year. Since I stopped paying for prime, they ship everything later than expected date. They are changing my payment method after 2-3 days of my order and asking me to correct it, then everything delay more. They do this almost for all my orders.  I paid for prime more than 5 years and ordered more than 500 products. Now, I am not valuable for them.",2021-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,7.0,532,94,37,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,using amazon year great beginning last year everything changed providing costumer service like developing country especially last year since stopped paying prime ship everything later expected date changing payment method day order asking correct everything delay almost order paid prime year ordered product valuable,0.01127977894399449,0.9887202210560055,0.05272013460459899,0.2,0.8049041374489225,80.49041374489225,High Trust
Alzbeta Homolkova,/users/604521a98e1c52001a46f35c,US,3.0,2021-03-07 18:55:43+00:00,1.0,Never had such bad customer service,"I got onto chat to ask a simple question. Why have my groceries been delivered to the lobby instead  of my door recently (can we change it back to my door?) and is it possible to use less bags (since they're always half empty?  Simple right? Nope. First live agent answer I got was ""Sorry for the inconvenience. We can offer you a $5 promo."" ...Uhh but what about my questions? I couldn't get an answer! Just kept getting copy and paste information about how deliveries work. I had to ask if they were really a live agent because it was like they weren't reading anything I wrote. And then he just left the chat. Just like that and I got another guy. Same deal. I finally got kind of an answer but it was like pulling teeth. I was still talking to him when HE just left.  Then I got a girl and I told her that my question is answered but I am very frustrated with the customer service and just wanted to express that, to which she replied by asking if I can help her with the order #. If she read it she would know it's not about the order anymore!! lol ...she could've just said ""Hey, I'm sorry for the bad experience. I will note your feedback"" and I would have been good with that but nope, once again it was like she didn't even read my message. I got off the  chat and was so frustrated I could cry ...and it all could've been solved in like 2 min if the first guy would've said:  ""Yes, we're sorry about that. The driver must have gotten it wrong. To ensure this won't happen again, you can write this down in your delivery instructions so they don't miss it again."" . I'm still not even sure if that applies for the bags question but I was pretty done by the end.",2021-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,7.0,1670,325,35,6,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,got onto chat ask simple question grocery delivered lobby instead door recently change back door possible use less bag since theyre always half empty simple right nope first live agent answer got sorry inconvenience offer promo uhh question couldnt get answer kept getting copy paste information delivery work ask really live agent like werent reading anything wrote left chat like got another guy deal finally got kind answer like pulling teeth still talking left got girl told question answered frustrated customer service wanted express replied asking help order read would know order anymore lol couldve said hey im sorry bad experience note feedback would good nope like didnt even read message got chat frustrated could cry couldve solved like min first guy wouldve said yes sorry driver must gotten wrong ensure wont happen write delivery instruction dont miss im still even sure applies bag question pretty done end,0.7277767300217676,0.27222326997823243,0.18227706113292205,0.2,0.47256704721570064,47.25670472157007,Low Trust
