Chelsea Easton,/users/5df23ecec8dc18526942255d,GB,8.0,2021-03-07 11:00:34+00:00,2.0,Damaged item's,"Damaged item'sAs a whole, I like Amazon. However in the recent month's/week's I have had many problems with item's that I have purchased or others have purchased for me from my wish list, that have been delivered damaged. Especially Easter Eggs!I understand wholeheartedly that item's do from time to time arrive damaged. However, in this instance it has been a reoccurring problem. I have even had item's delivered that were damaged before they had even left the depot. Just purely down to how the item's were packaged.I also feel it is out of order for Amazon to ask to have the item/s to be returned. Due to the fact that not only that the item's were damaged by Amazon or the delivery drivers but also that the customer has to pay for the item/s to be collected/returned. Customer's shouldn't have to return or pay for anything for damages that were caused by either Amazon and/or their delivery drivers. Adding to that, the collection company they have merged with are Hermes & Hermes aren't exactly a great company. So this can also be problematic!I hope that Amazon can resolve this major issue in the hopes that we the customers can just have a delivery without any issues or concerns. Please deal with these matters Amazon.Thanks.",2021-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,7.0,1239,214,14,2,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,damaged itemsas whole like amazon however recent monthsweeks many problem item purchased others purchased wish list delivered damaged especially easter eggsi understand wholeheartedly item time time arrive damaged however instance reoccurring problem even item delivered damaged even left depot purely item packagedi also feel order amazon ask item returned due fact item damaged amazon delivery driver also customer pay item collectedreturned customer shouldnt return pay anything damage caused either amazon andor delivery driver adding collection company merged hermes hermes arent exactly great company also problematici hope amazon resolve major issue hope customer delivery without issue concern please deal matter amazonthanks,0.13829607687968476,0.8617039231203152,0.12002243409983174,0.4,1.0548564483801237,105.48564483801238,High Trust
Rafael C,/users/6044a6052471c0001922105d,DK,2.0,2021-03-07 10:08:26+00:00,1.0,Do not recommend Amazon to anyone / they take no warranty responsibility whatsoever,"Do not recommend Amazon to anyone, as they do not comply with warranty regulations! I ordered a product which they sold through a seller in China. When the product failed within warranty periods, I contacted both the seller and Amazon. The seller does not respond, while Amazon says they can not help. They forward med to the seller, they used. Fantastic service and responsibility, right!!! No thanks! I will need to investigate how this first to the European regulations, obviously Amazon does not fulfill these!!!",2021-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,7.0,516,85,83,13,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,recommend amazon anyone comply warranty regulation ordered product sold seller china product failed within warranty period contacted seller amazon seller respond amazon say help forward med seller used fantastic service responsibility right thanks need investigate first european regulation obviously amazon fulfill,0.9995474973106065,0.0004525026893934525,0.04767246214245653,0.2,0.309760743773188,30.976074377318803,Low Trust
