Tyler P,/users/6043df5bdcb82000191f2318,US,1.0,2021-03-06 20:00:46+00:00,1.0,True rating is zero stars,"True rating is zero stars. Start to finish our experience was negative. Did not ship  products, called to find out why and told account specialists have to handle it. Told one would contact us within 24 hours. Tried four different days. Told the same thing. Never received a contact over 10 days. Called to cancel order and close all accounts. Next day, my credit card was charged. Tried to call and get that taken care of. Same story. Told the only way to handle it was to dispute the charge through my bank. Tried to file a complaint against these phantom account specialists. The email I was given to file the complaint, returned:   ""Hello from Amazon,You've written to an address that does not accept incoming direct e-mails""Don't ever use this company or anything associated with them!",2021-03-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,6.0,790,136,25,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,true rating zero star start finish experience negative ship product called find told account specialist handle told one would contact u within hour tried four different day told thing never received contact day called cancel order close account next day credit card charged tried call get taken care story told way handle dispute charge bank tried file complaint phantom account specialist email given file complaint returned hello amazonyouve written address accept incoming direct emailsdont ever use company anything associated,0.08203705788286772,0.9179629421171323,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.7742366589441522,77.42366589441522,High Trust
