Melanie,/users/601390db771237001953966d,US,1.0,2021-03-26 05:46:34+00:00,1.0,I CANT GET THROUGH TO ANYONE OF…,"I CANT GET THROUGH TO ANYONE OF LEGITIMACY AND HONESTY AND PROFESSIONALISM ITS ONLY THE SAME PEOPLE EVERY TIME FOR OVER  2 WEEKS NOW! My calls are being intercepted by THE SAME GROUP of Amazon employees and supervisors and I have proof. It’s been over 6 weeks of the worst customer service experience of my existence causing a great amount of emotional and mental distress not knowing why these people won’t let me through to anyone who can and will help me? I waited for several weeks on an investigation that was never ongoing like stated numerous times, I was lied to countless times and made to wait and wait on false pretenses never once did anything they stated come with any truth or reality. I finally got through to a very nice woman who filed the investigation on February 16th 2021 at 10:44 PM for the first time to my surprise as I was waiting and waiting for weeks then finding out it was all lies that was a huge blow... but the rep said my investigation was in the top five and I would hear back in 24-48 the latest but likely sooner considering the severity of what I’ve been enduring with some customer service agents and supervisors and I haven’t heard anything since about that investigation... I thought it was going to be over and I am finally going to get real help and be treated Like a human at the very least... I have never been through anything like this in my life I can’t come close to being able to even begin to describe how I feel I just can’t it’s not something I’m able to do right now I have tried believe me. I have emailed nearly every email address I’ve gotten from you guys asking for help begging for someone of legitimacy and honesty and loyalty for amazon and their customers to hopefully to read my messages and help me but I’ve gotten nothing back from anyone, I don’t understand. it’s not okay for anyone to go through any of this I can’t wrap 