equired verification to regain access and one of the requirements was my Social security number. I didn’t enter it but I almost did, being denied equal access and services, and information withheld, I haven’t received any truth at all and I can prove everything I just want it over and peacefully but they refuse to let me get help. They are customer service agents they can’t help in the area in need help in and they tell me all the time but refuse to let me get the real help and when I ask I’m switched over to nothing or someone not speaking til I hang up or a false title or the person sitting beside them. They legit just change their names and say the same lines “this is my first day at Amazon” or “I’ve never spoke with you before” even if I don’t say anything about that. It really takes a toll on a person after a while and I’m to my limit I can’t comprehend how anyone can be so cruel.",2021-03-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,3.0,26.0,4787,902,32,7,23.0,0,8,1,0,Genuine,cant get anyone legitimacy honesty professionalism people every time week call intercepted group amazon employee supervisor proof it’s week worst customer service experience existence causing great amount emotional mental distress knowing people won’t let anyone help waited several week investigation never ongoing like stated numerous time lied countless time made wait wait false pretense never anything stated come truth reality finally got nice woman filed investigation february th pm first time surprise waiting waiting week finding lie huge blow rep said investigation top five would hear back latest likely sooner considering severity i’ve enduring customer service agent supervisor haven’t heard anything since investigation thought going finally going get real help treated like human least never anything like life can’t come close able even begin describe feel can’t it’s something i’m able right tried believe emailed nearly every email address i’ve gotten guy asking help begging someone legitimacy honesty l