Guy,/users/6039630f67c0cf001af57a74,US,1.0,2021-02-26 21:08:20+00:00,1.0,Zero Customer Service & Transparency,"My brother used his ex girlfriend's card to order a monitor on my Amazon account. She filed a fraud claim. I intercepted it and returned it. The ups store lost it and required simply the address of the seller. I was locked out of my Amazon account due to the fraud claim. The emails they send regarding purchases have no info in them. Not the price. Not the seller. Nothing. I wrote them just asking for the address of the seller so I could file a lost package claim with ups . They responded with a cookie-cutter message saying my account was locked while investigating the fraud claim. I replied ""great, but that doesn't answer my question"". They replied with the same cookie cutter response. After 4 replies asking for the address with detailed reasons, I told them "" *fk it! Close my account!"" I'm done with Amazon. They have zero customer service and for whatever reason they've cut out all useful information in the last few years from post purchase emails. Why even send them? They just say ""thank you for your purchase"". I think it's so they can change the information about past orders whenever they need to to give them the edge on disputes, hiding all info behind their wall.",2021-02-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,26.0,1186,213,36,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,brother used ex girlfriend card order monitor amazon account filed fraud claim intercepted returned ups store lost required simply address seller locked amazon account due fraud claim email send regarding purchase info price seller nothing wrote asking address seller could file lost package claim ups responded cookiecutter message saying account locked investigating fraud claim replied great doesnt answer question replied cookie cutter response reply asking address detailed reason told fk close account im done amazon zero customer service whatever reason theyve cut useful information last year post purchase email even send say thank purchase think change information past order whenever need give edge dispute hiding info behind wall,0.19101134452315757,0.8089886554768424,0.11946158160403814,0.2,0.7283866440592288,72.83866440592288,Medium Trust
joeri,/users/5f358a010408597b757ca2d3,BE,3.0,2021-02-26 20:05:22+00:00,1.0,Fraud and i cannot do anything,"Amazon does not even give me an option to tell them they have a fraud in their system. I order steins gate - the complete series. It never arrives.  Day after day I send mails - through the system - to notify. By now I realize/suspect this person is a fraud, steeling my money, because he does not respond to my mails and I see many people in the reviews with the same problem..  .... I want to warn other people and cannot in any way or form.  Of course I made the payment in advance s- so I lost > 60 euro.",2021-02-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,26.0,508,103,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon even give option tell fraud system order stein gate complete series never arrives day day send mail system notify realizesuspect person fraud steeling money respond mail see many people review problem want warn people cannot way form course made payment advance lost euro,0.021591509587239988,0.97840849041276,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.8007578066197283,80.07578066197283,High Trust
