Victor R.,/users/60393a823099b5001afbdf69,US,1.0,2021-02-26 18:46:36+00:00,1.0,Worst experience ever,"Recently they start sending the verification link to your phone. By some reasons it never comes to some of the phones because of the notification format or cell provider setup or by some other reason. When you call them the first time they say it is a system glitch and should be fixed in 24 hours. And as you can imagine it never happens.  Attempting to reset that over their 800 number is just waste of your time. I spent several hours on the phone with them. I gave them all the information they needed including the phone #, credit card numbers, billing address, email, last transaction codes from my bank statement but this is not enough!  They ask you to name last three purchased items and if you do not remember the exact names of the items you purchased  you can not pass their security check!  Is not this weird? These guys become crazy. I am not going to use them any more. I hate all that. And I feel sorry for my time and nerves.",2021-02-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,26.0,942,177,21,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,recently start sending verification link phone reason never come phone notification format cell provider setup reason call first time say system glitch fixed hour imagine never happens attempting reset number waste time spent several hour phone gave information needed including phone credit card number billing address email last transaction code bank statement enough ask name last three purchased item remember exact name item purchased pas security check weird guy become crazy going use hate feel sorry time nerve,0.28807363338413944,0.7119263666158606,0.09927089175546831,0.2,0.675817361659024,67.5817361659024,Medium Trust
