Kay,/users/5eebf552bcb5e816b00fbf54,US,25.0,2021-02-25 20:57:57+00:00,1.0,2 Trips & A Lot of Hassle for a Razor,"After a terrible customer service experience about 1.5 years ago, I stopped using Amazon. I’ve rented a couple of movies, but that’s it. My roommate constantly orders from them without much issue (excluding a book that took 3 months to get here), so I thought I’d try them again. Big big big big mistake. Firstly, I had updated my card info months ago; it’s the same one they charge when I rented movies. I place an $80 something order and a week goes by without an update. Mind you, I had also updated my contact info to TEXT me updates, rather than email, as I hardly ever check my email. Well, they tried to run the wrong card, and then sent me one email saying my order hadn’t processed. One would think before accepting an order, the business would first make sure it was paid for, but I guess that’s crazy talk. Anyway, I cancelled that order. I re-updated my payment info and placed another order of about the same price; I changed some things. One of the things I ordered was a new double bladed safety blade razor. I read the description REPEATEDLY and it said this particular razor, a Viking Chieftan, came with one blade. For me, that is what I needed; I’m not about to pay an extra $10 for 100 blades, if I don’t even know if I’ll like the product. I get the razor, and there isn’t a blade. I looked everywhere. So, I decide to look up where to buy blades for these. I’m directed to Sally’s, but they were out of them. Great. I guess I get to return it. But hang on!! I didn’t know that you can’t print out and package a return for them to pick up, YOU have to play delivery person! YAY! Just what I wanted-a complete fiasco made out of a stupid razor. So, now, tomorrow I get to drive to the UPS store and return, what has now become, an albatross around my neck. Needless public trips during Covid; which is EXACTLY why I’ve been ordering things! I also left a bad review, which I updated today, and noticed my bad review hadn’t been posted, and the site refuses to post my update. I hope I get my refund, and I hope my bad review of this razor, doesn’t negatively affect the other order I placed lastnight; I have left several 5 star reviews of other items I’ve been happy with. But most of all, I wish a legitimate company didn’t make me feel like they’re going to spit in my food, because I was honest enough to leave a valid review of my experience. Amazon may say they care, but their actions show us a different story.",2021-02-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,25.0,2438,462,37,10,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,terrible customer service experience year ago stopped using amazon i’ve rented couple movie that’s roommate constantly order without much issue excluding book took month get thought i’d try big big big big mistake firstly updated card info month ago it’s one charge rented movie place something order week go without update mind also updated contact info text update rather email hardly ever check email well tried run wrong card sent one email saying order hadn’t processed one would think accepting order business would first make sure paid guess that’s crazy talk anyway cancelled order reupdated payment info placed another order price changed thing one thing ordered new double bladed safety blade razor read description repeatedly said particular razor viking chieftan came one blade needed i’m pay extra blade don’t even know i’ll like product get razor isn’t blade looked everywhere decide look buy blade i’m directed sally’s great guess get return hang didn’t know can’t print package return pick play delivery person yay wanteda complete fiasco made stupid razor tomorrow get drive ups store return become albatross around neck needless public trip covid exactly i’ve ordering thing also left bad review updated today noticed bad review hadn’t posted site refuse post update hope get refund hope bad review razor doesn’t negatively affect order placed lastnight left several star review item i’ve happy wish legitimate company didn’t make feel like they’re going spit food honest enough leave valid review experience amazon may say care action show u different story,0.9458759653067806,0.05412403469321936,0.2591138530566461,0.2,0.3788847879579389,37.88847879579389,Low Trust
