Nancy Madore,/users/6037a69d811a1e001ab731bf,US,1.0,2021-02-25 13:31:17+00:00,1.0,Refund Scam,"I received a completely different item from what I ordered. I returned the wrong product and Amazon confirmed the return and said the ""refund"" was granted (I wonder how many people check to see if they got the refund). Amazon never issued a refund. After 8 attempts to get my refund, I learned that Amazon applies a ""store credit"" as a ""refund"" unless you specifically request that the refund go to your credit card. Oh, and by the way, good luck finding where to make this request-- it cannot be found anywhere on the site. Getting the refund applied took a month...during which time I wanted to just give up but didn't because I hate these type of rip off scams. I happen to know (having been in retail) that most people would never bother to check and/or would forget about the refund.  I wonder how much Amazon makes on these 'refunds' in a year (and yet they don't owe any taxes. Go figure). I'd like to give a shout out to Tanana in customer service though, who finally, after a month, made the illusive switch from store credit to actual refund. As a former small retail merchant, I would've lost my merchants' license had I pulled a stunt like this.",2021-02-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,25.0,1157,211,11,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,received completely different item ordered returned wrong product amazon confirmed return said refund granted wonder many people check see got refund amazon never issued refund attempt get refund learned amazon applies store credit refund unless specifically request refund go credit card oh way good luck finding make request cannot found anywhere site getting refund applied took monthduring time wanted give didnt hate type rip scam happen know retail people would never bother check andor would forget refund wonder much amazon make refund year yet dont owe tax go figure id like give shout tanana customer service though finally month made illusive switch store credit actual refund former small retail merchant wouldve lost merchant license pulled stunt like,0.008806322881770839,0.9911936771182291,0.11833987661245092,0.2,0.8192648138816048,81.92648138816048,High Trust
