te supervisor tell rudely there nothing help even amazon fault choice accept solution offered repeat attempt rationalize fall deaf ear tell hanging cannot accept solution totally polite want waste time solution already provided,0.016564797336259332,0.9834352026637406,0.126752664049355,0.2,0.8170681341417413,81.70681341417414,High Trust
