Kai Skey,/users/602aeb23b90f370019804122,GB,1.0,2021-02-15 21:44:07+00:00,1.0,If I could rate no stars I would,"If I could rate no stars I would, absolutely ridiculous customer service, my address is a new establishment, I have order multiple times which the item was never delivered to my address, when checking the delivery map my address was pin pointed about a 15 minute walk away from my actual address, I had rang 3/4 times and the advisers I had spoken to had assured me they had left extra delivery instructions and also changed the pin point on the map so the delivery driver could find my address, a delivery did however come and the delivery driver even told me my address was pinned at the other side of my estate, now I am being told I will not be refunded MY money for something I didn’t receive and they want me to file a police report to get back the £30 I spent which is a bloody waste of time, absolutely disgusting in the customer service and will certainly not be ordering again, they’ve just lost a customer who spends a lot of their money on Amazon especially coming up to Christmas",2021-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,15.0,992,185,32,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,could rate star would absolutely ridiculous customer service address new establishment order multiple time item never delivered address checking delivery map address pin pointed minute walk away actual address rang time adviser spoken assured left extra delivery instruction also changed pin point map delivery driver could find address delivery however come delivery driver even told address pinned side estate told refunded money something didn’t receive want file police report get back £ spent bloody waste time absolutely disgusting customer service certainly ordering they’ve lost customer spends lot money amazon especially coming christmas,0.014290604911717394,0.9857093950882826,0.10375771172181716,0.2,0.8136062398885047,81.36062398885046,High Trust
