Josh Raymer,/users/602a29c6e62fd2001933590a,US,1.0,2021-02-15 07:59:52+00:00,1.0,Amazon has become a nightmare,"Amazon has become a nightmare.  I guess I'm just going to have to break down and start shopping at Wal-Mart again.  Every single time I order something, actually receiving the shipment is a migraine-inducing nightmare.  Can't deliver to a pick-up box nearby, because they're ALWAYS full.  If Amazon ships it USPS (the vast majority of the time), USPS will mark it ""delivered to parcel locker"" which actually means they failed to deliver it on time and took it back to the post office.  Then I might get it 1-3 days late, or never.  If they ship via UPS or Fed Ex, they won't leave it at the door, for no apparent reason, even though it's not signature required.  I'm so sick and tired of this.",2021-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,15.0,693,125,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon become nightmare guess im going break start shopping walmart every single time order something actually receiving shipment migraineinducing nightmare cant deliver pickup box nearby theyre always full amazon ship usps vast majority time usps mark delivered parcel locker actually mean failed deliver time took back post office might get day late never ship via ups fed ex wont leave door apparent reason even though signature required im sick tired,0.02096165908043964,0.9790383409195603,0.07010656197420079,0.2,0.8035404828546203,80.35404828546203,High Trust
Austen Stokes,/users/6029edb75b994c00199e7df6,US,1.0,2021-02-15 03:43:00+00:00,1.0,Amazon shipping is awful,"Amazon shipping is awful. Ever since Amazon brought their shipping in-house the accuracy at which they deliver items has completely gone downhill. UPS was far better than Amazon's own shipping. I've ordered multiple items that were marked as Prime and could be delivered same day ""by 6PM"", and I have yet to receive an item that day. I could just have easily gone to the store and bought what I needed and been guaranteed to have the item the same day.",2021-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,15.0,452,81,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon shipping awful ever since amazon brought shipping inhouse accuracy deliver item completely gone downhill ups far better amazon shipping ive ordered multiple item marked prime could delivered day pm yet receive item day could easily gone store bought needed guaranteed item day,0.019474240306444592,0.9805257596935554,0.045429052159282106,0.2,0.7993486902786341,79.93486902786341,High Trust
