PaulN,/users/6029c13e0da303001b80f690,US,2.0,2021-02-15 00:40:22+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime Delvery Date Changed - No Notice,"Placed order which was shipped with Amazon Prime with a scheduled delivery date of 2/10/2021. I rearranged my schedule so that I would be home to accept the delivery. On the evening of 2/9/2021 I checked my Amazon account and found that Amazon had changed the delivery date to Friday 2/12/2021 without notifying me. I immediately contacted Amazon Customer Service, but they were not willing to fix or provide compensation since I would now have to rearrange my Friday schedule to be home to accept the delivery. I submitted a BBB complaint, but the Amazon BBB representative refused it. Amazon Customer Service is just about as bad as Comcast.",2021-02-15 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,15.0,643,109,45,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order shipped amazon prime scheduled delivery date rearranged schedule would home accept delivery evening checked amazon account found amazon changed delivery date friday without notifying immediately contacted amazon customer service willing fix provide compensation since would rearrange friday schedule home accept delivery submitted bbb complaint amazon bbb representative refused amazon customer service bad comcast,0.01272707583231041,0.9872729241676896,0.061132922041503085,0.2,0.8058630464921454,80.58630464921454,High Trust
Nelesh Shah,/users/5abd2d604de5666d34558630,GB,18.0,2021-05-06 10:27:48+00:00,2.0,This is specific to Amazon business,"This is specific to Amazon business, which is one of the worst experiences in retail out of any modern company. Absolutely horrendous service. After spending over 45mins dealing with them, nothing gets resolved.Update:After 3 weeks of chasing the issues eventually got resolved. Don't expect the level of service that you are used to with normal Amazon, the business team needs to step up their game.",2021-02-14 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,6.0,400,65,35,6,81.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,specific amazon business one worst experience retail modern company absolutely horrendous service spending min dealing nothing get resolvedupdateafter week chasing issue eventually got resolved dont expect level service used normal amazon business team need step game,0.012175332494188834,0.9878246675058112,0.03645541222658441,0.4,1.1012034161982225,110.12034161982226,High Trust
