Bob Piquette,/users/602945d30da303001b80c482,US,1.0,2021-02-14 15:46:32+00:00,1.0,crappy delivery recently,"Is it just me, or is Amazons shipping taken a turn for the worse lately?  I ordered an in stock item on Tuesday that was supposed to arrive Friday(which was longer than usual but I was OK with it), The item shipped that day (Tuesday). No delivery Friday, no delivery Saturday and now no delivery Sunday. It arrived at the local distribution center on Friday.  It's been sitting there for three days.  I usually order from Amazon over other on line retailers because of their reliable shipping. Not any longer.  This is the second item in 2 weeks that has been delivered late without adequate notification.  The same item that I ordered  is on their site and it says it will be delivered tomorrow if I order in the next 1hr 49 min.  Maybe I should do that.",2021-02-14 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,14.0,755,138,24,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon shipping taken turn worse lately ordered stock item tuesday supposed arrive fridaywhich longer usual ok item shipped day tuesday delivery friday delivery saturday delivery sunday arrived local distribution center friday sitting three day usually order amazon line retailer reliable shipping longer second item week delivered late without adequate notification item ordered site say delivered tomorrow order next hr min maybe,0.025569871625546695,0.9744301283744533,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.8026945930711302,80.26945930711302,High Trust
