Rick,/users/5fded3c8254baf001a5170b1,US,24.0,2021-02-13 20:48:34+00:00,1.0,Do you subscribe to Amazon Prime? Don't or Cancel,"do you subscribe to Amazon PRIME? You might want to read this.For several years there has been a growing issue with Amazon's PRIME subscription. The first major issue that seemed to hit everybody and they were many upset clients, was the price increase for non-college students. what this meant that is if you were not in any school either by age discrimination and or just not interested in school Amazon would penalize you by charging you $12.99 for their monthly subscription. If you were in school however you were appraised with a price of $9.99. while some people left amazon, they have become too big to fail and some of them bit the bullet and just kept the $12.99. as a personal note, it's pretty sad when people will just accept the punishment to stay with a company that has a large and diverse inventory. Many people believe this should change.now recently over last year or so , especially with the covid issue going on people have been noticing that the next day or same-day shipping options are no longer available . this became quite an issue when people were stuck at home and they purchased items that were PRIME-rated , and wanted them immediately and we're more than happy to spend the above and beyond $35 requirement to get them quickly, only to find out, that none of their items would arrive as expected from a PRIME member. Many of the delivery dates now came as short as four or five days later to as far out as a weaker more.many of us understand that third parties are responsible for their shipping and we expect those to take an extensively long time to be delivered, however, when an item is labeled as PRIME, that has been indicated to us that it is in one of the Amazon's local warehouses or at least nearby enough to get them to the customer either the same day or evening or even overnight.another issue with the PRIME membership that has weird its ugly head for quite some time and Netflix seems to have this issue as well as the lack of movies that were allowed to watch with our subscription. almost all the major motion pictures and popular movies and TV shows now have to be rented for $3.99. this is an addition to the subscription fee of the PRIME of $12.99 which means if you want to watch one movie a month you're now paying over $16 for your subscription to Amazon and if you watch more movies for a month just the bill keeps adding up.Amazon has somehow lost touch with its clientele base. Has gotten so big that they cannot fail. Amazon has become a household name where we purchase and buy items and have them delivered to our place, and as a consumer, the deliveries are probably the most important thing next to the quality of the items that we receive. Purchasing a large item 35 to $100 or more and waiting weeks to get them is not acceptable. Especially when everybody who is on Amazon is pretty much paying a pristine fee to gain special privileges. I talked to several people who are friends of mine that do not and will not get the PRIME subscription, only to find out that their delivery dates are no different from mine now. So the question remains, what is the purpose of the PRIME subscription if you cannot benefit from it.sadly none of these bad reviews that are actual personal experiences of clients of Amazon will cause Amazon to shut down and or change their policies. as I mentioned before they are just too big to fail and regardless of what your complaint is it will affect them in the least. However currently as of 2021 I suggested that people just not waste their money and purchasing that extra subscription to PRIME, as you will receive no benefits from it and if you have Netflix your movies are already covered, your delivery times are going to be no better off than eBay or any friends of yours that do not have PRIME, and if the only thing you'll save on is a couple of bucks from shipping. if the item shipping cost is a little higher than you expect, you can most likely find the item you're looking for it's several other online stores that offer free shipping.One thing you will find with Amazon, like many other outlet stores, is that they blame the 3rd party for their shortcomings, and while that may be true, that is not the problem of the customer, and should never be presented as such. Amazon has, on numerous times claimed that they cannot show certain movies because of their contract with the movie companies. OK, that is fine, but what does that have to do with the customer, you promised us up to date moves for our PRIME membership - not excuses why they cannot be viewed. Same with shipping. Do not tell the customers your business problems. Final notes, do not purchase the PRIME subscription and it is no longer worthwhile",2021-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,13.0,4720,857,49,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,subscribe amazon prime might want read thisfor several year growing issue amazon prime subscription first major issue seemed hit everybody many upset client price increase noncollege student meant school either age discrimination interested school amazon would penalize charging monthly subscription school however appraised price people left amazon become big fail bit bullet kept personal note pretty sad people accept punishment stay company large diverse inventory many people believe changenow recently last year especially covid issue going people noticing next day sameday shipping option longer available became quite issue people stuck home purchased item primerated wanted immediately happy spend beyond requirement get quickly find none item would arrive expected prime member many delivery date came short four five day later far weaker moremany u understand third party responsible shipping expect take extensively long time delivered however item labeled prime indicated u one amazon local warehouse least nearby enough get customer either day evening even overnightanother issue prime membership weird ugly head quite time netflix seems issue well lack movie allowed watch subscription almost major motion picture popular movie tv show rented addition subscription fee prime mean want watch one movie month youre paying subscription amazon watch movie month bill keep adding upamazon somehow lost touch clientele base gotten big cannot fail amazon become household name purchase buy item delivered place consumer delivery probably important thing next quality item receive purchasing large item waiting week get acceptable especially everybody amazon pretty much paying pristine fee gain special privilege talked several people friend mine get prime subscription find delivery date different mine question remains purpose prime subscription cannot benefit itsadly none bad review actual personal experience client amazon cause amazon shut change policy mentioned big fail regardless complaint affect least however currently suggested people waste money purchasing extra subscription prime receive benefit netflix movie already covered delivery time going better ebay friend prime thing youll save couple buck shipping item shipping cost little higher expect likely find item youre looking several online store offer free shippingone thing find amazon like many outlet store blame rd party shortcoming may true problem customer never presented amazon numerous time claimed cannot show certain movie contract movie company ok fine customer promised u date move prime membership excuse cannot viewed shipping tell customer business problem final note purchase prime subscription longer worthwhile,0.0026405374864213868,0.9973594625135787,0.4806505888951206,0.2,0.8948098490358134,89.48098490358134,High Trust
