Sheryl Powell,/users/56f2700a0000ff000a111d06,GB,17.0,2021-02-15 10:53:31+00:00,1.0,Multiple deliveries for one order in one day,"Previously, Amazon have been reasonably decent. However, for the last 6 months, some orders have arrived at 3 separate times. At times, the last order has not been delivered. On making enquiries, I was informed that there has been a delay somewhere or the product cannot be delivered. No courtesy message is sent. I have had to cancel the order and wait for a refund. Just because they are one of the richest companies in the world, they are delusional to think they are exempt from reducing their carbon footprint. Also, on a few occasions, I have received goods, which obviously have been another customers returns, unpackaged with crumbs. No care and attention. I didn't pay for them, but had the inconvenience of having to return the goods. I will be cancelling my PRIME. People need to start supporting local businesses who are suffering terribly.",2021-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,15.0,852,145,44,8,2.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,previously amazon reasonably decent however last month order arrived separate time time last order delivered making enquiry informed delay somewhere product cannot delivered courtesy message sent cancel order wait refund one richest company world delusional think exempt reducing carbon footprint also occasion received good obviously another customer return unpackaged crumb care attention didnt pay inconvenience return good cancelling prime people need start supporting local business suffering terribly,0.014083504518993657,0.9859164954810063,0.08132361189007291,0.2,0.8092229701185177,80.92229701185177,High Trust
