Nichole langford,/users/601d832ef0d6ef001a369634,US,5.0,2021-02-12 14:11:12+00:00,1.0,Very unethical / Deceptive Business Practices,"Very unethical. I ordered two video cameras and decided to return them. I was waiting for my refund and never received a notification that I had been issued a refund. I was not made aware that the refund would be credited as a gift card. I did not ask nor want a gift card. I call about my refund and I am told that I already received it. I’m livid because my card balance says differently. So I check my account and sure enough there’s a gift card attached to it. Before I knew this I ordered a movie for my kids thinking it was being paid via my debit card attached to my account and come to find out, the gift card was automatically being set as my primary use, when in the past it has always been my debit card. So by me using the balance from the gift card unknowingly, that disqualified me from receiving my refund instead. This was down right deceptive, and crazy. There should always be a disclaimer to let the customer know how a refund will be issued l. There was none for my purchase. I will not be supporting Amazon anymore. These companies don’t put money in our pockets, we put money in theirs. So they should show some appreciation with honesty and professional services period!",2021-02-12 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,12.0,1193,224,45,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,unethical ordered two video camera decided return waiting refund never received notification issued refund made aware refund would credited gift card ask want gift card call refund told already received i’m livid card balance say differently check account sure enough there’s gift card attached knew ordered movie kid thinking paid via debit card attached account come find gift card automatically set primary use past always debit card using balance gift card unknowingly disqualified receiving refund instead right deceptive crazy always disclaimer let customer know refund issued l none purchase supporting amazon anymore company don’t put money pocket put money show appreciation honesty professional service period,0.06428182154553912,0.9357181784544609,0.1256309590577678,0.2,0.792985281038784,79.2985281038784,High Trust
