Peter D,/users/5c194b7061091c4e8658f93d,GB,20.0,2021-02-11 22:27:50+00:00,1.0,Clunky App and Customer Service,"Got notified of my product being delivered, however our door never got knocked on and never received it or seen it outside. I tried using their automated chat which confirmed it got delivered, but when responding that it never arrived, they replied saying “we expect your package to arrive tomorrow”. This really confused me as made no sense. I requested to talk to a human, and it got me to request a call back which wouldn’t work so gave up. Finally managed to get hold of someone on the chat, and they explained that it may be an error and that I should wait two more days for it arrive. They were polite however, although I felt they were copy and pasting from a script. Not sure why I bother paying money for a Prime membership if they can’t keep their end of the deal.",2021-02-11 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,11.0,774,145,31,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,got notified product delivered however door never got knocked never received seen outside tried using automated chat confirmed got delivered responding never arrived replied saying “we expect package arrive tomorrow” really confused made sense requested talk human got request call back wouldn’t work gave finally managed get hold someone chat explained may error wait two day arrive polite however although felt copy pasting script sure bother paying money prime membership can’t keep end deal,0.03140253462516256,0.9685974653748375,0.08132361189007291,0.2,0.8005634550654332,80.05634550654332,High Trust
