Benjamin Petit,/users/60236bb2b9291e0019bdfb58,CA,2.0,2021-02-10 05:14:37+00:00,1.0,Amazon is the most disrespectful…,"Amazon is the most disrespectful company of its customers!They send me many ""automatic"" messages to make reviews on products. I spent a lot of time helping other customers with reviewing products and with their unjustified censorship they unilaterally deleted working hours !!! and of course, no justification or excuse ... to take your money amazon is here, to respect you it's another story!",2021-02-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,10.0,393,63,33,5,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,amazon disrespectful company customersthey send many automatic message make review product spent lot time helping customer reviewing product unjustified censorship unilaterally deleted working hour course justification excuse take money amazon respect another story,0.9920254800660062,0.007974519933993784,0.035333707234997194,0.2,0.3110540014139963,31.10540014139963,Low Trust
Gail Ann Duberchin,/users/60235cbc08522b001a40f83a,US,1.0,2021-02-10 04:10:46+00:00,1.0,Gift not received,"After an hour on the phone with Amazon customer service, I was not able to change my email so I could receive a gift sent to me by a friend. It resulted in her paying $14.95 for a book that I cannot read. I don't understand why, if my previous email is not available to me, Amazon cannot update my information and help me to receive my gift. Basically, they have cheated both my friend and me.",2021-02-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,10.0,393,77,17,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,hour phone amazon customer service able change email could receive gift sent friend resulted paying book cannot read dont understand previous email available amazon cannot update information help receive gift basically cheated friend,0.023352570692976245,0.9766474293070238,0.04318564217610768,0.2,0.7969608430887334,79.69608430887334,High Trust
