Mark Smith,/users/602331dd08522b001a40ec5a,US,1.0,2021-02-10 01:07:47+00:00,1.0,Amazon Internal Theft,"Having been an Amazon customer for over a decade, my experiences have always been at least good, if not excellent.  Unfortunately the same cannot be said for the very last order I will ever place with Amazon.I ordered an expensive Swiss Ortho queen size mattress and delivery was scheduled for about a week later, which was normal for me, since I was not a Prime member.  The night before the delivery was scheduled, they advanced the delivery date one day, which was fine, because there has been a lot of winter weather issues in the area.Then suddenly after I get to work Monday morning 2-8, I check my email and it says my mattress was Delivered - Given to Customer Directly, at 6:56 am.  I immediately knew something was wrong.  First, the order wasn't supposed to come until Tuesday, and now they say it arrived very early Monday morning? Second, Amazon NEVER delivers at 6:56 in the morning in my area, EVER.  Third, there was nobody home to accept delivery.  But no problem, because I luckily have Ring motion detection HD camera recording doorbell ON MY ENTIRE PROPERTY AND STREET.  What do you know?  Absolutely no activity.  No amazon driver, no truck, no delivery, no nothing.  The contract Amazon driver literally stole my package.  He/she fraudulently scanned it delivered from an unknown location, and then had the audacity to claim they ""handed it to customer.""  Unreal and total outrage don't even begin to describe my reaction.  They either stole it for themselves or sold it.  I contacted Amazon support for help and they couldn't care less.  Since most people just ask for a replacement, the thieves get away with it, and are quite literally robbing from the company blind.  But since I have ZERO, NO confidence in Amazon anymore and will be cancelling my Amazon credit card and demand a refund due to their extreme incompetence and lack of willingness to correct the situation, they keep stalling, saying the package will eventually show up, when I know absolutely that will never happen in a million years.  No problem, I'm done screaming at them.  If they want to employ thieves, that's their problem, and believe me, THERE ARE LOTS OF THEM ALL OVER THE COUNTRY.  The company just keeps resending items and the thieves are getting away with murder.  I explained the whole situation to my credit card company and the charge has been credited back while they investigate the formal dispute I started.  Do not waste your time with Amazon CS.  I did for 2 days, and you get people who can't even speak or write decent English in the chat or on the phone, it's all foreign countries who couldn't care less about you or your problem.  I'm a 6  figure earner who spent big bucks at Amazon over the years, but absolutely positively NEVER AGAIN.",2021-02-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,10.0,2758,477,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer decade experience always least good excellent unfortunately cannot said last order ever place amazoni ordered expensive swiss ortho queen size mattress delivery scheduled week later normal since prime member night delivery scheduled advanced delivery date one day fine lot winter weather issue areathen suddenly get work monday morning check email say mattress delivered given customer directly immediately knew something wrong first order wasnt supposed come tuesday say arrived early monday morning second amazon never delivers morning area ever third nobody home accept delivery problem luckily ring motion detection hd camera recording doorbell entire property street know absolutely activity amazon driver truck delivery nothing contract amazon driver literally stole package heshe fraudulently scanned delivered unknown location audacity claim handed customer unreal total outrage dont even begin describe reaction either stole sold contacted amazon support help couldnt care less since people ask replacement thief get away quite literally robbing company blind since zero confidence amazon anymore cancelling amazon credit card demand refund due extreme incompetence lack willingness correct situation keep stalling saying package eventually show know absolutely never happen million year problem im done screaming want employ thief thats problem believe lot country company keep resending item thief getting away murder explained whole situation credit card company charge credited back investigate formal dispute started waste time amazon c day get people cant even speak write decent english chat phone foreign country couldnt care less problem im figure earner spent big buck amazon year absolutely positively never,0.0049365879210322835,0.9950634120789678,0.2675266404935502,0.2,0.8510370341381939,85.10370341381939,High Trust
