Gert Weber,/users/60227536b3ed6200192e0c6a,GB,1.0,2021-02-09 11:43:57+00:00,1.0,Absolutely the worse company ever,"Absolutely the worse company ever. Professional scam artists who treat sellers like sh-it and take their money. What kind of policy is this when a customer receives a refund if the item sent out is one day late???? Not only do they refund the customer, the customer keeps the item! Amazon should be shutdown and take court for stealing. A-Z claims is joke. They question you about your performance when you are 0.1% over their 1% threshold. Why am I not performing? It because you keep granting cases for buyers for no fk-ing reason and suspending my account because you want a utility bill and then take 3 months to reply back and grant access to my own money and account. Go fk yourself Amazon!",2021-02-09 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,9.0,696,125,33,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,absolutely worse company ever professional scam artist treat seller like shit take money kind policy customer receives refund item sent one day late refund customer customer keep item amazon shutdown take court stealing az claim joke question performance threshold performing keep granting case buyer fking reason suspending account want utility bill take month reply back grant access money account go fk amazon,0.2583399614515335,0.7416600385484665,0.07010656197420079,0.2,0.6848513316690734,68.48513316690735,Medium Trust
