Rico Holmes,/users/5ec0d294242795f2834bf735,SE,2.0,2021-02-09 05:53:11+00:00,1.0,Have ordered plenty in the past from…,"Have ordered plenty in the past from both the UK and US versions. Very happily so.   The Swedish version however, is currently awful on every level. Perhaps it's due to teething conditions being a start-up here in current times, but each time I've ordered recently it's led to massive disappointment.    The third party system is way more expensive and unreliable than it need be.Orders from third party are more often than not from the UK, which means they will either just cancel your order rather than honor the free shipping, or you will get hammered on import duties (often infalated).   Side note: if your order qualifies for free shipping DOUBLE check at checkout, otherwise they'll charge you anyway and call it ""prioritised home delivery"" which is a joke, as it's not in Sweden.   I'm certainly done with ordering from Amazon any more.",2021-02-09 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,9.0,844,142,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered plenty past uk u version happily swedish version however currently awful every level perhaps due teething condition startup current time time ive ordered recently led massive disappointment third party system way expensive unreliable need beorders third party often uk mean either cancel order rather honor free shipping get hammered import duty often infalated side note order qualifies free shipping double check checkout otherwise theyll charge anyway call prioritised home delivery joke sweden im certainly done ordering amazon,0.00782064608223393,0.992179353917766,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.8120178878394214,81.20178878394213,High Trust
