Amelia Tambala,/users/6021c7c0b3ed6200192db847,GB,1.0,2021-02-08 23:23:31+00:00,1.0,Amazon ‘lost’ my AirPods during…,"Amazon ‘lost’ my AirPods during delivery showed up with one of the items I ordered and then after a day was unable to deliver, refused to give me a replacement and gave me a refund that takes a week to go into my account.",2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,221,44,32,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon ‘lost’ airpods delivery showed one item ordered day unable deliver refused give replacement gave refund take week go account,0.014869349817225404,0.9851306501827746,0.024677509814918678,0.2,0.7975008270543711,79.75008270543711,High Trust
Jonah,/users/6021acdffe424b001a6b50e4,CA,1.0,2021-02-08 21:28:04+00:00,1.0,I feel disrespected by Amazon,"My most recent experience with Amazon has been atrocious.  I feel disrespected as I have wasted over two months for a simple order that can not be fulfilled.  It has been a waste of my time, energy and do not feel like a valued customer.  I had ordered an extra large pajama pant from Amazon back in early December.  A couple days after I ordered, I contacted Amazon support as I meant to order a large size, not an extra large.  I spoke to an agent and asked for my order to be changed to a large size.  The agent assured me that they changed my order as it has not shipped yet, so I should be receiving the large pajama pants instead of the extra large.  Upon delivery, in early January, I received the extra large size.  I contacted customer support again to ask if they shipped an extra large and large size by mistake, but the large hadn't arrived yet.  The Amazon agent said the previous agent I spoke to did NOT do anything for my order, so there is no large size pajama pants being shipped to me.  I was upset, but I said okay, can we swap the extra large size I received for a large size.  The agent said no, the only thing I can do is to return it and re-order the large size.  So we processed the refund and I reordered the product in a large size.  Upon attempting to return it, I could not because the Amazon support worker I spoke to processed the wrong order for return.  So, again I had to go back to customer support for them to process the proper item for return.  Today, early February, I received the new package for the large pajama pants, but again, I am disappointed.  Even though I had ordered a large size, I again, received the extra large size pajama pants.  So, I contacted Amazon customer support in hopes to resolve the same problem again.  I let the agent know what had happened earlier, and what they can do moving forward.  The agent said sorry for the inconvenience, then disconnected me.  A new agent came to the chat, said sorry for the inconvenience, then disconnected from the chat as well.  The next agent came into the chat and said sorry for the inconvenience, but I'm going to send you to another member of our team to help you out.  So again, the agent disconnected from the chat and another Amazon agent connected.  The fourth new agent today said sorry for the inconvenience, there's nothing we can do, you can get a refund and buy it again if you want the large size as there's nothing they can do.  So I asked for a refund because clearly Amazon does not want my business, was not professional and wasted my time and effort with this simple order.  After two months of trying to solve the same issue and being let down every time, it's just not worth my time shopping with Amazon. I feel extremely disrespected by Amazon, the interaction I had with them was very unprofessional and I do not feel like a valued customer.  The past two months have been such a waste of my time, I would think twice about shopping with Amazon.",2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,2970,553,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recent experience amazon atrocious feel disrespected wasted two month simple order fulfilled waste time energy feel like valued customer ordered extra large pajama pant amazon back early december couple day ordered contacted amazon support meant order large size extra large spoke agent asked order changed large size agent assured changed order shipped yet receiving large pajama pant instead extra large upon delivery early january received extra large size contacted customer support ask shipped extra large large size mistake large hadnt arrived yet amazon agent said previous agent spoke anything order large size pajama pant shipped upset said okay swap extra large size received large size agent said thing return reorder large size processed refund reordered product large size upon attempting return could amazon support worker spoke processed wrong order return go back customer support process proper item return today early february received new package large pajama pant disappointed even though ordered large size received extra large size pajama pant contacted amazon customer support hope resolve problem let agent know happened earlier moving forward agent said sorry inconvenience disconnected new agent came chat said sorry inconvenience disconnected chat well next agent came chat said sorry inconvenience im going send another member team help agent disconnected chat another amazon agent connected fourth new agent today said sorry inconvenience there nothing get refund buy want large size there nothing asked refund clearly amazon want business professional wasted time effort simple order two month trying solve issue let every time worth time shopping amazon feel extremely disrespected amazon interaction unprofessional feel like valued customer past two month waste time would think twice shopping amazon,0.010452407740103871,0.9895475922598961,0.31015143017386426,0.2,0.8568040821647209,85.68040821647209,High Trust
Maureen Brown,/users/5ee39024f9633b5db37b72a7,GB,7.0,2021-02-08 20:56:11+00:00,5.0,Using Amazon,Using AmazonExcellent service and delivery of all goods on time. So far my expectations re quality and standards have been fulfilled. Well done.,2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,144,23,12,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,using amazonexcellent service delivery good time far expectation quality standard fulfilled well done,0.06228347271143457,0.9377165272885655,0.012899607403252944,1.0,1.9714381851249334,197.14381851249334,High Trust
Gwendolyn Shelton,/users/5b55fe1c4de5666d3423f627,US,4.0,2021-02-08 19:45:44+00:00,1.0,Worse delivery service ever,"Order expected yesterday, on the website map it showed I was next so I went to the door and open it and the next thing I see is a picture of my package at somebody else’s door. I ran outside and saw no one. So I called and after speaking to four different people who lied to me no package and no help. So this morning I called corporate to complain about this customer service and got none from them either.  I was disconnected twice this morning and when I finally got to speak to someone in logistics it appears that the carrier nor the driver has any accountability and according to the company there’s no way to contact the driver about the wrong delivery. This seems odd to me since the driver leaves their warehouse with thousands of dollars of merchandise and a Mercedes-Benz van woth thousands of dollars and they can’t get in touch with the driver?  I don’t believe that!  So their solution was to offer me a refund, which is hilarious because how are you gonna give me something that belongs to me in the first place. That certainly did not solve my problem. I hope one day Walmart or target or someone will give Amazon a run for their money because they are really taking advantage of customers making huge profits but delivering close to zero customer satisfaction. Oh yes and I am a prime customer. I pay for this service!",2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,1335,246,27,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,order expected yesterday website map showed next went door open next thing see picture package somebody else’s door ran outside saw one called speaking four different people lied package help morning called corporate complain customer service got none either disconnected twice morning finally got speak someone logistics appears carrier driver accountability according company there’s way contact driver wrong delivery seems odd since driver leaf warehouse thousand dollar merchandise mercedesbenz van woth thousand dollar can’t get touch driver don’t believe solution offer refund hilarious gonna give something belongs first place certainly solve problem hope one day walmart target someone give amazon run money really taking advantage customer making huge profit delivering close zero customer satisfaction oh yes prime customer pay service,0.17646034046606576,0.8235396595339343,0.13796971396522714,0.2,0.7393637725600125,73.93637725600125,Medium Trust
R Pach (JAFO),/users/5e8759154d2b5680d4beab5b,US,10.0,2021-02-08 17:56:06+00:00,1.0,Do NOT purchase Amazon Prime. It is the worst.,"I have been an Amazon customer for over 20+ years.This past season I decided to join the AMAZON Prime membership.WOW, What a mistake that was. They charge you $ 99 for slowing down your shipments.here are some examples of the ""service"" you get from Prime:They REMOVE other methods of shipping and only show ""Prime Shipping"", which is TERRIBLE.  There are no options for ground shipping, nor are there options for overnight shipping.  So, if you need something fast, do not join prime because that option disappears.Placed an order on a monday, with 2 day amazon Prime, which told me that it would be delivered on friday. (So much for 2 days). So, I make an appointment on saturday to have the items installed.At 9:30pm friday night, I get a message that my 2 days shipment placed 5 days ago was further delayed. So, I now had to go and cancel my appointment, which cost me a $ 50 dollar cancelation fee.  Item showed up saturday @ 9:40pm.  So, 2 day shipping on an order placed on a monday gets delivered @ 9:54pm on saturday night. And for that honor, it cost me $ 99 Prime fee, and another $ 50 fee because Prime did not perform as they promise.Place another order. No option for next day shipping, just ""Prime Shipping"".  Same thing happens. Order place on Monday. Says it will be delivered on wednesday.  Make an appointment to have the item installed.  Same thing happens.. Get a message wednesday night that the package is ""delayed"", and won't be delivered until friday or maybe saturday. (They are not sure).So, I contact what they call Prime customer service, which is basically just a chat room.  They are useless and then try and insult you with a $ 5 dollar ""coupon"" for them not performing.  At this point, I cancelled my Prime membership and will vow never to buy another thing on Amazon that I need quickly. I have no idea why the options for shipping methods was removed from their listings.  I'm not sure that these options were removed because I was a prime member, or if they were just removed across the board.In closing, if you need anything from Amazon that needs to be in a specific place at a specific date, you will be sorely disappointed. I have resorted to other sites that actually have more shipping options, and in some cases cheaper than amazon.If you are considering Amazon Prime, please note that they delay these orders and you will NOT get the orders as promised. I have placed 35 orders with Amazon since november and 20 of them were late, or in some cases, lost entirely.",2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,2507,447,46,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer yearsthis past season decided join amazon prime membershipwow mistake charge slowing shipmentshere example service get primethey remove method shipping show prime shipping terrible option ground shipping option overnight shipping need something fast join prime option disappearsplaced order monday day amazon prime told would delivered friday much day make appointment saturday item installedat pm friday night get message day shipment placed day ago delayed go cancel appointment cost dollar cancelation fee item showed saturday pm day shipping order placed monday get delivered pm saturday night honor cost prime fee another fee prime perform promiseplace another order option next day shipping prime shipping thing happens order place monday say delivered wednesday make appointment item installed thing happens get message wednesday night package delayed wont delivered friday maybe saturday sureso contact call prime customer service basically chat room useless try insult dollar coupon performing point cancelled prime membership vow never buy another thing amazon need quickly idea option shipping method removed listing im sure option removed prime member removed across boardin closing need anything amazon need specific place specific date sorely disappointed resorted site actually shipping option case cheaper amazonif considering amazon prime please note delay order get order promised placed order amazon since november late case lost entirely,0.007534267807861348,0.9924657321921386,0.250701065619742,0.2,0.8463730792200177,84.63730792200177,High Trust
Sheldon Behensky,/users/60214fc660b7ce0019092b7e,US,1.0,2021-02-08 14:52:53+00:00,1.0,Community help is useless,"I’ve been a customer of Amazon for at least 15 years and never had any problems until last August. Amazon’s community help became totally useless.I posted a review of a soap dispenser and received an email saying that it would not be posted due to a violation. I the email was a premade response listing several reasons. Going thru the list none of the reasons applied to the review. I replied asking what I did wrong, what was the violation.After a month with no reply I sent another request then I noticed that a review that I made and was approved was taken down. After 3 emails and a call to customer service I finally received a reply in the form of a premade response.Several more email requests and 4 more reviews being approved and removed. Each time that I was able to get a reply it was the same premade response also saying that they weren’t going do anything.Now after 12 emails and calls all of my reviews were removed and I’m am blocked from posting any more. I guess asking for help or information must have upset someone. Is it normal to punish people for asking for help or an explanation? After 5 months I still have not received an explanation as to what was wrong with the post that violated something. I guess that it’s beyond their capabilities to actually look into a problem and give an answer. I have the impression that all that they are able to do is ignore requests, sent out premade responses when they have to and destroy peoples work if they have the audacity to keep asking for an answer or help.I have been a customer of Amazon for around 15 plus years and this has left a very bitter impression as to how Amazon works now. Too bad they don’t care about their long term customers.",2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,1713,316,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’ve customer amazon least year never problem last august amazon’s community help became totally uselessi posted review soap dispenser received email saying would posted due violation email premade response listing several reason going thru list none reason applied review replied asking wrong violationafter month reply sent another request noticed review made approved taken email call customer service finally received reply form premade responseseveral email request review approved removed time able get reply premade response also saying weren’t going anythingnow email call review removed i’m blocked posting guess asking help information must upset someone normal punish people asking help explanation month still received explanation wrong post violated something guess it’s beyond capability actually look problem give answer impression able ignore request sent premade response destroy people work audacity keep asking answer helpi customer amazon around plus year left bitter impression amazon work bad don’t care long term customer,0.024823572139932578,0.9751764278600674,0.1772293886707796,0.2,0.8230340916641896,82.30340916641896,High Trust
customer,/users/5ebdf5d82427957a644a7038,CA,2.0,2021-02-08 14:20:58+00:00,1.0,Time and time again I keep encountering…,Time and time again I keep encountering Chinese scam sellers setting up shop on Amazon to give themselves credibility. They flood Amazon with photos of the same product each with slightly different descriptions and I get burned every time because I think I’m dealing with Amazon or a vetted reseller. Amazon is nothing more than a cheap e-business provider now for Chinese knockoff scams. The business is in a failure spiral.,2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,425,71,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,time time keep encountering chinese scam seller setting shop amazon give credibility flood amazon photo product slightly different description get burned every time think i’m dealing amazon vetted reseller amazon nothing cheap ebusiness provider chinese knockoff scam business failure spiral,0.03099829587784956,0.9690017041221505,0.039820527201346045,0.2,0.7924649575013445,79.24649575013444,High Trust
Ha,/users/5e11cfbd31bb5adf8295b0f6,GB,11.0,2021-02-08 13:55:14+00:00,1.0,The real experience of Amazon,"From friends, amazon is a great place to shop. From personal experience, I beg to differ. Products not fitting right, products being incorrect, products being delivered to the wrong address and products being automatically processed with '1 click'. I can say only once I have received satisfactory process of an order but the others have just felt like a hassle. I seem to do more returning, changing and calling amazon than actually enjoying the products they offer. Unfortunately, due to the pandemic, its hard to shop in store, I wish online platforms like these were easier and more helpful to use. Quality over quantity please.",2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,632,105,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,friend amazon great place shop personal experience beg differ product fitting right product incorrect product delivered wrong address product automatically processed click say received satisfactory process order others felt like hassle seem returning changing calling amazon actually enjoying product offer unfortunately due pandemic hard shop store wish online platform like easier helpful use quality quantity please,0.01338889535687238,0.9866111046431276,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.8050834547332295,80.50834547332295,High Trust
fatmaxtaffy,/users/4f23195d000064000112d209,GB,8.0,2021-02-08 11:35:30+00:00,1.0,I used to rate Amazon UK as a good…,"I used to rate Amazon UK as a good reliable company but over the last year I has deteriorated to one of the worst on my supply list. The customer services do not really answer complaints and the agent merely goes through a set of scripts generally meaningless. With more detailed complaints these are allegedly passed to a ‘team’ that do precisely a big fat zero, never respond, never phone back, all clandestine, and hide behind in-house confidentiality and data protection, so one does not get any answers. The management system is obstructive and again appear to be there to obstruct, restrict your rights and act as a bunch of box ticking paper clip movers. I have at present just over 50 outstanding complaints with this organisation going back over 18 months and only one resolved. I have cancelled my prime membership, all my subscriptions, and have placed the on my do not use list.They are so obsolete that they cannot even allocate divert companies to your orders, something even the smallest of companies can achieve with no expertise. The company relies on mass imports from the Far East and marketplace companies desperately seeking business. I understand from You Tube videos that they even take advantage of these too.Sorry Amazon not for me anymore till your systems and customer respect return.",2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,1311,221,35,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used rate amazon uk good reliable company last year deteriorated one worst supply list customer service really answer complaint agent merely go set script generally meaningless detailed complaint allegedly passed ‘team’ precisely big fat zero never respond never phone back clandestine hide behind inhouse confidentiality data protection one get answer management system obstructive appear obstruct restrict right act bunch box ticking paper clip mover present outstanding complaint organisation going back month one resolved cancelled prime membership subscription placed use listthey obsolete cannot even allocate divert company order something even smallest company achieve expertise company relies mass import far east marketplace company desperately seeking business understand tube video even take advantage toosorry amazon anymore till system customer respect return,0.025782393896197534,0.9742176061038025,0.12394840157038699,0.2,0.8118984833659786,81.18984833659786,High Trust
