Tonio O'Neill,/users/5e244d216167819c848403e0,GB,6.0,2021-02-08 01:15:11+00:00,1.0,"Money Mad, No Values!!","Used to buy from them all the time but well and truly finished now. Refusing to deliver alcohol etc to N.I. incase down the line they get additional charges. With record breaking sales and profits.. they are virtually tax exempt in the UK with their tricks and sneekiness. No excuse for it, just pure greed.",2021-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,8.0,307,55,22,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used buy time well truly finished refusing deliver alcohol etc ni incase line get additional charge record breaking sale profit virtually tax exempt uk trick sneekiness excuse pure greed,0.01807815040475182,0.9819218495952482,0.030846887268648347,0.2,0.7971303022513538,79.71303022513538,High Trust
