Helen Maerz,/users/60201ec4daea450019546fd9,US,2.0,2021-02-07 17:09:30+00:00,1.0,RUDE - customers don't matter,"Would leave zero stars if possible.  Amazon customer service is awful.  This company has gone downhill, they care nothing about their customers.  In trying to get a refund for an unwanted shipment, the customer service rep insisted there was nothing they could do.  I requested a manager SEVERAL times before being put through to another individual who was extremely rude, telling me again ""nothing they could do""  When I responded that there is somebody who can take care of it, her response ""do you work here?"" ""are you listening to me?""  Once upon a time Amazon was a great company with great customer service - now they are rude and care nothing about customer satisfaction.  I've been a prime member since it started in 2007 - spent thousands with Amazon every year since, no more.  Back to Ebay.",2021-02-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,7.0,801,138,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,would leave zero star possible amazon customer service awful company gone downhill care nothing customer trying get refund unwanted shipment customer service rep insisted nothing could requested manager several time put another individual extremely rude telling nothing could responded somebody take care response work listening upon time amazon great company great customer service rude care nothing customer satisfaction ive prime member since started spent thousand amazon every year since back ebay,0.016586458194119462,0.9834135418058806,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.8071862997868439,80.71862997868439,High Trust
