Christina Browning,/users/601ea8c533804d0019ccc0ad,US,1.0,2021-02-06 14:33:50+00:00,1.0,Amazon.com is not what is used to be,"Amazon.com is not what is used to be. At the start of the pandemic I had someone attempting to hack my Amazon account almost daily. It took months to get any real service or assistance from Amazon.  I finally had to terminate my relationship and cancel my prime account because Amazon didn't seem to be able to properly address the situation and could never escalate me to a manager or a department that could help or explain what was happening.  My account was suspended and finally closed.  Then come the holidays and my family receives close to $250 in Amazon gift cards. I decide to set up a new account with Amazon and rejoin Prime.  I order my son a PS4 since 5's are no where to be found. I order from Amazon direct seller and was told item would deliver between 1/22-2/6, then updates continue to show 2/6 as the anticipated delivery date. Then this week receive update it will deliver by 10pm 2/6. Then wake up this morning 2/6, to find out I have to re-authorize my purchase and that it is currently out of stock and Amazon has no idea when it will be in stock.  Customer Service SUCKS!  Amazon SUCKS!! I have $130 in remaining gc balance that I will use up, then I will do my best to never buy another item from Amazon again.  I will enjoy the Prime benefits of the movie and music streaming services, but will plan to buy all future purchases from local retailers or other online sources.",2021-02-06 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,6.0,1400,258,36,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,amazoncom used start pandemic someone attempting hack amazon account almost daily took month get real service assistance amazon finally terminate relationship cancel prime account amazon didnt seem able properly address situation could never escalate manager department could help explain happening account suspended finally closed come holiday family receives close amazon gift card decide set new account amazon rejoin prime order son p since found order amazon direct seller told item would deliver update continue show anticipated delivery date week receive update deliver pm wake morning find reauthorize purchase currently stock amazon idea stock customer service suck amazon suck remaining gc balance use best never buy another item amazon enjoy prime benefit movie music streaming service plan buy future purchase local retailer online source,0.6577442037875638,0.3422557962124362,0.1446999439147504,0.2,0.5000678868891681,50.006788688916814,Medium Trust
