S L,/users/5e37229ee5a4c73f9a8d4638,GB,6.0,2021-02-05 16:00:13+00:00,1.0,Simply disgusting,"I used to use Amazon for almost everything because I thought they are the best. They are expansive compared to Ali express. The same thing on Ali express is 6 quid and on Amazon it becomes 29.99 how is it possible.Had a delivery from Amazon US packed by Amazon themselves and then it came all opened and ripped apart no customs check was sticked onto the parcel so I’m pretty sure customs didn’t open the parcel. Tracking didn’t even give any useful information. (BTW they use fake tracking as I tried to type the tracking they give on the site to the delivery people. It says tracking not found) It stopped updating for a few days so I don’t even know where the parcel is. Contacted Amazon, they said they cannot do anything about it because the tracking doesn’t update to delivered and asked me to contact the shipping company myself... surely that is their job. The staff were very unhelpful as they keep saying ask the delivery people as we don’t know who it is... and we cannot chase after them ourselves, then quickly ended the chat... Sent them photos of the products and left a review.  Received a message from Amazon apparently my review is fake and misleading as they do not want any negative reviews on the products... worst company ever. I will be shopping with eBay and Ali express from now on. Shame on you!!!",2021-02-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,5.0,1323,239,17,2,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,used use amazon almost everything thought best expansive compared ali express thing ali express quid amazon becomes possiblehad delivery amazon u packed amazon came opened ripped apart custom check sticked onto parcel i’m pretty sure custom didn’t open parcel tracking didn’t even give useful information btw use fake tracking tried type tracking give site delivery people say tracking found stopped updating day don’t even know parcel contacted amazon said cannot anything tracking doesn’t update deliver