Kristin F.,/users/601cc911862682001b87e0a3,US,1.0,2021-02-05 04:27:19+00:00,1.0,Amazon will not help you after their third party seller scams you.,"I’ve bought from Amazon for the last time!!! They would not help me at all after I was scammed by a third party seller, Tek Star. Told me I didn’t qualify for their A to Z guarantee but couldn’t tell me why.  Bought a pc from tek star, a third party seller on their site.  When I received the pc it wasn’t built completely,  connections not made on the inside and couldn’t connect my cords from the outside because the video card was hanging lop sided.  Sent the pc back the same day.  Total cost was 914 and some change.  Tek Star is charging me 776.00 restocking fee and only refunded 138.00.  They are saying I sent back a different item than they sent me.  Amazon is refusing to help me and got nothing but the run around from 3 of their employees during a 3 day span.  Amazon told me I didn’t qualify for their A to Z guarantee and wouldn’t tell me why.  They gave me an email address to send me issue to, LOL and my email came back undeliverable.  Be aware!!!  Scamming third party seller and Amazon will leave you hanging.  I’ve since disputed the charge w my cc  company.",2021-02-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,5.0,1079,204,66,12,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,i’ve bought amazon last time would help scammed third party seller tek star told didn’t qualify z guarantee couldn’t tell bought pc tek star third party seller site received pc wasn’t built completely connection made inside couldn’t connect cord outside video card hanging lop sided sent pc back day total cost change tek star charging restocking fee refunded saying sent back different item sent amazon refusing help got nothing run around employee day span amazon told didn’t qualify z guarantee wouldn’t tell gave email address send issue lol email came back undeliverable aware scamming third party seller amazon leave hanging i’ve since disputed charge w cc company,0.990414318479493,0.0