Steve Fox,/users/60c6ae32a182a3001bd3ef68,US,11.0,2021-02-05 02:36:22+00:00,5.0,My go-to online shopping site and more...,"I've used Amazon as a consumer for years, always found them to have a good range of products and reasonable pricing.  I've also found they will stand behind their products if there's an issue - for example, I just recently completed getting a refund on an order that had been pending delivery for so long the online system no longer had a way to cancel it.  However, chat support took care of it in less than 5 minutes.  I'm happy, and will continue to be a regular customer.",2021-02-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,5.0,475,88,41,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive used amazon consumer year always found good range product reasonable pricing ive also found stand behind product there issue example recently completed getting refund order pending delivery long online system longer way cancel however chat support took care less minute im happy continue regular customer,0.03742851665877934,0.9625714833412207,0.049355019629837356,1.0,1.991156745596578,199.1156745596578,High Trust
Sudheer Ayyappan,/users/601c643bd93cd3001a2607c1,GB,1.0,2021-02-04 21:17:25+00:00,1.0,Amazon is blocking most of the reviews…,"Amazon is blocking most of the reviews and scamming with their selected user reviews. Even though if you are a genuine user they will remove the reviews. Most of the time they are doing this with the sponsored products in UK. I sent multiple mails to them, but no response. Not looks like you cannot trust the product review give for any product and it is also a sponsored program.",2021-02-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,4.0,381,70,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon blocking review scamming selected user review even though genuine user remove review time sponsored product uk sent multiple mail response look like cannot trust product review give product also sponsored program,0.036557629855636514,0.9634423701443635,0.03925967470555244,0.2,0.7895731200132922,78.95731200132921,High Trust
Clay,/users/5ebdd601c66da31f348572fc,US,3.0,2021-02-04 13:01:33+00:00,1.0,I am a Prime member and sick of Amazon censoring reviews,"I am a Prime member.   I am growing increasingly irritated that Amazon Censors your voice when reviewing.  Your review should he your honest opinion about your experience.  Dealing with Amazon, 3rd party vendors and then the delivery company's is all in the same experience.  So dont send me an email asking me about my experience and then censor it when my challenge was with the delivery part of the transaction and not the actual product itself.  A review is a customers opinion and not something amazon needs to censor.  If I discuss a purchase at the office coffee pot or on the phone with a friend I am glad I dont have Amazon censoring my thoughts.  It is up to my friend to decide which part of my conversation about a purchase experience they trust.  I dont need amazons help",2021-02-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,4.0,784,140,56,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime member growing increasingly irritated amazon censor voice reviewing review honest opinion experience dealing amazon rd party vendor delivery company experience dont send email asking experience censor challenge delivery part transaction actual product review customer opinion something amazon need censor discus purchase office coffee pot phone friend glad dont amazon censoring thought friend decide part conversation purchase experience trust dont need amazon help,0.02854703789165775,0.9714529621083422,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.801430350936392,80.1430350936392,High Trust
Jasmine Roper,/users/601be61680d0a300198678cb,GB,3.0,2021-02-04 12:18:34+00:00,1.0,Has Amazon been found out or bitten off more than it can chew?!,"Used to have good experiences with Amazon, but recently it has mainly been awful. Just the last few months I had a double order. I then had the inconvenience to repackage and label and sort with Hermes, to wait for a refund. Meanwhile waiting for a refund on this double order they admitted was their mistake I receive an email to advise I had returned some Halloween lights and will be refunded for them only. At the time I was still using the lights, and hadn't even told Amazon there was a problem with them, so a small refund was given without the large double order amount I had returned, then they were going to take that refund back and still no sort from double order. That was finally sorted with Amazon promising to get contact to me about what was happening about a parcel I didn't return and other issues. They never contacted me. I then had a faulty coffee machine and a faulty baby light. You can't get replacements but have to sort with them and post office returns. They did agree to send Hermes for the coffee maker and I did eventually get a refund, and took the hit on baby light. It does shine one colour and I can put an item on top to try the colours, it just wasn't worth anymore return labels, no local post office that does the online scan etc. I have had a few more issues re an electronic parcel left late at night soaking when the driver said it had been sent and given to me hours earlier, and a pair of tights ordered became a children's book. There doesn't seem to be any quality control or care, it's the hype of the next day delivery and all the products they have. And they seem to have taken advantage of us needing them due to Covid and lack of shops and etc, and lost any good service or product checks or etc. And people's accounts according to reviews are now all over the place re refunds and returns and etc.The customer service online chats are like robots. They don't read what's happened before and you start fresh each time, they sign you out after a minute difficult with a baby. Worst company I have ever dealt with for buying goods re the after sales, they are fine if you order something and it arrives on time and good quality, but that doesn't seem to happen as often anymore. Covid and having young baby and needing certain things made me use it, but I have found other online shops and deliveries, and will make the effort to go out to shops when I can to not use them, it has been that bad. Be careful to check refunds and products when they arrive is best advice I can give.",2021-02-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,4.0,2529,479,63,13,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used good experience amazon recently mainly awful last month double order inconvenience repackage label sort hermes wait refund meanwhile waiting refund double order admitted mistake receive email advise returned halloween light refunded time still using light hadnt even told amazon problem small refund given without large double order amount returned going take refund back still sort double order finally sorted amazon promising get contact happening parcel didnt return issue never contacted faulty coffee machine faulty baby light cant get replacement sort post office return agree send hermes coffee maker eventually get refund took hit baby light shine one colour put item top try colour wasnt worth anymore return label local post office online scan etc issue electronic parcel left late night soaking driver said sent given hour earlier pair tights ordered became childrens book doesnt seem quality control care hype next day delivery product seem taken advantage u needing due covid lack shop etc lost good service product check etc people account according review place refund return etcthe customer service online chat like robot dont read whats happened start fresh time sign minute difficult baby worst company ever dealt buying good sale fine order something arrives time good quality doesnt seem happen often anymore covid young baby needing certain thing made use found online shop delivery make effort go shop use bad careful check refund product arrive best advice give,0.001765118254242161,0.9982348817457578,0.2686483454851374,0.2,0.8528471099699064,85.28471099699064,High Trust
