Mario Cezary Pyzik,/users/6012016f1a3577001a26f226,US,4.0,2021-02-04 00:43:31+00:00,1.0,Very unhappy cutomer,"Dear Sir / Madam,My name is Mario Pyzik and I am a very unhappy customer.Starting from 6th of January you have cancelled my account 4 times. As apparently I was a fraud. I am a Polish citizen who came to USA to buy yacht and furnish it. Some of your people decided that I was spending too much money with Amazon and cancelled my account instead of calling me.Your help line unblocked the account 4 times and your 'specialist' cancelled it 3 times. Unbelievable. They have erased all my pervious orders from my account !!!!! I do not think it is legal.On 5th and 6th of January you have charged me USD144; USD34.91; USD62.99; USDS244.29. I do not know for what as I did not get these goods.I would like you to tell me what did you charge me for ? and get my money back. I spent over 10hrs talking to your representatives only to get promises that someone will get back to me in the next 24-48hrs (some in writing).Can someone tell me what did you you charge meUSD144; USD34.91; USD62.99; USDS244.29. or get me the money back. The last person I talked to was Jeff 806 (I think he was a real person, beforehandLisa, beforehand Rona, beforehand ....... 45min every time with no resolutionMario1hr after I posted this review, Amazon closed my account for the 4th time. They can do as they are pleased if you are not happy with the way they treat you ! They can take your money, not give any explanation etc etc etc",2021-02-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,4.0,1409,261,20,3,1.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,dear sir madammy name mario pyzik unhappy customerstarting th january cancelled account time apparently fraud polish citizen came usa buy yacht furnish people decided spending much money amazon cancelled account instead calling meyour help line unblocked account time specialist cancelled time unbelievable erased pervious order account think legalon th th january charged usd usd usd usds know get goodsi would like tell charge get money back spent hr talking representative get promise someone get back next hr writingcan someone tell charge meusd usd usd usds get money back last person talked jeff think real person beforehandlisa beforehand rona beforehand min every time resolutionmariohr posted review amazon closed account th time pleased happy way treat take money give explanation etc etc etc,0.9926732759876018,0.0073267240123982,0.14638250140213124,0.2,0.3329398622866253,33.29398622866253,Low Trust
