Derek Keyes,/users/6011aa983780e600196ca1b1,IE,5.0,2021-02-03 19:51:17+00:00,1.0,Echo 5 (Alexa. Not worth a ****,I got a present of an Echo 5 (Alexa from Amazon). It gives the option of selecting a default player in settings. So I chose Spotify. The result of that decision is that Echo 5 doesn't work. Alexa won't play anything I ask it to play. I got onto support. Admittedly they were on the case and even rang me back. So that was good. However it became apparent that had I chosen Amazon Music as my default everything would work properly. How do I know this? The agent asked me to make this my preferred option as it had a 30 day free trial and then €3.99 a month thereafter. So I did and Alexa works fine. The agent promised me that they would rectify the problem and I would be able to use Spotify as my option again. They would ring me in a few days and also the 30 day trial would be cancelled BEFORE it ran out. I haven't received any communication from them since January 21st and any text I send through support goes unanswered. This is actually a scam. They know the device won't work unless you BUY Amazon Music. They are so big they could not give a **** about you. They have your money. My advice..... DO NOT BUY ECHO 5 OR ANY DEVICE THAT SUPPORTS ALEXA FROM Amazon. In my opinion they are a despicable company that are far too big and should be broken up. My device is going in the bin where it belongs. I'll change my card too so they won't be able to get anything from my account either.,2021-02-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,3.0,1394,272,31,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,got present echo alexa amazon give option selecting default player setting chose spotify result decision echo doesnt work alexa wont play anything ask play got onto support admittedly case even rang back good however became apparent chosen amazon music default everything would work properly know agent asked make preferred option day free trial € month thereafter alexa work fine agent promised would rectify problem would able use spotify option would ring day also day trial would cancelled ran havent received communication since january st text send support go unanswered actually scam know device wont work unless buy amazon music big could give money advice buy echo device support alexa amazon opinion despicable company far big broken device going bin belongs ill change card wont able get anything account either,0.010795642190537014,0.989204357809463,0.1525518788558609,0.2,0.8251125546759037,82.51125546759037,High Trust
