Raj Raj,/users/5da0341d9b4b8c64ec5a4022,AE,2.0,2021-01-31 17:27:10+00:00,1.0,Extreme bad experience on amazon website,"I live in Dubai. I purchased a peacock clock from amazon website. The seller was NEW TREND STORE CXDH. In last two months, I purchased this clock two times. First time they made refund without my consent. Then they increased price. Again I bought it with higher price. After 3 weeks still I have not received the product. After several reminders their only reply was that we are following up with logistic company.  Then I received an email that they have made refund. After using my payment for several weeks, they made refund without my consent. Even Amazon did not approve my review on their website. I feel like completely cheated. I cant trust amazon any more. I am going to report this issue with consumer protection.",2021-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,31.0,723,127,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,live dubai purchased peacock clock amazon website seller new trend store cxdh last two month purchased clock two time first time made refund without consent increased price bought higher price week still received product several reminder reply following logistic company received email made refund using payment several week made refund without consent even amazon approve review website feel like completely cheated cant trust amazon going report issue consumer protection,0.008578146552594586,0.9914218534474054,0.071228266965788,0.2,0.8099565801168603,80.99565801168603,High Trust
Val Jewell,/users/5e5eeed3c4e31f4a5e96578a,US,2.0,2021-01-31 16:33:35+00:00,1.0,Why a poor rating for Amazon?!,"For the customer who could not believe Amazon's rating on trustpilot... I suspect that much of it has to do with the way Amazon is handling free trial memberships for customers and then charging them past the. Where this membership was canceled... Not only do they make canceling the membership as difficult as possible, apparently they link one membership to your phone number and one to your email... That way if you cancel one membership, another one stays active and the charges go on... What a lovely way to scam people! It has taken me probably 2 hours total to get this mess straightened out and refunds applied to my credit card, and I still don't have the final refund.My experience with Amazon as a product customer has been entirely different...",2021-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,31.0,756,131,30,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,customer could believe amazon rating trustpilot suspect much way amazon handling free trial membership customer charging past membership canceled make canceling membership difficult possible apparently link one membership phone number one email way cancel one membership another one stay active charge go lovely way scam people taken probably hour total get mess straightened refund applied credit card still dont final refundmy experience amazon product customer entirely different,0.07381263338799235,0.9261873666120076,0.07347167694896242,0.2,0.7777880186957963,77.77880186957962,High Trust
Magi,/users/5e3098fdddcefad9d460bb44,GB,2.0,2021-01-31 15:44:26+00:00,5.0,I'm shocked at the terrible rating that…,"I'm shocked at the terrible rating that amazon has on trustpilot!! I came here because I felt i needed to thank this company for the wonderful shopping experience that I have had for the past so many years. You order a thing and they give you an expected delivery date a few days away (I'm not a prime member) but the next morning they send you a link to show your delivery driver is 7 stops away! Such a quick, convenient service. Customer service is absolutely amazing. I cancelled a delivery and for some reason it couldn't be cancelled and the thing was dispatched, amazon calmly tells me to refuse that delivery or if its delivered initiate a free return and I'm refunded. If an item has a tiny bit of fault, i just complaint and they either send you a replacement or a full refund. What else can a shopper ask for?it can't get better than this. Thank you amazon",2021-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,31.0,867,161,40,7,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,im shocked terrible rating amazon trustpilot came felt needed thank company wonderful shopping experience past many year order thing give expected delivery date day away im prime member next morning send link show delivery driver stop away quick convenient service customer service absolutely amazing cancelled delivery reason couldnt cancelled thing dispatched amazon calmly tell refuse delivery delivered initiate free return im refunded item tiny bit fault complaint either send replacement full refund else shopper ask forit cant get better thank amazon,0.7201528564004742,0.2798471435995258,0.09029725182277061,1.0,1.657983022164317,165.7983022164317,High Trust
Julia Lamm,/users/5c3d48c9608f082fc1decfaa,US,2.0,2021-01-31 14:59:15+00:00,5.0,Had some questions about my amazon…,"Had some questions about my amazon order. Used their contact information TO CALL ME NOW. Yes they called right away! I was not expecting to talk to a human but I was wrong. I did not have to wait at all. The Amazon person was very helpful, efficient, and understanding. That was my first time talking to Customer Service at Amazon and I was pleasantly surprised with their level of customer service.",2021-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,31.0,399,72,35,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,question amazon order used contact information call yes called right away expecting talk human wrong wait amazon person helpful efficient understanding first time talking customer service amazon pleasantly surprised level customer service,0.18772309738054857,0.8122769026194514,0.040381379697139654,1.0,1.9142147272491536,191.42147272491536,High Trust
