Cindy Roah Welty,/users/5ef78267e3e25fb27d2213bc,US,4.0,2021-01-30 18:53:09+00:00,1.0,Very Poor Customer Service,"My review is in regards to Customer Service only with  Amazon. For most part, I have loved the ease of returns mostly and never had any delivery issues but when it comes to an unauthorized user hacking your account and sending items to another address for large amounts, it all seems good at first when you call and alert them but as is case right now for me, one of the charges for $350(I do not buy that many items at once and never spend this amount on one transaction) they are claiming is authorized when I reported it as fraud and have cut off access to my account. The agent doesn't seem to bother really reading content in email. I was only able to email them because I had received an emial regarding the fraud at the beginning. It is impossible to call them unless you can get into your account and I have no access. No matter how many emails I send to them, I keep getting repeat emails back as if they never read my email stating this was reported to them as fraud in beginning and they repeatedly send me the order contents and are telling me to give another credit card to use to pay for it. I cannot get anyone to call me, there should be a fraud department working on this but I get nowhere with any of the customer service email people. I have loved the convenience of Amazon, however, I do also shop on ebay, Mercari and Walmart at times and many of the items I buy, I can buy at Costco online as well or the places I just listed so if they do unlock my account, I am very likely to just quit Amazon altogether also due to a lot of political nonsense they are involved in as well, but that isn't a reason I would have quit them before this issue. I have other people tell me they get charged twice for items, some large costly items and they are unable to successfully get anyone at Amazon to help them and I refuse to deal with poor customer service and an uncaring company.",2021-01-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,30.0,1893,365,26,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,review regard customer service amazon part loved ease return mostly never delivery issue come unauthorized user hacking account sending item another address large amount seems good first call alert case right one charge buy many item never spend amount one transaction claiming authorized reported fraud cut access account agent doesnt seem bother really reading content email able email received emial regarding fraud beginning impossible call unless get account access matter many email send keep getting repeat email back never read email stating reported fraud beginning repeatedly send order content telling give another credit card use pay cannot get anyone call fraud department working get nowhere customer service email people loved convenience amazon however also shop ebay mercari walmart time many item buy buy costco online well place listed unlock account likely quit amazon altogether also due lot political nonsense involved well isnt reason would quit issue people tell get charged twice item large costly item unable successfully get anyone amazon help refuse deal poor customer service uncaring company,0.00505642804952647,0.9949435719504736,0.2047111609646663,0.2,0.83841401816817,83.841401816817,High Trust
Darius the Great,/users/600ae1c2227e45001948e58a,GB,7.0,2021-01-30 17:54:50+00:00,1.0,"Support your local High Street, ditch Amazon.","Amazon has swept the globe and is sure to dominate the High Street now that during the pandemic our local stores have been forced to close, been left on the brink of bankruptcy, whereas the world's richest billionaires have become even wealthier than before as they have not been subject to the same rules and regulations as us at the bottom of the pyramid have.This corporation during the pandemic has become greedier and greedier to the extent that they have now turned power mad because of the sheer amount of control they have over the market. They have become controlling, abusive, aggressive, disagreeable, rude, unwilling to listen or to help simply because we have allowed them get to this stage by allowing the sorrowful demise of our local High Street when they needed us most.Now that they have this control they are free to treat us with sheer contempt as they do not have to care about their customer base anymore. Complaints remain unanswered, they can keep returned items without issuing a refund by claiming they had been 'stolen' (when they have not been stolen) on the way and that they are not responsible for the loss (despite having provided the returns label themselves). The customer service staff are also joining in with the ego trip, supporting this corporation in their nastiness, despite being paid a day's wage in India which is the take home equivalent of a tuna and sweetcorn sandwich here in England. They disconnect the chat when they know they have done something wrong or are to blame, they put down the telephone in a similar way, they have removed the email option so you cannot contact them anymore to avoid the awful staff on the app and send you to a corrupt 'specialist' higher in the pecking order who sends you a ridiculous answer in 24 hours that displays no knowledge of the initial question or desire to even deal with the problem.They have also removed printer-less returns options for a lot of orders which is not compatible for those who do not have a printer. This means you simply cannot return your items back!.They are an evil corporation that are finding it easier to abuse their customers and flout the Consumer Rights Act 2015 simply because they know that they now have too much power and they know that they can get away with it because soon enough we will no longer have a high street left and will be reliant on their service. These corporations had not been stopped from making their billions during the pandemic and it is the common folk who have suffered and will continue to suffer under this dictatorship of who can and cannot be allowed to develop their own business, based on biased terms.",2021-01-30 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,30.0,2656,465,45,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon swept globe sure dominate high street pandemic local store forced close left brink bankruptcy whereas world richest billionaire become even wealthier subject rule regulation u bottom pyramid havethis corporation pandemic become greedier greedier extent turned power mad sheer amount control market become controlling abusive aggressive disagreeable rude unwilling listen help simply allowed get stage allowing sorrowful demise local high street needed u mostnow control free treat u sheer contempt care customer base anymore complaint remain unanswered keep returned item without issuing refund claiming stolen stolen way responsible loss despite provided return label customer service staff also joining ego trip supporting corporation nastiness despite paid day wage india take home equivalent tuna sweetcorn sandwich england disconnect chat know done something wrong blame put telephone similar way removed email option cannot contact anymore avoid awful staff app send corrupt specialist higher pecking order sends ridiculous answer hour display knowledge initial question desire even deal problemthey also removed print