Bradburry Innovation Group LLC,/users/6010423a99147600191da16e,US,1.0,2021-01-26 16:25:04+00:00,1.0,"Amazon gets worse, year after year","Started with Amazon in 2012 for my personal use, now I’ve spent thousands on hundreds of items since opening my business in 2019 but frequently ordered at least monthly on something since 2012. So, I’ve had some history with Amazon. These are my issues;First, their censoring of product reviews is absolutely abhorrent, you can leave a 1 star 1 word review but if you have specific information and pictures it somehow doesn’t fit their community standards. Second, what was once the best customer service in the industry has become the same condescending, uncaring culture you find with tv and cell phone providers. Lastly, anyone can sell on Amazon now, they sell knock-off items or items that barely match vague descriptions but not the item pictures. I spend more time reading reviews on products trying not to get burned than i do looking for the stuff I need.Bonus, they allow scalpers to sell on their site, price gouging and hoarding inventory blatantly through Amazon services.",2021-01-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,26.0,985,164,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,started amazon personal use i’ve spent thousand hundred item since opening business frequently ordered least monthly something since i’ve history amazon issuesfirst censoring product review absolutely abhorrent leave star word review specific information picture somehow doesn’t fit community standard second best customer service industry become condescending uncaring culture find tv cell phone provider lastly anyone sell amazon sell knockoff item item barely match vague description item picture spend time reading review product trying get burned looking stuff needbonus allow scalper sell site price gouging hoarding inventory blatantly amazon service,0.02015249052786263,0.9798475094721374,0.09197980931015143,0.2,0.808319716598099,80.8319716598099,High Trust
