Gavin,/users/56b3a30e0000ff000a030a48,GB,21.0,2021-01-26 08:03:25+00:00,3.0,Amazon Prime is away ahead of the game…,"Amazon Prime is away ahead of the game as a media and commodity provider and in the latter very good at sourcing unusual or hard to come by items that you may need from time to time! And their customer service on Prime products is second to none. However, here’s the but - don’t trust Amazon reviews for their associated/affiliated sellers as they are largely hogwash - this view is attested by several leading consumer related bodies. If buying an item via Amazon from one of these guys make sure you double check independent reviews on them. And don’t bother posting critical reviews on these sellers as Amazon will usually block them.",2021-01-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,26.0,637,112,39,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime away ahead game medium commodity provider latter good sourcing unusual hard come item may need time time customer service prime product second none however here’s don’t trust amazon review associatedaffiliated seller largely hogwash view attested several leading consumer related body buying item via amazon one guy make sure double check independent review don’t bother posting critical review seller amazon usually block,0.08378955793059216,0.9162104420694078,0.0628154795288839,0.6,1.3706683169404805,137.06683169404806,High Trust
R J,/users/5f03b8988e78a7f7ab55cead,US,2.0,2021-05-25 23:46:20+00:00,1.0,As a prime member,"Guess it's time to update my review.  Happy to see its not just me. Prime deliveries no longer get delivered in time, haven't for some time now. Delivery dates change often, again my order that was supposed to be here yesterday, said today up to 10pm, and no matter how many times I make the delivery instructions bold, that my work closes at 4pm, it never matters. This order has a birthday gift with it, and it did not show up today, might tomorrow, but most likely will get another email that the order was returned for non-delivery or some crap like that. I'll be cancelling my prime as well. People on here are right, this company made it big on great service, then it all went to hell like most others do, leaving consumers to come to these reviews to vent.  Amazon might catch on if they only had people at the top read the thousands of bad reviews and realize something has to change, but they won't, they're too busy getting huge bonuses and opening up more and more distribution centers.  Frustrating is to say the least, disappointing, totally, but hey, Bezzos made his billions and could care less anymore, same story different company.  I'm only one person, but I spend an average of $300 or more a month with them, so eventually, they will begin to see their sales go down, but no matter, they've made what they needed.  Not unlike Ebay, which I've watch being sucked down the toilet for the past years and I was not surprised with that either. So who's next?  A new supermarket place online? perhaps but for now, it's back to my local stores that still respect customers. Don't waste your money with Amazon, get you butt off the chair or couch and just go to a store.",2021-01-26 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,5.0,25.0,1682,307,17,4,119.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,guess time update review happy see prime delivery longer get delivered time havent time delivery date change often order supposed yesterday said today pm matter many time make delivery instruction bold work close pm never matter order birthday gift show today might tomorrow likely get another email order returned nondelivery crap like ill cancelling prime well people right company made big great service went hell like others leaving consumer come review vent amazon might catch people top read thousand bad review realize something change wont theyre busy getting huge bonus opening distribution center frustrating say least disappointing totally hey bezzos made billion could care less anymore story different company im one person spend average month eventually begin see sale go matter theyve made needed unlike ebay ive watch sucked toilet past year surprised either who next new supermarket place online perhaps back local store still respect customer dont waste money amazon get butt chair couch go store,0.0012335851166332648,0.9987664148833667,0.17218171620863712,0.2,0.8338195506834107,83.38195506834107,High Trust
