suza Q,/users/5ff77b5af96f1c001ae3b3a4,US,3.0,2021-01-25 16:09:27+00:00,1.0,Amazon blocks negative reviews,"Amazon blocks negative reviews from the public. To see which reviews have been blocked from public view, choose ""Accounts & Lists,"" then choose ""(your name) Amazon.com"" on the horizonal menu, and then choose ""Your Profile"" on the horizonal menu. Amazon clearly explains that some of your reviews may have been blocked from public view, and even if you remove any your reviews from your profile, they will not be removed from public view.  If you have a problem with any of your orders, you will not be able to revoke your review.",2021-01-25 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,25.0,529,92,30,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon block negative review public see review blocked public view choose account list choose name amazoncom horizonal menu choose profile horizonal menu amazon clearly explains review may blocked public view even remove review profile removed public view problem order able revoke review,0.034926956398118644,0.9650730436018814,0.051598429613011774,0.2,0.792856207723543,79.2856207723543,High Trust
