Bill Darby,/users/600b481c187dd6001a9b1a35,US,1.0,2021-01-22 21:48:18+00:00,1.0,Delivery does not occur when scheduled,"For over a week my “Subscribe and Save” order was scheduled to be delivered on January 25, 2021.  I planned my January 24 return from a trip for that reason.After I left, the delivery date changed to Thursday, January 21.  I arranged for someone to be at my house to receive the order on January 21.When was the order delivered?  About 6:15 p.m. on Wednesday, January 20.  Unfortunately, I have videos of the delivery and of the package being stolen from my front porch about 12:40 a.m. on January 21.No problem would have occurred if Amazon had simply done what they said they’d do.  Hope Amazon is  proud of its great service.",2021-01-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,22.0,628,112,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,week “subscribe save” order scheduled delivered january planned january return trip reasonafter left delivery date changed thursday january arranged someone house receive order january order delivered pm wednesday january unfortunately video delivery package stolen front porch january problem would occurred amazon simply done said they’d hope amazon proud great service,0.02480957573960679,0.9751904242603933,0.0628154795288839,0.2,0.8001583080359733,80.01583080359734,High Trust
Dawn Harris,/users/54a451d20000640001a14df2,US,8.0,2021-01-23 00:29:35+00:00,1.0,Nothing Has Changed ~ LOST ORDER AGAIN!,"While I canceled my membership awhile ago, I needed 5 items that I either couldn't order anywhere else or the prices were way higher than Amazon.  Of those 5 orders in the last 2 months, 3 were lost, including the latest one today, 1 was delivered late, and 1 was delivered on time.  Today's order at first stated it would be delivered by 9PM; chatting with customer service, they also said it would be delivered today.  As of 7:20 p.m. it's listed as late with no EDD and a note that if it's not delivered in another 2 days then I can get a refund.  HOW ABOUT GIVING RELIABLE SERVICE!  I'm done with Amazon, either I'll pay the exorbitant price somewhere else or I'll do without.  I AM DONE FOR GOOD WITH AMAZON!!!",2021-01-22 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,23.0,715,133,39,7,1.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,canceled membership awhile ago needed item either couldnt order anywhere else price way higher amazon order last month lost including latest one today delivered late delivered time today order first stated would delivered pm chatting customer service also said would delivered today pm listed late edd note delivered another day get refund giving reliable service im done amazon either ill pay exorbitant price somewhere else ill without done good amazon,0.946108987855207,0.05389101214479297,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.3418641824605064,34.18641824605064,Low Trust
