Gemma Gracie,/users/5ee11093db8298b2886fa34a,GB,5.0,2021-01-20 23:02:41+00:00,5.0,I never used Amazon as a company that I…,"I never used Amazon as a company that I would buy from until mid last year. I thought their cost on goods were always slightly higher than maybe buying directly from other companies. However, I can say that I’m now a regular buyer from Amazon after my experience on the run up to Christmas, in a way panic buying in-case anything was delayed due to COVID, I was always guaranteed that I would have my orders delivered on time which was reassuring and peace of mind. I have never had any issues with any of my deliveries and they have always fully committed to the delivery times given regardless of what is going on in the world at the moment. Completely flipped my opinion on buying from Amazon, I’m now converted to being a regular buyer. Great service and experience overall. Thanks Amazon!",2021-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,20.0,793,143,40,9,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,never used amazon company would buy mid last year thought cost good always slightly higher maybe buying directly company however say i’m regular buyer amazon experience run christmas way panic buying incase anything delayed due covid always guaranteed would order delivered time reassuring peace mind never issue delivery always fully committed delivery time given regardless going world moment completely flipped opinion buying amazon i’m converted regular buyer great service experience overall thanks amazon,0.10633465126695435,0.8936653487330457,0.08020190689848569,1.0,1.96287305574622,196.287305574622,High Trust
Magnus Kortell,/users/6008af2c6d10d9001a61644c,SE,2.0,2021-01-20 22:35:20+00:00,1.0,They might be cheap and you really get what you (don't) pay for!,"Amazon came to Sweden a couple month ago and I have made five different orders so far. The Swedish translations are really, really bad so I need to check up the description in English to be sure what to order. Only one of the purchases have worked out without problems. This only one was even fast in delivery! The other ones have been disasters. For the first one it took them four weeks to let me know the parcel got damaged (in the warehouse in UK). I needed to ask them for the parcel, not they contacting me, and then make a new order. When this new order finally came home the socket was UK, not Swedish. They gave me $5 giftcard to by adapters. They have still not arrived even though I made the order 7 weeks ago from two different sellers (it had been faster with Ali or Ebay). I had to pay additional custom-fees (even though this have to be included). I got the money back for the custom-fees as gift cards (even though I don't want to buy anything more ever on Amazon). One purchase was stopped because of card-issues even though it worked fine from another online-shop. The telephone support don't speak Swedish even though they should out of the info beside the number. The support was quite poor and arrogant. The chat-support not so much better when they keep up too many simultaneous chats at the same time. For me it is totally incomprehensible that Amazon have manage to become the biggest e-store-company in the world.",2021-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,20.0,1438,262,64,13,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon came sweden couple month ago made five different order far swedish translation really really bad need check description english sure order one purchase worked without problem one even fast delivery one disaster first one took four week let know parcel got damaged warehouse uk needed ask parcel contacting make new order new order finally came home socket uk swedish gave giftcard adapter still arrived even though made order week ago two different seller faster ali ebay pay additional customfees even though included got money back customfees gift card even though dont want buy anything ever amazon one purchase stopped cardissues even though worked fine another onlineshop telephone support dont speak swedish even though info beside number support quite poor arrogant chatsupport much better keep many simultaneous chat time totally incomprehensible amazon manage become biggest estorecompany world,0.01349052757585558,0.9865094724241444,0.14694335389792484,0.2,0.8226434069916572,82.26434069916571,High Trust
