Cass Rigo,/users/5e697ef64c154f0e182acb18,CA,5.0,2021-01-20 01:17:56+00:00,1.0,Disappointed and Angry Quarantined Student,"I placed an order for a laptop (found myself without one) on my account a week prior to my semester beginning and got Amazon Prime to ensure it would arrive rapidly. Pandemic and all, I knew 1-day delivery would be unlikely. I gave it the week within reason. However, within the next 5 minutes my order was cancelled and my account closed. Upon calling customer service, I am told that the investigative team will be in contact with me within 24hours as my credit card is apparently ""suspicious"". No one contacts me. I attempted to create 2 more accounts and reached out to customer service once more. Again, both orders cancelled, both accounts closed, and no one has answers for me. At this point I am contacting a friend and we place the order through her account. We wait 3 days. She calls on my behalf and we are told the investigation team could take up to an additional week before clearing the card for the order, and that they would be calling to validate my credit card. Today, the order was cancelled without notice, confirmation, or any contact whatsoever. I am now two days into my semester, still don't have a laptop and have ordered through Best Buy for the reliability despite the far longer wait. Within 10 minutes the order was confirmed and my card was validated. Amazon has made 0 effort to contact me or confirm that I am not ""fraud""-ing myself. I am so disappointed, feel deceived by their supposed reliability, and find myself unnecessarily stressed at the start of my semester. I deeply regret putting so much faith into their reputation.",2021-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,20.0,1562,276,42,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order laptop found without one account week prior semester beginning got amazon prime ensure would arrive rapidly pandemic knew day delivery would unlikely gave week within reason however within next minute order cancelled account closed upon calling customer service told investigative team contact within hour credit card apparently suspicious one contact attempted create account reached customer service order cancelled account closed one answer point contacting friend place order account wait day call behalf told investigation team could take additional week clearing card order would calling validate credit card today order cancelled without notice confirmation contact whatsoever two day semester still dont laptop ordered best buy reliability despite far longer wait within minute order confirmed card validated amazon made effort contact confirm frauding disappointed feel deceived supposed reliability find unnecessarily stressed start semester deeply regret putting much faith reputation,0.005750230209828652,0.9942497697901713,0.15479528883903534,0.2,0.8280839426628926,82.80839426628927,High Trust
