Sal,/users/6002023fe4f2d70019135429,GB,4.0,2021-01-15 21:20:46+00:00,1.0,Amazon don't need customer satisfaction,"Terrible customer service, via web chat.  No reply to complaints emails.Childs swing was bought from a marketplace seller. It became defective and unsafe to use. Swing broke after 7 months of normal use during British summer. Amazon claimed it was outside the 6 month statutory returns period and suggested contacting the seller.  No reply from seller. Went back and forth to Amazon 3 times, who claim its not their problem. Tried to explain swing is unsafe and unusable and under consumer act, 'not fit for purpose and not met expected safety standard for child's toy', so refund or replace should be given.No help whatsoever,  no reply to emails, rude and obstructive faceless web chat operators. I've held an Amazon account for over 20 years and spent thousands of pounds on their platform. Seems Amazon make enough profits that they don't need  customer satisfaction.",2021-01-15 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,15.0,871,143,39,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,terrible customer service via web chat reply complaint emailschilds swing bought marketplace seller became defective unsafe use swing broke month normal use british summer amazon claimed outside month statutory return period suggested contacting seller reply seller went back forth amazon time claim problem tried explain swing unsafe unusable consumer act fit purpose met expected safety standard child toy refund replace givenno help whatsoever reply email rude obstructive faceless web chat operator ive held amazon account year spent thousand pound platform seems amazon make enough profit dont need customer satisfaction,0.015260738918242967,0.984739261081757,0.08020190689848569,0.2,0.8084100119205756,80.84100119205756,High Trust
