Gareth,/users/588a47640000ff000a70c246,GB,10.0,2021-01-10 22:31:12+00:00,1.0,Amazon not so Prime service,"Yet again Amazon fail to deliver as per promised.  I don’t know why I bother paying a monthly subscription for their so called ‘Prime’ service as they don’t seem to be able to offer it anymore.  Ordered some wireless headphones for my wife, chose the ones I did as they would be delivered next day ( Monday, clearly stated when I ordered them ‘ buy within the next 1 hour 42 minutes for delivery tomorrow’, place my order and guess what, within an hour of buying the delivery changes to Tuesday from Monday.  My advice, don’t bother with the Prime subscription as they won’t honour it, they just take your money and run.",2021-01-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,10.0,620,113,27,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,yet amazon fail deliver per promised don’t know bother paying monthly subscription called ‘prime’ service don’t seem able offer anymore ordered wireless headphone wife chose one would delivered next day monday clearly stated ordered ‘ buy within next hour minute delivery tomorrow’ place order guess within hour buying delivery change tuesday monday advice don’t bother prime subscription won’t honour take money run,0.013280130828947133,0.9867198691710529,0.0633763320246775,0.2,0.806035200990462,80.6035200990462,High Trust
