MissKBR,/users/5ffb73d3bb1031001a492fde,US,1.0,2021-01-10 21:46:12+00:00,1.0,Amazon discriminates against conservative/independent voices,"Sadly, Amazon has decided to be in the business of using its platform and powers to monitor and control free speech, and which type of apps people have access to based on political leanings. I am a registered independent and the user of the application Parler which is powered by Amazon Web services. Amazon is picking winners and losers based on their politics, which Amazon is far left liberal. Because the people who run Amazon support far left liberal politics, they have decided they can use their powers to shut down and shut up conservatives. I am not conservative but I am an American patriot, and I will stand up for the liberty of the American people even if they have a different opinion to mine. Amazon shows a huge lack of concern for tens of millions of people who simply use their website to shop, and who use or desire to use applications that are powered by Amazon web servers, for example the app called Parler.  For this reason I will no longer be using amazon.com for anything, ever again, unless they change their mind about behaving with sure discrimination. I think we the people need to show big tech that they should not usurp their power to control what we hear and what we say. They are treating companies, and people using those company products, differently based on political leanings. This is no different than the archaic discriminatory thinking of the democrat party from 1776 through 1950 treating people with black skin differently than people with white skin. Yes you heard me right. The Democrat party IS the party of  segregation, racism, the Ku Klux Klan, and the south that fought to preserve slavery. Yet this is the party Amazon has decided to support full heartedly by shutting down the servers to any applications that have conservative voices. That is an act of discrimination by Amazon, for the soul purpose of controlling what people hear, in an attempt to control what people think. They are a shopping website to me. That’s it. How dare they put themselves in the business of restricting my liberties, my freedoms or any political aspect on any of our lives. I don’t care what party you are (I’m a registered Independent), the American people should not allow big tech oligarchs to control any aspect of our lives. One way to stop them is to shut down your Amazon account and never use Amazon again for anything. Another way to stop them is to contact your congressman and Senators and let them know they need to draft legislation that prohibits any company from discrimination based on political and policy beliefs. It’s sad because Amazon started with a good business plan, but it appears they’re ending with some sort of idea that they should have the power to pick and choose winners and losers based on their own personal political beliefs and leanings. Please join me, and my extended family and friends in taking their power away.",2021-01-10 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,10.0,2886,502,60,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sadly amazon decided business using platform power monitor control free speech type apps people access based political leaning registered independent user application parler powered amazon web service amazon picking winner loser based politics amazon far left liberal people run amazon support far left liberal politics decided use power shut shut conservative conservative american patriot stand liberty american people even different opinion mine amazon show huge lack concern ten million people simply use website shop use desire use application powered amazon web server example app called parler reason longer using amazoncom anything ever unless change mind behaving sure discrimination think people need show big tech usurp power control hear say treating company people using company product differently based political leaning different archaic discriminatory thinking democrat party treating people black skin differently people white skin yes heard right democrat party party segregation racism ku klux klan south fought preserve slavery yet party amazon decided support full heartedly shutting server application conservative voice act discrimination amazon soul purpose controlling people hear attempt control people think shopping website that’s dare put business restricting liberty freedom political aspect life don’t care party i’m registered independent american people allow big tech oligarch control aspect life one way stop shut amazon account never use amazon anything another way stop contact congressman senator let know need draft legislation prohibits company discrimination based political policy belief it’s sad amazon started good business plan appears they’re ending sort idea power pick choose winner loser based personal political belief leaning please join extended family friend taking power away,0.01101765733500893,0.9889823426649911,0.28154795288839035,0.2,0.8508007619101736,85.08007619101735,High Trust
