katrina heles,/users/5ff8e12e928b2a00194c358d,US,1.0,2021-01-08 22:48:20+00:00,1.0,Amazon scams people!!,"Amazon scams people!!! I don’t order things from amazon often, but sometimes they do have some cool stuff. I ordered one thing. When I checked out there was option for a one time FREE prime delivery. I was then automatically charged for delivery as a separate transaction! It wasn’t a big charge so I decided to let it go, but now my package is two days late and I received an email that I will be charged monthly for a amazon prime account. You know the one I never wanted. I called the customer service and line and after talking to a stupid machine for 30 minutes I was transferred to a real person just to answer the same questions again! She said the package was delayed and won’t be here for 5 MORE DAYS!! No refund for the shipping. The free prime shipping trail is a scam. It is not free, and it is not any faster than the regular free shipping! My package was important and time sensitive and I would have paid for the faster shipping if I had known this would have been a huge issue! When I told the customer service rep that she immediately tried to refund me. I told her that I still wanted my item, but I wanted to cancel any further payments! VERY annoyed with the service of amazon in every aspect. I will not be order ever again unless this issue is resolved to satisfaction! It is not just OK for packages to be a week late and then receive no explanation!",2021-01-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,8.0,1373,262,21,3,0.0,0,12,2,1,Suspicious,amazon scam people don’t order thing amazon often sometimes cool stuff ordered one thing checked option one time free prime delivery automatically charged delivery separate transaction wasn’t big charge decided let go package two day late received email charged monthly amazon prime account know one never wanted called customer service line talking stupid machine minute transferred real person answer question said package delayed won’t day refund shipping free prime shipping trail scam free faster regular free shipping package important time sensitive would paid faster shipping known would huge issue told customer service rep immediately tried refund told still wanted item wanted cancel payment annoyed service amazon every aspect order ever unless issue resolved satisfaction ok package week late receive explanation,0.9999994164700604,5.835299395906546e-07,0.14694335389792484,0.2,0.32938896254455474,32.93889625445547,Low Trust
