Susan,/users/5bf15556e4d4e63820615e75,US,5.0,2021-01-08 00:15:01+00:00,1.0,Amazon lost another customer,"I have been an Amazon customer for over 10 years (many of those Prime). Shortly after Christmas my account was hacked. Amazon reset my password and I got locked out again supposedly because I used my new Fire. I have costly security, change my password regularly and don't leave credit cards on Amazon. I did have gift card balances.The rep and I discussed closing the account and reopening one new but it would obliterate all past orders including Kindle books (thousands)so that was not a good option. I was told he would discuss it with supervisors and someone would get back to me. Next day I got an email stating it was PERMANENTLY closed. Sorry, no ability to check scheduled orders, see book lists or even chat with customer service. Instead, I get to sit on perpetual hold. I've already ordered some of my items from Walmart. Sooooo disappointed.",2021-01-08 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,8.0,854,149,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer year many prime shortly christmas account hacked amazon reset password got locked supposedly used new fire costly security change password regularly dont leave credit card amazon gift card balancesthe rep discussed closing account reopening one new would obliterate past order including kindle book thousandsso good option told would discus supervisor someone would get back next day got email stating permanently closed sorry ability check scheduled order see book list even chat customer service instead get sit perpetual hold ive already ordered item walmart sooooo disappointed,0.004315080019846756,0.9956849199801533,0.08356702187324734,0.2,0.8145558643647262,81.45558643647261,High Trust
Ghoulette,/users/5ff7498c78a85200194d885a,US,1.0,2021-01-07 18:00:54+00:00,2.0,"Buy elsewhere! Runaround, terrible service","I’ve been a prime member for 3 years. Last few months have been terrible. From having packages delivered to another address, having the delivery driver pull up in front of my residence, in the middle of a 2 way street, other vehicles were driving around it on the sidewalk. Driver sits only in the drivers seat, looks in the passenger seat, doesn’t get out of the vehicle to look in the back for my package, then drives off and puts my delivery status as to be delivered in 2 days. Then there’s mailing back a return and having to contact them to get the refund issued. I tried to place an order for a recliner. Had 3x the amount of the recliner in the bank. They “attempt” to charge my card and email me stating “payment declined.” I called my bank. Bank states they show no attempts for charges from amazon to my card and bank account. Rep also explained companies will do this if they don’t want to sell to the consumer. I closed my account with amazon. Take your buisness elsewhere! Less hassle, better service and probably products as well.",2021-01-07 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,7.0,1045,192,42,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,i’ve prime member year last month terrible package delivered another address delivery driver pull front residence middle way street vehicle driving around sidewalk driver sits driver seat look passenger seat doesn’t get vehicle look back package drive put delivery status delivered day there’s mailing back return contact get refund issued tried place order recliner x amount recliner bank “attempt” charge card email stating “payment declined” called bank bank state show attempt charge amazon card bank account rep also explained company don’t want sell consumer closed account amazon take buisness elsewhere less hassle better service probably product well,0.06426900361905333,0.9357309963809467,0.1076836791923724,0.4,1.0894022340289478,108.94022340