Silent.Oath87,/users/5c2f597e59b38d2156f40667,US,3.0,2021-01-05 11:24:48+00:00,1.0,The US Amazon Customer Service is the…,"The US Amazon Customer Service is the Worst! Also, they need to change their method of charging cards! They shouldn't keep re-authorizing your card every time a fulfillment center doesn't have your item in stock! I got like 4 charges for the same item onto my debit card! Each time, it was cancelled and it takes over 7-10 days for a refund to process!? That is absolutely ludicrous.In this case, they should only charge my card once everything is ready to be shipped. (That's what they do for Amazon JP.) The customer service in the US doesn't even answer my question correctly via chat, that I have to physically call Customer Service. Even then, they keep telling me stupid things, and I even have to request to speak to someone higher up. I just don't want to have to have my card re-authorized again. If they don't have it in stock, just remove it from the website!",2021-01-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,5.0,870,157,38,7,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,u amazon customer service worst also need change method charging card shouldnt keep reauthorizing card every time fulfillment center doesnt item stock got like charge item onto debit card time cancelled take day refund process absolutely ludicrousin case charge card everything ready shipped thats amazon jp customer service u doesnt even answer question correctly via chat physically call customer service even keep telling stupid thing even request speak someone higher dont want card reauthorized dont stock remove website,0.993947282282213,0.006052717717787037,0.08805384183959619,0.2,0.32063712722681276,32.063712722681274,Low Trust
vinzent1992,/users/5f21a652b015fd25d6a1a255,DK,7.0,2021-01-05 10:03:01+00:00,1.0,This is the first and the last time…,"This is the first and the last time I purchase anything from Amazon, I only used amazon because I absolutely had to immediately acquire a book. The fact that you have to register your credit card and then only afterwards you can remove it (although I'm 100% certain that they still save it in their own database although they pretend that it is removed) and the fact that you just have to but and be happy or pi$$ off (ie. no support or contact options at all) really pi$$es me off. So here you go Amazon, take my fogging money and give me that book, it will be that last money you ever get out of me I promise you that!.",2021-01-05 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,5.0,621,121,36,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,first last time purchase anything amazon used amazon absolutely immediately acquire book fact register credit card afterwards remove although im certain still save database although pretend removed fact happy pi ie support contact option really pie go amazon take fogging money give book last money ever get promise,0.04361199399140482,0.9563880060085952,0.06786315199102635,0.2,0.7917666334025028,79.17666334025027,High Trust
