stephen kan,/users/564708690000ff0001eaaf56,GB,48.0,2021-01-04 19:01:37+00:00,1.0,amazon said use there platinum credit…,amazon said use there platinum credit card and we will give you extra points ? everytime you buy with the card on amazon ? but if you use the card any were else we will charge you ?   i never bought anything off this card except for amazon i had some big buys ? but also had a few refunds amazon and the buyers said  all refunds had been paid and amazon had also gave the ok of refunds been paid  all except NEW DAY the credit card company the platinum card came from i was being charged for the goods i never had saying they had still not got the refunds back ? i could not speak to anyone and its automated were a robot talks to you ?  i cancelled the card because i was charge for using the card out side amazon which was a lie and i had to pay the card off and because i was late switching cards over my prime was paid by that card ? i waited to pay that off in the hope i would get a billed and find out for the missing refunds ? but instead i got a few reminders if i do not pay this off now i will be charged interest but i said were are my invoices that were due but never received ? i called them today after several attempts with the automated robot saying all the information was incorrect ? when i did get through i was promised a bill threw the post so this conversation has been recorded so lets see what happens ? do not touch this company if you dont mind refunds getting lost no body to talk to except a robot ? im ill and this should not be happening '   it said if i only use it,2021-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,4.0,1497,309,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon said use platinum credit card give extra point everytime buy card amazon use card else charge never bought anything card except amazon big buy also refund amazon buyer said refund paid amazon also gave ok refund paid except new day credit card company platinum card came charged good never saying st