Kaity Bair,/users/5f91cf32e20bf100190450f2,US,3.0,2021-01-04 06:26:37+00:00,3.0,Amazon reviews seem sketchy..,"MOST of the time Amazon is great, gets packages to me quickly with prime and has decent products. But lately I’ve been noticing something is off with the reviews! I was looking at reviews for a product and noticed there are reviews for a completely different product, which could give the impression that this item has 5 stars but really it’s from ratings from another product. Don’t know if this is a mistake or scheming but it makes me trust Amazon a lot less..",2021-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,4.0,463,84,29,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,time amazon great get package quickly prime decent product lately i’ve noticing something review looking review product noticed review completely different product could give impression item star really it’s rating another product don’t know mistake scheming make trust amazon lot less,0.1211458164074132,0.8788541835925868,0.04711160964666293,0.6,1.348849413725626,134.8849413725626,High Trust
María Dolores Bolívar,/users/59fe3e4a0000ff000ade17ec,US,2.0,2021-01-04 05:13:25+00:00,1.0,I give Amazon Prime a zero!,"Customer Service reflects the zero interest Amazon has on customers. They kept trying to prove that what I was saying was not true. They kept me on hold for hours. They concluded they could not help me and when I refuse to accept their arrogant answers, they hung up on me. This is what happened, On Saturday, Jan 2nd, they allowed Amazon France to access all of the cards I have stored with Amazon due to having a Prime Membership in the US. Amazon France was trying to charge me for a year membership, 60 dollars, a transaction I had not authorized and was not aware of. So I received a call from various banks notifying me that they had cancelled my cards. End result, it is Jan 3d and I will not have access to my cards and funds unless I go in person to the banks. Banks do not encourage me to request for them to send me the new cards, since the Pandemic has slowed all transactions of that sort. So in order to access my funds I must go to the banks. Amazon cancelled a purchase I had made prior to their membership scam, coming from France. They made ME call France, on my dime, and to negotiate the reimbursement on my own. They took absolutely no responsibility on their doings on account that they do not have access to what Amazon Prime France does. However, my card information is stored in the US, since I live in California and have nothing to do with France. The bank had the right word for all of this non sense... FRAUD. They are handling this at the FRAUD Department. Yet Amazon Prime does nothing other than give me the run around. Beware of having your information stored with Amazon. and also beware of contacting them. They do not have ""customer service"". The many agents and managers *leaders* who came to the phone ""to assist"" me were reading lines and repeating things that were totally irrelevant to my issue. It seemed to me they could hardly understand me and they did not care about what I said, some even spoke over me requesting me to remain calm and understand that they could not help me. If they are so eager to push their memberships by defrauding customers, should we trust them with confidential information? In my view they showed no ethics on this matter and the leaders and the agents need to be better trained ¨to respond¨, and not merely to read  or repeat lines they have memorized. There is an uneasy feeling when the customer service agent does not really speak the language of Amazon. They need to leave you on hold while ""they check their resources"" a line they use to probably check a manual that issues them a ready made response. Their behavior is awkward, not natural... it feels as if they are machines and not humans attempting to convey messages that are of the sort one could say ""one size fits all"". It is not that they don't speak English, since they do, but they are missing on any sort of local literacy. They sound as if they come from a different planet, and not just a different country. Highly suspicious practices! As for my star, I wish there was the possibility to give the company a minus star, and even several minus stars. How else would you rate another customer service department who took hours and even days to tend to an issue!!!!!?????!!!!!!",2021-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,4.0,3217,589,27,6,0.0,0,12,2,1,Suspicious,customer service reflects zero interest amazon customer kept trying prove saying true kept hold hour concluded could help refuse accept arrogant answer hung happened saturday jan nd allowed amazon france access card stored amazon due prime membership u amazon france trying charge year membership dollar transaction authorized aware received call various bank notifying cancelled card end result jan access card fund unless go person bank bank encourage request send new card since pandemic slowed transaction sort order access fund must go bank amazon cancelled purchase made prior membership scam coming france made call france dime negotiate reimbursement took absolutely responsibility doings account access amazon prime france however card information stored u since live california nothing france bank right word non sense fraud handling fraud department yet amazon prime nothing give run around beware information stored amazon also beware contacting customer service many agent manager leader came phone assist reading line repeating thing totally irrelevant issue seemed could hardly understand care said even spoke requesting remain calm understand could help eager push membership defrauding customer trust confidential information view showed ethic matter leader agent need better trained ¨to respond¨ merely read repeat line memorized uneasy feeling customer service agent really speak language amazon need leave hold check resource line use probably check manual issue ready made response behavior awkward natural feel machine human attempting convey message sort one could say one size fit dont speak english since missing sort local literacy sound come different planet different country highly suspicious practice star wish possibility give company minus star even several minus star else would rate another customer service department took hour even day tend issue,0.999998751022671,1.2489773290047523e-06,0.3303421200224341,0.2,0.3660690484931513,36.60690484931513,Low Trust
Liz G,/users/5ff284dee17491001abd2f8c,US,3.0,2021-02-26 01:18:03+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime’s customer service could…,"Amazon Prime’s customer service could hardly be worse. The reps, who do not have an adequate command of English to comprehend the issue, arrogantly told me I “shouldn’t be so upset” that I’ve been charged twice for several months, because they have failed to cancel an old email attached to my account, even I had their emails stating they had cancelled the erroneous account. My review stating this (almost verbatim) was rejected by Amazon (because it’s unflattering?), so I am posting here.",2021-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,2.0,26.0,492,82,38,5,53.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,amazon prime’s customer service could hardly worse rep adequate command english comprehend issue arrogantly told “shouldn’t upset” i’ve charged twice several month failed cancel old email attached account even email stating cancelled erroneous account review stating almost verbatim rejected amazon it’s unflattering posting,0.014442802684778376,0.9855571973152216,0.045989904655075714,0.2,0.8019765795886259,80.19765795886259,High Trust
