Jamie Thomson,/users/5d9dce89cd84b3e03448583f,GB,19.0,2021-01-03 22:58:36+00:00,4.0,Not perfect but so much better than most,"Let's get to the point, Amazon have some issues. Firstly there is a lot of low quality third party sellers on the site. It's getting very difficult to find quality and avoid the trash. So much so that it's not a place to make a lot of big purchases when you can go to more selective companies that don't just rack and stack.Second, their delivery guys will do anything to record a completed delivery. Leaving boxes over the fence, in the rain and when it's a fragile item. Not a good idea. The bad is easily outweighed by the good though. Returns are a breeze, delivery is nearly always on time, even around the holiday season.  On the few occasions I have had to contact a real person they have been quick to respond and very good at solving the problem. I think Amazon have shown that they super successful by being slightly better than the competition, most who set a very low bar. So a long way from perfect but still an easy recommend",2021-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,3.0,939,175,40,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,let get point amazon issue firstly lot low quality third party seller site getting difficult find quality avoid trash much place make lot big purchase go selective company dont rack stacksecond delivery guy anything record completed delivery leaving box fence rain fragile item good idea bad easily outweighed good though return breeze delivery nearly always time even around holiday season occasion contact real person quick respond good solving problem think amazon shown super successful slightly better competition set low bar long way perfect still easy recommend,0.021694791874099742,0.9783052081259003,0.0981491867638811,0.8,1.7087824414157262,170.87824414157262,High Trust
Sam,/users/597ac8680000ff000ab496ed,DE,14.0,2021-01-03 20:46:04+00:00,1.0,Zero customer resolution management support,"I recently brought an item with Amazon, the item arrived  late as the item shown to have been delivered but I didnt not received it. Once the item arrived I wanted to return the item, Amazon did not allow me to return or received a refund for the item because I opened the parcel I received to inspect the item I received. They told me I could not return or geta. refund for the item because of hygene issue, I believe it is allowed to inspect an item that you receiving from a seller through the internet, No matter how much complaint I made no one in the management of Amazon care to resolved the issue despite the issue was unfair to me, base on EU ruling, trader need to inform the customer clearly of their policy, there were no notice or information regarding the rejection of return or no refund of my item, they said I did something wrong when I dont know what I did wrong. I stopped buying on Amazon. If there is no company liability for the customer why should I risk it? Amazon doesnt seems to have any managment complaint handling and as a customer you cannot buy items online and lose your money because you inspected the item, it is complete nonsense. Unfortunately there is no management at Amazon that care to look behind the issue.",2021-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,3.0,1248,232,43,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently brought item amazon item arrived late item shown delivered didnt received item arrived wanted return item amazon allow return received refund item opened parcel received inspect item received told could return geta refund item hygene issue believe allowed inspect item receiving seller internet matter much complaint made one management amazon care resolved issue despite issue unfair base eu ruling trader need inform customer clearly policy notice information regarding rejection return refund item said something wrong dont know wrong stopped buying amazon company liability customer risk amazon doesnt seems managment complaint handling customer cannot buy item online lose money inspected item complete nonsense unfortunately management amazon care look behind issue,0.009842619178294598,0.9901573808217055,0.13011777902411667,0.2,0.821102246215676,82.1102246215676,High Trust
