frogyrogy,/users/5ff1bd53e17491001abcd299,US,1.0,2021-01-03 12:57:20+00:00,1.0,Do NOT provide Amazon with your credit…,"Do NOT provide Amazon with your credit card info . . . use gift cards or prepaid only . . . they will take money from any account they have on file. I recently placed an order totaling several hundred dollars. The charges appeared on my bank statement as three separate charges by amazon, as this was the weekend the charges appeared as pending. The next day I was notified by amazon that I needed to revise my payment info . . . I checked my bank and the charges showed as pending/paid, the amounts deducted from my available balance.I contacted Amazon and was informed that my account was overdrawn and I needed to provide a different card. I explained to them that I had a sufficient balance and their charges had been deducted from my account. I was basically told I was a liar and that I didn't have the money available. I spoke with two customer service reps and was told it was my problem and there wasn't anything Amazon could do to resolve this, and that I needed to provide a different card. I told them not to charge my card again as bank showed charges for order . . . and that I wanted to resolve this before charging my card again. Amazon took this clear instruction to cancel order and not charge my card again by promptly running the charges against the three cards I have on file and generated an overdraft on one account. When I asked why they did that I was informed it was an automated process and they couldn't do anything except take alternate payment . . . the overdraft fee for a charge I told them not to make? My problem, per Amazon. I had already attempted to cancel the order but the system has errors when canceling orders so you may get billed anyway. Amazon assured me this was a bank error and not their error, they had not been paid. Funny, when I finally got the order cancelled my money was refunded by Amazon . . . they didn't take it, but gave it back? Better watch your accoutn security when dealing with Amazon . . . I will be cancelling my Prime membership and will not shop with this company in the future. Be warned.",2021-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,3.0,2058,388,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,provide amazon credit card info use gift card prepaid take money account file recently placed order totaling several hundred dollar charge appeared bank statement three separate charge amazon weekend charge appeared pending next day notified amazon needed revise payment info checked bank charge showed pendingpaid amount deducted available balancei contacted amazon informed account overdrawn needed provide different card explained sufficient balance charge deducted account basically told liar didnt money available spoke two customer service rep told problem wasnt anything amazon could resolve needed provide different card told charge card bank showed charge order wanted resolve charging card amazon took clear instruction cancel order charge card promptly running charge three card file generated overdraft one account asked informed automated process couldnt anything except take alternate payment overdraft fee charge told make problem per amazon already attempted cancel order system error canceling order may get billed anyway amazon assured bank error error paid funny finally got order cancelled money refunded amazon didnt take gave back better watch accoutn security dealing amazon cancelling prime membership shop company future warned,0.011428983422272618,0.9885710165777274,0.21761076836791923,0.2,0.8378076619624475,83.78076619624476,High Trust
Maritsa Carilus,/users/5ff141a1e17491001abca50a,US,1.0,2021-01-03 04:01:43+00:00,1.0,Monitor your bank account,"If you're going to ordered anything, delete your card number information right after or monitor your bank account for awhile because they will charge your card whether you make an order or not. I got charged for my full order and charged again for a smaller amount on the same order. Then they demanded payment when I reported the fraudulent charge. Just a bunch of thieves.",2021-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,1.0,3.0,374,66,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,youre going ordered anything delete card number information right monitor bank account awhile charge card whether make order got charged full order charged smaller amount order demanded payment reported fraudulent charge bunch thief,0.013751076227558659,0.9862489237724413,0.03701626472237801,0.2,0.8005277148306963,80.05277148306963,High Trust
