Teri,/users/5c2582beb1584ae75654423a,US,8.0,2020-12-29 21:23:03+00:00,1.0,Bad Experiences With Amazon,"I ordered a lot of things from Amazon for Xmas but will never make that mistake again.  I never received several items (which they said were lost in the mail).  Several items did not come until after Xmas (even though they were ordered well ahead of time and were supposed to be here before Xmas),  and the ones I did receive were very poor quality.  Sweats that I ordered were very thin, more like t-shirt material or they were sized very small.  I ordered a Xmas tree which I received broken. (They did give me a refund for this)  I was double charged for one order which never got straightened out.  All in all it was not a good buying experience.  Every other place I ordered from delivered on time.  Also, if you take time to check prices from other sellers, you'll find Amazon really overcharges.  For instance, a gift set I ordered from Hickory Farms for $55 was over $100 on Amazon.  And amazon prime is NOT WORTH PAYING FOR.  You don't get your orders any quicker with it and most things have free shipping without it.  There will be very little, if anything, That I would order from Amazon in the future.",2020-12-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,29.0,1114,204,27,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered lot thing amazon xmas never make mistake never received several item said lost mail several item come xmas even though ordered well ahead time supposed xmas one receive poor quality sweat ordered thin like tshirt material sized small ordered xmas tree received broken give refund double charged one order never got straightened good buying experience every place ordered delivered time also take time check price seller youll find amazon really overcharge instance gift set ordered hickory farm amazon amazon prime worth paying dont get order quicker thing free shipping without little anything would order amazon future,0.00649699010586521,0.9935030098941348,0.11441390914189568,0.2,0.8196342867754465,81.96342867754464,High Trust
John Pelloet,/users/5feb97e79ef789001a838d6a,US,2.0,2020-12-29 21:03:29+00:00,1.0,Don't believe customer reviews on Amazon!,"I had the same experience with other reviewers like below. Amazon removed all my reviews without explaining which review violated their guideline. They say ""Any reviews that could be viewed as advertising, promotional, or biased will not be posted."" I posted none of these and all my reviews were honest. I contacted their community-help but when I asked which review & which part violated their guideline, they just said ""We cannot share additional information about this decision and may not reply to future emails.""Jon McJon>> Lies. All lies. I've now had numerous reviews removed for unknown reasons - without any recourse !! My reviews are always honest and polite - but apparently simply explaining why i think a company/product is not worth the time and money is not allowed !! So they cannot be trusted. Buyer Beware !!!!!!!!!!!!",2020-12-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,29.0,837,138,41,6,0.0,0,16,2,1,Suspicious,experience reviewer like amazon removed review without explaining review violated guideline say review could viewed advertising promotional biased posted posted none review honest contacted communityhelp asked review part violated guideline said cannot share additional information decision may reply future emailsjon mcjon lie lie ive numerous review removed unknown reason without recourse review always honest polite apparently simply explaining think companyproduct worth time money allowed cannot trusted buyer beware,0.9999999994250539,5.749460907367165e-10,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.31547952917137656,31.547952917137657,Low Trust
