pamela,/users/5fd12c3bf28f0700195d3108,US,3.0,2020-12-29 00:08:10+00:00,1.0,DO NOT SEND GIFTS THRU AMAZON!,"My suggestion to others is NEVER send a gift through Amazon.com. We were sent a gift, brought it to the AMAZON HUB as instructed for a 4-6 hour turnover credit and 10 days later we are fighting for a credit to our account. They told it could be as much as 2 weeks to receive a credit since they have so many steps to verify that they have the product. So now they have the product and the money from the person who purchased the gift and we have nothing. We called customer service and even as a prime member all we got was WE’RE SORRY but we can’t override the system to issue you the $200 credit coming to you. Sorry Not Sorry...DO NOT BUY GIFTS TO BE SENT TO OTHERS ON AMAZON if people need to return them!!!!!!",2020-12-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,29.0,714,140,30,6,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,suggestion others never send gift amazoncom sent gift brought amazon hub instructed hour turnover credit day later fighting credit account told could much week receive credit since many step verify product product money person purchased gift nothing called customer service even prime member got we’re sorry can’t override system issue credit coming sorry sorrydo buy gift sent others amazon people need return,0.9940347907158971,0.005965209284102935,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.31868647452427246,31.868647452427247,Low Trust
