Stacy Hudgins,/users/5fea1a3b34b0e20019c9329d,US,1.0,2020-12-28 17:47:44+00:00,1.0,My Amazon account was hacked,"My Amazon account was hacked.  I noticed the following morning and I called my credit card and Amazon.  The Amazon rep worked with me, said to change my password and that I should ignore any Amazon emails regarding the 13 orders.  Seemed perfect.  Now 2 weeks later, they shut off my Amazon account and tell me that I cannot talk to the department in charge of doing so.  So much for helping the customer.  Spoke with the supervisor and he had the gall to tell me that the department that makes the decisions about closing accounts DOESN'T HAVE PHONE SERVICE.  Don't treat your customers like we're stupid.",2020-12-28 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,28.0,606,107,28,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon account hacked noticed following morning called credit card amazon amazon rep worked said change password ignore amazon email regarding order seemed perfect week later shut amazon account tell cannot talk department charge much helping customer spoke supervisor gall tell department make decision closing account doesnt phone service dont treat customer like stupid,0.038727298821738206,0.9612727011782618,0.06001121704991587,0.2,0.7926385939991141,79.26385939991141,High Trust
Filipe,/users/4df0acaf00006400010912b0,PT,326.0,2023-10-08 11:01:22+00:00,1.0,"Dishonest, censoring seller","Allows fake, dishonest, factually-incorrect negative reviews of products the reviewer didn't purchase. Censors genuine, honest, factually-correct reviews of products the reviewer purchased (literally all my reviews are censored despite being genuine, honest, factually-correct reviews of products I purchased on Amazon). Refused to remove a fake, dishonest, factually-incorrect negative review of my book left out of spite by Android and iOS developer TMSoft after I reviewed one of their paid Android apps negatively. Enables third-party sellers to sell fake items and unilaterally cancel paid orders without providing any compensation. Spams you with calls despite multiple requests not to do so.Examples of censored reviews: ASIN B081SF349N""2-*da FilGov il 24 dicembre 2020DisappointingExpensive. Disappointing coverage (good but not as powerful as advertised). Enforces unwanted services, doesn't let you disable them (Armor). Connection/Roaming issues (my Pixel 4 often can't connect). Otherwise good.""ASIN B000QTUJXS""1-*from FilGov on November 2, 2021Terrible serviceIt was delivered with a single-voltage power adapter incompatible with my sockets and voltage system. Contacted HoMedics support. They refused to help and claimed that - despite it being available, sold, shipped, and delivered in/to other countries - using it outside..."" (Amazon cut the rest in their e-mail)ASIN B08BFM71CB""1-*de FilGov em 6 de Dezembro de 2022Unreliable1 of 2 broke after ~1 year of sporadic use. Amazon forwarded me to the manufacturer and the manufacturer ignored my e-mail.""ASIN B00R5S9EQ6""1-*de FilGov em 27 de Janeiro de 2023UselessOverpriced and useless. Usually fails to scan with an error or force close. There's no timer skip, so you must wait 60 seconds again whenever it force closes (which is often), violating their own guidelines and resulting in inconsistent results (when you can get that..."" (Amazon cut the rest in their e-mail)ASIN B075J888J7""5-*de FilGov em 3 de Junho de 2023ExcellentPH meter seems to slightly overestimate readings even after calibration and doesn't indicate battery polarity (?!). Otherwise excellent, good functionality and great support, had an issue that was my fault (batteries incorrectly installed) and they immediately sent..."" (Amazon cut the rest in their e-mail)ASIN B0C9WCYPCG""4-*de FilGov em 4 de Outubro de 2023Good juicerGood, small, quiet, powerful slow juicer. I had a big, noisy, fast juicer from Philips that often clogged and did a mess. This one is easier. It's not machine-washable and the rubber flap of the filters easily/quickly breaks as reported by others, but the..."" (Amazon cut the rest in their e-mail)",2020-12-28 00:00:00+00:00,2023.0,10.0,8.0,2664,389,27,3,1014.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,allows fake dishonest factuallyincorrect negative review product reviewer didnt purchase censor genuine honest factuallycorrect review product reviewer purchased literally review censored despite genuine honest factuallycorrect review product purchased amazon refused remove fake dishonest factuallyincorrect negative review book left spite android io developer tmsoft reviewed one paid android apps negatively enables thirdparty seller sell fake item unilaterally cancel paid order without providing compensation spam call despite multiple request soexamples censored review asin bsfnda filgov il dicembre disappointingexpensive disappointing coverage good powerful advertised enforces unwanted service doesnt let disable armor connectionroaming issue pixel often cant connect otherwise goodasin bqtujxsfrom filgov november terrible serviceit delivered singlevoltage power adapter incompatible socket voltage system contacted homedics support refused help claimed despite available sold shipped delivered country using outside amazon cut rest emailasin bbfmcbde filgov em de dezembro de unreliable broke year sporadic use amazon forw