Mick Faires,/users/514375a80000640001344dc6,GB,7.0,2020-12-27 14:07:29+00:00,1.0,"No date of birth given, courier refused to deliver parcel....","An amazon delivery driver turned up on my door step with a parcel in my name and my address thereon sent by an as yet unknown relative. The courier refused to hand over the parcel until I provided proof that I was over 18 and of my date of birth. I am over 60 years of age and look it. In these circumstances, as I look over 25, there is no legal requirement to furnish proof of my date of birth let alone provide it to a complete stranger on my doorstep. Speaking with 'Customer Services' on-line took me nowhere further forward at all.  I have no idea where my parcel is now or what will happen to it.",2020-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,27.0,603,119,61,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon delivery driver turned door step parcel name address thereon sent yet unknown relative courier refused hand parcel provided proof date birth year age look circumstance look legal requirement furnish proof date birth let alone provide complete stranger doorstep speaking customer service online took nowhere forward idea parcel happen,0.020045061136094246,0.9799549388639057,0.06674144699943915,0.2,0.8033257588318407,80.33257588318406,High Trust
Lynda A,/users/5f15513a4a3e41cd91ecf02a,GB,4.0,2020-12-27 13:54:40+00:00,1.0,Appalling customer service,"I ordered a Lego set on 21st December which promised Christmas Eve delivery. Amazon waited until 4pm on Christmas Eve to say it would be late and may be lost. As requested I explained to a very disappointed child the present wasn’t coming then waited a couple of days to see if it turned up. After then amazon kindly offered a refund. I explained I still wanted the product as it was still available on amazon and was told they would not price match, I would have to reorder at the (significantly) higher price. they also would not put me through to a manager to resolve. Not what I would call customer centric, appalling service",2020-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,27.0,629,115,26,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered lego set st december promised christmas eve delivery amazon waited pm christmas eve say would late may lost requested explained disappointed child present wasn’t coming waited couple day see turned amazon kindly offered refund explained still wanted product still available amazon told would price match would reorder significantly higher price also would put manager resolve would call customer centric appalling service,0.021122544051556513,0.9788774559484434,0.06449803701626472,0.2,0.8023383353774746,80.23383353774746,High Trust
