Frances Allen,/users/5fe832ef643b8d001ad65a08,US,2.0,2020-12-27 07:23:52+00:00,1.0,Suspect they sold item out from under me at higher price,"I purchased the Mandalorian Razor Crest Lego set for my son for Christmas on Amazon, from Amazon for $129.99 (not from a third party on their site) - ten days later I was informed that I would receive a refund because they “lost” the package. Now the Lego set can’t be purchased anywhere for under $260 and Amazon won’t match a third party price. This was completely an error on their end (and I don’t trust they didn’t sell it off to a store or someone else for higher price) - tracking the package it never left their facility - they prepped it for shipping but the post office never received it. With the amount of money Amazon brings in I expect better customer relations - they may have saved themselves $130 extra bucks this time by not matching the third party sellers on their site, but I won’t buy anything from Amazon anymore and I’m returning my Amazon purchases (I am taking my business elsewhere) - they’ve lost my trust - why would I purchase from Amazon what I can purchase from local stores that will also ship ... and I’m betting won’t hide behind their policy of “no third party matching” - so disappointed",2020-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,27.0,1124,206,56,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased mandalorian razor crest lego set son christmas amazon amazon third party site ten day later informed would receive refund “lost” package lego set can’t purchased anywhere amazon won’t match third party price completely error end don’t trust didn’t sell store someone else higher price tracking package never left facility prepped shipping post office never received amount money amazon brings expect better customer relation may saved extra buck time matching third party seller site won’t buy anything amazon anymore i’m returning amazon purchase taking business elsewhere they’ve lost trust would purchase amazon purchase local store also ship i’m betting won’t hide behind policy “no third party matching” disappointed,0.00691384335552799,0.993086156644472,0.1155356141334829,0.2,0.8196502011489326,81.96502011489326,High Trust
