TC,/users/5fe7cee45ad6be001bb8d049,GB,1.0,2020-12-27 00:01:52+00:00,1.0,Utterly disappointed with AMAZON!!,"I received a US$200 gift card from my boss who is based in the States. However, as I am based in UK, I am unable to use the gift card. Basically the US$200 has gone down the drain. Amazon said that they cannot transfer the balance to their UK site. Really weird considering they are an international company. They said I can use it on their US site, however, they are charging ridiculous international shipping fees because the site assumed I am based in US and is shipping to UK. Very disappointed with Amazon inflexibility. Lesson learnt, never ever buy an Amazon gift card!!",2020-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,27.0,577,104,34,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,received u gift card bos based state however based uk unable use gift card basically u gone drain amazon said cannot transfer balance uk site really weird considering international company said use u site however charging ridiculous international shipping fee site assumed based u shipping uk disappointed amazon inflexibility lesson learnt never ever buy amazon gift card,0.33616255005075696,0.663837449949243,0.05832865956253505,0.2,0.6435844568871284,64.35844568871283,Medium Trust
Michael Woodward,/users/5fe77b912867110019c01b3b,US,1.0,2020-12-26 18:06:15+00:00,1.0,Do not use Amazon during Christmas,Do not use Amazon during Christmas. I bought 19 items in total. I only bought one from Amazon. It was the very first item I bought and I only bought it from Amazon because it said it would arrive between the 21-23. The seller took three days just to print the label and here we are on Dec 26 and the item still hasn't arrived 13 days after I ordered it. Meanwhile. the other 18 items arrived including some from as  far as Italy. My step dad ordered two items from Amazon and the same exact thing happened. It appears that they may be falsely advertising their delivery times to get people to order. Then they don't tell you it won't arrive on time until it is too late to order from somewhere else so that you have gifts to give. I will NEVER use Amazon again during Christmas and I would not recommend anyone else use them either unless you don't want your gifts by Christmas. The worst part is that they sent me an e-mail today to review the product that still hasn't even arrived.,2020-12-26 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,26.0,984,187,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,use amazon christmas bought item total bought one amazon first item bought bought amazon said would arrive seller took three day print label dec item still hasnt arrived day ordered meanwhile item arrived including far italy step dad ordered two item amazon exact thing happened appears may falsely advertising delivery time get people order dont tell wont arrive time late order somewhere else gift give never use amazon christmas would recommend anyone else use either unless dont want gift christmas worst part sent email today review product still hasnt even arrived,0.003999977272178229,0.9960000227278217,0.10487941671340438,0.2,0.8189758947065917,81.89758947065917,High Trust
Pawel,/users/5fbcf3c30bb307001accb950,GB,11.0,2020-12-26 14:14:05+00:00,1.0,Amazon - real stinker,"Used to love Amazon and spent thousands with them - not any more! Time to support local shops again! Amazon has a habit of overpricing, was looking for a graphics card to finish my computer - had no choice but to pay almost £200 more than retail value (item sold and dispatched by Amazon) I get it , these are hard to get at the moment but it's still a cheeky move! Especially when other smaller retailers stick to suggested pricing. On top of that their drivers think it's ok to leave parcels in the communal areas and don't bother to come upstairs. Amazon also don't like negative product/service reviews and refuse to publish them on their website. Amazon you have become a real stinker and I'm not going near you again. Cheers - awaiting my prime membership refund.",2020-12-26 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,26.0,769,139,21,4,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,used love amazon spent thousand time support local shop amazon habit overpricing looking graphic card finish computer choice pay almost £ retail value item sold dispatched amazon get hard get moment still cheeky move especially smaller retailer stick suggested pricing top driver think ok leave parcel communal area dont bother come upstairs amazon also dont like negative productservice review refuse publish website amazon become real stinker im going near cheer awaiting prime membership refund,0.7445146212780441,0.25548537872195587,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.4433343887440402,44.33343887440402,Low Trust
