SimpleGuy,/users/5fe66bc35ad6be001bb840bf,US,3.0,2020-12-25 22:46:55+00:00,1.0,Amazon loves to take your money but if…,"Amazon loves to take your money but if you give them a bad review, they won't allow you to leave more reviews.  So much for free speech.  Typical.  People claim the want free speech but if you don't agree with them, then you are a racist, homophobic, or mean (not that I did or am any of those).  Just tired of the double standard.  Save your Prime Membership dollars.  Buy from somewhere else.",2020-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,25.0,394,73,39,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon love take money give bad review wont allow leave review much free speech typical people claim want free speech dont agree racist homophobic mean tired double standard save prime membership dollar buy somewhere else,0.031582097385313534,0.9684179026146864,0.04094223219293326,0.2,0.7923973977459298,79.23973977459298,High Trust
Ji Wilson,/users/5f1cb0c0f6abf0365828ed52,US,3.0,2020-12-25 17:55:17+00:00,1.0,I have been trying to get a $399.00…,"I have been trying to get a $399.00 refund from Amazon since December 6. Each time I contacted customer service they said 3-5 days. I was promised today would be the day. Well....of course not. I was told again 3-5 days. I will now contact my credit card company to resolve this. Additionally, I have had to close multiple credit card accounts due to a 9.99 charge that appears after I use a card. It says Prime Video. It is not. It’s a scam of a company that someway gets your CC number. It’s a security breach from Amazon. Every time I have contacted the CC company they close my account issue a new card and within 30 days send a letter that this is fraud. I have contacted Amazon multiple times. Folks, watch your bills. If there is anything that says Prime Video, it is not Amazon. And, although it’s convenient, I won’t ever shop on Amazon again",2020-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,25.0,851,159,36,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,trying get refund amazon since december time contacted customer service said day promised today would day wellof course told day contact credit card company resolve additionally close multiple credit card account due charge appears use card say prime video it’s scam company someway get cc number it’s security breach amazon every time contacted cc company close account issue new card within day send letter fraud contacted amazon multiple time folk watch bill anything say prime video amazon although it’s convenient won’t ever shop amazon,0.005320844577280275,0.9946791554227197,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.8151746870775965,81.51746870775966,High Trust
