Tan Gerine,/users/5f8da7cd5318ac001929629b,GB,4.0,2020-12-25 15:47:32+00:00,1.0,Sadly Amazon has been going downhill…,Sadly Amazon has been going downhill for a while now. Many features that used to be available have been disappearing one by one. One example of this is My Music Library. At one time any album that you bought that was sold by Amazon would have Auto-rip available so that you can listen to it anywhere but this has been slowly disappearing. Now the service either gets withdrawn between ordering an album and receiving it or it's just not available. Instead Amazon constantly push Music Unlimited which means you pay a load of money just to listen to music that you already own. I have Amazon Prime but Amazon really want me to take up Unlimited and what I get for my money is greatly diminished these days.The other problem is that the site is just inundated with dodgy chinese knock offs that probably don't have any sort of recognised safety standard. I'm not sure how they can get away with selling electrical items that have either fake safety stamps or at the very least questionable quality. And as far as I can tell there is very little in the way of customer service these days. You used to be able to talk to someone but now you just get punted round a confusing menu system until you give you up.Unfortunately the company have become unacceptably greedy and couldn't give a damn about their customers.,2020-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,25.0,1310,235,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sadly amazon going downhill many feature used available disappearing one one one example music library one time album bought sold amazon would autorip available listen anywhere slowly disappearing service either get withdrawn ordering album receiving available instead amazon constantly push music unlimited mean pay load money listen music already amazon prime amazon really want take unlimited get money greatly diminished daysthe problem site inundated dodgy chinese knock offs probably dont sort recognised safety standard im sure get away selling electrical item either fake safety stamp least questionable quality far tell little way customer service day used able talk someone get punted round confusing menu system give upunfortunately company become unacceptably greedy couldnt give damn customer,0.007460926805533732,0.9925390731944662,0.13180033651149747,0.2,0.8226296038995325,82.26296038995325,High Trust
Andrew,/users/4e6677ab00006400010bc737,GB,14.0,2020-12-25 15:38:44+00:00,1.0,Downward spiral of poor service,"Amazon have become very poor recently. If you're not a Prime member, the service is 3rd rate. I've had orders cancelled even though the product is in stock,  orders delivered late and customer service are little help. I now find that I'm not able to leave a review for a product, because I haven't met the minimum criteria.The worse they become, the less I use them and so they become even worse; it's a downward spiral. They're simply not interested in you without the 'loyalty card' of Prime membership.",2020-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,25.0,505,89,31,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon become poor recently youre prime member service rd rate ive order cancelled even though product stock order delivered late customer service little help find im able leave review product havent met minimum criteriathe worse become less use become even worse downward spiral theyre simply interested without loyalty card prime membership,0.029279614863021577,0.9707203851369784,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.7953433669936154,79.53433669936155,High Trust
