P Smith,/users/5f8aaae426f9d60019c39f09,GB,66.0,2020-12-24 20:58:05+00:00,1.0,Terrible delivery,"Terrible delivery, down for 1430-1630never arrived. Rescheduled for up to 10pm yet driver per Amazon tracker passed within 0.5miles my address twice before heading off elsewhere. Rechecked at 2000hrs driver been sat at costa coffee for 1.5hrs. 2100hrs still no delivery.Called customer service who although polute couldnt or wouldnt help resolve when delivery would take place. No contact with driver available no map tracker update available per service representative. Thoroughly dissatisfied at the professionalism of this company. As a courier man myself you dont send a driver with hundreds of pounds worth of parcels out and have no way of contacting them. Pathetic excuses.......",2020-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,24.0,686,104,17,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,terrible delivery never arrived rescheduled pm yet driver per amazon tracker passed within mile address twice heading elsewhere rechecked hr driver sat costa coffee hr hr still deliverycalled customer service although polute couldnt wouldnt help resolve delivery would take place contact driver available map tracker update available per service representative thoroughly dissatisfied professionalism company courier man dont send driver hundred pound worth parcel way contacting pathetic excuse,0.13695678668024033,0.8630432133197596,0.05832865956253505,0.2,0.7431873385723867,74.31873385723867,Medium Trust
