nm,/users/5f4ba0937000d395152b9dc9,US,12.0,2020-12-27 03:30:44+00:00,1.0,I agree with everyone. Amazon has really gone downhill,"I agree with everyone here, Amazon has gone downhill since the pandemic started. Especially Christmas, be very careful on amazon around Christmas time. Packages are always missing or delayed out of nowhere which is really frustrating, and the “two day shipping” comes in like a week. I ordered 2 things for Xmas for my brother on the 17th. About week later, (Xmas eve) I get a notification saying “running late”, and then giving me an apology saying there sorry my package was late and it should arrive the next day. I was pissed, but I thought at least it’s on Christmas Day. Well On Xmas, it ended up never arriving, and it said “your package may be lost“. I was so pissed and talked to a customer support representative. They told me I can get a replacement. I ended up just doing that and I told my brother about the situation. I am so pissed at amazon and I will do everything in my power to avoid them.",2020-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,27.0,908,168,54,9,3.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,agree everyone amazon gone downhill since pandemic started especially christmas careful amazon around christmas time package always missing delayed nowhere really frustrating “two day shipping” come like week ordered thing xmas brother th week later xmas eve get notification saying “running late” giving apology saying sorry package late arrive next day pissed thought least it’s christmas day well xmas ended never arriving said “your package may lost“ pissed talked customer support representative told get replacement ended told brother situation pissed amazon everything power avoid,0.012811688948630844,0.9871883110513692,0.09422321929332586,0.2,0.8124387993843497,81.24387993843497,High Trust
Rob Huntley,/users/5fe4bc7c7223ed001bdff976,US,2.0,2020-12-24 16:06:27+00:00,1.0,Gift Cards if lost can't be replaced after 30 days!,"Very upset with Amazon. I purchased a $200 gift card for my sister's Christmas gift in 2019. Sadly my sister lost the card. Apparently Amazon won't do anything to help recover the lost money after 30 days. I have the serial number and date of purchase, in fact it shows up in the 'orders section' online, but despite explaining this the customer service representative simply said they were sorry and refused to help. Basically, I'm out $200, my sister ends up with nothing and Oh, how wonderful...Amazon clears $200 cash for nothing...I'm so done with them...and I'm telling everyone...",2020-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,24.0,587,99,51,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,upset amazon purchased gift card sister christmas gift sadly sister lost card apparently amazon wont anything help recover lost money day serial number date purchase fact show order section online despite explaining customer service representative simply said sorry refused help basically im sister end nothing oh wonderfulamazon clear cash nothingim done themand im telling everyone,0.012892466291416514,0.9871075337085835,0.055524397083567024,0.2,0.8046586462710053,80.46586462710053,High Trust
matthew rhodes,/users/5fe4b08d7e9d9a0019272474,US,2.0,2020-12-24 15:18:55+00:00,1.0,I ordered an 800 dollar item and…,"I ordered an 800 dollar item and received a 300 dollar item.  Being Christmas this leaves me in a jam as we only buy one gift per person as a rule. I asked Amazon to refund the difference and I’d just keep what I got.  The largest retailer in the world says “we cannot do that, you must pay 800 for the 300 dollar item or return it.”  I asked if they’d expedite overnight the item I ordered and “no we cannot do that.” Big lesson learned here, shop local at retailers with skin in the game. Amazon could not have treated me more callously on their own mistake if they’d flung feces in my lap. I hope they go the way of Sears someday, hopefully nothing is too big to fail when they harm enough customers. The biggest retailer in the world told me “we cannot” when the reality is, they can.  They don’t care.  It remains to be seen if I’ll get a refund or not even though I have shipping proof of having returned it.",2020-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,24.0,914,178,33,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered dollar item received dollar item christmas leaf jam buy one gift per person rule asked amazon refund difference i’d keep got largest retailer world say “we cannot must pay dollar item return it” asked they’d expedite overnight item ordered “no cannot that” big lesson learned shop local retailer skin game amazon could treated callously mistake they’d flung feces lap hope go way sears someday hopefully nothing big fail harm enough customer biggest retailer world told “we cannot” reality don’t care remains seen i’ll get refund even though shipping proof returned,0.012187037202683975,0.987812962797316,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.8138728302489104,81.38728302489105,High Trust
