swati shah,/users/5fdaaf60c839220019eba68a,US,1.0,2020-12-17 01:07:57+00:00,1.0,Terrible - No refund after weeks of follow up,"I ordered a Samsung S20 phone which arrived on time. After checking phone, i decided it's not for me and i wanted to go with different phone.Returned phone within their return policy period with exact same original packaging and in exact brand new condition as it was received.I didn't received refund for 2 weeks so started following up. To my surprise 3 weeks after, i got email suggesting they never received phone and box they received was empty.Contacted local UPS store and they conducted investigation right away, checked their cameras, see item in box and been packaged for return etc.Amazon hasn't been co-operating at all, numerous emails and phone calls but they keep insisting that unless i return original item, they can't issue refund.I keep saying i have returned it as exactly described in their policy and to a UPS store but they won't do anything about it nor open up investigation of fraud on their end nor work with UPS to understand what happened here.Never buy any expensive items from this site, it's good chance you will get rip off as you don't control delivery or return of such items and Amazon will simply won't refund your hard earned $.It's ok to buy small and non expensive items but stay away anything more than $50.",2020-12-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,17.0,1248,216,45,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered samsung phone arrived time checking phone decided wanted go different phonereturned phone within return policy period exact original packaging exact brand new condition receivedi didnt received refund week started following surprise week got email suggesting never received phone box received emptycontacted local ups store conducted investigation right away checked camera see item box packaged return etcamazon hasnt cooperating numerous email phone call keep insisting unless return original item cant issue refundi keep saying returned exactly described policy ups store wont anything open investigation fraud end work ups understand happened herenever buy expensive item site good chance get rip dont control delivery return item amazon simply wont refund hard earned ok buy small non expensive item stay away anything,0.006049381098996196,0.9939506189010038,0.12114413909141895,0.2,0.8212041372687857,82.12041372687857,High Trust
