Sara,/users/5b0ebe7a4de5666d34a43f90,GB,8.0,2024-04-11 20:31:25+00:00,1.0,Update on previous.,I just wanted to update on my previous review submitted just 30 mins ago. I have since been back on the Amazon Website and the items that I were told were out of stock are showing '10 in stock'What a joke. Is that 10 other customers that are going to pay over £1000 for items that aren't received.Another update on 17th Dec I have now been informed that my parcel will be delivered on Wednesday the 23rd Dec. This is 10 days after I made the purchase with AMAZON PRIME.... I question if my delivery date has been put back to the Wednesday as Amazon perhaps expect that they cant deliver the item but perhaps i wont chase it so close to Christmas OR by the time I know it isnt going to be delivered it is too late for me to do anything about it. Who knows. But I will of course update.Update. A very kind colleague placed the same order through her account and received delivery the following day.... Whilst I was still waiting for delivery of several repurchased items. I didn't eventually get a full refund on all of the orders placed (after Christmas) but none of them ever showed up in a delivery. I've never had a response to my email or complaint either. I will never make any big purchases through Amazon Prime again. ,2020-12-16 00:00:00+00:00,2024.0,4.0,11.0,1224,229,19,3,1212.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,wanted update previous review submitted min ago since back amazon website item told stock showing stockwhat joke customer going pay £ item arent receivedanother update th dec informed parcel delivered wednesday rd dec day made purchase amazon prime question delivery date put back wednesday amazon perhaps expect cant deliver item perhaps wont chase close christmas time know isnt going delivered late anything know course updateupdate kind colleague placed order account received delivery following day whilst still waiting delivery several repurchased item didnt eventually get full refund order plac