Allen,/users/5fd92a2d970eab001a5554d5,US,2.0,2020-12-15 21:28:08+00:00,1.0,Another Bait and Switch by Amazon,"I ordered two pairs of boots, and the fact that they both had $10 off helped - this was for amazon shipped items as well as other companies, and would be applied at checkout - I read all the info before continuing.  I didnt see the discount, so started a chat with a rep, then xferred to another one.  They indicated that I would see the discount on my next order at checkout.  So placing another order a week later, and it's not there.  Go back to chat.  Explain things again, requested to pull up last weeks chat.  Got transferred to 5, yes 5 different reps who would be better to help me out...  Got no resolution - so emptied my cart, and will go shopping for what I need locally and will be staying away from Amazon.  I always run into things like this and it takes hours of my time and only then does it get resolved IF it get resolved.  I feel it is a Bait and Switch and more people will not notice they didnt get a credit or just won't put the time into looking into it as $30 isn't that important to them, but if one qualifies for the discount, they should get it w/o all these hassles.....  I have the last chat where I was xferred to 5 different people.  (An Amazon ploy thinking the customer is going to give up and move on????)",2020-12-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,15.0,1241,241,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered two pair boot fact helped amazon shipped item well company would applied checkout read info continuing didnt see discount started chat rep xferred another one indicated would see discount next order checkout placing another order week later go back chat explain thing requested pull last week chat got transferred yes different rep would better help got resolution emptied cart go shopping need locally staying away amazon always run thing like take hour time get resolved get resolved feel bait switch people notice didnt get credit wont put time looking isnt important one qualifies discount get wo hassle last chat xferred different people amazon ploy thinking customer going give move,0.006982756467423626,0.9930172435325764,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.8235417120635401,82.35417120635401,High Trust
