Karin Keller,/users/5fd8f800f232db001b0544bb,US,3.0,2020-12-15 21:45:45+00:00,1.0,Watch out for double charges,"I have been doing business with Amazon for several years, but feel they’re method for customers paying is off completely. First you get charged to see if you have money in your account, then that’s supposed to drop off and you get charged when the item ships. Well I recently got charged for an item I already received and the customer service rep didn’t seem to get it, but I was charged 2 times for two separate  items altogether and makes me wonder how many other times they’ve done this not just to me but others who may have a larger than normal order. I loved shopping on amazon but my view is definitely starting to change about them and their charging system",2020-12-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,15.0,666,123,28,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,business amazon several year feel they’re method customer paying completely first get charged see money account that’s supposed drop get charged item ship well recently got charged item already received customer service rep didn’t seem get charged time two separate item altogether make wonder many time they’ve done others may larger normal order loved shopping amazon view definitely starting change charging system,0.013778794950449822,0.9862212050495501,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.8069075739212977,80.69075739212977,High Trust
