Richard Head,/users/5fd5b1c03a64c6001a4affe3,US,1.0,2020-12-13 06:16:38+00:00,1.0,Why in the world would delivering…,"Why in the world would delivering groceries in a non-tempered vehicle ever be a good idea? Just what I want is warm milk, meats and other perishables after watching my food travel to my distant neighbors. Most recently placed an order with perishables that the site indicated was packed 3 hours before it was finally delivered to me (an hour after the 2 hour delivery window). Obvious system “bugs” to workout, but start with tempering the groceries while in transit to so many stops. Seems pretty simple.",2020-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,13.0,505,87,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,world would delivering grocery nontempered vehicle ever good idea want warm milk meat perishable watching food travel distant neighbor recently placed order perishable site indicated packed hour finally delivered hour hour delivery window obvious system “bugs” workout start tempering grocery transit many stop seems pretty simple,0.026015620418202476,0.9739843795817975,0.04879416713404375,0.2,0.7967510232177074,79.67510232177074,High Trust
Amy Law,/users/5fd576a0a78beb001b3d0081,CA,1.0,2020-12-13 02:04:29+00:00,1.0,What is the point of paying for the…,"What is the point of paying for the Prime membership. Customer service is horrible and the delivery is not on time. When the item is returned back to Amazon due to no fault of yours, they don't let you know. But, you will get an email to let you know after your item has been returned to Amazon. Customer service have no knowledge about why the item was returned and to shut you up they offer you only a $5 promo credit, SO CHEAP! They seriously need to work on their service and delivery.",2020-12-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,13.0,489,94,36,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,point paying prime membership customer service horrible delivery time item returned back amazon due fault dont let know get email let know item returned amazon customer service knowledge item returned shut offer promo credit cheap seriously need work service delivery,0.05394635193696427,0.9460536480630357,0.05272013460459899,0.2,0.7835708509524377,78.35708509524378,High Trust
EW H,/users/5fd54891d0820d0019bfaadd,US,2.0,2020-12-12 22:48:14+00:00,1.0,Amazon is another American Biz Failure..,"Amazon is another great American business ethics failure. Placed several items in my cart with a promised delivery date of 12/18-12/22 for all the items, then I ordered the items and paid. Guess what, as soon as they got my money they changed the delivery dates to 12/22-12-28 and 1/2-1/8. Needed items for Christmas, so of course I was a bit furious. Will never buy from them again. Amazon should be broken up by the gov't.",2020-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,12.0,424,76,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon another great american business ethic failure placed several item cart promised delivery date item ordered item paid guess soon got money changed delivery date needed item christmas course bit furious never buy amazon broken govt,0.022997974367633855,0.9770020256323662,0.04262478968031408,0.2,0.7970259707522459,79.70259707522459,High Trust
Michelle,/users/5725165b0000ff000a1c15bc,US,7.0,2020-12-12 22:37:41+00:00,1.0,Falsely claimed to deliver a package,"Amazon sent me a message claiming that my packaged was delivered. I checked my proch, no package. Checked my mailroom, no package. Mind you, I am teaching from home and I my living room faces the street, so I see cars and trucks come and go all day. Called Amazon right away and they gave me the run around. Amazon told me “maybe the driver scanned the package as delivered but thte package could arrive in another 2 business days.” 😡Sorry, I dont understand; how do you “accidently” scan a package as delivered. No, your driver is incompetent and a thief. Here we are 24 hours later and NO PACKAGE! Now “i have to wait unti after 7pm Monday, to request a refund.” 😡😡I will NEVER EVER again purchase from Amazon. Now I am stuck scrambling to find the last two gifts that the driver stole.",2020-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,12.0,788,146,36,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon sent message claiming packaged delivered checked proch package checked mailroom package mind teaching home living room face street see car truck come go day called amazon right away gave run around amazon told “maybe driver scanned package delivered thte package could arrive another business days” 😡sorry dont understand “accidently” scan package delivered driver incompetent thief hour later package “i wait unti pm monday request refund” 😡😡i never ever purchase amazon stuck scrambling find last two gift driver stole,0.06981396159905123,0.9301860384009488,0.08188446438586652,0.2,0.7814699120776476,78.14699120776476,High Trust
Baz Thompson,/users/5fd4f861ed74d7001a4b9637,GB,4.0,2020-12-12 19:58:16+00:00,1.0,Awful would give zero if poss,"Awful - Nb this is about Amazon export sales LLC: ordered from them, package arrived safely in UK. Delivery screwed up by useless UK courier, Hermes. Hermes say you can contact the seller directly who will raise delivery issues with them. Just try contacting Amazon, a pathetic joke. You get a stupid chat algorithm that repeats the same thing - do you want the contact details for the (US leg) courier company, who - you guessed it - on their website say 'you should raise delivery queries with the seller'. Amazon are happy to take your money, flaming useless when anything goes wrong.",2020-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,12.0,587,103,29,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,awful nb amazon export sale llc ordered package arrived safely uk delivery screwed useless uk courier hermes hermes say contact seller directly raise delivery issue try contacting amazon pathetic joke get stupid chat algorithm repeat thing want contact detail u leg courier company guessed website say raise delivery query seller amazon happy take money flaming useless anything go wrong,0.014177419025947718,0.9858225809740523,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.8044648519003744,80.44648519003744,High Trust
stephenishy,/users/57028d820000ff000a145006,GB,168.0,2020-12-12 19:23:14+00:00,5.0,Never had a bad delivery,"Thought I would leave a review. I must admit I was totally surprised at the bad reviews. I have used amazon for years with not one issue order in the morning delivery same day. Surely you cannot get better than that. Once an item did not arrive by arrival date(Royal Mail) requested a refund , given refund in a couple of hours. Item arrived next day I phoned Amazon and was given an apology for a late delivery was told to keep item and keep refund. The Amazon items I've ordered always arrive on time and sometimes earlier. I am a Amazon convert I will even spend more on an item because I know it will arrive on time.",2020-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,12.0,620,119,24,5,0.0,0,0,2,1,Suspicious,thought would leave review must admit totally surprised bad review used amazon year one issue order morning delivery day surely cannot get better item arrive arrival dateroyal mail requested refund given refund couple hour item arrived next day phoned amazon given apology late delivery told keep item keep refund amazon item ive ordered always arrive time sometimes earlier amazon convert even spend item know arrive time,0.8170782531728039,0.18292174682719609,0.06674144699943915,1.0,1.6048091628134857,160.48091628134858,High Trust
