Martin Cattani,/users/5f05c91ea667792438133b09,US,3.0,2020-12-12 06:57:14+00:00,1.0,"Currently under their ""$20 and under…","Currently under their ""$20 and under deals"" section, there is a book by Obama with over 11K gushing reviews, while only two items further down the menu is a chia pet of Trump's head... If this isn't representative of the politicization of their site, and how low they've sunk, I'm not sure what is. Already cancelled my prime account a year ago and went back to buying on ebay, but it's still repugnant and worthy of a one-star review in my opinion.",2020-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,12.0,449,82,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,currently deal section book obama k gushing review two item menu chia pet trump head isnt representative politicization site low theyve sunk im sure already cancelled prime account year ago went back buying ebay still repugnant worthy onestar review opinion,0.023615631935785964,0.976384368064214,0.045989904655075714,0.2,0.7973901649631221,79.7390164963122,High Trust
