David,/users/55f6c5fa0000ff0001dba631,ES,8.0,2020-12-11 20:28:05+00:00,1.0,AMAZON DELIVERIES,"The purpose of this review is not malicious, but made in an attempt to improve Amazon and customer confidence!. The concept of Amazon is a good one especially now that we are virtually locked in due to Covid-19. However, success has gone to Bezo's head and this can be clearly seen by an increasing in substandard products, poor delivery and the attitude of some of the customer service agents.I am TQM trained and run my former business along those lines. TQM means total Quality Management and the buck stops right at the feet of the person running the show. This means Jeff Bezo is vicariously liable for the actions  of all his employees, no matter how he tries to worm his way out the responsibilities they are firmly stuck with him..Amazon did not deliver my cooker and are refusing to reimburse me. I have asked them for proof of delivery and they cannot give it to me as simply they never delivered it. I have boded my time in order to gather evidence that Amazon will just leave packages unattended. I now have this proof. Also in the Costa Blanca Olive Press Oct 1st 2020 THERE IS A FRONT PAGE FEATURE ALLEGING THAT AMAZON CUSTOMERS ARE NOT GETTING THEIR PACKAGES DELIVERED BY DECEPTIVE DELIVERY DRIVERS.Clear proof that Amazon does not take care to ensure that what you buy and pay for your get!Amazon is fully aware if this. I also made them aware over two years ago about poor delivery and this directly caused a slight improvement. However, regrettably BEZO has never stayed on top of things as any competent CEO would do, preferring, as his does to pass the buck over onto his delivery firms.However, when you buy on AMAZON your contract is between you and Amazon, being as it is,  made at the point of your purchase. Amazon cant by law introduce a third party, ie their contracted delivery firms, into your already executed contract in an illegal attempt to shirk off its contractual responsibilities.No matter what the small print says you would have to physically agree to a third party being joined into an alrady existing contract,I feel that Amazon has grown too big for its boots! When I was able to prove that Customer Service Executive ANDRY A lied to me, purposely on two occasions, that is deception! When I complained over it I was told and I quote: I would appreciate if you keep communication on a professional way, as we always ensure our specialists provide a good service showing respect to our customer and we would appreciate if we received the same treatment form our customers.Katherine A.Departamento de Relaciones EjecutivasAmazon.esI MEAN PLEASE JUST..............How many ways can you tell Amazon this person, Andry A lied to me twice??Amazon refunded me 40 Euros!So back to the 500 euro cooker! Having given Amazon the chance to rectify the problem with no avail the next step is to report them, which I will now do to the following:- EU europa consumersAlso including the National Consumer Arbitration Board I would urge anyone with difficulties with Amazon to do the same and you would be more than welcome to quote this review.We are undoubtedly heading for difficult times and every penny will no doubt count. I kinda take objection to being ripped off...especially by the reputed richest man in the world.",2020-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,11.0,3251,561,17,2,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,purpose review malicious made attempt improve amazon customer confidence concept amazon good one especially virtually locked due covid however success gone bezos head clearly seen increasing substandard product poor delivery attitude customer service agentsi tqm trained run former business along line tqm mean total quality management buck stop right foot person running show mean jeff bezo vicariously liable action employee matter try worm way responsibility firmly stuck himamazon deliver cooker refusing reimburse asked proof delivery cannot give simply never delivered boded time order gather evidence amazon leave package unattended proof also costa blanca olive press oct st front page feature alleging amazon customer getting package delivered deceptive delivery driversclear proof amazon take care ensure buy pay getamazon fully aware also made aware two year ago poor delivery directly caused slight improvement however regrettably bezo never stayed top thing competent ceo would preferring pas buck onto delivery firmshowever buy amazon contract amazon made point purchase amazon cant law introduce third party ie contracted delivery firm already executed contract illegal attempt shirk contractual responsibilitiesno matter small print say would physically agree third party joined alrady existing contracti feel amazon grown big boot able prove customer service executive andry lied purposely two occasion deception complained told quote would appreciate keep communication professional way always ensure specialist provide good service showing respect customer would appreciate received treatment form customerskatherine adepartamento de relaciones ejecutivasamazonesi mean please justhow many way tell amazon person andry lied twiceamazon refunded eurosso back euro cooker given amazon chance rectify problem avail next step report following eu europa consumersalso including national consumer arbitration board would urge anyone difficulty amazon would welcome quote reviewwe undoubtedly heading difficult time every penny doubt count kinda take objection ripped offespecially reputed richest man world,0.9772862538166509,0.022713746183349093,0.3146382501402131,0.2,0.37428452311971716,37.42845231197172,Low Trust
Ben G.,/users/5d126bf7f7134be8f529c885,GB,87.0,2020-12-11 19:57:17+00:00,1.0,Don't get hooked in - arrogance at its best,"Appalling service from Amazon. I bought some indoor CCTV cameras from them and the USB cables were only around 4 foot. The original page had not stated this. When you consider that most residential rooms will be around at least 7 foot high, a 4 foot power cable is no use. Since it was a 4 pack, this is a bit ridiculous and would cost a lot to separately purchase 8ft cables - you need a bit of gather. I took this up with Amazon and spoke to at least 10 agents, both online and subsequently on the phone. In that time, the product page was conveniently updated. I had the original to compare but this made little difference as they were coming up with every excuse under the sun as to why they would not send me any replacement cables. Despite my contact being with Amazon, they tried to get me to deal with the seller directly in China - it's not my place to have to do this and its highly unlikely that they would respond. It's worth pointing out, Which, the Consumer champion, exposed fundamentally security flaws in a significant number of CCTV cameras sold as also refused to remove them. You can use any search engine to find this. Not only arrogant attitude but also deceitful behaviour experienced from Amazon today. I won't be dealing with them again and I'll start the process of returning all of my purchases and selling the two Echo Dots to make my home Amazon free. I burn more calories switching the lights off at the walls anyway - Alexa takes longer to respond!",2020-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,11.0,1479,273,43,9,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,appalling service amazon bought indoor cctv camera usb cable around foot original page stated consider residential room around least foot high foot power cable use since pack bit ridiculous would cost lot separately purchase ft cable need bit gather took amazon spoke least agent online subsequently phone time product page conveniently updated original compare made little difference coming every excuse sun would send replacement cable despite contact amazon tried get deal seller directly china place highly unlikely would respond worth pointing consumer champion exposed fundamentally security flaw significant number cctv camera sold also refused remove use search engine find arrogant attitude also deceitful behaviour experienced amazon today wont dealing ill start process returning purchase selling two echo dot make home amazon free burn calorie switching light wall anyway alexa take longer respond,0.32338177432880694,0.676618225671193,0.1531127313516545,0.2,0.6689316591059273,66.89316591059273,Medium Trust
Pritti Brown,/users/5fd38c4da07568001a4a6fb8,US,1.0,2020-12-11 15:25:37+00:00,1.0,I am fed up with Amazon!,"I am fed up with Amazon!! Their delivery service is trash!! When they deliver as expected, they're great, but when they lie about ""attempted""/false deliveries, it pisses me off, and this time I'm beyond pissed off!! Out of the few years that I've been ordering from Amazon, they've been ok, except for the fact that their lazy employees will lie and say that they either delivered/attempted a delivery, when they didn't deliver nor attempt anything!! I'm sick of them doing this, then they have the nerve to tell me to wait on a refund for a fukn product that I've never received. Wth!! You guys didn't deliver anything to me so wth am I waiting for?!! 😳 Fuk this, I'm not handicapped, so I'll just take my ass to the store and grab what I need.",2020-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,11.0,745,136,24,6,0.0,0,12,2,1,Suspicious,fed amazon delivery service trash deliver expected theyre great lie attemptedfalse delivery piss time im beyond pissed year ive ordering amazon theyve ok except fact lazy employee lie say either deliveredattempted delivery didnt deliver attempt anything im sick nerve tell wait refund fukn product ive never received wth guy didnt deliver anything wth waiting 😳 fuk im handicapped ill take as store grab need,0.9999995430808053,4.569191947023654e-07,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.31525541634518345,31.525541634518344,Low Trust
