Maine Supper Club,/users/5ce1896addb8fd2b0701b0c1,US,4.0,2020-12-09 22:04:43+00:00,1.0,Absolute Fraud Committed by Amazon,"Purchased a wine fridge on amazon. When it arrived and we plugged it in, the light came on but the unit never cooled. It was also missing the door handle to the fridge. Arranged a return and sent back the next day. That was 11 weeks ago. I have reached out five times and each time told I had to wait for the special team to get back to me to process the refund. Five times I've been told that and five times I've had no follow up. In the midst of filing a credit card dispute over the matter. Despite clear documentation of the approved return and tracking showing the item returned back to amazon, I'm out $500. Absolute disgusting, abysmal service. I have cancelled prime and will never order another thing from this despicable, great, inhuman company.",2020-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,9.0,755,139,34,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased wine fridge amazon arrived plugged light came unit never cooled also missing door handle fridge arranged return sent back next day week ago reached five time time told wait special team get back process refund five time ive told five time ive follow midst filing credit card dispute matter despite clear documentation approved return tracking showing item returned back amazon im absolute disgusting abysmal service cancelled prime never order another thing despicable great inhuman company,0.006727390809749419,0.9932726091902506,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.8122280039781875,81.22280039781874,High Trust
