Chelsea,/users/56f00d0b0000ff000a1087e1,GB,26.0,2020-12-15 08:58:56+00:00,1.0,Customer service is awful,Customer service is awful! Our Amazon fire stick broke after a couple of months we paid nearly £50 for. When we told them we was told to pack it up and send it to them so they could fix it and send it back. I paid £50 for this and you expect me to wait until you've fixed the broken stick? I said no we want a new one sent out. They said we will send a new one out once we receive the tracking information. A week after us sending the tracking information we've heard nothing. Eager to take your money but not to help you! They then sent the repaired stick with no charger or remote. Since we have plugged it in our TV it hasn't been detected and having to take it out and plug it back in each time. Useless.,2020-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,15.0,708,144,25,4,6.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,customer service awful amazon fire stick broke couple month paid nearly £ told told pack send could fix send back paid £ expect wait youve fixed broken stick said want new one sent said send new one receive tracking information week u sending tracking information weve heard nothing eager take money help sent repaired stick charger remote since plugged tv hasnt detected take plug back time useless,0.6785908451696834,0.3214091548303166,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.47685712929401414,47.68571292940141,Low Trust
