T kall,/users/5fd0e234e8176d0019e28193,US,2.0,2020-12-09 14:42:11+00:00,1.0,Buyer BEWARE of Amazon fraud,"Buyer BEWARE! Amazon are scammers. I have now realized how this company cheats people and I’m sick in my stomach. So I ordered over $3500 worth of merchandise so by night fall my card declined 2 separate orders one totaling over $600! When I received decline notice I called Wells Fargo immediately but it was following morning. They explained I had reached my limit but Amazon had reran charges ( as they always do in this case and that policy is stated on their website page) and  charges was cleared.Well in my acct they still have my order as needing another payment method. I spent 2 hours on chat to climb latter to corporate to get disconnected. Then spoke with supervisor in Philippines Diana that didn’t even know how to start to correct this. The issue is not hardly 1 charge from my orders Match charges took from my debit card. There is no way to cross trace it. Not even with printing each item with images individually because charges even still  do not MATCH or add up! I have now lost $696 of my Christmas money. I had to sit down and add every orders up then add up every charge on my debit card. That was only way to compare and sure enough I’m short over $600! amazon customer service ask me same question s for hours in hopes I’ll just give in and loose the funds. They have no way of dissecting  this or are just not willing. I’m going to call my bank and since charges don’t match will credit back all of it but I did order my Christmas through Amazon. I’m an honest person so want to pay what I owe but will not pay a cent more. This situation feels impossible, frustrating, and just completely unethical and horrible right here at Christmas.I’m now convinced Amazon is running away with tons of money from people. For anyone who reads this sit down and go through your bank account compared to your actual orders placed. I think you will also be in disbelief!!!!  What’s even worse is something similar happened last year and after going through my accounts with my bank Amazon was ordered to credit back $2800. Once again charges on my card did not match orders or individual items. If this has happened to me 2 times this has to be happening to others. My suspicion is most of the public trust and are not looking twice at charges and comparing. I cannot imagine the gain Amazon has if they are doing this to so many others. I had to share this and warn others. I think I’m done with Amazon forever! I will go back to in person buying or find another vendor like wal mart who has been around forever and charges ALWAYS match exactly just like target, just like Sephora, etc. etc. That company Amazon  is worth millions so to then steal from the public is just disgusting and the greenest of GREED I have ever witnessed!!!!",2020-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,9.0,2748,507,28,5,0.0,0,13,2,1,Suspicious,buyer beware amazon scammer realized company cheat people i’m sick stomach ordered worth merchandise night fall card declined separate order one totaling received decline notice called well fargo immediately following morning explained reached limit amazon reran charge always case policy stated website page charge clearedwell acct still order needing another payment method spent hour chat climb latter corporate get disconnected spoke supervisor philippine diana didn’t even know start correct issue hardly charge order match charge took debit card way cross trace even printing item image individually charge even still match add lost christmas money sit add every order add every charge debit card way compare sure enough i’m short amazon customer service ask question hour hope i’ll give loose fund way dissecting willing i’m going call bank since charge don’t match credit back order christmas amazon i’m honest person want pay owe pay cent situation feel impossible frustrating completely unethical horrible right christmasi’m convinced amazon running away ton money people anyone read sit go bank account compared actual order placed think also disbelief what’s even worse something similar happened last year going account bank amazon ordered credit back charge card match order individual item happened time happening others suspicion public trust looking twice charge comparing cannot imagine gain amazon many others share warn others think i’m done amazon forever go back person buying find another vendor like wal mart around forever charge always match exactly like target like sephora etc etc company amazon worth million steal public disgusting greenest greed ever witnessed,0.9999998143804667,1.8561953329943037e-07,0.2843522153673584,0.2,0.3568705358832383,35.68705358832383,Low Trust
