Kerry,/users/5c1a12d325a092da6e41454a,IE,10.0,2020-12-08 17:49:00+00:00,1.0,Terrible customer service,"Terrible customer service - couldn't locate my account though my address so said they couldn't help me. I checked my online account and read out the address exactly as it was and yet they still couldn't find me. I asked is there any other way of finding it , that I could give any other details and she said no. How is that a good system. I'm a customer service manager myself and have never had an issue like this where they can only access your account with one detail. The reason I was calling in the first place was because I ordered something 3 weeks ago as a Xmas present and there was no update since 28th November, they then decided to tell me for some reason it was returned to the warehouse. If I hadn't messaged them were they ever going to tell me this. Then the cheek to offer a gift card, I wouldn't use Amazon again so would be of no use to me.",2020-12-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,8.0,859,168,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,terrible customer service couldnt locate account though address said couldnt help checked online account read address exactly yet still couldnt find asked way finding could give detail said good system im customer service manager never issue like access account one detail reason calling first place ordered something week ago xmas present update since th november decided tell reason returned warehouse hadnt messaged ever going tell cheek offer gift card wouldnt use amazon would use,0.02356149683266619,0.9764385031673338,0.09422321929332586,0.2,0.807063895442332,80.7063895442332,High Trust
