TRACI H.,/users/5fced7502252ee0019be0518,US,3.0,2020-12-08 01:49:05+00:00,1.0,Prime Membership Became A Waste Of Money,"I had been paying for Prime Membership and had not been receiving several of my items on time. As luck would have it, several of the items not received on time were for someone else. I realize that we are experiencing a pandemic and as a result delivery and customer service has been affected. So, I just overlooked the fact that Prime Delivery Service would sometimes take an extra day of two. In tracking my items, I noticed that delivery was on schedule until my items arrived at the Baltimore. Maryland faculity... At that location. I noticed that large ticket items were delayed for many days and upon inquiry to Amazon, it was discovered that the items were ""lost"". 😮 I was then left with the option of having to reorder the item after receiving a refund or just receiving a refund. This was beyond frustrating because i simply wanted the items. The last straw was ordering a sound bar as a Birthday gift using Prime Delivery. That order was placed on 11/29/20 and arrived at the Baltimore City facility for delivery on 12/4/20. Today is 12/7/20 and it still hasn't arrived. I had to call Amazon Customer Service to find out the status of my order and was told that it appeared to.be ""lost"".yet the tracking system clearly indicated that it was ""delayed"". Had I not contacted Amazon Customer Service, I would STILL be waiting on an item that would never arrive...😮yet it was paid for... So, Amazon did refund my money and I reordered only because I wanted that item and did not have the time to search for another. I cancelled Prime Membership because I was not receiving Prime Membership Service. Amazon faithfully accepted Prime Membership money from my account and totally failed to provide the service that it promised to render. I received items from vendors over seas quicker that I received some of my Prime Membership items. To add insult to injury, Amazon never offered to refund even a small portion of the money that they received for a service they failed to provide. Amazon Customer Service Reps. are polite and friendly and never hesitate to apologize for errors...most of which appear to be caused by corporate administration policies that may need updating As a result,supervisors and customer service reps. are left in an uncomfortable position when dealing with customers that want answers. I loved Amazon, at one time, as they appeared to really care abut customers. Now, it appears to focus more on making money and expanding. So, why are items being ""lost"" at the Baltimore City facility which is responsible for delivery??? Anyway, I started with eBay and have been a customer almost since that establishment started. Most of the same items are offered on eBay and other websites. Ebay is probably where I belong... Amazon can't seem to handle expansion. BUYER, BEWARE... Track your items closely and save your money if you are paying for a Prime Membership.Service and not receiving it. I am truly bothered by this.",2020-12-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,8.0,2944,506,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,paying prime membership receiving several item time luck would several item received time someone else realize experiencing pandemic result delivery customer service affected overlooked fact prime delivery service would sometimes take extra day two tracking item noticed delivery schedule item arrived baltimore maryland faculity location noticed large ticket item delayed many day upon inquiry amazon discovered item lost 😮 left option reorder item receiving refund receiving refund beyond frustrating simply wanted item last straw ordering sound bar birthday gift using prime delivery order placed arrived baltimore city facility delivery today still hasnt arrived call amazon customer service find status order told appeared tobe lostyet tracking system clearly indicated delayed contacted amazon customer service would still waiting item would never arrive😮yet paid amazon refund money reordered wanted item time search another cancelled prime membership receiving prime membership service amazon faithfully accepted prime membership money account totally failed provide service promised render received item vendor sea quicker received prime membership item add insult injury amazon never offered refund even small portion money received service failed provide amazon customer service rep polite friendly never hesitate apologize errorsmost appear caused corporate administration policy may need updating resultsupervisors customer service rep left uncomfortable position dealing customer want answer loved amazon one time appeared really care abut customer appears focus making money expanding item lost baltimore city facility responsible delivery anyway started ebay customer almost since establishment started item offered ebay website ebay probably belong amazon cant seem handle expansion buyer beware track item closely save money paying prime membershipservice receiving truly bothered,0.0033078709311610372,0.996692129068839,0.28379136287156476,0.2,0.8551043371087325,85.51043371087324,High Trust
