lapsy,/users/5fcd0a8b82fe94001919f095,CA,1.0,2020-12-06 17:04:51+00:00,2.0,Price difference,"I noticed Amazon is getting more aggressive  and controlling of customer experiences.. I could not even find phone number or email address to ask for refund not until I googled..I usually buy products that are shipped by Amazon. I reviewed the product price that I had purchased, custard powder, for 12.04 including taxes (free delivery) for 300 g which was very expensive compared to my grocery store sold $5.99. When I attempted to return, 7.50 was deducted from the refund TTL as delivery charge which left me with only $4.54  I did not proceed. I called their call center and was issued a credit . When I reviewed the price difference at Amazon's site they declined to post my review . They did the same thing with my previous purchase.. Their prices are creeping up...",2020-12-06 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,6.0,773,135,16,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,noticed amazon getting aggressive controlling customer experience could even find phone number email address ask refund googledi usually buy product shipped amazon reviewed product price purchased custard powder including tax free delivery g expensive compared grocery store sold attempted return deducted refund ttl delivery charge left proceed called call center issued credit reviewed price difference amazon site declined post review thing previous purchase price creeping,0.016280281942359007,0.983719718057641,0.07571508693213685,0.4,1.1070028764152477,110.70028764152478,High Trust
