Manateaz,/users/5f0c76b82b69c0a66c1ed7f8,US,2.0,2020-12-06 14:10:56+00:00,1.0,Really has gone downhill - deliveries go missing all the time,"Especially now that they stopped using USPS and started using 'Amazon Logistics' for delivery, I've had SO MANY misdelivered, missing and possibly stolen packages (mostly food which I need...). The only way Amazon customer service deals with it is issuing refunds. The last 3 food orders (prime pantry, Whole Foods) were not delivered to the correct address and subsequently went missing. Status on my order page said 'delayed' but when I contacted customer service they said the packages were missing. This is not acceptable! Back when they used USPS or UPS for everything Amazon was a lot more reliable - I used to exclusively order foods since I'm avoiding stores due to pandemic. Now it seems not possible due to nonstop delivery problems.",2020-12-06 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,6.0,743,123,61,11,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,especially stopped using usps started using amazon logistics delivery ive many misdelivered missing possibly stolen package mostly food need way amazon customer service deal issuing refund last food order prime pantry whole food delivered correct address subsequently went missing status order page said delayed contacted customer service said package missing acceptable back used usps ups everything amazon lot reliable used exclusively order food since im avoiding store due pandemic seems possible due nonstop delivery problem,0.024138385985128047,0.9758616140148719,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.8017277784039587,80.17277784039587,High Trust
AnkGames,/users/5fcc52a90f30bd00198d5879,US,1.0,2020-12-06 03:43:37+00:00,1.0,Customer non-Service.,"Amazon's customer service does not read or simply does not care. Here is an actual email response ignoring my request: Your account has been closed. All payment methods and addresses have been removed and I've unsubscribed you from our mailing list. Your account is no longer accessible to you or anyone else.We've appreciated your business and wish you the best of luck in the future. Best regards,Amazon.com Original Message---------------12/05/20 02:36:34 PSTYour Name: My NameComments:NOTICE: In reference to previous closing requests, this Amazon account MUST stay OPEN for 30 days prior to closing as the account owner has pending transactions.-End of Email-See how they completely ignored my request to keep my account open for my pending transactions? Also, on a relevant note, Amazon's products are all sold by unverifiable third party vendors that falsely advertise products as larger or more sturdily made than they actually are. Furthermore, full refunds are practically impossible, while other refunds are seldom ever reimbursed for the full sales, tax, and shipping price you paid, and other times you are often stuck with a fraudster's faulty product with no way to get fully reimbursed or compensated.I will not ever buy anything online ever again due to my many bad experiences on all types of online vendors. If an item isn't in store where you can get a accurate look at it then good luck. The phrase Caveat Emptor still rings true, especially on the internet.",2020-12-06 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,6.0,1479,238,21,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service read simply care actual email response ignoring request account closed payment method address removed ive unsubscribed mailing list account longer accessible anyone elseweve appreciated business wish best luck future best regardsamazoncom original message pstyour name namecommentsnotice reference previous closing request amazon account must stay open day prior closing account owner pending transactionsend emailsee completely ignored request keep account open pending transaction also relevant note amazon product sold unverifiable third party vendor falsely advertise product larger sturdily made actually furthermore full refund practically impossible refund seldom ever reimbursed full sale tax shipping price paid time often stuck fraudsters faulty product way get fully reimbursed compensatedi ever buy anything online ever due many bad experience type online vendor item isnt store get accurate look good luck phrase caveat emptor still ring true especially internet,0.015243187281277343,0.9847568127187226,0.1334828939988783,0.2,0.819074985159137,81.9074985159137,High Trust
John Vuitton,/users/5e12d05a31bb5a616596079f,GB,35.0,2020-12-05 21:38:25+00:00,1.0,I pay for prime for a good reason,"I pay for prime for a good reason, to get a better service than the usual standard of service. I waited in all day and as I was sitting I got an email stating they attempted to deliver, to no avail. I was sitting at home when they emailed. I have a buzzer service and a door bell, so there was no excuse for them not to come to the door. I was so appalled and angry that this occurred. Why? I just don't understand why? Is it a crime to want an honest and professional service?",2020-12-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,5.0,477,97,33,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,pay prime good reason get better service usual standard service waited day sitting got email stating attempted deliver avail sitting home emailed buzzer service door bell excuse come door appalled angry occurred dont understand crime want honest professional service,0.09118853755679593,0.9088114624432041,0.05440269209197981,0.2,0.765286269639998,76.5286269639998,High Trust
