Ralph Brown Jr.,/users/5d70379de9e2513ec887bd57,US,10.0,2020-12-04 17:23:56+00:00,1.0,Horrible Service,"Amazon is becoming less and less accessible, outsourcing calls to non-USA locations. These operators can rarely help with the support needed. Now Amazon won't allow those operators to redirect to US locations OR Supervisors. Amazon is purposefully ignoring their customers and providing sub-par service to save a buck. Save a buck, lose a customer.",2020-12-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,4.0,348,54,16,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon becoming less less accessible outsourcing call nonusa location operator rarely help support needed amazon wont allow operator redirect u location supervisor amazon purposefully ignoring customer providing subpar service save buck save buck lose customer,0.07384900845268222,0.9261509915473178,0.03028603477285474,0.2,0.7691327027282299,76.91327027282298,High Trust
