Night Shade,/users/5d5e13823d6bf54f7a5a1274,GB,20.0,2020-12-04 12:15:24+00:00,1.0,I have been an Amazon customer for 10…,"I have been an Amazon customer for 10 years. I cannot believe how rude these people were to me today. I paid for Huyu subscription for £4.99 and it said Prime Video was included. I purchased this on the 28th of November. I have just been paid from work today then all of a sudden I was charged £7.99 then when I spoke to them to ask for a refund. A lady said she couldn't see the transaction I said you just charged me how can you not see it? She then transferred me to another incompetent person and he was saying he couldn't see it and how I should contact my bank to get the money back. I said instead of that I can take a picture that the money has been taken he ignored me and kept asking the same questions and repeating himself. Then I asked to speak to his manager he said I have a supervisor I said to him did you just hear what I said I said? MANAGER. He replied well we class a supervisor the same as a manager. The supervisor was beyond rude to the point I never want to buy anything on Amazon again for anything. He said that in the past we have made exceptions for you and that how I have accidentally purchased Amazon Prime when I checked out of paying for an item. I thought you cheeky idiot. I told him I already paid for Prime Video so why am I being charged again? How can I accidentally purchase something? These people must have thought I was stupid. I am so disgusted with the lies and disrespect of these people. The supervisor was saying he will make an exception and refund Huyu and Amazon Prime but in the future, we will not refund you if this happens again. I said to him as far as I'm concerned don't go on like you guys are holier than thou since you want to bring up the past things I bought on Amazon once in 2015 you charged me £79.99 without my authorization so don't even go there. I said to him you weren't there when I was refunded Amazon Prime in the past so don't go on like it was my fault. I am so done with Amazon and they don't deserve me as a customer. I will be buying from eBay as someone else said their customer services are much nicer. I have never had this problem with their team. Adios Amazon you're not worth it. I will never waste my hard earned money on there again!!!",2020-12-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,4.0,2223,438,38,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,amazon customer year cannot believe rude people today paid huyu subscription £ said prime video included purchased th november paid work today sudden charged £ spoke ask refund lady said couldnt see transaction said charged see transferred another incompetent person saying couldnt see contact bank get money back said instead take picture money taken ignored kept asking question repeating asked speak manager said supervisor said hear said said manager replied well class supervisor manager supervisor beyond rude point never want buy anything amazon anything said past made exception accidentally purchased amazon prime checked paying item thought cheeky idiot told already paid prime video charged accidentally purchase something people must thought stupid disgusted lie disrespect people supervisor saying make exception refund huyu amazon prime future refund happens said far im concerned dont go like guy holier thou since want bring past thing bought amazon charged £ without authorization dont even go said werent refunded amazon prime past dont go like fault done amazon dont deserve customer buying ebay someone else said customer service much nicer never problem team adios amazon youre worth never waste hard earned money,0.7296033895224368,0.27039661047756325,0.24565339315759954,0.2,0.48432898387030154,48.43289838703016,Low Trust
radhica dhuri,/users/5f64c2d4a90bb011310c2bbc,IN,2.0,2020-12-04 11:33:02+00:00,1.0,Amazon sent me an EMPTY BOX INSTEAD OF A LIPSTICK.,"I purchased two lipsticks from Amazon. They were both from the Colorbar brand, Sinful matte lipcolor. I paid by Visa card. They received the payment and I waited for the order. However i was delivered an EMPTY BOX?! I was shocked and contacted the customer care but they were rude to me and said they will INVESTIGATE?! I was so dissatisfied they did not promise to get my product delivered correctly since it was a mistake on their part. They just wasted my time and said it will take 5 more days?? I had purchased them as a gift for a friend and now they were gonna be late??! How horrible is this... I used to trust Amazon and shop there frequently however now I would advise everyone to never pay them by card they have terrible resellers who send you EMPTY BOXES after getting Paid in full by card. So dissatisfied and disappointed with Amazon. I still haven’t received the products I paid for lets hope they take customer complaints seriously atleast. Overall a big thumbs down👎",2020-12-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,4.0,984,178,50,10,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,purchased two lipstick amazon colorbar brand sinful matte lipcolor paid visa card received payment waited order however delivered empty box shocked contacted customer care rude said investigate dissatisfied promise get product delivered correctly since mistake part wasted time said take day purchased gift friend gonna late horrible used trust amazon shop frequently however would advise everyone never pay card terrible resellers send empty box getting paid full card dissatisfied disappointed amazon still haven’t received product paid let hope take customer complaint seriously atleast overall big thumb down👎,0.5626537471874168,0.4373462528125832,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.538639475256544,53.863947525654396,Medium Trust
