Gabrielle M,/users/5fc77c370a6ce00019bfcc02,US,1.0,2020-12-10 01:35:02+00:00,1.0,I really starting to hate amazon,"I really starting to hate amazon! They keep taking charges out of my account that is not even documented in their system. The first charge was $12.99 and the rep did not know where it came from. She then told me I have to dispute it with my bank.But oh, it gets better. I bought an item recently, the money was taken out of my account. I checked my bank account today and guess what?! My account is overdrawn 700 dollars. I called the rep , she said it is your bank letting us know you actually have the money in your account.I am so pissed off 😡🤬😤So everytime I order from amazon I am going to have to dispute the transactions with my bank..yea okAlso, my sister's card info got stolen yesterday. Someone in San Fran decided to buy an airbBNB for a night smh! Now we both had to close our cards. I am sure Amazon is responsible for her card info being stolen.",2020-12-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,10.0,860,166,32,6,8.0,0,3,1,0,Genuine,really starting hate amazon keep taking charge account even documented system first charge rep know came told dispute bankbut oh get better bought item recently money taken account checked bank account today guess account overdrawn dollar called rep said bank letting u know actually money accounti pissed 😡🤬😤so everytime order amazon going dispute transaction bankyea okalso sister card info got stolen yesterday someone san fran decided buy airbbnb night smh close card sure amazon responsible card info stolen,0.7559757768793113,0.24402422312068872,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.44063241442069206,44.063241442069206,Low Trust
