Canna Bella,/users/5fc722e26b07160019de8e48,US,1.0,2020-12-02 05:17:10+00:00,1.0,Amazon has the most abusive gaslight…,"Amazon has the most abusive gaslighting call center employees I’ve ever encountered. My dogs medicine is a week late. A WEEK! First package was destroyed and the refunded instead of sending a new one! Now, 2 days after a “rush delivery” of a new one, still not here. When I spoke to NICOLE (call center in WA possibly Everett) she acted like she was high on barbiturates. She was almost slurring. And tells me she sees no problem with the fact that my package didn’t even make it on a truck today. She then proceeds to BLAME ME of all things telling me they needed me to update info. What info? When I asked she didn’t answer! She was messed up on something. And to top it off she acted like the first time the driver didn’t deliver was due to my building being inaccessible. Funny thing is, I live in a complex with an amazon locker that is open until 10pm 7 days a week. He “attempted” to deliver at 5pm with delivery instructions to deliver to my apartment if necessary. Their drivers are being lazy and incompetent. I delivered for 2 years, it’s the most simple job. Amazon hires the dumbest of the dumb, I think that’s pretty obvious at this point. My mom also works for corporate (she’s gonna help me with this issue) and absolutely hates it. She said it’s the worst company to work for. And she did say they have SO MANY ISSUES with their lower level employees like the call center, fulfillment, & delivery and that they are always hiring BECAUSE they have to fire so many people. You would think the company would get it together and hire competent people, pay them enough, so they dont have to keep cycling. Looking at this objectively, this can fail a company even one as big and powerful as amazon. If they anger enough customers, a new company rises who treats their employees better, has smarter employees, satisfies customers, and offers the same type of service as amazon....they will be gone. And that will happen because it always happens. So in conclusion to hell amazon & all the incompetent employees they hire (not my mom, she’s leaving after getting her stocks haha) Don’t use them unless u absolutely have to. P.S: they have been raising prices on many items & through my bargain shopping I’ve been finding much better deals on items on other websites (and better quality) & in stores.",2020-12-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,12.0,2.0,2308,416,37,6,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,amazon abusive gaslighting call center employee i’ve ever encountered dog medicine week late week first package destroyed refunded instead sending new one day “rush delivery” new one still spoke nicole call center wa possibly everett acted like high barbiturate almost slurring tell see problem fact package didn’t even make truck today proceeds blame thing telling needed update info info asked didn’t answer messed something top acted like first time driver didn’t deliver due building inaccessible funny thing live complex amazon locker open pm day week “attempted” deliver pm delivery instruction deliver apartment necessary driver lazy incompetent delivered year it’s simple job amazon hire dumbest dumb think that’s pretty obvious point mom also work corporate she’s gonna help issue absolutely hate said it’s worst company work say many issue lower level employee like call center fulfillment delivery always hiring fire many people would think company would get together hire competent people pay enough dont keep cycling looking objectively fail company even one big powerful amazon anger enough customer new company rise treat employee better smarter employee satisfies customer offer type service amazonthey gone happen always happens conclusion hell amazon incompetent employee hire mom she’s leaving getting stock haha don’t use unless u absolutely p raising price many item bargain shopping i’ve finding much better deal item website better quality store,0.6644506642139469,0.3