Claire Noser,/users/5fc297df44c93b001a545428,US,1.0,2020-11-28 18:33:12+00:00,1.0,I ordered an item for $170,"I ordered an item for $170. It was a prime item and during the shipping processes something got messed up and I got a notification it was undeliverable. I call customer service because I was told my giftcard payment could be refunded back to my visa so I could go ahead and re-order the item. I re-ordered with a CC and the refund went back to my account. I called customer service again as now I have a balance on my account and the $170 spent on my CC and they told me whoever I talked to was wrong and the money cannot go on my credit card. I would have waited to re-purchase this item if I knew that, I was mislead and then no one tried to fix the mistake they made.",2020-11-28 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,28.0,670,134,26,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item prime item shipping process something got messed got notification undeliverable call customer service told giftcard payment could refunded back visa could go ahead reorder item reordered cc refund went back account called customer service balance account spent cc told whoever talked wrong money cannot go credit card would waited repurchase item knew mislead one tried fix mistake made,0.016227760024766075,0.9837722399752339,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.8069169668748856,80.69169668748856,High Trust
