Joanna Rosas,/users/5fbb192805e509001aa71420,US,1.0,2020-11-23 02:06:45+00:00,2.0,I have been an amazon prime member for…,"I have been an amazon prime member for several years now. Most of time they do a decent job. Except for the way too many deliveries that were placed at other people’s addresses. Which I have complained about and customer service has mostly been great. This last incident though has really upset me. Yesterday I was supposed to be getting an item for a project. I have family flying into town over thanksgiving and needed to have this project done before they get here. Amazon marked it as delivered to a secure location but nothing had been delivered. I contacted customer service and they were great. They refunded the purchase price and assured me that it was marked as delivered in error and I would still get the item. Which shortly after I did receive it. However, I have 2 aquariums and one crashed so I had to move my German blue ram to a 10 gallon tank. Seeing he was so stressed in the 10 gallon I bought a 20 long from petco to rehouse him. The other other items I ordered from Amazon were an air pump, background and a heater that were supposed to arrive the next day. So, amazon decided to make sure I didn’t get those items in the timeframe they were supposed to be delivered. Now, I have to deal with a stressed almost dead blue ram because amazon decided to retaliate and say all my items needed for the 20 gallon were not going to arrive for another 24 to 48 hours since I complained they day before. If my blue ram dies because of amazon not delivering my items on the day I needed them, I’m going to raise hell. We have been paying for prime for years now. Amazon should take responsibility for delivering on the day they said they would. And not wait until the day of delivery then just tell you it’s running late. I really did not want to be still trying to set up this tank while family is here over the holidays. And for anyone who has a fish tank or a blue ram, you know it is time sensitive emergency situation. Bad on amazon for delaying my orders because I complained the day before.",2020-11-23 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,23.0,2009,379,39,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime member several year time decent job except way many delivery placed people’s address complained customer service mostly great last incident though really upset yesterday supposed getting item project family flying town thanksgiving needed project done get amazon marked delivered secure location nothing delivered contacted customer service great refunded purchase price assured marked delivered error would still get item shortly receive however aquarium one crashed move german blue ram gallon tank seeing stressed gallon bought long petco rehouse item ordered amazon air pump background heater supposed arrive next day amazon decided make sure didn’t get item timeframe supposed delivered deal stressed almost dead blue ram amazon decided retaliate say item needed gallon going arrive another hour since complained day blue ram dy amazon delivering item day needed i’m going raise hell paying prime year amazon take responsibility delivering day said would wait day delivery tell it’s running late really want still trying set tank family holiday anyone fish tank blue ram know time sensitive emergency situation bad amazon delaying order complained day,0.006385916573094893,0.9936140834269052,0.2125630959057768,0.4,1.139319660894608,113.93196608946079,High Trust
