Raffs,/users/5806409f0000ff000a4eb814,GB,17.0,2020-11-18 10:31:10+00:00,1.0,Not the marketplace to trust........,"Ordered 7th November, paid 639.99 for a jll treadmill through amazon. Bought, paid, marked as dispatched out for delivery 17th Nov. Waited and waited on 17th, thought I would check with Arrow Xl the delivery company on the parcel tracking. It said out for delivery. Contacted Arrow, no delivery as we the customer hadn't booked a date, we had NOT been contacted. Booked date for 19th Nov. Less than one hour after received an email to say delivery and item cancelled from Arrow. Arrow xl stated cancelled by customer. NOT SO, LIARS. Contacted Arrow Xl, they said Jll hadn't given them the product to deliver so Arrow cancelled, yet they marked as cancelled by customer. Spoke to Jll the seller of the JLL TREADMILL we bought, they said cancelled by Arrow, until product comes back from Arrow xl no refund.  We the customer have not had the product, have not cancelled this, and will require a full refund NOW.MY ADVICE IN THE STRONGEST TERMS POSSIBLE IS DO NOT TOUCH EITHER JLL, ARROW XL WITH A VERY VERY LONG BARGEPOLE.Amazon were no better, they said nothing to dowith them contact seller. Really ? Well my amazon prime is now cancelled and no more orders for Amazon as I thought they were a reputable company I could trust, clearly this is not the case!! I have now cancelled my prime membership, and one long standing customer lost to amazon, NOT THE MARKET PLACE TO TRUST in my experience,  more the marketplace that likes to wash its hands of you.",2020-11-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,18.0,1453,257,36,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,ordered th november paid jll treadmill amazon bought paid marked dispatched delivery th nov waited waited th thought would check arrow xl delivery company parcel tracking said delivery contacted arrow delivery customer hadnt booked date contacted booked date th nov less one hour received email say delivery item cancelled arrow arrow xl stated cancelled customer liar contacted arrow xl said jll hadnt given product deliver arrow cancelled yet marked cancelled customer spoke jll seller jll treadmill bought said cancelled arrow product come back arrow xl refund customer product cancelled require full refund nowmy advice strongest term possible touch either jll arrow xl long bargepoleamazon better said nothing dowith contact seller really well amazon prime cancelled order amazon thought reputable company could trust clearly case cancelled prime membership one long standing customer lost amazon market place trust experience marketplace like wash hand,0.20223399719509694,0.7977660028049031,0.1441390914189568,0.2,0.7277108196862428,72.77108196862429,Medium Trust
