Alli Bay,/users/5fb36ac61a6a17001aab70aa,US,1.0,2020-11-17 06:16:49+00:00,1.0,Bezos should be ashamed of his self!!,"Amazon's quality is horrific now!  Foreign sellers peddle trash (like, literally); shipping speed is much slower than before; and reviews are fake - bought and paid for lies.  So, you really can't trust anything!  I knew that going into my purchase, but I took a chance because the deal was good.  I guess that I should have known.  The item arrived late, damaged, and not as expected, as it was pictured and described as a set of three and what arrived was just one.  The seller will only provide a partial refund - blaming his false advertising on ""poor English"" - and Amazon won't do anything!  They keep saying that I've already gotten a full refund, so there's nothing else that they can do.  The thing is - I haven't gotten a refund at all.  You should be able to trust a giant like Amazon.  There's no way that I'd ever buy online from some random Chinese pop-up shop that I hadn't heard of - but getting Amazon's backing makes you feel protected.  Wrong!!!  Amazon allows its sellers to dupe you.  So now, I'm out of money and patience - the latter exacerbated by poorly trained, difficult-to-understand reps who put you on hold just to tell you ""I don't know""  Guess my Christmas shopping will be done elsewhere this year!",2020-11-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,17.0,1231,220,37,7,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,amazon quality horrific foreign seller peddle trash like literally shipping speed much slower review fake bought paid lie really cant trust anything knew going purchase took chance deal good guess known item arrived late damaged expected pictured described set three arrived one seller provide partial refund blaming false advertising poor english amazon wont anything keep saying ive already gotten full refund there nothing else thing havent gotten refund able trust giant like amazon there way id ever buy online random chinese popup shop hadnt heard getting amazon backing make feel protected wrong amazon allows seller dupe im money patience latter exacerbated poorly trained difficulttounderstand rep put hold tell dont know guess christmas shopping done elsewhere year,0.9955138168141848,0.0044861831858151735,0.12338754907459339,0.2,0.32692060140782625,32.69206014078262,Low Trust
