James,/users/5fb25c5d2f2525001a80f038,IE,1.0,2020-11-16 11:44:14+00:00,1.0,Why do I say “don’t buy from Amazon”,Why do I say “don’t buy from Amazon”? On July 25th I ordered from Amazon UK a German electric razor. I got an email from Ninth Avenue taking the money and saying I could monitor the order at an R.R.Donnelley number. There was no info at this number. In August I complained that no razor had been delivered. They apologised for this “inconvenience”. Later I got a US mailed sealed envelope with an empty razor case. They ignored when I emailed this fact. They said the goods had been sent from a US warehouse and I should ask the local post and tell them the results. I told them I would be laughed out of it if I asked what happened to goods sent from an unknown US depot on a date unknown. I asked many times for my money back. I am still asking. Their ‘support service’ Headrush emailed that they had now satisfied my query which they were closing. As of 15 November I have received no razor and no money.,2020-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,16.0,907,173,36,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,say “don’t buy amazon” july th ordered amazon uk german electric razor got email ninth avenue taking money saying could monitor order rrdonnelley number info number august complained razor delivered apologised “inconvenience” later got u mailed sealed envelope empty razor case ignored emailed fact said good sent u warehouse ask local post tell result told would laughed asked happened good sent unknown u depot date unknown asked many time money back still asking ‘support service’ headrush emailed satisfied query closing november received razor money,0.007388314743749869,0.9926116852562501,0.09702748177229388,0.2,0.8157113389825839,81.57113389825838,High Trust
ELIZABETH WOODS,/users/55cbe57c0000ff0001d3c476,US,10.0,2020-11-16 08:47:06+00:00,5.0,Amazon Next Day Delivery,"I never knew that Amazon had next day and Sunday delivery.I started shopping on Amazon 2 months ago. I wish that I had known about the excellent service Amazon provides.Tonight my packages were delivered in a hertz rental van. I was able to track the drivers arrival to my home.It's good that I went down to meet him. Becuz he was delivering more packages than he could carry at one time.I went and found him a dolly to haul all his packages.( ALL DRIVERS SHOULD CARRY A DOLLY.)He was nice and thanked me for helping him.I'm becoming a regular shopper on Amazon now.I said goodbye to Walmart, Target, Ebay, Wish, and Aliexpress.My favorite place to buy everything I need is on Amazon.Not all orders will arrive the next day. Only orders that Amazon can fill.I must admit. Knowing my things will arrive so fast. Makes me want to shop more.Thank Amazon for making me a happy customer.",2020-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,16.0,882,157,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,never knew amazon next day sunday deliveryi started shopping amazon month ago wish known excellent service amazon providestonight package delivered hertz rental van able track driver arrival homeits good went meet becuz delivering package could carry one timei went found dolly haul package driver carry dollyhe nice thanked helping himim becoming regular shopper amazon nowi said goodbye walmart target ebay wish aliexpressmy favorite place buy everything need amazonnot order arrive next day order amazon filli must admit knowing thing arrive fast make want shop morethank amazon making happy customer,0.04300971882852083,0.9569902811714792,0.08805384183959619,1.0,1.9961059089536588,199.61059089536587,High Trust
Danielle Smith,/users/57e2f8c90000ff000a46981d,US,2.0,2020-11-15 23:20:53+00:00,1.0,The customer service is mediocre at…,"The customer service is mediocre at best. I have been waiting for almost 2 weeks for someone to contact me and unlock my account even after I explained to them that it was hacked and the situation has since been resolved. They keep asking me about a ""form"" that I need to fill out, and then they say that they have completed the form and someone will contact me the next day. I've been hearing this every other day since 10/30/2020. I understand that there's a pandemic happening, but that should not stop the workers from doing their job in a decent timeframe.",2020-11-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,15.0,561,103,36,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer service mediocre best waiting almost week someone contact unlock account even explained hacked situation since resolved keep asking form need fill say completed form someone contact next day ive hearing every day since understand there pandemic happening stop worker job decent timeframe,0.013046075747124592,0.9869539242528754,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.805030523539786,80.5030523539786,High Trust
Richard,/users/5012ed7500006400011e1d21,US,16.0,2020-11-15 21:51:49+00:00,1.0,Unreliable delivery with delivery to wrong addresses.,"I have had several packages delivered to the wrong address and have to go searching for them based on the photos provided.  With my most recent purchase of two items they were delivered to the neighbor across the street.  When I went to look for the package it was not there and I have been unable to contact the neighbor but most likely stolen as it was out in the open and near the sidewalk.  I have house numbers placed in three different areas on my house so the drivers are either not paying attention, cannot read, or just don't care.  I now have to wait days for resolution on products I bought that were delivered to the wrong address.  Even the customer service representative could see they were delivered to the wrong address.  Amazon needs to do something about some of their unreliable drivers.",2020-11-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,15.0,807,145,53,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,several package delivered wrong address go searching based photo provided recent purchase two item delivered neighbor across street went look package unable contact neighbor likely stolen open near sidewalk house number placed three different area house driver either paying attention cannot read dont care wait day resolution product bought delivered wrong address even customer service representative could see delivered wrong address amazon need something unreliable driver,0.04356657234522116,0.9564334276547788,0.08132361189007291,0.2,0.794481436205404,79.4481436205404,High Trust
