Hazek,/users/5cd576fc763a2bb26831beb3,GB,8.0,2020-11-12 06:42:34+00:00,1.0,I bought 2 kg of sheep cheese on…,"I bought 2 kg of sheep cheese on Amazon. After receiving the parcel, I realized that the difference in weight was 400gr, so it was really big.I waited 6 days for the goods, so the seller had time to refund the difference. I had to remind myself in personto get your money back. I decided to give a discount on the opinion about a given seller. I have posted photos and a cheese sticker that shows the difference in weight to the offer and the money I paid. But for another time, Amazon blocked my post. I am writing again because recently I had a lot of such situations with Amazon and I can get the impression that Amazon supports frauds. Now it's Christmas and I'm not going to buy on Amazon anymore. They will bubble my e-mail with their crap offers that I will not use to my satisfaction. I hope that the big man's disease will make the Amazon tiny soon",2020-11-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,12.0,857,163,33,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought kg sheep cheese amazon receiving parcel realized difference weight gr really bigi waited day good seller time refund difference remind personto get money back decided give discount opinion given seller posted photo cheese sticker show difference weight offer money paid another time amazon blocked post writing recently lot situation amazon get impression amazon support fraud christmas im going buy amazon anymore bubble email crap offer use satisfaction hope big man disease make amazon tiny soon,0.01130347942119195,0.9886965205788081,0.09141895681435783,0.2,0.8126320516522757,81.26320516522757,High Trust
