Andrew Mosby,/users/5facb984bdde17001afc5fd1,US,1.0,2020-11-12 04:26:49+00:00,1.0,Unimpressed with Amazon's integrity,"Unimpressed with Amazon's integrity and attention in managing sellers. I ordered two items (pairs of shoes) that ""shipped"" together a few months ago, and what I received in the mail was a completely wrong order (a box of golf balls.) I went through the returns process for a replacement (and returned it as an incorrect item shipped and explained the problem in the return request)--repackaged, put their return label on the package, and handed it off to UPS. Everything seemed to be going fine. Then I only got one of the two items that I originally ordered in the replacement; the other was no longer available, but I wasn't notified of this; I had to check when it was still not marked shipped a few weeks later.I contacted customer service the first time to have the unavailable item refunded. That was processed, and everything seemed okay. Weeks later, I got an email saying that I would be charged for the refunded item if they didn't receive the return... Okay, now we have a problem, because I NEVER got this item in the first place. I thought it might have been a mistake with automation, so I disregarded it, but it was not a mistake; I was charged again for that item. I confirmed in tracking that they did receive the GOLF BALLS that they had shipped me originally, contacted customer service again and was refunded for the second charge. Everything was fine... I thought. More than a month later I find an unauthorized charge on my bank statement and went back through my email to find that they had charged me AGAIN for the OTHER item, that a replacement had been sent for, because returns hadn't received the original (again, that was NEVER shipped.) So I had to contact them again to have a refund issued for a double charge.Customer service is fair to work with, but, first, this issue is not one that should have come up in the first place and, second, you have to dig to find the link to chat with a live representative. I'm not sure that they even deserve 1/5 stars.",2020-11-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,12.0,1987,357,35,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,unimpressed amazon integrity attention managing seller ordered two item pair shoe shipped together month ago received mail completely wrong order box golf ball went return process replacement returned incorrect item shipped explained problem return requestrepackaged put return label package handed ups everything seemed going fine got one two item originally ordered replacement longer available wasnt notified check still marked shipped week lateri contacted customer service first time unavailable item refunded processed everything seemed okay week later got email saying would charged refunded item didnt receive return okay problem never got item first place thought might mistake automation disregarded mistake charged item confirmed tracking receive golf ball shipped originally contacted customer service refunded second charge everything fine thought month later find unauthorized charge bank statement went back email find charged item replacement sent return hadnt received original never shipped contact refund issued double chargecustomer service fair work first issue one come first place second dig find link chat live representative im sure even deserve star,0.0035182010623521468,0.9964817989376479,0.20022434099831743,0.2,0.8382857676684874,83.82857676684874,High Trust
