Charles Small,/users/5fac2f629b74c1001af50fb7,US,4.0,2020-11-11 18:45:48+00:00,4.0,Amazon does a good job of policing vendors but not product reviews,"Amazon is a marketplace where many vendors hawk their wares. I have been on Amazon Prime for several years and am satisfied with the service. Amazon does a decent job of policing confidence tricksters. Their product reviews, on the other hand, are not, in my experience, reliable. But so are virtually all of on-line reviews on other sites. Solution? Join Consumer Reports and support CR. Their reviews can be trusted.",2020-11-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,11.0,418,70,66,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon marketplace many vendor hawk ware amazon prime several year satisfied service amazon decent job policing confidence trickster product review hand experience reliable virtually online review site solution join consumer report support cr review trusted,0.026663091096253803,0.9733369089037462,0.03925967470555244,0.8,1.6945203893929837,169.45203893929838,High Trust
Gavla,/users/5c17acf86291ac2150ec73b6,GB,3.0,2020-11-11 17:31:34+00:00,1.0,Amazon! Never again.,"Unfortunately, I have completely lost faith and trust in amazon.I was lucky enough to be able order an xbox series x on preorder day, but it did not arrive on release day. Not ideal, but not the end of the world. The next day, I had a notification that it had been delivered, i.e left with the resident.Impossible, as no-one was home!!! Amazon could not tell me where my parcel was, as far as they were concerned it had been delivered. Struggled to get any sense other than to wait a few days for a refund. Even with a refund(which I have to wait for), i can no longer order the product as it is sold out everywhere I should have ordered with a company where I could have physically picked up the console from the shop. Lesson learned.  DO NOT TRUST AMAZON OR ITS COURIERS WHEN PURCHASING RELEASE DAY PRODUCTS!",2020-11-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,11.0,810,151,20,3,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,unfortunately completely lost faith trust amazoni lucky enough able order xbox series x preorder day arrive release day ideal end world next day notification delivered ie left residentimpossible noone home amazon could tell parcel far concerned delivered struggled get sense wait day refund even refundwhich wait longer order product sold everywhere ordered company could physically picked console shop lesson learned trust amazon courier purchasing release day product,0.8664632049377778,0.13353679506222216,0.08468872686483454,0.2,0.38370614290407795,38.370614290407794,Low Trust
