Quintin W,/users/5defe1622ce6df0934d178f9,US,1.0,2020-11-09 05:04:02+00:00,1.0,Tacky Service and Tacky Customer Service,"1st of all I never get my stuff in 2 days.. Let's just put that out there... I'm fed up! By this time I'm only paying for Prime Video bc ordering products is THE WORST! Here's my breaking point: I planned a birthday party for a child and purchased ALL SUPPLIES from Amazon. Even the birthday outfit! I ordered on Tuesday! I was told I would receive my items by FRIDAY that was pushing it considering the party was Saturday but whatever.. Friday came all I got was the table cover. The other items I received an email saying I wouldn't receive them until that Saturday or Sunday due to a ""delay"" (Oh its Sunday BTW and NOTHING HAS CAME!) Anywho: I called Saturday to just cancel and receive a refund they told me my items were delivered.. I argued with the representative and the Supervisor (Nijel B) bc they kept saying that my items were delivered already. Then when I asked him does he NOT see the email that Amazon sent me saying that my items were running late and would not be there until Nov 7 or Nov 8 he stated he had to escalate my situation. I ended up going to Party City and purchasing so at this point AMAZON JUST GIVE ME MY MONEY SO I CAN MOVE ALONG.. THANKS !!!",2020-11-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,9.0,1176,225,40,6,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,st never get stuff day let put im fed time im paying prime video bc ordering product worst here breaking point planned birthday party child purchased supply amazon even birthday outfit ordered tuesday told would receive item friday pushing considering party saturday whatever friday came got table cover item received email saying wouldnt receive saturday sunday due delay oh sunday btw nothing came anywho called saturday cancel receive refund told item delivered argued representative supervisor nijel b bc kept saying item delivered already asked see email amazon sent saying item running late would nov nov stated escalate situation ended going party city purchasing point amazon give money move along thanks,0.9999283730693982,7.162693060180914e-05,0.1261918115535614,0.2,0.3252741757760132,32.52741757760132,Low Trust
