Lisa B,/users/5f94e408caa554001b5cafb9,CA,8.0,2020-11-13 01:54:14+00:00,1.0,Amazon Allows Sellers on Scam Lists To Sell There,"I got my information from Scam Sellers.com  website , sellers name is Bewinner. purchased a cell phone on Sept 14 from Amazon, the phone arrived, wifi works but can't make any calls, tried several SIM cards, nothing will not work.  Went on a help form was told cell phone is not compatible in this country, there was nothing in the description about this, I looked at the diagram about how to insert the SIM card and it is reversed to ours.  I contacted the Seller Bewinner and they agreed to a refund.  I sent the package back waited 30 days checked no refund, checked the tracking number the seller never bothered to pick up the package.  I keep getting the same message from Amazon, this phone was over $100, I can't use it.  I have already spend 20$ in shipping.  This will be the last time I order from Amazon how can you trust them they allow companies on scam lists to sell there, I can't take the chance with anymore money, its not worth it Amazon you are not that good. I WANT MY MONEY BACK.",2020-11-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,13.0,1000,187,49,9,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,got information scam sellerscom website seller name bewinner purchased cell phone sept amazon phone arrived wifi work cant make call tried several sim card nothing work went help form told cell phone compatible country nothing description looked diagram insert sim card reversed contacted seller bewinner agreed refund sent package back waited day checked refund checked tracking number seller never bothered pick package keep getting message amazon phone cant use already spend shipping last time order amazon trust allow company scam list sell cant take chance anymore money worth amazon good want money back,0.013232722538022414,0.9867672774619776,0.10487941671340438,0.2,0.8143595220736696,81.43595220736695,High Trust
