ng wet touch anything let dry garage three day cuz didnt return box printed prepaid label told phone want back wet week past received broken item nobody contact get email stating headphone delivered broken molded threw garbage processing refund basically today sent six email every single rep different one first said provide u proof return receipt second one said didnt return doorbell dont know thats third one said refunded ketchup delivered broken know refunded already im talking headphone another one finally said getting refunded never heard lifeand reason told want touch wet headphone three day delivered used lady shaver pube hair daughter,0.007216950092458874,0.9927830499075412,0.16432978126752665,0.2,0.8292574812072758,82.92574812072758,High Trust
