Odair Soares,/users/5f4726b24630aa866203d71d,US,2.0,2020-11-04 16:14:13+00:00,1.0,They are worthless!!!,"I have issues with my prime account. I was on the phone with a rip for 1.5 hours. This guy did not know a thing about membership, I had to read off the q&A section in Amazon website. I am so frustrated with them and it seems like they get paid by the hour because they just want to keep you on the phone as long as they can. I would ask him a question and he would say oh let me ask a technician and he just kept me on hold and at the end nothing was accomplished.",2020-11-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,4.0,464,99,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,issue prime account phone rip hour guy know thing membership read qa section amazon website frustrated seems like get paid hour want keep phone long would ask question would say oh let ask technician kept hold end nothing accomplished,0.028007949134168493,0.9719920508658315,0.055524397083567024,0.2,0.7971009048496291,79.71009048496292,High Trust
Karen Flanagan,/users/5e04c7096af50253822c0e34,US,2.0,2020-11-04 02:49:35+00:00,1.0,Returned an item,"Returned an item, they received it 10/27 and they are refusing to give me a refund of $128.39 stating it was not paid for, even though I have proven it was! Amazon used to be great but it is horrible now! Customer service is horrible with people who do not have a good grasp of either English or Listening skills. I have been a prime member for years and bought a lot, but I am seriously thinking of going elsewhere.",2020-11-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,4.0,416,80,16,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,returned item received refusing give refund stating paid even though proven amazon used great horrible customer service horrible people good grasp either english listening skill prime member year bought lot seriously thinking going elsewhere,0.5192471530962827,0.48075284690371733,0.044868199663488505,0.2,0.5493500633845564,54.935006338455636,Medium Trust
Mr. T,/users/5fa1f70fbacc87001cbbadc7,US,2.0,2020-11-04 00:34:46+00:00,1.0,Large item return with Amazon,"I didn't know how bad Amazon was until I had to return something on 11/03/2020. I never even thought to search for bad reviews but now I am amazed at how many bad reviews Amazon.com has! Amazon is turning into a garbage company especially after dealing with customer service. This whole idea how Amazon puts the customer first is absolute nonsense. After this experience its much safer to buy things from retail stores. If you don’t like something its an easy no hassle return. Don't waste literally a day trying to return packages to a UPS shipping center and then being insulted by an Amazon customer service rep. I had to return some gym equipment it was a bit large and heavy but it turned out to be an absolute nightmare! First the seller was price gouging which Amazon allows. Don’t be fooled with yoyo prices on Amazon they allow sellers to take advantage of people during a pandemic. Be careful with Amazon pricing. Second I just didn’t want the equipment it was too large for my space. To make things worse customer service yelled at me on the phone. I am not kidding this women actually told me that Amazon takes no responsibility for the sale if its from a third party then instead of helping me figure out how to return the items she hangs up on me! I am not kidding she didn’t finish helping me and hung up the phone on me because I was asking them to please make returning large items more easy. I didn't even know it was from a third party until I tried to return it and I was having some problems with how or where to return the items. I was treated like a fool, insulted by their customer service and they never even resolved the problem! I used to buy a lot from Amazon but we are now reconsidering everything we buy from Amazon for several reasons. Amazon will NOT help the customer with return problems. Amazon prices are all over the place. They have no consistency for pricing its like trying to buy something with Bitcoin one day its selling for half the next day its up 100%. I will only be made a fool one time. I know I am just one little tiny voice in a company who has taken over the United States but I know for sure if their customer service acted like this to me they are doing it to others. With this kind of behavior some day some online retailer will catch on and make online shopping a much better experience. Don’t even try to have Amazon customer service call you unless you are ready to be insulted and don't order anything that cannot be returned at the UPS Store. I am just warning others before they waste a day and get insulted. Minus 100 stars for Amazon.",2020-11-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,4.0,2598,486,29,5,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,didnt know bad amazon return something never even thought search bad review amazed many bad review amazoncom amazon turning garbage company especially dealing customer service whole idea amazon put customer first absolute nonsense experience much safer buy thing retail store don’t like something easy hassle return dont waste literally day trying return package ups shipping center insulted amazon customer service rep return gym equipment bit large heavy turned absolute nightmare first seller price gouging amazon allows don’t fooled yoyo price amazon allow seller take advantage people pandemic careful amazon pricing second didn’t want equipment large space make thing worse customer service yelled phone kidding woman actually told amazon take responsibility sale third party instead helping figure return item hang kidding didn’t finish helping hung phone asking please make returning large item easy didnt even know third party tried return problem return item treated like fool insulted customer service never even resolved problem used buy lot amazon reconsidering everything buy amazon several reason amazon help customer return problem amazon price place consistency pricing like trying buy something bitcoin one day selling half next day made fool one time know one little tiny voice company taken united state know sure customer service acted like others kind behavior day online retailer catch make online shopping much better experience don’t even try amazon customer service call unless ready insulted dont order anything cannot returned ups store warning others waste day get insulted minus star amazon,0.7326259254356537,0.26737407456434625,0.2725743129556927,0.2,0.48820189987331164,48.82018998733116,Low Trust
highmetalman,/users/5fa1f3b74683a80019afbf09,US,1.0,2020-11-04 00:21:48+00:00,1.0,A good one. Man in woods?,"First,  I'm going to say that I've been a Prime Member for almost 3 years now, and I've NEVER seen Amazon THIS horrible.  I adopt sick or injured animals,  and I have this amazing cat who has a fractured hip. I ordered 4 total items last week,  one item being a Adult cat hip and joint pain relief bottle.  Over the weekend,  I kept checking the ""package updates,"" like most of us do,  and everything was on schedule,  until Monday,  where it said that the hip and joint pain relief was ""Undeliverable."" (?????????!!!!!!!!!!!!!)Not sure what that even means.  Turns out, there was an amazon delivery driver that came to my house at almost 8 o'clock pm, on SUNDAY NIGHT.  I never recieved a call,  no knocking on the door,  doorbell,  package dropped off... NOTHING.  I just got off the phone with Amazon's so called ""customer service"" and spoke to a guy named Paul. After repeating myself so many times I got seriously pissed. Like,  it was bad... Then,  after I explained everything for the 63rd time,  I simply asked,  so what happened,  why was there a driver at my house but no knock,  no doorbell,  call,  nothing?  They've been to my house several times, no problem?  Okay, whatever.  He says,  sir,  I have no idea what happened or WHY they were even there. (BOOM!!! Mind... BLOWN!) I'm sorry? That's concerning.  But okay I want to hear more... (Keep in mind I'm now trying to find out if they have a ""undeliverable"" product,  why the HELL is someone at my house.... I mean right? Okay,  so then he says I'm sorry for everything,  I say okay cool,  so now what,  can you guys just send it back to me?  He says that he'll issue me a refund,  3 to five MORE business days,  THEN,  I.... (ME!!) Can then,  RE- ORDER the product.  Holy crap. I'm now ready to throw my phone.  After ALLLLLLLLLL that,  I'm okay,  sort of.  I'm raising my voice,  TELLING him that I don't have that time,  but he's horrible at talking to customers. Oh did I mention that every time I spoke,  even AFTER he asks me something,  he continuously interrupted me, saying,  ""Sir, sir, I'm TRYING to explain to you what happened."" Ohhhh, okay, you're trying to explain ""what happened"" but 'has no idea' why the driver was there with no product, or a undeliverable product. He says he'll check something.  Puts me on hold.  Okay fine..... I'm cussing like mad behind his back.  He didn't do this earlier?  Keep in mind,  this whole conversation was almost 35 minutes. (Gives you a time frame of me telling this 'as high of a position I could speak to at the time' guy sooo many times what happened and to just send it back to me,  him interrupting me,  and being put on hold SO FAR.)He comes back,  tells me that the driver said he was on the OPPOSITE SIDE OF MY ROAD. **Whoa!!! Wait, what?  Then where the f##k was he?? Holy God. Can't speak to anyone higher,  tell him how pissed off I am..  Then here's the kicker. Ready...........................?He then goes,  ""Sir, I understand you,  and since you want compensation,  I'll put an extra 10 bucks on your account,  in a gift card.""   You guys. This ass**** just insinuated that I was seeking compensation of 10 whole bucks.  My cat's medicine is 30 bucks.  Which,  I have to re-order myself AFTER I get the refund, then order,  then wait,  the whole process again.  Wow. I tell this guy that I don't care about his 10 dollar 'I'm sorry I suck at my job, please don't do nuthin else' bribe, but Jesus.... I just told him to just issue the refund and I'll be talking to someone tomorrow.  Am I wrong here?  Can't listen,  interrupts continuously, says you're looking for compensation, when you've never said that,  driver is across the street or something, (Which is nothing but country sticks anyway)  doesn't know why,  now YOU have to reorder yourself, do the whole WAIT process,  all for what?  Some guy that is disrespectful, unprofessional,  totally the wrong type of guy you want in customer service. Sorry Amazon, you guys failed humanity with this one.",2020-11-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,4.0,3990,706,25,6,0.0,0,22,2,1,Suspicious,first im going say ive prime member almost year ive never seen amazon horrible adopt sick injured animal amazing cat fractured hip ordered total item last week one item adult cat hip joint pain relief bottle weekend kept checking package update like u everything schedule monday said hip joint pain relief undeliverable sure even mean turn amazon delivery driver came house almost oclock pm sunday night never recieved call knocking door doorbell package dropped nothing got phone amazon called customer service spoke guy named paul repeating many time got seriously pissed like bad explained everything rd time simply asked happened driver house knock doorbell call nothing theyve house several time problem okay whatever say sir idea happened even boom mind blown im sorry thats concerning okay want hear keep mind im trying find undeliverable product hell someone house mean right okay say im sorry everything say okay cool guy send back say hell issue refund five business day order product holy crap im ready throw phone allllllllll im okay sort im raising voice telling dont time he horrible talking customer oh mention every time spoke even asks something continuously interrupted saying sir sir im trying explain happened ohhhh okay youre trying explain happened idea driver product undeliverable product say hell check something put hold okay fine im cussing like mad behind back didnt earlier keep mind whole conversation almost minute give time frame telling high position could speak time guy sooo many time happened send back interrupting put hold farhe come back tell driver said opposite side road whoa wait fk holy god cant speak anyone higher tell pissed here kicker readyhe go sir understand since want compensation ill put extra buck account gift card guy as insinuated seeking compensation whole buck cat medicine buck reorder get refund order wait whole process wow tell guy dont care dollar im sorry suck job please dont nuthin else bribe jesus told issue refund ill talking someone tomorrow wrong cant listen interrupt continuously say youre looking compensation youve never said driver across street something nothing country stick anyway doesnt know reorder whole wait process guy disrespectful unprofessional totally wrong type guy want customer service sorry amazon guy failed humanity one,0.9999999999997595,2.404743071338089e-13,0.39596186203028605,0.2,0.3791923724061774,37.91923724061774,Low Trust
Gerryj,/users/505447e80000640001219e9e,GB,9.0,2020-11-03 22:26:56+00:00,1.0,What has happened to Amazon of late.,"What has happened to Amazon of late.I have found that Amazon service has been getting worse over last few months  I have been a customer of theirs since 2007 but not for much longer here is  2 examples in last month, I ordered some goods at prime special day price. Then got an email that they had gone missing and a refund would be given. They kindly said I could reorder .You guessed it at the higher price . Did I ordered again through this shower. let me think NO . Another one on 4th August pre-order a Thrustmaster product release date 23 Sept . This went back to 23Oct  on the 21 Oct this went back again to 14 Nov .on the same for day another email saying sorry 23 Oct was in fact the correct date. Then on the morning of 23 of October another email saying  sorry item no longer available and they had cancelled my order I would receive a refund in 5 to 7 days. I know they did the same thing to many of their customers  The moral is don't pre-order from Amazon you might not get it .Will I give any custom to either of these companies again What do you think. In Jan my prime is up . What will I spend that £80 on  ?Off to ebay",2020-11-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,3.0,1136,226,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,happened amazon latei found amazon service getting worse last month customer since much longer example last month ordered good prime special day price got email gone missing refund would given kindly said could reorder guessed higher price ordered shower let think another one th august preorder thrustmaster product release date sept went back oct oct went back nov day another email saying sorry oct fact correct date morning october another email saying sorry item longer available cancelled order would receive refund day know thing many customer moral dont preorder amazon might get give custom either company think jan prime spend £ ebay,0.019925227557741877,0.9800747724422582,0.126752664049355,0.2,0.815387919031,81.5387919031,High Trust
Bev Kalaher Compton,/users/5fa1c927423838001a5c5d7e,US,1.0,2020-11-03 22:04:30+00:00,1.0,Beware of ordering things you might…,"Beware of ordering things you might need to return.  Although I  ordered a ""Prime"" item, returns and refunds guaranteed, you may end up having to pay postage to Quanzhou Fuhian or some other country through the postal service.  They claim you'll be reimbursed for postage, but who knows how long that will take or how much it will be!!!",2020-11-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,3.0,336,59,36,6,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,beware ordering thing might need return although ordered prime item return refund guaranteed may end pay postage quanzhou fuhian country postal service claim youll reimbursed postage know long take much,0.7781189733791697,0.2218810266208303,0.03309029725182277,0.2,0.4175585727607797,41.75585727607797,Low Trust
Danisha G,/users/5fa1af9ae7f841001b237494,US,2.0,2020-11-03 19:35:04+00:00,1.0,Amazon's Customer service is useless…,"Amazon's Customer service is useless and their policies are amazingly stupid. I placed an order on 10/27/20 that had a ONE-Day shipping guarantee with a delivery the following day after shipment. Well 2 days later on 10/29/20 after waiting all day and getting a message that the package was on the way and would arrive between 1:45 pm to 5:45 pm I received a later message saying the package was delayed and now they would be sending the items in two separate delievries on 10/30 and 10/31. This was not the guarantee on their website nor is it the 2 day shipping I pay for as a Prime Member. Needless to say I was a bit upset as this is not the only time this has happened and so I cancelled the order fully expecting to be credited back my money straight away, fast forward to today 11/3/20 and I still have not received a refund and to make matters worse I'm being told by Amazon customer service that I need to wait for the items to ship back to the warehouse before they even begin to process the refund. What?,Why? The package never left Amazon's chain of custody since it was being delivered by their carriers, so how is it that I have to wait for it to get back to the warehouse when they should be able to scan the items as a return right there and begin the refund process? I have sent returns before through UPS, FedEx and the regular mail and the second the package is scanned the refund process begins immediately, but somehow even though Amazon's carriers are in possession of the package they refuse to begin process of the refund until the package physically reaches their warehouse and I have to wait X amount of days with no way to track the progression of the items to get my money back....this is NOT okay, Amazon!! What happens if the items never make it to your warehouse even though your carriers where the last ones holding the package? Do I not get my money back because your employees left my package in the back of their truck and forgot to make the return? This is why I think their return policy regarding cancellations is a confusing mess. They should have a way to track the eta of items being returned to their warehouses and should not penalize the customer and make them wait for a refund if the carriers were Amazon drivers in the first place. This is just not a good way of doing business and feels like they are actually trying to steal money from their customers with this insane policy. (again, they have the package already...it's just not in the warehouse)In the beginning Amazon was great but it has started to slowly go downhill in quality of goods sold through and fulfilled by them and quality of their service through deliveries and customer service. After this last wake up call I will no longer be returning as a member and will be taking my online shopping business elsewhere. I'm sure this won't matter to them but it matters to me to do business with a company that cares for it's customers. GoodBye Amazon, and If I don't receive my refund I will be filing a complaint with the ftc or bbb.",2020-11-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,3.0,3041,560,37,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service useless policy amazingly stupid placed order oneday shipping guarantee delivery following day shipment well day later waiting day getting message package way would arrive pm pm received later message saying package delayed would sending item two separate delievries guarantee website day shipping pay prime member needless say bit upset time happened cancelled order fully expecting credited back money straight away fast forward today still received refund make matter worse im told amazon customer service need wait item ship back warehouse even begin process refund whatwhy package never left amazon chain custody since delivered carrier wait get back warehouse able scan item return right begin refund process sent return ups fedex regular mail second package scanned refund process begin immediately somehow even though amazon carrier possession package refuse begin process refund package physically reach warehouse wait x amount day way track progression item get money backthis okay amazon happens item never make warehouse even though carrier last one holding package get money back employee left package back truck forgot make return think return policy regarding cancellation confusing mess way track eta item returned warehouse penalize customer make wait refund carrier amazon driver first place good way business feel like actually trying steal money customer insane policy package alreadyits warehousein beginning amazon great started slowly go downhill quality good sold fulfilled quality service delivery customer service last wake call longer returning member taking online shopping business elsewhere im sure wont matter matter business company care customer goodbye amazon dont receive refund filing complaint ftc bbb,0.07186764020577707,0.9281323597942229,0.3140773976444195,0.2,0.8268816594259953,82.68816594259954,High Trust
