NANCY,/users/5b3a6d2d4de5666d34299c89,US,3.0,2020-11-03 15:40:54+00:00,1.0,Tried to return a Farberware percolator…,Tried to return a Farberware percolator purchased 3/23/20 that I opened and tried to use last week. It’s defective. It makes weak/thin coffee. Just spoke to Amazon. They won’t credit me bc it’s over 30 days. Amazon is a price gouger and sells substandard products. I’m done with them.,2020-11-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,3.0,284,49,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tried return farberware percolator purchased opened tried use last week it’s defective make weakthin coffee spoke amazon won’t credit bc it’s day amazon price gouger sell substandard product i’m done,0.032464949947399145,0.9675350500526009,0.027481772293886708,0.2,0.7892638794850778,78.92638794850778,High Trust
