David Johnson,/users/5f9f0a5e732ced001914f1d4,US,4.0,2020-11-03 00:46:09+00:00,5.0,Great Service,"Honestly, I've never had a problem with them (that wasn't fixed).  Stuff happens, product gets damaged in shipping.  But with Amazon, they fix it!  I either get full refunds or they ship out a replacement right away.  Mind you I'm a Prime member.  So your mileage may vary.Their delivery people?  Oh my goodness.  Bless their hearts!  They've done some outright illogical things.  Like leaving a package in my planter instead of near my door.  I have sprinklers that water that planter.  So I had a entire box of coffee product get ruined.  Simply find their online text support and within 5 minutes, full refund.  It never fails.  Plus since it was a food item no need to return.They used to give me a free month of Prime with each problem.  I kid you not, at one point I had almost 2 years of free Prime.  They don't do that anymore but it sure was fun when they did.Have I ever been frustrated with them while on the line?  Sure.  It happens.  But come on, in the end, they fix it.",2020-11-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,3.0,984,180,13,2,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,honestly ive never problem wasnt fixed stuff happens product get damaged shipping amazon fix either get full refund ship replacement right away mind im prime member mileage may varytheir delivery people oh goodness bless heart theyve done outright illogical thing like leaving package planter instead near door sprinkler water planter entire box coffee product get ruined simply find online text support within minute full refund never fails plus since food item need returnthey used give free month prime problem kid one point almost year free prime dont anymore sure fun didhave ever frustrated line sure happens come end fix,0.29163837855664154,0.7083616214433585,0.10095344924284913,1.0,1.874371500570249,187.4371500570249,High Trust
Ashley E.O.,/users/5fa08c82c3bf72001ab67e17,US,1.0,2020-11-02 22:48:08+00:00,1.0,Heartbreakingly bad.,"I just had probably the single most appalling conversation with a woman that is in a management position for customer support. Her attitude was snide, sarcastic, rude, and condescending. As if my questions should have been directed towards a toddler instead, because even they would know the answer. I spent about $200 trying to shop 3 weeks early for Halloween because I needed an outfit for a job I was working. I received none of the packages. Two that were lost contained outfits and tights. Number one, well they lost those, just like they lost outfit and pair of tights number two. Not before a whole week and a half had passed after they lost outfit/tights number one, so the same outfit had gone up $11+ from the week before. Going out and shopping on the 30th of October cost me $83 more than what I would’ve spent if I got one of the outfits/tights and my boots I ordered that were so conveniently lost too. I asked her to cancel my prime. I’m done. When she asked if she could help me with anything else today I laughed and said well that would’ve required you to actually help me in the first place. Had to share as that is my only small victory I have from that ordeal.",2020-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,2.0,1182,219,20,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,probably single appalling conversation woman management position customer support attitude snide sarcastic rude condescending question directed towards toddler instead even would know answer spent trying shop week early halloween needed outfit job working received none package two lost contained outfit tights number one well lost like lost outfit pair tights number two whole week half passed lost outfittights number one outfit gone week going shopping th october cost would’ve spent got one outfitstights boot ordered conveniently lost asked cancel prime i’m done asked could help anything else today laughed said well would’ve required actually help first place share small victory ordeal,0.010434602379495925,0.9895653976205041,0.12282669657879977,0.2,0.819348038126012,81.9348038126012,High Trust
dgnFy,/users/5fa06d85e7f841001b22cd57,US,1.0,2020-11-02 20:36:21+00:00,1.0,I wish i could rate 0 stars,"I wish i could rate 0 stars. The only useful feature Amazon has over other vendors are the reviews and question section. Recently, for reasons they refuse to explain, they took away my ability to post reviews. They deleted hundreds of my reviews that many were rated as helpful. When I asked why they told me my activity was ""unusual"". The only unusualness was purchasing more products online due to covid... When I persisted with questioning they accused me of ""being in a relationship"" with the sellers. No appology or thank you for my years of business. I pay the full membership rate every month. They will not give me full access because 8 years ago my original account was set up as student and I was given half price. They have refused to give me full access.Amazon is likely failing. Their stock continues to drop. I think they are passing the buck to their customers along with their blame for their poor business practices. I am happy to be leaving this sinking ship behind and take my money to an ethical platform.",2020-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,2.0,1025,183,27,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wish could rate star useful feature amazon vendor review question section recently reason refuse explain took away ability post review deleted hundred review many rated helpful asked told activity unusual unusualness purchasing product online due covid persisted questioning accused relationship seller appology thank year business pay full membership rate every month give full access year ago original account set student given half price refused give full accessamazon likely failing stock continues drop think passing buck customer along blame poor business practice happy leaving sinking ship behind take money ethical platform,0.012878004934243627,0.9871219950657564,0.10263600673022995,0.2,0.8140881988789241,81.40881988789242,High Trust
John Russell,/users/58a319910000ff000a774b9b,TH,16.0,2020-11-02 20:32:45+00:00,1.0,No packaging and poor service,"I ordered a gallon of specialised detergent. The bottle arrived without a cap in a thin cardboard box devoid of packaging. The box had been badly handled in the post, the foil cap had split and the contents had spilt out. Perhaps their staff share their customers' opinion of this company. As they don't accept online returns for this item, I spent an hour on the phone to the USA struggling to get my account unlocked (no explanation for why it was locked) and a second interrogation of my name, date of birth, address, email, credit card etc etc to get a replacement.",2020-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,2.0,569,103,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered gallon specialised detergent bottle arrived without cap thin cardboard box devoid packaging box badly handled post foil cap split content spilt perhaps staff share customer opinion company dont accept online return item spent hour phone usa struggling get account unlocked explanation locked second interrogation name date birth address email credit card etc etc get replacement,0.014062610639814968,0.985937389360185,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.8045222560934407,80.45222560934407,High Trust
Joe Ross,/users/5fa0610162b45b00194e1232,GB,3.0,2020-11-02 20:03:43+00:00,1.0,I ordered a muzzle for a dog  from…,"I ordered a muzzle for a dog  from amazon. I requested a return because the muzzle did not fit my dog. That request for a return was made on the 26.09.2020, after I contacted them 3 times, firstly by the return and contact option on their website and then twice by the experience of customer service option on their website I have received no communication from amazon. The product is still awaiting return on the 02.11.2020 and I have requested a refund so much for there next day return policy AS STATED IN THEIR REURN POLICY! PLEASE DO NOT BUY FROM THIS COMPANY, THEIR CUSTOMER SERVICE IS  NON EXISTENT",2020-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,2.0,605,109,35,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered muzzle dog amazon requested return muzzle fit dog request return made contacted time firstly return contact option website twice experience customer service option website received communication amazon product still awaiting return requested refund much next day return policy stated reurn policy please buy company customer service non existent,0.016321308482129114,0.9836786915178709,0.061132922041503085,0.2,0.804065930167236,80.4065930167236,High Trust
Daniel and Margaret Boprey,/users/5db8cc81d8fdb56db4596023,US,2.0,2020-11-02 19:05:32+00:00,1.0,Nightmare with amazon,"Obtained a set of crossbars for my new Hyundai Santa Fe through Amazon from a co. called snail auto. Product would not fit securely enough to trust mounting a carrier on. The seller was not helpful in dealing with issue. I've been on phone 5 times with amazon trying to get a solution. Their customer service reps have been polite ,but no resolution yet. I expected amazon to step up and resolve this but they are playing middleman. I can say that I have ordered many items from Walmart on line and they have always been helpful with any problems that come up. I order most things online and although amazon prides themselves on fast efficient delivery , I've learned that their customer assist with issues is unacceptable. Therefore I can find everything I need online I won't be using amazon in the future. They obviously have so much business that alienating a few must be their business model.",2020-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,2.0,897,159,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,obtained set crossbar new hyundai santa fe amazon co called snail auto product would fit securely enough trust mounting carrier seller helpful dealing issue ive phone time amazon trying get solution customer service rep polite resolution yet expected amazon step resolve playing middleman say ordered many item walmart line always helpful problem come order thing online although amazon pride fast efficient delivery ive learned customer assist issue unacceptable therefore find everything need online wont using amazon future obviously much business alienating must business model,0.0022043445931904985,0.9977956554068095,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.8167329370696413,81.67329370696413,High Trust
