KIRSTEN,/users/5ace831d4de5666d34ba6405,US,2.0,2020-10-29 12:18:49+00:00,1.0,Steal and lie,"I,  like many others got an email telling me that my item had been delivered.  Surprise,  surprise,  it had not.  This is the 3rd time in two months (1st time was was twice on the same day)  they have pulled this on me.  I don't care that the drivers show an item as delivered when it has not been.  What kind of company tells it's employees to flat out lie to it's customers?  When your item shows as being delivered,  they ""claim"" they can't help you,  as your item has indeed been delivered.  I don't care if my item is going to be late.  Just tell me it will be late.  Do not tell your employees to lie and say it's there.   They are also stealing my money,  as when I am using Prime,  to get said item quicker,  I am NOT getting that item at all,  because it's still with the driver,  who lied and said I have my item.  This has been a very normal practice for Amazon.  Make em pay for Prime,  and don't give them the items we have all ready been paid for.Yeah boss,  your right!  What a wonderful business model!!! And don't even get me started on the error filled emails I have gotten,  if your going to copy and paste your emails,  all least take 30 seconds to proof read it before you send it.  It makes Amazon,  on a whole,  look like complete morons.",2020-10-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,29.0,1261,242,13,3,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,like many others got email telling item delivered surprise surprise rd time two month st time twice day pulled dont care driver show item delivered kind company tell employee flat lie customer item show delivered claim cant help item indeed delivered dont care item going late tell late tell employee lie say also stealing money using prime get said item quicker getting item still driver lied said item normal practice amazon make em pay prime dont give item ready paid foryeah bos right wonderful business model dont even get started error filled email gotten going copy paste email least take second proof read send make amazon whole look like complete moron,0.9134902772075323,0.08650972279246771,0.1357263039820527,0.2,0.3704001221926444,37.04001221926444,Low Trust
