Arnold Saenz,/users/5f987fb23f216700191b2e60,US,1.0,2020-10-27 20:15:04+00:00,2.0,Mainly about Amazon customer review system…,"Mainly reviewing Amazon customer review system.  Seems they reject most of my negative reviews of products for reasons they aren't clear about so it makes it difficult to avoid creating a similar future review since they aren't specific.  I want to inform potential customers of the truth about a product but Amazon doesn't care... they're mainly interested in reviews that help promote sales to increase their coffers.  Also, it seems their quality control has decreased in recent years and is going in the same direction, which is down, which makes it easier for competition to be, well, competitive and give consumers other options when dissatisfied, and that's good for consumers because we can express our dissatisfaction by using simple economics and give our consumer dollars to the competitor with the best, or nearly best, offer.  Services like Wikibuy and Fakespot Reviews are helping consumers and kudos to them, and any others, for helping consumers get better values and avoid products that aren't transparent regarding customer reviews.",2020-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,27.0,1050,166,43,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,mainly reviewing amazon customer review system seems reject negative review product reason arent clear make difficult avoid creating similar future review since arent specific want inform potential customer truth product amazon doesnt care theyre mainly interested review help promote sale increase coffer also seems quality control decreased recent year going direction make easier competition well competitive give consumer option dissatisfied thats good consumer express dissatisfaction using simple economics give consumer dollar competitor best nearly best offer service like wikibuy fakespot review helping consumer kudos others helping consumer get better value avoid product arent transparent regarding customer review,0.032272406494277