KK,/users/5f97822a888f970019339313,US,1.0,2020-10-27 02:14:10+00:00,1.0,ITEM NOT RECEIVED AND NOT REFUNDED,"I ordered an item twice and still did not receive it. And Amazon won't give me my refund ($78) although it's their fault. First time it says it was delivered at another address (apparently delivered at a keyfood that's not even remotely close to me yet they said it was signed by me, mind you I wasn't even home. 2nd time it was left in the mailboxes area WHICH IS NOT A SECURE AREA IN THIS BUILDING SINCE ANYONE CAN GET TO THE ""MAILROOM"" (Which is a hallway near the laundryroom by the way). Hence I did not find it when I got home. When my packages used to be delivered by post office or UPS. I never had issues with not finding my stuff. Since Amazon is doing it OWN DELIVERY now. I have an issue with my package at least 80% of the time. Now I lost my money because they won't refund it. When it's their fault for hiring DELIVERY DRIVERS THAT PROBABLY DIDN'T FINISH HIGHSCHOOL SINCE SOME OF THEM CAN'T EVEN READ AN ADDRESS CORRECTLY",2020-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,27.0,936,179,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item twice still receive amazon wont give refund although fault first time say delivered another address apparently delivered keyfood thats even remotely close yet said signed mind wasnt even home nd time left mailbox area secure area building since anyone get mailroom hallway near laundryroom way hence find got home package used delivered post office ups never issue finding stuff since amazon delivery issue package least time lost money wont refund fault hiring delivery driver probably didnt finish highschool since cant even read address correctly,0.005320072804997858,0.9946799271950021,0.10039259674705553,0.2,0.8174184829469121,81.74184829469121,High Trust
rubyroo,/users/5ac63ed44de5666d34ec3bc8,GB,6.0,2020-10-26 21:32:10+00:00,1.0,I worked for amazon on behalf of apollo…,"I worked for amazon on behalf of apollo logistics. this is the most unprofessional company I have ever worked for a had a motor accident called the support team for support and all they were worried about was how many parcels I had left to deliver. I was not asked once if I needed medical attention l, if I was ok or nothing. to top if off even after being shaken up they still made me drive back to the warehouse in avon mouth alone although I told my manager I did not feel comfortable doing this.there is no proper routine what so ever you get paid £85 a day to be out from morning to night. I have messaged my manager several times just to be ignored and not recieve any reply from him although I saw he has been on WhatsApp messaging in the group chat we have where the rota is sent out too all drivers/workers.I find it very unprofessional the manager rolls his eyes at you when you express how you are feeling or what you are finding hard about the job role. there is no communication what's so ever. save yourself the stress and hassle I have never been so upset or cried so much since working for apollo logistics. apply else where £85 pound really is not worth the stress you will endure. they dont care about the staff they just care about you delivering there parcels weather you are hurt or sick.",2020-10-26 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,26.0,1310,249,40,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,worked amazon behalf apollo logistics unprofessional company ever worked motor accident called support team support worried many parcel left deliver asked needed medical attention l ok nothing top even shaken still made drive back warehouse avon mouth alone although told manager feel comfortable thisthere proper routine ever get paid £ day morning night messaged manager several time ignored recieve reply although saw whatsapp messaging group chat rota sent driversworkersi find unprofessional manager roll eye express feeling finding hard job role communication whats ever save stress hassle never upset cried much since working apollo logistics apply else £ pound really worth stress endure dont care staff care delivering parcel weather hurt sick,0.033913995458631496,0.9660860045413685,0.13965227145260797,0.2,0.8109734565612058,81.09734565612058,High Trust
