Sania Rahman,/users/5f94704ffdadc5001acafba2,CA,2.0,2020-10-26 19:49:47+00:00,1.0,#Amazon.com the worst experience ever!,"My first experience with #Amazon is horrible! I dont know with this level of service how they became such a popular site!!!I received an email gift card from my office as my farewell gift on October 8th, 2020. After that, I opened an account on amazon.ca as I am living in Canada. Then I checked my amazon gift card on an email that I received, there I have seen a gift card redeem option on my email so I redeemed my points and it said it is added to my account. Then I ordered a few items from my account using my gift card balance. Amazon also confirmed that order by email. After a few hours, I received another email saying something suspicious happening in my account so they froze my account. The email says to activate my account i have to reply their email with details of my gift card. So I have replied the email using the order number of my gift card and a screenshot of that email. Though I replied to the email still i was receiving the same email multiple times and I replied two times to those emails with all details, nobody returned to me with any solution! Then i called amazon customer service. They took all notes and told me they wanted to make sure this is me, they have taken my address details and phone number and told me I will hear from them within 3/4 days. I was waiting for thier email or phone call, nobody contacted me and my account remained on hold. Then after waiting gor 4 days I called again to thier customer care and repeated the whole complaint process that took around 40/50 minutes. This time again the customer care gave me hope that they are going to solve it. The customer care agent told me the problem my account is on amazon.ca but for redeemed points and purchase they used amazon.com id as i was doing it directly from my email gift card. Then i asked how is that possible, as i never opened account on amazon.com. His reply was the system doesnt require a new account, it just used the same information i used for amazon.ca, as my gift card was from amazon.com. Since then it's been more than 5 days I am still waiting for thier reply and my account is also on hold. I cannot use my account anymire. I dont know whether i will be able to get back my gift card money which is 225US$. I just want to use my gift card, hopefully i will never go for amazon shopping in future and will not suggest anyone.I have no idea what kind of service it is!?Sania RahmanCanada",2020-10-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,26.0,2413,457,38,5,2.0,0,6,1,0,Genuine,first experience amazon horrible dont know level service became popular sitei received email gift card office farewell gift october th opened account amazonca living canada checked amazon gift card email received seen gift card redeem option email redeemed point said added account ordered item account using gift card balance amazon also confirmed order email hour received another email saying something suspicious happening account froze account email say activate account reply email detail gift card replied email using order number gift card screenshot email though replied email still receiving email multiple time replied two time email detail nobody returned solution called amazon customer service took note told wanted make sure taken address detail phone number told hear within day waiting thier email phone call nobody contacted account remained hold waiting gor day called thier customer care repeated whole complaint process took around minute time customer care gave hope going solve customer care agent told problem account amazonca redeemed point purchase used amazoncom id directly email gift card asked possible never opened account amazoncom reply system doesnt require new account used information used amazonca gift card amazoncom since day still waiting thier reply account also hold cannot use account anymire dont know whether able get back gift card money u 