Ms D,/users/5d08b94f252a763d6e2c69d9,US,23.0,2020-11-15 05:28:39+00:00,1.0,GET REAL AMAZON! and also ebt snap headaches,"oh please. WHY is amazon all of a sudden NOT allowing me to login, but sending me to my webmail in order to  confirm it's me logging in? what a  big bother for nothing!  this is happening every single day  for several days now. The dumb FOREIGN customer service has NO  answers. They a re also taking the brunt of my anger. And threatening me since i used some cuss words about amazon. Much deserved! So, they say this: ""Someone is attempting to sign-in to your account.WhenOct xx, 2020 xxxx PMDeviceMozilla Firefox for Windows (XXXXX)NearSame as current IP address (xxxxxxxx) ""the email says: ""Someone is attempting to sign-in to your account.When: 	Oct xx, 2020 xxxx PM Pacific Daylight TimeDevice: 	Mozilla Firefox Windows (xxxx)Near: 	xxxxxxx, United StatesPlease approve or deny."" LOL, RIDICULOUS AND SUCH A HUGE WASTE OF MY TIME AND ENERGY, AND GETS ME SO INFURIATED! do they really want extremely angry customers? .....yeah really, Amazon? IT'S ME TRYING TO SIGN IN SO I CAN SPEND MONEY ON YOUR SITE! i guess that's not ok with you? who the h3ll do youthink you are , a BANK? there is no reason for this. I haven't changed anything. THEY have apparently bought into some dimwit's version of website security! There is def such a thing as overdoing it,  and guess what, YOU SEND PEOPLE AWAY FROM YOUR WEBSITE, AND MAKE THEM  INFURIATED, THEY WILL LIKELY NOT COME BACK . They will likely boycott you , or worse, sue you or some kind of mass  consumer action..  And i spend thousands there.  HOW  BRAINLESS AND SENSELESS COULD THEY POSSIBLY BE!NOV. 14- update----- still doing this to me after all my complaints, and it's a month later. EVERY day  first time i log in, and sometimes twice a day, THAT'S CRAZY.======================== AMAZON  WRONGFULLY BILLING EBT FOODSTAMP ITEMS TO CASH OR CREDIT.Recently Amazon  started accepting EBT snap foodstamps for Fresh  grocery orders. BUT THEY WOULD ONLY CHARGE SOME OF THE FOOD TO EBT, when the program  states they have to charge ebt for food items.  They instead charged to the other payment method,  such as bank acct or credit card! That's not allowed by the Snap program. It's a government program and correct processing of payment has to be obeyed . After a few times, i noticed they  corrected this, for the most part- but not entirely. This must have cost some poor people having overdraft on thier tiny bank account with only 3 bucks left in it. Because some of my own  erroneously charged items would cost 20+ bucks. Probably theirs too. Well i think numerous people would have complained , i know some did, complain to t he government. I think AMZN got thier proverbial butt swatted. As they did clean it up as i said, FOR THE MOST PART. now they seem to be almost always billing the food items to ebt snap LIKE THEY SHOULD.But for me it cost me several hours of filing payment disputes to my  credit card co, to get the charges reversed and put back onto ebt electronic benefit transfer card.  HUGE HEADACHE.================================Amazon recently also DELETED ALL MY  HUNDREDS OF COMMENTS AND REVIEWS, FOR SOME PERSONAL PRIVATE  UNKNOWN REASON of some admin. I put in hundreds of hours on those, and had a high ranking for  my reviews. they were read  over 50,000 times. They gave me NO reason except some bogus thing about "" we repeatedly warned you about violating our rules"" but of course, NOT REALLY ! they  didn't warn me at all. As if there was anything to warn about! someone simply was on the other side of a current affairs issue, and  had a personal bone to pick. that's all i can figure. Did this p*ss me off at all? oh, you better believe it!  am i powerless though? NOPE. far from it. i think Amazon site has been handed over to inferior management, who are now ruining the site and abusing customers who have spent thousands on their site. this is going to  backfire  massively. .===============================Once upon a time, i think amazon used to have a feedback  feature where you could tell t hem what you think about thier site. This was so essential! now they don't have it, but so many  problems and  stress are happening to customers- it's a huge mistake to remove that! it makes anger build into  a real head of steam. There's no   effective outlet! They aren't listening! People will feel like punishing any stupid company doing that.The owner Bezos, is getting so dang rich,  richest guy  on earth. Well right there, you know he isn't putting the money we pay,into proper  service and proper  management of the site and the commerce.BEZOS IS CUTTING CORNERS AND CHEAPING OUT ON ESSENTIAL BUSINESS PRACTICES, SITE MGMT, AND ALLOWING BAD TREATMENT OF CUSTOMERS, IN ORDER TO GET EVEN FILTHIER RICH.",2020-10-23 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,11.0,15.0,4695,811,44,8,23.0,0,14,1,0,Genuine,oh please amazon sudden allowing login sending webmail order confirm logging big bother nothing happening every single day several day dumb foreign customer service answer also taking brunt anger threatening since used cuss word amazon much deserved say someone attempting signin accountwhenoct xx xxxx pmdevicemozilla firefox window xxxxxnearsame current ip address xxxxxxxx email say someone attempting signin accountwhen oct xx xxxx pm pacific daylight timedevice mozilla firefox window xxxxnear xxxxxxx united statesplease approve deny lol ridiculous huge waste time energy get infuriated really want extremely angry customer yeah really amazon trying sign spend money site guess thats ok hll youthink bank reason havent changed anything apparently bought dimwit version website security def thing overdoing guess send people away website make infuriated likely come back likely boycott worse sue kind mass consumer action spend thousand brainless senseless could possibly benov update still complaint month later every day first time log sometimes twice day thats crazy amazon wrongfully bill