Stanislaw Wawrinka,/users/5f8f9cc825f09e001ab5febb,CH,2.0,2020-10-21 02:28:53+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service,"i placed my 1st order today, cause I heard they deliver free & let u spend foodstamps. literally everything in my cart was food. the only item ""not eligible"" was yogurt, which is most definitely eligible & would be at any store. even still everything else should have been charged to ebt card, but it was all fraudulently charged to my debit card. I will dispute charges at my bank & shop elsewhere since customer service did nothing",2020-10-21 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,21.0,433,78,22,3,0.0,1,0,2,1,Suspicious,placed st order today cause heard deliver free let u spend foodstamps literally everything cart food item eligible yogurt definitely eligible would store even still everything else charged ebt card fraudulently charged debit card dispute charge bank shop elsewhere since customer service nothing,0.9999999999108546,8.914535776227694e-11,0.04374649467190129,0.2,0.3087492989789529,30.874929897895292,Low Trust
Alex Kalinowsky,/users/5f8f84a76d3b5a001b17e21e,US,1.0,2020-10-21 00:46:06+00:00,1.0,Late and wrong item and next to no help~,"Late and wrong item and laughable support. I ordered a winch off of Amazon with a guaranteed delivery date of Friday. I got a notification on my phone that the package was one stop away at 730AM. Shortly after I notice it said the driver has to make a few more stops. I started messaging customer service with concerns because every time that had happened previous my items didn't get delivered that day. I was assured the item would be delivered by the customer service people. Fast forward to around 130PM and I get a call from the driver asking him to meet him somewhere, because the line to gain access to my address was long, so he called his supervisor and they said to see if I could meet them. I wasn't able to as my truck was waiting on the winch to get delivered to put the bumper on and my wife was running errands in her car. So Amazon marked it as an attempted delivery, although the driver didn't attempt delivery because they were unwilling to wait in line. I spent at least an hour on the phone and multiple hours in chat trying to get my item. I finally ask to speak to a manager who apologies and offers a $80 credit. Great. So I'm a day late but I should still have enough time to install the winch and get the bumper on my truck.Wrong. The next day, Saturday, again I get a call from the driver. His partner forgot his ID and they won't be able to get to my address. I agree to meet them in a parking lot outside the gate. I drive there and wait 10 minutes before calling Amazon customer service again. After being on the phone for 15 minutes I decide to look for the Amazon drivers. I find them half a mile away pulled into an exit to the road. They wanted me to come to them, but they were in a dangerous spot and I tried to get them to move down the road to the parking lot. Instead they loaded up a dolly and brought the winch to me. Wonderful. I call Amazon back to ask them about their drivers parking in the road. While on hold I open the package to find it's the wrong item. Amazon would only do a return on the item because I was compensated the day before and wanted me to wait until they had the item to issue a refund. I at least got them to do the refund right away. Ultimately, I had to drive over an hour away to get a winch so I could start to put my truck together again. Worst experience I can remember having shopping anywhere.",2020-10-21 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,21.0,2366,463,40,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,late wrong item laughable support ordered winch amazon guaranteed delivery date friday got notification phone package one stop away shortly notice said driver make stop started messaging customer service concern every time happened previous item didnt get delivered day assured item would delivered customer service people fast forward around pm get call driver asking meet somewhere line gain access address long called supervisor said see could meet wasnt able truck waiting winch get delivered put bumper wife running errand car amazon marked attempted delivery although driver didnt attempt delivery unwilling wait line spent least hour phone multiple hour chat trying get item finally ask speak manager apology offer credit great im day late still enough time install winch get bumper truckwrong next day saturday get call driver partner forgot id wont able get address agree meet parking lot outside gate drive wait minute calling amazon customer service phone minute decide look amazon driver find half mile away pulled exit road wanted come dangerous spot tried get move road parking lot instead loaded dolly brought winch wonderful call amazon back ask driver parking road hold open package find wrong item amazon would return item compensated day wanted wait item issue refund least got refund right away ultimately drive hour away get winch could start put truck together worst experience remember shopping anywhere,0.003574248628276564,0.9964257513717234,0.2596747055524397,0.2,0.8501478167963497,85.01478167963496,High Trust
latoya james,/users/5eea55d9d6502c75d9d36640,US,2.0,2020-10-21 00:27:20+00:00,1.0,Amazon uses USPS and they never can…,"Amazon uses USPS and they never can deliver a package correctly! They always have an excuse to why they were unable to deliver a package. USPS wonders why they are dying down, because they suck!",2020-10-21 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,21.0,194,35,36,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon us usps never deliver package correctly always excuse unable deliver package usps wonder dying suck,0.4336634275524232,0.5663365724475768,0.01962983735277622,0.2,0.5870942536943436,58.70942536943436,Medium Trust
Megan Mericle,/users/5f484a64c2d4adf8033a74d0,US,2.0,2020-10-21 00:26:11+00:00,1.0,So I used to be in love with Amazon,"So I used to be in love with Amazon. I was one of those people who ordered from there like every other day. But not anymore! After spending THOUSANDS OF DOLLARS AND THOUSANDS OF HOURS on Amazon I think I will finally be cancelling my Prime membership. This past week, after finally having time to finish furnishing my apartment after working 14+ hours every day at the hospital (thanks COVID) Amazon screwed up MAJORLY four different times in 48 hours. I will admit that somehow (not convinced this wasn't their fault either) my old address ended up on 4 different orders. So like the responsibile person I am, I tried cancelling the orders first, then I immediately contacted Amazon. I was ASSURED this would be taken care of no problem. I could cancel the one order that was PRIME 24 Hour delivery as SOON as it was assigned to a driver and the rep would take care of the rest. I trusted her so I placed the orders for the correct address. I was able to cancel the one the next morning and she did take care of one. However, one of the the orders from an outside vendors did not cancel and I was contacted and told they would not cancel it nor change it and the rep just out on the request CANCEL, not even the reason! Like what the hell! Now it was too late because FedEx has it. So I am now out of $170. GREAT! Mistake #1. That night I get home from work expecting 2 of my packages.... NOTHING! Ok.... I pull up the GPS. Driver says I'm next and is RIGHT BY MY APT! Yay! Then I notice the driver is driving AWAY FROM MY APT?!?! WHY?!?! Why is the driver driving towards my old place!?!?! I contact Amazon AGAIN they give me the bogus answer of, ""Oh he has a couple of more stops then you..."" Listen Linda, in my last life I was a dispatcher don't pull that bs with me try again! Then I get ""It's after 8pm they can't deliver this late it will have to wait until tomorrow sorry."" WTheck! Mistake #2 So tomorrow is here. I get notice that another package is delivered. So when I get home I grab it, and I open it up. I had ordered the emancipation newspaper article clipping on canvas.... When I opened my package up it was A DEER SCENE IN SNOW ON CANVAS WTheck!!!!! HOW DO YOU MESS THAT UP!?!?! That's mistake#3! Then I check on my other package that was supposed to have been delivered today.... NOT EVEN ENROUTE!!!! #4! I contact customer service.... They promptly end the chat on me without notice and I have to wait for someone else!!! #5! When I finally get a supervisor, they only thing they can do is issue me a refund in the form of a gift card which will take two hours so I can reorder my stuff ... NOT GOOD ENOUGH!!!! Refund my credit card and I WILL TAKE MY MONEY ELSEWHERE (Which I did! Ebay had everything cheaper and of better quality. I just have to wait a little longer for it which is fine at least I know I'll get it!) I'm so DONE AND OVER AMAZON! THEY HAVE FOREVER LOST MY BUSINESS!!!!!!",2020-10-21 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,21.0,2910,557,35,9,0.0,0,47,2,1,Suspicious,used love amazon one people ordered like every day anymore spending thousand dollar thousand hour amazon think finally cancelling prime membership past week finally time finish furnishing apartment working hour every day hospital thanks covid amazon screwed majorly four different time hour admit somehow convinced wasnt fault either old address ended different order like responsibile person tried cancelling order first immediately contacted amazon assured would taken care problem could cancel one order prime hour delivery soon assigned driver rep would take care rest trusted placed order correct address able cancel one next morning take care one however one order outside vendor cancel contacted told would cancel change rep request cancel even reason like hell late fedex great mistake night get home work expecting package nothing ok pull gps driver say im next right apt yay notice driver driving away apt driver driving towards old place contact amazon give bogus answer oh couple stop listen linda last life dispatcher dont pull b try get pm cant deliver late wait tomorrow sorry wtheck mistake tomorrow get notice another package delivered get home grab open ordered emancipation newspaper article clipping canvas opened package deer scene snow canvas wtheck mess thats mistake check package supposed delivered today even enroute contact customer service promptly end chat without notice wait someone else finally get supervisor thing issue refund form gift card take two hour reorder stuff good enough refund credit card take money elsewhere ebay everything cheaper better quality wait little longer fine least know ill get im done amazon forever lost business,1.0,0.0,0.3123948401570387,0.2,0.3624789680314077,36.24789680314077,Low Trust
