mrmped,/users/5f8f464f17dfec001a3e60b3,US,6.0,2020-10-20 20:26:51+00:00,1.0,Nothing but incompetance,"This company screws up by canceling an order that has expedited shipping then requires you to reorder which no longer can be shipped on time and then all the agent (in Costa Rica) can say is sorry.   second agent cant even figure out what happened or how to fix it (agent in US), and the manager (in Columbia) is OK with not fixing the situation and closing my account. since I really hate dealing with incompetence.  so they should get a negative star rating.  I have had them handle small stuff fairly well but about every tenth order they screw it up.  and then they say we are sorry, would you like a five dollar coupon?  WTC",2020-10-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,20.0,629,117,24,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,company screw canceling order expedited shipping requires reorder longer shipped time agent costa rica say sorry second agent cant even figure happened fix agent u manager columbia ok fixing situation closing account since really hate dealing incompetence get negative star rating handle small stuff fairly well every tenth order screw say sorry would like five dollar coupon wtc,0.0505390151935355,0.9494609848064645,0.06561974200785194,0.2,0.7878544408048026,78.78544408048026,High Trust
