Good customer,/users/5f8e7acc25f09e001ab56f14,US,1.0,2020-10-20 05:56:56+00:00,1.0,Amazon took my money...and told me to give up,"I had to call in and cancel two subscribes, but they refund me back PARTIALLY.  In fact, this is not my first time. It has had happened to me for 3-4 times so far. So I payed Amazon for nothing a couple times…Over a year ago, I found out that without my knowledge, Amazon subscribes me HBO and other stuff for over 6 month. Amazon guy said he will cancel them and refund for all. And he said you won’t see charges again.Well, now again  I found out that without my knowledge, Amazon subscribes me HBO and other stuff for over 8 month again. Amazon charged me for nothing for over 8 month.  I contacted Amazon customer service, and he agreed to refund ONLY 6 month back. He told me I only lost two month subscribes money which is about $60… It is a lot of money for nothing.  Basically Amazon customer service guy who is a lead of team told me  that I should give up. Are you kidding me?please everyone be aware of unknown subscribes by Amazon. Amazon said ""I did cancel"", but often time NOT. Amazon only support partially and you CAN'T elevate issues to any higher up.",2020-10-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,20.0,1068,201,45,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,call cancel two subscribes refund back partially fact first time happened time far payed amazon nothing couple times…over year ago found without knowledge amazon subscribes hbo stuff month amazon guy said cancel refund said won’t see charge againwell found without knowledge amazon subscribes hbo stuff month amazon charged nothing month contacted amazon customer service agreed refund month back told lost two month subscribes money … lot money nothing basically amazon customer service guy lead team told give kidding meplease everyone aware unknown subscribes amazon amazon said cancel often time amazon support partially cant elevate issue higher,0.00908952429546422,0.9909104757045358,0.11273135165451487,0.2,0.8180015081831709,81.80015081831709,High Trust
