Becky Cannon,/users/5f8e374a2d1fd60019b33dc6,US,1.0,2020-10-20 01:03:19+00:00,1.0,I had the most ridiculous experience…,"I had the most ridiculous experience with Amazon's customer service. I wanted to get a credit from a gift that I received for an ebook and I already own the ebook. Meanwhile, as I am trying to process this, it appears that my telephone number is linked to my mother's account, who died a month ago. So, I ask her to close that account and I do not have access to the email. She gets the credit of my ebook sent to my mother's account. I cannot retrieve the credit and I have spent almost 2 hours on this ridiculous $12. What a waste of supposedly high tech customer service.",2020-10-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,20.0,574,110,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ridiculous experience amazon customer service wanted get credit gift received ebook already ebook meanwhile trying process appears telephone number linked mother account died month ago ask close account access email get credit ebook sent mother account cannot retrieve credit spent almost hour ridiculous waste supposedly high tech customer service,0.027850238365442592,0.9721497616345574,0.06169377453729669,0.2,0.798413635724738,79.8413635724738,High Trust
loserlobster,/users/5f8dbd5f25f09e001ab52cdf,US,2.0,2020-10-19 16:32:59+00:00,1.0,Why fast shipping and bad customer service don't mix.,"I have given Amazon many chances due to their fast shipping time and somewhat competitive prices.  But I am finally at the limit. I made an account for this website for the sole purpose of pointing out to anyone who likes fast shipping that there is one glaring problem with it.  Should an accident happen when submitting your order, you can not edit your order, because they need to get it out the door to get it to you in a day. This means you have almost no time  to go back and edit your order (say change the address or even cancel it!).  Not to mention when time is of the essence they have you talk to a robot that doesn't work (its in beta in their defense) and now your slim chance of getting your order fixed just flew out the window.  I've used Amazon for about 5 years and their customer service has gotten worse slowly over time.  I finally can say I do not see my self using this website again based on the slow deterioration of their service.",2020-10-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,19.0,957,183,53,9,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,given amazon many chance due fast shipping time somewhat competitive price finally limit made account website sole purpose pointing anyone like fast shipping one glaring problem accident happen submitting order edit order need get door get day mean almost time go back edit order say change address even cancel mention time essence talk robot doesnt work beta defense slim chance getting order fixed flew window ive used amazon year customer service gotten worse slowly time finally say see self using website based slow deterioration service,0.042245513567819984,0.95775448643218,0.10263600673022995,0.2,0.799404444562136,79.9404444562136,High Trust
