Manoj Kumar,/users/5f857af2cecc5f001e035a2b,IN,1.0,2020-10-13 13:22:43+00:00,1.0,CANCELLATION OF ORDER BY AMAZON WITHOUT MY CONSENT AFTER ACCEPTING ADVANCE PAYMENT …,I have been purchasing regularly from Amazon since last two years and found only tolerable petty mistakes untill today when I came to know about the blunders Amazon do. I had ordered a carpet through Amazon making advance payment and the order was successfully placed and the advance money was debited from my account but to my surprise after two hours the order got cancelled by itself and the money was refunded. When asked to Amazon customer service they said the order was cancelled by the seller saying that the price quoted was wrong. I didn't know that Amazon only supports the sellers and not the buyers. How could someone quote less on an online portal and Amazon supports them blindly not holding them responsible for their mistakes. This is very sad and made me unhappy.Chennai- India,2020-10-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,13.0,795,137,84,13,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchasing regularly amazon since last two year found tolerable petty mistake untill today came know blunder amazon ordered carpet amazon making advance payment order successfully placed advance money debited account surprise two hour order got cancelled money refunded asked amazon customer service said order cancelled seller saying price quoted wrong didnt know amazon support seller buyer could someone quote less online portal amazon support blindly holding responsible mistake sad made unhappychennai india,0.007074101540678483,0.9929258984593216,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.8118303076144056,81.18303076144056,High Trust
