Marie,/users/5e272c98616781ebef858129,US,3.0,2020-10-11 17:10:17+00:00,1.0,Very poor service!!!!,"In the last year amazon service has gone down hill. I have had several orders that haven’t even been shipped out and you can’t get customer service to help you with it. They say it’s lost or in an advance shipment phase but they can’t give you a date when it will shipped. Which means that the money that they are holding for that shipment is tied up till it ships or they cancel it. I am paying for prime, and you may get prime orders that should be there in 2 days, 2 weeks later. When you call to complain they say that there is processing time. Since when I always got 2 day items in 2 days that is why I pay for the service. I am still waiting on an item that they said would be here by 9pm on 10/9 and all I get from them is they aren’t sure where it is but they will let me know. I asked to have their company’s corporate number and was told by DJ, “that they can’t give that information out because of security reasons and it is against their privacy, but she could give me a mailing address.” They don’t help you and really don’t care about the customer.",2020-10-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,11.0,1063,212,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,last year amazon service gone hill several order haven’t even shipped can’t get customer service help say it’s lost advance shipment phase can’t give date shipped mean money holding shipment tied till ship cancel paying prime may get prime order day week later call complain say processing time since always got day item day pay service still waiting item said would pm get aren’t sure let know asked company’s corporate number told dj “that can’t give information security reason privacy could give mailing address” don’t help really don’t care customer,0.01322378821967793,0.986776211780322,0.11890072910824454,0.2,0.81716825171181,81.716825171181,High Trust
