Pierre Germishuizen,/users/5f79ac1dc831f2157a529892,ES,1.0,2020-10-04 11:11:57+00:00,1.0,Amazon allows their sellers to use your money and then cancel the order and refund you at the last minute.,"I have tried to buy a camera on two separate occasions and from different sellers. On both occasions the sale went through and money left my account. Without any communication or reason both orders were subsequently cancelled. Once an order is cancelled by the seller it dissappears from your orders list and therefore you can't leave a review on the seller. On both occasions customer service at amazon was absolutely useless. Very friendly and courteous but useless. They are happy to get their cut I'm sure but take no responsibility for sellers scamming us for revenue. The second sale was cancelled on the morning of the first date of delivery, so the company was never going to send it. I would discourage anyone from buying anything expensive through amazon. I will never do it again.",2020-10-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,10.0,4.0,791,135,106,20,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tried buy camera two separate occasion different seller occasion sale went money left account without communication reason order subsequently cancelled order cancelled seller dissappears order list therefore cant leave review seller occasion customer service amazon absolutely useless friendly courteous useless happy get cut im sure take responsibility seller scamming u revenue second sale cancelled morning first date delivery company never going send would discourage anyone buying anything expensive amazon never,0.0031267376541975426,0.9968732623458024,0.07571508693213685,0.2,0.8135796485593285,81.35796485593285,High Trust
