Marilynn Cantu,/users/5f6d033ed41eaa28c0090f6d,US,1.0,2020-09-24 20:36:32+00:00,1.0,I am failing my anthropology class…,"I am failing my anthropology class because of Amazon. Before my class started, I ordered my textbook through Amazon prime. They said it would be there in about a week. 5 days after it was supposed to be delivered, I called them as it was not delivered, nor was my money refunded until I called them. This is my class textbook so I asked, instead of a refund please send another book. They said they did, but the same thing happened, and they did not contact me to tell me the book was damaged, or to give me a refund. At this point I'm 5 weeks into my class, I get my refund and order the book elsewhere. Had amazon contacted me the first (or even the second) time, I would have had my textbook before my exam. Amazon took so long, I had to take my exam without the textbook (there is no Ebook either) and now I received the lowest grade I have ever gotten in 8 years. I am very disappointed in Amazon and will never buy books from them again.",2020-09-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,24.0,943,184,35,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,failing anthropology class amazon class started ordered textbook amazon prime said would week day supposed delivered called delivered money refunded called class textbook asked instead refund please send another book said thing happened contact tell book damaged give refund point im week class get refund order book elsewhere amazon contacted first even second time would textbook exam amazon took long take exam without textbook ebook either received lowest grade ever gotten year disappointed amazon never buy book,0.004375552868536953,0.995624447131463,0.10319685922602355,0.2,0.8184515954109362,81.84515954109361,High Trust
