Sharon Ciarallo,/users/5f6ca4db4b28adc538a8b7c5,US,1.0,2020-09-24 13:53:44+00:00,1.0,Beware,"Beware, Amazon has scammers who have access into their system through a backdoor who will purchase items on your account and charge them to your credit card.  It will look like you purchased the items and that the item will be delivered to you.  However, you will pay for the item but never receive it.  They have tried to do this to us 3 times.  We fortunately caught them and cancelled our credit card before we were charged.  However, when we called amazon, their customer service was useless and said that they were getting access into our account through our email when this was impossible.  They refused to admit that the issue is on their side.  We have since cancelled our account with them.",2020-09-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,24.0,699,124,6,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,beware amazon scammer access system backdoor purchase item account charge credit card look like purchased item item delivered however pay item never receive tried u time fortunately caught cancelled credit card charged however called amazon customer service useless said getting access account email impossible refused admit issue side since cancelled account,0.026924132786057296,0.9730758672139427,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.8004470755026528,80.04470755026529,High Trust
