Pete Wright,/users/5c1165056b8fe687858eed89,GB,59.0,2020-09-19 21:07:18+00:00,1.0,On 17 July  I ordered an paid for  a…,"On 17 July  I ordered an paid for  a Canon picxma printer. This item was not delivered and after days of trying to contact them was told that this item was out of stock. To date 2 months later this has still not been delivered and unbelievably the item is still up for sale. Amazon,  the world's most profitable company owned by the world's richest man can get away with robbing me or less than  £30.00 and still advertising the printer for sale when they keep telling me it is not in stock",2020-09-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,19.0,490,93,37,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,july ordered paid canon picxma printer item delivered day trying contact told item stock date month later still delivered unbelievably item still sale amazon world profitable company owned world richest man get away robbing less £ still advertising printer sale keep telling stock,0.08715617950268428,0.9128438204973157,0.05215928210880538,0.2,0.7668537666704188,76.68537666704188,High Trust
