Emmelyn John,/users/5f6659ed000e29ec22df94a3,US,2.0,2020-09-19 19:20:38+00:00,1.0,The overnight staff are rude and lazy,"I do not like writing negative reviews........BUTI have never had a problem with Amazon customer service in the past. Whenever they delivered my packages to the wrong address or did not deliver them at all, they were very helpful. However, during these past months, it has been ridiculous the number of times I have had to call to report they never delivered the package, or that every single day in the amazon status, it would say the package would arrive at 8 pm, then never arrived and the next day it would say the same and not arrive again.The customer service people only give excuse after excuse and tell me to wait till a certain day (even though the package should have arrived five days to a week ago). When I tell them I am tired of these situations and that I cannot wait because I need the product, they say there is nothing they can do.Last night I had a similar situation. I ordered a book two weeks ago, and it was Prime. It has been showing in the amazon status that it is out for delivery since six days ago, then every night, it says it was delayed and will arrive the next day at 8 pm. I have complained about this, and they keep telling me it will arrive the next day, as the link says. When it does not arrive, and I call AGAIN, they tell me the same thing and refuse to cancel the order. I checked the USPS webpage with the tracking number, and nowhere it says that the package ever left to be delivered. The USPS says it still has not been scanned (mind you, it was prime, and amazon should have had delivered the package the next day and two weeks have passed). The last lady I spoke to last night (the name said deepshikha) told me just to pick it up at the postal service. I told her why I should have to go to pick up something I pay PRIME to have delivered by Amazon? She proceeded to ask me sarcastically if I knew more than her how things run there internally at the facility.I asked her to transfer me to someone else since I did not want to keep dealing with her, and she said she could not do that, which is a lie because they often do transfer their customers to other people when they are unable to figure out what is going on.I do not know what kind of people they are hiring lately, but it seems as if the company does not care anymore if they have or not customer service skills. I used to order from Amazon every other day, but it seems like it is not worth it anymore. First, because they think that our money grow out of trees and we NEED to suck it up when they do not deliver our products and lastly because what is the point of paying for a PRIME membership when you buy products UNDER PRIME (THEY SPECIFICALLY SAY PRIME AND THAT WILL ARRIVE IN ONE TO TWO DAYS) and the products take a week or more or never arrive at all?This will definitely be my last year paying for prime membership, and in the meantime, will hesitate to buy from them. From now on, I will order from other websites and pay for fast shipping.",2020-09-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,19.0,2958,569,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,like writing negative reviewsbuti never problem amazon customer service past whenever delivered package wrong address deliver helpful however past month ridiculous number time call report never delivered package every single day amazon status would say package would arrive pm never arrived next day would say arrive againthe customer service people give excuse excuse tell wait till certain day even though package arrived five day week ago tell tired situation cannot wait need product say nothing dolast night similar situation ordered book two week ago prime showing amazon status delivery since six day ago every night say delayed arrive next day pm complained keep telling arrive next day link say arrive call tell thing refuse cancel order checked usps webpage tracking number nowhere say package ever left delivered usps say still scanned mind prime amazon delivered package next day two week passed last lady spoke last night name said deepshikha told pick postal service told go pick something pay prime delivered amazon proceeded ask sarcastically knew thing run internally facilityi asked transfer someone else since want keep dealing said could lie often transfer customer people unable figure going oni know kind people hiring lately seems company care anymore customer service skill used order amazon every day seems like worth anymore first think money grow tree need suck deliver product lastly point paying prime membership buy product prime specifically say prime arrive one two day product take week never arrive allthis definitely last year paying prime membership meantime hesitate buy order website pay fast shipping,0.005503608359342426,0.9944963916406576,0.319125070106562,0.2,0.8610732098416412,86.10732098416412,High Trust
