Mike,/users/5ea04877949c72c2a553694b,US,10.0,2020-09-17 00:45:35+00:00,1.0,Amazon doesn't care,"Amazon may have some products you want. But when it comes to regular shipping, they are the worst in the industry. Took almost 2 weeks to ship. Had to call Amazon to get them to resend. First time UPS shipping label was created, but after a week it didn't ship. I won't buy again from Amazon because if you don't have Prime, then they don't care. So, Amazon has lost me as a customer. I had my account deleted. I will spend my money somewhere else.",2020-09-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,17.0,448,86,19,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon may product want come regular shipping worst industry took almost week ship call amazon get resend first time ups shipping label created week didnt ship wont buy amazon dont prime dont care amazon lost customer account deleted spend money somewhere else,0.027401705913245776,0.9725982940867542,0.04823331463825014,0.2,0.7959458099710272,79.59458099710271,High Trust
