Michael L Boyd,/users/5f0f4cbe1a3e16154ce49359,US,10.0,2020-09-16 07:30:34+00:00,1.0,Easy question confuses two who can't!,"Why I would ever believe that any one of Amazon's employee's  who are manning the Live Chat, are truly alive has me wondering, for sure! This in regards to delivery. Amazon asks if you would like to pick a delivery day, during the week to bundle ordered items into a single shipment. Ok fine. So I do, and for what when they still send out when they decide and thus my desire to have one order to know when it will be dropped off, is good for me and I would think what they desire since, they asked and recommended it themselves! But can you get not one but two chat bots to understand??? NO these two would only play some helpless game of total disbelief and try to bend things there way. Which in the end is nothing but time wasted, with two helpless individuals who were not to be ever considered customer help. And I realize this is my last time to need a review regarding such. Because this will be my last time ever trying the need that option for help thru message or chat, and strictly call for assistance!",2020-09-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,16.0,1014,193,37,6,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,would ever believe one amazon employee manning live chat truly alive wondering sure regard delivery amazon asks would like pick delivery day week bundle ordered item single shipment ok fine still send decide thus desire one order know dropped good would think desire since asked recommended get one two chat bot understand two would play helpless game total disbelief try bend thing way end nothing time wasted two helpless individual ever considered customer help realize last time need review regarding last time ever trying need option help thru message chat strictly call assistance,0.5506251808666057,0.4493748191333943,0.10824453168816602,0.2,0.5463363159043303,54.633631590433026,Medium Trust
Dan,/users/5f49f31ca34d3b1b618a86fd,US,2.0,2020-09-15 22:36:52+00:00,1.0,Was a Prime member for quite a few…,"Was a Prime member for quite a few years but decided I would not renew my Prime account with all of delay issues expected with the current Covid issue. I have noticed when I place an order through Amazon now that I am no longer a Prime member it is not processed for almost a week before it is shipped. My issue is I can order the same product through other vendors and it is processed and usually shipped the next day although it may take a few days to arrive. Can't help but feel like Amazon tries to pressure you into their Prime membership. I have ordered items from Ebay, Walmart and other vendors and received them within a couple of days though so it is not a carrier issue. I have to assume it is intentional on Amazon's part in an attempt to gain prime memberships. Needless to say I will just order elsewhere in the future.",2020-09-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,15.0,833,159,35,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime member quite year decided would renew prime account delay issue expected current covid issue noticed place order amazon longer prime member processed almost week shipped issue order product vendor processed usually shipped next day although may take day arrive cant help feel like amazon try pressure prime membership ordered item ebay walmart vendor received within couple day though carrier issue assume intentional amazon part attempt gain prime membership needless say order elsewhere future,0.0038242833133643023,0.9961757166866357,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.8159229677095545,81.59229677095546,High Trust
David Prince,/users/5f613b6dbf1ae743949599a5,US,2.0,2020-09-15 22:09:07+00:00,1.0,If I give zero stars I would,"If I give zero stars I would. Today I had to contact customer service because I placed an order on a Thursday, I don’t have prime by the way, and paid for TWO DAY SHIPPING. What comes to mind when you see “Two- Day Shipping”? My thought was well let me pay $17.00 for two day because I want it to come a lot faster as a special event was coming up and I made a last ditch effort to get a gift. Yes I know it’s my fault for being so late for a gift but I trusted amazon for being a very fast delivery company, the convenience is astronomical. Order one thing today and get it by the next. Seems good right? Well I paid for two day shipping and expected it (as in the name) for it to be shipped out the same day and be received two days AFTER the order was placed. This has been the case countless times when I used amazon in the past. That’s why I choose amazon. So this time it wasn’t the case, my item shipped out three days after the order was placed and I called with my confused self and I got nothing but attitude and defensive wording and blame game. I told them that Two Day Shipping is different from Two Day Delivery. Two Day Delivery is when you order something and regardless of when you order it, it will be delivered within two days of whenever the order being placed. Two day shipping is more of it will shipped two day when you place the order. I mean it’s all about convenience with amazon so if you can kind of have a play on words with customers but still not break the “contract” they still win because they keep your money based of your assumptions. Like anyone, I would have assumed that when I’m trying to buy something under pressure or time constraint and I see “if you pay $17.00 extra, you can get Two Day Shipping”. My thought “oh that’s convenient cause I need it pretty much now” but that wasn’t the case. I just wish it was more apparent as to what they are saying right there when you purchase a different shipping method rather then having you just assume something based off the wording. They need better customer service as well.",2020-09-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,15.0,2063,398,28,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,give zero star would today contact customer service placed order thursday don’t prime way paid two day shipping come mind see “two day shipping” thought well let pay two day want come lot faster special event coming made last ditch effort get gift yes know it’s fault late gift trusted amazon fast delivery company convenience astronomical order one thing today get next seems good right well paid two day shipping expected name shipped day received two day order placed case countless time used amazon past that’s choose amazon time wasn’t case item shipped three day order placed called confused self got nothing attitude defensive wording blame game told two day shipping different two day delivery two day delivery order something regardless order delivered within two day whenever order placed two day shipping shipped two day place order mean it’s convenience amazon kind play word customer still break “contract” still win keep money based assumption like anyone would assumed i’m trying buy something pressure time constraint see “if pay extra get two day shipping” thought “oh that’s convenient cause need pretty much now” wasn’t case wish apparent saying right purchase different shipping method rather assume something based wording need better customer service well,0.005739581017747929,0.994260418982252,0.2232192933258553,0.2,0.8417740681562971,84.17740681562971,High Trust
