Freddie,/users/5f176c6b96fe874a6924c140,GB,6.0,2020-09-10 13:20:48+00:00,1.0,Disgusting! Didn’t receive my item and they’re refusing a refund!,"Disgusting customer service. I ordered 2x watches, upon opening my parcel I saw two watch boxes, but only one box had a watch inside, the other was empty! To my shock, I contacted Amazon immediately and they opened an investigation. After a few days, they asked me to file a police report, which I did. After sending them the report ID, Amazon said we will not be refunding or replacing since our records show both items left our fulfillment centre ‘complete’. To my shock, I did my own investigation and weighed the watch on its own and with its packaging, alongside the parcel box and realised my entire parcel which was 900 grams was missing about 70 grams which was the exact weight of the second watch that was missing! Amazon’s website also verified that one watch is 70 grams. Hence, I forwarded my findings to Amazon explaining my parcel should have been 970 grams and not 900 grams (all together), yet they sent me another generic email stating we will not be refunding or replacing! Now I’ve paid hundreds of pounds only for one watch. Tried calling various different departments and spoke to many managers but simply put nobody cares. My money is simply gone and I cannot do anything about it. In fact they’ve refused to look at my evidence and when I asked to see their findings, I got nothing back. They’ve literally taken my money and are refusing to do anything about it. I’ve asked many times to provide me a email so I could send them my findings, but nobody cares. I advise people not to buy expensive items as there is no guarantee you’ll get it, it never was like this, but this seems to be the new Amazon. As far as Amazon is concerned, as long as you receive a package at your address (empty or not) their job is done. All my family, friends and colleagues have stopped buying from them.",2020-09-10 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,10.0,1809,329,65,10,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,disgusting customer service ordered x watch upon opening parcel saw two watch box one box watch inside empty shock contacted amazon immediately opened investigation day asked file police report sending report id amazon said refunding replacing since record show item left fulfillment centre ‘complete’ shock investigation weighed watch packaging alongside parcel box realised entire parcel gram missing gram exact weight second watch missing amazon’s website also verified one watch gram hence forwarded finding amazon explaining parcel gram gram together yet sent another generic email stating refunding replacing i’ve paid hundred pound one watch tried calling various different department spoke many manager simply put nobody care money simply gone cannot anything fact they’ve refused look evidence asked see finding got nothing back they’ve literally taken money refusing anything i’ve asked many time provide email could send finding nobody care advise people buy expensive item guarantee you’ll get never like seems new amazon far amazon concerned long receive package address empty job done family friend colleague stopped buying,0.38916825183066267,0.6108317481693373,0.18452047111609646,0.2,0.642319968307888,64.2319968307888,Medium Trust
