Patricia Mickett Gearing,/users/5cca258f85a5408bafa087d7,US,5.0,2020-09-07 12:37:57+00:00,1.0,Wrong delivery,"Hello all !!I have been an Amazon user for so long and have had no problems!  Recently an item I ordered never arrived and they kept telling me I got my refund and I never did!  Finally, had to contact my bank and file a dispute!But, that is not the BIG one!I placed 4 orders within a week!  One arrived fine and the other 4 were delivered to the wrong address and the thing that got my goat the most is they sent me a picture of someone else’s doorway!!!!!!!  On calling, they have that calm scripted attitude that only made me more angry.  One order I cancelled that was a small amount and went to Staples.  The second order had two items in it and requested replacement!  They only replaced half!  And I had to get the second half replaced also! Don’t you know it, IT went to the SAME wrong address again with a picture of the doorway.  My third order order thank the lord arrived with no problem.  I called back to check on the next replacement and talked to Logistics who assured me everything was fine.  Yesterday the second replacement was due and for some reason I checked my account and there was a delivery confirmation and yet again a wrong delivery and someone else’s house!  By this time I am furious!  After explaining my story again and with anger, they suggested I check the neighborhood and see if I can see it.  We live in a condo with 26 units and you know that wasn’t going to happen.  Since distribution is a town away, I wanted them to call and make the driver return ( of course he would have to remember where he left it ) and of course no dice!  So to make a long story short they are sending a third replacement today, but I don’t have much hope.  So as of this minute there are 3 Katy Perry CD’s out there just floating, and if you got one, please enjoy it on me! And, if she reaches the top of the charts with the cd, well I know I had something to do with it!  What has happened to Amazon, to big, to fast, bound to crash!  Spent almost 2 hours on the phone trying to resolve, I think I will pay full price and go back to brick and mortar!   Beware my friends !!!!  Pretty sure my cd will be in the bargain bin before I see it-Amazon get it together!",2020-09-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,7.0,2179,421,14,2,0.0,0,29,2,1,Suspicious,hello amazon user long problem recently item ordered never arrived kept telling got refund never finally contact bank file disputebut big onei placed order within week one arrived fine delivered wrong address thing got goat sent picture someone else’s doorway calling calm scripted attitude made angry one order cancelled small amount went staple second order two item requested replacement replaced half get second half replaced also don’t know went wrong address picture doorway third order order thank lord arrived problem called back check next replacement talked logistics assured everything fine yesterday second replacement due reason checked account delivery confirmation yet wrong delivery someone else’s house time furious explaining story anger suggested check neighborhood see see live condo unit know wasn’t going happen since distribution town away wanted call make driver return course would remember left course dice make long story short sending third replacement today don’t much hope minute katy perry cd’s floating got one please enjoy reach top chart cd well know something happened amazon big fast bound crash spent almost hour phone trying resolve think pay full price go back brick mortar beware friend pretty sure cd bargain bin see itamazon get together,1.0,0.0,0.23611890072910824,0.2,0.34722378014582167,34.72237801458217,Low Trust
Mary Hakobyan,/users/5f55c5aee3965ce46fdf6c6f,CA,2.0,2020-09-07 05:31:34+00:00,1.0,I am a seller on Amazon and I can say…,"I am a seller on Amazon and I can say there is no seller support of any kind. I advise everyone to sell on eBay, much better seller support. Basically you can never call and get help on the phone, you can only open a case for which you have to click many places, answer many questions, choose topics and if your problem is not among the listed ones you basically cannot ask for help. And if you get to open a case, after a day a machine generated response comes probably partly related to your problem and the case is closed. You cannot reply and ask more details, if you want to contact them with the same problem you have to go and click many places, choose a topic and etc.This is ridiculous! Buyers can easily call and get help on the phone, whereas the sellers cannot. Buyers are more important for amazon, they deserve better assistance, whereas sellers are nothing.",2020-09-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,7.0,872,162,38,10,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,seller amazon say seller support kind advise everyone sell ebay much better seller support basically never call get help phone open case click many place answer many question choose topic problem among listed one basically cannot ask help get open case day machine generated response come probably partly related problem case closed cannot reply ask detail want contact problem go click many place choose topic etcthis ridiculous buyer easily call get help phone whereas seller cannot buyer important amazon deserve better assistance whereas seller nothing,0.026143000109706663,0.9738569998902933,0.09085810431856421,0.2,0.8051001208088595,80.51001208088596,High Trust
