Grace Walters,/users/5f52bf251884c618fb6c22e5,US,1.0,2020-09-04 22:27:03+00:00,1.0,The worst experience ever,"The worst experience everGood afternoonMy name is Grace Walters and I need help with getting the product I ordered or my money back from Amazon. On July 15 2020 I ordered a desktop computer for my child so she can do the remote learning in September. The item never arrived and I reported it. I asked fpr a new item to be sent to me or a refund. Its is now September 4 and all Amazon is doing is HANDLING me . Telling me they are so sorry they will investigate. I have been calling then twice a week since July. They told me to check the neighborhood . I did , I asked the retire women that are always on there porch. I asked my noisy upstairs neighbor . I ask my niece that lives with me. No package came. I have bought other large costly items from Amazon before , this never happened. But now that it did. Amazon is acting as if I have cooties and is feeding me a well scripted line.  We are looking into it. They told me to give them 2 - 3 days each time .I did, I have but still no desk top computer and no money. This last call the supervisor asked me if I contacted anyone from ups or fedex about this. Why ?  how? I asked him so what type of investigation yoy have been doing all this time to be asking me that question. I am a single mother of 2 children with little or no support. There father died last year from renal failure and I have little or no family here . Any help i can get would be appreciated.Thank you Grace Walters",2020-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,9.0,4.0,1439,288,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,worst experience evergood afternoonmy name grace walter need help getting product ordered money back amazon july ordered desktop computer child remote learning september item never arrived reported asked fpr new item sent refund september amazon handling telling sorry investigate calling twice week since july told check neighborhood asked retire woman always porch asked noisy upstairs neighbor ask niece life package came bought large costly item amazon never happened amazon acting cootie feeding well scripted line looking told give day time still desk top computer money last call supervisor asked contacted anyone ups fedex asked type investigation yoy time asking question single mother child little support father died last year renal failure little family help get would appreciatedthank grace walter,0.012459786422868808,0.9875402135771312,0.16152551878855861,0.2,0.8260752105462773,82.60752105462772,High Trust
