Christi Nickerson-Rowe,/users/5f4d76e0e6592bfb68722a17,US,1.0,2020-08-31 22:17:11+00:00,1.0,The drivers give no f*cks about doing…,"The drivers give no f*cks about doing their job correctly.  2 packages in 2 weeks stolen because the drivers don't read or can't read notes and numbers.  I've received 2 of my neighbors packages because they can't read the address numbers 2 feet above where they dropped the package or didn't want to walk to the back of my condo.  They did like to take pictures showing they didn't bother reading the notes for deliveries.  Next issue... John makes t shirts and sells them at $15 each.  Amazon says they'll buy all his tshirts at $5.  The stores he sold too can't get their supply because Amazon bought them all.  Amazon sells them online at $8 each your shop sold them at $16.  Your shop tried to make $1 profit.  John took a cut and probably a small loss that could put his production out of business.  Customers refuse to go to either one because they can get then cheaper on Amazon.  Don't buy Amazon!  Wal-Mart does the same thing but Amazon put john in bankrupty and then bought John's business for pennies.  You May want it cheaper but you're hurting small businesses for the convenience of ""1 day delivery""",2020-08-31 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,31.0,1115,200,38,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,driver give fcks job correctly package week stolen driver dont read cant read note number ive received neighbor package cant read address number foot dropped package didnt want walk back condo like take picture showing didnt bother reading note delivery next issue john make shirt sell amazon say theyll buy tshirts store sold cant get supply amazon bought amazon sell online shop sold shop tried make profit john took cut probably small loss could put production business customer refuse go either one get cheaper amazon dont buy amazon walmart thing amazon put john bankrupty bought john business penny may want cheaper youre hurting small business convenience day delivery,0.011758618771406345,0.9882413812285936,0.11217049915872125,0.2,0.8165547904460411,81.6554790446041,High Trust
