Simona,/users/580f0f6f0000ff000a50c3d0,CY,4.0,2020-08-29 08:32:51+00:00,1.0,Terible experience,"I have barely used Amazon, made some orders more than one year ago.. However someone hacked my account and made an upgrade to premium also started to do some shopping, luckily i didnt had funds on the card so it wasnt processed. They emailed me telling me that they have blocked my account as they noticed unusual activity and to try and reset my password in about 2 h. Fair enough... Days have passed and i still couldn't reset my password.. Kepping asking me for an otp which never came. Called them too while struggling with this and the said that will keep not allow any activity to take place from my account and cancel the premium... Well.. One month later i got charged and still no access on my account and i can not verify my account as the dude who hacked it changed the address and the support lady kept asking me to verify my address.... HOWWW??? I told her every possible address i could have had ordered from and aparently she said that it is not from my country...asked about a refund on the upgrade and to close the account..she told me to apply for charge back.. Basically nothing was possible as i couldnt enter my account and i ended up making charge back and cancelling my card as no other friendly way to do it..verry disappointed on the quality of support, considering the size of the company... Oh.. One thing she told me.. In order to cancel this account i have to create another one with the sane email... Is that even possible???",2020-08-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,29.0,1455,267,18,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,barely used amazon made order one year ago however someone hacked account made upgrade premium also started shopping luckily didnt fund card wasnt processed emailed telling blocked account noticed unusual activity try reset password h fair enough day passed still couldnt reset password kepping asking otp never came called struggling said keep allow activity take place 