LISA,/users/5f481e57867714a8fb409406,GB,6.0,2020-08-27 23:30:33+00:00,1.0,amazon are trash i made 8 orders only 7…,"amazon are trash i made 8 orders only 7 arrived so i just asked for a refund .then they blocked me and banned my account .Hello,We have closed this account. Our records show that your account is directly linked to an account we have closed for violating the terms of our Conditions of Use & Sale agreement. When we close your account for violating the terms of an agreement, you cannot open a new account or use another account to place orders on our site. We have cancelled and refunded any open orders you had on this account. Any digital content that you purchased with this account is still available to you. To access the content, click the “Manage Your Content and Devices” link on the Your Account menu on Amazon.co.uk.  If you would like to appeal this decision, please reply to this email to reach an Account Specialist. Our Customer Service team can only confirm that we sent this message and help you with technical issues. They cannot reverse this decision or share more details on this matter. Sincerely, Account SpecialistAmazon.co.uknow i will just charge back the entire account f@~ck amazon",2020-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,27.0,1107,192,40,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon trash made order arrived asked refund blocked banned account hellowe closed account record show account directly linked account closed violating term condition use sale agreement close account violating term agreement cannot open new account use another account place order site cancelled refunded open order account digital content purchased account still available access content click “manage content devices” link account menu amazoncouk would like appeal decision please reply email reach account specialist customer service team confirm sent message help technical issue cannot reverse decision share detail matter sincerely account specialistamazoncouknow charge back entire account fc