uzair rashid,/users/5f3e6b9729878d297f3a3bac,IN,2.0,2020-08-27 15:41:29+00:00,1.0,Shocking Revelation about Amazon,Shocking Revelation about AmazonI had ordered a Puma slippers in the month of June 2020 & expected delivery time was given on 24th of July 2020. I checked my order on 24 of July & I was shocked to see that the said is being shown as delivered on 11 July 2020. So I called the customer care & they ensured me that there has been some technical issues & will get delivered within 3 working days but I didn't get that. So I called customer care again & i was ensured again the same to wait for 3 working days & this time they even assured me that I will get a call from Amazon but again I didn't get any call or response. Then I called the customer care again & narrated the whole story & this time around I was told the same story to wait for another 3 working days & did some acting of apologies & sorries & I did again wait for another 3 working days as I had been doing from last 3 months but the story remained the same I couldn't get the product nor I get the call from Amazon. So I decided to call the Customer care again & now I am not getting connected. I tried like anything but every time I failed to get connected. I thought as if they have blocked my number. So today after so many days I tried again to call customer care lot of times & now I am not being connected same as earlier & furthermore the system is telling me that we have failed to locate & find your order. I was shocked to see this sort of behaviour & fraud from the reputed organization like Amazon. This is pathetic & not acceptable in any manner. Is this the fundamental motive of the company to loot & indulge in the fraudulent practices. Is this the social obligation of the company.,2020-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,27.0,1663,329,32,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,shocking revelation amazoni ordered puma slipper month june expected delivery time given th july checked order july shocked see said shown delivered july called customer care ensured technical issue get delivered within working day didnt get called customer care ensured wait working day time even assured get call amazon didnt get call response called customer care narrated whole story time around told story wait another working day acting apology sorries wait another working day last month story remained couldnt get product get call amazon decided call customer care getting connected tried like anything every time failed get connected thought blocked number today many day tried call customer care lot time connected earlier furthermore system telling failed locate find order shocked see sort behaviour fraud reputed organization like amazon pathetic acceptable manner fundamental motive company loot indulge fraudulent practice social obligation company,0.011811841058483853,0.9881881589415161,0.18452047111609646,0.2,0.8309981736939773,83.09981736939773,High Trust
dg bunny,/users/5f47ca3abc400d38e825241b,US,1.0,2020-08-27 14:59:37+00:00,1.0,"Ordered two packages, both lost and cancelled","Ordered two packages, both lost in transit. We have prime delivery, and expected the packages to come the day after since it was guaranteed free shipping. After placing the first order, it got ""lost in transit"" and was cancelled, and we reordered the same package which again got ""lost in transit."" It's time to look for different ways to buy items online, not reliable at all. I can't trust their shipping dates at all, look to purchase items from your local store.",2020-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,27.0,466,82,45,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered two package lost transit prime delivery expected package come day since guaranteed free shipping placing first order got lost transit cancelled reordered package got lost transit time look different way buy item online reliable cant trust shipping date look purchase item local store,0.011384301037051571,0.9886156989629484,0.045989904655075714,0.2,0.8035058304124892,80.35058304124892,High Trust
Xin Chen,/users/5f4779bc4630aa612a03fdf4,CA,1.0,2020-08-27 09:15:51+00:00,2.0,Amazon seems to be very environmentally…,"Amazon seems to be very environmentally insensitive.I ordered a Selkirk gas exhaust vent top from Amazon.ca. Only a week later, the price dropped by $25. I requested a refund of the price difference, but the Customer Services would not do that even though it was only 7 days later. Instead, the Customer Service person said I would have to return my order and reorder with reduced price even though they are the same products from the same supplier. I had to ship my order back and they would ship my a new order. It only created two unnecessary shipping, wasting fossil fuel. It even created more handling effort for them and myself. No one gain anything but it wastes energy, packing materials and labor, causing environmental pollution. Really nonsense and foolish practice from both environment and business points of view.",2020-08-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,27.0,827,140,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon seems environmentally insensitivei ordered selkirk gas exhaust vent top amazonca week later price dropped requested refund price difference customer service would even though day later instead customer service person said would return order reorder reduced price even though product supplier ship order back would ship new order created two unnecessary shipping wasting fossil fuel even created handling effort one gain anything waste energy packing material labor causing environmental pollution really nonsense foolish practice environment business point view,0.01473558711472377,0.9852644128852762,0.07851934941110487,0.4,1.108336076324859,110.83360763248591,High Trust
