PD,/users/5637458b0000ff0001e763d7,GB,31.0,2020-08-25 14:58:43+00:00,1.0,Drivers expose your parcels to be nicked!! All the time”,"I didn’t want to do this but it’s got to the point Where I feel something really has to be said or done now. What is it with amazon delivery drivers knocking on the door, but not waiting at all, they literally dump your parcel every single time on the floor in front of the door, knock and then run off back to their vans and drive off”!! 😡😡 what the hell”! So this is really caring about your costumers eh? I am always home the majority of the time and they never ever give me a chance to get to their door. We have cameras on the house and it clearly shows they just knock and run off 😯. They don’t wait at all for you to answer. How is this right !? I’ve always had my settings as leave in safe place but they never ever do this no more. Its lucky I’m in because I’m sure everyone else is at risk of having their parcels nicked seen as they r completely exposed to the public. Anyone can take your parcel. I have reported this whenever it asks for my feedback on how the driver did. But seems they all do it now and nothing ever gets done about it. Something should be done about this. It’s sick.",2020-08-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,25.0,1099,220,56,10,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,didn’t want it’s got point feel something really said done amazon delivery driver knocking door waiting literally dump parcel every single time floor front door knock run back van drive off” 😡😡 hell” really caring costumer eh always home majority time never ever give chance get door camera house clearly show knock run 😯 don’t wait answer right i’ve always setting leave safe place never ever lucky i’m i’m sure everyone else risk parcel nicked seen r completely exposed public anyone take parcel reported whenever asks feedback driver seems nothing ever get done something done it’s sick,0.9346987577047048,0.06530124229529521,0.12338754907459339,0.2,0.35732813096256627,35.732813096256