Rachel-Leanne Edwards,/users/58b461ff0000ff000a7c0976,GB,12.0,2020-08-24 12:21:21+00:00,1.0,AMAZON PRIME WARDROBE NOT WORTH THE HASSLE... EVEN WHEN YOU USE IT CORRECTLY. DON'T BOTHER!,"Amazon Prime Wardrobe is not worth the trouble. I have been a customer/member for years, they have made a lit of money from me. I used Prime Wardrobe for the first time. We sent all items back within the time frame, following the returns instructions to the letter, & obtaining proof of postage. After a few days, my account showed that returns were accepted. I carried on as normal. I place orders every month & every month I use subscribe & save.Just over a few weeks ago, Amazon Prime Wardrobe started charging me for an item (a BRA, that did not fit) in fact, I bought a bra later on, in a different size, through Amazon, because the prime wardrobe one didn't fit. This bra, however, ordered through Amazon, paid for & delivered & I am happy with it........I tried straight away to sort this matter out on chat. They could not help. Then, despite me having the same details & same phone number for over ten years, they told me they ""could not connect my call"" so I found the freephone no. & called. I was assured if would be sorted on the first call. Next day, charged my bank again. I have had to strip that bank account & not use it, because of what follwed; • several emails  • daily phone calls  • Promises made over phone AND in writing    that the auto-charge would stop...• Always contacting Amazon & not the other   way around.• managers & supervisors ""Not being able to   get hold of the Prime Wardrobe dept.""???• Being given TWO email addresses for    Prime Wardrobe & BOTH of them being   WRONG & sent back to me.• Over 2 and a half weeks later & daily calls & emails from me, complaints from me, I am STILL being auto-charged EVERY DAY, for an item I fo not have, I cannot use my bank account & ammeter promises of ""someone from the department will get back to you"" no one has.???Poor, poor customer service, no loyalty shown at all. Its impacting on my metal health as each time I'm told it's sorted, I wake up to another & the exact same charge.I have given Anazon a hell of a lot 9f m9ney over the years, I've had times I've complained, but mainly, was overall really happy - otherwise I wouldn't be a member for so long, or carried on using all the various extra services including Prime  - but this matter has pushed me to the edge.Amazon Prime Wardrobe needs to dort itself out. I would Not recommend it & I would encourage people away from it & when this matter (which I will have to escalate) is sorted, I'm afraid the whole experience has just worn me down & I'll be leaving Amazon Prime. You need to SORT OUT YOUR CUSTOMER SERVICE, BEFORE YOU LOSE ALL YOUR REALLY LOYAL CUSTOMERS!!",2020-08-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,24.0,2607,483,91,15,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime wardrobe worth trouble customermember year made lit money used prime wardrobe first time sent item back within time frame following return instruction letter obtaining proof postage day account showed return accepted carried normal place order every month every month use subscribe savejust week ago amazon prime wardrobe started charging item bra fit fact bought bra later different size amazon prime wardrobe one didnt fit bra however ordered amazon paid delivered happy iti tried straight away sort matter chat could help despite detail phone number ten year told could connect call found freephone called assured would sorted first call next day charged bank strip bank account use follwed • several email • daily phone call • promise made phone writing autocharge would stop• always contacting amazon way around• manager supervisor able get hold prime wardrobe dept• given two email address prime wardrobe wrong sent back me• half week later daily call email complaint still autocharged every day item fo cannot use bank account ammeter promise someone department get back one haspoor poor customer service loyalty shown impacting metal health time im told sorted wake another exact chargei given anazon hell lot f mney year ive time ive complained mainly overall really happy otherwise wouldnt member long carried using various extra service including prime matter pushed edgeamazon prime wardrobe need dort would recommend would encourage people away matter escalate sorted im afraid whole experience worn ill leaving amazon prime need sort customer service lose really loyal customer,0.03405415447589969,0.9659458455241003,0.27089175546831185,0.2,0.8371512738557125,83.71512738557125,High Trust
