Abismrita Sharma,/users/5f42289dc963bbe76f178184,IN,2.0,2020-08-23 08:28:20+00:00,1.0,Amazon.in,"Amazon.in: Product is out for delivery, no calls, no one came, finally got a message saying delivery attempted but customer unavailable (I was not even contacted). Delivery guys no. doesn't work. Reached out to customer care. They have no contact details of the delivery guy, nor they can connect you to him on conference call. It was worth 7.5k. Have seen reviews where delivery guys are even updating as order delivered and ppl are not even getting the products. Now im worried about losing my 7.5k and not getting the products also. Surprisingly amazon is not taking any strict action towards these type of delivery guys..so basically these delivery guys are updating these ""delivery attempted"" or ""order delivered"" and selling these products to local shops. At the end customer is suffering, getting frustrated running after customer care to get the product or the refund. Never order anything if you love your hard earned money. This is my 3rd worst experience.",2020-08-23 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,23.0,966,160,9,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazonin product delivery call one came finally got message saying delivery attempted customer unavailable even contacted delivery guy doesnt work reached customer care contact detail delivery guy connect conference call worth k seen review delivery guy even updating order delivered ppl even getting product im worried losing k getting product also surprisingly amazon taking strict action towards type delivery guysso basically delivery guy updating delivery attempted order delivered selling product local shop end customer suffering getting frustrated running customer care get product refund never order anything love hard earned money rd worst experience,0.026174092457698462,0.9738259075423016,0.08973639932697701,0.2,0.8048602336365461,80.48602336365461,High Trust
Jonathan Irons,/users/5f417388e456be2af022f54a,US,1.0,2020-08-22 19:35:47+00:00,1.0,This a reivew of the terrible customer support I received buying a camera from Amazon,"This is not a review of the camera. It is with the customer support. I ordered this camera 8/13 and it was ""delivered"" 8/19 (by Amazon mind you), but I had no package. I tried for 2 days between the management in the building I live in and the company that manages the package room to find out what may have happened. Nothing between either of them. So obviously next I call Amazon. They said because it's expensive that they have to run an investigation. After that's over, I got an email saying they've confirmed it was delivered to the right address and they can't provide a refund or replacement. They say I need to file a police report with the NYPD and to call them when it's fully completed and that I assume the risk of the package after they give it to the carrier. I immediately call them and ask for a manager. After being transferred a man tells me that he himself can't issue a refund/replacement but he's gonna transfer me over to the right department that will. I get transferred over again and placed on hold. Now i'm on the phone with a woman who's telling me the same thing the email said that they can't do anything without a completed police report. She claims the package was signed by (the package required a signature) someone named ""mario"". So you claim to deliver my package, don't take a picture of it, I don't get a locker code for it from the package room, you don't deliver it directly to my door, and have some random man named mario sign for it (nobody that works in my building is named mario I checked). Now I have no camera, that I need for work mind you, Amazon won't give me a refund/replacement so i'm out $4,500 during a pandemic, and I have to file and wait for a completed police report and maybe they'll help me and who knows how long that'll take. All this for something I ordered and never even seen. This is the worst customer support I've ever received in my entire life, especially from a company i've been shopping with since 2013. Obviously you cannot order anything expensive from them, because if something happens in the shipping process you're dead in the water.  Thanks for the $5 promotional for my pain suffering tho.",2020-08-22 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,22.0,2172,399,85,15,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,review camera customer support ordered camera delivered amazon mind package tried day management building live company manages package room find may happened nothing either obviously next call amazon said expensive run investigation thats got email saying theyve confirmed delivered right address cant provide refund replacement say need file police report nypd call fully completed assume risk package give carrier immediately call ask manager transferred man tell cant issue refundreplacement he gonna transfer right department get transferred placed hold im phone woman who telling thing email said cant anything without completed police report claim package signed package required signature someone named mario claim deliver package dont take picture dont get locker code package room dont deliver directly door random man named mario sign nobody work building named mario checked camera need work mind amazon wont give refundreplacement im pandemic file wait completed police report maybe theyll help know long thatll take something ordered never even seen worst customer support ive ever received entire life especially company ive shopping since obviously cannot order anything expensive something happens shipping process youre dead water thanks promotional pain suffering tho,0.004131671209975421,0.9958683287900246,0.2237801458216489,0.2,0.842690193559342,84.2690193559342,High Trust
