elivered within mintsbut delivery boy abdullah tell it’s returned seller cant delivery todaydelivery boy rudehe cover face face mask doesnt maintain social distance,0.016463461366907666,0.9835365386330923,0.11946158160403814,0.2,0.8156605856373538,81.56605856373538,High Trust
cheryl herman,/users/5f3b5168ff765d3a0a4ead84,US,2.0,2020-08-18 03:56:36+00:00,1.0,Amazon has terrible customer service,"This is not a review for the firestick itself, but the handling of my order for two.  I returned them using the exact same package they arrived in, however Amazon had only refunded me for one and they apparently have no idea of what to do now.  I have been transferred multiple times and hung up on, though he did call back and remained as clueless as earlier.  I was transferred one last time to someone else who didn't understand why he received the call and then he promptly hung up on me.  And all I was doing was trying to understand why I was not refunded for both devices since they were back in their warehouse simultaneously.  Again I realize this is not a review of the firesticks themselves, but there was no place to send feedback on the performance of their ""keystone cops"" customer service.Thank you.",2020-08-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,18.0,814,148,36,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,review firestick handling order two returned using exact package arrived however amazon refunded one apparently idea transferred multiple time hung though call back remained clueless earlier transferred one last time someone else didnt understand received call promptly hung trying understand refunded device since back warehouse simultaneously realize review firesticks place send feedback performance keystone cop customer servicethank,0.01818447069822115,0.9818155293017788,0.08300616937745373,0.2,0.8075089985263801,80.75089985263801,High Trust
