Oleg Kuperman,/users/5f393d8badfac22067f866f5,US,1.0,2020-08-16 14:08:28+00:00,1.0,Ordered two Sealy pillows from Amazon...,"I ordered two sealy pillows from Amazon on August 7th, given my Prime membership (which is a completely useless word now, including the videos, that are just as useless to me) the pillows were supposed to arrive on August 10th. On August 13th, still haven't received the pillows, I called Amazon to find out why the shipment status said ""ups is ready to accept the package"". It took three more days and three more phone calls and chats to find out that the pillow were lost in transit. The way amazon ""corrected"" this issue is by filling out form and requesting a refund for me, which I still didn't get. I got a runaround every step of the way and at no point did they even attempt to try and fix the problem by shipping pillows from elsewhere, even though they have them, they're on their website, available for purchase.Their Lasership service loses and damages my packages, their cuefomed service takes weeks to process exchanges and refunds. I would also like to mention that their chat-based customer service is completely useless, they're rude, inattentive and completely and utterly incompetent. I've bend shopping with Amazon for well-over a decade but, based on the mishaps that occurred this and past year, I am now forced to re-think my shopping strategy and find a new retail outlet.",2020-08-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,16.0,1296,224,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered two sealy pillow amazon august th given prime membership completely useless word including video useless pillow supposed arrive august th august th still havent received pillow called amazon find shipment status said ups ready accept package took three day three phone call chat find pillow lost transit way amazon corrected issue filling form requesting refund still didnt get got runaround every step way point even attempt try fix problem shipping pillow elsewhere even though theyre website available purchasetheir lasership service loses damage package cuefomed service take week process exchange refund would also like mention chatbased customer service completely useless theyre rude inattentive completely utterly incompetent ive bend shopping amazon wellover decade based mishap occurred past year forced rethink shopping strategy find new retail outlet,0.007644090145881435,0.9923559098541186,0.1256309590577678,0.2,0.8213041467386129,82.13041467386128,High Trust
Elise,/users/5d792cba1addcd5f4caf31f7,US,4.0,2020-08-16 13:30:53+00:00,3.0,Not keeping their promises,"You shop on Amazon.  You find what you want.  One of the reasons you shop here is because of their shipping.  You place your order because Amazon promises your package will be delivered on a certain day.  Then you wait because your package doesn't come.  After they take your money and send you a confirmation telling you when you will get it, you don't get it, and you get an email saying sorry it's late, and if you don't get it by this day, you can have your money back.",2020-08-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,16.0,473,90,26,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,shop amazon find want one reason shop shipping place order amazon promise package delivered certain day wait package doesnt come take money send confirmation telling get dont get get email saying sorry late dont get day money back,0.02129385078553476,0.9787061492144652,0.050476724621424565,0.6,1.3994484195315173,139.94484195315172,High Trust
