Pallavi,/users/5f36b75ea25a04c4761f2855,IN,2.0,2020-08-14 16:10:32+00:00,1.0,Horrible service,"Horrible service, I would give it 0 stars. I Very excitedly Ordered a newly launched Mobile phone, specially bought the prime membership to buy the mobile. The delivery came on a Monday without any intimations from amazon or the delivery guy. There was a exchange involved so the delivery guy goes back. I am at work on Monday like most people. Second day same thing even though the delivery person had been told to call . Third day by chance I am home due to a holiday and get a notification that the delivery has been rejected and item sent back to seller. I did not reject it, the delivery did not come. On calling the customer care they tell me they “ apologize for the inconvenience “ and will reinitiate delivery and I should get it in 24/48 hrs. 48 hrs later I call them & they tell me that it’s been returned to the seller. I till now Have not gotten any information about this from them. And they are again said “we apologize for the inconvenience “ we can’t do nothing now. Oh did I mention I had called on the delivery agent number provided but with no response and had left my phone at home so it could be exchanged for the past two days. Do cont order consumables! Order cheap small stuff that they can leave on ur doorstep & u wouldn’t care.",2020-08-14 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,14.0,1255,238,16,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,horrible service would give star excitedly ordered newly launched mobile phone specially bought prime membership buy mobile delivery came monday without intimation amazon delivery guy exchange involved delivery guy go back work monday like people second day thing even though delivery person told call third day chance home due holiday get notification delivery rejected item sent back seller reject delivery come calling customer care tell “ apologize inconvenience “ reinitiate delivery get hr hr later call tell it’s returned seller till gotten information said “we apologize inconvenience “ can’t nothing oh mention called delivery agent number provided response left phone home could exchanged past two day cont order consumables order cheap small stuff leave ur doorstep u wouldn’t care,0.03384570861013392,0.9661542913898661,0.1334828939988783,0.2,0.8097737244947087,80.97737244947088,High Trust
