Lisa Joy,/users/5f36665f24bf2435336cdef5,US,1.0,2020-08-14 10:29:04+00:00,1.0,Flawed return processing- inept customer service,"I order from amazon a half dozen times a year and for over a decade had no issues and no returns that I recall.On July 28, I returned two moth traps thru UPS store purchased for wrong type of moth. Immediately received email saying one refund was being processed and other would be upon receipt of item. I left for a cross-country trip. Thirteen days later, second refund had yet to be processed. UPS said to call amazon and they would take care of it. Spent 40 min on phone- first with a rep who could not help and escalated me (w/o giving details) to a supervisor with whom I had to start from scratch.She also could not help at first and I became quite agitated over the ridiculousness of the situation- especially after she asked me how UPS had shipped the items - together or separately. (How would I know!!) After I became entirely frustrated, she used her “resources” a second time to confirm the second item had been received Aug 3!! Then she said it would take up to 10 business days to refund. I angrily threatened to write a complaint letter, after which she “found” a way to refund in 3-5 days.Ok. 40 min of incompetence and aggravation.... This is amazon returns processing tracking and customer “service”????Bring it back to US. The ESL factor did not help this situation. Rating: D-",2020-08-14 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,14.0,1297,234,48,6,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,order amazon half dozen time year decade issue return recallon july returned two moth trap thru ups store purchased wrong type moth immediately received email saying one refund processed would upon receipt item left crosscountry trip thirteen day later second refund yet processed ups said call amazon would take care spent min phone first rep could help escalated wo giving detail supervisor start scratchshe also could help first became quite agitated ridiculousness situation especially asked ups shipped item together separately would know became entirely frustrated used “resources” second time confirm second item received aug said would take business day refund angrily threatened write complaint letter “found” way refund daysok min incompetence aggravation amazon return processing tracking customer “service”bring back u esl factor help situation rating,0.8402656487202039,0.15973435127979607,0.13123948401570387,0.2,0.4061150724430388,40.61150724430388,Low Trust
Sharon Curnutte,/users/5f36095a1504dce8e381f5ce,US,1.0,2020-08-14 03:48:21+00:00,1.0,BUYER BEWARE!!!!,"BUYER BEWARE!!!!!  I have spent a few thousand dollars lately with about 1 out of 7 purchases, or less (trying to be generous), purchases are defective or broken. For heavy and expensive purchases especially a problem if defective. Amazon only refunded part of the purchase price and later than promised. Amazon promised rewards as compensation, that they now say do not exist. Amazon customer service out and out lies about what they are doing to correct their defective product returns, requiring multiple calls to multiple people who all say something different. Most amazon customer service associates state they do not want a negative customer experience, but then do not deliver a satisfactory result, only partial refund and not when promised, messed up pick up reservations made by amazon for product too heavy for me to load in my car 50 lbs boxes times 2 (the original  purchase and the replacement both broken = 100lbs for an elderly 120 lb woman to deal with), and lies about reward compensations. I THINK AMAZON IS GETTING TOO BIG FOR ITS BRITCHES!!! This is the short version of my Amazon experiences.  I think this alone shows Amazon is ready to take your money, but not willing to deliver good results from mishaps that are out of the customers control! My take away from my Amazon experiences to date are not favorable and thief by deception if their products are defective or not fully listed as needing further parts or accessories. I had to spend several hours on the phone and more time on line in trying to resolve the issues of one of the defective products just to get to the above results. Now multiply that time by every defective product, they have stolen about 2 weeks of my life to date trying to resolve problems in 2020 alone. MY TIME IS VALUABLE, they do not care.  My money is now in their possession and I have no product. They say the refund issued, but I did not receive all they charged me for the product. Everything cannot be blamed on the pandemic, I think Amazon should take responsibility to right the wrongs that happen. And I think the amount of stress and anxiety they caused me concerning the one of many problems I have experienced was totally abusive! Unfortunately for me the purchase I have been referencing is a outdoor fountain (just one of a list of defective products), not a high demand PPE, and I made the purchase to attempt to brighten my life and unstress having lost my Mother and Sister and am a Nurse working under pandemic dangers. GEE THANKS AMAZON for delivering poor products, poor customer service and causing me undue additional stress and anxiety on my attempt to be a loyal customer. Also beware of the product descriptions, they do not always say a needed a drive  that is not installed in electronics to make it usable, just say great product, heck they do not even help you figure out what is needed to make the product usable not to mention the additional costs needed to use the product. Again thief by deception. I would give them a minus 5 stars...but that is not an option.",2020-08-14 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,14.0,3051,538,16,2,0.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,buyer beware spent thousand dollar lately purchase less trying generous purchase defective broken heavy expensive purchase especially problem defective amazon refunded part purchase price later promised amazon promised reward compensation say exist amazon customer service lie correct defective product return requiring multiple call multiple people say something different amazon customer service associate state want negative customer experience deliver satisfactory result partial refund promised messed pick reservation made amazon product heavy load car lb box time original purchase replacement broken lb elderly lb woman deal lie reward compensation think amazon getting big britches short version amazon experience think alone show amazon ready take money 