IDKai,/users/5f301d1ac8526afe99a36e25,US,2.0,2020-08-09 15:58:40+00:00,1.0,Amazon’s customer service usually good but this?!?,"I ordered two chairs on Amazon and used my Amazon credit card. When I posted a review about the poor quality the chairs were and how poorly Amazon’s customer service behaved, they refused to post my review. They’ve posted every other review that I’ve made whether it was favorable or unfavorable about the item. However when it was unfavorable to them, they refuse to post it. Be very careful with Amazon and their credit card. With any other credit card you can dispute a charge but with Amazon credit card they won’t even answer the phone. The chairs were of poor quality and very difficult to put together. I requested the seller replace only one of the chairs because that was the only one that was broken upon delivery. They responded immediately that they would make it right and then they ignored my next three requests. So I tried to deal with Amazon directly and submitted a dispute and they totally blew me off. They said they get back with me in a week and I never heard from them. I placed another dispute and same process. So then I tried through the Amazon credit card and I couldn’t even get a customer service rep on the phone. And there’s no way to dispute a charge online. I will certainly never use my Amazon credit card again. While Amazon has pretty much everything you could want, they can’t behave as though you don’t matter at all.",2020-08-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,9.0,1355,246,50,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered two chair amazon used amazon credit card posted review poor quality chair poorly amazon’s customer service behaved refused post review they’ve posted every review i’ve made whether favorable unfavorable item however unfavorable refuse post careful amazon credit card credit card dispute charge amazon credit card won’t even answer phone chair poor quality difficult put together requested seller replace one chair one broken upon delivery responded immediately would make right ignored next three request tried deal amazon directly submitted dispute totally blew said get back week never heard placed another dispute process tried amazon credit card couldn’t even get customer service rep phone there’s way dispute charge online certainly never use amazon credit card amazon pretty much everything could want can’t behave though don’t matter,0.00756412104936739,0.9924358789506326,0.13796971396522714,0.2,0.8238118822683617,82.38118822683617,High Trust
Margaret Lyons,/users/5ed2291e25754ac12fc8904a,GB,3.0,2020-08-09 15:34:08+00:00,1.0,What is the world coming to?,"This is the first time I have ever been asked for photo ID before being handed my parcel.I obviously look over 18.He took my date a birth from my passport?This is diabolical.If you have to claim something from the post office to claim a parcel you just need a debit or credit card...not  picture ID.Come off it...my passport photo is pretty poor, and not as clear as previous passports.There are so many scams going on that needing your date of birth is going a step too far.I will be 63 in a couple of days and the item was a gift.They would have taken the parcel back had I not given picture ID.What is f I had no ID? It wouldn't matter how many times they came back. What is the world coming to?",2020-08-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,9.0,698,134,28,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,first time ever asked photo id handed parceli obviously look took date birth passportthis diabolicalif claim something post office claim parcel need debit credit cardnot picture idcome itmy passport photo pretty poor clear previous passportsthere many scam going needing date birth going step fari couple day item giftthey would taken parcel back given picture idwhat f id wouldnt matter many time came back world coming,0.020099165424005534,0.9799008345759944,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.8049812641752658,80.49812641752658,High Trust
