Jeanie Anderson,/users/5f2db273a2b0e28a05beece3,US,1.0,2020-08-07 19:59:54+00:00,1.0,If I could give a 0 stars,"If I could give a 0 stars, I would have. We placed an order for an item for an outdoor event On Saturday. It got to Albuquerque which is where we are on Thursday and we were supposed to get it Friday sometime. BUT!!! Someone put on a flight to Seattle Washington Friday morning. We called UPS, they were no help and just said “yup it’s in Seattle.”  Then we called amazon. They were worse than helpful. They just said well you’ll have to wait 4 more days then we can refund your money. REALLY.l!!!!  We have been prime members for years. We are thinking we will not renew. This is a habit they have gotten into and we don’t have to continue.",2020-08-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,7.0,641,123,25,7,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,could give star would placed order item outdoor event saturday got albuquerque thursday supposed get friday sometime someone put flight seattle washington friday morning called ups help said “yup it’s seattle” called amazon worse helpful said well you’ll wait day refund money reallyl prime member year thinking renew habit gotten don’t continue,0.9984591986994993,0.001540801300500716,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.31456737204677304,31.456737204677303,Low Trust
