Bob,/users/5c12e9cb1ac0782fc286cd24,US,4.0,2020-08-06 21:28:54+00:00,1.0,"As a ""company"" Amazon pretty much…","As a ""company"" Amazon pretty much sucks. They tell you one thing about your order when the complete opposite is true, and when you catch them in a lie and confront any of their customer service reps. they lie more. Meanwhile Bezos is getting close to being the first Trillonaire.... go figure.Oh BTW, having a prime membership is absolutely useless. Supposed to be like two day shipping, I ordered two office chairs on 8/1, got notified on 8/5 that they shipped, checked with the shipper on 8/6 and the only thing they knew is that a shipping label had been created.",2020-08-06 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,6.0,566,101,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,company amazon pretty much suck tell one thing order complete opposite true catch lie confront customer service rep lie meanwhile bezos getting close first trillonaire go figureoh btw prime membership absolutely useless supposed like two day shipping ordered two office chair got notified shipped checked shipper thing knew shipping label created,0.023769602188364585,0.9762303978116355,0.056646102075154234,0.2,0.7994444193208485,79.94444193208486,High Trust
