Jerry Todd Moyes,/users/5f2aeddfdef28c4cb69ea9e4,US,1.0,2020-08-05 17:35:38+00:00,1.0,The declining quality of Amazon…,"The declining quality of Amazon services just hit rock bottom for me. I ordered a 4 foot light fixture for my shop directly from Amazon, as a prime member. It was deliverd today by an Amazon delivery driver, not UPS. Pretty cool, right? Not so much. The fixture and package were smashed flat accross the center with a clear truck tire print. I soon discovered what was once amazing customer service, is now horrible. There was no option to speak with anyone over the phone, and my only resolution option is send it back and have it replaced! So this package which was ran over by a truck shipped from an Amazon facility, where it was picked by an Amazon employee, loaded by an Amazon employee, and delivered by an Amazon employee ... None of whom cared that it was smashed flat with a tire track going accross it? You've got to be kidding me! Now I'm told I have to ship it back ... More like customer disservice.",2020-08-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,5.0,913,169,32,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,declining quality amazon service hit rock bottom ordered foot light fixture shop directly amazon prime member deliverd today amazon delivery driver ups pretty cool right much fixture package smashed flat accross center clear truck tire print soon discovered amazing customer service horrible option speak anyone phone resolution option send back replaced package ran truck shipped amazon facility picked amazon employee loaded amazon employee delivered amazon employee none cared smashed flat tire track going accross youve got kidding im told ship back like customer disservice,0.33653663151511026,0.6634633684848897,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.6506884986002688,65.06884986002687,Medium Trust
