Kosta,/users/5f1aab427252dc5c04ad0483,IE,9.0,2020-08-01 10:45:09+00:00,4.0,Still good but their customer service it's going a bit downwards lately,"I remember the time 2 years ago I bought firetv stick and had an issue with it, support was literally chasing me every day to have a call with me to help me get it fixed and we got it done first time when I was free to talk.This is how you make and impression and keep a customer.Seems this is no longer the case, now they need some convincing. I had some soap coming in (yeah I know.. :)).It had never been handed over from the Amazon warehouse to the courier according to the UPS tracking number and 2 different support guys did not bother checking and telling me that's either on the way or because I used a mail forwarding company as recepient it's their fault.I had to convince them hard to even look at the tracking.Eventually it got sorted and refunded within a week in 2 chats by 10 mins so I'm fairly happy.Still it's a bit sad to see they could not keep their best people in.",2020-08-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,1.0,885,171,71,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,remember time year ago bought firetv stick issue support literally chasing every day call help get fixed got done first time free talkthis make impression keep customerseems longer case need convincing soap coming yeah know never handed amazon warehouse courier according ups tracking number different support guy bother checking telling thats either way used mail forwarding company recepient faulti convince hard even look trackingeventually got sorted refunded within week chat min im fairly happystill bit sad see could keep best people,0.008380888295903131,0.9916191117040969,0.09590577678070668,0.8,1.71499071120819,171.499071120819,High Trust
