BREE,/users/5f24cbcbc2b59381bb04c693,US,1.0,2020-08-01 02:05:59+00:00,1.0,Ripped off by Amazon/Ancheer,"I purchased ancheer electric bike through amazon. The tires popped the first day I rode it. I went to walmart to buy new tires, since amazon could not help me. The tubes are not the ones for this type of bike. Later I went to plug the adapter wire together as the cheap box cracked. After finally being able to put the 2 pieces together,  when I tried to plug it into the bike, not the outlet, it sparked. I contacted Ancheer from the info in the booklet, phone just rang. Noone could help me from the email response I received.  They referred me to Amazon. The person I was referred to has never contacted me. I have spoken to numerous staff and one supervisor who told me they couldn't  help me. Originally they told me to contact the seller. I did ,  no assistance what-so-ever. I have a warranty, as the Ancheer staff tells me they are just agents for ancheer, and refers me to amazon. Ancheer recently stated since I did not buy the bike from them I have to have Amazon take care of it. Amazon cannot help, refers me to seller. Seller wants me to take bike somewhere to pay to get it fixed. I  really want to tell them all where to go. Take it, this all has been going on for months. It has been 9 months of seeking assistance, 11 months of not riding my 400.00 bike. There also is no bike shop in my city.  I am seeking outside assistance. If the pandemic was over I would take them to court and let the judge figure it out.Do not buy any electric bikes from Amazon,or Ancheer. They all get a bad review and the seller, commors.",2020-08-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,1.0,1534,294,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased ancheer electric bike amazon tire popped first day rode went walmart buy new tire since amazon could help tube one type bike later went plug adapter wire together cheap box cracked finally able put piece together tried plug bike outlet sparked contacted ancheer info booklet phone rang noone could help email response received referred amazon person referred never contacted spoken numerous staff one supervisor told couldnt help originally told contact seller assistance whatsoever warranty ancheer staff tell agent ancheer refers amazon ancheer recently stated since buy bike amazon take care amazon cannot help refers seller seller want take bike somewhere pay get fixed really want tell go take going month month seeking assistance month riding bike also bike shop city seeking outside assistance pandemic would take court let judge figure outdo buy electric bike amazonor ancheer get bad review seller commors,0.02365545267978281,0.9763445473202171,0.16489063376332025,0.2,0.8211504004127727,82.11504004127727,High Trust
Darlene Maloney,/users/5f24c569b152161fc17d564b,US,1.0,2020-08-01 01:29:20+00:00,2.0,Amazon needs better customer service,"I returned a defective refurbished item but during the return process erroneously checked the do not need box. When I got my refund they credited me $10 less than what I paid, charging a $10 restocking fee which I was unaware of. I contacted them 5 times and told them about the reason mistake, and corrected the return reason that the refurbished item did not work. All five Times, after repeating the same issue in a chat, they said they would make it right and referred my issue to another department to credit me the erroneous restocking fee. All five times no one contacted me.  And no credit. Finally in a phone call I made,  Amazon said they could not assist and change the return reason to allow for a full refund. I checked the box and tgst was that. They could not credit my credit card or even offer a gift card. Why did it tAke five times to do that?  And, more importantly What seller would not rectify an issue like that ? They used to be a good company .. they need to be regulated.",2020-08-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,8.0,1.0,997,188,36,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,returned defective refurbished item return process erroneously checked need box got refund credited less paid charging restocking fee unaware contacted time told reason mistake corrected return reason refurbished item work five time repeating issue chat said would make right referred issue another department credit erroneous restocking fee five time one contacted credit finally phone call made amazon said could assist change return reason allow full refund checked box tgst could credit credit card even offer gift card take five time importantly seller would rectify issue like used good company need regulated,0.006778006559777901,0.9932219934402221,0.10544026920919798,0.4,1.1176990505619506,111.76990505619506,High Trust
