Steve Spindler,/users/5e95eca7c78e4f9e8f2bd658,US,3.0,2020-07-30 21:17:00+00:00,1.0,"Item broken in shipment, over 2 weeks for refund","Waited and waited to order my new table saw! super excited. Package shows up 3 days late and looks like it was thrown out of a plane. It shipped in Illinois, traveled all over Illinois then showed up. I live in Illinois! I took pictures of the condition of the box. Had my fingers crossed that Dewalt packaged it well. Dewalt had so much styrofoam around this saw. You would think it could handle anything. Nope! It was damaged. They actually dented in an entire corner of the table. I let them know. They say we are sorry. You will have to arrange for UPS to come pick it back up. UPS wants money to give me a time that they will come to pick it up. I finally drove it to a ups store. They have had it for over a week. No refund. I speak to guy who says yes we have it. I will issue a refund. It will take 7 days to process! So now the item I returned on 7/23/20 will not be refunded until 8/6/20. I cancelled my account. I will buy my items from local places from now on.",2020-07-30 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,30.0,973,196,48,9,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,waited waited order new table saw super excited package show day late look like thrown plane shipped illinois traveled illinois showed live illinois took picture condition box finger crossed dewalt packaged well dewalt much styrofoam around saw would think could handle anything nope damaged actually dented entire corner table let know say sorry arrange ups come pick back ups want money give time come pick finally drove ups store week refund speak guy say yes issue refund take day process item returned refunded cancelled account buy item local place,0.689416380909341,0.310583619090659,0.10992708917554683,0.2,0.4772772273804389,47.72772273804389,Low Trust
