Ina Interstate,/users/5f2096679c322f00219cabc9,US,1.0,2020-07-28 21:19:48+00:00,1.0,Blatant disregard for their customers,"I ordered a laptop and Amazon said it would arrive wednesday July 29. Cool. I make arrangements to be here to get it off the porch to avoid it being stolen on wednesday the 29th. Monday we get a notification saying it will actually be here tuesday the 28th. Okayyyy, so I change gears and make arrangements for Tuesday. Oh and the new caveat they threw in is now it also has to be signed for. I NEVER agreed to that so that adds another element of aggravation because should I not hear them knock I'm screwed. Well sure enough I miss them and they tell us its at the CVS. My husband goes to get it. No, they say you have to come back after 3:00 pm So I go to get it at 4:30. I am told it isn't there and MAY be there tomorrow. Like I'm going to rearrange everything AGAIN for a maybe??? I cancelled the order. This company does NOT appreciate your business and has BLATANT disregard for your time and convenience. They seriously DO NOT CARE.I will go elsewhere.",2020-07-28 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,28.0,961,185,37,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered laptop amazon said would arrive wednesday july cool make arrangement get porch avoid stolen wednesday th monday get notification saying actually tuesday th okayyyy change gear make arrangement tuesday oh new caveat threw also signed never agreed add another element aggravation hear knock im screwed well sure enough miss tell u cv husband go get say come back pm go get told isnt may tomorrow like im going rearrange everything maybe cancelled order company appreciate business blatant disregard time convenience seriously carei go elsewhere,0.013861711385668295,0.9861382886143317,0.10375771172181716,0.2,0.8138206866515292,81.38206866515291,High Trust
