Caroline Hardesty,/users/5862fe810000ff000a660be1,US,7.0,2020-07-19 18:18:03+00:00,2.0,Awful company,"First, this company is sexist and ignorant. They openly support the Black Lives movement, displaying banners supporting them, suggesting antiracist books, etc. However, they showed no support for the #metoo movement even though women are statistically far more likely to be abused or murdered by men than are blacks. Do womens' lives not matter too? Also, they sell fake versions of brand names on their site consistently and fail to post customer reviews when people state this in the reviews. This is called bait-and-switch and is an illegal practice. This is a toxic company with toxic leadership selling inferior products. Almost every major company sells their goods online now. I just order directly from those companies and receive far better products at similar or lower prices. The one good thing they did was introduce whole foods delivery, although I am concerned that they will eventually cheapen and ruin that brand now that they have their grubby little claws on it.",2020-07-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,19.0,980,160,13,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,first company sexist ignorant openly support black life movement displaying banner supporting suggesting antiracist book etc however showed support metoo movement even though woman statistically far likely abused murdered men black womens life matter also sell fake version brand name site consistently fail post customer review people state review called baitandswitch illegal practice toxic company toxic leadership selling inferior product almost every major company sell good online order directly company receive far better product similar lower price one good thing introduce whole food delivery although concerned eventually cheapen ruin brand grubby little claw,0.010845089045433251,0.9891549109545668,0.08973639932697701,0.4,1.1125247353426788,111.25247353426788,High Trust
