Factsnonlyfacts wat,/users/5bae22bc4de5666d345b07ab,US,6.0,2020-07-19 14:19:55+00:00,1.0,I would give the no star!!!!,"I would give the no star!!!!I ordered so much from Amazon over 1000 of dollars, I'm a customer more then 12 years. I moved to a new construction subdivision and the carriers have issues and my account clearly shows that they have issues to find it. Even google map does not show my address. Some of my last orders didnt arrive for some reason but most of the things I ordered did arrive and I either kept or returned my items. My account shows that and I have prove and receipts for that. I'm a prime member paid 119 $ a year. After contacting them for items that didnt arrive, they send me a threat email that they will close my account due to me going against their""condition of use"" what does that even mean. The threat email : Thank you for writing to us.We're concerned about the activity on your account. We want to do all that we can to help you avoid any problems with the delivery of items you purchase from Amazon.com. Your account remains open and available for your use. Please keep in mind that we may close your account if you do not meet the terms of our agreements. To learn more about our policies, visit our “Conditions of Use” page. You can find a link to this page at the bottom of any page on Amazon.com.If you have any order or account related concerns, please contact our CustomerSincerely,Account SpecialistAmazon.com On top of that. It does not matter if you pay 119$ for a year and want to cancel your prime. You lose 119$ and no refund and they take your benefits regarding that you paid 119$ for a year. ????????. You should be able to keep the benefits until it expires and not take the benefits and the money but no refund. SCAM. I use to like amazon but it is not doing good. I start buying from Ali express where most of their stuff is from anyways and walmart where you get free  day shipping as well. They think they hurt me by the threat but th