Philip,/users/54e9a6510000ff0001acb9bd,IE,60.0,2020-07-18 12:36:44+00:00,1.0,AVOID AT ALL COST!!,"AVOID AT ALL COST!!I purchased an order at $869 while on offer ( normal price $988). I waited 2 weeks with no shipping yet. I email them on 5 occasions to see where the order was. Then they cancelled order and said there was unauthorised activity on my account. But they've taken my money!!. So now Im waiting on a refund, which I dont want! I only want my item. Now they say I need to buy again, which of course is at the higer price of $988.. Conveniently . Amazon is SCAM and robbing thieves !! They cannot even honour the order!! Never again im buying from them",2020-07-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,18.0,565,109,19,4,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,avoid costi purchased order offer normal price waited week shipping yet email occasion see order cancelled order said unauthorised activity account theyve taken money im waiting refund dont want want item say need buy course higer price conveniently amazon scam robbing thief cannot even honour order never im buying,0.9999910627486994,8.937251300578097e-06,0.061132922041503085,0.2,0.3122310530339509,31.223105303395087,Low Trust
Ohmlix Omee,/users/5f12c2281629291bcccbb695,NG,1.0,2020-07-18 11:06:27+00:00,5.0,Just a Token of Appreciation.,"“Those who want to wear waist beads should also be prepared to own hips that can hold it”. This is the case with Amazon, only that it has a very Large Waist, and its beads never fall down. Its temerity for business delivery had been tried uncountable number of times during this trying time of Covid-19 Pandemic, but it is never swayed. An organization that appreciates humanity speaks through deeds to humankind. These are limitless positive deeds that touch employees, customers, communities and the world at large. For the love of humanity, Amazon went further to declared war on COVID-19 by furthering research that will bring the evil menace to its knees. On behalf of the global majority that appreciate good works, I say; long live Amazon!",2020-07-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,18.0,746,127,29,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,“those want wear waist bead also prepared hip hold it” case amazon large waist bead never fall temerity business delivery tried uncountable number time trying time covid pandemic never swayed organization appreciates humanity speaks deed humankind limitless positive deed touch employee customer community world large love humanity amazon went declared war covid furthering research bring evil menace knee behalf global majority appreciate good work say long live amazon,0.12486532493616838,0.8751346750638316,0.071228266965788,1.0,1.9518129909250734,195.18129909250734,High Trust
George Christoff,/users/5a286db90000ff000aed50ed,US,25.0,2020-07-18 02:23:44+00:00,1.0,gift card scam,"I am an amazon Prime member and spent thousands of dollars just this year on purchases but I found they ve been playing a really simple scam with the ""gift card"" thing to make you keep buying stuff. I always pay with a debit card,and when I request a return and a refund I want it back in my bank account. Last time I made a purchase for $230 and when had to return it money automatically goes to a gift car, instead of my bank acct. Supposedly there is an option to dis-select the ""gift card"" option, but it is not exactly visible, and you wouldn't expect the money to go n a gift card when you paid with a debit card. Same day I made 3 purchases which was paid through the gift card (that is how I understood that the $230 went on a gift card). After I called to request my money to be put back in my bank account instead of the gift card, they told me that I have to return all items because they cant transfer money from a gift card unless it the full original amount which was there. I had other stuff to purchase so I used all the money from the gift card but unfortunately I had to return another order for $80 , which was paid through that gift card and those money are back in gift card and I can get them back unless I return all I ve purchase through the gift card, which is at least 5 different orders. So now I am 'forced"" to spend another $80, want it or not otherwise they will stay in that useless gift card. that s kinda f a scam f you ask me to have you keep some money on a gift card that the only way to have use of them is to make another purchase through amazon. After all the money I spend, they cant solve a simple issue like that! And again, when I requested the return for the $230 - they automatically went to a gift a card. And I have never used a gift card with amazon before...That s a small and simple SCAM! Plain and simple!",2020-07-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,18.0,1856,374,14,3,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,amazon prime member spent thousand dollar year purchase found playing really simple scam gift card thing make keep buying stuff always pay debit cardand request return refund want back bank account last time made purchase return money automatically go gift car instead bank acct supposedly option disselect gift card option exactly visible wouldnt expect money go n gift card paid debit card day made purchase paid gift card understood went gift card called request money put back bank account instead gift card told return item cant transfer money gift card unless full original amount stuff purchase used money gift card unfortunately return another order paid gift card money back gift card get back unless return purchase gift card least different order forced spend another want otherwise stay useless gift card kinda f scam f ask keep money gift card way use make another purchase amazon money spend cant solve simple issue like requested return automatically went gift card never used gift card amazon beforethat small simple scam plain simple,0.854123987291894,0.14587601270810602,0.20975883342680876,0.2,0.41488977303941477,41.488977303941475,Low Trust
