DizzyGal,/users/5f120ed92c3d5880ed21b4ec,US,1.0,2020-07-17 20:50:36+00:00,1.0,Amazon is going downhill,"I used to order a lot from Amazon, and thought they had pretty good customer service.  But my opinion of them based on recent orders has changed drastically, and I’m going to avoid ordering from them. I’ve had issues with packages coming well after promised dates, or packages that didn’t come at all.  When I call customer service, I get the runaround from some rather condescending guys that are obviously in another country.  They have messed up refunds, claimed that what I’m seeing on their web site isn’t correct according to what they see, told me I’m too impatient, interrupt and talk over me, etc. I feel like they are lying about things instead of owning up to mistakes and trying to make things right.",2020-07-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,17.0,712,125,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used order lot amazon thought pretty good customer service opinion based recent order changed drastically i’m going avoid ordering i’ve issue package coming well promised date package didn’t come call customer service get runaround rather condescending guy obviously another country messed refund claimed i’m seeing web site isn’t correct according see told i’m impatient interrupt talk etc feel like lying thing instead owning mistake trying make thing right,0.014324251232895263,0.9856757487671047,0.07010656197420079,0.2,0.8068591867783925,80.68591867783925,High Trust
