jake mcqueen,/users/5f11f87a785ff83ed03e33ca,GB,1.0,2020-07-17 19:14:08+00:00,1.0,Lesson Learned.,"Ordered a game on Pre-order. Obviously so that I could get it on the day it came out as promised by Amazon. So I wait in all day for the game to come and nothing! They didn’t even have the decency to email to let me know that the package which I paid for to get on a certain day was not coming until 3 DAYS LATER! Why am I paying for Amazon prime every month to receive non existent customer service? I will NEVER, I repeat NEVER be preordering with Amazon again I will just buy the game on the consoles store as a digital download instead. At least then I get what I paid for. People wonder why no one buys games on discs or preorders anymore. THIS IS WHY! You have single handedly ruined my weekend. To top it off they don’t even have a proper complaints procedure.",2020-07-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,17.0,767,151,15,2,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,ordered game preorder obviously could get day came promised amazon wait day game come nothing didn’t even decency email let know package paid get certain day coming day later paying amazon prime every month receive non existent customer service never repeat never preordering amazon buy game console store digital download instead least get paid people wonder one buy game disc preorders anymore single handedly ruined weekend top don’t even proper complaint procedure,0.6049855064252163,0.3950144935747837,0.08468872686483454,0.2,0.5144449921603588,51.44449921603588,Medium Trust
Victor Stasiuc,/users/5f11f3515792f3f8feee943c,US,8.0,2020-07-17 18:52:35+00:00,1.0,Amazon has an awful customer support,"Amazon has an awful customer support. Had some free time because of COVID and started to record reviews on a purchased items using 2 cameras explaining everything about the product. In 3 weeks got all my reviews deleted. I spend tons of hours to record and edit it. Asked what is the problem through the community-help email - no answer for a week. Called to the support - copy/paste answer after several calls. Called and talk to a lead same copy/paste answer with a warning not to answer my future emails. This company got way to big, only copy/paste no-brain responses, faceless giant... I spent 7k USD for the last year only, my monthly Prime expires next month so I'm done with that.",2020-07-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,17.0,688,123,36,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon awful customer support free time covid started record review purchased item using camera explaining everything product week got review deleted spend ton hour record edit asked problem communityhelp email answer week called support copypaste answer several call called talk lead copypaste answer warning answer future email company got way big copypaste nobrain response faceless giant spent k usd last year monthly prime expires next month im done,0.009223288238544939,0.9907767117614551,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.8091853272772502,80.91853272772502,High Trust
jcdhjdfds,/users/5f11c9152294176cd9d83086,IN,1.0,2020-07-17 15:54:29+00:00,1.0,I used to have very high opinion about…,"I used to have very high opinion about Amazon customer service but lately starting from the end of the last year I'd say it started to deteriorate dramatically. A̲͎̲m̲͎̲a̲͎̲z̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲̲ ̲͎̲c̲͎̲u̲͎̲s̲͎̲t̲͎̲o̲͎̲m̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲s̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲v̲͎̲i̲͎̲c̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲h̲͎̲e̲͎̲l̲͎̲p̲͎̲l̲͎̲i̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲p̲͎̲h̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲n̲͎̲u̲͎̲m̲͎̲b̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲i̲͎̲s̲͎̲ ̲͎̲+̲͎̲1̲͎̲ ̲͎̲8̲͎̲4̲͎̲4̲͎̲ ̲͎̲4̲͎̲2̲͎̲0̲͎̲ ̲͎̲0̲͎̲0̲͎̲7̲͎̲2̲͎̲A̲͎̲m̲͎̲a̲͎̲z̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲̲ ̲͎̲c̲͎̲u̲͎̲s̲͎̲t̲͎̲o̲͎̲m̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲s̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲v̲͎̲i̲͎̲c̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲h̲͎̲e̲͎̲l̲͎̲p̲͎̲l̲͎̲i̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲p̲͎̲h̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲n̲͎̲u̲͎̲m̲͎̲b̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲i̲͎̲s̲͎̲ ̲͎̲+̲͎̲1̲͎̲ ̲͎̲8̲͎̲4̲͎̲4̲͎̲ ̲͎̲4̲͎̲2̲͎̲0̲͎̲ ̲͎̲0̲͎̲0̲͎̲7̲͎̲2̲͎̲A̲͎̲m̲͎̲a̲͎̲z̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲̲ ̲͎̲c̲͎̲u̲͎̲s̲͎̲t̲͎̲o̲͎̲m̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲s̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲v̲͎̲i̲͎̲c̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲h̲͎̲e̲͎̲l̲͎̲p̲͎̲l̲͎̲i̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲p̲͎̲h̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲n̲͎̲u̲͎̲m̲͎̲b̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲i̲͎̲s̲͎̲ ̲͎̲+̲͎̲1̲͎̲ ̲͎̲8̲͎̲4̲͎̲4̲͎̲ ̲͎̲4̲͎̲2̲͎̲0̲͎̲ ̲͎̲0̲͎̲0̲͎̲7̲͎̲2̲͎̲A̲͎̲m̲͎̲a̲͎̲z̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲̲ ̲͎̲c̲͎̲u̲͎̲s̲͎̲t̲͎̲o̲͎̲m̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲s̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲v̲͎̲i̲͎̲c̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲h̲͎̲e̲͎̲l̲͎̲p̲͎̲l̲͎̲i̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲p̲͎̲h̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲n̲͎̲u̲͎̲m̲͎̲b̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲i̲͎̲s̲͎̲ ̲͎̲+̲͎̲1̲͎̲ ̲͎̲8̲͎̲4̲͎̲4̲͎̲ ̲͎̲4̲͎̲2̲͎̲0̲͎̲ ̲͎̲0̲͎̲0̲͎̲7̲͎̲2̲͎̲A̲͎̲m̲͎̲a̲͎̲z̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲̲ ̲͎̲c̲͎̲u̲͎̲s̲͎̲t̲͎̲o̲͎̲m̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲s̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲v̲͎̲i̲͎̲c̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲h̲͎̲e̲͎̲l̲͎̲p̲͎̲l̲͎̲i̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲p̲͎̲h̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲n̲͎̲u̲͎̲m̲͎̲b̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲i̲͎̲s̲͎̲ ̲͎̲+̲͎̲1̲͎̲ ̲͎̲8̲͎̲4̲͎̲4̲͎̲ ̲͎̲4̲͎̲2̲͎̲0̲͎̲ ̲͎̲0̲͎̲0̲͎̲7̲͎̲2̲͎̲A̲͎̲m̲͎̲a̲͎̲z̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲̲ ̲͎̲c̲͎̲u̲͎̲s̲͎̲t̲͎̲o̲͎̲m̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲s̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲v̲͎̲i̲͎̲c̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲h̲͎̲e̲͎̲l̲͎̲p̲͎̲l̲͎̲i̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲p̲͎̲h̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲n̲͎̲u̲͎̲m̲͎̲b̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲i̲͎̲s̲͎̲ ̲͎̲+̲͎̲1̲͎̲ ̲͎̲8̲͎̲4̲͎̲4̲͎̲ ̲͎̲4̲͎̲2̲͎̲0̲͎̲ ̲͎̲0̲͎̲0̲͎̲7̲͎̲2̲͎̲A̲͎̲m̲͎̲a̲͎̲z̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲̲ ̲͎̲c̲͎̲u̲͎̲s̲͎̲t̲͎̲o̲͎̲m̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲ ̲͎̲s̲͎̲e̲͎̲r̲͎̲v̲͎̲i̲͎̲c̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲h̲͎̲e̲͎̲l̲͎̲p̲͎̲l̲͎̲i̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲p̲͎̲h̲͎̲o̲͎̲n̲͎̲e̲͎̲ ̲͎̲n̲͎̲u̲͎̲m̲͎̲b̲͎̲e̲͎̲