Vlad Sharanhovich,/users/52815f3900006400015497dd,US,6.0,2020-07-16 22:54:46+00:00,2.0,I used to have very high opinion about…,"I used to have very high opinion about Amazon customer service but lately starting from the end of the last year I'd say it started to deteriorate dramatically. Specifically the customer service located in India (judging by names of representative you are chatting with). I regularly get very rude and inappropriate responses how and what's most worrying is that the person on another end of the chat how have an ability to just cancel the chat window without giving you a change to rate your experience. This ""trick"" lets them to give you a ""middle finger"" and get away with it without getting bad ratings and complaint from you. I don't know what's going on with Amazon but if this continues like this I'll have to look for other places to shop, fortunately nowadays Amazon is by far not the only large online retailer, haha.",2020-07-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,16.0,827,145,39,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used high opinion amazon customer service lately starting end last year id say started deteriorate dramatically specifically customer service located india judging name representative chatting regularly get rude inappropriate response whats worrying person another end chat ability cancel chat window without giving change rate experience trick let give middle finger get away without getting bad rating complaint dont know whats going amazon continues like ill look place shop fortunately nowadays amazon far large online retailer haha,0.030577342118539737,0.9694226578814603,0.08132361189007291,0.4,1.1009760513187448,110.09760513187447,High Trust
KC,/users/5f10bf7eb121de7d7494004b,US,2.0,2020-07-16 20:59:24+00:00,1.0,I have been an Amazon Prime member for…,"I have been an Amazon Prime member for over 3 years. Just recently I had fraud where my account was hacked and an electronic e-gift card was bought in the amount of $400 and sent to an account I had no affiliation with. I reported this to Amazon immediately, within 30 minutes of it happening because I got a notification and keep a close eye on my account. The amazon team did nothing from stopping this recipient from taking my money and using it and when they sent me over to the fraud department all I got both times I reported it was a email saying sorry the recipient you sent it to received it and it was used. However, I never sent it and don’t know Shabab Gersham that the one amazon said was the recipient. I then had to get with my CC provider to stop this charge sense amazon doesn’t care to help their customers just take their money. My CC was amazing and stopped the transaction. However, now I just received and email from Amazon my account is suspended until I pay them the $400 that is owed to them. I cannot believe after all the purchases and being a loyal customer that they would treat people so bad. Very disappointed in the poor customer service",2020-07-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,16.0,1169,220,39,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime member year recently fraud account hacked electronic egift card bought amount sent account affiliation reported amazon immediately within minute happening got notification keep close eye account amazon team nothing stopping recipient taking money using sent fraud department got time reported email saying sorry recipient sent received used however never sent don’t know shabab gersham one amazon said recipient get cc provider stop charge sense amazon doesn’t care help customer take money cc amazing stopped transaction however received email amazon account suspended pay owed cannot believe purchase loyal customer would treat people bad disappointed poor customer service,0.008531591238907918,0.9914684087610921,0.12338754907459339,0.2,0.8204117141954647,82.04117141954647,High Trust
