Melissa,/users/5f1058df6bfb50cb772d490d,US,1.0,2020-07-16 13:41:23+00:00,1.0,Actually it should be 0 stars,"Actually it should be 0 stars.  I purchased 3 gift cards totaling $500 in June 2020. Amazon processed the order, then suppressed the card for supposed fraudulent activity. (NEVER, Once did they send a message before cancelling the transaction). These cards were Never sent out. They have refunded $200 of my funds but refused the other $300 stating that my financial institution should handle the issue. But then in the same email stated""We recently processed these charges on your VISA ending in 22:--113-4652560-3044217   --$300.00""Notice it says WE ..  NOT your bank""I Have dealt with customer service via email in the beginning because the customer service was closed do to Cova.I Have been actually speaking to numerous customer service reps. Since first of July. All who told me the refund will be issued.Today I get the email stating THEY will not refund 🤬🤬🤬",2020-07-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,16.0,865,142,29,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,actually star purchased gift card totaling june amazon processed order suppressed card supposed fraudulent activity never send message cancelling transaction card never sent refunded fund refused stating financial institution handle issue email statedwe recently processed charge visa ending notice say banki dealt customer service via email beginning customer service closed covai actually speaking numerous customer service rep since first july told refund issuedtoday get email stating refund 🤬🤬🤬,0.008943840126561804,0.9910561598734382,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.8114562908172575,81.14562908172574,High Trust
Refinnej,/users/5f102d95be9ada0e5e0b0cc4,US,3.0,2020-07-16 10:36:19+00:00,4.0,Expect delays during a global pandemic,"Thanks to Amazon, my family and I have have had less potential exposure time to COVID.  Most of goods arrive on time but during this PANDEMIC, Amazon and postal carriers are having to work differently and more people are staying home and ordering online which will cause delays.  I absolutely cannot whine about slow deliveries like some reviewers are because it is expected during a PANDEMIC.  Some people are delusional to think everyone else is going to carry on as before the PANDEMIC just to get them their packages in 2 days.  You are not the center of the universe.",2020-07-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,16.0,572,100,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,thanks amazon family less potential exposure time covid good arrive time pandemic amazon postal carrier work differently people staying home ordering online cause delay absolutely cannot whine slow delivery like reviewer expected pandemic people delusional think everyone else going carry pandemic get package day center universe,0.04117390713473065,0.9588260928652693,0.056085249579360626,0.8,1.6906300963485068,169.0630096348507,High Trust
