Melissa Brown,/users/57ae0ccc0000ff000a3a4eb9,US,3.0,2020-07-15 17:25:38+00:00,1.0,Horrible delivery service,"Amazon will not accomodate people who live in locked apartment buildings. They will not acknowledge delivery requests when I work all day. They attempted twice to deliver, when before each attempt, I contacted dispatch to make sure they come at a later time. They deleted my whole order that I already waited 2 weeks for. This is not the first time. They are the worst delivery service, I wish you could pick between them or USPS whom actually have keys to my building. Even using prime, because they wont wait until I can meet them- my orders average a 2-4 week delivery.",2020-07-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,15.0,572,102,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon accomodate people live locked apartment building acknowledge delivery request work day attempted twice deliver attempt contacted dispatch make sure come later time deleted whole order already waited week first time worst delivery service wish could pick usps actually key building even using prime wont wait meet order average week delivery,0.009851097021968758,0.9901489029780313,0.05720695457094784,0.2,0.8065158424032052,80.65158424032052,High Trust
Jacqui Leigh Johnston,/users/5f0f31321a3e162564e47e1b,US,1.0,2020-07-15 16:39:20+00:00,1.0,Deliveries Arent Guaranteed,"I had amazon prime and loved it, however I just cancelled and wont be buying anything from them again.I live in a very secure apartment and have never had issues with deliveries until 3 months ago. They are constantly saying items have been delivered but they are NO WHERE TO BE SEEN. I've had to order items several times over and gotten refunds, just for them to tell me it says it was delivered so it just must have been and been stolen. My 4 neighbors that I know personally have been stealing duplicate items of mine?? Ok. Delivery is not guaranteed. Ever.",2020-07-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,15.0,561,103,27,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime loved however cancelled wont buying anything againi live secure apartment never issue delivery month ago constantly saying item delivered seen ive order item several time gotten refund tell say delivered must stolen neighbor know personally stealing duplicate item mine ok delivery guaranteed ever,0.020742631758205805,0.9792573682417942,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.8011822455342453,80.11822455342454,High Trust
