Anne Loyd,/users/5ecdc00ada677aacd3d21bd9,US,4.0,2020-07-13 19:04:24+00:00,1.0,I ordered an exercise bike on June 29,"I ordered an exercise bike on June 29, 2020 that was in stock with a ship date estimate of July 9th through 13th.  Up until this morning, the website indicated that it would be received by tonight. At approximately 10:30 a.m. I received an email that my shipment was delayed with a ship date estimate of August 6 to August 31st.  I contacted customer service and the only option they would provide was a refund.  They were not even sure that they would even get the replacement bike within the time frame of August 6th to August 31st.  I requested a supervisor and held for several minutes, only to be told that a supervisor would call me back.  The representative asked what resolution I would like and I indicated that I wanted a replacement.  I never received a call from the supervisor.  I only received a call from the representative advising that they would only give me a refund, which could also take up to 5 business days. We previous had Amazon Prime for several years and cancelled it because our orders were routinely late and it did not make sense to pay a yearly fee if we did not receive our items within the promised time. Amazon's customer service is incredibly lacking.  They have gotten too big to take care of their customers.  This is a huge disappointment and will definitely affect whether we continue to utilize Amazon.",2020-07-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,13.0,1343,239,37,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered exercise bike june stock ship date estimate july th th morning website indicated would received tonight approximately received email shipment delayed ship date estimate august august st contacted customer service option would provide refund even sure would even get replacement bike within time frame august th august st requested supervisor held several minute told supervisor would call back representative asked resolution would like indicated wanted replacement never received call supervisor received call representative advising would give refund could also take business day previous amazon prime several year cancelled order routinely late make sense pay yearly fee receive item within promised time amazon customer service incredibly lacking gotten big take care customer huge disappointment definitely affect whether continue utilize amazon,0.007582646005413651,0.9924173539945863,0.1340437464946719,0.2,0.8230174262962275,82.30174262962275,High Trust
Mrmax Mistermax,/users/5f0cae2776d25230abe021c2,US,3.0,2020-07-13 18:56:38+00:00,1.0,Amazon Buyer Beware,"EG. Softsoap refill bt Arett sales. Over $17. Regular price $7. Shipping $14, twice the regular price. Amazon allows this kind of sales tactic all the time.",2020-07-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,13.0,156,27,19,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,eg softsoap refill bt arett sale regular price shipping twice regular price amazon allows kind sale tactic time,0.042654418166582025,0.957345581833418,0.01514301738642737,0.2,0.7817013943939946,78.17013943939945,High Trust
Liz Tyrrell,/users/5f0c9048a0250d42a527dd9b,US,2.0,2020-07-13 16:48:15+00:00,1.0,I have been a loyal prime member for a…,"I have been a loyal prime member for a decade now, but am receiving the worst customer service from Amazon.I had fraud on my account and have been trying proactively to solve it for nearly 3 weeks now.  You have major gaps in your customer service and the way you handle fraudulent charges.  I was notified I had fraud on my account and my Amazon account was promptly shut down.  I could not verify or deny the charges since I am locked out of all aspects of my account.  Because I order a lot of items from Amazon I had no idea what was fraudulent and what was not.  It took me over 2 weeks and 9 phone calls to customer service, to just get a comprehensive list of ordered items that I could verify.  But alas, my account is still closed.I replied to every email, requesting the last 2 of a credit card, but news flash - my card was compromised.  I do not seem to have another active card associated with this account.  Therefore I cannot give the last 2 digits of my credit card, I have tried.  All I get is automated emails and no one to help me resolve the issue.Your customer service sent order numbers, without associated items, so all customers have to dig through emails to figure out what items they are.  Then there are other emails with no item stated that just request the last 2 of a credit card.  While I will happily pay for my charges, I am not just going to give my credit card without any item(s) specifications for Amazon to charge how they please.  Especially when there was supposedly fraud on my account!  I cannot seem to verify my identity with a new credit card and am caught in a endless loop of customer service agents who can't solve the issue and emails requesting credit card information (last 2 digits) that is not linked to my account.This is such terrible customer service to a loyal customer who has spent thousands of dollars at Amazon.  I have been hung up while being transferred, told totally different information by the same agents answering Amazon's phone, but each agent told me they can't do anything and to wait for an email.  My 2 Amazon Alexas are closed down, 3 Amazon kids tablets, and of course ordering.  I have now spent hours on the phone trying to resolve and pay for items I ordered.  It's totally and completely ridiculous and needless.  You need to take a close look at how you are treating ""valued"" customers, because it is beyond frustrating and deplorable.",2020-07-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,13.0,2416,440,39,9,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,loyal prime member decade receiving worst customer service amazoni fraud account trying proactively solve nearly week major gap customer service way handle fraudulent charge notified fraud account amazon account promptly shut could verify deny charge since locked aspect account order lot item amazon idea fraudulent took week phone call customer service get comprehensive list ordered item could verify ala account still closedi replied every email requesting last credit card news flash card compromised seem another active card associated account therefore cannot give last digit credit card tried get automated email one help resolve issueyour customer service sent order number without associated item customer dig email figure item email item stated request last credit card happily pay charge going give credit card without item specification amazon charge please especially supposedly fraud account cannot seem verify identity new credit card caught endless loop customer service agent cant solve issue email requesting credit card information last digit linked accountthis terrible customer service loyal customer spent thousand dollar amazon hung transferred told totally different information agent answering amazon phone agent told cant anything wait email amazon alexas closed amazon kid tablet course ordering spent hour phone trying resolve pay item ordered totally completely ridiculous needless need take close look treating valued customer beyond frustrating deplorable,0.027915153494059167,0.9720848465059408,0.24677509814918677,0.2,0.8353974428828077,83.53974428828077,High Trust
debbie harlin,/users/5f0c86881fe9b5401102b746,US,1.0,2020-07-13 16:30:46+00:00,1.0,No verification for Digital Nintendo Switch eCards…,"I purchased a Nintendo Switch eCards for my grandson for $35 2 days ago and the code never came through and kept saying pending verification.  I thought it didn't go through so I tried again... another ecard for $35 same thing happened.  I thought they were just busy and by in the morning it would be emailed to me.  The next morning it's not there so I decided to call Amazon Customer Service.  You can't call at first you have to chat...acts like a robot with robot script and asks if there was a payment problem and I answered no.  Matter of fact the night before I logged onto GameStop and downloaded the same card with no problem.  The robot then tells me they will research and let me know something in 3 business days.  So this morning, Monday, I get an email that the process has started and gave me a phone number.  I called and got a nice woman who said nothing was wrong with the payment and she transferred me to the Digital Department.  This young man said my account was locked because of suspected fraud.  I told him that it wasn't fraud I did order both of them.  He said my account was locked for 24hours and that it has been sent to the fraud department to investigate.  I asked to speak to a supervisor.  This supposed supervisor I am quite sure was not one!!!  Never once did they say I am sorry for your inconvenience...or that this has happened.  Every answer was from a script and then they ask did we answer your concerns...and I said No...they get an attitude and keep reading the same line.  I asked to speak to the supervisors supervisor and was told you can only talk to one a day???!!!!  Why I suspect he wasn't a supervisor was that he referenced and quoted the guy before who I had no problem with...I just wanted them to unlock my account now and he couldn't do it.  What I find to be hypocritical and suspicious is that when you get the phone number to call and you call it before they will talk to you... they send you a text message that you have to respond verifying through that message that it is you!!!  But through this purchase they can't verify by like text message??!!  GameStop sent me a text with a code to verify instantly and I got the codes instantly.  GameStop is not as big as Amazon, however, they must have better programmers than Amazon.  Learned my lesson...never buying digital from Amazon again.  Always go to a stand a lone store site they are better equipped and so grateful for the purchase!",2020-07-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,13.0,2451,452,51,7,0.0,0,13,2,1,Suspicious,purchased nintendo switch ecards grandson day ago code never came kept saying pending verification thought didnt go tried another ecard thing happened thought busy morning would emailed next morning decided call amazon customer service cant call first chatacts like robot robot script asks payment problem answered matter fact night logged onto gamestop downloaded card problem robot tell research let know something business day morning monday get email process started gave phone number called got nice woman said nothing wrong payment transferred digital department young man said account locked suspected fraud told wasnt fraud order said account locked hour sent fraud department investigate asked speak supervisor supposed supervisor quite sure one never say sorry inconvenienceor happened every answer script ask answer concernsand said nothey get attitude keep reading line asked speak supervisor supervisor told talk one day suspect wasnt supervisor referenced quoted guy problem withi wanted unlock account couldnt find hypocritical suspicious get phone number call call talk send text message respond verifying message purchase cant verify like text message gamestop sent text code verify instantly got code instantly gamestop big amazon however must better programmer amazon learned lessonnever buying digital amazon always go stand lone store site better equipped grateful purchase,0.9999997556169924,2.443830076082065e-07,0.25350532809871,0.2,0.3507011878112458,35.070118781124584,Low Trust
AlexanderHunt,/users/4e98632d00006400010d2bac,PL,25.0,2020-07-13 09:52:43+00:00,1.0,"A very,very,very bad delivery",I have order a bottle of Gin from Amazon twice in the past with no trouble. Before I go on I will inform you that I am 74 years of age in August 20.The person who delivered the package demanded that i show him some ID as it was alcohol.I asked him why but as i had my Bus Pass on me I showed him that. He then wanted my date of birth and i once again asked him why as i was clearly over the age of buying alcohol but nevertheless i told him my date of birth. I told him this was a nonsense and he told me to calm down. I replied that I was calm and saying date of birth again i picked up my parcels and closed my door.His response was to ring my doorbell and hammer loudly on my door.He the called my home phone I hung up and blocked his call.My wife who is 72 years was very distressed and still is by his behavior. Ringing the doorbell and hammering on my door for a little over 8 minutes.I reported this to Amazon when I was less shaken by the experience and was told they would investigate.This happen last Thursday 9/7/20 and I have not heard back from Amazon what the outcome was. My wife is now very nervous of answering the door.I have a ring camera installed which also records voice conversation very clearly and i am debating if i should take legal advice for the distress caused.,2020-07-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,13.0,1291,256,29,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,order bottle gin amazon twice past trouble go inform year age august person delivered package demanded show id alcoholi asked bus pas showed wanted date birth asked clearly age buying alcohol nevertheless told date birth told nonsense told calm replied calm saying date birth picked parcel closed doorhis response ring doorbell hammer loudly doorhe called home phone hung blocked callmy wife year distressed still behavior ringing doorbell hammering door little minutesi reported amazon less shaken experience told would investigatethis happen last thursday heard back amazon outcome wife nervous answering doori ring camera installed also record voice conversation clearly debating take legal advice distress caused,0.05849002218582089,0.9415099778141791,0.1435782389231632,0.2,0.7994706366917221,79.94706366917221,High Trust
darla sequeira,/users/5f0b1a22b810ff83082fe976,US,1.0,2020-07-12 14:11:55+00:00,1.0,If I could give them 0 I would,"If I could give them 0 I would.  This has happened to me a couple of times now.  Amazon promises a package would get to me in two days and then somehow it never shows up.  My order said it was delayed in shipping I needed the package for a birthday party I was giving for my grand daughter and daughter.  I contacted customer service they said give it another day. I contacted them three times and all they could say is it’s delayed, I asked them if was list and they said no but they could give me a refund. They didn’t act like they even cared they didn’t offer any restitution, so on the day of the party I was out at Party City buying plates and decorations.  I cancelled my membership with Amazon merely because of their attitude and non caring.",2020-07-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,12.0,750,144,30,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,could give would happened couple time amazon promise package would get two day somehow never show order said delayed shipping needed package birthday party giving grand daughter daughter contacted customer service said give another day contacted three time could say it’s delayed asked list said could give refund didn’t act like even cared didn’t offer restitution day party party city buying plate decoration cancelled membership amazon merely attitude non caring,0.012249256087885855,0.9877507439121141,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.810027923834913,81.0027923834913,High Trust
