Helen North,/users/505afe9200006400012207ab,GB,11.0,2020-07-11 16:06:33+00:00,1.0,Poor Service & Waste of time,"Amazon's own delivery a joke!Had morning email from Amazon - out for delivery today.Alexa message to expect delivery today.Waited in...Checked Tracking at 3pm...Stated 'Delivered handed to customer' Checked with neighbours, checked front garden- nothing.Spent time contacting Amazon Customer Services...waiited for her to contact delivery driver. Told me package mistakenly marked as delivered, but admitted not delivered. Will now be delivered in three days time, on Tuesday. This package was garden soil. I intended to use my precious week-end to repot my seedlings. A whole day Saturday wasted, as I stayed in waiting. Not happy! Crap service, unreliable & untruthful. Package would need to be scanned, so was obviously on board - Clearly, no mistake, just couldn't be bothered to deliver to my door. £5.00 voucher given, but this does not compensate at all, for all this hassle and wasted time.",2020-07-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,11.0,898,140,28,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon delivery jokehad morning email amazon delivery todayalexa message expect delivery todaywaited inchecked tracking pmstated delivered handed customer checked neighbour checked front garden nothingspent time contacting amazon customer serviceswaiited contact delivery driver told package mistakenly marked delivered admitted delivered delivered three day time tuesday package garden soil intended use precious weekend repot seedling whole day saturday wasted stayed waiting happy crap service unreliable untruthful package would need scanned obviously board clearly mistake couldnt bothered deliver door £ voucher given compensate hassle wasted time,0.25925952335980385,0.7407404766401962,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.686074108202319,68.60741082023189,Medium Trust
