Hafsa Saadia,/users/5f095870b2943ea831e6d24c,US,4.0,2020-07-11 07:14:04+00:00,4.0,Satisfied and impressed customer,"So I received an amazon gift card from someone and I wanted to use it to buy some things from amazon. The gift card number would not work. So I thought I would have to call customer service. But then the next day, I downloaded the amazon shop app from google play store on my phone. And then I scanned the giftcard through the app, and thankfully it worked. I ordered what I needed to order and luckily I was offered amazon prime free for a month to use. When I received the items, I decided to return one product back because I didnt love it, so I initiated a return online for that product. The instructions for the return were to pack it back up and include a printed out receipt inside. And no need to put the address or postage or anything on the outside. Amazon Prime person would come to my door the next business day and pick up that item and I will be credited. I chose to get amazon credit when I was filing the return online. The very next day, I got the email that I got a refund and the credit was in my amazon account. Completely satisfied with the amazon service so far. No issues for me. Would like amazon to be better at recognizing gift cards entered manually!",2020-07-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,11.0,1178,227,32,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,received amazon gift card someone wanted use buy thing amazon gift card number would work thought would call customer service next day downloaded amazon shop app google play store phone scanned giftcard app thankfully worked ordered needed order luckily offered amazon prime free month use received item decided return one product back didnt love initiated return online product instruction return pack back include printed receipt inside need put address postage anything outside amazon prime person would come door next business day pick item credited chose get amazon credit filing return online next day got email got refund credit amazon account completely satisfied amazon service far issue would like amazon better recognizing gift card entered manually,0.029748044946065248,0.9702519550539348,0.12731351654514864,0.8,1.7105886808359971,171.05886808359972,High Trust
