Emma Hathaway,/users/5f0906a0df4f24b6c28be67d,US,1.0,2020-07-11 00:25:41+00:00,2.0,The sad truth...,"Honestly, I want to rate this a 1/5 but on the rare occasion it does work, it works better than some places. I have Amazon prime. They want to make such a huge deal about 2 day shipping, yet send it with usps and it arrives several days late. WE PAY for TWO day shipping. The ugly truth is, even though you would put their prime members first, they don't.  They don't even have an option of what carrier to choose. You are screwed either way.",2020-07-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,11.0,442,86,16,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,honestly want rate rare occasion work work better place amazon prime want make huge deal day shipping yet send usps arrives several day late pay two day shipping ugly truth even though would put prime member first dont dont even option carrier choose screwed either way,0.019649443269248487,0.9803505567307516,0.04823331463825014,0.4,1.0998219412930257,109.98219412930257,High Trust
Jessica Boonstra,/users/5f08c8dc2df8b867795c3d90,US,1.0,2020-07-10 20:00:37+00:00,1.0,Taking a break from Amazon,"I am in need of support due to an order that shows as delivered but isn't. I've had generally good experiences with Amazon in the past and I don't want to give up on the company. However, the message on their customer support line that states, ""if you need help with your account or an order, please call back later"" is discouraging to say the least. How do you not have support for orders when you have more money and resources than many other companies that *have* managed to provide support even through Covid?Money talks, so this is what I am going to say with mine: Amazon, you will not have any more of my business until you can stand behind your products and provide support to your customers.",2020-07-10 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,10.0,700,129,26,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,need support due order show delivered isnt ive generally good experience amazon past dont want give company however message customer support line state need help account order please call back later discouraging say least support order money resource many company managed provide support even covidmoney talk going say mine amazon business stand behind product provide support customer,0.0037682322980032313,0.9962317677019967,0.0723499719573752,0.2,0.8125858782424733,81.25858782424733,High Trust
