Vicky Hadaway,/users/5f0754ac87dd7d50703201ef,GB,5.0,2020-07-09 17:32:35+00:00,1.0,Don’t believe anything Amazon says,Don’t believe anything Amazon saysWe ordered a furniture set and near the time of the delivery date we started to get alarmed at the reviews we were reading as people were stating the seller was a con artist.We got onto Amazon and spoke to a women called Toni who assured us if our items were not delivered we will be refunded our money. She said she will contact us Wednesday to let us know.. well it Thursday and no response fromToni - I spoke to another representative who said it’s not up to Amazon to refund us we need to go back to the seller .. not happy spoke to another person who has put in a investigation and have submitted a a-z customer satisfaction which means it’s going to take another 2 weeks before we get anywhere ..If amazon is selling items on behalf of these sellers they must take responsibility of refunding people when their items don’t turn up .. so if they promise you a refund don’t believe it until it is in your bank,2020-07-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,9.0,947,178,34,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,don’t believe anything amazon sayswe ordered furniture set near time delivery date started get alarmed review reading people stating seller con artistwe got onto amazon spoke woman called toni assured u item delivered refunded money said contact u wednesday let u know well thursday response fromtoni spoke another representative said it’s amazon refund u need go back seller happy spoke another person put investigation submitted az customer satisfaction mean it’s going take another week get anywhere amazon selling item behalf seller must take responsibility refunding people item don’t turn promise refund don’t believe bank,0.007231096114200168,0.9927689038857999,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.8163508007931524,81.63508007931523,High Trust
