JAMES MULVEY,/users/57865bb10000ff000a318045,US,5.0,2020-07-08 13:07:39+00:00,1.0,Amazon,"Amazon. - Very pissed off customer.They have taken away the true meaning of PRIME(But your still paying for it.)That one to two day shipping has gone out the window.And no it’s not because of this pandemic. Abundance of merchandise you order - now comes from China ?Which leads to a minimum of 2-3 weeks shipping if not more.   You received the wrong merchandise,  Someone can go back and change your invoice To suit their needs. - Such as “Beauty Eccentals” Who is listed  under the title  “Lancôme of paris”Ex: I ordered & paid for my usual perfumeLancôme  O De Orangerie.Company sent me Lancome De Lancome ??Notified them on Amazon site. Then Changed my involved in Amazons system to an old invoiceShowing That I ordered “De Lancome”From Back in 2017.  I never even heard of this perfume. Not sure if its ben out that longThen again after notifying company thru Amazons site  they post That you cannot return it back to amazon.Something — very shady is going on.Packages getting lost,Mis- Delivered, Extended Delays  & you cannot cancel them ? You just have to wait ?We order from Amazon constantly. But its not what were paying for. I think its time for an Amazon Break",2020-07-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,8.0,1173,203,6,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon pissed customerthey taken away true meaning primebut still paying itthat one two day shipping gone windowand it’s pandemic abundance merchandise order come china lead minimum week shipping received wrong merchandise someone go back change invoice suit need “beauty eccentals” listed title “lancôme paris”ex ordered paid usual perfumelancôme de orangeriecompany sent lancome de lancome notified amazon site changed involved amazon system old invoiceshowing ordered “de lancome”from back never even heard perfume sure ben longthen notifying company thru amazon site post cannot return back amazonsomething — shady going onpackages getting lostmis delivered