Carlos Fernandes,/users/5f058bf109a036f1062ccb4c,GB,7.0,2020-07-08 09:03:54+00:00,1.0,Not delivered,"Delivery means, 1.) knocking on the door or ring the bell and 2.) giving it to a person. Not thrown on the door step. Lucky it wasn't raining or an item that would break. Lucky it wasn't taken also, as my area has issues of amazon packages been left on door steps and they go missing. Amazon should start employing more qualified drivers, not monkeys.",2020-07-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,8.0,351,65,13,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,delivery mean knocking door ring bell giving person thrown door step lucky wasnt raining item would break lucky wasnt taken also area issue amazon package left door step go missing amazon start employing qualified driver monkey,0.03577027675549252,0.9642297232445075,0.03645541222658441,0.2,0.7894059440675706,78.94059440675706,High Trust
