Roberto Martuscelli,/users/5eee7fe88526dd60e6201fe7,CO,7.0,2020-07-05 00:41:17+00:00,5.0,Almost perfect,"First of all I want to share my experience for Amazon.com from Colombia, and also for Amazon.it from Italy (I'm italian living in Colombia).Starting since November 2019 and until the lockdown for the Covid-19, my experience on Amazon.com buying from Colombia was something really near to the perfection.They was giving international free shipping starting from orders of 35USD or more, all was really very quick and efficient, only some very little details (like the difficulty on returnig objects containing lithium batteries) was giving little problems but resolved with efficience and courtesy by the customer service.Unfortunately actually there is no free shipping, but probably due to the flying restrictions of Colombia, but I repeat, buying on Amazon.com is actually a superior category than buying on every other platform, maybe only eBay have the same professionality but not the same convenience.Similar (but better) experience buying on Amazon.it from Italy, in this case it's all quicker and easyer, because most of the articles are shipped from the same country of addressee.People that giving less than 5 star to Amazon, should buy something on AliExpress (really a platform full of thieves actually) or any other chinese platform, or experiment how a local platform like Mercadolibre after almost 2 months that I returned some defective goods that I received, still hasn't returned my money (about 120 USD).In my opinion, and relatively to all the platforms I tried right now (AliExpress, DHGate, Gearbest, Lightinthebox, Chinavasion, Banggood (and some less famous chinese platform), eBay.com and eBay.it, Linio, Mercadolibre, ePrice, CHL, Aeropost, PideloRapido and others), Amazon is really the #1 wothout any doubt.",2020-07-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,5.0,1735,265,14,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,first want share experience amazoncom colombia also amazonit italy im italian living colombiastarting since november lockdown covid experience amazoncom buying colombia something really near perfectionthey giving international free shipping starting order usd really quick efficient little detail like difficulty returnig object containing lithium battery giving little problem resolved efficience courtesy customer serviceunfortunately actually free shipping probably due flying restriction colombia repeat buying amazoncom actually superior category buying every platform maybe ebay professionality conveniencesimilar better experience buying amazonit italy case quicker easyer article shipped country addresseepeople giving less star amazon buy something aliexpress really platform full thief actually chinese platform experiment local platform like mercadolibre almost month returned defective good received still hasnt returned money usdin opinion relatively platform tried right aliexpress dhgate gearbest lightinthebox chinavasion banggood less famous chinese platform ebaycom ebayit linio mercadolibre eprice chl aeropost pidelorapido others amazon really wothout doubt,0.03144157830343626,0.9685584216965637,0.14862591138530568,1.0,2.014004393125343,201.40043931253427,High Trust
