James H,/users/5efce71fc126ea9789a50883,US,3.0,2020-07-01 19:42:42+00:00,1.0,Fake Items,"On July 15, 2019 I purchased two Hyperice Hypervolt massage guns off Amazon from the seller ""TUSAHYPER"" for $375.83 each. On May 2020 the devices stopped working. The devices were still under the 1 year warranty so I reached out directly to Hyperice for a replacement. Hyperice customer service informed me that my devices were fakes and the seller on Amazon was known to be selling fraudulent devices. I retained the customer service chat logs from Hyperice that prove this claim. I went to leave a negative review as a warning to others on the Amazon seller's page but was unable to do so. I then contacted Amazon customer service to file a complaint and request a full refund on the fake items. I had to call and chat numerous times for the complaint to finally be filed (or so I thought). I received an email from Amazon on June 8, 2020 confirming that a complaint had been filed on my behalf and they would follow up with the outcome. I received no follow up after two weeks so I reached out to Amazon customer service again. After dozens of chats and calls, it is now three weeks later and I am being told no complaint was filed and zero progress has been made on my request. Amazon is doing nothing against that fraudulent seller and nothing for me as a swindled customer. I have been a Prime member for a few years but very disappointed at this terrible customer experience and will be rethinking continuing my membership. I would like an immediate, full refund on both fake Hyperice products.",2020-07-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,1.0,1501,270,10,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,july purchased two hyperice hypervolt massage gun amazon seller tusahyper may device stopped working device still year warranty reached directly hyperice replacement hyperice customer service informed device fake seller amazon known selling fraudulent device retained customer service chat log hyperice prove claim went leave negative review warning others amazon seller page unable contacted amazon customer service file complaint request full refund fake item call chat numerous time complaint finally filed thought received email amazon june confirming complaint filed behalf would follow outcome received follow two week reached amazon customer service dozen chat call three week later told complaint filed zero progress made request amazon nothing fraudulent seller nothing swindled customer prime member year disappointed terrible customer experience rethinking continuing membership would like immediate full refund fake hyperice product,0.013777404965087503,0.9862225950349125,0.1514301738642737,0.2,0.823397332290311,82.3397332290311,High Trust
Ivy,/users/55ca81b30000ff0001d37df0,ES,12.0,2020-07-01 19:36:10+00:00,1.0,Amazon business conduct UNACCEPTABLE,"This business conduct by Amazon is UNBELIEVABLE and UNACCEPTABLE Our company UVILITE is unable to sell on Amazon. Our account got approved in April and we can't login ever since.Gettin same error every time - ""Internal ErrorWe're sorry but we encountered an error while processing your request.""We sent 100s messages to seller support and NOBODY was able to help and fix it. We changed passwords, cookies, parental controls, loggin in and out 100 times... None of the seller support recommendations were valid and solved the issue.Its been almost 3 MONTHS now. UPDATE:Today we got email saying ""Thank you for your patience with our verification process. Case closed” WE HAVE BEEN VERIFIED in APRIL!!!!Please advise.Regards,Irena Prager",2020-07-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,1.0,735,115,36,4,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,business conduct amazon unbelievable unacceptable company uvilite unable sell amazon account got approved april cant login ever sincegettin error every time internal errorwere sorry encountered error processing requestwe sent message seller support nobody able help fix changed password cooky parental control loggin time none seller support recommendation valid solved issueits almost month updatetoday got email saying thank patience verification process case closed” verified aprilplease adviseregardsirena prager,0.8844865493843648,0.11551345061563523,0.06449803701626472,0.2,0.37065633271107057,37.06563327110706,Low Trust
