Kathy Garvin,/users/55f519550000ff0001db596e,US,14.0,2020-06-27 04:38:47+00:00,1.0,What's up with your shipping Amazon?,"Ok, here I go again. Ordered 2 5# bags of gummies today. They split the order into 2 different deliveries when they both came from amazon and they were according to checkout coming together. See they take this upon their selves to do this and we don't know it. I got the one this afternoon when it was hot. The package was hot and had a tennis ball size of melted together gummies. Tracking according to CR said the other one would be here just before 1am. What? I'm not and no other customer would stay up that late for delivery. I just checked tracking again while I was on chat and it changed to the 27-28th. I pay $15 a month every month whether I use it or not to have next day to 2 day ship, not at their convenience ship. I told them if it's not here tomorrow I will be back to cancel. I don't know how much more of their incompetence I can take in a month.",2020-06-27 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,27.0,864,172,36,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ok go ordered bag gummies today split order different delivery came amazon according checkout coming together see take upon self dont know got one afternoon hot package hot tennis ball size melted together gummies tracking according cr said one would im customer would stay late delivery checked tracking chat changed th pay month every month whether use next day day ship convenience ship told tomorrow back cancel dont know much incompetence take month,0.037626969692276815,0.9623730303077231,0.09646662927650028,0.2,0.8004798410091616,80.04798410091615,High Trust
Lola,/users/57516e5a0000ff000a25ec31,GB,42.0,2020-06-26 20:27:25+00:00,4.0,Great,"It is worth paying Prime membership as the amount of stuff I have ordered for last minute things came fast. Also, Prime TV is included so you cannot go wrong. I haven't explored the other parts of my membership yet but I intend to. Although there can be mixed sellers on there, it can be hard to return items if you have brought from a seller. Amazon offers a range of products so most of the time you can find it at a reasonable price. Also, Amazon has a 'Smile' link that donates a small percentage to a charity of your choice. You only need to use the Amazon Smile link make your purchase as normal. It linked with your main Amazon account so all your orders are still there and it accumulates how much you have donated over time.",2020-06-26 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,26.0,733,140,5,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,worth paying prime membership amount stuff ordered last minute thing came fast also prime tv included cannot go wrong havent explored part membership yet intend although mixed seller hard return item brought seller amazon offer range product time find reasonable price also amazon smile link donates small percentage charity choice need use amazon smile link make purchase normal linked main amazon account order still accumulates much donated time,0.06055213117349048,0.9394478688265095,0.07851934941110487,0.8,1.6854278042954756,168.54278042954755,High Trust
