Paula Elvey,/users/52b096f200006400015a3965,GB,30.0,2020-06-26 14:52:13+00:00,1.0,"Refusal to Refund Returned Item, Appalling Customer Service","What an absolutely appalling experience I have received from Amazon over the last 10 days.  My ac was hacked and an item I did not order was sent to me (yes my address) and £70 vouchers given for my birthday were used to pay for it, alongside £9 from my business account (item was £79).  I duly returned the item after informing them of the situation with my ac.  Since then, the only communication is via Livechat.  Only one advisor (Jason, on Mon June 22nd) was polite and helpful, and today Fri June 26th Mark (1535 time) was particularly rude, unhelpful and ended up just ignoring me.  I have the screenshots on my phone.  Basically they have the item back unopened but will not refund me!  Will not transfer me to the relevant dept and will not do anything!! Apart from the security issue - what a terrible way to treat a customer, not give the item back and refuse to help.  I really enjoyed using my Amazon AC but unless I get someone to deal with this soon, I fear I may never use again. And that would be a shame as they were usually pretty good before.  Hopefully someone out there can help.",2020-06-26 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,26.0,1101,205,59,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,absolutely appalling experience received amazon last day ac hacked item order sent yes address £ voucher given birthday used pay alongside £ business account item £ duly returned item informing situation ac since communication via livechat one advisor jason mon june nd polite helpful today fri june th mark time particularly rude unhelpful ended ignoring screenshots phone basically item back unopened refund transfer relevant dept anything apart security issue terrible way treat customer give item back refuse help really enjoyed using amazon ac unless get someone deal soon fear may never use would shame usually pretty good hopefully someone help,0.8367619972169115,0.16323800278308853,0.11497476163768929,0.2,0.4046139537190821,40.46139537190821,Low Trust
