JS,/users/5e7e20af5409e8f8e06d92fe,US,2.0,2020-06-25 20:27:34+00:00,1.0,Tired of low quality or counterfeit goods,"I initially loved the convenience Amazon offered, ordering almost anything while I am sitting on my couch in the living room and receiving the goods fairly quickly as a prime customer. In the last 3-4 months, I ordered a number of various items from skincare products to herbal medicine, furniture to wigs, you name it. Almost all were waiting Th we super low quality although the reviews were good and products had many stars. Then I learned many sellers offer free product to whomever gives positive feedback. I also received a number of counterfeit providers and after months of battling with all these issues, I finally gave up and decided to cancel my amazon account. It’s not worth it. I’m not going to play the stupidest buy and return game. It’s just waste of time. I’d rather pay the premium and go to a store and buy legitimate items where a company stands behind the quality of the goods.",2020-06-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,25.0,899,159,41,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,initially loved convenience amazon offered ordering almost anything sitting couch living room receiving good fairly quickly prime customer last month ordered number various item skincare product herbal medicine furniture wig name almost waiting th super low quality although review good product many star learned many seller offer free product whomever give positive feedback also received number counterfeit provider month battling issue finally gave decided cancel amazon account it’s worth i’m going play stupidest buy return game it’s waste time i’d rather pay premium go store buy legitimate item company stand behind quality good,0.014856188736446884,0.9851438112635531,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.8104070149980133,81.04070149980133,High Trust
