Gina,/users/5ef3efbefb792617b01a3abd,US,1.0,2020-06-25 00:28:52+00:00,1.0,Gone down hill,"I received an item that was used today, my last order was delivered to the wrong house. The item was a used charger, I told the representative that I came into contact with someone with Covid-19 last week and hence why I didn't go to the store to buy a new charger.  I don't want to get anyone sick. She said well you need to drop the item off at a local UPS store. Why would I do that if I could be sick with Covid? That would endanger other people. She said well then we will send you a free replacement, I'm sorry driving 20 minutes to my local UPS and using my gas is not free! Terrible customer service that does not care about other people possibly contracting this virus",2020-06-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,25.0,677,132,14,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,received item used today last order delivered wrong house item used charger told representative came contact someone covid last week hence didnt go store buy new charger dont want get anyone sick said well need drop item local ups store would could sick covid would endanger people said well send free replacement im sorry driving minute local ups using gas free terrible customer service care people possibly contracting virus,0.09139636566871505,0.908603634331285,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.7691083230545936,76.91083230545937,High Trust
