Lili Wang,/users/5cbc526dbcc58780676b6272,GB,3.0,2020-06-24 00:28:17+00:00,1.0,As a customer,"BEWARE... 4 OR 5 STAR RATINGS ON SELLERS ACCOUNT IS QUESTIONABLE.As a customer, I expect to be able to leave genuine and honest review about a product I purchased. Back a few weeks ago, my husband purchased a water mat on amazon for our 2 year old. On the first day, the material on the mat started to peel off, which u dont expect especially when the seller says its durable, mind you it's not cheap either. My husband left a review stating what we experienced with the purchase, the seller kept harassing my husband to take the review down and in exchange will give him a full refund so that they can keep their 5 star ratings. My husband then did a update review stating that he is being asked my the seller to take it down and expressed that buyers should beware of the 5 star rating this seller has on their account. Few weeks go by and Amazon sends my husband an email informing him that amazon have removed my husbands review as amazon deems it as an authentic product. My question is on what basis is Amazon deeming the product as authentic  and that my husbands review is not. No explanation is given, makes you second guess the authenticity of the way Amazon operates. As a result its put alot of doubt in my mind about the way Amazon operates and that it does not appear to have its consumers best interest at heart,instead it seems like its protecting its sellers so that amazon can profit from their so called good ratings. I doubt amazon cares or reads this since they clearly dont reply to peoples complaints.",2020-06-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,24.0,1524,281,13,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,beware star rating seller account questionableas customer expect able leave genuine honest review product purchased back week ago husband purchased water mat amazon year old first day material mat started peel u dont expect especially seller say durable mind cheap either husband left review stating experienced purchase seller kept harassing husband take review exchange give full refund keep star rating husband update review stating asked seller take expressed buyer beware star rating seller account week go amazon sends husband email informing amazon removed husband review amazon deems authentic product question basis amazon deeming product authentic husband review explanation given make second guess authenticity way amazon operates result put alot doubt mind way amazon operates appear consumer best interest heartinstead seems like protecting seller amazon profit called good rating doubt amazon care read since clearly dont reply people complaint,0.027679802533765587,0.9723201974662344,0.15759955131800338,0.2,0.8176800089967179,81.76800089967179,High Trust
