John T,/users/5ef23c94e82d23721b86e2f6,GB,5.0,2020-06-23 17:48:02+00:00,5.0,Love Amazon :),"During lock down I've been using Amazon a lot, bit too much probably, eek. Got to say every single order was delivered on time and arrived as expected, cannot fault them, free returns through Prime and credited as soon as its scanned at the post office. I've bought everything from parts for the car, games, a tablet aven a Mavic Mini. All expertly packed and delivered under the new regulations. Drivers are excellent and just thought this company could do with some praise rather than negativity during these trying times. Even one item which had been ordered whilst out of stock was refunded immediately after a quick Web chat.Well done Amazon, highly recommend!",2020-06-23 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,23.0,665,113,14,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,lock ive using amazon lot bit much probably eek got say every single order delivered time arrived expected cannot fault free return prime credited soon scanned post office ive bought everything part car game tablet aven mavic mini expertly packed delivered new regulation driver excellent thought company could praise rather negativity trying time even one item ordered whilst stock refunded immediately quick web chatwell done amazon highly recommend,0.07281103145919962,0.9271889685408004,0.0633763320246775,1.0,1.9762697506753357,197.62697506753358,High Trust
