James,/users/53239d4e000064000168f61f,CA,7.0,2020-06-28 00:17:14+00:00,1.0,Flagrant lies & borderline harassment,"In the past few months I've been ripped off several times on amazon.  Every damn time other than 1 I got no resolution other than vaguely threatening emails after my negative reviews (which DON""T violate their ""community guidelines"") were deleted without cause.  3 of my orders were clothing items that never arrived or in the case of 1 was advertised as a multipack but only 1 was sent loose (without the package just a plain envelope).  All were supposedly ""fulfilled by amazon"", 1 even sold by amazon itself but the other 2 were from china & thailand respectively and never shipped.  Another item was a small set of guitar repair tools which were so shoddy they were inoperable right out of the package with the most important was never shipped.  The seller lied and lied with repeated promises of shipping a replacement but did nothing.  I'd even paid for their so called ""prime"" service which made zero difference in reliability.On a side note don't bother with their prime service for the video streaming.  you can get better elsewhere including the free sites (tubi or pluto tv etc).  Most of primes so called content are the kind of movies you'd find on the 99 cent rental shelf in a corner store back in the 90's.  You could count on 1 hand the number that are known big name titles.",2020-06-21 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,28.0,1292,228,37,5,7.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,past month ive ripped several time amazon every damn time got resolution vaguely threatening email negative review dont violate community guideline deleted without cause order clothing item never arrived case advertised multipack sent loose without package plain envelope supposedly fulfilled amazon even sold amazon china thailand respectively never shipped another item small set guitar repair tool shoddy inoperable right package important never shipped seller lied lied repeated promise shipping replacement nothing id even paid called prime service made zero difference reliabilityon side note dont bother prime service video streaming get better elsewhere including free site tubi pluto tv etc prime called content kind movie youd find cent rental shelf corner store back could count hand number known big name title,0.013709279529126758,0.9862907204708733,0.12787436904094224,0.2,0.818720234043625,81.87202340436251,High Trust
