MJ,/users/5eed076d8628fe4f2307f508,US,6.0,2020-06-19 19:57:57+00:00,1.0,Total Disappointment,"We started using Amazon at the beginning and it was an amazing company. Every book and CD we ordered arrived carefully packaged, customer service was good and pricing was reasonable. For years we loved it. Now? It is a corporate beast that doesn’t care about anything but money.We have had more broken and late items than I can count. Prime shipping is not free, it is the cost of the item with shipping built into the total price 80% of the time. Customer service is non-existent and if you are patient enough to wait for a human being it is scripted from key words that you use to describe the problem. It is a terrible beast. We are slowly moving to other sites for our needs and will not be renewing our membership when it expires. So disappointing!",2020-06-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,19.0,753,138,20,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,started using amazon beginning amazing company every book cd ordered arrived carefully packaged customer service good pricing reasonable year loved corporate beast doesn’t care anything moneywe broken late item count prime shipping free cost item shipping built total price time customer service nonexistent patient enough wait human scripted key word use describe problem terrible beast slowly moving site need renewing membership expires disappointing,0.10672173930467331,0.8932782606953267,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.762118659231567,76.2118659231567,High Trust
