Jeffrey Williams,/users/5833a9170000ff000a59a8f3,US,4.0,2020-06-19 14:51:53+00:00,1.0,Amazon is no longer the honorable company they used to be.,"Amazon has gone downhill terribly. From diluted, uninterested customer service, unwanted ads constantly pushing you to upgrade from the free music and video Prime services to a ""premium"" monthly subscription for both services, wildly different price points on the exact item, both sold and shipped directly by Amazon Prime - these are only a few of their new tactics. What I first noticed was that with my Amazon Music subscription, suddenly a few music tracks on an album would be made unavailable and THEN AGAIN try to push an upgraded service to unlock the tracks. All unacceptable.Amazon used to be beyond reproach and revolutionized online shopping. Unfortunately they have followed other companies' procedures trying to squeeze more money out of customers while cutting back on their services we pay for. I bought a baby gate for $49 only to find the same gate listed by Amazon twice for $42. An item sold by Amazon is an item sold by Amazon. I wasted $7. Let the buyer beware I guess. Amazon used to issue refunds in this scenario but stopped. It's all about the $ for them.I am very disappointed with Amazon.",2020-06-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,19.0,1116,191,58,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon gone downhill terribly diluted uninterested customer service unwanted ad constantly pushing upgrade free music video prime service premium monthly subscription service wildly different price point exact item sold shipped directly amazon prime new tactic first noticed amazon music subscription suddenly music track album would made unavailable try push upgraded service unlock track unacceptableamazon used beyond reproach revolutionized online shopping unfortunately followed company procedure trying squeeze money customer cutting back service pay bought baby gate find gate listed amazon twice item sold amazon item sold amazon wasted let buyer beware guess amazon used issue refund scenario stopped themi disappointed amazon,0.00921609634645852,0.9907839036535415,0.1071228266965788,0.2,0.8168165171660865,81.68165171660866,High Trust
