ter literally work home almost month got product refund response claim helping ppl need mask handwash mostly stock company still make ton money selling non essential ppl really make realize really dont care customer jeff bezo dont care u employee union terrible pay hour amazon making bank miscellaneous product none essential stuff restock sell time original price sad people cannot live without company like would probably still use urgent item one day delivery incident show indecent careless company try best use less hope would,0.005612441569187291,0.9943875584308127,0.15030846887268648,0.2,0.8272554729899436,82.72554729899436,High Trust
