Tim Logan,/users/5ee848326300b370e8eff760,US,1.0,2020-06-16 04:19:07+00:00,1.0,Price of Prime not worth the headache! Incompetent chain of command...,"I deprioritized UPS for shipping and Amazon continued to use their services anyway. I bought a computer desk for approx. $350 on June 5th (Amazon Prime) and got confirmation it would arrive on June 11th. As expected, it didn't arrive. Amazon customer service representatives apologized and promised I would receive it the following day, but it never arrived (as expected). So, Amazon customer service reps. promised it would arrive today (June 15th). Guess what happened? It never arrived. An Amazon customer service supervisor promised me tonight it will definitely arrive tomorrow, but I should wait another day (June 17th) if it doesn't. Keep in mind, UPS is 15 mins from my home. I talked to 5 online chat reps, 6 customer service reps, and 1 supervisor. You know what they all have in common? They repeat common knowledge, make false claims/promises, and expect paying customers to increase the duration of their expected delivery date due to their incompetence. I've been an Amazon Prime customer for 7 years and spent over $2000 in the past 4 months. Nevertheless, tonight I canceled my membership and will NEVER use their services again.",2020-06-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,16.0,1145,189,70,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,deprioritized ups shipping amazon continued use service anyway bought computer desk approx june th amazon prime got confirmation would arrive june th expected didnt arrive amazon customer service representative apologized promised would receive following day never arrived expected amazon customer service rep promised would arrive today june th guess happened never arrived amazon customer service supervisor promised tonight definitely arrive tomorrow wait another day june th doesnt keep mind ups min home talked online chat rep customer service rep supervisor know common repeat common knowledge make false claimspromises expect paying customer increase duration expected delivery date due incompetence ive amazon prime customer year spent past month nevertheless tonight canceled membership never use service,0.014537534243134224,0.9854624657568658,0.10600112170499158,0.2,0.8139314572194312,81.39314572194311,High Trust
