Jeanne Ann Braddick,/users/5ee4d083207f326cb873e767,US,1.0,2020-06-13 13:20:47+00:00,1.0,Canceled my Amazon account,"Canceled my Amazon account. Here’s why:(1) ordered an expensive book on the site. Turns out the book was being sold by a “third party”. Book never arrived although my Amazon account says delivery is running late. Ordered book from Barnes and Noble and it arrived in 2 days. Amazon can’t change status of book delivery on my account because they didn’t “sell it” to me. No luck hearing from the company through the link Amazon sent me and Amazon “can’t help”.(2) ordered mouse traps and was informed that they would arrive in 3 days. Kept getting updates that shipment was running late. Had a friend go to Home Depot to buy a product; didn’t want to wait until a shipment arrived (wanted to catch a mouse ASAP). Mouse caught. Shipment finally arrived. Spent over an hour on phone with two customer service reps, the first one disconnected call and didn’t call back, to arrange UPS pickup of unopened mouse traps as I’m leaving my house as little as possible due to Covid.(3) have a friend who works PT in an Amazon warehouse. No PPE or physical distancing measures were implement for over a month after pandemic declared. Recently Amazon has several advertisements letting the public know how careful they are being with employees. They could have and should have implemented the measures long ago!",2020-06-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,13.0,1297,224,26,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,canceled amazon account here’s ordered expensive book site turn book sold “third party” book never arrived although amazon account say delivery running late ordered book barnes noble arrived day amazon can’t change status book delivery account didn’t “sell it” luck hearing company link amazon sent amazon “can’t help” ordered mouse trap informed would arrive day kept getting update shipment running late friend go home depot buy product didn’t want wait shipment arrived wanted catch mouse asap mouse caught shipment finally arrived spent hour phone two customer service rep first one disconnected call didn’t call back arrange ups pickup unopened mouse trap i’m leaving house little possible due covid friend work pt amazon warehouse ppe physical distancing measure implement month pandemic declared recently amazon several advertisement letting public know careful employee could implemented measure long ago,0.025389488560053842,0.9746105114399461,0.1256309590577678,0.2,0.8124314475315266,81.24314475315266,High Trust
