Consumer,/users/5ee41b0ef9633b43fc7bc9f0,AU,2.0,2020-06-13 00:19:19+00:00,1.0,"Name the activity where you charge, don't deliver and then not refund?","The problem is evident from the last 3 emails (from a long stream) between the customer  and Amazon as shown below. Email 3 has not been replied to (You can't give bad customer service if you don't give any service). It is a pity you can't give zero starsEMAIL 1 Customer to AmazonAs of this morning, 10 June 2020, the refund that Amazon undertook toprovide for goods that were never delivered (order *******) has still not been credited to my account. Clearly this is unsatisfactory given the following facts:1. The purchase price was immediately deducted from my account on theday of order. 24 April 2020. 2. The so-called ""supplier"" had an avalanche of customer reviews,alleging fraudulent behaviour, in the period soon after my purchase.3. The so-called ""supplier"" provided a supposed tracking number whichwas impossible to trace.4. The goods were not delivered, and is reasonable to assume that theywere never despatched, if indeed (based on the other customer reviews)the goods were ever available.5. On 18 May I sought a refund of the purchase price. On that day (18May) you advised (on behalf of Amazon) that the refund would occur in2 - 10 business days.6. On 1 June I emailed you advising that the refund had not beenreceived. You replied that my refund was ""currently in process"" butthat I would have to wait and that you were ""following it up"" and would getback to me.7. There has been no further communication from you, or from anyoneelse at Amazon.8. Amazon claims to be the ""Earth's Most Customer-Centric Company"". Myexperience, as outlined above, makes this a ludicrous claim.Through this entire process, I sought to work cooperatively withAmazon to resolve this simple issue in a courteous and cooperative manner. I have refrained from involving external agencies or publishing reviewsof the type that other defrauded customers did. However, Amazon has notmet its commitments to me at any stage. I seek immediate implementation of your commitment on the 18th Maywhich, in your own words was: ""I would like to inform you that we haverectified the issue and a full refund of **** for your order*******  has been processed to the original mode ofpayment."" I emphasise the words ""has been processed"", as your lateremail backtracked from this statement and used the words ""is currentlyin process"".  Please advise that the refund has been provided as a matter ofurgency.EMAIL 2 Amazon to customerI’m ***** from the Amazon.com.au Executive Customer Relations teamresponding on behalf of my colleague ***** who is currently out ofoffice.We understand your concern regarding the refund. We are working toresolve the issue at the earliest, please understand that it is not atall our intention to hold your amount. Unfortunately, the sellerissued the refund in the form of a gift card to a different account.We fixed it and trying to refund the amount to your original paymentmethod and this where we are facing difficulties. Our payments team isworking on it. I'd request you to please give us some more time so that we can resolve the refund issue. Thank you for understanding.Email 3 How much more time do you need to resolve the issue (i.e. refund my money) when I was told the issue had been resolved on the 18th May? Note, it is now the 11 June.NO REPLY",2020-06-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,13.0,3265,540,70,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,problem evident last email long stream customer amazon shown email replied cant give bad customer service dont give service pity cant give zero starsemail customer amazona morning june refund amazon undertook toprovide good never delivered order still credited account clearly unsatisfactory given following fact purchase price immediately deducted account theday order april socalled supplier avalanche customer reviewsalleging fraudulent behaviour period soon purchase socalled supplier provided supposed tracking number whichwas impossible trace good delivered reasonable assume theywere never despatched indeed based customer reviewsthe good ever available may sought refund purchase price day may advised behalf amazon refund would occur business day june emailed advising refund beenreceived replied refund currently process butthat would wait following would getback communication anyoneelse amazon amazon claim earth customercentric company myexperience outlined make ludicrous claimthrough entire process sought work cooperatively withamazon resolve simple issue courteous cooperative manner refrained involving external agency publishing reviewsof type defrauded customer however amazon notmet commitment stage seek immediate implementation commitment th maywhich word would like inform haverectified issue full refund order processed original mode ofpayment emphasise word processed lateremail backtracked statement used word currentlyin process please advise refund provided matter ofurgencyemail amazon customeri’m amazoncomau executive customer relation teamresponding behalf colleague currently ofofficewe understand concern regarding refund working toresolve issue earliest please understand atall intention hold amount unfortunately sellerissued refund form gift card different accountwe fixed trying refund amount original paymentmethod facing difficulty payment team isworking id request please give u time resolve refund issue thank understandingemail much time need resolve issue ie refund money told issue resolved th may note juneno reply,0.0019284548589699419,0.99807154514103,0.3028603477285474,0.2,0.8596078421162245,85.96078421162245,High Trust
