Allan Evans,/users/5edfd0770329dbd935509aa3,US,1.0,2020-06-09 18:10:15+00:00,1.0,Horrible nonexistent customer service,"Horrible nonexistent customer service. Ordered an item, they cancelled the order for the PC almost immediately but left the 70 dollar warranty charge on and locked my account, turned down my proof of card ownership claiming I had to have a printed out billing for the card. That in itself is just horrid. Nobody uses paper billing statements anymore and to force people to use them as proof of their own card is just moronic. Sent 2 photos of the card with exactly the information asked for as well as a screen shot of them not refunding the warranty charge after cancelling the order of the pc and they said it wasn’t enough, though exactly the info they asked for, and that I needed a paper billing statement with my phone number on it as well now. This all seems incredibly shady. They’re controlling what products I can actually order and cancel without my consent as well as sending people through unnecessary and nowhere near more secure hoops while stealing money by not canceling orders along with them. It makes no sense to me how a company of this size and “caliber” can operate like this and without a phone number for customer service reps to be reached at but instead have everything taken care of by automated email reply bots that can not discern information if it’s not in specific prose that is neglected to be shown or given an example of proper procedure. As there probably isn’t a procedure, it’s just a mandatory no to everything requested. Horrible that companies like google and amazon that are the biggest in the world for their respective trades, but they can’t even give out adequate customer service options and responses and we just let them run this way and accumulate profits and growth, stepping all over us as customers and rights given human beings. Shame on these companies and the people continuing to support them. Go back to in person shopping and cut these grotesquely operated businesses out of lives and wallets.",2020-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,9.0,1952,341,37,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,horrible nonexistent customer service ordered item cancelled order pc almost immediately left dollar warranty charge locked account turned proof card ownership claiming printed billing card horrid nobody us paper billing statement anymore force people use proof card moronic sent photo card exactly information asked well screen shot refunding warranty charge cancelling order pc said wasn’t enough though exactly info asked needed paper billing statement phone number well seems incredibly shady they’re controlling product actually order cancel without consent well sending people unnecessary nowhere near secure hoop stealing money canceling order along make sense company size “caliber” operate like without phone number customer service rep reached instead everything taken care automated email reply bot discern information it’s specific prose neglected shown given example proper procedure probably isn’t procedure it’s mandatory everything requested horrible company like google amazon biggest world respective trade can’t even give adequate customer service option response let run way accumulate profit growth stepping u customer right given human being shame company people continuing support go back person shopping cut grotesquely operated business life wallet,0.004324378496255037,0.995675621503745,0.19125070106561975,0.2,0.8360879509649963,83.60879509649963,High Trust
