Sil Scarpelli,/users/5eda702638d5466924f052c8,GB,1.0,2020-06-05 16:18:34+00:00,1.0,I ordered something for next-day delivery,"I ordered something for next-day delivery. FOR CLARIFICATION, THE ITEM IS OFFERED AND DELIVERED BY AMAZON.The next day the tracking system shows the courier on my street, after 1hour and a half the status updates to ""delivered;Handed to resident""obviously, i dont have my TV yet, so i reach out to support and they tell me ""maybe it was accidently scanned as delivered, you have to wait 2 additional days to make sure it still arrives""i told them i am going back to work and only have 1 more day, so they told me they would Get back in touch with me and to give them my number>next day, Support #1 never got back in touch with me.same day, message support again, get told the same smick, Luckily i found someone to stay at home to get the delivery which was Promised to get here next day at MAX. also told me they would get back in touch with me next dayNext day again, Support #2 never got back to me, never got my delivery.I message support again, this time i demand them to put me through with their delivery support, 30 mins of arguing they finally put me through and i get told they DID DELIVER, but it seems like they delivered to the wrong address; WHY DID IT TAKE 2 DAYS TO ADMIT THIS.When i tell them to get the idiot that delivered the TV to the wrong address to go back to where he delivered the huge af tv, they said they couldnt promise me they would do that; yet they also tell me the person who got it wouldnt keep it so WTH are they gonna do with my tv??Third and last Support also promised to get back in touch next day, once again GHOSTED me.long story short, AMAZON SUPPORT is completely imcompetent, lies over and over, and their delivery couriers are complete morons. and they are completely unwilling to fix their mistakes.to make matters worse, the TV i ordered is OUT OF STOCK since the day after i delivered, and on top of that the price of it went up by 60Pound, so if i get a refund and try to buy it again it will be at a higher price, and if i want to wait for a replacement it might take months because its out of stock.their couriers are a disgrace, their support is a disgrace, and their awful lies are So Damn Annoying.",2020-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,5.0,2152,410,41,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered something nextday delivery clarification item offered delivered amazonthe next day tracking system show courier street hour half status update deliveredhanded residentobviously dont tv yet reach support tell maybe accidently scanned delivered wait additional day make sure still arrivesi told going back work day told would get back touch give numbernext day support never got back touch mesame day message support get told smick luckily found someone stay home get delivery promised get next day max also told would get back touch next daynext day support never got back never got deliveryi message support time demand put delivery support min arguing finally put get told deliver seems like delivered wrong address take day admit thiswhen tell get idiot delivered tv wrong address go back delivered huge af tv said couldnt promise would yet also tell person got wouldnt keep wth gonna tvthird last support also promised get back touch next day ghosted melong story short amazon support completely imcompetent lie delivery courier complete moron completely unwilling fix mistakesto make matter worse tv ordered stock since day delivered top price went pound get refund try buy higher price want wait replacement might take month stocktheir courier disgrace support disgrace awful lie damn annoying,0.003687088381272533,0.9963129116187275,0.22994952327537857,0.2,0.8441463604644394,84.41463604644393,High Trust
