SandEm Stock,/users/5ed7cf441c2c69e631bab36a,US,1.0,2020-06-03 16:28:37+00:00,2.0,No more Amazon purchases EVER!!,"We purchased five items from Amazon. When we received the box there were only two items in the Box. Of course the tracking information showed all five items had been received which was totally inaccurate. We have done everything humanly possible at this point to correct this issue and get our items returned to us. Amazon will not put you in touch with a live person, they will not read their emails, and they do not allow you to reach out to the vendors and possibly have them intervene. We will never shop Amazon again. They take your money quickly but the customer service is horribly lacking. We went to our bank to get a refund for the items and that was our wake-up call.",2020-06-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,3.0,678,125,31,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased five item amazon received box two item box course tracking information showed five item received totally inaccurate done everything humanly possible point correct issue get item returned u amazon put touch live person read email allow reach vendor possibly intervene never shop amazon take money quickly customer service horribly lacking went bank get refund item wakeup call,0.012675559766653906,0.9873244402333461,0.07010656197420079,0.4,1.107683532511513,110.76835325115131,High Trust
Peter,/users/5ed7b2631c2c696132ba9992,PL,1.0,2020-06-03 14:23:57+00:00,1.0,I do not recommend Amazon !!,"I do not recommend Amazon !!! I advise against buying if you don't have to!Amazon represents the attitude of greed and greed. Only profit counts - at all costs!They do everything so as not to lose their purchase order - that's why they send goods for which they can't collect money. At the same time, they extort additional fees under the guise of not receiving payment for the goods!And they immediately threaten me with debt recovery!It's unfair! If Amazon can't get the amount on my card, why is it sending goods !!! Facing me with only one option - paying extra costs!In addition, I have to analyze the whole situation, wonder what they mean, write to the bank why the download did not take place, write back, get nervous ...I lost a lot of time dealing with this matter. I do not recommend this store.",2020-06-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,3.0,806,145,28,6,0.0,0,12,2,1,Suspicious,recommend amazon advise buying dont toamazon represents attitude greed greed profit count coststhey everything lose purchase order thats send good cant collect money time extort additional fee guise receiving payment goodsand immediately threaten debt recoveryits unfair amazon cant get amount card sending good facing one option paying extra costsin addition analyze whole situation wonder mean write bank download take place write back get nervous lost lot time dealing matter recommend store,0.9999989629048234,1.0370951766258685e-06,0.08132361189007291,0.2,0.3162652409256029,31.626524092560288,Low Trust
