Paolo,/users/5ed7350cc3e29886005ea79b,US,2.0,2020-06-03 05:39:52+00:00,1.0,Been having major issues with Amazon…,"Been having major issues with Amazon and their 2 day Prime membership deliveries. USPS, who are teamed up with Amazon had attempted to deliver my stuff, yet it always fails miserably even though Amazon guarantees the delivery on that exact date. I am not sure why Amazon would lie to me that their “guaranteed delivery” would come that day, yet their membership with USPS has failed twice to deliver my packages so far. They should remove Prime right now if they are failing customer expectations. Amazon customer support also said they cannot help me or make a claim to USPS for as to why the shipment is not delivered even though my package was in the same city as I live, but is not shipping to me. I work all day at an essential business and I cannot go to USPS to pick up my mail even if it is a few miles away, and I also don’t have days off to pick up my package if I could. Unfortunately, Amazon doesn’t want to take responsibility for what happens to my package and just told me to call USPS automated phone, which it couldn’t help me file a claim. I cannot even choose the option to get a refund from Amazon either. I am not paying $12.99 a month to get a delayed shipment and also lack of customer support or even a refund for my package. Huge disappointment right now. If it doesn’t work out due to COVID-19, then don’t implement Prime for people. They’re cheating us out with our money.",2020-06-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,3.0,1399,262,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,major issue amazon day prime membership delivery usps teamed amazon attempted deliver stuff yet always fails miserably even though amazon guarantee delivery exact date sure amazon would lie “guaranteed delivery” would come day yet membership usps failed twice deliver package far remove prime right failing customer expectation amazon customer support also said cannot help make claim usps shipment delivered even though package city live shipping work day essential business cannot go usps pick mail even mile away also don’t day pick package could unfortunately amazon doesn’t want take responsibility happens package told call usps automated phone couldn’t help file claim cannot even choose option get refund amazon either paying month get delayed shipment also lack customer support even refund package huge disappointment right doesn’t work due covid don’t implement prime people they’re cheating u money,0.005364567970879797,0.9946354320291202,0.14694335389792484,0.2,0.8267063867941451,82.67063867941451,High Trust
Margot,/users/5ed6e3b53c5b16ac21878c63,US,1.0,2020-06-02 23:41:55+00:00,1.0,Don’t use amazon pay!,"I used to think Amazon Customer service was great. I bought a rug using amazon pay and even though I had deleted my x bf Amex from amazon pay it proceeded to charge him even though it had my billing address and my shipping address. I immediately had the merchant refund back to his amex and then recharge my Amex. I confirmed with my x that everything was resolved and we confirmed with Amex they received the refund immediately and no dispute was entered. But amazon pay doesn’t care and proceeded without any warning or trying to resolve locked my amazon account. Which also locks all my Alexa accounts including fire stick, Alexa look, Alexa echo. Everything I’m locked out. Even though I have called and emailed 50 times nobody will fix it. Amazon has no phone support and the email is a robot saying due to a dispute we canceled your account. If you give us permission to charge your card we will unlock your account. Really? How many times can I send the same receipts showing that the item was paid for already. My account will have been locked now for 30 days. Come on already!",2020-06-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,2.0,1085,198,21,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,used think amazon customer service great bought rug using amazon pay even though deleted x bf amex amazon pay proceeded charge even though billing address shipping address immediately merchant refund back amex recharge amex confirmed x everything resolved confirmed amex received refund immediately dispute entered amazon pay doesn’t care proceeded without warning trying resolve locked amazon account also lock alexa account including fire stick alexa look alexa echo everything i’m locked even though called emailed time nobody fix amazon phone support email robot saying due dispute canceled account give u permission charge card unlock account really many time send receipt showing item paid already account locked day come already,0.0