Gilbert Downey,/users/5ed6805d09611b77f5904f31,US,3.0,2020-06-02 16:41:30+00:00,1.0,Used to love Amazon,"Sad how bad Amazon has gotten. Their 2 day delivery for Prime is no longer available. It is more like 5-6 days or longer. The company is still charging $140 a year for the service and you know the old television shows and movies aren't worth that.Not to mention the website is overrun with horrible scams from 3rd party sellers like hubcaps.wheels. Amazon knows what is going on and they allow these people to sell these Chinese products to unsuspecting customers.Finally, you have people selling on eBay with their Prime accounts. This is unacceptable and Amazon is a big part of the problem. They'd do anything to made a buck. Very sad company that I want nothing to do with.Can't wait until something better comes along and ruins Bezos and his terrible company.",2020-06-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,2.0,764,133,19,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,sad bad amazon gotten day delivery prime longer available like day longer company still charging year service know old television show movie arent worth thatnot mention website overrun horrible scam rd party seller like hubcapswheels amazon know going allow people sell chinese product unsuspecting customersfinally people selling ebay prime account unacceptable amazon big part problem theyd anything made buck sad company want nothing withcant wait something better come along ruin bezos terrible company,0.01806880427510579,0.9819311957248942,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.805884274250557,80.5884274250557,High Trust
