Justin,/users/5aa1e0554de5666d345167ef,US,2.0,2020-05-26 01:19:16+00:00,1.0,Whats the point of being a prime member…,"Whats the point of being a prime member if nothing you order qualifies? I ordered a page two weeks now and I had a notification saying it was going to be delivered by the past Friday by 8pm. Never showed up and Amazon than said it would be delivered this week by this Friday. So I get a notification today saying it would be here by 8pm. It never showed up, amazon is the worst place to order from. They must think I am an idiot, its being delivered by fed ex and today is memorial day, Amazon may be working but fed ex is not. Good luck contacting Amazon when you have an issue with an order, they route you to an automated messaging that sends out robotic messages no matter what you type on it. Its a shame that a company thats so big who says they are all about their customers don't have time for customer issues. I would have given them zero stars if I could have.",2020-05-26 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,26.0,870,171,40,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,whats point prime member nothing order qualifies ordered page two week notification saying going delivered past friday pm never showed amazon said would delivered week friday get notification today saying would pm never showed amazon worst place order must think idiot delivered fed ex today memorial day amazon may working fed ex good luck contacting amazon issue order route automated messaging sends robotic message matter type shame company thats big say customer dont time customer issue would given zero star could,0.022175663183675386,0.9778243368163246,0.09590577678070668,0.2,0.8080933237643037,80.80933237643036,High Trust
Tyler Stoneski,/users/5ecc535bee8f291b53d9c92f,US,2.0,2020-05-25 23:24:36+00:00,1.0,Would give them 0 stars if i could,"Would give them 0 stars if i could. Amazon let my account get hacked and then  wouldn't let me reset it. They hung up on me cause they didn't want to help me. They also gave out my personal information and now scammers claiming to be from amazon text me all the time. Dumb indiansat the call center don't know what the hell they're doing. When they couldn't help me i asked if i can talk to a manger to get a better answer since they didn't have one and they told me no. Use ebay, don't waste your time unless your ok with all your personal info being givin out to scam artists.",2020-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,25.0,578,114,34,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,would give star could amazon let account get hacked wouldnt let reset hung cause didnt want help also gave personal information scammer claiming amazon text time dumb indiansat call center dont know hell theyre couldnt help asked talk manger get better answer since didnt one told use ebay dont waste time unless ok personal info givin scam artist,0.027549751999336423,0.9724502480006636,0.06393718452047112,0.2,0.799012560904426,79.9012560904426,High Trust
M D,/users/5ecc25e082bffbcf657a190a,US,4.0,2020-05-25 20:09:55+00:00,1.0,Monday may 25th 2020,"Monday may 25th 2020, we had two amazon deliveries today and both did not read the note under delivery to “leave package in beginning of driveway next too American flag” both times they came down the 200foot driveway. The second delivery the amazing guy called me an ass*hole as he was speeding down my driveway because I asked him why he did not read his notes and  came down my driveway instead of leaving the package in the beginning of property/driveway.  Amazon has the “scabs” of delivery people in comparison to fedex and ups!",2020-05-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,25.0,533,94,20,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,monday may th two amazon delivery today read note delivery “leave package beginning driveway next american flag” time came foot driveway second delivery amazing guy called asshole speeding driveway asked read note came driveway instead leaving package beginning propertydriveway amazon “scabs” delivery people comparison fedex ups,0.11949697778821677,0.8805030222117832,0.05272013460459899,0.2,0.7507955380268114,75.07955380268115,High Trust
