Missy Darnell,/users/5ec9db842b4bf60cbe5a28fa,US,2.0,2020-05-24 02:27:26+00:00,1.0,I ordered a bed topper last Saturday…,"I ordered a bed topper last Saturday night. (5/16/20) the details of the order said it would be here the following Friday. However Wednesday came and the product was still showing as not shipped. So I contacted Amazon customer service and  was promised it would, for sure, be here by Friday. Well Friday came and no bed topper. I'm a disabled stay at home mom with severe chronic pain. I have spent this past week in agony as our bed had recently started causing serious pain while sleeping making functioning during the day rather difficult. The following day I recieved an email around 10am telling me the item had been delivered directly to the customer (me). I had not received it. I checked with my apartments office and the front door. Nothing. Contacted customer service and was told that sometimes the drivers scan it delivered accidentally. They advised me the driver was in my area but they had until Monday (memorial day...) to deliver it. When it finally reached me it was brought by my neighbor. Who found it at their door. Around 4PM. This has been a rather frustrating process.",2020-05-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,24.0,1092,191,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered bed topper last saturday night detail order said would following friday however wednesday came product still showing shipped contacted amazon customer service promised would sure friday well friday came bed topper im disabled stay home mom severe chronic pain spent past week agony bed recently started causing serious pain sleeping making functioning day rather difficult following day recieved email around telling item delivered directly customer received checked apartment office front door nothing contacted customer service told sometimes driver scan delivered accidentally advised driver area monday memorial day deliver finally reached brought neighbor found door around pm rather frustrating process,0.007959120717109745,0.9920408792828903,0.1071228266965788,0.2,0.817445004980761,81.7445004980761,High Trust
Eileen M.,/users/5ec9c83bce35a486978a1d03,US,1.0,2020-05-24 01:05:21+00:00,3.0,What's going on with Amazon deliveries lately?,"I ordered two of the exact same sweatshirts from Amazon 2 weeks ago. The only thing different was the color. One of them arrived within four to five days. The other one never arrived although I kept checking the shipment status. I finally got a notification that it was undeliverable as addressed and it was sent to another address. Seriously? It was from the same order, same address, same everything.  How could one get there with no problem and the other one couldn't find its way to my home....so they just sent it back to the ""third party shipper""?  My account was credited, but I question how one part of my order arrived with no problem but for the other part of the order they couldn't find me?",2020-05-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,24.0,702,128,46,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered two exact sweatshirt amazon week ago thing different color one arrived within four five day one never arrived although kept checking shipment status finally got notification undeliverable addressed sent another address seriously order address everything could one get problem one couldnt find way homeso sent back third party shipper account credited question one part order arrived problem part order couldnt find,0.014252537807725733,0.9857474621922743,0.0717891194615816,0.6,1.4072315549884533,140.72315549884533,High Trust
Jason Cantrell,/users/5ec96a1e2b4bf62f495a04d9,US,1.0,2020-05-23 18:23:41+00:00,1.0,No delivery and no refund,"I ordered a part needed to fix my car. It said it would be delivered in 9 days, very long wait but I couldn’t find the part any faster anywhere else. 10 days later it wasn’t delivered or even shipped. I couldn’t take the chance of waiting however long they decided to wait to ship it (1 week? 2 weeks? 6 weeks?) so I called to cancel the order and was told I couldn’t cancel because it’s scheduled to be shipped. They said they have no idea how long that would take but there’s nothing they can do and I’ll just have to wait until it finally gets shipped and then I can refuse the delivery. There’s nothing keeping them from never shipping the item and keeping my money hostage. I will never purchase anything from Amazon again. I have never had any issues even close to this with EBay. I just wish it didn’t cost me $378 to find out that Amazon is a crooked deceitful company.",2020-05-23 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,23.0,877,168,25,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered part needed fix car said would delivered day long wait couldn’t find part faster anywhere else day later wasn’t delivered even shipped couldn’t take chance waiting however long decided wait ship week week week called cancel order told couldn’t cancel it’s scheduled shipped said idea long would take there’s nothing i’ll wait finally get shipped refuse delivery there’s nothing keeping never shipping item keeping money hostage never purchase anything amazon never issue even close ebay wish didn’t cost find amazon crooked deceitful company,0.008166003514287938,0.991833996485712,0.09422321929332586,0.2,0.8147616421015211,81.47616421015212,High Trust
Chris & Heather MacAlpine,/users/5b2074214de5666d34d1bce0,CA,2.0,2020-05-23 18:15:45+00:00,1.0,***BUYER BEWARE***  No Refunds,"Our family are Amazon Prime Members- Amazon does NOT stand behind getting you refunds from they're bad sellers.Spoke to 6 different Amazon reps., each one told me the other rep. didn't follow proper A-Z  complaint/refund process. I requested talking to a manager, and was connected to a woman named Josie.G., as she would not give me her last name. She admitted she could see all the errors and incorrect information the previous amazon reps. had given me. I was basically told, that I had to contact seller myself for a refund and shipping cost. When purchasing items off Amazon, see who the seller is, and order off their website directly, as you'll usually save money.#jeffbezos #amazon #amazonbadcustomerservice #amazonterrible",2020-05-23 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,23.0,731,118,30,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,family amazon prime member amazon stand behind getting refund theyre bad sellersspoke different amazon rep one told rep didnt follow proper az complaintrefund process requested talking manager connected woman named josieg would give last name admitted could see error incorrect information previous amazon rep given basically told contact seller refund shipping cost purchasing item amazon see seller order website directly youll usually save moneyjeffbezos amazon amazonbadcustomerservice amazonterrible,0.012728406071278172,0.9872715939287219,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.80687191586509,80.687191586509,High Trust
