Julia Jager,/users/5ebd72c50eea57e4f29e5ecc,NL,6.0,2020-05-22 14:25:30+00:00,1.0,Thanks for nothing. Amazon: you are welcome!,"I ordered a book, but after 2 months of waiting it never arrived. I was promised by customer service they would resend the book with priority shipping, because it had already taken so long, and that I had nothing to worry about. In the end I didn't hear anything. Had to make contact again, then all of a sudden it wasn't possible what the first customer supporter promised. I stood my ground and in the end they would refund the book ánd give me a gift card to reorder the particular book with priority shipping. I was content and it was worth my time to pursue the issue. Now today, I wanted to reorder the book, but the gift card wasn't registering. Had to contact customer service again. Now I get told it's not a gift card but a promo card and with a promo card you have to order something from Amazon itselve and it's not applicable on other products. So, although it was entirely clear the gift card's intent was to pay for my priority shipping on the same book I didn't get initially, it doesn't do anything for me. I tried to pursue the issue, but I got bounced around the chatroom like it was a sport, just to get rid of me and everytime I had to explain again and again what was going on. The first time around I even got an offer, but she disconnected when I had a question about it.In the end I was rudely spoken to and they didn't want to help me. So I thanked for nothing and they said, you are welcome! Never ordering with Amazon again.",2020-05-22 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,22.0,1452,278,44,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered book month waiting never arrived promised customer service would resend book priority shipping already taken long nothing worry end didnt hear anything make contact sudden wasnt possible first customer supporter promised stood ground end would refund book ánd give gift card reorder particular book priority shipping content worth time