Jessica,/users/5ec73aecee8f2963c0d70721,US,2.0,2020-05-22 02:37:57+00:00,1.0,Amazon has lost my trust.,"I was a very loyal and frequent amazon customer until I got an email yesterday saying my account had been closed! Their reason was that I requested “too many refunds” on things. I responded and explained but apparently they cut you off with no warning or justification. For clarification, I order probably 20+ items per month on Amazon. Sometimes way more. The last 60 days I had 62 orders (for myself, family, school and business etc). Out of these 62 orders, 5 did not turn up. I believe most were orders delivered via usps not amazon directly, but some were amazon. Of these 6 items, there was 4 lost packages, 2 boxes had 2 items each in them. So obviously if my package does not arrive, I am well within my rights to inquire about it. I’m usually told to wait several days/contact seller etc, all of which I do. If it still doesn’t turn up, I ask for a refund or replacement. Expected, right? Well apparently I’m being punished for that. How is it my fault that certain packages never made it to me? I know I’ve seen many delivery drivers throw packages out of their vehicles and not bother to bring them to the door, so perhaps they were carelessly left and stolen. Maybe amazon workers are stealing them. Maybe they’re lost in transit. Who knows. But the point is, I spend a lot of money with Amazon and order 90% of my things through them. If several items go missing and I request the issues be fixed, do I really deserve to have my account closed? This is absurd to me. I have a credit card through them, have paid for prime membership, of which I now cannot access anything (books, movies, as well as the prime shipping etc). I am furious at this company’s lack of consideration for someone who has been an AVID customer for many years. I wish I spent my money elsewhere. Now nobody is responding to my emails. I don’t know what to do about pending orders, about accessing my prime benefits, about my credit card. What a nightmare.",2020-05-22 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,22.0,1942,357,25,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,loyal frequent amazon customer got email yesterday saying account closed reason requested “too many refunds” thing responded explained apparently cut warning justification clarification order probably item per month amazon sometimes way last day order family school business etc order turn believe order delivered via usps amazon directly amazon item lost package box item obviously package arrive well within right inquire i’m usually told wait several dayscontact seller etc still doesn’t turn ask refund replacement expected right well apparently i’m punished fault certain package never made know i’ve seen many delivery driver throw package vehicle bother bring door perhaps carelessly left stolen maybe amazon worker stealing maybe they’re lost transit know point spend lot money amazon order thing several item go missing request issue fixed really deserve account closed absurd credit card paid prime membership cannot access anything book movie well prime shipping etc furious company’s lack consideration someone avid customer many year wish spent money elsewhere nobody responding email don’t know pending order accessing prime benefit credit card nightmare,0.01682064463873276,0.9831793553612672,0.20022434099831743,0.2,0.8316345458802971,83.16345458802971,High Trust
