Dee Gee,/users/5c2587580214996187d825dc,CA,6.0,2020-05-18 22:30:11+00:00,1.0,The latest scoop is that it is…,"The latest scoop is that it is unreasonable to expect delivery drivers:Bring item to door, not throw it over the fence.Walk eight extra steps to leave a parcel out of the street sightline Close and lock the gate that they unlocked and opened to come into the yard…You must include these things in the delivery instructions… apparently if you do not and things go missing that is your fault.  Who knew that training is optional in some professions? Two Women’s Casual Unbalanced Crew Neck Knit Sweater Loose Pullover Cardigans Never received … Was estimated to arrive in January but was delivered in December while I was away. I suspect the delivery driver left it in the front yard instead of bringing it to the door. Likely left the gate open too. The usual.   Amazon did refund this purchase. Bobby Pin and Hair Clip Magnetic Holder: HairpinPal (Sea Foam Teal)I never received the item....delivery driver threw it over the front fence but I use the back where the garage is to come and go . Not the sellers or the products fault but the shady delivery driver. My neighbour told me she had seen someone throw a package over my, since she has been my neighbour for over 35 years, I know her and trust her completely. This was at first denied by the delivery company, but later confirmed when they looked at the “proof of delivery” picture.Never received the product, never reimbursed.And neither review was allowed on amazon... needs to be more product related but I just don't know how to review things that are never received.In fact, when I contacted Amazon about this last order I got a rather nasty and insulting email back from them telling me that there was a lot of returns and complaining from my account and I was at risk of being denied from ordering WOW  The problems with delivery only started when they changed their delivery protocols and the only things I returned were junk made in China garbage — why do they never look in person like they do on the website? Amazing that.Anyway when I was on amazon.ca chat -explaining why I was not impressed with the amazon.com.ca delivery company,  I was instructed that I must include my delivery expectations in the delivery instructions.  Needless to say a company that I once greatly admired and trusted no longer holds my respect.",2020-05-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,18.0,2290,400,31,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,latest scoop unreasonable expect delivery driversbring item door throw fencewalk eight extra step leave parcel street sightline close lock gate unlocked opened come yard…you must include thing delivery instructions… apparently thing go missing fault knew training optional profession two women’s casual unbalanced crew neck knit sweater loose pullover cardigan never received … estimated arrive january delivered december away suspect delivery driver left front yard instead bringing door likely left gate open usual amazon refund purchase bobby pin hair clip magnetic holder hairpinpal sea foam teali never received itemdelivery driver threw front fence use back garage come go seller product fault shady delivery driver neighbour told seen someone throw package since neighbour year know trust completely first denied delivery company later confirmed looked “proof delivery” picturenever received product never reimbursedand neither review allowed amazon need product related dont know review thing never receivedin fact contacted amazon last order got rather nasty insulting email back telling lot return complaining account risk denied ordering wow problem delivery started changed delivery protocol thing returned junk made china garbage — never look person like website amazing thatanyway amazonca chat explaining impressed amazoncomca delivery company instructed must include delivery expectation delivery instruction needless say company greatly admired trusted longer hold respect,0.006194197705429304,0.993805802