Kris R,/users/5ec1a59b24279578954c66ff,CA,2.0,2020-05-17 20:59:13+00:00,1.0,Amazon forbids anyone to review them on…,"Amazon forbids anyone to review them on Glassdoor so I'll share my thoughts here.  I'm a nurse who they wanted to pay barely over minimum wage to work with them, which is laughable.  The company gives you Amazon stock options to preserve cash and to keep people invested in their corporation.  I was given no contract, it was only ""read to me"" by an obnoxious Indian woman.  If you want to hire the best, learn some professionalism.  Additionally, a company who's CEO has deals with the CIA and DOD is one of the most powerful men on the planet.  He can start my paying staff appropriately.  Amazon Ontario only hires South Asians as well, so if you're anything else, forget it.",2020-05-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,17.0,678,121,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon forbids anyone review glassdoor ill share thought im nurse wanted pay barely minimum wage work laughable company give amazon stock option preserve cash keep people invested corporation given contract read obnoxious indian woman want hire best learn professionalism additionally company who ceo deal cia dod one powerful men planet start paying staff appropriately amazon ontario hire south asian well youre anything else forget,0.021750026746631776,0.9782499732533683,0.06786315199102635,0.2,0.8026976170248893,80.26976170248894,High Trust
