Roger Lamb,/users/5429bdfb00006400018d4194,GB,19.0,2020-05-17 20:17:57+00:00,1.0,Amazon’s misleading product description.,"A tin of anti fouling boat paint advertised as 2.5 lts turned out to be only 750mls. I believe that to be mis-representation and also illegal. I tried to post a review which should go back to the seller, but Amazon sent it back because they said it was inappropriate. Amazon make it almost impossible to contact themselves and they are responsible for the incorrect advertising of that particular product. I emailed the seller who firmly put the blame back to Amazon but they remain impossible to contact. I am left with an expensive tin of paint that is not sufficient to complete the job it was bought for and frustrated that Amazon makes it virtually impossible to contact them to rectify the situation.",2020-05-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,17.0,706,124,40,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tin anti fouling boat paint advertised lts turned ml believe misrepresentation also illegal tried post review go back seller amazon sent back said inappropriate amazon make almost impossible contact responsible incorrect advertising particular product emailed seller firmly put blame back amazon remain impossible contact left expensive tin paint sufficient complete job bought frustrated amazon make virtually impossible contact rectify situation,0.05701751490045604,0.942982485099544,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.7854003844454535,78.54003844454535,High Trust
