Mary Malisko,/users/5ec0b576914d19e344832bbf,US,1.0,2020-05-17 03:57:00+00:00,1.0,I am sorry to say that Amazon has just…,"I am sorry to say that Amazon has just lost me aa a customer. I always was able to order from Amazon with ease, now all of a sudden it has become a big deal to order. It won't accept my passcode without verifying my email address. No one seems to be able to help me. One customer service rep had me create a new account & even though i saved my password, it still won't work unless i go to my email & verify email address. Every time I close out of Amazon & check email & get passcode & go back it says invalid.  2nd rep tells me I have to keep the screen open to Amazon. I keep telling them I can't do that & even spoke to a supervisor & he couldn't even help me. Told me there is no other way to log in.Well if this is such a big deal now I'll order from someplace else. I used to love shopping with Amazon, but you just lost me & I told supervisor that & he didn't seem to really care. So much for appreciating your customers! He didn't even attempt to have me place my order over the phone. Bye bye Amazon!!!     Mary Malisko",2020-05-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,17.0,1029,210,39,9,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,sorry say amazon lost aa customer always able order amazon ease sudden become big deal order wont accept passcode without verifying email address one seems able help one customer service rep create new account even though saved password still wont work unless go email verify email address every time close amazon check email get passcode go back say invalid nd rep tell keep screen open amazon keep telling cant even spoke supervisor couldnt even help told way log inwell big deal ill order someplace else used love shopping amazon lost told supervisor didnt seem really care much appreciating customer didnt even attempt place order phone bye bye amazon mary malisko,0.8921190773866575,0.10788092261334248,0.11777902411665732,0.2,0.3774962661300027,37.74962661300027,Low Trust
Christian Miedel,/users/5ebee11737a9ff40936e14e4,US,3.0,2020-05-17 00:44:54+00:00,2.0,I'm torn.,"I'm torn.I've spent close to a hundred thousand dollars on Amazon so as far as my knowledge of the company, I'm very familiar. Well before the pandemic Amazon was, what I would call, a masterpiece of a company.  They said your products would arrive in three days and they did.  Then they said two days...and they did.  You got a bad product, they took it back no questions asked.  They were the reason I claimed all other companies failed.  They did what needed to be done.Then shipping got less reliable.  Returns got harder.  The epitome of beautiful capitalism grew and grew, acquired and aquired and eventually, the model company became what I fear it might have always been: a demon.Bad deals no other company could have ever gotten through, political policies thrust at the population to further their status. Dirty, dirty money followed by regulation to stop competition.  An evil giant hell bent on consuming the planet. Amazon for me now is a love lost.  I can't hate them because I remember when I held them so dearly.  But they are a force so powerful and so dangerous that unless tamed, they have the potential to destroy the world.",2020-05-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,17.0,1144,199,9,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,im tornive spent close hundred thousand dollar amazon far knowledge company im familiar well pandemic amazon would call masterpiece company said product would arrive three day said two daysand got bad product took back question asked reason claimed company failed needed donethen shipping got less reliable return got harder epitome beautiful capitalism grew grew acquired aquired eventually model company became fear might always demonbad deal company could ever gotten political policy thrust population status dirty dirty money followed regulation stop competition evil giant hell bent consuming planet amazon love lost cant hate remember held dearly force powerful dangerous unless tamed potential destroy world,0.019656307611223382,0.9803436923887766,0.11160964666292765,0.4,1.112493775526974,111.2493775526974,High Trust
