haley ratliff,/users/5ec01105914d191a3282f047,US,1.0,2020-05-16 16:13:17+00:00,1.0,Amazon is awful and I hope they see this,"Amazon is awful and I hope they see this. I had used my card for multiple purchases before they randomly told me that I couldn’t use my card anymore, it was coming up as denied for a $10 charge when I have well over $1000 in the bank. So I used a different card finally after arguing with them for a half an hour on the phone and contacting my bank many times. Then they stop taking that card and I buy a vanilla card to finally be able to order the products that I needed for the first product I had bought. Now I have a useless tattoo gun and they have officially taken my account down “temporarily”. I contacted them one last time to talk to a supervisor for her to tell me there was nothing she could do for me. Worst experience using any shopping platform and they have left me with now useless junk and a bad attitude",2020-05-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,16.0,823,162,40,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon awful hope see used card multiple purchase randomly told couldn’t use card anymore coming denied charge well bank used different card finally arguing half hour phone contacting bank many time stop taking card buy vanilla card finally able order product needed first product bought useless tattoo gun officially taken account “temporarily” contacted one last time talk supervisor tell nothing could worst experience using shopping platform left useless junk bad attitude,0.008679466189879501,0.9913205338101205,0.09085810431856421,0.2,0.8138318877687731,81.38318877687732,High Trust
