jordan Perry,/users/5ebff899914d1947b182e075,US,2.0,2020-05-16 14:29:38+00:00,1.0,Would put 0 if possible,"Would put 0 if possible. Office lady did not help what so ever. Amazon lost my shipment in transit (which is understandable) but they gave me an $85.59 promotional certificate. (That i have to use for ""sold and shipped by amazon"") When I tried to use it, it says $5. So contacted customer service and was told it was a mistake and would not resolve the issue. Argued with lady for 15 minutes then she disconnected from me because I was cursing.Also product was only product at the price so had to pay 40 dollars more. When all I wanted was them to send me the same product for the same price for their mistake. I didnt want a refund I didnt want extra money I wanted what I paid for for the price I paid. Email I received below.Hello,I'm sorry to hear about the problem you've had with your BalanceFrom Adjustable Zero Gravity Lounge Chair Recliners for Patio.I've requested a refund for $85.59 USD. This will go through within the next 3-5 business days and will appear as a credit on your billing statement. Please note that this does not include your bank's processing time.I've also issued a $85.59 promotional certificate to your Amazon.com account, which will automatically apply the next time you order an eligible item sold and shipped by Amazon.com. The promotional certificate doesn't apply to items offered by other sellers on the Amazon.com website and won't cover the purchase of gift cards, sales tax, gift wrap, or additional shipping costs.Your promotional balance doesn't appear in Your Account, but will always display at checkout when you place an order through the Shopping Cart for an eligible item shipped and sold by Amazon.If you place a 1-Click order for eligible Kindle books or other digital products sold by Amazon Digital Services, the promotional funds will apply to your order automatically before another payment method is charged. The promotion will not apply to digital game and software download orders from Amazon.For more information about promotional codes, including the terms and conditions of use and what happens when you return an order paid for with a promotional code, gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=201894800I hope this helps. We look forward to seeing you again soon.We'd appreciate your feedback. Please use the buttons below to vote about your experience today.Best regards,Travis R.Amazon.com",2020-05-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,16.0,2348,386,23,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,would put possible office lady help ever amazon lost shipment transit understandable gave promotional certificate use sold shipped amazon tried use say contacted customer service told mistake would resolve issue argued lady minute disconnected cursingalso product product price pay dollar wanted send product price mistake didnt want refund didnt want extra money wanted paid price paid email received belowhelloim sorry hear problem youve balancefrom adjustable zero gravity lounge chair recliner patioive requested refund usd go within next business day appear credit billing statement please note include bank processing timeive also issued promotional certificate amazoncom account automatically apply next time order eligible item sold shipped amazoncom promotional certificate doesnt apply item offered seller amazoncom website wont cover purchase gift card sale tax gift wrap additional shipping costsyour promotional balance doesnt appear account always display checkout place order shopping cart eligible item shipped sold amazonif place click order eligible kindle book digital product sold amazon digital service promotional fund apply order automatically another payment method charged promotion apply digital game software download order amazonfor information promotional code including term condition use happens return order paid promotional code gphelpcustomerdisplayhtmlnodeidi hope help look forward seeing soonwed appreciate feedback please use button vote experience todaybest regardstravis ramazoncom,0.006592472932907306,0.9934075270670927,0.21648906337633203,0.2,0.8400015762088128,84.00015762088128,High Trust
Tracie Lowenstein,/users/5ebfedfac66da3c15d86aae1,US,1.0,2020-05-16 13:44:15+00:00,1.0,Review your delivery policies,I have ordered hemp chews for my 12 year old dog with arthritis in his back for over a year now and they have been a lifesaver for him not having to take harsh steroids that harm his organs. I recently had my other dog develop an allergy to something and I started giving her half a chew twice daily. So I had to  order another bag ahead of time. I got a notification that two bags would be delivered next Wednesday with the normal monthly delivery. I now have to ration the dogs medicine and I am literally losing sleep with an itchy dog scratching all night long because they want to be more efficient with their deliveries rather than trust that customers genuinely need the items that they ordered and aren’t just hoarding! I think this policy should be reviewed for items like medication.,2020-05-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,16.0,793,146,29,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered hemp chew year old dog arthritis back year lifesaver take harsh steroid harm organ recently dog develop allergy something started giving half chew twice daily order another bag ahead time got notification two bag would delivered next wednesday normal monthly delivery ration dog medicine literally losing sleep itchy dog scratching night long want efficient delivery rather trust customer genuinely need item ordered aren’t hoarding think policy reviewed item like medication,0.042099075178704114,0.9579009248212959,0.08188446438586652,0.2,0.7953273552878212,79.53273552878211,High Trust
