y later item longer available order uv lamp nail watt previous one found good claimed cure nail ten second didn’t took roughly three minute per nail previous lamp second max put review amazon appearing selling page review happened another item bought last year wasn’t aware untill noticed pattern happens leave bad review confidence buying look item look review amazon average star find misleading won’t ordering company future,0.017120766032373044,0.982879233967627,0.15703869882220975,0.4,1.1228473567482553,112.28473567482553,High Trust
