Mrs. Santos,/users/5ebeba840eea57c8359f3938,US,1.0,2020-05-15 15:53:42+00:00,1.0,Several time of products lost in transit and never receiving anything.,"I’ve been a prime member for several years now and this past month I’ve been so disappointed. I’ve order things and never received it. After having long conversations and requesting for upper management, never have I received an answer to my question. How can a product I ordered be lost in transit, delivery carrier being Amazon Logistics and they are not able to track down where my product is at? I’ve given the supervisor my phone number so the Amazon fulfillment center can call me and give me an update. But it’s been several hours and no phone call. This has happened to me two other times and I accepted a refund. But this time I’m not settling for a refund. I want answers to my questions. If it’s being delivered from Amazon, why can’t they track down which driver has it. Which employee is stealing these products? It’s so disappointing to see how Amazon is handling these problems and situations. Can’t the CEO see what’s going on to the products that the customers don’t get? Can’t he see that many customers are unhappy with the effortless customer service? I’m seriously thinking of canceling my long time prime membership, if I don’t receive answers to why this is happening. I want trust and be a satisfied customer. If someone from upper management or the CEO is reading this, please do the investigation that is strongly needed. People are not receiving what they have ordered and are unsatisfied.",2020-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,15.0,1416,247,70,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’ve prime member several year past month i’ve disappointed i’ve order thing never received long conversation requesting upper management never received answer question product ordered lost transit delivery carrier amazon logistics able track product i’ve given supervisor phone number amazon fulfillment center call give update it’s several hour phone