dy' company. AMAZON YOU ARE A GREEDY FARCE!",2020-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,15.0,1923,339,41,7,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,placed three separate order one day amazon marketplace unbeknownst amazon lumped together one banking transaction got dispatch one item email stating payment declinedcard perfectly fine nowhere near limit contacted customer servicesno way contact available help hub must explained problem assistant manager requested cancellation one appeared whole amazon though plenty boasted day could could cancel orderasked confirm detail everything back delivery amazon took money bank account two item dispatched another payment declined email contacted customer service repeating issue though supposed screen read past conversation could find way help properly one point told manager would refunded one item even got confirmation email two week later refund receivednow advised confirm card let order auto cancel meantime received two item order cancelled still getting four item worth nearly £ told hour hour spend chat money would refunded nothing one conversation asked az marketplace refund request operative requested incorrectly one item receive got email back seller telling would sending item paid go bank request refund whole payment waiting day amazon cock customer service team havent got clue knew tell stop using bad language stating thought amazon greedy company amazon greedy farce,0.6304050744345343,0.3695949255654657,0.19012899607403252,0.2,0.5228232619975394,52.28232619975394,Medium Trust
