Brian,/users/5ebd65ad0eea570dfa9e51e4,US,3.0,2020-05-14 16:15:21+00:00,3.0,"Amazon, wake up... you have the virus!","Two months ago I would have given them 5 stars. I have been an Amazon Prime member for a couple of years now. I have always loved this company and web site.., and then came covid-19!!! I am not complaining about the slower (much slower) shipping... we all have to adjust to aid each other. What I am talking about is their product line & what they have aided Chinese companies in doing. For instance: I wanted to find “hand sanitizer.”  If you go to the other well-known ‘brick and mortar’ sites you will find it marked, “Out of stock” and there will be no “cheap” substitutes. Amazon owes it to their customers to maintain some quality control. Instead they are stocking many, very many substitutes that did not exist before. Also, they have allowed the price on “junk” to go through the roof. Read the review, the comments on these outrageously priced & newly appearing Chinese made hand sanitizers. It is absolutely nothing but a rip-off. Amazon should start listing items as “sold out” & stop aiding these companies with no quality control in flooding our markets with overpriced garbage. It is Amazon’s good name that will suffer. We expect Amazon to do at least a little policing of the products they sell, and prices that have quadrupled in a month’s time. I hope the Amazon name will mean as much “post” covid-19 as it did “pre” covid-19!!!",2020-05-14 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,14.0,1348,239,38,7,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,two month ago would given star amazon prime member couple year always loved company web site came covid complaining slower much slower shipping adjust aid talking product line aided chinese company instance wanted find “hand sanitizer” go wellknown ‘brick mortar’ site find marked “out stock” “cheap” substitute amazon owes customer maintain quality control instead stocking many many substitute exist also allowed price “junk” go roof read review comment outrageously priced newly appearing chinese made hand sanitizers absolutely nothing ripoff amazon start listing item “sold out” stop aiding company quality control flooding market overpriced garbage amazon’s good name suffer expect amazon least little policing product sell price quadrupled month’s time hope amazon name mean much “post” covid “pre” covid,0.9976491563487593,0.0023508436512407194,0.1340437464946719,0.6,0.9279841711245547,92.79841711245547,High Trust
