Michael Evans,/users/5e8b269bb539f34be8df423b,US,2.0,2020-05-13 15:17:52+00:00,1.0,Do not choose Amazon delivery if you can help it!,"I am writing a review about Amazon shipping, i will never order anything again if it is being shipped by an Amazon delivery driver. The Coronavirus is forcing alot of people to have to buy from the internet to avoid going into stores. I have ordered a few items from Amazon over the past few weeks, 2 out of the 3 times, the shipping was fine right up until the delivery day. The delivery driver just dropped the package off outside my apartment door, and did not even make an attempt to knock on my door. Of course no one wants to take the chance of being face to face with people at their front door, but bare minimum, the driver could knock on my apartment door and take some steps back before i answer the door. I have had $200 items just left at my door when i am HOME, and if it wasnt for the text notification, someone could have walked off with those items. I tracked my delivery today and saw on Amazons site that the driver was only 4 stops away from my place so i expected my stop was coming in the next 10 minutes or so. 20 minutes later i get a text that my item was delivered, i know absolutely FOR SURE that no one was in the hallway at my apartment that could have taken my package and the package never showed up. Amazon Delivery Drivers, if you do not want to do your job and make sure your companies product reaches its customers because you are scared of Coronavirus, then STAY HOME!  Amazon leaves no way to contact them about their own drivers incapability of doing their jobs, and they refused to publish my review on the sellers page. Long story, short. I paid for an item that was probably delivered to another home by a Amazon driver and Amazon is taking no responsibiity for the mistake.",2020-05-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,13.0,1714,326,49,10,1.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,writing review amazon shipping never order anything shipped amazon delivery driver coronavirus forcing alot people buy internet avoid going store ordered item amazon past week time shipping fine right delivery day delivery driver dropped package outside apartment door even make attempt knock door course one want take chance face face people front door bare minimum driver could knock apartment door take step back answer door item left door home wasnt text notification someone could walked item tracked delivery today saw amazon site driver stop away place expected stop coming next minute minute later get text item delivered know absolutely sure one hallway apartment could taken package package never showed amazon delivery driver want job make sure company product reach customer scared coronavirus stay home amazon leaf way contact driver incapability job refused publish review seller page long story short paid item probably delivered another home amazon driver amazon taking responsibiity mistake,0.03453960920000757,0.9654603907999925,0.18283791362871565,0.2,0.8192977781257393,81.92977781257393,High Trust
R M,/users/5eb9b6ac242795e8d647a24a,US,3.0,2020-05-11 20:33:55+00:00,1.0,Amazon delivery problem - again,"I want to say, everytime I purchase something that is ""fulfilled' by Amazon; I have an issue. It is always the driver delivering it to the wrong address or not following the delivery instructions I provide.When it happens, customer service is usually good about it. Not this time.I received notice that my item was next to be delivered. About 10 minutes later, I received notice that it was delivered. The picture showed a rug outside the door it was left by. I do not have a rig by my door. I tried to call customer service and was told no one is answering due to the pandemic. I then got online and started chatting with a customer service rep. This was all within 5 minutes of the delivery notice. I asked them to have the driver come back, get the package and deliver it to the right address. The rep said it was scanned and marked as delivered by accident. I said, I suppose the app telling me I am the next stop, the package being placed in front of a door, the order marked as delivered and a picture being taken is all an accident as well? The rep said it was. Again, I asked for the driver to come back and deliver the package to me. The rep asked me to wait until tomorrow for delivery, despite me telling her several times it was already delivered. She continued to argue until I finally asked for my money back. My chat was transferred 2 times to a different rep. The 3rd one finally said he issued a refund. We shall see.",2020-05-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,11.0,1434,272,31,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,want say everytime purchase something fulfilled amazon issue always driver delivering wrong address following delivery instruction providewhen happens customer service usually good timei received notice item next delivered minute later received notice delivered picture showed rug outside door left rig door tried call customer service told one answering due pandemic got online started chatting customer service rep within minute delivery notice asked driver come back get package deliver right address rep said scanned marked delivered accident said suppose app telling next stop package placed front door order marked delivered picture taken accident well rep said asked driver come back deliver package rep asked wait tomorrow delivery despite telling several time already delivered continued argue finally asked money back chat transferred time different rep rd one finally said issued refund shall see,0.008783694175230672,0.9912163058247694,0.1525518788558609,0.2,0.8261185286835568,82.61185286835568,High Trust
