ReeRee Rooiz,/users/5ea4d6de949c72815b560904,US,1.0,2020-05-09 12:26:57+00:00,1.0,Amazon has become the worst online,"Amazon has become the worst online company to purchase from and has treated their customers poorly. Don’t get me started on customer service support. I ordered an item in March and was given the run around from oh it’s going to ship tomorrow, to oh we don’t have your size (which they clearly did as stated in their email response to one of my several attempts to contact them). As it became abundantly clear I was never going to receive my order, I cancelled it. Then as I tried to leave a customer review on the company/product (similar to this one), Amazon said my review could not be posted because I did not follow the Amazon review guidelines! Huge joke... let them give their customers the run around, yet don’t give a true experience on an order. I started ordering from other online retailers and have had no issues others than a slighter increase in price on certain items. Won’t be ordering from Amazon anytime soon!",2020-05-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,9.0,927,166,34,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon become worst online company purchase treated customer poorly don’t get started customer service support ordered item march given run around oh it’s going ship tomorrow oh don’t size clearly stated email response one several attempt contact became abundantly clear never going receive order cancelled tried leave customer review companyproduct similar one amazon said review could posted follow amazon review guideline huge joke let give customer run around yet don’t give true experience order started ordering online retailer issue others slighter increase price certain item won’t ordering amazon anytime soon,0.21596258050151068,0.7840374194984894,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.7106390126095925,71.06390126095926,Medium Trust
