Stephen Melnick,/users/5eb531cccdab042b94b3e2a2,AT,1.0,2020-05-08 10:18:51+00:00,1.0,Amazon was charging me twice for being a Prime Member…,Amazon was charging me twice for being a prime member. One of the billings was for a country I did not live in. The Amazon representative canceled my Prime Account in the country I live in and kept the Amazon Prime where I do not live and have not been in a few years. I used to order a few hundred dollars a month of products but I will cut down. There was a period a while back where i was sent used products and broken products. I am much more selective now. There still are many products which I buy on Amazon but am very careful to read the reviews. You would think that a customer who orders a couple hundred dollars a month of product would not be charged twice for a service as simple as Amazon Prime,2020-05-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,8.0,708,140,54,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon charging twice prime member one billing country live amazon representative canceled prime account country live kept amazon prime live year used order hundred dollar month product cut period back sent used product broken product much selective still many product buy amazon careful read review would think customer order couple hundred dollar month product would charged twice service simple amazon prime,0.01729555928234407,0.982704440717656,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.8070560902410489,80.70560902410489,High Trust
