Kelly Witcher,/users/5eb4099717f2af5e70776cee,US,2.0,2020-05-07 13:14:14+00:00,2.0,Get it together!,"A couple of weeks ago, I purchased a shirt for my husband. The money was taken off the day that it was ordered. Okay, no problem! However, I also ordered 3 other different items. It took a week to try to take the money off. It should not take that long. I don't like to order from a company that takes money a week later. I prefer money withdrawal the date prior to placement of an order. Get your business together Amazon!",2020-05-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,7.0,423,82,16,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,couple week ago purchased shirt husband money taken day ordered okay problem however also ordered different item took week try take money take long dont like order company take money week later prefer money withdrawal date prior placement order get business together amazon,0.22615739123813047,0.7738426087618695,0.045989904655075714,0.4,0.9961192853119498,99.61192853119498,High Trust
Kamila Beblot,/users/5e8b3ba0ebf8a95d831e36ee,IE,2.0,2020-05-07 10:57:23+00:00,3.0,I use amazon for years now but this was out of order,"I use amazon for years now and never had any issues, I always found customer service very good. However this time everything changed. I ordered a little balance bike for my sons birthday specifically. Was waiting for over a week for it to be dispatched but noticed nothing was happening. I contacted amazon to check up on it the day beforw it was due to arrive and they send me an email that my order was cancelled due to stock availability. When I ordered the bike it was in stock so how can they sell items that are not in stock?!!  Also if there was an issue like that that could of informed me so I could shop elsewhere. If it wasn’t me chasing them I don’t even know if they would of let me know at all!!! I contacted them again and it didn’t feel like they cared at all. I do understand current circumstances but you just can’t put smth out for sale when it’s not in stock?!?! Now I ended up having no gift for my sons birthday. Never was So disappointed tbh. It sucks.",2020-05-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,7.0,975,188,52,12,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,use amazon year never issue always found customer service good however time everything changed ordered little balance bike son birthday specifically waiting week dispatched noticed nothing happening contacted amazon check day beforw due arrive send email order cancelled due stock availability ordered bike stock sell item stock also issue like could informed could shop elsewhere wasn’t chasing don’t even know would let know contacted didn’t feel like cared understand current circumstance can’t put smth sale it’s stock ended gift son birthday never disappointed tbh suck,0.9951454164597657,0.00485458354023427,0.10544026920919798,0.6,0.9235153456119567,92.35153456119566,High Trust
Joanna Herrera,/users/5eb3bd2317f2af293b772904,US,1.0,2020-05-07 07:48:23+00:00,1.0,Amazon customer service used to be…,Amazon customer service used to be great. I used to love Amazon but it seriously sucks now. I dropped an item off at UPS on March 7th and waited for my refund. April 21st rolled by and nothing no refund more than a month. Contacted Amazon and basically they told me to F off they could not do anything to contact UPS. I did that and UPA routed the item back to me as undeliverable asked Amazon for a new label and their response they could do anything about it. It just sucks buy elsewhere. The items they sell are shotty and low quality. Never using Amazon again.,2020-05-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,7.0,564,108,35,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service used great used love amazon seriously suck dropped item ups march th waited refund april st rolled nothing refund month contacted amazon basically told f could anything contact ups upa routed item back undeliverable asked amazon new label response could anything suck buy elsewhere item sell shotty low quality never using amazon,0.014567259364584733,0.9854327406354153,0.06057206954570948,0.2,0.8048307842268495,80.48307842268495,High Trust
AD M,/users/5eb3b41917f2afaf2d7721f1,US,1.0,2020-05-07 07:09:29+00:00,1.0,I use to love shopping at Amazon but…,"I use to love shopping at Amazon but lately I haven’t been getting things I ordered like masks. The items will say that it’s shipped and the money is deducted from my card but after the supposedly arrival date nothing shows up , then it says my package is lost. I’ve tried the online chat& emails and was told I’ll be refunded for these items. It’s weeks later and still no refund and nobody to talk to. This is ridiculous and bad customer service. If they can’t send my product, please refund my money. It’s not right to do customers this way. I’m very disappointed in the poor service & nobody trying to solve it.",2020-05-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,7.0,615,115,37,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,use love shopping amazon lately haven’t getting thing ordered like mask item say it’s shipped money deducted card supposedly arrival date nothing show say package lost i’ve tried online chat email told i’ll refunded item it’s week later still refund nobody talk ridiculous bad customer service can’t send product please refund money it’s right customer way i’m disappointed poor service nobody trying solve,0.015853332796874682,0.9841466672031253,0.06449803701626472,0.2,0.8049729410048155,80.49729410048155,High Trust
Denise Valerio,/users/5eb398bfc66da361097f3436,US,1.0,2020-05-07 05:12:46+00:00,3.0,Just 😔 wondering...,"I have been a customer of amazon.com for a long time. I am overall satisfied with its services. However, when I share my reviews, only the positive ones get posted. Also, lately, as much as l would like to be understanding of the special circumstances of the pandemic and the confusion it has created, i find myself more inconvenienced than what it is reasonable, from my perspective. When ordering supplies; whether because of unavailability of it, or at times showing available items on the site, yet not been able to order them. For one reason or another not been able to place items in the ""cart."" I have tried to reach customer service to place the order, when in real need of an item. Customer Service has had a recording which states it is also unavailable? Is there something going on I am not getting? I wish I could stick to this site...but it's been kind of challenging to do so. Hope it can improve and that it is just a temporary situation. Thanks. Denise.",2020-05-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,7.0,969,175,19,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer amazoncom long time overall satisfied service however share review positive one get posted also lately much l would like understanding special circumstance pandemic confusion created find inconvenienced reasonable perspective ordering supply whether unavailability time showing available item site yet able order one reason another able place item cart tried reach customer service place order real need item customer service recording state also unavailable something going getting wish could stick sitebut kind challenging hope improve temporary situation thanks denise,0.011572289597354573,0.9884277104026454,0.0981491867638811,0.6,1.4138436925540987,141.38436925540987,High Trust
