Bri Alvarez,/users/5ead04f36727728d4bdd085e,US,1.0,2020-05-07 01:33:45+00:00,1.0,Amazon flagged my account for fraud after I used a gift card from Christmas,"My job gave Amazon gift cards for Christmas. I used my gift card and my account was flagged for fraud. I emailed them a receipt of gift card with all the information they asked for. This was in January; it is May now and my account is still locked. No one has reached out to me. I call them periodically to see if there has been any progress and they always say we will review your account and get back to you. I am not only offended that after numerous information provided to them they still have not figured it out, but that they have no consideration for customers. They are dragging their feet on something simple. I’m yet to be contacted by a supervisor. Terrible customer service.",2020-05-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,7.0,687,128,75,14,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,job gave amazon gift card christmas used gift card account flagged fraud emailed receipt gift card information asked january may account still locked one reached call periodically see progress always say review account get back offended numerous information provided still figured consideration customer dragging foot something simple i’m yet contacted supervisor terrible customer service,0.009743868991727404,0.9902561310082726,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.8094858893964526,80.94858893964526,High Trust
