p3r4 k0j07,/users/5eb1ab4c13f56f942ffaef1e,RS,3.0,2020-05-05 18:48:18+00:00,1.0,Classic corporate waste!,"Classic corporate waste!I don't have a bank account, so I decided to accept a $25 gift card in exchange for my services, with the idea of later exchanging it for Bitcon through purse.io.. I redeemed the card about a month ago, no problems, $25 added to my account balance. So over the coming weeks I accepted 3 more cards, $25 each, each redeemed successfully, giving me a total balance of $100. No communication from amazon about any issues.Yesterday I make my first earn transaction through purse.io for $26.99 and my account is immediately suspended and I'm asked to provide a purchase receipt for the gift cards. I explain the same as above, and my account is now closed and $100 balance gone. So it's a gift card, that you have to gift to yourself. If you didn't buy it yourself then you have to ask the person who gave you the card for proof of payment. Imagine that! Someone, God forbid, gives it to you as a gift, they have to include a receipt of purchase and probably an affidavit too, just in case.That's real convenient. Or maybe that's just the special treatment peasants from 3rd world countries get.CORPORATE WASTE !!!",2020-05-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,5.0,1133,201,24,3,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,classic corporate wastei dont bank account decided accept gift card exchange service idea later exchanging bitcon purseio redeemed card month ago problem added account balance coming week accepted card redeemed successfully giving total balance communication amazon issuesyesterday make first earn transaction purseio account immediately suspended im asked provide purchase receipt gift card explain account closed balance gone gift card gift didnt buy ask person gave card proof payment imagine someone god forbid give gift include receipt purchase probably affidavit casethats real convenient maybe thats special treatment peasant rd world country getcorporate waste,0.9753049240866929,0.024695075913307107,0.11273135165451487,0.2,0.3348938082875565,33.48938082875565,Low Trust
Darin Cox (Kahless),/users/5eb1a168cf143717a3977433,US,1.0,2020-05-05 17:25:04+00:00,1.0,Customer service is horrible,"Customer service is horrible.  My account got locked because my daughter tried to order something for a friend and didn't know she can't do that.  Now I'm unable to reach anyone that can help.  The phone number that I found isn't being answered.  The Chat line is useless.  They even eventually had someone call me, but it's the same BS.  They just keep saying that someone will contact me via email.  They have sent me two emails regarding the situation but both said the exact same thing.  I responded to both, but I seem to be stuck in an automation loop and a person isn't actually reading my response.  When I use Chat again, they just tell me someone will get back to me in 24 hours.  I've paid for Prime almost since it's inception.  I now cannot access my account for anything.",2020-05-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,5.0,785,143,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer service horrible account got locked daughter tried order something friend didnt know cant im unable reach anyone help phone number found isnt answered chat line useless even eventually someone call b keep saying someone contact via email sent two email regarding situation said exact thing responded seem stuck automation loop person isnt actually reading response use chat tell someone get back hour ive paid prime almost since inception cannot access account anything,0.019427749593610977,0.9805722504063891,0.08020190689848569,0.2,0.8063265065828916,80.63265065828917,High Trust
