Monica Santillana,/users/5eb19440cf1437745a976964,US,1.0,2020-05-05 16:29:01+00:00,1.0,No Customer Service at all!,"I’m given 1 star because I can’t give it 0. It’s unbelievable Amazon at this point doesn’t have any representative available for questions or concerns regarding the orders.  I know we are living difficult times but a company as Amazon should be more careful about its customers. I don’t know how can I get help to fix the issues. I tried calling and the chat but I didn’t get help. I decided to tell my story because my experience could help to somebody else. If you are going to buy something in Amazon, think about it twice or three times before you do it. On last Sunday I made a purchase of 2 items; unfortunately 20 min later, my husband came home with no good news and I realized I shouldn’t expend the money in those purchases, then I tried to cancel the orders. It’s funny how fast according with the sellers, those orders were already shipped (really?... On Sunday? And why? If they weren’t an essential items) and the money was instantly taken from my bank account. The only option I saw was to return the item (Non sense! I’m supposed to have the option to cancel the purchase!), any way I filled it out the form and I explained in a message everything about my situation (keep in mind! 30 minutes after I made the order). I received a confirmation from one of the sellers saying my return was approved, obvious I thought my refund will be ready in the next week and they won’t send the item. For my surprise today I received the item and now I have to print out the slip for the return. At this point I’m out of ink on my printer and libraries are closed, so I have no idea what I’m gonna do and no! No money to buy the ink. Oh! other surprise... on my account now I have a pending charge of $9 for restocking. For the other item I haven’t received any response, the seller is supposed to answer today and if they don’t do it, I have to fill another form. Obvious I had to do the same return process, filling out the form instead of cancel the order (cause they don’t give that option) and I sent 2 messages explaining about my situation, but so far my money is not in my bank account and I need it. It’s frustrating! Where’s the Amazon’s Customer’s Service? Why there is no representatives trying to help customers? Unbelievable!",2020-05-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,5.0,2242,420,27,5,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,i’m given star can’t give it’s unbelievable amazon point doesn’t representative available question concern regarding order know living difficult time company amazon careful customer don’t know get help fix issue tried calling chat didn’t get help decided tell story experience could help somebody else going buy something amazon think twice three time last sunday made purchase item unfortunately min later husband came home good news realized shouldn’t expend money purchase tried cancel order it’s funny fast according seller order already shipped really sunday weren’t essential item money instantly taken bank account option saw return item non sense i’m supposed option cancel purchase way filled form explained message everything situation keep mind minute made order received confirmation one seller saying return approved obvious thought refund ready next week won’t send item surprise today received item print slip return point i’m ink printer library closed idea i’m gonna money buy ink oh surprise account pending charge restocking item haven’t received response seller supposed answer today don’t fill another form obvious return process filling form instead cancel order cause don’t give option sent message explaining situation far money bank account need it’s frustrating where’s amazon’s customer’s service representative trying help customer unbelievable,0.997686538776237,0.0023134612237629693,0.23555804823331464,0.2,0.3482683402585444,34.82683402585444,Low Trust
