Telacare,/users/5e6d2caf062aad7a6ec6831d,US,5.0,2020-05-03 23:46:56+00:00,1.0,Poor Service & Bad Support,"Poor service, wrong items shipped and not honoring prime membership. When I went to cancel my membership the first thing they said is, “you saved over $250 in shipping this year. You will lose free same day shipping, 2 day prime and special deals.” Yet, I get non of that right now this year at all. Then when my order that took two weeks to get here was wrong again, I am told to ship back and wait two weeks again. Then, I have to wait 4 weeks for a refund. Not sure how I should be expected to pay for this lack of service. When I message their support he says “Do what you have too.” He doesn’t even care either and why should he? I’m just a customer who orders thousands a year. Walmart is happy to take my business.",2020-05-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,3.0,721,142,26,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,poor service wrong item shipped honoring prime membership went cancel membership first thing said “you saved shipping year lose free day shipping day prime special deals” yet get non right year order took two week get wrong told ship back wait two week wait week refund sure expected pay lack service message support say “do too” doesn’t even care either i’m customer order thousand year walmart happy take business,0.020328934487057547,0.9796710655129425,0.07964105440269209,0.2,0.8057637436370096,80.57637436370096,High Trust
Muffy,/users/5eacb41c46f4d03f93f87bc1,US,1.0,2020-05-03 21:57:10+00:00,1.0,ZERO buyer protection!,"2 items purchased march 13th, sellers non responsive! no replays at all, No tracking! I simply want a refund! Customer service non existentthey credited me 4.61 shipping Excuse me wheres the other 34.00! Then I go into my amazon chargethey are charging me this money instead of giving me a credit. Are you kidding me Your only option of a dispute is to fax documents. Or use a live chat they will open a claim, but give them 2 weeks? I now have to dispute 2 items I didnt recieve, now dispute a debit that should've been a credit. I cancelled amazon prime immediately, paid my account in full, I'll stick with ebay! I sent each seller 8 messages asking for for a refund, nothing. It's been a horrible experience I'm new to Amazon. I'm out!!",2020-05-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,3.0,740,136,22,3,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,item purchased march th seller non responsive replay tracking simply want refund customer service non existentthey credited shipping excuse wheres go amazon chargethey charging money instead giving credit kidding option dispute fax document use live chat open claim give week dispute item didnt recieve dispute debit shouldve credit cancelled amazon prime immediately paid account full ill stick ebay sent seller message asking refund nothing horrible experience im new amazon im,0.9993048974204298,0.0006951025795701726,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.3156027391753712,31.560273917537117,Low Trust
