Kristen Oakley,/users/5eadf2f167277286c9dd90a3,US,1.0,2020-05-02 22:23:54+00:00,1.0,Misleading advertisements,"This review is regarding Amazon and their misleading advertisements, which this is hardly the first time they have been accused of such and likely not the last settlement they have to pay out due to misleading statements. During the wake of our current pandemic they choose to keep profits high by making unachievable promises to unsuspecting customers regarding their shipping policies. I also a fool agreed to sign up with Amazon prime and pay 119$ a year for this two day shipping reward. As I checkout excited at the decision I made only to discover I will be lucky to receive my shipment in 3 weeks. Upon inquiring with a customer service representative they chose to guilt me as of why I expect my shipment as previously promised to me two minutes prior when they are too busy sending out medical equipment for healthcare professionals. Of course we all understand the need and importance of medical equipment at a time like this, but why are you tricking people into signing up if you know that you aren't able to supply what is promised. Of course her response was, ""well just cancel your order then."" Which of course can be done, but it's the principal of it all and their willingness to profit off of the unsuspecting and unaware. We all know how this works, no one remember to cancel in time or they are elderly or disabled and unsure of the process. Now they are not even required to supply what is advertised. Most would be understanding had they been truthful at the start, but to fabricate and make false statements and to guilt customers for asking for what was just offered to them is bad business in itself. Now had I signed up a year ago and there was no way of predicting the outcome of what could happen it would be reasonable, but covid 19 has been present and affecting all for months now. If you can't supply as promised then take the advertisement down instead of continuing to mislead consumers. Of course our star customer service members response was now, ""I don't know why they haven't took down the advertisement yet, they are probably busy with all this covid stuff."" My....how I should chose my words wisely....as if removing a single line of advertisement will take months to do. While they are so busy saving the world from Covid 19. Thank you Amazon. I got a laugh at least, even if I didn't get my shipment. Until next time, which will be sooner than you think.",2020-05-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,2.0,2397,429,25,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,review regarding amazon misleading advertisement hardly first time accused likely last settlement pay due misleading statement wake current pandemic choose keep profit high making unachievable promise unsuspecting customer regarding shipping policy also fool agreed sign amazon prime pay year two day shipping reward checkout excited decision made discover lucky receive shipment week upon inquiring customer service representative chose guilt expect shipment previously promised two minute prior busy sending medical equipment healthcare professional course understand need importance medical equipment time like tricking people signing know arent able supply promised course response well cancel order course done principal willingness profit unsuspecting unaware know work one remember cancel time elderly disabled unsure process even required supply advertised would understanding truthful start fabricate make false statement guilt customer asking offered bad business signed year ago way predicting outcome could happen would reasonable covid present affecting month cant supply promised take advertisement instead continuing mislead consumer course star customer service member response dont know havent took advertisement yet probably busy covid stuff myhow chose word wiselyas removing single line advertisement take month busy saving world covid thank amazon got laugh least even didnt get shipment next time sooner think,0.018722365125326525,0.9812776348746735,0.2406057206954571,0.2,0.8387599615764281,83.8759961576428,High Trust
