Medical life,/users/5eac23f15448529ba31e4ea1,US,2.0,2020-05-01 16:30:27+00:00,1.0,Was double charged for my items,"Was double charged for my items. I did order 8 things from Amazon which I’ve never done. I did get a refund for the things that were double charged. But getting an answer from someone was almost impossible. I had five different people “help” me. I use help loosely because they weren’t really answering my question. The sixth person finally helped me. It’s unacceptable to be double charging customers. My items ended up shipping out earlier. I was told they don’t charge until item(s) ship. Well they also charge when it ships early plus they get you again when the original shipping date comes around. And yes I got my refund from my bank but still. And on top of that I ordered a new kindle within my order since my nook broke and they charged me two different amounts. The bigger amount was refund. But the experience to get an answer, plus being double charged was highly unacceptable, unprofessional, and absolutely ridiculous. Been an Amazon member for about 5 years roughly never had these kind of issues before. Not sure if I want to order from amazon again. Ordering 8 things from Amazon isn’t a good idea I learned. I needed a new wallet, a new kindle plus the case and charger, a new electric toothbrush. And I ordered 4 other things that I’ve been eating for a long time. Which I regret ordering all at once because Amazon messed with my money and charged me way way too much. I basically paid for 16 items when I ordered 8.",2020-05-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,1.0,1437,261,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,double charged item order thing amazon i’ve never done get refund thing double charged getting answer someone almost impossible five different people “help” use help loosely weren’t really answering question sixth person finally helped it’s unacceptable double charging customer item ended shipping earlier told don’t charge item ship well also charge ship early plus get