Mary Epright,/users/5eaac25a54485208a71d70c3,US,1.0,2020-04-30 12:23:17+00:00,1.0,"Was a loyal Amazon member, no more...","I am now finished with Amazon.  I have been a prime member for years, back when it only cost $25! Over time the customer service has slipped but now I have just had enough. I understand the pandemic but be honest! If I order something from Amazon I should only have to deal with Amazon to get a problem resolved. I ordered something that when it arrived was not what it was supposed to be. I returned, as per Amazons instructions but they said I needed to deal with the seller to get my refund - want to guess where the seller is...China and I'm in U.S. Yep a month now and no refund.  Then I order something that is supposed to be two day delivery, 10 days later it is now supposed to come after I leave my current location, there is no phone support so I use chat, he tells me I have to contact the carrier myself and when they get the package back they will process my refund. What the..? Of course he also told me I needed to understand that with Covid19 there are so many restrictions, etc.  I have dealt with several businesses large and small during the pandemic and the only one that does not have phone customer support or the ability to help is Amazon. Maybe they should stop advertising delivery times if they can't meet the commitment and if I have to deal with sellers and carriers myself why should I go through Amazon in the first place... I'm done, it used to be convienent, I've learned my lesson. I'll stick with local stores or deal with sellers directly to begin with. Amazon is the only business I have dealt with in the past 60 days that is blaming Covid 19 for their poor customer support.",2020-04-30 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,30.0,1612,305,37,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,finished amazon prime member year back cost time customer service slipped enough understand pandemic honest order something amazon deal amazon get problem resolved ordered something arrived supposed returned per amazon instruction said needed deal seller get refund want guess seller ischina im u yep month refund order something supposed two day delivery day later supposed come leave current location phone support use chat tell contact carrier get package back process refund course also told needed understand covid many restriction etc dealt several business large small pandemic one phone customer support ability help amazon maybe stop advertising delivery time cant meet commitment deal seller carrier go amazon first place im done used convienent ive learned lesson ill stick local store deal seller directly begin amazon business dealt past day blaming covid poor customer support,0.030096824684506984,0.969903175315493,0.17106001121704992,0.2,0.8191635899011565,81.91635899011564,High Trust
