Sharon Love,/users/5ea8e39dada65c286f0c26e7,US,1.0,2020-04-29 02:27:43+00:00,1.0,Hell to delete your credit card info from Amazon's website.,"Amazon's website do not let you cancel trial prime subscriptions.  The website will say that you do not have a subscription so therefore you can not cancel something that you do not have..  Next, Amazon will charge any credit card that they have access to for you failing to cancel your subscription.  But remember, the website is huge and after a long search I realized that there is no way to cancel a 30 day subscription.  Amazon will amazingly find a way to get a credit card number for you and charge it.  Lucky for me, they found an old card that had expired and my bank denied the charge.  Amazon is a greedy company and will scam you for all the money it can get.  You also cannot find old credit card information to delete it.  Amazon will hide info to keep charging you.",2020-04-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,29.0,780,145,59,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon website let cancel trial prime subscription website say subscription therefore cancel something next amazon charge credit card access failing cancel subscription remember website huge long search realized way cancel day subscription amazon amazingly find way get credit card number charge lucky found old card expired bank denied charge amazon greedy company scam money get also cannot find old credit card information delete amazon hide info keep charging,0.022842184188516326,0.9771578158114836,0.08132361189007291,0.2,0.8048436302837564,80.48436302837564,High Trust
Formally a Loyal Amazon Customer,/users/5ea8cc2db61f5a4324e1ec3d,US,1.0,2020-04-29 00:37:30+00:00,1.0,BEWARE OF SCAM ATTEMPTS BETWEEN AMAZON…,"BEWARE OF SCAM ATTEMPTS BETWEEN AMAZON AND THE SHIPPER NONSTOP DELIVERY INC /417-EXPRESSWe purchased the 2 kayak set. Amazon took our money and by the time 417 Express (the shipper) came to deliver the kayaks, the truck showed up with one kayak. I told the driver and his helper they are missing a kayak....I ordered a pair of them.  they told me another would be on the way next week although the freight receipt showed 1 kayak to be delivered. It was made clear to the shipper that we ordered a pair of them. I called the shipper and they told I would to have to call Amazon and have them make a Freight Bill number on the second kayak in order to have them deliver it since it was in the shipping warehouse. I shouldn’t have to call Amazon. We bought 2 kayaks, they should of delivered 2 kayaks. I attempt to call Amazon and of course, it is not possible to talk to a human about this problem. I then contacted the shipper and the shipper (2nd contact) told me there is no indication of a 2nd kayak in their system and no second kayak in their warehouse. This is a bunch of bunk on behalf of Amazon and NDI/ 417 Express. Amazon / NDI made no attempts to right the wrongs they committed to loyal customers like us. The shipping company blaming Amazon and Amazon blaming the shipping company is completely unacceptable to us.  We immediately requested a full refund of our purchase and demanded they pick up this kayak they delivered here at their cost. I will be completing google reviews and any reviews in any forums in regards to the purchase of kayaks from Amazon. Considering that Summertime is coming, all of my friends and family who ask me about ordering Kayaks from Amazon will be highly discouraged from doing so. Y’all attempted to rip off of wrong people!",2020-04-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,29.0,1769,324,39,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,beware scam attempt amazon shipper nonstop delivery inc expresswe purchased kayak set amazon took money time express shipper came deliver kayak truck showed one kayak told driver helper missing kayaki ordered pair told another would way next week although freight receipt showed kayak delivered made clear shipper ordered pair called shipper told would call amazon make freight bill number second kayak order deliver since shipping warehouse shouldn’t call amazon bought kayak delivered kayak attempt call amazon course possible talk human problem contacted shipper shipper nd contact told indication nd kayak system second kayak warehouse bunch bunk behalf amazon ndi express amazon ndi made attempt right wrong committed loyal customer like u shipping company blaming amazon amazon blaming shipping company completely unacceptable u immediately requested full refund purchase demanded pick kayak delivered cost completing google review review forum regard purchase kayak amazon considering summertime coming friend family ask ordering kayak amazon highly discouraged y’all attempted rip wrong people,0.11192402551929714,0.8880759744807029,0.18171620863712842,0.2,0.7803812289677771,78.03812289677771,High Trust
