Talitha Mcfadden James',/users/5ea87c81ada65c2f080bf487,US,1.0,2020-05-12 19:15:00+00:00,1.0,It has become obvious during this…,"It has become obvious during this covid-19 that Amazon is clearly unable to handle pressure. The need for Amazon was high but instead of Amazon showing their ability to meet many needs at once they've kept people from becoming prime members, while cancelling a great deal of current prime members such as myself. As I call to sort this matter out, nothing but a recording greets me and then hangs up. While many other prime members wait months to receive items that were supposed to be delivered within the two day mark. Completely unacceptable for a corporation that has been around for so long and has gained millions from the very same people they are now letting down. In my experience businesses are only deemed reliable if they are able to remain resilient through hardship and difficulties but unfortunately Amazon you all have proved this is impossible for you.😢 I get it everyone is trying to figure this thing out but your business blooms when you have put a plan together to prevent the customers from feeling the pain of the situation by rendering poor service. I do not typically write reviews but I have been compelled to make my voice heard. I hope you all realize another way to handle this in a way to prevent the customers from believing you've cracked under pressure....",2020-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,5.0,12.0,1289,225,34,6,14.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,become obvious covid amazon clearly unable handle pressure need amazon high instead amazon showing ability meet many need theyve kept people becoming prime member cancelling great deal current prime member call sort matter nothing recording greets hang many prime member wait month receive item supposed delivered within two day mark completely unacceptable corporation around long gained million people letting experience business deemed reliable able remain resilient hardship difficulty unfortunately amazon proved impossible you😢 get everyone trying figure thing business bloom put plan together prevent customer feeling pain situation rendering poor service typically write review compelled make voice heard hope realize another way handle way prevent customer believing youve cracked pressure,0.013213537821505405,0.9867864621784946,0.1261918115535614,0.2,0.8186315933999596,81.86315933999596,High Trust
