Arman Lloyd,/users/5ea03e269d9288fff5b789c7,US,1.0,2020-04-22 12:53:06+00:00,1.0,Today is April 22,"Today is April 22, 2020. I’ve been getting charged double everyday since April 18, 2020. I purchased $320 worth of product, but have sense had my PayPal Cash card DRAINED! I have over $800 in double charges, and random $23 charges put on my card. I spoke to a representative, which knew little about the situation but the only thing I understand “Your account was charged all that money Twice just so we can make sure you have the available funds in your account the money will go back In your account eventually ”. This is total BS, I’ve never encountered this problem before, I’ve heard of similar stories to mine with friends and family. Amazon is a garbage company, they shouldn’t be taking advantage of people especially when they have limited funds. Since when do they charge double and then some, such a joke. I would honestly recommend everyone to limit the use of Amazon!",2020-04-22 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,22.0,880,156,17,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,today april i’ve getting charged double everyday since april purchased worth product sense paypal cash card drained double charge random charge put card spoke representative knew little situation thing understand “your account charged money twice make sure available fund account money go back account eventually ” total b i’ve never encountered problem i’ve heard similar story mine friend family amazon garbage company shouldn’t taking advantage people especially limited fund since charge double joke would honestly recommend everyone limit use amazon,0.3098646060314042,0.6901353939685958,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.6625662948530584,66.25662948530584,Medium Trust
CaptnRye,/users/5e6f8493baa5184e24175a04,US,6.0,2020-04-22 11:31:06+00:00,5.0,Better then most!!,"I have to say, I do $50K online shopping a year, between personal and business. Not a single online vendor gets it 100% right all the time, but Amazon comes about as close as anyone can get statistically to getting it right! Prices are almost always lowest or close (of course there are exceptions), they hold the vendors they allow to use them as a Marketplace to high standards of customer satisfaction, and are quick to step in and make things right.At the end of the day, I almost always revert to buying things on Amazon rather then go to a retail store only to find the almost never have the exact item I want anyway. I can do my comparitive shopping, search reviews, and with little exception have it sitting on my front porch 2 days later. Living in a very rural area, this is a life changer, and I go out of my way to support Amazon, after supporting my local small businesses when possible, for providing the level of service and customer support that they do!Keep up the good work Amazon!",2020-04-22 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,22.0,999,184,18,3,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,say k online shopping year personal business single online vendor get right time amazon come close anyone get statistically getting right price almost always lowest close course exception hold vendor allow use marketplace high standard customer satisfaction quick step make thing rightat end day almost always revert buying thing amazon rather go retail store find almost never exact item want anyway comparitive shopping search review little exception sitting front porch day later living rural area life changer go way support amazon supporting local small business possible providing level service customer support dokeep good work amazon,0.7238195659476959,0.2761804340523041,0.10319685922602355,1.0,1.6587295888713567,165.87295888713567,High Trust
