Ed Peters,/users/5a315a8c0000ff000af0935c,DK,23.0,2020-04-16 16:27:13+00:00,1.0,WORST CUSTOMER SERVICE EVER!!!,"What a bunch of donkeys sitting in customerservice!!!Im new on amazon.have ordered 2 things,just to chek the procedure.it went only half ok.Both got shipped,but 1 got cancelled for some reason..Im danish,but lives in georgia and 9 out of 10 times,when i want to buy a thing,they dont ship to denmark or georgia.A friend here in georgia to me: use usa2georgia,all georgians use that.i made a profile there and went to amazon again.then problems began big time.Second time i tried to order,amazon locked my account and told me to log in and follow the instructions.They didnt said how to log in on a locked account,that was up to me,to find out of.They asked for billing statement,i dont know what that is,so i send them a pic of my bankcard.That was not the right thing,fair enough.I then asked what it was they needed in a mail,never got a answer.I mailed them again,ask them to explain to me,what a billing statement is,never got answer. I asked them again to mail me or call me on phone,never heard from them.Now ive googled what a billing statement is,i took a pic of my bankaccount and try to send them,but for some reason,it was not possible,dont know why.Now ive lost my temper and im boiling,i had enough of these fools. I've have wasted 1 hole day trying to fix the problem,trying to get in contact with them,now its simply game over.Completely waste of time and good energy.And i can see MANY reviews here from unhappy customers,so im not in doubt:NEVER EVER AMAZON AGAIN!!!",2020-04-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,16.0,1483,257,30,4,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,bunch donkey sitting customerserviceim new amazonhave ordered thingsjust chek procedureit went half okboth got shippedbut got cancelled reasonim danishbut life georgia timeswhen want buy thingthey dont ship denmark georgiaa friend georgia use usageorgiaall georgian use thati made profile went amazon againthen problem began