Eugene Soloviov,/users/5e9843703b1eb230ea44b2d4,UA,1.0,2020-07-17 19:11:28+00:00,1.0,Account suspended for an unknown reason,"I received a gift card as a birthday present from a co-worker and wanted to purchase an item on Amazon. After an attempted checkout, my account was suspended and I was asked to complete a form and provide a billing statement, and I did. Then it happened again. Then an email about some 'suspicious gift card activity' came, and I forwarded the gift card notification email in response. To no avail. All the items in my list have since been purchased by other people and I can't use my gift card. No customer support employee was able to help me. Won't consider using Amazon ever again.",2020-04-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,7.0,17.0,585,106,39,6,92.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,received gift card birthday present coworker wanted purchase item amazon attempted checkout account suspended asked complete form provide billing statement happened email suspicious gift card activity came forwarded gift card notification email response avail item list since purchased people cant use gift card customer support employee able help wont consider using amazon ever,0.0061340612452537415,0.9938659387547463,0.05945036455412227,0.2,0.8088230422881976,80.88230422881976,High Trust
