Cecilie Jensen,/users/51ec2adc000064000144ad34,DK,5.0,2020-04-14 14:52:47+00:00,1.0,This is unacceptable...,"I will NEVER buy anything from this company again. I bought a flashlight for 73 dollars in december. It was surpossed to be a christmas present. I waited and waited, but no message came saying my package had arrived. I wrote to amazon asking for it. First they didn’t answer. Few days later, the page sent me a message saying that my package seemed to be lost. When I asked to get my money refunded, they sent me a message saying that my package had arrived, but when I went to the postoffice, the package had already been sent back. Again I asked for my money to be refunded. They told me that I would get a refund within 10 days. I’ve been asking for the money ever since, no refund. I started asking in january. Now it’s april. Unacceptable. Do your shopping elsewhere if you want to have a present for christmas in time.",2020-04-14 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,14.0,824,155,23,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,never buy anything company bought flashlight dollar december surpossed christmas present waited waited message came saying package arrived wrote amazon asking first didn’t answer day later page sent message saying package seemed lost asked get money refunded sent message saying package arrived went postoffice package already sent back asked money refunded told would get refund within day i’ve asking money ever since refund started asking january it’s april unacceptable shopping elsewhere want present christmas time,0.02194254709403436,0.9780574529059657,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.8064151538225847,80.64151538225846,High Trust
