Adamant,/users/5817d48f0000ff000a52d929,GB,11.0,2020-04-14 06:53:26+00:00,1.0,DILU Store and Amazon: Unreliable and Dishonest,"I feel both companies are unreliable and a law onto themselves.I had ordered a hair trimmer from a Chinese Firm DILU Store hosted on Amazon.The publicised date of delivery did not correlate with the date sent on the email.  Initially it was 2 weeks, and on the e-mail it was 8 weeks!Upon contacting the seller, I was informed the item had been dispatched.  This could not be cancelled.The seller was dishonest since he had not dispatched the item and upon seeking evidence of dispatch date, we ascertained that he hurriedly sent a day after I had sought cancellation.Upon contacting Amazon, I was transferred to Philipines Call Center and there I had the displeasure of conversing with the call manger Larrisa.  Dismissive, rude, and unempathetic she aggravated the situation.  'It was my fault and she was not going to budge'Amazon seems to protect the seller.  I have to await the delivery of the parcel, (8 weeks after placing the order), refuse and upon receipt (no time line), will I only secure the money back.The Seller and Amazon have a racket.  The customer is at a loss.Consumers be warned! Their policies do not protect consumer and furthermore foreign suppliers are more protected than local consumer.",2020-04-14 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,14.0,1213,203,47,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,feel company unreliable law onto themselvesi ordered hair trimmer chinese firm dilu store hosted amazonthe publicised date delivery correlate date sent email initially week email weeksupon contacting seller informed item dispatched could cancelledthe seller dishonest since dispatched item upon seeking evidence dispatch date ascertained hurriedly sent day sought cancellationupon contacting amazon transferred philipines call center displeasure conversing call manger larrisa dismissive rude unempathetic aggravated situation fault going budgeamazon seems protect seller await delivery parcel week placing order refuse upon receipt time line secure money backthe seller amazon racket customer lossconsumers warned policy protect consumer furthermore foreign supplier protected local consumer,0.17322711028774818,0.8267728897122518,0.11385305664610207,0.2,0.7361570561853463,73.61570561853463,Medium Trust
