Charles Hoppner,/users/5e8f593f708bf837a4f029ab,CA,9.0,2020-04-09 17:29:00+00:00,1.0,They claim to have shipping preference…,"They claim to have shipping preference options that are not available. I often choose ""1 day shipping"" only to find out that my order is arriving in 5 days. This is not a pandemic issue, as this has happened before.  Customer service will claim that nothing is wrong, and that it never said 1 day shipping, but believe me, I can read and I know what it said when I ordered. I don't even care if it's delayed, just don't pretend I didn't choose 1 day shipping - it's insulting to be gaslighted like that. Scummy company, and when the pandemic is over I will likely cancel prime and go back to shopping local where people are honest.",2020-04-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,9.0,631,118,39,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,claim shipping preference option available often choose day shipping find order arriving day pandemic issue happened customer service claim nothing wrong never said day shipping believe read know said ordered dont even care delayed dont pretend didnt choose day shipping insulting gaslighted like scummy company pandemic likely cancel prime go back shopping local people honest,0.016684987008376114,0.9833150129916239,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.8048936253965411,80.48936253965411,High Trust
