Kintija Anspoka,/users/5e8ce73d4d2b560fb7c15189,GB,2.0,2020-04-07 20:49:07+00:00,1.0,Just don't contact customer service,I just got in touch with their customer service team through the chat. Since the person i spoke to was kind of rude and pretty much called me a liar I thought I'll come on here and see if people had similar experiences.So I got in touch with them because i was charged for amazon prime. Haven't bought amazon prime and have not used the free trial (for anyone wondering). So I saw it on my bank statement and was super confused. I went on my amazon account and to the prime section. On there it said- you are not currently an amazon prime member. Which got me even more confused so I contacted the customer support team. Explained the situation and asked how to cancel because you can't cancel it if it's not showing on your account obviously. So the person that was talking to me said that it is showing on my account and that he will cancel it for me and I will get a refund. I asked does he know why it's not showing on my account if I'm being charged for it and where is the charge even coming from If I haven't signed up for it. He said that I have signed up for it and it's showing on my account. So pretty much calling me a liar. I realised there is no point to try and prove myself right so I just said thank you. Before even responding with a- thank you for contacting us or have a good evening the person just left the chat. It just made me feel so weird after and i honestly felt like I was a criminal trying to scam money out of them when this was not my fault at all!!!,2020-04-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,7.0,1482,295,35,5,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,got touch customer service team chat since person spoke kind rude pretty much called liar thought ill come see people similar experiencesso got touch charged amazon prime havent bought amazon prime used free trial anyone wondering saw bank statement super confused went amazon account prime section said currently amazon prime member got even confused contacted customer support team explained situation asked cancel cant cancel showing account obviously person talking said showing account cancel get refund asked know showing account im charged charge even coming havent signed said signed showing account pretty much calling liar realised point try prove right said thank even responding thank contacting u good evening person left chat made feel weird honestly felt like criminal trying scam money fault,0.6561322790459916,0.3438677209540084,0.16545148625911385,0.2,0.5050241577288269,50.50241577288269,Medium Trust
