Long Sight,/users/5e8961a5ebf8a94a5d1d607b,US,2.0,2020-04-05 21:03:49+00:00,2.0,Amazon.com cannot be trusted or believed anymore.,"In all fairness, the current huge delays because they are being overwhelmed.  Shipments taking average of 1.5 to 2 weeks to arrive unless patrons pay for next day service, which few can afford.  Items show available then go out of stock.  Their 'Smile' program is the most positive thing I can say.  I cancelled Amazon Prime due to constant problems.  Deliveries are left outside gate, on the street in a high traffic/theft area - doorbells aren't even rung. Deliveries are made to incorrect locations.  Customer service is overseas (866-216-1072; 888-280-3321) - ""0""Other:  Reviews aren't honest, cannot be believed.  Best to compare with similar platforms for factual ratings. Some reviewers are paid or given free products.  I was contacted at least a dozen times by a third party seller who wanted me to change my rating for a $15.00 item.  Final offer was $50.00 to change it.  I didn't.  More and more sales are being made through 2nd or 3rd party sellers, which Amazon assumes no responsibility for.  Had one experience where seller flatly lied and wouldn't refund for several unopened packages in one return.  Knew from tracking he'd received it.  Customers suffer losses that way.  Also, I get e-mails trying to sell me things after searches on Amazon, particularly for books about certain subjects I've just searched for, like health and diets.  Am very private, few people have my e-mail.  Am positive Amazon is selling my private contact information, which I resent in this age of increased identity theft.  I will have less and less to do with them in the future - they cannot be trusted.",2020-04-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,5.0,1601,267,49,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,fairness current huge delay overwhelmed shipment taking average week arrive unless patron pay next day service afford item show available go stock smile program positive thing say cancelled amazon prime due constant problem delivery left outside gate street high traffictheft area doorbell arent even rung delivery made incorrect location customer service overseas review arent honest cannot believed best compare similar platform factual rating reviewer paid given free product contacted least dozen time third party seller wanted change rating item final offer change didnt sale made nd rd party seller amazon assumes responsibility one experience seller flatly lied wouldnt refund several unopened package one return knew tracking hed received customer suffer loss way also get email trying sell thing search amazon particularly book certain subject ive searched like health diet private people email positive amazon selling private contact information resent age increased identity theft less less future cannot trusted,0.004739403020849636,0.9952605969791504,0.14974761637689288,0.4,1.1275798217649537,112.75798217649537,High Trust
