Lawrence Klebesadel,/users/5e89fdf162514530f8eb4840,US,1.0,2020-04-05 15:49:14+00:00,1.0,Have to hound Amazon for refunds on undeliverable shipments.,"More and more shipments are coming in damaged or being declared undeliverable.  Amazon treats undeliverable shipments as a Return and processes the refund when the item is returned.  However, once the shipper declares the shipment undeliverable they neither deliver or return the package and Amazon doesn't process any refund until you hound them for your money back even if there hasn't been any activity logged on the tracking information for over a month.  Even with the month wait, they then wait 10 days to process the refund. .... and have you noticed that you can leave a review for every seller on Amazon except Amazon itself?",2020-04-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,5.0,634,106,60,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,shipment coming damaged declared undeliverable amazon treat undeliverable shipment return process refund item returned however shipper declares shipment undeliverable neither deliver return package amazon doesnt process refund hound money back even hasnt activity logged tracking information month even month wait wait day process refund noticed leave review every seller amazon except amazon,0.01745185215656513,0.9825481478434349,0.05945036455412227,0.2,0.8031641468325419,80.3164146832542,High Trust
