Michelle Hamby,/users/5e89436cb539f334c4de7f31,US,3.0,2020-04-05 02:34:48+00:00,1.0,Customer service terrible!,"I have been a customer of Amazons for over five years and today is probably the first time I can say that I have had terrible customer service.  Two days ago I reported suspicious activity on my account.  The customer service agent was fantastic and immediately refunded me the money that was taken however she failed to tell me that they would be locking my account and no one ever contacted me to let me know.  When I went to log into my account and found it locked, I was given a customer service number to call regarding this issue.  I called it and was put on hold for over 45 minutes before the line was disconnected.  I did a Google search to see if there was another number I could call.  I found one and when I called that number I immediately got a response saying there was no one available to take my call due to the covid virus.  I was directed to start a chat however I could not do this because you have to be logged into your account to do a chat.  I ended up having to open a new account and started a chat.  After waiting for an additional 40 minutes I was transferred to three different agents none of which could help me.  I was then told that they “sent a urgent message” to account specialist but I could take them up to 48 hours to respond.  I will probably never shop through Amazon again due to this experience.  I am extremely unimpressed by this experience.",2020-04-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,5.0,1384,263,26,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer amazon five year today probably first time say terrible customer service two day ago reported suspicious activity account customer service agent fantastic immediately refunded money taken however failed tell would locking account one ever contacted let know went log account found locked given customer service number call regarding issue called put hold minute line disconnected google search see another number could call found one called number immediately got response saying one available take call due covid virus directed start chat however could logged account chat ended open new account started chat waiting additional minute transferred three different agent none could help told “sent urgent message” account specialist could take hour respond probably never shop amazon due experience extremely unimpressed experience,0.008125351978143815,0.9918746480218562,0.14750420639371845,0.2,0.8254381652896717,82.54381652896717,High Trust
