Charles,/users/5d0c2d82ff6d0937540c495e,US,21.0,2020-04-03 00:36:50+00:00,1.0,"Used To Be Good, Now Terrible","Every year amazon gets worse as it becomes more of a monopoly. Currently they aren’t even doing phone support, only chat. And none of the chat agents are in America. They wont even have someone call you if you request it. The delivery personnel are terrible. They leave packages in the wrong place, out in rain, in mud, they’ve left shipping debris behind on my porch, damaged my porch, etc. Amazon customer support refuses to do anything for these types of problems. They simply tell you that issues you’ve had with drivers/delivery will be passed along. This isn’t even getting into all of the problems with the website... price gouging, product availability, membership price, items available for non-members, subscribe and save problems, site navigability, and so on.",2020-04-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,3.0,771,127,29,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,every year amazon get worse becomes monopoly currently aren’t even phone support chat none chat agent america wont even someone call request delivery personnel terrible leave package wrong place rain mud they’ve left shipping debris behind porch damaged porch etc amazon customer support refuse anything type problem simply tell issue you’ve driversdelivery passed along isn’t even getting problem website price gouging product availability membership price item available nonmember subscribe save problem site navigability,0.015748082964490505,0.9842519170355095,0.071228266965788,0.2,0.8063716119109123,80.63716119109124,High Trust
