Kristin Griffey,/users/5e8542a187efac0f66d2b870,US,1.0,2020-04-02 01:41:22+00:00,1.0,"Amazon- Liars and Cheats and Thieves, Oh my.","I have spent most of my money on Amazon- purchasing necessities for home and work. My account had fraud on it several times PRIOR to COVID-19 regulations or anyone identified with Corona Virus in the US. I did what Amazon told me to do- implement a two-step authorization when I log in. I was told someone from Amazon Fraud Dept would contact me. I removed all of my payment methods with the exception of my Amazon store card. I cancelled my debit card. When yet another fraud happened, I cancelled my Amazon Store Card. Fraud continued to happen. I am locked out of my own account and receiving multiple emails from Amazon demanding payment for fraudulent purchases on an inactive card. Are you kidding me? I wholeheartedly believe this is an inside job- and I have proof that will come out in court. In the world we live in right now, I don’t want this headache in my life. This long term member is navigating an Amazonless life just fine. I had however, better be granted access to my history, I will not pay for fraudulent charges and this needs to be done in a timely manner. SHAME on AMAZON. Liars, cheats and thieves that wouldn’t recognize true customer service if it stared them in the face. GROSS.",2020-04-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,4.0,2.0,1207,218,44,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,spent money amazon purchasing necessity home work account fraud several time prior covid regulation anyone identified corona virus u amazon told implement twostep authorization log told someone amazon fraud dept would contact removed payment method exception amazon store card cancelled debit card yet another fraud happened cancelled amazon store card fraud continued happen locked account receiving multiple email amazon demanding payment fraudulent purchase inactive card kidding wholeheartedly believe inside job proof come court world live right don’t want headache life long term member navigating amazonless life fine however better granted access history pay fraudulent charge need done timely manner shame amazon liar cheat thief wouldn’t recognize true customer service stared face gross,0.009160626075511673,0.9908393739244883,0.12226584408300617,0.2,0.8198728557788453,81.98728557788453,High Trust
