Memento Mori,/users/5e80c2c13d0621db90735f37,GB,1.0,2020-03-29 15:48:34+00:00,1.0,Amazon.com and Amazon.co.uk are without…,"Amazon.com and Amazon.co.uk are without doubt the worst company going. I signed up to audible with a view to continuing to use it but didn't find it all that good, and so cancelled my membership. To my shock they continued to debit my account £7.99 for 8 months after this despite repeatedly asking - and finally demanding- that they stop. The only thing that stopped them and gained me a refund of the money that they had stolen from me was threatening them with legal action and talking about their theft to the press/media.That's just for starters. I've ordered products from Amazon and in the early days they were pretty good. Now they're just pedalling overpriced crap and the deliveries  are so pathetically slow. Delivery used to be pretty good but now they want to charge extortionate amounts for delivery at the speeds they used to deliver at for free. I can understand a small charge but not the amounts they want to push. Even when they give a delivery day/time, they often claim the courier is running late and I end up getting my products a day or two late. Absolutely crap. Customer services have been useless on every occasion I've had the misfortune of dealing with them and that's been both the British and - even worse - the US customer services. The only way to get rubbish companies such as Amazon to sort themselves out is to boycott them and not use their services. I won't ever use them again personally. Utter dross.",2020-03-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,29.0,1440,256,40,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazoncom amazoncouk without doubt worst company going signed audible view continuing use didnt find good cancelled membership shock continued debit account £ month despite repeatedly asking finally demanding stop thing stopped gained refund money stolen threatening legal action talking theft pressmediathats starter ive ordered product amazon early day pretty good theyre pedalling overpriced crap delivery pathetically slow delivery used pretty good want charge extortionate amount delivery speed used deliver free understand small charge amount want push even give delivery daytime often claim courier running late end getting product day two late absolutely crap customer service useless every occasion ive misfortune dealing thats british even worse u customer service way get rubbish company amazon sort boycott use service wont ever use personally utter dross,0.009590136274451006,0.990409863725549,0.1435782389231632,0.2,0.8239205796474072,82.39205796474072,High Trust
