Raul Butuc,/users/559301820000ff0001c98e04,GB,8.0,2020-03-25 17:56:37+00:00,1.0,Prime Customer - Customer Service MANAGERS Hang Up On You - AVOID AMAZON,"As a Prime customer, I have been experiencing a very critical issue with a high-value order being misdelivered, without signature to a fake name (or at least not anyone in my building). I have spent over 20 hours talking to customer support, their managers and their managers' managers throughout the last 3 weeks. Every conversation is going in circles; their chain of communication is virtually non-existent; let's say their CS representative Mr. X doesn't know what their CS representative Mr. Y said, so you have to explain everything from the beginning every single time, even when being transferred! The best part is when you get conflicting responses from different customer service reps... (sarcasm intended) - such as: we have a delivery signature / we don't have a delivery signature - which then obviously takes extra time to figure out. Some of the managers even had the audacity to close the conversation after I caught them contradicting themselves!! Please stay away from this company. I will be taking legal action against them based on these events and they will pay for everything wrong they've done.",2020-03-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,25.0,1118,184,72,13,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,prime customer experiencing critical issue highvalue order misdelivered without signature fake name least anyone building spent hour talking customer support manager manager manager throughout last week every conversation going circle chain communication virtually nonexistent let say c representative mr x doesnt know c representative mr said explain everything beginning every single time even transferred best part get conflicting response different customer service rep sarcasm intended delivery signature dont delivery signature obviously take extra time figure manager even audacity close conversation caught contradicting please stay away 