Valentina De Giorgio,/users/5e7b087c062aad208eccb673,FR,1.0,2020-03-25 07:30:11+00:00,1.0,Amazon is losing a loyal customer,"I want to share the horrible experienceI recently had with #amazon and #amazon.fr First and foremost I want to tell I'm an Amazon customer since 2010.  This to say that, in over 10 years, I have never had such an horrible experience with Amazon Customer Service, as I had with Amazon.fr. Since March 18 my account has repeatedly been blocked/put on hold, I guess it was from the Fraud Department, every time I tried to set orders. I had to buy an office chair, a TV and a FitBit watch.I called the customer care France (English speakers) 7 times over the course of just 48 hours, I got all kind of different explanations, contradicting with each other, and wrong guidance, with the result that I only managed to buy the office chair on Amazon, for the TV I used another e-commerce site. And even for the office chair, I was mistakenly instructed to set orders again, as they were not appearing inside my accounts, one I managed to cancel it and get refunded, the other one, done through my Italian account, I could not cancel it as the customer care couldnt even see the order (me neither!), so I refused the package at delivery and I'm still waiting for a reimbursement. I never had such a level of distress. This during confinement, where Amazon was for me the only way to buy things and make my home a bit more comfortable... in the last call I was promised by a philipino girl to be contacted by the fraud department to get an explanation of why they keep blocking my account, they never did. Now I would need to set other orders but nobody can guarantee me that, once clicking on purchase, my account doesn't get blocked or put on hold again. I am really disappointed and for first time in my life I'm forced to use other e-commerce sites for my purchases. Amazon is losing a loyal customer. The fraud department should at least have bothered to call me to give me an explanation and guarantee me my account can be used again now.",2020-03-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,25.0,1935,354,33,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,want share horrible experiencei recently amazon amazonfr first foremost want tell im amazon customer since say year never horrible experience amazon customer service amazonfr since march account repeatedly blockedput hold guess fraud department every time tried set order buy office chair tv fitbit watchi called customer care france english speaker time course hour got kind different explanation contradicting wrong guidance result managed buy office chair amazon tv used another ecommerce site even office chair mistakenly instructed set order appearing inside account one managed cancel get refunded one done italian account could cancel customer care couldnt even see order neither refused package delivery im still waiting reimbursement never level distress confinement amazon way buy thing make home bit comfortable last call promised philipino girl contacted fraud department get explanation keep blocking account never would need set order nobody guarantee clicking purchase account doesnt get blocked put hold really disappointed first time life im forced use ecommerce site purchase amazon losing loyal customer fraud department least bothered call give explanation guarantee account used,0.03049649371996387,0.9695035062800361,0.19854178351093663,0.2,0.8244601098422054,82.44601098422054,High Trust
