Mercedes Davis,/users/5e798897baa51880221c079f,US,2.0,2020-03-24 04:12:15+00:00,1.0,False Advertisement,"Amazon is a disappointment. A Close friend bought a crib for my baby, and unfortunately it was damaged, the return policy says drop off at ur nearest UPS store and a gift card refund will be sent to your amazon account in 2 to 3 hours. I returned it at 1:00 pm and 8 hours had passed with no refund. I contacted them and there response is they can’t give me a refund cause the item was not returned to them but the policy doesn’t state that, i continue to tell them what the policy says and they responded that it happens but they can’t issue a refund nor is there anyone there to give me one. I became furious asking for there corporate number, they so lucky I wasn’t on a call cause I would have cussed them out. Amazon online shopping if you have a policy that isn’t true correct it, do not advertise one thing then do the next, it’s unprofessional and untrustworthy. Shortly we came to an agreement to have another shipped but it will not come till the 21st, my baby is due the 5th which means my baby will not have a crib. I even offered to pay for faster shipping to no avail although it was there product that is causing this inconvenience. I don’t use Amazon often so heads up to the next victim. First it’s AmazonPrime taking lump sums of money from your account, now it Amazon online shopping using false advertisement to rob u of ur money, They deceive and steal. 😤#Amazon Amazon.com Just so y’all know and every other customer who buys from them, be aware that amazon is a scam.",2020-03-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,24.0,1490,282,19,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon disappointment close friend bought crib baby unfortunately damaged return policy say drop ur nearest ups store gift card refund sent amazon account hour returned pm hour passed refund contacted response can’t give refund cause item returned policy doesn’t state continue tell policy say responded happens can’t issue refund anyone give one became furious asking corporate number lucky wasn’t call cause would cussed amazon online shopping policy isn’t true correct advertise one thing next it’s unprofessional untrustworthy shortly came agreement another shipped come till st baby due th mean baby crib even offered pay faster shipping avail although product causing inconvenience don’t use amazon often head next victim first it’s amazonprime taking lump sum money account amazon online shopping using false advertisement rob u ur money deceive steal 😤amazon amazoncom y’all know every customer buy aware amazon scam,0.009466137149830111,0.9905338628501699,0.15816040381379698,0.2,0.8268990121878442,82.68990121878443,High Trust
