Opticalpig,/users/5e76c473062aadd7e4cad491,US,1.0,2020-03-22 01:54:04+00:00,1.0,My account was 'put on hold' which I…,"My account was 'put on hold' which I was told was for 'suspicious activity'. I'm an older person (over 60) and sometimes fumble a bit with tech stuff. But when I tried to resolve this... You want to talk about a VICIOUS CIRCLE!?!?You CAN NOT do an online chat with them unless you log in... HMMM? If you want to talk to them about the fact you CAN'T LOG IN, how is that possible?!? Duh!Then I called the 'security and login issue line'. Whoa. Get a drink, turn on the first Lord of The Rings movie, have the other two movies available and sit back for several HOURS OF ON HOLDNESS!!!!Finally get through to them and the guy talks to me like I'm a criminal!!! He asked me for an order number from something I've purchased. It took me a few minutes as I had deleted those e-mails. I kept saying, ""Hang on second. I'll find one"" He'd respond in a disgusted voice, ""Uh Huh... sure you will"". It was so insulting. I did eventually give him an order number.Then he said, ""I'll turn this over to our security team to check it out. They'll call you within 24 hours""They didn't. Still can't login. I have movies and books I've purchased that can only be viewed or listened to by logging in. So they've sold me these things... and have now STOLEN THEM BACK with no explanation!Amazon sucks.",2020-03-22 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,22.0,1280,238,37,8,0.0,0,12,2,1,Suspicious,account put hold told suspicious activity im older person sometimes fumble bit tech stuff tried resolve want talk vicious circleyou online chat unless log hmmm want talk fact cant log possible duhthen called security login issue line whoa get drink turn first lord ring movie two movie available sit back several hour holdnessfinally get guy talk like im criminal asked order number something ive purchased took minute deleted email kept saying hang second ill find one hed respond disgusted voice uh huh sure insulting eventually give order numberthen said ill turn security team check theyll call within hoursthey didnt still cant login movie book ive purchased viewed listened logging theyve sold thing stolen back explanationamazon suck,0.999998258974925,1.7410250749971823e-06,0.1334828939988783,0.2,0.32669744931231315,32.669744931231314,Low Trust
