Cassidy C,/users/5e6293d2ac65ea373c6dfaff,US,1.0,2020-03-19 17:48:06+00:00,1.0,I’m so disappointed in Amazon!!!!!!!!!,"I’m so disappointed in Amazon these days. I have been a prime member for 5+ years & have never had to call customer until the past year. Now I am on the phone with customer service  every week. I have been receiving broken items, items that do not fit description, wrong items, about to get charged twice for something I never tried to return. Why would I even be charged twice in the first place? SHADY!!!!!!!!!!!!! All the 3rd parties they are allowing without any check, might as well be on eBay. I received the wrong colors on items. I bought food pouches for my toddler and they were in a random box (not the company box) and the box wasn’t taped all around it was flipped in on sides as if I was packaging it without tape available! I have so many items that are broken. I bought k-cups that were sticked once I received them that they were re-packaged by Amazon, yet it was still the company’s box.... the k cups are bad! They have clumps of stuff. When you shake a k cup you should hear loose coffee grounds not thumps! I recently bought an item that I paid one amount for when I placed the order, I got confirmation email with same price but now the price has changed. I was told should have returned them if I didn’t like the price change. I was supposed to pay $7 and got charged $29... it’s the companies fault not mine, give me my refund I would have never purchased them at that price! I ordered a helmet/bike pad set for my daughter and the gloves on have 4 finger holes in each hand! I don’t know where everyone else lives but where I’m from we have 5 fingers on each hand. They then expected me to to out of my way to return it, even though it was a damaged product! The other bike helmet/pads set was supposed to be pink and white and I received all black...... I wrote a review on one (unicorn light) item I purchased  because the picture was COMPLETELY misleading. They sent me a new one and gave me a refund. But the new one was just as bad & was even chipped! They asked me to remove my review since they replaced & refunded me. I did. But feel bad no one should pay that price for the item. So I plan on going back to re-review bad! Another company emailed me, asking for me to return my product because I discount code was not supposed to go out and if I don’t return the company will go bankrupt... really!? How is that even right!? I seriously could go on and on about the disappointments In the quality of items, the package/delivery, refund policy, customer service. Again, until a year or less I have never had issues with amazon, but after THIS many in such a short amount of time. I’m done! What frustrates me the most is I PAY for this service every year!!!! I’m cancelling my membership and sticking to Target where I always get 5% and don’t pay anything annually! I suggest that to everyone now. I used to say that about Amazon but I will no longer recommend them to anyone. I hope I’m alone in all this mess because I would hate for someone else to go through all this, but from reading some of the reviews seems MANY people are unhappy and Amazon doesn’t care. So hopefully one by one they lose their customers and to bankrupt because they opened all these facilities thinking they were great, which they were til then, now they are awful and I hope they have to start shutting down places all over or get their stuff straight so people can stop having to go through all this!",2020-03-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,19.0,3412,648,38,5,0.0,0,30,2,1,Suspicious,i’m disappointed amazon day prime member year never call customer past year phone customer service every week receiving broken item item fit description wrong item get charged twice something never tried return would even charged twice first place shady rd party allowing without check might well ebay received wrong color item bought food pouch toddler random box company box box wasn’t taped around flipped side packaging without tape available many item broken bought kcups sticked received repackaged amazon yet still company’s box k cup bad clump stuff shake k cup hear loose coffee ground thump recently bought item paid one amount placed order got confirmation email price price changed told returned didn’t like price change supposed pay got charged it’s company fault mine give refund would never purchased price ordered helmetbike pad set daughter glove finger hole hand don’t know everyone else life i’m finger hand expected way return even though damaged product bike helmetpads set supposed pink white received black wrote review one unicorn light item purchased picture completely misleading sent new one gave refund new one bad even chipped asked remove review since replaced refunded feel bad one pay price item plan going back rereview bad another company emailed asking return product discount code supposed go don’t return company go bankrupt really even right seriously could go disappointment quality item packagedelivery refund policy customer service year less never issue amazon many short amount time i’m done frustrates pay service every year i’m cancelling membership sticking target always get don’t pay anything annually suggest everyone used say amazon longer recommend anyone hope i’m alone mess would hate someone else go reading review seems many people unhappy amazon doesn’t care hopefully one one lose customer bankrupt opened facility thinking great til awful hope start shutting place get stuff straight people stop go,1.0,0.0,0.36343241727425685,0.2,0.37268648345485134,37.26864834548513,Low Trust
