Anika Lyons,/users/5ce4d28734e8299515887f80,AU,3.0,2020-03-16 20:45:49+00:00,1.0,Amazon gave me the opportunity to leave…,"Amazon gave me the opportunity to leave a review on their site and they assessed it, realised that it wasn't a glowing review, then decided to not allow it to be published.I purchased an item from them and received updates every 4 days with tracking details and telling me that my item was close. Almost 4 weeks passed and nothing. When I contacted them, no response at all. Finally I'd had enough and sent them a last email insisting that they tell me my items whereabouts. They simply replied ""sorry here is a refund'. No explanation. I didn't want a refund, I wanted the item that they had assured me was on its way with their tracking information. Nobody was avaialble to speak to or would reply to my messages. They blocked my review because it was honest and I realised that only favourable reviews are passed. That's not honesty at all. What a scam this company is. Needless to say that I won't be purchasing from the Amazon platform again. Highly disappointed.",2020-03-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,16.0,968,173,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon gave opportunity leave review site assessed realised wasnt glowing review decided allow publishedi purchased item received update every day tracking detail telling item close almost week passed nothing contacted response finally id enough sent last email insisting tell item whereabouts simply replied sorry refund explanation didnt want refund wanted item assured way tracking information nobody avaialble speak would reply message blocked review honest realised favourable review passed thats honesty scam company needless say wont purchasing amazon platform highly disappointed,0.0213001053065746,0.9786998946934254,0.09702748177229388,0.2,0.8087554437011715,80.87554437011715,High Trust
