James Ripson,/users/5e6b8404baa518934615c5ee,US,4.0,2020-03-13 13:00:58+00:00,1.0,They have gone way down hill in…,"They have gone way down hill in customer service, poor product quality and delivery.  I have now had 2 products that were junk and didn't perform as advertised.  I have had packages that they claimed were delivered that were not.  A prime membership gives you nothing, they treat you like crap no matter who you are.  Told me I had to wait to verify if USPS had delivered it.  It wasn't in my mail box, told me to calm down. Tired of them forgetting we are the customers and that we expect products to be delivered on time and not be jerked around do to there incompetence.   Cancelled everything with them, will never use them again.",2020-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,13.0,634,116,32,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,gone way hill customer service poor product quality delivery product junk didnt perform advertised package claimed delivered prime membership give nothing treat like crap matter told wait verify usps delivered wasnt mail box told calm tired forgetting customer expect product delivered time jerked around incompetence cancelled everything never use,0.015295977009830415,0.9847040229901696,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.8053637893974965,80.53637893974965,High Trust
Judah Kessler,/users/5a5656350000ff000afec7a2,US,52.0,2020-06-18 02:15:48+00:00,1.0,Unexplained & Unauthorised Charge. Customer Service of no help.,"Today I was reconciling my bank account and discovered a charge made against it from Amazon. My last order was placed several days ago and all charges were paid in full. This was a mystery. So I contacted ""customer service"" via ""Chat"" and ""Prerna"" of ""Customer Service"" brushed the issue off by telling me ""I'm sorry but if you want details so I request you please contact the bank to this they will provide you details."" I checked the on-line invoice for the order referenced. There's no mention of the extra charge but the money certainly has been taken from my account. Mystery charges and no responsibility for explanation. Buyers beware.I'm investigating with the ""bank"" and will be following up with Consumer Protection because there was no authority given for any ""additional"" charges to be made against me.I'll up-date as I learn more.Up-Date: June 2020The previous matter was some-what settled, almost a month later, with the issuance of a refund of the extra charges but my ""1-Star"" remains because, subsequently, on a rather large order, Amazon came through again with greater reason not to be trusted. That resulted in over 50$ in ""over-draft"" fees on my account! What they did was charge my debit card immediately when I placed the order (which they claim they do not do... a lie), then ""refunded"" the charge the next day. Ah... the following day they charged the full amount again (order still not shipped) and then AGAIN, the NEXT day they charged me. Double-charged. The double-charge resulted in every purchase/bill payment I made subsequently, to, effectively ""bounce""... to the tune of 55$ over-draft charges! I've NEVER had an over-draft on that account so when I explained it all to the bank, the only thing they could assure me of was that they understood the situation and that my reputation was still ""excellent"" with them. Meanwhile, it took many ""chats"" with Amazon, on-line AND informing them that I would take the matter to the local Attorney General as well as Consumer Protection/Affairs and social media. After about 2 days of being offered ""Promo Credit"" (which wouldn't pay the bills nor compensate for the cost of the fees which were their fault), the one double-charge was returned to my account and a day later, 50$ was also ""refunded"" to my account.Bottom line: Buyer Beware... be VERY aware. When using a debit card, CONSTANTLY check your account, daily if not twice daily, until your order is received. Maybe best to check after receipt as well. Amazon cannot be trusted. I never will trust them again.",2020-03-12 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,6.0,18.0,2541,429,63,9,98.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,today reconciling bank account discovered charge made amazon last order placed several day ago charge paid full mystery contacted customer service via chat prerna customer service brushed issue telling im sorry want detail request please contact bank provide detail checked online invoice order referenced there mention extra charge money certainly taken account mystery charge responsibility explanation buyer bewareim investigating bank following consumer protection authority given additional charge made meill update learn moreupdate june previous matter somewhat settled almost month later issuance refund extra charge star remains subsequently rather large order amazon came greater reason trusted resulted overdraft fee account charge debit card immediately placed order claim lie refunded charge next day ah following day charged full amount order still shipped next day charged doublecharged doublecharge resulted every purchasebill payment made subsequently effectively bounce tune overdraft charge ive never overdraft account explained bank thing could assure understood situation reputation still excellent meanwhile took many chat amazon online informing would take matter local attorney general well consumer protectionaffairs social medium day offered promo credit wouldnt pay bill compensate cost fee fault one doublecharge returned account day later also refunded accountbottom line buyer beware aware using debit card constantly check account daily twice daily order received maybe best check receipt well amazon cannot trusted never trust,0.08779368729245066,0.9122063127075494,0.2406057206954571,0.2,0.8042243004928661,80.4224300492866,High Trust
