Elisa Rivas,/users/5e68956135d35d400e38869a,US,2.0,2020-03-11 07:38:25+00:00,2.0,Angry member,"I used to LOVE Amazon and Amazon Prime. I currently have Amazon Prime, but I'm considering getting rid of my Amazon account entirely! Their customer service so far sucks! I've never had issues with them in the past, but it's quite odd now, as they have caused new issues that shouldn't exist! I go on my phone one day to discover I've been somehow logged out of my Amazon account because my device (the same one I've had for three years) is no longer suddenly recognized. When I try logging back in, my password was not accepted. I use a total of 4 different passwords, the only possible four I use on any website and I've tried all four with no luck. I tried to create a new password, and I had to verify I wasn't a robot, verify my email, and verify the expiration date on my bank card. I did all of the above AND once they all failed, I gave my old bank card info instead in case Amazon had for whatever reason not kept my updates. After several attempts, Amazon still would not let me log in. I tried going to Customer service in their site, but it wouldn't let me go through unless I logged in (which was my issue in the first place), so I tried ""Help,"" which took me a little bit to find the option about account login issues, but once I found it, it told me I had to login to fix these issues. I tried looking on both ""Help"" and ""Customer Service"" for an email or phone number and not only did I not find anything, but it kept telling me I had to login. I reattempted my four passwords and even tried a few others that I could remember that I rarely ever use on any site, just to see if they'd work. Nothing. I even wondered if someone has hacked into my account, but if they have, it's clear that Amazon is not willing to help me or keep my money and account safe. Finally, Amazon has locked my account entirely/for good until I can meet their impossible requirements and it's only now, at last, that they have provided me with a phone number. I give two stars for the benefit of the doubt, since Amazon has never caused me trouble before and, in the past, I've always loved Amazon and would have given them five stars, but if after I call them, they are unable to help me and/or they don't fix their glitchy website, not only will this rating decrease to a one star (although, at that point, I'd wish I could give zero), but I will remove my account, Prime and all permanently and never buy from Amazon again. I am infuriated that my account could potentially be threatened by a hacker and that I can't fix the problem by a simple password change! They better fix this or I'll cause a riot!",2020-03-11 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,11.0,2599,498,12,2,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,used love amazon amazon prime currently amazon prime im considering getting rid amazon account entirely customer service far suck ive never issue past quite odd caused new issue shouldnt exist go phone one day discover ive somehow logged amazon account device one ive three year longer suddenly recognized try logging back password accepted use total different password possible four use website ive tried four luck tried create new password verify wasnt robot verify email verify expiration date bank card failed gave old bank card info instead case amazon whatever reason kept update several attempt amazon still would let log tried going customer service site wouldnt let go unless logged issue first place tried help took little bit find option account login issue found told login fix issue tried looking help customer service email phone number find anything kept telling login reattempted four password even tried others could remember rarely ever use site see theyd work nothing even wondered someone hacked account clear amazon willing help keep money account safe finally amazon locked account entirelyfor good meet impossible requirement last provided phone number give two star benefit doubt since amazon never caused trouble past ive always loved amazon would given five star call unable help andor dont fix glitchy website rating decrease one star although point id wish could give zero remove account prime permanently never buy amazon infuriated account could potentially threatened hacker cant fix problem simple password change better fix ill cause riot,0.9364553488040982,0.0635446511959018,0.27930454290521595,0.4,0.687633234178994,68.7633234178994,Medium Trust
