Amber Campbell,/users/5e63ed12baa518d037121937,US,1.0,2020-03-07 18:52:08+00:00,1.0,I am having a horrible experience with…,"I am having a horrible experience with Amazon currently. Over the last three days it has been nothing but a nightmare on the phone with them. First my Amazon account was canceled without my permission or my knowledge. When I called to inquire about this because I have shipped packages which are to be delivered to my home they pretty much told me since my account was canceled there’s nothing they can do to help me and that I would need to open a new account. Keep in mind  I never canceled To begin with. They will not give me any information on my already purchased items And because I can’t check the order status I have no idea if I’m even going to receive “again my already purchased  orders!! “ I did have one customer service representative by the name of Carlos that  explained things a little more clearly for me After speaking to three different supervisors are quite a few other customer  service representatives. I ended up opening a new account with my new email address. Which in return caused me to have to call customer service again to re-register all my Amazon devices including my fire stick, tablet etc. Which had me on the phone once again with customer service for sometime until I finally got a resolution by another supervisor by the name of Jeremy who was also great helping me get these things back in order after the nightmare of customer service representative that could not help me.  Keep in mind I am an Amazon prime customer so with my Amazon a prime account Being canceled right after I paid my Amazon prime bill I’m sure you can understand why I am quite frustrated. And also having packages still not delivered to my home and having no idea where they are or if they will even be Delivered! But because I was reassured that everything Would be fine by supervisor Jeremy I was starting to feel a little better about everything. Moving forward because I’m starting to feel better about everything I begin to place another order on my new Amazon prime account feeling confident that nothing else will happen. Boy was I wrong. I proceeded to place my order to only receive an email not even five minutes after my order was placed stating that my new Amazon prime account has been suspended for suspicious activity!!!????? At this point I have lost all faith. I called customer service and again got absolutely no answers! I was told that I need to wait 24 hours after filling out a form that they sent me via email. Once again my children are not able to use their tablet or the fire stick or any other devices in my home for absolutely no reason! I cannot access my Amazon account at all because it was suspended for absolutely no reason this is a brand new account and this is the first order that I’ve made on it after having a three day nightmare with being on the phone with terrible customer service, having packages delivered to my neighbors that should have been delivered to me. having my Amazon account canceled without my knowledge,  having to open a new Amazon account,  not knowing where my other packages are, Being charge for my prime The day before my account is mysteriously canceled, and  finally suspending my account for suspicious activity for absolutely no reason and then not giving me any answers as to why when I call! I am Mind blown",2020-03-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,7.0,3292,592,39,7,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,horrible experience amazon currently last three day nothing nightmare phone first amazon account canceled without permission knowledge called inquire shipped package delivered home pretty much told since account canceled there’s nothing help would need open new account keep mind never canceled begin give information already purchased item can’t check order status idea i’m even going receive “again already purchased order “ one customer service representative name carlos explained thing little clearly speaking three different supervisor quite customer service representative ended opening new account new email address return caused call customer service reregister amazon device including fire stick tablet etc phone customer service sometime finally got resolution another supervisor name jeremy also great helping get thing back order nightmare customer service representative could help keep mind amazon prime customer amazon prime account canceled right paid amazon prime bill i’m sure understand quite frustrated also package still delivered home idea even delivered reassured everything would fine supervisor jeremy starting feel little better everything moving forward i’m starting feel better everything begin place another order new amazon prime account feeling confident nothing else happen boy wrong proceeded place order receive email even five minute order placed stating new amazon prime account suspended suspicious activity point lost faith called customer service got absolutely answer told need wait hour filling form sent via email child able use tablet fire stick device home absolutely reason cannot access amazon account suspended absolutely reason brand new account first order i’ve made three day nightmare phone terrible customer service package delivered neighbor delivered amazon account canceled without knowledge open new amazon account knowing package charge prime day account mysteriously canceled finally suspending account suspicious activity absolutely reason giving answer call mind blown,0.9998817192241114,0.00011828077588860175,0.3320246775098149,0.2,0.36646407588990726,36.646407588990726,Low Trust
