M R,/users/5c147a89dd906938ba4229e4,US,3.0,2020-03-01 01:09:58+00:00,1.0,I was sitting in my basement office the…,I was sitting in my basement office the other day and see a guy in a reflective vest walk by my window. At first I thought it was someone reading our electric meter which is right by the window. The man walked over to our pine tree 15’ from my window and proceeds to pee!! I ran upstairs and told my husband who opened the front door to yell at the delivery man and the guy ran to the Amazon truck and sped away. Come to find out my neighbor across the street just had a delivery from him. I called Amazon logistics and filed a complaint with the tracking # my neighbor gave me. I also called the police and filed a report. It just takes a moment to go to the gas station which is a few minutes away. Infuriating and against the law to pee in someone’s yard!!,2020-03-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,3.0,1.0,759,151,40,8,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,sitting basement office day see guy reflective vest walk window first thought someone reading electric meter right window man walked pine tree ’ window proceeds pee ran upstairs told husband opened front door yell delivery man guy ran amazon truck sped away come find neighbor across street delivery called amazon logistics filed complaint tracking neighbor gave also called police filed report take moment go gas station minute away infuriating law pee someone’s yard,0.9442198304480849,0.055780169551915115,0.08468872686483454,0.2,0.34482783014892443,34.48278301489244,Low Trust
Keva,/users/5a3bb7240000ff000af48b84,US,2.0,2020-02-29 19:56:29+00:00,1.0,Amazon delivery sucks,"I ordered a package on 25th of February, the 26th it was showing my package was delivered. I contacted customer service and was told I had to wait until Monday (03-92-2020) for a response to my order not being delivered. I explained that I have an upcoming job interview with an airline and I really need my package; to cover my tattoos. I explained that I didn’t receive the package it had to be delivered to the wrong apartment. I got nowhere, while I’m sitting at home today I get a knock on my door, I opened the door to an amazon package. I got happy for nothing it’s not my package, they delivered someone else package to my house and took off before I got to the door 😒😒.",2020-02-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,29.0,678,130,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered package th february th showing package delivered contacted customer service told wait monday response order delivered explained upcoming job interview airline really need package cover tattoo explained didn’t receive package delivered wrong apartment got nowhere i’m sitting home today get knock door opened door amazon package got happy nothing it’s package delivered someone else package house took got door 😒😒,0.026937803559963343,0.9730621964400367,0.07291082445316882,0.2,0.8011132631106521,80.11132631106521,High Trust
