Randy,/users/55ec5ce70000ff0001d9ad4b,CA,6.0,2020-02-29 16:38:20+00:00,1.0,If you account is hacked,"If you account is hacked - good luck trying to sort it out with support - the front line cannot deal with ""Account specialist"" - who in my experience are inadequate, they cannot communicate and no one can contact these people.  Never ever park a credit card on Amazon - delete it after every transaction.  Wasted 18 phone calls and about 4 hours trying to do the proper thing and help fix the hack - next time I will just contact the credit card company and reject the charge.",2020-02-29 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,29.0,476,89,24,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,account hacked good luck trying sort support front line cannot deal account specialist experience inadequate cannot communicate one contact people never ever park credit card amazon delete every transaction wasted phone call hour trying proper thing help fix hack next time contact credit card company reject charge,0.022665697313154574,0.9773343026868454,0.04991587212563096,0.2,0.7986503257685489,79.86503257685489,High Trust
