Chris fullwood,/users/581613540000ff000a526550,GB,22.0,2020-02-28 21:35:59+00:00,2.0,I have for some time noticed post and…,"I have for some time noticed post and packaging costs soaring. It is now not unusual to find these costs exceeding the cost of the product you wish to purchase. More recently amazon locked me out of my kindle account, thereby denying me access to books I had purchased. Their one time code didnt work, and the so called ten minute window to use that code is rubbish. Within four minutes they had sent me three codes that I didnt ask for.Amazon is unraveling, creating proceedures that dont work whilst deviously trying to indicate amazon is good value....it isnt the moment you include postage and packaging!!!Amazon has entered a marketing scenario of becoming increasingly irrelevant. I have, not once in six months that cannot be purchased cheaper elsewhere.Delivery has increased in price substancially, but times have not improved. Their chief competitor has slashed their delivery times, with items arriving upto four days early, not so amazon.Very very unsatisfactory.I deleted my kindle account, afterall whats the point?They were denying me access to products I had already purchased.Thats amazon for you!",2020-02-28 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,28.0,1114,179,38,8,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,time noticed post packaging cost soaring unusual find cost exceeding cost product wish purchase recently amazon locked kindle account thereby denying access book purchased one time code didnt work called ten minute window use code rubbish within four minute sent three code didnt ask foramazon unraveling creating proceedures dont work whilst deviously trying indicate amazon good valueit isnt moment include postage packagingamazon entered marketing scenario becoming increasingly irrelevant six month cannot purchased cheaper elsewheredelivery increased price substancially time improved chief competitor slashed delivery time item arriving upto four day early amazonvery unsati