Stacey Anne,/users/5e507a0968c4b91916cec9f7,US,1.0,2020-02-22 00:47:13+00:00,1.0,wish List nightmare,"It’s very difficult to find someone’s wish list. After looking n looking I finally called and now I’m told I must be invited to view the wish list. It was always difficult anyhow. There was never anywhere to click “find wish list”. You can no longer view a wish list unless you are invited. And it always gets screwed up. They never Mark the items bought and the screen is confusing. The item stays on it if you buy it. It goes not get removed from the list. You have to make sure you read it properly and see if it says 1 purchased. It’s stupid - plain and simple! For a billion dollar company they don’t make things easy. They need to adjust that. And delivery is horrible but after complaining again and again they did something with my account and now I get my boxes. But I had a lot of problems with deliveries, not getting them, getting lost, late etc.",2020-02-22 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,22.0,858,163,19,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,it’s difficult find someone’s wish list looking n looking finally called i’m told must invited view wish list always difficult anyhow never anywhere click “find wish list” longer view wish list unless invited always get screwed never mark item bought screen confusing item stay buy go get removed list make sure read properly see say purchased it’s stupid plain simple billion dollar company don’t make thing easy need adjust delivery horrible complaining something account get box lot problem delivery getting getting lost late etc,0.04410306135141744,0.9558969386485826,0.09141895681435783,0.2,0.7962322606871629,79.62322606871629,High Trust
Samantha Weiss,/users/5e50611968c4b94d72cec189,US,1.0,2020-02-21 23:01:51+00:00,2.0,What a huge disappointment Amazon is....,"I bought a comforter set from Amazon and it was delivered 3 days ago. Today on their website, the price is $8.50 lower than when I purchased it. I contacted them and asked if they'd refund the difference to my credit card, or at least give me a gift card with the difference. Two different people said NO. I've only had the product for THREE days! And they won't refund the difference to me? That's low and that is not how you treat customers that you've had since 1999.What kind of customer service is this? This is absurd and ridiculous and I'm not happy with Amazon any more. If I hadn't already unpacked the set and put it on my bed I'd return it so I could re-order it, but it's too late.",2020-02-21 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,21.0,693,133,40,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,bought comforter set amazon delivered day ago today website price lower purchased contacted asked theyd refund difference credit card least give gift card difference two different people said ive product three day wont refund difference thats low treat customer youve since kind customer service absurd ridiculous im happy amazon hadnt already unpacked set put bed id return could reorder late,0.08284812214293727,0.9171518778570628,0.07459338194054964,0.4,1.0734946153166414,107.34946153166413,High Trust
