Alison,/users/51fec1b50000640001468f42,US,4.0,2020-02-20 21:23:43+00:00,1.0,Any damage to your home on Amazon delivery is NOT guaranteed.,"I bought an item from an Amazon third party seller who used Fed Ex to deliver the package. Package was hand delivered to me on my driveway.  After the Fed Ex truck left, I noticed many deep gouges  on my driveway corresponding to tire track.  It covered an area of  20 x 20 ft.  Fed Ex is ignoring me despite all the info they have.  Amazon is adamant in NOT helping me. Never mind that I have bought it though Amazon.  They parrot, ""it is a third party seller so we can not talk to Fed Ex or do any thing"".   I have spoken with four reps, two supervisors (Kelly C was the worst) and  the head quarters.  Marina from the transportation dept in Seattle, after interrogating for 5 minutes to verify  my identity, rudely told me the only person I could air my grievance is Jeff Bezos and gave me his email address!! What an irresponsible company Amazon has turned out to be!   What a departure from the friendly company I thought it was.  This is a service matching the  companies that have since disappeared.  It was a rude awakening.  MORAL OF THE STORY:   Do NOT buy anything from Amazon's third party seller since Amazon will not help you if there is any issue with delivery.",2020-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,20.0,1176,217,61,11,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,bought item amazon third party seller used fed ex deliver package package hand delivered driveway fed ex truck left noticed many deep gouge driveway corresponding tire track covered area x ft fed ex ignoring despite info amazon adamant helping never mind bought though amazon parrot third party seller talk fed ex thing spoken four rep two supervisor kelly c worst head quarter marina transportation dept seattle interrogating minute verify identity rudely told person could air grievance jeff bezos gave email address irresponsible company amazon turned departure friendly company thought service matching company since disappeared rude awakening moral story buy anything amazon third party seller since amazon help issue delivery,0.7610457832298532,0.23895421677014683,0.12170499158721257,0.2,0.4438181067025159,44.38181067025159,Low Trust
Don Holtz,/users/5e4edfda68c4b96e3ecdeb31,US,4.0,2020-02-20 19:37:09+00:00,2.0,Amazon now is making a habit of…,"Amazon now is making a habit of notifying customers that their order has been delivered, when in fact, it was not delivered. And when you call to ask why, I am told that many times the system will mark a package delivered when it was not delivered. I have to wait 24 hours, and if I still do not find the package, I can claim I never received it. Amazon used to brag about being ""customer eccentric"", now I understand why I'm not seeing that anymore.",2020-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,20.0,450,86,32,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon making habit notifying customer order delivered fact delivered call ask told many time system mark package delivered delivered wait hour still find package claim never received amazon used brag customer eccentric understand im seeing anymore,0.017260568961177458,0.9827394310388226,0.04823331463825014,0.4,1.1010163784470612,110.10163784470612,High Trust
