Sara Dashiell,/users/5e4eabc27168c0c8b9500388,US,1.0,2020-02-20 15:58:06+00:00,1.0,Horrible customer service,"Horrible customer service. I used the live chat feature to resolve an issue and explained the issue in my chat. The rep on the chat then asked me 3 different times to explain the issue even though I clearly wrote out each problem. Then had me change the passowrd to the business account and logged off and we never finished the process. Now I'm locked out of my account. I called a customer rep number and because I couldnt log into the account I couldnt tell her the exact billing address of the account, so she said, there's nothing we can do to help. I'm completely in shock, my business account password was requested to be changed by Amazon, then failed to complete the process, then another Amazon rep simply said there is nothing we can do. So now I have 200 employees locked out of the business account and Amazon ""can't do anything about it""It gets even better - I asked to be transferred to the Amazon Business customer service and the rep said they won't accept your call because you don't have the exact billing address for them, which is in the account but I'm locked out. It's 2 hours of dealing with Amazon and all I want to do is log into my account, seems simple enough for Amazon but they can't do it.",2020-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,20.0,1219,227,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,horrible customer service used live chat feature resolve issue explained issue chat rep chat asked different time explain issue even though clearly wrote problem change passowrd business account logged never finished process im locked account called customer rep number couldnt log account couldnt tell exact billing address account said there nothing help im completely shock business account password requested changed amazon failed complete process another amazon rep simply said nothing employee locked business account amazon cant anything itit get even better asked transferred amazon business customer service rep said wont accept call dont exact billing address account im locked hour dealing amazon want log account seems simple enough amazon cant,0.018395769510384494,0.9816042304896155,0.12731351654514864,0.2,0.8162648185538375,81.62648185538374,High Trust
Игорь Хрущев,/users/5e4ea24f68c4b9b9d5cdbd64,RU,1.0,2020-02-20 15:15:05+00:00,1.0,Amazon - scammers.,"Don't try to sell with Amazon.I am owner of russian clothes brand with registered trade mark. I created account at may 2019 and problems started in the same moment. I placed all my private information, all documents that amazon need. I paid first 47$, but they didnt appear on my balance. I created ticket to amazon's support, but didnt recieve any responce. Then I paid 47$ second time, money has been displayed on balance, but after one hour amazon requested my documents. The same documents, that I uploaded when registered account.I send my legal documents second time. and... attention... Amazon blocked my account. I tried to do anything, but there is no support, no telephone, no any feedback, and, so you have already understand - no money back. Today I logged in my account and there is no money more. No money, blocked account, a lot of hard work with documents and losted nerves.So I can confidently say that Amazon are scammers.",2020-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,20.0,940,162,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dont try sell amazoni owner russian clothes brand registered trade mark created account may problem started moment placed private information document amazon need paid first didnt appear balance created ticket amazon support didnt recieve responce paid second time money displayed balance one hour amazon requested document document uploaded registered accounti send legal document second time attention amazon blocked account tried anything support telephone feedback already understand money back today logged account money money blocked account lot hard work document losted nervesso confidently say amazon scammer,0.01947824836456175,0.9805217516354382,0.09085810431856421,0.2,0.8084324966814319,80.84324966814319,High Trust
