Laimonas,/users/540f3a950000640001898205,GB,10.0,2020-02-20 10:49:37+00:00,1.0,Amazon making unauthorized transaction after account closed,"My partner bought 165 GBP Phillips vacuum cleaner. 1,5 weeks later vacuum cleaner died . Partner talked to Amazon and they agree sent new one . Weeks later they demanded to sent old one . First of all was nothing mentioned in chat with agent , second they aspect us to pay for return postage third was no instructions given . Usually they replace when sent back old one if they requested. My partner closed Amazon account same day after they demanded to pay for old one another 165 GBP. So after over month past since this happened and account was closed  Amazon managed to make unauthorized transaction and took 165 GBP out of his account yesterday . You are disgrace. Shame on you . Do not save your card details on Amazon, buy as you go if you do. I will close my account and use eBay .",2020-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,20.0,789,149,59,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,partner bought gbp phillips vacuum cleaner week later vacuum cleaner died partner talked amazon agree sent new one week later demanded sent old one first nothing mentioned chat agent second aspect u pay return postage third instruction given usually replace sent back old one requested partner closed amazon account day demanded pay old one another gbp month past since happened account closed amazon managed make unauthorized transaction took gbp account yesterday disgrace shame save card detail amazon buy go close account use ebay,0.020603866313941302,0.9793961336860587,0.08356702187324734,0.2,0.8064114712176789,80.64114712176789,High Trust
