P,/users/5e4e5bc285f62fbd23e24275,KR,1.0,2020-02-20 10:14:18+00:00,1.0,"Extremely unfriendly, unhelpful Customer Service Team","I ordered a laptop stand (space gray), got a silver one instead, I inquired the Amazon customer service team, who asked me to just keep it, I said ""no, I want the product that was promised,"" they told me in that case to pay for the international shipping cost for replacement, I said ""no, I am not willing to pay for Amazon’s mistake."" They eventually promised to send me another replacement without a cost, got a silver one again. I contacted the customer service again who weren't so friendly and helpful enough to resolve my issue without causing any further inconvenience i.e. They told me that I had to return the wrongful item via taking a long, adventurous, and mysterious trip to find a DHL/UPS service center in my country whose location is unknown to me, otherwise would be automatically charged twice to cover the “free item.” They also threatened me that if I do not pay for the ""free item"" without returning it, I will be placing my “account under jeopardy,” which they refused to further elaborate on what they meant by that. I was very convinced that the color that I received was not what was described in the product description (unless I have an opthalmologic medical condition of which I am not aware). Extremely unfriendly, stubborn, unwise people who are not suited to deal with customer service at all.On the next day, the seller contacted me directly, waived me off of the stupid return hassle and gave me a discount coupon for all the inconvenience.",2020-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,20.0,1473,258,53,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered laptop stand space gray got silver one instead inquired amazon customer service team asked keep said want product promised told case pay international shipping cost replacement said willing pay amazon’s mistake eventually promised send another replacement without cost got silver one contacted customer service werent friendly helpful enough resolve issue without causing inconvenience ie told return wrongful item via taking long adventurous mysterious trip find dhlups service center country whose location unknown otherwise would automatically charged twice cover “free item” also threatened pay free item without returning placing “account jeopardy” refused elaborate meant convinced color received described product description unless opthalmologic medical condition aware extremely unfriendly stubborn unwise people suited deal customer service allon next day seller contacted directly waived stupid return hassle gave discount coupon inconvenience,0.003511847379452297,0.9964881526205477,0.1446999439147504,0.2,0.827184065093224,82.71840650932239,High Trust
