Jon Galvin,/users/5e4e1a216ca715ccd98055f4,US,3.0,2020-02-20 05:58:51+00:00,1.0,I ordered a two complete solar power…,"I ordered a two complete solar power systems from Amazon.  It involved a large number of small, sensitive electrical devices, components and connections.The boxes arrived in over-sized boxes with no packaging material at all.  Nothing was numbered or identified.  No invoice or package listing to identify any of the parts. Just a bunch of fragile components loose in a box.I ordered a hand held police scanner a month later.  It arrived poorly packaged also with absolutely NO packaging material to soften the blows from being thrown around during shipment.  No ""Fragile"" sticker, nothing!I'll never order anything again from this company.",2020-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,20.0,640,100,37,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered two complete solar power system amazon involved large number small sensitive electrical device component connectionsthe box arrived oversized box packaging material nothing numbered identified invoice package listing identify part bunch fragile component loose boxi ordered hand held police scanner month later arrived poorly packaged also absolutely packaging material soften blow thrown around shipment fragile sticker nothingill never order anything company,0.06499231407347576,0.9350076859265243,0.056085249579360626,0.2,0.7787208928791343,77.87208928791343,High Trust
Cynthia Butler,/users/5e4df01f7168c027774f9585,US,1.0,2020-02-20 02:34:24+00:00,1.0,If I could give them zero stars I…,If I could give them zero stars I would!!! I ordered hair for a client that was supposed to be delivered on a Wednesday guaranteed delivery and it was not delivered. I called Amazon and they told me I needed to talk to the carrier to see what my options were. The carrier tells me there is no way to get my package to me on time because the Amazon distribution center didn’t get the package out on time. I explained how important this is because this is my business and I can’t cancel on a client the night before that would make me look horrible! They then tell me I will need to pick up the package myself. This package is over 45 min from my house. I asked Amazon if they can compensate me for having to drive 45 min to get this package and they tell me they will give me $10 off my next order. $10 are you serious that doesn’t even pay for my gas to drive 45 min for a package that was guaranteed delivery. Then he asks me if I want to cancel my account. I asked to speak to someone higher up and he tells me he is the highest up they have wow so he must be the president of Amazon what a joke! I have been a prime member for years and to have an issue and be treated so awful blows my mind!,2020-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,20.0,1195,244,34,8,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,could give zero star would ordered hair client supposed delivered wednesday guaranteed delivery delivered called amazon told needed talk carrier see option carrier tell way get package time amazon distribution center didn’t get package time explained important business can’t cancel client night would make look horrible tell need pick package package min house asked amazon compensate drive min get package tell give next order serious doesn’t even pay gas drive min package guaranteed delivery asks want cancel account asked speak someone higher tell highest wow must president amazon joke prime member year issue treated awful blow mind,0.9951281343681969,0.004871865631803085,0.13684800897363994,0.2,0.3298055346106295,32.980553461062954,Low Trust
