Tracy DeFoe,/users/5e4d9ca385f62f00bae1f61d,US,1.0,2020-02-19 20:38:33+00:00,1.0,The very worst,"The very worst!  They sent me an email regarding recalled products and to contact customer service for a refund.  I contacted customer service and after over an hour of arguing with them, they said that I can't have a refund because the order is expired and it's to late.  Understand that by law they must refund recalled items. The product was purchased in August 2019 and the recall just came out on January 30, 2020 covering January 2013-November 2019.  This, by law, must be refunded, but no, they will let me return it with a restocking fee.  Yes, that is right, a restocking fee for a product that is recalled and they are going to restock it!!!!!!   WTH!!!!!!!  How does Amazon get away with this?  I am contact the FDA, the BBB and t",2020-02-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,19.0,741,134,14,3,0.0,0,14,2,1,Suspicious,worst sent email regarding recalled product contact customer service refund contacted customer service hour arguing said cant refund order expired late understand law must refund recalled item product purchased august recall came january covering january november law must refunded let return restocking fee yes right restocking fee product recalled going restock wth amazon get away contact fda bbb,0.9999999821122548,1.788774517397229e-08,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.3150308558311412,31.50308558311412,Low Trust
