Elmer Brown,/users/5aec79bd4de5666d3420cb1d,US,5.0,2020-02-19 16:02:10+00:00,1.0,"Very poor customer support, knowledge",I purchase quite a few thing on Amazon and they have some of the worst representative I have ever encountered. The majority of them you can't understand them or have no knowledge of what they are talking about. Recently I returned and item I had not opened to UPS. The Amazon representative told me once item is scanned by UPS I would received my credit back into my gift card within 1 to 2 hrs. 20 hrs later no credit appeared on my account. Called Amazon got a representative you could not understand and was told once Amazon receives item you will get credit applied.Another example on a previous return received e-mail that I would receive money back on my credit card in 3 to 5 days. Waited full 5 days checking each day up to that 5 days. Received no money back. Called Amazon and this representative told me it was applied to my gift card balance. Incorrect information passed onto consumers all the time. I call Amazon at least 3 times a week about screw up with their service. Getting to much of a hassle to shop with them any more. Starting to seek out other online sellers.,2020-02-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,19.0,1084,200,37,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchase quite thing amazon worst representative ever encountered majority cant understand knowledge talking recently returned item opened ups amazon representative told item scanned ups would received credit back gift card within hr hr later credit appeared account called amazon got representative could understand told amazon receives item get credit appliedanother example previous return received email would receive money back credit card day waited full day checking day day received money back called amazon representative told applied gift card balance incorrect information passed onto consumer time call amazon least time week screw service getting much hassle shop starting seek online seller,0.00877876460