North Walsham Nigel,/users/4efae177000064000110f14c,GB,24.0,2020-02-13 21:06:54+00:00,1.0,Amazon refuses to cancel a subscription.,"I purchased an item back in June 2019 and somehow, unbeknown to me I was given a free one month subscription. As I didn’t know about it I didn’t cancel it. Since then I have had my credit card charged each month for the subscription fee, £7.99.After the purchase I cancelled my Amazon account due to other problems, receiving unordered goods which is not uncommon!However, the subscription was obviously not cancelled.As I don’t have an account, Amazon are not helpful and will not cancel the subscription. I am now in the process of having to cancel my credit card and get a new account just because they won’t help me.I shall never use Amazon again and advise anyone else to be careful and watch their credit card statements closely.",2020-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,13.0,735,129,40,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,purchased item back june somehow unbeknown given free one month subscription didn’t know didn’t cancel since credit card charged month subscription fee £after purchase cancelled amazon account due problem receiving unordered good uncommonhowever subscription obviously cancelledas don’t account amazon helpful cancel subscription process cancel credit card get new account won’t help mei shall never use amazon advise anyone else careful watch credit card statement closely,0.2084927797839213,0.7915072202160787,0.0723499719573752,0.2,0.7102236044995143,71.02236044995142,Medium Trust
