Paulette Williams,/users/5e40d27b12b06c1c76ef31f4,US,2.0,2020-02-10 13:33:03+00:00,1.0,You'll never hurt me again nor get my coins #PERIODTT,"UPDATE: Unbelievably, they had the audacity to reinstate my account, and ALLOW me to reorder, which is totally hilarious 😂. I just Pray, for the sake of the other consumers, they still have, that they change their policy. Because, what happen to me was actually life changing, and an experience I wouldn't wish on my worst enemy. Thanks but NO THANKS, I'm scarred for life, after such let down. I mean I really have spent so much money with them, and to be treated that way is absolutely beyond me.After all the years that I've spent thousands of dollars with this company, the treatment I received today is absolutely horrifying. I had to create a new account, because my Prime, through T-Mobile was messed up. Once I finally got it fixed, I ordered $631.81 worth of merchandise, and not only did they cancel my order, but they suspended my account as well smh. I can understand precautions, as it relates to the possibilities of fraud. But, for these companies, your mobile number, in so many ways, mimics your SSN, and we're talking about a Fortune 500 company, you mean to tell me, there's no system in place to cross reference accounts; regardless of the difference between emails and delivery addresses being used, while traveling. MY PHONE NUMBER has remained constant throughout the entire time. Never ever again will I allow anyone to get me crying mad, the way these reps did me today. I'm actually begging you to allow me to spend my money with you??? I'm the fool lol 😂 lls 🤣... But, I just didn't feel like sitting down and surfing the web all over again, with another merchant. But, seeing that the day is gone, and mind you, my order was placed EARLIER, without resolve, looks like I have no other choice. I just hate that I lost Prime Video, and to keep it 💯, I doubt I find that same Mother's Day birthstone necklace elsewhere, but I can't force them to cross check their own obviously out dated system, to work with a loyal customer, opposed to being a tremendous hindrance. Nonetheless, I'm comfortable within, that I waited long enough, and for whatever reason, it just wasn't meant for me to spend with them, and I'm okay with that 👌🙄😭💔💯💪",2020-02-10 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,10.0,2159,384,53,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,update unbelievably audacity reinstate account allow reorder totally hilarious 😂 pray sake consumer still change policy happen actually life changing experience wouldnt wish worst enemy thanks thanks im scarred life let mean really spent much money treated way absolutely beyond meafter year ive spent thousand dollar company treatment received today absolutely horrifying create new account prime tmobile messed finally got fixed ordered worth merchandise cancel order suspended account well smh understand precaution relates possibility fraud company mobile number many way mimic ssn talking fortune company mean tell there system place cross reference account regardless difference email delivery address used traveling phone number remained constant throughout entire time never ever allow anyone get cry mad way rep today im actually begging allow spend money im fool lol 😂 lls 🤣 didnt feel like sitting surfing web another merchant seeing day gone mind order placed earlier without resolve look like choice hate lost prime video keep 💯 doubt find mother day birthstone necklace elsewhere cant force cross check obviously dated system work loyal customer opposed tremendous hindrance nonetheless im comfortable within waited long enough whatever reason wasnt meant spend im okay 👌🙄😭💔💯💪,0.00988663652429535,0.9901133634757047,0.2153673583847448,0.2,0.8381301534148013,83.81301534148014,High Trust
