Dennis Campbell,/users/5e40890548e557a35ee91c64,US,5.0,2020-02-09 22:34:58+00:00,1.0,Beware gift card purchases if you have card info on file,"I joined Amazon for 4k tv and discovered good deals. But I started buying Amazon gift cards at Kroger to get extra fuel rewards. I had my bank accounts and credit card listed for other purchases but what I ordered was confirmed as strictly a gift card purchase. I got dog food shipped one time without ordering or showing being subscribed but I dismissed it. Then I started noticing a 1.81 charge to my bank account. I have overdraft but was maxed for paying off a credit card. So the 1.81 caused an overdraft fee. Which caused more. Then my auto insurance payment I thought went through didn't because it was the up in excess charges. I spent five hours trying to clear it up. So far I have three obvious overdraft that are supposed to be credited. But I cannot get answers as to how they could approve a gift card purchase with not enough funds or how to get a refund for said gift cards. All they will say is they bill upon shipment. But Nobody ships before payment, especially if extra charges have not been approved. And I ordered many parts with 3 cards. They charged extra money to my bank twice.This is not by accident and it is not legal. I do not leave my information for people to just use at will",2020-02-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,9.0,1208,227,56,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,joined amazon k tv discovered good deal started buying amazon gift card kroger get extra fuel reward bank account credit card listed purchase ordered confirmed strictly gift card purchase got dog food shipped one time without ordering showing subscribed dismissed started noticing charge bank account overdraft maxed paying credit card caused overdraft fee caused auto insurance payment thought went didnt excess charge spent five hour trying clear far three obvious overdraft supposed credited cannot get answer could approve gift card purchase enough fund get refund said gift card say bill upon shipment nobody ship payment especially extra charge approved ordered many part card charged extra money bank twicethis accident legal leave information people use,0.00915712063183623,0.9908428793681637,0.12731351654514864,0.2,0.8208841429931116,82.08841429931117,High Trust
