Rosie,/users/5e3e812648e55756a5e85974,AU,1.0,2020-02-12 20:12:10+00:00,1.0,“Arriving by 8pm” Not!,"What happened:I ordered my product on the 19th of January, then on the 8th of February it said that my package was arriving that day by 8pm. Then, after 8pm it said it was delayed! I had been waiting all day for it. Talk about disappointment. Then it happened again. I did the same. Now my order is lost in the post! I am sooooo angry I want to scream. And you know what? I did.Why I gave Amazon these stars:I gave Amazon 1 Star because they are terrible. I will never get back those hours I spent looking at cars going past to see if one of them was my delivery. Overall I think:Amazon should keep to when they say you are getting your delivery. And overlook their delivery promises. Amazon sometimes deliver on time or early, so that gave me false hope it would come earlier.I hope that other websites have greater reliability with delivery times.",2020-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,12.0,849,158,22,4,4.0,0,2,0,0,Genuine,happenedi ordered product th january th february said package arriving day pm pm said delayed waiting day talk disappointment happened order lost post sooooo angry want scream know didwhy gave amazon starsi gave amazon star terrible never get back hour spent looking car going past see one delivery overall thinkamazon keep say getting delivery overlook delivery promise amazon sometimes deliver time early gave false hope would come earlieri hope website greater reliability delivery time,0.1681116068199679,0.831888393180032,0.0886146943353898,0.2,0.7336671354570939,73.36671354570939,Medium Trust
