Allyssa,/users/5a99c8c74de5666d3468f67d,US,2.0,2020-02-08 15:34:57+00:00,1.0,Amazon Shipping and Customer Service seriously lacking,"A piece of furniture arrived to me in a box that looked like it had been dropped from the top shelf more than once or twice. It was shipped directly from Amazon Warehouse. The box was taped up a million times, and there were chunks missing from the box. The pieces inside were broken and unusable. I called amazon and they refused to replace the item. They offered to return it, and I could place a new order, but now the item is $50 more than I paid. They then refused to honor the price I paid. Extremely poor customer service from Amazon as well as the agent who assisted, who could care less about what happened.",2020-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,8.0,616,117,54,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,piece furniture arrived box looked like dropped top shelf twice shipped directly amazon warehouse box taped million time chunk missing box piece inside broken unusable called amazon refused replace item offered return could place new order item paid refused honor price paid extremely poor customer service amazon well agent assisted could care less happened,0.018317697094365207,0.9816823029056347,0.06561974200785194,0.2,0.8039650998543877,80.39650998543877,High Trust
