Jo Cooke,/users/5e3e8acabef4a446296aaa8f,GB,5.0,2020-02-08 10:39:11+00:00,1.0,Long term customer feed up with Prime and being messed about.,I've been an Amazon customer since it started in the UK. I got Prime when it first started and for many years bought a year membership. My daughter called about a query and they cancelled the member without asking and now I have to pay monthly. Prime stuff often takes days to arrive and I never know when it's coming so I spend days waiting for delivery. I order from them because I struggle with my health but I'm so disappointed with the service that I am starting to purchase elsewhere and finding stuff cheaper and getting better deliveries. Amazon's loss others gain.,2020-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,8.0,573,103,61,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive amazon customer since started uk got prime first started many year bought year membership daughter called query cancelled member without asking pay monthly prime stuff often take day arrive never know coming spend day waiting delivery order struggle health im disappointed service starting purchase elsewhere finding stuff cheaper getting better delivery amazon loss others gain,0.006652322333427771,0.9933476776665723,0.05776780706674145,0.2,0.8082274002466344,80.82274002466345,High Trust
Claire Ireland,/users/5e3e53d968c4b966e2c52a87,IE,2.0,2020-02-08 06:23:43+00:00,1.0,They made changes to my payment details…,"They made changes to my payment details without my knowledge or authorisation (something they should not have access to do). I raised a ticket for suspected data breach, they spent 2 weeks telling me they were investigating and would update when they knew more. Then in the end they refused to provide me with any information on the outcome of the investigation and closed off the issue by issuing me ""goodwill credit"". Do not trust them with your card data! They obviously had a breach but didn't want to admit this, so tried to silence me by issuing some credit.  I've reported them to the Payments Regulator!",2020-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,8.0,611,107,40,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,made change payment detail without knowledge authorisation something access raised ticket suspected data breach spent week telling investigating would update knew end refused provide information outcome investigation closed issue issuing goodwill credit trust card data obviously breach didnt want admit tried silence issuing credit ive reported payment regulator,0.20999918336332277,0.7900008166366772,0.06001121704991587,0.2,0.7070026517283217,70.70026517283216,Medium Trust
