Jacki Carder,/users/5e3df9fb68c4b947a2c519f9,US,1.0,2020-02-08 00:00:16+00:00,1.0,I know there are many people who love…,"I know there are many people who love Amazon, but I'm not one of them.  I'm tired of getting charged for Amazon Prime when I specifically do not sign up for it.  Then I have to make multiple calls to get the money credited back to my acct. The last time the gal said it would be 3-5 days to show up, only to find out she never put it through.  Then call today & the guys says he will report ger & to give him 5 min & I would gr et a confirmation email sent so I'd know it was put into the system.  Well that's been about 4 hours ago.  I've had it, if I have to choose between ordering something from Amazon & not, I guess I do without.",2020-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,8.0,635,133,38,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,know many people love amazon im one im tired getting charged amazon prime specifically sign make multiple call get money credited back acct last time gal said would day show find never put call today guy say report ger give min would gr et confirmation email sent id know put system well thats hour ago ive choose ordering something amazon guess without,0.009981660074140693,0.9900183399258593,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.8099278463510395,80.99278463510396,High Trust
Karen Traettino Petralia Imperatrice,/users/5e3dbf3848e5572b44e81faa,US,1.0,2020-02-07 19:50:01+00:00,1.0,Amazon Shipping Sucks,"I am done with Amazon. The past 2 months I have had 4 delivery problems, 2 of them happened within the past 2 days. This past Wednesday my package was delivered to the wrong house. After complaining to customer service, I was reassured this would not happen again. I ordered something yesterday and today it was delivered to the same wrong house. My house number is 56, they keep delivering it to house number 60 even though package clearly has my correct house number. I have been a prime member for many years and even today I was told repeatedly this will not happen again. 2 other times I never even got my package. Beware from now on when ordering from Amazon, their shipping sucks lately. Goodbye Amazon, I will no longer be ordering from you.",2020-02-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,7.0,749,136,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,done amazon past month delivery problem happened within past day past wednesday package delivered wrong house complaining customer service reassured would happen ordered something yesterday today delivered wrong house house number keep delivering house number even though package clearly correct house number prime member many year even today told repeatedly happen time never even got package beware ordering amazon shipping suck lately goodbye amazon longer ordering,0.03607560770294677,0.9639243922970532,0.07627593942793046,0.2,0.7972173840341127,79.72173840341127,High Trust
Peter,/users/5e3d90ad12b06cc3c4ee0735,US,1.0,2020-02-07 16:31:57+00:00,1.0,Beware of their process,"I bought a item on Amazon which generally works out.  However, this product failed and the company did not honor its warranty.  Amazon refuses to let me post that the manufacturer does not honor its warranty.  They want to hide that fact. I can review the product, but any buyers of any other products from the same company will not know of this warranty failure.  In an open market where amazon says they wanted users to have all the information about a product, I am shocked by this response from Amazon.  I have had 3 phone calls with their customer service and thus far they have not done what they said they will do.  So while most times things work out, beware if there is a problem.",2020-02-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,7.0,689,127,23,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought item amazon generally work however product failed company honor warranty amazon refuse let post manufacturer honor warranty want hide fact review product buyer product company know warranty failure open market amazon say wanted user information product shocked response amazon phone call customer service thus far done said time thing work beware problem,0.015413121331626816,0.9845868786683731,0.071228266965788,0.2,0.8065390927273441,80.65390927273441,High Trust
Linda Clouse,/users/5d8b83d5ac80765c40764996,US,4.0,2020-02-07 15:38:09+00:00,3.0,Take no responsibility,"I am giving Amazon three stars because I have had one positive and one negative experience with Amazon customer service over many years. I ordered a settee from Amazon and was given a delivery date of Thursday.  All day Thursday Amazon showed that the settee was scheduled to arrive by 8 PM. It never arrived. I understood all of that, but on Friday the Amazon organization lost their credibility with me. On Friday, I received an email from Amazon saying they had a glitch and they would let me know when my item shipped and when it was expected to arrive. I read that to mean it could arrive in a week, six weeks, two months. I called customer service to get a more specific delivery date; they said they didn't know. I was told to call back next week to see if they had more information. They would give me no information as to why there was a delay in delivery. I have been a Prime member since the beginning and an Amazon customer long before that. I have never been left with such incompetent, open-ended information in my extended experience with them. Perhaps they're getting too big for their boots.",2020-02-07 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,7.0,1108,202,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,giving amazon three star one positive one negative experience amazon customer service many year ordered settee amazon given delivery date thursday day thursday amazon showed settee scheduled arrive pm never arrived understood friday amazon organization lost credibility friday received email amazon saying glitch would let know item shipped expected arrive read mean could arrive week six week two month called customer service get specific delivery date said didnt know told call back next week see information would give information delay delivery prime member since beginning amazon customer long never left incompetent openended information extended experience perhaps theyre getting big boot,0.0079899888