Martin F,/users/5afd758f4de5666d34759c90,US,6.0,2020-02-04 19:05:07+00:00,1.0,Terrible experience - Buy somewhere else,"Had a terrible experience buying from Amazon.Ordered a bed frame, turned out the price was more than if I had bought it directly from the maker/brand, also the shipping was very slow.Never received the bed frame that I ordered, instead I received something else that I did not order. Amazon have now made it my problem to return the item that I have never ordered else they won´t return my money and/or deliver what I actually ordered. Also I have had to re-order what I actually ordered in the first place, because they won´t deliver what I have already ordered and paid for before the other item which I did not order is returned.So they have taken no responsibility for their mistake and have made their mistake my problem instead - which is not okay.Everyone makes mistakes but at least act as an adult and take your responsibility when it happens.Because I had to re-order as I cannot wait many weeks for my bed frame to arrive I have now paid double until they refund me the money, and ended up having to sign up for a Prime membership to not have to wait yet another long period to actually receive what I ordered in the first place.I cannot recommend using Amazon.Most products are cheaper at Walmart, Ebay or other places and if you haven´t signed up for Prime membership their shipping is slow and your order is neglected. It took them several days to get my order shipped.I will definitely not keep my Prime membership and will look to order from other places in the future.",2020-02-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,4.0,1485,267,40,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,terrible experience buying amazonordered bed frame turned price bought directly makerbrand also shipping slownever received bed frame ordered instead received something else order amazon made problem return item never ordered else won´t return money andor deliver actually ordered also reorder actually ordered first place won´t deliver already ordered paid item order returnedso taken responsibility mistake made mistake problem instead okayeveryone make mistake least act adult take responsibility happensbecause reorder cannot wait many week bed frame arrive paid double refund money ended sign prime membership wait yet another long period actually receive ordered first placei cannot recommend using amazonmost product cheaper walmart ebay place haven´t signed prime membership shipping slow order neglected took several day get order shippedi definitely keep prime membership look order place future,0.009106472873751542,0.9908935271262485,0.14974761637689288,0.2,0.8253962868385027,82.53962868385028,High Trust
