Tloluvin,/users/5e3863a2e5a4c77d858df402,US,2.0,2020-02-03 18:17:41+00:00,1.0,Buy somewhere else,"In the past I used Amazon with an acceptable level of success.  That has changed.  In the past year around 30% of the items I have purchased from Amazon have had a problem.  I have received things that were not the size I ordered.  I have received things whose actual size does not accord with the size claimed.  I have received things that were broken, and clearly a returned item, but were not advertised as returned.  I have received electronics that flat failed after 2 days.I'm a single father of 4 kids; I don't have time for the hassle of returning to Amazon a third of the items I order.  That is not convenience.Amazon is no longer simply an online storefront.  They create software like Rekognition, to help totalitarian governments oppress their people.  They create TV shows like Hunters, which will portray that any politically conservative American is a Nazi.  Maybe they should have stayed as just a storefront.  I can't buy from Amazon anymore, because I don't have the time to return a third of my order.  So, I will no longer need my Amazon Prime membership.",2020-02-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,3.0,1076,188,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,past used amazon acceptable level success changed past year around item purchased amazon problem received thing size ordered received thing whose actual size accord size claimed received thing broken clearly returned item advertised returned received electronics flat failed daysim single father kid dont time hassle returning amazon third item order convenienceamazon longer simply online storefront create software like rekognition help totalitarian government oppress people create tv show like hunter portray politically conservative american nazi maybe stayed storefront cant buy amazon anymore dont time return third order longer need amazon prime membership,0.011953043280687685,0.9880469567193123,0.10544026920919798,0.2,0.8151115322014958,8