Zoe Clark Adams,/users/5e36b3abfe8989582627f78b,GB,6.0,2020-02-02 11:34:24+00:00,1.0,Not even worthy of one star! Worst customer service ever!,"Not even worthy of one star!My account was hacked in October.  £1300 was taken from my account for fraudulent transactions.  Contacted amazon told them, they promised the money back within 48 hours.  Nothing happened, chased them 16 times. This was very financially difficult at Christmas time to have my account drained with no help of support from amazon. Finally they paid random amounts back to my account in December, nothing added up to the amounts taken and I was still hundreds of pounds out of pocket.  Numerous phone calls and unresponsive emails later, Finally Amazon instructed me to go to my bank and ask them for a charge back!   I did this, the money was then returned to me via my bank. Then amazon blocked my account and emailed me telling me until I repaid all the money back to them for the fraudulent transactions my account would remain blocked!!!   I have now called and emailed them 8 times, each time I am told that my account is being investigated and they will contact me within 48 hours, 48 hours goes past call again and I am told the same, your account is being investigated and we will contact you within 48 hours, repeat, repeat, repeat. Nothing has been sorted, you can’t speak to a supervisor, manager or the department that is looking into your account.  It is such poor, unbelievable customer service, I can’t work out how they can be this successful with this shocking treatment. Still just receiving emails about me owing them money, no response to any of my emails or phone calls. SHOCKING!!!!",2020-02-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,2.0,1531,267,57,10,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,even worthy one starmy account hacked october £ taken account fraudulent transaction contacted amazon told promised money back within hour nothing happened chased time financially difficult christmas time account drained help support amazon finally paid random amount back account december nothing added amount taken still hundred pound pocket numerous phone call unresponsive email later finally amazon instructed go bank ask charge back money returned via bank amazon blocked account emailed telling repaid money back fraudulent transaction account would remain blocked called emailed time time told account investigated contact within hour hour go past call told account investigated contact within hour repeat repeat repeat nothing sorted can’t speak supervisor manager department looking account poor unbelievable customer service can’t work successful shocking treatment still receiving email owing money response email phone call shocking,0.99989775161483,0.00010224838517003398,0.14974761637689288,0.2,0.3300006474679636,33.00006474679636,Low Trust
Charlene Hostetler,/users/5bdf760b4de5666d3447e326,US,5.0,2020-02-02 08:29:32+00:00,1.0,Major concerns about Amazon,"When a company’s security question is what is the date, month and year that you joined Amazon prime, that is insane, Think how many people at AMAZON have access to that answer by just looking at your account. I have tried for almost 3 months to get back on Amazon after years of being a prime member, but they ask questions like that which I wouldn’t have a clue and it’s not important to me when I joined  Amazon prime. No wonder our world is in trouble! These young entrepreneurs may be smart, but they lack wisdom in a severe way. And their common sense is nil. I understand why some of my friends are canceling their Amazon accounts. Distrust will take a company downward.Charlene Hostetler",2020-02-02 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,2.0,694,126,27,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,company’s security question date month year joined amazon prime insane think many people amazon access answer looking account tried almost month get back amazon year prime member ask question like wouldn’t clue it’s important joined amazon prime wonder world trouble young entrepreneur may smart lack wisdom severe way common sense nil understand friend canceling amazon account distrust take company downwardcharlene hostetler,0.10455082832469695,0.895449171675303,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.7618580687316504,76.18580687316503,High Trust
