Michael Porter,/users/5e35b3eee5a4c707d68ccc35,US,2.0,2020-02-01 17:37:07+00:00,5.0,For those who have bad experiences,"For those who have bad experiences, if you communicate via email and track everything, you should almost always have a positive outcome. I recently moved, and before I moved I ordered an item which was estimated to be delivered after I was to be moved in to my new location. However, the item was delivered several days before I signed the lease for my new location. Armed with the tracking info which showed the date of delivery of the item, the info provided by Amazon of the estimated delivery time frame, and my lease documents which showed the date I took possession of my new location, i was able to successfully obtain a refund for that item which I never received.",2020-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,1.0,672,121,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bad experience communicate via email track everything almost always positive outcome recently moved moved ordered item estimated delivered moved new location however item delivered several day signed lease new location armed tracking info showed date delivery item info provided amazon estimated delivery time frame lease document showed date took possession new location able successfully obtain refund item never received,0.03840906384575032,0.9615909361542497,0.06786315199102635,1.0,1.9943680984753303,199.43680984753303,High Trust
