Michael,/users/5e225658ddcefa548359a65a,US,2.0,2020-02-01 01:37:36+00:00,5.0,It's Pretty Hard To Beat Amazon!,"It's pretty hard to beat Amazon, especially if you are a prime or business prime member like myself. Fast shipping, excellent customer service, and great products! If you have any issue with a order, they will do whatever it takes to resolve the issue (even giving people promo credit for the inconvenience) in a timely manner. GO AMAZON!",2020-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,1.0,338,58,32,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,pretty hard beat amazon especially prime business prime member like fast shipping excellent customer service great product issue order whatever take resolve issue even giving people promo credit inconvenience timely manner go amazon,0.4769900417989771,0.5230099582010229,0.03252944475602917,1.0,1.7680108680517173,176.80108680517174,High Trust
Kat,/users/5e34c260ddcefa68876323a3,US,1.0,2020-02-01 00:12:30+00:00,1.0,Cold Amazon,"I have always loved amazon! When I’m missing a package they always try to do the best to help me.Today was different my son who is three years old. He accidentally clicked on some very expensive apps. Unfortunately, the device app team was unable to help me.I truly feel sad about amazon now because it was warm & fuzzy. Now, it’s cold & heartless.",2020-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,1.0,348,64,11,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,always loved amazon i’m missing package always try best help metoday different son three year old accidentally clicked expensive apps unfortunately device app team unable help mei truly feel sad amazon warm fuzzy it’s cold heartless,0.20474469858720093,0.7952553014127991,0.0358945597307908,0.2,0.7048065626525577,70.48065626525577,Medium Trust
Waris Haris,/users/5e34c13fd1e2f9c55ca14a03,US,1.0,2020-02-01 00:07:36+00:00,1.0,Amazon doesn't care about you...,"Amazon doesn't care about your experience or your satisfaction. If you call them because  you had a bad experience, they won't provide you with a case number to keep a record of complaints. They won't categorize what issues they are experiencing or what customers are experiencing. If you bought a broken item and return it but it happens to you again and again then you started to complain about it by calling Amazon customer service... they won't keep a update or follow-up on the issue of the matter by not assisting you with a case number. This review I am leaving is from right after calling Amazon and realizing the person over the phone refused to leave a case number for me. I wanted a case number.  I don't want to explain the terrible experience I am given on a consent basis if I choose to purchase through Amazon.",2020-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,1.0,825,149,32,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon doesnt care experience satisfaction call bad experience wont provide case number keep record complaint wont categorize issue experiencing customer experiencing bought broken item return happens started complain calling amazon customer service wont keep update followup issue matter assisting case number review leaving right calling amazon realizing person phone refused leave case number wanted case number dont want explain terrible experience given consent basis choose purchase amazon,0.017635117673904695,0.9823648823260953,0.08356702187324734,0.2,0.8078958455376972,80.78958455376973,High Trust
Susan Cantrell,/users/5d9fa9a9b97c7b5ea1b96e76,US,8.0,2020-01-31 23:29:18+00:00,2.0,Lack of true customer service,"Lack of true customer service. Amazon use to pride themselves on service now they have outsourced and folks answering the phones in the Caribbean tell you what they think you want to hear. It now typically takes several phone calls to get anything accomplished.  We're Prime members and that now means nothing, including shipping time. So disgusted. Amazon you have become too big.",2020-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,31.0,381,63,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,lack true customer service amazon use pride service outsourced folk answering phone caribbean tell think want hear typically take several phone call get anything accomplished prime member mean nothing including shipping time disgusted amazon become big,0.043433544018649885,0.9565664559813501,0.035333707234997194,0.4,1.0853499694376745,108.53499694376745,High Trust
Brian McPhee,/users/5e34934ce5a4c7809b8c622e,FR,6.0,2020-01-31 20:51:33+00:00,5.0,A lifesaver,"I have been an Amazon customer since the very beginning - in the UK, the US and now France. I think their service quality is astonishingly good. Living in rural France it is a lifesaver. Just recently I have had my first returns and they were handled quickly and without fuss - maybe thanks to my many, many orders over the years. I think they should pay far more tax and pay their employees way more money - and I'd be happy to pay an extra 15% if I was confident it was going to staff wages.",2020-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,31.0,493,97,11,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer since beginning uk u france think service quality astonishingly good living rural france lifesaver recently first return handled quickly without fuss maybe thanks many many order year think pay far tax pay employee way money id happy pay extra confident going staff wage,0.07030373960859661,0.9296962603914034,0.05440269209197981,1.0,1.9757286686140976,197.57286686140975,High Trust
