Steven Watson,/users/585180e20000ff000a61ba8e,GB,29.0,2020-01-31 20:04:15+00:00,1.0,Amazon is not what it was... Such a shame,"I've always rated amazon. I've supported them for years and years since they were an online book company to the present day! I've always been a high recommender of Amazon and their customer service. But over the last 6-12 months the quality has severely declined! I've supported the amazon infrastructure buying all new produ ts but found that over time their quality has degraded also. I've always bought from amazon over ebay as I trusted their products but now I find the market flooded with cheap knockoffs and rubbish Chinese crap. Amazon is not the reputable decent and solid online company it once was, it has become diluted, and the customer service has become very lax and uncaring! Such a shame that the mighty has fallen!",2020-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,31.0,732,126,41,9,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,ive always rated amazon ive supported year year since online book company present day ive always high recommender amazon customer service last month quality severely declined ive supported amazon infrastructure buying new produ t found time quality degraded also ive always bought amazon ebay trusted product find market flooded cheap knockoff rubbish chinese crap amazon reputable decent solid online company become diluted customer service become lax uncaring shame mighty fallen,0.8777286933791139,0.12227130662088614,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.3752691362044419,37.52691362044419,Low Trust
