anonymous person,/users/5e328b27ddcefa672a61b25d,US,1.0,2020-01-30 07:52:35+00:00,1.0,Amazon's customer service is HORRIBLE,"Amazon's customer service is HORRIBLE. I ordered an apple watch a few days ago, hoped to get same day delivery (because that's what i chose out of the options for delivery). Only to realize that the shipment was delayed and the apple watch would only come the next day in the morning. Okay fine. But then, it was delivered to the WRONG address, not to my house, and a picture was taken of the package outside someone else's house. They decided to send me a replacement, I initially agreed hoping it would come soon but then decided to cancel it. I was tired of the crap amazon was putting me through, and I've been paying my hard earned money for a prime membership for the past seven years now. They don't deserve a dime of money if anything. One customer service representative I was speaking to tried to SCAM me. Yes you heard that right. She tried to connect me to the ""amazon carrier"" department, and asked for my phone number on the chat. Sounds phishy doesn't it? I gave her my number thinking she was being genuine and I got a call from a ""scam likely"" number. Just Terrible. After calling Amazon's real customer service number, I was able to get the replacement order cancelled, and i was told the charge was refunded and I shouldn't be charged for it. However I was, and I am absolutely disgusted with the way amazon has treated me as their customer. I can take my business elsewhere and I know for a fact I will be cancelling my prime membership. Amazon won't get a dime of money anymore.",2020-01-30 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,30.0,1499,276,37,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service horrible ordered apple watch day ago hoped get day delivery thats chose option delivery realize shipment delayed apple watch would come next day morning okay fine delivered wrong address house picture taken package outside someone elses house decided send replacement in