David,/users/5e2c77a7616781f6d1886a2a,US,1.0,2020-01-25 17:15:42+00:00,1.0,They delivered my packages to wrong…,"They delivered my packages to wrong address twice in 3 months. Only solution you have is to cancel and reorder the items. It takes 3-5 days to get your refund, and extra time to get the second delivery. I have Prime to get quick deliveries, but I ended up waiting more than a week to get my items. Amazon delivery drivers are careless.",2020-01-25 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,25.0,335,63,36,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,delivered package wrong address twice month solution cancel reorder item take day get refund extra time get second delivery prime get quick delivery ended waiting week get item amazon delivery driver careless,0.012735234935208582,0.9872647650647914,0.035333707234997194,0.2,0.8006991239793951,80.06991239793952,High Trust
