Justin,/users/5e2b4adbd1e2f962a99c6913,PT,48.0,2020-01-24 20:12:55+00:00,2.0,How the hell can a site that makes…,"How the hell can a site that makes millions (billions?) not have a simple way to message sellers? I had an email saying a seller said blahblahblah and wanted a response. Did I have to click on a button to respond? No. It involved navigating what can only be described as a maze, of countless different categories that seemed to have no relevance to messaging. Ebay is straightforward in comparison. Actually, EVERY OTHER site I have used involving a transaction between a seller and a buyer is easy. Amazon is the sole exception.",2020-01-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,24.0,529,93,35,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,hell site make million billion simple way message seller email saying seller said blahblahblah wanted response click button respond involved navigating described maze countless different category seemed relevance messaging ebay straightforward comparison actually every site used involving transaction seller buyer easy amazon sole exception,0.13138280506495653,0.8686171949350434,0.05215928210880538,0.4,1.0447404538892828,104.47404538892829,High Trust
Dr. LATA MARINA VARGHESE,/users/5e2b3728fe89895b7a2271e1,IN,1.0,2020-01-24 18:29:26+00:00,3.0,Received Refund for ASUS Vivobook from Seller,"I had placed an order for ASUS Vivobook X507UA-EJ838T  from AMAZON India and paid Rs. 30000 (COD). But unfortunately I received a defective product. It was my first online purchase for an electronic product and it turned out to be a disappointing & shocking experience.  After a few months of constant complaints and correspondence with  AMAZON, ICONS (Mumbai) and ASUS, I  finally received the refund although I had to pay Rs. 600 as courier charge for returning the defective product to the seller.Prof. (Dr.) Lata Marina Varghese",2020-01-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,24.0,532,87,45,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order asus vivobook xuaejt amazon india paid r cod unfortunately received defective product first online purchase electronic product turned disappointing shocking experience month constant complaint correspondence amazon icon mumbai asus finally received refund although pay r courier charge returning defective product sellerprof dr lata marina varghese,0.05911831287795854,0.9408816871220415,0.04879416713404375,0.6,1.3801996769878295,138.01996769878295,High Trust
4T's,/users/5e2aff59d1e2f9a2129c2bc1,US,1.0,2020-01-24 14:31:17+00:00,1.0,Disappointed,"First of all, I never write reviews, but I feel compelled to after getting off the phone with customer service regarding the status of my refund.  I ordered my husband a New England Patriots jacket for Christmas and the sizing ran small so I exchanged the jacket for a larger size, but instead received a Chargers jacket (not to mention the larger size cost an additional $33)!  That was disappointing and returned the jacket in December.  My account shows the jacket was received on January 8th and ""refund is processing"".  Well, it's been over 2 weeks, which prompted my call today.  I had a very hard time understanding the first associate and she put me on a long hold and returned to say, "" yes, we will process your refund and then she proceeded to say she would return a majority of the refund to a gift card.""  I was very confused as I had purchased both items on my debit card and never used a gift card.  She kept repeating that I had used a gift card and didn't seem to care what I was saying.  I asked to speak with a supervisor, and after a 5-7 minute hold was connected to a supervisor who was equally hard to understand and didn't seem to care whatsoever about my experience.  She said she had requested my refund to be returned to my debit card with no explanation of how long that would take.  When I asked how much longer, she said it could be another 5 business days.  Really!!  I've purchased some rather expensive items from Amazon and this is my first experience with a return.  Absolutely ridiculous!  It was very clear that either of these women cared less about me as a customer.  And, I feel if I hadn't called I would have never received a refund.",2020-01-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,24.0,1674,308,12,1,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,first never write review feel compelled getting phone customer service regarding status refund ordered husband new england patriot jacket christmas sizing ran small exchanged jacket larger size instead received charger jacket mention larger size cost additional disappointing returned jacket december account show jacket received january th refund processing well week prompted call today hard time understanding first associate put long hold returned say yes process refund proceeded say would return majority refund gift card confused purchased item debit card never used gift card kept repeating used gift card didnt seem care saying asked speak supervisor minute hold connected supervisor equally hard understand didnt seem care whatsoever experience said requested refund returned debit card explanation long would take asked much longer said could another business day really ive purchased rather expensive item amazon first experience return absolutely ridiculous clear either woman cared less customer feel hadnt called would never received refund,0.8850773641174642,0.11492263588253582,0.17274256870443072,0.2,0.39200983168215403,39.2009831682154,Low Trust
Larry Haynes,/users/5e2af3b1e5a4c7b87f87532d,US,5.0,2020-01-24 13:43:04+00:00,3.0,I used to love amazon,"I used to love amazon. I've been a solid customer for over 8 years. Probably spend over $5,000 a year with them. More and more with each passing year. Now their service has gotten worse, prices increased, and more and more shipping problems. Amazon get your act together.",2020-01-24 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,24.0,271,48,21,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used love amazon ive solid customer year probably spend year passing year service gotten worse price increased shipping problem amazon get act together,0.02668714389567029,0.9733128561043297,0.0269209197980931,0.6,1.3920406120117834,139.20406120117835,High Trust
