Phyllis Snelson,/users/5e29d00dd1e2f9072b9b909e,US,2.0,2020-01-23 17:00:34+00:00,1.0,My last 3 orders have been a nightmare,"My last 3 orders have been a nightmare. 1st order was a blanket. A gift when it got to the  Destination my son had to pay an extra 20.00 for shipping. 2nd Order never arrived but I was charged. 3rd order my account was charged, but Amazon said my bank denied payment.  So they cancel my order. But charged my bank account. Been on the phone with the bank an them all morning.Amazon SUCKS. Watch your bank account when it comes to them. I will no longer shop Amazon. It isn't worth the headache anymore.",2020-01-23 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,23.0,502,95,38,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,last order nightmare st order blanket gift got destination son pay extra shipping nd order never arrived charged rd order account charged amazon said bank denied payment cancel order charged bank account phone bank morningamazon suck watch bank account come longer shop amazon isnt worth headache anymore,0.02007031552752257,0.9799296844724774,0.0532809871003926,0.2,0.8006210396563171,80.06210396563172,High Trust
