Joseph Essa,/users/5e1eeaeeddcefa65b057aa53,FR,7.0,2020-01-22 13:42:11+00:00,1.0,"Amazon, the Hardcore Usurpers","We all know amazon's motto: ""customers first"" except that it's easy to refund customers when 85% of the products don't belong to them (it's also difficult to get refunds on products that belong to them).Amazon takes commissions of up to 25% just for appearing on their site. It can go up to more than 50% if they handle the delivery. It's like ordering products from amazon, until something goes wrong:""it's this salesman's fault"" ""it's not our fault"" ""we can't do anything for you"" ""Actually, it wasn't us who sold you this product""A scam? A counterfeit product?""It's not our fault.""And they still charge us for their Prime delivery, which is worthless, even though we've told them 40 times we don't want it.But on the other hand, when honest salesmen are robbed of their market by this trade monopoly with its aggressive marketing, they are forced to prostitute themselves in amazon to hope to make sales.This disgusting enterprise appropriates the success of successful salesmen. But at the slightest false step, or when the salesman threatens to encroach on the headless monster's success, Amazon holds all the salesmen's money and products in its warehouses hostage, and lets the salesman get his hands on a robot that has to check documents (it costs less than a human, of course), here's how it goes:Amazon support robot:""Please submit invoices for product X dated within the last 365 days.""Amazon vendors:""What, what bill?""Amazon support robot:""We're sorry, some information is missing. Please submit invoices for product X dated within the last 365 days.""Amazon vendors:""You're mistaken, I've never sold this product and I don't intend to sell it.""Amazon support robot:""We're sorry, there's some information missing. Please submit invoices for product X dated within the last 365 days.""Amazon vendors:""I have told you that I DO NOT SELL this product and I NEVER SELL IT, I NEVER BUY IT and therefore I HAVE NO INVOICES.""Amazon support robot:""Please submit invoices for product X dated within the last 365 days. Please note, after 4 unsuccessful requests, we may be able to close your account permanently and keep the funds and stock"".The vendors hire a lawyer, sue that disgusting piece of filth from Amazon and get their case, but guess what?Pay the damages and reimburse the attorney's fees? You're naive, you haven't read the terms and conditions of the seller's contract that you agreed to ""we, as the world's leading trading company, can do whatever we want"".In conclusion, a company that thinks it is a state to create its own laws. But we still don't understand how sellers can have such CLEAN LOVE by selling their products to this IMMONDY that treats them like dogs.At Amazon, they are above it all: 47% negative reviews on Trustpilot but they don't even respond, it would cost too much, and anyway it's not their fault.",2020-01-22 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,22.0,2838,467,29,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,know amazon motto customer first except easy refund customer product dont belong also difficult get refund product belong themamazon take commission appearing site go handle delivery like ordering product amazon something go wrongits salesman fault fault cant anything actually wasnt u sold producta scam counterfeit productits faultand still charge u prime delivery worthless even though weve told time dont want itbut hand honest salesman robbed market trade monopoly aggressive marketing forced prostitute amazon hope make salesthis disgusting enterprise appropriates success successful salesman slightest false step salesman threatens encroach headless monster success amazon hold salesmens money product warehouse hostage let salesman get hand robot check document cost less human course here goesamazon support robotplease submit invoice product x dated within last daysamazon vendorswhat billamazon support robotwere sorry information missing please submit invoice product x dated within last daysamazon vendorsyoure mistaken ive never sold product dont intend sell itamazon support robotwere sorry there information missing please submit invoice product x dated within last daysamazon vendorsi told sell product never sell never buy therefore invoicesamazon support robotplease submit invoice product x dated within last day please note unsuccessful request may able close account permanently keep fund stockthe vendor hire lawyer sue disgusting piece filth amazon get case guess whatpay damage reimburse attorney fee youre naive havent read term condition seller contract agreed world leading trading company whatever wantin conclusion company think state create law still dont understand seller clean love selling product immondy treat like dogsat amazon negative review trustpilot dont even respond would cost much anyway fault,0.0055105251189813955,0.9944894748810186,0.2619181155356141,0.2,0.8496283605476321,84.96283605476322,High Trust
