JE,/users/5e15eca2fa8e7bec03d1b73f,US,3.0,2020-01-20 18:54:52+00:00,1.0,"If you are a ""seller"" be prepared to be…","If you are a ""seller"" be prepared to be ripped off by this giant!  The fall of Amazon will come about because of how poorly they their vendors or people who resell on their platform.  Not only do they charge absorbent fees to ""sell"" but they take 2 weeks to pay you as a vendor. Then if you happen to have a credit card that expired on your seller account they will hold your money because the card didn't work.  First of all, why do they need my credit card when they are withdrawing money from my funds of what I sold?  Second, why does it take 2-3 days to resubmit an ""exception"" to get our funds to us?  There is NO REASON for their lame delay and lame excuses other than they want to try to slap your hands as if you did something wrong!  Amazon strives hard to ship out packages and get them to customers in the same day or within a day or two. Yet, if there is some lame excuse for them to hold up a resellers funds they will do it in a flash.",2020-01-20 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,20.0,950,190,40,9,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,seller prepared ripped giant fall amazon come poorly vendor people resell platform charge absorbent fee sell take week pay vendor happen credit card expired seller account hold money card didnt work first need credit card withdrawing money fund sold second take day resubmit exception get fund u reason lame delay lame excuse want try slap hand something wrong amazon strives hard ship package get customer day within day two yet lame excuse hold resellers fund flash,0.17157215786342483,0.8284278421365752,0.1065619742007852,0.2,0.7355263159084446,73.55263159084447,Medium Trust
