Hillary,/users/5771caa00000ff000a2ce0f6,US,11.0,2020-01-19 23:27:10+00:00,5.0,I know it's not a popular opinion to…,"I know it's not a popular opinion to love Amazon, but I do. I've never once had a problem with an item that Amazon did not correct including times when an item was lost or damage and Amazon had to give me more credit than I had paid so I could buy a new one. Word to the wise: Always Call to use Customer Service & be nice. You should hear some of the horror stories I've heard from customer service reps from Amazon. The person on the phone did not do anything to you personally so don't take out your grievance on them. Also, USA is called the melting pot for a reason; if you have a problem with your rep having an accent that's on your small mind. I live in NYC in a borough where 142 languages are spoken- the most in the world- guess what? Other people have accents. Get over it. I buy a LOT of items from Amazon Warehouse Deals and am usually happy, but if I'm not, Amazon will accept my return with no fuss. I still support small business, but there's no beating Amazon's convenience.",2020-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,19.0,992,193,37,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,know popular opinion love amazon ive never problem item amazon correct including time item lost damage amazon give credit paid could buy new one word wise always call use customer service nice hear horror story ive heard customer service rep amazon person phone anything personally dont take grievance also usa called melting pot reason problem rep accent thats small mind live nyc borough language spoken world guess people accent get buy lot item amazon warehouse deal usually happy im amazon accept return fuss still support small business there beating amazon convenience,0.018646025216331012,0.981353974783669,0.10824453168816602,1.0,2.012325893729468,201.2325893729468,High Trust
