Blynn,/users/5e2472c5e5a4c789c783bbf4,US,1.0,2020-01-19 16:06:22+00:00,1.0,Beware if you are using gift cards,We have been Prime members since the service started.  I have noticed over the last year that customer service has greatly declined.  If you have a problem - it takes HOURS to try to resolve. If you ask for a manager they do not want to get one and you can not even tell it you really have one when they finally do.  Yesterday took me 2 hours - 4 reps (3 online and one by phone)  They gave me a bogus email to mail my proof in to - it does not work.  (cs-reply).  I have tried 3 times all come back saying 'nobody@bounces.' When I asked for a different email they would not give me one (THEY asked me to send proof) It is ridiculous.  I had a 12.60 balance in gift cards.  I added in 100. (75 card and 25 card).  My balance then said 106.70.  Should have said 112.60 (100 + 12.60)   112.60 Minus 91.70 = 20.90.  But I have 5.90.  I asked if they could check the cards or their program because it is not seeming to add and subtract correctly.  NOPE. They asked if I had taken screen shots each time.  WOW.... now when we add in gift cards we need to take a screen shot each time so we have 'proof'.  There is no way to look back at gift card additions to ones acct.  But they want screen shots that wont make it there cause - bogus email addresses given.  What a racket.  They will make many more millions in unused gift card money.  Pretty disgusted right now and thinking over if Amazon is worth it - and we spend thousands at Amazon a year.,2020-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,19.0,1443,283,34,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime member since service started noticed last year customer service greatly declined problem take hour try resolve ask manager want get one even tell really one finally yesterday took hour rep online one phone gave bogus email mail proof work csreply tried time come back saying nobodybounces asked different email would give one asked send proof ridiculous balance gift card added card card balance said said minus asked could check card program seeming add subtract correctly nope asked taken screen shot time wow add gift card need take screen shot time proof way look back gift card addition one acct want screen shot wont make cause bogus email address given racket make many million unused gift card money pretty disgusted right thinking amazon worth spend thousand amazon year,0.011091147537668582,0.9889088524623314,0.15872125630959058,0.2,0.8261986774930838,82.61986774930838,High Trust
Paul S,/users/5e2471436167814e0b84134c,US,1.0,2020-01-19 15:25:15+00:00,1.0,More miserable Amazon customer service,"Been a Amazon member for quite a while and for the most part they have been good to deal with until now.Since I buy quite a bit on Amazon I always reconcile my credit card statement and compare it to my Amazon charges monthly. Well this month I noticed a charge I didn't recognize so I called Amazon customer service for an explanation.The person I spoke to stated they could not find the order or charge amount either and told me to dispute it with my credit card company, which I did. My Amazon account was immediately locked down when I did that. So I called customer service back about 3 times to fix the issue.The new customer service person had no problem locating the order in question and couldn't understand why the first customer service person couldn't and then told me to dispute it, which they have a record of.They advised me to reverse the dispute which I did.Did they unlock my account after they discovered the problem was their fault, NOPE, tough luck nothing we can do until they get the money back in about a week.So I am denied all the Amazon services I paid for due to their error. Some of the other online services like Walmart, Target, Costco and others are stepping up their game with better pricing so I have switched to them this past week and may continue. Amazon has gotten huge and unfriendly.",2020-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,19.0,1323,241,38,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon member quite part good deal nowsince buy quite bit amazon always reconcile credit card statement compare amazon charge monthly well month noticed charge didnt recognize called amazon customer service explanationthe person spoke stated could find order charge amount either told dispute credit card company amazon account immediately locked called customer service back time fix issuethe new customer service person problem locating order question couldnt understand first customer service person couldnt told dispute record ofthey advised reverse dispute diddid unlock account discovered problem fault nope tough luck nothing get money back weekso denied amazon service paid due error online service like walmart target costco others stepping game better pricing switched past week may continue amazon gotten huge unfriendly,0.011553663579885486,0.9884463364201145,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.8212562585073091,82.12562585073091,High Trust
Reagan,/users/5b8fc9ce4de5666d347d4164,US,3.0,2020-01-19 13:19:36+00:00,1.0,AMAZON WORST SERVICE EVER!!!,"This has been the worst week (12/26-1/4)& this has to be the worst customer service I have ever had with Amazon. I been a prime user for a long time as its always been really convenient for me even if there was a price diff as to going in the store as alot of times, I dont want to go & battle people in the store when I deal with angry people day in and out as a call center supervisor/trainer.  This past week, I let myself believe that I could use my prime account to order my puppy & two cats items instead of going somewhere more reasonable like CHEWY.  I ordered a dog training collar as the puppy is biting & I want to break him from it, his food & puppy pads, & my cats their food. My order was to be here Sunday by USPS. I planned my furbabies meals around this delivery as i have not had issues with amazon in the past and usually when am told I’ll get it I do. There was no delivery updates from time it shipped from distro center friday. on sunday, nothing stating it was out for delivery. So i called in. The first lady told me i would have to wait until 9 PM to report it not delivered (even when I know how late my city delivers packages from Nov-Jan only til 2pm on a Sunday.) so at 9PM i called back. The lady told me my package was delayed. when I ask why she refused to tell me, so i ask to be transferred to a sup. At this point she disconnected the call. I called back in. The next gentleman was sweet but like i told him, unless you have animals at home hungry you wont understand. he kindly transferred me to a sup who stated her name & it was disconnected. When i called back the THIRD time i did not want anyone but a supervisor as this is horrid customer service & very rude. The sup i got put me on hold & found out it was delayed due to carrier. he insisted that i would get it no later than the 31st (5 days after i ordered). Well today on Dec. 31st, 2019 & i still had no order. This now means going back to a store after working 10+ hrs in a call center to get things for my animals because if i dont, they starve. I tried to chat and they kept insisting on a refund. All I wanted was my animals food & pads. That is not much to ask for. I got so fed up I called in. The guy told me he would refund it & didnt understand i just wanted a re-order. He didn’t understand that I wanted their stuff. Then I told him do not return to debit card as I didn’t have 3-5 business days to wait for refund. He did part back on my card and part in GC. Then on top of it all he told me ""for my inconvenience he was going to give me a $5 credit for my next order."" First off, ive been a prime user since 2016.i only do Amazon Prime because it was convenient of two day shipping instead of having to battle people after work. honestly what is a $5 credit going to do for me on Amazon. Nothing is the answer. At this point due to fact Ive been hung up on, package lost that is not a want in life but a need of my animals for their survival as they look to me to take care of them, & the Customer service department just plain out not listening to a word i say as i repeatedly told them i dont want it refunded just do a reorder, Due to the rudeness of the amazon customer service department and the fact that every time I try to chat your chat team passes my chat around like a basketball and I end up talking to new person every 2-3 min then I have to hold just for them to do opposite of what is ask, I am cancelling amazon prime and will be dropping twitch prime through amazon and going directly to Twitch with my services.  As a call center supervisor I can tell you my agents would never treat a customer or human like that.  If one of my agents treated a guest the way Amazon customer service did me in This time period, i would either be putting someone on a corrective action, or they wouldve been terminated.  Keep outsourcing all your business and amazon will lose more than their share customers.",2020-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,19.0,3921,791,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,worst week worst customer service ever amazon prime user long time always really convenient even price diff going store alot time dont want go battle people store deal angry people day call center supervisortrainer past week let believe could use prime account order puppy two cat item instead going somewhere reasonable like chewy ordered dog training collar puppy biting want break food puppy pad cat food order sunday usps planned furbabies meal around delivery issue amazon past usually told i’ll get delivery update time shipped distro center friday sunday nothing stating delivery called first lady told would wait pm report delivered even know late city delivers package novjan til pm sunday pm called back lady told package delayed ask refused tell ask transferred sup point disconnected call called back next gentleman sweet like told unless animal home hungry wont understand kindly transferred sup stated name disconnected called back third time want anyone supervisor horrid customer service rude sup got put hold found delayed due carrier insisted would get later st day ordered well today dec st still order mean going back store working hr call center get thing animal dont starve tried chat kept insisting refund wanted animal food pad much ask got fed called guy told would refund didnt understand wanted reorder didn’t understand wanted stuff told return debit card didn’t business day wait refund part back card part gc top told inconvenience going give credit next order first ive prime user since amazon prime convenient two day shipping instead battle people work honestly credit going amazon nothing answer point due fact ive hung package lost want life need animal survival look take care customer service department plain listening word say repeatedly told dont want refunded reorder due rudeness amazon customer service department fact every time try chat chat team p