Romeco Kissoonauth,/users/5e23d9d7e5a4c77fd4838899,US,1.0,2020-01-19 04:24:13+00:00,1.0,Do Not Turst Amazon!,"I honestly wish I could give them 0 stars! I live in Orlando, purchased a birthday present for my nephew and had it shipped to his home in Baldwin N.Y instead of carrying it on the flight with me. His birthday is on 1/16 and the item guarantee that it will be delivered by the 15th so when I get to NY I would be able to give him his B-day present on the 16th. It said the item was delivered on the 15th BUT no package was delivered, no photo taken to show proof of delivery. I paid for a birthday present, travel all the way to NY and Amazon did not make good on their commitment to have my purchase delivered. When I called customer service , all I got was "" we'll refund your money"". What the hell, such an inconvenience! I ended up going to the store and purchasing a present for him. I'm not renewing my prime and I'm closing my Amazon account. Amazon- Good for nothing! stick with the old way - driving to the store and making my purchase in hand.",2020-01-19 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,19.0,953,188,20,4,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,honestly wish could give star live orlando purchased birthday present nephew shipped home baldwin ny instead carrying flight birthday item guarantee delivered th get ny would able give bday present th said item delivered th package delivered photo taken show proof delivery paid birthday present travel way ny amazon make good commitment purchase delivered called customer service got well refund money hell inconvenience ended going store purchasing present im renewing prime im closing amazon account amazon good nothing stick old way driving store making purchase hand,0.8157948726889201,0.18420512731107985,0.10544026920919798,0.2,0.4131906174973795,41.31906174973795,Low Trust
