Lisa Pugh,/users/5ac4d2de4de5666d34af9aaf,US,13.0,2020-01-18 22:00:45+00:00,1.0,Customer service is horrible,"Customer service is horrible. I called regarding an item that wasn't coming up the discount price in the check out. So I called Amazon and explained to them what the item was, what the advertisement said and offered a screenshot. I was told that upon speaking to the supervisor that they couldn't see anything on their end regarding the discount so they can not honor it, I then explained to this person that I had just ordered the same item yesterday and received the discount at check out. She refused to look at my order to see the day prior and just said she couldn't help. I now get why they are always on the news and people are always hit them up.",2020-01-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,18.0,654,123,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer service horrible called regarding item wasnt coming discount price check called amazon explained item advertisement said offered screenshot told upon speaking supervisor couldnt see anything end regarding discount honor explained person ordered item yesterday received discount check refused look order see day prior said couldnt help get always news people always hit,0.02422517402196801,0.975774825978032,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.8016843843855387,80.16843843855386,High Trust
