Chris Professional,/users/5e229ab1ddcefa23d559b24e,US,1.0,2020-01-18 05:50:39+00:00,1.0,WORST DELIVERY SERVICE EVER!,"WORST DELIVERY SERVICE EVER! AVOID IF POSSIBLE! THEIR SYSTEM IS CRAP AND DECEPTIVE AS WELL AS THE PEOPLE WHO WORK THERE. NOTIFICATION WILL SAY YOUR PACKAGE IS GOING TO BE DELIVERED ON A CERTAIN DATE, DATE WILL ARRIVE AND THE TIME WILL THE CONTINUOUSLY LOOP. NOTIFICATIONS STATE 10 STOPS AWAY THEN 5 STOPS, THEN 1 STOP ALL EARLY IN THE DAY. THEN AFTER STARTED DELIVERY TIME HAS PASSED THE SYSTEM WILL NOTIFY YOU THAT YOUR PACKAGE WILL ARRIVE BY 9PM. AT 10PM YOUR PACKAGE WILL THEN BE IN THE SYSTEM SHOWING TO BE DELIVERED ANYWHERE FROM 1 DAY TO TWO WEEKS OR THE END OF THE MONTH. RIDICULOUS RIGHT?  THEN WHEN YOU CALL, THE AGENTS WILL MAKE UP 5 TO 10 DIFFERENT EXCUSES AS TO WHY THE SYSTEM IS DELIVERING WRONG INFO AND ULTIMATELY YOU WILL HAVE WASTED YOUR TIME MAKING THE CALL, AND WAITING ON YOUR PACKAGE THAT MAY OR MAY NOT EVER ARRIVE. GOING TO START DOWN SCORING SELLERS FOR USING THEIR SERVICE. MAYBE THAT WILL INSPIRE SOME CHANGE SINCE FILING COMPLAINTS FOR 6 MONTHS STRAIGHT HAS YIELDED ABSOLUTELY NO DIFFERENCE. I LITERALLY HATE THIS AMAZON LOGISTICS. I HAVE NO ISSUES WITH USPS, FEDEX, UPS OF DHL. IF YOU HAVE HAD ISSUES WITH AMAZON LOGISTICS ASK AMAZON TO DEPRIORITIZE THEM AS YOUR DELIVERY SERVICE OR JUST DO WHAT I DO AND ORDER DIRECTLY FROM THE COMPANY INSTEAD OF AMAZON.",2020-01-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,18.0,1283,231,28,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,worst delivery service ever avoid possible system crap deceptive well people work notification say package going delivered certain date date arrive time continuously loop notification state stop away stop stop early day started delivery time passed system notify package arrive pm pm package system showing delivered anywhere day two week end month ridiculous right call agent make different excuse system delivering wrong info ultimately wasted time making call waiting package may may ever arrive going start scoring seller using service maybe inspire change since filing complaint month straight yielded absolutely difference literally hate amazon logistics issue usps fedex ups dhl issue amazon logistics ask amazon deprioritize delivery service order directly company instead amazon,0.2402444657521913,0.7597555342478087,0.12955692652832304,0.2,0.705789152429569,70.5789152429569,Medium Trust
Michelle A Finn,/users/5e228020013d41e12b24b174,US,1.0,2020-01-18 03:48:58+00:00,1.0,Normally they're not horrible,"Normally they're not horrible. But, after dealing with a seller who lied consistently for 2 weeks saying he shipped the product he did not ship and then telling me the day I need it though they forgot, so I had to go and buy one at the local store for six times the price. After dealing with that I contact Amazon customer service to write a review on the seller. After writing to separate reviews continually Amazon told me that my reviews were negative and therefore could not be published so I decided to chat with their customer service. You would figure that chatting with customer service would mean an actual person? Nope! Not only in that not an actual person but a computer system that doesn't even speak English properly! After getting the exact same paragraph multiple times with the exact same grammatical and spelling errors I decided screw it. And I tried to contact Amazon through email or phone. Nope! So I decided to try to contact the seller, nope! Basically I'm stuck. If you get a seller that super crappy, tough. Amazon is a figment of your imagination and actual people don't work there, it's little green Martian men that you can never get ahold of",2020-01-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,18.0,1171,209,29,4,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,normally theyre horrible dealing seller lied consistently week saying shipped product ship telling day need though forgot go buy one local store six time price dealing contact amazon customer service write review seller writing separate review continually amazon told review negative therefore could published decided chat customer service would figure chatting customer service would mean actual person nope actual person computer system doesnt even speak english properly getting exact paragraph multiple time exact grammatical spelling error decided screw tried contact amazon email phone nope decided try contact seller nope basically im stuck get seller super crappy tough amazon figment imagination actual people dont work little green martian men never get ahold,0.9149263125434125,0.0850736874565875,0.11721817162086372,0.2,0.3659804780524665,36.59804780524665,Low Trust
Julie Dan,/users/5e226e13e5a4c7da8b830db4,US,1.0,2020-01-18 02:32:00+00:00,3.0,Amazon lost my package,"Amazon lost my package. They sent me an email telling me they shipped my package to the wrong place and said we are canceling your order and refunding your money in 3 to 5 days. Why not just fulfill the order and re ship? I called to get more info and they said they can’t because of policy, and I have to reorder. Problem is they won’t refund my money for 3-5 days. I asked them if they could ship it faster, than the free 3-7 day free shipping that was offered, since they lost it and they said no. I understand that the package is coming from a 3rd party vendor, but if they can offer 2day prime shipping for free, than why not 2 day free shipping since they lost it? Customer service was very dismissive of my complaint and not at all helpful in getting my package in a timely manner.I also was unable to find a place to add a customer review regarding Amazon. I don’t want to leave a bad review for the 3rd party vendor, when it is an Amazon issue.I am sure I will continue to purchase from Amazon, but this shopping experience did not make me feel very valued.",2020-01-18 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,18.0,1066,207,22,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon lost package sent email telling shipped package wrong place said canceling order refunding money day fulfill order ship called get info said can’t policy reorder problem won’t refund money day asked could ship faster free day free shipping offered since lost said understand package coming rd party vendor offer day prime shipping free day free shipping since lost customer service dismissive complaint helpful getting package timely manneri also unable find place add customer review regarding amazon don’t want leave bad review rd party vendor amazon issuei sure continue purchase amazon shopping experience make feel valued,0.019316684724123238,0.9806833152758767,0.1160964666292765,0.6,1.4135609509637934,141.35609509637933,High Trust
