Lyn B,/users/5e220535013d41213e2485af,US,3.0,2020-02-01 02:51:13+00:00,1.0,Beware of your credit card information…,"Beware of your credit card information and monitor all charges by Amazon.com because if you don't they will steal your money. I have had too many issues with Amazon and I just don't save any credit card info anymore. The services are ended before the full month is completed, and charges appear during that month for unauthorized charges almost every month, so I'm over Amazon.com! I'd rather shop online somewhere else than deal with the headaches.",2020-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,2.0,1.0,449,76,39,6,15.0,0,1,0,0,Genuine,beware credit card information monitor charge amazoncom dont steal money many issue amazon dont save credit card info anymore service ended full month completed charge appear month unauthorized charge almost every month im amazoncom id rather shop online somewhere else deal headache,0.05768936566562811,0.9423106343343719,0.04262478968031408,0.2,0.7796802751032487,77.96802751032487,High Trust
Stephen Clark,/users/5e21df516167816f0b831b9c,US,6.0,2020-01-17 16:34:37+00:00,2.0,Unfortunately Not Great,"Unfortunately, due to their contracted delivery drivers, ordering with Amazon directly to my apartment is virtually impossible. It was never a problem when FedEx or UPS were delivering the orders, now - since the apartments in my entire complex look the same - they just throw the package at any random door, take a picture of it on the floor (no apartment number visible) and mark it as delivered.If I don't order to my place of business, it's a 9/10 chance my package will not be delivered to my door and I will have to search for it to no avail.",2020-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,17.0,548,101,23,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,unfortunately due contracted delivery driver ordering amazon directly apartment virtually impossible never problem fedex ups delivering order since apartment entire complex look throw package random door take picture floor apartment number visible mark deliveredif dont order place business chance package delivered door search avail,0.022660478694478015,0.977339521305522,0.056646102075154234,0.4,1.099998981067792,109.9998981067792,High Trust
Tony Wheeler,/users/5e1ae2d2ddcefa0bde55a235,GB,6.0,2020-01-17 15:14:02+00:00,1.0,Amazon sadly becoming very unreliable,Amazon a company that started great but has sadly got to big and is now getting terribly unreliable.My experience with Amazon and I don't use them a lot was awfull?I ordered two item's  a 2020 calender and a saint bernard design hoodie.The first item the calender I was informed was damaged in transit so I was refunded.The second item the saint bernard design hoodie I was told was running late.Two weeks later I used online chat to see how the order was progressing.It was explained to me that the item had been left in the Amazon locker as I'd asked them to do but had now been returned to Amazon as I had failed to collect the item.At no time was it ever explained to me the item was in the locker or any code sent to access the locker.I was offered the useall sympathetic approach and £5 to make it all better I which I refused.i didn't want £5 I wanted my item's they were presants for my partner.After this experience I would be very reluctant to use Amazon's services in the future?,2020-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,17.0,990,184,37,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon company started great sadly got big getting terribly unreliablemy experience amazon dont use lot awfulli ordered two item calender saint bernard design hoodiethe first item calender informed damaged transit refundedthe second item saint bernard design hoodie told running latetwo week later used online chat see order progressingit explained item left amazon locker id asked returned amazon failed collect itemat time ever explained item locker code sent access lockeri offered useall sympathetic approach £ make better refusedi didnt want £ wanted item presants partnerafter experience would reluctant use amazon service future,0.009287455807558995,0.990712544192441,0.10319685922602355,0.2,0.8159956439414252,81.59956439414252,High Trust
Joanne Archer,/users/5e219368e5a4c74016828911,GB,1.0,2020-01-17 10:58:56+00:00,1.0,So my first delivery at Christmas,"So my first delivery at Christmas, I had a card put through my door stating that the parcel had been handed to the householder! No one was home and I imagined that perhaps a neighbour had taken it,, however 3 days later I found it hidden in a bush soaking wet in my garden,, Why did the card not say 'parcel in bush instead of handed to me'So I give them the excuse that perhaps they are busy, I try again, I stay home all day like a stalker tracking my delivery, even sitting in my window, it gets to 9.25pm in the evening, I track driver again and he's miles away but still coming for which they apologise, but at 9:20pm I also receive an email stated driver tried to deliver at 9:20pm and no one was home so could not leave it unattended,, How dare I be blamed for failed delivery I was home, and guess what no card was left for failed delivery because they never cameVery poor service, 😡😡😡I have cancelled my order now I wonder how long before they refund me, bet it's not as quick as I paid them.....",2020-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,17.0,1005,195,33,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,first delivery christmas card put door stating parcel handed householder one home imagined perhaps neighbour taken however day later found hidden bush soaking wet garden card say parcel bush instead handed meso give excuse perhaps busy try stay home day like stalker tracking delivery even sitting window get pm evening track driver he mile away still coming apologise pm also receive email stated driver tried deliver pm one home could leave unattended dare blamed failed delivery home guess card left failed delivery never camevery poor service 😡😡😡i cancelled order wonder long refund bet quick paid,0.05528101566723604,0.9447189843327639,0.10936623667975323,0.2,0.7942327395023325,79.42327395023325,High Trust
