Princess Mia,/users/5e20e7e2616781a72b829ae7,GB,2.0,2020-01-16 22:47:16+00:00,1.0,VERY BAD AND DONT CARE AS THEY HAVE LOADS OF CUSTOMERS,"I’m not happy with the service I’ve received and after being a whole loyal customer to amazon I’m very disappointed with the service. I’ve also worked for amazon delivering parcels and honestly if this is how you treat your loyal customers it’s disgusting.i purchased a gift card trying it out after seeing it sooo many times in every item I wanted to purchase I decided to try it. I had customers that need to have nails done tomorrow Saturday the 18th of January and after topping up my card went on to purchase my stuff Also being a prime member I selected the prime stuff to be delivered ASAP . Upon going to check out the whole process got to the end and told me to pay today £0.00 at no point was I told I had to put my bank card details at all . After that, it said order placed my gift card balance went from £106 to £18, meaning money was deducted from my gift card. My order was meant to arrive tonight, tomorrow and Saturday . Only getting home no parcel. Logged in and the app said payment revision pendingI’ve had to call amazon and your very rude colleague cancelled my prime membership without even trying to apologise and try talking to me as a customer to stop me from cancelling it and so clearly amazon has so many customers it doesn’t care about why someone is cancelling. I’ve had to cancel my prime membership, the order and then all this because Amazon could not be clear with their t&c’s your colleague told me I had to click a bank card upon ordering but where was that option. I NEVER SAW ANYWHERE. Your system asked me to click my card . It was my first time using it and all it said was payment £0.00 because I had a gift card. What’s the whole point of a gift card? You top up money on it and you use it anywhere. My bank card is on my account and I don’t understand why money was taken on my gift card.It’s honestly not fair. After purchasing your system Told me my stuff would be here today 6-10pm and some tomorrow and some Saturday .what I honestly did was top up a card and the money was taken out of my bank, into my gift card. Purchased stuff online even closed some websites I was going to buy from mainly because amazon has been loyal in bringing my stuff. And upon purchasing the money was deducted from my gift card and I spent the day at work today. This has really stressed me . I’m going to lose my two customers because of this and I’m only a student and a single mum trying to start up my small business and these are my first clients. It’s really not fair",2020-01-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,16.0,2501,481,54,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’m happy service i’ve received whole loyal customer amazon i’m disappointed service i’ve also worked amazon delivering parcel honestly treat loyal customer it’s disgustingi purchased gift card trying seeing sooo many time every item wanted purchase decided try customer need nail done tomorrow saturday th january topping card went purchase stuff also prime member selected prime stuff delivered asap upon going check whole process got end told pay today £ point told put bank card detail said order placed gift card balance went £ £ meaning money deducted gift card order meant arrive tonight tomorrow saturday getting home parcel logged app said payment revision pendingi’ve call amazon rude colleague cancelled prime membership without even trying apologise try talking customer stop cancelling clearly amazon many customer doesn’t care someone cancelling i’ve cancel prime membership order amazon could clear tc’s colleague told click bank card upon ordering option never saw anywhere system asked click card first time using said payment £ gift card what’s whole point gift card top money use anywhere bank card account don’t understand money taken gift cardit’s honestly fair purchasing system told stuff would today pm tomorrow saturday honestly top card money taken bank gift card purchased stuff online even closed website going buy mainly amazon loyal bringing stuff upon purchasing money deducted gift card spent day work today really stressed i’m going lose two customer i’m student single mum trying start small business first client it’s really fair,0.012730924214536391,0.9872690757854636,0.26977005047672464,0.2,0.8475885479880768,84.75885479880768,High Trust
