robby rodriguez,/users/5e1fcee761678111e281f084,US,2.0,2020-01-16 02:48:22+00:00,1.0,Never received package,"I ordered a package and did not receive it. When I called Amazon customer service I was told the package was delivered to a different address and that there was nothing Amazon could do about it. I went to the address it was delivered to and was told they never received any packages that day either. After contacting Amazon customer service again and explaining the situation I was told to reorder and pay for the item a second time. I’m really upset about it, and I don’t have enough money to buy the item again. Thanks for nothing Amazon.",2020-01-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,16.0,540,99,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered package receive called amazon customer service told package delivered different address nothing amazon could went address delivered told never received package day either contacting amazon customer service explaining situation told reorder pay item second time i’m really upset don’t enough money buy item thanks nothing amazon,0.035232531762936906,0.964767468237063,0.055524397083567024,0.2,0.793488613535245,79.3488613535245,High Trust
ZaviJ30,/users/5e1fc596fa8e7b309dd6a910,US,1.0,2020-01-16 02:22:25+00:00,4.0,Anything you needs is basically on…,"Anything you needs is basically on Amazon! If you did not receive your item, Amazon will replace or refund you no questions ask! If you need to return a product, you are refunded right away as soon as the item is confirmed in UPS possession! I subscribe to Amazon prime,  and Amazon Unlimited where I listen to the majority of my music. Only thing is the customer service could be better and know more about a company they work for. This is the reason for my 4 star rating! Other than that, Amazon rates a 5 on keeping the products offered affordable.",2020-01-16 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,16.0,551,102,35,6,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,anything need basically amazon receive item amazon replace refund question ask need return product refunded right away soon item confirmed ups possession subscribe amazon prime amazon unlimited listen majority music thing customer service could better know company work reason star rating amazon rate keeping product offered affordable,0.9404035315002645,0.059596468499735544,0.05720695457094784,0.8,1.2412396251640572,124.12396251640571,High Trust
