Rose Hemminghaus,/users/5e1d173addcefaecb656b64c,US,1.0,2020-01-14 01:20:03+00:00,1.0,5 items were supposed to come on…,"5 items were supposed to come on Saturday Amazon said is was delivered my son drove all the way over because one item was his and he needed it, I told him it had to be in mailbox because I looked at front and back door. It was not here anywhere on Amazon it said left in secure place!  I called and they said it would be here on Monday it didn’t come I called again or chatted with a couple of people who just keep telling me tomorrow.  Why do they say it has been delivered when it was not delivered.  That’s what makes me mad and it’s a pain to call and wait only to hear the same thing from different people over and over.  Why did they tell me Saturday that it was coming Monday clearly they didn’t know that because Monday I was told Tuesday.  I am very upset with Amazon!",2020-01-14 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,14.0,777,155,33,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,item supposed come saturday amazon said delivered son drove way one item needed told mailbox looked front back door anywhere amazon said left secure place called said would monday didn’t come called chatted couple people keep telling tomorrow say delivered delivered that’s make mad it’s pain call wait hear thing different people tell saturday coming monday clearly didn’t know monday told tuesday upset amazon,0.41245324269062167,0.5875467573093783,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.611159806024291,61.1159806024291,Medium Trust
