Christopher C,/users/5ddbfb3629966b05d1297d15,CA,7.0,2020-01-09 20:42:45+00:00,1.0,Ships Incorrect Product and Refuses Refund or Replacement,"Amazon.ca shipped the incorrect item or an order purchased this month.  When the item arrived it was not at all as shown in the image or description.  The product was shown as having a black frame with a beautiful photo included. The product that arrived had a gold frame and no image.Upon filing a support request with Amazon I was advised that it was in fact a mistake, but the $700 item did not qualify for a refund or return.  They instructed me to resolve the matter directly with the manufacturer despite fulfillment from Amazon.com.ca.Having left a review on the product Amazon expunged it as I was not permitted to talk about the service experience (just the product features itself).After escalating the matter to a supervisor I was told that I could return the product, but by the time the conversation ended they had changed their mind (or had been corrected).  I was not to return or replace the product.At Amazon's instructions I reached out to the manufacturer by telephone and e-mail and was advised that ""they'll get back to me."".  No call or e-mail has been returned.",2020-01-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,9.0,1084,188,57,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazonca shipped incorrect item order purchased month item arrived shown image description product shown black frame beautiful photo included product arrived gold frame imageupon filing support request amazon advised fact mistake item qualify refund return instructed resolve matter directly manufacturer despite fulfillment amazoncomcahaving left review product amazon expunged permitted talk service experience product feature itselfafter escalating matter supervisor told could return product time conversation ended changed mind corrected return replace productat amazon instruction reached manufacturer telephone email advised theyll get back call email returned,0.01354259091798105,0.98645