Brandt,/users/541442c900006400018a43d1,US,3.0,2020-01-09 17:15:55+00:00,1.0,Amazons customer service is anything but....,"Amazons customer service is anything but customer oriented.  It is impossible to converse with anyone empowered to resolve an issue.  I have found that if a customers issue does not fit neatly within the dialog Amazon has scripted for their “customer service representatives”, any attempt at resolution is pure frustration.   Following the theft of my credit card, all charges against the stolen card were placed on hold by my credit card company, including some payable to Amazon.  Upon returning from my travels, at my instruction, I approved amounts due Amazon.  However since Amazon did not subsequently “re - present” request for payment to the credit card company, they locked my account and have subsequently showered me with emails demanding payment.  If Amazon were truly as customer oriented, as they claim, the would staff their customer service department with people and procedures that work.",2020-01-09 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,9.0,905,143,44,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service anything customer oriented impossible converse anyone empowered resolve issue found customer issue fit neatly within dialog amazon scripted “customer service representatives” attempt resolution pure frustration following theft credit card charge stolen card placed hold credit card company including payable amazon upon returning travel instruction approved amount due amazon however since amazon subsequently “re present” request payment credit card company locked account subsequently showered email demanding payment amazon truly customer oriented claim would staff customer service department people procedure work,0.01048173610466103,0.9895182638953389,0.08020190689848569,0.2,0.8107995133273666,81.07995133273666,High Trust
