Sam Cooper,/users/5e15298927bff2cc8ae0b7a0,AU,1.0,2020-01-08 01:00:12+00:00,1.0,Complete waste of time. Talked in circles,"Worst customer service I have ever encountered. My payment wasn’t going through due to an issue on their side. Was talked in circles by the customer service representative eventually the problem was solved not before I almost threw my phone out of sheer frustration dealing with the rep. Once the problem was solved I was then contacted again two minutes later asking what my problem was and how could they help. Upon informing them that my problem had already been fixed the new rep continued to ask my account details and what I needed fixed. No one listens, they are condescending and waste your time.",2020-01-08 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,8.0,604,105,41,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,worst customer service ever encountered payment wasn’t going due issue side talked circle customer service representative eventually problem solved almost threw phone sheer frustration dealing rep problem solved contacted two minute later asking problem could help upon informing problem already fixed new rep continued ask account detail needed fixed one listens condescending waste time,0.01431075275466186,0.9856892472453381,0.05888951205832866,0.2,0.8046225260343348,80.46225260343348,High Trust
