Alex Jasper,/users/5e13080a361d61608d0dae41,AU,1.0,2020-01-06 10:12:53+00:00,1.0,BEWARE: AMAZON IS A SCAM!,Amazon in Australia is indistinguishable from a scam. I bought an electronic item on Amazon Marketplace. The item was non-functioning. The vendor said they would issue a refund then disappeared from Amazon. I have contacted Amazon customer service SIX times over months now and each time I get a reply from Amazon saying my refund will be issued within 1-2 weeks and then nothing happens and there is no refund. Presumably they just go on like this until the customer gives up. BUY ANYWHERE BUT AMAZON.COM.AU - IT'S A SCAM.,2020-01-06 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,6.0,523,90,25,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon australia indistinguishable scam bought electronic item amazon marketplace item nonfunctioning vendor said would issue refund disappeared amazon contacted amazon customer service six time month time get reply amazon saying refund issued within week nothing happens refund presumably go like customer give buy anywhere amazoncomau scam,0.007986658152317805,0.9920133418476822,0.050476724621424565,0.2,0.806102015848126,80.6102015848126,High Trust
Andy Baird,/users/5b83007d4de5666d34459257,US,2.0,2020-01-06 06:36:32+00:00,1.0,HORRIBLE DELIVERY,"I had a package I really needed and they GUARANTEED DELIVERY.  They said they attempted to deliver but ""business was closed"" which means they drove to my apt complex, the office was closed and they didn't deliver to me.  I have been told by amazon supervisors that my account clearly says that absolutely no packages are to be delivered to the office.  When I asked customer support about it, this is the excuse they gave me for NOT delivering my package today.""I understand and I'm very sorry. If the delivery instructions were there when the driver delivered it, the driver possibly ignored your delivery instructions. I'm very sorry for this.The driver possibly be rushing to deliver the package to reach their quota that's why he wasn't able to attempt to deliver at your front door.""So in other words, the driver was too lazy to do their job.  What a joke.",2020-01-06 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,6.0,861,150,17,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,package really needed guaranteed delivery said attempted deliver business closed mean drove apt complex office closed didnt deliver told amazon supervisor account clearly say absolutely package delivered office asked customer support excuse gave delivering package todayi understand im sorry delivery instruction driver delivered driver possibly ignored delivery instruction im sorry thisthe driver possibly rushing deliver package reach quota thats wasnt able attempt deliver front doorso word driver lazy job joke,0.04106081280313099,0.958939187196869,0.08412787436904094,0.2,0.7962951684722427,79.62951684722427,High Trust
