Maureen Davis,/users/5e116b46361d610e4e0d1ff3,US,1.0,2020-01-05 04:51:32+00:00,1.0,Amazon is a rip off,"I will never have another card on file at any website ever again and i will NEVER order from Amazon ever again for the remainder of my life. Twice now I've had money taken from my bank account that was not authorized by me and when i caught Amazon charging me for things I was not authorizing a payment for and contacted customer service by chat and by phone and i asked where is my money for the charges I never authorized i was told I would receive my item ... I was never asking about an item because there was no item, there was Amazon taking $28.24 from me yesterday and then there was Amazon today taking my last 14.00 of my SSI and making it so I can't eat any food today. When i told them they took my last money today that i was supposed to use for food for an unauthorized payment, the rep on the phone laughed at me. Why would someone in customer service laugh at someone who is suffering without food today because their company stole my last 14 dollars and caused me an undue hardship. Why would they create a chat that will not answer the question the consumer is asking like 'Where is my money you took that i did not authorize"" ..that is a legit question and a consumer who has spent hundreds on their website should be able to have that simple question answered without 6 hours 4 different chat people and a phone contact with a rep who laughed at me. After all the contact to this rotten company, I still have no idea where the hell my money is , why they took it, or if they are planning to return it, so i will be contacting my bank, social security, a lawyer, the BBB , the newspapers and television news media , Consumer reports...they don't get to rip off a disabled person living on disability without getting their asses sued.",2020-01-05 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,5.0,1751,334,19,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,never another card file website ever never order amazon ever remain