Mik Bas,/users/5e10c8c7984836dcb47db0c4,GB,1.0,2020-01-04 17:18:25+00:00,1.0,Real Talk about Amazon and Amazon Prime,"Ordered an item on Friday on Prime, told I was getting it the following day.Next day: Notification on phone said item was delivered to my neighbor.Checked the CCTV and asked my neighbor.Neighbor said they didn't get any package and no one knocked at both my residence and their residence at the specified time of delivery as viewed on the CCTV.Contacted Amazon Customer Service and told them of my evidence that the item wasn't delivered, they told me that it could be a miss scan of items.So basically Amazon lied about my order and their Prime services about telling consumers the dates they will receive their items. If I haven't raised it up they wouldn't have done anything about it.To top it up Customer Service told me that they will deliver my item guarantee on Tuesday (we'll see about that), another working day extra so what was the point of Prime? Offered me only £5 Amazon Credit after almost a whole day of investigating and tracking.Bottomline is, Amazon Prime is pointless, there is no guarantee, and most of the time their couriers will just drop you packages through an open window or squeeze it through the letterbox without thinking of the contents.Throughout the years of being a Prime member, I'll clearly wont be renewing it since the service has gone downhill and other perks like Amazon Prime Video and Music doesn't offer considering when you're paying quite a sum of subscription or annual fee, you win some but most of the time you lose.It's better to buy somewhere else where you could get it cheaper and get Cashback from your purchases and use postal services that looks after your packages with more care.",2020-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,4.0,1637,282,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item friday prime told getting following daynext day notification phone said item delivered neighborchecked cctv asked neighborneighbor said didnt get package one knocked residence residence specified time delivery viewed cctvcontacted amazon customer service told evidence item wasnt delivered told could miss scan itemsso basically amazon lied order prime service telling consumer date receive item havent raised wouldnt done anything itto top customer service told deliver item guarantee tuesday well see another working day extra point prime offered £ amazon credit almost whole day investigating trackingbottomline amazon prime pointless guarantee time courier drop package open window squeeze letterbox without thinking contentsthroughout year prime member ill clearly wont renewing since service gone downhill perk like amazon prime video music doesnt offer considering youre paying quite sum subscription annual fee win time loseits better buy somewhere else could get cheaper get cashback purchase use postal service look package care,0.004876669573636004,0.995123330426364,0.15816040381379698,0.2,0.8291937459759414,82.91937459759414,High Trust
