Sirin Arkhon,/users/5e1062f2361d61a9ea0cbdc0,HU,1.0,2020-01-04 10:13:18+00:00,1.0,This was my complain I have send them,"This was my complain I have send them: So. I have ordered a backpack early December, and it was said it will arrive around the 2nd or 3rd week of December. It would have been a Christmas gift, and you guys were really sure it will arrive, with all that advertising, spam emails and everything. ""Order up and you get your stuff before Christmas!"" So I did, waaaaay before the last chance to do this.Then I got an automatic email to rate my order, when it should have been arrived. But it did not. And I checked it, and it said, ""sorry, but Amazon is too busy in this season, you will get your stuff around 2-3 of January.""I was mad at first.Contacted the seller, who said, it's Amazon's fault, I should talk to them. Ok....So I have started to chat with the customer service. I talked to 5 different people. Or as I thought, but then I have realized they were AIs. Fkin AIs, who were not able to understand my problem, so they passed me to the next AI. Maybe the last one was a real person. I can't be sure at this point, because they all said the same lines over and over again.STOP USING Artificial Intelligence in customer service! It took tons of my time trying to tell what's my problem, and we didn't get any solution.At the end, since they didn't understand, I dropped it, and let it go. If it arrives in january, then it arrives in january, who cares anymore.But.I got an email today, when it should have arrived, Amazon said they will refund my order, because they couldn't deliver it.And why is that? NOBODY called the address, but that's why I GAVE THE PHONE NUMBER! Delivery companies ALWAYS calls or messages! ALWAYS, from whomewer I order from.ALWAYS.But I guess nobody were by the address, trying to deliver anything, so they were just stealing my money and time.Thanks for this roller coaster, I'm done with Amazon and will make sure to tell everybody that don't order from Amazon.Because delivering and customer service both sucks.I can just hope they will really send my money back at this point.",2020-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,4.0,2013,364,37,8,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,complain send ordered backpack early december said arrive around nd rd week december would christmas gift guy really sure arrive advertising spam email everything order get stuff christmas waaaaay last chance thisthen got automatic email rate order arrived checked said sorry amazon busy season get stuff around januaryi mad firstcontacted seller said amazon fault talk okso started chat customer service talked different people thought realized ai fkin ai able understand problem passed next ai maybe last one real person cant sure point said line againstop using artificial intelligence customer service took ton time trying tell whats problem didnt get solutionat end since didnt understand dropped let go arrives january arrives january care anymorebuti got email today arrived amazon said refund order couldnt deliver itand nobody called address thats gave phone number delivery company always call message always whomewer order fromalwaysbut guess nobody address trying deliver anything stealing money timethanks roller coaster im done amazon make sure tell everybody dont order amazonbecause delivering customer service sucksi hope really send money back point,0.7854601677434276,0.21453983225657236,0.2041503084688727,0.2,0.4480999778220607,44.80999778220607,Low Trust
