Susanna Y.,/users/5c876b22c142941c4ba08a16,US,5.0,2020-01-03 22:02:04+00:00,2.0,"Blocked account, bad customer service.","While I appreciate the wide variety of things Amazon offers, I am not happy with their customer service. My account was restricted and 10 years of accurate, non-paid reviews were removed for no reason. They have still not restored my full account and I'm finally tired of waiting for them to respond. I have been finding what I need elsewhere, and not using them nearly as much as i had. Good bye Amazon.",2020-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,3.0,404,73,38,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,appreciate wide variety thing amazon offer happy customer service account restricted year accurate nonpaid review removed reason still restored full account im finally tired waiting respond finding need elsewhere using nearly much good bye amazon,0.017014916654913607,0.9829850833450864,0.04094223219293326,0.4,1.0996809881111298,109.96809881111298,High Trust
J Helfrich,/users/5e0f99f8b14ccf7c37fa757d,US,3.0,2020-01-03 19:52:19+00:00,1.0,Trying to locate a Customer Service phone#…abysmal experience/abysmal company!,"Trying to locate a Customer Service phone number on Amazon’s website is obviously an intentional roadblock constructed by Amazon.  When I finally uncovered a number, I was talking with someone, “Raheem”, in the third world, whose English was barely understandable.  Raheem gave incorrect information upon which I relied saying unauthorized charges would be reversed without cancellation to my wife’s Prime account.  Later, contrary to Raheem’s assurances, we discovered her Prime account had been cancelled.  Totally bad experience!  When I later, again, called Amazon Customer Service, I was informed that the incorrect Amex credit card had been used for two years to pay for Prime - disgusted now with Amazon!   Moreover, after 5 years of Prime membership, I am throughly done! I have NO confidence in the company’s competence and/or it’s integrity.",2020-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,3.0,851,131,78,9,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,trying locate customer service phone number amazon’s website obviously intentional roadblock constructed amazon finally uncovered number talking someone “raheem” third world whose english barely understandable raheem gave incorrect information upon relied saying unauthorized charge would reversed without cancellation wife’s prime account later contrary raheem’s assurance discovered prime account cancelled totally bad experience later called amazon customer service informed incorrect amex credit card used two year pay prime disgusted amazon moreover year prime membership throughly done confidence company’s competence andor it’s integrity,0.7455687860647161,0.2544312139352839,0.07347167694896242,0.2,0.4419099423574344,44.19099423574344,Low Trust
Vanjo Chan,/users/590089be0000ff000a9151da,GB,32.0,2020-01-03 17:07:45+00:00,1.0,"Poor platform, unclear terms and conditions and frustrating customer service reps","Made an order on 20th December for a relatively expensive productEst arrival is 3rd-8th JanReceive email from Amazon 28 Dec that seller has not confirmed the dispatch of this order, and we are unable to provide you with dispatch details yet.Requested confirmation through Amazon platform to seller on 30 Dec for invoice, confirmation of dispatch or order or something.Another message is sent to seller on 2nd Jan as there was no response from initial inquiry.Contacted Amazon live chat on 3rd Jan for help as still no response from seller.Amazon tells me they can't do anything except send another email to the seller and that they have until the 8th Jan to dispatch the order.Technically if they don't respond i have to wait an additional 3 further days from the 8th to apply for a refund which will take an additional 5-7 days.I was given £5 amazon credit for any inconveniences, here's the kicker though - it only applies on amazon products only.Can't tell if amazon just wanted to troll me for xmas and new years 2020.FYI this was for amazon.co.uk",2020-01-03 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,3.0,1051,180,81,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,made order th december relatively expensive productest arrival rdth janreceive email amazon dec seller confirmed dispatch order unable provide dispatch detail yetrequested confirmation amazon platform seller dec invoice confirmation dispatch order somethinganother message sent seller nd jan response initial inquirycontacted amazon live chat rd jan help still response selleramazon tell cant anything except send another email seller th jan dispatch ordertechnically dont respond wait additional day th apply refund take additional daysi given £ amazon credit inconvenience here kicker though applies amazon product onlycant tell amazon wanted troll xmas new year fyi amazoncouk,0.04120014376475323,0.958