Rahat Ahmad,/users/5e0cfab5361d6169960b16dd,US,1.0,2020-01-01 20:03:13+00:00,1.0,I ordered an item and within a few…,"I ordered an item and within a few hours attempted to cancel the item before shipment happened. However, Amazon auto rejected the cancel and next I chatted with customer service rep and advised they would call me. The customer service rep said they would cancel the order before it ships from CA to VA. However, the next day customer service rep could not do anything as the item was sent for departure. The issue of lack of communication is between Amazon and logistic piece of it. Also, the customer service reps do not speak good english and have strong accents very difficult to understand. What if my 2 year old orders via Alexa than i would have the same headache for weeks in attempting to cancel an order. Very Sad for such a large billion dollar company to have such ""crap"" customer service.",2020-01-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,1.0,800,143,35,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item within hour attempted cancel item shipment happened however amazon auto rejected cancel next chatted customer service rep advised would call customer service rep said would cancel order ship ca va however next day customer service rep could anything item sent departure issue lack communication amazon logistic piece also customer service rep speak good english strong accent difficult understand year old order via alexa would headache week attempting cancel order sad large billion dollar company crap customer service,0.012488565417934949,0.987511434582065,0.08020190689848569,0.2,0.8097960986707297,80.97960986707297,High Trust
