Elizabeth Thomas,/users/5e0cc93531bb5a731f9377e9,US,2.0,2020-01-01 16:31:41+00:00,1.0,Horrible experience,"Horrible experience! I will beusing other online retailers. I placed an order last night for several items. I checked my email 5 min Iater and noticed they referenced the wrong credit card so I called customer service to make the corrections. They said the credit card i requested will only be charged if the other one is declined. I then asked her not to use this card as my backup card and if the card I want to charge is declined I will provide another credit card or purchase the items at a later date. After waiting over 5 min on the phone, customer service assured me my back up card has been deleted and I will be notified if my card is declined. Less than 8 hours later I find out my back up credit card was charged. I called Amazon, and explained that due to their error I am unable to pay my rent. Amazon said they could do nothing but I would have to wait 24 to 48 hours. Extremely Upset!",2020-01-01 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,1.0,899,174,19,2,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,horrible experience beusing online retailer placed order last night several item checked email min iater noticed referenced wrong credit card called customer service make correction said credit card requested charged one declined asked use card backup card card want charge declined provide another credit card purchase item later date waiting min phone customer service assured back card deleted notified card declined less hour later find back credit card charged called amazon explained due error unable pay rent amazon said could nothing would wait hour extremely upset,0.3467711938171274,0.6532288061828726,0.0975883342680875,0.2,0.6461320699450537,64.61320699450536,Medium Trust
