Bates Reed,/users/5e0ba4726af502e2942efa6d,US,1.0,2019-12-31 19:42:09+00:00,1.0,I purchased a solar pannel from the…,"I purchased a solar pannel from the company below.  I tried to find a fix in American Stores so I could make the thing work but no one in america has the fittings for the product.  That took me about 4 months to figure out after going place to place to place.   I contacted amazon and really all they did was send the same request I sent, over and over for now almost a year.  There has been no resolution, Amazon did nothing basically and the company they represent here offered a $5 and $6 refund? What the hell?  Anyway Amazon failed the test and so did this client. Never had problems with Amazon til this and it shows me how much Amazon really just doesn't give a damn. Watch whag you buy. They won't give you direction where to buy parts to make this product work.. What a shamed..  150 Watts Monocrystalline Solar Panel Lightweight Flexible Charger for Boat Car Power Supply (150W)ASIN: B07N86DN6HYou have received a message from the Amazon Seller - BelovedkaiHere is their letter back to me.. They don't get it, there is no fixing it at my local? Whatever they are trying to say.  We've tried everyone.. Hello,Thanks for your email,We are really sorry that your item has been out of warranty, how about we refund you $6 and you fix the problem at your local?Waiting for your replyBest Regards OF COURSE AMAZON GAVE ME NO RECOURSE TO RECOVER MY MONEY.",2019-12-31 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,31.0,1358,246,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased solar pannel company tried find fix american store could make thing work one america fitting product took month figure going place place place contacted amazon really send request sent almost year resolution amazon nothing basically company represent offered refund hell anyway amazon failed test client never problem amazon til show much amazon really doesnt give damn watch whag buy wont give direction buy part make product work sha