David J,/users/5c7fdbea469a12261fb14480,ES,51.0,2019-12-31 00:04:02+00:00,2.0,Prime  No benefits.,"Prime ..I agree with other posters here and other sites. Prime is no longer the 'next day delivery' promised. In fact paying Prime is now rip off becaue deliveries are the same without paying for it. In effect its a wste of money.Prime offers other  benefits --so they say . Music .. theres a rotten selection and only there to force you into subscribing to their millions of songs library . Its cheaper and better to get Spotify and forget Amazon music altogether.  During this year the music selection has been reduced continually . Now its useless. Asking for a song gets the generic response 'Heres a  station you might find if your lucky what you are lookng for '  Generally you dont . so thats another waste of time.Linking Spotify to the Echo account used to be easy . Now they make it difficult to force you into the poor Amazon Music.Amazon Prime Videos . another free benefit!!!   It offers nothing more than a few old movies . Far better is available elsewhere. Netfilx is FAR superior and at the same subcription price . Amazon is no competitor.Finally the Echo units 'age' and become deaf. I have 4 ... YES FOUR , in different continents and they all suffer from the same deafness problem. In my opinion its an inbuilt planned problem designed to make you buy another later version.  Dirty business practice.I wouldnt buy another echo..ever. I recommend you dont either.Nor would I subscribe to Prime. tyhose who have already done so would be well advised to review any benefit . They like me and others will conclude theres no value and cancel for refund",2019-12-31 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,31.0,1568,277,19,3,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,prime agree poster site prime longer next day delivery promised fact paying prime rip becaue delivery without paying effect wste moneyprime offer benefit say music there rotten selection force subscribing million song library cheaper better get spotify forget amazon music altogether year music selection reduced continually useless asking song get generic response here station might find lucky lookng generally dont thats another waste timelinking spotify echo account used easy make difficult force poor amazon musicamazon prime video another free benefit offer nothing old movie far better available elsewhere netfilx far superior subcription price amazon competitorfinally echo unit age become deaf yes four different continent suffer deafness problem opinion inbuilt planned problem designed make buy another later version dirty business practicei wouldnt buy another echoever recommend dont eithernor would subscribe prime tyhose already done would well advised review benefit like others conclude there value cancel refund,0.8471594387543699,0.15284056124563006,0.15535614133482895,0.4,0.7074915088897809,70.74915088897808,Medium Trust
Pissed off,/users/5e0a82e6b14ccf11ecf8404a,US,2.0,2019-12-30 23:07:28+00:00,1.0,WOW free two day shipping is not real even if it says so and your a member.,"WOW, I ordered an item and it was listed as a prime item. I am (WAS until today) A prime member so it should have been in two days. Well ordered it on the 28 won't arrive till the 3rd. I will be returning it. It seems that free shipping is only if they feel like it so it seems. But if you buy something with out a prime member ship they tell you that you could get free two day shipping if you have a prime account and it is a prime item. If they have some kind of trouble they need to make it right with you, nope nothing. The item should also have the Prime removed from it if they can not deliver it in two days. Oh well I will buy my stuff some ware else, even if it cost more.",2019-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,30.0,682,145,75,17,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wow ordered item listed prime item today prime member two day well ordered wont arrive till rd returning seems free shipping feel like seems buy something prime member ship tell could get free two day shipping prime account prime item kind trouble need make right nope nothing item also prime removed deliver two day oh well buy stuff ware else even cost,0.0055473674313558955,0.9944526325686441,0.08132361189007291,0.2,0.8134910386623366,81.34910386623366,High Trust
Laura,/users/5cbf2f42844622432ed052b1,GB,14.0,2020-01-02 12:22:18+00:00,2.0,It's a shame having to write this on…,"It's a shame having to write this on such a well known company but unfortunately people should know.Over the past couple of weeks we have brought various items totaling quite a lot of money.It started on the 19/12 when we ordered two items totaling just under £300.00, when placing this order amazon advised we are eligible for next day delivery prime - which of course was a result.I waited at home the hole day on the 20/12 to my surprise the order never arrived. We contact amazon on the 21/12, 22/12, 23/12 and the 24/12. The call centre which amazon uses is unfortunately useless and do not help in the slightest, they blamed our bank stating there was an issue with the payment - even though we had ordered 1 other item at the same time which arrived on the 22/12, using the same card! In order to get our delivery we had to cancel the order and put the order back through, waiting for the pending transaction to go.. thankfully we spoke to a very pleasant employee at amazon who managed to locate us the parcel to be sent the same day.We thought this may have been a blip which is understandable.. until we purchased another item from amazon which was just under £120.00, to our surprise we recieved this delivery on the 29/12.. to open it up to receive a HAIR ROOT KIT? which would clearly be under £10.00!I called amazon again and after being kn the phone for 1 hours I was no further forward, the call centre does not show any empathy and feels pausing for 3 minutes after you have spoken, polite. If they are not pasuing for a while after speaking they will interrupt you.So on the 29/12 we had to send a few emails, thankfully the issue potentially has been sorted.. I mean we have been provided an exchange but have been provided a refund to put through yet another order.  A lady by the name of Lydia Dimitrova, decied to respond to our email on this occasion, apparently using a expression stating you are 'pised' of is unacceptable. I would never swear at somebody on the telephone rather than just stating the obvious - it seems their call centre does not understand how furious and frustrated people get when they receive a ROOT DYE KIT, rather than an item for £120! Lydia proceeded to advise they can terminate calls if staff feel threatened etc, I think this is absolutely disgusting that you are accusing myself of this! I feel amazon (lydia) is taking the light away from Amazon's cock up rather than holding their hands up that they have done wrong.Amazon continue to state as the item didnt come through their company they cannot exchange, as far as I am aware if something is being sold through a company, you order from the same company, the item is in amazon packaging and it was packed at an amazon warehouse then the negligence is on them!Once my last item has finally been delivered, I will be deleting my account and will never use amazon again.",2019-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2020.0,1.0,2.0,2877,522,37,8,3.0,0,5,1,0,Genuine,shame write well known company unfortunately people knowover past couple week brought various item totaling quite lot moneyit started ordered two item totaling £ placing order amazon advised eligible next day delivery prime course resulti waited home hole day surprise order never arrived contact amazon call centre amazon us unfortunately useless help slightest blamed bank stating issue payment even though ordered item time arrived using card order get delivery cancel order put order back waiting pending transaction go thankfully spoke pleasant employee amazon managed locate u parcel sent daywe thought may blip understandable purchased another item amazon £ surprise recieved delivery open receive hair root kit would clearly £i called amazon kn phone hour forward call centre show empathy feel pausing minute spoken polite pasuing speaking interrupt youso send email thankfully issue potentially sorted mean provided exchange provided refund put yet another order lady name lydia dimitrova decied respond email occasion apparently using expression stating pised unacceptable would never swear somebody telephone rather stating obvious seems call centre understand furious frustrated people get receive root dye kit rather item £ lydia proceeded advise terminate call staff feel threatened etc think absolutely disgusting accusing feel amazon lydia taking light away amazon cock rather holding hand done wrongamazon continue state item didnt come company cannot exchange far aware something sold company order company item amazon packaging packed amazon warehouse negligence themonce last item finally delivered deleting account never use amazon,0.8905077384972062,0.10949226150279379,0.2927650028042625,0.4,0.7132991313122494,71.32991313122494,Medium Trust
Joan Ebright,/users/5e0a75fc6af502011d2e7842,US,1.0,2019-12-30 22:11:35+00:00,1.0,I have had an account with Amazon for…,"I have had an account with Amazon for some time.  I was even gifted an Amazon tablet for X-mas.  Unable to open my account.  Called several times, answered security questions, to unblock account-to NO avail.  Once was sent to an agent that took over my computer and said there was a problem and it would cost &650.00 to repair.  BS.  wanted to start over but am unable.  They sent OTP numbers.  When typed in, the come up as invalid!!!  The tablet will have to go back!!, and the ""H"" with Amazon.  J. Ebright",2019-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,30.0,508,93,38,8,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,account amazon time even gifted amazon tablet xmas unable open account called several time answered security question unblock accountto avail sent agent took computer said problem would cost repair b wanted start unable sent otp number typed come invalid tablet go back h amazon j ebright,0.9834366510664841,0.016563348933515853,0.05215928210880538,0.2,0.318713530888519,31.8713530888519,Low Trust
Bleezy Boy,/users/5e0163926af502d17e2ad201,US,6.0,2019-12-30 21:30:29+00:00,5.0,THIS IS HOW ONLINE SHOPPING SHOULD BE,"This is what online shopping should be, this is by far the best experience I've had with online ordering, I have been using eBay as long as I can remember but when they started letting people sell fake/knock off items I had to cut down a bit, but even the $13 a month for Amazon Prime is honestly not bad at all, it just ensures that you will get the majority of your items in 2 days, which is Awesome no matter who you are, and it also allows me to watch shows and movies that I do not own all for the Prime fee, I swear idk if I can shop anywhere else after my recent great experiences shopping with them, I see why they're taking over, I only wish I had jumped on earlier, Definitely Recommend !!",2019-12-30 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,30.0,699,139,37,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,online shopping far best experience ive online ordering using ebay long remember started letting people sell fakeknock item cut bit even month amazon prime honestly bad ensures get majority item day awesome matter also allows watch show movie prime fee swear idk shop anywhere else recent great experience shopping see theyre taking wish jumped earlier definitely recommend,0.14130835096557626,0.8586916490344237,0.07795849691531127,1.0,1.9449375239002742,194.49375239002742,High Trust
