"Adrian ""frustrated"" Feliciano",/users/5e08c380b14ccf2615f76802,US,1.0,2019-12-29 15:19:23+00:00,1.0,Amazon delivery causing property damage,"On 12/6/2019 a package from Amazon was being delivered. The UPS guy had a smart idea to drive on the lawn. Well he tired to drive on the lawn and was stuck until a tow truck had to pull him out. I went out and got numerous “Please do not drive on grass” signs. Then yesterday (3 weeks later) we were expecting a package from Amazon. This package was being delivered by Amazon and what do they do? They drive on the grass and get stuck and waited 3 hrs for a tow truck but this is before they damaged my lawn some more. The 1st incident occurred on 12/31/2018, an Amazon driver in a white van also drove on the lawn and got stuck causing major lawn damage!  So do Amazon drivers know how to read? I highly doubt it!",2019-12-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,29.0,714,141,39,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,package amazon delivered ups guy smart idea drive lawn well tired drive lawn stuck tow truck pull went got numerous “please drive grass” sign yesterday week later expecting package amazon package delivered amazon drive grass get stuck waited hr tow truck damaged lawn st incident occurred amazon driver white van also drove lawn got stuck causing major lawn damage amazon driver know read highly doubt,0.27920010116102023,0.7207998988389798,0.07908020190689849,0.2,0.6762159898008696,67.62159898008696,Medium Trust
