Jan Le,/users/5e07f5a9b14ccf09fbf7306f,US,3.0,2019-12-29 00:39:14+00:00,1.0,This holiday season Amazon has been one…,"This holiday season Amazon has been one of the worst experience I had to deal with. A couch I ordered went missing, UPS was the one delivering it too if that makes a big difference. Delivery men were sloppy, one was too lazy to deliver to my front door or leave in the mail box since it was a small package and said ""Failed to Deliver"" came later and made me walk all the way outside to pick it up.Another delivery they stuffed into some random electronic locker when I never even used that service. Had to have apartment managers look through it one by one to find the package. Just recently UPS decided to mess around with me by saying my address does not exist... I had a lot of other packages delivered to this address already... I fixed the ""wrong address"" to the same exact address and now my delivery is delayed for more days. I got that delivery today and lo and behold they gave me the wrong item. I ordered a 16ft cable, was given a 10ft cable instead...All these late deliveries, wrong deliveries, and bad customer service making me think twice about using Amazon.",2019-12-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,29.0,1075,199,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,holiday season amazon one worst experience deal couch ordered went missing ups one delivering make big difference delivery men sloppy one lazy deliver front door leave mail box since small package said failed deliver came later made walk way outside pick upanother delivery stuffed random electronic locker never even used service apartment manager look one one find package recently ups decided mess around saying address exist lot package delivered address already fixed wrong address exact address delivery delayed day got delivery today lo behold gave wrong item ordered ft cable given ft cable insteadall late delivery wrong delivery bad customer service making think twice using amazon,0.005709931312895637,0.9942900686871043,0.11160964666292765,0.2,0.8194669636761378,81.94669636761378,High Trust
This Guy,/users/5e07e2706af50280372d69e1,US,1.0,2019-12-28 23:17:43+00:00,1.0,Amazons Continued Use of USPS is a JOKE!!,"If I could give zero stars I would. Once again, Amazon's continued use of the United States Postal Service (USPS) has screwed me, too many times to count. You pay for GUARANTEED delivery by a certain date, but God forbid if you live in an apartment or condo complex. UPS and FedEx hand deliver all packages right to my door on time as they are supposed to, but not the laziest people on earth who work for the USPS. I get package delivery notices in my box requiring ME to travel 20 miles round trip to pick up my package, which will now be 2 days LATE at least before I have time to do so. I have registered complaints with Amazon but they do not care and REFUSE to hold the USPS to the same delivery standards as UPS and FedEx, but continue to say my delivery is GUARANTEED. BS! I have also asked them to tell me WHO will be delivering my package prior to placing my order, and again they REFUSE to change their policy and at least let me know that so I can go someplace else without this hassle. In the future anytime I see that USPS is my carrier I am cancelling my order and going elsewhere. Go to hell USPS, and you wonder why you are losing money. If you were a private company you would be out of business. Amazon should be ASHAMED of themselves for allowing them to continue to deliver sub-standard service compared to other carriers.",2019-12-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,28.0,1343,256,41,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,could give zero star would amazon continued use united state postal service usps screwed many time count pay guaranteed delivery certain date god forbid live apartment condo complex ups fedex hand deliver package right door time supposed laziest people earth work usps get package delivery notice box requiring travel mile round trip pick package day late least time registered complaint amazon care refuse hold usps delivery standard ups fedex continue say delivery guaranteed b also asked tell delivering package prior placing order refuse change policy least let know go someplace else without hassle future anytime see usps carrier cancelling order going elsewhere go hell usps wonder losing money private company would business amazon ashamed allowing continue deliver substandard service compared carrier,0.025865874806564885,0.9741341251934351,0.1435782389231632,0.2,0.8157827103813502,81.57827103813501,High Trust
