Krystin,/users/579085270000ff000a33aa92,US,2.0,2019-12-28 16:44:00+00:00,1.0,I had the worse experience with Amazon…,"I had the worse experience with Amazon today!! So much so I cancelled my prime membership after being with them for a few years. I ordered a gift for my daughter with expectation of it being delivered today. Well, I just happened to check my email last night and saw that my package was delayed until Monday. Of course, they didn't notify me to let me know. Then when I called to see if there was anything could do due to the circumstances, they were no help. All they wanted to offer me was a $5 credit after I spent almost $150 just on this order alone. I was highly upset due to the fact that my daughter is going out of town Sunday and will not return until next Sunday...so now she has to wait until she gets back to get her gift. I am so beyond pist...I will never order from Amazon again since the delivery time that the quote you is not guaranteed. And then they notify you to let you your package is delayed. So just so you know the date they quote you not guaranteed, even though it says it will be delivered by that day...not estimated time or expected date...but it will be delivered on that date. Its BS!!! They have lost a customer for good..and I will be telling everyone I can do not order thru Amazon!!! They may got your package to you on time and they will not do anything to fix the problem but offer you a $5 credit!!!",2019-12-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,28.0,1339,259,39,7,0.0,0,11,2,1,Suspicious,worse experience amazon today much cancelled prime membership year ordered gift daughter expectation delivered today well happened check email last night saw package delayed monday course didnt notify let know called see anything could due circumstance help wanted offer credit spent almost order alone highly upset due fact daughter going town sunday return next sundayso wait get back get gift beyond pisti never order amazon since delivery time quote guaranteed notify let package delayed know date quote guaranteed even though say delivered daynot estimated time expected datebut delivered date b lost customer goodand telling everyone order thru amazon may got package time anything fix problem offer credit,0.9999914347643916,8.565235608437582e-06,0.14526079641054404,0.2,0.329056441899913,32.9056441899913,Low Trust
EWKB,/users/536e7032000064000172cdb2,GB,30.0,2019-12-28 12:38:05+00:00,1.0,"Price for item was £69 ten mins ago, now £80","Price for item was £80 yesterday, added it to my cart to check it out properly later. This morning it was £69, logged onto my PC to buy it and it was back up to £80 in the space of ten mins. I phoned to ask what was going on, they said demand for the item had made the price go up - no chance this is true, the ""demand"" was me adding it to my cart, it's a niche item. This kind of price fluctuation is ridiculous. Something should be on sale for a set period, not changing every few minutes.",2019-12-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,28.0,491,102,44,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,price item £ yesterday added cart check properly later morning £ logged onto pc buy back £ space ten min phoned ask going said demand item made price go chance true demand adding cart niche item kind price fluctuation ridiculous something sale set period changing every minute,0.053459189654255036,0.946540810345745,0.05720695457094784,0.2,0.7847117960870621,78.47117960870621,High Trust
