Rob M,/users/5dc5c047ec22cd146f3c58f5,US,6.0,2019-12-25 16:57:05+00:00,1.0,Untrustworthy and low-quality,"Amazon's e-commerce dominance has allowed the company to grow essentially without competition with a focus solely on profits. Products are increasingly low quality and often defective or falsely represented. It is too easy for sellers to take a bad or poorly rated product, relabel it, and inflate it with false reviews. The average product rating on Amazon is 4.4/5 - this fact alone should raise eyebrows. My experience with this company has been unpleasant. Amazon is not trustworthy, focused solely on profits, and increasingly represented by the lowest quality products available.",2019-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,25.0,585,91,29,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon ecommerce dominance allowed company grow essentially without competition focus solely profit product increasingly low quality often defective falsely represented easy seller take bad poorly rated product relabel inflate false review average product rating amazon fact alone raise eyebrow experience company unpleasant amazon trustworthy focused solely profit increasingly represented lowest quality product available,0.08173356614390927,0.9182664338560907,0.05103757711721817,0.2,0.769340732351489,76.9340732351489,High Trust
