Robert Thompson,/users/5e03629e98483650ba77f7dc,CA,1.0,2019-12-25 13:22:48+00:00,1.0,Not as advertised,"I used to big a big fan of Amazon as I can easily browse and find what I wanted. But, more and more knock off products are put on there that are not as advertised by the fake reviews. The shipping had also taken a huge dive, I used to get everything within a week with their free shipping now it's become a joke and they'll ship it as slow as possible taking up to a month now , delaying so they can push the idea of prime while saying it shipped from day 1 so you can't cancel. Then add on-top of that for christmas they presented dates before Christmas for shipping and after purchase all the dates shifted back to way after.",2019-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,25.0,627,124,17,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used big big fan amazon easily browse find wanted knock product put advertised fake review shipping also taken huge dive used get everything within week free shipping become joke theyll ship slow possible taking month delaying push idea prime saying shipped day cant cancel add ontop christmas presented date christmas shipping purchase date shifted back way,0.019681402158322456,0.9803185978416775,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.8040684408165203,80.40684408165203,High Trust
