Ontario College of Management & Technology OCMT,/users/5e02d5a36af502a6612b6580,CA,1.0,2019-12-25 03:21:16+00:00,1.0,This is the first time I have ordered…,"This is the first time I have ordered anything from Amazon and the experience is disappointing that I can't say how worse more it can be. I ordered two quantities of an item on November 30. I paid for a rush delivery since Nov 30. I am still expecting the delivery as at the writing of my pain. The item I have ordered was to be sent abroad with someone traveling in hope the person could help to deliver it. Well, to the shame of Amazon and their seller, the person has left and here I am, still waiting to receive the order. I called Amazon and the only thing I could get was ""sorry"". I contacted the seller they passed the blame to the postal service. It is bad and worse than anything I have seen. This is nothing to write home about as far as my experience with this company is concerned.",2019-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,25.0,793,154,38,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,first time ordered anything amazon experience disappointing cant say worse ordered two quantity item november paid rush delivery since nov still expecting delivery writing pain item ordered sent abroad someone traveling hope person could help deliver well shame amazon seller person left still waiting receive order called amazon thing could get sorry contacted seller passed blame postal service bad worse anything seen nothing write home far experience company concerned,0.008373652122441476,0.9916263478775585,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.8130874308092223,81.30874308092223,High Trust
Katie Cambria,/users/5e02d2f0984836133877ce58,US,1.0,2019-12-25 03:13:38+00:00,1.0,Single mom left broke at Christmas due to unauthorized charges.,"I’m a broke single mom struggling to make ends meet. Today being Christmas Eve, the one day of the year single moms everywhere are down to their last dollar.. Well I noticed my bank account negative $83. My account was at $0 due to Christmas. I go to check account activity. There were 2 separate charges dated December 23, 2019 for Amazon Prime Video purchases I did not authorize, (One for $4.99 and one for 7.99, along with two overdraft penalty fees of $35/each) on a credit card I did not authorize to use, for this card is NOT set as my default payment. Why would I authorize payment on an account I knew had no money in it? So I can pay an overdraft fee for something that costs fraction of the price? I don’t think so. I called Amazon to report it. I told them I did not authorize the purchases, nor did I authorize the use of this credit card, and that these charges resulted in two $35 overdraft fees. That this happened on their end not mine. They can’t explain why it happened, putting blame on the “buy now 1-click” option and proceeded to tell me how to disable that option in the future. They quickly refunded the purchase amounts, but told me I’m on my own with the overdraft fees and there’s nothing they can do. These charges were NEVER authorized... Yesterday Amazon deceitfully charged me separately for two  movies, on the same day causing two separate overdraft fees on an account they were not authorized to charge. One of these movies was purchased weeks ago but only charged yesterday? Why is that? Told them my financial situation, and that these charges have put my account in the negative and I’m a single mom the day before Christmas. That they need to compensate me for this mistake they made. Talked to two different people both told me I’m on my own. Merry Christmas indeed. Amazon is making its way as one of the world’s most valuable companies. Yet they refused to compensate me for the error they made, leaving a poor single mom with a negative bank account at Christmas. Thanks a lot Amazon. Is this what I get for the 5yrs I’ve been a loyal Amazon prime member?",2019-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,25.0,2098,384,63,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’m broke single mom struggling make end meet today christmas eve one day year single mom everywhere last dollar well noticed bank account negative account due christmas go check account activity separate charge dated december amazon prime video purchase authorize one one along two overdraft penalty fee credit card authorize use card set default payment would authorize payment account knew money pay overdraft fee something cost fraction price don’t think called amazon report told authorize purchase authorize use credit card charge resulted two overdraft fee happened end mine can’t explain happened putting blame “buy click” option proceeded tell disable option future quickly refunded purchase amount told i’m overdraft fee there’s nothing charge never authorized yesterday amazon deceitfully charged separately two movie day causing two separate overdraft fee account authorized charge one movie purchased week ago charged yesterday told financial situation charge put account negative i’m single mom day christmas need compensate mistake made talked two different people told i’m merry christmas indeed amazon making way one world’s valuable company yet refused compensate error made leaving poor single mom negative bank account christmas thanks lot amazon get yr i’ve loyal amazon prime member,0.008486165570853481,0.9915138344291465,0.2153673583847448,0.2,0.8388303888915223,83.88303888915223,High Trust
L Champlin,/users/5e02af8b31bb5add038f929a,US,2.0,2019-12-25 00:38:44+00:00,1.0,Loyal Customer screwed over…,"I have been a loyal customer to Amazon since 2012.. all of a sudden in August of this year my Amazon acct was hacked and locked. I went thru their verification process three times. Was told my account was cleared, only to find out in November my account was locked again for a supposed outstanding balance. When I called customer service all they could do was send an email to the account verification department again.. 5 different times they were to send me another email to verify my account and twice a phone call. To date nothing but then they cancelled my accounts for prime and audibles. An want to only give me 4 of the 14 credits back that were on my audibles acct. I couldn't use any of my credits because of my locked account. Now Amazon sent me an email to call this TRS Recovery Service, which I did, this service didn't have my account locked, but seen where I was sent packages to a business in my town and to Utah both of which I have never done. When I asked a representative if this was sent AFTER I verified my correct information, she said yes.. an when I asked why would I send packages to places I never have before, or under accounts I already told them wasn't mine... I was informed if I didn't do it then how did I know where the packages went, after informing the representative several times TRS told me, I was once again told it was my fault and nothing could be done without the accounts department.. but no one can get ahold of the accounts department.  I'm so tired of the run around, I don't understand how after 7 years of no problems all of a sudden it's all my fault an no one can fix anything, or even wants to try. So I am out not only my 12.99 a month since September, I am also out 22.99 for my audibles membership for 7 months and my audibles escape for 7 months at 6.95 a month... At one point I was being charges two audibles fees an audible escapes fees a month but still wasn't allowed to use my credits because of this ""hold"" on my account... I'm pretty mad an I am sure no one within Amazon cares or will try to rectify this situation. So disappointed with them.",2019-12-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,25.0,2108,403,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,loyal customer amazon since sudden august year amazon acct hacked locked went thru verification process three time told account cleared find november account locked supposed outstanding balance called customer service could send email account verification department different time send another email verify account twice phone call date nothing cancelled account prime audible want give credit back audible acct couldnt use credit locked account amazon sent email call trs recovery service service didnt account locked seen sent package business town utah never done asked representative sent verified correct information said yes asked would send package place never account already told wasnt mine informed didnt know package went informing representative several time trs told told fault nothing could done without account department one get ahold account department im tired run around dont understand year problem sudden fault one fix anything even want try month since september also audible membership month audible escape month month one point charge two audible fee audible escape fee month still wasnt allowed use credit hold account im pretty mad sure one within amazon care try rectify situation disappointed,0.013483993800247838,0.9865160061997522,0.22602355580482333,0.2,0.8384627142608408,83.84627142608409,High Trust
Brian,/users/5e029bce361d616c2f071103,US,1.0,2019-12-24 23:21:00+00:00,1.0,Dissatisfied and Amazon is the worst place to order from,"Bought a nice Frigidaire wine cooler for my wife for Christmas, received the item opened it up and guess what glass everywhere front door glass broken, so I called customer service and only thing I get is a return item that I have to go out of my way to ship it back and get a refund, no return and replace and I have to order it all over again? What kind of a crappy place is this! This is my first time using Amazon and last time also told the wife to delete her amazon account as well! Merry Christmas to my wife that does not get a gift now thanks a lot Amazon!",2019-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,24.0,565,115,56,10,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,bought nice frigidaire wine cooler wife christmas received item opened guess glass everywhere front door glass broken called customer service thing get return item go way ship back get refund return replace order kind crappy place first time using amazon last time also told wife delete amazon account well merry christmas wife get gift thanks lot amazon,0.7747750488560112,0.22522495114398877,0.06449803701626472,0.2,0.42551208297524734,42.55120829752473,Low Trust
