Sofia Zaman,/users/5e028cd6361d61224b070c64,GB,1.0,2019-12-24 22:12:19+00:00,1.0,Bought last minute Xmas presents for…,Bought last minute Xmas presents for the kids items they added for Santa at the last minute as kids tooOrdered from amazon one day delivery so would arrive just before Xmas day perfect Only the next day get a message it will not be arriving as there’s been a delay after a 15 min call reassures by amazon customer service advisor it will arrive by evening latest Xmas morning Ring back again as not arrived by 10pm after another 20 min call told it’s not even been put out for shipment need to cancel and reorder asked how exactly it’s happened not able to explain that’s the best they can do for ruining someone’s Xmas!!!Not happy at all not delivered the service promised and why was I not made aware of this in the first call when I still had time to go out and shop!!!Asked to speak to supervisor put on hold for another 10 mins listening to some annoying music Unbelievable really disappointed Spoke to manager couldn’t explain what has gone wrong no explanation as to what has happened said even if I place order again still wouldn’t get it till another 3 days Spoke to 3 people and got 3 different answersNot happy,2019-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,24.0,1121,206,37,6,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,bought last minute xmas present kid item added santa last minute kid tooordered amazon one day delivery would arrive xmas day perfect next day get message arriving there’s delay min call reassures amazon customer service advisor arrive evening latest xmas morning ring back arrived pm another min call told it’s even put shipment need cancel reorder asked exactly it’s happened able explain that’s best ruining someone’s xmasnot happy delivered service promised made aware first call still time go shopasked speak supervisor put hold another min listening annoying music unbelievable really disappointed spoke manager couldn’t explain gone wrong explanation happened said even place order still wouldn’t get till another day spoke people got different answersnot happy,0.9934318249784214,0.006568175021578582,0.1155356141334829,0.2,0.32639121033748586,32.63912103374859,Low Trust
