Denise Evans,/users/5e02339b31bb5aaf518f6177,US,4.0,2019-12-24 15:49:55+00:00,1.0,I had been a loyal customer,"I had been a loyal customer,  constantly raving about their website.  You see I work for a tax software company.  I was pleasantly surprised at the ease of using the website. I bragged about how amazing their technology is.  And then this week happened. I was more than happy to use $300 in gift cards.  Little did I know the order was duplicated and they started taking money from my checking account.  No problem,  I'll just cancel the items. Bullsh@t... Amazons website isn't as great and wondrous as I had proclaimed.  I attempted to chat with someone,  but you can't because it's all A.I. No live person.  As I started canceling items, instead of Amazon putting my cash back in my account,  they decided to credit the gift card.  Amazon has taught me a valuable lesson this year.  Stop shopping online and get out there in the real world!! These so called conveniences come at a price.  I would have recommended Amazon to anyone prior to this.  I will never order from them again!! Waste of time and money!!!",2019-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,24.0,1013,179,27,6,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,loyal customer constantly raving website see work tax software company pleasantly surprised ease using website bragged amazing technology week happened happy use gift card little know order duplicated started taking money checking account problem ill cancel item bullsht amazon website isnt great wondrous proclaimed attempted chat someone cant ai live person started canceling item instead amazon putting cash back account decided credit gift card amazon taught valuable lesson year stop shopping online get real world called convenience come price would recommended amazon anyone prior never order waste time money,0.9977598744112879,0.0022401255887121163,0.10039259674705553,0.2,0.3211985821437672,32.11985821437672,Low Trust
