Neil,/users/5b898fc24de5666d34b4d5c6,GB,12.0,2019-12-24 13:36:22+00:00,1.0,Shocking delivery service,"Shocking delivery service. Have been a loyal Amazon customer for years but recently had delivery issues. First time few weeks ago got the message that my order had been put through post box, no it hadn't as been home all day. Amazon didn't seem to care that my parcel with personal details had gone missing just promised wouldn't happen again and sent a replacement. This Sunday same again, your parcel is in letterbox, no it isn't and have been in all day. Again Amazon customer service not bothered and could confirm they seen my additional delivery instructions on how to find the property, promised a note in dispatch section so wouldn't happen again. Yesterday waiting for the replacement, get the notification to say driver 5 stops away so keep watch, when it says 3 stops a van pulls up, in the less than 20 seconds it takes me to get to the drive the driver is back in the van, manage to stop him driving away and he proudly confirms it's in the letterbox, not my letterbox it wasn't. he had helpfully confirmed it's in the letterbox of the new build next door along with my original parcel from Sunday. He confirmed he didn't read the additional note as claimed wasn't one. Only after checking his electronic gadget confirmed the note was there, So clearly he isn't very good at his job. The new build next door doesn't even have a number and the speed he was back in the van he clearly didn't even bother to knock just stuck it in letterbox, mumbled about being busy! Asked how we can fix it, well considering the new build is empty and no one is likely to be there the week of Xmas the only way to fix it is me to cancel the order and now go to the shop to buy the Xmas present, instead of using Amazon. Again Amazon didn't care and promised to raise a complaint but helpfully can't tell me the outcome of said complaint, ie they won't investigate it. Cancelled prime and will shop elsewhere.",2019-12-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,24.0,1903,350,25,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,shocking delivery service loyal amazon customer year recently delivery issue first time week ago got message order put post box hadnt home day amazon didnt seem care parcel personal detail gone missing promised wouldnt happen sent replacement sunday parcel letterbox isnt day amazon customer service bothered could confirm seen additional delivery instruction find property promised note dispatch section wouldnt happen yesterday waiting replacement get notification say driver stop away keep watch say stop van pull less second take get drive driver back van manage stop driving away proudly confirms letterbox letterbox wasnt helpfully confirmed letterbox new build next door along original parcel sunday confirmed didnt read additional note claimed wasnt one checking electronic gadget confirmed note clearly isnt good job new build next door doesnt even number speed back van clearly didnt even bother knock stuck letterbox mumbled busy asked fix well considering new build empty one likely week xmas way fix cancel order go shop buy xmas present instead using amazon amazon didnt care promised raise complaint helpfully cant tell outcome said complaint ie wont investigate cancelled prime shop elsewhere,0.09419265836740297,0.905807341632597,0.1962983735277622,0.2,0.792163345521851,79.2163345521851,High Trust
