customer,/users/5c07b99318423cca18be7f55,US,2.0,2019-12-22 22:53:14+00:00,2.0,Pending Refund,"As of today, I would rate Amazon a zero. I ordered a few items a few weeks ago and patiently waited for the packages to arrive. On the expected delivery day I discovered the driver delivered the packages to the wrong apartment!    I received the refund for the two less expensive items but I am still pending the refund on the two more expensive items. The customer service representative stated I should be refunded within 3 to 5 days. When that didn’t happen I called again and was once again given the same information.    I reached out again after one week only to be told by a third representative the refund was never initiated! The level of incompetence is ridiculous!",2019-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,22.0,675,120,14,2,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,today would rate amazon zero ordered item week ago patiently waited package arrive expected delivery day discovered driver delivered package wrong apartment received refund two less expensive item still pending refund two expensive item customer service representative stated refunded within day didn’t happen called given information reached one week told third representative refund never initiated level incompetence ridiculous,0.7943278829715898,0.20567211702841015,0.06730229949523275,0.4,0.7162965184132516,71.62965184132516,Medium Trust
