Alyssa Crum,/users/5dff05506af5026c2829ba13,US,1.0,2019-12-22 05:56:24+00:00,5.0,Wonderful Customer Service,"I had such a positive experience calling Amazon’s customer service line! I was transferred to someone from the exact department I had a question about, and the rep walked me through the website step by step in order to resolve my problem. He even refunded me for a product I had purchased by mistake and gave me a new $1 off coupon that had been applied to the mistaken purchase. Such a positive experience!",2019-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,22.0,407,74,26,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,positive experience calling amazon’s customer service line transferred someone exact department question rep walked website step step order resolve problem even refunded product purchased mistake gave new coupon applied mistaken purchase positive experience,0.4479501833707671,0.5520498166292329,0.04150308468872686,1.0,1.7843255252523618,178.4325525252362,High Trust
John Lee,/users/5dfed1dcb14ccf738cf37071,US,1.0,2019-12-22 02:16:04+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service experience,"Worst customer service experience. They absolutely took no responsibility for a lost item after wasting 3 days and repeatedly being told it's a X-mas gift that I ordered way ahead of time, and I still haven't received it yet.  If Amazon keeps up with their customer service like this, they will eventually go down.  I will be canceling my prime membership.",2019-12-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,22.0,356,61,33,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,worst customer service experience absolutely took responsibility lost item wasting day repeatedly told xmas gift ordered way ahead time still havent received yet amazon keep customer service like eventually go canceling prime membership,0.02537954292449739,0.9746204570755026,0.034212002243409985,0.2,0.7941526289864334,79.41526289864333,High Trust
Kathleen Bergeron,/users/5a2a0fc50000ff000aee0507,US,15.0,2019-12-21 20:22:32+00:00,2.0,Disgusted and disappointed,"I ordered a gift on Dec 2 and they have been lying to me ever since— jerking the delivery date back and forth. I finally called customer service and the first rep could barely speak English. I tried to be polite but she could not comprehend what I was asking. I demanded a rep in the US who could  understand English and when I got one ( after 20 minutes on hold) she did “get” what I was saying. She filed a stuck order ticket. So-Amazon then lied again and said the item would arrive on the 19th. I knew this was bull because the website STILL did not show it as having been shipped. As of today the site says it will arrive today which of course, is nonsense. Last time I heard from the customer service gal she said it won’t ship till the 28th 😡😡. This episode clearly proves that Amazon listed merchandise for sale for which they lacked sufficient stock to fill orders and instead of being honest, they lie lie lie. And I have been a prime member for well over a decade. Very very disgusted.",2019-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,21.0,996,191,26,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered gift dec lying ever since— jerking delivery date back forth finally called customer service first rep could barely speak english tried polite could comprehend asking demanded rep u could understand english got one minute hold “get” saying filed stuck order ticket soamazon lied said item would arrive th knew bull website still show shipped today site say arrive today course nonsense last time heard customer service gal said won’t ship till th 😡😡 episode clearly prof amazon listed merchandise sale lacked sufficient stock fill order instead honest lie lie lie prime member well decade disgusted,0.03753190305377423,0.9624680969462258,0.1071228266965788,0.4,1.1026586138124286,110.26586138124286,High Trust
Shell,/users/5dfe72fa6af5025afe2998bb,US,1.0,2019-12-21 19:33:27+00:00,1.0,I don’t know what happened to amazon…,"I don’t know what happened to amazon recently, but I’m cancelling my membership. First, I had chosen a Christmas angel off of a tree at work for struggling families and purchased the kids their gifts. So, I’m checking on my orders as always. and the day of(12/18/19)I see “on it’s way” and saying it’ll be there by 8pm. By 6pm it still hadn’t gone out for delivery, so I contact customer service since I had to have the gift for the kids the next morning. They said that it’s delayed and I can expect it the 19th. I was heated but figured I could make it work. Then they tell me it will now be the 20th and then back to the 19th then the 21ST. I told them to cancel it because I won’t have a need for the toy and I had already gone out and bought ANOTHER one so the kid could have something. They said the can’t cancel it. Like yeah you can I ordered it from you. Anyway. It was just one thing that never showed up. so since I’ve had amazon for years, I figured I’d give it another shot. I placed an order. And same thing! It’s supposed to be delivered today, and it’s doing the “on it’s way!” Thing and since it’s still saying that, I know it’s not coming. So I’m cancelling my account. They are the worst.",2019-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,21.0,1207,237,37,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,don’t know happened amazon recently i’m cancelling membership first chosen christmas angel tree work struggling family purchased kid gift i’m checking order always day ofi see “on it’s way” saying it’ll pm pm still hadn’t gone delivery contact customer service since gift kid next morning said it’s delayed expect th heated figured could make work tell th back th st told cancel won’t need toy already gone bought another one kid could something said can’t cancel like yeah ordered anyway one thing never showed since i’ve amazon year figured i’d give another shot placed order thing it’s supposed de