Juliet,/users/5dfd759831bb5a6be08d7046,US,1.0,2019-12-21 01:35:00+00:00,1.0,Thank you Amazon for insulting me!,"I had an Amazon account for years and never had any problems because I never make any returns or need any helps with the order. as long as I receive my orders. Until I requested a return and contact customer service through Chat. The worst customer service that I have ever experienced in my life. Here are my experiencesThe 1st customer service representative told me that I can still return my item after 30 days return period(she told me she will give it as an exceptional case) and I will get a refund from Amazon. I just have to wait for the seller to send me a return label. ( I was very appreciated at this point).The seller did email me asking what is the reason for returns. and I emailed them back and never hear from them again.  So I contact Amazon customer service again through Chat about the situation and I had to repeat the situation all over again( you know how frustrated it is to repeat the same thing). The 2nd representative told me they will taking care of it, even if the seller doesn't make a refund, they will credit the refund for me from Amazon. I just have to wait for the seller to send me a return label. ( I was like ok that's great service).The seller never emailed a return label, so I contact Amazon again, and the 3rd representative was sharp, he told me he will email the seller again if they don't response within 2 business days, they will file a claim and request for a return/refund. and he was like, don't worry we will taking care of it for you. Nothing happened at this point, so I contacted the Amazon again and repeated the same thing all over again, here comes the worst part, the 4th customer service representative literary insulting me by following steps:1st- she said "" stop making up stories, you not going to get refunds""( she literary saying I am lying about what the previous reps told me) 2nd, she sent a return policy link to me to show me that if I don't know about the return policy. third- she said: You not going  to get a refund, but I can give you $5.( I was like how rude this person is, I don't need your $5)so she literary insulted me as a liar and a cheap person to get rid fast by offering $5 and she also insulted her colleagues( the previous 3 representatives)'s work. I was so shocked how unprofessional and uneducated this person is, and how can Amazon hire this type of person as customer service. As her wish she did get rid of me fast, I ended up canceling my amazon account permanently and will not buy anything from Amazon ever again in my life nor my family. We can live without Amazon, we can buy anything else from other smaller e-commerce site or stores. and support those businesses that deserve it. I think the fundamental problem with this case is that Amazon is so big and doesn't have competitors for the past 20 years, they don't care if their service is good or not, and they may don't have the capacity to deal with all the issues which result in poor customer services. The only way to have better service and better products is to have competitors, it is beneficial for both companies and consumers.",2019-12-21 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,21.0,3090,574,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon account year never problem never make return need help order long receive order requested return contact customer service chat worst customer service ever experienced life experiencesthe st customer service representative told still return item day return periodshe told give exceptional case get refund amazon wait seller send return label appreciated pointthe seller email asking reason return emailed back never hear contact amazon customer service chat situation repeat situation know frustrated repeat thing nd representative told taking care even seller doesnt make refund credit refund amazon wait seller send return label like ok thats great servicethe seller never emailed return label contact amazon rd representative sharp told email seller dont response within business day file claim request returnrefund like dont worry taking care nothing happened point contacted amazon repeated thing come worst part th customer service representative literary insulting following stepsst said stop making story going get refund literary saying lying previous rep told nd sent return policy link show dont know return policy third said going get refund give like rude person dont need literary insulted liar cheap person get rid fast offering also insulted colleague previous representativess work shocked unprofessional uneducated person amazon hire type person customer service wish get rid fast ended canceling amazon account permanently buy anything amazon ever life family live without amazon buy anything else smaller ecommerce site store support business deserve think fundamental problem case amazon big doesnt competitor past year dont care service good may dont capacity deal issue result poor customer service way better service better product competitor beneficial company consumer,0.0045303405813816025,0.9954696594186184,0.32192933258553,0.2,0.8621206962264152,86.21206962264152,High Trust
