Aabaana,/users/55c26e910000ff0001d1f614,GB,12.0,2019-12-20 16:49:45+00:00,1.0,"OH, FOR A NIL STAR REVIEW.","All I ever seem to hear from other scarred ex-Customers of Amazon is that they will never use Amazon or Amazon Marketplace again.Having returned £152 (+£20 postage) two items to a Chinese Seller, quite simply, Amazon refuses to forward the refund for either sums of money.I have now spent since the items arrived in June, trying to resolve this issue; Amazon has an in-house Department called 'A to Z Guarantee' - quite cleverly, Amazon doesn't specify what the name implies; however, it appears to guarantee, no matter what, its Customers will NOT receive a refund NOR any explanation for their refusal.I have proof the goods were posted and have been assured on four separate occasions, the money had been refunded to my bank account; however, no money has been refunded.As it's nigh on impossible to find ANYWHERE one can scribe a negative review, making public Amazon's disgusting administration of their Customers; I can only guess Review sites are intimidated by the size and the power Amazon holds and are afraid to publicise the awful experience experienced by so many members of the public.",2019-12-20 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,20.0,1099,183,26,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ever seem hear scarred excustomers amazon never use amazon amazon marketplace againhaving returned £ £ postage two item chinese seller quite simply amazon refuse forward refund either sum moneyi spent since item arrived june trying resolve issue amazon inhouse department called z guarantee quite cleverly amazon doesnt specify name implies however appears guarantee matter customer receive refund explanation refusali proof good posted assured four separate occasion money refunded bank account however money refundedas nigh impossible find anywhere one scribe negative review making public amazon disgusting administration customer guess review site intimidated size power amazon hold afraid publicise awful experience experienced many member public,0.01672444103526938,0.9832755589647306,0.10263600673022995,0.2,0.8121649808284113,81.21649808284113,High Trust
