Sam,/users/5dfc63b398483609bd74e511,US,1.0,2019-12-20 06:01:55+00:00,1.0,A customer service that doesn't have clue,"I placed some orders for Christmas but after i received confirmation message i noticed the delivery date is 31 December instead of  23 Dec that was showing during the ordering process, so i sent email to customer service requesting their help to change the date, they replied saying this cannot be changed and i should cancel the order and redo it again which i reject their offer and asked to keep it , the next day i was  surprised to find out that instead of helping to solve the issue or at least leave it some genius has canceled the order and blocked the account , so i called to verify the problem and was told that there was some unauthorized activities on my account and therefore they canceled all the orders and blocked my account, and for the past 4 days i'm still struggling with all the geniuses at amazon customer service trying to find solution to reopen the account, the funny thing that i need to reopen the account in order to get a refund in case they refuse to deliver the order. and as usual after every time i call them or blast them for this mess that they made in such critical time all what i hear is apology and clueless justification or blame the problem on the system or back office, and then once i hangup will find email thanking me for my call and request to participate in satisfactory survey that doesn't have minus level on it  .I believe Amazon has become a large dinosaurs that due for extinction and collapse.",2019-12-20 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,20.0,1447,267,41,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order christmas received confirmation message noticed delivery date december instead dec showing ordering process sent email customer service requesting help change date replied saying cannot changed cancel order redo reject offer asked keep next day surprised find instead helping solve issue least leave genius canceled order blocked account called verify problem told unauthorized activity account therefore canceled order blocked account past day im still struggling genius amazon customer service trying find solution reopen account funny thing need reopen account order get refund case refuse deliver order usual every time call blast mess made critical time hear apology clueless justification blame problem system back office hangup find email thanking call request participate satisfactory survey doesnt minus level believe amazon become large dinosaur due extinction collapse,0.007902721109311034,0.992097278890689,0.14974761637689288,0.2,0.8259981627207231,82.59981627207232,High Trust
Mo,/users/5dfb763631bb5a00968c46cd,GB,15.0,2019-12-20 04:00:40+00:00,4.0,One of the best online shopping experience,"Generally one of the best e commerce sites. Their prices are competitive, and after hundreds of orders, I have only had an issue with delivery once. I had returned an item once and it was the most pleasant returns process I have experienced. I had the item collected from my home without any issues.I did however find issues with what i assume is their Indian call centre. Upon having my delivery lost, I contacted the call centre. It had been during the 2017 black Friday sales so it was a little understandable that the items were missing. However, what i did find annoying is the customer service rep being unable to understand that a mere refund and repurchase is not ideal as I had purchased during a sale, and the prices had increased. After trying to ask for a re-delivery rather than a refund, and the rep not understanding why a refund and repurchase was not ideal, I agreed to the refund. after 10 days, i did not receive the refund, i call again and am told its sorted. Again no refund. On my subsequent call, I was lucky enough to be directed to what i believe is the Irish call centre. I had no issues with communication and had finally received my refund two days later. One thing i really like about calling Amazon is that they call back in a certain number of minutes rather than you having to stay on the line.Other than my less than pleasant refund experience, Amazon tend to be good with returns. I like to believe that the experience is a one off. Amazon have been very consistent and i'd recommend them to anyone.edit: i did forget to mention that they carried on my Amazon prime (student) even though I am certain I cancelled it. what was annoying is that they still kept around £7 even though I had cancelled it again a week after realising. I also don't like how they try to trick you into paying for delivery as it is the default option even after being eligible for free delivery. I find that it takes a long time for the app to load when you do select free delivery. the cynical side of me says that's intentional to make people frustrated and just pay for the delivery.I did get scammed by a seller once. I was refunded immediately by an automated system. I believe once a seller is found to be a scammer, any claims automatically refunds you.One last point. Be wary of ""fulfilled by amazon"" products. they can be at the Amazon warehouse, but may stil have issues. I recently purchased a new item delivered by amazon, However, it was quite clear that it was used,",2019-12-20 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,20.0,2491,457,42,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,generally one best e commerce site price competitive hundred order issue delivery returned item pleasant return process experienced item collected home without issuesi however find issue assume indian call centre upon delivery lost contacted call centre black friday sale little understandable item missing however find annoying customer service rep unable understand mere refund repurchase ideal purchased sale price increased trying ask redelivery rather refund rep understanding refund repurchase ideal agreed refund day receive refund call told sorted refund subsequent call lucky enough directed believe irish call centre issue communication finally received refund two day later one thing really like calling amazon call back certain number minute rather stay lineother less pleasant refund experience amazon tend good return like believe experience one amazon consistent id recommend anyoneedit forget mention carried amazon prime student even though certain cancelled annoying still kept around £ even though cancelled week realising also dont like try trick paying delivery default option even eligible free delivery find take long time app load select free delivery cynical side say thats intentional make people frustrated pay deliveryi get scammed seller refunded immediately automated system believe seller found scammer claim automatically refund youone last point wary fulfilled amazon product amazon warehouse may stil issue recently purchased new item delivered amazon however quite clear used,0.004869865288217059,0.9951301347117829,0.25630959057767805,0.8,1.7488269854714271,174.88269854714272,High Trust
