Monera Ellsworth,/users/5dfc2e21361d619e5a04311a,US,3.0,2019-12-20 02:39:06+00:00,4.0,Love their Prime Features!,"Love their prime features! I got a free trial and it was great! I'll consider getting it for good once I have more funds. My orders were all good quality but like other sites can depend on the seller and how reputable they are. Everything marked prime came in the 2 day window and was good quality. Some super cheap but more iffy from China sites seem like a scam but the products did come as described within a month, but took a while to get here! Give it a solid month for those type. For those in the US, give it a week or so for standard shipping... Overall positive experience with Amazon and will shop there again.",2019-12-20 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,20.0,620,119,26,4,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,love prime feature got free trial great ill consider getting good fund order good quality like site depend seller reputable everything marked prime came day window good quality super cheap iffy china site seem like scam product come described within month took get give solid month type u give week standard shipping overall positive experience amazon shop,0.7885173541827051,0.21148264581729492,0.06674144699943915,0.8,1.3190896123085352,131.90896123085352,High Trust
Mark,/users/5dfbcf51b14ccf5b07f212c8,US,4.0,2019-12-19 20:16:03+00:00,4.0,Why so many negative reviews?,"Honestly, surprised to see so many negative reviews here. I generally don't like mega companies but I haven't had any issues with Amazon in probably 15 years or more. Usually, large companies are plagued by horrible customer service, etc., but I've had nothing but a pleasant experience with Amazon. I really want to ""hate"" them like I ""hate"" most large companies because of their profits-over-everything-else ways, but I haven't had any bad experiences with them on a personal level as far as buying $hit from them. I don't really know what to say. I mean, I realize not everyone will have a positive experience with a company, especially with one that millions of people use, but I have nothing bad to say about Amazon on a personal level. Yeah, they are a big company and profits are their driving force, so I'm sure they do some shady $hit from time to time, not to mention they are pretty much destroying (if they haven't already) mom and pop outlets, but man, I can't say much negative about them. This really surprises me because I ""hate"" just about everything mainstream. I have decided to give them 4 stars instead of 5, only because I know deep down, they are still just a big ""nasty"" mega corp. But on a personal level and customer, they have never let me down. Good stuff, albeit their ""mega company"" status.",2019-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,19.0,1320,234,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,honestly surprised see many negative review generally dont like mega company havent issue amazon probably year usually large company plagued horrible customer service etc ive nothing pleasant experience amazon really want hate like hate large company profitsovereverythingelse way havent bad experience personal level far buying hit dont really know say mean realize everyone positive experience company especially one million people use nothing bad say amazon personal level yeah big company profit driving force im sure shady hit time time mention pretty much destroying havent already mom pop outlet man cant say much negative really surprise hate everything mainstream decided give star instead know deep still big nasty mega corp personal level customer never let good stuff albeit mega company status,0.013983185670061448,0.9860168143299386,0.13123948401570387,0.8,1.71925630396811,171.925630396811,High Trust
Chris Adkins Rutkey,/users/5dfbd265361d61d2bd0408e3,US,1.0,2019-12-19 19:41:50+00:00,1.0,Driverless truck going down the street almost hits a house!,"On Saturday 9/14/19 around 10:00 am a driverless Amazon truck went by my house headed toward another house! I screamed, I ran, I caught up to the truck and unable to get in while it was in motion, I could only turn the wheel to take it of course before it hit a house! Another person jumped in and put the truck in park after my turning the wheel slowed it down and my screams got their attention. The driver 4 houses down delivering the package comes jogging up to the truck that's stopped in the middle of someone's front lawn, looks at me and without a word, he jumps in and flee's. The neighbors video shows him run the stop sign at the corner as he sped away! I reported it and the fact that my arm hurt me for several days. I pulled the muscle reaching up and yanking on the wheel so hard. It was very sore. After repeating the story to numerous people over a couple weeks time, the final response from Amazon was to call my own auto insurance that they should cover any injury! NOT EVEN A THANK YOU FOR SAVING A PERSONS HOUSE FROM IMPACT. Not a THANK YOU for anything. SHAME on them.",2019-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,19.0,1090,211,59,10,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,saturday around driverless amazon truck went house headed toward another house screamed ran caught truck unable get motion could turn wheel take course hit house another person jumped put truck park turning wheel slowed scream got attention driver house delivering package come jogging truck thats stopped middle someone front lawn look without word jump flees neighbor video show run stop sign corner sped away reported fact arm hurt several day pulled muscle reaching yanking wheel hard sore repeating story numerous people couple week time final response amazon call auto insurance cover injury even thank saving person house impact thank anything shame,0.9303415270737406,0.06965847292625937,0.11833987661245092,0.2,0.3584972117856199,35.849721178561985,Low Trust
