John,/users/5dfb8ba5361d61066903cca2,US,1.0,2019-12-19 14:42:36+00:00,1.0,Prime membership randomly cancelled with no refund,"Prime membership cancelled after 6 months. Amazon says they received a chargeback. However, I did not initiate a dispute, my bank has no record of any disputes and Amazon can not provide any sort of case number. Amazon only has a note that says the Prime was cancelled due to a chargeback. That’s it! After getting transferred 6 times and being placed on hold, I’m done with Amazon. Horrible company and now I have actually initiated a dispute for my Prime membership. Maybe I’ll dispute every charge from Amazon just to make a point. Update: a supervisor refunded my money and told me there actually was not a chargeback and that someone at Amazon mistakingly cancelled my Prime. Wow. What I do know is that I spent over an hour of my life corrected a mistake made by Amazon.",2019-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,19.0,776,139,50,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,prime membership cancelled month amazon say received chargeback however initiate dispute bank record dispute amazon provide sort case number amazon note say prime cancelled due chargeback that’s getting transferred time placed hold i’m done amazon horrible company actually initiated dispute prime membership maybe i’ll dispute every charge amazon make point update supervisor refunded money told actually chargeback someone amazon mistakingly cancelled prime wow know spent hour life corrected mistake made amazon,0.09277782816312242,0.9072221718368776,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.7692027853015011,76.92027853015011,High Trust
Jason Hurley,/users/5dfb699261babd331d02b042,IE,2.0,2019-12-19 22:47:17+00:00,1.0,Legalised Theft.,"Horrid company to deal with, I have spent €750 on childrens christmas gifts and they were not delivered to DPD Parcel Wizard for forwarding to my southern Ireland address. I have never had a problem before with DPD not receiving my items from the UK, they have requested a POD from Amazon but the company have not provided any proof of delivery and will not replace or refund the items. I can only surmise that Amazons carriers have seized the opportunity to be dishonest during the busy christmas period and Amazon are washing their hands of it.",2019-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,19.0,546,97,16,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,horrid company deal spent € childrens christmas gift delivered dpd parcel wizard forwarding southern ireland address never problem dpd receiving item uk requested pod amazon company provided proof delivery replace refund item surmise amazon carrier seized opportunity dishonest busy christmas period amazon washing hand,0.013766412642832414,0.9862335873571676,0.05440269209197981,0.2,0.8039973320969798,80.39973320969797,High Trust
