Michele,/users/5dfae7fed348bfe7a97c2c7e,US,1.0,2019-12-19 03:07:30+00:00,1.0,PROMISES NOT KEPT,"I ordered a keepsake box for a gift for Christmas, needing it by 12/19/19. Promised delivery by Amazon Prime was 12/18. I got a message at 6:00 tonight that it won't arrive today, but on 12/21/19. When I contacted customer service after 45 minutes, they kept saying sorry, but nothing they can do, it would arrive between 12/19 and 12/21. I explained that it would be too late. They said they can refund my money for the purchase since it won't arrive in time. Thinking this was their customer service offer, I accepted that resolution, thinking it was still going to be delivered at some point. I went into my orders to check on another item, and I saw they cancelled that order!! When I went back to customer service to find out about it, they said I asked to cancel the order and there is nothing they can do. Now, it can't even be reversed and I would have to start al over. This company has gone way down hill and do not care anymore about keeping customers.  Prime isn't worth it AT ALL!  The customer service reps are rude and keep passing you off on someone else.",2019-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,19.0,1071,199,17,3,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,ordered keepsake box gift christmas needing promised delivery amazon prime got message tonight wont arrive today contacted customer service minute kept saying sorry nothing would arrive explained would late said refund money purchase since wont arrive time thinking customer service offer accepted resolution thinking still going delivered point went order check another item saw cancelled order went back customer service find said asked cancel order nothing cant even reversed would start al company gone way hill care anymore keeping customer prime isnt worth customer service rep rude keep passing someone else,0.7265443326875936,0.27345566731240645,0.11160964666292765,0.2,0.45904976298878875,45.90497629887887,Low Trust
Eddie G,/users/5dfad6e47293b11643f77e82,US,2.0,2019-12-19 01:48:26+00:00,1.0,WORST EXPERIENCE OF MY LIFE,"WORST EXPERIENCE OF MY LIFE! Order something for my fiancé last Thursday to be sure it would be here by Xmas. Got a (Fedex) tracking number which I periodically checked.. Package stated it would be delivered Wednesday Dec. 18th.. Was off work and home all day.. Checked tracking number, package was delivered... No package at my house.. Called Fedex and gave them my tracking number.. They stated the package for THAT tracking number was delivered but wasn’t my name or address. Called Amazon.. They told me it was a third party seller and they didn’t have any phone number for them and it would be about 3 weeks before my money was refunded... I will NEVER EVER use amazon again and I will be sure to tell everyone the same",2019-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,19.0,724,130,27,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,worst experience life order something fiancé last thursday sure would xmas got fedex tracking number periodically checked package stated would delivered wednesday dec th work home day checked tracking number package delivered package house called fedex gave tracking number stated package tracking number delivered wasn’t name address called amazon told third party seller didn’t phone number would week money refunded never ever use amazon sure tell everyone,0.0939770471666825,0.9060229528333175,0.07291082445316882,0.2,0.7675936413072925,76.75936413072925,High Trust
