Mike,/users/5df66325214ad806bf7339d9,US,1.0,2019-12-15 22:23:38+00:00,1.0,Amazon can't make scheduled deliveries,"Amazon has now missed 3 scheduled deliveries for a tv I originally purchased on Black Friday. For TVs and items that require a signature, you need a scheduled delivery which is a 3 hour window on a day you choose. Amazon has now missed 3 of those and about to miss a fourth. It's now December 15th and I still have not received it. They started using their own delivery service (Amazon Logistics) that they can't track. I've called customer service and they can't contact the warehouse or make sure that it will be delivered. The scheduled delivery time frame just comes and passes. Each time I have to take off work, wait 3 hours for the delivery window to come and pass, and then waste time calling Amazon. There's also an issue where if you call customer service, they can't tell what time zone you are in and will mess that up as well, but that's a review in itself. I called customer service again and the supervisor, Michelle, just told me it will be guaranteed to be delivered by the scheduled time frame. This is after they have missed 3 scheduled time frames already and will probably miss a fourth. I have no faith it will make it. All she could say was to request a refund. What a joke.Edit: Amazon has now missed the 4th scheduled delivery attempt. I cancelled my order and will go to Best Buy instead. So much for Amazon's guarantee that 4th time would be it. This is pretty embarrassing for Amazon.",2019-12-15 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,15.0,1412,259,38,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon missed scheduled delivery tv originally purchased black friday tv item require signature need scheduled delivery hour window day choose amazon missed miss fourth december th still received started using delivery service amazon logistics cant track ive called customer service cant contact warehouse make sure delivered scheduled delivery time frame come pass time take work wait hour delivery window come pas waste time calling amazon there also issue call customer service cant tell time zone mess well thats review called customer service supervisor michelle told guaranteed delivered scheduled time frame missed scheduled time frame already probably miss fourth faith make could say request refund jokeedit amazon missed th scheduled delivery attempt cancelled order go best buy instead much amazon guarantee th time would pretty embarrassing amazon,0.007487142417854886,0.9925128575821451,0.14526079641054404,0.2,0.8253085880731813,82.53085880731813,High Trust
