Corinne Yarborough,/users/5df2683f7e8d914bd77154b2,US,1.0,2019-12-12 16:19:29+00:00,1.0,I received a phone call after a…,"I received a phone call after a purchase.  I could not understand the person due to her heavy foreign accent.  After repeatedly asking her to repeat what she said, I asked if I could speak to someone who spoke English with less of an accent. (I asked very nicely.)  Still she would not transfer me.  I finally had to say that I was hanging up.  I did want to speak to someone - but to someone whom I understood.I am not happy that the person spoke English with such a heavy accent.  We were unable to continue the conversation.",2019-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,12.0,527,99,32,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,received phone call purchase could understand person due heavy foreign accent repeatedly asking repeat said asked could speak someone spoke english less accent asked nicely still would transfer finally say hanging want speak someone someone understoodi happy person spoke english heavy accent unable continue conversation,0.025540296721643097,0.9744597032783568,0.055524397083567024,0.2,0.7983347310558919,79.83347310558919,High Trust
