Trevor Newman,/users/5a846102f675864e560224f7,GB,4.0,2019-12-12 12:12:47+00:00,1.0,Beware one click payments on Amazon,"Beware one click payments on Amazon. I am an Amazon Prime member and when I made a purchase for an eligible item and used the one click purchase option I was charged Express delivery. When I complained I was told to use the normal checkout option. I have never used express delivery and this is not an option in the one click settings. I tried to cancel the item when I realised I had been charged but was told it was too late. I am now faced with swallowing the charge or paying to send the item back, even if I do, I suspect they will not refund the express deliver. 'BUYERS BEWARE'",2019-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,12.0,584,113,35,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,beware one click payment amazon amazon prime member made purchase eligible item used one click purchase option charged express delivery complained told use normal checkout option never used express delivery option one click setting tried cancel item realised charged told late faced swallowing charge paying send item back even suspect refund express deliver buyer beware,0.034005725234333005,0.965994274765667,0.0633763320246775,0.2,0.795672403787769,79.5672403787769,High Trust
