David Baker,/users/59e8a2d90000ff000ad6fe56,GB,18.0,2019-12-12 10:31:15+00:00,1.0,Zero Starts if I had the choice,"Zero Starts if I had the choice, I could write an entire book on how bad amazon are at everything. My only advice is go somewhere else. Ebay the high street, department store any other online shop. Just save yourself the grief and don't use any Amazon services or products.I have been trying to raise a complaint for over a year. There online chats are a total waste of time. I have been passed from person to person, lied to many times, given the wrong information time and time again and promised countless call backs that never happened. I finally got the executive customer relations managers email address and the managing directors Email address in the last couple of weeks. The managing director just passed the buck to one of his P.A's who had no interest is solving the issue.To cut a very long story short all they did was give me a gift voucher to spend on Amazon, oh the irony. Anyone who has a serious complaint and is getting nowhere try managingdirectoratamazon.co.uk it won't do any good but it might give you some personal satisfaction.",2019-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,12.0,1053,187,31,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,zero start choice could write entire book bad amazon everything advice go somewhere else ebay high street department store online shop save grief dont use amazon service productsi trying raise complaint year online chat total waste time passed person person lied many time given wrong information time time promised countless call back never happened finally got executive customer relation manager email address managing director email address last couple week managing director passed buck one pa interest solving issueto cut long story short give gift voucher spend amazon oh irony anyone serious complaint getting nowhere try managingdirectoratamazoncouk wont good might give personal satisfaction,0.018699358729686012,0.981300641270314,0.1048794167