Koriyn,/users/5df16df8ebb746f3b207f542,US,1.0,2019-12-11 22:31:24+00:00,1.0,Okay so my problem with amazon…,"Okay so my problem with amazon originally started as my fault, i put the wrong address. Instead of putting west I put east. On the day of the delivery the driver called me, I apologized and gave him the correct address, and he told me he would update the address and I would get it delivered the following day. Cool.So the following day I check my shipping address at 6 am, and it wasn't corrected. I did the chat thing and the chatter informed me that she added it to the delivery instructions. Skeptical, I called in and the lady on the phone confirmed with me I would receive the package today at the corrected address.A few hours go by and I receive a call from the driver that he was at the wrong address, yet again, and when I gave him the corrected address he said it was outside of his delivery zone.So I call in again and after a 30 minute phone call of just trying to update my address for the following day, the guy told me he updated the notes and address. Address was still incorrect and delivery notes were deleted and he put that I wanted my order the following day.So I then do the chat thing again and they inform me to replace the order and I would get a full refund, which would've worked but I had ordered the last item in stock. So I ask if I can update the address and they tell me no and ask if I want to speak to a specialist.I understand the mistake was originally my fault but it is a simple mistake and I was willing to wait a few days to accommodate that but they have no basic understanding of what I am asking for.",2019-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,11.0,1544,301,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,okay problem amazon originally started fault put wrong address instead putting west put east day delivery driver called apologized gave correct address told would update address would get delivered following day coolso following day check shipping address wasnt correc