Laura Schreib,/users/5df165a60f7962c9bc2f853a,US,1.0,2019-12-11 21:58:00+00:00,1.0,Amazon Delivery Courier Lied!,"The Amazon delivery service decided that since my business as closed they would just send my entire order back.  They marked it as wrong address even after their own tracking said we were closed.  Well, yes, businesses are allowed business hours.  The items could easily have been delivered the next day which is what UPS, FedEx, USPS and all other couriers do.  Instead, I have been on the phone for over 35 minutes trying to figure out where my things are, why I am only getting a partial refund and what they are going to do about the price difference on the items that I purchased.  This entire company has cost millions of people their jobs, has a giant negative impact on the environment and continues to disappoint.  What a joke.",2019-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,11.0,736,131,29,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon delivery service decided since business closed would send entire order back marked wrong address even tracking said closed well yes business allowed business hour item could easily delivered next day ups fedex usps courier instead phone minute trying figure thing getting partial refund going price difference item purchased entire company cost million people job giant negative impact environment continues disappoint joke,0.01601310242702115,0.9839868975729789,0.07347167694896242,0.2,0.806687784176282,80.66877841762819,High Trust
