Paul Falzon,/users/529a37630000640001577668,MT,2.0,2019-12-11 14:29:01+00:00,1.0,I've been a customer for years and…,"I've been a customer for years and spend literal thousands of pounds a year on amazon.co.ukMy last order was a fitness watch, over 200 pounds which I needed delivered ASAP - so I paid extra for expedited shipping and have a guaranteed delivery day. So this was confirmed to be the 5th.,5th comes, im informed that it will be delivered by 8pm - around 19:00 im informed that the delivery wont occur. I contact amazon support chat - we arrive to an agreement that delivery is delayed to the 10th - but ill be refunded for the shipping.10th arrives, 1th arrives, nothing and tracking info doesnt show anything - no details at all. I contact support, they say it will be delayed again. I ask for a refund since I wont be here to collect or receive it anyway and need the item before I leave and will now have to buy it AGAIN from a local supplier, since amazon failed to deliver.They ask me if im willing to wait till saturday - I'm not, since I'm not there and it was delayed TWICE already. Then, from saturday it moves to sunday... wow... I keep asking for a refund, they say they can only refund once they have the item. But the item is lost and no one knows where it is and, above all, i paid for an item i DID NOT RECEIVE. So delayed a total of 3 times and I wont be around to receive the package even if it were delivered.I say I dont agree and want a refund, and all I keep getting is a literal copy and paste template reply that they cannot refund me ~(for an item they did not give me mind you) and I have no choice. I tell them it's a scam and that I'll have to escalate this with my credit card provider. They literally keep copying and pasting their reply.I've literally been scammed and amazon stole over 200 pounds from me. This wasn't so bad in the past, but their service over the last year is just an embarassment. I pity all these years I've been their customer (over 20 years now)",2019-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,11.0,1895,364,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive customer year spend literal thousand pound year amazoncoukmy last order fitness watch pound needed delivered asap paid extra expedited shipping guaranteed delivery day confirmed thth come im informed delivered pm around im informed delivery wont occur contact amazon support chat arrive agreement delivery delayed th ill refunded shippingth arrives th arrives nothing tracking info doesnt show anything detail contact support say delayed ask refund since wont collect receive anyway need item leave buy local supplier since amazon failed deliverthey ask im willing wait till saturday im since im delayed twice already saturday move sunday wow keep asking refund say refund item item lost one know paid item receive delayed total time wont around receive package even deliveredi say dont agree want refund keep getting literal copy paste template reply cannot refund item give mind choice tell scam ill escalate credit card provider literally keep copying pasting replyive literally scammed amazon stole pound wasnt bad past service last year embarassment pity year ive customer year,0.01764797863358114,0.9823520213664189,0.2041503084688727,0.2,0.832006072376984,83.20060723769839,High Trust
