Tesla Younis Henry,/users/5df0e5a9ebb746c118078830,AE,1.0,2019-12-11 12:51:20+00:00,1.0,They dont even deserve 1 star,"They dont even deserve 1 star. It's my son's birthday today. I placed my order on the 9th Dec and they state ""next day delivery guaranteed"" however 48hrs later I still don't have my item!  My son woke up with no present and the mystery with the late delivery continues. The fact you use the term ""guaranteed"" means it will happen! Why set an expectation you can't commit to, not only are you breaking the SLA it's false advertising. I have spent all day explaining, re explaining, emails, phone calls. Now im being told that there is ""no guarantee "" of recieving a call back regarding my now  ""lost"" item and in 2hrs which has nearly been the end of the working day😂The whole point of online shopping is convenience..well Amazon uae are a joke. Bad representation of the real Amazon next time I will just purchase from a shop then at least i have guaranteed delivery and my son has a birthday present to OPEN!",2019-12-11 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,11.0,909,166,29,6,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,dont even deserve star son birthday today placed order th dec state next day delivery guaranteed however hr later still dont item son woke present mystery late delivery continues fact use term guaranteed mean happen set expectation cant commit breaking sla false advertising spent day explaining explaining email phone call im told guarantee recieving call back regarding lost item hr nearly end working day😂the whole point online shopping conveniencewell amazon uae joke bad representation real amazon next time purchase shop least guaranteed delivery son birthday present open,0.5333949125423851,0.46660508745761486,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.5519228465891552,55.192284658915526,Medium Trust
