Carley-Jayne Giddings,/users/5b446e1c4de5666d34f1fba4,GB,29.0,2019-12-10 00:46:54+00:00,5.0,Not a bad word to say about amazon,"Not a bad word to say about amazon, fast deliver, packaged lovely, all items I've bought over the years have been exactly what I ordered, never any issues.In fact, a few months back my account was hacked and someone bought an echo dot and ps4 cards on my card, I found this the day after it happened to acted quickly. Called amazon and they refunded straight away! No problems or waiting time. The first guy I spoke to was pretty rude trying to basically blame me for giving out my password? 🙄 But the final result I got my money back anyway.",2019-12-10 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,10.0,542,102,34,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,bad word say amazon fast deliver packaged lovely item ive bought year exactly ordered never issuesin fact month back account hacked someone bought echo dot p card card found day happened acted quickly called amazon refunded straight away problem waiting time first guy spoke pretty rude trying basically blame giving password 🙄 final result got money back anyway,0.25442554371319925,0.7455744562868007,0.05720695457094784,1.0,1.8842286190575899,188.422861905759,High Trust
