Daniel,/users/5de3f826ebb746086200bb06,GB,6.0,2019-12-09 21:02:04+00:00,1.0,Poor deliveries,"Extremely disappointed with Amazon and its delivery service!It's the second time I order a big-ish item from them and second time I receive a box that has been hit everywhere.First time was a small piece of furniture for the bathroom. Not only the box came badly hit, it was also left outside in a non-safe place and under heavy rain. Luckily the wood of the furniture was not affected, even if the cardboard box was totally wet and partially open around the corners.This time, it's an oil-filled radiator. The box has come not sealed and looks like having being opened. Apart from that, it has been so badly hit that the radiator has two dents in the metal where the box was hit. I have paid for a new product and what I receive (again) is a damaged box that I can not even guarantee that has not been opened before. Is this the service that a company like Amazon offers? I buy online frequently and I´ve never had a problem with absolutely any delivery except from Amazon.It's a pity that generally I had positive experiences with Amazon regarding products and customer service, but the delivery is sub standard. Also not being able to choose a time slot or any collecting points for big items (I live now in a flat so there is no place to leave it whilst I'm not home), but this is another story...",2019-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,9.0,1301,238,15,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,extremely disappointed amazon delivery serviceits second time order bigish item second time receive box hit everywherefirst time small piece furniture bathroom box came badly hit also left outside nonsafe place heavy rain luckily wood furniture affected even cardboard box totally wet partially open around cornersthis time oilfilled radiator box come sealed look like opened apart badly hit radiator two dent metal box hit paid new product receive damaged box even guarantee opened service company like amazon offer buy online frequently i´ve never problem absolutely delivery except amazonits pity generally positive experience amazon regarding product customer service delivery sub standard also able choose time slot collecting point big item live flat place leave whilst im home another story,0.03471172112149047,0.9652882788785095,0.1334828939988783,0.2,0.8093407182390304,80.93407182390304,High Trust
Shaun Rob Lewis,/users/54ad2e100000ff0001a2872d,GB,15.0,2019-12-09 20:33:15+00:00,1.0,Lost all online content Amazon not interested,"Lost access to my email address and requested it be changed, foreign call centre could do nothing and kept repeating I need to logon to my email account which I no longer had access to (encrypted email with no password reset). I have lost hundreds of pound worth of movies, kindle book and music in the blink of an eye. Amazon have done nothing to help me resolve it. A warning to all Do NOT use amazon.to purchases online content unless you are prepared to lose it if you lose your email address. I'm gutted and will never purchase from Amazon again.",2019-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,9.0,551,102,45,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,lost access email address requested changed foreign call centre could nothing kept repeating need logon email account longer access encrypted email password reset lost hundred pound worth movie kindle book music blink eye amazon done nothing help resolve warning use amazonto purchase online content unless prepared lose lose email address im gutted never purchase amazon,0.026614253827392617,0.9733857461726074,0.05720695457094784,0.2,0.7981342640004933,79.81342640004932,High Trust
