HRVL8,/users/5dea75f7153b7eecfa92aa3b,NL,1.0,2019-12-07 19:43:35+00:00,1.0,AMAZON ROBBED MY MONEY SIMPLY.NEVER TRUST THEM AND THEIR WORDS,"I'm from Iran and as all the world know there is bad story between IR and US (course governments not people)So i tried to buy some original clothes or shoes etc.tried to find a way for this.found too many IR websites which sell Amazon Gift Cards.this is not same with fake gift cards or something like that.cards are all legal and Amazon took its money for them.so i earned 3X50$ gift cards.and redeemed them for my account.worked without problem.and for deliver problem i asked my friend to use his address in Croatia and take delivery my things and send to me.before buying i talked to amazon's operators at chat and explained all story about cards and address and asked them inform me if there is any problem or not.i'll take my order or not?and they said yes sure.there is nothing bad with your country and your friend's address.go order anything u like no worries.I did.bought a Nike sneakers and my shopping confirmed by Amazon.but next day they sent an email and said your order canceled due some regional problems.i got disappointed but after opening my acc i just got amazed.order was canceled ok but where is my Gift cards that u confirmed them?its 2 years that i ask them bring my cards back and they dont.the worst un-respecting act is where that they dont say we wont bring them.they say u are right but nothing happens.each time i talk the help operator says OMG this is not good.dont worry ill fix this.u should take your cards back we are really sorry for this.promise u get them tomorrow.But seems its still today there cuz i never seen their tomorrow after 2 years.and each time ask again i have to explain all story again and im getting exactly same lies: OMG dont worry it gonna fix until tomorrow!!!I paid for those Gift Cards.150$ was my salary for 2 months. 1$ was 50000 Rials that time and now 1$=150,000 Rials.whats my fault?i im a simple guy who wanted buy a pair of shoes.why u dont give my money back?i worked hard for thatAny other name for this? whats this if its not robbing or stealing or lying?",2019-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,7.0,2027,364,62,10,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,im iran world know bad story ir u course government peopleso tried buy original clothes shoe etctried find way thisfound many ir website sell amazon gift cardsthis fake gift card something like thatcards legal amazon took money themso earned x gift cardsand redeemed accountworked without problemand deliver problem asked friend use address croatia take delivery thing send mebefore buying talked amazon operator chat explained story card address asked inform problem notill take order notand said yes surethere nothing bad country friend addressgo order anything u like worriesi didbought nike sneaker shopping confirmed amazonbut next day sent email said order canceled due regional problemsi got disappointed opening acc got amazedorder canceled ok gift card u confirmed themits year ask bring card back dontthe worst unrespecting act dont say wont bring themthey say u right nothing happenseach time talk help operator say omg gooddont worry ill fix thisu take card back really sorry thispromise u get tomorrowbut seems still today cuz never seen tomorrow yearsand time ask explain story im getting exactly lie omg dont worry gonna fix tomorrowi paid gift card salary month rial time rialswhats faulti im simple guy wanted buy pair shoeswhy u dont give money backi worked hard thatany name whats robbing stealing lying,0.46269499722213553,0.5373050027778645,0.2041503084688727,0.2,0.6094825630827069,60.948256308270686,Medium Trust
