Darren Smith,/users/5de94672741d5f5c4b348318,GB,6.0,2019-12-05 18:03:41+00:00,1.0,"I am a prime customer,I recently…","I am a prime customer,I recently ordered a karcher window vac on there black Friday deals. I received an email with tracking information saying it would be delivered by 1pm Friday.  On checking the tracking the time had changed to 3 to 7-30 then later changing to 9 pm. After waiting in all afternoon I checked again only to be told that they would be unable to deliver and it would be delivered in the next 3 to 5 days.  And if I had not received it by then to get in contact with them. After the 5days I checked the tracking  only to be told that I had sent it back and would get a refund. I then got in contact to find out what was going on. Only to be told it had be damaged in transit and they would refund me. When I asked why they just didn't send a replacement,they said it was there policy to refund a damaged item and I would have to order again.when I said it was in a sell I was told that I would have to buy at full price. Nice one Amazon that's how you treat your prime customer . I will not be renewing my prime and never buy from you again thanks slot.",2019-12-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,5.0,1068,216,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime customeri recently ordered karcher window vac black friday deal received email tracking information saying would delivered pm friday checking tracking time changed later changing pm waiting afternoon checked told would unable deliver would delivered next day received get contact day checked tracking told sent back would get refund got contact find going told damaged transit would refund asked didnt send replacementthey said policy refund damaged item would order againwhen said sell told would buy full price nice one amazon thats treat prime customer renewing prime never buy thanks slot,0.010940329585457936,0.989059670414542,0.12114413909141895,0.2,0.8187586630255548,81.87586630255548,High Trust
