Karen,/users/5de34875ae7758decbb4a4b6,US,1.0,2019-12-01 04:59:02+00:00,1.0,Amazon Monopoly = Bad Customer Service,After getting a new cell phone I was having trouble getting into one of my old email accounts and unfortunately it was tied to my Amazon account so I couldn’t reset my Amazon password without being able to get into that email account. I got locked out of the Amazon account because I kept trying to get in and couldn’t remember my password or reset it without access to the email account. I called Amazon Customer Service and they were completely unhelpful. First they argued with me over the expiration date of the credit card I was holding in my hand and kept telling me the expiration date was not the date of the card I had in my hand and then they told me that the last three items I purchased on the account were wrong (which they weren’t). After being on the phone for 20+ minutes they told me they apparently couldn’t do anything to help me access my account and that I should start a new account (and lose any points I have on mine) all because I can’t access one email account. I got off the phone again and waited an hour and tried a new password on the account. This time I was right and got into my account. How funny but the credit card number I had given them on the phone was the same one I had on file on the account and the last three items I purchased were also the ones I told them on the phone. I will try like I usually do to avoid Amazon in the future. They are a monopoly as we all know and so they are no longer at all concerned about customer service. Maybe the employees I’m talking to were too concerned with ending the call quickly so they could meet some customer service metric rather than actually helping me solve the problem. They treated me like a criminal who was trying to hack the system so I could buy my daughter a couple sweatshirts for Christmas. Next time I’ll pay the extra money and give my business to a company that still cares about its customers and needs the business.,2019-12-01 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,12.0,1.0,1918,367,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,getting new cell phone trouble getting one old email account unfortunately tied amazon account couldn’t reset amazon password without able get email account got locked amazon account kept trying get couldn’t remember password reset without access email account called amazon customer service completely unhelpful first argued expiration date credit card holding hand kept telling expiration date date card hand told last three item purchased account wrong weren’t phone minute told apparently couldn’t anything help access account start new account lose point mine can’t access one email account got phone waited hour tried new password account time right got account funny credit card number given phone one file account last three item purchased also one told phone try like usually avoid amazon future monopoly know longer concerned customer service maybe employee i’m talking concerned ending call quickly could meet customer service metric rather actually helping solve problem treated like criminal trying hack system could buy daughter couple sweatshirt christmas next time i’ll pay extra money give business company still care customer need business,0.008205014741947585,0.9917949852580524,0.2058328659562535,0.2,0.8370640658202769,83.7064065820277,High Trust
