Alecia Yarrish,/users/540a711b000064000188dc9b,US,2.0,2019-11-30 20:26:41+00:00,1.0,I used to trust Amazon,"I used to trust Amazon, but not after this week!  My first order I placed on the 24th was never delivered and still says it is on it's way but running late!  Had to request a refund and reorder the item!  The second order I placed I should have had on the 29th, and again, it's on it's way but running late! WTH?  I have paid for Prime service for many years and this is what I get? As I see on this forum of reviews, I am NOT the only one that is getting bad service now from Amazon!  Called customer service and they tell me it will be delivered today or tomorrow!  REALLY?  What kind of answer is that?  Amazon is going down the tubes and they just don't care that they will be losing customers!",2019-11-30 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,30.0,698,138,22,5,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,used trust amazon week first order placed th never delivered still say way running late request refund reorder item second order placed th way running late wth paid prime service many year get see forum review one getting bad service amazon called customer service tell delivered today tomorrow really kind answer amazon going tube dont care losing customer,0.9995724667165964,0.00042753328340361385,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.3156932955256053,31.569329552560532,Low Trust
