XYZ,/users/5de15eb0322d00d42ea47c36,US,6.0,2019-11-29 18:09:08+00:00,1.0,Amazon Cheats Customers and gives you the runaround so you'll give up on getting your money back,"I cannot believe how dishonest Amazon is.  The richest man in the world cheating customers.  I recently returned a product that didn't work properly.  UPS did not pick up the package on the scheduled day (which was the next day after requesting the return) so I called Amazon and said I needed to print out a receipt so that I could just drop it off at a UPS location.  They re-did the return so I could print out the label however, the second time was one day after the final return date so they charged a $22.00 re-stocking fee for the item.  I was told by Amazon when I called about UPS not showing up, that it would not affect anything since I did initially initiate the return on time.  I also returned three defective items a few months ago and they said they only received two of the items (all three were put in the box when I mailed the package).  I contacted Amazon a total of five times over a period of six weeks and was told every time that they needed to conduct an investigation.  No one ever made note of anything from a previous inquiry I had made - it was like starting over each time.  Amazon sells defective items (one items got so hot, it was too hot to turn off by hand and threw sparks when I went to unplug it) and then they don't want to give you your money back.  They are impossible to deal with and they just give you the runaround so you'll give up.  They have proof that I initiated the return on time and that I had called to get a shipping label to print out when UPS didn't come so I could drop it off because I couldn't wait around a second day for UPS to show up or not, and yet they are saying I didn't do the return in time and there is nothing they can do.  Luckily I was able to dispute the last problem with my credit card company and will do so again with this last problem and the stocking fee for ""requesting the return one day late"" when it was just a request for a shipping label since I didn't get one initially - UPS was to supply that when they picked it up.  I refuse to do business ever again with Amazon or any business they own.",2019-11-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,29.0,2080,407,96,17,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,cannot believe dishonest amazon richest man world cheating customer recently returned product didnt work properly ups pick package scheduled day next day requesting return called amazon said needed print receipt could drop ups location redid return could print label however second time one day final return date charged restocking fee item told amazon called ups showing would affect anything since initially initiate return time also returned three defective item month ago said received two item three put box mailed package contacted amazon total five time period six week told every time needed conduct investigation one ever made note anything previous inquiry made like starting time amazon sell defective item one item got hot hot turn hand threw spark went unplug dont want give money back impossible deal give runaround youll give proof initiated return time called get shipping label print ups didnt come could drop couldnt wait around second day ups show yet saying didnt return time nothing luckily able dispute last problem credit card company last problem stocking fee requesting return one day late request shipping label since didnt get one initially ups supply picked refuse business ever amazon business,0.001884771317900938,0.998115228682099,0.22826696578799777,0.2,0.844711007498649,84.4711007498649,High Trust
