ng me it on the way, daily. I am not doing your job! If you are agreeing to pay for me for my time I my going rate is $23 per/hr. Then we can talk about doing research into order you already have all the info on. Great that you hidden this but I am saving our post, if I need them at a later date.0640 28 nov 19Amazon Prime Let's look into this in real-time! When you have a moment, please reach out to us via phone/chat here: (REMOVED ACCOUNT LINK), and we can provide additional assistance with this.-Joshua K.645 28 nov 19Woody A. Guevara Been there done that and problem was not fixed, still do not have item, items show up on your app. I came to you because that link didn't help. So stop trying to pass them ball and fix this.642 28 nov 19Amazon Prime Unfortunately we cannot access your account on Facebook so you would need to contact us on the link previously provided so we can assist your further.-Sarah659 28 nov 19Woody A. Guevara If I call AGAIN you are agreeing that Amazon paying me for my time?",2019-11-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,28.0,2911,544,4,1,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,poor customer servicesfb post amazon nov posti customer since order time order something item call track item replace item go item today find lost item deliver th nov kept sending email say way day come find lost th cant get another like refund item amazon prime member date started nov amazon prime thank reaching u today woody sorry youve trouble recent order seeing trend one carrier particular please look order detail removed account info click track package carrier name appear amazon ups usps etc keep u posted wed like help however possiblesandra b nov amazon prime certainly understand concern dont access secure account detail facebook happy help way link provided sandra b allow check tracking detail locate carrier order well standing bycarla c nov woody guevara order check told item cant ordered delivered today web site need fix today nov amazon prime understand frustration weve hidden commen