Agnieszka K,/users/5b607d664de5666d3448de4c,PL,4.0,2019-11-28 09:55:06+00:00,1.0,What’s happening with amazon recently,"What’s happening with amazon recently? 22 September I ordered a pair of curtains for £6.40. Amazon cancelled the same day, because the seller was no more active, yet they charged my money and never has refunded. I contacted amazon multiple times, yet they kept saying that they didn’t charge me, while they did. I escalated and I received an automatic reply that my case will be dealt with within 10 working days. 10 working days passed and I reminded I should receive an answer, but I received only the same automatic reply that they will deal with my request within 10 working days. Now when the item is cancelled, it only disappears from the list of customer’s orders, yet the refund is not processed. I have also ordered 7 sets of hangers of the total value of £49 and the order hasn’t been dispatched within last 2 months. So I cancelled it. Again, order disappeared and no mentioning of the refund for me. Instead they are blabling something about the refund of canvas for £44, because they got “damaged in transit”? What? Their system evidently doesn’t work recently, their knowledge of English is not very good and in case of contact they write sentences such as “firstly apologise me for the inconvenience”, everyone says something different and eventually they close the case without returning your money. And there is no one to complain to. Their system doesn’t work and they are chipping money from you. Pity I can’t give 0 stars.",2019-11-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,28.0,1442,251,37,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,what’s happening amazon recently september ordered pair curtain £ amazon cancelled day seller active yet charged money never refunded contacted amazon multiple time yet kept saying didn’t charge escalated received automatic reply case dealt within working day working day passed reminded receive answer received automatic reply deal request within working day item cancelled disappears list customer’s order yet refund processed also ordered set hanger total value £ order hasn’t dispatched within last month cancelled order disappeared mentioning refund instead blabling something refund canvas £ got “damaged transit” system evidently doesn’t work recently knowledge english good case contact write sentence “firstly apologise inconvenience” everyone say something different eventually close case without returning money one complain system doesn’t work chipping money pity can’t give star,0.0053850863283331826,0.9946149136716668,0.14077397644419518,0.2,0.8254622521246724,82.54622521246723,High Trust
