DocShifty,/users/5bac1ae74de5666d34c8e0f9,US,1.0,2019-11-26 16:23:17+00:00,1.0,Failure and waste of time and money.,"Our corporate account has been deactivated 3 times by mistake. The 3rd time we received confirmation that it would be reactivated and a letter saying our account is in good standing. Amazon Pay has the most difficult support to get in touch with, takes the longest to respond or they flat out ignore you and close your tickets without responding. We have been waiting to have out account reactivated for 2 months. Every time we reopen the ticket. They close it without responding. They have NO support phone number and Amazon support cannot help with anything Amazon Pay. Amazon Pay is impossible to deal with and never helpful in correcting any issues with their API.  On a side note chargebacks are frequent and they offer zero digital seller support for fraudulent purchases. They do not offer 3d secure payments or any type of fraud radar. Fraudsters just create new Amazon accounts and continue to use stolen credit cards. In short Amazon Pay is NOT worth your time or your effort. They will do more damage to your business than it is worth and when something goes wrong they are no where to be found. Don't be surprised if Amazon Pay does not last very long. I would not advise any time investments into it.",2019-11-26 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,26.0,1213,214,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,corporate account deactivated time mistake rd time received confirmation would reactivated letter saying account good standing amazon pay difficult support get touch take longest respond flat ignore close ticket without responding waiting account reactivated month every time reopen ticket close without responding support phone number amazon support cannot help anything amazon pay amazon pay impossible deal never helpful correcting issue api side note chargebacks frequent offer zero digital seller support fraudulent purchase offer secure payment type fraud radar fraudsters create new amazon account continue use stolen credit card short amazon pay worth time effort damage business worth something go wrong found dont surprised amazon pay last long would advise time investment,0.005885909442807456,0.9941140905571926,0.12002243409983174,0.2,0.8210615320985627,82.10615320985627,High Trust
