Alissa A Yerep,/users/5ddc3c7829966bd49e29aeb3,US,1.0,2019-11-25 20:41:50+00:00,1.0,Inconsistent customer communication,"Amazon customer service can never seem to give the same answer more than once. I work for an apartment complex that the drivers can never deliver to the correct address (one would think you must be able to read to deliver packages).  I have tried to have packages picked up for that don't live hear any more 1 customer service rep saide they would call back with someone to pick it up and never called back the 2nd person said that couldn't be done, just keep the package. This is a billion dollar business that they can not even have people trained is the same manner. If anyone else in the really world would do this they would be fired or the business would be shut  down.",2019-11-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,25.0,675,127,35,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer service never seem give answer work apartment complex driver never deliver correct address one would think must able read deliver package tried package picked dont live hear customer service rep saide would call back someone pick never called back nd person said couldnt done keep package billion dollar business even people trained manner anyone else really world would would fired business would shut,0.029520242931454593,0.9704797570685454,0.071228266965788,0.2,0.7994855319274303,79.94855319274303,High Trust
