Don L Smith,/users/5ddb6edcfc4e5b98bf1f02d5,CA,1.0,2019-11-25 06:05:17+00:00,1.0,Iike myself have Amazon Prime,"Iike myself have Amazon Prime, I placed an order it's says have it the next day for free shipping. Well I waited and waited for it to show. When it came past the time for it show it now says it be out the next day. I called up good old Amazon too see why it was never out for delivery. Come to find out they don't deliver on Sundays. I informed the agent the only reason I placed this order what's for one piece that I needed for my computer but I need it for my job. I kindly asked what is it today again for any inconvenience because their system had a flaw in it and it let me down as an Amazon Prime member again we pay for that. Sheep lately and for me so I can get a $5 credit I said are you joking I said $5 a company that is worth billions of dollars is offering a customer $5 for an error but they made that is supposed to have a good system in place for people to receive their packages on time. I told her it feel like I was being kicked in the nuts by Amazon and ask to speak to a supervisor, and the supervisor answered she informed me that I could only get $6 because that's what was the shipping cost and that I didn't pay for shipping and I had to inform him it's free because I'm a Prime member. I informed him Amazon treats their customers like shipping we're only worth what we pay in shipping. I'm no longer going to use this joke of a company.",2019-11-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,25.0,1364,279,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,iike amazon prime placed order say next day free shipping well waited waited show came past time show say next day called good old amazon see never delivery come find dont deliver sunday informed agent reason placed order whats one piece needed computer need job kindly asked today inconvenience system flaw let amazon prime member pay sheep lately get credit said joking said company worth billion dollar offering customer error made supposed g