Isabel Pueblas Avilés,/users/5dd975ec99905e2cef548a4e,ES,2.0,2019-11-23 18:19:09+00:00,1.0,I believe that the AMAZON world is overrated,"I believe that the AMAZON world is overrated without a doubt. I was more or less satisfied with the service, even ""the nightmare"" that I had to live this summer with the purchase of a fan .... absolutely crazy. I spent a month receiving email from a manufacturer to whom the fan was supposedly selling to AMAZON, offering me discounts, each email was going up 5%, so that it did not return the item, which previously to AMAZON indicated that it did not meet the operating expectations indicated in his page ... and I lost the account, but I think he sent me more than 15 emails ... come on, what was said ... nonsense.I think that the AMAZON customer service department leaves a lot to be desired, rather they are somewhat ineffective, not very decisive and in the end it does not seem that they have cared to lose several clients, since in my AMAZON account we bought several members of my family .And I have to say that there IS LIFE beyond AMAZON. A very high percentage of items can be found in EL CORTE INGLÉS or in neighborhood stores, and there you always have the guarantee of touching it, seeing it, smelling it, etc ... before buying, and in many cases if you know how to search you save the Shipping cost and in the end it comes out better than in AMAZON.Checked, it has been since September that I unsubscribed and no problem.My recommendation .... search on Google and it will give you other equally valid options, and in many cases BETTER than in AMAZON.",2019-11-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,23.0,1468,269,44,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,believe amazon world overrated without doubt less satisfied service even nightmare live summer purchase fan absolutely crazy spent month receiving email manufacturer fan supposedly selling amazon offering discount email going return item previously amazon indicated meet operating expectation indicated page lost account think sent email come said nonsensei think amazon customer service department leaf lot desired rather somewhat ineffective decisive end seem cared lose several client since amazon account bought several member family say life beyond amazon high percentage item found el corte inglés neighborhood store always guarantee touching seeing smelling etc buying many case know search save shipping cost end come better amazonchecked since september unsubscribed problemmy recommendation search google give equally valid option many case better amazon,0.013600434953410956,0.9863995650465891,0.15086932136848008,0.2,0.8233736467969907,82.33736467969906,High Trust
