Mira,/users/5dd2a51e2316bc3f44987060,US,1.0,2019-11-18 14:26:55+00:00,1.0,I've had the Prime Membership for a…,"I've had the Prime Membership for a long time.  first it worked very good. My orders were coming within 2 days. I ordered a lot, usually a few orders a week would be a norm. But when they changed their delivery company, everything went downhill. I haven't had a single order delivered on time in the last 2 months. Four orders within one week went missing. Still waiting on some of the refunds to go into my account. Yet they didn't forget to charge me for the Prime Membership the conditions of which they failed to meet. Today I cancelled all of my subscriptions with them, all of the orders that were not shipped on time and my Prime Membership. I am happy I will not have to deal with this disaster anymore! Goodbye Amazon! I really enjoyed using you when you actually worked.",2019-11-18 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,18.0,780,144,36,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,ive prime membership long time first worked good order coming within day ordered lot usually order week would norm changed delivery company everything went downhill havent single order delivered time last month four order within one week went missing still waiting refund go account yet didnt forget charge prime membership condition failed meet today cancelled subscription order shipped time prime membership happy deal disaster anymore goodbye amazon really enjoyed using actually worked,0.06748953481286434,0.9325104651871357,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.7824077844724238,78.24077844724238,High Trust
