Jennifer Hebert,/users/5dd02db76cc9f9e09dc8c74e,US,4.0,2019-11-16 17:12:11+00:00,1.0,I would give Amazon a -100 if I could!,"I would give Amazon a -100 if I could.  I tried to order a TV 4 times and a problem occurred every single time and I have yet to get the TV.  I was a prime member for a very long time and Amazon used to be all about customer service, but not anymore.  They failed to take responsibility and absolutely NO accountability!  It was the worst experience I have come across with any company in a long time.  I cancelled my Prime membership as a result.  Guess Amazon is all about money and big business now and does not care about the customers!",2019-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,16.0,540,104,38,9,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,would give amazon could tried order tv time problem occurred every single time yet get tv prime member long time amazon used customer service anymore failed take responsibility absolutely accountability worst experience come across company long time cancelled prime membership result guess amazon money big business care customer,0.12499909631359254,0.8750009036864075,0.05832865956253505,0.2,0.7491661837557108,74.91661837557108,Medium Trust
