Jack Thompson,/users/5dd0040acbe2aca65ad6b603,US,1.0,2019-11-16 14:13:39+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime delivery is becoming an issue with its private drivers,"Amazon is too large to care but I have run into so many issues with Amazon Prime. Most recently I ordered an item and it was supposed to be delivered the next day. I was home all day and around 5 p.m. I checked my order and it said ""The order was delivered and left with a resident."" I checked with everyone in my building and no one picked it up. My real issue and when I contacted Amazon I got an automated message saying it may not have been delivered so wait 36 hours before contacting Amazon again. So if it was a mistake why is the delivery message so specific. Amazon is becoming useless to deal with and it's pricing may be good but I would rather pay a little bit more for reliability. With Amazon using private delivery companies this is not going to improve it is only going to get worse.",2019-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,16.0,799,155,67,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon large care run many issue amazon prime recently ordered item supposed delivered next day home day around pm checked order said order delivered left resident checked everyone building one picked real issue contacted amazon got automated message saying may delivered wait hour contacting amazon mistake delivery message specific amazon becoming useless deal pricing may good would rather pay little bit reliability amazon using private delivery company going improve going get worse,0.00466303405193801,0.995336965948062,0.08693213684800898,0.2,0.8150549103436329,81.50549103436329,High Trust
Customer A,/users/5dcff9e9cb183cc11e8113e2,US,1.0,2019-11-16 13:32:13+00:00,1.0,AWFUL CUSTOMER SERVICE,"AWFUL. REALLY GONE DOWNHILL. This happens a lot lately. If I have 1 problem, suddenly I have 10. Customer Service is embarrassing when before I would've said they had the best of any company. In 7 days Amazon has screwed up 5 out of 6 packages; resulting in 4 calls totaling over 2 hrs. (so far...) that STILL has NOT completely resolved issues (still don't have items or my refunds...). The really weird part is that each problem was different; but the WORST part is that Customer Service (for the most part) has been HORRENDOUS causing situations to escalate! I worked in Customer Service for years & it's really quite simple... Admit you're wrong, apologize and RESOLVE issue (and when company ROYALLY screws up, like in my situation, you proactively offer compensation to show you value your customer). PERIOD. What you do NOT do is talk over customer, cut them off, continually place them on hold, transfer them & ask them to repeat their story again & again only to have it repeated back INCORRECTLY again & again; IF something does finally get resolved DO NOT USE THE WORDS ""as a 1 time courtesy"" --ahhhh....THAT IS SOOOO RUDE TO SAY THAT BASICALLY YOU ARE DOING ME A FAVOR BY FIXING YOUR MISTAKE! WORDING MATTERS PEOPLE. Also DO NOT ARGUE W/ THE CUSTOMER OVER THIS! I mean MY GOD. ARE YOU SERIOUS?? Also enough w/ the fake ""ahhhs"" like you're soothing a baby. TRAIN YOUR INDIANS IN AMERICAN WAYS PLEASE. THESE METHODS ARE RUDE IN OUR CULTURE. THIS IS NOT EMPATHY. IT IS CONSIDERED PATRONIZING, RUDE, INCONSIDERATE OR JUST PLAIN NOT PAYING ATTENTION. Issues TOTAL in 7 days: 1. Wrong model of phone case sent resulting in return. 2. Received EMPTY package (CLEARLY open where the flap wasn't put down correctly at top and my items slid out somewhere during transportation/delivery; you could see in the pic that Amazon took of the delivered item in front of my door that the package was wide open, LOL! Called & 1 rep offered refund AND free replacement immediately (very nice & good at his job); however NEXT rep talked over me, cut me off constantly, repeated herself & used my credit resulting in a callback 2 days later to ANOTHER rude rep that argued, talked over me, cut me off, blah blah blah for 45 min. to then FINALLY ""do me the courtesy"" of returning the credit... 3. Different phone case ordered, arrived in my city at 7:30 am, yet by 8 pm (guaranteed delivery by 9pm); called Amazon & they said they had no driver so they offered a $5 credit & promised it would be delivered next day (ok, no problem) yet when didn't arrive next day I checked & it looked like package was delivered through app yet when I clicked on ""tracking"" it said item shipped to another state at 3:50am (??) and then BACK to MY city/state at 3 PM where it was then supposedly ""damaged"" and shipped back to seller... (do WHAT???). HOWEVER when I called Amazon THEY said item showed ""on hold at shipper"" and they didn't know why, so they marked it as REFUSED BY BUYER!!! (so now THAT'S on my acct. along w/ fact that I don't have my product or refund...) 4. The SAME day that my phone case was supposedly ""damaged"" I was supposed to receive a bath product but it was ALSO supposedly ""damaged"" & shipped back to seller... (when I tried to ask Amazon about the refund re: this product they were ""having computer issues"" after I'd already given tracking numbers multi times, been on hold, xferred around, explained story over & over... so they couldn't tell if refund was issued... 5. An item I ordered FIVE days ago (also on same day I ordered 2 other items separately w/ no problems, BTW) & scheduled for delivery tomorrow, SUDDENLY shows that I need to ""update my payment method"". Do WHAT??? I have the email confirmation from FIVE days ago and after 100's of orders I have NEVER had Amazon wait FIVE days to charge for something... They just DON'T do that... ALSO there is a GC Balance on my acct. that is technically my 1st payment/default payment option anyway, but for some reason REFUSES to allow me to use it for this $6. They had NO explanation for this and just kept saying to ""check w/ my bank"", LOL!! THAT IS NOT THE QUESTION. WHAT IS GOING ON AMAZON????",2019-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,16.0,4154,749,22,3,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,awful really gone downhill happens lot lately problem suddenly customer service embarrassing wouldve said best company day amazon screwed package resulting call totaling hr far still completely resolved issue still dont item refund really weird part problem different worst part customer service part horrendous causing situation escalate worked customer service year really quite simple admit youre wrong apologize resolve issue company royally screw like situation proactively offer compensation show value customer period talk customer cut continually place hold transfer ask repeat story repeated back incorrectly something finally get resolved use word time courtesy ahhhhthat soooo rude say basically favor fixing mistake wording matter people also argue w customer mean god serious also enough w fake ahhhs like youre soothing baby train indian american way please method rude culture empathy considered patronizing rude inconsiderate plain paying attention issue total day wrong model phone case sent resulting return received empty package clearly open flap wasnt put correctly top item slid somewhere transportationdelivery could see pic amazon took delivered item front door package wide open lol called rep offered refund free replacement immediately nice good job however next rep talked cut constantly repeated used credit resulting callback day later another rude rep argued talked cut blah blah blah min finally courtesy returning credit different phone case ordered arrived city yet pm guaranteed delivery pm called amazon said driver offered credit promised would delivered next day ok problem yet didnt arrive next day checked looked like package delivered app yet clicked tracking said item shipped another state back citystate pm supposedly damaged shipped back seller however called amazon said item showed hold shipper didnt know marked refused buyer thats acct along w fact dont product refund day phone case supposedly damaged supposed receive bath product also supposedly damaged shipped back seller tried ask amazon refund product computer issue id already given tracking number multi time hold xferred around explained story couldnt tell refund issued item ordered five day ago also day ordered item separately w problem btw scheduled delivery tomorrow suddenly show need update payment method email confirmation five day ago order never amazon wait five day charge something dont also gc balance acct technically st paymentdefault payment option anyway reason refuse allow use explanation kept saying check w bank lol question going amazon,0.9997378680246145,0.0002621319753854934,0.4200785193494111,0.2,0.38414676985757495,38.414676985757495,Low Trust
