Gvegas 72,/users/5dcf55a44fa33c033c9dec83,US,1.0,2019-11-16 01:49:34+00:00,1.0,Have always had great experience BUT,"Have always had great experience. But the past week I have been in touch 3 times due to an item in limbo.  Told two/ three different stories each time. Funny part is ordered the same item same day and delivered within the 2 day window. But second one (same item) ordered same day went into a black hole.  Have decided to give up but the frustrating thing is I then finally asked to cancel since it was not shipped. LOL that was a joke. Really disappointed given other good shipping and receiving.  May rethink next time to order anything from them. Got email a week and 2 days later today with this message Your package may be lostWe're very sorry your delivery is so late. Although it may still arrive, you can request a refund or replacement now. Geez I just wanted it cancelled.",2019-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,16.0,781,144,36,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,always great experience past week touch time due item limbo told two three different story time funny part ordered item day delivered within day window second one item ordered day went black hole decided give frustrating thing finally asked cancel since shipped lol joke really disappointed given good shipping receiving may rethink next time order anything got email week day later today message package may lostwere sorry delivery late although may still arrive request refund replacement geez wanted cancelled,0.006064576053077206,0.9939354239469228,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.8131202638523173,81.31202638523173,High Trust
Sin Oman,/users/5dcf3d4ccb183c89fd80dc0e,US,1.0,2019-11-16 00:06:03+00:00,1.0,Terrible service and product,"In the past month they sent me a defective air mattress with a hole,  a package all busted that had tape all over it with damaged products, a coat that was USED with a huge tear in it, left packages on the street in inner city Baltimore, and now have NO CLUE where an $80 package even is! Customer service is USELESS.  I am done with this company! I'd rather pay more elsewhere.  All were prime items too... over $100 a year? For WHAT? Buyer beware",2019-11-16 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,16.0,448,86,28,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,past month sent defective air mattress hole package busted tape damaged product coat used huge tear left package street inner city baltimore clue package even customer service useless done company id rather pay elsewhere prime item year buyer beware,0.49495253019717106,0.5050474698028289,0.04823331463825014,0.2,0.5621703978290645,56.217039782906454,Medium Trust
Tim Matthew,/users/5dcf3ac86cc9f92463c87631,US,1.0,2019-11-15 23:58:57+00:00,1.0,Amazon not what it used to be.,"I used to enjoy and trust shopping on Amazon. Recent purchases of automotive parts and maintenance products arrive damaged and Amazon puts you through the ringer on returns. I ordered a 5 quart jug of motor oil that arrived leaking in a oil saturated box. They wanted me to send it back somehow even after I sent them pictures. I ended up just eating the purchase since I knew no shipper would accept it. I've also grown tired of their constant price manipulation, which I usually find has increased in my basket when I go to purchase. I no longer trust their return process or pricing and have been using Walmart.com more and more with zero problems and better price stability.",2019-11-15 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,15.0,678,121,30,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used enjoy trust shopping amazon recent purchase automotive part maintenance product arrive damaged amazon put ringer return ordered quart jug motor oil arrived leaking oil saturated box wanted send back somehow even sent picture ended eating purchase since knew shipper would accept ive also grown tired constant price manipulation usually find increased basket go purchase longer trust return process pricing using walmartcom zero problem better price stability,0.00999847963736214,0.9900015203626379,0.06786315199102635,0.2,0.8085733905795242,80.85733905795242,High Trust
