Brianna Jean,/users/5dccf1dad71aee1a2cfd8fc8,US,2.0,2019-11-14 06:19:43+00:00,4.0,Amazon has become the way of the world!,"Amazon has become the way of the world. We can find anything we need at the edge of our finger tips + 2 day prime shipping?! SIGN ME UP! I’ve worked hand in hand with Amazon and their affiliate program which has been wonderful. I’ve also ordered many of my own personal things through the site as well. From clothes, to toilet paper and even random items like a pineapple carver LOL. They have a large variety of items and various vendors to choose from. The only issue I’ve really ever had is they tend to lose my packages. I even have an Amazon hub at my apartment complex where they can drop off the package directly. It’s always frustrating when something doesn’t arrive on time or gets lost some way some how in transit. However, Amazon has always swooped right in to help save the day. Their customer service is awesome! I’m more of a pick up the phone type of gal. I like that one on one customer service (it must be the sales person in me) but Amazon does also offer a chat service where you can speak to a representative directly. I’ve had phone calls and chats with them but I’ve had instances before where I can’t leave my desk to make a phone call. Easily enough I’ve gotten right on the chat, let them know my package was missing and they have sent a new one right out to me. Easy peasy! I’ve had really great service and have always been satisfied with the overall experience of the company itself. I would highly recommend checking them out!!",2019-11-14 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,14.0,1457,272,39,8,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,amazon become way world find anything need edge finger tip day prime shipping sign i’ve worked hand hand amazon affiliate program wonderful i’ve also ordered many personal thing site well clothes toilet paper even random item like pineapple carver lol large variety item various vendor choose issue i’ve really ever tend lose package even amazon hub apartment complex drop package directly it’s always frustrating something doesn’t arrive time get lost way transit however amazon always swooped right help save day customer service awesome i’m pick phone type gal like one one customer service must sale person amazon also offer chat service speak representative directly i’ve phone call chat i’ve instance can’t leave desk make phone call easily enough i’ve gotten right chat let know package missing sent new one right easy peasy i’ve really great service always satisfied overall experience company would highly recommend checking,0.9927240122914253,0.007275987708574738,0.1525518788558609,0.8,1.2341483696254596,123.41483696254596,High Trust
bob qualkinbush,/users/5dccb4686b0819f76195fef4,US,1.0,2019-11-14 01:57:05+00:00,1.0,Amazon is great until it's not,"Amazon is great until it's not. I used Amazon regularly until I had an issue with an expensive product that never arrived. The Amazon tracking said the product arrived and was placed in my mailbox (the product never would have fit in my mailbox). I have video proof that no delivery attempt was made, thanks nest. I reached out to Amazon for an explanation, they told me it was going to arrive the next day. I expressed my frustration as I had skipped work to receive the package and now I had to use another sick day. I touched base with Amazon customer support the next morning and was told the package would arrive that day. I checked in again in the afternoon and employees tell me it's still coming. Around 3pm I check back in to be told by an employee the tracking shows it arrived and is in your mailbox. I explain the situation to them and they offer to refund the money or resend the package. This means a third day off work. They offer me $5 credit for my troubles, really $5. That's not even 10% of the order. They didn't care at all about the fact that they had wasted two days of mine on account of them giving me bad information. I cancelled the order because I want going to sit around again waiting for something not to show up. Amazon has worse customer service than Comcast. They don't care at all about the customers.",2019-11-14 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,14.0,1336,251,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon great used amazon regularly issue expensive product never arrived amazon tracking said product arrived placed mailbox product never would fit mailbox video proof delivery attempt made thanks nest reached amazon explanation told going arrive next day expressed frustration skipped work receive package use another sick day touched base amazon customer support next morning told package would arrive day checked afternoon employee tell still coming around pm check back told employee tracking show arrived mailbox explain situation offer refund money resend package mean third day work offer credit trouble really thats even order didnt care fact wasted two day mine account giving bad information cancelled order want going sit around waiting something show amazon worse customer service comcast dont care customer,0.006538950128453914,0.993461049871546,0.14077397644419518,0.2,0.824885320224612,82.4885320224612,High Trust
