Bob Trost,/users/5dcc2b34e71f3315fc09e081,US,1.0,2019-11-13 16:11:43+00:00,1.0,I purchased a new pressure washer from…,I purchased a new pressure washer from the seller xirent and after 3 days I sent the seller a message asking why there were 2 different tracking numbers. Almost immediately the seller said the shipment was lost in transit to me. The price was way lower than competitors for the power washer. Without asking the seller for a refund they very quickly refunded my money. Amazon condoned the sellers business practices and shut me down for questioning the sellers credibility. Do not trust Amazon to protect you from crooked sellers.,2019-11-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,13.0,529,90,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased new pressure washer seller xirent day sent seller message asking different tracking number almost immediately seller said shipment lost transit price way lower competitor power washer without asking seller refund quickly refunded money amazon condoned seller business practice shut questioning seller credibility trust amazon protect crooked seller,0.013191857268142938,0.986808142731857,0.050476724621424565,0.2,0.8034994162902134,80.34994162902134,High Trust
