Susan,/users/5dcbf924a380edd4fa7d6bf9,US,1.0,2019-11-13 12:38:41+00:00,1.0,I have been a LONG time prime member…,I have been a LONG time prime member and have had no issues until this week. I ordered a NEW Apple iPad    It arrived same day as stated - however the screen was badly scratched.   I tried an online return but was stopped and directed to enter my phone - I received a call back and the service clerk could not even hear me due to the LOUD background noise on HIS end.  After explaining several times that the screen was scratched upon arrival and I only wanted a replacement- seems like a simple request- he told me that couldn’t be done. I asked to speak with a supervisor.  I was on hold for over 15 minutes.  Spoke to a supervisor supposedly but still no help and transferred to yet another employee.   Brenda said she would look to see if I can get a replacement- and I had to re explain the whole situation.   She was very rude   In total I was on the phone over 30 minutes and supposedly a replacement is on the way.  I had to take the damaged one to UPS to return.  Never once did anyone apologize aOr attempt to make this easily fixed scenario better.  Very disappointed in amazon.,2019-11-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,13.0,1089,205,37,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,long time prime member issue week ordered new apple ipad arrived day stated however screen badly scratched tried online return stopped directed enter phone received call back service clerk could even hear due loud background noise end explaining several time screen scratched upon arrival wanted replacement seems like simple request told couldn’t done asked speak supervisor hold minute spoke supervisor supposedly still help transferred yet another employee brenda said would look see get replacement explain whole situation rude total phone minute supposedly replacement way take damaged one ups return never anyone apologize aor attempt make easily fixed scenario better disappointed amazon,0.008486957384034122,0.9915130426159658,0.11497476163768929,0.2,0.8187514736355208,81.87514736355209,High Trust
Liam Goss,/users/5dcbcacb24418363a38a0ee5,GB,3.0,2019-11-13 09:26:39+00:00,1.0,Appalling customer service,"Appalling customer serviceI've been using amazon for a long time, >5 years. Until now, I've never had to contact customer services, thankfully. However, today was different - I ordered an item that was originally scheduled for delivery on Monday. The delivery attempt was made on Sunday which of course failed.The next step was to contact amazon regarding the redelivery, a change of address which I was assured had been carried out. Come the delivery day, I watched the handy map that informs you of the driver's location in relation to you. The driver was at the bottom of my road around 20:50, but as it got to 21:00 the map switched off and instructed me to contact Amazon.This is where the problem starts, the customer service assistant fed incorrect information in an attempt to reassure me. Starting by initially saying the change of address was never done, they couldn't see the history of the change despite me informing them the map on the delivery details was showing a new address. I followed up by asking them how this was the case and pasted the chat logs of the verification.The story changed, saying it was updated but the carrier didn't do it. Unfortunately for Amazon, it was their own carrier and probably would have been better to think that answer through. By this point, and hour had passed trying to get an answer for where my parcel is and why it wasn't delivered when it was 5 minutes from my house.I asked for a formal complaints procedure because I felt I was getting nowhere. The customer service assistant ignored the first request, and the 2nd request they said they would handle it. So I asked for a reference number or confirmation of the complaint, to which they could provide neither. Googling resolved that issue, but i still have no idea what happened to my parcel and when an exact delivery date will be. Not something I expect when I pay for Amazon Prime.Please shop locally, even if it is a bigger store because when things go wrong they seem quite disinterested and unwilling to help. In this case not even allowing me to go and collect the item myself! I've lost days in annual leave and my employer is not amused.Please look at your amazon.co.uk reviews on this site.",2019-11-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,13.0,2209,388,26,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,appalling customer serviceive using amazon long time year ive never contact customer service thankfully however today different ordered item originally scheduled delivery monday delivery attempt made sunday course failedthe next step contact amazon regarding redelivery change address assured carried come delivery day watched handy map informs driver location relation driver bottom road around got map switched instructed contact amazonthis problem start customer service assistant fed incorrect information attempt reassure starting initially saying change address never done couldnt see history change despite informing map delivery detail showing new address followed asking case pasted chat log verificationthe story changed saying updated carrier didnt unfortunately amazon carrier probably would better think answer point hour passed trying get answer parcel wasnt delivered minute housei asked formal complaint procedure felt getting nowhere customer service assistant ignored first request nd request said would handle asked reference number confirmation complaint could provide neither googling resolved issue still idea happened parcel exact delivery date something expect pay amazon primeplease shop locally even bigger store thing go wrong seem quite disinterested unwilling help case even allowing go collect item ive lost day annual leave employer amusedplease look amazoncouk review site,0.029535700880629297,0.9704642991193707,0.21761076836791923,0.2,0.8287543032332692,82.87543032332691,High Trust
