Michael Fields,/users/5dca0be84d076d1ef05f171a,US,1.0,2019-11-12 01:34:05+00:00,2.0,Amazon service sucks.,"I have shopped Amazon for years.  Minor problems but easily solved. I have tried to order gift cards twice recently, the first order Amazon simply cancelled the order with no notice, today I again attempted to order a gift card. Order was successfully placed. It was frozen for review. I contacted Amazon they said they were waiting on my credit card company to approve the transaction. I contacted my credit card company and was told nothing wrong with account plenty of money available no further verification required. Called Amazon back was told after 5/minutes of bull**it. That Amazon had to verify the order and it wouldn’t happen until sometime the next day, maybe.  If I wanted to wait 24 hours to get the card I would have gone shopping in the morning. Amazon support was no assistance. I canceled the order and I will go to store in the morning and buy the gift cards to mail. They will just be late.",2019-11-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,12.0,911,162,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,shopped amazon year minor problem easily solved tried order gift card twice recently first order amazon simply cancelled order notice today attempted order gift card order successfully placed frozen review contacted amazon said waiting credit card company approve transaction contacted credit card company told nothing wrong account plenty money available verification required called amazon back told minute bullit amazon verify order wouldn’t happen sometime next day maybe wanted wait hour get card would gone shopping morning amazon support assistance canceled order go store morning buy gift card mail late,0.012467279399465913,0.9875327206005341,0.09085810431856421,0.4,1.1119379811639798,111.19379811639799,High Trust
Lu Olive,/users/5dc9d6394054bba0cee6b88a,US,1.0,2019-11-11 21:44:38+00:00,1.0,No help,"To top it off I order a package that did not come in when it was supposed to. I contacted customer service they told me within the next day I got a notification that it was being delivered at 9am waited all day. They're tracking system sucks, they don't update it to let you know how close or far your package is so your stuck canceling all your plans for the day waiting to see if it gets there to never show up. Then you contact them and they are no help at all. Just give a run around the whole time.",2019-11-11 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,11.0,503,102,7,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,top order package come supposed contacted customer service told within next day got notification delivered waited day theyre tracking system suck dont update let know close far package stuck canceling plan day waiting see get never show contact help give run around whole time,0.0193472061508474,0.9806527938491526,0.05720695457094784,0.2,0.8017677878387659,80.17677878387659,High Trust
lisa peepee,/users/5dc9b03dfe42a35055c0903a,US,1.0,2019-11-11 19:02:32+00:00,1.0,Very disappointed in customer service,"I have loved Amazon for a few years now and am super disappointed with their customer service. My account got hacked. The hacker changed the contact e-mail address to their own so I could no longer get into my account. The hacker had access to my credit cards and addresses. We made 5 calls into the call center and it was shocking how unhelpful the customer service representatives were. The call center is in the Philipines and sounded like a party was going on in the background. We basically had to cancel our current account, but we paid for an account and have no clue how to access a new account. We are blocked. We keep calling and the reps say they are sending it....somewhere. I guess a trillion-dollar company stays that way by paying low wages in foreign countries.",2019-11-11 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,11.0,777,140,37,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,loved amazon year super disappointed customer service account got hacked hacker changed contact email address could longer get account hacker access credit card address made call call center shocking unhelpful customer service representative call center philipines sounded like party going background basically cancel current account paid account clue access new account blocked keep calling rep say sending itsomewhere guess trilliondollar company stay way paying low wage foreign country,0.03342971952360058,0.9665702804763994,0.07851934941110487,0.2,0.7989890101204207,79.89890101204207,High Trust
