Nicole Ahne,/users/5dc95ec3dfa0792ddf8bf2c6,SE,1.0,2019-11-11 13:16:13+00:00,1.0,Amazon has stolen 467USD from me,"Amazon has stolen 467 USD from me. I find it totally unacceptable how this company can operate in this reckless manner by charging thousands of customers for services they have never signed up for. In November 2016 I used Amazon service for the first time when ordering a gift for a friend. I did not sign up for a membership of any kind. However, ever since (the past 36 months) Amazon has charged a monthly fee of 12,99 USD from my account for a ""AmazonPrime Membership"".The reason I did not find out is due to an accident that has absorbed all of my attention in the past years. Also I used my German bank account at the time and I then had to move back to Sweden, which is why I did not keep an eye on the German bank account.I contacted Amazon who confirms that they can not see that I neither signed up for a Prime subscription, nor used the Prime membership. I was refunded for 3 months only and informed that I should contact my German bank for the full refund. However my German bank can make a refund of maximum 3 months and claims that it is Amazon's responsibility to make a full refund for a membership that I never signed up for. Otherwise it is considered theft and that I need to hire a lawyer in order to get my money back. Looking forward for Amazon to take action and make me the full refund that I legally have the right to.",2019-11-11 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,11.0,1344,257,32,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon stolen usd find totally unacceptable company operate reckless manner charging thousand customer service never signed november used amazon service first time ordering gift friend sign membership kind however ever since past month amazon charged monthly fee usd account amazonprime membershipthe reason find due accident absorbed attention past year also used german bank account time move back sweden keep eye german bank accounti contacted amazon confirms see neither signed prime subscription used prime membership refunded month informed contact german bank full refund however german bank make refund maximum month claim amazon responsibility make full refund membership never signed otherwise considered theft need hire lawyer order get money back looking forward amazon take action make full refund legally right,0.009034103985567926,0.9909658960144321,0.1441390914189568,0.2,0.8243107662910074,82.43107662910074,High Trust
