Heather Grace,/users/5dc636c818c0e82d9aa62e2d,US,1.0,2019-11-09 03:47:31+00:00,1.0,Horrible customer service,"I have specific delivery instructions for packages on my account.  The drivers have yet to follow the directions despite multiple calls to amazon logistics.  I am consistently told that the drivers supervisor will be made aware.  I’ve been hearing this since June and nothing has changed with how they deliver the packages.  The customer service is atrocious when I contact them regarding their employees inability to follow basic delivery instructions. It makes me wonder why I pay for the prime membership and deal with this company since customer service is no longer a top priority. I will be eliminating my prime membership and any ordering through amazon.  It might cost a bit more to go to the local pet store for food and other stores for supplies but at least the customer service aspect will be in check.  Historically I had confidence when I called amazon that they would rectify an issue.  Now their attitude is one of detachment, failure to listen and failure to hold employees accountable.  Sorry amazon but you just lost a loyal and frequent shopper.",2019-11-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,9.0,1065,179,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,specific delivery instruction package account driver yet follow direction despite multiple call amazon logistics consistently told driver supervisor made aware i’ve hearing since june nothing changed deliver package customer service atrocious contact regarding employee inability follow basic delivery instruction make wonder pay prime membership deal company since customer service longer top priority eliminating prime membership ordering amazon might cost bit go local pet store food store supply least customer service aspect check historically confidence called amazon would rectify issue attitude one detachment failure listen failure hold employee accountable sorry amazon lost loyal frequent shopper,0.022738866182422445,0.9772611338175775,0.10039259674705553,0.2,0.8087090862581998,80.87090862581998,High Trust
Ilenia,/users/5dc5fc84567fde628207ef8e,GB,1.0,2019-11-08 23:39:15+00:00,1.0,Horrible customer service and investigation team,"I tried to buy a phone, I didn't use my computer but a different one. Amazon locked my account without any notice because they thought it wasn't me. They later send me an email asking to reset password and payment details. All my orders had been deleted and there was no way to recover it. I tried to reset everything and called customer service to understand what to do, they told me not to place a new order because my account was under investigation (??????) and that they would send me an email to update me.Having received no email I called again, this time they suggested to place a new order because the old one was definetely cancelled. So I did, and 10 minutes later my order was cancelled again and the transaction was pending on my bank account.I called again the customer service hoping someone would help me to recover this order. No way!! Nothing to do. My money are now blocked and the order has been cancelled again, they had no idea what was going on.Thank you Amazon for this nightmare.",2019-11-08 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,8.0,1004,183,48,6,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,tried buy phone didnt use computer different one amazon locked account without notice thought wasnt later send email asking reset password payment detail order deleted way recover tried reset everything called customer service understand told place new order account investigation would send email update mehaving received email called time suggested place new order old one definetely cancelled minute later order cancelled transaction pending bank accounti called customer service hoping someone would help recover order way nothing money blocked order cancelled idea going onthank amazon nightmare,0.1870495601996405,0.8129504398003595,0.10263600673022995,0.2,0.7270024212462258,72.70024212462258,Medium Trust
