Jake Miera,/users/5dc56332ec22cd535d3c14b2,US,2.0,2019-11-08 12:44:49+00:00,1.0,First and only order.,"I ordered a shirt from Amazon in August or 2019. I wanted the shirt to be delivered quickly so I clicked something for them to charge me an extra fee to have it delivered faster. Unbeknownst to me after doing that they signed me up for monthly prime payments. I was layed off from my job at the time not long after the order and was using the money in my account while looking for other work. To my surprise a payment from Amazon went through when I was low on funds in my account, overdrawing me, and causing an overdraft fee of 32 dollars. I eventually called them to see why they were charging me after a second Amazon purchase, thinking the shirt I ordered was processed twice and very late, putting me at negative 94. They only refunded me the one payment from the prime subscription I never signed up for after figuring out what they had done, and wouldn't even refund me for the item I purchased in August that never even showed up. I am now negative 80 dollars in my bank account because of their error, until the check from my new job is deposited. They were very unhelpful, and couldn't care less about the situation they put me in. Basically I paid 80 dollars to be jerked around by them and left empty handed. This review doesn't even begin to describe how displeased I am.",2019-11-08 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,8.0,1285,241,21,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered shirt amazon august wanted shirt delivered quickly clicked something charge extra fee delivered faster unbeknownst signed monthly prime payment layed job time long order using money account looking work surprise payment amazon went low fund account overdrawing causing overdraft fee dollar eventually called see charging second amazon purchase thinking shirt ordered processed twice late putting negative refunded one payment prime subscription never signed figuring done wouldnt even refund item purchased august never even showed negative dollar bank account error check new job deposited unhelpful couldnt care less situation put basically paid dollar jerked around left empty handed review doesnt even begin describe displeased,0.012406604888589419,0.9875933951114105,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.8208297878529571,82.08297878529571,High Trust
