Sean,/users/5d975df8dfffa82ab96670ef,US,3.0,2019-11-07 19:46:52+00:00,1.0,Fed up with poor customer service,"Fed up with poor customer service. No recourse for late arrivals and making me jump through hoops to prove orders were late when all information is in their system. The past 4/6 orders have been late and 1 of those never arrived. On one occasion have they offered me a FIVE DOLLAR CREDIT that can only be used on Amazon sold items which are basically non-existent for anything useful to me or relative to my shopping habits. The membership prices have increased only to offer worse customer service and worse shipping times. In this day and age it is almost just as easy and price efficient to shop on eBay. It won't be too much longer until that is fully accurate statement. I am done with the inconveniences and greedy tactics of Amazon which I used to admire as a company. I am fed up, and done. Please do not enable Amazon to rip us customers off and spend your money elsewhere.*I called about my most recent order being late I'm, to follow up about the previous recent orders, and cancel my membership. I spoke with supervisor ""Carla"", after being escalated from a first level rep due to no recourse, and we conveniently got ""disconnected"". During the call they stated they couldn't even cancel my membership. They would provide a link to which I could service the cancellation myself. How lazy? I guess I'm expected to reconsider while taking the time to jump through hoops to cancel. Afterward I receive a message that states she has applied a $40 credit to my account that I can only use on Amazon items, but without a proper conversation and acceptance from the customer. $40 credit for $1000+ worth of late equipment over 5 orders. How convenient it must have been to be disconnected from a ""problem"" customer, and be able to employ such shoddy customer service. My 8 year tenure with prime ends today.",2019-11-07 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,7.0,1812,322,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,fed poor customer service recourse late arrival making jump hoop prove order late information system past order late never arrived one occasion offered five dollar credit used amazon sold item basically nonexistent anything useful relative shopping habit membership price increased offer worse customer service worse shipping time day age almost easy price efficient shop ebay wont much longer fully accurate statement done inconvenience greedy tactic amazon used admire company fed done please enable amazon rip u customer spend money elsewherei called recent order late im follow previous recent order cancel membership spoke supervisor carla escalated first level rep due recourse conveniently got disconnected call stated couldnt even cancel membership would provide link could service cancellation lazy guess im expected reconsider taking time jump hoop cancel afterward receive message state applied credit account use amazon item without proper conversation acceptance customer credit worth late equipment order convenient must disconnected problem customer able employ shoddy customer service year tenure prime end today,0.01107803382580875,0.9889219661741913,0.18059450364554122,0.2,0.830579883816204,83.05798838162039,High Trust
