Bill Johnson,/users/5dc395761beb09683db45943,US,1.0,2019-11-07 03:54:46+00:00,1.0,Beware! Prime Promises Not Kept,"Ordered a bite guard that was promised the next day.  Order did not arrive and I was informed that it was damaged in shipment and I would be refunded within 24 hours.  THAT DID NOT HAPPEN.  When I called 3 days later because the charge was still on my account, they said they could not remove the charge or replace the item.  Now I have no item, the charge remains on my account and Amazon refuses to help!  The supervisor on the phone admitted the item shows as never shipped. So Amazon, one of the worlds largest corporations has kept my money for several days, and has no intention of fulfilling my order.  Please be aware that Amazon has little interest in customer service and feels no obligation to keep its promises.",2019-11-07 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,7.0,723,132,31,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered bite guard promised next day order arrive informed damaged shipment would refunded within hour happen called day later charge still account said could remove charge replace item item charge remains account amazon refuse help supervisor phone admitted item show never shipped amazon one world largest corporation kept money several day intention fulfilling order please aware amazon little interest customer service feel obligation keep promise,0.02081569628636729,0.9791843037136327,0.07403252944475602,0.2,0.8043986577457675,80.43986577457675,High Trust
