Andrew,/users/51f7dc0f000064000145e39e,GB,17.0,2019-11-06 10:55:07+00:00,1.0,Haven for fraud and counterfeit goods,Woke up 1 morning to find my account had been hacked and I'd supposedly ordered a £90 jumper from China. I immediately contacted the seller to cancel the order prior to the item being dispatched. The seller ignored me. I contacted Amazon who sent me a generic reply offering no help. The item was sent a week later despite my cancellation request. The item arrived and was a poor quality counterfeit item worth about £5. Amazon and the seller continued to ignore me and I had to claim the money back through the bank. Amazon also barred me from reviewing the product or seller despite me paying for the item and having it in possession. From what I cam see Amazon and it's third party sellers are all complicit in the regular hacking and fraud which is taking place on Amazon.com.,2019-11-06 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,6.0,780,141,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,woke morning find account hacked id supposedly ordered £ jumper china immediately contacted seller cancel order prior item dispatched seller ignored contacted amazon sent generic reply offering help item sent week later despite cancellation request item arrived poor quality counterfeit item worth £ amazon seller continued ignore claim money back bank amazon also barred reviewing product seller despite paying item possession cam see amazon third party seller complicit regular hacking fraud taking place amazoncom,0.013224272774718592,0.9867757272252814,0.07908020190689849,0.2,0.8092039039940204,80.92039039940204,High Trust
