Josh,/users/5dc1c9271f54b9d54889ea02,US,2.0,2019-11-05 19:10:34+00:00,1.0,Amazon lied to me,"I have been an Amazon Prime member for many years. They were great, fast, efficient, and good customer service. However, several months ago I placed an order for an item that was on backorder for three weeks. No big deal. But when the three weeks past, I got an email saying the item would not be available for unknown amount of time. Just for kicks, I looked my item up on Amazon. It should to be in-stock but the process had tripled. Yes, tripled. I contacted customer service and asked how an item could be in-stock and yet my back-ordered order had not been filled. They could not give me an explanation and told me that if I ordered the same item at the new price, when it arrived, they would refund me the difference. When the new order arrived, I contacted them again for my refund and they refused to give it to me. After days of going back and forth with customer service, I finally wrote a letter to the corporate office with print-outs of all the chat messages with customer service. I sent the letter certified with signature delivery confirmation. I got the signature card back a week later and expected.Well, I just got the letter back... opened and taped back shut saying ""Return to sender - wrong address."" So I'm done with Amazon.",2019-11-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,5.0,1247,227,17,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime member many year great fast efficient good customer service however several month ago placed order item backorder three week big deal three week past got email saying item would available unknown amount time kick looked item amazon instock process tripled yes tripled contacted customer service asked item could instock yet backordered order filled could give explanation told ordered item new price arrived would refund difference new order arrived contacted refund refused give day going back forth customer service finally wrote letter corporate office printout chat message customer service sent letter certified signature delivery confirmation got signature card back week later expectedwell got letter back opened taped back shut saying return sender wrong address im done amazon,0.007247652732096221,0.9927523472679037,0.12731351654514864,0.2,0.8218388769429816,82.18388769429816,High Trust
