One That Travels,/users/5dc0b219f73d4793f3ed6c10,US,8.0,2019-11-05 06:01:27+00:00,1.0,Oh Where to Begin WHERE to begin?,"Oh Where to Begin WHERE to begin?? Amazon has barred me from writing reviews because they felt that I was reviewing in return for discounted products or for free products. However, the reviews that I was writng, were very legitimate for discounts or not! The discounts DID NOT require reviews! My reviews have gone completely away from amazon.com why? Because they said that I have the broken their policy too many times and that they are removing all of my reviews. That is just the beginning.   I have emailed and called Amazon at least six times in the last year to discuss what actually happened because according to their ""computers"", I am doing something illegal. Really??? Anyways, all of my phone calls and all of my emails have always gone unanswered! The last time I tried was two weeks ago. Now, getting onto the business side of Amazon Prime, what a rip off! Definitely not worth $179. Amazon, you'll never get my money for Prime. Good luck!",2019-11-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,5.0,953,167,33,7,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,oh begin begin amazon barred writing review felt reviewing return discounted product free product however review writng legitimate discount discount require review review gone completely away amazoncom said broken policy many time removing review beginning emailed called amazon least six time last year discus actually happened according computer something illegal really anyways phone call email always gone unanswered last time tried two week ago getting onto business side amazon prime rip definitely worth amazon youll never get money prime good luck,0.9749827313654499,0.025017268634550116,0.09366236679753225,0.2,0.3312411076767815,33.12411076767815,Low Trust
