JHarding,/users/5dbd9bd0bc30addeed8fbd1e,US,2.0,2019-11-02 15:16:09+00:00,1.0,Wish I could give a 0,"Wish I could give a 0.  Prime used to be a great value.  However, since the price has almost doubled, the delivery time & customer service makes Prime a total waste of time.  Promise of 2 day delivery has now turned into 4+ days.  You mark 2 day delivery before you pay, then once you pay, they tell you your delivery time can be as much as a week or more.  And the customer service is based out of India or some such place with people who ""are sorry for the inconvenience, but can't help you at all"". They also lie to you and don't offer any real help.  I am done with Amazon.  Not the sellers, but Amazon itself.",2019-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,2.0,614,120,21,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wish could give prime used great value however since price almost doubled delivery time customer service make prime total waste time promise day delivery turned day mark day delivery pay pay tell delivery time much week customer service based india place people sorry inconvenience cant help also lie dont offer real help done amazon seller amazon,0.002879891335901059,0.997120108664099,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.812020514231096,81.2020514231096,High Trust
