Telboy,/users/55f7df820000ff0001dbe224,GB,8.0,2019-11-02 10:12:17+00:00,1.0,Covering their bottoms !!,"I REVIEWED THIS ITEM HONESTLY BUT AMAZON REFUSED TO PUBLISH IT.  INFORMATION THAT POTENTIAL BUYERS SHOULD BE TOLD.Thank you for submitting a customer review. Thank you for submitting a customer review on Amazon. After carefully reviewing your submission, your review could not be posted to the website. While we appreciate your time and comments, reviews must adhere to the guidelines: Neos SmartCam | Security Camera, Works with Alexa, 1080P Full HD, Night Vision, 2-Way Audio Smart Camera | UK Warranty	 ★★   from mrhappy on 31 October 2019  BUYER BEWARE - SAMSUNG ‘A’ & ‘J’ SERIES PHONES PROBLEMS WITH NEOS APP Just discovered that my 18 month old A Series Samsung phone won’t work on these cameras platform. A known problem according to Neos tech people. Confirmed by email that ‘J’ series also problematic. Why is this not indicated on the sales literature ? I think I’ve got a clue !!Had about 8 emails back and forth with NEOS regarding the failure of my phone not working with the app. Think they were getting more terse near the end. Obviously my fault for having the wrong phone !I pointed out in the end, that I could cope using the iOS app on my iPad which is working OK, and the reply I got was also abrupt. My reply was, do they expect me to buy a new iPhone or Android phone (that’s if I knew which make/model would work) to get the app to work ?It’s a shame really because I can see that these cameras are great for the price if you have the correct phone. They just need to be more transparent about which makes/models won’t work with their App.",2019-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,2.0,1562,281,25,4,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,reviewed item honestly amazon refused publish information potential buyer toldthank submitting customer review thank submitting customer review amazon carefully reviewing submission review could posted website appreciate time comment review must adhere guideline neos smartcam security camera work alexa p full hd night vision way audio smart camera uk warranty ★★ mrhappy october buyer beware samsung ‘a’ ‘j’ series phone problem neos app discovered month old series samsung phone won’t work camera platform known problem according neos tech people confirmed email ‘j’ series also problematic indicated sale literature think i’ve got clue email back forth neos regarding failure phone working app think getting terse near end obviously fault wrong phone pointed end could cope using io app ipad working ok reply got also abrupt reply expect buy new iphone android phone that’s knew makemodel would work get app work it’s shame really see camera great price correct phone need transparent makesmodels won’t work app,0.7508388784241796,0.24916112157582038,0.15759955131800338,0.2,0.45610047105151086,45.61004710515108,Low Trust
Steve Sylheti O'neil,/users/5dbd40b796632f84f2e1edc0,GB,1.0,2019-11-02 08:40:23+00:00,1.0,"12 hours and counting good for 1 item, I spent on phone.. I hate Amazon staff","12 hours and counting, for a item that's not showing on their system... So now I want to return the product, I can't. On top I've been told fraud team will look into it. I mean did I. Steal the blink security system, exclusive to amazon. I just spent 3 hours just thisormomg.. Ongoing case for months and unresponsive complaints time.. I spent so many hours complaining, that I changed my name to, Mr complain. I shall, be closing my acc.. Truth is Amazon is not good for me or many more.. We get same day delivery seduced by great presented website, so we shop, and shop till we're addicts.. I have got so many shft I can't belive my self.. I even brought a stupid tootlh flosser( jet powered)) I have 4 mobile phones, 9 useless up camera, magnetic board. AND I also the owner of 10pound magnet.. Incase I wanna check if my steel is fake or not.. 7 earphones 3 Bluetooth spk... I'm mentioning this is I never needed them nor do I use it... Yes I forgot 2 useless key finder, very ugly... Yeh I don't need amazon, its not healthy.. Its like a ritual, everyday atleast something, I need to order, so I can see the brown package.. Main issues is with everything but their site in having issue at.. Balaji, Aditya, pankag. All 3 of you should not be allowed near any customers and stay away from the phones...",2019-11-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,11.0,2.0,1306,245,77,16,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,hour counting item thats showing system want return product cant top ive told fraud team look mean steal blink security system exclusive amazon spent hour thisormomg ongoing case month unresponsive complaint time spent many hour complaining changed name mr complain shall closing acc truth amazon good many get day delivery seduced great presented website shop shop till addict got many shft cant belive self even brought stupid tootlh flosser 