Heather Yee,/users/5db85db8882c7962843c86e2,US,1.0,2019-10-29 15:45:09+00:00,1.0,I normally love Amazon and have a prime…,"I normally love Amazon and have a prime membership.  For Christmas last year my parents bought both my kids the Kindle Fire Tablet Kids edition that came with a warranty that they will replace them no questions asked. Well i have two boys and over the summer one of them dropped something heavy on his so i sent it in got it replaced and then they ""accidentally charged"" me for it. I called they apologized  refunded the money and i figured all was ok accidents happen.  Well just last month my other son his screen died or something you could no longer see what was on it and then he also shattered his brothers screen so i sent both of them in and then this morning my account was charged.  I called and was told that it was an accident, and then was told this is how their system works and they said that they refunded my money but now its going to take a week to get if back in my account.  I love the convenience of amazon but this was the 2nd time this has happened.  I will no longer be purchasing electronic items such as kindles from amazon anymore.",2019-10-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,29.0,1058,202,40,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,normally love amazon prime membership christmas last year parent bought kid kindle fire tablet kid edition came warranty replace question asked well two boy summer one dropped something heavy sent got replaced accidentally charged called apologized refunded money figured ok accident happen well last month son screen died something could longer see also shattered brother screen sent morning account charged called told accident told system work said refunded money going take week get back account love convenience amazon nd time happened longer purchasing electronic item kindles amazon anymore,0.015675895252204232,0.9843241047477957,0.11329220415030847,0.2,0.8148204932039597,81.48204932039597,High Trust
Clive Pearce,/users/5cd301e1275b13e30e27a35f,GB,14.0,2019-10-29 11:39:26+00:00,1.0,Shoddy and incompetent,"Shoddy and incompetentBought a coffee machine costing £350.00+ from an Amazon Marketplace seller in Germany.It was very faulty (coffee very weak and tasteless; steam wand a joke) I trained as a Barista as a hobby after retiring so I do know what I'm talking about.Amazon rejected my claim because I had not followed the (very) fine print of their return 'rules' to the letter.I had returned the machine to Germany anyway, so the seller was the beneficiary of my money AND the machine.Sloping shoulder reaction from Amazon which if you read the other reviews here is a common occurrence.There are many other players in this space, so don't bother with the lure of free postage etc.",2019-10-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,29.0,680,116,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,shoddy incompetentbought coffee machine costing £ amazon marketplace seller germanyit faulty coffee weak tasteless steam wand joke trained barista hobby retiring know im talking aboutamazon rejected claim followed fine print return rule letteri returned machine germany anyway seller beneficiary money machinesloping shoulder reaction amazon read review common occurrencethere many player space dont bother lure free postage etc,0.043919418341769614,0.9560805816582304,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.7910520687315269,79.1052068731527,High Trust
Willie Dixon,/users/5db7a54d6a261a5d09f1586a,US,1.0,2019-10-30 17:54:27+00:00,5.0,Amazon A Company Customers Can Trust...,"I am giving Amazon such a high rating because 2 months ago I ordered a new Bluetooth Earpiece and several other items.  The Bluetooth took5 weeks to arrive, so Amazon refunded me my funds and the very next day,  my package arrived.  I immediately got in touch with Amazon to have them reverse the refund they gave me. Though I never received the Thanos Avengers Action Figure I ordered,  one thing gave me so much more respect for Amazon as a company.  I ordered a set of security alarms and though the alarms were malfunctioned,  the person (s) that sales the Alarms through Amazon wanted me to give them a better review than the one(1) Star I gave them, which should have been zero(0), but I was unable to give that rating.  Even after I received my refund,  the person (s) continually texted me,  trying to pressure me into giving them a better rating which goes against my moral code and upbringing.  Amazon received my message of complaint about this issue and handled it themselves and I never received another text nor phone call from them since. Knowing that Amazon cares enough for their customers to push forward and handle situations such as this, let's me know as a valued customer that they really and truthfully put us the consumer first and will go above and beyond to make sure that we are satisfied with the service Amazon supplies to the public on a daily basis.",2019-10-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,30.0,1380,246,39,6,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,giving amazon high rating month ago ordered new bluetooth earpiece several item bluetooth took week arrive amazon refunded fund next day package arrived immediately got touch amazon reverse refund gave though never received thanos avenger action figure ordered one thing gave much respect amazon company ordered set security alarm though alarm malfunctioned person sale alarm amazon wanted give better review one star gave zero unable give rating even received refund person continually texted trying pressure giving better rating go moral code upbringing amazon received message complaint issue handled never received another text phone call since knowing amazon care enough customer push forward handle situation let know valued customer really truthfully put u consumer first go beyond make sure satisfied service amazon supply public daily basis,0.02306476296460264,0.9769352370353973,0.13796971396522714,1.0,2.016061561310744,201.6061561310744,High Trust
Christian Eaton,/users/5db7a1ff17611cdddbfad8e7,US,1.0,2019-10-29 02:22:02+00:00,1.0,Most deceptive company,Most deceptive company.  They trick customers into signing up for prime. Then lie about the benefits of prime. Beware if you purchase a prime products and you aren’t signed up for prime they will automatically start stealing money out of your account you used to purchase the product and good luck reaching anyone to have it stopped. Then they guarantee the prime product will be received within 1-2 days and that’s a lie and you can’t reach anyone when the product is fulfilled by amazon to find out where the product is. Not to mention most of there products are counterfeit and over priced I wish that this company was held accountable for there business practices and all the lies and deception and theft. They should be sued and put out of business! I can’t stand Amazon!,2019-10-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,29.0,776,137,22,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,deceptive company trick customer signing prime lie benefit prime beware purchase prime product aren’t signed prime automatically start stealing money account used purchase product good luck reaching anyone stopped guarantee prime product received within day that’s lie can’t reach anyone product fulfilled amazon find product mention product counterfeit priced wish company held accountable business practice lie deception theft sued put business can’t stand amazon,0.3391434047826291,0.6608565952173708,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.6457956559934303,64.57956559934303,Medium Trust
