Deniqua Ortiz,/users/5c7f6e544fe0fbd2fba83753,US,3.0,2019-10-28 23:43:12+00:00,1.0,Amazon is falling apart,Amazon used to be my go to for online shopping for years. This past year I have experienced two incidents where I did not receive my package. Of course they blame the postal service when infact its who they do business with when we order from their site. Amazon uses third party venders to sell the items we buy. I am now skeptical to by from them after going through this twice this year  months apart. Im also a prime member and feel this is now a waste of my money.,2019-10-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,28.0,468,91,23,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon used go online shopping year past year experienced two incident receive package course blame postal service infact business order site amazon us third party vender sell item buy skeptical going twice year month apart im also prime member feel waste money,0.01193908740105543,0.9880609125989446,0.05103757711721817,0.2,0.8042379717229159,80.42379717229159,High Trust
Zachary Oviatt,/users/5db770528d1aece6b34a5a32,US,1.0,2019-10-28 22:49:32+00:00,1.0,Smile and Nod,"Had a prime account associated with an email I no longer had control of. The associate indicated they would cancel the prime membership and refund a period of the charging as I was not using the benefits. That was more than I could have asked for. What I was after was an email for officially closing the account down. I never received that email. Or the refund. Nor was the prime membership cancelled.A lot of the actions they said they were taking were right there as we were speaking. I'm confused that I spent all that time and we achieved nothing. Ultimately I was able to get control of the email linked to the prime account. Customer service definitely did not play any role in this resolution. Amazon's a good experience when you're buying stuff, but if they start charging your card and you don't know where it's coming from, they sure as hell don't. At least, that's the answer I got from the associate I talked with before the one I discussed above.Stats:-Total Time Spent on Phone: 45 minutes-Satisfaction with Resolution: No resolution",2019-10-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,28.0,1048,184,13,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime account associated email longer control associate indicated would cancel prime membership refund period charging using benefit could asked email officially closing account never received email refund prime membership cancelleda lot action said taking right speaking im confused spent time achieved nothing ultimately able get control email linked prime account customer service definitely play role resolution amazon good experience youre buying stuff start charging card dont know coming sure hell dont least thats answer got associate talked one discussed abovestatstotal time spent phone minutessatisfaction resolution resolution,0.030605352651059178,0.9693946473489409,0.10319685922602355,0.2,0.8053366955196751,80.5336695519675,High Trust
Scott Abney,/users/5db757226a261ac2edf14143,US,2.0,2019-10-28 21:01:29+00:00,1.0,I have been an Amazon Prime customer…,"I have been an Amazon Prime customer for years and since they started their own delivery the service is terrible.  Packages are routinely delivered late (no sure what Prime is doing for me).  They also leave packages in the worst locations.  Today for instance they left my package in the middle of my driveway where my dogs can get to it instead of by the front door.   In another instance last week they claimed they delivered my packages and handed them directly to the resident at 9:08 am.  Hard to do when my wife and I are working at that time, they were just left in the middle of the driveway.  I love Amazon but their delivery is enough to make me think about finding a different service.",2019-10-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,28.0,697,128,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime customer year since started delivery service terrible package routinely delivered late sure prime also leave package worst location today instance left package middle driveway dog get instead front door another instance last week claimed delivered package handed directly resident hard wife working time left middle driveway love amazon delivery enough make think finding different service,0.026036802558872488,0.9739631974411275,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.80133942261288,80.133942261288,High Trust
Katelyn Griffin,/users/5db7458f8d1aecd6cb4a45b7,US,1.0,2019-10-28 19:46:31+00:00,1.0,Horrible service,"To say I’m disappointed is an understatement. About a month ago, I contacted customer service because certain packages (heavy ones) were being delivered to my leasing office instead of my door. I was told the packages mentioned were being delivered by USPS, as amazon has a contract with them. I opened a case and voiced my concern, only to see no results. This past Saturday, my pets food was delivered to my leasing office and closed before I got off of work. I’d selected “leave at front door” during my order to avoid this issue. Of course, I got home to no package. I had to go out and purchase another food for my pets to hold them over until the office opened up Monday. Considering I’d already been assured this wouldn’t happen again, I was pretty upset. As not to be tied to the phone, I tried to use the customer service chat. Absolutely useless, I was told “I apologize for the inconvenience, I’ll pass along the feedback”. That’s fine, but at this point it’s more than an inconvenience. What is the point of paying $129 a year for a delivery service, to still have to drive somewhere, load up my own package, then carry it up 2 flights of stairs? If that was the route I wanted to take I’d save myself the $129 and go to the store myself. But see the reason I chose amazon is due to the odd hours I work, and the fact that I suffer from back and neck issues and have been advised against carrying heavy items. I decided to call, the man I spoke with couldn’t seem to understand why I was upset. I asked to speak to a supervisor, was left on hold for about 10 minutes, then told she didn’t have time to talk to me right then, but he would try to help. I repeated my concern again, and he then told me he didn’t understand why she wouldn’t help me and put my on hold again. A few minutes later, a male supervisor picked up. He said he understood my concern and presented me with options. He said he could file a request to have amazon deliver rather than usps. He then asked me if I’d written a letter to usps asking them to deliver mypackages to my front door. I’m sorry, what? Why should I have to do that? I select “deliver to my front door” and provide MY ADDRESS. That tells you that I want my packages delivered to my front door, regardless of the reasoning behind it. After all, isn’t that what I’m paying for? He told me that amazon is only responsible for making sure the packages arrive in 2 days, and how they’re delivered isn’t their responsibility. I explained that, yes, if they pay USPS on behalf of amazon, they are indeed responsible for it. At that point, I told him I felt like, after 45 minutes of arguing, and all the hassle, that I was entitled to some sort of compensation. I’ve been paying for a prime membership but still having to essentially deliver my own packages and purchase extra pet food when it’s delivered to the wrong place and I can’t get there until days after due to my work schedule. He said I couldn’t have any refund on my membership since it was an annual subscription. So I explained that he needed to find a way considering I was paying for a service I wasn’t getting. I suggested that instead, I get a refund for all of the items I’ve ordered that I had to retrieve myself...he put me on hold and said he could give me $63 dollars towards my membership. This is the worst experience I’ve ever had. I am researching other places to order my pets food from, as I do not wish to support a company who doesn’t deliver exceptional customer service. If a manager cannot make time to speak with an unhappy customer due to issues caused by their company, they should not be employed there. Amazon, you’ve lost a loyal customer. As soon as I find an alternative, I will certainly take my business elsewhere and make sure I inform others so they avoid the hassle.",2019-10-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,28.0,3809,714,16,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,say i’m disappointed understatement month ago contacted customer service certain package heavy one delivered leasing office instead door told package mentioned delivered usps amazon contract opened case voiced concern see result past saturday pet food delivered leasing office closed got work i’d selected “leave front door” order avoid issue course got home package go purchase another food pet hold office opened monday considering i’d already assured wouldn’t happen pretty upset tied phone tried use customer service chat absolutely useless told “i apologize inconvenience i’ll pas along feedback” that’s fine point it’s inconvenience point paying year delivery service still drive somewhere load package carry flight stair route wanted take i’d save go store see reason chose amazon due odd hour work fact suffer back neck issue advised carrying heavy item decided call man spoke couldn’t seem understand upset asked speak supervisor left hold minute told didn’t time talk right would try help repeated concern told didn’t understand wouldn’t help put hold minute later male supervisor picked said understood concern presented option said could file request amazon deliver rather usps asked i’d written letter usps asking deliver mypackages front door i’m sorry select “deliver front door” provide address tell want package delivered front door regardless reasoning behind isn’t i’m paying told amazon responsible making sure package arrive day they’re delivered isn’t responsibility explained yes pay usps behalf amazon indeed responsible point told felt like minute arguing hassle entitled sort compensation i’ve paying prime membership still essentially deliver package purchase extra pet food it’s delivered wrong place can’t get day due work schedule said couldn’t refund membership since annual subscription explained needed find way considering paying service wasn’t getting suggested instead get refund item i’ve ordered retrieve myselfhe put hold said could give dollar towards membership worst experience i’ve ever researching place order pet food wish support company doesn’t deliver exceptional customer service manager cannot make time speak unhappy customer due issue caused company employed amazon you’ve lost loyal customer soon find alternative certainly take business elsewhere make sure inform others avoid hassle,0.009436293415671567,0.9905637065843285,0.40044868199663486,0.2,0.8753715896914911,87.5371589691491,High Trust
