Matt Weavil,/users/5db6e02170a20de5f5ce1b7c,US,14.0,2019-10-28 12:45:00+00:00,5.0,1000+ Orders In Three Countries,"I've been a Prime member for longer than I can remember and while I've definitely had issues with orders through amazon, they always solve them promptly. While their system isn't perfect, of the 1000+ orders in 3 different countries I have made through them, I've maybe had 20 issues with orders in total and almost all of those were shipping related. Amazon is THE go-to retailer.",2019-10-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,28.0,381,66,31,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive prime member longer remember ive definitely issue order amazon always solve promptly system isnt perfect order different country made ive maybe issue order total almost shipping related amazon goto retailer,0.03842492844167691,0.9615750715583231,0.03701626472237801,1.0,1.9881907887236372,198.81907887236372,High Trust
