Zach,/users/5db615e97cbf6e4122625be9,US,1.0,2019-10-27 22:10:52+00:00,1.0,They locked my & themselves out of my account,"I ordered a laptop and then about seven hours later received an email saying that Amazon thought that my purchase was fruad and my account hacked. It also said they locked down my account, disable my password, and cancelled any pending orders. They did this without asking me or any sort of verification that I actually made the purchase. I log onto my account and saw that my order was removed from my order history and buy-it-again history as well as my new mailing address removed from my account and money had been refounded to my account. I called customer support trying to make sure that my laptop would still arrive when I needed it by and they said that an account specialist would call me with in 24 hours. Instead,  I recieved an emailed that was verbatim the first email. At this point because I needed the laptop by a specific time I decided to log on and order it again and move on. Instead my password was denied so I tried reseting it and was denied again. I called customer service again about both my laptop and my loss of access. They said that once they cancel an order I would need to re-order the item my self and that that they would call me in an hour to help me get access to my account again. One hour later they are helping me regain acess to my account but each one time password (OTP) THEY send ME keeps getting denied so they transfer me from customer service to account services/verification. As I am beimg helped, we are disconnected so I re-call them. This time however they no longer have access to my account because the number of OTP attempts, which THEY were sending ME, was exceeded so both themselves and me are locked out of my account for 24 hours and I still have not been able to re order my laptop. They had someone decid that a puchase was invalid without any sort of verification or attempt to contact me and locked me and themselves out of my own account. What is the purpose of a customer service if they cannot access their customers accounts?",2019-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,27.0,1992,369,45,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered laptop seven hour later received email saying amazon thought purchase fruad account hacked also said locked account disable password cancelled pending order without asking sort verification actually made purchase log onto account saw order removed order history buyitagain history well new mailing address removed account money refounded account called customer support trying make sure laptop would still arrive needed said account specialist would call hour instead recieved emailed verbatim first email point needed laptop specific time decided log order move instead password denied tried reseting denied called customer service laptop loss access said cancel order would need reorder item self would call hour help get access account one hour later helping regain acess account one time password otp send keep getting denied transfer customer service account servicesverification beimg helped disconnected recall time however longer access account number otp attempt sending exceeded locked account hour still able order laptop someone decid puchase invalid without sort verification attempt contact locked account purpose customer service cannot access customer account,0.005227819794104002,0.994772180205896,0.20695457094784073,0.2,0.8387770042925161,83.87770042925162,High Trust
