Stephen,/users/5db2fda0a3642718d2c2b017,US,1.0,2019-10-25 13:50:26+00:00,1.0,The shame of Amazon,"I wonder if any other seller on Amazon have had their account hacked, had product shipped at a no cost? This happened with my company product (lots of product) was ordered from our online store at no cost and shipped to 2050 Los Felix Street, Unit171, Las Vegas, NV 89156, with our company name.We discovered this while it was happening and immediately contact the famed Amazon customer service. Sadly, they are much less than useless, they refused to help time after time after time again. Having escalated this up through various management levels their claim was they could do nothing to stop or redirect the shipments, this is an outright lie as the shipper is the only entity that can effect a change in the shipment according to UPS, who, unbelievable were less use than the incompetent customer service at Amazon.Just cursory steps in Amazons security could prevent this type of occurrence but the rush for profits, ( As if Jeff Bezos needs any more money) I believe prevented a true investigation into our complaint. Maybe it is an inside job as only three logins from our company can make moves like this and none were entered at our end. Again, the customer service refused to say who had logged on at our end.We have reported this crime to the local Las Vegas police and FBI. Personally I think this is a much deeper problem with Amazon which they are refusing to acknowledge.Companies like ours have put Amazon where they are today and to receive no support is galling in the extreme. If I could have given less stars than one, I would have done so.Has any other company had this experience?Stephen Buckley, Dakota Biotech",2019-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,25.0,1634,285,19,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wonder seller amazon account hacked product shipped cost happened company product lot product ordered online store cost shipped los felix street unit la vega nv company namewe discovered happening immediately contact famed amazon customer service sadly much less useless refused help time time time escalated various management level claim could nothing stop redirect shipment outright lie shipper entity effect change shipment according ups unbelievable less use incompetent customer service amazonjust cursory step amazon security could prevent type occurrence rush profit jeff bezos need money believe prevented true investigation complaint maybe inside job three logins company make move like none entered end customer service refused say logged endwe reported crime local la vega police fbi personally think much deeper problem amazon refusing acknowledgecompanies like put amazon today receive support galling extreme could given less star one would done sohas company experiencestephen buckley dakota biotech,0.009981878893770085,0.9900181211062299,0.15984296130117778,0.2,0.8269776528133505,82.69776528133505,High Trust
