Angie Mosley,/users/5db10994b76b0d89d32b70c3,US,1.0,2019-10-24 02:17:09+00:00,1.0,Unfortunately 0 star no option,"Unfortunately i had to give a star i paid $75 for a gift card woth cash i earned for a couple days work and get a message when tried to use ot that the code was already redeemed found out 3 other people in my small town had the same iss got the run around for days then get this email Amazon	Your Account	Amazon.comMessage From Customer ServiceHello,Greetings!I'm from Amazon Gift Card Escalation Team and I'll be happy to assist you in this case.I'm following up on your recent contact to our Customer Service Department.I've reviewed our previous conversation with you, and I'm sorry to know you weren't able to redeem the gift card. However, I'm very sorry that the complete information was not provided to you in the previous correspondence.I would have loved to add the gift card funds to your account. However on researching the details of the gift card, I found that it may have been used by someone other than the intended recipient. In this situation, I'm not able to resend the gift card or refund the order.This usually doesn’t happen and I apologize for the inconvenience.For reasons of security and privacy, we can not share information about the usage of the misredeemed gift cards. I hope you understand my limitations in this case.In this case, as the gift card was purchased from a store so, I'd have recommended contacting the store from where this gift card was purchased however as the gift card has been misredeemed and used so they might can't do anything in this case.Hence under these circumstances, if the gift card was purchased using a credit/debit card, we suggest that the purchaser contact their bank to see what options they may have available.This is one of those rare scenarios where we are unable to assist you to the best of our abilities. But I want you to know that we have every desire to do the best we can to always help our esteemed customers like you.We apologize for asking you to take these extra steps and for not being able to assist you any better in this case. But we at Amazon sincerely hope that this information helps you in receiving a reimbursement.In addition to our large selection, one of the benefits we try very hard to offer our customers is convenience.On a personal note, I appreciate your patience, cooperation and understanding in this matter.​I understand that my reply may not be helpful but I hope you'll understand my limitations. Your patronage is highly appreciated.We look forward to a warm and fruitful association.We'd appreciate your feedback. Please use the buttons below to vote about your experience today.Best regards,AbhishekAmazon.comThank you for your inquiry. Did I solve your problem?Yes NoYour feedback is helping us build Earth's Most Customer-Centric Company.Are u kidding me? No one wants to give my money back even tho they show ot wasnt the intended person. I will never order from them again.",2019-10-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,24.0,2881,493,30,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,unfortunately give star paid gift card woth cash earned couple day work get message tried use ot code already redeemed found people small town iss got run around day get email amazon account amazoncommessage customer servicehellogreetingsim amazon gift card escalation team ill happy assist caseim following recent contact customer service departmentive reviewed previous conversation im sorry know werent able redeem gift card however im sorry complete information provided previous correspondencei would loved add gift card fund account however researching detail gift card found may used someone intended recipient situation im able resend gift card refund orderthis usually doesn’t happen apologize inconveniencefor reason security privacy share information usage misredeemed gift card hope understand limitation casein case gift card purchased store id recommended contacting store gift card purchased however gift card misredeemed used might cant anything casehence circumstance gift card purchased using creditdebit card suggest purchaser contact bank see option may availablethis one rare scenario unable assist best ability want know every desire best always help esteemed customer like youwe apologize asking take extra step able assist better case amazon sincerely hope information help receiving reimbursementin addition large selection one benefit try hard offer customer convenienceon personal note appreciate patience cooperation understanding matter​i understand reply may helpful hope youll understand limitation patronage highly appreciatedwe look forward warm fruitful associationwed appreciate feedback please use button vote experience todaybest regardsabhishekamazoncomthank inquiry solve problemyes noyour feedback helping u build earth customercentric companyare u kidding one want give money back even tho show ot wasnt intended person never order,0.0418654710821357,0.9581345289178643,0.2765002804262479,0.2,0.8343673205441817,83.43673205441817,High Trust
