KM,/users/5daf4b655827834e0bf7a538,CR,2.0,2019-10-22 18:34:01+00:00,1.0,Absolute frustration!,"I was writing to a CS agent from the leadership team and she just disconnected the chat. I was writing about the frustration, absolute frustration that the customer service department is. It is incredible I had to go through all this to get the refund that the customer service department promised. The agents don't read, don't know the policies and don't dig into the cases. I followed the CS agents indications step by step and I got endless hours of frustration, being asked the same questions over and over and over again. Had to take insinuations that I was presenting fake receipts and questioning about the format and content of a government legal authorized receipt. I'm not a cheater, I am a customer. A many years customer and I got a kicked this time, from Amazon, its policies and its customer service department. Not customer centric, more like Amazon own benefit centric. Having writing proof to support that I followed the customer service department indications step by step barely worked to get my promised refund. I'm not a liar, I'm not a cheater, this is not a gift Amazon is giving me or an exception. This is what is fare, to stand behind what your agents say and honor your customers.After all these years being a loyal customer, I'm left with a sour taste and a spit on my face.",2019-10-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,22.0,1302,230,21,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,writing c agent leadership team disconnected chat writing frustration absolute frustration customer service department incredible go get refund customer service department promised agent dont read dont know policy dont dig case followed c agent indication step step got endless hour frustration asked question take insinuation presenting fake receipt questioning format content government legal authorized receipt im cheater customer many year customer got kicked time amazon policy customer service department customer centric like amazon benefit centric writing proof support followed customer service department indication step step barely worked get promised refund im liar im cheater gift amazon giving exception fare stand behind agent say honor customersafter year loyal customer im left sour taste spit face,0.022392850380025385,0.9776071496199746,0.12899607403252944,0.2,0.8146027896164932,81.46027896164932,High Trust
