l ke,/users/5d58682e08fa0e5f71a98f54,US,14.0,2019-10-20 06:21:25+00:00,1.0,Boycott Amazon.com this holiday season! 2019,"0 stars-Google The Guardian for Amazon.com Boycott. Google ""who owns full beauty brands?"" to see that WomanWithin, Jessica London, Roamans, etc. have gone out of business, in debt, been bought, no wonder we're being robbed!  ""Today FullBeauty — which owns the brands Woman Within, Roaman's, Jessica London, Swimsuitsforall, King Size, ellos and Brylane Home — is saddled with debt from its buyout, with leverage levels sitting at nine times earnings, Moody's noted in March.Nov 9, 2018"".  Amazon.com certainly is doing their part to keep the secret, no wonder we're not getting our orders from WW!  Stop ordering, they're just taking our money for their debt! These big companies should be allowing ALL reviews to monitor the problems- WW deleted all negative but honest reviews. See what happened?  Amazon.com next?  With all the lawsuits regarding their so-called ""2 day delivery"" scam, never say never. Sellers suffer as well.  Previously-Yet another review warning the customers has been taken down from A.com, now I find out Womanwithin.com does the same thing-NO honest reviews for THEIR customers!  I put the Womanwithin.com review on their A.com site.  How many millions do these companies pay to rip their customers off by agreeing between each other to remove negative/helpful reviews?  See below, enough said.  Thank you for submitting a customer review on Amazon. After carefully reviewing your submission, your review could not be posted to the website. While we appreciate your time and comments, reviews must adhere to the following guidelines:(trustpilot doesn't allow links to bad companies, thanks again!)    from jane on October 15, 2019  Item takes WEEKS to arrive- should note so when we order. Items take WEEKS to arrive- should note so when we order.I'm still waiting on my coat. I have waited for 6-7 years to order this particular coat as they are always out of stock. This year when I actually ordered it, 10/4/19, it made no mention of being out of stock, no longer available, etc. I read the ""terms & conditions"", ""FAQs"" so WW clearly is aware of the problems but won't let US, the customer, actually know the status. I had to call customer service, they were polite to check on it & then told me it will take at LEAST another week. To date, 10/19/19, when coat was promised to be here AGAIN, it is not.  I stopped using Amazon.com for these same types of problems. A.com KNOWS you won't get your item in the self-proclaimed 2 day delivery service, if you ever get it at all, yet does not care as they are rolling in billions of dollars at our expense. I was especially sad to see Woman Within join these ranks since I avoid A.com like the plague & ordered directly from WW. I may order again or might not, but just make sure you only order items on sale so it will be worth the years/months/weeks to get, if at all. Colorado is not the snowy state of years gone by with global warming only giving us a few months of snow vs. the 9 months a year, the used-to-be norm of years gone by. I was so hoping to wear this coat in the snow. Now it will get here when the temp's in the 90's again. Oh, well! Maybe next year! P.S. Don't move to Colorado, it's has hot as Texas now-a-days.l K on Oct 12, 2019",2019-10-20 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,20.0,3224,563,44,6,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,starsgoogle guardian amazoncom boycott google owns full beauty brand see womanwithin jessica london roamans etc gone business debt bought wonder robbed today fullbeauty — owns brand woman within roamans jessica london swimsuitsforall king size ellos brylane home — saddled debt buyout leverage level sitting nine time earnings moody noted marchnov amazoncom certainly part keep secret wonder getting order ww stop ordering theyre taking money debt big company allowing review monitor problem ww deleted negative honest review see happened amazoncom next lawsuit r