Porsche,/users/5da93b8788d49a3a9ef58ef9,US,1.0,2019-10-18 04:11:53+00:00,1.0,They remove reviews that cost them money,"I would like to love this company; However, the fact that they remove customer reviews when the review is within the guidelines for their own illegitimate reasons makes it impossible! I have went back and forth with this company in regards to this issue and it is out of control at this point. I make purchases and I will review the product based on my experience. Amazon has approved then deleted my reviews. They have restricted my access to review on an old account and when I ask about the specific reason for the deletion of the reviews, their review team does not respond. They are removing negative reviews because they know that these reviews on certain products will cost them money. Example: I purchased my Phleb exam review book 4th addition (Hard copy) but was using the Phleb essentials 6th addition instructional book in class & had the pdf 6th edition exam review (just needed a physical copy) and the 4th & 6th editions are the exact same, just a new cover. So I put this in my review & they deleted it. When I addressed that, I still never got a response. I like the fact that I can get almost anything from this online store. But their review team customer service makes you want to not purchase from them at all. I will be placing this review everywhere I can because something needs to be done about this.",2019-10-18 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,18.0,1325,241,40,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,would like love company however fact remove customer review review within guideline illegitimate reason make impossible went back forth company regard issue control point make purchase review product based experience amazon approved deleted review restricted access review old account ask specific reason deletion review review team respond removing negative review know review certain product cost money example purchased phleb exam review book th addition hard copy using phl