Terry O Callaghan,/users/544297e9000064000190e8db,IE,64.0,2019-10-17 13:50:42+00:00,1.0,Every time I order from Amazon.com my…,"Every time I order from Amazon.com my items are delayed.  Despite tracked items tracking always stops halfway through the delivery process, and it's impossible to know where exactly your items are. Contacting them via chat and depending on the knowledge level of the customer service person, this can be either good or terrible, as most don't seem to care one bit where your items are.I will not be using them again as I feel they are very unreliable.  The complaint procedure is also pitiful, and nothing is ever made of it.",2019-10-17 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,17.0,525,91,38,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,every time order amazoncom item delayed despite tracked item tracking always stop halfway delivery process impossible know exactly item contacting via chat depending knowledge level customer service person either good terrible dont seem care one bit item arei using feel unreliable complaint procedure also pitiful nothing ever made,0.050151388163783284,0.9498486118362167,0.05103757711721817,0.2,0.785131821341552,78.5131821341552,High Trust
