Reid O'Neal,/users/5da845a021b2e226cde2cf92,US,1.0,2019-10-17 10:50:45+00:00,1.0,This is either a scam or ran by a bunch of ret44rds,"So I was trying to spend some money on amazon, the biggest online retailer. I am from the US. I make an account, add my card and place my order. My account was immediately locked and I received an email to send them my bank statement for the card used, claiming that someone will reply and fix it within 48 hours.I send my bank statement, wait 48 hours, nothing happens. Only one week later they reinstated my account.I try to place my order again using the same card, 20 minutes later my account gets locked again, asking for the SAME BANK STATEMENT.I send it to them again and this time it takes almost 2 weeks for them to reopen.I wait a couple of days since I no longer needed the product and placed another order this morning for something else. Low and behold my account get locked for the 3rd TIME shortly after, and guess what, THEY ARE ASKING FOR THE SAME STATEMENT, they cannot verify that the card belongs to me. LMFAO1. New customers cannot order like from any other online store. They will lock you out and ask you for a bank statement. This is never mentioned anywhere when you sign up.2. I wasted a whole month of my life waiting for them to read and verify the same statement that I sent 3 times over.3. They are either scammers or ran by total ret44rds. Asking for the same thing 3 times in a row, lock account, get statement, read statement, unlock account 1 week later not 48 hours like they claim, then lock account again, rinse and repeat. 4. How did they get so big? They clearly do not want your money and I read on here that they have massive problems with delivering also.5. This site is one bad joke.",2019-10-17 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,17.0,1626,304,51,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,trying spend money amazon biggest online retailer u make account add card place order account immediately locked received email send bank statement card used claiming someone reply fix within hoursi send bank statement wait hour nothing happens one week later reinstated accounti try place order using card minute later account get locked asking bank statementi send time take almost week reopeni wait couple day since longer needed product placed another order morning something else low behold account get locked rd time shortly guess asking statement cannot verify card belongs lmfao new customer cannot order like online store lock ask bank statement never mentioned anywhere sign wasted whole month life waiting read verify statement sent time either scammer ran total retrds asking thing time row lock account get statement read statement unlock account week later hour like claim lock account rinse repeat get big clearly want money read massive problem delivering also site one bad joke,0.005986429495669547,0.9940135705043305,0.17049915872125632,0.2,0.8311066169964164,83.11066169964164,High Trust
deana staton,/users/5da828429315cc2545246692,US,2.0,2019-10-17 09:04:11+00:00,5.0,Would love to give 10 stars if I could,"Would love to give 10 stars if I could!  Life is so much easier since I started ordering my groceries, household items, gardening items, ...Well, just about everything!!Both my husband and I are disabled and for items to be brought right to our door is a blessing for us. Sometimes and item might be damaged or not exactly what I wanted but never have I had a problem with returning anything. I have noticed a lot of ppl giving a bad review for Amazon but when I read what they wrote, the problem truly wasn't Amazon's fault. Seems their complaints were about a seller or the delivery guy. Nothing is perfect but for us, Amazon comes close!My suggestion is before you purchase anything from Amazon or any other company. READ the entire thing and know in advance what the return policy is for that company. It's not rocket science! Just do a little research first.",2019-10-17 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,17.0,863,155,38,9,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,would love give star could life much easier since started ordering grocery household item gardening item well everythingboth husband disabled item brought right door blessing u sometimes item might damaged exactly wanted never problem returning anything noticed lot ppl giving bad review amazon read wrote problem truly wasnt amazon fault seems complaint seller delivery guy nothing perfect u amazon come closemy suggestion purchase anything amazon company read entire thing know advance return policy company rocket science little research first,0.9721228929745934,0.027877107025406578,0.08693213684800898,1.0,1.531324980882305,153.1324980882305,High Trust
