James,/users/5b5b56a84de5666d347684e3,GB,54.0,2019-10-15 16:20:18+00:00,2.0,policy change is appalling,"Was a very good site until the recent 18+ verification policy was bought in and now if you order anything that is 18+ you will have to wait in all day to receive your package so you can provide id( identification for a parcel, have you lost your minds?! ) completely defeats the object of having prime as parcels are delayed due to this issue .I will not be buying another 18+ item from amazon and will be reducing my usage of it due to this issue . There is no need to provide Identification as I have ordered the item from my account which I pay for myself , and the package is addressed to me no one else therefore it is my responsibility not Amazon’s .... what a shamblesAlso a side note . Amazons customer service is appalling the staff are not helpful and quite frankly don’t care and the lack of English speaking staff just says it all . The amazon system is down and now and I am unable to even contact amazon about my account ..... what is going on !!!!!!",2019-10-15 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,15.0,964,186,26,4,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,good site recent verification policy bought order anything wait day receive package provide id identification parcel lost mind completely defeat object prime parcel delayed due issue buying another item amazon reducing usage due issue need provide identification ordered item account pay package addressed one else therefore responsibility amazon’s shamblesalso side note amazon customer service appalling staff helpful quite frankly don’t care lack english speaking staff say amazon system unable even contact amazon account going,0.9997168383137057,0.0002831616862942754,0.10431856421761077,0.4,0.6210052936866693,62.10052936866693,Medium Trust
