Ste Cm,/users/5d6e508da9494ab0d92f2453,GB,4.0,2019-10-12 10:23:43+00:00,1.0,2 weeks of delivery hell!!,"2 weeks of delivery hell!!I have had several orders that have gone missing or got damaged. Over the last 2 weeks we have noticed a pattern developing. If the package is sent by a third party (DPD, YODEL, XPD, MY HERMES EVEN ROYAL MAIL!!!) it arrives on time/early. If its being delivered by amazon logistics, it gets lost being passed between depots claiming its at the wrong depot!I have had every excuse from my address is wrong to its been deactivated (customer service won't explain that one to me) I get reassured every day the parcel is coming and they've fixed the issue but 2 weeks on and it's the same thingCustomer service is horrible, rude and incompetent, based nowhere near the UK and therefore have no idea what they are talking about. They tried saying the driver was parked outside my property when he said we weren't in and then later confirmed he was over 20minutes away by car!! Definitely not parking distance for delivery.They are not signed up to an ombudsman service but yet deflect complaints to the ombudsman service to which they have no obligation to act upon their decision. When you raise a complaint its filed as an internal matter as such you never get a resolution and the ntry and fob off their failure to deliver with a token monetary compensation of a 10 pound voucher..... Which if you use you have to complain about because the item doesn't arrive and as such the vicious cycle continues.Amazon themselves can not deliver. It would be quicker ordering off wish/joom",2019-10-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,12.0,1502,263,26,5,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,week delivery helli several order gone missing got damaged last week noticed pattern developing package sent third party dpd yodel xpd hermes even royal mail arrives timeearly delivered amazon logistics get lost passed depot claiming wrong depoti every excuse address wrong deactivated customer service wont explain one get reassured every day parcel coming theyve fixed issue week thingcustomer service horrible rude incompetent based nowhere near uk therefore idea talking tried saying driver parked outside property said werent later confirmed minute away car definitely parking distance deliverythey signed ombudsman service yet deflect complaint ombudsman service obligation act upon decision raise complaint filed internal matter never get resolution ntry fob failure deliver token monetary compensation pound voucher use complain item doesnt arrive vicious cycle continuesamazon deliver would quicker ordering wishjoom,0.9996167468853707,0.00038325311462927836,0.14750420639371845,0.2,0.3296924678360583,32.96924678360583,Low Trust
