Tiny Tears,/users/5a524e720000ff000afc1146,GB,14.0,2019-10-09 11:02:09+00:00,1.0,"Truly awful, makes my blood boil","Good grief, this company deserve no stars.  Service has gone right down the pan.Even if you purchase an item saying Prime delivery from Amazon, it still doesn't turn up.  95% of items either don't turn up, or arrive late.  Even if it says Prime, Amazon are now contracting out most of the items now to private sellers, who are a nightmare to deal with and who don't send items and then don't refund them.  Amazon takes the money from your account and then private seller does not send you the item.  You have to go through the rigmarole of contacting the seller, and then Amazon trying to get your money back, often taking weeks.  Amazon do not care how they treat their customers.Amazon have now removed the option for you to email them if there's a problem with delivery or an item hasn't turned up.  Instead it's the imbeciles on live chat who have one shared brain cell between them who cannot seem to understand basic complaints about any items not arriving and who just give you BS.Delivery drivers are unprofessional and rude, often just chucking the item in through an open front door or window, damaging it, or putting it in an inappropriate place like a dustbin.  This is despite safe place instructions given on account which are ignored.I keep asking what I am paying a rip off price for Prime for because there are no special offers anymore and there's certainly no next day delivery anymore.  And saying there is a music account that comes with Prime - there's not, it's an extra subscription fee.Awful",2019-10-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,9.0,1516,267,32,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,good grief company deserve star service gone right paneven purchase item saying prime delivery amazon still doesnt turn item either dont turn arrive late even say prime amazon contracting item private seller nightmare deal dont send item dont refund amazon take money account private seller send item go rigmarole contacting seller amazon trying get money back often taking week amazon care treat customersamazon removed option email there problem delivery item hasnt turned instead imbecile live chat one shared brain cell cannot seem understand basic complaint item arriving give bsdelivery driver unprofessional rude often chucking item open front door window damaging putting inappropriate place like dustbin despite safe place instruction given account ignoredi keep asking paying rip price prime special offer anymore there certainly next day delivery anymore saying music account come prime there extra subscription feeawful,0.007406453740554779,0.9925935462594452,0.14974761637689288,0.2,0.8262462964051012,82.62462964051012,High Trust
