Alonzo Johnston,/users/5d99d06b9655772b3cfe4286,RO,1.0,2019-10-06 11:35:48+00:00,1.0,This site has turned into one big scam,"This site has turned into one big scam. I wanted to send a prime gift for 3 months, worth ~40 bucks to one of my nephews so he can register an account and buy some games from them. I am a prime member myself and been shopping with amazon for many years.I paid for his prime gift from my account and used his email address for delivery. It worked instantly, got charged and the prime gift was delivered to his email. I called him and told him to start an account and enjoy his gift. He did just that and converted the prime gift to gift card balance so he can shop around. That is an option that THEY OFFER.Immediately after placing his order for some games with the balance his account was locked and funds confiscated, receiving this email from amazon:""address-verification-digi@xxxxxxxxxx Fri, Oct 4, 9:40 PM (2 days ago) to meHello,We have closed your account and canceled all outstanding orders.We took these actions because either the Amazon Gift Card or the Amazon Gift Card balance you are using is in violation of our Terms and Conditions. We cannot reissue the gift card or reimburse you for these funds. For further details, we suggest that you contact the party who sold or gave you the gift card.Please note that buying Amazon.com gift cards by unauthorized third parties, and sold or transfer-for-value of Amazon.com gift cards is a violation of our terms.You can find more information on the Amazon.com. Help page:xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxIf you believe we took this action in error, please send the gift card purchase receipt, or other documentation such as an email from the sender, to back up all the Amazon Gift Cards used to place the order D01-6420113-2355430 to our secure fax line.Make sure that you write your name, phone number, and Amazon account email address on the document. If you did not buy the gift card, we request you to get in touch with the original purchaser to provide the gift card receipt or proof of purchase.""Great job amazon! Why do you even offer this if you have no intention of following thru? Never buy gifts from amazon for anyone or you might face issues and get your giftee thinking your word is worthless in the process.Needless to say that you've lost me as a customer. Good job",2019-10-06 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,6.0,2223,390,38,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,site turned one big scam wanted send prime gift month worth buck one nephew register account buy game prime member shopping amazon many yearsi paid prime gift account used email address delivery worked instantly got charged prime gift delivered email called told start account enjoy gift converted prime gift gift card balance shop around option offerimmediately placing order game balance account locked fund confiscated receiving email amazonaddressverificationdigixxxxxxxxxx fri oct pm day ago mehellowe closed account canceled outstanding orderswe took action either amazon gift card amazon gift card balance using violation term condition cannot reissue gift card reimburse fund detail suggest contact party sold gave gift cardplease note buying amazoncom gift card unauthorized third party sold transferforvalue amazoncom gift card violation termsyou find information amazoncom help pagexxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxif believe took action error please send gift card purchase receipt documentation email sender back amazon gift card used place order secure fax linemake sure write name phone number amazon account email address document buy gift card request get touch original purchaser provide gift card receipt proof purchasegreat job amazon even offer intention following thru never buy gift amazon anyone might face issue get giftee thinking word worthless processneedless say youve lost customer good job,0.04744019329739124,0.9525598067026088,0.21873247335950646,0.2,0.8200263980232056,82.00263980232056,High Trust
