Ellie Rhodes,/users/57d8edc70000ff000a44335a,US,25.0,2019-09-28 14:43:10+00:00,1.0,One time passcodes aren’t working,"I don’t know what has happened to Amazon recently. I have both the buyers account and a sellers account and I have been locked out of both this week even though I have had them for a decades. Each time I have to use a one time pass code to get into my account but the passcode is either never show up or when they do show up they are expired or don’t work. This is happened for multiple accounts, multiple email addresses, multiple browsers, multiple devices, and multiple networks. One time pass codes from other companies work just fine. Amazon has admitted they are having some sort of problem with this. They give Pat little answers like clear your history etcetera but don’t seem to be fixing the actual problem. I need to just shop at Walmart.",2019-09-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,28.0,749,138,33,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,don’t know happened amazon recently buyer account seller account locked week even though decade time use one time pas code get account passcode either never show show expired don’t work happened multiple account multiple email address multiple browser multiple device multiple network one time pas code company work fine amazon admitted sort problem give pat little answer like clear history etcetera don’t seem fixing actual problem need shop walmart,0.020776015750263065,0.9792239842497369,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.805091521008772,80.5091521008772,High Trust
