Miguel Ángel Martínez Martín,/users/595438b00000ff000aa954c4,ES,5.0,2019-10-02 10:55:34+00:00,1.0,How to play with the patience (and health) of the user,"It has already been mentioned ""in extenso"" in the opinions of other Trustpilot users, but it should be remembered that, with exceptions (that there are any and I can attest to this), the customer service of the Seattle giant is contrary to all principles of digital marketing. His only obsession seems to be the income statement - which I do not say is not important - bypassing the users' experience and, therefore, their feelings, which oscillate between stupor and frustration. When one complains, v.gr, about the ineptitude of the logistics companies they work with (another topic to talk long and hard), they get to the lie (deception from A to Z) to justify themselves and avoid their responsibility and, sometimes, to threaten you - in a little subtle way - with ""investigations"" about the activity of your account (why do you use the option of returning the product on certain occasions ... will it be, perhaps, because they offer it unconditionally, publicizing it with hype and saucer? Well, I don't know that they have a bad conscience for destroying retail trade, the main support of Spanish GDP). What is notorious is that there is no difference in the time of arrival of an order, whether or not you subscribed to its PRIME program, on the contrary; I have never had more problems than when I paid that fee. Already, the drop that fills the glass, is when they send you something totally different from what you have asked for. From there begins an odyssey of pseudo-bureaucratic nonsense, total omission of help to the client (who is helpless and angry) and even willing treatment. It is you, the victim of HIS error, who has to ""chase"" them by land, sea, air, email, telephone and / or Twitter, so that they end up giving you a solution that is always late, bad and when you have already promised yourself, a thousand times, it is worth paying a few euros more and buying the neighbor of a lifetime, to trust your mental balance to a transnational with a lot of paraphernalia and, apparently, few scruples (my late grandfather said that ""cheap is expensive"" ). This, which they do to a person with a disability and with a very low tolerance for stress, can extrapolate it for someone with iron health. They will tell me what they get. Sometimes, too many, we are snobs who pretend to be on the crest of the technological wave when, in fact, they have put you there based on advertising hoaxes and creating you ""needs"" that are not such. Sometimes. For everything else, the complaint to a court of contentious-administrative. Don't waste your time with the customer service offices.",2019-09-27 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,10.0,2.0,2597,451,54,11,5.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,already mentioned extenso opinion trustpilot user remembered exception attest customer service seattle giant contrary principle digital marketing obsession seems income statement say important bypassing user experience therefore feeling oscillate stupor frustration one complains vgr ineptitude logistics company work another topic talk long hard get lie deception z justify avoid responsibility sometimes threaten little subtle way investigation activity account use option returning product certain occasion perhaps offer unconditionally publicizing hype saucer well dont know bad conscience destroying retail trade main support spanish gdp notorious difference time arrival order whether subscribed prime program contrary never problem paid fee already drop fill glass send something totally different asked begin odyssey pseudobureaucratic nonsense total omission help client helpless angry even willing treatment victim error chase land sea air email telephone twitter end giving solution always late bad already promised thousand time worth paying euro buying neighbor lifetime trust mental balance transnational lot paraphernalia apparently scruple late grandfather said cheap expensive person disability low tolerance stress extrapolate someone iron health tell get sometimes many snob pretend crest technological wave fact put based advertising hoax creating need sometimes everything else complaint court contentiousadministrative dont waste time customer service office,0.005504065649831835,0.9944959343501681,0.25294447560291644,0.2,0.8478368622956673,84.78368622956674,High Trust
