Kimber M,/users/5a1b6aab0000ff000ae7fff1,US,2.0,2019-09-26 13:48:48+00:00,1.0,Completely disappointed in Prime delivery,"We have been a long time Amazon (Prime) customers. Never having any issues with promised dates or delivery. Since Amazon has gone to their own delivery system and no longer using USPS we have had nothing but issue after issue. The drivers don’t follow instructions where to leave the packages or to even simply ring a doorbell to notify the home something or someone is at the door so we can retrieve the package before a porch pirate comes.Now most importantly This is the 2nd time this month that we have placed a prime order and it will state that it has arrived at a facility 1 1/2 hrs away from us,  then off to the other facility 45-50 minutes from our home but delayed, yet it’s NEVER DELIVERED!We have been calling since Monday the day it was due to be delivered and was told no worries it will be delivered by 8 p.m. Tuesday... Nothing delivered.. called Tuesday was told again  you’ll receive it tomorrow it keeps being scanned so it’s just delayed. Called again yesterday and had nothing but a run around rep after rep. Even called the corporate office and it has gone nowhere. After pushing the issue they should be able to contact their own facility and speak to a supervisor to try to have package located and see why it’s not getting loaded on the truck to be delivered, The logistics rep stated that we would have a call last evening within 2 hrs from the facility that the package is in. To no surprise we never received a call back from that facility. Now as anyone would understand we know it’s not the reps fault on the other end of the phone that the package is sitting lost in one of Amazons own facilities, but when it’s been 4 days of no answer and no package with our items it is frustrating to know they cannot call or email that facility to get an answer to get back to the customer. Even more frustrating that they claim they can’t reach someone in that facility to physically go look for a missing package. Their answer is we’ll refund you and you can reorder your items. That’s fine on one of our items but what about the others that are already sold out that we already waited over a month in a half to be restocked on the site? I ever In a million years would have given Amazon a 1 star rating but at this point I feel a 1 is being beyond generous!! If we wanted a refund instead of the item... then why would we order the item in the first place? All we ask is the items you packaged all together gets found and delivered ..... yet, Amazon can’t do that simple task that all other postal carriers are able too. Just we’re sorry.. do you want that refund??? Amazon has gone down hill quickly. Beware when ordering it’s a crapshoot if you’ll receive your item by the expected date if ever at all!!!!",2019-09-26 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,26.0,2730,512,41,5,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,long time amazon prime customer never issue promised date delivery since amazon gone delivery system longer using usps nothing issue issue driver don’t follow instruction leave package even simply ring doorbell notify home something someone door retrieve package porch pirate comesnow importantly nd time month placed prime order state arrived facility hr away u facility minute home delayed yet it’s never deliveredwe calling since monday day due delivered told worry delivered pm tuesday nothing delivered called tuesday told you’ll receive tomorrow keep scanned it’s delayed called yesterday nothing run around rep rep even called corporate office gone nowhere pushing issue able contact facility speak supervisor try package located see it’s getting loaded truck delivered logistics rep stated would call last evening within hr facility package surprise never received call back facility anyone would understand know it’s rep fault end phone package sitting lost one amazon facility it’s day answer package item frustrating know cannot call email facility get answer get back customer even frustrating claim can’t reach someone facility physically go look missing package answer we’ll refund reorder item that’s fine one item others already sold already waited month half restocked site ever million year would given amazon star rating point feel beyond generous wanted refund instead item would order item first place ask item packaged together get found delivered yet amazon can’t simple task postal carrier able we’re sorry want refund amazon gone hill quickly beware ordering it’s crapshoot you’ll receive item expected date ever,0.9977858563643576,0.0022141436356424293,0.2871564778463264,0.2,0.3585383673870865,35.85383673870865,Low Trust
