Alissa Fisher,/users/5d8b6d0e4f2e2960ab8de4f9,US,1.0,2019-09-25 13:35:18+00:00,2.0,Only several hours and price changed.,"While I've had great experiences with Amazon.com previously. I recently had a purchase, that within hours the price dropped by $10. When I contacted customer service they stated they do not do a post-purchase price refund.I found this to be surprising, considering that they seem to be abreast at staying the most competitive as well as giving the best customer service. This area is lacking and may be something they should reconsider in the future. While this was only a $10 purchase, it gives me pause before larger purchases in the future; considering that there could be a change in price that they will not work around. Most every other store I've shopped with will make allowances for this type of change. I find this to be considerly lacking for such a large and profitable company",2019-09-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,25.0,789,136,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive great experience amazoncom previously recently purchase within hour price dropped contacted customer service stated postpurchase price refundi found surprising considering seem abreast staying competitive well giving best customer service area lacking may something reconsider future purchase give pause larger purchase future considering could change price work around every store ive shopped make allowance type change find considerly lacking large profitable company,0.00701618165343203,0.992983818346568,0.07627593942793046,0.4,1.11174709705887,111.17470970588701,High Trust
