Jessica,/users/5a3163290000ff000af098fc,US,2.0,2019-09-25 05:20:17+00:00,1.0,Amazon support is getting worse,"Amazon support is getting worse. They can't really help with the issue and are robotic with answers. I pay for prime, yet there's many times it doesn't come in at the time that is expected and Amazon says it's guaranteed for delivery. In the end, they just ask you to wait another 48 hours. That's honestly not a solution to getting the items I ordered in the timeframe that was promised. There are also other possible options to get it earlier, like repurchase with faster shipping or other solutions. Many times, I order on Amazon for that guaranteed delivery. However, when I find out the shipping us delayed, it's almost always on the day it's supposed to arrive and at night - past an hour I'm able to go out and purchase at a store. There's multiple things wrong with doing business like this.",2019-09-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,25.0,799,144,31,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon support getting worse cant really help issue robotic answer pay prime yet there many time doesnt come time expected amazon say guaranteed delivery end ask wait another hour thats honestly solution getting item ordered timeframe promised also possible option get earlier like repurchase faster shipping solution many time order amazon guaranteed delivery however find shipping u delayed almost always day supposed arrive night past hour im able go purchase store there multiple thing wrong business like,0.005841444668747896,0.9941585553312521,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.8132318295444819,81.32318295444819,High Trust
