James Morris,/users/5a0b24c00000ff000ae26950,GB,5.0,2019-09-24 14:54:11+00:00,1.0,Amazon Going Downhill....,"Amazon, Amazon, Amazon....How you have gone downhill in the past few years. Amazon UK Specifically.Amazon seem to think that because they control such a large portion of the online retail market, that they can treat customers however they want and just ignore any and all complaints or resolve them by offering a month of Prime but not getting to the source of the issue.We have had a common issue with delivery drivers leaving our parcels in our reception area (We live in a block of flats) - One day we did not receive a parcel even though it said it was delivered. I contact Amazon, they say they are going to look into it - Perfect!They ""look into it"" and close down my account after my first claim, to which I now cant get a refund for the item. Whenever I try and contact Amazon, they send me to ""Account Specialists"" which also send me the same Copy + Pasted email over and over again about my account closure not being reverted and how they may not reply to future emails...They COMPLETELY ignore the part about me not receiving my £50 delivery.I have now had to reach out to my bank and explain the situation with Amazon and how this wasn't delivered but yet Amazon are refusing to do anything about it. Completely unacceptable customer service from one of the biggest retailers in the world. Keep this up and you wont be on top for long. (Not to mention, theres no Ombudsman that can even challenge Amazon as Amazon refuse to work with them!)",2019-09-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,24.0,1452,264,25,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon amazon amazonhow gone downhill past year amazon uk specificallyamazon seem think control large portion online retail market treat customer however want ignore complaint resolve offering month prime getting source issuewe common issue delivery driver leaving parcel reception area live block flat one day receive parcel even though said delivered contact amazon say going look perfectthey look close account first claim cant get refund item whenever try contact amazon send account specialist also send copy pasted email account closure reverted may reply future emailsthey completely ignore part receiving £ deliveryi reach bank explain situation amazon wasnt delivered yet amazon refusing anything completely unacceptable customer service one biggest retailer world keep wont top long mention there ombudsman even challenge amazon amazon refuse work,0.1605249028965295,0.8394750971034706,0.14806505888951205,0.2,0.7493505603296376,74.93505603296377,Medium Trust
