AMR,/users/5d89aace7c6eb15863856870,AE,1.0,2019-09-24 05:34:09+00:00,1.0,Worst customer experience,"Absolutely disgusting experience with customer service and carrier used by Amazon UK. The carrier was playing for a week emailing one day saying they tried to deliver and no one was there,Although no one has contacted my number or tried the concierge , then they tell me they are coming last Tuesday and on the same day the status of the order changes to returned as it was damaged and that my money will be refunded in 2 to 3 business days. Today i get in touch with the useless customer service and they tell me no refund has been processed yet because they are waiting for the return of the order which i have never received!!! Hey, AMAZON either make sure you deliver good service or refund people promptly when you dont",2019-09-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,24.0,724,133,25,3,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,absolutely disgusting experience customer service carrier used amazon uk carrier playing week emailing one day saying tried deliver one therealthough one contacted number tried concierge tell coming last tuesday day status order change returned damaged money refunded business day today get touch useless customer service tell refund processed yet waiting return order never received hey amazon either make sure deliver good service refund people promptly dont,0.5506199549706629,0.44938004502933715,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.5396086989027785,53.96086989027785,Medium Trust
Vhalkor TV,/users/5d895f3d22d2dc432a2b9181,MX,1.0,2019-09-24 00:11:49+00:00,1.0,Deplorable Delivery System,"I've Purchased products before without much trouble, But this new Amazon Logistics transport company refuses to deliver the product and the drivers won't even attempt to contact me. I've provided explicit delivery instructions, different contact numbers and even called customer service in advance to avoid delivery issues and STILL I have not received my product. Amazon.mx Amazon Logistics subpar compared to Fedex DHL etc. Do not use service until it is fixed. I've had to contact local authorities to file a theft charge since they refuse to give me what i Purchased.",2019-09-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,24.0,571,92,26,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive purchased product without much trouble new amazon logistics transport company refuse deliver product driver wont even attempt contact ive provided explicit delivery instruction different contact number even called customer service advance avoid delivery issue still received product amazonmx amazon logistics subpar compared fedex dhl etc use service fixed ive contact local authority file theft charge since refuse give purchased,0.016350124844567066,0.9836498751554329,0.051598429613011774,0.2,0.8021446235003188,80.21446235003188,High Trust
