Todd Dunham,/users/5d83ca0d68161034d5b5404a,US,2.0,2019-09-19 18:34:32+00:00,1.0,Amazon returns at kohls... DISASTER,"I have loved Kohls for years...I am writing this review to hopefully get some attention from corporate about one of the worst decisions I have ever seen made... good intentions but disastrous results.Regarding partnership with Kohls and Amazon and returns. You all...  (Amazon , Ups store and Kohls) need to fix the situation quick! I had our church admin assistant help me to make sure i wasn't missing something... she confirmed all i will explain ... I tried every option to avoid what i am about to describe.. I PERSONALLY  spoke with customer service at all three companies ... Amazon, Kohls and UPS STORE To confirm as well.I ordered several different things for an event ... some came late so we needed to return the items .. some were just the wrong thing... etc... normal return things.First attempt to return ... i went all the way to the back of the Kohl's store and the nice customer service lady started sorting boxes ... i asked what she was doing she said not everything can be returned here... i was kinda seeing the writing on the wall that this was not going to be convenient at all ... an hour later ... only one item could be returned and it had to be returned only there.  The very kind lady, who i actually felt very bad for due to the line up of people gave me some very incorrect information... so i called amazon right there and put them on speaker phone the lady was very surprized at what amazon said regarding the small percentage of items that can be returned at Kohl's for now...She literally said if this is only a small percentage we wont be able to deal with much more... SOMEONE SHOULD HAVE ANTICIPATED THAT RIGHT?To be clear... I am an Amazon Prime memberSo pack it all up take it to the office only to find amazon would not let the rest be picked up like normal... now there were ridiculous fees to have some items picked up ... so an hour later i now have a few more boxes that can be picked up at the office and the rest ... well off to the Ups Store i go...Only some of the items would let you preprint the labels and about half would not ( our highly competent admin assistant tried every way possible)  so when i arrive to the UPS store we had to figure that out also...I am tired just telling the story... literally had to invest several hours ... in this..Disaster!Fix it quick or you will loose far more than you stood to gain by this moveI would love a response to this Thanks",2019-09-19 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,19.0,2421,450,35,5,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,loved kohl yearsi writing review hopefully get attention corporate one worst decision ever seen made good intention disastrous resultsregarding partnership kohl amazon return amazon ups store kohl need fix situation quick church admin assistant help make sure wasnt missing something confirmed explain tried every option avoid describe personally spoke customer service three company amazon kohl ups store confirm welli ordered several different thing event came late needed return item wrong thing etc normal return thingsfirst attempt return went way back kohl store nice customer service lady started sorting box asked said everything returned kinda seeing writing wall going convenient hour later one item could returned returned kind lady actually felt bad due line people gave incorrect information called amazon right put speaker phone lady surprized amazon said regarding small percentage item returned kohl nowshe literally said small percentage wont able deal much someone anticipated rightto clear amazon prime memberso pack take office find amazon would let rest picked like normal ridiculous fee item picked hour later box picked office rest well ups store goonly item would let preprint label half would highly competent admin assistant tried every way possible arrive ups store figure alsoi tired telling story literally invest several hour thisdisasterfix quick loose far stood gain movei would love response thanks,0.22983357174712843,0.7701664282528715,0.2523836231071228,0.2,0.7355599387478604,73.55599387478604,Medium Trust
Elisha Williams,/users/5d83b8727449e033bf828306,US,2.0,2019-09-19 17:19:32+00:00,1.0,I would give it zero stars if that was…,"I would give it zero stars if that was possible! Amazon freaking sucks! I bought a Charger, first time had to be returned because it got broken in transit, so we had to order a new one! And the refund takes 5-7 business days and so we didn't get our product and we had to spend more money while we waited for our refund. They gave us ""store credit"" for the inconvenience neglecting to mention you have to spend a minimum of 50$ just to use 15 bucks of store credit. Then when the next time we ordered it they just never freaking showed up with it. It was suppose to be delivered before nine, said we were next on the dilevery route and then never freaking showed I waited all day. Then I call and they say that ""Oh if it shows up tomorrow then I don't have to pay"" IF??? Freaking IF??? It shows up!?? I need my laptop for work and they have yet to deliver a product that should have been delivered four days ago! Why do I even have Amazon prime if I can't even get the product that I have now paid three times for. And of course my refund won't come for 5-7 buinsess day! I just want my freaking laptop charger that I paid for not another refund or God forbid store credit!",2019-09-19 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,19.0,1173,231,39,9,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,would give zero star possible amazon freaking suck bought charger first time returned got broken transit order new one refund take business day didnt get product spend money waited refund gave u store credit inconvenience neglecting mention spend minimum use buck store credit next time ordered never freaking showed suppose delivered nine said next dilevery route never freaking showed waited day call say oh show tomorrow dont pay freaking show need laptop work yet deliver product delivered four day ago even amazon prime cant even get product paid three time course refund wont come buinsess day want freaking laptop charger paid another refund god forbid store credit,0.9980796585985922,0.0019203414014078435,0.12955692652832304,0.2,0.3268715560063685,32.68715560063685,Low Trust
