customer,/users/5bbcddab4de5666d347d73e9,US,4.0,2019-09-19 15:20:54+00:00,1.0,So I just realized when I ordered…,So I just realized when I ordered something today from amazon that I had a past order that I was charged for but never received.  Granted it was from April 2019 but life happens and I forgot about the order.  I contacted them today to let them know I never received my goods that I paid for and they said I am basically SOL.  So I wanted to cancel the order I just placed 5 minutes prior and was told it was already in the advanced shipping stages?  I just placed the order.  I am sorry but if Amazon finds it ok to keep your money when I have proof in tracking that the goods were never delivered then I no longer find the need to do business with them.  On top of it they can't cancel an order I just placed 5 minutes prior?  No thanks amazon you lost yourself a loyal customer.,2019-09-19 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,19.0,780,154,34,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,realized ordered something today amazon past order charged never received granted april life happens forgot order contacted today let know never received good paid said basically sol wanted cancel order placed minute prior told already advanced shipping stage placed order sorry amazon find ok keep money proof tracking good never delivered longer find need business top cant cancel order placed minute prior thanks amazon lost loyal customer,0.06901702828690613,0.9309829717130939,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.78276574272699,78.276574272699,High Trust
