Karen Alfaro,/users/5d821f444bbf8f4c36f75880,US,1.0,2019-09-18 12:13:36+00:00,1.0,I will no longer be shopping Amazon,"I will no longer be shopping Amazon. This was a tragic game played by all it seems (from CS to delivery). Interesting that the delivery person attempted ONE time (Sunday the 15th) in 3 days to deliver my item, I PAID FOR WEEKS AGO, now, after 3 days of being told it was going to be delivered and NO attempt was made to deliver Monday or Tuesday (was home both days), all of a sudden it is damaged. WOW! All I can say is, glad I am done with Amazon.Thank you for using my money (not sure how they justify having my money for 2 weeks and not sending order), and wasting much of my time!",2019-09-18 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,18.0,585,116,35,7,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,longer shopping amazon tragic game played seems c delivery interesting delivery person attempted one time sunday th day deliver item paid week ago day told going delivered attempt made deliver monday tuesday home day sudden damaged wow say glad done amazonthank using money sure justify money week sending order wasting much time,0.19178681324705604,0.808213186752944,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.7171183712788837,71.71183712788837,Medium Trust
