Gary Carmen,/users/5c506e6d4c453a502589b4ca,GB,2.0,2019-09-14 21:27:38+00:00,1.0,I have been a loyal customer for many…,"I have been a loyal customer for many years the service is great when you receive the items, when you don’t (which is my case today), the way the situation is handled is appalling. I receive a message to say that the item has been delivered and handed to the resident, although nothing has been delivered. I phone Amazon Customer Service and their records are different to what is showing in my Amazon App, it doesn’t show as being delivered.  I needed the item I ordered for work, I now can’t do the job as it hasn’t arrived. The only option presented to me is that they contact the seller and should get a response in 24/48 hours. So that is not a great option. I asked whether they can order the item for me again and have it delivered ASAP, they can’t do that. So I would have to pay for the item twice in order to get it ASAP. I was given the option of £5 voucher which I refused as that doesn’t help with me getting my item, perhaps Amazon should focus on that. If the item says it has been delivered and it hasn’t, I would expect Amazon to send the item again and deliver as soon as they can, then handle the seller in parallel to find out why the first item had not been delivered",2019-09-14 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,14.0,1188,231,38,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,loyal customer many year service great receive item don’t case today way situation handled appalling receive message say item delivered handed resident although nothing delivered phone amazon customer service record different showing amazon app doesn’t show delivered needed item ordered work can’t job hasn’t arrived option presented contact seller get response hour great option asked whether order item delivered asap can’t would pay item twice order get asap given option £ voucher refused doesn’t help getting item perhaps amazon focus item say delivered hasn’t would expect amazon send item deliver soon handle seller parallel find first item delivered,0.008652060772985446,0.9913479392270146,0.12955692652832304,0.2,0.821585354919172,82.15853549191719,High Trust
Francine Eaton,/users/5d7d1e66d53e5100fcf5527d,US,1.0,2019-09-14 17:07:57+00:00,3.0,XPO Logistics is the worst company…,"XPO Logistics is the worst company ever. I ordered a play house for my granddaughters on Amazon . XPO Logistics was supposed to deliver it last Saturday. The drivers lied saying they knocked on the door. I waited all day thinking they were still coming. I received an email at 4 pm that night saying they tried to deliver but no one was home. I have two dogs that would have alerted me if someone was at the door.Then when I called to complain that they never tried to deliver the package the people on the phone where rude. Additionally, I found out they had my phone number wrong. I asked them to change it but I was told they couldn't change the number, I had to contact Amazon to have the number changed. The supervisor even refused to change the number or help me plus she was rude. ""You didn't see a big truck pull up in front of your house "". My bedroom are in the front of the house not my living area so how would I see them pull up to the house.I called Amazon and changed my number plus let them know I was unhappy with the delivery provider. Amazon changed my number in the system. By Wednesday I still had not received a call to deliver the playhouse. So I called to find out why. The lady on the phone was actually helpful. She explained they where calling the wrong number despite the notes in the system giving the correct phone number. She actually changed my number so the organization could contact me when they were delivering.Today I was given another 4 hour window. I called to try and find a smaller window explaining I have things I need to get done (the stuff I couldn't get done last weekend because I waited all day). Again the lady on the line was rude and unhelpful.If you order something and find that this company will be delivering it. I suggest you find the product somewhere else. I am not ordering anymore large items from Amazon if they are going to keep using this company. XPO Logistics  has horrible customer service!!!! Amazon has not done anything about this organization that they paired up with.",2019-09-14 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,14.0,2038,378,35,6,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,xpo logistics worst company ever ordered play house granddaughter amazon xpo logistics supposed deliver last saturday driver lied saying knocked door waited day thinking still coming received email pm night saying tried deliver one home two dog would alerted someone doorthen called complain never tried deliver package people phone rude additionally found phone number wrong asked change told couldnt change number contact amazon number changed supervisor even refused change number help plus rude didnt see big truck pull front house bedroom front house living area would see pull housei called amazon changed number plus let know unhappy delivery provider amazon changed number system wednesday still received call deliver playhouse called find lady phone actually helpful explained calling wrong number despite note system giving correct phone number actually changed number organization could contact deliveringtoday given another hour window called try find smaller window explaining thing need get done stuff couldnt get done last weekend waited day lady line rude unhelpfulif order something find company delivering suggest find product somewhere else ordering anymore large item amazon going keep using company xpo logistics horrible customer service amazon done anything organization paired,0.8791624749040314,0.12083752509596857,0.21200224340998317,0.6,1.0028192112299807,100.28192112299807,High Trust
