Matthew Clawson,/users/57bde3f80000ff000a3dd1f1,GB,11.0,2019-09-10 20:20:37+00:00,1.0,Avoid,"Avoid, avoid! They use fraudulent courier companies who send you notifications claiming 'handed to customer', whilst the customer is not home, but at work, and avoid the concierge downstairs.When challenging this with Amazon, either via the virtual chat, helpline or via extremely rude automated email responses, they don't care for you 'the customer' more their own pocket. Surely as a client, if you do not receive an item they should act, investigate, not ignore the fact you have been defrauded of funds or merchandise.To help anyone else out in this situation, know the following: If Amazon cannot prove receipt of your order, as in a signature etc, you can claim funds back via PayPal or your chosen card provider.But to avoid altogether this situation, AVOID AMAZON!",2019-09-10 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,10.0,773,126,5,1,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,avoid avoid use fraudulent courier company send notification claiming handed customer whilst customer home work avoid concierge downstairswhen challenging amazon either via virtual chat helpline via extremely rude automated email response dont care customer pocket surely client receive item act investigate ignore fact defrauded fund merchandiseto help anyone else situation know following amazon cannot prove receipt order signature etc claim fund back via paypal chosen card providerbut avoid altogether situation avoid amazon,0.44692228443411647,0.5530777155658835,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.5906723406769406,59.067234067694066,Medium Trust
Gaby N,/users/593ebec00000ff000aa2cba5,CA,3.0,2019-09-10 19:34:24+00:00,1.0,Fake Stock & Shipping promisses,"I tried to get an outdoor game for our wedding in late September. Bought this august 17th it was meant to ship in 3 days with my amazon prime for free, this seemed like the best price and fastest delivery, altho i did see the competition on other sites. It's been 3 weeks and they have not shipped it, they keep changing the shipping date but don't actually say it's out of stock. I check online where i bourhgt it and it still says its in stock, I finally call 18445606843 customer service line (which i had to dig around for) as this product is owned, and shipped by amazon. They finally tell me after 40 mins that it's not in stock and that i can cancel my order. I look online and it's still got 5 star and says in stock - this is just blatant lie, it's like they got a 100$ loan from me.. No business should be allowed to operate that way. Don't by from Amazon - Buy Local.",2019-09-10 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,10.0,878,173,31,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tried get outdoor game wedding late september bought august th meant ship day amazon prime free seemed like best price fastest delivery altho see competition site week shipped keep changing shipping date dont actually say stock check online bourhgt still say stock finally call customer service line dig around product owned shipped amazon finally tell min stock cancel order look online still got star say stock blatant lie like got loan business allowed operate way dont amazon buy local,0.019304027339723504,0.9806959726602765,0.09702748177229388,0.2,0.809753482684597,80.9753482684597,High Trust
Mark Wark,/users/5d77e84d1addcdf18bae9057,US,1.0,2019-09-10 18:15:51+00:00,3.0,"Amazon was great, but that seems to be changing","Amazon has been GREAT, exceeding other retail avenues on price, delivery and customer service.  That seems to be changing.  It's getting nearly impossible to contact an actual person if you have a problem.  Over the years we get about 1 in 20 mis-deliveries. In the past you could contact them, talk to a person and either get a replacement or sometimes they could contact the carrier to find and fix a mis-delivery.   Not possible anymore as far as I can tell,  I've spent the last 30 minutes trying to break through the Barrier - getting nowhere.  I am advised by robo-service that even though they've said it's delivered... it may take up to 36 hours for it to actually be delivered.  If this service continues it will be the revival of brick and mortar shopping",2019-09-10 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,10.0,765,135,47,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon great exceeding retail avenue price delivery customer service seems changing getting nearly impossible contact actual person problem year get misdeliveries past could contact talk person either get replacement sometimes could contact carrier find fix misdelivery possible anymore far tell ive spent last minute trying break barrier getting nowhere advised roboservice even though theyve said delivered may take hour actually delivered service continues revival brick mortar shopping,0.010594739406834718,0.9894052605931652,0.07571508693213685,0.6,1.40984564768301,140.984564768301,High Trust
Michael Tharp,/users/5d77e2137f865484d4c6d3ea,US,5.0,2019-09-10 17:49:17+00:00,1.0,Bad Attitude,"I get or used to receive multiple Amazon deliveries every week. Most of my shopping was done on Amazon. Their prices are not very completive on most of their merchandize but it was covenant to shop there. They make it very hard to contact them in anyway and when it happens they call you at their convenience.  They make lots of mistakes such as sending my packages to addresses that I have never lived at, they send the wrong items, send broken items. I have no reason why I put up with Amazon’s unprofessionalism for so long. I ordered a 6ft computer cable they delivered a 3ft cable instead. I went to return the package stating that the cable was the wrong length and since it was the wrong item and Amazon’s computer immediately sends me another cable and I thought it was great until I saw it was another 3ft cable which is wrong for the second time. It took me a long time but I found out how to talk with Amazon. I clicked and they called me when they wanted to. I didn’t like waiting around my phone to fix their two mistakes but I did. I was called by a lady that could speak English just good enough for me to understand and within a minute she stopped the order that was coming to me at no cost and told me to order another one. I have up till now spent thousands of dollars with Amazon and they gave me bad attitude over $6.25. I will never spend another penny at Amazon. Walmart and many others are just as easy and they seem to care.",2019-09-10 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,10.0,1448,279,12,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,get used receive multiple amazon delivery every week shopping done amazon price completive merchandize covenant shop make hard contact anyway happens call convenience make lot mistake sending package address never lived send wrong item send broken item reason put amazon’s unprofessionalism long ordered ft computer cable delivered ft cable instead went return package stating 