are this feedback with the seller to help them improve their service in the future)  I again confirm lead associate if this is another lie....!! He said its error on system front...; further confirming will get response from seller in 2 days processing refundAnd now today 09/09/2019 what I receive is another automated email from seller on return shipping *** What made them all to lie..., is this some kind of big scam of looting stealing customer money along with seller... in case customer somehow ignore refund emails and bank statements... this can be some serious unclaimed tricked money!! Hope JEFF BEZOS can see how each passing day his so called customer centric company along with sellers are into wrong practices of lying and giving false assurances fooling its customers!!",2019-09-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,9.0,2651,440,53,8,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,say annoying frustrating experience buying amazon happy man allfirst time told send shipping receipt c amazon refund processed dayssecond time contacted package got delivered tricked lie get refund day delivered date rd august fact didn’t happened contacted back third time associate said issue refund right away order cost return shipping charge later claimed successfully issued august email confirmation turned nothing trick lie refund didn’t happen claimed credited bank account september contacted back put numerous associate nothing lie lie demanded bank transaction reference number id positive never initiated first placefinally refused give lead associate admitted transaction never initiated seller initiated refund demanded apology email measure would taken wrong habit lying false assurance practiced among amazon customer contact associate customer doesn’t suffer go annoying agonizing frustrating trauma amazon customer care post email refund request send seller associate said received confirmation email stating belowon amazonin wroteamazon hellothe seller initiated refund order seller authorized request seller resolve issue yes nowe’ll share feedback seller help improve service future confirm lead associate another lie said error system front confirming get response seller day processing refundand today receive another automated email seller return shipping made lie kind big scam looting stealing customer money along seller case customer somehow ignore refund email bank statement serious unclaimed tricked money hope jeff bezos see passing day called customer centric company along seller wrong practice lying giving false assurance fooling customer,0.9992293862493122,0.0007706137506877653,0.24677509814918677,0.2,0.3497403265051812,34.97403265051812,Low Trust
