John Ferrett,/users/5215e9dc000064000148fe11,GB,40.0,2019-09-08 11:40:57+00:00,1.0,Tried posting a negative review on…,"Tried posting a negative review on Amazon again but I always get back these ""automatics"" replies which off course you can't reply to.Thank you for submitting a customer review on Amazon. After carefully reviewing your submission, your review could not be posted to the website. While we appreciate your time and comments, reviews must adhere to the following guidelines:""I get the same thing from otherlike Argos.Why have these reviews if they don't allow negative ones? Xpelair C4HTS 4-inch Simply Silent Contour Extractor Fan Humidifier Don't use this company Still waiting for item to arrive. Looks like it's 15' days from collection to delivery. I live in cheam Surrey don't use the company or Yodel.Waste of time don't use them.   A few common issues to keep in mind:Your review should focus on specific features of the product and your experience with it. Feedback on the seller or your shipment experience should be providedWe do not allow profane or obscene content. This applies to adult products too.Advertisements, promotional material or repeated posts that make the same point excessively are considered spam.Please do not include URLs external to Amazon or personally identifiable content in your review.Any attempt to manipulate Community content or features, including contributing false, misleading or inauthentic content, is strictly prohibited.",2019-09-08 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,8.0,1363,210,35,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tried posting negative review amazon always get back automatic reply course cant reply tothank submitting customer review amazon carefully reviewing submission review could posted website appreciate time comment review must adhere following guidelinesi get thing otherlike argoswhy review dont allow negative one xpelair chts inch simply silent contour extractor fan humidifier dont use company still waiting item arrive look like day collection delivery live cheam surrey dont use company yodelwaste time dont use common issue keep mindyour review focus specific feature product experience feedback seller shipment experience providedwe allow profane obscene content applies adult product tooadvertisements promotional material repeated post make point excessively considered spamplease include url external amazon personally identifiable content reviewany attempt manipulate community content feature including contributing false misleading inauthentic content strictly prohibited,0.049998531598546156,0.9500014684014538,0.11777902411665732,0.2,0.7985565390240583,79.85565390240583,High Trust
Teff,/users/5cc8db5b8eb10e49adaee173,US,3.0,2019-09-08 00:39:04+00:00,1.0,Cannot dispute third parties of Amazon not fulfilled by amazon,"Amazon representatives including their supervisor threaten to place a hold my account because of a charge back. They told me on the phone and in writing to either drop the dispute against the third party amazon seller not fulfilled by amazon or threaten to place a hold on my account. The amount was exactly $4.04 on August 29, 2019.  I have been a happy and satisfied customer with Amazon since 2004 and have placed many orders.I asked for help in writing explaining the situation but nothing has come as of today (9-07-2019)",2019-09-08 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,8.0,526,92,62,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon representative including supervisor threaten place hold account charge back told phone writing either drop dispute third party amazon seller fulfilled amazon threaten place hold account amount exactly august happy satisfied customer amazon since placed many ordersi asked help writing explaining situation nothing come today,0.01634333953899858,0.9836566604610014,0.051598429613011774,0.2,0.802148016153103,80.21480161531031,High Trust
Jesse William Larson,/users/5d225ca4ba70b8797a5ecbab,TH,5.0,2019-09-08 00:08:32+00:00,1.0,Amazon Stealing Millions from customers,"Amazon has stolen $2000 dollars in Amazon gift cards from me. Not only from one amazon account but two of my accounts.. on one of my accounts I had $500 in Amazon gift cards on and that account was locked. So I loaded $1500 on my other account thinking I could resolve the issue later. then the account with $1500 was also locked. I have no clue how to get my money back from amazon after months of phone calls and only one response to my emails. Apparently, from my reseach they are stealing Millions a year in Amazon gift cards from their customers this way. If this theft of gift cards happens to you report AMAZON to the Better Business Bureau asap. .....Because they will just get stonewall you and nothing will be returned to you nor will they help you to resolve the issue so you just left guessing about why they could just steal from you. I have heard that it could be for the craziest of reasons they lock up your account... Some reasons include ..if you buy certain products with your gift cards its like a booby trap and they will lock your money and not give it back...If you're a new Amazon account they will lock your money from you.. If you put $500-$1000 amazon gift cards on your account they will lock your account as soon as you go to buy something. You can put 10 of thousands of gift cards on your balance but as soon as you go to spend them they steal it all which is their major source of ill-gotten profits. even if you go traveling and you purchase something with your gift cards they will lock your account a separate you from your money and pretend you are not from the US so they have the right to steal your gift card balance from you. This a horrible and criminal thing that Amazon is doing non of these reasons are justifying this theft by Amazon of its customers. They are exploiting their power and looting the little guy with unfair policies and business practices.. Case Action Lawsuits are the only way to stop them..they have become drunk with power and have gone to far...and they are not going to stop because they are making to much money by giving themselves permission to steal from their customers who use Amazon Gift cards. Its criminal and Amazon should be ashamed of itself, this is a total disgrace of a company..and Jeff Bezos how could you allow this to happen as if there will be no consequences for stealing millions of dollars from your customers..... just because you need the profits because you screwed your company up in bad business deals..you can know for sure this an organized system of theft that needs to be brought down, This is criminal activity at the highest level and you know Amazon cant get away with this.",2019-09-08 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,8.0,2676,493,39,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon stolen dollar amazon gift card one amazon account two account one account amazon gift card account locked loaded account thinking could resolve issue later account also locked clue get money back amazon month phone call one response email apparently reseach stealing million year amazon gift card customer way theft gift card happens report amazon better business bureau asap get stonewall nothing returned help resolve issue left guessing could steal heard could craziest reason lock account reason include buy certain product gift card like booby trap lock money give backif youre new amazon account lock money put amazon gift card account lock account soon go buy something put thousand gift card balance soon go spend steal major source illgotten profit even go traveling purchase something gift card lock account separate money pretend u right steal gift card balance horrible criminal thing amazon non reason justifying theft amazon customer exploiting power looting little guy unfair policy business practice case action lawsuit way stop themthey become drunk power gone farand going stop making much money giving permission steal customer use amazon gift card criminal amazon ashamed total disgrace companyand jeff bezos could allow happen consequence stealing million dollar customer need profit screwed company bad business dealsyou know sure organized system theft need brought criminal activity highest level know amazon cant get away,0.013612037082408896,0.9863879629175911,0.2765002804262479,0.2,0.8484940375440452,84.84940375440452,High Trust
