wrenton Rogers,/users/58e421260000ff000a89aa98,GB,68.0,2019-09-05 10:53:24+00:00,1.0,We recently ordered and received…,"We recently ordered and received quickly a new 55inch LG ULTRA TELEVISION, unfortunalely the screen had a hole in it , and a wire from the TV was protruding from it.The courier collected it for return within a day, but we did not receive our refund for a month. Sadly we were out of pocket, and the refund system only provides that refunds are not sent to your Bank until AT LEAST 3-4 WEEKS on receipt of the returned goods.We were informed by the courier that broken televisions/ returns are a regular occurance with Amazon, and so we purchased elsewhere. By the time we had our refund , we had spent the cost of the TV, and the Customer Service at Amazon did not have any sympathy for our loss or wait for the refund. Advice to otheres would be to purchase TV elsewhere.",2019-09-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,5.0,772,144,33,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently ordered received quickly new inch lg ultra television unfortunalely screen hole wire tv protruding itthe courier collected return within day receive refund month sadly pocket refund system provides refund sent bank least week receipt returned goodswe informed courier broken television return regular occurance amazon purchased elsewhere time refund spent cost tv customer service amazon sympathy loss wait refund advice otheres would purchase tv elsewhere,0.07566010615256319,0.9243398938474368,0.08076275939427931,0.2,0.7783224988025743,77.83224988025744,High Trust
