Jayci Blackburn,/users/5d701725e9e2510de987af36,US,1.0,2019-09-04 20:04:23+00:00,1.0,If I could give this person 0 stars I…,"This is NOT to shame Amazon as a whole because I love shopping here but Amazons customer service is something out of this world. Completely unacceptable. If I could give this person 0 stars I would. FIRST of all Mr. JC answered the phone and sounded rude right off the get go. I needed help with my mom's amazon prime account and granted he couldn't help me because I wasn't the primary card holder but this man sounded MISERABLE. He was also terribly rude. If you guys are going to hire customer service representative's please make sure they are people who actually ENJOY helping people. I've worked in customer service for 5 years and know how to properly take care of customers. I even asked him if he was okay and he straight up just says ""I'm fine"". nothing else or no apology. What a shame. Find a different job if your not happy Mr. JC. Geez.",2019-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,4.0,850,157,38,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,shame amazon whole love shopping amazon customer service something world completely unacceptable could give person star would first mr jc answered phone sounded rude right get go needed help mom amazon prime account granted couldnt help wasnt primary card holder man sounded miserable also terribly rude guy going hire customer service representative please make sure people actually enjoy helping people ive worked customer service year know properly take care customer even asked okay straight say im fine nothing else apology shame find different job happy mr jc geez,0.013223259325003203,0.9867767406749968,0.08805384183959619,0.2,0.8109991387054176,81.09991387054177,High Trust
