Sydnie,/users/56e31f0a0000ff000a0df668,GB,31.0,2019-09-02 08:57:53+00:00,2.0,Bad Delivery Service,"I normally have a really good experience with Amazon, I have a Prime account so usually everything comes next day. However, Thursday 29th August, I ordered a dog crate, which had Prime delivery, so it should have arrived Friday but I waited all day Friday and it never came. I called Amazon to find out what had happened and they said there was an issue so it would come Saturday instead. Still nothing Saturday. I called Saturday explained I had Prime delivery and was told I would receive it on Saturday but it hadn't come and they refunded me a next day delivery charge. They confirmed it would definitely be delivered on Sunday but on Sunday I still didn't receive anything. It is now Monday 3 days after it was supposed to come and I have been notified it will be delivered today. This has been very inconvenient for me as I have a husky and we needed the crate for her over the weekend and today.",2019-09-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,2.0,902,167,20,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,normally really good experience amazon prime account usually everything come next day however thursday th august ordered dog crate prime delivery arrived friday waited day friday never came called amazon find happened said issue would come saturday instead still nothing saturday called saturday explained prime delivery told would receive saturday hadnt come refunded next day delivery charge confirmed would definitely delivered sunday sunday still didnt receive anything monday day supposed come notified delivered today inconvenient husky needed crate weekend today,0.028237321090828153,0.9717626789091719,0.09366236679753225,0.4,1.1046138128140923,110.46138128140923,High Trust
