Terrance Wortham,/users/5d6c6915730974c7472c1a6f,US,1.0,2019-09-02 00:58:12+00:00,1.0,I've had 4,"I've had 4, yes count them 4, orders all of a sudden become damaged while out for delivery. I'm currently waiting on another order that was due Friday. All of a sudden it's due on Saturday. After reporting that it's out for delivery, I see a driver in my neighborhood making delivery. I ask if he has my package and he says no without even checking. Now my status is saying, delayed, will be out for delivery on Tuesday. I'm a prime member and can honestly say, Amazon is growing faster than what they can keep up.",2019-09-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,2.0,514,97,10,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive yes count order sudden become damaged delivery im currently waiting another order due friday sudden due saturday reporting delivery see driver neighborhood making delivery ask package say without even checking status saying delayed delivery tuesday im prime member honestly say amazon growing faster keep,0.021416056549887312,0.9785839434501127,0.05440269209197981,0.2,0.8001725101434524,80.01725101434523,High Trust
