shefali suryavanshi,/users/5d6b413e26ec4a29f422ff14,IN,2.0,2019-09-01 03:56:00+00:00,1.0,Amazon not returning it's product within 2 days of delivery,"I bought one mobile phone from amazon, and soon after delivery i changed my mind to buy a new phone now. So i asked the customer service of amazon to return it, I told them honestly that the phone is not even unboxed(the seal and plastic over the box is not even torn) so please return it, but they told me that they won't return it and can only replace it with the same item.I no longer want the phone i ordered earlier and want to buy a different phone latter, then they should return and refund, but these guys are pushing and pressurizing to keep that product only, anyway. they said that they will return/replace only in case of damaged product, does that mean that i have to damage the product and ask them to replace it, recursively.It sounds very weird that the service company with big name are not providing good service and just pushing your whatsoever product to your customer when they aren't willing to keep it. If the customer is not happy with look and feel of the product then also as per replacement policy you're pushing the same product on customer, then what is the use of online shopping.I would have gone to store and bought a phone by experiencing it, then and there and bought accordingly, if i would have known that ""amazon"" will create such a hassle for a mobile phone.There is no use buying anything on Amazon, because they incorporate policy feasible to them not customer.Highly dissatisfied with amazon services, products, customer help and their self satisfying ""policies"".",2019-09-01 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,1.0,1504,266,59,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought one mobile phone amazon soon delivery changed mind buy new phone asked customer service amazon return told honestly phone even unboxedthe seal plastic box even torn please return told wont return replace itemi longer want phone ordered earlier want buy diff