Dawn,/users/5d6b0e552eb4d88159ab059d,CA,1.0,2019-09-01 00:19:06+00:00,1.0,Amazon won't post my negative review.,"My product rating/review was not approved. Apparently explaining a product arrived damaged (holes and dents) followed by useless 'customer service' is not welcome. Truthfully, my product rating was influenced by being late, arriving damaged and then a useless interaction with Customer Service! I purchased an XL dog crate. the pan arrived with a large hole/gouge in the bottom and several dents. Amazon CS would not replace the damaged piece, saying they could not swap out individual parts, only swap out the entire cage. Even after explaining I had physical challenges that would mean I would have to have someone disassemble the crate, rebox it and then drag it outside when the delivery service came (which means whomever would be helping me would need to be waiting at my home all day - provided they showed up when promised). I am appalled that even after explaining I had physical limitations that make me unable to manage the swap out on my own, Amazon would not simply swap out the damaged pan, since they sell that as a replacement item. How is it, in 2019, Amazon cannot train/empower their Customer Service reps to assist customers with physical challenges/disabilities?",2019-09-01 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,9.0,1.0,1183,196,37,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,product ratingreview approved apparently explaining product arrived damaged hole dent followed useless customer service welcome truthfully product rating influenced late arriving damaged useless interaction customer service purchased xl dog crate pan arrived large holegouge bottom several dent amazon c would replace damaged piece saying could swap individual part swap entire cage even explaining physical challenge would mean would someone disassemble crate rebox drag outside delivery service came mean whomever would helping would need waiting home day provided showed promised appalled even explaining physical limitation make unable manage swap amazon would simply swap damaged pan since sell replacement item amazon cannot trainempower customer service rep assist customer physical challengesdisabilities,0.048831157463956915,0.9511688425360431,0.10992708917554683,0.2,0.7975698391031308,79.75698391031308,High Trust
