Gen,/users/5d67df9bc22777fc648ff65d,CA,2.0,2019-08-29 14:22:27+00:00,1.0,We will not be using Amazon’s services…,"We will not be using Amazon’s services anymore. We are very disappointed about an incident that happened.My partner and I bought this item online. There was probably a bug in the system or something like that because the confirmation email indicated that two items (instead of one) were being sent. We are 100% sure it’s not a mistake from our part, because we’re used with Amazon’s platform, we’ve been ordering many things in the past and we double checked every steps of the order placement.20 minutes after we realized that two items would be shipped (and charged), we called Amazon. When we talked to the representative, there was no willingness to accommodate or compensate for this mistake. Very disappointing indeed.",2019-08-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,29.0,724,120,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,using amazon’s service anymore disappointed incident happenedmy partner bought item online probably bug system something like confirmation email indicated two item instead one sent sure it’s mistake part we’re used amazon’s platform we’ve ordering many thing past double checked every step order placement minute realized two item would shipped charged called amazon talked representative willingness accommodate compensate mistake disappointing indeed,0.01573251455482651,0.9842674854451735,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.8055942026216333,80.55942026216333,High Trust
