Valerie Ray,/users/5d67027b93122ae7cc5a24e9,US,2.0,2019-08-28 22:40:58+00:00,1.0,Amazon has gone downhill,"Amazon has gone downhill. I've been a loyal customer for quite a while now and something has changed. Over the last 5 days, I've had to deal with customer service 4 times. I won't go into all of the details with the issues because it would take too long to explain them all, but I'll list what I've had to deal with. - Wrong package delivered. - Several packages tagged as delivered but weren't. - One packaged not received and could not be reordered. - Several packages not delivered on guaranteed date. - One item received was used and damaged. All of that within 5 days. I had to deal with customer service 4 times and every time it was with someone with a heavy accent that was hard to understand. And they all made empty promises that this would never happen again. Every promise they made was broken. This is not the Amazon I used to enjoy using and depended on. I just cancelled my membership. And I'm glad cancelled when I did because it was set to renew in less than two weeks. I just saved myself $119 and more headaches to come.",2019-08-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,28.0,1039,195,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon gone downhill ive loyal customer quite something changed last day ive deal customer service time wont go detail issue would take long explain ill list ive deal wrong package delivered several package tagged delivered werent one packaged received could reordered several package delivered guaranteed date one item received used damaged within day deal customer service time every time someone heavy accent hard understand made empty promise would never happen every promise made broken amazon used enjoy using depended cancelled membership im glad cancelled set renew less two week saved headache come,0.003307072649254268,0.9966929273507458,0.10936623667975323,0.2,0.8202197110113235,82.02197110113235,High Trust
