Billie Rose,/users/5d605304dca16712ebaa9ef6,US,1.0,2019-08-23 21:04:27+00:00,1.0,Amazon is Scamming the customer,"I was told today that my Amazon account had been hacked/Red Flagged because of attempted purchases out of Texas and New Mexico. I live in Arizona. I was told,  To prove that I do live in Arizona,  Never mind the fact that Amazon just shipped me 2 items this week to my home in ARIZONA, and ALL my personal info indicates I DO Live in AZ.,  I was told I needed to go buy a $100 eBay card or Walmart card. I said I don't have the money to do that and why would I have to buy something like that for $100?! the Amazon manager called me a liar.. He said that I live in the United States and I don't have a $100, yes, I was a liar!  I was in absolute shock!! Amazon is horrible!!",2019-08-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,23.0,674,138,31,5,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,told today amazon account hackedred flagged attempted purchase texas new mexico live arizona told prove live arizona never mind fact amazon shipped item week home arizona personal info indicates live az told needed go buy ebay card walmart card said dont money would buy something like amazon manager called liar said live united state dont yes liar absolute shock amazon horrible,0.997810599313312,0.0021894006866880478,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.31657422922724754,31.657422922724756,Low Trust
Robert Ferraro,/users/553df6df0000ff0001bb04bc,US,2.0,2019-08-23 20:45:31+00:00,1.0,Amazon absolutely poor delivery performance. Order sitting for a week unshipped.,"I usually order one or two items at a time from Amazon and they usually arrive in a reasonable time frame.Two weeks ago decided to order a whole bunch of stuff - about 14 different items on two different orders.I couldn't believe that everything was delivered in a trickle one item at a time over about 6 different shipments.... then.... a week later the bulk of the stuff I ordered on my second order had not been delivered so I went online to take a look and 7 days later my order hadn't even shipped. Everything was in stock but still sitting in waiting to be shipped status for a whole week! This was not the free shipping option but the standard shipping option in which I paid shipping for. I decided to immediately cancel my order (about $140 worth of goods) and then drove to Walmart 20 minutes down the road and bought everything I cancelled at Amazon. Not only did I get it immediately all within an hour of shopping but it was also cheaper overall.I have learned I will not order from Amazon again unless it is one item at a time and that will be rare. I don't know what all the rave is about about how good Amazon is. I think it's pretty pathetic actually. These were everyday goods that I can get anywhere and they were all in stock. Before they decide to try to innovate with drone delivery etc, they should focus on being able to get the basic delivery mechanism perfected first.",2019-08-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,23.0,1394,260,80,11,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,usually order one two item time amazon usually arrive reasonable time frametwo week ago decided order whole bunch stuff different item two different ordersi couldnt believe everything delivered trickle one item time different shipment week later bulk stuff ordered second order delivered went online take look day later order hadnt even shipped everything stock still sitting waiting shipped status whole week free shipping option standard shipping option paid shipping decided immediately cancel order worth good drove walmart minute road bought everything cancelled amazon get immediately within hour shopping also cheaper overalli learned order amazon unless one item time rare dont know rave good amazon think pretty pathetic actually everyday good get anywhere stock decide try innovate drone delivery etc focus able get basic delivery mechanism perfected first,0.014972857772264352,0.9850271422277357,0.14582164890633764,0.2,0.8216779008951353,82.16779008951353,High Trust
