CE,/users/5bc31ddf4de5666d34dd8bda,GB,40.0,2019-08-15 13:39:49+00:00,1.0,Service has gone downhill fast,"Amazon used to be great.  Often when I ordered items with free delivery they still arrived quickly.  Then I started using Prime.  I recently stopped this for two reasons - first it's a waste of money, often items are cheaper without Prime, so technically you ARE paying for delivery, secondly they took my annual Prime payment from an unauthorised card, even though I had cancelled it.  I recently ordered some items and every time I order they put up the option to join Prime and what they do with your order is just hold it back for several days.  Even given free delivery this is the slowest online service I have ever come across.  I ordered some items on Sunday last and they have still not been despatched.  There is no reason for this other than trying to force people into using Prime.  Three high value items I was going to buy on Amazon I will now be buying on the high street.",2019-08-15 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,15.0,887,163,30,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon used great often ordered item free delivery still arrived quickly started using prime recently stopped two reason first waste money often item cheaper without prime technically paying delivery secondly took annual prime payment unauthorised card even though cancelled recently ordered item every time order put option join prime order hold back several day even given free delivery slowest online service ever come across ordered item sunday last still despatched reason trying force people using prime three high value item going buy amazon buying high street,0.012137929696437818,0.9878620703035622,0.09141895681435783,0.2,0.8122148265146527,81.22148265146527,High Trust
