Justin Goyeau,/users/5d472e918ad82450580247d3,CA,1.0,2019-08-04 19:29:01+00:00,1.0,Don't trust amazon prime.,"Don't trust primeI made an order on thursday, August 1st and it said 2 day shipping. And would be here for saturday. When I checked on saturday, August 3, it said my item would now be arriving monday  August 5th. And that's just one. I ordered another 2 items on friday, August 2nd  with 2 day delivery and low and behold, its sunday at 3 pm and my packages are not even shipped yet. Therefore 0 chance of them showing up today. So they failed to meet there guaranteed yet again. When I called to complain they said there was nothing they could do about it. I am a paying prime member. This is terrible service and the messed up part is all the stuff I ordered was for a friend of mine bday and also for the mother of my children. I was excited to give my gift to my friend on time and my kids have checking the front door continuously for their mother's package. Thanks for managing to wreck my gift to a close friend and upsetting my kids. 3 disappointed adults and 2 upset kids.",2019-08-04 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,4.0,981,189,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dont trust primei made order thursday august st said day shipping would saturday checked saturday august said item would arriving monday august th thats one ordered another item friday august nd day delivery low behold sunday pm package even shipped yet therefore chance showing today failed meet guaranteed yet called complain said nothing could paying prime member terrible service messed part stuff ordered friend mine bday also mother child excited give gift friend time kid checking front door continuously mother package thanks managing wreck gift close friend upsetting kid disappointed adult upset kid,0.025678205339022146,0.9743217946609779,0.10600112170499158,0.2,0.8083611216714872,80.83611216714873,High Trust
