Rose D,/users/5d463bed8ad824ed0602012a,US,1.0,2019-08-04 01:59:26+00:00,1.0,Return policy has changed! HORRIBLE,"I was buying everything at amazon but not any more, I usually expend $700/month there. Last week, I returned 5 different items from different orders and send them back. I used to get my return 2-3 hours after I drop of the item at UPS. Now they said I have too wait until the items reach the facility which will take 2 weeks, (I did not use UPS, I used amazon locker which is close to my place), once they receive the item after 2 weeks, then the have to open the item and process it so add another week. No store ever takes that long to refund something!!!!  I will start buying from other stores and all of of them have better prices than amazon! I have been wasting a lot of money!",2019-08-04 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,4.0,684,134,35,5,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,buying everything amazon usually expend month last week returned different item different order send back used get return hour drop item ups said wait item reach facility take week use ups used amazon locker close place receive item week open item process add another week store ever take long refund something start buying store better price amazon wasting lot money,0.9928947000143132,0.007105299985686764,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.318583496880112,31.858349688011202,Low Trust
makemefeelgood,/users/5d45eab817d44e496ac312bf,US,1.0,2019-08-03 20:29:19+00:00,1.0,Why do you want to feel bad?,"Fifty percent of the time you will get opened, damaged products.  Avoid amazon like the plague.  Go get some exercise and buy your stuff at real stores.  Easier to return, get a refund.  A salesman makes you feel good when you buy stuff.  A sheister makes you feel bad, like you got ripped off.  Amazon are nothing but sheisters.",2019-08-03 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,3.0,329,59,28,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,fifty percent time get opened damaged product avoid amazon like plague go get exercise buy stuff real store easier return get refund salesman make feel good buy stuff sheister make feel bad like got ripped amazon nothing sheisters,0.008205519144247862,0.9917944808557522,0.03309029725182277,0.2,0.8025152998782407,80.25152998782407,High Trust
Linda C,/users/5d44f8a31ca6d30a2e2129b6,US,2.0,2019-08-03 03:00:06+00:00,1.0,Dont try to buy anything guaranteed…,"Dont try to buy anything guaranteed same day. I haven't had anything delivered same day even though guaranteed. Full of excuses about things being out of their control. This time, the items I bought are Amazon items, not delivered same day because of delay but rescheduled for delivery today. Still nothing due to issues ""beyond their control"". Their warehouse is 15 minutes from my house. There were 3 Amazon vans in my housing area all at the same time while I was driving home from work. How can their product being delivered by their vans less than 15 minutes away be out of their control 2 days straight? Then, when I ask for a refund, I get the run around and my status on the orders say I refused the packages when they delivered. IT WAS NEVER DELIVERED!!! This is the 3rd time they pulled this crap. The first two times they promised gift cards (which I never received). I don't need them anyways. Goodbye prime, goodbye Amazon!!",2019-08-03 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,3.0,937,168,36,6,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,dont try buy anything guaranteed day havent anything delivered day even though guaranteed full excuse thing control time item bought amazon item delivered day delay rescheduled delivery today still nothing due issue beyond control warehouse minute house amazon van housing area time driving home work product delivered van less minute away control day straight ask refund get run around status order say refused package delivered never delivered rd time pulled crap first two time promised gift card never received dont need anyways goodbye prime goodbye amazon,0.9522379580369208,0.047762041963079205,0.09422321929332586,0.2,0.3427256648402048,34.27256648402048,Low Trust
