Frank S,/users/5bad5e034de5666d34bc829d,US,30.0,2019-08-02 22:10:12+00:00,1.0,"Amazon filter or block reviews you post, leaving the fake ones in place!!","I always like to spend some time and efforts to write unbiased reviews on Amazon (or other site, such as eBay, Google...etc), because I want other customers to learn from my experiences with a product or company, good or bad. Like many other customer I am sure, I also use the review on Amazon to decide or not to buy a product, so I also feel that it's normal to do the same for others people.Unfortunately, after spending time and efforts to write good (sometimes long) reviews about products purchased on the site, the review get sent back to me with the following error message from Amazon: ""Thank you for submitting a customer review on Amazon. After carefully reviewing your submission, your review could not be posted to the website. While we appreciate your time and comments, reviews must adhere to the following guidelines *insert link to Amazon review guidelines here*I always try to follow all their guideline to the letter when posting a product review, so I am very surprised to get this kind of answer from Amazon. After sending an email to them to check about what was wrong with my reviews, here comes the surprising response from them: ""We removed your review because we detected unusual review behavior on this product and are not accepting reviews of it at this time. We place limits on reviews to preserve trust in customer reviews."" Imagine my surprise when reading this ! And they often do that too !!! That wasn't the first time a legit unbiased review got rejected, while on the other hand, the product page display obviously FAKE reviews or short UN-useful one like ""I like the color"". Amazon, please explain how this kind of behavior blocking legit reviews from verified purchase buyer is going to ""preserve trust in customer reviews"" ????...So yup, as you can see Amazon select the reviews they want to see posted, and block the legit ones (especially if they are negative on one of their own product page btw). You have been warned ! Do NOT believe all review you read on Amazon !! And if you feel like writing a review for something you bought on there, good luck to see it posted either !!",2019-08-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,8.0,2.0,2120,374,73,13,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,always like spend time effort write unbiased review amazon site ebay googleetc want customer learn experience product company good bad like many customer sure also use review amazon decide buy product also feel normal others peopleunfortunately spending time effort write good sometimes long review product purchased site review get sent back following error message amazon thank submitting customer review amazon carefully reviewing submission review could posted website appreciate time comment review must adhere following guideline insert link amazon review guideline herei always try follow guideline letter posting product review surprised get kind answer amazon sending email check wrong review come surprising response removed review detected unusual review behavior product accepting review time place limit review preserve trust customer review imagine surprise reading often wasnt first time legit unbiased review got rejected hand product page display obviously fake review short unuseful one like like color amazon please explain kind behavior blocking legit review verified purchase buyer going preserve trust customer review yup see amazon select review want see posted block legit one especially negative one product page btw warned believe review read amazon feel like writing review something bought good luck see posted either,0.9999689085219212,3.1091478078781876e-05,0.20975883342680876,0.2,0.34196731242440115,34.196731242440116,Low Trust
