Ivar Tangen,/users/5a958c0d0e7d9e41885e422b,GB,34.0,2019-07-30 22:56:48+00:00,1.0,Is Amazon running a scam?  Amazon Prime Subscription,"Is Amazon running a scam? Amazon Prime SubscriptionAmazon charged my credit card for Amazon Prime £7.99. Since I never subscribed to the service nor ever been in need for it, i contacted Amazon and they said they would refund the money.I asked for an explanation and I was told that after buying an item on Amazon the subscription was triggered. So as far as I can understand this is a default and you have to opt out to avoid been charged for a subscription to Amazon Prime.Please note that the subscription was never confirmed to me, by email or any other means. I also logged onto my Amazon account and the subscription does NOT show on the page for ‘Your Memberships and Subscriptions’.Conclusion: Amazon is running a scam.",2019-07-30 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,30.0,727,128,52,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon running scam amazon prime subscriptionamazon charged credit card amazon prime £ since never subscribed service ever need contacted amazon said would refund moneyi asked explanation told buying item amazon subscription triggered far understand default opt avoid charged subscription amazon primeplease note subscription never confirmed email mean also logged onto amazon account subscription show page ‘your membership subscriptions’conclusion amazon running scam,0.04023932139507353,0.9597606786049264,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.7942381631947795,79.42381631947795,High Trust
