Sabrina Ross,/users/5d3916eabd87976907de95bd,US,3.0,2019-07-25 02:41:53+00:00,1.0,AWFUL,"AWFUL, if I could rate it 0 starts I would. I am I prime membership customer. I spend a lot of money with Amazon but rarely ever get my Amazon items in 2 days or less. I ordered firestick on 7/15. Here it is 7/24 and I have yet to receive my item. The customer service team act as if they could care less. I was in a chat for over an hour just trying to get them to explain to me why my replacement order was cancelled only to be reordered. No one would give me a direct answer and still here I am waiting for my order. They tell you with prime membership you get 2 day delivery.   They don't actually say it's 2 day from the time it's actually in process of being shipped. It's been almost 2 weeks for 1 small order. Just firesticks. They really lost my respect and as far as their concern for customers that's nothing to them. After they get your money they could care less what issue you're having or you've had.",2019-07-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,25.0,915,181,5,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,awful could rate start would prime membership customer spend lot money amazon rarely ever get amazon item day less ordered firestick yet receive item customer service team act could care less chat hour trying get explain replacement order cancelled reordered one would give direct answer still waiting order tell prime membership get day delivery dont actually say day time actually process shipped almost week small order firesticks really lost respect far concern customer thats nothing get money could care less issue youre youve,0.012140223543715798,0.9878597764562842,0.10151430173864273,0.2,0.8142327485758706,81.42327485758706,High Trust
