Julia D,/users/5d38aff27576c4821d28daa9,US,2.0,2019-07-24 19:27:43+00:00,1.0,"Very bad place with bs ""Seller…","Very bad place with bs ""Seller Support"". The entire system is geared to consumers only. They can bankrupt you with their policies. You call customer service and someone in India rattles down a script, how sorry they are about the issues they cause without ever fixing them. Also they block you from being able to respond to customer questions without giving you a reason or lifting the mistake some computer AI made. Customers can return anything and everything after using and abusing the product, damaging it and citing the reason for return "" damaged"" product. Yet you as a seller pay for the returns and even for the destruction of the product afterwards. Amazon is evil.",2019-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,24.0,675,116,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bad place b seller support entire system geared consumer bankrupt policy call customer service someone india rattle script sorry issue cause without ever fixing also block able respond customer question without giving reason lifting mistake computer ai made customer return anything everything using abusing product damaging citing reason return damaged product yet seller pay return even destruction product afterwards amazon evil,0.010765259393221666,0.9892347406067783,0.06505888951205833,0.2,0.8076291482058009,80.7629148205801,High Trust
Lansing Smith,/users/5d374ec382c0a57479f32bfb,US,2.0,2019-07-24 18:56:12+00:00,5.0,I Purchased a Pair of Vibrathotics,"I Purchased a Pair of Vibrathotics I purchased a pair of the Vibrathotics last week not knowing how they would work. So, when they got to my home, I opened them immediately and put them in my slippers. They had a good charge, so I was able to wear them for about two hours. I even had them on the high setting. I have nephropathy in both feet because of a serious back injure, and life. I'm 65 and I worked for 35 years in the film industry. My work involved a lot of lifting and very long days on my feet. I have a plate in my neck at C5-C7, I have Peripheral Nerve Disorders. Because of the problems with my neck and spine, I have nerve damage in both feet. Anyway, after about two hours with the Vibrathotics on high, I turned them off because my feet were burning, because of the nerve damage. So, the next day when I woke up, I noticed that my feet felt great. No pins and needles or nails being hammered into my foot or ankle. However, as things go, the pain started to slowly come back throughout the day. So, I put my slippers on and wore them for another two or three hours, and the same thing happened again. I was pain free for hours, then the pain would slowly creep in and I would put my slippers back on. This seems to be the system that works for me, but it may be different for you. I hope my story helps you with your feet health.  I love my Vibrathotics.                                            THE END",2019-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,24.0,1423,273,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,purchased pair vibrathotics purchased pair vibrathotics last week knowing would work got home opened immediately put slipper good charge able wear two hour even high setting nephropathy foot serious back injure life im worked year film industry work involved lot lifting long day foot plate neck cc peripheral nerve disorder problem neck spine nerve damage foot anyway two hour vibrathotics high turned foot burning nerve damage next day woke noticed foot felt great pin needle nail hammered foot ankle however thing go pain started slowly come back throughout day put slipper wore another two three hour thing happened pain free hour pain would slowly creep would put slipper back seems system work may different hope story help foot health love vibrathotics end,0.03228314604279458,0.9677168539572054,0.1531127313516545,1.0,2.0144809732489337,201.44809732489338,High Trust
Rosie Gallegos,/users/5d388d508bb4d1221f2f062d,US,1.0,2019-07-24 16:59:50+00:00,2.0,Most stressful online shopping experience,"Honestly, I had purchased on Amazon before and I never had problems with any of my orders. But recently, I decided to purchase shoes on Amazon and I had the most stressful experience. When I ordered my shoes, I kept tracking it and everything was going well and I liked how Amazon always tells you when your shipment will arrive. On the day my shipment was suppose to arrive, i checked my tracking information and it said it was being sent back to seller with no explanation. When I reached out to the seller he explained to me he didn't know why either and that id receive a refud. I was very annoyed and confused but I gave amazon another chance because like I said before, I have had good experiences with Amazon. So I decided to just purchase the same shoes from another seller on Amazon and when I did everything was going well until on the day the shipment was suppose to arrive AGAIN. On this day, I logged on to check my tracking info and it said UPS was unable to deliver my package. I contacted an Amazon Agent and they told me that my address was incomplete and I needed to contact UPS to complete it. Mind you my product was delivered and at a UPS near me. When I contacted UPS to complete my address they told me that it was a huge change of address if I completed it,So UPS told me to contact Amazon to complete the address. when I spoke to another Amazon Agent they said they couldn't complete my address either because the carrier had the product. At this point I'm calling UPS and Amazon back and forth to complete my address and no one can do it. Finally UPS told me I could pick it up at the UPS ware house but I needed an ID. And I couldn't pick it up because I always use a Nickname online shopping. If Amazon could have told me my address was incomplete as soon as I purchased my product, I would not have gone through all of this. That was the most stressful online experience I've ever had at that point I just canceled my order.",2019-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,24.0,1953,374,41,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,honestly purchased amazon never problem order recently decided purchase shoe amazon stressful experience ordered shoe kept tracking everything going well liked amazon always tell shipment arrive day shipment suppose arrive checked tracking information said sent back seller explanation reached seller explained didnt know either id receive refud annoyed confused gave amazon another chance like said good experience amazon decided purchase shoe another seller amazon everything going well day shipment suppose arrive day logged check tracking info said ups unable deliver package contacted amazon agent told address incomplete needed contact ups complete mind product delivered ups near contacted ups complete address told huge change address completed itso ups told contact amazon complete address spoke another amazon agent said couldnt complete address either carrier product point im calling ups amazon back forth complete address one finally ups told could pick ups ware house needed id couldnt pick always use nickname online shopping amazon could told address incomplete soon purchased product would gone stressful online experience ive ever point canceled order,0.016357405057941945,0.9836425949420581,0.20975883342680876,0.4,1.1337730641563908,113.37730641563908,High Trust
Shannon Cecere,/users/5d3879487576c4059428b7ad,US,1.0,2019-07-24 15:29:24+00:00,1.0,I have been an amazon prime member for…,"I have been an amazon prime member for years. Up until a few weeks ago, I have never had an issue with any orders or ever had to contact customer service. I placed an order that was not completely fulfilled from seller. From that point, there was a lot of suspicious activity and emails that did not make sense. I tried to place another order and realized my account was locked. When I called and spoke to a customer service rep, she was friendly at first. As she looked further into my account, she stated that I needed to re-pay for a few items that were being disputed. First of all, why should I ever have to pay again for items that I already paid for. One order was for something I never even ordered, nor was it ever delivered to my home. When I stated that, she was extremely rude and her words when I told her I didnt order it was ""oh yes you did"" I have never experienced such rude customer service. I have been a member for years and have placed orders on a weekly basis. When I asked to speak to the account specialist she said no. When I asked to speak to her supervisor, she said no. When I asked to cancel my account she told me no. They dont cancel accounts. Its a paid membership!!! I should have the option of cancelling. I will never order from Amazon again. I intend on taking this further as well. To be told I can not cancel a paid membership is absurd. The customer service is horrible. So disappointed",2019-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,24.0,1425,273,39,8,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,amazon prime member year week ago never issue order ever contact customer service placed order completely fulfilled seller point lot suspicious activity email make sense tried place another order realized account locked called spoke customer service rep friendly first looked account stated needed repay item disputed first ever pay item already paid one order something never even ordered ever delivered home stated extremely rude word told didnt order oh yes never experienced rude customer service member year placed order weekly basis asked speak account specialist said asked speak supervisor said asked cancel account told dont cancel account paid membership option cancelling never order amazon intend taking well told cancel paid membership absurd customer service horrible disappointed,0.7047023503403206,0.2952976496596794,0.1531127313516545,0.2,0.4782713711001706,47.82713711001706,Low Trust
Chloe,/users/5d383f586614ab730345c608,GB,4.0,2019-07-24 11:22:27+00:00,1.0,No correspondence or help with refund.,"Created a new account to buy items and the account was locked due to an incorrectly entered billing address. Due to this I purchased the items elsewhere. My account has still been charged however I could not request a refund due to my account being locked. I was advised to wait weeks for the items to be sent back to amazon so they could process a refund, and advised an account expert would be in contact to help unlock my account. This was four weeks ago. Despite several phone calls, and promises to have an account expert help unlock my account, I have not received any further correspondence from amazon. I am disgusted that nobody can tell me how they have charged my account, or when I will receive a refund for items that should never have been sent, as the account was locked. Shocking service.",2019-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,24.0,804,146,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,created new account buy item account locked due incorrectly entered billing address due purchased item elsewhere account still charged however could request refund due account locked advised wait week item sent back amazon could process refund advised account expert would contact help unlock account four week ago despite several phone call promise account expert help unlock account received correspondence amazon disgusted nobody tell charged account receive refund item never sent account locked shocking service,0.019525022994355747,0.9804749770056442,0.08188446438586652,0.2,0.8066143813799953,80.66143813799953,High Trust
