Claire Jennings,/users/56fd899b0000ff000a13682d,GB,5.0,2019-07-23 22:04:27+00:00,1.0,It's all well and good until something goes wrong...,"I am so disappointed with Amazon.  Having used them regularly for years we've had our account hacked and a product bought fraudulently.  After much chasing Amazon reluctantly refunded us a week ago but then without warning reversed the refund today, taking the money from us again and are now denying it.  Their ""customer service"" team actually even terminated our chat conversation earlier this evening leaving us over £100 out of pocket.  Appalling way to treat your loyal customers Amazon.",2019-07-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,23.0,492,79,52,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,disappointed amazon used regularly year weve account hacked product bought fraudulently much chasing amazon reluctantly refunded u week ago without warning reversed refund today taking money u denying customer service team actually even terminated chat conversation earlier evening leaving u £ pocket appalling way treat loyal customer amazon,0.035423194449561754,0.9645768055504382,0.0443073471676949,0.2,0.791149872208758,79.1149872208758,High Trust
JJ,/users/56886cb00000ff0001f8d0fd,CA,5.0,2019-07-23 21:00:22+00:00,1.0,steel sprinkler with spike with a bit…,"steel sprinkler with spike with a bit bubble wrap in box...nothing to pretect point or to keep it from moving around.  Took box, placed on tile, sprinkler shifted down and spike end penetrated box and cracked my tile.  I have pics of the sealed box with spike sticking out and video of the box opening to show how poorly packaged.  Amazon offers as lousy $15.  Really, how about negiligence?  I am out over $300 to get a decent tile guy to come back at least 2 times to complete this repair, and hopefully without damaging surounding tiles.  Unbelieve fraudsters Amazon.",2019-07-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,23.0,570,100,38,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,steel sprinkler spike bit bubble wrap boxnothing pretect point keep moving around took box placed tile sprinkler shifted spike end penetrated box cracked tile pic sealed box spike sticking video box opening show poorly packaged amazon offer lousy really negiligence get decent tile guy come back least time complete repair hopefully without damaging surounding tile unbelieve fraudsters amazon,0.015608028629144644,0.9843919713708553,0.056085249579360626,0.2,0.8034130356012998,80.34130356012999,High Trust
