Lisa Tatem,/users/5c51b5c4b364c28f7251f702,US,2.0,2019-07-23 15:42:45+00:00,1.0,Security features are awful and customer service is unprofessional,"So, someone hacked into my amazon account and made fraudulent/unauthorized charges. I contacted Amazon as soon as I realized the purchases had been made via an email notification. I checked my bank statement prior to contact them and one charge had already gone through on my card and the other was pending. The person I spoke to at Amazon, literally called me a LIAR and said NO money had been removed from my account and that both charges were only pending. I again explained I have PROOF the larger amount had already been removed from my account. Rude employees!! Please take your money and spend it somewhere where you're account is safe and they employees value their customers.",2019-07-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,23.0,684,118,66,9,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,someone hacked amazon account made fraudulentunauthorized charge contacted amazon soon realized purchase made via email notification checked bank statement prior contact one charge already gone card pending person spoke amazon literally called liar said money removed account charge pending explained proof larger amount already removed account rude employee please take money spend somewhere youre account safe employee value customer,0.23463668972324886,0.7653633102767512,0.06618059450364554,0.2,0.6959177740391047,69.59177740391047,Medium Trust
Heather Weber,/users/5d37078e6614abe3ab453adf,US,1.0,2019-07-23 13:12:41+00:00,3.0,Issues with online purchases,"Recently, I have been having issues with my orders; receiving items that I did not order, receiving products that do not work (are defective), unable to return purchases, required to pay additional cost for products upon arrival, etc.  As a result, I have been spending too much time following up with Vendors, calling customer service, asking for refunds, and returning items; all defeating the purpose of online shopping.I believe that Amazon should spend more time in qualifying their Vendors.  Online shopping should be straight forward: 1) buy an item 2) receive the item ordered.Very disappointed.",2019-07-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,23.0,603,95,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently issue order receiving item order receiving product work defective unable return purchase required pay additional cost product upon arrival etc result spending much time following vendor calling customer service asking refund returning item defeating purpose online shoppingi believe amazon spend time qualifying vendor online shopping straight forward buy item receive item orderedvery disappointed,0.011414258010374783,0.9885857419896252,0.0532809871003926,0.6,1.404949068414891,140.4949068414891,High Trust
