M.Ranjith Kumar,/users/5d36fa8f6614ab1241453204,IN,1.0,2019-07-23 12:16:24+00:00,1.0,"poor services , customer not satisfied they compromised","i'm orderd LG refrigerator of MAROON colour ., delivery is delay upto five days . then product is got it . when i'm saw the refrigerator colour is BLACK . i'm shocked . amazon say's please retrun it they replaced. but my consern is retrun approvel takes 15 days of time and again new product comes to door after 15 days .. totally 30 days are waiting period . so most of the customers are co compromised. again redmi note 5 (Black) are orderd samething repeted . they delivered gold colour . if you think black colour phone is 11,990 rupees . gold colour phone is 9,900 . customer loose 2000 rupees . again retrun polices are accepted but its time taken process . agai and again customer will be compromised. finally im giving one star for they service.",2019-07-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,23.0,753,139,55,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,im orderd lg refrigerator maroon colour delivery delay upto five day product got im saw refrigerator colour black im shocked amazon say please retrun replaced consern retrun approvel take day time new product come door day totally day waiting period customer co compromised redmi note black orderd samething repeted delivered gold colour think black colour phone rupee gold colour phone customer loose rupee retrun police accepted time taken process agai customer compromised finally im giving one star service,0.013694053325886524,0.9863059466741135,0.07795849691531127,0.2,0.8087446727201191,80.87446727201191,High Trust
