Peter On,/users/5d3611efa3e23831222b8748,US,3.0,2019-07-22 19:46:48+00:00,1.0,"Scammed twice!! First by the fraudster, then by Amazon customer service!!","So story short, somebody (who I don't know well) gave me a fake check of $2000. I used this money to buy Amazon gifts cards (physical cards NOT with my online account) at CVS.I slowly realized that this was a FRAUD. I called my banks and of course I called Amazon.FIRST, I called on THURSDAY. (7/11/2019) FIRST GUY was a man named Jay A. I told him my situation and he told me there was nothing on my account and I should call my bank. I was a bit confused and said ok. Later that day, I realized something: -Why would anything be on my Amazon account? I bought physical amazon cards, took pictures, and send it to this fraudster person, I didn't purchase these Amazon gift cards online. If Jay asked the proper questions he would have asked me to give him the amazon gift card numbers.SECOND CALL. SECOND GUY I talked to was a man name Astrid. I asked him if I could talk to Jay A, the first guy. He sternly told me no and that he would be able to help me. I repeated the same story, answered the same questions. I expressed my frustration and he said ""it's be gonna be okay sir."" 7/15/2019, 4 days later, I check my debit card balance and it's at -$1500 dollars. I call my bank, they said it's too late. Now I call Amazon, again.THIRD CALL, A women picks up to help me. I asked them if I could check the status of my situation. She said she had no information, she could only see the emails exchanged. So I had to retell the same story, again, and answer the same questions, again.FOURTH CALL, Couple days later, a women named Denise picks takes the case. She asks me to send photographs of the amazon gift cards and to provide details of the case. You could probably guess the response I had at this point - I've pretty much given up.Today is 7/22/2019 (~10 days later) and the case is finally closed.They were able to recover $21.",2019-07-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,22.0,1834,348,73,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,story short somebody dont know well gave fake check used money buy amazon gift card physical card online account cvsi slowly realized fraud called bank course called amazonfirst called thursday first guy man named jay told situation told nothing account call bank bit confused said ok later day realized something would anything amazon account bought physical amazon card took picture send fraudster person didnt purchase amazon gift card online jay asked proper question would asked give amazon gift card numberssecond call second guy talked man name astrid asked could talk jay first guy sternly told would able help repeated story answered question expressed frustration said gonna okay sir day later check debit card balance dollar call bank said late call amazon againthird call woman pick help asked could check status situation said information could see email exchanged retell story answer question againfourth call couple day later woman named denise pick take case asks send photograph amazon gift card provide detail case could probably guess response point ive pretty much given uptoday day later case finally closedthey able recover,0.005593875049975646,0.9944061249500243,0.195176668536175,0.2,0.8362383961822472,83.62383961822472,High Trust
Vanessa,/users/5d35e906adcf32590a9aec04,US,4.0,2019-07-22 17:02:10+00:00,3.0,I don't normally order college books…,"I don't normally order college books from amazon because their almost as much as the one I buy from my college. Not only that, sometimes it ships late and I need that book by a certain date.  The books come in undamaged, but that about the only good thing I have to say about them.",2019-07-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,22.0,281,55,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dont normally order college book amazon almost much one buy college sometimes ship late need book certain date book come undamaged good thing say,0.00884919478279793,0.9911508052172021,0.030846887268648347,0.6,1.4017447800623306,140.17447800623307,High Trust
KimAnd Brennan,/users/5d35c641a3e238105a2b52ad,US,5.0,2019-07-22 15:00:58+00:00,1.0,At this point I would very 0 stars if I…,"At this point I would very 0 stars if I could. Me and my Fiancé have spent the past 2 days for over 2 hours at a time on the phone with FedEx and Amazon trying to find our package and no one has been able to help us. FedEx has the package and we got an email stating it was out for delivery on Saturday, so we stay home the whole day. We then got another message Sunday morning stating the driver couldn't deliver because we had moved. We have not moved at all, we have lived at this address for 7 years. We call Amazon back and they just keep telling us there is nothing they can do to help us because the package has already shipped. They tell us to contact FedEx. We call FedEx and they tell us that Amazon is the shipper, so they have to be the ones to help us find and confirm our package and address. There is an east cherry and just a cherry where we live and we explained that to 5 different people at Amazon, but they continue to keep telling us that there is nothing they can do for us. We asked if they can just change they address to another address that we know that package will go to and they stated no we can not do that. We explained how the delivery driver keeps going to the wrong address and we need to change it, so our important and expensive package could be delivered because we need it asap. Again he told us he cant do anything. At this point I am very  p***** off because no one seems to give a crap. I am a Prime member and have been for a very long time, and when I have this happen not just once, but three times, I become overly p***** off and aggravated. The last time Amazon messed up they insured me that they took care of the address problem and it would not happen again. Well here we are yet again. Over the past 2 days we have talked to 5 different people and no one seems to know nothing. We were told yesterday by a guy named Jack at Amazon who was suppose to be a manager that he would call us back on Monday (today) by 9:30 am our time to fix the problem. Here we are right at 11 am and still no call and no information on our package. Amazons customer service is worthless and I am getting very close to just doing away with Amazon Prime because this is bull crap. They should have better costumer service. It is very unprofessional to not help your costumer, then not call them back when you promise to help them find their package. We are very unhappy with the costumer service and their inability to find our package and fix Amazons problem. This is beyond ridicules.",2019-07-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,22.0,2513,495,40,10,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,point would star could fiancé spent past day hour time phone fedex amazon trying find package one able help u fedex package got email stating delivery saturday stay home whole day got another message sunday morning stating driver couldnt deliver moved moved lived address year call amazon back keep telling u nothing help u package already shipped tell u contact fedex call fedex tell u amazon shipper one help u find confirm package address east cherry cherry live explained different people amazon continue keep telling u nothing u asked change address another address know package go stated explained delivery driver keep going wrong address need change important expensive package could delivered need asap told u cant anything point p one seems give crap prime member long time happen three time become overly p aggravated last time amazon messed insured took care address problem would happen well yet past day talked different people one seems know nothing told yesterday guy named jack amazon suppose manager would call u back monday today time fix problem right still call information package amazon customer service worthless getting close away amazon prime bull crap better costumer service unprofessional help costumer call back promise help find package unhappy costumer service inability find package fix amazon problem beyond ridicule,0.007609362975564554,0.9923906370244354,0.2776219854178351,0.2,0.8517197155957847,85.17197155957848,High Trust
