Tim Alan,/users/5d352f7e8c9ca178ebe9c2b2,US,1.0,2019-07-22 03:37:47+00:00,1.0,dont Shop anything digital on weekends.,"Even though amazon coins appear to be a good value, there are some things to consider. Today I ordered 50000 amazon coins. I have been told be several friends that it’s an awesome way to save a few bucks on several things that except amazon coin for payment and you receive your coins quickly. That’s a lie. After 2 hours I reached out via chat to find out why I have yet to receive my coin purchase. I was told that it can take up to 4 hours on digital purchases. Ok. I wait three more hours and reach out via chat again. This guy tells me up to 48 hours.. I expressed my displeasure of being told 4 hours initially, and he recanted and said my mistake, I meant 24 hours. He was unable to explain why, so I asked for a supervisor to explain why.. then I received an email apologizing for taking more than 4 hours, but they had been unable to authorize my card, and I should contact my back, or provide another form of payment. I contacted Chase bank who informs me that Amazon has not even attempted to authorize my card.. finally the guy I had on chat asks for my phone number to have a supervisor call me. After 5 or 6 mins, he tells me that he is unable to complete the call an provides a number for me to call. After another ten mins on hold I get another guy that can’t answer any questions, but did let me know that the department that deals with digital purchases is actually closed on weekend and I can’t really talk to anyone that can help anyway.. sooooo. Don’t buy digital products of any kind on weekends seems to be the moral of this story. Bottom line is that being a loyal amazon customer as well as a prime member doesn’t seem to mean anything on a weekend.",2019-07-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,22.0,1674,324,39,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,even though amazon coin appear good value thing consider today ordered amazon coin told several friend it’s awesome way save buck several thing except amazon coin payment receive coin quickly that’s lie hour reached via chat find yet receive coin purchase told take hour digital purchase ok wait three hour reach via chat guy tell hour expressed displeasure told hour initially recanted said mistake meant hour unable explain asked supervisor explain received email apologizing taking hour unable authorize card contact back provide another form payment contacted chase bank informs amazon even attempted authorize card finally guy chat asks phone number supervisor call min tell unable complete call provides number call another ten min hold get another guy can’t answer question let know department deal digital purchase actually closed weekend can’t really talk anyone help anyway sooooo don’t buy digital product kind weekend seems moral story bottom line loyal amazon customer well prime member doesn’t seem mean anything weekend,0.009104082154028949,0.9908959178459711,0.18171620863712842,0.2,0.8317912006504111,83.17912006504112,High Trust
Sandra Cole,/users/5d351c80a0b0aa0e1563f784,US,2.0,2019-07-22 02:16:53+00:00,1.0,I have always shopped with Amazon,"I have always shopped with Amazon. But for them to text me 3 and 4 times a day is really too much. I didn't give them my information to be harassed. I will no longer shop with Amazon,  it's just the principal of respect. I can't even sleep without my notifications sounding off with a message from them. I leave my phone on for family emergencies. I wish I never trusted them with my information. Good bye nuisance company.",2019-07-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,22.0,423,79,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,always shopped amazon text time day really much didnt give information harassed longer shop amazon principal respect cant even sleep without notification sounding message leave phone family emergency wish never trusted information good bye nuisance company,0.01243914208265563,0.9875608579173444,0.0443073471676949,0.2,0.8026418983922111,80.26418983922112,High Trust
