Ariane Portal,/users/5d34ad37a0b0aacc7963df5d,US,1.0,2019-07-21 18:21:45+00:00,1.0,Worst customer service ever,"I ordered a massage chair on Amazon Prime day which was fulfilled by amazon, with a specific delivery date and time. The date came and went, it apparently hasn’t left the warehouse yet, spoke to many different customer service agents and got different vague answers by each of them. Some say that I will get an email to confirm the delivery date, some say that it’s out of stock. Nobody seems to really know anything about it. Worst customer service I’ve ever experienced, considering that I’ve been a Prime member for years!",2019-07-21 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,21.0,525,92,27,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered massage chair amazon prime day fulfilled amazon specific delivery date time date came went apparently hasn’t left warehouse yet spoke many different customer service agent got different vague answer say get email confirm delivery date say it’s stock nobody seems really know anything worst customer service i’ve ever experienced considering i’ve prime member year,0.04884498928600278,0.9511550107139972,0.051598429613011774,0.2,0.785897191279601,78.5897191279601,High Trust
