Leigh,/users/562eacb30000ff0001e5e0d5,US,2.0,2019-07-16 18:19:01+00:00,1.0,Disappointed in Amazon,"I have been an Amazon customer for years. I have never had a problem until today.I received an email that my order had shipped. Unfortunately, I hadn’t ordered anything. I contacted Amazon to tell them that they had charged me for something I didn’t order.The first representative spoke such broken English that I had to ask for someone else. That representative told me they were sorry, they would contact the seller and when and if they heard back from them, they would issue a refund. I told her that wasn’t good enough, and she argued with me. I asked for a supervisor, who told me the same thing. When I told the supervisor I would cancel my account over this, he transferred me to the our-of-country seller, where no one spoke English. I call back and asked for a supervisor. I had to ask for a second one because the first one barely spoke English. This one told me to call my bank.I called a third time. This time, the supervisor finally said she would reverse the charge, but due to her very poor English skills, she was telling me she would reverse it in ten days when, after about ten minutes of asking every simple way I knew how, I determined she meant she was reversing the charge immediately but my bank might take ten days to process it.I am a pretty tolerant person, but when I call customer service from the USA, I want to speak with someone speaking coherent English. I have also NEVER before had Amazon refuse to make something good immediately. I should not have had to have spent an hour trying to recoup funds for something I didn’t order. I never order from third party sellers, and certainly not from a seller that is out of the country. They could have verified that by looking at the hundreds of purchases I’ve made from them over the past ten years. I asked fo a phone number to the corporate office; unfortunately, they don’t speak to customers. I’m so disappointed in what has been my go-to company for years.",2019-07-16 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,16.0,1939,353,22,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer year never problem todayi received email order shipped unfortunately hadn’t ordered anything contacted amazon tell charged something didn’t orderthe first representative spoke broken english ask someone else representative told sorry would contact seller heard back would issue refund told wasn’t good enough argued asked supervisor told thing told supervisor would cancel account transferred ourofcountry seller one spoke english call back asked supervisor ask second one first one barely spoke english one told call banki called third time time supervisor finally said would reverse charge due poor english skill telling would reverse ten day ten minute asking every simple way knew determined meant reversing charge immediately bank might take ten day process iti pretty tolerant person call customer service usa want speak someone speaking coherent english also never amazon refuse make something good immediately spent hour trying recoup fund something didn’t order never order third party seller certainly seller country could verified looking hundred purchase i’ve made past ten year asked fo phone number corporate office unfortunately don’t speak customer i’m disappointed goto company year,0.007674956830966197,0.9923250431690338,0.19798093101514302,0.2,0.8357587077875456,83.57587077875456,High Trust
