Sara,/users/5d2ca361a4257a815e9c1034,US,2.0,2019-07-15 16:01:39+00:00,2.0,"Received a new, undamaged item--Such a rare occurrence","I have reviewed amazon at a 1 star level on other sites for multiple deliveries of used, dirty, opened, and damaged items.  Today, for probably the first time in months (since I stopped buying from them), I received a brand new, unopened, undamaged item.  It's a shame that getting one good delivery out of over 15, prompts me to be so pleased I write a review at a two star rating.  On the negative side, despite me checkmarking that I did not ""free, fast shipping,"" they signed me up for prime anyway.  So I had to waste my time going in to cancel it.  I did not renew prime last years after all the bad service and I haven't missed it for even one minute.",2019-07-15 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,15.0,658,125,54,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,reviewed amazon star level site multiple delivery used dirty opened damaged item today probably first time month since stopped buying received brand new unopened undamaged item shame getting one good delivery prompt pleased write review two star rating negative side despite checkmarking free fast shipping signed prime anyway waste time going cancel renew prime last year bad service havent missed even one minute,0.021276331949645826,0.9787236680503542,0.07010656197420079,0.4,1.1033831464200172,110.33831464200172,High Trust
