Ben Douglas,/users/5d250234aa34eb48bb693e80,US,1.0,2019-07-09 21:18:07+00:00,1.0,Amazon hijacks your money,"Apparently Amazon has adopted a sneaky way to perpetuate business when it comes to your refunds. If you decide to return an item you are given the option to ""Refund to your Amazon account"", What they don't tell you is that it does not go back as a credit to your Amazon credit card through Chase Card Services. Instead it goes to something called gift card through Amazon. When this happens you cannot do anything with that return credit except for buy more items from Amazon. The forward-thinking is that when you decide to make a purchase be highly cautious as to what method of payment you're going to select. Do not select gift card, they make it sound as though it is something that you were awarded, instead it locks you into a gift card to only purchase future items and does not allow you to refund for credit to your credit card. It is a complete scam. It is a huge sales tactic, it is a trap. Sure there is a highlighted radio button labeled ""WHY"", the verbage used is that it indicates that your return is quicker than waiting for it to go back to your credit card. Therefore Amazon traps you into HIJACKING YOUR MONEY to purchase more product rather than allowing you to receive a credit back on your Amazon credit card. Amazon and Chase credit card services is going to tell you this is not true.  Sure they give you a choice  at the time of purchase only .  Do not misconstrue this  with  using  your credit card . If you elect to purchase through gift card you are stuck  and have no recourse . I think this is very shady and underhanded business, they are going to retort and say all the legal words and terms are laid out but if you go to the section of your Amazon account when making a return take a look at the words carefully. When it says refund to your account it does not mean back on your credit card. It means is going to be refunded to a gift card. Once this happens you have no further recourse to remove it from a gift card and to apply it back as a credit to your Chase Card Services Credit Card. I feel that Chase Card Services is also one of the bad guys Co siding with Amazon in this trickery a words. Subscriber and buyer be Aware that Amazon and Chase credit card services are doing just that to us.",2019-07-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,9.0,2234,425,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,apparently amazon adopted sneaky way perpetuate business come refund decide return item given option refund amazon account dont tell go back credit amazon credit card chase card service instead go something called gift card amazon happens cannot anything return credit except buy item amazon forwardthinking decide make purchase highly cautious method payment youre going select select gift card make sound though something awarded instead lock gift card purchase future item allow refund credit credit card complete scam huge sale tactic trap sure highlighted radio button labeled verbage used indicates return quicker waiting go back credit card therefore amazon trap hijacking money purchase product rather allowing receive credit back amazon credit card amazon chase credit card service going tell true sure give choice time purchase misconstrue using credit card elect purchase gift card stuck recourse think shady underhanded business going retort say legal word term laid go section amazon account making return take look word carefully say refund account mean back credit card mean going refunded gift card happens recourse remove gift card apply back credit chase card service credit card feel chase card service also one bad guy co siding amazon trickery word subscriber buyer aware amazon chase credit card service u,0.017447151686493363,0.9825528483135066,0.23836231071228267,0.2,0.8389488862992099,83.894888629921,High Trust
