D. S.,/users/5d221cb4310339cce65bd497,US,3.0,2019-07-07 16:24:22+00:00,1.0,Guaranteed delivery is a lie.,"Amazon has no problem collecting payment for prime shipping but they do have a problem honoring the guaranteed delivery. As the price of prime as gone up, the delivery times have been extended. Used to be able to count on two day delivery, now you are lucky to have your order in 4 or 5 days. For the second time in 10 days, my order is late by 4 days. Ordered on the 1st, now expected on the 8th. Spoke with customer service on the 5th..the guaranteed delivery date and they “ assured me” my order would be delivered by 8 p.m.. I assured them that it was impossible since the tracking said the item was in Kentucky and I live in Massachusetts . A second customer service rep also put me on hold to check and told me it would arrive Monday, the 8th. When I told him what the first rep said about delivery on the fifth, he double checked and then changed his answer also assuring me an on time delivery of the 5th. Needless to say, the item never arrived and now says delivery on the 9th.. I’m expecting to just dispute it with my credit card.  Huge disappointment. Can’t count on receiving items on time anymore.",2019-07-07 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,7.0,1112,211,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon problem collecting payment prime shipping problem honoring guaranteed delivery price prime gone delivery time extended used able count two day delivery lucky order day second time day order late day ordered st expected th spoke customer service ththe guaranteed delivery date “ assured me” order would delivered pm assured impossible since tracking said item kentucky live massachusetts second customer service rep also put hold check told would arrive monday th told first rep said delivery fifth double checked changed answer also assuring time delivery th needless say item never arrived say delivery th i’m expecting dispute credit card huge disappointment can’t count receiving item time anymore,0.006738392612383997,0.993261607387616,0.11833987661245092,0.2,0.8202987790162982,82.02987790162982,High Trust
