Deborah Beale,/users/5641f95a0000ff0001e99ec9,GB,4.0,2019-07-03 10:33:02+00:00,5.0,Being I have just made a review on John…,"Being I have just made a review on John Lewis and Partners, I would like to take this oppurtinty to review Amazon when an electrical appliance had gone wrong.The customer service from Amazon was excellent and the appliance was replaced with no hassle as it was just under a year old and under guarantee .This is not the case with John Lewis , the hassle and the cost of phone calls and time to sort out something that doesn't work after 6 weeks is appalling. John Lewis refuses refunds or replacements for non useable products.Amazon wins every time.",2019-07-03 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,3.0,550,98,40,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,made review john lewis partner would like take oppurtinty review amazon electrical appliance gone wrongthe customer service amazon excellent appliance replaced hassle year old guarantee case john lewis hassle cost phone call time sort something doesnt work week appalling john lewis refuse refund replacement non useable productsamazon win every time,0.04895286460720288,0.9510471353927972,0.054963544587773416,1.0,1.9865162766139535,198.65162766139534,High Trust
rob hammer,/users/52960a6f000064000156efeb,US,10.0,2019-07-03 03:18:20+00:00,1.0,I am beyond Furious with amazon,I am beyond furious with the Amazon I pay a lot of money for prime and everytime they guarantee a package to be delivered and yet I've had six packages stolen they told me I was getting a guaranteed delivery tonight by 9 before I was going away from vacation it's already 11:15 no package I am beyond just disgusted with Amazon already. their customer service Representatives have no idea what they're talkin about have spoken to multiple managers nobody can tell me where my package is all they can say it's coming it was supposed to be guaranteed delivered on Monday at 9 p.m. now it's not coming till July 4th or 5th ridiculous what's the point of two day and one day shipping and I pay extra for and they don't even offer a solution,2019-07-03 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,3.0,736,137,31,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,beyond furious amazon pay lot money prime everytime guarantee package delivered yet ive six package stolen told getting guaranteed delivery tonight going away vacation already package beyond disgusted amazon already customer service representative idea theyre talkin spoken multiple manager nobody tell package say coming supposed guaranteed delivered monday pm coming till july th th ridiculous whats point two day one day shipping pay extra dont even offer solution,0.03379930788804776,0.9662006921119523,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.7984677044407209,79.84677044407209,High Trust
Miracles Happen,/users/5d1be9393fc1c89cd83923ed,US,1.0,2019-07-02 23:49:16+00:00,5.0,I have been an Amazon/prime shopper for…more years than I can count!,"I have been an Amazon/prime shopper for years and YEARS and then some.  A bazillion dollar company doesn't need little guy reviews. It will not make or break them at all.  When something is horrible, we all race to our puters to leave BAD reviews, I know, I am one of those people and I call em like I see em! FAST.  But when something is good, we often forget to give those shout outs.Amazon might as well be a family member for as often as I am ordering things and boxes showing up at my door.  Little things, BIG THINGS, VERY high dollar things, lots of low to mid dollar things, household things, and even food.Have I had counterfeit items. YES.  I have a have items not arrive, rarely but yes!  Have I gotten broken items, you betcha?  Have I gotten items not nearly as described! Uh huh.  Not that often but every single time I contacted customer service via chat for starters.  At first I would always get someone in India or the phillipines and I was thinking to myself ....oh Lawd, here we go, they are not going to understand me the loud-mouthed American, this will not have a happy ending, etc.  BOY WAS I WRONG and quick to misjudge.  These people are SO NICE and the way customer service SHOULD be!  They always, and usually through chat only, resolve whatever my problem is, be it a replacement, a refund and I REALLY feel that their apologies are sincere.(and I am cynical too)  In one case I did have to go through 3 reps to get resolution but that was the only time.  I have also spoken to their customer service on the phone and again, no matter who I speak to, no matter their race or country-problem gets resolved-FAST.I also am an online shopper of many other places.  Think along the lines of HSN, WALMART, CHEWY etc.  If I have a problem with one of those places, OMG its a hair pulling NIGHTMARE to get it fixed, be it a replacement or refund.So IMHO and from my years of experience with Amazon, I want to say THANK YOU for having the BEST CUSTOMER SERVICE on the PLANET!  Other companies need to learn from you.",2019-07-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,2.0,2036,378,68,12,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,amazonprime shopper year year bazillion dollar company doesnt need little guy review make break something horrible race puters leave bad review know one people call em like see em fast something good often forget give shout outsamazon might well family member often ordering thing box showing door little thing big thing high dollar thing lot low mid dollar thing household thing even foodhave counterfeit item yes item arrive rarely yes gotten broken item betcha gotten item nearly described uh huh often every single time contacted customer service via chat starter first would always get someone india phillipines thinking oh lawd go going understand loudmouthed american happy ending etc boy wrong quick misjudge people nice way customer service always usually chat resolve whatever problem replacement refund really feel apology sincereand cynical one case go rep get resolution time also spoken customer service phone matter speak matter race countryproblem get resolvedfasti also online shopper many place think along line hsn walmart chewy etc problem one place omg hair pulling nightmare get fixed replacement refundso imho year experience amazon want say thank best customer service planet company need learn,0.9342762590044781,0.06572374099552192,0.21200224340998317,1.0,1.5752623191797577,157.52623191797576,High Trust
