Michael Agneta,/users/5d1b515b40bca63196ac359c,US,1.0,2019-07-02 14:09:02+00:00,1.0,Ordered two items,"Ordered two items, ten minutes later cancelled one item reason; made in error. Customer rep said ohhh too late already shipped; check with shipper NOT TRUE. AMAZON REP. A LIAR. This is a 50 year old trick to see if the item ""sticks"" or customer doesn't send it back. Amazon said; Oh just tell shipper to return to us. Shipper FedEx dropped item without ringing doorbell, we were waiting, $554 item. Now, I have to pull teeth to return the item via UPS. Amazon ""oh you cannot leave item NO UNATTENDED RETURNS, Amazon failed to give shipping confirmation for return which is required to find out when shipper will pick up item, another pull teeth nightmare with Amazon getting proper number. Call UPS yourself, your told, then I call UPS they said NO SUCH RULE regarding unattended item return just leave a note and we will get the item back to Amazon. AMAZON HAS BECOME A LIE BY OMISSION COMPANY BE VERY CAUTIOUS IN DOING BUSINESS HERE.",2019-07-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,2.0,935,167,17,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered two item ten minute later cancelled one item reason made error customer rep said ohhh late already shipped check shipper true amazon rep liar year old trick see item stick customer doesnt send back amazon said oh tell shipper return u shipper fedex dropped item without ringing doorbell waiting item pull teeth return item via ups amazon oh cannot leave item unattended return amazon failed give shipping confirmation return required find shipper pick item another pull teeth nightmare amazon getting proper number call ups told call ups said rule regarding unattended item return leave note get item back amazon amazon become lie omission company cautious business,0.01862838504204775,0.9813716149579522,0.09366236679753225,0.2,0.8094182808384826,80.94182808384825,High Trust
