Emma,/users/58ada4ea0000ff000a7a4dff,GB,14.0,2019-07-02 10:53:42+00:00,2.0,Item damaged in transit,"Ordered a toy which was a gift, was told that the item would be delivered today. No notifications received so checked the tracking and delivery company state damaged in transit and returned to sender. I then had to contact Amazon myself to get the issue resolved. Called just after 8am this morning, call handler said she needed more time to look into it and would call back within 15 mins. I got sick of waiting so used live chat, not very customer friendly either so asked them to cancel the order in full and refund me as only option given was to reorder the item and then they would refund when original was returned to them by the courier, I of course wasn’t happy laying out the money again. They offered a £5 credit to my account as a gesture of goodwill but I really don’t think this is good enough, taking into account the amount of time I have wasted today contacting them and also the inconvenience of now having to source the item elsewhere and also having to wait for my refund. Rubbish service.",2019-07-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,2.0,1008,186,23,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered toy gift told item would delivered today notification received checked tracking delivery company state damaged transit returned sender contact amazon get issue resolved called morning call handler said needed time look would call back within min got sick waiting used live chat customer friendly either asked cancel order full refund option given reorder item would refund original returned courier course wasn’t happy laying money offered £ credit account gesture goodwill really don’t think good enough taking account amount time wasted today contacting also inconvenience source item elsewhere also wait refund rubbish service,0.01895130709476406,0.981048692905236,0.10431856421761077,0.4,1.11138805929614,111.13880592961401,High Trust
Dana,/users/5c11bb7f6b8fe6404a8f2750,US,5.0,2019-07-02 10:12:53+00:00,3.0,"Products are great, shipping, not so good","Products are great, not a single problem with anything I’ve purchased from them. Delivery of merchandise, however, is very disappointing. They’re two day delivery sometimes turns into more than a week. They’re package tracker is just a plain outright lie. They really need to be more honest about there shipping practices, the ONLY thing the “prime” membership saves you is the $20.00 shipping cost. Some independent stores will get your merchandise to you in two days but I don’t think the Amazon store itself cares when you get your orders.",2019-07-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,2.0,542,90,41,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,product great single problem anything i’ve purchased delivery merchandise however disappointing they’re two day delivery sometimes turn week they’re package tracker plain outright lie really need honest shipping practice thing “prime” membership save shipping cost independent store get merchandise two day don’t think amazon store care get order,0.017766555180298432,0.9822334448197015,0.050476724621424565,0.6,1.4012120673341355,140.12120673341354,High Trust
Mohammed Shahin,/users/5d1af86c97935f5064d803df,EG,2.0,2019-07-02 06:26:58+00:00,1.0,"Good device, terrible customer service","First of all the device is working well until now Except it's going too hot on Linux (Amazon technical representative told they will contact me for this issue but they didn't), I've used it for approx 1 month for software development (I'veen't tested gaming on it yet).The bad review because of how Gigabyte and Amazon dealt with me after I purchased the device with a promotion stated on the title (Free RAM) without warning that the promotion is only for US and Canada residents only.For me as an International shopper, I've been fooled by both Gigabyte and Amazon as Both refused to give me the promotion even it's their fault, not mine.Amazon always tells please contact the manufacturer.The manufacturer ""Gigabyte"" responds first time after two weeks to provide them with details which I've provided already alongside with my invoice, then after resubmitting the same information, they replied again after another two weeks that the promotion is for US and Canada resident only!!!!   Really???!!For Gigabyte and their worst support I've ever seen, I'm not going to purchase their products again of course.I'm not happy at all with my purchase, As I hate to be fooled this way by both the companies.But, unfortunately, I can't return the device because I need it for my work, and also because it's pain to return an international shipped item.The first time to deal with Amazon and the worst experience I've ever had with online shopping as they fooled me with the promotion and not follow up with my technical issues.",2019-07-02 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,2.0,1522,255,38,5,0.0,0,6,2,1,Suspicious,first device working well except going hot linux amazon technical representative told contact issue didnt ive used approx month software development iveent tested gaming yetthe bad review gigabyte amazon dealt purchased device promotion stated title free ram without wa