Alex,/users/5d1a89d59a289370e5280f13,US,1.0,2019-07-01 22:31:51+00:00,1.0,Amazon used to be a great place…,"Amazon used to be a great place with great deals. Unfortunately that is no longer the case. they had low prices at first and shut down soo many franchises after they did that, they raised prices and not only that, they try to squeeze more money from customers. They take days/weeks when you check out with free shipping (only available if you spend more than 50$) and they conveniently have a "" change shipping speed button"" for an x amount of dollars more they are going to do what they are supposed to do, that is, ship products out in a timely manner. If you, much like myself, thought amazon was a place where you can get other people's opinions on items you want to purchase, then you're out of luck. They don't allow you to share honest opinions. If you have nothing nice to say about the product then you go against ""community guidelines"" and you aren't allowed to write anymore reviews forever making it virtually impossible to get honest reviews. which is INSANE. If amazon was sending me free stuff to write reviews about, I'd feel more obligated to give a positive review and turn a blind eye to the cons. Amazon is becoming too powerful at the expense of the buyers and the sellers. I will NOT being buying anything from amazon ever again. What a shame, good at first and slowly take a turn for the worse appears to be a reacquiring theme.",2019-07-01 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,1.0,1351,247,32,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon used great place great deal unfortunately longer case low price first shut soo many franchise raised price try squeeze money customer take daysweeks check free shipping available spend conveniently change shipping speed button x amount dollar going supposed ship product timely manner much like thought amazon place get people opinion item want purchase youre luck dont allow share honest opinion nothing nice say product go community guideline arent allowed write anymore review forever making virtually impossible get honest review insane amazon sending free stuff write review id feel obligated give positive review turn blind eye con amazon becoming powerful expense buyer seller buying anything amazon ever shame good first slowly take turn worse appears reacquiring theme,0.0071265297984287705,0.9928734702015712,0.13853056646102074,0.2,0.8241428483929898,82.41428483929897,High Trust
Emily Gaskill,/users/5d1a4689be59e89771e01172,US,3.0,2019-07-01 17:44:49+00:00,5.0,Customer Service Gentleman (Nathaniel) Was Amazing!!,"My name is Emily. I spent 4 hours on the phone arguing with UPS because they refused to pick up their package that was going back to Amazon. The UPS woman and the Customer Service woman neglected to even try and help me for 4 hours. One phone call with this amazing guy named Nathaniel he helped me out by being able to get me my full refund back and to make sure that UPS actually grabbed all their packages this time. He was extremely nice about the whole situation and he deserves a raise for sure for helping me out with such a ridiculous situation that had nothing to do with the company he works for. UPS and their Customer Service is AWFUL and honestly I love Amazon their great and their Customer Service is always amazing, thank you guys for your help!",2019-07-01 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,1.0,761,144,52,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,name emily spent hour phone arguing ups refused pick package going back amazon ups woman customer service woman neglected even try help hour one phone call amazing guy named nathaniel helped able get full refund back make sure ups actually grabbed package time extremely nice whole situation deserves raise sure helping ridiculous situation nothing company work ups customer service awful honestly love amazon great customer service always amazing thank guy help,0.19716103935255136,0.8028389606474486,0.08076275939427931,1.0,1.9175720322025802,191.75720322025802,High Trust
Matthew Hall,/users/5d1a1de697935f2247d79b0d,US,5.0,2019-07-01 15:02:05+00:00,1.0,amazon vendor account balance has been reduced to -318 canada dollars,"amazon'da seller 9 months ago I received ip notification and my account has been suspended.I sent Amazon's billing and authorization documents to seller-performance and did not accept them.The rest of the 318 canadian dollars confiscated my money and said that he would wait 90 days and then pay the balance. After 6 months, he did not pay my balance. In this process, the balance appeared to be 0.On June 27, 2019, my balance appeared as -318 Canadian dollars and I was charged. I have a $ 1390 balance in my account in the USA that was reset fortunately did not fall to the minus. My 1390 dollar balance was not paid even after 6 months.Amazon has been unable to solve the problem for months.",2019-07-01 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,7.0,1.0,694,124,69,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazonda seller month ago received ip notification account suspendedi sent amazon billing authorization document sellerperformance accept themthe rest canadian dollar confiscated money said would wait day pay balance month pay balance process balance appeared june balance appeared canadian dollar charged balance account usa reset fortunately fall minus dollar balance paid even monthsamazon unable solve problem month,0.024798894333986254,0.9752011056660137,0.06954570947840717,0.2,0.8015096947286883,80.15096947286882,High Trust
