Emmy K,/users/5d19408ca9030c67552b4431,US,1.0,2019-06-30 23:08:39+00:00,5.0,I love Amazon,"I've first purchased from Amazon in '02, my orders at that point were infrequent and sporadic through the next 10 years, when my kids were very young. However, I became an Amazon Prime member in 2014, and at that point, I started ordering all the time, multiple packages a week, of stuff for myself, my kids, my husband, etc, and started using the same day delivery service all the time. I don't know if there's anywhere that numbers are complied, but I can safely say that I ordered over 100 items through same day delivery, split into dozens of orders. I have been so impressed with Amazon and their ability to keep up with this. I had orders put in by noon, that arrived by 4pm that day, even though it says it will arrive by 9pm. With the thousands of orders they get every day, the reliability and efficiency is unbelievable. No system is perfect, but with the large amount of things I've ordered, I can think of maybe 2 or 3 times that something didn't show up on time, that came maybe a day or two later. This is even with the same day items.A couple years ago, I was staying at my Mom's house, and she lived in a neighborhood that was part of the Prime Now delivery area. I used the Prime Now 1 hour delivery service, and the two hour free delivery, and I made at least 30 of these orders, and never once were they late or incomplete. The selection is limited, as are the delivery areas, but the variety of things they can deliver to your door are really impressive. I've had groceries, household items, sweatpants, t-shirts, work pants and socks for my husband, toiletries, rain boots and various clothes for my kids, cleaning supplies, gifts, etc, all delivered within less than an hour. I now live in the suburbs, out of the Prime Now area, but I still use the same day delivery. The free delivery, even with a short window of two days, isn't something you find everywhere.Nothing is perfect, but the reliability of my deliveries, and the accuracy and good condition of the items, has been about 98%, in the many years, and many, MANY orders. I see a lot of complaints about Amazon, and I just wanted to put in my experience, as some of the complaints are from people who have only used Amazon a couple times, and had a later arrival, or a problem with their order, which is unfortunate, but in a huge operation, there are bound to be flaws, but overall, they offer a service which was previously not available. Also, I get frustrated when I see complaints directed at Amazon, when the order was through a third party, and the both the product and delivery were through another supplier, but the person ordering it didn't even bother to pay attention to this.Bottom line, I'm appreciative of Amazon, and they have definitely been useful to me, and I've gotten my Prime membership fee back many times over, with as many times as I've used the same day, one day, and two day free delivery.",2019-06-30 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,30.0,2898,529,13,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive first purchased amazon order point infrequent sporadic next year kid young however became amazon prime member point started ordering time multiple package week stuff kid husband etc started using day delivery service time dont know there anywhere number complied safely say ordered item day delivery split dozen order impressed amazon ability keep order put noon arrived pm day even though say arrive pm thousand order get every day reliability efficiency unbelievable system perfect large amount thing ive ordered think maybe time something didnt show time came maybe day two later even day itemsa couple year ago staying mom house lived neighborhood part prime delivery area used prime hour delivery service two hour free delivery made least order never late incomplete selection limited delivery area variety thing deliver door really impressive ive grocery household item sweatpants tshirts work pant sock husband toiletry rain boot various clothes kid cleaning supply gift etc delivered within less hour live suburb prime area still use day delivery free delivery even short window two day isnt something find everywherenothing perfect reliability delivery accuracy good condition item many year many many order see lot complaint amazon wanted put experience complaint people used amazon couple time later arrival problem order unfortunate huge operation bound flaw overall offer service previously available also get frustrated see complaint directed amazon order third party product delivery another supplier person ordering didnt even bother pay attention thisbottom line im appreciative amazon definitely useful ive gotten prime membership fee back many time many time ive used day one day two day free delivery,0.001838684573847642,0.9981613154261524,0.2966909702748177,1.0,2.0584188517680397,205.84188517680397,High Trust
