Eduardo Cruz,/users/5c8bb5e9e38f494267746383,MX,4.0,2019-06-30 20:19:03+00:00,1.0,Account on Hold. No notification. No explanation. Keep charging Prime Subscription,"My account had been put on hold for the last 15 days. I was not notified. I contacted support several times (3x) to understand what is going on, gave all information requested, was informed that someone would get back to me within 24h, which has not happened.I am an Amazon Prime member, and they also keep billing my credit card without giving me access to my account!?!",2019-06-30 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,30.0,371,67,82,11,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,account put hold last day notified contacted support several time x understand going gave information requested informed someone would get back within h happenedi amazon prime member also keep billing credit card without giving access account,0.1564140119387056,0.8435859880612944,0.03757711721817162,0.2,0.7293084174742814,72.93084174742815,Medium Trust
James,/users/5d18bf95a9030ce4e32b10a1,US,2.0,2019-06-30 13:56:40+00:00,1.0,"Poor customer service, falsified shipping guarantees","I placed an order nine days ago for a computer case. It was supposed to arrive Wednesday the 26th. After tracking it that evening I realized something wasn't right. So I began contacting Amazon. Several representatives assured me it would be here Friday June 28th. One representative Akshay J, even went as far as to tell me she was on the phone with UPS. That they had the package and it would be here that Friday. So Friday rolls around, still no updates. By end of day we contacted support again. This time, the representative was much more helpful, didn't lie about the situation, and stated that in fact UPS had no idea where the package was, it was ""lost in transit"". So we got a refund for that order. Placed a second order that Friday with the guarantee of Sunday June 30th deliver. Well here I sit with a notification that in fact it will be tomorrow before my case arrives. All customer support could say was ""But USPS don't deliver every Sundays"". This was literally one of my first purchases from Amazon, has literally been the worst online shopping experiences I have ever had. I will never use any Amazon services again. I do not appreciate being lied to just so a customer support representative can close out their tickets. Absolutely terrible experience. After the first mess up I should have went with another company.",2019-06-30 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,30.0,1336,237,52,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order nine day ago computer case supposed arrive wednesday th tracking evening realized something wasnt right began contacting amazon several representative assured would friday june th one representative akshay j even went far tell phone ups package would friday friday roll around still update end day contacted support time representative much helpful didnt lie situation stated fact ups idea package lost transit got refund order placed second order friday guarantee sunday june th deliver well sit notification fact tomorrow case arrives customer support could say usps dont deliver every sunday literally one first purchase amazon literally worst online shopping experience ever never use amazon service appreciate lied customer support representative close ticket absolutely terrible experience first mess went another company,0.008220285556775503,0.9917797144432245,0.13292204150308468,0.2,0.8224742655222291,82.24742655222292,High Trust
Daniela,/users/5a05f5bd0000ff000ae0f655,US,4.0,2019-06-29 22:32:07+00:00,1.0,Can I give -1000 stars?,"I don’t understand why I can’t get in touch with CS in the US for over 1 week. Before it was just a breeze to speak with someone and to have your issues resolved. Anyway for 1 week I have been dealing with a misdelivered package and I have spoken with people around the world. They have 0 understanding of what I’m describing - keep saying the same things. Nobody can resolve my problem or get in touch with the US Logistics like before. Why bother with Amazon? For my needs I can use Target subscription and never have this problem again as Target is next door. Goodbye Amazon! Thanks to your abysmal CS, Target gets a new customer.",2019-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,29.0,633,119,23,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,don’t understand can’t get touch c u week breeze speak someone issue resolved anyway week dealing misdelivered package spoken people around world understanding i’m describing keep saying thing nobody resolve problem get touch u logistics like bother amazon need use target subscription never problem target next door goodbye amazon thanks abysmal c target get new customer,0.09383900486117609,0.9061609951388239,0.06674144699943915,0.2,0.7664287869692997,76.64287869692997,High Trust
qwerty 489,/users/5d1797ebbe59e83385df00ed,RU,1.0,2019-06-29 16:55:14+00:00,1.0,Outrageous attitude of account…,"Outrageous attitude of account specialists!At first I couldn't log in to my account, i couldn't restore the password so I had to create a new account. I created an order, the order was accepted, but the next day I receive a letter from some account specialist that I violated some conditions, my current and old accounts were deleted, and the order was canceled. Prior to that, orders were made from the old account, no problems and no reports that I had violated something. For some reason right now they decided to block my account without any explanation of the reasons. To my questions about why my account was blocked, I received a letter with a vague answer from an incompetent account specialist who didn't even introduce himself. To my request to substantiate the answer and give a link to these terms, I received a rude reply that my requests would not be considered. Well, if Amazon believes that such customer treatment is acceptable, I am very glad that I am not their customer any more.",2019-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,29.0,999,175,31,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,outrageous attitude account specialistsat first couldnt log account couldnt restore password create new account created order order accepted next day receive letter account specialist violated condition current old account deleted order canceled prior order made old account problem report violated something reason right decided block account without explanation reason question account blocked received letter vague answer incompetent account specialist didnt even introduce request substantiate answer give link term received rude reply request would considered well amazon belief customer treatment acceptable glad customer,0.059005521324297025,0.940994478675703,0.0981491867638811,0.2,0.7901270766906278,79.01270766906278,High Trust
Marty Mcfly,/users/5d178465a9030c36552abe1c,US,2.0,2019-06-29 15:48:10+00:00,4.0,Great and reliable (prime),"Amazon Prime is one of the main reasons I rarely ever step foot in a store anymore. The only thing I wouldn’t recommend getting from amazon is clothing as it never seems to be as described on the website. But for electronics and media it’s excellent. My most recent order was the Arnold Schwarzenegger movie “Commando” on Blu-Ray which was less than $10 and had one day shipping. Amazon Prime has really good shipping times but when it comes to one day shipping in the past it would usually come the day after the expected delivery date, but it was actually correct this time. It can be very questionable sometimes how amazon is able to ship their items so quickly.",2019-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,29.0,665,120,26,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime one main reason rarely ever step foot store anymore thing wouldn’t recommend getting amazon clothing never seems described website electronics medium it’s excellent recent order arnold schwarzenegger movie “commando” bluray less one day shipping amazon prime really good shipping time come one day shipping past would usually come day expected delivery date actually correct time questionable sometimes amazon able ship item quickly,0.017198872081757778,0.9828011279182423,0.06730229949523275,0.8,1.7048610238581676,170.48610238581676,High Trust
