Anthony J Pittman,/users/5d17609e3fc1c828fe371020,US,3.0,2019-06-29 12:59:23+00:00,1.0,Amazon has gone way down hill.,"Amazon has gone way down hill since they have gotten so large. There have been countless times I have received the completely wrong item from what I ordered. I definitely will not be renewing my subscription. While getting 1-2 day shipping is a great perk, it’s not worth the hassle when I consistently receive the wrong item and have to return it just to get the wrong item again. They need to do a better job in warehouse management because it is embarrassing to receive a book when I ordered a front decor license plate.",2019-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,29.0,523,95,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon gone way hill since gotten large countless time received completely wrong item ordered definitely renewing subscription getting day shipping great perk it’s worth hassle consistently receive wrong item return get wrong item need better job warehouse management embarrassing receive book ordered front decor license plate,0.019481461479055568,0.9805185385209444,0.0532809871003926,0.2,0.8009154666805507,80.09154666805507,High Trust
