Tay Lola,/users/5d16d3399a2893aed62696c1,US,2.0,2019-06-29 03:05:23+00:00,2.0,"Delivery driver lied, never showed and claimed no access to the property","I ordered a math book for my son on Wednesday. It was set to be delivered today by 9PM. It is almost 8. Around 7 I was able to track the vehicle headed my way, several miles out. I went outside since I live in a townhouse and even though one gate was open due to an open house in another unit, I stood out front looking out for the driver. A message popped up saying I was next. No problem since I was already outside WAITING and WAITING. About a minute later, I received a message saying that the driver had been unable to deliver my package due to lack of access to my residence. That was a total lie. I called the cust sac number and got a nice customer service person in a foreign country. She attempted to be as helpful as she could but there was confusion about the order status. If the not so honest driver was still in the neighborhood, could he just return and do what he was supposed to do in the first place...actually attempt the delivery? They claim they have no communication with the driver who NEVER ever attempted delivery. The rep. stated that I MAY get it the next day and if not they will reorder with one day delivery. I informed her that I am not going to mess up my Saturday waiting on a math book. Not an urgent item, but nonetheless a ridiculous waste of everyone's time and the driver is obviously a liar who is getting paid by customers to NOT do his job. In the future, I will have items delivered to a locker for smaller items.",2019-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,29.0,1456,282,72,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered math book son wednesday set delivered today pm almost around able track vehicle headed way several mile went outside since live townhouse even though one gate open due open house another unit stood front looking driver message popped saying next problem since already outside waiting waiting minute later received message saying driver unable deliver package due lack access residence total lie called cust sac number got nice customer service person foreign country attempted helpful could confusion order status honest driver still neighborhood could return supposed first placeactually attempt delivery claim communication driver never ever attempted delivery rep stated may get next day reorder one day delivery informed going mess saturday waiting math book urgent item nonetheless ridiculous waste everyones time driver obviously liar getting paid customer job future item delivered locker smaller item,0.006010069227395845,0.9939899307726041,0.15816040381379698,0.4,1.1286270461490615,112.86270461490615,High Trust
S A,/users/5d16c4b597935f82d9d66fd8,US,1.0,2019-06-29 01:54:10+00:00,1.0,They signed me up for prime without my consent,"They signed me up for prime and fullmoon video without consent. They sent an email saying thank you for signing up for free trials on both. Idid not sign up for either! I know there shady practices during check out, so i am always aware of what i am clicking on and careful to read all to make sure i dont accidentally sign up for prime which i have alnost done in the past. I dont even know what prime video fullmoon os. Yes I was able to cancel free trial but if i didnt read my email amd cancel they were going to charge per month after trials were over. I never signed up in the first place. Yes they have good prices but i am so annoyed with this huge business I will pay full price somewhere else. Unethical business practices!",2019-06-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,29.0,733,143,46,9,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,signed prime fullmoon video without consent sent email saying thank signing free trial idid sign either know shady practice check always aware clicking careful read make sure dont accidentally sign prime alnost done past dont even know prime video fullmoon o yes able cancel free trial didnt read email amd cancel going charge per month trial never signed first place yes good price annoyed huge business pay full price somewhere else unethical business practice,0.2966325134300453,0.7033674865699546,0.08020190689848569,0.2,0.6677241246646745,66.77241246646744,Medium Trust
Lynn,/users/5c8d15055577151df0850628,US,3.0,2019-06-28 19:02:48+00:00,1.0,All I needed was to change my old work…,"All I needed was to change my old work email address on the amazon account to my personal email address. I appeared to get locked out online and couldn't do it myself (it would not longer accept my pw).  1 1/2 hrs. later after multiple calls and call backs that never happened... dealing with incompetence like Alex (in the accounts services department).  I am amazed that (practically) the richest man on the planet, running one of the wealthiest companies on the planet, appears to invest $0 in customer service.  They're not knowledgeable, they transfer you a million times to the next not knowledgeable person.  They apologize constantly which honestly is the only thing that makes sense, cause they're service is sorry. They put on hold for 5mins to find the phone number of the department they need to transfer you too (this is 2019).  And apparently, they're all packed in like sardins in the same room, you hear everybodies conversation but your own.  They practically ask you for your DNA before even trying to provide help, only to find out that even with all that information, they're useless.  Really Jeff Bezo's - you can't get any lower. Talk to the CEO of Zappos, they know what they're doing, you don't. Throw some of your riches to customer service please both international and domestic neither are good.  Horrible experience - zero service and I think it's simply because they can.",2019-06-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,28.0,1400,239,39,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,needed change old work email address amazon account personal email address appeared get locked online couldnt would longer accept pw hr later multiple call call back never happened dealing incompetence like alex account service department amazed practically richest man planet running one wealthiest company planet appears invest customer service theyre knowledgeable transfer million time next knowledgeable person apologize constantly honestly thing make sense cause theyre service sorry put hold min find phone number department need transfer apparently theyre packed like sardins room hear everybodies conversation practically ask dna even trying provide help find even information theyre useless really jeff bezos cant get lower talk ceo zappos know theyre dont throw rich customer service please international domestic neither good horrible experience zero service think simply,0.008420940557693038,0.991579059442307,0.1340437464946719,0.2,0.8225982790200879,82.25982790200878,High Trust
