KLB,/users/578e39740000ff000a3324ac,US,3.0,2019-06-28 16:47:46+00:00,1.0,Absolutely horrible,"Absolutely horrible customer service. The people are nice enough but their ability to help the customer is non-existent. There was a promotion in my Amazon extension that said ""Get 12 months of Audible for just $119.50 plus an Echo Dot for 99¢ extra"" - When I clicked on the link, it took me to a page that has no terms and conditions, and no where did it say it's not available to already existing members.  I have the screenshots to prove all of this. After chatting with Amazon, they told me that they couldn't help and it was Audible. So, like a moron, I wasted my time on the phone with them only for them to tell me that they can't control what Amazon lists, and they can do nothing for me. Time wasted? over 15 minutes. Do they care? Nope - too bad. I guess now my research begins to find another place to find audio books and to warn colleagues and friends of this company's inability to do anything in the best interest of their members.",2019-06-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,28.0,946,178,19,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolutely horrible customer service people nice enough ability help customer nonexistent promotion amazon extension said get month audible plus echo dot ¢ extra clicked link took page term condition say available already existing member screenshots prove chatting amazon told couldnt help audible like moron wasted time phone tell cant control amazon list nothing time wasted minute care nope bad guess research begin find another place find audio book warn colleague friend company inability anything best interest member,0.03947402132524001,0.96052597867476,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.8002293381876324,80.02293381876325,High Trust
