SEKHMET SEKHMET,/users/5d0ffca88e06a2a1048888af,US,2.0,2019-06-25 00:50:57+00:00,1.0,"Amazon does not want us to tell the truth about their service, Amazon does not want to hear the truth","Amazon does not want to hear the truth, I purchased  a book on Amazon called Sirius Connection the seller was VERY professional and product arrived on time, they paid for the shipping.  I also noticed that they have a large collection of books Not listed on Amazon.  I gave the seller a very good review because I was very satisfied with their service and in please read below what amazon did with my review ( Amazon deleted the review).  Plus, I gave a good review for another product, Amazon edited the review and RE-ARRANGED the words into saying something more EXAGERATING to misleading consumers.  Sirius Connection  ★★★★★   from Dua sekhmet on June 21, 2019 TRIFTBooks - Squared  - a seller on Amazon  I gave them 5 stars and wrote these few words below: great service  very good service, I will order from them directly, they have a large collection of products not posted on here. Amazon DELETED MY REVIEW AND THIS IS AMAZON EMAIL REPLY BELOW LET ME KNOW THEY DELETED MY REVIEW.Thank you for submitting a customer review. Thank you for submitting a customer review on Amazon. After carefully reviewing your submission, your review could not be posted to the website. While we appreciate your time and comments, reviews must adhere to the following guidelines:Sirius Connection  ★★★★★   from Dua sekhmet on June 21, 2019  great service  very good service, I will order from them directly, they have a large collection of products not posted on here.    A few common issues to keep in mind: • Your review should focus on specific features of the product and your experience with it. Feedback on the seller or your shipment experience should be provided at•We do not allow profane or obscene content. This applies to adult products too.•Advertisements, promotional material or repeated posts that make the same point excessively are considered spam.•Please do not include URLs external to Amazon or personally identifiable content in your review.•Any attempt to manipulate Community content or features, including contributing false, misleading, or inauthentic content, is strictly prohibited.",2019-06-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,25.0,2098,341,101,20,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon want hear truth purchased book amazon called sirius connection seller professional product arrived time paid shipping also noticed large collection book listed amazon gave seller good review satisfied service please read amazon review amazon deleted review plus gave good review another product amazon edited review rearranged word saying something exagerating misleading consumer sirius connection ★★★★★ dua sekhmet june triftbooks squared seller amazon gave star wrote word great service good service order directly large collection product posted amazon deleted review amazon email reply let know deleted reviewthank submitting customer review thank submitting customer review amazon carefully reviewing submission review could posted website appreciate time comment review must adhere following guidelinessirius connection ★★★★★ dua sekhmet june great service good service order directly large collection product posted common issue keep mind • review focus specific feature product experience feedback seller shipment experience provided at•we allow profane obscene content applies adult product too•advertisements promotional material repeated post make point excessively considered spam•please include url external amazon personally identifiable content review•any attempt manipulate community content feature including contributing false misleading inauthentic content strictly prohibited,0.010027644712446061,0.9899723552875539,0.19125070106561975,0.2,0.8332363178569009,83.32363178569008,High Trust
Stacey Holt,/users/5d1141a20bc5cf2d3da22267,US,1.0,2019-06-24 21:33:45+00:00,1.0,Lied to. False advertising,I have been ordering from amazon for many many years and never had a problem....til today.  I had a offer on my account where I could download the amazon app and receive $10 amazon cash after the first time I signed in. I downloaded it then signed in. But to my surprise I didn’t get my $10.  So I chatted with customer service and spoke with a Anika. I think that’s how it was spelled.  Anyways they tell me I can’t get my $10 if I didn’t get an email after I downloaded it. I am the type of customer that will shop somewhere else even if it’s higher if you do me wrong.  So I’m not dealing with amazon anymore. I don’t like false advertising or lies. If you say I’m going to get something then I should get it if I do what it said. I took screenshots of everything so I have the proof of everything I was told and the offer. So I canceled my prime membership and am going to eBay from now on.,2019-06-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,24.0,894,179,26,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordering amazon many many year never problemtil today offer account could download amazon app receive amazon cash first time signed downloaded signed surprise didn’t get chatted customer service spoke anika think that’s spelled anyways tell can’t get didn’t get email downloaded type customer shop somewhere else even it’s higher wrong i’m dealing amazon anymore don’t like false advertising lie say i’m going get something get said took screenshots everything proof everything told offer canceled prime membership going ebay,0.014012197528673515,0.9859878024713264,0.10039259674705553,0.2,0.8130724205850743,81.30724205850743,High Trust
Kat Chiappone,/users/582d2ab70000ff000a5828b5,US,27.0,2019-06-25 02:24:24+00:00,3.0,Responsiveness of giants among us,"I've been ordering from Amazon Prime for about 3 or more yrs. Now with the usual mis delivered items but In the last year it has been getting worse.Now they have this new thing when they deliver your package they send you a picture of your back porch. Trouble is, it's not always your porch. I have pointed this out several times but they'd rather shine you On with an obligatory sorry and a couple of bucks. Not to mention you pay an additional $119. for Prime -  1 to 2 day shipping . This week I ordered And promised my 5 yr. Old granddaughter a Dodger hat, glove, and 2 balls by Wednesday. Wrong. Wrong porch. Told them and said send driver lbackout to get and redilever. Nope, too easy, will resend. Another two days. Hat came in mail, thank goodness. Promised my granddaughter a Dodger hat n ball to help make up for it. Supposed to get Friday. Wrong again. Same porch, not mine. Sent text as soon as I got the picture and quite aggravated now with a crying granddaughter i immediately send a text to send driver back out now and pick up my items and deliver to me. That didn't happen. Next day I find the obligatory sorry again. Was quite upset by now and have to take nitroglycerin tabs for the chest pains they created and let them know it too. So needless to say, no reply, no baseball no bat and no resolution. Could that driver live there or know someone there?? Does that person need glasses??? I'm my opinion Amazon condones the theft of packages not belonging to addresses not to mention opening other people's mail. Found out open someone's mail from your mailbox. It's a federal pffense. You give it back. I guess when you get that big you can treat common people however you want. They should remember when they weren't so big and who helped them get there. I'm a big Dodger can having been born in NYC. First game I went to and only games were Brooklyn Dodgers. Now we carry the torch for LA Dodgers. This is so disappointing how they treat people. Thank you Trustpilot, for listening.  And here it is Monday and you guessed it. No bat, no ball no response,no consideration for the consumer. Why would you think I ordered that. To see someone else get it. So much for 20 + years in the military. My husband fought in Korean war and two tours in Vietnam and he can't even get our 5/6 year old granddaughter some Dodger stuff. Guess that's a thank you for your service we'll not soon forget. But don't waste any time collecting that $119. Prime membership. Soery, yes, we're quite upset.",2019-06-24 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,25.0,2504,463,33,5,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive ordering amazon prime yr usual mi delivered item last year getting worsenow new thing deliver package send picture back porch trouble always porch pointed several time theyd rather shine obligatory sorry couple buck mention pay additional prime day shipping week ordered promised yr old granddaughter dodger hat glove ball wednesday wrong wrong porch told said send driver lbackout get redilever nope easy resend another two day hat came mail thank goodness promised granddaughter dodger hat n ball help make supposed get friday wrong porch mine sent text soon got picture quite aggravated cry granddaughter immediately send text send driver back pick item deliver didnt happen next day find obligatory sorry quite upset take nitroglycerin tab chest pain created let know needless say reply baseball bat resolution could driver live know someone person need glass im opinion amazon condones theft package belonging address mention opening people mail found open someone mail mailbox federal pffense give back guess get big treat common people however want remember werent big helped get im big dodger born nyc first game went game brooklyn dodger carry torch la dodger disappointing treat people thank trustpilot listening monday guessed bat ball responseno consideration consumer would think ordered see someone else get much year military husband fought korean war two tour vietnam cant even get year old granddaughter dodger stuff guess thats thank service well soon forget dont waste time collecting prime membership soery yes quite upset,0.016277060142540833,0.9837229398574592,0.2596747055524397,0.6,1.4437964110392174,144.37964110392173,High Trust
Raimen L.,/users/5d0ffe2243cae95dcfceac23,US,2.0,2019-06-23 22:33:27+00:00,1.0,amazon adds is big scam!,"i'm sure if some one looking to buy something on line it go strait to google, so i did the same thing. Didn't take very long to find what i'm was looking for, i see Amazon add for the same item price is $84.95,so i click on and  takes me to the amazon side with same item just different price $109.10. well price is dot matching advertising price so i make quick call to Amazon customer service and see ore the honer the price what they advertising on nation web search google. Well was no luck. they are not going to match the price from they original add.So big disappointment.",2019-06-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,23.0,579,110,24,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,im sure one looking buy something line go strait google thing didnt take long find im looking see amazon add item price click take amazon side item different price well price dot matching advertising price make quick call amazon customer service see ore honer price advertising nation web search google well luck going match price original addso big disappointment,0.012370673103888986,0.987629326896111,0.06169377453729669,0.2,0.8061534183555149,80.61534183555149,High Trust
Lindsey G,/users/5894cccf0000ff000a739a54,GB,27.0,2019-06-23 08:03:49+00:00,1.0,Amazon deliberately ignore your complaints in favour of quoting Ts and Cs.,"This is a review of Amazon’s poor Customer Service with regards to Amazon Prime, and it’s renewal procedures.For whatever reason this year, I did not have a preferred card set up on my Amazon Prime renewal...Amazon Prime users beware - if you don’t have a preferred card set up to renew your Prime membership, Amazon will bill ANY card linked to your account, even if it’s not your card. Amazon will bill any card that they can verify, even it’s it’s not against your name and address. So, if your relatives have ever used your Prime account and their card is linked to your account, as far as Amazon is concerned they can bill it.After some back and forth emails with Amazon Customer Service team, who insisted on quoting the Terms and Conditions at me. I finally sent this:“1. I am aware of the Terms and Conditions. Stop quoting them at me please. My issue is, Amazon should not legally be able to charge a card belonging to someone other than the account holder and need to change their policy.2. One would assume that “any other payment method YOU have on file refers to cards on file in the account holder’s name, not any person’s card.3. If you cannot charge a preferred card, or one isn’t set in the name of the account holder, Amazon must suspend Prime until it’s resolved. Not go ahead and charge any card belonging to any person. The policy/Terms and Conditions need to be reviewed.Microsoft for example, if they cannot bill for a subscription, the subscription is suspended until card details are updated.” Got this response:“Hello,This is Abigail a member from the management team.As you have requested that we should change the system where we should only be charging the account holders Card it we will take that as a feed back and pass it to the concerned team.Unlike other companies Amazon will not be able to see any card details except for the last four digits of the card so we would not now who is the card holder.However as you have requested we will pass the information to the concerned team.Thank you for contacting Amazon.Your feedback is helping us build Earth's Most Customer-Centric Company.Warmest regards,Abigail”So, I’m awaiting a response from the preferred team over a week later. No surprises there.",2019-06-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,23.0,2234,387,74,12,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,review amazon’s poor customer service regard amazon prime it’s renewal proceduresfor whatever reason year preferred card set amazon prime renewalamazon prime user beware don’t preferred card set renew prime membership amazon bill card linked account even it’s card amazon bill card verify even it’s it’s name address relative ever used prime account card linked account far amazon concerned bill itafter back forth email amazon customer service team insisted quoting term condition finally sent this“ aware term condition stop quoting please issue amazon legally able charge card belonging someone account holder need change policy one would assume “any payment method file refers card file account holder’s name person’s card cannot charge preferred card one isn’t set name account holder amazon must suspend prime it’s resolved go ahead charge card belonging person policyterms condition need reviewedmicrosoft example cannot bill subscription subscription suspended card detail updated” got response“hellothis abigail member management teamas requested change system charging account holder card take feed back pas concerned teamunlike company amazon able see card detail except last four digit card would card holderhowever requested pas information concerned teamthank contacting amazonyour feedback helping u build earth customercentric companywarmest regardsabigail”so i’m awaiting response preferred team week later surprise,0.016711786749345894,0.9832882132506541,0.21704991587212563,0.2,0.8350540897997522,83.505408979975