Lawrence Klebesadel,/users/58528c330000ff000a620449,US,1.0,2019-06-16 20:35:55+00:00,1.0,Don't bother trying to use a physical gift card at Amazon.,"Have you ever tried to use a physical gift card at Amazon?  You either lost some of your money, or were completely frustrated.  They still haven't figured out how to split an order between a physical gift card and another payment method.  I spent over 2 hours on the phone with customer service getting passed from one service agent to another and not one of them could actually help me.  All I wanted to do was use my American Express Gift Card with a $25 value (pre-paid card that looks like a credit card and has a credit card number) to pay for part of a $35 purchase. Amazon insisted that I could only use the card for something that cost under $25 (forcing you to loose value since it will never come to exactly $25).  Brick and mortar stores have been able to perform this payment split for as long as I can remember but not even the higher level service to which I was finally escalated could manage to charge the gift card for $25 and then pay the balance with any other of my registered payment methods.Amazon is a leading online retailer and it is ridiculous that they haven't been able to figure this out either in an automated method or by a procedure where customer service helps split the payment.  I'm sure there are other reasons to split payments between two methods... Amazon doesn't seem to care or even understand why a customer would want to do such a thing.",2019-06-16 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,16.0,1380,254,58,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ever tried use physical gift card amazon either lost money completely frustrated still havent figured split order physical gift card another payment method spent hour phone customer service getting passed one service agent another one could actually help wanted use american express gift card value prepaid card look like credit card credit card number pay part purchase amazon insisted could use card something cost forcing loose value since never come exactly brick mortar store able perform payment split long remember even higher level service finally escalated could manage charge gift card pay balance registered payment methodsamazon leading online retailer ridiculous havent able figure either automated method procedure customer service help split payment im sure reason split payment two method amazon doesnt seem care even understand customer would want thing,0.00967971206234443,0.9903202879376556,0.142456533931576,0.2,0.823651450755143,82.3651450755143,High Trust
