Sha,/users/5cfdbfaa400f6f69e22de9e4,US,4.0,2019-06-10 02:34:00+00:00,1.0,Delivery services....always use a locker!!,"If I could give no stars I would. Amazon delivery services has really went down. I’ve had I package stolen and one lost. Now today after giving them another chance they don’t show up. I called to complain about the message I’ve received stating they attempted to deliver when NO one ever showed up and I get some run around about how she was requesting for them to come back out. Lies! No one ever came back out and no one called (as per the rep). I am so sick of this, if I pay for something I want it!! Amazon you need to get that together and honor your word!",2019-06-10 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,10.0,562,111,42,5,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,could give star would amazon delivery service really went i’ve package stolen one lost today giving another chance don’t show called complain message i’ve received stating attempted deliver one ever showed get run around requesting come back lie one ever came back one called per rep sick pay something want amazon need get together honor word,0.9485646525381237,0.05143534746187628,0.062254627033090294,0.2,0.3381685991375562,33.81685991375562,Low Trust
TW,/users/5b96f4054de5666d347140b7,US,3.0,2019-06-09 23:23:59+00:00,1.0,Amazon Delivery Services SUCK!  And that it putting it mildly!,"My review is strictly about Amazon Delivery Services and how much they really SUCK!Never on time, when they say by 9PM they mean you'll get it shortly before 9PM.  The amazon delivery service shows up in cars, trucks, vans, uhaul vehicles, etc. so how the heck are we supposed to know these people are legit?  Most of the time they run up to front porch, throw package down at door, never ring doorbell, snap a pic, and off they run!. This past Friday, I'm standing in my driveway, the driver shows up with headphones in ears, scans packages after 10 minutes of digging thru vehicle, runs up to front porch (hello I'm RIGHT THERE IN YOUR LINE OF SIGHT!) drops packages, snaps a pic and runs off.  One of the packages was for a neighbor 3 houses down main street (i'm on a culdesac).  These guys are something else to say the least!  I'm 18 miles from a distribution center and anytime it says ""delivery by 9PM"" they do mean we are going to delivery to everyone else's known to mankind packages before we deliver your packages at 8:58PM after I've been waiting an entire day to receive.",2019-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,9.0,1085,198,62,10,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,review strictly amazon delivery service much really sucknever time say pm mean youll get shortly pm amazon delivery service show car truck van uhaul vehicle etc heck supposed know people legit time run front porch throw package door never ring doorbell snap pic run past friday im standing driveway driver show headphone ear scan package minute digging thru vehicle run front porch hello im right line sight drop package snap pic run one package neighbor house main street im culdesac guy something else say least im mile distribution center anytime say delivery pm mean going delivery everyone elses known mankind package deliver package pm ive waiting entire day receive,0.9066810241172848,0.0933189758827152,0.11104879416713405,0.2,0.3688692467747844,36.88692467747844,Low Trust
Stephen,/users/5851a6de0000ff000a61cc0a,GB,89.0,2019-06-09 16:10:37+00:00,1.0,Dishonest Amazon Couriers,Yet another blatant lie by the Amazon Logistics courier that the ‘parcel was handed to resident’ when in fact nobody was in and there was no sign of my parcel anywhere on my property.I live in a remote location but it has a postcode and most delivery drivers find it easily. Some Amazon drivers who cannot find me easily simply lie about delivery and either steal or dispose of my parcels. They are just too lazy and dishonest to do their job properly.,2019-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,9.0,452,83,25,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,yet another blatant lie amazon logistics courier ‘parcel handed resident’ fact nobody sign parcel anywhere propertyi live remote location postcode delivery driver find easily amazon driver cannot find easily simply lie delivery either steal dispose parcel lazy dishonest job properly,0.36739534164533566,0.6326046583546643,0.04655075715086932,0.2,0.6256124806075061,62.56124806075061,Medium Trust
Scott Mine,/users/5cfd10f6400f6fa9232d8aed,US,1.0,2019-06-09 14:01:43+00:00,2.0,"Do NOT trust ""2 day or 1 day shipping""!","Do NOT trust ""2 day or 1 day shipping"" as advertised!As a Prime member, I've usually enjoyed shipping as advertised, but in late 2018, and now in 2019, too many times has Amazon broken their promise on shipping.  And I pay over $100.00 for this?  In short, when I put an item in the basket, it shows the day it's to be delivered.  Even more, once I place the order, I check to see if it's the same delivery date, and it shows the same.  But on the day of delivery, they'll wait until late night to show it's been ""delayed"" and it's then usually 2 or 3 more days scheduled to be delivered!!!!Would this be ""false advertising"" in the real world???",2019-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,9.0,645,122,39,9,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,trust day day shipping advertisedas prime member ive usually enjoyed shipping advertised late many time amazon broken promise shipping pay short put item basket show day delivered even place order check see delivery date show day delivery theyll wait late night show delayed usually day scheduled deliveredwould false advertising real world,0.9271146877073584,0.07288531229264161,0.06842400448681997,0.4,0.6501274570436848,65.01274570436848,Medium Trust
jim,/users/5cd999fe6e5fb26c4187f64b,GB,10.0,2019-06-09 10:14:46+00:00,4.0,Amazon are quite reliable and sort out problems with individual sellers,"Wrote a review recently which was really about Deal of the Day and NOT about Amazon itself. We had problems with deal of the day but Amazon swooped in and sorted it rapidly and happily. I wanred to make certain that reviews of the ""seller"" Deal of the Day do not tarnish Amazon.We have used Amazon a lot over a decade and had almost no problems. Items often arrive faster than suggested, good prices, good quality, well packed and returns normally no problem. We know Amazon get a lot of flak, often for tax situation but we review purely on the service and only had one niggle with Amazon themselves, as opposed to particular sellers ( music cd's purchased under a previous profile not credited with the music library freebie about a year ago - not a ""biggie"").So, individual sellers are not the same as Amazon but Amazon can be relied upon to sort out any problems. Usually.",2019-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,9.0,876,158,71,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wrote review recently really deal day amazon problem deal day amazon swooped sorted rapidly happily wanred make certain review seller deal day tarnish amazonwe used amazon lot decade almost problem item often arrive faster suggested good price good quality well packed return normally problem know amazon get lot flak often tax situation review purely service one niggle amazon opposed particular seller music cd purchased previous profile credited music library freebie year ago biggieso individual seller amazon amazon relied upon sort problem usually,0.006784883438672931,0.9932151165613271,0.0886146943353898,0.8,1.7143304971477413,171.43304971477414,High Trust
