seda,/users/5cfc91f651c8d43d49cee91c,US,1.0,2019-06-09 04:58:33+00:00,1.0,I am selling patented jewelry…,"I am selling patented jewelry organizer-jewelryfileportfolio.com. I shipped one to a customer to NY and was delivered on APril 24, 2019. Then, she wrote it is too big. I contacted Amazon, and I was told that Amazon gave automatically return authorization.  I waited and it was never returned. Then When I contacted Amazon, Amazon told me that since they paid me (THEY NEVER PAID ANYTHING AND MY BANK STATEMENT IS A PROOF). Then Amazon sent a bill and telling me that will charge to my credit card. Amazon wants to charge my credit card for something that never paid AND CUSTOMER NEVER RETURN MY ORGANIZER. i have sent tons of emails and here is the last email:We have reviewed the buyer's claim and the information you provided for order 113-5954665-8672240.Although we understand your position, we stand by our decision. We cannot give you more information about this matter, and we may not reply to further emails about this claim.IT COST ME ABOUT $450.00. i need help. THIS IS HIGHWAY ROBBERY.",2019-06-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,9.0,996,170,30,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,selling patented jewelry organizerjewelryfileportfoliocom shipped one customer ny delivered april wrote big contacted amazon told amazon gave automatically return authorization waited never returned contacted amazon amazon told since paid never paid anything bank statement proof amazon sent bill telling charge credit card amazon want charge credit card something never paid customer never return organizer sent ton email last emailwe reviewed buyer claim information provided order although understand position stand decision cannot give information matter may reply email claimit cost need help highway robbery,0.011201052978538368,0.9887989470214616,0.09534492428491306,0.2,0.8134684583677134,81.34684583677134,High Trust
