Nathan Elliott,/users/5bcf3e834de5666d34943c01,GB,3.0,2019-06-07 00:25:32+00:00,1.0,Bad customer service say it isnt soo,"Amazon a usual with the stunning serviceSent to the US on holiday so wanted to grab a few bits made sense to order straight from amazon as it was the cheapest and with the two of prime would get to me 4 days before I leave. Win winOn Friday I get a message to say my parcel has been delivered. Funny i was in all day and didn't get a knock at the door and this order wasny fitting in a letterbox. So go outside no parcel check with the neighbours no parcel.Contact amazon via the app to say my parcel hasn't been delivered which p****d me off as I took a day off from my holiday to wait in for the parcel get told it was left outside on the porch. So flag this to amazon as I don't have any goods received. Got told they need to investigate it and this will take a few days. I flag at this point I leave the UK on Wednesday my error it was thursday but never the less I get told contact on monday and we will sort out from there.No Monday comes contact amazon via the app to then get told pay through two people to get told the the investigation want raised on friday and they would need to raise one on monday. Now that puts me right at the 3 day limit of been leaving to go back to the UK. I flag yet again I will not be in the county at this point. And get told don't worry if you need in the country we will refund you because he courier they used left the parcel outside. No problem great at least I will get my money back.Low and behold something new comes up. Amazon saying they can't do anything as I need a police report. This is the funny part how do I report a problem when I'm not in the damm county so they are now saying they can do anything about it. This is after contacting them on Friday letting them know I'm leaving soon, then not raising the investigation, contacting in Monday they say we will refund you. Contact in Thursday sorry we can do anything. If I was told on the Friday when I reported this issue the first time no doubt this could of been sorted out but no amazon want to be haf assed as usual so I got no products and I'm out my money because there couirer couldn't knock the damm door to hand me the parcel. Needless to say I would rather pay more to get a better service and won't be using amazon again.",2019-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,7.0,2239,450,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon usual stunning servicesent u holiday wanted grab bit made sense order straight amazon cheapest two prime would get day leave win winon friday get message say parcel delivered funny day didnt get knock door order wasny fitting letterbox go outside parcel check neighbour parcelcontact amazon via app say parcel hasnt delivered pd took day holiday wait parcel get told left outside porch flag amazon dont good received got told need investigate take day flag point leave uk wednesday error thursday never less get told contact monday sort thereno monday come contact amazon via app get told pay two people get told investigation want raised friday would need raise one monday put right day limit leaving go back uk flag yet county point get told dont worry need country refund courier used left parcel outside problem great least get money backlow behold something new come amazon saying cant anything need police report funny part report problem im damm county saying anything contacting friday letting know im leaving soon raising investigation contacting monday say refund contact thursday sorry anything told friday reported issue first time doubt could sorted amazon want haf assed usual got product im money couirer couldnt knock damm door hand parcel needless say would rather pay get better service wont using amazon,0.005594381550185716,0.9944056184498142,0.2523836231071228,0.2,0.8476795338463317,84.76795338463316,High Trust
Grouch Girl,/users/5cf941e06eafc28cf0cf2e7e,US,1.0,2019-06-06 16:40:14+00:00,1.0,"False advertisement, subject to change AFTER purchase","I ordered an item, advertised as one day shipping and PRIME, AFTER the order was completed and paid for, suddenly the ship time becomes much longer. It was not shipped for 2 days and now day 4 and no item. It would not seem a big deal, but it was advertised and bought as one day shipping. Why pay for a prime membership if there is no benefit to it. Their chat line is worthless since the person repeated the same boxed phrase and can not answer a single question.",2019-06-06 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,6.0,465,90,53,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered item advertised one day shipping prime order completed paid suddenly ship time becomes much longer shipped day day item would seem big deal advertised bought one day shipping pay prime membership benefit chat line worthless since person repeated boxed phrase answer single question,0.014806018327139743,0.9851939816728602,0.050476724621424565,0.2,0.802692335760715,80.2692335760715,High Trust
