CR,/users/5cf83596d27f4d6bca8225d1,US,1.0,2019-06-05 21:35:20+00:00,1.0,Prime is a waste of time and money.,"Amazon dropped the ball completely and offered no solution. I ordered a deck latch for a boat from amazon which arrived broken. I contacted amazon customer service and they assured me the replacement would arrive in two days. At this point I cut the deck to fit the hatch. Fast forward 3 weeks. I have no hatch, amazon has canceled my order and my refund has not arrived. Further more, after having two emails to customer service ignored and an extremely unproductive customer service conversation I was forced to order the hatch my self from the manufacturer. This has cost me an additional 40 dollars, a roughly 30% increase. Amazon also missed 3 other delivery dates by more than a week  removed my reviews stating that their shipping promises were not being fulfilled. Today is my last day paying for prime service, it is a sham. Amazon has lost its connection to its customers.",2019-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,5.0,882,154,35,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon dropped ball completely offered solution ordered deck latch boat amazon arrived broken contacted amazon customer service assured replacement would arrive two day point cut deck fit hatch fast forward week hatch amazon canceled order refund arrived two email customer service ignored extremely unproductive customer service conversation forced order hatch self manufacturer cost additional dollar roughly increase amazon also missed delivery date week removed review stating shipping promise fulfilled today last day paying prime service sham amazon lost connection customer,0.010659577227343118,0.9893404227726569,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.8119444682567715,81.19444682567715,High Trust
Adey,/users/5b3a40fd4de5666d34fa7726,ES,4.0,2019-06-06 08:31:02+00:00,1.0,Household with(out) prime benefits,"Amazon's Household documentation makes it clear that Prime benefits (delivery, Video) can be shared, as long as you're not a student, or sharing a discounted Prime or other shared delivery benefits.We have a household setup, happily sharing Kindle books via the Family Library, can see each others' payment methods and use them; we both had Prime. I let my Prime expire so we could share my partners. Our Amazon Household is in Amazon.com (only place I could create one).Both our accounts are in Spain. Nothing in the documentation mentions limitations about country or only for amazon.com. Sharing books should not be possible according to their Kindle support expert. Yet it works.1h48 of being on the phone with customer service, an escalation to a supervisor, them saying that there isn't an option to share Prime and it shouldn't work. I say ""OK"" and wait for them to make a suggestion. Nothing. I offer them some options, update the documentation, add the feature, compensation for my time and informing them of the problem. All Amazon can do is give a transcript and a reference number, and maybe someone internally will look at it. No compensation options and having to tell them the expected next steps for good customer service.This statement in the email from Amazon is a joke:> We're Building Earth's Most Customer-Centric CompanyFrom their response: (...MVKP26, English is their 2nd language)- Amazon.com and Amazon.es are differents places and dont have the same policies. - I can escalate your query and I will do it for the, the investigation will be intern and dont be share with the customer.",2019-06-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,6.0,6.0,1610,267,34,4,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon household documentation make clear prime benefit delivery video shared long youre student sharing discounted prime shared delivery benefitswe household setup happily sharing kindle book via family library see others payment method use prime let prime expire could share partner amazon household amazoncom place could create oneboth account spain nothing documentation mention limitation country amazoncom sharing book possible according kindle support expert yet worksh phone customer service escalation supervisor saying isnt option share prime shouldnt work say ok wait make suggestion nothing offer option update documentation add feature compensation time informing problem amazon give transcript reference number maybe someone internally look compensation option tell expected next step good customer servicethis statement email amazon joke building earth customercentric companyfrom response mvkp english nd language amazoncom amazones differents place dont policy escalate query investigation intern dont share customer,0.004785210281971637,0.9952147897180283,0.14974761637689288,0.2,0.8275569181343927,82.75569181343927,High Trust
