Timothy,/users/53a8a49700006400017b0b51,US,3.0,2019-05-28 14:30:49+00:00,3.0,Too much counterfeiting,"I use Amazon all the time, but will always pick another retailer when reasonable. Their fulfillment system is too easily exploited by counterfeiters. Anyone can use their fulfillment system, and all items are combined together. When a retailer sells through Amazon (including Amazon itself), they pull an item from their shelf. Could be a counterfeit someone sent in or a legit item. You don't know.With more traditional retailers online, you know they buy their stock from reliable distributors so you know for sure you are getting the item/brand you paid for.",2019-05-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,5.0,28.0,561,91,23,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,use amazon time always pick another retailer reasonable fulfillment system easily exploited counterfeiter anyone use fulfillment system item combined together retailer sell amazon including amazon pull item shelf could counterfeit someone sent legit item dont knowwith traditional retailer online know buy stock reliable distributor know sure getting itembrand paid,0.07806395189057777,0.9219360481094222,0.05103757711721817,0.6,1.3711755394781546,137.11755394781545,High Trust
