Lew,/users/5ce59c47ffb9d3ac5939e3fa,US,18.0,2019-05-23 07:21:01+00:00,4.0,Pretty good experiences,"I have not always agreed with some of their business practices, but I've given them feedback on this and I've shopped with them a lot. Their website usually loads quickly and their apps haven't given me many problems. Their prices are often the lowest and I really like that the active and prominent review system helps keep the sellers from abusing customers too much -- without warning, anyway. As for sellers, they could stand to mark down some of their seller fees.One of the best things that Amazon has done is to empower aspiring authors with Kindle Direct Publishing -- independent publishing has taken off largely because of Amazon's KDP and Audible. This is really good, especially for young, tech savvy writers who get turned down by traditional publishers for whatever reason.",2019-05-23 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,5.0,23.0,787,132,23,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,always agreed business practice ive given feedback ive shopped lot website usually load quickly apps havent given many problem price often lowest really like active prominent review system help keep seller abusing customer much without warning anyway seller could stand mark seller feesone best thing amazon done empower aspiring author kindle direct publishing independent publishing taken largely amazon kdp audible really good especially young tech savvy writer get turned traditional publisher whatever reason,0.030856056696938677,0.9691439433030613,0.07403252944475602,0.8,1.6993784775404819,169.9378477540482,High Trust
