Scott Sandsmark,/users/5cdc7f8594dddbb96d8baab4,US,2.0,2019-05-15 21:13:13+00:00,1.0,Don’t order large or expensive items,"Ordered a $260 home gym on Amazon Prime. After months of back and forth with their steps for returns, they approved a return at my expense. Useless, as that would cost more than I paid for it in the first place. Please, do not order anything large or expensive from Amazon!",2019-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,5.0,15.0,273,51,36,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered home gym amazon prime month back forth step return approved return expense useless would cost paid first place please order anything large expensive amazon,0.08831733937094607,0.9116826606290539,0.02860347728547392,0.2,0.7615620257716217,76.15620257716216,High Trust
Gia Nghia Tran,/users/5cdc53eba5274efb4e1e7588,US,1.0,2019-05-15 18:01:28+00:00,1.0,I’m totally disappointed,"I’m totally disappointed with Amazon. I have ordered the Airpods last month and i have waited for 3 weeks to have it arrived like Amazon noticed the arrival date to me. But until today is the day my orders must be arrived, I received the email about orders have been delayed. Why ? Why Amazon didn’t notice to me sooner about it was out of stock earlier ? I am having a flight next 5 days, so how can I have what I need before my flight ? Only 5 days left, so can I place other orders and how can it arrive before time ? I was very angry about how Amazon cheated me, they should have noticed me earlier. They don’t care about customer at all.",2019-05-15 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,5.0,15.0,642,128,24,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,i’m totally disappointed amazon ordered airpods last month waited week arrived like amazon noticed arrival date today day order must arrived received email order delayed amazon didn’t notice sooner stock earlier flight next day need flight day left place order arrive time angry amazon cheated noticed earlier don’t care customer,0.01886113590876441,0.9811388640912356,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.8049272559379341,80.49272559379341,High Trust
