Jun Wee,/users/54c079840000ff0001a5c7d4,SG,28.0,2019-05-14 11:00:11+00:00,1.0,My order was supposed to arrive today,"My order was supposed to arrive today. However, when I checked the status, it was not even shipped yet there was not one e-mail notification from Amazon at all.When I tried to contact customer service, the e-mail function was no longer available.The only contact option was a call or a chat.The Amazon US customer service person is outsourced and from India. Not sure if he understood what I wanted because he promised me complimentary expedited shipping after cancelling my order because of their mistake, and telling me to re-order again.Lo and behold, my new order does not have expedited shipping.The chat message is not retrievable and thus looked like our conversation didn't happen at all.Not only is Amazon refusing to be unaccountable for their customers' orders after purchase, they don't even have the decency to hire competent people to do a basic job.Such lousy customer service should be automated as artificial intelligence is smarter and will hit more customer quotas than a robotic person.Instead of having convenience shopping online with Amazon, I would have had the items I needed quicker if I just went to the store and got it myself.Absolutely deplorable. Order# 111-9962967-6665004",2019-05-14 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,5.0,14.0,1204,194,37,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,order supposed arrive today however checked status even shipped yet one email notification amazon allwhen tried contact customer service email function longer availablethe contact option call chatthe amazon u customer service person outsourced india sure understood wanted promised complimentary expedited shipping cancelling order mistake telling reorder againlo behold new order expedited shippingthe chat message retrievable thus looked like conversation didnt happen allnot amazon refusing unaccountable customer order purchase dont even decency hire competent people basic jobsuch lousy customer 