rav bains,/users/59ad2dcf0000ff000ac3bbdf,GB,2.0,2019-05-11 08:58:32+00:00,1.0,Fraud committed by Amazon couriers,"Hi all, just thought i'd post and share my utter frustration with my latest experience with Amazon. In brief, i purchased an item which could not be posted through my letterbox and also required signature as proof of delivery. The item was to be delivered the next day (Saturday) as confirmed upon checkout on Amazons site and then on the confirmation email, it stated Tuesday. I then called through to the actual retailer and they confirmed this is some issue at Amazons end, which i find it hard to believe as an ""issue"", as Amazon dont just make mistakes, its all done purposely. I continued with the purchase under the guarantee that it will be delivered by Tuesday. Tuesday came and no delivery. I called the retailer again rather than Amazon, as Amazon is slooow to respond and i need answers quick. The retailer called the courier (DHL) and they confirmed delivery for the Wednesday. We, as a family, then went away for one week as the children were off from school and upon our return, there was no proof of attempted delivery for our item. I called the retailer and they confirmed that the delivery was made, and someone had signed for it. i asked for proof of signature and the signature was clearly not mine or anyone from my household nor my neighbours. Even if it was my neighbours then the proof of attempted delivery should advise that item was left with that neighbour, but nothing. Now, Amazon have rejected my claim for refund, even though the item is showing as “one the way, but its running late” and when I choose the option Track Package, it reads – “Your package may be lost” . this is a clear case of fraud as my item is not with me and i am now out of pocket for £429. I believe the courier has signed on my behalf and i now refuse to do any further business with Amazon, but i will fight this until i get my money back. Appalling Amazon and sheer arrogance",2019-05-11 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,5.0,11.0,1882,346,34,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,hi thought id post share utter frustration latest experience amazon brief purchased item could posted letterbox also required signature proof delivery item delivered next day saturday confirmed upon checkout amazon site confirmation email stated tuesday called actual retailer confirmed issue amazon end find hard believe issue amazon dont make mistake done purposely continued purchase guarantee delivered tuesday tuesday came delivery called retailer rather amazon amazon slooow respond need answer quick retailer called courier dhl confirmed delivery wednesday family went away one week child school upon return proof attempted delivery item called retailer confirmed delivery made someone signed asked proof signature signature clearly mine anyone household neighbour even neighbour proof attempted delivery advise item left neighbour nothing amazon rejected claim refund even though item showing “one way running late” choose option track package read – “your package may lost” clear case fraud item pocket £ believe courier signed behalf refuse business amazon fight get money back appalling amazon sheer arrogance,0.013337614520556986,0.986662385479443,0.19405496354458776,0.2,0.832142185448639,83.21421854486391,High Trust
