Linda Tara,/users/5cd5627ca71a01bb84d02e6a,CN,1.0,2019-05-10 11:51:56+00:00,2.0,"Top too big, bottoms fit perfectly - just watch out for public hairs stuck to them!","I have so many mixed feelings about this set. I really wanted to love it. And I do love the bottoms. But the top is too big for me- I am 5’4” 110 lbs 34C, 26, 36.5, and got a small- the top just won’t stay up on its own without support from the shoulders. This is frustrating because I got this just so that it could be sleeveless. If there was a smaller sized top, it would probably be perfect for me. ALSO- the main reason for the 1 star, other than the top fitting so poorly, is that on the adhesive liner on the bottoms (which had been somewhat peeling upward by the time I got them), there was a... I hate to say this, because this is so utterly disgusting, but there was a pubic hair stuck to it. Listen, I get that other people need to try these bikinis on to see if they fit, but that’s just revolting. You should not be sending your “brand new” products out to customers with pubic hairs stuck to them. That’s the main reason for this poor review- I really wanted to LOVE this item and had such high hopes. But sadly I’ll be returning.",2019-05-10 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,5.0,10.0,1044,206,83,16,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,many mixed feeling set really wanted love love bottom top big ’” lb c got small top won’t stay without support shoulder frustrating got could sleeveless smaller sized top would probably perfect also main reason star top fitting poorly adhesive liner bottom somewhat peeling upward time got hate say utterly disgusting pubic hair stuck listen get people need try bikini see fit that’s revolting sending “brand new” product customer pubic hair stuck that’s main reason poor review really wanted love item high hope sadly i’ll returning,0.017190194722719928,0.9828098052772801,0.1155356141334829,0.4,1.1145120254653367,111.45120254653366,High Trust
