Justin,/users/5cc9e82be7d72bb47655eda2,US,1.0,2019-05-01 18:44:37+00:00,1.0,Too big to care anymore.,"In the past I have been such a strong supporter of Amazon and Whole Foods. Immensely matter of fact to the point others know more about my Prime membership than what I do for work. Until recently I had no problem with the occasional late delivery, higher than other sites price or invasion of Amazon devices. This has all changed due to the latest fiasco and complete ignorance of CS. I am now not relying on Amazon as my go to for anything I can find elsewhere. I will curb my visits to Whole Foods due to not wanting to contribute to the furthering of the dominance of the markets. I will not recommend either first before others no more. Besides half of my packages arriving late anymore, my latest order after being 4 days late I was offered a refund for my trouble, I accepted, and drove the 67 miles to the nearest Amazon pickup location to find the delivery cancelled due to refund!? I made absolutely clear I was not asking for a refund I only wanted my order, but agreed after being asked twice with assurance it would not effect my delivery finally arriving that day. After this was found out and I was standing at the pickup location, 67 miles away, I was told by 4 employees there is nothing that can be done ""after an order is refunded."" !!!???What!!??? I explained to each employee I did not ASK for a refund I was OFFERED the refund! And a refund would not effect the order in that way, a CANCELLATION might?? Which was THEIR mistake not mine!! The package had just arrived before I got there and was either in the back, in the local independent couriers vehicle still, or back at the warehouse only 25 mins away. The pickup location was open for 2 more hrs I explained. No one gave a enough to correct THEIR mistake and I am not an Amazon fan any longer.",2019-05-01 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,5.0,1.0,1770,331,24,5,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,past strong supporter amazon whole food immensely matter fact point others know prime membership work recently problem occasional late delivery higher site price invasion amazon device changed due latest fiasco complete ignorance c relying amazon go anything find elsewhere curb visit whole food due wanting contribute furthering dominance market recommend either first others besides half package arriving late anymore latest order day late offered refund trouble accepted drove mile nearest amazon pickup location find delivery cancelled due refund made absolutely clear asking refund wanted order agreed asked twice assurance would effect delivery finally arriving day found standing pickup location mile away told employee nothing done order refunded explained employee ask refund offered refund refund would effect order way cancellation might mistake mine package arrived got either back local independent courier vehicle still back warehouse min away pickup location open hr explained one gave enough correct mistake amazon fan longer,0.9999070504256938,9.294957430616702e-05,0.1856421761076837,0.2,0.3371749100086898,33.71749100086898,Low Trust
