Joy Skrzypek,/users/5cc6453d8eb10e2521ac24b6,US,3.0,2019-04-29 00:28:53+00:00,1.0,Not worth $$ for Prime,"I was a Prime member since the beginning, not any more. The AZUL (Amazon Logistics) is a joke. When my packages come ANY other way - no problems. Every single package being delivered by Amazon themselves?? Lost, dropped in wrong area, lost, not deliverable, lost, lost, delivered to wrong place, and now, today 4:35pm ""your package is 3 stops away"", at 8:00pm ""your package is delayed, if you don't have it by Thursday (today is Sunday) contact us"". Absolutely terrible",2019-04-29 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,29.0,469,80,22,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime member since beginning azul amazon logistics joke package come way problem every single package delivered amazon lost dropped wrong area lost deliverable lost lost delivered wrong place today pm package stop away pm package delayed dont thursday today sunday contact u absolutely terrible,0.03542010246890177,0.9645798975310982,0.044868199663488505,0.2,0.7912635886982468,79.12635886982467,High Trust
Hallieand Cody Mote,/users/5cc615c7fcc15708b68270c9,US,1.0,2019-04-28 21:06:22+00:00,2.0,Amazon delivery was absolutely,"Amazon delivery was absolutely terrible! I ordered at the beginning of the week with an expected delivery of saturday the 27, they arrived on the 25th. However, they delivered to the wrong address. They reordered them after me arguing with them for 2 hours and started they would be here no later than saturday the 27, this morning I looked and they had been out for delivery for 12 hours at a facility 15 minutes from my location. When i called they started that they would credit $5 to my account for anything amazon specifically sells. (As if I would use them again) then I tracked when my package would be delivered, get this, it was delivered to the SAME WRONG address! I figured out where it was and called them, I had to personally go and pick up my package from a strangers house. The ONLY reason I am doing 2 stars is because they refunded me my money after 3 problems, however they did hassle me about that.",2019-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,28.0,917,170,30,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon delivery absolutely terrible ordered beginning week expected delivery saturday arrived th however delivered wrong address reordered arguing hour started would later saturday morning looked delivery hour facility minute location called started would credit account anything amazon specifically sell would use tracked package would delivered get delivered wrong address figured called personally go pick package stranger house reason star refunded money problem however hassle,0.36402149709223,0.63597850290777,0.09534492428491306,0.4,0.9370582363108676,93.70582363108676,High Trust
NVM,/users/5cc4713bfcc15750e5816b1c,US,19.0,2019-04-28 15:53:02+00:00,2.0,There are good products with good…,"There are good products with good prices but the shipping for countries like Macedonia(now North Macedonia) are way too high. I bought few  items from them like sandals-gladiator, Samsung galaxy s6 edge, coat, sex toy make up.. but the shipping oh man. Macedonian with $150 salary can't afford it. u need to change the shipping to Free or at least to $2. Plus the customs fee on the products are insane. Maybe it's  not your fault maybe is  this country but at least u can lower the shipping prices and add some more products available for buying for Macedonia too.thanks",2019-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,28.0,571,100,34,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,good product good price shipping country like macedonianow north macedonia way high bought item like sandalsgladiator samsung galaxy edge coat sex toy make shipping oh man macedonian salary cant afford u need change shipping free least plus custom fee product insane maybe fault maybe country least u lower shipping price add product available buying macedonia toothanks,0.0771403678688628,0.9228596321311372,0.056085249579360626,0.4,1.0726468659814408,107.26468659814408,High Trust
Jason Commo,/users/5cc5c45cfcc15733578227f6,US,1.0,2019-04-28 15:19:01+00:00,1.0,Lied to for 2 days,"I paid for 2 day shipping, Friday I have one update saying it is in Texas. I call customer service Friday and am told that it will be on the truck in morning. Saturday I check my updates and it doesn’t say shipped but I wait. Then 7 I get an update that it is going to be late so I call and see what happened, again am told that it will be on the truck in the morning. This morning I get no update and I finally get told it’s lost. Liars atleast someone was honest.",2019-04-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,28.0,465,97,18,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,paid day shipping friday one update saying texas call customer service friday told truck morning saturday check update doesn’t say shipped wait get update going late call see happened told truck morning morning get update finally get told it’s lost liar atleast someone honest,0.03432226610596438,0.9656777338940357,0.05440269209197981,0.2,0.7937194053654139,79.37194053654139,High Trust
