GaryCarolyn Bordin,/users/5cc3100efcc1571a99804909,US,2.0,2019-04-26 14:05:12+00:00,1.0,We ordered a bike for our granddaughter…,"We ordered a bike for our granddaughter when it went on sale, only to have the seller and Amazon not honor the sale, and not responding to our emails.  Amazon is blaming the seller, but has the bike available to ship in 2 days for double the price.  Classic bait and switch.",2019-04-26 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,26.0,274,52,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered bike granddaughter went sale seller amazon honor sale responding email amazon blaming seller bike available ship day double price classic bait switch,0.025853832925362318,0.9741461670746376,0.029164329781267526,0.2,0.7929059494935723,79.29059494935723,High Trust
