Niharika,/users/5cc21cc9cf18bc6e8bc2f736,US,2.0,2019-04-25 20:47:07+00:00,1.0,I ordered a Sectional Sofa from Poundex…,"I ordered a Sectional Sofa from Poundex  through Amazon on April 9th 2019. On the 11th April Amazon updated my order as shipped and on Thursday April 18th as delivered. I was hoping my package to be delivered to the address I provided but unfortunately the package got delivered to a different address in Vernal, UT. I contacted the seller to get an update as to what went wrong to which the seller replied stating the below: “Hello, we can resend you, it usually takes about 17-28 days to arrive. “ When I replied saying it shows delivered the seller replied as below : Dear friends,The post office sent the wrong address, which is really not what we want, but we have no right to control the post office.We believe that we will not let our customers suffer losses.So we apologize for waiting for a long time. A full refund has been given to you. please check carefully.This is the first day of my work. . I hope to apologize for your bad shopping experience. Please check your Amazon account when you are free.”I replied stating my disappointment because I lost good deals because of this and I wanted my package instead the refund. The company replied stating the below: “Hello, your tracking number LT662630612CN” Now when I track the number it shows invalid. I have been trying to follow-up with amazon as well for the same issue and amazon keeps stating that seller will contact you. Talking about best customer experience, I have been a loyal customer for amazon since years and this has never happened to me. I am very disappointed with this experience. I am still waiting for amazon to take action to this kind of customer service but every time I call they tell me the seller will contact you. I never expected such customer service from amazon. I do have lost my blind trust on ordering things through amazon after this incident. I am still waiting for amazon to take some action to this in order to keep my faith as a loyal customer with amazon. Its been almost a week leading me nowhere. The same happened to my friend and he chose a refund instead of getting into all this hassle. I understand that is a smart move but then I lost on so many good deals because of this and now I have to go over everything again. I am so disappointed.",2019-04-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,25.0,2248,409,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered sectional sofa poundex amazon april th th april amazon updated order shipped thursday april th delivered hoping package delivered address provided unfortunately package got delivered different address vernal ut contacted seller get update went wrong seller replied stating “hello resend usually take day arrive “ replied saying show delivered seller replied dear friendsthe post office sent wrong address really want right control post officewe believe let customer suffer lossesso apologize waiting long time full refund given please check carefullythis first day work hope apologize bad shopping experience please check amazon account free”i replied stating disappointment lost good deal wanted package instead refund company replied stating “hello tracking number ltcn” track number show invalid trying followup amazon well issue amazon keep stating seller contact talking best customer experience loyal customer amazon since year never happened disappointed experience still waiting amazon take action kind customer service every time call tell seller contact never expected customer service amazon lost blind trust ordering thing amazon incident still waiting amazon take action order keep faith loyal customer amazon almost week leading nowhere happened friend chose refund instead getting hassle understand smart move lost many good deal go everything disappointed,0.007527072558111551,0.9924729274418884,0.22938867077958497,0.2,0.8421141978768613,84.21141978768613,High Trust
Julian,/users/5821dc8d0000ff000a5542e5,GB,14.0,2019-04-25 20:32:09+00:00,1.0,A-Z Guarantee does not guarantee if item becomes faulty within 30 days of purchase,"Amazon cannot resolve issues with faulty products.I bought an item that became faulty and Amazon could not resolve the issue.  Their A-Z Guarantee is only valid if the item becomes faulty within 30 days of purchase.  Otherwise, you are not covered.  You are completely at the mercy of sellers as Amazon is useless.",2019-04-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,25.0,314,53,82,14,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon cannot resolve issue faulty productsi bought item became faulty amazon could resolve issue az guarantee valid item becomes faulty within day purchase otherwise covered completely mercy seller amazon useless,0.011043650528917334,0.9889563494710827,0.029725182277061134,0.2,0.8004232111909536,80.04232111909536,High Trust
tjp,/users/5cc212fdfcc157e8fd7f79e1,US,1.0,2019-04-25 20:10:47+00:00,1.0,I think I've had it with Amazon,"I think I've had it with Amazon.  One of the most important things I use to trust on Amazon was the so called ""verified purchase"" reviews. I no longer do and here is why.I have over 4 months or so, received 4 different emails from 4 different company's that I have given less than favorable review of the products they sell/ sold to me. The emails I received from these companies all asked that I amend my review to a more favorable one in exchange for a monetary gift. Either a discount of their less than favorable items, or an Amazon gift card. To me these amount to bribes, bribes to change my review from less than favorable to a favorable one.To warn other potential buyers of this scam/bribes, I did modify my review of these items, but not in a favorable way, but to warn other buyers, what these sellers are doing and that it puts the so called ""verified purchase""  reviews, all of them as suspect.Since I did this, Amazon has sent me a threatening email warning me that this is inappropriate and issued this warning of what I'm not sure of some sort of punitive action if I don't straighten up and fly right so to speak. I assume Amazon does not want their holy grail of reviews to be dissed in any way.What if anything they did to the companies offering bribes in exchange for a more positive rating, I don't know..... As far as I'm concerned, Amazon can go pound sand, I have no trust in them or their reviews whatsoever.  Since I can't warn other potential buyers of what is happening directly in the product review that I'm being bribed over, I will try here and other sites to try and get the word out.",2019-04-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,25.0,1617,301,31,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,think ive amazon one important thing use trust amazon called verified purchase review longer whyi month received different email different company given less favorable review product sell sold email received company asked amend review favorable one exchange monetary gift either discount less favorable item amazon gift card amount bribe bribe change review less favorable favorable oneto warn potential buyer scambribes modify review item favorable way warn buyer seller put called verified purchase review suspectsince amazon sent threatening email warning inappropriate issued warning im sure sort punitive action dont straighten fly right speak assume amazon want holy grail review dissed waywhat anything company offering bribe exchange positive rating dont know far im concerned amazon go pound sand trust review whatsoever since cant warn potential buyer happening directly product review im bribed try site try get word,0.013076458945255274,0.9869235410547448,0.16881660123387549,0.2,0.8272250907741474,82.72250907741474,High Trust
