Victoria,/users/59f635e30000ff000adb8b47,GB,7.0,2019-04-22 18:53:41+00:00,1.0,Wish I could give zero stars!,"Wish I could give zero stars!! It all started 8 days ago when I placed an order for a luggage set. Everything seemed fine until I looked at my orders the next day and noticed that it needed a revised payment method. I did just that and the same happened again. I rang my card company and they said everything eas ok there end. I then tried a few other cards which did the same. I rang and was assured it was resolved. It was not. Tried again, didn’t work so rang again. Was assured it would be fixed and I’d get a call back within 30 minutes. I did not. Tried again, didn’t work so rang again. Was told it will be passed to the payment team and they would definitely resolve it. They did not. Tried again and again and rang them back to be greeted by a fourth advisor that said aw I don’t know should I just cancel it. The set had been discontinued and that was the last one available in the UK which I’d explained. Still no further help so I cancelled every subscription I have with them. I then emailed my issues I have had with them. Since then I have received countless calls directing me to an advisor while they argued that I called them. I did not. One advisor then said we’ll thanks for calls you have a nice day. Terrible customer service. All I wanted to do was order an item simple and effective. Well that didn’t happen. I’ve had to deal with 8 days of crap. Keep acting this way and it won’t just be my family who won’t order from you again. I’ll be sure to make sure all my family and friends hear about your terrible service too so they can decide if you’re worth the hassle. You clearly aren’t as customer focused as you make out to be!!",2019-04-22 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,22.0,1653,322,29,6,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,wish could give zero star started day ago placed order luggage set everything seemed fine looked order next day noticed needed revised payment method happene