Unknown,/users/5cb882b87fe1089acb1c41a7,US,1.0,2019-04-18 13:59:59+00:00,1.0,You ca not ask for a refund With out being suspended,"I ordered some items from amazon PRIME! however I got everything else i ordered but some ot the items i ordered I didn't get, However They sent me an email that stated this"" As we informed you earlier, we have closed this account. This is because you have consistently asked us to issue refunds for a large number of your orders. While we expect the occasional problem with an order, we cannot continue to issue refunds to you at this rate.I have cancelled your prime membership and a refund of 13.9 USD was issued to your account.After a thorough review, we have decided not to restore your full access to this account. You will not be able to place orders on our site. If you have any digital content on this account, you can access the content from the “Manage Your Content and Devices” link on the Your Account menu on Amazon.com.he last order was for a phone case that was to small. It was for an iphone XR and I got an Iphone max. I asked to send it back and just resend the same exact phone  case back out,instead the agent told me "" oh now ill put the  funds on a gift card and you can go find it and order it yourself. the moral of this review is ' all because I asked for a refund on items that I did not receive I got my account closed. delivery companies make mistakes as well and let me tell you how I know. My order was delivered three houses down from mines but I got my account closed because I notified them , I work hard for my money and If i see something that is not right I am going to speak on it. I don't even write reviews but I have been with amazon  for a while now and it is not right. the closed my account all because I did not receive my items and I called them on it. Out of the million items I've ordered from them i didn't receive 2 and the total was no more than 100.00 it was actually to be exact 98.78 and they closed my account after i've spent over 500.00 with them in the past month.all I'm saying is if you want to continue to work with tem and you place an order and don't receive it please do not contact them they will close your account due to that.amazon not the only site, there are more sites you can order from. Ill just wait the extra day.",2019-04-18 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,18.0,2188,432,52,11,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ordered item amazon prime however got everything else ordered ot item ordered didnt get however sent email stated informed earlier closed account consistently asked u issue refund large number order expect occasional problem order cannot continue issue refund ratei cancelled prime membership refund usd issued accountafter thorough review decided restore full access account able place order site digital content account access content “manage content devices” link account menu amazoncomhe last order phone case small iphone xr got iphone max asked send back resend exact phone case back outinstead agent told oh ill put fund gift card go find order moral review asked refund item receive got account closed delivery company make mistake well let tell know order delivered three house mine got account closed notified work hard money see something right going speak dont even write review amazon right closed account receive item called million item ive ordered didnt receive total actually exact closed account ive spent past monthall im saying want continue work tem place order dont receive please contact close account due thatamazon site site order ill wait extra day,0.011606448880656702,0.9883935511193433,0.2422882781828379,0.2,0.8426544311962393,84.26544311962392,High Trust
