Natasha Banks,/users/5cb68dbc854e7a69ed7b6586,AU,1.0,2019-04-17 02:23:46+00:00,1.0,Beware of purchasing for kindle.,"Amazon has one click purchasing for kindle, at my own error I didn’t realise another account was logged in and the purchase went to another account. I phoned immediately to cancel and they placed a ‘promo’ on my account instead of a direct refund which you apparently cannot see on your account and as there’s no cart for digital purchases there’s no way of knowing if this promo has been applied (according to my email this is standard practice). I made the purchase again and the full amount came off my card. I phoned and outlined the issue to which I was told that the kindle books are a third party seller - something you aren’t aware of and the promo can’t be used. Therefore not only has the money been spent and not refunded, I don’t have the books I wanted, I have a promo I can’t use and the only solution they can offer is I spend the money again to purchase the books. Stick to Apple iBooks people. Not only does amazon pay its employees pittance, but they’ll steal your money too.",2019-04-17 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,17.0,993,185,32,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon one click purchasing kindle error didn’t realise another account logged purchase went another account phoned immediately cancel placed ‘promo’ account instead direct refund apparently cannot see account there’s cart digital purchase there’s way knowing promo applied according email standard practice made purchase full amount came card phoned outlined issue told kindle book third party seller something aren’t aware promo can’t used therefore money spent refunded don’t book wanted promo can’t use solution offer spend money purchase book stick apple ibooks people amazon pay employee pittance they’ll steal money,0.009664044450363857,0.9903359555496362,0.10375771172181716,0.2,0.8159195201191815,81.59195201191814,High Trust
