Amber Pullin,/users/5cb4df07710f036c0bdfb080,US,1.0,2019-04-15 19:44:09+00:00,2.0,Charged double for stupid policy no one knows about.,"It’s okay. I got the free trial for prime, got most my stuff in 2 days. The MAJOR problem I have with amazon, is placing a hold/ charging me twice. So instead of $120 coming out of my account $240 did and now we have to wait on our bank to release the “hold” on MY money. Amazon apparently sends a hold for the money, then after it’s paid and shipped they release it, which it’s been 4 days now and haven’t seen any of my money. Luckily I had the extra funds and transferred or I’d be catching a $36 over draft charge for this bs too.",2019-04-15 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,15.0,534,108,52,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,it’s okay got free trial prime got stuff day major problem amazon placing hold charging twice instead coming account wait bank release “hold” money amazon apparently sends hold money it’s paid shipped release it’s day haven’t seen money luckily extra fund transferred i’d catching draft charge b,0.028330088140540194,0.9716699118594598,0.06057206954570948,0.4,1.0979493698388716,109.79493698388715,High Trust
Peter Anderson,/users/5cb4d14bd8ab4323f97c7e3b,US,3.0,2019-04-15 19:15:30+00:00,5.0,"Things go wrong in this business of delivering things. When it does, Amazon will always try and make it right...","If anything goes wrong, Amazon normally have your back. They are very easy to do business with. Once (a few years ago) I bought a Xbox One and it came with 2 controllers. One of the controllers was slightly damaged, but still functional. I contacted Amazon and instead of asking for me to send the entire console back, they just gave me a refund for the value of one of the controllers so I could buy a functional one. I ended up with 3 controllers so I was very happy! You can tell that their true mission is to be the number one company for customer service.",2019-04-15 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,15.0,560,107,112,20,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,anything go wrong amazon normally back easy business year ago bought xbox one came controller one controller slightly damaged still functional contacted amazon instead asking send entire console back gave refund value one controller could buy functional one ended controller happy tell true mission number one company customer service,0.057440812761009825,0.9425591872389901,0.06001121704991587,1.0,1.9832818370294782,198.32818370294783,High Trust
