Kerry,/users/5cb1ab06b67c03bf09c1359f,GB,7.0,2019-04-14 10:59:46+00:00,1.0,Dishonest website,"Dishonest website, I never signed up to Amazon Prime yet every year I am charged £79.99 for it, which takes weeks to get back from Amazon. How can you be charged for something you never purchased. Like wise the Amazon fire which was advertised as being safe for children to use with a parental control panel is not child safe, I only noticed my 7 year old managed to get around it when I had charges for downloaded games on my bank statement, so he got around it with out being stopped by parental control box which requires a parent to type in a 4 digit code in order to exit from the childs zone. I asked my son to show me how and it's so easy to do it's frightening. False advertising right there, why advertise a tabled for kids if it's not child proof, then theres the packaging issue, I purchased two very small items which came in a box big enough for a microwave with what looks like 50meters of brown paper and 10 lots of air bags and I'm charged extorionatley for that, this is not acceptable behaviour. Oh and I'd love to know why Amazon sell books on peadophilia that's just bang out of order yet they block books of trusted sources. Amazon is a disgusting company run by the elete who actually ban honest reviews of products and shut people down if they speak out.",2019-04-14 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,14.0,1277,241,17,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,dishonest website never signed amazon prime yet every year charged £ take week get back amazon charged something never purchased like wise amazon fire advertised safe child use parental control panel child safe noticed year old managed get around charge downloaded game bank statement got around stopped parental control box requires parent type digit code order exit child zone asked son show easy frightening false advertising right advertise tabled kid child proof there packaging issue purchased two small item came box big enough microwave look like meter brown paper lot air bag im charged extorionatley acceptable behaviour oh id love know amazon sell book peadophilia thats bang order yet block book trusted source amazon disgusting company run elete actually ban honest review product shut people speak,0.006936387249177149,0.9930636127508229,0.1351654514862591,0.2,0.8235648966726633,82.35648966726633,High Trust
