Georgia Onmymind,/users/5cb25080c81c2f084eaab46c,US,3.0,2019-04-13 21:52:21+00:00,5.0,Highly recommended.  Excellent customer service,"I have never had an uncorrected problem with amazon for anything.  They always make things right whenever something minor pops up, such as a lost package.  Several times, the package showed up later, and they let me keep the original and replacement products.  But there is room for improvement.  Sometimes, the product information or reviews of products area mixed up, or they let bogus reviews stay online for too long.  Hopefully, their algorithms will improve over time to fix these issues too.",2019-04-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,13.0,498,82,47,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,never uncorrected problem amazon anything always make thing right whenever something minor pop lost package several time package showed later let keep original replacement product room improvement sometimes product information review product area mixed let bogus review stay online long hopefully algorithm improve time fix issue,0.022588838249998355,0.9774111617500016,0.045989904655075714,1.0,1.9979035618060161,199.7903561806016,High Trust
Gary,/users/5cb22dddc81c2fe56faa97e8,US,3.0,2019-04-13 18:43:44+00:00,2.0,I've had Prime for many years and order…,"I've had Prime for many years and order tons of things through them.  But their service has gone down hill drastically.  They lose track of shipments and their customer service reps are from third world countries and hard to understand, plus you get the ""canned"" company line/talking points.  As they up the Prime fee, they lower the quality of the shipping.  Many times their ""two day shipping"" loses it's sparkle when it takes 2-5 days to ship, meaning their two day shipping takes 4-7 days to receive the package!  Their latest. ""shipping with Amazon"" is the worst.  They sub contract with companies to deliver for them.  Latest screw up they not only did not know where my package was, they didn't even know what company was delivering it!  It's gotten so bad that I have them on speed dial.  LOL",2019-04-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,13.0,800,140,40,8,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,ive prime many year order ton thing service gone hill drastically lose track shipment customer service rep third world country hard understand plus get canned company linetalking point prime fee lower quality shipping many time two day shipping loses sparkle take day ship meaning two day shipping take day receive package latest shipping amazon worst sub contract company deliver latest screw know package didnt even know company delivering gotten bad speed dial lol,0.3107779682134796,0.6892220317865204,0.07851934941110487,0.4,0.9603148857754811,96.0314885775481,High Trust
jerry yarberry,/users/5cb21f9db67c0336e3c1b105,US,2.0,2019-04-13 17:43:51+00:00,4.0,From the get-gp on my profile there is…,"From the get-gp on my profile there is a listOf all my debit cards like 5 the last one isthe only one that is active and can't delete old one from deleted closed accounts from closed Bank of America accounts.. I'm with Chase bank..mBeen on phone with several chat  personalFinally last on I chatted with said refund takes 3-5 business days... hope it works out, and I'm just got product on AmazonThat I want... refund money is going right back to them..Still can't believe the super Fast shipping......"" AMAZON AWESOME""Thanks 😊 Jly",2019-04-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,13.0,531,92,39,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,getgp profile listof debit card like last one isthe one active cant delete old one deleted closed account closed bank america account im chase bankmbeen phone several chat personalfinally last chatted said refund take business day hope work im got product amazonthat want refund money going right back themstill cant believe super fast shipping amazon awesomethanks 😊 jly,0.04692775614743079,0.9530722438525692,0.051598429613011774,0.8,1.6868558078488871,168.6855807848887,High Trust
Jermaine Michael Jones,/users/5b0da1b44de5666d34af2715,GB,10.0,2019-04-13 11:11:05+00:00,1.0,Absolutely the most shocking company to…,"Absolutely the most shocking company to ever deal with! Someone has been using my card to make purchases on their account only found out due to a bank statement, I called them up to have my card details removed to then be told we can not remove your card details on another person account due to data protection act !!! It’s my card where is my data protection?? Absolutely stupid uneducated people working behind the scenes at Amazon and to allow one of their customers to continue to use my card is outrageous!!! I’ve had to block the card so that no more transaction come from this card but for Amazon not to remove my card is a joke it’s my card and they have breached my data protection due to me making them aware of this fraud and for their manager to do sweet FA!!!!",2019-04-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,13.0,774,146,40,6,0.0,0,11,2,1,Suspicious,absolutely shocking company ever deal someone using card make purchase account found due bank statement called card detail removed told remove card detail another person account due data protection act it’s card data protection absolutely stupid uneducated people working behind scene amazon allow one customer continue use card outrageous i’ve block card transaction come card amazon remove card joke it’s card breached data protection due making aware fraud manager sweet fa,0.999998857785605,1.142214394955765e-06,0.08188446438586652,0.2,0.3163774639843708,31.637746398437077,Low Trust
elena,/users/5cb16dcd2d7a9595380277dd,IL,8.0,2019-04-13 05:09:57+00:00,2.0,Why should I keep buying on Amazon?!,"I recently acquired some products and I expected the shopping experience on your platform to be very positive from the beginning to the end, that is, until I receive my products at the indicated address during the process billing.I have not received my purchase yet, but I am already thinking about avoiding future purchases on your platform, so as not to have the hassles and wear that the delivery of the purchased products generates. My reasons are simple and important to not buy back from Amazon:It is already several days that I am receiving text messages sent by B2C (Bar Group Services), the company designated by Amazon in Israel to deliver the purchases to Israeli buyers.The messages have a link for an interactive application that should facilitate delivery coordination, but ... it does not work, there is no interaction, it does not lead to any contact.Searching the internet, I found the single line of customer service ... and it does not work either! The client only hears the pre-recorded message about the service schedule, restricted to the service between 8am and 5pm during the work week and from 8am to 12m on Fridays. Even so, no one answers the client even within these very tight times: during the whole day the only thing the user hears is the pre-recorded message with the promise of returning his call to the number of which the client has communicated. When? It is not known, because nobody called me back. In summary, the transport company chosen by Amazon for Israeli buyers only has two telephone recordings: 1) Reminder of customer service hours; 2) The promise to return the call without referring to the deadline.Finishing: I buy in several platforms of different products and I enjoy them a lot, because I receive them quickly and in perfect conditions. But the same does not happen with Amazon products, because the delivery is long, tortuous and forces me to waste my time to move to remote and difficult locations, which were not stipulated in the billing of my purchase. Since the same products can be found on other E-Commerce platforms, why should I keep buying on Amazon?",2019-04-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,13.0,2115,360,36,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,recently acquired product expected shopping experience platform positive beginning end receive product indicated address process billingi received purchase yet already thinking avoiding future purchase platform hassle wear delivery purchased product generates reason simple important buy back amazonit already several day receiving text message sent bc bar group service company designated amazon israel deliver purchase israeli buyersthe message link interactive application facilitate delivery coordination work interaction lead contactsearching internet found single line customer service work either client hears prerecorded message service schedule restricted service pm work week friday even one answer client even within tight time whole day thing user hears prerecorded message promise returning call number client communicated known nobody called back summary transport company chosen amazon israeli buyer two telephone recording reminder customer service hour promise return call without referring deadlinefinishing buy several platform different product enjoy lot receive quickly perfect condition happen amazon product delivery long tortuous force waste time move remote difficult location stipulated billing purchase since product found ecommerce platform keep buying amazon,0.04333160313965442,0.9566683968603455,0.20190689848569826,0.4,1.1187155781273124,111.87155781273124,High Trust
