Aiden Kind,/users/5cb08d48b158a82c8a44e8fe,US,1.0,2019-04-12 13:13:31+00:00,1.0,Amazon just blocked me from writing…,Amazon just blocked me from writing reviews for absolutely no reason. It says I violated the guidelines. Which is a joke. And even some of my verified purchase reviews are hidden by the sensitivity filter. I think it's pretty common knowledge Amazon is full off fake reviews and yet I can't reviews products they actually know I purchased. What a scam. I'll be avoiding Amazon from here out. EBay is usually cheaper and now they have just as many items with fast and free shipping. And I don't need to pay membership fees. There's no need for you anymore Amazon,2019-04-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,12.0,561,100,36,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon blocked writing review absolutely reason say violated guideline joke even verified purchase review hidden sensitivity filter think pretty common knowledge amazon full fake review yet cant review product actually know purchased scam ill avoiding amazon ebay usually cheaper many item fast free shipping dont need pay membership fee there need anymore amazon,0.024978713403952774,0.9750212865960473,0.056085249579360626,0.2,0.7987276932138958,79.87276932138958,High Trust
Lee J,/users/588773f10000ff000a6fd7e0,GB,56.0,2019-04-12 08:28:18+00:00,1.0,*DO NOT TRUST AMAZON*,"*DO NOT TRUST AMAZON*Everyone who has EVER purchased anything on Amazon check all of your bank statements very closely. Look for Prime that you have never subscribed to also for Amazon Music. When you place an order with a third party seller, they (Amazon) have a habit of ""accidentally"" signing you up to one of these subscription services and charging to ANY CARD that has been used to buy a product. Even if it is not in the name of the person who holds the Amazon account.Example! My 70 year old mother was being billed for Amazon music, she did not even know about this. It went on for months. Finally yesterday I got to the cause of it and Amazon has agreed to refund ALL 8 wrongfully claimed payments from a pensioner. That amounted to almost £80 STOLEN from a vulnerable person.They also agreed to refund the £9.99 STOLEN from my card. It only came to my attention when I used my mothers Amazon to order an item from a third party seller. When I checked my card. I had been charged £9.99 for Amazon music, as my mother's registered card was lost and had to be cancelled and replaced. So Amazon took the money without authorisation from my account. Just to add. I have now been charged £1 by amazon only a day after this scamming, thieving, fraudulent bunch of vultures ""apologised"" for stealing money. I therefore deleted both my card and my mother's card from amazon. I suggest EVERYONE does the same. If you buy anything on Amazon, DO NOT STORE YOUR CARD!!! Simply input it for each transaction. Your money is NOT SAFE!! Better than that NEVER USE AMAZON. We never will again!!Had this not happened, and I had not been charged my mother would never have known about this and Amazon would have continued pocketing her money. Along with their tax avoidance schemes. So be warned. This company openly admitted to me that the system sometimes ""accidentally"" subscribes when a purchase is made. The person who scripted Amazon's website must be a total amateur if this is what happens. So everyone get checking you statements, if you see one payment to AMAZON MUSIC or AMAZON PRIME, that you have not asked for, go to your bank (or call them) Order statements dating back to when you first started using Amazon. You may find more unauthorised charges. Also if you have elderly parents who use amazon help them check their account. Amazon do not pay tax correctly, why should they also get away with STEALING from vulnerable people.My mother's was almost £80, your refund could be more, It depends how long it has been ongoing. But every penny they have taken without permission will be refunded. And Amazon if you're reading this. ALL CARDS have now been removed from your scummy site and not one more order will be placed using Amazon. Sorry this is a long post but it needed explaining in case amazon are stealing from others. They certainly won't check their end, as long as they get their money coming in. So ensure you all check.I would love to have replies on here of anyone who checks their account and finds they have been unknowingly charged. I know for a fact amazon do it frequently, my bank told me this and even said they refund people OFTEN. So there is a good chance of you being owed and I would love to hear about your situation.Thanks for reading.",2019-04-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,12.0,3269,585,21,4,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,trust amazoneveryone ever purchased anything amazon check bank statement closely look prime never subscribed also amazon music place order third party seller amazon habit accidentally signing one subscription service charging card used buy product even name person hold amazon accountexample year old mother billed amazon music even know went month finally yesterday got cause amazon agreed refund wrongfully claimed payment pensioner amounted almost £ stolen vulnerable personthey also agreed refund £ stolen card came attention used mother amazon order item third party seller checked card charged £ amazon music mother registered card lost cancelled replaced amazon took money without authorisation account add charged £ amazon day scamming thieving fraudulent bunch vulture apologised stealing money therefore deleted card mother card amazon suggest everyone buy anything amazon store card simply input transaction money safe better never use amazon never againhad happened charged mother would never known amazon would continued pocketing money along tax avoidance scheme warned company openly admitted system sometimes accidentally subscribes purchase made person scripted amazon website must total amateur happens everyone get checking statement see one payment amazon music amazon prime asked go bank call order statement dating back first started using amazon may find unauthorised charge also elderly parent use amazon help check account amazon pay tax correctly also get away stealing vulnerable peoplemy mother almost £ refund could depends long ongoing every penny taken without permission refunded amazon youre reading card removed scummy site one order placed using amazon sorry long post needed explaining case amazon stealing others certainly wont check end long get money coming ensure checki would love reply anyone check account find unknowingly charged know fact amazon frequently bank told even said refund people often good chance owed would love hear situationthanks reading,0.9998095407029425,0.0001904592970575214,0.32809871003925967,0.2,0.36571497165638067,36.571497165638064,Low Trust
