Hate Apple Thieves,/users/5c7ef6d88b5c6043059eda1d,CA,3.0,2019-04-03 01:56:54+00:00,1.0,Amazon's owner Geoff Bezos has become a…,"Amazon's owner Geoff Bezos has become a mult-billionaire and now I know why. I order the HEPA 11 filters in order to purify the air in my home. Instead, once the air started ciruclating through the house the stench was unbelievaable. The filters must be made from inferior products and I should NOT have installed the filter as the pleats were alll crooked and there was no brand name. But I trusted Amazon who, in the past, had been reliable until Bezos made his fortune and now handles garbage and ships that out with no conscience at all. The cost of a Trane furnace is a huge investment and my lungs are irreplaceable so the last thing I would do is install an inferior filterthat will pollute both the furnace and my house but more impportantly will damage my lungs as I have breathing problems as it is. That's why I spent so much on a high quality furnace and ordered the MERV 11 rating as that has always been adequate and I've NEVER before noticed any bad odors coming from the filter itself. I could not breathe and began choking and could hardly talk when I called customer service at Amazon. The person who answered could barely speak English and did not even know how to spell her name so I could made a record of my call. I insisted I be transferred to a manager and after a long, long wait someone came on the line whose English was equally incomprehensible. He was not even a manager but probably just one of her peers who was just faking being a supervisor. Do yourself a favor and recognize that men like Geoff Bezos become billionaires for a reason... they hire weak staff (putting it politely) and use resellers who send out junk. The box intself was in bad condition but I needed a new filter so I order a case of 3 to save on shipping. Instead I may have damaged my furnace. I quickly removed the ""new"" filter and put back the one I'd taken out and opened all the windows to try to get rid of the horrible bad odor that circulated throughout the house. As for a refund, probably not likely given the calibre of the staff I spoke with. I suggest for house products, especially something as essential as filters to purify the air you breathe DO NOT BUY ANYTHING LIKE THAT FROM AMAZON. Probably the only thing you can buy from Amazon with any confidence is a Kindle digitally delivered book.Those are still over priced but at least they won't destroy your expensive furance and pollute the air you breathe.",2019-04-03 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,3.0,2425,446,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon owner geoff bezos become multbillionaire know order hepa filter order purify air home instead air started ciruclating house stench unbelievaable filter must made inferior product installed filter pleat alll crooked brand name trusted amazon past reliable bezos made fortune handle garbage ship conscience cost trane furnace huge investment lung irreplaceable last thing would install inferior filterthat pollute furnace house impportantly damage lung breathing problem thats spent much high quality furnace ordered merv rating always adequate ive never noticed bad odor coming filter could breathe began choking could hardly talk called customer service amazon person answered could barely speak english even know spell name could made record call insisted transferred manager long long wait someone came line whose english equally incomprehensible even manager probably one peer faking supervisor favor recognize men like geoff bezos become billionaire reason hire weak staff putting politely use resellers send junk box intself bad condition needed new filter order case save shipping instead may damaged furnace quickly removed new filter put back one id taken opened window try get rid horrible bad odor circulated throughout house refund probably likely given calibre staff spoke suggest house product especially something essential filter purify air breathe buy anything like amazon probably thing buy amazon confidence kindle digitally delivered bookthose still priced least wont destroy expensive furance pollute air breathe,0.01254669710063549,0.9874533028993645,0.2501402131239484,0.2,0.8437546940744719,84.37546940744718,High Trust
