Lorraine Pauley,/users/5c5f0beda0148b5344b0c323,US,5.0,2019-04-01 17:24:58+00:00,2.0,"I love Amazon, sort of.","I love Amazon,  Well i use to love Amazon. I hate to write a negative review for them , but this last item was just to much for me.  I ordered a floor mirror that is on a stand that you can adjust.  Well as i'm trying to put this thing together, (which i hate doing) following the instructions with these screws and o rings.  I find out i'm short an o ring, for the bottom part,  hoping that won't matter much, i press on.. then find out i'm missing a whole screw for the bottom part of the stand!!  WHAT THE HELL!!  Isn't this stuff suppose to be checked ?  I am done ordering furniture thru these places online and having to put it together your self. It's bull##!#, there's always something that's wrong with it, if it's not missing parts, then it's wobbling, just not strong enough. And then returning it is a whole nother headache. I guess i'll go to the furniture store and buy it whole, and have it delivered.   Very, very, disappointed.",2019-04-01 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,4.0,1.0,944,177,23,5,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,love amazon well use love amazon hate write negative review last item much ordered floor mirror stand adjust well im trying put thing together hate following instruction screw ring find im short ring bottom part hoping wont matter much press find im missing whole screw bottom part stand hell isnt stuff suppose checked done ordering furniture thru place online put together self bull there always something thats wrong missing part wobbling strong enough returning whole nother headache guess ill go furniture store buy whole delivered disappointed,0.9848329358386559,0.015167064161344057,0.09927089175546831,0.4,0.6274377104317657,62.743771043176565,Medium Trust
