Linda,/users/5bc62f374de5666d346b83dc,US,4.0,2019-03-12 16:17:45+00:00,1.0,NOT WHAT THEY SAY!,"I have been a Prime member with Amazon for almost 10 years (maybe longer). When you placed an order marked ""Prime"", you ALWAYS got it in 2 days. We order about once/week. Yesterday morning I needed to order a few things. I went to place the first order which was not fulfilled by Amazon but shipped by Amazon so when I saw the estimated delivery time Friday the 15th, I was not bothered by it. Then I saw I had accumulated points and I wanted to order these yoga pants that I have been looking at. It was also a Prime product but was not fulfilled by Amazon but shipped by Amazon. Since I received the product for free, I paid the $3.99 expedited one day shipping. I just received noticed today that it really is not one day shipping but 2 day shipping (what a load of bull). So I started looking around in Amazon and choosing items that are Prime, In-Stock, Sold and Fulfilled BY Amazon. THEY ALL SAID DELIVERY BY FRIDAY. So tell me, what happened to the 2 day free shipping that Prime members receive. I called and spoke to 2 people and both were clueless and made excuse after excuse. There are no excuses. It is either 2 days shipping for Prime, In-Stock, Sold and Fulfilled BY Amazon or they have changed their shipping policies. Not happy at all and will start looking for alternatives before buying from Amazon.",2019-03-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,3.0,12.0,1318,244,18,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime member amazon almost year maybe longer placed order marked prime always got day order onceweek yesterday morning needed order thing went place first order fulfilled amazon shipped amazon saw estimated delivery time friday th bothered saw accumulated point wanted order yoga pant looking also prime product fulfilled amazon shipped amazon since received product free paid expedited one day shipping received noticed today really one day shipping day shipping load bull started looking around amazon choosing item prime instock sold fulfilled amazon said delivery friday tell happened day free shipping prime member receive called spoke people clueless made excuse excuse excuse either day shipping prime instock sold fulfilled amazon changed shipping policy happy start looking alternative buying amazon,0.0175633295776449,0.982436670422355,0.13684800897363994,0.2,0.8185879370059055,81.85879370059055,High Trust
SoniR,/users/57a205450000ff000a377357,GB,12.0,2019-03-12 12:42:36+00:00,1.0,Amazon.com is the worst customer…,"Amazon.com is the worst customer service I have ever come across. I’m in the uk and shop all over the world and never experienced this kind of customer service ever. I returned an entire order of 6 creams because the packing label had discrepancies when compared the my original. They refunded me for only one item, when I contacted them by email I got different replies each time from different named representatives, I’m Indian and I could recognise that the representative names were all indian. They cause ld ne do much inconvenience and frustration due to them not doing their jobs properly, they never read past history of messages and simply just threw out emails replies which took me back to step 1 and having to explain the issue over and over again. In the end I had to call and ask to speak to a manager, I was put through to Africa and the manager refunded me! Sorry but wherever there are Indians dealing with customer services, they are useless! They are getting paid to not do their job properly but I fact confuse matters worse and they do not support which is what they are paid to do! So disappointing that a customer has to go through this stress to get a refund they are owed! My question still is, if weight of my return parcel clearly proves the weight of 6 items then how on earth are they saying I only returned one! Where have the other 5 items gone????? Fraud! That’s what!!!!!!! Anyways I got my refund in end but it was a total mess and this is due to customer service representatives in INDIA!",2019-03-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,3.0,12.0,1523,279,33,5,0.0,0,14,2,1,Suspicious,amazoncom worst customer service ever come across i’m uk shop world never experienced kind customer service ever returned entire order cream packing label discrepancy compared original refunded one item contacted email got different reply time different named representative i’m indian could recognise representative name indian cause ld ne much inconvenience frustration due job properly never read past history message simply threw email reply took back step explain issue end call ask speak manager put africa manager refunded sorry wherever indian dealing customer service useless getting paid job properly fact confuse matter worse support paid disappointing customer go stress get refund owed question still weight return parcel clearly prof weight item earth saying returned one item gone fraud that’s anyways got refund end total mess due customer service representative india,0.999999966501788,3.349821198206371e-08,0.15647784632641615,0.2,0.3312955860143892,33.129558601438916,Low Trust
