Kd,/users/5c7ce572c4eae10359b4f758,US,1.0,2019-03-04 08:44:36+00:00,1.0,Why Reject it?,"I tired to post this on Amazon as a review and it was rejected after attempting to buy a utensil rack; 3/1/2019, Well my rack was delivered yesterday. And went to the post office to pick it up. And the post office worker came back. We both was looking at the box like wow. The box was mangled half opened. I looked inside and the box was empty. There was a label on the box form the 1st post office stating. ""That the box was in that condition when they received it"". Things happen. I know that but my whole problem with this. Is Amazon takes their employees through a virtual assessment during the application process. They have videos showing what looks like a well organized organization. Yet something like this happens😒. Upon calling Amazon. I can't get a replacement only a refund. Again disappointed. I guess I will have to look for another one. What a waste of time.",2019-03-04 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,3.0,4.0,874,160,14,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,tired post amazon review rejected attempting buy utensil rack well rack delivered yesterday went post office pick post office worker came back looking box like wow box mangled half opened looked inside box empty label box form st post office stating box condition received thing happen know whole problem amazon take employee virtual assessment application process video showing look like well organized organization yet something like happens😒 upon calling amazon cant get replacement refund disappointed guess look another one waste time,0.011088749771332777,0.9889112502286672,0.08973639932697701,0.2,0.8124029049797289,81.2402904979729,High Trust
