Holly J Moses,/users/5c77745a07dd7830c827d281,US,3.0,2019-02-28 08:29:52+00:00,5.0,GREAT Company,"I have used Amazon for years.  I am a Prime member but believe I get more than my membership fees in return.  I use multiple areas available and have never been disappointed.  I regularly place orders which are almost always delivered on time and in great shape.  I get notifications of orders, shipping and delivery information as well. Any order I have had issues with has been quickly and easily resolved. The Subscribe and Save is fantastic.  Monthly deliveries of items I use at a minimum of 5% discount.The Prime Video is great and I use it often.  You can add other offerings like BritBox and more.  Their Prime Originals are usually great and I end up binge watching them.  If ordering, you can pre-order DVDs and books.  Games are great too.I really enjoy and use my Amazon Fire HD.I highly recommend using Amazon, I believe they do a great job!",2019-02-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,28.0,854,151,13,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,used amazon year prime member believe get membership fee return use multiple area available never disappointed regularly place order almost always delivered time great shape get notification order shipping delivery information well order issue quickly easily resolved subscribe save fantastic monthly delivery item use minimum discountthe prime video great use often add offering like britbox prime original usually great end binge watching ordering preorder dvd book game great tooi really enjoy use amazon fire hdi highly recommend using amazon believe great job,0.053775020689758486,0.9462249793102415,0.08468872686483454,1.0,1.9900502350280878,199.00502350280877,High Trust
Chrissa,/users/5c775c0358bc48f495e1400d,US,1.0,2019-02-28 03:56:53+00:00,1.0,Really sad.,"Really sad how they treat their customers. We had our miracle baby a year ago. She finally turned 1 years old. We went through a lot just to have her! I ordered a cannon camera from amazon for her first birthday so I can capture one of the best moments of our life. Unfortunately the camera got delayed and did not make it in time when it was guaranteed next day shipping. We called customer service and the first representative did not explain the situation properly, and called my husband a miss. We got transferred to a supervisor who had a heavy accent, was SOOO rude, and was not at all helpful whatsoever. She kept talking over us, had a smart attitude while answering questions and didn’t seem to care much how we felt. We then got transferred to ANOTHER SUPERVISOR. She was monotone. We explained the issue and why it was so important to us to have had the camera on this specific day. She said “ oh I’m so sorry, I can do a $10 credit.....” like really? We shop all the time with you all and you offer a $10 credit for an important milestone in our lives? Horrible. I canceled the camera, my prime membership, and will no longer be shopping at Whole Foods. I can’t believe how insensitive they are and how badly they treat customers.",2019-02-28 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,28.0,1242,231,11,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,really sad treat customer miracle baby year ago finally turned year old went lot ordered cannon camera amazon first birthday capture one best moment life unfortunately camera got delayed make time guaranteed next day shipping called customer service first representative explain situation properly called husband miss got transferred supervisor heavy accent sooo rude helpful whatsoever kept talking u smart attitude answering question didn’t seem care much felt got transferred another supervisor monotone explained issue important u camera specific day said “ oh i’m sorry credit” like really shop time offer credit important milestone life horrible canceled camera prime membership longer shopping whole food can’t believe insensitive badly treat customer,0.06263830354503115,0.9373616964549688,0.12955692652832304,0.2,0.794592233533149,79.4592233533149,High Trust
