Debbra Record,/users/5c7445425ec9e75f5dd34209,US,2.0,2019-02-26 02:01:57+00:00,1.0,I am ONLY giving Amazon.com one star…,"I am ONLY giving Amazon.com one star because it is the only way that I can write my review of the company. Back in 2006 when I was going to college and I needed to buy a book for my college class in order to write a book review or book report, I was informed that I could not get a refund. Well, the seller pocketed my money, but never sent me the book on the Song of Solomon.A fellow classmate heard about how I was treated through Amazon.com and they showed me the lovingkindness and tender mercies of God by allowing me to borrow the book that they had bought, but I had to be sure to return the book to them for their library when I was through with it, which I did return the book to them when I was through with it. Any way, that was my very first experience buying anything online. I have NEVER bought anything online again, and I NEVER will buy online again.Sincerely Debbra Record",2019-02-25 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,26.0,889,173,37,7,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,giving amazoncom one star way write review company back going college needed buy book college class order write book review book report informed could get refund well seller pocketed money never sent book song solomona fellow classmate heard treated amazoncom showed lovingkindness tender mercy god allowing borrow book bought sure return book library return book way first experience buying anything online never bought anything online never buy online againsincerely debbra record,0.0033316529798784245,0.9966683470201215,0.09702748177229388,0.2,0.8177396698645195,81.77396698645195,High Trust
