Alison Hendry,/users/5c6d15b70422e03c28a868cd,GB,1.0,2019-02-20 08:54:26+00:00,1.0,I am so disappointed in Amazon,"I am so disappointed in Amazon.  I've been a member for over 15 years and loved the ease of Amazon however over the last year I had trouble logging into my account and was given conflicting information and most recently I have had someone else purchase items worth £150. I contacted Amazon and was assured there was no risk to my account but then another order was placed that I had not made. I have contacted Amazon of FIVE occasions, I have to go through the same security questions and explain the same issues.  They advised they have sent the information to the Investigations team who were meant to contact me over a week ago.  I cant speak to anyone in the Investigations team as they don't have phones and no one else was able to assist me. I am so frustrated and continue to be £150 our of pocket nearly two weeks on.",2019-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,20.0,825,154,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,disappointed amazon ive member year loved ease amazon however last year trouble logging account given conflicting information recently someone else purchase item worth £ contacted amazon assured risk account another order placed made contacted amazon five occasion go security question explain issue advised sent information investigation team meant contact week ago cant speak anyone investigation team dont phone one else able assist frustrated continue £ pocket nearly two week,0.010466681750939082,0.9895333182490609,0.08637128435221536,0.2,0.8120409159949734,81.20409159949735,High Trust
