Ryan Stutchman,/users/5c64fd14e319b835ae5381ee,US,2.0,2019-02-14 05:31:10+00:00,2.0,Amazon lies,"Short version, they lie to you even when you call them out on it.  Full story; Received a notice that they where unable to delivery because they couldn’t gain acces to my house...  called up CS to find out what’s going on and they said they try again the next day.  I told them they didn’t try at all because I have security cameras and no one showed up.  After being on hold for about 15 minutes (I pretty sure they put me on hold hoping I will hang up) they informed me that the package was lost in transit and they are sending a new one out.   I’m fairly confident that was a big lie they train their CS reps to do.  I than question her how it can go from unable to deliver than lost.  She said that the driver did a great incorrect scan which I believe is another lie.  I tried to call her out on that but she was from some other country and got very frustrated when something wasn’t to script and I was tired of trying to understand her.  Therefore I just accepted the new delivery.",2019-02-14 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,14.0,987,193,11,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,short version lie even call full story received notice unable delivery couldn’t gain acces house called c find what’s going said try next day told didn’t try security camera one showed hold minute pretty sure put hold hoping hang informed package lost transit sending new one i’m fairly confident big lie train c rep question go unable deliver lost said driver great incorrect scan believe another lie tried call country got frustrated something wasn’t script tired trying understand therefore accepted new delivery,0.019377995447324017,0.980622004552676,0.10824453168816602,0.4,1.1119599086139713,111.19599086139714,High Trust
corye,/users/5c64559bdfce6534871d01ac,US,1.0,2019-02-13 17:37:09+00:00,1.0,Amazon shipping and logistics sucks,"Anymore the shipping service with Amazon sucks a$$, they can't get stuff out of the warehouse on time, they use the wrong carrier to meet the dates they send to their customers, and then act like it's all the carrier's fault? No dip sh!t if you guys shipped on a Thursday instead of Friday the 2 day guaranteed item would show up Monday not Tuesday. My other personal favorite I've had happen is when they say it's sold by Amazon but actually being drop shipped by a 3rd party, so they charge you immediately for the item as it ""shipped"" but in reality it's pending fulfillment by a 3rd party that then takes 2 ucking weeks for them to fulfill as it was back ordered. Amazon is becoming just as slimy as their CEO.",2019-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,13.0,714,134,35,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,anymore shipping service amazon suck cant get stuff warehouse time use wrong carrier meet date send customer act like carrier fault dip sht guy shipped thursday instead friday day guaranteed item would show monday tuesday personal favorite ive happen say sold amazon actually drop shipped rd party charge immediately item shipped reality pending fulfillment rd party take ucking week fulfill back ordered amazon becoming slimy ceo,0.07198186064917694,0.9280181393508231,0.07515423443634324,0.2,0.7790399165626802,77.90399165626802,High Trust
Lester Obando,/users/5c62ec93f2be03dad7a509dc,GB,3.0,2019-02-13 15:42:00+00:00,1.0,Amazon lied to me,"""Im not happy with Amazon at this moment. I had to return a faulty Fire tablet to you guys. The agent that handled the replacement for the tablet, did not tell me the prepaid shipping label was for the US only. Also the email I received for the pre paid label did not state it was for the US only. When I went to the post office to return the tablet. I was charged for the shipping. They told me that Amazon lied to me. When I contacted Amazon via chat I was told theres nothing they could do. Im very disappointed with Amazon for not attempting to initiate a refund for me. I should of being told I had to pay for the shipping"" 😡",2019-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,13.0,630,126,17,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,im happy amazon moment return faulty fire tablet guy agent handled replacement tablet tell prepaid shipping label u also email received pre paid label state u went post office return tablet charged shipping told amazon lied contacted amazon via chat told there nothing could im disappointed amazon attempting initiate refund told pay shipping 😡,0.03959114403674428,0.9604088559632558,0.07066741446999439,0.2,0.7943379108756267,79.43379108756267,High Trust
