Michael Duquaine,/users/5c6384f9680fa15310086f0e,US,1.0,2019-02-13 02:47:20+00:00,1.0,They ship with Lasership,"They ship with Lasership.  There are the most incompetent, shady, and unprofessional ""business"" out there.  When using same day or next day delivery they may use this pitiful excuse for a delivery service and if they do you can expect to NOT receive your package when promised, or even AT ALL.  This ""company"" is nothing but thugs who steal your packages or claim to deliver so that they can collect the commission on the item and not actually deliver it until much later.  Just a horrible experience and It's not worth the headache and hassle dealing with with to remain an Amazon customer (which I have been for about 15 years up until now). I now have no choice but to end this relationship with Amazon until it is verified that they no longer using this horrific 'service'.  It's really sad.",2019-02-13 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,13.0,795,141,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ship lasership incompetent shady unprofessional business using day next day delivery may use pitiful excuse delivery service expect receive package promised even company nothing thug steal package claim deliver collect commission item actually deliver much later horrible experience worth headache hassle dealing remain amazon customer year choice end relationship amazon verified longer using horrific service really sad,0.011864370367225834,0.9881356296327741,0.07908020190689849,0.2,0.8098838551977668,80.98838551977668,High Trust
MRS. EMMA  PROCTOR,/users/544778870000640001919a74,GB,62.0,2019-02-12 18:45:43+00:00,5.0,Love Amazon & great customer service,"The customer service I always receive from Amazon is so good. I recently accidentally sent a CD, that I had only ordered that morning, back with a faulty disc driver. The representatives stated they couldn't guarantee the CD would be located so offered me a £10 voucher of good will (double the price of the CD). Then today I received a parcel and in it was my CD. They are always quick to respond to any queries.I have learnt to only order from Amazon direct as a majority of the time that I have any problems with items not turning up is due to external sellers.Keep it up Amazon, as far as im concerned you're doing it right, hence the reason I order so much from you!",2019-02-12 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,12.0,671,127,36,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,customer service always receive amazon good recently accidentally sent cd ordered morning back faulty disc driver representative stated couldnt guarantee cd would located offered £ voucher good double price cd today received parcel cd always quick respond queriesi learnt order amazon direct majority time problem item turning due external sellerskeep amazon far im concerned youre right hence reason order much,0.5710079554897064,0.4289920445102936,0.071228266965788,1.0,1.7287416756483045,172.87416756483046,High Trust
