Glyn Poolford,/users/56f036e20000ff000a109903,GB,25.0,2019-02-08 14:03:53+00:00,1.0,AMAZON FRAUD??????????,"On 23 January I received an email advising my username/email address had been successfully changed, despite the fact that I had not changed this or confirmed to Amazon that I had wished for it to be changed.  I replied immediately notifying this, but the arrogance of Amazon led them to suggest the email I received was jut a spam.  NO IT WASN'T, it was from Amazon.  I would challenge anyone to find a contact phone number for their UK customer services.  I eventually found one, via a newspaper article.  I phoned it and ended up speaking to someone in the Caribbean speaking pigeon English and refusing to accept that someone could have changed my account details.Be warned, Amazon do not care about you; PROFIT IS THERE ONLY CONCERN",2019-02-08 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,8.0,736,128,22,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,january received email advising usernameemail address successfully changed despite fact changed confirmed amazon wished changed replied immediately notifying arrogance amazon led suggest email received jut spam wasnt amazon would challenge anyone find contact phone number uk customer service eventually found one via newspaper article phoned ended speaking someone caribbean speaking pigeon english refusing accept someone could changed account detailsbe warned amazon care profit concern,0.03881353685505718,0.9611864631449428,0.0717891194615816,0.2,0.7949510554647877,79.49510554647877,High Trust
