Alan,/users/4c1a6927000064000103390b,GB,9.0,2019-02-07 11:46:11+00:00,1.0,Appalling Customer Service!,"I have been a customer with Amazon UK since 2005 and just recently I purchased Car/Van Tyre Vulcanising Cement from an Amazon seller (Ma-Man) but what I received was bicycle puncture repair glue which believe me isn't the same thing!  I questioned this with Amazon Customer Services and wrote a Negative Review for the product and the same in the Sellers Feedback.  I later accidentally received an email from Amazon which was obviously intended for the seller (Ma-Man),... ""I've read the review and I understand your concerns......""  both of my reviews were subsequently removed and my account has since been closed! Amazon obviously care more about protecting their sellers than they do their customers.  Don't be fooled, all they want is your money!",2019-02-07 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,7.0,752,123,27,3,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,customer amazon uk since recently purchased carvan tyre vulcanising cement amazon seller maman received bicycle puncture repair glue believe isnt thing questioned amazon customer service wrote negative review product seller feedback later accidentally received email amazon obviously intended seller maman ive read review understand concern review subsequently removed account since closed amazon obviously care protecting seller customer dont fooled want money,0.7281654721175336,0.2718345278824664,0.06898485698261357,0.2,0.4497142353377559,44.97142353377559,Low Trust
Andy Fox,/users/5c5b4c08a5c97d40f579faf2,US,3.0,2019-02-06 21:06:26+00:00,1.0,Beware Of Your Info with Amazon,"Realized we've been being charged by Amazon for a ""sellers"" account that we do not control and is not associated with any of the emails we own. Secondly Amazon is charging a credit card we rarely use when buying from them. Amazon will not give us information because our emails are not associated with the sellers account, yet they keep charging our card (14 times to the tune of $559.96). They finally agreed to deactivate the card, but will not take responsibility for the money. (The credit card company is taking responsibility for some, but not all of it.) Gone over the statements carefully & these are the ONLY charges that do not fit. The problem seems to be with Amazon & only Amazon, yet they do not assume responsibility. Advise that you do not leave your personal information (billing/ship to addresses, credit card info, etc) on Amazon and cut WAY back on your Amazon purchases!",2019-02-06 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,6.0,891,156,31,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,realized weve charged amazon seller account control associated email secondly amazon charging credit card rarely use buying amazon give u information email associated seller account yet keep charging card time tune finally agreed deactivate card take responsibility money credit card company taking responsibility gone statement carefully charge fit problem seems amazon amazon yet assume responsibility advise leave personal information billingship address credit card info etc amazon cut way back amazon purchase,0.06161733022448117,0.9383826697755189,0.08749298934380258,0.2,0.78668993275652,78.668993275652,High Trust
