JK,/users/5c59deb09b9ba667303604ed,US,1.0,2019-02-05 19:06:28+00:00,1.0,"Much worse service than DMV, Social Security and INS combined","You think Amazon.com has a good service until your account got locked out for no reason.  I cannot login to my account since December, 2018.  I received NO communication from Amazon.  I made more than 20 phone calls to customer service who cannot provide any reason for the account suspension.  The so called ""specialists"" have no phone you can call, they do not read your email, they simply do not care.  The only hope to get you gift card money back and your ebook back is to initiate a lawsuit,At DMV, Social Security and INS you just need to wait.  At Amazon, they do not tell you anything about your account.  You do not know how long you have to wait to get your money, ebook and account back.If you are a seller who got suspended for no reason, Amazon will keep your money as long as they like and your inventory at the ""Fulfilled By Amazon"" (FBA) warehouses until someday someone decides to get ride of it.  The only hope to get your money and inventory back is to bring Amazon to the court, if you still have sufficient financial resources left to hire a lawyer.AVOID Amazon if you could  !!!!",2019-02-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,5.0,1102,202,61,10,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,think amazoncom good service account got locked reason cannot login account since december received communication amazon made phone call customer service cannot provide reason account suspension called specialist phone call read email simply care hope get gift card money back ebook back initiate lawsuitat dmv social security in need wait amazon tell anything account know long wait get money ebook account backif seller got suspended reason amazon keep money long like inventory fulfilled amazon fba warehouse someday someone decides get ride hope get money inventory back bring amazon court still sufficient financial resource left hire lawyeravoid amazon could,0.8685434804277392,0.1314565195722608,0.11329220415030847,0.2,0.38838670061619207,38.838670061619204,Low Trust
