Jess gates,/users/5ac71fa64de5666d348643ec,GB,14.0,2019-02-03 11:51:23+00:00,4.0,INFLATED PRICES!!,"I am not going to discredit their customer service, which I have never had an issue with to date.  However, just recently I have looked at Amazon then looked elsewhere for the same item. Every time I have been able to get it for at least half price. I wanted a body cream that you can’t get many places, it was £57 on Amazon and I got it easily on line for £20.  Their prices have gotten very inflated.They won’t be my first stop in future.",2019-02-03 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,3.0,440,86,17,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,going discredit customer service never issue date however recently looked amazon looked elsewhere item every time able get least half price wanted body cream can’t get many place £ amazon got easily line £ price gotten inflatedthey won’t first stop future,0.016193718152459395,0.9838062818475406,0.04823331463825014,0.8,1.7015498038514203,170.15498038514204,High Trust
