No Name,/users/5c54791c542d98f98ce5c8c9,US,1.0,2019-02-01 16:51:54+00:00,5.0,Customer service gold,"I've had many customer service nightmares where they just keep feeding you the same garbage. Well today was a much different experience. I had returned a defective item and had my money refunded. The problem was when i bought it amazon had applied a coupon to the order. When i went to repurchase the same item the coupon code wasn't applied. I chatted with a customer service agent named PARNESH. This agent gave me a promo code for future use to buy a different item, refunded the difference of the original coupon and expedited the shipping to overnight. I did not expect anything but the same ""sorry we can't help you any further"" garbage but wow what a wonderful experience. I wish amazon had a more in depth customer service feedback where you can write something about your experience rather than just a rating from terrible to great. This representative needs to be acknowledged because we need more people like them who care about the customers and want to do a good job.",2019-02-01 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,2.0,1.0,980,173,21,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive many customer service nightmare keep feeding garbage well today much different experience returned defective item money refunded problem bought amazon applied coupon order went repurchase item coupon code wasnt applied chatted customer service agent named parnesh agent gave promo code future use buy different item refunded difference original coupon expedited shipping overnight expect anything sorry cant help garbage wow wonderful experience wish amazon depth customer service feedback write something experience rather rating terrible great representative need acknowledged need people like care customer want good job,0.04258210885962795,0.957417891140372,0.09702748177229388,1.0,1.9981144419246448,199.81144419246448,High Trust
