Sophie Russell,/users/5c422984affe60d562996599,US,3.0,2019-01-18 19:37:35+00:00,4.0,Girls of Glass Kindle Edition,"I have come to realize that I am not a huge mystery fan, and when I novel is categorized as such.. I am very picky as to which I like, and am harder on them rating wise then other genres. But this, this was incredible. It was twisted, disturbing, and you really never knew where the next page was going to take you. I got everything wrong, and that's exactly what I loved and hated, all at once. A MUST READ for any mystery readers.",2019-01-18 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,18.0,432,85,29,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,come realize huge mystery fan novel categorized picky like harder rating wise genre incredible twisted disturbing really never knew next page going take got everything wrong thats exactly loved hated must read mystery reader,0.047954020034295185,0.9520459799657048,0.04767246214245653,0.8,1.6855574824113435,168.55574824113435,High Trust
