Tammi Remmark,/users/5c40be864c22a511bab5c7d5,US,1.0,2019-01-17 17:42:39+00:00,1.0,Amazon has become so big that they do…,"Amazon has become so big that they do not care how they treat their customers. I have been a customer since 2010 and I have spent $20,000 plus with them ordering merchandise. They recently closed my account stating that I had too many returns. I have had less than 2% returns of all merchandise ever ordered with them. They said it was due to my account being closed previously for returns. This is far from the truth; my account was closed by me in Dec of 2017 due to my account being hacked. I have always suspected this hacking came from an Amazon employee but could never prove it. In Dec of 2017 this hacker went into my account and returned items and requested gift cards as credit. Then this person ordered items ($4,000) worth of merchandise and had it shipped to an address in TN another state. I made Amazon aware of this and they did nothing to stop these shipments. I did file a police report but little could they do because it was in Amazons hands. How I expect it was hacked through Amazon is they never sent UPS or anyone to pick up and of the items the hacker said he was returning. Amazon will always have returned items sent back. My account was closed for about a month trying to get through this. This was a nightmare. So as I mentioned Amazon just closed my account stating this is the 2nd time because of returns. The returns I have had was for 2 of the same coat that were incorrect size as stated on their website and I paid the shipping back. I wear a size large and ordered size large, did not fit then ordered an XLarge still too small. I had them shipped back and then Amazon closed my account. To sum this up Amazon treats a customer of 19 years and who has spent over $20,000 with them all because they have NO competent people to do the research of why the account was closed before because of their own lack of security. I will NEVER purchase from them again, there is plenty of companies to buy from that have 2 day free shipping with comparable prices that do not treat their customers this way.",2019-01-17 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,17.0,2030,383,38,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon become big care treat customer customer since spent plus ordering merchandise recently closed account stating many return less return merchandise ever ordered said due account closed previously return far truth account closed dec due account hacked always suspected hacking came amazon employee could never prove dec hacker went account returned item requested gift card credit person ordered item worth merchandise shipped address tn another state made amazon aware nothing stop shipment file police report little could amazon hand expect hacked amazon never sent ups anyone pick item hacker said returning amazon always returned item sent back account closed month trying get nightmare mentioned amazon closed account stating nd time return return coat incorrect size stated website paid shipping back wear size large ordered size large fit ordered xlarge still small shipped back amazon closed account sum amazon treat customer year spent competent people research account closed lack security never purchase plenty company buy day free shipping comparable price treat customer way,0.006248549889859356,0.9937514501101407,0.2148065058889512,0.2,0.8398370262328606,83.98370262328606,High Trust
