Keith Dunkelbarger,/users/5c37b962a33add0a7adc32c4,US,1.0,2019-01-10 21:33:11+00:00,1.0,Amazon might be one of the biggest…,"Amazon might be one of the biggest companies in the World but they are far from the best. I have been a member for many years and recently went to log on to find that my password did not work. I emailed Amazon to tell them the first of January. They responded on January 6th, that they were sorry that I did not remember my security question. They did not ask for my security question. They said they did not have my email address. I spent several hundred dollars before Christmas and in a few weeks and they said I no longer existed. I called yesterday and talked with Gavin and he did some checking and found that possibly a foreigner changed my email address. He said he reported it and I would be contacted today. I called today and spoke to a foreign lady with a lot of background noise and I could not understand her. I asked for a supervisor, then another foreign lady came on the phone and said I will have to wait until Monday to get an email about the cause of the problem. I am very disappointed in the fact that Amazon can not let you know what is going on and resolve the problem immediately. Terrible company to work with over the phone.",2019-01-10 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,10.0,1151,220,35,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon might one biggest company world far best member many year recently went log find password work emailed amazon tell first january responded january th sorry remember security question ask security question said email address spent several hundred dollar christmas week said longer existed called yesterday talked gavin checking found possibly foreigner changed email address said reported would contacted today called today spoke foreign lady lot background noise could understand asked supervisor another foreign lady came phone said wait monday get email cause problem disappointed fact amazon let know going resolve problem immediately terrible company work phone,0.015584041057478066,0.984415958942522,0.12338754907459339,0.2,0.8168854892861797,81.68854892861796,High Trust
