John Blossom,/users/5c3572fe3243708d55cff788,US,2.0,2019-01-09 04:05:28+00:00,1.0,I am an Amazon Prime member and order a…,"I am an Amazon Prime member and order a fishing combo, rod and reel, under Prime delivery. First of all, the date guaranteed was for 4 days after I placed my order, uh, how does two day shipping turn into four. Then, even though the tracking number showed my product was in my town and scanned in at 6:22 AM, I got an update from Amazon that I would have a day or two more before my package would get to me. I live in Colorado. My package was shipped from Texas and it could not get here in four days. I could have driven to Texas, picked up my fishing gear, driven home and been happily fishing before a major shipping and distribution company can deliver it to me. Plans ruined and money cost, but hey, what does Amazon care?",2019-01-09 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,9.0,727,141,40,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime member order fishing combo rod reel prime delivery first date guaranteed day placed order uh two day shipping turn four even though tracking number showed product town scanned got update amazon would day two package would get live colorado package shipped texas could get four day could driven texas picked fishing gear driven home happily fishing major shipping distribution company deliver plan ruined money cost hey amazon care,0.009382402555698445,0.9906175974443016,0.07908020190689849,0.2,0.8111248391035305,81.11248391035305,High Trust
VL,/users/5c3521f1f5a3c9c0106a9f39,US,4.0,2019-01-08 23:00:32+00:00,1.0,FRAUDULENT BUSINESS PRACTICES,"Big travelers and therefore big online shoppers, we (inclusive of associates, friends, neighbors and family) discontinued not only our Prime memberships held since inception but any and all business with Amazon, who we had supported from the beginning. We abandoned our purchases and videos and then debanked our stock as we debunked the Amazon business model. We did this after receiving numerous damaged/defective products, many in boxes far bigger than the product, without protective packaging. We attempted resolution for several months before realizing the corrupt structure that Amazon lives under, the model Jeff Bezos embraces so lovingly as he fills his pockets and dances away. When we attempted to resolve one very expensive problem (received wrong product) after returning some and donating other damaged or defective products, Amazon's clear disdain of law, dishonor of ethics and clear indifference to their own documented policies was appalling. Since then we continue to learn of poor conditions for employees and bullying of vendors.",2019-01-08 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,8.0,1051,160,29,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,big traveler therefore big online shopper inclusive associate friend neighbor family discontinued prime membership held since inception business amazon supported beginning abandoned purchase video debanked stock debunked amazon business model receiving numerous damageddefective product many box far bigger product without protective packaging attempted resolution several month realizing corrupt structure amazon life model jeff bezos embrace lovingly fill pocket dance away attempted resolve one expensive problem received wrong product returning donating damaged defective product amazon clear disdain law dishonor ethic clear indifference documented policy appalling since continue learn poor condition employee bullying vendor,0.018423478566568462,0.9815765214334315,0.08973639932697701,0.2,0.8087355405821112,80.87355405821111,High Trust
