Jake Susnik,/users/5c3248f24230e061c4236930,US,1.0,2019-01-06 18:29:47+00:00,1.0,Please look at timeline for reviews before and after 2018,"I suggest you look at the timeline for Amazon reviews if pre-2018 I would have given 5 stars. Amazon use to be the cheapest and I have used heavily that past several years but this last year things changed and they are getting greedy now and are no longer the cheapest from several different perspectives! Just comparing the base price I have been finding more and more to not be cheapest, then add shipping. Free 2 day with Prime that now costs $119 instead of $60 like it use to and this does not include free shipping on returns! That is another funny thing, free 2-day shipping selected but finding more and more it is not here in 2 days or sometimes even a week? My word ... so much $ was lost on Christmas presents this year just for paying the return shipping costs.lol, a $16.99 toy that the box is 6""x6""x2"" and weighs almost nothings costs $6.99 to return? A $70 Weighted blanket cost $29 to return .... NEVER again will I use Amazon for Christmas or gifts or rally anything I am not 99.9% it will not be returned! For gifts I am going back to physical stores like Kohl's where can shop online but the item can be returned directly without shipping costs.",2019-01-06 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,6.0,1164,217,57,10,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,suggest look timeline amazon review pre would given star amazon use cheapest used heavily past several year last year thing changed getting greedy longer cheapest several different perspective comparing base price finding cheapest add shipping free day prime cost instead like use include free shipping return another funny thing free day shipping selected finding day sometimes even week word much lost christmas present year paying return shipping costslol toy box xx weighs almost nothing cost return weighted blanket cost return never use amazon christmas gift rally anything returned gift going back physical store like kohl shop online item returned directly without shipping cost,0.656758727593246,0.34324127240675395,0.12170499158721257,0.2,0.4959616345208195,49.596163452081946,Low Trust
