Ruthie S,/users/5c30329a3714941574e5ec66,US,3.0,2019-01-05 04:41:26+00:00,4.0,Overall a great site.,"Overall, I have had a great experience with amazon.  I did overnight a package once and in actuality it took 2 weeks to arrive, but amazon did refund me for the entire purchase, so I can't really be mad.  Prices are great and prime enables me to get my items shipped very fast.My only complaint is that as a seller, it takes like 2 months to receive the money from your sales, which is way overdone.  I get that the customer gets some time to check the product, but even after those 10 days it takes amazon several weeks to process and send your payment.",2019-01-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,5.0,554,105,21,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,overall great experience amazon overnight package actuality took week arrive amazon refund entire purchase cant really mad price great prime enables get item shipped fastmy complaint seller take like month receive money sale way overdone get customer get time check product even day take amazon several week process send payment,0.01756910393730358,0.9824308960626964,0.05888951205832866,0.8,1.702993350443014,170.2993350443014,High Trust
Mark Rafman,/users/5c30291e37149443f0e5e9e2,CA,4.0,2019-01-05 03:49:14+00:00,3.0,"some experiences excellent, some atrocious","I've ordered 18  items from Amazon Canada within the last year, using Prime.  In more than half the cases, I found decent-quality products at a decent price.  It's convenient having stuff delivered to my office.  However, in a few cases, Amazon tried three or more times to make the delivery after normal office hours, despite promises to follow my requested times.  Each time, customer service said they would put a note on my file so that all future orders would be delivered during office hours.  Nothing worked, and I spent a huge amount of time on the phone and on chat.  If you have a problem, I suggest you contact them by email to save your time.",2019-01-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,5.0,654,117,42,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive ordered item amazon canada within last year using prime half case found decentquality product decent price convenient stuff delivered office however case amazon tried three time make delivery normal office hour despite promise follow requested time time customer service said would put note file future order would delivered office hour nothing worked spent huge amount time phone chat problem suggest contact email save time,0.006923361626599289,0.9930766383734007,0.06561974200785194,0.6,1.4096622675882706,140.96622675882708,High Trust
Warith,/users/5c3025eb3714947c15e5e909,US,16.0,2019-01-05 03:44:19+00:00,5.0,Excellent! - Choose shipping carrier if you can,"Amazon is now the go to place when I definitely need something.  It took a lot for me to return to Mail Order, but now I see that's really the only way to get what you need.  When ordering though, place in special shipping instructions to avoid UPS (United Parcel Service) if possible.  In the Atlanta delivery area, UPS is very unreliable in my experience.  Go with USPS, FedEx, or Amazon Locker if possible.",2019-01-05 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,5.0,409,74,47,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon go place definitely need something took lot return mail order see thats really way get need ordering though place special shipping instruction avoid ups united parcel service possible atlanta delivery area ups unreliable experience go usps fedex amazon locker possible,0.02612381700571488,0.9738761829942851,0.04150308468872686,1.0,1.995238708434888,199.5238708434888,High Trust
