ann murphy,/users/526316a60000640001513dab,GB,28.0,2019-01-04 21:41:44+00:00,1.0,Awful customer service and total lack…,"Awful customer service and total lack of understanding or competence. I simply tried to change my phone number on my account and their 2 step verification process that was applied without my knowledge or consent keeps texting my old number so I cannot receive it. I have called and emailed Amazon so many times that I have lost the will to pursue any further and I have been left out of pocket due to selling an item and paying for postage but cannot add postage tracking details or confirm it was dispatched. Each time I speak to Amazon I get fobbed off and told to wait as the issue is being dealt with.. It has been almost 2 weeks to date and still no access. I have been left out of pocket and with a poor opinion of Amazon. I have also been receiving calls from Amazon -their recorded automated announcement left states it is them and each time I have answered they disconnect the call. Appalling service, sorry I ever used them.",2019-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,4.0,934,173,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,awful customer service total lack understanding competence simply tried change phone number account step verification process applied without knowledge consent keep texting old number cannot receive called emailed amazon many time lost pursue left pocket due selling item paying postage cannot add postage tracking detail confirm dispatched time speak amazon get fobbed told wait issue dealt almost week date still access left pocket poor opinion amazon also receiving call amazon recorded automated announcement left state time answered disconnect call appalling service sorry ever used,0.027300874668641322,0.9726991253313587,0.09702748177229388,0.2,0.8057550590201381,80.57550590201382,High Trust
