Jerry Sinkovec,/users/50d1f6dd00006400012ad33d,US,6.0,2019-01-04 17:38:54+00:00,1.0,.aweeklydeal.com is a fraud and a rip-off outfit,".aweeklydeal.com is a fraud and rip-off outfitDon't buy a watch or anything from them, because you won't get what you ordered and it will be broke and you'll never hear from them even though you send them three or more emails. There was a good looking watch they were offering for $39.00 and with their discount, it was $32.00. They were advertising a Curran watch model, but when you get the watch it's not Curren, but a Curpen 8225, and it doesn't function. When you email them, you'll never hear from them, they just ignore you. They claim they have tons of happy customers, and you just happen to be not one of them. They claim a lot of great and good things, yet they are just the opposite. They openly commit FRAUD! They don't list a phone number so you really have no way of contacting them, so never order anything from a company that doesn't list 100% of all their contact info, so you always know where they are and several ways of contacting them. If it isn't all there, they're probably a fraud to a great extent. A couple of other writers and myself will be posting this to tons of sites so people will learn about their poor performance and the poor quality of products and the outright FRAUD they commit.",2019-01-04 00:00:00+00:00,2019.0,1.0,4.0,1219,225,48,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,aweeklydealcom fraud ripoff outfitdont buy watch anything wont get ordered broke youll never hear even though send three email good looking watch offering discount advertising curran watch model get watch curren curpen doesnt function email youll never hear ignore claim ton happy customer happen one claim lot great good thing yet opposite openly commit fraud dont list phone number really way contacting never order anything company doesnt list contact info always know several way contacting isnt theyre probably fraud great extent couple writer posting ton site people learn poor performance poor quality product outright fraud commit,0.08288166971212817,0.9171183302878718,0.1261918115535614,0.2,0.7837975274546481,78.37975274546481,High Trust
