Amazon customer 7O3396O8O8,/users/5c19df759eb0d6c6c5f7bd15,IN,1.0,2018-12-19 06:08:55+00:00,3.0,Worst experience on online shopping…,Worst experience on online shopping ever!! Amazon can’t keep track on what their sellers mail to their buyers. I ordered the MPow headphones (red color) and instead received a black/neon green pair of headphones made by Yuanguo. I tried to get my money back and instead their costumer services negotiated with me to resend a replacement and Amazon costumer services guaranteed that this time I would receive what I bought. The replacement arrived and now I’m stuck with 4 pairs on earbuds I never ordered. I’m very upset and would like to be sent the product that I actually ordered. I will never buy anything with amazon again. Amazon needs to wake up for that and keep a better track on what’s being send by the sellers.,2018-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,19.0,722,127,36,5,0.0,1,2,2,1,Suspicious,worst experience online shopping ever amazon can’t keep track seller mail buyer ordered mpow headphone red color instead received blackneon green pair headphone made yuanguo tried get money back instead costumer service negotiated resend replacement amazon costumer service guaranteed time would receive bought replacement arrived i’m stuck pair earbuds never ordered i’m upset would like sent product actually ordered never buy anything amazon amazon need wake keep better track what’s send seller,0.999999999997577,2.4229507289419416e-12,0.071228266965788,0.6,0.914245653394369,91.4245653394369,High Trust
Steph,/users/5c19a30d9eb0d6539bf79f25,US,1.0,2018-12-19 02:08:55+00:00,1.0,Do not trust if in a time crunch,"Something is up with there shipping and they like to make it difficult to find a way to get a hold of a person. They try to automate everything. 1.) Bought a mug, it arrived shattered. (literally in pieces). Had an issue getting in touch with someone cause the automation kept trying to get me to return it. Why would I need to go through the trouble at returning a shattered item? 2.) Bought an amazon basics sweatshirt in small. I received a zip up hoodie in XL. No problem easy mistake. Reached out and they decided to send a replacement. Yup, received another XL zip up hoodie. At this point I am a little disappointed, and chatted with them. They could not ""assure"" me that if they send a replacement that I would receive the right item. So stuck with store credit which I have been nervous to use. Which I am know genius but seems like they could reach out to the warehouse and be like ""yup, these are in the wrong location."" 3.) Used that store credit eventually. Ordered some slip on shoes I was gonna wear for a wedding which I researched. Knew my size etc. Sure enough received 2 sizes larger than I ordered. Still made me print out, and return before I received any sort of credit or refund. In general, amazon is easy but super unreliable. In a time crunch do not use.",2018-12-19 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,19.0,1280,240,32,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,something shipping like make difficult find way get hold person try automate everything bought mug arrived shattered literally piece issue getting touch someone cause automation kept trying get return would need go trouble returning shattered item bought amazon basic sweatshirt small received zip hoodie xl problem easy mistake reached decided send replacement yup received another xl zip hoodie point little disappointed chatted could assure send replacement would receive right item stuck store credit nervous use know genius seems like could reach warehouse like yup wrong location used store credit eventually ordered slip shoe gonna wear wedding researched knew size etc sure enough received size larger ordered still made print return received sort credit refund general amazon easy super unreliable time crunch use,0.005673051494539675,0.9943269485054603,0.1346045989904655,0.2,0.8240843940508232,82.40843940508232,High Trust
