Ian,/users/53c43e3300006400017edfa9,GB,32.0,2018-12-18 13:55:19+00:00,5.0,You just cant get better service or prices,"I'm a very regular customer and when ever problems have happened its been sorted in minutes on Chat. Faulty goods replaced without quibble, long return times (my One Plus 6T I bought in November and can return to quibble till end of Jan - brilliant service.Having said all that I tend to avoid Marketplace sellers as they are often poor.",2018-12-18 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,18.0,337,60,42,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,im regular customer ever problem happened sorted minute chat faulty good replaced without quibble long return time one plus bought november return quibble till end jan brilliant servicehaving said tend avoid marketplace seller often poor,0.06258319520378916,0.9374168047962108,0.03365114974761638,1.0,1.9754386323476287,197.54386323476288,High Trust
jonesyjona,/users/52f601b8000064000162d2d2,GB,39.0,2018-12-18 13:45:41+00:00,1.0,dont like the truth,"so amazon want your feedback but when it is negative they wont publish it on their reviews, basically I order something which came from China Postage and packaging  was included but when I pick the parcel up from the post office I had to pay another £13.50 so why did Amazon not tell me, surely a product review is the truth but they wont publish it, I wont be using Amazon again.",2018-12-18 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,18.0,380,72,19,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon want feedback negative wont publish review basically order something came china postage packaging included pick parcel post office pay another £ amazon tell surely product review truth wont publish wont using amazon,0.10550829055633669,0.8944917094436633,0.040381379697139654,0.2,0.7553221306612596,75.53221306612596,High Trust
Ismail,/users/5c18f32025a092244f405c77,GB,1.0,2018-12-18 13:36:52+00:00,1.0,I've been an amazon prime member for…,"I've been an amazon prime member for years and after my last order I will never order anything from amazon again, here's why: I ordered an headset which Amazon lost more than 6 times (I never received the headset) over a month (I'm a prime member it was one day delivery) and then I said ""It seems that you are unable to deliver the headset so send it to an amazon click and collect so I can go pick it up"". After which point Amazon abandoned all reason and started to treat me like a criminal; transferred me countless times but no one absolutely did anything and ultimately I have to go to the police station 1,5 month after my order because Amazon is refusing to refund or redeliver it. In sum, Amazon failed so many times that they started to blame me and has confiscated my item until I fulfil their bidding; institutional harassment.The week after I ask for click and collect, I received an email confirming it has ben delivered to the amazon locker near me, but no verification code so I called customer service and 2 more phone calls and 48 hours later I received an verification code from the LOGISTICS team (bear in mind it has been 1.5 month since the order) BUT when I finally got to the amazon locker the employee said that the item has been sent back to amazon only after 2 days (its supposed to stay there for 4 days) and I call Amazon and they confirm that the item has been sent back, and here is where it gets crazy mysterious/annoying: After few very angry calls I am transferred to the investigation team who refuses to refund or redeliver it and when I reject they transfer me to what I understand to be the Margaret Thatcher of the company and with her determined cold voice she repeats her catchphrase ""We will not be able to proceed any further until you get a police crime investigation report"". So, naturaly I ask ""Why me? I am not going to do Amazon's job, Amazon lost this 6 times and sent it back from the locker the 7th time, you go investigate!"" to which she replies ""No matter how long you prolong this conversation or how many times you call us back the answer is the same"" and she had a very patronizing tone and she was completely irresponsive to my complaints about it; this was the investigation team and I realized that they were responsible for making sure that I do not get my headset.Ladies and gentleman, I am completing my PhD at the moment about transnational corporations and domestic regulations and the reason why products are cheaper on Amazon is because they don't pay taxes; so IF I BUY THE SAME HEADSET FROM A SHOP 10 MIN NEAR ME IT IS 50 POUNDS MORE EXPENSIVE. Hence, Amazon has monopolized the market and devised this over-compartmentalized system to assimilate and re-direct any customer's complaint or objection in which you end up talking to Margaret Thacher who tells you that ""you must go to the police, there is no alternative"".Amazon is evil, and they treat their employees badly, the only reason they thrive is because items are cheaper, because they do not pay the taxes that small-medium enterprises pay; This experience made me fundamentally re-think Amazon services and I decided to never use it again because of the way they treat their customers, like criminals, whereas is their sheer incompetency and deliberate system of complaint assimilation that are the problems. And they call themselves ""the most customer-centric company in the world""- what a scam.My order number for evidence: order #204-3245038-8882756",2018-12-18 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,18.0,3480,616,37,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,ive amazon prime member year last order never order anything amazon here ordered headset amazon lost time never received headset month im prime member one day delivery said seems unable deliver headset send amazon click collect go pick point amazon abandoned reason started treat like criminal transferred countless time one absolutely anything ultimately go police station month order amazon refusing refund redeliver sum amazon failed many time started blame confiscated item fulfil bidding institutional harassmentthe week ask click collect received email confirming ben delivered amazon locker near verification code called customer service phone call hour later received verification code logistics team bear mind month since order finally got amazon locker employee said item sent back amazon day supposed stay day call amazon confirm item sent back get crazy mysteriousannoying angry call transferred investigation team refuse refund redeliver reject transfer understand margaret thatcher company determined cold voice repeat catchphrase able proceed get police crime investigation report naturaly ask going amazon job amazon lost time sent back locker th time go investigate reply matter long prolong conversation many time call u back answer patronizing tone completely irresponsive complaint investigation team realized responsible making sure get headsetladies gentleman completing phd moment transnational corporation domestic regulation reason product cheaper amazon dont pay tax buy headset shop min near pound expensive hence amazon monopolized market devised overcompartmentalized system assimilate redirect customer complaint objection end talking margaret thacher tell must go police alternativeamazon evil treat employee badly reason thrive item cheaper pay tax smallmedium enterprise pay experience made fundamentally rethink amazon service decided never use way treat customer like criminal whereas sheer incompetency deliberate system complaint assimilation problem call customercentric company world scammy order number evidence order,0.022740115420965917,0.9772598845790341,0.34548513740886144,0.2,0.8577269697712894,85.77269697712893,High Trust
