Tara,/users/5c1882b2b7fe825797b9fc30,US,1.0,2018-12-18 05:16:36+00:00,1.0,My first experience with Amazon,"My first experience with Amazon will now be my last. My husband recieved and egift on Amazon from a customer. Around the same time I received 3 Amazon gift cards as a bonus from my work. Once my husband tried to add my cards to his account, it was flagged for fraud and now we have lost it all....why was it flagged??? Because the cards were reported lost or stolen.....the cards that I watched my boss walk in with in the big yellow envelope, open it up and pull out little black boxes with orange ribbons. Inside the boxes were individual cards with stickers covering the numbers. Nothing tampered with. But now we are out because we do not have a receipt to prove they are not stolen. Absolutely horrible. We banked on these cards as well as his account for a trip. Now just days before Christmas we are locked out and out money. Never again will we deal with Amazon. Quite the scam they have worked out.",2018-12-18 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,18.0,907,169,31,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,first experience amazon last husband recieved egift amazon customer around time received amazon gift card bonus work husband tried add card account flagged fraud lost allwhy flagged card reported lost stolenthe card watched bos walk big yellow envelope open pull little black box orange ribbon inside box individual card sticker covering number nothing tampered receipt prove stolen absolutely horrible banked card well account trip day christmas locked money never deal amazon quite scam worked,0.012132749342956037,0.987867250657044,0.09478407178911946,0.2,0.8128904396863459,81.28904396863459,High Trust
Christie Pollard,/users/595d57290000ff000aabee09,US,7.0,2018-12-17 21:10:33+00:00,5.0,I love Amazon,"I love Amazon. I have ordered most all my birthday and Christmas gifts from Amazon, as well as household items, clothing, and personal items. We also order some food items, skin care, and cat food. Much is set up on ""Subscribe and Save,"" with a savings of 15%. The two-day shipping with Amazon Prime and the bonus when you request delayed shipping is also great. Any problem I have had has been quickly and easily resolved. SOMETIMES, you have to ask for a US based representative. Most understand your problem, but sometimes there is a cultural or language misunderstanding.Because of the frequency of our Amazon use, UPS stops at our door several times a week.",2018-12-17 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,17.0,662,115,13,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,love amazon ordered birthday christmas gift amazon well household item clothing personal item also order food item skin care cat food much set subscribe save saving twoday shipping amazon prime bonus request delayed shipping also great problem quickly easily resolved sometimes ask u based representative understand problem sometimes cultural language misunderstandingbecause frequency amazon use ups stop door several time week,0.019369710708753096,0.9806302892912468,0.06449803701626472,1.0,2.0032147520488763,200.32147520488763,High Trust
Whitethunda,/users/5c17dedcd0943ff8adabe12d,US,1.0,2018-12-17 17:37:35+00:00,1.0,Terrible customer service and security policies,"My amazon account had been compromised. Called customer service to get it resolved and there was nothing they could do other than ""escalate"" the situation to their recovery team, which would respond to me via email within 24-48 hours. Well 3 days later and still have yet to here back from them. Although it's a busier time of the year, it does not excuse their priority that they take with this types of situations. Especially when peoples personal information, including cards and addresses are on the account! If this ever does get resolved, I believe I'll just delete my account and not give them my business anymore. -future ex-amazon prime member.",2018-12-17 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,17.0,653,111,47,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon account compromised called customer service get resolved nothing could escalate situation recovery team would respond via email within hour well day later still yet back although busier time year excuse priority take type situation especially people personal information including card address account ever get resolved believe ill delete account give business anymore future examazon prime member,0.04533996676847745,0.9546600332315226,0.062254627033090294,0.2,0.7897809420223794,78.97809420223794,High Trust
