Emily McDougall,/users/5c117a35a3936127bf47f214,GB,5.0,2018-12-12 21:22:34+00:00,4.0,Usually very good!,"I have never had any problems with Amazon.  I have rarely had to return any items and when I have, the process has always been quick and painless. Most recently, however, they have sent me a book with about 30 pages stuck together. Instead of them sending me a replacement (which is usually what happens when I go through the return process), they have asked me to send this item back for a refund.  I ordered the book in the Black Friday sale at about £2.79.  The book has now gone up up £7.99.  There is no way I would pay full price for the book so I am now a Christmas present short.  I wish they would have just replaced it as it was their fault for sending a faulty product to start with.",2018-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,12.0,694,135,18,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,never problem amazon rarely return item process always quick painless recently however sent book page stuck together instead sending replacement usually happens go return process asked send item back refund ordered book black friday sale £ book gone £ way would pay full price book christmas present short wish would replaced fault sending faulty product start,0.013911111539143154,0.9860888884608568,0.07571508693213685,0.8,1.7081874616168558,170.81874616168557,High Trust
sandhyayadav,/users/5c117a60a39361657947f239,IN,1.0,2018-12-12 21:15:16+00:00,1.0,"Fraudsters,They have simply stolen my Money and refused to listen now","Order # 404-9586055-6829933This is the most bizarre service i have received from any online Company till date.They have simply stolen my Money and they are least bothered now .I  have ordered   2 phone(Redmi pro 6) from Amazon on  01 December.The courier person handed over the box to  one of my family members at home and took the OTP from me.Since a courier boy is only supposed to drop the parcel  and replacement/refund always needs to be done directly with the company there was no point that i cross checked the parcel before giving away the otp. When i opened the box i found only one phone where as i receive bill for 2 phones.I immediately contacted Amazon customer care services who confirmed that only one box was delivered which contains both the phones.I contacted customer care services and they asked me to drop a mail and wait for a week I showed the images of box received and i clearly told them that  2 mobile phone along with boxes can not be packed in such small box with mentioned wait of 0.45 kgs on the box.Single mobile phone weight  along with box is close to 0.40 kgs    so obviously the box can not contain 2 mobile phones.To my utter surprise,no body bothered to revert back on that and they  simply  reverted we have checked and we are not going to give you any refund or replacement.Surely it can be a possibility that I might be lying but then the box sent by Amazon does not have the space to contain 2 mobile phones so how can they do it.How can  a box of 0.45 kgs(mentioned on the box) contains two mobile phones of weight 0.40 kgs(with box)I  am going to take these scammers and fraud people to  court  and file legal case against them as i have all the proofs with me.I have myself worked  in an online MNC and i can never imagine such pathetic  behavior and response with an intent to completely steel my Money...Beware every one,think twice before you purchase anything from them...",2018-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,12.0,1921,346,69,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,order bizarre service received online company till datethey simply stolen money least bothered ordered phoneredmi pro amazon decemberthe courier person handed box one family member home took otp mesince courier boy supposed drop parcel replacementrefund always need done directly company point cross checked parcel giving away otp opened box found one phone receive bill phonesi immediately contacted amazon customer care service confirmed one box delivered contains phonesi contacted customer care service asked drop mail wait week showed image box received clearly told mobile phone along box packed small box mentioned wait kg boxsingle mobile phone weight along box close kg obviously box contain mobile phonesto utter surpriseno body bothered revert back simply reverted checked going give refund replacementsurely possibility might lying box sent amazon space contain mobile phone ithow box kgsmentioned box contains two mobile phone weight kgswith boxi going take scammer fraud people court file legal case proof mei worked online mnc never imagine pathetic behavior response intent completely steel moneybeware every onethink twice purchase anything,0.00809030264227258,0.9919096973577274,0.19405496354458776,0.2,0.8347658413877812,83.47658413877812,High Trust
