T Ken,/users/5c10fba26b8fe652158e76d0,GB,4.0,2018-12-12 12:15:28+00:00,1.0,Bunch of useless grifters,"Gotta love that Amazon charge you a premium and then provide a dismally atrocious service.I bought an item on Monday morning (editor picks, Prim eligible). I ordered on Monday as i was home on Tuesday and this was my delivery date.I do not live on the Isle of Mann or in the middle of Scotland, I live in Zone 3 London. How is it that I waited all day for my delivery only for Amazon to send me a message at 4pm telling me that they didn't bother sorting my item that day and it should come before Friday.Just had a message now that the delivery guy couldn't deliver the parcel and it's gone back to depot, No surprise seeing as I had to go back to work today because I can't sit on my backside all day waiting for deliveries like some dole dependant mug.I have now tried to cancel the delivery but That will prob take over a month to refund or not at all as has happened previously when another prime delivery completely failed.All in all this company could do with a serious internal review about delivery procedures.",2018-12-12 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,12.0,1019,191,25,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,gotta love amazon charge premium provide dismally atrocious servicei bought item monday morning editor pick prim eligible ordered monday home tuesday delivery datei live isle mann middle scotland live zone london waited day delivery amazon send message pm telling didnt bother sorting item day come fridayjust message delivery guy couldnt deliver parcel gone back depot surprise seeing go back work today cant sit backside day waiting delivery like dole dependant mugi tried cancel delivery prob take month refund happened previously another prime delivery completely failedall company could serious internal review delivery procedure,0.012200426714827892,0.9877995732851721,0.1071228266965788,0.2,0.8153243519819019,81.53243519819019,High Trust
