Alycia O'Connell,/users/5bd4ad204de5666d34d3993f,US,4.0,2018-12-09 23:45:36+00:00,2.0,CUSTOMER SERVICE NOT HELPFUL!,"CUSTOMER SERVICE NOT HELPFUL!!  Giving two stars because i have had great experience with buying and receiving for the most part off amazon but utilized customer service for the first time,that gets a zero star.  Super frustrating experience.  Bought an item on amazon as i had thought they had great policies for things such as price adjustments, a few days later the price dropped significantly on their site and several other sites were also cheaper.  I went on the chat, told the whole story, was transferred to someone else, they told me they could not adjust it but i could rebuy it (first) and then return the one I have.  I kept asking to get confirmation i would not need to pay to return without answer, I am glad I waited since of course there was a cost.  I  told the representative who then started acting like he was saying that the whole time (even though we have a transcript).  I expressed my concern and he said it was a pleasure assisting me which he did not.  Not only did I loose money but about a half an hour waiting on a chat, they must be talking to several people at once because the responses took forever.  Will think again before ordering so much on amazon.",2018-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,9.0,1186,216,29,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,customer service helpful giving two star great experience buying receiving part amazon utilized customer service first timethat get zero star super frustrating experience bought item amazon thought great policy thing price adjustment day later price dropped significantly site several site also cheaper went chat told whole story transferred someone else told could adjust could rebuy first return one kept asking get confirmation would need pay return without answer glad waited since course cost told representative started acting like saying whole time even though transcript expressed concern said pleasure assisting loose money half hour waiting chat must talking several people response took forever think ordering much amazon,0.31197253211171905,0.688027467888281,0.12114413909141895,0.4,0.9682425617624243,96.82425617624243,High Trust
