Kacper Jaskurzynski,/users/58a612840000ff000a785b56,GB,9.0,2018-12-09 15:52:35+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime is a scam,"I paid for Amazon Prime in the past, loads of missed deliveries so I cancelled. Recently, Amazon tempted me with a month free trial... Here's what happened 1- they keep leaving my parcels outside my door, near a busy road, even during torrential rain. Despite adding a ""do not leave outside"" note, they continue to do so.2- one parcel never arrived. Most likely got stolen after it was left outside.3- ordered an item as next day delivery 48 hours ago. Just been advised it will be here tomorrow. So 72 hours after ordering.I'm sorry, but this is a service that I wouldn't use even if it was free. What is the point of paying Amazon monthly for my parcels being stolen and to get ""free next day delivery"" when it arrives after 3 days? Might as well stick with the 3-5 days actual free delivery.Best of all, customer rep tried to give me a ""goodwill gesture"" of another 1 month for free of that sub-standard service.",2018-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,9.0,915,166,22,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,paid amazon prime past load missed delivery cancelled recently amazon tempted month free trial here happened keep leaving parcel outside door near busy road even torrential rain despite adding leave outside note continue one parcel never arrived likely got stolen left outside ordered item next day delivery hour ago advised tomorrow hour orderingim sorry service wouldnt use even free point paying amazon monthly parcel stolen get free next day delivery arrives day might well stick day actual free deliverybest customer rep tried give goodwill gesture another month free substandard service,0.008960179421768312,0.9910398205782317,0.09310151430173864,0.2,0.8141402131494636,81.41402131494637,High Trust
Glynne Thomas,/users/59df8c190000ff000ad439e9,GB,7.0,2018-12-09 15:07:07+00:00,1.0,ABSOLOUTLY DISGUSTED AT CUSTOMER SERVICE,"I have been trying to order gift cards ( a substantial amount as christmas bonuses for my employees this year) for a week now. At first I received only part of my order, which was delivered to my local post office with no issue. BUT the remamainder of the order has been declined, 4 TIMES! I initially called Amazon 4 days ago to see what the problem was with payment and they advised me that my bank had declined the balance of the order, so I spoke to my bank to authorise the balance. Tried again to put an order in for the remainder of the gift cards, again declined. I again spoke to Amazon 2 days ago. I was advised that the initial order would have to be cancelled by the call handler so that I could again put an order in on line as I was unable to do it over the phone. I agreed to this and tried to order again on line. 20 minutes later I received an email to say that not only had the order been cancelled but my account HAD BEEN CLOSED due to fraudulent activity! Amazon were actually gloating at how good they had been to detect this!! I and my wife AGAIN (for the 2nd time that day) had to call customer service and go through the whole sorry saga again!I was sent another email with a link to retrieve my account. This I did and AGAIN tried to put the order for the balance of the giftcards I wished to purchase along with some batteries I require for tooling for my job. No emails to say that the order had been declined this time but when I went through to the order details via my email, I saw that AGAIN the orders had been CANCELLED. TODAY WAS YET ANOTHER PHONE CALL TO AMAZON CUSTOME SERVICES. 4 TIMES THIS WEEK I HAVE CALLED. As I have a business account, and the order was over £1000, I had to be put through to the business dept. They couldn't help. I needed to speak to yet another dept because, although I can now access my account I cannot actually use it! But they weren't availiable. So I am now having to wait another day for them to call me back, that's if they do and don't send me an email to say they have shut my account yet again.I am trying to spend a lot of money with Amazon, and yes, with gift cards they can be fraudulent purchases I understand that, but all along I and my wife have spoken to Amazon and our bank to get this resolved.I AM TOTALLY DISGUSTED AT THE LEVEL OF SERVICE I HAVE RECEIVED (OR NOT) FROM AMAZON.I WASTRYING TO GIVE MY EMPLOYEES GIFT CARDS AS A CHRISTMAS PRESENT FOR ALL THEIR HARD WORK THIS YEAR AT OUR CHRISTMAS PARTY LAST NIGHT BUT AMAZON HAS RUINED IT! THANK YOU AMAZON! MY EMPLOYEES NOW HAVE IOU'S. NOT GOOD!",2018-12-09 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,9.0,2577,501,40,5,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,trying order gift card substantial amount christmas bonus employee year week first received part order delivered local post office issue remamainder order declined time initially called amazon day ago see problem payment advised bank declined balance order spoke bank authorise balance tried put order remainder gift card declined spoke amazon day ago advised initial order would cancelled call handler could put order line unable phone agreed tried order line minute later received email say order cancelled account closed due fraudulent activity amazon actually gloating good detect wife nd time day call customer service go whole sorry saga againi sent another email link retrieve account tried put order balance giftcards wished purchase along battery require tooling job email say order declined time went order detail via email saw order cancelled today yet another phone call amazon custome service time week called business account order £ put business dept couldnt help needed speak yet another dept although access account cannot actually use werent availiable wait another day call back thats dont send email say shut account yet againi trying spend lot money amazon yes gift card fraudulent purchase under