Mark Evans,/users/5be57b045483f4b8a9947d19,GB,27.0,2018-12-02 12:13:27+00:00,3.0,Good product but not portable as no internal battery,"I bought an Echo Alexa speaker. It’s great for playing all kinds of audio. I am using it for radio, music and audio books currently. The voice recognition is good. Size and style good. I was however very disappointed to discover that it has no internal battery so it’s not portable. This limits my use to one room. If I had realised this (I should have read the spec but just naturally assumed that a speaker would have a rechargeable internal battery) I would not have bought it.",2018-12-02 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,2.0,480,88,52,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bought echo alexa speaker it’s great playing kind audio using radio music audio book currently voice recognition good size style good however disappointed discover internal battery it’s portable limit use one room realised read spec naturally assumed speaker would rechargeable internal battery would bought,0.08731092229610016,0.9126890777038998,0.049355019629837356,0.6,1.3662155427779172,136.62155427779172,High Trust
Cynthia,/users/5c0351ab5483f4b8a92e30a9,US,5.0,2018-12-02 03:59:08+00:00,2.0,can be unreliable,"I am a Prime member and was fairly happy with the service until recently. Yesterday Amazon messaged me that my two packages had been delivered, but when I checked my apt lobby they weren't there. I waited until the next day to call Amazon and it turned out both packages had been delivered to the wrong address. But Amazon couldn't find where they ended up exactly, just some unknown spot with $80 worth of merchandise. That is so unprofessional! I was refunded my money and will instead order online at another store where I have the option for store pickup. I might just close my Prime account and no longer shop at Amazon.",2018-12-02 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,2.0,625,113,17,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,prime member fairly happy service recently yesterday amazon messaged two package delivered checked apt lobby werent waited next day call amazon turned package delivered wrong address amazon couldnt find ended exactly unknown spot worth merchandise unprofessional refunded money instead order online another store option store pickup might close prime account longer shop amazon,0.10869421080543262,0.8913057891945674,0.0633763320246775,0.4,1.058328161002219,105.8328161002219,High Trust
Melissa,/users/596e9ffc0000ff000ab0e4d8,US,3.0,2018-12-01 22:17:26+00:00,2.0,I absolutely loved Amazon until today,"I absolutely love Amazon. But after today's customer care service I'm looking for another company to do my shopping. In April I bought the Amazon Kindle Fire 8 kids edition and it was great for about a month. Unfortunately my son ran the battery down and out of speaking to customer care I found out that was a common issue where once it dies it will not restart and has to be sent in. I resent it in and got a refurbished Kindle that had a scratch along the case. Cat scratch turned into a crack within a week and I returned it. Thankfully it has the 2-year unlimited replacement. The next one after maybe 2 weeks would only go to the Amazon reset menu. So I had to send it back in. This is around the 16th of November. By the 23rd I had not heard anything and contacted customer care who told me it was on its way and would be here within 3 to 5 days. As of today December 1st I contact to see where it was. I was told that it is out of stock and I would have to purchase the item again and once it got sent out they would refund me the money. I refuse to do that and after three agents, one supervisor and two hours I decide to cut my loss and take a partial credit. I went back do snapshot the screen to show my family and the Agents had deleted it off my side. I'm pretty sure that that's not in Amazon's policy. Thankfully it still shows on Amazon side and I took screenshots of where the conversation is missing and the Agent I was speaking to at the time verifying that I did in fact speak to these other agents. I'm pretty sad that Amazon is letting these kinds of individuals ruin their business.",2018-12-01 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,12.0,1.0,1606,317,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolutely love amazon today customer care service im looking another company shopping april bought amazon kindle fire kid edition great month unfortunately son ran battery speaking customer care found common issue dy restart sent resent got refurbished kindle scratch along case cat scratch turned crack within week returned thankfully year unlimited replacement next one maybe week would go amazon reset menu send back around th november rd heard anything contacted customer care told way would within day today december st contact see told stock would purchase item got sent would refund money refuse three agent one supervisor two hour decide cut loss take partial credit went back snapshot screen show family agent deleted side im pretty sure thats amazon policy thankfully still show amazon side took screenshots conversation missing agent speaking time verifying fact speak agent im pretty sad amazon letting kind individual ruin business,0.007997606638997158,0.9920023933610028,0.1777902411665732,0.4,1.131559244913816,113.15592449138161,High Trust
