Ren,/users/558794260000ff0001c785ec,GB,16.0,2018-11-18 07:14:48+00:00,1.0,Amazon Prime: A complete waste of good money,"I’ve been using Amazon for years but have reached the end of my teather with this company. Like many of the reviews below: - Paying for Prime next day delivery. It’s constantly been a 50/50 chance of getting my delivery on time or at all. This year alone, I have had to contact Amazon about the status of 5 different orders as they wouldn’t arrive when expected and then when I would go into my order status page on Amazon, it will simply say there had been delays and it should arrive soon, and if it doesn’t, I should get in touch with customer service. Must items on Amazon are free delivery so what I am actually paying for is quicker delivery which never happens- plus, I want to make an order and know it will arrive, not having to continuously exchange emails with customer service which always try to fob you off with some nonesense story. On the first occasion, the rep even said I couldn’t couldn’t get a refund, that Amazon would first have to resend me the item, then if I wanted a return I would have to send it back or reject delivery before I could get a refund! This was after s two week delay on a next day delivery order! Unbelievable. Amazon Prime is for those that are happy to pay for a hit and miss service.",2018-11-18 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,11.0,18.0,1229,233,44,8,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,i’ve using amazon year reached end teather company like many review paying prime next day delivery it’s constantly chance getting delivery time year alone contact amazon status different order wouldn’t arrive expected would go order status page amazon simply say delay arrive soon doesn’t get touch customer service must item amazon free delivery actually paying quicker delivery never happens plus want make order know arrive continuously exchange email customer service always try fob nonesense story first occasion rep even said couldn’t couldn’t get refund amazon would first resend item wanted return would send back reject delivery could get refund two week delay next day delivery order unbelievable amazon prime happy pay hit miss service,0.0772462589191493,0.9227537410808507,0.13067863151991027,0.2,0.7875125968444074,78.75125968444074,High Trust
