Luke,/users/4ebbe04d00006400010e54b9,GB,55.0,2018-11-14 14:56:39+00:00,1.0,ATM Im dealing with A-Z guarantee…,"ATM Im dealing with A-Z guarantee dispute. The amazon been misleading and being dishonest with me. I have spoken to them when my phone broke and received an email confirming the A-Z guarantee has been filed. I  had to wait 2 weeks. Then after that nothing happened so I had to contact them again. I been told the A-Z guarantee was filed for different order, which I immediately disputed as I have an email with the correct order number filed. Then they changed the story telling me that they MISLEADED me. And that no A-Z guarantee claim has been filed!?So I was told they will raise it up and the new A-Z guarantee claim is filed and I had to wait 1 week. I did wait and they just send me a message that they denied the claim and that I had to go to bank sort it out myself.I disagreed and appealed the claim. Been told 24 hour to wait and that they will call me.Nobody did. I had to call today to find out that they don't know why nobody contacted me and now they filled another claim which takes 24hrs.So now its almost 4 week without my phone I paid £200 pounds.If they will not sort me out I will take it to trading standards and will file official complaint. The new papers will also hear of this.Pretty disgusting from Amazon as Im customer for over 10 years and spend a lots of money.The fact they been lying to me is hard to accept and the £200 pounds is another issue.If amazon is becoming this sort of business then Im done. Ebay and other sites have better prices as I find out today.I will seek legal advice to seek the compensation.",2018-11-14 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,11.0,14.0,1546,294,34,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,atm im dealing az guarantee dispute amazon misleading dishonest spoken phone broke received email confirming az guarantee filed wait week nothing happened contact told az guarantee filed different order immediately disputed email correct order number filed changed story telling misleaded az guarantee claim filedso told raise new az guarantee claim filed wait week wait send message denied claim go bank sort myselfi disagreed appealed claim told hour wait call menobody call today find dont know nobody contacted filled another claim take hrsso almost week without phone paid £ poundsif sort take trading standard file official complaint new paper also hear thispretty disgusting amazon im customer year spend lot moneythe fact lying hard accept £ pound another issueif amazon becoming sort business im done ebay site better price find todayi seek legal advice seek compensation,0.3835974438471739,0.6164025561528261,0.16489063376332025,0.2,0.6411794048290771,64.11794048290771,Medium Trust
