en child lock gate throw thing amazon wonder call damaged item want new one sent got bad amazon won’t sort problem deliveriesitems think pulling sort scam employed descent delivery drive would case would problem themvery poor company don’t care customer service got big company customer servicecare longer priority,0.018176653407813315,0.9818233465921867,0.14750420639371845,0.2,0.820412514574837,82.0412514574837,High Trust
