Lee Cheney,/users/5bda9b234de5666d3466bb8b,US,3.0,2021-04-05 18:28:00+00:00,5.0,Very Convenient,"I’ve had some minor issues with Amazon in the past, but they’ve almost always fixed every issue. They’ve even gone above and beyond on fixing a few issues that I’ve had in the past. They took away my ability to review items and ask questions for a while without explanation which was very frustrating. Now I refuse to write many reviews because of that issue, but at least they restored my account. Overall, they have such convenient and well priced products and services that it would be hard for me to quit using Amazon.",2018-11-01 00:00:00+00:00,2021.0,4.0,5.0,522,94,15,2,886.0,0,0,0,0,Genuine,i’ve minor issue amazon past they’ve almost always fixed every issue they’ve even gone beyond fixing issue i’ve past took away ability review item ask question without explanation frustrating refuse write many review issue least restored account overall convenient well priced product service would hard quit using amazon,4.504785252221403e-07,0.9999995495214747,0.05272013460459899,1.0,2.0105438016816572,201.05438016816572,High Trust
