Sam,/users/5bd7a6694de5666d34e4df3e,US,108.0,2018-10-30 14:30:08+00:00,4.0,Great Quality Products,"I've always had a great experience with Amazon, along with everyone else I know. I've ordered books, watches, tools, headphones, cables etc. on Amazon. I've always received my products, and they've always been pretty much exactly as described. Prime is one of the best services out there. I always get Prime-marked products within 2 days of my order. I've only ever ordered one product that wasn't great, and it was a cheap Fitbit knock-off.I've never had to deal with their customer service as far as I can remember, so I can't speak on this. Everything else is great though! Pay attention to the written reviews on Amazon; they're very accurate!",2018-10-30 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,30.0,647,110,22,3,0.0,0,2,2,1,Suspicious,ive always great experience amazon along everyone else know ive ordered book watch tool headphone cable etc amazon ive always received product theyve always pretty much exactly described prime one best service always get primemarked product within day order ive ever ordered one product wasnt great cheap fitbit knockoffive never deal customer service far remember cant speak everything else great though pay attention written review amazon theyre accurate,0.8676672080581117,0.1323327919418883,0.06169377453729669,0.8,1.2785051508784036,127.85051508784035,High Trust
