Chiara Lau,/users/5bd787094de5666d34d1e623,AU,1.0,2018-10-29 22:17:55+00:00,1.0,BAD EXPERIENCE,"I ordered the game to be arrived on the release date, but I didn't get it!!! Though the courier is responsible for the delivery but Amazon is also to be blamed. They only sent it out by parcel post which is the SLOWEST way of delivery and there is no guarantee to get it on time and it turned out I cannot get it by the release date!!! If I chose expedited delivery and cannot get it on time. WHAT IS THE POINT??? I had to buy another game somewhere else so my weekend wasn't wasted so I can only refunded it and I missed my pre-order goodies. There is no compensation I wish I could have my pre-order goodies back :(Never gonna buy on Amazon again!!! Don't give out impossible delivery choices if you cannot make it.",2018-10-29 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,29.0,717,138,14,2,0.0,0,9,2,1,Suspicious,ordered game arrived release date didnt get though courier responsible delivery amazon also blamed sent parcel post slowest way delivery guarantee get time turned cannot get release date chose expedited delivery cannot get time point buy another game somewhere else weekend wasnt wasted refunded missed preorder goody compensation wish could preorder goody back never gonna buy amazon dont give impossible delivery choice cannot make,0.9999560095447126,4.399045528735712e-05,0.07739764441951767,0.2,0.3155015241115472,31.55015241115472,Low Trust
