L Golden,/users/5bd6ecaa4de5666d343050ef,US,1.0,2018-10-29 11:19:09+00:00,1.0,Bad Sad customer service,"There site stated I would not be charged for an order until it shipped.  Amazon cancelled an order I placed almost immediately after I order, due to some problem with that seller.  So I placed another order and this morning saw on bank account that I was charged for both, and that it overdrew my account and my bank charged me $29.00.  I am a very poor single mom and cannot afford this.  Complained over and over - all they will say is refund will be 3-5 days.  Too late - damage done.  They are like Wal-Mart, soooo big that the little customers don't really matter, as we probably don't really affect their bottom line.  I find that sad.",2018-10-29 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,29.0,641,119,24,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,site stated would charged order shipped amazon cancelled order placed almost immediately order due problem seller placed another order morning saw bank account charged overdrew account bank charged poor single mom cannot afford complained say refund day late damage done like walmart soooo big little customer dont really matter probably dont really affect bottom line find sad,0.01206558628376885,0.9879344137162311,0.06674144699943915,0.2,0.8073154962580035,80.73154962580034,High Trust
Carl,/users/5bd60ef84de5666d349f2aac,US,1.0,2018-10-28 19:45:57+00:00,3.0,Amazon has been slipping for a while,"Amazon has been slipping for a while. Their shipping has been getting longer and longer. They will tell you at check out when the item(s) will be delivered and the item(s) arrive a week later. Being a Prime member at one time had benefits, now its becoming a nice cash cow for Amazon without providing what was, top notch service and delivery. One day, about 4 years ago, I orderd an item from Amazon and it actually arrived the same day! I was sold on Amazon, now I can take 20 minutes of my time and go to Walmart, pay less and have the item in my hand when i leave the store. This is what happens when a company get too big for itself.",2018-10-28 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,28.0,638,125,36,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon slipping shipping getting longer longer tell check item delivered item arrive week later prime member one time benefit becoming nice cash cow amazon without providing top notch service delivery one day year ago orderd item amazon actually arrived day sold amazon take minute time go walmart pay less item hand leave store happens company get big,0.08864475584452951,0.9113552441554705,0.07010656197420079,0.6,1.3696989344725752,136.9698934472575,High Trust
Trevor,/users/5bd4e63d4de5666d34f3a300,US,1.0,2018-10-27 22:27:12+00:00,1.0,Horrible,I pay for prime 15 a month and I do not know why. 3 missed deliveries in a WEEK and they didn’t offer anything. Was like pulling teeth just getting my prime refunded. If I picked no rush they would of given me 15 in vouchers anyways which they didn’t offer. If you don’t have to shop with amazon DONT. They are horrible.,2018-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,27.0,320,63,8,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,pay prime month know missed delivery week didn’t offer anything like pulling teeth getting prime refunded picked rush would given voucher anyways didn’t offer don’t shop amazon dont horrible,0.05083094420560895,0.949169055794391,0.035333707234997194,0.2,0.7816512693441949,78.16512693441949,High Trust
C,/users/5bd4cbfe4de5666d34e69734,US,1.0,2018-10-27 20:35:12+00:00,2.0,Why am I paying for PRIME?,"This year Amazon has lost three of my orders, and delayed almost a dozen. I use my Prime account for the ""free 2-3 day"" shipping, but now orders usually come in 4 or 5 days. Nothing is ever on time anymore. I've never had to complain about Amazon before, but I might as well just go to other sites if they're going to have the same slow service as every other store.",2018-10-27 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,27.0,366,72,26,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,year amazon lost three order delayed almost dozen use prime account free day shipping order usually come day nothing ever time anymore ive never complain amazon might well go site theyre going slow service every store,0.01409505898556204,0.9859049410144379,0.040381379697139654,0.4,1.1010287464466468,110.10287464466468,High Trust
