Benjamin Kuch,/users/555c648b0000ff0001c045e7,GB,16.0,2018-10-25 17:10:59+00:00,1.0,Worst seller experience ever,"Worst seller experience ever! I had a buyer who claimed item not received (let's be honest, 9 out of 10 times that's a scam, but anyway!) and I was forced to refund the buyer because it was sent, as usual, Royal Mail 2nd class large letter, ie untracked/no signature. Ok my bad, fine. Next time I need to send a £20 videogame tracked signed for, spending a fortune on the shipping, right??BUT worst of all though is that, prior to the decision of granting the buyer a refund, I had lengthy discussions regarding this case where I was reassured by Amazon Seller support, that I needn't worry about this buyer. I quote (Mayank S.): ""Upon investigation, I would like to inform you that as per the tracking details the product has been delivered to the buyer."" Well thanks, but what tracking details are you talking about?! Anyway thanks for confirming that the product has been delivered...! And ""Hence, be assured that if buyer has any issue with the delivery then amazon will provide the certain support to the buyer.""Later I got a message from another person (Pranav Kumar C.): ""After reviewing your email I understand that the seller demands a refund, claiming the item has not been received but you have already refunded.Kindly be informed that I am forwarding this information to our concerned team right now so that they can investigate this buyer. I have filed the investigation report against this buyer. I assure you that our team will take strict action against the buyer accordingly. However, if the buyer leaves a negative feedback our team will remove the feedback. You do not need to worry about this buyer as our team will now take care of this issue as we never allow any buyer to give loss to our valued sellers like you. I also assure you that you will not face such inconvenience in future as your case is being handled on top priority."" Ok thanks again, but what are you talking about? I haven't refunded the buyer! And what action have you taken against that buyer exactly?It's absolutely nuts. Stay away from selling on Amazon is my advice.",2018-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,25.0,2060,362,28,4,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,worst seller experience ever buyer claimed item received let honest time thats scam anyway forced refund buyer sent usual royal mail nd class large letter ie untrackedno signature ok bad fine next time need send £ videogame tracked signed spending fortune shipping rightbut worst though prior decision granting buyer refund lengthy discussion regarding case reassured amazon seller support neednt worry buyer quote mayank upon investigation would like inform per tracking detail product delivered buyer well thanks tracking detail talking anyway thanks confirming product delivered hence assured buyer issue delivery amazon provide certain support buyerlater got message another person pranav kumar c reviewing email understand seller demand refund claiming item received already refundedkindly informed forwarding information concerned team right investigate buyer filed investigation report buyer assure team take strict action buyer accordingly however buyer leaf negative feedback team remove feedback need worry buyer team take care issue never allow buyer give loss valued seller like also assure face inconvenience future case handled top priority ok thanks talking havent refunded buyer action taken buyer exactlyits absolutely nut stay away selling amazon advice,0.9896872790988142,0.010312720901185846,0.20302860347728546,0.2,0.34576208114605,34.576208114605,Low Trust
user name,/users/5a6581a50000ff000b040606,US,7.0,2018-10-25 15:08:36+00:00,1.0,Amazon-Flex contractor application process - Bot driven response after response after response after response...,"Long story short.I applied to be an Amazon-Flex contractor on October 4, 2018. As part of that process the contractor must submit to a background check that takes '2-5 business days' as stated on the application app.It is now 10/25/2018 with no decision. I asked Amazon:'What would be some of the reasons for delay? When might I expect a decision?'I received a bot generated response that the information was with their vendor and to basically sit tight. I respond that I understand and please answer my questions. In reply I got back the same bot generated reply. I got that bot-reply no less than 7 times. I also got a bot generated response that Amazon had received my information back from their vendor and were reviewing it. I heard from THAT bot twice.In frustration I used 'Attn: Mr. Bezos' as part of my subject line. To Mr. Bezos credit he forwarded my concerns to the Escalation team. I got  responses from two Escalation-bots that never addressed my original questions, didn't answer why I had received conflicting messages about my status, and included WORD FOR WORD the original bot response.OK-my promise of making a long story short didn't work out but you can see my frustration.My expectation is that if Amazon comments on this review it will include same bot-language contained in the messages they have generated to my questions all along.Caveat Emptor",2018-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,25.0,1371,232,112,14,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,long story shorti applied amazonflex contractor october part process contractor must submit background check take business day stated application appit decision asked amazonwhat would reason delay might expect decisioni received bot generated response information vendor basically sit tight respond understand please answer question reply got back bot generated reply got botreply less time also got bot generated response amazon received information back vendor reviewing heard bot twicein frustration used attn mr bezos part subject line mr bezos credit forwarded concern escalation team got response two escalationbots never addressed original question didnt answer received conflicting message status included word word original bot responseokmy promise making long story short didnt work see frustrationmy expectation amazon comment review include botlanguage contained message generated question alongcaveat emptor,0.01606726137052587,0.9839327386294742,0.13011777902411667,0.2,0.8179899251195604,81.79899251195604,High Trust
K,/users/5bd1d71b4de5666d34ad9eb3,US,1.0,2018-10-25 14:48:13+00:00,1.0,Horrible customer service,"Amazon is convenient, UNTIL you need customer service. I ordered a jacket online that dropped in price by $15 just two days later. I contacted customer service before the item was delivered, and they refused to refund the difference. Said to return the item and repurchase - what a joke! The $15 is not going to break me, but will be returning the item based on principle.",2018-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,25.0,372,67,25,3,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon convenient need customer service ordered jacket online dropped price two day later contacted customer service item delivered refused refund difference said return item repurchase joke going break returning item based principle,0.0503500976664796,0.9496499023335204,0.03757711721817162,0.2,0.7823403746103945,78.23403746103945,High Trust
Snehal Patole,/users/5bd199094de5666d3466638e,IN,1.0,2018-10-25 10:33:28+00:00,1.0,I have ordered titan watch of rs 5000…,"I have ordered titan watch of rs 5000 from amazon but that was too loose so I went to titan shop in season mall in pune I asked that person to remove 1 clip so he told me that this watch is not original titan not make this kind of model. It's a fake watch. I was very shocked that how come it is possible coz it's come with name and logo so I talked to my sister iwho is working with one Amazon dealer in mumbai and when i heard this from her mouth that time was speechless i wanted to share with u she told me that where she is working that dealer buy earphone in rs 20 from China packed with brand name and logo and they sell here of rs 1500 with brand name like JBL, Motorola, Sony and it's works almost 6 months and  no one can find it's fake. if when someone find that it's not working or some problem in their earphone that time can't replace it coz replacing time already gone.   It's very bad I will never ordered from Amazon. Amazon u just came before some years back and really means people can't go out and buy product whatever they want. even i.  R u trying to fool people.",2018-10-25 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,25.0,1085,217,38,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered titan watch r amazon loose went titan shop season mall pune asked person remove clip told watch original titan make kind model fake watch shocked come possible coz come name logo talked sister iwho working one amazon dealer mumbai heard mouth time speechless wanted share u told working dealer buy earphone r china packed brand name logo sell r brand name like jbl motorola sony work almost month one find fake someone find working problem earphone time cant replace coz replacing time already gone bad never ordered amazon amazon u came year back really mean people cant go buy product whatever want even r u trying fool people,0.004851089688950504,0.9951489103110495,0.12170499158721257,0.2,0.8219154534