Sumita Marolf,/users/5bc23ab54de5666d34666c21,US,1.0,2018-10-13 18:34:38+00:00,1.0,poor delivery on Prime,"I just wanted to leave you some feedback regarding:Order no: 112-0650956-9413807Tracking no: TBA333254983000This is my first time ordering with Amazon Prime, and I am so disappointed.The driver attempted to delivery this package twice, I live in a gated community and it appears that they just went to the gate and saw it was closed and gave up on the delivery and did not contact me or leave it at the office for the apartment like all other carriers do. I called Amazon customer service and told them that the driver can use a access code on the gate, or call me or leave it somewhere safe. I also said that the order was urgent and was needed for an event the next day. The driver just turned up at the gate again saw it was closed and did not bother to use the access code or call me despite me waiting all day for this order.He logged this 2nd failed delivery as “business closed for holiday” which is ridiculous as we are not a business, my address is a private residence and there is no holiday going on!So I called Amazon again and the lady said that it would be delivered tomorrow. I said that I had already explained that the order was needed for today and she then put me through to the Amazon Logistic representative. Everyone I spoke with so far has agreed that the driver’s reason for the failed delivery and his actions were “crazy” and “wrong”. The logistics representative said that he would send a message out to the driver and can see when the driver reads this message and the driver would call me and get the package to me today.I explained that we need it soon as we are all ready to leave and were just waiting for this package to be delivered.2 hours later I heard nothing, so I called yet again for the 3rd time, and the Amazon representative said that the driver’s reason for not delivering was wrong. He then again put me through to a logistics representative and this time she said that she could not contact driver at all as they did not have a way to do this, and that the package was sitting at the centre and was not out for delivery. I said that it was ridiculous that  they were a logistics company responsible for the driver getting my order to me but had no way of contacting them, that is truly ludicrous. I asked if she could track the messages they had previously sent out to the driver and see if he had read them, but she contradicted her colleague and said that they did not have the facility to do this either.Amazon has failed to fulfill my order in time, and I am so unimpressed with Amazon Prime - there clearly is not point paying for this if they cannot get my order to me in the time-frame they quoted, while I wait at home all day. It should not take 3 different phone calls and being told conflicting information and thinking that the driver was just outside my gate twice (so close!) but didn't act on the instructions given to them.I am now left without my order which I need today, and have no idea how I am going to sort out an alternative and this has pretty much ruined what was going to be a good weekend.Very poor service.",2018-10-13 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,13.0,3081,577,22,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,wanted leave feedback regardingorder tracking tbathis first time ordering amazon prime disappointedthe driver attempted delivery package twice live gated community appears went gate saw closed gave delivery contact leave office apartment like carrier called amazon customer service told driver use access code gate call leave somewhere safe also said order urgent needed event next day driver turned gate saw closed bother use access code call despite waiting day orderhe logged nd failed delivery “business closed holiday” ridiculous business address private residence holiday going onso called amazon lady said would delivered tomorrow said already explained order needed today put amazon logistic representative everyone spoke far agreed driver’s reason failed delivery action “crazy” “wrong” logistics representative said would send message driver see driver read message driver would call get package todayi explained need soon ready leave waiting package delivered hour later heard nothing called yet rd time amazon representative said driver’s reason delivering wrong put logistics representative time said could contact driver way package sitting centre delivery said ridiculous logistics company responsible driver getting order way contacting truly ludicrous asked could track message previously sent driver see read contradicted colleague said facility eitheramazon failed fulfill order time unimpressed amazon prime clearly point paying cannot get order timeframe quoted wait home day take different phone call told conflicting information thinking driver outside gate twice close didnt act instruction given themi left without order need today idea going sort alternative pretty much ruined going good weekendvery poor service,0.15222333224901693,0.847776667750983,0.3236118900729108,0.2,0.7886107118900737,78.86107118900738,High Trust
Mrs Sharon Rochell,/users/5bb77c7c4de5666d347755ac,GB,2.0,2018-10-13 18:33:31+00:00,2.0,TERRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE!!!!,"AMAZON TERRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE!!!!! , spoke to THREE people and had difficulty understanding all three due to their accent and English, was told I could return my goods as they were faulty and less than 12 months old so still under manufacturer warranty,and receive replacements as they still had the item in stock, but after quite a lengthy conversation ( if that’s what you could call it! ) I was then told I could only receive a refund,and then told to re order, couldn’t understand  the reason why, again because of the broken English,obviously has a set response to give to customers,probably why he couldn’t  answer my questions and kept repeating the same lines back to me ! asked if I was to re order could I get the item at the price  I paid? Apparently NOT!!! it has now gone up in price! Argued the fact I shouldn’t have to pay more for the same thing when it’s within the manufacturers warranty, and wanted more of an explanation as to why they couldn’t just send out a replacement as first offered? (my theory being it was due to the increase in price obviously, what else could it be) Getting nowhere asked to speak to a manager but to no avail,put on hold countless times (he was probably speaking to a manager) Upshot is no way was I getting a replacement, ended up with a refund into my amazon account, plus a goodwill jester of £15 off my next purchase! I will have to make a purchase obviously, just to get my money back, BUT TRUST ME THAT WILL BE MY LAST PURCHASE FROM AMAZON !!!!!!!!!",2018-10-13 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,10.0,13.0,1507,276,29,3,0.0,0,21,2,1,Suspicious,amazon terrible customer service spoke three people difficulty understanding three due accent english told could return good faulty less month old still manufacturer warrantyand receive replacement still item stock quite lengthy conversation that’s could call told could receive refundand to