Chaloux,/users/5baf2e854de5666d346d000d,EE,6.0,2018-09-29 08:15:42+00:00,2.0,"Amazon is good, other sellers arent, customer service can be improved a lot","Amazon itself is offering quality service, shipping products usually as promised. Other sellers are a pain, ordered a leather jacket, didnt like it and shipped it back to a seller, seller started making up lies, like they havent received the jacket even though they had.I contacted Amazon Support and was on the live chat with a person who spoke awful English and submitted an A-Z guarantee claim under wrong issues. Claim got denied, contacted support again and got on the line with a very helpful support agent, but since the last agent was so bad, there was little to do, we submit another claim to make amazon rethink the claim decision, but because it was still under the wrong issue, it got once again denied. Contacted them for third time and this time requested someone higher up, was forwarded to them and spoke to them for about 30 minutes, as final result, the agent forwarded the case to investigation. A day later I was contacted by Amazon, finally telling me that they will issue me a full price refund, this included product price, shipping and return shipping. Could have had a better experience, but atleast my problem got solved, research a seller before you buy from them!",2018-09-29 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,9.0,29.0,1191,207,75,13,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon offering quality service shipping product usually promised seller pain ordered leather jacket didnt like shipped back seller seller started making lie like havent received jacket even though hadi contacted amazon support live chat person spoke awful english submitted az guarantee claim wrong issue claim got denied contacted support got line helpful support agent since last agent bad little submit another claim make amazon rethink claim decision still wrong issue got denied contacted third time time requested someone higher forwarded spoke minute final result agent forwarded case investigation day later contacted amazon finally telling issue full price refund included product price shipping return shipping could better experience atleast problem got solved research seller buy,0.01978670850404926,0.9802132914959507,0.1160964666292765,0.4,1.1133259390738306,111.33259390738306,High Trust
