Kellie Ko Takemoto,/users/5bac7ad14de5666d34f5322d,US,1.0,2018-09-27 06:39:34+00:00,1.0,Item not delivered.  Bye bye $600,I've been a long time customer to amazon spending tens of thousands of dollars with no problems until recently.  They said my package was delivered and it wasn't.  I go through their process. Notify them.  They launch a 72 hour investigation and they should get back to you but they don't.  I call them up they said it was delivered.  I said it wasn't.  They told me that it's out of their hands and it's up to me to report to authorities and USPS and that they're not liable. I called the police make a police report.  Call amazon back up told them my police report and they said I will need to notify them once police finishes their investigation and from there they may issue me a refund.  I'm SOL of $600 worth of goods that I need to buy again for items that I didn't receive which means I am now paying double for what's it's worth.  Maybe amazon might replace an item if your item is cheap but don't count on it if you made a big purchase because they won't take care of you.  Don't use their credit card to make a purchase because they will probably side with amazon.,2018-09-27 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,9.0,27.0,1075,204,33,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive long time customer amazon spending ten thousand dollar problem recently said package delivered wasnt go process notify launch hour investigation get back dont call said delivered said wasnt told hand report authority usps theyre liable called police make police report call amazon back told police report said need notify police finish investigation may issue refund im sol worth good need buy item didnt receive mean paying double whats worth maybe amazon might replace item item cheap dont count made big purchase wont take care dont use credit card make purchase probably side amazon,0.009101646180112102,0.9908983538198879,0.11441390914189568,0.2,0.818331958738323,81.8331958738323,High Trust
