Susannah Bautista,/users/5b9c4e5a4de5666d34a4a272,US,4.0,2018-09-15 00:12:23+00:00,1.0,Fraudulent sellers ruin integrity,"Customer service has always been wonderful and helpful but I have to give low rating due to the quality of the products. Amazon does not regulate the legitimacy of branded products, thus allowing fraudulent sellers to sell fraudulent products. This problem has become more rampant as time goes on, and Amazon doesn't seem to care at all. The only recourse when receiving a fraudulent product is to return the item within 30 days. This is a problem, because some items, you keep in storage until you're ready to use them. The other problem being that it wastes the customer's time, as you have to wait for shipping before finding out that the item you needed yesterday is a fake, and you don't have time to take a chance ordering it from another seller.",2018-09-15 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,9.0,15.0,752,133,33,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer service always wonderful helpful give low rating due quality product amazon regulate legitimacy branded product thus allowing fraudulent seller sell fraudulent product problem become rampant time go amazon doesnt seem care recourse receiving fraudulent product return item within day problem item keep storage youre ready use problem waste customer time wait shipping finding item needed yesterday fake dont time take chance ordering another seller,0.012310323137738204,0.9876896768622618,0.07459338194054964,0.2,0.8087635148192409,80.87635148192409,High Trust
