Steverino Bob,/users/5b9a71c14de5666d344d076b,US,3.0,2018-09-13 14:37:05+00:00,3.0,Amazon is going downhill,"Amazon is going downhill.  Don't get me wrong, I'm not going to ""dump Amazon Prime"" like others suggest.  I'm simply going to deal with them cautiously.My first complaint is their search algorithm.  Last night, I was looking for watches.  Amazon's initial search returned over 10,000 results.  I didn't want to wade through 10,000 result so I decided to change the sort from [Default] to [Price Low to High].  I didn't narrow the search in ANY way.  The new results dropped to 100.  I literally lost over 9,900 purchase options.  I was forced to go back to the previous search results and wade through a ton of crap that was of no interest to me.  It literally too me a half hour to find a Timex watch that should have shown up on the low end of prices when I changed the sort order but it was eliminated in those results.  What the hell is that???My next complaint is that they've changed their ""Two Day Shipping"" policy.  I understand that this change occurred some time ago but the point is that you have to pay attention to WHEN the item ships.  Two days is no longer calculated from the date of order but from the date of ship.  In some cases, shipping won't occur for a couple of weeks!My third complaint is that their customer service used to be automatic.  They would take responsibility when things went wrong and they'd offer a resolution without even being asked.  Today, getting Amazon to take responsibility for broken promises is like pulling teeth.  I used to give them 5 stars for customer service but today, I'd be hard pressed to give them anything more than 2.5.Bottom line.  Amazon is no longer the go-to for me and I shop around before placing ANY orders there.  Besides finding better pricing in other places, there are many browser add-ons and apps that offer me additional savings or money back on my purchases with other retailers.  I would have given them 2 stars but I do get some use out of the included streaming benefit.",2018-09-13 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,9.0,13.0,1950,347,24,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon going downhill dont get wrong im going dump amazon prime like others suggest im simply going deal cautiouslymy first complaint search algorithm last night looking watch amazon initial search returned result didnt want wade result decided change sort default price low high didnt narrow search way new result dropped literally lost purchase option forced go back previous search result wade ton crap interest literally half hour find timex watch shown low end price changed sort order eliminated result hell thatmy next complaint theyve changed two day shipping policy understand change occurred time ago point pay attention item ship two day longer calculated date order date ship case shipping wont occur couple weeksmy third complaint customer service used automatic would take responsibility thing went wrong theyd offer resolution without even asked today getting amazon take responsibility broken promise like pulling teeth used give star customer service today id hard pressed give anything bottom line amazon longer goto shop around placing order besides finding better pricing place many browser addons apps offer additional saving money back purchase retailer would given star get use included streaming benefit,0.055954236299052565,0.9440457637009474,0.1946158160403814,0.6,1.4109460450585498,141.094604505855,High Trust
