Marty Davis,/users/5b944fc04de5666d34bfa043,US,6.0,2018-09-08 23:07:52+00:00,5.0,Amazing Amazon,"Best customer service ever! Not only do I get what I want, I get it fast, and if I have an issue, Amazon reps are on my side! I once received a sex toy that was defective and my account was credited a refund with no questions asked. I sent back an airbed that deflated after a few weeks. Same thing. I know that Amazon always has my back. And the prices are great! I'm an Amazonian for as long as I reside on this planet! Thank you, Jeff Bezos, for your brilliance in changing retail for the better.",2018-09-08 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,9.0,8.0,499,99,14,2,0.0,0,4,2,1,Suspicious,best customer service ever get want get fast issue amazon rep side received sex toy defective account credited refund question asked sent back airbed deflated week thing know amazon always back price great im amazonian long reside planet thank jeff bezos brilliance changing retail better,0.9793520691777751,0.020647930822224936,0.055524397083567024,1.0,1.521428844827826,152.1428844827826,High Trust
customer,/users/5b89cfa04de5666d342a932d,US,3.0,2018-09-08 18:33:25+00:00,1.0,Never again,"Never again. I ordered a product for my son on August 24, 2018 and also purchased Amazon Prime again so he could get the product on time. I could have went to the store to pre-order the game so my son could have the gift for his birthday today. The shipping status kept saying it would be delivered on 9/7/18. I thought I could trust Amazon but they have disappointed me. I left Prime a few months ago because their service has went downhill. I called them and they tell me all they can do is give me another month for free. I told them I would never use their service again so all I want is the money for the service I did not receive. All the manager kept telling me is I can't give you a refund for us messing up but we are giving you this free month even if you don't want it. Never trust Amazon Prime because it isn't any good anymore.",2018-09-08 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,9.0,8.0,840,167,11,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,never ordered product son august also purchased amazon prime could get product time could went store preorder game son could gift birthday today shipping status kept saying would delivered thought could trust amazon disappointed left prime month ago service went downhill called tell give another month free told would never use service want money service receive manager kept telling cant give refund u messing giving free month even dont want never trust amazon prime isnt good anymore,0.024108242463768366,0.9758917575362316,0.09366236679753225,0.2,0.8066783521276222,80.66783521276221,High Trust
