Bill,/users/5b8ff2174de5666d34bbdf12,US,1.0,2018-09-05 15:12:57+00:00,1.0,Amazon: Put your alleged Security Policy where the sun don't shine...,"Placed an order to upgrade a PC on Monday 9/3 at 07:45 promised delivery date is Tuesday 9/4 before 20:00.Fast forward to Tuesday 9/4 at 04:46 I get an email that Amazon believes my account has been compromised, SO, my account is disabled, all changes to the account have been reversed, all orders CANCELLED.How they came to this decision that the account was compromised, is beyond me.  I did change to a new credit card, and changed my phone number from my VOIP phone to my cell.  Question, if you believe that my account is compromised, why not contact me?  Ask first, just do not take unilateral action.In the meantime they had not even sent a pre-authorization to my bank, I called my bank to see if the block was on their end.  IT WAS NOT.Decided to try again, placed the same order at 08:15 Tuesday, while on the phone with their alleged Customer Service.  Order is now set to arrive Thursday prior to 20:00, not happy at all about this, but OK.Fast forward to 15:40 I have noted my bank has not been pinged for the cost of the parts.  Again call alleged Customer Service, they say there is no problem, the parts are guaranteed to arrive Thursday.  Again not happy, but OK.at 16:27 I receive the following Email:I understand your concern, as well as your desire to get this matter resolved quickly. To help prevent unauthorized charges to your credit card, certain orders must go through a manual review process that takes 1-2 business days.I'm sorry, but there is no way to speed up this process. We greatly appreciate your patience with our security measures.Once we've completed our review process and received authorization from your bank to proceed with the charge, we'll begin processing your order.We hope to see you again soon.We'd appreciate your feedback. Please use the buttons below to vote about your experience today.Best regards,Nancy O.Amazon.com Now we are 2 days into this debacle, and NOTHING has been accomplished, other then to anger me. So it seems it will be another day AT LEAST before Amazon gets around to decide if they want my money. This is after 3  phone calls, multiple emails.  I want to know how they are going to VERIFY me, are they going to visit me at home or at work in person?    And really NO WAY TO SPEED UP THE PROCESS?  Sounds like a delaying tactic to me.  Though they insist that the parts will arrive arrive Thursday 9/6.  Tell me, has Amazon mastered time travel, that is the only way to get things not shipped on time delivered on time.Fast forward to 08:30 Wednesday 9/5  bank has still not been contacted about the amount or any inquiry made about my account.  Call Alleged Customer Service again, told to be patient.  all is well parts will arrive on time.  09:00 Wednesday 9/5 decide I have had enough of Amazon and their alleged Security Policy, Cancelled order, went to another vendor, paid $10 more for the parts, and an extra $35.00 for next day shipping.  As I write this, the parts are being pulled, and are being shipped by the other vendor.  If I had gone with them first, I would have had the parts today 9/5 and not had to pay the next day shipping.",2018-09-05 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,9.0,5.0,3117,554,69,11,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order upgrade pc monday promised delivery date tuesday fast forward tuesday get email amazon belief account compromised account disabled change account reversed order cancelledhow came decision account compromised beyond change new credit card changed phone number voip phone cell question believe account compromised contact ask first take unilateral actionin meantime even sent preauthorization bank called bank see block end notdecided try placed order tuesday phone alleged customer service order set arrive thursday prior happy okfast forward noted bank pinged cost part call alleged customer service say problem part guaranteed arrive thursday happy okat receive following emaili understand concern well desire get matter resolved quickly help prevent unauthorized charge credit card certain order must go manual review process take business daysim sorry way speed process greatly appreciate patience security measuresonce weve completed review process received authorization bank proceed charge well begin processing orderwe hope see soonwed appreciate feedback please use button vote experience todaybest regardsnancy oamazoncom day debacle nothing accomplished anger seems another day least amazon get around decide want money phone call multiple email want know going verify going visit home work person really way speed process sound like delaying tactic though insist part arrive arrive thursday tell amazon mastered time travel way get thing shipped time delivered timefast forward wednesday bank still contacted amount inquiry made account call alleged customer service told patient well part arrive time wednesday decide enough amazon alleged security policy cancelled order went another vendor paid part extra next day shipping write part pulled shipped vendor gone first would part today pay next day shipping,0.004144932007738535,0.9958550679922614,0.3107122826696579,0.2,0.8600699905300623,86.00699905300623,High Trust
