Farhad Heravi,/users/5b8e57ed4de5666d3463bdec,GB,3.0,2018-09-04 10:10:21+00:00,1.0,Absolutely atrocious service,"Absolutely atrocious service. Amazon used to be good once upon time. No more. I’ve ordered quite a number of items of the last few weeks and none bar 1 came on time.  Yet their website tracking service showed it as delivered. I looked for it with my neighbours in the block, asked the management company for cameras after speaking to amazon customer service and informing them that even though the item says it was delivered, it was in fact, not delivered so I asked to see the cameras for my apartment so that I can investigate. The CS said he’s investigating and will call me back in 24hrs, which turned out to be a lie. Items show up 2 days later, however no explanation, no one told me that they were arriving when they did, delivered by amazon and worse, no apology.I’ve since decided to cancel my prime subscription and not to shop with Amazon any longer. Good riddance.",2018-09-04 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,9.0,4.0,876,159,28,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,absolutely atrocious service amazon used good upon time i’ve ordered quite number item last week none bar came time yet website tracking service showed delivered looked neighbour block asked management company camera speaking amazon customer service informing even though item say delivered fact delivered asked see camera apartment investigate c said he’s investigating call back hr turned lie item show day later however explanation one told arriving delivered amazon worse apologyi’ve since decided cancel prime subscription shop amazon longer good riddance,0.009042458930518244,0.9909575410694818,0.0891755468311834,0.2,0.8133138799009775,81.33138799009775,High Trust
