Anon,/users/5b8c18134de5666d345961d7,BZ,1.0,2018-09-02 17:04:23+00:00,1.0,Amazon spies - They tracked my phone!,"I wanted to buy some new headphones so I wrote a note on my phone with some specs of what was needed. This is the only place where this information was written down, I never searched anywhere online and I did not have a conversation with anyone about it.A few days later, I receive an email from Amazon with a link to their site and a list of all the headphones which met these specs!The email was sent to my address which does not have an Amazon account associated with it. The address is, however, connected to my phone. And yes it was definitely a link to the real Amazon website.Whenever I tried to contact Amazon they just send me template emails saying they cannot help as I do not have an account with them. Very frustrating and what's more, they did not deny that they had tracked my phone. It is scary that nothing we do is private anymore. I never gave consent from Amazon or any company to behave that way and now I won't be using them again as I do not want to fund this unethical and disturbing behaviour.",2018-09-02 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,9.0,2.0,1018,193,37,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,wanted buy new headphone wrote note phone spec needed place information written never searched anywhere online conversation anyone ita day later receive email amazon link site list headphone met specsthe email sent address amazon account associated address however connected phone yes definitely link real amazon websitewhenever tried contact amazon send template email saying cannot help account frustrating whats deny tracked phone scary nothing private anymore never gave consent amazon company behave way wont using want fund unethical disturbing behaviour,0.08346691263194608,0.916533087368054,0.10824453168816602,0.2,0.7799154500216602,77.99154500216602,High Trust
