Melinda Weir,/users/5b8064334de5666d34f62f82,US,1.0,2018-08-24 20:42:46+00:00,1.0,I have been an extremely happy Amazon…,"I have been an extremely happy Amazon customer for many years. But, I will not order anything else until I get my issue resolved.  On June 28 my husband ordered a Hatsan air rifle from a third party through Amazon.  The rifle was defective.  On July 14 (after several attempts by the seller offering to help us ""fix it"" over the phone) we initiated a return with Amazon.  We were provided a return label and shipped it using UPS.  Two weeks later still no refund so we contacted the seller who stated that they never received the item.  After providing a screen shot of the tracking number to the seller the seller notified us that he was located in Ohio and the tracking label show the rifle went to KY.  The next day, Saturday, we went to UPS to find out what happened.  UPS staff told us that the item went to the Amazon Fulfillment center in Kentucky and printed a copy of the tracking info, including the name of the person who accepted the package at the fulfillment center, and gave us a copy.  After 4 lengthy phone calls to customer service (each time providing them with the exact same information) on several different occasions we STILL do not have a refund.  Additionally, we don't even have the defective item.  So here it is ...  6 weeks after the return of a defective item we still don't have a refund and Amazon continuously states that they will handle it.  However, we never hear back from them even after they promise to contact us within 24 to 48 hours ...  I always have to call them and with each phone call it's like we're starting over.  It's been a nightmare.  The item was $399.00 PLUS $14 to ship it back. Absolutely UNBELIEVABLE!!!",2018-08-24 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,8.0,24.0,1661,302,38,7,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,extremely happy amazon customer many year order anything else get issue resolved june husband ordered hatsan air rifle third party amazon rifle defective july several attempt seller offering help u fix phone initiated return amazon provided return label shipped using ups two week later still refund contacted seller stated never received item providing screen shot tracking number seller seller notified u located ohio tracking label show rifle went ky next day saturday went ups find happened ups staff told u item went amazon fulfillment center kentucky printed copy tracking info including name person accepted package fulfillment center gave u copy lengthy phone call customer service time providing exact information several different occasion still refund additionally dont even defective item week return defective item still dont refund amazon continuously state handle however never hear back even promise contact u within hour always call phone call like starting nightmare item plus ship back absolutely unbelievable,0.5611397853567236,0.4388602146432764,0.1693774537296691,0.2,0.553305598067572,55.33055980675719,Medium Trust
Thomas,/users/5b8050ac4de5666d34e5c128,US,3.0,2018-08-24 18:59:02+00:00,5.0,Amaz-on is Amaz-ing!,"Amazon Prime is awesome! I have saved more than the annual fee of $119 on shipping costs alone, and there is also the added advantage of Amazon Prime streaming video if you have the inkling for good movies, much of it original programming. I have had only one incident with an article of clothing I ordered that was too small. I followed the instructions for returning the item, took it to the post office, and was given a receipt with no charge. I got a prompt refund to my account from Amazon. I always look for things available on Amazon Prime and eBay, and most times the price is best at Amazon. It's wonderful to get free 2-day shipping, and I always buy with confidence from Amazon!",2018-08-24 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,8.0,24.0,689,127,20,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,amazon prime awesome saved annual fee shipping cost alone also added advantage amazon prime streaming video inkling good movie much original programming one incident article clothing ordered small followed instruction returning item took post office given receipt charge got prompt refund account amazon always look thing available amazon prime ebay time price best amazon wonderful get free day shipping always buy confidence amazon,0.3270569010271059,0.6729430989728942,0.071228266965788,1.0,1.8507172028796046,185.07172028796046,High Trust
