Marty,/users/56c51adb0000ff000a072f25,NZ,15.0,2018-07-30 04:36:02+00:00,3.0,Great shop with a not-so-great video service (Amazon Prime),"No need to review the store... That's all good. Even great. Huge product range, relatively fast and cheap shipment options to New Zealand. What's not to like?Well, Amazon Prime video... The movies and TV shows they offer to NZ customers are better than Netflix NZ, but it is impossible to watch 'em. Due to that stupid Google vs Amazon discussion, you can't stream via Chromecast (yeah, cast via computer = annoying as it's in the other room and screen mirroring on mobile isn't reliable).Amazon's Firestick isn't available in NZ... Roku is shipped to NZ but then the Amazon Prime channel isn't available. Unless you do the VPN trick but then Amazon blocks videos that should be available in NZ. It's just impossible to use Amazon Prime in NZ. Cancelled the subscription. Back to the more-or-less-crappy alternatives, we have here.",2018-07-30 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,7.0,30.0,831,139,59,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,need review store thats good even great huge product range relatively fast cheap shipment option new zealand whats likewell amazon prime video movie tv show offer nz customer better netflix nz impossible watch em due stupid google v amazon discussion cant stream via chromecast yeah cast via computer annoying room screen mirroring mobile isnt reliableamazons firestick isnt available nz roku shipped nz amazon prime channel isnt available unless vpn trick amazon block video available nz impossible use amazon prime nz cancelled subscription back moreorlesscrappy alternative,0.03231984025444631,0.9676801597455537,0.07795849691531127,0.6,1.399431779255839,139.9431779255839,High Trust
