Summer G,/users/5b593cc04de5666d34cd24be,US,1.0,2018-07-26 03:19:33+00:00,1.0,I've been with Amazon Prime at least 5…,"I've been with Amazon Prime at least 5 years, probably more like 7 or 8.  Today I was on the amazon.com site browsing when a little pop-up window solicits me, saying... ""download the amazon app and we will give you $10 off a $20 purchase""... I went ahead and clicked the link provided within the pop up ad. It downloaded the amazom app and I resumed browsing. After putting $20 of items in my cart, went to check out, and low and behold there was no $10 credit as advertised in the promotional pop up! I called customer service and after being on the phone for over a half hour and speaking to two different people I had no choice but to cancel my Prime Membership. WHY do I want to be with a company that doesn't stand by their own words!?! They solicited me with an offer so I'm not really sure what's going through their heads right now...but apparently they need the $10 more than I do, bless  their little heart! All i can say is if they dont want to honor their promotions maybe they shouldn't solicit people with little pop up windows ....The funny thing is not only did I cancel my Prime membership (for which they will have to refund me 120...) but I will not be renewing it again in the future!!!So they lost 120 this year and 100's in future years....Overall this was more of a blessing in disguise... now I'm free!!!I won't have to pay 120 a year for free shipping which I use but a handful of times each year. Otherwise the only other service I was using was Amazon video... and between you and me it leaves a lot to be desired. Nothing that Netflix or Hulu cant do as well... if not better.",2018-07-26 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,7.0,26.0,1604,304,39,8,0.0,0,10,2,1,Suspicious,ive amazon prime least year probably like today amazoncom site browsing little popup window solicits saying download amazon app give purchase went ahead clicked link provided within pop ad downloaded amazom app resumed browsing putting item cart went check low behold credit advertised promotional pop called customer service phone half hour speaking two different people choice cancel prime membership want company doesnt stand word solicited offer im really sure whats going head right nowbut apparently need bless little heart say dont want honor promotion maybe shouldnt solicit people little pop window funny thing cancel prime membership refund renewing futureso lost year future yearsoverall blessing disguise im freei wont pay year free shipping use handful time year otherwise service using amazon video leaf lot desired nothing netflix hulu cant well better,0.9999824915352935,1.750846470649492e-05,0.17049915872125632,0.2,0.3341085859766045,33.41085859766045,Low Trust
