Honesty,/users/5ab367224de5666d34f502ca,GB,8.0,2018-07-24 18:02:18+00:00,1.0,Seller beware This company is rubbish.,"Seller beware This company is rubbish.You make a complaint you speak to a different person every time then they close the complaint I sold over £600 worth of stock I receive £200 back after fees which aren’t obvious. They are not equipped with handling complaints I had my items fulfilled by Amazon when I asked for them back they come back in damaged packaging and sporadic deliveries I sent them all over in one delivery they send it back to me all the six deliveries over five days, yes 2 in one day from 2 different delivery companies whf?eBay is crap but at least you know where you are there. Some customers or con artists which ever you wanna call them can make a living out of asking Amazon for their money back. Amazon just refund the customer the money back but don’t ask for the product back yet they still keep your sellers for your £5 pound in every £20 and you’re just left it suck it up. Dealing with this company has been one of the worst experiences of my business life I own three companies and I’ve never had to deal with anything so bad or people incompetent.",2018-07-24 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,7.0,24.0,1079,201,38,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,seller beware company rubbishyou make complaint speak different person every time close complaint sold £ worth stock receive £ back fee aren’t obvious equipped handling complaint item fulfilled amazon asked back come back damaged packaging sporadic delivery sent one delivery send back six delivery five day yes one day different delivery company whfebay crap least know customer con artist ever wanna call make living asking amazon money back amazon refund customer money back don’t ask product back yet still keep seller £ pound every £ you’re left suck dealing company one worst experience business life three company i’ve never deal anything bad people incompetent,0.014460613333876762,0.9855393866661233,0.112731351654514