Mike,/users/55fd39f20000ff0001dcef5e,GB,18.0,2018-07-19 19:44:53+00:00,1.0,Recently I changed Internet providers,"Recently I changed Internet providers, Talk Talk to Now, all the equipment consisting of 2 mobile phones 1 Amazon Kindle Fire, Amazon Dot, 3 computers, Mac, Windows 7 & 10 and Amazon dot and echo.  The only problem I am having is with the echo and despite following the instructions to the letter several times I am still, unable to connect the echo to the internet, attempting to get assistance from Amazon is virtually impossible, I have no idea why? I need to find out how to resolve this issue before I take this matter further either through QVC Shopping channel or the courts.  Immediate assistance is required.  Being a long-standing customer of Amazon they would have my contact details.",2018-07-19 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,7.0,19.0,695,120,37,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,recently changed internet provider talk talk equipment consisting mobile phone amazon kindle fire amazon dot computer mac window amazon dot echo problem echo despite following instruction letter several time still unable connect echo internet attempting get assistance amazon virtually impossible idea need find resolve issue take matter either qvc shopping channel court immediate assistance required longstanding customer amazon would contact detail,0.02765182777300681,0.9723481722269932,0.06730229949523275,0.2,0.7996345460125431,79.96345460125431,High Trust
