Sven,/users/5b2d75c04de5666d34f5ba5b,NO,2.0,2018-06-22 22:26:14+00:00,4.0,"Reliable, just pay attention sometimes","I often buy on Amazon goods that I can't find anywhere else. Choice is amazing and I can (almost) always find what I am looking for. I make a couple of orders every month. During the years, only twice my packages were lost I have been refunded promptly. Another time I received an item (a t-shirt) with the wrong color, and again they promptly replaced it.Just be aware of shops when the sale and shipment is not handled exclusively by Amazon. Check their rating carefully. Amazon is filtering and checking quality a lot but a ""black sheep"" can always be met.",2018-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,6.0,22.0,559,101,38,5,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,often buy amazon good cant find anywhere else choice amazing almost always find looking make couple order every month year twice package lost refunded promptly another time received item tshirt wrong color promptly replaced itjust aware shop sale shipment handled exclusively amazon check rating carefully amazon filtering checking quality lot black sheep always met,0.011194510453191423,0.9888054895468086,0.056646102075154234,0.8,1.705731965188435,170.5731965188435,High Trust
