Sarah Phillips,/users/5756d0c30000ff000a26fcc6,IT,3.0,2018-06-22 18:17:08+00:00,1.0,I spent a week trying to get my Amazon purchases to arrive..no luck...,"Ho passato una settimana cercando di fare arrivare i miei prodotti. Sono rimasta a casa 3 giorni per aspettarli. Sono stata scaricata da un operatore ad un altro. Il corriere Amazon si perdeva sempre e non è mai arrivata a destinazione. L'altro corriere faceva le finte consegne in rete (controllando direttamente con i responsabili di zona le consegna che risultavano a video in realtà non erano programmate) e poi cominciavano le storielline tipo 'il corriere ha forato vicino a casa sua e se n'e andato a riparare la gomma!!! ì Comodo di venerdì sera quando non riescono ad andare in consegna. Cosi mi hanno invitato ad andare in persona a ritirare la merce. Ma secondo voi se avessi voluto andare a fare lo shopping in persona sarei andata al centro commerciale vero? Invece di pagare in anticipo online - si, hanno addebitato la carta di credito e chissa se mai rivedrò i soldi per la merce mai ricevuta....pessima esperienza. Hanno problemi di logistica e di formazione personale.I spent a week trying to get my Amazon purchases to arrive. I was passed from one customer service rep to another (6 in all in 5 days). The Amazon delivery driver got lost and couldn't find the house. The first one said he would take the goods back because Amazon would contact me in any case and then they would deliver another day. The other shipper firstly put fake delivery details on his website - when I actually phoned to ask, the area manager confirmed that there was no actual delivery planned.Then after 3 days when they were supposed to turn up again (they planned the delivery for a Friday afternoon after 4.30pm) 'unfortunately' the driver got a flat tyre on the gravel road just outside my house. So he went to get it fixed. Silly boy! Why didn't he phone me??? I could have gone and got the goods - that is if he had been there! So this shipper actually invited me to go and get the good myself! Don't you think that if I had wanted to go and buy the goods at a shopping centre without actually having to pay in advance (yes of course they already debited my Visa - and no little amount either - around E200) I would have done so??? Who knows when or i I will get my money back! Terrible experience. I wouldn't recommend it to anyone - except maybe if you live near to their depot so even if they don't deliver you can take a walk and go and get the stuff! Amazon Italy has serious problems with logistics and customer services personnel. Another world.",2018-06-22 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,6.0,22.0,2454,444,70,13,0.0,0,8,2,1,Suspicious,ho passato una settimana cercando di fare arrivare miei prodotti sono rimasta casa giorni per aspettarli sono stata scaricata da un operatore ad un altro il corriere amazon si perdeva sempre e non è mai arrivata destinazione laltro corriere faceva le finte consegne rete controllando direttamente con responsabili di zona le consegna che risultavano video realtà non erano programmate e poi cominciavano le storielline tipo il corriere ha forato vicino casa sua e se ne andato riparare la gomma ì comodo di venerdì serum quando non riescono ad andare consegna cosi mi hanno invitato ad andare persona ritirare la merce secondo voi se avessi voluto andare fare lo shopping persona sarei andata al centro commerciale vero invece di pagare anticipo online si hanno addebitato la carta di credito e chissa se mai rivedrò soldi per la merce mai ricevutapessima esperienza hanno problemi di logistica e di formazione personalei spent week trying get amazon purchase arrive passed one customer service rep another day amazon delivery driver got lost couldnt find house first one said would take good back amazon would contact case would deliver another day shipper firstly put fake delivery detail website actually phoned ask area manager confirmed actual delivery plannedthen day supposed turn planned delivery friday afternoon pm unfortunately driver got flat tyre gravel road outside house went get fixed silly boy didnt phone could gone got good shipper actually invited go get good dont think wanted go buy good shopping centre without actually pay advance yes course already debited visa little amount either around e would done know get money back terrible experience wouldnt recommend anyone except maybe live near depot even dont deliver take walk go get stuff amazon italy serious problem logistics customer service personnel another world,0.9992975833332463,0.0007024166667537468,0.24901850813236118,0.2,0.3501549099598491,35.01549099598491,Low Trust
