Matthew,/users/5b2a1c784de5666d34298ce8,GB,4.0,2018-06-21 17:53:08+00:00,5.0,Fantastic! Brilliant!! Amazing!!!,"Never had any issues, they have spoilt me for other online shops because of the choice, price and amazing swift prime delivery.Order a lot of things from amazon on like training supplements, phone covers and cables, clothes, healthy snacks, cleaning products etc. The choice of products and range within each product category is fantastic!! Had prime for a long time now and can't fault it at all!! Well worth the money between the tv, extra deals and swift guaranteed delivery!!!  Will continue to be a loyal customer for years to come.",2018-06-21 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,6.0,21.0,537,91,33,3,0.0,0,7,2,1,Suspicious,never issue spoilt online shop choice price amazing swift prime deliveryorder lot thing amazon like training supplement phone cover cable clothes healthy snack cleaning product etc choice product range within product category fantastic prime long time cant fault well worth money tv extra deal swift guaranteed delivery continue loyal customer year come,0.9989525387623932,0.0010474612376067949,0.05103757711721817,1.0,1.510731246042247,151.07312460422472,High Trust
Jane Louise Austin,/users/5b2be5524de5666d34a66497,GB,1.0,2018-06-21 17:50:18+00:00,1.0,★Amazon in Breach of Sale of Goods Act,"★   from Amazon Customer on 21 June 2018  Amazon in Breach of Sale of Goods Act I bought a brand new HD Fire 8 Tablet. This item became faulty within a few weeks, but Amazon want to replace it for a second hand refurbished item. Amazon are refusing to provide a like for like brand new replacement or a refund! This is in breach of the Sale of Goods Act. I will therefore be reporting them to Trading Standards. The item is still under warranty.",2018-06-21 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,6.0,21.0,445,85,38,8,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,★ amazon customer june amazon breach sale good act bought brand new hd fire tablet item became faulty within week amazon want replace second hand refurbished item amazon refusing provide like like brand new replacement refund breach sale good act therefore reporting trading standard item still warranty,0.04348997499768193,0.9565100250023181,0.04767246214245653,0.2,0.7877895049296504,78.77895049296504,High Trust
Jay Rodriguez,/users/5b2bdebf4de5666d349fabd9,US,1.0,2018-06-21 17:22:10+00:00,1.0,BEWARE,"Amazon has gone from a trusted company to a monopoly which does not care for its consumers.I had a package which showed as arrived but was unable to locate the package. I contacted Amazon after I gave the package another day to arrive, they suggested give it 72 more hours just to verify. Instead of attempting to figure out what is happening, the blame was shifted to me and the shipping company. They advised only if I am able to produce a police report will they be able to investigate further otherwise tough luck. After calling the police and my checking with my neighbors, no one saw anything and the police are not willing to help since there is no information to go off of. So now I am out my product and the money. This is unacceptable and I will not stop until every review site, the Better Business Bureau, and if need be my lawyer hear about this horrendous service by Amazon.",2018-06-21 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,6.0,21.0,888,164,6,1,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon gone trusted company monopoly care consumersi package showed arrived unable locate package contacted amazon gave package another day arrive suggested give hour verify instead attempting figure happening blame shifted shipping company advised able produce police report able investigate otherwise tough luck calling police checking neighbor one saw anything police willing help since information go product money unacceptable stop every review site better business bureau need lawyer hear horrendous service amazon,0.04428223777417344,0.9557177622258266,0.09197980931015143,0.2,0.7962548429749435,79.62548429749435,High Trust
