Christine L,/users/5b2a9da24de5666d34a6ed7f,US,1.0,2018-06-20 18:43:25+00:00,1.0,Used to be a great company,"Used to be a great company, had superb customer service until recently. Items getting lost, wrong shipments, delayed delivery, which I can all somewhat tolerate, because of the great customer service that provide speedy resolution to all of those issues above. However, my last experience with the company was bad enough for me to write an review. I made a wrong order and tried to cancel. Contacted customer service on day one, was assured that when the item gets shipped out, I will be get my gift card credit back so I can immediate make another order. I was satisfied with what was promised to me as it felt like it was a reasonable resolution. Representative even said she'll personally ensure this to go through. Item shipped, didn't get my refund. Contacted customer service again and said refund will be issued within an hour. After an hour, no refund still. Contacted customer service the third time, and got told sorry you just have to wait, takes up to 24-48 hours for refund to go through. Supervisor refused to resolve this, despite the fact i've got similar situation resolved with instant refund. My main issue with Amazon's customer service is, don't promise me things that you cannot deliver, twice, and then tell me that's not how your policy works on the third time.",2018-06-20 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,6.0,20.0,1285,222,26,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,used great company superb customer service recently item getting lost wrong shipment delayed delivery somewhat tolerate great customer service provide speedy resolution issue however last experience company bad enough write review made wrong order tried cancel contacted customer service day one assured item get shipped get gift card credit back immediate make another order satisfied promised felt like reasonable resolution representative even said shell personally ensure go item shipped didnt get refund contacted customer service said refund issued within hour hour refund still contacted customer service third time got told sorry wait take hour refund go supervisor refused resolve despite fact ive got similar situation resolved instant refund main issue amazon customer service dont promise thing cannot deliver twice tell thats policy work third time,0.004103376669490099,0.9958966233305099,0.12450925406618059,0.2,0.8228501624784911,82.28501624784911,High Trust
