Deborah,/users/5954de2f0000ff000aa97b1c,GB,6.0,2018-06-16 07:27:00+00:00,1.0,AMAZON ARE A JOKE TO TRY AND SELL ON...,"AMAZON ARE A JOKE TO TRY AND SELL ON...BEWARE OF THIS HAPPENING TO NEW SELLERS ON AMAZON.I honestly wish that I could give them 0 stars for how I have been treated by them..I opened an individual seller account, and listed some items - I clicked on items they had in their own product category and amended the staus for the ones I had. All seemed fine - then after only 2 days I find that Amazon has restricted my selling account as they think that some of the items are fraudulent - I would never sell items that were not genuine. Well my problem was that as I purchased items years ago so I could not supply an invoice within the past year, and inventory would therefore not match the listings, also asking for supply chain was absolutely ludicrous of them in my situation, being an individual who had bought items from lots of different places, and even some of the people I purchased from may not trade any more... As a result of this restriction, I did post one item which counted towards the £30 selling fee, leaving me owing £10 to them -- (me out of pocket for that game), but the other items that people had ordered had to be cancelled, seeing as though if Amazon would not pay me, then there was no way that I would send the items and hence be even more out of pocket myself.Their appeal process proved absolutely useless in my case and my selling privileges have been removed. I have tried on numerous occasions for some resolution to no avail.  I, therefore, am not going to pay them the £10 still owing to them for less than one day of being able to sell on their site.I THINK THEIR SERVICE ABSOLUTELY STINKS AND THIS ONLY HAPPENED DUE TO CLICKING ON PRODUCTS THEY HAD IN THEIR INVENTORY CATALOGUE - SO MUCH FOR MAKING THINGS SIMPLER TO LIST -- THEY HAVE SCREWED ME RIGHT OVER AND I REFUSE TO USE THEM EVER AGAIN = THEY HAVE NOW LOST SOMEONE WHO WOULD ALSO BUY FROM THEIR SITE TOO...PLEASE REPLY TO THIS IF YOU HAVE HAD SIMILAR EXPERIENCE TRYING TO SELL WITH THEM== MAYBE THEY NEED TO SORT OUT HOW THINGS LIKE THIS CAN HAPPEN.update 16th June 2018 - they have now had the audacity to take the £10.52 out of my bank so having to go to the bank to dispute it seeing as though they have not exactly done what they promised - I am formerly complaining to them, and thinking about using an ombudsman, or going to the papers.. :(",2018-06-15 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,6.0,16.0,2336,440,39,9,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon joke try sell onbeware happening new seller amazoni honestly wish could give star treated themi opened individual seller account listed item clicked item product category amended staus one seemed fine day find amazon restricted selling account think item fraudulent would never sell item genuine well problem purchased item year ago could supply invoice within past year inventory would therefore match listing also asking supply chain absolutely ludicrous situation individual bought item lot different place even people purchased may trade result restriction post one item counted towards £ selling fee leaving owing £ pocket game item people ordered cancelled seeing though amazon would pay way would send item hence even pocket myselftheir appeal process proved absolutely useless case selling privilege removed tried numerous occasion resolution avail therefore going pay £ still owing less one day able sell sitei think service absolutely stink happened due clicking product inventory catalogue much making thing simpler list screwed right refuse use ever lost someone would also buy site tooplease reply similar experience trying sell maybe need sort thing like happenupdate th june audacity take £ bank go bank dispute seeing though exactly done promised formerly complaining thinking using ombudsman going paper,0.004493436375550107,0.9955065636244499,0.24677509814918677,0.2,0.8471083014420623,84.71083014420623,High Trust
