Carla,/users/5b1f39cc4de5666d34e40557,US,2.0,2018-06-12 03:23:33+00:00,1.0,Amazon is a SCAM.,"Amazon is a SCAM.You can buy their overpriced items anywhere else. I was offered an Amazon credit card that they later didn't provide a link on the Amazon website, causing me to have trouble paying. Seller experience is awful -- buyers don't read the listings and expect every item to be new even if it is listed as new, buyers don't ask for a return and leave a 1 star review and don't respond to messages... And Amazon doesn't remove those reviews! Amazon charges the customer a flat rate for shipping, regardless of the weight of the item, which is far more expensive than necessary for items under 1lb. Amazon also uses boxes that are too big in order to charge sellers extra. Sellers pay exorbitant fees for storage  and the mere privilege to sell on Amazon, which is forwarded to the buyer in the form of item prices. Don't be a bezo, use eBay or other sites instead. He is scamming sellers and buyers alike, how do you think he became the richest person on the planet?",2018-06-12 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,6.0,12.0,975,178,17,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon scamyou buy overpriced item anywhere else offered amazon credit card later didnt provide link amazon website causing trouble paying seller experience awful buyer dont read listing expect every item new even listed new buyer dont ask return leave star review dont respond message amazon doesnt remove review amazon charge customer flat rate shipping regardless weight item far expensive necessary item lb amazon also us box big order charge seller extra seller pay exorbitant fee storage mere privilege sell amazon forwarded buyer form item price dont bezo use ebay site instead scamming seller buyer alike think became richest person planet,0.040470220005118664,0.9595297799948813,0.09983174425126191,0.2,0.799731238847693,79.97312388476931,High Trust
