on group would tell need waste time send baritone ukulele back maybe would refund money really amazon group also rude insulting tone also lack following many email reply matter much money lost regard contracted deal could write song receiving defective instrument amazon responsible matter ironic thing one digital partner selling one song amazon im certainly going tell amazon treat songwriter composer,0.860919231055527,0.13908076894447297,0.1357263039820527,0.2,0.396685645268647,39.6685645268647,Low Trust
