YC Kuek,/users/5ae7ed1a4de5666d342d3d91,MY,9.0,2018-05-01 04:58:28+00:00,1.0,"Parcel lost, replacement sent but charged me twice","My parcel was lost. As I spoke to Amazon Customer service, they sent replacement and confirmed I don't have to pay again. After some time, I received reminder to return the order, otherwise they will charge me again. I checked with Amazon Customer service, they assured me I will not be charged. One day, I was charged over $240+ and as I did not remember this, I thought this was a fraud and called to suspend my credit card. As I recalled about this, Amazon Customer support apologized and refunded. However, as I was using foreign credit card, I had to pay $12 due to the currency buy in/out rate difference. As I complained to Amazon support, they only agreed to give me a voucher that can only buy Amazon brand products which is useless to me.",2018-05-01 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,5.0,1.0,748,137,50,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,parcel lost spoke amazon customer service sent replacement confirmed dont pay time received reminder return order otherwise charge checked amazon customer service assured charged one day charged remember thought fraud called suspend credit card recalled amazon customer support apologized refunded however using foreign credit card pay due currency buy inout rate difference complained amazon support agreed give voucher buy amazon brand product useless,0.008564468751387397,0.9914355312486126,0.07683679192372406,0.2,0.8110851240090511,81.10851240090511,High Trust
