paul,/users/5241540400006400014da3b1,GB,17.0,2018-04-30 06:43:13+00:00,5.0,To be or not to be prime member...?,"For the prime membership is it worth the extra £79 a year. Thats a tough one. But i will say customer service is excellent. Ive had issues with several rogue companies selling dodgy products and obviously if its a company like ebay well you can wait months to get anything back if at all. Amazon deal with issues straight away, and refunds are instant which to be honest i love. Id rather pay a little more than subject myself to the hassle of chasing money owed with no back up what so ever, yes that would be ebay again. And dont get me started on paypal. Thats a joke. Billion dollar companies that cant be bothered to sort out a decent app that works on your mobile well is just well stupid in this day and age. The amazon app ive never had a problem with. Order, pay, print FREE return labels is a doddle. Ebay and paypal app are probably the worst things on my phone, way too buggy imo",2018-04-30 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,4.0,30.0,891,171,35,8,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,prime membership worth extra £ year thats tough one say customer service excellent ive issue several rogue company selling dodgy product obviously company like ebay well wait month get anything back amazon deal issue straight away refund instant honest love id rather pay little subject hassle chasing money owed back ever yes would ebay dont get started paypal thats joke billion dollar company cant bothered sort decent app work mobile well well stupid day age amazon app ive never problem order pay print free return label doddle ebay paypal app probably worst thing phone way buggy imo,0.011740365377899367,0.9882596346221006,0.09590577678070668,1.0,2.013310972667192,201.33109726671918,High Trust
