Fred M,/users/5aa822954de5666d34d618be,US,7.0,2018-04-06 03:07:49+00:00,5.0,I Love Amazon... Just Not Certain Sellers on Amazon,"I've never had any negative interactions with Amazon.com itself. Whenever I purchase directly from Amazon my items tend to arrive quickly and in excellent condition. When I've spoken with customer service via live chat, my issues have always been handled to my satisfaction. The same cannot be said for certain sellers on Amazon. However, I won't name them here, as this review is for Amazon and not individual storefronts.",2018-04-06 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,4.0,6.0,423,69,51,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive never negative interaction amazoncom whenever purchase directly amazon item tend arrive quickly excellent condition ive spoken customer service via live chat issue always handled satisfaction cannot said certain seller amazon however wont name review amazon individual storefront,0.032323851169147835,0.9676761488308522,0.038698822209758836,1.0,1.9915778388573777,199.15778388573779,High Trust
