BiggJazza,/users/5a8c5786f675864e5604d16d,GB,1.0,2018-02-20 17:16:55+00:00,1.0,1 star because I couldn't give zero,"1 star because I couldn't give zero. Seller only partially fulfilled an order. Filed an A-Z guarantee claim to attempt to get my full order only to find the claim was filed under 'late delivery' NOT 'missing items'! Then, to add insult to injury, Amazon, at the seller's instruction want me to send the fulfilled part of the order back and the seller will provide a full refund. Unnacceptable, I want what was advertised and what I paid for and I thought it was my claim. Problem exasperated by offshore Customer Service and lack of English language skills. Even their supervisors are working to scripts and lack any power to act on their own initiative. Never again will I buy so much as a ping pong ball from these.",2018-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,2.0,20.0,717,129,35,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,star couldnt give zero seller partially fulfilled order filed az guarantee claim attempt get full order find claim filed late delivery missing item add insult injury amazon seller instruction want send fulfilled part order back seller provide full refund unnacceptable want advertised paid thought claim problem exasperated offshore customer service lack english language skill even supervisor working script lack power act initiative never buy much ping pong ball,0.05844327954247324,0.9415567204575268,0.0723499719573752,0.2,0.7852483546202385,78.52483546202384,High Trust
NB,/users/57e6bf2f0000ff000a476754,US,10.0,2018-02-20 01:37:57+00:00,2.0,Needs Work,"Like any auction site, you will encounter problem sellers and shipping issues.  However, Amazon's customer service is where the ratings drop.  It's obviously outsourced, so you immediately face a language barrier and wind up having to slowly repeat your issue several times. Representatives will make you promises (such as gift cards as an apology for messing up an order, or a refund of your shipping on a late item), and then just never put it into the system, so when you call to check the status, you're told the conversation never happened.  Also, there is no way to quickly report a seller engaging in fraud.",2018-02-20 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,2.0,20.0,614,105,10,2,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,like auction site encounter problem seller shipping issue however amazon customer service rating drop obviously outsourced immediately face language barrier wind slowly repeat issue several time representative make promise gift card apology messing order refund shipping late item never put system call check status youre told conversation never happened also way quickly report seller engaging fraud,0.04338798021282803,0.9566120197871719,0.05888951205832866,0.4,1.0900839123052517,109.00839123052518,High Trust
