Veritas,/users/54a30a690000640001a11ee1,GB,5.0,2018-02-17 11:25:17+00:00,4.0,Amazon UK is another…,"Amazon UK is another love-them-or-hate-them company. For me, they've always quickly resolved issues with products sold by them. The returns policy is easy to complete. The third party sellers may take longer but they too, in the main, tend to deal with matters sensibly. It helps to provide photographs.The review system is a good way to voice any praise and complaints and helps the future customer to judge for themselves, though I suspect many of the gushing reviews are false positives.I find the emails which provide updates of purchase, delivery, and the tracking particularly useful.The only problems I've had were with sellers from abroad and that's usually due to transport delays/lost in post or wrong product information. They seem to have a stock photo which can misrepresent the actual item. Their couriers have mostly all been pleasant. I've heard about the pressure they're under to deliver within a certain time and have tried to offer tips, none of which have been accepted!P.S. I'd forgotten about the packaging. Sometimes they go overboard with huge boxes and swathes of horrid paper for small items and other times, squash expensive items together with 'air bags' that have burst by the time they've reached you because the outer box has been squished. Once, the Amazon sealing tape wasn't stuck on properly which was surprising as it's normally impossible to pry off. So, minus a star.",2018-02-17 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,2.0,17.0,1406,231,21,4,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,amazon uk another lovethemorhatethem company theyve always quickly resolved issue product sold return policy easy complete third party seller may take longer main tend deal matter sensibly help provide photographsthe review system good way voice praise complaint help future customer judge though suspect many gushing review false positivesi find email provide update purchase delivery tracking particularly usefulthe problem ive seller abroad thats usually due transport delayslost post wrong product information seem stock photo misrepresent actual item courier mostly pleasant ive heard pressure theyre deliver within certain time tried offer tip none acceptedps id forgotten packaging sometimes go overboard huge box swathe horrid paper small item time squash expensive item together air bag burst time theyve reached outer box squished amazon sealing tape wasnt stuck properly surprising normally impossible pry minus star,0.03582871637864649,0.9641712836213535,0.12955692652832304,0.8,1.7079970271163412,170.79970271163413,High Trust
