Lucy,/users/59b9070f0000ff000ac890d2,GB,1.0,2018-01-31 17:49:23+00:00,1.0,Scam promotion,"Scam promotion. On checkout page :'Sign up for Amazon premier mastercard' save £10 on this order.Signed up, got approved, back to checkout page and  no discount applied. Full price only.Chatted to customer service, fobbing me off saying the promotion is nothing to do with them and I need to email Amazon Mastercard!Can take upto 48 hours for a reply.So much for £10 off this order. Disgusted with them.",2018-01-31 00:00:00+00:00,2018.0,1.0,31.0,403,68,14,2,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,scam promotion checkout page sign amazon premier mastercard save £ ordersigned got approved back checkout page discount applied full price onlychatted customer service fobbing saying promotion nothing need email amazon mastercardcan take upto hour replyso much £ order disgusted,0.11378503578833221,0.8862149642116678,0.03813796971396523,0.2,0.7507350760486269,75.07350760486268,High Trust
