Jamie Leoar,/users/5a29a1d80000ff000aede30f,US,1.0,2017-12-07 20:34:26+00:00,1.0,Another night on elm street...,"They are so terrible during the holidays. Do not deal with them. They will double the prices and gouge your wallets. You will find just about everything 25% cheaper on eBay, Walmart, etc. GUARANTEED. If you are a seller, they will hold your money until the holidays are over because this is how they can fund their projects, with your money!  They will also steal all your suppliers if they benefit them.You will be sending plans after plans to their worthless seller support that will reply 2 weeks later.Good luck.",2017-12-07 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,12.0,7.0,516,90,30,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,terrible holiday deal double price gouge wallet find everything cheaper ebay walmart etc guaranteed seller hold money holiday fund project money also steal supplier benefit themyou sending plan plan worthless seller support reply week latergood luck,0.08429862889722693,0.915701371102773,0.050476724621424565,0.2,0.7679460304756713,76.79460304756714,High Trust
