bran,/users/51df1a6a0000640001437772,GB,13.0,2017-11-25 23:17:19+00:00,1.0,amazon censors reviews it does not like,"I wrote a review and mentioned amazon in the review. amazon then deleted my review because it had the word amazon in it. i tried to speak to support but they blocked my phone. i called the us site and spoke to a support lady that censoring and blocking reviews was endemic among amazon to prevent bad publicity. But i think this is more a problem with their UK operation.here is the long painful back and forth with amazon before they blocked me:Hello,I understand that you are upset, and I regret that we have not been able to address your concerns to your satisfaction. Unfortunately, we will not be able to offer any additional insight or action regarding these matters.Warmest regards,Rob D.AmazonYour feedback is helping us build Earth's Most Customer-Centric Company.Original messageYes. That is my point exactly. It was my review of both the product and the shopping experience itself. It did not contravene any of your guidelines, yet you removed it because it mentions that on this occasion amazon did not live up to par. You admit that that is the ONLY reason why my review was pulled. So it proves my point that you censor any reviews that might mention any negative comment about amazon even if small and even if it does not breach your review guidelines. So the question I have is why can I not write in my review that despite being a super amazon fan on this occasion you let me down????BOn 10 Jul 2017, at 10:17, Amazon wrote: Hello, I'm writing in response to your review titled ""overprices bonito flakes,"" on ""Wadakyu Hana Bonito Flakes 100 g."" The review was removed since it's not a review of the product itself, but rather about your shopping experience with us. We hope to see you again soon. Did I solve your problem? If yes, please click here: If no, please click here:    Warmest regards,   Sasha Amazon Your feedback is helping us build Earth's Most Customer-Centric Company.  Original message:hi Liz, i have just reviewed your guidelines you provided: i fail to see which guideline or point i am infringing. can you highlight the specific clause please?thanks,BOriginal MessageFrom: ""AmazonSent: Sunday, 18 June, 2017 2:41pmSubject: A message from CommunitiesHelloI’m sorry you’re disappointed with the information we’ve previously provided to you regarding your review of ""Wadakyu Hana Bonito Flakes, specifically that you review was about the seller rather than the product itself.Unfortunately, we won't be able to assist any further on this issue, but we'll be more than happy to provide any help you may need in the future.Did I solve your problem?Warmest regards,LizAmazonYour feedback is helping us build Earth's Most Customer-Centric Company.Original message:Hi LizThanks for replying. I'm not happy with this response. My question is that when I write about other sellers in terms of their customer service, it's fine. But when the seller happens to be amazon then it's blocked. So can you explain why this is?ThanksOn 18 Jun 2017, at 09:42, Amazon  wrote:  Hello,  I've read your review ""overprices bonito flakes"" for ""Wadakyu Hana Bonito Flakes 100 g"". Since your review was about the seller you ordered from, not the product itself, it doesn’t fall within our guidelines. You can see our review guidelines here:  For your convenience I’ve included a copy of your review below.  there are alternatives at half price elsewhere  I found it at half price elsewhere. thought i am a big fan of amazon, i am somewhat disappointed that amazon did not have a better price on this occasion. for some reason, amazon keeps rejecting my review. 06/17/17 14:48:52 Comments:hi, i wrote a review on amazon about a order experience. my review was rejected several times, despite me checking scrupulously to make sure that i did not use any contentious language or rude words. it then dawned on me that i was being censored because i dared to express my disappointment at amazon. i was shocked that this level of censorship goes and your organisation stamps down on people who make any remarks about amazon. i would like to understand the policy on this and why this is forbidden by your company. thanks",2017-11-25 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,11.0,25.0,4123,691,39,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,wrote review mentioned amazon review amazon deleted review word amazon tried speak support blocked phone called u site spoke support lady censoring blocking review endemic among amazon prevent bad publicity think problem uk operationhere long painful back forth amazon blocked mehelloi understand upset regret able address concern satisfaction unfortunately able offer additional insight action regarding matterswarmest regardsrob damazonyour feedback helping u build earth customercentric companyoriginal messageyes point exactly review product shopping experience contravene guideline yet removed mention occasion amazon live par admit reason review pulled prof point censor review might mention negative comment amazon even small even breach review guideline question write review despite super amazon fan occasion let downbon jul amazon wrote hello im writing response review titled overprices bonito flake wadakyu hana bonito flake g review removed since review product rather shopping experience u hope see soon solve problem yes please click please click warmest regard sasha amazon feedback helping u build earth customercentric company original messagehi liz reviewed guideline provided fail see guideline point infringing highlight specific clause pleasethanksboriginal messagefrom amazonsent sunday june pmsubject message communitieshelloi’m sorry you’re disappointed information we’ve previously provided regarding review wadakyu hana bonito flake specifically review seller rather product itselfunfortunately wont able assist issue well happy provide help may need futuredid solve problemwarmest regardslizamazonyour feedback helping u build earth customercentric companyoriginal messagehi lizthanks replying im happy response question write seller term customer service fine seller happens amazon blocked explain isthankson jun amazon wrote hello ive read review overprices bonito flake wadakyu hana bonito flake g since review seller ordered product doesn’t fall within guideline see review guideline convenience i’ve included copy review alternative half price elsewhere found half price elsewhere thought big fan amazon somewhat disappointed amazon better price occasion reason amazon keep rejecting review commentshi wrote review amazon order experience review rejected several time despite checking scrupulously make sure use contentious language rude word dawned censored dared express disappointment amazon shocked level censorship go organisation stamp people make remark amazon would like understand policy forbidden company thanks,0.016400854413089458,0.9835991455869105,0.38754907459338195,0.2,0.8693093877121316,86.93093877121316,High Trust
