Laurie Starkey,/users/5a18cdca0000ff000ae76601,US,1.0,2017-11-25 02:02:42+00:00,1.0,Very poor customer service and delivery lately!!!!,"As a loyal and very FREQUENT customer, I am really saddened by my recent experiences with Amazon. I’ve had two recent orders that just didn’t arrive with very little explanation. And when I called, the associates I spoke to on both occasions were less than helpful, which ultimately led to my decision of canceling my prime membership. I spent over 2 hours on the phone with various Amazon representatives on Tuesday night trying to track down my package. After 2 hours of frustration I asked to just cancel all of my orders and cancel my prime membership. At the end of the 2 hours I was assured I would receive a refund for my order of $99.28 for my items that never arrived. After 3 days of not seeing my credit card credited, I called amazon for an update. The representative I spoke to told me my refund was never processed!!!! Why did I spend 2 extremely frustrating hours on the phone Tuesday night only to not have my issues and refund processed! I beyond frustrated with their service and mainly their delivery lately. I paid for my prime membership because I live in NYC and it’s just easier to order household items online as opposed to lugging heavy bags from the store. However when your items do not arrive in the “guaranteed prime” timeframe, it adds more stress to my life. Having to call and track down items and speaking to USPS time and time again makes the ease and appeal of online ordering less than appealing, and downright frustrating. I am saddened also because the amazon representatives I spoke to didn’t seem to care much about offering a solution other than “let’s see if the package arrives tomorrow”.  Unfortunately that is not a solution for me, also considering the hundreds and even thousands of dollars I’ve spent at Amazon. I understand that Amazon is a massive company and makes millions each year. I understand in the whole scheme of things, the few thousand dollars I spend with you doesn’t really matter, however I wanted to share my recent experiences with you, in the small chance it might matter.",2017-11-25 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,11.0,25.0,2039,360,50,7,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,loyal frequent customer really saddened recent experience amazon i’ve two recent order didn’t arrive little explanation called associate spoke occasion less helpful ultimately led decision canceling prime membership spent hour phone various amazon representative tuesday night trying track package hour frustration asked cancel order cancel prime membership end hour assured would receive refund order item never arrived day seeing credit card credited called amazon update representative spoke told refund never processed spend extremely frustrating hour phone tuesday night issue refund processed beyond frustrated service mainly delivery lately paid prime membership live nyc it’s easier order household item online opposed lugging heavy bag store however item arrive “guaranteed prime” timeframe add stress life call track item speaking usps time time make ease appeal online ordering less appealing downright frustrating saddened also amazon representative spoke didn’t seem care much offering solution “let’s see package arrives tomorrow” unfortunately solution also considering hundred even thousand dollar i’ve spent amazon understand amazon massive company make million year understand whole scheme thing thousand dollar spend doesn’t really matter however wanted share recent experience small chance might matter,0.9478797911723116,0.05212020882768842,0.20190689848569826,0.2,0.3664414841109839,36.644148411098385,Low Trust
Jan Cartwright,/users/5a17ff270000ff000ae71ba8,GB,7.0,2017-11-24 11:26:49+00:00,3.0,I'm a little 50/50 with Amazon,"I'm a little 50/50 with Amazon, products are great, you can find great prices in the marketplaces. But when I deal with products directly from Amazon, I find their services lacking. I've saved something in my basket for a week now, waiting to purchase it. Today I noticed that it had double in price, but was still 49% off RRP? I don't understand that.",2017-11-24 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,11.0,24.0,352,64,30,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,im little amazon product great find great price marketplace deal product directly amazon find service lacking ive saved something basket week waiting purchase today noticed double price still rrp dont understand,0.024342183306324552,0.9756578166936755,0.0358945597307908,0.6,1.3950078202929956,139.50078202929956,High Trust
