Kaushal,/users/5a049d3f0000ff000ae0627c,IN,3.0,2017-11-09 18:24:02+00:00,1.0,Both Customer Support & Seller are …,"Both Customer Support & Seller are pathetic. Before making an order, I asked them if the item will be deliverable, to India(International delivery, USA to India), both customer support and seller said item will be delivered to India. But even then, before making an order, I tried to ask the same question from several customer support and they all said deliverable to India. Finally, I bought $2000 amazon gift card from third party. I made an order of laptop Dell Alienware 17 R4, I used gift card, and paid rest of the amount from my debit card. Following are the details.===================================================ORDER # 113-2215371-0609818ORDER PLACED October 7, 2017Alienware AW17R4-7006SLV-PUS 17"" Gaming Laptop (7th Generation Intel Core i7, 16GB RAM, 256GB SSD + 1TB HDD, Silver) with NVIDIA GTX 1070Seller ==> Beach Camera Same Day Shipping ===================================================They cancelled my order, and when I asked customer support they asked me to make order again, as there must be some mistake. So I made the order again on 10th October. Following are the details.===============================================ORDER # 113-7252378-8515458ORDER PLACED October 10, 2017Alienware AW17R4-7006SLV-PUS 17"" Gaming Laptop (7th Generation Intel Core i7, 16GB RAM, 256GB SSD + 1TB HDD, Silver) with NVIDIA GTX 1070Seller ==> Beach Camera Same Day Shipping ===============================================They cancelled my order again. I again talked to customer support and seller both and really this made me crazy. They were giving wrong information, offering me $5-$20 for all of this trouble. Amazon Customer Support do not value their customer's time. Finally, I need to write mail to Jeff Bezos CEO of Amazon and then I came to know, this item could not be delivered to India. and neither they can refund my Amazon gift card as it was bought by 3rd party, and neither 3rd party allows any refund. So my $2000 became waste now. I just sent my $2000 gift card code, to Jeff Bezos, as a contribution to improve the Amazon Pathetic Customer Support.",2017-11-09 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,11.0,9.0,2081,321,36,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,customer support seller pathetic making order asked item deliverable indiainternational delivery usa india customer support seller said item delivered india even making order tried ask question several customer support said deliverable india finally bought amazon gift card third party made order laptop dell alienware r used gift card paid rest amount debit card following detailsorder order placed october alienware awrslvpus gaming laptop th generation intel core gb ram gb ssd tb hdd silver nvidia gtx seller beach camera day shipping cancelled order asked customer support asked make order must mistake made order th october following detailsorder order placed october alienware awrslvpus gaming laptop th generation intel core gb ram gb ssd tb hdd silver nvidia gtx seller beach camera day shipping cancelled order talked customer support seller really made crazy giving wrong information offering trouble amazon customer support value customer time finally need write mail jeff bezos ceo amazon came know item could delivered india neither refund amazon gift card bought rd party neither rd party allows refund became waste sent gift card code jeff bezos contribution improve amazon pathetic customer support,0.004404801822142305,0.9955951981778577,0.18003365114974762,0.2,0.8338043293188783,83.38043293188782,High Trust
