Ben,/users/59e07f350000ff000ad47e45,GB,2.0,2017-10-13 09:15:16+00:00,1.0,Bad stance on game pre-orders- Amazon,Bad stance on pre-orders from Amazon UK.The whole point of pre-ordering games is to guarantee that hardcore gamers like myself get games as soon as possible.I pre ordered WWE 2K18 Deluxe Edition around a month in advance to get the pre-order bonus and mainly to get it 4 days early. It has not arrived and is now in limbo with regards to when I get it.Amazon's response? The game is unavailable and out of stock due to high demand and it'll take us 2-3 business days to give you a response from another department.Out of stock is supposed to be impossible when pre-ordering since they guarantee receipt of the game on release day.I eventually received £10 off at Amazon which is useful but does nothing for the integrity of a pre-order guarantee. This is the third time Amazon have failed to get a WWE game to me as per the pre-order guarantee.,2017-10-13 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,10.0,13.0,844,152,37,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,bad stance preorders amazon ukthe whole point preordering game guarantee hardcore gamers like get game soon possiblei pre ordered wwe k deluxe edition around month advance get preorder bonus mainly get day early arrived limbo regard get itamazons response game unavailable stock due high demand itll take u business day give response another departmentout stock supposed impossible preordering since guarantee receipt game release dayi eventually received £ amazon useful nothing integrity preorder guarantee third time amazon failed get wwe game per preorder guarantee,0.023874438545442904,0.9761255614545571,0.08524957936062816,0.2,0.8051126965994042,80.51126965994042,High Trust
