Patricia L DeGeorgio Deleon,/users/5066bb81000064000122ca0e,US,7.0,2017-08-31 13:33:15+00:00,3.0,AMAZON is FOR BUYERS not SELLERS,"AMAZON is FOR BUYERS not SELLERS! they rip you off and charge you an arm and leg for selling stuff. I literally sold over $800 dollars worth of books and ended up with $350 due to the fees and I had the seller option which was 80 bucks a month if you have tons of listings. I thought it would help me, but either way they get you. Plus their are so many TROLLS that buy your new books and return the same book but used! They get away with it too! I had that happen, had proof of the fraud, and they still took the money out of my account! I am done selling with them. I would rather sell elsewhere!",2017-08-31 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,8.0,31.0,598,122,32,6,0.0,0,5,2,1,Suspicious,amazon buyer seller rip charge arm leg selling stuff literally sold dollar worth book ended due fee seller option buck month ton listing thought would help either way get plus many troll buy new book return book used get away happen proof fraud still took money account done selling would rather sell elsewhere,0.9681854383702617,0.03181456162973828,0.06842400448681997,0.6,0.9295920817122331,92.95920817122331,High Trust
