April R.,/users/57e5d1d40000ff000a4742a9,US,4.0,2017-07-12 18:27:48+00:00,4.0,I've been shopping on Amazon.com since …,"I've been shopping on Amazon.com since they first came about (1994?) - and for the most part, they are fantastic. Every once in a while, a package arrives a date later than it should have - not the end of the world...I do have a few specific gripes, though. Why do they not have parental controls on Amazon Music Unlimited yet? This seems absolutely ridiculous to me - and if you do a quick Google search on this topic, you'll see a massive amount of unhappy people complaining. For parents, this is an absolute necessity, and a bizarre oversight on Amazon's part. My other issue is with Amazon Fresh. First of all, the price. Holy cow. It's a great convenience, but all the other local grocery delivery services are far cheaper. Also, it always seems like something goes wrong with these deliveries; whether it's all four of my bread items expire in three days from the delivery date, or half my order is delivered on time, but the other half is off in outer space and nobody can seem to track it down...I just can't figure out why these things aren't fixed by now. Train your people correctly. Track your deliveries. Easy stuff for a giant like Amazon.Other than those things, Amazon has been my favorite go-to online shopping place for many, many years, and I can't imagine it ever being replaced. Their customer service reps almost always fix your issues, and generally go above what you expected as a remedy. Their prices are almost always the best around (and you can always track prices via camel camel camel).",2017-07-12 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,7.0,12.0,1517,269,40,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ive shopping amazoncom since first came part fantastic every package arrives date later end worldi specific gripe though parental control amazon music unlimited yet seems absolutely ridiculous quick google search topic youll see massive amount unhappy people complaining parent absolute necessity bizarre oversight amazon part issue amazon fresh first price holy cow great convenience local grocery delivery service far cheaper also always seems like something go wrong delivery whether four bread item expire three day delivery date half order delivered time half outer space nobody seem track downi cant figure thing arent fixed train people correctly track delivery easy stuff giant like amazonother thing amazon favorite goto online shopping place many many year cant imagine ever replaced customer service rep almost always fix issue generally go expected remedy price almost always best around always track price via camel camel camel,0.005605584046431681,0.9943944159535684,0.15086932136848008,0.8,1.72737107225048,172.737107225048,High Trust
