Jay,/users/59253a420000ff000a9bc722,GB,19.0,2017-07-06 13:45:03+00:00,1.0,Ordered a Western Digital hard drive 30 …,"Ordered a Western Digital hard drive 30 06 2017 sold directly from Amazon . Tracking shows it originated in Southern France , no mention that it was anywhere than U K as they did offer next day delivery . Eventually arrived 05 07 2017 in single thickness cardboard no padding ,  arrived unusable although they have accepted return I now have to wait another seven days after their courier ( the dreaded HERMES ) to return the item  , so app. three weeks total ( that is if they refund ) otherwise back to trading standards , and still no hard drive . They are now on par with ebay .The reason I have posted the review on Trust Pilot , negative reviews against Amazon are not accepted on their site . Amazon really show themselves for what they are . They passed a return label to send the u/s item back and I was told the courier would call on 06 07 2017 to collect . Phoned Amazon met with laughter , ' thats done to keep you quiet '  take note prospective customers , if they send you rubbish do not expect to get your monies returned .  It is not possible to contact amazon uk at reasonable expense , there is no email address .",2017-07-05 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,7.0,6.0,1131,218,41,8,1.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered western digital hard drive sold directly amazon tracking show originated southern france mention anywhere u k offer next day delivery eventually arrived single thickness cardboard padding arrived unusable although accepted return wait another seven day courier dreaded hermes return item app three week total refund otherwise back trading standard still hard drive par ebay reason posted review trust pilot negative review amazon accepted site amazon really show passed return label send u item back told courier would call collect phoned amazon met laughter thats done keep quiet take note prospective customer send rubbish expect get monies returned possible contact amazon uk reasonable expense email address,0.007736718131582438,0.9922632818684176,0.12226584408300617,0.2,0.8205848097508099,82.058480975081,High Trust
