e matter regional national customer service manager update replacement order shipped yet dont know taking long amazon providing update reason service soooo badi would given star rating optionawesome amazon,0.8518638984614889,0.1481361015385111,0.11104879416713405,0.2,0.39627780960268233,39.62778096026823,Low Trust
