Kasper,/users/58c6cd6f0000ff000a8118b8,NL,2.0,2017-03-13 16:49:21.566000+00:00,2.0,"Waterdamaged goods, twice.","I ordered books on amazon as they were half the price they would be had I bought them from somewhere within the EU, even after import taxes. When they arrived the package was in a bad shape. Upon opening it I saw the books were bent out of shape due to water damage and the pages wrinkled.I therefore requested a replacement from Amazon.com, this was not an issue and I was pleased with their return policy other than the fact I had to pay the majority of the return shipping costs myself (about 30 euros). Even with these extra costs the books were still cheaper from Amazon than from anywhere in the EU and I was in no rush so I was still very pleased.However when the replacements arrived it immediately became apperent that these too had suffered water damage, albeit to a lesser extent than the first ones. At this point asking for a replacement once again would put the total price of the books and return shipping over the price of simply ordering them elsewhere and I decided to cut my losses.Amazons return policy was good, their shipping quality less so.TL;DRReceived damaged books from amazon, payed shipping to replace them, received new damage books.",2017-03-13 00:00:00+00:00,2017.0,3.0,13.0,1163,206,26,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,ordered book amazon half price would bought somewhere within eu even import tax arrived package bad shape upon opening saw book bent shape due water damage page wrinkledi therefore requested replacement amazoncom issue pleased return policy fact pay majority return shipping cost euro even extra cost book still cheaper amazon anywhere eu rush still pleasedhowever replacement arrived immediately became apperent suffered water damage albeit lesser extent first one point asking replacement would put total price book return shipping price simply ordering elsewhere decided cut lossesamazons return policy good shipping quality less sotldrreceived damaged book amazon payed shipping replace received new damage book,0.008174377350828243,0.9918256226491717,0.1155356141334829,0.4,1.1190199341512825,111.90199341512826,High Trust
