nathan,/users/5712d60f0000ff000a180baa,US,2.0,2016-04-18 02:38:37+00:00,3.0,"OK for buying some products, not great for selling","I do buy some items on Amazon, not too many.  Do not buy cosmetics, or anything lower cost that the Chinese can make, as there are thousands of fake items listed on Amazon.com. It is more expensive as well.  I find an item on Amazon, and find the exact seller and same item on EBAY for much less.  I tried to open a store on Amazon, it did not go so well.  Our money was held for a very long time (we did not get paid for months) and what we here this is the norm.  We also listed my Company phone number (expensive items) so customers could call to confirm we were the real deal. Most were asking for our number from Amazon, as customers of high end item want to Many want to talk to a human, not a computer.  Amazon did not like this, gave us a hard time, so we no longer sell on Amazon. Amazon is good for sellers of low cost items that are somewhat standard, easy to spot a consumer, not high end or custom items that consumers want to discuss before a purchase.  While this could happen on Amazon, Amazon's Terms & Conditions make every item a ""Coke"", and if you are not selling a ""Coke"" forget it.",2016-04-18 00:00:00+00:00,2016.0,4.0,18.0,1103,216,50,9,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,buy item amazon many buy cosmetic anything lower cost chinese make thousand fake item listed amazoncom expensive well find item amazon find exact seller item ebay much less tried open store amazon go well money held long time get paid month norm also listed company phone number expensive item customer could call confirm real deal asking number amazon customer high end item want many want talk human computer amazon like gave u hard time longer sell amazon amazon good seller low cost item somewhat standard easy spot consumer high end custom item consumer want discus purchase could happen amazon amazon term condition make every item coke selling coke forget,0.0060191541256557025,