Karetha Palmer-Dellgrottaglia,/users/56abb3820000ff000a012153,US,3.0,2016-01-29 18:50:07.675000+00:00,3.0,"Be aware, some things are amazing, others...","I love amazon for their books, their prime, customer service, and their amazing deals. 5 stars pretty much all around. Howver, regarding boots, shoes, and some other goods:While shopping for boots have you ever noticed the same model of the same brand is said to run big on one site, small on another, get 5 stars here, or three stars there? People from one site swear by this brand or this style, others have nothing but complaints? I have been in the re-sale business of shoes for several years now and have noticed several interesting quirks when researching and reselling shoes. The era of 6pm and Amazon have (unfortunately) created loopholes for customers who think they can count on a brand name (even Frye, Keen, Sorel, etc) for quality. 6pm and Amazon frequently (if not always) sell cheaper low quality versions. For example: The boots you buy from the company are all leather with a leather sole and welted construction (sole sewn to the boot) for example, but Amazon's are glued together with rubber soles. Full grain leathers are used on the company's boots, split leathers are used on the others. I don't know why the brand's allow for this blatant misuse of their names and logos (except that it must be profitable), but be aware that what you are buying through these companies will not last and is not the quality you may be expecting.",2016-01-29 00:00:00+00:00,2016.0,1.0,29.0,1353,237,44,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,love amazon book prime customer service amazing deal star pretty much around howver regarding boot shoe good shopping boot ever noticed model brand said run big one site small another get star three star people one site swear brand style others nothing complaint resale business shoe several year noticed several interesting quirk researching reselling shoe era pm amazon unfortunately created loophole customer think count brand name even frye keen sorel etc quality pm amazon frequently always sell cheaper low quality version example boot buy company leather leather sole welted construction sole sewn boot example amazon glued together rubber sol full grain leather used company boot split leather used others dont know brand allow blatant misuse name logo except must profitable aware buying company last quality may expecting,0.01569287328228252,0.9843071267177175,0.13292204150308468,0.6,1.4187379716594757,141.87379716594756,High Trust
