Kelli,/users/567abe470000ff0001f6511e,US,4.0,2015-12-23 15:43:15.452000+00:00,5.0,Unlike anything else,"There is not a negative thing you could say about amazon customer service, unless you are just a complainer. Anytime I have had an issue, they went above what I expect to make it right. I have never had to make a single phone call to them when there was an issue, I have always been able to resolve it over chat or email. I online shop all the time, and this is by far the safest company you could possibly shop with. Thank you, Amazon!!",2015-12-23 00:00:00+00:00,2015.0,12.0,23.0,437,86,20,3,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,negative thing could say amazon customer service unless complainer anytime issue went expect make right never make single phone call issue always able resolve chat email online shop time far safest company could possibly shop thank amazon,0.288329914547787,0.711670085452213,0.04823331463825014,1.0,1.8654817056537565,186.54817056537564,High Trust
