ZQubed,/users/557aef810000ff0001c5885d,US,3.0,2015-06-12 14:42:09.042000+00:00,2.0,Excessive issues w/Amazon related to Prime Membership,"Amazon really pushes its Prime subscription service.  Though it has several benefits, the one promoted heavily is free 2 day shipping on Prime eligible products.  This benefit was really the only benefit of interest for me. It is important to note that Prime eligible products are often a few dollars more expensive than non-prime products.  In essence, they recoupe their two day shipping cost.  The standard shipping cost is generally already built in as the non-prime products are often free ground shipping anyway. My problem is that about half of my orders don't arrive w/in their ""guaranteed"" delivery date timeframe.  In one case an item was supposed to be delivered Saturday and it was delivered Tuesday.  In another case I ordered several items.  One I needed immediately.  On that item I paid for 1-day shipping.  The item was packaged together with my two day shipping items and delivered in two days.  There have been several other instances where items simply weren't delivered in the two day timeframe which Amazon guarantees.  They claim they can't control shippers.   Fine, but that's not my problem. If your service providers can't meet your guaranteed timeline, then you need to compensate members for failing ot meet your guarantee.",2015-06-12 00:00:00+00:00,2015.0,6.0,12.0,1254,203,53,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon really push prime subscription service though several benefit one promoted heavily free day shipping prime eligible product benefit really benefit interest important note prime eligible product often dollar expensive nonprime product essence recoupe two day shipping cost standard shipping cost generally already built nonprime product often free ground shipping anyway problem half order dont arrive win guaranteed delivery date timeframe one case item supposed delivered saturday delivered tuesday another case ordered several item one needed immediately item paid day shipping item packaged together two day shipping item delivered two day several instance item simply werent delivered two day timeframe amazon guarantee claim cant control shipper fine thats problem service provider cant meet guaranteed timeline need compensate member failing ot meet guarantee,0.020245371479317962,0.9797546285206821,0.11385305664610207,0.4,1.1126479255895614,111.26479255895615,High Trust
