dlith,/users/551becf80000ff0001b57664,US,1.0,2015-04-01 13:06:03+00:00,2.0,PRIME - the great and the awful,"I got roped into prime after a 30 day free trial and have used the 2 day shipping several times. Living somewhat far from stores and shopping, it has been really nice to be able to order something I need and having it at my door in two days instead of waiting until I feel like driving the half hour to go pick it up myself. That being said... I have been trying to take advantage of the Prime Instant Video aspect of my membership. On three occasions now (in 6 months) shows or movies that I have been in the middle of, or that I have added to my watch list, went from being free to being an additional charge to watch - within 24 hours time! Imagine marking a movie on Monday night that you were thrilled to have included in your membership only to find out by Tuesday night that you now had to pay. Even worse, imagine watching one episode of a series on Wednesday, that was included in your membership, and turning on the next episode on Thursday to find that it is no longer included.  Amazon seems to be luring you in to their 'perks' only to raise all prices and scam you out of your pennies in other ways. It is not good practice and does not give me a good feeling about giving my business to this company.",2015-04-01 00:00:00+00:00,2015.0,4.0,1.0,1217,236,31,7,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,got roped prime day free trial used day shipping several time living somewhat far store shopping really nice able order something need door two day instead waiting feel like driving half hour go pick said trying take advantage prime instant video aspect membership three occasion month show movie middle added watch list went free additional charge watch within hour time imagine marking movie monday night thrilled included membership find tuesday night pay even worse imagine watching one episode series wednesday included membership turning next episode thursday find longer included amazon seems luring perk raise price scam penny way good practice give good feeling giving business company,0.0487194412092069,0.9512805587907931,0.13236118900729107,0.4,1.1021125171968547,110.21125171968546,High Trust
