Ada McCarty,/users/5209149f0000640001479c56,US,10.0,2015-02-24 16:57:03+00:00,4.0,Customers always come first (almost always),"Received a very nasty letter from Amazon a few days ago regarding my suspicious purchasing behavior. I was really shocked because normally Amazon is all about making the customer's shopping experience enjoyable. At any rate, instead of thanking me for all the tens of thousands of dollars of orders I put through their system (I'm a buyer for our company) they said I was abusing their Amazon prime membership.  Who knew!   At any rate,  Amazon gets almost everything else right - but every so often they do make mistakes. Here are a few I've experienced:  1)Nasty letters sent regarding policy violations (of which we have had none, but that doesn't prevent them from sending nastygrams).   2) Several times, they have posted items for sale which they did not have in stock.  They wont let other sellers do this, but Amazon does this a lot (items that will ship in 30 days or longer somtimes).   This seems rather sneaky.   3)  Items not arriving on time.  If you advertise 2 day business shipping, you should get it to a customer in 2 business days. Several times now my Prime purchases did not arrive on time   Really minor issues, and Amazon continues to be the gold standard for e-commerce. But, they are  worth a mention in case an Amazon exec is ever looking for ways to improve their service :)",2015-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2015.0,2.0,24.0,1306,227,43,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,received nasty letter amazon day ago regarding suspicious purchasing behavior really shocked normally amazon making customer shopping experience enjoyable rate instead thanking ten thousand dollar order put system im buyer company said abusing amazon prime membership knew rate amazon get almost everything else right every often make mistake ive experienced nasty letter sent regarding policy violation none doesnt prevent sending nastygrams several time posted item sale stock wont let seller amazon lot item ship day longer somtimes seems rather sneaky item arriving time advertise day business shipping get customer business day several time prime purchase arrive time really minor issue amazon continues gold standard ecommerce worth mention case amazon exec ever looking way improve service,0.08276497336182216,0.9172350266381778,0.12731351654514864,0.8,1.6840802166281186,168.40802166281185,High Trust
