djshazz,/users/52de07b700006400015f8e78,US,1.0,2014-01-21 05:39:32+00:00,1.0,Amazon delivers TOTAL DISAPPOINTMENT!,"I sold an item on Amazon recently where the buyer claimed they ordered the wrong item.  Amazon quickly refunded the buyers entire purchase and told me that if I want the item back I have to pay for the return shipping, otherwise the buyer gets to keep it (FOR FREE).  What?  Are you serious?  Yep, my original cost on the item was $20. I listed it on Amazon for $17., after Amazon's fees ($6.00) and my reimbursement for shipping $4. even though it cost $10. (Yes, Amazon takes a cut on shipping too, even though they don't ship it.) I was to receive a total of $5. for the sale (Yes, lesson learned—I essentially lost $15. Not to mention my time and packing costs).  I’ve tried contacting Amazon’s sellers department via their 800 number only to have them tell me that they cannot help me and if I want a resolution I may only contact them via email.  REALLY?  I’ve tried contacting the seller support team via email three times now only to receive an automated response that leads me absolutely no where!  Wow, what a major disappointment, AMAZON you’ve cost me money and made plentiful amounts for yourself all the while ignoring the people that have made you what you are today.  A very, sincere disappointment!",2014-01-21 00:00:00+00:00,2014.0,1.0,21.0,1215,217,37,4,0.0,0,2,1,0,Genuine,sold item amazon recently buyer claimed ordered wrong item amazon quickly refunded buyer entire purchase told want item back pay return shipping otherwise buyer get keep free serious yep original cost item listed amazon amazon fee reimbursement shipping even though cost yes amazon take cut shipping even though dont ship receive total sale yes lesson learned—i essentially lost mention time packing cost i’ve tried contacting amazon’s seller department via number tell cannot help want resolution may contact via email really i’ve tried contacting seller support team via email three time receive automated response lead absolutely wow major disappointment amazon you’ve cost money made plentiful amount ignoring people made today sincere disappointment,0.1745077401383339,0.8254922598616661,0.12170499158721257,0.2,0.7370871282482756,73.70871282482756,Medium Trust
