Jonathan,/users/528299a2000064000154c395,US,23.0,2013-11-12 20:22:13+00:00,5.0,Amazon is possessed - by angels,"Their customer service has gotten spotty the past few months, nothing serious, just ppl not knowing what they're talking about, they may have recently hired a bunch of new folks, hard to say.  But nonetheless, I've been treated with utmost respect every time I've purchased from them.  They have replied to every concern I've sent promptly (and I tend to ask a lot of questions!).  I've had a lot of marketplace sellers advertise products as ""like new"", and 9/10 of the time they aren't, but when I've felt undeniably let down by this form of deception, I've contacted the sellers as required, and 9/10 of the time, they treat me as respectfully as Amazon does, and as for the rest, Amazon has saved the day.  A couple sellers left bad tastes in my mouth.  I usually don't have enough dough to shop directly from Amazon's inventory, but when I have, I've noticed their delivery times are on par with the marketplace sellers', even when you factor in the 3-6 day delay they implement for free Super Save shipping (4 days to ship + 3 days for delivery).  All in all, these guys are good.  I feel safe with them, I will continue to buy from them.",2013-11-12 00:00:00+00:00,2013.0,11.0,12.0,1143,206,31,6,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,customer service gotten spotty past month nothing serious ppl knowing theyre talking may recently hired bunch new folk hard say nonetheless ive treated utmost respect every time ive purchased replied every concern ive sent promptly tend ask lot question ive lot marketplace seller advertise product like new time arent ive felt undeniably let form deception ive contacted seller required time treat respectfully amazon rest amazon saved day couple seller left bad taste mouth usually dont enough dough shop directly amazon inventory ive noticed delivery time par marketplace seller even factor day delay implement free super save shipping day ship day delivery guy good feel safe continue buy,0.05427939873148518,0.9457206012685149,0.1155356141334829,1.0,1.995967423460954,199.5967423460954,High Trust
