Jonathan Sluijters,/users/4df956c4000064000109405a,DK,5.0,2013-04-01 15:07:17+00:00,5.0,"Just perfect, great quality, great service and cheap prices.","I recently purchased 5 items from Amazon.com, getting it shipped from the US to Denmark. I asked for as few shipments as possible, due to a 30$ import fee being added at the Danish boarder per package when the package is imported from outside EU. When they then shipped the items, it was split into to packages, and I contacted Amazon as soon as I received the email. One of the packages was already shipped, so unfortunately it couldn't be changed, but they gave me a 30$ refund for the extra import fee. As I was already positive about Amazon.com, since their prices are way lower then in Denmark, I have nothing bad to say about Amazon. Great prices, great service!",2013-04-01 00:00:00+00:00,2013.0,4.0,1.0,668,121,60,9,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,recently purchased item amazoncom getting shipped u denmark asked shipment possible due import fee added danish boarder per package package imported outside eu shipped item split package contacted amazon soon received email one package already shipped unfortunately couldnt changed gave refund extra import fee already positive amazoncom since price way lower denmark nothing bad say amazon great price great service,0.12239052094031598,0.877609479059684,0.06786315199102635,1.0,1.9523773699280473,195.23773699280474,High Trust
