Sue Hall,/users/5116507e0000640001304fd4,GB,4.0,2013-02-11 16:17:09+00:00,4.0,"Good selection, great prices","I use Amazon a lot to buy software, ebooks and MP3s.  The prices are hard to beat and their catalog is huge.  I still prefer bricks and mortar shopping for blu-ray and physical books because their shipping can be a bit slow and they have an annoying habit of splitting parcels even if you ask them not to. For downloads, though, I think Amazon has the best selection out there - and choices for DRM (steam/origin) too.",2013-02-11 00:00:00+00:00,2013.0,2.0,11.0,418,77,28,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,use amazon lot buy software ebooks mp price hard beat catalog huge still prefer brick mortar shopping bluray physical book shipping bit slow annoying habit splitting parcel even ask downloads though think amazon best selection choice drm steamorigin,0.0315055776886644,0.9684944223113356,0.04318564217610768,0.8,1.6928843395908892,169.28843395908893,High Trust
