Scott Mishler,/users/5080a7b50000640001248763,US,9.0,2012-10-20 22:27:11+00:00,5.0,Amazon dominates all the rest,"I have never had any problems with either buying or selling anything on Amazon. I bought my wife a 2nd gen Kindle a few years ago for Christmas and it broke within a few weeks. She called Amazon, spoke to them and within 2 days received a new one. My brother in law spilled water on his Kindle and was upset. I told him to call amazon and lo and behold they replaced it! Honestly can't say anything negative about them. They have a loyal customer here.",2012-10-20 00:00:00+00:00,2012.0,10.0,20.0,452,87,29,5,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,never problem either buying selling anything amazon bought wife nd gen kindle year ago christmas broke within week called amazon spoke within day received new one brother law spilled water kindle upset told call amazon lo behold replaced honestly cant say anything negative loyal customer,0.11037592490315001,0.88962407509685,0.04879416713404375,1.0,1.9545708709752339,195.45708709752338,High Trust
