Rejean Paquet,/users/4fc947cc00006400011a71de,US,7.0,2012-06-01 23:08:46+00:00,5.0,"Amazing selection, best price and free shipping","I have been an Amazon customer for many years, I have been a PRIME member for the last 4 years. I enjoy shopping on Amazon, you can find ANYTHING you want, I'm amazed at the large selection of products that you can find. The prices are always competitive, most of the time the best price around the internet. No tax for me in FL plus Free shipping with Prime membership. Prime membership gives you access to movies. Plus the free space in the cloud, the Amazon player, the electronic download for software, very very convenient.  For more savings I use the subscribe and save, again very convenient and unique to Amazon. Overall a great shopping experience. This is why I come back, I order from Amazon almost every week.  Oh and the customer service is so easy to deal with, they will help you in no time and fix whatever issue you might have. The only problem I have I would say is if Amazon would accept PayPal, this would be the best of the best... still highly recommended.",2012-06-01 00:00:00+00:00,2012.0,6.0,1.0,978,179,47,7,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazon customer many year prime member last year enjoy shopping amazon find anything want im amazed large selection product find price always competitive time best price around internet tax fl plus free shipping prime membership prime membership give access movie plus free space cloud amazon player electronic download software convenient saving use subscribe save convenient unique amazon overall great shopping experience come back order amazon almost every week oh customer service easy deal help time fix whatever issue might problem would say amazon would accept paypal would best best still highly recommended,0.02511077123013975,0.9748892287698603,0.10039259674705553,1.0,2.0075231337343413,200.75231337343413,High Trust
