Jon Loveless,/users/4f457958000064000114b28a,US,5.0,2012-02-22 23:29:04+00:00,5.0,They never miss,"I order many things from Amazon - A kindle Fire, ebooks, clothes, computer parts, car parts, and a list too long to mention it all. They have a large warehouse in Phoenix so things arrive a day early if they ship from there. Believe it or not I have never had an issue with merchandise shipped by Amazon or its affiliates except for one Kindle cover which came from Europe. Much bad weather there caused a delay so the company send me another of the same article using a different method. They both arrived so I kept (and paid for) both and gave one as a present. Amazon rocks.",2012-02-22 00:00:00+00:00,2012.0,2.0,22.0,577,109,15,3,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,order many thing amazon kindle fire ebooks clothes computer part car part list long mention large warehouse phoenix thing arrive day early ship believe never issue merchandise shipped amazon affiliate except one kindle cover came europe much bad weather caused delay company send another article using different method arrived kept paid gave one present amazon rock,0.02699288658871558,0.9730071134112844,0.061132922041503085,1.0,1.9987301411139429,199.8730141113943,High Trust
