Ed,/users/4ef978e4000064000110dc37,US,1.0,2011-12-27 07:52:03+00:00,1.0,Poor customer service.  Bad replacement policies,I placed an order with amazon only to have it damaged in shipping.  UPS sent it back to amazon.  They never contacted me relating to the order at all.  There was a Xmas present in the order and it was due prior to Xmas.  When I finally was able to get a hold of Customer service they told me that I had to re-do the entire order and I would be refunded for the first order within 4 weeks or I could just get a refund for the entire order in 4 weeks... They would not just replace the order and send me replacements..  Poor policies.  Non communication of lost shipments and they like to hang onto your money for a long time.  Very bad customer service.  This was my first time ever buying from them and it is now my last.  I will also be telling my friends about the poor service and making sure that I have them make their purchases elsewhere online.,2011-12-27 00:00:00+00:00,2011.0,12.0,27.0,851,165,48,6,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,placed order amazon damaged shipping ups sent back amazon never contacted relating order xmas present order due prior xmas finally able get hold customer service told redo entire order would refunded first order within week could get refund entire order week would replace order send replacement poor policy non communication lost shipment like hang onto money long time bad customer service first time ever buying last also telling friend poor service making sure make purchase elsewhere online,0.005007533907456645,0.9949924660925433,0.09254066180594504,0.2,0.8160043654074606,81.60043654074606,High Trust
