Deborah Crew-Johnson,/users/4dee66c700006400010905e1,US,2.0,2011-06-07 19:43:13+00:00,4.0,Pretty Good,"Amazon has a great variety and selection of just about anything you need.  They are very reliable and the orders arrive pretty quickly.  I give it 4 stars and not 5 because I'm not happy with the S&H charges.  I think these charges have increased dramatically.  I understand an adjustment in rates due to the oil and gas prices and here's an example of what I mean:   I ordered an item for $4.79 and had to pay $7.97 for S&H charges.  In the same order I was charged $29.94 for a $59.94 order although the items were being shipped from different locations.  I'm trying to decide whether I want to keep my order because of this.  Outside of this, I love Amazon!!!",2011-06-07 00:00:00+00:00,2011.0,6.0,7.0,663,122,11,2,0.0,0,3,2,1,Suspicious,amazon great variety selection anything need reliable order arrive pretty quickly give star im happy sh charge think charge increased dramatically understand adjustment rate due oil gas price here example mean ordered item pay sh charge order charged order although item shipped different location im trying decide whether want keep order outside love amazon,0.8407056667241888,0.15929433327581122,0.06842400448681997,0.8,1.2933319675352695,129.33319675352695,High Trust
