William,/users/4d655f99000064000106bd5b,US,8.0,2011-02-24 21:26:06+00:00,5.0,One of the best,"I have been an Amazon.com customer for quite a long time.If there are any issues I can count on Amazon.com customer support to remedy the issue.Sometimes they will go beyond their terms just to solve an issue.Amazon prime is great if you are a frequent Amazon.com shopper and in addition to the free 2 day shipping from prime, they recently started free Instant Video.They have also been actively monitoring their competitors' prices to price their products competitively. Large product offerings, good prices, and superior customer service = 5/5 stars.",2011-02-24 00:00:00+00:00,2011.0,2.0,24.0,558,93,15,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,amazoncom customer quite long time issue count amazoncom customer support remedy issue sometimes go beyond term solve issue amazon prime great frequent amazoncom shopper addition free day shipping prime recently started free instant video also actively monitoring competitor price price product competitively large product offering good price superior customer service star,0.010535369148853129,0.9894646308511469,0.05215928210880538,1.0,2.0051641718473343,200.51641718473343,High Trust
