Joseph DeFauw,/users/4ceb2faa000064000105325e,US,2.0,2010-11-26 23:31:39+00:00,5.0,"After four years, we have not had any bad experiences with Amazon.","Since 2006, we have placed almost a hundred orders with Amazon.com.  To the best of my memory, we have never had to contact customer service, and we have never had any bad experiences with Amazon or with anyone who was selling on Amazon.  They seem to be a very well run company.  I realize that not everyone will have such good luck, but their overall record is probably very good.      For $90 a year we get amazon prime, which means we get free two day shipping on most items that are ordered directly from Amazon.  Since we get the free shipping, it is very difficult for other websites (where we usually have to pay shipping) to compete with Amazon.  That is why we end up placing most of our orders with Amazon.  Amazon prime was a smart idea.      What makes shopping on Amazon such a great experience is that alot of people write reveiws of the products on Amazon.  That helps us alot when we make our buying decisions.      I do not recall any bad experiences with the vendors who sell on the Amazon marketplace.   However, some vendors are slower than others.  If you order from an unfamiliar vendor, be prepared to wait.      So far, we have been very satisfied.   Hope they keep up the good work!",2010-11-26 00:00:00+00:00,2010.0,11.0,26.0,1212,217,66,12,0.0,0,1,1,0,Genuine,since placed almost hundred order amazoncom best memory never contact customer service never bad experience amazon anyone selling amazon seem well run company realize everyone good luck overall record probably good year get amazon prime mean get free two day shipping item ordered directly amazon since get free shipping difficult website usually pay shipping compete amazon end placing order amazon amazon prime smart idea make shopping amazon great experience alot people write reveiws product amazon help u alot make buying decision recall bad experience vendor sell amazon marketplace however vendor slower others order unfamiliar vendor prepared wait far satisfied hope keep good work,0.03353482310422605,0.9664651768957739,0.12170499158721257,1.0,2.0075735867653295,200.75735867653296,High Trust
