Tiny,/users/4c99d5d80000640001045b1a,GB,1.0,2010-09-22 19:36:24+00:00,2.0,Computer specification wrongly advertised,"I order a notebook laptop. The delivery was very good i ordered it Thursday and it arrived Friday day but i paid for the service which was around £9. I was so disappointed when i open it because it was advertised as having a centrino processor but got the celeron. When i look at the website it has gone down in price from £390 to £377.I rang amazon, the man on the other line was very helpful he said he will investigate and will give me a replacement. When i mentioned about it has gone down in price so they should give me the price advertise now, he said that the price advertised now is from the third party seller. So they will refund me and it will take 2 weeks before they can return my money. More frustrating because i wanted the laptop immediately that is why i paid for the fast delivery. He arranged for it to be returned via DHL at first he said i should arrange the pick up myself but i insisted he should arrange it that very moment.I still have to wait when my money will be refunded. A very unsatisfied customer",2010-09-22 00:00:00+00:00,2010.0,9.0,22.0,1033,200,41,4,0.0,0,0,1,0,Genuine,order notebook laptop delivery good ordered thursday arrived friday day paid service around £ disappointed open advertised centrino processor got celeron look website gone price £ £ rang amazon man line helpful said investigate give replacement mentioned gone price give price advertise said price advertised third party seller refund take week return money frustrating wanted laptop immediately paid fast delivery arranged returned via dhl first said arrange pick insisted arrange moment still wait money refunded unsatisfied customer,0.012137244630412696,0.9878627553695873,0.11217049915872125,0.4,1.116365477516538,111.6365477516538,High Trust
